анных Требований","ar":"تحليل الرؤية: استخراج متطلبات منظمة","en":"vision"},"description":{"zh":"Aha Loop 视觉分析技能用于解析项目视觉文档，提取结构化需求，用于架构和规划","ja":"Aha Loop ビジョン分析スキルは、プロジェクトのビジョンドキュメントを解析し、構造化された要件を抽出して、建築と計画に使用します","ko":"Aha Loop 비전 분석 스킬은 프로젝트 비전 문서를 분석하여 구조화된 요구 사항을 추출하여 아키텍처와 계획에 사용합니다","es":"El skill de visión analiza documentos de visión de proyecto y extrae requisitos estructurados para arquitectura y planificación","fr":"Le skill de vision analyse les documents de vision de projet et extrait des exigences structurées pour l''architecture et la planification","de":"Der Vision-Skill analysiert Projektvisiondokumente und extrahiert strukturierte Anforderungen für Architektur und Planung","pt":"A habilidade de visão do Aha Loop analisa documentos de visão de projeto e extrai requisitos estruturados para arquitetura e planejamento.","ru":"Навык видения Aha Loop анализирует документы видения проекта и извлекает структурированные требования для архитектуры и планирования.","ar":"مهارة الرؤية في Aha Loop تحليل وثائق رؤية المشروع واستخراج متطلبات منظمة للبنية التحتية والتخطيط.","en":"[MVP] Aha Loop is a fully autonomous AI development system, extended from the core ideas of Ralph. It''s not just an execution engine, but a complete AI devel..."},"definition":{"en":"[MVP] Aha Loop is a fully autonomous AI development system, extended from the core ideas of Ralph. It''s not just an execution engine, but a complete AI development framework with planning capabilities, research abilities, and oversight mechanisms."},"features":{"zh":["解析项目视觉文档","提取结构化需求","用于架构和规划","支持工作空间模式","输出分析结果"],"ja":["プロジェクトのビジョンドキュメントを解析","構造化された要件を抽出","建築と計画に使用","ワークスペースモードをサポート","分析結果を出力"],"ko":["프로젝트 비전 문서를 분석","구조화된 요구 사항을 추출","아키텍처와 계획에 사용","작업공간 모드를 지원","분석 결과를 출력"],"es":["Análisis de documentos de visión de proyecto","Extracción de requisitos estructurados","Compatibilidad con el modo de espacio de trabajo","Salida de análisis en formato Markdown","Validación de requisitos obligatorios","Integración con el orchestrador de Aha Loop"],"fr":["Analyse de documents de vision de projet","Extraction d''exigences structurées","Compatibilité avec le mode d''espace de travail","Sortie d''analyse au format Markdown","Validation des exigences obligatoires","Intégration avec l''orchestrator d''Aha Loop"],"de":["Analyse von Projektvisiondokumenten","Extraktion von strukturierten Anforderungen","Kompatibilität mit dem Arbeitsbereichsmodus","Analyseaussgabe im Markdown-Format","Validierung von obligatorischen Anforderungen","Integration mit dem Aha Loop-Orchestrator"],"pt":["Análise de documentos de visão de projeto","Extração de requisitos estruturados para arquitetura e planejamento","Compatibilidade com o modo de workspace do Aha Loop","Saída de análise em formato markdown"],"ru":["Анализ документов видения проекта","Извлечение структурированных требований для архитектуры и планирования","Совместимость с режимом workspace Aha Loop","Выходные данные анализа в формате markdown"],"ar":["تحليل وثائق رؤية المشروع","استخراج متطلبات منظمة للبنية التحتية والتخطيط","التوافق مع وضع المساحة العمل في Aha Loop","إخراج تحليل في تنسيق markdown"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Aha Loop","视觉分析技能","项目视觉文档","结构化需求","架构和规划","工作空间模式"],"ja":["Aha Loop","ビジョン分析スキル","プロジェクトのビジョンドキュメント","構造化された要件","建築と計画","ワークスペースモード"],"ko":["Aha Loop","비전 분석 스킬","프로젝트 비전 문서","구조화된 요구 사항","아키텍처와 계획","작업공간 모드"],"es":["análisis de visión","desarrollo de AI","Aha Loop","proyecto de visión","arquitectura de software","planificación de proyecto","análisis de requisitos","espacio de trabajo","orchestrador"],"fr":["analyse de vision","développement d''IA","Aha Loop","projet de vision","architecture de logiciel","planification de projet","analyse d''exigences","espace de travail","orchestrator"],"de":["Vision-Analyse","KI-Entwicklung","Aha Loop","Projektvision","Software-Architektur","Projektplanung","Anforderungsanalyse","Arbeitsbereich","Orchestrator"],"pt":["análise de visão","desenvolvimento de AI","arquitetura de projeto","planejamento de projeto","Aha Loop","modo de workspace"],"ru":["анализ видения","разработка ИИ","архитектура проекта","планирование проекта","Aha Loop","режим workspace"],"ar":["تحليل الرؤية","تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي","بنية المشروع","تخطيط المشروع","Aha Loop","وضع المساحة العمل"]}},"owner":"YougLin-dev","repo":"Aha-Loop","repoPath":"YougLin-dev/Aha-Loop","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.418Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vision","description":"Parses and analyzes project vision to extract structured requirements. Use at project start to understand goals, scope, and constraints. Triggers on: analyze vision, parse project goals, understand requirements.","bodyPreview":"# Vision Analysis Skill\n\nParse the project vision document and extract structured requirements for architecture and planning.\n\n## Workspace Mode Note\n\nWhen running in workspace mode, all paths are relative to `.aha-loop/` directory:\n- Vision file: `.aha-loop/project.vision.md`\n- Analysis output: `.aha-loop/project.vision-analysis.md`\n\nThe orchestrator will provide the actual paths in the prompt context.\n\n---\n\n## The Job\n\n1. Read `project.vision.md` from the project root\n2. Validate all required","body":"# Vision Analysis Skill\n\nParse the project vision document and extract structured requirements for architecture and planning.\n\n## Workspace Mode Note\n\nWhen running in workspace mode, all paths are relative to `.aha-loop/` directory:\n- Vision file: `.aha-loop/project.vision.md`\n- Analysis output: `.aha-loop/project.vision-analysis.md`\n\nThe orchestrator will provide the actual paths in the prompt context.\n\n---\n\n## The Job\n\n1. Read `project.vision.md` from the project root\n2. Validate all required sections are present\n3. Extract and structure the requirements\n4. Identify project type and scale\n5. Output analysis to guide architecture decisions\n6. Save analysis to `project.vision-analysis.md`\n\n---\n\n## Input: project.vision.md\n\nThe vision document should contain:\n\n### Required Sections\n\n| Section | Purpose |\n|---------|---------|\n| **What** | One-sentence description of the project |\n| **Why** | Motivation and problem being solved |\n| **Target Users** | Who will use this product |\n| **Success Criteria** | Measurable definition of success |\n\n### Optional Sections\n\n| Section | Purpose |\n|---------|---------|\n| **Constraints** | Technical, budget, or time limitations |\n| **Inspirations** | Reference products or desired style |\n| **Non-Goals** | What the project explicitly won''t do |\n\n---\n\n## Analysis Process\n\n### Step 1: Validate Vision Document\n\nCheck that `project.vision.md` exists and contains required sections:\n\n```markdown\n## Validation Checklist\n- [ ] What section present and clear\n- [ ] Why section explains motivation\n- [ ] Target Users defined\n- [ ] Success Criteria are measurable\n```\n\nIf sections are missing or unclear, document what''s needed before proceeding.\n\n### Step 2: Identify Project Type\n\nClassify the project:\n\n| Type | Characteristics |\n|------|-----------------|\n| **CLI Tool** | Command-line interface, no UI |\n| **Web App** | Browser-based, frontend + backend |\n| **API Service** | Backend only, REST/GraphQL |\n| **Library** | Reusable code package |\n| **Desktop App** | Native desktop application |\n| **Mobile App** | iOS/Android application |\n| **Full Stack** | Complete web application |\n| **Infrastructure** | DevOps, deployment tools |\n\n### Step 3: Estimate Project Scale\n\n| Scale | Stories | Duration | Complexity |\n|-------|---------|----------|------------|\n| **Small** | 5-15 | Days | Single component |\n| **Medium** | 15-50 | Weeks | Multiple components |\n| **Large** | 50-200 | Months | Full system |\n| **Enterprise** | 200+ | Quarters | Multiple systems |\n\n### Step 4: Extract Core Features\n\nFrom the vision, identify:\n\n1. **Must-Have Features** - Critical for MVP\n2. **Should-Have Features** - Important but not blocking\n3. **Nice-to-Have Features** - Enhancements for later\n4. **Out of Scope** - Explicitly excluded\n\n### Step 5: Identify Technical Implications\n\nBased on features, note:\n\n- Data storage needs (database type, scale)\n- Authentication requirements\n- External integrations\n- Performance requirements\n- Security considerations\n- Deployment environment\n\n---\n\n## Output: project.vision-analysis.md\n\n```markdown\n# Vision Analysis\n\n**Generated:** [timestamp]\n**Vision Version:** [hash or date of vision.md]\n\n## Project Classification\n\n- **Type:** [Web App | API Service | CLI Tool | ...]\n- **Scale:** [Small | Medium | Large | Enterprise]\n- **Estimated Stories:** [range]\n\n## Core Requirements\n\n### Must-Have (MVP)\n1. [Feature 1]\n2. [Feature 2]\n3. ...\n\n### Should-Have (Post-MVP)\n1. [Feature 1]\n2. ...\n\n### Nice-to-Have (Future)\n1. [Feature 1]\n2. ...\n\n### Out of Scope\n- [Excluded item 1]\n- [Excluded item 2]\n\n## Technical Implications\n\n### Data & Storage\n- [Storage needs analysis]\n\n### Authentication & Security\n- [Auth requirements]\n\n### Integrations\n- [External system integrations]\n\n### Performance\n- [Performance requirements]\n\n### Deployment\n- [Deployment environment needs]\n\n## Constraints Summary\n\n| Constraint | Impact |\n|------------|--------|\n| [Constraint 1] | [How it affects decisions] |\n\n## Open Questions\n\n- [ ] [Question that needs clarification]\n- [ ] [Another question]\n\n## Recommended Next Steps\n\n1. Run Architect Skill to determine technology stack\n2. Address any open questions before proceeding\n3. ...\n\n## Architecture Hints\n\nBased on this vision, consider:\n- [Hint about architecture approach]\n- [Hint about technology category]\n```\n\n---\n\n## Decision Points\n\n### When Vision is Unclear\n\nIf the vision document lacks detail:\n\n1. **Do NOT guess** - Document what''s missing\n2. **List specific questions** - What exactly needs clarification\n3. **Provide options** - Suggest possible interpretations\n4. **Proceed cautiously** - Make conservative assumptions and note them\n\n### When Scope is Too Large\n\nIf estimated scale is \"Large\" or \"Enterprise\":\n\n1. **Recommend phased approach** - Break into multiple major milestones\n2. **Identify MVP subset** - What''s the smallest useful version\n3. **Flag risk** - Note that large projects need careful management\n\n### When Constraints Conflict\n\nIf constraints seem to conflict with goals:\n\n1. **Document the conflict** - Be explicit about the tension\n2. **Propose resolutions** - Suggest possible compromises\n3. **Prioritize** - Recommend which constraint to relax\n\n---\n\n## Integration with Orchestrator\n\nAfter vision analysis:\n\n1. Save `project.vision-analysis.md` to project root\n2. Signal completion to orchestrator\n3. Architect Skill uses this analysis as input\n\n---\n\n## Example Analysis\n\n**Input Vision:**\n```markdown\n# Project Vision\n\n## What\nA personal finance tracker that helps users manage their budget and track expenses.\n\n## Why\nExisting apps are too complex. Users need a simple, focused tool.\n\n## Target Users\nIndividuals who want basic expense tracking without complexity.\n\n## Success Criteria\n- Users can add expenses in under 5 seconds\n- Monthly reports generated automatically\n- Works offline\n\n## Constraints\n- Must be a web app (PWA for offline)\n- No paid APIs (keep it free)\n- Single developer, limited time\n```\n\n**Output Analysis:**\n```markdown\n# Vision Analysis\n\n## Project Classification\n- **Type:** Web App (PWA)\n- **Scale:** Medium\n- **Estimated Stories:** 20-35\n\n## Core Requirements\n\n### Must-Have (MVP)\n1. Quick expense entry (< 5 seconds)\n2. Expense categorization\n3. Monthly report generation\n4. Offline support (PWA)\n5. Data persistence\n\n### Should-Have (Post-MVP)\n1. Budget setting and tracking\n2. Expense trends visualization\n3. Export functionality\n\n### Nice-to-Have (Future)\n1. Multiple currencies\n2. Receipt photo capture\n3. Bank import\n\n### Out of Scope\n- Multi-user/sharing features\n- Investment tracking\n- Tax preparation\n\n## Technical Implications\n\n### Data & Storage\n- Local-first (IndexedDB for offline)\n- Optional cloud sync later\n\n### Authentication & Security\n- Initially: None (local only)\n- Later: Simple auth for sync\n\n### Performance\n- Critical: Fast expense entry\n- PWA service worker for offline\n\n### Deployment\n- Static hosting (Netlify, Vercel)\n- No backend initially\n\n## Constraints Summary\n\n| Constraint | Impact |\n|------------|--------|\n| PWA required | Must use service workers, IndexedDB |\n| No paid APIs | Use free/open solutions only |\n| Limited time | Focus on MVP, defer nice-to-haves |\n\n## Recommended Next Steps\n\n1. Run Architect Skill to select frontend framework\n2. Design offline-first data architecture\n3. Plan PWA implementation strategy\n```\n\n---\n\n## Checklist\n\nBefore completing vision analysis:\n\n- [ ] All required vision sections validated\n- [ ] Project type identified\n- [ ] Scale estimated\n- [ ] Features categorized (must/should/nice/out)\n- [ ] Technical implications documented\n- [ ] Constraints analyzed\n- [ ] Open questions listed\n- [ ] Analysis saved to `project.vision-analysis.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:15:59.688Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Autonomous AI Development Agents needing advanced project vision analysis and planning capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级项目视觉分析和规划能力的自主AI开发代理。","ja":"高度なプロジェクトビジョン分析および計画機能を必要とする自律型AI開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 프로젝트 비전 분석 및 계획 기능을 필요로 하는 자율적 AI 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de AI autónomos que necesitan capacidades de análisis y planificación de visión de proyecto avanzadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement d''IA autonomes ayant besoin d''une analyse et d''une planification de vision de projet avancées.","de":"Perfekt für autonome AI-Entwicklungsagenten, die erweiterte Projektvision-Analyse- und Planungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de desenvolvimento de IA autônoma que necessitam de análise e planejamento de visão de projeto avançados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для автономных агентов разработки ИИ, которым необходимы передовые возможности анализа и планирования проектной видения.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المستقلين لتطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى تحليل وتصميم رؤية مشروع متقدم"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to parse project vision documents and extract structured requirements for architecture and planning using markdown files like `project.vision.md` and output analysis to files like `project.vision-analysis.md`.","zh":"使代理能够解析项目视觉文档，并从中提取结构化的架构和规划要求，使用类似`project.vision.md`的markdown文件，并将分析输出到类似`project.vision-analysis.md`的文件中。","ja":"エージェントがプロジェクトビジョンドキュメントを解析し、`project.vision.md`のようなマークダウンファイルからアーキテクチャおよび計画の構造化された要件を抽出し、`project.vision-analysis.md`のようなファイルに出力分析を出力できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 프로젝트 비전 문서를 파싱하고, `project.vision.md`와 같은 마크다운 파일에서 구조화된 아키텍처 및 계획 요구사항을 추출하여, `project.vision-analysis.md`와 같은 파일에 분석 결과를 출력할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a analizar documentos de visión de proyecto y extraer requisitos estructurados para arquitectura y planificación utilizando archivos de markdown como `project.vision.md` y salida de análisis a archivos como `project.vision-analysis.md`.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser les documents de vision de projet et d''extraire des exigences structurées pour l''architecture et la planification en utilisant des fichiers markdown comme `project.vision.md` et en sortie d''analyse dans des fichiers comme `project.vision-analysis.md`.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Projektvision-Dokumente zu parsen und strukturierte Anforderungen für Architektur und Planung mithilfe von Markdown-Dateien wie `project.vision.md` zu extrahieren und Analyseergebnisse in Dateien wie `project.vision-analysis.md` auszugeben.","pt":"Permite que os agentes analisem documentos de visão de projeto e extraiam requisitos estruturados para arquitetura e planejamento usando arquivos markdown como `project.vision.md` e saída de análise para arquivos como `project.vision-analysis.md`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью разбирать документы проектной видения и извлекать структурированные требования для архитектуры и планирования с помощью файлов markdown типа `project.vision.md` и вывода результатов анализа в файлы типа `project.vision-analysis.md`.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء تحليل مستندات رؤية المشروع واستخراج متطلبات بنية وتخطيط باستخدام ملفات تنسيق مثل `project.vision.md` وإخراج تحليل إلى ملفات مثل `project.vision-analysis.md`"},"useCases":{"en":["Parsing project vision documents","Extracting structured requirements for architecture","Generating analysis outputs in markdown format"],"zh":["解析项目视觉文档","提取结构化的架构和规划要求","生成markdown格式的分析输出"],"ja":["プロジェクトビジョンドキュメントの解析","アーキテクチャおよび計画の構造化された要件の抽出","マークダウン形式の分析出力の生成"],"ko":["프로젝트 비전 문서 파싱","구조화된 아키텍처 및 계획 요구사항 추출","마크다운 형식의 분석 출력 생성"],"es":["Análisis de documentos de visión de proyecto","Extracción de requisitos estructurados para arquitectura","Generación de salidas de análisis en formato markdown"],"fr":["Analyse de documents de vision de projet","Extraction d''exigences structurées pour l''architecture","Génération de sorties d''analyse au format markdown"],"de":["Analyse von Projektvision-Dokumenten","Extraktion von strukturierten Anforderungen für Architektur","Generierung von Analyseausgaben im Markdown-Format"],"pt":["Análise de documentos de visão de projeto","Extração de requisitos estruturados para arquitetura","Geração de saídas de análise em formato markdown"],"ru":["Разбор документов проектной видения","Извлечение структурированных требований для архитектуры","Генерация результатов анализа в формате markdown"],"ar":["تحليل مستندات رؤية المشروع","استخراج متطلبات بنية متطابقة","توليد مخرجات تحليل بالتنسيق markdown"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to `.aha-loop/` directory","Limited to markdown file format for vision documents and analysis outputs"],"zh":["需要访问`.aha-loop/`目录","仅限于markdown文件格式的视觉文档和分析输出"],"ja":[".aha-loop/ディレクトリへのアクセスが必要","ビジョンドキュメントおよび分析出力はマークダウンファイル形式のみ"],"ko":[".aha-loop/ 디렉토리에 대한 액세스가 필요","비전 문서 및 분석 출력은 마크다운 파일 형식만으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso al directorio `.aha-loop/`","Limitado al formato de archivo markdown para documentos de visión y salidas de análisis"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au répertoire `.aha-loop/`","Limité au format de fichier markdown pour les documents de vision et les sorties d''analyse"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das Verzeichnis `.aha-loop/`","Begrenzt auf Markdown-Dateiformat für Projektvision-Dokumente und Analyseausgaben"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao diretório `.aha-loop/`","Limitado ao formato de arquivo markdown para documentos de visão e saídas de análise"],"ru":["Требует доступа к каталогу `.aha-loop/`","Ограничен форматом файла markdown для документов видения и результатов анализа"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الدليل `.aha-loop/`","محدود بتنسيق ملف markdown لمستندات الرؤية ومخرجات التحليل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('YougLin-dev/Aha-Loop/roadmap', 'community', 'YougLin-dev', 'Aha-Loop', 'YougLin-dev/Aha-Loop', 'roadmap', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.418Z', '2026-02-18T04:16:03.347Z', NULL, '{"id":"YougLin-dev/Aha-Loop/roadmap","name":"roadmap","description":{"zh":"Aha Loop 路线图技能是一种自动化的 AI 开发系统，用于计划项目执行和组织 PRD","ja":"Aha Loop ロードマップ スキルは，自動化された AI 開発システムで，プロジェクト実行と PRD の計画を実現","ko":"Aha Loop 로드맵 스킬은 자동화된 AI 개발 시스템으로 프로젝트 실행 및 PRD 조직을 위한 계획을 수립","es":"Roadmap es una habilidad de Aha Loop que permite planificar proyectos creando hitos y organizando PRDs de manera eficiente.","fr":"Roadmap est une compétence d''Aha Loop qui permet de planifier des projets en créant des jalons et en organisant des PRDs de manière efficace.","de":"Roadmap ist eine Fähigkeit von Aha Loop, die die Planung von Projekten ermöglicht, indem Meilensteine erstellt und PRDs effizient organisiert werden.","pt":"A habilidade Roadmap do Aha Loop permite planejar a execução do projeto criando marcos e organizando PRDs em uma fila executável.","ru":"Навык Roadmap от Aha Loop позволяет спланировать выполнение проекта, создавая вехи и организуя PRD в исполняемую очередь.","ar":"تمكن مهارة خريطة الطريق من Aha Loop من تخطيط تنفيذ المشروع من خلال إنشاء نقاط مرجعية وتنظيم ملفات PRD في ملف قابلة للتنفيذ.","en":"[MVP] Aha Loop is a fully autonomous AI development system, extended from the core ideas of Ralph. It''s not just an execution engine, but a complete AI development framework with planning capabilities, research abilities, and oversight mechanisms."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Aha Loop 路线图技能","ja":"Aha Loop ロードマップ スキル","ko":"Aha Loop 로드맵 스킬","es":"Planificación de Proyectos con Roadmap","fr":"Planification de Projets avec Roadmap","de":"Projektplanung mit Roadmap","pt":"Roadmap Skill: Planeje a Execução do Projeto com Aha Loop","ru":"Навык Roadmap: Планирование Выполнения Проекта с Aha Loop","ar":"مهارة خريطة الطريق: تخطيط تنفيذ المشروع مع Aha Loop","en":"roadmap"},"description":{"zh":"Aha Loop 路线图技能是一种自动化的 AI 开发系统，用于计划项目执行和组织 PRD","ja":"Aha Loop ロードマップ スキルは，自動化された AI 開発システムで，プロジェクト実行と PRD の計画を実現","ko":"Aha Loop 로드맵 스킬은 자동화된 AI 개발 시스템으로 프로젝트 실행 및 PRD 조직을 위한 계획을 수립","es":"Roadmap es una habilidad de Aha Loop que permite planificar proyectos creando hitos y organizando PRDs de manera eficiente.","fr":"Roadmap est une compétence d''Aha Loop qui permet de planifier des projets en créant des jalons et en organisant des PRDs de manière efficace.","de":"Roadmap ist eine Fähigkeit von Aha Loop, die die Planung von Projekten ermöglicht, indem Meilensteine erstellt und PRDs effizient organisiert werden.","pt":"A habilidade Roadmap do Aha Loop permite planejar a execução do projeto criando marcos e organizando PRDs em uma fila executável.","ru":"Навык Roadmap от Aha Loop позволяет спланировать выполнение проекта, создавая вехи и организуя PRD в исполняемую очередь.","ar":"تمكن مهارة خريطة الطريق من Aha Loop من تخطيط تنفيذ المشروع من خلال إنشاء نقاط مرجعية وتنظيم ملفات PRD في ملف قابلة للتنفيذ.","en":"[MVP] Aha Loop is a fully autonomous AI development system, extended from the core ideas of Ralph. It''s not just an execution engine, but a complete AI devel..."},"definition":{"en":"[MVP] Aha Loop is a fully autonomous AI development system, extended from the core ideas of Ralph. It''s not just an execution engine, but a complete AI development framework with planning capabilities, research abilities, and oversight mechanisms."},"features":{"zh":["自动化项目执行规划","组织 PRD 到可执行队列","支持 workspace 模式","提供 vision 分析和架构支持"],"ja":["自動化プロジェクト実行計画","PRD を実行可能なキューに組織","ワークスペース モードをサポート","ビジョン分析とアーキテクチャを提供"],"ko":["자동화 프로젝트 실행 계획","PRD 를 실행 가능한 큐로 조직","작업공간 모드 지원","비전 분석 및 아키텍처 제공"],"es":["Creación de hitos para proyectos","Organización de PRDs en una cola ejecutable","Planificación de proyectos de manera eficiente","Integración con Aha Loop","Compatibilidad con modo de espacio de trabajo"],"fr":["Création de jalons pour les projets","Organisation de PRDs dans une file d''exécution","Planification de projets de manière efficace","Intégration avec Aha Loop","Compatibilité avec le mode d''espace de travail"],"de":["Erstellung von Meilensteinen für Projekte","Organisation von PRDs in einer ausführbaren Warteschlange","Projektplanung auf effiziente Weise","Integration mit Aha Loop","Kompatibilität mit Arbeitsbereichsmodus"],"pt":["Criação de marcos para planejar a execução do projeto","Organização de PRDs em uma fila executável","Integração com o modo de workspace do Aha Loop","Suporte a arquivos de visão e arquitetura do projeto","Gerenciamento de tarefas e PRDs em uma interface única"],"ru":["Создание вех для планирования выполнения проекта","Организация PRD в исполняемую очередь","Интеграция с режимом workspace от Aha Loop","Поддержка файлов видения и архитектуры проекта","Управление задачами и PRD в едином интерфейсе"],"ar":["إنشاء نقاط مرجعية لتخطيط تنفيذ المشروع","تنظيم ملفات PRD في ملف قابلة للتنفيذ","التكامل مع وضع المساحة العمل من Aha Loop","دعم ملفات الرؤية والهيكل للمشروع","إدارة المهام وملفات PRD في واجهة واحدة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Aha Loop","路线图技能","AI 开发系统","项目执行规划","PRD 组织","自动化开发"],"ja":["Aha Loop","ロードマップ スキル","AI 開発システム","プロジェクト実行計画","PRD 組織","自動化開発"],"ko":["Aha Loop","로드맵 스킬","AI 개발 시스템","프로젝트 실행 계획","PRD 조직","자동화 개발"],"es":["planificación de proyectos","roadmap","Aha Loop","PRD","proyecto","gestión de proyectos","desarrollo de software","planificación de software"],"fr":["planification de projets","roadmap","Aha Loop","PRD","projet","gestion de projets","développement de logiciels","planification de logiciels"],"de":["Projektplanung","Roadmap","Aha Loop","PRD","Projekt","Projektmanagement","Softwareentwicklung","Softwareplanung"],"pt":["roadmap","aha loop","planejamento de projeto","execução de projeto","prds","gestão de tarefas","desenvolvimento de software","engenharia de software","metodologias ágeis"],"ru":["roadmap","aha loop","планирование проекта","выполнение проекта","prd","управление задачами","разработка программного обеспечения","инженерия программного обеспечения","гибкие методологии"],"ar":["خريطة الطريق","aha loop","تخطيط المشروع","تنفيذ المشروع","ملفات PRD","إدارة المهام","تطوير البرمجيات","هندسة البرمجيات","منهجيات敏捷"]}},"owner":"YougLin-dev","repo":"Aha-Loop","repoPath":"YougLin-dev/Aha-Loop","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.418Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"roadmap","description":"Creates and manages project roadmaps with milestones and PRD queues. Use after architecture is defined for project planning. Triggers on: create roadmap, plan milestones, organize prds.","bodyPreview":"# Roadmap Skill\n\nPlan project execution by creating milestones and organizing PRDs into an executable queue.\n\n## Workspace Mode Note\n\nWhen running in workspace mode, all paths are relative to `.aha-loop/` directory:\n- Vision analysis: `.aha-loop/project.vision-analysis.md`\n- Architecture: `.aha-loop/project.architecture.md`\n- Roadmap: `.aha-loop/project.roadmap.json`\n- PRD files: `.aha-loop/tasks/`\n\nThe orchestrator will provide the actual paths in the prompt context.\n\n---\n\n## The Job\n\n1. Read `","body":"# Roadmap Skill\n\nPlan project execution by creating milestones and organizing PRDs into an executable queue.\n\n## Workspace Mode Note\n\nWhen running in workspace mode, all paths are relative to `.aha-loop/` directory:\n- Vision analysis: `.aha-loop/project.vision-analysis.md`\n- Architecture: `.aha-loop/project.architecture.md`\n- Roadmap: `.aha-loop/project.roadmap.json`\n- PRD files: `.aha-loop/tasks/`\n\nThe orchestrator will provide the actual paths in the prompt context.\n\n---\n\n## The Job\n\n1. Read `project.vision-analysis.md` and `project.architecture.md`\n2. Decompose project into milestones\n3. Break each milestone into PRDs\n4. Order PRDs by dependencies\n5. Output `project.roadmap.json`\n6. Generate initial PRD files in `tasks/`\n\n---\n\n## Milestone Strategy\n\n### Standard Milestone Structure\n\n| Milestone | Focus | Goal |\n|-----------|-------|------|\n| **M0: Foundation** | Project scaffolding, CI/CD, tooling | Development environment ready |\n| **M1: MVP** | Core features only | Minimal usable product |\n| **M2: Essential** | Important features | Feature-complete for basic use |\n| **M3: Enhanced** | Nice-to-have features | Polished product |\n| **M4: Optimization** | Performance, UX polish | Production-ready |\n\n### Milestone Sizing\n\nEach milestone should:\n- Be completable in a reasonable timeframe\n- Have 3-7 PRDs (avoid too many or too few)\n- Deliver tangible, testable value\n- Build on previous milestones\n\n---\n\n## PRD Decomposition\n\n### From Features to PRDs\n\nFor each milestone, break down features into PRDs:\n\n```\nMilestone: M1 - MVP\n├── PRD-001: Project Scaffolding\n├── PRD-002: Database Schema\n├── PRD-003: Core Data Models\n├── PRD-004: Basic API Endpoints\n└── PRD-005: Minimal UI\n```\n\n### PRD Sizing\n\nEach PRD should:\n- Take 1-5 Aha Loop iterations (5-25 stories)\n- Focus on one coherent feature area\n- Be independently testable\n- Not depend on unfinished PRDs\n\n### PRD Ordering\n\nOrder PRDs by dependencies:\n\n1. **Infrastructure first** - Project setup, database, auth\n2. **Backend before frontend** - APIs before UI that uses them\n3. **Core before optional** - Must-have before nice-to-have\n4. **Data before presentation** - Models before views\n\n---\n\n## Roadmap JSON Structure\n\n```json\n{\n  \"version\": 1,\n  \"projectName\": \"[From vision]\",\n  \"status\": \"in_progress\",\n  \"currentMilestone\": \"M1\",\n  \"currentPRD\": \"PRD-002\",\n  \"createdAt\": \"[timestamp]\",\n  \"updatedAt\": \"[timestamp]\",\n  \"milestones\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"M0\",\n      \"title\": \"Foundation\",\n      \"description\": \"Project setup and development environment\",\n      \"status\": \"completed\",\n      \"completedAt\": \"[timestamp]\",\n      \"prds\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": \"PRD-001\",\n          \"title\": \"Project Scaffolding\",\n          \"description\": \"Initialize project structure, dependencies, and tooling\",\n          \"status\": \"completed\",\n          \"prdFile\": \"tasks/prd-scaffolding.md\",\n          \"stories\": 5,\n          \"completedAt\": \"[timestamp]\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"M1\",\n      \"title\": \"MVP\",\n      \"description\": \"Minimum viable product with core functionality\",\n      \"status\": \"in_progress\",\n      \"prds\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": \"PRD-002\",\n          \"title\": \"Database Schema\",\n          \"description\": \"Design and implement database schema\",\n          \"status\": \"in_progress\",\n          \"prdFile\": \"tasks/prd-database.md\",\n          \"stories\": 8,\n          \"dependsOn\": [\"PRD-001\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"PRD-003\",\n          \"title\": \"Core API\",\n          \"description\": \"Implement core API endpoints\",\n          \"status\": \"pending\",\n          \"prdFile\": \"tasks/prd-core-api.md\",\n          \"stories\": 12,\n          \"dependsOn\": [\"PRD-002\"]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"M2\",\n      \"title\": \"Essential Features\",\n      \"description\": \"Complete essential features for basic use\",\n      \"status\": \"pending\",\n      \"prds\": []\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changelog\": [\n    {\n      \"timestamp\": \"[timestamp]\",\n      \"action\": \"created\",\n      \"description\": \"Initial roadmap created from vision and architecture\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Roadmap Creation Process\n\n### Step 1: Analyze Requirements\n\nFrom vision analysis, categorize features:\n\n```markdown\n## Feature Categories\n\n### M1: MVP (Must ship)\n- [Feature 1]\n- [Feature 2]\n\n### M2: Essential (Should ship)\n- [Feature 3]\n- [Feature 4]\n\n### M3: Enhanced (Nice to ship)\n- [Feature 5]\n```\n\n### Step 2: Create M0 Foundation\n\nEvery project starts with M0:\n\n```markdown\n## M0: Foundation PRDs\n\n### PRD-001: Project Scaffolding\n- Initialize project with chosen tech stack\n- Set up directory structure\n- Configure linting and formatting\n- Set up basic CI (if applicable)\n- Create initial README\n\n### PRD-002: Development Environment\n- Database setup (if applicable)\n- Environment configuration\n- Development scripts\n- Basic testing infrastructure\n```\n\n### Step 3: Decompose Milestones into PRDs\n\nFor each milestone after M0:\n\n1. List all features for this milestone\n2. Group related features\n3. Order by dependencies\n4. Create PRD for each group\n5. Estimate stories per PRD\n\n### Step 4: Generate PRD Files\n\nFor each PRD, create a stub file in `tasks/`:\n\n```markdown\n# PRD: [Title]\n\n**ID:** PRD-XXX\n**Milestone:** M[N]\n**Status:** Pending\n\n## Overview\n\n[Brief description from roadmap]\n\n## Context\n\n[How this relates to previous PRDs and the overall project]\n\n## Goals\n\n- [Goal 1]\n- [Goal 2]\n\n## User Stories\n\n[To be generated when this PRD becomes active]\n\n## Dependencies\n\n- PRD-XXX: [What it depends on]\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] [High-level criterion]\n- [ ] [Another criterion]\n\n---\n\n*This PRD will be fully expanded when it becomes the active PRD.*\n```\n\n---\n\n## Dynamic Roadmap Updates\n\n### When to Update Roadmap\n\nThe roadmap should be updated when:\n\n1. **PRD Completed** - Mark as complete, update timestamps\n2. **New Requirement Discovered** - Add new PRD\n3. **Scope Change** - Modify or remove PRDs\n4. **Better Approach Found** - Restructure PRDs\n5. **Milestone Complete** - Update status, move to next\n\n### Update Process\n\n```json\n{\n  \"changelog\": [\n    {\n      \"timestamp\": \"2026-01-29T12:00:00Z\",\n      \"action\": \"prd_completed\",\n      \"prdId\": \"PRD-002\",\n      \"description\": \"Database schema implemented\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"timestamp\": \"2026-01-29T14:00:00Z\",\n      \"action\": \"prd_added\",\n      \"prdId\": \"PRD-007\",\n      \"description\": \"Added caching layer PRD based on performance research\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### Automatic Triggers\n\nThe orchestrator should trigger roadmap review:\n\n- After each PRD completion\n- After each milestone completion\n- When significant learnings are recorded\n- When errors repeatedly occur\n\n---\n\n## Integration with Orchestrator\n\n### Orchestrator Reads\n\n```bash\n# Get current PRD\njq ''.currentPRD'' project.roadmap.json\n\n# Get PRD file path\njq -r ''.milestones[].prds[] | select(.id == \"PRD-002\") | .prdFile'' project.roadmap.json\n```\n\n### Orchestrator Updates\n\nAfter PRD completion:\n\n```bash\n# Update PRD status\njq ''.milestones[].prds[] |= if .id == \"PRD-002\" then .status = \"completed\" else . end'' project.roadmap.json\n```\n\n---\n\n## PRD Queue Management\n\n### Getting Next PRD\n\n```python\n# Pseudocode for finding next PRD\ndef get_next_prd(roadmap):\n    for milestone in roadmap.milestones:\n        if milestone.status == \"completed\":\n            continue\n        for prd in milestone.prds:\n            if prd.status == \"pending\":\n                if all_dependencies_complete(prd):\n                    return prd\n    return None  # All complete or blocked\n```\n\n### Handling Blocked PRDs\n\nIf a PRD''s dependencies aren''t met:\n1. Skip to next available PRD\n2. If no PRDs available, report blocking issue\n3. Consider if dependencies need reprioritization\n\n---\n\n## Example Roadmap\n\n**Project:** Personal Finance Tracker (from vision example)\n\n```json\n{\n  \"version\": 1,\n  \"projectName\": \"Finance Tracker\",\n  \"status\": \"in_progress\",\n  \"currentMilestone\": \"M0\",\n  \"currentPRD\": \"PRD-001\",\n  \"milestones\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"M0\",\n      \"title\": \"Foundation\",\n      \"status\": \"in_progress\",\n      \"prds\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": \"PRD-001\",\n          \"title\": \"SvelteKit Project Setup\",\n          \"description\": \"Initialize SvelteKit project with TypeScript, Tailwind, PWA support\",\n          \"status\": \"in_progress\",\n          \"prdFile\": \"tasks/prd-project-setup.md\",\n          \"stories\": 6\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"M1\",\n      \"title\": \"MVP - Core Expense Tracking\",\n      \"status\": \"pending\",\n      \"prds\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": \"PRD-002\",\n          \"title\": \"Data Layer\",\n          \"description\": \"Implement IndexedDB with Dexie for expense storage\",\n          \"status\": \"pending\",\n          \"prdFile\": \"tasks/prd-data-layer.md\",\n          \"stories\": 8,\n          \"dependsOn\": [\"PRD-001\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"PRD-003\",\n          \"title\": \"Quick Expense Entry\",\n          \"description\": \"Fast expense input form (< 5 seconds goal)\",\n          \"status\": \"pending\",\n          \"prdFile\": \"tasks/prd-expense-entry.md\",\n          \"stories\": 10,\n          \"dependsOn\": [\"PRD-002\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"PRD-004\",\n          \"title\": \"Expense List View\",\n          \"description\": \"View and manage recorded expenses\",\n          \"status\": \"pending\",\n          \"prdFile\": \"tasks/prd-expense-list.md\",\n          \"stories\": 8,\n          \"dependsOn\": [\"PRD-002\"]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"M2\",\n      \"title\": \"Reports & PWA\",\n      \"status\": \"pending\",\n      \"prds\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": \"PRD-005\",\n          \"title\": \"Monthly Reports\",\n          \"description\": \"Auto-generated monthly expense reports\",\n          \"status\": \"pending\",\n          \"prdFile\": \"tasks/prd-reports.md\",\n          \"stories\": 10,\n          \"dependsOn\": [\"PRD-003\", \"PRD-004\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"PRD-006\",\n          \"title\": \"PWA Offline Support\",\n          \"description\": \"Full offline capability with service worker\",\n          \"status\": \"pending\",\n          \"prdFile\": \"tasks/prd-pwa.md\",\n          \"stories\": 8,\n          \"dependsOn\": [\"PRD-002\"]\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Checklist\n\nBefore completing roadmap:\n\n- [ ] All milestones defined with clear goals\n- [ ] PRDs created for at least M0 and M1\n- [ ] Dependencies between PRDs mapped\n- [ ] PRD stub files created in tasks/\n- [ ] Roadmap JSON validates\n- [ ] Current milestone and PRD set correctly\n- [ ] Changelog initialized\n- [ ] Saved to `project.roadmap.json`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:16:03.347Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Project Management Agents needing advanced planning and execution capabilities with JSON-based roadmaps.","zh":"非常适合需要高级规划和执行能力的项目管理代理，使用基于JSON的路线图。","ja":"プロジェクト管理エージェントが高度な計画と実行機能を必要とする場合に最適です。JSONベースのロードマップを使用します。","ko":"JSON 기반의 로드맵을 사용하여 고급 계획 및 실행 기능을 필요한 프로젝트 관리 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de gestión de proyectos que necesitan capacidades de planificación y ejecución avanzadas con planes de ruta basados en JSON.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion de projet nécessitant des capacités de planification et d''exécution avancées avec des feuilles de route basées sur JSON.","de":"Perfekt für Projektmanagement-Agenten, die erweiterte Planungs- und Ausführungsfähigkeiten mit JSON-basierten Roadmaps benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de gerenciamento de projetos que necessitam de capacidades de planejamento e execução avançadas com planos de ação baseados em JSON.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по управлению проектами, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности планирования и выполнения с дорожными картами на основе JSON.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات إدارة المشاريع التي تحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة للتخطيط والتنفيذ باستخدام خارطة طريق قائمة على JSON."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to plan project execution by creating milestones and organizing PRDs into an executable queue using JSON files like `project.roadmap.json`, and integrates with vision analysis and architecture files like `project.vision-analysis.md` and `project.architecture.md`.","zh":"使代理能够通过创建里程碑和将PRD组织到可执行队列中来计划项目执行，使用JSON文件如`project.roadmap.json`，并与视觉分析和架构文件如`project.vision-analysis.md`和`project.architecture.md`集成。","ja":"エージェントがマイルストーンを作成し、PRDを実行可能なキューに組織することでプロジェクトの実行を計画できるようにし、`project.roadmap.json`などのJSONファイルを使用し、`project.vision-analysis.md`および`project.architecture.md`などのビジョン分析およびアーキテクチャファイルと統合します。","ko":"에이전트가 마일스톤을 생성하고 PRD를 실행 가능한 큐로 구성하여 프로젝트 실행을 계획할 수 있도록 하며, `project.roadmap.json`과 같은 JSON 파일을 사용하고, `project.vision-analysis.md` 및 `project.architecture.md`와 같은 비전 분석 및 아키텍처 파일과 통합합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a planificar la ejecución del proyecto creando hitos y organizando PRD en una cola ejecutable utilizando archivos JSON como `project.roadmap.json`, e integra con archivos de análisis de visión y arquitectura como `project.vision-analysis.md` y `project.architecture.md`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de planifier l''exécution du projet en créant des jalons et en organisant les PRD dans une file d''exécution à l''aide de fichiers JSON tels que `project.roadmap.json`, et s''intègre avec des fichiers d''analyse de vision et d''architecture tels que `project.vision-analysis.md` et `project.architecture.md`.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die ProjektAusführung zu planen, indem Meilensteine erstellt und PRD in eine ausführbare Warteschlange organisiert werden, unter Verwendung von JSON-Dateien wie `project.roadmap.json`, und integriert sich mit Dateien für die Analyse von Vision und Architektur wie `project.vision-analysis.md` und `project.architecture.md`.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a planejar a execução do projeto criando marcos e organizando PRDs em uma fila executável usando arquivos JSON, como `project.roadmap.json`, e integra-se com arquivos de análise de visão e arquitetura, como `project.vision-analysis.md` e `project.architecture.md`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью планировать выполнение проекта, создавая вехи и организуя PRD в выполнимую очередь с помощью файлов JSON, таких как `project.roadmap.json`, и интегрируется с файлами анализа видения и архитектуры, такими как `project.vision-analysis.md` и `project.architecture.md`.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تخطيط تنفيذ المشروع عن طريق إنشاء مراحل رئيسية وتنظيم ملفات PRD في قائمة قابلة للتنفيذ باستخدام ملفات JSON مثل `project.roadmap.json`، ويتكامل مع ملفات تحليل الرؤية والهيكلية مثل `project.vision-analysis.md` و `project.architecture.md`."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating project planning with mileage tracking","Generating executable queues from PRD files","Debugging roadmap inconsistencies with JSON validation"],"zh":["使用里程碑跟踪自动化项目规划","从PRD文件生成可执行队列","使用JSON验证调试路线图不一致性"],"ja":["マイルストーン追跡を使用したプロジェクト計画の自動化","PRDファイルから実行可能なキューを生成する","JSON検証を使用したロードマップの不一致のデバッグ"],"ko":["마일스톤 추적을 사용한 프로젝트 계획 자동화","PRD 파일에서 실행 가능한 큐 생성","JSON 검증을 사용한 로드맵 불일치 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización de la planificación de proyectos con seguimiento de hitos","Generación de colas ejecutables a partir de archivos PRD","Depuración de inconsistencias en la hoja de ruta con validación JSON"],"fr":["Automatisation de la planification de projet avec suivi des jalons","Génération de files d''exécution à partir de fichiers PRD","Débogage des incohérences dans la feuille de route avec validation JSON"],"de":["Automatisierung der Projektplanung mit Meilensteinverfolgung","Erzeugung von ausführbaren Warteschlangen aus PRD-Dateien","Fehlerbehebung bei Inkonsistenzen in der Roadmap mit JSON-Validierung"],"pt":["Automatizar o planejamento de projetos com rastreamento de milhagem","Gerar filas executáveis a partir de arquivos PRD","Depurar inconsistências de planos de ação com validação JSON"],"ru":["Автоматизировать планирование проектов с отслеживанием пройденного расстояния","Генерировать выполнимые очереди из файлов PRD","Отлаживать несоответствия дорожной карты с помощью проверки JSON"],"ar":["تأتمتة ت