 Loop","fr":"Recherche approfondie avec Aha Loop","de":"Tiefere Recherche mit Aha Loop","pt":"Pesquisa Avançada com Aha Loop","ru":"Продвинутые исследования с Aha Loop","ar":"البحث المتقدم مع Aha Loop","en":"research"},"description":{"zh":"Aha Loop研究技能是一个完全自主的AI开发系统组件，专注于在代码实施前进行深入的技术研究，确保基于充分信息的高质量决策。它包含规划能力、研究功能和监督机制。","ja":"Aha Loopリサーチスキルは、実装前に徹底的な技術調査を行い、情報に基づいた高品質な意思決定を確保する完全自律型AI開発システムのコンポーネントです。計画機能、研究能力、監視メカニズムを備えています。","ko":"Aha Loop 리서치 스킬은 구현 전 철저한 기술 연구를 수행하여 정보에 기반한 고품질 의사 결정을 보장하는 완전 자율형 AI 개발 시스템 구성 요소입니다. 계획 기능, 연구 능력 및 감독 메커니즘을 포함합니다.","es":"Aha Loop es un sistema de desarrollo de IA completamente autónomo que permite la investigación técnica exhaustiva","fr":"Aha Loop est un système de développement d''IA entièrement autonome qui permet la recherche technique approfondie","de":"Aha Loop ist ein vollständig autonomes AI-Entwicklungssystem, das umfassende technische Recherche ermöglicht","pt":"A habilidade de pesquisa da Aha Loop permite uma pesquisa técnica aprofundada antes da implementação, garantindo decisões informadas de alta qualidade.","ru":"Способность исследования Aha Loop позволяет проводить углубленное техническое исследование перед реализацией, гарантируя принятие обоснованных решений высоко...","ar":"تمكن مهارة البحث في Aha Loop من إجراء بحث تقني متقدم قبل التنفيذ، مما يضمن اتخاذ قرارات مستنيرة من الجودة العالية.","en":"[MVP] Aha Loop is a fully autonomous AI development system, extended from the core ideas of Ralph. It''s not just an execution engine, but a complete AI devel..."},"definition":{"en":"[MVP] Aha Loop is a fully autonomous AI development system, extended from the core ideas of Ralph. It''s not just an execution engine, but a complete AI development framework with planning capabilities, research abilities, and oversight mechanisms."},"features":{"zh":["实施前深度技术研究确保高质量决策","专用研究报告目录(.aha-loop/research/)","集成知识库管理系统(.aha-loop/knowledge/)","工作区模式相对路径管理","供应商目录隔离(.aha-loop/.vendor/)"," orchestrator提供实际路径上下文"],"ja":["実装前の詳細な技術調査による高品質な意思決定","専用研究レポートディレクトリ(.aha-loop/research/)","統合ナレッジベース管理システム(.aha-loop/knowledge/)","ワークスペースモードの相対パス管理","ベンダーディレクトリの分離(.aha-loop/.vendor/)","オーケストレーターによる実際のパスコンテキスト提供"],"ko":["구현 전 심층 기술 연구를 통한 고품질 의사 결정","전용 연구 보고서 디렉토리(.aha-loop/research/)","통합 지식 베이스 관리 시스템(.aha-loop/knowledge/)","워크스페이스 모드 상대 경로 관리","벤더 디렉토리 분리(.aha-loop/.vendor/)","오케스트레이터에 의한 실제 경로 컨텍스트 제공"],"es":["Investigación técnica exhaustiva","Capacidades de planificación autónomas","Mecanismos de supervisión","Informes de investigación","Base de conocimiento"],"fr":["Recherche technique approfondie","Capacités de planification autonomes","Mécanismes de surveillance","Rapports de recherche","Base de connaissances"],"de":["Umfassende technische Recherche","Autarke Planungsfähigkeiten","Überwachungsmechanismen","Forschungsberichte","Wissensbasis"],"pt":["Pesquisa técnica aprofundada","Tomada de decisões informadas","Implementação de soluções AI de alta qualidade","Relatórios de pesquisa personalizados","Integração com o conhecimento base"],"ru":["Углубленное техническое исследование","Принятие обоснованных решений","Реализация высококачественных решений AI","Пользовательские отчеты исследований","Интеграция с базой знаний"],"ar":["البحث التقني المتقدم","اتخاذ قرارات مستنيرة","تنفيذ حلول ذكية من الجودة العالية","تقارير بحث مخصصة","التكامل مع قاعدة المعرفة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Aha Loop研究技能","自主AI开发框架","技术研究实现","研究报告生成","知识库集成","工作区模式路径","AI开发监督机制","Ralph扩展系统","MVP开发框架"],"ja":["Aha Loopリサーチスキル","自律AI開発フレームワーク","技術調査実装","研究レポート生成","ナレッジベース統合","ワークスペースモードパス","AI開発監視メカニズム","Ralph拡張システム","MVP開発フレームワーク"],"ko":["Aha Loop 리서치 스킬","자율 AI 개발 프레임워크","기술 연구 구현","연구 보고서 생성","지식 베이스 통합","워크스페이스 모드 경로","AI 개발 감독 메커니즘","Ralph 확장 시스템","MVP 개발 프레임워크"],"es":["desarrollo de IA","investigación técnica","planificación autónoma","sistema de desarrollo de IA","recherche en profundidad"],"fr":["développement d''IA","recherche technique","planification autonome","système de développement d''IA","recherche approfondie"],"de":["KI-Entwicklung","technische Recherche","autarke Planung","KI-Entwicklungssystem","tiefere Recherche"],"pt":["pesquisa avançada","desenvolvimento de soluções AI","tomada de decisões informadas","implementação de soluções de alta qualidade","relatórios de pesquisa personalizados","conhecimento base"],"ru":["продвинутые исследования","разработка решений AI","принятие обоснованных решений","реализация высококачественных решений","пользовательские отчеты исследований","база знаний"],"ar":["البحث المتقدم","تطوير حلول ذكية","اتخاذ قرارات مستنيرة","تنفيذ حلول من الجودة العالية","تقارير بحث مخصصة","قاعدة المعرفة"]}},"owner":"YougLin-dev","repo":"Aha-Loop","repoPath":"YougLin-dev/Aha-Loop","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.418Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"research","description":"Conducts deep technical research for Aha Loop stories. Use before implementing stories involving unfamiliar libraries or architectural decisions. Triggers on: research this, investigate, explore options, compare alternatives.","bodyPreview":"# Deep Research Skill\n\nConduct thorough technical research before implementation to ensure high-quality, informed decisions.\n\n## Workspace Mode Note\n\nWhen running in workspace mode, all paths are relative to `.aha-loop/` directory:\n- Research reports: `.aha-loop/research/` (not `scripts/aha-loop/research/`)\n- Knowledge base: `.aha-loop/knowledge/` (not `knowledge/`)\n- Vendor directory: `.aha-loop/.vendor/` (not `.vendor/`)\n\nThe orchestrator will provide the actual paths in the prompt context.\n\n-","body":"# Deep Research Skill\n\nConduct thorough technical research before implementation to ensure high-quality, informed decisions.\n\n## Workspace Mode Note\n\nWhen running in workspace mode, all paths are relative to `.aha-loop/` directory:\n- Research reports: `.aha-loop/research/` (not `scripts/aha-loop/research/`)\n- Knowledge base: `.aha-loop/knowledge/` (not `knowledge/`)\n- Vendor directory: `.aha-loop/.vendor/` (not `.vendor/`)\n\nThe orchestrator will provide the actual paths in the prompt context.\n\n---\n\n## The Job\n\n1. Identify research topics from the current story''s `researchTopics` field\n2. Fetch third-party library source code if needed\n3. Search documentation and best practices\n4. Analyze and compare alternatives\n5. Generate a research report\n6. Update knowledge base with findings\n7. Mark `researchCompleted: true` in prd.json\n\n---\n\n## Research Process\n\n### Step 1: Identify What to Research\n\nRead the current story from `prd.json` and extract:\n- `researchTopics` - explicit topics to investigate\n- Dependencies mentioned in acceptance criteria\n- Patterns referenced in the description\n\nAlso check:\n- Previous story''s `learnings` field for follow-up research needs\n- `knowledge/project/gotchas.md` for related known issues\n\n### Step 2: Fetch Library Source Code (If Needed)\n\nFor any third-party library research, fetch the source:\n\n```bash\n# Fetch specific library\n./scripts/aha-loop/fetch-source.sh rust tokio 1.35.0\n\n# Or fetch all project dependencies\n./scripts/aha-loop/fetch-source.sh --from-deps\n```\n\nAfter fetching, the source will be at `.vendor/<ecosystem>/<name>-<version>/`\n\n---\n\n## Library Version Selection\n\n### Always Prefer Latest Stable Versions\n\nWhen researching or recommending libraries, **always check for and prefer the latest stable version** unless there''s a specific compatibility reason not to.\n\n### Version Research Process\n\n1. **Query the package registry for latest version:**\n\n   ```bash\n   # Rust (crates.io)\n   curl -s \"https://crates.io/api/v1/crates/tokio\" | jq ''.crate.max_stable_version''\n   \n   # Or use cargo\n   cargo search tokio --limit 1\n   \n   # Node.js (npm)\n   npm view react version\n   \n   # Python (PyPI)\n   pip index versions requests 2>/dev/null | head -1\n   ```\n\n2. **Verify stability:**\n   - Released at least 1-2 weeks ago (not bleeding edge)\n   - Check GitHub issues for critical bugs\n   - Review changelog for breaking changes\n\n3. **Check compatibility:**\n   - Works with existing project dependencies\n   - Compatible with project''s minimum supported language version\n   - No known conflicts\n\n### Version Documentation\n\nAlways document version decisions:\n\n```markdown\n## Version Decision: [Library Name]\n\n**Selected Version:** X.Y.Z\n**Latest Available:** X.Y.Z (as of YYYY-MM-DD)\n**Reason:** [Why this version was chosen]\n\n**Compatibility Notes:**\n- Works with [other dependency] v[X.Y]\n- Requires [language] v[X.Y]+\n```\n\n### When to Use Older Versions\n\nOnly use older versions when:\n- Latest version has critical bugs\n- Incompatible with required dependencies\n- Breaking changes require significant refactoring\n- Project explicitly constrains the version\n\n**Always document the reason** in `knowledge/project/decisions.md`:\n\n```markdown\n### ADR: Using [Library] v[Old] instead of v[New]\n\n**Context:** [Why we''re not using latest]\n**Decision:** Pin to v[Old]\n**Consequences:** [What we''re missing, when to revisit]\n```\n\n---\n\n### Step 3: Read Source Code Strategically\n\n**Reading Order (Most Important First):**\n\n1. **README.md** - Understand design intent and quick-start examples\n2. **Entry Point Files:**\n   - Rust: `src/lib.rs`, `src/main.rs`\n   - TypeScript/JS: `src/index.ts`, `index.js`\n   - Python: `__init__.py`, `main.py`\n3. **Module Structure** - Scan `mod.rs` files or directory structure\n4. **Type Definitions** - Find core structs, interfaces, types\n5. **Target Functionality** - Locate the specific feature you need\n6. **Tests** - Learn correct usage patterns from test files\n\n**Reading Tips:**\n\n- Use semantic search to find relevant code sections\n- Focus on PUBLIC APIs, skip internal implementation unless needed\n- Look for `examples/` directory for usage patterns\n- Check `tests/` for edge cases and proper usage\n\n### Step 4: Web Search for Context\n\nSearch for:\n- Official documentation\n- Best practices and common patterns\n- Known issues and gotchas\n- Performance considerations\n- Alternative libraries\n\nUse MCP tools like `context7` for up-to-date documentation.\n\n### Step 5: Compare Alternatives (If Applicable)\n\nWhen multiple solutions exist, create a comparison:\n\n| Criterion | Option A | Option B | Option C |\n|-----------|----------|----------|----------|\n| Performance | ... | ... | ... |\n| API Ergonomics | ... | ... | ... |\n| Maintenance Status | ... | ... | ... |\n| Bundle Size | ... | ... | ... |\n| Learning Curve | ... | ... | ... |\n\nInclude a **recommendation** with reasoning.\n\n---\n\n## Research Report Template\n\nSave to: `scripts/aha-loop/research/[story-id]-research.md`\n\n```markdown\n# Research Report: [Story ID] - [Story Title]\n\n**Date:** YYYY-MM-DD\n**Status:** Complete | Needs Follow-up\n\n## Research Topics\n\n1. [Topic from researchTopics array]\n2. ...\n\n## Findings\n\n### Topic 1: [Name]\n\n**Summary:** Brief answer to the research question\n\n**Source Code Analysis:**\n- Library: [name] v[version]\n- Key File: `.vendor/rust/tokio-1.35.0/src/runtime/mod.rs`\n- Relevant Code: Lines 123-189\n- Pattern Observed: [description]\n\n**Documentation Notes:**\n- [Key insight from docs]\n- [Another insight]\n\n**Code Example:**\n```[language]\n// Example from source or docs\n```\n\n### Topic 2: [Name]\n...\n\n## Alternatives Comparison\n\n| Criterion | Option A | Option B | Recommendation |\n|-----------|----------|----------|----------------|\n| ... | ... | ... | ... |\n\n**Recommendation:** [Option X] because [reasoning]\n\n## Implementation Recommendations\n\nBased on research, the story should be implemented as follows:\n\n1. [Specific implementation guidance]\n2. [Pattern to follow]\n3. [Pitfalls to avoid]\n\n## Follow-up Research Needed\n\n- [ ] [Topic that needs deeper investigation]\n- [ ] [Question that emerged during research]\n\n## Knowledge Base Updates\n\nThe following should be added to knowledge base:\n\n**To `knowledge/project/patterns.md`:**\n- [Pattern specific to this project]\n\n**To `knowledge/domain/[topic]/`:**\n- [Reusable knowledge about a library or technique]\n```\n\n---\n\n## Updating Knowledge Base\n\n### Project Knowledge (`knowledge/project/`)\n\nAdd patterns specific to THIS project:\n- How this codebase uses a library\n- Project-specific conventions discovered\n- Gotchas specific to this codebase\n\n### Domain Knowledge (`knowledge/domain/`)\n\nAdd reusable technical knowledge:\n- Library usage patterns (applicable to any project)\n- Comparison documents\n- Best practices\n\n**Create new topic directories as needed:**\n\n```\nknowledge/domain/\n└── [topic-name]/\n    ├── README.md           # Overview\n    ├── patterns.md         # Common patterns\n    ├── gotchas.md          # Known issues\n    └── examples/           # Code examples\n```\n\n---\n\n## Source Code Reading Report\n\nWhen you read library source code, document your findings:\n\n```markdown\n## Source Code Analysis: [Library] v[Version]\n\n### Module Structure\n```\nsrc/\n├── lib.rs          # Main entry, exports public API\n├── runtime/        # Async runtime implementation\n│   ├── mod.rs      # Module exports\n│   └── scheduler.rs # Task scheduling\n└── sync/           # Synchronization primitives\n```\n\n### Key Types\n\n- `Runtime` (src/runtime/mod.rs:45) - Main runtime struct\n- `Handle` (src/runtime/handle.rs:23) - Runtime handle for spawning\n\n### Key Functions\n\n- `Runtime::new()` (L89-L120) - Creates new runtime with default config\n- `spawn()` (L156-L189) - Spawns a new async task\n\n### Usage Patterns from Tests\n\nFrom `tests/runtime.rs:34`:\n```rust\nlet rt = Runtime::new().unwrap();\nrt.block_on(async {\n    // ...\n});\n```\n\n### Important Notes\n\n- Thread safety: Runtime is Send + Sync\n- Performance: Use `spawn_blocking` for CPU-heavy tasks\n- Gotcha: Don''t call `block_on` from async context\n```\n\n---\n\n## Checklist\n\nBefore marking research complete:\n\n- [ ] All `researchTopics` investigated\n- [ ] Library source code fetched and key files read (if applicable)\n- [ ] Web search performed for documentation and best practices\n- [ ] Alternatives compared (if multiple options exist)\n- [ ] Research report saved to `scripts/aha-loop/research/`\n- [ ] Knowledge base updated with reusable findings\n- [ ] Implementation recommendations documented\n- [ ] `researchCompleted: true` set in prd.json\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:16:20.342Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Advanced AI Agents needing thorough technical research capabilities for informed decision-making.","zh":"非常适合需要具备全面技术研究能力以进行明智决策的高级AI代理。","ja":"情報に基づいた意思決定を行うための徹底的な技術調査能力を必要とする高度なAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"정보에 기반한 의사 결정을 내리기 위해 철저한 기술 연구 능력이 필요한 고급 AI 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de IA avanzados que necesitan capacidades exhaustivas de investigación técnica para una toma de decisiones informada.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA avancés ayant besoin de capacités de recherche technique approfondies pour une prise de décision éclairée.","de":"Ideal für fortgeschrittene KI-Agenten, die umfassende technische Forschungsfähigkeiten für fundierte Entscheidungsfindung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA Avançados que necessitam de capacidades de pesquisa técnica aprofundada para tomada de decisões informadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых агентов ИИ, которым необходимы тщательные технические исследования для принятия обоснованных решений.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المتقدم الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات بحث تقني شامل لاتخاذ قرارات مستنيرة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to conduct deep technical research, ensuring high-quality decisions through thorough analysis of research reports stored in the `.aha-loop/research/` directory, leveraging a knowledge base in `.aha-loop/knowledge/` for comprehensive insights.","zh":"使代理能够进行深入的技术研究，通过彻底分析存储在`.aha-loop/research/`目录中的研究报告来确保高质量的决策，并利用`.aha-loop/knowledge/`中的知识库获得全面的见解。","ja":"エージェントが深い技術調査を実施できるようにし、`.aha-loop/research/`ディレクトリに保存された調査報告書を徹底的に分析することで高品質な意思決定を確保し、`.aha-loop/knowledge/`のナレッジベースを活用して包括的な洞察を得ます。","ko":"에이전트가 심층적인 기술 연구를 수행할 수 있도록 하여, `.aha-loop/research/` 디렉토리에 저장된 연구 보고서를 철저히 분석하여 고품질의 결정을 보장하고, `.aha-loop/knowledge/`의 지식 베이스를 활용하여 포괄적인 통찰력을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes realizar investigaciones técnicas profundas, garantizando decisiones de alta calidad mediante un análisis exhaustivo de los informes de investigación almacenados en el directorio `.aha-loop/research/`, aprovechando una base de conocimientos en `.aha-loop/knowledge/` para obtener perspectivas integrales.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mener des recherches techniques approfondies, garantissant des décisions de haute qualité grâce à une analyse minutieuse des rapports de recherche stockés dans le répertoire `.aha-loop/research/`, en tirant parti d''une base de connaissances dans `.aha-loop/knowledge/` pour des insights complets.","de":"Ermöglicht Agenten, tiefgehende technische Recherchen durchzuführen und sichert so hochwertige Entscheidungen durch gründliche Analyse der im Verzeichnis `.aha-loop/research/` gespeicherten Forschungsberichte, unter Nutzung einer Wissensbasis in `.aha-loop/knowledge/` für umfassende Einblicke.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar pesquisas técnicas aprofundadas, garantindo decisões de alta qualidade por meio da análise minuciosa de relatórios de pesquisa armazenados no diretório `.aha-loop/research/`, utilizando uma base de conhecimento em `.aha-loop/knowledge/` para insights abrangentes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов способностью проводить глубокие технические исследования, обеспечивая принятие высококачественных решений посредством тщательного анализа отчетов исследований, хранящихся в каталоге `.aha-loop/research/`, используя базу знаний в `.aha-loop/knowledge/` для всесторонних выводов.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من إجراء بحوث تقنية متعمقة، مما يضمن اتخاذ قرارات عالية الجودة من خلال تحليل متعمق لتقارير البحث المخزنة في الدليل `.aha-loop/research/` ، باستخدام قاعدة معرفة في `.aha-loop/knowledge/` للرؤى الشاملة."},"useCases":{"en":["Conducting thorough technical research before implementation","Generating research reports for oversight mechanisms","Utilizing knowledge base for informed AI development framework planning"],"zh":["在实施前进行彻底的技术研究","为监督机制生成研究报告","利用知识库进行明智的AI开发框架规划"],"ja":["実装前の徹底的な技術調査の実施","監督メカニズムのための調査報告書の生成","情報に基づいたAI開発フレームワーク計画のためのナレッジベースの活用"],"ko":["구현 전 철저한 기술 연구 수행","감독 메커니즘을 위한 연구 보고서 생성","정보에 기반한 AI 개발 프레임워크 계획을 위한 지식 베이스 활용"],"es":["Realizar una investigación técnica exhaustiva antes de la implementación","Generar informes de investigación para mecanismos de supervisión","Utilizar la base de conocimientos para una planificación informada del marco de desarrollo de IA"],"fr":["Mener une recherche technique approfondie avant la mise en œuvre","Générer des rapports de recherche pour les mécanismes de supervision","Utiliser la base de connaissances pour une planification éclairée du cadre de développement IA"],"de":["Durchführung gründlicher technischer Recherchen vor der Implementierung","Erstellung von Forschungsberichten für Überwachungsmechanismen","Nutzung der Wissensbasis für eine fundierte Planung von KI-Entwicklungsframeworks"],"pt":["Realizar pesquisas técnicas aprofundadas antes da implementação","Gerar relatórios de pesquisa para mecanismos de supervisão","Utilizar a base de conhecimento para planejamento de estrutura de desenvolvimento de IA informado"],"ru":["Проведение тщательных технических исследований перед реализацией","Генерация отчетов исследований для механизмов надзора","Использование базы знаний для планирования информированной структуры разработки ИИ"],"ar":["إجراء بحوث تقنية متعمقة قبل التنفيذ","generar تقارير البحث لأجهزة الرقابة","استخدام قاعدة المعرفة لتخطيط إطار عمل تطوير ذكاء اصطناعي مستنير"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to `.aha-loop/` directory for relative pathing","Workspace mode constraints for research reports and knowledge base"],"zh":["需要访问`.aha-loop/`目录以进行相对路径处理","研究报告和知识库的工作区模式限制"],"ja":["相対パス処理のために`.aha-loop/`ディレクトリへのアクセスが必要","調査報告書とナレッジベースに関するワークスペースモードの制約"],"ko":["상대 경로 처리를 위해 `.aha-loop/` 디렉토리에 대한 액세스 필요","연구 보고서 및 지식 베이스에 대한 작업 공간 모드 제약"],"es":["Requiere acceso al directorio `.aha-loop/` para rutas relativas","Restricciones del modo de espacio de trabajo para informes de investigación y base de conocimientos"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au répertoire `.aha-loop/` pour le chemin relatif","Contraintes du mode espace de travail pour les rapports de recherche et la base de connaissances"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf das `.aha-loop/`-Verzeichnis für relative Pfadangaben","Einschränkungen des Arbeitsbereichmodus für Forschungsberichte und Wissensbasis"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao diretório `.aha-loop/` para caminhos relativos","Restrições do modo de trabalho para relatórios de pesquisa e base de conhecimento"],"ru":["Требует доступа к каталогу `.aha-loop/` для относительного пути","Ограничения режима работы для отчетов исследований и базы знаний"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الدليل `.aha-loop/` لمسارات相対ية","قيود وضع العمل لتقرير البحث وقاعدة المعرفة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('cartridge-gg/controller/update-pr', 'community', 'cartridge-gg', 'controller', 'cartridge-gg/controller', 'update-pr', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.418Z', '2026-02-18T04:15:52.982Z', NULL, '{"id":"cartridge-gg/controller/update-pr","name":"update-pr","description":{"zh":"更新拉取请求涉及查看评论、回复反馈和修改代码。通过此过程，开发者可以确保代码质量和可靠性","ja":"プルリクエストの更新には、コメントの表示、フィードバックの対応、コードの変更が含まれます。このプロセスにより、開発者はコードの品質と信頼性を確保できます","ko":"업데이트 プル リクエスト에는 코멘트 보기, 피드백 대응, 코드 수정이 포함됩니다. 이 프로세스를 통해 개발자는 코드 품질과 신뢰성을 확보할 수 있습니다","es":"Update-pr es una herramienta para actualizar solicitudes de extracción de forma eficiente. Permite a los desarrolladores gestionar y actualizar sus solicitudes de extracción de manera efectiva.","fr":"Update-pr est un outil pour mettre à jour les demandes d''extraction de manière efficace. Il permet aux développeurs de gérer et de mettre à jour leurs demandes d''extraction de manière efficace.","de":"Update-pr ist ein Tool, um Pull-Requests effizient zu aktualisieren. Es ermöglicht Entwicklern, ihre Pull-Requests effektiv zu verwalten und zu aktualisieren.","pt":"O update-pr é uma habilidade que permite atualizar pull requests de forma eficiente. Aprenda a identificar, buscar comentários e resolver problemas de código.","ru":"Обновление пулл-реквеста - это навык, который позволяет обновлять пулл-реквесты эффективно. Узнайте, как идентифицировать, получать комментарии и решать проблемы с кодом.","ar":"تحديث الطلبات الجديدة هو مهارة تسمح بتحديث الطلبات الجديدة بفعالية. تعلم كيفية تحديد، استرجاع التعليقات وحل مشاكل الكود.","en":"A self custodial embedded account to seamlessly play onchain games"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"更新拉取请求","ja":"プルリクエストの更新","ko":"업데이트 プル リクエスト","es":"Actualiza solicitudes de extracción con update-pr","fr":"Mettre à jour les demandes d''extraction avec update-pr","de":"Aktualisieren von Pull-Request