os y revisiones de solicitudes de extracción","Permite abordar la retroalimentación y actualizar el código","Integra con GitHub para una experiencia de desarrollo fluida","Proporciona una forma eficiente de gestionar el flujo de trabajo de desarrollo"],"fr":["Identifie et gère les demandes d''extraction","Obtient des commentaires et des révisions de demandes d''extraction","Permet de traiter les commentaires et de mettre à jour le code","Intègre avec GitHub pour une expérience de développement fluide","Fournit un moyen efficace de gérer le flux de travail de développement"],"de":["Identifiziert und verwaltet Pull-Requests","Ermittelt Kommentare und Überprüfungen von Pull-Requests","Ermöglicht die Bearbeitung von Kommentaren und die Aktualisierung des Codes","Integriert mit GitHub für eine flüssige Entwicklungserfahrung","Bietet eine effiziente Möglichkeit, den Entwicklungsworkfluss zu verwalten"],"pt":["Identificar pull requests abertos","Buscar comentários e revisões","Resolver problemas de código de forma eficiente","Melhorar a produtividade do desenvolvedor","Fazer atualizações precisas e rápidas"],"ru":["Идентифицировать открытые пулл-реквесты","Получать комментарии и ревью","Решать проблемы с кодом эффективно","Улучшать производительность разработчика","Делать точные и быстрые обновления"],"ar":["تحديد الطلبات الجديدة المفتوحة","استرجاع التعليقات والمراجعات","حل مشاكل الكود بفعالية","تحسين إنتاجية المطور","إجراء تحديثات دقيقة وسريعة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["更新拉取请求","代码修改","gh命令行工具","拉取请求评论","代码质量","代码可靠性","开发者工具","代码审查","反馈机制"],"ja":["プルリクエストの更新","コードの変更","ghコマンドラインツール","プルリクエストのコメント","コードの品質","コードの信頼性","開発者ツール","コードレビュー","フィードバック機構"],"ko":["업데이트 プル リクエスト","코드 수정","gh 명령줄 도구","업데이트 プル リクエスト 코멘트","코드 품질","코드 신뢰성","개발자 도구","코드 리뷰","피드백 메커니즘"],"es":["update-pr","solicitudes de extracción","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","GitHub","flujo de trabajo de desarrollo","gestión de solicitudes de extracción"],"fr":["update-pr","demandes d''extraction","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","GitHub","flux de travail de développement","gestion des demandes d''extraction"],"de":["update-pr","Pull-Requests","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools","GitHub","Entwicklungsworkfluss","Verwaltung von Pull-Requests"],"pt":["update-pr","pull request","desenvolvedor","produtividade","código","revisão","comentários","git","github"],"ru":["обновление пулл-реквеста","пулл-реквест","разработчик","производительность","код","ревью","комментарии","git","github"],"ar":["تحديث الطلبات الجديدة","الطلبات الجديدة","مطور","إنتاجية","كود","مراجعة","تعليقات","git","github"]}},"owner":"cartridge-gg","repo":"controller","repoPath":"cartridge-gg/controller","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.418Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"update-pr","description":"Update an existing pull request with new changes or respond to review feedback. Use when addressing PR comments, making requested changes, or updating a PR after review.","bodyPreview":"# Update Pull Request\n\n## Steps\n\n### 1. Identify the PR\n\n```bash\n# List open PRs for current branch\ngh pr list --head $(git branch --show-current)\n\n# Or get PR details by number\ngh pr view <PR_NUMBER>\n```\n\n### 2. Fetch Review Comments\n\n```bash\n# View PR reviews and comments\ngh pr view <PR_NUMBER> --comments\n\n# View the PR diff to understand context\ngh pr diff <PR_NUMBER>\n```\n\n### 3. Address Feedback\n\nFor each review comment:\n1. Read and understand the feedback\n2. Make the necessary code changes","body":"# Update Pull Request\n\n## Steps\n\n### 1. Identify the PR\n\n```bash\n# List open PRs for current branch\ngh pr list --head $(git branch --show-current)\n\n# Or get PR details by number\ngh pr view <PR_NUMBER>\n```\n\n### 2. Fetch Review Comments\n\n```bash\n# View PR reviews and comments\ngh pr view <PR_NUMBER> --comments\n\n# View the PR diff to understand context\ngh pr diff <PR_NUMBER>\n```\n\n### 3. Address Feedback\n\nFor each review comment:\n1. Read and understand the feedback\n2. Make the necessary code changes\n3. Stage and commit with a descriptive message\n\n```bash\n# Stage changes\ngit add -u\n\n# Commit with reference to what was addressed\ngit commit -m \"address review: <brief description>\"\n```\n\n### 4. Push Updates\n\n```bash\n# Push to the same branch (PR updates automatically)\ngit push\n```\n\n### 5. Respond to Review Comments (Optional)\n\nIf you need to reply to specific comments:\n\n```bash\n# Reply to a review comment\ngh api repos/{owner}/{repo}/pulls/<PR_NUMBER>/comments/<COMMENT_ID>/replies \\\n  -f body=\"Done - updated the implementation as suggested\"\n```\n\nOr use the GitHub web interface for complex discussions.\n\n### 6. Re-request Review (if needed)\n\n```bash\n# Re-request review from specific reviewers\ngh pr edit <PR_NUMBER> --add-reviewer <username>\n```\n\n## Handling Common Review Requests\n\n### \"Please add tests\"\n1. Identify the appropriate test file in `packages/*/src/__tests__/`\n2. Add test cases covering the new functionality\n3. Run `pnpm test` to verify\n\n### \"Update types\"\n1. Check TypeScript errors with `pnpm build`\n2. Update type definitions as needed\n3. Ensure no type errors remain\n\n### \"Fix lint issues\"\n```bash\npnpm format  # Auto-fix formatting\npnpm lint    # Check and fix lint issues\n```\n\n### \"Update snapshots\"\n```bash\npnpm test:storybook:update\ngit add packages/*/__image_snapshots__/\ngit commit -m \"chore: update storybook snapshots\"\n```\n\n## Squashing Commits (if requested)\n\nIf the reviewer asks to squash commits:\n\n```bash\n# Interactive rebase to squash\ngit rebase -i origin/main\n\n# In the editor, change ''pick'' to ''squash'' for commits to combine\n# Save and edit the combined commit message\n\n# Force push (safe for PR branches)\ngit push --force-with-lease\n```\n\n## Example Workflow\n\n```bash\n# 1. Fetch latest review comments\ngh pr view 42 --comments\n\n# 2. Make changes based on feedback\n# ... edit files ...\n\n# 3. Commit and push\ngit add -u\ngit commit -m \"address review: add error handling for edge case\"\ngit push\n\n# 4. Notify reviewer\necho \"Updated PR #42 - addressed all review comments\"\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:15:52.982Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for GitHub Automation Agents needing to streamline pull request updates and code review processes.","zh":"适合需要简化拉取请求更新和代码审查流程的GitHub自动化代理。","ja":"GitHubの自動化エージェントがプルリクエストの更新とコードレビューのプロセスを合理化する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"GitHub 자동화 에이전트가 풀 리퀘스트 업데이트와 코드 리뷰 프로세스를 간소화해야 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de automatización de GitHub que necesitan simplificar las actualizaciones de solicitudes de extracción y los procesos de revisión de código.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''automatisation GitHub ayant besoin de rationaliser les mises à jour des demandes d''extraction et les processus d''examen de code.","de":"Ideal für GitHub-Automatisierungsagenten, die Updates von Pull-Anfragen und Code-Review-Prozessen rationalisieren müssen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Automação do GitHub que precisam otimizar as atualizações de solicitações de pull e os processos de revisão de código.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации GitHub, которым необходимо оптимизировать обновления запросов на включение и процессы проверки кода.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الآليين في GitHub الذين يحتاجون إلى تسهيل تحديثات طلبات السحب وعمليات مراجعة الشفرة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to seamlessly manage GitHub pull requests using the gh command-line tool, facilitating efficient review comment fetching and code updates via PR diffs and comments.","zh":"赋予代理使用gh命令行工具无缝管理GitHub拉取请求的能力，方便地通过PR差异和评论获取审查评论并更新代码。","ja":"エージェントがghコマンドラインツールを使用してGitHubのプルリクエストをシームレスに管理できるようにし、PRの差分とコメントを介してレビューコメントの取得とコードの更新を効率化します。","ko":"에이전트가 gh 명령줄 도구를 사용하여 GitHub 풀 리퀘스트를 無縫하게 관리할 수 있도록 하여 PR 차이점 및评论을 통해 리뷰 코멘트를 가져오고 코드를 업데이트하는 것을 효율화합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes gestionar de forma transparente las solicitudes de extracción de GitHub mediante la herramienta de línea de comandos gh, facilitando la obtención eficiente de comentarios de revisión y actualizaciones de código a través de diferencias y comentarios de PR.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer de manière transparente les demandes d''extraction GitHub à l''aide de l''outil de ligne de commande gh, facilitant ainsi la récupération efficace des commentaires d''examen et des mises à jour de code via les différences et les commentaires de PR.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, GitHub-Pull-Anfragen mithilfe des gh-Befehlszeilenwerkzeugs nahtlos zu verwalten, wodurch eine effiziente Abrufung von Review-Kommentaren und Code-Updates über PR-Diffs und -Kommentare erleichtert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar solicitações de pull do GitHub de forma transparente usando a ferramenta de linha de comando gh, facilitando a obtenção eficiente de comentários de revisão e atualizações de código via diferenças e comentários de PR.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью бесшовного управления запросами на включение в GitHub с помощью инструмента командной строки gh, что облегчает эффективную получение комментариев к обзору и обновления кода через различия и комментарии PR.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من إدارة طلبات السحب في GitHub بطريقة متسلسلة باستخدام أداة سطر الأوامر gh، مما يسهل الحصول الفعال على تعليقات المراجعة وتحديثات الشفرة عبر اختلافات وتعليقات طلبات السحب."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating PR update checks","Fetching and addressing review comments","Streamlining code changes based on PR feedback"],"zh":["自动化PR更新检查","获取和处理审查评论","根据PR反馈简化代码更改"],"ja":["PR更新チェックの自動化","レビューコメントの取得と処理","PRのフィードバックに基づくコード変更の合理化"],"ko":["PR 업데이트 체크 자동화","리뷰 코멘트 가져오기 및 처리","PR 피드백에 따른 코드 변경 단순화"],"es":["Automatización de controles de actualización de PR","Recuperación y atención de comentarios de revisión","Optimización de cambios de código en función de la retroalimentación de PR"],"fr":["Automatisation des vérifications de mise à jour de PR","Récupération et traitement des commentaires d''examen","Optimisation des modifications de code en fonction de la rétroaction de PR"],"de":["Automatisierung von PR-Update-Checks","Abruf und Bearbeitung von Review-Kommentaren","Optimierung von Code-Änderungen basierend auf PR-Rückmeldungen"],"pt":["Automatizar verificações de atualização de PR","Buscar e tratar comentários de revisão","Otimizar alterações de código com base em feedback de PR"],"ru":["Автоматизация проверок обновления PR","Получение и обработка комментариев к обзору","Оптимизация изменений кода на основе обратной связи PR"],"ar":["تأتمة فحص تحديثات طلب السحب","استرجاع ومعالجة تعليقات المراجعة","تحسين التغييرات في الشفرة بناءً على ملاحظات طلب السحب"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub CLI installation","Limited to GitHub pull requests","Needs repository access and authentication"],"zh":["需要安装GitHub CLI","仅限GitHub拉取请求","需要存储库访问和身份验证"],"ja":["GitHub CLIのインストールが必要","GitHubのプルリクエストのみに限定される","リポジトリへのアクセスと認証が必要"],"ko":["GitHub CLI 설치가 필요함","GitHub 풀 리퀘스트에만 제한됨","저장소 액세스 및 인증이 필요함"],"es":["Requiere instalación de GitHub CLI","Limitado a solicitudes de extracción de GitHub","Requiere acceso y autenticación de repositorio"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de GitHub CLI","Limité aux demandes d''extraction GitHub","Nécessite l''accès et l''authentification du référentiel"],"de":["Benötigt GitHub-CLI-Installation","Begrenzt auf GitHub-Pull-Anfragen","Benötigt Repository-Zugriff und -Authentifizierung"],"pt":["Exige instalação do GitHub CLI","Limitado a solicitações de pull do GitHub","Necessita acesso e autenticação ao repositório"],"ru":["Требует установки GitHub CLI","Ограничен запросами на включение в GitHub","Требует доступа и аутентификации к репозиторию"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت واجهة سطر أوامر GitHub","محدود بطلبات السحب في GitHub","يحتاج إلى الوصول والمصادقة على المستودع"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('YougLin-dev/Aha-Loop/god-member', 'community', 'YougLin-dev', 'Aha-Loop', 'YougLin-dev/Aha-Loop', 'god-member', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.418Z', '2026-02-18T04:16:45.954Z', NULL, '{"id":"YougLin-dev/Aha-Loop/god-member","name":"god-member","description":{"zh":"Aha Loop, MVP, ","ja":"Aha Loop, MVP","ko":"Aha Loop, MVP ","es":"El Comité de Dios es un órgano de supervisión independiente con autoridad suprema en Aha Loop, un sistema de desarrollo de IA autónomo","fr":"Le Comité de Dieu est un organe de surveillance indépendant avec autorité suprême dans Aha Loop, un système de développement d''IA autonome","de":"Der Gott-Ausschuss ist ein unabhängiges Aufsichtsorgan mit oberster Autorität in Aha Loop, einem autonomen KI-Entwicklungssystem","pt":"O membro do Comitê Divino tem autoridade suprema sobre o projeto, independente da camada de execução. Aha Loop é um sistema de desenvolvimento de IA autônomo e completo","ru":"Член Божественного Комитета имеет верховную власть над проектом, независимо от слоя выполнения. Aha Loop - это полностью автономная и полная система разработки ИИ","ar":"عضو لجنة الإلهية لديه السلطة العليا على المشروع، مستقل عن طبقة التنفيذ. Aha Loop هو نظام كامل ومتكامل لتنمية الذكاء الاصطناعي","en":"[MVP] Aha Loop is a fully autonomous AI development system, extended from the core ideas of Ralph. It''s not just an execution engine, but a complete AI development framework with planning capabilities, research abilities, and oversight mechanisms."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Aha Loop ","ja":"Aha Loop","ko":"Aha Loop ","es":"Miembro del Comité de Dios: Autoridad Suprema en Aha Loop","fr":"Membre du Comité de Dieu: Autorité Suprême dans Aha Loop","de":"Gott-Mitglied: Oberste Autorität in Aha Loop","pt":"Membro do Comitê Divino: Autoridade Suprema em Aha Loop","ru":"Член Божественного Комитета: Верхо