umentation Automatisée","de":"Automatisierte Dokumentenprüfung","pt":"Revisão de Documentação Automatizada","ru":"Автоматический обзор документации","ar":"استعراض وثائق آلي","en":"doc-review"},"description":{"zh":"文档审查技能是Aha Loop的一部分，用于自动化文档维护。它可以扫描文档，检查过时指标，验证代码文件，并生成清理报告。","ja":"ドキュメントレビュースキルはAha Loopの一部で、ドキュメントのメンテナンスを自動化するために使用されます。ドキュメントをスキャンし、古い指標をチェックし、コードファイルを検証し、クリーンアップレポートを生成します。","ko":"문서 검토 스킬은 Aha Loop의 일부로 문서 유지 보수를 자동화하는 데 사용됩니다. 문서를 스캔하고 오래된 지표를 확인하고 코드 파일을 검증하고 정리 보고서를 생성합니다.","es":"La habilidad de revisión de documentación es un sistema que revisa documentos para detectar obsolescencia, inexactitud y falta de relevancia","fr":"La capacité de révision de documentation est un système qui examine les documents pour détecter l''obsolescence, l''inexactitude et le manque de pertinence","de":"Die Dokumentenprüfungsfähigkeit ist ein System, das Dokumente auf Veraltetheit, Ungenauigkeit und mangelnde Relevanz überprüft","pt":"O skill de revisão de documentação é uma ferramenta automatizada que verifica a documentação para indicadores de obsolescência, precisão e relevância","ru":"Навык обзора документации - это автоматизированный инструмент, который проверяет документацию на наличие признаков устаревания, точности и актуальности","ar":"مهارة استعراض الوثائق هي أداة آلية تحقق من الوثائق لexistence مؤشرات القديمة والدقة والصلة","en":"[MVP] Aha Loop is a fully autonomous AI development system, extended from the core ideas of Ralph. It''s not just an execution engine, but a complete AI devel..."},"definition":{"en":"[MVP] Aha Loop is a fully autonomous AI development system, extended from the core ideas of Ralph. It''s not just an execution engine, but a complete AI development framework with planning capabilities, research abilities, and oversight mechanisms."},"features":{"zh":["自动化文档扫描","过时指标检查","代码文件验证","生成清理报告","可选的自动修复","支持定期维护"],"ja":["ドキュメントの自動スキャン","古い指標のチェック","コードファイルの検証","クリーンアップレポートの生成","自動修復のオプション","定期メンテナンスのサポート"],"ko":["문서 자동 스캔","오래된 지표 확인","코드 파일 검증","정리 보고서 생성","자동 수정 옵션","정기 유지 보수 지원"],"es":["Análisis de indicadores de obsolescencia","Verificación de la existencia de código y archivos referenciados","Detección de contenido desactualizado","Generación de informes de limpieza","Aplicación opcional de correcciones"],"fr":["Analyse des indicateurs d''obsolescence","Vérification de l''existence du code et des fichiers référencés","Détection de contenu obsolète","Génération de rapports de nettoyage","Application optionnelle de corrections"],"de":["Analyse von Veraltetheitsindikatoren","Überprüfung der Existenz von referenziertem Code und Dateien","Erkennung von veralteten Inhalten","Generierung von Bereinigungsberichten","Optionale Anwendung von Korrekturen"],"pt":["Verificação de indicadores de obsolescência","Verificação de precisão da documentação","Identificação de conteúdo desatualizado","Geração de relatório de limpeza","Aplicação opcional de correções"],"ru":["Проверка на наличие признаков устаревания","Проверка точности документации","Определение устаревшего контента","Генерация отчета о очистке","Опциональное применение исправлений"],"ar":["التحقق من وجود مؤشرات القديمة","التحقق من دقة الوثائق","تحديد المحتوى غير محدث","توليد تقرير تنظيف","تطبيق إصلاحات اختيارية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["文档审查","自动化文档维护","AI文档管理","文档扫描","代码文件验证","清理报告","自动修复","定期维护"],"ja":["ドキュメントレビュー","自動化ドキュメントメンテナンス","AIドキュメント管理","ドキュメントスキャン","コードファイル検証","クリーンアップレポート","自動修復","定期メンテナンス"],"ko":["문서 검토","자동화 문서 유지","AI 문서 관리","문서 스캔","코드 파일 검증","정리 보고서","자동 수정","정기 유지 보수"],"es":["revisión de documentación","automatización de documentación","gestión de documentación","análisis de documentación","herramientas de documentación","desarrollo de software","ingeniería de software"],"fr":["révision de documentation","automatisation de documentation","gestion de documentation","analyse de documentation","outils de documentation","développement de logiciels","ingénierie de logiciels"],"de":["Dokumentenprüfung","Automatisierung von Dokumenten","Dokumentenmanagement","Dokumentenanalyse","Dokumentenwerkzeuge","Softwareentwicklung","Softwareingenieurwesen"],"pt":["revisão de documentação","documento automatizado","ferramenta de revisão","documentação técnica","manutenção de documentação","precisão da documentação"],"ru":["обзор документации","автоматизированный документ","инструмент обзора","техническая документация","поддержка документации","точность документации"],"ar":["استعراض الوثائق","وثيقة آلية","أداة استعراض","وثائق فنية","صيانة الوثائق","دقة الوثائق"]}},"owner":"YougLin-dev","repo":"Aha-Loop","repoPath":"YougLin-dev/Aha-Loop","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.418Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"doc-review","description":"Reviews and cleans up outdated documentation. Use periodically to maintain documentation health. Triggers on: review docs, clean up documentation, check for stale docs.","bodyPreview":"# Doc Review Skill\n\nSystematically review documentation for staleness, accuracy, and relevance.\n\n---\n\n## The Job\n\n1. Scan all documentation files\n2. Check for staleness indicators\n3. Verify referenced code/files still exist\n4. Identify outdated content\n5. Generate cleanup report\n6. Optionally apply fixes\n\n---\n\n## When to Use\n\n### Scheduled\n\n- After each milestone completion\n- Monthly maintenance cycle\n- Before major releases\n\n### On Demand\n\n- When documentation feels outdated\n- After significant","body":"# Doc Review Skill\n\nSystematically review documentation for staleness, accuracy, and relevance.\n\n---\n\n## The Job\n\n1. Scan all documentation files\n2. Check for staleness indicators\n3. Verify referenced code/files still exist\n4. Identify outdated content\n5. Generate cleanup report\n6. Optionally apply fixes\n\n---\n\n## When to Use\n\n### Scheduled\n\n- After each milestone completion\n- Monthly maintenance cycle\n- Before major releases\n\n### On Demand\n\n- When documentation feels outdated\n- After significant refactoring\n- When onboarding reveals confusion\n\n---\n\n## Review Process\n\n### Step 1: Inventory Documentation\n\nScan for documentation files:\n\n```bash\nfind . -name \"*.md\" -not -path \"./.git/*\" -not -path \"./.vendor/*\" -not -path \"./.worktrees/*\"\n```\n\nCommon locations:\n- `README.md` (root and subdirs)\n- `docs/` directory\n- `AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md`\n- `.claude/skills/*/SKILL.md`\n- `knowledge/` directory\n- `scripts/aha-loop/templates/`\n\n### Step 2: Check Staleness Indicators\n\nFor each document, check:\n\n| Indicator | Check Method | Threshold |\n|-----------|--------------|-----------|\n| Last modified | `git log -1` | > 30 days |\n| Referenced files | grep + verify | Missing = stale |\n| Code examples | Syntax check | Errors = stale |\n| Version numbers | Compare to actual | Mismatch = stale |\n| Links | HTTP check | Broken = stale |\n\n### Step 3: Verify Code References\n\nFor each code reference in docs:\n\n```markdown\n## Code Reference Check\n\nFile: [doc-path]\nReference: `src/main.rs:45-60`\nStatus: [Exists | Missing | Changed]\n\nIf Changed:\n- Original: [what doc says]\n- Current: [what code shows]\n- Action: [Update doc | Flag for review]\n```\n\n### Step 4: Check External Links\n\n```bash\n# Extract URLs\ngrep -oP ''https?://[^\\s)]+'' file.md\n\n# Check each URL\ncurl -s -o /dev/null -w \"%{http_code}\" URL\n```\n\n### Step 5: Generate Report\n\nCreate `docs-review-report.md`:\n\n```markdown\n# Documentation Review Report\n\n**Date:** [YYYY-MM-DD]\n**Reviewed:** [N] files\n**Issues Found:** [N]\n\n## Summary\n\n| Category | Count |\n|----------|-------|\n| Stale (>30 days) | [N] |\n| Missing References | [N] |\n| Broken Links | [N] |\n| Outdated Examples | [N] |\n\n## Issues by File\n\n### [file1.md]\n- [ ] Line 45: Reference to `src/old.rs` - file no longer exists\n- [ ] Line 78: Code example uses deprecated API\n\n### [file2.md]\n- [ ] Line 12: Version \"1.0.0\" should be \"2.0.0\"\n- [ ] Line 56: Broken link to external docs\n\n## Recommended Actions\n\n1. **Delete:** [files that should be removed]\n2. **Update:** [files that need content updates]\n3. **Review:** [files that need human review]\n\n## Auto-fixable\n\nThe following can be auto-fixed:\n- [ ] Update version numbers\n- [ ] Remove dead links\n- [ ] Update file paths\n\nRun `./scripts/aha-loop/doc-cleaner.sh --fix` to apply.\n```\n\n---\n\n## Staleness Criteria\n\n### Definitely Stale\n\n- References files that don''t exist\n- Contains code that doesn''t compile\n- Links to 404 pages\n- Describes features that were removed\n\n### Probably Stale\n\n- Not modified in 60+ days\n- Uses old API patterns\n- References old version numbers\n- No recent git commits mention the file\n\n### Needs Human Review\n\n- Contains outdated but complex content\n- Describes deprecated but still-supported features\n- Historical documentation (changelogs, decisions)\n\n---\n\n## Auto-Fix Rules\n\n### Safe to Auto-Fix\n\n- Update file paths (if clear mapping exists)\n- Remove broken external links\n- Update version numbers in dependency lists\n- Fix obvious typos in code references\n\n### Requires Human Review\n\n- Content changes beyond mechanical updates\n- Removing entire sections\n- Changing technical instructions\n- Modifying architecture decisions\n\n---\n\n## Integration\n\n### With Doc Cleaner Script\n\n```bash\n# Generate report only\n./scripts/aha-loop/doc-cleaner.sh --report\n\n# Apply safe fixes\n./scripts/aha-loop/doc-cleaner.sh --fix\n\n# Interactive mode\n./scripts/aha-loop/doc-cleaner.sh --interactive\n```\n\n### With Observability\n\nLog review activities:\n\n```markdown\n## 2026-01-29 16:00:00 | Task: Maintenance | Phase: Doc Review\n\n### Documentation Review\nScanned 45 files, found 7 issues.\n\n### Key Findings\n- AGENTS.md references outdated skill paths\n- README example code uses deprecated API\n\n### Actions Taken\n- Auto-fixed 3 version number issues\n- Flagged 4 items for human review\n```\n\n---\n\n## Checklist\n\nBefore completing review:\n\n- [ ] All markdown files scanned\n- [ ] Code references verified\n- [ ] External links checked\n- [ ] Report generated\n- [ ] Auto-fixes applied (if safe)\n- [ ] Human review items flagged\n\n---\n\n## Example Review\n\n### Input\n\nFile: `docs/api.md` last modified 90 days ago\n\n```markdown\n# API Documentation\n\n## Authentication\n\nSee `src/auth/mod.rs` for implementation.\n\nUse version 0.5.0 of the auth library:\n```toml\nauth-lib = \"0.5.0\"\n```\n\nMore info: https://example.com/old-docs\n```\n\n### Review Findings\n\n1. **Stale**: Last modified 90 days ago\n2. **Missing Reference**: `src/auth/mod.rs` doesn''t exist (moved to `src/api/auth.rs`)\n3. **Outdated Version**: Current version is 1.2.0, not 0.5.0\n4. **Broken Link**: https://example.com/old-docs returns 404\n\n### Report Entry\n\n```markdown\n### docs/api.md\n\n**Staleness:** 90 days since last update\n**Issues:**\n- [ ] Line 5: `src/auth/mod.rs` → `src/api/auth.rs`\n- [ ] Line 8: Version 0.5.0 → 1.2.0\n- [ ] Line 12: Broken link (404)\n\n**Recommendation:** Update file paths and versions, remove broken link\n```\n\n---\n\n## Prevention\n\nTo reduce future staleness:\n\n1. **Update docs with code** - When changing code, update related docs\n2. **Add doc checks to CI** - Fail on broken references\n3. **Schedule regular reviews** - Monthly or per-milestone\n4. **Use relative links** - Easier to maintain than absolute\n5. **Date-stamp examples** - \"As of v1.2.0\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:17:00.825Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Maintenance Agents needing automated documentation review and cleanup capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化文档审查和清理功能的维护代理。","ja":"メンテナンスエージェントが自動化されたドキュメントのレビューとクリーンアップ機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"자동화된 문서 검토 및 정리 기능이 필요한 유지 보수 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de mantenimiento que necesitan capacidades de revisión y limpieza de documentación automatizadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de maintenance ayant besoin de capacités de révision et de nettoyage de documentation automatisées.","de":"Perfekt für Wartungsagenten, die automatisierte Dokumentationsprüf- und Bereinigungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Manutenção que necessitam de capacidades de revisão e limpeza de documentação automatizadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов технического обслуживания, которым необходимы автоматические возможности проверки и очистки документации.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكلاء التي تحتاج إلى إمكانيات مراجعة الوثائق والتنظيف التلقائي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to systematically scan documentation files for staleness, verify referenced code and files, and generate cleanup reports using staleness indicators and content verification protocols.","zh":"使代理能够系统地扫描文档文件以检测过时内容，验证引用的代码和文件，并使用过时指标和内容验证协议生成清理报告。","ja":"エージェントがドキュメントファイルを体系的にスキャンして古い内容を検出するとともに、参照されたコードとファイルを検証し、古い指標とコンテンツ検証プロトコルを使用してクリーンアップレポートを生成できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 문서 파일을 체계적으로 스캔하여 오래된 내용을 감지하고 참조된 코드 및 파일을 검증한 다음 오래된 지표 및 내용 검증 프로토콜을 사용하여 정리 보고서를 생성할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a escanear sistemáticamente los archivos de documentación en busca de obsolescencia, verificar el código y los archivos referenciados y generar informes de limpieza utilizando indicadores de obsolescencia y protocolos de verificación de contenido.","fr":"Permet aux agents de scanner systématiquement les fichiers de documentation pour détecter les contenus obsolètes, de vérifier le code et les fichiers référencés, et de générer des rapports de nettoyage en utilisant des indicateurs d''obsolescence et des protocoles de vérification de contenu.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Dokumentationsdateien systematisch auf Veraltetheit zu scannen, referenzierten Code und Dateien zu überprüfen und Bereinigungsberichte unter Verwendung von Veraltetheitsindikatoren und Inhaltüberprüfungsprotokollen zu generieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a escanear sistematicamente arquivos de documentação para detecção de obsolescência, verificar códigos e arquivos referenciados e gerar relatórios de limpeza usando indicadores de obsolescência e protocolos de verificação de conteúdo.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью систематически сканировать файлы документации на наличие устаревшей информации, проверять ссылки на код и файлы, а также генерировать отчеты об очистке с использованием индикаторов устаревшей информации и протоколов верификации содержимого.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء من خلالها مسح الملفات الوثائقية بشكل منهجي للكشف عن التأخير، التحقق من Код الملفات المرتبطة وتوليد تقارير التنظيف باستخدام مؤشرات التأخير وبروتوكولات التحقق من المحتوى."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating monthly documentation maintenance cycles","Generating cleanup reports after milestone completions","Identifying outdated content before major releases"],"zh":["自动执行月度文档维护周期","在里程碑完成后生成清理报告","在主要版本发布前识别过时内容"],"ja":["月次ドキュメントメンテナンスサイクルの自動化","マイルストーン完了後のクリーンアップレポートの生成","主要リリース前の古いコンテンツの特定"],"ko":["월간 문서 유지 관리 주기의 자동화","마일스톤 완료 후 정리 보고서 생성","메이저 버전 릴리스 전 오래된 내용 식별"],"es":["Automatizar ciclos de mantenimiento de documentación mensuales","Generar informes de limpieza después de completar hitos","Identificar contenido obsoleto antes de lanzamientos importantes"],"fr":["Automatiser les cycles de maintenance de documentation mensuels","Générer des rapports de nettoyage après l''achèvement des jalons","Identifier le contenu obsolète avant les sorties majeures"],"de":["Automatisierung monatlicher Dokumentationswartungszyklen","Generierung von Bereinigungsberichten nach dem Abschließen von Meilensteinen","Identifizierung veralteter Inhalte vor großen Veröffentlichungen"],"pt":["Automatizar ciclos de manutenção de documentação mensal","Gerar relatórios de limpeza após a conclusão de marcos","Identificar conteúdo desatualizado antes de lançamentos importantes"],"ru":["Автоматизация ежемесячных циклов технического обслуживания документации","Генерация отчетов об очистке после завершения этапов","Определение устаревшего контента до крупных релизов"],"ar":["توفير دورات صيانة الوثائق الشهرية","توليد تقارير التنظيف بعد إكمال المراحل الرئيسية","تحديد المحتوى القديم قبل الإصدارات الكبيرة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to documentation files and referenced code","May need additional configuration for custom staleness indicators"],"zh":["需要访问文档文件和引用的代码","可能需要额外的配置来使用自定义的过时指标"],"ja":["ドキュメントファイルと参照コードへのアクセスが必要","カスタムの古い指標を使用するために追加の設定が必要になる可能性がある"],"ko":["문서 파일 및 참조 코드에 대한 액세스가 필요함","사용자 지정 오래된 지표를 사용하기 위해 추가 구성이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere acceso a archivos de documentación y código referenciado","Puede necesitar configuración adicional para indicadores de obsolescencia personalizados"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux fichiers de documentation et au code référencé","Peut nécessiter une configuration supplémentaire pour les indicateurs d''obsolescence personnalisés"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf Dokumentationsdateien und referenzierten Code","Kann zusätzliche Konfiguration für benutzerdefinierte Veraltetheitsindikatoren erfordern"],"pt":["Requer acesso a arquivos de documentação e código referenciado","Pode necessitar de configuração adicional para indicadores de obsolescência personalizados"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлам документации и ссылочному коду","Может потребовать дополнительной настройки для пользовательских индикаторов устаревшей информации"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملفات الوثائق والكود المرتبط","يمكن أن يحتاج إلى تكوين إضافي لمؤشرات التأخير المخصصة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
