키텍처 문서 출력"],"es":["Desarrollo de sistemas AI autónomos","Planificación y supervisión de proyectos de AI","Investigación y análisis de requisitos","Generación de arquitecturas de sistemas","Integración con otros sistemas y herramientas"],"fr":["Développement de systèmes AI autonomes","Planification et supervision de projets d''AI","Recherche et analyse des exigences","Génération d''architectures de systèmes","Intégration avec d''autres systèmes et outils"],"de":["Entwicklung autonomer AI-Systeme","Planung und Überwachung von AI-Projekten","Forschung und Analyse von Anforderungen","Generierung von Systemarchitekturen","Integration mit anderen Systemen und Tools"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de arquitetura de sistemas de TI","Planejamento e pesquisa de tecnologias","Supervisão e controle de projetos","Análise de visão e requisitos de projeto","Geração de saídas de arquitetura"],"ru":["Разработка архитектуры ИТ-систем","Планирование и исследование технологий","Контроль и надзор за проектами","Анализ видения и требований проекта","Генерация выходных данных архитектуры"],"ar":["تصميم هندسة نظام المعلومات","التخطيط والبحث عن التكنولوجيا","الإشراف والرقابة على المشاريع","تحليل الرؤية والمتطلبات المشروع","توليد مخرجات الهندسة المعمارية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI架构师技能","技术栈","系统架构","Aha Loop","项目需求","Workspace模式"],"ja":["AIアーキテクトスキル","技術スタック","システムアーキテクチャ","Aha Loop","プロジェクト要件","ワークスペースモード"],"ko":["AI 아키텍트 스킬","기술 스택","시스템 아키텍처","Aha Loop","프로젝트 요구 사항","작업 공간 모드"],"es":["arquitecto de sistemas AI","desarrollo de AI","sistemas autónomos","planificación de proyectos","investigación de requisitos","arquitectura de sistemas","inteligencia artificial"],"fr":["architecte de systèmes AI","développement d''AI","systèmes autonomes","planification de projets","recherche d''exigences","architecture de systèmes","intelligence artificielle"],"de":["AI-Systemarchitekt","AI-Entwicklung","autonome Systeme","Projektplanung","Anforderungsanalyse","Systemarchitektur","künstliche Intelligenz"],"pt":["arquiteto de sistemas","desenvolvimento de arquitetura de TI","planejamento de tecnologias","supervisão de projetos","análise de visão","geração de saídas de arquitetura"],"ru":["архитектор систем","разработка архитектуры ИТ-систем","планирование технологий","контроль проектов","анализ видения","генерация выходных данных архитектуры"],"ar":["مهندس نظام","تصميم هندسة نظام المعلومات","التخطيط للتكنولوجيا","الإشراف على المشاريع","تحليل الرؤية","توليد مخرجات الهندسة المعمارية"]}},"owner":"YougLin-dev","repo":"Aha-Loop","repoPath":"YougLin-dev/Aha-Loop","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.418Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"architect","description":"Designs system architecture and selects technology stack based on vision analysis. Use after vision analysis for technical decisions. Triggers on: design architecture, select tech stack, choose framework.","bodyPreview":"# Architect Skill\n\nResearch, evaluate, and decide on technology stack and system architecture based on project requirements.\n\n## Workspace Mode Note\n\nWhen running in workspace mode, all paths are relative to `.aha-loop/` directory:\n- Vision analysis: `.aha-loop/project.vision-analysis.md`\n- Architecture output: `.aha-loop/project.architecture.md`\n\nThe orchestrator will provide the actual paths in the prompt context.\n\n---\n\n## The Job\n\n1. Read `project.vision-analysis.md` for requirements\n2. Resea","body":"# Architect Skill\n\nResearch, evaluate, and decide on technology stack and system architecture based on project requirements.\n\n## Workspace Mode Note\n\nWhen running in workspace mode, all paths are relative to `.aha-loop/` directory:\n- Vision analysis: `.aha-loop/project.vision-analysis.md`\n- Architecture output: `.aha-loop/project.architecture.md`\n\nThe orchestrator will provide the actual paths in the prompt context.\n\n---\n\n## The Job\n\n1. Read `project.vision-analysis.md` for requirements\n2. Research candidate technologies for each layer\n3. Evaluate and compare options\n4. Make decisions with documented rationale\n5. Design system architecture\n6. Output `project.architecture.md`\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. Prefer Latest Stable Versions\n\n**Always use the latest stable version of libraries unless there''s a specific reason not to.**\n\n```markdown\n## Version Selection Process\n\n1. Query official source for latest version:\n   - Rust: crates.io API or `cargo search`\n   - Node: npmjs.com or `npm view [pkg] version`\n   - Python: pypi.org or `pip index versions`\n\n2. Check release date and stability:\n   - Released > 2 weeks ago (not bleeding edge)\n   - No critical issues in GitHub issues\n   - Changelog shows no breaking changes from common patterns\n\n3. Document the version and why:\n   - Record in project.architecture.md\n   - Add to knowledge/project/decisions.md\n```\n\n### 2. Consider Long-term Maintenance\n\n- Active community and regular updates\n- Good documentation\n- Large ecosystem of plugins/extensions\n- Backed by reputable organization or strong community\n\n### 3. Evaluate Total Cost\n\n- Learning curve for the team/AI\n- Bundle size / binary size\n- Runtime performance\n- Development velocity\n\n---\n\n## Research Process\n\n### Step 1: Identify Technology Layers\n\nBased on project type, identify which layers need decisions:\n\n| Layer | Examples |\n|-------|----------|\n| **Language** | Rust, TypeScript, Python, Go |\n| **Frontend Framework** | React, Vue, Svelte, SolidJS |\n| **Backend Framework** | Axum, Actix, Express, FastAPI |\n| **Database** | PostgreSQL, SQLite, MongoDB |\n| **ORM/Query Builder** | Diesel, SQLx, Prisma, Drizzle |\n| **Authentication** | JWT, Sessions, OAuth providers |\n| **Deployment** | Docker, Serverless, VPS |\n| **Testing** | Built-in, Jest, Pytest, Vitest |\n\n### Step 2: Research Each Layer\n\nFor each layer requiring a decision:\n\n1. **Identify 2-4 candidates** - Don''t over-research\n2. **Fetch source code** if needed for deep understanding\n3. **Check latest versions** - Use web search or package registry\n4. **Read documentation** - Understand core concepts\n5. **Compare tradeoffs** - Performance, DX, ecosystem\n\n### Step 3: Use Structured Comparison\n\n```markdown\n## [Layer Name] Decision\n\n### Candidates\n\n| Criterion | Option A | Option B | Option C |\n|-----------|----------|----------|----------|\n| Latest Version | v1.2.3 | v2.0.0 | v0.9.0 |\n| Release Date | 2026-01-15 | 2026-01-20 | 2025-12-01 |\n| GitHub Stars | 45k | 30k | 15k |\n| Bundle Size | 50kb | 80kb | 30kb |\n| Learning Curve | Medium | Low | High |\n| Documentation | Excellent | Good | Fair |\n| TypeScript Support | Native | Via types | Partial |\n| Community Activity | Very Active | Active | Moderate |\n\n### Decision: [Option B]\n\n### Rationale\n- [Reason 1]\n- [Reason 2]\n- [Reason 3]\n\n### Tradeoffs Accepted\n- [What we''re giving up]\n- [Mitigation strategy if any]\n```\n\n### Step 4: Check Compatibility\n\nBefore finalizing:\n\n- Verify all chosen technologies work together\n- Check for known integration issues\n- Ensure versions are compatible\n- Test with a minimal proof-of-concept if uncertain\n\n---\n\n## Version Research Commands\n\n### Rust (crates.io)\n\n```bash\n# Get latest version\ncurl -s \"https://crates.io/api/v1/crates/tokio\" | jq ''.crate.max_stable_version''\n\n# Or use cargo\ncargo search tokio --limit 1\n```\n\n### Node.js (npm)\n\n```bash\n# Get latest version\nnpm view react version\n\n# Get all versions\nnpm view react versions --json\n```\n\n### Check GitHub for Activity\n\n```bash\n# Using gh CLI\ngh api repos/tokio-rs/tokio --jq ''.pushed_at, .stargazers_count''\n```\n\n---\n\n## Architecture Design\n\nAfter technology decisions, design the architecture:\n\n### 1. Component Diagram\n\n```markdown\n## System Components\n\n[Component A] --> [Component B] --> [Component C]\n       |                               |\n       v                               v\n  [Database]                    [External API]\n```\n\n### 2. Data Flow\n\nDocument how data flows through the system:\n- User inputs\n- Processing steps\n- Storage points\n- Output paths\n\n### 3. Directory Structure\n\nPropose the project structure:\n\n```\nproject/\n├── src/\n│   ├── main.rs\n│   ├── api/\n│   ├── db/\n│   └── ...\n├── tests/\n├── Cargo.toml\n└── ...\n```\n\n### 4. Key Patterns\n\nDocument architectural patterns to follow:\n- Error handling approach\n- Logging strategy\n- Configuration management\n- Testing approach\n\n---\n\n## Output: project.architecture.md\n\n```markdown\n# Project Architecture\n\n**Generated:** [timestamp]\n**Based on:** project.vision-analysis.md\n\n## Technology Stack\n\n### Core Technologies\n\n| Layer | Technology | Version | Rationale |\n|-------|------------|---------|-----------|\n| Language | Rust | 1.75 | Performance, safety |\n| Web Framework | Axum | 0.7.4 | Ergonomic, async |\n| Database | SQLite | 3.45 | Simple, embedded |\n| ORM | SQLx | 0.7.3 | Compile-time checks |\n\n### Development Tools\n\n| Tool | Version | Purpose |\n|------|---------|---------|\n| cargo-watch | 8.5.2 | Auto-rebuild |\n| sqlx-cli | 0.7.3 | Migrations |\n\n## Architecture Decisions\n\n### ADR-001: [Decision Title]\n\n**Context:** [Why this decision was needed]\n**Decision:** [What was decided]\n**Rationale:** [Why this option]\n**Consequences:** [Impact of decision]\n\n### ADR-002: ...\n\n## System Design\n\n### Component Overview\n\n[Diagram or description]\n\n### Data Flow\n\n[How data moves through system]\n\n### Directory Structure\n\n```\n[Proposed structure]\n```\n\n## Key Patterns\n\n### Error Handling\n[Approach]\n\n### Configuration\n[Approach]\n\n### Testing Strategy\n[Approach]\n\n## Dependencies\n\n### Production Dependencies\n\n```toml\n[dependencies]\naxum = \"0.7.4\"\ntokio = { version = \"1.35\", features = [\"full\"] }\nsqlx = { version = \"0.7.3\", features = [\"sqlite\", \"runtime-tokio\"] }\n```\n\n### Development Dependencies\n\n```toml\n[dev-dependencies]\n```\n\n## Security Considerations\n\n- [Security item 1]\n- [Security item 2]\n\n## Performance Considerations\n\n- [Performance item 1]\n- [Performance item 2]\n\n## Deployment Strategy\n\n[How the project will be deployed]\n\n## Next Steps\n\n1. Initialize project structure\n2. Set up CI/CD\n3. Begin roadmap planning\n```\n\n---\n\n## Integration with Orchestrator\n\nAfter architecture design:\n\n1. Save `project.architecture.md` to project root\n2. Update `knowledge/project/decisions.md` with ADRs\n3. Signal completion to orchestrator\n4. Roadmap Skill uses architecture as input\n\n---\n\n## Checklist\n\nBefore completing architecture:\n\n- [ ] All technology layers evaluated\n- [ ] Latest stable versions verified for each choice\n- [ ] Compatibility between choices confirmed\n- [ ] Decisions documented with rationale\n- [ ] Directory structure proposed\n- [ ] Key patterns defined\n- [ ] Dependencies listed with versions\n- [ ] ADRs recorded in knowledge/project/decisions.md\n- [ ] Architecture saved to `project.architecture.md`\n\n---\n\n## Example: Web App Architecture\n\n**Input:** Vision analysis showing PWA finance tracker\n\n**Output:**\n\n```markdown\n# Project Architecture\n\n## Technology Stack\n\n### Core Technologies\n\n| Layer | Technology | Version | Rationale |\n|-------|------------|---------|-----------|\n| Language | TypeScript | 5.3.3 | Type safety, ecosystem |\n| Framework | SvelteKit | 2.5.0 | Fast, simple, SSR+SPA |\n| Styling | Tailwind CSS | 3.4.1 | Utility-first, fast |\n| Database | IndexedDB (Dexie) | 4.0.1 | Offline-first PWA |\n| Build | Vite | 5.0.12 | Fast, modern |\n\n### PWA Stack\n\n| Component | Technology | Version |\n|-----------|------------|---------|\n| Service Worker | Workbox | 7.0.0 |\n| Manifest | Vite PWA Plugin | 0.17.4 |\n\n## Architecture Decisions\n\n### ADR-001: SvelteKit over React/Next.js\n\n**Context:** Need a modern frontend framework for PWA\n**Decision:** Use SvelteKit 2.x\n**Rationale:**\n- Smaller bundle size (critical for PWA)\n- Built-in SSR and static generation\n- Simpler mental model than React\n- Excellent TypeScript support\n**Consequences:** Smaller community than React, but sufficient for this project.\n\n### ADR-002: Dexie for IndexedDB\n\n**Context:** Need offline data storage\n**Decision:** Use Dexie.js 4.x wrapper for IndexedDB\n**Rationale:**\n- Promise-based API\n- Excellent TypeScript support\n- Reactive queries\n- Well-maintained\n**Consequences:** Additional 30kb bundle, but worth the DX improvement.\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:16:40.808Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing autonomous technology stack planning and system architecture decision-making capabilities.","zh":"适合需要自治技术栈规划和系统架构决策能力的AI代理。","ja":"自律的なテクノロジー・スタックの計画とシステム・アーキテクチャの意思決定能力が必要なAIエージェントに適しています。","ko":"자율적인 기술 스택 계획 및 시스템 아키텍처 의사 결정 능력이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan planificación autónoma de la pila de tecnología y capacidades de toma de decisiones de arquitectura del sistema.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA nécessitant une planification autonome de la pile technologique et des capacités de prise de décision d''architecture système.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die eine autarke Planung der Technologie-Stacks und Systemarchitektur-Entscheidungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que precisam de planejamento autônomo de pilha de tecnologia e capacidades de tomada de decisão de arquitetura de sistema.","ru":"Идеально для ИИ-агентов, которым необходимы автономное планирование технологического стека и возможности принятия решений по системной архитектуре.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يحتاج إلى تخطيط تكنولوجي مستقل وقدرات اتخاذ قرارات بنية النظام."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to research, evaluate, and decide on technology stacks and system architectures based on project requirements, utilizing files like `project.vision-analysis.md` and generating outputs in `project.architecture.md` format.","zh":"赋予代理研究、评估和根据项目需求决定技术栈和系统架构的能力，利用如`project.vision-analysis.md`的文件，并以`project.architecture.md`格式生成输出。","ja":"プロジェクトの要件に基づいてテクノロジー・スタックとシステム・アーキテクチャを研究、評価、決定するエージェントの能力を与え、`project.vision-analysis.md`のようなファイルを使用し、`project.architecture.md`形式で出力を生成します。","ko":"에이전트에게 프로젝트 요구 사항에 따라 기술 스택과 시스템 아키텍처를 연구, 평가 및 결정할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, `project.vision-analysis.md`와 같은 파일을 사용하고 `project.architecture.md` 형식으로 출력을 생성합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a investigar, evaluar y decidir sobre pilas de tecnología y arquitecturas del sistema en función de los requisitos del proyecto, utilizando archivos como `project.vision-analysis.md` y generando salidas en formato `project.architecture.md`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de rechercher, d''évaluer et de décider sur les piles technologiques et les architectures système en fonction des exigences du projet, en utilisant des fichiers tels que `project.vision-analysis.md` et en générant des sorties au format `project.architecture.md`.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, Forschung, Bewertung und Entscheidungen über Technologie-Stacks und Systemarchitekturen auf der Grundlage der Projektanforderungen zu treffen, unter Verwendung von Dateien wie `project.vision-analysis.md` und Generierung von Ausgaben im Format `project.architecture.md`.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a pesquisar, avaliar e decidir sobre pilhas de tecnologia e arquiteturas de sistema com base nos requisitos do projeto, utilizando arquivos como `project.vision-analysis.md` e gerando saídas no formato `project.architecture.md`.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность исследовать, оценивать и принимать решения о технологических стеках и системных архитектурах на основе требований проекта, используя файлы вида `project.vision-analysis.md` и генерируя выводы в формате `project.architecture.md`.","ar":"يُمكّن الوكيل من البحث والتقدير والقرار بشأن تكنولوجيا المكدس وهندسة النظام بناءً على متطلبات المشروع، باستخدام الملفات مثل `project.vision-analysis.md` وتوليد الإخراجات بتنسيق `project.architecture.md`."},"useCases":{"en":["Evaluating project requirements from vision analysis files","Generating system architecture plans based on project needs","Researching and deciding on optimal technology stacks"],"zh":["从愿景分析文件评估项目需求","根据项目需求生成系统架构计划","研究和决定最佳的技术栈"],"ja":["ビジョン分析ファイルからプロジェクトの要件を評価する","プロジェクトのニーズに基づいてシステム・アーキテクチャ計画を生成する","最適なテクノロジー・スタックを研究し、決定する"],"ko":["비전 분석 파일로부터 프로젝트 요구 사항을 평가한다","프로젝트 요구 사항에 따라 시스템 아키텍처 계획을 생성한다","최적의 기술 스택을 연구 및 결정한다"],"es":["Evaluación de los requisitos del proyecto a partir de archivos de análisis de visión","Generación de planes de arquitectura del sistema en función de las necesidades del proyecto","Investigación y decisión sobre las pilas de tecnología óptimas"],"fr":["Évaluation des exigences du projet à partir de fichiers d''analyse de vision","Génération de plans d''architecture système en fonction des besoins du projet","Recherche et décision sur les piles technologiques optimales"],"de":["Auswertung der Projektanforderungen aus Vision-Analyse-Dateien","Erstellung von Systemarchitektur-Plänen auf der Grundlage der Projektbedürfnisse","Recherche und Entscheidung über optimale Technologie-Stacks"],"pt":["Avaliando os requisitos do projeto a partir de arquivos de análise de visão","Gerando planos de arquitetura de sistema com base nas necessidades do projeto","Pesquisando e decidindo sobre pilhas de tecnologia ótimas"],"ru":["Оценка требований проекта из файлов анализа видения","Генерация планов системной архитектуры на основе потребностей проекта","Исследование и принятие решений о наиболее подходящих технологических стеках"],"ar":["تقييم متطلبات المشروع من ملفات تحليل الرؤية","توليد خطط بنية النظام بناءً على احتياجات المشروع","البحث والقرار بشأن المكدس التكنولوجي الأمثل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to `.aha-loop/` directory for file input/output","Dependent on orchestrator-provided prompt context for path information"],"zh":["需要访问`.aha-loop/`目录以进行文件输入/输出","依赖于编排器提供的提示上下文以获取路径信息"],"ja":["ファイルの入出力を行うために`.aha-loop/`ディレクトリへのアクセスが必要","パス情報を取得するためにオーケストレーターが提供するプロンプト・コンテキストに依存する"],"ko":["파일 입력/출력을 위해 `.aha-loop/` 디렉토리에 접근이 필요합니다","경로 정보를 얻기 위해 오케스트레이터가 제공하는 프롬프트 컨텍스트에 의존합니다"],"es":["Requiere acceso al directorio `.aha-loop/` para entrada/salida de archivos","Dependiente del contexto de la llamada del orquestador para la información de la ruta"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au répertoire `.aha-loop/` pour l''entrée/sortie de fichiers","Dépendant du contexte de l''appel de l''orchestrateur pour les informations de chemin"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das Verzeichnis `.aha-loop/` für Dateiein-/ausgabe","Abhängig vom Kontext des Orchester-Aufrufs für Pfadinformationen"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao diretório `.aha-loop/` para entrada/saída de arquivos","Dependente do contexto do prompt fornecido pelo orquestrador para informações de caminho"],"ru":["Требует доступа к директории `.aha-loop/` для ввода/вывода файлов","Зависит от контекста подсказки, предоставленного оркестратором, для информации о пути"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الدليل `.aha-loop/` للإدخال والإخراج الملفات","يتوقف على سياق التلميح المقدم من قبل المنظم لمعلومات المسار"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('YougLin-dev/Aha-Loop/god-consensus', 'community', 'YougLin-dev', 'Aha-Loop', 'YougLin-dev/Aha-Loop', 'god-consensus', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.418Z', '2026-02-18T04:17:15.673Z', NULL, '{"id":"YougLin-dev/Aha-Loop/god-consensus","name":"god-consensus","description":{"zh":"God Committee Consensus Skill, AI","ja":"God - AI","ko":"God - AI","pt":"A habilidade God-Consensus é uma ferramenta de desenvolvimento de AI que guia os membros do Comitê de Deus no processo de consenso para tomada de decisões coletivas","ru":"Навык God-Consensus - это инструмент разработки ИИ, который руководит членами Комитета Бога в процессе консенсуса для принятия коллективных решений","ar":"مهارة God-Consensus هي أداة تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي التي توجيه أعضاء لجنة الله في عملية الإجماع لاتخاذ القرارات الجماعية","en":"[MVP] Aha Loop is a fully autonomous AI development system, extended from the core ideas of Ralph. It''s not just an execution engine, but a complete AI development framework with planning capabilities, research abilities, and oversight mechanisms."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"God Committee Consensus Skill - AI ","ja":"God - AI","ko":"God - AI","pt":"God-Consensus: Ferramenta de Desenvolvimento de AI","ru":"God-Consensus: Инструмент Разработки ИИ","ar":"God-Consensus: أداة تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي","en":"god-consensus"},"description":{"zh":"God Committee Consensus Skill, AI","ja":"God - AI","ko":"God - AI","pt":"A habilidade God-Consensus é uma ferramenta de desenvolvimento de AI que guia os membros do Comitê de Deus no processo de consenso para tomada de decisões co...","ru":"Навык God-Consensus - это инструмент разработки ИИ, который руководит членами Комитета Бога в процессе консенсуса для принятия коллективных решений","ar":"مهارة God-Consensus هي أداة تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي التي توجيه أعضاء لجنة الله في عملية الإجماع لاتخاذ القرارات الجماعية","en":"[MVP] Aha Loop is a fully autonomous AI development system, extended from the core ideas of Ralph. It''s not just an execution engine, but a complete AI devel..."},"definition":{"en":"[MVP] Aha Loop is a fully autonomous AI development system, extended from the core ideas of Ralph. It''s not just an execution engine, but a complete AI development framework with planning capabilities, research abilities, and oversight mechanisms."},"features":{"zh":["AI","God Committee","AI","AI","AI"],"ja":["God - AI","AI","AI","AI","AI"],"ko":["God - AI","AI","AI","AI","AI"],"pt":["Processo de consenso para tomada de decisões coletivas","Integração com o framework de desenvolvimento de AI Aha Loop","Mecanismos de supervisão e planejamento","Suporte à tomada de decisões baseada em configuração","Autonomia na tomada de decisões","Integração com a engine de execução de AI"],"ru":["Процесс консенсуса для принятия коллективных решений","Интеграция с фреймворком разработки ИИ Aha Loop","Механизмы надзора и планирования","Поддержка принятия решений на основе конфигурации","Автономность в принятии решений","Интеграция с двигателем выполнения ИИ"],"ar":["عملية إجماع لاتخاذ القرارات الجماعية","التكامل مع إطار عمل تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي Aha Loop","آليات الإشراف والتخطيط","دعم اتخاذ القرارات المستندة إلى التكوين","الاستقلالية في اتخاذ القرارات","التكامل مع محرك تنفيذ الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI","God Committee","AI","AI","AI","AI"],"ja":["God - AI","AI","AI","AI","AI","AI"],"ko":["God - AI","AI","AI","AI","AI","AI"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de AI","tomada de decisões coletivas","consenso","Aha Loop","framework de desenvolvimento de AI","autonomia","supervisão","planejamento"],"ru":["разработка ИИ","принятие коллективных решений","консенсус","Aha Loop","фреймворк разработки ИИ","автономность","надзор","планирование"],"ar":["تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي","اتخاذ القرارات الجماعية","إجماع","Aha Loop","إطار عمل تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي","استقلالية","إشراف","تخطيط"]}},"owner":"YougLin-dev","repo":"Aha-Loop","repoPath":"YougLin-dev/Aha-Loop","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.418Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"god-consensus","description":"Guides God Committee members through consensus-building for collective decisions. Use for proposals, voting, and disagreement resolution. Triggers on: consensus, voting, proposal, committee decision.","bodyPreview":"# God Committee Consensus Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nThis skill guides God Committee members through the consensus-building process for making collective decisions.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Proposing a significant change or intervention\n- Voting on another member''s proposal\n- Resolving disagreements between members\n- Making decisions that require consensus per configuration\n\n## Consensus Requirements\n\n### Actions Requiring Consensus\n\nPer `.god/config.json`, these actions requir","body":"# God Committee Consensus Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nThis skill guides God Committee members through the consensus-building process for making collective decisions.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Proposing a significant change or intervention\n- Voting on another member''s proposal\n- Resolving disagreements between members\n- Making decisions that require consensus per configuration\n\n## Consensus Requirements\n\n### Actions Requiring Consensus\n\nPer `.god/config.json`, these actions require consensus:\n- **Termination**: Stopping the entire project\n- **Major Rollback**: Rolling back multiple commits or PRDs\n- **Skill Deletion**: Removing existing skills\n\n### Actions Allowing Solo Decision\n\n- Minor fixes and repairs\n- Observation and documentation\n- Pausing for investigation\n- Sending alerts and notifications\n\n### Quorum Rules\n\n- **Standard Quorum**: 2 out of 3 members must agree\n- **Emergency Quorum**: 1 member can act alone in critical situations\n\n## Creating a Proposal\n\n### Step 1: Prepare Your Case\n\nBefore proposing, gather evidence and formulate your rationale:\n\n```markdown\n## Proposal Preparation\n\n### Issue Identified\n[Clear description of the problem]\n\n### Evidence\n- [Log entry/observation 1]\n- [Log entry/observation 2]\n- [Metric or data point]\n\n### Proposed Action\n[Specific action to take]\n\n### Expected Outcome\n[What success looks like]\n\n### Risks\n[Potential downsides]\n\n### Alternatives Considered\n[Other options and why not chosen]\n```\n\n### Step 2: Acquire Speaking Rights\n\n```bash\n./scripts/god/council.sh lock YOUR_ID\n```\n\n### Step 3: Create the Proposal\n\n```bash\n./scripts/god/council.sh propose YOUR_ID \"TYPE\" \"DESCRIPTION\" \"RATIONALE\"\n```\n\n**Proposal Types:**\n- `intervention` - Active intervention in execution\n- `repair` - Fix or repair action\n- `policy_change` - Change to rules or configuration\n- `termination` - Stop project execution\n- `rollback` - Revert to previous state\n\n**Example:**\n\n```bash\n./scripts/god/council.sh propose alpha \"intervention\" \\\n  \"Pause PRD execution to fix failing tests\" \\\n  \"Test coverage dropped 15% in last 3 stories. Need to address before proceeding.\"\n```\n\n### Step 4: Notify Members\n\nThe proposal system automatically notifies all members. The message will be in their inboxes.\n\n### Step 5: Release Speaking Rights\n\n```bash\n./scripts/god/council.sh unlock YOUR_ID\n```\n\n## Voting on Proposals\n\n### Step 1: Review the Proposal\n\n```bash\n# Check pending decisions\n./scripts/god/council.sh status\n\n# Read the specific proposal\ncat .god/council/decisions/DECISION_ID.json | jq ''.''\n```\n\n### Step 2: Analyze the Proposal\n\nConsider these questions:\n\n1. **Is the problem real?**\n   - Verify the evidence\n   - Check if it''s already being addressed\n\n2. **Is the solution appropriate?**\n   - Will it solve the problem?\n   - Are there better alternatives?\n   - What are the side effects?\n\n3. **Is it timely?**\n   - Is immediate action needed?\n   - Can we wait for more information?\n\n### Step 3: Cast Your Vote\n\n```bash\n./scripts/god/council.sh lock YOUR_ID\n./scripts/god/council.sh vote YOUR_ID \"DECISION_ID\" \"VOTE\" \"COMMENT\"\n./scripts/god/council.sh unlock YOUR_ID\n```\n\n**Vote Options:**\n- `approve` - Support the proposal\n- `reject` - Oppose the proposal  \n- `abstain` - Neither support nor oppose\n\n**Example:**\n\n```bash\n./scripts/god/council.sh vote beta \"decision-20260129150000\" \"approve\" \\\n  \"Agree with the assessment. Tests should be fixed before proceeding.\"\n```\n\n### Step 4: Document Your Reasoning\n\nAlways add a comment explaining your vote:\n\n```markdown\n## Vote: [APPROVE/REJECT/ABSTAIN]\n\n### Reasoning\n[Why you voted this way]\n\n### Conditions (if any)\n[Conditions for your support]\n\n### Alternative Suggestion (if rejecting)\n[What you''d propose instead]\n```\n\n## Reaching Consensus\n\n### Unanimous Agreement\n\nIdeal scenario - all members agree:\n\n```\nAlpha: approve\nBeta: approve  \nGamma: approve\nResult: APPROVED (unanimous)\n```\n\n### Majority Agreement\n\nQuorum reached with majority:\n\n```\nAlpha: approve\nBeta: approve\nGamma: reject\nResult: APPROVED (2/3 majority)\n```\n\n### Split Decision\n\nWhen members disagree significantly:\n\n1. **Initiate Discussion Session**\n   ```bash\n   ./scripts/god/council.sh session-start \"Resolving: PROPOSAL_TOPIC\"\n   ```\n\n2. **Each Member States Position**\n   - Present full reasoning\n   - Listen to others'' concerns\n   - Look for common ground\n\n3. **Seek Compromise**\n   - Modify the proposal\n   - Add conditions\n   - Split into smaller decisions\n\n4. **Re-vote if Needed**\n   - Create amended proposal\n   - Vote again\n\n### Deadlock Resolution\n\nIf consensus cannot be reached:\n\n1. **Defer Decision**\n   - Wait for more information\n   - Set review deadline\n\n2. **Escalate Scope**\n   - Break into smaller decisions\n   - Address sub-issues separately\n\n3. **Time-box Discussion**\n   - Set deadline for decision\n   - Default action if no consensus\n\n## Emergency Consensus\n\nIn critical situations, expedited consensus is allowed:\n\n### Emergency Criteria\n\n- System crash or imminent failure\n- Security breach\n- Data loss risk\n- Infinite loop/resource exhaustion\n\n### Emergency Protocol\n\n1. **Declare Emergency**\n   ```bash\n   ./scripts/god/awakener.sh critical \"REASON\"\n   ```\n\n2. **Take Immediate Action**\n   - One member can act alone\n   - Document the action immediately\n\n3. **Post-Action Review**\n   - Inform other members ASAP\n   - Document full rationale\n   - Get retroactive approval\n\n### Emergency Action Template\n\n```markdown\n## Emergency Action Report\n\n### Timestamp\n[When action was taken]\n\n### Acting Member\n[Who took the action]\n\n### Situation\n[What triggered the emergency]\n\n### Action Taken\n[What was done]\n\n### Justification\n[Why immediate action was needed]\n\n### Outcome\n[Result of the action]\n\n### Post-Action Votes\n- Alpha: [pending/approved/rejected]\n- Beta: [pending/approved/rejected]\n- Gamma: [pending/approved/rejected]\n```\n\n## Consensus Best Practices\n\n### Do\n\n- ✅ Present clear evidence\n- ✅ Consider all perspectives\n- ✅ Propose specific, actionable items\n- ✅ Accept compromise when reasonable\n- ✅ Document all reasoning\n- ✅ Respect deadlines\n\n### Don''t\n\n- ❌ Vote without reviewing the proposal\n- ❌ Reject without suggesting alternatives\n- ❌ Take solo action when consensus is required\n- ❌ Ignore minority opinions\n- ❌ Let proposals languish without voting\n- ❌ Make personal attacks\n\n## Decision Record\n\nAll decisions are recorded in `.god/council/decisions/` with this structure:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"decisionId\": \"decision-20260129150000\",\n  \"type\": \"intervention\",\n  \"status\": \"decided\",\n  \"createdAt\": \"2026-01-29T15:00:00Z\",\n  \"decidedAt\": \"2026-01-29T15:30:00Z\",\n  \"proposal\": {\n    \"author\": \"alpha\",\n    \"description\": \"...\",\n    \"rationale\": \"...\"\n  },\n  \"votes\": {\n    \"alpha\": {\"vote\": \"approve\", \"comment\": \"...\", \"timestamp\": \"...\"},\n    \"beta\": {\"vote\": \"approve\", \"comment\": \"...\", \"timestamp\": \"...\"},\n    \"gamma\": {\"vote\": \"abstain\", \"comment\": \"...\", \"timestamp\": \"...\"}\n  },\n  \"quorum\": 2,\n  \"result\": \"approved\",\n  \"executedAt\": \"2026-01-29T15:35:00Z\"\n}\n```\n\n## After Consensus\n\nOnce a decision is reached:\n\n1. **If Approved**: Execute the proposed action\n2. **If Rejected**: Document why and any alternatives\n3. **Update Timeline**: Log the decision event\n4. **Notify Stakeholders**: If relevant to execution layer\n\n```bash\n# After approved decision\n./scripts/god/observer.sh event \"decision\" \"Proposal approved: DESCRIPTION\"\n\n# Execute the action\n[perform the approved action]\n\n# Mark as executed\njq ''.executedAt = \"''\"$(date -u +%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ)\"''\"'' \\\n  .god/council/decisions/DECISION_ID.json > tmp && mv tmp .god/council/decisions/DECISION_ID.json\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:17:15.673Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Autonomous AI Agents requiring collective decision-making capabilities through consensus-building processes.","zh":"适用于需要通过共识建立过程实现集体决策能力的自主AI代理。","ja":"集団的意思決定能力をコンセンサスビルディングプロセスを通じて実現する必要がある自律AIエージェントに適しています。","ko":"공동 의사 결정 능력을 합의 형성 프로세스를 통해 실現해야 하는 자율적 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de IA autónomos que requieren capacidades de toma de decisiones colectivas mediante procesos de construcción de consenso.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents IA autonomes nécessitant des capacités de prise de décision collective via des processus d''établissement de consensus.","de":"Ideal für autonome KI-Agenten, die kollektive Entscheidungsfähigkeiten durch Konsensbildungsprozesse benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Autônomos que requerem capacidades de tomada de decisão coletiva por meio de processos de consenso.","ru":"Идеально для автономных агентов ИИ, требующих коллективных возможностей принятия решений посредством процессов построения консенсуса.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكيين المستقلين الذين يتطلبون قدرات اتخاذ القرارات الجماعية من خلال عمليات بناء الإجماع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to facilitate consensus among God Committee members using configuration files like `.god/config.json`, enabling effective decision-making for significant changes, interventions, and resolving disagreements.","zh":"使代理能够使用配置文件（如`.god/config.json`）促进上帝委员会成员之间的共识，从而为重大变更、干预和解决纠纷做出有效的决策。","ja":"エージェントが`.god/config.json`などのコンフィグファイルを使用して、ゴッド委員会メンバー間のコンセンサスを促進し、重大な変更、介入、意見の不一致を解決するための効果的な意思決定を行うことを可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 `.god/config.json`과 같은 구성 파일을 사용하여 신 위원회 회원 간의 합의를 촉진하여 중요한 변경, 개입 및 의견 불일치 해결을 위한 효과적인 의사 결정에 도움이 됩니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes facilitar el consenso entre los miembros del Comité God mediante el uso de archivos de configuración como `.god/config.json`, permitiendo una toma de decisiones efectiva para cambios significativos, intervenciones y resolución de desacuerdos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de faciliter le consensus entre les membres du Comité God en utilisant des fichiers de configuration comme `.god/config.json`, permettant une prise de décision efficace pour les changements significatifs, les interventions et la résolution des désaccords.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Konsens unter den Mitgliedern des God-Ausschusses mithilfe von Konfigurationsdateien wie `.god/config.json` zu erleichtern, was eine effektive Entscheidungsfindung für bedeutende Änderungen, Interventionen und die Beilegung von Meinungsverschiedenheiten ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a facilitar o consenso entre os membros do Comitê de Deus usando arquivos de configuração como `.god/config.json`, permitindo uma tomada de decisão eficaz para mudanças significativas, intervenções e resolução de desacordos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью облегчить консенсус среди членов Комитета Бога с помощью файлов конфигурации, таких как `.god/config.json`, обеспечивая эффективное принятие решений для значительных изменений, вмешательств и разрешения разногласий.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تسهيل الإجماع بين أعضاء لجنة الله باستخدام ملفات التهيئة مثل `.god/config.json`، مما يتيح اتخاذ قرارات فعالة للتغييرات الكبيرة والتدخلات و حل الخلافات."},"useCases":{"en":["Proposing significant changes or interventions","Voting on proposals","Resolving disagreements between committee members","Making consensus-driven decisions"],"zh":["提议重大变化或干预","对提案进行投票","解决委员会成员之间的分歧","做出基于共识的决策"],"ja":["重大な変更や介入を提案する","提案に投票する","委員間の意見の不一致を解決する","コンセンサスに基づく意思決定を行う"],"ko":["중요한 변경이나 개입을 제안함","제안에 투표함","위원회 회원 간의 의견 불일치를 해결함","합의에 기반한 의사 결정함"],"es":["Proponer cambios o intervenciones significativos","Votar propuestas","Resolver desacuerdos entre miembros del comité","Tomar decisiones basadas en consenso"],"fr":["Proposer des changements ou interventions significatifs","Voter sur les propositions","Résoudre les désaccords entre les membres du comité","Prendre des décisions basées sur le consensus"],"de":["Vorschlagen signifikanter Änderungen oder Interventionen","Abstimmung über Vorschläge","Beilegung von Meinungsverschiedenheiten zwischen Ausschussmitgliedern","Treffen von konsensgestützten Entscheidungen"],"pt":["Propor mudanças ou intervenções significativas","Votar em propostas","Resolver desacordos entre membros do comitê","Tomar decisões impulsionadas por consenso"],"ru":["Предлагать значительные изменения или вмешательства","Голосовать по предложениям","Разрешать разногласия между членами комитета","Принимать решения, основанные на консенсусе"],"ar":["اقتراح تغييرات أو تدخلات كبيرة","التصويت على الاقتراحات","حل الخلافات بين أعضاء اللجنة","اتخاذ قرارات مدفوعة بالإجماع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires `.god/config.json` configuration file","Limited to God Committee consensus-building processes"],"zh":["需要`.god/config.json`配置文件","仅限于上帝委员会的共识建立过程"],"ja":["`.god/config.json`コンフィグファイルが必要","ゴッド委員会のコンセンサスビルディングプロセスのみに限定"],"ko":["`.god/config.json` 구성 파일이 필요함","신 위원회의 합의 형성 프로세스에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere un archivo de configuración `.god/config.json`","Limitado a los procesos de construcción de consenso del Comité God"],"fr":["Nécessite un fichier de configuration `.god/config.json`","Limité aux processus d''établissement de consensus du Comité God"],"de":["Erfordert die Konfigurationsdatei `.god/config.json`","Beschränkt auf die Konsensbildungsprozesse des God-Ausschusses"],"pt":["Requer arquivo de configuração `.god/config.json`","Limitado a processos de consenso do Comitê de Deus"],"ru":["Требует файла конфигурации `.god/config.json`","Ограничен процессами построения консенсуса Комитета Бога"],"ar":["يتطلب ملف التهيئة `.god/config.json`","محدود بعمليات بناء الإجماع في لجنة الله"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('zoonk/zoonk/zoonk-commit', 'community', 'zoonk', 'zoonk', 'zoonk/zoonk', 'zoonk-commit', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.418Z', '2026-02-18T04:17:25.837Z', NULL, '{"id":"zoonk/zoonk/zoonk-commit","name":"zoonk-commit","description":{"zh":"zoonk-commit是一个代码提交消息格式，帮助开发者规范代码提交","ja":"zoonk-commitはコミットメッセージのフォーマットであり、開発者がコードの提交を規格化するのに役立ちます","ko":"zoonk-commit은 커밋 메시지 형식으로 개발자가 코드 제출을 표준화하는 데 도움이 됩니다","es":"zoonk-commit te ayuda a aprender y aplicar una estructura de mensajes de commit efectiva para mejorar la colaboración en tu equipo.","fr":"zoonk-commit vous aide à apprendre et à appliquer une structure de messages de commit efficace pour améliorer la collaboration au sein de votre équipe.","de":"zoonk-commit hilft Ihnen, eine effektive Commit-Nachrichten-Struktur zu erlernen und anzuwenden, um die Zusammenarbeit in Ihrem Team zu verbessern.","pt":"O zoonk-commit é um padrão para escrever mensagens de commit claras e concisas, melhorando a colaboração e a manutenção do código","ru":"Zoonk-commit — это стандарт для написания ясных и кратких сообщений коммитов, улучшающий сотрудничество и поддержку кода","ar":"زونك كميت هو معيار لكتابة رسائل الالتزام الواضحة والموجزة، مما ي cải thiện التعاون وصيانة الكود","en":"Learn anything with step-by-step activities"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"zoonk-commit: 代码提交消息格式","ja":"zoonk-commit: コミットメッセージのフォーマット","ko":"zoonk-commit: 커밋 메시지 형식","es":"zoonk-commit: Guía de mensajes de commit","fr":"zoonk-commit: Guide des messages de commit","de":"zoonk-commit: Commit-Nachrichten-Anleitung","pt":"Zoonk Commit: Padrão de Mensagens de Commit","ru":"Zoonk Commit: Стандарт сообщений коммитов","ar":"زونك كميت: معايير رسائل الالتزام","en":"zoonk-commit"},"description":{"zh":"zoonk-commit是一个代码提交消息格式，帮助开发者规范代码提交","ja":"zoonk-commitはコミットメッセージのフォーマットであり、開発者がコードの提交を規格化するのに役立ちます","ko":"zoonk-commit은 커밋 메시지 형식으로 개발자가 코드 제출을 표준화하는 데 도움이 됩니다","es":"zoonk-commit te ayuda a aprender y aplicar una estructura de mensajes de commit efectiva para mejorar la colaboración en tu equipo.","fr":"zoonk-commit vous aide à apprendre et à appliquer une structure de messages de commit efficace pour améliorer la collaboration au sein de votre équipe.","de":"zoonk-commit hilft Ihnen, eine effektive Commit-Nachrichten-Struktur zu erlernen und anzuwenden, um die Zusammenarbeit in Ihrem Team zu verbessern.","pt":"O zoonk-commit é um padrão para escrever mensagens de commit claras e concisas, melhorando a colaboração e a manutenção do código","ru":"Zoonk-commit — это стандарт для написания ясных и кратких сообщений коммитов, улучшающий сотрудничество и поддержку кода","ar":"زونك كميت هو معيار لكتابة رسائل الالتزام الواضحة والموجزة، مما ي cải thiện التعاون وصيانة الكود","en":"Learn anything with step-by-step activities"},"definition":{"en":"Learn anything with step-by-step activities"},"features":{"zh":["标准化的代码提交消息格式","支持多种类型的提交消息","支持多个范围的提交消息","简洁易读的提交消息格式"],"ja":["標準化されたコミットメッセージのフォーマット","多種多様なタイプのコミットメッセージをサポート","複数のスコープのコミットメッセージをサポート","簡潔で読みやすいコミットメッセージのフォーマット"],"ko":["표준화된 커밋 메시지 형식","다양한 유형의 커밋 메시지를 지원","여러 범위의 커밋 메시지를 지원","간결하고 읽기 쉬운 커밋 메시지 형식"],"es":["Estructura de mensajes de commit","Tipos de commit (feat, fix, refactor, chore)","Ámbitos de commit (aplicaciones y paquetes)","Ámbitos inferidos para cambios generales","Mejora de la colaboración en equipo","Estructura de mensajes de commit personalizable"],"fr":["Structure de messages de commit","Types de commit (feat, fix, refactor, chore)","Champs de commit (applications et packages)","Champs déduits pour les modifications générales","Amélioration de la collaboration d''équipe","Structure de messages de commit personnalisable"],"de":["Commit-Nachrichten-Struktur","Commit-Typen (feat, fix, refactor, chore)","Commit-Bereiche (Anwendungen und Pakete)","Abgeleitete Bereiche für allgemeine Änderungen","Verbesserung der Teamzusammenarbeit","Anpassbare Commit-Nachrichten-Struktur"],"pt":["Formato de mensagem de commit padrão","Tipos de commit: feat, fix, refactor, chore","Escopos personalizados para monorepos","Inferência de escopos para alterações não relacionadas a aplicativos ou pacotes","Melhoria da colaboração e manutenção do código"],"ru":["Стандартный формат сообщений коммитов","Типы коммитов: feat, fix, refactor, chore","Пользовательские области для монорепозиториев","Вывод областей для изменений, не связанных с приложениями или пакетами","Улучшение сотрудничества и поддержки кода"],"ar":["تنسيق رسائل الالتزام المعياري","أنواع الالتزام: feat, fix, refactor, chore","نطاقات مخصصة لل仓庫 الموحد","استنتاج النطاقات للتغييرات غير المرتبطة بالتطبيقات أو الحزم","تحسين التعاون وصيانة الكود"]},"keywords":{"zh":["zoonk-commit","代码提交消息格式","代码规范","提交消息格式","代码提交","开发者工具"],"ja":["zoonk-commit","コミットメッセージのフォーマット","コード規格","コミットメッセージ","コードの提交","開発者ツール"],"ko":["zoonk-commit","커밋 메시지 형식","코드 규격","커밋 메시지","코드 제출","개발자 도구"],"es":["zoonk-commit","mensajes de commit","estructura de commit","colaboración en equipo","desarrollo de software","git commit","commit messages","estructura de mensajes de commit"],"fr":["zoonk-commit","messages de commit","structure de commit","collaboration d''équipe","développement de logiciels","git commit","messages de commit","structure de messages de commit"],"de":["zoonk-commit","Commit-Nachrichten","Commit-Struktur","Teamzusammenarbeit","Software-Entwicklung","git commit","Commit-Nachrichten","Commit-Nachrichten-Struktur"],"pt":["zoonk-commit","padrão de mensagens de commit","colaboração","manutenção de código","monorepo","commit messages","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["zoonk-commit","стандарт сообщений коммитов","сотрудничество","поддержка кода","монорепозиторий","сообщения коммитов","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["زونك كميت","معايير رسائل الالتزام","التعاون","صيانة الكود","仓庫 الموحد","رسائل الالتزام","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"zoonk","repo":"zoonk","repoPath":"zoonk/zoonk","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.418Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"zoonk-commit","description":"Guidelines for writing commit messages and PR descriptions. Use when creating commits, writing PR descriptions, or asking about commit format.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Commit Messages\n\n## Format\n\n```\ntype(scope): short message\n```\n\n## Types\n\n- `feat` - new feature\n- `fix` - bug fix\n- `refactor` - code refactoring\n- `chore` - maintenance tasks (deps, config, tooling)\n\n## Scopes\n\nUse the app or package name as scope when working in a monorepo:\n\n**Apps**: `web`, `mobile`, `api`, `admin`, `docs`\n\n**Packages**: `ui`, `utils`, `core`, `db`, `config`\n\n**Inferred scopes** (when change doesn''t fit an app/package):\n\n- `agents` - CLAUDE.md, AGENTS.md, `.claude/` folder","body":"# Commit Messages\n\n## Format\n\n```\ntype(scope): short message\n```\n\n## Types\n\n- `feat` - new feature\n- `fix` - bug fix\n- `refactor` - code refactoring\n- `chore` - maintenance tasks (deps, config, tooling)\n\n## Scopes\n\nUse the app or package name as scope when working in a monorepo:\n\n**Apps**: `web`, `mobile`, `api`, `admin`, `docs`\n\n**Packages**: `ui`, `utils`, `core`, `db`, `config`\n\n**Inferred scopes** (when change doesn''t fit an app/package):\n\n- `agents` - CLAUDE.md, AGENTS.md, `.claude/` folder\n- `ci` - GitHub workflows, CI/CD configuration\n- `deps` - dependency updates across multiple packages\n- `data` - data layer changes spanning multiple packages\n\n## Examples\n\n```\nfeat(web): add user profile page\nfix(api): handle null response in auth\nrefactor(db): use enum for status field\nchore(deps): update react to v19\nchore(agents): add commit skill\nfix(ci): update node version in workflow\n```\n\n## Rules\n\n- Use lowercase for entire message\n- No period at the end\n- Keep message under 72 characters\n- Use imperative mood (\"add\" not \"added\")\n\n# PR Descriptions\n\nKeep descriptions brief. Focus on what changed. No need to list verification commands run.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:17:25.837Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Management Agents needing structured commit message formatting.","zh":"非常适合需要结构化提交消息格式的代码管理代理。","ja":"構造化されたコミットメッセージ形式を必要とするコード管理エージェントに最適です。","ko":"구조화된 커밋 메시지 형식을 필요로 하는 코드 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de gestión de código que necesitan un formato de mensaje de confirmación estructurado.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion de code nécessitant un formatage de message de validation structuré.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Management-Agents, die ein strukturiertes Commit-Nachrichten-Format benötigen.","pt":"Perfect for Code Management Agents needing structured commit message formatting.","ru":"Perfect for Code Management Agents needing structured commit message formatting.","ar":"Perfect for Code Management Agents needing structured commit message formatting."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate standardized commit messages using the type(scope): short message format, incorporating types such as feat, fix, refactor, and chore, with scopes like web, mobile, and ui.","zh":"使代理能够使用类型(范围):短消息格式生成标准化的提交消息，包括feat、fix、refactor和chore等类型，以及web、mobile和ui等范围。","ja":"エージェントがタイプ(スコープ):短いメッセージ形式を使用して標準化されたコミットメッセージを生成できるようにします。例えば、feat、fix、refactor、choreなどのタイプや、web、mobile、uiなどのスコープを含みます。","ko":"에이전트가 유형(범위): 짧은 메시지 형식을 사용하여 표준화된 커밋 메시지를 생성할 수 있도록 합니다. 예를 들어, feat, fix, refactor, chore와 같은 유형이나 web, mobile, ui와 같은 범위를 포함합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar mensajes de confirmación estandarizados utilizando el formato tipo(alcance): mensaje corto, incorporando tipos como feat, fix, refactor y chore, con alcances como web, móvil y ui.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des messages de validation standardisés en utilisant le format type(portée) : message court, incorporant des types tels que feat, fix, refactor et chore, avec des portées comme web, mobile et ui.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, standardisierte Commit-Nachrichten mit dem Format Typ(Umfang): kurze Nachricht zu generieren, wobei Typen wie feat, fix, refactor und chore mit Umfängen wie web, mobile und ui verwendet werden.","pt":"Empowers agents to generate standardized commit messages using the type(scope): short message format, incorporating types such as feat, fix, refactor, and chore, with scopes like web, mobile, and ui.","ru":"Empowers agents to generate standardized commit messages using the type(scope): short message format, incorporating types such as feat, fix, refactor, and chore, with scopes like web, mobile, and ui.","ar":"Empowers agents to generate standardized commit messages using the type(scope): short message format, incorporating types such as feat, fix, refactor, and chore, with scopes like web, mobile, and ui."},"useCases":{"en":["Standardizing commit history","Automating commit message generation","Enforcing coding conventions"],"zh":["标准化提交历史","自动化提交消息生成","强制编码约定"],"ja":["コミット履歴の標準化","コミットメッセージの自動生成","コーディング規約の強制"],"ko":["提交 기록 표준화","提交 메시지 자동 생성","코딩 규약 강제"],"es":["Estandarizar el historial de confirmaciones","Automatizar la generación de mensajes de confirmación","Hacer cumplir las convenciones de codificación"],"fr":["Standardiser l''historique des validations","Automatiser la génération de messages de validation","Faire respecter les conventions de codage"],"de":["Standardisieren der Commit-Historie","Automatisieren der Commit-Nachrichtengenerierung","Durchsetzen von Codierkonventionen"],"pt":["Standardizing commit history","Automating commit message generation","Enforcing coding conventions"],"ru":["Standardizing commit history","Automating commit message generation","Enforcing coding conventions"],"ar":["Standardizing commit history","Automating commit message generation","Enforcing coding conventions"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to specified format","Limited to Git version control systems"],"zh":["需要遵守指定的格式","仅限于Git版本控制系统"],"ja":["指定された形式に従う必要がある","Gitバージョン管理システムのみに限定される"],"ko":["지정된 형식에 따라야 함","Git 버전 관리 시스템에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere adherencia al formato especificado","Limitado a sistemas de control de versiones Git"],"fr":["Nécessite l''adhésion au format spécifié","Limité aux systèmes de contrôle de version Git"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung des angegebenen Formats","Begrenzt auf Git-Versionierungssysteme"],"pt":["Requires adherence to specified format","Limited to Git version control systems"],"ru":["Requires adherence to specified format","Limited to Git version control systems"],"ar":["Requires adherence to specified format","Limited to Git version control systems"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('YougLin-dev/Aha-Loop/vision-builder', 'community', 'YougLin-dev', 'Aha-Loop', 'YougLin-dev/Aha-Loop', 'vision-builder', 0, 0, 75, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.418Z', '2026-02-18T04:17:24.275Z', NULL, '{"id":"YougLin-dev/Aha-Loop/vision-builder","name":"vision-builder","description":{"zh":"Vision Builder 技术是 Aha Loop 的一部分，用于生成完整的项目愿景文档。它通过交互式对话引导用户创建结构化的项目计划","ja":"ビジョンビルダー スキルは、Aha Loop の一部であり、完全なプロジェクト ビジョン ドキュメントを生成するために使用されます。構造化された対話を通じて、ユーザーがプロジェクト計画を作成することを支援します","ko":"비전 빌더 技术은 Aha Loop의 일부로 완전한 프로젝트 비전 문서를 생성합니다. 구조화된 대화를 통해 사용자가 프로젝트 계획을 생성하도록 도와줍니다","es":"Vision Builder es una habilidad que guía a los usuarios a través de un diálogo interactivo para crear un documento de visión de proyecto completo y bien estructurado","fr":"Vision Builder est une compétence qui guide les utilisateurs à travers un dialogue interactif pour créer un document de vision de projet complet et bien structuré","de":"Vision Builder ist eine Fähigkeit, die Benutzer durch ein interaktives Gespräch führt, um ein vollständiges und gut strukturiertes Projektvision-Dokument zu erstellen","pt":"O Construtor de Visão é uma habilidade de IA que ajuda a criar projetos completos e bem estruturados através de diálogos interativos.","ru":"Построитель Видения - это навык ИИ, который помогает создать полноценные и хорошо структурированные проекты посредством интерактивных диалогов.","ar":"بناء رؤية هو مهارة ذكاء اصطناعي تساعد على إنشاء مشاريع كاملة ومنظمة من خلال محادثات تفاعلية.","en":"[MVP] Aha Loop is a fully autonomous AI development system, extended from the core ideas of Ralph. It''s not just an execution engine, but a complete AI development framework with planning capabilities, research abilities, and oversight mechanisms."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Vision Builder 技术指南","ja":"ビジョンビルダー スキルガイド","ko":"비전 빌더 기술 문서","es":"Construye tu visión de proyecto con Vision Builder","fr":"Créez votre vision de projet avec Vision Builder","de":"Erstellen Sie Ihre Projektvision mit Vision Builder","pt":"Construtor de Visão: Crie Projetos Completos com AI","ru":"Построитель Видения: Создавайте Полноценные Проекты с ИИ","ar":"بناء رؤية: إنشاء مشاريع كاملة باستخدام الذكاء الاصطناعي","en":"vision-builder"},"description":{"zh":"Vision Builder 技术是 Aha Loop 的一部分，用于生成完整的项目愿景文档。它通过交互式对话引导用户创建结构化的项目计划","ja":"ビジョンビルダー スキルは、Aha Loop の一部であり、完全なプロジェクト ビジョン ドキュメントを生成するために使用されます。構造化された対話を通じて、ユーザーがプロジェクト計画を作成することを支援します","ko":"비전 빌더 技术은 Aha Loop의 일부로 완전한 프로젝트 비전 문서를 생성합니다. 구조화된 대화를 통해 사용자가 프로젝트 계획을 생성하도록 도와줍니다","es":"Vision Builder es una habilidad que guía a los usuarios a través de un diálogo interactivo para crear un documento de visión de proyecto completo y bien estr...","fr":"Vision Builder est une compétence qui guide les utilisateurs à travers un dialogue interactif pour créer un document de vision de projet complet et bien stru...","de":"Vision Builder ist eine Fähigkeit, die Benutzer durch ein interaktives Gespräch führt, um ein vollständiges und gut strukturiertes Projektvision-Dokument zu ...","pt":"O Construtor de Visão é uma habilidade de IA que ajuda a criar projetos completos e bem estruturados através de diálogos interativos.","ru":"Построитель Видения - это навык ИИ, который помогает создать полноценные и хорошо структурированные проекты посредством интерактивных диалогов.","ar":"بناء رؤية هو مهارة ذكاء اصطناعي تساعد على إنشاء مشاريع كاملة ومنظمة من خلال محادثات تفاعلية.","en":"[MVP] Aha Loop is a fully autonomous AI development system, extended from the core ideas of Ralph. It''s not just an execution engine, but a complete AI devel..."},"definition":{"en":"[MVP] Aha Loop is a fully autonomous AI development system, extended from the core ideas of Ralph. It''s not just an execution engine, but a complete AI development framework with planning capabilities, research abilities, and oversight mechanisms."},"features":{"zh":["交互式对话生成项目愿景文档","结构化的项目计划创建","自动化的项目愿景文档生成","可行的项目计划验证","支持多种项目类型"],"ja":["対話形式のプロジェクト ビジョン ドキュメント生成","構造化されたプロジェクト計画の作成","自動化されたプロジェクト ビジョン ドキュメント生成","実行可能なプロジェクト計画の検証","多様なプロジェクト タイプをサポート"],"ko":["대화 형식의 프로젝트 비전 문서 생성","구조화된 프로젝트 계획 생성","자동화된 프로젝트 비전 문서 생성","실행 가능한 프로젝트 계획 검증","다양한 프로젝트 유형 지원"],"es":["Detecta ideas de proyecto vagas","Engage en diálogos estructurados","Refina progresivamente la visión","Genera un documento de visión de proyecto completo","Valida la visión para asegurarse de que sea actionable"],"fr":["Détecte les idées de projet vagues","Engage dans des dialogues structurés","Affine progressivement la vision","Génère un document de vision de projet complet","Valide la vision pour s''assurer qu''elle est actionable"],"de":["Erkennst vage Projektideen","Engagiert sich in strukturierten Dialogen","Verfeinert schrittweise die Vision","Erstellt ein vollständiges Projektvision-Dokument","Überprüft die Vision, um sicherzustellen, dass sie umsetzbar ist"],"pt":["Detecção de ideias vagas de projeto","Diálogo estruturado com o usuário","Refinamento progressivo da visão do projeto","Geração de documento de visão do projeto","Validação da visão do projeto"],"ru":["Обнаружение неясных идей проекта","Структурированный диалог с пользователем","Постепенное усовершенствование видения проекта","Генерация документа видения проекта","Валидация видения проекта"],"ar":["اكتشاف الأفكار الغامضة للمشروع","حوار منظم مع المستخدم","تحسين رؤية المشروع تدريجيًا","إنشاء وثيقة رؤية المشروع","التحقق من صحة رؤية المشروع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vision Builder","项目愿景文档","交互式对话","结构化项目计划","自动化文档生成","项目计划验证"],"ja":["ビジョンビルダー","プロジェクト ビジョン ドキュメント","対話形式","構造化されたプロジェクト計画","自動化されたドキュメント生成","プロジェクト計画の検証"],"ko":["비전 빌더","프로젝트 비전 문서","대화 형식","구조화된 프로젝트 계획","자동화된 문서 생성","프로젝트 계획 검증"],"es":["desarrollo de AI","visión de proyecto","documento de visión","herramienta de desarrollo","diálogo interactivo","proyecto de software","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["développement d''IA","vision de projet","document de vision","outils de développement","dialogue interactif","projet de logiciel","développement de logiciel"],"de":["Entwicklung künstlicher Intelligenz","Projektvision","Projektvision-Dokument","Entwicklungstool","interaktives Gespräch","Software-Projekt","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["construtor de visão","ia para projetos","desenvolvimento de projetos","tecnologia de ia","projetos de software","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["построитель видения","ии для проектов","разработка проектов","технология ии","проекты программного обеспечения","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["بناء رؤية","الذكاء الاصطناعي للمشاريع","تنمية المشاريع","تكنولوجيا الذكاء الاصطناعي","مشاريع البرمجيات","تنمية البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"YougLin-dev","repo":"Aha-Loop","repoPath":"YougLin-dev/Aha-Loop","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.418Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vision-builder","description":"Builds project visions through interactive guided conversation. Use when users have vague ideas needing structure. Triggers on: build vision, I have an idea, start new project, new idea.","bodyPreview":"# Vision Builder Skill\n\nGuide users through an interactive conversation to build a complete, well-structured project vision document.\n\n---\n\n## The Job\n\n1. Detect when user has a vague project idea\n2. Engage in structured dialogue using AskQuestion tool\n3. Progressively refine the vision through targeted questions\n4. Generate a complete `project.vision.md` document\n5. Validate the vision is actionable\n\n---\n\n## When to Use\n\nActivate this skill when user says things like:\n- \"I have an idea for...\"","body":"# Vision Builder Skill\n\nGuide users through an interactive conversation to build a complete, well-structured project vision document.\n\n---\n\n## The Job\n\n1. Detect when user has a vague project idea\n2. Engage in structured dialogue using AskQuestion tool\n3. Progressively refine the vision through targeted questions\n4. Generate a complete `project.vision.md` document\n5. Validate the vision is actionable\n\n---\n\n## When to Use\n\nActivate this skill when user says things like:\n- \"I have an idea for...\"\n- \"Help me build a project vision\"\n- \"I want to create something that...\"\n- \"Build a project vision for me\"\n- \"I have an idea...\"\n- Any vague project description without clear structure\n\n---\n\n## Conversation Flow\n\n### Phase 1: Project Type\n\nStart by understanding what kind of project this is.\n\n```\nQuestion: What type of project is this?\n\nOptions:\n[A] Web Application (website/app accessed via browser)\n[B] CLI Tool (command line tool)\n[C] API Service (backend API service)\n[D] Desktop Application (Windows/Mac/Linux app)\n[E] Mobile Application (iOS/Android)\n[F] Library/SDK (code package for other developers)\n[G] Other (please describe)\n```\n\nIf user selects [G], follow up with open-ended question.\n\n### Phase 2: Core Problem\n\nUnderstand the problem being solved.\n\n```\nQuestion: What problem does this project solve?\n\nOptions:\n[A] Improve Efficiency (automation, reduce repetitive work)\n[B] Information Management (store, organize, retrieve data)\n[C] Communication/Collaboration (help people work together)\n[D] Entertainment/Creative (games, media, art)\n[E] Learning/Education (teaching, training)\n[F] Other (please describe)\n\nAllow multiple selections: true\n```\n\nFollow up: \"Can you describe the problem you want to solve in more detail?\"\n\n### Phase 3: Target Users\n\nIdentify who will use the product.\n\n```\nQuestion: Who will use this product?\n\nOptions:\n[A] Developers/Technical Users\n[B] General Consumers/Individual Users\n[C] Enterprise/Team Users\n[D] Specific Industry Professionals\n[E] Personal Use Only\n[F] Other\n\nAllow multiple selections: true\n```\n\nIf [D] selected, ask: \"Which industry?\"\n\n### Phase 4: Scale and Ambition\n\nUnderstand the scope.\n\n```\nQuestion: What is the scale and ambition of this project?\n\nOptions:\n[A] Small Project - Quick idea validation, completed in days\n[B] Medium Project - Complete features, completed in weeks\n[C] Large Project - Full product, requires months\n[D] Uncertain - Help me evaluate\n```\n\n### Phase 5: Success Criteria\n\nDefine what success looks like.\n\n```\nQuestion: What defines success for this project? (multiple selections allowed)\n\nOptions:\n[A] Feature complete and usable\n[B] Performance meets requirements (speed, stability)\n[C] Good user experience\n[D] People willing to use/pay\n[E] Learn/practice new technologies\n[F] Other\n```\n\nFollow up for selected items to get specific metrics.\n\n### Phase 6: Technical Preferences\n\nGather technical constraints.\n\n```\nQuestion: Do you have technology stack preferences?\n\nOptions:\n[A] Clear preferences (please specify)\n[B] Some preferences but open to discussion\n[C] Let AI decide\n[D] Want to try new technologies\n```\n\nIf [A] or [B], ask follow-up about specific technologies.\n\n```\nQuestion: Are there any technologies you want to avoid?\n\nOptions:\n[A] No, open to all\n[B] Avoid overly complex frameworks\n[C] Avoid paid/commercial components\n[D] Specific technologies to avoid (please specify)\n```\n\n### Phase 7: Constraints\n\nIdentify limitations.\n\n```\nQuestion: Are there any constraints? (multiple selections allowed)\n\nOptions:\n[A] Limited time\n[B] Limited budget/free only\n[C] Must work offline\n[D] Specific platform requirements\n[E] High security/privacy requirements\n[F] No special constraints\n```\n\n### Phase 8: Inspirations\n\nGet reference points.\n\n```\nQuestion: Are there similar products for reference?\n\nOptions:\n[A] Yes, I can name a few\n[B] Have a general direction but unsure of specific products\n[C] No, this is a completely new idea\n[D] Help me find some references\n```\n\n---\n\n## Output Generation\n\nAfter completing the conversation, generate `project.vision.md`:\n\n```markdown\n# Project Vision\n\n## What\n\n[One clear sentence synthesized from conversation]\n\n## Why\n\n[Problem statement from Phase 2, refined]\n\n## Target Users\n\n[Users identified in Phase 3, with details]\n\n## Success Criteria\n\n[Measurable criteria from Phase 5]\n- [Criterion 1 with metric]\n- [Criterion 2 with metric]\n- ...\n\n## Constraints\n\n[Constraints from Phase 7]\n- [Constraint 1]\n- ...\n\n## Technical Preferences\n\n### Preferred\n- [Technology/approach user wants]\n\n### To Avoid\n- [Technology/approach to avoid]\n\n## Inspirations\n\n[References from Phase 8]\n- [Product 1] - [what to learn from it]\n- ...\n\n## Non-Goals\n\n[Explicitly out of scope based on conversation]\n- [Non-goal 1]\n- ...\n\n---\n\n*Vision built interactively on [date]*\n*Ready for: Orchestrator → Architecture → Roadmap*\n```\n\n---\n\n## Adaptive Questioning\n\n### If User Gives Short Answers\n\nAdd follow-up prompts:\n- \"Can you elaborate on that?\"\n- \"Do you have a specific example?\"\n- \"Why is this important to you?\"\n\n### If User Is Uncertain\n\nOffer to help:\n- \"I can give you some options to reference\"\n- \"Based on what you said, I understand it as... Is that correct?\"\n- \"How about we continue and come back to this question later?\"\n\n### If User Wants to Skip\n\nAllow skipping optional sections:\n- Technical Preferences → AI decides\n- Inspirations → Skip\n- Non-Goals → Infer from scope\n\n**Never skip:** What, Why, Target Users, Success Criteria\n\n---\n\n## Example Conversation\n\n**User:** I want to build some kind of expense tracker\n\n**AI:** \nLet me help you refine this idea into a complete project vision.\n\nFirst, what type of project is this?\n[A] Web App  [B] CLI Tool  [C] API Service  [D] Mobile App  [E] Other\n\n**User:** A\n\n**AI:**\nOK, a web expense tracking app. What problem does it solve?\n[A] Existing expense software is too complex\n[B] Need specific tracking features\n[C] Want better data analysis\n[D] Other\n\n**User:** A, too complex\n\n**AI:**\nGot it, you want a simple expense tracker. Who will use it?\n[A] Just myself\n[B] Family members\n[C] Small team\n[D] Public facing\n\n**User:** A\n\n**AI:**\nSimple personal expense tracking. What defines success?\n[A] Can quickly record expenses\n[B] Can generate monthly reports\n[C] Can categorize and analyze\n[D] Can export data\n(multiple selections allowed)\n\n**User:** A, B, C\n\n**AI:**\nHow quick is \"quickly record\"?\n[A] Under 5 seconds per entry\n[B] Under 10 seconds\n[C] Not sure, just needs to be fast\n\n**User:** A\n\n...continues until vision is complete...\n\n---\n\n## Validation Checklist\n\nBefore saving vision:\n\n- [ ] What section is clear and specific\n- [ ] Why section explains the problem\n- [ ] Target users are defined\n- [ ] At least 2 measurable success criteria\n- [ ] User has confirmed the summary\n\n---\n\n## Integration\n\nAfter vision is built:\n\n1. Save to `project.vision.md`\n2. Show summary to user for confirmation\n3. Suggest next step: \"Run orchestrator to start building\"\n4. Optionally auto-trigger orchestrator\n\n---\n\n## Mindset\n\n**You are a professional product consultant.**\n\n- Ask questions like a curious expert\n- Never make user feel their idea is bad\n- Help refine vague ideas into concrete plans\n- Be encouraging but also realistic\n- Adapt your language to user''s style (formal/casual)\n\n**Remember:** The goal is to help users who \"only have fragments in their mind\" build a complete, actionable vision through professional guidance.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:17:24.275Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Development Agents needing structured project planning and vision documentation capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要结构化项目规划和愿景文档编制能力的AI开发代理。","ja":"構造化されたプロジェクト計画とビジョンドキュメントの作成能力が必要なAI開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"구조화된 프로젝트 계획 및 비전 문서 작성 기능이 필요한 AI 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo de IA que necesitan planificación de proyectos estructurada y capacidades de documentación de visión.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Développement d''IA nécessitant une planification de projet structurée et des capacités de documentation de vision.","de":"Perfekt für AI-Entwicklungsagenten, die eine strukturierte Projektplanung und Visiondokumentationsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento de IA que necessitam de planejamento de projetos estruturado e capacidades de documentação de visão.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки ИИ, которым необходимы структурированный планирование проектов и возможности документирования видения.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الناشئين عن الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى تخطيط مشروع منظم وقدرات توثيق الرؤية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to guide users through interactive conversations, generating well-structured project vision documents in Markdown format, utilizing targeted questions and oversight mechanisms.","zh":"赋予代理引导用户通过交互式对话，生成格式良好的项目愿景文档（Markdown格式），利用有针对性的问题和监督机制。","ja":"エージェントが対話形式でユーザーを導き、ターゲットを絞った質問と監視メカニズムを利用して、構造化されたプロジェクトビジョンドキュメント（Markdown形式）を生成できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 대화 형식으로 사용자를 안내하여 구조화된 프로젝트 비전 문서(Markdown 형식)를 생성할 수 있도록 하며, 대상이 되는 질문과 감시 메커니즘을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para guiar a los usuarios a través de conversaciones interactivas, generando documentos de visión de proyecto bien estructurados en formato Markdown, utilizando preguntas y mecanismos de supervisión dirigidos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de guider les utilisateurs à travers des conversations interactives, en générant des documents de vision de projet bien structurés au format Markdown, en utilisant des questions et des mécanismes de surveillance ciblés.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Benutzer durch interaktive Gespräche zu führen, indem sie gut strukturierte Projektvisiondokumente im Markdown-Format generieren, unter Verwendung gezielter Fragen und Überwachungsmechanismen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a orientar os usuários por meio de conversas interativas, gerando documentos de visão de projeto bem estruturados no formato Markdown, utilizando perguntas direcionadas e mecanismos de supervisão.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью направлять пользователей через интерактивные разговоры, генерируя хорошо структурированные документы видения проекта в формате Markdown, используя целевые вопросы и механизмы надзора.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على توجيه المستخدمين من خلال محادثات تفاعلية، وتوليد وثائق رؤية المشروع المنظمة جيدًا بصيغة Markdown، باستخدام أسئلة محددة وآليات الرقابة."},"useCases":{"en":["Refining vague project ideas into actionable plans","Generating complete project.vision.md documents","Validating project visions for feasibility and clarity"],"zh":["将模糊的项目想法转化为可行的计划","生成完整的项目愿景文档（project.vision.md）","验证项目愿景的可行性和清晰度"],"ja":["漠然としたプロジェクトアイデアを実行可能な計画に絞り込む","完全なプロジェクトビジョンドキュメント（project.vision.md）を生成する","プロジェクトビジョンの可行性と明確性を検証する"],"ko":["모호한 프로젝트 아이디어를 실행 가능한 계획으로 정제하는 것","완전한 프로젝트 비전 문서(project.vision.md)를 생성하는 것","프로젝트 비전의 실현 가능성과 명확성을 검증하는 것"],"es":["Perfeccionar ideas de proyecto vagas en planes de acción","Generar documentos de visión de proyecto completos project.vision.md","Validar visiones de proyecto para su factibilidad y claridad"],"fr":["Affiner des idées de projet vagues en plans d''action","Générer des documents de vision de projet complets project.vision.md","Valider les visions de projet pour leur faisabilité et leur clarté"],"de":["Verfeinern vager Projektideen in handhabbare Pläne","Generieren vollständiger Projektvisiondokumente project.vision.md","Überprüfen von Projektvisionen auf Machbarkeit und Klarheit"],"pt":["Refinamento de ideias de projeto vagas em planos de ação","Geração de documentos de visão de projeto completos no formato project.vision.md","Validação de visões de projeto para viabilidade e clareza"],"ru":["Уточнение неясных идей проекта в планы действий","Генерация полных документов видения проекта в формате project.vision.md","Проверка видения проекта на осуществимость и ясность"],"ar":["تحسين الأفكار الغامضة للمشروع في خطط العمل","توليد وثائق رؤية المشروع الكاملة بنفس التنسيق project.vision.md","التحقق من رؤية المشروع للقابلية للتطبيق والوضوح"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires user input and engagement","Output is limited to Markdown format (.md files)"],"zh":["需要用户输入和参与","输出仅限于Markdown格式（.md文件）"],"ja":["ユーザーの入力と参加が必要","出力はMarkdown形式（.mdファイル）に限定される"],"ko":["사용자 입력과 참여가 필요합니다","출력은 Markdown 형식(.md 파일)으로 제한됩니다"],"es":["Requiere entrada y compromiso del usuario","La salida está limitada al formato Markdown (.md archivos)"],"fr":["Nécessite une entrée et un engagement de l''utilisateur","La sortie est limitée au format Markdown (.md fichiers)"],"de":["Benutzereingabe und -engagement erforderlich","Die Ausgabe ist auf das Markdown-Format (.md-Dateien) beschränkt"],"pt":["Requer entrada e engajamento do usuário","Saída limitada ao formato Markdown (.md files)"],"ru":["Требует ввода и участия пользователя","Выходные данные ограничены форматом Markdown (.md files)"],"ar":["يتطلب إدخال المستخدم والمشاركة","مخرجات محدودة بصيغة Markdown (.md files)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('zainfathoni/kelas.rumahberbagi.com/ui-preview', 'community', 'zainfathoni', 'kelas.rumahberbagi.com', 'zainfathoni/kelas.rumahberbagi.com', 'ui-preview', 0, 0, 35, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.418Z', '2026-02-18T04:16:55.715Z', NULL, '{"id":"zainfathoni/kelas.rumahberbagi.com/ui-preview","name":"ui-preview","description":{"zh":"UI预览技能允许开发者使用Chrome DevTools预览和分析本地开发服务器和故事书，提高开发效率","ja":"UIプレビュースキルは、開発者がChrome DevToolsを使用してローカル開発サーバーとストーリーブックをプレビューして分析できるようにし、開発効率を向上させます","ko":"UI 미리보기 기술은 개발자가 Chrome DevTools를 사용하여 로컬 개발 서버 및 스토리북을 미리 보고 분석할 수 있도록 하여 개발 효율성을 높입니다","es":"La vista previa de UI permite a los desarrolladores previsualizar servidores de desarrollo local y storybooks usando Chrome DevTools","fr":"L''aperçu UI permet aux développeurs de prévisualiser les serveurs de développement locaux et les storybooks à l''aide de Chrome DevTools","de":"Die UI-Vorschau ermöglicht es Entwicklern, lokale Entwicklungsserver und Storybooks mit Chrome DevTools zu prüfen","pt":"O UI Preview é uma habilidade que permite pré-visualizar servidores de desenvolvimento local e storybooks usando o Chrome DevTools.","ru":"Предварительный просмотр UI — это навык, который позволяет предварительно просматривать локальные серверы разработки и storybooks с помощью Chrome DevTools.","ar":"معاينة واجهة المستخدم هي مهارة تمكنك من معاينة خوادمنك التطويرية المحلية و storybooks باستخدام أدوات مطور Chrome.","en":"Kelas Rumah Berbagi"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"UI预览：使用Chrome DevTools预览本地开发服务器和故事书","ja":"UIプレビュー：Chrome DevToolsでローカル開発サーバーとストーリーブックをプレビュー","ko":"UI 미리보기: Chrome DevTools를 사용하여 로컬 개발 서버 및 스토리북 미리 보기","es":"Vista previa de UI: herramientas de desarrollo","fr":"Aperçu UI : outils de développement","de":"UI-Vorschau: Entwicklungstools","pt":"Pré-visualização de UI: Ferramentas de Desenvolvimento","ru":"Предварительный просмотр UI: Инструменты разработки","ar":"معاينة واجهة المستخدم: أدوات التطوير","en":"ui-preview"},"description":{"zh":"UI预览技能允许开发者使用Chrome DevTools预览和分析本地开发服务器和故事书，提高开发效率","ja":"UIプレビュースキルは、開発者がChrome DevToolsを使用してローカル開発サーバーとストーリーブックをプレビューして分析できるようにし、開発効率を向上させます","ko":"UI 미리보기 기술은 개발자가 Chrome DevTools를 사용하여 로컬 개발 서버 및 스토리북을 미리 보고 분석할 수 있도록 하여 개발 효율성을 높입니다","es":"La vista previa de UI permite a los desarrolladores previsualizar servidores de desarrollo local y storybooks usando Chrome DevTools","fr":"L''aperçu UI permet aux développeurs de prévisualiser les serveurs de développement locaux et les storybooks à l''aide de Chrome DevTools","de":"Die UI-Vorschau ermöglicht es Entwicklern, lokale Entwicklungsserver und Storybooks mit Chrome DevTools zu prüfen","pt":"O UI Preview é uma habilidade que permite pré-visualizar servidores de desenvolvimento local e storybooks usando o Chrome DevTools.","ru":"Предварительный просмотр UI — это навык, который позволяет предварительно просматривать локальные серверы разработки и storybooks с помощью Chrome DevTools.","ar":"معاينة واجهة المستخدم هي مهارة تمكنك من معاينة خوادمنك التطويرية المحلية و storybooks باستخدام أدوات مطور Chrome.","en":"Kelas Rumah Berbagi"},"definition":{"en":"Kelas Rumah Berbagi"},"features":{"zh":["导航到目标URL","截取当前页面截图","打开新浏览器标签页","按下键盘按键","在页面上运行JavaScript"],"ja":["ターゲットURLに移動","現在のページのスクリーンショットを取得","新しいブラウザタブを開く","キーボードキーの押下","ページでJavaScriptを実行"],"ko":["타겟 URL로 이동","현재 페이지의 스크린샷을 캡처","새 브라우저 탭을 열기","키보드 키를 누르기","페이지에서 JavaScript 실행"],"es":["Navegación a URL específicas","Captura de pantalla de la página actual","Apertura de una nueva pestaña del navegador","Simulación de pulsaciones de teclas","Ejecución de scripts de JavaScript en la página"],"fr":["Navigation vers des URL spécifiques","Capture d''écran de la page actuelle","Ouverture d''un nouvel onglet du navigateur","Simulation de frappes de touches","Exécution de scripts JavaScript sur la page"],"de":["Navigation zu bestimmten URLs","Screenshot der aktuellen Seite","Öffnen eines neuen Browser-Tabs","Simulieren von Tastenanschlägen","Ausführen von JavaScript-Scripts auf der Seite"],"pt":["Navegação para URL específicos","Captura de telas da página atual","Abertura de novas guias do navegador","Simulação de pressionamento de teclas","Execução de scripts JavaScript na página"],"ru":["Переход на конкретные URL-адреса","Снятие скриншотов текущей страницы","Открытие новых вкладок браузера","Имитация нажатия клавиш","Выполнение скриптов JavaScript на странице"],"ar":["التنقل إلى عناوين URL محددة","التقط الصور الشاشة للصفحة الحالية","فتح علامات تبويب جديدة في المتصفح","محاكاة الضغط على المفاتيح","تشغيل سكريبتات جافا سكريبت على الصفحة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["UI预览","Chrome DevTools","本地开发服务器","故事书","开发效率","网页开发"],"ja":["UIプレビュー","Chrome DevTools","ローカル開発サーバー","ストーリーブック","開発効率","Web開発"],"ko":["UI 미리보기","Chrome DevTools","로컬 개발 서버","스토리북","개발 효율성","웹 개발"],"es":["vista previa de UI","herramientas de desarrollo","Chrome DevTools","servidores de desarrollo local","storybook","depuración de aplicaciones web"],"fr":["aperçu UI","outils de développement","Chrome DevTools","serveurs de développement locaux","storybook","débogage d''applications web"],"de":["UI-Vorschau","Entwicklungstools","Chrome DevTools","lokale Entwicklungsserver","storybook","Fehlersuche von Webanwendungen"],"pt":["pré-visualização de ui","desenvolvimento web","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","chrome devtools","storybooks","servidores de desenvolvimento local"],"ru":["предварительный просмотр ui","веб-разработка","инструменты разработки","chrome devtools","storybooks","локальные серверы разработки"],"ar":["معاينة واجهة المستخدم","تطوير الويب","أدوات التطوير","أدوات مطور كروم","storybooks","خوادمنك التطويرية المحلية"]}},"owner":"zainfathoni","repo":"kelas.rumahberbagi.com","repoPath":"zainfathoni/kelas.rumahberbagi.com","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.418Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ui-preview","description":"","version":"1","bodyPreview":"# UI Preview Skill\n\nPreview local dev servers and storybooks using Chrome DevTools.\n\n## Available Tools\n\n- `navigate_page` - Navigate to a URL\n- `take_screenshot` - Capture a screenshot of the current page\n- `new_page` - Open a new browser tab\n- `press_key` - Press keyboard keys (e.g., scrolling with PageDown, End)\n- `evaluate_script` - Run JavaScript on the page\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Navigate** to the target URL using `navigate_page`\n2. **Screenshot** the page using `take_screenshot`\n3. **Analyze*","body":"# UI Preview Skill\n\nPreview local dev servers and storybooks using Chrome DevTools.\n\n## Available Tools\n\n- `navigate_page` - Navigate to a URL\n- `take_screenshot` - Capture a screenshot of the current page\n- `new_page` - Open a new browser tab\n- `press_key` - Press keyboard keys (e.g., scrolling with PageDown, End)\n- `evaluate_script` - Run JavaScript on the page\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Navigate** to the target URL using `navigate_page`\n2. **Screenshot** the page using `take_screenshot`\n3. **Analyze** captured screenshots with `look_at` for visual analysis\n\n## Local Dev URLs\n\nCheck `.amp/dev-environment.txt` for the running URLs (defaults:\nweb=http://localhost:7001, server=https://localhost:7002).\n\n| Service           | Path       |\n| ----------------- | ---------- |\n| Web dev server    | /          |\n| Server dev server | /          |\n| Webview storybook | /storybook |\n| Server storybook  | /storybook |\n\n## Storybooks\n\nAccess a specific story directly using the hash: `/storybook#${story-title}`\n\nThe story title is derived from the filename: `handoff-story.svelte` →\n`#handoff-tool`\n\n### Webview Storybook (localhost:7001)\n\nComponents for the VS Code extension webview UI.\n\n**Thread Components:**\n\n- `#thread` - Full thread view\n- `#streaming-thread` - Thread with streaming content\n- `#scrollable-thread` - Thread with scroll behavior\n- `#thread-reply-area` - Message input area\n- `#thread-status` - Thread status indicators\n- `#thread-summary` - Thread summary view\n- `#thread-hints` - Thread hint suggestions\n- `#thread-environment-input` - Environment input\n\n**Tool Calls:**\n\n- `#bash` - Bash tool output\n- `#edit-file` - File edit diffs\n- `#create-file` - File creation\n- `#read` - File read output\n- `#grep` - Search results\n- `#glob` - File glob results\n- `#handoff-tool` - Handoff tool states\n- `#mermaid` - Diagram rendering\n- `#oracle-tool` - Oracle tool output\n- `#task-tool` - Task tool output\n- `#web-search` - Web search results\n\n**Editor & Input:**\n\n- `#prompt-editor` - Message input editor\n- `#mention-menu` - @mention autocomplete\n- `#combobox` - Combobox component\n- `#agent-mode-selector` - Agent mode picker\n\n**Diff Viewer:**\n\n- `#diff-viewer` - Side-by-side diff\n- `#diff-display` - Inline diff display\n- `#unified-diff` - Unified diff format\n\n**Settings:**\n\n- `#settings-page` - Settings page\n- `#settings-error-modal` - Error modal\n- `#sign-in-page` - Authentication page\n\n**Layout:**\n\n- `#layout-navbar` - Navigation bar\n- `#current-thread-navbar-item` - Thread nav item\n\n### Server Storybook (localhost:7002)\n\nComponents for the ampcode.com web app.\n\n**Thread Management:**\n\n- `#thread-feed` - Thread list feed\n- `#thread-feed-item` - Individual thread item\n- `#thread-feed-list` - Virtualized thread list\n- `#thread-actions` - Thread action buttons\n- `#thread-visibility` - Visibility settings\n- `#thread-visibility-edit` - Edit visibility\n- `#thread-page` - Full thread page\n- `#thread-open-in-button` - Open in editor button\n- `#pull-request-badge` - PR badge display\n\n**Settings:**\n\n- `#settings-access-token-section` - API tokens\n- `#settings-advanced-section` - Advanced settings\n- `#settings-client-section` - Client settings\n- `#billing-section` - Billing info\n- `#amp-free-section` - Free tier info\n- `#code-host-connections-section` - GitHub/GitLab connections\n\n**User & Profile:**\n\n- `#avatar` - User avatar\n- `#profile-card` - Profile card\n- `#profile-dropdown` - Profile menu\n- `#user-display` - User name display\n\n**Dashboard:**\n\n- `#welcome` - Welcome page\n- `#usage-by-day` - Usage metrics\n\n**UI Components:**\n\n- `#amp-logo` - Logo variants\n- `#badge-single` - Single badge\n- `#badge-group` - Badge group\n- `#copyable-text` - Copy-to-clipboard text\n- `#colors` - Color palette\n- `#icons` - Icon set\n\n**OG Images:**\n\n- `#og-images` - Social preview images\n\n## Tips\n\n- Story titles use kebab-case from filenames (remove `-story.svelte`)\n- Reload the skill if MCP tools become unavailable\n- Use `list_pages` to manage multiple browser tabs\n- Use `press_key` with \"End\" or \"PageDown\" to scroll the page\n- Use `evaluate_script` for custom page interactions\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:16:55.715Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Development Agents needing automated UI testing and visual regression capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化UI测试和视觉回归功能的前端开发代理。","ja":"フロントエンド開発エージェントが自動化されたUIテストと視覚的回帰機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"자동화된 UI 테스트 및 시각적 회귀 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollo Frontend que necesitan capacidades automatizadas de pruebas de IU y regresión visual.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Développement Frontend ayant besoin de capacités automatisées de tests d''interface utilisateur et de régression visuelle.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Entwicklungsagenten, die automatisierte UI-Tests und visuelle Regressionsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Frontend que precisam de testes de UI automatizados e capacidades de regressão visual.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки frontend, которым необходимы автоматизированные тесты UI и возможности визуальной регрессии.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطوير الواجهة الأمامية الذين يحتاجون إلى اختبارات واجهة المستخدم الآلية وقدرات الانحدار البصري."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables automated visual testing of local development servers and Storybook instances using Chrome DevTools protocol. Provides programmatic browser control through navigation, screenshot capture, keyboard simulation, and JavaScript execution for comprehensive UI analysis.","zh":"启用使用Chrome DevTools协议的本地开发服务器和Storybook实例的自动化视觉测试。通过导航、截图捕获、键盘模拟和JavaScript执行提供程序化浏览器控制，以进行全面UI分析。","ja":"Chrome DevToolsプロトコルを使用したローカル開発サーバーとStorybookインスタンスの自動化された視覚テストを可能にします。ナビゲーション、スクリーンショットのキャプチャ、キーボードのシミュレーション、JavaScriptの実行を通じて、包括的なUI分析のためのプログラムによるブラウザーの制御を提供します。","ko":"Chrome DevTools 프로토콜을 사용하여 로컬 개발 서버 및 Storybook 인스턴스의 자동화된 시각적 테스트를 가능하게 합니다. 탐색, 스크린샷 캡처, 키보드 시뮬레이션 및 자바스크립트 실행을 통해 포괄적인 UI 분석을 위한 프로그램에 의한 브라우저 제어를 제공합니다.","es":"Permite pruebas visuales automatizadas de servidores de desarrollo local e instancias de Storybook utilizando el protocolo Chrome DevTools. Proporciona control programático del navegador mediante navegación, captura de pantallas, simulación de teclado y ejecución de JavaScript para un análisis exhaustivo de la IU.","fr":"Permet des tests visuels automatisés des serveurs de développement local et des instances Storybook en utilisant le protocole Chrome DevTools. Offre un contrôle programmatique du navigateur via la navigation, la capture de captures d''écran, la simulation de clavier et l''exécution JavaScript pour une analyse complète de l''interface utilisateur.","de":"Ermöglicht automatisierte visuelle Tests von lokalen Entwicklungsservern und Storybook-Instanzen unter Verwendung des Chrome DevTools-Protokolls. Bietet programmatische Browsersteuerung durch Navigation, Screenshot-Erfassung, Tastatursimulation und JavaScript-Ausführung für umfassende UI-Analysen.","pt":"Permite testes visuais automatizados de servidores de desenvolvimento local e instâncias do Storybook usando o protocolo Chrome DevTools. Fornece controle programático do navegador por meio de navegação, captura de tela, simulação de teclado e execução de JavaScript para análise de UI abrangente.","ru":"Позволяет выполнять автоматизированное визуальное тестирование локальных серверов разработки и экземпляров Storybook с использованием протокола Chrome DevTools. Обеспечивает программный контроль над браузером посредством навигации, захвата экрана, имитации клавиатуры и выполнения JavaScript для всестороннего анализа UI.","ar":"يسمح باختبارات بصرية آلية للخادم التطويني المحلي ومثيلات Storybook باستخدام بروتوكول Chrome DevTools. يقدم التحكم البرمجي للمتصفح من خلال الملاحة وتصوير الشاشة ومحاكاة لوحة المفاتيح وتنفيذ JavaScript لتحليل واجهة المستخدم الشامل."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating visual regression testing of development builds","Validating Storybook component rendering across versions","Debugging layout issues through programmatic browser interaction","Generating visual documentation for UI components"],"zh":["自动化开发构建的视觉回归测试","验证Storybook组件在不同版本中的渲染","通过程序化浏览器交互调试布局问题","生成UI组件的视觉文档"],"ja":["開発ビルドの視覚的回帰テストの自動化","バージョン間のStorybookコンポーネントのレンダリングを検証","プログラムによるブラウザーの相互作用を通じてレイアウトの問題をデバッグ","UIコンポーネントの視覚的ドキュメントの生成"],"ko":["개발 빌드의 시각적 회귀 테스트 자동화","버전 간의 Storybook 컴포넌트 렌더링 검증","프로그램에 의한 브라우저 상호작용을 통해 레이아웃 문제 디버깅","UI 컴포넌트의 시각적 문서 생성"],"es":["Automatización de pruebas de regresión visual de compilaciones de desarrollo","Validación de la representación de componentes de Storybook entre versiones","Depuración de problemas de diseño mediante interacción programática con el navegador","Generación de documentación visual para componentes de IU"],"fr":["Automatisation des tests de régression visuelle des builds de développement","Validation du rendu des composants Storybook entre les versions","Débogage des problèmes de mise en page via une interaction programmatique avec le navigateur","Génération d''une documentation visuelle pour les composants d''interface utilisateur"],"de":["Automatisierung visueller Regressionstests von Entwicklungs-Builds","Validierung des Storybook-Komponentenrendering über Versionen hinweg","Debugging von Layoutproblemen durch programmatische Browserinteraktion","Erstellung visueller Dokumentation für UI-Komponenten"],"pt":["Automatizar testes de regressão visual de compilações de desenvolvimento","Validar renderização de componentes do Storybook em várias versões","Depurar problemas de layout por meio de interação programática do navegador","Gerar documentação visual para componentes de UI"],"ru":["Автоматизировать визуальное тестирование сборок разработки","Проверять рендеринг компонентов Storybook в разных версиях","Отлаживать проблемы с макетом посредством программного взаимодействия с браузером","Генерировать визуальную документацию для компонентов UI"],"ar":["تأتمت اختبارات الانحدار البصري لعمليات بناء التطوير","التحقق من تحرير مكونات Storybook عبر الإصدارات","تصحيح أخطاء التخطيط من خلال التفاعل البرمجي للمتصفح","توليد توثيق بصرية لمكونات واجهة المستخدم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Chrome/Chromium browser installation","Limited to web-based UI previews only","Depends on local dev server availability"],"zh":["需要Chrome/Chromium浏览器安装","仅限于基于Web的UI预览","依赖于本地开发服务器的可用性"],"ja":["Chrome/Chromiumブラウザーのインストールが必要","WebベースのUIプレビューのみに限定","ローカル開発サーバーの可用性に依存"],"ko":["Chrome/Chromium 브라우저 설치가 필요","웹 기반 UI预览만 해당","로컬 개발 서버의 가용성에 의존"],"es":["Requiere la instalación del navegador Chrome/Chromium","Limitado únicamente a vistas previas de IU basadas en web","Depende de la disponibilidad del servidor de desarrollo local"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation du navigateur Chrome/Chromium","Limité aux prévisualisations d''interface utilisateur basées sur le web uniquement","Dépend de la disponibilité du serveur de développement local"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation des Chrome/Chromium-Browsers","Beschränkt sich ausschließlich auf webbasierte UI-Vorschauen","Hängt von der Verfügbarkeit des lokalen Entwicklungsservers ab"],"pt":["Requer instalação do navegador Chrome/Chromium","Limitado a visualizações de UI baseadas na web apenas","Depende da disponibilidade do servidor de desenvolvimento local"],"ru":["Требует установки браузера Chrome/Chromium","Ограничен только