:"zoonk-translations"},"description":{"zh":"zoonk-translations 项目提供了国际化解决方案，使用 next-intl 和 JSON 消息文件存储翻译内容","ja":"zoonk-translations プロジェクトは国際化ソリューションを提供し、next-intl と JSON メッセージファイルを使用して翻訳コンテンツを存储します","ko":"zoonk-translations 프로젝트는 국제화 솔루션을 제공하며 next-intl과 JSON 메시지 파일을 사용하여 번역 내용을 저장합니다","es":"Zoonk-translations es un proyecto que utiliza next-intl para la internacionalización, con traducciones almacenadas en archivos JSON.","fr":"Zoonk-translations est un projet qui utilise next-intl pour l''internationalisation, avec des traductions stockées dans des fichiers JSON.","de":"Zoonk-translations ist ein Projekt, das next-intl für die Internationalisierung verwendet, mit Übersetzungen in JSON-Dateien gespeichert.","pt":"O zoonk-translations é uma habilidade que permite a internacionalização de projetos com atividades passo a passo. Utiliza o next-intl para armazenar traduçõe...","ru":"Zoonk-переводы - это навык, который позволяет международные проекты с пошаговыми активностями. Использует next-intl для хранения переводов в файлах JSON","ar":"ترجمات زونك هو مهارة يسمح بالتعريب للمشاريع مع أنشطة خطوة بخطوة. يستخدم next-intl لتخزين الترجمات في ملفات JSON","en":"Learn anything with step-by-step activities"},"definition":{"en":"Learn anything with step-by-step activities"},"features":{"zh":["next-intl 支持","JSON 消息文件存储","服务器组件支持","客户端组件支持","元数据服务器操作支持"],"ja":["next-intl サポート","JSON メッセージファイル存储","サーバーコンポーネントサポート","クライアントコンポーネントサポート","メタデータサーバーアクションサポート"],"ko":["next-intl 지원","JSON 메시지 파일 저장","서버 컴포넌트 지원","클라이언트 컴포넌트 지원","메타데이터 서버 액션 지원"],"es":["Uso de next-intl para la internacionalización","Traducciones almacenadas en archivos JSON","Compatibilidad con componentes de servidor y cliente","Soporte para metadatos y acciones de servidor","Reglas críticas para la internacionalización"],"fr":["Utilisation de next-intl pour l''internationalisation","Traductions stockées dans des fichiers JSON","Compatibilité avec les composants serveur et client","Prise en charge des métadonnées et des actions de serveur","Règles critiques pour l''internationalisation"],"de":["Verwendung von next-intl für die Internationalisierung","Übersetzungen in JSON-Dateien gespeichert","Kompatibilität mit Server- und Client-Komponenten","Unterstützung für Metadaten und Server-Aktionen","Kritische Regeln für die Internationalisierung"],"pt":["Integração com next-intl","Armazenamento de traduções em arquivos JSON","Suporte a vários idiomas","Atividades passo a passo para aprendizado","Uso de getTranslations e useTranslations"],"ru":["Интеграция с next-intl","Хранение переводов в файлах JSON","Поддержка нескольких языков","Пошаговые активности для обучения","Использование getTranslations и useTranslations"],"ar":["التكامل مع next-intl","تخزين الترجمات في ملفات JSON","دعم لعدة لغات","أنشطة خطوة بخطوة للتعلم","استخدام getTranslations و useTranslations"]},"keywords":{"zh":["zoonk-translations","next-intl","国际化","JSON 消息文件","服务器组件","客户端组件","元数据服务器操作"],"ja":["zoonk-translations","next-intl","国際化","JSON メッセージファイル","サーバーコンポーネント","クライアントコンポーネント","メタデータサーバーアクション"],"ko":["zoonk-translations","next-intl","국제화","JSON 메시지 파일","서버 컴포넌트","클라이언트 컴포넌트","메타데이터 서버 액션"],"es":["zoonk translations","next-intl","internacionalización","traducciones","desarrollo web","i18n","internationalización de software","traducción de contenido"],"fr":["zoonk translations","next-intl","internationalisation","traductions","développement web","i18n","internationalisation de logiciels","traduction de contenu"],"de":["zoonk translations","next-intl","internationalisierung","übersetzungen","webentwicklung","i18n","internationalisierung von software","inhaltübersetzung"],"pt":["internacionalização","next-intl","traduções","projetos multilíngues","desenvolvimento web","i18n","json","getTranslations","useTranslations"],"ru":["международная разработка","next-intl","переводы","многоязычные проекты","веб-разработка","i18n","json","getTranslations","useTranslations"],"ar":["تعريب","next-intl","ترجمات","مشاريع متعددة اللغات","تطوير ويب","i18n","json","getTranslations","useTranslations"]}},"owner":"zoonk","repo":"zoonk","repoPath":"zoonk/zoonk","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.418Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"zoonk-translations","description":"Work with internationalization using next-intl. Use when handling translations, i18n, getTranslations, useTranslations, translating content, or when the user needs to add or modify translations.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Internationalization (i18n) Workflow\n\n## Overview\n\nThis project uses `next-intl` for internationalization. Translations are stored in JSON message files.\n\n## Key Functions\n\n- **Server Components**: Use `getTranslations` (no locale needed)\n- **Client Components**: Use `useTranslations`\n- **Metadata/Server Actions**: Use `getTranslations` with locale parameter\n\n## Critical Rules\n\n### 1. No Dynamic Values in Translation Keys\n\n**IMPORTANT**: The `t` function does NOT support dynamic values as keys","body":"# Internationalization (i18n) Workflow\n\n## Overview\n\nThis project uses `next-intl` for internationalization. Translations are stored in JSON message files.\n\n## Key Functions\n\n- **Server Components**: Use `getTranslations` (no locale needed)\n- **Client Components**: Use `useTranslations`\n- **Metadata/Server Actions**: Use `getTranslations` with locale parameter\n\n## Critical Rules\n\n### 1. No Dynamic Values in Translation Keys\n\n**IMPORTANT**: The `t` function does NOT support dynamic values as keys.\n\n```tsx\n// BAD: Dynamic key - will NOT work\nconst category = getCategory();\nt(category); // Error!\nt(MYLABELS[category]);\n\n// GOOD: String literals only\nt(\"Arts courses\");\nt(\"Business courses\");\nt(\"Technology courses\");\n```\n\n### 2. String Interpolation IS Supported\n\nYou CAN use string interpolation for dynamic values within translations:\n\n```tsx\n// GOOD: Interpolation with static key\nt(\"Explore all {category} courses\", { category: \"arts\" });\nt(\"Welcome, {name}!\", { name: user.name });\nt(\"{count} items remaining\", { count: 5 });\n```\n\n### 3. Don''t Pass `t` Function Around\n\nYou can''t pass the `t` function to other functions or components:\n\n```tsx\n// BAD: Passing t function\nfunction myFunction(t, label) {\n  return t(label);\n}\nmyFunction(t, \"Some label\");\n\n// GOOD: Call t directly\nfunction myFunction(translatedLabel: string) {\n  return translatedLabel;\n}\nmyFunction(t(\"Some label\"));\n```\n\n### 4. Locale Parameter Rules\n\n```tsx\n// Server Component - no locale needed\nconst t = await getTranslations();\nt(\"Hello\");\n\n// generateMetadata - needs locale\nexport async function generateMetadata({ params }) {\n  const { locale } = await params;\n  const t = await getTranslations({ locale });\n  return { title: t(\"Page Title\") };\n}\n```\n\n## Workflow for Adding Translations\n\n1. **Add translation call in code**:\n\n   ```tsx\n   const t = await getTranslations();\n   return <h1>{t(\"New page title\")}</h1>;\n   ```\n\n2. **Add the key to message files**:\n\n   Find JSON message files in your locales directory (e.g., `messages/en.json`, `messages/es.json`) and add the new key:\n\n   ```json\n   {\n     \"New page title\": \"New page title\"\n   }\n   ```\n\n3. **Translate for each locale**:\n\n   ```json\n   // messages/es.json\n   {\n     \"New page title\": \"Nuevo título de página\"\n   }\n   ```\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Conditional Text\n\n```tsx\n// Use separate translation keys\nconst status = isActive ? t(\"Active\") : t(\"Inactive\");\n```\n\n### Pluralization\n\n```tsx\n// Use ICU message format\nt(\"items\", { count: 5 }); // \"5 items\"\n```\n\nIn your messages file:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"items\": \"{count, plural, =0 {No items} =1 {1 item} other {# items}}\"\n}\n```\n\n### Rich Text (with components)\n\n```tsx\nt.rich(\"Read our {link}\", {\n  link: (chunks) => <Link href=\"/terms\">{chunks}</Link>,\n});\n```\n\nIn your messages file:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"Read our {link}\": \"Read our <link>terms of service</link>\"\n}\n```\n\n## File Structure\n\n```\nmessages/\n  en.json      # English translations\n  es.json      # Spanish translations\n  pt.json      # Portuguese translations\n```\n\n## Namespaces\n\nFor larger apps, organize translations by namespace:\n\n```tsx\n// Server Component\nconst t = await getTranslations(\"Dashboard\");\nt(\"welcome\"); // Looks up \"Dashboard.welcome\"\n\n// Client Component\nconst t = useTranslations(\"Dashboard\");\nt(\"welcome\");\n```\n\n```json\n{\n  \"Dashboard\": {\n    \"welcome\": \"Welcome to your dashboard\"\n  }\n}\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:18:11.027Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Multilingual AI Agents needing seamless internationalization (i18n) workflow integration with next-intl and JSON message files.","zh":"适合需要与 next-intl 和 JSON 消息文件实现无缝国际化（i18n）工作流集成的多语言 AI 代理。","ja":"next-intl と JSON メッセージファイルを使用したシームレスな国際化（i18n）ワークフロー統合が必要なマルチリンガル AI エージェントに適しています。","ko":"next-intl 및 JSON 메시지 파일을 사용하여 무결점의 국제화(i18n) 워크플로 통합이 필요한 다국어 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA Multilingües que necesitan una integración de flujo de trabajo de internacionalización (i18n) sin problemas con next-intl y archivos de mensajes JSON.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''IA Multilingues ayant besoin d''une intégration de workflow d''internationalisation (i18n) sans problème avec next-intl et des fichiers de messages JSON.","de":"Perfekt für mehrsprachige KI-Agents, die eine nahtlose Integration des Internationalisierungs-Workflows (i18n) mit next-intl und JSON-Nachrichtendateien benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA Multilíngues que necessitam de integração de fluxo de trabalho de internacionalização (i18n) sem problemas com next-intl e arquivos de mensagens JSON.","ru":"Идеально для многоязычных агентов ИИ, которым необходима бесперебойная интеграция рабочего процесса международной поддержки (i18n) с next-intl и файлами сообщений JSON.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المتعددة اللغات الذي يحتاج إلى دمج سير عمل دولي (i18n) دون عوائق مع next-intl وملفات رسائل JSON."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage translations efficiently using getTranslations for server components and useTranslations for client components, while adhering to critical rules like avoiding dynamic values in translation keys, thus ensuring compatibility with next-intl and JSON message files.","zh":"赋予代理管理翻译的效率，使用 getTranslations 来管理服务器组件的翻译，使用 useTranslations 来管理客户端组件的翻译，同时遵守关键规则，例如避免在翻译键中使用动态值，从而确保与 next-intl 和 JSON 消息文件的兼容性。","ja":"エージェントは、getTranslations を使用してサーバーコンポーネントの翻訳を管理し、useTranslations を使用してクライアントコンポーネントの翻訳を管理することで、翻訳を効率的に管理できます。また、動的値を翻訳キーに使用しないなどの重要なルールに従うことで、next-intl と JSON メッセージファイルとの互換性を確保します。","ko":"에이전트가 서버 컴포넌트의 번역을 관리하기 위해 getTranslations를 사용하고 클라이언트 컴포넌트의 번역을 관리하기 위해 useTranslations를 사용함으로써 번역을 효율적으로 관리할 수 있습니다. 또한,翻译 키에서 동적 값을 피하는 것과 같은 중요한 규칙을 준수하여 next-intl 및 JSON 메시지 파일과의 호환성을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar traducciones de manera eficiente utilizando getTranslations para componentes del servidor y useTranslations para componentes del cliente, mientras se adhieren a reglas críticas como evitar valores dinámicos en claves de traducción, lo que garantiza la compatibilidad con next-intl y archivos de mensajes JSON.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les traductions de manière efficace en utilisant getTranslations pour les composants serveur et useTranslations pour les composants client, tout en respectant les règles critiques comme éviter les valeurs dynamiques dans les clés de traduction, ce qui garantit la compatibilité avec next-intl et les fichiers de messages JSON.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, Übersetzungen effizient zu verwalten, indem sie getTranslations für Serverkomponenten und useTranslations für Clientkomponenten verwenden, während sie sich an kritische Regeln wie das Vermeiden dynamischer Werte in Überschlüssel halten, was die Kompatibilität mit next-intl und JSON-Nachrichtendateien gewährleistet.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar traduções de forma eficiente usando getTranslations para componentes do servidor e useTranslations para componentes do cliente, enquanto adere a regras críticas como evitar valores dinâmicos em chaves de tradução, garantindo assim a compatibilidade com next-intl e arquivos de mensagens JSON.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно управлять переводами, используя getTranslations для компонентов сервера и useTranslations для компонентов клиента, при этом соблюдая критически важные правила, такие как избегание динамических значений в ключах перевода, обеспечивая тем самым совместимость с next-intl и файлами сообщений JSON.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إدارة الترجمات بفعالية باستخدام getTranslations لمكونات الخادم واستخدام useTranslations لمكونات العميل، مع الالتزام بالقواعد الحرجة مثل تجنب القيم الديناميكية في مفاتيح الترجمة، مما يضمن بالتالي التوافق مع next-intl وملفات رسائل JSON."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing internationalization (i18n) in Next.js applications using next-intl","Managing translations across server and client components with getTranslations and useTranslations","Enforcing translation key standards to prevent errors with dynamic values"],"zh":["在 Next.js 应用程序中使用 next-intl 实现国际化（i18n）","使用 getTranslations 和 useTranslations 管理服务器和客户端组件的翻译","执行翻译键标准以防止动态值错误"],"ja":["next-intl を使用して Next.js アプリケーションで国際化（i18n）を実現する","getTranslations と useTranslations を使用してサーバーとクライアントコンポーネントの翻訳を管理する","動的値のエラーを防ぐために翻訳キーの規格を施行する"],"ko":["next-intl을 사용하여 Next.js 애플리케이션에서 국제화(i18n)를 구현하는 것","getTranslations와 useTranslations를 사용하여 서버 및 클라이언트 컴포넌트의 번역을 관리하는 것","동적 값 오류를 방지하기 위한 번역 키 표준 시행"],"es":["Implementar la internacionalización (i18n) en aplicaciones Next.js con next-intl","Gestionar traducciones en componentes del servidor y del cliente con getTranslations y useTranslations","Hacer cumplir los estándares de claves de traducción para prevenir errores con valores dinámicos"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre l''internationalisation (i18n) dans les applications Next.js avec next-intl","Gérer les traductions dans les composants serveur et client avec getTranslations et useTranslations","Faire respecter les normes de clés de traduction pour prévenir les erreurs avec des valeurs dynamiques"],"de":["Implementierung der Internationalisierung (i18n) in Next.js-Anwendungen mit next-intl","Verwaltung von Übersetzungen in Server- und Clientkomponenten mit getTranslations und useTranslations","Durchsetzung von Überschlüssel-Standards, um Fehler mit dynamischen Werten zu vermeiden"],"pt":["Implementação da internacionalização (i18n) em aplicações Next.js usando next-intl","Gerenciamento de traduções em componentes do servidor e do cliente com getTranslations e useTranslations","Aplicação de padrões de chave de tradução para prevenir erros com valores dinâmicos"],"ru":["Реализация международной поддержки (i18n) в приложениях Next.js с помощью next-intl","Управление переводами на серверных и клиентских компонентах с помощью getTranslations и useTranslations","Внедрение стандартов ключей перевода для предотвращения ошибок с динамическими значениями"],"ar":["تنفيذ الدعم الدولي (i18n) في تطبيقات Next.js باستخدام next-intl","إدارة الترجمات عبر مكونات الخادم والعميل باستخدام getTranslations و useTranslations","تطبيق معايير مفاتيح الترجمة لمنع الأخطاء بالقيم الديناميكية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires next-intl for internationalization","Translations must be stored in JSON message files","No dynamic values allowed in translation keys"],"zh":["需要 next-intl 来实现国际化","翻译必须存储在 JSON 消息文件中","翻译键中不允许使用动态值"],"ja":["国際化のために next-intl が必要","翻訳は JSON メッセージファイルに格納する必要がある","翻訳キーには動的値を使用できない"],"ko":["국제화를 위해 next-intl이 필요","번역은 JSON 메시지 파일에 저장되어야 함","번역 키에는 동적 값을 사용할 수 없음"],"es":["Requiere next-intl para la internacionalización","Las traducciones deben almacenarse en archivos de mensajes JSON","No se permiten valores dinámicos en claves de traducción"],"fr":["Nécessite next-intl pour l''internationalisation","Les traductions doivent être stockées dans des fichiers de messages JSON","Les valeurs dynamiques ne sont pas autorisées dans les clés de traduction"],"de":["Benötigt next-intl für die Internationalisierung","Übersetzungen müssen in JSON-Nachrichtendateien gespeichert werden","Dynamische Werte sind in Überschlüssel nicht erlaubt"],"pt":["Exige next-intl para internacionalização","As traduções devem ser armazenadas em arquivos de mensagens JSON","Não são permitidos valores dinâmicos em chaves de tradução"],"ru":["Требует next-intl для международной поддержки","Переводы должны храниться в файлах сообщений JSON","Динамические значения в ключах перевода не допускаются"],"ar":["يتطلب next-intl لدعم اللغة","يجب تخزين الترجمات في ملفات رسائل JSON","لا يسمح بالقيم الديناميكية في مفاتيح الترجمة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('zoonk/zoonk/zoonk-design', 'community', 'zoonk', 'zoonk', 'zoonk/zoonk', 'zoonk-design', 0, 0, 25, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.418Z', '2026-02-18T04:17:47.746Z', NULL, '{"id":"zoonk/zoonk/zoonk-design","name":"zoonk-design","description":{"zh":"zoonk 设计是一种简洁高效的设计风格，强调极简主义和直观的用户体验","ja":"zoonk デザインはシンプルで使いやすいデザインスタイルで、極少主義と直感的なユーザーエクスペリエンスを重視しています","ko":"zoonk 디자인은 심플하고 직관적인 디자인 스타일로, 최소主义과 직관적인 사용자 경험을 강조합니다","es":"zoonk-design te permite aprender y diseñar con actividades paso a paso, siguiendo pautas de diseño minimalista e intuitivo.","fr":"zoonk-design vous permet d''apprendre et de concevoir avec des activités étape par étape, en suivant des lignes directrices de conception minimalistes et intuitives.","de":"zoonk-design ermöglicht es Ihnen, zu lernen und zu designen, mit schrittweisen Aktivitäten, die minimalistische und intuitive Designrichtlinien befolgen.","pt":"O Zoonk Design é um guia de design que enfatiza a importância de uma experiência de usuário intuitiva e minimalista.","ru":"Zoonk Дизайн — это руководство по дизайну, которое подчеркивает важность интуитивного и минималистского пользовательского опыта.","ar":"ديزاين زونك هو دليل تصميم يؤكد على أهمية تجربة المستخدم المينيمалистية والسهلة الاستخدام.","en":"Learn anything with step-by-step activities"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"zoonk 设计：简洁高效的设计指南","ja":"zoonk デザイン：シンプルで使いやすいデザインガイド","ko":"zoonk 디자인: 심플하고 직관적인 디자인 가이드","es":"Diseño intuitivo con zoonk-design","fr":"Conception intuitive avec zoonk-design","de":"Intuitives Design mit zoonk-design","pt":"Zoonk Design: Diretrizes de Design Minimalista","ru":"Zoonk Дизайн: Руководство по Минималистскому Дизайну","ar":"ديزاين زونك: إرشادات تصميم مينيمалистي","en":"zoonk-design"},"description":{"zh":"zoonk 设计是一种简洁高效的设计风格，强调极简主义和直观的用户体验","ja":"zoonk デザインはシンプルで使いやすいデザインスタイルで、極少主義と直感的なユーザーエクスペリエンスを重視しています","ko":"zoonk 디자인은 심플하고 직관적인 디자인 스타일로, 최소主义과 직관적인 사용자 경험을 강조합니다","es":"zoonk-design te permite aprender y diseñar con actividades paso a paso, siguiendo pautas de diseño minimalista e intuitivo.","fr":"zoonk-design vous permet d''apprendre et de concevoir avec des activités étape par étape, en suivant des lignes directrices de conception minimalistes et intu...","de":"zoonk-design ermöglicht es Ihnen, zu lernen und zu designen, mit schrittweisen Aktivitäten, die minimalistische und intuitive Designrichtlinien befolgen.","pt":"O Zoonk Design é um guia de design que enfatiza a importância de uma experiência de usuário intuitiva e minimalista.","ru":"Zoonk Дизайн — это руководство по дизайну, которое подчеркивает важность интуитивного и минималистского пользовательского опыта.","ar":"ديزاين زونك هو دليل تصميم يؤكد على أهمية تجربة المستخدم المينيمалистية والسهلة الاستخدام.","en":"Learn anything with step-by-step activities"},"definition":{"en":"Learn anything with step-by-step activities"},"features":{"zh":["简洁高效的设计风格","极简主义的设计原则","直观的用户体验","高品质的设计细节","灵感来自知名品牌如 Vercel、Linear 和 Apple"],"ja":["シンプルで使いやすいデザインスタイル","極少主義の設計原則","直感的なユーザーエクスペリエンス","高品質の設計細節","Vercel、Linear、Apple などの著名ブランドからのインスピレーション"],"ko":["심플하고 직관적인 디자인 스타일","최소주의의 디자인 원칙","직관적인 사용자 경험","고품질의 디자인 세부 사항","Vercel, Linear, Apple 등의 유명 브랜드에서 영감을 얻음"],"es":["Diseño minimalista y intuitivo","Animaciones sutiles y tipografía de alta calidad","Espacio en blanco y colores neutros","Inspiración en marcas de diseño de alta calidad como Vercel, Linear y Apple","Enfoque en la calidad y los detalles","Diseño fácil de usar y navegar"],"fr":["Conception minimaliste et intuitive","Animations subtiles et typographie de haute qualité","Espace blanc et couleurs neutres","Inspirations de marques de conception de haute qualité comme Vercel, Linear et Apple","Focus sur la qualité et les détails","Conception facile à utiliser et naviguer"],"de":["Minimalistisches und intuitives Design","Feine Animationen und hochwertige Typografie","Leerraum und neutrale Farben","Inspiriert von Design-Marken wie Vercel, Linear und Apple","Fokus auf Qualität und Details","Benutzeroberfläche einfach zu bedienen und navigieren"],"pt":["Design minimalista e intuitivo","Animações sutis e tipografia de alta qualidade","Inspiração em marcas como Vercel, Linear e Apple","Enfoque na experiência de usuário","Design limpo e organizado"],"ru":["Минималистский и интуитивный дизайн","Нежные анимации и высококачественная типография","Вдохновение от брендов như Vercel, Linear и Apple","Акцент на пользовательском опыте","Чистый и организованный дизайн"],"ar":["تصميم مينيمалистي وسهل الاستخدام","حركات متحركة لطيفة وطباعة عالية الجودة","الإلهام من العلامات التجارية مثل Vercel و Linear و Apple","التركيز على تجربة المستخدم","تصميم نظيف ومنظم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["zoonk 设计","简洁设计","极简主义设计","直观设计","高品质设计","用户体验设计","设计风格","设计原则","设计细节"],"ja":["zoonk デザイン","シンプルデザイン","極少主義デザイン","直感デザイン","高品質デザイン","ユーザーエクスペリエンスデザイン","デザインスタイル","設計原則","設計細節"],"ko":["zoonk 디자인","심플 디자인","최소주의 디자인","직관 디자인","고품질 디자인","사용자 경험 디자인","디자인 스타일","디자인 원칙","디자인 세부 사항"],"es":["diseño minimalista","diseño intuitivo","interfaces de usuario","experiencias de usuario","design de alta calidad","vercel","linear","apple","tipografía","animaciones sutiles"],"fr":["conception minimaliste","conception intuitive","interfaces utilisateur","expériences utilisateur","conception de haute qualité","vercel","linear","apple","typographie","animations subtiles"],"de":["minimalistisches design","intuitives design","benutzeroberflächen","benutzererfahrungen","hochwertiges design","vercel","linear","apple","typografie","feine animationen"],"pt":["design minimalista","experiência de usuário","design intuitivo","animações sutis","tipografia de alta qualidade","Vercel","Linear","Apple"],"ru":["минималистский дизайн","пользовательский опыт","интуитивный дизайн","нежные анимации","высококачественная типография","Vercel","Linear","Apple"],"ar":["تصميم مينيمалистي","تجربة المستخدم","تصميم سهل الاستخدام","حركات متحركة لطيفة","طباعة عالية الجودة","Vercel","Linear","Apple"]}},"owner":"zoonk","repo":"zoonk","repoPath":"zoonk/zoonk","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.418Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"zoonk-design","description":"Design philosophy and UI/UX guidelines inspired by Apple, Linear, and Vercel. Use when planning new features, designing interfaces, reviewing implementations, or making visual and interaction design decisions.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Design Guidelines\n\nWhenever you''re designing something, follow this design style:\n\nSubtle animations, great typography, clean, minimalist, and intuitive design with lots of black/white and empty space. Make it clean, intuitive and super simple to use. Take inspiration from brands with great design like Vercel, Linear, and Apple. Ask yourself \"How would Apple, Linear, or Vercel design this?\"\n\nYou **deeply care about quality and details**, so every element should feel polished and well thought o","body":"# Design Guidelines\n\nWhenever you''re designing something, follow this design style:\n\nSubtle animations, great typography, clean, minimalist, and intuitive design with lots of black/white and empty space. Make it clean, intuitive and super simple to use. Take inspiration from brands with great design like Vercel, Linear, and Apple. Ask yourself \"How would Apple, Linear, or Vercel design this?\"\n\nYou **deeply care about quality and details**, so every element should feel polished and well thought out.\n\nSome design preferences:\n\n- Avoid cards/items with borders and heavy shadows. Prefer using empty space and subtle dividers instead\n- For buttons, prefer `outline` variant for most buttons and links. Use the default one only for active/selected states or for submit buttons. Use the `secondary` variant for buttons you want to emphasize a bit more\n- Prefer using existing components instead of creating new ones. If a component doesn''t exist, search the `shadcn` registry before creating a new one\n\n## Philosophy\n\n**\"Design is not just what it looks like. Design is how it works.\"**\n\nApproach every design challenge by asking: \"What is the simplest way to solve this problem?\" Great design removes everything that doesn''t serve the user''s goal. The best interface is often the one with the least interface.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n1. **Simplicity is the ultimate sophistication** — Remove everything that doesn''t serve the user''s goal. If something feels complex, find a simpler way.\n\n2. **Clarity over cleverness** — Users should never have to think about how to use your interface. The right action should be obvious.\n\n3. **Restraint is a feature** — Say no to most things. The courage to leave things out is what separates good design from great design.\n\n4. **Details matter obsessively** — The spacing, the timing of animations, the weight of a shadow—these micro-decisions compound into the feeling of quality.\n\n5. **Empty space is not empty** — White space is a powerful design element. It creates focus, hierarchy, and breathing room.\n\n## Design Language\n\n- **Color**: Primarily black and white with generous empty space. Color is used sparingly and purposefully.\n- **Borders & Shadows**: Avoid heavy borders and shadows on cards/items. Use subtle dividers and empty space instead.\n- **Buttons**: Use `outline` variant for most actions. Default/filled for primary actions or selected states. `secondary` for slightly emphasized actions.\n- **Typography**: Clean, readable, with clear hierarchy. Let typography do the heavy lifting.\n- **Animation**: Subtle and purposeful. Animations should feel natural and provide feedback, never distract.\n\n## Design Process\n\n### Phase 1: Planning (Before Implementation)\n\n1. **Understand the problem deeply** — What is the user trying to accomplish? What is their mental model? What are the edge cases?\n\n2. **Map the user journey** — What are the key moments? Where might users get confused? What''s the happy path?\n\n3. **Question everything** — Do we need this feature? Can we combine steps? What can we remove?\n\n4. **Think in flows, not screens** — Design the experience, not just the UI. Consider transitions, loading states, empty states, error states.\n\n5. **Propose the simplest solution** — Start minimal. You can always add, but it''s hard to remove.\n\nAsk yourself:\n\n- How would Apple design this?\n- How would Linear design this?\n- How would Vercel design this?\n- What would Steve Jobs ask to remove?\n\n### Phase 2: Review (After Implementation)\n\n1. **Check consistency** — Does it match the design language? Are spacing, colors, and typography consistent?\n\n2. **Evaluate simplicity** — Is there anything that can be removed? Any unnecessary visual noise?\n\n3. **Test the flow** — Does the interaction feel natural? Are loading and error states handled gracefully?\n\n4. **Assess accessibility** — Can all users access this? Is the contrast sufficient? Are interactive elements appropriately sized?\n\n5. **Feel the quality** — Does it feel polished? Would Apple ship this?\n\n## What to Avoid\n\n- Bloated interfaces with too many options\n- Design by committee—too many competing ideas\n- Decoration that doesn''t serve function\n- Complexity that could be simplified\n- Features without clear user value\n- Inconsistency with established patterns\n\n## Component Guidelines\n\n- Always prefer existing UI components before creating new ones\n- Check component libraries (like shadcn) before building from scratch\n- Use the compound components pattern for all UI components\n\n## Remember\n\nYour job is to be the guardian of quality and simplicity. Push for excellence. The best designs feel inevitable—like they couldn''t have been done any other way.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:17:47.746Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for UI/UX-focused agents seeking to create intuitive and minimalist designs with subtle animations and great typography.","zh":"适合专注于 UI/UX 的代理商，旨在创建直观和极简的设计，具有细腻的动画和优秀的排版。","ja":"UI/UX に焦点を当てたエージェントが、直感的でミニマリストのデザインを作成し、繊細なアニメーションと優れたタイポグラフィを実現するのに適しています。","ko":"UI/UX 에 중점을 둔 에이전트가 직관적이고 최소한의 디자인을 만들고 싶은 경우에 적합하며, 섬세한 애니메이션과 отлич한 타이포그래피를 제공합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes centrados en UI/UX que buscan crear diseños intuitivos y minimalistas con animaciones sutiles y una gran tipografía.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents axés sur l''UI/UX qui cherchent à créer des conceptions intuitives et minimalistes avec des animations subtiles et une grande typographie.","de":"Ideal für UI/UX-fokussierte Agenten, die intuitive und minimalistische Designs mit subtilen Animationen und großartiger Typografie erstellen möchten.","pt":"Ideal para agentes focados em UI/UX que buscam criar designs intuitivos e minimalistas com animações sutis e uma grande tipografia.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, ориентированных на UI/UX, стремящихся создавать интуитивные и минималистские дизайны с тонкими анимациями и отличной типографией.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يركزون على واجهة المستخدم وتجربة المستخدم ويسعون إلى创اء تصاميم直ه وسهله مع حركات متحركه خفيفه وطباعه رائعه."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft polished and well-thought-out designs inspired by brands like Vercel, Linear, and Apple, utilizing clean and intuitive design principles with a focus on black/white color schemes and empty space, while deeply caring about quality and details in every design element.","zh":"赋予代理商打造精致和经过深思熟虑的设计的能力，灵感来自 Vercel、Linear 和 Apple 等品牌，利用干净和直观的设计原则，注重黑白色调和空白空间，同时深深关注每个设计元素的质量和细节。","ja":"Vercel、Linear、Apple などのブランドからインスピレーションを得た、磨かれたデザインとよく考えられたデザインを作成するエージェントの能力を与え、クリーンで直感的なデザイン原則を使用し、黒と白の色_scheme と空白スペースに焦点を当て、デザイン要素の質と細部に深く気を配る。","ko":"에이전트가 Vercel, Linear, Apple 등의 브랜드에서 영감을 얻어 정교하고 잘 생각된 디자인을 만들 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 깨끗하고 직관적인 디자인 원칙을 사용하여 블랙과 화이트 색상과 빈 공간에 중점을 두고, 모든 디자인 요소의 품질과 세부 사항에 깊이 관심을 둡니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear diseños pulidos y bien pensados inspirados en marcas como Vercel, Linear y Apple, utilizando principios de diseño limpios e intuitivos con un enfoque en esquemas de color negro/blanco y espacio vacío, mientras se preocupa profundamente por la calidad y los detalles en cada elemento de diseño.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des conceptions polies et bien réfléchies inspirées par des marques comme Vercel, Linear et Apple, en utilisant des principes de conception propres et intuitifs avec un accent sur les schémas de couleur noir/blanc et l''espace vide, tout en se souciant profondément de la qualité et des détails dans chaque élément de conception.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, polierte und gut durchdachte Designs zu erstellen, die von Marken wie Vercel, Linear und Apple inspiriert sind, indem sie saubere und intuitive Designprinzipien mit einem Fokus auf Schwarz/Weiß-Farbschemata und leeren Raum verwenden, während sie sich tief um Qualität und Details in jedem Designelement kümmern.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar designs polidos e bem pensados, inspirados em marcas como Vercel, Linear e Apple, utilizando princípios de design limpos e intuitivos com foco em esquemas de cor preto/branco e espaço vazio, enquanto se preocupa profundamente com a qualidade e os detalhes em cada elemento de design.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать отполированные и хорошо продуманные дизайны, вдохновленные брендами như Vercel, Linear и Apple, используя чистые и интуитивные принципы дизайна с фокусом на черно-белых цветовых схемах и пустом пространстве, при этом глубоко заботясь о качестве и деталях каждого элемента дизайна.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من انشاء تصاميم متقنه وحسابه، مستوحاه من العلامات التجاريه مثل Vercel و Linear و Apple، باستخدام مبادئ تصميم نظيفه وسهله الفهم مع التركيز على مخططات الألوان الأسود والأبيض والفراغ، مع الاهتمام العميق بالجوده والتفاصيل في كل عنصر من عناصر التصميم."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing minimalist web applications with subtle animations","Creating intuitive mobile interfaces with great typography","Developing clean and simple dashboard designs inspired by top tech brands"],"zh":["为网页应用程序设计极简的网页应用程序，具有细腻的动画","创建直观的移动接口，具有优秀的排版","开发干净简单的仪表板设计，灵感来自顶级科技品牌"],"ja":["繊細なアニメーションを備えたミニマリストの Web アプリケーションを設計する","優れたタイポグラフィを備えた直感的なモバイル インターフェイスを作成する","トップテック ブランドからインスピレーションを得たクリーンでシンプルなダッシュボード デザインを開発する"],"ko":["섬세한 애니메이션을 갖춘 최소한의 웹 애플리케이션을 디자인하는 것","우수한 타이포그래피를 갖춘 직관적인 모바일 인터페이스를 생성하는 것","최상위 기술 브랜드에서 영감을 얻은 깨끗하고 단순한 대시보드 디자인을 개발하는 것"],"es":["Diseñar aplicaciones web minimalistas con animaciones sutiles","Crear interfaces móviles intuitivas con una gran tipografía","Desarrollar diseños de paneles de control limpios y simples inspirados en las mejores marcas de tecnología"],"fr":["Concevoir des applications web minimalistes avec des animations subtiles","Créer des interfaces mobiles intuitives avec une grande typographie","Développer des conceptions de tableaux de bord propres et simples inspirées par les meilleures marques de technologie"],"de":["Minimalistische Webanwendungen mit subtilen Animationen entwerfen","Intuitive mobile Schnittstellen mit großartiger Typografie erstellen","Sauber und einfache Dashboard-Designs entwickeln, die von den besten Technologiemarken inspiriert sind"],"pt":["Criar aplicações web minimalistas com animações sutis","Criar interfaces móveis intuitivas com uma grande tipografia","Desenvolver designs de painel de controle limpos e simples, inspirados em marcas de tecnologia de ponta"],"ru":["Создание минималистских веб-приложений с тонкими анимациями","Создание интуитивных мобильных интерфейсов с отличной типографией","Разработка чистых и простых дизайнов панелей управления, вдохновленных топовыми технологическими брендами"],"ar":["انشاء تطبيقات ويب متواضعه مع حركات متحركه خفيفه","انشاء واجهات محموله سهله الفهم مع طباعه رائعه","تطوير تصاميم لوحة تحكم نظيفه وسهله، مستوحاه من العلامات التجاريه الرائده في مجال التكنولوجيا"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires a deep understanding of design principles and attention to detail","Limited to designing with a minimalist and intuitive aesthetic"],"zh":["需要对设计原则有深刻的理解和对细节的关注","仅限于设计极简和直观的美学"],"ja":["デザイン原則に対する深い理解と詳細への注意が必要","ミニマリストで直感的な美学での設計のみ"],"ko":["디자인 원칙에 대한 깊은 이해와 세부 사항에 대한주의가 필요","최소한하고 직관적인 미학での 디자인만 가능"],"es":["Requiere un profundo conocimiento de los principios de diseño y atención al detalle","Limitado a diseñar con un estético minimalista e intuitivo"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance approfondie des principes de conception et une attention aux détails","Limité à la conception avec un esthétique minimaliste et intuitif"],"de":["Erfordert ein tiefes Verständnis der Designprinzipien und eine Aufmerksamkeit für Details","Begrenzt auf das Designen mit einem minimalistischen und intuitiven Ästhetik"],"pt":["Exige uma compreensão profunda dos princípios de design e atenção aos detalhes","Limitado a designs com uma estética minimalista e intuitiva"],"ru":["Требует глубокого понимания принципов дизайна и внимания к деталям","Ограничен дизайном с минималистской и интуитивной эстетикой"],"ar":["يتطلب فهمًا عميقًا لمبادئ التصميم والاهتمام بالتفاصيل","محدود بالتصاميم التي تتميز بالجمال الدقيق والبساطه"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":25}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('zoonk/zoonk/cache-components', 'community', 'zoonk', 'zoonk', 'zoonk/zoonk', 'cache-components', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.418Z', '2026-02-18T04:18:29.847Z', NULL, '{"id":"zoonk/zoonk/cache-components","name":"cache-components","description":{"zh":"Next.js 缓存组件可以自动激活，帮助开发者提高效率。通过检查 next.config 文件，应用缓存组件模式","ja":"Next.js キャッシュコンポーネントは自動的にアクティベートされ、開発者の効率を向上させます。next.config ファイルを確認して、キャッシュコンポーネントのパターンを適用する","ko":"Next.js 캐시 컴포넌트는 자동으로 활성화되어 개발자의 효율성을 높여줍니다. next.config 파일을 확인하여 캐시 컴포넌트 패턴을 적용하세요","pt":"O cache components é uma funcionalidade do Next.js que permite armazenar em cache componentes para melhorar o desempenho","ru":"Кэш-компоненты - это функция Next.js, которая позволяет кэшировать компоненты для улучшения производительности","ar":"مكونات الذاكرة المؤقتة هي ميزة في Next.js التي تسمح بتخزين مكونات في الذاكرة المؤقتة لتحسين الأداء","en":"Learn anything with step-by-step activities"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Next.js 缓存组件自动激活","ja":"Next.js キャッシュコンポーネントの自動アクティベーション","ko":"Next.js 캐시 컴포넌트 자동 활성화","pt":"Cache Components: Otimização de Next.js","ru":"Кэш-компоненты: оптимизация Next.js","ar":"مكونات الذاكرة المؤقتة: تحسين Next.js","en":"cache-components"},"description":{"zh":"Next.js 缓存组件可以自动激活，帮助开发者提高效率。通过检查 next.config 文件，应用缓存组件模式","ja":"Next.js キャッシュコンポーネントは自動的にアクティベートされ、開発者の効率を向上させます。next.config ファイルを確認して、キャッシュコンポーネントのパターンを適用する","ko":"Next.js 캐시 컴포넌트는 자동으로 활성화되어 개발자의 효율성을 높여줍니다. next.config 파일을 확인하여 캐시 컴포넌트 패턴을 적용하세요","pt":"O cache components é uma funcionalidade do Next.js que permite armazenar em cache componentes para melhorar o desempenho","ru":"Кэш-компоненты - это функция Next.js, которая позволяет кэшировать компоненты для улучшения производительности","ar":"مكونات الذاكرة المؤقتة هي ميزة في Next.js التي تسمح بتخزين مكونات في الذاكرة المؤقتة لتحسين الأداء","en":"Learn anything with step-by-step activities"},"definition":{"en":"Learn anything with step-by-step activities"},"features":{"zh":["自动激活缓存组件","检查 next.config 文件","应用缓存组件模式","提高开发效率","支持 React Server Components"],"ja":["キャッシュコンポーネントの自動アクティベーション","next.config ファイルの確認","キャッシュコンポーネントのパターンの適用","開発効率の向上","React Server Components のサポート"],"ko":["캐시 컴포넌트 자동 활성화","next.config 파일 확인","캐시 컴포넌트 패턴 적용","개발 효율성 향상","React Server Components 지원"],"pt":["Otimização de desempenho","Armazenamento em cache de componentes","Integração com Next.js","Melhoria da escalabilidade","Redução do tempo de carregamento"],"ru":["Оптимизация производительности","Кэширование компонентов","Интеграция с Next.js","Улучшение масштабируемости","Сокращение времени загрузки"],"ar":["تحسين الأداء","تخزين مكونات في الذاكرة المؤقتة","التكامل مع Next.js","تحسين التماسك","تقليل وقت التحميل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Next.js","缓存组件","自动激活","next.config","React Server Components","开发效率","缓存机制"],"ja":["Next.js","キャッシュコンポーネント","自動アクティベーション","next.config","React Server Components","開発効率","キャッシュ機構"],"ko":["Next.js","캐시 컴포넌트","자동 활성화","next.config","React Server Components","개발 효율성","캐시 메커니즘"],"pt":["cache components","next.js","otimização de desempenho","armazenamento em cache","escalabilidade","tempo de carregamento"],"ru":["кэш-компоненты","next.js","оптимизация производительности","кэширование","масштабируемость","время загрузки"],"ar":["مكونات الذاكرة المؤقتة","next.js","تحسين الأداء","تخزين في الذاكرة المؤقتة","التماسك","وقت التحميل"]}},"owner":"zoonk","repo":"zoonk","repoPath":"zoonk/zoonk","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.418Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cache-components","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Next.js Cache Components\n\n> **Auto-activation**: This skill activates automatically in projects with `cacheComponents: true` in next.config.\n\n## Project Detection\n\nWhen starting work in a Next.js project, check if Cache Components are enabled:\n\n```bash\n# Check next.config.ts or next.config.js for cacheComponents\ngrep -r \"cacheComponents\" next.config.* 2>/dev/null\n```\n\nIf `cacheComponents: true` is found, apply this skill''s patterns proactively when:\n\n- Writing React Server Components\n- Impleme","body":"# Next.js Cache Components\n\n> **Auto-activation**: This skill activates automatically in projects with `cacheComponents: true` in next.config.\n\n## Project Detection\n\nWhen starting work in a Next.js project, check if Cache Components are enabled:\n\n```bash\n# Check next.config.ts or next.config.js for cacheComponents\ngrep -r \"cacheComponents\" next.config.* 2>/dev/null\n```\n\nIf `cacheComponents: true` is found, apply this skill''s patterns proactively when:\n\n- Writing React Server Components\n- Implementing data fetching\n- Creating Server Actions with mutations\n- Optimizing page performance\n- Reviewing existing component code\n\nCache Components enable **Partial Prerendering (PPR)** - mixing static HTML shells with dynamic streaming content for optimal performance.\n\n## Philosophy: Code Over Configuration\n\nCache Components represents a shift from **segment configuration** to **compositional code**:\n\n| Before (Deprecated)                     | After (Cache Components)                  |\n| --------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| `export const revalidate = 3600`        | `cacheLife(''hours'')` inside `''use cache''` |\n| `export const dynamic = ''force-static''` | Use `''use cache''` and Suspense boundaries |\n| All-or-nothing static/dynamic           | Granular: static shell + cached + dynamic |\n\n**Key Principle**: Components co-locate their caching, not just their data. Next.js provides build-time feedback to guide you toward optimal patterns.\n\n## Core Concept\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                   Static Shell                       │\n│  (Sent immediately to browser)                       │\n│                                                      │\n│  ┌─────────────┐  ┌─────────────┐  ┌─────────────┐  │\n│  │   Header    │  │  Cached     │  │  Suspense   │  │\n│  │  (static)   │  │  Content    │  │  Fallback   │  │\n│  └─────────────┘  └─────────────┘  └──────┬──────┘  │\n│                                           │         │\n│                                    ┌──────▼──────┐  │\n│                                    │  Dynamic    │  │\n│                                    │  (streams)  │  │\n│                                    └─────────────┘  │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n## Mental Model: The Caching Decision Tree\n\nWhen writing a React Server Component, ask these questions in order:\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ Does this component fetch data or perform I/O?          │\n└─────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────┘\n                      │\n           ┌──────────▼──────────┐\n           │   YES               │ NO → Pure component, no action needed\n           └──────────┬──────────┘\n                      │\n    ┌─────────────────▼─────────────────┐\n    │ Does it depend on request context? │\n    │ (cookies, headers, searchParams)   │\n    └─────────────────┬─────────────────┘\n                      │\n         ┌────────────┴────────────┐\n         │                         │\n    ┌────▼────┐              ┌─────▼─────┐\n    │   YES   │              │    NO     │\n    └────┬────┘              └─────┬─────┘\n         │                         │\n         │                   ┌─────▼─────────────────┐\n         │                   │ Can this be cached?   │\n         │                   │ (same for all users?) │\n         │                   └─────┬─────────────────┘\n         │                         │\n         │              ┌──────────┴──────────┐\n         │              │                     │\n         │         ┌────▼────┐          ┌─────▼─────┐\n         │         │   YES   │          │    NO     │\n         │         └────┬────┘          └─────┬─────┘\n         │              │                     │\n         │              ▼                     │\n         │         ''use cache''                │\n         │         + cacheTag()               │\n         │                                    │\n         └──────────────┬─────────────────────┘\n                        │\n                        ▼\n              Wrap in <Suspense>\n              (dynamic streaming)\n```\n\n**Key insight**: The `''use cache''` directive is for data that''s the _same across users_. User-specific data stays dynamic with Suspense.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Enable Cache Components\n\n```typescript\n// next.config.ts\nimport type { NextConfig } from \"next\";\n\nconst nextConfig: NextConfig = {\n  cacheComponents: true,\n};\n\nexport default nextConfig;\n```\n\n### Basic Usage\n\n```tsx\n// Cached component - output included in static shell\nasync function CachedPosts() {\n  \"use cache\";\n  const posts = await db.posts.findMany();\n  return <PostList posts={posts} />;\n}\n\n// Page with static + cached + dynamic content\nexport default async function BlogPage() {\n  return (\n    <>\n      <Header /> {/* Static */}\n      <CachedPosts /> {/* Cached */}\n      <Suspense fallback={<Skeleton />}>\n        <DynamicComments /> {/* Dynamic - streams */}\n      </Suspense>\n    </>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Core APIs\n\n### 1. `''use cache''` Directive\n\nMarks code as cacheable. Can be applied at three levels:\n\n```tsx\n// File-level: All exports are cached\n\"use cache\";\nexport async function getData() {\n  /* ... */\n}\nexport async function Component() {\n  /* ... */\n}\n\n// Component-level\nasync function UserCard({ id }: { id: string }) {\n  \"use cache\";\n  const user = await fetchUser(id);\n  return <Card>{user.name}</Card>;\n}\n\n// Function-level\nasync function fetchWithCache(url: string) {\n  \"use cache\";\n  return fetch(url).then((r) => r.json());\n}\n```\n\n**Important**: All cached functions must be `async`.\n\n### 2. `cacheLife()` - Control Cache Duration\n\n```tsx\nimport { cacheLife } from \"next/cache\";\n\nasync function Posts() {\n  \"use cache\";\n  cacheLife(\"hours\"); // Use a predefined profile\n\n  // Or custom configuration:\n  cacheLife({\n    stale: 60, // 1 min - client cache validity\n    revalidate: 3600, // 1 hr - start background refresh\n    expire: 86400, // 1 day - absolute expiration\n  });\n\n  return await db.posts.findMany();\n}\n```\n\n**Predefined profiles**: `''default''`, `''seconds''`, `''minutes''`, `''hours''`, `''days''`, `''weeks''`, `''max''`\n\n### 3. `cacheTag()` - Tag for Invalidation\n\n```tsx\nimport { cacheTag } from \"next/cache\";\n\nasync function BlogPosts() {\n  \"use cache\";\n  cacheTag(\"posts\");\n  cacheLife(\"days\");\n\n  return await db.posts.findMany();\n}\n\nasync function UserProfile({ userId }: { userId: string }) {\n  \"use cache\";\n  cacheTag(\"users\", `user-${userId}`); // Multiple tags\n\n  return await db.users.findUnique({ where: { id: userId } });\n}\n```\n\n### 4. `updateTag()` - Immediate Invalidation\n\nFor **read-your-own-writes** semantics:\n\n```tsx\n\"use server\";\nimport { updateTag } from \"next/cache\";\n\nexport async function createPost(formData: FormData) {\n  await db.posts.create({ data: formData });\n\n  updateTag(\"posts\"); // Client immediately sees fresh data\n}\n```\n\n### 5. `revalidateTag()` - Background Revalidation\n\nFor stale-while-revalidate pattern:\n\n```tsx\n\"use server\";\nimport { revalidateTag } from \"next/cache\";\n\nexport async function updatePost(id: string, data: FormData) {\n  await db.posts.update({ where: { id }, data });\n\n  revalidateTag(\"posts\", \"max\"); // Serve stale, refresh in background\n}\n```\n\n## When to Use Each Pattern\n\n| Content Type | API                 | Behavior                              |\n| ------------ | ------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| **Static**   | No directive        | Rendered at build time                |\n| **Cached**   | `''use cache''`       | Included in static shell, revalidates |\n| **Dynamic**  | Inside `<Suspense>` | Streams at request time               |\n\n## Parameter Permutations & Subshells\n\n**Critical Concept**: With Cache Components, Next.js renders ALL permutations of provided parameters to create reusable subshells.\n\n```tsx\n// app/products/[category]/[slug]/page.tsx\nexport async function generateStaticParams() {\n  return [\n    { category: \"jackets\", slug: \"classic-bomber\" },\n    { category: \"jackets\", slug: \"essential-windbreaker\" },\n    { category: \"accessories\", slug: \"thermal-fleece-gloves\" },\n  ];\n}\n```\n\nNext.js renders these routes:\n\n```\n/products/jackets/classic-bomber        ← Full params (complete page)\n/products/jackets/essential-windbreaker ← Full params (complete page)\n/products/accessories/thermal-fleece-gloves ← Full params (complete page)\n/products/jackets/[slug]                ← Partial params (category subshell)\n/products/accessories/[slug]            ← Partial params (category subshell)\n/products/[category]/[slug]             ← No params (fallback shell)\n```\n\n**Why this matters**: The category subshell (`/products/jackets/[slug]`) can be reused for ANY jacket product, even ones not in `generateStaticParams`. Users navigating to an unlisted jacket get the cached category shell immediately, with product details streaming in.\n\n### `generateStaticParams` Requirements\n\nWith Cache Components enabled:\n\n1. **Must provide at least one parameter** - Empty arrays now cause build errors (prevents silent production failures)\n2. **Params prove static safety** - Providing params lets Next.js verify no dynamic APIs are called\n3. **Partial params create subshells** - Each unique permutation generates a reusable shell\n\n```tsx\n// ❌ ERROR with Cache Components\nexport function generateStaticParams() {\n  return []; // Build error: must provide at least one param\n}\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: Provide real params\nexport async function generateStaticParams() {\n  const products = await getPopularProducts();\n  return products.map(({ category, slug }) => ({ category, slug }));\n}\n```\n\n## Cache Key = Arguments\n\nArguments become part of the cache key:\n\n```tsx\n// Different userId = different cache entry\nasync function UserData({ userId }: { userId: string }) {\n  \"use cache\";\n  cacheTag(`user-${userId}`);\n\n  return await fetchUser(userId);\n}\n```\n\n## Build-Time Feedback\n\nCache Components provides early feedback during development. These build errors **guide you toward optimal patterns**:\n\n### Error: Dynamic data outside Suspense\n\n```\nError: Accessing cookies/headers/searchParams outside a Suspense boundary\n```\n\n**Solution**: Wrap dynamic components in `<Suspense>`:\n\n```tsx\n<Suspense fallback={<Skeleton />}>\n  <ComponentThatUsesCookies />\n</Suspense>\n```\n\n### Error: Uncached data outside Suspense\n\n```\nError: Accessing uncached data outside Suspense\n```\n\n**Solution**: Either cache the data or wrap in Suspense:\n\n```tsx\n// Option 1: Cache it\nasync function ProductData({ id }: { id: string }) {\n  \"use cache\";\n  return await db.products.findUnique({ where: { id } });\n}\n\n// Option 2: Make it dynamic with Suspense\n<Suspense fallback={<Loading />}>\n  <DynamicProductData id={id} />\n</Suspense>;\n```\n\n### Error: Request data inside cache\n\n```\nError: Cannot access cookies/headers inside ''use cache''\n```\n\n**Solution**: Extract runtime data outside cache boundary (see \"Handling Runtime Data\" above).\n\n## Additional Resources\n\n- For complete API reference, see [REFERENCE.md](REFERENCE.md)\n- For common patterns and recipes, see [PATTERNS.md](PATTERNS.md)\n- For debugging and troubleshooting, see [TROUBLESHOOTING.md](TROUBLESHOOTING.md)\n\n## Code Generation Guidelines\n\nWhen generating Cache Component code:\n\n1. **Always use `async`** - All cached functions must be async\n2. **Place `''use cache''` first** - Must be first statement in function body\n3. **Call `cacheLife()` early** - Should follow `''use cache''` directive\n4. **Tag meaningfully** - Use semantic tags that match your invalidation needs\n5. **Extract runtime data** - Move `cookies()`/`headers()` outside cached scope\n6. **Wrap dynamic content** - Use `<Suspense>` for non-cached async components\n\n---\n\n## Proactive Application (When Cache Components Enabled)\n\nWhen `cacheComponents: true` is detected in the project, **automatically apply these patterns**:\n\n### When Writing Data Fetching Components\n\nAsk yourself: \"Can this data be cached?\" If yes, add `''use cache''`:\n\n```tsx\n// Before: Uncached fetch\nasync function ProductList() {\n  const products = await db.products.findMany();\n  return <Grid products={products} />;\n}\n\n// After: With caching\nasync function ProductList() {\n  \"use cache\";\n  cacheTag(\"products\");\n  cacheLife(\"hours\");\n\n  const products = await db.products.findMany();\n  return <Grid products={products} />;\n}\n```\n\n### When Writing Server Actions\n\nAlways invalidate relevant caches after mutations:\n\n```tsx\n\"use server\";\nimport { updateTag } from \"next/cache\";\n\nexport async function createProduct(data: FormData) {\n  await db.products.create({ data });\n  updateTag(\"products\"); // Don''t forget!\n}\n```\n\n### When Composing Pages\n\nStructure with static shell + cached content + dynamic streaming:\n\n```tsx\nexport default async function Page() {\n  return (\n    <>\n      <StaticHeader /> {/* No cache needed */}\n      <CachedContent /> {/* ''use cache'' */}\n      <Suspense fallback={<Skeleton />}>\n        <DynamicUserContent /> {/* Streams at runtime */}\n      </Suspense>\n    </>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### When Reviewing Code\n\nFlag these issues in Cache Components projects:\n\n- [ ] Data fetching without `''use cache''` where caching would benefit\n- [ ] Missing `cacheTag()` calls (makes invalidation impossible)\n- [ ] Server Actions without `updateTag()`/`revalidateTag()` after mutations\n- [ ] `cookies()`/`headers()` called inside `''use cache''` scope\n- [ ] Dynamic components without `<Suspense>` boundaries\n- [ ] **DEPRECATED**: `export const revalidate` - replace with `cacheLife()` in `''use cache''`\n- [ ] **DEPRECATED**: `export const dynamic` - replace with Suspense + cache boundaries\n- [ ] Empty `generateStaticParams()` return - must provide at least one param\n\n### Note\n\nThis project use a default `cacheLife` set to the `max` profile, so you don''t need to call `cacheLife()` in most cases unless you need to customize the cache lifetime.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:18:29.847Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for Next.js Development Agents optimizing React Server Component performance.","zh":"适用于 Next.js 开发代理，优化 React 服务器组件性能。","ja":"Next.js 開発エージェントの React サーバーコンポーネントのパフォーマンスを最適化するために不可欠です。","ko":"Next.js 개발 에이전트용으로 React 서버 컴포넌트 성능을 최적화하는 데 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para agentes de desarrollo de Next.js que optimizan el rendimiento de los componentes del servidor de React.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents de développement Next.js qui optimisent les performances des composants serveur React.","de":"Wesentlich für Next.js-Entwicklungsagenten, die die Leistung von React-Server-Komponenten optimieren.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de Desenvolvimento do Next.js que otimizam o desempenho dos Componentes de Servidor do React.","ru":"Необходимо для агентов разработки Next.js, оптимизирующих производительность компонентов сервера React.","ar":"ضروري للوكلاء تطوير Next.js الذي يتحسين أداء مكونات الخادم React."},"recommendation":{"en":"Proactively enables cacheComponents patterns when detected in next.config, allowing agents to implement optimized data fetching strategies and reduce redundant API calls in React Server Components.","zh":"在检测到 next.config 中的 cacheComponents 模式时，主动启用缓存组件模式，允许代理实现优化的数据获取策略，并在 React 服务器组件中减少冗余的 API 调用。","ja":"next.config で cacheComponents パターンを検出したときに、キャッシュコンポーネントパターンをプロアクティブに有効にし、エージェントが最適化されたデータ取得戦略を実装し、React サーバーコンポーネントで冗長な API コールを削減できるようにします。","ko":"next.config에서 캐시 컴포넌트 패턴을 감지할 때 캐시 컴포넌트 패턴을 프로액티브로 활성화하여 에이전트가 최적화된 데이터 가져오기 전략을 구현하고 리액트 서버 컴포넌트에서冗余 API 호출을 줄일 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita proactivamente los patrones cacheComponents cuando se detectan en next.config, lo que permite a los agentes implementar estrategias de obtención de datos optimizadas y reducir las llamadas API redundantes en los componentes del servidor de React.","fr":"Active proactivement les modèles cacheComponents lorsqu''ils sont détectés dans next.config, ce qui permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des stratégies de récupération de données optimisées et de réduire les appels API redondants dans les composants serveur React.","de":"Aktiviert proaktiv Muster von cacheComponents, wenn diese in next.config erkannt werden, sodass Agenten optimierte Datenabrufstrategien implementieren und redundante API-Aufrufe in React-Server-Komponenten reduzieren können.","pt":"Habilita proativamente os padrões cacheComponents quando detectados no next.config, permitindo que os agentes implementem estratégias de recuperação de dados otimizadas e reduzam chamadas de API redundantes nos Componentes de Servidor do React.","ru":"Продвинутым образом включает шаблоны cacheComponents при их обнаружении в next.config, что позволяет агентам реализовывать оптимизированные стратегии извлечения данных и сокращать избыточные вызовы API в компонентах сервера React.","ar":"يتم تفعيله بشكل استباقي الأنماط cacheComponents عند اكتشافه في next.config، مما يسمح للوكلاء بتنفيذ استراتيجيات استرجاع البيانات المثلى وتقليل المكالمات الزائدة ل API في مكونات الخادم React."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing cache() wrapper patterns for data fetching","Optimizing React Server Component re-render performance","Configuring cache revalidation strategies in Next.js applications"],"zh":["为数据获取实现 cache() 包装器模式","优化 React 服务器组件重新渲染性能","在 Next.js 应用程序中配置缓存重新验证策略"],"ja":["データ取得のための cache() ラッパーパターンの実装","React サーバーコンポーネントの再描画パフォーマンスの最適化","Next.js アプリケーションでのキャッシュ再検証戦略の構成"],"ko":["데이터 가져오기용 캐시() 래퍼 패턴 구현","리액트 서버 컴포넌트의 재描画 성능 최적화","Next.js 애플리케이션에서 캐시 재검증 전략 구성"],"es":["Implementar patrones de envoltura cache() para la obtención de datos","Optimizar el rendimiento de re-renderizado de los componentes del servidor de React","Configurar estrategias de revalidación de caché en aplicaciones de Next.js"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des modèles d''enveloppe cache() pour la récupération de données","Optimiser les performances de re-rendering des composants serveur React","Configurer des stratégies de révalidation de cache dans les applications Next.js"],"de":["Implementierung von cache()-Wrapper-Mustern für den Datenabruf","Optimierung der Neuerzeugungsleistung von React-Server-Komponenten","Konfigurieren von Cache-Neuvalidierungsstrategien in Next.js-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Implementação de padrões de wrapper cache() para recuperação de dados","Otimização do desempenho de re-renderização dos Componentes de Servidor do React","Configuração de estratégias de revalidação de cache em aplicações Next.js"],"ru":["Реализация шаблонов обертки cache() для извлечения данных","Оптимизация производительности повторной отрисовки компонентов сервера React","Настройка стратегий повторной проверки кэша в приложениях Next.js"],"ar":["تنفيذ أنماط غلاف cache() لاسترجاع البيانات","تحسين أداء إعادة تحويل مكونات الخادم React","تكوين استراتيجيات إعادة التحقق من صحة ذاكرة التخزين المؤقت في تطبيقات Next.js"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires cacheComponents: true in next.config","Next.js projects only","Auto-activates only when configuration detected"],"zh":["需要在 next.config 中设置 cacheComponents: true","仅限 Next.js 项目","仅在检测到配置时自动激活"],"ja":["next.config で cacheComponents: true を設定する必要がある","Next.js プロジェクトのみ","構成が検出されたときにのみ自動で有効になる"],"ko":["next.config에서 캐시 컴포넌트: true로 설정해야 함","Next.js 프로젝트만 해당","구성이 감지될 때만 자동으로 활성화됨"],"es":["Requiere cacheComponents: true en next.config","Solo proyectos de Next.js","Se activa automáticamente solo cuando se detecta la configuración"],"fr":["Nécessite cacheComponents : true dans next.config","Uniquement les projets Next.js","S''active automatiquement uniquement lorsque la configuration est détectée"],"de":["Benötigt cacheComponents: true in next.config","Nur Next.js-Projekte","Aktiviert sich automatisch nur, wenn die Konfiguration erkannt wird"],"pt":["Exige cacheComponents: true no next.config","Apenas projetos Next.js","Ativa automaticamente apenas quando a configuração é detectada"],"ru":["Требует cacheComponents: true в next.config","Только проекты Next.js","Автоматически активируется только при обнаружении конфигурации"],"ar":["يتطلب cacheComponents: true في next.config","مشاريع Next.js فقط","تفعيل التنشيط تلقائيًا فقط عند اكتشاف التكوين"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('husamql3/pstrack/drizzle', 'community', 'husamql3', 'pstrack', 'husamql3/pstrack', 'drizzle', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.418Z', '2026-02-18T04:18:35.296Z', NULL, '{"id":"husamql3/pstrack/drizzle","name":"drizzle","description":{"zh":"Drizzle ORM 是一个帮助您解决、跟踪和增长的平台，提供了配置、命名约定和列定义的指导","ja":"Drizzle ORM は、設定、命名規則、カラム定義を提供するプラットフォームです","ko":"Drizzle ORM은 설정, 명명 규칙 및 열 정의를 제공하는 플랫폼입니다","es":"Drizzle es una plataforma que ayuda a solucionar, rastrear y crecer. Nuestra guía de estilo de esquema ORM te ayudará a configurar y utilizar Drizzle de manera efectiva.","fr":"Drizzle est une plateforme qui aide à résoudre, à suivre et à grandir. Notre guide de style de schéma ORM vous aidera à configurer et à utiliser Drizzle de manière efficace.","de":"Drizzle ist eine Plattform, die hilft, Probleme zu lösen, zu verfolgen und zu wachsen. Unser Schemastilführer für ORM hilft Ihnen, Drizzle effektiv zu konfigurieren und zu verwenden.","pt":"O Drizzle ORM é uma plataforma que ajuda a resolver, rastrear e crescer. Este guia de estilo fornece diretrizes para configurar e otimizar seu schema.","ru":"Drizzle ORM — это платформа, которая помогает решать, отслеживать и расти. Это руководство по стилю предоставляет рекомендации по настройке и оптимизации вашей схемы.","ar":"دريزل ORM هو منصة تساعد على حل وتعقب ونمو. هذا الدليل يوفر إرشادات لتكوين وتحسين مخطط قاعدة البيانات الخاص بك.","en":"Platform that helps you solve, track, and grow. 🚀"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Drizzle ORM 架构风格指南","ja":"Drizzle ORM スキーマスタイルガイド","ko":"Drizzle ORM 스키마 스타일 가이드","es":"Guía de estilo de esquema Drizzle ORM","fr":"Guide de style de schéma Drizzle ORM","de":"Drizzle ORM-Schemastilführer","pt":"Guia de Estilo de Schema Drizzle ORM","ru":"Руководство по стилю схемы Drizzle ORM","ar":"دليل نمط مخطط قاعدة البيانات دريزل","en":"drizzle"},"description":{"zh":"Drizzle ORM 是一个帮助您解决、跟踪和增长的平台，提供了配置、命名约定和列定义的指导","ja":"Drizzle ORM は、設定、命名規則、カラム定義を提供するプラットフォームです","ko":"Drizzle ORM은 설정, 명명 규칙 및 열 정의를 제공하는 플랫폼입니다","es":"Drizzle es una plataforma que ayuda a solucionar, rastrear y crecer. Nuestra guía de estilo de esquema ORM te ayudará a configurar y utilizar Drizzle de mane...","fr":"Drizzle est une plateforme qui aide à résoudre, à suivre et à grandir. Notre guide de style de schéma ORM vous aidera à configurer et à utiliser Drizzle de m...","de":"Drizzle ist eine Plattform, die hilft, Probleme zu lösen, zu verfolgen und zu wachsen. Unser Schemastilführer für ORM hilft Ihnen, Drizzle effektiv zu konfig...","pt":"O Drizzle ORM é uma plataforma que ajuda a resolver, rastrear e crescer. Este guia de estilo fornece diretrizes para configurar e otimizar seu schema.","ru":"Drizzle ORM — это платформа, которая помогает решать, отслеживать и расти. Это руководство по стилю предоставляет рекомендации по настройке и оптимизации ваш...","ar":"دريزل ORM هو منصة تساعد على حل وتعقب ونمو. هذا الدليل يوفر إرشادات لتكوين وتحسين مخطط قاعدة البيانات الخاص بك.","en":"Platform that helps you solve, track, and grow. 🚀"},"definition":{"en":"Platform that helps you solve, track, and grow. 🚀"},"features":{"zh":["配置文件支持","命名约定指导","列定义支持","主键支持","默认值支持"],"ja":["設定ファイルのサポート","命名規則のガイド","カラム定義のサポート","プライマリキーのサポート","デフォルト値のサポート"],"ko":["설정 파일 지원","명명 규칙 가이드","열 정의 지원","기본 키 지원","기본값 지원"],"es":["Configuración de esquema","Gestión de migraciones","Soporte para PostgreSQL","Convenciones de nomenclatura","Definición de columnas"],"fr":["Configuration de schéma","Gestion des migrations","Prise en charge de PostgreSQL","Conventions de nommage","Définition de colonnes"],"de":["Schemakonfiguration","Migrationverwaltung","Unterstützung für PostgreSQL","Benennungskonventionen","Spaltendefinition"],"pt":["Configuração de esquema personalizada","Suporte a migrations","Dialecto PostgreSQL com strict: true","Convenções de nomenclatura para tabelas e colunas","Definições de colunas personalizadas"],"ru":["Пользовательская настройка схемы","Поддержка миграций","Диалект PostgreSQL с strict: true","Конвенции именования для таблиц и столбцов","Пользовательские определения столбцов"],"ar":["تكوين مخطط مخصص","دعم الهجرات","لهجة PostgreSQL مع strict: true","اتفاقيات命名 للجداول والأعمدة","تعريفات أعمدة مخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Drizzle ORM","对象关系映射","配置文件","命名约定","列定义","主键","默认值"],"ja":["Drizzle ORM","オブジェクト関係マッピング","設定ファイル","命名規則","カラム定義","プライマリキー","デフォルト値"],"ko":["Drizzle ORM","객체 관계 매핑","설정 파일","명명 규칙","열 정의","기본 키","기본값"],"es":["Drizzle ORM","esquema de estilo","configuración de base de datos","gestión de migraciones","PostgreSQL","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["Drizzle ORM","schéma de style","configuration de base de données","gestion des migrations","PostgreSQL","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Drizzle ORM","Schemastil","Datenbankkonfiguration","Migrationverwaltung","PostgreSQL","Softwareentwicklung"],"pt":["Drizzle ORM","schema de banco de dados","gerenciamento de esquemas","configuração de esquema","migrations","PostgreSQL","convenções de nomenclatura"],"ru":["Drizzle ORM","схема базы данных","управление схемами","настройка схемы","миграции","PostgreSQL","конвенции именования"],"ar":["دريزل ORM","مخطط قاعدة البيانات","إدارة مخططات","تكوين مخطط","هجرات","PostgreSQL","اتفاقيات命名"]}},"owner":"husamql3","repo":"pstrack","repoPath":"husamql3/pstrack","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.418Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"drizzle","description":"Drizzle ORM schema and database guide. Use when working with database schemas (src/database/schemas/*), defining tables, creating migrations, or database model code. Triggers on Drizzle schema definition, database migrations, or ORM usage questions.","bodyPreview":"# Drizzle ORM Schema Style Guide\n\n## Configuration\n\n- Config: `/packages/db/drizzle.config.ts`\n- Schemas: `/packages/db/src/schema`\n- Migrations: `/packages/db/src/migrations`\n- Dialect: `postgresql` with `strict: true`\n\n## Naming Conventions\n\n- **Tables**: Plural snake_case (`users`, `session_groups`)\n- **Columns**: snake_case (`user_id`, `created_at`)\n\n## Column Definitions\n\n### Primary Keys\n\n```typescript\nid: text(''id'')\n  .primaryKey()\n  .$defaultFn(() => idGenerator(''agents''))\n  .notNull(),","body":"# Drizzle ORM Schema Style Guide\n\n## Configuration\n\n- Config: `/packages/db/drizzle.config.ts`\n- Schemas: `/packages/db/src/schema`\n- Migrations: `/packages/db/src/migrations`\n- Dialect: `postgresql` with `strict: true`\n\n## Naming Conventions\n\n- **Tables**: Plural snake_case (`users`, `session_groups`)\n- **Columns**: snake_case (`user_id`, `created_at`)\n\n## Column Definitions\n\n### Primary Keys\n\n```typescript\nid: text(''id'')\n  .primaryKey()\n  .$defaultFn(() => idGenerator(''agents''))\n  .notNull(),\n```\n\nID prefixes make entity types distinguishable. For internal tables, use `uuid`.\n\n### Foreign Keys\n\n```typescript\nuserId: text(''user_id'')\n  .references(() => users.id, { onDelete: ''cascade'' })\n  .notNull(),\n```\n\n### Timestamps\n\n```typescript\n...timestamps,\n```\n\n### Indexes\n\n```typescript\n// Return array (object style deprecated)\n(t) => [uniqueIndex(''client_id_user_id_unique'').on(t.clientId, t.userId)],\n```\n\n## Type Inference\n\n```typescript\nexport const insertAgentSchema = createInsertSchema(agents);\nexport type NewAgent = typeof agents.$inferInsert;\nexport type AgentItem = typeof agents.$inferSelect;\n```\n\n## Example Pattern\n\n```typescript\nexport const agents = pgTable(\n  ''agents'',\n  {\n    id: text(''id'').primaryKey().$defaultFn(() => idGenerator(''agents'')).notNull(),\n    slug: varchar(''slug'', { length: 100 }).$defaultFn(() => randomSlug(4)).unique(),\n    userId: text(''user_id'').references(() => users.id, { onDelete: ''cascade'' }).notNull(),\n    clientId: text(''client_id''),\n    chatConfig: jsonb(''chat_config'').$type<LobeAgentChatConfig>(),\n    ...timestamps,\n  },\n  (t) => [uniqueIndex(''client_id_user_id_unique'').on(t.clientId, t.userId)],\n);\n```\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Junction Tables (Many-to-Many)\n\n```typescript\nexport const agentsKnowledgeBases = pgTable(\n  ''agents_knowledge_bases'',\n  {\n    agentId: text(''agent_id'').references(() => agents.id, { onDelete: ''cascade'' }).notNull(),\n    knowledgeBaseId: text(''knowledge_base_id'').references(() => knowledgeBases.id, { onDelete: ''cascade'' }).notNull(),\n    userId: text(''user_id'').references(() => users.id, { onDelete: ''cascade'' }).notNull(),\n    enabled: boolean(''enabled'').default(true),\n    ...timestamps,\n  },\n  (t) => [primaryKey({ columns: [t.agentId, t.knowledgeBaseId] })],\n);\n```\n\n## Database Migrations\n\nSee `references/db-migrations.md` for detailed migration guide.\n\n```bash\n# Generate migrations\nbun run db:generate\n```\n\n### Migration Best Practices\n\n```sql\n-- ✅ Idempotent operations\nALTER TABLE \"users\" ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS \"avatar\" text;\nDROP TABLE IF EXISTS \"old_table\";\nCREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS \"users_email_idx\" ON \"users\" (\"email\");\n\n-- ❌ Non-idempotent\nALTER TABLE \"users\" ADD COLUMN \"avatar\" text;\n```\n\nRename migration files meaningfully: `0046_meaningless.sql` → `0046_user_add_avatar.sql`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:18:35.296Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Database Agents needing standardized PostgreSQL schema management with Drizzle ORM.","zh":"非常适合需要标准化PostgreSQL模式管理的数据库代理，使用Drizzle ORM。","ja":"Drizzle ORMを使用して標準化されたPostgreSQLスキーマ管理が必要なデータベースエージェントに最適。","ko":"Drizzle ORM을 사용하여 표준화된 PostgreSQL 스키마 관리가 필요한 데이터베이스 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Base de Datos que necesitan gestión de esquemas de PostgreSQL estandarizados con Drizzle ORM.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de base de données nécessitant une gestion standardisée des schémas PostgreSQL avec Drizzle ORM.","de":"Perfekt für Datenbankagenten, die eine standardisierte Verwaltung von PostgreSQL-Schemata mit Drizzle ORM benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Banco de Dados que necessitam de gerenciamento de esquema PostgreSQL padronizado com Drizzle ORM.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов баз данных, которым требуется стандартизированное управление схемой PostgreSQL с помощью Drizzle ORM.","ar":"مثالي لعميل قاعدة البيانات الذي يحتاج إلى إدارة مخطط PostgreSQL معيارية مع Drizzle ORM."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce strict naming conventions and configure PostgreSQL databases with dialect strictness, utilizing schema styles and migrations defined in TypeScript files like drizzle.config.ts.","zh":"赋予代理强制执行严格的命名约定，并使用TypeScript文件（如drizzle.config.ts）中定义的模式样式和迁移配置PostgreSQL数据库，利用方言严格性。","ja":"エージェントに厳密な命名規則を適用させ、TypeScriptファイル（drizzle.config.tsなど）で定義されたスキーマスタイルとマイグレーションを使用してPostgreSQLデータベースを構成するための方言厳格性を活用する。","ko":"에이전트가 엄격한 명명 규칙을 적용하고 TypeScript 파일(drizzle.config.ts 등)에서 정의된 스키마 스타일 및 마이그레이션을 사용하여 PostgreSQL 데이터베이스를 구성할 수 있도록 하며, 방언 엄격성을 활용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes aplicar convenciones de nomenclatura estrictas y configurar bases de datos de PostgreSQL con rigidez de dialecto, utilizando estilos de esquema y migraciones definidas en archivos de TypeScript como drizzle.config.ts.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer des conventions de nommage strictes et de configurer les bases de données PostgreSQL avec une rigidité de dialecte, en utilisant des styles de schéma et des migrations définis dans des fichiers TypeScript comme drizzle.config.ts.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, strikte Namenskonventionen durchzusetzen und PostgreSQL-Datenbanken mit Dialektrigide zu konfigurieren, indem es Schemastile und Migrationen verwendet, die in TypeScript-Dateien wie drizzle.config.ts definiert sind.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor convenções rigorosas de nomenclatura e configurar bancos de dados PostgreSQL com rigor de dialeto, utilizando estilos de esquema e migrações definidas em arquivos TypeScript como drizzle.config.ts.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечивать строгие конвенции именования и настраивать базы данных PostgreSQL с диалектным строгим соблюдением, используя стили схем и миграции, определенные в файлах TypeScript, таких как drizzle.config.ts.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء Activation لإ施دار اتفاقيات命名 صارمة وتكوين قواعد البيانات PostgreSQL مع صرامة لهجة ، باستخدام أنماط مخطط والهجرات المحددة في ملفات TypeScript مثل drizzle.config.ts."},"useCases":{"en":["Defining database schemas with snake_case naming conventions","Configuring PostgreSQL dialects for strict data consistency","Managing database migrations with TypeScript"],"zh":["使用下划线命名约定定义数据库模式","为严格的数据一致性配置PostgreSQL方言","使用TypeScript管理数据库迁移"],"ja":["スネークケース命名規則を使用してデータベーススキーマを定義する","厳密なデータ整合性のためにPostgreSQL方言を構成する","TypeScriptを使用してデータベースマイグレーションを管理する"],"ko":["스네이크 케이스命명 규칙을 사용하여 데이터베이스 스키마를 정의하는 것","엄格한 데이터 일관성을 위한 PostgreSQL 방언 구성","TypeScript를 사용하여 데이터베이스 마이그레이션 관리"],"es":["Definir esquemas de base de datos con convenciones de nomenclatura snake_case","Configurar dialectos de PostgreSQL para una consistencia estricta de los datos","Gestionar migraciones de base de datos con TypeScript"],"fr":["Définir des schémas de base de données avec des conventions de nommage snake_case","Configurer les dialectes PostgreSQL pour une cohérence stricte des données","Gérer les migrations de base de données avec TypeScript"],"de":["Datenbankschemata mit Namenskonventionen im snake_case-Format definieren","PostgreSQL-Dialekte für eine strikte Datenkonsistenz konfigurieren","Datenbankmigrationen mit TypeScript verwalten"],"pt":["Definir esquemas de banco de dados com convenções de nomenclatura snake_case","Configurar dialetos PostgreSQL para consistência rigorosa de dados","Gerenciar migrações de banco de dados com TypeScript"],"ru":["Определение схем баз данных с соглашениями об именовании snake_case","Настройка диалектов PostgreSQL для строгой последовательности данных","Управление миграциями баз данных с помощью TypeScript"],"ar":["تحديد مخططات قاعدة البيانات باتفاقيات命名 snake_case","تكوين لهجات PostgreSQL لاتساق البيانات الصارم","إدارة هجرات قاعدة البيانات مع TypeScript"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires PostgreSQL database","Strict mode must be enabled for dialect","TypeScript configuration files are mandatory"],"zh":["需要PostgreSQL数据库","必须启用严格模式以启用方言","TypeScript配置文件是必需的"],"ja":["PostgreSQLデータベースが必要","方言を有効にするには厳密モードを有効にする必要がある","TypeScript構成ファイルは必須"],"ko":["PostgreSQL 데이터베이스가 필요합니다.","방언을 활성화하려면 엄격한 모드를 활성화해야 합니다.","TypeScript 구성 파일은 필수입니다."],"es":["Requiere una base de datos PostgreSQL","El modo estricto debe estar habilitado para el dialecto","Los archivos de configuración de TypeScript son obligatorios"],"fr":["Nécessite une base de données PostgreSQL","Le mode strict doit être activé pour le dialecte","Les fichiers de configuration TypeScript sont obligatoires"],"de":["Erfordert eine PostgreSQL-Datenbank","Der strikte Modus muss für den Dialekt aktiviert sein","TypeScript-Konfigurationsdateien sind obligatorisch"],"pt":["Requer banco de dados PostgreSQL","O modo estrito deve ser habilitado para o dialeto","Arquivos de configuração TypeScript são obrigatórios"],"ru":["Требуется база данных PostgreSQL","Строгое соблюдение должно быть включено для диалекта","Файлы конфигурации TypeScript являются обязательными"],"ar":["يتطلب قاعدة بيانات PostgreSQL","يجب تمكين الوضع الصارم لللهجة","ملفات التكوين TypeScript إجباري"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('hoangnb24/skills/worker', 'community', 'hoangnb24', 'skills', 'hoangnb24/skills', 'worker', 0, 0, 35, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.418Z', '2026-02-18T04:18:43.512Z', NULL, '{"id":"hoangnb24/skills/worker","name":"worker","description":{"zh":"Worker 技能实现了自动化的珠子执行，通过 Agent Mail 维护上下文","ja":"Worker スキルは、Agent Mail を使用してコンテキストを維持しながらビーズを自動実行します","ko":"워커 기능은 에이전트 메일을 사용하여 컨텍스트를 유지하면서 비즈를 자동으로 실행합니다","es":"La habilidad de trabajador ejecuta beads de manera autónoma dentro de una pista asignada, manteniendo el contexto a través de Agent Mail.","fr":"La compétence de travailleur exécute des beads de manière autonome dans une piste attribuée, en maintenant le contexte via Agent Mail.","de":"Die Arbeiterfähigkeit führt Beads autonom innerhalb einer zugewiesenen Spur aus, wobei der Kontext über Agent Mail aufrechterhalten wird.","pt":"As habilidades de trabalhador permitem a execução autônoma de beads dentro de uma faixa atribuída, mantendo o contexto via Agent Mail","ru":"Навыки работника позволяют автономно выполнять биды в rámci назначенной полосы, сохраняя контекст через Agent Mail","ar":"تمكن مهارات العامل من تنفيذ البيدات التلقائي داخل مسار معين، مع الحفاظ على السياق عبر بريد العامل","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Worker 技能：自动化珠子执行","ja":"Worker スキル：オートマティック ビーズ実行","ko":"워커 기능: 자동 비즈 실행","es":"Habilidad de Trabajador: Ejecución Autónoma de Beads","fr":"Compétence de Travailleur : Exécution Autonome de Beads","de":"Arbeiterfähigkeit: Autonome Bead-Ausführung","pt":"Habilidades de Trabalhador: Execução Autônoma de Beads","ru":"Навыки Работника: Автономное Выполнение Бидов","ar":"مهارات العامل: تنفيذ البيدات التلقائي","en":"worker"},"description":{"zh":"Worker 技能实现了自动化的珠子执行，通过 Agent Mail 维护上下文","ja":"Worker スキルは、Agent Mail を使用してコンテキストを維持しながらビーズを自動実行します","ko":"워커 기능은 에이전트 메일을 사용하여 컨텍스트를 유지하면서 비즈를 자동으로 실행합니다","es":"La habilidad de trabajador ejecuta beads de manera autónoma dentro de una pista asignada, manteniendo el contexto a través de Agent Mail.","fr":"La compétence de travailleur exécute des beads de manière autonome dans une piste attribuée, en maintenant le contexte via Agent Mail.","de":"Die Arbeiterfähigkeit führt Beads autonom innerhalb einer zugewiesenen Spur aus, wobei der Kontext über Agent Mail aufrechterhalten wird.","pt":"As habilidades de trabalhador permitem a execução autônoma de beads dentro de uma faixa atribuída, mantendo o contexto via Agent Mail","ru":"Навыки работника позволяют автономно выполнять биды в rámci назначенной полосы, сохраняя контекст через Agent Mail","ar":"تمكن مهارات العامل من تنفيذ البيدات التلقائي داخل مسار معين، مع الحفاظ على السياق عبر بريد العامل","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["自动执行珠子","通过 Agent Mail 维护上下文","支持循环执行","提高任务处理效率"],"ja":["ビーズの自動実行","Agent Mail を使用したコンテキストの維持","ループ実行のサポート","タスク処理の効率化"],"ko":["비즈의 자동 실행","에이전트 메일을 사용한 컨텍스트 유지","루프 실행 지원","태스크 처리 효율화"],"es":["Ejecución autónoma de beads","Mantenimiento de contexto mediante Agent Mail","Asignación de pistas para la ejecución de beads","Repetición de la ejecución para cada bead en la pista","Inicio, trabajo y finalización de cada bead"],"fr":["Exécution autonome de beads","Maintenance du contexte via Agent Mail","Attribution de pistes pour l''exécution de beads","Répétition de l''exécution pour chaque bead dans la piste","Début, travail et fin de chaque bead"],"de":["Autonome Bead-Ausführung","Kontextaufrechterhaltung über Agent Mail","Zuweisung von Spuren für die Bead-Ausführung","Wiederholung der Ausführung für jedes Bead in der Spur","Start, Arbeit und Abschluss jedes Beads"],"pt":["Execução autônoma de beads","Manutenção de contexto via Agent Mail","Integração com faixas atribuídas","Melhoria da eficiência do agente","Automatização de tarefas"],"ru":["Автономное выполнение бидов","Сохранение контекста через Agent Mail","Интеграция с назначенными полосами","Повышение эффективности агента","Автоматизация задач"],"ar":["تنفيذ البيدات التلقائي","الحفاظ على السياق عبر بريد العامل","التكامل مع المسارات المعينة","تحسين كفاءة العامل","أتمتة المهام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Worker 技能","自动化执行","珠子","Agent Mail","上下文维护","任务处理"],"ja":["Worker スキル","自動実行","ビーズ","Agent Mail","コンテキスト維持","タスク処理"],"ko":["워커 기능","자동 실행","비즈","에이전트 메일","컨텍스트 유지","태스크 처리"],"es":["habilidad de trabajador","ejecución autónoma de beads","Agent Mail","pistas de ejecución","desarrollo de software","automatización de procesos"],"fr":["compétence de travailleur","exécution autonome de beads","Agent Mail","pistes d''exécution","développement de logiciels","automatisation de processus"],"de":["Arbeiterfähigkeit","autonome Bead-Ausführung","Agent Mail","Ausführungsspuren","Softwareentwicklung","Prozessautomatisierung"],"pt":["habilidades de trabalhador","execução autônoma de beads","agent mail","faixas atribuídas","eficiência do agente","automatização de tarefas","desenvolvimento de agentes"],"ru":["навыки работника","автономное выполнение бидов","agent mail","назначенные полосы","эффективность агента","автоматизация задач","разработка агентов"],"ar":["مهارات العامل","تنفيذ البيدات التلقائي","بريد العامل","المسارات المعينة","كفاءة العامل","أتمتة المهام","تطوير العوامل"]}},"owner":"hoangnb24","repo":"skills","repoPath":"hoangnb24/skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.418Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"worker","description":"Execute beads autonomously within a track. Handles bead-to-bead context persistence via Agent Mail, uses preferred tools from AGENTS.md, and reports progress to orchestrator.","bodyPreview":"# Worker Skill: Autonomous Bead Execution\n\nExecutes beads within an assigned track, maintaining context via Agent Mail.\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  TRACK LOOP (repeat for each bead in track)                                 │\n│                                                                             │\n│  ┌──────────────┐   ┌──────────────┐   ┌──────────────┐                    │\n│  │ START BEAD   │ → │ WORK ON BEAD │ → │ COMPLETE","body":"# Worker Skill: Autonomous Bead Execution\n\nExecutes beads within an assigned track, maintaining context via Agent Mail.\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  TRACK LOOP (repeat for each bead in track)                                 │\n│                                                                             │\n│  ┌──────────────┐   ┌──────────────┐   ┌──────────────┐                    │\n│  │ START BEAD   │ → │ WORK ON BEAD │ → │ COMPLETE     │ ──┐                │\n│  │              │   │              │   │ BEAD         │   │                │\n│  │ • Read ctx   │   │ • Implement  │   │ • Report     │   │                │\n│  │ • Reserve    │   │ • Use tools  │   │ • Save ctx   │   │                │\n│  │ • Claim      │   │ • Check mail │   │ • Release    │   │                │\n│  └──────────────┘   └──────────────┘   └──────────────┘   │                │\n│         ▲                                                  │                │\n│         └──────────────────────────────────────────────────┘                │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n## Initial Setup (Once Per Track)\n\n### 1. Register Agent Identity\n\n**Tool**: `mcp__mcp_agent_mail__register_agent`\n\n| Parameter          | Value                     |\n| ------------------ | ------------------------- |\n| `project_key`      | `<absolute-project-path>` |\n| `program`          | `amp`                     |\n| `model`            | `<your-model>`            |\n| `task_description` | `Track N: <description>`  |\n\n_Name auto-generated if omitted (e.g., BlueLake)_\n\n### 2. Understand Your Assignment\n\nFrom orchestrator: **Track number**, **Beads (in order)**, **File scope**, **Epic thread** (`<epic-id>`), **Track thread** (`track:<AgentName>:<epic-id>`)\n\n---\n\n## Bead Execution Loop\n\n### Step 1: Start Bead\n\n#### 1.1 Read Context from Previous Bead\n\n**Tool**: `mcp__mcp_agent_mail__summarize_thread`\n\n| Parameter          | Value                         |\n| ------------------ | ----------------------------- |\n| `project_key`      | `<path>`                      |\n| `thread_id`        | `track:<AgentName>:<epic-id>` |\n| `include_examples` | `true`                        |\n\n#### 1.2 Check Inbox\n\n**Tool**: `mcp__mcp_agent_mail__fetch_inbox`\n\n| Parameter        | Value         |\n| ---------------- | ------------- |\n| `project_key`    | `<path>`      |\n| `agent_name`     | `<AgentName>` |\n| `include_bodies` | `true`        |\n\n#### 1.3 Reserve Files\n\n**Tool**: `mcp__mcp_agent_mail__file_reservation_paths`\n\n| Parameter     | Value                      |\n| ------------- | -------------------------- |\n| `project_key` | `<path>`                   |\n| `agent_name`  | `<AgentName>`              |\n| `paths`       | `[\"<your-file-scope>/**\"]` |\n| `ttl_seconds` | `7200`                     |\n| `exclusive`   | `true`                     |\n| `reason`      | `<bead-id>`                |\n\nIf conflict → report blocker (see `reference/message-templates.md`)\n\n#### 1.4 Claim Bead\n\n```bash\nbd update <bead-id> --status in_progress\nbd show <bead-id>\n```\n\n---\n\n### Step 2: Work on Bead\n\n#### 2.1 Explore Codebase\n\n**Tool**: `mcp__gkg__search_codebase_definitions`\n\n| Parameter               | Value         |\n| ----------------------- | ------------- |\n| `search_terms`          | `[\"<terms>\"]` |\n| `project_absolute_path` | `<path>`      |\n\n**Tool**: `mcp__gkg__get_references`\n\n| Parameter            | Value      |\n| -------------------- | ---------- |\n| `absolute_file_path` | `<file>`   |\n| `definition_name`    | `<symbol>` |\n\n#### 2.2 Make Changes\n\n**Tool**: `mcp__morph_mcp__edit_file`\n\n| Parameter     | Value                                 |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| `path`        | `<file>`                              |\n| `code_edit`   | Use `// ... existing code ...` syntax |\n| `instruction` | `<what you''re changing>`              |\n\nAfter edits: `get_diagnostics(\"<edited-file>\")`\n\n#### 2.3 For UI Work\n\nLoad `frontend-design` skill first, then follow this workflow:\n\n##### 2.3.1 Search for Components\n\n**Tool**: `mcp__shadcn__search_items_in_registries`\n\n| Parameter    | Value         |\n| ------------ | ------------- |\n| `registries` | `[\"@shadcn\"]` |\n| `query`      | `<component>` |\n\n##### 2.3.2 View Component Details\n\n**Tool**: `mcp__shadcn__view_items_in_registries`\n\n| Parameter | Value                     |\n| --------- | ------------------------- |\n| `items`   | `[\"@shadcn/<component>\"]` |\n\n##### 2.3.3 Get Usage Examples\n\n**Tool**: `mcp__shadcn__get_item_examples_from_registries`\n\n| Parameter    | Value              |\n| ------------ | ------------------ |\n| `registries` | `[\"@shadcn\"]`      |\n| `query`      | `<component>-demo` |\n\n##### 2.3.4 Install Component\n\n**Tool**: `mcp__shadcn__get_add_command_for_items`\n\n| Parameter | Value                     |\n| --------- | ------------------------- |\n| `items`   | `[\"@shadcn/<component>\"]` |\n\nThen run the returned command (e.g., `npx shadcn@latest add button`).\n\n##### 2.3.5 Verify Installation\n\n**Tool**: `mcp__shadcn__get_audit_checklist`\n\n| Parameter | Value                             |\n| --------- | --------------------------------- |\n| `reason`  | `Verify <component> installation` |\n\n#### 2.4 Check Inbox Periodically\n\nUse `mcp__mcp_agent_mail__fetch_inbox` with `since_ts` parameter.\n\n#### 2.5 If Blocker or Interface Change\n\nSee `reference/message-templates.md` for message formats.\n\n---\n\n### Step 3: Complete Bead\n\n#### 3.1 Verify & Check\n\n```bash\nget_diagnostics(\"<project-path>\")\nbun run check-types\nbun run build\n```\n\n#### 3.2 Close Bead\n\n```bash\nbd close <bead-id> --reason \"<concise summary>\"\n```\n\n#### 3.3 Report to Orchestrator\n\n**Tool**: `mcp__mcp_agent_mail__send_message`\n\n| Parameter     | Value                                |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `project_key` | `<path>`                             |\n| `sender_name` | `<AgentName>`                        |\n| `to`          | `[\"<OrchestratorName>\"]`             |\n| `thread_id`   | `<epic-id>`                          |\n| `subject`     | `[<bead-id>] COMPLETE`               |\n| `body_md`     | See `reference/message-templates.md` |\n\n#### 3.4 Save Context for Next Bead\n\nSelf-addressed message to track thread. See `reference/message-templates.md`.\n\n#### 3.5 Release Reservations\n\n**Tool**: `mcp__mcp_agent_mail__release_file_reservations`\n\n| Parameter     | Value         |\n| ------------- | ------------- |\n| `project_key` | `<path>`      |\n| `agent_name`  | `<AgentName>` |\n\n---\n\n### Step 4: Continue to Next Bead\n\nLoop back to Step 1. Context from Step 3.4 available via track thread.\n\n---\n\n## Track Completion\n\nWhen all beads done, send track complete message (see `reference/message-templates.md`), then return:\n\n```\nTrack N (<AgentName>) Complete:\n- Completed beads: a, b, c\n- Summary: <what was built>\n- All acceptance criteria met\n```\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Bead Lifecycle Checklist\n\n```\nSTART: summarize_thread → fetch_inbox → file_reservation_paths → bd update\nWORK:  gkg tools → morph edits → get_diagnostics → check inbox\nDONE:  verify → bd close → send_message (orchestrator) → send_message (self) → release\nNEXT:  loop to START\n```\n\n### Thread Reference\n\n| Thread                        | Purpose                                 |\n| ----------------------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| `<epic-id>`                   | Cross-agent, orchestrator communication |\n| `track:<AgentName>:<epic-id>` | Your personal context persistence       |\n\n### Tool Reference\n\n| Task              | Tool                                             |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| Find code         | `mcp__gkg__search_codebase_definitions`          |\n| Get definition    | `mcp__gkg__get_definition`                       |\n| Find usages       | `mcp__gkg__get_references`                       |\n| Edit file         | `mcp__morph_mcp__edit_file`                      |\n| Search components | `mcp__shadcn__search_items_in_registries`        |\n| View components   | `mcp__shadcn__view_items_in_registries`          |\n| Get examples      | `mcp__shadcn__get_item_examples_from_registries` |\n| Install component | `mcp__shadcn__get_add_command_for_items`         |\n| Verify install    | `mcp__shadcn__get_audit_checklist`               |\n\n---\n\n## Additional Resources\n\n- **Message Templates**: `reference/message-templates.md` for all Agent Mail message formats\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:18:43.512Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Autonomous Agents requiring efficient bead execution and context maintenance via Agent Mail.","zh":"适用于需要高效的珠子执行和通过代理邮件维护上下文的自主代理。","ja":"エージェントメールを介したコンテキストの維持と効率的なビーズの実行が必要な自律エージェントに適しています。","ko":"에이전트 메일을 통해 효율적인 비즈 실행과 컨텍스트 유지 관리가 필요한 자율 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes Autónomos que requieren una ejecución de cuentas eficiente y mantenimiento de contexto a través del Correo del Agente.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents autonomes nécessitant une exécution de perles efficace et un maintien de contexte via le Courrier de l''Agent.","de":"Ideal für autonome Agenten, die eine effiziente Perlenausführung und Kontextpflege über die Agenten-Post erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Autônomos que requerem execução de beads eficiente e manutenção de contexto via Correio de Agente.","ru":"Идеально для автономных агентов, требующих эффективного выполнения бидов и поддержания контекста через Почту Агента.","ar":"مثالي لعميل tự động يتطلب تنفيذ بيدات فعال و صيانة السياق من خلال بريد العميل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute beads within assigned tracks, leveraging Agent Mail for seamless context switching and maintaining continuity across bead executions, utilizing TRACK LOOP protocols for efficient task management.","zh":"赋予代理执行分配轨道内的珠子、利用代理邮件实现无缝的上下文切换和跨珠子执行维持连续性，利用轨道循环协议实现高效的任务管理。","ja":"エージェントに、割り当てられたトラック内のビーズを実行する機能を付与し、エージェントメールを利用してシームレスなコンテキストの切り替えとビーズ実行間の連続性を維持し、トラックループプロトコルを利用して効率的なタスク管理を実現します。","ko":"에이전트에 할당된 트랙 내의 비즈를 실행할 수 있는 기능을 부여하고, 에이전트 메일을 사용하여 무縫의 컨텍스트 전환과 비즈 실행 간의 연속성을 유지하며, 트랙 루프 프로토콜을 사용하여 효율적인 작업 관리를 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar perlas dentro de las pistas asignadas, aprovechando el Correo del Agente para un conmutación de contexto sin problemas y mantener la continuidad en las ejecuciones de perlas, utilizando protocolos de BUCLE DE PISTA para una gestión de tareas eficiente.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des perles dans les pistes assignées, en exploitant le Courrier de l''Agent pour un commutation de contexte sans heurts et en maintenant la continuité entre les exécutions de perles, en utilisant des protocoles de BOUCLE DE PISTE pour une gestion de tâches efficace.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Perlen innerhalb der zugewiesenen Tracks auszuführen, indem sie die Agenten-Post für eine nahtlose Kontextumschaltung nutzen und die Kontinuität über Perlenausführungen hinweg aufrechterhalten, wobei TRACK-SCHLEIFEN-Protokolle für eine effiziente Aufgabenverwaltung verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar beads dentro de faixas atribuídas, utilizando o Correio de Agente para comutação de contexto sem interrupção e manter a continuidade em várias execuções de beads, utilizando protocolos de LAÇO DE FAIXA para gerenciamento de tarefas eficiente.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять биды в назначенных треках, используя Почту Агента для бесшовного переключения контекста и поддержания непрерывности при выполнении бидов, используя протоколы ПЕТЛИ ТРЕКА для эффективного управления задачами.","ar":"يمنح العملاء تنفيذ البيدات داخل المسارات المخصصة، باستخدام بريد العميل للتبديل السلس للسياق والحفاظ على الاستمرارية عبر تنفيذ بيدات متعددة، باستخدام بروتوكولات حلقة المسار لإدارة المهام الفعالة."},"useCases":{"en":["Executing beads in parallel tracks","Maintaining context across multiple bead executions","Automating track loop iterations for efficient task completion"],"zh":["在并行轨道中执行珠子","跨多个珠子执行维持上下文","自动化轨道循环迭代以实现高效任务完成"],"ja":["並行トラック内でビーズを実行する","複数のビーズ実行間でコンテキストを維持する","トラックループのイテレーションを自動化して効率的なタスク完了を実現する"],"ko":["병렬 트랙에서 비즈를 실행하는 것","여러 비즈 실행 간에 컨텍스트를 유지하는 것","트랙 루프 반복을 자동화하여 효율적인 작업 완수를 구현하는 것"],"es":["Ejecutar perlas en pistas paralelas","Mantener el contexto en varias ejecuciones de perlas","Automatizar iteraciones de bucle de pista para una finalización de tareas eficiente"],"fr":["Exécuter des perles dans des pistes parallèles","Maintenir le contexte sur plusieurs exécutions de perles","Automatiser les itérations de boucle de piste pour une achèvement de tâches efficace"],"de":["Perlen in parallelen Tracks ausführen","Kontext über mehrere Perlenausführungen hinweg aufrechterhalten","Track-Schleifen-Iterationen automatisieren, um eine effiziente Aufgabenabschluss zu ermöglichen"],"pt":["Executar beads em faixas paralelas","Manter contexto em várias execuções de beads","Automatizar iterações de laço de faixa para conclusão eficiente de tarefas"],"ru":["Выполнять биды в параллельных треках","Поддерживать контекст при нескольких выполнениях бидов","Автоматизировать итерации петли трека для эффективного завершения задач"],"ar":["تنفيذ البيدات في مسارات متوازية","الحفاظ على السياق عبر تنفيذ بيدات متعددة","توفير التكرارات حلقة المسار لاستكمال المهام الفعال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Agent Mail integration","TRACK LOOP protocol compatibility necessary"],"zh":["需要代理邮件集成","轨道循环协议的兼容性是必要的"],"ja":["エージェントメールの統合が必要","トラックループプロトコルの互換性が必要"],"ko":["에이전트 메일 통합이 필요","트랙 루프 프로토콜 호환성이 필요"],"es":["Requiere integración con Correo del Agente","Compatibilidad con protocolo TRACK LOOP necesaria"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec le Courrier de l''Agent","Compatibilité avec le protocole BOUCLE DE PISTE nécessaire"],"de":["Erfordert Integration mit der Agenten-Post","Kompatibilität mit dem TRACK-SCHLEIFEN-Protokoll erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer integração com Correio de Agente","Compatibilidade com protocolo LAÇO DE FAIXA necessária"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с Почтой Агента","Необходима совместимость с протоколом ПЕТЛИ ТРЕКА"],"ar":["يتطلب تكامل مع بريد العميل","ملاءمة بروتوكول حلقة المسار ضرورية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
