أتمتة سير العمل باستخدام CLI","en":"github-actions"},"description":{"zh":"GitHub Actions 技术提供了轻量级、灵活的 Spec-Driven Development 解决方案，用于现代 AI 驱动的开发","ja":"GitHub Actions スキルは、モダンな AI ドリブンの開発向けの軽量で柔軟な Spec-Driven Development 解決策を提供します","ko":"GitHub Actions 기술은 현대적인 AI 기반 개발을 위한 가볍고 유연한 Spec-Driven Development 솔루션을 제공합니다","es":"Acciones de GitHub es una habilidad que permite a los agentes desencadenar, monitorear y gestionar flujos de trabajo de Acciones de GitHub para proyectos de ...","fr":"Les Actions GitHub sont une compétence qui permet aux agents de déclencher, de surveiller et de gérer les flux de travail des Actions GitHub pour les projets...","de":"GitHub-Aktionen sind eine Fähigkeit, die es Agenten ermöglicht, Workflows von GitHub-Aktionen auszulösen, zu überwachen und zu verwalten, um agile Entwicklun...","pt":"O GitHub Actions é uma habilidade que permite automatizar workflows de CI/CD usando a CLI do GitHub","ru":"GitHub Actions — это навык, который позволяет автоматизировать воркфлоу CI/CD с помощью CLI GitHub","ar":"إجراءات GitHub هي مهارة تتيح لك أتمتة سير العمل باستخدام واجهة سطر الأوامر في GitHub","en":"Lightweight, flexible Spec-Driven Development (SDD) for modern AI-powered development"},"definition":{"en":"Lightweight, flexible Spec-Driven Development (SDD) for modern AI-powered development"},"features":{"zh":["触发和监控 GitHub Actions 工作流","使用 GitHub CLI (`gh`) 进行工作流交互","调试失败的工作流运行","管理工作流 artifact","检查构建状态以进行发布"],"ja":["GitHub Actions ワークフローをトリガーして監視する","GitHub CLI (`gh`) を使用してワークフローとやり取りする","失敗したワークフロー実行をデバッグする","ワークフロー artifact を管理する","リリース前にビルド状態をチェックする"],"ko":["GitHub Actions 워크플ロー 트리거 및 모니터링","GitHub CLI (`gh`)를 사용하여 워크플ロー 상호 작용","실패한 워크플ロー 실행 디버깅","워크플ロー artifact 관리","릴리즈 전 빌드 상태 확인"],"es":["Desencadenar flujos de trabajo de CI/CD de forma manual","Monitorear el estado de ejecución de los flujos de trabajo","Depurar flujos de trabajo fallidos","Gestionar artefactos de flujo de trabajo","Comprobar el estado de compilación antes de lanzar"],"fr":["Déclencher des flux de travail CI/CD de manière manuelle","Surveiller l''état d''exécution des flux de travail","Déboguer des flux de travail échoués","Gérer des artefacts de flux de travail","Vérifier l''état de construction avant de lancer"],"de":["CI/CD-Workflows manuell auslösen","Überwachung des Ausführungsstatus von Workflows","Fehlerhafte Workflows debuggen","Workflow-Artefakte verwalten","Build-Status vor dem Release überprüfen"],"pt":["Automação de workflows de CI/CD","Uso da CLI do GitHub","Monitoramento de status de workflows","Depuração de workflows com falhas","Gerenciamento de artefatos de workflows","Verificação de status de build antes de releases"],"ru":["Автоматизация воркфлоу CI/CD","Использование CLI GitHub","Мониторинг статуса воркфлоу","Отладка воркфлоу с ошибками","Управление артефактами воркфлоу","Проверка статуса сборки перед релизами"],"ar":["أتمتة سير العمل","استخدام واجهة سطر الأوامر في GitHub","مراقبة حالة سير العمل","تصحيح أخطاء سير العمل","إدارة مكونات سير العمل","تحقق من حالة البناء قبل الإصدار"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GitHub Actions","Spec-Driven Development","CI/CD","自动化","GitHub CLI","工作流管理"],"ja":["GitHub Actions","Spec-Driven Development","CI/CD","自動化","GitHub CLI","ワークフロー管理"],"ko":["GitHub Actions","Spec-Driven Development","CI/CD","자동화","GitHub CLI","워크플ロー 관리"],"es":["Acciones de GitHub","Desarrollo ágil","CI/CD","Automatización de flujos de trabajo","Desarrollo de software","Herramientas de desarrollo","Integración continua","Entrega continua"],"fr":["Actions GitHub","Développement agile","CI/CD","Automatisation des flux de travail","Développement de logiciels","Outils de développement","Intégration continue","Livraison continue"],"de":["GitHub-Aktionen","Agile Entwicklung","CI/CD","Automatisierung von Workflows","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools","Kontinuierliche Integration","Kontinuierliche Lieferung"],"pt":["GitHub Actions","Automação de workflows","CI/CD","CLI do GitHub","Monitoramento de workflows","Depuração de workflows","Gerenciamento de artefatos","Verificação de status de build"],"ru":["GitHub Actions","Автоматизация воркфлоу","CI/CD","CLI GitHub","Мониторинг воркфлоу","Отладка воркфлоу","Управление артефактами","Проверка статуса сборки"],"ar":["إجراءات GitHub","أتمتة سير العمل","CI/CD","واجهة سطر الأوامر في GitHub","مراقبة سير العمل","تصحيح أخطاء سير العمل","إدارة مكونات سير العمل","تحقق من حالة البناء"]}},"owner":"codervisor","repo":"lean-spec","repoPath":"codervisor/lean-spec","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.418Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"github-actions","description":"GitHub Actions workflow management for LeanSpec. Use when triggering, monitoring, or debugging CI/CD workflows.","version":"0.1.0","bodyPreview":"# GitHub Actions Skill\n\nTeach agents how to trigger, monitor, and manage GitHub Actions workflows for the LeanSpec project.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nActivate this skill when any of the following are true:\n- Triggering CI/CD workflows manually\n- Monitoring workflow run status\n- Debugging failed workflow runs\n- Managing workflow artifacts\n- Checking build status before releases\n\n## Core Principles\n\n1. **Use GitHub CLI (`gh`)** - All workflow interactions use the `gh` CLI tool\n2. **Check Status","body":"# GitHub Actions Skill\n\nTeach agents how to trigger, monitor, and manage GitHub Actions workflows for the LeanSpec project.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nActivate this skill when any of the following are true:\n- Triggering CI/CD workflows manually\n- Monitoring workflow run status\n- Debugging failed workflow runs\n- Managing workflow artifacts\n- Checking build status before releases\n\n## Core Principles\n\n1. **Use GitHub CLI (`gh`)** - All workflow interactions use the `gh` CLI tool\n2. **Check Status Before Acting** - Always verify current run status before triggering new ones\n3. **Monitor Until Completion** - Background workflows need periodic status checks\n4. **Artifacts Are Ephemeral** - Download important artifacts before they expire (default: 30 days)\n5. **Respect Rate Limits** - Don''t poll too frequently (minimum 30s between checks)\n\n## Available Workflows\n\n| Workflow | File | Triggers | Purpose |\n|----------|------|----------|---------|\n| **CI** | `ci.yml` | push, PR to main | Build, test, lint (Node.js + Rust) |\n| **Publish** | `publish.yml` | release, manual | Publish to npm (all platforms) |\n| **Desktop Build** | `desktop-build.yml` | push, PR, manual | Build Tauri desktop apps |\n| **Copilot Setup** | `copilot-setup-steps.yml` | push, PR, manual | Setup environment for Copilot agent |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Check Workflow Status\n\n```bash\n# List recent workflow runs\ngh run list --limit 10\n\n# View specific workflow runs\ngh run list --workflow ci.yml --limit 5\ngh run list --workflow publish.yml --limit 5\n\n# Get details of a specific run\ngh run view <run-id>\n\n# Watch a run in progress\ngh run watch <run-id>\n```\n\n### Trigger Workflows\n\n```bash\n# Trigger CI manually (usually automatic on push/PR)\ngh workflow run ci.yml\n\n# Trigger publish (dev version)\ngh workflow run publish.yml --field dev=true\n\n# Trigger publish (dry run - validates without publishing)\ngh workflow run publish.yml --field dev=true --field dry_run=true\n\n# Trigger desktop build\ngh workflow run desktop-build.yml\n```\n\n### Debug Failed Runs\n\n```bash\n# View failed run logs\ngh run view <run-id> --log-failed\n\n# View full logs\ngh run view <run-id> --log\n\n# Re-run failed jobs only\ngh run rerun <run-id> --failed\n\n# Re-run entire workflow\ngh run rerun <run-id>\n```\n\n### Manage Artifacts\n\n```bash\n# List artifacts from a run\ngh run view <run-id>\n\n# Download all artifacts from a run\ngh run download <run-id>\n\n# Download specific artifact\ngh run download <run-id> --name ui-dist\ngh run download <run-id> --name binaries-linux-x64\n```\n\n## Workflow Details\n\n### CI Workflow (`ci.yml`)\n\n**Triggers**: Push to main, PRs to main\n\n**Jobs**:\n1. **node** - Node.js/TypeScript build and test\n   - Install dependencies\n   - Build all packages\n   - Run typecheck\n   - Run tests\n   - Upload UI build artifact\n\n2. **rust** - Rust build and test (depends on node)\n   - Check formatting (`cargo fmt`)\n   - Run clippy linting\n   - Build binaries\n   - Run tests\n   - Validate specs\n\n**Common Failures**:\n- TypeScript errors → Run `pnpm typecheck` locally\n- Test failures → Run `pnpm test` locally\n- Clippy warnings → Run `cargo clippy -- -D warnings` in `rust/`\n- Formatting issues → Run `cargo fmt` in `rust/`\n\n### Publish Workflow (`publish.yml`)\n\n**Triggers**:\n- GitHub Release creation (primary production method)\n- Manual workflow dispatch (for dev/testing)\n\n**Inputs** (for manual dispatch):\n- `dry_run` (boolean) - Validate without publishing\n- `dev` (boolean) - Publish with `@dev` tag\n\n**Jobs**:\n1. **build-ui** - Build UI package first\n2. **rust-binaries** - Build for all platforms (matrix: darwin-x64, darwin-arm64, linux-x64, windows-x64)\n3. **publish-platform** - Publish platform-specific npm packages\n4. **publish-main** - Publish main packages (after platform packages propagate)\n\n**Common Failures**:\n- Platform packages not propagating → Retry publish-main job\n- Version mismatch → Run `pnpm sync-versions` locally\n- npm auth errors → Check `NPM_TOKEN` secret\n\n### Desktop Build Workflow (`desktop-build.yml`)\n\n**Triggers**: Changes to `packages/desktop/`, `packages/ui/`, or the workflow file\n\n**Jobs**:\n- Matrix build on macOS, Ubuntu, Windows\n- Builds Tauri desktop bundle\n- Uploads artifacts per platform\n\n## Workflow Patterns for Agents\n\n### Pattern 1: Check Before Triggering\n\nAlways check if a workflow is already running before triggering:\n\n```bash\n# Check for running CI workflows\ngh run list --workflow ci.yml --status in_progress\n\n# Only trigger if nothing is running\ngh workflow run ci.yml\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Wait for Completion\n\n```bash\n# Trigger and wait\ngh workflow run publish.yml --field dev=true\n\n# Get the latest run ID\nRUN_ID=$(gh run list --workflow publish.yml --limit 1 --json databaseId --jq ''.[0].databaseId'')\n\n# Watch until completion\ngh run watch $RUN_ID\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Debug and Retry\n\n```bash\n# Check what failed\ngh run view <run-id> --log-failed\n\n# If transient failure, retry just failed jobs\ngh run rerun <run-id> --failed\n\n# If you need clean state, retry all\ngh run rerun <run-id>\n```\n\n### Pattern 4: Pre-Release Validation\n\nBefore publishing a release:\n\n```bash\n# 1. Ensure CI passes\ngh run list --workflow ci.yml --branch main --limit 1\n\n# 2. Run publish dry run\ngh workflow run publish.yml --field dev=true --field dry_run=true\n\n# 3. Watch the dry run\nRUN_ID=$(gh run list --workflow publish.yml --limit 1 --json databaseId --jq ''.[0].databaseId'')\ngh run watch $RUN_ID\n\n# 4. If successful, trigger real dev publish\ngh workflow run publish.yml --field dev=true\n```\n\n## Decision Tree\n\n```\nNeed to check if build passing?\n└─> gh run list --workflow ci.yml --limit 1\n\nNeed to publish packages?\n├─> Production: Create GitHub Release (recommended)\n└─> Testing: gh workflow run publish.yml --field dev=true\n\nWorkflow failed?\n├─> View logs: gh run view <id> --log-failed\n├─> Transient: gh run rerun <id> --failed\n└─> Real issue: Fix locally, push, let CI re-run\n\nNeed build artifacts?\n└─> gh run download <run-id> --name <artifact-name>\n```\n\n## Reference Documentation\n\n- [references/WORKFLOWS.md](./references/WORKFLOWS.md) - Detailed workflow documentation\n- [references/COMMANDS.md](./references/COMMANDS.md) - Complete command reference\n- [references/TROUBLESHOOTING.md](./references/TROUBLESHOOTING.md) - Common issues and solutions\n\n## Setup Requirements\n\n### GitHub CLI Authentication\n\n```bash\n# Check if authenticated\ngh auth status\n\n# Login if needed\ngh auth login\n\n# Verify repo access\ngh repo view codervisor/lean-spec\n```\n\n### Required Permissions\n\n- Repository read access (for viewing runs)\n- Repository write access (for triggering workflows)\n- `NPM_TOKEN` secret configured (for publish workflow)\n\n## Auto-activation Hints\n\nIf the tool supports auto-activation, detect:\n- Tasks related to: \"CI\", \"workflow\", \"build\", \"deploy\", \"publish\", \"GitHub Actions\"\n- Commands being run: `gh run`, `gh workflow`\n- Errors mentioning: workflow failures, CI failures, build errors"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:18:51.521Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for DevOps Agents requiring automated workflow management through GitHub Actions","zh":"适用于需要通过 GitHub Actions 实现自动化工作流管理的 DevOps 代理","ja":"GitHub Actions を使用した自動化されたワークフロー管理を必要とする DevOps エージェントに最適","ko":"GitHub Actions를 통해 자동화된 워크플로우 관리를 필요로 하는 DevOps 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de DevOps que requieren una gestión de flujo de trabajo automatizada a través de GitHub Actions","fr":"Idéal pour les agents DevOps nécessitant une gestion de workflow automatisée via GitHub Actions","de":"Ideal für DevOps-Agents, die eine automatisierte Workflow-Verwaltung über GitHub Actions erfordern","pt":"Ideal para agentes DevOps que requerem gerenciamento de fluxo de trabalho automatizado por meio de GitHub Actions","ru":"Идеально для агентов DevOps, требующих автоматизированного управления рабочим процессом через GitHub Actions","ar":"مثالية لعميل DevOps الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة تدفق العمل التلقائي من خلال إجراءات GitHub"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to trigger, monitor, and manage GitHub Actions workflows using the GitHub CLI (`gh`), enabling seamless CI/CD pipeline automation and efficient debugging of failed workflow runs through workflow artifacts and build status checks","zh":"赋予代理触发、监控和管理 GitHub Actions 工作流的能力，使用 GitHub CLI (`gh`)，实现 CI/CD 流水线的自动化和高效的调试，通过工作流artifact和构建状态检查","ja":"エージェントに GitHub Actions ワークフローをトリガー、監視、管理する能力を与え、GitHub CLI (`gh`) を使用して CI/CD パイプラインの自動化と、ワークフロー アーティファクトとビルド状態チェックを介した失敗したワークフロー実行の効率的なデバッグを実現","ko":"에이전트가 GitHub Actions 워크플로우를 트리거, 모니터링, 관리할 수 있도록 하며, GitHub CLI (`gh`)를 사용하여 CI/CD 파이프라인 자동화 및 워크플로우 아티팩트와 빌드 상태 체크를 통해 실패한 워크플로우 실행의 효율적인 디버깅을 가능하게 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes para desencadenar, monitorear y gestionar flujos de trabajo de GitHub Actions utilizando la CLI de GitHub (gh), lo que permite una automatización de pipeline de CI/CD sin problemas y un depuración eficiente de ejecuciones de flujo de trabajo fallidas a través de artefactos de flujo de trabajo y comprobaciones de estado de compilación","fr":"Permet aux agents de déclencher, de surveiller et de gérer les flux de travail GitHub Actions à l''aide de la CLI GitHub (gh), ce qui permet une automation de pipeline CI/CD transparente et un débogage efficace des exécutions de flux de travailHaving échouées via des artefacts de flux de travail et des vérifications d''état de build","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, GitHub-Actions-Workflows mithilfe der GitHub-CLI (gh) auszulösen, zu überwachen und zu verwalten, was eine nahtlose Automatisierung von CI/CD-Pipelines und eine effiziente Fehlersuche bei fehlgeschlagenen Workflow-Ausführungen über Workflow-Artefakte und Build-Status-Checks ermöglicht","pt":"Permite que os agentes acionem, monitorem e gerenciem fluxos de trabalho de GitHub Actions usando a CLI do GitHub (`gh`), permitindo a automação de pipeline de CI/CD sem interrupções e a depuração eficiente de execuções de fluxo de trabalho com falha por meio de artefatos de fluxo de trabalho e verificações de status de compilação","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью запускать, контролировать и управлять рабочими процессами GitHub Actions с помощью CLI GitHub (`gh`), что позволяет автоматизировать конвейер CI/CD и эффективно отлаживать неудачные запуски рабочих процессов с помощью артефактов рабочего процесса и проверок статуса сборки","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من تشغيل ومراقبة وإدارة سير عمل إجراءات GitHub باستخدام CLI GitHub (`gh`) ، مما يتيح تلقائيًا трубة CI/CD وتحسين تصحيح الأخطاء في تشغيل سير العمل الفاشل من خلال إنتاج سير العمل وتحقق حالة البناء"},"useCases":{"en":["Triggering CI/CD workflows manually for rapid deployment","Monitoring workflow run status for real-time pipeline insights","Debugging failed workflow runs to minimize downtime","Managing workflow artifacts for efficient release management","Checking build status before releases to ensure stability"],"zh":["手动触发 CI/CD 工作流以实现快速部署","实时监控工作流运行状态以获取管道见解","调试失败的工作流运行以最小化停机时间","管理工作流 artifact 以实现高效的发布管理","在发布前检查构建状态以确保稳定性"],"ja":["手動で CI/CD ワークフローをトリガーして迅速なデプロイを実現","ワークフロー実行状態をリアルタイムに監視してパイプラインの洞察を取得","失敗したワークフロー実行をデバッグしてダウンタイムを最小限に抑える","ワークフローアーティファクトを管理して効率的なリリース管理を実現","リリース前にビルド状態をチェックして安定性を確保"],"ko":["수동으로 CI/CD 워크플로우를 트리거하여 빠른 배포를实现","워크플로우 실행 상태를 실시간으로 모니터링하여 파이프라인에 대한洞察을 얻음","실패한 워크플로우 실행을 디버깅하여 다운타임을 최소화","워크플로우 아티팩트를 관리하여 효율적인 릴리즈 관리를 가능하게 함","릴리즈 전에 빌드 상태를 체크하여 안정성을 보장"],"es":["Desencadenar flujos de trabajo de CI/CD manualmente para una implementación rápida","Monitorear el estado de ejecución del flujo de trabajo para obtener información sobre la canalización en tiempo real","Depurar ejecuciones de flujo de trabajo fallidas para minimizar el tiempo de inactividad","Gestionar artefactos de flujo de trabajo para una gestión de versiones eficiente","Comprobar el estado de compilación antes de las versiones para garantizar la estabilidad"],"fr":["Déclencher des flux de travail CI/CD manuellement pour un déploiement rapide","Surveiller l''état d''exécution du flux de travail pour obtenir des informations sur la pipeline en temps réel","Déboguer les exécutions de flux de travailHaving échouées pour minimiser le temps d''arrêt","Gérer les artefacts de flux de travail pour une gestion de version efficace","Vérifier l''état de build avant les versions pour assurer la stabilité"],"de":["CI/CD-Workflows manuell auslösen, um eine schnelle Bereitstellung zu ermöglichen","Überwachen des Workflow-Ausführungsstatus, um Echtzeit-Einblicke in die Pipeline zu erhalten","Fehlersuche bei fehlgeschlagenen Workflow-Ausführungen, um die Ausfallzeit zu minimieren","Verwalten von Workflow-Artefakten für eine effiziente Versionsverwaltung","Überprüfen des Build-Status vor den Releases, um die Stabilität zu gewährleisten"],"pt":["Disparar fluxos de trabalho de CI/CD manualmente para implantação rápida","Monitorar o status de execução do fluxo de trabalho para obter insights de pipeline em tempo real","Depurar execuções de fluxo de trabalho com falha para minimizar o tempo de inatividade","Gerenciar artefatos de fluxo de trabalho para gerenciamento de lançamento eficiente","Verificar o status de compilação antes dos lançamentos para garantir estabilidade"],"ru":["Запускать рабочие процессы CI/CD вручную для быстрой развертки","Контролировать статус запуска рабочего процесса для получения информации о конвейере в режиме реального времени","Отлаживать неудачные запуски рабочих процессов, чтобы минимизировать время простоя","Управлять артефактами рабочего процесса для эффективного управления выпусками","Проверять статус сборки перед выпусками, чтобы обеспечить стабильность"],"ar":["تشغيل سير عمل CI/CD يدويًا لنشر سريع","مراقبة حالة تشغيل سير العمل للحصول على رؤى трубية في الوقت الفعلي","تصحيح تشغيل سير العمل الفاشل لتقليل وقت الاستراحة","إدارة إنتاج سير العمل لإدارة الإصدار الفعال","التحقق من حالة البناء قبل الإصدارات لضمان الاستقرار"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub CLI (`gh`) installation","Limited to GitHub Actions workflows","Needs active GitHub repository access"],"zh":["需要安装 GitHub CLI (`gh`)","仅限 GitHub Actions 工作流","需要活动的 GitHub 仓库访问"],"ja":["GitHub CLI (`gh`) のインストールが必要","GitHub Actions ワークフローに限定","アクティブな GitHub リポジトリへのアクセスが必要"],"ko":["GitHub CLI (`gh`) 설치가 필요","GitHub Actions 워크플로우에만 한정","활성 GitHub 리포지토리 접근이 필요"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de la CLI de GitHub (gh)","Limitado a flujos de trabajo de GitHub Actions","Necesita acceso activo a un repositorio de GitHub"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de la CLI GitHub (gh)","Limité aux flux de travail GitHub Actions","Nécessite un accès actif à un référentiel GitHub"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation der GitHub-CLI (gh)","Begrenzt auf GitHub-Actions-Workflows","Benötigt aktiven Zugriff auf ein GitHub-Repository"],"pt":["Requer instalação do GitHub CLI (`gh`)","Limitado a fluxos de trabalho de GitHub Actions","Necessita de acesso ativo ao repositório do GitHub"],"ru":["Требует установки GitHub CLI (`gh`)","Ограничен рабочими процессами GitHub Actions","Требует активного доступа к репозиторию GitHub"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت CLI GitHub (`gh`)","محدود بسير عمل إجراءات GitHub","يحتاج إلى الوصول النشط إلى مستودع GitHub"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":85}');
