stern und Konventionen","Verbesserung der Lesbarkeit und Wartbarkeit des Codes"],"pt":["Abordagem passo a passo para simplificar código","Eliminação de complexidades desnecessárias","Foco em escrever o mínimo de código possível","Pesquisa prévia para entender o contexto","Análise de padrões de código existentes","Compreensão do ''porquê'' por trás do código"],"ru":["Пошаговый подход к упрощению кода","Устранение ненужной сложности","Фокус на написании минимального количества кода","Предварительное исследование для понимания контекста","Анализ существующих шаблонов кода","Понимание ''почему'' за кодом"],"ar":["نهج خطوة بخطوة لتبسيط الكود","تقليص التعقيدات غير الضرورية","التركيز على كتابة الحد الأدنى من الكود","البحث المسبق لفهم السياق","تحليل أنماط الكود الموجودة","فهم ''لماذا'' وراء الكود"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码简化","软件开发","代码优化","开发效率","复杂性减少"],"ja":["コード簡素化","ソフトウェア開発","コード最適化","開発効率","複雑さ減少"],"ko":["코드 단순화","소프트웨어 개발","코드 최적화","개발 효율성","복잡성 giảm"],"es":["simplificación de código","eliminación de complejidad","guía de simplificación","mejora de legibilidad","mantenimiento de código","desarrollo de software","programación eficiente"],"fr":["simplification de code","élimination de complexité","guide de simplification","amélioration de lisibilité","maintenance de code","développement de logiciels","programmation efficace"],"de":["Code-Vereinfachung","Beseitigung von Komplexität","Anleitung zur Vereinfachung","Verbesserung der Lesbarkeit","Wartung von Code","Software-Entwicklung","effiziente Programmierung"],"pt":["simplificação de código","desenvolvimento de software","programação","melhoria de código","redução de complexidade","desenvolvedores","código limpo"],"ru":["упрощение кода","разработка программного обеспечения","программирование","улучшение кода","снижение сложности","разработчики","чистый код"],"ar":["تبسيط الكود","تطوير البرمجيات","البرمجة","تحسين الكود","تقليل التعقيد","المطورون","كود نظيف"]}},"owner":"zoonk","repo":"zoonk","repoPath":"zoonk/zoonk","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.419Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"zoonk-code-simplification","description":"Review code for simplification opportunities and detect overengineering. Use when reviewing new code, refactoring, or verifying that an implementation follows the less is more principle.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Code Simplification\n\nA ruthless approach to eliminating unnecessary complexity. The core principle: **the best code is the code you don''t write**.\n\n## Before Suggesting Changes\n\n**CRITICAL: Research before suggesting.**\n\n1. **Read project guidelines** - Check for AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, or similar documentation\n2. **Search for existing patterns** - Find how similar code is written elsewhere in the codebase\n3. **Understand the \"why\"** - A pattern that looks verbose might exist for good reasons (f","body":"# Code Simplification\n\nA ruthless approach to eliminating unnecessary complexity. The core principle: **the best code is the code you don''t write**.\n\n## Before Suggesting Changes\n\n**CRITICAL: Research before suggesting.**\n\n1. **Read project guidelines** - Check for AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, or similar documentation\n2. **Search for existing patterns** - Find how similar code is written elsewhere in the codebase\n3. **Understand the \"why\"** - A pattern that looks verbose might exist for good reasons (framework requirements, established conventions, etc.)\n\n**Never suggest a simplification that:**\n\n- Contradicts patterns documented in project guidelines\n- Differs from how the same thing is done elsewhere in the codebase\n- Breaks framework requirements\n- Removes code that exists for a documented reason\n\n## Patterns to Flag\n\n### Over-abstraction\n\nCreating interfaces/types/wrappers for things used only once.\n\n### Premature Generalization\n\nBuilding for flexibility that isn''t needed yet. YAGNI (You Aren''t Gonna Need It).\n\n### Unnecessary State\n\nUsing `useState`/`useEffect` when derived values or server-rendered data suffice.\n\n### Verbose Patterns\n\nLong-form code when concise alternatives exist:\n\n- Optional chaining (`?.`) instead of nested conditionals\n- Nullish coalescing (`??`) instead of `|| defaultValue` with falsy edge cases\n- Object shorthand, destructuring, spread operators\n\n### Copy-Paste with Variations\n\nCode that should be a simple parameterized function.\n\n### Configuration Over Convention\n\nCustom setup when defaults would work fine.\n\n### Pass-Through Wrappers\n\nComponents or functions that just forward to another without adding meaningful behavior.\n\n## Review Process\n\n### Step 1: Gather Context\n\n1. Read project documentation (AGENTS.md, README, etc.)\n2. Search codebase for similar patterns\n3. Identify framework/library conventions\n\n### Step 2: Analyze Against Conventions\n\n1. Does the code follow established patterns?\n2. Is there similar code elsewhere that follows the same pattern?\n3. Are there framework requirements that justify the structure?\n4. Would the suggested simplification break any conventions?\n\n### Step 3: Evaluate Simplification Opportunities\n\n1. Is this the cleanest approach within the project''s conventions?\n2. Is there a simpler way that still follows established patterns?\n3. What can be deleted without breaking conventions?\n4. Is every abstraction earning its keep?\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Context Gathered\n\nBriefly list what you researched before making suggestions:\n\n- Project conventions reviewed\n- Similar patterns found in codebase\n- Framework requirements identified\n\n### Simplification Opportunities\n\nFor each issue:\n\n1. **What**: Brief description of the complexity\n2. **Why it''s overengineered**: Explain the unnecessary complexity\n3. **Verified against conventions**: Confirm this doesn''t break project patterns\n4. **Simpler alternative**: Show the cleaner approach with code\n5. **Impact**: Lines saved, cognitive load reduced, or maintenance simplified\n\n### Verdict\n\n- **Clean** - This code is already minimal. Ship it.\n- **Minor tweaks** - A few small simplifications possible.\n- **Needs simplification** - Significant complexity that should be addressed.\n- **Overengineered** - This needs a fundamental rethink.\n\n## Principles\n\n- **Research first, suggest second** - Never propose changes without understanding project context\n- Be direct and specific. Don''t soften feedback with excessive qualifiers.\n- Always provide concrete alternatives, not just criticism.\n- Recognize that sometimes complexity is warranted—explain when the current approach is justified.\n- Consider maintainability: simpler code is easier to debug, test, and modify.\n- Remember: every line of code is a liability. Fewer lines = fewer bugs = less maintenance.\n- **When in doubt, search the codebase** - If you''re unsure about a pattern, find how it''s done elsewhere\n\nThe goal is code so clean and obvious that it barely needs comments because the intent is crystal clear. But never sacrifice correctness or convention-compliance for brevity.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:19:13.299Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Optimization Agents needing ruthless complexity elimination techniques.","zh":"非常适合需要无情消除复杂性的代码优化代理","ja":"コード最適化エージェントが容赦なく複雑性を排除する必要がある場合に最適","ko":"코드 최적화 에이전트가 무자비하게 복잡성을 제거하는 데 필요한 경우에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de optimización de código que necesitan técnicas de eliminación de complejidad despiadadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''optimisation de code ayant besoin de techniques d''élimination de complexité impitoyables.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Optimierungsagenten, die gnadenlose Komplexitätseleminierungstechniken benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Otimização de Código que necessitam de técnicas de eliminação de complexidade implacáveis.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов оптимизации кода, которым необходимы беспощадные методы устранения сложностей.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحسين الكود الذي يحتاج إلى تقنيات قاسية لتحسين التعقيدات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to simplify code by researching project guidelines, searching for existing patterns, and understanding the ''why'' behind verbose code, ensuring the best code is the code that doesn''t get written, following principles outlined in AGENTS.md and CLAUDE.md documentation.","zh":"赋予代理简化代码的能力，通过研究项目指南、搜索现有模式、理解冗长代码背后的原因，确保最好的代码是不会被编写的代码，遵循AGENTS.md和CLAUDE.md文档中概述的原则","ja":"エージェントにコードを簡略化する能力を付与し、プロジェクトガイドラインを調査し、既存のパターンを検索し、冗長なコードの背後にある理由を理解することで、最も優れたコードは書かれないコードであることを保証し、AGENTS.mdおよびCLAUDE.mdドキュメントに概説された原則に従う","ko":"에이전트에게 코드를 단순화하는 능력을 부여하여 프로젝트 가이드라인을 연구하고 기존 패턴을 검색하고冗장한 코드背后的 이유를 이해함으로써 가장 좋은 코드는 작성되지 않는 코드임을 보장하며 AGENTS.md 및 CLAUDE.md 문서에概説된 원칙을 따름","es":"Habilita a los agentes a simplificar el código investigando las directrices del proyecto, buscando patrones existentes y entendiendo el ''por qué'' detrás del código verboso, asegurando que el mejor código es el que no se escribe, siguiendo los principios descritos en la documentación AGENTS.md y CLAUDE.md.","fr":"Permet aux agents de simplifier le code en recherchant les directives de projet, en cherchant des modèles existants et en comprenant le ''pourquoi'' derrière le code verbeux, en s''assurant que le meilleur code est celui qui n''est pas écrit, en suivant les principes décrits dans la documentation AGENTS.md et CLAUDE.md.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, den Code zu vereinfachen, indem sie die Projektanweisungen recherchieren, vorhandene Muster suchen und das ''Warum'' hinter dem verbosen Code verstehen, um sicherzustellen, dass der beste Code der ist, der nicht geschrieben wird, unter Berücksichtigung der in der AGENTS.md- und CLAUDE.md-Dokumentation beschriebenen Grundsätze.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a simplificar o código pesquisando diretrizes do projeto, procurando por padrões existentes e entendendo o ''porquê'' por trás do código verboso, garantindo que o melhor código é o código que não é escrito, seguindo os princípios delineados na documentação AGENTS.md e CLAUDE.md.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью упростить код, изучая руководства проекта, ища существующие шаблоны и понимая ''почему'' за сложным кодом, обеспечивая, чтобы лучший код был кодом, который не написан, следуя принципам, изложенным в документации AGENTS.md и CLAUDE.md.","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من تبسيط الشفرة من خلال البحث في إرشادات المشروع والبحث عن الأنماط الحالية وفهم ''لماذا'' وراء الشفرة الم siêu ، مما يضمن أن أفضل شفرة هي الشفرة التي لم يتم كتابتها ، متبعة المبادئ المحددة في توثيق AGENTS.md و CLAUDE.md."},"useCases":{"en":["Researching project guidelines before suggesting changes","Searching for existing code patterns to avoid duplication","Understanding the rationale behind complex code to simplify it effectively"],"zh":["在建议更改之前研究项目指南","搜索现有代码模式以避免重复","理解复杂代码背后的理由以有效地简化"],"ja":["変更を提案する前にプロジェクトガイドラインを調査する","重複を避けるために既存のコードパターンを検索する","複雑なコードの背後にある理由を理解して効果的に簡略化する"],"ko":["변경을 제안하기 전에 프로젝트 가이드라인을 연구","중복을 피하기 위해 기존 코드 패턴을 검색","복잡한 코드의背后的 이유를 이해하여 효과적으로 단순화"],"es":["Investigar las directrices del proyecto antes de sugerir cambios","Buscar patrones de código existentes para evitar la duplicación","Entender la razón detrás del código complejo para simplificarlo de manera efectiva"],"fr":["Rechercher les directives de projet avant de suggérer des modifications","Chercher des modèles de code existants pour éviter la duplication","Comprendre la raison derrière le code complexe pour le simplifier de manière efficace"],"de":["Recherchieren der Projektanweisungen, bevor Änderungen vorgeschlagen werden","Suchen von vorhandenen Code-Mustern, um Duplizierungen zu vermeiden","Verstehen der Begründung hinter dem komplexen Code, um ihn effektiv zu vereinfachen"],"pt":["Pesquisar diretrizes do projeto antes de sugerir alterações","Procurar padrões de código existentes para evitar duplicação","Entender a razão por trás do código complexo para simplificá-lo de forma eficaz"],"ru":["Изучать руководства проекта перед предложением изменений","Искать существующие шаблоны кода, чтобы избежать дублирования","Понимать причину за сложным кодом, чтобы упростить его эффективно"],"ar":["البحث في إرشادات المشروع قبل اقتراح التغييرات","البحث عن أنماط الشفرة الحالية لتجنب التكرار","فهم السبب وراء الشفرة المعقدة لتبسيتها بفعالية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to project documentation like AGENTS.md or CLAUDE.md","Needs understanding of coding principles and existing patterns"],"zh":["需要访问项目文档，如AGENTS.md或CLAUDE.md","需要理解编码原则和现有模式"],"ja":["AGENTS.mdまたはCLAUDE.mdなどのプロジェクトドキュメントへのアクセスが必要","コーディング原則と既存のパターンの理解が必要"],"ko":["AGENTS.md 또는 CLAUDE.md와 같은 프로젝트 문서에 액세스해야 함","코딩 원칙과 기존 패턴을 이해해야 함"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la documentación del proyecto, como AGENTS.md o CLAUDE.md","Necesita comprensión de los principios de codificación y patrones existentes"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la documentation de projet, telle que AGENTS.md ou CLAUDE.md","Nécessite une compréhension des principes de codage et des modèles existants"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Projekt-Dokumentation wie AGENTS.md oder CLAUDE.md","Benötigt Verständnis für die Codierungsprinzipien und vorhandenen Muster"],"pt":["Requer acesso à documentação do projeto, como AGENTS.md ou CLAUDE.md","Necessita de compreensão dos princípios de codificação e padrões existentes"],"ru":["Требует доступа к документации проекта, такой как AGENTS.md или CLAUDE.md","Требует понимания принципов кодирования и существующих шаблонов"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى توثيق المشروع مثل AGENTS.md أو CLAUDE.md","يحتاج إلى فهم مبادئ الترميز والأنماط الحالية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
