von AI-Anwendungen","Kompatibilität mit Rust und TypeScript","Befehle für Entwicklung, Testing und Veröffentlichung","Unterstützung für Web- und Desktop-Anwendungen","Option für automatische Neuerstellung"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento ágil de AI","Spec-Driven Development","Comandos para desenvolvimento, teste e publicação","Suporte a Rust e TypeScript","Interface de usuário web e aplicativo de desktop"],"ru":["Гибкая разработка AI","Spec-Driven Development","Команды для разработки, тестирования и публикации","Поддержка Rust и TypeScript","Веб-интерфейс и настольное приложение"],"ar":["تنمية آي آي الخفيفة","Spec-Driven Development","أوامر لتنمية واختبار ونشر","دعم الرست والタイプ سكريبت","واجهة المستخدم على الويب وتطبيق سطح المكتب"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Spec-Driven开发","现代AI开发","轻量级开发","Rust开发","TypeScript开发","自动重建","调试功能"],"ja":["Spec-Driven開発","モダンAI開発","軽量開発","Rust開発","TypeScript開発","自動リビルド","デバッグ機能"],"ko":["Spec-Driven 개발","현대 AI 개발","경량 개발","Rust 개발","TypeScript 개발","자동 재구축","디버깅 기능"],"es":["desarrollo de AI","Spec-Driven Development","Rust","TypeScript","aplicaciones web","aplicaciones de escritorio","desarrollo ágil","testing","publicación"],"fr":["développement AI","Spec-Driven Development","Rust","TypeScript","applications web","applications de bureau","développement agile","test","publication"],"de":["AI-Entwicklung","Spec-Driven Development","Rust","TypeScript","Web-Anwendungen","Desktop-Anwendungen","agiles Entwicklung","Testing","Veröffentlichung"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de AI","Spec-Driven Development","Leanspec-Scripts","Rust","TypeScript","desenvolvimento ágil"],"ru":["разработка AI","Spec-Driven Development","Leanspec-Scripts","Rust","TypeScript","гибкая разработка"],"ar":["تنمية آي آي","Spec-Driven Development","leanspec-scripts","رست","تايب سكريبت","تنمية خفيفة"]}},"owner":"codervisor","repo":"lean-spec","repoPath":"codervisor/lean-spec","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.419Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"leanspec-scripts","description":"All pnpm and cargo commands for LeanSpec development. Use when looking up build, dev, test, or publish commands.","version":"0.1.0","bodyPreview":"# LeanSpec Scripts Reference\n\nAll commands for development, testing, and publishing.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\nMost common daily commands:\n\n```bash\npnpm dev              # Start web UI + Rust HTTP server\npnpm dev:watch        # Same + auto-rebuild Rust on changes\npnpm dev:web          # Start web UI only\npnpm dev:desktop      # Start desktop app\npnpm build            # Build all TS packages\npnpm build:rust       # Build Rust (debug)\npnpm build:rust:release # Build Rust (release)\npnpm test","body":"# LeanSpec Scripts Reference\n\nAll commands for development, testing, and publishing.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\nMost common daily commands:\n\n```bash\npnpm dev              # Start web UI + Rust HTTP server\npnpm dev:watch        # Same + auto-rebuild Rust on changes\npnpm dev:web          # Start web UI only\npnpm dev:desktop      # Start desktop app\npnpm build            # Build all TS packages\npnpm build:rust       # Build Rust (debug)\npnpm build:rust:release # Build Rust (release)\npnpm test             # Run tests\npnpm typecheck        # Type check all packages\npnpm format           # Format all code\npnpm cli              # Run LeanSpec CLI\npnpm pre-release      # Full pre-release check\n```\n\n## Publishing & Release\n\n```bash\n# Sync versions across packages\ntsx scripts/sync-versions.ts\ntsx scripts/sync-rust-versions.ts\n\n# Prepare for publishing (backup package.json files)\ntsx scripts/prepare-publish.ts\n\n# Publish packages\ntsx scripts/publish-platform-packages.ts\ntsx scripts/publish-main-packages.ts\n\n# Restore packages after publishing\ntsx scripts/restore-packages.ts\n```\n\n## Documentation\n\n```bash\npnpm docs:dev         # Start docs dev server\npnpm docs:build       # Build docs\n```\n\n## Testing\n\n```bash\npnpm test             # Run all tests\npnpm test:watch       # Watch mode\npnpm test:ui          # With UI\npnpm test:coverage    # With coverage\npnpm test:rust        # Rust tests only\n```\n\n## Rust Development\n\n```bash\n# Build\npnpm build:rust           # Debug build (default for dev)\npnpm build:rust:release   # Release build (for publishing)\npnpm check:rust           # Quick check without building\n\n# Quality\npnpm lint:rust            # Clippy with warnings as errors\npnpm format:rust          # Format code\npnpm format:rust:check    # Check formatting\n\n# Low-level (when you need more control)\ncargo build --manifest-path rust/Cargo.toml\ncargo build --release --manifest-path rust/Cargo.toml\nnode scripts/copy-rust-binaries.mjs --debug   # Copy from debug\nnode scripts/copy-rust-binaries.mjs           # Copy from release\nnode scripts/copy-rust-binaries.mjs --all     # All platforms\n```\n\n## Desktop Development\n\n```bash\npnpm dev:desktop      # Start desktop app in dev mode\n\n# Build & bundle\nturbo run build:desktop --filter=@leanspec/desktop\n\n# Or directly with Tauri\ncd packages/desktop\npnpm build:desktop\npnpm bundle:linux     # Debian package\npnpm bundle:macos     # DMG\npnpm bundle:windows   # NSIS installer\n```\n\n## Validation\n\n```bash\npnpm pre-push         # Quick check: typecheck + clippy\npnpm pre-release      # Full: build + typecheck + test + lint\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:19:06.038Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents requiring Spec-Driven Development for streamlined development, testing, and publishing processes","zh":"适合需要基于规范的开发以实现开发、测试和发布流程的AI代理","ja":"開発、テスト、公開のプロセスを効率化するためのSpec-Driven Developmentを必要とするAIエージェントに最適","ko":"개발, 테스트, 배포 프로세스를 간소화하기 위한 사양 기반 개발을 요구하는 AI 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA que requieren Desarrollo impulsado por especificaciones para procesos de desarrollo, prueba y publicación optimizados","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA nécessitant un développement piloté par des spécifications pour des processus de développement, de test et de publication rationalisés","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents, die spezifikationsgetriebene Entwicklung für optimierte Entwicklungs-, Test- und Veröffentlichungsprozesse erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA que requerem Desenvolvimento Dirigido por Especificações para processos de desenvolvimento, teste e publicação simplificados","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, требующих разработки, управляемой спецификациями, для упрощения процессов разработки, тестирования и публикации","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يحتاج إلى تطوير مدفوع بالمواصفات لتسلسل عمليات التطوير والاختبار والنشر"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage pnpm for efficient package management, facilitating rapid development with commands like pnpm dev, pnpm build, and pnpm test, while also supporting Rust HTTP server integration","zh":"使代理能够利用pnpm实现高效的包管理，通过pnpm dev、pnpm build和pnpm test等命令实现快速开发，同时支持Rust HTTP服务器集成","ja":"エージェントがpnpmを使用して効率的なパッケージ管理を実現し、pnpm dev、pnpm build、pnpm testなどのコマンドを使用して迅速な開発を実現し、同時にRust HTTPサーバー統合もサポート","ko":"에이전트가 pnpm을 사용하여 효율적인 패키지 관리를 가능하게 하여 pnpm dev, pnpm build, pnpm test 등의 명령어로 빠른 개발을 가능하게 하며,同时 Rust HTTP 서버 통합을 지원","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aprovechar pnpm para una gestión de paquetes eficiente, facilitando un desarrollo rápido con comandos como pnpm dev, pnpm build y pnpm test, y también admitiendo la integración del servidor HTTP de Rust","fr":"Permet aux agents d''utiliser pnpm pour une gestion de packages efficace, facilitant un développement rapide avec des commandes comme pnpm dev, pnpm build et pnpm test, tout en prenant en charge l''intégration du serveur HTTP Rust","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, pnpm für effizientes Paketmanagement zu nutzen, um ein schnelles Entwickeln mit Befehlen wie pnpm dev, pnpm build und pnpm test zu ermöglichen, und unterstützt auch die Integration des Rust-HTTP-Servers","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitar o pnpm para gerenciamento de pacotes eficiente, facilitando o desenvolvimento rápido com comandos como pnpm dev, pnpm build e pnpm test, além de suportar a integração do servidor HTTP Rust","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность использовать pnpm для эффективного управления пакетами, что облегчает быструю разработку с помощью команд, таких как pnpm dev, pnpm build и pnpm test, а также поддерживает интеграцию с сервером HTTP Rust","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على الاستفادة من pnpm لإدارة الحزم بكفاءة، وتسهيل التطوير السريع بالأوامر مثل pnpm dev و pnpm build و pnpm test، بالإضافة إلى دعم تكامل خادم HTTP Rust"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating development workflows with pnpm dev:watch","Building and testing TypeScript packages with pnpm build","Deploying Rust applications using pnpm build:rust:release"],"zh":["使用pnpm dev:watch自动化开发工作流","使用pnpm build构建和测试TypeScript包","使用pnpm build:rust:release部署Rust应用"],"ja":["pnpm dev:watchを使用して開発ワークフローを自動化","pnpm buildを使用してTypeScriptパッケージのビルドとテスト","pnpm build:rust:releaseを使用してRustアプリケーションをデプロイ"],"ko":["pnpm dev:watch를 사용하여 개발 워크플로 자동화","pnpm build를 사용하여 TypeScript 패키지 빌드 및 테스트","pnpm build:rust:release를 사용하여 Rust 애플리케이션 배포"],"es":["Automatizar flujos de trabajo de desarrollo con pnpm dev:watch","Crear y probar paquetes de TypeScript con pnpm build","Implementar aplicaciones de Rust mediante pnpm build:rust:release"],"fr":["Automatiser les flux de travail de développement avec pnpm dev:watch","Construire et tester des packages TypeScript avec pnpm build","Déployer des applications Rust à l''aide de pnpm build:rust:release"],"de":["Automatisieren von Entwicklungs-Workflows mit pnpm dev:watch","Erstellen und Testen von TypeScript-Paketen mit pnpm build","Bereitstellen von Rust-Anwendungen mit pnpm build:rust:release"],"pt":["Automatizar fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento com pnpm dev:watch","Construir e testar pacotes TypeScript com pnpm build","Implantar aplicativos Rust usando pnpm build:rust:release"],"ru":["Автоматизировать рабочие процессы разработки с помощью pnpm dev:watch","Создавать и тестировать пакеты TypeScript с помощью pnpm build","Развертывать приложения Rust с помощью pnpm build:rust:release"],"ar":["أتمتة سلاسل العمل التطويرية ب pnpm dev:watch","بناء وتجريب حزم TypeScript ب pnpm build","نشر تطبيقات Rust باستخدام pnpm build:rust:release"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires pnpm installation","Dependent on Rust for HTTP server functionality"],"zh":["需要安装pnpm","依赖于Rust实现HTTP服务器功能"],"ja":["pnpmのインストールが必要","Rustに依存してHTTPサーバー機能を実現"],"ko":["pnpm 설치가 필요","Rust에 의존하여 HTTP 서버 기능을 구현"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de pnpm","Depende de Rust para la funcionalidad del servidor HTTP"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de pnpm","Dépend de Rust pour la fonctionnalité du serveur HTTP"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation von pnpm","Ist von Rust für die Funktionalität des HTTP-Servers abhängig"],"pt":["Requer instalação do pnpm","Depende do Rust para funcionalidade do servidor HTTP"],"ru":["Требует установки pnpm","Зависит от Rust для функциональности HTTP-сервера"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت pnpm","يعتمد على Rust لوظيفة خادم HTTP"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
