 関数のプレビューを作成","プレビュー名とグループのカスタマイズをサポート","Material 3 と Jetpack Compose の統合","Android 開発の効率を高める","複数のテーマとモードをサポート"],"ko":["Jetpack Compose 함수의 미리보기를 만들기","미리보기 이름과 그룹을 사용자 정의","Material 3와 Jetpack Compose를 통합","Android 개발 효율성을 높이기","여러 테마와 모드를 지원"],"es":["Crea vistas previas de funciones de Jetpack Compose","Permite probar y depurar interfaces de usuario de manera eficiente","Soporte para temas y estilos personalizados","Integración con Android Studio","Compatibilidad con Material 3"],"fr":["Crée des aperçus de fonctions Jetpack Compose","Permet de tester et de déboguer les interfaces utilisateur de manière efficace","Prise en charge des thèmes et des styles personnalisés","Intégration avec Android Studio","Compatibilité avec Material 3"],"de":["Erstellt Vorschauen von Jetpack-Compose-Funktionen","Ermöglicht effizientes Testen und Debuggen von Benutzeroberflächen","Unterstützung für benutzerdefinierte Themen und Stile","Integration mit Android Studio","Kompatibilität mit Material 3"],"pt":["Criação de pré-visualizações de componentes Jetpack Compose","Suporte a diferentes cenários e temas","Integração com o Material 3/You","Uso de anotações @Preview para configurar as pré-visualizações","Suporte a grupos e nomes personalizados para as pré-visualizações"],"ru":["Создание предварительных просмотров компонентов Jetpack Compose","Поддержка различных сценариев и тем","Интеграция с Material 3/You","Использование аннотаций @Preview для настройки предварительных просмотров","Поддержка групп и пользовательских имен для предварительных просмотров"],"ar":["إنشاء معاينة لمكونات جيتباك كومبوز","دعم السيناريوهات والمواضيع المختلفة","التكامل مع مادة 3/أنت","استخدام التدوين @Preview لتهيئة المعاينة","دعم المجموعات والأسماء المخصصة للمعاينة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Jetpack Compose","Compose Preview","Android 开发","Material 3","自定义预览","提高效率"],"ja":["Jetpack Compose","Compose Preview","Android 開発","Material 3","プレビューのカスタマイズ","効率の向上"],"ko":["Jetpack Compose","Compose Preview","Android 개발","Material 3","미리보기 사용자 정의","효율성 향상"],"es":["Jetpack Compose","Compose Preview","vista previa","interfaz de usuario","Android Studio","Material 3","desarrollo de aplicaciones","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["Jetpack Compose","Compose Preview","aperçu","interface utilisateur","Android Studio","Material 3","développement d''applications","outils de développement"],"de":["Jetpack Compose","Compose Preview","Vorschau","Benutzeroberfläche","Android Studio","Material 3","App-Entwicklung","Entwicklertools"],"pt":["Jetpack Compose","Compose Preview","pré-visualização","desenvolvimento Android","Material 3/You","anotações @Preview"],"ru":["Jetpack Compose","Compose Preview","предпросмотр","разработка Android","Material 3/You","аннотации @Preview"],"ar":["جيتباك كومبوز","معاينة التركيب","معاينة","تطوير أندرويد","مادة 3/أنت","التدوين @Preview"]}},"owner":"heddxh","repo":"NeoDB-You","repoPath":"heddxh/NeoDB-You","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.419Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"compose-preview","description":"Creates Compose Preview functions for composables. Use when asked to add preview, create preview, or generate @Preview for Compose UI.","bodyPreview":"# Compose Preview\n\n为 Jetpack Compose 函数创建预览。\n\n## 基本用法\n\n```kotlin\n@Preview\n@Composable\nprivate fun XxxPreview() {\n    AppTheme {\n        Xxx()\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## @Preview 注解参数\n\n| 参数                | 说明              | 示例                                                         |\n|-------------------|-----------------|------------------------------------------------------------|\n| `name`            | 预览名称            | `@Preview(name = \"Dark Mode\")`                             |\n| `group`           | 分组","body":"# Compose Preview\n\n为 Jetpack Compose 函数创建预览。\n\n## 基本用法\n\n```kotlin\n@Preview\n@Composable\nprivate fun XxxPreview() {\n    AppTheme {\n        Xxx()\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## @Preview 注解参数\n\n| 参数                | 说明              | 示例                                                         |\n|-------------------|-----------------|------------------------------------------------------------|\n| `name`            | 预览名称            | `@Preview(name = \"Dark Mode\")`                             |\n| `group`           | 分组名称            | `@Preview(group = \"Buttons\")`                              |\n| `widthDp`         | 宽度 (dp)         | `@Preview(widthDp = 320)`                                  |\n| `heightDp`        | 高度 (dp)         | `@Preview(heightDp = 640)`                                 |\n| `showBackground`  | 显示背景            | `@Preview(showBackground = true)`                          |\n| `backgroundColor` | 背景色 (ARGB Long) | `@Preview(backgroundColor = 0xFFFFFFFF)`                   |\n| `showSystemUi`    | 显示系统 UI         | `@Preview(showSystemUi = true)`                            |\n| `device`          | 设备规格            | `@Preview(device = \"id:pixel_5\")`                          |\n| `uiMode`          | UI 模式           | `@Preview(uiMode = Configuration.UI_MODE_NIGHT_YES)`       |\n| `locale`          | 语言              | `@Preview(locale = \"zh-rCN\")`                              |\n| `fontScale`       | 字体缩放            | `@Preview(fontScale = 1.5f)`                               |\n| `wallpaper`       | 壁纸              | `@Preview(wallpaper = Wallpapers.GREEN_DOMINATED_EXAMPLE)` |\n\n## Multipreview 注解\n\n创建自定义多预览注解以复用配置：\n\n```kotlin\n@Preview(name = \"Light\", uiMode = Configuration.UI_MODE_NIGHT_NO)\n@Preview(name = \"Dark\", uiMode = Configuration.UI_MODE_NIGHT_YES)\nannotation class ThemePreviews\n\n@Preview(name = \"Phone\", device = \"spec:width=411dp,height=891dp\")\n@Preview(name = \"Tablet\", device = \"spec:width=1280dp,height=800dp,dpi=240\")\nannotation class DevicePreviews\n```\n\n使用：\n\n```kotlin\n@ThemePreviews\n@DevicePreviews\n@Composable\nprivate fun MyComponentPreview() {\n    AppTheme {\n        MyComponent()\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## 设备规格\n\n### 预定义设备\n\n- `id:pixel_5`, `id:pixel_fold`, `id:pixel_tablet`\n- `id:wearos_small_round`, `id:wearos_large_round`\n\n### 自定义规格\n\n```kotlin\n@Preview(device = \"spec:width=411dp,height=891dp,dpi=420\")\n@Preview(device = \"spec:width=1280dp,height=800dp,orientation=landscape\")\n```\n\n## 项目约定\n\n1. **Preview 函数命名**: `XxxPreview` 或 `PreviewXxx`\n2. **使用 AppTheme**: 始终用 `AppTheme { }` 包裹预览内容\n3. **私有函数**: Preview 函数应为 `private`\n4. **Mock 数据**: 使用假数据填充预览，不依赖 ViewModel\n5. **放置位置**: 在同一文件中，放在被预览组件下方\n\n## 工作流程\n\n1. 找到需要预览的 Composable 函数\n2. 分析其参数，确定需要的 mock 数据\n3. 在函数下方创建 Preview 函数\n4. 用 `NeoDBYouTheme` 包裹\n5. 根据需要添加多个 `@Preview` 变体（亮/暗主题、不同尺寸等）,大多数情况下Preview不需要参数。\n\n## 示例\n\n### 简单组件预览\n\n```kotlin\n@Composable\nfun Greeting(name: String, modifier: Modifier = Modifier) {\n    Text(text = \"Hello $name!\", modifier = modifier)\n}\n\n@Preview(showBackground = true)\n@Composable\nprivate fun GreetingPreview() {\n    AppTheme {\n        Greeting(\"Android\")\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 状态变体预览\n\n```kotlin\n@Preview(name = \"Empty\")\n@Preview(name = \"Loading\")\n@Preview(name = \"Content\")\n@Composable\nprivate fun MyScreenPreview() {\n    AppTheme {\n        // 根据需要展示不同状态\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 亮暗主题预览\n\n```kotlin\n@PreviewLightDark\n@Composable\nprivate fun CardPreview() {\n    AppTheme {\n        MyCard(title = \"Sample\", content = \"Preview content\")\n    }\n}\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:19:04.584Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Android Development Agents needing native UI component preview capabilities with Jetpack Compose.","zh":"非常适合需要原生 UI 组件预览功能的 Android 开发代理，特别是使用 Jetpack Compose 的开发环境。","ja":"Android 開発エージェントがネイティブ UI コンポーネントのプレビュー機能を必要とする場合に最適です。特に Jetpack Compose を使用する開発環境に適しています。","ko":"네이티브 UI 컴포넌트 미리보기 기능이 필요한 Android 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 특히 Jetpack Compose를 사용하는 개발 환경에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de Android que necesitan capacidades de vista previa de componentes de interfaz de usuario nativos con Jetpack Compose.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement Android qui ont besoin de fonctionnalités d''aperçu de composants d''interface utilisateur natifs avec Jetpack Compose.","de":"Perfekt für Android-Entwicklungsagenten, die native Vorschau-Funktionen für Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten mit Jetpack Compose benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Android que necessitam de capacidades de visualização de componentes de interface do usuário nativos com Jetpack Compose.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки Android, которым необходимы возможности предварительного просмотра компонентов пользовательского интерфейса с Jetpack Compose.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطوير Android الذي يحتاج إلى mogelijkkeiten لمعاينة مكونات واجهة المستخدم الأصلية مع Jetpack Compose."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create previews for Jetpack Compose functions with Material 3/You, utilizing annotations like @Preview for customized preview names and groups, and integrating seamlessly with AppTheme.","zh":"赋予代理创建使用 Material 3/You 的 Jetpack Compose 函数的预览功能，利用 @Preview 等注解自定义预览名称和分组，并与 AppTheme 无缝集成。","ja":"エージェントが Material 3/You を使用する Jetpack Compose 関数のプレビューを作成する機能を提供します。@Preview などの注釈を使用してプレビュー名とグループをカスタマイズし、AppTheme とシームレスに統合します。","ko":"에이전트가 Material 3/You를 사용하는 Jetpack Compose 함수의 미리보기를 생성할 수 있는 기능을 제공합니다. @Preview 등의 주석을 사용하여 미리보기 이름과 그룹을 사용자 지정하고 AppTheme와無縫に統合합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear vistas previas para funciones de Jetpack Compose con Material 3/You, utilizando anotaciones como @Preview para nombres y grupos de vista previa personalizados, e integrándose de forma transparente con AppTheme.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des aperçus pour les fonctions Jetpack Compose avec Material 3/You, en utilisant des annotations comme @Preview pour des noms et des groupes d''aperçu personnalisés, et en s''intégrant sans effort avec AppTheme.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Vorschauen für Jetpack-Compose-Funktionen mit Material 3/You zu erstellen, indem es Annotationen wie @Preview für benutzerdefinierte Vorschaunamen und -gruppen verwendet und nahtlos in AppTheme integriert.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar visualizações prévias para funções do Jetpack Compose com Material 3/You, utilizando anotações como @Preview para nomes e grupos de visualização personalizados, e integrando-se perfeitamente com AppTheme.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать предварительные просмотры для функций Jetpack Compose с Material 3/You, используя аннотации типа @Preview для настройки имен и групп предварительного просмотра, и бесшовно интегрируясь с AppTheme.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل khảILITIES لإنشاء معاينة مسبقة للأدوار Jetpack Compose مع Material 3/You، باستخدام تعليقات مثل @Preview لأسماء ومعايير معاينة مخصصة، وتكامل متسلسلة مع AppTheme."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating previews for custom UI components","Debugging Jetpack Compose layouts with Material 3/You","Creating themed previews with AppTheme"],"zh":["为自定义 UI 组件生成预览","使用 Material 3/You 调试 Jetpack Compose 布局","使用 AppTheme 创建主题预览"],"ja":["カスタム UI コンポーネントのプレビューを生成する","Material 3/You を使用して Jetpack Compose レイアウトをデバッグする","AppTheme を使用してテーマ付きプレビューを作成する"],"ko":["커스텀 UI 컴포넌트를 위한 미리보기를 생성하는 것","Material 3/You를 사용하여 Jetpack Compose 레이아웃을 디버깅하는 것","AppTheme를 사용하여 테마가 적용된 미리보기를 생성하는 것"],"es":["Generación de vistas previas para componentes de interfaz de usuario personalizados","Depuración de diseños de Jetpack Compose con Material 3/You","Creación de vistas previas temáticas con AppTheme"],"fr":["Génération d''aperçus pour des composants d''interface utilisateur personnalisés","Débogage des conceptions Jetpack Compose avec Material 3/You","Création d''aperçus thématiques avec AppTheme"],"de":["Erstellung von Vorschauen für benutzerdefinierte Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten","Fehlersuche in Jetpack-Compose-Layouts mit Material 3/You","Erstellung von thematischen Vorschauen mit AppTheme"],"pt":["Geração de visualizações prévias para componentes de UI personalizados","Depuração de layouts do Jetpack Compose com Material 3/You","Criação de visualizações temáticas com AppTheme"],"ru":["Генерация предварительных просмотров для пользовательских компонентов интерфейса","Отладка макетов Jetpack Compose с Material 3/You","Создание тематических предварительных просмотров с AppTheme"],"ar":["إنشاء معاينة مسبقة لمكونات واجهة المستخدم المخصصة","تصحيح أخطاء تخطيطات Jetpack Compose مع Material 3/You","إنشاء معاينة مواضيعية مع AppTheme"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Android development environment","Jetpack Compose and Material 3/You dependency needed","Kotlin programming language required"],"zh":["需要 Android 开发环境","需要 Jetpack Compose 和 Material 3/You 依赖","需要 Kotlin 编程语言"],"ja":["Android 開発環境が必要","Jetpack Compose と Material 3/You 依存関係が必要","Kotlin プログラミング言語が必要"],"ko":["Android 개발 환경이 필요합니다.","Jetpack Compose 및 Material 3/You 의존성이 필요합니다.","Kotlin 프로그래밍 언어가 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere un entorno de desarrollo de Android","Se necesita la dependencia de Jetpack Compose y Material 3/You","Se requiere el lenguaje de programación Kotlin"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement de développement Android","Dépendance de Jetpack Compose et Material 3/You nécessaire","Langage de programmation Kotlin requis"],"de":["Benötigt eine Android-Entwicklungsumgebung","Abhängigkeit von Jetpack Compose und Material 3/You erforderlich","Kotlin-Programmiersprache erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer ambiente de desenvolvimento Android","Dependência do Jetpack Compose e Material 3/You necessária","Linguagem de programação Kotlin necessária"],"ru":["Требуется среда разработки Android","Необходима зависимость от Jetpack Compose и Material 3/You","Требуется язык программирования Kotlin"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة تطوير Android","مطلوب تبعية Jetpack Compose و Material 3/You","مطلوب لغة برمجة Kotlin"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('proyecto26/projectx/nestjs', 'community', 'proyecto26', 'projectx', 'proyecto26/projectx', 'nestjs', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.419Z', '2026-02-18T04:19:24.308Z', NULL, '{"id":"proyecto26/projectx/nestjs","name":"nestjs","description":{"zh":"NestJS 是一个用于构建可扩展的微服务架构的框架，支持 Temporal 工作流和 React","ja":"NestJS は、Temporal ワークフローと React をサポートする拡張可能なマイクロサービス アーキテクチャを構築するためのフレームワーク","ko":"NestJS는 Temporal 워크플로와 React를 지원하는 확장 가능한 마이크로 서비스 아키텍처를 구축하기 위한 프레임워크","es":"NestJS es un framework para crear aplicaciones full-stack escalables. Combina Temporal para un evento dirigido arquitectura","fr":"NestJS est un framework pour créer des applications full-stack évolutives. Il combine Temporal pour une architecture orientée événement","de":"NestJS ist ein Framework für die Erstellung skalierbarer Full-Stack-Anwendungen. Es kombiniert Temporal für eine ereignisgesteuerte Architektur","pt":"NestJS é uma estrutura para criar aplicações Node.js escaláveis e manteníveis. Aprenda a criar microserviços com NestJS","ru":"NestJS — это фреймворк для создания масштабируемых и поддерживаемых приложений Node.js. Узнайте, как создавать микросервисы с помощью NestJS","ar":"NestJS هو إطار لتطوير تطبيقات Node.js قابلة للتوسيع والصيانة. تعلم كيفية إنشاء المايكروسيرفيس باستخدام NestJS","en":"Tame full-stack chaos with Temporal workflows and React wizardry, the ultimate event-driven architecture for your apps 🧙‍♂️✨"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"NestJS 微服务开发","ja":"NestJS マイクロサービス開発","ko":"NestJS 마이크로 서비스 개발","es":"Desarrollo de Microservicios con NestJS","fr":"Développement de Microservices avec NestJS","de":"Microservice-Entwicklung mit NestJS","pt":"Desenvolvimento de Microserviços com NestJS","ru":"Разработка Микросервисов с NestJS","ar":"تطوير المايكروسيرفيس باستخدام NestJS","en":"nestjs"},"description":{"zh":"NestJS 是一个用于构建可扩展的微服务架构的框架，支持 Temporal 工作流和 React","ja":"NestJS は、Temporal ワークフローと React をサポートする拡張可能なマイクロサービス アーキテクチャを構築するためのフレームワーク","ko":"NestJS는 Temporal 워크플로와 React를 지원하는 확장 가능한 마이크로 서비스 아키텍처를 구축하기 위한 프레임워크","es":"NestJS es un framework para crear aplicaciones full-stack escalables. Combina Temporal para un evento dirigido arquitectura","fr":"NestJS est un framework pour créer des applications full-stack évolutives. Il combine Temporal pour une architecture orientée événement","de":"NestJS ist ein Framework für die Erstellung skalierbarer Full-Stack-Anwendungen. Es kombiniert Temporal für eine ereignisgesteuerte Architektur","pt":"NestJS é uma estrutura para criar aplicações Node.js escaláveis e manteníveis. Aprenda a criar microserviços com NestJS","ru":"NestJS — это фреймворк для создания масштабируемых и поддерживаемых приложений Node.js. Узнайте, как создавать микросервисы с помощью NestJS","ar":"NestJS هو إطار لتطوير تطبيقات Node.js قابلة للتوسيع والصيانة. تعلم كيفية إنشاء المايكروسيرفيس باستخدام NestJS","en":"Tame full-stack chaos with Temporal workflows and React wizardry, the ultimate event-driven architecture for your apps 🧙‍♂️✨"},"definition":{"en":"Tame full-stack chaos with Temporal workflows and React wizardry, the ultimate event-driven architecture for your apps 🧙‍♂️✨"},"features":{"zh":["支持 Temporal 工作流","集成 React 前端框架","支持 JWT 和 Passport 认证","微服务架构","模块化设计"],"ja":["Temporal ワークフローをサポート","React フロントエンド フレームワークを統合","JWT と Passport 認証をサポート","マイクロサービス アーキテクチャ","モジュール化設計"],"ko":["Temporal 워크플로를 지원","React 프론트엔드 프레임워크를 통합","JWT와 Passport 인증을 지원","마이크로 서비스 아키텍처","모듈화 설계"],"es":["Arquitectura de microservicios","Integración con Temporal","Autenticación con JWT y Passport","Gestión de pedidos y catálogo de productos","Módulos compartidos","Estructura de proyecto escalable"],"fr":["Architecture de microservices","Intégration avec Temporal","Authentification avec JWT et Passport","Gestion de commandes et catalogue de produits","Modules partagés","Structure de projet évolutif"],"de":["Mikroservice-Architektur","Integration mit Temporal","Authentifizierung mit JWT und Passport","Bestell- und Produktkatalogverwaltung","Freigegebene Module","Skalierbare Projektstruktur"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de microserviços","Integração com Temporal","Estrutura de projeto escalável","Autenticação com JWT e Passport","Gerenciamento de pedidos e catálogo de produtos"],"ru":["Разработка микросервисов","Интеграция с Temporal","Масштабируемая структура проекта","Аутентификация с помощью JWT и Passport","Управление заказами и каталогом товаров"],"ar":["تطوير المايكروسيرفيس","التكامل مع Temporal","هيكلة مشروع قابلة للتوسيع","التحقق من هوية المستخدم باستخدام JWT و Passport","إدارة الطلبات وقائمة المنتجات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["NestJS","微服务","Temporal","React","事件驱动","Node.js","JWT","Passport"],"ja":["NestJS","マイクロサービス","Temporal","React","イベント駆動","Node.js","JWT","Passport"],"ko":["NestJS","마이크로 서비스","Temporal","React","이벤트 驱动","Node.js","JWT","Passport"],"es":["NestJS","microservicios","Temporal","full-stack","desarrollo de aplicaciones","autenticación","gestión de pedidos","catálogo de productos","módulos compartidos"],"fr":["NestJS","microservices","Temporal","full-stack","développement d''applications","authentification","gestion de commandes","catalogue de produits","modules partagés"],"de":["NestJS","Mikroservices","Temporal","Full-Stack","Anwendungsentwicklung","Authentifizierung","Bestellverwaltung","Produktkatalog","freigegebene Module"],"pt":["NestJS","microserviços","desenvolvimento de aplicações","Temporal","React","autenticação","gerenciamento de pedidos"],"ru":["NestJS","микросервисы","разработка приложений","Temporal","React","аутентификация","управление заказами"],"ar":["NestJS","المايكروسيرفيس","تطوير التطبيقات","Temporal","React","التحقق من هوية المستخدم","إدارة الطلبات"]}},"owner":"proyecto26","repo":"projectx","repoPath":"proyecto26/projectx","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.419Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"nestjs","description":"NestJS microservices development. Use when creating controllers, services, modules, guards, interceptors, or working with NestJS patterns in auth, order, or product services.","bodyPreview":"# NestJS Microservices Development\n\n## Project Structure\n\nThis project uses NestJS for three microservices:\n- `apps/auth` - Authentication (JWT, Passport)\n- `apps/order` - Order management (integrates with Temporal)\n- `apps/product` - Product catalog\n\nShared modules are in `packages/core`.\n\n## Creating a New Module\n\n### 1. Create Module File\n\n```typescript\n// feature/feature.module.ts\nimport { Module } from ''@nestjs/common'';\nimport { FeatureController } from ''./feature.controller'';\nimport { Feat","body":"# NestJS Microservices Development\n\n## Project Structure\n\nThis project uses NestJS for three microservices:\n- `apps/auth` - Authentication (JWT, Passport)\n- `apps/order` - Order management (integrates with Temporal)\n- `apps/product` - Product catalog\n\nShared modules are in `packages/core`.\n\n## Creating a New Module\n\n### 1. Create Module File\n\n```typescript\n// feature/feature.module.ts\nimport { Module } from ''@nestjs/common'';\nimport { FeatureController } from ''./feature.controller'';\nimport { FeatureService } from ''./feature.service'';\n\n@Module({\n  controllers: [FeatureController],\n  providers: [FeatureService],\n  exports: [FeatureService],\n})\nexport class FeatureModule {}\n```\n\n### 2. Create Service with Repository Pattern\n\n```typescript\n// feature/feature.service.ts\nimport { Injectable } from ''@nestjs/common'';\nimport { PrismaService } from ''@projectx/db'';\n\n@Injectable()\nexport class FeatureService {\n  constructor(private readonly prisma: PrismaService) {}\n\n  async findAll() {\n    return this.prisma.feature.findMany();\n  }\n\n  async findOne(id: string) {\n    return this.prisma.feature.findUnique({ where: { id } });\n  }\n\n  async create(data: CreateFeatureDto) {\n    return this.prisma.feature.create({ data });\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 3. Create Controller with Swagger\n\n```typescript\n// feature/feature.controller.ts\nimport { Controller, Get, Post, Body, Param } from ''@nestjs/common'';\nimport { ApiTags, ApiOperation, ApiResponse } from ''@nestjs/swagger'';\nimport { FeatureService } from ''./feature.service'';\n\n@ApiTags(''features'')\n@Controller(''features'')\nexport class FeatureController {\n  constructor(private readonly featureService: FeatureService) {}\n\n  @Get()\n  @ApiOperation({ summary: ''Get all features'' })\n  @ApiResponse({ status: 200, description: ''Returns all features'' })\n  findAll() {\n    return this.featureService.findAll();\n  }\n\n  @Get('':id'')\n  @ApiOperation({ summary: ''Get feature by ID'' })\n  findOne(@Param(''id'') id: string) {\n    return this.featureService.findOne(id);\n  }\n\n  @Post()\n  @ApiOperation({ summary: ''Create a feature'' })\n  create(@Body() createFeatureDto: CreateFeatureDto) {\n    return this.featureService.create(createFeatureDto);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## DTOs with Validation\n\n```typescript\n// feature/dto/create-feature.dto.ts\nimport { IsString, IsNotEmpty, IsOptional } from ''class-validator'';\nimport { ApiProperty, ApiPropertyOptional } from ''@nestjs/swagger'';\n\nexport class CreateFeatureDto {\n  @ApiProperty({ description: ''Feature name'' })\n  @IsString()\n  @IsNotEmpty()\n  name: string;\n\n  @ApiPropertyOptional({ description: ''Feature description'' })\n  @IsString()\n  @IsOptional()\n  description?: string;\n}\n```\n\n## Authentication Guards\n\nUse guards from `@projectx/core`:\n\n```typescript\nimport { UseGuards } from ''@nestjs/common'';\nimport { JwtAuthGuard } from ''@projectx/core'';\n\n@Controller(''protected'')\n@UseGuards(JwtAuthGuard)\nexport class ProtectedController {\n  // All routes require authentication\n}\n```\n\n## Exception Handling\n\n```typescript\nimport { NotFoundException, BadRequestException } from ''@nestjs/common'';\n\n// In service\nasync findOne(id: string) {\n  const item = await this.prisma.feature.findUnique({ where: { id } });\n  if (!item) {\n    throw new NotFoundException(`Feature with ID ${id} not found`);\n  }\n  return item;\n}\n```\n\n## Testing Services\n\n```typescript\nimport { Test, TestingModule } from ''@nestjs/testing'';\nimport { FeatureService } from ''./feature.service'';\nimport { PrismaService } from ''@projectx/db'';\n\ndescribe(''FeatureService'', () => {\n  let service: FeatureService;\n  let prisma: PrismaService;\n\n  beforeEach(async () => {\n    const module: TestingModule = await Test.createTestingModule({\n      providers: [\n        FeatureService,\n        {\n          provide: PrismaService,\n          useValue: {\n            feature: {\n              findMany: jest.fn(),\n              findUnique: jest.fn(),\n              create: jest.fn(),\n            },\n          },\n        },\n      ],\n    }).compile();\n\n    service = module.get<FeatureService>(FeatureService);\n    prisma = module.get<PrismaService>(PrismaService);\n  });\n\n  it(''should be defined'', () => {\n    expect(service).toBeDefined();\n  });\n});\n```\n\n## Running Services\n\n```bash\n# Run specific service\npnpm dev:auth\npnpm dev:order\npnpm dev:product\n\n# Run all services\npnpm dev\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Always use DTOs** for request/response validation\n2. **Document with Swagger** decorators for API documentation\n3. **Use repository pattern** via Prisma services from `@projectx/db`\n4. **Handle errors** with NestJS built-in exceptions\n5. **Write tests** for services and controllers\n6. **Use guards** from `@projectx/core` for authentication\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:19:24.308Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Full-Stack Agents seeking to tame complexity with event-driven architectures and Temporal workflows","zh":"适合于使用事件驱动架构和 Temporal 工作流来应对复杂性的全栈代理","ja":"イベント駆動型アーキテクチャと Temporal ワークフローを使用して複雑さを抑えるフルスタックエージェントに最適","ko":"이벤트 驱動 型 아키텍처와 Temporal 워크플로를 사용하여 복잡성을 억제하는 풀스택 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes Full-Stack que buscan domar la complejidad con arquitecturas orientadas a eventos y flujos de trabajo Temporal","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Full-Stack cherchant à maîtriser la complexité avec des architectures orientées aux événements et des flux de travail Temporal","de":"Ideal für Full-Stack-Agents, die die Komplexität mit ereignisgesteuerten Architekturen und Temporal-Workflows zähmen möchten","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Full-Stack que buscam domar a complexidade com arquiteturas orientadas a eventos e fluxos de trabalho Temporal","ru":"Идеально для полнофункциональных агентов, стремящихся освоить сложность с помощью событийно-ориентированных архитектур и рабочих процессов Temporal","ar":"مثالي لعميل الخدمة الكاملة الذين يرغبون في ترويض التعقيد باستخدام هندسة مدفوعة بالأحداث وعمليات Temporal"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to develop scalable microservices using NestJS, integrating seamlessly with Temporal for workflow management and React for dynamic user interfaces, leveraging libraries like Passport for authentication and JWT for secure data exchange","zh":"赋予代理开发人员使用 NestJS 构建可扩展的微服务的能力，并将其无缝集成到 Temporal 中进行工作流管理和 React 中进行动态用户界面，利用 Passport 和 JWT 等库进行身份验证和安全数据交换","ja":"エージェントが NestJS を使用してスケーラブルなマイクロサービスを開発し、Temporal と React を統合してワークフロー管理と動的ユーザーインターフェイスを実現し、Passport と JWT などのライブラリを使用して認証とセキュアなデータ交換を行うことができるようにする","ko":"에이전트가 NestJS를 사용하여 확장 가능한 마이크로 서비스를 개발하고 Temporal 및 React와 통합하여 워크플로우 관리 및 동적 사용자 인터페이스를 구현하며 Passport 및 JWT와 같은 라이브러리를 사용하여 인증 및 보안 데이터 교환을 수행할 수 있도록 함","es":"Permite a los agentes desarrollar microservicios escalables utilizando NestJS, integrándose de forma transparente con Temporal para la gestión de flujos de trabajo y React para interfaces de usuario dinámicas, aprovechando bibliotecas como Passport para la autenticación y JWT para el intercambio de datos seguro","fr":"Permet aux agents de développer des microservices évolutifs en utilisant NestJS, en s''intégrant en toute transparence avec Temporal pour la gestion des flux de travail et React pour les interfaces utilisateur dynamiques, en exploitant des bibliothèques comme Passport pour l''authentification et JWT pour un échange de données sécurisé","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, skalierbare Microservices mit NestJS zu entwickeln, die nahtlos mit Temporal für die Workflow-Verwaltung und React für dynamische Benutzeroberflächen integriert werden, und Bibliotheken wie Passport für die Authentifizierung und JWT für den sicheren Datenaustausch nutzen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a desenvolver microsserviços escaláveis usando NestJS, integrando-se perfeitamente com Temporal para gerenciamento de fluxos de trabalho e React para interfaces de usuário dinâmicas, aproveitando bibliotecas como Passport para autenticação e JWT para troca de dados segura","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью разрабатывать масштабируемые микросервисы, используя NestJS, интегрируя их без проблем с Temporal для управления рабочими процессами и React для динамических пользовательских интерфейсов, используя библиотеки, такие как Passport для аутентификации и JWT для безопасного обмена данными","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من تطوير خدمات микرو قابلة للتوسيع باستخدام NestJS، وتكاملها بسلاسة مع Temporal لإدارة سير العمل و React لواجهات المستخدم الديناميكية، واستخدام مكتبات مثل Passport للتحقق من الصحة و JWT لتبادل البيانات الآمن"},"useCases":{"en":["Building event-driven architectures with NestJS microservices","Integrating Temporal workflows for robust application management","Implementing secure authentication mechanisms with Passport and JWT"],"zh":["使用 NestJS 微服务构建事件驱动架构","将 Temporal 工作流集成到应用程序管理中","使用 Passport 和 JWT 实现安全身份验证机制"],"ja":["NestJS マイクロサービスを使用してイベント駆動型アーキテクチャを構築する","Temporal ワークフローをアプリケーション管理に統合する","Passport と JWT を使用してセキュアな認証メカニズムを実装する"],"ko":["NestJS 마이크로 서비스를 사용하여 이벤트 驱动 型 아키텍처를 구축","Temporal 워크플로를 애플리케이션 관리에 통합","Passport 및 JWT를 사용하여 보안 인증 메커니즘을 구현"],"es":["Construir arquitecturas orientadas a eventos con microservicios NestJS","Integrar flujos de trabajo Temporal para una gestión de aplicaciones robusta","Implementar mecanismos de autenticación seguros con Passport y JWT"],"fr":["Construire des architectures orientées aux événements avec des microservices NestJS","Intégrer des flux de travail Temporal pour une gestion d''applications robuste","Mettre en œuvre des mécanismes d''authentification sécurisés avec Passport et JWT"],"de":["Ereignisgesteuerte Architekturen mit NestJS-Microservices erstellen","Temporal-Workflows integrieren für eine robuste Anwendungsverwaltung","Sichere Authentifizierungsmechanismen mit Passport und JWT implementieren"],"pt":["Construir arquiteturas orientadas a eventos com microsserviços NestJS","Integrar fluxos de trabalho Temporal para gerenciamento de aplicativos robusto","Implementar mecanismos de autenticação seguros com Passport e JWT"],"ru":["Построение событийно-ориентированных архитектур с микросервисами NestJS","Интеграция рабочих процессов Temporal для надежного управления приложениями","Реализация безопасных механизмов аутентификации с помощью Passport и JWT"],"ar":["بناء هندسة مدفوعة بالأحداث مع خدمات микرو NestJS","دمج سير العمل Temporal لإدارة تطبيقات قوية","تنفيذ آليات التحقق من الصحة الآمنة مع Passport و JWT"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires TypeScript and Node.js environment","Dependent on NestJS and Temporal compatibility"],"zh":["需要 TypeScript 和 Node.js 环境","依赖于 NestJS 和 Temporal 的兼容性"],"ja":["TypeScript と Node.js 環境が必要","NestJS と Temporal の互換性に依存する"],"ko":["TypeScript 및 Node.js 환경이 필요","NestJS 및 Temporal의 호환성에 의존"],"es":["Requiere entorno de TypeScript y Node.js","Dependiente de la compatibilidad de NestJS y Temporal"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement TypeScript et Node.js","Dépend de la compatibilité de NestJS et Temporal"],"de":["Benötigt eine TypeScript- und Node.js-Umgebung","Abhängig von der Kompatibilität von NestJS und Temporal"],"pt":["Requer ambiente TypeScript e Node.js","Dependente da compatibilidade do NestJS e Temporal"],"ru":["Требует среды TypeScript и Node.js","Зависит от совместимости NestJS и Temporal"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة TypeScript و Node.js","يعتمد على توافق NestJS و Temporal"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
