estion des schémas de base de données","Migrations de base de données","Service client Prisma","Support pour React et Temporal workflows","Architecture d''événements pilotée","Intégration avec NestJS"],"de":["Verwaltung von Datenbankschemata","Datenbankmigrationen","Prisma-Client-Dienst","Unterstützung für React und Temporal Workflows","Ereignisgesteuerte Architektur","Integration mit NestJS"],"pt":["Criação de esquemas de banco de dados","Realização de migrações","Gerenciamento de dados","Integração com React","Suporte a Temporal workflows","NestJS Prisma service"],"ru":["Создание схем базы данных","Выполнение миграций","Управление данными","Интеграция с React","Поддержка Temporal workflows","Сервис NestJS Prisma"],"ar":["إنشاء مخططات لقواعد البيانات","إجراء هجرات","إدارة البيانات","التكامل مع رياكت","دعم Temporal workflows","خدمة NestJS Prisma"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Prisma","数据库操作","Schema管理","Temporl工作流","React","事件驱动架构","NestJS","开发工具"],"ja":["Prisma","データベース操作","Schema管理","Temporlワークフロー","React","イベントドリブンアーキテクチャ","NestJS","開発ツール"],"ko":["Prisma","데이터베이스 연산","스키마 관리","Temporl 워크플로우","React","이벤트 드리븐 아키텍처","NestJS","개발 툴"],"es":["Prisma","Base de datos","Arquitectura de eventos","React","Temporal workflows","NestJS","Diseño de aplicaciones","Desarrollo de software","Gestión de datos"],"fr":["Prisma","Base de données","Architecture d''événements","React","Temporal workflows","NestJS","Conception d''applications","Développement de logiciels","Gestion de données"],"de":["Prisma","Datenbank","Ereignisgesteuerte Architektur","React","Temporal Workflows","NestJS","Anwendungsdesign","Softwareentwicklung","Datenverwaltung"],"pt":["Prisma","Banco de dados","Full-stack","React","Temporal workflows","NestJS","Gerenciamento de dados","Migrações","Esquemas de banco de dados"],"ru":["Prisma","База данных","Полная стека","React","Temporal workflows","NestJS","Управление данными","Миграции","Схемы базы данных"],"ar":["بريسما","قواعد البيانات","الطوابق الكاملة","رياكت","Temporal workflows","NestJS","إدارة البيانات","هجرات","مخططات لقواعد البيانات"]}},"owner":"proyecto26","repo":"projectx","repoPath":"proyecto26/projectx","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.419Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"prisma","description":"Prisma ORM and PostgreSQL database operations. Use when working with database schema, migrations, queries, or the @projectx/db package.","bodyPreview":"# Prisma Database Operations\n\n## Database Package Location\n\nThe Prisma schema and client are in `packages/db/`.\n\n## Schema Location\n\n```\npackages/db/\n├── prisma/\n│   ├── schema.prisma    # Database schema\n│   ├── migrations/      # Migration history\n│   └── seed.ts          # Seed script\n└── src/\n    └── lib/\n        ├── prisma.service.ts           # NestJS Prisma service\n        └── [model]/                    # Repository services\n            └── [model]-repository.service.ts\n```\n\n## Common Co","body":"# Prisma Database Operations\n\n## Database Package Location\n\nThe Prisma schema and client are in `packages/db/`.\n\n## Schema Location\n\n```\npackages/db/\n├── prisma/\n│   ├── schema.prisma    # Database schema\n│   ├── migrations/      # Migration history\n│   └── seed.ts          # Seed script\n└── src/\n    └── lib/\n        ├── prisma.service.ts           # NestJS Prisma service\n        └── [model]/                    # Repository services\n            └── [model]-repository.service.ts\n```\n\n## Common Commands\n\n```bash\n# Generate Prisma client after schema changes\npnpm prisma:generate\n\n# Create and apply migration (development)\npnpm prisma:migrate:dev\n\n# Apply migrations (production)\npnpm prisma:migrate\n\n# Seed the database\npnpm prisma:seed\n\n# Open Prisma Studio\npnpm --filter @projectx/db exec prisma studio\n```\n\n## Schema Patterns\n\n### Basic Model\n\n```prisma\nmodel Product {\n  id          String   @id @default(cuid())\n  name        String\n  description String?\n  price       Decimal  @db.Decimal(10, 2)\n  createdAt   DateTime @default(now())\n  updatedAt   DateTime @updatedAt\n\n  // Relations\n  categoryId  String\n  category    Category @relation(fields: [categoryId], references: [id])\n  orderItems  OrderItem[]\n\n  @@index([categoryId])\n  @@map(\"products\")\n}\n```\n\n### PostGIS Geometry Support\n\n```prisma\nmodel Location {\n  id        String   @id @default(cuid())\n  name      String\n  // PostGIS geometry stored as Unsupported type\n  point     Unsupported(\"geometry(Point, 4326)\")\n\n  @@map(\"locations\")\n}\n```\n\n### Enums\n\n```prisma\nenum OrderStatus {\n  PENDING\n  PROCESSING\n  SHIPPED\n  DELIVERED\n  CANCELLED\n}\n```\n\n## Repository Pattern\n\n### Creating a Repository Service\n\n```typescript\n// packages/db/src/lib/product/product-repository.service.ts\nimport { Injectable } from ''@nestjs/common'';\nimport { PrismaService } from ''../prisma.service'';\nimport { Prisma, Product } from ''@prisma/client'';\n\n@Injectable()\nexport class ProductRepositoryService {\n  constructor(private readonly prisma: PrismaService) {}\n\n  async findAll(params?: {\n    skip?: number;\n    take?: number;\n    cursor?: Prisma.ProductWhereUniqueInput;\n    where?: Prisma.ProductWhereInput;\n    orderBy?: Prisma.ProductOrderByWithRelationInput;\n  }): Promise<Product[]> {\n    return this.prisma.product.findMany(params);\n  }\n\n  async findById(id: string): Promise<Product | null> {\n    return this.prisma.product.findUnique({\n      where: { id },\n      include: { category: true },\n    });\n  }\n\n  async create(data: Prisma.ProductCreateInput): Promise<Product> {\n    return this.prisma.product.create({ data });\n  }\n\n  async update(id: string, data: Prisma.ProductUpdateInput): Promise<Product> {\n    return this.prisma.product.update({\n      where: { id },\n      data,\n    });\n  }\n\n  async delete(id: string): Promise<Product> {\n    return this.prisma.product.delete({ where: { id } });\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Query Patterns\n\n### Filtering and Pagination\n\n```typescript\nconst products = await prisma.product.findMany({\n  where: {\n    name: { contains: ''shirt'', mode: ''insensitive'' },\n    price: { gte: 10, lte: 100 },\n    category: { name: ''Clothing'' },\n  },\n  skip: 0,\n  take: 20,\n  orderBy: { createdAt: ''desc'' },\n  include: { category: true },\n});\n```\n\n### Transactions\n\n```typescript\nconst [order, inventory] = await prisma.$transaction([\n  prisma.order.create({ data: orderData }),\n  prisma.inventory.update({\n    where: { productId },\n    data: { quantity: { decrement: quantity } },\n  }),\n]);\n```\n\n### Raw SQL (for PostGIS)\n\n```typescript\nconst nearbyLocations = await prisma.$queryRaw`\n  SELECT id, name, ST_AsGeoJSON(point) as geojson\n  FROM locations\n  WHERE ST_DWithin(\n    point,\n    ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(${lng}, ${lat}), 4326)::geography,\n    ${radiusMeters}\n  )\n`;\n```\n\n## Migration Workflow\n\n1. **Modify schema.prisma** with your changes\n2. **Generate migration**: `pnpm prisma:migrate:dev --name descriptive_name`\n3. **Review migration** in `prisma/migrations/`\n4. **Test locally** before committing\n5. **Apply in production**: `pnpm prisma:migrate`\n\n## Seeding\n\n```typescript\n// packages/db/prisma/seed.ts\nimport { PrismaClient } from ''@prisma/client'';\n\nconst prisma = new PrismaClient();\n\nasync function main() {\n  // Upsert to avoid duplicates\n  await prisma.category.upsert({\n    where: { slug: ''electronics'' },\n    update: {},\n    create: {\n      name: ''Electronics'',\n      slug: ''electronics'',\n    },\n  });\n}\n\nmain()\n  .catch(console.error)\n  .finally(() => prisma.$disconnect());\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Use repository services** instead of direct Prisma calls in controllers\n2. **Always include `@@map`** for explicit table names\n3. **Add indexes** for frequently queried fields\n4. **Use transactions** for related operations\n5. **Name migrations descriptively** (e.g., `add_product_inventory`)\n6. **Validate data** at the application layer before database operations\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:19:25.998Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Full-Stack Agents seeking to streamline database operations with Temporal workflows and React integrations.","zh":"适合于希望使用 Temporal 工作流和 React 集成简化数据库操作的全栈代理人。","ja":"Temporal ワークフローと React 統合を使用してデータベース操作を簡素化したいフルスタック エージェントに最適です。","ko":"데이터베이스 작업을 Temporal 워크플로와 React 통합으로 간소화하려는 풀스택 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes Full-Stack que buscan optimizar las operaciones de base de datos con flujos de trabajo temporales y integraciones de React.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Full-Stack qui cherchent à rationaliser les opérations de base de données avec des flux de travail temporaires et des intégrations React.","de":"Ideal für Full-Stack-Agents, die Datenbankoperationen mit Temporal-Workflows und React-Integrationen optimieren möchten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Full-Stack que buscam otimizar operações de banco de dados com fluxos de trabalho Temporal e integrações React.","ru":"Идеально для полнофункциональных агентов, стремящихся оптимизировать операции базы данных с помощью рабочих процессов Temporal и интеграций React.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطبيق الكامل الذين يسعون لتبسيط عمليات قاعدة البيانات مع تدفقات العمل Temporal وتكاملات React."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage complex database schemas using Prisma, facilitating event-driven architecture and streamlined migrations with schema.prisma and seed.ts configurations, all while leveraging NestJS Prisma services for robust repository management.","zh":"赋予代理人使用 Prisma 管理复杂数据库模式的能力，促进事件驱动架构和简化迁移，使用 schema.prisma 和 seed.ts 配置，同时利用 NestJS Prisma 服务进行强大的存储库管理。","ja":"Prisma を使用して複雑なデータベーススキーマを管理し、イベント駆動型アーキテクチャと schema.prisma および seed.ts 構成を使用したマイグレーションの簡素化を促進し、NestJS Prisma サービスを使用した堅牢なリポジトリ管理を可能にします。","ko":"프리즈마를 사용하여 복잡한 데이터베이스 스키마를 관리할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 이벤트 驱动 아키텍처와 schema.prisma 및 seed.ts 구성으로 마이그레이션을 간소화하고, NestJS Prisma 서비스를 사용하여 강력한 저장소 관리를 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes gestionar esquemas de base de datos complejos utilizando Prisma, facilitando la arquitectura orientada a eventos y las migraciones optimizadas con configuraciones schema.prisma y seed.ts, todo mientras aprovecha los servicios Prisma de NestJS para una gestión robusta de repositorios.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer des schémas de base de données complexes en utilisant Prisma, facilitant l''architecture orientée événement et les migrations optimisées avec des configurations schema.prisma et seed.ts, le tout en exploitant les services Prisma de NestJS pour une gestion robuste des référentiels.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, komplexe Datenbankschemata mit Prisma zu verwalten, wodurch eine ereignisorientierte Architektur und optimierte Migrationen mit schema.prisma- und seed.ts-Konfigurationen ermöglicht werden, und zwar unter Ausnutzung der Prisma-Dienste von NestJS für eine robuste Repository-Verwaltung.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerenciem esquemas de banco de dados complexos usando Prisma, facilitando a arquitetura orientada a eventos e migrações otimizadas com configurações schema.prisma e seed.ts, aproveitando os serviços Prisma do NestJS para gerenciamento de repositório robusto.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять сложными схемами баз данных с помощью Prisma, облегчая событийно-ориентированную архитектуру и оптимизированные миграции с конфигурациями schema.prisma и seed.ts, используя при этом сервисы Prisma от NestJS для надежного управления репозиторием.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من إدارة مخططات قاعدة البيانات المعقدة باستخدام Prisma، و تسهيل هندسة التوجيه بالأحداث و الهجرة المُبسطة مع إعدادات schema.prisma و seed.ts، في حين الاستفادة من خدمات Prisma من NestJS لإدارة مستودع قوي."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating database migrations with Prisma migrations","Generating repository services for custom models","Debugging schema inconsistencies with schema.prisma"],"zh":["使用 Prisma 迁移自动执行数据库迁移","为自定义模型生成存储库服务","使用 schema.prisma 调试模式不一致"],"ja":["Prisma マイグレーションを使用してデータベースマイグレーションを自動化する","カスタムモデル用のリポジトリサービスを生成する","schema.prisma を使用してスキーマの不一致をデバッグする"],"ko":["프리즈마 마이그레이션을 사용하여 데이터베이스 마이그레이션을 자동화","사용자 지정 모델에 대한 저장소 서비스를 생성","schema.prisma를 사용하여 스키마 불일치를 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar las migraciones de base de datos con migraciones de Prisma","Generar servicios de repositorio para modelos personalizados","Depurar inconsistencias de esquema con schema.prisma"],"fr":["Automatiser les migrations de base de données avec les migrations Prisma","Générer des services de référentiel pour des modèles personnalisés","Déboguer les incohérences de schéma avec schema.prisma"],"de":["Automatisieren von Datenbankmigrationen mit Prisma-Migrationen","Generieren von Repository-Diensten für benutzerdefinierte Modelle","Debuggen von Schemainkonsistenzen mit schema.prisma"],"pt":["Automatizar migrações de banco de dados com migrações Prisma","Gerar serviços de repositório para modelos personalizados","Depurar inconsistências de esquema com schema.prisma"],"ru":["Автоматизировать миграции базы данных с помощью миграций Prisma","Генерировать сервисы репозитория для пользовательских моделей","Отлаживать несоответствия схемы с помощью schema.prisma"],"ar":["أتمتة هجرة قاعدة البيانات باستخدام هجرات Prisma","توليد خدمات المستودع للمodels المخصصة","تصحيح أخطاء عدم تطابق مخطط مع schema.prisma"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Prisma schema setup in packages/db/","NestJS environment necessary for Prisma service integration"],"zh":["需要在 packages/db/ 中设置 Prisma 模式","需要 NestJS 环境来集成 Prisma 服务"],"ja":["packages/db/ に Prisma スキーマを設定する必要がある","Prisma サービスを統合するために NestJS 環境が必要"],"ko":["packages/db/에 프리즈마 스키마를 설정해야 함","프리즈마 서비스를 통합하기 위해 NestJS 환경이 필요"],"es":["Requiere configuración de esquema Prisma en packages/db/","Entorno NestJS necesario para la integración del servicio Prisma"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de schéma Prisma dans packages/db/","Environnement NestJS nécessaire pour l''intégration du service Prisma"],"de":["Erfordert Prisma-Schema-Setup in packages/db/","NestJS-Umgebung erforderlich für die Prisma-Service-Integration"],"pt":["Requer configuração do esquema Prisma em packages/db/","Ambiente NestJS necessário para integração do serviço Prisma"],"ru":["Требуется настройка схемы Prisma в packages/db/","Необходимо окружение NestJS для интеграции сервиса Prisma"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد مخطط Prisma في packages/db/","بيئة NestJS ضرورية لدمج خدمة Prisma"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
