stion du chaos de la pile complète"],"de":["Verwaltung von Workflows und Aktivitäten","Ereignisarchitektur für Anwendungen","Integration mit React","Entwicklung von skalierbaren Anwendungen","Verwaltung des Chaos der vollständigen Stapel"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de workflows determinísticos","Orquestração de atividades em uma arquitetura de eventos","Integração com React para criar interfaces de usuário","Gerenciamento de trabalhadores e clientes","Suporte a escalabilidade e confiabilidade"],"ru":["Разработка детерминированных рабочих процессов","Оркестрация активностей в архитектуре событий","Интеграция с React для создания пользовательских интерфейсов","Управление работниками и клиентами","Поддержка масштабируемости и надежности"],"ar":["تطوير سير عمل محددة","توجيه الأنشطة في بنية الأحداث","التكامل مع React لإنشاء واجهات المستخدم","إدارة العمال والعملاء","دعم التوسيع والثبات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Temporal","工作流","事件驱动架构","React","全栈开发","Deterministic 函数","活动的编排"],"ja":["Temporal","ワークフロー","イベント駆動アーキテクチャ","React","フルスタック開発","Deterministic 関数","アクティビティのオーケストレーション"],"ko":["Temporal","워크플로","이벤트 驱动 아키텍처","React","풀스택 개발","Deterministic 함수","액티비티의 오케스트레이션"],"es":["desarrollo de aplicaciones","arquitectura de eventos","flujos de trabajo temporales","React","escalabilidad","gestión del caos","desarrollo de software","tecnologías de vanguardia"],"fr":["développement d''applications","architecture d''événements","flux de travail temporaires","React","évolution","gestion du chaos","développement de logiciels","technologies de pointe"],"de":["Anwendungsentwicklung","Ereignisarchitektur","temporale Workflows","React","Skalierbarkeit","Verwaltung des Chaos","Softwareentwicklung","SpitzenTechnologien"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de workflows","arquitetura de eventos","react","temporal","escalabilidade","confiabilidade","trabalhadores","clientes"],"ru":["разработка рабочих процессов","архитектура событий","react","temporal","масштабируемость","надежность","работники","клиенты"],"ar":["تطوير سير عمل","بنية الأحداث","react","زمني","توسيع","ثبات","عمال","عملاء"]}},"owner":"proyecto26","repo":"projectx","repoPath":"proyecto26/projectx","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.419Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"temporal","description":"Temporal workflow orchestration. Use when working with durable workflows, activities, or the order processing pipeline in packages/workflows.","bodyPreview":"# Temporal Workflow Development\n\n## Package Location\n\nTemporal workflows and activities are in `packages/workflows/`.\n\n```\npackages/workflows/\n├── src/\n│   ├── workflows/        # Workflow definitions\n│   ├── activities/       # Activity implementations\n│   ├── worker.ts         # Worker configuration\n│   └── client.ts         # Temporal client\n└── package.json\n```\n\n## Workflow Basics\n\nWorkflows are deterministic functions that orchestrate activities.\n\n### Defining a Workflow\n\n```typescript\n// p","body":"# Temporal Workflow Development\n\n## Package Location\n\nTemporal workflows and activities are in `packages/workflows/`.\n\n```\npackages/workflows/\n├── src/\n│   ├── workflows/        # Workflow definitions\n│   ├── activities/       # Activity implementations\n│   ├── worker.ts         # Worker configuration\n│   └── client.ts         # Temporal client\n└── package.json\n```\n\n## Workflow Basics\n\nWorkflows are deterministic functions that orchestrate activities.\n\n### Defining a Workflow\n\n```typescript\n// packages/workflows/src/workflows/order.workflow.ts\nimport {\n  proxyActivities,\n  sleep,\n  defineSignal,\n  setHandler,\n  condition,\n} from ''@temporalio/workflow'';\nimport type * as activities from ''../activities'';\n\nconst { processPayment, sendOrderConfirmation, updateInventory, notifyShipping } =\n  proxyActivities<typeof activities>({\n    startToCloseTimeout: ''5 minutes'',\n    retry: {\n      maximumAttempts: 3,\n      initialInterval: ''1 second'',\n      backoffCoefficient: 2,\n    },\n  });\n\nexport const cancelOrderSignal = defineSignal(''cancelOrder'');\n\nexport interface OrderWorkflowInput {\n  orderId: string;\n  customerId: string;\n  items: Array<{ productId: string; quantity: number }>;\n  total: number;\n}\n\nexport async function orderWorkflow(input: OrderWorkflowInput): Promise<string> {\n  let cancelled = false;\n\n  setHandler(cancelOrderSignal, () => {\n    cancelled = true;\n  });\n\n  // Step 1: Process payment\n  const paymentResult = await processPayment({\n    orderId: input.orderId,\n    amount: input.total,\n    customerId: input.customerId,\n  });\n\n  if (!paymentResult.success) {\n    return ''PAYMENT_FAILED'';\n  }\n\n  // Check for cancellation\n  if (cancelled) {\n    // Refund payment\n    await refundPayment({ paymentId: paymentResult.paymentId });\n    return ''CANCELLED'';\n  }\n\n  // Step 2: Update inventory\n  await updateInventory(input.items);\n\n  // Step 3: Send confirmation email\n  await sendOrderConfirmation({\n    orderId: input.orderId,\n    customerId: input.customerId,\n  });\n\n  // Step 4: Wait for shipping (with timeout)\n  await sleep(''1 hour'');\n  await notifyShipping({ orderId: input.orderId });\n\n  return ''COMPLETED'';\n}\n```\n\n## Activities\n\nActivities are the building blocks that perform actual work.\n\n### Defining Activities\n\n```typescript\n// packages/workflows/src/activities/payment.activities.ts\nimport Stripe from ''stripe'';\n\nconst stripe = new Stripe(process.env.STRIPE_SECRET_KEY!);\n\nexport interface ProcessPaymentInput {\n  orderId: string;\n  amount: number;\n  customerId: string;\n}\n\nexport interface ProcessPaymentResult {\n  success: boolean;\n  paymentId?: string;\n  error?: string;\n}\n\nexport async function processPayment(\n  input: ProcessPaymentInput\n): Promise<ProcessPaymentResult> {\n  try {\n    const paymentIntent = await stripe.paymentIntents.create({\n      amount: Math.round(input.amount * 100),\n      currency: ''usd'',\n      metadata: {\n        orderId: input.orderId,\n        customerId: input.customerId,\n      },\n    });\n\n    return {\n      success: true,\n      paymentId: paymentIntent.id,\n    };\n  } catch (error) {\n    return {\n      success: false,\n      error: error instanceof Error ? error.message : ''Payment failed'',\n    };\n  }\n}\n\nexport async function refundPayment(input: { paymentId: string }): Promise<void> {\n  await stripe.refunds.create({\n    payment_intent: input.paymentId,\n  });\n}\n```\n\n## Worker Setup\n\n```typescript\n// packages/workflows/src/worker.ts\nimport { Worker } from ''@temporalio/worker'';\nimport * as activities from ''./activities'';\n\nasync function run() {\n  const worker = await Worker.create({\n    workflowsPath: require.resolve(''./workflows''),\n    activities,\n    taskQueue: ''order-processing'',\n    connection: {\n      address: process.env.TEMPORAL_ADDRESS || ''localhost:7233'',\n    },\n  });\n\n  await worker.run();\n}\n\nrun().catch(console.error);\n```\n\n## Client Usage in NestJS\n\n```typescript\n// apps/order/src/order/order.service.ts\nimport { Injectable } from ''@nestjs/common'';\nimport { Client, Connection } from ''@temporalio/client'';\nimport { orderWorkflow, cancelOrderSignal } from ''@projectx/workflows'';\n\n@Injectable()\nexport class OrderService {\n  private client: Client;\n\n  async onModuleInit() {\n    const connection = await Connection.connect({\n      address: process.env.TEMPORAL_ADDRESS || ''localhost:7233'',\n    });\n    this.client = new Client({ connection });\n  }\n\n  async createOrder(orderData: CreateOrderDto): Promise<string> {\n    const orderId = generateOrderId();\n\n    // Start workflow\n    const handle = await this.client.workflow.start(orderWorkflow, {\n      taskQueue: ''order-processing'',\n      workflowId: `order-${orderId}`,\n      args: [{\n        orderId,\n        customerId: orderData.customerId,\n        items: orderData.items,\n        total: orderData.total,\n      }],\n    });\n\n    return orderId;\n  }\n\n  async cancelOrder(orderId: string): Promise<void> {\n    const handle = this.client.workflow.getHandle(`order-${orderId}`);\n    await handle.signal(cancelOrderSignal);\n  }\n\n  async getOrderStatus(orderId: string): Promise<string> {\n    const handle = this.client.workflow.getHandle(`order-${orderId}`);\n    const description = await handle.describe();\n    return description.status.name;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Query Workflow State\n\n```typescript\n// In workflow\nimport { defineQuery, setHandler } from ''@temporalio/workflow'';\n\nexport const getOrderStatusQuery = defineQuery<string>(''getOrderStatus'');\n\nexport async function orderWorkflow(input: OrderWorkflowInput): Promise<string> {\n  let status = ''PENDING'';\n\n  setHandler(getOrderStatusQuery, () => status);\n\n  status = ''PROCESSING_PAYMENT'';\n  await processPayment(/* ... */);\n\n  status = ''UPDATING_INVENTORY'';\n  await updateInventory(/* ... */);\n\n  // ...\n}\n\n// In client\nconst handle = client.workflow.getHandle(workflowId);\nconst status = await handle.query(getOrderStatusQuery);\n```\n\n## Docker Setup\n\nThe project includes Temporal in docker-compose.yml:\n\n```bash\n# Start Temporal server + UI\ndocker-compose up -d temporal temporal-ui\n\n# Access Temporal UI\nopen http://localhost:8080\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Keep workflows deterministic** - No direct I/O, random, or time-dependent operations\n2. **Use activities for side effects** - All external calls go in activities\n3. **Set appropriate timeouts** - Configure startToCloseTimeout for activities\n4. **Handle signals gracefully** - Check for signals at appropriate points\n5. **Use queries for state** - Don''t expose internal state directly\n6. **Version workflows** - Use workflow versioning for updates\n7. **Test workflows** - Use Temporal''s testing framework\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:19:48.248Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Event-Driven Agents needing advanced workflow orchestration capabilities with Temporal","zh":"适合需要使用Temporal实现高级工作流编排的事件驱动代理","ja":"Temporalを使用した高度なワークフロー管弦楽の機能が必要なイベント駆動エージェントに最適","ko":"Temporal을 사용하여 고급 워크플로우 오케스트레이션 기능이 필요한 이벤트 驅動 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Eventos que necesitan capacidades de orquestación de flujo de trabajo avanzadas con Temporal","fr":"Parfait pour les agents à événements nécessitant des capacités d''orchestration de workflow avancées avec Temporal","de":"Perfekt für Ereignisgesteuerte Agenten, die erweiterte Workflow-Orchestrierungsfunktionen mit Temporal benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Orientados a Eventos que necessitam de capacidades de orquestração de fluxo de trabalho avançadas com Temporal","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, ориентированных на события, которые требуют расширенных возможностей оркестровки рабочих процессов с помощью Temporal","ar":"مثالي لعميل الحدث الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتنسيق سير العمل مع Temporal"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to orchestrate activities using Temporal workflows, providing a deterministic event-driven architecture with React wizardry, leveraging workflow definitions, activity implementations, and worker configurations in TypeScript","zh":"赋予代理使用Temporal工作流来编排活动的能力，提供一种确定性的事件驱动架构，并利用TypeScript中的工作流定义、活动实现和工作人员配置，结合React的魔术","ja":"エージェントにTemporalワークフローを使用してアクティビティを管弦楽する機能を提供し、決定的なイベント駆動アーキテクチャを提供し、TypeScriptのワークフロー定義、活動実装、ワーカー構成を利用し、Reactの魔法を利用する","ko":"에이전트가 Temporal 워크플로우를 사용하여 활동을 오케스트레이션 할 수있는 기능을 제공하여 결정적 이벤트 驱动 아키텍처를 제공하고 TypeScript의 워크플로우 정의, 활동 구현 및 워커 구성 및 React의 마법을 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes para orquestar actividades utilizando flujos de trabajo de Temporal, proporcionando una arquitectura de eventos determinista con magia de React, aprovechando definiciones de flujo de trabajo, implementaciones de actividad y configuraciones de trabajadores en TypeScript","fr":"Permet aux agents d''orchestrer des activités à l''aide de flux de travail Temporal, fournissant une architecture d''événements déterministe avec des sorts de React, en exploitant les définitions de flux de travail, les implémentations d''activité et les configurations de travailleurs en TypeScript","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Aktivitäten mit Temporal-Workflows zu orchestrieren, wodurch eine deterministische ereignisgesteuerte Architektur mit React-Zauber bereitgestellt wird, die Workflow-Definitionen, Aktivitätsimplementierungen und Arbeitskonfigurationen in TypeScript nutzt","pt":"Habilite os agentes a orquestrar atividades usando fluxos de trabalho Temporal, fornecendo uma arquitetura orientada a eventos determinística com magia do React, aproveitando definições de fluxo de trabalho, implementações de atividades e configurações de trabalhador em TypeScript","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оркестровать hoạtности с помощью рабочих процессов Temporal, обеспечивая детерминированную событийную архитектуру с помощью магии React, используя определения рабочих процессов, реализации hoạtностей и конфигурации рабочих в TypeScript","ar":"يُمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تنسيق الأنشطة باستخدام سير عمل Temporal، مما يوفر هندسة حدثية محددة باستخدام سحر React، وستفيد من تعريفات سير العمل وتنفيذ الأنشطة وتكوين العمال في TypeScript"},"useCases":{"en":["Orchestrating complex workflows with Temporal","Implementing activity implementations in TypeScript","Configuring workers for event-driven architectures"],"zh":["使用Temporal编排复杂工作流","在TypeScript中实现活动实现","为事件驱动架构配置工作人员"],"ja":["Temporalを使用して複雑なワークフローを管弦楽する","TypeScriptで活動実装を実装する","イベント駆動アーキテクチャのためにワーカーを構成する"],"ko":["Temporal을 사용하여 복잡한 워크플로우를 오케스트레이션","TypeScript에서 활동 구현을 구현","이벤트 驱动 아키텍처를 위한 워커 구성"],"es":["Orquestar flujos de trabajo complejos con Temporal","Implementar implementaciones de actividad en TypeScript","Configurar trabajadores para arquitecturas de eventos"],"fr":["Orchestrer des flux de travail complexes avec Temporal","Implémenter des implémentations d''activité en TypeScript","Configurer des travailleurs pour des architectures d''événements"],"de":["Komplexe Workflows mit Temporal orchestrieren","Aktivitätsimplementierungen in TypeScript implementieren","Arbeiter für ereignisgesteuerte Architekturen konfigurieren"],"pt":["Orquestração de fluxos de trabalho complexos com Temporal","Implementação de implementações de atividades em TypeScript","Configuração de trabalhadores para arquiteturas orientadas a eventos"],"ru":["Оркестровка сложных рабочих процессов с помощью Temporal","Реализация реализаций hoạtностей на TypeScript","Конфигурация рабочих для событийных архитектур"],"ar":["تنسيق سير عمل معقدة مع Temporal","تنفيذ تنفيذات الأنشطة في TypeScript","تكوين العمال لهندسة الحدث"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Temporal workflow setup","TypeScript knowledge necessary","React wizardry integration needed"],"zh":["需要Temporal工作流设置","需要TypeScript知识","需要React魔术集成"],"ja":["Temporalワークフロー設定が必要","TypeScriptの知識が必要","Reactの魔法の統合が必要"],"ko":["Temporal 워크플로우 설정이 필요","TypeScript 지식이 필요","React의 마법 통합이 필요"],"es":["Requiere configuración de flujo de trabajo de Temporal","Conocimiento de TypeScript necesario","Integración de magia de React necesaria"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de flux de travail Temporal","Connaissances de TypeScript nécessaires","Intégration de sorts de React nécessaire"],"de":["Benötigt Temporal-Workflow-Setup","TypeScript-Kenntnisse erforderlich","React-Zauber-Integration erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer configuração de fluxo de trabalho Temporal","Conhecimento de TypeScript necessário","Integração de magia do React necessária"],"ru":["Требуется настройка рабочего процесса Temporal","Необходимо знание TypeScript","Необходима интеграция магии React"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد سير عمل Temporal","مطلوب معرفة TypeScript","مطلوبة تكامل سحر React"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
