ento de software","AI","qualidade","produtividade","refatoração","YAGNI","manutenção"],"ru":["правила кодирования","разработка программного обеспечения","AI","качество","производительность","рефакторинг","YAGNI","поддержка"],"ar":["قواعد الكودинг","التنمية البرمجية","AI","الجودة","الإنتاجية","إعادة هيكلة","YAGNI","الصيانة"]}},"owner":"shinpr","repo":"agentic-code","repoPath":"shinpr/agentic-code","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.419Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"coding-rules","description":"Applies coding standards for clean, maintainable code. Use when: writing functions, handling errors, refactoring, or reviewing code style.","bodyPreview":"# Development Rules\n\n## Language-Specific References\n\nFor language-specific rules, also read:\n- **TypeScript**: [references/typescript.md](references/typescript.md)\n\n## Basic Principles\n\n✅ **Aggressive Refactoring**\n- Continuously improve code structure and readability\n- Make code changes in small, safe steps\n- Prioritize maintainability over initial implementation speed\n\n❌ **Unused \"Just in Case\" Code** - YAGNI principle\n- Don''t write code for hypothetical future requirements\n- Delete unused fu","body":"# Development Rules\n\n## Language-Specific References\n\nFor language-specific rules, also read:\n- **TypeScript**: [references/typescript.md](references/typescript.md)\n\n## Basic Principles\n\n✅ **Aggressive Refactoring**\n- Continuously improve code structure and readability\n- Make code changes in small, safe steps\n- Prioritize maintainability over initial implementation speed\n\n❌ **Unused \"Just in Case\" Code** - YAGNI principle\n- Don''t write code for hypothetical future requirements\n- Delete unused functions, variables, and imports immediately\n- Keep codebase lean and focused on current needs\n\n## Comment Writing Rules\n\n- **Function Description Focus**: Describe what the code \"does\", not how it works\n- **No Historical Information**: Do not record development history in comments\n- **Timeless**: Write only content that remains valid whenever read\n- **Conciseness**: Keep explanations to necessary minimum\n- **Explain \"Why\"**: Comments should explain reasoning, not implementation details\n\n## Function Design\n\n**Parameter Management**\n- **0-2 parameters maximum**: Use structured data (object/struct/dict) for 3+ parameters\n  ```\n  ✅ Good: createUser({name, email, role})\n  ❌ Avoid: createUser(name, email, role, department, startDate)\n  ```\n  *Note: Use your language''s idiomatic approach for grouping parameters*\n\n**Dependency Injection**\n- **Inject external dependencies explicitly**: Ensure testability and modularity\n- Pass dependencies as parameters (functions, constructors, or other language-appropriate mechanisms)\n- Avoid global state, direct instantiation, or implicit dependencies\n- Prefer interfaces/contracts over concrete implementations where applicable\n\n## Error Handling\n\n**Absolute Rule**: Error suppression prohibited. All errors must have log output and appropriate handling.\n\n**Layer-Specific Error Handling**\n- **Presentation Layer**: Convert errors to user-friendly messages, log excluding sensitive information\n- **Business Layer**: Detect business rule violations, propagate domain-specific errors\n- **Data Layer**: Convert technical errors to domain errors\n\n**Structured Logging and Sensitive Information Protection**\nNever include sensitive information in logs:\n- Passwords, tokens, API keys, secrets\n- Credit card numbers, personal identification numbers\n- Any personally identifiable information (PII)\n\n**Asynchronous Error Handling**\n- Use appropriate error handling mechanisms for your language\n- Always log and appropriately propagate errors\n- Set up global error handlers where applicable\n\n## Clean Code Principles\n\n✅ **Recommended Practices**\n- Delete unused code immediately\n- Remove debug statements and temporary logging\n- Use meaningful variable and function names\n- Keep functions small and focused on single responsibility\n\n❌ **Avoid These Practices**\n- Commented-out code (use version control for history)\n- Magic numbers without explanation\n- Deep nesting (prefer early returns)\n- Functions that do multiple unrelated things\n\n## Refactoring Techniques\n\n**Basic Policy**\n- **Small Steps**: Maintain always-working state through gradual improvements\n- **Safe Changes**: Minimize the scope of changes at once\n- **Behavior Guarantee**: Ensure existing behavior remains unchanged while proceeding\n\n**Implementation Procedure**\n1. Understand Current State\n2. Make Gradual Changes\n3. Verify Behavior\n4. Final Validation\n\n**Priority Order**\n1. Duplicate Code Removal\n2. Large Function Division\n3. Complex Conditional Branch Simplification\n4. Architecture Improvement\n\n## Performance Considerations\n\n**General Principles**\n- Measure before optimizing (avoid premature optimization)\n- Focus on algorithmic complexity over micro-optimizations\n- Consider memory usage, especially with large datasets\n- Use appropriate data structures for the use case\n\n**Resource Management**\n- Properly close files, connections, and other resources\n- Be mindful of memory leaks in long-running applications\n- Use efficient algorithms for data processing\n\n## Code Organization\n\n**File Structure**\n- Group related functionality together\n- Separate concerns (business logic, data access, presentation)\n- Use consistent naming conventions throughout the project\n- Keep configuration separate from business logic\n\n**Modularity**\n- Write small, focused modules/functions\n- Minimize dependencies between modules\n- Use clear interfaces between components\n- Follow single responsibility principle\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:20:20.560Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Review Agents seeking to enforce systematic workflows and quality gates in AI-assisted development environments.","zh":"适用于代码审查代理，寻求在AI辅助开发环境中执行系统化工作流和质量门。","ja":"コードレビュー代理が、AIアシスト開発環境で体系的なワークフローと品質ゲートを実施しようとしている場合に適しています。","ko":"코드 리뷰 에이전트가 AI 보조 개발 환경에서 체계적인 워크플ロー와 품질 게이트를 시행하려고 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Revisión de Código que buscan implementar flujos de trabajo sistemáticos y puertas de calidad en entornos de desarrollo asistidos por inteligencia artificial.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Revue de Code cherchant à mettre en œuvre des flux de travail systématiques et des portes de qualité dans les environnements de développement assistés par l''intelligence artificielle.","de":"Ideal für Code-Review-Agenten, die systematische Workflows und Qualitätsprüfungen in von künstlicher Intelligenz unterstützten Entwicklungsumgebungen durchsetzen möchten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Revisão de Código que buscam impor fluxos de trabalho sistemáticos e portais de qualidade em ambientes de desenvolvimento assistidos por IA.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов контроля кода, стремящихся обеспечить системные рабочие процессы и ворота качества в средах разработки с поддержкой ИИ.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المراجعة الكودية الذين يسعون إلى إنفاذ تدفقات عمل منهجية وأبواب جودة في بيئات التطوير المدعومة بالذكاء الاصطناعي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement aggressive refactoring, adhere to the YAGNI principle, and enforce language-specific rules such as those for TypeScript, ensuring maintainable and efficient codebases through continuous improvement and deletion of unused code.","zh":"赋予代理实施激进的重构，遵循YAGNI原则，并执行特定语言的规则，例如TypeScript的规则，确保通过持续改进和删除未使用的代码来保持可维护和高效的代码库。","ja":"代理に積極的なリファクタリングの実施、YAGNI原則の遵守、TypeScriptなどの特定の言語のルールの適用を可能にし、継続的な改善と未使用コードの削除を通じて、維持可能で効率的なコードベースを保証します。","ko":"에이전트가 공격적인 리팩토링을 구현하고 YAGNI 원칙을遵守하며 TypeScript 등의 특정 언어 규칙을 적용할 수 있도록 해주어, 연속적인 개선과 사용하지 않는 코드의 삭제를 통해 유지 보수 가능하고 효율적인 코드베이스를 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar una refactorización agresiva, a adherirse al principio YAGNI y a hacer cumplir reglas específicas de lenguaje, como las de TypeScript, garantizando así bases de código mantenibles y eficientes a través de la mejora continua y la eliminación de código no utilizado.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre une refactoring agressive, d''adhérer au principe YAGNI et de faire respecter des règles spécifiques de langage, telles que celles de TypeScript, garantissant ainsi des bases de code maintenables et efficaces grâce à l''amélioration continue et à la suppression de code non utilisé.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, eine aggressive Refactoring durchzuführen, dem YAGNI-Prinzip zu folgen und sprachspezifische Regeln wie die von TypeScript durchzusetzen, um so wartbare und effiziente Codebasen durch kontinuierliche Verbesserung und Löschung ungenutzten Codes sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar uma refatoração agressiva, aderir ao princípio YAGNI e impor regras específicas de linguagem, como aquelas para TypeScript, garantindo bases de código mantidas e eficientes por meio de melhoria contínua e exclusão de código não utilizado.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовать агрессивную рефакторинг, следовать принципу YAGNI и обеспечить соблюдение языково-специфических правил, таких как для TypeScript, гарантируя поддерживаемые и эффективные кодовые базы посредством непрерывного совершенствования и удаления неиспользуемого кода.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تنفيذ إعادة هيكلة عنيفة والامتثال لمبدأ YAGNI وفرض قواعد محددة للغة مثل تلك الخاصة بلغة TypeScript، مما يضمن قواعد متابعة فعالة من خلال التحسين المستمر وحذف الشفرة غير المستخدمة."},"useCases":{"en":["Enforcing coding standards across large projects","Automating code reviews for adherence to quality gates","Implementing language-specific best practices for TypeScript development"],"zh":["在大型项目中执行编码标准","自动化代码审查以遵守质量门","实施TypeScript开发的语言特定最佳实践"],"ja":["大規模なプロジェクト全体でコーディング規範を実施する","コードレビューを自動化して品質ゲートに従う","TypeScript開発の言語特有のベストプラクティスを実施する"],"ko":["대규모 프로젝트에서 코딩 표준을 시행하는 것","코드 리뷰를 자동화하여 품질 게이트를 따르는 것","TypeScript 개발을 위한 언어 특정 최선의 관행을 구현하는 것"],"es":["Hacer cumplir los estándares de codificación en proyectos grandes","Automatizar las revisiones de código para el cumplimiento de las puertas de calidad","Implementar las mejores prácticas específicas de lenguaje para el desarrollo de TypeScript"],"fr":["Faire respecter les normes de codage dans les grands projets","Automatiser les revues de code pour le respect des portes de qualité","Mettre en œuvre les meilleures pratiques spécifiques de langage pour le développement TypeScript"],"de":["Durchsetzen von Codierungsstandards in großen Projekten","Automatisieren von Code-Reviews zur Einhaltung von Qualitätsprüfungen","Implementieren von sprachspezifischen Best Practices für die TypeScript-Entwicklung"],"pt":["Impor padrões de codificação em projetos grandes","Automatizar revisões de código para aderência aos portais de qualidade","Implementar as melhores práticas específicas de linguagem para desenvolvimento TypeScript"],"ru":["Обеспечение соблюдения стандартов кодирования в крупных проектах","Автоматизация проверок кода на соблюдение ворот качества","Реализация языково-специфических最佳 практик для разработки на TypeScript"],"ar":["إلزام معايير التشفير عبر المشاريع الكبيرة","توفير مراجعات التشفير اتوماتيكيا لامتثال لأبواب الجودة","تنفيذ أفضل الممارسات المحددة للغة من أجل تطوير بلغة TypeScript"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to specific language rules such as TypeScript guidelines","May necessitate significant upfront investment in setting up quality gates and workflows"],"zh":["需要遵守特定的语言规则，例如TypeScript指南","可能需要在设置质量门和工作流方面进行大量的前期投资"],"ja":["TypeScriptのガイドラインなどの特定の言語規則に従う必要がある","品質ゲートとワークフローを設定するための大量の前期投資が必要になる可能性がある"],"ko":["TypeScript 가이드라인 등의 특정 언어 규칙을 따르는必要가 있음","품질 게이트와 워크플로우를 설정하는 데 상당한 초기 투자가 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere la adhesión a reglas de lenguaje específicas, como las directrices de TypeScript","Puede necesitar una inversión significativa inicial para configurar las puertas de calidad y los flujos de trabajo"],"fr":["Nécessite l''adhésion à des règles de langage spécifiques, telles que les directives TypeScript","Peut nécessiter un investissement initial significatif pour configurer les portes de qualité et les flux de travail"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung von sprachspezifischen Regeln, wie den TypeScript-Richtlinien","Kann einen erheblichen vorherigen Investitionsaufwand für die Einrichtung von Qualitätsprüfungen und Workflows erfordern"],"pt":["Exige aderência a regras específicas de linguagem, como as diretrizes do TypeScript","Pode necessitar de um investimento significativo inicial para configurar portais de qualidade e fluxos de trabalho"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения конкретных языкових правил, таких как руководство по TypeScript","Может потребовать значительных первоначальных инвестиций для настройки ворот качества и рабочих процессов"],"ar":["يتطلب الامتثال للقواعد المحددة للغة مثل إرشادات TypeScript","قد يحتاج إلى استثمار كبير في البداية لتكوين أبواب الجودة وسير العمل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('proyecto26/projectx/react-router-v7', 'community', 'proyecto26', 'projectx', 'proyecto26/projectx', 'react-router-v7', 0, 0, 75, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.419Z', '2026-02-18T04:20:37.255Z', NULL, '{"id":"proyecto26/projectx/react-router-v7","name":"react-router-v7","description":{"zh":"React Router v7 是一个强大的路由库，帮助您构建复杂的单页应用。了解其项目结构和最佳实践","ja":"React Router v7 は強力なルーティングライブラリで、複雑なシングルページアプリケーションを構築するのに役立ちます。そのプロジェクト構造とベストプラクティスを学びましょう","ko":"React Router v7은 강력한 라우팅 라이브러리로서 복잡한 单页 애플리케이션을 구축하는 데 도움이 됩니다. 그 프로젝트 구조와 최적의 사용법을 익히세요","es":"React Router v7 es una herramienta para crear aplicaciones con arquitectura de eventos. Aprende a estructurar tu proyecto con las mejores prácticas.","fr":"React Router v7 est un outil pour créer des applications avec une architecture d''événements. Apprenez à structurer votre projet avec les meilleures pratiques.","de":"React Router v7 ist ein Werkzeug zum Erstellen von Anwendungen mit Ereignisarchitektur. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie Ihr Projekt mit den besten Praktiken strukturieren.","pt":"O React Router v7 é uma biblioteca poderosa para gerenciar rotas em aplicações React. Aprenda a usá-lo com SSR e Framework Mode","ru":"React Router v7 — это мощная библиотека для управления маршрутами в приложениях React. Узнайте, как использовать его с SSR и Framework Mode","ar":"رياكت روتر v7 هو مكتبة قوية لإدارة المسارات في التطبيقات رياكت. تعلم كيفية استخدامها مع SSR و Framework Mode","en":"Tame full-stack chaos with Temporal workflows and React wizardry, the ultimate event-driven architecture for your apps 🧙‍♂️✨"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"React Router v7 最佳实践","ja":"React Router v7 ベストプラクティス","ko":"React Router v7 최적의 사용법","es":"React Router v7: Mejores Prácticas","fr":"React Router v7: Bonnes Pratiques","de":"React Router v7: Best Practices","pt":"React Router v7: Melhores Práticas","ru":"React Router v7: Лучшие Практики","ar":"رياكت روتر v7: أفضل الممارسات","en":"react-router-v7"},"description":{"zh":"React Router v7 是一个强大的路由库，帮助您构建复杂的单页应用。了解其项目结构和最佳实践","ja":"React Router v7 は強力なルーティングライブラリで、複雑なシングルページアプリケーションを構築するのに役立ちます。そのプロジェクト構造とベストプラクティスを学びましょう","ko":"React Router v7은 강력한 라우팅 라이브러리로서 복잡한 单页 애플리케이션을 구축하는 데 도움이 됩니다. 그 프로젝트 구조와 최적의 사용법을 익히세요","es":"React Router v7 es una herramienta para crear aplicaciones con arquitectura de eventos. Aprende a estructurar tu proyecto con las mejores prácticas.","fr":"React Router v7 est un outil pour créer des applications avec une architecture d''événements. Apprenez à structurer votre projet avec les meilleures pratiques.","de":"React Router v7 ist ein Werkzeug zum Erstellen von Anwendungen mit Ereignisarchitektur. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie Ihr Projekt mit den besten Praktiken strukturie...","pt":"O React Router v7 é uma biblioteca poderosa para gerenciar rotas em aplicações React. Aprenda a usá-lo com SSR e Framework Mode","ru":"React Router v7 — это мощная библиотека для управления маршрутами в приложениях React. Узнайте, как использовать его с SSR и Framework Mode","ar":"رياكت روتر v7 هو مكتبة قوية لإدارة المسارات في التطبيقات رياكت. تعلم كيفية استخدامها مع SSR و Framework Mode","en":"Tame full-stack chaos with Temporal workflows and React wizardry, the ultimate event-driven architecture for your apps 🧙‍♂️✨"},"definition":{"en":"Tame full-stack chaos with Temporal workflows and React wizardry, the ultimate event-driven architecture for your apps 🧙‍♂️✨"},"features":{"zh":["文件基础路由","服务器端渲染（SSR）","框架模式","布局路由","admin 路由","页面组件"],"ja":["ファイルベースのルーティング","サーバーサイドレンダリング（SSR）","フレームワークモード","レイアウトルーティング","admin ルーティング","ページコンポーネント"],"ko":["파일 기반 라우팅","서버 측 렌더링（SSR）","프레임워크 모드","레이아웃 라우팅","admin 라우팅","페이지 컴포넌트"],"es":["Enrutamiento basado en archivos","Soporte para SSR (Server-Side Rendering)","Arquitectura de eventos","Estructura de proyecto organizada","Compatibilidad con Temporal workflows"," Mejores prácticas para aplicaciones React"],"fr":["Enrutamiento basado en archivos","Prise en charge du SSR (Server-Side Rendering)","Architecture d''événements","Structure de projet organisée","Compatibilité avec Temporal workflows","Meilleures pratiques pour les applications React"],"de":["Dateibasiertes Routing","Unterstützung für SSR (Server-Seitige Rendering)","Ereignisarchitektur","Organisierte Projektstruktur","Kompatibilität mit Temporal Workflows","Best Practices für React-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Suporte a SSR (Server-Side Rendering)","Modo Framework para aplicações escaláveis","Rotas baseadas em arquivos","Componentes de página e layout","Serviços de API integrados"],"ru":["Поддержка SSR (Server-Side Rendering)","Режим Framework для масштабируемых приложений","Маршруты на основе файлов","Компоненты страницы и макета","Интегрированные сервисы API"],"ar":["دعم SSR (Server-Side Rendering)","الوضع الإطار للتطبيقات القابلة للتوسيع","مسارات تستند إلى الملفات","مكونات الصفحة والتخطيط","خدمات API متكاملة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["React Router v7","单页应用","路由库","项目结构","最佳实践","服务器端渲染","框架模式","JavaScript 库"],"ja":["React Router v7","シングルページアプリケーション","ルーティングライブラリ","プロジェクト構造","ベストプラクティス","サーバーサイドレンダリング","フレームワークモード","JavaScript ライブラリ"],"ko":["React Router v7","单页 애플리케이션","라우팅 라이브러리","프로젝트 구조","최적의 사용법","서버 측 렌더링","프레임워크 모드","JavaScript 라이브러리"],"es":["React Router v7","arquitectura de eventos","Temporal workflows","SSR","enrutamiento basado en archivos","mejores prácticas React","desarrollo de aplicaciones","framework React"],"fr":["React Router v7","architecture d''événements","Temporal workflows","SSR","enrutamiento basado en archivos","meilleures pratiques React","développement d''applications","framework React"],"de":["React Router v7","Ereignisarchitektur","Temporal Workflows","SSR","dateibasiertes Routing","Best Practices React","Anwendungsentwicklung","React-Framework"],"pt":["React Router v7","SSR","Framework Mode","Rotas em React","Aplicações escaláveis","Desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["React Router v7","SSR","Режим Framework","Маршруты в React","Масштабируемые приложения","Веб-разработка"],"ar":["رياكت روتر v7","SSR","الوضع الإطار","مسارات في رياكت","تطبيقات قابلة للتوسيع","تطوير الويب"]}},"owner":"proyecto26","repo":"projectx","repoPath":"proyecto26/projectx","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.419Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"react-router-v7","description":"React Router v7 full-stack development with SSR. Use when working with routes, loaders, actions, SSR, Form components, fetchers, navigation guards, protected routes, URL search params, or the web app in apps/web.","bodyPreview":"# React Router v7 Best Practices\n\n## Project Structure\n\nThe frontend app is in `apps/web/` using React Router v7 with SSR (Framework Mode).\n\n```\napps/web/\n├── src/\n│   ├── routes/           # File-based routing\n│   │   ├── layouts/      # Layout routes (root, auth, admin)\n│   │   ├── admin/        # Admin routes\n│   │   └── _index.tsx    # Home page\n│   ├── pages/            # Page components\n│   ├── components/       # Shared components\n│   ├── services/         # API services (http.server.ts)","body":"# React Router v7 Best Practices\n\n## Project Structure\n\nThe frontend app is in `apps/web/` using React Router v7 with SSR (Framework Mode).\n\n```\napps/web/\n├── src/\n│   ├── routes/           # File-based routing\n│   │   ├── layouts/      # Layout routes (root, auth, admin)\n│   │   ├── admin/        # Admin routes\n│   │   └── _index.tsx    # Home page\n│   ├── pages/            # Page components\n│   ├── components/       # Shared components\n│   ├── services/         # API services (http.server.ts)\n│   ├── cookies/          # Session management (auth.server.ts)\n│   ├── lib/              # Utilities and helpers\n│   ├── root.tsx          # Root layout\n│   └── entry.server.tsx  # Server entry\n├── react-router.config.ts\n└── vite.config.ts\n```\n\n## File-Based Routing\n\nRoutes are defined by file structure in `src/routes/`:\n\n| File | Route |\n|------|-------|\n| `_index.tsx` | `/` |\n| `about.tsx` | `/about` |\n| `products.tsx` | `/products` |\n| `products.$id.tsx` | `/products/:id` |\n| `products._index.tsx` | `/products` (index) |\n| `auth.login.tsx` | `/auth/login` |\n| `admin/index.tsx` | `/admin` |\n| `$.tsx` | Catch-all (404) |\n\n### Layout Routes\n\n```\nroutes/\n├── layouts/\n│   ├── root-layout.tsx   # Root layout with Outlet\n│   └── auth-layout.tsx   # Auth layout (login/register)\n├── products.tsx          # Layout for /products/*\n├── products._index.tsx   # /products\n└── products.$id.tsx      # /products/:id\n```\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n**Framework Mode (This Project - Vite plugin with SSR)**:\n```ts\n// routes.ts\nimport { index, route, layout } from \"@react-router/dev/routes\";\n\nexport default [\n  layout(\"./routes/layouts/root-layout.tsx\", [\n    index(\"./routes/_index.tsx\"),\n    route(\"products/:pid\", \"./routes/products.$id.tsx\"),\n    route(\"admin/*\", \"./routes/admin/index.tsx\"),\n  ]),\n];\n```\n\n**Data Mode (Alternative for SPAs)**:\n```tsx\nimport { createBrowserRouter, RouterProvider } from \"react-router\";\n\nconst router = createBrowserRouter([\n  {\n    path: \"/\",\n    Component: Root,\n    ErrorBoundary: RootErrorBoundary,\n    loader: rootLoader,\n    children: [\n      { index: true, Component: Home },\n      { path: \"products/:productId\", Component: Product, loader: productLoader },\n    ],\n  },\n]);\n\nReactDOM.createRoot(root).render(<RouterProvider router={router} />);\n```\n\n## Route Configuration\n\n### Nested Routes with Outlets\n\n```tsx\ncreateBrowserRouter([\n  {\n    path: \"/dashboard\",\n    Component: Dashboard,\n    children: [\n      { index: true, Component: DashboardHome },\n      { path: \"settings\", Component: Settings },\n    ],\n  },\n]);\n\nfunction Dashboard() {\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <h1>Dashboard</h1>\n      <Outlet /> {/* Renders child routes */}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Dynamic Segments and Splats\n\n```tsx\n{ path: \"teams/:teamId\" }           // params.teamId\n{ path: \":lang?/categories\" }       // Optional segment\n{ path: \"files/*\" }                 // Splat: params[\"*\"]\n```\n\n## SSR-First Architecture (CRITICAL)\n\n**Core Principle**: Always use loaders for data fetching, actions for mutations.\n\n```tsx\n// app/routes/products.$id.tsx\nimport type { Route } from \"./+types/products.$id\";\n\n// ALWAYS use loaders for server-side data fetching\nexport async function loader({ params }: Route.LoaderArgs) {\n  const product = await fetchProduct(params.id);\n  if (!product) {\n    throw new Response(\"Not Found\", { status: 404 });\n  }\n  return { product };\n}\n\nexport function meta({ data }: Route.MetaArgs) {\n  return [\n    { title: data?.product.name ?? \"Product\" },\n    { name: \"description\", content: data?.product.description },\n  ];\n}\n\n// Component receives data via props (loaderData)\nexport default function ProductPage({ loaderData }: Route.ComponentProps) {\n  const { product } = loaderData;\n\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <h1>{product.name}</h1>\n      <p>{product.description}</p>\n      <span>${product.price}</span>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Authentication Utilities\n\nUse the auth utilities from `apps/web/src/cookies/auth.server.ts`:\n\n```tsx\nimport { getAuthSession, getAccessTokenOrRedirect, logoutRedirect } from \"~/cookies/auth.server\";\n\n// In loaders - get session with user info\nexport async function loader({ request }: Route.LoaderArgs) {\n  const session = await getAuthSession(request);\n\n  // Auto-redirect to login if not authenticated\n  const accessToken = await getAccessTokenOrRedirect(request);\n\n  // Use token for API calls\n  const data = await authRequest(''/api/orders'', accessToken);\n  return { data, user: session.user };\n}\n\n// In actions - logout\nexport async function action({ request }: Route.ActionArgs) {\n  return logoutRedirect(request);\n}\n```\n\n## HTTP Service Utilities\n\nUse utilities from `apps/web/src/services/http.server.ts`:\n\n```tsx\nimport { httpRequest, authRequest } from \"~/services/http.server\";\n\n// Public endpoints (no auth required)\nconst products = await httpRequest(''/api/products'');\n\n// Protected endpoints (auto-adds Bearer token)\nconst orders = await authRequest(''/api/orders'', accessToken);\n\n// With options\nconst data = await authRequest(''/api/data'', accessToken, {\n  method: ''POST'',\n  body: JSON.stringify(payload),\n});\n```\n\n**Features**:\n- Automatic 4-second timeout with retry support\n- Custom error handling with `errorHandler` option\n- Use `defaultResponse` pattern for graceful timeout handling\n\n## TanStack Query Integration (SSR Pattern)\n\nUse React Query ONLY for retry logic when loader times out:\n\n```tsx\nimport { useQuery } from \"@tanstack/react-query\";\n\nexport async function loader({ request }: Route.LoaderArgs) {\n  const session = await getAuthSession(request);\n  const data = await authRequest(''/api/stats'', session.accessToken);\n  return { stats: data ?? defaultResponse }; // defaultResponse on timeout\n}\n\nexport default function Dashboard({ loaderData }: Route.ComponentProps) {\n  // React Query with loader data as initialData\n  const { data: stats, isLoading } = useQuery({\n    queryKey: [\"dashboard-stats\"],\n    queryFn: () => fetch(\"/api/stats\").then((r) => r.json()),\n    initialData: loaderData.stats,\n    enabled: loaderData.stats === undefined, // Only fetch if loader timed out\n    staleTime: 60_000, // 1 minute\n  });\n\n  if (isLoading) return <Skeleton />;\n  return <StatsDisplay stats={stats} />;\n}\n```\n\n## Route with Action (Form Handling)\n\n```tsx\n// app/routes/products.new.tsx\nimport type { Route } from \"./+types/products.new\";\nimport { Form, redirect, useActionData } from \"react-router\";\n\nexport async function action({ request }: Route.ActionArgs) {\n  const formData = await request.formData();\n  const name = formData.get(\"name\") as string;\n  const price = parseFloat(formData.get(\"price\") as string);\n\n  // Server-side validation\n  const errors: Record<string, string> = {};\n  if (!name) errors.name = \"Name is required\";\n  if (isNaN(price)) errors.price = \"Valid price is required\";\n\n  if (Object.keys(errors).length) {\n    return { errors };\n  }\n\n  const product = await createProduct({ name, price });\n  return redirect(`/products/${product.id}`);\n}\n\nexport default function NewProduct({ actionData }: Route.ComponentProps) {\n  const errors = actionData?.errors;\n\n  return (\n    <Form method=\"post\">\n      <div>\n        <label htmlFor=\"name\">Name</label>\n        <input type=\"text\" name=\"name\" id=\"name\" />\n        {errors?.name && <span className=\"error\">{errors.name}</span>}\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <label htmlFor=\"price\">Price</label>\n        <input type=\"number\" name=\"price\" id=\"price\" step=\"0.01\" />\n        {errors?.price && <span className=\"error\">{errors.price}</span>}\n      </div>\n      <button type=\"submit\">Create Product</button>\n    </Form>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Component Library Integration\n\nUse components from `@projectx/ui`:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Button, Card, Input } from \"@projectx/ui\";\n\nexport default function ProductForm() {\n  return (\n    <Card>\n      <Form method=\"post\">\n        <Input label=\"Product Name\" name=\"name\" required />\n        <Button type=\"submit\">Save</Button>\n      </Form>\n    </Card>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Styling with Tailwind CSS v4\n\nUse utility classes and DaisyUI components:\n\n```tsx\nimport { classnames } from \"~/lib/classnames\"; // includes tailwind-merge\n\nexport default function ProductCard({ product }: { product: Product }) {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"card bg-base-100 shadow-xl\">\n      <div className=\"card-body\">\n        <h3 className=\"card-title text-lg font-semibold\">{product.name}</h3>\n        <p className=\"text-base-content/70\">{product.description}</p>\n        <span className=\"text-xl font-bold text-primary\">\n          ${product.price}\n        </span>\n        <div className=\"card-actions justify-end\">\n          <button className=\"btn btn-primary\">Buy Now</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n**DaisyUI Components**: `btn`, `card`, `alert`, `badge`, `modal`, `drawer`, `navbar`\n\n## Error Handling\n\n```tsx\nimport { isRouteErrorResponse, useRouteError } from \"react-router\";\n\nexport function ErrorBoundary() {\n  const error = useRouteError();\n\n  if (isRouteErrorResponse(error)) {\n    return (\n      <div className=\"alert alert-error\">\n        <h1>{error.status} {error.statusText}</h1>\n        <p>{error.data}</p>\n      </div>\n    );\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"alert alert-error\">\n      <h1>Something went wrong</h1>\n      <p>{error instanceof Error ? error.message : \"Unknown error\"}</p>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Navigation\n\n```tsx\nimport { Link, NavLink, useNavigate } from \"react-router\";\n\nfunction Navigation() {\n  const navigate = useNavigate();\n\n  return (\n    <nav className=\"navbar bg-base-100\">\n      {/* Basic link */}\n      <Link to=\"/products\" className=\"btn btn-ghost\">Products</Link>\n\n      {/* Active state styling */}\n      <NavLink\n        to=\"/products\"\n        className={({ isActive }) =>\n          classnames(\"btn btn-ghost\", isActive && \"btn-active\")\n        }\n      >\n        Products\n      </NavLink>\n\n      {/* Programmatic navigation */}\n      <button className=\"btn btn-primary\" onClick={() => navigate(\"/checkout\")}>\n        Go to Checkout\n      </button>\n    </nav>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Key Decision Points\n\n### Form vs Fetcher\n\n**Use `<Form>`**: Creating/deleting with URL change, adding to history\n**Use `useFetcher`**: Inline updates, list operations, popovers - no URL change\n\n### Loader vs useEffect\n\n**Use loader**: Data before render, server-side fetch, automatic revalidation\n**Use useEffect**: Client-only data, user-interaction dependent, subscriptions\n\n## Running the Frontend\n\n```bash\n# Development with HMR\npnpm dev:web\n\n# Build for production\npnpm build:web\n\n# Type checking\npnpm --filter web typecheck\n\n# Run Storybook for components\npnpm storybook\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **ALWAYS use loaders** for server-side data fetching (SSR-first)\n2. **ALWAYS use actions** for form submissions and mutations\n3. **Use `authRequest`/`httpRequest`** from services for API calls\n4. **Pass `initialData`** to React Query from loader data\n5. **Use `enabled: initialData === undefined`** to avoid duplicate requests\n6. **Handle errors** with ErrorBoundary components\n7. **Type routes** using the generated `+types` files\n8. **Use Form component** for progressive enhancement\n9. **Validate on server**, return errors via action\n10. **Keep components pure** - receive data via props\n\n## Additional Documentation\n\n- **Data Loading**: See [LOADERS.md](LOADERS.md) for loader patterns, parallel loading, search params\n- **Mutations**: See [ACTIONS.md](ACTIONS.md) for actions, Form, fetchers, validation\n- **Navigation**: See [NAVIGATION.md](NAVIGATION.md) for Link, NavLink, programmatic nav\n- **Advanced**: See [ADVANCED.md](ADVANCED.md) for error boundaries, protected routes, lazy loading\n\n## Mode Comparison\n\n| Feature | Framework Mode | Data Mode | Declarative Mode |\n|---------|---------------|-----------|------------------|\n| Setup | Vite plugin | `createBrowserRouter` | `<BrowserRouter>` |\n| Type Safety | Auto-generated types | Manual | Manual |\n| SSR Support | Built-in | Manual | Limited |\n| Use Case | Full-stack apps (this project) | SPAs with control | Simple/legacy |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:20:37.255Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full-Stack Agents needing advanced client-side routing with React Router v7 and Server-Side Rendering (SSR) capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级客户端路由的全栈代理，支持React Router v7和服务器端渲染（SSR）功能。","ja":"React Router v7とサーバーサイドレンダリング（SSR）機能を使用した高度なクライアントサイドルーティングが必要なフルスタックエージェントに最適です。","ko":"React Router v7 및 서버 측 렌더링(SSR) 기능을 사용하는 고급 클라이언트 측 라우팅이 필요한 풀스택 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Full-Stack que necesitan enrutamiento avanzado del lado del cliente con React Router v7 y capacidades de renderizado del lado del servidor (SSR).","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full-Stack nécessitant un routage avancé côté client avec React Router v7 et des capacités de rendu côté serveur (SSR).","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agents, die erweitertes Client-Seitiges Routing mit React Router v7 und Server-Seitiges Rendering (SSR)-Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full-Stack que necessitam de roteamento avançado do lado do cliente com React Router v7 e capacidades de Renderização do Lado do Servidor (SSR).","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Full-Stack, которым необходим продвинутый клиентский маршрутизация с React Router v7 и возможностями серверной отрисовки (SSR).","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء كامل الحزمة الذين يحتاجون إلى مسارات متقدمة على جانب العميل مع React Router v7 وقدرات تحرير الخادم (SSR)."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage complex routing scenarios with file-based routing, layout routes, and API services using React Router v7, while leveraging Server-Side Rendering (SSR) for enhanced performance and SEO optimization through Framework Mode.","zh":"赋予代理管理复杂路由场景的能力，使用React Router v7实现文件基于路由、布局路由和API服务，同时利用服务器端渲染（SSR）提高性能和SEO优化的框架模式。","ja":"React Router v7を使用してファイルベースのルーティング、レイアウトルーティング、およびAPIサービスを提供し、サーバーサイドレンダリング（SSR）を使用してパフォーマンスとSEOの最適化を実現するフレームワークモードを活用して、複雑なルーティングシナリオを管理できるようにエージェントをEmpowerします。","ko":"리액트 라우터 v7를 사용하여 파일 기반 라우팅, 레이아웃 라우팅 및 API 서비스를 제공하고 서버 측 렌더링(SSR)을 사용하여 성능과 SEO 최적화를 구현하는 프레임워크 모드를 통해 복잡한 라우팅 시나리오를 관리할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar escenarios de enrutamiento complejos con enrutamiento basado en archivos, rutas de diseño y servicios de API utilizando React Router v7, aprovechando al mismo tiempo el renderizado del lado del servidor (SSR) para un mejor rendimiento y optimización de SEO a través del modo de framework.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer des scénarios de routage complexes avec un routage basé sur des fichiers, des routes de disposition et des services d''API en utilisant React Router v7, tout en exploitant le rendu côté serveur (SSR) pour améliorer les performances et l''optimisation du référencement (SEO) via le mode framework.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, komplexe Routing-Szenarien mit dateibasiertem Routing, Layout-Routen und API-Diensten mit React Router v7 zu verwalten, während sie gleichzeitig das Server-Seitige Rendering (SSR) für verbesserte Leistung und SEO-Optimierung über den Framework-Modus nutzen.","pt":"Habilite os agentes a gerenciar cenários de roteamento complexos com roteamento baseado em arquivos, rotas de layout e serviços de API usando React Router v7, aproveitando a Renderização do Lado do Servidor (SSR) para melhorar o desempenho e a otimização do SEO por meio do Modo de Framework.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять сложными сценариями маршрутизации с помощью маршрутизации на основе файлов, маршрутов макета и сервисов API с использованием React Router v7, используя при этом серверную отрисовку (SSR) для повышения производительности и оптимизации SEO через Режим фреймворка.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إدارة سيناريوهات التوجيه المعقدة باستخدام التوجيه القائم على الملفات وطرق التصميم وخدمات API باستخدام React Router v7 ، مع الاستفادة من تحرير الخادم (SSR) لتحسين الأداء وتحسين تحسين محركات البحث من خلال وضع الإطار."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing file-based routing for scalable applications","Creating layout routes for authenticated and admin users","Optimizing server-side rendering for improved page load times"],"zh":["为可扩展应用程序实现文件基于路由","为已认证和管理员用户创建布局路由","优化服务器端渲染以提高页面加载时间"],"ja":["拡張可能なアプリケーション用のファイルベースのルーティングの実装","認証済みユーザーおよび管理者ユーザー用のレイアウトルーティングの作成","ページロード時間の向上のためのサーバーサイドレンダリングの最適化"],"ko":["확장 가능한 애플리케이션을 위한 파일 기반 라우팅 구현","인증된 사용자 및 관리자 사용자를 위한 레이아웃 라우팅 생성","페이지 로드 시간 개선을 위한 서버 측 렌더링 최적화"],"es":["Implementar enrutamiento basado en archivos para aplicaciones escalables","Crear rutas de diseño para usuarios autenticados y administradores","Optimizar el renderizado del lado del servidor para mejorar los tiempos de carga de página"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre un routage basé sur des fichiers pour des applications évolutives","Créer des routes de disposition pour les utilisateurs authentifiés et les administrateurs","Optimiser le rendu côté serveur pour améliorer les temps de chargement de page"],"de":["Implementierung von dateibasiertem Routing für skalierbare Anwendungen","Erstellung von Layout-Routen für authentifizierte und Administrator-Benutzer","Optimierung des Server-Seitigen Renderings für verbesserte Seitenladezeiten"],"pt":["Implementar roteamento baseado em arquivos para aplicações escaláveis","Criar rotas de layout para usuários autenticados e administradores","Otimizar a renderização do lado do servidor para melhorar os tempos de carregamento de página"],"ru":["Реализовать маршрутизацию на основе файлов для масштабируемых приложений","Создать маршруты макета для аутентифицированных и администраторских пользователей","Оптимизировать серверную отрисовку для улучшения времени загрузки страницы"],"ar":["تنفيذ توجيه قائم على الملفات لتطبيقات قابلة للتوسيع","إنشاء طرق تصميم لمستخدمين موثوق بهم ومسؤولين","تحسين تحرير الخادم لتحسين أوقات تحميل الصفحة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React Router v7 compatibility","Server-Side Rendering (SSR) setup required for full functionality"],"zh":["需要React Router v7兼容性","服务器端渲染（SSR）设置需要用于完整功能"],"ja":["React Router v7の互換性が必要","サーバーサイドレンダリング（SSR）の設定が完全な機能を使用するために必要"],"ko":["리액트 라우터 v7 호환성이 필요","서버 측 렌더링(SSR) 설정이 완전한 기능을 사용하는 데 필요"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con React Router v7","Configuración de renderizado del lado del servidor (SSR) necesaria para la funcionalidad completa"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité avec React Router v7","Configuration du rendu côté serveur (SSR) requise pour la fonctionnalité complète"],"de":["Benötigt Kompatibilität mit React Router v7","Server-Seitiges Rendering (SSR)-Einrichtung erforderlich für die vollständige Funktionalität"],"pt":["Exige compatibilidade com React Router v7","Configuração de Renderização do Lado do Servidor (SSR) necessária para funcionalidade completa"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с React Router v7","Настройка серверной отрисовки (SSR) необходима для полной функциональности"],"ar":["يتطلب توافقًا مع React Router v7","تتطلب إعداد تحرير الخادم (SSR) للوظائف الكاملة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
