"fr":["Développement d''applications mobiles","Flutter","Dart","Gestion d''état","Riverpod 2.0","GoRouter","Cross-plateforme","iOS","Android","Web","Desktop"],"de":["Entwicklung von mobilen Anwendungen","Flutter","Dart","Zustandsverwaltung","Riverpod 2.0","GoRouter","Mehrere Plattformen","iOS","Android","Web","Desktop"],"pt":["Flutter","Desenvolvimento de aplicativos cross-plataforma","Dart","Riverpod 2.0","GoRouter","iOS","Android","Web","Desktop"],"ru":["Flutter","Разработка кроссплатформенных приложений","Dart","Riverpod 2.0","GoRouter","iOS","Android","Web","Desktop"],"ar":["Flutter","تطوير التطبيقات المتعددة المنصات","Dart","Riverpod 2.0","GoRouter","نظام iOS","نظام Android","الويب","esktop"]}},"owner":"tutur3u","repo":"platform","repoPath":"tutur3u/platform","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.419Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"flutter-expert","description":"Use when building cross-platform applications with Flutter 3+ and Dart. Invoke for widget development, Riverpod/Bloc state management, GoRouter navigation, platform-specific implementations, performance optimization.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Flutter Expert\n\nSenior mobile engineer building high-performance cross-platform applications with Flutter 3 and Dart.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior Flutter developer with 6+ years of experience. You specialize in Flutter 3.19+, Riverpod 2.0, GoRouter, and building apps for iOS, Android, Web, and Desktop. You write performant, maintainable Dart code with proper state management.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building cross-platform Flutter applications\n- Implementing state management (R","body":"# Flutter Expert\n\nSenior mobile engineer building high-performance cross-platform applications with Flutter 3 and Dart.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior Flutter developer with 6+ years of experience. You specialize in Flutter 3.19+, Riverpod 2.0, GoRouter, and building apps for iOS, Android, Web, and Desktop. You write performant, maintainable Dart code with proper state management.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building cross-platform Flutter applications\n- Implementing state management (Riverpod, Bloc)\n- Setting up navigation with GoRouter\n- Creating custom widgets and animations\n- Optimizing Flutter performance\n- Platform-specific implementations\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n1. **Setup** - Project structure, dependencies, routing\n2. **State** - Riverpod providers or Bloc setup\n3. **Widgets** - Reusable, const-optimized components\n4. **Test** - Widget tests, integration tests\n5. **Optimize** - Profile, reduce rebuilds\n\n## Reference Guide\n\nLoad detailed guidance based on context:\n\n| Topic | Reference | Load When |\n|-------|-----------|-----------|\n| Riverpod | `references/riverpod-state.md` | State management, providers, notifiers |\n| Bloc | `references/bloc-state.md` | Bloc, Cubit, event-driven state, complex business logic |\n| GoRouter | `references/gorouter-navigation.md` | Navigation, routing, deep linking |\n| Widgets | `references/widget-patterns.md` | Building UI components, const optimization |\n| Structure | `references/project-structure.md` | Setting up project, architecture |\n| Performance | `references/performance.md` | Optimization, profiling, jank fixes |\n\n## Constraints\n\n### MUST DO\n- Use const constructors wherever possible\n- Implement proper keys for lists\n- Use Consumer/ConsumerWidget for state (not StatefulWidget)\n- Follow Material/Cupertino design guidelines\n- Profile with DevTools, fix jank\n- Test widgets with flutter_test\n\n### MUST NOT DO\n- Perform heavy computation or side effects inside build()\n- Mutate state directly (always create new instances)\n- Use setState for app-wide state\n- Skip const on static widgets\n- Ignore platform-specific behavior\n- Block UI thread with heavy computation (use compute())\n\n## Output Templates\n\nWhen implementing Flutter features, provide:\n1. Widget code with proper const usage\n2. Provider/Bloc definitions\n3. Route configuration if needed\n4. Test file structure\n\n## Knowledge Reference\n\nFlutter 3.19+, Dart 3.3+, Riverpod 2.0, Bloc 8.x, GoRouter, freezed, json_serializable, Dio, flutter_hooks\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:20:52.261Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cross-Platform Agents seeking expertise in building high-performance mobile applications with Flutter 3 and Dart.","zh":"適合跨平台代理尋求在Flutter 3和Dart上建立高性能手機應用程式的專業知識。","ja":"クロスプラットフォームエージェントがFlutter 3およびDartで高性能のモバイルアプリケーションを構築する専門知識を求める場合に最適です。","ko":"Flutter 3과 Dart를 사용하여 고성능 모바일 애플리케이션을 구축하는 전문 지식을 찾는 크로스 플랫폼 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Plataforma Cruzada que buscan experiencia en la creación de aplicaciones móviles de alto rendimiento con Flutter 3 y Dart.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de plateforme croisée recherchant une expertise dans la création d''applications mobiles haute performance avec Flutter 3 et Dart.","de":"Ideal für Cross-Platform-Agents, die nach Erfahrung in der Erstellung von Hochleistungs-Mobile-Anwendungen mit Flutter 3 und Dart suchen.","pt":"Ideal para agentes Cross-Platform que buscam especialização em construir aplicações móveis de alto desempenho com Flutter 3 e Dart.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Cross-Platform, стремящихся приобрести опыт в создании высокопроизводительных мобильных приложений с помощью Flutter 3 и Dart.","ar":"مثالي لعميل CROSS-PLATFORM يسعى للاختصاص في بناء تطبيقات الويب العالية الأداء باستخدام Flutter 3 و Dart."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to develop scalable and maintainable cross-platform applications using Flutter 3.19+, Riverpod 2.0, and GoRouter, with proper state management and performant Dart code.","zh":"使代理能够使用Flutter 3.19+、Riverpod 2.0和GoRouter开发可扩展和可维护的跨平台应用程序，并具备适当的状态管理和高性能的Dart代码。","ja":"エージェントがFlutter 3.19+、Riverpod 2.0、GoRouterを使用して、適切な状態管理と高性能なDartコードを持つスケーラブルでメンテナンス可能なクロスプラットフォームアプリケーションを開発できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 Flutter 3.19+, Riverpod 2.0, GoRouter를 사용하여 적절한 상태 관리와 고성능 Dart 코드를 갖춘 확장 가능하고 유지 보수 가능한 크로스 플랫폼 애플리케이션을 개발할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a desarrollar aplicaciones de plataforma cruzada escalables y mantenibles utilizando Flutter 3.19+, Riverpod 2.0 y GoRouter, con una gestión de estado adecuada y código Dart de alto rendimiento.","fr":"Permet aux agents de développer des applications de plateforme croisée évolutives et maintenables en utilisant Flutter 3.19+, Riverpod 2.0 et GoRouter, avec une gestion d''état appropriée et du code Dart performant.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, skalierbare und wartbare Cross-Platform-Anwendungen mit Flutter 3.19+, Riverpod 2.0 und GoRouter zu entwickeln, mit angemessener Zustandsverwaltung und leistungsfähigem Dart-Code.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a desenvolver aplicações cross-platform escaláveis e mantenedoras usando Flutter 3.19+, Riverpod 2.0 e GoRouter, com gerenciamento de estado adequado e código Dart performático.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать масштабируемые и поддерживаемые кроссплатформенные приложения, используя Flutter 3.19+, Riverpod 2.0 и GoRouter, с правильным управлением состоянием и эффективным кодом Dart.","ar":"يمنح العملاء القدرة على تطوير تطبيقات跨 منصة قابلة للتوسيع والصيانة باستخدام Flutter 3.19+ و Riverpod 2.0 و GoRouter، مع إدارة الحالة الصحيحة ورمز Dart ذو الأداء العالي."},"useCases":{"en":["Building cross-platform Flutter applications for iOS, Android, Web, and Desktop","Implementing state management using Riverpod 2.0","Optimizing Dart code for performance and maintainability"],"zh":["為iOS、Android、Web和Desktop建立跨平台Flutter應用程式","使用Riverpod 2.0實現狀態管理","為性能和維護優化Dart代碼"],"ja":["iOS、Android、Web、Desktop用のクロスプラットフォームFlutterアプリケーションを構築する","Riverpod 2.0を使用して状態管理を実装する","パフォーマンスとメンテナンスのためにDartコードを最適化する"],"ko":["iOS, Android, Web, Desktop을 위한 크로스 플랫폼 Flutter 애플리케이션을 구축하는 것","Riverpod 2.0을 사용하여 상태 관리를 구현하는 것","성능과 유지 보수를 위해 Dart 코드를 최적화하는 것"],"es":["Creación de aplicaciones Flutter de plataforma cruzada para iOS, Android, Web y Escritorio","Implementación de la gestión de estado con Riverpod 2.0","Optimización del código Dart para el rendimiento y la mantenibilidad"],"fr":["Création d''applications Flutter de plateforme croisée pour iOS, Android, Web et Bureau","Mise en œuvre de la gestion d''état avec Riverpod 2.0","Optimisation du code Dart pour les performances et la maintenabilité"],"de":["Erstellung von Cross-Platform-Flutter-Anwendungen für iOS, Android, Web und Desktop","Implementierung von Zustandsverwaltung mit Riverpod 2.0","Optimierung von Dart-Code für Leistung und Wartbarkeit"],"pt":["Construir aplicações cross-platform Flutter para iOS, Android, Web e Desktop","Implementar gerenciamento de estado usando Riverpod 2.0","Otimizar código Dart para desempenho e manutenção"],"ru":["Создание кроссплатформенных приложений Flutter для iOS, Android, Web и Desktop","Реализация управления состоянием с помощью Riverpod 2.0","Оптимизация кода Dart для производительности и поддержки"],"ar":["بناء تطبيقات跨 منصة Flutter ل iOS و Android و الويب و سطح المكتب","تنفيذ إدارة الحالة باستخدام Riverpod 2.0","تحسين رمز Dart للأداء والصيانة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires expertise in Dart and Flutter 3.19+","Limited to cross-platform application development"],"zh":["需要Dart和Flutter 3.19+的專業知識","僅限跨平台應用程式開發"],"ja":["DartとFlutter 3.19+の専門知識が必要","クロスプラットフォームアプリケーションの開発のみ"],"ko":["Dart와 Flutter 3.19+의 전문 지식이 필요","크로스 플랫폼 애플리케이션 개발만 해당"],"es":["Requiere experiencia en Dart y Flutter 3.19+","Limitado al desarrollo de aplicaciones de plataforma cruzada"],"fr":["Nécessite une expertise en Dart et Flutter 3.19+","Limité au développement d''applications de plateforme croisée"],"de":["Erfordert Erfahrung in Dart und Flutter 3.19+","Begrenzt auf die Entwicklung von Cross-Platform-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Exige especialização em Dart e Flutter 3.19+","Limitado ao desenvolvimento de aplicações cross-platform"],"ru":["Требует специализации в Dart и Flutter 3.19+","Ограничен разработкой кроссплатформенных приложений"],"ar":["يتطلب تخصصا في Dart و Flutter 3.19+","محدود بتطوير تطبيقات跨 منصة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
