Autumn Add Payments es una herramienta que automatiza el proceso de pago, incluyendo checkout, actualizaciones y cancelaciones","fr":"Autumn Add Payments est un outil qui automatise le processus de paiement, y compris la vérification, les mises à jour et les annulations","de":"Autumn Add Payments ist ein Tool, das den Zahlungsprozess automatisiert, einschließlich Checkout, Upgrades und Stornierungen","pt":"Autumn é uma solução de pagamento que automatiza o checkout, upgrades e cancelamentos.","ru":"Осень - это решение для платежей, которое автоматизирует checkout, апгрейды и отмены.","ar":"أوتومن هو حل دفع يأتمتة الفواتير وتحسينات الإصدار والإلغاء.","en":"Turn Your Work Into Content"},"definition":{"en":"Turn Your Work Into Content"},"features":{"zh":["自动处理 Stripe 结账","支持升级、降级和取消操作","提供 Stripe 结账 URL 和预览数据","确认购买时附加卡信息","支持返回客户的预览数据"],"ja":["Stripe のチェックアウトを自動的に処理","アップグレード、ダウングレード、キャンセルをサポート","Stripe のチェックアウト URL とプレビューデータを提供","購入を確認するときにカード情報を付加","リターン顧客のプレビューデータをサポート"],"ko":["스트라잎 결제를 자동으로 처리","업그레이드, 다운그레이드, 취소를 지원","스트라잎 결제 URL과预览 데이터를 제공","구매를 확인할 때 카드 정보를 부착","반환 고객의预览 데이터를 지원"],"es":["Checkout automático","Actualizaciones y downgrades automáticos","Cancelaciones automáticas","Integración con Stripe","Soporte para clientes recurrentes","Documentación y ejemplos de código"],"fr":["Vérification automatique","Mises à jour et downgrades automatiques","Annulations automatiques","Intégration avec Stripe","Prise en charge des clients récurrents","Documentation et exemples de code"],"de":["Automatischer Checkout","Automatische Upgrades und Downgrades","Automatische Stornierungen","Integration mit Stripe","Unterstützung für wiederkehrende Kunden","Dokumentation und Codebeispiele"],"pt":["Checkout automático","Integração com Stripe","Gerenciamento de assinaturas","Cancelamentos automáticos","Upgrade e downgrade de planos"],"ru":["Автоматический checkout","Интеграция со Stripe","Управление подписками","Автоматические отмены","Апгрейд и даунгрейд планов"],"ar":["فواتير آلية","دمج مع ستريب","إدارة الاشتراكات","إلغاء آلي","تحسين الإصدار وتخفيض الخطة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Autumn 添加支付功能","Stripe 结账","自动化支付流程","升级、降级和取消操作","支付网关","电子商务解决方案"],"ja":["Autumn の支払い機能","Stripe のチェックアウト","自動化された支払いプロセス","アップグレード、ダウングレード、キャンセル","支払いゲートウェイ","電子商取引ソリューション"],"ko":["Autumn 결제 기능","스트라잎 결제","자동화된 결제 프로세스","업그레이드, 다운그레이드, 취소","결제 게이트웨이","전자상거래 솔루션"],"es":["pagos automáticos","integración de pagos","API de pagos","checkout automático","stripe","desarrollo de aplicaciones","autumn add payments","pagos en línea","procesamiento de pagos"],"fr":["paiements automatiques","intégration de paiements","API de paiements","vérification automatique","stripe","développement d''applications","autumn add payments","paiements en ligne","traitement de paiements"],"de":["automatisierte Zahlungen","Zahlungsintegration","Zahlungs-API","automatischer Checkout","stripe","Anwendungsentwicklung","autumn add payments","Online-Zahlungen","Zahlungsverarbeitung"],"pt":["autumn add payments","integração de pagamentos","checkout automático","gerenciamento de assinaturas","cancelamentos automáticos","stripe","desenvolvimento de pagamentos"],"ru":["осень добавить платежи","интеграция платежей","автоматический checkout","управление подписками","автоматические отмены","stripe","разработка платежей"],"ar":["أوتومن أضف مدفوعات","دمج المدفوعات","فواتير آلية","إدارة الاشتراكات","إلغاء آلي","ستريب","تطوير المدفوعات"]}},"owner":"usenotra","repo":"notra","repoPath":"usenotra/notra","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.419Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"autumn-add-payments","description":"Skill for adding Stripe checkout and payment flows using Autumn.","bodyPreview":"# Autumn Payments\n\n**Always consult [docs.useautumn.com](https://docs.useautumn.com) for code examples and latest API.**\n\nAutumn handles Stripe checkout, upgrades, downgrades, and cancellations automatically.\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Payment Flow\n1. `checkout` - Returns Stripe URL (new) or preview data (returning customer)\n2. `attach` - Confirms purchase when card already on file\n\n### Checkout Result\n\n| Field | Description |\n|-------|-------------|\n| `url` | Stripe checkout URL (null if car","body":"# Autumn Payments\n\n**Always consult [docs.useautumn.com](https://docs.useautumn.com) for code examples and latest API.**\n\nAutumn handles Stripe checkout, upgrades, downgrades, and cancellations automatically.\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Payment Flow\n1. `checkout` - Returns Stripe URL (new) or preview data (returning customer)\n2. `attach` - Confirms purchase when card already on file\n\n### Checkout Result\n\n| Field | Description |\n|-------|-------------|\n| `url` | Stripe checkout URL (null if card on file) |\n| `product` | Target product with scenario |\n| `current_product` | Customer''s current product |\n| `lines` | Invoice line items |\n| `total` | Amount in major currency units |\n| `currency` | Currency code |\n\n---\n\n## Product Scenarios\n\n| Scenario | Meaning | Action |\n|----------|---------|--------|\n| `new` | Not subscribed | Subscribe |\n| `active` | Current plan | Current Plan |\n| `scheduled` | Scheduled | Already Scheduled |\n| `upgrade` | Higher tier | Upgrade |\n| `downgrade` | Lower tier | Downgrade |\n| `renew` | Cancelled | Renew |\n\n---\n\n## React Implementation\n\n```tsx\nimport { useCustomer, usePricingTable } from \"autumn-js/react\";\n\nconst { checkout, attach } = useCustomer();\nconst { products } = usePricingTable();\n\n// Checkout flow\nconst data = await checkout({ productId: \"pro\" });\nif (data.url) {\n  window.location.href = data.url;  // New customer\n} else {\n  // Show confirmation dialog, then:\n  await attach({ productId: \"pro\" });\n}\n\n// Cancel\nconst { cancel } = useCustomer();\nawait cancel({ productId: \"pro\" });\n// Or downgrade to free:\nawait attach({ productId: \"free\" });\n```\n\n---\n\n## Backend Implementation\n\n```typescript\nimport { Autumn } from \"autumn-js\";\n\nconst autumn = new Autumn({ secretKey: process.env.AUTUMN_SECRET_KEY });\n\n// Checkout\nconst { data } = await autumn.checkout({ customer_id, product_id: \"pro\" });\nif (data.url) return redirect(data.url);\n\n// Attach (after user confirms)\nawait autumn.attach({ customer_id, product_id: \"pro\" });\n\n// Get products with scenarios\nconst { data: productsData } = await autumn.products.list({ customer_id });\n```\n\n---\n\n## Prepaid Pricing\n\nFor seat-based or prepaid products, pass quantities:\n\n```typescript\nawait autumn.checkout({\n  customer_id,\n  product_id: \"credits_pack\",\n  options: [{ feature_id: \"credits\", quantity: 500 }],\n});\n```\n\n---\n\n## Button Text Pattern\n\n```typescript\nfunction getButtonText(product: Product): string {\n  const { scenario, properties } = product;\n  if (properties?.has_trial) return \"Start Trial\";\n  if (scenario === \"active\") return \"Current Plan\";\n  \n  const text = { upgrade: \"Upgrade\", downgrade: \"Downgrade\", new: \"Subscribe\" };\n  return text[scenario] ?? \"Enable\";\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Common Gotchas\n\n1. **URL field** - It''s `data.url`, not `data.checkout_url`\n2. **Don''t build custom logic** - Use `products.list` for scenarios\n3. **Proration automatic** - Autumn handles upgrade/downgrade proration\n4. **Cancel via free** - Prefer attaching free plan over hard cancel\n5. **Success URL** - Pass `success_url` to redirect after Stripe checkout\n\n---\n\n## Resources\n\n- [Checkout Docs](https://docs.useautumn.com/api-reference/core/checkout)\n- [Attach Docs](https://docs.useautumn.com/api-reference/core/attach)\n- [LLMs.txt](https://docs.useautumn.com/llms.txt)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:20:47.334Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for E-commerce Agents needing automated payment processing with Stripe checkout and subscription management.","zh":"非常适合需要使用Stripe checkout和订阅管理进行自动化支付处理的电子商务代理。","ja":"ストライプのチェックアウトとサブスクリプション管理を使用した自動化された支払い処理を必要とする電子商取引エージェントに最適です。","ko":"스트라이프 체크아웃 및 구독 관리를 사용한 자동화된 결제 처리가 필요한 전자상거래 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de comercio electrónico que necesitan procesamiento de pagos automatizado con checkout y gestión de suscripciones de Stripe.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de commerce électronique ayant besoin d''un traitement de paiement automatisé avec la fonction de checkout et la gestion d''abonnement de Stripe.","de":"Perfekt für E-Commerce-Agents, die ein automatisiertes Zahlungsverarbeitungssystem mit Stripe-Checkout und Abonnementsverwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Comércio Eletrônico que precisam de processamento de pagamento automatizado com checkout e gerenciamento de assinatura da Stripe.","ru":"Идеально для агентов электронной коммерции, которым требуется автоматизированная обработка платежей с помощью Stripe checkout и управления подписками.","ar":"مثالي لوسائل إدارة التجارة الإلكترونية التي تحتاج إلى معالجة الدفع الآلي مع نظام الدفع من Stripe وإدارة الاشتراك"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to handle Stripe checkout, upgrades, downgrades, and cancellations automatically, leveraging the Autumn API for seamless payment flow and card management, including `checkout` and `attach` functionalities.","zh":"赋予代理自动处理Stripe checkout、升级、降级和取消的能力，利用Autumn API实现无缝的支付流程和卡管理，包括`checkout`和`attach`功能。","ja":"ストライプのチェックアウト、アップグレード、ダウングレード、キャンセルを自動的に処理するエージェントを可能にし、Autumn APIを使用して無шовな支払いフローとカード管理を実現し、`checkout`および`attach`機能を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 스트라이프 체크아웃, 업그레이드, 다운그레이드 및 취소를 자동으로 처리할 수 있도록 하며, Autumn API를 사용하여 무결점의 결제 흐름 및 카드 관리를 구현하며, `체크 아웃` 및 `첨부` 기능을 포함합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a manejar el checkout de Stripe, actualizaciones, degradaciones y cancelaciones de forma automática, aprovechando la API de Autumn para un flujo de pago y gestión de tarjetas sin problemas, incluyendo las funcionalidades `checkout` y `attach`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer le checkout de Stripe, les mises à niveau, les dégradations et les annulations de manière automatique, en exploitant l''API Autumn pour un flux de paiement et une gestion de cartes sans interruption, y compris les fonctionnalités `checkout` et `attach`.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, den Stripe-Checkout, Upgrades, Downgrades und Stornierungen automatisch zu verwalten, indem sie die Autumn-API für einen nahtlosen Zahlungsfluss und eine Kartenverwaltung nutzen, einschließlich der `checkout`- und `attach`-Funktionen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a lidarem com o checkout da Stripe, atualizações, downgrade e cancelamentos de forma automática, utilizando a API do Autumn para um fluxo de pagamento e gerenciamento de cartões sem interrupções, incluindo funcionalidades `checkout` e `attach`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматически обрабатывать Stripe checkout, обновления, понижения и отмены, используя API Autumn для бесперебойного потока платежей и управления картами, включая функциональность `checkout` и `attach`.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على التعامل مع نظام الدفع من Stripe وتحديثاته وترقياته وإلغاءاته بشكل آلي، مستخدمين واجهة برمجة التطبيقات من Autumn من أجل تدفق دفع سلس وإدارة البطاقات، بما في ذلك وظائف `checkout` و `attach`"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating payment processing for new and returning customers","Generating Stripe checkout URLs for secure transactions","Confirming purchases with card information already on file using the `attach` method"],"zh":["为新老客户自动化支付处理","为安全交易生成Stripe checkout URL","使用`attach`方法确认已有卡信息的购买"],"ja":["新規およびリターン顧客の自動化された支払い処理","セキュアな取引のためのストライプチェックアウトURLの生成","`attach`メソッドを使用した既存のカード情報による購入の確認"],"ko":["신규 및 리턴 고객의 자동 결제 처리","안전한 거래를 위한 스트라이프 체크아웃 URL 생성","`첨부` 방법을 사용하여 기존 카드 정보로 구매 확인"],"es":["Automatizar el procesamiento de pagos para nuevos y antiguos clientes","Generar URLs de checkout de Stripe para transacciones seguras","Confirmar compras con información de tarjeta ya registrada utilizando el método `attach`"],"fr":["Automatiser le traitement des paiements pour les nouveaux et anciens clients","Générer des URL de checkout de Stripe pour des transactions sécurisées","Confirmer les achats avec des informations de carte déjà enregistrées en utilisant la méthode `attach`"],"de":["Automatisieren des Zahlungsverarbeitungsprozesses für neue und bestehende Kunden","Erzeugen von Stripe-Checkout-URLs für sichere Transaktionen","Bestätigen von Käufen mit bereits registrierten Karteninformationen unter Verwendung der `attach`-Methode"],"pt":["Automatizar o processamento de pagamento para novos e antigos clientes","Gerar URLs de checkout da Stripe para transações seguras","Confirmar compras com informações de cartão já registradas usando o método `attach`"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обработку платежей для новых и постоянных клиентов","Генерировать URL-адреса Stripe checkout для безопасных транзакций","Подтверждать покупки с помощью информации о карте, уже имеющейся в файле, используя метод `attach`"],"ar":["تأتمتة معالجة الدفع للعملاء الجدد والقدامى","توليد روابط الدفع من Stripe للأعمال التجارية الآمنة","التأكد من عمليات الشراء باستخدام معلومات البطاقة المسجلة بالفعل باستخدام طريقة `attach`"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Autumn API access and documentation consultation at docs.useautumn.com","Stripe checkout and payment processing limitations apply"],"zh":["需要Autumn API访问和文档咨询，文档地址：docs.useautumn.com","适用Stripe checkout和支付处理的限制"],"ja":["Autumn APIへのアクセスとドキュメントの参照が必要、ドキュメントはdocs.useautumn.comで確認できます","ストライプのチェックアウトおよび支払い処理の制限が適用されます"],"ko":["Autumn API 액세스 및 문서 참조 필요, 문서는 docs.useautumn.com에서 확인할 수 있습니다","스트라이프 체크아웃 및 결제 처리의 제한이 적용됩니다"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la API de Autumn y consulta de la documentación en docs.useautumn.com","Se aplican las limitaciones de checkout y procesamiento de pagos de Stripe"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''API Autumn et une consultation de la documentation sur docs.useautumn.com","Les limites de checkout et de traitement de paiement de Stripe s''appliquent"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die Autumn-API und Dokumentationskonsultation unter docs.useautumn.com","Die Eins