 فعالة","تنسيق الوكلاء","مهام متوفرة كتذاكر","سياق شامل لكل مهمة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["dex","终端接口","jj命令","任务管理","结构化任务","命令调用","开发工具"],"ja":["dex","ターミナルインターフェース","jjコマンド","タスク管理","構造化されたタスク","コマンド呼び出し","開発ツール"],"ko":["dex","터미널 인터페이스","jj 명령","태스크 관리","구조화된 태스크","명령 호출","개발 도구"],"es":["dex","interfaz de terminal","JJ","coordinación de agentes","invocación de comandos","administración de tareas","tickets estructurados"],"fr":["dex","interface terminal","JJ","coordination d''agents","invocation de commandes","gestion de tâches","tickets structurés"],"de":["dex","Terminal-Schnittstelle","JJ","Agentenkoordination","Aufruf von Befehlen","Aufgabenverwaltung","strukturierte Tickets"],"pt":["dex","interface de terminal","jj","coordenação de agentes","tarefas como tickets","comandos de execução","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","terminal de linha de comando"],"ru":["dex","терминальный интерфейс","jj","координация агентов","задачи как билеты","команды выполнения","инструменты разработки","командная строка терминала"],"ar":["DEX","واجهة طرفية","jj","تنسيق الوكلاء","مهام كتذاكر","أوامر التنفيذ","أدوات التطوير","سطر أوامر طرفي"]}},"owner":"eliaskc","repo":"kajji","repoPath":"eliaskc/kajji","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.419Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"dex","description":"Manage tasks via dex CLI. Use when breaking down complex work, tracking implementation items, or persisting context across sessions.","bodyPreview":"# Agent Coordination with dex\n\n## Command Invocation\n\nUse `dex` directly for all commands. If not on PATH, use `npx @zeeg/dex` instead.\n\n```bash\ncommand -v dex &>/dev/null && echo \"use: dex\" || echo \"use: npx @zeeg/dex\"\n```\n\n## Core Principle: Tickets, Not Todos\n\nDex tasks are **tickets** - structured artifacts with comprehensive context:\n\n- **Name**: One-line summary (issue title)\n- **Description**: Full background, requirements, approach (issue body)\n- **Result**: Implementation details, decis","body":"# Agent Coordination with dex\n\n## Command Invocation\n\nUse `dex` directly for all commands. If not on PATH, use `npx @zeeg/dex` instead.\n\n```bash\ncommand -v dex &>/dev/null && echo \"use: dex\" || echo \"use: npx @zeeg/dex\"\n```\n\n## Core Principle: Tickets, Not Todos\n\nDex tasks are **tickets** - structured artifacts with comprehensive context:\n\n- **Name**: One-line summary (issue title)\n- **Description**: Full background, requirements, approach (issue body)\n- **Result**: Implementation details, decisions, outcomes (PR description)\n\nThink: \"Would someone understand the what, why, and how from this task alone?\"\n\n## Dex Tasks are Ephemeral\n\n**Never reference dex task IDs in external artifacts** (commits, PRs, docs). Task IDs like `abc123` become meaningless once tasks are completed. Describe the work itself, not the task that tracked it.\n\n## When to Use dex\n\n**Use dex when:**\n\n- Breaking down complexity into subtasks\n- Work spans multiple sessions\n- Context needs to persist for handoffs\n- Recording decisions for future reference\n\n**Skip dex when:**\n\n- Work is a single atomic action\n- Everything fits in one session with no follow-up\n- Overhead exceeds value\n\n## dex vs Built-in Task Tools\n\nSome AI agents (like Claude Code) have built-in task tools. These are session-only and not the same as dex.\n\n|                 | dex                                   | Built-in Task Tools |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------- |\n| **Persistence** | Files in `.dex/`                      | Session-only        |\n| **Context**     | Rich (description + context + result) | Basic               |\n| **Hierarchy**   | 3-level (epic → task → subtask)       | Flat                |\n\nUse **dex** for persistent work. Use built-in task tools for ephemeral in-session tracking only.\n\n## Basic Workflow\n\n### Create a Task\n\n```bash\ndex create \"Short name\" --description \"Full implementation context\"\n```\n\nDescription should include: what needs to be done, why, implementation approach, and acceptance criteria. See [examples.md](examples.md) for good/bad examples.\n\n### List and View Tasks\n\n```bash\ndex list                  # Pending tasks\ndex list --ready          # Unblocked tasks\ndex show <id>             # Full details\n```\n\n### Complete a Task\n\n```bash\ndex complete <id> --result \"What was accomplished\" --commit <sha>\n```\n\n**Always verify before completing.** Results must include evidence: test counts, build status, manual testing outcomes. See [verification.md](verification.md) for the full checklist.\n\n### Edit and Delete\n\n```bash\ndex edit <id> --description \"Updated description\"\ndex delete <id>\n```\n\nFor full CLI reference including blockers, see [cli-reference.md](cli-reference.md).\n\n## Understanding Task Fields\n\nTasks have two text fields:\n\n- **Name**: Brief one-line summary (shown in `dex list`)\n- **Description**: Full details - requirements, approach, acceptance criteria (shown with `--full`)\n\nWhen you run `dex show <id>`, the description may be truncated. The CLI will hint at `--full` if there''s more content.\n\n### Gathering Context\n\nWhen picking up a task, gather all relevant context:\n\n```bash\ndex show <id> --full              # Full task details\ndex show <parent-id> --full       # Parent context (if applicable)\ndex show <blocker-id> --full      # What blockers accomplished\n```\n\nBefore starting, verify you can answer:\n\n- **What** needs to be done specifically?\n- **Why** is this needed?\n- **How** should it be implemented?\n- **When** is it done (acceptance criteria)?\n\nIf any answer is unclear:\n\n1. Check parent task or completed blockers for more details\n2. Suggest entering plan mode to flesh out requirements before starting\n\n**Proceed without full context when:**\n\n- Task is trivial/atomic (e.g., \"Add .gitignore entry\")\n- Conversation already provides the missing context\n- Description itself is sufficiently detailed\n\n## Task Hierarchies\n\nThree levels: **Epic** (large initiative) → **Task** (significant work) → **Subtask** (atomic step).\n\n**Choosing the right level:**\n\n- Small feature (1-2 files) → Single task\n- Medium feature (3-7 steps) → Task with subtasks\n- Large initiative (5+ tasks) → Epic with tasks\n\n```bash\n# Create subtask under parent\ndex create --parent <id> \"Subtask name\" --description \"...\"\n```\n\nFor detailed hierarchy guidance, see [hierarchies.md](hierarchies.md).\n\n## Recording Results\n\nComplete tasks **immediately after implementing AND verifying**:\n\n- Capture decisions while fresh\n- Note deviations from plan\n- Document verification performed\n- Create follow-up tasks for tech debt\n\nYour result must include explicit verification evidence. Don''t just describe what you did—prove it works. See [verification.md](verification.md).\n\n## Commit Messages with GitHub Issues\n\nWhen a task is linked to a GitHub issue (shown in `dex show` output), include issue references in commit messages:\n\n- **Root tasks** (the task itself has GitHub metadata): Use `Fixes #N`\n  - This closes the issue when merged\n- **Subtasks** (parent/ancestor has GitHub metadata): Use `Refs #N`\n  - This links to the issue without closing it\n\nCheck `dex show <id>` for GitHub issue info before committing. The \"(via parent)\" indicator means use `Refs`, direct metadata means use `Fixes`.\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Right-size tasks**: Completable in one focused session\n2. **Clear completion criteria**: Description should define \"done\"\n3. **Don''t over-decompose**: 3-7 children per parent\n4. **Action-oriented descriptions**: Start with verbs (\"Add\", \"Fix\", \"Update\")\n5. **Verify before completing**: Tests passing, manual testing done\n\n## Additional Resources\n\n- [cli-reference.md](cli-reference.md) - Full CLI documentation\n- [examples.md](examples.md) - Good/bad context and result examples\n- [verification.md](verification.md) - Verification checklist and process\n- [hierarchies.md](hierarchies.md) - Epic/task/subtask organization\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:21:44.729Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Terminal-based Agents needing structured task management with tickets","zh":"非常适合需要结构化任务管理的终端代理，具有票据功能","ja":"ターミナルベースのエージェントが構造化されたタスク管理を必要とする場合に最適です","ko":"구조화된 작업 관리가 필요한 터미널 기반 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes basados en Terminal que necesitan gestión de tareas estructuradas con tickets","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents basés sur Terminal nécessitant une gestion de tâches structurées avec des tickets","de":"Perfekt für Terminal-basierte Agents, die eine strukturierte Aufgabenverwaltung mit Tickets benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes baseados em Terminal que necessitam de gerenciamento de tarefas estruturado com tickets","ru":"Идеально для агентов, работающих в терминале, которым необходим структурированное управление задачами с помощью тикетов","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء القائمين على الطرفية الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة مهام منظم مع تذاكر"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage tasks using a simple terminal interface with comprehensive context, including name, description, and result, leveraging the power of command invocation with `dex` or `npx @zeeg/dex`","zh":"赋予代理使用简单的终端接口管理任务的能力，包括名称、描述和结果等全面背景，利用`dex`或`npx @zeeg/dex`命令调用功能","ja":"エージェントがシンプルなターミナルインターフェースを使用してタスクを管理できるようにし、名前、説明、結果などを含む包括的なコンテキストを提供し、`dex`または`npx @zeeg/dex`によるコマンド呼び出し機能を活用します","ko":"에이전트가 간단한 터미널 인터페이스를 사용하여 작업을 관리할 수 있도록 하며, 이름, 설명, 결과 등을 포함한 포괄적인 컨텍스트를 제공하고, `dex` 또는 `npx @zeeg/dex`를 통한 명령 호출 기능을 활용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes gestionar tareas utilizando una interfaz de terminal simple con contexto integral, incluyendo nombre, descripción y resultado, aprovechando el poder de la invocación de comandos con `dex` o `npx @zeeg/dex`","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer des tâches en utilisant une interface de terminal simple avec un contexte complet, y compris le nom, la description et le résultat, en exploitant le pouvoir de l''invocation de commandes avec `dex` ou `npx @zeeg/dex`","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Aufgaben mithilfe einer einfachen Terminaloberfläche mit umfassendem Kontext zu verwalten, einschließlich Name, Beschreibung und Ergebnis, unter Ausnutzung der Kommandoinvokation mit `dex` oder `npx @zeeg/dex`","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar tarefas usando uma interface de terminal simples com contexto abrangente, incluindo nome, descrição e resultado, aproveitando o poder da invocação de comandos com `dex` ou `npx @zeeg/dex`","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять задачами, используя простой интерфейс терминала с полным контекстом, включая имя, описание и результат, используя возможности вызова команд с помощью `dex` или `npx @zeeg/dex`","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إدارة المهام باستخدام واجهة طرفية بسيطة مع سياق شامل ، بما في ذلك الاسم و الوصف و النتيجة ، واستخدام قوة استدعاء الأوامر مع `dex` أو `npx @zeeg/dex`"},"useCases":{"en":["Invoking commands directly with `dex`","Creating structured tickets with comprehensive context","Managing tasks using a terminal-based interface"],"zh":["直接使用`dex`调用命令","创建具有全面背景的结构化票据","使用基于终端的接口管理任务"],"ja":["`dex`を使用して直接コマンドを呼び出す","包括的なコンテキストを持つ構造化されたチケットを作成する","ターミナルベースのインターフェースを使用してタスクを管理する"],"ko":["`dex`를 사용하여 직접 명령을 호출합니다","포괄적인 컨텍스트를 가진 구조화된 티켓을 생성합니다","터미널 기반 인터페이스를 사용하여 작업을 관리합니다"],"es":["Invocar comandos directamente con `dex`","Crear tickets estructurados con contexto integral","Gestionar tareas utilizando una interfaz basada en terminal"],"fr":["Invocer des commandes directement avec `dex`","Créer des tickets structurés avec un contexte complet","Gérer des tâches en utilisant une interface basée sur terminal"],"de":["Kommandos direkt mit `dex` aufrufen","Strukturierte Tickets mit umfassendem Kontext erstellen","Aufgaben mithilfe einer terminalbasierten Oberfläche verwalten"],"pt":["Invocar comandos diretamente com `dex`","Criar tickets estruturados com contexto abrangente","Gerenciar tarefas usando uma interface baseada em terminal"],"ru":["Прямой вызов команд с помощью `dex`","Создание структурированных тикетов с полным контекстом","Управление задачами, используя интерфейс терминала"],"ar":["استدعاء الأوامر مباشرة مع `dex`","إنشاء تذاكر منظم مع سياق شامل","إدارة المهام باستخدام واجهة الطرفية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires `dex` to be on PATH or installation via `npx @zeeg/dex`","Terminal interface only"],"zh":["需要`dex`在PATH上或通过`npx @zeeg/dex`安装","仅终端接口"],"ja":["`dex`がPATH上にあるか、`npx @zeeg/dex`を介してインストールされる必要がある","ターミナルインターフェースのみ"],"ko":["`dex`가 PATH에 있거나 `npx @zeeg/dex`를 통해 설치되어야 합니다","터미널 인터페이스만"],"es":["Requiere que `dex` esté en PATH o instalación vía `npx @zeeg/dex`","Interfaz de terminal solo"],"fr":["Nécessite que `dex` soit sur PATH ou installation via `npx @zeeg/dex`","Interface de terminal uniquement"],"de":["Benötigt, dass `dex` im PATH ist oder Installation über `npx @zeeg/dex`","Nur Terminaloberfläche"],"pt":["Requer que `dex` esteja no PATH ou instalação via `npx @zeeg/dex`","Interface de terminal apenas"],"ru":["Требует, чтобы `dex` был в PATH или устанавливался через `npx @zeeg/dex`","Только интерфейс терминала"],"ar":["يتطلب أن يكون `dex` في PATH أو التثبيت عبر `npx @zeeg/dex`","واجهة الطرفية فقط"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('alexandru/social-publish/arrow-resource', 'community', 'alexandru', 'social-publish', 'alexandru/social-publish', 'arrow-resource', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.419Z', '2026-02-18T04:21:36.754Z', NULL, '{"id":"alexandru/social-publish/arrow-resource","name":"arrow-resource","description":{"zh":"Arrow Resource ","ja":"Arrow Resource ","ko":"Arrow Resource ","es":"Arrow Resource es un servicio autoalojado que permite compartir contenido en varias redes sociales al mismo tiempo de forma eficiente","fr":"Arrow Resource est un service auto-hébergé qui permet de partager du contenu sur plusieurs réseaux sociaux en même temps de manière efficace","de":"Arrow Resource ist ein selbstgehosteter Service, der es ermöglicht, Inhalte auf mehreren sozialen Plattformen gleichzeitig effizient zu teilen","pt":"O Arrow Resource é um serviço de hospedagem própria que facilita a compartilhagem de conteúdo em várias plataformas de mídia social","ru":"Arrow Resource — это само-хостинговый сервис, который помогает делиться контентом в нескольких социальных сетях","ar":"Arrow Resource هو خدمة مُضيفة ذاتية تساعد على مشاركة المحتوى على منصات التواصل الاجتماعي المتعددة","en":"Self-hosted service that helps me share to multiple social media platforms at the same time."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Arrow Resource - Kotlin ","ja":"Arrow Resource - Kotlin","ko":"Arrow Resource - Kotlin","es":"Arrow Resource: Compartir en redes sociales de forma simu...","fr":"Arrow Resource : Partagez sur plusieurs plateformes socia...","de":"Arrow Resource: Teilen auf mehreren sozialen Plattformen ...","pt":"Arrow Resource: Compartilhe em Múltiplas Plataformas","ru":"Arrow Resource: Публикация в нескольких соцсетях","ar":"Arrow Resource: شارك على منصات التواصل الاجتماعي المتعددة","en":"arrow-resource"},"description":{"zh":"Arrow Resource ","ja":"Arrow Resource ","ko":"Arrow Resource ","es":"Arrow Resource es un servicio autoalojado que permite compartir contenido en varias redes sociales al mismo tiempo de forma eficiente","fr":"Arrow Resource est un service auto-hébergé qui permet de partager du contenu sur plusieurs réseaux sociaux en même temps de manière efficace","de":"Arrow Resource ist ein selbstgehosteter Service, der es ermöglicht, Inhalte auf mehreren sozialen Plattformen gleichzeitig effizient zu teilen","pt":"O Arrow Resource é um serviço de hospedagem própria que facilita a compartilhagem de conteúdo em várias plataformas de mídia social","ru":"Arrow Resource — это само-хостинговый сервис, который помогает делиться контентом в нескольких социальных сетях","ar":"Arrow Resource هو خدمة مُضيفة ذاتية تساعد على مشاركة المحتوى على منصات التواصل الاجتماعي المتعددة","en":"Self-hosted service that helps me share to multiple social media platforms at the same time."},"definition":{"en":"Self-hosted service that helps me share to multiple social media platforms at the same time."},"features":{"zh":["resourceScope { ... }","resource { install(acquire) { a, exitCase -> release } }","Compose .bind()","parZip","references/resource.md"],"ja":["resourceScope { ... }","resource { install(acquire) { a, exitCase -> release } }","Compose .bind()","parZip","references/resource.md"],"ko":["resourceScope { ... }","resource { install(acquire) { a, exitCase -> release } }","Compose .bind()","parZip","references/resource.md"],"es":["Compartir en varias redes sociales al mismo tiempo","Implementación sencilla con Kotlin","Definir recursos con `resource { install(acquire) { a, exitCase -> release } }`","Composición con `.bind()`","Uso de `parZip` para adquisición paralela independiente"],"fr":["Partagez sur plusieurs réseaux sociaux en même temps","Mise en œuvre simple avec Kotlin","Définir des ressources avec `resource { install(acquire) { a, exitCase -> release } }`","Composition avec `.bind()`","Utilisation de `parZip` pour acquisition parallèle indépendante"],"de":["Teilen auf mehreren sozialen Plattformen gleichzeitig","Einfache Implementierung mit Kotlin","Ressourcen definieren mit `resource { install(acquire) { a, exitCase -> release } }`","Zusammensetzung mit `.bind()`","Verwendung von `parZip` für unabhängige parallele Beschaffung"],"pt":["Compartilhe conteúdo em múltiplas plataformas","Use o `resourceScope` para gerenciar recursos","Defina recursos com `resource` e `install`","Compose com `.bind()` e use `parZip` para aquisição paralela","Leia `references/resource.md` para padrões e exemplos concretos"],"ru":["Публикация контента в нескольких социальных сетях","Используйте `resourceScope` для управления ресурсами","Определите ресурсы с помощью `resource` и `install`","Составьте с помощью `.bind()` и используйте `parZip` для параллельного приобретения","Прочитайте `references/resource.md` для образцов и конкретных примеров"],"ar":["مشاركة المحتوى على منصات التواصل الاجتماعي المتعددة","استخدم `resourceScope` لإدارة الموارد","حدد الموارد باستخدام `resource` و `install`","اركب باستخدام `.bind()` واستخدم `parZip` للحصول على متوازي","اقرأ `references/resource.md` للنماذج والأمثلة المحددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Kotlin","Arrow Resource","resourceScope","resource","Compose","parZip","references/resource.md"],"ja":["Kotlin","Arrow Resource","resourceScope","resource","Compose","parZip","references/resource.md"],"ko":["Kotlin","Arrow Resource","resourceScope","resource","Compose","parZip","references/resource.md"],"es":["compartir en redes sociales","Kotlin","programación","desarrollo de software","Arrow Resource","redes sociales","compartir contenido"],"fr":["partager sur les réseaux sociaux","Kotlin","programmation","développement de logiciels","Arrow Resource","réseaux sociaux","partager du contenu"],"de":["teilen auf sozialen Plattformen","Kotlin","Programmierung","Softwareentwicklung","Arrow Resource","soziale Plattformen","Inhalte teilen"],"pt":["Arrow Resource","compartilhamento de conteúdo","múltiplas plataformas","mídia social","Kotlin","programação","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["Arrow Resource","публикация контента","несколько социальных сетей","само-хостинговый сервис","Kotlin","программирование","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["Arrow Resource","مشاركة المحتوى","منصات التواصل الاجتماعي المتعددة","خدمة مضيفة ذاتية","Kotlin","برمجة","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"alexandru","repo":"social-publish","repoPath":"alexandru/social-publish","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.419Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"arrow-resource","description":"Kotlin + Arrow Resource lifecycle management with `Resource`, `ResourceScope`, and `resourceScope`. Use for designing safe acquisition/release of files, streams, DB pools/connections, HTTP clients, or multipart parts; composing resources (including parallel acquisition); or integrating Resource with typed errors and cancellation.","bodyPreview":"# Arrow Resource (Kotlin)\n\n## Quick start\n- Use `resourceScope { ... }` at lifecycle boundaries.\n- Define each resource with `resource { install(acquire) { a, exitCase -> release } }`.\n- Compose with `.bind()`; use `parZip` for independent parallel acquisition.\n- Read `references/resource.md` for patterns and concrete examples.\n\n## Workflow\n1. Identify the acquire step and the release step.\n2. Implement a `Resource<A>` using `install`.\n3. Create reusable constructors on `ResourceScope` when need","body":"# Arrow Resource (Kotlin)\n\n## Quick start\n- Use `resourceScope { ... }` at lifecycle boundaries.\n- Define each resource with `resource { install(acquire) { a, exitCase -> release } }`.\n- Compose with `.bind()`; use `parZip` for independent parallel acquisition.\n- Read `references/resource.md` for patterns and concrete examples.\n\n## Workflow\n1. Identify the acquire step and the release step.\n2. Implement a `Resource<A>` using `install`.\n3. Create reusable constructors on `ResourceScope` when needed.\n4. Compose resources into higher-level resources with `.bind()`.\n5. Execute in `resourceScope` and keep finalizers idempotent.\n\n## Usage guidance\n- Prefer Resource over `use`/`try/finally` when you need suspend finalizers or MPP support.\n- Use `ExitCase` to handle rollback/cleanup differences.\n- When mixing with typed errors, pick nesting order deliberately to control `ExitCase` seen by finalizers.\n\n## References\n- Load `references/resource.md` for API details and end-to-end examples.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:21:36.754Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Kotlin-based AI Agents requiring efficient resource management and parallel acquisition capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高效资源管理和并行获取能力的Kotlin-based AI代理。","ja":"KotlinベースのAIエージェントが効率的なリソース管理と並列取得機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"효율적인 리소스 관리 및 병렬 획득 기능이 필요한 Kotlin 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de inteligencia artificial basados en Kotlin que requieren una gestión de recursos eficiente y capacidades de adquisición paralela.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle basés sur Kotlin nécessitant une gestion des ressources efficace et des capacités d''acquisition parallèle.","de":"Ideal für auf Kotlin basierende KI-Agents, die eine effiziente Ressourcenverwaltung und parallele Akquise-Fähigkeiten erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA baseados em Kotlin que exigem gerenciamento de recursos eficiente e capacidades de aquisição paralela.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ на основе Kotlin, требующих эффективного управления ресурсами и возможностей параллельного получения.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يعتمدون على Kotlin الذين يتطلبون إدارة موارد فعالة وقدرات الحصول الموازية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage resources safely using `resourceScope` and compose them with `.bind()` for independent parallel acquisition via `parZip`, while ensuring proper release via `install` and `acquire` steps.","zh":"赋予代理使用`resourceScope`安全管理资源的能力，并使用`.bind()`组合它们，以便通过`parZip`实现独立的并行获取，同时通过`install`和`acquire`步骤确保正确的释放。","ja":"`resourceScope`を使用してエージェントがリソースを安全に管理できるようにし、`.bind()`でこれらを組み合わせて`parZip`を介した独立した並列取得を可能にし、`install`と`acquire`ステップを介して適切なリリースを保証します。","ko":"에이전트가 `resourceScope`를 사용하여 리소스를 안전하게 관리할 수 있도록 하며, `.bind()`를 사용하여 이를 조합하여 `parZip`를 통해 독립적인 병렬 획득을 가능하게 하며, `install` 및 `acquire` 단계를 통해 적절한 릴리즈를 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar los recursos de manera segura utilizando `resourceScope` y combinarlos con `.bind()` para adquisición paralela independiente a través de `parZip`, mientras se garantiza la liberación adecuada a través de los pasos `install` y `acquire`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les ressources en toute sécurité en utilisant `resourceScope` et de les combiner avec `.bind()` pour une acquisition parallèle indépendante via `parZip`, tout en assurant une libération appropriée via les étapes `install` et `acquire`.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, Ressourcen sicher zu verwalten, indem sie `resourceScope` verwenden und diese mit `.bind()` für unabhängige parallele Akquise über `parZip` kombinieren, während eine ordnungsgemäße Freigabe durch die Schritte `install` und `acquire` sichergestellt wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar recursos com segurança usando `resourceScope` e compô-los com `.bind()` para aquisição paralela independente via `parZip`, garantindo a liberação apropriada via etapas `install` e `acquire`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью безопасного управления ресурсами с помощью `resourceScope` и их композиции с помощью `.bind()` для независимого параллельного получения через `parZip`, обеспечивая надлежащее освобождение через этапы `install` и `acquire`.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إدارة الموارد بأمان باستخدام `resourceScope` وتركيبها باستخدام `.bind()` للحصول الموازي المستقل عبر `parZip` ، مع ضمان الإصدار المناسب عبر خطوات `install` و `acquire`."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing resource-intensive tasks with automatic release","Composing multiple resources for parallel execution using `parZip`","Defining reusable constructors on `ResourceScope` for streamlined resource management"],"zh":["使用自动释放实现资源密集型任务","使用`parZip`实现多个资源的并行执行","在`ResourceScope`上定义可重用构造函数以简化资源管理"],"ja":["自動リリースを使用したリソース集中タスクの実装","`parZip`を使用した複数リソースの並列実行","`ResourceScope`上で再利用可能なコンストラクタを定義してリソース管理を簡素化する"],"ko":["자동 릴리즈를 사용하여 리소스 집중적인 태스크를 구현하는 것","`parZip`를 사용하여 여러 리소스의 병렬 실행","`ResourceScope`에서 재사용 가능한 생성자를 정의하여 리소스 관리를 간소화하는 것"],"es":["Implementar tareas intensivas en recursos con liberación automática","Componer varios recursos para ejecución paralela utilizando `parZip`","Definir constructores reutilizables en `ResourceScope` para una gestión de recursos optimizada"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des tâches gourmandes en ressources avec libération automatique","Combiner plusieurs ressources pour une exécution parallèle en utilisant `parZip`","Définir des constructeurs réutilisables sur `ResourceScope` pour une gestion des ressources rationalisée"],"de":["Implementierung ressourcenintensiver Aufgaben mit automatischer Freigabe","Zusammensetzen mehrerer Ressourcen für parallele Ausführung unter Verwendung von `parZip`","Definieren wiederverwendbarer Konstruktoren auf `ResourceScope` für eine optimierte Ressourcenverwaltung"],"pt":["Implementação de tarefas intensivas de recursos com liberação automática","Composição de vários recursos para execução paralela usando `parZip`","Definição de construtores reutilizáveis em `ResourceScope` para gerenciamento de recursos simplificado"],"ru":["Реализация задач, интенсивно использующих ресурсы, с автоматическим освобождением","Композиция нескольких ресурсов для параллельного выполнения с помощью `parZip`","Определение многократно используемых конструкторов в `ResourceScope` для упрощенного управления ресурсами"],"ar":["تنفيذ مهام مكثفة للموارد مع الإصدار التلقائي","تركيب موارد متعددة للتنفيذ الموازي باستخدام `parZip`","تحديد مصنعي إعادة الاستخدام في `ResourceScope` لإدارة الموارد المبسطة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Kotlin programming language","Needs understanding of `resourceScope`, `install`, and `acquire` concepts"],"zh":["需要Kotlin编程语言","需要了解`resourceScope`、`install`和`acquire`概念"],"ja":["Kotlinプログラミング言語が必要","`resourceScope`、`install`、`acquire`の概念の理解が必要"],"ko":["Kotlin 프로그래밍 언어가 필요","`resourceScope`, `install`, `acquire` 개념에 대한 이해가 필요"],"es":["Requiere el lenguaje de programación Kotlin","Necesita comprensión de los conceptos `resourceScope`, `install` y `acquire`"],"fr":["Nécessite le langage de programmation Kotlin","Nécessite une compréhension des concepts `resourceScope`, `install` et `acquire`"],"de":["Erfordert die Programmiersprache Kotlin","Benötigt das Verständnis der Konzepte `resourceScope`, `install` und `acquire`"],"pt":["Exige a linguagem de programação Kotlin","Necessita de compreensão dos conceitos `resourceScope`, `install` e `acquire`"],"ru":["Требует языка программирования Kotlin","Требует понимания концепций `resourceScope`, `install` и `acquire`"],"ar":["يتطلب لغة البرمجة Kotlin","يتطلب فهم مفاهيم `resourceScope` و `install` و `acquire`"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
