":"Bump Version: Инструмент управления версиями для разработ...","ar":"بمب الفيرسيون: أداة تحكم بالإصدار للطورين","en":"bump-version"},"description":{"zh":"bump-version 是一个用于自动分析代码更改并升级版本的工具，支持 SemVer 升级","ja":"bump-version はコードの変更を自動分析し、バージョンをアップグレードするツールです。SemVer アップグレードをサポートしています","ko":"bump-version은 코드 변경을 자동 분석하고 버전을 업그레이드하는 도구입니다. SemVer 업그레이드를 지원합니다","es":"Bump Version es una herramienta para analizar cambios y actualizar referencias de versión en tu código. Ayuda a mantener tu proyecto actualizado y organizado","fr":"Bump Version est un outil pour analyser les modifications et mettre à jour les références de version dans votre code. Il aide à maintenir votre projet à jour...","de":"Bump Version ist ein Tool zum Analysieren von Änderungen und Aktualisieren von Versionsverweisen in Ihrem Code. Es hilft, Ihr Projekt auf dem neuesten Stand ...","pt":"Bump Version é uma ferramenta para desenvolvedores que analisa alterações e atualiza referências de versão no código.","ru":"Bump Version — это инструмент для разработчиков, который анализирует изменения и обновляет ссылки на версию в коде.","ar":"بمب الفيرسيون هي أداة للطورين تحليل التغييرات وتحديث المراجع بالإصدار في الكود","en":"A collection of Google Apps Script custom functions for tracking crypto portfolios in Google Sheets"},"definition":{"en":"A collection of Google Apps Script custom functions for tracking crypto portfolios in Google Sheets"},"features":{"zh":["自动分析代码更改","支持 SemVer 升级","升级版本号","生成版本升级日志","支持 Git 版本控制"],"ja":["コードの変更を自動分析","SemVer アップグレードをサポート","バージョン番号をアップグレード","バージョンアップグレードログを生成","Git 版本管理をサポート"],"ko":["코드 변경을 자동 분석","SemVer 업그레이드를 지원","버전 번호를 업그레이드","버전 업그레이드 로그를生成","Git 버전 관리를 지원"],"es":["Análisis de cambios desde la última etiqueta de versión","Determinación de la versión semver correcta","Actualización de todas las referencias de versión en el código","Integración con Git","Automatización del proceso de actualización de versiones"],"fr":["Analyse des modifications depuis la dernière étiquette de version","Détermination de la version semver correcte","Mise à jour de toutes les références de version dans le code","Intégration avec Git","Automatisation du processus de mise à jour des versions"],"de":["Analyse von Änderungen seit dem letzten Versions-Tag","Bestimmung der korrekten semver-Version","Aktualisierung aller Versionsverweise im Code","Integration mit Git","Automatisierung des Prozesses der Versionsaktualisierung"],"pt":["Análise de alterações desde a última tag","Determinação da versão correta com base no semver","Atualização de referências de versão no código","Integração com Git","Suporte a workflows personalizados"],"ru":["Анализ изменений с момента последней тегировки","Определение правильной версии на основе semver","Обновление ссылок на версию в коде","Интеграция с Git","Поддержка пользовательских рабочих процессов"],"ar":["تحليل التغيرات منذ العلامة الأخيرة","تحديد الإصدار الصحيح بناءً على semver","تحديث المراجع بالإصدار في الكود","التكامل مع جيت","دعم سير العمل المخصص"]},"keywords":{"zh":["bump-version","自动版本升级","SemVer 升级","代码分析","版本管理","Git 版本控制"],"ja":["bump-version","自動バージョンアップ","SemVer アップグレード","コード分析","バージョン管理","Git 版本管理"],"ko":["bump-version","자동 버전 업그레이드","SemVer 업그레이드","코드 분석","버전 관리","Git 버전 관리"],"es":["gestión de versiones","bump version","git","semver","actualización de versiones","automatización","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["gestion de versions","bump version","git","semver","mise à jour des versions","automatisation","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["Versionsmanagement","Bump Version","Git","semver","Versionsaktualisierung","Automatisierung","Softwareentwicklung","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["controle de versão","bump version","semver","git","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","gerenciamento de versão"],"ru":["управление версиями","bump version","semver","git","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки","управление версиями"],"ar":["التحكم بالإصدار","بمب الفيرسيون","semver","جيت","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","إدارة الإصدار"]}},"owner":"PaulRBerg","repo":"cryptfolio-scripts","repoPath":"PaulRBerg/cryptfolio-scripts","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.419Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"bump-version","description":"This skill should be used when the user asks to bump version, release a new version, bump the version, prepare a release, update version numbers, what version should this be, or mentions version bumping, semver analysis, or release preparation.","version":"0.1.0","bodyPreview":"# Bump Version\n\nAnalyze changes since the last version tag, determine the correct semver bump, and update all version references in the codebase.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Identify the Latest Version Tag\n\n```bash\ngit tag --sort=-v:refname | head -1\n```\n\nThe tag format is `vMAJOR.MINOR.PATCH` (e.g. `v2.1.1`).\n\n### Step 2: Analyze Changes Since the Last Tag\n\nGather the commit log and diff since the tag:\n\n```bash\ngit log <tag>..HEAD --oneline\ngit diff <tag>..HEAD --stat\n```\n\n### Step 3: Classify th","body":"# Bump Version\n\nAnalyze changes since the last version tag, determine the correct semver bump, and update all version references in the codebase.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Identify the Latest Version Tag\n\n```bash\ngit tag --sort=-v:refname | head -1\n```\n\nThe tag format is `vMAJOR.MINOR.PATCH` (e.g. `v2.1.1`).\n\n### Step 2: Analyze Changes Since the Last Tag\n\nGather the commit log and diff since the tag:\n\n```bash\ngit log <tag>..HEAD --oneline\ngit diff <tag>..HEAD --stat\n```\n\n### Step 3: Classify the Semver Bump\n\nApply [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/) rules to the changes:\n\n| Bump    | Criteria                                                                                     |\n| ------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `patch` | Bug fixes, dependency bumps, formatting, docs, refactors with no behavioral change           |\n| `minor` | New features, new functions, new chain/token support, non-breaking additions                  |\n| `major` | Breaking changes: renamed/removed public functions, changed function signatures, schema moves |\n\n**Context-specific guidance for this codebase:**\n\n- Adding a new custom function (e.g. `GET_BALANCE_V2`) &rarr; **minor**\n- Adding a new chain or token to `data.gs` &rarr; **minor**\n- Renaming or removing an existing custom function &rarr; **major**\n- Changing the parameters of an existing custom function &rarr; **major**\n- Fixing a bug in price fetching or balance calculation &rarr; **patch**\n- Updating RPC URLs, API endpoints, or constants &rarr; **patch**\n- Reformatting, linting, dependency bumps &rarr; **patch**\n\nPresent the analysis and proposed version to the user for confirmation before making changes.\n\n### Step 4: Update Version References\n\nAfter the user confirms the bump, update exactly two locations:\n\n#### 1. `package.json` &mdash; `version` field\n\nUpdate the `\"version\"` field to the new semver string (without the `v` prefix):\n\n```json\n\"version\": \"X.Y.Z\"\n```\n\n#### 2. `src/cryptfolio.gs` &mdash; `VERSION` constant\n\nThe `VERSION` constant near line 13 is a monotonically incrementing integer string used by Google Apps Script for library deployment. Increment it by 1 from the current value:\n\n```js\nconst VERSION = \"N\";  // increment N by 1\n```\n\nThis is **not** the semver version. It is a separate deployment counter that always increments by exactly 1 regardless of the semver bump type.\n\n### Step 5: Summary\n\nAfter updating, display a summary:\n\n```\nVersion bump: vOLD -> vNEW\n  package.json:       \"OLD\" -> \"NEW\"\n  src/cryptfolio.gs:  VERSION \"N\" -> \"N+1\"\n```\n\nDo **not** create a git tag or commit. The user handles that separately.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:22:05.959Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Version Control Agents needing automated semantic versioning updates.","zh":"非常适合需要自动语义版本更新的版本控制代理。","ja":"バージョン管理エージェントが自動的なセマンティックバージョンの更新を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"자동적인 의미 버전 업데이트 기능이 필요한 버전 제어 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de control de versiones que necesitan actualizaciones de versionado semántico automatizado.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de contrôle de version nécessitant des mises à jour de versionnage sémantique automatisées.","de":"Perfekt für Version Control Agents, die automatisierte semantische Versionsaktualisierungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Controle de Versão que necessitam de atualizações de versionamento semântico automatizadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов контроля версий, которым требуются автоматические обновления семантического версионирования.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التحكم في الإصدار الذي يحتاج إلى تحديثات الإصدار النصي التلقائية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze changes since the last version tag, determine the correct semver bump, and update all version references in the codebase using Git and semantic versioning protocols.","zh":"赋予代理分析自上一个版本标签以来所做的更改、确定正确的语义版本更新并使用 Git 和语义版本控制协议更新代码库中的所有版本引用。","ja":"エージェントに、最後のバージョンタグ以降に加えられた変更を分析し、正しいセマンティックバージョンの更新を決定し、Git およびセマンティックバージョニングプロトコルを使用してコードベース内のすべてのバージョン参照を更新する能力を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 마지막 버전 태그 이후의 변경 사항을 분석하고 올바른 의미 버전 업데이트를 결정하며 Git 및 의미 버전 제어 프로토콜을 사용하여 코드베이스의 모든 버전 참조를 업데이트하는 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a analizar los cambios desde la última etiqueta de versión, determinar el aumento de semver correcto y actualizar todas las referencias de versión en el código utilizando Git y protocolos de versionado semántico.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser les modifications depuis le dernier tag de version, de déterminer la mise à jour de semver correcte et de mettre à jour toutes les références de version dans le codebase en utilisant Git et les protocoles de versionnage sémantique.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Änderungen seit dem letzten Versionstag zu analysieren, den korrekten Semver-Sprung zu bestimmen und alle Versionsverweise im Codebase mithilfe von Git und semantischen Versionierungsprotokollen zu aktualisieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a analisar as alterações desde a última tag de versão, determinar o aumento de semver correto e atualizar todas as referências de versão no código usando Git e protocolos de versionamento semântico.","ru":"Позволяет агентам анализировать изменения с момента последней тэга версии, определять правильный семвер-бамп и обновлять все ссылки на версию в кодовой базе, используя Git и протоколы семантического версионирования.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء تحليل التغييرات منذ آخر علامة إصدار ، وتحديد زيادة semver الصحيحة ، وتحديث جميع المراجع الإصدار في قاعدة الشفرة باستخدام Git وبروتوكولات الإصدار النصي."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating version updates","Analyzing commit logs for version changes","Determining semantic version bumps"],"zh":["自动版本更新","分析提交日志以进行版本更改","确定语义版本更新"],"ja":["バージョンの自動更新","バージョン変更のためのコミットログの分析","セマンティックバージョンの更新の決定"],"ko":["자동 버전 업데이트","버전 변경을 위한 커밋 로그 분석","의미 버전 업데이트의 결정"],"es":["Automatizar actualizaciones de versión","Analizar registros de confirmación para cambios de versión","Determinar aumentos de versión semántica"],"fr":["Automatiser les mises à jour de version","Analyser les journaux de validation pour les modifications de version","Déterminer les mises à jour de version sémantique"],"de":["Automatisierung von Versionsaktualisierungen","Analyse von Commit-Logs für Versionsänderungen","Bestimmung semantischer VersionsSprünge"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de versão","Analizar registros de confirmação para alterações de versão","Determinar aumentos de versão semântica"],"ru":["Автоматизация обновлений версии","Анализ журналов фиксации для изменений версии","Определение семвер-бампов"],"ar":["تأتمتة تحديثات الإصدار","تحليل سجلات الإلتزام لتغييرات الإصدار","تحديد زيادات الإصدار النصي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git version control system","Specific tag format required (vMAJOR.MINOR.PATCH)"],"zh":["需要 Git 版本控制系统","需要特定的标签格式（vMAJOR.MINOR.PATCH）"],"ja":["Git バージョン管理システムが必要","特定のタグ形式（vMAJOR.MINOR.PATCH）が必要"],"ko":["Git 버전 제어 시스템이 필요","특정한 태그 형식(vMAJOR.MINOR.PATCH)이 필요"],"es":["Requiere el sistema de control de versiones Git","Se requiere un formato de etiqueta específico (vMAJOR.MINOR.PATCH)"],"fr":["Nécessite le système de contrôle de version Git","Un format d''étiquette spécifique est requis (vMAJOR.MINOR.PATCH)"],"de":["Benötigt das Git-versionskontrollsystem","Ein bestimmtes Tagformat ist erforderlich (vMAJOR.MINOR.PATCH)"],"pt":["Requer sistema de controle de versão Git","Formato de tag específico necessário (vMAIOR.MINOR.PATCH)"],"ru":["Требуется система контроля версий Git","Требуется конкретный формат тэга (vMAJOR.MINOR.PATCH)"],"ar":["يتطلب نظام التحكم في الإصدار Git","تنسيق علامة محدد مطلوب (vMAJOR.MINOR.PATCH)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('nevir/agentfill/skill', 'community', 'nevir', 'agentfill', 'nevir/agentfill', 'skill', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.419Z', '2026-02-18T04:21:54.113Z', NULL, '{"id":"nevir/agentfill/skill","name":"skill","description":{"zh":"A polyfill that standardizes and centralizes AGENTS.md configuration and Agent Skills support.","ja":"AGENTS.mdAgent Skills","ko":"AGENTS.md Agent Skills ","es":"Este polyfill estandariza y centraliza la configuración de AGENTS.md y el soporte de habilidades de agentes en tu repositorio","fr":"Ce polyfill standardise et centralise la configuration de AGENTS.md et le support des compétences des agents dans votre référentiel","de":"Dieser Polyfill standardisiert und zentralisiert die Konfiguration von AGENTS.md und die Unterstützung von Agentenfähigkeiten in Ihrem Repository","pt":"O polyfill para habilidades de agentes standardiza e centraliza a configuração do AGENTS.md e suporte a habilidades de agentes no seu repositório.","ru":"Полифилл для навыков агентов стандартизирует и централизует конфигурацию AGENTS.md и поддержку навыков агентов в вашем репозитории.","ar":"ملء متعدد للسمات الوكيل يوحّد ومركزية إعدادات AGENTS.md ودعم سمات الوكيل في مستودعك.","en":"A \"polyfill\" that standardizes and centralizes AGENTS.md configuration and Agent Skills support within your repository."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Agent Skills Polyfill","ja":"Agent Skills ","ko":"Agent Skills ","es":"Polyfill para habilidades de agentes","fr":"Polyfill pour les compétences des agents","de":"Polyfill für Agentenfähigkeiten","pt":"Polyfill para Habilidades de Agentes","ru":"Полифилл для навыков агентов","ar":"ملء متعدد للسمات الوكيل","en":"skill"},"description":{"zh":"A polyfill that standardizes and centralizes AGENTS.md configuration and Agent Skills support.","ja":"AGENTS.mdAgent Skills","ko":"AGENTS.md Agent Skills ","es":"Este polyfill estandariza y centraliza la configuración de AGENTS.md y el soporte de habilidades de agentes en tu repositorio","fr":"Ce polyfill standardise et centralise la configuration de AGENTS.md et le support des compétences des agents dans votre référentiel","de":"Dieser Polyfill standardisiert und zentralisiert die Konfiguration von AGENTS.md und die Unterstützung von Agentenfähigkeiten in Ihrem Repository","pt":"O polyfill para habilidades de agentes standardiza e centraliza a configuração do AGENTS.md e suporte a habilidades de agentes no seu repositório.","ru":"Полифилл для навыков агентов стандартизирует и централизует конфигурацию AGENTS.md и поддержку навыков агентов в вашем репозитории.","ar":"ملء متعدد للسمات الوكيل يوحّد ومركزية إعدادات AGENTS.md ودعم سمات الوكيل في مستودعك.","en":"A \"polyfill\" that standardizes and centralizes AGENTS.md configuration and Agent Skills support within your repository."},"definition":{"en":"A \"polyfill\" that standardizes and centralizes AGENTS.md configuration and Agent Skills support within your repository."},"features":{"zh":["Create or update portable agent skills","Work across Claude Code, Gemini CLI, and other agents","Support the Agent Skills specification","Centralize AGENTS.md configuration","Standardize Agent Skills support"],"ja":["Agent Skills","Claude Code, Gemini CLI","Agent Skills","AGENTS.md","Agent Skills"],"ko":["Agent Skills ","Claude Code, Gemini CLI ","Agent Skills ","AGENTS.md ","Agent Skills "],"es":["Crea habilidades de agentes portátiles","Soporte para Claude Code y Gemini CLI","Compatibilidad con la especificación de habilidades de agentes","Actualiza habilidades de agentes existentes","Centraliza la configuración de AGENTS.md"],"fr":["Créez des compétences d''agent portables","Prise en charge de Claude Code et Gemini CLI","Compatibilité avec la spécification des compétences des agents","Met à jour les compétences d''agent existantes","Centralise la configuration de AGENTS.md"],"de":["Erstellt portable Agentenfähigkeiten","Unterstützung für Claude Code und Gemini CLI","Kompatibilität mit der Agentenfähigkeits-Spezifikation","Aktualisiert bestehende Agentenfähigkeiten","Zentralisiert die Konfiguration von AGENTS.md"],"pt":["Criação de habilidades de agentes portáteis","Suporte a múltiplos agentes","Standardização da configuração do AGENTS.md","Centralização do suporte a habilidades de agentes","Compatibilidade com Claude Code e Gemini CLI"],"ru":["Создание переносимых навыков агентов","Поддержка нескольких агентов","Стандартизация конфигурации AGENTS.md","Централизация поддержки навыков агентов","Совместимость с Claude Code и Gemini CLI"],"ar":["إنشاء سمات وكلاء محمولة","دعم وكلاء متعددين","توحيد إعدادات AGENTS.md","مركزية دعم سمات الوكيل","التوافق مع Claude Code و Gemini CLI"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Agent Skills","Polyfill","AGENTS.md","configuration","centralize","standardize","Claude Code","Gemini CLI","Agent Skills specification"],"ja":["Agent Skills","Polyfill","AGENTS.md","","Claude Code","Gemini CLI","Agent Skills"],"ko":["Agent Skills","Polyfill","AGENTS.md","","Claude Code","Gemini CLI","Agent Skills "],"es":["polyfill para habilidades de agentes","habilidades de agentes portátiles","configuración de AGENTS.md","especificación de habilidades de agentes","Claude Code","Gemini CLI","desarrollo de agentes"],"fr":["polyfill pour les compétences des agents","compétences d''agent portables","configuration de AGENTS.md","spécification des compétences des agents","Claude Code","Gemini CLI","développement d''agents"],"de":["Polyfill für Agentenfähigkeiten","portable Agentenfähigkeiten","Konfiguration von AGENTS.md","Agentenfähigkeits-Spezifikation","Claude Code","Gemini CLI","Agentenentwicklung"],"pt":["polyfill para habilidades de agentes","standardização da configuração do AGENTS.md","suporte a habilidades de agentes","agentes portáteis","Claude Code","Gemini CLI","desenvolvimento de software","tecnologia de agentes"],"ru":["полифилл для навыков агентов","стандартизация конфигурации AGENTS.md","поддержка навыков агентов","переносимые агенты","Claude Code","Gemini CLI","разработка программного обеспечения","технология агентов"],"ar":["ملء متعدد للسمات الوكيل","توحيد إعدادات AGENTS.md","دعم سمات الوكيل","وكلاء محمولون","Claude Code","Gemini CLI","تطوير البرمجيات","تكنولوجيا الوكيل"]}},"owner":"nevir","repo":"agentfill","repoPath":"nevir/agentfill","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.419Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"skill","description":">-","bodyPreview":"# /skill\n\nCreate or update portable agent skills in `.agents/skills/` that work across Claude Code, Gemini CLI, and other agents supporting the [Agent Skills specification](https://agentskills.io).\n\n## Determine the Mode\n\n**Creating a new skill** — the user wants a skill that doesn''t exist yet. Follow the full workflow below.\n\n**Updating an existing skill** — the user wants to modify a skill in `.agents/skills/`. Read the existing SKILL.md and supporting files first, then apply changes following","body":"# /skill\n\nCreate or update portable agent skills in `.agents/skills/` that work across Claude Code, Gemini CLI, and other agents supporting the [Agent Skills specification](https://agentskills.io).\n\n## Determine the Mode\n\n**Creating a new skill** — the user wants a skill that doesn''t exist yet. Follow the full workflow below.\n\n**Updating an existing skill** — the user wants to modify a skill in `.agents/skills/`. Read the existing SKILL.md and supporting files first, then apply changes following the same quality principles.\n\n## Creating a New Skill\n\n### Step 1: Understand\n\nAsk the user to describe what they want the skill to do. Gather:\n\n- **Purpose**: What task does this skill help with?\n- **Trigger**: When should an agent activate this skill? What would the user say?\n- **Examples**: 2-3 concrete examples of the skill in action (input/output or before/after)\n\nIf the user is vague, suggest concrete examples to refine the scope. A good skill is focused — it does one thing well. If the request covers multiple distinct tasks, suggest splitting into separate skills.\n\n### Step 2: Research\n\nBefore writing the skill:\n\n- Search for existing patterns, conventions, and code related to the skill''s domain\n- Check `.agents/skills/` for existing skills that might overlap\n- Identify project-specific conventions the skill should follow\n- Note any tools, scripts, or references the skill might need to bundle\n\n### Step 3: Plan\n\nDesign the skill and present the plan to the user before writing:\n\n- **Name**: lowercase-hyphenated, 1-64 characters, descriptive. This becomes the `/slash-command`.\n- **Description**: 1-2 sentences covering WHAT it does and WHEN to use it. Include keywords matching how users naturally phrase the request. This is the most important field — it determines when agents auto-activate the skill.\n- **Instructions outline**: Key steps, rules, and examples. Only include information the agent doesn''t already know.\n- **Supporting files**: Decide what goes in SKILL.md vs `references/`:\n  - **In SKILL.md**: Rules and content the agent needs in every or most activations\n  - **In references/**: Content needed only in specific scenarios (e.g., \"when creating a new script from scratch\")\n  - Each reference file needs a clear trigger condition — not just \"overflow\"\n  - Multiple focused files are better than one monolithic reference\n\n### Step 4: Create\n\nCreate the skill directory and files:\n\n1. Create `.agents/skills/<name>/`\n2. Write `SKILL.md` with YAML frontmatter and markdown body\n3. Add supporting files as needed (`references/`, `scripts/`, `assets/`)\n\nUse the SKILL.md template below. For the full frontmatter reference, read `references/skill-specification.md`.\n\n**SKILL.md template:**\n\n```yaml\n---\nname: <lowercase-hyphenated-name>\ndescription: >-\n  <What it does>. <When to use it — include trigger keywords>.\n---\n\n# <Skill Title>\n\n<Brief overview — 1-2 sentences.>\n\n## <Main workflow or instructions>\n\n<Steps, rules, examples. Only include what the agent doesn''t already know.>\n```\n\n**Key rules:**\n- Keep the body under 500 lines (aim for under 200 for workflow skills; up to 400 for style/rules skills)\n- Use universal frontmatter fields (`name`, `description`) for portability\n- Agent-specific fields (like Claude''s `allowed-tools`) are safe to add but will be ignored by other agents\n- Use input/output examples — they''re more effective than descriptions\n- Reference supporting files from the body so the agent knows when to load them\n\n### Step 5: Validate\n\nRun the validation script to check structure and frontmatter:\n\n```sh\n.agents/skills/skill/scripts/validate-skill.sh .agents/skills/<name>\n```\n\nAlso verify manually:\n\n- [ ] `name` is lowercase-hyphenated, 1-64 characters\n- [ ] `description` explains WHAT and WHEN (includes trigger keywords)\n- [ ] Body is focused — no information the agent already knows\n- [ ] No unnecessary agent-specific assumptions in instructions\n- [ ] Supporting files are referenced from SKILL.md\n- [ ] Scripts are executable (`chmod +x`)\n\n### Step 6: Test\n\nSuggest the user test the skill:\n\n1. Start a new agent session (skills are discovered at session start)\n2. Ask the agent to perform the task the skill handles\n3. Verify the skill activates and produces correct results\n4. If it doesn''t activate, check the description for missing trigger keywords\n\n## Updating an Existing Skill\n\n1. **Read** the existing SKILL.md and all supporting files\n2. **Understand** what changes are needed and why\n3. **Update** the files, keeping the same quality principles (conciseness, portability, good description)\n4. **Validate** with the validation script\n5. **Note**: Claude Code hot-reloads skill changes (v2.1.0+) — no restart needed\n\n## Design Principles\n\n### Description Quality Matters Most\n\nThe description determines whether agents auto-activate the skill. Write it as if explaining to a colleague when they should reach for this tool. Include the 3-5 most natural phrasings a user would use.\n\n### Concise is Key\n\nOnly include information the agent doesn''t already know. If the agent can figure something out from context, don''t spell it out. Challenge every paragraph.\n\n### Portability First\n\nSkills in `.agents/skills/` are shared across all configured agents. Stick to universal frontmatter fields. Describe actions rather than naming agent-specific tools. Use forward slashes for paths.\n\n### One Skill, One Job\n\nEach skill should have a focused purpose. If a skill tries to do too many things, it will either trigger too broadly or its instructions will be too vague to be useful. Split into separate skills instead.\n\n### Right-Size Your References\n\nNot all content belongs in `references/`. If the agent needs content in most activations, it belongs in SKILL.md. Reference files are for content needed only in specific scenarios.\n\n**In SKILL.md** (loaded every activation):\n- Core rules, conventions, and patterns\n- Examples of correct/incorrect usage\n- Common decision guidance\n\n**In focused reference files** (loaded on demand):\n- Full code templates (e.g., \"read when creating a new script from scratch\")\n- Detailed rules for uncommon scenarios (e.g., \"read when formatting tables\")\n- Extended examples for edge cases\n\n**Reference file guidelines:**\n- Each file should have a clear load trigger stated in SKILL.md\n- Name files by scenario: `new-script-template.md` not `full-guide.md`\n- Multiple small files (50-150 lines each) beat one large file\n- A reference that''s always loaded defeats the purpose — merge it into SKILL.md\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:21:54.113Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Multi-Agent Developers needing standardized skill configuration across Claude Code, Gemini CLI, and other Agent Skills specification-compliant agents.","zh":"适合需要在Claude Code、Gemini CLI和其他符合Agent Skills规范的代理技能中实现标准化技能配置的多代理开发人员。","ja":"Claude Code、Gemini CLI、そしてその他のエージェントスキル仕様に準拠したエージェントで標準化されたスキル構成が必要なマルチエージェント開発者に最適です。","ko":"Claude Code, Gemini CLI 및 기타 에이전트 스킬 사양 규격을 준수하는 에이전트에서 표준화된 스킬 구성을 필요로 하는 멀티 에이전트 개발자를 위한 최적의 솔루션입니다.","es":"Perfecto para desarrolladores de Multi-Agent que necesitan una configuración de habilidades estandarizada en Claude Code, Gemini CLI y otros agentes compatibles con la especificación de habilidades de agente.","fr":"Parfait pour les développeurs de Multi-Agent ayant besoin d''une configuration de compétences standardisée dans Claude Code, Gemini CLI et d''autres agents conformes à la spécification de compétences d''agent.","de":"Perfekt für Multi-Agent-Entwickler, die eine standardisierte Fähigkeitskonfiguration in Claude Code, Gemini CLI und anderen Agent-Skills-Spezifikations-konformen Agenten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para desenvolvedores de Multi-Agent que precisam de configuração de habilidades padronizadas em toda a Claude Code, Gemini CLI e outros agentes compatíveis com a especificação de habilidades de agentes.","ru":"Идеально подходит для разработчиков многоагентных систем, которым необходима стандартизированная конфигурация навыков во всех приложениях Claude Code, Gemini CLI и других агентов, соответствующих спецификации навыков агентов.","ar":"مثالي لمنطقي متعددة الوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى تكوين مهارات معياري عبر كلود كود، جيميني سي إل آي، ووكلاء مهارات دیگر مطابقين لمواصفات مهارات الوكيل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to work seamlessly with portable skills using the Agent Skills specification, supporting centralized configuration in `.agents/skills/` and compatibility with multiple agent platforms via standardized SKILL.md and supporting files, leveraging the Gemini CLI and Claude Code ecosystems.","zh":"赋予代理能够无缝地与便携式技能一起工作，使用代理技能规范，支持 `.agents/skills/` 中的集中配置，并通过标准化的SKILL.md和支持文件与多个代理平台兼容，利用Gemini CLI和Claude Code生态系统。","ja":"エージェントスキル仕様を使用して、エージェントがポータブルスキルとシームレスに連携できるようにし、`.agents/skills/`での集中構成をサポートし、標準化されたSKILL.mdとサポートファイルを介して複数のエージェントプラットフォームと互換性を保ち、Gemini CLIとClaude Codeのエコシステムを活用します。","ko":"에이전트 스킬 사양을 사용하여 에이전트가 이식 가능한 스킬과 무결점으로 협력할 수 있도록 하며, `.agents/skills/`의 집중 구성과 표준화된 SKILL.md 및 지원 파일을 통해 여러 에이전트 플랫폼과 호환성을 지원하며, Gemini CLI 및 Claude Code 생태계를 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a trabajar de forma fluida con habilidades portátiles que utilizan la especificación de habilidades de agente, admitiendo una configuración centralizada en `.agents/skills/` y la compatibilidad con varias plataformas de agentes a través de un SKILL.md estandarizado y archivos de soporte, aprovechando los ecosistemas de Gemini CLI y Claude Code.","fr":"Permet aux agents de travailler en toute transparence avec des compétences portables utilisant la spécification de compétences d''agent, en prenant en charge une configuration centralisée dans `.agents/skills/` et la compatibilité avec plusieurs plateformes d''agents via un SKILL.md standardisé et des fichiers de support, en exploitant les écosystèmes de Gemini CLI et de Claude Code.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, nahtlos mit portablen Fähigkeiten zu arbeiten, die die Agent-Skills-Spezifikation verwenden, und unterstützt eine zentrale Konfiguration in `.agents/skills/` sowie die Kompatibilität mit mehreren Agent-Plattformen über ein standardisiertes SKILL.md und unterstützende Dateien, indem es die Ökosysteme von Gemini CLI und Claude Code nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a trabalharem de forma transparente com habilidades portáteis usando a especificação de habilidades de agentes, com suporte a configuração centralizada em `.agents/skills/` e compatibilidade com várias plataformas de agentes por meio de SKILL.md e arquivos de suporte padronizados, aproveitando os ecossistemas Gemini CLI e Claude Code.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность работать без проблем с переносными навыками, используя спецификацию навыков агентов, поддерживая централизованную конфигурацию в `.agents/skills/` и совместимость с несколькими платформами агентов посредством стандартизированных SKILL.md и файлов поддержки, используя экосистемы Gemini CLI и Claude Code.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من العمل بسهولة مع المهارات القابلة للنقل باستخدام مواصفات مهارات الوكيل، مع دعم التكوين المركزي في `.agents/skills/` ومدى توافق مع منصات وكلاء متعددة من خلال ملفات SKILL.md المقابلة ومرفقاتها المعيارية، واستخدام بيئات جيميني سي إل آي وكلود كود."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating portable skills for cross-agent compatibility","Updating existing skills for improved functionality","Standardizing skill configuration across repositories"],"zh":["为跨代理兼容性创建便携式技能","更新现有技能以提高功能","在存储库中标准化技能配置"],"ja":["クロスエージェント互換性のためのポータブルスキルの作成","既存のスキルの更新による機能の向上","リポジトリ間でのスキル構成の標準化"],"ko":["에이전트 간 상호 운용성을 위한 이식 가능한 스킬 생성","기존 스킬의 更新을 통한 기능 개선","리포지토리 간 스킬 구성의 표준화"],"es":["Creación de habilidades portátiles para la compatibilidad entre agentes","Actualización de habilidades existentes para mejorar la funcionalidad","Estandarización de la configuración de habilidades en varios repositorios"],"fr":["Création de compétences portables pour la compatibilité entre agents","Mise à jour de compétences existantes pour améliorer la fonctionnalité","Standardisation de la configuration de compétences dans plusieurs référentiels"],"de":["Erstellung portabler Fähigkeiten für die Kompatibilität zwischen Agenten","Aktualisierung bestehender Fähigkeiten zur Verbesserung der Funktionalität","Standardisierung der Fähigkeitskonfiguration in mehreren Repositories"],"pt":["Criar habilidades portáteis para compatibilidade entre agentes","Atualizar habilidades existentes para melhorar a funcionalidade","Padronizar a configuração de habilidades em repositórios"],"ru":["Создание переносных навыков для совместимости между агентами","Обновление существующих навыков для улучшения функциональности","Стандартизация конфигурации навыков в репозиториях"],"ar":["إنشاء مهارات قابلة للنقل لتوافق الوكلاء المتبادل","تحديث المهارات الحالية لتحسين الوظائف","تمييز تكوين المهارات عبر مستودعات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of Agent Skills specification","Limited to agents supporting the Agent Skills specification"],"zh":["需要了解代理技能规范","仅限支持代理技能规范的代理"],"ja":["エージェントスキル仕様の理解が必要","エージェントスキル仕様をサポートするエージェントのみに限定"],"ko":["에이전트 스킬 사양에 대한 이해가 필요","에이전트 스킬 사양을 지원하는 에이전트에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de la especificación de habilidades de agente","Limitado a agentes que admiten la especificación de habilidades de agente"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension de la spécification de compétences d''agent","Limité aux agents prenant en charge la spécification de compétences d''agent"],"de":["Erfordert das Verständnis der Agent-Skills-Spezifikation","Begrenzt auf Agenten, die die Agent-Skills-Spezifikation unterstützen"],"pt":["Exige compreensão da especificação de habilidades de agentes","Limitado a agentes que suportam a especificação de habilidades de agentes"],"ru":["Требует понимания спецификации навыков агентов","Ограничен агентами, поддерживающими спецификацию навыков агентов"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم مواصفات مهارات الوكيل","محدود بالوكلاء التي تدعم مواصفات مهارات الوكيل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
