 travail interactif pour publier des packages Hex avec vérification manuelle","de":"Der Hex-Release ist ein interaktiver Workflow zum Veröffentlichen von Hex-Paketen mit manueller Überprüfung","pt":"O lançamento Hex é um fluxo de trabalho interativo para lançar pacotes com verificação manual em cada etapa","ru":"Hex Релиз - это интерактивный workflow для выпуска пакетов с ручной проверкой на каждом этапе","ar":"إصدار Hex هو تدفق عمل تفاعلي لإصدار الحزم مع التحقق اليدوي في كل خطوة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["自动化发布","手动发布","支持GitHub Actions","支持本地发布","交互式工作流程","手动验证"],"ja":["自動化リリース","手動リリース","GitHub Actionsのサポート","ローカルリリースのサポート","インタラクティブなワークフロー","手動検証"],"ko":["자동 릴리스","수동 릴리스","GitHub Actions 지원","로컬 릴리스 지원","대화형 워크플로우","수동 검증"],"es":["Flujo de trabajo interactivo","Verificación manual en cada paso","Compatibilidad con GitHub Actions","Lanzamiento automático y manual","Preparación de lanzamiento","Creación de etiquetas de lanzamiento"],"fr":["Flux de travail interactif","Vérification manuelle à chaque étape","Compatibilité avec GitHub Actions","Publication automatique et manuelle","Préparation de publication","Création d''étiquettes de publication"],"de":["Interaktiver Workflow","Manuelle Überprüfung bei jedem Schritt","Kompatibilität mit GitHub Actions","Automatisierte und manuelle Veröffentlichung","Vorbereitung der Veröffentlichung","Erstellung von Veröffentlichungsetiketten"],"pt":["Fluxo de trabalho interativo","Verificação manual em cada etapa","Suporte a lançamento automático via GitHub Actions","Suporte a lançamento manual local","Criação de tags de lançamento","Gatilho de workflow de lançamento"],"ru":["Интерактивный workflow","Ручная проверка на каждом этапе","Поддержка автоматического выпуска через GitHub Actions","Поддержка ручного выпуска локально","Создание тегов выпуска","Триггер workflow выпуска"],"ar":["تدفق عمل تفاعلي","التحقق اليدوي في كل خطوة","دعم الإصدار التلقائي عبر GitHub Actions","دعم الإصدار اليدوي المحلي","إنشاء علامات الإصدار","مفعّل تدفق العمل للإصدار"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Hex包","自动化发布","手动发布","GitHub Actions","本地发布","交互式工作流程","手动验证","开发工具"],"ja":["Hexパッケージ","自動化リリース","手動リリース","GitHub Actions","ローカルリリース","インタラクティブなワークフロー","手動検証","開発ツール"],"ko":["Hex 패키지","자동 릴리스","수동 릴리스","GitHub Actions","로컬 릴리스","대화형 워크플로우","수동 검증","개발 도구"],"es":["lanzamiento de Hex","flujo de trabajo interactivo","verificación manual","GitHub Actions","lanzamiento automático","lanzamiento manual","preparación de lanzamiento","creación de etiquetas de lanzamiento"],"fr":["sortie Hex","flux de travail interactif","vérification manuelle","GitHub Actions","publication automatique","publication manuelle","préparation de publication","création d''étiquettes de publication"],"de":["Hex-Release","interaktiver Workflow","manuelle Überprüfung","GitHub Actions","automatisierte Veröffentlichung","manuelle Veröffentlichung","Vorbereitung der Veröffentlichung","Erstellung von Veröffentlichungsetiketten"],"pt":["lançamento hex","fluxo de trabalho interativo","verificação manual","github actions","lançamento de pacotes","criação de tags","workflow de lançamento","desenvolvimento de software","automatização de processos"],"ru":["hex релиз","интерактивный workflow","ручная проверка","github actions","выпуск пакетов","создание тегов","workflow выпуска","разработка программного обеспечения","автоматизация процессов"],"ar":["إصدار hex","تدفق عمل تفاعلي","التحقق اليدوي","github actions","إصدار الحزم","إنشاء علامات","تدفق العمل للإصدار","تطوير البرمجيات","توفير العمليات"]}},"owner":"agentjido","repo":"jido_action","repoPath":"agentjido/jido_action","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.419Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"hex-release","description":"Guides interactive Hex package release for AgentJido repos. Supports automated (GitHub Actions workflow_dispatch) and manual release flows. Uses git_ops for version bumping and changelog generation. Triggers on: release, hex publish, bump version, new release, publish package.","bodyPreview":"# Hex Release (Human-in-the-Loop)\n\nInteractive workflow for releasing a Hex package with manual verification at each step.\nSupports two release paths: **automated** (via GitHub Actions) and **manual** (local).\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when asked to:\n- Release a new version to Hex\n- Bump the package version\n- Prepare a release\n- Create a release tag\n- Trigger a release workflow\n\n## Pre-flight Checks\n\nBefore starting, run these checks automatically:\n\n### 1. Identify the Package\n\nRead `mix.e","body":"# Hex Release (Human-in-the-Loop)\n\nInteractive workflow for releasing a Hex package with manual verification at each step.\nSupports two release paths: **automated** (via GitHub Actions) and **manual** (local).\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when asked to:\n- Release a new version to Hex\n- Bump the package version\n- Prepare a release\n- Create a release tag\n- Trigger a release workflow\n\n## Pre-flight Checks\n\nBefore starting, run these checks automatically:\n\n### 1. Identify the Package\n\nRead `mix.exs` to determine:\n- Package name (from `project()` → `:name` or `:app`)\n- Current version (from `@version` or `project()` → `:version`)\n- Whether it has `git_ops` as a dependency (required for automated release)\n\n### 2. Check for Git Dependencies\n\n```bash\ngrep -E ''github:|git:|path:'' mix.exs\n```\n\nCategorize any git/path deps found:\n- **dev/test only** (`only: [:dev, :test]`): Will not block Hex publish — note but continue\n- **runtime deps**: **STOP** — these block `mix hex.publish`. Tell the user which deps need to be published to Hex first or switched to Hex versions\n\n### 3. Git Status\n\n```bash\ngit status --porcelain\n```\nIf dirty, **STOP** and ask user to commit or stash changes first.\n\n### 4. Verify Branch\n\n```bash\ngit branch --show-current\n```\nConfirm user is on `main`. Warn if on a different branch.\n\n### 5. Check for Releasable Commits\n\n```bash\ngit log --oneline $(git describe --tags --abbrev=0 2>/dev/null || echo \"\")..HEAD\n```\nIf no commits since last tag, **STOP** — nothing to release.\n\nReview commits and confirm they follow conventional commit format (`feat:`, `fix:`, `chore:`, etc.).\nNon-conventional commits won''t be picked up by `git_ops` for the CHANGELOG.\n\n### 6. Run Tests\n\n```bash\nmix test\n```\nIf tests fail, **STOP** and show failures.\n\n### 7. Run Quality Checks\n\n```bash\nmix quality\n```\nThis typically runs: format check, compile with warnings-as-errors, credo, and dialyzer.\nIf the alias doesn''t exist, run `mix format --check-formatted && mix compile --warnings-as-errors` as a minimum.\nIf any check fails, **STOP** and show the issues.\n\n### 8. Hex Publish Dry Run\n\n```bash\nmix hex.publish --dry-run\n```\nVerify the package metadata and file list look correct. If this fails, **STOP**.\n\n**SHOW USER**: Summary of all pre-flight results and current version.\n\n**ASK USER**: \"All checks passed. Which release path: **automated** (GitHub Actions) or **manual** (local)?\"\n\n---\n\n## Path A: Automated Release (GitHub Actions)\n\nThe AgentJido repos have a reusable release workflow triggered via `workflow_dispatch`.\n\n### Step 1: Confirm Workflow Exists\n\nCheck that `.github/workflows/release.yml` exists and calls:\n```yaml\nuses: agentjido/github-actions/.github/workflows/elixir-release.yml@main\n```\n\n### Step 2: Explain Dispatch Options\n\n**TELL USER**:\n```\nThe release workflow supports these options:\n\n  • dry_run: true     — Full dry run (no git push, no tag, no Hex publish)\n  • hex_dry_run: true — Runs git_ops release + push, but skips actual Hex publish\n  • skip_tests: true  — Skip test step (use if CI already passed)\n\nRecommended first run: dry_run: true\n```\n\n### Step 3: Trigger the Workflow\n\n**Option 1 — GitHub CLI** (if `gh` is available):\n```bash\n# Dry run first\ngh workflow run release.yml -f dry_run=true\n\n# Watch the run\ngh run list --workflow=release.yml --limit=1\ngh run watch\n```\n\n**Option 2 — GitHub UI**:\n```\n1. Go to: https://github.com/agentjido/{REPO}/actions/workflows/release.yml\n2. Click \"Run workflow\"\n3. Set dry_run = true for first attempt\n4. Click \"Run workflow\"\n```\n\n**ASK USER**: \"Run a dry run first? (recommended)\"\n\n### Step 4: Verify Dry Run Results\n\nAfter the dry run completes:\n```bash\ngh run view --log-failed  # Check for errors\n```\n\nReview the workflow summary for:\n- Version that would be released\n- Hex publish dry-run output\n- Any skipped steps\n\n**ASK USER**: \"Dry run succeeded. Ready to run the real release?\"\n\n### Step 5: Trigger Real Release\n\n```bash\ngh workflow run release.yml\n# Or with skip_tests if CI already passed:\ngh workflow run release.yml -f skip_tests=true\n```\n\n### Step 6: Verify\n\n```bash\ngh run watch  # Wait for completion\n```\n\n**TELL USER**:\n```\n✅ Release triggered!\n\nThe workflow will:\n  1. Run git_ops.release to bump version + update CHANGELOG\n  2. Push the release commit and tag\n  3. Publish to Hex.pm\n  4. Create a GitHub Release\n\nMonitor at: https://github.com/agentjido/{REPO}/actions\nAfter publish, verify at: https://hex.pm/packages/{PACKAGE}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Path B: Manual Release (Local)\n\nUse when the automated workflow isn''t available, or for repos that can''t publish to Hex (e.g., git deps blocking publish).\n\n### Step 1: Determine Version Bump\n\n`git_ops` handles this automatically from conventional commits, but ask the user for confirmation.\n\nRun the release in dry-run mode to preview:\n```bash\nmix git_ops.release --dry-run\n```\n\nThis shows what version would be bumped to based on commit types:\n- `feat:` commits → minor bump\n- `fix:` commits → patch bump\n- `BREAKING CHANGE:` → major bump\n\n**SHOW USER**: The proposed version bump and commits that will be included.\n\n**ASK USER**: \"git_ops wants to release vX.Y.Z. Proceed, or override with a specific version?\"\n\n### Step 2: Run the Release\n\n```bash\n# Let git_ops decide the version:\nmix git_ops.release --yes\n\n# Or force a specific version:\nmix git_ops.release --yes --new-version X.Y.Z\n```\n\nThis will:\n- Bump the version in `mix.exs`\n- Update `CHANGELOG.md` from conventional commits\n- Create a release commit\n- Create a git tag\n\n**SHOW USER**: The release commit diff and tag.\n\n### Step 3: Review Before Pushing\n\n```bash\ngit log --oneline -3\ngit diff HEAD~1\ngit tag -l | tail -5\n```\n\n**ASK USER**: \"Release commit and tag created locally. Ready to push?\"\n\n### Step 4: Push\n\n```bash\ngit push origin main\ngit push origin --tags\n```\n\n### Step 5: Publish to Hex\n\n```bash\n# Final dry-run check\nmix hex.publish --dry-run\n\n# Publish\nmix hex.publish --yes\n```\n\n### Step 6: Create GitHub Release\n\n```bash\nVERSION=\"v$(grep -m1 ''@version \"'' mix.exs | sed ''s/.*\"\\(.*\\)\".*/\\1/'')\"\ngh release create \"$VERSION\" \\\n  --title \"Release $VERSION\" \\\n  --notes \"See [CHANGELOG.md](CHANGELOG.md) for details.\"\n```\n\n**TELL USER**:\n```\n✅ Release complete!\n\n  Published: https://hex.pm/packages/{PACKAGE}\n  GitHub:    https://github.com/agentjido/{REPO}/releases/tag/{VERSION}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Rollback\n\n### Before pushing:\n```bash\ngit reset --soft HEAD~1          # Undo release commit\ngit tag -d v{VERSION}            # Delete local tag\ngit checkout mix.exs CHANGELOG.md  # Restore files\n```\n\n### After pushing but before Hex publish:\n```bash\ngit push origin :refs/tags/v{VERSION}  # Delete remote tag\ngit revert HEAD                         # Revert release commit\ngit push origin main\n```\n\n### After Hex publish:\nHex packages **cannot be unpublished** after 1 hour. You can retire a version:\n```bash\nmix hex.retire {PACKAGE} {VERSION} invalid --message \"Released in error\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Notes\n\n- All AgentJido repos use **conventional commits** — non-conventional commits are ignored by `git_ops`\n- The `quality` mix alias varies per repo — check `mix.exs` aliases section\n- `git_ops` is a dev-only dependency — release commands run in `MIX_ENV=dev`\n- The automated workflow uses `GITHUB_TOKEN` for git push and `HEX_API_KEY` (org secret) for Hex publish\n- Repos with runtime git dependencies (e.g., `jido_runic`) cannot publish to Hex — use manual path for git tag/release only, skip Hex publish step\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:22:07.259Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Elixir Agents needing streamlined package release management on Hex","zh":"非常适合需要在 Hex 上简化包管理的 Elixir 代理","ja":"Hex 上でパッケージのリリース管理を簡素化する必要がある Elixir エージェントに最適","ko":"Hex에서 패키지 릴리스 관리를 간소화해야 하는 Elixir 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes Elixir que necesitan una gestión de lanzamiento de paquetes optimizada en Hex","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Elixir ayant besoin d''une gestion de version de package simplifiée sur Hex","de":"Perfekt für Elixir-Agents, die eine optimierte Paket-Veröffentlichungsverwaltung auf Hex benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Elixir que necessitam de uma gestão simplificada de lançamento de pacotes no Hex","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Elixir, которым требуется упрощенное управление выпуском пакетов на Hex","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء Elixir الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة مبسطة لإصدار الحزم على Hex"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate Hex package releases via GitHub Actions or manual local workflows, supporting package version bumps, release tag creation, and trigger release workflows with mix.exs file verification","zh":"使代理能够通过 GitHub Actions 或手动本地工作流自动执行 Hex 包的发布，支持包版本升级、发布标签创建，并通过 mix.exs 文件验证触发发布工作流","ja":"エージェントが GitHub Actions または手動のローカル ワークフローを介して Hex パッケージのリリースを自動化できるようにし、パッケージ バージョンのバンプ、リリース タグの作成、mix.exs ファイルの検証によるリリース ワークフローのトリガーをサポート","ko":"에이전트가 GitHub Actions 또는 수동 로컬 워크플ロー 통해 Hex 패키지 릴리스를 자동화 할 수 있도록하여, 패키지 버전 업그레이드, 릴리스 태그 생성 및 mix.exs 파일 확인을 통해 릴리스 워크플로우를 트리거하는 것을 지원","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar los lanzamientos de paquetes de Hex a través de GitHub Actions o flujos de trabajo manuales locales, con soporte para incrementos de versión de paquetes, creación de etiquetas de lanzamiento y desencadenamiento de flujos de trabajo de lanzamiento con verificación del archivo mix.exs","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les versions de packages Hex via GitHub Actions ou des flux de travail manuels locaux, en prenant en charge les increments de version de package, la création d''étiquettes de version et le déclenchement de flux de travail de version avec vérification du fichier mix.exs","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, Hex-Paket-Veröffentlichungen über GitHub Actions oder manuelle lokale Workflows zu automatisieren, mit Unterstützung für Paketversionserhöhungen, Erstellung von Veröffentlichungstags und Auslösen von Veröffentlichungsworkflows mit Überprüfung der Datei mix.exs","pt":"Capacita os agentes a automatizar os lançamentos de pacotes Hex através do GitHub Actions ou de fluxos de trabalho locais manuais, suportando aumentos de versão de pacotes, criação de tags de release e acionamento de fluxos de trabalho de lançamento com verificação do arquivo mix.exs","ru":"Позволяет агентам автоматизировать выпуски пакетов Hex через GitHub Actions или вручную с помощью локальных рабочих процессов, поддерживая повышение версии пакета, создание тегов выпуска и запуск рабочих процессов выпуска с проверкой файла mix.exs","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من أتمتة إصدارات حزم Hex عبر GitHub Actions أو سير العمل المحلي اليدوي، مع دعم زيادة إصدارات الحزم، وإنشاء علامات الإصدار، وتشغيل سير عمل الإصدار مع التحقق من ملف mix.exs"},"useCases":{"en":["Releasing new package versions to Hex","Automating package version bumps","Triggering release workflows with GitHub Actions"],"zh":["将新包版本发布到 Hex","自动执行包版本升级","使用 GitHub Actions 触发发布工作流"],"ja":["Hex に新しいパッケージ バージョンをリリースする","パッケージ バージョンの自動バンプ","GitHub Actions によってリリース ワークフローをトリガーする"],"ko":["Hex에 새로운 패키지 버전 릴리스","패키지 버전 자동 업그레이드","GitHub Actions에 의해 릴리스 워크플로우 트리거"],"es":["Lanzar nuevas versiones de paquetes en Hex","Automatizar los incrementos de versión de paquetes","Desencadenar flujos de trabajo de lanzamiento con GitHub Actions"],"fr":["Publier de nouvelles versions de packages sur Hex","Automatiser les increments de version de packages","Déclencher des flux de travail de version avec GitHub Actions"],"de":["Veröffentlichen neuer Paketversionen auf Hex","Automatisieren von Paketversionserhöhungen","Auslösen von Veröffentlichungsworkflows mit GitHub Actions"],"pt":["Lançamento de novas versões de pacotes no Hex","Automatização de aumentos de versão de pacotes","Acionamento de fluxos de trabalho de lançamento com GitHub Actions"],"ru":["Выпуск новых версий пакетов на Hex","Автоматизация повышения версий пакетов","Запуск рабочих процессов выпуска с помощью GitHub Actions"],"ar":["إصدار إصدارات جديدة من الحزم على Hex","أتمتة زيادة إصدارات الحزم","تشغيل سير عمل الإصدار باستخدام GitHub Actions"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires mix.exs file access","Elixir and Hex ecosystem only","GitHub Actions setup required for automated release path"],"zh":["需要访问 mix.exs 文件","仅限 Elixir 和 Hex 生态系统","需要 GitHub Actions 设置以实现自动发布路径"],"ja":["mix.exs ファイルへのアクセスが必要","Elixir と Hex エコシステムのみ","自動リリース パスを実現するには GitHub Actions の設定が必要"],"ko":["mix.exs 파일 액세스가 필요","Elixir 및 Hex 생태계만","자동 릴리스 경로를 구현하려면 GitHub Actions 설정이 필요"],"es":["Requiere acceso al archivo mix.exs","Solo ecosistema Elixir y Hex","Se requiere configuración de GitHub Actions para la ruta de lanzamiento automatizada"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au fichier mix.exs","Écosystème Elixir et Hex uniquement","Configuration de GitHub Actions requise pour le chemin de publication automatisé"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die Datei mix.exs","Nur Elixir- und Hex-Ökosystem","GitHub-Actions-Konfiguration erforderlich für den automatisierten Veröffentlichungspfad"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao arquivo mix.exs","Apenas para o ecossistema Elixir e Hex","Configuração do GitHub Actions necessária para o caminho de release automatizado"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к файлу mix.exs","Только для экосистемы Elixir и Hex","Требуется настройка GitHub Actions для автоматизированного пути выпуска"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملف mix.exs","بيئة Elixir وHex فقط","إعداد GitHub Actions مطلوب لمسار الإصدار الآلي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('abdullah1854/MCPGateway/pptx', 'community', 'abdullah1854', 'MCPGateway', 'abdullah1854/MCPGateway', 'pptx', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.419Z', '2026-02-18T04:22:38.844Z', NULL, '{"id":"abdullah1854/MCPGateway/pptx","name":"pptx","description":{"es":"La habilidad PPTX permite crear y editar presentaciones de forma eficiente. Convierte presentaciones a PDF y extrae diapositivas con facilidad.","fr":"La compétence PPTX permet de créer et d''éditer des présentations de manière efficace. Convertissez des présentations en PDF et extrayez des diapositives avec facilité.","de":"Die PPTX-Fähigkeit ermöglicht die effiziente Erstellung und Bearbeitung von Präsentationen. Konvertieren Sie Präsentationen in PDF und extrahieren Sie Folien mit Leichtigkeit.","pt":"A habilidade PPTX permite criar apresentações de forma eficiente. Extraia slides e edite apresentações com facilidade.","ru":"Навык PPTX позволяет создавать презентации эффективно. Извлекайте слайды и редактируйте презентации с легкостью.","ar":"تمكنك مهارة PPTX من إنشاء عروض تقديمية بفعالية. استخرج الشرائح و تحرير العروض بسهولة.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"es":"Habilidad PPTX: Creación y Edición de Presentaciones","fr":"Compétence PPTX: Création et Édition de Présentations","de":"PPTX-Fähigkeit: Erstellung und Bearbeitung von Präsentati...","pt":"Criar Apresentações com Habilidade PPTX","ru":"Создание Презентаций с Помощью PPTX","ar":"إنشاء عروض تقديمية باستخدام مهارة PPTX","en":"pptx"},"description":{"es":"La habilidad PPTX permite crear y editar presentaciones de forma eficiente. Convierte presentaciones a PDF y extrae diapositivas con facilidad.","fr":"La compétence PPTX permet de créer et d''éditer des présentations de manière efficace. Convertissez des présentations en PDF et extrayez des diapositives avec...","de":"Die PPTX-Fähigkeit ermöglicht die effiziente Erstellung und Bearbeitung von Präsentationen. Konvertieren Sie Präsentationen in PDF und extrahieren Sie Folien...","pt":"A habilidade PPTX permite criar apresentações de forma eficiente. Extraia slides e edite apresentações com facilidade.","ru":"Навык PPTX позволяет создавать презентации эффективно. Извлекайте слайды и редактируйте презентации с легкостью.","ar":"تمكنك مهارة PPTX من إنشاء عروض تقديمية بفعالية. استخرج الشرائح و تحرير العروض بسهولة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"es":["Creación de presentaciones","Edición de presentaciones","Conversión a PDF","Extracción de diapositivas","Acceso a XML raw","Conversión a markdown"],"fr":["Création de présentations","Édition de présentations","Conversion en PDF","Extraction de diapositives","Accès à XML brut","Conversion en markdown"],"de":["Erstellung von Präsentationen","Bearbeitung von Präsentationen","Konvertierung in PDF","Extraktion von Folien","Zugriff auf Roh-XML","Konvertierung in Markdown"],"pt":["Criação de apresentações","Extração de slides","Edição de apresentações","Conversão para PDF","Acesso a XML raw","Suporte a marcação"],"ru":["Создание презентаций","Извлечение слайдов","Редактирование презентаций","Конвертация в PDF","Доступ к сырому XML","Поддержка разметки"],"ar":["إنشاء عروض تقديمية","استخراج الشرائح","تحرير العروض","تحويل إلى PDF","وصول إلى XML غير المعالج","دعم الترميز"]},"keywords":{"es":["pptx","presentaciones","creación de presentaciones","edición de presentaciones","conversión a pdf","extracción de diapositivas","desarrollo de presentaciones"],"fr":["pptx","présentations","création de présentations","édition de présentations","conversion en pdf","extraction de diapositives","développement de présentations"],"de":["pptx","präsentationen","erstellung von präsentationen","bearbeitung von präsentationen","konvertierung in pdf","extraktion von folien","entwicklung von präsentationen"],"pt":["PPTX","apresentações","slides","edição","conversão","XML","marcação","desenvolvimento","programação"],"ru":["PPTX","презентации","слайды","редактирование","конвертация","XML","разметка","разработка","программирование"],"ar":["PPTX","عروض تقديمية","شرائح","تحرير","تحويل","XML","ترميز","تطوير","برمجة"]}},"owner":"abdullah1854","repo":"MCPGateway","repoPath":"abdullah1854/MCPGateway","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.419Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pptx","description":"Create, edit, and analyze PowerPoint presentations (.pptx). Activates for PowerPoint, pptx, presentation, slides, deck, create slides.","bodyPreview":"# PowerPoint (PPTX) Skill\n\n## When This Skill Activates\n- \"Create a presentation\", \"make slides\"\n- \"PowerPoint\", \"pptx\", \"deck\"\n- \"Add slide\", \"edit presentation\"\n- \"Convert presentation to PDF\"\n- \"Extract slides\", \"presentation template\"\n\n## Core Workflows\n\n### 1. Reading/Analyzing Presentations\n\n**Extract to markdown:**\n```bash\npython -m markitdown presentation.pptx\n```\n\n**Access raw XML:**\n```bash\nunzip -o presentation.pptx -d pptx_extracted\nls pptx_extracted/ppt/slides/  # Individual slide X","body":"# PowerPoint (PPTX) Skill\n\n## When This Skill Activates\n- \"Create a presentation\", \"make slides\"\n- \"PowerPoint\", \"pptx\", \"deck\"\n- \"Add slide\", \"edit presentation\"\n- \"Convert presentation to PDF\"\n- \"Extract slides\", \"presentation template\"\n\n## Core Workflows\n\n### 1. Reading/Analyzing Presentations\n\n**Extract to markdown:**\n```bash\npython -m markitdown presentation.pptx\n```\n\n**Access raw XML:**\n```bash\nunzip -o presentation.pptx -d pptx_extracted\nls pptx_extracted/ppt/slides/  # Individual slide XML\n```\n\n### 2. Creating Presentations\n\n**Using python-pptx:**\n```python\nfrom pptx import Presentation\nfrom pptx.util import Inches, Pt\nfrom pptx.enum.text import PP_ALIGN\nfrom pptx.dml.color import RgbColor\n\nprs = Presentation()\n\n# Add title slide\ntitle_layout = prs.slide_layouts[0]\nslide = prs.slides.add_slide(title_layout)\ntitle = slide.shapes.title\nsubtitle = slide.placeholders[1]\n\ntitle.text = \"Presentation Title\"\nsubtitle.text = \"Subtitle Here\"\n\n# Add content slide\ncontent_layout = prs.slide_layouts[1]\nslide = prs.slides.add_slide(content_layout)\nslide.shapes.title.text = \"Slide Title\"\n\n# Add bullet points\nbody = slide.placeholders[1]\ntf = body.text_frame\ntf.text = \"First bullet point\"\n\np = tf.add_paragraph()\np.text = \"Second bullet point\"\np.level = 0\n\np = tf.add_paragraph()\np.text = \"Sub-bullet\"\np.level = 1\n\nprs.save(''output.pptx'')\n```\n\n### 3. Adding Visual Elements\n\n**Images:**\n```python\nfrom pptx.util import Inches\n\nslide = prs.slides.add_slide(prs.slide_layouts[6])  # Blank slide\nslide.shapes.add_picture(\n    ''image.png'',\n    left=Inches(1),\n    top=Inches(1),\n    width=Inches(4)\n)\n```\n\n**Tables:**\n```python\nfrom pptx.util import Inches\n\nrows, cols = 3, 4\nleft, top = Inches(1), Inches(2)\nwidth, height = Inches(8), Inches(2)\n\ntable = slide.shapes.add_table(rows, cols, left, top, width, height).table\n\n# Set column headers\ntable.cell(0, 0).text = ''Header 1''\ntable.cell(0, 1).text = ''Header 2''\n\n# Fill data\nfor row in range(1, rows):\n    for col in range(cols):\n        table.cell(row, col).text = f''R{row}C{col}''\n```\n\n**Charts:**\n```python\nfrom pptx.chart.data import CategoryChartData\nfrom pptx.enum.chart import XL_CHART_TYPE\n\nchart_data = CategoryChartData()\nchart_data.categories = [''Q1'', ''Q2'', ''Q3'', ''Q4'']\nchart_data.add_series(''Sales'', (19.2, 21.4, 16.7, 28.0))\n\nx, y, cx, cy = Inches(2), Inches(2), Inches(6), Inches(4)\nslide.shapes.add_chart(\n    XL_CHART_TYPE.COLUMN_CLUSTERED, x, y, cx, cy, chart_data\n)\n```\n\n### 4. Styling\n\n**Text formatting:**\n```python\nfrom pptx.util import Pt\nfrom pptx.dml.color import RgbColor\n\nparagraph = shape.text_frame.paragraphs[0]\nrun = paragraph.runs[0]\n\nrun.font.name = ''Arial''\nrun.font.size = Pt(24)\nrun.font.bold = True\nrun.font.color.rgb = RgbColor(0x14, 0x14, 0x13)  # Dark\n```\n\n**Slide background:**\n```python\nfrom pptx.dml.color import RgbColor\nfrom pptx.enum.dml import MSO_THEME_COLOR\n\nbackground = slide.background\nfill = background.fill\nfill.solid()\nfill.fore_color.rgb = RgbColor(0xFA, 0xF9, 0xF5)  # Light cream\n```\n\n### 5. Design Palettes\n\n| Theme | Primary | Secondary | Accent |\n|-------|---------|-----------|--------|\n| **Professional** | #141413 | #FAF9F5 | #D97757 |\n| **Ocean** | #1E3A5F | #EAF4FC | #4A90D9 |\n| **Forest** | #2D4739 | #F5F9F6 | #6B8E23 |\n| **Minimal** | #333333 | #FFFFFF | #FF6B35 |\n\n### 6. Converting to PDF/Images\n\n**To PDF:**\n```bash\n# Using LibreOffice\nlibreoffice --headless --convert-to pdf presentation.pptx\n\n# Using unoconv\nunoconv -f pdf presentation.pptx\n```\n\n**To images:**\n```bash\n# Using pdftoppm (convert to PDF first, then images)\nlibreoffice --headless --convert-to pdf presentation.pptx\npdftoppm presentation.pdf slide -png\n```\n\n### 7. Template-Based Creation\n\n```python\nfrom pptx import Presentation\n\n# Load template\nprs = Presentation(''template.pptx'')\n\n# Get available layouts\nfor i, layout in enumerate(prs.slide_layouts):\n    print(f''{i}: {layout.name}'')\n\n# Use specific layout\nslide = prs.slides.add_slide(prs.slide_layouts[2])\n\n# Replace placeholder text\nfor shape in slide.placeholders:\n    if shape.has_text_frame:\n        if ''Title'' in shape.text:\n            shape.text = ''New Title''\n```\n\n## Dependencies\n\n```bash\npip install python-pptx markitdown\nbrew install libreoffice poppler  # For PDF conversion\n```\n\n## Slide Layout Reference\n\n| Index | Layout Name | Use For |\n|-------|-------------|---------|\n| 0 | Title Slide | Opening slide |\n| 1 | Title and Content | Standard content |\n| 2 | Section Header | Section breaks |\n| 3 | Two Content | Comparison |\n| 4 | Comparison | Side-by-side |\n| 5 | Title Only | Custom content |\n| 6 | Blank | Full custom |\n\n## Output Format\n\n```markdown\n## PPTX Operation: [Create/Edit/Analyze]\n\n### Input\n[Template or requirements]\n\n### Slides Created\n1. Slide 1: [Title/Content summary]\n2. Slide 2: [Title/Content summary]\n\n### Styling Applied\n- Theme: [Name]\n- Fonts: [Primary, Secondary]\n- Colors: [Palette]\n\n### Output\n[File path, slide count]\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:22:38.844Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Document Analysis Agents needing advanced PowerPoint presentation processing capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 PowerPoint 演示文稿处理能力的文档分析代理。","ja":"ドキュメント分析エージェントが高度な PowerPoint プレゼンテーション処理機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 PowerPoint 프레젠테이션 처리 기능이 필요한 문서 분석 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Documentos que necesitan capacidades de procesamiento de presentaciones de PowerPoint avanzadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de documents nécessitant des fonctionnalités de traitement de présentation PowerPoint avancées.","de":"Perfekt für Dokumentenanalyse-Agents, die erweiterte PowerPoint-Präsentationsverarbeitungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Documentos que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de processamento de apresentações do PowerPoint.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа документов, требующих продвинутых возможностей обработки презентаций PowerPoint.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل الوثائق التي تحتاج إلى khảيات متقدمة لمعالجة عروض PowerPoint."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to extract presentation content to markdown, access raw XML, and convert presentations to PDF using Python, providing a robust set of tools for working with .pptx files and leveraging libraries like markitdown and unzip.","zh":"赋予代理从 markdown 中提取演示文稿内容、访问原始 XML、使用 Python 将演示文稿转换为 PDF 的能力，提供了一套用于处理 .pptx 文件和利用 markitdown 和 unzip 库的强大工具集。","ja":"Python を使用してプレゼンテーションの内容を markdown に抽出する、raw XML にアクセスする、プレゼンテーションを PDF に変換する機能をエージェントに与え、.pptx ファイルの操作と markitdown および unzip ライブラリの利用に対する強力なツールセットを提供する。","ko":"Python을 사용하여 프레젠테이션의 내용을 markdown로 추출하고, 원시 XML에 접근하고, 프레젠테이션을 PDF로 변환하는 기능을 에이전트에게 부여하며, .pptx 파일을 처리하고 markitdown 및 unzip 라이브러리를 활용하는 강력한 도구 세트를 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a extraer el contenido de la presentación a markdown, acceder a XML sin procesar y convertir presentaciones a PDF utilizando Python, proporcionando un conjunto robusto de herramientas para trabajar con archivos .pptx y aprovechar bibliotecas como markitdown y unzip.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''extraire le contenu de la présentation en markdown, d''accéder au XML brut et de convertir les présentations en PDF à l''aide de Python, fournissant un ensemble d''outils robuste pour travailler avec des fichiers .pptx et exploiter des bibliothèques comme markitdown et unzip.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, die Präsentationsinhalte in Markdown zu extrahieren, auf rohes XML zuzugreifen und Präsentationen mit Python in PDF umzuwandeln, und bietet ein robustes Werkzeugset zum Arbeiten mit .pptx-Dateien und zum Nutzen von Bibliotheken wie markitdown und unzip.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a extrair o conteúdo da apresentação para markdown, acessar o XML bruto e converter apresentações para PDF usando Python, fornecendo um conjunto robusto de ferramentas para trabalhar com arquivos .pptx e aproveitar bibliotecas como markitdown e unzip.","ru":"Позволяет агентам извлекать содержимое презентации в markdown, получать доступ к сырому XML и конвертировать презентации в PDF с помощью Python, обеспечивая надежный набор инструментов для работы с файлами .pptx и использования библиотек, таких как markitdown и unzip.","ar":"يمنح العميل khảية استخراج محتوى العرض إلى markdown، والوصول إلى XML غير المعالج، وتحويل العروض إلى PDF باستخدام Python، مما يوفر مجموعة أدوات قوية للعمل مع ملفات .pptx وتسخير المكتبات مثل markitdown و unzip."},"useCases":{"en":["Extracting slides from existing presentations","Converting PowerPoint decks to PDF for sharing","Analyzing presentation templates using raw XML data"],"zh":["从现有演示文稿中提取幻灯片","将 PowerPoint 演示文稿转换为 PDF 以进行共享","使用原始 XML 数据分析演示文稿模板"],"ja":["既存のプレゼンテーションからスライドを抽出する","PowerPoint のデッキを PDF に変換して共有する","raw XML データを使用してプレゼンテーションのテンプレートを分析する"],"ko":["기존 프레젠테이션에서 슬라이드를 추출하는 것","PowerPoint 데크를 PDF로 변환하여 공유하는 것","원시 XML 데이터를 사용하여 프레젠테이션 템플릿을 분석하는 것"],"es":["Extraer diapositivas de presentaciones existentes","Convertir decks de PowerPoint a PDF para compartir","Analizar plantillas de presentación utilizando datos XML sin procesar"],"fr":["Extraire des diapositives de présentations existantes","Convertir des decks PowerPoint en PDF pour les partager","Analyser des modèles de présentation en utilisant des données XML brutes"],"de":["Folien aus bestehenden Präsentationen extrahieren","PowerPoint-Decks in PDF zum Teilen umwandeln","Präsentationsvorlagen mithilfe von rohen XML-Daten analysieren"],"pt":["Extrair slides de apresentações existentes","Converter decks do PowerPoint para PDF para compartilhamento","Analizar modelos de apresentação usando dados XML brutos"],"ru":["Извлечение слайдов из существующих презентаций","Преобразование презентаций PowerPoint в PDF для обмена","Анализ шаблонов презентаций с помощью сырых XML-данных"],"ar":["استخراج الشرائح من العروض الموجودة","تحويل عروض PowerPoint إلى PDF للمشاركة","تحليل قوالب العرض باستخدام بيانات XML غير المعالجة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment","Limited to .pptx file format","Dependent on external libraries like markitdown and unzip"],"zh":["需要 Python 环境","仅限 .pptx 文件格式","依赖于外部库，如 markitdown 和 unzip"],"ja":["Python 環境が必要",".pptx ファイル形式のみ","markitdown や unzip などの外部ライブラリに依存する"],"ko":["Python 환경이 필요함",".pptx 파일 형식만 지원","markitdown 및 unzip 같은 외부 라이브러리에 의존"],"es":["Requiere entorno de Python","Limitado al formato de archivo .pptx","Dependiente de bibliotecas externas como markitdown y unzip"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python","Limité au format de fichier .pptx","Dépendant de bibliothèques externes comme markitdown et unzip"],"de":["Benötigt Python-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf .pptx-Dateiformat","Abhängig von externen Bibliotheken wie markitdown und unzip"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Python","Limitado ao formato de arquivo .pptx","Dependente de bibliotecas externas como markitdown e unzip"],"ru":["Требуется среда Python","Ограничен форматом файла .pptx","Зависит от внешних библиотек, таких как markitdown и unzip"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Python","محدود بالتنسيق .pptx","يعتمد على المكتبات الخارجية مثل markitdown و unzip"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('abdullah1854/MCPGateway/xlsx', 'community', 'abdullah1854', 'MCPGateway', 'abdullah1854/MCPGateway', 'xlsx', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.419Z', '2026-02-18T04:22:13.872Z', NULL, '{"id":"abdullah1854/MCPGateway/xlsx","name":"xlsx","description":{"zh":"XLSX Excel ","ja":"XLSX Excel","ko":"XLSX Excel ","es":"La habilidad XLSX permite crear y manipular archivos de hoja de cálculo de Excel con fórmulas y funciones avanzadas. Ideal para análisis de datos y creación de modelos financieros.","fr":"La compétence XLSX permet de créer et manipuler des fichiers de feuille de calcul Excel avec des formules et des fonctions avancées. Idéal pour l''analyse de données et la création de modèles financiers.","de":"Die XLSX-Fähigkeit ermöglicht die Erstellung und Manipulation von Excel-Tabellen mit Formeln und Funktionen. Ideal für Datenanalyse und Finanzmodellierung.","pt":"A habilidade XLSX permite criar planilhas Excel com fórmulas e análise de dados. É ideal para desenvolvedores que precisam criar modelos financeiros e budgets.","ru":"Навык XLSX позволяет создавать таблицы Excel с формулами и анализом данных. Он идеален для разработчиков, которые нуждаются в создании финансовых моделей и бюджетов.","ar":"مهارة XLSX تسمح بإنشاء جداول إكسل مع الصيغ وتحليل البيانات. وهي مثالية للمطورين الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء نماذج مالية وميزانيات.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"XLSX ","ja":"XLSX","ko":"XLSX ","es":"Habilidad XLSX: Creación de Hojas de Cálculo de Excel","fr":"Compétence XLSX : Création de Feuilles de Calcul Excel","de":"XLSX-Fähigkeit: Erstellung von Excel-Tabellen","pt":"Habilidades XLSX: Crie Planilhas Excel com Fórmulas","ru":"Навыки XLSX: Создавайте таблицы Excel с формулами","ar":"مهارات XLSX: إنشاء جداول إكسل مع الصيغ","en":"xlsx"},"description":{"zh":"XLSX Excel ","ja":"XLSX Excel","ko":"XLSX Excel ","es":"La habilidad XLSX permite crear y manipular archivos de hoja de cálculo de Excel con fórmulas y funciones avanzadas. Ideal para análisis de datos y creación ...","fr":"La compétence XLSX permet de créer et manipuler des fichiers de feuille de calcul Excel avec des formules et des fonctions avancées. Idéal pour l''analyse de ...","de":"Die XLSX-Fähigkeit ermöglicht die Erstellung und Manipulation von Excel-Tabellen mit Formeln und Funktionen. Ideal für Datenanalyse und Finanzmodellierung.","pt":"A habilidade XLSX permite criar planilhas Excel com fórmulas e análise de dados. É ideal para desenvolvedores que precisam criar modelos financeiros e budgets.","ru":"Навык XLSX позволяет создавать таблицы Excel с формулами и анализом данных. Он идеален для разработчиков, которые нуждаются в создании финансовых моделей и б...","ar":"مهارة XLSX تسمح بإنشاء جداول إكسل مع الصيغ وتحليل البيانات. وهي مثالية للمطورين الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء نماذج مالية وميزانيات.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Excel "," "," "," "," "],"ja":["Excel ","","","",""],"ko":["Excel "," "," "," "," "],"es":["Creación de archivos XLSX con fórmulas y funciones de Excel","Análisis de datos y creación de modelos financieros","Manipulación de datos con pivot tables y gráficos","Uso de fórmulas en lugar de cálculos hardcodeados","Formato de hojas de cálculo con estilos y colores personalizados"],"fr":["Création de fichiers XLSX avec des formules et des fonctions Excel","Analyse de données et création de modèles financiers","Manipulation de données avec des tableaux croisés et des graphiques","Utilisation de formules au lieu de calculs hardcodeés","Formatage de feuilles de calcul avec des styles et des couleurs personnalisés"],"de":["Erstellung von XLSX-Dateien mit Excel-Formeln und -Funktionen","Datenanalyse und Finanzmodellierung","Manipulation von Daten mit Pivot-Tabellen und Grafiken","Verwendung von Formeln anstelle von hardcodierten Berechnungen","Formatierung von Excel-Tabellen mit benutzerdefinierten Stilen und Farben"],"pt":["Criação de planilhas Excel com fórmulas","Análise de dados com pivot tables","Adição de fórmulas e cálculos","Formatação de planilhas com gráficos","Desenvolvimento de modelos financeiros e budgets"],"ru":["Создание таблиц Excel с формулами","Анализ данных с помощью сводных таблиц","Добавление формул и расчетов","Форматирование таблиц с графиками","Разработка финансовых моделей и бюджетов"],"ar":["إنشاء جداول إكسل مع الصيغ","تحليل البيانات باستخدام جداول المحور","إضافة الصيغ والتحديثات","تنسيق الجداول مع الرسومات","تطوير نماذج مالية وميزانيات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["XLSX","Excel "," "," "," ","Python"],"ja":["XLSX","Excel","","","","Python"],"ko":["XLSX","Excel "," "," "," ","Python"],"es":["XLSX","Excel","hoja de cálculo","análisis de datos","modelos financieros","fórmulas","funciones","pivot tables","gráficos"],"fr":["XLSX","Excel","feuille de calcul","analyse de données","modèles financiers","formules","fonctions","tableaux croisés","graphiques"],"de":["XLSX","Excel","Tabellenkalkulation","Datenanalyse","Finanzmodellierung","Formeln","Funktionen","Pivot-Tabellen","Grafiken"],"pt":["XLSX","planilhas Excel","fórmulas","análise de dados","modelos financeiros","budgets","desenvolvimento de software","programação"],"ru":["XLSX","таблицы Excel","формулы","анализ данных","финансовые модели","бюджеты","разработка программного обеспечения","программирование"],"ar":["XLSX","جداول إكسل","الصيغ","تحليل البيانات","نماذج مالية","ميزانيات","تطوير البرمجيات","البرمجة"]}},"owner":"abdullah1854","repo":"MCPGateway","repoPath":"abdullah1854/MCPGateway","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.419Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"xlsx","description":"Create, edit, and analyze Excel spreadsheets (.xlsx). Activates for Excel, spreadsheet, xlsx, financial model, data analysis, create workbook, formulas.","bodyPreview":"# Excel Spreadsheet (XLSX) Skill\n\n## When This Skill Activates\n- \"Create spreadsheet\", \"Excel file\", \"xlsx\"\n- \"Financial model\", \"budget\", \"forecast\"\n- \"Data analysis\", \"pivot table\"\n- \"Add formulas\", \"calculations\"\n- \"Format spreadsheet\", \"charts\"\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### Formula-First Approach\n**CRITICAL: Always use Excel formulas instead of calculating values in Python and hardcoding them.**\n\n```python\n# WRONG - Hardcoded calculation\ncell.value = 100 * 0.15  # 15\n\n# CORRECT - Excel formula\nce","body":"# Excel Spreadsheet (XLSX) Skill\n\n## When This Skill Activates\n- \"Create spreadsheet\", \"Excel file\", \"xlsx\"\n- \"Financial model\", \"budget\", \"forecast\"\n- \"Data analysis\", \"pivot table\"\n- \"Add formulas\", \"calculations\"\n- \"Format spreadsheet\", \"charts\"\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### Formula-First Approach\n**CRITICAL: Always use Excel formulas instead of calculating values in Python and hardcoding them.**\n\n```python\n# WRONG - Hardcoded calculation\ncell.value = 100 * 0.15  # 15\n\n# CORRECT - Excel formula\ncell.value = \"=A1*B1\"  # Recalculates automatically\n```\n\n### Financial Modeling Standards\n\n| Convention | Format | Example |\n|------------|--------|---------|\n| Inputs (assumptions) | Blue text | `font.color = \"0000FF\"` |\n| Formulas | Black text | `font.color = \"000000\"` |\n| Cross-sheet links | Green text | `font.color = \"008000\"` |\n| External references | Red text | `font.color = \"FF0000\"` |\n\n## Core Workflows\n\n### 1. Reading Excel Files\n\n**With pandas:**\n```python\nimport pandas as pd\n\n# Read specific sheet\ndf = pd.read_excel(''data.xlsx'', sheet_name=''Sheet1'')\n\n# Read all sheets\nall_sheets = pd.read_excel(''data.xlsx'', sheet_name=None)\nfor name, df in all_sheets.items():\n    print(f\"Sheet: {name}\")\n    print(df.head())\n```\n\n**With openpyxl (preserves formulas):**\n```python\nfrom openpyxl import load_workbook\n\nwb = load_workbook(''data.xlsx'', data_only=False)  # Keep formulas\nws = wb.active\n\nfor row in ws.iter_rows(min_row=1, max_row=10):\n    for cell in row:\n        print(f\"{cell.coordinate}: {cell.value}\")\n```\n\n### 2. Creating Workbooks\n\n```python\nfrom openpyxl import Workbook\nfrom openpyxl.styles import Font, Alignment, Border, Side, PatternFill\nfrom openpyxl.utils import get_column_letter\n\nwb = Workbook()\nws = wb.active\nws.title = \"Data\"\n\n# Add headers\nheaders = [''Name'', ''Quantity'', ''Price'', ''Total'']\nfor col, header in enumerate(headers, 1):\n    cell = ws.cell(row=1, column=col, value=header)\n    cell.font = Font(bold=True)\n    cell.alignment = Alignment(horizontal=''center'')\n\n# Add data with formulas\ndata = [\n    (''Widget A'', 100, 10.50),\n    (''Widget B'', 50, 25.00),\n    (''Widget C'', 75, 15.75),\n]\n\nfor row, (name, qty, price) in enumerate(data, 2):\n    ws.cell(row=row, column=1, value=name)\n    ws.cell(row=row, column=2, value=qty)\n    ws.cell(row=row, column=3, value=price)\n    ws.cell(row=row, column=4, value=f\"=B{row}*C{row}\")  # Formula!\n\n# Add total row\nlast_row = len(data) + 2\nws.cell(row=last_row, column=3, value=\"Total:\")\nws.cell(row=last_row, column=4, value=f\"=SUM(D2:D{last_row-1})\")\n\nwb.save(''output.xlsx'')\n```\n\n### 3. Formatting\n\n**Number formats:**\n```python\nfrom openpyxl.styles.numbers import FORMAT_CURRENCY_USD_SIMPLE\n\ncell.number_format = ''$#,##0.00''           # Currency\ncell.number_format = ''0.0%''                # Percentage\ncell.number_format = ''#,##0''               # Number with commas\ncell.number_format = ''yyyy-mm-dd''          # Date\n```\n\n**Cell styling:**\n```python\nfrom openpyxl.styles import Font, PatternFill, Border, Side, Alignment\n\n# Font\ncell.font = Font(\n    name=''Arial'',\n    size=11,\n    bold=True,\n    color=''000000''\n)\n\n# Background\ncell.fill = PatternFill(\n    start_color=''FAF9F5'',\n    end_color=''FAF9F5'',\n    fill_type=''solid''\n)\n\n# Border\nthin_border = Border(\n    left=Side(style=''thin''),\n    right=Side(style=''thin''),\n    top=Side(style=''thin''),\n    bottom=Side(style=''thin'')\n)\ncell.border = thin_border\n\n# Alignment\ncell.alignment = Alignment(\n    horizontal=''center'',\n    vertical=''center'',\n    wrap_text=True\n)\n```\n\n### 4. Common Formulas\n\n```python\n# SUM\nws[''D10''] = ''=SUM(D2:D9)''\n\n# AVERAGE\nws[''E10''] = ''=AVERAGE(E2:E9)''\n\n# IF\nws[''F2''] = ''=IF(D2>100,\"High\",\"Low\")''\n\n# VLOOKUP\nws[''G2''] = ''=VLOOKUP(A2,Products!A:C,3,FALSE)''\n\n# SUMIF\nws[''H10''] = ''=SUMIF(A:A,\"Widget*\",D:D)''\n\n# INDEX/MATCH (better than VLOOKUP)\nws[''I2''] = ''=INDEX(C:C,MATCH(A2,A:A,0))''\n```\n\n### 5. Charts\n\n```python\nfrom openpyxl.chart import BarChart, Reference\n\nchart = BarChart()\nchart.title = \"Sales by Product\"\nchart.x_axis.title = \"Product\"\nchart.y_axis.title = \"Revenue\"\n\ndata = Reference(ws, min_col=4, min_row=1, max_col=4, max_row=5)\ncategories = Reference(ws, min_col=1, min_row=2, max_row=5)\n\nchart.add_data(data, titles_from_data=True)\nchart.set_categories(categories)\nchart.shape = 4\n\nws.add_chart(chart, \"F2\")\n```\n\n### 6. Multiple Sheets\n\n```python\n# Create sheets\nwb.create_sheet(\"Inputs\")\nwb.create_sheet(\"Calculations\")\nwb.create_sheet(\"Output\")\n\n# Access sheets\ninputs = wb[\"Inputs\"]\ncalcs = wb[\"Calculations\"]\n\n# Cross-sheet reference\ncalcs[''A1''] = \"=Inputs!B5*1.15\"\n```\n\n### 7. Data Validation\n\n```python\nfrom openpyxl.worksheet.datavalidation import DataValidation\n\n# Dropdown list\ndv = DataValidation(\n    type=\"list\",\n    formula1=''\"Option1,Option2,Option3\"'',\n    allow_blank=True\n)\ndv.add(''A2:A100'')\nws.add_data_validation(dv)\n\n# Number range\ndv_num = DataValidation(\n    type=\"whole\",\n    operator=\"between\",\n    formula1=0,\n    formula2=100\n)\ndv_num.add(''B2:B100'')\nws.add_data_validation(dv_num)\n```\n\n## Dependencies\n\n```bash\npip install openpyxl pandas xlsxwriter\n```\n\n## Zero Formula Errors\n\nBefore delivering, verify no errors exist:\n```python\n# Check for formula errors\nERROR_VALUES = [''#REF!'', ''#DIV/0!'', ''#VALUE!'', ''#N/A'', ''#NAME?'', ''#NULL!'', ''#NUM!'']\n\nfor row in ws.iter_rows():\n    for cell in row:\n        if cell.value in ERROR_VALUES:\n            print(f\"Error at {cell.coordinate}: {cell.value}\")\n```\n\n## Financial Model Template\n\n```\nSheet: Inputs (Blue text)\n├── Assumptions\n│   ├── Growth Rate: 5%\n│   ├── Tax Rate: 21%\n│   └── Discount Rate: 10%\n\nSheet: Model (Black text, formulas)\n├── Revenue = Prior Year * (1 + Growth Rate)\n├── Expenses = Revenue * Expense Ratio\n├── EBIT = Revenue - Expenses\n├── Tax = EBIT * Tax Rate\n└── Net Income = EBIT - Tax\n\nSheet: Output (Summary)\n├── =Model!NetIncome\n└── =NPV(Inputs!DiscountRate, Model!CashFlows)\n```\n\n## Output Format\n\n```markdown\n## XLSX Operation: [Create/Edit/Analyze]\n\n### Structure\n- Sheets: [List of sheets]\n- Rows: [Count]\n- Formulas: [Count]\n\n### Key Formulas\n| Cell | Formula | Purpose |\n|------|---------|---------|\n| D10 | =SUM(D2:D9) | Total revenue |\n\n### Formatting Applied\n- [Headers: Bold, centered]\n- [Numbers: Currency format]\n- [Totals: Double border]\n\n### Validation\n- [ ] No formula errors (#REF!, #DIV/0!, etc.)\n- [ ] Formulas recalculate correctly\n- [ ] Number formats applied\n\n### Output\n[File path, sheet count, row count]\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:22:13.872Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Data Analysis Agents needing advanced Excel spreadsheet manipulation capabilities with xlsx files","zh":"非常适合需要高级Excel电子表格操作功能的数据分析代理，特别是处理xlsx文件","ja":"データ分析エージェントが高度なExcelスプレッドシート操作機能を必要とする場合、特にxlsxファイルの場合に最適","ko":"데이터 분석 에이전트가 고급 Excel 스프레드시트 조작 기능을 필요로 할 때 특히 xlsx 파일의 경우에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis de datos que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de manipulación de hojas de cálculo de Excel con archivos xlsx","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de données ayant besoin de capacités avancées de manipulation de feuilles de calcul Excel avec des fichiers xlsx","de":"Perfekt für Data-Analytics-Agents, die erweiterte Excel-Tabellenkalkulationsfunktionen für xlsx-Dateien benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Dados que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de manipulação de planilhas do Excel com arquivos xlsx","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа данных, которым необходимы расширенные возможности манипулирования таблицами Excel с файлами xlsx","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء تحليل البيانات الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتعديل جداول البيانات في Excel مع الملفات xlsx"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create and manipulate Excel spreadsheets using formulas, pivot tables, and data analysis, while supporting file formats like xlsx, enabling seamless financial modeling, budgeting, and forecasting with precise calculations and visualizations through charts","zh":"赋予代理创建和操作Excel电子表格的能力，使用公式、数据透视表和数据分析，同时支持如xlsx的文件格式，实现财务建模、预算和预测的精确计算和可视化","ja":"エージェントがExcelスプレッドシートを作成、操作できるようにし、式、ピボットテーブル、データ分析を使用し、xlsxなどのファイル形式をサポートして、財務モデリング、予算、予測の正確な計算と視覚化を実現","ko":"에이전트가 Excel 스프레드시트를 생성하고 조작할 수 있도록 하며, 수식, 피벗 테이블, 데이터 분석을 사용하며, xlsx와 같은 파일 형식을 지원하여 재무 모델링, 예산, 예측의 정확한 계산 및 시각화를 구현","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear y manipular hojas de cálculo de Excel utilizando fórmulas, tablas dinámicas y análisis de datos, al tiempo que admite formatos de archivo como xlsx, lo que permite un modelado financiero, presupuestación y previsión sin problemas con cálculos y visualizaciones precisas a través de gráficos","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de manipuler des feuilles de calcul Excel à l''aide de formules, de tableaux croisés dynamiques et d''analyse de données, tout en prenant en charge des formats de fichiers tels que xlsx, ce qui permet une modélisation financière, une budgétisation et une prévision sans problème avec des calculs et des visualisations précis via des graphiques","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Excel-Tabellenkalkulationen mithilfe von Formeln, Pivot-Tabellen und Datenanalyse zu erstellen und zu manipulieren, während es Dateiformate wie xlsx unterstützt, wodurch ein nahtloses Finanzmodellierung, Budgetierung und Forecasting mit präzisen Berechnungen und Visualisierungen durch Diagramme ermöglicht wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar e manipular planilhas do Excel usando fórmulas, tabelas dinâmicas e análise de dados, ao mesmo tempo em que suporta formatos de arquivo como xlsx, permitindo modelagem financeira, orçamento e previsão sem interrupções com cálculos precisos e visualizações por meio de gráficos","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать и манипулировать таблицами Excel с помощью формул, сводных таблиц и анализа данных, а также поддерживает форматы файлов, такие как xlsx, что позволяет осуществлять бесперебойное финансовое моделирование, бюджетирование и прогнозирование с точными расчетами и визуализациями через диаграммы","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء وتعديل جداول البيانات في Excel باستخدام الصيغ والجداول الديناميكية وتحليل البيانات، مع دعم تنسيقات الملفات مثل xlsx، مما يتيح النمذجة المالية والتخطيط المالي والتنبؤ بدقة مع الحسابات الدقيقة والتصورات من خلال الرسومات البيانية"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating financial modeling and forecasting in xlsx files","Generating pivot tables for data analysis","Creating and formatting spreadsheets with formulas and charts"],"zh":["在xlsx文件中自动化财务建模和预测","为数据分析生成数据透视表","使用公式和图表创建和格式化电子表格"],"ja":["xlsxファイル内の財務モデリングと予測の自動化","データ分析のためのピボットテーブルの生成","式とチャートを使用したスプレッドシートの作成と書式設定"],"ko":["xlsx 파일의 재무 모델링 및 예측 자동화","데이터 분석을 위한 피벗 테이블 생성","수식 및 차트를 사용한 스프레드시트 생성 및 서식"],"es":["Automatización del modelado y la previsión financieros en archivos xlsx","Generación de tablas dinámicas para el análisis de datos","Creación y formato de hojas de cálculo con fórmulas y gráficos"],"fr":["Automatisation de la modélisation et de la prévision financières dans des fichiers xlsx","Génération de tableaux croisés dynamiques pour l''analyse de données","Création et mise en forme de feuilles de calcul avec des formules et des graphiques"],"de":["Automatisierung von Finanzmodellierung und Forecasting in xlsx-Dateien","Erstellung von Pivot-Tabellen für die Datenanalyse","Erstellung und Formatierung von Tabellenkalkulationen mit Formeln und Diagrammen"],"pt":["Automatizar a modelagem financeira e previsão em arquivos xlsx","Gerar tabelas dinâmicas para análise de dados","Criar e formatar planilhas com fórmulas e gráficos"],"ru":["Автоматизировать финансовое моделирование и прогнозирование в файлах xlsx","Генерировать сводные таблицы для анализа данных","Создавать и форматировать таблицы с формулами и диаграммами"],"ar":["تأتمتة النمذجة المالية والتنبؤ في ملفات xlsx","إنشاء جداول ديناميكية لتحليل البيانات","إنشاء وتشكيل جداول البيانات مع الصيغ والرسومات البيانية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Excel formulas for calculations instead of hardcoded Python values","Specific to xlsx file format"],"zh":["需要使用Excel公式进行计算，而不是使用Python的硬编码值","仅限xlsx文件格式"],"ja":["計算にはExcelの式を使用する必要があり、Pythonのハードコード値ではできない","xlsxファイル形式にのみ対応"],"ko":["계산에는 Excel 수식이 필요하며 Python의 하드코딩된 값을 사용할 수 없음","xlsx 파일 형식만 지원"],"es":["Requiere fórmulas de Excel para cálculos en lugar de valores de Python codificados de forma rígida","Específico del formato de archivo xlsx"],"fr":["Nécessite des formules Excel pour les calculs au lieu de valeurs Python codées en dur","Spécifique au format de fichier xlsx"],"de":["Benötigt Excel-Formeln für Berechnungen anstelle von hartcodierten Python-Werten","Spezifisch für das xlsx-Dateiformat"],"pt":["Exige fórmulas do Excel para cálculos em vez de valores Python codificados","Específico para o formato de arquivo xlsx"],"ru":["Требует формул Excel для расчетов вместо жестко заданных значений Python","Специфичен для формата файла xlsx"],"ar":["يتطلب صيغ Excel للحسابات بدلاً من القيم Python المحددة","محدد لتنسيق الملف xlsx"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('nicolaygerold/howtobuildwithai/ui-preview', 'community', 'nicolaygerold', 'howtobuildwithai', 'nicolaygerold/howtobuildwithai', 'ui-preview', 0, 0, 35, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.419Z', '2026-02-18T04:22:50.819Z', NULL, '{"id":"nicolaygerold/howtobuildwithai/ui-preview","name":"ui-preview","description":{"zh":"UI 预览技能允许开发者使用 Chrome DevTools 预览和测试本地开发服务器和 Storybook，提供了一种高效的开发和测试方式","ja":"UI プレビュースキルは、Chrome DevTools を使用してローカル開発サーバーと Storybook をプレビューおよびテストするための方法を提供する","ko":"UI 미리 보기 스킬은 Chrome DevTools를 사용하여 로컬 개발 서버와 Storybook를 미리 보거나 테스트하기 위한 방법을 제공합니다","es":"La habilidad de vista previa de UI permite probar servidores de desarrollo locales y storybooks utilizando Chrome DevTools","fr":"La compétence d''aperçu UI permet de tester les serveurs de développement locaux et les storybooks à l''aide de Chrome DevTools","de":"Die UI-Vorschau-Fähigkeit ermöglicht das Testen lokaler Entwicklungsserver und Storybooks mithilfe von Chrome DevTools","pt":"A visualização de UI permite que os desenvolvedores visualizem servidores de desenvolvimento local e storybooks usando Chrome DevTools, melhorando a produtividade.","ru":"Просмотр UI позволяет разработчикам просматривать локальные серверы разработки и storybooks с помощью Chrome DevTools, повышая производительность.","ar":"تتيح معاينة واجهة المستخدم للمطورين معاينة خوادار التطوير المحلي والكتب القصصية باستخدام أدوات Developer من جوجل كروم، وتحسين الإنتاجية.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"UI 预览技能 - 使用 Chrome DevTools 预览本地开发服务器","ja":"UI プレビュースキル - Chrome DevTools を使用したローカル開発サーバーのプレビュー","ko":"UI 미리 보기 스킬 - Chrome DevTools를 사용한 로컬 개발 서버 미리 보기","es":"Vista previa de UI: herramientas de desarrollo","fr":"Aperçu UI : outils de développement","de":"UI-Vorschau: Entwicklungstools","pt":"Visualização de UI: Ferramentas de Desenvolvimento","ru":"Просмотр UI: Инструменты для разрабо