],"fr":["Navigation vers des URL spécifiques","Capture d''écran","Obtention d''instantanés de texte de la page","Clic sur des éléments par UID","Remplir des champs de saisie de texte","Ouverture de nouvelles onglets du navigateur"],"de":["Navigation zu bestimmten URLs","Bildschirmfotos erstellen","Erhalt von Text-Schnappschüssen der Seite","Klicken auf Elemente per UID","Ausfüllen von Texteingabefeldern","Öffnen neuer Browser-Registerkarten"],"pt":["Navegação para URL de destino","Captura de tela da página atual","Captura de instantâneo de texto da página","Clique em elementos por UID","Preenchimento de campos de entrada","Abertura de nova guia do navegador"],"ru":["Навигация по целевому URL","Снятие скриншота текущей страницы","Снятие текстового снимка страницы","Клик по элементам по UID","Ввод текста в поля ввода","Открытие новой вкладки браузера"],"ar":["التحكم في الصفحة المستهدفة","التقاط لقطة شاشة للصفحة الحالية","التقاط صورة نصية للصفحة","نقر على عناصر بواسطة UID","كتابة نص في حقول الإدخال","فتح علامة تبويب جديدة في المتصفح"]},"keywords":{"zh":["UI 预览技能","Chrome DevTools","本地开发服务器","Storybook","开发效率","开发工具","前端开发","Web 开发"],"ja":["UI プレビュースキル","Chrome DevTools","ローカル開発サーバー","Storybook","開発効率","開発ツール","フロントエンド開発","Web 開発"],"ko":["UI 미리 보기 스킬","Chrome DevTools","로컬 개발 서버","Storybook","개발 효율성","개발 도구","프론트엔드 개발","웹 개발"],"es":["vista previa de UI","desarrollo web","Chrome DevTools","servidores de desarrollo locales","storybooks","pruebas de interfaz de usuario","depuración de UI","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["aperçu UI","développement web","Chrome DevTools","serveurs de développement locaux","storybooks","tests d''interface utilisateur","débogage de UI","outils de développement"],"de":["UI-Vorschau","Webentwicklung","Chrome DevTools","lokale Entwicklungsserver","Storybooks","Benutzeroberflächentests","UI-Debugging","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["visualização de ui","desenvolvimento web","chrome devtools","servidores de desenvolvimento local","storybook","produtividade de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["просмотр ui","веб-разработка","chrome devtools","локальные серверы разработки","storybook","производительность разработки"],"ar":["معاينة واجهة المستخدم","تطوير الويب","أدوات Developer من جوجل كروم","خوادار التطوير المحلي","كتاب قصصي","إنتاجية التطوير"]}},"owner":"nicolaygerold","repo":"howtobuildwithai","repoPath":"nicolaygerold/howtobuildwithai","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.419Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ui-preview","description":"Preview and screenshot local dev servers and storybooks. Use when asked to view UI components, take screenshots of storybooks, or inspect the web/server apps.","version":"1","bodyPreview":"# UI Preview Skill\n\nPreview local dev servers and storybooks using Chrome DevTools.\n\n## Available Tools\n\n- `navigate_page` - Navigate to a URL\n- `take_screenshot` - Capture a screenshot of the current page\n- `take_snapshot` - Get a text snapshot of the page (a11y tree with element UIDs)\n- `click` - Click on an element by UID\n- `fill` - Type text into an input field\n- `new_page` - Open a new browser tab\n- `list_pages` - List open browser tabs\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Navigate** to the target URL using","body":"# UI Preview Skill\n\nPreview local dev servers and storybooks using Chrome DevTools.\n\n## Available Tools\n\n- `navigate_page` - Navigate to a URL\n- `take_screenshot` - Capture a screenshot of the current page\n- `take_snapshot` - Get a text snapshot of the page (a11y tree with element UIDs)\n- `click` - Click on an element by UID\n- `fill` - Type text into an input field\n- `new_page` - Open a new browser tab\n- `list_pages` - List open browser tabs\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Navigate** to the target URL using `navigate_page`\n2. **Screenshot** the page using `take_screenshot`\n3. **Analyze** captured screenshots with `look_at` for visual analysis\n\n## Local Dev URLs\n\n| Service | URL |\n|---------|-----|\n| Web dev server | http://localhost:7001 |\n| Server dev server | https://localhost:7002 |\n| Webview storybook | http://localhost:7001/storybook |\n| Server storybook | https://localhost:7002/storybook |\n\n## Storybooks\n\nAccess a specific story directly using the hash: `/storybook#${story-title}`\n\nThe story title is derived from the filename: `handoff-story.svelte` → `#handoff-tool`\n\n### Webview Storybook (localhost:7001)\n\nComponents for the VS Code extension webview UI.\n\n**Thread Components:**\n- `#thread` - Full thread view\n- `#streaming-thread` - Thread with streaming content\n- `#scrollable-thread` - Thread with scroll behavior\n- `#thread-reply-area` - Message input area\n- `#thread-status` - Thread status indicators\n- `#thread-summary` - Thread summary view\n- `#thread-hints` - Thread hint suggestions\n- `#thread-environment-input` - Environment input\n\n**Tool Calls:**\n- `#bash` - Bash tool output\n- `#edit-file` - File edit diffs\n- `#create-file` - File creation\n- `#read` - File read output\n- `#grep` - Search results\n- `#glob` - File glob results\n- `#handoff-tool` - Handoff tool states\n- `#mermaid` - Diagram rendering\n- `#oracle-tool` - Oracle tool output\n- `#task-tool` - Task tool output\n- `#web-search` - Web search results\n\n**Editor & Input:**\n- `#prompt-editor` - Message input editor\n- `#mention-menu` - @mention autocomplete\n- `#combobox` - Combobox component\n- `#agent-mode-selector` - Agent mode picker\n\n**Diff Viewer:**\n- `#diff-viewer` - Side-by-side diff\n- `#diff-display` - Inline diff display\n- `#unified-diff` - Unified diff format\n\n**Settings:**\n- `#settings-page` - Settings page\n- `#settings-error-modal` - Error modal\n- `#sign-in-page` - Authentication page\n\n**Layout:**\n- `#layout-navbar` - Navigation bar\n- `#current-thread-navbar-item` - Thread nav item\n\n### Server Storybook (localhost:7002)\n\nComponents for the ampcode.com web app.\n\n**Thread Management:**\n- `#thread-feed` - Thread list feed\n- `#thread-feed-item` - Individual thread item\n- `#thread-feed-list` - Virtualized thread list\n- `#thread-actions` - Thread action buttons\n- `#thread-visibility` - Visibility settings\n- `#thread-visibility-edit` - Edit visibility\n- `#thread-page` - Full thread page\n- `#thread-open-in-button` - Open in editor button\n- `#pull-request-badge` - PR badge display\n\n**Settings:**\n- `#settings-access-token-section` - API tokens\n- `#settings-advanced-section` - Advanced settings\n- `#settings-client-section` - Client settings\n- `#billing-section` - Billing info\n- `#amp-free-section` - Free tier info\n- `#code-host-connections-section` - GitHub/GitLab connections\n\n**User & Profile:**\n- `#avatar` - User avatar\n- `#profile-card` - Profile card\n- `#profile-dropdown` - Profile menu\n- `#user-display` - User name display\n\n**Dashboard:**\n- `#welcome` - Welcome page\n- `#usage-by-day` - Usage metrics\n\n**UI Components:**\n- `#amp-logo` - Logo variants\n- `#badge-single` - Single badge\n- `#badge-group` - Badge group\n- `#copyable-text` - Copy-to-clipboard text\n- `#colors` - Color palette\n- `#icons` - Icon set\n\n**OG Images:**\n- `#og-images` - Social preview images\n\n## Tips\n\n- Use `take_snapshot` to get element UIDs for clicking/filling\n- Story titles use kebab-case from filenames (remove `-story.svelte`)\n- Reload the skill if MCP tools become unavailable\n- Use `list_pages` to manage multiple browser tabs\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:22:50.819Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced UI testing and debugging capabilities with Chrome DevTools.","zh":"适合需要使用Chrome DevTools进行高级UI测试和调试的前端代理。","ja":"Chrome DevToolsを使用して高度なUIテストとデバッグ機能を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Chrome DevTools를 사용하여 고급 UI 테스트 및 디버깅 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Frontend que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de prueba y depuración de UI con Chrome DevTools.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin de fonctionnalités avancées de test et de débogage d''interface utilisateur avec Chrome DevTools.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte UI-Test- und Debugging-Funktionen mit Chrome DevTools benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de teste e depuração de UI com Chrome DevTools.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности тестирования и отладки UI с помощью Chrome DevTools.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الواجهة الأمامية الذين يحتاجون إلى متطلبات متقدمة لاختبار واجهة المستخدم وتصحيح الأخطاء باستخدام أدوات تطور كروم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate UI interactions using navigate_page, take_screenshot, and click tools, while utilizing a11y tree with element UIDs for accessibility testing and Chrome DevTools for protocol-based debugging.","zh":"赋予代理自动化UI交互的能力，使用navigate_page、take_screenshot和click工具，同时利用a11y树和元素UID进行无障碍测试，并使用Chrome DevTools进行基于协议的调试。","ja":"エージェントに、navigate_page、take_screenshot、clickツールを使用してUIの相互作用を自動化する機能を与え、a11yツリーと要素UIDを使用してアクセシビリティテストを行い、Chrome DevToolsを使用してプロトコルベースのデバッグを行う。","ko":"에이전트에게 navigate_page, take_screenshot, click 도구를 사용하여 UI 상호 작용을 자동화할 수 있는 능력을 부여하고, a11y 트리 및 요소 UID를 사용하여 접근성 테스트를 수행하며, Chrome DevTools를 사용하여 프로토콜 기반 디버깅을 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar las interacciones de la interfaz de usuario utilizando navigate_page, take_screenshot y herramientas de clic, mientras utiliza el árbol a11y con UID de elementos para pruebas de accesibilidad y Chrome DevTools para depuración basada en protocolo.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les interactions avec l''interface utilisateur en utilisant navigate_page, take_screenshot et outils de clic, tout en utilisant l''arbre a11y avec des ID d''éléments pour les tests d''accessibilité et Chrome DevTools pour le débogage basé sur le protocole.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Benutzeroberflächen-Interaktionen mit navigate_page, take_screenshot und Klick-Tools zu automatisieren, während sie den a11y-Baum mit Element-UIDs für die Zugriffstestung und Chrome DevTools für die protokollbasierte Fehlersuche verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar interações de UI usando navigate_page, take_screenshot e ferramentas de clique, enquanto utiliza a árvore a11y com UIDs de elementos para testes de acessibilidade e Chrome DevTools para depuração baseada em protocolo.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность автоматизировать взаимодействия с пользовательским интерфейсом с помощью navigate_page, take_screenshot и инструментов клика, а также использовать дерево a11y с UID элементов для тестирования доступности и Chrome DevTools для отладки на основе протокола.","ar":"يمكن للعميل تفعيل عمليات التفاعل التلقائية مع واجهة المستخدم باستخدام navigate_page و take_screenshot وأدوات النقر، مع استخدام شجرة a11y مع عناصر UID للتجارب على إمكانية الوصول وأدوات تطور كروم لتصحيح الأخطاء المعتمد على البروتوكول."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating UI testing for storybooks","Debugging local dev servers with Chrome DevTools protocol","Generating visual snapshots of web pages for comparison"],"zh":["自动化storybook的UI测试","使用Chrome DevTools协议调试本地开发服务器","生成网页的视觉快照以进行比较"],"ja":["storybookのUIテストの自動化","Chrome DevToolsプロトコルを使用したローカル開発サーバーのデバッグ","ウェブページの視覚的スナップショットの生成による比較"],"ko":["storybook의 UI 테스트 자동화","Chrome DevTools 프로토콜을 사용한 로컬 개발 서버 디버깅","웹 페이지의 시각적 스냅샷 생성을 통한 비교"],"es":["Automatización de pruebas de UI para storybooks","Depuración de servidores de desarrollo locales con el protocolo Chrome DevTools","Generación de instantáneas visuales de páginas web para comparación"],"fr":["Automatisation des tests d''interface utilisateur pour les storybooks","Débogage des serveurs de développement locaux avec le protocole Chrome DevTools","Génération d''instantanés visuels de pages web pour comparaison"],"de":["Automatisierung von UI-Tests für Storybooks","Fehlersuche in lokalen Entwicklungsservern mit dem Chrome-DevTools-Protokoll","Erzeugung von visuellen Momentaufnahmen von Webseiten zum Vergleich"],"pt":["Automatizar testes de UI para storybooks","Depurar servidores de desenvolvimento local com protocolo Chrome DevTools","Gerar capturas visuais de páginas da web para comparação"],"ru":["Автоматизировать тестирование UI для storybooks","Отлаживать локальные серверы разработки с помощью протокола Chrome DevTools","Генерировать визуальные снимки веб-страниц для сравнения"],"ar":["السماح بتحسين اختبارات واجهة المستخدم لstorybook","تصحيح أخطاء الخوادم المحلية للتطوير باستخدام بروتوكول أدوات تطور كروم","إنشاء لقطات مرئية من صفحات الويب للمقارنة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Chrome DevTools installation","Limited to local dev servers and storybooks","Dependent on element UIDs for interaction"],"zh":["需要安装Chrome DevTools","仅限于本地开发服务器和storybook","依赖于元素UID进行交互"],"ja":["Chrome DevToolsのインストールが必要","ローカル開発サーバーとstorybookのみに限定される","要素UIDに依存して相互作用を行う"],"ko":["Chrome DevTools 설치가 필요함","로컬 개발 서버 및 스토리북에만限定됨","요소 UID에 의존하여 상호 작용함"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de Chrome DevTools","Limitado a servidores de desarrollo locales y storybooks","Dependiente de los UID de elementos para la interacción"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Chrome DevTools","Limité aux serveurs de développement locaux et aux storybooks","Dépend des ID d''éléments pour l''interaction"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von Chrome DevTools","Begrenzt auf lokale Entwicklungsserver und Storybooks","Abhängig von Element-UIDs für die Interaktion"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Chrome DevTools","Limitado a servidores de desenvolvimento local e storybooks","Dependente de UIDs de elementos para interação"],"ru":["Требует установки Chrome DevTools","Ограничен локальными серверами разработки и storybooks","Зависит от UID элементов для взаимодействия"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت أدوات تطور كروم","محدود بالخادم المحلي للتطوير و storybooks","يعتمد على عناصر UID للتفاعل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
