无关性","快速入门","支持 Express、Fastify 和 serverless 环境","高度可定制"],"ja":["任意の GraphQL スキーマをサポート","フレームワーク非依存","クイックスタート","Express、Fastify、serverless 環境をサポート","高度にカスタマイズ可能"],"ko":["모든 GraphQL 스키마 지원","프레임워크 독립성","빠른 시작","Express, Fastify, serverless 환경 지원","고도화된 사용자 정의"],"es":["Soporte para cualquier esquema GraphQL","Integración con Express, Fastify y entornos sin servidor","Compatibilidad con GraphQL 4.x","Seguridad y escalabilidad avanzadas","Facilidad de uso y configuración"],"fr":["Prise en charge de n''importe quel schéma GraphQL","Intégration avec Express, Fastify et environnements sans serveur","Compatibilité avec GraphQL 4.x","Sécurité et évolutivité avancées","Facilité d''utilisation et de configuration"],"de":["Unterstützung für jedes GraphQL-Schema","Integration mit Express, Fastify und serverlosen Umgebungen","Kompatibilität mit GraphQL 4.x","Erweiterte Sicherheit und Skalierbarkeit","Einfache Bedienung und Konfiguration"],"pt":["Instalação rápida com npm","Definição de esquemas com GraphQL","Integração com Express e outros frameworks","Suporte a ambientes serverless","Escalabilidade e segurança"],"ru":["Быстрая установка с помощью npm","Определение схем с помощью GraphQL","Интеграция с Express и другими фреймворками","Поддержка серверных окружений","Масштабируемость и безопасность"],"ar":["التثبيت السريع مع npm","تعريف المخططات مع GraphQL","التكامل مع إكسبرس والاطارات الأخرى","دعم البيئات الخالية من الخادم","التماسك والأمان"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Apollo Server","GraphQL 服务器","开源","GraphQL 模式","框架无关性","快速入门"],"ja":["Apollo Server","GraphQL サーバー","オープンソース","GraphQL スキーマ","フレームワーク非依存","クイックスタート"],"ko":["Apollo Server","GraphQL 서버","오픈소스","GraphQL 스키마","프레임워크 독립성","빠른 시작"],"es":["Apollo Server","GraphQL","Servidor GraphQL","Desarrollo de aplicaciones","Escalabilidad","Seguridad","Express","Fastify","Entornos sin servidor"],"fr":["Apollo Server","GraphQL","Serveur GraphQL","Développement d''applications","Évolutivité","Sécurité","Express","Fastify","Environnements sans serveur"],"de":["Apollo Server","GraphQL","GraphQL-Server","Anwendungsentwicklung","Skalierbarkeit","Sicherheit","Express","Fastify","Serverlose Umgebungen"],"pt":["Apollo Server 4.x","GraphQL","Servidor GraphQL","API escalável","Segurança API","Express","Fastify","Serverless"],"ru":["Apollo Server 4.x","GraphQL","Сервер GraphQL","Масштабируемый API","Безопасность API","Express","Fastify","Serverless"],"ar":["أپولو سرڤر 4.x","GraphQL","خادم GraphQL","واجهة برمجة تطبيقات قابلة للتوسع","أمان واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","إكسبرس","فاستيفي","خالية من الخادم"]}},"owner":"simnova","repo":"sharethrift","repoPath":"simnova/sharethrift","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.420Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"apollo-server","description":">","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"# Apollo Server 4.x Guide\n\nApollo Server is an open-source GraphQL server that works with any GraphQL schema. Version 4.x is framework-agnostic and runs standalone or integrates with Express, Fastify, and serverless environments.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Step 1: Install\n\n```bash\nnpm install @apollo/server graphql\n```\n\nFor Express integration:\n```bash\nnpm install @apollo/server express graphql cors\n```\n\n### Step 2: Define Schema\n\n```typescript\nconst typeDefs = `#graphql\n  type Book {\n    title: Strin","body":"# Apollo Server 4.x Guide\n\nApollo Server is an open-source GraphQL server that works with any GraphQL schema. Version 4.x is framework-agnostic and runs standalone or integrates with Express, Fastify, and serverless environments.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Step 1: Install\n\n```bash\nnpm install @apollo/server graphql\n```\n\nFor Express integration:\n```bash\nnpm install @apollo/server express graphql cors\n```\n\n### Step 2: Define Schema\n\n```typescript\nconst typeDefs = `#graphql\n  type Book {\n    title: String\n    author: String\n  }\n\n  type Query {\n    books: [Book]\n  }\n`;\n```\n\n### Step 3: Write Resolvers\n\n```typescript\nconst resolvers = {\n  Query: {\n    books: () => [\n      { title: ''The Great Gatsby'', author: ''F. Scott Fitzgerald'' },\n      { title: ''1984'', author: ''George Orwell'' },\n    ],\n  },\n};\n```\n\n### Step 4: Start Server\n\n**Standalone (Recommended for getting started):**\n```typescript\nimport { ApolloServer } from ''@apollo/server'';\nimport { startStandaloneServer } from ''@apollo/server/standalone'';\n\nconst server = new ApolloServer({ typeDefs, resolvers });\n\nconst { url } = await startStandaloneServer(server, {\n  listen: { port: 4000 },\n});\n\nconsole.log(`Server ready at ${url}`);\n```\n\n**Express v4:**\n```typescript\nimport { ApolloServer } from ''@apollo/server'';\nimport { expressMiddleware } from ''@apollo/server/express4'';\nimport { ApolloServerPluginDrainHttpServer } from ''@apollo/server/plugin/drainHttpServer'';\nimport express from ''express'';\nimport http from ''http'';\nimport cors from ''cors'';\n\nconst app = express();\nconst httpServer = http.createServer(app);\n\nconst server = new ApolloServer({\n  typeDefs,\n  resolvers,\n  plugins: [ApolloServerPluginDrainHttpServer({ httpServer })],\n});\n\nawait server.start();\n\napp.use(\n  ''/graphql'',\n  cors(),\n  express.json(),\n  expressMiddleware(server, {\n    context: async ({ req }) => ({ token: req.headers.authorization }),\n  }),\n);\n\nawait new Promise<void>((resolve) => httpServer.listen({ port: 4000 }, resolve));\nconsole.log(''Server ready at http://localhost:4000/graphql'');\n```\n\n## Schema Definition\n\n### Scalar Types\n\n- `Int` - 32-bit integer\n- `Float` - Double-precision floating-point\n- `String` - UTF-8 string\n- `Boolean` - true/false\n- `ID` - Unique identifier (serialized as String)\n\n### Type Definitions\n\n```graphql\ntype User {\n  id: ID!\n  name: String!\n  email: String\n  posts: [Post!]!\n}\n\ntype Post {\n  id: ID!\n  title: String!\n  content: String\n  author: User!\n}\n\ninput CreatePostInput {\n  title: String!\n  content: String\n}\n\ntype Query {\n  user(id: ID!): User\n  users: [User!]!\n}\n\ntype Mutation {\n  createPost(input: CreatePostInput!): Post!\n}\n```\n\n### Enums and Interfaces\n\n```graphql\nenum Status {\n  DRAFT\n  PUBLISHED\n  ARCHIVED\n}\n\ninterface Node {\n  id: ID!\n}\n\ntype Article implements Node {\n  id: ID!\n  title: String!\n}\n```\n\n## Resolvers Overview\n\nResolvers follow the signature: `(parent, args, contextValue, info)`\n\n- **parent**: Result from parent resolver (root resolvers receive undefined)\n- **args**: Arguments passed to the field\n- **contextValue**: Shared context object (auth, dataSources, etc.)\n- **info**: Field-specific info and schema details (rarely used)\n\n```typescript\nconst resolvers = {\n  Query: {\n    user: async (_, { id }, { dataSources }) => {\n      return dataSources.usersAPI.getUser(id);\n    },\n  },\n  User: {\n    posts: async (parent, _, { dataSources }) => {\n      return dataSources.postsAPI.getPostsByAuthor(parent.id);\n    },\n  },\n  Mutation: {\n    createPost: async (_, { input }, { dataSources, user }) => {\n      if (!user) throw new GraphQLError(''Not authenticated'');\n      return dataSources.postsAPI.create({ ...input, authorId: user.id });\n    },\n  },\n};\n```\n\n## Context Setup\n\nContext is created per-request and passed to all resolvers.\n\n```typescript\ninterface MyContext {\n  token?: string;\n  user?: User;\n  dataSources: {\n    usersAPI: UsersDataSource;\n    postsAPI: PostsDataSource;\n  };\n}\n\nconst server = new ApolloServer<MyContext>({\n  typeDefs,\n  resolvers,\n});\n\n// Standalone\nconst { url } = await startStandaloneServer(server, {\n  context: async ({ req }) => {\n    const token = req.headers.authorization || '''';\n    const user = await getUser(token);\n    return {\n      token,\n      user,\n      dataSources: {\n        usersAPI: new UsersDataSource(),\n        postsAPI: new PostsDataSource(),\n      },\n    };\n  },\n});\n\n// Express middleware\nexpressMiddleware(server, {\n  context: async ({ req, res }) => ({\n    token: req.headers.authorization,\n    user: await getUser(req.headers.authorization),\n    dataSources: {\n      usersAPI: new UsersDataSource(),\n      postsAPI: new PostsDataSource(),\n    },\n  }),\n});\n```\n\n## Reference Files\n\nDetailed documentation for specific topics:\n\n- [Resolvers](references/resolvers.md) - Resolver patterns and best practices\n- [Context and Auth](references/context-and-auth.md) - Authentication and authorization\n- [Plugins](references/plugins.md) - Server and request lifecycle hooks\n- [Data Sources](references/data-sources.md) - RESTDataSource and DataLoader\n- [Error Handling](references/error-handling.md) - GraphQLError and error formatting\n- [Troubleshooting](references/troubleshooting.md) - Common issues and solutions\n\n## Key Rules\n\n### Schema Design\n\n- Use **!** (non-null) for fields that always have values\n- Prefer input types for mutations over inline arguments\n- Use interfaces for polymorphic types\n- Keep schema descriptions for documentation\n\n### Resolver Best Practices\n\n- Keep resolvers thin - delegate to services/data sources\n- Always handle errors explicitly\n- Use DataLoader for batching related queries\n- Return partial data when possible (GraphQL''s strength)\n\n### Performance\n\n- Use `@defer` and `@stream` for large responses\n- Implement DataLoader to solve N+1 queries\n- Consider persisted queries for production\n- Use caching headers and CDN where appropriate\n\n## Ground Rules\n\n- ALWAYS use Apollo Server 4.x patterns (not v3 or earlier)\n- ALWAYS type your context with TypeScript generics\n- ALWAYS use `GraphQLError` from `graphql` package for errors\n- NEVER expose stack traces in production errors\n- PREFER `startStandaloneServer` for simple setups\n- USE `expressMiddleware` with drain plugin for Express apps\n- IMPLEMENT authentication in context, authorization in resolvers\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:23:00.872Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full-Stack Agents needing scalable and framework-agnostic GraphQL server capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要可扩展和框架无关的GraphQL服务器能力的全栈代理。","ja":"フルスタックエージェントがスケーラブルでフレームワーク非依存のGraphQLサーバーキャパシティを必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"확장 가능하고 프레임워크에 종속되지 않는 GraphQL 서버 기능이 필요한 풀스택 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Full-Stack que necesitan capacidades de servidor GraphQL escalables y agnósticas de framework.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full-Stack nécessitant des fonctionnalités de serveur GraphQL escalables et agnostiques de framework.","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agents, die skalierbare und framework-agnostische GraphQL-Server-Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full-Stack que necessitam de capacidades de servidor GraphQL escaláveis e independentes de framework.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Full-Stack, которым необходимы масштабируемые и независимые от фреймворка возможности сервера GraphQL.","ar":"مثالي لعميل البرمجيات الكامل الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات خادم GraphQL قابلة للتوسعة ومستقلة عن الإطار"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to deploy GraphQL schemas with ease, leveraging libraries like @apollo/server and graphql, and integrating seamlessly with Express, Fastify, and serverless environments via protocols like HTTP and WebSocket.","zh":"赋予代理部署GraphQL模式定义的能力，利用像@apollo/server和graphql这样的库，并通过HTTP和WebSocket等协议与Express、Fastify和无服务器环境无缝集成。","ja":"@apollo/serverやgraphqlなどのライブラリを利用して、GraphQLスキーマ定義を容易にデプロイできるエージェントをEmpowerし、HTTPやWebSocketなどのプロトコルを介してExpress、Fastify、およびサーバーレス環境とシームレスに統合します。","ko":"에이전트가 GraphQL 스키마 정의를 쉽게 배포할 수 있도록 하며, @apollo/server 및 graphql과 같은 라이브러리를 활용하고, HTTP 및 WebSocket과 같은 프로토콜을 통해 Express, Fastify 및 서버리스 환경과 무결점으로 통합합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar esquemas GraphQL con facilidad, aprovechando bibliotecas como @apollo/server y graphql, e integrándose de forma transparente con Express, Fastify y entornos sin servidor a través de protocolos como HTTP y WebSocket.","fr":"Permet aux agents de déployer des schémas GraphQL avec facilité, en exploitant des bibliothèques comme @apollo/server et graphql, et en s''intégrant de manière transparente avec Express, Fastify et des environnements sans serveur via des protocoles comme HTTP et WebSocket.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, GraphQL-Schemata mit Leichtigkeit zu bereitstellen, indem es Bibliotheken wie @apollo/server und graphql nutzt und nahtlos in Express, Fastify und serverlose Umgebungen über Protokolle wie HTTP und WebSocket integriert.","pt":"Permite que os agentes implantem esquemas GraphQL com facilidade, aproveitando bibliotecas como @apollo/server e graphql, e integrando-se perfeitamente com Express, Fastify e ambientes sem servidor por meio de protocolos como HTTP e WebSocket.","ru":"Позволяет агентам развертывать схемы GraphQL с легкостью, используя библиотеки seperti @apollo/server и graphql, и интегрируясь без проблем с Express, Fastify и бессерверными средами через протоколы seperti HTTP и WebSocket.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من نشر مخططات GraphQL بسهولة، مستفيدة من المكتبات مثل @apollo/server و graphql، وتكاملها بشكل مثالي مع Express و Fastify وبيئات خالية من الخادم عبر بروتوكولات مثل HTTP و WebSocket"},"useCases":{"en":["Deploying GraphQL APIs with custom schema definitions","Integrating Apollo Server with existing Express or Fastify applications","Building serverless GraphQL services with scalable data fetching"],"zh":["使用自定义模式定义部署GraphQL API","将Apollo Server集成到现有的Express或Fastify应用程序中","构建具有可扩展数据获取的无服务器GraphQL服务"],"ja":["カスタムスキーマ定義を使用してGraphQL APIをデプロイする","Apollo Serverを既存のExpressまたはFastifyアプリケーションに統合する","スケーラブルなデータ取得を備えたサーバーレスGraphQLサービスを構築する"],"ko":["사용자 지정 스키마 정의를 사용하여 GraphQL API 배포","기존 Express 또는 Fastify 애플리케이션에 Apollo Server 통합","확장 가능한 데이터 가져오기를 사용하는 서버리스 GraphQL 서비스 빌드"],"es":["Implementación de API de GraphQL con definiciones de esquema personalizadas","Integración del servidor Apollo con aplicaciones Express o Fastify existentes","Creación de servicios GraphQL sin servidor con extracción de datos escalable"],"fr":["Déploiement d''API GraphQL avec des définitions de schéma personnalisées","Intégration du serveur Apollo avec des applications Express ou Fastify existantes","Création de services GraphQL sans serveur avec une collecte de données scalable"],"de":["Bereitstellung von GraphQL-APIs mit benutzerdefinierten Schemadefinitionen","Integration des Apollo-Servers mit bestehenden Express- oder Fastify-Anwendungen","Erstellung von serverlosen GraphQL-Diensten mit skalierbarer Datenabfrage"],"pt":["Implantação de APIs GraphQL com definições de esquema personalizadas","Integração do Apollo Server com aplicativos Express ou Fastify existentes","Criação de serviços GraphQL sem servidor com busca de dados escalável"],"ru":["Развертывание API GraphQL с пользовательскими определениями схемы","Интеграция Apollo Server с существующими приложениями Express или Fastify","Создание бессерверных сервисов GraphQL со скалируемой загрузкой данных"],"ar":["نشر واجهات برمجة تطبيقات GraphQL مع تعريفات مخطط مخصصة","دمج خادم Apollo مع تطبيقات Express أو Fastify الحالية","إنشاء خدمات GraphQL خالية من الخادم مع استرجاع بيانات قابل للتوسعة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Node.js environment","Dependent on GraphQL schema definition"],"zh":["需要Node.js环境","依赖于GraphQL模式定义"],"ja":["Node.js環境が必要","GraphQLスキーマ定義に依存する"],"ko":["Node.js 환경이 필요합니다.","GraphQL 스키마 정의에 의존합니다."],"es":["Requiere un entorno Node.js","Dependiente de la definición del esquema GraphQL"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Node.js","Dépendante de la définition du schéma GraphQL"],"de":["Benötigt eine Node.js-Umgebung","Abhängig von der Definition des GraphQL-Schemas"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Node.js","Dependente da definição do esquema GraphQL"],"ru":["Требуется среда Node.js","Зависит от определения схемы GraphQL"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Node.js","يعتمد على تعريف مخطط GraphQL"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
