 ガイド","ko":"Apollo Client 4.x 가이드","es":"Apollo Client 4.x: Guía de Estado de JavaScript","fr":"Apollo Client 4.x : Guide de Gestion d''État JavaScript","de":"Apollo Client 4.x: JavaScript-Zustandsverwaltung","pt":"Apollo Client 4.x: Guia de Gerenciamento de Estado","ru":"Apollo Client 4.x: Руководство по управлению состоянием","ar":"أپولو كلينت 4.x: دليل لإدارة الحالة","en":"apollo-client"},"description":{"zh":"Apollo Client 是一个用于 JavaScript 的全面的状态管理库，支持 GraphQL。版本 4.x 提供了改进的缓存和 TypeScript 支持","ja":"Apollo Client は JavaScript 用の包括的な状態管理ライブラリで、GraphQL をサポートしています。バージョン 4.x ではキャッシュと TypeScript サポートが改善されています","ko":"Apollo Client는 GraphQL을 지원하는 JavaScript용 종합적인 상태 관리 라이브러리입니다. 버전 4.x에서는 캐싱과 TypeScript 지원이 개선되었습니다","es":"Apollo Client es una biblioteca de gestión de estado para JavaScript que permite gestionar datos locales y remotos con GraphQL.","fr":"Apollo Client est une bibliothèque de gestion d''état pour JavaScript qui permet de gérer les données locales et distantes avec GraphQL.","de":"Apollo Client ist eine Bibliothek zur Zustandsverwaltung für JavaScript, mit der Sie lokale und remote Daten mit GraphQL verwalten können.","pt":"O Apollo Client 4.x é uma biblioteca de gerenciamento de estado para JavaScript que permite gerenciar dados locais e remotos com GraphQL. Ele traz melhorias ...","ru":"Apollo Client 4.x — это библиотека управления состоянием для JavaScript, которая позволяет управлять локальными и удаленными данными с помощью GraphQL. Она в...","ar":"أپولو كلينت 4.x هو مكتبة لإدارة الحالة لجافاسكريبت التي تمكنك من إدارة البيانات المحلية والبعيدة باستخدام جرافكول. وهو يحتوي على تحسينات ذاكرة التخزين المؤقت...","en":"Application developed to help encourage sharing - Both in sharing physical goods by using the public website - as well as sharing knowledge in how the system..."},"definition":{"en":"Application developed to help encourage sharing - Both in sharing physical goods by using the public website - as well as sharing knowledge in how the system is developed."},"features":{"zh":["改进的缓存","更好的 TypeScript 支持","React 19 兼容性","Next.js App Router 设置指南"],"ja":["キャッシュの改善","TypeScript サポートの改善","React 19 互換性","Next.js App Router 設定ガイド"],"ko":["개선된 캐싱","개선된 TypeScript 지원","React 19 호환성","Next.js App Router 설정 가이드"],"es":["Mejora de la caché","Compatibilidad con React 19","Mejora del soporte para TypeScript","Guías de configuración para frameworks específicos","Soporte para SSR en frameworks modernos"],"fr":["Amélioration du cache","Compatibilité avec React 19","Amélioration de la prise en charge de TypeScript","Guides de configuration pour les frameworks spécifiques","Prise en charge du SSR dans les frameworks modernes"],"de":["Verbesserung der Zwischenspeicherung","Kompatibilität mit React 19","Verbesserung der TypeScript-Unterstützung","Konfigurationsanleitungen für Frameworks","Unterstützung für SSR in modernen Frameworks"],"pt":["Melhorias no cache","Suporte a TypeScript","Compatibilidade com React 19","Gerenciamento de dados locais e remotos com GraphQL","Setup especializado para Next.js com App Router"],"ru":["Улучшения кэша","Поддержка TypeScript","Совместимость с React 19","Управление локальными и удаленными данными с помощью GraphQL","Специализированный.setup для Next.js с App Router"],"ar":["تحسينات ذاكرة التخزين المؤقت","دعم تايبسكريبت","توافق مع رياكت 19","إدارة البيانات المحلية والبعيدة باستخدام جرافكول","إعداد خاص لنيكست جيه إس مع أپ روتر"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Apollo Client","GraphQL","状态管理","JavaScript","React","Next.js","TypeScript"],"ja":["Apollo Client","GraphQL","状態管理","JavaScript","React","Next.js","TypeScript"],"ko":["Apollo Client","GraphQL","상태 관리","JavaScript","React","Next.js","TypeScript"],"es":["Apollo Client","GraphQL","JavaScript","gestión de estado","caché","TypeScript","React 19","SSR"],"fr":["Apollo Client","GraphQL","JavaScript","gestion d''état","cache","TypeScript","React 19","SSR"],"de":["Apollo Client","GraphQL","JavaScript","Zustandsverwaltung","Zwischenspeicherung","TypeScript","React 19","SSR"],"pt":["Apollo Client 4.x","Gerenciamento de estado","GraphQL","JavaScript","React 19","Next.js","TypeScript","Cache","Desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["Apollo Client 4.x","Управление состоянием","GraphQL","JavaScript","React 19","Next.js","TypeScript","Кэш","Веб-разработка"],"ar":["أپولو كلينت 4.x","إدارة الحالة","غرافكول","جافاسكريبت","رياكت 19","نيكست جيه إس","تايبسكريبت","ذاكرة التخزين المؤقت","تطوير الويب"]}},"owner":"simnova","repo":"sharethrift","repoPath":"simnova/sharethrift","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.420Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"apollo-client","description":">","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"# Apollo Client 4.x Guide\n\nApollo Client is a comprehensive state management library for JavaScript that enables you to manage both local and remote data with GraphQL. Version 4.x brings improved caching, better TypeScript support, and React 19 compatibility.\n\n## Framework-Specific Setup Guides\n\nFor modern React frameworks with SSR support, use these specialized setup guides:\n\n- **[Next.js App Router Setup](references/setup-nextjs.md)** - For Next.js applications using the App Router with React","body":"# Apollo Client 4.x Guide\n\nApollo Client is a comprehensive state management library for JavaScript that enables you to manage both local and remote data with GraphQL. Version 4.x brings improved caching, better TypeScript support, and React 19 compatibility.\n\n## Framework-Specific Setup Guides\n\nFor modern React frameworks with SSR support, use these specialized setup guides:\n\n- **[Next.js App Router Setup](references/setup-nextjs.md)** - For Next.js applications using the App Router with React Server Components\n- **[React Router Framework Mode Setup](references/setup-react-router.md)** - For React Router 7 applications with streaming SSR\n- **[TanStack Start Setup](references/setup-tanstack-start.md)** - For TanStack Start applications with modern routing\n\nThese guides provide framework-specific integration packages and patterns optimized for SSR, streaming, and React Server Components.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Step 1: Install\n\n```bash\nnpm install @apollo/client graphql rxjs\n```\n\n### Step 1.5: Set up TypeScript Code Generation (optional but recommended)\n\nFor TypeScript type generation (recommended):\n\n```bash\nnpm install -D @graphql-codegen/cli @graphql-codegen/typescript @graphql-codegen/typescript-operations @graphql-codegen/typed-document-node\n```\n\n```typescript\n// codegen.ts\nimport { CodegenConfig } from \"@graphql-codegen/cli\";\n\nconst config: CodegenConfig = {\n  overwrite: true,\n  schema: \"<URL_OF_YOUR_GRAPHQL_API>\",\n  // This assumes that all your source files are in a top-level `src/` directory - you might need to adjust this to your file structure\n  documents: [\"src/**/*.{ts,tsx}\"],\n  // Don''t exit with non-zero status when there are no documents\n  ignoreNoDocuments: true,\n  generates: {\n    // Use a path that works the best for the structure of your application\n    \"./src/types/__generated__/graphql.ts\": {\n      plugins: [\"typescript\", \"typescript-operations\", \"typed-document-node\"],\n      config: {\n        avoidOptionals: {\n          // Use `null` for nullable fields instead of optionals\n          field: true,\n          // Allow nullable input fields to remain unspecified\n          inputValue: false,\n        },\n        // Use `unknown` instead of `any` for unconfigured scalars\n        defaultScalarType: \"unknown\",\n        // Apollo Client always includes `__typename` fields\n        nonOptionalTypename: true,\n        // Apollo Client doesn''t add the `__typename` field to root types so\n        // don''t generate a type for the `__typename` for root operation types.\n        skipTypeNameForRoot: true,\n      },\n    },\n  },\n};\n\nexport default config;\n```\n\nThe typed-document-node plugin might have a bundle size tradeoff but can prevent inconsistencies and is best suited for usage with LLMs, so it is recommended for most applications.\nSee the [GraphQL Code Generator documentation](https://www.apollographql.com/docs/react/development-testing/graphql-codegen#recommended-starter-configuration) for other recommended configuration patterns if required.\n\n### Step 2: Create Client\n\n```typescript\nimport { ApolloClient, InMemoryCache, HttpLink } from \"@apollo/client\";\nimport { SetContextLink } from \"@apollo/client/link/context\";\n\nconst httpLink = new HttpLink({\n  uri: \"https://your-graphql-endpoint.com/graphql\",\n});\n\n// Use SetContextLink for auth headers to update dynamically per request\nconst authLink = new SetContextLink(({ headers }) => {\n  const token = localStorage.getItem(\"token\");\n  return {\n    headers: {\n      ...headers,\n      authorization: token ? `Bearer ${token}` : \"\",\n    },\n  };\n});\n\nconst client = new ApolloClient({\n  link: authLink.concat(httpLink),\n  cache: new InMemoryCache(),\n});\n```\n\n### Step 3: Setup Provider\n\n```tsx\nimport { ApolloProvider } from \"@apollo/client\";\nimport App from \"./App\";\n\nfunction Root() {\n  return (\n    <ApolloProvider client={client}>\n      <App />\n    </ApolloProvider>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Step 4: Execute Query\n\n```tsx\nimport { gql } from \"@apollo/client\";\nimport { useQuery } from \"@apollo/client/react\";\n\nconst GET_USERS = gql`\n  query GetUsers {\n    users {\n      id\n      name\n      email\n    }\n  }\n`;\n\nfunction UserList() {\n  const { loading, error, data } = useQuery(GET_USERS);\n\n  if (loading) return <p>Loading...</p>;\n  if (error) return <p>Error: {error.message}</p>;\n\n  return (\n    <ul>\n      {data.users.map((user) => (\n        <li key={user.id}>{user.name}</li>\n      ))}\n    </ul>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Basic Query Usage\n\n### Using Variables\n\n```tsx\nconst GET_USER = gql`\n  query GetUser($id: ID!) {\n    user(id: $id) {\n      id\n      name\n      email\n    }\n  }\n`;\n\nfunction UserProfile({ userId }: { userId: string }) {\n  const { loading, error, data, dataState } = useQuery(GET_USER, {\n    variables: { id: userId },\n  });\n\n  if (loading) return <p>Loading...</p>;\n  if (error) return <p>Error: {error.message}</p>;\n\n  return <div>{data.user.name}</div>;\n}\n```\n\n> **Note for TypeScript users**: Use [`dataState`](https://www.apollographql.com/docs/react/data/typescript#type-narrowing-data-with-datastate) for more robust type safety and better type narrowing in Apollo Client 4.x.\n\n### TypeScript Integration\n\n```typescript\n// Define types for codegen or TypedDocumentNode\ninterface GetUserData {\n  user: {\n    id: string;\n    name: string;\n    email: string;\n  };\n}\n\ninterface GetUserVariables {\n  id: string;\n}\n\n// Types are inferred from TypedDocumentNode - never use manual generics\nconst GET_USER: TypedDocumentNode<GetUserData, GetUserVariables> = gql`\n  query GetUser($id: ID!) {\n    user(id: $id) {\n      id\n      name\n      email\n    }\n  }\n`;\n\nconst { data } = useQuery(GET_USER, {\n  variables: { id: userId },\n});\n\n// data.user is automatically typed from GET_USER\n```\n\n## Basic Mutation Usage\n\n```tsx\nimport { gql, TypedDocumentNode } from \"@apollo/client\";\nimport { useMutation } from \"@apollo/client/react\";\n\ninterface CreateUserMutation {\n  createUser: {\n    id: string;\n    name: string;\n    email: string;\n  };\n}\n\ninterface CreateUserMutationVariables {\n  input: {\n    name: string;\n    email: string;\n  };\n}\n\nconst CREATE_USER: TypedDocumentNode<\n  CreateUserMutation,\n  CreateUserMutationVariables\n> = gql`\n  mutation CreateUser($input: CreateUserInput!) {\n    createUser(input: $input) {\n      id\n      name\n      email\n    }\n  }\n`;\n\nfunction CreateUserForm() {\n  const [createUser, { loading, error }] = useMutation(CREATE_USER);\n\n  const handleSubmit = async (formData: FormData) => {\n    const { data } = await createUser({\n      variables: {\n        input: {\n          name: formData.get(\"name\") as string,\n          email: formData.get(\"email\") as string,\n        },\n      },\n    });\n    if (data) {\n      console.log(\"Created user:\", data.createUser);\n    }\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <form\n      onSubmit={(e) => {\n        e.preventDefault();\n        handleSubmit(new FormData(e.currentTarget));\n      }}\n    >\n      <input name=\"name\" placeholder=\"Name\" />\n      <input name=\"email\" placeholder=\"Email\" />\n      <button type=\"submit\" disabled={loading}>\n        {loading ? \"Creating...\" : \"Create User\"}\n      </button>\n      {error && <p>Error: {error.message}</p>}\n    </form>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Client Configuration Options\n\n```typescript\nconst client = new ApolloClient({\n  // Required: The cache implementation\n  cache: new InMemoryCache({\n    typePolicies: {\n      Query: {\n        fields: {\n          // Field-level cache configuration\n        },\n      },\n    },\n  }),\n\n  // Network layer\n  link: new HttpLink({ uri: \"/graphql\" }),\n\n  // Avoid defaultOptions if possible as they break TypeScript expectations.\n  // Configure options per-query/mutation instead for better type safety.\n  // defaultOptions: {\n  //   watchQuery: { fetchPolicy: ''cache-and-network'' },\n  // },\n\n  // DevTools are enabled by default in development\n  // Only configure when enabling in production\n  devtools: {\n    enabled: true, // Only needed for production\n  },\n\n  // Custom name for this client instance\n  clientAwareness: {\n    name: \"web-client\",\n    version: \"1.0.0\",\n  },\n});\n```\n\n## Reference Files\n\nDetailed documentation for specific topics:\n\n- [Queries](references/queries.md) - useQuery, useLazyQuery, polling, refetching\n- [Mutations](references/mutations.md) - useMutation, optimistic UI, cache updates\n- [Caching](references/caching.md) - InMemoryCache, typePolicies, cache manipulation\n- [State Management](references/state-management.md) - Reactive variables, local state\n- [Error Handling](references/error-handling.md) - Error policies, error links, retries\n- [Troubleshooting](references/troubleshooting.md) - Common issues and solutions\n\n## Key Rules\n\n### Query Best Practices\n\n- **Each page should generally only have one query, composed from colocated fragments.** Use `useFragment` or `useSuspenseFragment` in all non-page-components. Use `@defer` to allow slow fields below the fold to stream in later and avoid blocking the page load.\n- **Fragments are for colocation, not reuse.** Each fragment should describe exactly the data needs of a specific component, not be shared across components for common fields. See [Fragment Colocation](https://www.apollographql.com/docs/react/data/fragments#colocating-fragments).\n- Always handle `loading` and `error` states in UI when using non-suspenseful hooks (`useQuery`, `useLazyQuery`). When using Suspense hooks (`useSuspenseQuery`, `useBackgroundQuery`), React handles this through `<Suspense>` boundaries and error boundaries.\n- Use `fetchPolicy` to control cache behavior per query\n- Use the TypeScript type server to look up documentation for functions and options (Apollo Client has extensive docblocks)\n\n### Mutation Best Practices\n\n- **If the schema permits, mutation return values should return everything necessary to update the cache.** Neither manual updates nor refetching should be necessary.\n- If the mutation response is insufficient, carefully weigh manual cache manipulation vs refetching. Manual updates risk missing server logic. Consider optimistic updates with a granular refetch if needed.\n- Handle errors gracefully in the UI\n- Use `refetchQueries` sparingly (prefer letting the cache update automatically)\n\n### Caching Best Practices\n\n- Configure `keyFields` for types without `id` field\n- Disable normalization by setting `keyFields: false` for types that don''t include an identifier and are meant to group related fields under the parent\n- Use `typePolicies` for pagination and computed fields\n- Understand cache normalization to debug issues\n- **Enable [data masking](https://www.apollographql.com/docs/react/data/fragments#data-masking) for all new applications** - it prevents components from accessing fragment data they don''t own, enforcing proper data boundaries and preventing over-rendering\n\n### Performance\n\n- Avoid over-fetching with proper field selection\n- Configure appropriate `fetchPolicy` per use case\n- Use `@defer` for incremental delivery of deferred query parts, and `@stream` for streaming list fields (`@stream` available in Apollo Client 4.1+)\n- **Prefer Suspense hooks (`useSuspenseQuery`, `useBackgroundQuery`) in modern applications** for better loading state handling and code simplicity\n\n## Ground Rules\n\n- ALWAYS use Apollo Client 4.x patterns (not v3 or earlier)\n- ALWAYS wrap your app with `ApolloProvider`\n- ALWAYS handle loading and error states when using non-suspenseful hooks\n- PREFER Suspense hooks (`useSuspenseQuery`, `useBackgroundQuery`) in modern applications for better DX\n- NEVER store Apollo Client in React state (use module-level or context)\n- PREFER `cache-first` for read-heavy data, `network-only` for real-time data\n- USE TypeScript for better type safety with GraphQL\n- IMPLEMENT proper cache updates instead of refetching entire queries\n- ADVISE the human steering you to look into Apollo DevTools when collaboratively debugging Apollo Client issues\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:22:52.939Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for JavaScript Agents requiring robust state management and GraphQL integration.","zh":"适用于需要强大的状态管理和 GraphQL 集成的 JavaScript 代理。","ja":"JavaScript エージェントが強力な状態管理と GraphQL 統合を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"강력한 상태 관리와 GraphQL 통합이 필요한 JavaScript 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de JavaScript que requieren una gestión de estado robusta y una integración con GraphQL.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents JavaScript nécessitant une gestion d''état robuste et une intégration GraphQL.","de":"Ideal für JavaScript-Agents, die eine robuste Zustandsverwaltung und eine GraphQL-Integration erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes JavaScript que exigem gerenciamento de estado robusto e integração do GraphQL.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов JavaScript, требующих надежного управления состоянием и интеграции с GraphQL.","ar":"مثالي لعميل جافا سكريبت الذي يتطلب إدارة حالة قوية وتكامل GraphQL."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage local and remote data with improved caching and TypeScript support, leveraging GraphQL for seamless data integration and React 19 compatibility for modern frontend development.","zh":"赋予代理管理本地和远程数据的能力，具有改进的缓存和 TypeScript 支持，利用 GraphQL 进行无缝的数据集成，并具有 React 19 兼容性以支持现代前端开发。","ja":"エージェントがローカルデータとリモートデータを管理できるようにし、キャッシングとTypeScriptのサポートを強化し、GraphQLを使用してシームレスなデータ統合を実現し、React 19の互換性を備え、モダンなフロントエンド開発をサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 로컬 및 원격 데이터를 관리할 수 있도록 하며, 캐싱 및 TypeScript 지원을 개선하고, GraphQL을 사용하여无缝한 데이터 통합을 제공하며, React 19 호환성을 통해 현대적인 프론트엔드 개발을 지원합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes gestionar datos locales y remotos con una caché mejorada y soporte de TypeScript, aprovechando GraphQL para una integración de datos sin problemas y compatibilidad con React 19 para el desarrollo de frontend moderno.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les données locales et distantes avec une mise en cache améliorée et une prise en charge de TypeScript, en exploitant GraphQL pour une intégration de données transparente et une compatibilité React 19 pour le développement frontend moderne.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, lokale und remote Daten mit verbesserter Caching und TypeScript-Unterstützung zu verwalten, indem GraphQL für eine nahtlose Datenintegration und React 19-Kompatibilität für die moderne Frontend-Entwicklung genutzt wird.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerenciem dados locais e remotos com cache aprimorado e suporte ao TypeScript, aproveitando o GraphQL para integração de dados sem problemas e compatibilidade com o React 19 para desenvolvimento de frontend moderno.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять локальными и удаленными данными с улучшенным кэшированием и поддержкой TypeScript, используя GraphQL для бесшовной интеграции данных и совместимости с React 19 для современного разработки frontend.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إدارة البيانات المحلية والبعيدة مع ذاكرة مؤقتة محسنة ودعم TypeScript ، واستخدام GraphQL لتكامل البيانات بدون مشاكل ومتوافقة مع React 19 لتطوير واجهة المستخدم الحديثة."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing efficient data caching with Apollo Client 4.x","Setting up framework-specific configurations for Next.js App Router","Developing scalable React applications with GraphQL and TypeScript"],"zh":["使用Apollo Client 4.x实现高效的数据缓存","为Next.js App Router设置框架特定的配置","使用GraphQL和TypeScript开发可扩展的React应用程序"],"ja":["Apollo Client 4.xを使用して効率的なデータキャッシングを実現する","Next.js App Routerにフレームワーク固有の設定を行う","GraphQLとTypeScriptを使用してスケーラブルなReactアプリケーションを開発する"],"ko":["Apollo Client 4.x를 사용하여 효율적인 데이터 캐싱을 구현하는 것","Next.js App Router에 프레임워크 특정 설정을 구성하는 것","GraphQL 및 TypeScript를 사용하여 확장 가능한 React 애플리케이션을 개발하는 것"],"es":["Implementar una caché de datos eficiente con Apollo Client 4.x","Configurar configuraciones específicas del marco para Next.js App Router","Desarrollar aplicaciones React escalables con GraphQL y TypeScript"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre un cache de données efficace avec Apollo Client 4.x","Configurer des configurations spécifiques au framework pour Next.js App Router","Développer des applications React évolutives avec GraphQL et TypeScript"],"de":["Eine effiziente Daten-Caching mit Apollo Client 4.x implementieren","Framework-spezifische Konfigurationen für Next.js App Router einrichten","Skalierbare React-Anwendungen mit GraphQL und TypeScript entwickeln"],"pt":["Implementar cache de dados eficiente com Apollo Client 4.x","Configurar configurações específicas do framework para Next.js App Router","Desenvolver aplicativos React escaláveis com GraphQL e TypeScript"],"ru":["Реализовать эффективный кэш данных с Apollo Client 4.x","Настроить конфигурации, специфичные для фреймворка, для Next.js App Router","Разрабатывать масштабируемые приложения React с GraphQL и TypeScript"],"ar":["تنفيذ ذاكرة مؤقتة للبيانات بكفاءة مع Apollo Client 4.x","تكوين إعدادات محددة بالإطار للنافذة التطبيقية Next.js","تطوير تطبيقات React القابلة للتوسيع مع GraphQL وTypeScript"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires JavaScript and GraphQL setup","Version 4.x specific features may not be compatible with older versions","React 19 compatibility may require updates to existing React applications"],"zh":["需要JavaScript和GraphQL设置","4.x版本特定的功能可能与旧版本不兼容","React 19兼容性可能需要对现有的React应用程序进行更新"],"ja":["JavaScriptとGraphQLの設定が必要","バージョン4.x特有の機能は古いバージョンと互換性がない可能性がある","React 19の互換性を保つために、既存のReactアプリケーションを更新する必要がある可能性がある"],"ko":["JavaScript 및 GraphQL 설정이 필요합니다","4.x 버전 특정 기능은 이전 버전과 호환되지 않을 수 있습니다","React 19 호환성을 유지하기 위해 기존 React 애플리케이션을 업데이트해야 할 수 있습니다"],"es":["Requiere configuración de JavaScript y GraphQL","Las características específicas de la versión 4.x pueden no ser compatibles con versiones anteriores","La compatibilidad con React 19 puede requerir actualizaciones de aplicaciones React existentes"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration JavaScript et GraphQL","Les fonctionnalités spécifiques à la version 4.x peuvent ne pas être compatibles avec les versions antérieures","La compatibilité avec React 19 peut nécessiter des mises à jour des applications React existantes"],"de":["Erfordert JavaScript- und GraphQL-Setup","Version-4.x-spezifische Funktionen sind möglicherweise nicht mit älteren Versionen kompatibel","Die Kompatibilität mit React 19 kann Updates für bestehende React-Anwendungen erfordern"],"pt":["Exige configuração do JavaScript e do GraphQL","Recursos específicos da versão 4.x podem não ser compatíveis com versões anteriores","Compatibilidade com o React 19 pode exigir atualizações de aplicativos React existentes"],"ru":["Требует настройки JavaScript и GraphQL","Функции, специфичные для версии 4.x, могут быть несовместимы с более ранними версиями","Совместимость с React 19 может требовать обновлений существующих приложений React"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد جافا سكريبت وGraphQL","الميزات المحددة للإصدار 4.x قد لا تكون متوافقة مع الإصدارات السابقة","التوافق مع React 19 قد يتطلب تحديثات لتطبيقات React الحالية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('sanity-io/pkg-utils/tsdown', 'community', 'sanity-io', 'pkg-utils', 'sanity-io/pkg-utils', 'tsdown', 0, 0, 35, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.420Z', '2026-02-18T04:22:58.964Z', NULL, '{"id":"sanity-io/pkg-utils/tsdown","name":"tsdown","description":{"zh":"tsdown是一个下一代TypeScript库打包工具，提供快速的构建和自动的.d.ts文件生成","ja":"tsdownは次世代のTypeScriptライブラリバンドラーであり、高速なビルドと自動的な.d.tsファイル生成を提供する","ko":"tsdown은 다음 세대의 TypeScript 라이브러리 번들러로 빠른 빌드와 자동 .d.ts 파일 생성을 제공한다","es":"tsdown es una biblioteca de TypeScript que ofrece compilaciones rápidas y generación automática de declaraciones de tipo para paquetes npm modernos","fr":"tsdown est une bibliothèque TypeScript qui propose des compilations rapides et une génération automatique de déclarations de type pour les packages npm modernes","de":"tsdown ist eine TypeScript-Bibliothek, die schnelle Kompilierungen und automatische Generierung von Typdeklarationen für moderne npm-Pakete bietet","pt":"O tsdown é uma biblioteca de bundler TypeScript de próxima geração, construída sobre Rolldown e Oxc, que fornece builds rápidos e geração automática de .d.ts.","ru":"Tsdown - это библиотека следующего поколения для сборки TypeScript, построенная на Rolldown и Oxc, которая обеспечивает быстрые сборки и автоматическую генерацию .d.ts.","ar":"tsdown هي مكتبة من الجيل التالي لمجمعات TypeScript، مبنية على Rolldown و Oxc، توفر بناء سريع وتوليد تلقائي ل.d.ts","en":"Simple utilities for modern npm packages."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"tsdown：现代npm包的简单实用工具","ja":"tsdown：モダンなnpmパッケージのシンプルユーティリティ","ko":"tsdown: 현대적 npm 패키지의 단순한 유틸리티","es":"tsdown: Biblioteca de TypeScript para paquetes npm modernos","fr":"tsdown: Bibliothèque TypeScript pour packages npm modernes","de":"tsdown: TypeScript-Bibliothek für moderne npm-Pakete","pt":"tsdown: Ferramentas de Utilitário para Pacotes npm Modernos","ru":"tsdown: Простые утилиты для современных пакетов npm","ar":"tsdown: أدوات بسيطة للحزم npm الحديثة","en":"tsdown"},"description":{"zh":"tsdown是一个下一代TypeScript库打包工具，提供快速的构建和自动的.d.ts文件生成","ja":"tsdownは次世代のTypeScriptライブラリバンドラーであり、高速なビルドと自動的な.d.tsファイル生成を提供する","ko":"tsdown은 다음 세대의 TypeScript 라이브러리 번들러로 빠른 빌드와 자동 .d.ts 파일 생성을 제공한다","es":"tsdown es una biblioteca de TypeScript que ofrece compilaciones rápidas y generación automática de declaraciones de tipo para paquetes npm modernos","fr":"tsdown est une bibliothèque TypeScript qui propose des compilations rapides et une génération automatique de déclarations de type pour les packages npm modernes","de":"tsdown ist eine TypeScript-Bibliothek, die schnelle Kompilierungen und automatische Generierung von Typdeklarationen für moderne npm-Pakete bietet","pt":"O tsdown é uma biblioteca de bundler TypeScript de próxima geração, construída sobre Rolldown e Oxc, que fornece builds rápidos e geração automática de .d.ts.","ru":"Tsdown - это библиотека следующего поколения для сборки TypeScript, построенная на Rolldown и Oxc, которая обеспечивает быстрые сборки и автоматическую генер...","ar":"tsdown هي مكتبة من الجيل التالي لمجمعات TypeScript، مبنية على Rolldown و Oxc، توفر بناء سريع وتوليد تلقائي ل.d.ts","en":"Simple utilities for modern npm packages."},"definition":{"en":"Simple utilities for modern npm packages."},"features":{"zh":["快速的构建","自动的.d.ts文件生成","无缝迁移","支持Rolldown/Rollup/Unplugin插件","智能的依赖处理"],"ja":["高速なビルド","自動的な.d.tsファイル生成","無縫な移行","Rolldown/Rollup/Unpluginプラグインのサポート","スマートな依存関係の処理"],"ko":["빠른 빌드","자동 .d.ts 파일 생성","무장해 이동","Rolldown/Rollup/Unplugin 플러그인 지원","スマート한 의존성 처리"],"es":["Compilaciones rápidas","Generación automática de declaraciones de tipo","Soporte para plugins de Rolldown y Rollup","Manejo inteligente de dependencias","Compatibilidad con tsup"],"fr":["Compilations rapides","Génération automatique de déclarations de type","Prise en charge des plugins Rolldown et Rollup","Gestion intelligente des dépendances","Compatibilité avec tsup"],"de":["Schnelle Kompilierungen","Automatische Generierung von Typdeklarationen","Unterstützung für Rolldown- und Rollup-Plugins","Intelligente Abhängigkeitsverwaltung","Kompatibilität mit tsup"],"pt":["Builds rápidos","Geração automática de .d.ts","Suporte a plugins Rolldown/Rollup/Unplugin","Manipulação inteligente de dependências","Migração fácil do tsup"],"ru":["Быстрые сборки","Автоматическая генерация .d.ts","Поддержка плагинов Rolldown/Rollup/Unplugin","Умная обработка зависимостей","Легкая миграция из tsup"],"ar":["بناء سريع","توليد تلقائي ل.d.ts","دعم ملحقات Rolldown/Rollup/Unplugin","معالجة ذكية للاتكالية","هجرة سهلة من tsup"]},"keywords":{"zh":["tsdown","TypeScript","npm包","构建工具","自动化","依赖处理","Rolldown","Rollup","Unplugin"],"ja":["tsdown","TypeScript","npmパッケージ","ビルドツール","自動化","依存関係の処理","Rolldown","Rollup","Unplugin"],"ko":["tsdown","TypeScript","npm 패키지","빌드 도구","자동화","의존성 처리","Rolldown","Rollup","Unplugin"],"es":["tsdown","TypeScript","npm","paquetes modernos","compilaciones rápidas","generación de declaraciones de tipo","Rolldown","Rollup","plugins"],"fr":["tsdown","TypeScript","npm","packages modernes","compilations rapides","génération de déclarations de type","Rolldown","Rollup","plugins"],"de":["tsdown","TypeScript","npm","moderne Pakete","schnelle Kompilierungen","Generierung von Typdeklarationen","Rolldown","Rollup","Plugins"],"pt":["tsdown","bundler TypeScript","pacotes npm modernos","builds rápidos","geração automática de .d.ts","plugins Rolldown/Rollup/Unplugin"],"ru":["tsdown","сборка TypeScript","современные пакеты npm","быстрые сборки","автоматическая генерация .d.ts","плагины Rolldown/Rollup/Unplugin"],"ar":["tsdown","مجمعات TypeScript","حزم npm حديثة","بناء سريع","توليد تلقائي ل.d.ts","ملحقات Rolldown/Rollup/Unplugin"]}},"owner":"sanity-io","repo":"pkg-utils","repoPath":"sanity-io/pkg-utils","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.420Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tsdown","description":"tsdown fast TypeScript library bundler powered by Rolldown and Oxc. Use when bundling TypeScript libraries, configuring entry points, or generating .d.ts declaration files.","version":"2026.1.28","bodyPreview":"tsdown is a next-generation TypeScript library bundler built on Rolldown and Oxc. It provides blazing-fast builds, automatic `.d.ts` generation, and seamless migration from tsup. Supports Rolldown/Rollup/Unplugin plugins and features smart dependency handling.\n\n> The skill is based on tsdown v0.20.1, generated at 2026-01-28.\n\n**Anthony''s Preferences:**\n\n- Build pure-ESM packages, avoid CJS\n- Always enable `dts` option for type declarations\n- Enable `exports` option for auto-generated package exp","body":"tsdown is a next-generation TypeScript library bundler built on Rolldown and Oxc. It provides blazing-fast builds, automatic `.d.ts` generation, and seamless migration from tsup. Supports Rolldown/Rollup/Unplugin plugins and features smart dependency handling.\n\n> The skill is based on tsdown v0.20.1, generated at 2026-01-28.\n\n**Anthony''s Preferences:**\n\n- Build pure-ESM packages, avoid CJS\n- Always enable `dts` option for type declarations\n- Enable `exports` option for auto-generated package exports\n\n## Core\n\n| Topic         | Description                                       | Reference                                |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| Configuration | Config file setup, defineConfig, multiple configs | [core-config](references/core-config.md) |\n| CLI           | Command-line interface and options                | [core-cli](references/core-cli.md)       |\n| Entry Points  | Entry files, aliases, glob patterns               | [core-entry](references/core-entry.md)   |\n\n## Build Options\n\n| Topic             | Description                                            | Reference                                                        |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Output            | Format (ESM/CJS/IIFE/UMD), directory, target, platform | [options-output](references/options-output.md)                   |\n| Declaration Files | .d.ts generation, isolatedDeclarations, sourcemaps     | [options-dts](references/options-dts.md)                         |\n| Dependencies      | External, noExternal, dependency bundling              | [options-dependencies](references/options-dependencies.md)       |\n| Package Exports   | Auto-generating exports, main, module fields           | [options-package-exports](references/options-package-exports.md) |\n\n## Features\n\n| Topic         | Description                            | Reference                                                    |\n| ------------- | -------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| Optimization  | Tree shaking, minification, sourcemaps | [features-optimization](references/features-optimization.md) |\n| Shims         | CJS/ESM compatibility shims            | [features-shims](references/features-shims.md)               |\n| Unbundle Mode | Bundleless transpile-only builds       | [features-unbundle](references/features-unbundle.md)         |\n| Watch Mode    | Auto-rebuild on file changes           | [features-watch](references/features-watch.md)               |\n\n## Advanced\n\n| Topic            | Description                                | Reference                                                            |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Plugins          | Rolldown, Unplugin, Rollup, Vite plugins   | [advanced-plugins](references/advanced-plugins.md)                   |\n| Hooks            | Build lifecycle hooks                      | [advanced-hooks](references/advanced-hooks.md)                       |\n| Programmatic API | Using tsdown from code                     | [advanced-programmatic](references/advanced-programmatic.md)         |\n| Rolldown Options | Customizing inputOptions and outputOptions | [advanced-rolldown-options](references/advanced-rolldown-options.md) |\n\n## Recipes\n\n| Topic             | Description                    | Reference                                              |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| Framework Support | Vue and React library bundling | [recipes-frameworks](references/recipes-frameworks.md) |\n| Migration         | Migrating from tsup            | [recipes-migration](references/recipes-migration.md)   |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:22:58.964Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Modern Web Development Agents requiring efficient TypeScript library bundling and seamless migration from tsup.","zh":"适用于需要高效的TypeScript库打包和从tsup无缝迁移的现代Web开发代理。","ja":"tsupからのシームレスな移行と効率的なTypeScriptライブラリバンドルを必要とするモダンWeb開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"tsup에서 무중단으로 마이그레이션하고 효율적인 TypeScript 라이브러리 번들을 필요로 하는 현대적인 웹 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollo Web Moderno que requieren una biblioteca de TypeScript eficiente y una migración sin problemas desde tsup.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement Web moderne nécessitant un bundle de bibliothèque TypeScript efficace et une migration en douceur depuis tsup.","de":"Ideal für moderne Web-Entwicklungsagenten, die eine effiziente TypeScript-Bibliothek und eine nahtlose Migration von tsup erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Web Moderno que exigem empacotamento eficiente de bibliotecas TypeScript e migração sem problemas do tsup.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов современного веб-разработки, требующих эффективного объединения библиотек TypeScript и бесшовной миграции из tsup.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تطوير الويب الحديثة التي تتطلب حزمة كفؤة لمكتبات TypeScript وانتقال بدون مشاكل من tsup."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build pure-ESM packages with blazing-fast builds, automatic `.d.ts` generation, and smart dependency handling using Rolldown and Oxc, while enabling `dts` and `exports` options for enhanced functionality.","zh":"赋予代理构建纯ESM包的能力，具有闪电般快速的构建、自动`.d.ts`生成和使用Rolldown和Oxc的智能依赖处理，同时启用`dts`和`exports`选项以实现增强功能。","ja":"RolldownとOxcを使用したスマートな依存関係の処理、自動的な`.d.ts`の生成、そして高速なビルドで純粋なESMパッケージを構築する能力をエージェントに与え、さらに`dts`と`exports`オプションを有効にして機能を拡張します。","ko":"Rolldown과 Oxc를 사용한 스마트한 의존성 처리, 자동 `.d.ts` 생성, 그리고 빠른 빌드를 통해 순수한 ESM 패키지를 구축할 수 있는 능력을 에이전트에게 부여하며,さらに `dts`와 `exports` 옵션을 활성화하여 기능을 강화합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear paquetes puros ESM con compilaciones extremadamente rápidas, generación automática de `.d.ts` y administración inteligente de dependencias utilizando Rolldown y Oxc, al mismo tiempo que permite las opciones `dts` y `exports` para una funcionalidad mejorada.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des paquets ESM purs avec des builds incroyablement rapides, une génération automatique de `.d.ts` et une gestion intelligente des dépendances en utilisant Rolldown et Oxc, tout en permettant les options `dts` et `exports` pour une fonctionnalité améliorée.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, reine ESM-Pakete mit extrem schnellen Builds, automatischer `.d.ts`-Generierung und intelligenter Abhängigkeitsverwaltung mit Rolldown und Oxc zu erstellen, während gleichzeitig die Optionen `dts` und `exports` für eine erweiterte Funktionalität aktiviert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir pacotes puros-ESM com compilações extremamente rápidas, geração automática de `.d.ts` e tratamento inteligente de dependências usando Rolldown e Oxc, permitindo opções `dts` e `exports` para funcionalidade aprimorada.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать чистые пакеты ESM с быстрыми сборками, автоматической генерацией `.d.ts` и умным управлением зависимостями с помощью Rolldown и Oxc, а также включает опции `dts` и `exports` для расширенной функциональности.","ar":"يتمكن العملاء من بناء حزم ESM النقية مع بناء سريع للغاية، وتوليد تلقائي ل`.d.ts` ومعالجة зависимости ذكية باستخدام Rolldown و Oxc، مع تمكين خيارات `dts` و `exports` لتعزيز الوظائف."},"useCases":{"en":["Bundling TypeScript libraries with Rolldown/Rollup/Unplugin plugins","Migrating existing projects from tsup to tsdown for improved performance","Generating automatic type declarations with the `dts` option","Enabling auto-generated package exports with the `exports` option"],"zh":["使用Rolldown/Rollup/Unplugin插件进行TypeScript库打包","从tsup迁移到tsdown以提高性能","使用`dts`选项生成自动类型声明","使用`exports`选项启用自动生成的包导出"],"ja":["Rolldown/Rollup/Unpluginプラグインを使用したTypeScriptライブラリのバンドル","パフォーマンスの向上のためにtsupからtsdownへの移行","`dts`オプションを使用した自動型宣言の生成","`exports`オプションを使用した自動生成されたパッケージのエクスポートの有効化"],"ko":["Rolldown/Rollup/Unplugin 플러그인을 사용한 TypeScript 라이브러리 번들","성능 향상을 위해 tsup에서 tsdown으로 마이그레이션","`dts` 옵션을 사용한 자동 형 선언 생성","`exports` 옵션을 사용한 자동 생성된 패키지 내보내기 활성화"],"es":["Empaquetado de bibliotecas de TypeScript con plugins de Rolldown/Rollup/Unplugin","Migración de proyectos existentes desde tsup a tsdown para mejorar el rendimiento","Generación de declaraciones de tipo automáticas con la opción `dts`","Habilitación de exports de paquetes autogenerados con la opción `exports`"],"fr":["Bundling de bibliothèques TypeScript avec des plugins Rolldown/Rollup/Unplugin","Migration de projets existants de tsup à tsdown pour améliorer les performances","Génération de déclarations de type automatiques avec l''option `dts`","Activation d''exports de paquets autogénérés avec l''option `exports`"],"de":["Bündelung von TypeScript-Bibliotheken mit Rolldown/Rollup/Unplugin-Plug-ins","Migration von bestehenden Projekten von tsup zu tsdown für verbesserte Leistung","Automatische Generierung von Typdeklarationen mit der Option `dts`","Aktivierung von autogenerierten Paket-Exports mit der Option `exports`"],"pt":["Empacotamento de bibliotecas TypeScript com plugins Rolldown/Rollup/Unplugin","Migração de projetos existentes do tsup para o tsdown para melhorar o desempenho","Geração automática de declarações de tipo com a opção `dts`","Habilitação de exportações de pacotes auto-geradas com a opção `exports`"],"ru":["Объединение библиотек TypeScript с помощью плагинов Rolldown/Rollup/Unplugin","Миграция существующих проектов из tsup в tsdown для улучшения производительности","Автоматическая генерация объявлений типов с помощью опции `dts`","Включение автоматически сгенерированных экспортов пакетов с помощью опции `exports`"],"ar":["حزم مكتبات TypeScript باستخدام إضافة Rolldown/Rollup/Unplugin","نقل المشاريع الحالية من tsup إلى tsdown لتحسين الأداء","توليد تلقائي لاعلامات النوع باستخدام خيار `dts`","تمكين تصدير الحزم التلقائي مع خيار `exports`"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires tsdown v0.20.1 or compatible version","Limited to TypeScript library bundling and migration"],"zh":["需要tsdown v0.20.1或兼容版本","仅限于TypeScript库打包和迁移"],"ja":["tsdown v0.20.1または互換性のあるバージョンが必要","TypeScriptライブラリのバンドルと移行に限定"],"ko":["tsdown v0.20.1 또는 호환되는 버전이 필요","TypeScript 라이브러리 번들 및 마이그레이션에 제한"],"es":["Requiere tsdown v0.20.1 o una versión compatible","Limitado al empaquetado de bibliotecas de TypeScript y migración"],"fr":["Nécessite tsdown v0.20.1 ou une version compatible","Limité au bundling de bibliothèques TypeScript et à la migration"],"de":["Benötigt tsdown v0.20.1 oder eine kompatible Version","Begrenzt auf die Bündelung von TypeScript-Bibliotheken und Migration"],"pt":["Exige tsdown v0.20.1 ou versão compatível","Limitado ao empacotamento de bibliotecas TypeScript e migração"],"ru":["Требует tsdown v0.20.1 или совместимой версии","Ограничен объединением библиотек TypeScript и миграцией"],"ar":["يتطلب tsdown الإصدار 0.20.1 أو إصدارًا متوافقًا","محدود بحزم مكتبات TypeScript والانتقال"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('OrchardCMS/OrchardCore/orchardcore-module-creator', 'community', 'OrchardCMS', 'OrchardCore', 'OrchardCMS/OrchardCore', 'orchardcore-module-creator', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.420Z', '2026-02-18T04:23:19.344Z', NULL, '{"id":"OrchardCMS/OrchardCore/orchardcore-module-creator","name":"orchardcore-module-creator","description":{"zh":"OrchardCore模块创建器指导您创建新的OrchardCore模块，遵循项目约定","ja":"OrchardCoreモジュール作成ツールは、プロジェクトの規約に従って新しいOrchardCoreモジュールを作成するためのガイダンスを提供","ko":"오차드코어 모듈 생성기는 프로젝트 규약을 따르는 새로운 오차드코어 모듈을 생성하기 위한 가이드를 제공","es":"OrchardCore es un framework de aplicación modular y multi-tenant de código abierto, y un sistema de gestión de contenido construido sobre ese framework.","fr":"OrchardCore est un framework d''application modulaire et multi-locataire open source, et un système de gestion de contenu construit sur ce framework.","de":"OrchardCore ist ein Open-Source-Modular- und Multi-Tenant-Anwendungsframework und ein Content-Management-System, das auf diesem Framework aufbaut.","pt":"O Criador de Módulos OrchardCore é uma ferramenta para criar novos módulos seguindo as convenções do projeto","ru":"Создатель модулей OrchardCore — это инструмент для создания новых модулей в соответствии с соглашениями проекта","ar":"مبدع وحدة أوركارد كور هو أداة لإنشاء وحدات جديدة متوافقة مع اتفاقيات المشروع","en":"Orchard Core is an open-source modular and multi-tenant application framework built with ASP.NET Core, and a content management system (CMS) built on top of that framework."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"OrchardCore模块创建器","ja":"OrchardCoreモジュール作成ツール","ko":"오차드코어 모듈 생성기","es":"Creador de módulos OrchardCore","fr":"Créateur de modules OrchardCore","de":"OrchardCore-Modul-Ersteller","pt":"Criador de Módulos OrchardCore","ru":"Создатель модулей OrchardCore","ar":"مبدع وحدة أوركارد كور","en":"orchardcore-module-creator"},"description":{"zh":"OrchardCore模块创建器指导您创建新的OrchardCore模块，遵循项目约定","ja":"OrchardCoreモジュール作成ツールは、プロジェクトの規約に従って新しいOrchardCoreモジュールを作成するためのガイダンスを提供","ko":"오차드코어 모듈 생성기는 프로젝트 규약을 따르는 새로운 오차드코어 모듈을 생성하기 위한 가이드를 제공","es":"OrchardCore es un framework de aplicación modular y multi-tenant de código abierto, y un sistema de gestión de contenido construido sobre ese framework.","fr":"OrchardCore est un framework d''application modulaire et multi-locataire open source, et un système de gestion de contenu construit sur ce framework.","de":"OrchardCore ist ein Open-Source-Modular- und Multi-Tenant-Anwendungsframework und ein Content-Management-System, das auf diesem Framework aufbaut.","pt":"O Criador de Módulos OrchardCore é uma ferramenta para criar novos módulos seguindo as convenções do projeto","ru":"Создатель модулей OrchardCore — это инструмент для создания новых модулей в соответствии с соглашениями проекта","ar":"مبدع وحدة أوركارد كور هو أداة لإنشاء وحدات جديدة متوافقة مع اتفاقيات المشروع","en":"Orchard Core is an open-source modular and multi-tenant application framework built with ASP.NET Core, and a content management system (CMS) built on top of ..."},"definition":{"en":"Orchard Core is an open-source modular and multi-tenant application framework built with ASP.NET Core, and a content management system (CMS) built on top of that framework."},"features":{"zh":["创建新的OrchardCore模块","遵循项目约定","支持多种模块类型","简化模块开发流程","提高开发效率"],"ja":["新しいOrchardCoreモジュールの作成","プロジェクトの規約に従った作成","複数のモジュールタイプのサポート","モジュール開発プロセスの簡素化","開発効率の向上"],"ko":["새로운 오차드코어 모듈 생성","프로젝트 규약을 따르는 생성","다양한 모듈 유형 지원","모듈 개발 프로세스 간소화","개발 효율성 향상"],"es":["Creación de módulos personalizados","Seguimiento de convenciones de proyecto","Compatibilidad con .NET SDK 10.0+","Soporte para contenido y comportamiento personalizados","Creación de partes de contenido y controladores"],"fr":["Création de modules personnalisés","Suivi des conventions de projet","Compatibilité avec .NET SDK 10.0+","Prise en charge de contenu et de comportement personnalisés","Création de parties de contenu et de pilotes"],"de":["Erstellung benutzerdefinierter Module","Einhaltung von Projekt-Konventionen","Unterstützung für .NET SDK 10.0+","Unterstützung für benutzerdefinierten Inhalt und Verhalten","Erstellung von Inhaltsteilen und Treibern"],"pt":["Criação de módulos personalizados","Compatibilidade com o framework ASP.NET Core","Suporte à criação de partes de conteúdo e campos","Integração com o sistema de gerenciamento de conteúdo (CMS)","Seguimento das convenções do projeto OrchardCore"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских модулей","Совместимость с фреймворком ASP.NET Core","Поддержка создания частей контента и полей","Интеграция с системой управления контентом (CMS)","Соблюдение соглашений проекта OrchardCore"],"ar":["إنشاء وحدات مخصصة","التوافق مع إطار العمل ASP.NET Core","دعم إنشاء أجزاء المحتوى والحقول","التكامل مع نظام إدارة المحتوى (CMS)","الامتثال لاتفاقيات مشروع أوركارد كور"]},"keywords":{"zh":["OrchardCore模块创建器","OrchardCore模块开发","ASP.NET Core","内容管理系统","模块化应用框架"],"ja":["OrchardCoreモジュール作成ツール","OrchardCoreモジュール開発","ASP.NET Core","コンテンツ管理システム","モジュール化アプリケーションフレームワーク"],"ko":["오차드코어 모듈 생성기","오차드코어 모듈 개발","ASP.NET Core","콘텐츠 관리 시스템","모듈화된 애플리케이션 프레임워크"],"es":["OrchardCore","módulos personalizados","framework de aplicación modular","sistema de gestión de contenido","ASP.NET Core","desarrollo de módulos","creación de módulos","convenciones de proyecto"],"fr":["OrchardCore","modules personnalisés","framework d''application modulaire","système de gestion de contenu","ASP.NET Core","développement de modules","création de modules","conventions de projet"],"de":["OrchardCore","benutzerdefinierte Module","modulares Anwendungsframework","Content-Management-System","ASP.NET Core","Modulentwicklung","Modulerstellung","Projekt-Konventionen"],"pt":["OrchardCore","módulos personalizados","ASP.NET Core","CMS","desenvolvimento web","código aberto","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["OrchardCore","пользовательские модули","ASP.NET Core","CMS","веб-разработка","открытый код","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["أوركارد كور","وحدات مخصصة","إطار العمل ASP.NET Core","نظام إدارة المحتوى","تطوير الويب","الكود المفتوح","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"OrchardCMS","repo":"OrchardCore","repoPath":"OrchardCMS/OrchardCore","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.420Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"orchardcore-module-creator","description":"Creates new OrchardCore modules with proper structure, manifest, startup, and patterns. Use when the user needs to create a new module, add content parts, fields, drivers, handlers, or admin functionality.","bodyPreview":"# OrchardCore Module Creator\n\nThis skill guides you through creating new OrchardCore modules following project conventions.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- OrchardCore repository at `D:\\orchardcore`\n- .NET SDK 10.0+ installed\n\n## Module Creation Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Determine Module Type\n\n**What kind of module are you creating?**\n\n| Type | Description | Key Components |\n|------|-------------|----------------|\n| **Content Part** | Adds data/behavior to content items | Part, Driver, Views |\n| **Content Fiel","body":"# OrchardCore Module Creator\n\nThis skill guides you through creating new OrchardCore modules following project conventions.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- OrchardCore repository at `D:\\orchardcore`\n- .NET SDK 10.0+ installed\n\n## Module Creation Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Determine Module Type\n\n**What kind of module are you creating?**\n\n| Type | Description | Key Components |\n|------|-------------|----------------|\n| **Content Part** | Adds data/behavior to content items | Part, Driver, Views |\n| **Content Field** | Custom field type | Field, Driver, Views |\n| **Settings** | Site-wide configuration | SiteSettings, Driver |\n| **Admin Feature** | Admin pages/tools | Controller, Views, Menu |\n| **API** | REST endpoints | ApiController |\n| **Background Task** | Scheduled jobs | IBackgroundTask |\n\n### Step 2: Create Module Directory\n\n```bash\n# Create module folder\nmkdir src/OrchardCore.Modules/OrchardCore.YourModule\ncd src/OrchardCore.Modules/OrchardCore.YourModule\n```\n\n### Step 3: Create Required Files\n\nEvery module needs these three files:\n\n1. **Manifest.cs** - Module metadata\n2. **Startup.cs** - Service registration  \n3. **OrchardCore.YourModule.csproj** - Project file\n\nSee `references/module-structure.md` for templates.\n\n### Step 4: Add Components Based on Type\n\n**For Content Part modules:**\n```\nModels/YourPart.cs\nViewModels/YourPartViewModel.cs\nDrivers/YourPartDisplayDriver.cs\nViews/YourPart.cshtml\nViews/YourPart_Edit.cshtml\n```\n\n**For Admin modules:**\n```\nControllers/AdminController.cs\nViews/Admin/Index.cshtml\nAdminMenu.cs\nPermissionProvider.cs\n```\n\n**For Data-storing modules:**\n```\nMigrations.cs\nIndexes/YourIndex.cs\n```\n\nSee `references/patterns.md` for code templates.\n\n### Step 5: Register in Startup.cs\n\n```csharp\npublic override void ConfigureServices(IServiceCollection services)\n{\n    // Content part\n    services.AddContentPart<YourPart>()\n        .UseDisplayDriver<YourPartDisplayDriver>();\n    \n    // Services\n    services.AddScoped<IYourService, YourService>();\n    \n    // Migrations (if storing data)\n    services.AddDataMigration<Migrations>();\n    \n    // Permissions (if securing features)\n    services.AddPermissionProvider<PermissionProvider>();\n    \n    // Navigation (if adding admin menu)\n    services.AddNavigationProvider<AdminMenu>();\n}\n```\n\n### Step 6: Build and Test\n\n```bash\n# Build the module\ncd D:\\orchardcore\ndotnet build src/OrchardCore.Modules/OrchardCore.YourModule\n\n# Run the application\ncd src/OrchardCore.Cms.Web\ndotnet run -f net10.0\n\n# Enable the feature in Admin → Features\n```\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Naming Conventions\n\n| Item | Convention | Example |\n|------|------------|---------|\n| Module folder | `OrchardCore.ModuleName` | `OrchardCore.Rating` |\n| Namespace | `OrchardCore.ModuleName` | `OrchardCore.Rating` |\n| Feature ID | `OrchardCore.ModuleName` | `OrchardCore.Rating` |\n| Content Part | `NamePart` | `RatingPart` |\n| Driver | `NamePartDisplayDriver` | `RatingPartDisplayDriver` |\n| View | `PartName.cshtml` | `RatingPart.cshtml` |\n| Edit View | `PartName_Edit.cshtml` | `RatingPart_Edit.cshtml` |\n\n### Common Dependencies\n\nAdd to `.csproj` as needed:\n\n```xml\n<!-- Core module support -->\n<ProjectReference Include=\"..\\..\\OrchardCore\\OrchardCore.Module.Targets\\OrchardCore.Module.Targets.csproj\" />\n\n<!-- Content management -->\n<ProjectReference Include=\"..\\..\\OrchardCore\\OrchardCore.ContentManagement\\OrchardCore.ContentManagement.csproj\" />\n\n<!-- Admin UI -->\n<ProjectReference Include=\"..\\..\\OrchardCore\\OrchardCore.Admin\\OrchardCore.Admin.csproj\" />\n```\n\n### Feature Categories\n\nUse in `Manifest.cs`:\n- `Content Management`\n- `Content`\n- `Navigation`\n- `Security`\n- `Infrastructure`\n- `Theming`\n- `Developer`\n\n## References\n\n- `references/module-structure.md` - Directory layout and file templates\n- `references/patterns.md` - Code patterns (parts, drivers, handlers, etc.)\n- `references/examples.md` - Complete module examples\n- `AGENTS.md` (repo root) - Coding conventions and build commands\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:23:19.344Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for ASP.NET Core Agents needing to create custom OrchardCore modules with multi-tenant capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要创建具有多租户功能的自定义OrchardCore模块的ASP.NET Core代理。","ja":"ASP.NET CoreエージェントがカスタムのOrchardCoreモジュールをマルチテナント機能で作成する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"ASP.NET Core 에이전트가 멀티 테넌트 기능으로 사용자 지정 OrchardCore 모듈을 만들 필요がある 경우에 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes ASP.NET Core que necesitan crear módulos personalizados de OrchardCore con capacidades de multi-inquilino.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents ASP.NET Core nécessitant la création de modules OrchardCore personnalisés avec des capacités multi-locataires.","de":"Ideal für ASP.NET Core-Agents, die benutzerdefinierte OrchardCore-Module mit Multi-Tenant-Funktionen erstellen müssen.","pt":"Ideal para agentes ASP.NET Core que precisam criar módulos personalizados do OrchardCore com capacidades multi-tenant.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ASP.NET Core, которым необходимо создавать пользовательские модули OrchardCore с возможностями многоเทнантности.","ar":"مثالي لعميل ASP.NET Core الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء وحدات OrchardCore مخصصة معقدرات متعدد المستأجرين."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate modular OrchardCore applications using ASP.NET Core, complete with content management system (CMS) functionality and .NET SDK 10.0+ compatibility, following project conventions for seamless integration.","zh":"赋予代理生成模块化的OrchardCore应用程序的能力，使用ASP.NET Core，具有内容管理系统（CMS）功能和.NET SDK 10.0+兼容性，遵循项目惯例以实现无缝集成。","ja":"ASP.NET Coreを使用して、コンテンツ管理システム（CMS）機能および.NET SDK 10.0+との互換性を備えたモジュラーなOrchardCoreアプリケーションを生成するエージェントの能力を提供し、プロジェクトの規約に従ってシームレスな統合を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 ASP.NET Core를 사용하여 콘텐츠 관리 시스템(CMS) 기능 및 .NET SDK 10.0+와의 호환성을 갖춘 모듈러한 OrchardCore 애플리케이션을 생성할 수 있는 기능을 부여하여 프로젝트 규칙에 따라無縫な統合을 달성합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar aplicaciones modulares de OrchardCore utilizando ASP.NET Core, completas con funcionalidad de sistema de gestión de contenido (CMS) y compatibilidad con .NET SDK 10.0+, siguiendo las convenciones del proyecto para una integración sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des applications modulaires OrchardCore à l''aide d''ASP.NET Core, complètes avec une fonctionnalité de système de gestion de contenu (CMS) et une compatibilité avec .NET SDK 10.0+, en suivant les conventions de projet pour une intégration sans problème.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, modulare OrchardCore-Anwendungen mit ASP.NET Core zu generieren, einschließlich Content-Management-System (CMS)-Funktionalität und .NET SDK 10.0+-Kompatibilität, unter Befolgen der Projektkonventionen für eine reibungslose Integration.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar aplicações modulares OrchardCore usando ASP.NET Core, completo com funcionalidade de sistema de gerenciamento de conteúdo (CMS) e compatibilidade com .NET SDK 10.0+, seguindo convenções de projeto para integração sem problemas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать модульные приложения OrchardCore с использованием ASP.NET Core, включая функциональность системы управления контентом (CMS) и совместимость с .NET SDK 10.0+, следующую проектным соглашениям для беспроблемной интеграции.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء تطبيقات OrchardCore القائمة على الوحدات باستخدام ASP.NET Core، كاملة مع وظائف نظام إدارة المحتوى (CMS) ومتوافق مع .NET SDK 10.0+، متبعة الاتفاقيات المشروع من أجل التكامل السلس."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating custom content parts with data and behavior for content items","Developing modular applications with multi-tenant support using OrchardCore","Generating views and drivers for content parts in OrchardCore modules"],"zh":["为内容项目创建带有数据和行为的自定义内容部分","使用OrchardCore开发具有多租户支持的模块化应用程序","为OrchardCore模块中的内容部分生成视图和驱动程序"],"ja":["コンテンツアイテム用のデータおよび動作を含むカスタムコンテンツパーツを作成する","OrchardCoreを使用してマルチテナントサポートを備えたモジュラーなアプリケーションを開発する","OrchardCoreモジュール内のコンテンツパーツ用のビューおよびドライバーを生成する"],"ko":["콘텐츠 아이템을 위한 데이터 및 동작을 포함하는 사용자 지정 콘텐츠 부분을 만들기","OrchardCore를 사용하여 멀티 테넌트 지원을 갖춘 모듈러한 애플리케이션을 개발하기","OrchardCore 모듈 내의 콘텐츠 부분을 위한 보기 및 드라이버를 생성하기"],"es":["Crear partes de contenido personalizadas con datos y comportamiento para elementos de contenido","Desarrollar aplicaciones modulares con soporte multi-inquilino utilizando OrchardCore","Generar vistas y controladores para partes de contenido en módulos de OrchardCore"],"fr":["Créer des parties de contenu personnalisées avec des données et un comportement pour les éléments de contenu","Développer des applications modulaires avec un support multi-locataires en utilisant OrchardCore","Générer des vues et des pilotes pour les parties de contenu dans les modules OrchardCore"],"de":["Erstellen von benutzerdefinierten Inhaltsteilen mit Daten und Verhalten für Inhaltsartikel","Entwickeln von modularen Anwendungen mit Multi-Tenant-Unterstützung unter Verwendung von OrchardCore","Generieren von Ansichten und Treibern für Inhaltsteile in OrchardCore-Modulen"],"pt":["Criar partes de conteúdo personalizadas com dados e comportamento para itens de conteúdo","Desenvolver aplicações modulares com suporte multi-tenant usando OrchardCore","Gerar visualizações e drivers para partes de conteúdo em módulos OrchardCore"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских частей контента с данными и поведением для элементов контента","Разработка модульных приложений с поддержкой многоเทнантности, используя OrchardCore","Генерирование представлений и драйверов для частей контента в модулях OrchardCore"],"ar":["إنشاء أجزاء المحتوى المخصصة مع البيانات والسلوك لأغراض المحتوى","تطوير التطبيقات القائمة على الوحدات مع دعم متعدد المستأجرين باستخدام OrchardCore","إنشاء مناظير وتحريك لأجزاء المحتوى في وحدات OrchardCore"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires OrchardCore repository access",".NET SDK 10.0+ installation","ASP.NET Core compatibility"],"zh":["需要OrchardCore存储库访问权限",".NET SDK 10.0+安装","ASP.NET Core兼容性"],"ja":["OrchardCoreリポジトリへのアクセスが必要",".NET SDK 10.0+のインストール","ASP.NET Coreの互換性"],"ko":["OrchardCore 저장소 액세스 필요",".NET SDK 10.0+ 설치","ASP.NET Core 호환성"],"es":["Requiere acceso al repositorio de OrchardCore","Instalación de .NET SDK 10.0+","Compatibilidad con ASP.NET Core"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au référentiel OrchardCore","Installation de .NET SDK 10.0+","Compatibilité avec ASP.NET Core"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf das OrchardCore-Repository","Installation von .NET SDK 10.0+","ASP.NET Core-Kompatibilität"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao repositório OrchardCore","Instalação do .NET SDK 10.0+","Compatibilidade com ASP.NET Core"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к репозиторию OrchardCore","Установка .NET SDK 10.0+","Совместимость с ASP.NET Core"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مستودع OrchardCore","تثبيت .NET SDK 10.0+","التوافق مع ASP.NET Core"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
