mpatibilidad con runtime code, tests, examples y docs","Fácil integración con openai-agents-python"],"fr":["Cadre de workflow multi-agent","Génération de résumés concis","Création de titres pour les demandes d''extraction","Compatibilité avec le code runtime, les tests, les exemples et les docs","Intégration facile avec openai-agents-python"],"de":["Multi-Agent-Workflow-Framework","Generierung von knappen Zusammenfassungen","Erstellung von Titeln für Pull-Requests","Kompatibilität mit Runtime-Code, Tests, Beispielen und Dokumentation","Einfache Integration mit openai-agents-python"],"pt":["Geração de resumos de PR concisos","Título e descrição de PR prontos para uso","Integração com repositórios de código","Suporte a fluxos de trabalho de múltiplos agentes","Criação de resumos de PR personalizados"],"ru":["Создание кратких сводок PR","Готовый заголовок и описание PR","Интеграция с репозиториями кода","Поддержка многомодульных рабочих процессов","Создание индивидуальных сводок PR"],"ar":["إنشاء ملخصات الطلبات الموجزة","عنوان ووصف الطلب الجاهزان للاستخدام","التكامل مع مستودعات الشفرة","دعم التدفقات العملية متعددة الوكلاء","إنشاء ملخصات الطلبات المخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["PR草稿摘要","多Agent工作流","轻量级框架","PR准备摘要","代码审查","开发工具"],"ja":["PRドラフトサマリー","マルチエージェントワークフロー","軽量級フレームワーク","PR用の要約","コードレビュー","開発ツール"],"ko":["PR 초안 요약","다중 에이전트 워크플로우","가벼운 프레임워크","PR 준비 요약","코드 리뷰","개발 도구"],"es":["resumen de borrador de PR","flujo de trabajo de multiagente","desarrollo de software","solicitudes de extracción","openai-agents-python","automatización de tareas","optimización de procesos"],"fr":["résumé de brouillon de PR","flux de travail multi-agent","développement de logiciels","demandes d''extraction","openai-agents-python","automatisation de tâches","optimisation de processus"],"de":["PR-Entwurfszusammenfassung","Multi-Agent-Workflow","Softwareentwicklung","Pull-Requests","openai-agents-python","Aufgabenautomatisierung","Prozessoptimierung"],"pt":["pr-draft-summary","framework para fluxos de trabalho","resumos de PR","repositórios de código","desenvolvimento de software","fluxos de trabalho de múltiplos agentes"],"ru":["pr-draft-summary","фреймворк для рабочих процессов","сводки PR","репозитории кода","разработка программного обеспечения","многомодульные рабочие процессы"],"ar":["pr-draft-summary","إطار عمل للتدفقات العملية","ملخصات الطلبات","مستودعات الشفرة","تطوير البرمجيات","التدفقات العملية متعددة الوكلاء"]}},"owner":"openai","repo":"openai-agents-python","repoPath":"openai/openai-agents-python","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.420Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pr-draft-summary","description":"Create a PR title and draft description after substantive code changes are finished. Trigger when wrapping up a moderate-or-larger change (runtime code, tests, build config, docs with behavior impact) and you need the PR-ready summary block with change summary plus PR draft text.","bodyPreview":"# PR Draft Summary\n\n## Purpose\nProduce the PR-ready summary required in this repository after substantive code work is complete: a concise summary plus a PR-ready title and draft description that begins with \"This pull request <verb> ...\". The block should be ready to paste into a PR for openai-agents-python.\n\n## When to Trigger\n- The task for this repo is finished (or ready for review) and it touched runtime code, tests, examples, docs with behavior impact, or build/test configuration.\n- You ar","body":"# PR Draft Summary\n\n## Purpose\nProduce the PR-ready summary required in this repository after substantive code work is complete: a concise summary plus a PR-ready title and draft description that begins with \"This pull request <verb> ...\". The block should be ready to paste into a PR for openai-agents-python.\n\n## When to Trigger\n- The task for this repo is finished (or ready for review) and it touched runtime code, tests, examples, docs with behavior impact, or build/test configuration.\n- You are about to send the \"work complete\" response and need the PR block included.\n- Skip only for trivial or conversation-only tasks where no PR-style summary is expected.\n\n## Inputs to Collect Automatically (do not ask the user)\n- Current branch: `git rev-parse --abbrev-ref HEAD`.\n- Working tree: `git status -sb`.\n- Untracked files: `git ls-files --others --exclude-standard` (use with `git status -sb` to ensure they are surfaced; `--stat` does not include them).\n- Changed files: `git diff --name-only` (unstaged) and `git diff --name-only --cached` (staged); sizes via `git diff --stat` and `git diff --stat --cached`.\n- Base reference (use the branch''s upstream, fallback to `origin/main`):\n  - `BASE_REF=$(git rev-parse --abbrev-ref --symbolic-full-name @{upstream} 2>/dev/null || echo origin/main)`.\n  - `BASE_COMMIT=$(git merge-base --fork-point \"$BASE_REF\" HEAD || git merge-base \"$BASE_REF\" HEAD || echo \"$BASE_REF\")`.\n- Commits ahead of the base fork point: `git log --oneline --no-merges ${BASE_COMMIT}..HEAD`.\n- Category signals for this repo: runtime (`src/agents/`), tests (`tests/`), examples (`examples/`), docs (`docs/`, `mkdocs.yml`), build/test config (`pyproject.toml`, `uv.lock`, `Makefile`, `.github/`).\n\n## Workflow\n1) Run the commands above without asking the user; compute `BASE_REF`/`BASE_COMMIT` first so later commands reuse them.\n2) If there are no staged/unstaged/untracked changes and no commits ahead of `${BASE_COMMIT}`, reply briefly that no code changes were detected and skip emitting the PR block.\n3) Infer change type from the touched paths listed under \"Category signals\"; classify as feature, fix, refactor, or docs-with-impact, and flag backward-compatibility risk when runtime code changed.\n4) Summarize changes in 1–3 short sentences using the key paths (top 5) and `git diff --stat` output; explicitly call out untracked files from `git status -sb`/`git ls-files --others --exclude-standard` because `--stat` does not include them. If the working tree is clean but there are commits ahead of `${BASE_COMMIT}`, summarize using those commit messages.\n5) Choose the lead verb for the description: feature → `adds`, bug fix → `fixes`, refactor/perf → `improves` or `updates`, docs-only → `updates`.\n6) Suggest a branch name. If already off main, keep it; otherwise propose `feat/<slug>`, `fix/<slug>`, or `docs/<slug>` based on the primary area (e.g., `docs/pr-draft-summary-guidance`).\n7) If the current branch matches `issue-<number>` (digits only), keep that branch suggestion. Optionally pull light issue context (for example via the GitHub API) when available, but do not block or retry if it is not. When an issue number is present, reference `https://github.com/openai/openai-agents-python/issues/<number>` and include an auto-closing line such as `This pull request resolves #<number>.`.\n8) Draft the PR title and description using the template below.\n9) Output only the block in \"Output Format\". Keep any surrounding status note minimal and in English.\n\n## Output Format\nWhen closing out a task and the summary block is desired, add this concise Markdown block (English only) after any brief status note. If the user says they do not want it, skip this section.\n\n```\n# Pull Request Draft\n\n## Branch name suggestion\n\ngit checkout -b <kebab-case suggestion, e.g., feat/pr-draft-summary-skill>\n\n## Title\n\n<single-line imperative title, which can be a commit message; if a common prefix like chore: and feat: etc., having them is preferred>\n\n## Description\n\n<include what you changed plus a draft pull request title and description for your local changes; start the description with prose such as \"This pull request resolves/updates/adds ...\" using a verb that matches the change (you can use bullets later), explain the change background (for bugs, clearly describe the bug, symptoms, or repro; for features, what is needed and why), any behavior changes or considerations to be aware of, and you do not need to mention tests you ran.>\n```\n\nKeep it tight—no redundant prose around the block, and avoid repeating details between `Changes` and the description. Tests do not need to be listed unless specifically requested.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:23:13.165Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing automated pull request summarization.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化拉取请求总结的代码审查代理。","ja":"コードレビュー代理が自動化されたプルリクエストの要約を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"자동화된 풀 리퀘스트 요약이 필요한 코드 리뷰 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de revisión de código que necesitan una suma de solicitudes de extracción automatizada.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de révision de code nécessitant une sommaire de demande d''extraction automatisée.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agenten, die eine automatisierte Zusammenfassung von Pull-Requests benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que necessitam de resumo de solicitação de pull automatizado.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов код-ревью, которым требуется автоматизированное резюме запроса на слияние.","ar":"مثالي لعميل استعراض الشفرة الذي يحتاج إلى ملخص طلب السحب التلقائي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate PR-ready summaries, including concise titles and draft descriptions, utilizing multi-agent workflows and repository-specific formatting, such as producing summaries for openai-agents-python.","zh":"赋予代理生成准备就绪的PR摘要的能力，包括简洁的标题和草稿描述，利用多代理工作流和特定于存储库的格式，例如为openai-agents-python生成摘要。","ja":"エージェントにPR用のサマリーを生成する能力を付与します。包括的なタイトルと下書きの説明、多エージェントのワークフロー、リポジトリ固有のフォーマット（openai-agents-python用のサマリーを生成するなど）を利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 PR 준비 요약을 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다. 이는 다중 에이전트 워크플로 및 리포지토리별 형식을 활용하여 요약서를 생성하는 것을 포함합니다. 예를 들어 openai-agents-python 요약서를 생성합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar resúmenes listos para PR, incluyendo títulos concisos y descripciones de borrador, utilizando flujos de trabajo de multiagente y formato específico del repositorio, como la generación de resúmenes para openai-agents-python.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des résumés prêts pour PR, y compris des titres concis et des descriptions de brouillon, en utilisant des flux de travail multi-agents et un format spécifique au référentiel, comme la production de résumés pour openai-agents-python.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, PR-fertige Zusammenfassungen zu generieren, einschließlich knapper Titel und Entwurfsbeschreibungen, unter Verwendung von Multiagenten-Workflows und repositoryspezifischem Formatting, wie z.B. die Erstellung von Zusammenfassungen für openai-agents-python.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerem resumos prontos para solicitação de pull, incluindo títulos concisos e descrições de rascunho, utilizando fluxos de trabalho de multiagente e formatação específica do repositório, como produzir resumos para openai-agents-python.","ru":"Позволяет агентам генерировать резюме, готовые для запроса на слияние, включая краткие заголовки и черновые описания, используя рабочие процессы мультиагента и форматирование, специфичное для репозитория, например, генерировать резюме для openai-agents-python.","ar":"يمكن للعميل توليد ملخصات جاهزة لطلب السحب، بما في ذلك عناوين موجزة ووصف مسودة، باستخدام سير عمل متعدد الوكلاء وتدوين محدد للمستودع، مثل إنتاج ملخصات ل openai-agents-python."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating pull request summaries","Generating PR-ready titles and descriptions","Streamlining code review workflows"],"zh":["自动化拉取请求总结","生成PR准备就绪的标题和描述","简化代码审查工作流"],"ja":["プルリクエストのサマリーの自動化","PR用のタイトルと説明の生成","コードレビューのワークフローの最適化"],"ko":["풀 리퀘스트 요약의 자동화","PR 준비 제목 및 설명의 생성","코드 리뷰 워크플로의 간소화"],"es":["Automatización de resúmenes de solicitudes de extracción","Generación de títulos y descripciones listas para PR","Optimización de flujos de trabajo de revisión de código"],"fr":["Automatisation des sommaires de demande d''extraction","Génération de titres et de descriptions prêts pour PR","Optimisation des flux de travail de révision de code"],"de":["Automatisierung von Pull-Request-Zusammenfassungen","Generierung von PR-fertigen Titeln und Beschreibungen","Optimierung von Code-Review-Workflows"],"pt":["Automatizar resumos de solicitação de pull","Gerar títulos e descrições prontos para solicitação de pull","Otimizar fluxos de trabalho de revisão de código"],"ru":["Автоматизировать резюме запроса на слияние","Генерировать заголовки и описания, готовые для запроса на слияние","Оптимизировать рабочие процессы код-ревью"],"ar":["توفير ملخصات طلب السحب","توليد عناوين ووصف جاهزة لطلب السحب","تبسيط سير عمل استعراض الشفرة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to repository code and commit history","Specific to openai-agents-python repository format"],"zh":["需要访问存储库代码和提交历史","特定于openai-agents-python存储库格式"],"ja":["リポジトリのコードとコミット履歴へのアクセスが必要","openai-agents-pythonリポジトリ形式に特有"],"ko":["리포지토리 코드 및 커밋 기록에 대한 액세스가 필요함","openai-agents-python 리포지토리 형식에 특정"],"es":["Requiere acceso al código del repositorio y al historial de confirmaciones","Específico del formato del repositorio openai-agents-python"],"fr":["Requiert l''accès au code du référentiel et à l''historique des validations","Spécifique au format du référentiel openai-agents-python"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf den Repository-Code und den Commit-Verlauf","Spezifisch für das Format des openai-agents-python-Repositorys"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao código do repositório e histórico de commits","Específico para o formato de repositório openai-agents-python"],"ru":["Требует доступа к коду репозитория и истории коммитов","Специфичен для формата репозитория openai-agents-python"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى رمز المستودع وتاريخ الإنشاء","محدد لتنسيق المستودع openai-agents-python"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
