m","ar":"Tempo Codegen: واجهة TypeScript لـ Ethereum","en":"tempo-codegen"},"description":{"zh":"Tempo Codegen是一个TypeScript接口，用于以太坊，提供生成actions的能力，确保合约规范的一致性","ja":"Tempo Codegenはイーサリアム用のTypeScriptインターフェイスであり、アクションを生成し、契約仕様の一貫性を確保する機能を提供します","ko":"Tempo Codegen은 이더리움을 위한 TypeScript 인터페이스로서 액션을 생성하고 계약 규격의 일관성을 보장하는 기능을 제공합니다","es":"Tempo Codegen es una interfaz de TypeScript para Ethereum que permite generar acciones basadas en especificaciones de contratos precompilados","fr":"Tempo Codegen est une interface TypeScript pour Ethereum qui permet de générer des actions basées sur les spécifications de contrats précompilés","de":"Tempo Codegen ist eine TypeScript-Schnittstelle für Ethereum, die das Erstellen von Aktionen basierend auf Spezifikationen von vorcompilierten Verträgen ermö...","pt":"O Tempo Codegen é uma interface TypeScript para Ethereum que permite gerar ações com base em especificações de contrato pré-compilado.","ru":"Tempo Codegen — это интерфейс TypeScript для Ethereum, который позволяет генерировать действия на основе спецификаций предварительно скомпилированного контра...","ar":"Tempo Codegen هو واجهة TypeScript لـ Ethereum يسمح بتوليد الإجراءات بناءً على مواصفات العقد المترجمة مسبقًا.","en":"TypeScript Interface for Ethereum"},"definition":{"en":"TypeScript Interface for Ethereum"},"features":{"zh":["以太坊合约规范支持","TypeScript接口","actions生成","合约一致性检查","预编译合约支持"],"ja":["イーサリアム契約仕様サポート","TypeScriptインターフェイス","アクション生成","契約の一貫性チェック","事前コンパイル済み契約サポート"],"ko":["이더리움 계약 규격 지원","TypeScript 인터페이스","액션 생성","계약 일관성 확인","사전 컴파일 계약 지원"],"es":["Interfaz de TypeScript para Ethereum","Generación de acciones basadas en especificaciones de contratos precompilados","Compatibilidad con precompilados de contratos","Ejemplos de acciones generadas en src/tempo/actions/","Documentación de especificaciones en test/tempo/docs/specs/","Preferencia por la fuente de verdad en caso de inconsistencias"],"fr":["Interface TypeScript pour Ethereum","Génération d''actions basées sur les spécifications de contrats précompilés","Compatibilité avec les précompilés de contrats","Exemples d''actions générées dans src/tempo/actions/","Documentation des spécifications dans test/tempo/docs/specs/","Préférence pour la source de vérité en cas d''incohérences"],"de":["TypeScript-Schnittstelle für Ethereum","Erstellung von Aktionen basierend auf Spezifikationen von vorcompilierten Verträgen","Kompatibilität mit vorcompilierten Verträgen","Beispiele für generierte Aktionen in src/tempo/actions/","Dokumentation der Spezifikationen in test/tempo/docs/specs/","Bevorzugung der Quelle der Wahrheit im Falle von Inkonsistenzen"],"pt":["Geração de ações com base em especificações de contrato pré-compilado","Interface TypeScript para Ethereum","Compatibilidade com pré-compilados","Especificações de contrato em `test/tempo/docs/specs/`","Exemplo de ação gerada em `src/tempo/actions/token.ts`"],"ru":["Генерация действий на основе спецификаций предварительно скомпилированного контракта","Интерфейс TypeScript для Ethereum","Совместимость с предварительно скомпилированными контрактами","Спецификации контракта в `test/tempo/docs/specs/`","Пример сгенерированного действия в `src/tempo/actions/token.ts`"],"ar":["توليد الإجراءات بناءً على مواصفات العقد المترجمة مسبقًا","واجهة TypeScript لـ Ethereum","التوافق مع العقود المترجمة مسبقًا","مواصفات العقد في `test/tempo/docs/specs/`","مثال للإجراء المولَّد في `src/tempo/actions/token.ts`"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Tempo Codegen","以太坊","TypeScript","合约规范","actions生成","预编译合约"],"ja":["Tempo Codegen","イーサリアム","TypeScript","契約仕様","アクション生成","事前コンパイル済み契約"],"ko":["Tempo Codegen","이더리움","TypeScript","계약 규격","액션 생성","사전 컴파일 계약"],"es":["Tempo Codegen","TypeScript","Ethereum","contratos precompilados","generación de código","acciones","desarrollo de blockchain","interfaz de programación de aplicaciones"],"fr":["Tempo Codegen","TypeScript","Ethereum","contrats précompilés","génération de code","actions","développement de blockchain","interface de programmation d''applications"],"de":["Tempo Codegen","TypeScript","Ethereum","vorcompilierte Verträge","Codegenerierung","Aktionen","Blockchain-Entwicklung","Schnittstelle für die Programmierung von Anwendungen"],"pt":["Tempo Codegen","Interface TypeScript","Ethereum","Geração de ações","Pré-compilados","Contrato inteligente","Desenvolvimento de blockchain"],"ru":["Tempo Codegen","Интерфейс TypeScript","Ethereum","Генерация действий","Предварительно скомпилированные контракты","Умный контракт","Разработка блокчейна"],"ar":["Tempo Codegen","واجهة TypeScript","Ethereum","توليد الإجراءات","العقود المترجمة مسبقًا","العقد الذكي","تطوير البلوكشين"]}},"owner":"wevm","repo":"viem","repoPath":"wevm/viem","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.420Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tempo-codegen","description":"Skill for generating Tempo code.","bodyPreview":"# Tempo Code Generation\n\nWhen generating actions (in `src/tempo/actions/`), follow these guidelines.\n\nAn example of a generated action set can be found in `src/tempo/actions/token.ts`.\n\n## Source of Truth\n\n- **All actions must be based on precompile contract specifications** in `test/tempo/docs/specs/`.\n- It could be likely that some interfaces may be inconsistent between the specs (`test/tempo/docs/specs`) and the precompiles (`test/tempo/crates/contracts/src/precompiles`). Always prefer the pr","body":"# Tempo Code Generation\n\nWhen generating actions (in `src/tempo/actions/`), follow these guidelines.\n\nAn example of a generated action set can be found in `src/tempo/actions/token.ts`.\n\n## Source of Truth\n\n- **All actions must be based on precompile contract specifications** in `test/tempo/docs/specs/`.\n- It could be likely that some interfaces may be inconsistent between the specs (`test/tempo/docs/specs`) and the precompiles (`test/tempo/crates/contracts/src/precompiles`). Always prefer the precompile interfaces over the specs.\n- If the specification is unclear or missing details, **prompt the developer** for guidance rather than making assumptions\n\n## Documentation Requirements\n\nAll actions **must include comprehensive JSDoc** with:\n\n1. **Function description** - What the action does\n2. **`@example` block** - Complete working example showing:\n   - Required imports (`createClient`, `http`, action imports)\n   - Client setup with chain and transport\n   - Action usage with realistic parameters\n   - Expected return value handling (if applicable)\n3. **`@param` tags** - For each parameter (client, parameters)\n4. **`@returns` tag** - Description of the return value\n\nExample:\n```typescript\n/**\n * Gets the pool ID for a token pair.\n *\n * @example\n * ```ts\n * import { createClient, http } from ''viem''\n * import { tempo } from ''tempo.ts/chains''\n * import { Actions } from ''tempo.ts/viem''\n *\n * const client = createClient({\n *   chain: tempo({ feeToken: ''0x20c0000000000000000000000000000000000001'' })\n *   transport: http(),\n * })\n *\n * const poolId = await Actions.amm.getPoolId(client, {\n *   userToken: ''0x...'',\n *   validatorToken: ''0x...'',\n * })\n * ```\n *\n * @param client - Client.\n * @param parameters - Parameters.\n * @returns The pool ID.\n */\n```\n\n## Action Types\n\n### Read-Only Actions\n\nFor view/pure functions that only read state:\n\n- Use `readContract` from `viem/actions`\n- Return type should use `ReadContractReturnType`\n- Parameters extend `ReadParameters`\n\n### Mutate-Based Actions\n\nFor state-changing functions, **both variants must be implemented**:\n\n**1. Standard Async Variant**\n\n- Uses `writeContract` from `viem/actions`\n- Returns transaction hash\n- Async operation that doesn''t wait for confirmation\n\n```typescript\nexport async function myAction<\n  chain extends Chain | undefined,\n  account extends Account | undefined,\n>(\n  client: Client<Transport, chain, account>,\n  parameters: myAction.Parameters<chain, account>,\n): Promise<myAction.ReturnValue> {\n  return myAction.inner(writeContract, client, parameters)\n}\n```\n\n**2. Sync Variant (`*Sync`)**\n\n- Named with `Sync` suffix (e.g., `mintSync`, `burnSync`, `rebalanceSwapSync`)\n- Uses `writeContractSync` from `viem/actions`\n- **Waits for transaction confirmation**\n- Returns both the receipt and extracted event data\n- **Must use `extractEvent` to get return values** (not `simulateContract`)\n\n```typescript\nexport async function myActionSync<\n  chain extends Chain | undefined,\n  account extends Account | undefined,\n>(\n  client: Client<Transport, chain, account>,\n  parameters: myActionSync.Parameters<chain, account>,\n): Promise<myActionSync.ReturnValue> {\n  const { throwOnReceiptRevert = true, ...rest } = parameters\n  const receipt = await myAction.inner(writeContractSync, client, {\n    ...rest,\n    throwOnReceiptRevert,\n  } as never)\n  const { args } = myAction.extractEvent(receipt.logs)\n  return {\n    ...args,\n    receipt,\n  } as never\n}\n```\n\n## Namespace Properties\n\nAll actions **must include** the following components within their namespace:\n\n### 1. `Parameters` Type\n\n```typescript\n// Read actions\nexport type Parameters = ReadParameters & Args \n\n// Write actions\nexport type Parameters<\n  chain extends Chain | undefined = Chain | undefined,\n  account extends Account | undefined = Account | undefined,\n> = WriteParameters<chain, account> & Args \n```\n\n### 2. `Args` Type\n\nArguments must be documented with JSDoc.\n\n```typescript\nexport type Args = {\n  /** JSDoc for each argument */\n  argName: Type\n}\n```\n\n### 3. `ReturnValue` Type\n\n```typescript\n// Read actions\nexport type ReturnValue = ReadContractReturnType<typeof Abis.myAbi, ''functionName'', never>\n\n// Write actions\nexport type ReturnValue = WriteContractReturnType\n```\n\n### 4. `ErrorType` Type (for write actions)\n\nWrite actions must include an `ErrorType` export. Use `BaseErrorType` from `viem` as a placeholder with a TODO comment for future exhaustive error typing:\n\n```typescript\n// TODO: exhaustive error type\nexport type ErrorType = BaseErrorType\n```\n\n### 5. `call` Function\n\n**Required for all actions** - enables composition with other viem actions:\n\n```typescript\n/**\n * Defines a call to the `functionName` function.\n *\n * Can be passed as a parameter to:\n * - [`estimateContractGas`](https://viem.sh/docs/contract/estimateContractGas): estimate the gas cost of the call\n * - [`simulateContract`](https://viem.sh/docs/contract/simulateContract): simulate the call\n * - [`sendCalls`](https://viem.sh/docs/actions/wallet/sendCalls): send multiple calls\n *\n * @example\n * ```ts\n * import { createClient, http, walletActions } from ''viem''\n * import { tempo } from ''tempo.ts/chains''\n * import { Actions } from ''tempo.ts/viem''\n *\n * const client = createClient({\n *   chain: tempo({ feeToken: ''0x20c0000000000000000000000000000000000001'' })\n *   transport: http(),\n * }).extend(walletActions)\n *\n * const hash = await client.sendTransaction({\n *   calls: [actions.amm.myAction.call({ arg1, arg2 })],\n * })\n * ```\n *\n * @param args - Arguments.\n * @returns The call.\n */\nexport function call(args: Args) {\n  return defineCall({\n    address: Addresses.contractName,\n    abi: Abis.contractName,\n    args: [/* transformed args */],\n    functionName: ''functionName'',\n  })\n}\n```\n\nThe `call` function enables these use cases:\n- `sendCalls` - Batch multiple calls in one transaction\n- `sendTransaction` with `calls` - Send transaction with multiple operations\n- `multicall` - Execute multiple calls in parallel\n- `estimateContractGas` - Estimate gas costs\n- `simulateContract` - Simulate execution\n\n### 6. `extractEvent` Function (for mutate-based actions)\n\n**Required for all actions that emit events**:\n\n```typescript\n/**\n * Extracts the `EventName` event from logs.\n *\n * @param logs - The logs.\n * @returns The `EventName` event.\n */\nexport function extractEvent(logs: Log[]) {\n  const [log] = parseEventLogs({\n    abi: Abis.contractName,\n    logs,\n    eventName: ''EventName'',\n    strict: true,\n  })\n  if (!log) throw new Error(''`EventName` event not found.'')\n  return log\n}\n```\n\n### 7. `inner` Function (for write actions)\n\n```typescript\n/** @internal */\nexport async function inner<\n  action extends typeof writeContract | typeof writeContractSync,\n  chain extends Chain | undefined,\n  account extends Account | undefined,\n>(\n  action: action,\n  client: Client<Transport, chain, account>,\n  parameters: Parameters<chain, account>,\n): Promise<ReturnType<action>> {\n  const { arg1, arg2, ...rest } = parameters\n  const call = myAction.call({ arg1, arg2 })\n  return (await action(client, {\n    ...rest,\n    ...call,\n  } as never)) as never\n}\n```\n\n## Namespace Structure\n\nOrganize actions using namespace pattern:\n\n```typescript\nexport async function myAction(...) { ... }\n\nexport namespace myAction {\n  export type Parameters = ...\n  export type Args = ...\n  export type ReturnValue = ...\n  \n  export async function inner(...) { ... }  // for write actions\n  export function call(args: Args) { ... }\n  export function extractEvent(logs: Log[]) { ... }  // for mutate actions\n}\n```\n\n## Decision-Making\n\nWhen encountering situations that require judgment:\n\n- **Specification ambiguities**: Prompt developer for clarification\n- **Missing contract details**: Request ABI or specification update\n- **Event structure uncertainty**: Ask for event definition\n- **Parameter transformations**: Confirm expected input/output formats\n- **Edge cases**: Discuss handling strategy with developer\n\n## Naming Conventions\n\n- Action names should match contract function names (in camelCase)\n- Sync variants use `Sync` suffix (e.g., `myActionSync`)\n- Event names in `extractEvent` should match contract event names exactly\n- Namespace components should be exported within the action''s namespace\n\n## Testing\n\nTests should be co-located with actions in `*action-name*.test.ts` files. Reference contract tests in `test/tempo/crates/precompiles/` for expected behavior. \n\nSee `src/tempo/actions/token.test.ts` for a comprehensive example of test patterns and structure.\n\n### Test Structure\n\nOrganize tests by action name with a default test case and behavior-specific tests:\n\n```typescript\ndescribe(''actionName'', () => {\n  test(''default'', async () => {\n    // Test the primary/happy path scenario\n    const { receipt, ...result } = await Actions.namespace.actionSync(client, {\n      param1: value1,\n      param2: value2,\n    })\n    \n    expect(receipt).toBeDefined()\n    expect(result).toMatchInlineSnapshot(`...`)\n  })\n\n  test(''behavior: specific edge case'', async () => {\n    // Test specific behaviors, edge cases, or variations\n  })\n\n  test(''behavior: error conditions'', async () => {\n    // Test error handling\n    await expect(\n      actions.namespace.actionSync(client, { ... })\n    ).rejects.toThrow()\n  })\n})\n\ndescribe.todo(''unimplementedAction'')\n```"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:23:55.689Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Ethereum-focused AI Agents needing seamless integration with precompile contract specifications via TypeScript interfaces.","zh":"适用于以太坊专注的AI代理，需要与预编译合约规范通过TypeScript接口实现无缝集成。","ja":"Ethereumに焦点を当てたAIエージェントが、TypeScriptインターフェースを通じて事前コンパイルされた契約仕様とのシームレスな統合を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"이더리움에 중점을 둔 AI 에이전트가 TypeScript 인터페이스를 통해 사전 컴파일된 계약 사양과 무결점으로 통합해야 하는 경우 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA centrados en Ethereum que necesitan una integración perfecta con las especificaciones de contratos precompilados a través de interfaces de TypeScript.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA axés sur Ethereum nécessitant une intégration transparente avec les spécifications de contrats précompilés via des interfaces TypeScript.","de":"Ideal für Ethereum-fokussierte KI-Agenten, die eine nahtlose Integration mit vorcompilierten Vertragspezifikationen über TypeScript-Schnittstellen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA focados em Ethereum que necessitam de integração perfeita com especificações de contrato pré-compilado via interfaces TypeScript.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на Ethereum, которым необходима бесшовная интеграция с спецификациями предварительно скомпилированных контрактов через интерфейсы TypeScript.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يركز على إيثيريوم والذي يحتاج إلى دمج مثالي مع مواصفات عقود ما قبل التجميع عبر واجهات TypeScript."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate Ethereum actions based on precompile contract specifications, ensuring consistency between specs and precompiles, and leveraging TypeScript for robust interface development, specifically utilizing files like `token.ts` and following guidelines outlined in `src/tempo/actions/`.","zh":"赋予代理人根据事前编译合约规范生成以太坊操作的能力，确保规范和事前编译之间的一致性，并利用TypeScript进行强大的接口开发，特别是使用诸如`token.ts`之类的文件，并遵循`src/tempo/actions/`中概述的指南。","ja":"事前コンパイルされた契約仕様に基づいてEthereumアクションを生成するエージェントを可能にし、仕様と事前コンパイルの間の一貫性を確保し、TypeScriptを利用してロバストなインターフェイス開発を行う、特に`token.ts`などのファイルを使用し、`src/tempo/actions/`に概説されているガイドラインに従う。","ko":"사전 컴파일된 계약 사양을 기반으로 이더리움 동작을 생성하는 에이전트를 가능하게 하며, 사양과 사전 컴파일 사이의 일관성을 보장하며, TypeScript를 활용하여 강력한 인터페이스 개발을 수행하며, 특히 `token.ts`와 같은 파일을 사용하고 `src/tempo/actions/`에概説된 지침을 따릅니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar acciones de Ethereum basadas en las especificaciones de contratos precompilados, garantizando la coherencia entre las especificaciones y los precompilados, y aprovechando TypeScript para un desarrollo de interfaces robustas, específicamente utilizando archivos como `token.ts` y siguiendo las directrices establecidas en `src/tempo/actions/`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des actions Ethereum basées sur les spécifications de contrats précompilés, en garantissant la cohérence entre les spécifications et les précompilés, et en exploitant TypeScript pour un développement d''interfaces robustes, en utilisant spécifiquement des fichiers comme `token.ts` et en suivant les directives établies dans `src/tempo/actions/`.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Ethereum-Aktionen basierend auf vorcompilierten Vertragspezifikationen zu generieren, die Konsistenz zwischen Spezifikationen und Vorcompilaten sicherzustellen und TypeScript für eine robuste Schnittstellenentwicklung zu nutzen, insbesondere durch die Verwendung von Dateien wie `token.ts` und die Einhaltung der in `src/tempo/actions/` festgelegten Richtlinien.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerem ações Ethereum com base em especificações de contrato pré-compilado, garantindo a consistência entre as especificações e os pré-compilados, e utilizando o TypeScript para o desenvolvimento de interfaces robustas, utilizando arquivos como `token.ts` e seguindo as diretrizes delineadas em `src/tempo/actions/`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать действия Ethereum на основе спецификаций предварительно скомпилированных контрактов, обеспечивая согласованность между спецификациями и предварительно скомпилированными контрактами, и используя TypeScript для разработки прочных интерфейсов, в частности, используя файлы типа `token.ts` и следуя рекомендациям, изложенным в `src/tempo/actions/`.","ar":"يمكن للعميل توليد إجراءات إيثيريوم بناءً على مواصفات عقود ما قبل التجميع، مما يضمن الاتساق بين المواصفات والعقود قبل التجميع، واستخدام TypeScript لتطوير واجهات قوية، باستخدام ملفات مثل `token.ts` ومتابعة الإرشادات المحددة في `src/tempo/actions/`."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating action sets for Ethereum smart contracts","Validating action interfaces against precompile contract specifications","Automating tempo code generation for Ethereum-based projects"],"zh":["为以太坊智能合约生成动作集","验证动作接口与事前编译合约规范的一致性","自动为以太坊项目生成tempo代码"],"ja":["Ethereumスマートコントラクトのアクションセットを生成する","事前コンパイルされた契約仕様との一致性を検証する","Ethereumベースのプロジェクト用のtempoコードを自動生成する"],"ko":["이더리움 스마트 계약을 위한 액션 세트 생성","사전 컴파일된 계약 사양에 대한 액션 인터페이스 유효성 검사","이더리움 기반 프로젝트를 위한 템포 코드 자동 생성"],"es":["Generación de conjuntos de acciones para contratos inteligentes de Ethereum","Validación de interfaces de acciones contra las especificaciones de contratos precompilados","Automatización de la generación de código tempo para proyectos basados en Ethereum"],"fr":["Génération d''ensembles d''actions pour les contrats intelligents Ethereum","Validation des interfaces d''actions contre les spécifications de contrats précompilés","Automatisation de la génération de code tempo pour les projets basés sur Ethereum"],"de":["Generierung von Aktionssets für Ethereum-Smart-Verträge","Validierung von Aktions-Schnittstellen gegen vorcompilierte Vertragspezifikationen","Automatisierung der Tempo-Codegenerierung für auf Ethereum basierende Projekte"],"pt":["Gerar conjuntos de ações para contratos inteligentes Ethereum","Validar interfaces de ação contra especificações de contrato pré-compilado","Automatizar geração de código tempo para projetos baseados em Ethereum"],"ru":["Генерировать наборы действий для умных контрактов Ethereum","Проверять интерфейсы действий против спецификаций предварительно скомпилированных контрактов","Автоматизировать генерацию кода темпо для проектов на основе Ethereum"],"ar":["توليد مجموعات الإجراءات لعبودات إيثيريوم الذكية","التحقق من واجهات الإجراءات مقابل مواصفات عقود ما قبل التجميع","تأتمة توليد رمز الوقت لمشاريع إيثيريوم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to precompile contract specifications","Dependent on consistency between specs and precompiles","TypeScript knowledge necessary for interface development"],"zh":["需要访问预编译合约规范","依赖于规范与预编译之间的一致性","需要TypeScript知识进行接口开发"],"ja":["事前コンパイルされた契約仕様へのアクセスが必要","仕様と事前コンパイルの間の一貫性に依存する","インターフェイス開発にはTypeScriptの知識が必要"],"ko":["사전 컴파일된 계약 사양에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다.","사양과 사전 컴파일 사이의 일관성에 의존합니다.","인터페이스 개발을 위해 TypeScript 지식이 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere acceso a las especificaciones de contratos precompilados","Dependiente de la coherencia entre las especificaciones y los precompilados","Conocimiento de TypeScript necesario para el desarrollo de interfaces"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès aux spécifications de contrats précompilés","Dépend de la cohérence entre les spécifications et les précompilés","Connaissances de TypeScript nécessaires pour le développement d''interfaces"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf vorcompilierte Vertragspezifikationen","Abhängig von der Konsistenz zwischen Spezifikationen und Vorcompilaten","TypeScript-Kenntnisse erforderlich für die Schnittstellenentwicklung"],"pt":["Requer acesso às especificações de contrato pré-compilado","Dependente da consistência entre as especificações e os pré-compilados","Conhecimento de TypeScript necessário para o desenvolvimento de interfaces"],"ru":["Требует доступа к спецификациям предварительно скомпилированных контрактов","Зависит от согласованности между спецификациями и предварительно скомпилированными контрактами","Знание TypeScript необходимо для разработки интерфейсов"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مواصفات عقود ما قبل التجميع","يعتمد على الاتساق بين المواصفات والعقود قبل التجميع","معرفة TypeScript ضرورية لتطوير الواجهات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
