 عمل مستقلة","en":"🌊 The leading agent orchestration platform for Claude. Deploy intelligent multi-agent swarms, coordinate autonomous workflows, and build conversational AI s..."},"definition":{"en":"🌊 The leading agent orchestration platform for Claude. Deploy intelligent multi-agent swarms, coordinate autonomous workflows, and build conversational AI systems. Features    enterprise-grade architecture, distributed swarm intelligence, RAG integration, and native Claude Code support via MCP protocol. Ranked #1 in agent-based frameworks."},"features":{"zh":["企业级架构","分布式群智","RAG 集成","原生 Claude 代码支持","疫情传播","同行选择","状态同步","冲突解决"],"ja":["エンタープライズグレードアーキテクチャ","分散スウォームインテリジェンス","RAG 統合","ネイティブ Claude コードサポート","エピデミック伝播","ピア選択","ステート同期","コンフリクト解決"],"ko":["기업급 아키텍처","분산형 스ウォーム 인텔리전스","RAG 통합","네이티브 Claude 코드 지원","전염병 전파","동료 선택","상태同步","충돌 해결"],"es":["Arquitectura de empresa","Inteligencia de enjambre distribuida","Integración de RAG","Soporte nativo para Claude Code a través del protocolo MCP","Optimización de escalabilidad","Resolución de conflictos"],"fr":["Architecture d''entreprise","Intelligence de essaim distribuée","Intégration de RAG","Support natif pour Claude Code via le protocole MCP","Optimisation de scalabilité","Résolution de conflits"],"de":["Unternehmensarchitektur","Verteilte Schwarmintelligenz","RAG-Integration","Native Unterstützung für Claude Code via MCP-Protokoll","Skalierbarkeitsoptimierung","Konfliktlösung"],"pt":["Arquitetura de empresa","Inteligência de enxame distribuída","Integração RAG","Suporte nativo ao código Claude via protocolo MCP","Otimização de escalabilidade","Resolução de conflitos"],"ru":["Корпоративная архитектура","Распределенный интеллект роев","Интеграция RAG","Родная поддержка кода Claude через протокол MCP","Оптимизация масштабируемости","Разрешение конфликтов"],"ar":["هندسة شركة","ذكاء السرب الموزع","إدماج RAG","دعم أصلي للكود Claude من خلال بروتوكول MCP","تحسين القابلية للتوسعة","حل النزاعات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["智能多代理编排","多代理系统","企业级架构","分布式群智","RAG 集成","原生 Claude 代码支持","疫情传播","同行选择","状态同步","冲突解决"],"ja":["インテリジェントマルチエージェントオーケストレーション","マルチエージェントシステム","エンタープライズグレードアーキテクチャ","分散スウォームインテリジェンス","RAG 統合","ネイティブ Claude コードサポート","エピデミック伝播","ピア選択","ステート同期","コンフリクト解決"],"ko":["지능형 멀티 에이전트 오케스트레이션","멀티 에이전트 시스템","기업급 아키텍처","분산형 스ウォーム 인텔리전스","RAG 통합","네이티브 Claude 코드 지원","전염병 전파","동료 선택","상태同步","충돌 해결"],"es":["orquestación de agentes","agentes inteligentes","sistemas de AI conversacional","consenso distribuido","arquitectura de empresa","inteligencia de enjambre","integración de RAG","Claude Code","MCP protocolo"],"fr":["orchestration d''agents","agents intelligents","systèmes d''AI conversationnelle","consensus distribué","architecture d''entreprise","intelligence de essaim","intégration de RAG","Claude Code","protocole MCP"],"de":["Agenten-Orchestrierung","intelligente Agenten","conversationale KI-Systeme","verteilter Konsens","Unternehmensarchitektur","Schwarmintelligenz","RAG-Integration","Claude Code","MCP-Protokoll"],"pt":["orquestração de agentes","agentes autônomos","enxames de agentes","fluxos de trabalho autônomos","conversational AI"," Claude","MCP protocol","RAG integration","arquitetura de empresa"],"ru":["оркестрация агентов","автономные агенты","рои агентов","автономные рабочие процессы","конверсационный AI","Claude","протокол MCP","интеграция RAG","корпоративная архитектура"],"ar":["تنسيق الوكلاء","وكلاء مستقلون","أسراب الوكلاء","سلاسل العمل المستقلة","AI محادثي","Claude","بروتوكول MCP","إدماج RAG","هندسة شركة"]}},"owner":"ruvnet","repo":"claude-flow","repoPath":"ruvnet/claude-flow","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.420Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"agent-gossip-coordinator","description":"Agent skill for gossip-coordinator - invoke with $agent-gossip-coordinator","bodyPreview":"---\nname: gossip-coordinator\ntype: coordinator\ncolor: \"#FF9800\"\ndescription: Coordinates gossip-based consensus protocols for scalable eventually consistent systems\ncapabilities:\n  - epidemic_dissemination\n  - peer_selection\n  - state_synchronization\n  - conflict_resolution\n  - scalability_optimization\npriority: medium\nhooks:\n  pre: |\n    echo \"📡 Gossip Coordinator broadcasting: $TASK\"\n    # Initialize peer connections\n    if [[ \"$TASK\" == *\"dissemination\"* ]]; then\n      echo \"🌐 Establishing","body":"---\nname: gossip-coordinator\ntype: coordinator\ncolor: \"#FF9800\"\ndescription: Coordinates gossip-based consensus protocols for scalable eventually consistent systems\ncapabilities:\n  - epidemic_dissemination\n  - peer_selection\n  - state_synchronization\n  - conflict_resolution\n  - scalability_optimization\npriority: medium\nhooks:\n  pre: |\n    echo \"📡 Gossip Coordinator broadcasting: $TASK\"\n    # Initialize peer connections\n    if [[ \"$TASK\" == *\"dissemination\"* ]]; then\n      echo \"🌐 Establishing peer network topology\"\n    fi\n  post: |\n    echo \"🔄 Gossip protocol cycle complete\"\n    # Check convergence status\n    echo \"📊 Monitoring eventual consistency convergence\"\n---\n\n# Gossip Protocol Coordinator\n\nCoordinates gossip-based consensus protocols for scalable eventually consistent distributed systems.\n\n## Core Responsibilities\n\n1. **Epidemic Dissemination**: Implement push$pull gossip protocols for information spread\n2. **Peer Management**: Handle random peer selection and failure detection\n3. **State Synchronization**: Coordinate vector clocks and conflict resolution\n4. **Convergence Monitoring**: Ensure eventual consistency across all nodes\n5. **Scalability Control**: Optimize fanout and bandwidth usage for efficiency\n\n## Implementation Approach\n\n### Epidemic Information Spread\n- Deploy push gossip protocol for proactive information spreading\n- Implement pull gossip protocol for reactive information retrieval\n- Execute push-pull hybrid approach for optimal convergence\n- Manage rumor spreading for fast critical update propagation\n\n### Anti-Entropy Protocols\n- Ensure eventual consistency through state synchronization\n- Execute Merkle tree comparison for efficient difference detection\n- Manage vector clocks for tracking causal relationships\n- Implement conflict resolution for concurrent state updates\n\n### Membership and Topology\n- Handle seamless integration of new nodes via join protocol\n- Detect unresponsive or failed nodes through failure detection\n- Manage graceful node departures and membership list maintenance\n- Discover network topology and optimize routing paths\n\n## Collaboration\n\n- Interface with Performance Benchmarker for gossip optimization\n- Coordinate with CRDT Synchronizer for conflict-free data types\n- Integrate with Quorum Manager for membership coordination\n- Synchronize with Security Manager for secure peer communication"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:23:52.376Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Distributed AI Agents needing scalable gossip-based consensus protocols for multi-agent swarms and autonomous workflows.","zh":"非常适合需要可扩展的基于流言协议的一致性协议的分布式AI代理，用于多代理群和自主工作流。","ja":"分散型AIエージェントがスケーラブルなゴシップベースのコンセンサスプロトコルを必要とするマルチエージェントスウォームやオートノマスワークフローに最適です。","ko":"분산 AI 에이전트가 확장 가능한 거짓말 기반 일관성 프로토콜을 필요로 하는 다중 에이전트 스웜 및 자율 워크플로에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Inteligencia Artificial Distribuidos que necesitan protocolos de consenso basados en rumores escalables para enjambres de agentes múltiples y flujos de trabajo autónomos.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Intelligence Artificielle Distribués ayant besoin de protocoles de consensus basés sur les rumeurs escalables pour les essaims d''agents multiples et les flux de travail autonomes.","de":"Perfekt für verteilte KI-Agents, die skalierbare Konsensprotokolle basierend auf Gerüchten für Multiagenten-Schwärme und autonome Workflows benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA Distribuídos que necessitam de protocolos de consenso baseados em fofoca escaláveis para enxames de multiagentes e fluxos de trabalho autônomos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для распределенных агентов ИИ, которым необходимы масштабируемые протоколы консенсуса на основе сплетен для многоагентных роев и автономных рабочих процессов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الموزع الذي يحتاج إلى بروتوكولات إجماع قابلة للتوسيع dựa على الإشاعة لمجموعات متعددة الوكلاء وال Fluxes العمل ذاتية الحكم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to coordinate epidemic dissemination, peer selection, and state synchronization using native Claude Code support via MCP, enabling scalable eventually consistent systems with conflict resolution and scalability optimization capabilities.","zh":"赋予代理人使用MCP上的本地Claude Code支持，协调流言传播、对等选择和状态同步，实现具有冲突解决和可扩展性优化功能的最终一致性系统。","ja":"MCP経由のネイティブClaude Codeサポートを使用して、エージェントが疫学的伝播、ピア選択、状態同期を調整できるようにし、コンフリクト解決およびスケーラビリティの最適化機能を備えた最終的に一貫したシステムを実現します。","ko":"MCP를 통해 네이티브 Claude Code 지원을 사용하여 에이전트가 역학적 전파, 피어 선택 및 상태 동기화를 조정할 수 있도록 하여 충돌 해결 및 확장성 최적화 기능을 갖춘 최종적으로 일관된 시스템을 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a coordinar la diseminación epidémica, la selección de pares y la sincronización de estado utilizando el soporte nativo de Claude Code a través de MCP, lo que permite sistemas eventualmente coherentes escalables con capacidades de resolución de conflictos y optimización de escalabilidad.","fr":"Permet aux agents de coordonner la dissémination épidémique, la sélection des pairs et la synchronisation de l''état en utilisant le support natif de Claude Code via MCP, ce qui permet des systèmes éventuellement cohérents escalables avec des capacités de résolution de conflits et d''optimisation de l''escalabilité.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die epidemische Verbreitung, die Partnerauswahl und die Zustandssynchronisation mithilfe der nativen Claude-Code-Unterstützung über MCP zu koordinieren, wodurch skalierbare, letztendlich konsistente Systeme mit Konfliktlösungs- und Skalierbarkeitsoptimierungsfunktionen ermöglicht werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a coordenar a disseminação epidêmica, seleção de pares e sincronização de estado usando o suporte nativo do Claude Code via MCP, permitindo sistemas eventualmente consistentes com capacidades de resolução de conflitos e otimização de escalabilidade.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью координировать эпидемиологическое распространение, выбор пиров и синхронизацию состояния с использованием родной поддержки Claude Code через MCP, что позволяет создавать масштабируемые системы с возможностями разрешения конфликтов и оптимизации масштабируемости.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تنسيق انتشار الوباء واختيار الأقران وتنسيق الحالة باستخدام الدعم الأصلي ل Claude Code من خلال MCP ، مما يسمح بنظام متسق في النهاية مع القدرات على حل النزاعات وتنظيم التوسع."},"useCases":{"en":["Coordinating gossip-based consensus protocols for distributed AI systems","Deploying intelligent multi-agent swarms with autonomous workflows","Building conversational AI systems with RAG integration and enterprise-grade architecture"],"zh":["协调分布式AI系统的基于流言的一致性协议","部署具有自主工作流的智能多代理群","构建具有RAG集成和企业级架构的对话式AI系统"],"ja":["分散型AIシステムのゴシップベースのコンセンサスプロトコルを調整する","オートノマスワークフローを備えたインテリジェントなマルチエージェントスウォームをデプロイする","RAG統合と企業グレードアーキテクチャを備えた会話型AIシステムを構築する"],"ko":["분산 AI 시스템의 거짓말 기반 일관성 프로토콜을 조정하는 것","자율 워크플로우가 있는 지능형 다중 에이전트 스웜을 배포하는 것","RAG 통합 및 기업급 아키텍처를 사용하는 대화형 AI 시스템을 구축하는 것"],"es":["Coordinar protocolos de consenso basados en rumores para sistemas de inteligencia artificial distribuidos","Implementar enjambres de agentes múltiples inteligentes con flujos de trabajo autónomos","Crear sistemas de inteligencia artificial conversacional con integración de RAG y arquitectura de nivel empresarial"],"fr":["Coordonner les protocoles de consensus basés sur les rumeurs pour les systèmes d''intelligence artificielle distribués","Déployer des essaims d''agents multiples intelligents avec des flux de travail autonomes","Construire des systèmes d''intelligence artificielle conversationnelle avec une intégration de RAG et une architecture de niveau entreprise"],"de":["Koordinieren von Konsensprotokollen basierend auf Gerüchten für verteilte KI-Systeme","Bereitstellen von intelligenten Multiagenten-Schwärmen mit autonomen Workflows","Erstellen von konversationalem KI-System mit RAG-Integration und Unternehmensarchitektur"],"pt":["Coordenar protocolos de consenso baseados em fofoca para sistemas de IA distribuídos","Implantar enxames de multiagentes inteligentes com fluxos de trabalho autônomos","Construir sistemas de IA conversacional com integração RAG e arquitetura de nível empresarial"],"ru":["Координировать протоколы консенсуса на основе сплетен для распределенных систем ИИ","Развертывать интеллектуальные многоагентные рои с автономными рабочими процессами","Создавать системы разговорного ИИ с интеграцией RAG и корпоративной архитектурой"],"ar":["تنسيق بروتوكولات الإجماع القائمة على الإشاعة لأنظمة الذكاء الاصطناعي الموزعة","نشر مجموعات متعددة الوكلاء الذكية مع Fluxes العمل ذاتية الحكم","بناء أنظمة الذكاء الاصطناعي للحوار مع تكامل RAG وهندسة معمارية من الدرجة الأولى"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires native Claude Code support via MCP","Designed for eventually consistent systems","May require additional configuration for conflict resolution and scalability optimization"],"zh":["需要MCP上的本地Claude Code支持","设计用于最终一致性系统","可能需要额外配置以实现冲突解决和可扩展性优化"],"ja":["MCP経由のネイティブClaude Codeサポートが必要","最終的に一貫したシステム向けに設計","コンフリクト解決およびスケーラビリティの最適化には追加の構成が必要になる場合がある"],"ko":["MCP를 통해 네이티브 Claude Code 지원이 필요","최종적으로 일관된 시스템을 위한 설계","충돌 해결 및 확장성 최적화에는 추가 구성이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere soporte nativo de Claude Code a través de MCP","Diseñado para sistemas eventualmente coherentes","Puede requerir configuración adicional para la resolución de conflictos y la optimización de escalabilidad"],"fr":["Nécessite un support natif de Claude Code via MCP","Conçu pour les systèmes éventuellement cohérents","Peut nécessiter une configuration supplémentaire pour la résolution de conflits et l''optimisation de l''escalabilité"],"de":["Benötigt native Claude-Code-Unterstützung über MCP","Entwickelt für letztendlich konsistente Systeme","Kann zusätzliche Konfiguration für Konfliktlösung und Skalierbarkeitsoptimierung erfordern"],"pt":["Exige suporte nativo do Claude Code via MCP","Projetado para sistemas eventualmente consistentes","Pode exigir configuração adicional para resolução de conflitos e otimização de escalabilidade"],"ru":["Требует родной поддержки Claude Code через MCP","Разработан для систем с evetually последовательной работой","Может потребовать дополнительной настройки для разрешения конфликтов и оптимизации масштабируемости"],"ar":["يتطلب الدعم الأصلي ل Claude Code من خلال MCP","صمّم لنظام متسق في النهاية","يمكن أن يتطلب تكوينًا إضافيًا لحل النزاعات وتنظيم التوسع"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
