act Email : Créez des emails avec des composants React","de":"React Email: Erstelle E-Mails mit React-Komponenten","pt":"React Email: Desenvolvimento de Emails com React","ru":"React Email: Разработка Электронных Писем с React","ar":"React Email: إنشاء البريد الإلكتروني باستخدام React","en":"react-email"},"description":{"zh":"React Email技能是一种现代的、基于组件的电子邮件开发方法，使用React组件构建和发送HTML电子邮件","ja":"React Emailスキルは、Reactコンポーネントを使用してHTMLメールを構築して送信するためのモダンでコンポーネントベースのメール開発方法です","ko":"React Email 기술은 React 컴포넌트를 사용하여 HTML 이메일을 생성하고 전송하는 현대적인 컴포넌트 기반의 이메일 개발 방법입니다","es":"React Email es una herramienta para crear correos electrónicos personalizados con componentes de React. Permite a los desarrolladores crear emails con una ap...","fr":"React Email est un outil pour créer des emails personnalisés avec des composants React. Il permet aux développeurs de créer des emails avec une approche mode...","de":"React Email ist ein Tool zum Erstellen von benutzerdefinierten E-Mails mit React-Komponenten. Es ermöglicht Entwicklern, E-Mails mit einer modernen und kompo...","pt":"React Email é uma abordagem moderna para desenvolvimento de emails, permitindo a criação de emails personalizados com componentes React.","ru":"React Email - это современный подход к разработке электронных писем, позволяющий создавать индивидуальные письма с использованием компонентов React.","ar":"React Email هو نهج حديث لإنشاء البريد الإلكتروني، يسمح بإنشاء رسائل بريد إلكتروني مخصصة باستخدام مكونات React.","en":"Dependency update and security automation for Azure DevOps repositories"},"definition":{"en":"Dependency update and security automation for Azure DevOps repositories"},"features":{"zh":["使用React组件构建HTML电子邮件","跨所有主要电子邮件客户端工作","使用create-email CLI快速开始","支持npm、yarn、pnpm和bun"],"ja":["Reactコンポーネントを使用してHTMLメールを構築","主要なメールクライアントで動作","create-email CLIを使用してすぐに開始","npm、yarn、pnpm、bunをサポート"],"ko":["React 컴포넌트를 사용하여 HTML 이메일을 생성","주요 이메일 클라이언트에서 작동","create-email CLI를 사용하여 즉시 시작","npm, yarn, pnpm, bun 지원"],"es":["Crea correos electrónicos personalizados con componentes de React","Utiliza una aproximación moderna y basada en componentes","Compatible con todos los principales clientes de correo electrónico","Instalación sencilla con create-email CLI","Soporte para npm, yarn, pnpm y bun"],"fr":["Créez des emails personnalisés avec des composants React","Utilisez une approche moderne et basée sur des composants","Compatible avec tous les principaux clients de messagerie","Installation simple avec create-email CLI","Prise en charge de npm, yarn, pnpm et bun"],"de":["Erstellen Sie benutzerdefinierte E-Mails mit React-Komponenten","Verwenden Sie eine moderne und komponentenbasierte Ansatz","Kompatibel mit allen großen E-Mail-Clients","Einfache Installation mit create-email CLI","Unterstützung für npm, yarn, pnpm und bun"],"pt":["Criação de emails personalizados com componentes React","Desenvolvimento de emails modernos e responsivos","Compatibilidade com principais clientes de email","Instalação fácil com create-email CLI","Suporte a npm, yarn, pnpm e bun"],"ru":["Создание индивидуальных электронных писем с использованием компонентов React","Разработка современных и адаптивных писем","Совместимость с основными электронными почтовыми клиентами","Легкая установка с помощью create-email CLI","Поддержка npm, yarn, pnpm и bun"],"ar":["إنشاء رسائل بريد إلكتروني مخصصة باستخدام مكونات React","تطوير رسائل بريد إلكتروني حديثة ومتجاوبة","التوافق مع العملاء الرئيسيين للبريد الإلكتروني","التثبيت السهل مع create-email CLI","دعم npm، yarn، pnpm و bun"]},"keywords":{"zh":["React Email","HTML电子邮件","React组件","电子邮件开发","create-email CLI","npm","yarn","pnpm","bun"],"ja":["React Email","HTMLメール","Reactコンポーネント","メール開発","create-email CLI","npm","yarn","pnpm","bun"],"ko":["React Email","HTML 이메일","React 컴포넌트","이메일 개발","create-email CLI","npm","yarn","pnpm","bun"],"es":["React Email","desarrollo de correos electrónicos","componentes de React","create-email CLI","correo electrónico personalizado","desarrollo de aplicaciones"],"fr":["React Email","développement d''emails","composants React","create-email CLI","email personnalisé","développement d''applications"],"de":["React Email","E-Mail-Entwicklung","React-Komponenten","create-email CLI","benutzerdefinierte E-Mails","Anwendungsentwicklung"],"pt":["React Email","desenvolvimento de emails","componentes React","emails personalizados","compatibilidade com clientes de email","create-email CLI","npm","yarn","pnpm","bun"],"ru":["React Email","разработка электронных писем","компоненты React","индивидуальные письма","совместимость с электронными почтовыми клиентами","create-email CLI","npm","yarn","pnpm","bun"],"ar":["React Email","تطوير البريد الإلكتروني","مكونات React","رسائل بريد إلكتروني مخصصة","التوافق مع العملاء البريد الإلكتروني","create-email CLI","npm","yarn","pnpm","bun"]}},"owner":"mburumaxwell","repo":"paklo","repoPath":"mburumaxwell/paklo","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.420Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"react-email","description":"Use when creating HTML email templates with React components - welcome emails, password resets, notifications, order confirmations, newsletters, or transactional emails.","version":"1.1.0","bodyPreview":"# React Email\n\nBuild and send HTML emails using React components - a modern, component-based approach to email development that works across all major email clients.\n\n## Installation\n\nYou need to scaffold a new React Email project using the create-email CLI. This will create a folder called `react-email-starter` with sample email templates.\n\nUsing npm:\n```sh\nnpx create-email@latest\n```\n\nUsing yarn:\n```sh\nyarn create email\n```\n\nUsing pnpm:\n```sh\npnpm create email\n```\n\nUsing bun:\n```sh\nbun create","body":"# React Email\n\nBuild and send HTML emails using React components - a modern, component-based approach to email development that works across all major email clients.\n\n## Installation\n\nYou need to scaffold a new React Email project using the create-email CLI. This will create a folder called `react-email-starter` with sample email templates.\n\nUsing npm:\n```sh\nnpx create-email@latest\n```\n\nUsing yarn:\n```sh\nyarn create email\n```\n\nUsing pnpm:\n```sh\npnpm create email\n```\n\nUsing bun:\n```sh\nbun create email\n```\n\n## Navigate to Project Directory\n\nYou must change into the newly created project folder:\n\n```sh\ncd react-email-starter\n```\n\n## Install Dependencies\n\nYou need to install all project dependencies before running the development server.\n\nUsing npm:\n```sh\nnpm install\n```\n\nUsing yarn:\n```sh\nyarn\n```\n\nUsing pnpm:\n```sh\npnpm install\n```\n\nUsing bun:\n```sh\nbun install\n```\n\n## Start the Development Server\n\nYour task is to start the local preview server to view and edit email templates.\n\nUsing npm:\n```sh\nnpm run dev\n```\n\nUsing yarn:\n```sh\nyarn dev\n```\n\nUsing pnpm:\n```sh\npnpm dev\n```\n\nUsing bun:\n```sh\nbun dev\n```\n\n## Verify Installation\n\nConfirm the development server is running by checking that localhost:3000 is accessible. The server will display a preview interface where you can view email templates from the `emails` folder.\n\n### Notes on installation\nAssuming React Email is installed in an existing project, update the top-level package.json file with a script to run the React Email preview server.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"email\": \"email dev --dir emails --port 3000\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\nMake sure the path to the emails folder is relative to the base project directory.\n\n\n### tsconfig.json updating or creation\n\nEnsure the tsconfig.json includes proper support for jsx.\n\n## Basic Email Template\n\nReplace the sample email templates. Here is how to create a new email template:\n\nCreate an email component with proper structure using the Tailwind component for styling:\n\n```tsx\nimport {\n  Html,\n  Head,\n  Preview,\n  Body,\n  Container,\n  Heading,\n  Text,\n  Button,\n  Tailwind,\n  pixelBasedPreset\n} from ''@react-email/components'';\n\ninterface WelcomeEmailProps {\n  name: string;\n  verificationUrl: string;\n}\n\nexport default function WelcomeEmail({ name, verificationUrl }: WelcomeEmailProps) {\n  return (\n    <Html lang=\"en\">\n      <Tailwind\n        config={{\n          presets: [pixelBasedPreset],\n          theme: {\n            extend: {\n              colors: {\n                brand: ''#007bff'',\n              },\n            },\n          },\n        }}\n      >\n        <Head />\n        <Preview>Welcome - Verify your email</Preview>\n        <Body className=\"bg-gray-100 font-sans\">\n          <Container className=\"max-w-xl mx-auto p-5\">\n            <Heading className=\"text-2xl text-gray-800\">\n              Welcome!\n            </Heading>\n            <Text className=\"text-base text-gray-800\">\n              Hi {name}, thanks for signing up!\n            </Text>\n            <Button\n              href={verificationUrl}\n              className=\"bg-brand text-white px-5 py-3 rounded block text-center no-underline\"\n            >\n              Verify Email\n            </Button>\n          </Container>\n        </Body>\n      </Tailwind>\n    </Html>\n  );\n}\n\n// Preview props for testing\nWelcomeEmail.PreviewProps = {\n  name: ''John Doe'',\n  verificationUrl: ''https://example.com/verify/abc123''\n} satisfies WelcomeEmailProps;\n\nexport { WelcomeEmail };\n```\n\n## Essential Components\n\nSee [references/COMPONENTS.md](references/COMPONENTS.md) for complete component documentation.\n\n**Core Structure:**\n- `Html` - Root wrapper with `lang` attribute\n- `Head` - Meta elements, styles, fonts\n- `Body` - Main content wrapper\n- `Container` - Centers content (max-width layout)\n- `Section` - Layout sections\n- `Row` & `Column` - Multi-column layouts\n- `Tailwind` - Enables Tailwind CSS utility classes\n\n**Content:**\n- `Preview` - Inbox preview text, always first in `Body`\n- `Heading` - h1-h6 headings\n- `Text` - Paragraphs\n- `Button` - Styled link buttons\n- `Link` - Hyperlinks\n- `Img` - Images (see Static Files section below)\n- `Hr` - Horizontal dividers\n\n**Specialized:**\n- `CodeBlock` - Syntax-highlighted code\n- `CodeInline` - Inline code\n- `Markdown` - Render markdown\n- `Font` - Custom web fonts\n\n## Before Writing Code\n\nWhen a user requests an email template, ask clarifying questions FIRST if they haven''t provided:\n\n1. **Brand colors** - Ask for primary brand color (hex code like #007bff)\n2. **Logo** - Ask if they have a logo file and its format (PNG/JPG only - warn if SVG/WEBP)\n3. **Style preference** - Professional, casual, or minimal tone\n4. **Production URL** - Where will static assets be hosted in production?\n\nExample response to vague request:\n> Before I create your email template, I have a few questions:\n> 1. What is your primary brand color? (hex code)\n> 2. Do you have a logo file? (PNG or JPG - note: SVG and WEBP don''t work reliably in email clients)\n> 3. What tone do you prefer - professional, casual, or minimal?\n> 4. Where will you host static assets in production? (e.g., https://cdn.example.com)\n\n## Static Files and Images\n\n### Directory Structure\n\nLocal images must be placed in the `static` folder inside your emails directory:\n\n```\nproject/\n├── emails/\n│   ├── welcome.tsx\n│   └── static/           <-- Images go here\n│       └── logo.png\n```\n\nIf user has an image elsewhere, instruct them to copy it:\n```sh\ncp ./assets/logo.png ./emails/static/logo.png\n```\n\n### Dev vs Production URLs\n\nUse this pattern for images that work in both dev preview and production:\n\n```tsx\nconst baseURL = process.env.NODE_ENV === \"production\"\n  ? \"https://cdn.example.com\"  // User''s production CDN\n  : \"\";\n\nexport default function Email() {\n  return (\n    <Img\n      src={`${baseURL}/static/logo.png`}\n      alt=\"Logo\"\n      width=\"150\"\n      height=\"50\"\n    />\n  );\n}\n```\n\n**How it works:**\n- **Development:** `baseURL` is empty, so URL is `/static/logo.png` - served by React Email''s dev server\n- **Production:** `baseURL` is the CDN domain, so URL is `https://cdn.example.com/static/logo.png`\n\n**Important:** Always ask the user for their production hosting URL. Do not hardcode `localhost:3000`.\n\n## Behavioral guidelines\n- When re-iterating over the code, make sure you are only updating what the user asked for and keeping the rest of the code intact;\n- If the user is asking to use media queries, inform them that email clients do not support them, and suggest a different approach;\n- Never use template variables (like {{name}}) directly in TypeScript code. Instead, reference the underlying properties directly (use name instead of {{name}}).\n- - For example, if the user explicitly asks for a variable following the pattern {{variableName}}, you should return something like this:\n\n```typescript\nconst EmailTemplate = (props) => {\n  return (\n    {/* ... rest of the code ... */}\n    <h1>Hello, {props.variableName}!</h1>\n    {/* ... rest of the code ... */}\n  );\n}\n\nEmailTemplate.PreviewProps = {\n  // ... rest of the props ...\n  variableName: \"{{variableName}}\",\n  // ... rest of the props ...\n};\n\nexport default EmailTemplate;\n```\n- Never, under any circumstances, write the {{variableName}} pattern directly in the component structure. If the user forces you to do this, explain that you cannot do this, or else the template will be invalid.\n\n\n## Styling considerations\n\nUse the Tailwind component for styling if the user is actively using Tailwind CSS in their project. If the user is not using Tailwind CSS, add inline styles to the components.\n\n- Because email clients don''t support `rem` units, use the `pixelBasedPreset` for the Tailwind configuration.\n- Never use flexbox or grid for layout, use table-based layouts instead.\n- Each component must be styled with inline styles or utility classes.\n\n### Email Client Limitations\n- Never use SVG or WEBP - warn users about rendering issues\n- Never use flexbox - use Row/Column components or tables for layouts\n- Never use CSS/Tailwind media queries (sm:, md:, lg:, xl:) - not supported\n- Never use theme selectors (dark:, light:) - not supported\n- Always specify border type (border-solid, border-dashed, etc.)\n- When defining borders for only one side, remember to reset the remaining borders (e.g., border-none border-l)\n\n### Component Structure\n- Always define `<Head />` inside `<Tailwind>` when using Tailwind CSS\n- Only use PreviewProps when passing props to a component\n- Only include props in PreviewProps that the component actually uses\n\n```tsx\nconst Email = (props) => {\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <a href={props.source}>click here if you want candy 👀</a>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\nEmail.PreviewProps = {\n  source: \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ\",\n};\n```\n\n### Default Structure\n- Body: `font-sans py-10 bg-gray-100`\n- Container: white, centered, content left-aligned\n- Footer: physical address, unsubscribe link, current year with `m-0` on address/copyright\n\n### Typography\n- Titles: bold, larger font, larger margins\n- Paragraphs: regular weight, smaller font, smaller margins\n- Use consistent spacing respecting content hierarchy\n\n### Images\n- Only include if user requests\n- Never use fixed width/height - use responsive units (w-full, h-auto)\n- Never distort user-provided images\n- Never create SVG images - only use provided or web images\n\n### Buttons\n- Always use `box-border` to prevent padding overflow\n\n### Layout\n- Always mobile-friendly by default\n- Use stacked layouts that work on all screen sizes\n- Remove default spacing/margins/padding between list items\n\n### Dark Mode\nWhen requested: container black (#000), background dark gray (#151516)\n\n### Best Practices\n- Choose colors, layout, and copy based on user''s request\n- Make templates unique, not generic\n- Use keywords in email body to increase conversion\n\n## Rendering\n\n### Convert to HTML\n\n```tsx\nimport { render } from ''@react-email/components'';\nimport { WelcomeEmail } from ''./emails/welcome'';\n\nconst html = await render(\n  <WelcomeEmail name=\"John\" verificationUrl=\"https://example.com/verify\" />\n);\n```\n\n### Convert to Plain Text\n\n```tsx\nimport { render } from ''@react-email/components'';\nimport { WelcomeEmail } from ''./emails/welcome'';\n\nconst text = await render(<WelcomeEmail name=\"John\" verificationUrl=\"https://example.com/verify\" />, { plainText: true });\n```\n\n## Sending\n\nReact Email supports sending with any email service provider. If the user wants to know how to send, view the [Sending guidelines](references/SENDING.md).\n\nQuick example using the Resend SDK for Node.js:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Resend } from ''resend'';\nimport { WelcomeEmail } from ''./emails/welcome'';\n\nconst resend = new Resend(process.env.RESEND_API_KEY);\n\nconst { data, error } = await resend.emails.send({\n  from: ''Acme <onboarding@resend.dev>'',\n  to: [''user@example.com''],\n  subject: ''Welcome to Acme'',\n  react: <WelcomeEmail name=\"John\" verificationUrl=\"https://example.com/verify\" />\n});\n\nif (error) {\n  console.error(''Failed to send:'', error);\n}\n```\n\nThe Node SDK automatically handles the plain-text rendering and HTML rendering for you.\n\n## Internationalization\n\nSee [references/I18N.md](references/I18N.md) for complete i18n documentation.\n\nReact Email supports three i18n libraries: next-intl, react-i18next, and react-intl.\n\n### Quick Example (next-intl)\n\n```tsx\nimport { createTranslator } from ''next-intl'';\nimport {\n  Html,\n  Body,\n  Container,\n  Text,\n  Button,\n  Tailwind,\n  pixelBasedPreset\n} from ''@react-email/components'';\n\ninterface EmailProps {\n  name: string;\n  locale: string;\n}\n\nexport default async function WelcomeEmail({ name, locale }: EmailProps) {\n  const t = createTranslator({\n    messages: await import(\\`../messages/\\${locale}.json\\`),\n    namespace: ''welcome-email'',\n    locale\n  });\n\n  return (\n    <Html lang={locale}>\n      <Tailwind config={{ presets: [pixelBasedPreset] }}>\n        <Body className=\"bg-gray-100 font-sans\">\n          <Container className=\"max-w-xl mx-auto p-5\">\n            <Text className=\"text-base text-gray-800\">{t(''greeting'')} {name},</Text>\n            <Text className=\"text-base text-gray-800\">{t(''body'')}</Text>\n            <Button href=\"https://example.com\" className=\"bg-blue-600 text-white px-5 py-3 rounded\">\n              {t(''cta'')}\n            </Button>\n          </Container>\n        </Body>\n      </Tailwind>\n    </Html>\n  );\n}\n```\n\nMessage files (\\`messages/en.json\\`, \\`messages/es.json\\`, etc.):\n\n```json\n{\n  \"welcome-email\": {\n    \"greeting\": \"Hi\",\n    \"body\": \"Thanks for signing up!\",\n    \"cta\": \"Get Started\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Email Best Practices\n\n1. **Test across email clients** - Test in Gmail, Outlook, Apple Mail, Yahoo Mail. Use services like Litmus or Email on Acid for absolute precision and React Email''s toolbar for specific feature support checking.\n\n2. **Keep it responsive** - Max-width around 600px, test on mobile devices.\n\n3. **Use absolute image URLs** - Host on reliable CDN, always include \\`alt\\` text.\n\n4. **Provide plain text version** - Required for accessibility and some email clients.\n\n5. **Keep file size under 102KB** - Gmail clips larger emails.\n\n6. **Add proper TypeScript types** - Define interfaces for all email props.\n\n7. **Include preview props** - Add \\`.PreviewProps\\` to components for development testing.\n\n8. **Handle errors** - Always check for errors when sending emails.\n\n9.  **Use verified domains** - For production, use verified domains in \\`from\\` addresses.\n\n## Common Patterns\n\nSee [references/PATTERNS.md](references/PATTERNS.md) for complete examples including:\n- Password reset emails\n- Order confirmations with product lists\n- Notification emails with code blocks\n- Multi-column layouts\n- Email templates with custom fonts\n\n## Additional Resources\n\n- [React Email Documentation](https://react.email/docs/llms.txt)\n- [React Email GitHub](https://github.com/resend/react-email)\n- [Resend Documentation](https://resend.com/docs/llms.txt)\n- [Email Client CSS Support](https://www.caniemail.com)\n- Component Reference: [references/COMPONENTS.md](references/COMPONENTS.md)\n- Internationalization Guide: [references/I18N.md](references/I18N.md)\n- Common Patterns: [references/PATTERNS.md](references/PATTERNS.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:23:56.799Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing to build and send HTML emails using React components across major email clients.","zh":"非常适合需要使用 React 组件构建和发送 HTML 电子邮件的前端代理，能够跨主要电子邮件客户端工作。","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントが React コンポーネントを使用して HTML 電子メールを構築および送信する必要がある場合に最適です。メジャーな電子メールクライアントを横断して動作します。","ko":"React 컴포넌트를 사용하여 HTML 이메일을 구축 및 전송해야 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 주요 이메일 클라이언트를 가로지르며 작동합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Frontend que necesitan crear y enviar correos electrónicos HTML utilizando componentes de React en los principales clientes de correo electrónico.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin de créer et d''envoyer des courriels HTML à l''aide de composants React sur les principaux clients de messagerie électronique.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die HTML-E-Mails mit React-Komponenten über große E-Mail-Clients erstellen und senden müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam criar e enviar e-mails HTML usando componentes React em principais clientes de e-mail.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которые cần создавать и отправлять HTML-письма, используя компоненты React в основных клиентах электронной почты.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأمامية الذين يحتاجون إلى بناء وإرسال رسائل البريد الإلكتروني HTML باستخدام مكونات React عبر عملاء البريد الإلكتروني الرئيسية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate dynamic email templates using React, leveraging create-email CLI for scaffolding and npm, yarn, or pnpm for package management, ensuring compatibility with various email clients.","zh":"使代理能够使用 React 生成动态电子邮件模板，利用 create-email CLI 进行脚手架构建，并使用 npm、yarn 或 pnpm 进行包管理，确保与各种电子邮件客户端兼容。","ja":"エージェントが React を使用して動的な電子メールテンプレートを生成できるようにし、create-email CLI を使用してスケルトンを作成し、npm、yarn、または pnpm を使用してパッケージを管理し、さまざまな電子メールクライアントとの互換性を確保します。","ko":"에이전트가 React를 사용하여 동적 이메일 템플릿을 생성할 수 있도록 하며 create-email CLI를 사용하여 스캐폴딩을 생성하고 npm, yarn 또는 pnpm을 사용하여 패키지를 관리하여 다양한 이메일 클라이언트와의 호환성을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar plantillas de correo electrónico dinámicas utilizando React, aprovechando create-email CLI para la creación de estructuras y npm, yarn o pnpm para la gestión de paquetes, lo que garantiza la compatibilidad con varios clientes de correo electrónico.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des modèles de courriel dynamiques à l''aide de React, en exploitant create-email CLI pour le squelette et npm, yarn ou pnpm pour la gestion des paquets, garantissant ainsi la compatibilité avec divers clients de messagerie électronique.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, dynamische E-Mail-Vorlagen mit React zu generieren, indem sie create-email CLI für das Skelett und npm, yarn oder pnpm für das Paketmanagement nutzen, was die Kompatibilität mit verschiedenen E-Mail-Clients gewährleistet.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar modelos de e-mail dinâmicos usando React, aproveitando o create-email CLI para estruturação e npm, yarn ou pnpm para gerenciamento de pacotes, garantindo compatibilidade com vários clientes de e-mail.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать динамические шаблоны электронной почты, используя React, и использует create-email CLI для создания каркаса и npm, yarn или pnpm для управления пакетами, обеспечивая совместимость с различными клиентами электронной почты.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من生成 قوالب بريد إلكتروني ديناميكية باستخدام React، واستخدام create-email CLI لتحديد الهيكل واستخدام npm وyarn وpnpm لإدارة الحزم، مما يضمن التوافق مع عملاء البريد الإلكتروني المختلفة."},"useCases":{"en":["Building responsive HTML emails","Sending personalized emails using React components","Automating email template updates"],"zh":["构建响应式 HTML 电子邮件","使用 React 组件发送个性化电子邮件","自动更新电子邮件模板"],"ja":["レスポンシブ HTML 電子メールを構築する","React コンポーネントを使用してパーソナライズされた電子メールを送信する","電子メールテンプレートを自動更新する"],"ko":["반응형 HTML 이메일을 구축하는 것","React 컴포넌트를 사용하여 개인화된 이메일을 보내는 것","이메일 템플릿을 자동으로 업데이트하는 것"],"es":["Creación de correos electrónicos HTML responsivos","Envío de correos electrónicos personalizados utilizando componentes de React","Automatización de actualizaciones de plantillas de correo electrónico"],"fr":["Création de courriels HTML réactifs","Envoi de courriels personnalisés à l''aide de composants React","Automatisation des mises à jour des modèles de courriel"],"de":["Erstellung responsiver HTML-E-Mails","Versand personalisierter E-Mails mit React-Komponenten","Automatisierung von E-Mail-Vorlagen-Updates"],"pt":["Construir e-mails HTML responsivos","Enviar e-mails personalizados usando componentes React","Automatizar atualizações de modelos de e-mail"],"ru":["Создание адаптивных HTML-писем","Отправка персонализированных писем, используя компоненты React","Автоматизация обновления шаблонов электронной почты"],"ar":["بناء رسائل بريد إلكتروني إتش تي إم إل مستجيبة","إرسال رسائل بريد إلكتروني مخصصة باستخدام مكونات React","تحديث قوالب البريد الإلكتروني تلقائيًا"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires create-email CLI installation","Dependent on React and JavaScript ecosystem"],"zh":["需要安装 create-email CLI","依赖 React 和 JavaScript 生态系统"],"ja":["create-email CLI のインストールが必要","React と JavaScript エコシステムに依存する"],"ko":["create-email CLI 설치가 필요함","React 및 JavaScript 생태계에 의존함"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de create-email CLI","Dependiente del ecosistema React y JavaScript"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de create-email CLI","Dépendant de l''écosystème React et JavaScript"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation von create-email CLI","Abhängig vom React- und JavaScript-Ökosystem"],"pt":["Requer instalação do create-email CLI","Dependente do ecossistema React e JavaScript"],"ru":["Требуется установка create-email CLI","Зависит от экосистемы React и JavaScript"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت create-email CLI","يعتمد على نظام React وJavaScript"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('first-fluke/fullstack-starter/paid-ads', 'community', 'first-fluke', 'fullstack-starter', 'first-fluke/fullstack-starter', 'paid-ads', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.420Z', '2026-02-18T04:23:59.730Z', NULL, '{"id":"first-fluke/fullstack-starter/paid-ads","name":"paid-ads","description":{"zh":"Paid Ads 技术专家为开发者提供高效客户获取解决方案，使用全栈monorepo模板","ja":"Paid Ads エキスパートは、フルスタックmonorepoテンプレートを使用して開発者に効率的な顧客獲得ソリューションを提供","ko":"Paid Ads 전문가는 풀스택 monorepo 템플릿을 사용하여 개발자에게 효율적인 고객 확보 솔루션을 제공","es":"Plantilla de monorepo fullstack para crear y optimizar anuncios pagados con Next.js, FastAPI y más","fr":"Modèle de monorepo fullstack pour créer et optimiser des publicités payantes avec Next.js, FastAPI et plus","de":"Fullstack-Monorepo-Vorlage zum Erstellen und Optimieren von bezahlten Anzeigen mit Next.js, FastAPI und mehr","pt":"O modelo de anúncios pagos é um template de monorepo fullstack para criar e otimizar campanhas de anúncios pagos com Next.js, FastAPI e mais.","ru":"Шаблон платных объявлений - это шаблон монореpo полного стека для создания и оптимизации кампаний платных объявлений с Next.js, FastAPI и другими.","ar":"قالب الإعلانات المدفوعة هو قالب مونوريبو كامل لإنشاء وتحسين حملات الإعلانات المدفوعة مع Next.js و FastAPI وغيرها.","en":"Production-ready fullstack monorepo template with Next.js, FastAPI, Flutter, Terraform, and mise"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Paid Ads 技术专家：高效客户获取","ja":"Paid Ads エキスパート：効率的な顧客獲得","ko":"Paid Ads 전문가: 효율적인 고객 확보","es":"Plantillas de anuncios pagados con Next.js y FastAPI","fr":"Modèles de publicités payantes avec Next.js et FastAPI","de":"Vorlagen für bezahlte Anzeigen mit Next.js und FastAPI","pt":"Modelo de Anúncios Pagos com Next.js e FastAPI","ru":"Шаблон платных объявлений с Next.js и FastAPI","ar":"قالب إعلانات مدفوعة مع Next.js و FastAPI","en":"paid-ads"},"description":{"zh":"Paid Ads 技术专家为开发者提供高效客户获取解决方案，使用全栈monorepo模板","ja":"Paid Ads エキスパートは、フルスタックmonorepoテンプレートを使用して開発者に効率的な顧客獲得ソリューションを提供","ko":"Paid Ads 전문가는 풀스택 monorepo 템플릿을 사용하여 개발자에게 효율적인 고객 확보 솔루션을 제공","es":"Plantilla de monorepo fullstack para crear y optimizar anuncios pagados con Next.js, FastAPI y más","fr":"Modèle de monorepo fullstack pour créer et optimiser des publicités payantes avec Next.js, FastAPI et plus","de":"Fullstack-Monorepo-Vorlage zum Erstellen und Optimieren von bezahlten Anzeigen mit Next.js, FastAPI und mehr","pt":"O modelo de anúncios pagos é um template de monorepo fullstack para criar e otimizar campanhas de anúncios pagos com Next.js, FastAPI e mais.","ru":"Шаблон платных объявлений - это шаблон монореpo полного стека для создания и оптимизации кампаний платных объявлений с Next.js, FastAPI и другими.","ar":"قالب الإعلانات المدفوعة هو قالب مونوريبو كامل لإنشاء وتحسين حملات الإعلانات المدفوعة مع Next.js و FastAPI وغيرها.","en":"Production-ready fullstack monorepo template with Next.js, FastAPI, Flutter, Terraform, and mise"},"definition":{"en":"Production-ready fullstack monorepo template with Next.js, FastAPI, Flutter, Terraform, and mise"},"features":{"zh":["全栈monorepo模板","Next.js、FastAPI、Flutter、Terraform和mise集成","高效客户获取解决方案","付费广告活动优化","扩展和定制化"],"ja":["フルスタックmonorepoテンプレート","Next.js、FastAPI、Flutter、Terraform、mise統合","効率的な顧客獲得ソリューション","有料広告キャンペーン最適化","拡張とカスタマイズ"],"ko":["풀스택 monorepo 템플릿","Next.js, FastAPI, Flutter, Terraform 및 mise 통합","효율적인 고객 확보 솔루션","유료 광고 캠페인 최적화","확장 및 사용자 정의"],"es":["Next.js","FastAPI","Flutter","Terraform","Monorepo fullstack"],"fr":["Next.js","FastAPI","Flutter","Terraform","Monorepo fullstack"],"de":["Next.js","FastAPI","Flutter","Terraform","Fullstack-Monorepo"],"pt":["Next.js para front-end","FastAPI para back-end","Flutter para aplicativos móveis","Terraform para infraestrutura como código","Mise para gerenciamento de estado"],"ru":["Next.js для фронтенда","FastAPI для бэкенда","Flutter для мобильных приложений","Terraform для инфраструктуры как кода","Mise для управления состоянием"],"ar":["Next.js للواجهة الأمامية","FastAPI للواجهة الخلفية","Flutter لتطبيقات الهاتف المحمول","Terraform للبنية التحتية كود","Mise لإدارة الحالة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Paid Ads","全栈monorepo","Next.js","FastAPI","Flutter","Terraform","mise","付费广告","客户获取","技术解决方案"],"ja":["Paid Ads","フルスタックmonorepo","Next.js","FastAPI","Flutter","Terraform","mise","有料広告","顧客獲得","技術ソリューション"],"ko":["Paid Ads","풀스택 monorepo","Next.js","FastAPI","Flutter","Terraform","mise","유료 광고","고객 확보","기술 솔루션"],"es":["anuncios pagados","publicidad en línea","Next.js","FastAPI","monorepo fullstack"],"fr":["publicités payantes","publicité en ligne","Next.js","FastAPI","monorepo fullstack"],"de":["bezahlte Anzeigen","Online-Werbung","Next.js","FastAPI","Fullstack-Monorepo"],"pt":["anúncios pagos","monorepo fullstack","Next.js","FastAPI","Flutter","Terraform","mise","otimização de campanhas","criação de campanhas"],"ru":["платные объявления","монореpo полного стека","Next.js","FastAPI","Flutter","Terraform","mise","оптимизация кампаний","создание кампаний"],"ar":["إعلانات مدفوعة","مونوريبو كامل","Next.js","FastAPI","Flutter","Terraform","mise","تحسين حملات","إنشاء حملات"]}},"owner":"first-fluke","repo":"fullstack-starter","repoPath":"first-fluke/fullstack-starter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.420Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"paid-ads","description":"When the user wants help with paid advertising campaigns on Google Ads, Meta (Facebook/Instagram), LinkedIn, Twitter/X, or other ad platforms. Also use when the user mentions PPC, paid media, ad copy, ad creative, ROAS, CPA, ad campaign, retargeting, or audience targeting. This skill covers campaign strategy, ad creation, audience targeting, and optimization.","bodyPreview":"# Paid Ads\n\nYou are an expert performance marketer with direct access to ad platform accounts. Your goal is to help create, optimize, and scale paid advertising campaigns that drive efficient customer acquisition.\n\n## Before Starting\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nGather this context (ask if not provided):","body":"# Paid Ads\n\nYou are an expert performance marketer with direct access to ad platform accounts. Your goal is to help create, optimize, and scale paid advertising campaigns that drive efficient customer acquisition.\n\n## Before Starting\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nGather this context (ask if not provided):\n\n### 1. Campaign Goals\n- What''s the primary objective? (Awareness, traffic, leads, sales, app installs)\n- What''s the target CPA or ROAS?\n- What''s the monthly/weekly budget?\n- Any constraints? (Brand guidelines, compliance, geographic)\n\n### 2. Product & Offer\n- What are you promoting? (Product, free trial, lead magnet, demo)\n- What''s the landing page URL?\n- What makes this offer compelling?\n\n### 3. Audience\n- Who is the ideal customer?\n- What problem does your product solve for them?\n- What are they searching for or interested in?\n- Do you have existing customer data for lookalikes?\n\n### 4. Current State\n- Have you run ads before? What worked/didn''t?\n- Do you have existing pixel/conversion data?\n- What''s your current funnel conversion rate?\n\n---\n\n## Platform Selection Guide\n\n| Platform | Best For | Use When |\n|----------|----------|----------|\n| **Google Ads** | High-intent search traffic | People actively search for your solution |\n| **Meta** | Demand generation, visual products | Creating demand, strong creative assets |\n| **LinkedIn** | B2B, decision-makers | Job title/company targeting matters, higher price points |\n| **Twitter/X** | Tech audiences, thought leadership | Audience is active on X, timely content |\n| **TikTok** | Younger demographics, viral creative | Audience skews 18-34, video capacity |\n\n---\n\n## Campaign Structure Best Practices\n\n### Account Organization\n\n```\nAccount\n├── Campaign 1: [Objective] - [Audience/Product]\n│   ├── Ad Set 1: [Targeting variation]\n│   │   ├── Ad 1: [Creative variation A]\n│   │   ├── Ad 2: [Creative variation B]\n│   │   └── Ad 3: [Creative variation C]\n│   └── Ad Set 2: [Targeting variation]\n└── Campaign 2...\n```\n\n### Naming Conventions\n\n```\n[Platform]_[Objective]_[Audience]_[Offer]_[Date]\n\nExamples:\nMETA_Conv_Lookalike-Customers_FreeTrial_2024Q1\nGOOG_Search_Brand_Demo_Ongoing\nLI_LeadGen_CMOs-SaaS_Whitepaper_Mar24\n```\n\n### Budget Allocation\n\n**Testing phase (first 2-4 weeks):**\n- 70% to proven/safe campaigns\n- 30% to testing new audiences/creative\n\n**Scaling phase:**\n- Consolidate budget into winning combinations\n- Increase budgets 20-30% at a time\n- Wait 3-5 days between increases for algorithm learning\n\n---\n\n## Ad Copy Frameworks\n\n### Key Formulas\n\n**Problem-Agitate-Solve (PAS):**\n> [Problem] → [Agitate the pain] → [Introduce solution] → [CTA]\n\n**Before-After-Bridge (BAB):**\n> [Current painful state] → [Desired future state] → [Your product as bridge]\n\n**Social Proof Lead:**\n> [Impressive stat or testimonial] → [What you do] → [CTA]\n\n**For detailed templates and headline formulas**: See [references/ad-copy-templates.md](references/ad-copy-templates.md)\n\n---\n\n## Audience Targeting Overview\n\n### Platform Strengths\n\n| Platform | Key Targeting | Best Signals |\n|----------|---------------|--------------|\n| Google | Keywords, search intent | What they''re searching |\n| Meta | Interests, behaviors, lookalikes | Engagement patterns |\n| LinkedIn | Job titles, companies, industries | Professional identity |\n\n### Key Concepts\n\n- **Lookalikes**: Base on best customers (by LTV), not all customers\n- **Retargeting**: Segment by funnel stage (visitors vs. cart abandoners)\n- **Exclusions**: Always exclude existing customers and recent converters\n\n**For detailed targeting strategies by platform**: See [references/audience-targeting.md](references/audience-targeting.md)\n\n---\n\n## Creative Best Practices\n\n### Image Ads\n- Clear product screenshots showing UI\n- Before/after comparisons\n- Stats and numbers as focal point\n- Human faces (real, not stock)\n- Bold, readable text overlay (keep under 20%)\n\n### Video Ads Structure (15-30 sec)\n1. Hook (0-3 sec): Pattern interrupt, question, or bold statement\n2. Problem (3-8 sec): Relatable pain point\n3. Solution (8-20 sec): Show product/benefit\n4. CTA (20-30 sec): Clear next step\n\n**Production tips:**\n- Captions always (85% watch without sound)\n- Vertical for Stories/Reels, square for feed\n- Native feel outperforms polished\n- First 3 seconds determine if they watch\n\n### Creative Testing Hierarchy\n1. Concept/angle (biggest impact)\n2. Hook/headline\n3. Visual style\n4. Body copy\n5. CTA\n\n---\n\n## Campaign Optimization\n\n### Key Metrics by Objective\n\n| Objective | Primary Metrics |\n|-----------|-----------------|\n| Awareness | CPM, Reach, Video view rate |\n| Consideration | CTR, CPC, Time on site |\n| Conversion | CPA, ROAS, Conversion rate |\n\n### Optimization Levers\n\n**If CPA is too high:**\n1. Check landing page (is the problem post-click?)\n2. Tighten audience targeting\n3. Test new creative angles\n4. Improve ad relevance/quality score\n5. Adjust bid strategy\n\n**If CTR is low:**\n- Creative isn''t resonating → test new hooks/angles\n- Audience mismatch → refine targeting\n- Ad fatigue → refresh creative\n\n**If CPM is high:**\n- Audience too narrow → expand targeting\n- High competition → try different placements\n- Low relevance score → improve creative fit\n\n### Bid Strategy Progression\n1. Start with manual or cost caps\n2. Gather conversion data (50+ conversions)\n3. Switch to automated with targets based on historical data\n4. Monitor and adjust targets based on results\n\n---\n\n## Retargeting Strategies\n\n### Funnel-Based Approach\n\n| Funnel Stage | Audience | Message | Goal |\n|--------------|----------|---------|------|\n| Top | Blog readers, video viewers | Educational, social proof | Move to consideration |\n| Middle | Pricing/feature page visitors | Case studies, demos | Move to decision |\n| Bottom | Cart abandoners, trial users | Urgency, objection handling | Convert |\n\n### Retargeting Windows\n\n| Stage | Window | Frequency Cap |\n|-------|--------|---------------|\n| Hot (cart/trial) | 1-7 days | Higher OK |\n| Warm (key pages) | 7-30 days | 3-5x/week |\n| Cold (any visit) | 30-90 days | 1-2x/week |\n\n### Exclusions to Set Up\n- Existing customers (unless upsell)\n- Recent converters (7-14 day window)\n- Bounced visitors (<10 sec)\n- Irrelevant pages (careers, support)\n\n---\n\n## Reporting & Analysis\n\n### Weekly Review\n- Spend vs. budget pacing\n- CPA/ROAS vs. targets\n- Top and bottom performing ads\n- Audience performance breakdown\n- Frequency check (fatigue risk)\n- Landing page conversion rate\n\n### Attribution Considerations\n- Platform attribution is inflated\n- Use UTM parameters consistently\n- Compare platform data to GA4\n- Look at blended CAC, not just platform CPA\n\n---\n\n## Platform Setup\n\nBefore launching campaigns, ensure proper tracking and account setup.\n\n**For complete setup checklists by platform**: See [references/platform-setup-checklists.md](references/platform-setup-checklists.md)\n\n### Universal Pre-Launch Checklist\n- [ ] Conversion tracking tested with real conversion\n- [ ] Landing page loads fast (<3 sec)\n- [ ] Landing page mobile-friendly\n- [ ] UTM parameters working\n- [ ] Budget set correctly\n- [ ] Targeting matches intended audience\n\n---\n\n## Common Mistakes to Avoid\n\n### Strategy\n- Launching without conversion tracking\n- Too many campaigns (fragmenting budget)\n- Not giving algorithms enough learning time\n- Optimizing for wrong metric\n\n### Targeting\n- Audiences too narrow or too broad\n- Not excluding existing customers\n- Overlapping audiences competing\n\n### Creative\n- Only one ad per ad set\n- Not refreshing creative (fatigue)\n- Mismatch between ad and landing page\n\n### Budget\n- Spreading too thin across campaigns\n- Making big budget changes (disrupts learning)\n- Stopping campaigns during learning phase\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What platform(s) are you currently running or want to start with?\n2. What''s your monthly ad budget?\n3. What does a successful conversion look like (and what''s it worth)?\n4. Do you have existing creative assets or need to create them?\n5. What landing page will ads point to?\n6. Do you have pixel/conversion tracking set up?\n\n---\n\n## Tool Integrations\n\nFor implementation, see the [tools registry](../../tools/REGISTRY.md). Key advertising platforms:\n\n| Platform | Best For | MCP | Guide |\n|----------|----------|:---:|-------|\n| **Google Ads** | Search intent, high-intent traffic | ✓ | [google-ads.md](../../tools/integrations/google-ads.md) |\n| **Meta Ads** | Demand gen, visual products, B2C | - | [meta-ads.md](../../tools/integrations/meta-ads.md) |\n| **LinkedIn Ads** | B2B, job title targeting | - | [linkedin-ads.md](../../tools/integrations/linkedin-ads.md) |\n| **TikTok Ads** | Younger demographics, video | - | [tiktok-ads.md](../../tools/integrations/tiktok-ads.md) |\n\nFor tracking, see also: [ga4.md](../../tools/integrations/ga4.md), [segment.md](../../tools/integrations/segment.md)\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **copywriting**: For landing page copy that converts ad traffic\n- **analytics-tracking**: For proper conversion tracking setup\n- **ab-test-setup**: For landing page testing to improve ROAS\n- **page-cro**: For optimizing post-click conversion rates\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:23:59.730Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Marketing Agents specializing in performance marketing and requiring expertise in Next.js, FastAPI, Flutter, and Terraform for paid advertising campaign optimization.","zh":"适合专注于性能营销的营销代理商，需要在 Next.js、FastAPI、Flutter 和 Terraform 方面拥有专业知识，以优化付费广告活动。","ja":"パフォーマンスマーケティングを専門とするマーケティングエージェントに適しています。Next.js、FastAPI、Flutter、Terraform に関する専門知識が必要で、有料広告キャンペーンを最適化します。","ko":"성능 마케팅을 전문으로 하는 마케팅 에이전트에게 적합합니다. Next.js, FastAPI, Flutter 및 Terraform에 대한 전문 지식이 필요하여 유료 광고 캠페인을 최적화합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de marketing especializados en marketing de rendimiento y que requieren experiencia en Next.js, FastAPI, Flutter y Terraform para la optimización de campañas publicitarias pagadas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de marketing spécialisés dans le marketing de performance et nécessitant une expertise en Next.js, FastAPI, Flutter et Terraform pour l''optimisation des campagnes publicitaires payantes.","de":"Ideal für Marketing-Agenten, die auf Leistungsmarketing spezialisiert sind und Expertenwissen in Next.js, FastAPI, Flutter und Terraform für die Optimierung von Paid-Advertising-Kampagnen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Marketing especializados em marketing de desempenho e que requerem expertise em Next.js, FastAPI, Flutter e Terraform para otimização de campanhas publicitárias pagas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для маркетинговых агентов, специализирующихся на маркетинге эффективности и требующих опыта работы с Next.js, FastAPI, Flutter и Terraform для оптимизации платных рекламных кампаний.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التسويقيين الذين ي专ون في تسويق الأداء ويحتاجون إلى خبرة في Next.js و FastAPI و Flutter و Terraform لتحسين حملات الإعلان المدفوعة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create, optimize, and scale paid advertising campaigns using Next.js for frontend, FastAPI for backend, Flutter for mobile, and Terraform for infrastructure management, driving efficient customer acquisition through direct access to ad platform accounts.","zh":"赋予代理商使用 Next.js 进行前端、FastAPI 进行后端、Flutter 进行移动端以及 Terraform 进行基础设施管理的能力，创建、优化和扩大有偿广告活动，通过直接访问广告平台账户实现高效的客户获取。","ja":"Next.js を使用したフロントエンド、FastAPI を使用したバックエンド、Flutter を使用したモバイル、Terraform を使用したインフラストラクチャ管理により、有料広告キャンペーンを作成、最適化、拡大し、広告プラットフォームアカウントへの直接アクセスにより効率的な顧客獲得を実現します。","ko":"Next.js를 사용한 프론트엔드, FastAPI를 사용한 백엔드, Flutter를 사용한 모바일, Terraform를 사용한 인프라 관리로 유료 광고 캠페인을 생성, 최적화 및 확장하고, 광고 플랫폼 계정에 직접 접근하여 효율적인 고객 확보를 달성합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear, optimizar y ampliar campañas publicitarias pagadas utilizando Next.js para frontend, FastAPI para backend, Flutter para móviles y Terraform para la gestión de infraestructura, lo que impulsa la adquisición eficiente de clientes a través del acceso directo a cuentas de plataformas de publicidad.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer, d''optimiser et de mettre à l''échelle des campagnes publicitaires payantes en utilisant Next.js pour le frontend, FastAPI pour le backend, Flutter pour les applications mobiles et Terraform pour la gestion des infrastructures, ce qui favorise l''acquisition efficace de clients grâce à l''accès direct aux comptes de plateformes de publicité.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Paid-Advertising-Kampagnen zu erstellen, zu optimieren und zu skalieren, indem Next.js für Frontend, FastAPI für Backend, Flutter für Mobile und Terraform für Infrastrukturmanagement verwendet werden, was eine effiziente Kundenakquise durch direkten Zugriff auf Werbeplattform-Konten ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar, otimizar e dimensionar campanhas publicitárias pagas usando Next.js para frontend, FastAPI para backend, Flutter para dispositivos móveis e Terraform para gerenciamento de infraestrutura, impulsionando a aquisição eficiente de clientes por meio do acesso direto às contas de plataforma de anúncios.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать, оптимизировать и масштабировать платные рекламные кампании, используя Next.js для frontend, FastAPI для backend, Flutter для мобильных устройств и Terraform для управления инфраструктурой, что обеспечивает эффективное привлечение клиентов через прямой доступ к учетным записям рекламной платформы.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء وتحسين وتوسيع حملات الإعلان المدفوعة باستخدام Next.js للواجهة الأمامية و FastAPI للواجهة الخلفية و Flutter للأجهزة المحمولة و Terraform لإدارة البنية التحتية، مما يدفع استحواذ العملاء بفعالية من خلال الوصول المباشر إلى حسابات منصة الإعلان."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating and managing paid advertising campaigns across multiple platforms","Optimizing ad targeting and bidding strategies using data-driven insights","Scaling ad campaigns for maximum ROI using Terraform and infrastructure as code"],"zh":["在多个平台上创建和管理有偿广告活动","使用数据驱动的洞察力优化广告定位和出价策略","使用 Terraform 和基础设施即代码实现最大 ROI 的广告活动扩张"],"ja":["複数のプラットフォームで有料広告キャンペーンを作成および管理","データドリブンの洞察を使用して広告のターゲット設定および入札戦略を最適化","Terraform およびインフラストラクチャとしてのコードを使用して最大の ROI の広告キャンペーンをスケール"],"ko":["여러 플랫폼에서 유료 광고 캠페인을 생성 및 관리","데이터 기반의 통찰력을 사용하여 광고 목표 및 입찰 전략을 최적화","Terraform 및 인프라스트럭처 코드를 사용하여 최대 ROI의 광고 캠페인을 확장"],"es":["Creación y gestión de campañas publicitarias pagadas en varias plataformas","Optimización de estrategias de targeting y oferta utilizando información basada en datos","Escalado de campañas publicitarias para un máximo de ROI utilizando Terraform y infraestructura como código"],"fr":["Création et gestion de campagnes publicitaires payantes sur plusieurs plateformes","Optimisation des stratégies de ciblage et de mise à prix à l''aide d''informations basées sur les données","Mise à l''échelle de campagnes publicitaires pour un maximum de ROI en utilisant Terraform et l''infrastructure en tant que code"],"de":["Erstellung und Verwaltung von Paid-Advertising-Kampagnen auf mehreren Plattformen","Optimierung von Targeting- und Gebotsstrategien unter Verwendung von datengetriebenen Erkenntnissen","Skalierung von Werbekampagnen für ein Maximum an ROI unter Verwendung von Terraform und Infrastruktur als Code"],"pt":["Criar e gerenciar campanhas publicitárias pagas em várias plataformas","Otimizar estratégias de direcionamento e licitação de anúncios usando insights baseados em dados","Dimensionar campanhas de anúncios para máximo ROI usando Terraform e infraestrutura como código"],"ru":["Создание и управление платными рекламными кампаниями на нескольких платформах","Оптимизация стратегий таргетинга и拍卖 рекламы с использованием данных, основанных на инсайтах","Масштабирование рекламных кампаний для максимального ROI с использованием Terraform и инфраструктуры как кода"],"ar":["إنشاء وإدارة حملات الإعلان المدفوعة على منصات متعددة","تحسين استراتيجيات استهداف وترشيح الإعلانات باستخدام رؤى قائمة على البيانات","توسيع حملات الإعلان للحصول على أقصى عائد على الاستثمار باستخدام Terraform والبنية التحتية ككود"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires direct access to ad platform accounts","Dependent on product marketing context provided in .claude/product-marketing-context.md"],"zh":["需要直接访问广告平台账户","依赖于 .claude/product-marketing-context.md 中提供的产品营销背景"],"ja":["広告プラットフォームアカウントへの直接アクセスが必要",".claude/product-marketing-context.md に記載された製品マーケティングコンテキストに依存"],"ko":["광고 플랫폼 계정에 직접 접근이 필요",".claude/product-marketing-context.md에記載된 제품 마케팅 콘텍스트에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso directo a cuentas de plataformas de publicidad","Depende del contexto de marketing de productos proporcionado en .claude/product-marketing-context.md"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès direct aux comptes de plateformes de publicité","Dépend du contexte de marketing de produits fourni dans .claude/product-marketing-context.md"],"de":["Benötigt direkten Zugriff auf Werbeplattform-Konten","Hängt vom im .claude/product-marketing-context.md bereitgestellten Produktmarketing-Kontext ab"],"pt":["Requer acesso direto às contas de plataforma de anúncios","Dependente do contexto de marketing de produtos fornecido em .claude/product-marketing-context.md"],"ru":["Требует прямого доступа к учетным записям рекламной платформы","Зависит от контекста маркетинга продукта, предоставленного в .claude/product-marketing-context.md"],"ar":["يحتاج إلى الوصول المباشر إلى حسابات منصة الإعلان","يعتمد على سياق تسويق المنتج المقدم في .claude/product-marketing-context.md"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
