a aplicaciones de página única","Herramientas clave para un flujo de trabajo de desarrollo sin problemas","Aplicación de demostración que muestra buenas prácticas y herramientas utilizadas","Commits fáciles de revisar y seguros de enviar","Soporte para Commits Convencionales","Reglas personalizables para commits"],"fr":["Configuration de base de développement pour les applications à page unique","Outils clés pour un flux de travail de développement sans problème","Application de démonstration qui montre de bonnes pratiques et des outils utilisés","Commits faciles à revoir et sûrs à envoyer","Prise en charge des Commits Convencionales","Règles personnalisables pour les commits"],"de":["Grundlegende Entwicklungskonfiguration für Single-Page-Anwendungen","Schlüsseltools für einen reibungslosen Entwicklungsworkflow","Demo-Anwendung, die gute Praktiken und verwendete Tools zeigt","Commits, die leicht zu überprüfen und sicher zu senden sind","Unterstützung für Conventional Commits","Anpassbare Regeln für Commits"],"pt":["Configuração de desenvolvimento básica para SPA","Ferramentas e configurações para experiência de desenvolvedor sem problemas","Commits fáceis de revisar e seguros","Demonstração de boas práticas e uso de ferramentas","Suporte a Commits Convencionais"],"ru":["Базовая настройка разработки для SPA","Инструменты и настройки для бесперебойного опыта разработчика","Безопасные и легко просматриваемые коммиты","Демонстрация хороших практик и использования инструментов","Поддержка Конвенциональных Коммитов"],"ar":["إعداد تطوير أساسي لتطبيقات صفحة واحدة","أدوات وإعدادات لتجربة مطور خالية من المشاكل","التزامات آمنة وسهلة الاستعراض","عرض على أفضل الممارسات واستخدام الأدوات","دعم التزامات التقليدية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Commit Work","单页应用开发","开发环境设置","代码提交质量","开发团队协作","无缝开发体验"],"ja":["コミットワーク","シングルページアプリケーション開発","開発環境設定","コードの提交品質","開発チームの協力","無駄のない開発体験"],"ko":["commit-work","단일 페이지 애플리케이션 개발","개발 환경 설정","코드 제출 품질","개발 팀 협력","無駄없는 개발 경험"],"es":["commit work","desarrollo de aplicaciones de página única","configuración de desarrollo","commits seguros","commits fáciles de revisar","conventional commits","flujo de trabajo de desarrollo","herramientas de desarrollo","devops"],"fr":["commit work","développement d''applications à page unique","configuration de développement","commits sûrs","commits faciles à revoir","conventional commits","flux de travail de développement","outils de développement","devops"],"de":["commit work","entwicklung von single-page-anwendungen","entwicklungskonfiguration","sichere commits","commits, die leicht zu überprüfen sind","conventional commits","entwicklungsworkflow","entwicklungstools","devops"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de spa","commits seguros","experiência de desenvolvedor","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","commits convencionais","boas práticas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["разработка spa","безопасные коммиты","опыт разработчика","инструменты разработки","конвенциональные коммиты","хорошие практики разработки"],"ar":["تطوير تطبيقات صفحة واحدة","التزامات آمنة","تجربة المطور","أدوات التطوير","التزامات التقليدية","أفضل الممارسات للتطوير"]}},"owner":"bartstc","repo":"vite-ts-react-template","repoPath":"bartstc/vite-ts-react-template","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.420Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"commit-work","description":"Create high-quality git commits: review/stage intended changes, split into logical commits, and write clear commit messages (including Conventional Commits). Use when the user asks to commit, craft a commit message, stage changes, or split work into multiple commits.","bodyPreview":"# Commit work\n\n## Goal\n\nMake commits that are easy to review and safe to ship:\n\n- only intended changes are included\n- commits are logically scoped (split when needed)\n- commit messages describe what changed and why\n\n## Inputs to ask for (if missing)\n\n- Single commit or multiple commits? (If unsure: default to multiple small commits when there are unrelated changes.)\n- Commit style: Conventional Commits are required.\n- Any rules: max subject length, required scopes.\n\n## Workflow (checklist)\n\n1.","body":"# Commit work\n\n## Goal\n\nMake commits that are easy to review and safe to ship:\n\n- only intended changes are included\n- commits are logically scoped (split when needed)\n- commit messages describe what changed and why\n\n## Inputs to ask for (if missing)\n\n- Single commit or multiple commits? (If unsure: default to multiple small commits when there are unrelated changes.)\n- Commit style: Conventional Commits are required.\n- Any rules: max subject length, required scopes.\n\n## Workflow (checklist)\n\n1. Inspect the working tree before staging\n   - `git status`\n   - `git diff` (unstaged)\n   - If many changes: `git diff --stat`\n2. Decide commit boundaries (split if needed)\n   - Split by: feature vs refactor, backend vs frontend, formatting vs logic, tests vs prod code, dependency bumps vs behavior changes.\n   - If changes are mixed in one file, plan to use patch staging.\n3. Stage only what belongs in the next commit\n   - Prefer patch staging for mixed changes: `git add -p`\n   - To unstage a hunk/file: `git restore --staged -p` or `git restore --staged <path>`\n4. Review what will actually be committed\n   - `git diff --cached`\n   - Sanity checks:\n     - no secrets or tokens\n     - no accidental debug logging\n     - no unrelated formatting churn\n5. Describe the staged change in 1-2 sentences (before writing the message)\n   - \"What changed?\" + \"Why?\"\n   - If you cannot describe it cleanly, the commit is probably too big or mixed; go back to step 2.\n6. Write the commit message\n   - Use Conventional Commits (required):\n     - `type(scope): short summary`\n     - blank line\n     - body (what/why, not implementation diary)\n     - footer (BREAKING CHANGE) if needed\n   - Prefer an editor for multi-line messages: `git commit -v`\n   - Use `references/commit-message-template.md` if helpful.\n7. Run the smallest relevant verification\n   - Run the repo''s fastest meaningful check (unit tests, lint, or build) before moving on.\n8. Repeat for the next commit until the working tree is clean\n\n## Deliverable\n\nProvide:\n\n- the final commit message(s)\n- a short summary per commit (what/why)\n- the commands used to stage/review (at minimum: `git diff --cached`, plus any tests run)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:24:05.837Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Management Agents needing structured commit messages and safe shipping practices.","zh":"非常适合需要结构化提交消息和安全交付实践的代码管理代理。","ja":"構造化されたコミットメッセージと安全な出荷手法を必要とするコード管理エージェントに最適です。","ko":"구조화된 커밋 메시지와 안전한 출하 관행이 필요한 코드 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de gestión de código que necesitan mensajes de confirmación estructurados y prácticas de envío seguras.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion de code nécessitant des messages de validation structurés et des pratiques d''expédition sécurisées.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Management-Agents, die strukturierte Commit-Mitteilungen und sichere Versandpraktiken benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Código que necessitam de mensagens de commit estruturadas e práticas de envio seguras.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по управлению кодом, требующих структурированных сообщений о фиксации и безопасных практик доставки.","ar":"مثالي لعميل إدارة الشيفرة الذي يحتاج إلى رسائل إيداع منظمة وممارسات شحن آمنة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create logically scoped commits with descriptive messages using Conventional Commits, ensuring only intended changes are included and commits are easy to review.","zh":"赋予代理创建逻辑作用域的提交和使用约定式提交的描述性消息，确保只包含预期的更改，并且提交易于审查。","ja":"エージェントが論理的にスコープされたコミットとConventional Commitsを使用した説明的なメッセージを作成できるようにし、意図した変更のみを含め、コミットを簡単にレビューできるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 논리적으로 범위가 지정된 커밋과 표준 커밋을 사용하여 설명적인 메시지를 생성할 수 있도록 하여, 의도된 변경만 포함하고 커밋을 쉽게 검토할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear confirmaciones lógicamente estructuradas con mensajes descriptivos utilizando Commits Convencionales, asegurando que solo se incluyan los cambios pretendidos y que las confirmaciones sean fáciles de revisar.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des validations logiquement structurées avec des messages descriptifs en utilisant les Commits Conventionnels, en veillant à ce que seuls les changements intentionnels soient inclus et que les validations soient faciles à examiner.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, logisch umfasste Commits mit beschreibenden Nachrichten unter Verwendung von Conventional Commits zu erstellen, sicherstellend, dass nur beabsichtigte Änderungen enthalten sind und Commits leicht zu überprüfen sind.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar commits com escopo lógico e mensagens descritivas usando Conventional Commits, garantindo que apenas as alterações pretendidas sejam incluídas e os commits sejam fáceis de revisar.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать логически определенные фиксации с описательными сообщениями, используя Conventional Commits, гарантируя, что включены только предназначенные изменения и фиксации легко просматриваются.","ar":"يُمكن العميل من إنشاء التزامات مدروسة منطقياً مع رسائل وصفية باستخدام الالتزامات التقليدية، مما يضمن أن تتضمن فقط التغييرات المزمعة وأن تكون الالتزامات سهلة الاستعراض."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating commit validation","Generating commit messages with clear descriptions","Splitting large changes into smaller, reviewable commits"],"zh":["自动提交验证","生成清晰描述的提交消息","将大型更改分解为较小、可审查的提交"],"ja":["コミットの検証を自動化する","明確な説明を持つコミットメッセージを生成する","大きな変更を小さくてレビュー可能なコミットに分割する"],"ko":["자동 커밋 검증","명확한 설명이 있는 커밋 메시지 생성","대형 변경을 더 작은 검토 가능한 커밋으로 분할"],"es":["Automatización de la validación de confirmaciones","Generación de mensajes de confirmación con descripciones claras","División de grandes cambios en confirmaciones más pequeñas y revisables"],"fr":["Automatisation de la validation des validations","Génération de messages de validation avec des descriptions claires","Division de grands changements en validations plus petites et examinables"],"de":["Automatisierung der Commit-Validierung","Erstellung von Commit-Mitteilungen mit klaren Beschreibungen","Aufteilung großer Änderungen in kleinere, überprüfbare Commits"],"pt":["Automatizar a validação de commit","Gerar mensagens de commit com descrições claras","Dividir alterações grandes em commits menores e passíveis de revisão"],"ru":["Автоматизация проверки фиксации","Генерация сообщений о фиксации с четкими описаниями","Разделение крупных изменений на более мелкие, пригодные для просмотра фиксации"],"ar":["تأطير التحقق من Commit","генерация رسائل الإيداع مع وصف واضح","تقسيم التغييرات الكبيرة إلى عمليات إيداع أصغر قابلة للاستعراض"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to Conventional Commits style","May require additional configuration for custom commit rules"],"zh":["需要遵守约定式提交样式","可能需要额外的配置以满足自定义提交规则"],"ja":["Conventional Commitsスタイルに従う必要がある","カスタムコミットルールに対応するために追加の構成が必要になる場合がある"],"ko":["표준 커밋 스타일에 따라야 함","사용자 정의 커밋 규칙에 대한 추가 구성이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere adherencia al estilo de Commits Convencionales","Puede requerir configuración adicional para reglas de confirmación personalizadas"],"fr":["Nécessite l''adhésion au style de Commits Conventionnels","Peut nécessiter une configuration supplémentaire pour des règles de validation personnalisées"],"de":["Erfordert Einhaltung des Conventional Commits-Stils","Kann zusätzliche Konfiguration für benutzerdefinierte Commit-Regeln erfordern"],"pt":["Exige aderência ao estilo de Conventional Commits","Pode exigir configuração adicional para regras de commit personalizadas"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения стиля Conventional Commits","Может потребовать дополнительной настройки для пользовательских правил фиксации"],"ar":["يتطلب الالتزام بنمط الالتزامات التقليدية","يمكن أن يتطلب تكوينا إضافيا لقواعد الإيداع المخصصة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
