ntes plataformas de hospedagem","Configuração de ambiente de variáveis","Definição de esquema e teste","Provisão de banco de dados","Modos de implantação: UI e Code"],"ru":["Развертывание на различных платформах хостинга","Настройка окружения переменных","Определение схемы и тестирование","Проставление базы данных","Режимы развертывания: UI и Code"],"ar":["تثبيت على منصات استضافة مختلفة","تكوين بيئة متغيرات","تحديد مخطط واختبار","توفير قاعدة بيانات","أنماط التثبيت: واجهة المستخدم والكود"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Bknd 部署","Bknd 托管","Cloudflare","Vercel","环境变量","部署日志","代码模式","UI 模式"],"ja":["Bknd デプロイ","Bknd ホスティング","Cloudflare","Vercel","環境変数","デプロイ ログ","コード モード","UI モード"],"ko":["Bknd 배포","Bknd 호스팅","Cloudflare","Vercel","환경 변수","배포 로그","코드 모드","UI 모드"],"es":["despliegue de aplicaciones","hosting de aplicaciones","Bknd","desarrollo de software","plataformas de hosting","variables de entorno","registros de despliegue"],"fr":["déploiement d''applications","hébergement d''applications","Bknd","développement de logiciels","plateformes d''hébergement","variables d''environnement","journaux de déploiement"],"de":["Bereitstellung von Anwendungen","Hosting von Anwendungen","Bknd","Software-Entwicklung","Hosting-Plattformen","Umgebungsvariablen","Bereitstellungsprotokolle"],"pt":["bknd","hospedagem","implantação","desenvolvimento web","padrões web","tecnologias sem build","flexibilidade","escalabilidade"],"ru":["bknd","хостинг","развертывание","веб-разработка","веб-стандарты","технологии без сборки","гибкость","масштабируемость"],"ar":["bknd","استضافة","تثبيت","تطوير ويب","معايير الويب","تكنولوجيا بدون بناء","مرونة","تسريع"]}},"owner":"cameronapak","repo":"freedom-stack-v3","repoPath":"cameronapak/freedom-stack-v3","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.420Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"bknd-deploy-hosting","description":"Use when deploying a Bknd application to production hosting. Covers Cloudflare Workers/Pages, Node.js/Bun servers, Docker, Vercel, AWS Lambda, and other platforms.","bodyPreview":"# Deploy to Hosting\n\nDeploy your Bknd application to various hosting platforms.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Working Bknd application locally\n- Schema defined and tested\n- Database provisioned (see `bknd-database-provision`)\n- Environment variables prepared (see `bknd-env-config`)\n\n## When to Use UI Mode\n\n- Cloudflare/Vercel dashboards for environment variables\n- Platform-specific deployment settings\n- Viewing deployment logs\n\n## When to Use Code Mode\n\n- All deployment configuration and commands\n- Adapt","body":"# Deploy to Hosting\n\nDeploy your Bknd application to various hosting platforms.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Working Bknd application locally\n- Schema defined and tested\n- Database provisioned (see `bknd-database-provision`)\n- Environment variables prepared (see `bknd-env-config`)\n\n## When to Use UI Mode\n\n- Cloudflare/Vercel dashboards for environment variables\n- Platform-specific deployment settings\n- Viewing deployment logs\n\n## When to Use Code Mode\n\n- All deployment configuration and commands\n- Adapter setup for target platform\n- CI/CD pipeline configuration\n\n## Platform Selection Guide\n\n| Platform | Best For | Database Options | Cold Start |\n|----------|----------|------------------|------------|\n| **Cloudflare Workers** | Edge, global low-latency | D1, Turso | ~0ms |\n| **Cloudflare Pages** | Static + API | D1, Turso | ~0ms |\n| **Vercel** | Next.js apps | Turso, Neon | ~200ms |\n| **Node.js/Bun VPS** | Full control, dedicated | Any | N/A |\n| **Docker** | Containerized, portable | Any | N/A |\n| **AWS Lambda** | Serverless, pay-per-use | Turso, RDS | ~500ms |\n\n## Code Approach\n\n### Cloudflare Workers\n\n**Step 1: Install Wrangler**\n\n```bash\nnpm install -D wrangler\n```\n\n**Step 2: Create `wrangler.toml`**\n\n```toml\nname = \"my-bknd-app\"\nmain = \"src/index.ts\"\ncompatibility_date = \"2024-01-01\"\n\n[[d1_databases]]\nbinding = \"DB\"\ndatabase_name = \"my-database\"\ndatabase_id = \"your-d1-database-id\"\n\n# Optional: R2 for media storage\n[[r2_buckets]]\nbinding = \"R2_BUCKET\"\nbucket_name = \"my-bucket\"\n\n[vars]\nENVIRONMENT = \"production\"\n```\n\n**Step 3: Configure Adapter**\n\n```typescript\n// src/index.ts\nimport { hybrid, type CloudflareBkndConfig } from \"bknd/adapter/cloudflare\";\nimport { d1Sqlite } from \"bknd/adapter/cloudflare\";\nimport { em, entity, text } from \"bknd\";\n\nconst schema = em({\n  posts: entity(\"posts\", {\n    title: text().required(),\n  }),\n});\n\nexport default hybrid<CloudflareBkndConfig>({\n  app: (env) => ({\n    connection: d1Sqlite({ binding: env.DB }),\n    schema,\n    isProduction: true,\n    auth: {\n      jwt: {\n        secret: env.JWT_SECRET,\n      },\n    },\n    config: {\n      media: {\n        enabled: true,\n        adapter: {\n          type: \"r2\",\n          config: { bucket: env.R2_BUCKET },\n        },\n      },\n    },\n  }),\n});\n```\n\n**Step 4: Create D1 Database**\n\n```bash\n# Create database\nwrangler d1 create my-database\n\n# Copy the database_id to wrangler.toml\n```\n\n**Step 5: Set Secrets**\n\n```bash\nwrangler secret put JWT_SECRET\n# Enter your secret (min 32 chars)\n```\n\n**Step 6: Deploy**\n\n```bash\nwrangler deploy\n```\n\n---\n\n### Cloudflare Pages (with Functions)\n\n**Step 1: Create `functions/api/[[bknd]].ts`**\n\n```typescript\nimport { hybrid, type CloudflareBkndConfig } from \"bknd/adapter/cloudflare\";\nimport { d1Sqlite } from \"bknd/adapter/cloudflare\";\nimport schema from \"../../bknd.config\";\n\nexport const onRequest = hybrid<CloudflareBkndConfig>({\n  app: (env) => ({\n    connection: d1Sqlite({ binding: env.DB }),\n    schema,\n    isProduction: true,\n    auth: {\n      jwt: { secret: env.JWT_SECRET },\n    },\n  }),\n});\n```\n\n**Step 2: Configure Pages**\n\nIn Cloudflare dashboard:\n1. Connect your git repository\n2. Set build command (if any)\n3. Add D1 binding under Settings > Functions > D1 Database Bindings\n4. Add environment variables under Settings > Environment Variables\n\n---\n\n### Node.js / Bun (VPS)\n\n**Step 1: Create Production Entry**\n\n```typescript\n// index.ts\nimport { serve, type BunBkndConfig } from \"bknd/adapter/bun\";\n// or for Node.js:\n// import { serve } from \"bknd/adapter/node\";\n\nconst config: BunBkndConfig = {\n  connection: {\n    url: process.env.DB_URL!,\n    authToken: process.env.DB_TOKEN,\n  },\n  isProduction: true,\n  auth: {\n    jwt: {\n      secret: process.env.JWT_SECRET!,\n      expires: \"7d\",\n    },\n  },\n  config: {\n    media: {\n      enabled: true,\n      adapter: {\n        type: \"s3\",\n        config: {\n          bucket: process.env.S3_BUCKET!,\n          region: process.env.S3_REGION!,\n          accessKeyId: process.env.S3_ACCESS_KEY!,\n          secretAccessKey: process.env.S3_SECRET_KEY!,\n        },\n      },\n    },\n    guard: {\n      enabled: true,\n    },\n  },\n};\n\nserve(config);\n```\n\n**Step 2: Set Environment Variables**\n\n```bash\nexport DB_URL=\"libsql://your-db.turso.io\"\nexport DB_TOKEN=\"your-turso-token\"\nexport JWT_SECRET=\"your-32-char-minimum-secret\"\nexport PORT=3000\n```\n\n**Step 3: Run with Process Manager**\n\n```bash\n# Using PM2\nnpm install -g pm2\npm2 start \"bun run index.ts\" --name bknd-app\n\n# Or systemd (create /etc/systemd/system/bknd.service)\n```\n\n---\n\n### Docker\n\n**Step 1: Create `Dockerfile`**\n\n```dockerfile\nFROM oven/bun:1.0-alpine\n\nWORKDIR /app\n\nCOPY package.json bun.lockb ./\nRUN bun install --frozen-lockfile --production\n\nCOPY . .\n\n# Create data directory for SQLite (if using file-based)\nRUN mkdir -p /app/data\n\nENV PORT=3000\n\nEXPOSE 3000\n\nCMD [\"bun\", \"run\", \"index.ts\"]\n```\n\n**Step 2: Create `docker-compose.yml`**\n\n```yaml\nversion: \"3.8\"\nservices:\n  bknd:\n    build: .\n    ports:\n      - \"3000:3000\"\n    volumes:\n      - bknd-data:/app/data\n    environment:\n      - DB_URL=file:/app/data/bknd.db\n      - JWT_SECRET=${JWT_SECRET}\n      - NODE_ENV=production\n    restart: unless-stopped\n\nvolumes:\n  bknd-data:\n```\n\n**Step 3: Deploy**\n\n```bash\n# Build and run\ndocker compose up -d\n\n# View logs\ndocker compose logs -f bknd\n```\n\n---\n\n### Vercel (Next.js)\n\n**Step 1: Create API Route**\n\n```typescript\n// app/api/bknd/[[...bknd]]/route.ts\nexport { GET, POST, PUT, DELETE, PATCH } from \"bknd/adapter/nextjs\";\n```\n\n**Step 2: Create `bknd.config.ts`**\n\n```typescript\nimport type { NextjsBkndConfig } from \"bknd/adapter/nextjs\";\nimport { em, entity, text } from \"bknd\";\n\nconst schema = em({\n  posts: entity(\"posts\", {\n    title: text().required(),\n  }),\n});\n\ntype Database = (typeof schema)[\"DB\"];\ndeclare module \"bknd\" {\n  interface DB extends Database {}\n}\n\nexport default {\n  app: (env) => ({\n    connection: {\n      url: env.DB_URL,\n      authToken: env.DB_TOKEN,\n    },\n    schema,\n    isProduction: env.NODE_ENV === \"production\",\n    auth: {\n      jwt: { secret: env.JWT_SECRET },\n    },\n  }),\n} satisfies NextjsBkndConfig;\n```\n\n**Step 3: Set Vercel Environment Variables**\n\nIn Vercel dashboard or CLI:\n\n```bash\nvercel env add DB_URL\nvercel env add DB_TOKEN\nvercel env add JWT_SECRET\n```\n\n**Step 4: Deploy**\n\n```bash\nvercel deploy --prod\n```\n\n---\n\n### AWS Lambda\n\n**Step 1: Install Dependencies**\n\n```bash\nnpm install -D serverless serverless-esbuild\n```\n\n**Step 2: Create `handler.ts`**\n\n```typescript\nimport { createHandler } from \"bknd/adapter/aws\";\n\nexport const handler = createHandler({\n  connection: {\n    url: process.env.DB_URL!,\n    authToken: process.env.DB_TOKEN,\n  },\n  isProduction: true,\n  auth: {\n    jwt: { secret: process.env.JWT_SECRET! },\n  },\n});\n```\n\n**Step 3: Create `serverless.yml`**\n\n```yaml\nservice: bknd-api\n\nprovider:\n  name: aws\n  runtime: nodejs20.x\n  region: us-east-1\n  environment:\n    DB_URL: ${env:DB_URL}\n    DB_TOKEN: ${env:DB_TOKEN}\n    JWT_SECRET: ${env:JWT_SECRET}\n\nplugins:\n  - serverless-esbuild\n\nfunctions:\n  api:\n    handler: handler.handler\n    events:\n      - http:\n          path: /{proxy+}\n          method: ANY\n      - http:\n          path: /\n          method: ANY\n```\n\n**Step 4: Deploy**\n\n```bash\nserverless deploy --stage prod\n```\n\n---\n\n## Pre-Deployment Checklist\n\n```bash\n# 1. Generate types\nnpx bknd types\n\n# 2. Test locally with production-like config\nDB_URL=\"your-prod-db\" JWT_SECRET=\"your-secret\" npx bknd run\n\n# 3. Verify schema sync\n# Schema auto-syncs on first request in production\n```\n\n## Environment Variables (All Platforms)\n\n| Variable | Required | Description |\n|----------|----------|-------------|\n| `DB_URL` | Yes | Database connection URL |\n| `DB_TOKEN` | Depends | Auth token (Turso/LibSQL) |\n| `JWT_SECRET` | Yes | Min 32 chars for security |\n| `PORT` | No | Server port (default: 3000) |\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n### \"Module not found\" for Native SQLite\n\n**Problem:** `better-sqlite3` not available in serverless\n\n**Fix:** Use LibSQL/Turso instead of file-based SQLite:\n```typescript\nconnection: {\n  url: \"libsql://your-db.turso.io\",\n  authToken: process.env.DB_TOKEN,\n}\n```\n\n### \"JWT_SECRET required\" Error\n\n**Problem:** Auth fails in production\n\n**Fix:** Set JWT_SECRET environment variable:\n```bash\n# Cloudflare\nwrangler secret put JWT_SECRET\n\n# Vercel\nvercel env add JWT_SECRET\n\n# Docker\ndocker run -e JWT_SECRET=\"your-secret\" ...\n```\n\n### Cold Start Timeouts (Lambda)\n\n**Problem:** First request times out\n\n**Fix:**\n- Use lighter database (Turso over RDS)\n- Reduce bundle size\n- Enable provisioned concurrency for critical functions\n\n### D1 Binding Not Found\n\n**Problem:** `env.DB is undefined`\n\n**Fix:** Check wrangler.toml D1 binding:\n```toml\n[[d1_databases]]\nbinding = \"DB\"  # Must match env.DB in code\ndatabase_name = \"my-database\"\ndatabase_id = \"actual-id-from-wrangler-d1-create\"\n```\n\n### Media Uploads Fail in Serverless\n\n**Problem:** Local storage doesn''t work in serverless\n\n**Fix:** Use cloud storage adapter:\n```typescript\nconfig: {\n  media: {\n    adapter: {\n      type: \"s3\",  // or \"r2\", \"cloudinary\"\n      config: { /* credentials */ },\n    },\n  },\n}\n```\n\n### CORS Errors\n\n**Problem:** Frontend can''t access API\n\n**Fix:** Configure CORS in your adapter:\n```typescript\n// Most adapters handle this automatically\n// For custom needs, check platform docs\n```\n\n## Deployment Commands Reference\n\n```bash\n# Cloudflare Workers\nwrangler deploy\nwrangler tail  # View logs\n\n# Vercel\nvercel deploy --prod\nvercel logs\n\n# Docker\ndocker compose up -d\ndocker compose logs -f\n\n# AWS Lambda\nserverless deploy --stage prod\nserverless logs -f api\n```\n\n## DOs and DON''Ts\n\n**DO:**\n- Set `isProduction: true` in production config\n- Use cloud storage (S3/R2/Cloudinary) for media\n- Set strong JWT_SECRET (min 32 chars)\n- Enable Guard for authorization\n- Test with production database before deploying\n- Use environment variables for all secrets\n\n**DON''T:**\n- Use file-based SQLite in serverless\n- Hardcode secrets in code\n- Deploy without testing schema sync\n- Use local storage adapter in production\n- Skip JWT_SECRET configuration\n- Commit `.env` files with real secrets\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **bknd-database-provision** - Set up production database\n- **bknd-production-config** - Production security settings\n- **bknd-storage-config** - Configure media storage\n- **bknd-env-config** - Environment variable setup\n- **bknd-local-setup** - Local development (pre-deploy testing)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:24:48.466Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Agents needing flexible and standardized deployment options across various hosting platforms.","zh":"非常适合需要在各种托管平台上具有灵活和标准化的部署选项的云代理。","ja":"様々なホスティングプラットフォームで柔軟で標準化されたデプロイオプションを必要とするクラウドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"다양한 호스팅 플랫폼에서 유연하고 표준화된 배포 옵션을 필요로 하는 클라우드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Nube que necesitan opciones de implementación flexibles y estandarizadas en varias plataformas de alojamiento.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Cloud nécessitant des options de déploiement flexibles et standardisées sur diverses plateformes d''hébergement.","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Agents, die flexible und standardisierte Bereitstellungsoptionen auf verschiedenen Hosting-Plattformen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Nuvem que precisam de opções de implantação flexíveis e padronizadas em várias plataformas de hospedagem.","ru":"Идеально подходит для облачных агентов, которым необходимы гибкие и стандартизированные варианты развертывания на различных платформах хостинга.","ar":"مثالي لعميل السحابة الذي يحتاج إلى خيارات نشر مرنة وموحدة عبر منصات استضافة مختلفة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to deploy Bknd applications anywhere using Web Standards, with features like environment variable management through Cloudflare/Vercel dashboards and platform-specific deployment settings, all while utilizing code mode for configuration and commands.","zh":"赋予代理部署到任何地方的能力，使用Web标准，通过Cloudflare/Vercel仪表板进行环境变量管理和特定于平台的部署设置，同时利用代码模式进行配置和命令。","ja":"Web標準を使用して、クラウドフラレ/バーセルダッシュボードを介した環境変数の管理やプラットフォーム固有のデプロイ設定など、各種の機能を提供し、コードモードを使用して構成やコマンドを実行できるようにエージェントを強化します。","ko":"웹 표준을 사용하여 에이전트가 어디에서든 배포할 수 있도록 하고, Cloudflare/Vercel 대시보드를 통해 환경 변수 관리 및 플랫폼별 배포 설정과 같은 다양한 기능을 제공하고, 코드 모드를 사용하여 설정 및 명령을 구성할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes implementar aplicaciones Bknd en cualquier lugar utilizando Estándares Web, con características como la gestión de variables de entorno a través de paneles de Cloudflare/Vercel y configuraciones de implementación específicas de la plataforma, todo mientras se utiliza el modo de código para la configuración y los comandos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de déployer des applications Bknd n''importe où en utilisant des Normes Web, avec des fonctionnalités comme la gestion des variables d''environnement via les tableaux de bord Cloudflare/Vercel et les paramètres de déploiement spécifiques à la plateforme, le tout en utilisant le mode code pour la configuration et les commandes.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Bknd-Anwendungen überall mit Web-Standards zu bereitstellen, mit Funktionen wie Umgebungsvariablen-Verwaltung über Cloudflare/Vercel-Dashboards und plattformspezifische Bereitstellungseinstellungen, alles unter Verwendung des Code-Modus für Konfiguration und Befehle.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implantar aplicações Bknd em qualquer lugar usando Padrões da Web, com recursos como gerenciamento de variáveis de ambiente por meio dos painéis Cloudflare/Vercel e configurações de implantação específicas da plataforma, tudo isso utilizando o modo de código para configuração e comandos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью развертывать приложения Bknd где угодно с помощью Веб-стандартов, с функциями, такими как управление переменными среды через панели управления Cloudflare/Vercel и настройки развертывания, специфичные для платформы, все это при использовании режима кода для конфигурации и команд.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على نشر تطبيقات Bknd في أي مكان باستخدام معايير الويب، مع ميزات مثل إدارة متغيرات البيئة من خلال لوحات تحكم Cloudflare/Vercel وإعدادات النشر الخاصة بالمنصة، كل ذلك باستخدام وضع الكود للتكوين والأوامر."},"useCases":{"en":["Deploying Bknd applications to Cloudflare or Vercel","Configuring environment variables for hosted applications","Viewing and debugging deployment logs"],"zh":["将Bknd应用程序部署到Cloudflare或Vercel","为托管应用程序配置环境变量","查看和调试部署日志"],"ja":["BkndアプリケーションをCloudflareまたはVercelにデプロイする","ホストされたアプリケーションの環境変数を構成する","デプロイログを表示してデバッグする"],"ko":["Bknd 애플리케이션을 Cloudflare 또는 Vercel에 배포하는 것","호스팅된 애플리케이션에 대한 환경 변수 구성","배포 로그 보기 및 디버깅"],"es":["Implementar aplicaciones Bknd en Cloudflare o Vercel","Configurar variables de entorno para aplicaciones alojadas","Ver y depurar registros de implementación"],"fr":["Déployer des applications Bknd sur Cloudflare ou Vercel","Configurer des variables d''environnement pour des applications hébergées","Afficher et déboguer les journaux de déploiement"],"de":["Bknd-Anwendungen auf Cloudflare oder Vercel bereitstellen","Umgebungsvariablen für gehostete Anwendungen konfigurieren","Bereitstellungsprotokolle anzeigen und debuggen"],"pt":["Implantar aplicações Bknd no Cloudflare ou Vercel","Configurar variáveis de ambiente para aplicações hospedadas","Visualizar e depurar logs de implantação"],"ru":["Развертывание приложений Bknd на Cloudflare или Vercel","Настройка переменных среды для хостинговых приложений","Просмотр и отладка журналов развертывания"],"ar":["نشر تطبيقات Bknd على Cloudflare أو Vercel","تكوين متغيرات البيئة للتطبيقات المضيفة","عرض ومعالجة سجلات النشر"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires a working Bknd application locally","Needs a defined and tested schema","Database provisioning is necessary (see bknd-database-provision)","Environment variables must be prepared (see bknd-env-config)"],"zh":["需要在本地运行的Bknd应用程序","需要定义和测试的模式","数据库预配是必要的（请参阅bknd-database-provision）","环境变量必须准备好（请参阅bknd-env-config）"],"ja":["ローカルで動作するBkndアプリケーションが必要","定義およびテスト済みのスキーマが必要","データベースのプロビジョニングは必要です（bknd-database-provisionを参照）","環境変数を準備する必要があります（bknd-env-configを参照）"],"ko":["로컬에서 작동하는 Bknd 애플리케이션이 필요함","정의되고 테스트된 스키마가 필요함","데이터베이스 프로비저닝이 필요합니다(Bknd-데이터베이스-프로비저닝 참조)","환경 변수를 준비해야 합니다(Bknd-env-config 참조)"],"es":["Requiere una aplicación Bknd funcionando localmente","Necesita un esquema definido y probado","Es necesaria la provisión de bases de datos (ver bknd-database-provision)","Las variables de entorno deben estar preparadas (ver bknd-env-config)"],"fr":["Nécessite une application Bknd fonctionnelle en local","Nécessite un schéma défini et testé","La provision de bases de données est nécessaire (voir bknd-database-provision)","Les variables d''environnement doivent être préparées (voir bknd-env-config)"],"de":["Benötigt eine funktionierende Bknd-Anwendung lokal","Benötigt ein definiertes und getestetes Schema","Datenbankbereitstellung ist notwendig (siehe bknd-database-provision)","Umgebungsvariablen müssen vorbereitet werden (siehe bknd-env-config)"],"pt":["Exige uma aplicação Bknd funcional localmente","Necessita de um esquema definido e testado","É necessária a provisionamento de banco de dados (ver bknd-database-provision)","As variáveis de ambiente devem ser preparadas (ver bknd-env-config)"],"ru":["Требуется работающее локально приложение Bknd","Необходимо определенный и протестированный схема","Необходимо обеспечение базы данных (см. bknd-database-provision)","Переменные среды должны быть подготовлены (см. bknd-env-config)"],"ar":["يتطلب تطبيق Bknd عاملاً محليًا","يحتاج إلى مخطط محدد ومتجرب","يجب توفير تخزين قاعدة البيانات (انظر bknd-database-provision)","يجب إعداد متغيرات البيئة (انظر bknd-env-config)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('jihe520/mindpocket/ai-elements', 'community', 'jihe520', 'mindpocket', 'jihe520/mindpocket', 'ai-elements', 0, 0, 75, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.420Z', '2026-02-18T04:24:50.028Z', NULL, '{"id":"jihe520/mindpocket/ai-elements","name":"ai-elements","description":{"zh":"AI Elements是一个开源的个人收藏夹系统，提供预建组件和自定义注册表，帮助开发者快速构建AI原生应用","ja":"AI Elementsはオープンソースのパーソナルブックマークシステムであり、事前構築されたコンポーネントとカスタムレジストリを提供して、開発者がAIネイティブアプリケーションを迅速に構築できるようにします","ko":"AI Elements는 오픈소스 개인 북마크 시스템으로, 사전 구축된 구성 요소와 사용자 지정 레지스트리를 제공하여 개발자가 AI 네이티브 애플리케이션을 빠르게 구축할 수 있습니다","es":"AI Elements es una biblioteca de componentes y registro personalizado para desarrollar aplicaciones de IA de manera rápida y sencilla","fr":"AI Elements est une bibliothèque de composants et un registre personnalisé pour développer des applications IA rapidement et facilement","de":"AI Elements ist eine Komponentenbibliothek und ein benutzerdefinierter Register für die schnelle und einfache Entwicklung von KI-Anwendungen","pt":"AI Elements é uma biblioteca de componentes e registro personalizado construída em cima do shadcn/ui para ajudar a desenvolver aplicativos de IA mais rápido.","ru":"AI Элементы — это библиотека компонентов и пользовательский реестр, построенный на основе shadcn/ui, чтобы помочь разработать приложения ИИ быстрее.","ar":"عناصر الذكاء الاصطناعي هي مكتبة مكونات وسجل مخصص مبني على شادسن/يوي لمساعدة في إنشاء تطبيقات الذكاء الاصطناعي بشكل أسرع.","en":"Open-source, free, multi-platform, one-click deploy, AI Agent–integrated personal bookmarking system｜完全开源、免费、多端、一键部署、AI Agent 集成的个人收藏夹系统"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI Elements：开源个人收藏夹系统","ja":"AI Elements：オープンソースのパーソナルブックマークシステム","ko":"AI Elements: 오픈소스 개인 북마크 시스템","es":"AI Elements: Biblioteca de componentes para aplicaciones ...","fr":"AI Elements: Bibliothèque de composants pour applications IA","de":"AI Eleme