nalizado","Instalación sencilla","Integración con shadcn/ui","Desarrollo de aplicaciones de IA rápido"],"fr":["Composants préconstruits","Registre personnalisé","Installation facile","Intégration avec shadcn/ui","Développement d''applications IA rapide"],"de":["Vordefinierte Komponenten","Benutzerdefinierter Register","Einfache Installation","Integration mit shadcn/ui","Schnelle Entwicklung von KI-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Biblioteca de componentes pré-construídos","Registro personalizado","Integração com shadcn/ui","Instalação rápida e fácil","Desenvolvimento de aplicativos de IA mais rápido"],"ru":["Библиотека предварительно построенных компонентов","Пользовательский реестр","Интеграция с shadcn/ui","Быстрая и легкая установка","Разработка приложений ИИ быстрее"],"ar":["مكتبة مكونات مبنية مسبقا","سجل مخصص","التكامل مع شادسن/يوي","تثبيت سريع وسهل","إنشاء تطبيقات الذكاء الاصطناعي بشكل أسرع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI Elements","开源个人收藏夹系统","AI原生应用","预建组件","自定义注册表","一键部署"],"ja":["AI Elements","オープンソースパーソナルブックマークシステム","AIネイティブアプリケーション","事前構築されたコンポーネント","カスタムレジストリ","ワンクリックデプロイ"],"ko":["AI Elements","오픈소스 개인 북마크 시스템","AI 네이티브 애플리케이션","사전 구축된 구성 요소","사용자 지정 레지스트리","원클릭 배포"],"es":["desarrollo de aplicaciones de IA","biblioteca de componentes","registro personalizado","shadcn/ui","aplicaciones de IA","desarrollo rápido"],"fr":["développement d''applications IA","bibliothèque de composants","registre personnalisé","shadcn/ui","applications IA","développement rapide"],"de":["Entwicklung von KI-Anwendungen","Komponentenbibliothek","benutzerdefinierter Register","shadcn/ui","KI-Anwendungen","schnelle Entwicklung"],"pt":["AI Elements","biblioteca de componentes","desenvolvimento de aplicativos de IA","shadcn/ui","registro personalizado","instalação rápida","aplicativos de IA","desenvolvimento de software","tecnologia de IA"],"ru":["AI Элементы","библиотека компонентов","разработка приложений ИИ","shadcn/ui","пользовательский реестр","быстрая установка","приложения ИИ","разработка программного обеспечения","технология ИИ"],"ar":["عناصر الذكاء الاصطناعي","مكتبة مكونات","إنشاء تطبيقات الذكاء الاصطناعي","شادسن/يوي","سجل مخصص","تثبيت سريع","تطبيقات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير البرمجيات","تقنية الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"jihe520","repo":"mindpocket","repoPath":"jihe520/mindpocket","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.420Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ai-elements","description":"Create new AI chat interface components for the ai-elements library following established composable patterns, shadcn/ui integration, and Vercel AI SDK conventions. Use when creating new components in packages/elements/src or when the user asks to add a new component to ai-elements.","bodyPreview":"# AI Elements\n\n[AI Elements](https://www.npmjs.com/package/ai-elements) is a component library and custom registry built on top of [shadcn/ui](https://ui.shadcn.com/) to help you build AI-native applications faster. It provides pre-built components like conversations, messages and more.\n\nInstalling AI Elements is straightforward and can be done in a couple of ways. You can use the dedicated CLI command for the fastest setup, or integrate via the standard shadcn/ui CLI if you''ve already adopted s","body":"# AI Elements\n\n[AI Elements](https://www.npmjs.com/package/ai-elements) is a component library and custom registry built on top of [shadcn/ui](https://ui.shadcn.com/) to help you build AI-native applications faster. It provides pre-built components like conversations, messages and more.\n\nInstalling AI Elements is straightforward and can be done in a couple of ways. You can use the dedicated CLI command for the fastest setup, or integrate via the standard shadcn/ui CLI if you''ve already adopted shadcn''s workflow.\n\n\n\n## Quick Start\n\nHere are some basic examples of what you can achieve using components from AI Elements.\n\n\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore installing AI Elements, make sure your environment meets the following requirements:\n\n- [Node.js](https://nodejs.org/en/download/), version 18 or later\n- A [Next.js](https://nextjs.org/) project with the [AI SDK](https://ai-sdk.dev/) installed.\n- [shadcn/ui](https://ui.shadcn.com/) installed in your project. If you don''t have it installed, running any install command will automatically install it for you.\n- We also highly recommend using the [AI Gateway](https://vercel.com/docs/ai-gateway) and adding `AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY` to your `env.local` so you don''t have to use an API key from every provider. AI Gateway also gives $5 in usage per month so you can experiment with models. You can obtain an API key [here](https://vercel.com/d?to=%2F%5Bteam%5D%2F%7E%2Fai%2Fapi-keys&title=Get%20your%20AI%20Gateway%20key).\n\n\n\n## Installing Components\n\nYou can install AI Elements components using either the AI Elements CLI or the shadcn/ui CLI. Both achieve the same result: adding the selected component’s code and any needed dependencies to your project.\n\nThe CLI will download the component’s code and integrate it into your project’s directory (usually under your components folder). By default, AI Elements components are added to the `@/components/ai-elements/` directory (or whatever folder you’ve configured in your shadcn components settings).\n\nAfter running the command, you should see a confirmation in your terminal that the files were added. You can then proceed to use the component in your code.\n\n## Usage\n\nOnce an AI Elements component is installed, you can import it and use it in your application like any other React component. The components are added as part of your codebase (not hidden in a library), so the usage feels very natural.\n\n## Example\n\nAfter installing AI Elements components, you can use them in your application like any other React component. For example:\n\n```tsx title=\"conversation.tsx\"\n\"use client\";\n\nimport {\n  Message,\n  MessageContent,\n  MessageResponse,\n} from \"@/components/ai-elements/message\";\nimport { useChat } from \"@ai-sdk/react\";\n\nconst Example = () => {\n  const { messages } = useChat();\n\n  return (\n    <>\n      {messages.map(({ role, parts }, index) => (\n        <Message from={role} key={index}>\n          <MessageContent>\n            {parts.map((part, i) => {\n              switch (part.type) {\n                case \"text\":\n                  return (\n                    <MessageResponse key={`${role}-${i}`}>\n                      {part.text}\n                    </MessageResponse>\n                  );\n              }\n            })}\n          </MessageContent>\n        </Message>\n      ))}\n    </>\n  );\n};\n\nexport default Example;\n```\n\nIn the example above, we import the `Message` component from our AI Elements directory and include it in our JSX. Then, we compose the component with the `MessageContent` and `MessageResponse` subcomponents. You can style or configure the component just as you would if you wrote it yourself – since the code lives in your project, you can even open the component file to see how it works or make custom modifications.\n\n## Extensibility\n\nAll AI Elements components take as many primitive attributes as possible. For example, the `Message` component extends `HTMLAttributes<HTMLDivElement>`, so you can pass any props that a `div` supports. This makes it easy to extend the component with your own styles or functionality.\n\n## Customization\n\n\n\nAfter installation, no additional setup is needed. The component’s styles (Tailwind CSS classes) and scripts are already integrated. You can start interacting with the component in your app immediately.\n\nFor example, if you''d like to remove the rounding on `Message`, you can go to `components/ai-elements/message.tsx` and remove `rounded-lg` as follows:\n\n```tsx title=\"components/ai-elements/message.tsx\" highlight=\"8\"\nexport const MessageContent = ({\n  children,\n  className,\n  ...props\n}: MessageContentProps) => (\n  <div\n    className={cn(\n      \"flex flex-col gap-2 text-sm text-foreground\",\n      \"group-[.is-user]:bg-primary group-[.is-user]:text-primary-foreground group-[.is-user]:px-4 group-[.is-user]:py-3\",\n      className\n    )}\n    {...props}\n  >\n    <div className=\"is-user:dark\">{children}</div>\n  </div>\n);\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n## Why are my components not styled?\n\nMake sure your project is configured correctly for shadcn/ui in Tailwind 4 - this means having a `globals.css` file that imports Tailwind and includes the shadcn/ui base styles.\n\n## I ran the AI Elements CLI but nothing was added to my project\n\nDouble-check that:\n\n- Your current working directory is the root of your project (where `package.json` lives).\n- Your components.json file (if using shadcn-style config) is set up correctly.\n- You’re using the latest version of the AI Elements CLI:\n\n```bash title=\"Terminal\"\nnpx ai-elements@latest\n```\n\nIf all else fails, feel free to open an [issue on GitHub](https://github.com/vercel/ai-elements/issues).\n\n## Theme switching doesn’t work — my app stays in light mode\n\nEnsure your app is using the same data-theme system that shadcn/ui and AI Elements expect. The default implementation toggles a data-theme attribute on the `<html>` element. Make sure your tailwind.config.js is using class or data- selectors accordingly:\n\n## The component imports fail with “module not found”\n\nCheck the file exists. If it does, make sure your `tsconfig.json` has a proper paths alias for `@/` i.e.\n\n```json title=\"tsconfig.json\"\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"baseUrl\": \".\",\n    \"paths\": {\n      \"@/*\": [\"./*\"]\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## My AI coding assistant can''t access AI Elements components\n\n1. Verify your config file syntax is valid JSON.\n2. Check that the file path is correct for your AI tool.\n3. Restart your coding assistant after making changes.\n4. Ensure you have a stable internet connection.\n\n## Still stuck?\n\nIf none of these answers help, open an [issue on GitHub](https://github.com/vercel/ai-elements/issues) and someone will be happy to assist.\n\n## Available Components\n\nSee the `references/` folder for detailed documentation on each component.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:24:50.028Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing rapid development of AI-native applications with pre-built UI components.","zh":"适用于需要快速开发AI原生应用程序并具有预建UI组件的AI代理。","ja":"AIエージェントがAIネイティブアプリケーションを迅速に開発し、事前構築されたUIコンポーネントを使用するのに最適です。","ko":"사전 구축된 UI 구성 요소를 사용하여 AI 네이티브 애플리케이션을 빠르게 개발해야 하는 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA que necesitan un desarrollo rápido de aplicaciones nativas de IA con componentes de UI preconstruidos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin d''un développement rapide d''applications natives IA avec des composants UI préconstruits.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die eine schnelle Entwicklung von KI-nativen Anwendungen mit vorgefertigten Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de desenvolvimento rápido de aplicativos nativos de IA com componentes de UI pré-construídos.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым требуется быстрая разработка приложений, родных для ИИ, с предварительно построенными компонентами UI.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى تطوير سريع لتطبيقات ذكاء اصطناعي اصطناعي مع مكونات واجهة المستخدم المسبقة البناء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build faster with pre-built components like conversations and messages, leveraging the shadcn/ui library and custom registry, and supporting one-click deployment across multiple platforms.","zh":"赋予代理构建更快速的能力，使用对话和消息等预建组件，利用shadcn/ui库和自定义注册表，并支持跨多个平台的一键部署。","ja":"会話やメッセージなどの事前構築されたコンポーネントを使用して、エージェントがより迅速に構築できるようにし、shadcn/uiライブラリとカスタムレジストリを利用し、複数のプラットフォームでの1クリックデプロイをサポートします。","ko":"대화와 메시지 같은 사전 구축된 구성 요소를 사용하여 에이전트가 더 빠르게 구축할 수 있도록 하며, shadcn/ui 라이브러리와 사용자 정의 레지스트리를 활용하며, 여러 플랫폼에서 한 번의 클릭으로 배포하는 것을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a construir más rápido con componentes preconstruidos como conversaciones y mensajes, aprovechando la biblioteca shadcn/ui y el registro personalizado, y admitiendo la implementación de un solo clic en varias plataformas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de construire plus rapidement avec des composants préconstruits tels que des conversations et des messages, en exploitant la bibliothèque shadcn/ui et le registre personnalisé, et en prenant en charge le déploiement d''un seul clic sur plusieurs plateformes.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, schneller mit vorgefertigten Komponenten wie Konversationen und Nachrichten zu bauen, indem sie die shadcn/ui-Bibliothek und das benutzerdefinierte Register nutzen und die Ein-Klick-Implementierung auf mehreren Plattformen unterstützen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir mais rapidamente com componentes pré-construídos, como conversas e mensagens, aproveitando a biblioteca shadcn/ui e o registro personalizado, e suporta implantação em um clique em várias plataformas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью строить быстрее с помощью предварительно построенных компонентов, таких как разговоры и сообщения, используя библиотеку shadcn/ui и пользовательский реестр, и поддерживает однократное развертывание на нескольких платформах.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على بناء أسرع باستخدام المكونات المسبقة البناء ، مثل المحادثات والرسائل ، واستخدام مكتبة shadcn/ui وسجل مخصص ، ودعم النشر بلمسة واحدة عبر منصات متعددة."},"useCases":{"en":["Building AI-native applications with pre-built UI components","Deploying personal bookmarking systems integrated with AI Agents","Creating custom conversations and message interfaces"],"zh":["使用预建UI组件构建AI原生应用程序","部署与AI代理集成的个人书签系统","创建自定义对话和消息接口"],"ja":["事前構築されたUIコンポーネントを使用してAIネイティブアプリケーションを構築する","AIエージェントと統合されたパーソナルブックマークシステムをデプロイする","カスタム会話とメッセージインターフェイスを作成する"],"ko":["사전 구축된 UI 구성 요소를 사용하여 AI 네이티브 애플리케이션을 구축하는 것","AI 에이전트와 통합된 개인 북마크 시스템을 배포하는 것","사용자 지정 대화 및 메시지 인터페이스를 만드는 것"],"es":["Construir aplicaciones nativas de IA con componentes de UI preconstruidos","Implementar sistemas de marcadores personales integrados con Agentes de IA","Crear interfaces de conversación y mensaje personalizadas"],"fr":["Construire des applications natives IA avec des composants UI préconstruits","Déployer des systèmes de signets personnels intégrés aux agents IA","Créer des interfaces de conversation et de message personnalisées"],"de":["KI-native Anwendungen mit vorgefertigten Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten erstellen","Persönliche Lesezeichen-Systeme implementieren, die in KI-Agents integriert sind","Benutzerdefinierte Konversations- und Nachrichtenschnittstellen erstellen"],"pt":["Construir aplicativos nativos de IA com componentes de UI pré-construídos","Implantar sistemas de marcadores pessoais integrados com Agentes de IA","Criar interfaces de conversa e mensagem personalizadas"],"ru":["Построение приложений, родных для ИИ, с предварительно построенными компонентами UI","Развертывание личных систем закладок, интегрированных с агентами ИИ","Создание пользовательских интерфейсов разговора и сообщения"],"ar":["بناء تطبيقات ذكاء اصطناعي اصطناعي مع مكونات واجهة المستخدم المسبقة البناء","نشر أنظمة العلامات الشخصية المتكاملة مع وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","إنشاء واجهات محادثة ورسالة مخصصة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires shadcn/ui CLI or dedicated AI Elements CLI for setup","Dependent on npm package installation"],"zh":["需要shadcn/ui CLI或专用AI元素CLI进行设置","依赖于npm包安装"],"ja":["設定するにはshadcn/ui CLIまたは専用のAIエレメントCLIが必要","npmパッケージのインストールに依存する"],"ko":["설정을 위해 shadcn/ui CLI 또는 전용 AI 요소 CLI가 필요함","npm 패키지 설치에 의존"],"es":["Requiere shadcn/ui CLI o AI Elements CLI dedicado para la configuración","Dependiente de la instalación del paquete npm"],"fr":["Nécessite shadcn/ui CLI ou AI Elements CLI dédié pour la configuration","Dépend de l''installation du package npm"],"de":["Benötigt shadcn/ui-CLI oder dediziertes AI-Elements-CLI für die Einrichtung","Abhängig von der Installation des npm-Pakets"],"pt":["Requer shadcn/ui CLI ou CLI de Elementos de IA dedicados para configuração","Dependente da instalação do pacote npm"],"ru":["Требует shadcn/ui CLI или CLI посвященных элементов ИИ для настройки","Зависит от установки пакета npm"],"ar":["يتطلب shadcn/ui CLI أو CLI عناصر الذكاء الاصطناعي المخصصة للإعداد","يعتمد على تثبيت حزمة npm"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
