 reutilizáveis","Compartilhamento entre projetos","Isolamento adequado","Exportação e gerenciamento de dependências"],"ru":["Создание многократно используемых компонентов","Обмен между проектами","Правильная изоляция","Экспорт и управление зависимостями"],"ar":["إنشاء مكونات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام","مشاركة بين المشاريع","عزل مناسب","تصدير وإدارة التبعيات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Convex 组件","组件作者工具","可重用组件","自包含组件","依赖管理","跨项目共享"],"ja":["Convex コンポーネント","コンポーネントオーサリング","再利用可能なコンポーネント","自己完結型コンポーネント","依存関係管理","プロジェクト間の共有"],"ko":["Convex 컴포넌트","컴포넌트 작성 도구","재사용 가능한 컴포넌트","자체 포함형 컴포넌트","의존성 관리","프로젝트 간 공유"],"es":["componentes Convex","autorización de componentes","reutilización de componentes","desarrollo de software","proyectos K-12","proyectos universitarios"],"fr":["composants Convex","création de composants","réutilisation de composants","développement de logiciels","projets de la maternelle à l''université","projets universitaires"],"de":["Convex-Komponenten","Erstellung von Komponenten","Wiederverwendung von Komponenten","Softwareentwicklung","Projekte von der Grundschule bis zur Universität","Universitätsprojekte"],"pt":["Convex Component Authoring","componentes reutilizáveis","compartilhamento de componentes","isolamento de componentes","exportação de componentes","gerenciamento de dependências"],"ru":["Создание компонентов Convex","многократно используемые компоненты","обмен компонентами","изоляция компонентов","экспорт компонентов","управление зависимостями"],"ar":["إنشاء مكونات Convex","مكونات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام","مشاركة المكونات","عزل المكونات","تصدير المكونات","إدارة التبعيات"]}},"owner":"nakafaai","repo":"nakafa.com","repoPath":"nakafaai/nakafa.com","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.420Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"convex-component-authoring","description":"How to create, structure, and publish self-contained Convex components with proper isolation, exports, and dependency management","version":"1.0.0","tags":["convex","components","reusable","packages","npm"],"bodyPreview":"# Convex Component Authoring\n\nCreate self-contained, reusable Convex components with proper isolation, exports, and dependency management for sharing across projects.\n\n## Documentation Sources\n\nBefore implementing, do not assume; fetch the latest documentation:\n\n- Primary: https://docs.convex.dev/components\n- Component Authoring: https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring\n- For broader context: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n\n## Instructions\n\n### What Are Convex Components?\n\nConvex component","body":"# Convex Component Authoring\n\nCreate self-contained, reusable Convex components with proper isolation, exports, and dependency management for sharing across projects.\n\n## Documentation Sources\n\nBefore implementing, do not assume; fetch the latest documentation:\n\n- Primary: https://docs.convex.dev/components\n- Component Authoring: https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring\n- For broader context: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n\n## Instructions\n\n### What Are Convex Components?\n\nConvex components are self-contained packages that include:\n- Database tables (isolated from the main app)\n- Functions (queries, mutations, actions)\n- TypeScript types and validators\n- Optional frontend hooks\n\n### Component Structure\n\n```\nmy-convex-component/\n├── package.json\n├── tsconfig.json\n├── README.md\n├── src/\n│   ├── index.ts           # Main exports\n│   ├── component.ts       # Component definition\n│   ├── schema.ts          # Component schema\n│   └── functions/\n│       ├── queries.ts\n│       ├── mutations.ts\n│       └── actions.ts\n└── convex.config.ts       # Component configuration\n```\n\n### Creating a Component\n\n#### 1. Component Configuration\n\n```typescript\n// convex.config.ts\nimport { defineComponent } from \"convex/server\";\n\nexport default defineComponent(\"myComponent\");\n```\n\n#### 2. Component Schema\n\n```typescript\n// src/schema.ts\nimport { defineSchema, defineTable } from \"convex/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport default defineSchema({\n  // Tables are isolated to this component\n  items: defineTable({\n    name: v.string(),\n    data: v.any(),\n    createdAt: v.number(),\n  }).index(\"by_name\", [\"name\"]),\n  \n  config: defineTable({\n    key: v.string(),\n    value: v.any(),\n  }).index(\"by_key\", [\"key\"]),\n});\n```\n\n#### 3. Component Definition\n\n```typescript\n// src/component.ts\nimport { defineComponent, ComponentDefinition } from \"convex/server\";\nimport schema from \"./schema\";\nimport * as queries from \"./functions/queries\";\nimport * as mutations from \"./functions/mutations\";\n\nconst component = defineComponent(\"myComponent\", {\n  schema,\n  functions: {\n    ...queries,\n    ...mutations,\n  },\n});\n\nexport default component;\n```\n\n#### 4. Component Functions\n\n```typescript\n// src/functions/queries.ts\nimport { query } from \"../_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport const list = query({\n  args: {\n    limit: v.optional(v.number()),\n  },\n  returns: v.array(v.object({\n    _id: v.id(\"items\"),\n    name: v.string(),\n    data: v.any(),\n    createdAt: v.number(),\n  })),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.db\n      .query(\"items\")\n      .order(\"desc\")\n      .take(args.limit ?? 10);\n  },\n});\n\nexport const get = query({\n  args: { name: v.string() },\n  returns: v.union(v.object({\n    _id: v.id(\"items\"),\n    name: v.string(),\n    data: v.any(),\n  }), v.null()),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.db\n      .query(\"items\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_name\", (q) => q.eq(\"name\", args.name))\n      .unique();\n  },\n});\n```\n\n```typescript\n// src/functions/mutations.ts\nimport { mutation } from \"../_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport const create = mutation({\n  args: {\n    name: v.string(),\n    data: v.any(),\n  },\n  returns: v.id(\"items\"),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.db.insert(\"items\", {\n      name: args.name,\n      data: args.data,\n      createdAt: Date.now(),\n    });\n  },\n});\n\nexport const update = mutation({\n  args: {\n    id: v.id(\"items\"),\n    data: v.any(),\n  },\n  returns: v.null(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    await ctx.db.patch(args.id, { data: args.data });\n    return null;\n  },\n});\n\nexport const remove = mutation({\n  args: { id: v.id(\"items\") },\n  returns: v.null(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    await ctx.db.delete(args.id);\n    return null;\n  },\n});\n```\n\n#### 5. Main Exports\n\n```typescript\n// src/index.ts\nexport { default as component } from \"./component\";\nexport * from \"./functions/queries\";\nexport * from \"./functions/mutations\";\n\n// Export types for consumers\nexport type { Id } from \"./_generated/dataModel\";\n```\n\n### Using a Component\n\n```typescript\n// In the consuming app''s convex/convex.config.ts\nimport { defineApp } from \"convex/server\";\nimport myComponent from \"my-convex-component\";\n\nconst app = defineApp();\n\napp.use(myComponent, { name: \"myComponent\" });\n\nexport default app;\n```\n\n```typescript\n// In the consuming app''s code\nimport { useQuery, useMutation } from \"convex/react\";\nimport { api } from \"../convex/_generated/api\";\n\nfunction MyApp() {\n  // Access component functions through the app''s API\n  const items = useQuery(api.myComponent.list, { limit: 10 });\n  const createItem = useMutation(api.myComponent.create);\n  \n  return (\n    <div>\n      {items?.map((item) => (\n        <div key={item._id}>{item.name}</div>\n      ))}\n      <button onClick={() => createItem({ name: \"New\", data: {} })}>\n        Add Item\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Component Configuration Options\n\n```typescript\n// convex/convex.config.ts\nimport { defineApp } from \"convex/server\";\nimport myComponent from \"my-convex-component\";\n\nconst app = defineApp();\n\n// Basic usage\napp.use(myComponent);\n\n// With custom name\napp.use(myComponent, { name: \"customName\" });\n\n// Multiple instances\napp.use(myComponent, { name: \"instance1\" });\napp.use(myComponent, { name: \"instance2\" });\n\nexport default app;\n```\n\n### Providing Component Hooks\n\n```typescript\n// src/hooks.ts\nimport { useQuery, useMutation } from \"convex/react\";\nimport { FunctionReference } from \"convex/server\";\n\n// Type-safe hooks for component consumers\nexport function useMyComponent(api: {\n  list: FunctionReference<\"query\">;\n  create: FunctionReference<\"mutation\">;\n}) {\n  const items = useQuery(api.list, {});\n  const createItem = useMutation(api.create);\n  \n  return {\n    items,\n    createItem,\n    isLoading: items === undefined,\n  };\n}\n```\n\n### Publishing a Component\n\n#### package.json\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"my-convex-component\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"description\": \"A reusable Convex component\",\n  \"main\": \"dist/index.js\",\n  \"types\": \"dist/index.d.ts\",\n  \"files\": [\n    \"dist\",\n    \"convex.config.ts\"\n  ],\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"build\": \"tsc\",\n    \"prepublishOnly\": \"npm run build\"\n  },\n  \"peerDependencies\": {\n    \"convex\": \"^1.0.0\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"convex\": \"^1.17.0\",\n    \"typescript\": \"^5.0.0\"\n  },\n  \"keywords\": [\n    \"convex\",\n    \"component\"\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n#### tsconfig.json\n\n```json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"target\": \"ES2020\",\n    \"module\": \"ESNext\",\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"bundler\",\n    \"declaration\": true,\n    \"outDir\": \"dist\",\n    \"strict\": true,\n    \"esModuleInterop\": true,\n    \"skipLibCheck\": true\n  },\n  \"include\": [\"src/**/*\"],\n  \"exclude\": [\"node_modules\", \"dist\"]\n}\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n### Rate Limiter Component\n\n```typescript\n// rate-limiter/src/schema.ts\nimport { defineSchema, defineTable } from \"convex/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport default defineSchema({\n  requests: defineTable({\n    key: v.string(),\n    timestamp: v.number(),\n  })\n    .index(\"by_key\", [\"key\"])\n    .index(\"by_key_and_time\", [\"key\", \"timestamp\"]),\n});\n```\n\n```typescript\n// rate-limiter/src/functions/mutations.ts\nimport { mutation } from \"../_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport const checkLimit = mutation({\n  args: {\n    key: v.string(),\n    limit: v.number(),\n    windowMs: v.number(),\n  },\n  returns: v.object({\n    allowed: v.boolean(),\n    remaining: v.number(),\n    resetAt: v.number(),\n  }),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const now = Date.now();\n    const windowStart = now - args.windowMs;\n    \n    // Clean old entries\n    const oldEntries = await ctx.db\n      .query(\"requests\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_key_and_time\", (q) => \n        q.eq(\"key\", args.key).lt(\"timestamp\", windowStart)\n      )\n      .collect();\n    \n    for (const entry of oldEntries) {\n      await ctx.db.delete(entry._id);\n    }\n    \n    // Count current window\n    const currentRequests = await ctx.db\n      .query(\"requests\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_key\", (q) => q.eq(\"key\", args.key))\n      .collect();\n    \n    const remaining = Math.max(0, args.limit - currentRequests.length);\n    const allowed = remaining > 0;\n    \n    if (allowed) {\n      await ctx.db.insert(\"requests\", {\n        key: args.key,\n        timestamp: now,\n      });\n    }\n    \n    const oldestRequest = currentRequests[0];\n    const resetAt = oldestRequest \n      ? oldestRequest.timestamp + args.windowMs \n      : now + args.windowMs;\n    \n    return { allowed, remaining: remaining - (allowed ? 1 : 0), resetAt };\n  },\n});\n```\n\n```typescript\n// Usage in consuming app\nimport { useMutation } from \"convex/react\";\nimport { api } from \"../convex/_generated/api\";\n\nfunction useRateLimitedAction() {\n  const checkLimit = useMutation(api.rateLimiter.checkLimit);\n  \n  return async (action: () => Promise<void>) => {\n    const result = await checkLimit({\n      key: \"user-action\",\n      limit: 10,\n      windowMs: 60000,\n    });\n    \n    if (!result.allowed) {\n      throw new Error(`Rate limited. Try again at ${new Date(result.resetAt)}`);\n    }\n    \n    await action();\n  };\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- Never run `npx convex deploy` unless explicitly instructed\n- Never run any git commands unless explicitly instructed\n- Keep component tables isolated (don''t reference main app tables)\n- Export clear TypeScript types for consumers\n- Document all public functions and their arguments\n- Use semantic versioning for component releases\n- Include comprehensive README with examples\n- Test components in isolation before publishing\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n1. **Cross-referencing tables** - Component tables should be self-contained\n2. **Missing type exports** - Export all necessary types\n3. **Hardcoded configuration** - Use component options for customization\n4. **No versioning** - Follow semantic versioning\n5. **Poor documentation** - Document all public APIs\n\n## References\n\n- Convex Documentation: https://docs.convex.dev/\n- Convex LLMs.txt: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n- Components: https://docs.convex.dev/components\n- Component Authoring: https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:24:45.088Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents focused on educational content creation, such as Cursor, Windsurf, or Claude Code, needing to author reusable and isolated Convex components for learning platforms.","zh":"适用于专注于教育内容创作的AI代理，例如Cursor、Windsurf或Claude Code，需要创建可重用和隔离的Convex组件的学习平台。","ja":"教育コンテンツ作成に特化したAIエージェント、たとえばCursor、Windsurf、またはClaude Codeに適しています。これらのエージェントは、学習プラットフォームで再利用可能なConvexコンポーネントを作成する必要があります。","ko":"교육 콘텐츠 생성에 중점을 둔 AI 에이전트인 Cursor, Windsurf 또는 Claude Code와 같이 재사용 가능한 Convex 컴포넌트를 생성하여 학습 플랫폼에서 사용할 수 있습니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de IA centrados en la creación de contenido educativo, como Cursor, Windsurf o Claude Code, que necesitan crear componentes de Convex reutilizables y aislados para plataformas de aprendizaje.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA axés sur la création de contenu éducatif, tels que Cursor, Windsurf ou Claude Code, ayant besoin d''autoriser des composants Convex réutilisables et isolés pour les plateformes d''apprentissage.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents, die auf die Erstellung von Bildungsinhalten spezialisiert sind, wie z.B. Cursor, Windsurf oder Claude Code, und die wiederverwendbare und isolierte Convex-Komponenten für Lernplattformen erstellen müssen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA focados na criação de conteúdo educacional, como Cursor, Windsurf ou Claude Code, que precisam criar componentes Convex reutilizáveis e isolados para plataformas de aprendizado.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на создание образовательного контента, таких как Cursor, Windsurf или Claude Code, которым необходимо создавать повторно используемые и изолированные компоненты Convex для образовательных платформ.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الوكيل الذكي الذي يركز على إنشاء المحتوى التعليمي، مثل Cursor أو Windsurf أو Claude Code، والذي يحتاج إلى إنشاء مكونات Convex قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام ومحلية لمنصات التعلم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create self-contained Convex components with proper isolation, exports, and dependency management, utilizing the latest documentation from https://docs.convex.dev/components and https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring, to share across K-12 to University projects, leveraging Convex''s component authoring capabilities.","zh":"赋予代理创建具有适当隔离、导出和依赖管理的自包含Convex组件的能力，利用https://docs.convex.dev/components和https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring的最新文档，在K-12至大学项目中共享，利用Convex的组件创作功能。","ja":"エージェントが適切な隔離、エクスポート、依存関係管理を備えた自包含のConvexコンポーネントを作成できるようにし、https://docs.convex.dev/componentsおよびhttps://docs.convex.dev/components/authoringの最新ドキュメントを利用して、K-12から大学までのプロジェクトで共有し、Convexのコンポーネント作成機能を活用します。","ko":"에이전트가 적절한 격리, 내보내기 및 종속성 관리를 갖춘 자체 포함 Convex 컴포넌트를 생성할 수 있도록 하여 https://docs.convex.dev/components 및 https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring의 최신 문서를 사용하여 K-12에서 대학까지의 프로젝트에서 공유하고 Convex의 컴포넌트 작성 기능을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear componentes de Convex autocontenidos con aislamiento adecuado, exportaciones y administración de dependencias, utilizando la última documentación de https://docs.convex.dev/components y https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring, para compartir entre proyectos de K-12 a Universidades, aprovechando las capacidades de autoría de componentes de Convex.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des composants Convex autocontenus avec une isolation appropriée, des exportations et une gestion des dépendances, en utilisant la dernière documentation de https://docs.convex.dev/components et https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring, pour partager entre les projets de K-12 à Université, en exploitant les capacités d''authoring de composants de Convex.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, selbstenthaltene Convex-Komponenten mit ordnungsgemäßer Isolation, Exporten und Abhängigkeitsverwaltung zu erstellen, indem sie die neueste Dokumentation von https://docs.convex.dev/components und https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring nutzen, um diese zwischen K-12- und Universitätsprojekten zu teilen und die Komponenten-Authoring-Fähigkeiten von Convex zu nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar componentes Convex autossuficientes com isolamento adequado, exportações e gerenciamento de dependências, utilizando a documentação mais recente de https://docs.convex.dev/components e https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring, para compartilhar em projetos de K-12 a Universidade, aproveitando as capacidades de autorização de componentes do Convex.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать самодостаточные компоненты Convex с надлежащей изоляцией, экспортом и управлением зависимостями, используя последнюю документацию по https://docs.convex.dev/components и https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring, для обмена в проектах от K-12 до университетских проектов, используя возможности Convex по созданию компонентов.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على إنشاء مكونات Convex محلية مع عزل مناسب وتصدير وإدارة-dependencies، باستخدام أحدث توثيق من https://docs.convex.dev/components و https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring، لمشاركتها عبر مشاريع K-12 إلى مشاريع الجامعة، واستغلال إمكانيات Convex لإنشاء المكونات."},"useCases":{"en":["Authoring reusable Convex components for educational platforms","Implementing dependency management for shared components across projects","Creating isolated and exportable Convex components for various learning contexts"],"zh":["为教育平台创建可重用的Convex组件","跨项目实现共享组件的依赖管理","为各种学习环境创建隔离和可导出的Convex组件"],"ja":["教育プラットフォーム用に再利用可能なConvexコンポーネントを作成する","プロジェクト間で共有コンポーネントの依存関係管理を実装する","さまざまな学習コンテキスト用に隔離およびエクスポート可能なConvexコンポーネントを作成する"],"ko":["교육 플랫폼을 위한 재사용 가능한 Convex 컴포넌트를 생성하는 것","프로젝트 간에 공유 컴포넌트의 종속성 관리를 구현하는 것","다양한 학습 상황에서 격리 및 내보내기 가능한 Convex 컴포넌트를 생성하는 것"],"es":["Creación de componentes de Convex reutilizables para plataformas educativas","Implementación de la administración de dependencias para componentes compartidos entre proyectos","Creación de componentes de Convex aislados y exportables para diversos contextos de aprendizaje"],"fr":["Création de composants Convex réutilisables pour les plateformes éducatives","Mise en œuvre de la gestion des dépendances pour les composants partagés entre les projets","Création de composants Convex isolés et exportables pour différents contextes d''apprentissage"],"de":["Erstellung wiederverwendbarer Convex-Komponenten für Bildungsplattformen","Implementierung der Abhängigkeitsverwaltung für gemeinsam genutzte Komponenten zwischen Projekten","Erstellung isolierter und exportierbarer Convex-Komponenten für verschiedene Lernkontexte"],"pt":["Criação de componentes Convex reutilizáveis para plataformas educacionais","Implementação de gerenciamento de dependências para componentes compartilhados em projetos","Criação de componentes Convex isolados e exportáveis para vários contextos de aprendizado"],"ru":["Создание повторно используемых компонентов Convex для образовательных платформ","Реализация управления зависимостями для общих компонентов в проектах","Создание изолированных и экспортируемых компонентов Convex для различных контекстов обучения"],"ar":["إنشاء مكونات Convex قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام لمنصات تعليمية","تنفيذ إدارة-dependencies لمكونات مشتركة في المشاريع","إنشاء مكونات Convex محلية وقابلة للتصدير لمختلف سياقات التعلم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to Convex documentation and component authoring guides","Dependent on Convex''s component authoring features and APIs"],"zh":["需要访问Convex文档和组件创作指南","依赖于Convex的组件创作功能和API"],"ja":["Convexドキュメントおよびコンポーネント作成ガイドへのアクセスが必要","Convexのコンポーネント作成機能およびAPIに依存する"],"ko":["Convex 문서 및 컴포넌트 작성 가이드에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다.","Convex의 컴포넌트 작성 기능 및 API에 종속됩니다."],"es":["Requiere acceso a la documentación de Convex y guías de autoría de componentes","Depende de las características de autoría de componentes de Convex y sus API"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la documentation de Convex et aux guides d''authoring de composants","Dépend des fonctionnalités d''authoring de composants de Convex et de ses API"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Convex-Dokumentation und Komponenten-Authoring-Anleitungen","Hängt von den Komponenten-Authoring-Funktionen von Convex und deren APIs ab"],"pt":["Exige acesso à documentação do Convex e às diretrizes de autorização de componentes","Depende das funcionalidades de autorização de componentes e das APIs do Convex"],"ru":["Требует доступа к документации Convex и руководствам по созданию компонентов","Зависит от возможностей Convex по созданию компонентов и API"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى توثيق Convex وإرشادات إنشاء المكونات","يعتمد على إمكانيات Convex لإنشاء المكونات وواجهات برمجة التطبيقات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":90}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('hoangnb24/skills/issue-resolution', 'community', 'hoangnb24', 'skills', 'hoangnb24/skills', 'issue-resolution', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.420Z', '2026-02-18T04:24:02.990Z', NULL, '{"id":"hoangnb24/skills/issue-resolution","name":"issue-resolution","description":{"zh":"问题解决流程是一种系统性的方法，通过迭代诊断和验证修复来解决问题","ja":"問題解決パイプラインは、反復診断と検証修正を介して問題を解決するシステム的な方法です","ko":"이슈 해결 파이프ライン은 반복적 진단과 검증된 수정을 통해 문제를 해결하는 시스템적인 방법입니다","es":"El pipeline de resolución de problemas es un proceso sistemático para diagnosticar y corregir errores de manera iterativa","fr":"Le pipeline de résolution de problèmes est un processus systématique pour diagnostiquer et corriger les erreurs de manière itérative","de":"Die Pipeline zur Problembehandlung ist ein systematischer Prozess zur Fehlersuche und Korrektur in iterativen Schleifen","pt":"O pipeline de resolução de problemas é um processo sistemático para diagnosticar e reparar problemas de forma eficaz.","ru":"Конвейер решения проблем - системный процесс для диагностики и ремонта проблем эффективно.","ar":"PIPELINE حل المشكلات هو عملية منهجية لتشخيص وإصلاح المشكلات بفعالية","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"问题解决流程","ja":"問題解決パイプライン","ko":"이슈 해결 파이프라인","es":"Resolución de Problemas: Pipeline de Diagnóstico","fr":"Résolution de Problèmes: Pipeline de Diagnostic","de":"Problembehandlung: Pipeline zur Fehlersuche","pt":"Resolução de Problemas: Pipeline de Diagnóstico","ru":"Решение проблем: конвейер диагностики","ar":"حل المشكلات:Pipeline للتشخيص","en":"issue-resolution"},"description":{"zh":"问题解决流程是一种系统性的方法，通过迭代诊断和验证修复来解决问题","ja":"問題解決パイプラインは、反復診断と検証修正を介して問題を解決するシステム的な方法です","ko":"이슈 해결 파이프ライン은 반복적 진단과 검증된 수정을 통해 문제를 해결하는 시스템적인 방법입니다","es":"El pipeline de resolución de problemas es un proceso sistemático para diagnosticar y corregir errores de manera iterativa","fr":"Le pipeline de résolution de problèmes est un processus systématique pour diagnostiquer et corriger les erreurs de manière itérative","de":"Die Pipeline zur Problembehandlung ist ein systematischer Prozess zur Fehlersuche und Korrektur in iterativen Schleifen","pt":"O pipeline de resolução de problemas é um processo sistemático para diagnosticar e reparar problemas de forma eficaz.","ru":"Конвейер решения проблем - системный процесс для диагностики и ремонта проблем эффективно.","ar":"PIPELINE حل المشكلات هو عملية منهجية لتشخيص وإصلاح المشكلات بفعالية","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["迭代诊断","验证修复","问题解决流程","系统性方法","提高效率"],"ja":["反復診断","検証修正","問題解決パイプライン","システム的な方法","効率性の向上"],"ko":["반복적 진단","검증된 수정","이슈 해결 파이프라인","시스템적인 방법","효율성 향상"],"es":["Diagnóstico iterativo","Análisis de causa raíz","Corrección verificada","Reproducción de errores","Análisis de impacto","Verificación de soluciones"],"fr":["Diagnostic itératif","Analyse de cause racine","Correction vérifiée","Reproduction d''erreurs","Analyse d''impact","Vérification de solutions"],"de":["Iteratives Diagnose","Root-Cause-Analyse","Überprüfte Korrektur","Fehlerreproduktion","Auswirkungsanalyse","Lösungsverifizierung"],"pt":["Triage de problemas","Reprodução de erros","Análise de causa raiz","Impacto e solução","Verificação de reparos"],"ru":["Тriage проблем","Репродукция ошибок","Анализ коренной причины","Воздействие и решение","Проверка ремонта"],"ar":["ترياج المشكلات","إعادة إنتاج الأخطاء","تحليل السبب الجذري","التأثير والحل","التحقق من الإصلاحات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["问题解决","迭代诊断","验证修复","系统性方法","效率提高","开发流程"],"ja":["問題解決","反復診断","検証修正","システム的な方法","効率性の向上","開発プロセス"],"ko":["이슈 해결","반복적 진단","검증된 수정","시스템적인 방법","효율성 향상","개발 프로세스"],"es":["resolución de problemas","diagnóstico iterativo","análisis de causa raíz","corrección verificada","reproducción de errores","desarrollo de software","ingeniería de software"],"fr":["résolution de problèmes","diagnostic itératif","analyse de cause racine","correction vérifiée","reproduction d''erreurs","développement de logiciels","ingénierie de logiciels"],"de":["Problembehandlung","iteratives Diagnose","Root-Cause-Analyse","überprüfte Korrektur","Fehlerreproduktion","Softwareentwicklung","Softwareingenieurwesen"],"pt":["resolução de problemas","pipeline de diagnóstico","reparo verificado","diagnóstico sistemático","solução de problemas","análise de causa raiz"],"ru":["решение проблем","конвейер диагностики","проверенное исправление","систематическая диагностика","решение проблем","анализ коренной причины"],"ar":["حل المشكلات","PIPELINE للتشخيص","التصحيح المُؤكد","التشخيص المنهجي","حل المشكلات","تحليل السبب الجذري"]}},"owner":"hoangnb24","repo":"skills","repoPath":"hoangnb24/skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.420Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"issue-resolution","description":"Systematically diagnose and fix bugs through triage, reproduction, root cause analysis, and verified fixes. Use when resolving bugs, errors, failing tests, or investigating unexpected behavior.","bodyPreview":"# Issue Resolution Pipeline\n\nSystematically resolve issues through iterative diagnosis and verified fixes.\n\n## Pipeline Overview\n\n```\nINPUT → Triage → Reproduction → Root Cause Analysis → Impact → Fix → Verify\n              ◄──────────────►◄────────────────────►\n                    (Iterative loops allowed)\n```\n\n| Phase                  | Purpose                            | Output              |\n| ---------------------- | ---------------------------------- | ------------------- |\n| 0. Triage","body":"# Issue Resolution Pipeline\n\nSystematically resolve issues through iterative diagnosis and verified fixes.\n\n## Pipeline Overview\n\n```\nINPUT → Triage → Reproduction → Root Cause Analysis → Impact → Fix → Verify\n              ◄──────────────►◄────────────────────►\n                    (Iterative loops allowed)\n```\n\n| Phase                  | Purpose                            | Output              |\n| ---------------------- | ---------------------------------- | ------------------- |\n| 0. Triage              | Normalize input, classify severity | Issue Brief         |\n| 1. Reproduction        | Prove the bug, trace code path     | Repro Report + Test |\n| 2. Root Cause Analysis | Find WHY, not just WHERE           | RCA Report          |\n| 3. Impact Assessment   | Blast radius, regression risk      | Impact Report       |\n| 4. Fix Decomposition   | Break into beads                   | .beads/\\*.md        |\n| 5. Verification        | Prove fix works, no regressions    | Passing tests       |\n\n## Phase 0: Triage\n\nNormalize different input types to a structured Issue Brief.\n\n### Input Types\n\n| Type                  | Triage Strategy                       |\n| --------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| **Vague report**      | Clarify → Explore → Reproduce         |\n| **Error/Stack trace** | Parse trace → Locate code → Reproduce |\n| **Failing test**      | Run test → Extract assertion → Trace  |\n\n### Vague Report Triage\n\n```\nUser: \"Login is broken\"\n         │\n         ▼\nAsk clarification questions:\n• What error do you see?\n• When did it start working / stop working?\n• What steps trigger it?\n• Specific user/browser/environment?\n         │\n         ▼ (if user can''t clarify)\nExplore:\n• mcp__gkg__search_codebase_definitions: Find auth/login related code\n• git log: Recent changes in area\n• Check logs if available\n```\n\n### Error/Stack Trace Triage\n\n```\nParse the stack trace:\n• Extract file:line locations\n• mcp__gkg__get_definition on functions in trace\n• Read surrounding context\n         │\n         ▼\nIdentify reproduction conditions:\n• What input caused this?\n• Can we write a test?\n```\n\n### Failing Test Triage\n\n```\nRun test in isolation:\n• bun test <file> --filter \"<test name>\"\n• Read test file for setup/assertions\n• Check git log: was it passing before?\n         │\n         ▼\nTrace implementation:\n• What code does test exercise?\n• mcp__gkg__get_references on tested function\n• Recent changes to implementation?\n```\n\n### Severity Classification\n\nDetermines reproduction requirements:\n\n| Severity                            | Reproduction Required  |\n| ----------------------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| **CRITICAL** (production, security) | Failing test REQUIRED  |\n| **REGRESSION** (was working)        | Failing test REQUIRED  |\n| **RACE CONDITION** (timing)         | Failing test REQUIRED  |\n| **LOGIC BUG**                       | Failing test PREFERRED |\n| **UI/VISUAL**                       | Manual + screenshot OK |\n| **PERFORMANCE**                     | Benchmark/profile OK   |\n| **QUICK FIX** (obvious cause)       | Manual repro OK        |\n\n### Issue Brief Template\n\nSave to `history/issues/<id>/brief.md`:\n\n```markdown\n# Issue Brief: <Short Title>\n\n**Severity**: CRITICAL / HIGH / MEDIUM / LOW\n**Type**: Regression / Edge case / Race condition / UI / Performance / Other\n**Repro Required**: Failing test / Manual OK\n\n## Symptom\n\n<What is happening>\n\n## Expected Behavior\n\n<What should happen>\n\n## Reproduction\n\n<Steps, test command, or code path>\n\n## Evidence\n\n<Error message, stack trace, test output>\n\n## Affected Area\n\n<Files, modules, features involved>\n\n## Timeline\n\n<When started, recent changes if known>\n```\n\n## Phase 1: Reproduction\n\nProve the bug exists and trace the code path.\n\n### If Failing Test Required\n\n```bash\n# Create test file\n# packages/<area>/src/__tests__/<feature>.regression.test.ts\n\n# Test should:\n# 1. Set up conditions that trigger bug\n# 2. Assert expected behavior (currently fails)\n# 3. Be deterministic\n```\n\n### Reproduction Checklist\n\n- [ ] Bug is reproducible on demand\n- [ ] Exact error/behavior captured\n- [ ] Minimal reproduction (simplest case that fails)\n- [ ] Code path identified (stack trace or tracing)\n\n### Code Path Tracing\n\n```\nmcp__gkg__get_definition     → Find where error originates\nmcp__gkg__get_references     → Find callers\ngit blame <file>       → Who changed it, when\ngit log -p <file>      → What changed recently\n```\n\n### Repro Report Template\n\nSave to `history/issues/<id>/repro.md`:\n\n```markdown\n# Reproduction Report: <Issue Title>\n\n## Reproduction Method\n\n☐ Failing test: `<test file and name>`\n☐ Manual: <steps>\n\n## Error/Behavior Captured\n\n<Exact error message, stack trace>\n\n## Code Path\n\n1. Entry: `<file>:<line>` - <function>\n2. Calls: `<file>:<line>` - <function>\n3. Fails at: `<file>:<line>` - <reason>\n\n## Recent Changes (if relevant)\n\n- <commit>: <summary>\n```\n\n## Phase 2: Root Cause Analysis\n\nFind WHY the bug happens, not just WHERE.\n\n### RCA Framework\n\n```\nSTEP 1: Generate hypotheses (3-5)\n         │\n         ▼\nSTEP 2: Gather evidence for/against each\n         │\n         ▼\nSTEP 3: Eliminate hypotheses\n         │\n         ▼\nSTEP 4: Confirm root cause\n```\n\n### Bug Type → RCA Strategy\n\n| Bug Type            | Strategy                  | Key Tools                       |\n| ------------------- | ------------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| **Regression**      | Find breaking change      | `git bisect`, `git blame`       |\n| **Edge case**       | Analyze boundary inputs   | Type inspection, boundary tests |\n| **Race condition**  | Trace async flow          | Timing logs, async analysis     |\n| **Data corruption** | Trace state changes       | Data flow analysis              |\n| **External dep**    | Check version/API changes | Changelogs, API docs            |\n\n### Oracle for RCA\n\n**Hypothesis Generation:**\n\n```\noracle(\n  task: \"Generate root cause hypotheses\",\n  context: \"\"\"\n    Symptom: <error>\n    Code path: <trace>\n    Recent changes: <git log>\n\n    Generate 3-5 hypotheses ranked by likelihood.\n    For each, what evidence would support/refute it?\n  \"\"\",\n  files: [\"<affected files>\"]\n)\n```\n\n**Hypothesis Validation:**\n\n```\noracle(\n  task: \"Validate root cause hypothesis\",\n  context: \"\"\"\n    Hypothesis: <proposed cause>\n    Evidence: <gathered evidence>\n\n    1. Does evidence support or refute?\n    2. Explain causal chain: cause → symptom\n    3. What would confirm this?\n  \"\"\",\n  files: [\"<relevant files>\"]\n)\n```\n\n### Iteration: RCA → Reproduction Loop\n\nIf hypothesis needs more evidence:\n\n```\nIN RCA: \"Need timing logs to confirm race condition\"\n    │\n    ▼\nBACK TO REPRO:\n• Add instrumentation\n• Run with specific conditions\n• Capture new evidence\n    │\n    ▼\nRETURN TO RCA with new evidence\n```\n\n### RCA Report Template\n\nSave to `history/issues/<id>/rca.md`:\n\n```markdown\n# Root Cause Analysis: <Issue Title>\n\n## Iteration: <N>\n\n## Hypotheses Considered\n\n### Hypothesis A: <Description>\n\n- **Likelihood**: HIGH / MEDIUM / LOW\n- **Supporting evidence**: ...\n- **Refuting evidence**: ...\n- **Verdict**: ✓ CONFIRMED / ✗ ELIMINATED\n\n### Hypothesis B: ...\n\n## Root Cause (Confirmed)\n\n**Cause**: <Clear statement>\n\n**Causal chain**:\n\n1. <Step> leads to\n2. <Step> leads to\n3. <Symptom>\n\n## Why This Happened\n\n<Underlying reason - missing validation, wrong assumption, etc.>\n\n## Fix Approach\n\n**Immediate**: <What to change>\n**Preventive**: <How to prevent similar bugs>\n```\n\n## Phase 3: Impact Assessment\n\nBefore fixing, understand blast radius.\n\n### Impact Analysis\n\n```\nmcp__gkg__get_references <affected function>\n    → Who else calls this?\n\nGrep for related patterns\n    → Similar code that might have same bug?\n\nReview test coverage\n    → What tests cover this area?\n```\n\n### Regression Risk\n\n| Factor              | Risk Level |\n| ------------------- | ---------- |\n| High usage function | HIGH       |\n| Shared utility      | HIGH       |\n| Public API change   | HIGH       |\n| Internal helper     | LOW        |\n| Isolated module     | LOW        |\n\n### Spike for Complex Fixes\n\nIf fix approach is uncertain:\n\n```bash\nbd create \"Spike: Validate fix approach for <issue>\" -t task -p 0\n```\n\nExecute via MULTI_AGENT_WORKFLOW, write to `.spikes/<issue-id>/`.\n\n### Impact Report Template\n\nSave to `history/issues/<id>/impact.md`:\n\n```markdown\n# Impact Assessment: <Issue Title>\n\n## Blast Radius\n\n### Direct Impact\n\n- <File/function directly changed>\n\n### Callers Affected\n\n- <List from mcp__gkg__get_references>\n\n### Related Code\n\n- <Similar patterns that may need same fix>\n\n## Regression Risk\n\n**Level**: HIGH / MEDIUM / LOW\n**Reason**: <Why this risk level>\n\n## Test Coverage\n\n- Existing tests: <list>\n- Tests to add: <list>\n\n## Fix Validation\n\n☐ Spike completed (if needed): `.spikes/<id>/`\n☐ Fix approach validated\n```\n\n## Phase 4: Fix Decomposition\n\nBreak fix into beads.\n\n### Simple Fix (Single Bead)\n\n```bash\nbd create \"Fix: <issue title>\" -t bug -p <priority>\n```\n\nBead includes:\n\n- Root cause reference\n- Fix implementation\n- Test (failing → passing)\n- Docs update (if behavior change)\n\n### Complex Fix (Multiple Beads)\n\n```bash\nbd create \"Epic: Fix <issue>\" -t epic -p <priority>\nbd create \"Add regression test for <issue>\" -t task --blocks <epic>\nbd create \"Fix <component A>\" -t bug --blocks <epic> --deps <test>\nbd create \"Fix <component B>\" -t bug --blocks <epic> --deps <test>\nbd create \"Update docs for <behavior change>\" -t task --blocks <epic> --deps <fix-a>,<fix-b>\n```\n\n### Fix Bead Template\n\n```markdown\n# Fix: <Issue Title>\n\n**Type**: bug\n**Priority**: <0-4>\n**Fixes**: <issue reference>\n\n## Root Cause\n\n<From RCA report>\n\n## Fix Implementation\n\n<What to change and why>\n\n## Files to Modify\n\n- `<file>`: <change description>\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] Regression test passes\n- [ ] Original symptom no longer reproducible\n- [ ] No new test failures\n- [ ] `bun run check-types` passes\n- [ ] `bun run build` passes\n```\n\n## Phase 5: Verification\n\nProve fix works and nothing else broke.\n\n### Verification Checklist\n\n```bash\n# 1. Regression test passes\nbun test <regression-test-file>\n\n# 2. Original symptom gone\n<manual verification or test>\n\n# 3. No new failures\nbun run test\n\n# 4. Types and build\nbun run check-types\nbun run build\n```\n\n### Iteration: Verify → RCA Loop\n\nIf fix doesn''t work:\n\n```\nTest still fails after fix\n    │\n    ▼\nRoot cause was wrong or incomplete\n    │\n    ▼\nBACK TO RCA:\n• Eliminate current hypothesis\n• Generate new hypotheses\n• Update RCA Report with iteration\n```\n\n### Verify → Impact Loop\n\nIf fix causes regressions:\n\n```\nNew test failures after fix\n    │\n    ▼\nFix has unintended side effects\n    │\n    ▼\nBACK TO IMPACT:\n• Reassess blast radius\n• Consider alternative fix approach\n```\n\n## Loop Limits\n\nPrevent infinite iteration:\n\n| Loop         | Soft Limit | Hard Limit | At Hard Limit               |\n| ------------ | ---------- | ---------- | --------------------------- |\n| RCA → Repro  | 2          | 4          | Escalate / pair debug       |\n| RCA → Triage | 1          | 2          | Re-evaluate original report |\n| Verify → RCA | 2          | 3          | Oracle deep review          |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Tool Selection\n\n| Need                  | Tool                            |\n| --------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| Parse stack trace     | Read + mcp**gkg**get_definition |\n| Find callers          | mcp**gkg**get_references        |\n| Recent changes        | git log, git blame              |\n| Binary search commits | git bisect                      |\n| Reasoning about cause | oracle                          |\n| Validate fix approach | Spike via MULTI_AGENT_WORKFLOW  |\n\n### Common Mistakes\n\n- **Fixing symptom, not cause** → Leads to recurrence\n- **Skipping reproduction** → Can''t verify fix\n- **No regression test** → Bug returns later\n- **Ignoring impact** → Fix breaks other things\n- **Not iterating** → Wrong diagnosis persists\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:24:02.990Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Debugging Agents needing systematic issue resolution through iterative diagnosis and verified fixes.","zh":"适合需要通过迭代诊断和验证修复进行系统性问题解决的调试代理。","ja":"デバッグエージェントが体系的な問題解決を必要とする場合に適しています。問題は、反復診断と検証済みの修正を通じて解決されます。","ko":"시스템적인 문제 해결을 위해 반복적인 진단과 검증된 수정이 필요한 디버깅 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de depuración que necesitan una resolución sistemática de problemas a través de un diagnóstico iterativo y soluciones verificadas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de débogage qui nécessitent une résolution systématique des problèmes par le biais d''un diagnostic itératif et de corrections vérifiées.","de":"Ideal für Debugging-Agents, die eine systematische Problemlösung durch iterative Diagnose und verifizierte Korrekturen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Depuração que necessitam de resolução sistemática de problemas por meio de diagnóstico iterativo e soluções verificadas.","ru":"Идеально для агентов отладки, которым требуется системное решение проблем посредством итеративной диагностики и верифицированных исправлений.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات إصلاح العيوب التي تحتاج إلى حل مشاكل منهجي من خلال تشخيص متكرر وإصلاحات تم التحقق منها."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to resolve issues efficiently by leveraging a structured pipeline that includes triage, reproduction, root cause analysis, impact assessment, and verified fixes, utilizing iterative loops for complex problems.","zh":"通过利用包括初步诊断、复现、根本原因分析、影响评估和验证修复在内的结构化管道，赋予代理高效解决问题的能力，对于复杂问题，利用反复循环。","ja":"トライアージュ、複製、根本原因分析、影響評価、検証済みの修正を含む構造化されたパイプラインを活用することで、エージェントが問題を効率的に解決できるようになります。複雑な問題の場合は、反復ループを使用します。","ko":"초기 진단, 복제, 근본 원인 분석, 영향 평가 및 검증된 수정을 포함한 구조화된 파이프라인을 활용하여 에이전트가 문제를 효율적으로 해결할 수 있도록 합니다. 복잡한 문제의 경우 반복 루프를 사용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes resolver problemas de manera eficiente mediante la utilización de una canalización estructurada que incluye triaje, reproducción, análisis de causa raíz, evaluación de impacto y soluciones verificadas, utilizando bucles iterativos para problemas complejos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de résoudre les problèmes de manière efficace en exploitant une pipeline structurée qui comprend le triage, la reproduction, l''analyse de la cause profonde, l''évaluation de l''impact et les corrections vérifiées, en utilisant des boucles itératives pour les problèmes complexes.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Probleme effizient zu lösen, indem sie eine strukturierte Pipeline nutzen, die Triage, Reproduktion, Root Cause-Analyse, Auswirkungsabschätzung und verifizierte Korrekturen umfasst, unter Nutzung iterativer Schleifen für komplexe Probleme.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a resolver problemas de forma eficiente, aproveitando um pipeline estruturado que inclui triagem, reprodução, análise de causa raiz, avaliação de impacto e soluções verificadas, utilizando loops iterativos para problemas complexos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно решать проблемы, используя структурированный конвейер, включающий триаж, воспроизведение, анализ коренной причины, оценку воздействия и верифицированные исправления, с использованием итеративных циклов для сложных проблем.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من حل المشكلات بفعالية من خلال استخدام трубة منظم تشمل التriage واعادة الإنتاج وتحليل السبب الجذري وتقييم التأثير والإصلاحات المُؤكدة، باستخدام الحلقات المتكررة للمشاكل المعقدة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating issue reproduction for faster diagnosis","Generating root cause analysis reports for complex issues","Verifying fixes through systematic testing"],"zh":["自动化问题复现以加快诊断","为复杂问题生成根本原因分析报告","通过系统测试验证修复"],"ja":["問題の複製を自動化して診断を高速化する","複雑な問題の根本原因分析レポートを生成する","システムテストを通じて修正を検証する"],"ko":["문제를 자동으로 재현하여 진단을 가속화하는 것","복잡한 문제에 대한 근본 원인 분석 보고서 생성","시스템 테스트를 통해 수정을 검증"],"es":["Automatizar la reproducción de problemas para un diagnóstico más rápido","Generar informes de análisis de causa raíz para problemas complejos","Verificar soluciones mediante pruebas sistemáticas"],"fr":["Automatiser la reproduction des problèmes pour un diagnostic plus rapide","Générer des rapports d''analyse de cause profonde pour les problèmes complexes","Vérifier les corrections par des tests systématiques"],"de":["Automatisieren der Problemmreproduktion für eine schnellere Diagnose","Generieren von Root Cause-Analyseberichten für komplexe Probleme","Verifizieren von Korrekturen durch systematische Tests"],"pt":["Automatizar a reprodução de problemas para um diagnóstico mais rápido","Gerar relatórios de análise de causa raiz para problemas complexos","Verificar soluções por meio de testes sistemáticos"],"ru":["Автоматизировать воспроизведение проблем для более быстрой диагностики","Генерировать отчеты анализа коренной причины для сложных проблем","Проверять исправления посредством систематического тестирования"],"ar":["تحسين إعادة إنتاج المشاكل من أجل تشخيص أسرع","توليد تقارير تحليل السبب الجذري للمشاكل المعقدة","التحقق من الإصلاحات عن طريق الاختبارات المنهجية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires iterative loop support for complex issues","Depends on accurate input for effective triage"],"zh":["需要对复杂问题提供反复循环的支持","依赖于准确的输入以进行有效的初步诊断"],"ja":["複雑な問題に対する反復ループのサポートが必要","効果的なトライアージュを行うには正確な入力が必要"],"ko":["복잡한 문제에 대한 반복 루프 지원이 필요","유효한 초기 진단을 위해 정확한 입력이 필요"],"es":["Requiere soporte de bucle iterativo para problemas complejos","Depende de una entrada precisa para un triaje eficaz"],"fr":["Nécessite un support de boucle itérative pour les problèmes complexes","Dépend d''une entrée précise pour un triage efficace"],"de":["Benötigt Unterstützung für iterative Schleifen bei komplexen Problemen","Hängt von genauer Eingabe für ein effektives Triage ab"],"pt":["Exige suporte a loops iterativos para problemas complexos","Depende de entrada precisa para uma triagem eficaz"],"ru":["Требует поддержки итеративных циклов для сложных проблем","Зависит от точного ввода для эффективной триаж"],"ar":["يتطلب دعم الحلقات المتكررة للمشاكل المعقدة","يعتمد على مدخلات دقيقة لفعالية التriage"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
