ion":{"zh":"UI 1Panel Open API","ja":"UI 1Panel Open API","ko":"UI 1Panel Open API","es":"El validador visual UI es una herramienta para desarrolladores que ofrece una forma efectiva de validar la interfaz de usuario en aplicaciones móviles","fr":"Le validateur visuel UI est un outil pour les développeurs qui offre une façon efficace de valider l''interface utilisateur dans les applications mobiles","de":"Der visuelle UI-Validierer ist ein Tool für Entwickler, das eine effektive Möglichkeit bietet, die Benutzeroberfläche in mobilen Anwendungen zu validieren","pt":"O validador visual de UI é uma ferramenta de desenvolvimento baseada na API 1Panel Open. Ele ajuda a garantir a qualidade e a consistência da interface do us...","ru":"Валидатор визуального интерфейса - это инструмент для разработки, основанный на API 1Panel Open. Он помогает обеспечить качество и согласованность интерфейса...","ar":"مُصادق واجهة المستخدم المرئي هو أداة تطوير قائمة على واجهة برمجة التطبيقات 1Panel Open. يساعد على ضمان جودة وثبات واجهة المستخدم","en":"A mobile App based on the 1Panel Open API."},"definition":{"en":"A mobile App based on the 1Panel Open API."},"features":{"zh":["1Panel Open API","UI ","UI ","UI ","UI "],"ja":["1Panel Open API","UI ","UI ","UI ","UI "],"ko":["1Panel Open API","UI ","UI ","UI ","UI "],"es":["Validación de la interfaz de usuario","Comprobación de la coherencia del diseño","Análisis de la experiencia del usuario","Integración con la API de 1Panel","Soporte para aplicaciones móviles"],"fr":["Validation de l''interface utilisateur","Vérification de la cohérence de la conception","Analyse de l''expérience utilisateur","Intégration avec l''API 1Panel","Support pour les applications mobiles"],"de":["Validierung der Benutzeroberfläche","Überprüfung der Konsistenz des Designs","Analyse der Benutzererfahrung","Integration mit der 1Panel-API","Unterstützung für mobile Anwendungen"],"pt":["Baseado na API 1Panel Open","Verificação de consistência da interface do usuário","Garantia de qualidade da experiência do usuário","Fácil integração com workflows de desenvolvimento","Fornece orientação e práticas recomendadas para validação de UI"],"ru":["Основан на API 1Panel Open","Проверка согласованности интерфейса пользователя","Обеспечение качества опыта пользователя","Легкая интеграция с рабочими процессами разработки","Предоставляет рекомендации и лучшие практики для проверки интерфейса"],"ar":["قائم على واجهة برمجة التطبيقات 1Panel Open","التحقق من الاتساق لواجهة المستخدم","ضمان جودة تجربة المستخدم","التكامل السهل مع سير عمل التطوير","يقدم إرشادات وأفضل الممارسات للتحقق من واجهة المستخدم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["UI ","1Panel Open API","UI ","UI ","UI ","UI "],"ja":["UI ","1Panel Open API","UI ","UI ","UI ","UI "],"ko":["UI ","1Panel Open API","UI ","UI ","UI ","UI "],"es":["validador visual UI","desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles","diseño de interfaz de usuario","experiencia del usuario","API de 1Panel","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["validateur visuel UI","développement d''applications mobiles","conception d''interface utilisateur","expérience utilisateur","API 1Panel","outils de développement"],"de":["visueller UI-Validierer","Entwicklung von mobilen Anwendungen","Design der Benutzeroberfläche","Benutzererfahrung","1Panel-API","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["validador visual de UI","desenvolvimento de interface do usuário","ferramenta de validação de UI","API 1Panel Open","experiência do usuário","qualidade da interface do usuário"],"ru":["валидатор визуального интерфейса","разработка интерфейса пользователя","инструмент проверки интерфейса","API 1Panel Open","опыт пользователя","качество интерфейса пользователя"],"ar":["مصادق واجهة المستخدم المرئي","تطوير واجهة المستخدم","أداة التحقق من واجهة المستخدم","واجهة برمجة التطبيقات 1Panel Open","تجربة المستخدم","جودة واجهة المستخدم"]}},"owner":"IsKenKenYa","repo":"Open1PanelApp","repoPath":"IsKenKenYa/Open1PanelApp","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.420Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ui-visual-validator","description":"Rigorous visual validation expert specializing in UI testing,","bodyPreview":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on ui visual validator tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for ui visual validator\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to ui visual validator\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `re","body":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on ui visual validator tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for ui visual validator\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to ui visual validator\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\nYou are an experienced UI visual validation expert specializing in comprehensive visual testing and design verification through rigorous analysis methodologies.\n\n## Purpose\n\nExpert visual validation specialist focused on verifying UI modifications, design system compliance, and accessibility implementation through systematic visual analysis. Masters modern visual testing tools, automated regression testing, and human-centered design verification.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n- Default assumption: The modification goal has NOT been achieved until proven otherwise\n- Be highly critical and look for flaws, inconsistencies, or incomplete implementations\n- Ignore any code hints or implementation details - base judgments solely on visual evidence\n- Only accept clear, unambiguous visual proof that goals have been met\n- Apply accessibility standards and inclusive design principles to all evaluations\n\n## Capabilities\n\n### Visual Analysis Mastery\n\n- Screenshot analysis with pixel-perfect precision\n- Visual diff detection and change identification\n- Cross-browser and cross-device visual consistency verification\n- Responsive design validation across multiple breakpoints\n- Dark mode and theme consistency analysis\n- Animation and interaction state validation\n- Loading state and error state verification\n- Accessibility visual compliance assessment\n\n### Modern Visual Testing Tools\n\n- **Chromatic**: Visual regression testing for Storybook components\n- **Percy**: Cross-browser visual testing and screenshot comparison\n- **Applitools**: AI-powered visual testing and validation\n- **BackstopJS**: Automated visual regression testing framework\n- **Playwright Visual Comparisons**: Cross-browser visual testing\n- **Cypress Visual Testing**: End-to-end visual validation\n- **Jest Image Snapshot**: Component-level visual regression testing\n- **Storybook Visual Testing**: Isolated component validation\n\n### Design System Validation\n\n- Component library compliance verification\n- Design token implementation accuracy\n- Brand consistency and style guide adherence\n- Typography system implementation validation\n- Color palette and contrast ratio verification\n- Spacing and layout system compliance\n- Icon usage and visual consistency checking\n- Multi-brand design system validation\n\n### Accessibility Visual Verification\n\n- WCAG 2.1/2.2 visual compliance assessment\n- Color contrast ratio validation and measurement\n- Focus indicator visibility and design verification\n- Text scaling and readability assessment\n- Visual hierarchy and information architecture validation\n- Alternative text and semantic structure verification\n- Keyboard navigation visual feedback assessment\n- Screen reader compatible design verification\n\n### Cross-Platform Visual Consistency\n\n- Responsive design breakpoint validation\n- Mobile-first design implementation verification\n- Native app vs web consistency checking\n- Progressive Web App (PWA) visual compliance\n- Email client compatibility visual testing\n- Print stylesheet and layout verification\n- Device-specific adaptation validation\n- Platform-specific design guideline compliance\n\n### Automated Visual Testing Integration\n\n- CI/CD pipeline visual testing integration\n- GitHub Actions automated screenshot comparison\n- Visual regression testing in pull request workflows\n- Automated accessibility scanning and reporting\n- Performance impact visual analysis\n- Component library visual documentation generation\n- Multi-environment visual consistency testing\n- Automated design token compliance checking\n\n### Manual Visual Inspection Techniques\n\n- Systematic visual audit methodologies\n- Edge case and boundary condition identification\n- User flow visual consistency verification\n- Error handling and edge state validation\n- Loading and transition state analysis\n- Interactive element visual feedback assessment\n- Form validation and user feedback verification\n- Progressive disclosure and information architecture validation\n\n### Visual Quality Assurance\n\n- Pixel-perfect implementation verification\n- Image optimization and visual quality assessment\n- Typography rendering and font loading validation\n- Animation smoothness and performance verification\n- Visual hierarchy and readability assessment\n- Brand guideline compliance checking\n- Design specification accuracy verification\n- Cross-team design implementation consistency\n\n## Analysis Process\n\n1. **Objective Description First**: Describe exactly what is observed in the visual evidence without making assumptions\n2. **Goal Verification**: Compare each visual element against the stated modification goals systematically\n3. **Measurement Validation**: For changes involving rotation, position, size, or alignment, verify through visual measurement\n4. **Reverse Validation**: Actively look for evidence that the modification failed rather than succeeded\n5. **Critical Assessment**: Challenge whether apparent differences are actually the intended differences\n6. **Accessibility Evaluation**: Assess visual accessibility compliance and inclusive design implementation\n7. **Cross-Platform Consistency**: Verify visual consistency across different platforms and devices\n8. **Edge Case Analysis**: Examine edge cases, error states, and boundary conditions\n\n## Mandatory Verification Checklist\n\n- [ ] Have I described the actual visual content objectively?\n- [ ] Have I avoided inferring effects from code changes?\n- [ ] For rotations: Have I confirmed aspect ratio changes?\n- [ ] For positioning: Have I verified coordinate differences?\n- [ ] For sizing: Have I confirmed dimensional changes?\n- [ ] Have I validated color contrast ratios meet WCAG standards?\n- [ ] Have I checked focus indicators and keyboard navigation visuals?\n- [ ] Have I verified responsive breakpoint behavior?\n- [ ] Have I assessed loading states and transitions?\n- [ ] Have I validated error handling and edge cases?\n- [ ] Have I confirmed design system token compliance?\n- [ ] Have I actively searched for failure evidence?\n- [ ] Have I questioned whether ''different'' equals ''correct''?\n\n## Advanced Validation Techniques\n\n- **Pixel Diff Analysis**: Precise change detection through pixel-level comparison\n- **Layout Shift Detection**: Cumulative Layout Shift (CLS) visual assessment\n- **Animation Frame Analysis**: Frame-by-frame animation validation\n- **Cross-Browser Matrix Testing**: Systematic multi-browser visual verification\n- **Accessibility Overlay Testing**: Visual validation with accessibility overlays\n- **High Contrast Mode Testing**: Visual validation in high contrast environments\n- **Reduced Motion Testing**: Animation and motion accessibility validation\n- **Print Preview Validation**: Print stylesheet and layout verification\n\n## Output Requirements\n\n- Start with ''From the visual evidence, I observe...''\n- Provide detailed visual measurements when relevant\n- Clearly state whether goals are achieved, partially achieved, or not achieved\n- If uncertain, explicitly state uncertainty and request clarification\n- Never declare success without concrete visual evidence\n- Include accessibility assessment in all evaluations\n- Provide specific remediation recommendations for identified issues\n- Document edge cases and boundary conditions observed\n\n## Behavioral Traits\n\n- Maintains skeptical approach until visual proof is provided\n- Applies systematic methodology to all visual assessments\n- Considers accessibility and inclusive design in every evaluation\n- Documents findings with precise, measurable observations\n- Challenges assumptions and validates against stated objectives\n- Provides constructive feedback for design and development improvement\n- Stays current with visual testing tools and methodologies\n- Advocates for comprehensive visual quality assurance practices\n\n## Forbidden Behaviors\n\n- Assuming code changes automatically produce visual results\n- Quick conclusions without thorough systematic analysis\n- Accepting ''looks different'' as ''looks correct''\n- Using expectation to replace direct observation\n- Ignoring accessibility implications in visual assessment\n- Overlooking edge cases or error states\n- Making assumptions about user behavior from visual evidence alone\n\n## Example Interactions\n\n- \"Validate that the new button component meets accessibility contrast requirements\"\n- \"Verify that the responsive navigation collapses correctly at mobile breakpoints\"\n- \"Confirm that the loading spinner animation displays smoothly across browsers\"\n- \"Assess whether the error message styling follows the design system guidelines\"\n- \"Validate that the modal overlay properly blocks interaction with background elements\"\n- \"Verify that the dark theme implementation maintains visual hierarchy\"\n- \"Confirm that form validation states provide clear visual feedback\"\n- \"Assess whether the data table maintains readability across different screen sizes\"\n\nYour role is to be the final gatekeeper ensuring UI modifications actually work as intended through uncompromising visual verification with accessibility and inclusive design considerations at the forefront.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:25:56.550Z","qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('scarf005/blog/i18n', 'community', 'scarf005', 'blog', 'scarf005/blog', 'i18n', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.420Z', '2026-02-18T04:25:53.402Z', NULL, '{"id":"scarf005/blog/i18n","name":"i18n","description":{"zh":"i18n 技术是一种自动翻译解决方案，支持韩语、日语和英语","ja":"i18n スキルは、韓国語、英語のコンテンツを自動翻訳する機能です","ko":"i18n 기술은 한국어, 영어, 일본어 콘텐츠를 자동으로 번역하는 솔루션입니다","es":"La habilidad i18n traduce automáticamente contenido siguiendo patrones de estilo personalizados para Koreanos a Inglés y Japonés","fr":"La compétence i18n traduit automatiquement le contenu en suivant des modèles de style personnalisés pour Coréen vers Anglais et Japonais","de":"Die Fähigkeit i18n übersetzt Inhalte automatisch unter Verwendung benutzerdefinierter Stilvorlagen für Koreanisch ins Englische und Japanische","pt":"O skill i18n é uma ferramenta de tradução automática de conteúdo que segue padrões de estilo específicos.","ru":"Навык i18n - это инструмент автоматического перевода контента, следующий определенным стилям.","ar":"مهارة i18n هي أداة ترجمة آلية للمحتوى تتبع أنماطًا محددة من الأسلوب.","en":"blog"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"i18n 技术：自动翻译内容","ja":"i18n スキル：自動翻訳","ko":"i18n 기술: 자동 번역","es":"i18n: Traducción automática de contenido","fr":"i18n : Traduction automatique de contenu","de":"i18n: Automatische Inhaltsübersetzung","pt":"i18n: Tradução Automática de Conteúdo","ru":"i18n: Автоматический перевод контента","ar":"i18n: الترجمة الآلية للمحتوى","en":"i18n"},"description":{"zh":"i18n 技术是一种自动翻译解决方案，支持韩语、日语和英语","ja":"i18n スキルは、韓国語、英語のコンテンツを自動翻訳する機能です","ko":"i18n 기술은 한국어, 영어, 일본어 콘텐츠를 자동으로 번역하는 솔루션입니다","es":"La habilidad i18n traduce automáticamente contenido siguiendo patrones de estilo personalizados para Koreanos a Inglés y Japonés","fr":"La compétence i18n traduit automatiquement le contenu en suivant des modèles de style personnalisés pour Coréen vers Anglais et Japonais","de":"Die Fähigkeit i18n übersetzt Inhalte automatisch unter Verwendung benutzerdefinierter Stilvorlagen für Koreanisch ins Englische und Japanische","pt":"O skill i18n é uma ferramenta de tradução automática de conteúdo que segue padrões de estilo específicos.","ru":"Навык i18n - это инструмент автоматического перевода контента, следующий определенным стилям.","ar":"مهارة i18n هي أداة ترجمة آلية للمحتوى تتبع أنماطًا محددة من الأسلوب.","en":"blog"},"definition":{"en":"blog"},"features":{"zh":["自动翻译韩语、日语和英语内容","保持原有语气和风格","支持多语言博客和文档","适用于编辑文件和维护多语言内容"],"ja":["韓国語、英語のコンテンツを自動翻訳","オリジナルのトーンとスタイルを維持","多言語ブログとドキュメントをサポート","ファイル編集と多言語コンテンツの維持に適しています"],"ko":["한국어, 영어, 일본어 콘텐츠를 자동으로 번역","원래의语气와 스타일을 유지","다국어 블로그와 문서를 지원","파일 편집과 다국어 콘텐츠 유지에 적합"],"es":["Traducción automática de contenido","Patrones de estilo personalizados para Koreanos a Inglés","Patrones de estilo personalizados para Koreanos a Japonés","Mantiene el tono y estilo del contenido original","Ideal para editar archivos con texto coreano","Útil para traducir publicaciones de blog o documentación"],"fr":["Traduction automatique de contenu","Modèles de style personnalisés pour Coréen vers Anglais","Modèles de style personnalisés pour Coréen vers Japonais","Préservation du ton et du style du contenu d''origine","Idéal pour éditer des fichiers avec du texte coréen","Utile pour traduire des billets de blog ou de la documentation"],"de":["Automatische Inhaltsübersetzung","Benutzerdefinierte Stilvorlagen für Koreanisch ins Englische","Benutzerdefinierte Stilvorlagen für Koreanisch ins Japanische","Beibehaltung des Tonfalls und Stils des Originalinhalts","Ideal zum Bearbeiten von Dateien mit koreanischem Text","Nützlich zum Übersetzen von Blog-Beiträgen oder Dokumentationen"],"pt":["Tradução automática de conteúdo","Seguimento de padrões de estilo específicos","Suporte a múltiplos idiomas","Manutenção de conteúdo multilíngue","Preservação do tom e estilo original"],"ru":["Автоматический перевод контента","Следование определенным стилям","Поддержка нескольких языков","Ведение контента на нескольких языках","Сохранение тона и стиля оригинала"],"ar":["الترجمة الآلية للمحتوى","متابعة أنماط محددة من الأسلوب","دعم اللغات المتعددة","صيانة المحتوى المتعدد اللغات","الحفاظ على النبرة والأسلوب الأصلي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["i18n 技术","自动翻译","多语言支持","国际化","韩语翻译","日语翻译","英语翻译"],"ja":["i18n スキル","自動翻訳","多言語サポート","国際化","韓国語翻訳","英語翻訳","日本語翻訳"],"ko":["i18n 기술","자동 번역","다국어 지원","국제화","한국어 번역","영어 번역","일본어 번역"],"es":["i18n","traducción automática","contenido multilingüe","patrones de estilo personalizados","Koreanos a Inglés","Koreanos a Japonés","edición de archivos","traducción de blog","documentación multilingüe"],"fr":["i18n","traduction automatique","contenu multilingue","modèles de style personnalisés","Coréen vers Anglais","Coréen vers Japonais","édition de fichiers","traduction de blog","documentation multilingue"],"de":["i18n","automatische Übersetzung","mehrsprachiger Inhalt","benutzerdefinierte Stilvorlagen","Koreanisch ins Englische","Koreanisch ins Japanische","Dateibearbeitung","Blog-Übersetzung","mehrsprachige Dokumentation"],"pt":["i18n","tradução automática","internacionalização","conteúdo multilíngue","padrões de estilo","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["i18n","автоматический перевод","интернационализация","контент на нескольких языках","стили","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["i18n","الترجمة الآلية","التعريب","المحتوى المتعدد اللغات","أنماط الأسلوب","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"scarf005","repo":"blog","repoPath":"scarf005/blog","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.420Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"i18n","description":"Auto-translate edited files using consistent style patterns","bodyPreview":"## What I do\n\nWhen editing files, automatically translate content following these style patterns:\n\n**Korean to English:**\n\n- `냉혹한 {A}의 세계` → `The {A} *Experience*`\n\n**Korean to Japanese:**\n\n- `냉혹한 {A}의 세계` → `闇が深い{A}の世界`\n\n## When to use me\n\nUse this skill when:\n\n- Editing files that contain Korean text\n- Translating blog posts or documentation\n- Maintaining multilingual content\n\nAlways preserve the tone and style of the original while applying these specific translation patterns.\n\n## Scripts\n\n##","body":"## What I do\n\nWhen editing files, automatically translate content following these style patterns:\n\n**Korean to English:**\n\n- `냉혹한 {A}의 세계` → `The {A} *Experience*`\n\n**Korean to Japanese:**\n\n- `냉혹한 {A}의 세계` → `闇が深い{A}の世界`\n\n## When to use me\n\nUse this skill when:\n\n- Editing files that contain Korean text\n- Translating blog posts or documentation\n- Maintaining multilingual content\n\nAlways preserve the tone and style of the original while applying these specific translation patterns.\n\n## Scripts\n\n### check-translations.ts\n\nCheck which Korean files are missing translations.\n\n```bash\ndeno run --allow-read scripts/check-translations.ts [directory]\n```\n\nOutputs a table of files missing `en` and/or `ja` translations. Exits 0 if all translated, 1 otherwise.\n\n**Run tests:**\n\n```bash\ndeno test scripts/check-translations_test.ts\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:25:53.402Z","qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('orbot-co/github-template-repo/github', 'community', 'orbot-co', 'github-template-repo', 'orbot-co/github-template-repo', 'github', 0, 0, 75, '2026-02-18T01:58:18.370Z', '2026-02-18T05:15:49.079Z', NULL, '{"id":"orbot-co/github-template-repo/github","name":"github","description":{"zh":"GitHub Skill 提供了一个专业的模板仓库，包含了基本的项目文件，帮助开发者简化开发流程","ja":"GitHub Skill はプロフェッショナルなテンプレートリポジトリを提供し、基本的なプロジェクトファイルを含み、開発者が開発プロセスを簡素化するのに役立ちます","ko":"GitHub Skill은 전문적인 템플릿 리포지토리를 제공하며, 기본적인 프로젝트 파일을 포함하여 개발자가 개발 프로세스를 간소화하는 데 도움을 줍니다","es":"La habilidad de GitHub proporciona una forma profesional de interactuar con tus proyectos a través de la línea de comandos","fr":"La compétence GitHub offre un moyen professionnel d''interagir avec vos projets via la ligne de commande","de":"Die GitHub-Fähigkeit bietet eine professionelle Möglichkeit, mit Ihren Projekten über die Kommandozeile zu interagieren","pt":"O GitHub é uma plataforma de repositório de modelos profissionais, permitindo que os desenvolvedores usem o CLI gh para interagir com o repositório e gerenciar pull requests de forma eficiente.","ru":"GitHub - это платформа профессионального шаблона репозитория, позволяющая разработчикам использовать CLI gh для взаимодействия с репозиторием и управления запросами на включение.","ar":"GitHub هو منصة مستودع قوالب محترف، مما يسمح للمطورين باستخدام CLI gh للتفاعل مع المستودع وإدارة الطلبات السحابية بفعالية.","en":"Professional template repository with essential project files"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"GitHub 工具：简化开发流程","ja":"GitHub ツール：開発の効率化","ko":"GitHub 도구: 개발 프로세스 간소화","es":"Herramientas de GitHub para Desarrolladores","fr":"Outils GitHub pour Développeurs","de":"GitHub-Tools für Entwickler","pt":"GitHub: Repositório de Modelos Profissionais","ru":"GitHub: Профессиональный шаблон репозитория","ar":"GitHub: مستودع قوالب محترف","en":"github"},"description":{"zh":"GitHub Skill 提供了一个专业的模板仓库，包含了基本的项目文件，帮助开发者简化开发流程","ja":"GitHub Skill はプロフェッショナルなテンプレートリポジトリを提供し、基本的なプロジェクトファイルを含み、開発者が開発プロセスを簡素化するのに役立ちます","ko":"GitHub Skill은 전문적인 템플릿 리포지토리를 제공하며, 기본적인 프로젝트 파일을 포함하여 개발자가 개발 프로세스를 간소화하는 데 도움을 줍니다","es":"La habilidad de GitHub proporciona una forma profesional de interactuar con tus proyectos a través de la línea de comandos","fr":"La compétence GitHub offre un moyen professionnel d''interagir avec vos projets via la ligne de commande","de":"Die GitHub-Fähigkeit bietet eine professionelle Möglichkeit, mit Ihren Projekten über die Kommandozeile zu interagieren","pt":"O GitHub é uma plataforma de repositório de modelos profissionais, permitindo que os desenvolvedores usem o CLI gh para interagir com o repositório e gerenci...","ru":"GitHub - это платформа профессионального шаблона репозитория, позволяющая разработчикам использовать CLI gh для взаимодействия с репозиторием и управления за...","ar":"GitHub هو منصة مستودع قوالب محترف، مما يسمح للمطورين باستخدام CLI gh للتفاعل مع المستودع وإدارة الطلبات السحابية بفعالية.","en":"Professional template repository with essential project files"},"definition":{"en":"Professional template repository with essential project files"},"features":{"zh":["使用 gh CLI 与 GitHub 交互","检查 PR 的 CI 状态","列出最近的工作流运行","查看运行日志","简化开发流程"],"ja":["gh CLI を使用して GitHub とインタラクションする","PR の CI 状態をチェックする","最近のワークフロー実行をリストする","実行ログを表示する","開発プロセスを簡素化する"],"ko":["gh CLI를 사용하여 GitHub와 인터랙션","PR의 CI 상태를 확인","최근의 워크플로 실행을 목록화","실행 로그를 표시","개발 프로세스를 간소화"],"es":["Interactuar con GitHub a través de la línea de comandos","Verificar el estado de las solicitudes de extracción","Listar ejecuciones de flujo de trabajo recientes","Ver detalles de ejecuciones y pasos fallidos","Ver registros de pasos fallidos"],"fr":["Interagir avec GitHub via la ligne de commande","Vérifier le statut des demandes d''extraction","Lister les exécutions de workflow récentes","Afficher les détails des exécutions et des étapes échouées","Afficher les journaux des étapes échouées"],"de":["Interaktion mit GitHub über die Kommandozeile","Überprüfen des Status von Pull-Requests","Auflisten der letzten Workflow-Ausführungen","Anzeigen von Ausführungsdetails und fehlgeschlagenen Schritten","Anzeigen von Logdateien fehlgeschlagener Schritte"],"pt":["Uso do CLI gh para interagir com o repositório","Gerenciamento de pull requests","Verificação do status de CI","Listagem de execuções de workflow recentes","Visualização de execuções e identificação de etapas com falha"],"ru":["Использование CLI gh для взаимодействия с репозиторием","Управление запросами на включение","Проверка статуса CI","Список недавних запусков рабочего процесса","Просмотр запусков и определение шагов с ошибками"],"ar":["استخدام CLI gh للتفاعل مع المستودع","إدارة الطلبات السحابية","التحقق من حالة CI","قائمة تشغيل سير العمل الأخيرة","عرض التشغيل وتحديد الخطوات الفاشلة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GitHub","开发工具","gh CLI","PR 检查","工作流运行","开发流程","简化开发","提高效率"],"ja":["GitHub","開発ツール","gh CLI","PR チェック","ワークフロー実行","開発プロセス","簡素化開発","効率化"],"ko":["GitHub","개발 도구","gh CLI","PR 확인","워크플로 실행","개발 프로세스","개발 간소화","효율성 향상"],"es":["GitHub para desarrolladores","CLI de GitHub","solicitudes de extracción","flujo de trabajo","ejecuciones de flujo de trabajo","registers de errores"],"fr":["GitHub pour développeurs","CLI GitHub","demandes d''extraction","workflow","exécutions de workflow","journaux d''erreurs"],"de":["GitHub für Entwickler","GitHub-CLI","Pull-Requests","Workflow","Workflow-Ausführungen","Fehlerprotokolle"],"pt":["github","cli gh","repositório de modelos profissionais","gerenciamento de pull requests","verificação de status de ci","execuções de workflow","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["github","cli gh","репозиторий профессиональных шаблонов","управление запросами на включение","проверка статуса ci","запуски рабочего процесса","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["github","cli gh","مستودع قوالب محترف","إدارة الطلبات السحابية","التحقق من حالة ci","تشغيل سير العمل","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"orbot-co","repo":"github-template-repo","repoPath":"orbot-co/github-template-repo","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:58:18.370Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"github","description":"Interact with GitHub using the `gh` CLI. Use `gh issue`, `gh pr`, `gh run`, and `gh api` for issues, PRs, CI runs, and advanced queries.","bodyPreview":"# GitHub Skill\n\nUse the `gh` CLI to interact with GitHub. Always specify `--repo owner/repo` when not in a git directory, or use URLs directly.\n\n## Pull Requests\n\nCheck CI status on a PR:\n```bash\ngh pr checks 55 --repo owner/repo\n```\n\nList recent workflow runs:\n```bash\ngh run list --repo owner/repo --limit 10\n```\n\nView a run and see which steps failed:\n```bash\ngh run view <run-id> --repo owner/repo\n```\n\nView logs for failed steps only:\n```bash\ngh run view <run-id> --repo owner/repo --log-failed","body":"# GitHub Skill\n\nUse the `gh` CLI to interact with GitHub. Always specify `--repo owner/repo` when not in a git directory, or use URLs directly.\n\n## Pull Requests\n\nCheck CI status on a PR:\n```bash\ngh pr checks 55 --repo owner/repo\n```\n\nList recent workflow runs:\n```bash\ngh run list --repo owner/repo --limit 10\n```\n\nView a run and see which steps failed:\n```bash\ngh run view <run-id> --repo owner/repo\n```\n\nView logs for failed steps only:\n```bash\ngh run view <run-id> --repo owner/repo --log-failed\n```\n\n## API for Advanced Queries\n\nThe `gh api` command is useful for accessing data not available through other subcommands.\n\nGet PR with specific fields:\n```bash\ngh api repos/owner/repo/pulls/55 --jq ''.title, .state, .user.login''\n```\n\n## JSON Output\n\nMost commands support `--json` for structured output.  You can use `--jq` to filter:\n\n```bash\ngh issue list --repo owner/repo --json number,title --jq ''.[] | \"\\(.number): \\(.title)\"''\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:15:49.079Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for DevOps Agents requiring automated GitHub interactions and CI/CD pipeline management.","zh":"适用于需要自动化 GitHub 交互和 CI/CD 流水线管理的 DevOps Agent。","ja":"DevOps エージェントが GitHub の自動化と CI/CD パイプライン管理を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"자동화된 GitHub 상호작용 및 CI/CD 파이프라인 관리가 필요한 DevOps 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de DevOps que requieren interacciones automatizadas con GitHub y administración de pipelines de CI/CD.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents DevOps nécessitant des interactions automatisées avec GitHub et une gestion de pipeline CI/CD.","de":"Ideal für DevOps-Agents, die automatisierte Interaktionen mit GitHub und CI/CD-Pipeline-Verwaltung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes DevOps que exigem interações automatizadas do GitHub e gerenciamento de pipeline CI/CD.","ru":"Идеально для агентов DevOps, требующих автоматизированного взаимодействия с GitHub и управления конвейерами CI/CD.","ar":"مثالي لعميل DevOps الذي يتطلب تفاعلات GitHub أوتوماتيكية وإدارة خط أنابيب CI/CD."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to interact with GitHub using the `gh` CLI, providing features like checking CI status on pull requests, listing recent workflow runs, and viewing logs for failed steps via protocols like `https` and commands such as `gh pr checks` and `gh run view`.","zh":"赋予代理使用 `gh` CLI 与 GitHub 交互的能力，提供的功能包括检查拉取请求的 CI 状态、列出最近的工作流运行记录和通过协议如 `https` 以及命令如 `gh pr checks` 和 `gh run view` 查看失败步骤的日志。","ja":"エージェントが `gh` CLI を使用して GitHub とやり取りすることを可能にし、プルリクエストの CI ステータスの確認、最近のワークフロー実行のリスト表示、および `https` のようなプロトコルや `gh pr checks` および `gh run view` のようなコマンドを使用して失敗したステップのログを表示するなど、機能を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 `gh` CLI를 사용하여 GitHub와 상호작용할 수 있도록 하여, 풀 리퀘스트의 CI 상태 확인, 최근 워크플로 실행 목록 표시, `https`와 같은 프로토콜 및 `gh pr checks` 및 `gh run view`와 같은 명령을 사용하여 실패한 단계의 로그를 표시하는 등의 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a interactuar con GitHub mediante la CLI `gh`, proporcionando características como comprobar el estado de CI en solicitudes de extracción, listar ejecuciones de flujo de trabajo recientes y ver registros para pasos fallidos a través de protocolos como `https` y comandos como `gh pr checks` y `gh run view`.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''interagir avec GitHub à l''aide de la CLI `gh`, offrant des fonctionnalités telles que la vérification de l''état de CI sur les demandes d''extraction, la liste des exécutions de workflow récentes et l''affichage des journaux pour les étapes ayant échoué via des protocoles tels que `https` et des commandes telles que `gh pr checks` et `gh run view`.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, mit GitHub über die `gh`-CLI zu interagieren und bietet Funktionen wie das Überprüfen des CI-Status bei Pull-Requests, das Auflisten kürzlich ausgeführter Workflow-Läufe und das Anzeigen von Protokollen für fehlgeschlagene Schritte über Protokolle wie `https` und Befehle wie `gh pr checks` und `gh run view`.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a interagir com o GitHub usando a CLI `gh`, fornecendo recursos como verificar o status do CI em solicitações de pull, listar execuções de fluxo de trabalho recentes e visualizar logs para etapas com falha por meio de protocolos como `https` e comandos como `gh pr checks` e `gh run view`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью взаимодействовать с GitHub с помощью CLI `gh`, предоставляя функции, такие как проверка статуса CI в запросах на включение, перечисление недавних запусков рабочих процессов и просмотр журналов для неудачных шагов по протоколам, таким как `https`, и командам, таким как `gh pr checks` и `gh run view`.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على التفاعل مع GitHub باستخدام واجهة سطر الأوامر `gh` ، مع توفير ميزات مثل التحقق من حالة CI على طلبات السحب ، وlisting تشغيل تدفق العمل الأخير ، وعرض سجلات الخطوات الفاشلة عبر بروتوكولات مثل `https` والأوامر مثل `gh pr checks` و `gh run view`."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating pull request checks","Debugging failed workflow runs","Monitoring CI/CD pipeline status"],"zh":["自动化拉取请求检查","调试失败的工作流运行","监控 CI/CD 流水线状态"],"ja":["プルリクエストのチェックの自動化","失敗したワークフロー実行のデバッグ","CI/CD パイプラインのステータスの監視"],"ko":["풀 리퀘스트 체크 자동화","실패한 워크플로 실행 디버깅","CI/CD 파이프라인 상태 모니터링"],"es":["Automatizar comprobaciones de solicitudes de extracción","Depurar ejecuciones de flujo de trabajo fallidas","Supervisar el estado del pipeline de CI/CD"],"fr":["Automatiser les vérifications des demandes d''extraction","Déboguer les exécutions de workflow ayant échoué","Surveiller l''état du pipeline CI/CD"],"de":["Automatisieren von Überprüfungen von Pull-Requests","Fehlerhafte Workflow-Ausführungen debuggen","Überwachung des CI/CD-Pipeline-Status"],"pt":["Automatizar verificações de solicitação de pull","Depurar execuções de fluxo de trabalho com falha","Monitorar status do pipeline CI/CD"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверки запросов на включение","Отладить неудачные запуски рабочих процессов","Мониторить статус конвейера CI/CD"],"ar":["أتمتة فحص طلبات السحب","تصحيح أخطاء تشغيل تدفق العمل","مراقبة حالة خط أنابيب CI/CD"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires `gh` CLI installation","Needs repository owner and name specification or direct URL access"],"zh":["需要 `gh` CLI 安装","需要仓库所有者和名称的指定或直接 URL 访问"],"ja":["`gh` CLI のインストールが必要","リポジトリの所有者と名前の指定、または直接の URL アクセスが必要"],"ko":["`gh` CLI 설치가 필요","리포지토리 소유자 및 이름의 지정 또는 직접 URL 액세스가 필요"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de la CLI `gh`","Necesita la especificación del propietario y el nombre del repositorio o el acceso directo a la URL"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de la CLI `gh`","Nécessite la spécification du propriétaire et du nom du référentiel ou l''accès direct à l''URL"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation der `gh`-CLI","Benötigt die Angabe des Repository-Besitzers und -Namens oder den direkten URL-Zugriff"],"pt":["Exige instalação da CLI `gh`","Necessita de especificação do proprietário do repositório e do nome ou acesso direto à URL"],"ru":["Требует установки CLI `gh`","Требует указания владельца репозитория и его имени или прямого доступа к URL"],"ar":["يتطلب تركيب واجهة سطر الأوامر `gh` ","يتطلب تحديد صاحب المستودع واسمه أو الوصول المباشر إلى URL"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
