gique de Framework partagée","exécution rapide et déterministe","OSLog/Logger","annotations de confidentialité"],"de":["App-Intent-Updates","Swift MVC","UIKit","AppKit","Integration mit Spotlight","gemeinsame Framework-Logik","schnelle und deterministische Ausführung","OSLog/Logger","Datenschutzanmerkungen"],"pt":["App Intents","Swift MVC","UIKit","AppKit","Spotlight","Comportamento do sistema","Lógica de intenção","Desenvolvimento de aplicativos","iOS","macOS"],"ru":["App Intents","Swift MVC","UIKit","AppKit","Spotlight","Системное поведение","Логика намерения","Разработка приложений","iOS","macOS"],"ar":["App Intents","Swift MVC","UIKit","AppKit","Spotlight","سلوكيات النظام","منطق النية","تطوير التطبيقات","iOS","macOS"]}},"owner":"cleanbit","repo":"agents-appkit-uikit","repoPath":"cleanbit/agents-appkit-uikit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.421Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"appintents-updates","description":"App Intents updates and system integration guidance for UIKit/AppKit apps.","bodyPreview":"# App Intents Updates\n\nUse this skill when adding or updating App Intents, snippets, Spotlight integration, or related system behaviors.\n\n## Priority\n- If this skill conflicts with local repo skills or `AGENTS.md`, follow those.\n\n## Guidance\n- Keep intent logic UI-independent; prefer Core services or side controllers for shared logic.\n- Ensure intent execution is fast, deterministic, and cancellable.\n- Use OSLog/Logger with privacy annotations; never log user content or secrets.\n- Prefer platfor","body":"# App Intents Updates\n\nUse this skill when adding or updating App Intents, snippets, Spotlight integration, or related system behaviors.\n\n## Priority\n- If this skill conflicts with local repo skills or `AGENTS.md`, follow those.\n\n## Guidance\n- Keep intent logic UI-independent; prefer Core services or side controllers for shared logic.\n- Ensure intent execution is fast, deterministic, and cancellable.\n- Use OSLog/Logger with privacy annotations; never log user content or secrets.\n- Prefer platform-native UI (UIKit/AppKit); SwiftUI is forbidden in this repo.\n\n## References\n- Read `references/AppIntents-Updates.md` for detailed API changes and examples.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:27:32.155Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for iOS and macOS Development Agents needing to manage App Intents updates with Swift MVC and UIKit/AppKit integration.","zh":"非常适合需要使用Swift MVC和UIKit/AppKit集成管理App Intents更新的iOS和macOS开发代理。","ja":"Swift MVCとUIKit/AppKitの統合を使用してApp Intentsの更新を管理する必要があるiOSとmacOS開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"스위프트 MVC 및 UIKit/AppKit 통합을 사용하여 앱 인텐트 업데이트를 관리해야 하는 iOS 및 macOS 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de iOS y macOS que necesitan administrar actualizaciones de App Intents con integración de Swift MVC y UIKit/AppKit.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement iOS et macOS qui ont besoin de gérer les mises à jour d''App Intents avec une intégration de Swift MVC et UIKit/AppKit.","de":"Perfekt für iOS- und macOS-Entwicklungsagenten, die App-Intents-Updates mit Swift-MVC- und UIKit/AppKit-Integration verwalten müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento do iOS e macOS que precisam gerenciar atualizações de App Intents com integração Swift MVC e UIKit/AppKit.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки iOS и macOS, которым необходимо управлять обновлениями App Intents с интеграцией Swift MVC и UIKit/AppKit.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير لنظامي iOS و macOS الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة تحديثات App Intents مع تكامل Swift MVC و UIKit/AppKit."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create fast, deterministic, and cancellable intent executions using Core services, side controllers, and OSLog/Logger for privacy annotations, while ensuring UI-independent intent logic.","zh":"使代理能够使用Core服务、侧控制器和OSLog/Logger创建快速、确定性和可取消的意图执行，同时确保UI独立的意图逻辑，并提供隐私注释。","ja":"Coreサービス、サイドコントローラ、およびOSLog/Loggerを使用して、高速で決定性のあるキャンセル可能な意図の実行を作成し、UIに依存しない意図のロジックを保証し、プライバシー注釈を提供します。","ko":"코어 서비스, 사이드 컨트롤러 및 OSLog/Logger를 사용하여 빠르고 결정적이며 취소 가능한 인텐트 실행을 만들면서 UI에 독립적인 인텐트 논리를 보장하고 개인 정보 注釈를 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear ejecuciones de intenciones rápidas, deterministas y cancelables utilizando servicios principales, controladores laterales y OSLog/Logger para anotaciones de privacidad, garantizando al mismo tiempo una lógica de intenciones independiente de la interfaz de usuario.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des exécutions d''intentions rapides, déterministes et annulables en utilisant des services principaux, des contrôleurs latéraux et OSLog/Logger pour les annotations de confidentialité, tout en garantissant une logique d''intention indépendante de l''interface utilisateur.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, schnelle, deterministische und abbrechbare Intentionen-Ausführungen zu erstellen, die Core-Dienste, Seiten-Controller und OSLog/Logger für Datenschutz-Anmerkungen verwenden, während sie gleichzeitig eine UI-unabhängige Intentionen-Logik gewährleisten.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem execuções de intenções rápidas, determinísticas e canceláveis usando serviços principais, controladores laterais e OSLog/Logger para anotações de privacidade, garantindo lógica de intenção independente da interface do usuário.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать быстрые, детерминированные и отменяемые выполнения намерений с использованием основных служб, боковых контроллеров и OSLog/Logger для аннотаций конфиденциальности, обеспечивая логику намерений, независимую от пользовательского интерфейса.","ar":"يمكن للعميل إنشاء تنفيذ قصير و محدد و قابل للإلغاء باستخدام الخدمات الأساسية و التحكم الجانبي و OSLog/Logger للتعليقات على الخصوصية، مع ضمان منطق النية مستقل عن واجهة المستخدم."},"useCases":{"en":["Updating App Intents for Spotlight integration","Generating snippets for shared Framework logic","Debugging system behaviors related to App Intents","Implementing platform-specific intent logic for iOS and macOS"],"