جيثاب","مصادقة مايكروسوفت","أمان المصادقة"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.421Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"oauth-integrations","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# OAuth Integrations for Edge Environments\n\nImplement GitHub and Microsoft OAuth in Cloudflare Workers and other edge runtimes.\n\n## GitHub OAuth\n\n### Required Headers\n\nGitHub API has strict requirements that differ from other providers.\n\n| Header | Requirement |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `User-Agent` | **REQUIRED** - Returns 403 without it |\n| `Accept` | `application/vnd.github+json` recommended |\n\n```typescript\nconst resp = await fetch(''https://api.github.com/user'', {\n  headers: {\n    Authoriz","body":"# OAuth Integrations for Edge Environments\n\nImplement GitHub and Microsoft OAuth in Cloudflare Workers and other edge runtimes.\n\n## GitHub OAuth\n\n### Required Headers\n\nGitHub API has strict requirements that differ from other providers.\n\n| Header | Requirement |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `User-Agent` | **REQUIRED** - Returns 403 without it |\n| `Accept` | `application/vnd.github+json` recommended |\n\n```typescript\nconst resp = await fetch(''https://api.github.com/user'', {\n  headers: {\n    Authorization: `Bearer ${accessToken}`,\n    ''User-Agent'': ''MyApp/1.0'',  // Required!\n    ''Accept'': ''application/vnd.github+json'',\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Private Email Handling\n\nGitHub users can set email to private (`/user` returns `email: null`).\n\n```typescript\nif (!userData.email) {\n  const emails = await fetch(''https://api.github.com/user/emails'', { headers })\n    .then(r => r.json());\n  userData.email = emails.find(e => e.primary && e.verified)?.email;\n}\n```\n\nRequires `user:email` scope.\n\n### Token Exchange\n\nToken exchange returns form-encoded by default. Add Accept header for JSON:\n\n```typescript\nconst tokenResponse = await fetch(''https://github.com/login/oauth/access_token'', {\n  method: ''POST'',\n  headers: {\n    ''Content-Type'': ''application/x-www-form-urlencoded'',\n    ''Accept'': ''application/json'',  // Get JSON response\n  },\n  body: new URLSearchParams({ code, client_id, client_secret, redirect_uri }),\n});\n```\n\n### GitHub OAuth Notes\n\n| Issue | Solution |\n|-------|----------|\n| Callback URL | Must be EXACT - no wildcards, no subdirectory matching |\n| Token exchange returns form-encoded | Add `''Accept'': ''application/json''` header |\n| Tokens don''t expire | No refresh flow needed, but revoked = full re-auth |\n\n## Microsoft Entra (Azure AD) OAuth\n\n### Why MSAL Doesn''t Work in Workers\n\nMSAL.js depends on:\n- Browser APIs (localStorage, sessionStorage, DOM)\n- Node.js crypto module\n\nCloudflare''s V8 isolate runtime has neither. Use manual OAuth instead:\n1. Manual OAuth URL construction\n2. Direct token exchange via fetch\n3. JWT validation with `jose` library\n\n### Required Scopes\n\n```typescript\n// For user identity (email, name, profile picture)\nconst scope = ''openid email profile User.Read'';\n\n// For refresh tokens (long-lived sessions)\nconst scope = ''openid email profile User.Read offline_access'';\n```\n\n**Critical**: `User.Read` is required for Microsoft Graph `/me` endpoint. Without it, token exchange succeeds but user info fetch returns 403.\n\n### User Info Endpoint\n\n```typescript\n// Microsoft Graph /me endpoint\nconst resp = await fetch(''https://graph.microsoft.com/v1.0/me'', {\n  headers: { Authorization: `Bearer ${accessToken}` },\n});\n\n// Email may be in different fields\nconst email = data.mail || data.userPrincipalName;\n```\n\n### Tenant Configuration\n\n| Tenant Value | Who Can Sign In |\n|--------------|-----------------|\n| `common` | Any Microsoft account (personal + work) |\n| `organizations` | Work/school accounts only |\n| `consumers` | Personal Microsoft accounts only |\n| `{tenant-id}` | Specific organization only |\n\n### Azure Portal Setup\n\n1. App Registration → New registration\n2. Platform: **Web** (not SPA) for server-side OAuth\n3. Redirect URIs: Add both `/callback` and `/admin/callback`\n4. Certificates & secrets → New client secret\n\n### Token Lifetimes\n\n| Token Type | Default Lifetime | Notes |\n|------------|------------------|-------|\n| Access token | 60-90 minutes | Configurable via token lifetime policies |\n| Refresh token | 90 days | Revoked on password change |\n| ID token | 60 minutes | Same as access token |\n\n**Best Practice**: Always request `offline_access` scope and implement refresh token flow for sessions longer than 1 hour.\n\n## Common Corrections\n\n| If Claude suggests... | Use instead... |\n|----------------------|----------------|\n| GitHub fetch without User-Agent | Add `''User-Agent'': ''AppName/1.0''` (REQUIRED) |\n| Using MSAL.js in Workers | Manual OAuth + jose for JWT validation |\n| Microsoft scope without User.Read | Add `User.Read` scope |\n| Fetching email from token claims only | Use Graph `/me` endpoint |\n\n## Error Reference\n\n### GitHub Errors\n\n| Error | Cause | Fix |\n|-------|-------|-----|\n| 403 Forbidden | Missing User-Agent header | Add User-Agent header |\n| `email: null` | User has private email | Fetch `/user/emails` with `user:email` scope |\n\n### Microsoft Errors\n\n| Error | Cause | Fix |\n|-------|-------|-----|\n| AADSTS50058 | Silent auth failed | Use interactive flow |\n| AADSTS700084 | Refresh token expired | Re-authenticate user |\n| 403 on Graph /me | Missing User.Read scope | Add User.Read to scopes |\n\n## Reference\n\n- GitHub API: https://docs.github.com/en/rest\n- GitHub OAuth: https://docs.github.com/en/apps/oauth-apps\n- Microsoft Graph permissions: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/graph/permissions-reference\n- AADSTS error codes: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/entra/identity-platform/reference-error-codes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:28:07.213Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Edge Runtime Agents requiring secure GitHub and Microsoft OAuth integrations.","zh":"非常适合需要安全的GitHub和Microsoft OAuth集成的Edge Runtime Agents。","ja":"GitHubおよびMicrosoft OAuthのセキュアな統合を必要とするEdge Runtime Agentsに最適です。","ko":"보안 GitHub 및 Microsoft OAuth 통합이 필요한 Edge Runtime 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de tiempo de ejecución de Edge que requieren integraciones de GitHub y Microsoft OAuth seguras.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de runtime Edge nécessitant des intégrations GitHub et Microsoft OAuth sécurisées.","de":"Perfekt für Edge-Laufzeit-Agenten, die sichere GitHub- und Microsoft-OAuth-Integrationen erfordern.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Tempo de Execução de Borda que exigem integrações seguras do GitHub e do OAuth da Microsoft.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов среды Edge Runtime, требующих безопасных интеграций GitHub и Microsoft OAuth.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تشغيل الحواف التي تتطلب تكاملات آمنة لجيت هاب وأوث 2 من مايكروسوفت."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to authenticate with GitHub and Microsoft using OAuth, leveraging Cloudflare Workers and handling strict API requirements such as User-Agent headers and Accept application/vnd.github+json formats.","zh":"赋予代理通过OAuth使用GitHub和Microsoft进行身份验证的能力，利用Cloudflare Workers并处理严格的API要求，例如User-Agent头和接受application/vnd.github+json格式。","ja":"OAuthを使用してGitHubおよびMicrosoftと認証するエージェントを可能にし、Cloudflare Workersを活用し、User-AgentヘッダーやAccept application/vnd.github+json形式などの厳格なAPI要件を処理します。","ko":"OAuth를 사용하여 GitHub 및 Microsoft와 인증할 수 있는 에이전트를 활성화하며, Cloudflare Workers를 활용하여 User-Agent 헤더 및 application/vnd.github+json 형식과 같은 엄격한 API 요구 사항을 처리합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a autenticarse con GitHub y Microsoft mediante OAuth, aprovechando Cloudflare Workers y manejando estrictos requisitos de API como encabezados User-Agent y formatos de aplicación Accept application/vnd.github+json.","fr":"Permet aux agents de s''authentifier auprès de GitHub et Microsoft à l''aide d''OAuth, en exploitant Cloudflare Workers et en gérant les exigences d''API strictes telles que les en-têtes User-Agent et les formats d''application Accept application/vnd.github+json.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, sich mit GitHub und Microsoft über OAuth zu authentifizieren, indem es Cloudflare Workers nutzt und strenge API-Anforderungen wie User-Agent-Header und Accept-Anwendung/formate application/vnd.github+json verwaltet.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a se autenticarem com o GitHub e a Microsoft usando OAuth, aproveitando os Cloudflare Workers e lidando com requisitos de API rigorosos, como cabeçalhos User-Agent e formatos Accept application/vnd.github+json.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью аутентификации с GitHub и Microsoft с помощью OAuth, используя Cloudflare Workers и обрабатывая строгие требования API, такие как заголовки User-Agent и форматы Accept application/vnd.github+json.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من المصادقة مع جيت هاب ومايكروسوفت باستخدام أوث 2، مستفيداً من عمال كلاود فلير ومعالجة متطلبات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات الصارمة مثل رؤوس المستخدم وتنسيقات Accept application/vnd.github+json."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing GitHub OAuth for edge environments","Authenticating Microsoft services in Cloudflare Workers","Handling strict GitHub API header requirements"],"zh":["为边缘环境实现GitHub OAuth","在Cloudflare Workers中对Microsoft服务进行身份验证","处理严格的GitHub API头要求"],"ja":["エッジ環境でのGitHub OAuthの実装","Cloudflare WorkersでのMicrosoftサービスへの認証","厳格なGitHub APIヘッダーの要件の処理"],"ko":["에지 환경에서 GitHub OAuth 구현","Cloudflare Workers에서 Microsoft 서비스 인증","엄격한 GitHub API 헤더 요구 사항 처리"],"es":["Implementar OAuth de GitHub para entornos de borde","Autenticar servicios de Microsoft en Cloudflare Workers","Manejar requisitos estrictos de encabezados de API de GitHub"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre l''OAuth GitHub pour les environnements de bord","Authentifier les services Microsoft dans Cloudflare Workers","Gérer les exigences strictes d''en-têtes d''API GitHub"],"de":["GitHub-OAuth für Edge-Umgebungen implementieren","Microsoft-Dienste in Cloudflare Workers authentifizieren","Strenge Anforderungen an GitHub-API-Header verwalten"],"pt":["Implementação do OAuth do GitHub para ambientes de borda","Autenticação de serviços da Microsoft em Cloudflare Workers","Manipulação de requisitos rigorosos de cabeçalho de API do GitHub"],"ru":["Реализация OAuth GitHub для среды Edge","Аутентификация служб Microsoft в Cloudflare Workers","Обработка строгих требований заголовков API GitHub"],"ar":["تنفيذ أوث 2 لجيت هاب في بيئات الحواف","المصادقة على خدمات مايكروسوفت في عمال كلاود فلير","معالجة متطلبات رؤوس واجهة برمجة التطبيقات الصارمة لجيت هاب"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires specific User-Agent header","Limited to GitHub and Microsoft OAuth providers","Dependent on Cloudflare Workers or similar edge runtimes"],"zh":["需要特定的User-Agent头","仅限于GitHub和Microsoft OAuth提供商","依赖于Cloudflare Workers或类似的边缘运行时"],"ja":["特定のUser-Agentヘッダーが必要","GitHubおよびMicrosoft OAuthプロバイダーのみ","Cloudflare Workersまたは同等のエッジランタイムに依存"],"ko":["특정 User-Agent 헤더가 필요함","GitHub 및 Microsoft OAuth 공급자에만 제한됨","Cloudflare Workers 또는 유사한 에지 런타임에 의존"],"es":["Requiere un encabezado User-Agent específico","Limitado a los proveedores de OAuth de GitHub y Microsoft","Dependiente de Cloudflare Workers o entornos de tiempo de ejecución de Edge similares"],"fr":["Nécessite un en-tête User-Agent spécifique","Limité aux fournisseurs d''OAuth GitHub et Microsoft","Dépendant de Cloudflare Workers ou de runtime de bord similaires"],"de":["Benötigt einen bestimmten User-Agent-Header","Begrenzt auf GitHub- und Microsoft-OAuth-Anbieter","Abhängig von Cloudflare Workers oder ähnlichen Edge-Laufzeitumgebungen"],"pt":["Exige um cabeçalho User-Agent específico","Limitado a provedores de OAuth do GitHub e da Microsoft","Dependente de Cloudflare Workers ou ambientes de tempo de execução de borda semelhantes"],"ru":["Требует конкретного заголовка User-Agent","Ограничен поставщиками OAuth GitHub и Microsoft","Зависит от Cloudflare Workers или аналогичных среды Edge Runtime"],"ar":["يتطلب رأس مستخدم-عامل معين","محدود بمزودي أوث 2 لجيت هاب ومايكروسوفت","يعتمد على عمال كلاود فلير أو بيئات تشغيل الحواف المماثلة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ROU-Technology/ng-utils/angular-forms', 'community', 'ROU-Technology', 'ng-utils', 'ROU-Technology/ng-utils', 'angular-forms', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.421Z', '2026-02-18T04:27:44.389Z', NULL, '{"id":"ROU-Technology/ng-utils/angular-forms","name":"angular-forms","description":{"zh":"Angular Signal Forms 提供自动双向绑定、基于模式的验证和反応字段状态，帮助您构建类型安全的表单","ja":"Angular Signal Forms は自動的な双方向バインディング、スキーマベースのバリデーション、リアクティブなフィールド状態を提供し、型安全のフォームを構築するのに役立ちます","ko":"Angular Signal Forms 는 자동 두-way 바인딩, 스키마 기반 유효성 검사 및 반응 필드 상태를 제공하여 타입 안전한 폼을 구축하는 데 도움이 됩니다","es":"Angular Signal Forms es una API experimental que permite crear formularios reactivos y seguros con enlace bidireccional automático y validación basada en esquemas.","fr":"Angular Signal Forms est une API expérimentale qui permet de créer des formulaires réactifs et sécurisés avec un binding bidirectionnel automatique et une validation basée sur des schémas.","de":"Angular Signal Forms ist eine experimentelle API, mit der reaktive und sichere Formulare mit automatischem bidirektionalem Binding und schemabasierter Validierung erstellt werden können.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Angular 表单：Signal Forms 入门","ja":"Angular フォーム：Signal Forms ガイド","ko":"Angular 폼: Signal Forms 시작하기","es":"Formularios de Angular: Signal Forms","fr":"Formulaires Angular: Signal Forms","de":"Angular-Formulare: Signal Forms","en":"angular-forms"},"description":{"zh":"Angular Signal Forms 提供自动双向绑定、基于模式的验证和反応字段状态，帮助您构建类型安全的表单","ja":"Angular Signal Forms は自動的な双方向バインディング、スキーマベースのバリデーション、リアクティブなフィールド状態を提供し、型安全のフォームを構築するのに役立ちます","ko":"Angular Signal Forms 는 자동 두-way 바인딩, 스키마 기반 유효성 검사 및 반응 필드 상태를 제공하여 타입 안전한 폼을 구축하는 데 도움이 됩니다","es":"Angular Signal Forms es una API experimental que permite crear formularios reactivos y seguros con enlace bidireccional automático y validación basada en esq...","fr":"Angular Signal Forms est une API expérimentale qui permet de créer des formulaires réactifs et sécurisés avec un binding bidirectionnel automatique et une va...","de":"Angular Signal Forms ist eine experimentelle API, mit der reaktive und sichere Formulare mit automatischem bidirektionalem Binding und schemabasierter Validi...","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["自动双向绑定","基于模式的验证","反应字段状态","类型安全","实验性的 Signal Forms API"],"ja":["自動的な双方向バインディング","スキーマベースのバリデーション","リアクティブなフィールド状態","型安全","実験的な Signal Forms API"],"ko":["자동 두-way 바인딩","스키마 기반 유효성 검사","반응 필드 상태","타입 안전","실험적인 Signal Forms API"],"es":["Enlace bidireccional automático","Validación basada en esquemas","Estado reactivo de los campos","Tipado seguro","Compatibilidad con Angular v21"],"fr":["Binding bidirectionnel automatique","Validation basée sur des schémas","État réactif des champs","Typage sécurisé","Compatibilité avec Angular v21"],"de":["Automatisches bidirektionales Binding","Schemabasierte Validierung","Reaktiver Feldzustand","Sicheres Typisieren","Kompatibilität mit Angular v21"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Angular 表单","Signal Forms","类型安全","反应式表单","自动双向绑定","基于模式的验证"],"ja":["Angular フォーム","Signal Forms","型安全","反応性フォーム","自動的な双方向バインディング","スキーマベースのバリデーション"],"ko":["Angular 폼","Signal Forms","타입 안전","반응형 폼","자동 두-way 바인딩","스키마 기반 유효성 검사"],"es":["Formularios de Angular","Signal Forms","Formularios reactivos","Enlace bidireccional","Validación basada en esquemas","Desarrollo web","Angular v21"],"fr":["Formulaires Angular","Signal Forms","Formulaires réactifs","Binding bidirectionnel","Validation basée sur des schémas","Développement web","Angular v21"],"de":["Angular-Formulare","Signal Forms","Reaktive Formulare","Bidirektionales Binding","Schemabasierte Validierung","Webentwicklung","Angular v21"]}},"owner":"ROU-Technology","repo":"ng-utils","repoPath":"ROU-Technology/ng-utils","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.421Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"angular-forms","description":"Build signal-based forms in Angular v21+ using the new Signal Forms API. Use for form creation with automatic two-way binding, schema-based validation, field state management, and dynamic forms. Triggers on form implementation, adding validation, creating multi-step forms, or building forms with conditional fields. Signal Forms are experimental but recommended for new Angular projects.","bodyPreview":"# Angular Signal Forms\n\nBuild type-safe, reactive forms using Angular''s Signal Forms API. Signal Forms provide automatic two-way binding, schema-based validation, and reactive field state.\n\n**Note:** Signal Forms are experimental in Angular v21. For production apps requiring stability, see [references/form-patterns.md](references/form-patterns.md) for Reactive Forms patterns.\n\n## Basic Setup\n\n```typescript\nimport { Component, signal } from ''@angular/core'';\nimport { form, FormField, required, ema","body":"# Angular Signal Forms\n\nBuild type-safe, reactive forms using Angular''s Signal Forms API. Signal Forms provide automatic two-way binding, schema-based validation, and reactive field state.\n\n**Note:** Signal Forms are experimental in Angular v21. For production apps requiring stability, see [references/form-patterns.md](references/form-patterns.md) for Reactive Forms patterns.\n\n## Basic Setup\n\n```typescript\nimport { Component, signal } from ''@angular/core'';\nimport { form, FormField, required, email } from ''@angular/forms/signals'';\n\ninterface LoginData {\n  email: string;\n  password: string;\n}\n\n@Component({\n  selector: ''app-login'',\n  imports: [FormField],\n  template: `\n    <form (submit)=\"onSubmit($event)\">\n      <label>\n        Email\n        <input type=\"email\" [formField]=\"loginForm.email\" />\n      </label>\n      @if (loginForm.email().touched() && loginForm.email().invalid()) {\n        <p class=\"error\">{{ loginForm.email().errors()[0].message }}</p>\n      }\n      \n      <label>\n        Password\n        <input type=\"password\" [formField]=\"loginForm.password\" />\n      </label>\n      @if (loginForm.password().touched() && loginForm.password().invalid()) {\n        <p class=\"error\">{{ loginForm.password().errors()[0].message }}</p>\n      }\n      \n      <button type=\"submit\" [disabled]=\"loginForm().invalid()\">Login</button>\n    </form>\n  `,\n})\nexport class LoginComponent {\n  // Form model - a writable signal\n  loginModel = signal<LoginData>({\n    email: '''',\n    password: '''',\n  });\n  \n  // Create form with validation schema\n  loginForm = form(this.loginModel, (schemaPath) => {\n    required(schemaPath.email, { message: ''Email is required'' });\n    email(schemaPath.email, { message: ''Enter a valid email address'' });\n    required(schemaPath.password, { message: ''Password is required'' });\n  });\n  \n  onSubmit(event: Event) {\n    event.preventDefault();\n    if (this.loginForm().valid()) {\n      const credentials = this.loginModel();\n      console.log(''Submitting:'', credentials);\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Form Models\n\nForm models are writable signals that serve as the single source of truth:\n\n```typescript\n// Define interface for type safety\ninterface UserProfile {\n  name: string;\n  email: string;\n  age: number | null;\n  preferences: {\n    newsletter: boolean;\n    theme: ''light'' | ''dark'';\n  };\n}\n\n// Create model signal with initial values\nconst userModel = signal<UserProfile>({\n  name: '''',\n  email: '''',\n  age: null,\n  preferences: {\n    newsletter: false,\n    theme: ''light'',\n  },\n});\n\n// Create form from model\nconst userForm = form(userModel);\n\n// Access nested fields via dot notation\nuserForm.name                    // FieldTree<string>\nuserForm.preferences.theme       // FieldTree<''light'' | ''dark''>\n```\n\n### Reading Values\n\n```typescript\n// Read entire model\nconst data = this.userModel();\n\n// Read field value via field state\nconst name = this.userForm.name().value();\nconst theme = this.userForm.preferences.theme().value();\n```\n\n### Updating Values\n\n```typescript\n// Replace entire model\nthis.userModel.set({\n  name: ''Alice'',\n  email: ''alice@example.com'',\n  age: 30,\n  preferences: { newsletter: true, theme: ''dark'' },\n});\n\n// Update single field\nthis.userForm.name().value.set(''Bob'');\nthis.userForm.age().value.update(age => (age ?? 0) + 1);\n```\n\n## Field State\n\nEach field provides reactive signals for validation, interaction, and availability:\n\n```typescript\nconst emailField = this.form.email();\n\n// Validation state\nemailField.valid()      // true if passes all validation\nemailField.invalid()    // true if has validation errors\nemailField.errors()     // array of error objects\nemailField.pending()    // true if async validation in progress\n\n// Interaction state\nemailField.touched()    // true after focus + blur\nemailField.dirty()      // true after user modification\n\n// Availability state\nemailField.disabled()   // true if field is disabled\nemailField.hidden()     // true if field should be hidden\nemailField.readonly()   // true if field is readonly\n\n// Value\nemailField.value()      // current field value (signal)\n```\n\n### Form-Level State\n\nThe form itself is also a field with aggregated state:\n\n```typescript\n// Form is valid when all interactive fields are valid\nthis.form().valid()\n\n// Form is touched when any field is touched\nthis.form().touched()\n\n// Form is dirty when any field is modified\nthis.form().dirty()\n```\n\n## Validation\n\n### Built-in Validators\n\n```typescript\nimport { \n  form, required, email, min, max, \n  minLength, maxLength, pattern \n} from ''@angular/forms/signals'';\n\nconst userForm = form(this.userModel, (schemaPath) => {\n  // Required field\n  required(schemaPath.name, { message: ''Name is required'' });\n  \n  // Email format\n  email(schemaPath.email, { message: ''Invalid email'' });\n  \n  // Numeric range\n  min(schemaPath.age, 18, { message: ''Must be 18+'' });\n  max(schemaPath.age, 120, { message: ''Invalid age'' });\n  \n  // String/array length\n  minLength(schemaPath.password, 8, { message: ''Min 8 characters'' });\n  maxLength(schemaPath.bio, 500, { message: ''Max 500 characters'' });\n  \n  // Regex pattern\n  pattern(schemaPath.phone, /^\\d{3}-\\d{3}-\\d{4}$/, {\n    message: ''Format: 555-123-4567'',\n  });\n});\n```\n\n### Conditional Validation\n\n```typescript\nconst orderForm = form(this.orderModel, (schemaPath) => {\n  required(schemaPath.promoCode, {\n    message: ''Promo code required for discounts'',\n    when: ({ valueOf }) => valueOf(schemaPath.applyDiscount),\n  });\n});\n```\n\n### Custom Validators\n\n```typescript\nimport { validate } from ''@angular/forms/signals'';\n\nconst signupForm = form(this.signupModel, (schemaPath) => {\n  // Custom validation logic\n  validate(schemaPath.username, ({ value }) => {\n    if (value().includes('' '')) {\n      return { kind: ''noSpaces'', message: ''Username cannot contain spaces'' };\n    }\n    return null;\n  });\n});\n```\n\n### Cross-Field Validation\n\n```typescript\nconst passwordForm = form(this.passwordModel, (schemaPath) => {\n  required(schemaPath.password);\n  required(schemaPath.confirmPassword);\n  \n  // Compare fields\n  validate(schemaPath.confirmPassword, ({ value, valueOf }) => {\n    if (value() !== valueOf(schemaPath.password)) {\n      return { kind: ''mismatch'', message: ''Passwords do not match'' };\n    }\n    return null;\n  });\n});\n```\n\n### Async Validation\n\n```typescript\nimport { validateHttp } from ''@angular/forms/signals'';\n\nconst signupForm = form(this.signupModel, (schemaPath) => {\n  validateHttp(schemaPath.username, {\n    request: ({ value }) => `/api/check-username?u=${value()}`,\n    onSuccess: (response: { taken: boolean }) => {\n      if (response.taken) {\n        return { kind: ''taken'', message: ''Username already taken'' };\n      }\n      return null;\n    },\n    onError: () => ({\n      kind: ''networkError'',\n      message: ''Could not verify username'',\n    }),\n  });\n});\n```\n\n## Conditional Fields\n\n### Hidden Fields\n\n```typescript\nimport { hidden } from ''@angular/forms/signals'';\n\nconst profileForm = form(this.profileModel, (schemaPath) => {\n  hidden(schemaPath.publicUrl, ({ valueOf }) => !valueOf(schemaPath.isPublic));\n});\n```\n\n```html\n@if (!profileForm.publicUrl().hidden()) {\n  <input [formField]=\"profileForm.publicUrl\" />\n}\n```\n\n### Disabled Fields\n\n```typescript\nimport { disabled } from ''@angular/forms/signals'';\n\nconst orderForm = form(this.orderModel, (schemaPath) => {\n  disabled(schemaPath.couponCode, ({ valueOf }) => valueOf(schemaPath.total) < 50);\n});\n```\n\n### Readonly Fields\n\n```typescript\nimport { readonly } from ''@angular/forms/signals'';\n\nconst accountForm = form(this.accountModel, (schemaPath) => {\n  readonly(schemaPath.username); // Always readonly\n});\n```\n\n## Form Submission\n\n```typescript\nimport { submit } from ''@angular/forms/signals'';\n\n@Component({\n  template: `\n    <form (submit)=\"onSubmit($event)\">\n      <input [formField]=\"form.email\" />\n      <input [formField]=\"form.password\" />\n      <button type=\"submit\" [disabled]=\"form().invalid()\">Submit</button>\n    </form>\n  `,\n})\nexport class LoginComponent {\n  model = signal({ email: '''', password: '''' });\n  form = form(this.model, (schemaPath) => {\n    required(schemaPath.email);\n    required(schemaPath.password);\n  });\n  \n  onSubmit(event: Event) {\n    event.preventDefault();\n    \n    // submit() marks all fields touched and runs callback if valid\n    submit(this.form, async () => {\n      await this.authService.login(this.model());\n    });\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Arrays and Dynamic Fields\n\n```typescript\ninterface Order {\n  items: Array<{ product: string; quantity: number }>;\n}\n\n@Component({\n  template: `\n    @for (item of orderForm.items; track $index; let i = $index) {\n      <div>\n        <input [formField]=\"item.product\" placeholder=\"Product\" />\n        <input [formField]=\"item.quantity\" type=\"number\" />\n        <button type=\"button\" (click)=\"removeItem(i)\">Remove</button>\n      </div>\n    }\n    <button type=\"button\" (click)=\"addItem()\">Add Item</button>\n  `,\n})\nexport class OrderComponent {\n  orderModel = signal<Order>({\n    items: [{ product: '''', quantity: 1 }],\n  });\n  \n  orderForm = form(this.orderModel, (schemaPath) => {\n    applyEach(schemaPath.items, (item) => {\n      required(item.product, { message: ''Product required'' });\n      min(item.quantity, 1, { message: ''Min quantity is 1'' });\n    });\n  });\n  \n  addItem() {\n    this.orderModel.update(m => ({\n      ...m,\n      items: [...m.items, { product: '''', quantity: 1 }],\n    }));\n  }\n  \n  removeItem(index: number) {\n    this.orderModel.update(m => ({\n      ...m,\n      items: m.items.filter((_, i) => i !== index),\n    }));\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Displaying Errors\n\n```html\n<input [formField]=\"form.email\" />\n\n@if (form.email().touched() && form.email().invalid()) {\n  <ul class=\"errors\">\n    @for (error of form.email().errors(); track error) {\n      <li>{{ error.message }}</li>\n    }\n  </ul>\n}\n\n@if (form.email().pending()) {\n  <span>Validating...</span>\n}\n```\n\n## Styling Based on State\n\n```html\n<input\n  [formField]=\"form.email\"\n  [class.is-invalid]=\"form.email().touched() && form.email().invalid()\"\n  [class.is-valid]=\"form.email().touched() && form.email().valid()\"\n/>\n```\n\n## Reset Form\n\n```typescript\nasync onSubmit() {\n  if (!this.form().valid()) return;\n  \n  await this.api.submit(this.model());\n  \n  // Clear interaction state\n  this.form().reset();\n  \n  // Clear values\n  this.model.set({ email: '''', password: '''' });\n}\n```\n\nFor Reactive Forms patterns (production-stable), see [references/form-patterns.md](references/form-patterns.md).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:27:44.389Z","qualityScore":40}');
