kills.io","программирование ИИ-пара","разработка программного обеспечения","кодирование агентов"],"ar":["أدوات الترميز للوكلاء","مولد لمهارات الوكلاء","الذكاء الاصطناعي","واجهة سطر الأوامر","agentskills.io","برمجة زوج الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير البرمجيات","ترميز الوكلاء"]}},"owner":"KrystianYCSilva","repo":"hefesto-skill-generator","repoPath":"KrystianYCSilva/hefesto-skill-generator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.421Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"coding-agent-tools","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Coding Agent Tools & Workflows\n\nThis skill guides the setup and usage of the modern \"AI Pair Programmer\" stack.\n\n## How to select AI Coding Tools\n\nChoose tools based on interaction depth.\n> See [CLI Guide](references/cli-guide.md) for detailed comparisons.\n\n| Tool | Type | Best Use Case |\n|------|------|---------------|\n| **Claude Code / Aider** | CLI Agent | Full-file refactoring, multi-file edits, \"Apply this feature\". |\n| **GitHub Copilot** | IDE Ghostwriter | Autocomplete, boilerplate gene","body":"# Coding Agent Tools & Workflows\n\nThis skill guides the setup and usage of the modern \"AI Pair Programmer\" stack.\n\n## How to select AI Coding Tools\n\nChoose tools based on interaction depth.\n> See [CLI Guide](references/cli-guide.md) for detailed comparisons.\n\n| Tool | Type | Best Use Case |\n|------|------|---------------|\n| **Claude Code / Aider** | CLI Agent | Full-file refactoring, multi-file edits, \"Apply this feature\". |\n| **GitHub Copilot** | IDE Ghostwriter | Autocomplete, boilerplate generation, quick unit tests. |\n| **Cursor** | AI-Native IDE | \"Chat with codebase\", semantic search, diff review. |\n| **OpenCode** | Open Interpreter | Local LLM execution, privacy-focused tasks. |\n\n## How to workflow with AI Agents (The \"Coding Vibe\")\n\n1.  **Spec-First**: Don''t write code. Write a Markdown spec (`spec.md`) and ask the agent to \"Implement this spec\".\n2.  **TDD Loop**:\n    -   Ask agent: \"Generate tests for feature X based on spec.\"\n    -   Run tests (Fail).\n    -   Ask agent: \"Write implementation to pass tests.\"\n    -   Run tests (Pass).\n3.  **Reviewer Mode**: Before committing, pipe `git diff` to the agent: \"Review this diff for security issues and potential bugs.\"\n\n## How to integrate AI into CI/CD\n\n-   **PR Reviews**: Use actions (like Codium or custom scripts) to auto-review PRs.\n-   **Commit Messages**: Use `git diff | llm \"generate conventional commit\"` for standardized history.\n-   **Doc Generation**: Auto-generate API docs from code signatures on merge.\n\n## References\n\n-   [CLI Guide & Documentation](references/cli-guide.md)\n-   [Modern AI Coding Stack](references/modern-stack.md)\n-   [CLI & Tool Peculiarities](references/cli-nuances.md)\n-   [Warnings & Pitfalls](references/warnings.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:28:21.272Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Pair Programmer Agents needing advanced coding tools integration and workflow automation.","zh":"非常适合需要高级编码工具集成和工作流自动化的AI配对编程代理。","ja":"高度なコードツールの統合とワークフローの自動化が必要なAIペアプログラマーエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 코딩 도구 통합 및 워크플로 자동화가 필요한 AI 페어 프로그래머 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Programación de Pares de IA que necesitan una integración de herramientas de codificación avanzadas y automatización de flujos de trabajo.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Programmation de Paires d''IA ayant besoin d''outils de codage avancés et d''automatisation de flux de travail.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Programmieragenten, die eine Integration von fortschrittlichen Codierungstools und eine Automatisierung von Workflows benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Programação em Par de IA que necessitam de integração de ferramentas de codificação avançadas e automação de fluxo de trabalho.","ru":"Идеально для агентов-программистов ИИ, которым необходима интеграция передовых инструментов кодирования и автоматизация рабочего процесса.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء برمجة الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى أدوات ترميز متقدمة وتوافق في автоматизация سير العمل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage modern AI coding tools like Claude Code and GitHub Copilot, enabling features such as full-file refactoring, multi-file edits, and autocomplete, while following the agentskills.io standard and academically consolidated best practices.","zh":"使代理能够利用现代AI编码工具，如Claude Code和GitHub Copilot，实现全文件重构、多文件编辑和自动补全等功能，同时遵循agentskills.io标准和学术巩固的最佳实践。","ja":"エージェントがClaude CodeやGitHub Copilotなどの最新のAIコーディングツールを利用できるようにし、ファイルの完全なリファクタリング、複数ファイルの編集、自動補完などの機能を実現しながら、agentskills.io標準と学術的に統合されたベストプラクティスに従わせます。","ko":"에이전트가 Claude Code와 GitHub Copilotなどの 최신 AI 코딩 도구를 활용할 수 있도록 하여 전체 파일 리팩토링, 다중 파일 편집, 자동 완성 등의 기능을 구현하면서 agentskills.io 표준 및 학술적으로 통합된 최적의 규범을 따르도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes aprovechar las herramientas de codificación de IA modernas como Claude Code y GitHub Copilot, habilitando características como la refactorización de archivos completos, ediciones de varios archivos y autocompletar, siguiendo el estándar agentskills.io y las mejores prácticas académicas consolidadas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exploiter les outils de codage d''IA modernes tels que Claude Code et GitHub Copilot, activant des fonctionnalités telles que la refactorisation de fichiers complets, les éditions de plusieurs fichiers et l''autocomplétion, tout en suivant la norme agentskills.io et les meilleures pratiques académiques consolidées.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, moderne KI-Codierungstools wie Claude Code und GitHub Copilot zu nutzen, Funktionen wie die Refaktorierung von ganzen Dateien, die Bearbeitung von mehreren Dateien und die Autocompletion zu aktivieren, während sie den agentskills.io-Standard und die akademisch konsolidierten Best Practices einhalten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitar as ferramentas de codificação de IA modernas, como Claude Code e GitHub Copilot, habilitando recursos como refatoração de arquivo completo, edição de vários arquivos e autocompletar, seguindo o padrão agentskills.io e as melhores práticas consolidadas academicamente.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью использовать современные инструменты кодирования ИИ, такие как Claude Code и GitHub Copilot, что позволяет реализовывать такие функции, как полная рефакторинг файлов, редактирование нескольких файлов и автозаполнение, в соответствии со стандартом agentskills.io и академически обоснованными передовыми методами.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من利用 أدوات برمجة الذكاء الاصطناعي الحديثة مثل Claude Code و GitHub Copilot، وتتمكن من الميزات مثل إعادة هيكلة الملف الكامل، وتعديل ملفات متعددة، وأتمتة الإكمال، مع اتباع معيار agentskills.io وأفضل الممارسات الأكاديمية الموحدة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code reviews with AI-powered tools","Generating boilerplate code using IDE ghostwriters like GitHub Copilot","Refactoring large codebases with CLI agents such as Claude Code"],"zh":["使用AI驱动的工具自动进行代码审查","使用IDE虚拟作者（如GitHub Copilot）生成样板代码","使用CLI代理（如Claude Code）重构大型代码库"],"ja":["AI駆動のツールを使用してコードレビューを自動化する","IDEのゴーストライター（例：GitHub Copilot）を使用してボイラープレートコードを生成する","CLIエージェント（例：Claude Code）を使用して大規模なコードベースをリファクタリングする"],"ko":["AI 구동 도구를 사용하여 코드 리뷰를 자동화하는 것","IDE 고스트라이터(GitHub Copilot 등)를 사용하여 보일러플레이트 코드를 생성하는 것","CLI 에이전트(Claude Code 등)를 사용하여 대규모 코드베이스를 리팩토링하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar las revisiones de código con herramientas de IA","Generar código de plantilla utilizando escritores fantasmales de IDE como GitHub Copilot","Reestructurar grandes bases de código con agentes de CLI como Claude Code"],"fr":["Automatiser les examens de code avec des outils d''IA","Générer du code de modèle à l''aide d''écritures fantômes d''IDE comme GitHub Copilot","Réorganiser de grandes bases de code avec des agents de CLI tels que Claude Code"],"de":["Automatisieren von Code-Reviews mit KI-gesteuerten Tools","Generieren von Vorlagen-Code unter Verwendung von IDE-Ghostwritern wie GitHub Copilot","Umstrukturieren von großen Codebasen mit CLI-Agents wie Claude Code"],"pt":["Automatizar revisões de código com ferramentas alimentadas por IA","Gerar código de modelo usando ghostwriters de IDE como GitHub Copilot","Reestruturar grandes bases de código com agentes de CLI como Claude Code"],"ru":["Автоматизация проверки кода с помощью инструментов ИИ","Генерация кода-шаблона с помощью ghostwriters IDE, таких как GitHub Copilot","Переструктуризация больших кодовых баз с помощью агентов CLI, таких как Claude Code"],"ar":["أتمتة مراجعة الشفرة باستخدام أدوات مدعومة بالذكاء الاصطناعي","توليد رمز القالب باستخدام كتّاب IDE مثل GitHub Copilot","إعادة هيكلة مجموعات كبيرة من الشفرة باستخدام وكلاء CLI مثل Claude Code"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires compatibility with multiple CLIs and IDEs","Dependent on the agentskills.io standard for skill development"],"zh":["需要与多个CLI和IDE兼容","依赖于agentskills.io标准进行技能开发"],"ja":["複数のCLIおよびIDEとの互換性が必要","スキル開発のためのagentskills.io標準への依存"],"ko":["여러 CLI 및 IDE와의 호환성이 필요","에이전트스킬 개발을 위한 agentskills.io 표준 의존성"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con varios CLI e IDE","Dependiente del estándar agentskills.io para el desarrollo de habilidades"],"fr":["Nécessite une compatibilité avec plusieurs CLI et IDE","Dépend de la norme agentskills.io pour le développement de compétences"],"de":["Benötigt Kompatibilität mit mehreren CLIs und IDEs","Ist abhängig vom agentskills.io-Standard für die Entwicklung von Fähigkeiten"],"pt":["Exige compatibilidade com várias CLIs e IDEs","Dependente do padrão agentskills.io para desenvolvimento de habilidades"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с несколькими CLI и IDE","Зависит от стандарта agentskills.io для разработки навыков"],"ar":["يتطلب التوافق مع واجهات سطر الأوامر المتعددة و IDE","يعتمد على معيار agentskills.io لتطوير المهارات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Monsoft-Solutions/alluring-website-v1/page-cro', 'community', 'Monsoft-Solutions', 'alluring-website-v1', 'Monsoft-Solutions/alluring-website-v1', 'page-cro', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.421Z', '2026-02-18T04:28:14.308Z', NULL, '{"id":"Monsoft-Solutions/alluring-website-v1/page-cro","name":"page-cro","description":{"zh":"页面转化率优化（CRO）专家为您提供专业建议，帮助提高页面转化率","ja":"ページコンバージョンレート最適化（CRO）専門家がページの改善をサポート","ko":"페이지 전환률 최적화(CRO) 전문가가 페이지 개선과 전환률 향상을 도와드립니다","es":"Optimiza la tasa de conversión de tus páginas web con técnicas de análisis y recomendaciones expertas","fr":"Optimisez le taux de conversion de vos pages web avec des techniques d''analyse et des recommandations d''experts","de":"Optimieren Sie die Konversionsrate Ihrer Website mit Analysetechniken und Expertenempfehlungen","pt":"Otimização de taxa de conversão de página para desenvolvedores. Aprenda a analisar e melhorar a eficácia das suas páginas de marketing.","ru":"Оптимизация коэффициента конверсии страницы для разработчиков. Узнайте, как анализировать и улучшать эффективность ваших маркетинговых страниц.","ar":"تحسين نسبة التحويل الصفحة للمطورين. تعلم كيفية تحليل وتحسين فعالية صفحات التسويق الخاصة بك.","en":"This is the v1 of the Alluring website"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"页面转化率优化（CRO）专家","ja":"ページコンバージョンレート最適化（CRO）","ko":"페이지 전환률 최적화(CRO) 전문가","es":"Optimización de Conversión de Página","fr":"Optimisation du Taux de Conversion de Page","de":"Seitenkonversionsrate Optimierung","pt":"Otimização de Taxa de Conversão de Página","ru":"Оптимизация коэффициента конверсии страницы","ar":"تحسين نسبة التحويل الصفحة","en":"page-cro"},"description":{"zh":"页面转化率优化（CRO）专家为您提供专业建议，帮助提高页面转化率","ja":"ページコンバージョンレート最適化（CRO）専門家がページの改善をサポート","ko":"페이지 전환률 최적화(CRO) 전문가가 페이지 개선과 전환률 향상을 도와드립니다","es":"Optimiza la tasa de conversión de tus páginas web con técnicas de análisis y recomendaciones expertas","fr":"Optimisez le taux de conversion de vos pages web avec des techniques d''analyse et des recommandations d''experts","de":"Optimieren Sie die Konversionsrate Ihrer Website mit Analysetechniken und Expertenempfehlungen","pt":"Otimização de taxa de conversão de página para desenvolvedores. Aprenda a analisar e melhorar a eficácia das suas páginas de marketing.","ru":"Оптимизация коэффициента конверсии страницы для разработчиков. Узнайте, как анализировать и улучшать эффективность ваших маркетинговых страниц.","ar":"تحسين نسبة التحويل الصفحة للمطورين. تعلم كيفية تحليل وتحسين فعالية صفحات التسويق الخاصة بك.","en":"This is the v1 of the Alluring website"},"definition":{"en":"This is the v1 of the Alluring website"},"features":{"zh":["页面分析","转化率优化","营销效果提升","专业建议","数据驱动的决策"],"ja":["ページ分析","コンバージョンレート最適化","マーケティング効果の向上","専門家のアドバイス","データドリブンの意思決定"],"ko":["페이지 분석","전환률 최적화","마케팅 효과 향상","전문가의 조언","데이터 기반의 의사결정"],"es":["Análisis de páginas web","Recomendaciones expertas","Mejora de la tasa de conversión","Técnicas de optimización","Análisis de contexto de marketing","Identificación de áreas de mejora"],"fr":["Analyse de pages web","Recommandations d''experts","Amélioration du taux de conversion","Techniques d''optimisation","Analyse du contexte de marketing","Identification des domaines d''amélioration"],"de":["Analyse von Websites","Expertenempfehlungen","Verbesserung der Konversionsrate","Optimierungstechniken","Analyse des Marketingkontexts","Identifizierung von Verbesserungsbereichen"],"pt":["Análise de páginas de marketing","Recomendações para melhorar a taxa de conversão","Otimização de elementos da página","Análise de comportamento do usuário","Melhoria da experiência do usuário"],"ru":["Анализ маркетинговых страниц","Рекомендации для улучшения коэффициента конверсии","Оптимизация элементов страницы","Анализ поведения пользователя","Улучшение пользовательского опыта"],"ar":["تحليل صفحات التسويق","توصيات لتحسين نسبة التحويل","تحسين عناصر الصفحة","تحليل سلوك المستخدم","تحسين تجربة المستخدم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["页面转化率优化","CRO","页面分析","转化率提高","营销效果提升","专业建议"],"ja":["ページコンバージョンレート最適化","CRO","ページ分析","コンバージョンレート向上","マーケティング効果の向上","専門家のアドバイス"],"ko":["페이지 전환률 최적화","CRO","페이지 분석","전환률 향상","마케팅 효과 향상","전문가의 조언"],"es":["optimización de conversión","análisis de páginas web","recomendaciones expertas","mejora de la tasa de conversión","técnica de optimización","marketing digital","desarrollo web","SEO"],"fr":["optimisation du taux de conversion","analyse de pages web","recommandations d''experts","amélioration du taux de conversion","technique d''optimisation","marketing digital","développement web","SEO"],"de":["Seitenkonversionsrate-Optimierung","Analyse von Websites","Expertenempfehlungen","Verbesserung der Konversionsrate","Optimierungstechniken","digitales Marketing","Webentwicklung","SEO"],"pt":["otimização de taxa de conversão","CRO","páginas de marketing","análise de comportamento do usuário","experiência do usuário","desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["оптимизация коэффициента конверсии","CRO","маркетинговые страницы","анализ поведения пользователя","пользовательский опыт","веб-разработка"],"ar":["تحسين نسبة التحويل","CRO","صفحات التسويق","تحليل سلوك المستخدم","تجربة المستخدم","تطوير الويب"]}},"owner":"Monsoft-Solutions","repo":"alluring-website-v1","repoPath":"Monsoft-Solutions/alluring-website-v1","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.421Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"page-cro","description":"When the user wants to optimize, improve, or increase conversions on any marketing page — including homepage, landing pages, pricing pages, feature pages, or blog posts. Also use when the user says CRO, conversion rate optimization, this page isnt converting, improve conversions, or why isnt this page working. For signup/registration flows, see signup-flow-cro. For post-signup activation, see onboarding-cro. For forms outside of signup, see form-cro. For popups/modals, see popup-cro.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Page Conversion Rate Optimization (CRO)\n\nYou are a conversion rate optimization expert. Your goal is to analyze marketing pages and provide actionable recommendations to improve conversion rates.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore providing recommendations, identify:\n\n1. **Page","body":"# Page Conversion Rate Optimization (CRO)\n\nYou are a conversion rate optimization expert. Your goal is to analyze marketing pages and provide actionable recommendations to improve conversion rates.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore providing recommendations, identify:\n\n1. **Page Type**: Homepage, landing page, pricing, feature, blog, about, other\n2. **Primary Conversion Goal**: Sign up, request demo, purchase, subscribe, download, contact sales\n3. **Traffic Context**: Where are visitors coming from? (organic, paid, email, social)\n\n---\n\n## CRO Analysis Framework\n\nAnalyze the page across these dimensions, in order of impact:\n\n### 1. Value Proposition Clarity (Highest Impact)\n\n**Check for:**\n\n- Can a visitor understand what this is and why they should care within 5 seconds?\n- Is the primary benefit clear, specific, and differentiated?\n- Is it written in the customer''s language (not company jargon)?\n\n**Common issues:**\n\n- Feature-focused instead of benefit-focused\n- Too vague or too clever (sacrificing clarity)\n- Trying to say everything instead of the most important thing\n\n### 2. Headline Effectiveness\n\n**Evaluate:**\n\n- Does it communicate the core value proposition?\n- Is it specific enough to be meaningful?\n- Does it match the traffic source''s messaging?\n\n**Strong headline patterns:**\n\n- Outcome-focused: \"Get [desired outcome] without [pain point]\"\n- Specificity: Include numbers, timeframes, or concrete details\n- Social proof: \"Join 10,000+ teams who...\"\n\n### 3. CTA Placement, Copy, and Hierarchy\n\n**Primary CTA assessment:**\n\n- Is there one clear primary action?\n- Is it visible without scrolling?\n- Does the button copy communicate value, not just action?\n    - Weak: \"Submit,\" \"Sign Up,\" \"Learn More\"\n    - Strong: \"Start Free Trial,\" \"Get My Report,\" \"See Pricing\"\n\n**CTA hierarchy:**\n\n- Is there a logical primary vs. secondary CTA structure?\n- Are CTAs repeated at key decision points?\n\n### 4. Visual Hierarchy and Scannability\n\n**Check:**\n\n- Can someone scanning get the main message?\n- Are the most important elements visually prominent?\n- Is there enough white space?\n- Do images support or distract from the message?\n\n### 5. Trust Signals and Social Proof\n\n**Types to look for:**\n\n- Customer logos (especially recognizable ones)\n- Testimonials (specific, attributed, with photos)\n- Case study snippets with real numbers\n- Review scores and counts\n- Security badges (where relevant)\n\n**Placement:** Near CTAs and after benefit claims\n\n### 6. Objection Handling\n\n**Common objections to address:**\n\n- Price/value concerns\n- \"Will this work for my situation?\"\n- Implementation difficulty\n- \"What if it doesn''t work?\"\n\n**Address through:** FAQ sections, guarantees, comparison content, process transparency\n\n### 7. Friction Points\n\n**Look for:**\n\n- Too many form fields\n- Unclear next steps\n- Confusing navigation\n- Required information that shouldn''t be required\n- Mobile experience issues\n- Long load times\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\nStructure your recommendations as:\n\n### Quick Wins (Implement Now)\n\nEasy changes with likely immediate impact.\n\n### High-Impact Changes (Prioritize)\n\nBigger changes that require more effort but will significantly improve conversions.\n\n### Test Ideas\n\nHypotheses worth A/B testing rather than assuming.\n\n### Copy Alternatives\n\nFor key elements (headlines, CTAs), provide 2-3 alternatives with rationale.\n\n---\n\n## Page-Specific Frameworks\n\n### Homepage CRO\n\n- Clear positioning for cold visitors\n- Quick path to most common conversion\n- Handle both \"ready to buy\" and \"still researching\"\n\n### Landing Page CRO\n\n- Message match with traffic source\n- Single CTA (remove navigation if possible)\n- Complete argument on one page\n\n### Pricing Page CRO\n\n- Clear plan comparison\n- Recommended plan indication\n- Address \"which plan is right for me?\" anxiety\n\n### Feature Page CRO\n\n- Connect feature to benefit\n- Use cases and examples\n- Clear path to try/buy\n\n### Blog Post CRO\n\n- Contextual CTAs matching content topic\n- Inline CTAs at natural stopping points\n\n---\n\n## Experiment Ideas\n\nWhen recommending experiments, consider tests for:\n\n- Hero section (headline, visual, CTA)\n- Trust signals and social proof placement\n- Pricing presentation\n- Form optimization\n- Navigation and UX\n\n**For comprehensive experiment ideas by page type**: See [references/experiments.md](references/experiments.md)\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What''s your current conversion rate and goal?\n2. Where is traffic coming from?\n3. What does your signup/purchase flow look like after this page?\n4. Do you have user research, heatmaps, or session recordings?\n5. What have you already tried?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **signup-flow-cro**: If the issue is in the signup process itself\n- **form-cro**: If forms on the page need optimization\n- **popup-cro**: If considering popups as part of the strategy\n- **copywriting**: If the page needs a complete copy rewrite\n- **ab-test-setup**: To properly test recommended changes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:28:14.308Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Marketing Optimization Agents needing advanced page analysis and conversion rate improvement capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级页面分析和转化率改进功能的营销优化代理","ja":"マーケティング最適化エージェントが高度なページ分析とコンバージョン率改善機能を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"고급 페이지 분석 및 전환률 개선 기능이 필요한 마케팅 최적화 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de optimización de marketing que necesitan un análisis de página avanzado y capacidades de mejora de la tasa de conversión.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''optimisation de marketing qui ont besoin d''une analyse de page avancée et de capacités d''amélioration du taux de conversion.","de":"Perfekt für Marketing-Optimierungsagenten, die eine erweiterte Seitenanalyse und Funktionen zur Verbesserung der Konvertierungsrate benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Otimização de Marketing que necessitam de análise de página avançada e capacidades de melhoria da taxa de conversão.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по оптимизации маркетинга, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности анализа страниц и улучшения коэффициента конверсии.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى تحليل صفحة متقدم وقدرات تحسين معدل التحويل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze marketing pages and provide actionable recommendations to improve conversion rates using product marketing context and identifying key page elements for optimization, leveraging Markdown files like `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` for context.","zh":"赋予代理分析营销页面的能力，并提供可行的改进建议以提高转化率，利用产品营销背景和识别关键页面元素进行优化，利用Markdown文件（如.claude/product-marketing-context.md）获取背景","ja":"エージェントにマーケティングページを分析し、コンバージョン率を改善するための実行可能な推奨事項を提供する機能を与え、製品マーケティングコンテキストと最適化のための重要なページ要素を識別し、Markdownファイル（.claude/product-marketing-context.mdなど）を使用してコンテキストを利用","ko":"에이전트에게 마케팅 페이지를 분석하고 전환률을 개선하기 위한 실행 가능한 제안을 제공하는 기능을 부여하며, 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트와 최적화를 위한 중요한 페이지 요소를 식별하고, Markdown 파일 (.claude/product-marketing-context.md 등)을 사용하여 컨텍스트를 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a analizar páginas de marketing y proporcionar recomendaciones activas para mejorar las tasas de conversión utilizando el contexto de marketing de productos y identificando elementos de página clave para la optimización, aprovechando archivos Markdown como .claude/product-marketing-context.md para el contexto.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser les pages de marketing et de fournir des recommandations actionnables pour améliorer les taux de conversion en utilisant le contexte de marketing de produits et en identifiant les éléments de page clés pour l''optimisation, en exploitant les fichiers Markdown tels que .claude/product-marketing-context.md pour le contexte.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Marketingseiten zu analysieren und handhabbare Empfehlungen zur Verbesserung der Konvertierungsrate zu liefern, indem sie den Produktmarketing-Kontext und die Identifizierung wichtiger Seitenelemente für die Optimierung nutzen, unter Ausnutzung von Markdown-Dateien wie .claude/product-marketing-context.md für den Kontext.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a analisar páginas de marketing e fornecer recomendações práticas para melhorar as taxas de conversão usando o contexto de marketing de produtos e identificando elementos-chave da página para otimização, aproveitando arquivos Markdown como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` para contexto.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью анализировать маркетинговые страницы и предоставлять действенные рекомендации для улучшения коэффициента конверсии с использованием контекста маркетинга продукта и определения ключевых элементов страницы для оптимизации, используя файлы Markdown, такие как `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`, для контекста.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تحليل صفحات التسويق وتقديم توصيات قابلة للتنفيذ لتحسين معدلات التحويل باستخدام سياق تسويق المنتج وتحديد عناصر الصفحة الرئيسية لتحسين الأداء، باستخدام ملفات Markdown مثل `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` لسياق."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing marketing pages for conversion rate optimization","Providing actionable recommendations for improvement","Identifying key page elements for optimization"],"zh":["分析营销页面以优化转化率","提供改进的可行建议","识别关键页面元素以优化"],"ja":["コンバージョン率最適化のためのマーケティングページ分析","改善のための実行可能な推奨事項の提供","最適化のための重要なページ要素の識別"],"ko":["전환률 최적화를 위한 마케팅 페이지 분석","개선에 대한 실행 가능한 제안 제공","최적화를 위한 중요한 페이지 요소 식별"],"es":["Análisis de páginas de marketing para la optimización de la tasa de conversión","Proporcionar recomendaciones activas para la mejora","Identificar elementos de página clave para la optimización"],"fr":["Analyse de pages de marketing pour l''optimisation du taux de conversion","Fournir des recommandations actionnables pour l''amélioration","Identifier les éléments de page clés pour l''optimisation"],"de":["Analyse von Marketingseiten für die Optimierung der Konvertierungsrate","Bereitstellung von handhabbaren Empfehlungen für die Verbesserung","Identifizierung wichtiger Seitenelemente für die Optimierung"],"pt":["Analisar páginas de marketing para otimização da taxa de conversão","Fornecer recomendações práticas para melhoria","Identificar elementos-chave da página para otimização"],"ru":["Анализ маркетинговых страниц для оптимизации коэффициента конверсии","Предоставление действенных рекомендаций для улучшения","Определение ключевых элементов страницы для оптимизации"],"ar":["تحليل صفحات التسويق لتحسين معدل التحويل","تقديم توصيات قابلة للتنفيذ لتحسين الأداء","تحديد عناصر الصفحة الرئيسية لتحسين الأداء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires product marketing context file (.claude/product-marketing-context.md) for optimal performance","Limited to analyzing marketing pages only"],"zh":["需要产品营销背景文件 (.claude/product-marketing-context.md) 以实现最佳性能","仅限于分析营销页面"],"ja":["最適なパフォーマンスを実現するには、製品マーケティングコンテキストファイル (.claude/product-marketing-context.md) が必要","マーケティングページのみを分析"],"ko":["최적의 성능을 달성하려면 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트 파일 (.claude/product-marketing-context.md) が 필요","마케팅 페이지만 분석"],"es":["Requiere un archivo de contexto de marketing de productos (.claude/product-marketing-context.md) para un rendimiento óptimo","Limitado a analizar solo páginas de marketing"],"fr":["Nécessite un fichier de contexte de marketing de produits (.claude/product-marketing-context.md) pour des performances optimales","Limité à l''analyse de pages de marketing uniquement"],"de":["Benötigt eine Produktmarketing-Kontext-Datei (.claude/product-marketing-context.md) für optimale Leistung","Begrenzt auf die Analyse von Marketingseiten nur"],"pt":["Requer arquivo de contexto de marketing de produtos (.claude/product-marketing-context.md) para desempenho ótimo","Limitado à análise de páginas de marketing apenas"],"ru":["Требует файла контекста маркетинга продукта (.claude/product-marketing-context.md) для оптимальной производительности","Ограничен только анализом маркетинговых страниц"],"ar":["يتطلب ملف سياق تسويق المنتج (.claude/product-marketing-context.md) لأداء مثالي","محدود بتحليل صفحات التسويق فقط"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('plastikaweb/plastikspace/angular-signals', 'community', 'plastikaweb', 'plastikspace', 'plastikaweb/plastikspace', 'angular-signals', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.421Z', '2026-02-18T04:27:24.429Z', NULL, '{"id":"plastikaweb/plastikspace/angular-signals","name":"angular-signals","description":{"zh":"Angular Signals","ja":"Angular Signals","ko":"Angular Signals","es":"Angular Signals es una primitiva reactiva para la gestión de estado en Angular, proporcionando reactividad fina y sincrónica","fr":"Angular Signals est un primitif réactif pour la gestion d''état dans Angular, offrant une réactivité fine et synchrone","de":"Angular Signals ist ein reaktives Primitiv für die Statusverwaltung in Angular, das eine feine und synchrone Reaktivität bietet","pt":"Angular Signals é uma primitiva reativa para gerenciamento de estado em aplicações Angular, fornecendo reatividade fina e síncrona.","ru":"Angular Signals — реактивная примитиве для управления состоянием в приложениях Angular, обеспечивающая тонкую и синхронную реактивность.","ar":"إشارات أنجولار هي بدائية تفاعلية لإدارة الحالة في تطبيقات أنجولار، توفر تفاعلية دقيقة ومزامنة.","en":"An nx monorepo with examples of plastikaweb coding using Angular, @ngrx, tailwind and material https://deepwiki.com/plastikaweb/plastikspace"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Angular Signals","ja":"Angular Signals","ko":"Angular Signals","es":"Angular Signals: Primitive Reactiva para Gestión de Estado","fr":"Angular Signals: Primitif Réactif pour la Gestion d''État","de":"Angular Signals: Reaktives Primitive für Statusverwaltung","pt":"Angular Signals: Gerenciamento de Estado Reativo","ru":"Angular Signals: Реактивное управление состоянием","ar":"إشارات أنجولار: إدارة الحالة التفاعلية","en":"angular-signals"},"description":{"zh":"Angular Signals","ja":"Angular Signals","ko":"Angular Signals","es":"Angular Signals es una primitiva reactiva para la gestión de estado en Angular, proporcionando reactividad fina y sincrónica","fr":"Angular Signals est un primitif réactif pour la gestion d''état dans Angular, offrant une réactivité fine et synchrone","de":"Angular Signals ist ein reaktives Primitiv für die Statusverwaltung in Angular, das eine feine und synchrone Reaktivität bietet","pt":"Angular Signals é uma primitiva reativa para gerenciamento de estado em aplicações Angular, fornecendo reatividade fina e síncrona.","ru":"Angular Signals — реактивная примитиве для управления состоянием в приложениях Angular, обеспечивающая тонкую и синхронную реактивность.","ar":"إشارات أنجولار هي بدائية تفاعلية لإدارة الحالة في تطبيقات أنجولار، توفر تفاعلية دقيقة ومزامنة.","en":"An nx monorepo with examples of plastikaweb coding using Angular, @ngrx, tailwind and material https://deepwiki.com/plastikaweb/plastikspace"},"definition":{"en":"An nx monorepo with examples of plastikaweb coding using Angular, @ngrx, tailwind and material https://deepwiki.com/plastikaweb/plastikspace"},"features":{"zh":["Angular","@ngrx","tailwind","material","plastikaweb","nx monorepo"],"ja":["Angular","@ngrx","tailwind","material","plastikaweb","nx monorepo"],"ko":["Angular","@ngrx","tailwind","material","plastikaweb","nx monorepo"],"es":["Gestión de estado reactiva","Reactividad fina y sincrónica","Compatibilidad con @ngrx y Tailwind","Ejemplos de uso en un monorepo de nx","Tipado explícito para signals","Actualización basada en valores actuales"],"fr":["Gestion d''état réactive","Réactivité fine et synchrone","Compatibilité avec @ngrx et Tailwind","Exemples d''utilisation dans un monorepo de nx","Typage explicite pour les signals","Mise à jour basée sur les valeurs actuelles"],"de":["Reaktive Statusverwaltung","Feine und synchrone Reaktivität","Kompatibilität mit @ngrx und Tailwind","Beispiele für die Verwendung in einem nx-Monorepo","Explizite Typisierung für Signals","Aktualisierung basierend auf aktuellen Werten"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de estado reativo","Reatividade fina e síncrona","Integração com @ngrx e Tailwind","Exemplos de uso em aplicações reais","Documentação detalhada e recursos para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["Реактивное управление состоянием","Тонкая и синхронная реактивность","Интеграция с @ngrx и Tailwind","Примеры использования в реальных приложениях","Дetailed документация и ресурсы для разработчиков"],"ar":["إدارة الحالة التفاعلية","تفاعلية دقيقة ومزامنة","التكامل مع @ngrx و Tailwind","أمثلة الاستخدام في التطبيقات الفعلية","توثيق مفصل وموارد لل مطورين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Angular Signals","nx monorepo","plastikaweb","Angular","@ngrx","tailwind","material","state management","reactive primitive"],"ja":["Angular Signals","nx monorepo","plastikaweb","Angular","@ngrx","tailwind","material","state management","reactive primitive"],"ko":["Angular Signals","nx monorepo","plastikaweb","Angular","@ngrx","tailwind","material","state management","reactive primitive"],"es":["angular signals","gestión de estado","reactividad","ngrx","tailwind","monorepo nx","tipado explícito","actualización de estado"],"fr":["angular signals","gestion d''état","réactivité","ngrx","tailwind","monorepo nx","typage explicite","mise à jour d''état"],"de":["angular signals","statusverwaltung","reaktivität","ngrx","tailwind","nx-monorepo","explizite typisierung","aktualisierung von status"],"pt":["angular signals","gerenciamento de estado reativo","reactividade fina","ngxr","tailwind","desenvolvimento de aplicações","angular","estado reativo"],"ru":["angular signals","реактивное управление состоянием","тонкая реактивность","ngxr","tailwind","разработка приложений","angular","реактивное состояние"],"ar":["إشارات أنجولار","إدارة الحالة التفاعلية","تفاعلية دقيقة","ngxr","tailwind","تطوير التطبيقات","أنجولار","حالة تفاعلية"]}},"owner":"plastikaweb","repo":"plastikspace","repoPath":"plastikaweb/plastikspace","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.421Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"angular-signals","description":"Implement signal-based reactive state management in Angular v20+. Use for creating reactive state with signal(), derived state with computed(), dependent state with linkedSignal(), and side effects with effect(). Triggers on state management questions, converting from BehaviorSubject/Observable patterns to signals, or implementing reactive data flows.","bodyPreview":"# Angular Signals\n\nSignals are Angular''s reactive primitive for state management. They provide synchronous, fine-grained reactivity.\n\n## Core Signal APIs\n\n### signal() - Writable State\n\n```typescript\nimport { signal } from ''@angular/core'';\n\n// Create writable signal\nconst count = signal(0);\n\n// Read value\nconsole.log(count()); // 0\n\n// Set new value\ncount.set(5);\n\n// Update based on current value\ncount.update(c => c + 1);\n\n// With explicit type\nconst user = signal<User | null>(null);\nuser.set({","body":"# Angular Signals\n\nSignals are Angular''s reactive primitive for state management. They provide synchronous, fine-grained reactivity.\n\n## Core Signal APIs\n\n### signal() - Writable State\n\n```typescript\nimport { signal } from ''@angular/core'';\n\n// Create writable signal\nconst count = signal(0);\n\n// Read value\nconsole.log(count()); // 0\n\n// Set new value\ncount.set(5);\n\n// Update based on current value\ncount.update(c => c + 1);\n\n// With explicit type\nconst user = signal<User | null>(null);\nuser.set({ id: 1, name: ''Alice'' });\n```\n\n### computed() - Derived State\n\n```typescript\nimport { signal, computed } from ''@angular/core'';\n\nconst firstName = signal(''John'');\nconst lastName = signal(''Doe'');\n\n// Derived signal - automatically updates when dependencies change\nconst fullName = computed(() => `${firstName()} ${lastName()}`);\n\nconsole.log(fullName()); // \"John Doe\"\nfirstName.set(''Jane'');\nconsole.log(fullName()); // \"Jane Doe\"\n\n// Computed with complex logic\nconst items = signal<Item[]>([]);\nconst filter = signal('''');\n\nconst filteredItems = computed(() => {\n  const query = filter().toLowerCase();\n  return items().filter(item => item.name.toLowerCase().includes(query));\n});\n\nconst totalPrice = computed(() => filteredItems().reduce((sum, item) => sum + item.price, 0));\n```\n\n### linkedSignal() - Dependent State with Reset\n\n```typescript\nimport { signal, linkedSignal } from ''@angular/core'';\n\nconst options = signal([''A'', ''B'', ''C'']);\n\n// Resets to first option when options change\nconst selected = linkedSignal(() => options()[0]);\n\nconsole.log(selected()); // \"A\"\nselected.set(''B''); // User selects B\nconsole.log(selected()); // \"B\"\noptions.set([''X'', ''Y'']); // Options change\nconsole.log(selected()); // \"X\" - auto-reset to first\n\n// With previous value access\nconst items = signal<Item[]>([]);\n\nconst selectedItem = linkedSignal<Item[], Item | null>({\n  source: () => items(),\n  computation: (newItems, previous) => {\n    // Try to preserve selection if item still exists\n    const prevItem = previous?.value;\n    if (prevItem && newItems.some(i => i.id === prevItem.id)) {\n      return prevItem;\n    }\n    return newItems[0] ?? null;\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### effect() - Side Effects\n\n```typescript\nimport { signal, effect, inject, DestroyRef } from ''@angular/core'';\n\n@Component({...})\nexport class Search {\n  query = signal('''');\n\n  constructor() {\n    // Effect runs when query changes\n    effect(() => {\n      console.log(''Search query:'', this.query());\n    });\n\n    // Effect with cleanup\n    effect((onCleanup) => {\n      const timer = setInterval(() => {\n        console.log(''Current query:'', this.query());\n      }, 1000);\n\n      onCleanup(() => clearInterval(timer));\n    });\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Effect rules:**\n\n- Run in injection context (constructor or with `runInInjectionContext`)\n- Automatically cleaned up when component destroys\n\n## Component State Pattern\n\n```typescript\n@Component({\n  selector: ''app-todo-list'',\n  template: `\n    <input [value]=\"newTodo()\" (input)=\"newTodo.set($any($event.target).value)\" />\n    <button (click)=\"addTodo()\" [disabled]=\"!canAdd()\">Add</button>\n\n    <ul>\n      @for (todo of filteredTodos(); track todo.id) {\n        <li [class.done]=\"todo.done\">\n          {{ todo.text }}\n          <button (click)=\"toggleTodo(todo.id)\">Toggle</button>\n        </li>\n      }\n    </ul>\n\n    <p>{{ remaining() }} remaining</p>\n  `,\n})\nexport class TodoList {\n  // State\n  todos = signal<Todo[]>([]);\n  newTodo = signal('''');\n  filter = signal<''all'' | ''active'' | ''done''>(''all'');\n\n  // Derived state\n  canAdd = computed(() => this.newTodo().trim().length > 0);\n\n  filteredTodos = computed(() => {\n    const todos = this.todos();\n    switch (this.filter()) {\n      case ''active'':\n        return todos.filter(t => !t.done);\n      case ''done'':\n        return todos.filter(t => t.done);\n      default:\n        return todos;\n    }\n  });\n\n  remaining = computed(() => this.todos().filter(t => !t.done).length);\n\n  // Actions\n  addTodo() {\n    const text = this.newTodo().trim();\n    if (text) {\n      this.todos.update(todos => [...todos, { id: crypto.randomUUID(), text, done: false }]);\n      this.newTodo.set('''');\n    }\n  }\n\n  toggleTodo(id: string) {\n    this.todos.update(todos => todos.map(t => (t.id === id ? { ...t, done: !t.done } : t)));\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## RxJS Interop\n\n### toSignal() - Observable to Signal\n\n```typescript\nimport { toSignal } from ''@angular/core/rxjs-interop'';\nimport { interval } from ''rxjs'';\n\n@Component({...})\nexport class Timer {\n  private http = inject(HttpClient);\n\n  // From observable - requires initial value or allowUndefined\n  counter = toSignal(interval(1000), { initialValue: 0 });\n\n  // From HTTP - undefined until loaded\n  users = toSignal(this.http.get<User[]>(''/api/users''));\n\n  // With requireSync for synchronous observables (BehaviorSubject)\n  private user$ = new BehaviorSubject<User | null>(null);\n  currentUser = toSignal(this.user$, { requireSync: true });\n}\n```\n\n### toObservable() - Signal to Observable\n\n```typescript\nimport { toObservable } from ''@angular/core/rxjs-interop'';\nimport { switchMap, debounceTime } from ''rxjs'';\n\n@Component({...})\nexport class Search {\n  query = signal('''');\n\n  private http = inject(HttpClient);\n\n  // Convert signal to observable for RxJS operators\n  results = toSignal(\n    toObservable(this.query).pipe(\n      debounceTime(300),\n      switchMap(q => this.http.get<Result[]>(`/api/search?q=${q}`))\n    ),\n    { initialValue: [] }\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Signal Equality\n\n```typescript\n// Custom equality function\nconst user = signal<User>({ id: 1, name: ''Alice'' }, { equal: (a, b) => a.id === b.id });\n\n// Only triggers updates when ID changes\nuser.set({ id: 1, name: ''Alice Updated'' }); // No update\nuser.set({ id: 2, name: ''Bob'' }); // Triggers update\n```\n\n## Untracked Reads\n\n```typescript\nimport { untracked } from ''@angular/core'';\n\nconst a = signal(1);\nconst b = signal(2);\n\n// Only depends on ''a'', not ''b''\nconst result = computed(() => {\n  const aVal = a();\n  const bVal = untracked(() => b());\n  return aVal + bVal;\n});\n```\n\n## Service State Pattern\n\n```typescript\n@Injectable({ providedIn: ''root'' })\nexport class Auth {\n  // Private writable state\n  private _user = signal<User | null>(null);\n  private _loading = signal(false);\n\n  // Public read-only signals\n  readonly user = this._user.asReadonly();\n  readonly loading = this._loading.asReadonly();\n  readonly isAuthenticated = computed(() => this._user() !== null);\n\n  private http = inject(HttpClient);\n\n  async login(credentials: Credentials): Promise<void> {\n    this._loading.set(true);\n    try {\n      const user = await firstValueFrom(this.http.post<User>(''/api/login'', credentials));\n      this._user.set(user);\n    } finally {\n      this._loading.set(false);\n    }\n  }\n\n  logout(): void {\n    this._user.set(null);\n  }\n}\n```\n\nFor advanced patterns including resource(), see [references/signal-patterns.md](references/signal-patterns.md).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:27:24.429Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents leveraging Angular and @ngrx for fine-grained state management and reactive primitives.","zh":"适用于使用 Angular 和 @ngrx 进行细粒度状态管理和响应式原语的前端代理。","ja":"Angular と @ngrx を使用した細粒度な状態管理とリアクティブなプリミティブを活用するフロントエンドエージェントに適しています。","ko":"Angular와 @ngrx를 사용하여 세분화된 상태 관리 및 반응형 원시 값을 활용하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes Frontend que utilizan Angular y @ngrx para una gestión de estado granular y primitivos reactivos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Frontend qui utilisent Angular et @ngrx pour une gestion d''état fine et des primitives réactives.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agenten, die Angular und @ngrx für eine feinkörnige Zustandsverwaltung und reaktive Primitiven verwenden.","pt":"Ideal for Frontend Agents leveraging Angular and @ngrx for fine-grained state management and reactive primitives.","ru":"Ideal for Frontend Agents leveraging Angular and @ngrx for fine-grained state management and reactive primitives.","ar":"Ideal for Frontend Agents leveraging Angular and @ngrx for fine-grained state management and reactive primitives."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage state synchronously with Angular Signals, utilizing @ngrx and tailwind for robust frontend development, and material design for intuitive user interfaces.","zh":"赋予代理管理状态的能力，与 Angular Signals 同步，利用 @ngrx 和 tailwind 进行强大的前端开发，并使用 material design 进行直观的用户界面设计。","ja":"エージェントが Angular Signals と同期して状態を管理できるようにし、@ngrx と tailwind を使用して堅牢なフロントエンド開発を行い、直観的なユーザーインターフェイスのためのマテリアルデザインを使用します。","ko":"에이전트가 Angular Signals와同步하여 상태를 관리할 수 있도록 하며, @ngrx와 tailwind를 사용하여 강력한 프론트엔드 개발을进行하고, 직관적인 사용자 인터페이스를 위한 머터리얼 디자인을 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar el estado de forma sincrónica con Angular Signals, utilizando @ngrx y tailwind para un desarrollo de frontend robusto, y material design para interfaces de usuario intuitivas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer l''état de manière synchrone avec Angular Signals, en utilisant @ngrx et tailwind pour un développement de frontend robuste, et material design pour des interfaces utilisateur intuitives.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, den Zustand synchron mit Angular Signals zu verwalten, indem @ngrx und tailwind für eine robuste Frontend-Entwicklung und material design für intuitive Benutzeroberflächen verwendet werden.","pt":"Empowers agents to manage state synchronously with Angular Signals, utilizing @ngrx and tailwind for robust frontend development, and material design for intuitive user interfaces.","ru":"Empowers agents to manage state synchronously with Angular Signals, utilizing @ngrx and tailwind for robust frontend development, and material design for intuitive user interfaces.","ar":"Empowers agents to manage state synchronously with Angular Signals, utilizing @ngrx and tailwind for robust frontend development, and material design for intuitive user interfaces."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing synchronous state updates with signal()","Creating readable and writable signals for fine-grained reactivity","Updating signal values based on current state using update()"],"zh":["使用 signal() 实现同步状态更新","创建可读和可写的信号以实现细粒度的响应性","使用 update() 根据当前状态更新信号值"],"ja":["signal() を使用して同期状態更新を実装する","細粒度なリアクティブ性を実現するために読み取り可能で書き込み可能なシグナルを作成する","update() を使用して現在の状態に基づいてシグナル値を更新する"],"ko":["signal()를 사용하여 동기화된 상태 업데이트를 구현하는 것","세분화된 반응성을 위해 읽기 및 쓰기 가능한 신호를 생성하는 것","update()를 사용하여 현재 상태에 따라 신호 값을 업데이트하는 것"],"es":["Implementar actualizaciones de estado sincrónicas con signal()","Crear señalesías legibles y escribibles para reactividad granular","Actualizar valores de señalías según el estado actual utilizando update()"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des mises à jour d''état synchrones avec signal()","Créer des signaux lisibles et scriptables pour une réactivité fine","Mettre à jour les valeurs de signaux en fonction de l''état actuel à l''aide de update()"],"de":["Synchronisierte Zustandsaktualisierungen mit signal() implementieren","Lesbare und beschreibbare Signale für feinkörnige Reaktivität erstellen","Signalwerte basierend auf dem aktuellen Zustand mit update() aktualisieren"],"pt":["Implementing synchronous state updates with signal()","Creating readable and writable signals for fine-grained reactivity","Updating signal values based on current state using update()"],"ru":["Implementing synchronous state updates with signal()","Creating readable and writable signals for fine-grained reactivity","Updating signal values based on current state using update()"],"ar":["Implementing synchronous state updates with signal()","Creating readable and writable signals for fine-grained reactivity","Updating signal values based on current state using update()"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Angular and @ngrx setup","Limited to Angular ecosystem"],"zh":["需要 Angular 和 @ngrx 设置","仅限于 Angular 生态系统"],"ja":["Angular と @ngrx のセットアップが必要","Angular エコシステムに限定される"],"ko":["Angular 및 @ngrx 설정이 필요함","Angular 생태계에만 한정됨"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Angular y @ngrx","Limitado al ecosistema de Angular"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration d''Angular et @ngrx","Limité à l''écosystème d''Angular"],"de":["Benötigt eine Einrichtung von Angular und @ngrx","Begrenzt auf das Angular-Ökosystem"],"pt":["Requires Angular and @ngrx setup","Limited to Angular ecosystem"],"ru":["Requires Angular and @ngrx setup","Limited to Angular ecosystem"],"ar":["Requires Angular and @ngrx setup","Limited to Angular ecosystem"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
