Cloudflare Workers でポケモンゲームを構築","ko":"Base44 SDK - React와 Cloudflare Workers로 포켓몬 게임을 구축","es":"Base44 SDK: Desarrollo de aplicaciones con React y Cloudf...","fr":"Base44 SDK : Développement d''applications avec React et C...","de":"Base44 SDK: Entwicklung von Anwendungen mit React und Clo...","pt":"Base44 SDK: Desenvolva Aplicativos com React e Cloudflare...","ru":"Base44 SDK: Создание приложений с React и Cloudflare Workers","ar":"Base44 SDK: بناء التطبيقات باستخدام React و Cloudflare Wo...","en":"base44-sdk"},"description":{"zh":"Base44 SDK 是一个使用 React 和 Cloudflare Workers 构建的 Pokémon 游戏开发平台。使用 Base44 JavaScript SDK 构建 Base44 平台应用","ja":"Base44 SDK は、React と Cloudflare Workers を使用して構築されたポケモンゲーム開発プラットフォームです。Base44 JavaScript SDK を使用して Base44 プラットフォームのアプリを構築","ko":"Base44 SDK는 React와 Cloudflare Workers를 사용하여 구축된 포켓몬 게임 개발 플랫폼입니다. Base44 JavaScript SDK를 사용하여 Base44 플랫폼 애플리케이션을 구축","es":"Base44 SDK es una herramienta para desarrollar aplicaciones en la plataforma Base44 utilizando React y Cloudflare Workers. Permite implementar característica...","fr":"Base44 SDK est un outil pour développer des applications sur la plateforme Base44 en utilisant React et Cloudflare Workers. Il permet d''implémenter des fonct...","de":"Base44 SDK ist ein Werkzeug zum Erstellen von Anwendungen auf der Base44-Plattform mit React und Cloudflare Workers. Es ermöglicht die Implementierung von Fu...","pt":"A Base44 SDK é uma plataforma de desenvolvimento de aplicativos que combina React e Cloudflare Workers para criar experiências de usuário personalizadas.","ru":"Base44 SDK — это платформа для разработки приложений, сочетающая React и Cloudflare Workers для создания индивидуальных пользовательских опытов.","ar":"Base44 SDK هي منصة لتطوير التطبيقات التي تجمع بين React و Cloudflare Workers لإنشاء تجارب مستخدم مخصصة.","en":"Pokemon game built with React + Cloudflare Workers"},"definition":{"en":"Pokemon game built with React + Cloudflare Workers"},"features":{"zh":["使用 React 和 Cloudflare Workers 构建","支持 Base44 JavaScript SDK","即时激活 Base44 SDK","构建 Base44 平台应用","支持 Pokémon 游戏开发"],"ja":["React と Cloudflare Workers を使用して構築","Base44 JavaScript SDK をサポート","Base44 SDK を即時アクティブ化","Base44 プラットフォームのアプリを構築","ポケモンゲーム開発をサポート"],"ko":["React와 Cloudflare Workers를 사용하여 구축","Base44 JavaScript SDK 지원","Base44 SDK 즉시 활성화","Base44 플랫폼 애플리케이션 구축","포켓몬 게임 개발 지원"],"es":["Desarrollo de aplicaciones con React","Implementación de características con Cloudflare Workers","Uso del SDK de JavaScript para personalizar funcionalidades","Compatibilidad con la plataforma Base44","Implementación de funcionalidades personalizadas"],"fr":["Développement d''applications avec React","Implémentation de fonctionnalités avec Cloudflare Workers","Utilisation du SDK JavaScript pour personnaliser les fonctionnalités","Compatibilité avec la plateforme Base44","Implémentation de fonctionnalités personnalisées"],"de":["Erstellung von Anwendungen mit React","Implementierung von Funktionen mit Cloudflare Workers","Verwendung des JavaScript-SDKs zur Anpassung von Funktionen","Kompatibilität mit der Base44-Plattform","Implementierung von Anpassungen"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de aplicativos com React","Integração com Cloudflare Workers","Criação de experiências de usuário personalizadas","Suporte à plataforma Base44","Implementação de recursos personalizados"],"ru":["Разработка приложений с помощью React","Интеграция с Cloudflare Workers","Создание индивидуальных пользовательских опытов","Поддержка платформы Base44","Реализация индивидуальных функций"],"ar":["بناء التطبيقات باستخدام React","التكامل مع Cloudflare Workers","إنشاء تجارب مستخدم مخصصة","دعم منصة Base44","تنفيذ ميزات مخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Base44 SDK","React","Cloudflare Workers","JavaScript","Base44 平台","Pokémon 游戏","开发工具包"],"ja":["Base44 SDK","React","Cloudflare Workers","JavaScript","Base44 プラットフォーム","ポケモンゲーム","開発キット"],"ko":["Base44 SDK","React","Cloudflare Workers","JavaScript","Base44 플랫폼","포켓몬 게임","개발 도구 키트"],"es":["Base44 SDK","Desarrollo de aplicaciones","React","Cloudflare Workers","JavaScript","Plataforma Base44","Funcionalidades personalizadas"],"fr":["Base44 SDK","Développement d''applications","React","Cloudflare Workers","JavaScript","Plateforme Base44","Fonctionnalités personnalisées"],"de":["Base44 SDK","Anwendungsentwicklung","React","Cloudflare Workers","JavaScript","Base44-Plattform","Anpassungen"],"pt":["Base44 SDK","Desenvolvimento de aplicativos","React","Cloudflare Workers","Experiências de usuário personalizadas","Plataforma Base44","Tecnologia de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Base44 SDK","Разработка приложений","React","Cloudflare Workers","Индивидуальные пользовательские опыты","Платформа Base44","Технология разработки"],"ar":["Base44 SDK","تطوير التطبيقات","React","Cloudflare Workers","تجارب مستخدم مخصصة","منصة Base44","تكنولوجيا التطوير"]}},"owner":"offloadmywork","repo":"pokemon-app","repoPath":"offloadmywork/pokemon-app","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.421Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"base44-sdk","description":"The base44 SDK is the library to communicate with base44 services. In projects, you use it to communicate with remote resources (entities, backend functions, ai agents) and to write backend functions. This skill is the place for learning about available modules and types. When you plan or implement a feature, you must learn this skill","bodyPreview":"# Base44 Coder\n\nBuild apps on the Base44 platform using the Base44 JavaScript SDK.\n\n## ⚡ IMMEDIATE ACTION REQUIRED - Read This First\n\nThis skill activates on ANY mention of \"base44\" or when a `base44/` folder exists. **DO NOT read documentation files or search the web before acting.**\n\n**Your first action MUST be:**\n1. Check if `base44/config.jsonc` exists in the current directory\n2. If **YES** (existing project scenario):\n   - This skill (base44-sdk) handles the request\n   - Implement features","body":"# Base44 Coder\n\nBuild apps on the Base44 platform using the Base44 JavaScript SDK.\n\n## ⚡ IMMEDIATE ACTION REQUIRED - Read This First\n\nThis skill activates on ANY mention of \"base44\" or when a `base44/` folder exists. **DO NOT read documentation files or search the web before acting.**\n\n**Your first action MUST be:**\n1. Check if `base44/config.jsonc` exists in the current directory\n2. If **YES** (existing project scenario):\n   - This skill (base44-sdk) handles the request\n   - Implement features using Base44 SDK\n   - Do NOT use base44-cli unless user explicitly requests CLI commands\n3. If **NO** (new project scenario):\n   - Transfer to base44-cli skill for project initialization\n   - This skill cannot help until project is initialized\n\n## When to Use This Skill vs base44-cli\n\n**Use base44-sdk when:**\n- Building features in an **EXISTING** Base44 project\n- `base44/config.jsonc` already exists in the project\n- Base44 SDK imports are present (`@base44/sdk`)\n- Writing JavaScript/TypeScript code using Base44 SDK modules\n- Implementing functionality, components, or features\n- User mentions: \"implement\", \"build a feature\", \"add functionality\", \"write code for\"\n- User says \"create a [type] app\" **and** a Base44 project already exists\n\n**DO NOT USE base44-sdk for:**\n- ❌ Initializing new Base44 projects (use `base44-cli` instead)\n- ❌ Empty directories without Base44 configuration\n- ❌ When user says \"create a new Base44 project/app/site\" and no project exists\n- ❌ CLI commands like `npx base44 create`, `npx base44 deploy`, `npx base44 login` (use `base44-cli`)\n\n**Skill Dependencies:**\n- `base44-sdk` assumes a Base44 project is **already initialized**\n- `base44-cli` is a **prerequisite** for `base44-sdk` in new projects\n- If user wants to \"create an app\" and no Base44 project exists, use `base44-cli` first\n\n**State Check Logic:**\nBefore selecting this skill, verify:\n- IF (user mentions \"create/build app\" OR \"make a project\"):\n  - IF (directory is empty OR no `base44/config.jsonc` exists):\n    → Use **base44-cli** (project initialization needed)\n  - ELSE:\n    → Use **base44-sdk** (project exists, build features)\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```javascript\n// In Base44-generated apps, base44 client is pre-configured and available\n\n// CRUD operations\nconst task = await base44.entities.Task.create({ title: \"New task\", status: \"pending\" });\nconst tasks = await base44.entities.Task.list();\nawait base44.entities.Task.update(task.id, { status: \"done\" });\n\n// Get current user\nconst user = await base44.auth.me();\n```\n\n```javascript\n// External apps\nimport { createClient } from \"@base44/sdk\";\n\n// IMPORTANT: Use ''appId'' (NOT ''clientId'' or ''id'')\nconst base44 = createClient({ appId: \"your-app-id\" });\nawait base44.auth.loginViaEmailPassword(\"user@example.com\", \"password\");\n```\n\n## ⚠️ CRITICAL: Do Not Hallucinate APIs\n\n**Before writing ANY Base44 code, verify method names against this table or [QUICK_REFERENCE.md](references/QUICK_REFERENCE.md).**\n\nBase44 SDK has unique method names. Do NOT assume patterns from Firebase, Supabase, or other SDKs.\n\n### Authentication - WRONG vs CORRECT\n\n| ❌ WRONG (hallucinated) | ✅ CORRECT |\n|------------------------|-----------|\n| `signInWithGoogle()` | `loginWithProvider(''google'')` |\n| `signInWithProvider(''google'')` | `loginWithProvider(''google'')` |\n| `auth.google()` | `loginWithProvider(''google'')` |\n| `signInWithEmailAndPassword(email, pw)` | `loginViaEmailPassword(email, pw)` |\n| `signIn(email, pw)` | `loginViaEmailPassword(email, pw)` |\n| `createUser()` / `signUp()` | `register({email, password})` |\n| `onAuthStateChanged()` | `me()` (no listener, call when needed) |\n| `currentUser` | `await auth.me()` |\n\n### Functions - WRONG vs CORRECT\n\n| ❌ WRONG (hallucinated) | ✅ CORRECT |\n|------------------------|-----------|\n| `functions.call(''name'', data)` | `functions.invoke(''name'', data)` |\n| `functions.run(''name'', data)` | `functions.invoke(''name'', data)` |\n| `callFunction(''name'', data)` | `functions.invoke(''name'', data)` |\n| `httpsCallable(''name'')(data)` | `functions.invoke(''name'', data)` |\n\n### Integrations - WRONG vs CORRECT\n\n| ❌ WRONG (hallucinated) | ✅ CORRECT |\n|------------------------|-----------|\n| `ai.generate(prompt)` | `integrations.Core.InvokeLLM({prompt})` |\n| `openai.chat(prompt)` | `integrations.Core.InvokeLLM({prompt})` |\n| `llm(prompt)` | `integrations.Core.InvokeLLM({prompt})` |\n| `sendEmail(to, subject, body)` | `integrations.Core.SendEmail({to, subject, body})` |\n| `email.send()` | `integrations.Core.SendEmail({to, subject, body})` |\n| `uploadFile(file)` | `integrations.Core.UploadFile({file})` |\n| `storage.upload(file)` | `integrations.Core.UploadFile({file})` |\n\n### Entities - WRONG vs CORRECT\n\n| ❌ WRONG (hallucinated) | ✅ CORRECT |\n|------------------------|-----------|\n| `entities.Task.find({...})` | `entities.Task.filter({...})` |\n| `entities.Task.findOne(id)` | `entities.Task.get(id)` |\n| `entities.Task.insert(data)` | `entities.Task.create(data)` |\n| `entities.Task.remove(id)` | `entities.Task.delete(id)` |\n| `entities.Task.onChange(cb)` | `entities.Task.subscribe(cb)` |\n\n## SDK Modules\n\n| Module | Purpose | Reference |\n|--------|---------|-----------|\n| `entities` | CRUD operations on data models | [entities.md](references/entities.md) |\n| `auth` | Login, register, user management | [auth.md](references/auth.md) |\n| `agents` | AI conversations and messages | [base44-agents.md](references/base44-agents.md) |\n| `functions` | Backend function invocation | [functions.md](references/functions.md) |\n| `integrations` | AI, email, file uploads, custom APIs | [integrations.md](references/integrations.md) |\n| `connectors` | OAuth tokens (service role only) | [connectors.md](references/connectors.md) |\n| `analytics` | Track custom events and user activity | [analytics.md](references/analytics.md) |\n| `appLogs` | Log user activity in app | [app-logs.md](references/app-logs.md) |\n| `users` | Invite users to the app | [users.md](references/users.md) |\n\nFor client setup and authentication modes, see [client.md](references/client.md).\n\n**TypeScript Support:** Each reference file includes a \"Type Definitions\" section with TypeScript interfaces and types for the module''s methods, parameters, and return values.\n\n## Installation\n\nInstall the Base44 SDK:\n\n```bash\nnpm install @base44/sdk\n```\n\n**Important:** Never assume or hardcode the `@base44/sdk` package version. Always install without a version specifier to get the latest version.\n\n## Creating a Client (External Apps)\n\nWhen creating a client in external apps, **ALWAYS use `appId` as the parameter name**:\n\n```javascript\nimport { createClient } from \"@base44/sdk\";\n\n// ✅ CORRECT\nconst base44 = createClient({ appId: \"your-app-id\" });\n\n// ❌ WRONG - Do NOT use these:\n// const base44 = createClient({ clientId: \"your-app-id\" });  // WRONG\n// const base44 = createClient({ id: \"your-app-id\" });        // WRONG\n```\n\n**Required parameter:** `appId` (string) - Your Base44 application ID\n\n**Optional parameters:**\n- `token` (string) - Pre-authenticated user token\n- `options` (object) - Configuration options\n  - `options.onError` (function) - Global error handler\n\n**Example with error handler:**\n```javascript\nconst base44 = createClient({\n  appId: \"your-app-id\",\n  options: {\n    onError: (error) => {\n      console.error(\"Base44 error:\", error);\n    }\n  }\n});\n```\n\n## Module Selection\n\n**Working with app data?**\n- Create/read/update/delete records → `entities`\n- Import data from file → `entities.importEntities()`\n- Realtime updates → `entities.EntityName.subscribe()`\n\n**User management?**\n- Login/register/logout → `auth`\n- Get current user → `auth.me()`\n- Update user profile → `auth.updateMe()`\n- Invite users → `users.inviteUser()`\n\n**AI features?**\n- Chat with AI agents → `agents` (requires logged-in user)\n- Create new conversation → `agents.createConversation()`\n- Manage conversations → `agents.getConversations()`\n- Generate text/JSON with AI → `integrations.Core.InvokeLLM()`\n- Generate images → `integrations.Core.GenerateImage()`\n\n**Custom backend logic?**\n- Run server-side code → `functions.invoke()`\n- Need admin access → `base44.asServiceRole.functions.invoke()`\n\n**External services?**\n- Send emails → `integrations.Core.SendEmail()`\n- Upload files → `integrations.Core.UploadFile()`\n- Custom APIs → `integrations.custom.call()`\n- OAuth tokens (Google, Slack) → `connectors` (backend only)\n\n**Tracking and analytics?**\n- Track custom events → `analytics.track()`\n- Log page views/activity → `appLogs.logUserInApp()`\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Filter and Sort Data\n\n```javascript\nconst pendingTasks = await base44.entities.Task.filter(\n  { status: \"pending\", assignedTo: userId },  // query\n  \"-created_date\",                             // sort (descending)\n  10,                                          // limit\n  0                                            // skip\n);\n```\n\n### Protected Routes (check auth)\n\n```javascript\nconst user = await base44.auth.me();\nif (!user) {\n  // Navigate to your custom login page\n  navigate(''/login'', { state: { returnTo: window.location.pathname } });\n  return;\n}\n```\n\n### Backend Function Call\n\n```javascript\n// Frontend\nconst result = await base44.functions.invoke(\"processOrder\", {\n  orderId: \"123\",\n  action: \"ship\"\n});\n\n// Backend function (Deno)\nimport { createClientFromRequest } from \"npm:@base44/sdk\";\n\nDeno.serve(async (req) => {\n  const base44 = createClientFromRequest(req);\n  const { orderId, action } = await req.json();\n  // Process with service role for admin access\n  const order = await base44.asServiceRole.entities.Orders.get(orderId);\n  return Response.json({ success: true });\n});\n```\n\n### Service Role Access\n\nUse `asServiceRole` in backend functions for admin-level operations:\n\n```javascript\n// User mode - respects permissions\nconst myTasks = await base44.entities.Task.list();\n\n// Service role - full access (backend only)\nconst allTasks = await base44.asServiceRole.entities.Task.list();\nconst token = await base44.asServiceRole.connectors.getAccessToken(\"slack\");\n```\n\n## Frontend vs Backend\n\n| Capability | Frontend | Backend |\n|------------|----------|---------|\n| `entities` (user''s data) | Yes | Yes |\n| `auth` | Yes | Yes |\n| `agents` | Yes | Yes |\n| `functions.invoke()` | Yes | Yes |\n| `integrations` | Yes | Yes |\n| `analytics` | Yes | Yes |\n| `appLogs` | Yes | Yes |\n| `users` | Yes | Yes |\n| `asServiceRole.*` | No | Yes |\n| `connectors` | No | Yes |\n\nBackend functions use `Deno.serve()` and `createClientFromRequest(req)` to get a properly authenticated client.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:28:55.169Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full Stack Agents needing seamless integration with Cloudflare Workers and React for building immersive Pokémon game experiences.","zh":"非常适合需要与Cloudflare Workers和React实现无缝集成的全栈代理，用于构建身临其境的宝可梦游戏体验。","ja":"Cloudflare WorkersおよびReactとのシームレスな統合が必要なフルスタックエージェントに最適で、没入感のあるポケモンゲーム体験を構築することができます。","ko":"클라우드플레어 워커와 리액트와의無縫な 통합이 필요한 풀스택 에이전트에게 적합하며, 몰입감 있는 포켓몬 게임 경험을 구축하는 데 사용할 수 있습니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Full Stack que necesitan una integración sin problemas con Cloudflare Workers y React para crear experiencias de juego de Pokémon inmersivas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full Stack ayant besoin d''une intégration transparente avec Cloudflare Workers et React pour créer des expériences de jeu Pokémon immersives.","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agents, die eine nahtlose Integration mit Cloudflare Workers und React für die Erstellung immersiver Pokémon-Spieleerfahrungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full Stack que precisam de integração sem interrupções com Cloudflare Workers e React para criar experiências de jogos Pokémon imersivas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для полнофункциональных агентов, которым необходима бесшовная интеграция с Cloudflare Workers и React для создания иммерсивных игровых опытов Pokémon.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء متعددة المهام الذين يحتاجون إلى تكامل بدون انقطاع مع Cloudflare Workers و React لإنشاء تجارب ألعاب Pokémon غامرة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build apps on the Base44 platform using the Base44 JavaScript SDK, leveraging React and Cloudflare Workers for robust and scalable applications, with features activated by detecting ''base44/'' folders or mentions of ''base44'' and utilizing files like ''base44/config.jsonc'' for project setup.","zh":"赋予代理商在Base44平台上构建应用程序的能力，使用Base44 JavaScript SDK，利用React和Cloudflare Workers进行强大且可扩展的应用程序开发，并通过检测''base44/''文件夹或提及''base44''来激活功能，并利用''base44/config.jsonc''文件进行项目设置。","ja":"エージェントがBase44プラットフォーム上でアプリケーションを構築できるようにし、Base44 JavaScript SDKを使用し、ReactおよびCloudflare Workersを活用して強力でスケーラブルなアプリケーションを開発し、''base44/''フォルダまたは''base44''の言及を検出して機能を有効にし、プロジェクト設定のために''base44/config.jsonc''ファイルを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 Base44 플랫폼에서 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있도록 하며, Base44 자바스크립트 SDK를 사용하여 리액트 및 클라우드플레어 워커를 활용하여 강력하고 확장 가능한 애플리케이션을 개발하며, ''base44/'' 폴더나 ''base44'' 언급을 감지하여 기능을 활성화하며, 프로젝트 설정을 위해 ''base44/config.jsonc'' 파일을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear aplicaciones en la plataforma Base44 utilizando el SDK de JavaScript de Base44, aprovechando React y Cloudflare Workers para aplicaciones robustas y escalables, con características activadas detectando carpetas ''base44/'' o menciones de ''base44'' y utilizando archivos como ''base44/config.jsonc'' para la configuración del proyecto.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications sur la plateforme Base44 en utilisant le SDK JavaScript de Base44, en exploitant React et Cloudflare Workers pour des applications robustes et évolutives, avec des fonctionnalités activées en détectant des dossiers ''base44/'' ou des mentions de ''base44'' et en utilisant des fichiers comme ''base44/config.jsonc'' pour la configuration du projet.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Anwendungen auf der Base44-Plattform mit dem Base44-JavaScript-SDK zu erstellen, indem React und Cloudflare Workers für robuste und skalierbare Anwendungen genutzt werden, mit Funktionen, die durch Erkennen von ''base44/''-Ordnern oder Erwähnungen von ''base44'' und Verwenden von Dateien wie ''base44/config.jsonc'' für die Projektkonfiguration aktiviert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir aplicativos na plataforma Base44 usando o SDK JavaScript Base44, aproveitando React e Cloudflare Workers para aplicações robustas e escaláveis, com recursos ativados por detecção de pastas ''base44/'' ou menções de ''base44'' e utilizando arquivos como ''base44/config.jsonc'' para configuração do projeto.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать приложения на платформе Base44 с помощью SDK JavaScript Base44, используя React и Cloudflare Workers для создания прочных и масштабируемых приложений, с функциями, активируемыми путем обнаружения папок ''base44/'' или упоминаний ''base44'' и использования файлов, таких как ''base44/config.jsonc'', для настройки проекта.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من بناء التطبيقات على منصة Base44 باستخدام SDK JavaScript Base44، واستخدام React و Cloudflare Workers لتطبيقات قوية وموسعة، مع ميزات تم تفعيلها بواسطة كشف مجلدات ''base44/'' أو ذكر ''base44'' و sửة ملفات مثل ''base44/config.jsonc'' لإعداد المشروع."},"useCases":{"en":["Initializing Base44 projects by checking for ''base44/config.jsonc''","Implementing features for existing Base44 projects","Building Pokémon games with React and Cloudflare Workers"],"zh":["通过检查''base44/config.jsonc''来初始化Base44项目","为现有的Base44项目实现功能","使用React和Cloudflare Workers构建宝可梦游戏"],"ja":["''base44/config.jsonc''を確認してBase44プロジェクトを初期化する","既存のBase44プロジェクトに機能を実装する","ReactおよびCloudflare Workersを使用してポケモンゲームを構築する"],"ko":["''base44/config.jsonc''를 확인하여 Base44 프로젝트를 초기화하는 것","기존의 Base44 프로젝트에 기능을 구현하는 것","리액트 및 클라우드플레어 워커를 사용하여 포켓몬 게임을 구축하는 것"],"es":["Inicializar proyectos Base44 comprobando ''base44/config.jsonc''","Implementar características para proyectos Base44 existentes","Crear juegos de Pokémon con React y Cloudflare Workers"],"fr":["Initialiser des projets Base44 en vérifiant ''base44/config.jsonc''","Mettre en œuvre des fonctionnalités pour les projets Base44 existants","Créer des jeux Pokémon avec React et Cloudflare Workers"],"de":["Base44-Projekte initialisieren, indem ''base44/config.jsonc'' überprüft wird","Funktionen für bestehende Base44-Projekte implementieren","Pokémon-Spiele mit React und Cloudflare Workers erstellen"],"pt":["Inicializar projetos Base44 verificando ''base44/config.jsonc''","Implementar recursos para projetos Base44 existentes","Construir jogos Pokémon com React e Cloudflare Workers"],"ru":["Инициализация проектов Base44 путем проверки ''base44/config.jsonc''","Реализация функций для существующих проектов Base44","Создание игр Pokémon с помощью React и Cloudflare Workers"],"ar":["تثبيت مشاريع Base44 من خلال التحقق من ''base44/config.jsonc''","تنفيذ الميزات للمشاريع Base44 الحالية","بناء ألعاب Pokémon مع React و Cloudflare Workers"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires ''base44/'' folder or mention of ''base44'' to activate","Needs ''base44/config.jsonc'' for existing project handling"],"zh":["需要''base44/''文件夹或''base44''的提及来激活功能","需要''base44/config.jsonc''来处理现有的项目"],"ja":["機能を有効にするために''base44/''フォルダまたは''base44''の言及が必要","既存のプロジェクトの処理に''base44/config.jsonc''が必要"],"ko":["기능을 활성화하기 위해 ''base44/'' 폴더나 ''base44'' 언급이 필요","기존 프로젝트의 처리를 위해 ''base44/config.jsonc''가 필요"],"es":["Requiere una carpeta ''base44/'' o mención de ''base44'' para activar","Necesita ''base44/config.jsonc'' para el manejo de proyectos existentes"],"fr":["Nécessite un dossier ''base44/'' ou une mention de ''base44'' pour activer","A besoin de ''base44/config.jsonc'' pour la gestion de projets existants"],"de":["Benötigt einen ''base44/''-Ordner oder eine Erwähnung von ''base44'', um zu aktivieren","Benötigt ''base44/config.jsonc'' für die Verwaltung bestehender Projekte"],"pt":["Exige pasta ''base44/'' ou menção de ''base44'' para ativar","Necessita ''base44/config.jsonc'' para tratamento de projetos existentes"],"ru":["Требует папки ''base44/'' или упоминания ''base44'' для активации","Требует ''base44/config.jsonc'' для обработки существующих проектов"],"ar":["يتطلب مجلد ''base44/'' أو ذكر ''base44'' لتفعيل","يحتاج ''base44/config.jsonc'' لمعالجة المشاريع الحالية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
