,"React Three Fiber","animations","importation de ressources","règles personnalisées"],"de":["Remotion","Software-Entwicklung","Benutzererfahrungen","Three.js","React Three Fiber","Animationen","Import von Ressourcen","benutzerdefinierte Regeln"],"pt":["Remotion","melhores práticas","3D","animações","importação de ativos","desenvolvimento de vídeo","plataforma de código aberto"],"ru":["Remotion","лучшие практики","3D","анимации","импорт активов","разработка видео","открытая платформа"],"ar":["Remotion","أفضل الممارسات","3D","الرسوم المتحركة","استيراد الأصول","تطوير الفيديو","منصة مفتوحة المصدر"]}},"owner":"Spagestic","repo":"thenorthstar","repoPath":"Spagestic/thenorthstar","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.421Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"remotion-best-practices","description":"Best practices for Remotion - Video creation in React","tags":"remotion, video, react, animation, composition","bodyPreview":"## When to use\n\nUse this skills whenever you are dealing with Remotion code to obtain the domain-specific knowledge.\n\n## How to use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [rules/3d.md](rules/3d.md) - 3D content in Remotion using Three.js and React Three Fiber\n- [rules/animations.md](rules/animations.md) - Fundamental animation skills for Remotion\n- [rules/assets.md](rules/assets.md) - Importing images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion\n- [rules/audio.md]","body":"## When to use\n\nUse this skills whenever you are dealing with Remotion code to obtain the domain-specific knowledge.\n\n## How to use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [rules/3d.md](rules/3d.md) - 3D content in Remotion using Three.js and React Three Fiber\n- [rules/animations.md](rules/animations.md) - Fundamental animation skills for Remotion\n- [rules/assets.md](rules/assets.md) - Importing images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion\n- [rules/audio.md](rules/audio.md) - Using audio and sound in Remotion - importing, trimming, volume, speed, pitch\n- [rules/calculate-metadata.md](rules/calculate-metadata.md) - Dynamically set composition duration, dimensions, and props\n- [rules/can-decode.md](rules/can-decode.md) - Check if a video can be decoded by the browser using Mediabunny\n- [rules/charts.md](rules/charts.md) - Chart and data visualization patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/compositions.md](rules/compositions.md) - Defining compositions, stills, folders, default props and dynamic metadata\n- [rules/display-captions.md](rules/display-captions.md) - Displaying captions in Remotion with TikTok-style pages and word highlighting\n- [rules/extract-frames.md](rules/extract-frames.md) - Extract frames from videos at specific timestamps using Mediabunny\n- [rules/fonts.md](rules/fonts.md) - Loading Google Fonts and local fonts in Remotion\n- [rules/get-audio-duration.md](rules/get-audio-duration.md) - Getting the duration of an audio file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-dimensions.md](rules/get-video-dimensions.md) - Getting the width and height of a video file with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-duration.md](rules/get-video-duration.md) - Getting the duration of a video file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/gifs.md](rules/gifs.md) - Displaying GIFs synchronized with Remotion''s timeline\n- [rules/images.md](rules/images.md) - Embedding images in Remotion using the Img component\n- [rules/import-srt-captions.md](rules/import-srt-captions.md) - Importing .srt subtitle files into Remotion using @remotion/captions\n- [rules/lottie.md](rules/lottie.md) - Embedding Lottie animations in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md](rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md) - Measuring DOM element dimensions in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-text.md](rules/measuring-text.md) - Measuring text dimensions, fitting text to containers, and checking overflow\n- [rules/sequencing.md](rules/sequencing.md) - Sequencing patterns for Remotion - delay, trim, limit duration of items\n- [rules/tailwind.md](rules/tailwind.md) - Using TailwindCSS in Remotion\n- [rules/text-animations.md](rules/text-animations.md) - Typography and text animation patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/timing.md](rules/timing.md) - Interpolation curves in Remotion - linear, easing, spring animations\n- [rules/transcribe-captions.md](rules/transcribe-captions.md) - Transcribing audio to generate captions in Remotion\n- [rules/transitions.md](rules/transitions.md) - Scene transition patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/trimming.md](rules/trimming.md) - Trimming patterns for Remotion - cut the beginning or end of animations\n- [rules/videos.md](rules/videos.md) - Embedding videos in Remotion - trimming, volume, speed, looping, pitch\n- [rules/parameters.md](rules/parameters.md) - Make a video parametrizable by adding a Zod schema\n- [rules/maps.md](rules/maps.md) - Add a map using Mapbox and animate it\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:29:13.756Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents specializing in video production and animation, needing advanced Remotion capabilities for 3D content and animations","zh":"非常适合专门从事视频制作和动画的AI代理，需要高级Remotion功能用于3D内容和动画","ja":"ビデオ制作およびアニメーションに特化したAIエージェントに最適で、3Dコンテンツおよびアニメーション用の高度なRemotion機能が必要","ko":"비디오 제작 및 애니메이션을 전문으로 하는 AI 에이전트에게 적합하며 3D 콘텐츠 및 애니메이션을 위한 고급 Remotion 기능이 필요함","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que se especializan en producción de video y animación, y necesitan capacidades avanzadas de Remotion para contenido y animaciones 3D","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA spécialisés dans la production de vidéos et l''animation, ayant besoin de capacités avancées de Remotion pour le contenu et les animations 3D","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die sich auf Videoproduktion und Animation spezialisieren und erweiterte Remotion-Funktionen für 3D-Inhalte und -Animationen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA especializados em produção de vídeo e animação, necessitando de capacidades avançadas de Remotion para conteúdo e animações 3D","ru":"Идеально для ИИ-агентов, специализирующихся на производстве видео и анимации, требующих расширенных возможностей Remotion для 3D-контента и анимаций","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المتخصص في إنتاج الفيديو والرسوم المتحركة، والذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة من Remotion ل내容 ورسوم متحركة 3D"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create immersive video experiences using Three.js and React Three Fiber for 3D content, and master fundamental animation skills for engaging visuals, while efficiently importing and managing assets such as images, videos, audio, and fonts","zh":"赋予代理创建使用Three.js和React Three Fiber进行3D内容的沉浸式视频体验的能力，掌握基本的动画技能以创建吸引人的视觉效果，同时高效地导入和管理图像、视频、音频和字体等资产","ja":"Three.jsおよびReact Three Fiberを使用した3Dコンテンツのイマーシブなビデオ体験を作成するエージェントの能力を提供し、魅力的なビジュアルを作成するための基本的なアニメーションスキルをマスターし、画像、ビデオ、オーディオ、フォントなどの資産を効率的にインポートおよび管理する","ko":"에이전트가 Three.js 및 React Three Fiber를 사용하여 3D 콘텐츠의 몰입형 비디오 경험을 생성할 수 있는 능력을 제공하고, 매력적인 시각 효과를 생성하기 위한 기본적인 애니메이션 스킬을 마스터하며, 이미지, 비디오, 오디오, 글꼴 등의 자산을 효율적으로 가져오고 관리함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear experiencias de video inmersivas utilizando Three.js y React Three Fiber para contenido 3D, y a dominar habilidades de animación fundamentales para visuales atractivas, mientras importa y gestiona eficientemente activos como imágenes, videos, audio y fuentes","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des expériences de vidéo immersives en utilisant Three.js et React Three Fiber pour le contenu 3D, et de maîtriser les compétences d''animation fondamentales pour des visuels engageants, tout en important et en gérant efficacement les ressources telles que les images, les vidéos, l''audio et les polices","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, immersive Videoumgebungen mit Three.js und React Three Fiber für 3D-Inhalte zu erstellen und grundlegende Animationsfähigkeiten für ansprechende visuelle Effekte zu meistern, während sie aktiv wie Bilder, Videos, Audio und Schriftarten effizient importieren und verwalten","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar experiências de vídeo imersivas usando Three.js e React Three Fiber para conteúdo 3D, e dominar habilidades de animação fundamentais para visuais atraentes, além de importar e gerenciar ativos como imagens, vídeos, áudio e fontes de forma eficiente","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать иммерсивные видеоопыты, используя Three.js и React Three Fiber для 3D-контента, и осваивать основные навыки анимации для увлекательных визуальных эффектов, а также эффективно импортировать и управлять активами, такими как изображения, видео, аудио и шрифты","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية إنشاء تجارب فيديو غامرة باستخدام Three.js و React Three Fiber ل내容 3D، وتطوير المهارات الأساسية للرسوم المتحركة من أجل صور جذابة، وكفاءة استيراد وإدارة الملفات مثل الصور والفيديو والصوت والخطوط"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating 3D animations for explainer videos","Optimizing video asset imports for faster rendering","Debugging animation timelines for smoother transitions"],"zh":["为解释性视频生成3D动画","优化视频资产导入以实现更快的渲染","调试动画时间轴以实现更平滑的过渡"],"ja":["解説ビデオ用の3Dアニメーションを生成する","レンダリングを高速化するためにビデオアセットのインポートを最適化する","スムーズな遷移を実現するためにアニメーションタイムラインをデバッグする"],"ko":["설명 비디오를 위한 3D 애니메이션 생성","렌더링을 더 빠르게 하기 위한 비디오 자산 가져오기 최적화","부드러운 전환을 위해 애니메이션 타임라인 디버깅"],"es":["Generar animaciones 3D para vídeos explicativos","Optimizar la importación de activos de video para un renderizado más rápido","Depurar las líneas de tiempo de animación para transiciones más suaves"],"fr":["Générer des animations 3D pour des vidéos explicatives","Optimiser l''importation de ressources vidéo pour un rendu plus rapide","Déboguer les chronologies d''animation pour des transitions plus fluides"],"de":["Erzeugen von 3D-Animationen für Erklärvideos","Optimieren des Videoasset-Imports für schnellere Renderung","Debuggen von Animationszeitachsen für reibungslosere Übergänge"],"pt":["Geração de animações 3D para vídeos explicativos","Otimização da importação de ativos de vídeo para renderização mais rápida","Depuração de cronogramas de animação para transições mais suaves"],"ru":["Генерация 3D-анимаций для экспозиционных видеороликов","Оптимизация импорта видеоактивов для более быстрого рендеринга","Отладка временных шкал анимации для более плавных переходов"],"ar":["توليد الرسوم المتحركة 3D لأفلام الفيديو التوضيحية","تحسين استيراد الملفات الفيديوية لجعل العرض أسرع","تصحيح الأخطاء في جداول الرسوم المتحركة لجعل الانتقالات أكثر سلاسة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Remotion codebase access","Familiarity with Three.js and React Three Fiber necessary","Limited to video and animation production tasks"],"zh":["需要Remotion代码库访问权限","需要熟悉Three.js和React Three Fiber","仅限视频和动画生产任务"],"ja":["Remotionコードベースへのアクセスが必要","Three.jsおよびReact Three Fiberに慣れていないと使用できない","ビデオおよびアニメーション制作タスクのみに限定される"],"ko":["Remotion 코드베이스 접근 권한 필요","Three.js 및 React Three Fiber에 익숙하지 않으면 사용할 수 없음","비디오 및 애니메이션 제작 작업만 사용 가능"],"es":["Requiere acceso al código base de Remotion","Familiaridad con Three.js y React Three Fiber necesaria","Limitado a tareas de producción de video y animación"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au code source de Remotion","Familiarité avec Three.js et React Three Fiber nécessaire","Limité aux tâches de production de vidéo et d''animation"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf den Remotion-Codebasis","Vertrautheit mit Three.js und React Three Fiber erforderlich","Begrenzt auf Videoproduktions- und Animationsaufgaben"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao código base do Remotion","Familiaridade com Three.js e React Three Fiber necessária","Limitado a tarefas de produção de vídeo e animação"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к кодовой базе Remotion","Необходимо знание Three.js и React Three Fiber","Ограничен задачами по производству видео и анимации"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى قاعدة الشفرة Remotion","الاحترافية بالثري جي إس ورياكت ثري فايبر ضرورية","محدود بمهمات إنتاج الفيديو والرسوم المتحركة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
