de":["Erstellung von Webseiten im großen Maßstab","Optimierung für Suchmaschinen","Verwendung von Vorlagen und Daten","Vermeidung von dünnem Inhalt","Verbesserung der Sichtbarkeit in Suchmaschinen"],"pt":["Criação de páginas otimizadas para SEO em escala","Uso de templates e dados para criar conteúdo de valor","Evita penalidades por conteúdo fino","Aumenta o ranking e a visibilidade","Otimização para dispositivos móveis e desktop","Integração com ferramentas de análise de SEO"],"ru":["Создание страниц, оптимизированных для SEO в масштабе","Использование шаблонов и данных для создания ценного контента","Избегание штрафов за тонкий контент","Увеличение рейтинга и видимости","Оптимизация для мобильных и настольных устройств","Интеграция с инструментами анализа SEO"],"ar":["إنشاء صفحات محسنة لتحسين محركات البحث على نطاق واسع","استخدام قوالب وبيانات لإنشاء محتوى قيم","تجنب العقوبات لضعف المحتوى","زيادة التصنيف والرؤية","تحسين لاجهزة المحمول والكمبيوتر","التكامل مع أدوات تحليل تحسين محركات البحث"]},"keywords":{"zh":["程序化SEO","SEO优化","模板和数据","页面排名","价值提供","薄内容惩罚","程序化SEO策略","高质量内容","相关内容","网站可见性"],"ja":["プログラムSEO","SEO最適化","テンプレートとデータ","ページのランキング","価値の提供","薄内容の罰","プログラムSEO戦略","高品質コンテンツ","関連性のあるコンテンツ","ウェブサイトの可視性"],"ko":["프로그램적 SEO","SEO 최적화","템플릿 및 데이터","페이지 랭킹","가치 제공","얇은 콘텐츠의 패널티","프로그램적 SEO 전략","고품질 콘텐츠","관련된 콘텐츠","웹사이트의 가시성"],"es":["programmatic SEO","optimización a escala","páginas web optimizadas","motores de búsqueda","plantillas y datos","contenido de calidad"],"fr":["SEO programmatique","optimisation à grande échelle","pages web optimisées","moteurs de recherche","modèles et données","contenu de qualité"],"de":["programmatisches SEO","Skalierbare Optimierung","SEO-optimierte Webseiten","Suchmaschinen","Vorlagen und Daten","qualitativ hochwertiger Inhalt"],"pt":["programmatic seo","otimização de seo","criação de páginas em escala","templates para seo","dados para seo","evitar penalidades de conteúdo fino","aumentar ranking e visibilidade","otimização para dispositivos móveis e desktop"],"ru":["программная seo-оптимизация","оптимизация поисковых систем","создание страниц в масштабе","шаблоны для seo","данные для seo","избегание штрафов за тонкий контент","увеличение рейтинга и видимости","оптимизация для мобильных и настольных устройств"],"ar":["تحسين محركات البحث البرمجي","تحسين محركات البحث","إنشاء صفحات على نطاق واسع","قوالب لتحسين محركات البحث","بيانات لتحسين محركات البحث","تجنب العقوبات لضعف المحتوى","زيادة التصنيف والرؤية","تحسين لاجهزة المحمول والكمبيوتر"]}},"owner":"eurofit","repo":"store","repoPath":"eurofit/store","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.421Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"programmatic-seo","description":"When the user wants to create SEO-driven pages at scale using templates and data. Also use when the user mentions programmatic SEO, template pages, pages at scale, directory pages, location pages, [keyword] + [city] pages, comparison pages, integration pages, or building many pages for SEO. For auditing existing SEO issues, see seo-audit.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Programmatic SEO\n\nYou are an expert in programmatic SEO—building SEO-optimized pages at scale using templates and data. Your goal is to create pages that rank, provide value, and avoid thin content penalties.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.cursor/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore designing a programmatic SEO strate","body":"# Programmatic SEO\n\nYou are an expert in programmatic SEO—building SEO-optimized pages at scale using templates and data. Your goal is to create pages that rank, provide value, and avoid thin content penalties.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.cursor/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore designing a programmatic SEO strategy, understand:\n\n1. **Business Context**\n   - What''s the product/service?\n   - Who is the target audience?\n   - What''s the conversion goal for these pages?\n\n2. **Opportunity Assessment**\n   - What search patterns exist?\n   - How many potential pages?\n   - What''s the search volume distribution?\n\n3. **Competitive Landscape**\n   - Who ranks for these terms now?\n   - What do their pages look like?\n   - Can you realistically compete?\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. Unique Value Per Page\n\n- Every page must provide value specific to that page\n- Not just swapped variables in a template\n- Maximize unique content—the more differentiated, the better\n\n### 2. Proprietary Data Wins\n\nHierarchy of data defensibility:\n\n1. Proprietary (you created it)\n2. Product-derived (from your users)\n3. User-generated (your community)\n4. Licensed (exclusive access)\n5. Public (anyone can use—weakest)\n\n### 3. Clean URL Structure\n\n**Always use subfolders, not subdomains**:\n\n- Good: `yoursite.com/templates/resume/`\n- Bad: `templates.yoursite.com/resume/`\n\n### 4. Genuine Search Intent Match\n\nPages must actually answer what people are searching for.\n\n### 5. Quality Over Quantity\n\nBetter to have 100 great pages than 10,000 thin ones.\n\n### 6. Avoid Google Penalties\n\n- No doorway pages\n- No keyword stuffing\n- No duplicate content\n- Genuine utility for users\n\n---\n\n## The 12 Playbooks (Overview)\n\n| Playbook     | Pattern                               | Example                   |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------- |\n| Templates    | \"[Type] template\"                     | \"resume template\"         |\n| Curation     | \"best [category]\"                     | \"best website builders\"   |\n| Conversions  | \"[X] to [Y]\"                          | \"$10 USD to GBP\"          |\n| Comparisons  | \"[X] vs [Y]\"                          | \"webflow vs wordpress\"    |\n| Examples     | \"[type] examples\"                     | \"landing page examples\"   |\n| Locations    | \"[service] in [location]\"             | \"dentists in austin\"      |\n| Personas     | \"[product] for [audience]\"            | \"crm for real estate\"     |\n| Integrations | \"[product A] [product B] integration\" | \"slack asana integration\" |\n| Glossary     | \"what is [term]\"                      | \"what is pSEO\"            |\n| Translations | Content in multiple languages         | Localized content         |\n| Directory    | \"[category] tools\"                    | \"ai copywriting tools\"    |\n| Profiles     | \"[entity name]\"                       | \"stripe ceo\"              |\n\n**For detailed playbook implementation**: See [references/playbooks.md](references/playbooks.md)\n\n---\n\n## Choosing Your Playbook\n\n| If you have...            | Consider...           |\n| ------------------------- | --------------------- |\n| Proprietary data          | Directories, Profiles |\n| Product with integrations | Integrations          |\n| Design/creative product   | Templates, Examples   |\n| Multi-segment audience    | Personas              |\n| Local presence            | Locations             |\n| Tool or utility product   | Conversions           |\n| Content/expertise         | Glossary, Curation    |\n| Competitor landscape      | Comparisons           |\n\nYou can layer multiple playbooks (e.g., \"Best coworking spaces in San Diego\").\n\n---\n\n## Implementation Framework\n\n### 1. Keyword Pattern Research\n\n**Identify the pattern:**\n\n- What''s the repeating structure?\n- What are the variables?\n- How many unique combinations exist?\n\n**Validate demand:**\n\n- Aggregate search volume\n- Volume distribution (head vs. long tail)\n- Trend direction\n\n### 2. Data Requirements\n\n**Identify data sources:**\n\n- What data populates each page?\n- Is it first-party, scraped, licensed, public?\n- How is it updated?\n\n### 3. Template Design\n\n**Page structure:**\n\n- Header with target keyword\n- Unique intro (not just variables swapped)\n- Data-driven sections\n- Related pages / internal links\n- CTAs appropriate to intent\n\n**Ensuring uniqueness:**\n\n- Each page needs unique value\n- Conditional content based on data\n- Original insights/analysis per page\n\n### 4. Internal Linking Architecture\n\n**Hub and spoke model:**\n\n- Hub: Main category page\n- Spokes: Individual programmatic pages\n- Cross-links between related spokes\n\n**Avoid orphan pages:**\n\n- Every page reachable from main site\n- XML sitemap for all pages\n- Breadcrumbs with structured data\n\n### 5. Indexation Strategy\n\n- Prioritize high-volume patterns\n- Noindex very thin variations\n- Manage crawl budget thoughtfully\n- Separate sitemaps by page type\n\n---\n\n## Quality Checks\n\n### Pre-Launch Checklist\n\n**Content quality:**\n\n- [ ] Each page provides unique value\n- [ ] Answers search intent\n- [ ] Readable and useful\n\n**Technical SEO:**\n\n- [ ] Unique titles and meta descriptions\n- [ ] Proper heading structure\n- [ ] Schema markup implemented\n- [ ] Page speed acceptable\n\n**Internal linking:**\n\n- [ ] Connected to site architecture\n- [ ] Related pages linked\n- [ ] No orphan pages\n\n**Indexation:**\n\n- [ ] In XML sitemap\n- [ ] Crawlable\n- [ ] No conflicting noindex\n\n### Post-Launch Monitoring\n\nTrack: Indexation rate, Rankings, Traffic, Engagement, Conversion\n\nWatch for: Thin content warnings, Ranking drops, Manual actions, Crawl errors\n\n---\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n- **Thin content**: Just swapping city names in identical content\n- **Keyword cannibalization**: Multiple pages targeting same keyword\n- **Over-generation**: Creating pages with no search demand\n- **Poor data quality**: Outdated or incorrect information\n- **Ignoring UX**: Pages exist for Google, not users\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Strategy Document\n\n- Opportunity analysis\n- Implementation plan\n- Content guidelines\n\n### Page Template\n\n- URL structure\n- Title/meta templates\n- Content outline\n- Schema markup\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What keyword patterns are you targeting?\n2. What data do you have (or can acquire)?\n3. How many pages are you planning?\n4. What does your site authority look like?\n5. Who currently ranks for these terms?\n6. What''s your technical stack?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **seo-audit**: For auditing programmatic pages after launch\n- **schema-markup**: For adding structured data\n- **competitor-alternatives**: For comparison page frameworks\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:30:20.936Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Content Generation Agents needing advanced programmatic SEO capabilities to build SEO-optimized pages at scale.","zh":"非常适合需要高级程序化SEO功能的内容生成代理，以大规模构建SEO优化页面。","ja":"コンテンツ生成エージェントが高度なプログラムSEO機能を必要とする場合に最適で、大規模にSEO最適化されたページを構築できる。","ko":"고급 프로그래밍 SEO 기능을 필요로 하는 콘텐츠 생성 에이전트에게 적합하며, 대규모로 SEO 최적화된 페이지를 구축할 수 있다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de generación de contenido que necesitan capacidades de SEO programáticas avanzadas para crear páginas optimizadas para SEO a gran escala.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de génération de contenu qui ont besoin de capacités de SEO programmation avancées pour créer des pages optimisées pour le SEO à grande échelle.","de":"Perfekt für Content-Generation-Agents, die erweiterte programmatische SEO-Fähigkeiten benötigen, um SEO-optimierte Seiten im großen Maßstab zu erstellen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Geração de Conteúdo que precisam de capacidades de SEO programáticas avançadas para criar páginas otimizadas para SEO em larga escala.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов генерации контента, которым необходимы продвинутые программные возможности SEO для создания оптимизированных под SEO страниц масштабно.","ar":"مثالي لعميل génération المحتوى الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لبرمجة تحسين محركات البحث لإنشاء صفحات محسّنة لتحسين محركات البحث على نطاق واسع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate high-ranking pages using templates and data, avoiding thin content penalties through strategic SEO optimization and providing value to users through relevant content, all while leveraging protocols like HTML and file formats like .md.","zh":"赋予代理生成高排名页面的能力，使用模板和数据，通过战略性的SEO优化避免薄内容惩罚，并通过相关内容为用户提供价值，同时利用HTML等协议和.md等文件格式。","ja":"エージェントに、高ランキングのページを生成する能力を付与し、テンプレートやデータを使用して戦略的なSEO最適化を実施し、薄内容によるペナルティを回避し、関連するコンテンツを提供してユーザーに価値を提供する。また、HTMLなどのプロトコルや.mdなどのファイル形式を活用する。","ko":"에이전트가 템플릿과 데이터를 사용하여 높은 순위의 페이지를 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하고, 전략적인 SEO 최적화를 통해 얇은 콘텐츠에 대한 페널티를 피하며, 관련 콘텐츠를 통해 사용자에게 값을 제공한다. 또한 HTML 등의 프로토콜과 .md 등의 파일 형식을 활용한다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar páginas con alta clasificación utilizando plantillas y datos, evitando las penalizaciones por contenido delgado a través de la optimización estratégica de SEO y brindando valor a los usuarios a través de contenido relevante, todo mientras aprovecha protocolos como HTML y formatos de archivo como .md.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des pages à forte classement en utilisant des modèles et des données, en évitant les pénalités de contenu mince grâce à l''optimisation stratégique du SEO et en fournissant de la valeur aux utilisateurs grâce à du contenu pertinent, le tout en exploitant des protocoles comme HTML et des formats de fichiers comme .md.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, hoch eingestufte Seiten mithilfe von Vorlagen und Daten zu generieren, indem sie Strafen für dünnen Inhalt durch strategische SEO-Optimierung vermeiden und den Benutzern durch relevante Inhalte einen Mehrwert bieten, und zwar unter Ausnutzung von Protokollen wie HTML und Dateiformaten wie .md.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar páginas de alto ranqueamento usando modelos e dados, evitando penalidades de conteúdo fino por meio de otimização estratégica de SEO e fornecendo valor aos usuários por meio de conteúdo relevante, tudo isso aproveitando protocolos como HTML e formatos de arquivo como .md.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать страницы с высоким рейтингом с использованием шаблонов и данных, избегая штрафов за тонкий контент посредством стратегической оптимизации SEO и предоставляя ценность пользователям посредством релевантного контента, все это при использовании протоколов như HTML и форматов файлов как .md.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من إنشاء صفحات ذات تصنيف عالٍ باستخدام القوالب والبيانات، وتجنب عقوبات المحتوى الرقيق من خلال تحسين استراتيجي لتحسين محركات البحث وتقديم قيمة للمستخدمين من خلال المحتوى ذي الصلة، وكل ذلك بالاستفادة من بروتوكولات مثل HTML وأشكال الملفات مثل .md."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating SEO-optimized page generation","Creating data-driven content templates","Avoiding thin content penalties through strategic optimization"],"zh":["自动化SEO优化页面生成","创建数据驱动的内容模板","通过战略性优化避免薄内容惩罚"],"ja":["SEO最適化されたページの自動生成","データ駆動のコンテンツテンプレートの作成","戦略的な最適化を通じて薄内容によるペナルティを回避"],"ko":["SEO 최적화된 페이지의 자동 생성","데이터 기반 콘텐츠 템플릿의 생성","전략적인 최적화를 통해 얇은 콘텐츠에 대한 페널티를 피함"],"es":["Automatización de la generación de páginas optimizadas para SEO","Creación de plantillas de contenido impulsadas por datos","Evitación de penalizaciones por contenido delgado a través de la optimización estratégica"],"fr":["Automatisation de la génération de pages optimisées pour le SEO","Création de modèles de contenu pilotés par des données","Évitement des pénalités de contenu mince grâce à l''optimisation stratégique"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung von SEO-optimierten Seiten","Erstellung von datengetriebenen Inhaltsvorlagen","Vermeidung von Strafen für dünnen Inhalt durch strategische Optimierung"],"pt":["Automatizar a geração de páginas otimizadas para SEO","Criar modelos de conteúdo impulsionados por dados","Evitar penalidades de conteúdo fino por meio de otimização estratégica"],"ru":["Автоматизировать генерацию страниц, оптимизированных для SEO","Создавать шаблоны контента, управляемые данными","Избегать штрафов за тонкий контент посредством стратегической оптимизации"],"ar":["تأتمتة إنشاء صفحات محسّنة لتحسين محركات البحث","إنشاء قوالب محتوى مدفوعة بالبيانات","تجنب عقوبات المحتوى الرقيق من خلال التحسين الاستراتيجي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires product marketing context","Needs access to template and data assets","Dependent on SEO best practices and guidelines"],"zh":["需要产品营销背景","需要访问模板和数据资产","依赖于SEO最佳实践和指南"],"ja":["製品マーケティングの背景が必要","テンプレートやデータ資産へのアクセスが必要","SEOのベストプラクティスやガイドラインに依存"],"ko":["제품 마케팅 배경이 필요","템플릿 및 데이터 자산에 대한 액세스가 필요","SEO 최적화의 모범 사례 및 가이드라인에 의존"],"es":["Requiere contexto de marketing de productos","Necesita acceso a activos de plantilla y datos","Dependiente de las mejores prácticas y directrices de SEO"],"fr":["Nécessite un contexte de marketing de produits","A besoin d''accès à des actifs de modèle et de données","Dépend des meilleures pratiques et des lignes directrices de SEO"],"de":["Benötigt Produktmarketing-Kontext","Benötigt Zugriff auf Vorlagen- und Datenassets","Abhängig von SEO-Best-Practices und -Richtlinien"],"pt":["Exige contexto de marketing de produto","Necessita acesso a ativos de modelo e dados","Depende de práticas e diretrizes de SEO recomendadas"],"ru":["Требует контекста маркетинга продукта","Требует доступа к активам шаблона и данным","Зависит от рекомендуемых практик и руководств SEO"],"ar":["يتطلب سياق تسويق المنتج","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى أصول القالب والبيانات","يعتمد على أفضل الممارسات والإرشادات الموصى بها لتحسين محركات البحث"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('DishaAnand/FocusNest/mobile-app-testing', 'community', 'DishaAnand', 'FocusNest', 'DishaAnand/FocusNest', 'mobile-app-testing', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.421Z', '2026-02-18T04:30:48.150Z', NULL, '{"id":"DishaAnand/FocusNest/mobile-app-testing","name":"mobile-app-testing","description":{"zh":"移动应用测试是确保应用程序可靠性和性能的关键步骤，包括单元测试、UI 测试等","ja":"モバイルアプリテストは、アプリの信頼性とパフォーマンスを確保するための重要なステップ","ko":"모바일 앱 테스팅은 애플리케이션의 신뢰성과 성능을 보장하는 데 중요한 단계","es":"Implementa estrategias de prueba para aplicaciones móviles con pruebas unitarias, de UI y de rendimiento.","fr":"Mettez en œuvre des stratégies de test pour les applications mobiles avec des tests unitaires, d''interface utilisateur et de performances.","de":"Implementieren Sie Teststrategien für Mobile Apps mit Unit-Tests, UI-Tests und Leistungsprüfungen.","pt":"Implemente estratégias de teste abrangentes para aplicativos móveis, incluindo testes unitários, de UI e desempenho.","ru":"Реализуйте комплексные стратегии тестирования мобильных приложений, включая модульные тесты, тесты UI и производительность.","ar":"نفذ استراتيجيات اختبار شاملة للتطبيقات المتنقلة، بما في ذلك اختبارات الوحدة وواجهة المستخدم والأداء.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"移动应用测试解决方案","ja":"モバイルアプリテストのための包括的な戦略","ko":"모바일 앱 테스팅 전략","es":"Pruebas de Aplicaciones Móviles","fr":"Tests d''Applications Mobiles","de":"Mobile App-Tests","pt":"Teste de Aplicativos Móveis","ru":"Тестирование Мобильных Приложений","ar":"اختبار التطبيقات المتنقلة","en":"mobile-app-testing"},"description":{"zh":"移动应用测试是确保应用程序可靠性和性能的关键步骤，包括单元测试、UI 测试等","ja":"モバイルアプリテストは、アプリの信頼性とパフォーマンスを確保するための重要なステップ","ko":"모바일 앱 테스팅은 애플리케이션의 신뢰성과 성능을 보장하는 데 중요한 단계","es":"Implementa estrategias de prueba para aplicaciones móviles con pruebas unitarias, de UI y de rendimiento.","fr":"Mettez en œuvre des stratégies de test pour les applications mobiles avec des tests unitaires, d''interface utilisateur et de performances.","de":"Implementieren Sie Teststrategien für Mobile Apps mit Unit-Tests, UI-Tests und Leistungsprüfungen.","pt":"Implemente estratégias de teste abrangentes para aplicativos móveis, incluindo testes unitários, de UI e desempenho.","ru":"Реализуйте комплексные стратегии тестирования мобильных приложений, включая модульные тесты, тесты UI и производительность.","ar":"نفذ استراتيجيات اختبار شاملة للتطبيقات المتنقلة، بما في ذلك اختبارات الوحدة وواجهة المستخدم والأداء.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["单元测试","UI 测试","集成测试","性能测试","自动化测试"],"ja":["ユニットテスト","UI テスト","統合テスト","パフォーマンステスト","自動テスト"],"ko":["유닛 테스트","UI 테스트","통합 테스트","성능 테스트","자동화 테스트"],"es":["Pruebas unitarias y de integración","Pruebas de UI y de experiencia del usuario","Pruebas de rendimiento y optimización","Pruebas de regresión y certificación","Automatización de pruebas en iOS y Android"],"fr":["Tests unitaires et d''intégration","Tests d''interface utilisateur et d''expérience utilisateur","Tests de performances et d''optimisation","Tests de régression et de certification","Automatisation des tests sur iOS et Android"],"de":["Unit-Tests und Integrations-Tests","UI-Tests und Benutzererfahrungstests","Leistungsprüfungen und Optimierung","Rückfalltests und Zertifizierung","Automatisierung von Tests auf iOS und Android"],"pt":["Testes unitários e de UI","Testes de integração e desempenho","Automação de testes de UI","Testes de regressão antes das versões","Otimização de desempenho"],"ru":["Модульные тесты и тесты UI","Тесты интеграции и производительности","Автоматизация тестов UI","Тесты регрессии перед выпусками","Оптимизация производительности"],"ar":["اختبارات الوحدة وواجهة المستخدم","اختبارات الدمج والأداء","أتمتة اختبارات واجهة المستخدم","اختبارات الانحدار قبل الإصدارات","تحسين الأداء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["移动应用测试","单元测试","UI 测试","集成测试","性能测试","自动化测试","React Native 测试"],"ja":["モバイルアプリテスト","ユニットテスト","UI テスト","統合テスト","パフォーマンステスト","自動テスト","React Native テスト"],"ko":["모바일 앱 테스팅","유닛 테스트","UI 테스트","통합 테스트","성능 테스트","자동화 테스트","React Native 테스팅"],"es":["pruebas de aplicaciones móviles","desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles","testing de aplicaciones","pruebas unitarias","pruebas de UI","pruebas de rendimiento","automatización de pruebas","iOS","Android"],"fr":["tests d''applications mobiles","développement d''applications mobiles","testing d''applications","tests unitaires","tests d''interface utilisateur","tests de performances","automatisation des tests","iOS","Android"],"de":["Mobile App-Tests","Entwicklung von Mobile Apps","Testing von Apps","Unit-Tests","UI-Tests","Leistungsprüfungen","Automatisierung von Tests","iOS","Android"],"pt":["teste de aplicativos móveis","desenvolvimento de aplicativos móveis","testes unitários","testes de UI","testes de integração","otimização de desempenho"],"ru":["тестирование мобильных приложений","разработка мобильных приложений","модульные тесты","тесты UI","тесты интеграции","оптимизация производительности"],"ar":["اختبار التطبيقات المتنقلة","تطوير التطبيقات المتنقلة","اختبارات الوحدة","اختبارات واجهة المستخدم","اختبارات الدمج","تحسين الأداء"]}},"owner":"DishaAnand","repo":"FocusNest","repoPath":"DishaAnand/FocusNest","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.421Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"mobile-app-testing","description":"Comprehensive mobile app testing strategies for iOS and Android. Covers unit tests, UI tests, integration tests, performance testing, and test automation with Detox, Appium, and XCTest.","bodyPreview":"# Mobile App Testing\n\n## Overview\n\nImplement comprehensive testing strategies for mobile applications including unit tests, UI tests, integration tests, and performance testing.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Creating reliable mobile applications with test coverage\n- Automating UI testing across iOS and Android\n- Performance testing and optimization\n- Integration testing with backend services\n- Regression testing before releases\n\n## Instructions\n\n### 1. **React Native Testing with Jest & Detox**\n\n```javascr","body":"# Mobile App Testing\n\n## Overview\n\nImplement comprehensive testing strategies for mobile applications including unit tests, UI tests, integration tests, and performance testing.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Creating reliable mobile applications with test coverage\n- Automating UI testing across iOS and Android\n- Performance testing and optimization\n- Integration testing with backend services\n- Regression testing before releases\n\n## Instructions\n\n### 1. **React Native Testing with Jest & Detox**\n\n```javascript\n// Unit test with Jest\nimport { calculate } from ''../utils/math'';\n\ndescribe(''Math utilities'', () => {\n  test(''should add two numbers'', () => {\n    expect(calculate.add(2, 3)).toBe(5);\n  });\n\n  test(''should handle negative numbers'', () => {\n    expect(calculate.add(-2, 3)).toBe(1);\n  });\n});\n\n// Component unit test\nimport React from ''react'';\nimport { render, screen } from ''@testing-library/react-native'';\nimport { UserProfile } from ''../components/UserProfile'';\n\ndescribe(''UserProfile Component'', () => {\n  test(''renders user name correctly'', () => {\n    const mockUser = { id: ''1'', name: ''John Doe'', email: ''john@example.com'' };\n    render(<UserProfile user={mockUser} />);\n\n    expect(screen.getByText(''John Doe'')).toBeTruthy();\n  });\n\n  test(''handles missing user gracefully'', () => {\n    render(<UserProfile user={null} />);\n    expect(screen.getByText(/no user data/i)).toBeTruthy();\n  });\n});\n\n// E2E Testing with Detox\ndescribe(''Login Flow E2E Test'', () => {\n  beforeAll(async () => {\n    await device.launchApp();\n  });\n\n  beforeEach(async () => {\n    await device.reloadReactNative();\n  });\n\n  it(''should login successfully with valid credentials'', async () => {\n    await waitFor(element(by.id(''emailInput'')))\n      .toBeVisible()\n      .withTimeout(5000);\n\n    await element(by.id(''emailInput'')).typeText(''user@example.com'');\n    await element(by.id(''passwordInput'')).typeText(''password123'');\n    await element(by.id(''loginButton'')).multiTap();\n\n    await waitFor(element(by.text(''Home Feed'')))\n      .toBeVisible()\n      .withTimeout(5000);\n  });\n\n  it(''should show error with invalid credentials'', async () => {\n    await element(by.id(''emailInput'')).typeText(''invalid@example.com'');\n    await element(by.id(''passwordInput'')).typeText(''wrongpass'');\n    await element(by.id(''loginButton'')).multiTap();\n\n    await waitFor(element(by.text(/invalid credentials/i)))\n      .toBeVisible()\n      .withTimeout(5000);\n  });\n\n  it(''should navigate between tabs'', async () => {\n    await element(by.id(''profileTab'')).tap();\n    await waitFor(element(by.text(''Profile'')))\n      .toBeVisible()\n      .withTimeout(2000);\n\n    await element(by.id(''homeTab'')).tap();\n    await waitFor(element(by.text(''Home Feed'')))\n      .toBeVisible()\n      .withTimeout(2000);\n  });\n});\n```\n\n### 2. **iOS Testing with XCTest**\n\n```swift\nimport XCTest\n@testable import MyApp\n\nclass UserViewModelTests: XCTestCase {\n  var viewModel: UserViewModel!\n  var mockNetworkService: MockNetworkService!\n\n  override func setUp() {\n    super.setUp()\n    mockNetworkService = MockNetworkService()\n    viewModel = UserViewModel(networkService: mockNetworkService)\n  }\n\n  func testFetchUserSuccess() async {\n    let expectedUser = User(id: UUID(), name: \"John\", email: \"john@example.com\")\n    mockNetworkService.mockUser = expectedUser\n\n    await viewModel.fetchUser(id: expectedUser.id)\n\n    XCTAssertEqual(viewModel.user?.name, \"John\")\n    XCTAssertNil(viewModel.errorMessage)\n    XCTAssertFalse(viewModel.isLoading)\n  }\n\n  func testFetchUserFailure() async {\n    mockNetworkService.shouldFail = true\n\n    await viewModel.fetchUser(id: UUID())\n\n    XCTAssertNil(viewModel.user)\n    XCTAssertNotNil(viewModel.errorMessage)\n    XCTAssertFalse(viewModel.isLoading)\n  }\n}\n\nclass MockNetworkService: NetworkService {\n  var mockUser: User?\n  var shouldFail = false\n\n  override func fetch<T: Decodable>(\n    _: T.Type,\n    from endpoint: String\n  ) async throws -> T {\n    if shouldFail {\n      throw NetworkError.unknown\n    }\n    return mockUser as! T\n  }\n}\n\n// UI Test\nclass LoginUITests: XCTestCase {\n  override func setUp() {\n    super.setUp()\n    continueAfterFailure = false\n    XCUIApplication().launch()\n  }\n\n  func testLoginFlow() {\n    let app = XCUIApplication()\n\n    let emailTextField = app.textFields[\"emailInput\"]\n    let passwordTextField = app.secureTextFields[\"passwordInput\"]\n    let loginButton = app.buttons[\"loginButton\"]\n\n    emailTextField.tap()\n    emailTextField.typeText(\"user@example.com\")\n\n    passwordTextField.tap()\n    passwordTextField.typeText(\"password123\")\n\n    loginButton.tap()\n\n    let homeText = app.staticTexts[\"Home Feed\"]\n    XCTAssertTrue(homeText.waitForExistence(timeout: 5))\n  }\n\n  func testNavigationBetweenTabs() {\n    let app = XCUIApplication()\n    let profileTab = app.tabBars.buttons[\"Profile\"]\n    let homeTab = app.tabBars.buttons[\"Home\"]\n\n    profileTab.tap()\n    XCTAssertTrue(app.staticTexts[\"Profile\"].exists)\n\n    homeTab.tap()\n    XCTAssertTrue(app.staticTexts[\"Home\"].exists)\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 3. **Android Testing with Espresso**\n\n```kotlin\n@RunWith(AndroidJUnit4::class)\nclass UserViewModelTest {\n  private lateinit var viewModel: UserViewModel\n  private val mockApiService = mock<ApiService>()\n\n  @Before\n  fun setUp() {\n    viewModel = UserViewModel(mockApiService)\n  }\n\n  @Test\n  fun fetchUserSuccess() = runTest {\n    val expectedUser = User(\"1\", \"John\", \"john@example.com\")\n    `when`(mockApiService.getUser(\"1\")).thenReturn(expectedUser)\n\n    viewModel.fetchUser(\"1\")\n\n    assertEquals(expectedUser.name, viewModel.user.value?.name)\n    assertEquals(null, viewModel.errorMessage.value)\n  }\n\n  @Test\n  fun fetchUserFailure() = runTest {\n    `when`(mockApiService.getUser(\"1\"))\n      .thenThrow(IOException(\"Network error\"))\n\n    viewModel.fetchUser(\"1\")\n\n    assertEquals(null, viewModel.user.value)\n    assertNotNull(viewModel.errorMessage.value)\n  }\n}\n\n// UI Test with Espresso\n@RunWith(AndroidJUnit4::class)\nclass LoginActivityTest {\n  @get:Rule\n  val activityRule = ActivityScenarioRule(LoginActivity::class.java)\n\n  @Test\n  fun testLoginWithValidCredentials() {\n    onView(withId(R.id.emailInput))\n      .perform(typeText(\"user@example.com\"))\n\n    onView(withId(R.id.passwordInput))\n      .perform(typeText(\"password123\"))\n\n    onView(withId(R.id.loginButton))\n      .perform(click())\n\n    onView(withText(\"Home\"))\n      .check(matches(isDisplayed()))\n  }\n\n  @Test\n  fun testLoginWithInvalidCredentials() {\n    onView(withId(R.id.emailInput))\n      .perform(typeText(\"invalid@example.com\"))\n\n    onView(withId(R.id.passwordInput))\n      .perform(typeText(\"wrongpassword\"))\n\n    onView(withId(R.id.loginButton))\n      .perform(click())\n\n    onView(withText(containsString(\"Invalid credentials\")))\n      .check(matches(isDisplayed()))\n  }\n\n  @Test\n  fun testNavigationBetweenTabs() {\n    onView(withId(R.id.profileTab)).perform(click())\n    onView(withText(\"Profile\")).check(matches(isDisplayed()))\n\n    onView(withId(R.id.homeTab)).perform(click())\n    onView(withText(\"Home\")).check(matches(isDisplayed()))\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 4. **Performance Testing**\n\n```swift\nimport XCTest\n\nclass PerformanceTests: XCTestCase {\n  func testListRenderingPerformance() {\n    let viewModel = ItemsViewModel()\n    viewModel.items = (0..<1000).map { i in\n      Item(id: UUID(), title: \"Item \\(i)\", price: Double(i))\n    }\n\n    measure {\n      _ = viewModel.items.filter { $0.price > 50 }\n    }\n  }\n\n  func testNetworkResponseTime() {\n    let networkService = NetworkService()\n\n    measure {\n      let expectation = XCTestExpectation(description: \"Fetch user\")\n\n      Task {\n        do {\n          _ = try await networkService.fetch(User.self, from: \"/users/test\")\n          expectation.fulfill()\n        } catch {\n          XCTFail(\"Network request failed\")\n        }\n      }\n\n      wait(for: [expectation], timeout: 10)\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### ✅ DO\n- Write tests for business logic first\n- Use dependency injection for testability\n- Mock external API calls\n- Test both success and failure paths\n- Automate UI testing for critical flows\n- Run tests on real devices\n- Measure performance on target devices\n- Keep tests isolated and independent\n- Use meaningful test names\n- Maintain >80% code coverage\n\n### ❌ DON''T\n- Skip testing UI-critical flows\n- Use hardcoded test data\n- Ignore performance regressions\n- Test implementation details\n- Make tests flaky or unreliable\n- Skip testing on actual devices\n- Ignore accessibility testing\n- Create interdependent tests\n- Test without mocking APIs\n- Deploy untested code\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:30:48.150Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Automated Testing Agents needing comprehensive mobile app testing capabilities with Jest and Detox","zh":"适用于需要全面移动应用测试能力的自动化测试代理，支持Jest和Detox","ja":"JestおよびDetoxを使用した包括的なモバイルアプリテスト機能が必要な自動テストエージェントに最適","ko":"Jest와 Detox를 사용한 종합적인 모바일 앱 테스트 기능이 필요한 자동화 테스트 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de prueba automatizados que necesitan capacidades de prueba de aplicaciones móviles integrales con Jest y Detox","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de test automatisés nécessitant des capacités de test d''applications mobiles complètes avec Jest et Detox","de":"Ideal für automatisierte Testagenten, die umfassende Mobile-App-Testfunktionen mit Jest und Detox benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Teste Automatizados que necessitam de capacidades de teste de aplicativos móveis abrangentes com Jest e Detox","ru":"Идеально для автоматизированных агентов тестирования, требующих всесторонних возможностей тестирования мобильных приложений с Jest и Detox","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الآليين لاختبار الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات شاملة لاختبار التطبيقات المحمولة مع Jest و Detox"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement unit tests, UI tests, integration tests, and performance testing for mobile applications, leveraging React Native, Jest, and Detox for automated UI testing across iOS and Android","zh":"赋予代理实现单元测试、UI测试、集成测试和性能测试的能力，利用React Native、Jest和Detox进行自动化UI测试，支持iOS和Android","ja":"エージェントがユニットテスト、UIテスト、統合テスト、パフォーマンステストを実装できるようにし、React Native、Jest、Detoxを利用して自動化UIテストをiOSとAndroidで実行","ko":"에이전트가 유닛 테스트, UI 테스트, 통합 테스트, 성능 테스트를 구현할 수 있도록 하며 React Native, Jest, Detox를 사용하여 자동화 UI 테스트를 iOS와 Android에서 수행","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar pruebas unitarias, pruebas de UI, pruebas de integración y pruebas de rendimiento para aplicaciones móviles, aprovechando React Native, Jest y Detox para pruebas de UI automatizadas en iOS y Android","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des tests unitaires, des tests d''interface utilisateur, des tests d''intégration et des tests de performance pour les applications mobiles, en exploitant React Native, Jest et Detox pour les tests d''interface utilisateur automatisés sur iOS et Android","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Einheitstests, UI-Tests, IntegrationsTests und Leistungstests für Mobile-Anwendungen zu implementieren, indem React Native, Jest und Detox für automatisierte UI-Tests auf iOS und Android genutzt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar testes unitários, testes de UI, testes de integração e testes de desempenho para aplicações móveis, utilizando React Native, Jest e Detox para testes de UI automatizados em iOS e Android","ru":"Позволяет агентам реализовывать модульные тесты, тесты UI, тесты интеграции и тесты производительности для мобильных приложений, используя React Native, Jest и Detox для автоматизированного тестирования UI на iOS и Android","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تنفيذ اختبارات الوحدة واختبارات الواجهة واختبارات التكامل واختبارات الأداء للتطبيقات المحمولة، باستخدام React Native و Jest و Detox لاختبارات الواجهة الآلية عبر iOS و Android"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating UI testing for cross-platform compatibility","Performing integration testing with backend services","Optimizing mobile app performance through load testing"],"zh":["自动化UI测试以实现跨平台兼容性","使用后端服务执行集成测试","通过负载测试优化移动应用性能"],"ja":["クロスプラットフォームの互換性のために自動化UIテストを実行","バックエンドサービスを使用して統合テストを実行","負荷テストを使用してモバイルアプリのパフォーマンスを最適化"],"ko":["크로스 플랫폼 호환성을 위한 자동화 UI 테스트 수행","백엔드 서비스를 사용한 통합 테스트 수행","부하 테스트를 사용한 모바일 앱 성능 최적화"],"es":["Automatizar pruebas de UI para compatibilidad entre plataformas","Realizar pruebas de integración con servicios de backend","Optimizar el rendimiento de la aplicación móvil a través de pruebas de carga"],"fr":["Automatiser les tests d''interface utilisateur pour la compatibilité multiplateforme","Réalisser des tests d''intégration avec des services backend","Optimiser les performances de l''application mobile via des tests de charge"],"de":["Automatisieren von UI-Tests für Cross-Platform-Kompatibilität","Durchführen von IntegrationsTests mit Backendservices","Optimieren der Leistung von Mobile-Anwendungen durch Lasttests"],"pt":["Automatizar testes de UI para compatibilidade entre plataformas","Realizar testes de integração com serviços de backend","Otimizar o desempenho do aplicativo móvel por meio de testes de carga"],"ru":["Автоматизировать тестирование UI для совместимости между платформами","Выполнять тестирование интеграции с сервисами бэкенда","Оптимизировать производительность мобильного приложения с помощью тестирования нагрузки"],"ar":["تأتمتة اختبارات الواجهة لتوافق بين المنصات","إجراء اختبارات التكامل مع خدمات الخلفية","تحسين أداء التطبيق المحمول من خلال اختبارات الحمل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React Native environment","Limited to Jest and Detox frameworks"],"zh":["需要React Native环境","仅限Jest和Detox框架"],"ja":["React Native環境が必要","JestおよびDetoxフレームワークのみ"],"ko":["React Native 환경이 필요","Jest와 Detox 프레임워크만 지원"],"es":["Requiere entorno de React Native","Limitado a los marcos Jest y Detox"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement React Native","Limité aux frameworks Jest et Detox"],"de":["Benötigt React-Native-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf Jest- und Detox-Frameworks"],"pt":["Requer ambiente React Native","Limitado aos frameworks Jest e Detox"],"ru":["Требует среды React Native","Ограничен фреймворками Jest и Detox"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة React Native","محدود بإطارات العمل Jest و Detox"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
