"en":"A demo project showcasing the Agentuity platform (SDK, tools, and runtime)"},"definition":{"en":"A demo project showcasing the Agentuity platform (SDK, tools, and runtime)"},"features":{"zh":["支持代码自动化部署","提供 CI 构建日志 URL ","支持触发器配置","命令行界面","项目上下文支持","身份验证支持"],"ja":["コードの自動化デプロイをサポート","CI ビルドログ URL を提供","トリガー設定をサポート","コマンドラインインターフェース","プロジェクトコンテキストをサポート","認証をサポート"],"ko":["코드 자동화 배포 지원","CI 빌드 로그 URL 제공","트리거 설정 지원","명령줄 인터페이스","프로젝트 컨텍스트 지원","인증 지원"],"es":["Despliegue de proyectos en la nube","Autenticación segura con agentuity auth login","Compatibilidad con proyecto context","Opción para especificar la URL de los registros de la construcción","Opción para especificar el disparador"],"fr":["Déploiement de projets dans le cloud","Authentification sécurisée avec agentuity auth login","Compatibilité avec le contexte du projet","Option pour spécifier l''URL des journaux de construction","Option pour spécifier le déclencheur"],"de":["Bereitstellung von Projekten in der Cloud","Sichere Authentifizierung mit agentuity auth login","Kompatibilität mit Projekt-Kontext","Option zum Festlegen der URL der Build-Protokolle","Option zum Festlegen des Triggers"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Agentuity CLI","云部署","代码自动化部署","CI 构建日志","触发器配置","命令行界面","项目上下文","身份验证"],"ja":["Agentuity CLI","クラウドデプロイ","コード自動化デプロイ","CI ビルドログ","トリガー設定","コマンドラインインターフェース","プロジェクトコンテキスト","認証"],"ko":["Agentuity CLI","클라우드 배포","코드 자동화 배포","CI 빌드 로그","트리거 설정","명령줄 인터페이스","프로젝트 컨텍스트","인증"],"es":["despliegue en la nube","Agentuity CLI","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","despliegue de proyectos","autenticación segura"],"fr":["déploiement dans le cloud","Agentuity CLI","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","déploiement de projets","authentification sécurisée"],"de":["Cloud-Bereitstellung","Agentuity CLI","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools","Projekt-Bereitstellung","sichere Authentifizierung"]}},"owner":"agentuity","repo":"sdk-explorer","repoPath":"agentuity/sdk-explorer","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.422Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"agentuity-cli-cloud-deploy","description":"Deploy project to the Agentuity Cloud. Requires authentication. Use for Agentuity cloud platform operations","version":"0.1.2","tags":"mutating creates-resource slow api-intensive requires-auth requires-project","bodyPreview":"# Cloud Deploy\n\nDeploy project to the Agentuity Cloud\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Authenticated with `agentuity auth login`\n- Project context required (run from project directory or use `--project-id`)\n- auth login\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\nagentuity cloud deploy [options]\n```\n\n## Options\n\n| Option | Type | Required | Default | Description |\n|--------|------|----------|---------|-------------|\n| `--logsUrl` | string | Yes | - | The url to the CI build logs |\n| `--trigger` | string | No | `\"cli\"` | The trigger","body":"# Cloud Deploy\n\nDeploy project to the Agentuity Cloud\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Authenticated with `agentuity auth login`\n- Project context required (run from project directory or use `--project-id`)\n- auth login\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\nagentuity cloud deploy [options]\n```\n\n## Options\n\n| Option | Type | Required | Default | Description |\n|--------|------|----------|---------|-------------|\n| `--logsUrl` | string | Yes | - | The url to the CI build logs |\n| `--trigger` | string | No | `\"cli\"` | The trigger that caused the build |\n| `--commitUrl` | string | Yes | - | The url to the CI commit |\n| `--message` | string | Yes | - | The message to associate with this deployment |\n| `--commit` | string | Yes | - | The commit SHA for this deployment |\n| `--branch` | string | Yes | - | The git branch for this deployment |\n| `--provider` | string | Yes | - | The CI provider name (attempts to autodetect) |\n| `--repo` | string | Yes | - | The repo url |\n| `--event` | string | No | `\"manual\"` | The event that triggered the deployment |\n| `--pullRequestNumber` | number | Yes | - | the pull request number |\n| `--pullRequestUrl` | string | Yes | - | the pull request url |\n| `--reportFile` | string | Yes | - | file path to save build report JSON with errors, warnings, and diagnostics |\n| `--childMode` | boolean | No | `false` | Internal: run as forked child process |\n\n## Examples\n\nDeploy current project:\n\n```bash\nbunx @agentuity/cli cloud deploy\n```\n\nDeploy with verbose output:\n\n```bash\nbunx @agentuity/cli cloud deploy --log-level=debug\n```\n\n## Output\n\nReturns JSON object:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": \"boolean\",\n  \"deploymentId\": \"string\",\n  \"projectId\": \"string\",\n  \"logs\": \"array\",\n  \"urls\": \"object\"\n}\n```\n\n| Field | Type | Description |\n|-------|------|-------------|\n| `success` | boolean | Whether deployment succeeded |\n| `deploymentId` | string | Deployment ID |\n| `projectId` | string | Project ID |\n| `logs` | array | The deployment startup logs |\n| `urls` | object | Deployment URLs |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:31:50.297Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Deployment Agents needing streamlined project deployment to the Agentuity Cloud","zh":"非常适合需要简化项目部署至Agentuity云的云部署Agent","ja":"エージェンティティクラウドへの効率的なプロジェクトデプロイメントを必要とするクラウドデプロイメントエージェントに最適","ko":"에이전티티 클라우드로의 간소화된 프로젝트 배포가 필요한 클라우드 배포 에이전트에 완벽함","es":"Perfecto para agentes de implementación en la nube que necesitan una implementación de proyecto simplificada en la nube de Agentuity","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de déploiement cloud nécessitant un déploiement de projet simplifié sur le cloud Agentuity","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Bereitstellungsagenten, die eine vereinfachte Projektbereitstellung in der Agentuity-Cloud benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Implantação em Nuvem que necessitam de implantação de projetos simplificada na Nuvem Agentuity","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов облачной развертки, которым требуется упрощенная развертка проектов в облаке Agentuity","ar":"مثالي لعميل توزيع السحابي الذين يحتاجون إلى توزيع مشروع مبسط في سحابة Agentuity"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to deploy projects to the Agentuity Cloud with ease, utilizing options like --logsUrl for CI build logs and --trigger for specifying deployment triggers, all while leveraging the Agentuity platform''s SDK, tools, and runtime","zh":"使Agent能够轻松将项目部署到Agentuity云，利用诸如--logsUrl用于CI构建日志和--trigger用于指定部署触发器之类的选项，同时充分利用Agentuity平台的SDK、工具和运行时环境","ja":"エージェンティティプラットフォームのSDK、ツール、ランタイムを活用しながら、CIビルドログ用の--logsUrlやデプロイメントトリガー指定用の--triggerなどのオプションを利用して、エージェントが簡単にプロジェクトをエージェンティティクラウドにデプロイできるようにする","ko":"--logsUrl을 사용한 CI 빌드 로그 및 --trigger를 사용한 배포 트리거 지정과 같은 옵션을 활용하여 에이전트가 에이전티티 플랫폼의 SDK, 도구 및 런타임을 모두 활용하면서 에이전티티 클라우드에 프로젝트를 쉽게 배포할 수 있도록 지원함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar proyectos en la nube de Agentuity con facilidad, utilizando opciones como --logsUrl para registros de compilación de CI y --trigger para especificar desencadenadores de implementación, aprovechando al mismo tiempo el SDK, las herramientas y el tiempo de ejecución de la plataforma Agentuity","fr":"Permet aux agents de déployer des projets sur le cloud Agentuity avec facilité, en utilisant des options comme --logsUrl pour les journaux de build CI et --trigger pour spécifier les déclencheurs de déploiement, tout en exploitant le SDK, les outils et le runtime de la plateforme Agentuity","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Projekte in der Agentuity-Cloud mit Leichtigkeit bereitzustellen, indem Optionen wie --logsUrl für CI-Build-Logs und --trigger zur Angabe von Bereitstellungs-Trigger verwendet werden, während gleichzeitig die Agentuity-Plattform-SDK, -Tools und -Laufzeit genutzt werden","pt":"Permite que os agentes implantem projetos na Nuvem Agentuity com facilidade, utilizando opções como --logsUrl para logs de compilação de CI e --trigger para especificar gatilhos de implantação, aproveitando ao mesmo tempo a plataforma SDK, ferramentas e tempo de execução da Agentuity","ru":"Позволяет агентам развертывать проекты в облаке Agentuity с легкостью, используя опции, такие как --logsUrl для журналов сборки CI и --trigger для указания триггеров развертки, при этом利用уя платформу SDK, инструменты и среду выполнения Agentuity","ar":"يمكن للعميل توزيع المشاريع على سحابة Agentuity بسهولة، باستخدام خيارات مثل --logsUrl لسجلات بناء CI و --trigger لتحديد مشغلات التوزيع، مع الاستفادة من منصة SDK وأدوات ووقت تشغيل Agentuity في نفس الوقت"},"useCases":{"en":["Deploying projects to the Agentuity Cloud","Specifying CI build logs with --logsUrl","Triggering deployments with custom triggers using --trigger"],"zh":["将项目部署到Agentuity云","使用--logsUrl指定CI构建日志","使用--trigger通过自定义触发器触发部署"],"ja":["エージェンティティクラウドへのプロジェクトのデプロイ","--logsUrlを使用したCIビルドログの指定","--triggerを使用したカスタムトリガーによるデプロイメントのトリガー"],"ko":["에이전티티 클라우드에 프로젝트 배포","--logsUrl으로 CI 빌드 로그 지정","--trigger를 사용하여 사용자 정의 트리거로 배포 트리거"],"es":["Implementar proyectos en la nube de Agentuity","Especificar registros de compilación de CI con --logsUrl","Activar implementaciones con desencadenadores personalizados mediante --trigger"],"fr":["Déployer des projets sur le cloud Agentuity","Spécifier les journaux de build CI avec --logsUrl","Déclencher des déploiements avec des déclencheurs personnalisés à l''aide de --trigger"],"de":["Projekte in der Agentuity-Cloud bereitstellen","CI-Build-Logs mit --logsUrl angeben","Bereitstellungen mit benutzerdefinierten Trigger über --trigger auslösen"],"pt":["Implantação de projetos na Nuvem Agentuity","Especificar logs de compilação de CI com --logsUrl","Disparar implantações com gatilhos personalizados usando --trigger"],"ru":["Развертка проектов в облаке Agentuity","Указание журналов сборки CI с помощью --logsUrl","Триггер развертки с помощью пользовательских триггеров с --trigger"],"ar":["توزيع المشاريع على سحابة Agentuity","تحديد سجلات بناء CI مع --logsUrl","تشغيل التوزيع مع مشغلات مخصصة باستخدام --trigger"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires authentication with agentuity auth login","Project context required","Specific options like --logsUrl are mandatory"],"zh":["需要使用agentuity auth login进行身份验证","需要项目上下文","--logsUrl等特定选项是必需的"],"ja":["agentuity auth loginによる認証が必要","プロジェクトコンテキストが必要","--logsUrlなどの特定のオプションが必須"],"ko":["agentuity auth login을 통한 인증 필요","프로젝트 컨텍스트 필요","--logsUrl과 같은 특정 옵션은 필수"],"es":["Requiere autenticación con agentuity auth login","Se requiere contexto de proyecto","Opciones específicas como --logsUrl son obligatorias"],"fr":["Nécessite une authentification avec agentuity auth login","Un contexte de projet est requis","Des options spécifiques comme --logsUrl sont obligatoires"],"de":["Erfordert Authentifizierung mit agentuity auth login","Projektkontext ist erforderlich","Bestimmte Optionen wie --logsUrl sind obligatorisch"],"pt":["Exige autenticação com agentuity auth login","Contexto de projeto necessário","Opções específicas como --logsUrl são obrigatórias"],"ru":["Требуется аутентификация с помощью agentuity auth login","Необходим контекст проекта","Конкретные опции, такие как --logsUrl, являются обязательными"],"ar":["يتطلب المصادقة مع تسجيل الدخول إلى agentuity","مطلوب سياق المشروع","خيارات محددة مثل --logsUrl إجبارية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ankitsharma495/Flowbase/rbac-authorization-patterns', 'community', 'ankitsharma495', 'Flowbase', 'ankitsharma495/Flowbase', 'rbac-authorization-patterns', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.422Z', '2026-02-18T04:31:30.576Z', NULL, '{"id":"ankitsharma495/Flowbase/rbac-authorization-patterns","name":"rbac-authorization-patterns","description":{"zh":"RBAC 授权模式为 laneweaverTMS 提供了基于角色的访问控制和多租户授权的专业指导","ja":"RBAC 認可パターンは、laneweaverTMS に対してロールベースのアクセス制御とマルチテナント認可の専門的なガイダンスを提供します","ko":"RBAC 인증 패턴은 laneweaverTMS에 역할 기반 액세스 제어 및 多租户 인증에 대한 전문 지침을 제공합니다","es":"Expertos en patrones de autorización RBAC para laneweaverTMS. Implemente el control de acceso basado en roles y la autorización multi-tenant en Go/Echo con Supabase/PostgreSQL","fr":"Expertise dans les modèles d''autorisation RBAC pour laneweaverTMS. Mettez en œuvre le contrôle d''accès basé sur les rôles et l''autorisation multi-locataire dans Go/Echo avec Supabase/PostgreSQL","de":"Expertenwissen zu RBAC-Autorisierungsmustern für laneweaverTMS. Implementieren Sie die rollenbasierte Zugriffskontrolle und die Multi-Tenant-Autorisierung in Go/Echo mit Supabase/PostgreSQL","pt":"Implemente o padrão RBAC para controle de acesso e isolamento de multi-tenant em um backend Go/Echo com Supabase/PostgreSQL","ru":"Реализуйте шаблон RBAC для контроля доступа и изоляции многотенантности в бэкенде Go/Echo с Supabase/PostgreSQL","ar":"نفذ نمط RBAC للتحكم في الوصول وعزل متعدد المستأجرين في خلفية Go/Echo مع Supabase/PostgreSQL","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"RBAC 授权模式","ja":"RBAC 認可パターン","ko":"RBAC 인증 패턴","es":"Patrones de autorización RBAC para laneweaverTMS","fr":"Modèles d''autorisation RBAC pour laneweaverTMS","de":"RBAC-Autorisierungsmuster für laneweaverTMS","pt":"Padrões de Autorização RBAC para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Шаблоны авторизации RBAC для разработчиков","ar":"نماذج تفويض RBAC لمطوري البرمجيات","en":"rbac-authorization-patterns"},"description":{"zh":"RBAC 授权模式为 laneweaverTMS 提供了基于角色的访问控制和多租户授权的专业指导","ja":"RBAC 認可パターンは、laneweaverTMS に対してロールベースのアクセス制御とマルチテナント認可の専門的なガイダンスを提供します","ko":"RBAC 인증 패턴은 laneweaverTMS에 역할 기반 액세스 제어 및 多租户 인증에 대한 전문 지침을 제공합니다","es":"Expertos en patrones de autorización RBAC para laneweaverTMS. Implemente el control de acceso basado en roles y la autorización multi-tenant en Go/Echo con S...","fr":"Expertise dans les modèles d''autorisation RBAC pour laneweaverTMS. Mettez en œuvre le contrôle d''accès basé sur les rôles et l''autorisation multi-locataire d...","de":"Expertenwissen zu RBAC-Autorisierungsmustern für laneweaverTMS. Implementieren Sie die rollenbasierte Zugriffskontrolle und die Multi-Tenant-Autorisierung in...","pt":"Implemente o padrão RBAC para controle de acesso e isolamento de multi-tenant em um backend Go/Echo com Supabase/PostgreSQL","ru":"Реализуйте шаблон RBAC для контроля доступа и изоляции многотенантности в бэкенде Go/Echo с Supabase/PostgreSQL","ar":"نفذ نمط RBAC للتحكم في الوصول وعزل متعدد المستأجرين في خلفية Go/Echo مع Supabase/PostgreSQL","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["基于角色的访问控制","多租户授权","Echo 中间件集成","JWT 声明结构设计","RLS 策略编写"],"ja":["ロールベースのアクセス制御","マルチテナント認可","Echo ミドルウェア統合","JWT クレーム構造設計","RLS ポリシー作成"],"ko":["역할 기반 액세스 제어","多租户 인증","Echo 미들웨어 통합","JWT 클레임 구조 설계","RLS 정책 작성"],"es":["Implementación de middleware de Echo para comprobaciones de roles y permisos","Configuración de aislamiento multi-tenant con acceso basado en cuentas","Diseño de estructura de reclamaciones JWT para autorización","Escritura de políticas RLS para autorización","Definición de roles y permisos de usuario para operaciones de corretaje de carga"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre de middleware Echo pour les vérifications de rôles et de permissions","Configuration de l''isolement multi-locataire avec un accès basé sur les comptes","Conception de la structure des revendications JWT pour l''autorisation","Écriture de politiques RLS pour l''autorisation","Définition des rôles et des permissions des utilisateurs pour les opérations de courtage de fret"],"de":["Implementierung von Echo-Middleware für Rollen- und Berechtigungsprüfungen","Konfiguration der Multi-Tenant-Isolation mit kontobasiertem Zugriff","Entwurf der JWT-Anspruchstruktur für Autorisierung","Schreiben von RLS-Richtlinien für Autorisierung","Definition von Benutzerrollen und -berechtigungen für Frachtvermittlungsoperationen"],"pt":["Implementação de papéis e permissões de usuário","Criação de middleware de Echo para verificações de papel e permissão","Configuração de isolamento de multi-tenant com acesso baseado em conta","Projeto de estrutura de reivindicações JWT para autorização","Escrita de políticas RLS para autorização"],"ru":["Реализация ролей и разрешений пользователей","Создание middleware Echo для проверок ролей и разрешений","Настройка изоляции многотенантности с доступом на основе учетной записи","Проектирование структуры утверждений JWT для авторизации","Написание политик RLS для авторизации"],"ar":["تنفيذ أدوار ومصادقة مستخدم","إنشاء برنامج الوسيط Echo للتحقق من الأدوار والصلاحيات","تكوين عزل متعدد المستأجرين بالوصول المبني على الحساب","تصميم هيكل مطالبات JWT للتحقق","كتابة سياسات RLS للتحقق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["RBAC 授权模式","基于角色的访问控制","多租户授权","Go/Echo","Supabase/PostgreSQL","JWT 声明结构"],"ja":["RBAC 認可パターン","ロールベースのアクセス制御","マルチテナント認可","Go/Echo","Supabase/PostgreSQL","JWT クレーム構造"],"ko":["RBAC 인증 패턴","역할 기반 액세스 제어","多租户 인증","Go/Echo","Supabase/PostgreSQL","JWT 클레임 구조"],"es":["RBAC","Autorización basada en roles","Multi-tenant","Go","Echo","Supabase","PostgreSQL","Control de acceso","Seguridad"],"fr":["RBAC","Autorisation basée sur les rôles","Multi-locataire","Go","Echo","Supabase","PostgreSQL","Contrôle d''accès","Sécurité"],"de":["RBAC","Rollenbasierte Autorisierung","Multi-Tenant","Go","Echo","Supabase","PostgreSQL","Zugriffskontrolle","Sicherheit"],"pt":["RBAC","controle de acesso","isolamento de multi-tenant","Go","Echo","Supabase","PostgreSQL","autenticação","autorização"],"ru":["RBAC","контроль доступа","изоляция многотенантности","Go","Echo","Supabase","PostgreSQL","аутентификация","авторизация"],"ar":["RBAC","التحكم في الوصول","عزل متعدد المستأجرين","Go","Echo","Supabase","PostgreSQL","المصادقة","التحقق"]}},"owner":"ankitsharma495","repo":"Flowbase","repoPath":"ankitsharma495/Flowbase","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.422Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"rbac-authorization-patterns","description":"Provide patterns for implementing Role-Based Access Control and multi-tenant authorization in laneweaverTMS. Use when implementing user roles, permissions, tenant isolation, Echo authorization middleware, RLS policies for multi-tenant access, or JWT claims structure for freight brokerage applications.","bodyPreview":"# RBAC Authorization Patterns for laneweaverTMS\n\nExpert guidance for implementing Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) and multi-tenant authorization in a Go/Echo backend with Supabase/PostgreSQL.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse when:\n- Defining user roles and permissions for freight brokerage operations\n- Implementing Echo middleware for role/permission checks\n- Setting up multi-tenant isolation with account-based access\n- Designing JWT claims structure for authorization\n- Writing RLS policies for","body":"# RBAC Authorization Patterns for laneweaverTMS\n\nExpert guidance for implementing Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) and multi-tenant authorization in a Go/Echo backend with Supabase/PostgreSQL.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse when:\n- Defining user roles and permissions for freight brokerage operations\n- Implementing Echo middleware for role/permission checks\n- Setting up multi-tenant isolation with account-based access\n- Designing JWT claims structure for authorization\n- Writing RLS policies for tenant-isolated data access\n- Choosing appropriate HTTP status codes for authorization failures\n\n## Freight Brokerage Role Definitions\n\n### Standard Roles\n\n| Role | Description | Typical Access |\n|------|-------------|----------------|\n| `admin` | Full system access | All resources, user management, system config |\n| `dispatcher` | Load management, carrier selection | Loads, carriers, tracking, dispatch operations |\n| `sales` | Account management, quotes | Customers, quotes, lanes, tenders |\n| `finance` | Invoicing, payments, reports | Invoices, carrier bills, payments, financial reports |\n| `driver` | Limited mobile access | Assigned loads only, status updates, document upload |\n| `readonly` | View-only access | Read all operational data, no modifications |\n\n### Permission Model\n\nPermissions follow a `resource:action` pattern:\n\n```\nloads:read, loads:create, loads:update, loads:delete\ncarriers:read, carriers:create, carriers:update\ncustomers:read, customers:create, customers:update\ninvoices:read, invoices:create, invoices:approve\nreports:financial, reports:operational\nusers:manage\n```\n\n## Database Schema Patterns\n\n### Core RBAC Tables\n\n```sql\n-- Roles table\nCREATE TABLE public.roles (\n    id UUID DEFAULT gen_random_uuid() PRIMARY KEY,\n    name TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE,\n    description TEXT,\n    is_system_role BOOLEAN DEFAULT false,\n    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now() NOT NULL,\n    updated_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now() NOT NULL\n);\n\n-- Permissions table\nCREATE TABLE public.permissions (\n    id UUID DEFAULT gen_random_uuid() PRIMARY KEY,\n    resource TEXT NOT NULL,\n    action TEXT NOT NULL,\n    description TEXT,\n    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now() NOT NULL,\n    UNIQUE(resource, action)\n);\n\n-- Role-Permission junction\nCREATE TABLE public.role_permissions (\n    role_id UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES public.roles(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,\n    permission_id UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES public.permissions(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,\n    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now() NOT NULL,\n    PRIMARY KEY (role_id, permission_id)\n);\n\n-- User-Role junction (within account/tenant context)\nCREATE TABLE public.user_roles (\n    user_id UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES auth.users(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,\n    role_id UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES public.roles(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,\n    account_id UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES public.accounts(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,\n    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now() NOT NULL,\n    created_by UUID REFERENCES auth.users(id),\n    PRIMARY KEY (user_id, role_id, account_id)\n);\n\n-- Account-User junction for multi-tenant\nCREATE TABLE public.account_users (\n    id UUID DEFAULT gen_random_uuid() PRIMARY KEY,\n    account_id UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES public.accounts(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,\n    user_id UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES auth.users(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,\n    is_primary BOOLEAN DEFAULT false,\n    invited_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now() NOT NULL,\n    accepted_at TIMESTAMPTZ,\n    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now() NOT NULL,\n    UNIQUE(account_id, user_id)\n);\n\n-- Indexes for RLS policy performance\nCREATE INDEX idx_user_roles_user_id ON public.user_roles(user_id);\nCREATE INDEX idx_user_roles_account_id ON public.user_roles(account_id);\nCREATE INDEX idx_account_users_user_id ON public.account_users(user_id);\nCREATE INDEX idx_account_users_account_id ON public.account_users(account_id);\n```\n\n### Seed Default Roles\n\n```sql\nINSERT INTO public.roles (name, description, is_system_role) VALUES\n    (''admin'', ''Full system access'', true),\n    (''dispatcher'', ''Load management and carrier selection'', true),\n    (''sales'', ''Account management and quotes'', true),\n    (''finance'', ''Invoicing, payments, and reports'', true),\n    (''driver'', ''Limited mobile access for assigned loads'', true),\n    (''readonly'', ''View-only access to operational data'', true);\n```\n\n## Echo Authorization Middleware\n\n### Context Keys\n\n```go\npackage middleware\n\ntype contextKey string\n\nconst (\n    ContextKeyUserID    contextKey = \"user_id\"\n    ContextKeyAccountID contextKey = \"account_id\"\n    ContextKeyRoles     contextKey = \"roles\"\n    ContextKeyUser      contextKey = \"user\"\n)\n```\n\n### JWT Claims Structure\n\n```go\npackage auth\n\nimport \"github.com/golang-jwt/jwt/v5\"\n\ntype Claims struct {\n    jwt.RegisteredClaims\n    UserID      string   `json:\"user_id\"`\n    Email       string   `json:\"email\"`\n    AccountID   string   `json:\"account_id\"`\n    Roles       []string `json:\"roles\"`\n    Permissions []string `json:\"permissions,omitempty\"` // Optional: can derive from roles\n}\n```\n\n### Authentication Middleware\n\nValidates JWT and extracts claims into context:\n\n```go\npackage middleware\n\nimport (\n    \"net/http\"\n    \"strings\"\n\n    \"github.com/labstack/echo/v4\"\n)\n\nfunc JWTAuth(jwtSecret []byte) echo.MiddlewareFunc {\n    return func(next echo.HandlerFunc) echo.HandlerFunc {\n        return func(c echo.Context) error {\n            authHeader := c.Request().Header.Get(\"Authorization\")\n            if authHeader == \"\" {\n                return echo.NewHTTPError(http.StatusUnauthorized, \"missing authorization header\")\n            }\n\n            tokenString := strings.TrimPrefix(authHeader, \"Bearer \")\n            if tokenString == authHeader {\n                return echo.NewHTTPError(http.StatusUnauthorized, \"invalid authorization format\")\n            }\n\n            claims, err := ValidateToken(tokenString, jwtSecret)\n            if err != nil {\n                return echo.NewHTTPError(http.StatusUnauthorized, \"invalid or expired token\")\n            }\n\n            // Store in context for downstream handlers\n            c.Set(string(ContextKeyUserID), claims.UserID)\n            c.Set(string(ContextKeyAccountID), claims.AccountID)\n            c.Set(string(ContextKeyRoles), claims.Roles)\n            c.Set(string(ContextKeyUser), claims)\n\n            return next(c)\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Tenant Context Middleware\n\nEnsures valid tenant context after authentication:\n\n```go\nfunc TenantContext() echo.MiddlewareFunc {\n    return func(next echo.HandlerFunc) echo.HandlerFunc {\n        return func(c echo.Context) error {\n            accountID := c.Get(string(ContextKeyAccountID))\n            if accountID == nil || accountID.(string) == \"\" {\n                return echo.NewHTTPError(http.StatusForbidden, \"no tenant context\")\n            }\n\n            // Optionally validate account exists and is active\n            // This can be cached for performance\n\n            return next(c)\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Role-Based Authorization Middleware\n\n```go\n// RequireRole checks if user has any of the specified roles\nfunc RequireRole(roles ...string) echo.MiddlewareFunc {\n    return func(next echo.HandlerFunc) echo.HandlerFunc {\n        return func(c echo.Context) error {\n            userRoles, ok := c.Get(string(ContextKeyRoles)).([]string)\n            if !ok || len(userRoles) == 0 {\n                return echo.NewHTTPError(http.StatusForbidden, \"no roles assigned\")\n            }\n\n            for _, required := range roles {\n                for _, userRole := range userRoles {\n                    if userRole == required {\n                        return next(c)\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n\n            return echo.NewHTTPError(http.StatusForbidden, \"insufficient role permissions\")\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n// RequireAnyRole is an alias for RequireRole (OR logic)\nvar RequireAnyRole = RequireRole\n\n// RequireAllRoles checks if user has ALL specified roles\nfunc RequireAllRoles(roles ...string) echo.MiddlewareFunc {\n    return func(next echo.HandlerFunc) echo.HandlerFunc {\n        return func(c echo.Context) error {\n            userRoles, ok := c.Get(string(ContextKeyRoles)).([]string)\n            if !ok {\n                return echo.NewHTTPError(http.StatusForbidden, \"no roles assigned\")\n            }\n\n            userRoleSet := make(map[string]bool)\n            for _, r := range userRoles {\n                userRoleSet[r] = true\n            }\n\n            for _, required := range roles {\n                if !userRoleSet[required] {\n                    return echo.NewHTTPError(http.StatusForbidden, \"missing required role\")\n                }\n            }\n\n            return next(c)\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Permission-Based Authorization Middleware\n\n```go\n// RequirePermission checks for specific resource:action permission\nfunc RequirePermission(resource, action string) echo.MiddlewareFunc {\n    return func(next echo.HandlerFunc) echo.HandlerFunc {\n        return func(c echo.Context) error {\n            claims, ok := c.Get(string(ContextKeyUser)).(*Claims)\n            if !ok {\n                return echo.NewHTTPError(http.StatusForbidden, \"invalid user context\")\n            }\n\n            // Check explicit permissions if available\n            requiredPerm := resource + \":\" + action\n            for _, perm := range claims.Permissions {\n                if perm == requiredPerm || perm == resource+\":*\" || perm == \"*:*\" {\n                    return next(c)\n                }\n            }\n\n            // Fallback: derive from roles (requires DB lookup or cached mapping)\n            if hasPermissionViaRole(claims.Roles, resource, action) {\n                return next(c)\n            }\n\n            return echo.NewHTTPError(http.StatusForbidden, \"permission denied\")\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n// hasPermissionViaRole checks role-permission mapping\n// In production, use cached lookup or include permissions in JWT\nfunc hasPermissionViaRole(roles []string, resource, action string) bool {\n    // Admin role has all permissions\n    for _, role := range roles {\n        if role == \"admin\" {\n            return true\n        }\n    }\n\n    // Role-permission mapping (simplified; use DB in production)\n    rolePerms := map[string][]string{\n        \"dispatcher\": {\"loads:*\", \"carriers:read\", \"tracking:*\"},\n        \"sales\":      {\"customers:*\", \"quotes:*\", \"lanes:*\", \"tenders:*\"},\n        \"finance\":    {\"invoices:*\", \"payments:*\", \"reports:financial\"},\n        \"driver\":     {\"loads:read\", \"loads:update_status\", \"documents:upload\"},\n        \"readonly\":   {\"loads:read\", \"carriers:read\", \"customers:read\"},\n    }\n\n    requiredPerm := resource + \":\" + action\n    for _, role := range roles {\n        for _, perm := range rolePerms[role] {\n            if matchPermission(perm, requiredPerm) {\n                return true\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    return false\n}\n\nfunc matchPermission(pattern, required string) bool {\n    if pattern == required {\n        return true\n    }\n    // Handle wildcard: \"loads:*\" matches \"loads:read\"\n    if strings.HasSuffix(pattern, \":*\") {\n        prefix := strings.TrimSuffix(pattern, \"*\")\n        return strings.HasPrefix(required, prefix)\n    }\n    return false\n}\n```\n\n### Middleware Chain Example\n\nApply middleware in order: Auth -> Tenant -> Role -> Permission:\n\n```go\nfunc SetupRoutes(e *echo.Echo, cfg *config.Config) {\n    // Public routes (no auth required)\n    e.GET(\"/health\", handlers.HealthCheck)\n\n    // API routes with auth\n    api := e.Group(\"/api/v1\")\n    api.Use(middleware.JWTAuth(cfg.JWTSecret))\n    api.Use(middleware.TenantContext())\n\n    // Load routes - dispatchers and admins\n    loads := api.Group(\"/loads\")\n    loads.Use(middleware.RequireRole(\"admin\", \"dispatcher\", \"sales\", \"readonly\"))\n    loads.GET(\"\", handlers.ListLoads)\n    loads.GET(\"/:id\", handlers.GetLoad)\n\n    // Modify operations require specific roles\n    loads.POST(\"\", handlers.CreateLoad, middleware.RequireRole(\"admin\", \"dispatcher\", \"sales\"))\n    loads.PUT(\"/:id\", handlers.UpdateLoad, middleware.RequireRole(\"admin\", \"dispatcher\"))\n\n    // Finance routes\n    finance := api.Group(\"/finance\")\n    finance.Use(middleware.RequireRole(\"admin\", \"finance\"))\n    finance.GET(\"/invoices\", handlers.ListInvoices)\n    finance.POST(\"/invoices\", handlers.CreateInvoice)\n\n    // Admin-only routes\n    admin := api.Group(\"/admin\")\n    admin.Use(middleware.RequireRole(\"admin\"))\n    admin.GET(\"/users\", handlers.ListUsers)\n    admin.POST(\"/users\", handlers.CreateUser)\n}\n```\n\n## Multi-Tenant RLS Policies\n\n### Enable RLS on Tables\n\n```sql\nALTER TABLE public.loads ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;\nALTER TABLE public.customers ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;\nALTER TABLE public.carriers ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;\nALTER TABLE public.invoices ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;\n```\n\n### Account-Based Tenant Isolation\n\n```sql\n-- Users see only their account''s loads\nCREATE POLICY \"Users see only their account loads\"\n    ON public.loads\n    FOR SELECT\n    TO authenticated\n    USING (\n        account_id IN (\n            SELECT account_id\n            FROM public.account_users\n            WHERE user_id = (SELECT auth.uid())\n        )\n    );\n\n-- Users can create loads for their account\nCREATE POLICY \"Users create loads for their account\"\n    ON public.loads\n    FOR INSERT\n    TO authenticated\n    WITH CHECK (\n        account_id IN (\n            SELECT account_id\n            FROM public.account_users\n            WHERE user_id = (SELECT auth.uid())\n        )\n    );\n\n-- Users can update their account''s loads\nCREATE POLICY \"Users update their account loads\"\n    ON public.loads\n    FOR UPDATE\n    TO authenticated\n    USING (\n        account_id IN (\n            SELECT account_id\n            FROM public.account_users\n            WHERE user_id = (SELECT auth.uid())\n        )\n    )\n    WITH CHECK (\n        account_id IN (\n            SELECT account_id\n            FROM public.account_users\n            WHERE user_id = (SELECT auth.uid())\n        )\n    );\n```\n\n### Role-Based RLS Policies\n\nCombine tenant isolation with role restrictions:\n\n```sql\n-- Helper function to check user roles within account\nCREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION public.user_has_role(required_roles TEXT[])\nRETURNS BOOLEAN\nLANGUAGE sql\nSECURITY DEFINER\nSTABLE\nAS $$\n    SELECT EXISTS (\n        SELECT 1\n        FROM public.user_roles ur\n        JOIN public.roles r ON ur.role_id = r.id\n        WHERE ur.user_id = (SELECT auth.uid())\n        AND r.name = ANY(required_roles)\n    );\n$$;\n\n-- Only finance and admin can view invoices\nCREATE POLICY \"Finance users view invoices\"\n    ON public.customer_invoices\n    FOR SELECT\n    TO authenticated\n    USING (\n        account_id IN (\n            SELECT account_id\n            FROM public.account_users\n            WHERE user_id = (SELECT auth.uid())\n        )\n        AND public.user_has_role(ARRAY[''admin'', ''finance'', ''readonly''])\n    );\n\n-- Only finance and admin can create invoices\nCREATE POLICY \"Finance users create invoices\"\n    ON public.customer_invoices\n    FOR INSERT\n    TO authenticated\n    WITH CHECK (\n        account_id IN (\n            SELECT account_id\n            FROM public.account_users\n            WHERE user_id = (SELECT auth.uid())\n        )\n        AND public.user_has_role(ARRAY[''admin'', ''finance''])\n    );\n```\n\n### Driver-Specific Policies\n\nDrivers see only their assigned loads:\n\n```sql\n-- Drivers see only loads assigned to them\nCREATE POLICY \"Drivers see assigned loads\"\n    ON public.loads\n    FOR SELECT\n    TO authenticated\n    USING (\n        -- Driver is assigned to this load\n        driver_user_id = (SELECT auth.uid())\n        OR\n        -- Or user has broader access via role\n        (\n            account_id IN (\n                SELECT account_id\n                FROM public.account_users\n                WHERE user_id = (SELECT auth.uid())\n            )\n            AND public.user_has_role(ARRAY[''admin'', ''dispatcher'', ''sales'', ''readonly''])\n        )\n    );\n```\n\n## Authorization Decision Patterns\n\n### HTTP Status Code Guidelines\n\n| Scenario | Status Code | When to Use |\n|----------|-------------|-------------|\n| Missing or invalid token | `401 Unauthorized` | Token absent, expired, or malformed |\n| Valid token, insufficient permissions | `403 Forbidden` | User authenticated but lacks required role/permission |\n| Resource not found (or hidden) | `404 Not Found` | Resource doesn''t exist OR hiding existence is security concern |\n\n### Security-Aware 404 Pattern\n\nUse 404 instead of 403 when revealing resource existence is a security concern:\n\n```go\nfunc GetLoad(c echo.Context) error {\n    loadID := c.Param(\"id\")\n    accountID := c.Get(string(middleware.ContextKeyAccountID)).(string)\n\n    load, err := repo.GetLoad(c.Request().Context(), loadID)\n    if err != nil {\n        if errors.Is(err, sql.ErrNoRows) {\n            // Resource doesn''t exist\n            return echo.NewHTTPError(http.StatusNotFound, \"load not found\")\n        }\n        return echo.NewHTTPError(http.StatusInternalServerError, \"failed to fetch load\")\n    }\n\n    // Check tenant ownership - return 404 to hide existence\n    if load.AccountID != accountID {\n        return echo.NewHTTPError(http.StatusNotFound, \"load not found\")\n    }\n\n    return c.JSON(http.StatusOK, load)\n}\n```\n\n### Error Response Structure\n\n```go\ntype ErrorResponse struct {\n    Error   string `json:\"error\"`\n    Code    string `json:\"code,omitempty\"`\n    Details string `json:\"details,omitempty\"`\n}\n\n// Authorization error examples\n// 401: {\"error\": \"missing authorization header\", \"code\": \"AUTH_REQUIRED\"}\n// 401: {\"error\": \"invalid or expired token\", \"code\": \"TOKEN_INVALID\"}\n// 403: {\"error\": \"insufficient role permissions\", \"code\": \"ROLE_REQUIRED\"}\n// 403: {\"error\": \"permission denied\", \"code\": \"PERMISSION_DENIED\"}\n```\n\n## JWT Claims Best Practices\n\n### Minimal Claims for Performance\n\nInclude only essential claims; derive others from database:\n\n```go\ntype MinimalClaims struct {\n    jwt.RegisteredClaims\n    UserID    string `json:\"sub\"`       // Use standard ''sub'' claim\n    AccountID string `json:\"account_id\"`\n    Roles     []string `json:\"roles\"`    // Include for middleware checks\n}\n```\n\n### Full Claims with Permissions\n\nFor reduced database lookups, include permissions:\n\n```go\ntype FullClaims struct {\n    jwt.RegisteredClaims\n    UserID      string   `json:\"sub\"`\n    Email       string   `json:\"email\"`\n    AccountID   string   `json:\"account_id\"`\n    AccountName string   `json:\"account_name\"`\n    Roles       []string `json:\"roles\"`\n    Permissions []string `json:\"permissions\"` // Flattened from roles\n}\n```\n\n### Token Generation\n\n```go\nfunc GenerateToken(user *User, account *Account, roles []string, permissions []string) (string, error) {\n    now := time.Now()\n    claims := &FullClaims{\n        RegisteredClaims: jwt.RegisteredClaims{\n            Subject:   user.ID,\n            IssuedAt:  jwt.NewNumericDate(now),\n            ExpiresAt: jwt.NewNumericDate(now.Add(24 * time.Hour)),\n            Issuer:    \"laneweavertms\",\n        },\n        UserID:      user.ID,\n        Email:       user.Email,\n        AccountID:   account.ID,\n        AccountName: account.Name,\n        Roles:       roles,\n        Permissions: permissions,\n    }\n\n    token := jwt.NewWithClaims(jwt.SigningMethodHS256, claims)\n    return token.SignedString(jwtSecret)\n}\n```\n\n## Authorization Checklist\n\n```\nRBAC Schema:\n[ ] roles, permissions, role_permissions tables created\n[ ] user_roles table includes account_id for multi-tenant\n[ ] account_users table for tenant membership\n[ ] Indexes on user_id, account_id columns for RLS performance\n\nMiddleware Chain:\n[ ] JWT validation middleware extracts claims to context\n[ ] Tenant context middleware validates account_id\n[ ] Role middleware checks user roles array\n[ ] Permission middleware checks specific resource:action\n\nRLS Policies:\n[ ] RLS enabled on all tenant-owned tables\n[ ] SELECT policies use account_id IN (SELECT from account_users)\n[ ] INSERT policies use WITH CHECK for account_id\n[ ] UPDATE policies use both USING and WITH CHECK\n[ ] auth.uid() wrapped in SELECT for query plan caching\n[ ] Indexes exist on columns used in RLS conditions\n\nJWT Claims:\n[ ] Token includes user_id, account_id, roles\n[ ] Token expiration set appropriately (e.g., 24 hours)\n[ ] Refresh token mechanism for long-lived sessions\n\nError Handling:\n[ ] 401 for missing/invalid authentication\n[ ] 403 for valid auth but insufficient permissions\n[ ] 404 when hiding resource existence is security concern\n[ ] Error responses don''t leak sensitive information\n```\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **goth-oauth** - OAuth2 authentication foundation\n- **laneweaver-database-design** - Database schema conventions\n\n## Reference\n\n- Echo middleware documentation: https://echo.labstack.com/docs/middleware\n- Supabase RLS guide: https://supabase.com/docs/guides/auth/row-level-security\n- JWT best practices: https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc7519\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:31:30.576Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Backend Agents specializing in Go/Echo and Supabase/PostgreSQL, seeking to implement robust Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) and multi-tenant authorization patterns.","zh":"适用于专注于Go/Echo和Supabase/PostgreSQL的后端代理，希望实施强大的基于角色访问控制（RBAC）和多租户授权模式的代理。","ja":"Go/EchoおよびSupabase/PostgreSQLを専門とするバックエンドエージェントで、ロールベースのアクセス制御（RBAC）およびマルチテナント認証パターンを実装しようとするものに最適。","ko":"Go/Echo 및 Supabase/PostgreSQL을専門으로하는 백엔드 에이전트에서 강력한 역할 기반 액세스 제어(RBAC) 및 다중 테넌트 인증 패턴을 구현하려는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Backend que se especializan en Go/Echo y Supabase/PostgreSQL, y que buscan implementar un control de acceso basado en roles (RBAC) y patrones de autorización de multi-arrendatarios robustos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Backend spécialisés dans Go/Echo et Supabase/PostgreSQL, cherchant à mettre en œuvre un contrôle d''accès basé sur les rôles (RBAC) et des modèles d''autorisation multi-locataires robustes.","de":"Ideal für Backend-Agents, die sich auf Go/Echo und Supabase/PostgreSQL spezialisieren und robuste Rolle-basierte Zugriffskontrollen (RBAC) und Multi-Tenant-Autorisierungsmuster implementieren möchten.","pt":"Ideial para Agentes de Backend especializados em Go/Echo e Supabase/PostgreSQL, que buscam implementar um Controle de Acesso Baseado em Funções (RBAC) robusto e padrões de autorização multi-locatários.","ru":"Идеально для бэкенд-агентов, специализирующихся на Go/Echo и Supabase/PostgreSQL, стремящихся реализовать надежный контроль доступа на основе ролей (RBAC) и шаблоны авторизации для нескольких арендаторов.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الخلفية المتخصصين في Go/Echo و Supabase/PostgreSQL ، الذين يبحثون عن تنفيذ سيطرة وصول قائم على الدور (RBAC) قوي ونماذج تأشير متعددة المستأجرين."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to define user roles and permissions for freight brokerage operations, implement Echo middleware for role/permission checks, and set up multi-tenant isolation with account-based access using JWT claims structure and RLS policies for secure data access control.","zh":"赋予代理定义货运经纪业务的用户角色和权限、实现Echo中间件以进行角色/权限检查，并使用JWT声明结构和RLS策略设置多租户隔离以实现安全数据访问控制。","ja":"エージェントが貨物ブローカー業務のユーザーロールと権限を定義し、Echoミドルウェアを使用してロール/権限のチェックを実施し、JWTの要求構造とRLSポリシーを使用してマルチテナントの分離を設定して、安全なデータアクセス制御を実現できるようにする。","ko":"貨物 중개 운영에 대한 사용자 역할 및 권한을 정의하고 Echo 미들웨어를 사용하여 역할/권한 확인을 구현하며 JWT声明 구조 및 RLS 정책을 사용하여 다중 테넌트 격리를 설정하여 안전한 데이터 액세스 제어를 구현할 수 있습니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes definir roles y permisos de usuario para operaciones de corredor de carga, implementar middleware de Echo para comprobaciones de roles y permisos, y configurar el aislamiento de multi-arrendatarios con acceso basado en cuentas utilizando la estructura de reclamaciones JWT y las políticas de RLS para el control de acceso a datos seguro.","fr":"Permet aux agents de définir des rôles et des autorisations d''utilisateur pour les opérations de courtage de fret, de mettre en œuvre le middleware Echo pour les vérifications de rôles et d''autorisations, et de configurer l''isolement multi-locataires avec un accès basé sur les comptes en utilisant la structure de revendications JWT et les politiques de RLS pour un contrôle d''accès aux données sécurisé.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Benutzerrollen und -berechtigungen für Frachtvermittlungsoperationen zu definieren, Echo-Middleware für Rollen- und Berechtigungsprüfungen zu implementieren und Multi-Tenant-Isolation mit konto-basiertem Zugriff unter Verwendung der JWT-Anspruchstruktur und RLS-Richtlinien für sicheren Datenzugriff zu konfigurieren.","pt":"Permite que os agentes definam funções de usuário e permissões para operações de corretagem de carga, implementem middleware Echo para verificações de função/permissão e configurem isolamento multi-locatário com acesso baseado em conta usando estrutura de reivindicações JWT e políticas RLS para controle de acesso a dados seguro.","ru":"Позволяет агентам определять роли пользователей и разрешения для операций по грузовому брокериджу, реализовывать middleware Echo для проверок роли/разрешения и настраивать изоляцию для нескольких арендаторов с доступом на основе учетной записи, используя структуру претензий JWT и политики RLS для безопасного контроля доступа к данным.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء تعريف أدوار المستخدمين والسماحات لتشغيلات وسيط الشحن ، وتنفيذ برنامج Echo الوسيط للتحقق من دور / الإذن ، وضبط العزل متعدد المستأجرين مع الوصول المبني على الحساب باستخدام هيكل مطالبات JWT وسياسات RLS للتحكم الآمن في الوصول إلى البيانات."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) for freight brokerage operations","Designing and integrating Echo middleware for efficient role and permission checks","Setting up multi-tenant isolation with Supabase/PostgreSQL for secure data access"],"zh":["为货运经纪业务实施基于角色的访问控制（RBAC）","设计并集成Echo中间件以进行高效的角色和权限检查","使用Supabase/PostgreSQL设置多租户隔离以实现安全的数据访问"],"ja":["貨物ブローカー業務のロールベースのアクセス制御（RBAC）を実装する","Echoミドルウェアを設計して統合し、効率的なロールと権限のチェックを実施する","Supabase/PostgreSQLを使用してマルチテナントの分離を設定し、安全なデータアクセスを実現する"],"ko":["貨物 중개 운영을 위한 역할 기반 액세스 제어(RBAC) 구현","역할 및 권한 확인을 위한 Echo 미들웨어 설계 및 통합","Supabase/PostgreSQL을 사용한 다중 테넌트 격리 설정 및 안전한 데이터 액세스 구현"],"es":["Implementar el control de acceso basado en roles (RBAC) para operaciones de corredor de carga","Diseñar e integrar middleware de Echo para comprobaciones eficientes de roles y permisos","Configurar el aislamiento de multi-arrendatarios con Supabase/PostgreSQL para un acceso a datos seguro"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre le contrôle d''accès basé sur les rôles (RBAC) pour les opérations de courtage de fret","Concevoir et intégrer le middleware Echo pour des vérifications de rôles et d''autorisations efficaces","Configurer l''isolement multi-locataires avec Supabase/PostgreSQL pour un accès aux données sécurisé"],"de":["Implementierung von Rolle-basierten Zugriffskontrollen (RBAC) für Frachtvermittlungsoperationen","Entwurf und Integration von Echo-Middleware für effiziente Rollen- und Berechtigungsprüfungen","Konfiguration von Multi-Tenant-Isolation mit Supabase/PostgreSQL für sicheren Datenzugriff"],"pt":["Implementação do Controle de Acesso Baseado em Funções (RBAC) para operações de corretagem de carga","Projeto e integração do middleware Echo para verificações eficientes de função e permissão","Configuração do isolamento multi-locatário com Supabase/PostgreSQL para acesso seguro a dados"],"ru":["Реализация контроля доступа на основе ролей (RBAC) для операций по грузовому брокериджу","Проектирование и интеграция middleware Echo для эффективных проверок роли и разрешения","Настройка изоляции для нескольких арендаторов с Supabase/PostgreSQL для безопасного доступа к данным"],"ar":["تنفيذ سيطرة الوصول القائمة على الدور (RBAC) لتشغيلات وسيط الشحن","تصميم وتكامل برنامج Echo الوسيط للتحقق الفعال من الدور / الإذن","ضبط العزل متعدد المستأجرين مع Supabase/PostgreSQL للوصول الآمن إلى البيانات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Go and Echo backend environment","Specific to Supabase/PostgreSQL database systems","Limited to implementing RBAC and multi-tenant authorization patterns"],"zh":["需要Go和Echo后端环境","特定于Supabase/PostgreSQL数据库系统","仅限于实施RBAC和多租户授权模式"],"ja":["GoおよびEchoのバックエンド環境が必要","Supabase/PostgreSQLデータベースシステムに特有","RBACおよびマルチテナント認証パターンの実装に限定"],"ko":["Go 및 Echo 백엔드 환경이 필요함","Supabase/PostgreSQL 데이터베이스 시스템에 특정됨","RBAC 및 다중 테넌트 인증 패턴의 구현에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de backend de Go y Echo","Específico para sistemas de bases de datos Supabase/PostgreSQL","Limitado a la implementación de RBAC y patrones de autorización de multi-arrendatarios"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement de backend Go et Echo","Spécifique aux systèmes de bases de données Supabase/PostgreSQL","Limité à la mise en œuvre de RBAC et de modèles d''autorisation multi-locataires"],"de":["Benötigt eine Go- und Echo-Backend-Umgebung","Spezifisch für Supabase/PostgreSQL-Datenbanksysteme","Begrenzt auf die Implementierung von RBAC und Multi-Tenant-Autorisierungsmustern"],"pt":["Exige ambiente de backend Go e Echo","Específico para sistemas de banco de dados Supabase/PostgreSQL","Limitado à implementação de padrões de autorização RBAC e multi-locatários"],"ru":["Требует среды бэкенда Go и Echo","Конкретно для систем баз данных Supabase/PostgreSQL","Ограничен реализацией шаблонов авторизации RBAC и для нескольких арендаторов"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة خلفية Go و Echo","محدد لأنظمة قواعد البيانات Supabase/PostgreSQL","محدود بتنفيذ نماذج التأشير RBAC ومتعددة المستأجرين"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('agentuity/sdk-explorer/agentuity-cli-cloud-apikey-get', 'community', 'agentuity', 'sdk-explorer', 'agentuity/sdk-explorer', 'agentuity-cli-cloud-apikey-get', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.422Z', '2026-02-18T04:31:36.738Z', NULL, '{"id":"agentuity/sdk-explorer/agentuity-cli-cloud-apikey-get","name":"agentuity-cli-cloud-apikey-get","description":{"zh":"Agentuity CLI Cloud API密钥获取是一个demo项目，展示了Agentuity平台的SDK、工具和运行时","ja":"Agentuity CLI Cloud APIキー取得は、AgentuityプラットフォームのSDK、ツール、ランタイムを示すデモプロジェクトです","ko":"Agentuity CLI 클라우드 API 키 가져오기는 Agentuity 플랫폼의 SDK, 도구 및 런타임을 보여주는 데모 프로젝트입니다","es":"El comando Agentuity CLI permite obtener una clave API de nube específica por ID. Requiere autenticación previa con `agentuity auth login`","fr":"La commande Agentuity CLI permet de récupérer une clé API cloud spécifique par ID. Elle nécessite une authentification préalable avec `agentuity auth login`","de":"Der Agentuity-CLI-Befehl ermöglicht das Abrufen eines bestimmten Cloud-API-Schlüssels per ID. Eine vorherige Authentifizierung mit `agentuity auth login` ist erforderlich","pt":"O Agentuity CLI permite obter uma chave de API específica pelo ID. Autentique-se com `agentuity auth login` e use o comando `agentuity cloud apikey get <id>`","ru":"Agentuity CLI позволяет получить определенный ключ API по ID. Аутентифицируйтесь с помощью `agentuity auth login` и используйте команду `agentuity cloud apikey get <id>`","ar":"يسمح Agentuity CLI بالحصول على مفتاح API محدد بواسطة المعرف. أتمتة مع `agentuity auth login` واستخدم الأمر `agentuity cloud apikey get <id>`","en":"A demo project showcasing the Agentuity platform (SDK, tools, and runtime)"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Agentuity CLI Cloud API密钥获取","ja":"Agentuity CLI Cloud APIキー取得","ko":"Agentuity CLI 클라우드 API 키 가져오기","es":"Obtener clave API de nube con Agentuity CLI","fr":"Récupérer une clé API cloud avec Agentuity CLI","de":"Abrufen eines Cloud-API-Schlüssels mit Agentuity CLI","pt":"Obtenha Chave de API do Agentuity","ru":"Получить ключ API Agentuity","ar":"احصل على مفتاح API Agentuity","en":"agentuity-cli-cloud-apikey-get"},"description":{"zh":"Agentuity CLI Cloud API密钥获取是一个demo项目，展示了Agentuity平台的SDK、工具和运行时","ja":"Agentuity CLI Cloud APIキー取得は、AgentuityプラットフォームのSDK、ツール、ランタイムを示すデモプロジェクトです","ko":"Agentuity CLI 클라우드 API 키 가져오기는 Agentuity 플랫폼의 SDK, 도구 및 런타임을 보여주는 데모 프로젝트입니다","es":"El comando Agentuity CLI permite obtener una clave API de nube específica por ID. Requiere autenticación previa con `agentuity auth login`","fr":"La commande Agentuity CLI permet de récupérer une clé API cloud spécifique par ID. Elle nécessite une authentification préalable avec `agentuity auth login`","de":"Der Agentuity-CLI-Befehl ermöglicht das Abrufen eines bestimmten Cloud-API-Schlüssels per ID. Eine vorherige Authentifizierung mit `agentuity auth login` ist...","pt":"O Agentuity CLI permite obter uma chave de API específica pelo ID. Autentique-se com `agentuity auth login` e use o comando `agentuity cloud apikey get <id>`","ru":"Agentuity CLI позволяет получить определенный ключ API по ID. Аутентифицируйтесь с помощью `agentuity auth login` и используйте команду `agentuity cloud apik...","ar":"يسمح Agentuity CLI بالحصول على مفتاح API محدد بواسطة المعرف. أتمتة مع `agentuity auth login` واستخدم الأمر `agentuity cloud apikey get <id>`","en":"A demo project showcasing the Agentuity platform (SDK, tools, and runtime)"},"definition":{"en":"A demo project showcasing the Agentuity platform (SDK, tools, and runtime)"},"features":{"zh":["获取特定API密钥","支持命令行操作","实现安全的身份验证和授权","展示Agentuity平台的SDK、工具和运行时","支持多语言"],"ja":["特定のAPIキーを取得","コマンドライン操作をサポート","安全な認証と認可を実現","AgentuityプラットフォームのSDK、ツール、ランタイムを示す","多言語をサポート"],"ko":["특정 API 키를 가져옴","명령줄 운영을 지원","보안 인증 및 인가를 구현","Agentuity 플랫폼의 SDK, 도구 및 런타임을 보여줌","다중 언어를 지원"],"es":["Obtención de claves API de nube por ID","Autenticación con `agentuity auth login`","Uso de comandos para recuperar claves API","Compatibilidad con la plataforma Agentuity","Uso de la CLI para tareas de administración"],"fr":["Récupération de clés API cloud par ID","Authentification avec `agentuity auth login`","Utilisation de commandes pour récupérer des clés API","Compatibilité avec la plateforme Agentuity","Utilisation de la CLI pour des tâches d''administration"],"de":["Abrufen von Cloud-API-Schlüsseln per ID","Authentifizierung mit `agentuity auth login`","Verwendung von Befehlen zum Abrufen von API-Schlüsseln","Kompatibilität mit der Agentuity-Plattform","Verwendung der CLI für Administrationsaufgaben"],"pt":["Obtenha chaves de API específicas pelo ID","Autenticação com `agentuity auth login`","Uso do comando `agentuity cloud apikey get <id>`","Gerenciamento de chaves de API","Integração com a plataforma Agentuity"],"ru":["Получить определенные ключи API по ID","Аутентификация с помощью `agentuity auth login`","Использование команды `agentuity cloud apikey get <id>`","Управление ключами API","Интеграция с платформой Agentuity"],"ar":["احصل على مفاتيح API محددة بواسطة المعرف","أتمتة مع `agentuity auth login`","استخدام الأمر `agentuity cloud apikey get <id>`","إدارة مفاتيح API","التكامل مع منصة Agentuity"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Agentuity CLI","Cloud API密钥","命令行工具","身份验证","授权","SDK","工具","运行时"],"ja":["Agentuity CLI","Cloud APIキー","コマンドラインツール","認証","認可","SDK","ツール","ランタイム"],"ko":["Agentuity CLI","클라우드 API 키","명령줄 도구","인증","인가","SDK","도구","런타임"],"es":["Agentuity CLI","claves API de nube","autenticación","comandos","plataforma Agentuity","administración de claves API"],"fr":["Agentuity CLI","clés API cloud","authentification","commandes","plateforme Agentuity","administration de clés API"],"de":["Agentuity CLI","Cloud-API-Schlüssel","Authentifizierung","Befehle","Agentuity-Plattform","Verwaltung von API-Schlüsseln"],"pt":["Agentuity CLI","chave de API","gerenciamento de chaves de API","autenticação","comando de linha","desenvolvimento de software","plataforma de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Agentuity CLI","ключ API","управление ключами API","аутентификация","командная строка","разработка программного обеспечения","платформа разработки"],"ar":["Agentuity CLI","مفتاح API","إدارة مفاتيح API","أتمتة","سطر الأوامر","تطوير البرمجيات","منصة التطوير"]}},"owner":"agentuity","repo":"sdk-explorer","repoPath":"agentuity/sdk-explorer","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.422Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"agentuity-cli-cloud-apikey-get","description":"Get a specific API key by id. Requires authentication. Use for Agentuity cloud platform operations","version":"0.1.2","tags":"read-only fast requires-auth","bodyPreview":"# Cloud Apikey Get\n\nGet a specific API key by id\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Authenticated with `agentuity auth login`\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\nagentuity cloud apikey get <id>\n```\n\n## Arguments\n\n| Argument | Type | Required | Description |\n|----------|------|----------|-------------|\n| `<id>` | string | Yes | - |\n\n## Examples\n\nGet item details:\n\n```bash\nbunx @agentuity/cli cloud apikey get <id>\n```","body":"# Cloud Apikey Get\n\nGet a specific API key by id\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Authenticated with `agentuity auth login`\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\nagentuity cloud apikey get <id>\n```\n\n## Arguments\n\n| Argument | Type | Required | Description |\n|----------|------|----------|-------------|\n| `<id>` | string | Yes | - |\n\n## Examples\n\nGet item details:\n\n```bash\nbunx @agentuity/cli cloud apikey get <id>\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:31:36.738Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Security and Infrastructure Management Agents requiring programmatic API key administration.","zh":"非常适合需要以编程方式管理API密钥的安全和基础设施管理代理。","ja":"APIキーのプログラムによる管理を必要とするセキュリティおよびインフラストラクチャ管理エージェントに最適です。","ko":"API 키를 프로그래밍 방식으로 관리해야 하는 보안 및 인프라 관리 에이전트에 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de gestión de seguridad e infraestructura que requieren administración programática de claves API.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de gestion de la sécurité et de l''infrastructure nécessitant une administration programmatique des clés API.","de":"Ideal für Agenten der Sicherheits- und Infrastrukturverwaltung, die eine programmatische API-Schlüsselverwaltung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Segurança e Gerenciamento de Infraestrutura que requerem administração programática de chaves de API.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов безопасности и управления инфраструктурой, требующих программного управления ключами API.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الأمان وإدارة البنية التحتية الذين يتطلبون إدارة برمجية لمفاتيح API."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables direct retrieval of specific API key metadata from the Agentuity cloud platform through CLI integration. This provides secure, authenticated access to credential management without manual dashboard navigation.","zh":"通过CLI集成，可直接从Agentuity云平台检索特定的API密钥元数据。这提供了对凭证管理的安全、经过身份验证的访问，无需手动导航仪表板。","ja":"CLI統合を通じて、Agentuityクラウドプラットフォームから特定のAPIキーメタデータを直接取得できます。これにより、ダッシュボードを手動で操作することなく、資格情報管理への安全な認証アクセスが実現します。","ko":"CLI 통합을 통해 Agentuity 클라우드 플랫폼에서 특정 API 키 메타데이터를 직접 검색할 수 있도록 합니다. 이를 통해 대시보드를 수동으로 탐색하지 않고도 자격 증명 관리에 대한 안전한 인증 액세스를 제공합니다.","es":"Permite la recuperación directa de metadatos específicos de claves API desde la plataforma en la nube de Agentuity mediante integración CLI. Esto proporciona acceso seguro y autenticado a la gestión de credenciales sin navegación manual por el panel de control.","fr":"Permet la récupération directe de métadonnées spécifiques de clés API depuis la plateforme cloud Agentuity via une intégration CLI. Cela fournit un accès sécurisé et authentifié à la gestion des identifiants sans navigation manuelle dans le tableau de bord.","de":"Ermöglicht den direkten Abruf spezifischer API-Schlüssel-Metadaten von der Agentuity-Cloud-Plattform durch CLI-Integration. Dies bietet sicheren, authentifizierten Zugriff auf die Anmeldeinformationsverwaltung ohne manuelle Navigation im Dashboard.","pt":"Permite a recuperação direta de metadados específicos de chaves API da plataforma em nuvem Agentuity através da integração CLI. Isso fornece acesso seguro e autenticado ao gerenciamento de credenciais sem navegação manual no painel.","ru":"Позволяет напрямую получать определенные метаданные ключей API из облачной платформы Agentuity через интеграцию с CLI. Это обеспечивает безопасный, аутентифицированный доступ к управлению учетными данными без необходимости ручной навигации по панели управления.","ar":"يتيح الاسترجاع المباشر لبيانات تعريفية محددة لمفاتيح API من منصة Agentuity السحابية من خلال تكامل واجهة سطر الأوامر. وهذا يوفر وصولاً آمنًا ومعتمدًا لإدارة بيانات الاعتماد دون التنقل اليدوي في لوحة التحكم."},"useCases":{"en":["Auditing active API keys by identifier","Automating credential rotation workflows","Integrating key status checks into deployment pipelines","Troubleshooting authentication failures for specific keys"],"zh":["按标识符审核活跃的API密钥","自动化凭证轮换工作流","将密钥状态检查集成到部署流水线中","对特定密钥进行身份验证故障排除"],"ja":["識別子によるアクティブなAPIキーの監査","資格情報ローテーションワークフローの自動化","デプロイメントパイプラインへのキーステータスチェックの統合","特定のキーに対する認証障害のトラブルシューティング"],"ko":["식별자별 활성 API 키 감사","자격 증명 순환 워크플로우 자동화","배포 파이프라인에 키 상태 확인 통합","특정 키에 대한 인증 실패 문제 해결"],"es":["Auditoría de claves API activas por identificador","Automatización de flujos de trabajo de rotación de credenciales","Integración de comprobaciones de estado de claves en pipelines de despliegue","Solución de problemas de fallos de autenticación para claves específicas"],"fr":["Audit des clés API actives par identifiant","Automatisation des workflows de rotation des identifiants","Intégration des vérifications d''état des clés dans les pipelines de déploiement","Dépannage des échecs d''authentification pour des clés spécifiques"],"de":["Überprüfung aktiver API-Schlüssel anhand des Identifikators","Automatisierung von Workflows zur Anmeldeinformationsrotation","Integration von Schlüsselstatusprüfungen in Bereitstellungspipelines","Fehlerbehebung bei Authentifizierungsfehlern für bestimmte Schlüssel"],"pt":["Auditoria de chaves API ativas por identificador","Automação de fluxos de trabalho de rotação de credenciais","Integração de verificações de status de chaves em pipelines de implantação","Solução de problemas de falhas de autenticação para chaves específicas"],"ru":["Аудит активных ключей API по идентификатору","Автоматизация рабочих процессов смены учетных данных","Интеграция проверок статуса ключей в конвейеры развертывания","Устранение сбоев аутентификации для конкретных ключей"],"ar":["مراجعة مفاتيح API النشطة بواسطة المعرف","أتمتة سير عمل تدوير بيانات الاعتماد","دمج فحوصات حالة المفتاح في خطوط الأنابيب النشر","استكشاف أخطاء فشل المصادقة لمفاتيح محددة وإصلاحها"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires prior authentication via ''agentuity auth login''","Dependent on Agentuity cloud platform availability","CLI-only interface without direct API access"],"zh":["需要事先通过 ''agentuity auth login'' 进行身份验证","依赖于Agentuity云平台的可用性","仅限CLI界面，无直接API访问"],"ja":["事前に「agentuity auth login」による認証が必要","Agentuityクラウドプラットフォームの可用性に依存","直接APIアクセスがないCLI専用インターフェース"],"ko":["''agentuity auth login''을 통한 사전 인증 필요","Agentuity 클라우드 플랫폼 가용성에 의존","직접 API 액세스 없이 CLI 전용 인터페이스"],"es":["Requiere autenticación previa mediante ''agentuity auth login''","Depende de la disponibilidad de la plataforma en la nube de Agentuity","Interfaz exclusiva de CLI sin acceso directo a la API"],"fr":["Nécessite une authentification préalable via ''agentuity auth login''","Dépend de la disponibilité de la plateforme cloud Agentuity","Interface CLI uniquement sans accès direct à l''API"],"de":["Erfordert vorherige Authentifizierung über ''agentuity auth login''","Abhängig von der Verfügbarkeit der Agentuity-Cloud-Plattform","Nur CLI-Schnittstelle ohne direkten API-Zugriff"],"pt":["Requer autenticação prévia via ''agentuity auth login''","Dependente da disponibilidade da plataforma em nuvem Agentuity","Interface apenas CLI sem acesso direto à API"],"ru":["Требует предварительной аутентификации через ''agentuity auth login''","Зависит от доступности облачной платформы Agentuity","Только интерфейс командной строки (CLI) без прямого доступа к API"],"ar":["يتطلب مصادقة مسبقة عبر ''agentuity auth login''","يعتمد على توفر منصة Agentuity السحابية","واجهة سطر أوامر فقط دون وصول مباشر إلى API"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Meme-Lords/granhackaria-run1/gsd:workflow:resume-project', 'community', 'Meme-Lords', 'granhackaria-run1', 'Meme-Lords/granhackaria-run1', 'gsd:workflow:resume-project', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.422Z', '2026-02-18T04:31:39.736Z', NULL, '{"id":"Meme-Lords/granhackaria-run1/gsd:workflow:resume-project","name":"gsd:workflow:resume-project","description":{"zh":"项目恢复工作流用于恢复暂停或中断的项目","ja":"プロジェクト再開ワークフローは、一時停止または中断されたプロジェクトを再開するために使用","ko":"프로젝트 재개 워크플로는 일시 중단 또는 중단된 프로젝트를 재개하는 데 사용","es":"El flujo de trabajo para reanudar proyectos permite a los desarrolladores retomar su trabajo de donde lo dejaron, reduciendo tiempos de inactividad y mejorando la productividad.","fr":"Le workflow de réactivation de projets permet aux développeurs de reprendre leur travail là où ils l''ont laissé, réduisant les temps d''inactivité et améliorant la productivité.","de":"Der Workflow zur Wiederaufnahme von Projekten ermöglicht es Entwicklern, ihre Arbeit dort wieder aufzunehmen, wo sie sie unterbrochen haben, und reduziert Ausfallzeiten und verbessert die Produktivität.","pt":"O fluxo de trabalho de retomada de projeto permite restaurar o estado do projeto e continuar o trabalho de onde parou.","ru":"Workflow для возобновления проекта позволяет восстановить состояние проекта и продолжить работу с того места, где он был приостановлен.","ar":"تدفق العمل لاستئناف المشروع يسمح باستعادة حالة المشروع واستكمال العمل من حيث انتهى.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"项目恢复工作流","ja":"プロジェクト再開ワークフロー","ko":"프로젝트 재개 워크플로","es":"Reanudar Proyecto: Flujo de Trabajo para Desarrolladores","fr":"Réactiver Projet: Workflow pour Développeurs","de":"Projekt Wiederaufnahme: Workflow für Entwickler","pt":"Retomar Projeto: Fluxo de Trabalho de Retomada","ru":"Возобновление Проекта: Workflow для возобновления","ar":"استئناف المشروع: تدفق العمل لاستئناف","en":"gsd:workflow:resume-project"},"description":{"zh":"项目恢复工作流用于恢复暂停或中断的项目","ja":"プロジェクト再開ワークフローは、一時停止または中断されたプロジェクトを再開するために使用","ko":"프로젝트 재개 워크플로는 일시 중단 또는 중단된 프로젝트를 재개하는 데 사용","es":"El flujo de trabajo para reanudar proyectos permite a los desarrolladores retomar su trabajo de donde lo dejaron, reduciendo tiempos de inactividad y mejoran...","fr":"Le workflow de réactivation de projets permet aux développeurs de reprendre leur travail là où ils l''ont laissé, réduisant les temps d''inactivité et améliora...","de":"Der Workflow zur Wiederaufnahme von Projekten ermöglicht es Entwicklern, ihre Arbeit dort wieder aufzunehmen, wo sie sie unterbrochen haben, und reduziert Au...","pt":"O fluxo de trabalho de retomada de projeto permite restaurar o estado do projeto e continuar o trabalho de onde parou.","ru":"Workflow для возобновления проекта позволяет восстановить состояние проекта и продолжить работу с того места, где он был приостановлен.","ar":"تدفق العمل لاستئناف المشروع يسمح باستعادة حالة المشروع واستكمال العمل من حيث انتهى.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["加载保存的状态","恢复进度","验证准备就绪","继续工作"],"ja":["保存された状態をロード","進度を復元","準備完了を検証","作業を続ける"],"ko":["저장된 상태 로드","진행 상황 복원","준비 완료 검증","작업 계속"],"es":["Carga de estado guardado","Restauración de progreso","Verificación de preparación","Continuación del trabajo"],"fr":["Chargement de l''état enregistré","Restauration de la progression","Vérification de la préparation","Continuation du travail"],"de":["Laden des gespeicherten Zustands","Wiederherstellung des Fortschritts","Überprüfung der Bereitschaft","Fortsetzung der Arbeit"],"pt":["Carregamento do estado salvo","Restauração do progresso","Verificação da prontidão","Continuação do trabalho"],"ru":["Загрузка сохраненного состояния","Восстановление прогресса","Проверка готовности","Продолжение работы"],"ar":["تحميل الحالة المحفوظة","استعادة التقدم","التحقق من الجاهزية","استكمال العمل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["项目恢复","工作流","暂停项目","中断项目","继续工作","项目管理"],"ja":["プロジェクト再開","ワークフロー","一時停止プロジェクト","中断プロジェクト","作業を続ける","プロジェクト管理"],"ko":["프로젝트 재개","워크플로","일시 중단 프로젝트","중단 프로젝트","작업 계속","프로젝트 관리"],"es":["reanudar proyecto","flujo de trabajo para desarrolladores","proyecto pausado","proyecto interrumpido","productividad","tiempos de inactividad"],"fr":["réactiver projet","workflow pour développeurs","projet en pause","projet interrompu","productivité","temps d''inactivité"],"de":["projekt wiederaufnehmen","workflow für entwickler","pausiertes projekt","unterbrochenes projekt","produktivität","ausfallzeiten"],"pt":["retomar projeto","fluxo de trabalho","restaurar estado","continuar trabalho","desenvolvimento de software","gerenciamento de projeto"],"ru":["возобновление проекта","workflow","восстановление состояния","продолжение работы","разработка программного обеспечения","управление проектом"],"ar":["استئناف المشروع","تدفق العمل","استعادة الحالة","استكمال العمل","تطوير البرمجيات","إدارة المشروع"]}},"owner":"Meme-Lords","repo":"granhackaria-run1","repoPath":"Meme-Lords/granhackaria-run1","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.422Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"gsd:workflow:resume-project","description":"Workflow for resuming a paused project","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# GSD Resume Project Workflow\n\nWorkflow for resuming a paused or interrupted project.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Continuing after pause\n- Restoring project state\n- Picking up where left off\n\n## Phases\n\n1. Load saved state\n2. Restore progress\n3. Verify readiness\n4. Continue work\n\n## Success Criteria\n\nProject resumed from saved state.","body":"# GSD Resume Project Workflow\n\nWorkflow for resuming a paused or interrupted project.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Continuing after pause\n- Restoring project state\n- Picking up where left off\n\n## Phases\n\n1. Load saved state\n2. Restore progress\n3. Verify readiness\n4. Continue work\n\n## Success Criteria\n\nProject resumed from saved state.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:31:39.736Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Task Management Agents requiring efficient project resumption capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高效项目恢复能力的任务管理智能体。","ja":"効率的なプロジェクト再開機能を必要とするタスク管理エージェントに最適です。","ko":"효율적인 프로젝트 재개 기능이 필요한 작업 관리 에이전트에 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Gestión de Tareas que requieren capacidades de reanudación de proyectos eficientes.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Gestion de Tâches nécessitant des capacités de reprise de projet efficaces.","de":"Ideal für Task-Management-Agents, die effiziente Projektwiederaufnahmefähigkeiten erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Tarefas que exigem capacidades eficientes de retomada de projetos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления задачами, требующих эффективных возможностей возобновления проектов.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات إدارة المهام التي تتطلب قدرات استئناف مشروع فعالة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to seamlessly restore project states, verify readiness, and continue work from saved points, leveraging phases like loading saved states, restoring progress, and verifying readiness.","zh":"使智能体能够无缝恢复项目状态、验证准备情况并从保存点继续工作，利用诸如加载保存状态、恢复进度和验证准备情况等阶段。","ja":"保存された状態の読み込み、進捗の復元、準備状態の検証などのフェーズを活用して、エージェントがプロジェクト状態をシームレスに復元し、準備状態を検証し、保存ポイントから作業を継続できるようにします。","ko":"저장된 상태 로드, 진행 상황 복원, 준비 상태 확인과 같은 단계를 활용하여 에이전트가 프로젝트 상태를 원활하게 복원하고, 준비 상태를 확인하며, 저장 지점에서 작업을 계속할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes restaurar sin problemas los estados del proyecto, verificar la preparación y continuar trabajando desde puntos guardados, aprovechando fases como la carga de estados guardados, la restauración del progreso y la verificación de la preparación.","fr":"Permet aux agents de restaurer sans heurt les états de projet, de vérifier la préparation et de poursuivre le travail à partir de points enregistrés, en exploitant des phases comme le chargement des états enregistrés, la restauration de la progression et la vérification de la préparation.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Projektzustände nahtlos wiederherzustellen, die Bereitschaft zu überprüfen und die Arbeit von gespeicherten Punkten aus fortzusetzen, indem es Phasen wie das Laden gespeicherter Zustände, die Wiederherstellung des Fortschritts und die Überprüfung der Bereitschaft nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a restaurar estados de projeto de forma transparente, verificar a prontidão e continuar o trabalho a partir de pontos salvos, aproveitando fases como carregar estados salvos, restaurar o progresso e verificar a prontidão.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью бесшовного восстановления состояний проекта, проверки готовности и продолжения работы с сохраненных точек, используя фазы, такие как загрузка сохраненных состояний, восстановление прогресса и проверка готовности.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من استعادة حالات المشروع بسلاسة، والتحقق من الجاهزية، والمواصلة من العمل من النقاط المحفوظة، مستفيدة من مراحل مثل تحميل الحالات المحفوظة، واستعادة التقدم، والتحقق من الجاهزية."},"useCases":{"en":["Resuming paused projects","Restoring interrupted workflows","Picking up from saved states"],"zh":["恢复暂停的项目","恢复中断的工作流程","从保存的状态继续"],"ja":["一時停止したプロジェクトの再開","中断されたワークフローの復元","保存された状態からの再開"],"ko":["일시중지된 프로젝트 재개","중단된 워크플로우 복원","저장된 상태에서 이어서 작업"],"es":["Reanudar proyectos pausados","Restaurar flujos de trabajo interrumpidos","Recoger desde estados guardados"],"fr":["Reprendre des projets suspendus","Rétablir des flux de travail interrompus","Reprendre à partir d''états enregistrés"],"de":["Pausierte Projekte wieder aufnehmen","Unterbrochene Arbeitsabläufe wiederherstellen","Bei gespeicherten Zuständen weitermachen"],"pt":["Retomada de projetos pausados","Restauração de fluxos de trabalho interrompidos","Retomada a partir de estados salvos"],"ru":["Возобновление паузированных проектов","Восстановление прерванных рабочих процессов","Возобновление с сохраненных точек"],"ar":["استئناف المشاريع الموقفة","استعادة سير العمل المتقطع","المواصلة من النقاط المحفوظة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires saved project state","Dependent on project type and complexity"],"zh":["需要保存的项目状态","取决于项目类型和复杂性"],"ja":["保存されたプロジェクト状態が必要","プロジェクトの種類と複雑さに依存"],"ko":["저장된 프로젝트 상태 필요","프로젝트 유형 및 복잡성에 따라 다름"],"es":["Requiere un estado de proyecto guardado","Depende del tipo y la complejidad del proyecto"],"fr":["Nécessite un état de projet enregistré","Dépend du type et de la complexité du projet"],"de":["Benötigt einen gespeicherten Projektzustand","Hängt vom Projekttyp und der Komplexität ab"],"pt":["Exige estado de projeto salvo","Depende do tipo e complexidade do projeto"],"ru":["Требует сохраненного состояния проекта","Зависит от типа и сложности проекта"],"ar":["يتطلب حالة مشروع محفوظة","يعتمد على نوع المشروع و复杂يته"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
