ot","ru":"Облачный песочница CLI: Добавление тега к снимку","ar":"ساندبكس سحابي CLI: إضافة علامة إلى لقطة","en":"agentuity-cli-cloud-sandbox-snapshot-tag"},"description":{"zh":"Agentuity CLI 云沙盒快照标签管理允许开发者轻松添加或更新快照标签，实现高效的快照管理","ja":"Agentuity CLI クラウドサンドボックススナップショットタグ管理により、開発者はスナップショットタグを簡単に追加または更新できます","ko":"Agentuity CLI 클라우드 샌드박스 스냅샷 태그 관리를 통해 개발자는 스냅샷 태그를 쉽게 추가하거나 업데이트하여 효율적인 스냅샷 관리를实现할 수 있습니다","es":"El comando agentuity cloud sandbox snapshot tag permite agregar o actualizar etiquetas en instantáneas de sandbox en la nube.","fr":"La commande agentuity cloud sandbox snapshot tag permet d''ajouter ou de mettre à jour des étiquettes sur des instantanés de sandbox cloud.","de":"Der Befehl agentuity cloud sandbox snapshot tag ermöglicht das Hinzufügen oder Aktualisieren von Tags in Cloud-Sandbox-Snapshots.","pt":"O comando agentuity cloud sandbox snapshot tag permite adicionar ou atualizar tags em snapshots de forma eficiente. Saiba mais sobre como usá-lo.","ru":"Команда agentuity cloud sandbox snapshot tag позволяет добавлять или обновлять теги в снимках эффективно. Узнайте больше о том, как ее использовать.","ar":"الأمر agentuity cloud sandbox snapshot tag يسمح بإضافة أو تحديث العلامات على اللقطات بفعالية. تعلم المزيد حول كيفية استخدامه.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["添加或更新快照标签","支持多个快照标签","高效的快照管理","支持命令行操作","集成到 Agentuity CLI 中"],"ja":["スナップショットタグの追加または更新","複数のスナップショットタグをサポート","効率的なスナップショット管理","コマンドライン操作をサポート","Agentuity CLI に統合"],"ko":["스냅샷 태그 추가 또는 업데이트","複数의 스냅샷 태그 지원","효율적인 스냅샷 관리","명령줄操作 지원","Agentuity CLI에 통합"],"es":["Agregar etiquetas a instantáneas de sandbox en la nube","Actualizar etiquetas existentes en instantáneas de sandbox","Requiere autenticación con agentuity auth login","Requiere contexto de organización (--org-id o organización predeterminada)","Soporta opciones personalizadas para la gestión de etiquetas"],"fr":["Ajouter des étiquettes à des instantanés de sandbox cloud","Mettre à jour des étiquettes existantes sur des instantanés de sandbox","Nécessite une authentification avec agentuity auth login","Nécessite un contexte d''organisation (--org-id ou organisation par défaut)","Prend en charge des options personnalisées pour la gestion des étiquettes"],"de":["Hinzufügen von Tags zu Cloud-Sandbox-Snapshots","Aktualisieren von bestehenden Tags in Cloud-Sandbox-Snapshots","Erfordert Authentifizierung mit agentuity auth login","Erfordert Organisationskontext (--org-id oder Standardorganisation)","Unterstützt benutzerdefinierte Optionen für die Tag-Verwaltung"],"pt":["Adicionar tags a snapshots","Atualizar tags existentes","Gerenciar snapshots de forma eficiente","Integração com o comando agentuity auth login","Suporte a contexto de organização"],"ru":["Добавление тегов к снимкам","Обновление существующих тегов","Эффективное управление снимками","Интеграция с командой agentuity auth login","Поддержка контекста организации"],"ar":["إضافة علامات إلى اللقطات","تحديث العلامات الحالية","إدارة اللقطات بفعالية","التكامل مع الأمر agentuity auth login","دعم سياق المنظمة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Agentuity CLI","云沙盒","快照标签","命令行工具","开发者工具","云计算","快照管理"],"ja":["Agentuity CLI","クラウドサンドボックス","スナップショットタグ","コマンドラインツール","開発者ツール","クラウドコンピューティング","スナップショット管理"],"ko":["Agentuity CLI","클라우드 샌드박스","스냅샷 태그","명령줄 툴","개발자 툴","클라우드 컴퓨팅","스냅샷 관리"],"es":["etiquetado de instantáneas de sandbox en la nube","agentuity-cli","gestión de etiquetas","instantáneas de sandbox","nube","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["étiquetage d''instantanés de sandbox cloud","agentuity-cli","gestion des étiquettes","instantanés de sandbox","cloud","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["Tagging von Cloud-Sandbox-Snapshots","agentuity-cli","Tag-Verwaltung","Cloud-Sandbox-Snapshots","Cloud","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["agentuity cli","cloud sandbox","snapshot tag","gerenciamento de snapshots","organização de snapshots","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["agentuity cli","облачный песочница","тег снимка","управление снимками","организация снимков","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["agentuity cli","ساندبكس سحابي","علامة اللقطة","إدارة اللقطات","تنظيم اللقطات","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"agentuity","repo":"discord-help-agent","repoPath":"agentuity/discord-help-agent","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.422Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"agentuity-cli-cloud-sandbox-snapshot-tag","description":"Add or update a tag on a snapshot. Requires authentication. Use for Agentuity cloud platform operations","version":"0.0.110","tags":"slow requires-auth","bodyPreview":"# Cloud Sandbox Snapshot Tag\n\nAdd or update a tag on a snapshot\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Authenticated with `agentuity auth login`\n- Organization context required (`--org-id` or default org)\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\nagentuity cloud sandbox snapshot tag <snapshotId> [tag] [options]\n```\n\n## Arguments\n\n| Argument | Type | Required | Description |\n|----------|------|----------|-------------|\n| `<snapshotId>` | string | Yes | - |\n| `<tag>` | string | No | - |\n\n## Options\n\n| Option | Type | Required | Default |","body":"# Cloud Sandbox Snapshot Tag\n\nAdd or update a tag on a snapshot\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Authenticated with `agentuity auth login`\n- Organization context required (`--org-id` or default org)\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\nagentuity cloud sandbox snapshot tag <snapshotId> [tag] [options]\n```\n\n## Arguments\n\n| Argument | Type | Required | Description |\n|----------|------|----------|-------------|\n| `<snapshotId>` | string | Yes | - |\n| `<tag>` | string | No | - |\n\n## Options\n\n| Option | Type | Required | Default | Description |\n|--------|------|----------|---------|-------------|\n| `--clear` | boolean | Yes | - | Remove the tag from the snapshot |\n\n## Examples\n\nTag a snapshot as \"latest\":\n\n```bash\nbunx @agentuity/cli cloud sandbox snapshot tag snp_abc123 latest\n```\n\nRemove a tag from a snapshot:\n\n```bash\nbunx @agentuity/cli cloud sandbox snapshot tag snp_abc123 --clear\n```\n\n## Output\n\nReturns JSON object:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"snapshotId\": \"string\",\n  \"tag\": \"unknown\"\n}\n```\n\n| Field | Type | Description |\n|-------|------|-------------|\n| `snapshotId` | string | Snapshot ID |\n| `tag` | unknown | New tag |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:32:49.901Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Management Agents needing efficient snapshot organization and tagging capabilities in the agentuity-cli ecosystem.","zh":"非常适合需要在 agentuity-cli 生态系统中高效地组织快照和标签的云管理代理。","ja":"エージェンシクリークライアントエコシステムでスナップショットの組織化とタグ付け機能を効率的に行う必要があるクラウド管理エージェントに最適です。","ko":"에이전트유티 클라이언트 생태계에서 스냅샷을 효율적으로 구성하고 태그를 지정하는 기능이 필요한 클라우드 관리 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de administración de nube que necesitan una organización eficiente de instantáneas y capacidades de etiquetado en el ecosistema de agentuity-cli.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion cloud ayant besoin d''une organisation d''instantanés efficace et de capacités de balisage dans l''écosystème agentuity-cli.","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Management-Agents, die eine effiziente Snapshot-Organisation und Tagging-Funktionen im agentuity-cli-Ökosystem benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Nuvem que necessitam de organização eficiente de snapshots e capacidades de marcação no ecossistema da agentuity-cli.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов облачного управления, которым необходима эффективная организация снимков и функции тегирования в экосистеме agentuity-cli.","ar":"مثالي لعميل إدارة السحابة الذي يحتاج إلى تنظيم فعال للصور المتجمعة وسمات التصنيف في نظام بيئة واجهة سطر الأوامر للوكيل"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage cloud sandbox snapshots effectively by adding or updating tags, utilizing the `agentuity cloud sandbox snapshot tag` command with specific snapshot IDs and optional tags, all while leveraging authenticated sessions and organization context via `--org-id` or default org settings.","zh":"通过使用 `agentuity cloud sandbox snapshot tag` 命令并指定特定的快照 ID 和可选标签，利用经过验证的会话和通过 `--org-id` 或默认组织设置提供的组织上下文，赋予代理高效地管理云沙盒快照的能力。","ja":"特定のスナップショット ID およびオプションのタグを指定して `agentuity cloud sandbox snapshot tag` コマンドを使用し、`--org-id` またはデフォルトの組織設定を介して提供される認証セッションおよび組織コンテキストを活用することで、クラウドサンドボックスのスナップショットを効果的に管理できるようにエージェントをEmpowerします。","ko":"특정 스냅샷 ID 및 선택적 태그를 지정하여 `agentuity cloud sandbox snapshot tag` 명령을 사용하고 `--org-id` 또는 기본 조직 설정을 통해 제공되는 인증 세션 및 조직 컨텍스트를 활용하여 클라우드 샌드박스의 스냅샷을 효율적으로 관리할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 강화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a administrar las instantáneas de la caja de arena en la nube de manera efectiva al agregar o actualizar etiquetas, utilizando el comando `agentuity cloud sandbox snapshot tag` con identificadores de instantáneas específicos y etiquetas opcionales, todo mientras aprovecha sesiones autenticadas y contexto de organización a través de `--org-id` o configuración de organización predeterminada.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer efficacement les instantanés de la boîte de sable cloud en ajoutant ou en mettant à jour des balises, en utilisant la commande `agentuity cloud sandbox snapshot tag` avec des ID d''instantanés spécifiques et des balises facultatives, le tout en exploitant les sessions authentifiées et le contexte d''organisation via `--org-id` ou les paramètres d''organisation par défaut.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Cloud-Sandbox-Snapshots effektiv zu verwalten, indem sie Tags hinzufügen oder aktualisieren, indem sie den Befehl `agentuity cloud sandbox snapshot tag` mit spezifischen Snapshot-IDs und optionalen Tags verwenden, während sie authentifizierte Sitzungen und Organisationskontext über `--org-id` oder Standardorganisations-Einstellungen nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar snapshots de sandbox de nuvem de forma eficaz, adicionando ou atualizando tags, utilizando o comando `agentuity cloud sandbox snapshot tag` com IDs de snapshot específicas e tags opcionais, aproveitando sessões autenticadas e contexto de organização via `--org-id` ou configurações de organização padrão.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно управлять снимками облачного песочницы, добавляя или обновляя теги, используя команду `agentuity cloud sandbox snapshot tag` с конкретными идентификаторами снимков и необязательными тегами, используя аутентифицированные сеансы и контекст организации через `--org-id` или настройки организации по умолчанию.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إدارة صور متجمعة لبيئة رمل السحابة بفعالية، من خلال إضافة أو تحديث العلامات، باستخدام الأمر `agentuity cloud sandbox snapshot tag` مع معرّفات الصور المتجمعة المحددة وال علامات الاختيارية، مع الاستفادة من الجلسات المُوثقة وسياق المنظمة عبر `--org-id` أو الإعدادات الافتراضية للمنظمة"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating snapshot tagging for easier identification and retrieval","Updating existing tags on snapshots to reflect changes in project requirements","Organizing snapshots by tags for streamlined access and management within the cloud sandbox environment"],"zh":["自动化快照标签以便于识别和检索","更新现有的快照标签以反映项目需求的变化","通过标签组织快照以便于在云沙盒环境中访问和管理"],"ja":["識別および检索を容易にするためにスナップショットのタグ付けを自動化する","プロジェクト要件の変更を反映するために既存のスナップショットのタグを更新する","クラウドサンドボックス環境内でのアクセスおよび管理を簡素化するためにタグでスナップショットを整理する"],"ko":["식별 및 검색을 쉽게 하기 위해 스냅샷 태그 지정 자동화","프로젝트 요구 사항 변경 반영을 위해 기존 스냅샷 태그 업데이트","클라우드 샌드박스 환경 내에서 액세스 및 관리를 간소화하기 위해 태그로 스냅샷 구성"],"es":["Automatizar el etiquetado de instantáneas para una identificación y recuperación más fáciles","Actualizar las etiquetas existentes en las instantáneas para reflejar los cambios en los requisitos del proyecto","Organizar las instantáneas por etiquetas para un acceso y una administración más fluidos dentro del entorno de la caja de arena en la nube"],"fr":["Automatiser le balisage des instantanés pour une identification et une récupération plus faciles","Mettre à jour les balises existantes sur les instantanés pour refléter les changements dans les exigences du projet","Organiser les instantanés par balises pour un accès et une gestion plus fluides au sein de l''environnement de la boîte de sable cloud"],"de":["Automatisieren des Taggens von Snapshots für eine einfachere Identifizierung und Wiederherstellung","Aktualisieren der vorhandenen Tags auf Snapshots, um Änderungen in den Projektanforderungen widerzuspiegeln","Organisieren von Snapshots nach Tags für einen schnelleren Zugriff und eine einfachere Verwaltung innerhalb der Cloud-Sandbox-Umgebung"],"pt":["Automatizar a marcação de snapshots para identificação e recuperação mais fáceis","Atualizar tags existentes em snapshots para refletir alterações nos requisitos do projeto","Organizar snapshots por tags para acesso e gerenciamento simplificados no ambiente de sandbox de nuvem"],"ru":["Автоматизировать тегирование снимков для более простой идентификации и извлечения","Обновлять существующие теги на снимках, чтобы отразить изменения в требованиях проекта","Организовывать снимки по тегам для упрощенного доступа и управления в среде облачного песочница"],"ar":["توفير تلقيمي لتعيين علامات على الصور المتجمعة من أجل تحديد و استرجاع أسهل","تحديث العلامات الحالية على الصور المتجمعة لت phản映 التغييرات في متطلبات المشروع","تنظيم الصور المتجمعة حسب العلامات من أجل وصول و إدارة مبسطين في بيئة رمل السحابة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires prior authentication with `agentuity auth login`","Needs organization context specified via `--org-id` or default org","Limited to adding or updating tags on existing snapshots"],"zh":["需要使用 `agentuity auth login` 进行事前的身份验证","需要通过 `--org-id` 或默认组织指定组织上下文","仅限于在现有的快照上添加或更新标签"],"ja":["事前の認証として `agentuity auth login` を使用する必要がある","組織コンテキストを `--org-id` またはデフォルトの組織で指定する必要がある","既存のスナップショットにタグを追加または更新することのみに限定される"],"ko":["사전 인증으로 `agentuity auth login` 사용 필요","조직 컨텍스트를 `--org-id` 또는 기본 조직으로 지정 필요","기존 스냅샷에 태그를 추가하거나 업데이트하는 것만으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere autenticación previa con `agentuity auth login`","Necesita contexto de organización especificado a través de `--org-id` o configuración de organización predeterminada","Limitado a agregar o actualizar etiquetas en instantáneas existentes"],"fr":["Nécessite une authentification préalable avec `agentuity auth login`","A besoin d''un contexte d''organisation spécifié via `--org-id` ou les paramètres d''organisation par défaut","Limité à l''ajout ou à la mise à jour de balises sur les instantanés existants"],"de":["Benötigt vorherige Authentifizierung mit `agentuity auth login`","Benötigt Organisationskontext, der über `--org-id` oder Standardorganisations-Einstellungen angegeben wird","Begrenzt auf Hinzufügen oder Aktualisieren von Tags auf vorhandenen Snapshots"],"pt":["Requer autenticação prévia com `agentuity auth login`","Necessita de contexto de organização especificado via `--org-id` ou configurações de organização padrão","Limitado a adicionar ou atualizar tags em snapshots existentes"],"ru":["Требует предварительной аутентификации с помощью `agentuity auth login`","Требует указания контекста организации через `--org-id` или настройки организации по умолчанию","Ограничен добавлением или обновлением тегов на существующих снимках"],"ar":["يتطلب تسجيل الدخول المسبق باستخدام `agentuity auth login`","يحتاج إلى تحديد سياق المنظمة عبر `--org-id` أو الإعدادات الافتراضية للمنظمة","محدود بإضافة أو تحديث العلامات على الصور المتجمعة الحالية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('HexAI-inc/v0-futuristic-website-design/browser-extension', 'community', 'HexAI-inc', 'v0-futuristic-website-design', 'HexAI-inc/v0-futuristic-website-design', 'browser-extension', 0, 0, 25, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.422Z', '2026-02-18T04:32:09.299Z', NULL, '{"id":"HexAI-inc/v0-futuristic-website-design/browser-extension","name":"browser-extension","description":{"zh":"浏览器扩展是开发者增强浏览器功能的有力工具，需要考虑设计约束、持久性和安全性等因素","ja":"ブラウザーエクステンションは開発者がブラウザーの機能を強化するための強力なツールであり、デザイン制約、永続性、セキュリティなどの要素を考慮する必要があります","ko":"브라우저 확장은 개발자가 브라우저 기능을 강화하는 강력한 도구이며 디자인 제약, 지속성 및 보안 등의 요소를 고려해야 합니다","es":"Las extensiones de navegador son herramientas poderosas que requieren una cuidadosa consideración de la persistencia y la seguridad","fr":"Les extensions de navigateur sont des outils puissants qui nécessitent une considération soigneuse de la persistance et de la sécurité","de":"Browser-Erweiterungen sind leistungsstarke Werkzeuge, die eine sorgfältige Berücksichtigung von Persistenz und Sicherheit erfordern","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"浏览器扩展开发指南","ja":"ブラウザーエクステンション開発マスター","ko":"브라우저 확장 개발大全","es":"Extensiones de navegador: Guía de desarrollo","fr":"Extensions de navigateur: Le guide de développement","de":"Browser-Erweiterungen: Entwicklungshandbuch","en":"browser-extension"},"description":{"zh":"浏览器扩展是开发者增强浏览器功能的有力工具，需要考虑设计约束、持久性和安全性等因素","ja":"ブラウザーエクステンションは開発者がブラウザーの機能を強化するための強力なツールであり、デザイン制約、永続性、セキュリティなどの要素を考慮する必要があります","ko":"브라우저 확장은 개발자가 브라우저 기능을 강화하는 강력한 도구이며 디자인 제약, 지속성 및 보안 등의 요소를 고려해야 합니다","es":"Las extensiones de navegador son herramientas poderosas que requieren una cuidadosa consideración de la persistencia y la seguridad","fr":"Les extensions de navigateur sont des outils puissants qui nécessitent une considération soigneuse de la persistance et de la sécurité","de":"Browser-Erweiterungen sind leistungsstarke Werkzeuge, die eine sorgfältige Berücksichtigung von Persistenz und Sicherheit erfordern","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["设计约束","持久性","安全性","Manifest V3 服务工作器","前端设计"],"ja":["デザイン制約","永続性","セキュリティ","Manifest V3 サービスワーカー","フロントエンドデザイン"],"ko":["디자인 제약","지속성","보안","Manifest V3 서비스 워커","프론트엔드 디자인"],"es":["Diseño de UI/UX personalizable","Persistencia de datos segura","Compatibilidad con Manifest V3","Seguridad reforzada","Flexibilidad en la implementación"],"fr":["Conception de UI/UX personnalisable","Persistance de données sécurisée","Compatibilité avec Manifest V3","Sécurité renforcée","Flexibilité dans la mise en œuvre"],"de":["Benutzerdefinierte UI/UX-Designs","Sichere Datenpersistenz","Kompatibilität mit Manifest V3","Erhöhte Sicherheit","Flexibilität bei der Implementierung"]},"keywords":{"zh":["浏览器扩展开发","Manifest V3","服务工作器","持久性","安全性","前端设计","浏览器插件"],"ja":["ブラウザーエクステンション開発","Manifest V3","サービスワーカー","永続性","セキュリティ","フロントエンドデザイン","ブラウザープラグイン"],"ko":["브라우저 확장 개발","Manifest V3","서비스 워커","지속성","보안","프론트엔드 디자인","브라우저 플러그인"],"es":["desarrollo de extensiones de navegador","extensiones de navegador seguras","persistencia de datos en extensiones de navegador","Manifest V3","diseño de UI/UX para extensiones de navegador","seguridad en extensiones de navegador"],"fr":["développement d''extensions de navigateur","extensions de navigateur sécurisées","persistance de données dans les extensions de navigateur","Manifest V3","conception de UI/UX pour les extensions de navigateur","sécurité dans les extensions de navigateur"],"de":["Entwicklung von Browser-Erweiterungen","sichere Browser-Erweiterungen","Datenpersistenz in Browser-Erweiterungen","Manifest V3","UI/UX-Design für Browser-Erweiterungen","Sicherheit in Browser-Erweiterungen"]}},"owner":"HexAI-inc","repo":"v0-futuristic-website-design","repoPath":"HexAI-inc/v0-futuristic-website-design","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.422Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"browser-extension","description":"Master specialized skill for building 2025/2026-grade browser extensions. Deep expertise in Manifest v3, Service Worker persistence (Alarms, Offscreen API), Side Panel API, and Cross-Browser compatibility.","bodyPreview":"<domain_overview>\n# 🌐 BROWSER EXTENSION: THE 2026 MASTERCLASS\n> **Philosophy:** Extensions are ephemeral, restricted, yet powerful. Persistence is an Art. Security is a Mandate. \n> **Design Constraint:** For UI/UX, Aesthetics, and Layout, YOU MUST REFER TO THE `frontend-design` SKILL.\n**PERSISTENCE PARADOX GUARD (CRITICAL):** Never rely on global variables or in-memory state in background scripts. AI-generated code frequently fails by assuming Manifest V3 service workers are persistent. They ar","body":"<domain_overview>\n# 🌐 BROWSER EXTENSION: THE 2026 MASTERCLASS\n> **Philosophy:** Extensions are ephemeral, restricted, yet powerful. Persistence is an Art. Security is a Mandate. \n> **Design Constraint:** For UI/UX, Aesthetics, and Layout, YOU MUST REFER TO THE `frontend-design` SKILL.\n**PERSISTENCE PARADOX GUARD (CRITICAL):** Never rely on global variables or in-memory state in background scripts. AI-generated code frequently fails by assuming Manifest V3 service workers are persistent. They are NOT; they terminate after 30 seconds of inactivity. You MUST backup every piece of state to `chrome.storage` or `IndexedDB` immediately upon change. This skill aims to eliminate \"volatile-state\" bugs typical of generic AI implementations. If data is not in durable storage, it does not exist.\n</domain_overview>\n<manifest_architecture>\n## 🏗️ PROTOCOL 1: THE MANIFEST V3 CONSTITUTION\nAll extensions must be built on Manifest v3. No exceptions.\n1. **Manifest Blueprint:**\n    *   **Service Workers:** No persistent background pages. Use `\"background\": { \"service_worker\": \"background.js\" }`.\n    *   **No Remote Code:** All scripts must be local. `unsafe-eval` is forbidden.\n    *   **Permissions:** Principle of Least Privilege. Use `optional_permissions` where possible.\n    *   **Action UI:** Prefer `action` over `browser_action` or `page_action`.\n2. **Side Panel Supremacy:**\n    *   Requirement: Use `chrome.sidePanel` for persistent, non-intrusive experiences.\n    *   API: `chrome.sidePanel.setOptions({ path: ''sidepanel.html'', enabled: true })`.\n</manifest_architecture>\n<persistence_engine>\n## ⚡ PROTOCOL 2: THE PERSISTENCE ENGINE (ANTI-TERMINATION)\nService Workers sleep. You must keep the logic alive.\n1. **The Alarm Pulse:**\n    *   Use `chrome.alarms` to wake up the Service Worker every 1-5 minutes for background sync.\n2. **The Offscreen Document (When needed):**\n    *   Use the `offscreen` API for tasks like DOM parsing, heavy calculations, or keeping the SW alive via periodic messaging.\n3. **State Management Protocol:**\n    *   **NEVER** rely on global variables.\n    *   **Mandatory:** Use `chrome.storage.session` for transient session-only secrets.\n    *   **Mandatory:** Use `IndexedDB` or `chrome.storage.local` for large datasets and persistent user data.\n</persistence_engine>\n<security_fortress>\n## 🔐 PROTOCOL 3: THE SECURITY FORTRESS\n1. **Context Bridge Safety:**\n    *   Content Scripts are \"Hostile Territory\". Always sanitize data passed to the Service Worker via `chrome.runtime.sendMessage`.\n2. **Declarative Net Request:**\n    *   Use `declarativeNetRequest` for blocking/modifying headers. Only use `webRequest` as a fallback for Firefox if dynamic rules are critical.\n</security_fortress>\n<design_integration>\n## 🎨 PROTOCOL 4: DESIGN & UI/UX (INTEGRATED)\n> **Direct Instruction:** You are an extension developer, not a designer. You must outsource the \"Soul\" of the UI.\n1. **UI Execution:**\n    *   Popup/SidePanel: Follow the **8-Point Grid** and **Glassmorphism** rules from `frontend-design`.\n    *   Component Atomization: Use Atomic Design 2.0 principles.\n    *   Friction: Ensure the popup interaction is < 400ms (Doherty Threshold).\n</design_integration>\n<audit_and_reference>\n## 🛠️ PROTOCOL 5: SCRIPT ENFORCEMENT (THE SENTINEL)\nEvery extension build MUST pass the high-tier audit suite.\n1. **[manifest-auditor.js](skills/browser-extension/scripts/js/manifest-auditor.js):**\n    *   **Rule:** MV3 compliance and CSP safety. No broad permissions.\n2. **[persistence-check.js](skills/browser-extension/scripts/js/persistence-check.js):**\n    *   **Rule:** Service Worker \"Heartbeat\" verification and State integrity.\n3. **[asset-master.js](skills/browser-extension/scripts/js/asset-master.js):**\n    *   **Rule:** Icon dimensional audit and asset optimization.\n---\n## 📂 COGNITIVE AUDIT CYCLE\n1. Run `node scripts/js/manifest-auditor.js` -> Clean?\n2. Run `node scripts/js/persistence-check.js` -> Heartbeat detected?\n3. Run `node scripts/js/asset-master.js` -> Assets optimized?\n4. **MANDATORY:** Run `playwright test` -> All paths pass?\n5. Is it Manifest v3 compliant?\n6. Does the Service Worker handle termination gracefully (State stored)?\n7. Are permissions minimized?\n8. Is the UI justified by a \"Narrative-First\" screenplay from `frontend-design`?\n> **Link:** [frontend-design](skills/frontend-design/SKILL.md) \n</audit_and_reference>\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:32:09.299Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing to create ephemeral yet powerful browser extensions with persistence and security in mind.","zh":"非常适合需要创建临时但功能强大的浏览器扩展，并考虑持久性和安全性的前端代理。","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントが一時的なものでありながら強力なブラウザ拡張機能を作成する必要があり、持続性とセキュリティを念頭に置く場合に最適です。","ko":"프론트엔드 에이전트가 일시적이지만 강력한 브라우저 확장 기능을 만들 필요가 있고, 지속성과 보안을 고려해야 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Frontend que necesitan crear extensiones de navegador efímeras pero potentes con persistencia y seguridad en mente.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin de créer des extensions de navigateur éphémères mais puissantes avec une persistance et une sécurité en tête.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die flüchtige, aber leistungsstarke Browser-Erweiterungen mit Persistenz und Sicherheit im Hinterkopf erstellen müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam criar extensões de navegador efêmeras, mas poderosas, com persistência e segurança em mente.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходимо создавать временные, но мощные браузерные расширения с учетом сохранности и безопасности.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذي يحتاج إلى إنشاء ملحقات متصفح مؤقتة ولكن قوية مع مراعاة الاستمرارية والأمان في الاعتبار."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to develop browser extensions with Manifest V3 service workers, ensuring persistence through careful state management and adherence to security mandates, while leveraging UI/UX design constraints from the `frontend-design` skill.","zh":"赋予代理开发人员使用Manifest V3服务工作者创建浏览器扩展的能力，通过仔细的状态管理和对安全性要求的遵守来确保持久性，同时利用来自`frontend-design`技能的UI/UX设计约束。","ja":"エージェントがManifest V3サービスワーカーを使用してブラウザ拡張機能を開発できるようにし、慎重な状態管理とセキュリティ要件の遵守を通じて持続性を保証し、同時に`frontend-design`スキルからのUI/UX設計の制約を利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 Manifest V3 서비스 워커를 사용하여 브라우저 확장 기능을 개발할 수 있도록 하며, 신중한 상태 관리와 보안 요구사항 준수를 통해 지속성을 보장하고, `frontend-design` 스킬로부터의 UI/UX 디자인 제약을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a desarrollar extensiones de navegador con trabajadores de servicio de Manifest V3, garantizando la persistencia a través de una gestión de estado cuidadosa y el cumplimiento de los mandatos de seguridad, al mismo tiempo que aprovecha las restricciones de diseño de UI/UX del skill `frontend-design`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de développer des extensions de navigateur avec des travailleurs de service Manifest V3, en garantissant la persistance grâce à une gestion d''état soigneuse et au respect des exigences de sécurité, tout en exploitant les contraintes de conception UI/UX de la compétence `frontend-design`.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Browser-Erweiterungen mit Manifest V3-Service-Workern zu entwickeln, wodurch die Persistenz durch sorgfältige Zustandsverwaltung und Einhaltung der Sicherheitsvorschriften gewährleistet wird, während die UI/UX-Design-Einschränkungen des `frontend-design`-Skills genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a desenvolver extensões de navegador com service workers do Manifest V3, garantindo a persistência por meio de uma gestão cuidadosa do estado e aderência aos mandatos de segurança, ao mesmo tempo em que aproveita as restrições de design de UI/UX do skill `frontend-design`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью разработки браузерных расширений с помощью service workers Manifest V3, обеспечивая сохранность посредством тщательного управления состоянием и соблюдения требований безопасности, а также используя ограничения по дизайну UI/UX из навыка `frontend-design`.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تطوير ملحقات متصفح مع عمال الخدمة من مаниفست V3، مما يضمن الاستمرارية من خلال إدارة دقيقة للحالة والامتثال لمراسيم الأمان، وفي الوقت نفسه الاستفادة من قيود تصميم واجهة المستخدم والتجربة من مهارة `frontend-design`."},"useCases":{"en":["Developing extensions with restricted yet powerful capabilities","Implementing persistence paradox guards in background scripts","Designing secure and aesthetic browser extensions"],"zh":["开发具有限制但强大的功能的扩展","在后台脚本中实现持久性悖论防护","设计安全且美观的浏览器扩展"],"ja":["制限されたが強力な機能を持つ拡張機能を開発する","バックグラウンドスクリプトで永続性のパラドックスガードを実装する","セキュアで美しいブラウザ拡張機能を設計する"],"ko":["제한적이지만 강력한 기능을 가진 확장 기능을 개발하는 것","백그라운드 스크립트에서 지속성 역설 가드를 구현하는 것","보안 및 미학적인 브라우저 확장 기능을 설계하는 것"],"es":["Desarrollar extensiones con capacidades restringidas pero potentes","Implementar guardias de paradoja de persistencia en scripts de fondo","Diseñar extensiones de navegador seguras y estéticas"],"fr":["Développer des extensions avec des capacités restreintes mais puissantes","Mettre en œuvre des gardes de paradoxe de persistance dans les scripts de fond","Concevoir des extensions de navigateur sécurisées et esthétiques"],"de":["Erweiterungen mit eingeschränkten, aber leistungsstarken Fähigkeiten entwickeln","Widerspruchswächter für die Persistenz in Hintergrundskripten implementieren","Sichere und ästhetische Browser-Erweiterungen entwerfen"],"pt":["Desenvolver extensões com capacidades restritas, mas poderosas","Implementar guardiões de paradoxo de persistência em scripts de fundo","Projetar extensões de navegador seguras e esteticamente agradáveis"],"ru":["Разработка расширений с ограниченными, но мощными возможностями","Реализация стражей парадокса сохранности в фоновых скриптах","Проектирование безопасных и эстетически привлекательных браузерных расширений"],"ar":["تطوير ملحقات معقدرات مقيدة ولكن قوية","تنفيذ حماة تناقض الاستمرارية في سكريبتات الخلفية","تصميم ملحقات متصفح آمنة وجمالية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Must avoid global variables and in-memory state in background scripts","Requires adherence to Manifest V3 service worker constraints","UI/UX design must refer to the `frontend-design` skill"],"zh":["必须避免在后台脚本中使用全局变量和内存状态","需要遵守Manifest V3服务工作者的约束","UI/UX设计必须参考`frontend-design`技能"],"ja":["バックグラウンドスクリプトでグローバル変数とメモリ状態を使用しないこと","Manifest V3サービスワーカーの制約に従うこと","UI/UX設計は`frontend-design`スキルを参照すること"],"ko":["백그라운드 스크립트에서 전역 변수와 메모리 상태를 사용하지 말아야 한다","Manifest V3 서비스 워커의 제약을 준수해야 한다","UI/UX 디자인은 `frontend-design` 스킬을 참조해야 한다"],"es":["Deben evitar variables globales y estado en memoria en scripts de fondo","Requiere el cumplimiento de las restricciones de los trabajadores de servicio de Manifest V3","El diseño de UI/UX debe referirse al skill `frontend-design`"],"fr":["Doivent éviter les variables globales et l''état en mémoire dans les scripts de fond","Nécessite le respect des contraintes des travailleurs de service Manifest V3","La conception UI/UX doit se référer à la compétence `frontend-design`"],"de":["Müssen globale Variablen und Zustand im Speicher in Hintergrundskripten vermeiden","Erfordert die Einhaltung der Einschränkungen der Manifest V3-Service-Worker","Das UI/UX-Design muss auf den `frontend-design`-Skill verweisen"],"pt":["Deve evitar variáveis globais e estado na memória em scripts de fundo","Exige aderência às restrições de service workers do Manifest V3","O design de UI/UX deve referenciar a habilidade `frontend-design`"],"ru":["Необходимо избегать глобальных переменных и состояния в памяти в фоновых скриптах","Требуется соблюдение ограничений service workers Manifest V3","Дизайн UI/UX должен ссылаться на навык `frontend-design`"],"ar":["يجب تجنب المتغيرات العالمية وحالة الذاكرة في سكريبتات الخلفية","يتطلب الامتثال لقيود عمال الخدمة مانيفست V3","يجب أن يشير تصميم واجهة المستخدم إلى مهارة `frontend-design`"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":25}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('dvm-bitspilani/Signing-Portal/shadcn-ui', 'community', 'dvm-bitspilani', 'Signing-Portal', 'dvm-bitspilani/Signing-Portal', 'shadcn-ui', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.422Z', '2026-02-18T04:32:48.831Z', NULL, '{"id":"dvm-bitspilani/Signing-Portal/shadcn-ui","name":"shadcn-ui","description":{"zh":"shadcn-ui Radix UI Tailwind CSS","ja":"shadcn-ui Radix UI Tailwind CSS","ko":"shadcn-ui Radix UI Tailwind CSS","es":"Guía experta para crear componentes UI accesibles y personalizables con shadcn-ui, Radix UI y Tailwind CSS","fr":"Guide expert pour créer des composants UI accessibles et personnalisables avec shadcn-ui, Radix UI et Tailwind CSS","de":"Experten-Anleitung für die Erstellung zugänglicher und anpassbarer UI-Komponenten mit shadcn-ui, Radix UI und Tailwind CSS","pt":"O shadcn-ui é uma biblioteca de componentes UI que permite criar interfaces personalizáveis e acessíveis. Aprenda a usá-la com nosso guia.","ru":"Shadcn-ui — это библиотека компонентов UI, которая позволяет создавать настраиваемые и доступные интерфейсы. Узнайте, как ее использовать, с нашей помощью.","ar":"shadcn-ui هو مكتبة من مكونات واجهة المستخدم التي تسمح بإنشاء واجهات مستخدم قابلة للتعديل والوصول. تعلم كيفية استخدامها مع دليلنا.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"shadcn-ui ","ja":"shadcn-ui","ko":"shadcn-ui","es":"Guía de componentes UI de shadcn-ui","fr":"Guide de composants UI shadcn-ui","de":"shadcn-ui Komponenten-Anleitung","pt":"Guia de Componentes UI shadcn-ui para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Руководство по компонентам UI shadcn-ui для разработчиков","ar":"دليل مكونات واجهة المستخدم shadcn-ui للمطورين","en":"shadcn-ui"},"description":{"zh":"shadcn-ui Radix UI Tailwind CSS","ja":"shadcn-ui Radix UI Tailwind CSS","ko":"shadcn-ui Radix UI Tailwind CSS","es":"Guía experta para crear componentes UI accesibles y personalizables con shadcn-ui, Radix UI y Tailwind CSS","fr":"Guide expert pour créer des composants UI accessibles et personnalisables avec shadcn-ui, Radix UI et Tailwind CSS","de":"Experten-Anleitung für die Erstellung zugänglicher und anpassbarer UI-Komponenten mit shadcn-ui, Radix UI und Tailwind CSS","pt":"O shadcn-ui é uma biblioteca de componentes UI que permite criar interfaces personalizáveis e acessíveis. Aprenda a usá-la com nosso guia.","ru":"Shadcn-ui — это библиотека компонентов UI, которая позволяет создавать настраиваемые и доступные интерфейсы. Узнайте, как ее использовать, с нашей помощью.","ar":"shadcn-ui هو مكتبة من مكونات واجهة المستخدم التي تسمح بإنشاء واجهات مستخدم قابلة للتعديل والوصول. تعلم كيفية استخدامها مع دليلنا.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["shadcn-ui","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","UI","UI","UI"],"ja":["shadcn-ui","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","UI","UI","UI"],"ko":["shadcn-ui","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","UI","UI","UI"],"es":["Componentes UI accesibles","Personalización con Tailwind CSS","Integración con Radix UI","Botones y campos de formulario personalizables","Formularios con validación"],"fr":["Composants UI accessibles","Personnalisation avec Tailwind CSS","Intégration avec Radix UI","Boutons et champs de formulaire personnalisables","Formulaires avec validation"],"de":["Zugängliche UI-Komponenten","Anpassung mit Tailwind CSS","Integration mit Radix UI","Anpassbare Schaltflächen und Formularfelder","Formulare mit Validierung"],"pt":["Criação de componentes UI personalizáveis","Compatibilidade com Radix UI e Tailwind CSS","Acessibilidade e usabilidade","Instalação e configuração fáceis","Documentação completa e guias de início rápido"],"ru":["Создание настраиваемых компонентов UI","Совместимость с Radix UI и Tailwind CSS","Доступность и удобство использования","Легкая установка и конфигурация","Полная документация и руководства по быстрому началу"],"ar":["إنشاء مكونات واجهة المستخدم المخصصة","التوافق مع Radix UI و Tailwind CSS","الوصول والاستخدام","التثبيت والتهيئة السهلة","توثيق كامل ودلائل لبدء سريع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["shadcn-ui","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","UI","UI","UI","shadcn-ui","UI"],"ja":["shadcn-ui","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","UI","UI","UI","shadcn-ui","UI"],"ko":["shadcn-ui","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","UI","UI","UI","shadcn-ui","UI"],"es":["shadcn-ui","componentes UI","accesibilidad","personalización","Tailwind CSS","Radix UI","desarrollo web"],"fr":["shadcn-ui","composants UI","accessibilité","personnalisation","Tailwind CSS","Radix UI","développement web"],"de":["shadcn-ui","UI-Komponenten","Zugänglichkeit","Anpassung","Tailwind CSS","Radix UI","Webentwicklung"],"pt":["shadcn-ui","componentes UI","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","acessibilidade","usabilidade","desenvolvimento web","bibliotecas de componentes"],"ru":["shadcn-ui","компоненты UI","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","доступность","удобство использования","веб-разработка","библиотеки компонентов"],"ar":["shadcn-ui","مكونات واجهة المستخدم","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","الوصول","الاستخدام","تطوير الويب","مكتبات المكونات"]}},"owner":"dvm-bitspilani","repo":"Signing-Portal","repoPath":"dvm-bitspilani/Signing-Portal","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.422Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"shadcn-ui","description":"Complete shadcn/ui component library guide including installation, configuration, and implementation of accessible React components. Use when setting up shadcn/ui, installing components, building forms with React Hook Form and Zod, customizing themes with Tailwind CSS, or implementing UI patterns like buttons, dialogs, dropdowns, tables, and complex form layouts.","bodyPreview":"# shadcn/ui Component Patterns\n\nExpert guide for building accessible, customizable UI components with shadcn/ui, Radix UI, and Tailwind CSS.\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n- [When to Use](#when-to-use)\n- [Quick Start](#quick-start)\n- [Installation & Setup](#installation--setup)\n- [Project Configuration](#project-configuration)\n- [Core Components](#core-components)\n  - [Button](#button-component)\n  - [Input & Form Fields](#input--form-fields)\n  - [Forms with Validation](#forms-with-validation)\n  - [Card]","body":"# shadcn/ui Component Patterns\n\nExpert guide for building accessible, customizable UI components with shadcn/ui, Radix UI, and Tailwind CSS.\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n- [When to Use](#when-to-use)\n- [Quick Start](#quick-start)\n- [Installation & Setup](#installation--setup)\n- [Project Configuration](#project-configuration)\n- [Core Components](#core-components)\n  - [Button](#button-component)\n  - [Input & Form Fields](#input--form-fields)\n  - [Forms with Validation](#forms-with-validation)\n  - [Card](#card-component)\n  - [Dialog (Modal)](#dialog-modal-component)\n  - [Select (Dropdown)](#select-dropdown-component)\n  - [Sheet (Slide-over)](#sheet-slide-over-component)\n  - [Menubar & Navigation](#menubar--navigation)\n  - [Table](#table-component)\n  - [Toast Notifications](#toast-notifications)\n- [Advanced Patterns](#advanced-patterns)\n- [Customization](#customization)\n- [Next.js Integration](#nextjs-integration)\n- [Best Practices](#best-practices)\n- [Common Component Combinations](#common-component-combinations)\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Setting up a new project with shadcn/ui\n- Installing or configuring individual components\n- Building forms with React Hook Form and Zod validation\n- Creating accessible UI components (buttons, dialogs, dropdowns, sheets)\n- Customizing component styling with Tailwind CSS\n- Implementing design systems with shadcn/ui\n- Building Next.js applications with TypeScript\n- Creating complex layouts and data displays\n\n## Quick Start\n\nFor new projects, use the automated setup:\n\n```bash\n# Create Next.js project with shadcn/ui\nnpx create-next-app@latest my-app --typescript --tailwind --eslint --app\ncd my-app\nnpx shadcn@latest init\n\n# Install essential components\nnpx shadcn@latest add button input form card dialog select\n```\n\nFor existing projects:\n\n```bash\n# Install dependencies\nnpm install tailwindcss-animate class-variance-authority clsx tailwind-merge lucide-react\n\n# Initialize shadcn/ui\nnpx shadcn@latest init\n```\n\n## What is shadcn/ui?\n\nshadcn/ui is **not** a traditional component library or npm package. Instead:\n\n- It''s a **collection of reusable components** that you can copy into your project\n- Components are **yours to customize** - you own the code\n- Built with **Radix UI** primitives for accessibility\n- Styled with **Tailwind CSS** utilities\n- Includes CLI tool for easy component installation\n\n## Installation & Setup\n\n### Initial Setup\n\n```bash\n# Initialize shadcn/ui in your project\nnpx shadcn@latest init\n```\n\nDuring setup, you''ll configure:\n- TypeScript or JavaScript\n- Style (Default, New York, etc.)\n- Base color theme\n- CSS variables or Tailwind CSS classes\n- Component installation path\n\n### Installing Individual Components\n\n```bash\n# Install a single component\nnpx shadcn@latest add button\n\n# Install multiple components\nnpx shadcn@latest add button input form\n\n# Install all components\nnpx shadcn@latest add --all\n```\n\n### Manual Installation\n\nIf you prefer manual setup:\n\n```bash\n# Install dependencies for a specific component\nnpm install @radix-ui/react-slot\n\n# Copy component code from ui.shadcn.com\n# Place in src/components/ui/\n```\n\n## Project Configuration\n\n### Required Dependencies\n\n```json\n{\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"@radix-ui/react-accordion\": \"^1.1.2\",\n    \"@radix-ui/react-alert-dialog\": \"^1.0.5\",\n    \"@radix-ui/react-dialog\": \"^1.0.5\",\n    \"@radix-ui/react-dropdown-menu\": \"^2.0.6\",\n    \"@radix-ui/react-label\": \"^2.0.2\",\n    \"@radix-ui/react-select\": \"^2.0.0\",\n    \"@radix-ui/react-separator\": \"^1.0.3\",\n    \"@radix-ui/react-slot\": \"^1.0.2\",\n    \"@radix-ui/react-toast\": \"^1.1.5\",\n    \"class-variance-authority\": \"^0.7.0\",\n    \"clsx\": \"^2.0.0\",\n    \"lucide-react\": \"^0.294.0\",\n    \"tailwind-merge\": \"^2.0.0\",\n    \"tailwindcss-animate\": \"^1.0.7\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### TSConfig Configuration\n\n```json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"target\": \"es5\",\n    \"lib\": [\"dom\", \"dom.iterable\", \"es6\"],\n    \"allowJs\": true,\n    \"skipLibCheck\": true,\n    \"strict\": true,\n    \"forceConsistentCasingInFileNames\": true,\n    \"noEmit\": true,\n    \"esModuleInterop\": true,\n    \"module\": \"esnext\",\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"node\",\n    \"resolveJsonModule\": true,\n    \"isolatedModules\": true,\n    \"jsx\": \"preserve\",\n    \"incremental\": true,\n    \"plugins\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"next\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"baseUrl\": \".\",\n    \"paths\": {\n      \"@/components/*\": [\"./src/components/*\"],\n      \"@/lib/*\": [\"./src/lib/*\"]\n    }\n  },\n  \"include\": [\"next-env.d.ts\", \"**/*.ts\", \"**/*.tsx\", \".next/types/**/*.ts\"],\n  \"exclude\": [\"node_modules\"]\n}\n```\n\n### Tailwind Configuration\n\n```js\n// tailwind.config.js\n/** @type {import(''tailwindcss'').Config} */\nmodule.exports = {\n  darkMode: [\"class\"],\n  content: [\n    ''./pages/**/*.{ts,tsx}'',\n    ''./components/**/*.{ts,tsx}'',\n    ''./app/**/*.{ts,tsx}'',\n    ''./src/**/*.{ts,tsx}'',\n  ],\n  prefix: \"\",\n  theme: {\n    container: {\n      center: true,\n      padding: \"2rem\",\n      screens: {\n        \"2xl\": \"1400px\",\n      },\n    },\n    extend: {\n      colors: {\n        border: \"hsl(var(--border))\",\n        input: \"hsl(var(--input))\",\n        ring: \"hsl(var(--ring))\",\n        background: \"hsl(var(--background))\",\n        foreground: \"hsl(var(--foreground))\",\n        primary: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--primary))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--primary-foreground))\",\n        },\n        secondary: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--secondary))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--secondary-foreground))\",\n        },\n        destructive: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--destructive))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--destructive-foreground))\",\n        },\n        muted: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--muted))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--muted-foreground))\",\n        },\n        accent: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--accent))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--accent-foreground))\",\n        },\n        popover: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--popover))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--popover-foreground))\",\n        },\n        card: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--card))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--card-foreground))\",\n        },\n      },\n      borderRadius: {\n        lg: \"var(--radius)\",\n        md: \"calc(var(--radius) - 2px)\",\n        sm: \"calc(var(--radius) - 4px)\",\n      },\n      keyframes: {\n        \"accordion-down\": {\n          from: { height: \"0\" },\n          to: { height: \"var(--radix-accordion-content-height)\" },\n        },\n        \"accordion-up\": {\n          from: { height: \"var(--radix-accordion-content-height)\" },\n          to: { height: \"0\" },\n        },\n      },\n      animation: {\n        \"accordion-down\": \"accordion-down 0.2s ease-out\",\n        \"accordion-up\": \"accordion-up 0.2s ease-out\",\n      },\n    },\n  },\n  plugins: [require(\"tailwindcss-animate\")],\n}\n```\n\n### CSS Variables (globals.css)\n\n```css\n@tailwind base;\n@tailwind components;\n@tailwind utilities;\n\n@layer base {\n  :root {\n    --background: 0 0% 100%;\n    --foreground: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --card: 0 0% 100%;\n    --card-foreground: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --popover: 0 0% 100%;\n    --popover-foreground: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --primary: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --primary-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --secondary: 210 40% 96.1%;\n    --secondary-foreground: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --muted: 210 40% 96.1%;\n    --muted-foreground: 215.4 16.3% 46.9%;\n    --accent: 210 40% 96.1%;\n    --accent-foreground: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --destructive: 0 84.2% 60.2%;\n    --destructive-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --border: 214.3 31.8% 91.4%;\n    --input: 214.3 31.8% 91.4%;\n    --ring: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --radius: 0.5rem;\n  }\n\n  .dark {\n    --background: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --card: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --card-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --popover: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --popover-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --primary: 210 40% 98%;\n    --primary-foreground: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --secondary: 217.2 32.6% 17.5%;\n    --secondary-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --muted: 217.2 32.6% 17.5%;\n    --muted-foreground: 215 20.2% 65.1%;\n    --accent: 217.2 32.6% 17.5%;\n    --accent-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --destructive: 0 62.8% 30.6%;\n    --destructive-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --border: 217.2 32.6% 17.5%;\n    --input: 217.2 32.6% 17.5%;\n    --ring: 212.7 26.8% 83.9%;\n  }\n}\n\n@layer base {\n  * {\n    @apply border-border;\n  }\n  body {\n    @apply bg-background text-foreground;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Core Components\n\n### Button Component\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add button\n```\n\nBasic usage:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\";\n\nexport function ButtonDemo() {\n  return <Button>Click me</Button>;\n}\n```\n\nButton variants:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\";\n\nexport function ButtonVariants() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"flex gap-4\">\n      <Button variant=\"default\">Default</Button>\n      <Button variant=\"destructive\">Destructive</Button>\n      <Button variant=\"outline\">Outline</Button>\n      <Button variant=\"secondary\">Secondary</Button>\n      <Button variant=\"ghost\">Ghost</Button>\n      <Button variant=\"link\">Link</Button>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\nButton sizes:\n\n```tsx\n<div className=\"flex gap-4 items-center\">\n  <Button size=\"default\">Default</Button>\n  <Button size=\"sm\">Small</Button>\n  <Button size=\"lg\">Large</Button>\n  <Button size=\"icon\">\n    <Icon className=\"h-4 w-4\" />\n  </Button>\n</div>\n```\n\nWith loading state:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\";\nimport { Loader2 } from \"lucide-react\";\n\nexport function ButtonLoading() {\n  return (\n    <Button disabled>\n      <Loader2 className=\"mr-2 h-4 w-4 animate-spin\" />\n      Please wait\n    </Button>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Input & Form Fields\n\n#### Input Component\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add input\n```\n\nBasic input:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Input } from \"@/components/ui/input\";\n\nexport function InputDemo() {\n  return <Input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Email\" />;\n}\n```\n\nInput with label:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Input } from \"@/components/ui/input\";\nimport { Label } from \"@/components/ui/label\";\n\nexport function InputWithLabel() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"grid w-full max-w-sm items-center gap-1.5\">\n      <Label htmlFor=\"email\">Email</Label>\n      <Input type=\"email\" id=\"email\" placeholder=\"Email\" />\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\nInput with button:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\";\nimport { Input } from \"@/components/ui/input\";\n\nexport function InputWithButton() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"flex w-full max-w-sm items-center gap-2\">\n      <Input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Email\" />\n      <Button type=\"submit\" variant=\"outline\">Subscribe</Button>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Forms with Validation\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add form\n```\n\nThis installs React Hook Form, Zod, and form components.\n\nComplete form example:\n\n```tsx\n\"use client\"\n\nimport { zodResolver } from \"@hookform/resolvers/zod\"\nimport { useForm } from \"react-hook-form\"\nimport * as z from \"zod\"\n\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport {\n  Form,\n  FormControl,\n  FormDescription,\n  FormField,\n  FormItem,\n  FormLabel,\n  FormMessage,\n} from \"@/components/ui/form\"\nimport { Input } from \"@/components/ui/input\"\nimport { toast } from \"@/components/ui/use-toast\"\n\nconst formSchema = z.object({\n  username: z.string().min(2, {\n    message: \"Username must be at least 2 characters.\",\n  }),\n  email: z.string().email({\n    message: \"Please enter a valid email address.\",\n  }),\n})\n\nexport function ProfileForm() {\n  const form = useForm<z.infer<typeof formSchema>>({\n    resolver: zodResolver(formSchema),\n    defaultValues: {\n      username: \"\",\n      email: \"\",\n    },\n  })\n\n  function onSubmit(values: z.infer<typeof formSchema>) {\n    toast({\n      title: \"You submitted the following values:\",\n      description: (\n        <pre className=\"mt-2 w-[340px] rounded-md bg-slate-950 p-4\">\n          <code className=\"text-white\">{JSON.stringify(values, null, 2)}</code>\n        </pre>\n      ),\n    })\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <Form {...form}>\n      <form onSubmit={form.handleSubmit(onSubmit)} className=\"space-y-8\">\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"username\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Username</FormLabel>\n              <FormControl>\n                <Input placeholder=\"shadcn\" {...field} />\n              </FormControl>\n              <FormDescription>\n                This is your public display name.\n              </FormDescription>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n        \n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"email\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Email</FormLabel>\n              <FormControl>\n                <Input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\" {...field} />\n              </FormControl>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n        \n        <Button type=\"submit\">Submit</Button>\n      </form>\n    </Form>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Card Component\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add card\n```\n\nBasic card:\n\n```tsx\nimport {\n  Card,\n  CardContent,\n  CardDescription,\n  CardFooter,\n  CardHeader,\n  CardTitle,\n} from \"@/components/ui/card\"\n\nexport function CardDemo() {\n  return (\n    <Card>\n      <CardHeader>\n        <CardTitle>Card Title</CardTitle>\n        <CardDescription>Card Description</CardDescription>\n      </CardHeader>\n      <CardContent>\n        <p>Card Content</p>\n      </CardContent>\n      <CardFooter>\n        <p>Card Footer</p>\n      </CardFooter>\n    </Card>\n  )\n}\n```\n\nCard with form:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport {\n  Card,\n  CardContent,\n  CardDescription,\n  CardFooter,\n  CardHeader,\n  CardTitle,\n} from \"@/components/ui/card\"\nimport { Input } from \"@/components/ui/input\"\nimport { Label } from \"@/components/ui/label\"\n\nexport function CardWithForm() {\n  return (\n    <Card className=\"w-[350px]\">\n      <CardHeader>\n        <CardTitle>Create project</CardTitle>\n        <CardDescription>Deploy your new project in one-click.</CardDescription>\n      </CardHeader>\n      <CardContent>\n        <form>\n          <div className=\"grid w-full items-center gap-4\">\n            <div className=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5\">\n              <Label htmlFor=\"name\">Name</Label>\n              <Input id=\"name\" placeholder=\"Name of your project\" />\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </form>\n      </CardContent>\n      <CardFooter className=\"flex justify-between\">\n        <Button variant=\"outline\">Cancel</Button>\n        <Button>Deploy</Button>\n      </CardFooter>\n    </Card>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Dialog (Modal) Component\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add dialog\n```\n\nBasic dialog:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport {\n  Dialog,\n  DialogContent,\n  DialogDescription,\n  DialogFooter,\n  DialogHeader,\n  DialogTitle,\n  DialogTrigger,\n} from \"@/components/ui/dialog\"\n\nexport function DialogDemo() {\n  return (\n    <Dialog>\n      <DialogTrigger asChild>\n        <Button variant=\"outline\">Open Dialog</Button>\n      </DialogTrigger>\n      <DialogContent className=\"sm:max-w-[425px]\">\n        <DialogHeader>\n          <DialogTitle>Edit profile</DialogTitle>\n          <DialogDescription>\n            Make changes to your profile here. Click save when you''re done.\n          </DialogDescription>\n        </DialogHeader>\n        <div className=\"grid gap-4 py-4\">\n          <div className=\"grid grid-cols-4 items-center gap-4\">\n            <Label htmlFor=\"name\" className=\"text-right\">\n              Name\n            </Label>\n            <Input id=\"name\" value=\"Pedro Duarte\" className=\"col-span-3\" />\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <DialogFooter>\n          <Button type=\"submit\">Save changes</Button>\n        </DialogFooter>\n      </DialogContent>\n    </Dialog>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Sheet (Slide-over) Component\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add sheet\n```\n\nBasic sheet:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport {\n  Sheet,\n  SheetContent,\n  SheetDescription,\n  SheetHeader,\n  SheetTitle,\n  SheetTrigger,\n} from \"@/components/ui/sheet\"\n\nexport function SheetDemo() {\n  return (\n    <Sheet>\n      <SheetTrigger asChild>\n        <Button variant=\"outline\">Open Sheet</Button>\n      </SheetTrigger>\n      <SheetContent>\n        <SheetHeader>\n          <SheetTitle>Edit profile</SheetTitle>\n          <SheetDescription>\n            Make changes to your profile here. Click save when you''re done.\n          </SheetDescription>\n        </SheetHeader>\n        <div className=\"grid gap-4 py-4\">\n          <div className=\"grid grid-cols-4 items-center gap-4\">\n            <Label htmlFor=\"name\" className=\"text-right\">\n              Name\n            </Label>\n            <Input id=\"name\" value=\"Pedro Duarte\" className=\"col-span-3\" />\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"grid grid-cols-4 items-center gap-4\">\n            <Label htmlFor=\"username\" className=\"text-right\">\n              Username\n            </Label>\n            <Input id=\"username\" value=\"@peduarte\" className=\"col-span-3\" />\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </SheetContent>\n    </Sheet>\n  )\n}\n```\n\nSheet with side placement:\n\n```tsx\n<Sheet>\n  <SheetTrigger asChild>\n    <Button variant=\"outline\">Open Right Sheet</Button>\n  </SheetTrigger>\n  <SheetContent side=\"right\">\n    <SheetHeader>\n      <SheetTitle>Settings</SheetTitle>\n      <SheetDescription>\n        Configure your application settings here.\n      </SheetDescription>\n    </SheetHeader>\n    {/* Settings content */}\n  </SheetContent>\n</Sheet>\n```\n\n### Menubar & Navigation\n\n#### Menubar Component\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add menubar\n```\n\nBasic menubar:\n\n```tsx\nimport {\n  Menubar,\n  MenubarContent,\n  MenubarItem,\n  MenubarMenu,\n  MenubarSeparator,\n  MenubarShortcut,\n  MenubarSub,\n  MenubarSubContent,\n  MenubarSubTrigger,\n  MenubarTrigger,\n} from \"@/components/ui/menubar\"\n\nexport function MenubarDemo() {\n  return (\n    <Menubar>\n      <MenubarMenu>\n        <MenubarTrigger>File</MenubarTrigger>\n        <MenubarContent>\n          <MenubarItem>\n            New Tab <MenubarShortcut>⌘T</MenubarShortcut>\n          </MenubarItem>\n          <MenubarItem>\n            New Window <MenubarShortcut>⌘N</MenubarShortcut>\n          </MenubarItem>\n          <MenubarSeparator />\n          <MenubarItem>Share</MenubarItem>\n          <MenubarSeparator />\n          <MenubarItem>Print</MenubarItem>\n        </MenubarContent>\n      </MenubarMenu>\n      <MenubarMenu>\n        <MenubarTrigger>Edit</MenubarTrigger>\n        <MenubarContent>\n          <MenubarItem>\n            Undo <MenubarShortcut>⌘Z</MenubarShortcut>\n          </MenubarItem>\n          <MenubarItem>\n            Redo <MenubarShortcut>⌘Y</MenubarShortcut>\n          </MenubarItem>\n          <MenubarSeparator />\n          <MenubarSub>\n            <MenubarSubTrigger>Find</MenubarSubTrigger>\n            <MenubarSubContent>\n              <MenubarItem>Search the web</MenubarItem>\n              <MenubarItem>Find...</MenubarItem>\n              <MenubarItem>Find Next</MenubarItem>\n              <MenubarItem>Find Previous</MenubarItem>\n            </MenubarSubContent>\n          </MenubarSub>\n        </MenubarContent>\n      </MenubarMenu>\n    </Menubar>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Select (Dropdown) Component\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add select\n```\n\nBasic select:\n\n```tsx\nimport {\n  Select,\n  SelectContent,\n  SelectItem,\n  SelectTrigger,\n  SelectValue,\n} from \"@/components/ui/select\"\n\nexport function SelectDemo() {\n  return (\n    <Select>\n      <SelectTrigger className=\"w-[180px]\">\n        <SelectValue placeholder=\"Select a fruit\" />\n      </SelectTrigger>\n      <SelectContent>\n        <SelectItem value=\"apple\">Apple</SelectItem>\n        <SelectItem value=\"banana\">Banana</SelectItem>\n        <SelectItem value=\"orange\">Orange</SelectItem>\n      </SelectContent>\n    </Select>\n  )\n}\n```\n\nSelect in form:\n\n```tsx\n<FormField\n  control={form.control}\n  name=\"role\"\n  render={({ field }) => (\n    <FormItem>\n      <FormLabel>Role</FormLabel>\n      <Select onValueChange={field.onChange} defaultValue={field.value}>\n        <FormControl>\n          <SelectTrigger>\n            <SelectValue placeholder=\"Select a role\" />\n          </SelectTrigger>\n        </FormControl>\n        <SelectContent>\n          <SelectItem value=\"admin\">Admin</SelectItem>\n          <SelectItem value=\"user\">User</SelectItem>\n          <SelectItem value=\"guest\">Guest</SelectItem>\n        </SelectContent>\n      </Select>\n      <FormMessage />\n    </FormItem>\n  )}\n/>\n```\n\n### Toast Notifications\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add toast\n```\n\nSetup toast provider in root layout:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Toaster } from \"@/components/ui/toaster\"\n\nexport default function RootLayout({ children }) {\n  return (\n    <html lang=\"en\">\n      <body>\n        {children}\n        <Toaster />\n      </body>\n    </html>\n  )\n}\n```\n\nUsing toast:\n\n```tsx\nimport { useToast } from \"@/components/ui/use-toast\"\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\n\nexport function ToastDemo() {\n  const { toast } = useToast()\n\n  return (\n    <Button\n      onClick={() => {\n        toast({\n          title: \"Scheduled: Catch up\",\n          description: \"Friday, February 10, 2023 at 5:57 PM\",\n        })\n      }}\n    >\n      Show Toast\n    </Button>\n  )\n}\n```\n\nToast variants:\n\n```tsx\n// Success\ntoast({\n  title: \"Success\",\n  description: \"Your changes have been saved.\",\n})\n\n// Error\ntoast({\n  variant: \"destructive\",\n  title: \"Error\",\n  description: \"Something went wrong.\",\n})\n\n// With action\ntoast({\n  title: \"Uh oh! Something went wrong.\",\n  description: \"There was a problem with your request.\",\n  action: <ToastAction altText=\"Try again\">Try again</ToastAction>,\n})\n```\n\n### Table Component\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add table\n```\n\nBasic table:\n\n```tsx\nimport {\n  Table,\n  TableBody,\n  TableCaption,\n  TableCell,\n  TableHead,\n  TableHeader,\n  TableRow,\n} from \"@/components/ui/table\"\n\nconst invoices = [\n  { invoice: \"INV001\", status: \"Paid\", method: \"Credit Card\", amount: \"$250.00\" },\n  { invoice: \"INV002\", status: \"Pending\", method: \"PayPal\", amount: \"$150.00\" },\n]\n\nexport function TableDemo() {\n  return (\n    <Table>\n      <TableCaption>A list of your recent invoices.</TableCaption>\n      <TableHeader>\n        <TableRow>\n          <TableHead>Invoice</TableHead>\n          <TableHead>Status</TableHead>\n          <TableHead>Method</TableHead>\n          <TableHead className=\"text-right\">Amount</TableHead>\n        </TableRow>\n      </TableHeader>\n      <TableBody>\n        {invoices.map((invoice) => (\n          <TableRow key={invoice.invoice}>\n            <TableCell className=\"font-medium\">{invoice.invoice}</TableCell>\n            <TableCell>{invoice.status}</TableCell>\n            <TableCell>{invoice.method}</TableCell>\n            <TableCell className=\"text-right\">{invoice.amount}</TableCell>\n          </TableRow>\n        ))}\n      </TableBody>\n    </Table>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Customization\n\n### Theming with CSS Variables\n\nshadcn/ui uses CSS variables for theming. Configure in `globals.css`:\n\n```css\n@layer base {\n  :root {\n    --background: 0 0% 100%;\n    --foreground: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --primary: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --primary-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --secondary: 210 40% 96.1%;\n    --secondary-foreground: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --muted: 210 40% 96.1%;\n    --muted-foreground: 215.4 16.3% 46.9%;\n    --accent: 210 40% 96.1%;\n    --accent-foreground: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --destructive: 0 84.2% 60.2%;\n    --destructive-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --border: 214.3 31.8% 91.4%;\n    --input: 214.3 31.8% 91.4%;\n    --ring: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --radius: 0.5rem;\n  }\n\n  .dark {\n    --background: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --primary: 210 40% 98%;\n    --primary-foreground: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    /* ... other dark mode variables */\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Customizing Components\n\nSince you own the code, customize directly:\n\n```tsx\n// components/ui/button.tsx\nimport * as React from \"react\"\nimport { Slot } from \"@radix-ui/react-slot\"\nimport { cva, type VariantProps } from \"class-variance-authority\"\nimport { cn } from \"@/lib/utils\"\n\nconst buttonVariants = cva(\n  \"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors\",\n  {\n    variants: {\n      variant: {\n        default: \"bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/90\",\n        destructive: \"bg-destructive text-destructive-foreground hover:bg-destructive/90\",\n        outline: \"border border-input bg-background hover:bg-accent\",\n        // Add custom variant\n        custom: \"bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-500 to-pink-500 text-white\",\n      },\n      size: {\n        default: \"h-10 px-4 py-2\",\n        sm: \"h-9 rounded-md px-3\",\n        lg: \"h-11 rounded-md px-8\",\n        // Add custom size\n        xl: \"h-14 rounded-md px-10 text-lg\",\n      },\n    },\n    defaultVariants: {\n      variant: \"default\",\n      size: \"default\",\n    },\n  }\n)\n\nexport interface ButtonProps\n  extends React.ButtonHTMLAttributes<HTMLButtonElement>,\n    VariantProps<typeof buttonVariants> {\n  asChild?: boolean\n}\n\nconst Button = React.forwardRef<HTMLButtonElement, ButtonProps>(\n  ({ className, variant, size, asChild = false, ...props }, ref) => {\n    const Comp = asChild ? Slot : \"button\"\n    return (\n      <Comp\n        className={cn(buttonVariants({ variant, size, className }))}\n        ref={ref}\n        {...props}\n      />\n    )\n  }\n)\nButton.displayName = \"Button\"\n\nexport { Button, buttonVariants }\n```\n\n## Next.js Integration\n\n### App Router Setup\n\nFor Next.js 13+ with App Router, ensure components use `\"use client\"` directive:\n\n```tsx\n// src/components/ui/button.tsx\n\"use client\"\n\nimport * as React from \"react\"\nimport { Slot } from \"@radix-ui/react-slot\"\nimport { cva, type VariantProps } from \"class-variance-authority\"\nimport { cn } from \"@/lib/utils\"\n\n// ... rest of component\n```\n\n### Layout Integration\n\nAdd the Toaster to your root layout:\n\n```tsx\n// app/layout.tsx\nimport { Toaster } from \"@/components/ui/toaster\"\nimport \"./globals.css\"\n\nexport default function RootLayout({\n  children,\n}: {\n  children: React.ReactNode\n}) {\n  return (\n    <html lang=\"en\" suppressHydrationWarning>\n      <body className=\"min-h-screen bg-background font-sans antialiased\">\n        {children}\n        <Toaster />\n      </body>\n    </html>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Server Components\n\nWhen using shadcn/ui components in Server Components, wrap them in a Client Component:\n\n```tsx\n// app/dashboard/page.tsx\nimport { Card, CardContent, CardHeader, CardTitle } from \"@/components/ui/card\"\nimport { ButtonClient } from \"@/components/ui/button-client\"\n\nexport default function DashboardPage() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"container mx-auto p-6\">\n      <Card>\n        <CardHeader>\n          <CardTitle>Dashboard</CardTitle>\n        </CardHeader>\n        <CardContent>\n          <ButtonClient>Interactive Button</ButtonClient>\n        </CardContent>\n      </Card>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n```tsx\n// src/components/ui/button-client.tsx\n\"use client\"\n\nimport { Button } from \"./button\"\n\nexport function ButtonClient(props: React.ComponentProps<typeof Button>) {\n  return <Button {...props} />\n}\n```\n\n### Route Handlers with Forms\n\nCreate API routes for form submissions:\n\n```tsx\n// app/api/contact/route.ts\nimport { NextRequest, NextResponse } from \"next/server\"\nimport { z } from \"zod\"\n\nconst contactSchema = z.object({\n  name: z.string().min(2),\n  email: z.string().email(),\n  message: z.string().min(10),\n})\n\nexport async function POST(request: NextRequest) {\n  try {\n    const body = await request.json()\n    const validated = contactSchema.parse(body)\n\n    // Process form data\n    console.log(\"Form submission:\", validated)\n\n    return NextResponse.json({ success: true })\n  } catch (error) {\n    if (error instanceof z.ZodError) {\n      return NextResponse.json(\n        { errors: error.errors },\n        { status: 400 }\n      )\n    }\n\n    return NextResponse.json(\n      { error: \"Internal server error\" },\n      { status: 500 }\n    )\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Form with Server Action\n\nUsing Next.js 14+ Server Actions:\n\n```tsx\n// app/contact/page.tsx\n\"use client\"\n\nimport { zodResolver } from \"@hookform/resolvers/zod\"\nimport { useForm } from \"react-hook-form\"\nimport * as z from \"zod\"\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport {\n  Form,\n  FormControl,\n  FormField,\n  FormItem,\n  FormLabel,\n  FormMessage,\n} from \"@/components/ui/form\"\nimport { Input } from \"@/components/ui/input\"\nimport { Textarea } from \"@/components/ui/textarea\"\nimport { toast } from \"@/components/ui/use-toast\"\n\nconst formSchema = z.object({\n  name: z.string().min(2),\n  email: z.string().email(),\n  message: z.string().min(10),\n})\n\nasync function onSubmit(values: z.infer<typeof formSchema>) {\n  try {\n    const response = await fetch(\"/api/contact\", {\n      method: \"POST\",\n      headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n      body: JSON.stringify(values),\n    })\n\n    if (!response.ok) throw new Error(\"Failed to submit\")\n\n    toast({\n      title: \"Success!\",\n      description: \"Your message has been sent.\",\n    })\n  } catch (error) {\n    toast({\n      variant: \"destructive\",\n      title: \"Error\",\n      description: \"Failed to send message. Please try again.\",\n    })\n  }\n}\n\nexport default function ContactPage() {\n  const form = useForm<z.infer<typeof formSchema>>({\n    resolver: zodResolver(formSchema),\n  })\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"container mx-auto max-w-2xl py-8\">\n      <Form {...form}>\n        <form onSubmit={form.handleSubmit(onSubmit)} className=\"space-y-6\">\n          <FormField\n            control={form.control}\n            name=\"name\"\n            render={({ field }) => (\n              <FormItem>\n                <FormLabel>Name</FormLabel>\n                <FormControl>\n                  <Input placeholder=\"Your name\" {...field} />\n                </FormControl>\n                <FormMessage />\n              </FormItem>\n            )}\n          />\n\n          <FormField\n            control={form.control}\n            name=\"email\"\n            render={({ field }) => (\n              <FormItem>\n                <FormLabel>Email</FormLabel>\n                <FormControl>\n                  <Input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"your@email.com\" {...field} />\n                </FormControl>\n                <FormMessage />\n              </FormItem>\n            )}\n          />\n\n          <FormField\n            control={form.control}\n            name=\"message\"\n            render={({ field }) => (\n              <FormItem>\n                <FormLabel>Message</FormLabel>\n                <FormControl>\n                  <Textarea\n                    placeholder=\"Your message...\"\n                    className=\"resize-none\"\n                    {...field}\n                  />\n                </FormControl>\n                <FormMessage />\n              </FormItem>\n            )}\n          />\n\n          <Button type=\"submit\" className=\"w-full\">\n            Send Message\n          </Button>\n        </form>\n      </Form>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Metadata with shadcn/ui\n\nUsing shadcn/ui components in metadata:\n\n```tsx\n// app/layout.tsx\nimport { Metadata } from \"next\"\n\nexport const metadata: Metadata = {\n  title: {\n    default: \"My App\",\n    template: \"%s | My App\",\n  },\n  description: \"Built with shadcn/ui and Next.js\",\n}\n\n// app/about/page.tsx\nimport { Metadata } from \"next\"\nimport { Card, CardContent, CardHeader, CardTitle } from \"@/components/ui/card\"\n\nexport const metadata: Metadata = {\n  title: \"About Us\",\n  description: \"Learn more about our company\",\n}\n\nexport default function AboutPage() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"container mx-auto py-8\">\n      <Card>\n        <CardHeader>\n          <CardTitle>About Our Company</CardTitle>\n        </CardHeader>\n        <CardContent>\n          <p>We build amazing products with modern web technologies.</p>\n        </CardContent>\n      </Card>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Font Optimization\n\nOptimize fonts with next/font:\n\n```tsx\n// app/layout.tsx\nimport { Inter } from \"next/font/google\"\nimport { Toaster } from \"@/components/ui/toaster\"\nimport { cn } from \"@/lib/utils\"\nimport \"./globals.css\"\n\nconst inter = Inter({ subsets: [\"latin\"] })\n\nexport default function RootLayout({\n  children,\n}: {\n  children: React.ReactNode\n}) {\n  return (\n    <html lang=\"en\" suppressHydrationWarning>\n      <body className={cn(\"min-h-screen bg-background font-sans antialiased\", inter.className)}>\n        {children}\n        <Toaster />\n      </body>\n    </html>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Advanced Patterns\n\n### Form with Multiple Fields\n\n```tsx\nconst formSchema = z.object({\n  username: z.string().min(2).max(50),\n  email: z.string().email(),\n  bio: z.string().max(160).min(4),\n  role: z.enum([\"admin\", \"user\", \"guest\"]),\n  notifications: z.boolean().default(false),\n})\n\nexport function AdvancedForm() {\n  const form = useForm<z.infer<typeof formSchema>>({\n    resolver: zodResolver(formSchema),\n    defaultValues: {\n      username: \"\",\n      email: \"\",\n      bio: \"\",\n      role: \"user\",\n      notifications: false,\n    },\n  })\n\n  function onSubmit(values: z.infer<typeof formSchema>) {\n    console.log(values)\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <Form {...form}>\n      <form onSubmit={form.handleSubmit(onSubmit)} className=\"space-y-8\">\n        {/* Username field */}\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"username\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Username</FormLabel>\n              <FormControl>\n                <Input placeholder=\"johndoe\" {...field} />\n              </FormControl>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n\n        {/* Email field */}\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"email\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Email</FormLabel>\n              <FormControl>\n                <Input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"john@example.com\" {...field} />\n              </FormControl>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n\n        {/* Textarea field */}\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"bio\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Bio</FormLabel>\n              <FormControl>\n                <Textarea\n                  placeholder=\"Tell us about yourself\"\n                  className=\"resize-none\"\n                  {...field}\n                />\n              </FormControl>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n\n        {/* Select field */}\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"role\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Role</FormLabel>\n              <Select onValueChange={field.onChange} defaultValue={field.value}>\n                <FormControl>\n                  <SelectTrigger>\n                    <SelectValue placeholder=\"Select a role\" />\n                  </SelectTrigger>\n                </FormControl>\n                <SelectContent>\n                  <SelectItem value=\"admin\">Admin</SelectItem>\n                  <SelectItem value=\"user\">User</SelectItem>\n                  <SelectItem value=\"guest\">Guest</SelectItem>\n                </SelectContent>\n              </Select>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n\n        {/* Checkbox field */}\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"notifications\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem className=\"flex flex-row items-start space-x-3 space-y-0\">\n              <FormControl>\n                <Checkbox\n                  checked={field.value}\n                  onCheckedChange={field.onChange}\n                />\n              </FormControl>\n              <div className=\"space-y-1 leading-none\">\n                <FormLabel>Email notifications</FormLabel>\n                <FormDescription>\n                  Receive emails about your account activity.\n                </FormDescription>\n              </div>\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n\n        <Button type=\"submit\">Submit</Button>\n      </form>\n    </Form>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Accessibility**: Components use Radix UI primitives for ARIA compliance\n2. **Customization**: Modify components directly in your codebase\n3. **Type Safety**: Use TypeScript for type-safe props and state\n4. **Validation**: Use Zod schemas for form validation\n5. **Styling**: Leverage Tailwind utilities and CSS variables\n6. **Consistency**: Use the same component patterns across your app\n7. **Testing**: Components are testable with React Testing Library\n8. **Performance**: Components are optimized and tree-shakeable\n\n## Common Component Combinations\n\n### Login Form\n\n```tsx\n<Card className=\"w-[350px]\">\n  <CardHeader>\n    <CardTitle>Login</CardTitle>\n    <CardDescription>Enter your credentials to continue</CardDescription>\n  </CardHeader>\n  <CardContent>\n    <Form {...form}>\n      <form onSubmit={form.handleSubmit(onSubmit)} className=\"space-y-4\">\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"email\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Email</FormLabel>\n              <FormControl>\n                <Input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\" {...field} />\n              </FormControl>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"password\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Password</FormLabel>\n              <FormControl>\n                <Input type=\"password\" {...field} />\n              </FormControl>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n        <Button type=\"submit\" className=\"w-full\">Login</Button>\n      </form>\n    </Form>\n  </CardContent>\n</Card>\n```\n\n## References\n\n- Official Docs: https://ui.shadcn.com\n- Radix UI: https://www.radix-ui.com\n- React Hook Form: https://react-hook-form.com\n- Zod: https://zod.dev\n- Tailwind CSS: https://tailwindcss.com\n- Examples: https://ui.shadcn.com/examples\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:32:48.831Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing accessible and customizable UI components with shadcn/ui, Radix UI, and Tailwind CSS.","zh":"非常适合需要可访问和可定制的UI组件的前端代理，使用shadcn/ui、Radix UI和Tailwind CSS。","ja":"フロントエンドエージェント向けにアクセシビリティの高いカスタマイズ可能なUIコンポーネントを必要とする場合に最適です。shadcn/ui、Radix UI、Tailwind CSSを使用します。","ko":"액세스 가능하고 맞춤형 UI 컴포넌트가 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다. shadcn/ui, Radix UI 및 Tailwind CSS를 사용합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes frontend que necesitan componentes de interfaz de usuario accesibles y personalizables con shadcn/ui, Radix UI y Tailwind CSS.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend ayant besoin de composants d''interface utilisateur accessibles et personnalisables avec shadcn/ui, Radix UI et Tailwind CSS.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die zugängliche und anpassbare Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten mit shadcn/ui, Radix UI und Tailwind CSS benötigen.","pt":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing accessible and customizable UI components with shadcn/ui, Radix UI, and Tailwind CSS.","ru":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing accessible and customizable UI components with shadcn/ui, Radix UI, and Tailwind CSS.","ar":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing accessible and customizable UI components with shadcn/ui, Radix UI, and Tailwind CSS."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build responsive and accessible interfaces using shadcn/ui component patterns, leveraging Radix UI and Tailwind CSS for seamless customization and theming, with features like forms validation and core components such as buttons and input fields.","zh":"赋予代理构建响应式和可访问的接口的能力，使用shadcn/ui组件模式，利用Radix UI和Tailwind CSS进行无缝的定制和主题设置，具有表单验证和按钮、输入字段等核心组件的功能。","ja":"エージェントがshadcn/uiコンポーネントパターンを使用してレスポンシブでアクセシビリティの高いインターフェイスを構築する能力を提供し、Radix UIとTailwind CSSを使用してカスタマイズとテーマ設定をシームレスに行い、フォームのバリデーションやボタン、入力フィールドなどのコアコンポーネントなどの機能を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 shadcn/ui 컴포넌트 패턴을 사용하여 반응형 및 액세스 가능한 인터페이스를 구축할 수 있는 능력을 제공하며, Radix UI 및 Tailwind CSS를 사용하여 무결점 맞춤설정 및 테마 설정을 수행하고, 양식 검증 및 버튼, 입력 필드 등과 같은 핵심 구성 요소와 같은 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear interfaces responsivas y accesibles utilizando patrones de componentes shadcn/ui, aprovechando Radix UI y Tailwind CSS para una personalización y tematización sin problemas, con características como la validación de formularios y componentes básicos como botones y campos de entrada.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des interfaces responsives et accessibles en utilisant des modèles de composants shadcn/ui, en exploitant Radix UI et Tailwind CSS pour une personnalisation et une thématisation sans problème, avec des fonctionnalités comme la validation de formulaires et des composants de base tels que les boutons et les champs de saisie.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, responsive und zugängliche Schnittstellen zu erstellen, indem sie shadcn/ui-Komponentenmuster verwenden, Radix UI und Tailwind CSS für eine nahtlose Anpassung und Thematisierung nutzen, mit Funktionen wie Formularvalidierung und Kernkomponenten wie Schaltflächen und Eingabefeldern.","pt":"Empowers agents to build responsive and accessible interfaces using shadcn/ui component patterns, leveraging Radix UI and Tailwind CSS for seamless customization and theming, with features like forms validation and core components such as buttons and input fields.","ru":"Empowers agents to build responsive and accessible interfaces using shadcn/ui component patterns, leveraging Radix UI and Tailwind CSS for seamless customization and theming, with features like forms validation and core components such as buttons and input fields.","ar":"Empowers agents to build responsive and accessible interfaces using shadcn/ui component patterns, leveraging Radix UI and Tailwind CSS for seamless customization and theming, with features like forms validation and core components such as buttons and input fields."},"useCases":{"en":["Building accessible and customizable UI components with shadcn/ui","Creating responsive forms with validation using shadcn/ui and Radix UI","Customizing UI themes with Tailwind CSS and shadcn/ui component patterns"],"zh":["使用shadcn/ui构建可访问和可定制的UI组件","使用shadcn/ui和Radix UI创建响应式表单并进行验证","使用Tailwind CSS和shadcn/ui组件模式自定义UI主题"],"ja":["shadcn/uiを使用してアクセシビリティの高いカスタマイズ可能なUIコンポーネントを構築する","shadcn/uiとRadix UIを使用してレスポンシブなフォームを作成し、バリデーションを行う","Tailwind CSSとshadcn/uiコンポーネントパターンを使用してUIテーマをカスタマイズする"],"ko":["shadcn/ui를 사용하여 액세스 가능하고 맞춤형 UI 컴포넌트를 구축하는 것","shadcn/ui 및 Radix UI를 사용하여 반응형 양식을 만들고 검증하는 것","Tailwind CSS 및 shadcn/ui 컴포넌트 패턴을 사용하여 UI 테마를 맞춤설정하는 것"],"es":["Creación de componentes de interfaz de usuario accesibles y personalizables con shadcn/ui","Creación de formularios responsivos con validación utilizando shadcn/ui y Radix UI","Personalización de temas de interfaz de usuario con Tailwind CSS y patrones de componentes shadcn/ui"],"fr":["Création de composants d''interface utilisateur accessibles et personnalisables avec shadcn/ui","Création de formulaires responsifs avec validation en utilisant shadcn/ui et Radix UI","Personnalisation de thèmes d''interface utilisateur avec Tailwind CSS et des modèles de composants shadcn/ui"],"de":["Erstellung zugänglicher und anpassbarer Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten mit shadcn/ui","Erstellung responsiver Formulare mit Validierung unter Verwendung von shadcn/ui und Radix UI","Anpassung von Benutzeroberflächenthemen mit Tailwind CSS und shadcn/ui-Komponentenmustern"],"pt":["Building accessible and customizable UI components with shadcn/ui","Creating responsive forms with validation using shadcn/ui and Radix UI","Customizing UI themes with Tailwind CSS and shadcn/ui component patterns"],"ru":["Building accessible and customizable UI components with shadcn/ui","Creating responsive forms with validation using shadcn/ui and Radix UI","Customizing UI themes with Tailwind CSS and shadcn/ui component patterns"],"ar":["Building accessible and customizable UI components with shadcn/ui","Creating responsive forms with validation using shadcn/ui and Radix UI","Customizing UI themes with Tailwind CSS and shadcn/ui component patterns"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires setup and configuration of shadcn/ui, Radix UI, and Tailwind CSS","Limited to frontend development with supported libraries and frameworks"],"zh":["需要设置和配置shadcn/ui、Radix UI和Tailwind CSS","仅限于支持的库和框架的前端开发"],"ja":["shadcn/ui、Radix UI、Tailwind CSSの設定と構成が必要","サポートされているライブラリとフレームワークでのみフロントエンド開発が可能"],"ko":["shadcn/ui, Radix UI 및 Tailwind CSS의 설정 및 구성이 필요함","지원되는 라이브러리 및 프레임워크에서만 프론트엔드 개발이 가능함"],"es":["Requiere la configuración y el ajuste de shadcn/ui, Radix UI y Tailwind CSS","Limitado al desarrollo frontend con bibliotecas y frameworks compatibles"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration et la mise en place de shadcn/ui, Radix UI et Tailwind CSS","Limité au développement frontend avec des bibliothèques et des frameworks pris en charge"],"de":["Benötigt die Einrichtung und Konfiguration von shadcn/ui, Radix UI und Tailwind CSS","Begrenzt auf die Frontend-Entwicklung mit unterstützten Bibliotheken und Frameworks"],"pt":["Requires setup and configuration of shadcn/ui, Radix UI, and Tailwind CSS","Limited to frontend development with supported libraries and frameworks"],"ru":["Requires setup and configuration of shadcn/ui, Radix UI, and Tailwind CSS","Limited to frontend development with supported libraries and frameworks"],"ar":["Requires setup and configuration of shadcn/ui, Radix UI, and Tailwind CSS","Limited to frontend development with supported libraries and frameworks"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
