собности и задержки","Анализ рабочих процессов для выявления узких мест","Разработка стратегий оркестровки","Оптимизация затрат и использования ресурсов"],"ar":["تحسين التنسيق بين العوامل","تحسين الإنتاجية والكفاءة","تحليل سير العمل لتحديد نقاط الضعف","تصميم استراتيجيات التوجيه","تحسين التكاليف والاستخدام الأمثل للموارد"]},"keywords":{"zh":["多智能体优化","协调","通过率","延迟","复杂工作流","最优化策略","成本优化","上下文使用"],"ja":["マルチエージェント最適化","調整","スループット","待ち時間","複雑なワークフロー","最適化戦略","コスト最適化","コンテキスト使用"],"ko":["다중 에이전트 최적화","조율","처리량","대기 시간","복잡한 워크플로우","최적화 전략","비용 최적화","컨텍스트 사용"],"es":["optimización de agentes múltiples","coordinación de agentes","rendimiento de agentes","latencia de agentes","profilación de flujos de trabajo","orquestación de agentes"],"fr":["optimisation de plusieurs agents","coordination d''agents","performances d''agents","latence d''agents","profilation de flux de travail","orchestration d''agents"],"de":["Optimierung mehrerer Agenten","Koordination von Agenten","Leistung von Agenten","Latenz von Agenten","Prolifation von Arbeitsflüssen","Orchestrierung von Agenten"],"pt":["otimização de orquestração","múltiplos agentes","coordenação","throughput","latência","análise de workflows","desenvolvimento de estratégias","otimização de custos"],"ru":["оптимизация оркестровки","多агентные системы","координация","пропускная способность","задержка","анализ рабочих процессов","разработка стратегий","оптимизация затрат"],"ar":["تحسين توجيه","عوامل متعددة","تنسيق","إنتاجية","كفاءة","تحليل سير العمل","تصميم استراتيجيات","تحسين التكاليف"]}},"owner":"xiangteng007","repo":"XXT-AGENT","repoPath":"xiangteng007/XXT-AGENT","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.422Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"agent-orchestration-multi-agent-optimize","description":"Optimize multi-agent systems with coordinated profiling, workload distribution, and cost-aware orchestration. Use when improving agent performance, throughput, or reliability.","bodyPreview":"# Multi-Agent Optimization Toolkit\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Improving multi-agent coordination, throughput, or latency\n- Profiling agent workflows to identify bottlenecks\n- Designing orchestration strategies for complex workflows\n- Optimizing cost, context usage, or tool efficiency\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- You only need to tune a single agent prompt\n- There are no measurable metrics or evaluation data\n- The task is unrelated to multi-agent orchestration\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Establish","body":"# Multi-Agent Optimization Toolkit\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Improving multi-agent coordination, throughput, or latency\n- Profiling agent workflows to identify bottlenecks\n- Designing orchestration strategies for complex workflows\n- Optimizing cost, context usage, or tool efficiency\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- You only need to tune a single agent prompt\n- There are no measurable metrics or evaluation data\n- The task is unrelated to multi-agent orchestration\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Establish baseline metrics and target performance goals.\n2. Profile agent workloads and identify coordination bottlenecks.\n3. Apply orchestration changes and cost controls incrementally.\n4. Validate improvements with repeatable tests and rollbacks.\n\n## Safety\n\n- Avoid deploying orchestration changes without regression testing.\n- Roll out changes gradually to prevent system-wide regressions.\n\n## Role: AI-Powered Multi-Agent Performance Engineering Specialist\n\n### Context\n\nThe Multi-Agent Optimization Tool is an advanced AI-driven framework designed to holistically improve system performance through intelligent, coordinated agent-based optimization. Leveraging cutting-edge AI orchestration techniques, this tool provides a comprehensive approach to performance engineering across multiple domains.\n\n### Core Capabilities\n\n- Intelligent multi-agent coordination\n- Performance profiling and bottleneck identification\n- Adaptive optimization strategies\n- Cross-domain performance optimization\n- Cost and efficiency tracking\n\n## Arguments Handling\n\nThe tool processes optimization arguments with flexible input parameters:\n\n- `$TARGET`: Primary system/application to optimize\n- `$PERFORMANCE_GOALS`: Specific performance metrics and objectives\n- `$OPTIMIZATION_SCOPE`: Depth of optimization (quick-win, comprehensive)\n- `$BUDGET_CONSTRAINTS`: Cost and resource limitations\n- `$QUALITY_METRICS`: Performance quality thresholds\n\n## 1. Multi-Agent Performance Profiling\n\n### Profiling Strategy\n\n- Distributed performance monitoring across system layers\n- Real-time metrics collection and analysis\n- Continuous performance signature tracking\n\n#### Profiling Agents\n\n1. **Database Performance Agent**\n   - Query execution time analysis\n   - Index utilization tracking\n   - Resource consumption monitoring\n\n2. **Application Performance Agent**\n   - CPU and memory profiling\n   - Algorithmic complexity assessment\n   - Concurrency and async operation analysis\n\n3. **Frontend Performance Agent**\n   - Rendering performance metrics\n   - Network request optimization\n   - Core Web Vitals monitoring\n\n### Profiling Code Example\n\n```python\ndef multi_agent_profiler(target_system):\n    agents = [\n        DatabasePerformanceAgent(target_system),\n        ApplicationPerformanceAgent(target_system),\n        FrontendPerformanceAgent(target_system)\n    ]\n\n    performance_profile = {}\n    for agent in agents:\n        performance_profile[agent.__class__.__name__] = agent.profile()\n\n    return aggregate_performance_metrics(performance_profile)\n```\n\n## 2. Context Window Optimization\n\n### Optimization Techniques\n\n- Intelligent context compression\n- Semantic relevance filtering\n- Dynamic context window resizing\n- Token budget management\n\n### Context Compression Algorithm\n\n```python\ndef compress_context(context, max_tokens=4000):\n    # Semantic compression using embedding-based truncation\n    compressed_context = semantic_truncate(\n        context,\n        max_tokens=max_tokens,\n        importance_threshold=0.7\n    )\n    return compressed_context\n```\n\n## 3. Agent Coordination Efficiency\n\n### Coordination Principles\n\n- Parallel execution design\n- Minimal inter-agent communication overhead\n- Dynamic workload distribution\n- Fault-tolerant agent interactions\n\n### Orchestration Framework\n\n```python\nclass MultiAgentOrchestrator:\n    def __init__(self, agents):\n        self.agents = agents\n        self.execution_queue = PriorityQueue()\n        self.performance_tracker = PerformanceTracker()\n\n    def optimize(self, target_system):\n        # Parallel agent execution with coordinated optimization\n        with concurrent.futures.ThreadPoolExecutor() as executor:\n            futures = {\n                executor.submit(agent.optimize, target_system): agent\n                for agent in self.agents\n            }\n\n            for future in concurrent.futures.as_completed(futures):\n                agent = futures[future]\n                result = future.result()\n                self.performance_tracker.log(agent, result)\n```\n\n## 4. Parallel Execution Optimization\n\n### Key Strategies\n\n- Asynchronous agent processing\n- Workload partitioning\n- Dynamic resource allocation\n- Minimal blocking operations\n\n## 5. Cost Optimization Strategies\n\n### LLM Cost Management\n\n- Token usage tracking\n- Adaptive model selection\n- Caching and result reuse\n- Efficient prompt engineering\n\n### Cost Tracking Example\n\n```python\nclass CostOptimizer:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.token_budget = 100000  # Monthly budget\n        self.token_usage = 0\n        self.model_costs = {\n            ''gpt-5'': 0.03,\n            ''claude-4-sonnet'': 0.015,\n            ''claude-4-haiku'': 0.0025\n        }\n\n    def select_optimal_model(self, complexity):\n        # Dynamic model selection based on task complexity and budget\n        pass\n```\n\n## 6. Latency Reduction Techniques\n\n### Performance Acceleration\n\n- Predictive caching\n- Pre-warming agent contexts\n- Intelligent result memoization\n- Reduced round-trip communication\n\n## 7. Quality vs Speed Tradeoffs\n\n### Optimization Spectrum\n\n- Performance thresholds\n- Acceptable degradation margins\n- Quality-aware optimization\n- Intelligent compromise selection\n\n## 8. Monitoring and Continuous Improvement\n\n### Observability Framework\n\n- Real-time performance dashboards\n- Automated optimization feedback loops\n- Machine learning-driven improvement\n- Adaptive optimization strategies\n\n## Reference Workflows\n\n### Workflow 1: E-Commerce Platform Optimization\n\n1. Initial performance profiling\n2. Agent-based optimization\n3. Cost and performance tracking\n4. Continuous improvement cycle\n\n### Workflow 2: Enterprise API Performance Enhancement\n\n1. Comprehensive system analysis\n2. Multi-layered agent optimization\n3. Iterative performance refinement\n4. Cost-efficient scaling strategy\n\n## Key Considerations\n\n- Always measure before and after optimization\n- Maintain system stability during optimization\n- Balance performance gains with resource consumption\n- Implement gradual, reversible changes\n\nTarget Optimization: $ARGUMENTS\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:32:44.634Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced AI Agents like AutoGPT and LangChain needing enhanced multi-agent coordination and optimization capabilities.","zh":"适用于像 AutoGPT 和 LangChain 这样的高级 AI 代理，需要增强的多代理协调和优化能力。","ja":"AutoGPTやLangChainのような高度なAIエージェントに適しており、多エージェントの調整と最適化機能を強化する必要がある。","ko":"AutoGPT와 LangChain 같은 고급 AI 에이전트에 적합하며, 다중 에이전트 조정 및 최적화 기능을 강화하는 데 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA avanzados como AutoGPT y LangChain que necesitan capacidades de coordinación y optimización de múltiples agentes mejoradas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de l''IA avancés comme AutoGPT et LangChain nécessitant des capacités de coordination et d''optimisation de plusieurs agents améliorées.","de":"Ideal für fortgeschrittene KI-Agents wie AutoGPT und LangChain, die erweiterte Fähigkeiten zur Koordination und Optimierung mehrerer Agents benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Avançados como AutoGPT e LangChain que necessitam de capacidades de coordenação e otimização multi-agente aprimoradas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых агентов ИИ, таких как AutoGPT и LangChain, которым необходимы улучшенные возможности координации и оптимизации нескольких агентов.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكيين المتقدمين مثل AutoGPT و LangChain الذين يحتاجون إلى تحسينات في القدرات التوجيهية متعددة الوكلاء والتحسين"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize multi-agent workflows, leveraging profiling and bottleneck identification to improve throughput and latency, while reducing costs and enhancing tool efficiency through strategic orchestration and context usage optimization.","zh":"赋予代理优化多代理工作流的能力，利用 профилирование 和 瓶颈 识别来提高 吞吐量 和 延迟，同时通过 战略性 编排 和 上下文 使用 优化 来降低 成本 和 提高 工具 效率。","ja":"エージェントに、マルチエージェントのワークフローを最適化する能力を付与し、プロファイリングとボトルネックの特定を利用して、スループットと待機時間を改善し、戦略的なオーケストレーションとコンテキストの使用の最適化を通じて、コストを削減し、ツールの効率を高める。","ko":"에이전트가 다중 에이전트 워크플ロー 최적화를 가능하게 하며, 프로파일링 및 병목 지점 식별을 사용하여 처리량 및 대기 시간을 개선하고, 전략적 오케스트레이션 및 컨텍스트 사용 최적화를 통해 비용을 줄이고 도구 효율성을 향상합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a optimizar flujos de trabajo de múltiples agentes, aprovechando la creación de perfiles y la identificación de cuellos de botella para mejorar el rendimiento y la latencia, al tiempo que reduce los costos y mejora la eficiencia de las herramientas a través de la orquestación estratégica y la optimización del uso del contexto.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les flux de travail de plusieurs agents, en exploitant le profilage et l''identification des goulots d''étranglement pour améliorer le débit et la latence, tout en réduisant les coûts et en améliorant l''efficacité des outils grâce à une orchestration stratégique et à l''optimisation de l''utilisation du contexte.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Multi-Agent-Workflows zu optimieren, indem es Profilerstellung und Engpassidentifizierung nutzt, um die Durchlaufzeit und Latenz zu verbessern und gleichzeitig Kosten zu reduzieren und die Werkzeugeffizienz durch strategische Orchestrierung und Kontextnutzungsoptimierung zu steigern.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar fluxos de trabalho multi-agente, utilizando perfilagem e identificação de gargalos para melhorar o throughput e a latência, reduzindo custos e melhorando a eficiência das ferramentas por meio de orquestração estratégica e otimização do uso de contexto.","ru":"Позволяет агентам оптимизировать потоки работ нескольких агентов, используя профилирование и выявление узких мест для улучшения пропускной способности и задержки, при этом снижая затраты и повышая эффективность инструментов за счет стратегической оркестровки и оптимизации использования контекста.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تحسين تدفقات العمل متعددة الوكلاء، باستخدام الملف الشخصي وتحديد العيوب لتحسين الإنتاجية والكفاءة، وتقليل التكاليف وتحسين كفاءة الأدوات من خلال الأوركسترا الاستراتيجية وتحسين استخدام السياق"},"useCases":{"en":["Profiling agent workflows to identify and address bottlenecks","Designing and implementing efficient multi-agent orchestration strategies","Optimizing multi-agent systems for improved cost efficiency and context usage"],"zh":["对代理工作流进行 профилирование 以识别和解决 瓶颈","设计和实施 高效 的多代理 编排 策略","优化 多代理 系统 以提高 成本 效率 和 上下文 使用"],"ja":["エージェントのワークフローをプロファイリングしてボトルネックを特定して解決する","効率的なマルチエージェントのオーケストレーション戦略を設計して実装する","マルチエージェントシステムを最適化してコスト効率とコンテキストの使用を改善する"],"ko":["에이전트 워크플로우를 프로파일링하여 병목 지점을 식별하고 해결하는 것","효율적인 다중 에이전트 오케스트레이션 전략을 설계 및 구현하는 것","다중 에이전트 시스템을 최적화하여 비용 효율성 및 컨텍스트 사용을 개선하는 것"],"es":["Crear perfiles de flujos de trabajo de agentes para identificar y abordar cuellos de botella","Diseñar e implementar estrategias de orquestación de múltiples agentes eficientes","Optimizar sistemas de múltiples agentes para mejorar la eficiencia de costos y el uso del contexto"],"fr":["Profiler les flux de travail des agents pour identifier et résoudre les goulots d''étranglement","Concevoir et mettre en œuvre des stratégies d''orchestration de plusieurs agents efficaces","Optimiser les systèmes de plusieurs agents pour améliorer l''efficacité des coûts et l''utilisation du contexte"],"de":["Erstellen von Profilen für Agent-Workflows, um Engpässe zu identifizieren und zu beheben","Entwerfen und Implementieren effizienter Orchestrierungsstrategien für mehrere Agents","Optimieren von Multi-Agent-Systemen für verbesserte Kosteneffizienz und Kontextnutzung"],"pt":["Perfilagem de fluxos de trabalho de agentes para identificar e abordar gargalos","Desenvolvimento e implementação de estratégias de orquestração multi-agente eficientes","Otimização de sistemas multi-agente para melhor eficiência de custo e uso de contexto"],"ru":["Профилирование потоков работы агентов для выявления и устранения узких мест","Разработка и внедрение эффективных стратегий оркестровки нескольких агентов","Оптимизация систем нескольких агентов для улучшения стоимостной эффективности и использования контекста"],"ar":["إنشاء ملف شخصي لتدفقات العمل للوكلاء لتحديد ومعالجة العيوب","تصميم وتنفيذ استراتيجيات الأوركسترا متعددة الوكلاء الفعالة","تحسين أنظمة متعددة الوكلاء لتحسين كفاءة التكاليف واستخدام السياق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires measurable metrics and evaluation data for optimization","Not applicable for single-agent workflows or tasks unrelated to multi-agent orchestration"],"zh":["需要 可测量 的 指标 和 评估 数据 来 进行 优化","不适用于 单代理 工作流 或 与 多代理 编排 无关 的 任务"],"ja":["最適化を行うために、測定可能なメトリクスと評価データが必要","シングルエージェントのワークフローまたはマルチエージェントのオーケストレーションに関係しないタスクには適用できない"],"ko":["최적화를 수행하기 위해 측정 가능한 지표 및 평가 데이터가 필요합니다.","단일 에이전트 워크플로우 또는 다중 에이전트 오케스트레이션과 관련이 없는 작업에는 적용할 수 없습니다."],"es":["Requiere métricas medibles y datos de evaluación para la optimización","No es aplicable para flujos de trabajo de un solo agente o tareas no relacionadas con la orquestación de múltiples agentes"],"fr":["Nécessite des métriques mesurables et des données d''évaluation pour l''optimisation","N''est pas applicable pour les flux de travail d''un seul agent ou les tâches non liées à l''orchestration de plusieurs agents"],"de":["Benötigt messbare Metriken und Bewertungsdaten für die Optimierung","Nicht anwendbar für Workflows mit nur einem Agent oder Aufgaben, die nicht mit der Orchestrierung von mehreren Agents zusammenhängen"],"pt":["Exige métricas mensuráveis e dados de avaliação para otimização","Não se aplica a fluxos de trabalho de agente único ou tarefas não relacionadas à orquestração multi-agente"],"ru":["Требует измеримых метрик и данных оценки для оптимизации","Не применима к потокам работы одного агента или задачам, не связанным с оркестровкой нескольких агентов"],"ar":["يتطلب معايير قابلة للقياس وبيانات التقييم للتحسين","لا ينطبق على تدفقات عمل وكيل واحد أو المهام غير المرتبطة بمتعددة الوكلاء الأوركسترا"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('jbabin91/autocomplete-rs/beads-workflow', 'community', 'jbabin91', 'autocomplete-rs', 'jbabin91/autocomplete-rs', 'beads-workflow', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.422Z', '2026-02-18T04:32:53.610Z', NULL, '{"id":"jbabin91/autocomplete-rs/beads-workflow","name":"beads-workflow","description":{"zh":"Beads Workflow Rust ","ja":"Beads Workflow Rust","ko":"Beads Workflow Rust","es":"Beads Workflow es un motor de autocompletado de shell inteligente escrito en Rust, que optimiza el flujo de trabajo para agentes de codificación de IA.","fr":"Beads Workflow est un moteur de complétion de shell intelligent écrit en Rust, qui optimise le flux de travail pour les agents de codage IA.","de":"Beads Workflow ist ein intelligenter Shell-Vervollständigungsmotor in Rust, der den Arbeitsablauf für IA-Coding-Agenten optimiert.","pt":"Beads Workflow é um motor de conclusão de shell inteligente em Rust para automatizar tarefas de codificação","ru":"Beads Workflow - быстрый интеллектуальный движок ввода на Rust для автоматизации задач кодирования","ar":"بيدز وركفلو هو محرك استكمال شل ذكي مكتوب بلغة روست لتحسين مهام الترميز","en":"A fast, intelligent shell completion engine written in Rust"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Beads Workflow: Rust ","ja":"Beads Workflow: Rust","ko":"Beads Workflow: Rust","es":"Beads Workflow: Motor de autocompletado de shell inteligente","fr":"Beads Workflow: Moteur de complétion de shell intelligent","de":"Beads Workflow: Intelligenter Shell-Vervollständigungsmotor","pt":"Beads Workflow: Motor de Conclusão de Shell Inteligente","ru":"Beads Workflow: Быстрый Интеллектуальный Движок Ввода","ar":"بيدز وركفلو: محرك استكمال شل ذكي","en":"beads-workflow"},"description":{"zh":"Beads Workflow Rust ","ja":"Beads Workflow Rust","ko":"Beads Workflow Rust","es":"Beads Workflow es un motor de autocompletado de shell inteligente escrito en Rust, que optimiza el flujo de trabajo para agentes de codificación de IA.","fr":"Beads Workflow est un moteur de complétion de shell intelligent écrit en Rust, qui optimise le flux de travail pour les agents de codage IA.","de":"Beads Workflow ist ein intelligenter Shell-Vervollständigungsmotor in Rust, der den Arbeitsablauf für IA-Coding-Agenten optimiert.","pt":"Beads Workflow é um motor de conclusão de shell inteligente em Rust para automatizar tarefas de codificação","ru":"Beads Workflow - быстрый интеллектуальный движок ввода на Rust для автоматизации задач кодирования","ar":"بيدز وركفلو هو محرك استكمال شل ذكي مكتوب بلغة روست لتحسين مهام الترميز","en":"A fast, intelligent shell completion engine written in Rust"},"definition":{"en":"A fast, intelligent shell completion engine written in Rust"},"features":{"zh":["Rust","AI","","",""],"ja":["Rust","AI","","",""],"ko":["Rust","AI","","",""],"es":["Conversión de planes de markdown en tareas","Pulido iterativo de tareas a través de múltiples rondas y modelos","Coordinación de ejecución paralela a través de equipos de agentes de Claude Code","Optimización del flujo de trabajo para agentes de codificación de IA","Soporte para estructura de dependencia de tareas y subtareas"],"fr":["Conversion de plans markdown en tâches","Affinage itératif des tâches à travers plusieurs rondes et modèles","Coordination de l''exécution parallèle via des équipes d''agents de Claude Code","Optimisation du flux de travail pour les agents de codage IA","Prise en charge de la structure de dépendance des tâches et sous-tâches"],"de":["Konvertierung von Markdown-Plänen in Aufgaben","Iteratives Feinabstimmung von Aufgaben über mehrere Runden und Modelle","Koordination der parallelen Ausführung über Teams von Claude Code-Agents","Optimierung des Arbeitsablaufs für IA-Coding-Agenten","Unterstützung für Abhängigkeitsstruktur von Aufgaben und Unter-aufgaben"],"pt":["Conversão de planos em markdown para tarefas de codificação","Otimização de tarefas com dependência","Execução paralela via equipes de agentes Claude Code","Refinamento iterativo de tarefas","Suporte a múltiplos modelos"],"ru":["Преобразование планов в markdown в задачи кодирования","Оптимизация задач с зависимостью","Параллельное выполнение через команды агентов Claude Code","Итеративная доработка задач","Поддержка нескольких моделей"],"ar":["تحويل الخطط في تنسيق markdown إلى مهام ترميز","تحسين المهام مع الهيكل التبعي","تنفيذ متوازي عبر فرق وكلاء كلود كود","تحسين متكرر للمهام","دعم نماذج متعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Beads Workflow","Rust","AI","","Jira","Linear"],"ja":["Beads Workflow","Rust","AI","","Jira","Linear"],"ko":["Beads Workflow","Rust","AI","","Jira","Linear"],"es":["Beads Workflow","motor de autocompletado de shell","Rust","agentes de codificación de IA","flujo de trabajo","tareas","subtareas","estructura de dependencia","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["Beads Workflow","moteur de complétion de shell","Rust","agents de codage IA","flux de travail","tâches","sous-tâches","structure de dépendance","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Beads Workflow","Shell-Vervollständigungsmotor","Rust","IA-Coding-Agenten","Arbeitsablauf","Aufgaben","Unter-aufgaben","Abhängigkeitsstruktur","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["Beads Workflow","motor de conclusão de shell","Rust","automatização de tarefas","codificação","desenvolvimento de software","equipes de agentes"," Claude Code"],"ru":["Beads Workflow","движок ввода","Rust","автоматизация задач","кодирование","разработка программного обеспечения","команды агентов","Claude Code"],"ar":["بيدز وركفلو","محرك استكمال شل","روست","توصيل مهام","ترميز","تطوير برامج","فرق وكلاء","كلود كود"]}},"owner":"jbabin91","repo":"autocomplete-rs","repoPath":"jbabin91/autocomplete-rs","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.422Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"beads-workflow","description":"Converts markdown plans into beads (tasks with dependencies) and polishes them until implementation-ready. The bridge between planning and agent team execution. Use when converting a plan to beads, polishing bead descriptions, adding test coverage beads, reviewing bead dependencies, or preparing tasks for parallel agent team execution.","version":"1.1","bodyPreview":"# Beads Workflow\n\nBeads are epics, tasks, and subtasks with dependency structure, optimized for AI coding agents. They function like Jira or Linear but designed for machines. This skill covers the full lifecycle: converting markdown plans into beads, iteratively polishing them across multiple rounds and models, and coordinating parallel execution via Claude Code agent teams. Use this when you have a markdown plan and need to produce self-contained, implementation-ready tasks. Do not use this for","body":"# Beads Workflow\n\nBeads are epics, tasks, and subtasks with dependency structure, optimized for AI coding agents. They function like Jira or Linear but designed for machines. This skill covers the full lifecycle: converting markdown plans into beads, iteratively polishing them across multiple rounds and models, and coordinating parallel execution via Claude Code agent teams. Use this when you have a markdown plan and need to produce self-contained, implementation-ready tasks. Do not use this for the planning phase itself; use a planning skill for that.\n\n> **Core Principle:** \"Check your beads N times, implement once\" -- where N is as many as you can stomach.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Workflow             | What It Does                                                   | Key Detail                                                              |\n| -------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Plan to beads        | Converts a markdown plan into granular beads with dependencies | Use the full or short conversion prompt with `bd` tool                  |\n| Polish beads         | Iteratively reviews and improves bead quality                  | Run 6-9 rounds until steady-state; use full or standard prompt          |\n| Fresh session        | Breaks out of polishing plateaus                               | Start new session, re-establish context, then resume polishing          |\n| Cross-model review   | Gets alternative perspectives on bead quality                  | Run final pass with a different model (Codex, Gemini CLI)               |\n| Add test coverage    | Creates unit test and e2e test beads                           | Use the test coverage prompt to audit and fill gaps                     |\n| bd CLI basics        | Create, update, depend, close beads                            | Always use `bd` tool; never run bare `bv` (interactive TUI)             |\n| Robot mode           | Machine-readable bv output for agents                          | `bv --robot-triage`, `--robot-next`, `--robot-plan`, `--robot-insights` |\n| Agent team execution | Coordinate parallel bead execution via Claude Code agent teams | Beads = persistent truth; team tasks = ephemeral dispatch               |\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n| Mistake                                                  | Correct Pattern                                                                                                |\n| -------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Oversimplifying bead descriptions to short bullet points | Beads must be verbose and self-documenting with background, reasoning, and considerations                      |\n| Stopping after one polish round                          | Keep polishing until steady-state (typically 6-9 rounds); start a fresh session if progress flatlines          |\n| Omitting test coverage beads                             | Every feature bead should have associated unit test and e2e test beads with detailed logging                   |\n| Not making all blocking relationships explicit           | Use `bd depend` to declare every dependency; agents cannot infer implicit ordering                             |\n| Losing features from the original plan                   | Cross-check every plan section against beads; everything must be embedded so the plan is never consulted again |\n| Running bare `bv` without flags                          | Always use `bv --robot-*` flags; bare `bv` launches an interactive TUI that blocks agents                      |\n| Teammates editing the same files                         | Assign exclusive file ownership per teammate; work same-file beads sequentially                                |\n\n## Delegation\n\n- **Create initial beads from a markdown plan**: Use `Task` agent with the plan-to-beads prompt and `bd` tool access\n- **Polish beads across multiple rounds**: Use `Task` agent with the standard polish prompt, repeating until steady-state\n- **Review bead graph for cycles and missing dependencies**: Use `Explore` agent to run `bv --robot-insights` and validate the dependency structure\n- **Add test coverage beads**: Use `Task` agent with the test coverage prompt\n- **Execute beads in parallel**: Use agent teams -- lead discovers parallel tracks via `bd ready`/`bv --robot-plan`, spawns teammates with bead-scoped prompts, verifies and closes beads after completion\n\n## References\n\n- [Plan to Beads](references/plan-to-beads.md) -- Converting markdown plans into beads, exact prompts, what gets created\n- [Polishing Workflow](references/polishing-workflow.md) -- Polishing protocol, fresh session technique, cross-model review, quality checklist\n- [Agent Integration](references/agent-integration.md) -- bd CLI commands, robot mode, agent team execution, test coverage beads\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:32:53.610Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Coding Agents like Claude Code, AutoGPT, and LangChain needing intelligent task management and workflow optimization.","zh":"适用于Claude Code、AutoGPT和LangChain等AI编码代理，需要智能任务管理和工作流优化。","ja":"Claude Code、AutoGPT、LangChainなどのAIコーディングエージェントに適しており、知能なタスク管理とワークフローの最適化が必要です。","ko":"클라우드 코드, 오토지피티, 랭체인 등과 같은 AI 코딩 에이전트에 적합하며, 지능형 태스크 관리 및 워크플로 최적화가 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de codificación de IA como Claude Code, AutoGPT y LangChain que necesitan gestión de tareas inteligente y optimización de flujo de trabajo.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de codage IA comme Claude Code, AutoGPT et LangChain nécessitant une gestion de tâches intelligente et une optimisation du workflow.","de":"Ideal für AI-Coding-Agents wie Claude Code, AutoGPT und LangChain, die intelligente Aufgabenverwaltung und Workflow-Optimierung benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de codificação de IA como Claude Code, AutoGPT e LangChain que necessitam de gerenciamento de tarefas inteligente e otimização de fluxo de trabalho.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов кодирования ИИ, таких как Claude Code, AutoGPT и LangChain, которые требуют интеллектуального управления задачами и оптимизации рабочих процессов.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الترميز الاصطناعي مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT و LangChain الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة مهمات ذكية وتحسين سير العمل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to convert markdown plans into executable beads, leveraging dependency structures and parallel execution via Rust-based shell completion engines, and seamlessly integrating with Claude Code agent teams for iterative task polishing.","zh":"赋予代理将Markdown计划转换为可执行的任务，利用依赖结构和并行执行，通过基于Rust的shell完成引擎，并与Claude Code代理团队无缝集成，进行迭代任务抛光。","ja":"エージェントがマークダウン計画を実行可能なタスクに変換できるようにし、依存関係構造と並行実行を利用し、Rustベースのシェル完了エンジンを介して、Claude Codeエージェントチームとのシームレスな統合により、イテレーティブなタスク磨きを行う。","ko":"에이전트가 마크다운 계획을 실행 가능한 태스크로 변환할 수 있도록 하며, 의존 구조 및 병렬 실행을 활용하여, 러스트 기반 셸 완료 엔진을 통해 클라우드 코드 에이전트 팀과 무결점으로 통합되어, 반복적인 태스크 연마를 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a convertir planes de markdown en cuentas ejecutables, aprovechando estructuras de dependencia y ejecución paralela a través de motores de finalización de shell basados en Rust, e integrándose de forma transparente con equipos de agentes de Claude Code para pulir tareas de forma iterativa.","fr":"Permet aux agents de convertir des plans markdown en des tâches exécutables, en exploitant les structures de dépendance et l''exécution parallèle via des moteurs de complétion de shell basés sur Rust, et en s''intégrant de manière transparente avec les équipes d''agents de Claude Code pour affiner les tâches de manière itérative.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Markdown-Pläne in ausführbare Beads umzuwandeln, indem es Abhängigkeitsstrukturen und parallele Ausführung über Rust-basierte Shell-Vervollständigungs-Engines nutzt und nahtlos in Claude Code-Agententeams für iterative Aufgabenpolierung integriert.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a converter planos em markdown em tarefas prontas para execução, aproveitando estruturas de dependência e execução paralela via motores de conclusão de shell baseados em Rust, e integrando-se perfeitamente com equipes de agentes Claude Code para polir tarefas iterativamente.","ru":"Позволяет агентам преобразовывать планы в markdown в задачи, готовые к выполнению, используя структуры зависимостей и параллельное выполнение через движки завершения оболочки на основе Rust, и бесшовно интегрируясь с командами агентов Claude Code для итеративной полировки задач.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تحويل الخطط في markdown إلى مهام جاهزة للتنفيذ، مستفيدا من هياكل التبعية والتنفيذ المتوازي عبر محركات استكمال Shell المعتمدة على Rust، ودمجها بشكل متكامل مع فرق وكلاء Claude Code لتنقيح المهام بشكل متكرر."},"useCases":{"en":["Converting markdown plans into implementation-ready tasks","Iteratively polishing tasks across multiple rounds and models","Coordinating parallel execution of dependent tasks via agent teams"],"zh":["将Markdown计划转换为实现就绪的任务","在多个轮次和模型中迭代抛光任务","通过代理团队协调依赖任务的并行执行"],"ja":["マークダウン計画を実装可能なタスクに変換する","複数のラウンドとモデルを介してタスクをイテレーティブに磨き上げる","エージェントチームを介して依存タスクの並行実行を調整する"],"ko":["마크다운 계획을 구현 준비 태스크로 변환","여러 라운드와 모델을 통해 태스크를 반복적으로 연마","에이전트 팀을 통해 의존 태스크의 병렬 실행을 조정"],"es":["Convertir planes de markdown en tareas listas para la implementación","Pulir tareas de forma iterativa en varias rondas y modelos","Coordinar la ejecución paralela de tareas dependientes a través de equipos de agentes"],"fr":["Convertir des plans markdown en tâches prêtes à l''implémentation","Affiner les tâches de manière itérative sur plusieurs tours et modèles","Coordonner l''exécution parallèle de tâches dépendantes via des équipes d''agents"],"de":["Markdown-Pläne in implementierbare Aufgaben umwandeln","Aufgaben iterativ über mehrere Runden und Modelle polieren","Parallele Ausführung abhängiger Aufgaben über Agententeams koordinieren"],"pt":["Converter planos em markdown em tarefas prontas para implementação","Polir tarefas iterativamente em várias rodadas e modelos","Coordenar a execução paralela de tarefas dependentes via equipes de agentes"],"ru":["Преобразовывать планы в markdown в задачи, готовые к реализации","Итеративно полировать задачи в нескольких раундах и моделях","Координировать параллельное выполнение зависимых задач через команды агентов"],"ar":["تحويل الخطط في markdown إلى مهام جاهزة للتنفيذ","تنقيح المهام بشكل متكرر عبر جولات وطرازات متعددة","تنسيق التنفيذ المتوازي للمهام التابعة عبر فرق الوكلاء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires markdown plan as input","Designed specifically for machine-based task management, not human-centric project management tools like Jira or Linear"],"zh":["需要Markdown计划作为输入","专门为机器基于任务管理而设计，而不是人为中心的项目管理工具，如Jira或Linear"],"ja":["マークダウン計画を入力として必要とする","JiraやLinearなどの人間中心のプロジェクト管理ツールではなく、機械ベースのタスク管理のために特別に設計されている"],"ko":["마크다운 계획을 입력으로 필요로 함","지라 또는 리니어와 같은 인간 중심의 프로젝트 관리 도구가 아닌, 기계 기반의 태스크 관리를 위해 특별히 설계됨"],"es":["Requiere un plan de markdown como entrada","Diseñado específicamente para la gestión de tareas basada en máquina, no para herramientas de gestión de proyectos humanas como Jira o Linear"],"fr":["Nécessite un plan markdown comme entrée","Conçu spécifiquement pour la gestion de tâches basée sur la machine, et non pour les outils de gestion de projet humains comme Jira ou Linear"],"de":["Benötigt einen Markdown-Plan als Eingabe","Speziell für maschinenbasiertes Aufgabenmanagement und nicht für humanzentrierte Projektmanagement-Tools wie Jira oder Linear ausgelegt"],"pt":["Exige plano em markdown como entrada","Projetado especificamente para gerenciamento de tarefas baseado em máquina, não para ferramentas de gerenciamento de projetos humanas como Jira ou Linear"],"ru":["Требует плана в markdown в качестве входных данных","Разработан специально для машинного управления задачами, а не для инструментов управления проектами, ориентированных на человека, таких как Jira или Linear"],"ar":["يحتاج إلى خطة في markdown كمدخل","صمم خصيصا لإدارة المهام القائمة على الآلة، وليس لأدوات إدارة المشاريع البشرية مثل Jira أو Linear"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('EverHouse/everclubapp/code-reviewer', 'community', 'EverHouse', 'everclubapp', 'EverHouse/everclubapp', 'code-reviewer', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.422Z', '2026-02-18T04:33:35.145Z', NULL, '{"id":"EverHouse/everclubapp/code-reviewer","name":"code-reviewer","description":{"zh":"代码审查专家是一位具有12年以上经验的高级工程师，负责进行彻底的代码审查，以提高代码质量和共享知识","ja":"コードレビューエキスパートは、12年以上の経験を持つシニアエンジニアであり、コードの品質を高め、知識を共有するために徹底的なコードレビューを実施する","ko":"코드 리뷰어 전문가는 12년 이상의 경험을 가진 시니어 엔지니어로, 코드 품질을 향상시키고 지식을 공유하기 위해 철저한 코드 리뷰를 수행한다","es":"Un revisor de código es un ingeniero senior que realiza revisiones de código exhaustivas y constructivas para mejorar la calidad y compartir conocimientos.","fr":"Un réviseur de code est un ingénieur senior qui effectue des révisions de code exhaustives et constructives pour améliorer la qualité et partager des connaissances.","de":"Ein Code-Revisor ist ein Senior-Ingenieur, der gründliche und konstruktive Code-Reviews durchführt, um die Qualität zu verbessern und Wissen zu teilen.","pt":"O revisor de código é um engenheiro sênior que realiza revisões de código aprofundadas e construtivas para melhorar a qualidade e compartilhar conhecimento.","ru":"Код ревьювер - это главный инженер, который проводит тщательные и конструктивные проверки кода для улучшения качества и обмена знаниями.","ar":"مشرف الكود هو مهندس رئيسي ي执行 مراجعات الكود الشاملة والبناءة لتحسين الجودة ومشاركة المعرفة.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"代码审查专家","ja":"コードレビューエキスパート","ko":"코드 리뷰어 전문가","es":"Revisión de Código: Mejora la Calidad con un Revisor de C...","fr":"Révision de Code: Améliorez la Qualité avec un Réviseur d...","de":"Code-Review: Verbessern Sie die Qualität mit einem Code-R...","pt":"Revisão de Código: Melhore a Qualidade com um Revisor de ...","ru":"Проверка Код: Улучшите Качество с Помощью Код Ревьювера","ar":"مراجعة الكود: تح