API URLと環境変数の設定"],"ko":["API 요청","데이터 가져오기","캐싱","네트워크 디버깅","인증/토큰 관리","API URL 및 환경 변수 설정"],"es":["Solicitudes de API","Fetching de datos","Depuración de red","Implementación de caché","Gestión de autenticación y tokens","Configuración de URLs de API y variables de entorno"],"fr":["Requêtes API","Fetching de données","Débogage réseau","Mise en œuvre de cache","Gestion d''authentification et de jetons","Configuration des URLs d''API et des variables d''environnement"],"de":["API-Anfragen","Datenabruf","Netzwerksdebugging","Implementierung von Cache","Authentifizierungs- und Token-Management","Konfiguration von API-URLs und Umgebungsvariablen"],"pt":["Requisições de API eficientes","Fetching de dados com React Query e SWR","Caching e gerenciamento de tokens","Depuração de falhas de rede","Configuração de URLs de API e variáveis de ambiente"],"ru":["Эффективные запросы API","Загрузка данных с помощью React Query и SWR","Кэширование и управление токенами","Отладка сетевых сбоев","Настройка URL-адресов API и переменных среды"],"ar":["طلبات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات الفعالة","جلب البيانات باستخدام React Query و SWR","التخزين المؤقت وإدارة الرموز","تصحيح أعطال الشبكة","تكوين عناوين Url لواجهة برمجة التطبيقات ومتغيرات البيئة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Expo Networking","原生数据获取","API请求","数据获取","缓存","网络调试","身份验证","令牌管理"],"ja":["Expo Networking","ネイティブデータ取得","APIリクエスト","データ取得","キャッシュ","ネットワークデバッグ","認証","トークン管理"],"ko":["Expo Networking","네이티브 데이터 가져오기","API 요청","데이터 가져오기","캐싱","네트워크 디버깅","인증","토큰 관리"],"es":["Native Data Fetching","Expo","Laravel","API","Fetching de datos","Depuración de red","Caché","Autenticación","Tokens"],"fr":["Native Data Fetching","Expo","Laravel","API","Fetching de données","Débogage réseau","Cache","Authentification","Jetons"],"de":["Native Data Fetching","Expo","Laravel","API","Datenabruf","Netzwerksdebugging","Cache","Authentifizierung","Token"],"pt":["Native Data Fetching","Requisições de API","Fetching de dados","Caching","React Query","SWR","Depuração de falhas de rede","Configuração de URLs de API"],"ru":["Нативная Загрузка Данных","Запросы API","Загрузка данных","Кэширование","React Query","SWR","Отладка сетевых сбоев","Настройка URL-адресов API"],"ar":["التحميل المحلي للبيانات","طلبات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","جلب البيانات","التخزين المؤقت","React Query","SWR","تصحيح أعطال الشبكة","تكوين عناوين Url لواجهة برمجة التطبيقات"]}},"owner":"Liinkiing","repo":"larastack","repoPath":"Liinkiing/larastack","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.422Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"native-data-fetching","description":"Use when implementing or debugging ANY network request, API call, or data fetching. Covers fetch API, axios, React Query, SWR, error handling, caching strategies, offline support.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Expo Networking\n\n**You MUST use this skill for ANY networking work including API requests, data fetching, caching, or network debugging.**\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this router when:\n\n- Implementing API requests\n- Setting up data fetching (React Query, SWR)\n- Debugging network failures\n- Implementing caching strategies\n- Handling offline scenarios\n- Authentication/token management\n- Configuring API URLs and environment variables\n\n## Preferences\n\n- Avoid axios, prefer expo/fetch\n\n## Common Issues &","body":"# Expo Networking\n\n**You MUST use this skill for ANY networking work including API requests, data fetching, caching, or network debugging.**\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this router when:\n\n- Implementing API requests\n- Setting up data fetching (React Query, SWR)\n- Debugging network failures\n- Implementing caching strategies\n- Handling offline scenarios\n- Authentication/token management\n- Configuring API URLs and environment variables\n\n## Preferences\n\n- Avoid axios, prefer expo/fetch\n\n## Common Issues & Solutions\n\n### 1. Basic Fetch Usage\n\n**Simple GET request**:\n\n```tsx\nconst fetchUser = async (userId: string) => {\n  const response = await fetch(`https://api.example.com/users/${userId}`);\n\n  if (!response.ok) {\n    throw new Error(`HTTP error! status: ${response.status}`);\n  }\n\n  return response.json();\n};\n```\n\n**POST request with body**:\n\n```tsx\nconst createUser = async (userData: UserData) => {\n  const response = await fetch(\"https://api.example.com/users\", {\n    method: \"POST\",\n    headers: {\n      \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n      Authorization: `Bearer ${token}`,\n    },\n    body: JSON.stringify(userData),\n  });\n\n  if (!response.ok) {\n    const error = await response.json();\n    throw new Error(error.message);\n  }\n\n  return response.json();\n};\n```\n\n---\n\n### 2. React Query (TanStack Query)\n\n**Setup**:\n\n```tsx\n// app/_layout.tsx\nimport { QueryClient, QueryClientProvider } from \"@tanstack/react-query\";\n\nconst queryClient = new QueryClient({\n  defaultOptions: {\n    queries: {\n      staleTime: 1000 * 60 * 5, // 5 minutes\n      retry: 2,\n    },\n  },\n});\n\nexport default function RootLayout() {\n  return (\n    <QueryClientProvider client={queryClient}>\n      <Stack />\n    </QueryClientProvider>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n**Fetching data**:\n\n```tsx\nimport { useQuery } from \"@tanstack/react-query\";\n\nfunction UserProfile({ userId }: { userId: string }) {\n  const { data, isLoading, error, refetch } = useQuery({\n    queryKey: [\"user\", userId],\n    queryFn: () => fetchUser(userId),\n  });\n\n  if (isLoading) return <Loading />;\n  if (error) return <Error message={error.message} />;\n\n  return <Profile user={data} />;\n}\n```\n\n**Mutations**:\n\n```tsx\nimport { useMutation, useQueryClient } from \"@tanstack/react-query\";\n\nfunction CreateUserForm() {\n  const queryClient = useQueryClient();\n\n  const mutation = useMutation({\n    mutationFn: createUser,\n    onSuccess: () => {\n      // Invalidate and refetch\n      queryClient.invalidateQueries({ queryKey: [\"users\"] });\n    },\n  });\n\n  const handleSubmit = (data: UserData) => {\n    mutation.mutate(data);\n  };\n\n  return <Form onSubmit={handleSubmit} isLoading={mutation.isPending} />;\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### 3. Error Handling\n\n**Comprehensive error handling**:\n\n```tsx\nclass ApiError extends Error {\n  constructor(message: string, public status: number, public code?: string) {\n    super(message);\n    this.name = \"ApiError\";\n  }\n}\n\nconst fetchWithErrorHandling = async (url: string, options?: RequestInit) => {\n  try {\n    const response = await fetch(url, options);\n\n    if (!response.ok) {\n      const error = await response.json().catch(() => ({}));\n      throw new ApiError(\n        error.message || \"Request failed\",\n        response.status,\n        error.code\n      );\n    }\n\n    return response.json();\n  } catch (error) {\n    if (error instanceof ApiError) {\n      throw error;\n    }\n    // Network error (no internet, timeout, etc.)\n    throw new ApiError(\"Network error\", 0, \"NETWORK_ERROR\");\n  }\n};\n```\n\n**Retry logic**:\n\n```tsx\nconst fetchWithRetry = async (\n  url: string,\n  options?: RequestInit,\n  retries = 3\n) => {\n  for (let i = 0; i < retries; i++) {\n    try {\n      return await fetchWithErrorHandling(url, options);\n    } catch (error) {\n      if (i === retries - 1) throw error;\n      // Exponential backoff\n      await new Promise((r) => setTimeout(r, Math.pow(2, i) * 1000));\n    }\n  }\n};\n```\n\n---\n\n### 4. Authentication\n\n**Token management**:\n\n```tsx\nimport * as SecureStore from \"expo-secure-store\";\n\nconst TOKEN_KEY = \"auth_token\";\n\nexport const auth = {\n  getToken: () => SecureStore.getItemAsync(TOKEN_KEY),\n  setToken: (token: string) => SecureStore.setItemAsync(TOKEN_KEY, token),\n  removeToken: () => SecureStore.deleteItemAsync(TOKEN_KEY),\n};\n\n// Authenticated fetch wrapper\nconst authFetch = async (url: string, options: RequestInit = {}) => {\n  const token = await auth.getToken();\n\n  return fetch(url, {\n    ...options,\n    headers: {\n      ...options.headers,\n      Authorization: token ? `Bearer ${token}` : \"\",\n    },\n  });\n};\n```\n\n**Token refresh**:\n\n```tsx\nlet isRefreshing = false;\nlet refreshPromise: Promise<string> | null = null;\n\nconst getValidToken = async (): Promise<string> => {\n  const token = await auth.getToken();\n\n  if (!token || isTokenExpired(token)) {\n    if (!isRefreshing) {\n      isRefreshing = true;\n      refreshPromise = refreshToken().finally(() => {\n        isRefreshing = false;\n        refreshPromise = null;\n      });\n    }\n    return refreshPromise!;\n  }\n\n  return token;\n};\n```\n\n---\n\n### 5. Offline Support\n\n**Check network status**:\n\n```tsx\nimport NetInfo from \"@react-native-community/netinfo\";\n\n// Hook for network status\nfunction useNetworkStatus() {\n  const [isOnline, setIsOnline] = useState(true);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    return NetInfo.addEventListener((state) => {\n      setIsOnline(state.isConnected ?? true);\n    });\n  }, []);\n\n  return isOnline;\n}\n```\n\n**Offline-first with React Query**:\n\n```tsx\nimport { onlineManager } from \"@tanstack/react-query\";\nimport NetInfo from \"@react-native-community/netinfo\";\n\n// Sync React Query with network status\nonlineManager.setEventListener((setOnline) => {\n  return NetInfo.addEventListener((state) => {\n    setOnline(state.isConnected ?? true);\n  });\n});\n\n// Queries will pause when offline and resume when online\n```\n\n---\n\n### 6. Environment Variables\n\n**Using environment variables for API configuration**:\n\nExpo supports environment variables with the `EXPO_PUBLIC_` prefix. These are inlined at build time and available in your JavaScript code.\n\n```tsx\n// .env\nEXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.example.com\nEXPO_PUBLIC_API_VERSION=v1\n\n// Usage in code\nconst API_URL = process.env.EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL;\n\nconst fetchUsers = async () => {\n  const response = await fetch(`${API_URL}/users`);\n  return response.json();\n};\n```\n\n**Environment-specific configuration**:\n\n```tsx\n// .env.development\nEXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:3000\n\n// .env.production\nEXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.production.com\n```\n\n**Creating an API client with environment config**:\n\n```tsx\n// api/client.ts\nconst BASE_URL = process.env.EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL;\n\nif (!BASE_URL) {\n  throw new Error(\"EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL is not defined\");\n}\n\nexport const apiClient = {\n  get: async <T,>(path: string): Promise<T> => {\n    const response = await fetch(`${BASE_URL}${path}`);\n    if (!response.ok) throw new Error(`HTTP ${response.status}`);\n    return response.json();\n  },\n\n  post: async <T,>(path: string, body: unknown): Promise<T> => {\n    const response = await fetch(`${BASE_URL}${path}`, {\n      method: \"POST\",\n      headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n      body: JSON.stringify(body),\n    });\n    if (!response.ok) throw new Error(`HTTP ${response.status}`);\n    return response.json();\n  },\n};\n```\n\n**Important notes**:\n\n- Only variables prefixed with `EXPO_PUBLIC_` are exposed to the client bundle\n- Never put secrets (API keys with write access, database passwords) in `EXPO_PUBLIC_` variables—they''re visible in the built app\n- Environment variables are inlined at **build time**, not runtime\n- Restart the dev server after changing `.env` files\n- For server-side secrets in API routes, use variables without the `EXPO_PUBLIC_` prefix\n\n**TypeScript support**:\n\n```tsx\n// types/env.d.ts\ndeclare global {\n  namespace NodeJS {\n    interface ProcessEnv {\n      EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL: string;\n      EXPO_PUBLIC_API_VERSION?: string;\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nexport {};\n```\n\n---\n\n### 7. Request Cancellation\n\n**Cancel on unmount**:\n\n```tsx\nuseEffect(() => {\n  const controller = new AbortController();\n\n  fetch(url, { signal: controller.signal })\n    .then((response) => response.json())\n    .then(setData)\n    .catch((error) => {\n      if (error.name !== \"AbortError\") {\n        setError(error);\n      }\n    });\n\n  return () => controller.abort();\n}, [url]);\n```\n\n**With React Query** (automatic):\n\n```tsx\n// React Query automatically cancels requests when queries are invalidated\n// or components unmount\n```\n\n---\n\n## Decision Tree\n\n```\nUser asks about networking\n  |-- Basic fetch?\n  |   \\-- Use fetch API with error handling\n  |\n  |-- Need caching/state management?\n  |   |-- Complex app -> React Query (TanStack Query)\n  |   \\-- Simpler needs -> SWR or custom hooks\n  |\n  |-- Authentication?\n  |   |-- Token storage -> expo-secure-store\n  |   \\-- Token refresh -> Implement refresh flow\n  |\n  |-- Error handling?\n  |   |-- Network errors -> Check connectivity first\n  |   |-- HTTP errors -> Parse response, throw typed errors\n  |   \\-- Retries -> Exponential backoff\n  |\n  |-- Offline support?\n  |   |-- Check status -> NetInfo\n  |   \\-- Queue requests -> React Query persistence\n  |\n  |-- Environment/API config?\n  |   |-- Client-side URLs -> EXPO_PUBLIC_ prefix in .env\n  |   |-- Server secrets -> Non-prefixed env vars (API routes only)\n  |   \\-- Multiple environments -> .env.development, .env.production\n  |\n  \\-- Performance?\n      |-- Caching -> React Query with staleTime\n      |-- Deduplication -> React Query handles this\n      \\-- Cancellation -> AbortController or React Query\n```\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n**Wrong: No error handling**\n\n```tsx\nconst data = await fetch(url).then((r) => r.json());\n```\n\n**Right: Check response status**\n\n```tsx\nconst response = await fetch(url);\nif (!response.ok) throw new Error(`HTTP ${response.status}`);\nconst data = await response.json();\n```\n\n**Wrong: Storing tokens in AsyncStorage**\n\n```tsx\nawait AsyncStorage.setItem(\"token\", token); // Not secure!\n```\n\n**Right: Use SecureStore for sensitive data**\n\n```tsx\nawait SecureStore.setItemAsync(\"token\", token);\n```\n\n## Example Invocations\n\nUser: \"How do I make API calls in React Native?\"\n-> Use fetch, wrap with error handling\n\nUser: \"Should I use React Query or SWR?\"\n-> React Query for complex apps, SWR for simpler needs\n\nUser: \"My app needs to work offline\"\n-> Use NetInfo for status, React Query persistence for caching\n\nUser: \"How do I handle authentication tokens?\"\n-> Store in expo-secure-store, implement refresh flow\n\nUser: \"API calls are slow\"\n-> Check caching strategy, use React Query staleTime\n\nUser: \"How do I configure different API URLs for dev and prod?\"\n-> Use EXPO*PUBLIC* env vars with .env.development and .env.production files\n\nUser: \"Where should I put my API key?\"\n-> Client-safe keys: EXPO*PUBLIC* in .env. Secret keys: non-prefixed env vars in API routes only\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:33:19.202Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full Stack Agents needing native data fetching and caching capabilities in Expo and React applications.","zh":"非常适合需要在Expo和React应用程序中实现原生数据获取和缓存功能的全栈代理。","ja":"ExpoおよびReactアプリケーションでネイティブデータ取得およびキャッシュ機能を必要とするフルスタックエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Expo 및 React 응용 프로그램에서 네이티브 데이터 가져오기 및 캐싱 기능이 필요한 풀 스택 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Full Stack que necesitan capacidades de obtención y almacenamiento en caché de datos nativos en Expo y aplicaciones React.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full Stack ayant besoin de capacités de récupération et de mise en cache de données natives dans Expo et les applications React.","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agents, die native Datenabruf- und Cachefunktionen in Expo- und React-Anwendungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full Stack que necessitam de capacidades de busca e cache de dados nativos em aplicações Expo e React.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Full Stack, которым необходимы родные возможности извлечения и кэширования данных в приложениях Expo и React.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الويب الكامل الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات استرجاع البيانات والذاكرة المؤقتة الأصليين في تطبيقات Expo و React."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to handle API requests, data fetching, and caching using Expo''s fetch API, while also supporting React Query and SWR for robust data management, and OAuth authentication with Socialite.","zh":"赋予代理处理API请求、数据获取和缓存的能力，使用Expo的fetch API，同时支持React Query和SWR进行强大的数据管理，并支持Socialite的OAuth身份验证。","ja":"エージェントに、Expoのfetch APIを使用してAPIリクエスト、データ取得、およびキャッシュを処理する機能を与え、React QueryおよびSWRによるロバストなデータ管理をサポートし、SocialiteによるOAuth認証もサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 Expo의 fetch API를 사용하여 API 요청, 데이터 가져오기 및 캐싱을 처리할 수 있도록 하며, React Query 및 SWR를 통해 강력한 데이터 관리를 지원하며, Socialite를 통한 OAuth 인증도 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a manejar solicitudes de API, obtener y almacenar en caché datos utilizando la API de fetch de Expo, y también soporta React Query y SWR para una gestión de datos robusta, y autenticación OAuth con Socialite.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les requêtes API, de récupérer et de mettre en cache des données en utilisant l''API de fetch d''Expo, et prend également en charge React Query et SWR pour une gestion de données robuste, ainsi que l''authentification OAuth avec Socialite.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, API-Anfragen zu bearbeiten, Daten abzurufen und zu cachen, indem sie die Fetch-API von Expo verwenden, und unterstützt auch React Query und SWR für eine robuste Datenverwaltung sowie OAuth-Authentifizierung mit Socialite.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a lidar com solicitações de API, busca de dados e cache usando a API de busca do Expo, além de suportar React Query e SWR para gerenciamento robusto de dados e autenticação OAuth com Socialite.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обрабатывать запросы API, извлечение данных и кэширование с использованием API fetch от Expo, а также поддерживает React Query и SWR для надежного управления данными и аутентификации OAuth с Socialite.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على التعامل مع طلبات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات واسترجاع البيانات والذاكرة المؤقتة باستخدام واجهة برمجة التطبيقات لاسترجاع Expo، بالإضافة إلى دعم استعلام React و SWR لإدارة البيانات القوية وتوثيق OAuth مع Socialite."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing API requests with expo/fetch","Setting up data fetching and caching with React Query or SWR","Debugging network failures and handling offline scenarios","Managing authentication and tokens with Socialite"],"zh":["使用expo/fetch实现API请求","使用React Query或SWR设置数据获取和缓存","调试网络故障并处理离线场景","使用Socialite管理身份验证和令牌"],"ja":["expo/fetchを使用したAPIリクエストの実装","React QueryまたはSWRを使用したデータ取得およびキャッシュの設定","ネットワーク障害のデバッグとオフラインシナリオの処理","Socialiteを使用した認証およびトークンの管理"],"ko":["expo/fetch를 사용한 API 요청 구현","React Query 또는 SWR를 사용한 데이터 가져오기 및 캐싱 설정","네트워크 오류 디버깅 및 오프라인 시나리오 처리","Socialite를 사용한 인증 및 토큰 관리"],"es":["Implementar solicitudes de API con expo/fetch","Configurar la obtención y almacenamiento en caché de datos con React Query o SWR","Depurar fallos de red y manejar escenarios sin conexión","Administrar la autenticación y los tokens con Socialite"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des requêtes API avec expo/fetch","Configurer la récupération et la mise en cache de données avec React Query ou SWR","Déboguer les défaillances du réseau et gérer les scénarios hors ligne","Gérer l''authentification et les jetons avec Socialite"],"de":["Implementierung von API-Anfragen mit expo/fetch","Einrichten von Datenabruf und Caching mit React Query oder SWR","Fehlerbehebung bei Netzwerkfehlern und Handhabung von Offline-Szenarien","Verwaltung von Authentifizierung und Token mit Socialite"],"pt":["Implementar solicitações de API com expo/fetch","Configurar busca de dados e cache com React Query ou SWR","Depurar falhas de rede e lidar com cenários offline","Gerenciar autenticação e tokens com Socialite"],"ru":["Реализация запросов API с помощью expo/fetch","Настройка извлечения данных и кэширования с помощью React Query или SWR","Отладка сбоев сети и обработка офлайн-сценариев","Управление аутентификацией и токенами с помощью Socialite"],"ar":["تنفيذ طلبات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات باستخدام expo/fetch","تكوين استرجاع البيانات والذاكرة المؤقتة باستخدام استعلام React أو SWR","تصحيح الأعطال الشبكية وتعامل السيناريوهات دون اتصال","إدارة التوثيق والإشارات مع Socialite"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Expo environment","Prefer expo/fetch over axios","Limited to OAuth authentication with Socialite"],"zh":["需要Expo环境","更喜欢使用expo/fetch而不是axios","仅限Socialite的OAuth身份验证"],"ja":["Expo環境が必要","axiosよりもexpo/fetchを優先する","SocialiteのOAuth認証のみ"],"ko":["Expo 환경 필요","axios보다 expo/fetch를 선호","Socialite의 OAuth 인증만"],"es":["Requiere entorno Expo","Preferir expo/fetch sobre axios","Limitado a autenticación OAuth con Socialite"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Expo","Préférer expo/fetch à axios","Limité à l''authentification OAuth avec Socialite"],"de":["Benötigt Expo-Umgebung","Bevorzugung von expo/fetch gegenüber axios","Begrenzt auf OAuth-Authentifizierung mit Socialite"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Expo","Preferir expo/fetch em vez de axios","Limitado à autenticação OAuth com Socialite"],"ru":["Требуется среда Expo","Предпочтение expo/fetch вместо axios","Ограничен аутентификацией OAuth с Socialite"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Expo","الاعتماد على expo/fetch بدلاً من axios","محدود بالتوثيق OAuth مع Socialite"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
