ura de Azure a partir de plantillas ARM o descripciones en lenguaje natural.","fr":"Le générateur de diagrammes Azure crée des diagrammes d''architecture d''infrastructure Azure à partir de modèles ARM ou de descriptions en langage naturel.","de":"Der Azure-Diagramm-Generator erstellt Azure-Infrastruktur-Architekturdiagramme aus ARM-Vorlagen oder natürlichen Sprachbeschreibungen.","pt":"O Gerador de Diagramas Azure cria representações visuais da infraestrutura Azure a partir de modelos ARM, saída do Azure CLI ou descrições em linguagem natural","ru":"Генератор диаграмм Azure создает визуальные представления инфраструктуры Azure из шаблонов ARM, вывода Azure CLI или описаний на естественном языке","ar":"مُولِد رسومات أزور يخلق تمثيلات بصرية للبنية التحتية لأزور باستخدام قوالب ARM أو إخراج Azure CLI أو описات لغة طبيعية","en":"sarthakdev.me"},"definition":{"en":"sarthakdev.me"},"features":{"zh":["ARM","Azure CLI","Azure","JSON","Azure","VNets"],"ja":["ARM","Azure CLI","Azure","JSON","Azure","VNets"],"ko":["ARM","Azure CLI","Azure","JSON","Azure","VNets"],"es":["Generación de diagramas de arquitectura de Azure","Compatibilidad con plantillas ARM y salida de Azure CLI","Descripciones en lenguaje natural para la generación de diagramas","Visualización de recursos de Azure","Soporte para varios servicios de Azure"],"fr":["Génération de diagrammes d''architecture Azure","Prise en charge de modèles ARM et de sortie Azure CLI","Descriptions en langage naturel pour la génération de diagrammes","Visualisation de ressources Azure","Prise en charge de plusieurs services Azure"],"de":["Erstellung von Azure-Architekturdiagrammen","Unterstützung für ARM-Vorlagen und Azure-CLI-Ausgaben","Natürliche Sprachbeschreibungen für die Erstellung von Diagrammen","Visualisierung von Azure-Ressourcen","Unterstützung für mehrere Azure-Dienste"],"pt":["Geração de diagramas de arquitetura a partir de modelos ARM","Suporte à saída do Azure CLI","Criação de diagramas a partir de descrições em linguagem natural","Visualização de recursos Azure","Suporte a serviços Azure como Máquinas Virtuais, Contas de Armazenamento e VNets"],"ru":["Генерация диаграмм архитектуры из шаблонов ARM","Поддержка вывода Azure CLI","Создание диаграмм из описаний на естественном языке","Визуализация ресурсов Azure","Поддержка сервисов Azure, таких как Виртуальные Машины, Учетные Записи Хранилища и VNets"],"ar":["إنشاء مخططات بنية تحتية باستخدام قوالب ARM","دعم إخراج Azure CLI","إنشاء مخططات من описات لغة طبيعية","تمثيل موارد أزور","دعم خدمات أزور مثل الماكينات الافتراضية و حسابات التخزين و VNets"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Azure","ARM","Azure CLI","Azure","JSON","Azure","VNets","Azure"],"ja":["Azure","ARM","Azure CLI","Azure","JSON","Azure","VNets","Azure"],"ko":["Azure","ARM","Azure CLI","Azure","JSON","Azure","VNets","Azure"],"es":["Azure","diagramas de Azure","generador de diagramas","ARM","Azure CLI","infrastructure como código","visualización de recursos"],"fr":["Azure","diagrammes Azure","générateur de diagrammes","ARM","Azure CLI","infrastructure en tant que code","visualisation de ressources"],"de":["Azure","Azure-Diagramme","Diagramm-Generator","ARM","Azure-CLI","Infrastruktur als Code","Visualisierung von Ressourcen"],"pt":["Azure Diagram Generator","Gerador de Diagramas Azure","ARM templates","Azure CLI","Infraestrutura Azure","Recursos Azure","Serviços Azure"],"ru":["Генератор диаграмм Azure","Azure Diagram Generator","Шаблоны ARM","Azure CLI","Инфраструктура Azure","Ресурсы Azure","Сервисы Azure"],"ar":["مُولِد رسومات أزور","Azure Diagram Generator","قوالب ARM","Azure CLI","بنية تحتية أزور","موارد أزور","خدمات أزور"]}},"owner":"gamingopgamingop","repo":"sarthak-skill-forge","repoPath":"gamingopgamingop/sarthak-skill-forge","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.422Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"azure-diagrams","description":"Visualizes Azure infrastructure from ARM templates, Azure CLI, or descriptions. Use when user has Azure resources to diagram.","version":"1.0.0","tags":"azure, diagram, arm, resource-group, vnet, vm, storage, infrastructure","bodyPreview":"# Azure Diagram Generator\n\nGenerates architecture diagrams for Azure infrastructure from ARM templates, Azure CLI output, or natural language descriptions.\n\n## When to Use\n\nActivate this skill when:\n\n- User has ARM (Azure Resource Manager) templates (JSON)\n- User provides Azure CLI output (e.g., `az vm list`)\n- User wants to visualize Azure resources\n- User mentions Azure services (Virtual Machines, Storage Accounts, VNets, etc.)\n- User asks to \"diagram my Azure infrastructure\"\n\n## How It Works","body":"# Azure Diagram Generator\n\nGenerates architecture diagrams for Azure infrastructure from ARM templates, Azure CLI output, or natural language descriptions.\n\n## When to Use\n\nActivate this skill when:\n\n- User has ARM (Azure Resource Manager) templates (JSON)\n- User provides Azure CLI output (e.g., `az vm list`)\n- User wants to visualize Azure resources\n- User mentions Azure services (Virtual Machines, Storage Accounts, VNets, etc.)\n- User asks to \"diagram my Azure infrastructure\"\n\n## How It Works\n\nThis skill generates Azure-specific diagrams by parsing Azure resources and calling the Eraser API directly:\n\n1. **Parse Azure Resources**: Extract resources from ARM templates, CLI output, or descriptions\n2. **Map Azure Relationships**: Identify Resource Groups, VNets, subnets, and service connections\n3. **Generate Eraser DSL**: Create Eraser DSL code from Azure resources\n4. **Call Eraser API**: Use `/api/render/elements` with `diagramType: \"cloud-architecture-diagram\"`\n\n## Instructions\n\nWhen the user provides Azure infrastructure information:\n\n1. **Parse the Source**\n\n   - **ARM Templates**: Extract `resources` array, identify types (Microsoft.Compute/virtualMachines, etc.)\n   - **CLI Output**: Parse JSON output from `az` commands\n   - **Description**: Identify Azure service names and relationships\n\n2. **Identify Azure Components**\n\n   - **Networking**: Virtual Networks (VNets), Subnets, Network Security Groups, Load Balancers\n   - **Compute**: Virtual Machines, Virtual Machine Scale Sets, App Services, Functions\n   - **Storage**: Storage Accounts, Blob Storage, File Shares\n   - **Databases**: SQL Databases, Cosmos DB, Redis Cache\n   - **Security**: Network Security Groups, Azure AD, Key Vault\n   - **Load Balancing**: Application Gateway, Load Balancer, Traffic Manager\n   - **Other**: Service Bus, Event Hubs, API Management\n\n3. **Map Relationships**\n\n   - VMs in subnets\n   - Subnets in VNets\n   - VNets in Resource Groups\n   - Storage accounts accessed by VMs\n   - Databases accessed by applications\n   - Network Security Groups attached to subnets\n\n4. **Generate Eraser DSL** Convert Azure resources to Eraser DSL:\n\n   - **CRITICAL: Label Formatting Rules**\n     - Labels MUST be on a single line - NEVER use newlines inside label attributes\n     - Keep labels simple and readable - prefer separate labels over concatenating too much metadata\n     - Format DSL with proper line breaks (one node/group per line, but labels stay on single lines)\n     - If including metadata like CIDR blocks or instance types, include them in the same quoted label string: `[label: \"VNet 10.0.0.0/16\"]`\n\n   Example:\n\n   ```\n   myVNet [label: \"VNet 10.0.0.0/16\"] {\n     subnet1 [label: \"Subnet 1\"] {\n       myVM [icon: azure-vm, label: \"Virtual Machine\"]\n       gateway [icon: azure-app-gateway]\n     }\n     subnet2 [label: \"Subnet 2\"] {\n       database [icon: azure-sql]\n     }\n   }\n   storage [icon: azure-storage]\n   myVNet -> myVM\n   myVM -> database\n   ```\n\n5. **Make the HTTP Request**\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: You MUST execute this curl command after generating the DSL. Never stop after generating DSL without making the API call.\n\n   **CRITICAL**: In the `X-Skill-Source` header below, you MUST replace the value with your AI agent name:\n   - If you are Claude (Anthropic), use: `claude`\n   - If you are running in Cursor, use: `cursor`\n   - If you are ChatGPT (OpenAI), use: `chatgpt`\n   - If you are Gemini (Google), use: `gemini`\n   - Otherwise, use your model/agent name in lowercase\n\n   ```bash\n   curl -X POST https://app.eraser.io/api/render/elements \\\n     -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n     -H \"X-Skill-Source: eraser-skill\" \\\n     -H \"Authorization: Bearer ${ERASER_API_KEY}\" \\\n     -d ''{\n       \"elements\": [{\n         \"type\": \"diagram\",\n         \"id\": \"diagram-1\",\n         \"code\": \"<your generated DSL>\",\n         \"diagramType\": \"cloud-architecture-diagram\"\n       }],\n       \"scale\": 2,\n       \"theme\": \"${ERASER_THEME:-dark}\",\n       \"background\": true\n     }''\n   ```\n\n6. **Track Sources During Analysis**\n\n   As you analyze files and resources to generate the diagram, track:\n\n   - **Internal files**: Record each file path you read and what information was extracted (e.g., `infra/main.bicep` - VNet and subnet definitions)\n   - **External references**: Note any documentation, examples, or URLs consulted (e.g., Azure architecture best practices documentation)\n   - **Annotations**: For each source, note what it contributed to the diagram\n\n7. **Handle the Response**\n\n   **CRITICAL: Minimal Output Format**\n\n   Your response MUST always include these elements with clear headers:\n\n   1. **Diagram Preview**: Display with a header\n      ```\n      ## Diagram\n      ![{Title}]({imageUrl})\n      ```\n      Use the ACTUAL `imageUrl` from the API response.\n\n   2. **Editor Link**: Display with a header\n      ```\n      ## Open in Eraser\n      [Edit this diagram in the Eraser editor]({createEraserFileUrl})\n      ```\n      Use the ACTUAL URL from the API response.\n\n   3. **Sources section**: Brief list of files/resources analyzed (if applicable)\n      ```\n      ## Sources\n      - `path/to/file` - What was extracted\n      ```\n\n   4. **Diagram Code section**: The Eraser DSL in a code block with `eraser` language tag\n      ```\n      ## Diagram Code\n      ```eraser\n      {DSL code here}\n      ```\n      ```\n\n   5. **Learn More link**: `You can learn more about Eraser at https://docs.eraser.io/docs/using-ai-agent-integrations`\n\n   **Additional content rules:**\n   - If the user ONLY asked for a diagram, include NOTHING beyond the 5 elements above\n   - If the user explicitly asked for more (e.g., \"explain the architecture\", \"suggest improvements\"), you may include that additional content\n   - Never add unrequested sections like Overview, Security Considerations, Testing, etc.\n\n   The default output should be SHORT. The diagram image speaks for itself.\n\n## Azure-Specific Tips\n\n- **Resource Groups**: Show Resource Groups as logical containers\n- **VNets as Containers**: Always show VNets containing subnets and resources\n- **Network Security Groups**: Include NSG rules and attachments\n- **Subscriptions**: Note subscription context if provided\n- **Data Flow**: Show traffic flow (Internet → Application Gateway → VM → SQL Database)\n- **Use Azure Icons**: Request Azure-specific styling in the description\n\n## Example: ARM Template with Multiple Azure Services\n\n### User Input\n\n```json\n{\n  \"resources\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"Microsoft.Resources/resourceGroups\",\n      \"name\": \"rg-main\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"Microsoft.Network/virtualNetworks\",\n      \"name\": \"myVNet\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"addressSpace\": {\n          \"addressPrefixes\": [\"10.0.0.0/16\"]\n        },\n        \"subnets\": [\n          {\n            \"name\": \"subnet1\",\n            \"properties\": {\n              \"addressPrefix\": \"10.0.1.0/24\"\n            }\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"Microsoft.Compute/virtualMachines\",\n      \"name\": \"myVM\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"hardwareProfile\": {\n          \"vmSize\": \"Standard_B1s\"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"Microsoft.Web/sites\",\n      \"name\": \"myAppService\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"serverFarmId\": \"/subscriptions/.../serverfarms/myPlan\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"Microsoft.Storage/storageAccounts\",\n      \"name\": \"mystorageaccount\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"Microsoft.Sql/servers\",\n      \"name\": \"mysqlserver\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"administratorLogin\": \"admin\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### Expected Behavior\n\n1. Parses ARM template:\n\n   - **Resource Group**: rg-main (container)\n   - **Networking**: VNet with subnet\n   - **Compute**: VM, App Service\n   - **Storage**: Storage Account\n   - **Database**: SQL Server\n\n2. Generates DSL showing Azure service diversity:\n\n   ```\n   resource-group [label: \"Resource Group rg-main\"] {\n     myVNet [label: \"VNet 10.0.0.0/16\"] {\n       subnet1 [label: \"Subnet 1 10.0.1.0/24\"] {\n         myVM [icon: azure-vm, label: \"VM Standard_B1s\"]\n       }\n     }\n     myAppService [icon: azure-app-service, label: \"App Service\"]\n     mystorageaccount [icon: azure-storage, label: \"Storage Account\"]\n     mysqlserver [icon: azure-sql, label: \"SQL Server\"]\n   }\n\n   myAppService -> mystorageaccount\n   myVM -> mysqlserver\n   ```\n\n   **Important**: All label text must be on a single line within quotes. Azure-specific: Show Resource Groups as containers, include App Services, Storage Accounts, and SQL databases with proper Azure icons.\n\n3. Calls `/api/render/elements` with `diagramType: \"cloud-architecture-diagram\"`\n\n## Example: Azure CLI Output\n\n### User Input\n\n```\nUser runs: az vm list --output json\nProvides JSON output\n```\n\n### Expected Behavior\n\n1. Parses JSON to extract:\n\n   - VM names, sizes, states\n   - Resource groups\n   - Network interfaces\n   - Storage accounts\n\n2. Formats and calls API\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:33:54.133Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Agents needing advanced Azure infrastructure visualization capabilities from ARM templates or Azure CLI output.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 Azure 基础设施可视化能力的云代理，支持从 ARM 模板或 Azure CLI 输出中获取信息。","ja":"Azure インフラストラクチャの高度な視覚化機能が必要なクラウド エージェントに最適です。ARM テンプレートまたは Azure CLI の出力からの情報を取得することができます。","ko":"고급 Azure 인프라.visualization 기능이 필요한 클라우드 에이전트에게 적합합니다. ARM 템플릿 또는 Azure CLI 출력에서 정보를 얻을 수 있습니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes en la nube que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de visualización de infraestructura de Azure desde plantillas de ARM o salida de Azure CLI.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Cloud nécessitant des capacités de visualisation avancées d''infrastructure Azure à partir de modèles ARM ou de sortie Azure CLI.","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Agenten, die erweiterte Azure-Infrastruktur-Visualisierungsfunktionen aus ARM-Vorlagen oder Azure-CLI-Ausgaben benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Nuvem que precisam de capacidades avançadas de visualização de infraestrutura do Azure a partir de modelos do ARM ou saída do Azure CLI.","ru":"Идеально подходит для облачных агентов, которым необходимы расширенные возможности визуализации инфраструктуры Azure из шаблонов ARM или вывода Azure CLI.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء السحابية الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لتصور بنية تحتية Azure من قوالب ARM أو إخراج Azure CLI."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate architecture diagrams for Azure infrastructure using natural language descriptions, ARM templates, or Azure CLI output, providing a visual representation of Virtual Machines, Storage Accounts, VNets, and other Azure services.","zh":"使代理能够使用自然语言描述、ARM 模板或 Azure CLI 输出生成 Azure 基础设施的体系结构图，提供虚拟机、存储帐户、VNet 和其他 Azure 服务的可视化表示。","ja":"エージェントが自然言語の説明、ARM テンプレート、または Azure CLI の出力から Azure インフラストラクチャのアーキテクチャ ダイアグラムを生成できるようにし、仮想マシン、ストレージ アカウント、VNet、またはその他の Azure サービスを視覚的に表現します。","ko":"에이전트가 자연어 설명, ARM 템플릿 또는 Azure CLI 출력에서 Azure 인프라의 아키텍처 다이어그램을 생성할 수 있도록 하여 가상 머신, 스토리지 계정, VNet 및 기타 Azure 서비스를 시각적으로 표현합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar diagramas de arquitectura para la infraestructura de Azure utilizando descripciones en lenguaje natural, plantillas de ARM o salida de Azure CLI, proporcionando una representación visual de máquinas virtuales, cuentas de almacenamiento, VNets y otros servicios de Azure.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des diagrammes d''architecture pour l''infrastructure Azure en utilisant des descriptions en langage naturel, des modèles ARM ou une sortie Azure CLI, fournissant une représentation visuelle de machines virtuelles, de comptes de stockage, de VNets et d''autres services Azure.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Architekturdiagramme für die Azure-Infrastruktur mit Hilfe von natürlichen Sprachbeschreibungen, ARM-Vorlagen oder Azure-CLI-Ausgaben zu generieren, und bietet eine visuelle Darstellung von virtuellen Maschinen, Speicherkonten, VNets und anderen Azure-Diensten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar diagramas de arquitetura para infraestrutura do Azure usando descrições em linguagem natural, modelos do ARM ou saída do Azure CLI, fornecendo uma representação visual de Máquinas Virtuais, Contas de Armazenamento, VNets e outros serviços do Azure.","ru":"Позволяет агентам генерировать диаграммы архитектуры для инфраструктуры Azure с помощью естественного языка описаний, шаблонов ARM или вывода Azure CLI, обеспечивая визуальное представление виртуальных машин, учетных записей хранения, VNets и других сервисов Azure.","ar":"يتمكّن الوكلاء من توليد رسومات معمارية لبنية تحتية Azure باستخدام وصفات بلغة طبيعية أو قوالب ARM أو إخراج Azure CLI، مما يوفر تمثيلاً مرئياً لأجهزة افتراضية و حسابات تخزين و VNets وخدمات Azure الأخرى."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating diagrams from ARM templates for Azure deployment planning","Visualizing Azure resources from Azure CLI output for debugging purposes","Creating architecture diagrams from natural language descriptions for Azure infrastructure design"],"zh":["从 ARM 模板生成图表以进行 Azure 部署规划","从 Azure CLI 输出可视化 Azure 资源以进行调试","从自然语言描述创建体系结构图以进行 Azure 基础设施设计"],"ja":["Azure デプロイ計画のための ARM テンプレートからのダイアグラムの生成","デバッグのための Azure CLI 出力からの Azure リソースの視覚化","Azure インフラストラクチャ設計のための自然言語の説明からのアーキテクチャ ダイアグラムの作成"],"ko":["Azure 배포 계획을 위한 ARM 템플릿에서 다이어그램 생성","디버깅을 위한 Azure CLI 출력에서 Azure 리소스 시각화","Azure 인프라 디자인을 위한 자연어 설명에서 아키텍처 다이어그램 생성"],"es":["Generar diagramas a partir de plantillas de ARM para la planificación de la implementación de Azure","Visualizar recursos de Azure a partir de la salida de Azure CLI para fines de depuración","Crear diagramas de arquitectura a partir de descripciones en lenguaje natural para el diseño de la infraestructura de Azure"],"fr":["Générer des diagrammes à partir de modèles ARM pour la planification du déploiement Azure","Visualiser les ressources Azure à partir de la sortie Azure CLI pour des fins de débogage","Créer des diagrammes d''architecture à partir de descriptions en langage naturel pour la conception de l''infrastructure Azure"],"de":["Erstellen von Diagrammen aus ARM-Vorlagen für die Azure-Bereitstellungsplanung","Visualisieren von Azure-Ressourcen aus Azure-CLI-Ausgaben für Debugging-Zwecke","Erstellen von Architekturdiagrammen aus natürlichen Sprachbeschreibungen für das Design der Azure-Infrastruktur"],"pt":["Gerar diagramas a partir de modelos do ARM para planejamento de implantação do Azure","Visualizar recursos do Azure a partir da saída do Azure CLI para fins de depuração","Criar diagramas de arquitetura a partir de descrições em linguagem natural para design de infraestrutura do Azure"],"ru":["Генерировать диаграммы из шаблонов ARM для планирования развертывания Azure","Визуализировать ресурсы Azure из вывода Azure CLI для целей отладки","Создавать диаграммы архитектуры из естественного языка описаний для проектирования инфраструктуры Azure"],"ar":["توليد رسومات من قوالب ARM لتحضير تخطيط الإنشاء في Azure","تجسير موارد Azure من إخراج Azure CLI لغرض التصحيح","إنشاء رسومات معمارية من وصفات بلغة طبيعية لتصميم بنية تحتية Azure"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires ARM templates, Azure CLI output, or natural language descriptions as input","Limited to Azure infrastructure visualization"],"zh":["需要 ARM 模板、Azure CLI 输出或自然语言描述作为输入","仅限 Azure 基础设施可视化"],"ja":["入力として ARM テンプレート、Azure CLI 出力、または自然言語の説明が必要","Azure インフラストラクチャの視覚化のみ"],"ko":["ARM 템플릿, Azure CLI 출력 또는 자연어 설명을 입력으로 필요","Azure 인프라스트ラク처 시각화만"],"es":["Requiere plantillas de ARM, salida de Azure CLI o descripciones en lenguaje natural como entrada","Limitado a la visualización de la infraestructura de Azure"],"fr":["Nécessite des modèles ARM, une sortie Azure CLI ou des descriptions en langage naturel comme entrée","Limité à la visualisation de l''infrastructure Azure"],"de":["Benötigt ARM-Vorlagen, Azure-CLI-Ausgaben oder natürliche Sprachbeschreibungen als Eingabe","Begrenzt auf die Visualisierung der Azure-Infrastruktur"],"pt":["Exige modelos do ARM, saída do Azure CLI ou descrições em linguagem natural como entrada","Limitado à visualização de infraestrutura do Azure"],"ru":["Требует шаблонов ARM, вывода Azure CLI или естественного языка описаний в качестве входных данных","Ограничен визуализацией инфраструктуры Azure"],"ar":["يتطلب قوالب ARM أو إخراج Azure CLI أو وصفات بلغة طبيعية كمدخل","محدود بتصور بنية تحتية Azure"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Mahaboob26/NEXUS-TRUSAI/building-streamlit-multipage-apps', 'community', 'Mahaboob26', 'NEXUS-TRUSAI', 'Mahaboob26/NEXUS-TRUSAI', 'building-streamlit-multipage-apps', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.422Z', '2026-02-18T04:33:58.357Z', NULL, '{"id":"Mahaboob26/NEXUS-TRUSAI/building-streamlit-multipage-apps","name":"building-streamlit-multipage-apps","description":{"zh":"Streamlit 多页应用构建教程，介绍如何实现结构和导航","ja":"Streamlit マルチページアプリの構築方法を紹介します。構造とナビゲーションの実現方法を説明します","ko":"Streamlit 멀티페이지 앱 구축 튜토리얼: 구조 및 내비게이션 구현 방법","es":"Streamlit permite crear aplicaciones web interactivas con varias páginas. Aprende a estructurar y navegar estas aplicaciones para una mejor experiencia de usuario.","fr":"Streamlit permet de créer des applications web interactives avec plusieurs pages. Découvrez comment structurer et naviguer ces applications pour une meilleure expérience utilisateur.","de":"Streamlit ermöglicht die Erstellung interaktiver Webanwendungen mit mehreren Seiten. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie diese Anwendungen strukturieren und navigieren, um eine bessere Benutzererfahrung zu bieten.","pt":"Streamlit é uma biblioteca Python que permite criar aplicações web interativas de forma rápida e fácil. Aprenda a criar aplicações multipágina com Streamlit.","ru":"Streamlit — это библиотека Python, которая позволяет создавать интерактивные веб-приложения быстро и легко. Узнайте, как создавать мультистраничные приложения с Streamlit.","ar":"Streamlit هي مكتبة Python التي تمكن من إنشاء تطبيقات ويب تفاعلية بسرعة وسهولة. تعلم كيفية بناء تطبيقات متعددة الصفحات مع Streamlit.","en":"NEXUS AI: Fair & Auditable Credit Scoring An advanced credit decisioning system bringing transparency and governance to AI lending. Features a Random Forest model trained on Indian datasets, cryptographic audit logging, and a real-time \"Glassmorphism\" executive dashboard. Built with Python, FastA..."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Streamlit 多页应用构建","ja":"Streamlit マルチページアプリの構築","ko":"Streamlit 멀티페이지 앱 구축","es":"Construye aplicaciones de varias páginas con Streamlit","fr":"Créer des applications multi-pages avec Streamlit","de":"Erstellen Sie Streamlit-Mehrseiten-Apps","pt":"Construa Aplicativos Multipágina com Streamlit","ru":"Создание Мультистраничных Приложений с Streamlit","ar":"بناء تطبيقات متعددة الصفحات مع Streamlit","en":"building-streamlit-multipage-apps"},"description":{"zh":"Streamlit 多页应用构建教程，介绍如何实现结构和导航","ja":"Streamlit マルチページアプリの構築方法を紹介します。構造とナビゲーションの実現方法を説明します","ko":"Streamlit 멀티페이지 앱 구축 튜토리얼: 구조 및 내비게이션 구현 방법","es":"Streamlit permite crear aplicaciones web interactivas con varias páginas. Aprende a estructurar y navegar estas aplicaciones para una mejor experiencia de us...","fr":"Streamlit permet de créer des applications web interactives avec plusieurs pages. Découvrez comment structurer et naviguer ces applications pour une meilleur...","de":"Streamlit ermöglicht die Erstellung interaktiver Webanwendungen mit mehreren Seiten. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie diese Anwendungen strukturieren und navigieren, um...","pt":"Streamlit é uma biblioteca Python que permite criar aplicações web interativas de forma rápida e fácil. Aprenda a criar aplicações multipágina com Streamlit.","ru":"Streamlit — это библиотека Python, которая позволяет создавать интерактивные веб-приложения быстро и легко. Узнайте, как создавать мультистраничные приложени...","ar":"Streamlit هي مكتبة Python التي تمكن من إنشاء تطبيقات ويب تفاعلية بسرعة وسهولة. تعلم كيفية بناء تطبيقات متعددة الصفحات مع Streamlit.","en":"NEXUS AI: Fair & Auditable Credit Scoring An advanced credit decisioning system bringing transparency and governance to AI lending. Features a Random Forest ..."},"definition":{"en":"NEXUS AI: Fair & Auditable Credit Scoring An advanced credit decisioning system bringing transparency and governance to AI lending. Features a Random Forest model trained on Indian datasets, cryptographic audit logging, and a real-time \"Glassmorphism\" executive dashboard. Built with Python, FastAPI, and Streamlit."},"features":{"zh":["Streamlit 多页应用结构","目录结构最佳实践","主模块初始化","全局状态共享","页面导航实现"],"ja":["Streamlit マルチページアプリの構造","ディレクトリ構造のベストプラクティス","メインモジュールの初期化","グローバル状態の共有","ページナビゲーションの実現"],"ko":["Streamlit 멀티페이지 앱 구조","디렉토리 구조 최적화","메인 모듈 초기화","전역 상태 공유","페이지 내비게이션 구현"],"es":["Estructura de directorios para aplicaciones multi-página","Navegación entre páginas","Uso de Python y Streamlit para crear aplicaciones web interactivas","Creación de un dashboard de ejecutivo en tiempo real","Uso de FastAPI para crear APIs robustas"],"fr":["Structure de répertoire pour les applications multi-pages","Navigation entre les pages","Utilisation de Python et Streamlit pour créer des applications web interactives","Création d''un tableau de bord d''exécutif en temps réel","Utilisation de FastAPI pour créer des API robustes"],"de":["Verzeichnisstruktur für Mehrseiten-Apps","Navigation zwischen Seiten","Verwendung von Python und Streamlit für die Erstellung interaktiver Webanwendungen","Erstellung eines Echtzeit-Executive-Dashboards","Verwendung von FastAPI für die Erstellung robuster APIs"],"pt":["Estrutura de diretórios para aplicações multipágina","Navegação entre páginas","Compartilhamento de estado global entre páginas","Criação de aplicações robustas e escaláveis","Integração com bibliotecas Python como FastAPI"],"ru":["Структура директорий для мультистраничных приложений","Навигация между страницами","Общий глобальный статус между страницами","Создание прочных и масштабируемых приложений","Интеграция с библиотеками Python, такими как FastAPI"],"ar":["هيكل الدلائل لتطبيقات متعددة الصفحات","التنقل بين الصفحات","مشاركة الحالة العالمية بين الصفحات","إنشاء تطبيقات قوية ومرنة","التكامل مع مكتبات Python مثل FastAPI"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Streamlit","多页应用","构建","结构","导航","Python","FastAPI","开发"],"ja":["Streamlit","マルチページアプリ","構築","構造","ナビゲーション","Python","FastAPI","開発"],"ko":["Streamlit","멀티페이지 앱","구축","구조","내비게이션","Python","FastAPI","개발"],"es":["Streamlit","aplicaciones web interactivas","multi-página","navegación","Python","FastAPI","dashboard de ejecutivo"],"fr":["Streamlit","applications web interactives","multi-pages","navigation","Python","FastAPI","tableau de bord d''exécutif"],"de":["Streamlit","interaktive Webanwendungen","Mehrseiten-Apps","Navigation","Python","FastAPI","Echtzeit-Executive-Dashboard"],"pt":["Streamlit","aplicações multipágina","estrutura de diretórios","navegação","compartilhamento de estado","FastAPI","Python","desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["Streamlit","мультистраничные приложения","структура директорий","навигация","общий статус","FastAPI","Python","веб-разработка"],"ar":["Streamlit","تطبيقات متعددة الصفحات","هيكل الدلائل","التنقل","مشاركة الحالة","FastAPI","Python","تطوير الويب"]}},"owner":"Mahaboob26","repo":"NEXUS-TRUSAI","repoPath":"Mahaboob26/NEXUS-TRUSAI","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.422Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"building-streamlit-multipage-apps","description":"Building multi-page Streamlit apps. Use when creating apps with multiple pages, setting up navigation, or managing state across pages.","bodyPreview":"# Streamlit multi-page apps\n\nStructure and navigation for apps with multiple pages.\n\n## Directory structure\n\n```\nstreamlit_app.py          # Main entry point\napp_pages/\n    home.py\n    analytics.py\n    settings.py\n```\n\n**Important:** Name your pages directory `app_pages/` (not `pages/`). Using `pages/` conflicts with Streamlit''s old auto-discovery API and can cause unexpected behavior.\n\n## Main module\n\n```python\n# streamlit_app.py\nimport streamlit as st\n\n# Initialize global state (shared across","body":"# Streamlit multi-page apps\n\nStructure and navigation for apps with multiple pages.\n\n## Directory structure\n\n```\nstreamlit_app.py          # Main entry point\napp_pages/\n    home.py\n    analytics.py\n    settings.py\n```\n\n**Important:** Name your pages directory `app_pages/` (not `pages/`). Using `pages/` conflicts with Streamlit''s old auto-discovery API and can cause unexpected behavior.\n\n## Main module\n\n```python\n# streamlit_app.py\nimport streamlit as st\n\n# Initialize global state (shared across pages)\nif \"api_client\" not in st.session_state:\n    st.session_state.api_client = init_api_client()\n\n# Define navigation\npage = st.navigation([\n    st.Page(\"app_pages/home.py\", title=\"Home\", icon=\":material/home:\"),\n    st.Page(\"app_pages/analytics.py\", title=\"Analytics\", icon=\":material/bar_chart:\"),\n    st.Page(\"app_pages/settings.py\", title=\"Settings\", icon=\":material/settings:\"),\n])\n\n# App-level UI runs before page content\n# Useful for shared elements like titles\nst.title(f\"{page.icon} {page.title}\")\n\npage.run()\n```\n\n**Note:** When you handle titles in `streamlit_app.py`, individual pages should NOT use `st.title` again.\n\n## Navigation position\n\n**Few pages (3-7) → Top navigation:**\n\n```python\npage = st.navigation([...], position=\"top\")\n```\n\nCreates a clean horizontal menu. Great for simple apps. Sections are supported too—they appear as dropdowns in the top nav.\n\n**Many pages or nested sections → Sidebar:**\n\n```python\npage = st.navigation({\n    \"Main\": [\n        st.Page(\"app_pages/home.py\", title=\"Home\"),\n        st.Page(\"app_pages/analytics.py\", title=\"Analytics\"),\n    ],\n    \"Admin\": [\n        st.Page(\"app_pages/settings.py\", title=\"Settings\"),\n        st.Page(\"app_pages/users.py\", title=\"Users\"),\n    ],\n}, position=\"sidebar\")\n```\n\n**Mixed: Some pages ungrouped:**\n\nUse an empty string key `\"\"` for pages that shouldn''t be in a section. These ungrouped pages always appear first, before any named groups. Put all ungrouped pages in a single `\"\"` key:\n\n```python\npage = st.navigation({\n    \"\": [\n        st.Page(\"app_pages/home.py\", title=\"Home\"),\n        st.Page(\"app_pages/about.py\", title=\"About\"),\n    ],\n    \"Analytics\": [\n        st.Page(\"app_pages/dashboard.py\", title=\"Dashboard\"),\n        st.Page(\"app_pages/reports.py\", title=\"Reports\"),\n    ],\n}, position=\"top\")\n```\n\n## Page modules\n\n```python\n# app_pages/analytics.py\nimport streamlit as st\n\n# Access global state\napi = st.session_state.api_client\nuser = st.session_state.user\n\n# Page-specific content (title is handled in streamlit_app.py)\ndata = api.fetch_analytics(user.id)\nst.line_chart(data)\n```\n\n## Global state\n\nInitialize state in the main module only if it''s needed across multiple pages:\n\n```python\n# streamlit_app.py\nst.session_state.api = init_client()\nst.session_state.user = get_user()\nst.session_state.settings = load_settings()\n```\n\n**Tip:** Use `st.session_state.setdefault(\"key\", default_value)` to initialize values only if they don''t exist.\n\n**Why main module (for global state):**\n- Runs before every page\n- Ensures state is initialized\n- Single source of truth\n\n## Page-specific state\n\nUse prefixed keys for page-specific state:\n\n```python\n# app_pages/analytics.py\nif \"analytics_date_range\" not in st.session_state:\n    st.session_state.analytics_date_range = default_range()\n```\n\n## Share elements between pages\n\nPut shared UI in the entrypoint (before `page.run()`) so it appears on all pages:\n\n```python\n# streamlit_app.py\nimport streamlit as st\n\npages = [...]\npage = st.navigation(pages)\n\n# Shared title\nst.title(f\"{page.icon} {page.title}\")\n\n# Shared sidebar widgets\nwith st.sidebar:\n    st.selectbox(\"Theme\", [\"Light\", \"Dark\"])\n\npage.run()\n```\n\n## Programmatic navigation\n\nNavigate to another page programmatically:\n\n```python\nif st.button(\"Go to Settings\"):\n    st.switch_page(\"app_pages/settings.py\")\n```\n\nCreate navigation links with `st.page_link`:\n\n```python\nst.page_link(\"app_pages/home.py\", label=\"Home\", icon=\":material/home:\")\nst.page_link(\"https://example.com\", label=\"External\", icon=\":material/open_in_new:\")\n```\n\n> **Note:** Prefer `st.navigation` over `st.page_link` for standard navigation. Do not use `st.page_link` to recreate the nav bar you get with `st.navigation`. Only use `st.page_link` when linking to pages from somewhere other than the sidebar, or when building a more complex navigation menu.\n\n## Conditional pages\n\nShow different pages based on user role, authentication, or any other condition by building the pages list dynamically:\n\n```python\n# streamlit_app.py\nimport streamlit as st\n\npages = [st.Page(\"app_pages/home.py\", title=\"Home\", icon=\":material/home:\")]\n\nif st.user.is_logged_in:\n    pages.append(st.Page(\"app_pages/dashboard.py\", title=\"Dashboard\", icon=\":material/bar_chart:\"))\n\nif st.session_state.get(\"is_admin\"):\n    pages.append(st.Page(\"app_pages/admin.py\", title=\"Admin\", icon=\":material/settings:\"))\n\npage = st.navigation(pages)\npage.run()\n```\n\nCommon conditions for showing/hiding pages:\n- `st.user.is_logged_in` for authenticated users\n- `st.session_state` flags (roles, permissions, feature flags)\n- Environment variables or secrets\n- Time-based access (e.g., beta features)\n\n## Imports from pages\n\nWhen importing from page files in `app_pages/`, always import from the root directory perspective:\n\n```python\n# app_pages/dashboard.py - GOOD\nfrom utils.data import load_sales_data\n\n# app_pages/dashboard.py - BAD (don''t use relative imports)\nfrom ..utils.data import load_sales_data\n```\n\n## References\n\n- [Multipage apps docs](https://docs.streamlit.io/develop/concepts/multipage-apps)\n- [st.navigation](https://docs.streamlit.io/develop/api-reference/navigation/st.navigation)\n- [st.Page](https://docs.streamlit.io/develop/api-reference/navigation/st.page)\n- [st.session_state](https://docs.streamlit.io/develop/api-reference/caching-and-state/st.session_state)\n- [st.switch_page](https://docs.streamlit.io/develop/api-reference/navigation/st.switch_page)\n- [st.page_link](https://docs.streamlit.io/develop/api-reference/widgets/st.page_link)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:33:58.357Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Python Analysis Agents needing advanced multi-page data visualization capabilities with Streamlit","zh":"非常适合需要使用Streamlit进行高级多页数据可视化的Python分析代理","ja":"Streamlitを使用した高度なマルチページデータ可視化機能が必要なPython分析エージェントに最適","ko":"Streamlit를 사용하여 고급 多ページ 데이터 시각화를 필요로 하는 Python 분석 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis de Python que necesitan capacidades de visualización de datos avanzadas en varias páginas con Streamlit","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse Python nécessitant des capacités de visualisation de données avancées sur plusieurs pages avec Streamlit","de":"Perfekt für Python-Analyseagenten, die erweiterte Datenvisualisierungsfähigkeiten auf mehreren Seiten mit Streamlit benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise Python que necessitam de capacidades de visualização de dados avançadas em várias páginas com Streamlit","ru":"Идеально для агентов анализа Python, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности визуализации данных на нескольких страницах с Streamlit","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التحليلية بايثون الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لتصوير البيانات على عدة صفحات مع Streamlit"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to structure and navigate Streamlit apps with multiple pages, utilizing Python and Streamlit''s directory structure for organized and scalable applications, including features like global state initialization and page organization with the ''app_pages/'' directory","zh":"赋予代理结构和导航具有多个页面的Streamlit应用程序的能力，利用Python和Streamlit的目录结构实现有组织和可扩展的应用程序，包括全局状态初始化和使用''app_pages/''目录的页面组织等功能","ja":"エージェントがStreamlitアプリケーションを構造化およびナビゲートできるようにし、PythonおよびStreamlitのディレクトリ構造を使用して、グローバルステートの初期化や''app_pages/''ディレクトリを使用したページの組織化など、組織化されたスケーラブルなアプリケーションを実現する","ko":"에이전트가 Streamlit 애플리케이션을 구조화하고 탐색할 수 있도록 해주며, Python 및 Streamlit의 디렉토리 구조를 사용하여, 전역 상태 초기화 및 ''app_pages/'' 디렉토리를 사용한 페이지 구성 등, 유기적으로 구성된 확장 가능한 애플리케이션을 구현할 수 있다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a estructurar y navegar aplicaciones de Streamlit con varias páginas, utilizando Python y la estructura de directorios de Streamlit para aplicaciones organizadas y escalables, incluyendo características como la inicialización del estado global y la organización de páginas con el directorio ''app_pages/''","fr":"Permet aux agents de structurer et de naviguer dans les applications Streamlit à plusieurs pages, en utilisant Python et la structure de répertoire de Streamlit pour des applications organisées et escalables, y compris des fonctionnalités comme l''initialisation de l''état global et l''organisation des pages avec le répertoire ''app_pages/''","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Streamlit-Apps mit mehreren Seiten zu strukturieren und zu navigieren, indem sie Python und die Verzeichnisstruktur von Streamlit für organisierte und skalierbare Anwendungen verwenden, einschließlich Funktionen wie der Initialisierung des globalen Zustands und der Organisierung von Seiten mit dem Verzeichnis ''app_pages/''","pt":"Habilita os agentes a estruturarem e navegarem em aplicativos Streamlit com várias páginas, utilizando o Python e a estrutura de diretório do Streamlit para aplicações organizadas e escaláveis, incluindo recursos como inicialização de estado global e organização de páginas com o diretório ''app_pages/''","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью структурировать и навигировать по приложениям Streamlit с несколькими страницами, используя Python и структуру директорий Streamlit для организованных и масштабируемых приложений, включая функции như глобальную инициализацию состояния и организацию страниц с помощью директории ''app_pages/''","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على هيكلة وتحريك تطبيقات Streamlit مع عدة صفحات، مع استخدام بايثون وهيكل المجلدات في Streamlit لتطبيقات منظمة وقابلة للتوسيع، بما في ذلك ميزات مثل تهيئة الحالة العالمية وتنظيم الصفحات مع المجلد ''app_pages/''"},"useCases":{"en":["Building interactive executive dashboards with real-time data","Creating multi-page analytics applications with Streamlit","Organizing complex data visualizations into navigable page structures"],"zh":["构建交互式高管仪表板，实时显示数据","使用Streamlit创建多页分析应用程序","将复杂的数据可视化组织成可导航的页面结构"],"ja":["リアルタイムデータを表示するインタラクティブなエグゼクティブダッシュボードの構築","Streamlitを使用したマルチページ分析アプリケーションの作成","複雑なデータ可視化をナビゲート可能なページ構造に整理"],"ko":["실시간 데이터를 표시하는 상호 작용형 이그제큐티브 대시보드를 구축하기","Streamlit를 사용하여 다중 페이지 분석 애플리케이션을 만들기","복잡한 데이터 시각화를 탐색 가능한 페이지 구조로 구성하기"],"es":["Creación de tableros de ejecutivos interactivos con datos en tiempo real","Creación de aplicaciones analíticas de varias páginas con Streamlit","Organización de visualizaciones de datos complejas en estructuras de páginas navegables"],"fr":["Création de tableaux de bord interactifs pour les dirigeants avec des données en temps réel","Création d''applications d''analyse à plusieurs pages avec Streamlit","Organisation de visualisations de données complexes en structures de pages navigables"],"de":["Erstellung interaktiver Führungskräfte-Dashboards mit Echtzeitdaten","Erstellung von Analyseanwendungen mit mehreren Seiten mit Streamlit","Organisation komplexer Datenvisualisierungen in navigierbaren Seitenstrukturen"],"pt":["Construir painéis executivos interativos com dados em tempo real","Criar aplicações analíticas com várias páginas com Streamlit","Organizar visualizações de dados complexas em estruturas de página navegáveis"],"ru":["Создание интерактивных исполнительных панелей с данными в режиме реального времени","Создание аналитических приложений с несколькими страницами с Streamlit","Организация сложных визуализаций данных в навигируемые структуры страниц"],"ar":["بناء لوحات تنفيذية تفاعلية مع بيانات في الوقت الفعلي","إنشاء تطبيقات تحليلية مع عدة صفحات مع Streamlit","تنظيم تصورات البيانات المعقدة في هياكل صفحة قابلة للملاحة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Streamlit installation and compatibility","Must use ''app_pages/'' directory to avoid conflicts with Streamlit''s auto-discovery API"],"zh":["需要安装Streamlit并确保兼容性","必须使用''app_pages/''目录以避免与Streamlit的自动发现API发生冲突"],"ja":["Streamlitのインストールと互換性が必要","Streamlitの自動検出APIと衝突を避けるために、''app_pages/''ディレクトリを使用する必要がある"],"ko":["Streamlit를 설치하고 호환성을 보장해야 함","''app_pages/'' 디렉토리를 사용하여 Streamlit의 자동 검색 API와의 충돌을 피해야 함"],"es":["Requiere la instalación y la compatibilidad de Streamlit","Debe utilizar el directorio ''app_pages/'' para evitar conflictos con la API de autodetección de Streamlit"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la compatibilité de Streamlit","Doit utiliser le répertoire ''app_pages/'' pour éviter les conflits avec l''API de détection automatique de Streamlit"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation und Kompatibilität von Streamlit","Muss das Verzeichnis ''app_pages/'' verwenden, um Konflikte mit der Streamlit-Autodetektions-API zu vermeiden"],"pt":["Requer instalação e compatibilidade do Streamlit","Deve usar o diretório ''app_pages/'' para evitar conflitos com a API de autodescoberta do Streamlit"],"ru":["Требует установки и совместимости Streamlit","Должно использовать директорию ''app_pages/'' для избежания конфликтов с API автопоиска Streamlit"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت وتوافق Streamlit","يجب استخدام المجلد ''app_pages/'' لتجنب النزاعات مع واجهة برمجة التطبيقات للاكتشاف التلقائي في Streamlit"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('KrystianYCSilva/hefesto-skill-generator/code-reviewer', 'community', 'KrystianYCSilva', 'hefesto-skill-generator', 'KrystianYCSilva/hefesto-skill-generator', 'code-reviewer', 0, 0, 30, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.422Z', '2026-02-18T04:34:21.062Z', NULL, '{"id":"KrystianYCSilva/hefesto-skill-generator/code-reviewer","name":"code-reviewer","description":{"zh":"代码审查专家技能，用于检测错误、强制执行标准和提高代码可维护性","ja":"コードレビュー専門家スキルは、エラーの検出、規格の適用、コードの保守性の向上に使用されます","ko":"코드 리뷰 전문가 스킬은 오류検출, 표준 적용 및 코드 유지 보수성을 향상하는 데 사용됩니다","es":"Nuestro experto en revisión de código ayuda a detectar errores, a garantizar la seguridad y a mejorar la mantenibilidad del código.","fr":"Notre expert en révision de code aide à détecter les erreurs, à garantir la sécurité et à améliorer la maintenabilité du code.","de":"Unser Code-Review-Experte hilft dabei, Fehler zu erkennen, die Sicherheit zu gewährleisten und die Wartbarkeit des Codes zu verbessern.","en":"Hefesto e um gerador de skills que cria Agent Skills padronizadas para multiplos CLIs de IA, seguindo o padrao aberto agentskills.io e as melhores praticas academicamente consolidadas."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"代码审查专家 - 代码审查技能","ja":"コードレビュー専門家 - コードレビュースキル","ko":"코드 리뷰 전문가 - 코드 리뷰 스킬","es":"Revisión de Código Expertos","fr":"Expert en Révision de Code","de":"Code-Review-Experten","en":"code-reviewer"},"description":{"zh":"代码审查专家技能，用于检测错误、强制执行标准和提高代码可维护性","ja":"コードレビュー専門家スキルは、エラーの検出、規格の適用、コードの保守性の向上に使用されます","ko":"코드 리뷰 전문가 스킬은 오류検출, 표준 적용 및 코드 유지 보수성을 향상하는 데 사용됩니다","es":"Nuestro experto en revisión de código ayuda a detectar errores, a garantizar la seguridad y a mejorar la mantenibilidad del código.","fr":"Notre expert en révision de code aide à détecter les erreurs, à garantir la sécurité et à améliorer la maintenabilité du code.","de":"Unser Code-Review-Experte hilft dabei, Fehler zu erkennen, die Sicherheit zu gewährleisten und die Wartbarkeit des Codes zu verbessern.","en":"Hefesto e um gerador de skills que cria Agent Skills padronizadas para multiplos CLIs de IA, seguindo o padrao aberto agentskills.io e as melhores praticas a..."},"definition":{"en":"Hefesto e um gerador de skills que cria Agent Skills padronizadas para multiplos CLIs de IA, seguindo o padrao aberto agentskills.io e as melhores praticas academicamente consolidadas."},"features":{"zh":["正确性检查","安全性检查","架构检查","可读性检查","错误检测","代码优化"],"ja":["正しさの確認","セキュリティの確認","アーキテクチャの確認","可読性の確認","エラーの検出","コードの最適化"],"ko":["올바름 점검","보안 점검","아키텍처 점검","가독성 점검","오류 감지","코드 최적화"],"es":["Detección de errores de lógica","Análisis de seguridad","Evaluación de la arquitectura","Mejora de la legibilidad del código","Garantía de la corrección del código","Cumplimiento de los estándares de código"],"fr":["Détection des erreurs de logique","Analyse de sécurité","Évaluation de l''architecture","Amélioration de la lisibilité du code","Garantie de la correction du code","Respect des normes de code"],"de":["Fehlererkennung in der Logik","Sicherheitsanalyse","Architekturbewertung","Verbesserung der Lesbarkeit des Codes","Gewährleistung der Richtigkeit des Codes","Einhaltung der Code-Standards"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码审查","代码质量","代码安全","代码可维护性","代码优化","代码检查","代码审查工具"],"ja":["コードレビュー","コード品質","コードセキュリティ","コード保守性","コード最適化","コードチェック","コードレビューツール"],"ko":["코드 리뷰","코드 품질","코드 보안","코드 유지 보수성","코드 최적화","코드 점검","코드 리뷰 도구"],"es":["revisión de código","experto en revisión de código","análisis de código","seguridad del código","legibilidad del código","corrección del código","estándares de código","desarrollo de software","calidad del código"],"fr":["révision de code","expert en révision de code","analyse de code","sécurité du code","lisibilité du code","correction du code","normes de code","développement de logiciels","qualité du code"],"de":["Code-Review","Code-Review-Experte","Code-Analyse","Code-Sicherheit","Code-Lesbarkeit","Code-Richtigkeit","Code-Standards","Software-Entwicklung","Code-Qualität"]}},"owner":"KrystianYCSilva","repo":"hefesto-skill-generator","repoPath":"KrystianYCSilva/hefesto-skill-generator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.422Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"code-reviewer","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Code Review Expert\n\nThis skill transforms the agent into a rigorous code reviewer. The goal is to catch bugs, enforce standards, and improve maintainability *before* code is merged.\n\n## How to execute a Code Review\n\nFollow this hierarchy of importance:\n\n1.  **Correctness**: Does it do what it''s supposed to do? Are there logic errors?\n2.  **Security**: Are there vulnerabilities (Injection, XSS, Secrets)?\n3.  **Architecture**: Does it break boundaries? Is it scalable?\n4.  **Readability**: Is the","body":"# Code Review Expert\n\nThis skill transforms the agent into a rigorous code reviewer. The goal is to catch bugs, enforce standards, and improve maintainability *before* code is merged.\n\n## How to execute a Code Review\n\nFollow this hierarchy of importance:\n\n1.  **Correctness**: Does it do what it''s supposed to do? Are there logic errors?\n2.  **Security**: Are there vulnerabilities (Injection, XSS, Secrets)?\n3.  **Architecture**: Does it break boundaries? Is it scalable?\n4.  **Readability**: Is the intent clear? Are names descriptive?\n5.  **Performance**: Are there obvious bottlenecks ($O(n^2)$ loops, N+1 queries)?\n6.  **Style**: Formatting, typo fixes (Least important - use linters for this).\n\n## How to identify Anti-Patterns\n\nLook for these red flags:\n\n-   **God Class**: A class that knows/does too much. *Fix*: Extract Delegate/Service.\n-   **Shotgun Surgery**: A single change requires edits in many classes. *Fix*: Increase cohesion.\n-   **Primitive Obsession**: Using `int` or `string` for domain concepts like Money or Phone. *Fix*: Use Value Objects.\n-   **Feature Envy**: A method accesses data of another object more than its own. *Fix*: Move method to the data owner.\n\n## How to validate Architecture & Design\n\n-   **SOLID**: Check Single Responsibility and Dependency Inversion violations.\n-   **Coupling**: High coupling makes testing hard. Look for `new` keywords in business logic.\n-   **Leaky Abstractions**: Does the database schema leak into the UI layer?\n\n## Common Warnings & Pitfalls\n\n### \"Looks Good To Me\" (LGTM)\n-   **Issue**: rubber-stamping code without deep analysis.\n-   **Fix**: Always find at least one meaningful question or suggestion.\n\n### Nitpicking\n-   **Issue**: Focusing only on formatting/naming.\n-   **Fix**: Automate style checks. Focus review on logic and architecture.\n\n### Logic Errors\n-   **Off-by-one**: Check loop boundaries (`<` vs `<=`).\n-   **Null checks**: Are edge cases (null, empty list, negative numbers) handled?\n\n## Best Practices (Review Etiquette)\n\n| Rule | Explanation |\n|------|-------------|\n| **Critique Code, Not People** | \"This variable name is unclear\" vs \"You named this badly\". |\n| **Explain Why** | \"Extract this method to improve testability\" vs \"Extract this\". |\n| **Ask Questions** | \"What happens if this list is empty?\" (Socratic method). |\n\n## Deep Dives\n\n-   **Anti-Patterns**: See [ANTI-PATTERNS.md](references/anti-patterns.md).\n-   **Clean Code Standards**: See [CLEAN-CODE.md](references/clean-code.md).\n-   **Security Checklist**: See [SECURITY.md](references/security.md).\n\n## References\n\n-   [Google Engineering Practices - Code Review](https://google.github.io/eng-practices/review/)\n-   [Refactoring.guru](https://refactoring.guru/)\n-   [OWASP Top 10](https://owasp.org/www-project-top-ten/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:34:21.062Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code needing rigorous code analysis and review capabilities.","zh":"适合于Cursor、Windsurf和Claude Code等AI代理，需要严格的代码分析和审查能力。","ja":"Cursor、Windsurf、Claude CodeなどのAIエージェントに適しています。これらは、厳格なコード分析およびレビュー機能を必要とします。","ko":"Cursor, Windsurf, Claude Code와 같은 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 엄격한 코드 분석 및 리뷰 기능이 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf y Claude Code que necesitan capacidades de análisis y revisión de código rigurosas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Cursor, Windsurf et Claude Code ayant besoin d''une analyse et d''une révision de code rigoureuses.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Cursor, Windsurf und Claude Code, die eine umfassende Code-Analyse und -Überprüfung benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf e Claude Code que necessitam de capacidades de análise e revisão de código rigorosas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor, Windsurf и Claude Code, которым необходимы строгие возможности анализа и проверки кода.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Cursor و Windsurf و Claude Code الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات تحليل ومراجعة شاملة للكود."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce coding standards, detect security vulnerabilities such as Injection and XSS, and improve code maintainability through thorough reviews of correctness, security, architecture, and readability, utilizing best practices and standards from agentskills.io.","zh":"赋予代理执行编码标准、检测安全漏洞（如注入和XSS）以及通过正确性、安全性、架构和可读性的彻底审查来提高代码的可维护性，利用agentskills.io的最佳实践和标准。","ja":"エージェントにコード規約を適用させ、セキュリティ脆弱性（インジェクションやXSSなど）を検出させ、正確性、セキュリティ、アーキテクチャ、可読性の徹底的なレビューを通じてコードの保守性を向上させることができます。agentskills.ioのベストプラクティスと規約を利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 코딩 표준을 강제하고 보안 취약점(예: 삽입 및 XSS)을 обнаруж하며, 올바름, 보안, 아키텍처 및 가독성에 대한 철저한 리뷰를 통해 코드의 유지 보수성을 향상시킬 수 있습니다. agentskills.io의 모범 사례 및 표준을 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar normas de codificación, detectar vulnerabilidades de seguridad como Inyección y XSS, y mejorar la mantenibilidad del código a través de revisiones exhaustivas de corrección, seguridad, arquitectura y legibilidad, utilizando las mejores prácticas y normas de agentskills.io.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer des normes de codage, de détecter des vulnérabilités de sécurité telles que l''injection et le XSS, et d''améliorer la maintenabilité du code grâce à des examens approfondis de la correction, de la sécurité, de l''architecture et de la lisibilité, en utilisant les meilleures pratiques et les normes de agentskills.io.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Codierungsstandards durchzusetzen, Sicherheitslücken wie Injection und XSS zu erkennen und die Wartbarkeit des Codes durch gründliche Überprüfungen von Korrektheit, Sicherheit, Architektur und Lesbarkeit zu verbessern, unter Einsatz der besten Praktiken und Standards von agentskills.io.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor padrões de codificação, detectar vulnerabilidades de segurança, como Injeção e XSS, e melhorar a manutenibilidade do código por meio de revisões minuciosas de correção, segurança, arquitetura e legibilidade, utilizando as melhores práticas e padrões do agentskills.io.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечивать соблюдение стандартов кодирования, обнаруживать уязвимости безопасности, такие как Инъекция и XSS, и повышать поддерживаемость кода посредством тщательных обзоров правильности, безопасности, архитектуры и читаемости, используя лучшие практики и стандарты с agentskills.io.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من فرض معايير البرمجة، وكشف الثغرات الأمنية مثل الحقن و XSS، وتحسين صيانة الكود من خلال مراجعات شاملة لصحة الكود وأمانه وهندسته ومقروئيته، باستخدام أفضل الممارسات والمعايير من agentskills.io."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code reviews for scalability and architecture","Detecting security vulnerabilities in code submissions","Enforcing coding standards for consistency and readability"],"zh":["自动化代码审查以实现可扩展性和架构","在代码提交中检测安全漏洞","执行编码标准以实现一致性和可读性"],"ja":["スケーラビリティとアーキテクチャのためのコードレビューの自動化","コード提出でのセキュリティ脆弱性の検出","一貫性と可読性のためのコード規約の適用"],"ko":["확장성 및 아키텍처를 위한 코드 리뷰 자동화","코드 제출에서 보안 취약점 обнаруж","일관성 및 가독성을 위한 코딩 표준 적용"],"es":["Automatizar revisiones de código para escalabilidad y arquitectura","Detección de vulnerabilidades de seguridad en envíos de código","Aplicar normas de codificación para coherencia y legibilidad"],"fr":["Automatiser les examens de code pour la scalabilité et l''architecture","Détecter les vulnérabilités de sécurité dans les soumissions de code"," Appliquer des normes de codage pour la cohérence et la lisibilité"],"de":["Automatisierung von Code-Reviews für Skalierbarkeit und Architektur","Erkennung von Sicherheitslücken in Code-Eingaben","Durchsetzung von Codierungsstandards für Konsistenz und Lesbarkeit"],"pt":["Automatizar revisões de código para escalabilidade e arquitetura","Detectar vulnerabilidades de segurança em submissões de código","Impor padrões de codificação para consistência e legibilidade"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверки кода для масштабируемости и архитектуры","Обнаруживать уязвимости безопасности в поступающем коде","Обеспечивать соблюдение стандартов кодирования для согласованности и читаемости"],"ar":["توفير مراجعات الكود آليًا لتوسيع النطاق والهندسة المعمارية","كشف الثغرات الأمنية في إرسال الكود","فرض معايير البرمجة للاتساق والقابلية للقراءة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to code repositories","Limited to reviewing code in supported programming languages","Dependent on agent''s understanding of coding standards and best practices"],"zh":["需要访问代码仓库","仅限于支持的编程语言的代码审查","依赖于代理的编码标准和最佳实践理解"],"ja":["コードリポジトリへのアクセスが必要","サポートされているプログラミング言語でのみコードのレビューが可能","コード規約とベストプラクティスの理解に依存"],"ko":["코드 저장소에 대한 액세스가 필요함","지원되는 프로그래밍 언어만 코드 리뷰 가능","에이전트의 코딩 표준 및 모범 사례 이해에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso a repositorios de código","Limitado a la revisión de código en lenguajes de programación compatibles","Dependiente de la comprensión del agente de las normas y mejores prácticas de codificación"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux référentiels de code","Limité à la révision de code dans les langages de programmation pris en charge","Dépend de la compréhension de l''agent des normes et des meilleures pratiques de codage"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf Code-Repositorys","Begrenzt auf die Überprüfung von Code in unterstützten Programmiersprachen","Abhängig vom Verständnis des Agents für Codierungsstandards und Best Practices"],"pt":["Exige acesso a repositórios de código","Limitado à revisão de código em linguagens de programação compatíveis","Dependente da compreensão do agente sobre padrões de codificação e boas práticas"],"ru":["Требует доступа к хранилищам кода","Ограничен проверкой кода на поддерживаемых языках программирования","Зависит от понимания агентом стандартов кодирования и лучших практик"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مستودعات الكود","محدود بالمراجعة الكود في لغات البرمجة المدعومة","يعتمد على فهم الوكيل لمعايير البرمجة وأفضل الممارسات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
