Script、React、ネイティブ（iOS/Android）およびバンドル最適化をカバー","ko":"React Native 최적화 모범 사례 가이드. JavaScript, React, 네이티브(ios/Android) 및 번들 최적화를 다룹니다","es":"Guía de optimización de rendimiento para aplicaciones React Native, cubriendo JavaScript/React, Native y optimizaciones de empaquetado.","fr":"Guide d''optimisation des performances pour les applications React Native, couvrant JavaScript/React, Native et optimisation du packaging.","de":"Leitfaden zur Leistungsoptimierung für React-Native-Anwendungen, der JavaScript/React, Native und Bundle-Optimierungen abdeckt.","pt":"Guia de otimização de desempenho para aplicações React Native, cobrindo JavaScript/React e otimizações nativas","ru":"Руководство по оптимизации производительности для приложений React Native, охватывающее JavaScript/React и родные оптимизации","ar":"دليل تحسين الأداء لتطبيقات رياكت نيتيف، يشمل جافا سكريبت/رياكت وتحسينات الأصلية","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["JavaScript 优化","Native 优化","打包优化","性能优化指南","快速查找和深入理解"],"ja":["JavaScript 最適化","ネイティブ最適化","バンドル最適化","パフォーマンス最適化ガイド","高速検索と深い理解"],"ko":["JavaScript 최적화","네이티브 최적화","번들 최적화","성능 최적화 가이드","빠른 조회 및 심층적 이해"],"es":["Optimización de JavaScript y React","Optimización de Native para iOS y Android","Optimización de empaquetado","Patrones de código para una rápida búsqueda","Comandos de shell para medir el rendimiento"],"fr":["Optimisation de JavaScript et React","Optimisation de Native pour iOS et Android","Optimisation du packaging","Modèles de code pour une recherche rapide","Commandes shell pour mesurer les performances"],"de":["Optimierung von JavaScript und React","Optimierung von Native für iOS und Android","Optimierung des Bundle","Code-Muster für eine schnelle Suche","Shell-Befehle zur Leistungsmessung"],"pt":["Otimização de JavaScript/React","Otimização de desempenho nativo","Otimização de bundling","Guia de padrões de código","Comandos de shell para medição e processo","Exemplos de código corretos e incorretos"],"ru":["Оптимизация JavaScript/React","Оптимизация родного производительности","Оптимизация пакетирования","Руководство по стандартам кода","Команды shell для измерения и обработки","Примеры правильного и неправильного кода"],"ar":["تحسين جافا سكريبت/رياكت","تحسين الأداء الأصلي","تحسين تحزيم","دليل نموذج код","أوامر شل لقياس والمعالجة","أمثلة على الكود الصحيح والخاطئ"]},"keywords":{"zh":["React Native 优化","JavaScript 优化","Native 优化","打包优化","性能优化","React Native 最佳实践"],"ja":["React Native 最適化","JavaScript 最適化","ネイティブ最適化","バンドル最適化","パフォーマンス最適化","React Native ベストプラクティス"],"ko":["React Native 최적화","JavaScript 최적화","네이티브 최적화","번들 최적화","성능 최적화","React Native 모범 사례"],"es":["React Native","optimización de rendimiento","mejores prácticas","JavaScript","Native","empaquetado","desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles"],"fr":["React Native","optimisation des performances","meilleures pratiques","JavaScript","Native","packaging","développement d''applications mobiles"],"de":["React Native","Leistungsoptimierung","Best Practices","JavaScript","Native","Bundle","Mobile-App-Entwicklung"],"pt":["React Native","Otimização de desempenho","JavaScript","React","Desenvolvimento móvel","Bundling","Padrões de código"],"ru":["React Native","Оптимизация производительности","JavaScript","React","Мобильная разработка","Пакетирование","Стандарты кода"],"ar":["رياكت نيتيف","تحسين الأداء","جافا سكريبت","رياكت","تطوير الهاتف المحمول","تحزيم","نموذج الكود"]}},"owner":"budgie-at","repo":"budgie","repoPath":"budgie-at/budgie","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.422Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"react-native-best-practices","description":"Provides React Native performance optimization guidelines for FPS, TTI, bundle size, memory leaks, re-renders, and animations. Applies to tasks involving Hermes optimization, JS thread blocking, bridge overhead, FlashList, native modules, or debugging jank and frame drops.","tags":"react-native, expo, performance, optimization, profiling","bodyPreview":"# React Native Best Practices\n\n## Overview\n\nPerformance optimization guide for React Native applications, covering JavaScript/React, Native (iOS/Android), and bundling optimizations. Based on Callstack''s \"Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization\".\n\n## Skill Format\n\nEach reference file follows a hybrid format for fast lookup and deep understanding:\n\n- **Quick Pattern**: Incorrect/Correct code snippets for immediate pattern matching\n- **Quick Command**: Shell commands for process/measurement sk","body":"# React Native Best Practices\n\n## Overview\n\nPerformance optimization guide for React Native applications, covering JavaScript/React, Native (iOS/Android), and bundling optimizations. Based on Callstack''s \"Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization\".\n\n## Skill Format\n\nEach reference file follows a hybrid format for fast lookup and deep understanding:\n\n- **Quick Pattern**: Incorrect/Correct code snippets for immediate pattern matching\n- **Quick Command**: Shell commands for process/measurement skills\n- **Quick Config**: Configuration snippets for setup-focused skills\n- **Quick Reference**: Summary tables for conceptual skills\n- **Deep Dive**: Full context with When to Use, Prerequisites, Step-by-Step, Common Pitfalls\n\n**Impact ratings**: CRITICAL (fix immediately), HIGH (significant improvement), MEDIUM (worthwhile optimization)\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Debugging slow/janky UI or animations\n- Investigating memory leaks (JS or native)\n- Optimizing app startup time (TTI)\n- Reducing bundle or app size\n- Writing native modules (Turbo Modules)\n- Profiling React Native performance\n- Reviewing React Native code for performance\n\n## Priority-Ordered Guidelines\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | FPS & Re-renders | CRITICAL | `js-*` |\n| 2 | Bundle Size | CRITICAL | `bundle-*` |\n| 3 | TTI Optimization | HIGH | `native-*`, `bundle-*` |\n| 4 | Native Performance | HIGH | `native-*` |\n| 5 | Memory Management | MEDIUM-HIGH | `js-*`, `native-*` |\n| 6 | Animations | MEDIUM | `js-*` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Critical: FPS & Re-renders\n\n**Profile first:**\n```bash\n# Open React Native DevTools\n# Press ''j'' in Metro, or shake device → \"Open DevTools\"\n```\n\n**Common fixes:**\n- Replace ScrollView with FlatList/FlashList for lists\n- Use React Compiler for automatic memoization\n- Use atomic state (Jotai/Zustand) to reduce re-renders\n- Use `useDeferredValue` for expensive computations\n\n### Critical: Bundle Size\n\n**Analyze bundle:**\n```bash\nnpx react-native bundle \\\n  --entry-file index.js \\\n  --bundle-output output.js \\\n  --platform ios \\\n  --sourcemap-output output.js.map \\\n  --dev false --minify true\n\nnpx source-map-explorer output.js --no-border-checks\n```\n\n**Common fixes:**\n- Avoid barrel imports (import directly from source)\n- Remove unnecessary Intl polyfills (Hermes has native support)\n- Enable tree shaking (Expo SDK 52+ or Re.Pack)\n- Enable R8 for Android native code shrinking\n\n### High: TTI Optimization\n\n**Measure TTI:**\n- Use `react-native-performance` for markers\n- Only measure cold starts (exclude warm/hot/prewarm)\n\n**Common fixes:**\n- Disable JS bundle compression on Android (enables Hermes mmap)\n- Use native navigation (react-native-screens)\n- Defer non-critical work with `InteractionManager`\n\n### High: Native Performance\n\n**Profile native:**\n- iOS: Xcode Instruments → Time Profiler\n- Android: Android Studio → CPU Profiler\n\n**Common fixes:**\n- Use background threads for heavy native work\n- Prefer async over sync Turbo Module methods\n- Use C++ for cross-platform performance-critical code\n\n## References\n\nFull documentation with code examples in `references/`:\n\n### JavaScript/React (`js-*`)\n\n| File | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| `js-lists-flatlist-flashlist.md` | CRITICAL | Replace ScrollView with virtualized lists |\n| `js-profile-react.md` | MEDIUM | React DevTools profiling |\n| `js-measure-fps.md` | HIGH | FPS monitoring and measurement |\n| `js-memory-leaks.md` | MEDIUM | JS memory leak hunting |\n| `js-atomic-state.md` | HIGH | Jotai/Zustand patterns |\n| `js-concurrent-react.md` | HIGH | useDeferredValue, useTransition |\n| `js-react-compiler.md` | HIGH | Automatic memoization |\n| `js-animations-reanimated.md` | MEDIUM | Reanimated worklets |\n| `js-uncontrolled-components.md` | HIGH | TextInput optimization |\n\n### Native (`native-*`)\n\n| File | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| `native-turbo-modules.md` | HIGH | Building fast native modules |\n| `native-sdks-over-polyfills.md` | HIGH | Native vs JS libraries |\n| `native-measure-tti.md` | HIGH | TTI measurement setup |\n| `native-threading-model.md` | HIGH | Turbo Module threads |\n| `native-profiling.md` | MEDIUM | Xcode/Android Studio profiling |\n| `native-platform-setup.md` | MEDIUM | iOS/Android tooling guide |\n| `native-view-flattening.md` | MEDIUM | View hierarchy debugging |\n| `native-memory-patterns.md` | MEDIUM | C++/Swift/Kotlin memory |\n| `native-memory-leaks.md` | MEDIUM | Native memory leak hunting |\n| `native-android-16kb-alignment.md` | CRITICAL | Third-party library alignment for Google Play |\n\n### Bundling (`bundle-*`)\n\n| File | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| `bundle-barrel-exports.md` | CRITICAL | Avoid barrel imports |\n| `bundle-analyze-js.md` | CRITICAL | JS bundle visualization |\n| `bundle-tree-shaking.md` | HIGH | Dead code elimination |\n| `bundle-analyze-app.md` | HIGH | App size analysis |\n| `bundle-r8-android.md` | HIGH | Android code shrinking |\n| `bundle-hermes-mmap.md` | HIGH | Disable bundle compression |\n| `bundle-native-assets.md` | HIGH | Asset catalog setup |\n| `bundle-library-size.md` | MEDIUM | Evaluate dependencies |\n| `bundle-code-splitting.md` | MEDIUM | Re.Pack code splitting |\n\n## Searching References\n\n```bash\n# Find patterns by keyword\ngrep -l \"reanimated\" references/\ngrep -l \"flatlist\" references/\ngrep -l \"memory\" references/\ngrep -l \"profil\" references/\ngrep -l \"tti\" references/\ngrep -l \"bundle\" references/\n```\n\n## Problem → Skill Mapping\n\n| Problem | Start With |\n|---------|------------|\n| App feels slow/janky | `js-measure-fps.md` → `js-profile-react.md` |\n| Too many re-renders | `js-profile-react.md` → `js-react-compiler.md` |\n| Slow startup (TTI) | `native-measure-tti.md` → `bundle-analyze-js.md` |\n| Large app size | `bundle-analyze-app.md` → `bundle-r8-android.md` |\n| Memory growing | `js-memory-leaks.md` or `native-memory-leaks.md` |\n| Animation drops frames | `js-animations-reanimated.md` |\n| List scroll jank | `js-lists-flatlist-flashlist.md` |\n| TextInput lag | `js-uncontrolled-components.md` |\n| Native module slow | `native-turbo-modules.md` → `native-threading-model.md` |\n| Native library alignment issue | `native-android-16kb-alignment.md` |\n\n## Attribution\n\nBased on \"The Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization\" by Callstack.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:34:04.425Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Mobile App Development Agents needing advanced React Native performance optimization techniques.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 React Native 性能优化技术的移动应用开发代理。","ja":"React Native のパフォーマンス最適化の高度なテクニックを必要とするモバイルアプリ開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 React Native 성능 최적화 기술이 필요한 모바일 앱 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles que necesitan técnicas avanzadas de optimización de rendimiento de React Native.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement d''applications mobiles ayant besoin de techniques avancées d''optimisation des performances de React Native.","de":"Perfekt für Mobile App Development Agents, die erweiterte React Native Leistungs-Optimierungs-Techniken benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento de Aplicativos Móveis que necessitam de técnicas avançadas de otimização de desempenho do React Native.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки мобильных приложений, которым необходимы продвинутые методы оптимизации производительности React Native.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطبيق الهاتف المحمول الذي يحتاج إلى تقنيات متقدمة لتحسين أداء React Native."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize React Native applications using JavaScript and React best practices, Native iOS and Android optimizations, and advanced bundling techniques, including process measurement and optimization using shell commands.","zh":"赋予代理使用 JavaScript 和 React 最佳实践、原生 iOS 和 Android 优化以及高级打包技术（包括使用 Shell 命令进行过程测量和优化）来优化 React Native 应用。","ja":"JavaScript と React のベストプラクティス、ネイティブ iOS と Android の最適化、および高度なバンドリングテクニック（シェルコマンドを使用したプロセスの測定と最適化を含む）を使用して React Native アプリを最適化するためにエージェントをエンパワーします。","ko":"JavaScript 및 React 모범 사례, 네이티브 iOS 및 Android 최적화 및 고급 번들링 기술(쉘 명령을 사용한 프로세스 측정 및 최적화를 포함)을 사용하여 React Native 애플리케이션을 최적화할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a optimizar aplicaciones de React Native utilizando las mejores prácticas de JavaScript y React, optimizaciones de iOS y Android nativas, y técnicas de empaquetado avanzadas, incluyendo la medición y optimización del proceso utilizando comandos de shell.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les applications React Native en utilisant les meilleures pratiques de JavaScript et React, les optimisations natives iOS et Android, et les techniques de regroupement avancées, y compris la mesure et l''optimisation du processus à l''aide de commandes shell.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, React Native-Anwendungen zu optimieren, indem sie JavaScript- und React-Best-Practices, native iOS- und Android-Optimierungen sowie erweiterte Bündel-Techniken verwenden, einschließlich Prozessmessung und -optimierung unter Verwendung von Shell-Befehlen.","pt":"Habilite os agentes a otimizarem aplicativos React Native usando as melhores práticas JavaScript e React, otimizações nativas do iOS e Android, e técnicas avançadas de empacotamento, incluindo medição e otimização do processo usando comandos do shell.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать приложения React Native, используя лучшие практики JavaScript и React, родные оптимизации iOS и Android, а также продвинутые методы пакетирования, включая измерение и оптимизацию процесса с помощью команд оболочки.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل khảية تحسين أداء تطبيقات React Native باستخدام أفضل الممارسات لجافا سكريبت وري액ت، وتحسينات الأندرويد والآي أو إس الأصلية، و تقنيات تعبئة متقدمة، بما في ذلك قياس وتحسين العملية باستخدام أوامر الشل."},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing React Native application performance","Debugging JavaScript and Native code issues","Implementing efficient bundling and caching strategies"],"zh":["优化 React Native 应用性能","调试 JavaScript 和原生代码问题","实施高效的打包和缓存策略"],"ja":["React Native アプリのパフォーマンスを最適化する","JavaScript とネイティブコードの問題をデバッグする","効率的なバンドリングとキャッシュ戦略を実装する"],"ko":["React Native 애플리케이션 성능 최적화","JavaScript 및 네이티브 코드 문제 디버깅","효율적인 번들링 및 캐싱 전략 구현"],"es":["Optimizar el rendimiento de la aplicación React Native","Depurar problemas de código JavaScript y Nativo","Implementar estrategias de empaquetado y almacenamiento en caché eficientes"],"fr":["Optimiser les performances de l''application React Native","Déboguer les problèmes de code JavaScript et Natif","Mettre en œuvre des stratégies de regroupement et de mise en cache efficaces"],"de":["React Native-Anwendungsleistung optimieren","JavaScript- und Native-Code-Probleme debuggen","Effiziente Bündel- und Caching-Strategien implementieren"],"pt":["Otimizar o desempenho do aplicativo React Native","Depurar problemas de código JavaScript e Nativo","Implementar estratégias de empacotamento e cache eficientes"],"ru":["Оптимизировать производительность приложения React Native","Отладить проблемы кода JavaScript и родного кода","Реализовать эффективные стратегии пакетирования и кэширования"],"ar":["تحسين أداء تطبيق React Native","تصحيح أخطاء كود جافا سكريبت والأصلي","تنفيذ استراتيجيات تعبئة وذاكرة مؤقتة فعالة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of React Native and JavaScript","Focused on React Native optimization, not general mobile app development"],"zh":["需要了解 React Native 和 JavaScript","仅关注 React Native 优化，而不是一般的移动应用开发"],"ja":["React Native と JavaScript に関する知識が必要","一般的なモバイルアプリ開発ではなく、React Native の最適化に焦点を当てている"],"ko":["React Native 및 JavaScript에 대한 지식이 필요","일반적인 모바일 앱 개발이 아닌 React Native 최적화에 중점을 둠"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de React Native y JavaScript","Se centra en la optimización de React Native, no en el desarrollo general de aplicaciones móviles"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances sur React Native et JavaScript","Se concentre sur l''optimisation de React Native, et non sur le développement général d''applications mobiles"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von React Native und JavaScript","Konzentriert sich auf die Optimierung von React Native, nicht auf die allgemeine Entwicklung von Mobile Apps"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de React Native e JavaScript","Focado na otimização do React Native, não no desenvolvimento geral de aplicativos móveis"],"ru":["Требует знаний React Native и JavaScript","Сосредоточен на оптимизации React Native, а не на общем разработке мобильных приложений"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة برياكت نатив وجافا سكريبت","يركز على تحسين أداء رياكت نيتيف، وليس على تطوير تطبيقات الهاتف المحمول بشكل عام"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
