éation de composants autonomes","Autorisation intégrée","Gestion de dépendances","Compatibilité avec plusieurs projets","Exportations et isolation","Intégration avec @djpanda/convex-authz"],"de":["Erstellung von selbstenthaltenen Komponenten","Integrierte Autorisierung","Abhängigkeitsverwaltung","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Projekten","Exporte und Isolation","Integration mit @djpanda/convex-authz"],"pt":["Criação de componentes reutilizáveis","Autorização via @djpanda/convex-authz","Gerenciamento de dependências","Compartilhamento entre projetos","Isolamento e exportação de componentes","Integração com Convex"],"ru":["Создание многократно используемых компонентов","Авторизация через @djpanda/convex-authz","Управление зависимостями","Обмен между проектами","Изоляция и экспорт компонентов","Интеграция с Convex"],"ar":["إنشاء مكونات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام","المصادقة عبر @djpanda/convex-authz","إدارة التبعيات","المشاركة بين المشاريع","عزل وتصدير المكونات","التكامل مع Convex"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Convex 组件","组件作者工具","多租户组织","团队管理","内置授权","Convex 开发","组件开发"],"ja":["Convex コンポーネント","コンポーネント作成ツール","マルチテナント組織","チーム管理","内蔵認証","Convex 開発","コンポーネント開発"],"ko":["Convex 컴포넌트","컴포넌트 작성 도구","다중 테넌트 조직","팀 관리","내장 인증","Convex 개발","컴포넌트 개발"],"es":["componentes Convex","creación de componentes","autorización","gestión de dependencias","proyectos de desarrollo","desarrollo de software","Convex","@djpanda/convex-authz"],"fr":["composants Convex","création de composants","autorisation","gestion de dépendances","projets de développement","développement de logiciels","Convex","@djpanda/convex-authz"],"de":["Convex-Komponenten","Erstellung von Komponenten","Autorisierung","Abhängigkeitsverwaltung","Entwicklungsprojekte","Softwareentwicklung","Convex","@djpanda/convex-authz"],"pt":["componentes Convex","criação de componentes","autorização","gerenciamento de dependências","compartilhamento de componentes","desenvolvimento de software","Convex","reutilização de código","engenharia de software"],"ru":["компоненты Convex","создание компонентов","авторизация","управление зависимостями","обмен компонентами","разработка программного обеспечения","Convex","многократное использование кода","инженерия программного обеспечения"],"ar":["مكونات Convex","إنشاء مكونات","المصادقة","إدارة التبعيات","مشاركة المكونات","تطوير البرمجيات","Convex","إعادة استخدام الكود","هندسة البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"dbjpanda","repo":"convex-tenants","repoPath":"dbjpanda/convex-tenants","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.422Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"convex-component-authoring","description":"How to create, structure, and publish self-contained Convex components with proper isolation, exports, and dependency management","version":"1.0.0","tags":["convex","components","reusable","packages","npm"],"bodyPreview":"# Convex Component Authoring\n\nCreate self-contained, reusable Convex components with proper isolation, exports, and dependency management for sharing across projects.\n\n## Documentation Sources\n\nBefore implementing, do not assume; fetch the latest documentation:\n\n- Primary: https://docs.convex.dev/components\n- Component Authoring: https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring\n- For broader context: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n\n## Instructions\n\n### What Are Convex Components?\n\nConvex component","body":"# Convex Component Authoring\n\nCreate self-contained, reusable Convex components with proper isolation, exports, and dependency management for sharing across projects.\n\n## Documentation Sources\n\nBefore implementing, do not assume; fetch the latest documentation:\n\n- Primary: https://docs.convex.dev/components\n- Component Authoring: https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring\n- For broader context: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n\n## Instructions\n\n### What Are Convex Components?\n\nConvex components are self-contained packages that include:\n- Database tables (isolated from the main app)\n- Functions (queries, mutations, actions)\n- TypeScript types and validators\n- Optional frontend hooks\n\n### Component Structure\n\n```\nmy-convex-component/\n├── package.json\n├── tsconfig.json\n├── README.md\n├── src/\n│   ├── index.ts           # Main exports\n│   ├── component.ts       # Component definition\n│   ├── schema.ts          # Component schema\n│   └── functions/\n│       ├── queries.ts\n│       ├── mutations.ts\n│       └── actions.ts\n└── convex.config.ts       # Component configuration\n```\n\n### Creating a Component\n\n#### 1. Component Configuration\n\n```typescript\n// convex.config.ts\nimport { defineComponent } from \"convex/server\";\n\nexport default defineComponent(\"myComponent\");\n```\n\n#### 2. Component Schema\n\n```typescript\n// src/schema.ts\nimport { defineSchema, defineTable } from \"convex/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport default defineSchema({\n  // Tables are isolated to this component\n  items: defineTable({\n    name: v.string(),\n    data: v.any(),\n    createdAt: v.number(),\n  }).index(\"by_name\", [\"name\"]),\n  \n  config: defineTable({\n    key: v.string(),\n    value: v.any(),\n  }).index(\"by_key\", [\"key\"]),\n});\n```\n\n#### 3. Component Definition\n\n```typescript\n// src/component.ts\nimport { defineComponent, ComponentDefinition } from \"convex/server\";\nimport schema from \"./schema\";\nimport * as queries from \"./functions/queries\";\nimport * as mutations from \"./functions/mutations\";\n\nconst component = defineComponent(\"myComponent\", {\n  schema,\n  functions: {\n    ...queries,\n    ...mutations,\n  },\n});\n\nexport default component;\n```\n\n#### 4. Component Functions\n\n```typescript\n// src/functions/queries.ts\nimport { query } from \"../_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport const list = query({\n  args: {\n    limit: v.optional(v.number()),\n  },\n  returns: v.array(v.object({\n    _id: v.id(\"items\"),\n    name: v.string(),\n    data: v.any(),\n    createdAt: v.number(),\n  })),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.db\n      .query(\"items\")\n      .order(\"desc\")\n      .take(args.limit ?? 10);\n  },\n});\n\nexport const get = query({\n  args: { name: v.string() },\n  returns: v.union(v.object({\n    _id: v.id(\"items\"),\n    name: v.string(),\n    data: v.any(),\n  }), v.null()),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.db\n      .query(\"items\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_name\", (q) => q.eq(\"name\", args.name))\n      .unique();\n  },\n});\n```\n\n```typescript\n// src/functions/mutations.ts\nimport { mutation } from \"../_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport const create = mutation({\n  args: {\n    name: v.string(),\n    data: v.any(),\n  },\n  returns: v.id(\"items\"),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.db.insert(\"items\", {\n      name: args.name,\n      data: args.data,\n      createdAt: Date.now(),\n    });\n  },\n});\n\nexport const update = mutation({\n  args: {\n    id: v.id(\"items\"),\n    data: v.any(),\n  },\n  returns: v.null(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    await ctx.db.patch(args.id, { data: args.data });\n    return null;\n  },\n});\n\nexport const remove = mutation({\n  args: { id: v.id(\"items\") },\n  returns: v.null(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    await ctx.db.delete(args.id);\n    return null;\n  },\n});\n```\n\n#### 5. Main Exports\n\n```typescript\n// src/index.ts\nexport { default as component } from \"./component\";\nexport * from \"./functions/queries\";\nexport * from \"./functions/mutations\";\n\n// Export types for consumers\nexport type { Id } from \"./_generated/dataModel\";\n```\n\n### Using a Component\n\n```typescript\n// In the consuming app''s convex/convex.config.ts\nimport { defineApp } from \"convex/server\";\nimport myComponent from \"my-convex-component\";\n\nconst app = defineApp();\n\napp.use(myComponent, { name: \"myComponent\" });\n\nexport default app;\n```\n\n```typescript\n// In the consuming app''s code\nimport { useQuery, useMutation } from \"convex/react\";\nimport { api } from \"../convex/_generated/api\";\n\nfunction MyApp() {\n  // Access component functions through the app''s API\n  const items = useQuery(api.myComponent.list, { limit: 10 });\n  const createItem = useMutation(api.myComponent.create);\n  \n  return (\n    <div>\n      {items?.map((item) => (\n        <div key={item._id}>{item.name}</div>\n      ))}\n      <button onClick={() => createItem({ name: \"New\", data: {} })}>\n        Add Item\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Component Configuration Options\n\n```typescript\n// convex/convex.config.ts\nimport { defineApp } from \"convex/server\";\nimport myComponent from \"my-convex-component\";\n\nconst app = defineApp();\n\n// Basic usage\napp.use(myComponent);\n\n// With custom name\napp.use(myComponent, { name: \"customName\" });\n\n// Multiple instances\napp.use(myComponent, { name: \"instance1\" });\napp.use(myComponent, { name: \"instance2\" });\n\nexport default app;\n```\n\n### Providing Component Hooks\n\n```typescript\n// src/hooks.ts\nimport { useQuery, useMutation } from \"convex/react\";\nimport { FunctionReference } from \"convex/server\";\n\n// Type-safe hooks for component consumers\nexport function useMyComponent(api: {\n  list: FunctionReference<\"query\">;\n  create: FunctionReference<\"mutation\">;\n}) {\n  const items = useQuery(api.list, {});\n  const createItem = useMutation(api.create);\n  \n  return {\n    items,\n    createItem,\n    isLoading: items === undefined,\n  };\n}\n```\n\n### Publishing a Component\n\n#### package.json\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"my-convex-component\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"description\": \"A reusable Convex component\",\n  \"main\": \"dist/index.js\",\n  \"types\": \"dist/index.d.ts\",\n  \"files\": [\n    \"dist\",\n    \"convex.config.ts\"\n  ],\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"build\": \"tsc\",\n    \"prepublishOnly\": \"npm run build\"\n  },\n  \"peerDependencies\": {\n    \"convex\": \"^1.0.0\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"convex\": \"^1.17.0\",\n    \"typescript\": \"^5.0.0\"\n  },\n  \"keywords\": [\n    \"convex\",\n    \"component\"\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n#### tsconfig.json\n\n```json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"target\": \"ES2020\",\n    \"module\": \"ESNext\",\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"bundler\",\n    \"declaration\": true,\n    \"outDir\": \"dist\",\n    \"strict\": true,\n    \"esModuleInterop\": true,\n    \"skipLibCheck\": true\n  },\n  \"include\": [\"src/**/*\"],\n  \"exclude\": [\"node_modules\", \"dist\"]\n}\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n### Rate Limiter Component\n\n```typescript\n// rate-limiter/src/schema.ts\nimport { defineSchema, defineTable } from \"convex/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport default defineSchema({\n  requests: defineTable({\n    key: v.string(),\n    timestamp: v.number(),\n  })\n    .index(\"by_key\", [\"key\"])\n    .index(\"by_key_and_time\", [\"key\", \"timestamp\"]),\n});\n```\n\n```typescript\n// rate-limiter/src/functions/mutations.ts\nimport { mutation } from \"../_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport const checkLimit = mutation({\n  args: {\n    key: v.string(),\n    limit: v.number(),\n    windowMs: v.number(),\n  },\n  returns: v.object({\n    allowed: v.boolean(),\n    remaining: v.number(),\n    resetAt: v.number(),\n  }),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const now = Date.now();\n    const windowStart = now - args.windowMs;\n    \n    // Clean old entries\n    const oldEntries = await ctx.db\n      .query(\"requests\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_key_and_time\", (q) => \n        q.eq(\"key\", args.key).lt(\"timestamp\", windowStart)\n      )\n      .collect();\n    \n    for (const entry of oldEntries) {\n      await ctx.db.delete(entry._id);\n    }\n    \n    // Count current window\n    const currentRequests = await ctx.db\n      .query(\"requests\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_key\", (q) => q.eq(\"key\", args.key))\n      .collect();\n    \n    const remaining = Math.max(0, args.limit - currentRequests.length);\n    const allowed = remaining > 0;\n    \n    if (allowed) {\n      await ctx.db.insert(\"requests\", {\n        key: args.key,\n        timestamp: now,\n      });\n    }\n    \n    const oldestRequest = currentRequests[0];\n    const resetAt = oldestRequest \n      ? oldestRequest.timestamp + args.windowMs \n      : now + args.windowMs;\n    \n    return { allowed, remaining: remaining - (allowed ? 1 : 0), resetAt };\n  },\n});\n```\n\n```typescript\n// Usage in consuming app\nimport { useMutation } from \"convex/react\";\nimport { api } from \"../convex/_generated/api\";\n\nfunction useRateLimitedAction() {\n  const checkLimit = useMutation(api.rateLimiter.checkLimit);\n  \n  return async (action: () => Promise<void>) => {\n    const result = await checkLimit({\n      key: \"user-action\",\n      limit: 10,\n      windowMs: 60000,\n    });\n    \n    if (!result.allowed) {\n      throw new Error(`Rate limited. Try again at ${new Date(result.resetAt)}`);\n    }\n    \n    await action();\n  };\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- Never run `npx convex deploy` unless explicitly instructed\n- Never run any git commands unless explicitly instructed\n- Keep component tables isolated (don''t reference main app tables)\n- Export clear TypeScript types for consumers\n- Document all public functions and their arguments\n- Use semantic versioning for component releases\n- Include comprehensive README with examples\n- Test components in isolation before publishing\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n1. **Cross-referencing tables** - Component tables should be self-contained\n2. **Missing type exports** - Export all necessary types\n3. **Hardcoded configuration** - Use component options for customization\n4. **No versioning** - Follow semantic versioning\n5. **Poor documentation** - Document all public APIs\n\n## References\n\n- Convex Documentation: https://docs.convex.dev/\n- Convex LLMs.txt: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n- Components: https://docs.convex.dev/components\n- Component Authoring: https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:35:39.139Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT requiring advanced Convex component management with built-in authorization via @djpanda/convex-authz","zh":"适用于Claude Code和AutoGPT等需要高级Convex组件管理和内置授权的AI Agent，如@djpanda/convex-authz","ja":"Claude CodeやAutoGPTのようなConvexコンポーネントの高度な管理と内蔵の認可を必要とするAIエージェントに適しています。@djpanda/convex-authzを使用した認可が可能です","ko":"클라우드 코드와 오토지피티 같은 고급 Convex 구성 요소 관리와 내장 인증이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다. @djpanda/convex-authz를 사용한 인증이 가능합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude Code y AutoGPT que requieren una gestión avanzada de componentes Convex con autorización integrada a través de @djpanda/convex-authz","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Claude Code et AutoGPT nécessitant une gestion avancée de composants Convex avec autorisation intégrée via @djpanda/convex-authz","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Claude Code und AutoGPT, die eine erweiterte Convex-Komponentenverwaltung mit integrierter Autorisierung über @djpanda/convex-authz erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como Claude Code e AutoGPT que exigem gerenciamento avançado de componentes Convex com autorização incorporada via @djpanda/convex-authz","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code и AutoGPT, требующих продвинутого управления компонентами Convex с встроенной авторизацией через @djpanda/convex-authz","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT التي تتطلب إدارة متقدمة لمكونات Convex مع تفويض مدمج عبر @djpanda/convex-authz"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create self-contained, reusable Convex components with proper isolation, exports, and dependency management using Convex documentation and @djpanda/convex-authz for authorization, enabling seamless sharing across projects via https://docs.convex.dev/components","zh":"赋予代理创建自包含、可重用的Convex组件的能力，具有适当的隔离、导出和依赖管理，使用Convex文档和@djpanda/convex-authz进行授权，使得项目间的共享变得顺畅。相关文档请参阅https://docs.convex.dev/components","ja":"エージェントがセルフコンタインドで再利用可能なConvexコンポーネントを作成できるようにし、適切な隔離、エクスポート、依存関係管理を実現します。Convexのドキュメントと@djpanda/convex-authzを使用した認可により、プロジェクト間でのシームレスな共有を可能にします。https://docs.convex.dev/componentsを参照してください","ko":"에이전트가 자체 포함 및 재사용 가능한 Convex 구성 요소를 만들 수 있도록 하여 적절한 격리, 내보내기 및 종속성 관리를 제공합니다. Convex 문서 및 @djpanda/convex-authz를 사용한 인증으로 프로젝트 간에 원활한 공유를 가능하게 합니다. https://docs.convex.dev/components를 참조하세요","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear componentes Convex autocontenidos y reutilizables con aislamiento adecuado, exportaciones y gestión de dependencias utilizando la documentación de Convex y @djpanda/convex-authz para la autorización, lo que permite una compartición fluida entre proyectos a través de https://docs.convex.dev/components","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des composants Convex autocontenus et réutilisables avec une isolation appropriée, des exportations et une gestion des dépendances en utilisant la documentation Convex et @djpanda/convex-authz pour l''autorisation, ce qui permet un partage fluide entre les projets via https://docs.convex.dev/components","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, selbstenthaltene, wiederverwendbare Convex-Komponenten mit ordnungsgemäßer Isolation, Exporten und Abhängigkeitsverwaltung zu erstellen, indem sie die Convex-Dokumentation und @djpanda/convex-authz für die Autorisierung verwenden, was ein nahtloses Teilen zwischen Projekten über https://docs.convex.dev/components ermöglicht","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar componentes Convex autocontidos e reutilizáveis com isolamento adequado, exportações e gerenciamento de dependências usando a documentação Convex e @djpanda/convex-authz para autorização, permitindo compartilhamento sem problemas entre projetos via https://docs.convex.dev/components","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать самодостаточные, многократно используемые компоненты Convex с надлежащей изоляцией, экспортами и управлением зависимостями, используя документацию Convex и @djpanda/convex-authz для авторизации, что позволяет бесшовно делиться между проектами через https://docs.convex.dev/components","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء مكونات Convex مُحكمة ومُستعيدة مع عزل مناسب وتحميلات وإدارة التبعيات باستخدام توثيق Convex و@djpanda/convex-authz للتفويض، مما يُمكن المشاركة بدون عوائق عبر المشاريع عبر https://docs.convex.dev/components"},"useCases":{"en":["Authoring reusable Convex components for multi-tenant organizations","Implementing fine-grained authorization with @djpanda/convex-authz","Streamlining Convex component dependency management across projects"],"zh":["为多租户组织编写可重用的Convex组件","使用@djpanda/convex-authz实现细粒度的授权","使用Convex文档和@djpanda/convex-authz跨项目简化Convex组件的依赖管理"],"ja":["マルチテナント組織向けの再利用可能なConvexコンポーネントの作成","@djpanda/convex-authzを使用した細粒度の認可の実装","Convexドキュメントと@djpanda/convex-authzを使用したConvexコンポーネントの依存関係管理の簡素化"],"ko":["다중 테넌트 조직을 위한 재사용 가능한 Convex 구성 요소 작성","@djpanda/convex-authz를 사용한 세부적인 인증 구현","Convex 문서 및 @djpanda/convex-authz를 사용한 Convex 구성 요소 종속성 관리 간소화"],"es":["Creación de componentes Convex reutilizables para organizaciones multi-tenant","Implementación de una autorización detallada con @djpanda/convex-authz","Optimización de la gestión de dependencias de componentes Convex entre proyectos"],"fr":["Création de composants Convex réutilisables pour les organisations multi-locataires","Mise en œuvre d''une autorisation fine avec @djpanda/convex-authz","Optimisation de la gestion des dépendances de composants Convex entre les projets"],"de":["Erstellung wiederverwendbarer Convex-Komponenten für Multi-Tenant-Organisationen","Implementierung einer feingranularen Autorisierung mit @djpanda/convex-authz","Optimierung der Abhängigkeitsverwaltung von Convex-Komponenten zwischen Projekten"],"pt":["Criação de componentes Convex reutilizáveis para organizações multi-locatárias","Implementação de autorização granular com @djpanda/convex-authz","Otimização do gerenciamento de dependências de componentes Convex entre projetos"],"ru":["Создание многократно используемых компонентов Convex для многопользовательских организаций","Реализация тонкой авторизации с помощью @djpanda/convex-authz","Оптимизация управления зависимостями компонентов Convex между проектами"],"ar":["إنشاء مكونات Convex مُستعيدة لمنظمات متعددة المستأجرين","تنفيذ تفويض دقيق مع @djpanda/convex-authz","تعزيز إدارة التبعيات لمكونات Convex عبر المشاريع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Convex setup and documentation fetch from https://docs.convex.dev/components","Dependent on @djpanda/convex-authz for authorization"],"zh":["需要Convex设置和从https://docs.convex.dev/components获取文档","依赖@djpanda/convex-authz进行授权"],"ja":["Convexの設定とhttps://docs.convex.dev/componentsからのドキュメントの取得が必要","@djpanda/convex-authzに依存した認可"],"ko":["Convex 설정 및 https://docs.convex.dev/components에서 문서 가져오기가 필요합니다","@djpanda/convex-authz에 의존한 인증"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Convex y recuperación de documentación desde https://docs.convex.dev/components","Depende de @djpanda/convex-authz para la autorización"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration Convex et une récupération de documentation depuis https://docs.convex.dev/components","Dépend de @djpanda/convex-authz pour l''autorisation"],"de":["Benötigt Convex-Konfiguration und Abruf von Dokumentation von https://docs.convex.dev/components","Hängt von @djpanda/convex-authz für die Autorisierung ab"],"pt":["Exige configuração Convex e fetch de documentação de https://docs.convex.dev/components","Dependente de @djpanda/convex-authz para autorização"],"ru":["Требуется настройка Convex и получение документации с https://docs.convex.dev/components","Зависит от @djpanda/convex-authz для авторизации"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Convex وتحميل الوثائق من https://docs.convex.dev/components","يعتمد على @djpanda/convex-authz للتفويض"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":90}');
