"de":["Entwicklung von individuellen Preisstrategien","Analyse der Konkurrenz und des Marktes","Ermittlung der Zahlungsbereitschaft der Kunden","Entwicklung von flexiblen Preismodellen","Umsetzung von effektiven Preisstrategien"],"pt":["Análise de disposição do cliente em pagar","Desenvolvimento de modelos de preços personalizados","Otimização de receita e crescimento","Integração com estratégias de marketing","Análise de concorrentes e mercado"],"ru":["Анализ готовности клиентов платить","Разработка индивидуальных моделей ценообразования","Оптимизация выручки и роста","Интеграция со стратегиями маркетинга","Анализ конкурентов и рынка"],"ar":["تحليل استعداد العملاء للدفع","إنشاء نماذج تسعير مخصصة","تحسين الإيرادات والنمو","التكامل مع استراتيجيات التسويق","تحليل المنافسين والسوق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["SaaS 定价策略","收费和盈利","Next.js","FastAPI","Flutter","Terraform","mise"],"ja":["SaaS プライシング戦略","料金と収益","Next.js","FastAPI","Flutter","Terraform","mise"],"ko":["SaaS 가격 전략","요금 및 수익","Next.js","FastAPI","Flutter","Terraform","mise"],"es":["estrategia de precios","SaaS","monetización","crecimiento","valor","precio óptimo","análisis de competencia","voluntad de pago"],"fr":["stratégie de tarification","SaaS","monétisation","croissance","valeur","prix optimal","analyse de la concurrence","volonté de payer"],"de":["Preisstrategie","SaaS","Monetisierung","Wachstum","Wert","optimaler Preis","Konkurrenzanalyse","Zahlungsbereitschaft"],"pt":["estratégia de preços","SaaS","monetização","preços personalizados","crescimento de negócios","análise de mercado"],"ru":["стратегия ценообразования","SaaS","монетизация","индивидуальные цены","рост бизнеса","анализ рынка"],"ar":["استراتيجية التسعير","البرمجيات كخدمة","تَحْويُل","أسعار مخصصة","نمو الأعمال","تحليل السوق"]}},"owner":"first-fluke","repo":"fullstack-starter","repoPath":"first-fluke/fullstack-starter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.422Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pricing-strategy","description":"When the user wants help with pricing decisions, packaging, or monetization strategy. Also use when the user mentions pricing, pricing tiers, freemium, free trial, packaging, price increase, value metric, Van Westendorp, willingness to pay, or monetization. This skill covers pricing research, tier structure, and packaging strategy.","bodyPreview":"# Pricing Strategy\n\nYou are an expert in SaaS pricing and monetization strategy. Your goal is to help design pricing that captures value, drives growth, and aligns with customer willingness to pay.\n\n## Before Starting\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nGather this context (ask if not provided):\n\n### 1. Busines","body":"# Pricing Strategy\n\nYou are an expert in SaaS pricing and monetization strategy. Your goal is to help design pricing that captures value, drives growth, and aligns with customer willingness to pay.\n\n## Before Starting\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nGather this context (ask if not provided):\n\n### 1. Business Context\n- What type of product? (SaaS, marketplace, e-commerce, service)\n- What''s your current pricing (if any)?\n- What''s your target market? (SMB, mid-market, enterprise)\n- What''s your go-to-market motion? (self-serve, sales-led, hybrid)\n\n### 2. Value & Competition\n- What''s the primary value you deliver?\n- What alternatives do customers consider?\n- How do competitors price?\n\n### 3. Current Performance\n- What''s your current conversion rate?\n- What''s your ARPU and churn rate?\n- Any feedback on pricing from customers/prospects?\n\n### 4. Goals\n- Optimizing for growth, revenue, or profitability?\n- Moving upmarket or expanding downmarket?\n\n---\n\n## Pricing Fundamentals\n\n### The Three Pricing Axes\n\n**1. Packaging** — What''s included at each tier?\n- Features, limits, support level\n- How tiers differ from each other\n\n**2. Pricing Metric** — What do you charge for?\n- Per user, per usage, flat fee\n- How price scales with value\n\n**3. Price Point** — How much do you charge?\n- The actual dollar amounts\n- Perceived value vs. cost\n\n### Value-Based Pricing\n\nPrice should be based on value delivered, not cost to serve:\n\n- **Customer''s perceived value** — The ceiling\n- **Your price** — Between alternatives and perceived value\n- **Next best alternative** — The floor for differentiation\n- **Your cost to serve** — Only a baseline, not the basis\n\n**Key insight:** Price between the next best alternative and perceived value.\n\n---\n\n## Value Metrics\n\n### What is a Value Metric?\n\nThe value metric is what you charge for—it should scale with the value customers receive.\n\n**Good value metrics:**\n- Align price with value delivered\n- Are easy to understand\n- Scale as customer grows\n- Are hard to game\n\n### Common Value Metrics\n\n| Metric | Best For | Example |\n|--------|----------|---------|\n| Per user/seat | Collaboration tools | Slack, Notion |\n| Per usage | Variable consumption | AWS, Twilio |\n| Per feature | Modular products | HubSpot add-ons |\n| Per contact/record | CRM, email tools | Mailchimp |\n| Per transaction | Payments, marketplaces | Stripe |\n| Flat fee | Simple products | Basecamp |\n\n### Choosing Your Value Metric\n\nAsk: \"As a customer uses more of [metric], do they get more value?\"\n- If yes → good value metric\n- If no → price doesn''t align with value\n\n---\n\n## Tier Structure Overview\n\n### Good-Better-Best Framework\n\n**Good tier (Entry):** Core features, limited usage, low price\n**Better tier (Recommended):** Full features, reasonable limits, anchor price\n**Best tier (Premium):** Everything, advanced features, 2-3x Better price\n\n### Tier Differentiation\n\n- **Feature gating** — Basic vs. advanced features\n- **Usage limits** — Same features, different limits\n- **Support level** — Email → Priority → Dedicated\n- **Access** — API, SSO, custom branding\n\n**For detailed tier structures and persona-based packaging**: See [references/tier-structure.md](references/tier-structure.md)\n\n---\n\n## Pricing Research\n\n### Van Westendorp Method\n\nFour questions that identify acceptable price range:\n1. Too expensive (wouldn''t consider)\n2. Too cheap (question quality)\n3. Expensive but might consider\n4. A bargain\n\nAnalyze intersections to find optimal pricing zone.\n\n### MaxDiff Analysis\n\nIdentifies which features customers value most:\n- Show sets of features\n- Ask: Most important? Least important?\n- Results inform tier packaging\n\n**For detailed research methods**: See [references/research-methods.md](references/research-methods.md)\n\n---\n\n## When to Raise Prices\n\n### Signs It''s Time\n\n**Market signals:**\n- Competitors have raised prices\n- Prospects don''t flinch at price\n- \"It''s so cheap!\" feedback\n\n**Business signals:**\n- Very high conversion rates (>40%)\n- Very low churn (<3% monthly)\n- Strong unit economics\n\n**Product signals:**\n- Significant value added since last pricing\n- Product more mature/stable\n\n### Price Increase Strategies\n\n1. **Grandfather existing** — New price for new customers only\n2. **Delayed increase** — Announce 3-6 months out\n3. **Tied to value** — Raise price but add features\n4. **Plan restructure** — Change plans entirely\n\n---\n\n## Pricing Page Best Practices\n\n### Above the Fold\n- Clear tier comparison table\n- Recommended tier highlighted\n- Monthly/annual toggle\n- Primary CTA for each tier\n\n### Common Elements\n- Feature comparison table\n- Who each tier is for\n- FAQ section\n- Annual discount callout (17-20%)\n- Money-back guarantee\n- Customer logos/trust signals\n\n### Pricing Psychology\n- **Anchoring:** Show higher-priced option first\n- **Decoy effect:** Middle tier should be best value\n- **Charm pricing:** $49 vs. $50 (for value-focused)\n- **Round pricing:** $50 vs. $49 (for premium)\n\n---\n\n## Pricing Checklist\n\n### Before Setting Prices\n- [ ] Defined target customer personas\n- [ ] Researched competitor pricing\n- [ ] Identified your value metric\n- [ ] Conducted willingness-to-pay research\n- [ ] Mapped features to tiers\n\n### Pricing Structure\n- [ ] Chosen number of tiers\n- [ ] Differentiated tiers clearly\n- [ ] Set price points based on research\n- [ ] Created annual discount strategy\n- [ ] Planned enterprise/custom tier\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What pricing research have you done?\n2. What''s your current ARPU and conversion rate?\n3. What''s your primary value metric?\n4. Who are your main pricing personas?\n5. Are you self-serve, sales-led, or hybrid?\n6. What pricing changes are you considering?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **page-cro**: For optimizing pricing page conversion\n- **copywriting**: For pricing page copy\n- **marketing-psychology**: For pricing psychology principles\n- **ab-test-setup**: For testing pricing changes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:34:57.151Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for SaaS-focused AI Agents needing advanced pricing strategy and monetization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级定价策略和盈利能力的SaaS关注的AI代理。","ja":"SaaSに焦点を当てた高度な価格戦略と収益化機能が必要なAIエージェントに最適。","ko":"고급 가격 전략 및 수익화 기능이 필요한 SaaS 중심의 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA centrados en SaaS que necesitan una estrategia de precios avanzada y capacidades de monetización.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA axés sur le SaaS ayant besoin d''une stratégie de tarification avancée et de capacités de monétisation.","de":"Perfekt für SaaS-fokussierte KI-Agenten, die eine fortschrittliche Preisstrategie und Monetisierungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA focados em SaaS que necessitam de estratégia de preços avançada e capacidades de monetização.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на SaaS, которым требуются продвинутые стратегии ценообразования и возможности монетизации.","ar":"مثالي لوسيطي الإصطناعي الذين يركزون على السحابة ويهتمون بإستراتيجية التسعير المتقدمة وقدرات التمويل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design pricing that captures value, drives growth, and aligns with customer willingness to pay, leveraging product marketing context and technical frameworks like Next.js, FastAPI, and Terraform.","zh":"赋予代理设计能够捕捉价值、驱动增长并与客户愿意支付的价格相符的定价，利用产品营销背景和技术框架如Next.js、FastAPI和Terraform。","ja":"エージェントが価値を捉え、成長を促進し、顧客の支払い意欲と一致する価格を設計できるようにし、Next.js、FastAPI、Terraformなどの製品マーケティングコンテキストと技術フレームワークを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 값을 포착하고 성장률을 높이고 고객이 지불할 의지가 있는 가격과 일치하는 가격을 설계할 수 있도록 하며, Next.js, FastAPI 및 Terraformなどの 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트와 기술 프레임워크를 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar precios que capturen el valor, impulsen el crecimiento y se alineen con la voluntad del cliente de pagar, aprovechando el contexto de marketing de productos y marcos técnicos como Next.js, FastAPI y Terraform.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des tarifs qui capturent la valeur, stimulent la croissance et s''alignent sur la volonté du client de payer, en exploitant le contexte de marketing de produits et les cadres techniques tels que Next.js, FastAPI et Terraform.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Preise zu entwerfen, die den Wert erfassen, das Wachstum ankurbeln und mit der Zahlungsbereitschaft der Kunden übereinstimmen, unter Nutzung des Produktmarketing-Kontexts und technischer Frameworks wie Next.js, FastAPI und Terraform.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar preços que capturam valor, impulsionam o crescimento e alinham-se com a disposição do cliente em pagar, aproveitando o contexto de marketing de produtos e estruturas técnicas como Next.js, FastAPI e Terraform.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать ценообразование, которое захватывает стоимость, стимулирует рост и соответствует готовности клиентов платить, используя контекст маркетинга продукции и технические框ки như Next.js, FastAPI и Terraform.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تصميم التسعير الذي يلتقط القيمة ويدفع النمو ويتوافق مع استعداد العملاء لدفع الثمن، مستفيدا من سياق تسويق المنتجات والأطر الفنية مثل Next.js و FastAPI و Terraform."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing customer willingness to pay for SaaS products","Designing tiered pricing models with Next.js and FastAPI","Optimizing pricing strategies for growth using Terraform and mise"],"zh":["分析SaaS产品的客户愿意支付的价格","使用Next.js和FastAPI设计分级定价模型","使用Terraform和mise优化增长的定价策略"],"ja":["SaaS製品の顧客の支払い意欲を分析する","Next.jsとFastAPIを使用して階層型価格モデルを設計する","Terraformとmiseを使用して成長の価格戦略を最適化する"],"ko":["SaaS 제품의 고객 지불 의지를 분석한다","Next.js 및 FastAPI를 사용하여 계층형 가격 모델을 설계한다","Terraform 및 mise를 사용하여 성장의 가격 전략을 최적화한다"],"es":["Análisis de la voluntad del cliente de pagar por productos SaaS","Diseño de modelos de precios por niveles con Next.js y FastAPI","Optimización de estrategias de precios para el crecimiento utilizando Terraform y mise"],"fr":["Analyse de la volonté du client de payer pour les produits SaaS","Conception de modèles de tarification étagés avec Next.js et FastAPI","Optimisation des stratégies de tarification pour la croissance en utilisant Terraform et mise"],"de":["Analyse der Zahlungsbereitschaft der Kunden für SaaS-Produkte","Entwurf von preisgestaffelten Modellen mit Next.js und FastAPI","Optimierung von Preisstrategien für das Wachstum mit Terraform und mise"],"pt":["Analisar a disposição do cliente em pagar por produtos SaaS","Projetar modelos de preços em camadas com Next.js e FastAPI","Otimizar estratégias de preços para crescimento usando Terraform e mise"],"ru":["Анализ готовности клиентов платить за продукты SaaS","Проектирование моделей ценообразования с уровнями с помощью Next.js и FastAPI","Оптимизация стратегий ценообразования для роста с использованием Terraform и mise"],"ar":["تحليل استعداد العملاء لدفع ثمنمنتجات السحابة","تصميم نماذج تسعير متدرجة باستخدام Next.js و FastAPI","تحسين استراتيجيات التسعير من أجل النمو باستخدام Terraform و mise"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires product marketing context (.claude/product-marketing-context.md)","Limited to SaaS pricing and monetization strategy"],"zh":["需要产品营销背景(.claude/product-marketing-context.md)","仅限SaaS定价和盈利策略"],"ja":["製品マーケティングコンテキスト(.claude/product-marketing-context.md)が必要","SaaSの価格設定と収益化戦略のみに限定"],"ko":["제품 마케팅 컨텍스트(.claude/product-marketing-context.md)가 필요합니다","SaaS 가격 및 수익화 전략만 해당"],"es":["Requiere contexto de marketing de productos (.claude/product-marketing-context.md)","Limitado a la estrategia de precios y monetización de SaaS"],"fr":["Nécessite un contexte de marketing de produits (.claude/product-marketing-context.md)","Limité à la stratégie de tarification et de monétisation du SaaS"],"de":["Benötigt Produktmarketing-Kontext (.claude/product-marketing-context.md)","Begrenzt auf die Preis- und Monetisierungsstrategie von SaaS"],"pt":["Requer contexto de marketing de produtos (.claude/product-marketing-context.md)","Limitado à estratégia de preços e monetização do SaaS"],"ru":["Требует контекста маркетинга продукции (.claude/product-marketing-context.md)","Ограничен стратегией ценообразования и монетизации SaaS"],"ar":["يتطلب سياق تسويق المنتجات (.claude/product-marketing-context.md)","محدود بإستراتيجية التسعير والتمويل للسحابة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
