e","Modos de despliegue: UI y código"],"fr":["Déploiement sur des plateformes d''hébergement comme Cloudflare et Vercel","Configuration des variables d''environnement","Paramètres de déploiement spécifiques à la plateforme","Journal de déploiement","Modes de déploiement : UI et code"],"de":["Bereitstellung auf Hosting-Plattformen wie Cloudflare und Vercel","Konfiguration von Umgebungsvariablen","Plattformspezifische Bereitstellungseinstellungen","Bereitstellungsprotokoll","Bereitstellungsmodi: UI und Code"],"pt":["Implantação em várias plataformas de hospedagem","Configurações personalizadas para ambiente e implantação","Logs de implantação para monitoramento","Modo UI para configurações fáceis","Modo de código para configurações avançadas","Integração com Cloudflare e Vercel"],"ru":["Развертывание на нескольких платформах хостинга","Настройка параметров окружения и развертывания","Журналы развертывания для мониторинга","Режим UI для простой настройки","Режим кода для расширенной настройки","Интеграция с Cloudflare и Vercel"],"ar":["تثبيت على منصات استضافة متعددة","إعدادات مخصصة للبيئة والتثبيت","سجلات التثبيت للمonitoring","وضع الواجهة لإعدادات سهلة","وضع الشفرة لإعدادات متقدمة","التكامل مع Cloudflare و Vercel"]},"keywords":{"zh":["BKND 部署","托管平台","环境变量","部署日志","云原生应用","DevOps"],"ja":["BKND デプロイ","ホスティング プラットフォーム","環境変数","デプロイ ログ","クラウド ネイティブ アプリ","DevOps"],"ko":["BKND 배포","호스팅 플랫폼","환경 변수","배포 로그","클라우드 네이티브 앱","DevOps"],"es":["despliegue de aplicaciones","Bknd","plataformas de hosting","Cloudflare","Vercel","variables de entorno","despliegue en la nube","desarrollo de aplicaciones","devops"],"fr":["déploiement d''applications","Bknd","plateformes d''hébergement","Cloudflare","Vercel","variables d''environnement","déploiement dans le cloud","développement d''applications","devops"],"de":["Bereitstellung von Anwendungen","Bknd","Hosting-Plattformen","Cloudflare","Vercel","Umgebungsvariablen","Bereitstellung in der Cloud","Anwendungsentwicklung","devops"],"pt":["implantação de aplicativos","plataformas de hospedagem","Bknd","Cloudflare","Vercel","configurações personalizadas","logs de implantação","modo UI","modo de código"],"ru":["развертывание приложений","платформы хостинга","Bknd","Cloudflare","Vercel","настраиваемые параметры","журналы развертывания","режим UI","режим кода"],"ar":["تثبيت تطبيقات","منصات استضافة","Bknd","Cloudflare","Vercel","إعدادات مخصصة","سجلات التثبيت","وضع الواجهة","وضع الشفرة"]}},"owner":"cameronapak","repo":"cultivate-fellowship","repoPath":"cameronapak/cultivate-fellowship","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.422Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"bknd-deploy-hosting","description":"Use when deploying a Bknd application to production hosting. Covers Cloudflare Workers/Pages, Node.js/Bun servers, Docker, Vercel, AWS Lambda, and other platforms.","bodyPreview":"# Deploy to Hosting\n\nDeploy your Bknd application to various hosting platforms.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Working Bknd application locally\n- Schema defined and tested\n- Database provisioned (see `bknd-database-provision`)\n- Environment variables prepared (see `bknd-env-config`)\n\n## When to Use UI Mode\n\n- Cloudflare/Vercel dashboards for environment variables\n- Platform-specific deployment settings\n- Viewing deployment logs\n\n## When to Use Code Mode\n\n- All deployment configuration and commands\n- Adapt","body":"# Deploy to Hosting\n\nDeploy your Bknd application to various hosting platforms.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Working Bknd application locally\n- Schema defined and tested\n- Database provisioned (see `bknd-database-provision`)\n- Environment variables prepared (see `bknd-env-config`)\n\n## When to Use UI Mode\n\n- Cloudflare/Vercel dashboards for environment variables\n- Platform-specific deployment settings\n- Viewing deployment logs\n\n## When to Use Code Mode\n\n- All deployment configuration and commands\n- Adapter setup for target platform\n- CI/CD pipeline configuration\n\n## Platform Selection Guide\n\n| Platform | Best For | Database Options | Cold Start |\n|----------|----------|------------------|------------|\n| **Cloudflare Workers** | Edge, global low-latency | D1, Turso | ~0ms |\n| **Cloudflare Pages** | Static + API | D1, Turso | ~0ms |\n| **Vercel** | Next.js apps | Turso, Neon | ~200ms |\n| **Node.js/Bun VPS** | Full control, dedicated | Any | N/A |\n| **Docker** | Containerized, portable | Any | N/A |\n| **AWS Lambda** | Serverless, pay-per-use | Turso, RDS | ~500ms |\n\n## Code Approach\n\n### Cloudflare Workers\n\n**Step 1: Install Wrangler**\n\n```bash\nnpm install -D wrangler\n```\n\n**Step 2: Create `wrangler.toml`**\n\n```toml\nname = \"my-bknd-app\"\nmain = \"src/index.ts\"\ncompatibility_date = \"2024-01-01\"\n\n[[d1_databases]]\nbinding = \"DB\"\ndatabase_name = \"my-database\"\ndatabase_id = \"your-d1-database-id\"\n\n# Optional: R2 for media storage\n[[r2_buckets]]\nbinding = \"R2_BUCKET\"\nbucket_name = \"my-bucket\"\n\n[vars]\nENVIRONMENT = \"production\"\n```\n\n**Step 3: Configure Adapter**\n\n```typescript\n// src/index.ts\nimport { hybrid, type CloudflareBkndConfig } from \"bknd/adapter/cloudflare\";\nimport { d1Sqlite } from \"bknd/adapter/cloudflare\";\nimport { em, entity, text } from \"bknd\";\n\nconst schema = em({\n  posts: entity(\"posts\", {\n    title: text().required(),\n  }),\n});\n\nexport default hybrid<CloudflareBkndConfig>({\n  app: (env) => ({\n    connection: d1Sqlite({ binding: env.DB }),\n    schema,\n    isProduction: true,\n    auth: {\n      jwt: {\n        secret: env.JWT_SECRET,\n      },\n    },\n    config: {\n      media: {\n        enabled: true,\n        adapter: {\n          type: \"r2\",\n          config: { bucket: env.R2_BUCKET },\n        },\n      },\n    },\n  }),\n});\n```\n\n**Step 4: Create D1 Database**\n\n```bash\n# Create database\nwrangler d1 create my-database\n\n# Copy the database_id to wrangler.toml\n```\n\n**Step 5: Set Secrets**\n\n```bash\nwrangler secret put JWT_SECRET\n# Enter your secret (min 32 chars)\n```\n\n**Step 6: Deploy**\n\n```bash\nwrangler deploy\n```\n\n---\n\n### Cloudflare Pages (with Functions)\n\n**Step 1: Create `functions/api/[[bknd]].ts`**\n\n```typescript\nimport { hybrid, type CloudflareBkndConfig } from \"bknd/adapter/cloudflare\";\nimport { d1Sqlite } from \"bknd/adapter/cloudflare\";\nimport schema from \"../../bknd.config\";\n\nexport const onRequest = hybrid<CloudflareBkndConfig>({\n  app: (env) => ({\n    connection: d1Sqlite({ binding: env.DB }),\n    schema,\n    isProduction: true,\n    auth: {\n      jwt: { secret: env.JWT_SECRET },\n    },\n  }),\n});\n```\n\n**Step 2: Configure Pages**\n\nIn Cloudflare dashboard:\n1. Connect your git repository\n2. Set build command (if any)\n3. Add D1 binding under Settings > Functions > D1 Database Bindings\n4. Add environment variables under Settings > Environment Variables\n\n---\n\n### Node.js / Bun (VPS)\n\n**Step 1: Create Production Entry**\n\n```typescript\n// index.ts\nimport { serve, type BunBkndConfig } from \"bknd/adapter/bun\";\n// or for Node.js:\n// import { serve } from \"bknd/adapter/node\";\n\nconst config: BunBkndConfig = {\n  connection: {\n    url: process.env.DB_URL!,\n    authToken: process.env.DB_TOKEN,\n  },\n  isProduction: true,\n  auth: {\n    jwt: {\n      secret: process.env.JWT_SECRET!,\n      expires: \"7d\",\n    },\n  },\n  config: {\n    media: {\n      enabled: true,\n      adapter: {\n        type: \"s3\",\n        config: {\n          bucket: process.env.S3_BUCKET!,\n          region: process.env.S3_REGION!,\n          accessKeyId: process.env.S3_ACCESS_KEY!,\n          secretAccessKey: process.env.S3_SECRET_KEY!,\n        },\n      },\n    },\n    guard: {\n      enabled: true,\n    },\n  },\n};\n\nserve(config);\n```\n\n**Step 2: Set Environment Variables**\n\n```bash\nexport DB_URL=\"libsql://your-db.turso.io\"\nexport DB_TOKEN=\"your-turso-token\"\nexport JWT_SECRET=\"your-32-char-minimum-secret\"\nexport PORT=3000\n```\n\n**Step 3: Run with Process Manager**\n\n```bash\n# Using PM2\nnpm install -g pm2\npm2 start \"bun run index.ts\" --name bknd-app\n\n# Or systemd (create /etc/systemd/system/bknd.service)\n```\n\n---\n\n### Docker\n\n**Step 1: Create `Dockerfile`**\n\n```dockerfile\nFROM oven/bun:1.0-alpine\n\nWORKDIR /app\n\nCOPY package.json bun.lockb ./\nRUN bun install --frozen-lockfile --production\n\nCOPY . .\n\n# Create data directory for SQLite (if using file-based)\nRUN mkdir -p /app/data\n\nENV PORT=3000\n\nEXPOSE 3000\n\nCMD [\"bun\", \"run\", \"index.ts\"]\n```\n\n**Step 2: Create `docker-compose.yml`**\n\n```yaml\nversion: \"3.8\"\nservices:\n  bknd:\n    build: .\n    ports:\n      - \"3000:3000\"\n    volumes:\n      - bknd-data:/app/data\n    environment:\n      - DB_URL=file:/app/data/bknd.db\n      - JWT_SECRET=${JWT_SECRET}\n      - NODE_ENV=production\n    restart: unless-stopped\n\nvolumes:\n  bknd-data:\n```\n\n**Step 3: Deploy**\n\n```bash\n# Build and run\ndocker compose up -d\n\n# View logs\ndocker compose logs -f bknd\n```\n\n---\n\n### Vercel (Next.js)\n\n**Step 1: Create API Route**\n\n```typescript\n// app/api/bknd/[[...bknd]]/route.ts\nexport { GET, POST, PUT, DELETE, PATCH } from \"bknd/adapter/nextjs\";\n```\n\n**Step 2: Create `bknd.config.ts`**\n\n```typescript\nimport type { NextjsBkndConfig } from \"bknd/adapter/nextjs\";\nimport { em, entity, text } from \"bknd\";\n\nconst schema = em({\n  posts: entity(\"posts\", {\n    title: text().required(),\n  }),\n});\n\ntype Database = (typeof schema)[\"DB\"];\ndeclare module \"bknd\" {\n  interface DB extends Database {}\n}\n\nexport default {\n  app: (env) => ({\n    connection: {\n      url: env.DB_URL,\n      authToken: env.DB_TOKEN,\n    },\n    schema,\n    isProduction: env.NODE_ENV === \"production\",\n    auth: {\n      jwt: { secret: env.JWT_SECRET },\n    },\n  }),\n} satisfies NextjsBkndConfig;\n```\n\n**Step 3: Set Vercel Environment Variables**\n\nIn Vercel dashboard or CLI:\n\n```bash\nvercel env add DB_URL\nvercel env add DB_TOKEN\nvercel env add JWT_SECRET\n```\n\n**Step 4: Deploy**\n\n```bash\nvercel deploy --prod\n```\n\n---\n\n### AWS Lambda\n\n**Step 1: Install Dependencies**\n\n```bash\nnpm install -D serverless serverless-esbuild\n```\n\n**Step 2: Create `handler.ts`**\n\n```typescript\nimport { createHandler } from \"bknd/adapter/aws\";\n\nexport const handler = createHandler({\n  connection: {\n    url: process.env.DB_URL!,\n    authToken: process.env.DB_TOKEN,\n  },\n  isProduction: true,\n  auth: {\n    jwt: { secret: process.env.JWT_SECRET! },\n  },\n});\n```\n\n**Step 3: Create `serverless.yml`**\n\n```yaml\nservice: bknd-api\n\nprovider:\n  name: aws\n  runtime: nodejs20.x\n  region: us-east-1\n  environment:\n    DB_URL: ${env:DB_URL}\n    DB_TOKEN: ${env:DB_TOKEN}\n    JWT_SECRET: ${env:JWT_SECRET}\n\nplugins:\n  - serverless-esbuild\n\nfunctions:\n  api:\n    handler: handler.handler\n    events:\n      - http:\n          path: /{proxy+}\n          method: ANY\n      - http:\n          path: /\n          method: ANY\n```\n\n**Step 4: Deploy**\n\n```bash\nserverless deploy --stage prod\n```\n\n---\n\n## Pre-Deployment Checklist\n\n```bash\n# 1. Generate types\nnpx bknd types\n\n# 2. Test locally with production-like config\nDB_URL=\"your-prod-db\" JWT_SECRET=\"your-secret\" npx bknd run\n\n# 3. Verify schema sync\n# Schema auto-syncs on first request in production\n```\n\n## Environment Variables (All Platforms)\n\n| Variable | Required | Description |\n|----------|----------|-------------|\n| `DB_URL` | Yes | Database connection URL |\n| `DB_TOKEN` | Depends | Auth token (Turso/LibSQL) |\n| `JWT_SECRET` | Yes | Min 32 chars for security |\n| `PORT` | No | Server port (default: 3000) |\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n### \"Module not found\" for Native SQLite\n\n**Problem:** `better-sqlite3` not available in serverless\n\n**Fix:** Use LibSQL/Turso instead of file-based SQLite:\n```typescript\nconnection: {\n  url: \"libsql://your-db.turso.io\",\n  authToken: process.env.DB_TOKEN,\n}\n```\n\n### \"JWT_SECRET required\" Error\n\n**Problem:** Auth fails in production\n\n**Fix:** Set JWT_SECRET environment variable:\n```bash\n# Cloudflare\nwrangler secret put JWT_SECRET\n\n# Vercel\nvercel env add JWT_SECRET\n\n# Docker\ndocker run -e JWT_SECRET=\"your-secret\" ...\n```\n\n### Cold Start Timeouts (Lambda)\n\n**Problem:** First request times out\n\n**Fix:**\n- Use lighter database (Turso over RDS)\n- Reduce bundle size\n- Enable provisioned concurrency for critical functions\n\n### D1 Binding Not Found\n\n**Problem:** `env.DB is undefined`\n\n**Fix:** Check wrangler.toml D1 binding:\n```toml\n[[d1_databases]]\nbinding = \"DB\"  # Must match env.DB in code\ndatabase_name = \"my-database\"\ndatabase_id = \"actual-id-from-wrangler-d1-create\"\n```\n\n### Media Uploads Fail in Serverless\n\n**Problem:** Local storage doesn''t work in serverless\n\n**Fix:** Use cloud storage adapter:\n```typescript\nconfig: {\n  media: {\n    adapter: {\n      type: \"s3\",  // or \"r2\", \"cloudinary\"\n      config: { /* credentials */ },\n    },\n  },\n}\n```\n\n### CORS Errors\n\n**Problem:** Frontend can''t access API\n\n**Fix:** Configure CORS in your adapter:\n```typescript\n// Most adapters handle this automatically\n// For custom needs, check platform docs\n```\n\n## Deployment Commands Reference\n\n```bash\n# Cloudflare Workers\nwrangler deploy\nwrangler tail  # View logs\n\n# Vercel\nvercel deploy --prod\nvercel logs\n\n# Docker\ndocker compose up -d\ndocker compose logs -f\n\n# AWS Lambda\nserverless deploy --stage prod\nserverless logs -f api\n```\n\n## DOs and DON''Ts\n\n**DO:**\n- Set `isProduction: true` in production config\n- Use cloud storage (S3/R2/Cloudinary) for media\n- Set strong JWT_SECRET (min 32 chars)\n- Enable Guard for authorization\n- Test with production database before deploying\n- Use environment variables for all secrets\n\n**DON''T:**\n- Use file-based SQLite in serverless\n- Hardcode secrets in code\n- Deploy without testing schema sync\n- Use local storage adapter in production\n- Skip JWT_SECRET configuration\n- Commit `.env` files with real secrets\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **bknd-database-provision** - Set up production database\n- **bknd-production-config** - Production security settings\n- **bknd-storage-config** - Configure media storage\n- **bknd-env-config** - Environment variable setup\n- **bknd-local-setup** - Local development (pre-deploy testing)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:36:04.670Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Deployment Agents needing streamlined hosting platform integration.","zh":"非常适合需要简化托管平台集成的云部署代理。","ja":"ストリーミングされたホスティングプラットフォーム統合を必要とするクラウドデプロイエージェントに最適です。","ko":"스트리밍 호스팅 플랫폼 통합이 필요한 클라우드 배포 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de implementación en la nube que necesitan una integración de plataforma de alojamiento optimizada.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de déploiement cloud nécessitant une intégration de plateforme d''hébergement rationalisée.","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Deployment-Agents, die eine optimierte Hosting-Plattform-Integration benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Implantação em Nuvem que precisam de integração de plataforma de hospedagem simplificada.","ru":"Идеально для агентов облачной развертки, требующих упрощенной интеграции платформы хостинга.","ar":"مثالي لعميل توزيع السحابي الذي يحتاج إلى دمج منصة استضافة مبسط"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to deploy Bknd applications to various hosting platforms, leveraging environment variables and schema definitions for seamless integration with Cloudflare and Vercel dashboards, while adapting deployment configurations and commands.","zh":"赋予代理部署Bknd应用程序到各种托管平台的能力，利用环境变量和模式定义实现与Cloudflare和Vercel仪表板的无缝集成，同时适应部署配置和命令。","ja":"エージェントがBkndアプリケーションをさまざまなホスティングプラットフォームにデプロイできるようにし、環境変数とスキーマ定義を使用してCloudflareとVercelのダッシュボードとのシームレスな統合を実現し、デプロイ構成とコマンドをプラットフォーム固有の要件に適応させる。","ko":"에이전트가 Bknd 애플리케이션을 다양한 호스팅 플랫폼에 배포할 수 있도록 하며, 환경 변수와 스키마 정의를 사용하여 Cloudflare와 Vercel 대시보드와의 무縫 통합을实现하며, 배포 구성과 명령을 플랫폼 고유의 요구 사항에 맞추어 조정합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes implementar aplicaciones Bknd en varias plataformas de alojamiento, aprovechando variables de entorno y definiciones de esquema para una integración sin problemas con los paneles de Cloudflare y Vercel, mientras se adaptan las configuraciones y comandos de implementación.","fr":"Permet aux agents de déployer des applications Bknd sur différentes plateformes d''hébergement, en exploitant les variables d''environnement et les définitions de schéma pour une intégration transparente avec les tableaux de bord Cloudflare et Vercel, tout en adaptant les configurations et les commandes de déploiement.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Bknd-Anwendungen auf verschiedenen Hosting-Plattformen bereitzustellen, indem Umgebungsvariablen und Schemadefinitionen für eine nahtlose Integration mit den Cloudflare- und Vercel-Dashboards genutzt werden, während die Bereitstellungskonfigurationen und -befehle angepasst werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implantar aplicações Bknd em várias plataformas de hospedagem, aproveitando variáveis de ambiente e definições de esquema para integração transparente com painéis Cloudflare e Vercel, enquanto adapta configurações e comandos de implantação.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью развертывать приложения Bknd на различных платформах хостинга, используя переменные среды и определения схемы для бесшовной интеграции с панелями Cloudflare и Vercel, а также адаптируя конфигурации и команды развертки.","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على نشر تطبيقات Bknd على منصات استضافة متعددة، مستفيداً من متغيرات البيئة وتعريفات مخطط لدمجها بشكل прозрач مع لوحات التحكم في Cloudflare وVercel، مع تعديل إعدادات و أوامر النشر"},"useCases":{"en":["Deploying Bknd applications to Cloudflare","Configuring environment variables for Vercel","Adapting deployment settings for platform-specific requirements"],"zh":["将Bknd应用程序部署到Cloudflare","为Vercel配置环境变量","适应特定于平台的要求的部署设置"],"ja":["BkndアプリケーションをCloudflareにデプロイする","Vercelの環境変数を構成する","プラットフォーム固有の要件に適応したデプロイ設定"],"ko":["Bknd 애플리케이션을 Cloudflare에 배포하는 것","Vercel의 환경 변수를 구성하는 것","플랫폼 고유의 요구 사항에 맞춘 배포 설정"],"es":["Implementar aplicaciones Bknd en Cloudflare","Configurar variables de entorno para Vercel","Adaptar la configuración de implementación para requisitos específicos de la plataforma"],"fr":["Déployer des applications Bknd sur Cloudflare","Configurer des variables d''environnement pour Vercel","Adapter les paramètres de déploiement pour les exigences spécifiques à la plateforme"],"de":["Bknd-Anwendungen auf Cloudflare bereitstellen","Umgebungsvariablen für Vercel konfigurieren","Bereitstellungs-einstellungen an plattformspezifische Anforderungen anpassen"],"pt":["Implantação de aplicações Bknd no Cloudflare","Configuração de variáveis de ambiente para Vercel","Adaptação de configurações de implantação para requisitos específicos de plataforma"],"ru":["Развертка приложений Bknd в Cloudflare","Настройка переменных среды для Vercel","Адаптация настроек развертки для платформо-специфических требований"],"ar":["نشر تطبيقات Bknd على Cloudflare","تكوين متغيرات البيئة لـ Vercel","تعديل إعدادات النشر لتلبية متطلبات منصات محددة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires working Bknd application locally","Needs schema defined and tested","Database provisioned and environment variables prepared"],"zh":["需要在本地工作的Bknd应用程序","需要定义和测试的模式","已预配的数据库和准备好的环境变量"],"ja":["ローカルで動作するBkndアプリケーションが必要","定義およびテストされたスキーマが必要","プロビジョニングされたデータベースと準備された環境変数"],"ko":["로컬에서 작동하는 Bknd 애플리케이션이 필요함","정의 및 테스트된 스키마가 필요함","할당된 데이터베이스 및 준비된 환경 변수"],"es":["Requiere una aplicación Bknd funcionando localmente","Necesita un esquema definido y probado","Base de datos aprovisionada y variables de entorno preparadas"],"fr":["Nécessite une application Bknd fonctionnelle en local","Nécessite un schéma défini et testé","Base de données provisionnée et variables d''environnement préparées"],"de":["Benötigt eine funktionierende Bknd-Anwendung lokal","Benötigt ein definiertes und getestetes Schema","Bereitgestellte Datenbank und vorbereitete Umgebungsvariablen"],"pt":["Exige aplicação Bknd funcionando localmente","Necessita de esquema definido e testado","Banco de dados provisionado e variáveis de ambiente preparadas"],"ru":["Требует рабочего приложения Bknd на локальной машине","Требует определения и тестирования схемы","Подготовленный провайдер базы данных и переменные среды"],"ar":["يتطلب تطبيق Bknd عاملاً محليًا","يحتاج إلى مخطط محدد وتم اختباره","قاعدة بيانات مخزنة ومتغيرات بيئة معدة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('marian2js/opengoat/ai-elements', 'community', 'marian2js', 'opengoat', 'marian2js/opengoat', 'ai-elements', 0, 0, 75, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.422Z', '2026-02-18T04:35:47.299Z', NULL, '{"id":"marian2js/opengoat/ai-elements","name":"ai-elements","description":{"zh":"AI 元素库是构建在 shadcn/ui 之上的组件库，提供预构建组件以加速 AI 原生应用的开发","ja":"AI エレメントライブラリは shadcn/ui に基づいたコンポーネントライブラリであり、AI ネイティブアプリの開発を加速する事前構築コンポーネントを提供する","ko":"AI 요소 라이브러리는 shadcn/ui에 기반한 컴포넌트 라이브러리로서 AI 네이티브 애플리케이션 개발을 가속화하는 사전 구축 컴포넌트를 제공한다","es":"AI Elements es una biblioteca de componentes y registro personalizado para construir aplicaciones de IA nativas más rápido","fr":"AI Elements est une bibliothèque de composants et un registre personnalisé pour construire des applications d''IA natives plus rapidement","de":"AI Elements ist eine Komponentenbibliothek und ein benutzerdefinierter Registry zum schnelleren Aufbau von KI-Anwendungen","pt":"AI Elements é uma biblioteca de componentes e registro personalizado para construir aplicações de IA nativas mais rapidamente.","ru":"AI Элементы - это библиотека компонентов и пользовательский реестр для быстрого построения приложений ИИ.","ar":"عناصر الذكاء الاصطناعي هي مكتبة مكونات وسجل مخصص لإنشاء تطبيقات ذكاء اصطناعي أصلية بشكل أسرع.","en":"Build organizations of OpenClaw agents that coordinate work across Codex, Claude Code, Cursor, Lovable, and more 🐐 🐐 🐐"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI 元素库 - 快速构建 AI 原生应用","ja":"AI エレメントライブラリ - AI ネイティブアプリの迅速な構築","ko":"AI 요소 라이브러리 - AI 네이티브 애플리케이션 빠른 구축","es":"Elementos de IA para aplicaciones nativas","fr":"Éléments d''IA pour applications natives","de":"KI-Elemente für native Anwendungen","pt":"AI Elements: Biblioteca de Componentes para Aplicativos d...","ru":"AI Элементы: Библиотека Компонентов для Приложений ИИ","ar":"عناصر الذكاء الاصطناعي: مكتبة مكونات لتطبيقات الذكاء الاص...","e