stry für KI-Anwendungen","Integration mit shadcn/ui","Schnelle und einfache Installation","Kompatibilität mit mehreren KI-Plattformen"],"pt":["Biblioteca de componentes pré-construídos","Registro personalizado para aplicações de IA","Instalação rápida com CLI dedicado","Integração com shadcn/ui","Componentes para conversas e mensagens"],"ru":["Библиотека предварительно построенных компонентов","Пользовательский реестр для приложений ИИ","Быстрая установка с помощью специальной команды CLI","Интеграция с shadcn/ui","Компоненты для разговоров и сообщений"],"ar":["مكتبة مكونات مبنية مسبقًا","سجل مخصص لتطبيقات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تثبيت سريع مع واجهة سطر الأوامر المخصصة","التكامل مع shadcn/ui","مكونات للحوارات والرسائل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI 元素库","AI 原生应用","shadcn/ui","组件库","快速开发","预构建组件"],"ja":["AI エレメントライブラリ","AI ネイティブアプリ","shadcn/ui","コンポーネントライブラリ","迅速な開発","事前構築されたコンポーネント"],"ko":["AI 요소 라이브러리","AI 네이티브 애플리케이션","shadcn/ui","컴포넌트 라이브러리","빠른 개발","사전 구축된 컴포넌트"],"es":["aplicaciones de IA","biblioteca de componentes","registro personalizado","shadcn/ui","instalación rápida","compatibilidad con IA","desarrollo de aplicaciones","tecnologías de IA"],"fr":["applications d''IA","bibliothèque de composants","registre personnalisé","shadcn/ui","installation rapide","compatibilité avec l''IA","développement d''applications","technologies d''IA"],"de":["KI-Anwendungen","Komponentenbibliothek","benutzerdefinierter Registry","shadcn/ui","schnelle Installation","Kompatibilität mit KI","Anwendungsentwicklung","KI-Technologien"],"pt":["AI Elements","Biblioteca de componentes","Aplicativos de IA","Desenvolvimento de aplicações","CLI","shadcn/ui","Componentes pré-construídos"],"ru":["AI Элементы","Библиотека компонентов","Приложения ИИ","Разработка приложений","CLI","shadcn/ui","Предварительно построенные компоненты"],"ar":["عناصر الذكاء الاصطناعي","مكتبة مكونات","تطبيقات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير التطبيقات","واجهة سطر الأوامر","shadcn/ui","مكونات مبنية مسبقًا"]}},"owner":"marian2js","repo":"opengoat","repoPath":"marian2js/opengoat","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.422Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ai-elements","description":"Create new AI chat interface components for the ai-elements library following established composable patterns, shadcn/ui integration, and Vercel AI SDK conventions. Use when creating new components in packages/elements/src or when the user asks to add a new component to ai-elements.","bodyPreview":"# AI Elements\n\n[AI Elements](https://www.npmjs.com/package/ai-elements) is a component library and custom registry built on top of [shadcn/ui](https://ui.shadcn.com/) to help you build AI-native applications faster. It provides pre-built components like conversations, messages and more.\n\nInstalling AI Elements is straightforward and can be done in a couple of ways. You can use the dedicated CLI command for the fastest setup, or integrate via the standard shadcn/ui CLI if you''ve already adopted s","body":"# AI Elements\n\n[AI Elements](https://www.npmjs.com/package/ai-elements) is a component library and custom registry built on top of [shadcn/ui](https://ui.shadcn.com/) to help you build AI-native applications faster. It provides pre-built components like conversations, messages and more.\n\nInstalling AI Elements is straightforward and can be done in a couple of ways. You can use the dedicated CLI command for the fastest setup, or integrate via the standard shadcn/ui CLI if you''ve already adopted shadcn''s workflow.\n\n\n\n## Quick Start\n\nHere are some basic examples of what you can achieve using components from AI Elements.\n\n\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore installing AI Elements, make sure your environment meets the following requirements:\n\n- [Node.js](https://nodejs.org/en/download/), version 18 or later\n- A [Next.js](https://nextjs.org/) project with the [AI SDK](https://ai-sdk.dev/) installed.\n- [shadcn/ui](https://ui.shadcn.com/) installed in your project. If you don''t have it installed, running any install command will automatically install it for you.\n- We also highly recommend using the [AI Gateway](https://vercel.com/docs/ai-gateway) and adding `AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY` to your `env.local` so you don''t have to use an API key from every provider. AI Gateway also gives $5 in usage per month so you can experiment with models. You can obtain an API key [here](https://vercel.com/d?to=%2F%5Bteam%5D%2F%7E%2Fai%2Fapi-keys&title=Get%20your%20AI%20Gateway%20key).\n\n\n\n## Installing Components\n\nYou can install AI Elements components using either the AI Elements CLI or the shadcn/ui CLI. Both achieve the same result: adding the selected component’s code and any needed dependencies to your project.\n\nThe CLI will download the component’s code and integrate it into your project’s directory (usually under your components folder). By default, AI Elements components are added to the `@/components/ai-elements/` directory (or whatever folder you’ve configured in your shadcn components settings).\n\nAfter running the command, you should see a confirmation in your terminal that the files were added. You can then proceed to use the component in your code.\n\n## Usage\n\nOnce an AI Elements component is installed, you can import it and use it in your application like any other React component. The components are added as part of your codebase (not hidden in a library), so the usage feels very natural.\n\n## Example\n\nAfter installing AI Elements components, you can use them in your application like any other React component. For example:\n\n```tsx title=\"conversation.tsx\"\n\"use client\";\n\nimport {\n  Message,\n  MessageContent,\n  MessageResponse,\n} from \"@/components/ai-elements/message\";\nimport { useChat } from \"@ai-sdk/react\";\n\nconst Example = () => {\n  const { messages } = useChat();\n\n  return (\n    <>\n      {messages.map(({ role, parts }, index) => (\n        <Message from={role} key={index}>\n          <MessageContent>\n            {parts.map((part, i) => {\n              switch (part.type) {\n                case \"text\":\n                  return (\n                    <MessageResponse key={`${role}-${i}`}>\n                      {part.text}\n                    </MessageResponse>\n                  );\n              }\n            })}\n          </MessageContent>\n        </Message>\n      ))}\n    </>\n  );\n};\n\nexport default Example;\n```\n\nIn the example above, we import the `Message` component from our AI Elements directory and include it in our JSX. Then, we compose the component with the `MessageContent` and `MessageResponse` subcomponents. You can style or configure the component just as you would if you wrote it yourself – since the code lives in your project, you can even open the component file to see how it works or make custom modifications.\n\n## Extensibility\n\nAll AI Elements components take as many primitive attributes as possible. For example, the `Message` component extends `HTMLAttributes<HTMLDivElement>`, so you can pass any props that a `div` supports. This makes it easy to extend the component with your own styles or functionality.\n\n## Customization\n\n\n\nAfter installation, no additional setup is needed. The component’s styles (Tailwind CSS classes) and scripts are already integrated. You can start interacting with the component in your app immediately.\n\nFor example, if you''d like to remove the rounding on `Message`, you can go to `components/ai-elements/message.tsx` and remove `rounded-lg` as follows:\n\n```tsx title=\"components/ai-elements/message.tsx\" highlight=\"8\"\nexport const MessageContent = ({\n  children,\n  className,\n  ...props\n}: MessageContentProps) => (\n  <div\n    className={cn(\n      \"flex flex-col gap-2 text-sm text-foreground\",\n      \"group-[.is-user]:bg-primary group-[.is-user]:text-primary-foreground group-[.is-user]:px-4 group-[.is-user]:py-3\",\n      className\n    )}\n    {...props}\n  >\n    <div className=\"is-user:dark\">{children}</div>\n  </div>\n);\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n## Why are my components not styled?\n\nMake sure your project is configured correctly for shadcn/ui in Tailwind 4 - this means having a `globals.css` file that imports Tailwind and includes the shadcn/ui base styles.\n\n## I ran the AI Elements CLI but nothing was added to my project\n\nDouble-check that:\n\n- Your current working directory is the root of your project (where `package.json` lives).\n- Your components.json file (if using shadcn-style config) is set up correctly.\n- You’re using the latest version of the AI Elements CLI:\n\n```bash title=\"Terminal\"\nnpx ai-elements@latest\n```\n\nIf all else fails, feel free to open an [issue on GitHub](https://github.com/vercel/ai-elements/issues).\n\n## Theme switching doesn’t work — my app stays in light mode\n\nEnsure your app is using the same data-theme system that shadcn/ui and AI Elements expect. The default implementation toggles a data-theme attribute on the `<html>` element. Make sure your tailwind.config.js is using class or data- selectors accordingly:\n\n## The component imports fail with “module not found”\n\nCheck the file exists. If it does, make sure your `tsconfig.json` has a proper paths alias for `@/` i.e.\n\n```json title=\"tsconfig.json\"\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"baseUrl\": \".\",\n    \"paths\": {\n      \"@/*\": [\"./*\"]\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## My AI coding assistant can''t access AI Elements components\n\n1. Verify your config file syntax is valid JSON.\n2. Check that the file path is correct for your AI tool.\n3. Restart your coding assistant after making changes.\n4. Ensure you have a stable internet connection.\n\n## Still stuck?\n\nIf none of these answers help, open an [issue on GitHub](https://github.com/vercel/ai-elements/issues) and someone will be happy to assist.\n\n## Available Components\n\nSee the `references/` folder for detailed documentation on each component.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:35:47.299Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing to build organizations and coordinate work across multiple platforms like Codex, Claude Code, and Cursor.","zh":"非常适合需要构建组织并在多个平台（如Codex、Claude Code和Cursor）上协调工作的AI代理。","ja":"Codex、Claude Code、Cursorなどの複数のプラットフォームで組織を構築し、作業を調整する必要があるAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"다중 플랫폼(Codex, Claude Code, Cursor 등)에서 조직을 구축하고 작업을 조정해야 하는 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan crear organizaciones y coordinar el trabajo en múltiples plataformas como Codex, Claude Code y Cursor.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA qui ont besoin de créer des organisations et de coordonner le travail sur plusieurs plateformes comme Codex, Claude Code et Cursor.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die Organisationen aufbauen und die Arbeit auf mehreren Plattformen wie Codex, Claude Code und Cursor koordinieren müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que precisam construir organizações e coordenar trabalhos em várias plataformas como Codex, Claude Code e Cursor.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, которым необходимо создавать организации и координировать работу на нескольких платформах, таких как Codex, Claude Code и Cursor.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكيين الذين يحتاجون إلى بناء المنظمات وتنسيق العمل عبر منصات متعددة مثل Codex و Claude Code و Cursor."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build AI-native applications faster with pre-built components like conversations and messages, leveraging the shadcn/ui library and custom registry, and integrating via the standard shadcn/ui CLI or dedicated AI Elements CLI command.","zh":"通过预构建组件（如对话和消息）以及shadcn/ui库和自定义注册表的利用，并通过标准的shadcn/ui CLI或专用的AI元素CLI命令进行集成，从而使得代理能够更快地构建AI本地应用。","ja":"会話やメッセージなどの事前構築されたコンポーネントを使用し、shadcn/uiライブラリとカスタムレジストリを活用し、標準のshadcn/ui CLIまたは専用のAIエレメントCLIコマンドを介して統合することで、エージェントがAIネイティブアプリケーションをより迅速に構築できるようにします。","ko":"사전구축된 컴포넌트(대화 및 메시지 등)를 사용하고 shadcn/ui 라이브러리 및 사용자정의 레지스트리를 활용하여 표준 shadcn/ui CLI 또는 전용 AI 요소 CLI 명령을 통해 통합함으로써 에이전트가 AI 네이티브 애플리케이션을 더 빠르게 구축할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear aplicaciones nativas de IA más rápido con componentes preconstruidos como conversaciones y mensajes, aprovechando la biblioteca shadcn/ui y el registro personalizado, e integrándose a través de la CLI estándar de shadcn/ui o del comando CLI dedicado de AI Elements.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications natives IA plus rapidement avec des composants préconstruits tels que des conversations et des messages, en exploitant la bibliothèque shadcn/ui et le registre personnalisé, et en s''intégrant via la CLI standard de shadcn/ui ou la commande CLI dédiée d''AI Elements.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, KI-native Anwendungen schneller zu erstellen, mit vorgefertigten Komponenten wie Konversationen und Nachrichten, unter Ausnutzung der shadcn/ui-Bibliothek und des benutzerdefinierten Registriers, und integriert sich über die Standard-shadcn/ui-CLI oder den speziellen AI-Elements-CLI-Befehl.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir aplicativos nativos de IA mais rapidamente com componentes pré-construídos como conversas e mensagens, aproveitando a biblioteca shadcn/ui e registro personalizado, e integrando via a CLI padrão shadcn/ui ou comando CLI dedicado AI Elements.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать приложения ИИ быстрее с помощью предварительно созданных компонентов, таких как разговоры и сообщения, используя библиотеку shadcn/ui и пользовательский реестр, и интегрируя через стандартную CLI shadcn/ui или специальную команду CLI AI Elements.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من بناء تطبيقات ذكية أصلية بشكل أسرع باستخدام المكونات المسبقة البناء مثل المحادثات والرسائل، واستخدام مكتبة shadcn/ui وسجل مخصص، ودمجها عبر واجهة سطر أوامر شادسن/يوي标准 أو أوامر واجهة سطر أوامر专ية لأجزاء الذكاء الاصطناعي."},"useCases":{"en":["Building organizations of OpenClaw agents","Coordinating work across Codex, Claude Code, and Cursor","Creating custom AI-native applications with pre-built components"],"zh":["构建OpenClaw代理的组织","在Codex、Claude Code和Cursor上协调工作","使用预构建组件创建自定义AI本地应用"],"ja":["OpenClawエージェントの組織を構築する","Codex、Claude Code、Cursorで作業を調整する","事前構築されたコンポーネントを使用してカスタムAIネイティブアプリケーションを作成する"],"ko":["OpenClaw 에이전트의 조직을 구축하는 것","Codex, Claude Code, Cursor에서 작업을 조정하는 것","사전구축된 컴포넌트를 사용하여 사용자정의 AI 네이티브 애플리케이션을 생성하는 것"],"es":["Creación de organizaciones de agentes OpenClaw","Coordinación del trabajo en Codex, Claude Code y Cursor","Creación de aplicaciones personalizadas nativas de IA con componentes preconstruidos"],"fr":["Création d''organisations d''agents OpenClaw","Coordination du travail sur Codex, Claude Code et Cursor","Création d''applications natives IA personnalisées avec des composants préconstruits"],"de":["Erstellung von Organisationen von OpenClaw-Agents","Koordinierung der Arbeit auf Codex, Claude Code und Cursor","Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten KI-nativen Anwendungen mit vorgefertigten Komponenten"],"pt":["Construir organizações de agentes OpenClaw","Coordenar trabalhos em Codex, Claude Code e Cursor","Criar aplicativos nativos de IA personalizados com componentes pré-construídos"],"ru":["Создание организаций агентов OpenClaw","Координация работы на Codex, Claude Code и Cursor","Создание пользовательских приложений ИИ с предварительно созданными компонентами"],"ar":["بناء منظمات لوكلاء OpenClaw","تنسيق العمل عبر Codex و Claude Code و Cursor","إنشاء تطبيقات ذكية أصلية مخصصة بمكونات مسبقة البناء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires integration with shadcn/ui library","Dependent on compatibility with specific AI platforms like Codex, Claude Code, and Cursor"],"zh":["需要与shadcn/ui库集成","依赖于与特定AI平台（如Codex、Claude Code和Cursor）的兼容性"],"ja":["shadcn/uiライブラリとの統合が必要","Codex、Claude Code、Cursorなどの特定のAIプラットフォームとの互換性に依存する"],"ko":["shadcn/ui 라이브러리와의 통합이 필요","Codex, Claude Code, Cursor 등의 특정 AI 플랫폼과의 호환성에 의존"],"es":["Requiere integración con la biblioteca shadcn/ui","Depende de la compatibilidad con plataformas de IA específicas como Codex, Claude Code y Cursor"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec la bibliothèque shadcn/ui","Dépend de la compatibilité avec des plateformes IA spécifiques comme Codex, Claude Code et Cursor"],"de":["Erfordert Integration mit der shadcn/ui-Bibliothek","Hängt von der Kompatibilität mit bestimmten KI-Plattformen wie Codex, Claude Code und Cursor ab"],"pt":["Requer integração com a biblioteca shadcn/ui","Dependente da compatibilidade com plataformas de IA específicas como Codex, Claude Code e Cursor"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с библиотекой shadcn/ui","Зависит от совместимости с определенными платформами ИИ, такими как Codex, Claude Code и Cursor"],"ar":["يتطلب التكامل مع مكتبة shadcn/ui","يعتمد على التوافق مع منصات الذكاء الاصطناعي المحددة مثل Codex و Claude Code و Cursor"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
