предварительно построенные компоненты","пользовательский реестр","разговоры","сообщения"],"ar":["عناصر الذكاء الاصطناعي","مكتبة مكونات","تطبيقات ذكاء اصطناعي","تطوير البرمجيات","shadcn/ui","cli","مكونات مبنية مسبقا","سجل مخصص","التعليمات","الرسائل"]}},"owner":"dylsteck","repo":"ship","repoPath":"dylsteck/ship","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.422Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ai-elements","description":"Create new AI chat interface components for the ai-elements library following established composable patterns, shadcn/ui integration, and Vercel AI SDK conventions. Use when creating new components in packages/elements/src or when the user asks to add a new component to ai-elements.","bodyPreview":"# AI Elements\n\n[AI Elements](https://www.npmjs.com/package/ai-elements) is a component library and custom registry built on top of [shadcn/ui](https://ui.shadcn.com/) to help you build AI-native applications faster. It provides pre-built components like conversations, messages and more.\n\nInstalling AI Elements is straightforward and can be done in a couple of ways. You can use the dedicated CLI command for the fastest setup, or integrate via the standard shadcn/ui CLI if you''ve already adopted s","body":"# AI Elements\n\n[AI Elements](https://www.npmjs.com/package/ai-elements) is a component library and custom registry built on top of [shadcn/ui](https://ui.shadcn.com/) to help you build AI-native applications faster. It provides pre-built components like conversations, messages and more.\n\nInstalling AI Elements is straightforward and can be done in a couple of ways. You can use the dedicated CLI command for the fastest setup, or integrate via the standard shadcn/ui CLI if you''ve already adopted shadcn''s workflow.\n\n\n\n## Quick Start\n\nHere are some basic examples of what you can achieve using components from AI Elements.\n\n\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore installing AI Elements, make sure your environment meets the following requirements:\n\n- [Node.js](https://nodejs.org/en/download/), version 18 or later\n- A [Next.js](https://nextjs.org/) project with the [AI SDK](https://ai-sdk.dev/) installed.\n- [shadcn/ui](https://ui.shadcn.com/) installed in your project. If you don''t have it installed, running any install command will automatically install it for you.\n- We also highly recommend using the [AI Gateway](https://vercel.com/docs/ai-gateway) and adding `AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY` to your `env.local` so you don''t have to use an API key from every provider. AI Gateway also gives $5 in usage per month so you can experiment with models. You can obtain an API key [here](https://vercel.com/d?to=%2F%5Bteam%5D%2F%7E%2Fai%2Fapi-keys&title=Get%20your%20AI%20Gateway%20key).\n\n\n\n## Installing Components\n\nYou can install AI Elements components using either the AI Elements CLI or the shadcn/ui CLI. Both achieve the same result: adding the selected component’s code and any needed dependencies to your project.\n\nThe CLI will download the component’s code and integrate it into your project’s directory (usually under your components folder). By default, AI Elements components are added to the `@/components/ai-elements/` directory (or whatever folder you’ve configured in your shadcn components settings).\n\nAfter running the command, you should see a confirmation in your terminal that the files were added. You can then proceed to use the component in your code.\n\n## Usage\n\nOnce an AI Elements component is installed, you can import it and use it in your application like any other React component. The components are added as part of your codebase (not hidden in a library), so the usage feels very natural.\n\n## Example\n\nAfter installing AI Elements components, you can use them in your application like any other React component. For example:\n\n```tsx title=\"conversation.tsx\"\n\"use client\";\n\nimport {\n  Message,\n  MessageContent,\n  MessageResponse,\n} from \"@/components/ai-elements/message\";\nimport { useChat } from \"@ai-sdk/react\";\n\nconst Example = () => {\n  const { messages } = useChat();\n\n  return (\n    <>\n      {messages.map(({ role, parts }, index) => (\n        <Message from={role} key={index}>\n          <MessageContent>\n            {parts.map((part, i) => {\n              switch (part.type) {\n                case \"text\":\n                  return (\n                    <MessageResponse key={`${role}-${i}`}>\n                      {part.text}\n                    </MessageResponse>\n                  );\n              }\n            })}\n          </MessageContent>\n        </Message>\n      ))}\n    </>\n  );\n};\n\nexport default Example;\n```\n\nIn the example above, we import the `Message` component from our AI Elements directory and include it in our JSX. Then, we compose the component with the `MessageContent` and `MessageResponse` subcomponents. You can style or configure the component just as you would if you wrote it yourself – since the code lives in your project, you can even open the component file to see how it works or make custom modifications.\n\n## Extensibility\n\nAll AI Elements components take as many primitive attributes as possible. For example, the `Message` component extends `HTMLAttributes<HTMLDivElement>`, so you can pass any props that a `div` supports. This makes it easy to extend the component with your own styles or functionality.\n\n## Customization\n\n\n\nAfter installation, no additional setup is needed. The component’s styles (Tailwind CSS classes) and scripts are already integrated. You can start interacting with the component in your app immediately.\n\nFor example, if you''d like to remove the rounding on `Message`, you can go to `components/ai-elements/message.tsx` and remove `rounded-lg` as follows:\n\n```tsx title=\"components/ai-elements/message.tsx\" highlight=\"8\"\nexport const MessageContent = ({\n  children,\n  className,\n  ...props\n}: MessageContentProps) => (\n  <div\n    className={cn(\n      \"flex flex-col gap-2 text-sm text-foreground\",\n      \"group-[.is-user]:bg-primary group-[.is-user]:text-primary-foreground group-[.is-user]:px-4 group-[.is-user]:py-3\",\n      className\n    )}\n    {...props}\n  >\n    <div className=\"is-user:dark\">{children}</div>\n  </div>\n);\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n## Why are my components not styled?\n\nMake sure your project is configured correctly for shadcn/ui in Tailwind 4 - this means having a `globals.css` file that imports Tailwind and includes the shadcn/ui base styles.\n\n## I ran the AI Elements CLI but nothing was added to my project\n\nDouble-check that:\n\n- Your current working directory is the root of your project (where `package.json` lives).\n- Your components.json file (if using shadcn-style config) is set up correctly.\n- You’re using the latest version of the AI Elements CLI:\n\n```bash title=\"Terminal\"\nnpx ai-elements@latest\n```\n\nIf all else fails, feel free to open an [issue on GitHub](https://github.com/vercel/ai-elements/issues).\n\n## Theme switching doesn’t work — my app stays in light mode\n\nEnsure your app is using the same data-theme system that shadcn/ui and AI Elements expect. The default implementation toggles a data-theme attribute on the `<html>` element. Make sure your tailwind.config.js is using class or data- selectors accordingly:\n\n## The component imports fail with “module not found”\n\nCheck the file exists. If it does, make sure your `tsconfig.json` has a proper paths alias for `@/` i.e.\n\n```json title=\"tsconfig.json\"\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"baseUrl\": \".\",\n    \"paths\": {\n      \"@/*\": [\"./*\"]\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## My AI coding assistant can''t access AI Elements components\n\n1. Verify your config file syntax is valid JSON.\n2. Check that the file path is correct for your AI tool.\n3. Restart your coding assistant after making changes.\n4. Ensure you have a stable internet connection.\n\n## Still stuck?\n\nIf none of these answers help, open an [issue on GitHub](https://github.com/vercel/ai-elements/issues) and someone will be happy to assist.\n\n## Available Components\n\nSee the `references/` folder for detailed documentation on each component.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:35:57.383Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing pre-built UI components for AI-native applications.","zh":"非常适合需要为AI原生应用程序提供预建UI组件的前端代理。","ja":"AIネイティブアプリケーションに事前に構築されたUIコンポーネントを必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"AI 네이티브 애플리케이션에事前に 구축 된 UI 구성 요소를 필요로하는 프론트 엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de frontend que necesitan componentes de interfaz de usuario preconstruidos para aplicaciones nativas de IA.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de frontend ayant besoin de composants d''interface utilisateur préconstruits pour les applications natives IA.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die vorgefertigte Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten für AI-native Anwendungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam de componentes de interface do usuário pré-construídos para aplicações nativas de IA.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы предварительно созданные компоненты пользовательского интерфейса для приложений, родных для ИИ.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الأمامي الذين يحتاجون إلى مكونات واجهة المستخدم المُحسّنة مسبقًا للتطبيقات الأصلية للذكاء الاصطناعي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build conversational interfaces using pre-built components like conversations and messages, leveraging shadcn/ui and AI Elements'' custom registry, with integration via dedicated CLI command or standard shadcn/ui CLI.","zh":"赋予代理构建对话式界面使用预构建组件的能力，例如会话和消息，利用shadcn/ui和AI Elements的自定义注册表，并通过专用CLI命令或标准shadcn/ui CLI进行集成。","ja":"事前に構築されたコンポーネント（会話やメッセージなど）を使用して対話型インターフェースを構築するエージェントを可能にし、shadcn/uiとAI Elementsのカスタムレジストリを活用し、専用のCLIコマンドまたは標準のshadcn/ui CLIを介して統合します。","ko":"에이전트가 미리構築된 구성 요소 (대화 및 메시지 등)를 사용하여 대화형 인터페이스를 구축 할 수 있도록 하며, shadcn / ui 및 AI 요소의 사용자 정의 레지스트리를 활용하고, 전용 CLI 명령 또는 표준 shadcn / ui CLI를 통해 통합합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a construir interfaces conversacionales utilizando componentes preconstruidos como conversaciones y mensajes, aprovechando shadcn/ui y el registro personalizado de AI Elements, con integración a través de un comando CLI dedicado o el CLI estándar de shadcn/ui.","fr":"Permet aux agents de construire des interfaces conversationnelles en utilisant des composants préconstruits tels que des conversations et des messages, en exploitant shadcn/ui et le registre personnalisé d''AI Elements, avec une intégration via une commande CLI dédiée ou le CLI standard de shadcn/ui.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, konversationelle Schnittstellen mit vorgefertigten Komponenten wie Konversationen und Nachrichten zu erstellen, indem shadcn/ui und das benutzerdefinierte Register von AI-Elementen genutzt werden, mit Integration über einen dedizierten CLI-Befehl oder den Standard-shadcn/ui-CLI.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir interfaces conversacionais usando componentes pré-construídos, como conversas e mensagens, aproveitando o registro personalizado do shadcn/ui e os Elementos de IA, com integração via comando CLI dedicado ou CLI padrão do shadcn/ui.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать разговорные интерфейсы с использованием предварительно созданных компонентов, таких как разговоры и сообщения, используя индивидуальный реестр shadcn/ui и пакет Элементов ИИ, с интеграцией через专альный команду CLI или стандартную команду CLI shadcn/ui.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على بناء واجهات محادثات باستخدام مكونات محسّنة مسبقًا مثل المحادثات والرسائل، واستغلال السجل المخصص لشادكن/واجهة المستخدم ومكونات الذكاء الاصطناعي، مع التكامل عبر أمر CLI مخصص أو CLI стандарт لشادكن/واجهة المستخدم."},"useCases":{"en":["Building AI-powered chat interfaces","Creating custom message components for AI-native applications","Integrating conversations into existing shadcn/ui projects"],"zh":["构建AI驱动的聊天界面","为AI原生应用程序创建自定义消息组件","将对话集成到现有的shadcn/ui项目中"],"ja":["AI駆動のチャットインターフェースを構築する","AIネイティブアプリケーション用のカスタムメッセージコンポーネントを作成する","会話を既存のshadcn/uiプロジェクトに統合する"],"ko":["AI 구동 채팅 인터페이스를 구축하는 것","AI 네이티브 애플리케이션을 위한 사용자 정의 메시지 구성 요소를 생성하는 것","대화를 기존의 shadcn / ui 프로젝트에 통합"],"es":["Construir interfaces de chat con IA","Crear componentes de mensaje personalizados para aplicaciones nativas de IA","Integrar conversaciones en proyectos de shadcn/ui existentes"],"fr":["Construire des interfaces de chat avec IA","Créer des composants de message personnalisés pour les applications natives IA","Intégrer des conversations dans des projets shadcn/ui existants"],"de":["Erstellen von Chat-Schnittstellen mit KI","Erstellen benutzerdefinierter Nachrichtenkomponenten für KI-native Anwendungen","Integrieren von Konversationen in bestehende shadcn/ui-Projekte"],"pt":["Construir interfaces de chat alimentadas por IA","Criar componentes de mensagem personalizados para aplicações nativas de IA","Integrar conversas em projetos shadcn/ui existentes"],"ru":["Создание интерфейсов чата на основе ИИ","Создание пользовательских компонентов сообщений для приложений, родных для ИИ","Интеграция разговоров в существующие проекты shadcn/ui"],"ar":["بناء واجهات محادثات مدعومة بالذكاء الاصطناعي","إنشاء مكونات رسائل مخصصة للتطبيقات الأصلية للذكاء الاصطناعي","دمج المحادثات في مشاريع شادكن/واجهة المستخدم الحالية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires shadcn/ui adoption","Dependent on AI Elements package installation via npm"],"zh":["需要采用shadcn/ui","依赖于AI Elements包的安装通过npm"],"ja":["shadcn/uiの採用が必要","AI Elementsパッケージのnpm経由のインストールに依存"],"ko":["shadcn / ui를 채택해야 함","AI 요소 패키지의 npm을 통한 설치에 의존"],"es":["Requiere la adopción de shadcn/ui","Dependiente de la instalación del paquete AI Elements a través de npm"],"fr":["Nécessite l''adoption de shadcn/ui","Dépendante de l''installation du package AI Elements via npm"],"de":["Erfordert die Adoption von shadcn/ui","Abhängig von der Installation des AI-Elements-Pakets über npm"],"pt":["Exige a adoção do shadcn/ui","Dependente da instalação do pacote Elementos de IA via npm"],"ru":["Требует внедрения shadcn/ui","Зависит от установки пакета Элементов ИИ через npm"],"ar":["يتطلب اعتماد شادكن/واجهة المستخدم","يعتمد على تثبيت حزمة مكونات الذكاء الاصطناعي عبر npm"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('cameronapak/melos/bknd-deploy-hosting', 'community', 'cameronapak', 'melos', 'cameronapak/melos', 'bknd-deploy-hosting', 0, 0, 75, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.422Z', '2026-02-18T04:35:52.279Z', NULL, '{"id":"cameronapak/melos/bknd-deploy-hosting","name":"bknd-deploy-hosting","description":{"zh":"bknd","ja":"bknd","ko":"bknd","es":"El despliegue de aplicaciones Bknd en hosting permite a los desarrolladores implementar sus aplicaciones de manera fácil y eficiente","fr":"Le déploiement d''applications Bknd sur des plateformes d''hébergement permet aux développeurs de déployer leurs applications de manière simple et efficace","de":"Die Bereitstellung von Bknd-Anwendungen auf Hosting-Plattformen ermöglicht es Entwicklern, ihre Anwendungen einfach und effizient zu implementieren","pt":"Implante seu aplicativo Bknd em plataformas de hospedagem com facilidade. Saiba quando usar o modo UI e o modo Code.","ru":"Разверните свое приложение Bknd на платформах хостинга без проблем. Узнайте, когда использовать режим UI и режим Code.","ar":"ثبت تطبيقك Bknd على منصات الاستضافة بسهولة. اعرف متى تستخدم وضع واجهة المستخدم ووضع الكود.","en":"Free one-page church website. Easiest way to create a church website. "},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"bknd-deploy-hosting","ja":"bknd","ko":"bknd","es":"Despliegue de aplicaciones Bknd en hosting","fr":"Déploiement d''applications Bknd sur des plateformes d''héb...","de":"Bereitstellung von Bknd-Anwendungen auf Hosting-Plattformen","pt":"Implantação de Aplicativos Bknd em Plataformas de Hospedagem","ru":"Развертывание приложений Bknd на платформах хостинга","ar":"تثبيت تطبيقات Bknd على منصات الاستضافة","en":"bknd-deploy-hosting"},"description":{"zh":"bknd","ja":"bknd","ko":"bknd","es":"El despliegue de aplicaciones Bknd en hosting permite a los desarrolladores implementar sus aplicaciones de manera fáci