ntação e comandos","Pré-requisitos claros para implantação","Visão de logs de implantação"],"ru":["Развертывание на платформах хостинга, таких как Cloudflare и Vercel","Режим UI для настройки переменных среды","Режим Code для настройки развертывания и команд","Ясные предварительные условия для развертывания","Просмотр журналов развертывания"],"ar":["تثبيت على منصات الاستضافة مثل Cloudflare و Vercel","وضع واجهة المستخدم لتكوين متغيرات البيئة","وضع الكود لتكوين التثبيت والأوامر","شروط مسبقة واضحة للتثبيت","عرض سجلات التثبيت"]},"keywords":{"zh":["bknd","bknd","bknd","bknd","bknd","bknd"],"ja":["bknd","bknd","bknd","bknd","bknd","bknd"],"ko":["bknd","bknd","bknd","bknd","bknd","bknd"],"es":["despliegue de aplicaciones","hosting","Bknd","desarrollo de aplicaciones","plataformas de hosting","configuración de variables de entorno","visualización de registros de despliegue","adaptación a configuraciones de plataforma específicas","despliegue en modo UI y código"],"fr":["déploiement d''applications","hébergement","Bknd","développement d''applications","plateformes d''hébergement","configuration de variables d''environnement","affichage des journaux de déploiement","adaptation aux paramètres de déploiement spécifiques à la plateforme","déploiement en mode UI et code"],"de":["Bereitstellung von Anwendungen","Hosting","Bknd","Anwendungsentwicklung","Hosting-Plattformen","Konfiguration von Umgebungsvariablen","Anzeige von Bereitstellungsprotokollen","Anpassung an plattformspezifische Bereitstellungseinstellungen","Bereitstellung im UI- und Code-Modus"],"pt":["implantação de aplicativos Bknd","plataformas de hospedagem","Cloudflare","Vercel","modo UI","modo Code","variáveis de ambiente","logs de implantação"],"ru":["развертывание приложений Bknd","платформы хостинга","Cloudflare","Vercel","режим UI","режим Code","переменные среды","журналы развертывания"],"ar":["تثبيت تطبيقات Bknd","منصات الاستضافة","Cloudflare","Vercel","وضع واجهة المستخدم","وضع الكود","متغيرات البيئة","سجلات التثبيت"]}},"owner":"cameronapak","repo":"melos","repoPath":"cameronapak/melos","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.422Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"bknd-deploy-hosting","description":"Use when deploying a Bknd application to production hosting. Covers Cloudflare Workers/Pages, Node.js/Bun servers, Docker, Vercel, AWS Lambda, and other platforms.","bodyPreview":"# Deploy to Hosting\n\nDeploy your Bknd application to various hosting platforms.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Working Bknd application locally\n- Schema defined and tested\n- Database provisioned (see `bknd-database-provision`)\n- Environment variables prepared (see `bknd-env-config`)\n\n## When to Use UI Mode\n\n- Cloudflare/Vercel dashboards for environment variables\n- Platform-specific deployment settings\n- Viewing deployment logs\n\n## When to Use Code Mode\n\n- All deployment configuration and commands\n- Adapt","body":"# Deploy to Hosting\n\nDeploy your Bknd application to various hosting platforms.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Working Bknd application locally\n- Schema defined and tested\n- Database provisioned (see `bknd-database-provision`)\n- Environment variables prepared (see `bknd-env-config`)\n\n## When to Use UI Mode\n\n- Cloudflare/Vercel dashboards for environment variables\n- Platform-specific deployment settings\n- Viewing deployment logs\n\n## When to Use Code Mode\n\n- All deployment configuration and commands\n- Adapter setup for target platform\n- CI/CD pipeline configuration\n\n## Platform Selection Guide\n\n| Platform | Best For | Database Options | Cold Start |\n|----------|----------|------------------|------------|\n| **Cloudflare Workers** | Edge, global low-latency | D1, Turso | ~0ms |\n| **Cloudflare Pages** | Static + API | D1, Turso | ~0ms |\n| **Vercel** | Next.js apps | Turso, Neon | ~200ms |\n| **Node.js/Bun VPS** | Full control, dedicated | Any | N/A |\n| **Docker** | Containerized, portable | Any | N/A |\n| **AWS Lambda** | Serverless, pay-per-use | Turso, RDS | ~500ms |\n\n## Code Approach\n\n### Cloudflare Workers\n\n**Step 1: Install Wrangler**\n\n```bash\nnpm install -D wrangler\n```\n\n**Step 2: Create `wrangler.toml`**\n\n```toml\nname = \"my-bknd-app\"\nmain = \"src/index.ts\"\ncompatibility_date = \"2024-01-01\"\n\n[[d1_databases]]\nbinding = \"DB\"\ndatabase_name = \"my-database\"\ndatabase_id = \"your-d1-database-id\"\n\n# Optional: R2 for media storage\n[[r2_buckets]]\nbinding = \"R2_BUCKET\"\nbucket_name = \"my-bucket\"\n\n[vars]\nENVIRONMENT = \"production\"\n```\n\n**Step 3: Configure Adapter**\n\n```typescript\n// src/index.ts\nimport { hybrid, type CloudflareBkndConfig } from \"bknd/adapter/cloudflare\";\nimport { d1Sqlite } from \"bknd/adapter/cloudflare\";\nimport { em, entity, text } from \"bknd\";\n\nconst schema = em({\n  posts: entity(\"posts\", {\n    title: text().required(),\n  }),\n});\n\nexport default hybrid<CloudflareBkndConfig>({\n  app: (env) => ({\n    connection: d1Sqlite({ binding: env.DB }),\n    schema,\n    isProduction: true,\n    auth: {\n      jwt: {\n        secret: env.JWT_SECRET,\n      },\n    },\n    config: {\n      media: {\n        enabled: true,\n        adapter: {\n          type: \"r2\",\n          config: { bucket: env.R2_BUCKET },\n        },\n      },\n    },\n  }),\n});\n```\n\n**Step 4: Create D1 Database**\n\n```bash\n# Create database\nwrangler d1 create my-database\n\n# Copy the database_id to wrangler.toml\n```\n\n**Step 5: Set Secrets**\n\n```bash\nwrangler secret put JWT_SECRET\n# Enter your secret (min 32 chars)\n```\n\n**Step 6: Deploy**\n\n```bash\nwrangler deploy\n```\n\n---\n\n### Cloudflare Pages (with Functions)\n\n**Step 1: Create `functions/api/[[bknd]].ts`**\n\n```typescript\nimport { hybrid, type CloudflareBkndConfig } from \"bknd/adapter/cloudflare\";\nimport { d1Sqlite } from \"bknd/adapter/cloudflare\";\nimport schema from \"../../bknd.config\";\n\nexport const onRequest = hybrid<CloudflareBkndConfig>({\n  app: (env) => ({\n    connection: d1Sqlite({ binding: env.DB }),\n    schema,\n    isProduction: true,\n    auth: {\n      jwt: { secret: env.JWT_SECRET },\n    },\n  }),\n});\n```\n\n**Step 2: Configure Pages**\n\nIn Cloudflare dashboard:\n1. Connect your git repository\n2. Set build command (if any)\n3. Add D1 binding under Settings > Functions > D1 Database Bindings\n4. Add environment variables under Settings > Environment Variables\n\n---\n\n### Node.js / Bun (VPS)\n\n**Step 1: Create Production Entry**\n\n```typescript\n// index.ts\nimport { serve, type BunBkndConfig } from \"bknd/adapter/bun\";\n// or for Node.js:\n// import { serve } from \"bknd/adapter/node\";\n\nconst config: BunBkndConfig = {\n  connection: {\n    url: process.env.DB_URL!,\n    authToken: process.env.DB_TOKEN,\n  },\n  isProduction: true,\n  auth: {\n    jwt: {\n      secret: process.env.JWT_SECRET!,\n      expires: \"7d\",\n    },\n  },\n  config: {\n    media: {\n      enabled: true,\n      adapter: {\n        type: \"s3\",\n        config: {\n          bucket: process.env.S3_BUCKET!,\n          region: process.env.S3_REGION!,\n          accessKeyId: process.env.S3_ACCESS_KEY!,\n          secretAccessKey: process.env.S3_SECRET_KEY!,\n        },\n      },\n    },\n    guard: {\n      enabled: true,\n    },\n  },\n};\n\nserve(config);\n```\n\n**Step 2: Set Environment Variables**\n\n```bash\nexport DB_URL=\"libsql://your-db.turso.io\"\nexport DB_TOKEN=\"your-turso-token\"\nexport JWT_SECRET=\"your-32-char-minimum-secret\"\nexport PORT=3000\n```\n\n**Step 3: Run with Process Manager**\n\n```bash\n# Using PM2\nnpm install -g pm2\npm2 start \"bun run index.ts\" --name bknd-app\n\n# Or systemd (create /etc/systemd/system/bknd.service)\n```\n\n---\n\n### Docker\n\n**Step 1: Create `Dockerfile`**\n\n```dockerfile\nFROM oven/bun:1.0-alpine\n\nWORKDIR /app\n\nCOPY package.json bun.lockb ./\nRUN bun install --frozen-lockfile --production\n\nCOPY . .\n\n# Create data directory for SQLite (if using file-based)\nRUN mkdir -p /app/data\n\nENV PORT=3000\n\nEXPOSE 3000\n\nCMD [\"bun\", \"run\", \"index.ts\"]\n```\n\n**Step 2: Create `docker-compose.yml`**\n\n```yaml\nversion: \"3.8\"\nservices:\n  bknd:\n    build: .\n    ports:\n      - \"3000:3000\"\n    volumes:\n      - bknd-data:/app/data\n    environment:\n      - DB_URL=file:/app/data/bknd.db\n      - JWT_SECRET=${JWT_SECRET}\n      - NODE_ENV=production\n    restart: unless-stopped\n\nvolumes:\n  bknd-data:\n```\n\n**Step 3: Deploy**\n\n```bash\n# Build and run\ndocker compose up -d\n\n# View logs\ndocker compose logs -f bknd\n```\n\n---\n\n### Vercel (Next.js)\n\n**Step 1: Create API Route**\n\n```typescript\n// app/api/bknd/[[...bknd]]/route.ts\nexport { GET, POST, PUT, DELETE, PATCH } from \"bknd/adapter/nextjs\";\n```\n\n**Step 2: Create `bknd.config.ts`**\n\n```typescript\nimport type { NextjsBkndConfig } from \"bknd/adapter/nextjs\";\nimport { em, entity, text } from \"bknd\";\n\nconst schema = em({\n  posts: entity(\"posts\", {\n    title: text().required(),\n  }),\n});\n\ntype Database = (typeof schema)[\"DB\"];\ndeclare module \"bknd\" {\n  interface DB extends Database {}\n}\n\nexport default {\n  app: (env) => ({\n    connection: {\n      url: env.DB_URL,\n      authToken: env.DB_TOKEN,\n    },\n    schema,\n    isProduction: env.NODE_ENV === \"production\",\n    auth: {\n      jwt: { secret: env.JWT_SECRET },\n    },\n  }),\n} satisfies NextjsBkndConfig;\n```\n\n**Step 3: Set Vercel Environment Variables**\n\nIn Vercel dashboard or CLI:\n\n```bash\nvercel env add DB_URL\nvercel env add DB_TOKEN\nvercel env add JWT_SECRET\n```\n\n**Step 4: Deploy**\n\n```bash\nvercel deploy --prod\n```\n\n---\n\n### AWS Lambda\n\n**Step 1: Install Dependencies**\n\n```bash\nnpm install -D serverless serverless-esbuild\n```\n\n**Step 2: Create `handler.ts`**\n\n```typescript\nimport { createHandler } from \"bknd/adapter/aws\";\n\nexport const handler = createHandler({\n  connection: {\n    url: process.env.DB_URL!,\n    authToken: process.env.DB_TOKEN,\n  },\n  isProduction: true,\n  auth: {\n    jwt: { secret: process.env.JWT_SECRET! },\n  },\n});\n```\n\n**Step 3: Create `serverless.yml`**\n\n```yaml\nservice: bknd-api\n\nprovider:\n  name: aws\n  runtime: nodejs20.x\n  region: us-east-1\n  environment:\n    DB_URL: ${env:DB_URL}\n    DB_TOKEN: ${env:DB_TOKEN}\n    JWT_SECRET: ${env:JWT_SECRET}\n\nplugins:\n  - serverless-esbuild\n\nfunctions:\n  api:\n    handler: handler.handler\n    events:\n      - http:\n          path: /{proxy+}\n          method: ANY\n      - http:\n          path: /\n          method: ANY\n```\n\n**Step 4: Deploy**\n\n```bash\nserverless deploy --stage prod\n```\n\n---\n\n## Pre-Deployment Checklist\n\n```bash\n# 1. Generate types\nnpx bknd types\n\n# 2. Test locally with production-like config\nDB_URL=\"your-prod-db\" JWT_SECRET=\"your-secret\" npx bknd run\n\n# 3. Verify schema sync\n# Schema auto-syncs on first request in production\n```\n\n## Environment Variables (All Platforms)\n\n| Variable | Required | Description |\n|----------|----------|-------------|\n| `DB_URL` | Yes | Database connection URL |\n| `DB_TOKEN` | Depends | Auth token (Turso/LibSQL) |\n| `JWT_SECRET` | Yes | Min 32 chars for security |\n| `PORT` | No | Server port (default: 3000) |\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n### \"Module not found\" for Native SQLite\n\n**Problem:** `better-sqlite3` not available in serverless\n\n**Fix:** Use LibSQL/Turso instead of file-based SQLite:\n```typescript\nconnection: {\n  url: \"libsql://your-db.turso.io\",\n  authToken: process.env.DB_TOKEN,\n}\n```\n\n### \"JWT_SECRET required\" Error\n\n**Problem:** Auth fails in production\n\n**Fix:** Set JWT_SECRET environment variable:\n```bash\n# Cloudflare\nwrangler secret put JWT_SECRET\n\n# Vercel\nvercel env add JWT_SECRET\n\n# Docker\ndocker run -e JWT_SECRET=\"your-secret\" ...\n```\n\n### Cold Start Timeouts (Lambda)\n\n**Problem:** First request times out\n\n**Fix:**\n- Use lighter database (Turso over RDS)\n- Reduce bundle size\n- Enable provisioned concurrency for critical functions\n\n### D1 Binding Not Found\n\n**Problem:** `env.DB is undefined`\n\n**Fix:** Check wrangler.toml D1 binding:\n```toml\n[[d1_databases]]\nbinding = \"DB\"  # Must match env.DB in code\ndatabase_name = \"my-database\"\ndatabase_id = \"actual-id-from-wrangler-d1-create\"\n```\n\n### Media Uploads Fail in Serverless\n\n**Problem:** Local storage doesn''t work in serverless\n\n**Fix:** Use cloud storage adapter:\n```typescript\nconfig: {\n  media: {\n    adapter: {\n      type: \"s3\",  // or \"r2\", \"cloudinary\"\n      config: { /* credentials */ },\n    },\n  },\n}\n```\n\n### CORS Errors\n\n**Problem:** Frontend can''t access API\n\n**Fix:** Configure CORS in your adapter:\n```typescript\n// Most adapters handle this automatically\n// For custom needs, check platform docs\n```\n\n## Deployment Commands Reference\n\n```bash\n# Cloudflare Workers\nwrangler deploy\nwrangler tail  # View logs\n\n# Vercel\nvercel deploy --prod\nvercel logs\n\n# Docker\ndocker compose up -d\ndocker compose logs -f\n\n# AWS Lambda\nserverless deploy --stage prod\nserverless logs -f api\n```\n\n## DOs and DON''Ts\n\n**DO:**\n- Set `isProduction: true` in production config\n- Use cloud storage (S3/R2/Cloudinary) for media\n- Set strong JWT_SECRET (min 32 chars)\n- Enable Guard for authorization\n- Test with production database before deploying\n- Use environment variables for all secrets\n\n**DON''T:**\n- Use file-based SQLite in serverless\n- Hardcode secrets in code\n- Deploy without testing schema sync\n- Use local storage adapter in production\n- Skip JWT_SECRET configuration\n- Commit `.env` files with real secrets\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **bknd-database-provision** - Set up production database\n- **bknd-production-config** - Production security settings\n- **bknd-storage-config** - Configure media storage\n- **bknd-env-config** - Environment variable setup\n- **bknd-local-setup** - Local development (pre-deploy testing)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:35:52.279Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full Stack Agents needing streamlined deployment to Cloudflare, Vercel, and other hosting platforms.","zh":"非常适合需要简化部署到 Cloudflare、Vercel 和其他托管平台的全栈代理。","ja":"Cloudflare、Vercel、その他のホスティングプラットフォームへのデプロイを簡素化する必要があるフルスタックエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Cloudflare, Vercel 및 기타 호스팅 플랫폼에 대한 배포를 간소화해야 하는 풀 스택 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Full Stack que necesitan una implementación simplificada en Cloudflare, Vercel y otras plataformas de alojamiento.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full Stack ayant besoin d''un déploiement simplifié sur Cloudflare, Vercel et d''autres plateformes d''hébergement.","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agents, die eine vereinfachte Bereitstellung auf Cloudflare, Vercel und anderen Hosting-Plattformen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full Stack que necessitam de implantação simplificada para Cloudflare, Vercel e outras plataformas de hospedagem.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Full Stack, которым необходима упрощенная развертка на Cloudflare, Vercel и других платформах хостинга.","ar":"مثالي لعميل خادم كامل يحتاج إلى توزيع مبسط إلى Cloudflare و Vercel ومنصات استضافة أخرى."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to deploy Bknd applications with ease, utilizing environment variables, schema definitions, and database provisioning through platforms like Cloudflare and Vercel, while managing deployment logs and settings.","zh":"赋予代理以轻松部署 Bknd 应用程序的能力，利用环境变量、模式定义和通过 Cloudflare、Vercel 等平台的数据库预配，同时管理部署日志和设置。","ja":"エージェントが、Cloudflare や Vercel などのプラットフォームを介した環境変数、スキーマ定義、およびデータベースのプロビジョニングを利用して Bknd アプリケーションを簡単にデプロイできるようにし、デプロイ ログと設定の管理を行う。","ko":"에이전트가 Cloudflare, Vercel 등의 플랫폼을 통해 환경 변수, 스키마 정의 및 데이터베이스 프로비저닝을 사용하여 Bknd 애플리케이션을 쉽게 배포할 수 있도록 하며, 배포 로그 및 설정을 관리합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar aplicaciones Bknd con facilidad, utilizando variables de entorno, definiciones de esquema y aprovisionamiento de bases de datos a través de plataformas como Cloudflare y Vercel, al mismo tiempo que gestiona registros y configuraciones de implementación.","fr":"Permet aux agents de déployer des applications Bknd avec facilité, en utilisant des variables d''environnement, des définitions de schéma et un approvisionnement de base de données via des plateformes comme Cloudflare et Vercel, tout en gérant les journaux et les paramètres de déploiement.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Bknd-Anwendungen mit Leichtigkeit bereitzustellen, indem sie Umgebungsvariablen, Schemadefinitionen und Datenbankbereitstellung über Plattformen wie Cloudflare und Vercel nutzen und gleichzeitig Bereitstellungsprotokolle und -einstellungen verwalten.","pt":"Permite que os agentes implantem aplicações Bknd com facilidade, utilizando variáveis de ambiente, definições de esquema e provisionamento de banco de dados por meio de plataformas como Cloudflare e Vercel, além de gerenciar logs e configurações de implantação.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью развертывать приложения Bknd с легкостью, используя переменные среды, определения схемы и обеспечение базы данных через платформы, такие как Cloudflare и Vercel, а также управлять журналами развертывания и настройками.","ar":"يسمح للوكيلين بنشر تطبيقات Bknd بسهولة، باستخدام متغيرات البيئة وتعريفات المخطط وتوفير قاعدة البيانات من خلال منصات مثل Cloudflare و Vercel، بالإضافة إلى إدارة سجلات النشر والإعدادات."},"useCases":{"en":["Deploying Bknd applications to cloud hosting services","Configuring environment variables for deployment through Cloudflare/Vercel dashboards","Managing and viewing deployment logs for troubleshooting"],"zh":["将 Bknd 应用程序部署到云托管服务","通过 Cloudflare/Vercel 控制面板配置环境变量以进行部署","管理和查看部署日志以进行故障排除"],"ja":["Bknd アプリケーションをクラウド ホスティング サービスにデプロイする","Cloudflare/Vercel ダッシュボードを介したデプロイの環境変数の構成","デプロイ ログの管理と表示によるトラブルシューティング"],"ko":["Bknd 애플리케이션을 클라우드 호스팅 서비스에 배포하는 것","Cloudflare/Vercel 대시보드를 통해 배포를 위한 환경 변수 구성","배포 로그 관리 및 표시를 통한 문제 해결"],"es":["Implementar aplicaciones Bknd en servicios de alojamiento en la nube","Configurar variables de entorno para la implementación a través de paneles de Cloudflare/Vercel","Administrar y visualizar registros de implementación para la solución de problemas"],"fr":["Déployer des applications Bknd sur des services d''hébergement cloud","Configurer des variables d''environnement pour le déploiement via les tableaux de bord Cloudflare/Vercel","Gérer et afficher les journaux de déploiement pour la résolution des problèmes"],"de":["Bereitstellen von Bknd-Anwendungen in Cloud-Hosting-Diensten","Konfigurieren von Umgebungsvariablen für die Bereitstellung über Cloudflare-/Vercel-Dashboards","Verwalten und Anzeigen von Bereitstellungsprotokollen zur Fehlerbehebung"],"pt":["Implantação de aplicações Bknd em serviços de hospedagem em nuvem","Configuração de variáveis de ambiente para implantação por meio dos painéis de controle do Cloudflare/Vercel","Gerenciamento e visualização de logs de implantação para solução de problemas"],"ru":["Развертка приложений Bknd на сервисах облачного хостинга","Настройка переменных среды для развертки через панели управления Cloudflare/Vercel","Управление и просмотр журналов развертывания для устранения неполадок"],"ar":["نشر تطبيقات Bknd على خدمات الاستضافة السحابية","تكوين متغيرات البيئة لنشر عبر لوحات التحكم في Cloudflare / Vercel","إدارة ومشاهدة سجلات النشر لحل المشكلات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires a working Bknd application locally","Needs schema defined and tested","Requires database provisioning and environment variables prepared"],"zh":["需要在本地工作的 Bknd 应用程序","需要定义和测试模式","需要准备数据库预配和环境变量"],"ja":["ローカルで動作する Bknd アプリケーションが必要","スキーマが定義およびテストされている必要がある","データベースのプロビジョニングと環境変数の準備が必要"],"ko":["로컬에서 작동하는 Bknd 애플리케이션이 필요","스키마가 정의되고 테스트되어야 함","데이터베이스 프로비저닝 및 환경 변수 준비가 필요"],"es":["Requiere una aplicación Bknd funcional de forma local","Necesita un esquema definido y probado","Requiere aprovisionamiento de base de datos y variables de entorno preparadas"],"fr":["Nécessite une application Bknd fonctionnelle en local","Nécessite un schéma défini et testé","Nécessite un approvisionnement de base de données et des variables d''environnement préparées"],"de":["Benötigt eine funktionierende Bknd-Anwendung lokal","Benötigt ein definiertes und getestetes Schema","Benötigt Datenbankbereitstellung und Umgebungsvariablen, die vorbereitet sind"],"pt":["Exige uma aplicação Bknd funcionando localmente","Necessita de esquema definido e testado","Exige provisionamento de banco de dados e variáveis de ambiente preparadas"],"ru":["Требует работающего приложения Bknd на локальном компьютере","Требует определенной и протестированной схемы","Требует обеспечения базы данных и подготовленных переменных среды"],"ar":["يتطلب تطبيق Bknd يعمل محليًا","يتطلب مخططًا محددًا ومتجربًا","يتطلب توفير قاعدة البيانات ومتغيرات البيئة المعدة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
