 되었는지 여부에 대한 제안을 제공합니다","es":"La revisión de PR realiza una evaluación exhaustiva y devuelve una recomendación estructurada sobre la preparación para /preparepr","fr":"L''examen PR effectue une évaluation exhaustive et renvoie une recommandation structurée sur la préparation pour /preparepr","de":"Die PR-Überprüfung führt eine gründliche Bewertung durch und gibt eine strukturierte Empfehlung zur Vorbereitung für /preparepr zurück","pt":"A revisão de PR é uma ferramenta que realiza uma avaliação aprofundada do código e fornece recomendações estruturadas para desenvolvedores.","ru":"Проверка PR - это инструмент, который проводит тщательную оценку кода и предоставляет структурированные рекомендации для разработчиков.","ar":"استعراض تقرير PR هو أداة تقوم بتقييم شامل للشفرة وتقدم توصيات منظمة للمطورين.","en":"Trial openclaw / clawbot of Peter Steinberger with THANKS !"},"definition":{"en":"Trial openclaw / clawbot of Peter Steinberger with THANKS !"},"features":{"zh":["代码审查","代码质量评估","安全检查","PR号或URL输入","防止自动推送到主分支"],"ja":["コードレビュー","コード品質評価","セキュリティチェック","PR番号またはURLの入力","自動プッシュを主ブランチに防止"],"ko":["코드 리뷰","코드 품질 평가","보안 검사","PR 번호 또는 URL 입력","자동 푸시를 메인 브랜치에 방지"],"es":["Evaluación exhaustiva de PR","Recomendación estructurada sobre la preparación","No se permite la ejecución de comandos de git push","No se permite la detención del gateway","Se solicita el número o URL de PR","Se garantiza la seguridad y la integridad de los datos"],"fr":["Évaluation exhaustive de PR","Recommandation structurée sur la préparation","Il n''est pas possible d''exécuter des commandes de git push","Il n''est pas possible d''arrêter le gateway","La demande de numéro ou d''URL de PR est obligatoire","La sécurité et l''intégrité des données sont garanties"],"de":["Gründliche Bewertung von PR","Strukturierte Empfehlung zur Vorbereitung","Die Ausführung von git push-Befehlen ist nicht möglich","Die Deaktivierung des Gateways ist nicht möglich","Die Anforderung der PR-Nummer oder -URL ist obligatorisch","Die Sicherheit und Integrität der Daten sind garantiert"],"pt":["Avaliação aprofundada do código","Recomendações estruturadas para desenvolvedores","Não executa push para o repositório principal","Não executa comandos de parada do gateway","Trata a revisão como somente leitura"],"ru":["Тщательная оценка кода","Структурированные рекомендации для разработчиков","Не выполняет push в основной репозиторий","Не выполняет команды остановки шлюза","Относится к проверке как к только чтению"],"ar":["تقييم شامل للشفرة","توصيات منظمة للمطورين","لا ينفذ عمليات 推 إلى المستودع الرئيسي","لا ينفذ أوامر إيقاف البوابة","يعامل الاستعراض على أنه قراءة فقط"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码审查","代码质量","安全检查","PR审查","代码合并","自动化测试","代码评估","软件开发"],"ja":["コードレビュー","コード品質","セキュリティチェック","プルリクエストレビュー","コードマージ","自動テスト","コード評価","ソフトウェア開発"],"ko":["코드 리뷰","코드 품질","보안 검사","PR 리뷰","코드 병합","자동화 테스트","코드 평가","소프트웨어 개발"],"es":["revisión de PR","evaluación de PR","preparación de PR","Pull Request","git push","seguridad de datos","integridad de datos","desarrollo de software","ingeniería de software"],"fr":["examen PR","évaluation de PR","préparation de PR","demande de tirage","git push","sécurité des données","intégrité des données","développement de logiciels","ingénierie de logiciels"],"de":["PR-Überprüfung","Bewertung von PR","Vorbereitung von PR","Pull-Request","git push","Datensicherheit","Datenintegrität","Softwareentwicklung","Softwareingenieurwesen"],"pt":["revisão de PR","análise de código","desenvolvimento de software","qualidade de código","conformidade de código","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["проверка PR","анализ кода","разработка программного обеспечения","качество кода","соответствие кода","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["استعراض تقرير PR","تحليل الشفرة","تطوير البرمجيات","جودة الشفرة","امتثال الشفرة","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"Hung-Reo","repo":"hungreo-openclaw","repoPath":"Hung-Reo/hungreo-openclaw","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.423Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"review-pr","description":"Review-only GitHub pull request analysis with the gh CLI. Use when asked to review a PR, provide structured feedback, or assess readiness to land. Do not merge, push, or make code changes you intend to keep.","bodyPreview":"# Review PR\n\n## Overview\n\nPerform a thorough review-only PR assessment and return a structured recommendation on readiness for /preparepr.\n\n## Inputs\n\n- Ask for PR number or URL.\n- If missing, always ask. Never auto-detect from conversation.\n- If ambiguous, ask.\n\n## Safety\n\n- Never push to `main` or `origin/main`, not during review, not ever.\n- Do not run `git push` at all during review. Treat review as read only.\n- Do not stop or kill the gateway. Do not run gateway stop commands. Do not kill p","body":"# Review PR\n\n## Overview\n\nPerform a thorough review-only PR assessment and return a structured recommendation on readiness for /preparepr.\n\n## Inputs\n\n- Ask for PR number or URL.\n- If missing, always ask. Never auto-detect from conversation.\n- If ambiguous, ask.\n\n## Safety\n\n- Never push to `main` or `origin/main`, not during review, not ever.\n- Do not run `git push` at all during review. Treat review as read only.\n- Do not stop or kill the gateway. Do not run gateway stop commands. Do not kill processes on port 18792.\n\n## Execution Rule\n\n- Execute the workflow. Do not stop after printing the TODO checklist.\n- If delegating, require the delegate to run commands and capture outputs, not a plan.\n\n## Known Failure Modes\n\n- If you see \"fatal: not a git repository\", you are in the wrong directory. Use `~/openclaw`.\n- Do not stop after printing the checklist. That is not completion.\n\n## Writing Style for Output\n\n- Write casual and direct.\n- Avoid em dashes and en dashes. Use commas or separate sentences.\n\n## Completion Criteria\n\n- Run the commands in the worktree and inspect the PR directly.\n- Produce the structured review sections A through J.\n- Save the full review to `.local/review.md` inside the worktree.\n\n## First: Create a TODO Checklist\n\nCreate a checklist of all review steps, print it, then continue and execute the commands.\n\n## Setup: Use a Worktree\n\nUse an isolated worktree for all review work.\n\n```sh\ncd ~/Development/openclaw\n# Sanity: confirm you are in the repo\ngit rev-parse --show-toplevel\n\nWORKTREE_DIR=\".worktrees/pr-<PR>\"\ngit fetch origin main\n\n# Reuse existing worktree if it exists, otherwise create new\nif [ -d \"$WORKTREE_DIR\" ]; then\n  cd \"$WORKTREE_DIR\"\n  git checkout temp/pr-<PR> 2>/dev/null || git checkout -b temp/pr-<PR>\n  git fetch origin main\n  git reset --hard origin/main\nelse\n  git worktree add \"$WORKTREE_DIR\" -b temp/pr-<PR> origin/main\n  cd \"$WORKTREE_DIR\"\nfi\n\n# Create local scratch space that persists across /reviewpr to /preparepr to /mergepr\nmkdir -p .local\n```\n\nRun all commands inside the worktree directory.\nStart on `origin/main` so you can check for existing implementations before looking at PR code.\n\n## Steps\n\n1. Identify PR meta and context\n\n```sh\ngh pr view <PR> --json number,title,state,isDraft,author,baseRefName,headRefName,headRepository,url,body,labels,assignees,reviewRequests,files,additions,deletions --jq ''{number,title,url,state,isDraft,author:.author.login,base:.baseRefName,head:.headRefName,headRepo:.headRepository.nameWithOwner,additions,deletions,files:.files|length,body}''\n```\n\n2. Check if this already exists in main before looking at the PR branch\n\n- Identify the core feature or fix from the PR title and description.\n- Search for existing implementations using keywords from the PR title, changed file paths, and function or component names from the diff.\n\n```sh\n# Use keywords from the PR title and changed files\nrg -n \"<keyword_from_pr_title>\" -S src packages apps ui || true\nrg -n \"<function_or_component_name>\" -S src packages apps ui || true\n\ngit log --oneline --all --grep=\"<keyword_from_pr_title>\" | head -20\n```\n\nIf it already exists, call it out as a BLOCKER or at least IMPORTANT.\n\n3. Claim the PR\n\nAssign yourself so others know someone is reviewing. Skip if the PR looks like spam or is a draft you plan to recommend closing.\n\n```sh\ngh_user=$(gh api user --jq .login)\ngh pr edit <PR> --add-assignee \"$gh_user\"\n```\n\n4. Read the PR description carefully\n\nUse the body from step 1. Summarize goal, scope, and missing context.\n\n5. Read the diff thoroughly\n\nMinimum:\n\n```sh\ngh pr diff <PR>\n```\n\nIf you need full code context locally, fetch the PR head to a local ref and diff it. Do not create a merge commit.\n\n```sh\ngit fetch origin pull/<PR>/head:pr-<PR>\n# Show changes without modifying the working tree\n\ngit diff --stat origin/main..pr-<PR>\ngit diff origin/main..pr-<PR>\n```\n\nIf you want to browse the PR version of files directly, temporarily check out `pr-<PR>` in the worktree. Do not commit or push. Return to `temp/pr-<PR>` and reset to `origin/main` afterward.\n\n```sh\n# Use only if needed\n# git checkout pr-<PR>\n# ...inspect files...\n\ngit checkout temp/pr-<PR>\ngit reset --hard origin/main\n```\n\n6. Validate the change is needed and valuable\n\nBe honest. Call out low value AI slop.\n\n7. Evaluate implementation quality\n\nReview correctness, design, performance, and ergonomics.\n\n8. Perform a security review\n\nAssume OpenClaw subagents run with full disk access, including git, gh, and shell. Check auth, input validation, secrets, dependencies, tool safety, and privacy.\n\n9. Review tests and verification\n\nIdentify what exists, what is missing, and what would be a minimal regression test.\n\n10. Check docs\n\nCheck if the PR touches code with related documentation such as README, docs, inline API docs, or config examples.\n\n- If docs exist for the changed area and the PR does not update them, flag as IMPORTANT.\n- If the PR adds a new feature or config option with no docs, flag as IMPORTANT.\n- If the change is purely internal with no user-facing impact, skip this.\n\n11. Check changelog\n\nCheck if `CHANGELOG.md` exists and whether the PR warrants an entry.\n\n- If the project has a changelog and the PR is user-facing, flag missing entry as IMPORTANT.\n- Leave the change for /preparepr, only flag it here.\n\n12. Answer the key question\n\nDecide if /preparepr can fix issues or the contributor must update the PR.\n\n13. Save findings to the worktree\n\nWrite the full structured review sections A through J to `.local/review.md`.\nCreate or overwrite the file and verify it exists and is non-empty.\n\n```sh\nls -la .local/review.md\nwc -l .local/review.md\n```\n\n14. Output the structured review\n\nProduce a review that matches what you saved to `.local/review.md`.\n\nA) TL;DR recommendation\n\n- One of: READY FOR /preparepr | NEEDS WORK | NEEDS DISCUSSION | NOT USEFUL (CLOSE)\n- 1 to 3 sentences.\n\nB) What changed\n\nC) What is good\n\nD) Security findings\n\nE) Concerns or questions (actionable)\n\n- Numbered list.\n- Mark each item as BLOCKER, IMPORTANT, or NIT.\n- For each, point to file or area and propose a concrete fix.\n\nF) Tests\n\nG) Docs status\n\n- State if related docs are up to date, missing, or not applicable.\n\nH) Changelog\n\n- State if `CHANGELOG.md` needs an entry and which category.\n\nI) Follow ups (optional)\n\nJ) Suggested PR comment (optional)\n\n## Guardrails\n\n- Worktree only.\n- Do not delete the worktree after review.\n- Review only, do not merge, do not push.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:36:55.431Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing structured PR assessment and git workflow integration.","zh":"适合需要结构化PR评估和git工作流集成的代码审查代理。","ja":"コードレビューエージェントが構造化されたPR評価とGitワークフロー統合を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"코드 리뷰 에이전트가 구조화된 PR 평가 및 Git 워크플로 통합을 필요로 할 때 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de revisión de código que necesitan una evaluación de PR estructurada y la integración del flujo de trabajo de git.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de révision de code nécessitant une évaluation de PR structurée et l''intégration du workflow git.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agenten, die eine strukturierte PR-Bewertung und eine Git-Workflow-Integration benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que necessitam de avaliação estruturada de PR e integração de workflow do git.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов проверки кода, которым необходима структурированная оценка PR и интеграция с git.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المراجعة الكود التي تحتاج إلى تقييم منظم للرأس ودمج جيت"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform thorough review-only PR assessments using git, returning structured recommendations on readiness for merge, while ensuring safety protocols such as never pushing to main or running git push during review.","zh":"赋予代理执行彻底的仅审查PR评估，使用git，返回关于合并就绪的结构化建议，同时确保安全协议，例如永远不推送到主分支或在审查期间运行git推送。","ja":"エージェントがGitを使用して包括的なレビューのみのPR評価を実行し、マージの準備完了についての構造化された推奨事項を返し、安全性プロトコル（たとえば、メインブランチへのプッシュやレビュー中のGitプッシュの実行を決して行わないなど）を確保することを可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가Git를 사용하여 철저한 리뷰 전용 PR 평가를 수행하고 병합 준비에 대한 구조화된 추천 사항을 반환하며 안전 프로토콜(예: 메인 브랜치로 푸시하거나 리뷰 중에 Git 푸시를 실행하지 않는 것)을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar evaluaciones de PR exhaustivas y solo de revisión utilizando git, devolviendo recomendaciones estructuradas sobre la preparación para la fusión, al mismo tiempo que garantiza protocolos de seguridad como nunca empujar a main o ejecutar git push durante la revisión.","fr":"Autonomise les agents pour effectuer des évaluations de PR approfondies et uniquement de révision à l''aide de git, renvoyant des recommandations structurées sur la préparation pour la fusion, tout en garantissant des protocoles de sécurité tels que ne jamais pousser vers main ou exécuter git push pendant la révision.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, umfassende Bewertungen von PR durchzuführen, die nur für die Überprüfung bestimmt sind und git verwenden, und gibt strukturierte Empfehlungen zur Merge-Bereitschaft zurück, während sie gleichzeitig Sicherheitsprotokolle wie nie zum Hauptzweig zu drücken oder git push während der Überprüfung auszuführen, gewährleistet.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar avaliações de PR abrangentes usando o git, retornando recomendações estruturadas sobre a prontidão para mesclagem, garantindo protocolos de segurança, como nunca empurrar para o main ou executar git push durante a revisão.","ru":"Позволяет агентам выполнять тщательные проверки только PR-оценок, используя git, возвращая структурированные рекомендации о готовности к слиянию, обеспечивая протоколы безопасности, такие как никогда не đẩyать в основную ветку или запускать git push во время проверки.","ar":"يتمكن الوكلاء من أداء تقييمات شاملة للرأس باستخدام جيت، وإرجاع توصيات منظمة حول جاهزية الدمج، مع ضمان بروتوكولات الأمان، مثل أبدا دفع إلى الرئيسي أو تشغيل جيت دفع خلال المراجعة"},"useCases":{"en":["Assessing PR readiness for merge","Generating structured review recommendations","Validating PR numbers or URLs for accurate assessment"],"zh":["评估PR合并的就绪性","生成结构化的审查建议","验证PR编号或URL以进行准确的评估"],"ja":["マージの準備完了についてPRを評価する","構造化されたレビューの推奨事項を生成する","正確な評価のためのPR番号またはURLを検証する"],"ko":["병합을 위한 PR 준비 상태 평가","구조화된 리뷰 권장 사항 생성","정확한 평가를 위한 PR 번호 또는 URL 확인"],"es":["Evaluar la preparación de PR para la fusión","Generar recomendaciones de revisión estructuradas","Validar números o URLs de PR para una evaluación precisa"],"fr":["Évaluer la préparation de PR pour la fusion","Générer des recommandations de révision structurées","Valider les numéros ou les URL de PR pour une évaluation précise"],"de":["Bewerten der PR-Bereitschaft für das Zusammenführen","Erzeugen strukturierter Überprüfungsempfehlungen","Überprüfen von PR-Nummern oder -URLs für eine genaue Bewertung"],"pt":["Avaliando a prontidão do PR para mesclagem","Gerando recomendações de revisão estruturadas","Validando números ou URLs de PR para avaliação precisa"],"ru":["Оценка готовности PR к слиянию","Генерация структурированных рекомендаций по проверке","Проверка номеров или URL-адресов PR для точной оценки"],"ar":["تقييم جاهزية الرأس للدمج","إنتاج توصيات المراجعة المنظمة","التحقق من أرقام أو عناوين يو آر إل للرأس لتقييم دقيق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires explicit PR number or URL input","Does not support auto-detection of PR numbers or URLs","Treats review as read-only, prohibiting git push commands"],"zh":["需要显式的PR编号或URL输入","不支持PR编号或URL的自动检测","将审查视为只读，禁止Git推送命令"],"ja":["明示的なPR番号またはURLの入力が必要","PR番号またはURLの自動検出をサポートしない","レビューを読み取り専用として扱い、Gitプッシュコマンドを禁止する"],"ko":["명시적인 PR 번호 또는 URL 입력이 필요","PR 번호 또는 URL 자동 감지를 지원하지 않음","리뷰를 읽기 전용으로 처리하여 Git 푸시 명령을 금지"],"es":["Requiere una entrada explícita de número o URL de PR","No admite la auto-detección de números o URLs de PR","Trata la revisión como de solo lectura, prohibiendo los comandos git push"],"fr":["Nécessite une entrée explicite du numéro ou de l''URL de PR","Ne prend pas en charge la détection automatique des numéros ou des URL de PR","Traite la révision comme en lecture seule, interdisant les commandes git push"],"de":["Erfordert eine explizite Eingabe von PR-Nummer oder -URL","Unterstützt keine automatische Erkennung von PR-Nummern oder -URLs","Behandelt die Überprüfung als schreibgeschützt, was git-Push-Befehle verbietet"],"pt":["Requer entrada explícita do número ou URL do PR","Não suporta detecção automática de números ou URLs do PR","Trata a revisão como somente leitura, proibindo comandos git push"],"ru":["Требует явного ввода номера или URL-адреса PR","Не поддерживает автоматическое обнаружение номеров или URL-адресов PR","Рассматривает проверку как только для чтения, запрещая команды git push"],"ar":["يتطلب إدخال صريح لرقم أو عنوان يو آر إل للرأس","لا يدعم الكشف التلقائي عن أرقام أو عناوين يو آر إل للرأس","يعامل المراجعة على أنها للقراءة فقط، ويحظر أوامر جيت دفع"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
