ltados de búsqueda","Es compatible con la mayoría de los motores de búsqueda","Es fácil de implementar y mantener"],"fr":["Améliore la visibilité dans les résultats de recherche","Aide les moteurs de recherche à comprendre le contenu","Active les résultats enrichis dans la recherche","Augmente le taux de clics dans les résultats de recherche","Est compatible avec la plupart des moteurs de recherche","Est facile à mettre en œuvre et à maintenir"],"de":["Verbessert die Sichtbarkeit in den Suchergebnissen","Hilft den Suchmaschinen, den Inhalt zu verstehen","Aktiviert erweiterte Ergebnisse in der Suche","Erhöht die Klickraten in den Suchergebnissen","Ist mit den meisten Suchmaschinen kompatibel","Ist einfach zu implementieren und zu warten"],"pt":["Melhora a visibilidade dos sites nos resultados de busca","Fornece dados estruturados para os mecanismos de busca","Ajuda a criar rich results em resultados de busca","É compatível com vários tipos de conteúdo","Pode ser implementado em diferentes plataformas"],"ru":["Улучшает видимость сайтов в результатах поиска","Предоставляет структурированные данные поисковым системам","Помогает создавать богатые результаты в результатах поиска","Компатибелен с различными типами контента","Может быть реализован на разных платформах"],"ar":["يحسن ظهور المواقع على نتائج البحث","يقدم بيانات منظمة لمحركات البحث","يساعد على إنشاء نتائج غنية في نتائج البحث","يتوافق مع أنواع مختلفة من المحتوى","يمكن تنفيذه على منصات مختلفة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["schema 标记","结构化数据","搜索引擎优化","schema.org","丰富搜索结果","点击率","网站可见性","技术开发","开发者工具"],"ja":["スキーママークアップ","構造化データ","検索エンジン最適化","schema.org","豊富な検索結果","クリック率","ウェブサイトの可視性","技術開発","開発者ツール"],"ko":["스키마 마크업","구조화된 데이터","검색 엔진 최적화","schema.org","풍부한 검색 결과","클릭률","웹사이트 가시성","기술 개발","개발자 도구"],"es":["marcado de esquema","resultados enriquecidos","motores de búsqueda","contenido estructurado","visibilidad en la búsqueda","optimización de búsqueda","seo","schema.org","microdatos"],"fr":["balises de schéma","résultats enrichis","moteurs de recherche","contenu structuré","visibilité dans la recherche","optimisation de la recherche","seo","schema.org","microdonnées"],"de":["schema-markup","erweiterte suchergebnisse","suchmaschinen","strukturierter inhalt","sichtbarkeit in der suche","suchmaschinen-optimierung","seo","schema.org","mikrodaten"],"pt":["schema markup","dados estruturados","mecanismos de busca","visibilidade dos sites","rich results","desenvolvedores","otimização de sites","seo"],"ru":["schema markup","структурированные данные","поисковые системы","видимость сайтов","богатые результаты","разработчики","оптимизация сайтов","seo"],"ar":["schema markup","بيانات منظمة","محركات البحث","ظهور المواقع","نتائج غنية","مطورين","تحسين المواقع","seo"]}},"owner":"santipdmonte","repo":"CIVetRosario-LandingPage-Tailwind","repoPath":"santipdmonte/CIVetRosario-LandingPage-Tailwind","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.423Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"schema-markup","description":"When the user wants to add, fix, or optimize schema markup and structured data on their site. Also use when the user mentions schema markup, structured data, JSON-LD, rich snippets, schema.org, FAQ schema, product schema, review schema, or breadcrumb schema. For broader SEO issues, see seo-audit.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Schema Markup\n\nYou are an expert in structured data and schema markup. Your goal is to implement schema.org markup that helps search engines understand content and enables rich results in search.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore implementing schema, understand:\n\n1. **Page Type","body":"# Schema Markup\n\nYou are an expert in structured data and schema markup. Your goal is to implement schema.org markup that helps search engines understand content and enables rich results in search.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore implementing schema, understand:\n\n1. **Page Type** - What kind of page? What''s the primary content? What rich results are possible?\n\n2. **Current State** - Any existing schema? Errors in implementation? Which rich results already appearing?\n\n3. **Goals** - Which rich results are you targeting? What''s the business value?\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. Accuracy First\n- Schema must accurately represent page content\n- Don''t markup content that doesn''t exist\n- Keep updated when content changes\n\n### 2. Use JSON-LD\n- Google recommends JSON-LD format\n- Easier to implement and maintain\n- Place in `<head>` or end of `<body>`\n\n### 3. Follow Google''s Guidelines\n- Only use markup Google supports\n- Avoid spam tactics\n- Review eligibility requirements\n\n### 4. Validate Everything\n- Test before deploying\n- Monitor Search Console\n- Fix errors promptly\n\n---\n\n## Common Schema Types\n\n| Type | Use For | Required Properties |\n|------|---------|-------------------|\n| Organization | Company homepage/about | name, url |\n| WebSite | Homepage (search box) | name, url |\n| Article | Blog posts, news | headline, image, datePublished, author |\n| Product | Product pages | name, image, offers |\n| SoftwareApplication | SaaS/app pages | name, offers |\n| FAQPage | FAQ content | mainEntity (Q&A array) |\n| HowTo | Tutorials | name, step |\n| BreadcrumbList | Any page with breadcrumbs | itemListElement |\n| LocalBusiness | Local business pages | name, address |\n| Event | Events, webinars | name, startDate, location |\n\n**For complete JSON-LD examples**: See [references/schema-examples.md](references/schema-examples.md)\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Organization (Company Page)\nRequired: name, url\nRecommended: logo, sameAs (social profiles), contactPoint\n\n### Article/BlogPosting\nRequired: headline, image, datePublished, author\nRecommended: dateModified, publisher, description\n\n### Product\nRequired: name, image, offers (price + availability)\nRecommended: sku, brand, aggregateRating, review\n\n### FAQPage\nRequired: mainEntity (array of Question/Answer pairs)\n\n### BreadcrumbList\nRequired: itemListElement (array with position, name, item)\n\n---\n\n## Multiple Schema Types\n\nYou can combine multiple schema types on one page using `@graph`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@graph\": [\n    { \"@type\": \"Organization\", ... },\n    { \"@type\": \"WebSite\", ... },\n    { \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", ... }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Validation and Testing\n\n### Tools\n- **Google Rich Results Test**: https://search.google.com/test/rich-results\n- **Schema.org Validator**: https://validator.schema.org/\n- **Search Console**: Enhancements reports\n\n### Common Errors\n\n**Missing required properties** - Check Google''s documentation for required fields\n\n**Invalid values** - Dates must be ISO 8601, URLs fully qualified, enumerations exact\n\n**Mismatch with page content** - Schema doesn''t match visible content\n\n---\n\n## Implementation\n\n### Static Sites\n- Add JSON-LD directly in HTML template\n- Use includes/partials for reusable schema\n\n### Dynamic Sites (React, Next.js)\n- Component that renders schema\n- Server-side rendered for SEO\n- Serialize data to JSON-LD\n\n### CMS / WordPress\n- Plugins (Yoast, Rank Math, Schema Pro)\n- Theme modifications\n- Custom fields to structured data\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Schema Implementation\n```json\n// Full JSON-LD code block\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"...\",\n  // Complete markup\n}\n```\n\n### Testing Checklist\n- [ ] Validates in Rich Results Test\n- [ ] No errors or warnings\n- [ ] Matches page content\n- [ ] All required properties included\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What type of page is this?\n2. What rich results are you hoping to achieve?\n3. What data is available to populate the schema?\n4. Is there existing schema on the page?\n5. What''s your tech stack?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **seo-audit**: For overall SEO including schema review\n- **programmatic-seo**: For templated schema at scale\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:37:12.968Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for SEO Optimization Agents needing advanced schema markup implementation for rich search results.","zh":"适用于需要高级schema标记实现以获得丰富搜索结果的SEO优化代理","ja":"SEO最適化エージェントが高度なスキーママークアップの実装を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"豊富한 검색 결과를 얻기 위한 고급 스키마 표시 구현이 필요한 SEO 최적화 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de optimización de SEO que necesitan una implementación avanzada de marcado de esquema para resultados de búsqueda ricos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''optimisation du référencement (SEO) ayant besoin d''une mise en œuvre avancée de balises de schéma pour des résultats de recherche riches.","de":"Perfekt für SEO-Optimierungsagenten, die eine erweiterte Schema-Markup-Implementierung für reichhaltige Suchergebnisse benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de otimização de SEO que precisam de implementação avançada de marcação de esquema para resultados de pesquisa ricos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов оптимизации SEO, которым необходима продвинутая реализация схемы маркировки для богатых результатов поиска.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكالات تحسين 検索エンジン المحتوى التي تحتاج إلى تنفيذ متقدم لترميز مخطط لتوفير نتائج بحث غنية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement schema.org markup, enabling search engines to understand content and display rich results in search, utilizing protocols like JSON-LD and libraries for structured data optimization.","zh":"赋予代理实现schema.org标记的能力，使搜索引擎能够理解内容并在搜索结果中显示丰富的结果，利用JSON-LD等协议和结构化数据优化库","ja":"エージェントにschema.orgマークアップを実装する能力を付与し、検索エンジンがコンテンツを理解し、検索結果に豊富な結果を表示できるようにし、JSON-LDなどのプロトコルや構造化データ最適化ライブラリを利用","ko":"에이전트가 schema.org 표시를 구현할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 검색 엔진이 콘텐츠를 이해하고 검색 결과에 풍부한 결과를 표시할 수 있도록 하며, JSON-LDなどの 프로토콜과 구조화된 데이터 최적화 라이브러리를 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar el marcado de schema.org, lo que permite a los motores de búsqueda comprender el contenido y mostrar resultados ricos en la búsqueda, utilizando protocolos como JSON-LD y bibliotecas para la optimización de datos estructurados.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre les balises de schema.org, ce qui permet aux moteurs de recherche de comprendre le contenu et d''afficher des résultats riches dans la recherche, en utilisant des protocoles comme JSON-LD et des bibliothèques pour l''optimisation des données structurées.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, schema.org-Markup zu implementieren, sodass Suchmaschinen Inhalte verstehen und reichhaltige Ergebnisse in der Suche anzeigen können, wobei Protokolle wie JSON-LD und Bibliotheken für die Optimierung von strukturierten Daten verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar a marcação schema.org, permitindo que os mecanismos de busca entendam o conteúdo e exibam resultados ricos na pesquisa, utilizando protocolos como JSON-LD e bibliotecas para otimização de dados estruturados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовать маркировку schema.org, что позволяет поисковым системам понимать содержание и отображать богатые результаты в поиске, используя протоколы như JSON-LD и библиотеки для оптимизации структурированных данных.","ar":"تمكن الوكالات من تنفيذ ترميز مخطط، مما يسمح لمحركات البحث بفهم المحتوى وعرض نتائج بحث غنية، باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل JSON-LD ومكتبات لتحسين البيانات المهيكلة."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing product markup for e-commerce sites","Generating schema for event calendars","Enhancing article snippets with schema markup"],"zh":["为电子商务网站实施产品标记","为事件日历生成schema","使用schema标记增强文章摘要"],"ja":["電子商取引サイトの製品マークアップを実装","イベントカレンダーのスキーマを生成","スキーママークアップを使用して記事の要約を強化"],"ko":["전자상거래 사이트에 제품 표시를 구현","이벤트 달력에 대한 스키마 생성","스키마 표시를 사용하여 기사 요약 강화"],"es":["Implementar marcado de producto para sitios de comercio electrónico","Generar esquema para calendarios de eventos","Mejorar fragmentos de artículos con marcado de esquema"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des balises de produit pour les sites de commerce électronique","Générer des schémas pour les calendriers d''événements","Améliorer les extraits d''articles avec des balises de schéma"],"de":["Implementierung von Produktmarkierungen für E-Commerce-Websites","Generierung von Schemata für Veranstaltungskalender","Verbesserung von Artikelausschnitten mit Schemamarkierungen"],"pt":["Implementar marcação de produto para sites de comércio eletrônico","Gerar esquema para calendários de eventos","Melhorar trechos de artigo com marcação de esquema"],"ru":["Реализация маркировки продукта для электронных коммерческих сайтов","Генерация схемы для календарей событий","Улучшение сниппетов статей с помощью маркировки схемы"],"ar":["تنفيذ ترميز المنتج لمواقع التجارة الإلكترونية","generar مخطط للأحداث","تحسين مقتطفات المقال مع ترميز مخطط"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of schema.org vocabulary","Dependent on page type and content context"],"zh":["需要了解schema.org词汇","依赖于页面类型和内容上下文"],"ja":["schema.orgの語彙を理解する必要がある","ページの種類やコンテンツのコンテキストに依存する"],"ko":["schema.org 어휘를 이해해야 함","페이지 유형 및 콘텐츠 contexto에 의존"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento del vocabulario de schema.org","Depende del tipo de página y del contexto del contenido"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance du vocabulaire de schema.org","Dépend du type de page et du contexte du contenu"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse des schema.org-Vokabulars","Hängt vom Seitentyp und vom Kontext des Inhalts ab"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento do vocabulário schema.org","Dependente do tipo de página e contexto de conteúdo"],"ru":["Требует знания словаря schema.org","Зависит от типа страницы и контекста содержания"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة مصطلحات مخطط","يعتمد على نوع الصفحة وسياق المحتوى"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
