是一种结构化数据，帮助搜索引擎理解内容，实现丰富的搜索结果","ja":"スキーマ マークアップは、検索エンジンがコンテンツを理解し、豊富な検索結果を実現するための構造化データです","ko":"스키마 마크업은 검색 엔진이 콘텐츠를 이해하고 풍부한 검색 결과를 구현하는 구조화된 데이터입니다","es":"El marcado de esquema es fundamental para mejorar la comprensión de los motores de búsqueda y habilitar resultados enriquecidos. Aprende a implementarlo","fr":"Les balises de schéma sont essentielles pour améliorer la compréhension des moteurs de recherche et activer les résultats enrichis. Découvrez comment les met...","de":"Schema-Markup ist entscheidend, um die Verständlichkeit von Suchmaschinen zu verbessern und erweiterte Ergebnisse zu aktivieren. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie es imp...","pt":"O marcador de esquema é uma técnica para melhorar a visibilidade dos resultados de busca. Ele ajuda os motores de busca a entender o conteúdo e a exibir resu...","ru":"Маркировка схемы - это техника, которая улучшает видимость результатов поиска. Она помогает поисковым системам понимать контент и отображать богатые результаты","ar":"وسوم المخطط هي تقنية لتحسين وضوح نتائج البحث. تساعد محركات البحث على فهم المحتوى وعرض نتائج غنية","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["提高搜索结果可见性","增强用户体验","支持多种数据类型","易于实现和维护","提高网站流量","改善搜索引擎排名"],"ja":["検索結果の可視性を高める","ユーザーエクスペリエンスを向上させる","多様なデータタイプをサポート","実装とメンテナンスが容易","サイトのトラフィックを増やす","検索エンジンのランキングを向上させる"],"ko":["검색 결과 可視性를 높인다","사용자 경험을 향상한다","다양한 데이터 형식을 지원한다","구현과 유지 보수가 쉽다","사이트의 트래픽을 증가한다","검색 엔진의 랭킹을 향상한다"],"es":["Mejora la comprensión de los motores de búsqueda","Habilita resultados enriquecidos en los motores de búsqueda","Ayuda a aumentar la visibilidad y el tráfico del sitio web","Permite la creación de contenido estructurado","Es compatible con múltiples tipos de contenido"],"fr":["Améliore la compréhension des moteurs de recherche","Active les résultats enrichis dans les moteurs de recherche","Aide à augmenter la visibilité et le trafic du site web","Permet la création de contenu structuré","Est compatible avec plusieurs types de contenu"],"de":["Verbessert die Verständlichkeit von Suchmaschinen","Aktiviert erweiterte Ergebnisse in den Suchmaschinen","Hilft, die Sichtbarkeit und den Traffik der Website zu erhöhen","Ermöglicht die Erstellung von strukturiertem Inhalt","Ist kompatibel mit mehreren Inhaltstypen"],"pt":["Melhora a visibilidade dos resultados de busca","Ajuda os motores de busca a entender o conteúdo","Exibe resultados ricos","Aprimora a experiência do usuário","É compatível com vários formatos de dados","Pode ser implementado em diferentes tipos de páginas"],"ru":["Улучшает видимость результатов поиска","Помогает поисковым системам понимать контент","Отображает богатые результаты","Повышает качество пользовательского опыта","Поддерживает несколько форматов данных","Может быть реализован на разных типах страниц"],"ar":["تحسن وضوح نتائج البحث","تساعد محركات البحث على فهم المحتوى","عرض نتائج غنية","تحسين تجربة المستخدم","متوافقة مع عدة صيغ من البيانات","يمكن تنفيذها على أنواع مختلفة من الصفحات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Schema 标记","结构化数据","搜索引擎优化","SEO","网页开发","搜索结果","可视性","用户体验","网站流量"],"ja":["スキーマ マークアップ","構造化データ","検索エンジン オプティマイゼーション","SEO","ウェブ開発","検索結果","可視性","ユーザーエクスペリエンス","サイトのトラフィック"],"ko":["스키마 마크업","구조화된 데이터","검색 엔진 최적화","SEO","웹 개발","검색 결과","可視性","사용자 경험","사이트의 트래픽"],"es":["marcado de esquema","schema.org","resultados enriquecidos","motores de búsqueda","contenido estructurado","visibilidad del sitio web","tráfico del sitio web","optimización de motores de búsqueda"],"fr":["balises de schéma","schema.org","résultats enrichis","moteurs de recherche","contenu structuré","visibilité du site web","trafic du site web","optimisation des moteurs de recherche"],"de":["schema-markup","schema.org","erweiterte ergebnisse","suchmaschinen","strukturierter inhalt","sichtbarkeit der website","traffik der website","suchmaschinenoptimierung"],"pt":["marcadores de esquema","schema markup","otimização para motores de busca","SEO","desenvolvimento web","experiência do usuário","resultados ricos","visibilidade dos resultados de busca"],"ru":["маркировка схемы","schema markup","оптимизация для поисковых систем","SEO","веб-разработка","качество пользовательского опыта","богатые результаты","видимость результатов поиска"],"ar":["وسوم المخطط","schema markup","تحسين محركات البحث","SEO","تطوير الويب","جودة تجربة المستخدم","نتائج غنية","وضوح نتائج البحث"]}},"owner":"mateocostab","repo":"roi-calculator","repoPath":"mateocostab/roi-calculator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.423Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"schema-markup","description":"When the user wants to add, fix, or optimize schema markup and structured data on their site. Also use when the user mentions schema markup, structured data, JSON-LD, rich snippets, schema.org, FAQ schema, product schema, review schema, or breadcrumb schema. For broader SEO issues, see seo-audit.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Schema Markup\n\nYou are an expert in structured data and schema markup. Your goal is to implement schema.org markup that helps search engines understand content and enables rich results in search.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore implementing schema, understand:\n\n1. **Page Type","body":"# Schema Markup\n\nYou are an expert in structured data and schema markup. Your goal is to implement schema.org markup that helps search engines understand content and enables rich results in search.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore implementing schema, understand:\n\n1. **Page Type** - What kind of page? What''s the primary content? What rich results are possible?\n\n2. **Current State** - Any existing schema? Errors in implementation? Which rich results already appearing?\n\n3. **Goals** - Which rich results are you targeting? What''s the business value?\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. Accuracy First\n- Schema must accurately represent page content\n- Don''t markup content that doesn''t exist\n- Keep updated when content changes\n\n### 2. Use JSON-LD\n- Google recommends JSON-LD format\n- Easier to implement and maintain\n- Place in `<head>` or end of `<body>`\n\n### 3. Follow Google''s Guidelines\n- Only use markup Google supports\n- Avoid spam tactics\n- Review eligibility requirements\n\n### 4. Validate Everything\n- Test before deploying\n- Monitor Search Console\n- Fix errors promptly\n\n---\n\n## Common Schema Types\n\n| Type | Use For | Required Properties |\n|------|---------|-------------------|\n| Organization | Company homepage/about | name, url |\n| WebSite | Homepage (search box) | name, url |\n| Article | Blog posts, news | headline, image, datePublished, author |\n| Product | Product pages | name, image, offers |\n| SoftwareApplication | SaaS/app pages | name, offers |\n| FAQPage | FAQ content | mainEntity (Q&A array) |\n| HowTo | Tutorials | name, step |\n| BreadcrumbList | Any page with breadcrumbs | itemListElement |\n| LocalBusiness | Local business pages | name, address |\n| Event | Events, webinars | name, startDate, location |\n\n**For complete JSON-LD examples**: See [references/schema-examples.md](references/schema-examples.md)\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Organization (Company Page)\nRequired: name, url\nRecommended: logo, sameAs (social profiles), contactPoint\n\n### Article/BlogPosting\nRequired: headline, image, datePublished, author\nRecommended: dateModified, publisher, description\n\n### Product\nRequired: name, image, offers (price + availability)\nRecommended: sku, brand, aggregateRating, review\n\n### FAQPage\nRequired: mainEntity (array of Question/Answer pairs)\n\n### BreadcrumbList\nRequired: itemListElement (array with position, name, item)\n\n---\n\n## Multiple Schema Types\n\nYou can combine multiple schema types on one page using `@graph`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@graph\": [\n    { \"@type\": \"Organization\", ... },\n    { \"@type\": \"WebSite\", ... },\n    { \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", ... }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Validation and Testing\n\n### Tools\n- **Google Rich Results Test**: https://search.google.com/test/rich-results\n- **Schema.org Validator**: https://validator.schema.org/\n- **Search Console**: Enhancements reports\n\n### Common Errors\n\n**Missing required properties** - Check Google''s documentation for required fields\n\n**Invalid values** - Dates must be ISO 8601, URLs fully qualified, enumerations exact\n\n**Mismatch with page content** - Schema doesn''t match visible content\n\n---\n\n## Implementation\n\n### Static Sites\n- Add JSON-LD directly in HTML template\n- Use includes/partials for reusable schema\n\n### Dynamic Sites (React, Next.js)\n- Component that renders schema\n- Server-side rendered for SEO\n- Serialize data to JSON-LD\n\n### CMS / WordPress\n- Plugins (Yoast, Rank Math, Schema Pro)\n- Theme modifications\n- Custom fields to structured data\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Schema Implementation\n```json\n// Full JSON-LD code block\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"...\",\n  // Complete markup\n}\n```\n\n### Testing Checklist\n- [ ] Validates in Rich Results Test\n- [ ] No errors or warnings\n- [ ] Matches page content\n- [ ] All required properties included\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What type of page is this?\n2. What rich results are you hoping to achieve?\n3. What data is available to populate the schema?\n4. Is there existing schema on the page?\n5. What''s your tech stack?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **seo-audit**: For overall SEO including schema review\n- **programmatic-seo**: For templated schema at scale\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:37:43.623Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for SEO Optimization Agents needing advanced schema markup implementation.","zh":"非常适合需要高级schema标记实现的SEO优化代理","ja":"高度なスキーマ・マークアップの実装が必要なSEO最適化エージェントに最適","ko":"고급 스키마 마크업 구현이 필요한 SEO 최적화 에이전트에게 완벽함","es":"Perfecto para agentes de optimización de SEO que necesitan una implementación avanzada de marcado de esquema.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''optimisation de SEO ayant besoin d''une mise en œuvre avancée de balisage de schéma.","de":"Perfekt für SEO-Optimierungsagenten, die eine erweiterte Schema-Markup-Implementierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Otimização de SEO que precisam de implementação avançada de marcação de esquema.","ru":"Идеально для агентов по оптимизации SEO, которым требуется продвинутая реализация маркировки схемы.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحسين محركات البحث التي تحتاج إلى تنفيذ متقدم لترميز مخطط"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate structured data using schema.org markup, enabling rich results in search and enhancing content understanding for search engines, leveraging protocols like JSON-LD and Microdata.","zh":"使代理能够使用schema.org标记生成结构化数据，从而实现搜索结果的丰富化和提高搜索引擎对内容的理解，同时利用JSON-LD和Microdata等协议","ja":"エージェントがschema.orgマークアップを使用して構造化データを生成できるようにし、検索結果の豊富化と検索エンジンのコンテンツ理解の向上を実現し、JSON-LDやMicrodataなどのプロトコルを活用","ko":"에이전트가 schema.org 마크업을 사용하여 구조화된 데이터를 생성할 수 있도록 하여 검색 결과의 풍부화와 검색 엔진의 콘텐츠 이해를 향상시키고, JSON-LD 및 Microdata 등의 프로토콜을 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar datos estructurados utilizando el marcado de schema.org, lo que permite resultados enriquecidos en la búsqueda y mejora la comprensión del contenido para los motores de búsqueda, aprovechando protocolos como JSON-LD y Microdata.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des données structurées en utilisant le balisage de schema.org, ce qui permet des résultats enrichis dans la recherche et améliore la compréhension du contenu pour les moteurs de recherche, en exploitant des protocoles comme JSON-LD et Microdata.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, strukturierte Daten mit dem schema.org-Markup zu generieren, wodurch reichhaltige Ergebnisse in der Suche ermöglicht und das Verständnis des Inhalts für Suchmaschinen verbessert werden, indem Protokolle wie JSON-LD und Microdata genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar dados estruturados usando marcação schema.org, permitindo resultados ricos em pesquisas e aprimorando a compreensão do conteúdo para os mecanismos de busca, utilizando protocolos como JSON-LD e Microdata.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать структурированные данные с использованием маркировки schema.org, что позволяет получать богатые результаты в поиске и улучшать понимание контента для поисковых систем, используя протоколы như JSON-LD и Microdata.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على توليد بيانات منظمة باستخدام تعليمات schema.org، مما يسمح بالحصول على نتائج غنية في البحث وتحسين فهم المحتوى لمحركات البحث، باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل JSON-LD و Microdata."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing product markup for e-commerce sites","Generating schema for article and blog post content","Enabling rich results for event and review pages"],"zh":["电子商务网站的产品标记实现","文章和博客帖子内容的schema生成","活动和评论页面的丰富结果启用"],"ja":["電子商取引サイトの製品マークアップの実装","記事やブログ投稿のコンテンツのスキーマ生成","イベントやレビュー ページの豊富な結果の有効化"],"ko":["전자상거래 사이트의 제품 마크업 구현","기사 및 블로그 게시물 콘텐츠의 스키마 생성","이벤트 및 리뷰 페이지의 풍부한 결과 활성화"],"es":["Implementar el marcado de producto para sitios de comercio electrónico","Generar esquema para contenido de artículos y publicaciones de blog","Habilitar resultados enriquecidos para páginas de eventos y reseñas"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre le balisage de produit pour les sites de commerce électronique","Générer un schéma pour le contenu d''articles et de billets de blog","Activer les résultats enrichis pour les pages d''événements et d''avis"],"de":["Implementierung von Produktmarkierungen für E-Commerce-Websites","Generierung von Schemas für Artikel- und Blogpost-Inhalte","Aktivierung von Rich-Results für Event- und Review-Seiten"],"pt":["Implementar marcação de produto para sites de comércio eletrônico","Gerar esquema para conteúdo de artigos e posts de blog","Habilitar resultados ricos para páginas de eventos e revisões"],"ru":["Реализация маркировки продукта для сайтов электронной коммерции","Генерация схемы для содержания статей и блог-постов","Включение богатых результатов для страниц событий и обзоров"],"ar":["تنفيذ تعليمات المنتج للمواقع التجارية الإلكترونية","توليد مخطط للمحتوى المكون من مقالات ومنشورات المدونة","تمكين النتائج الغنية للصفحات الخاصة بالأحداث والاستعراضات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of page type and content context","Dependent on schema.org vocabulary and guidelines"],"zh":["需要了解页面类型和内容上下文","依赖于schema.org词汇和指南"],"ja":["ページの種類とコンテンツのコンテキストを理解する必要がある","schema.orgの語彙とガイドラインに依存する"],"ko":["페이지 유형 및 콘텐츠.context를 이해해야 함","schema.org 어휘 및 지침에 의존"],"es":["Requiere comprensión del tipo de página y del contexto del contenido","Dependiente del vocabulario y las directrices de schema.org"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension du type de page et du contexte du contenu","Dépendant du vocabulaire et des directives de schema.org"],"de":["Erfordert Verständnis für die Seitentypen und den Kontext des Inhalts","Abhängig vom Vokabular und den Richtlinien von schema.org"],"pt":["Exige compreensão do tipo de página e contexto de conteúdo","Depende do vocabulário e diretrizes do schema.org"],"ru":["Требует понимания типа страницы и контекста содержания","Зависит от словаря и руководств schema.org"],"ar":["يتطلب فهمًا لنوع الصفحة وسياق المحتوى","يعتمد على مفردات و إرشادات schema.org"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('yashvinthan/DuskSpendr/mobile-design', 'community', 'yashvinthan', 'DuskSpendr', 'yashvinthan/DuskSpendr', 'mobile-design', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.423Z', '2026-02-18T04:37:56.450Z', NULL, '{"id":"yashvinthan/DuskSpendr/mobile-design","name":"mobile-design","description":{"zh":"移动设计系统是一套-touch-first、电池意识、平台尊重、离线能力的设计哲学。其核心原则是移动不是小型桌面","ja":"モバイルデザインシステムはタッチファースト、電池意識、プラットフォーム尊重、オフライン能力の設計哲学である。コアプリンシプルはモバイルは小型デスクトップではない","ko":"모바일 디자인 시스템은 터치 우선, 배터리意识, 플랫폼 존중, 오프라인 능력의 디자인 철학입니다. 핵심 원칙은 모바일이 작은 데스크톱이 아님을 강조","es":"El diseño móvil se centra en la experiencia del usuario en dispositivos móviles, considerando factores como la pantalla táctil y la eficiencia energética.","fr":"La conception mobile se concentre sur l''expérience utilisateur sur les appareils mobiles, en tenant compte de facteurs tels que l''écran tactile et l''efficacité énergétique.","de":"Das mobile Design konzentriert sich auf die Benutzererfahrung auf mobilen Geräten, wobei Faktoren wie Touchscreen und Energieeffizienz berücksichtigt werden.","pt":"O design móvel é uma abordagem touch-first, battery-conscious e platform-respectful para criar experiências de usuário móvel","ru":"Мобильный дизайн - это подход, ориентированный на сенсорные экраны, экономящий батарею и уважающий платформу, для создания мобильных пользовательских trải nghiệm","ar":"تصميم الجوال هو نهج يركز على الشاشات اللمسية ويتوافق مع منصة المحمول لإنشاء تجارب مستخدم فعالة","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"移动设计系统开发","ja":"モバイルデザインシステム開発","ko":"모바일 디자인 시스템 개발","es":"Diseño Móvil: Principios y Herramientas","fr":"Conception Mobile: Principes et Outils","de":"Mobile Design: Prinzipien und Tools","pt":"Desenvolvimento de Design Móvel","ru":"Мобильный дизайн система","ar":"تصميم الجوال","en":"mobile-design"},"description":{"zh":"移动设计系统是一套-touch-first、电池意识、平台尊重、离线能力的设计哲学。其核心原则是移动不是小型桌面","ja":"モバイルデザインシステムはタッチファースト、電池意識、プラットフォーム尊重、オフライン能力の設計哲学である。コアプリンシプルはモバイルは小型デスクトップではない","ko":"모바일 디자인 시스템은 터치 우선, 배터리意识, 플랫폼 존중, 오프라인 능력의 디자인 철학입니다. 핵심 원칙은 모바일이 작은 데스크톱이 아님을 강조","es":"El diseño móvil se centra en la experiencia del usuario en dispositivos móviles, considerando factores como la pantalla táctil y la eficiencia energética.","fr":"La conception mobile se concentre sur l''expérience utilisateur sur les appareils mobiles, en tenant compte de facteurs tels que l''écran tactile et l''efficaci...","de":"Das mobile Design konzentriert sich auf die Benutzererfahrung auf mobilen Geräten, wobei Faktoren wie Touchscreen und Energieeffizienz berücksichtigt werden.","pt":"O design móvel é uma abordagem touch-first, battery-conscious e platform-respectful para criar experiências de usuário móvel","ru":"Мобильный дизайн - это подход, ориентированный на сенсорные экраны, экономящий батарею и уважающий платформу, для создания мобильных пользовательских trải ng...","ar":"تصميم الجوال هو نهج يركز على الشاشات اللمسية ويتوافق مع منصة المحمول لإنشاء تجارب مستخدم فعالة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Touch-first 设计哲学","电池意识和性能优化","平台尊重和兼容性","离线能力和缓存机制","移动设备特有功能支持"],"ja":["タッチファースト設計哲学","電池意識とパフォーマンス最適化","プラットフォーム尊重と互換性","オフライン能力とキャッシュメカニズム","モバイルデバイス特有機能サポート"],"ko":["터치 우선 디자인 철학","배터리意识와 성능 최적화","플랫폼 존중과 호환성","오프라인 능력과 캐시 메커니즘","모바일 장치 특有 기능 지원"],"es":["Enfoque en la experiencia del usuario","Diseño táctil","Eficiencia energética","Compatibilidad con plataformas","Capacidad de funcionamiento sin conexión"],"fr":["Focus sur l''expérience utilisateur","Conception tactile","Efficacité énergétique","Compatibilité des plateformes","Capacité de fonctionnement hors ligne"],"de":["Fokus auf die Benutzererfahrung","Touchscreen-Design","Energieeffizienz","Plattformkompatibilität","Offline-Fähigkeit"],"pt":["Abordagem touch-first","Economia de bateria","Respeito à plataforma","Capacidade offline","Validação de UX e touch"],"ru":["Ориентированный на сенсорные экраны подход","Экономия батареи","Уважение к платформе","Возможность работы офлайн","Валидация UX и сенсорных экранов"],"ar":["نهج يركز على الشاشات اللمسية","توافق منصة المحمول","القدرة على العمل بدون اتصال","تحقق من تجربة المستخدم واللمس","تشغيل البرامج النصية للتحقق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["移动设计系统","touch-first 设计","移动设备优化","电池意识设计","平台尊重设计","离线能力设计"],"ja":["モバイルデザインシステム","タッチファースト設計","モバイルデバイス最適化","電池意識設計","プラットフォーム尊重設計","オフライン能力設計"],"ko":["모바일 디자인 시스템","터치 우선 디자인","모바일 장치 최적화","배터리意识 디자인","플랫폼 존중 디자인","오프라인 능력 디자인"],"es":["diseño móvil","experiencia del usuario","desarrollo móvil","interfaces de usuario","eficiencia energética","plataformas móviles"],"fr":["conception mobile","expérience utilisateur","développement mobile","interfaces utilisateur","efficacité énergétique","plateformes mobiles"],"de":["mobiles Design","Benutzererfahrung","mobile Entwicklung","Benutzeroberflächen","Energieeffizienz","mobile Plattformen"],"pt":["design móvel","desenvolvimento de aplicativos móveis","experiência de usuário móvel","interface de usuário móvel","otimização de bateria","desenvolvimento de plataforma móvel"],"ru":["мобильный дизайн","разработка мобильных приложений","мобильный пользовательский опыт","мобильный пользовательский интерфейс","экономия батареи","разработка мобильной платформы"],"ar":["تصميم الجوال","تطوير تطبيقات الجوال","تجربة المستخدم للجوال","واجهة المستخدم للجوال","توافق منصة المحمول","تشغيل البرامج النصية للتحقق"]}},"owner":"yashvinthan","repo":"DuskSpendr","repoPath":"yashvinthan/DuskSpendr","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.423Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"mobile-design","description":"Mobile-first design thinking and decision-making for iOS and Android apps. Touch interaction, performance patterns, platform conventions. Teaches principles, not fixed values. Use when building React Native, Flutter, or native mobile apps.","bodyPreview":"# Mobile Design System\n\n> **Philosophy:** Touch-first. Battery-conscious. Platform-respectful. Offline-capable.\n> **Core Principle:** Mobile is NOT a small desktop. THINK mobile constraints, ASK platform choice.\n\n---\n\n## 🔧 Runtime Scripts\n\n**Execute these for validation (don''t read, just run):**\n\n| Script | Purpose | Usage |\n|--------|---------|-------|\n| `scripts/mobile_audit.py` | Mobile UX & Touch Audit | `python scripts/mobile_audit.py <project_path>` |\n\n---\n\n## 🔴 MANDATORY: Read Reference","body":"# Mobile Design System\n\n> **Philosophy:** Touch-first. Battery-conscious. Platform-respectful. Offline-capable.\n> **Core Principle:** Mobile is NOT a small desktop. THINK mobile constraints, ASK platform choice.\n\n---\n\n## 🔧 Runtime Scripts\n\n**Execute these for validation (don''t read, just run):**\n\n| Script | Purpose | Usage |\n|--------|---------|-------|\n| `scripts/mobile_audit.py` | Mobile UX & Touch Audit | `python scripts/mobile_audit.py <project_path>` |\n\n---\n\n## 🔴 MANDATORY: Read Reference Files Before Working!\n\n**⛔ DO NOT start development until you read the relevant files:**\n\n### Universal (Always Read)\n\n| File | Content | Status |\n|------|---------|--------|\n| **[mobile-design-thinking.md](mobile-design-thinking.md)** | **⚠️ ANTI-MEMORIZATION: Forces thinking, prevents AI defaults** | **⬜ CRITICAL FIRST** |\n| **[touch-psychology.md](touch-psychology.md)** | **Fitts'' Law, gestures, haptics, thumb zone** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| **[mobile-performance.md](mobile-performance.md)** | **RN/Flutter performance, 60fps, memory** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| **[mobile-backend.md](mobile-backend.md)** | **Push notifications, offline sync, mobile API** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| **[mobile-testing.md](mobile-testing.md)** | **Testing pyramid, E2E, platform-specific** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| **[mobile-debugging.md](mobile-debugging.md)** | **Native vs JS debugging, Flipper, Logcat** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| [mobile-navigation.md](mobile-navigation.md) | Tab/Stack/Drawer, deep linking | ⬜ Read |\n| [mobile-typography.md](mobile-typography.md) | System fonts, Dynamic Type, a11y | ⬜ Read |\n| [mobile-color-system.md](mobile-color-system.md) | OLED, dark mode, battery-aware | ⬜ Read |\n| [decision-trees.md](decision-trees.md) | Framework/state/storage selection | ⬜ Read |\n\n> 🧠 **mobile-design-thinking.md is PRIORITY!** This file ensures AI thinks instead of using memorized patterns.\n\n### Platform-Specific (Read Based on Target)\n\n| Platform | File | Content | When to Read |\n|----------|------|---------|--------------|\n| **iOS** | [platform-ios.md](platform-ios.md) | Human Interface Guidelines, SF Pro, SwiftUI patterns | Building for iPhone/iPad |\n| **Android** | [platform-android.md](platform-android.md) | Material Design 3, Roboto, Compose patterns | Building for Android |\n| **Cross-Platform** | Both above | Platform divergence points | React Native / Flutter |\n\n> 🔴 **If building for iOS → Read platform-ios.md FIRST!**\n> 🔴 **If building for Android → Read platform-android.md FIRST!**\n> 🔴 **If cross-platform → Read BOTH and apply conditional platform logic!**\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ CRITICAL: ASK BEFORE ASSUMING (MANDATORY)\n\n> **STOP! If the user''s request is open-ended, DO NOT default to your favorites.**\n\n### You MUST Ask If Not Specified:\n\n| Aspect | Ask | Why |\n|--------|-----|-----|\n| **Platform** | \"iOS, Android, or both?\" | Affects EVERY design decision |\n| **Framework** | \"React Native, Flutter, or native?\" | Determines patterns and tools |\n| **Navigation** | \"Tab bar, drawer, or stack-based?\" | Core UX decision |\n| **State** | \"What state management? (Zustand/Redux/Riverpod/BLoC?)\" | Architecture foundation |\n| **Offline** | \"Does this need to work offline?\" | Affects data strategy |\n| **Target devices** | \"Phone only, or tablet support?\" | Layout complexity |\n\n### ⛔ AI MOBILE ANTI-PATTERNS (YASAK LİSTESİ)\n\n> 🚫 **These are AI default tendencies that MUST be avoided!**\n\n#### Performance Sins\n\n| ❌ NEVER DO | Why It''s Wrong | ✅ ALWAYS DO |\n|-------------|----------------|--------------|\n| **ScrollView for long lists** | Renders ALL items, memory explodes | Use `FlatList` / `FlashList` / `ListView.builder` |\n| **Inline renderItem function** | New function every render, all items re-render | `useCallback` + `React.memo` |\n| **Missing keyExtractor** | Index-based keys cause bugs on reorder | Unique, stable ID from data |\n| **Skip getItemLayout** | Async layout = janky scroll | Provide when items have fixed height |\n| **setState() everywhere** | Unnecessary widget rebuilds | Targeted state, `const` constructors |\n| **Native driver: false** | Animations blocked by JS thread | `useNativeDriver: true` always |\n| **console.log in production** | Blocks JS thread severely | Remove before release build |\n| **Skip React.memo/const** | Every item re-renders on any change | Memoize list items ALWAYS |\n\n#### Touch/UX Sins\n\n| ❌ NEVER DO | Why It''s Wrong | ✅ ALWAYS DO |\n|-------------|----------------|--------------|\n| **Touch target < 44px** | Impossible to tap accurately, frustrating | Minimum 44pt (iOS) / 48dp (Android) |\n| **Spacing < 8px between targets** | Accidental taps on neighbors | Minimum 8-12px gap |\n| **Gesture-only interactions** | Motor impaired users excluded | Always provide button alternative |\n| **No loading state** | User thinks app crashed | ALWAYS show loading feedback |\n| **No error state** | User stuck, no recovery path | Show error with retry option |\n| **No offline handling** | Crash/block when network lost | Graceful degradation, cached data |\n| **Ignore platform conventions** | Users confused, muscle memory broken | iOS feels iOS, Android feels Android |\n\n#### Security Sins\n\n| ❌ NEVER DO | Why It''s Wrong | ✅ ALWAYS DO |\n|-------------|----------------|--------------|\n| **Token in AsyncStorage** | Easily accessible, stolen on rooted device | `SecureStore` / `Keychain` / `EncryptedSharedPreferences` |\n| **Hardcode API keys** | Reverse engineered from APK/IPA | Environment variables, secure storage |\n| **Skip SSL pinning** | MITM attacks possible | Pin certificates in production |\n| **Log sensitive data** | Logs can be extracted | Never log tokens, passwords, PII |\n\n#### Architecture Sins\n\n| ❌ NEVER DO | Why It''s Wrong | ✅ ALWAYS DO |\n|-------------|----------------|--------------|\n| **Business logic in UI** | Untestable, unmaintainable | Service layer separation |\n| **Global state for everything** | Unnecessary re-renders, complexity | Local state default, lift when needed |\n| **Deep linking as afterthought** | Notifications, shares broken | Plan deep links from day one |\n| **Skip dispose/cleanup** | Memory leaks, zombie listeners | Clean up subscriptions, timers |\n\n---\n\n## 📱 Platform Decision Matrix\n\n### When to Unify vs Diverge\n\n```\n                    UNIFY (same on both)          DIVERGE (platform-specific)\n                    ───────────────────           ──────────────────────────\nBusiness Logic      ✅ Always                     -\nData Layer          ✅ Always                     -\nCore Features       ✅ Always                     -\n                    \nNavigation          -                             ✅ iOS: edge swipe, Android: back button\nGestures            -                             ✅ Platform-native feel\nIcons               -                             ✅ SF Symbols vs Material Icons\nDate Pickers        -                             ✅ Native pickers feel right\nModals/Sheets       -                             ✅ iOS: bottom sheet vs Android: dialog\nTypography          -                             ✅ SF Pro vs Roboto (or custom)\nError Dialogs       -                             ✅ Platform conventions for alerts\n```\n\n### Quick Reference: Platform Defaults\n\n| Element | iOS | Android |\n|---------|-----|---------|\n| **Primary Font** | SF Pro / SF Compact | Roboto |\n| **Min Touch Target** | 44pt × 44pt | 48dp × 48dp |\n| **Back Navigation** | Edge swipe left | System back button/gesture |\n| **Bottom Tab Icons** | SF Symbols | Material Symbols |\n| **Action Sheet** | UIActionSheet from bottom | Bottom Sheet / Dialog |\n| **Progress** | Spinner | Linear progress (Material) |\n| **Pull to Refresh** | Native UIRefreshControl | SwipeRefreshLayout |\n\n---\n\n## 🧠 Mobile UX Psychology (Quick Reference)\n\n### Fitts'' Law for Touch\n\n```\nDesktop: Cursor is precise (1px)\nMobile:  Finger is imprecise (~7mm contact area)\n\n→ Touch targets MUST be 44-48px minimum\n→ Important actions in THUMB ZONE (bottom of screen)\n→ Destructive actions AWAY from easy reach\n```\n\n### Thumb Zone (One-Handed Usage)\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────┐\n│      HARD TO REACH          │ ← Navigation, menu, back\n│        (stretch)            │\n├─────────────────────────────┤\n│      OK TO REACH            │ ← Secondary actions\n│       (natural)             │\n├─────────────────────────────┤\n│      EASY TO REACH          │ ← PRIMARY CTAs, tab bar\n│    (thumb''s natural arc)    │ ← Main content interaction\n└─────────────────────────────┘\n        [  HOME  ]\n```\n\n### Mobile-Specific Cognitive Load\n\n| Desktop | Mobile Difference |\n|---------|-------------------|\n| Multiple windows | ONE task at a time |\n| Keyboard shortcuts | Touch gestures |\n| Hover states | NO hover (tap or nothing) |\n| Large viewport | Limited space, scroll vertical |\n| Stable attention | Interrupted constantly |\n\nFor deep dive: [touch-psychology.md](touch-psychology.md)\n\n---\n\n## ⚡ Performance Principles (Quick Reference)\n\n### React Native Critical Rules\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ CORRECT: Memoized renderItem + React.memo wrapper\nconst ListItem = React.memo(({ item }: { item: Item }) => (\n  <View style={styles.item}>\n    <Text>{item.title}</Text>\n  </View>\n));\n\nconst renderItem = useCallback(\n  ({ item }: { item: Item }) => <ListItem item={item} />,\n  []\n);\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: FlatList with all optimizations\n<FlatList\n  data={items}\n  renderItem={renderItem}\n  keyExtractor={(item) => item.id}  // Stable ID, NOT index\n  getItemLayout={(data, index) => ({\n    length: ITEM_HEIGHT,\n    offset: ITEM_HEIGHT * index,\n    index,\n  })}\n  removeClippedSubviews={true}\n  maxToRenderPerBatch={10}\n  windowSize={5}\n/>\n```\n\n### Flutter Critical Rules\n\n```dart\n// ✅ CORRECT: const constructors prevent rebuilds\nclass MyWidget extends StatelessWidget {\n  const MyWidget({super.key}); // CONST!\n\n  @override\n  Widget build(BuildContext context) {\n    return const Column( // CONST!\n      children: [\n        Text(''Static content''),\n        MyConstantWidget(),\n      ],\n    );\n  }\n}\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: Targeted state with ValueListenableBuilder\nValueListenableBuilder<int>(\n  valueListenable: counter,\n  builder: (context, value, child) => Text(''$value''),\n  child: const ExpensiveWidget(), // Won''t rebuild!\n)\n```\n\n### Animation Performance\n\n```\nGPU-accelerated (FAST):     CPU-bound (SLOW):\n├── transform               ├── width, height\n├── opacity                 ├── top, left, right, bottom\n└── (use these ONLY)        ├── margin, padding\n                            └── (AVOID animating these)\n```\n\nFor complete guide: [mobile-performance.md](mobile-performance.md)\n\n---\n\n## 📝 CHECKPOINT (MANDATORY Before Any Mobile Work)\n\n> **Before writing ANY mobile code, you MUST complete this checkpoint:**\n\n```\n🧠 CHECKPOINT:\n\nPlatform:   [ iOS / Android / Both ]\nFramework:  [ React Native / Flutter / SwiftUI / Kotlin ]\nFiles Read: [ List the skill files you''ve read ]\n\n3 Principles I Will Apply:\n1. _______________\n2. _______________\n3. _______________\n\nAnti-Patterns I Will Avoid:\n1. _______________\n2. _______________\n```\n\n**Example:**\n```\n🧠 CHECKPOINT:\n\nPlatform:   iOS + Android (Cross-platform)\nFramework:  React Native + Expo\nFiles Read: touch-psychology.md, mobile-performance.md, platform-ios.md, platform-android.md\n\n3 Principles I Will Apply:\n1. FlatList with React.memo + useCallback for all lists\n2. 48px touch targets, thumb zone for primary CTAs\n3. Platform-specific navigation (edge swipe iOS, back button Android)\n\nAnti-Patterns I Will Avoid:\n1. ScrollView for lists → FlatList\n2. Inline renderItem → Memoized\n3. AsyncStorage for tokens → SecureStore\n```\n\n> 🔴 **Can''t fill the checkpoint? → GO BACK AND READ THE SKILL FILES.**\n\n---\n\n## 🔧 Framework Decision Tree\n\n```\nWHAT ARE YOU BUILDING?\n        │\n        ├── Need OTA updates + rapid iteration + web team\n        │   └── ✅ React Native + Expo\n        │\n        ├── Need pixel-perfect custom UI + performance critical\n        │   └── ✅ Flutter\n        │\n        ├── Deep native features + single platform focus\n        │   ├── iOS only → SwiftUI\n        │   └── Android only → Kotlin + Jetpack Compose\n        │\n        ├── Existing RN codebase + new features\n        │   └── ✅ React Native (bare workflow)\n        │\n        └── Enterprise + existing Flutter codebase\n            └── ✅ Flutter\n```\n\nFor complete decision trees: [decision-trees.md](decision-trees.md)\n\n---\n\n## 📋 Pre-Development Checklist\n\n### Before Starting ANY Mobile Project\n\n- [ ] **Platform confirmed?** (iOS / Android / Both)\n- [ ] **Framework chosen?** (RN / Flutter / Native)\n- [ ] **Navigation pattern decided?** (Tabs / Stack / Drawer)\n- [ ] **State management selected?** (Zustand / Redux / Riverpod / BLoC)\n- [ ] **Offline requirements known?**\n- [ ] **Deep linking planned from day one?**\n- [ ] **Target devices defined?** (Phone / Tablet / Both)\n\n### Before Every Screen\n\n- [ ] **Touch targets ≥ 44-48px?**\n- [ ] **Primary CTA in thumb zone?**\n- [ ] **Loading state exists?**\n- [ ] **Error state with retry exists?**\n- [ ] **Offline handling considered?**\n- [ ] **Platform conventions followed?**\n\n### Before Release\n\n- [ ] **console.log removed?**\n- [ ] **SecureStore for sensitive data?**\n- [ ] **SSL pinning enabled?**\n- [ ] **Lists optimized (memo, keyExtractor)?**\n- [ ] **Memory cleanup on unmount?**\n- [ ] **Tested on low-end devices?**\n- [ ] **Accessibility labels on all interactive elements?**\n\n---\n\n## 📚 Reference Files\n\nFor deeper guidance on specific areas:\n\n| File | When to Use |\n|------|-------------|\n| [mobile-design-thinking.md](mobile-design-thinking.md) | **FIRST! Anti-memorization, forces context-based thinking** |\n| [touch-psychology.md](touch-psychology.md) | Understanding touch interaction, Fitts'' Law, gesture design |\n| [mobile-performance.md](mobile-performance.md) | Optimizing RN/Flutter, 60fps, memory/battery |\n| [platform-ios.md](platform-ios.md) | iOS-specific design, HIG compliance |\n| [platform-android.md](platform-android.md) | Android-specific design, Material Design 3 |\n| [mobile-navigation.md](mobile-navigation.md) | Navigation patterns, deep linking |\n| [mobile-typography.md](mobile-typography.md) | Type scale, system fonts, accessibility |\n| [mobile-color-system.md](mobile-color-system.md) | OLED optimization, dark mode, battery |\n| [decision-trees.md](decision-trees.md) | Framework, state, storage decisions |\n\n---\n\n> **Remember:** Mobile users are impatient, interrupted, and using imprecise fingers on small screens. Design for the WORST conditions: bad network, one hand, bright sun, low battery. If it works there, it works everywhere.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:37:56.450Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for UI/UX Agents needing touch-first, battery-conscious, and platform-respectful mobile design capabilities.","zh":"适合需要触摸优先、电池节能和平台尊重的移动设计能力的 UI/UX 代理。","ja":"タッチ優先、バッテリー意識、プラットフォーム尊重のモバイル設計能力を必要とする UI/UX エージェントに適しています。","ko":"터치 우선, 배터리意识, 플랫폼尊重의 모바일 디자인 能力を 필요로 하는 UI/UX 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de UI/UX que necesitan capacidades de diseño móvil de primera interacción, conscientes de la batería y respetuosas con la plataforma.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents UI/UX qui ont besoin de capacités de conception mobile de première interaction, conscientes de la batterie et respectueuses de la plateforme.","de":"Perfekt für UI/UX-Agents, die Touch-first-, batteriebewusste und plattformrespektierende Mobile-Design-Fähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de UI/UX que necessitam de capacidades de design móvel touch-first, conscientes da bateria e respeitosas com a plataforma.","ru":"Идеально для агентов UI/UX, которым необходимы возможности мобильного дизайна, ориентированные на сенсорные интерфейсы, экономичные по энергопотреблению и уважительные к платформе.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم / experiencia الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات تصميم الهاتف المحمول التي تلمس أولاً ، واعية للبطارية ، ومتوافقة مع المنصة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create mobile designs that respect platform choices and mobile constraints, utilizing Python scripts for mobile UX and touch audits, and ensuring offline capability.","zh":"赋予代理创建尊重平台选择和移动约束的移动设计能力，利用 Python 脚本进行移动 UX 和触摸审计，并确保离线能力。","ja":"エージェントがプラットフォームの選択とモバイルの制約を尊重したモバイル設計を作成することを可能にし、Python スクリプトを使用してモバイル UX とタッチの監査を行い、オフライン機能を確保します。","ko":"에이전트가 플랫폼 선택과 모바일 제약을尊重하는 모바일 디자인을 생성할 수 있도록 하며, Python 스크립트를 사용하여 모바일 UX와 터치 감사를 수행하고, 오프라인 기능을 보장합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear diseños móviles que respetan las opciones de plataforma y las limitaciones móviles, utilizando scripts de Python para la experiencia del usuario móvil y las auditorías de interacción táctil, y asegurando la capacidad sin conexión.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des conceptions mobiles qui respectent les choix de plateforme et les contraintes mobiles, en utilisant des scripts Python pour l''expérience utilisateur mobile et les audits d''interaction tactile, et en assurant la capacité hors ligne.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, mobile Designs zu erstellen, die Plattformoptionen und mobile Einschränkungen respektieren, indem Python-Skripte für mobile Benutzeroberflächen und Touch-Audits verwendet werden und die Offline-Fähigkeit gewährleisten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar designs móveis que respeitam as escolhas de plataforma e as restrições móveis, utilizando scripts Python para UX móvel e auditorias de toque, e garantindo a capacidade offline.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать мобильные дизайны, уважающие выбор платформы и мобильные ограничения, используя скрипты Python для мобильного UX и аудитов сенсорных взаимодействий, и обеспечивающие возможность работы в автономном режиме.","ar":"يمنح العميل khảية إنشاء تصاميم الهاتف المحمول التي تتقبل خيارات المنصة والقيود المتنقلة ، باستخدام البرامج النصية Python لتقديم تجربة المستخدم المتنقلة ومراجعة لمس ، وضمان القدرة على العمل بدون اتصال بالإنترنت."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating mobile UX and touch interactions using Python scripts","Auditing mobile designs for platform-respectful and battery-conscious principles","Generating mobile design systems with offline capabilities"],"zh":["使用 Python 脚本验证移动 UX 和触摸交互","审计移动设计以确保平台尊重和电池意识的原则","生成具有离线能力的移动设计系统"],"ja":["Python スクリプトを使用してモバイル UX とタッチの相互作用を検証する","プラットフォーム尊重とバッテリー意識の原則に基づいてモバイル設計を監査する","オフライン機能を備えたモバイル設計システムを生成する"],"ko":["Python 스크립트를 사용하여 모바일 UX와 터치 상호작용을 검증하는 것","플랫폼尊重과 배터리意识의 원칙에 따라 모바일 디자인을 감사하는 것","오프라인 기능을 갖춘 모바일 디자인 시스템을 생성하는 것"],"es":["Validar la experiencia del usuario móvil y las interacciones táctiles utilizando scripts de Python","Auditar diseños móviles para principios respetuosos con la plataforma y conscientes de la batería","Generar sistemas de diseño móvil con capacidades sin conexión"],"fr":["Valider l''expérience utilisateur mobile et les interactions tactiles à l''aide de scripts Python","Auditer les conceptions mobiles pour des principes respectueux de la plateforme et conscients de la batterie","Générer des systèmes de conception mobile avec des capacités hors ligne"],"de":["Überprüfen der mobilen Benutzeroberfläche und Touch-Interaktionen mithilfe von Python-Skripten","Audits von mobilen Designs für plattformrespektierende und batteriebewusste Prinzipien","Erstellen von mobilen Design-Systemen mit Offline-Fähigkeiten"],"pt":["Validar a experiência do usuário móvel e as interações de toque usando scripts Python","Auditar designs móveis para princípios respeitosos com a plataforma e conscientes da bateria","Gerar sistemas de design móvel com capacidades offline"],"ru":["Проверка мобильного UX и сенсорных взаимодействий с помощью скриптов Python","Аудит мобильных дизайнов на соблюдение платформо-независимых и энергосберегающих принципов","Генерация систем мобильного дизайна с возможностью работы в автономном режиме"],"ar":["التحقق من تجربة المستخدم المتنقلة وتفاعلات لمس باستخدام البرامج النصية Python","مراجعة تصاميم الهاتف المحمول لمبادئ متوافقة مع المنصة وواعية للبطارية","توليد أنظمة التصميم المتنقل مع القدرات دون اتصال بالإنترنت"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment for script execution","Limited to mobile design principles and audits, not a full-fledged design tool"],"zh":["需要 Python 环境来执行脚本","仅限移动设计原则和审计, 不是完整的设计工具"],"ja":["スクリプトの実行には Python 環境が必要","モバイル設計の原則と監査のみ、完全な設計ツールではありません"],"ko":["스크립트 실행을 위해 Python 환경이 필요","모바일 디자인 원칙과 감사에만 한정되어 있으며, 완전한 디자인 툴은 아님"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de Python para la ejecución de scripts","Limitado a principios y auditorías de diseño móvil, no es una herramienta de diseño completa"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python pour l''exécution de scripts","Limité aux principes et audits de conception mobile, et non une outil de conception complet"],"de":["Benötigt eine Python-Umgebung für die Skriptausführung","Begrenzt auf mobile Design-Prinzipien und -Audits, kein umfassendes Design-Tool"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Python para execução de scripts","Limitado a princípios e auditorias de design móvel, não é uma ferramenta de design completa"],"ru":["Требует среды Python для выполнения скриптов","Ограничен мобильными принципами дизайна и аудитами, не является полноценной инструментом для дизайна"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Python لتشغيل البرامج النصية","محدود بمبادئ ومراجعة تصميم الهاتف المحمول ، وليس أداة تصميم كاملة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('cyhinverse/YiBu/mobile-design', 'community', 'cyhinverse', 'YiBu', 'cyhinverse/YiBu', 'mobile-design', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.423Z', '2026-02-18T04:37:37.190Z', NULL, '{"id":"cyhinverse/YiBu/mobile-design","name":"mobile-design","description":{"zh":"移动设计系统是一种基于触摸、节能和平台尊重的设计哲学，旨在创建最佳的移动应用体验","ja":"モバイルデザインシステムは、タッチ、省エネルギー、プラットフォーム尊重に基づいた設計哲学であり、最適なモバイルアプリの体験を作成することを目的としています","ko":"모바일 디자인 시스템은 터치, 에너지 절약, 플랫폼尊重을 기반으로 하는 디자인 철학으로 최적의 모바일 앱 경험을 생성하는 것을 목표로 합니다","es":"El diseño móvil se centra en la experiencia del usuario en dispositivos móviles, considerando restricciones y capacidades de la plataforma.","fr":"La conception mobile se concentre sur l''expérience utilisateur sur les appareils mobiles, en tenant compte des contraintes et des capacités de la plateforme.","de":"Das mobile Design konzentriert sich auf die Benutzeroberfläche auf mobilen Geräten, wobei es die Einschränkungen und Fähigkeiten der Plattform berücksichtigt.","pt":"O sistema de design móvel é baseado em filosofia de toque, economia de bateria e respeito à plataforma, permitindo desenvolver aplicativos móveis eficazes.","ru":"Система мобильного дизайна основана на философии прикосновения, экономии батареи и уважении к платформе, что позволяет разработать эффективные мобильные приложения.","ar":"نظام التصميم الجوالي يقوم على فلسفة اللمس وتوفير البطارية والاحترام للمنصة، مما يسمح بتطوير تطبيقات جوالية فعالة.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"移动设计系统开发","ja":"モバイルデザインシステム開発","ko":"모바일 디자인 시스템 개발","es":"Diseño Móvil: Principios y Scripts de Validación","fr":"Conception Mobile: Principes et Scripts de Validation","de":"Mobile Design: Prinzipien und Validierungsskripte","pt":"Desenvolvimento Móvel: Sistema de Design para Desenvolved...","ru":"Мобильный Дизайн: Система Дизайна для Разработчиков","ar":"تصميم الجوال: نظام التصميم لتطوير التطبيقات","en":"mobile-design"},"description":{"zh":"移动设计系统是一种基于触摸、节能和平台尊重的设计哲学，旨在创建最佳的移动应用体验","ja":"モバイルデザインシステムは、タッチ、省エネルギー、プラットフォーム尊重に基づいた設計哲学であり、最適なモバイルアプリの体験を作成することを目的としています","ko":"모바일 디자인 시스템은 터치, 에너지 절약, 플랫폼尊重을 기반으로 하는 디자인 철학으로 최적의 모바일 앱 경험을 생성하는 것을 목표로 합니다","es":"El diseño móvil se centra en la experiencia del usuario en dispositivos móviles, considerando restricciones y capacidades de la plataforma.","fr":"La conception mobile se concentre sur l''expérience utilisateur sur les appareils mobiles, en tenant compte des contraintes et des capacités de la plateforme.","de":"Das mobile Design konzentriert sich auf die Benutzeroberfläche auf mobilen Geräten, wobei es die Einschränkungen und Fähigkeiten der Plattform berücksichtigt.","pt":"O sistema de design móvel é baseado em filosofia de toque, economia de bateria e respeito à plataforma, permitindo desenvolver aplicativos móveis eficazes.","ru":"Система мобильного дизайна основана на философии прикосновения, экономии батареи и уважении к платформе, что позволяет разработать эффективные мобильные прил...","ar":"نظام التصميم الجوالي يقوم على فلسفة اللمس وتوفير البطارية والاحترام للمنصة، مما يسمح بتطوير تطبيقات جوالية فعالة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["触摸优先的设计","基于移动设备的限制和特点","平台尊重的设计","离线功能支持","移动UX和触摸审计"],"ja":["タッチ優先の設計","モバイルデバイスの制約と特性に基づいた設計","プラットフォーム尊重の設計","オフライン機能サポート","モバイルUXとタッチ監査"],"ko":["터치 우선의 디자인","모바일 디바이스의 제약과 특성에 기반한 디자인","플랫폼尊重의 디자인","오프라인 기능 지원","모바일 UX와 터치 감사"],"es":["Enfoque de diseño centrado en la experiencia del usuario","Validación de la interfaz de usuario con scripts de Python","Consideración de las restricciones y capacidades de la plataforma","Diseño para dispositivos móviles con capacidades de pantalla táctil","Compatibilidad con dispositivos offline"],"fr":["Approche de design centrée sur l''expérience utilisateur","Validation de l''interface utilisateur avec des scripts Python","Prise en compte des contraintes et des capacités de la plateforme","Conception pour les appareils mobiles avec des capacités de écran tactile","Compatibilité avec les appareils hors ligne"],"de":["Benutzeroberflächen-Design mit Fokus auf die Benutzererfahrung","Validierung der Benutzeroberfläche mit Python-Skripten","Berücksichtigung der Einschränkungen und Fähigkeiten der Plattform","Design für mobile Geräte mit Touchscreen-Fähigkeiten","Kompatibilität mit offline-Geräten"],"pt":["Filosofia de toque","Economia de bateria","Respeito à plataforma","Desenvolvimento de aplicativos móveis eficazes","Validação com scripts de auditoria"],"ru":["Философия прикосновения","Экономия батареи","Уважение к платформе","Разработка эффективных мобильных приложений","Валидация с помощью скриптов аудита"],"ar":["فلسفة اللمس","توفير البطارية","الاحترام للمنصة","تطوير تطبيقات جوالية فعالة","التحقق مع سكريبتات التدقيق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["移动设计系统","触摸优先","移动设备限制","平台尊重","离线功能","移动UX","触摸审计"],"ja":["モバイルデザインシステム","タッチ優先","モバイルデバイス制約","プラットフォーム尊重","オフライン機能","モバイルUX","タッチ監査"],"ko":["모바일 디자인 시스템","터치 우선","모바일 디바이스 제약","플랫폼尊重","오프라인 기능","모바일 UX","터치 감사"],"es":["diseño móvil","experiencia del usuario","validación de interfaz de usuario","restricciones de plataforma","dispositivos móviles","python","scripts de validación"],"fr":["conception mobile","expérience utilisateur","validation de l''interface utilisateur","contraintes de plateforme","appareils mobiles","python","scripts de validation"],"de":["mobiles Design","Benutzeroberfläche","Validierung der Benutzeroberfläche","Plattformeinschränkungen","mobile Geräte","python","Validierungsskripte"],"pt":["design móvel","desenvolvimento de aplicativos móveis","sistema de design","filosofia de toque","economia de bateria","respeito à plataforma","validação de aplicativos"],"ru":["мобильный дизайн","разработка мобильных приложений","система дизайна","философия прикосновения","экономия батареи","уважение к платформе","валидация приложений"],"ar":["تصميم الجوال","تطوير تطبيقات الجوال","نظام التصميم","فلسفة اللمس","توفير البطارية","الاحترام للمنصة","التحقق من التطبيقات"]}},"owner":"cyhinverse","repo":"YiBu","repoPath":"cyhinverse/YiBu","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.423Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"mobile-design","description":"Mobile-first design thinking and decision-making for iOS and Android apps. Touch interaction, performance patterns, platform conventions. Teaches principles, not fixed values. Use when building React Native, Flutter, or native mobile apps.","bodyPreview":"# Mobile Design System\n\n> **Philosophy:** Touch-first. Battery-conscious. Platform-respectful. Offline-capable.\n> **Core Principle:** Mobile is NOT a small desktop. THINK mobile constraints, ASK platform choice.\n\n---\n\n## 🔧 Runtime Scripts\n\n**Execute these for validation (don''t read, just run):**\n\n| Script | Purpose | Usage |\n|--------|---------|-------|\n| `scripts/mobile_audit.py` | Mobile UX & Touch Audit | `python scripts/mobile_audit.py <project_path>` |\n\n---\n\n## 🔴 MANDATORY: Read Reference","body":"# Mobile Design System\n\n> **Philosophy:** Touch-first. Battery-conscious. Platform-respectful. Offline-capable.\n> **Core Principle:** Mobile is NOT a small desktop. THINK mobile constraints, ASK platform choice.\n\n---\n\n## 🔧 Runtime Scripts\n\n**Execute these for validation (don''t read, just run):**\n\n| Script | Purpose | Usage |\n|--------|---------|-------|\n| `scripts/mobile_audit.py` | Mobile UX & Touch Audit | `python scripts/mobile_audit.py <project_path>` |\n\n---\n\n## 🔴 MANDATORY: Read Reference Files Before Working!\n\n**⛔ DO NOT start development until you read the relevant files:**\n\n### Universal (Always Read)\n\n| File | Content | Status |\n|------|---------|--------|\n| **[mobile-design-thinking.md](mobile-design-thinking.md)** | **⚠️ ANTI-MEMORIZATION: Forces thinking, prevents AI defaults** | **⬜ CRITICAL FIRST** |\n| **[touch-psychology.md](touch-psychology.md)** | **Fitts'' Law, gestures, haptics, thumb zone** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| **[mobile-performance.md](mobile-performance.md)** | **RN/Flutter performance, 60fps, memory** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| **[mobile-backend.md](mobile-backend.md)** | **Push notifications, offline sync, mobile API** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| **[mobile-testing.md](mobile-testing.md)** | **Testing pyramid, E2E, platform-specific** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| **[mobile-debugging.md](mobile-debugging.md)** | **Native vs JS debugging, Flipper, Logcat** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| [mobile-navigation.md](mobile-navigation.md) | Tab/Stack/Drawer, deep linking | ⬜ Read |\n| [mobile-typography.md](mobile-typography.md) | System fonts, Dynamic Type, a11y | ⬜ Read |\n| [mobile-color-system.md](mobile-color-system.md) | OLED, dark mode, battery-aware | ⬜ Read |\n| [decision-trees.md](decision-trees.md) | Framework/state/storage selection | ⬜ Read |\n\n> 🧠 **mobile-design-thinking.md is PRIORITY!** This file ensures AI thinks instead of using memorized patterns.\n\n### Platform-Specific (Read Based on Target)\n\n| Platform | File | Content | When to Read |\n|----------|------|---------|--------------|\n| **iOS** | [platform-ios.md](platform-ios.md) | Human Interface Guidelines, SF Pro, SwiftUI patterns | Building for iPhone/iPad |\n| **Android** | [platform-android.md](platform-android.md) | Material Design 3, Roboto, Compose patterns | Building for Android |\n| **Cross-Platform** | Both above | Platform divergence points | React Native / Flutter |\n\n> 🔴 **If building for iOS → Read platform-ios.md FIRST!**\n> 🔴 **If building for Android → Read platform-android.md FIRST!**\n> 🔴 **If cross-platform → Read BOTH and apply conditional platform logic!**\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ CRITICAL: ASK BEFORE ASSUMING (MANDATORY)\n\n> **STOP! If the user''s request is open-ended, DO NOT default to your favorites.**\n\n### You MUST Ask If Not Specified:\n\n| Aspect | Ask | Why |\n|--------|-----|-----|\n| **Platform** | \"iOS, Android, or both?\" | Affects EVERY design decision |\n| **Framework** | \"React Native, Flutter, or native?\" | Determines patterns and tools |\n| **Navigation** | \"Tab bar, drawer, or stack-based?\" | Core UX decision |\n| **State** | \"What state management? (Zustand/Redux/Riverpod/BLoC?)\" | Architecture foundation |\n| **Offline** | \"Does this need to work offline?\" | Affects data strategy |\n| **Target devices** | \"Phone only, or tablet support?\" | Layout complexity |\n\n### ⛔ AI MOBILE ANTI-PATTERNS (YASAK LİSTESİ)\n\n> 🚫 **These are AI default tendencies that MUST be avoided!**\n\n#### Performance Sins\n\n| ❌ NEVER DO | Why It''s Wrong | ✅ ALWAYS DO |\n|-------------|----------------|--------------|\n| **ScrollView for long lists** | Renders ALL items, memory explodes | Use `FlatList` / `FlashList` / `ListView.builder` |\n| **Inline renderItem function** | New function every render, all items re-render | `useCallback` + `React.memo` |\n| **Missing keyExtractor** | Index-based keys cause bugs on reorder | Unique, stable ID from data |\n| **Skip getItemLayout** | Async layout = janky scroll | Provide when items have fixed height |\n| **setState() everywhere** | Unnecessary widget rebuilds | Targeted state, `const` constructors |\n| **Native driver: false** | Animations blocked by JS thread | `useNativeDriver: true` always |\n| **console.log in production** | Blocks JS thread severely | Remove before release build |\n| **Skip React.memo/const** | Every item re-renders on any change | Memoize list items ALWAYS |\n\n#### Touch/UX Sins\n\n| ❌ NEVER DO | Why It''s Wrong | ✅ ALWAYS DO |\n|-------------|----------------|--------------|\n| **Touch target < 44px** | Impossible to tap accurately, frustrating | Minimum 44pt (iOS) / 48dp (Android) |\n| **Spacing < 8px between targets** | Accidental taps on neighbors | Minimum 8-12px gap |\n| **Gesture-only interactions** | Motor impaired users excluded | Always provide button alternative |\n| **No loading state** | User thinks app crashed | ALWAYS show loading feedback |\n| **No error state** | User stuck, no recovery path | Show error with retry option |\n| **No offline handling** | Crash/block when network lost | Graceful degradation, cached data |\n| **Ignore platform conventions** | Users confused, muscle memory broken | iOS feels iOS, Android feels Android |\n\n#### Security Sins\n\n| ❌ NEVER DO | Why It''s Wrong | ✅ ALWAYS DO |\n|-------------|----------------|--------------|\n| **Token in AsyncStorage** | Easily accessible, stolen on rooted device | `SecureStore` / `Keychain` / `EncryptedSharedPreferences` |\n| **Hardcode API keys** | Reverse engineered from APK/IPA | Environment variables, secure storage |\n| **Skip SSL pinning** | MITM attacks possible | Pin certificates in production |\n| **Log sensitive data** | Logs can be extracted | Never log tokens, passwords, PII |\n\n#### Architecture Sins\n\n| ❌ NEVER DO | Why It''s Wrong | ✅ ALWAYS DO |\n|-------------|----------------|--------------|\n| **Business logic in UI** | Untestable, unmaintainable | Service layer separation |\n| **Global state for everything** | Unnecessary re-renders, complexity | Local state default, lift when needed |\n| **Deep linking as afterthought** | Notifications, shares broken | Plan deep links from day one |\n| **Skip dispose/cleanup** | Memory leaks, zombie listeners | Clean up subscriptions, timers |\n\n---\n\n## 📱 Platform Decision Matrix\n\n### When to Unify vs Diverge\n\n```\n                    UNIFY (same on both)          DIVERGE (platform-specific)\n                    ───────────────────           ──────────────────────────\nBusiness Logic      ✅ Always                     -\nData Layer          ✅ Always                     -\nCore Features       ✅ Always                     -\n                    \nNavigation          -                             ✅ iOS: edge swipe, Android: back button\nGestures            -                             ✅ Platform-native feel\nIcons               -                             ✅ SF Symbols vs Material Icons\nDate Pickers        -                             ✅ Native pickers feel right\nModals/Sheets       -                             ✅ iOS: bottom sheet vs Android: dialog\nTypography          -                             ✅ SF Pro vs Roboto (or custom)\nError Dialogs       -                             ✅ Platform conventions for alerts\n```\n\n### Quick Reference: Platform Defaults\n\n| Element | iOS | Android |\n|---------|-----|---------|\n| **Primary Font** | SF Pro / SF Compact | Roboto |\n| **Min Touch Target** | 44pt × 44pt | 48dp × 48dp |\n| **Back Navigation** | Edge swipe left | System back button/gesture |\n| **Bottom Tab Icons** | SF Symbols | Material Symbols |\n| **Action Sheet** | UIActionSheet from bottom | Bottom Sheet / Dialog |\n| **Progress** | Spinner | Linear progress (Material) |\n| **Pull to Refresh** | Native UIRefreshControl | SwipeRefreshLayout |\n\n---\n\n## 🧠 Mobile UX Psychology (Quick Reference)\n\n### Fitts'' Law for Touch\n\n```\nDesktop: Cursor is precise (1px)\nMobile:  Finger is imprecise (~7mm contact area)\n\n→ Touch targets MUST be 44-48px minimum\n→ Important actions in THUMB ZONE (bottom of screen)\n→ Destructive actions AWAY from easy reach\n```\n\n### Thumb Zone (One-Handed Usage)\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────┐\n│      HARD TO REACH          │ ← Navigation, menu, back\n│        (stretch)            │\n├─────────────────────────────┤\n│      OK TO REACH            │ ← Secondary actions\n│       (natural)             │\n├─────────────────────────────┤\n│      EASY TO REACH          │ ← PRIMARY CTAs, tab bar\n│    (thumb''s natural arc)    │ ← Main content interaction\n└─────────────────────────────┘\n        [  HOME  ]\n```\n\n### Mobile-Specific Cognitive Load\n\n| Desktop | Mobile Difference |\n|---------|-------------------|\n| Multiple windows | ONE task at a time |\n| Keyboard shortcuts | Touch gestures |\n| Hover states | NO hover (tap or nothing) |\n| Large viewport | Limited space, scroll vertical |\n| Stable attention | Interrupted constantly |\n\nFor deep dive: [touch-psychology.md](touch-psychology.md)\n\n---\n\n## ⚡ Performance Principles (Quick Reference)\n\n### React Native Critical Rules\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ CORRECT: Memoized renderItem + React.memo wrapper\nconst ListItem = React.memo(({ item }: { item: Item }) => (\n  <View style={styles.item}>\n    <Text>{item.title}</Text>\n  </View>\n));\n\nconst renderItem = useCallback(\n  ({ item }: { item: Item }) => <ListItem item={item} />,\n  []\n);\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: FlatList with all optimizations\n<FlatList\n  data={items}\n  renderItem={renderItem}\n  keyExtractor={(item) => item.id}  // Stable ID, NOT index\n  getItemLayout={(data, index) => ({\n    length: ITEM_HEIGHT,\n    offset: ITEM_HEIGHT * index,\n    index,\n  })}\n  removeClippedSubviews={true}\n  maxToRenderPerBatch={10}\n  windowSize={5}\n/>\n```\n\n### Flutter Critical Rules\n\n```dart\n// ✅ CORRECT: const constructors prevent rebuilds\nclass MyWidget extends StatelessWidget {\n  const MyWidget({super.key}); // CONST!\n\n  @override\n  Widget build(BuildContext context) {\n    return const Column( // CONST!\n      children: [\n        Text(''Static content''),\n        MyConstantWidget(),\n      ],\n    );\n  }\n}\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: Targeted state with ValueListenableBuilder\nValueListenableBuilder<int>(\n  valueListenable: counter,\n  builder: (context, value, child) => Text(''$value''),\n  child: const ExpensiveWidget(), // Won''t rebuild!\n)\n```\n\n### Animation Performance\n\n```\nGPU-accelerated (FAST):     CPU-bound (SLOW):\n├── transform               ├── width, height\n├── opacity                 ├── top, left, right, bottom\n└── (use these ONLY)        ├── margin, padding\n                            └── (AVOID animating these)\n```\n\nFor complete guide: [mobile-performance.md](mobile-performance.md)\n\n---\n\n## 📝 CHECKPOINT (MANDATORY Before Any Mobile Work)\n\n> **Before writing ANY mobile code, you MUST complete this checkpoint:**\n\n```\n🧠 CHECKPOINT:\n\nPlatform:   [ iOS / Android / Both ]\nFramework:  [ React Native / Flutter / SwiftUI / Kotlin ]\nFiles Read: [ List the skill files you''ve read ]\n\n3 Principles I Will Apply:\n1. _______________\n2. _______________\n3. _______________\n\nAnti-Patterns I Will Avoid:\n1. _______________\n2. _______________\n```\n\n**Example:**\n```\n🧠 CHECKPOINT:\n\nPlatform:   iOS + Android (Cross-platform)\nFramework:  React Native + Expo\nFiles Read: touch-psychology.md, mobile-performance.md, platform-ios.md, platform-android.md\n\n3 Principles I Will Apply:\n1. FlatList with React.memo + useCallback for all lists\n2. 48px touch targets, thumb zone for primary CTAs\n3. Platform-specific navigation (edge swipe iOS, back button Android)\n\nAnti-Patterns I Will Avoid:\n1. ScrollView for lists → FlatList\n2. Inline renderItem → Memoized\n3. AsyncStorage for tokens → SecureStore\n```\n\n> 🔴 **Can''t fill the checkpoint? → GO BACK AND READ THE SKILL FILES.**\n\n---\n\n## 🔧 Framework Decision Tree\n\n```\nWHAT ARE YOU BUILDING?\n        │\n        ├── Need OTA updates + rapid iteration + web team\n        │   └── ✅ React Native + Expo\n        │\n        ├── Need pixel-perfect custom UI + performance critical\n        │   └── ✅ Flutter\n        │\n        ├── Deep native features + single platform focus\n        │   ├── iOS only → SwiftUI\n        │   └── Android only → Kotlin + Jetpack Compose\n        │\n        ├── Existing RN codebase + new features\n        │   └── ✅ React Native (bare workflow)\n        │\n        └── Enterprise + existing Flutter codebase\n            └── ✅ Flutter\n```\n\nFor complete decision trees: [decision-trees.md](decision-trees.md)\n\n---\n\n## 📋 Pre-Development Checklist\n\n### Before Starting ANY Mobile Project\n\n- [ ] **Platform confirmed?** (iOS / Android / Both)\n- [ ] **Framework chosen?** (RN / Flutter / Native)\n- [ ] **Navigation pattern decided?** (Tabs / Stack / Drawer)\n- [ ] **State management selected?** (Zustand / Redux / Riverpod / BLoC)\n- [ ] **Offline requirements known?**\n- [ ] **Deep linking planned from day one?**\n- [ ] **Target devices defined?** (Phone / Tablet / Both)\n\n### Before Every Screen\n\n- [ ] **Touch targets ≥ 44-48px?**\n- [ ] **Primary CTA in thumb zone?**\n- [ ] **Loading state exists?**\n- [ ] **Error state with retry exists?**\n- [ ] **Offline handling considered?**\n- [ ] **Platform conventions followed?**\n\n### Before Release\n\n- [ ] **console.log removed?**\n- [ ] **SecureStore for sensitive data?**\n- [ ] **SSL pinning enabled?**\n- [ ] **Lists optimized (memo, keyExtractor)?**\n- [ ] **Memory cleanup on unmount?**\n- [ ] **Tested on low-end devices?**\n- [ ] **Accessibility labels on all interactive elements?**\n\n---\n\n## 📚 Reference Files\n\nFor deeper guidance on specific areas:\n\n| File | When to Use |\n|------|-------------|\n| [mobile-design-thinking.md](mobile-design-thinking.md) | **FIRST! Anti-memorization, forces context-based thinking** |\n| [touch-psychology.md](touch-psychology.md) | Understanding touch interaction, Fitts'' Law, gesture design |\n| [mobile-performance.md](mobile-performance.md) | Optimizing RN/Flutter, 60fps, memory/battery |\n| [platform-ios.md](platform-ios.md) | iOS-specific design, HIG compliance |\n| [platform-android.md](platform-android.md) | Android-specific design, Material Design 3 |\n| [mobile-navigation.md](mobile-navigation.md) | Navigation patterns, deep linking |\n| [mobile-typography.md](mobile-typography.md) | Type scale, system fonts, accessibility |\n| [mobile-color-system.md](mobile-color-system.md) | OLED optimization, dark mode, battery |\n| [decision-trees.md](decision-trees.md) | Framework, state, storage decisions |\n\n---\n\n> **Remember:** Mobile users are impatient, interrupted, and using imprecise fingers on small screens. Design for the WORST conditions: bad network, one hand, bright sun, low battery. If it works there, it works everywhere.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:37:37.190Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Interface Agents needing touch-first, battery-conscious, and platform-respectful mobile design capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要触摸优先、电池节能和平台尊重的移动设计能力的接口代理。","ja":"タッチ優先、バッテリー意識、プラットフォーム尊重のモバイルデザイン機能が必要なインターフェースエージェントに最適です。","ko":"터치 우선, 배터리意识, 플랫폼을尊重하는 모바일 디자인 기능이 필요한 인터페이스 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Interfaz que necesitan capacidades de diseño móvil de primera generación, conscientes de la batería y respetuosas con la plataforma.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Interface ayant besoin de capacités de conception mobile tactile, économes en batterie et respectueuses de la plate-forme.","de":"Perfekt für Interface-Agents, die touch-first, batteriebewusste und plattformrespektierende Mobile-Design-Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Interface que necessitam de capacidades de design móvel touch-first, conscientes da bateria e respeitosas com a plataforma.","ru":"Идеально для Интерфейсных Агентов, требующих тактильного, экономящего батарею и уважающего платформу мобильного дизайна.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الواجهة الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات التصميم المحمول التي تعتمد على اللمس أولاً وتأخذ في الاعتبار البطارية والاحترام للمنصة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design mobile interfaces with runtime scripts for validation, leveraging Python for mobile UX and touch audits, and respecting platform choices for seamless user experiences.","zh":"赋予代理设计移动接口的能力，使用运行时脚本进行验证，利用Python进行移动UX和触摸审计，并尊重平台选择以提供无缝的用户体验。","ja":"エージェントにモバイルインターフェイスを設計する能力を与え、ランタイムスクリプトを使用して検証を行い、Pythonを使用してモバイルUXとタッチ監査を行い、プラットフォームの選択を尊重してシームレスなユーザーエクスペリエンスを提供する。","ko":"에이전트에게 모바일 인터페이스를 설계할 수 있는 능력을 부여하고, 런타임 스크립트를 사용하여 검증을 수행하며, Python을 사용하여 모바일 UX와 터치 감사를 수행하며, 플랫폼의 선택을尊重하여无缝な 사용자 경험을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar interfaces móviles con scripts de tiempo de ejecución para validación, aprovechando Python para UX móvil y auditorías táctiles, y respetando las opciones de plataforma para experiencias de usuario sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des interfaces mobiles avec des scripts d''exécution pour validation, en exploitant Python pour l''UX mobile et les audits tactiles, et en respectant les choix de plate-forme pour des expériences utilisateur sans accroc.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, mobile Schnittstellen mit Laufzeit-Skripten für Validierung zu entwerfen, indem Python für mobile Benutzeroberflächen und Touch-Audits genutzt wird und Plattformwahlen für nahtlose Benutzererfahrungen respektiert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar interfaces móveis com scripts de runtime para validação, aproveitando o Python para experiência do usuário móvel e auditorias de toque, e respeitando as escolhas de plataforma para experiências de usuário sem interrupções.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать мобильные интерфейсы с помощью скриптов runtime для валидации, используя Python для мобильного пользовательского опыта и аудита прикосновений, и уважая выбор платформы для бесперебойного пользовательского опыта.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تصميم واجهات مستخدم محمول باستخدام سكريبتات زمن التشغيل للتحقق، واستخدام بايثون لتجربة المستخدم المحمول ومراجعة اللمس، والاحترام للخيار المنصة لتجارب مستخدم متواصلة."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating mobile UX and touch interactions with Python scripts","Auditing mobile applications for platform-respectful design","Designing battery-conscious and offline-capable mobile interfaces"],"zh":["使用Python脚本验证移动UX和触摸交互","审计移动应用程序的平台尊重设计","设计电池节能和离线能力的移动接口"],"ja":["Pythonスクリプトを使用してモバイルUXとタッチのやり取りを検証する","モバイルアプリケーションのプラットフォーム尊重設計を監査する","バッテリー意識とオフライン対応のモバイルインターフェイスを設計する"],"ko":["Python 스크립트를 사용하여 모바일 UX와 터치 상호 작용을 검증합니다.","모바일 애플리케이션의 플랫폼을尊重하는 설계를 감사합니다.","배터리 意識와 오프라인対応의 모바일 인터페이스를 설계합니다."],"es":["Validar la experiencia del usuario móvil y las interacciones táctiles con scripts de Python","Auditar aplicaciones móviles para un diseño respetuoso con la plataforma","Diseñar interfaces móviles conscientes de la batería y capaces de funcionar sin conexión"],"fr":["Valider l''expérience utilisateur mobile et les interactions tactiles avec des scripts Python","Auditer les applications mobiles pour une conception respectueuse de la plate-forme","Concevoir des interfaces mobiles économes en batterie et capables de fonctionner hors ligne"],"de":["Überprüfen der mobilen Benutzeroberfläche und der Touch-Interaktionen mit Python-Skripten","Audits von Mobile-Anwendungen für plattformrespektierendes Design","Entwerfen von batteriebewussten und offline-fähigen mobilen Schnittstellen"],"pt":["Validar experiência do usuário móvel e interações de toque com scripts Python","Auditar aplicativos móveis para design respeitoso com a plataforma","Projetar interfaces móveis conscientes da bateria e capazes de funcionar offline"],"ru":["Проверять мобильный пользовательский опыт и тактильные взаимодействия с помощью скриптов Python","Аудит мобильных приложений для уважающего платформу дизайна","Проектировать мобильные интерфейсы, экономящие батарею и способные работать offline"],"ar":["التحقق من تجربة المستخدم المحمول والتفاعلات التي تعتمد على اللمس باستخدام سكريبتات بايثون","مراجعة تطبيقات المحمول للتصميم المحترم للمنصة","تصميم واجهات مستخدم محمول تأخذ في الاعتبار البطارية وقادرة على العمل بدون اتصال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment for script execution","Focused on mobile design principles, not desktop applications"],"zh":["需要Python环境来执行脚本","专注于移动设计原则，不适用于桌面应用程序"],"ja":["スクリプトの実行にはPython環境が必要","モバイルデザイン原則に焦点を当てており、デスクトップアプリケーションには不向き"],"ko":["스크립트 실행을 위해 Python 환경이 필요합니다.","모바일 디자인 원칙에 중점을 두고있어, 데스크톱 애플리케이션에는 적합하지 않습니다."],"es":["Requiere un entorno de Python para la ejecución de scripts","Se centra en los principios de diseño móvil, no en aplicaciones de escritorio"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python pour l''exécution de scripts","Se concentre sur les principes de conception mobile, et non sur les applications de bureau"],"de":["Benötigt eine Python-Umgebung für die Skriptausführung","Konzentriert sich auf Mobile-Design-Prinzipien, nicht auf Desktop-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Python para execução de scripts","Focado em princípios de design móvel, não em aplicações de desktop"],"ru":["Требует среды Python для выполнения скриптов","Сосредоточен на принципах мобильного дизайна, а не на настольных приложениях"],"ar":["يحتاج إلى بيئة بايثون لتشغيل السكريبتات","مركز على مبادئ تصميم المحمول، وليس على التطبيقات المكتبية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
