обильный Дизайн Системы","ar":"تصميم الجوال","en":"mobile-design"},"description":{"zh":"移动设计系统是一种为开发者打造最佳移动体验的方法，强调触摸优先、节能、平台尊重和离线能力","ja":"モバイルデザインシステムは、開発者向けの最適なモバイル体験を作成するための方法で、タッチ優先、省エネルギー、プラットフォーム尊重、オフライン対応を強調する","ko":"모바일 디자인 시스템은 개발자를 위한 최적의 모바일 경험을 생성하기 위한 방법으로, 터치 우선, 에너지 절약, 플랫폼尊重, 오프라인対応을 강조","es":"El diseño móvil se centra en la creación de experiencias móviles efectivas, considerando las limitaciones y oportunidades de la plataforma móvil","fr":"La conception mobile se concentre sur la création d''expériences mobiles efficaces, en tenant compte des contraintes et des opportunités de la plateforme mobile","de":"Das Mobile Design konzentriert sich auf die Erstellung effektiver mobiler Erfahrungen, unter Berücksichtigung der Einschränkungen und Möglichkeiten der mobil...","pt":"O sistema de design móvel é baseado em uma filosofia de toque, economia de bateria e respeito à plataforma, com scripts de validação para garantir a melhor e...","ru":"Мобильная система дизайна основана на философии осязания, экономии батареи и уважении к платформе, со скриптами для проверки для обеспечения лучшего пользова...","ar":"نظام التصميم الجوال يعتمد على فلسفة اللمس وتوفير البطارية والاحترام للمنصة، مع سكربتات للتأكد من أفضل تجربة للمستخدم","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["触摸优先","节能","平台尊重","离线能力","移动UX和触摸审核"],"ja":["タッチ優先","省エネルギー","プラットフォーム尊重","オフライン対応","モバイルUXとタッチの監査"],"ko":["터치 우선","에너지 절약","플랫폼尊重","오프라인対応","모바일 UX 및 터치 감사"],"es":["Enfoque en diseño centrado en la plataforma","Consideración de las limitaciones móviles","Diseño de experiencias móviles efectivas","Uso de scripts de auditoría para la validación","Respeto a la elección de la plataforma"],"fr":["Approche de conception centrée sur la plateforme","Prise en compte des contraintes mobiles","Conception d''expériences mobiles efficaces","Utilisation de scripts d''audit pour la validation","Respect du choix de la plateforme"],"de":["Ansatzzentriertes Design","Berücksichtigung der mobilen Einschränkungen","Erstellung effektiver mobiler Erfahrungen","Verwendung von Audit-Skripten für die Validierung","Respekt vor der Plattformwahl"],"pt":["Filosofia de toque","Economia de bateria","Respeito à plataforma","Scripts de validação","Melhoria da experiência do usuário"],"ru":["Философия осязания","Экономия батареи","Уважение к платформе","Скрипты для проверки","Улучшение пользовательского опыта"],"ar":["فلسفة اللمس","توفير البطارية","الاحترام للمنصة","سكربتات للتأكد","تحسين تجربة المستخدم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["移动设计","移动开发","触摸优先","节能","平台尊重","离线能力","移动UX","移动体验"],"ja":["モバイルデザイン","モバイル開発","タッチ優先","省エネルギー","プラットフォーム尊重","オフライン対応","モバイルUX","モバイル体験"],"ko":["모바일 디자인","모바일 개발","터치 우선","에너지 절약","플랫폼尊重","오프라인対応","모바일 UX","모바일 경험"],"es":["diseño móvil","experiencias móviles","plataforma móvil","limitaciones móviles","diseño centrado en la plataforma","auditoría móvil"],"fr":["conception mobile","expériences mobiles","plateforme mobile","contraintes mobiles","conception centrée sur la plateforme","audit mobile"],"de":["Mobile Design","mobile Erfahrungen","mobile Plattform","mobile Einschränkungen","ansatzzentriertes Design","mobile Audit"],"pt":["design móvel","sistema de design","filosofia de toque","economia de bateria","respeito à plataforma","scripts de validação","experiência do usuário"],"ru":["мобильный дизайн","система дизайна","философия осязания","экономия батареи","уважение к платформе","скрипты для проверки","пользовательский опыт"],"ar":["تصميم الجوال","نظام التصميم","فلسفة اللمس","توفير البطارية","الاحترام للمنصة","سكربتات للتأكد","تجربة المستخدم"]}},"owner":"nianyi778","repo":"circle-fultter","repoPath":"nianyi778/circle-fultter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.423Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"mobile-design","description":"Mobile-first design thinking and decision-making for iOS and Android apps. Touch interaction, performance patterns, platform conventions. Teaches principles, not fixed values. Use when building React Native, Flutter, or native mobile apps.","bodyPreview":"# Mobile Design System\n\n> **Philosophy:** Touch-first. Battery-conscious. Platform-respectful. Offline-capable.\n> **Core Principle:** Mobile is NOT a small desktop. THINK mobile constraints, ASK platform choice.\n\n---\n\n## 🔧 Runtime Scripts\n\n**Execute these for validation (don''t read, just run):**\n\n| Script | Purpose | Usage |\n|--------|---------|-------|\n| `scripts/mobile_audit.py` | Mobile UX & Touch Audit | `python scripts/mobile_audit.py <project_path>` |\n\n---\n\n## 🔴 MANDATORY: Read Reference","body":"# Mobile Design System\n\n> **Philosophy:** Touch-first. Battery-conscious. Platform-respectful. Offline-capable.\n> **Core Principle:** Mobile is NOT a small desktop. THINK mobile constraints, ASK platform choice.\n\n---\n\n## 🔧 Runtime Scripts\n\n**Execute these for validation (don''t read, just run):**\n\n| Script | Purpose | Usage |\n|--------|---------|-------|\n| `scripts/mobile_audit.py` | Mobile UX & Touch Audit | `python scripts/mobile_audit.py <project_path>` |\n\n---\n\n## 🔴 MANDATORY: Read Reference Files Before Working!\n\n**⛔ DO NOT start development until you read the relevant files:**\n\n### Universal (Always Read)\n\n| File | Content | Status |\n|------|---------|--------|\n| **[mobile-design-thinking.md](mobile-design-thinking.md)** | **⚠️ ANTI-MEMORIZATION: Forces thinking, prevents AI defaults** | **⬜ CRITICAL FIRST** |\n| **[touch-psychology.md](touch-psychology.md)** | **Fitts'' Law, gestures, haptics, thumb zone** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| **[mobile-performance.md](mobile-performance.md)** | **RN/Flutter performance, 60fps, memory** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| **[mobile-backend.md](mobile-backend.md)** | **Push notifications, offline sync, mobile API** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| **[mobile-testing.md](mobile-testing.md)** | **Testing pyramid, E2E, platform-specific** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| **[mobile-debugging.md](mobile-debugging.md)** | **Native vs JS debugging, Flipper, Logcat** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| [mobile-navigation.md](mobile-navigation.md) | Tab/Stack/Drawer, deep linking | ⬜ Read |\n| [mobile-typography.md](mobile-typography.md) | System fonts, Dynamic Type, a11y | ⬜ Read |\n| [mobile-color-system.md](mobile-color-system.md) | OLED, dark mode, battery-aware | ⬜ Read |\n| [decision-trees.md](decision-trees.md) | Framework/state/storage selection | ⬜ Read |\n\n> 🧠 **mobile-design-thinking.md is PRIORITY!** This file ensures AI thinks instead of using memorized patterns.\n\n### Platform-Specific (Read Based on Target)\n\n| Platform | File | Content | When to Read |\n|----------|------|---------|--------------|\n| **iOS** | [platform-ios.md](platform-ios.md) | Human Interface Guidelines, SF Pro, SwiftUI patterns | Building for iPhone/iPad |\n| **Android** | [platform-android.md](platform-android.md) | Material Design 3, Roboto, Compose patterns | Building for Android |\n| **Cross-Platform** | Both above | Platform divergence points | React Native / Flutter |\n\n> 🔴 **If building for iOS → Read platform-ios.md FIRST!**\n> 🔴 **If building for Android → Read platform-android.md FIRST!**\n> 🔴 **If cross-platform → Read BOTH and apply conditional platform logic!**\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ CRITICAL: ASK BEFORE ASSUMING (MANDATORY)\n\n> **STOP! If the user''s request is open-ended, DO NOT default to your favorites.**\n\n### You MUST Ask If Not Specified:\n\n| Aspect | Ask | Why |\n|--------|-----|-----|\n| **Platform** | \"iOS, Android, or both?\" | Affects EVERY design decision |\n| **Framework** | \"React Native, Flutter, or native?\" | Determines patterns and tools |\n| **Navigation** | \"Tab bar, drawer, or stack-based?\" | Core UX decision |\n| **State** | \"What state management? (Zustand/Redux/Riverpod/BLoC?)\" | Architecture foundation |\n| **Offline** | \"Does this need to work offline?\" | Affects data strategy |\n| **Target devices** | \"Phone only, or tablet support?\" | Layout complexity |\n\n### ⛔ AI MOBILE ANTI-PATTERNS (YASAK LİSTESİ)\n\n> 🚫 **These are AI default tendencies that MUST be avoided!**\n\n#### Performance Sins\n\n| ❌ NEVER DO | Why It''s Wrong | ✅ ALWAYS DO |\n|-------------|----------------|--------------|\n| **ScrollView for long lists** | Renders ALL items, memory explodes | Use `FlatList` / `FlashList` / `ListView.builder` |\n| **Inline renderItem function** | New function every render, all items re-render | `useCallback` + `React.memo` |\n| **Missing keyExtractor** | Index-based keys cause bugs on reorder | Unique, stable ID from data |\n| **Skip getItemLayout** | Async layout = janky scroll | Provide when items have fixed height |\n| **setState() everywhere** | Unnecessary widget rebuilds | Targeted state, `const` constructors |\n| **Native driver: false** | Animations blocked by JS thread | `useNativeDriver: true` always |\n| **console.log in production** | Blocks JS thread severely | Remove before release build |\n| **Skip React.memo/const** | Every item re-renders on any change | Memoize list items ALWAYS |\n\n#### Touch/UX Sins\n\n| ❌ NEVER DO | Why It''s Wrong | ✅ ALWAYS DO |\n|-------------|----------------|--------------|\n| **Touch target < 44px** | Impossible to tap accurately, frustrating | Minimum 44pt (iOS) / 48dp (Android) |\n| **Spacing < 8px between targets** | Accidental taps on neighbors | Minimum 8-12px gap |\n| **Gesture-only interactions** | Motor impaired users excluded | Always provide button alternative |\n| **No loading state** | User thinks app crashed | ALWAYS show loading feedback |\n| **No error state** | User stuck, no recovery path | Show error with retry option |\n| **No offline handling** | Crash/block when network lost | Graceful degradation, cached data |\n| **Ignore platform conventions** | Users confused, muscle memory broken | iOS feels iOS, Android feels Android |\n\n#### Security Sins\n\n| ❌ NEVER DO | Why It''s Wrong | ✅ ALWAYS DO |\n|-------------|----------------|--------------|\n| **Token in AsyncStorage** | Easily accessible, stolen on rooted device | `SecureStore` / `Keychain` / `EncryptedSharedPreferences` |\n| **Hardcode API keys** | Reverse engineered from APK/IPA | Environment variables, secure storage |\n| **Skip SSL pinning** | MITM attacks possible | Pin certificates in production |\n| **Log sensitive data** | Logs can be extracted | Never log tokens, passwords, PII |\n\n#### Architecture Sins\n\n| ❌ NEVER DO | Why It''s Wrong | ✅ ALWAYS DO |\n|-------------|----------------|--------------|\n| **Business logic in UI** | Untestable, unmaintainable | Service layer separation |\n| **Global state for everything** | Unnecessary re-renders, complexity | Local state default, lift when needed |\n| **Deep linking as afterthought** | Notifications, shares broken | Plan deep links from day one |\n| **Skip dispose/cleanup** | Memory leaks, zombie listeners | Clean up subscriptions, timers |\n\n---\n\n## 📱 Platform Decision Matrix\n\n### When to Unify vs Diverge\n\n```\n                    UNIFY (same on both)          DIVERGE (platform-specific)\n                    ───────────────────           ──────────────────────────\nBusiness Logic      ✅ Always                     -\nData Layer          ✅ Always                     -\nCore Features       ✅ Always                     -\n                    \nNavigation          -                             ✅ iOS: edge swipe, Android: back button\nGestures            -                             ✅ Platform-native feel\nIcons               -                             ✅ SF Symbols vs Material Icons\nDate Pickers        -                             ✅ Native pickers feel right\nModals/Sheets       -                             ✅ iOS: bottom sheet vs Android: dialog\nTypography          -                             ✅ SF Pro vs Roboto (or custom)\nError Dialogs       -                             ✅ Platform conventions for alerts\n```\n\n### Quick Reference: Platform Defaults\n\n| Element | iOS | Android |\n|---------|-----|---------|\n| **Primary Font** | SF Pro / SF Compact | Roboto |\n| **Min Touch Target** | 44pt × 44pt | 48dp × 48dp |\n| **Back Navigation** | Edge swipe left | System back button/gesture |\n| **Bottom Tab Icons** | SF Symbols | Material Symbols |\n| **Action Sheet** | UIActionSheet from bottom | Bottom Sheet / Dialog |\n| **Progress** | Spinner | Linear progress (Material) |\n| **Pull to Refresh** | Native UIRefreshControl | SwipeRefreshLayout |\n\n---\n\n## 🧠 Mobile UX Psychology (Quick Reference)\n\n### Fitts'' Law for Touch\n\n```\nDesktop: Cursor is precise (1px)\nMobile:  Finger is imprecise (~7mm contact area)\n\n→ Touch targets MUST be 44-48px minimum\n→ Important actions in THUMB ZONE (bottom of screen)\n→ Destructive actions AWAY from easy reach\n```\n\n### Thumb Zone (One-Handed Usage)\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────┐\n│      HARD TO REACH          │ ← Navigation, menu, back\n│        (stretch)            │\n├─────────────────────────────┤\n│      OK TO REACH            │ ← Secondary actions\n│       (natural)             │\n├─────────────────────────────┤\n│      EASY TO REACH          │ ← PRIMARY CTAs, tab bar\n│    (thumb''s natural arc)    │ ← Main content interaction\n└─────────────────────────────┘\n        [  HOME  ]\n```\n\n### Mobile-Specific Cognitive Load\n\n| Desktop | Mobile Difference |\n|---------|-------------------|\n| Multiple windows | ONE task at a time |\n| Keyboard shortcuts | Touch gestures |\n| Hover states | NO hover (tap or nothing) |\n| Large viewport | Limited space, scroll vertical |\n| Stable attention | Interrupted constantly |\n\nFor deep dive: [touch-psychology.md](touch-psychology.md)\n\n---\n\n## ⚡ Performance Principles (Quick Reference)\n\n### React Native Critical Rules\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ CORRECT: Memoized renderItem + React.memo wrapper\nconst ListItem = React.memo(({ item }: { item: Item }) => (\n  <View style={styles.item}>\n    <Text>{item.title}</Text>\n  </View>\n));\n\nconst renderItem = useCallback(\n  ({ item }: { item: Item }) => <ListItem item={item} />,\n  []\n);\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: FlatList with all optimizations\n<FlatList\n  data={items}\n  renderItem={renderItem}\n  keyExtractor={(item) => item.id}  // Stable ID, NOT index\n  getItemLayout={(data, index) => ({\n    length: ITEM_HEIGHT,\n    offset: ITEM_HEIGHT * index,\n    index,\n  })}\n  removeClippedSubviews={true}\n  maxToRenderPerBatch={10}\n  windowSize={5}\n/>\n```\n\n### Flutter Critical Rules\n\n```dart\n// ✅ CORRECT: const constructors prevent rebuilds\nclass MyWidget extends StatelessWidget {\n  const MyWidget({super.key}); // CONST!\n\n  @override\n  Widget build(BuildContext context) {\n    return const Column( // CONST!\n      children: [\n        Text(''Static content''),\n        MyConstantWidget(),\n      ],\n    );\n  }\n}\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: Targeted state with ValueListenableBuilder\nValueListenableBuilder<int>(\n  valueListenable: counter,\n  builder: (context, value, child) => Text(''$value''),\n  child: const ExpensiveWidget(), // Won''t rebuild!\n)\n```\n\n### Animation Performance\n\n```\nGPU-accelerated (FAST):     CPU-bound (SLOW):\n├── transform               ├── width, height\n├── opacity                 ├── top, left, right, bottom\n└── (use these ONLY)        ├── margin, padding\n                            └── (AVOID animating these)\n```\n\nFor complete guide: [mobile-performance.md](mobile-performance.md)\n\n---\n\n## 📝 CHECKPOINT (MANDATORY Before Any Mobile Work)\n\n> **Before writing ANY mobile code, you MUST complete this checkpoint:**\n\n```\n🧠 CHECKPOINT:\n\nPlatform:   [ iOS / Android / Both ]\nFramework:  [ React Native / Flutter / SwiftUI / Kotlin ]\nFiles Read: [ List the skill files you''ve read ]\n\n3 Principles I Will Apply:\n1. _______________\n2. _______________\n3. _______________\n\nAnti-Patterns I Will Avoid:\n1. _______________\n2. _______________\n```\n\n**Example:**\n```\n🧠 CHECKPOINT:\n\nPlatform:   iOS + Android (Cross-platform)\nFramework:  React Native + Expo\nFiles Read: touch-psychology.md, mobile-performance.md, platform-ios.md, platform-android.md\n\n3 Principles I Will Apply:\n1. FlatList with React.memo + useCallback for all lists\n2. 48px touch targets, thumb zone for primary CTAs\n3. Platform-specific navigation (edge swipe iOS, back button Android)\n\nAnti-Patterns I Will Avoid:\n1. ScrollView for lists → FlatList\n2. Inline renderItem → Memoized\n3. AsyncStorage for tokens → SecureStore\n```\n\n> 🔴 **Can''t fill the checkpoint? → GO BACK AND READ THE SKILL FILES.**\n\n---\n\n## 🔧 Framework Decision Tree\n\n```\nWHAT ARE YOU BUILDING?\n        │\n        ├── Need OTA updates + rapid iteration + web team\n        │   └── ✅ React Native + Expo\n        │\n        ├── Need pixel-perfect custom UI + performance critical\n        │   └── ✅ Flutter\n        │\n        ├── Deep native features + single platform focus\n        │   ├── iOS only → SwiftUI\n        │   └── Android only → Kotlin + Jetpack Compose\n        │\n        ├── Existing RN codebase + new features\n        │   └── ✅ React Native (bare workflow)\n        │\n        └── Enterprise + existing Flutter codebase\n            └── ✅ Flutter\n```\n\nFor complete decision trees: [decision-trees.md](decision-trees.md)\n\n---\n\n## 📋 Pre-Development Checklist\n\n### Before Starting ANY Mobile Project\n\n- [ ] **Platform confirmed?** (iOS / Android / Both)\n- [ ] **Framework chosen?** (RN / Flutter / Native)\n- [ ] **Navigation pattern decided?** (Tabs / Stack / Drawer)\n- [ ] **State management selected?** (Zustand / Redux / Riverpod / BLoC)\n- [ ] **Offline requirements known?**\n- [ ] **Deep linking planned from day one?**\n- [ ] **Target devices defined?** (Phone / Tablet / Both)\n\n### Before Every Screen\n\n- [ ] **Touch targets ≥ 44-48px?**\n- [ ] **Primary CTA in thumb zone?**\n- [ ] **Loading state exists?**\n- [ ] **Error state with retry exists?**\n- [ ] **Offline handling considered?**\n- [ ] **Platform conventions followed?**\n\n### Before Release\n\n- [ ] **console.log removed?**\n- [ ] **SecureStore for sensitive data?**\n- [ ] **SSL pinning enabled?**\n- [ ] **Lists optimized (memo, keyExtractor)?**\n- [ ] **Memory cleanup on unmount?**\n- [ ] **Tested on low-end devices?**\n- [ ] **Accessibility labels on all interactive elements?**\n\n---\n\n## 📚 Reference Files\n\nFor deeper guidance on specific areas:\n\n| File | When to Use |\n|------|-------------|\n| [mobile-design-thinking.md](mobile-design-thinking.md) | **FIRST! Anti-memorization, forces context-based thinking** |\n| [touch-psychology.md](touch-psychology.md) | Understanding touch interaction, Fitts'' Law, gesture design |\n| [mobile-performance.md](mobile-performance.md) | Optimizing RN/Flutter, 60fps, memory/battery |\n| [platform-ios.md](platform-ios.md) | iOS-specific design, HIG compliance |\n| [platform-android.md](platform-android.md) | Android-specific design, Material Design 3 |\n| [mobile-navigation.md](mobile-navigation.md) | Navigation patterns, deep linking |\n| [mobile-typography.md](mobile-typography.md) | Type scale, system fonts, accessibility |\n| [mobile-color-system.md](mobile-color-system.md) | OLED optimization, dark mode, battery |\n| [decision-trees.md](decision-trees.md) | Framework, state, storage decisions |\n\n---\n\n> **Remember:** Mobile users are impatient, interrupted, and using imprecise fingers on small screens. Design for the WORST conditions: bad network, one hand, bright sun, low battery. If it works there, it works everywhere.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:37:47.760Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for UI/UX Agents focusing on touch-first, battery-conscious, and platform-respectful mobile design principles.","zh":"适合专注于触摸优先、电池节能和平台尊重的移动设计原则的UI/UX代理。","ja":"タッチファースト、バッテリー意識、プラットフォーム尊重のモバイルデザイン原則に焦点を当てたUI/UXエージェントに最適です。","ko":"터치 우선, 배터리 소모 최소화, 플랫폼을尊重하는 모바일 디자인 원칙에 중점을 둔 UI/UX 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de UI/UX que se centran en principios de diseño móvil de primera interacción, conscientes de la batería y respetuosos con la plataforma.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents UI/UX qui se concentrent sur les principes de conception mobile de première interaction, économes en batterie et respectueux de la plate-forme.","de":"Ideal für UI/UX-Agenten, die sich auf touch-first-, batteriebewusste und plattformrespektierende Mobile-Design-Prinzipien konzentrieren.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de UI/UX que se concentram em princípios de design móvel touch-first, conscientes da bateria e respeitosos com a plataforma.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов UI/UX, ориентированных на разработку мобильных приложений с учетом первого прикосновения, экономией батареи и уважением к платформе.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم / تجربة المستخدم الذين يركزون على مبادئ التصميم المحمول الأولي لللمس والواعي للبطارية والمحترم للمنصة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design mobile interfaces with a touch-first philosophy, respecting platform choices and ensuring offline capability, utilizing Python scripts for mobile UX and touch audits.","zh":"赋予代理设计移动接口的能力，遵循触摸优先的理念，尊重平台选择，确保离线能力，并利用Python脚本进行移动UX和触摸审计。","ja":"エージェントにタッチファーストの哲学に基づいてモバイルインターフェースを設計する能力を与え、プラットフォームの選択を尊重し、オフライン機能を確保し、Pythonスクリプトを使用してモバイルUXとタッチ監査を実行します。","ko":"에이전트가 터치 우선 철학을 기반으로 모바일 인터페이스를 설계하도록 하는 강력한 기능을 제공하며, 플랫폼 선택을尊重하고 오프라인 기능을 보장하며, Python 스크립트를 사용하여 모바일 UX 및 터치 감사를 수행합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes diseñar interfaces móviles con una filosofía de primera interacción, respetando las opciones de plataforma y garantizando la capacidad de funcionamiento sin conexión, utilizando scripts de Python para la experiencia del usuario móvil y las auditorías de interacción.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des interfaces mobiles avec une philosophie de première interaction, en respectant les choix de plate-forme et en garantissant la capacité de fonctionnement hors ligne, en utilisant des scripts Python pour l''expérience utilisateur mobile et les audits de toucher.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, mobile Schnittstellen mit einer touch-first-Philosophie zu entwerfen, die Plattformauswahl respektiert und die Offline-Fähigkeit sicherstellt, indem Python-Skripte für mobile Benutzeroberflächen und Touch-Audits verwendet werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes projetem interfaces móveis com uma filosofia de primeiro toque, respeitando as escolhas de plataforma e garantindo a capacidade offline, utilizando scripts Python para UX móvel e auditorias de toque.","ru":"Позволяет агентам разрабатывать мобильные интерфейсы с философией первого прикосновения, уважая выбор платформы и обеспечивающая возможность работы offline, используя скрипты Python для мобильного UX и аудита прикосновений.","ar":"تمكن الوكيل من تصميم واجهات المستخدم المحمول بالفلسفة الأولى للمس، مع احترام خيارات المنصة وضمان القدرة على العمل بدون اتصال، باستخدام البرامج النصية Python لتحسين تجربة المستخدم المحمول وتحليل اللمس."},"useCases":{"en":["Auditing mobile applications for touch and UX compliance","Designing platform-respectful mobile interfaces","Validating mobile design systems for offline capability"],"zh":["审计移动应用程序的触摸和UX合规性","设计平台尊重的移动接口","验证移动设计系统的离线功能"],"ja":["タッチとUXのコンプライアンスを保つためのモバイルアプリケーションの監査","プラットフォームを尊重したモバイルインターフェースの設計","モバイルデザインシステムのオフライン機能の検証"],"ko":["터치 및 UX 규정 준수에 대한 모바일 애플리케이션 감사","플랫폼을尊重하는 모바일 인터페이스 설계","모바일 디자인 시스템의 오프라인 기능에 대한 검증"],"es":["Auditoría de aplicaciones móviles para cumplimiento de interacción y experiencia del usuario","Diseño de interfaces móviles respetuosas con la plataforma","Validación de sistemas de diseño móvil para capacidad de funcionamiento sin conexión"],"fr":["Audit des applications mobiles pour la conformité à la touche et à l''expérience utilisateur","Conception d''interfaces mobiles respectueuses de la plate-forme","Validation des systèmes de conception mobile pour la capacité de fonctionnement hors ligne"],"de":["Prüfung mobiler Anwendungen auf Einhaltung von Touch- und Benutzeroberflächenkonformität","Entwurf plattformrespektierender mobiler Schnittstellen","Validierung mobiler Designsysteme für die Offline-Fähigkeit"],"pt":["Auditoria de aplicativos móveis para conformidade de toque e UX","Projeto de interfaces móveis respeitosas com a plataforma","Validação de sistemas de design móvel para capacidade offline"],"ru":["Аудит мобильных приложений для соответствия требованиям касания и UX","Разработка интерфейсов мобильных устройств с учетом платформы","Проверка систем мобильного дизайна на возможность работы offline"],"ar":["تدقيق التطبيقات المحمولة للامتثال لشروط اللمس وتجربة المستخدم","تصميم واجهات المستخدم المحمول المحترمة للمنصة"," التحقق من أنظمة التصميم المحمول للقدرة على العمل بدون اتصال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment for script execution","Focused on mobile design principles, not desktop applications"],"zh":["需要Python环境来执行脚本","仅专注于移动设计原则，不适用于桌面应用程序"],"ja":["スクリプトの実行にはPython環境が必要","モバイルデザイン原則にのみ焦点を当てており、デスクトップアプリケーションには不適"],"ko":["스크립트 실행을 위해 Python 환경이 필요","모바일 디자인 원칙에만 중점을 두고 있으며, 데스크톱 애플리케이션에는 부적합"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de Python para la ejecución de scripts","Se centra en principios de diseño móvil, no en aplicaciones de escritorio"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python pour l''exécution de scripts","Se concentre sur les principes de conception mobile, et non sur les applications de bureau"],"de":["Benötigt eine Python-Umgebung für die Skriptausführung","Konzentriert sich auf Mobile-Design-Prinzipien, nicht auf Desktop-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Python para execução de scripts","Focado em princípios de design móvel, não em aplicações de desktop"],"ru":["Требует среды Python для выполнения скриптов","Ориентирован на принципы разработки мобильных приложений, а не настольных"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Python لتنفيذ البرامج النصية","مركز على مبادئ التصميم المحمول، وليس على تطبيقات سطح المكتب"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
