ios Angular Signal","ru":"Формы Angular Signal","ar":"استمارات أنجولار سيغنال","en":"angular-forms"},"description":{"zh":"Angular Signal Forms 是一种构建响应式表单的方法，提供自动双向绑定、基于模式的验证和响应式字段状态","ja":"Angular Signal Forms は、リアクティブ フォームを構築する方法であり、自動双方向バインディング、スキーマベースの検証、リアクティブ フィールド状態を提供します","ko":"Angular Signal Forms는 반응형 폼을 구축하는 방법으로 자동 양방향 바인딩, 스키마 기반 유효성 검사, 반응형 필드 상태를 제공합니다","es":"Signal Forms de Angular es una API experimental para crear formularios reactivos y seguros. Permite enlace bidireccional automático y validación basada en es...","fr":"Signal Forms d''Angular est une API expérimentale pour créer des formulaires réactifs et sécurisés. Il permet un lien bidirectionnel automatique et une valida...","de":"Signal Forms von Angular ist eine experimentelle API für die Erstellung reaktiver und sicherer Formulare. Sie ermöglicht automatische bidirektionale Bindung ...","pt":"A API de Formulários Signal do Angular permite criar formulários reativos e seguros com ligação bidirecional automática e validação baseada em esquema.","ru":"API Signal Forms в Angular позволяет создавать реактивные и безопасные формы с автоматическим двусторонним связыванием и валидацией на основе схемы.","ar":"واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Forms Signal في Angular تسمح بإنشاء استمارات تفاعلية وأمنة مع ربط ثنائي الاتجاه تلقائي والتحقق من صحة بناء الجملة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["自动双向绑定","基于模式的验证","响应式字段状态","类型安全","实验性功能"],"ja":["自動双方向バインディング","スキーマベースの検証","リアクティブ フィールド状態","型安全","実験的な機能"],"ko":["자동 양방향 바인딩","스키마 기반 유효성 검사","반응형 필드 상태","타입 안전","실험적인 기능"],"es":["Enlace bidireccional automático","Validación basada en esquemas","Estado reactivo de los campos","Creación de formularios tipo-safe","Compatibilidad con Angular v21"],"fr":["Lien bidirectionnel automatique","Validation basée sur des schémas","État réactif des champs","Création de formulaires type-safe","Compatibilité avec Angular v21"],"de":["Automatische bidirektionale Bindung","Schema-basierte Validierung","Reaktiver Feldzustand","Erstellung von type-safe-Formularen","Kompatibilität mit Angular v21"],"pt":["Ligação bidirecional automática","Validação baseada em esquema","Estados de campo reativos","Tipagem segura","Integração com a API do Angular"],"ru":["Автоматическое двустороннее связывание","Валидация на основе схемы","Реактивные состояния полей","Безопасная типизация","Интеграция с API Angular"],"ar":["ربط ثنائي الاتجاه تلقائي","التحقق من صحة بناء الجملة","حالات حقل تفاعلية","ترميز آمن","التكامل مع واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Angular"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Angular 表单","响应式表单","Signal Forms","自动双向绑定","基于模式的验证","类型安全"],"ja":["Angular フォーム","リアクティブ フォーム","Signal Forms","自動双方向バインディング","スキーマベースの検証","型安全"],"ko":["Angular 폼","반응형 폼","Signal Forms","자동 양방향 바인딩","스키마 기반 유효성 검사","타입 안전"],"es":["Angular Signal Forms","formularios reactivos","enlace bidireccional","validación basada en esquemas","estado reactivo","type-safe","Angular v21"],"fr":["Formulaires Signal d''Angular","formulaires réactifs","lien bidirectionnel","validation basée sur des schémas","état réactif","type-safe","Angular v21"],"de":["Angular Signal Forms","reaktive Formulare","bidirektionale Bindung","schema-basierte Validierung","reaktiver Feldzustand","type-safe","Angular v21"],"pt":["formulários angular","signal forms","ligação bidirecional","validação baseada em esquema","estados de campo reativos","desenvolvimento web","angular forms"],"ru":["формы angular","signal формы","двустороннее связывание","валидация на основе схемы","реактивные состояния полей","веб-разработка","angular формы"],"ar":["استمارات أنجولار","استمارات سيغنال","ربط ثنائي الاتجاه","التحقق من صحة بناء الجملة","حالات حقل تفاعلية","تطوير الويب","استمارات أنجولار"]}},"owner":"walkingriver","repo":"Angular-Apprentice","repoPath":"walkingriver/Angular-Apprentice","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.423Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"angular-forms","description":"Build signal-based forms in Angular v21+ using the new Signal Forms API. Use for form creation with automatic two-way binding, schema-based validation, field state management, and dynamic forms. Triggers on form implementation, adding validation, creating multi-step forms, or building forms with conditional fields. Signal Forms are experimental but recommended for new Angular projects.","bodyPreview":"# Angular Signal Forms\n\nBuild type-safe, reactive forms using Angular''s Signal Forms API. Signal Forms provide automatic two-way binding, schema-based validation, and reactive field state.\n\n**Note:** Signal Forms are experimental in Angular v21. For production apps requiring stability, see [references/form-patterns.md](references/form-patterns.md) for Reactive Forms patterns.\n\n## Basic Setup\n\n```typescript\nimport { Component, signal } from ''@angular/core'';\nimport { form, FormField, required, ema","body":"# Angular Signal Forms\n\nBuild type-safe, reactive forms using Angular''s Signal Forms API. Signal Forms provide automatic two-way binding, schema-based validation, and reactive field state.\n\n**Note:** Signal Forms are experimental in Angular v21. For production apps requiring stability, see [references/form-patterns.md](references/form-patterns.md) for Reactive Forms patterns.\n\n## Basic Setup\n\n```typescript\nimport { Component, signal } from ''@angular/core'';\nimport { form, FormField, required, email } from ''@angular/forms/signals'';\n\ninterface LoginData {\n  email: string;\n  password: string;\n}\n\n@Component({\n  selector: ''app-login'',\n  imports: [FormField],\n  template: `\n    <form (submit)=\"onSubmit($event)\">\n      <label>\n        Email\n        <input type=\"email\" [formField]=\"loginForm.email\" />\n      </label>\n      @if (loginForm.email().touched() && loginForm.email().invalid()) {\n        <p class=\"error\">{{ loginForm.email().errors()[0].message }}</p>\n      }\n      \n      <label>\n        Password\n        <input type=\"password\" [formField]=\"loginForm.password\" />\n      </label>\n      @if (loginForm.password().touched() && loginForm.password().invalid()) {\n        <p class=\"error\">{{ loginForm.password().errors()[0].message }}</p>\n      }\n      \n      <button type=\"submit\" [disabled]=\"loginForm().invalid()\">Login</button>\n    </form>\n  `,\n})\nexport class LoginComponent {\n  // Form model - a writable signal\n  loginModel = signal<LoginData>({\n    email: '''',\n    password: '''',\n  });\n  \n  // Create form with validation schema\n  loginForm = form(this.loginModel, (schemaPath) => {\n    required(schemaPath.email, { message: ''Email is required'' });\n    email(schemaPath.email, { message: ''Enter a valid email address'' });\n    required(schemaPath.password, { message: ''Password is required'' });\n  });\n  \n  onSubmit(event: Event) {\n    event.preventDefault();\n    if (this.loginForm().valid()) {\n      const credentials = this.loginModel();\n      console.log(''Submitting:'', credentials);\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Form Models\n\nForm models are writable signals that serve as the single source of truth:\n\n```typescript\n// Define interface for type safety\ninterface UserProfile {\n  name: string;\n  email: string;\n  age: number | null;\n  preferences: {\n    newsletter: boolean;\n    theme: ''light'' | ''dark'';\n  };\n}\n\n// Create model signal with initial values\nconst userModel = signal<UserProfile>({\n  name: '''',\n  email: '''',\n  age: null,\n  preferences: {\n    newsletter: false,\n    theme: ''light'',\n  },\n});\n\n// Create form from model\nconst userForm = form(userModel);\n\n// Access nested fields via dot notation\nuserForm.name                    // FieldTree<string>\nuserForm.preferences.theme       // FieldTree<''light'' | ''dark''>\n```\n\n### Reading Values\n\n```typescript\n// Read entire model\nconst data = this.userModel();\n\n// Read field value via field state\nconst name = this.userForm.name().value();\nconst theme = this.userForm.preferences.theme().value();\n```\n\n### Updating Values\n\n```typescript\n// Replace entire model\nthis.userModel.set({\n  name: ''Alice'',\n  email: ''alice@example.com'',\n  age: 30,\n  preferences: { newsletter: true, theme: ''dark'' },\n});\n\n// Update single field\nthis.userForm.name().value.set(''Bob'');\nthis.userForm.age().value.update(age => (age ?? 0) + 1);\n```\n\n## Field State\n\nEach field provides reactive signals for validation, interaction, and availability:\n\n```typescript\nconst emailField = this.form.email();\n\n// Validation state\nemailField.valid()      // true if passes all validation\nemailField.invalid()    // true if has validation errors\nemailField.errors()     // array of error objects\nemailField.pending()    // true if async validation in progress\n\n// Interaction state\nemailField.touched()    // true after focus + blur\nemailField.dirty()      // true after user modification\n\n// Availability state\nemailField.disabled()   // true if field is disabled\nemailField.hidden()     // true if field should be hidden\nemailField.readonly()   // true if field is readonly\n\n// Value\nemailField.value()      // current field value (signal)\n```\n\n### Form-Level State\n\nThe form itself is also a field with aggregated state:\n\n```typescript\n// Form is valid when all interactive fields are valid\nthis.form().valid()\n\n// Form is touched when any field is touched\nthis.form().touched()\n\n// Form is dirty when any field is modified\nthis.form().dirty()\n```\n\n## Validation\n\n### Built-in Validators\n\n```typescript\nimport { \n  form, required, email, min, max, \n  minLength, maxLength, pattern \n} from ''@angular/forms/signals'';\n\nconst userForm = form(this.userModel, (schemaPath) => {\n  // Required field\n  required(schemaPath.name, { message: ''Name is required'' });\n  \n  // Email format\n  email(schemaPath.email, { message: ''Invalid email'' });\n  \n  // Numeric range\n  min(schemaPath.age, 18, { message: ''Must be 18+'' });\n  max(schemaPath.age, 120, { message: ''Invalid age'' });\n  \n  // String/array length\n  minLength(schemaPath.password, 8, { message: ''Min 8 characters'' });\n  maxLength(schemaPath.bio, 500, { message: ''Max 500 characters'' });\n  \n  // Regex pattern\n  pattern(schemaPath.phone, /^\\d{3}-\\d{3}-\\d{4}$/, {\n    message: ''Format: 555-123-4567'',\n  });\n});\n```\n\n### Conditional Validation\n\n```typescript\nconst orderForm = form(this.orderModel, (schemaPath) => {\n  required(schemaPath.promoCode, {\n    message: ''Promo code required for discounts'',\n    when: ({ valueOf }) => valueOf(schemaPath.applyDiscount),\n  });\n});\n```\n\n### Custom Validators\n\n```typescript\nimport { validate } from ''@angular/forms/signals'';\n\nconst signupForm = form(this.signupModel, (schemaPath) => {\n  // Custom validation logic\n  validate(schemaPath.username, ({ value }) => {\n    if (value().includes('' '')) {\n      return { kind: ''noSpaces'', message: ''Username cannot contain spaces'' };\n    }\n    return null;\n  });\n});\n```\n\n### Cross-Field Validation\n\n```typescript\nconst passwordForm = form(this.passwordModel, (schemaPath) => {\n  required(schemaPath.password);\n  required(schemaPath.confirmPassword);\n  \n  // Compare fields\n  validate(schemaPath.confirmPassword, ({ value, valueOf }) => {\n    if (value() !== valueOf(schemaPath.password)) {\n      return { kind: ''mismatch'', message: ''Passwords do not match'' };\n    }\n    return null;\n  });\n});\n```\n\n### Async Validation\n\n```typescript\nimport { validateHttp } from ''@angular/forms/signals'';\n\nconst signupForm = form(this.signupModel, (schemaPath) => {\n  validateHttp(schemaPath.username, {\n    request: ({ value }) => `/api/check-username?u=${value()}`,\n    onSuccess: (response: { taken: boolean }) => {\n      if (response.taken) {\n        return { kind: ''taken'', message: ''Username already taken'' };\n      }\n      return null;\n    },\n    onError: () => ({\n      kind: ''networkError'',\n      message: ''Could not verify username'',\n    }),\n  });\n});\n```\n\n## Conditional Fields\n\n### Hidden Fields\n\n```typescript\nimport { hidden } from ''@angular/forms/signals'';\n\nconst profileForm = form(this.profileModel, (schemaPath) => {\n  hidden(schemaPath.publicUrl, ({ valueOf }) => !valueOf(schemaPath.isPublic));\n});\n```\n\n```html\n@if (!profileForm.publicUrl().hidden()) {\n  <input [formField]=\"profileForm.publicUrl\" />\n}\n```\n\n### Disabled Fields\n\n```typescript\nimport { disabled } from ''@angular/forms/signals'';\n\nconst orderForm = form(this.orderModel, (schemaPath) => {\n  disabled(schemaPath.couponCode, ({ valueOf }) => valueOf(schemaPath.total) < 50);\n});\n```\n\n### Readonly Fields\n\n```typescript\nimport { readonly } from ''@angular/forms/signals'';\n\nconst accountForm = form(this.accountModel, (schemaPath) => {\n  readonly(schemaPath.username); // Always readonly\n});\n```\n\n## Form Submission\n\n```typescript\nimport { submit } from ''@angular/forms/signals'';\n\n@Component({\n  template: `\n    <form (submit)=\"onSubmit($event)\">\n      <input [formField]=\"form.email\" />\n      <input [formField]=\"form.password\" />\n      <button type=\"submit\" [disabled]=\"form().invalid()\">Submit</button>\n    </form>\n  `,\n})\nexport class LoginComponent {\n  model = signal({ email: '''', password: '''' });\n  form = form(this.model, (schemaPath) => {\n    required(schemaPath.email);\n    required(schemaPath.password);\n  });\n  \n  onSubmit(event: Event) {\n    event.preventDefault();\n    \n    // submit() marks all fields touched and runs callback if valid\n    submit(this.form, async () => {\n      await this.authService.login(this.model());\n    });\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Arrays and Dynamic Fields\n\n```typescript\ninterface Order {\n  items: Array<{ product: string; quantity: number }>;\n}\n\n@Component({\n  template: `\n    @for (item of orderForm.items; track $index; let i = $index) {\n      <div>\n        <input [formField]=\"item.product\" placeholder=\"Product\" />\n        <input [formField]=\"item.quantity\" type=\"number\" />\n        <button type=\"button\" (click)=\"removeItem(i)\">Remove</button>\n      </div>\n    }\n    <button type=\"button\" (click)=\"addItem()\">Add Item</button>\n  `,\n})\nexport class OrderComponent {\n  orderModel = signal<Order>({\n    items: [{ product: '''', quantity: 1 }],\n  });\n  \n  orderForm = form(this.orderModel, (schemaPath) => {\n    applyEach(schemaPath.items, (item) => {\n      required(item.product, { message: ''Product required'' });\n      min(item.quantity, 1, { message: ''Min quantity is 1'' });\n    });\n  });\n  \n  addItem() {\n    this.orderModel.update(m => ({\n      ...m,\n      items: [...m.items, { product: '''', quantity: 1 }],\n    }));\n  }\n  \n  removeItem(index: number) {\n    this.orderModel.update(m => ({\n      ...m,\n      items: m.items.filter((_, i) => i !== index),\n    }));\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Displaying Errors\n\n```html\n<input [formField]=\"form.email\" />\n\n@if (form.email().touched() && form.email().invalid()) {\n  <ul class=\"errors\">\n    @for (error of form.email().errors(); track error) {\n      <li>{{ error.message }}</li>\n    }\n  </ul>\n}\n\n@if (form.email().pending()) {\n  <span>Validating...</span>\n}\n```\n\n## Styling Based on State\n\n```html\n<input\n  [formField]=\"form.email\"\n  [class.is-invalid]=\"form.email().touched() && form.email().invalid()\"\n  [class.is-valid]=\"form.email().touched() && form.email().valid()\"\n/>\n```\n\n## Reset Form\n\n```typescript\nasync onSubmit() {\n  if (!this.form().valid()) return;\n  \n  await this.api.submit(this.model());\n  \n  // Clear interaction state\n  this.form().reset();\n  \n  // Clear values\n  this.model.set({ email: '''', password: '''' });\n}\n```\n\nFor Reactive Forms patterns (production-stable), see [references/form-patterns.md](references/form-patterns.md).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:38:18.265Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents requiring advanced form handling and validation in Angular applications.","zh":"适合需要在Angular应用中高级表单处理和验证的前端代理。","ja":"Angularアプリケーションで高度なフォーム処理と検証を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Angular 애플리케이션에서 고급 폼 처리 및 유효성 검사를 요구하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes frontend que requieren un manejo y validación de formularios avanzados en aplicaciones de Angular.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents frontend nécessitant une gestion et une validation de formulaires avancées dans les applications Angular.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agents, die erweitertes Formular-Handling und Validierung in Angular-Anwendungen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend que requerem manipulação e validação avançada de formulários em aplicações Angular.","ru":"Идеально подходит для фронтенд-агентов, требующих расширенной обработки и валидации форм в приложениях Angular.","ar":"مثالي لواجهات العملاء الأمامية التي تتطلب معالجة متقدمة للنماذج والتحقق من صحتها في تطبيقات Angular."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build type-safe, reactive forms using Angular''s Signal Forms API, providing automatic two-way binding, schema-based validation, and reactive field state with libraries like @angular/core.","zh":"赋予代理构建类型安全、响应式表单，使用Angular的Signal Forms API，提供自动双向绑定、基于模式的验证和响应式字段状态，使用类似@angular/core的库。","ja":"エージェントがAngularのSignal Forms APIを使用して型安全でリアクティブなフォームを構築できるようにし、自動的な双方向バインディング、スキーマベースの検証、およびリアクティブなフィールド状態を提供し、@angular/coreなどのライブラリを使用します。","ko":"에이전트가 Angular의 Signal Forms API를 사용하여 유형 안전 및 반응형 폼을 구축할 수 있도록 하여 자동 두 방향 바인딩, 스키마 기반 유효성 검사 및 반응형 필드 상태를 제공하고 @angular/core와 같은 라이브러리를 사용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear formularios reactivos y seguros mediante la API de Signal Forms de Angular, proporcionando enlace bidireccional automático, validación basada en esquemas y estado de campo reactivo con bibliotecas como @angular/core.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des formulaires réactifs et sécurisés à l''aide de l''API Signal Forms d''Angular, offrant un lien bidirectionnel automatique, une validation basée sur des schémas et un état de champ réactif avec des bibliothèques comme @angular/core.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, type-sichere, reaktive Formulare mit der Signal Forms API von Angular zu erstellen, wodurch automatisches bidirektionales Binden, schema-basierte Validierung und reaktiver Feldzustand mit Bibliotheken wie @angular/core bereitgestellt werden.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a construir formulários reativos e com segurança de tipos usando a API Signal Forms do Angular, fornecendo vinculação bidirecional automática, validação baseada em esquema e estado de campo reativo com bibliotecas como @angular/core.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать типобезопасные реактивные формы с использованием API Signal Forms в Angular, обеспечивая автоматическую двустороннюю привязку, валидацию на основе схемы и реактивное состояние полей с библиотеками, такими как @angular/core.","ar":"يمكن الواجهات من بناء نماذج تفاعلية وآمنة النوع باستخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Signal Forms الخاصة بـ Angular، مما يوفر ربطًا ثنائي الاتجاه تلقائيًا، والتحقق من الصحة بناءً على المخطط، وحقل الحالة التفاعلي مع مكتبات مثل @angular/core."},"useCases":{"en":["Building complex, data-driven forms with automatic validation","Implementing reactive field state for real-time form updates","Generating schema-based validation for robust form handling"],"zh":["构建具有自动验证的复杂数据驱动表单","实现实时表单更新的响应式字段状态","生成基于模式的验证以进行强大的表单处理"],"ja":["自動検証を伴う複雑なデータ駆動フォームの構築","リアルタイムフォーム更新のためのリアクティブなフィールド状態の実装","堅牢なフォーム処理のためのスキーマベースの検証の生成"],"ko":["자동 유효성 검사를 갖춘 복잡한 데이터 주도 폼 구축","실시간 폼 업데이트 위한 반응형 필드 상태 구현","강력한 폼 처리를 위한 스키마 기반 유효성 검사 생성"],"es":["Crear formularios complejos y impulsados por datos con validación automática","Implementar estado de campo reactivo para actualizaciones de formularios en tiempo real","Generar validación basada en esquemas para un manejo de formularios robusto"],"fr":["Créer des formulaires complexes et axés sur les données avec validation automatique","Mettre en œuvre un état de champ réactif pour des mises à jour de formulaires en temps réel","Générer une validation basée sur des schémas pour une gestion de formulaires robuste"],"de":["Erstellen komplexer, datengetriebener Formulare mit automatischer Validierung","Implementieren reaktiver Feldzustände für Echtzeit-Formular-Updates","Generieren schema-basierter Validierung für robustes Formular-Handling"],"pt":["Construção de formulários complexos e orientados a dados com validação automática","Implementação de estado de campo reativo para atualizações de formulário em tempo real","Geração de validação baseada em esquema para manipulação robusta de formulários"],"ru":["Создание сложных форм, управляемых данными, с автоматической валидацией","Реализация реактивного состояния полей для обновления форм в реальном времени","Генерация валидации на основе схемы для надежной обработки форм"],"ar":["بناء نماذج معقدة تعتمد على البيانات مع التحقق التلقائي من الصحة","تنفيذ حالة الحقل التفاعلية للتحديثات الفورية للنماذج","إنشاء التحقق من الصحة بناءً على المخطط للمعالجة القوية للنماذج"]},"limitations":{"en":["Signal Forms are experimental in Angular v21","Requires Angular v21 or later for Signal Forms support"],"zh":["Signal Forms在Angular v21中是实验性的","需要Angular v21或更高版本才能支持Signal Forms"],"ja":["Signal FormsはAngular v21では実験的なものである","Signal FormsをサポートするにはAngular v21またはそれ以降が必要"],"ko":["Signal Forms는 Angular v21에서 실험적입니다","Signal Forms를 지원하려면 Angular v21 이상이 필요합니다"],"es":["Las Signal Forms son experimentales en Angular v21","Requiere Angular v21 o posterior para admitir Signal Forms"],"fr":["Les Signal Forms sont expérimentales dans Angular v21","Nécessite Angular v21 ou ultérieur pour prendre en charge les Signal Forms"],"de":["Signal Forms sind experimentell in Angular v21","Benötigt Angular v21 oder höher für die Unterstützung von Signal Forms"],"pt":["Signal Forms são experimentais no Angular v21","Requer Angular v21 ou posterior para suporte a Signal Forms"],"ru":["Signal Forms являются экспериментальными в Angular v21","Требуется Angular v21 или более поздняя версия для поддержки Signal Forms"],"ar":["Signal Forms تجريبية في Angular v21","يتطلب Angular v21 أو إصدار أحدث لدعم Signal Forms"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
