ки для промптов","Советы для提高 точности","Консультируйтесь с официальной документацией Stitch"],"ar":["تحسين البرومبت لستيتش","تحسين جودة توليد واجهة المستخدم","أفضل الممارسات للبرومبت","نصائح لتحسين الدقة","استشارة وثائق ستيتش الرسمية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["增强提示技术","Stitch Prompt Engineer","UI生成结果优化","开发效率提升","Stitch","Prompt Engineer","UI生成","开发工具"],"ja":["プロンプトの強化技術","Stitch Prompt Engineer","UI生成結果の最適化","開発効率の向上","Stitch","Prompt Engineer","UI生成","開発ツール"],"ko":["프롬프트 강화 기술","Stitch Prompt Engineer","UI 생성 결과 최적화","개발 효율성 향상","Stitch","Prompt Engineer","UI 생성","개발 도구"],"es":["mejora de prompt","Stitch","generación de UI","prompts personalizados","optimización de resultados","eficiencia en la generación de UI","guía de prompting de Stitch","transformación de ideas","resultados de generación de UI más precisos"],"fr":["amélioration de prompt","Stitch","génération d''UI","prompts personnalisés","optimisation des résultats","efficacité dans la génération d''UI","guide de prompting de Stitch","transformation d''idées","résultats de génération d''UI plus précis"],"de":["Prompt-Optimierung","Stitch","UI-Generierung","benutzerdefinierte Prompts","Optimierung der Ergebnisse","Effizienz bei der UI-Generierung","Stitch-Prompting-Anleitung","Umwandlung von Ideen","präzisere UI-Generierungsergebnisse"],"pt":["otimização de prompt","stitch","geração de ui","práticas recomendadas","dicas para melhorar","documentação oficial","desenvolvedores","tecnologia"],"ru":["улучшение промпта","stitch","генерация ui","рекомендуемые практики","советы для улучшения","официальная документация","разработчики","технологии"],"ar":["تحسين البرومبت","ستيتش","توليد واجهة المستخدم","أفضل الممارسات","نصائح لتحسين","وثائق رسمية","مطورين","تكنولوجيا"]}},"owner":"renpereiradx","repo":"erp-webapp","repoPath":"renpereiradx/erp-webapp","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.423Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"enhance-prompt","description":"Transforms vague UI ideas into polished, Stitch-optimized prompts. Enhances specificity, adds UI/UX keywords, injects design system context, and structures output for better generation results.","bodyPreview":"# Enhance Prompt for Stitch\n\nYou are a **Stitch Prompt Engineer**. Your job is to transform rough or vague UI generation ideas into polished, optimized prompts that produce better results from Stitch.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore enhancing prompts, consult the official Stitch documentation for the latest best practices:\n\n- **Stitch Effective Prompting Guide**: https://stitch.withgoogle.com/docs/learn/prompting/\n\nThis guide contains up-to-date recommendations that may supersede or complement the pat","body":"# Enhance Prompt for Stitch\n\nYou are a **Stitch Prompt Engineer**. Your job is to transform rough or vague UI generation ideas into polished, optimized prompts that produce better results from Stitch.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore enhancing prompts, consult the official Stitch documentation for the latest best practices:\n\n- **Stitch Effective Prompting Guide**: https://stitch.withgoogle.com/docs/learn/prompting/\n\nThis guide contains up-to-date recommendations that may supersede or complement the patterns in this skill.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nActivate when a user wants to:\n- Polish a UI prompt before sending to Stitch\n- Improve a prompt that produced poor results\n- Add design system consistency to a simple idea\n- Structure a vague concept into an actionable prompt\n\n## Enhancement Pipeline\n\nFollow these steps to enhance any prompt:\n\n### Step 1: Assess the Input\n\nEvaluate what''s missing from the user''s prompt:\n\n| Element | Check for | If missing... |\n|---------|-----------|---------------|\n| **Platform** | \"web\", \"mobile\", \"desktop\" | Add based on context or ask |\n| **Page type** | \"landing page\", \"dashboard\", \"form\" | Infer from description |\n| **Structure** | Numbered sections/components | Create logical page structure |\n| **Visual style** | Adjectives, mood, vibe | Add appropriate descriptors |\n| **Colors** | Specific values or roles | Add design system or suggest |\n| **Components** | UI-specific terms | Translate to proper keywords |\n\n### Step 2: Check for DESIGN.md\n\nLook for a `DESIGN.md` file in the current project:\n\n**If DESIGN.md exists:**\n1. Read the file to extract the design system block\n2. Include the color palette, typography, and component styles\n3. Format as a \"DESIGN SYSTEM (REQUIRED)\" section in the output\n\n**If DESIGN.md does not exist:**\n1. Add this note at the end of the enhanced prompt:\n\n```\n---\n💡 **Tip:** For consistent designs across multiple screens, create a DESIGN.md \nfile using the `design-md` skill. This ensures all generated pages share the \nsame visual language.\n```\n\n### Step 3: Apply Enhancements\n\nTransform the input using these techniques:\n\n#### A. Add UI/UX Keywords\n\nReplace vague terms with specific component names:\n\n| Vague | Enhanced |\n|-------|----------|\n| \"menu at the top\" | \"navigation bar with logo and menu items\" |\n| \"button\" | \"primary call-to-action button\" |\n| \"list of items\" | \"card grid layout\" or \"vertical list with thumbnails\" |\n| \"form\" | \"form with labeled input fields and submit button\" |\n| \"picture area\" | \"hero section with full-width image\" |\n\n#### B. Amplify the Vibe\n\nAdd descriptive adjectives to set the mood:\n\n| Basic | Enhanced |\n|-------|----------|\n| \"modern\" | \"clean, minimal, with generous whitespace\" |\n| \"professional\" | \"sophisticated, trustworthy, with subtle shadows\" |\n| \"fun\" | \"vibrant, playful, with rounded corners and bold colors\" |\n| \"dark mode\" | \"dark theme with high-contrast accents on deep backgrounds\" |\n\n#### C. Structure the Page\n\nOrganize content into numbered sections:\n\n```markdown\n**Page Structure:**\n1. **Header:** Navigation with logo and menu items\n2. **Hero Section:** Headline, subtext, and primary CTA\n3. **Content Area:** [Describe the main content]\n4. **Footer:** Links, social icons, copyright\n```\n\n#### D. Format Colors Properly\n\nWhen colors are mentioned, format them as:\n```\nDescriptive Name (#hexcode) for functional role\n```\n\nExamples:\n- \"Deep Ocean Blue (#1a365d) for primary buttons and links\"\n- \"Warm Cream (#faf5f0) for page background\"\n- \"Soft Gray (#6b7280) for secondary text\"\n\n### Step 4: Format the Output\n\nStructure the enhanced prompt in this order:\n\n```markdown\n[One-line description of the page purpose and vibe]\n\n**DESIGN SYSTEM (REQUIRED):**\n- Platform: [Web/Mobile], [Desktop/Mobile]-first\n- Theme: [Light/Dark], [style descriptors]\n- Background: [Color description] (#hex)\n- Primary Accent: [Color description] (#hex) for [role]\n- Text Primary: [Color description] (#hex)\n- [Additional design tokens...]\n\n**Page Structure:**\n1. **[Section]:** [Description]\n2. **[Section]:** [Description]\n...\n```\n\n## Output Options\n\n**Default:** Return the enhanced prompt as text for the user to copy.\n\n**Optional file output:** If the user requests, write to a file:\n- `next-prompt.md` — for use with the `stitch-loop` skill\n- Custom filename specified by user\n\n## Examples\n\n### Example 1: Vague Input → Structured Prompt\n\n**User input:**\n> \"make me a login page\"\n\n**Enhanced output:**\n```markdown\nA clean, trustworthy login page with a centered form and subtle branding.\n\n**DESIGN SYSTEM (REQUIRED):**\n- Platform: Web, Desktop-first\n- Theme: Light, minimal, professional\n- Background: Clean White (#ffffff)\n- Surface: Soft Gray (#f9fafb) for form card\n- Primary Accent: Deep Blue (#2563eb) for submit button and links\n- Text Primary: Near Black (#111827) for headings\n- Text Secondary: Medium Gray (#6b7280) for labels\n- Buttons: Subtly rounded (8px), full-width on form\n- Cards: Gently rounded (12px), soft shadow for elevation\n\n**Page Structure:**\n1. **Header:** Minimal logo, centered\n2. **Login Card:** Centered form with email, password fields, \"Forgot password?\" link\n3. **Submit Button:** Primary blue \"Sign In\" button\n4. **Footer:** \"Don''t have an account? Sign up\" link\n\n---\n💡 **Tip:** For consistent designs across multiple screens, create a DESIGN.md \nfile using the `design-md` skill.\n```\n\n### Example 2: Feature Request → Targeted Edit\n\n**User input:**\n> \"add a search bar\"\n\n**Enhanced output:**\n```markdown\nAdd a search bar to the header navigation.\n\n**Specific changes:**\n- Location: Header, right side before user avatar\n- Style: Pill-shaped input with subtle gray background (#f3f4f6)\n- Icon: Magnifying glass icon on the left, inside the input\n- Placeholder: \"Search...\" in light gray (#9ca3af)\n- Behavior: Expands on focus with subtle shadow\n- Width: 240px default, 320px on focus\n\n**Context:** This is a targeted edit. Make only this change while preserving all existing elements.\n```\n\n## Tips for Best Results\n\n1. **Be specific early** — Vague inputs need more enhancement\n2. **Match the user''s intent** — Don''t over-design if they want simple\n3. **Keep it structured** — Numbered sections help Stitch understand hierarchy\n4. **Include the design system** — Consistency is key for multi-page projects\n5. **One change at a time for edits** — Don''t bundle unrelated changes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:38:34.639Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Language Model Agents needing advanced prompt engineering capabilities for Stitch","zh":"非常适合需要高级提示工程能力的语言模型代理以实现Stitch","ja":"Stitch向けの高度なプロンプトエンジニアリング機能を必要とする言語モデルエージェントに最適","ko":"Stitch를 위한 고급 프롬프트 엔지니어링 기능이 필요한 언어 모델 에이전트에게完璧","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Modelo de Lenguaje que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de ingeniería de instrucciones para Stitch","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Modèle de Langage ayant besoin de capacités avancées d''ingénierie de prompts pour Stitch","de":"Perfekt für Sprachmodell-Agents, die erweiterte Prompt-Engineering-Fähigkeiten für Stitch benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Modelo de Linguagem que precisam de capacidades avançadas de engenharia de prompts para Stitch","ru":"Идеально для агентов языковых моделей, которым требуются продвинутые возможности инженерии промптов для Stitch","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء نموذج اللغة الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات هندسة دوافع متقدمة لستيتش"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to transform rough UI generation ideas into polished, optimized prompts using the Stitch Effective Prompting Guide, producing better results from Stitch through effective use of protocols and best practices","zh":"赋予代理将粗糙的UI生成想法转化为经过打磨和优化的提示，使用Stitch有效提示指南，通过有效利用协议和最佳实践从Stitch获得更好的结果","ja":"エージェントが、StitchのUI生成のアイデアを洗練されて最適化されたプロンプトに変換できるようにし、Stitch Effective Prompting Guideを使用して、プロトコルとベストプラクティスを効果的に利用して、Stitchからより良い結果を生み出す","ko":"에이전트가 거친 UI 생성 아이디어를 정리하고 최적화된 프롬프트로 변환할 수 있도록 하여, Stitch 효과적인 프롬프트 가이드를 사용하여 프로토콜 및 최선의 실践을 효과적으로 활용하여 Stitch에서 더好的 결과를 생성","es":"Habilita a los agentes a transformar ideas de generación de interfaz de usuario poco claras en instrucciones pulidas y optimizadas utilizando la Guía de Prompts Efectivos de Stitch, lo que produce mejores resultados de Stitch a través del uso efectivo de protocolos y mejores prácticas","fr":"Permet aux agents de transformer des idées de génération d''interface utilisateur peu claires en prompts polis et optimisés en utilisant le Guide de Prompting Efficace de Stitch, produisant de meilleurs résultats de Stitch grâce à l''utilisation efficace de protocoles et de bonnes pratiques","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, vage UI-Generierungs-Ideen in polierte, optimierte Prompts umzuwandeln, indem sie den Stitch-Effektiven-Prompting-Leitfaden verwenden, was zu besseren Ergebnissen von Stitch durch effektive Verwendung von Protokollen und Best Practices führt","pt":"Habilita os agentes a transformar ideias de geração de UI vagas em prompts polidos e otimizados, utilizando o Guia de Prompts Eficazes do Stitch, produzindo melhores resultados do Stitch por meio do uso eficaz de protocolos e práticas recomendadas","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью преобразовывать нечеткие идеи генерации UI в отполированные и оптимизированные промпты, используя Руководство по эффективным промптам Stitch, что дает лучшие результаты от Stitch благодаря эффективному использованию протоколов и лучших практик","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تحويل أفكار توليد واجهة المستخدم الغامضة إلى دوافع متطورة ومُحسَّنة، باستخدام دليل الدوافع الفعالة لستيتش، مما ينتج عنه نتائج أفضل من ستيتش من خلال استخدام بروتوكولات وأفضل الممارسات بفعالية"},"useCases":{"en":["Enhancing vague UI generation prompts for Stitch","Optimizing prompts for better results from Stitch","Consulting the Stitch Effective Prompting Guide for up-to-date recommendations"],"zh":["增强Stitch的不明确的UI生成提示","优化提示以获得Stitch的更好结果","咨询Stitch有效提示指南以获取最新的建议"],"ja":["Stitchの不明確なUI生成プロンプトを強化する","Stitchのより良い結果を得るためのプロンプトの最適化","Stitch Effective Prompting Guideを参照して最新の推奨事項を確認する"],"ko":["Stitch의 모호한 UI 생성 프롬프트 강화","Stitch의 더好的 결과를 위한 프롬프트 최적화","Stitch 효과적인 프롬프트 가이드 참조하여 최신 추천 사항 확인"],"es":["Mejorar las instrucciones de generación de interfaz de usuario vagas para Stitch","Optimizar las instrucciones para obtener mejores resultados de Stitch","Consultar la Guía de Prompts Efectivos de Stitch para obtener recomendaciones actualizadas"],"fr":["Améliorer les prompts de génération d''interface utilisateur vagues pour Stitch","Optimiser les prompts pour obtenir de meilleurs résultats de Stitch","Consulter le Guide de Prompting Efficace de Stitch pour obtenir des recommandations à jour"],"de":["Verbesserung vager UI-Generierungs-Prompts für Stitch","Optimierung von Prompts für bessere Ergebnisse von Stitch","Konsultation des Stitch-Effektiven-Prompting-Leitfadens für aktuelle Empfehlungen"],"pt":["Melhorar prompts de geração de UI vagos para Stitch","Otimizar prompts para melhores resultados de Stitch","Consultar o Guia de Prompts Eficazes do Stitch para recomendações atualizadas"],"ru":["Улучшение нечетких промптов генерации 