漠然とした UI 生成のアイデアを洗練された最適化されたプロンプトに変換すること","ko":"Stitch 프롬프트 강화는 거친 또는 모호한 UI 생성 아이디어를 정교하고 최적화된 프롬프트로 변환하는 것","es":"El enhance-prompt es una habilidad que permite a los ingenieros de Stitch transformar ideas de generación de UI vagas en prompts optimizados","fr":"L''amélioration de prompt est une compétence qui permet aux ingénieurs Stitch de transformer des idées de génération d''UI vagues en prompts optimisés","de":"Die Prompt-Optimierung ist eine Fähigkeit, die es Ingenieuren von Stitch ermöglicht, vage UI-Generierungs-Ideen in optimierte Prompts umzuwandeln","pt":"Otimizar prompts para Stitch é fundamental para obter resultados precisos. Aprenda a criar prompts eficazes com nosso guia","ru":"Улучшение промптов для Stitch является важным для получения точных результатов. Узнайте, как создать эффективные промпты с помощью нашего руководства","ar":"تحسين البرومتات لستيتش ضروري لتحقيق نتائج دقيقة. تعلم كيفية إنشاء برومتات فعالة مع دليلنا","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["优化 UI 生成结果","精致的提示工程","Stitch 官方文档集成","最新的最佳实践","提高 UI 生成效率","简化提示创建过程"],"ja":["UI 生成結果の最適化","洗練されたプロンプトエンジニアリング","Stitch 公式ドキュメント統合","最新のベストプラクティス","UI 生成の効率の向上","プロンプト作成プロセスの簡素化"],"ko":["UI 생성 결과 최적화","정교한 프롬프트 엔지니어링","Stitch 공식 문서 통합","최신의 최적화된 방법","UI 생성 효율성 향상","프롬프트 생성 프로세스 단순화"],"es":["Transformación de ideas de generación de UI vagas en prompts optimizados","Mejora de la calidad de los resultados de generación de UI","Optimización de prompts según las últimas recomendaciones de Stitch","Guía para ingenieros de Stitch","Integración con la documentación oficial de Stitch"],"fr":["Transformation d''idées de génération d''UI vagues en prompts optimisés","Amélioration de la qualité des résultats de génération d''UI","Optimisation de prompts selon les dernières recommandations de Stitch","Guide pour les ingénieurs Stitch","Intégration avec la documentation officielle de Stitch"],"de":["Umwandlung von vagen UI-Generierungs-Ideen in optimierte Prompts","Verbesserung der Qualität der UI-Generierungs-Ergebnisse","Optimierung von Prompts gemäß den neuesten Empfehlungen von Stitch","Leitfaden für Stitch-Ingenieure","Integration mit der offiziellen Stitch-Dokumentation"],"pt":["Criação de prompts claros e concisos","Otimização de prompts para resultados precisos","Utilização do guia de prompts eficazes da Stitch","Melhoria da eficácia dos prompts com práticas recomendadas","Integração com a documentação oficial da Stitch"],"ru":["Создание ясных и кратких промптов","Улучшение промптов для точных результатов","Использование руководства по эффективным промптам Stitch","Улучшение эффективности промптов с помощью рекомендуемых практик","Интеграция с официальной документацией Stitch"],"ar":["إنشاء برومتات واضحة وموجزة","تحسين البرومتات لنتائج دقيقة","استخدام دليل البرومتات الفعالة لستيتش","تحسين فعالية البرومتات مع الممارسات الموصى بها","التكامل مع الوثائق الرسمية لستيتش"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Stitch 提升提示","UI 生成优化","提示工程","Stitch 官方文档","最佳实践","UI 生成效率","提示创建"],"ja":["Stitch プロンプトの強化","UI 生成の最適化","プロンプトエンジニアリング","Stitch 公式ドキュメント","ベストプラクティス","UI 生成の効率","プロンプト作成"],"ko":["Stitch 프롬프트 강화","UI 생성 최적화","프롬프트 엔지니어링","Stitch 공식 문서","최적의 방법","UI 생성 효율성","프롬프트 생성"],"es":["enhance-prompt","Stitch","generación de UI","ingenieros de Stitch","optimización de prompts","guía para ingenieros","documentación oficial de Stitch","mejora de la calidad de los resultados"],"fr":["amélioration de prompt","Stitch","génération d''UI","ingénieurs Stitch","optimisation de prompts","guide pour ingénieurs","documentation officielle de Stitch","amélioration de la qualité des résultats"],"de":["Prompt-Optimierung","Stitch","UI-Generierung","Stitch-Ingenieure","Optimierung von Prompts","Leitfaden für Ingenieure","offizielle Stitch-Dokumentation","Verbesserung der Qualität der Ergebnisse"],"pt":["otimização de prompts","stitch","prompts eficazes","resultados precisos","guias de prompts","documentação oficial","práticas recomendadas","desenvolvedores","tecnologia"],"ru":["улучшение промптов","stitch","эффективные промпты","точные результаты","руководство по промптам","официальная документация","рекомендуемые практики","разработчики","технологии"],"ar":["تحسين البرومتات","ستيتش","برومتات فعالة","نتائج دقيقة","دليل البرومتات","الوثائق الرسمية","الممارسات الموصى بها","المطورون","التكنولوجيا"]}},"owner":"ksolomon68","repo":"CaltransBizConnect","repoPath":"ksolomon68/CaltransBizConnect","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.423Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"enhance-prompt","description":"Transforms vague UI ideas into polished, Stitch-optimized prompts. Enhances specificity, adds UI/UX keywords, injects design system context, and structures output for better generation results.","bodyPreview":"# Enhance Prompt for Stitch\n\nYou are a **Stitch Prompt Engineer**. Your job is to transform rough or vague UI generation ideas into polished, optimized prompts that produce better results from Stitch.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore enhancing prompts, consult the official Stitch documentation for the latest best practices:\n\n- **Stitch Effective Prompting Guide**: https://stitch.withgoogle.com/docs/learn/prompting/\n\nThis guide contains up-to-date recommendations that may supersede or complement the pat","body":"# Enhance Prompt for Stitch\n\nYou are a **Stitch Prompt Engineer**. Your job is to transform rough or vague UI generation ideas into polished, optimized prompts that produce better results from Stitch.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore enhancing prompts, consult the official Stitch documentation for the latest best practices:\n\n- **Stitch Effective Prompting Guide**: https://stitch.withgoogle.com/docs/learn/prompting/\n\nThis guide contains up-to-date recommendations that may supersede or complement the patterns in this skill.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nActivate when a user wants to:\n- Polish a UI prompt before sending to Stitch\n- Improve a prompt that produced poor results\n- Add design system consistency to a simple idea\n- Structure a vague concept into an actionable prompt\n\n## Enhancement Pipeline\n\nFollow these steps to enhance any prompt:\n\n### Step 1: Assess the Input\n\nEvaluate what''s missing from the user''s prompt:\n\n| Element | Check for | If missing... |\n|---------|-----------|---------------|\n| **Platform** | \"web\", \"mobile\", \"desktop\" | Add based on context or ask |\n| **Page type** | \"landing page\", \"dashboard\", \"form\" | Infer from description |\n| **Structure** | Numbered sections/components | Create logical page structure |\n| **Visual style** | Adjectives, mood, vibe | Add appropriate descriptors |\n| **Colors** | Specific values or roles | Add design system or suggest |\n| **Components** | UI-specific terms | Translate to proper keywords |\n\n### Step 2: Check for DESIGN.md\n\nLook for a `DESIGN.md` file in the current project:\n\n**If DESIGN.md exists:**\n1. Read the file to extract the design system block\n2. Include the color palette, typography, and component styles\n3. Format as a \"DESIGN SYSTEM (REQUIRED)\" section in the output\n\n**If DESIGN.md does not exist:**\n1. Add this note at the end of the enhanced prompt:\n\n```\n---\n💡 **Tip:** For consistent designs across multiple screens, create a DESIGN.md \nfile using the `design-md` skill. This ensures all generated pages share the \nsame visual language.\n```\n\n### Step 3: Apply Enhancements\n\nTransform the input using these techniques:\n\n#### A. Add UI/UX Keywords\n\nReplace vague terms with specific component names:\n\n| Vague | Enhanced |\n|-------|----------|\n| \"menu at the top\" | \"navigation bar with logo and menu items\" |\n| \"button\" | \"primary call-to-action button\" |\n| \"list of items\" | \"card grid layout\" or \"vertical list with thumbnails\" |\n| \"form\" | \"form with labeled input fields and submit button\" |\n| \"picture area\" | \"hero section with full-width image\" |\n\n#### B. Amplify the Vibe\n\nAdd descriptive adjectives to set the mood:\n\n| Basic | Enhanced |\n|-------|----------|\n| \"modern\" | \"clean, minimal, with generous whitespace\" |\n| \"professional\" | \"sophisticated, trustworthy, with subtle shadows\" |\n| \"fun\" | \"vibrant, playful, with rounded corners and bold colors\" |\n| \"dark mode\" | \"dark theme with high-contrast accents on deep backgrounds\" |\n\n#### C. Structure the Page\n\nOrganize content into numbered sections:\n\n```markdown\n**Page Structure:**\n1. **Header:** Navigation with logo and menu items\n2. **Hero Section:** Headline, subtext, and primary CTA\n3. **Content Area:** [Describe the main content]\n4. **Footer:** Links, social icons, copyright\n```\n\n#### D. Format Colors Properly\n\nWhen colors are mentioned, format them as:\n```\nDescriptive Name (#hexcode) for functional role\n```\n\nExamples:\n- \"Deep Ocean Blue (#1a365d) for primary buttons and links\"\n- \"Warm Cream (#faf5f0) for page background\"\n- \"Soft Gray (#6b7280) for secondary text\"\n\n### Step 4: Format the Output\n\nStructure the enhanced prompt in this order:\n\n```markdown\n[One-line description of the page purpose and vibe]\n\n**DESIGN SYSTEM (REQUIRED):**\n- Platform: [Web/Mobile], [Desktop/Mobile]-first\n- Theme: [Light/Dark], [style descriptors]\n- Background: [Color description] (#hex)\n- Primary Accent: [Color description] (#hex) for [role]\n- Text Primary: [Color description] (#hex)\n- [Additional design tokens...]\n\n**Page Structure:**\n1. **[Section]:** [Description]\n2. **[Section]:** [Description]\n...\n```\n\n## Output Options\n\n**Default:** Return the enhanced prompt as text for the user to copy.\n\n**Optional file output:** If the user requests, write to a file:\n- `next-prompt.md` — for use with the `stitch-loop` skill\n- Custom filename specified by user\n\n## Examples\n\n### Example 1: Vague Input → Structured Prompt\n\n**User input:**\n> \"make me a login page\"\n\n**Enhanced output:**\n```markdown\nA clean, trustworthy login page with a centered form and subtle branding.\n\n**DESIGN SYSTEM (REQUIRED):**\n- Platform: Web, Desktop-first\n- Theme: Light, minimal, professional\n- Background: Clean White (#ffffff)\n- Surface: Soft Gray (#f9fafb) for form card\n- Primary Accent: Deep Blue (#2563eb) for submit button and links\n- Text Primary: Near Black (#111827) for headings\n- Text Secondary: Medium Gray (#6b7280) for labels\n- Buttons: Subtly rounded (8px), full-width on form\n- Cards: Gently rounded (12px), soft shadow for elevation\n\n**Page Structure:**\n1. **Header:** Minimal logo, centered\n2. **Login Card:** Centered form with email, password fields, \"Forgot password?\" link\n3. **Submit Button:** Primary blue \"Sign In\" button\n4. **Footer:** \"Don''t have an account? Sign up\" link\n\n---\n💡 **Tip:** For consistent designs across multiple screens, create a DESIGN.md \nfile using the `design-md` skill.\n```\n\n### Example 2: Feature Request → Targeted Edit\n\n**User input:**\n> \"add a search bar\"\n\n**Enhanced output:**\n```markdown\nAdd a search bar to the header navigation.\n\n**Specific changes:**\n- Location: Header, right side before user avatar\n- Style: Pill-shaped input with subtle gray background (#f3f4f6)\n- Icon: Magnifying glass icon on the left, inside the input\n- Placeholder: \"Search...\" in light gray (#9ca3af)\n- Behavior: Expands on focus with subtle shadow\n- Width: 240px default, 320px on focus\n\n**Context:** This is a targeted edit. Make only this change while preserving all existing elements.\n```\n\n## Tips for Best Results\n\n1. **Be specific early** — Vague inputs need more enhancement\n2. **Match the user''s intent** — Don''t over-design if they want simple\n3. **Keep it structured** — Numbered sections help Stitch understand hierarchy\n4. **Include the design system** — Consistency is key for multi-page projects\n5. **One change at a time for edits** — Don''t bundle unrelated changes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:38:46.051Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Language Model Agents like Claude Code, AutoGPT, and LangChain needing to refine user inputs into effective prompts.","zh":"适用于Claude Code、AutoGPT和LangChain等语言模型代理，需要将用户输入细化为有效的提示。","ja":"Claude Code、AutoGPT、LangChainなどの言語モデルエージェントに適しており、ユーザーの入力を効果的なプロンプトに洗練する必要があります。","ko":"Claude Code, AutoGPT, LangChain 등의 언어 모델 에이전트에 적합하며, 사용자 입력을 효과적인 프롬프트로 정제하는 데 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de modelo de lenguaje como Claude Code, AutoGPT y LangChain que necesitan perfeccionar las entradas de los usuarios en llamadas efectivas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de modèle de langage comme Claude Code, AutoGPT et LangChain qui ont besoin d''affiner les entrées des utilisateurs en invites efficaces.","de":"Ideal für Sprachmodellagenten wie Claude Code, AutoGPT und LangChain, die Benutzereingaben in effektive Prompts verfeinern müssen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Modelo de Linguagem, como Claude Code, AutoGPT e LangChain, que precisam refinar as entradas do usuário em prompts eficazes.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов языковых моделей, таких как Claude Code, AutoGPT и LangChain, которым необходимо доработать пользовательские входные данные в эффективные промпты.","ar":"مثالي لعميل نموذج اللغة مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT و LangChain الذين يحتاجون إلى تحسين إدخالات المستخدم إلى إشعارات فعالة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to transform rough or vague UI generation ideas into polished, optimized prompts that produce better results from Stitch, leveraging the Stitch Effective Prompting Guide and best practices for prompt engineering, including understanding of protocols and documentation.","zh":"赋予代理将粗糙或模糊的UI生成想法转化为精致、优化的提示，使得从Stitch获得更好的结果，利用Stitch有效提示指南和提示工程的最佳实践，包括对协议和文档的理解。","ja":"エージェントに、煩雑または曖昧なUI生成のアイデアを、洗練された最適化されたプロンプトに変換する力を与え、Stitch Effective Prompting Guideとプロンプトエンジニアリングのベストプラクティスを利用し、プロトコルとドキュメントの理解を利用して、Stitchからより良い結果を取得します。","ko":"에이전트가 조잡하거나 모호한 UI 생성 아이디어를 정교하고 최적화된 프롬프트로 변환할 수 있도록 해주어, 스티치에서 더好的 결과를 얻을 수 있으며, 스티치 효과적인 프롬프트 가이드와 프롬프트 엔지니어링의 모범 사례를 利用하며, 프로토콜과 문서에 대한 이해를 포함합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes transformar ideas de generación de UI poco claras o vagas en llamadas pulidas y optimizadas que producen mejores resultados de Stitch, aprovechando la Guía de llamadas efectivas de Stitch y las mejores prácticas para la ingeniería de llamadas, incluyendo la comprensión de protocolos y documentación.","fr":"Permet aux agents de transformer des idées de génération d''UI peu claires ou vagues en invites polies et optimisées qui produisent de meilleurs résultats de Stitch, en exploitant le Guide de prompts efficaces de Stitch et les meilleures pratiques pour l''ingénierie de prompts, y compris la compréhension des protocoles et de la documentation.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, grobe oder vage UI-Generierungs-Ideen in polierte, optimierte Prompts umzuwandeln, die bessere Ergebnisse von Stitch liefern, indem sie den Stitch-Leitfaden für effektive Prompts und die besten Praktiken für Prompt-Engineering nutzen, einschließlich des Verständnisses von Protokollen und Dokumentation.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a transformar ideias de geração de UI vagas ou grosseiras em prompts polidos e otimizados que produzem melhores resultados do Stitch, aproveitando o Guia de Prompting Eficaz do Stitch e as melhores práticas para engenharia de prompts, incluindo compreensão de protocolos e documentação.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью преобразовывать грубые или неясные идеи генерации UI в отполированные и оптимизированные промпты, которые дают лучшие результаты от Stitch, используя Руководство по эффективному промптингу Stitch и лучшие практики инженерии промптов, включая понимание протоколов и документации.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تحويل أفكار توليد واجهة المستخدم الغامضة أو الخشنة إلى إشعارات منقحة ومُحسنة تُنتج نتائج أفضل من Stitch، مستفيدة من دليل التوجيه الفعال لبرنامج Stitch وأفضل الممارسات للهندسة الإرشادية، بما في ذلك فهم البروتوكولات والتوثيق."},"useCases":{"en":["Refining vague user requests into actionable prompts","Optimizing prompts for better Stitch output","Consulting the Stitch Effective Prompting Guide for up-to-date recommendations"],"zh":["将模糊的用户请求细化为可行的提示","优化提示以获得更好的Stitch输出","咨询Stitch有效提示指南以获取最新的推荐"],"ja":["ユーザーの曖昧なリクエストを実行可能なプロンプトに洗練する","プロンプトを最適化してStitchの出力を向上させる","StitchEffective Prompting Guideを参照して最新の推奨事項を入手する"],"ko":["모호한 사용자 요청을 실행 가능한 프롬프트로 정제하는 것","프롬프트를 최적화하여 스티치 출력을 개선하는 것","스티치 효과적인 프롬프트 가이드를 참고하여 최신 추천을 얻는 것"],"es":["Perfeccionar las solicitudes de usuario vagas en llamadas accionables","Optimizar las llamadas para una mejor salida de Stitch","Consultar la Guía de llamadas efectivas de Stitch para obtener recomendaciones actualizadas"],"fr":["Affiner les demandes d''utilisateurs vagues en invites actionnables","Optimiser les invites pour une meilleure sortie de Stitch","Consulter le Guide de prompts efficaces de Stitch pour obtenir des recommandations à jour"],"de":["Verfeinern von vagen Benutzernanfragen in handhabbare Prompts","Optimieren von Prompts für eine bessere Stitch-Ausgabe","Konsultieren des Stitch-Leitfadens für effektive Prompts für aktuelle Empfehlungen"],"pt":["Refinamento de solicitações vagas do usuário em prompts atuáveis","Otimização de prompts para melhor saída do Stitch","Consultar o Guia de Prompting Eficaz do Stitch para recomendações atualizadas"],"ru":["Уточнение неясных запросов пользователя в действенные промпты","Оптимизация промптов для лучшего вывода Stitch","Консультирование по Руководству по эффективному промптингу Stitch для получения актуальных рекомендаций"],"ar":["تحسين الطلبات الغامضة للمستخدم إلى إشعارات قابلة للتنفيذ","تحسين الإشعارات لتحقيق نتائج أفضل من Stitch","استشارة دليل التوجيه الفعال لبرنامج Stitch للحصول على توصيات محدثة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires consultation of the Stitch Effective Prompting Guide","Stitch-specific prompting knowledge needed"],"zh":["需要咨询Stitch有效提示指南","需要针对Stitch的提示知识"],"ja":["Stitch Effective Prompting Guideの参照が必要","Stitch特有のプロンプト知識が必要"],"ko":["스티치 효과적인 프롬프트 가이드를 참고해야 하는 것","스티치에 대한 프롬프트 지식이 필요한 것"],"es":["Requiere la consulta de la Guía de llamadas efectivas de Stitch","Se necesita conocimiento de llamadas específicas de Stitch"],"fr":["Nécessite la consultation du Guide de prompts efficaces de Stitch","Connaissances de prompts spécifiques à Stitch nécessaires"],"de":["Erfordert die Konsultation des Stitch-Leitfadens für effektive Prompts","Stitch-spezifisches Prompt-Wissen erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer consulta do Guia de Prompting Eficaz do Stitch","Conhecimento de prompting específico do Stitch necessário"],"ru":["Требует консультации Руководства по эффективному промптингу Stitch","Необходимо знание промптинга, специфичного для Stitch"],"ar":["يتطلب استشارة دليل التوجيه الفعال لبرنامج Stitch","مطلوب معرفة التوجيه الخاصة ببرنامج Stitch"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
