ка видео","открытая платформа","Three.js","React Three Fiber"],"ar":["Remotion","أفضل الممارسات","3D","الرسوم المتحركة","استيراد الأصول","تطوير الفيديو","منصة مفتوحة المصدر","Three.js","React Three Fiber"]}},"owner":"Satoshi-Niina","repo":"Emergency-Assistance-google","repoPath":"Satoshi-Niina/Emergency-Assistance-google","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.423Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"remotion-best-practices","description":"Best practices for Remotion - Video creation in React","tags":"remotion, video, react, animation, composition","bodyPreview":"## When to use\n\nUse this skills whenever you are dealing with Remotion code to obtain the domain-specific knowledge.\n\n## How to use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [rules/3d.md](rules/3d.md) - 3D content in Remotion using Three.js and React Three Fiber\n- [rules/animations.md](rules/animations.md) - Fundamental animation skills for Remotion\n- [rules/assets.md](rules/assets.md) - Importing images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion\n- [rules/audio.md]","body":"## When to use\n\nUse this skills whenever you are dealing with Remotion code to obtain the domain-specific knowledge.\n\n## How to use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [rules/3d.md](rules/3d.md) - 3D content in Remotion using Three.js and React Three Fiber\n- [rules/animations.md](rules/animations.md) - Fundamental animation skills for Remotion\n- [rules/assets.md](rules/assets.md) - Importing images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion\n- [rules/audio.md](rules/audio.md) - Using audio and sound in Remotion - importing, trimming, volume, speed, pitch\n- [rules/calculate-metadata.md](rules/calculate-metadata.md) - Dynamically set composition duration, dimensions, and props\n- [rules/can-decode.md](rules/can-decode.md) - Check if a video can be decoded by the browser using Mediabunny\n- [rules/charts.md](rules/charts.md) - Chart and data visualization patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/compositions.md](rules/compositions.md) - Defining compositions, stills, folders, default props and dynamic metadata\n- [rules/display-captions.md](rules/display-captions.md) - Displaying captions in Remotion with TikTok-style pages and word highlighting\n- [rules/extract-frames.md](rules/extract-frames.md) - Extract frames from videos at specific timestamps using Mediabunny\n- [rules/fonts.md](rules/fonts.md) - Loading Google Fonts and local fonts in Remotion\n- [rules/get-audio-duration.md](rules/get-audio-duration.md) - Getting the duration of an audio file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-dimensions.md](rules/get-video-dimensions.md) - Getting the width and height of a video file with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-duration.md](rules/get-video-duration.md) - Getting the duration of a video file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/gifs.md](rules/gifs.md) - Displaying GIFs synchronized with Remotion''s timeline\n- [rules/images.md](rules/images.md) - Embedding images in Remotion using the Img component\n- [rules/import-srt-captions.md](rules/import-srt-captions.md) - Importing .srt subtitle files into Remotion using @remotion/captions\n- [rules/lottie.md](rules/lottie.md) - Embedding Lottie animations in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md](rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md) - Measuring DOM element dimensions in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-text.md](rules/measuring-text.md) - Measuring text dimensions, fitting text to containers, and checking overflow\n- [rules/sequencing.md](rules/sequencing.md) - Sequencing patterns for Remotion - delay, trim, limit duration of items\n- [rules/tailwind.md](rules/tailwind.md) - Using TailwindCSS in Remotion\n- [rules/text-animations.md](rules/text-animations.md) - Typography and text animation patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/timing.md](rules/timing.md) - Interpolation curves in Remotion - linear, easing, spring animations\n- [rules/transcribe-captions.md](rules/transcribe-captions.md) - Transcribing audio to generate captions in Remotion\n- [rules/transitions.md](rules/transitions.md) - Scene transition patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/trimming.md](rules/trimming.md) - Trimming patterns for Remotion - cut the beginning or end of animations\n- [rules/videos.md](rules/videos.md) - Embedding videos in Remotion - trimming, volume, speed, looping, pitch\n- [rules/parameters.md](rules/parameters.md) - Make a video parametrizable by adding a Zod schema\n- [rules/maps.md](rules/maps.md) - Add a map using Mapbox and animate it\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:39:24.202Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Video Generation Agents needing advanced Remotion capabilities and domain-specific knowledge.","zh":"适用于需要高级Remotion功能和特定领域知识的视频生成代理。","ja":"高度なRemotion機能とドメイン固有の知識を必要とするビデオ生成エージェントに適しています。","ko":"고급 Remotion 기능과 특정 도메인 지식을 필요로 하는 비디오 생성 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Generación de Video que necesitan capacidades de Remotion avanzadas y conocimientos específicos del dominio.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de génération de vidéos ayant besoin de capacités de Remotion avancées et de connaissances spécifiques au domaine.","de":"Perfekt für Video-Generierungsagenten, die erweiterte Remotion-Fähigkeiten und domänen-spezifisches Wissen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Geração de Vídeo que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de Remotion e conhecimento específico de domínio.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов генерации видео, которым требуются продвинутые возможности Remotion и специфические знания в области.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات génération الفيديو التي تحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة من Remotion ومعارف محددة لمنطقة معينة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create complex animations using Three.js and React Three Fiber, import various assets such as images, videos, and fonts, and leverage fundamental animation skills for Remotion, all while following best practices for 3D content and audio integration.","zh":"赋予代理创建使用Three.js和React Three Fiber的复杂动画的能力，导入诸如图像、视频和字体等各种资产，并利用Remotion的基本动画技能，同时遵循3D内容和音频集成的最佳实践。","ja":"Three.jsとReact Three Fiberを使用した複雑なアニメーションを作成するエージェントの能力を与え、画像、ビデオ、フォントなどの様々なアセットをインポートし、Remotionの基本的なアニメーションスキルを利用し、同時に3Dコンテンツとオーディオ統合のベストプラクティスに従う。","ko":"에이전트가 Three.js와 React Three Fiber를 사용하여 복잡한 애니메이션을 생성하고 이미지, 비디오, 글꼴 등의 다양한 자산을 가져오고 Remotion의 기본 애니메이션 기술을 활용하며 3D 콘텐츠와 오디오 통합의 모범 사례를 따르는 능력을 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear animaciones complejas utilizando Three.js y React Three Fiber, importar varios activos como imágenes, vídeos y fuentes, y aprovechar habilidades de animación fundamentales para Remotion, todo mientras sigue las mejores prácticas para contenido 3D y integración de audio.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des animations complexes en utilisant Three.js et React Three Fiber, d''importer divers actifs tels que des images, des vidéos et des polices, et de tirer parti des compétences en animation fondamentales pour Remotion, le tout en suivant les meilleures pratiques pour le contenu 3D et l''intégration audio.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, komplexe Animationen mit Three.js und React Three Fiber zu erstellen, verschiedene Assets wie Bilder, Videos und Schriftarten zu importieren und grundlegende Animationsfähigkeiten für Remotion zu nutzen, und zwar unter Einhaltung der besten Praktiken für 3D-Inhalte und Audio-Integration.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar animações complexas usando Three.js e React Three Fiber, importar vários ativos como imagens, vídeos e fontes, e aproveitar habilidades de animação fundamentais para Remotion, seguindo as melhores práticas para conteúdo 3D e integração de áudio.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать сложные анимации с помощью Three.js и React Three Fiber, импортировать различные активы, такие как изображения, видео и шрифты, и использовать фундаментальные навыки анимации для Remotion, следуя лучшим практикам для контента 3D и интеграции аудио.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من إنشاء رسوم متحركة معقدة باستخدام Three.js و React Three Fiber، واستيراد مختلف Assets مثل الصور والفيديوهات والخطوط، وتسخير المهارات الأساسية للرسوم المتحركة لبرنامج Remotion، مع اتباع أفضل الممارسات لتحويل المحتوى ثلاثي الأبعاد وتكامل الصوت."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating 3D animations with Remotion","Importing and utilizing assets like images and videos","Debugging and optimizing Remotion project animations"],"zh":["使用Remotion生成3D动画","导入和利用诸如图像和视频等资产","调试和优化Remotion项目动画"],"ja":["Remotionを使用した3Dアニメーションの生成","画像やビデオなどのアセットのインポートと利用","Remotionプロジェクトのアニメーションのデバッグと最適化"],"ko":["Remotion을 사용한 3D 애니메이션 생성","이미지나 비디오 등의 자산을 가져오고 사용하기","Remotion 프로젝트 애니메이션의 디버깅과 최적화"],"es":["Generación de animaciones 3D con Remotion","Importación y utilización de activos como imágenes y vídeos","Depuración y optimización de animaciones de proyectos de Remotion"],"fr":["Génération d''animations 3D avec Remotion","Importation et utilisation d''actifs tels que des images et des vidéos","Débogage et optimisation des animations de projets Remotion"],"de":["Erstellung von 3D-Animationen mit Remotion","Import und Nutzung von Assets wie Bildern und Videos","Fehlerbehebung und Optimierung von Remotion-Projekt-Animationen"],"pt":["Geração de animações 3D com Remotion","Importação e utilização de ativos como imagens e vídeos","Depuração e otimização de animações de projetos Remotion"],"ru":["Генерация 3D-анимаций с помощью Remotion","Импорт и использование активов, таких как изображения и видео","Отладка и оптимизация анимаций проектов Remotion"],"ar":["إنشاء رسوم متحركة ثلاثية الأبعاد باستخدام برنامج Remotion","استيراد واستخدام Assets مثل الصور والفيديوهات","تصحيح الأخطاء وتحسين رسوم متحركة لمشاريع برنامج Remotion"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Remotion codebase access","Limited to Remotion-specific applications"],"zh":["需要Remotion代码库访问","仅限Remotion特定应用"],"ja":["Remotionコードベースへのアクセスが必要","Remotion特有のアプリケーションに限定"],"ko":["Remotion 코드베이스에 대한 액세스가 필요","Remotion 전용 응용 프로그램으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la base de código de Remotion","Limitado a aplicaciones específicas de Remotion"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la base de code de Remotion","Limité aux applications spécifiques à Remotion"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf den Remotion-Codebasis","Befristet auf Remotion-spezifische Anwendungen"],"pt":["Requer acesso à base de código Remotion","Limitado a aplicações específicas de Remotion"],"ru":["Требует доступа к кодовой базе Remotion","Ограничен для применения в приложениях, специфичных для Remotion"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى قاعدة الشفرة Remotion","محدود لتطبيقات محددة لبرنامج Remotion"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
