"],"ru":["Использование 3D с Three.js и React Three Fiber","Фундаментальные анимации для Remotion","Импорт изображений, видео, аудио и шрифтов","Пример кода для каждой правила","Дetailed документация для каждого функции"],"ar":["استخدام 3D مع Three.js و React Three Fiber","الرسوم المتحركة الأساسية ل Remotion","استيراد الصور والفيديوهات والصوت والخطوط","كود مثال لكل قاعدة","وثائق مفصلة لكل ميزة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Remotion","最佳实践","3D内容","动画","资产","音频","开发效率"],"ja":["Remotion","ベストプラクティス","3Dコンテンツ","動画","資産","音声","開発効率"],"ko":["Remotion","최상의 관행","3D 콘텐츠","애니메이션","자산","오디오","개발 효율"],"es":["Remotion","mejores prácticas","3D","animaciones","assets","Three.js","React Three Fiber","desarrollo de video"],"fr":["Remotion","bonnes pratiques","3D","animations","assets","Three.js","React Three Fiber","développement de vidéo"],"de":["Remotion","Best Practices","3D","Animationen","Assets","Three.js","React Three Fiber","Videoentwicklung"],"pt":["Remotion","melhores práticas","3D","animações","importação de ativos","vídeo personalizado","desenvolvimento de vídeo","ferramentas de vídeo"],"ru":["Remotion","лучшие практики","3D","анимации","импорт активов","персонализированное видео","разработка видео","инструменты видео"],"ar":["Remotion","أفضل الممارسات","3D","الرسوم المتحركة","استيراد الأصول","فيديو مخصص","تطوير الفيديو","أدوات الفيديو"]}},"owner":"yp717","repo":"engagement-party","repoPath":"yp717/engagement-party","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.423Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"remotion-best-practices","description":"Best practices for Remotion - Video creation in React","tags":"remotion, video, react, animation, composition","bodyPreview":"## When to use\n\nUse this skills whenever you are dealing with Remotion code to obtain the domain-specific knowledge.\n\n## How to use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [rules/3d.md](rules/3d.md) - 3D content in Remotion using Three.js and React Three Fiber\n- [rules/animations.md](rules/animations.md) - Fundamental animation skills for Remotion\n- [rules/assets.md](rules/assets.md) - Importing images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion\n- [rules/audio.md]","body":"## When to use\n\nUse this skills whenever you are dealing with Remotion code to obtain the domain-specific knowledge.\n\n## How to use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [rules/3d.md](rules/3d.md) - 3D content in Remotion using Three.js and React Three Fiber\n- [rules/animations.md](rules/animations.md) - Fundamental animation skills for Remotion\n- [rules/assets.md](rules/assets.md) - Importing images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion\n- [rules/audio.md](rules/audio.md) - Using audio and sound in Remotion - importing, trimming, volume, speed, pitch\n- [rules/calculate-metadata.md](rules/calculate-metadata.md) - Dynamically set composition duration, dimensions, and props\n- [rules/can-decode.md](rules/can-decode.md) - Check if a video can be decoded by the browser using Mediabunny\n- [rules/charts.md](rules/charts.md) - Chart and data visualization patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/compositions.md](rules/compositions.md) - Defining compositions, stills, folders, default props and dynamic metadata\n- [rules/display-captions.md](rules/display-captions.md) - Displaying captions in Remotion with TikTok-style pages and word highlighting\n- [rules/extract-frames.md](rules/extract-frames.md) - Extract frames from videos at specific timestamps using Mediabunny\n- [rules/fonts.md](rules/fonts.md) - Loading Google Fonts and local fonts in Remotion\n- [rules/get-audio-duration.md](rules/get-audio-duration.md) - Getting the duration of an audio file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-dimensions.md](rules/get-video-dimensions.md) - Getting the width and height of a video file with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-duration.md](rules/get-video-duration.md) - Getting the duration of a video file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/gifs.md](rules/gifs.md) - Displaying GIFs synchronized with Remotion''s timeline\n- [rules/images.md](rules/images.md) - Embedding images in Remotion using the Img component\n- [rules/import-srt-captions.md](rules/import-srt-captions.md) - Importing .srt subtitle files into Remotion using @remotion/captions\n- [rules/lottie.md](rules/lottie.md) - Embedding Lottie animations in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md](rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md) - Measuring DOM element dimensions in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-text.md](rules/measuring-text.md) - Measuring text dimensions, fitting text to containers, and checking overflow\n- [rules/sequencing.md](rules/sequencing.md) - Sequencing patterns for Remotion - delay, trim, limit duration of items\n- [rules/tailwind.md](rules/tailwind.md) - Using TailwindCSS in Remotion\n- [rules/text-animations.md](rules/text-animations.md) - Typography and text animation patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/timing.md](rules/timing.md) - Interpolation curves in Remotion - linear, easing, spring animations\n- [rules/transcribe-captions.md](rules/transcribe-captions.md) - Transcribing audio to generate captions in Remotion\n- [rules/transitions.md](rules/transitions.md) - Scene transition patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/trimming.md](rules/trimming.md) - Trimming patterns for Remotion - cut the beginning or end of animations\n- [rules/videos.md](rules/videos.md) - Embedding videos in Remotion - trimming, volume, speed, looping, pitch\n- [rules/parameters.md](rules/parameters.md) - Make a video parametrizable by adding a Zod schema\n- [rules/maps.md](rules/maps.md) - Add a map using Mapbox and animate it\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:39:26.380Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Video Generation Agents needing advanced Remotion capabilities and domain-specific knowledge.","zh":"非常适合需要高级Remotion功能和特定领域知识的视频生成代理。","ja":"高度なRemotion機能とドメイン固有の知識を必要とするビデオ生成エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 Remotion 기능과 도메인 특정 지식을 필요로 하는 비디오 생성 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de generación de video que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de Remotion y conocimientos específicos de dominio.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de génération de vidéos ayant besoin de fonctionnalités avancées de Remotion et de connaissances spécifiques au domaine.","de":"Perfekt für Video-Generierungsagenten, die erweiterte Remotion-Funktionen und domänen-spezifisches Wissen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Geração de Vídeo que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de Remotion e conhecimento específico de domínio.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов генерации видео, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности Remotion и специфические знания в области.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين ينتجون الفيديو الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة من Remotion ومعارف محددة لقاعدة المعرفة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create complex 3D content using Three.js and React Three Fiber, while mastering fundamental animation skills and efficiently importing various assets such as images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion projects.","zh":"使代理能够使用Three.js和React Three Fiber创建复杂的3D内容，同时掌握基本的动画技能，并高效地将图像、视频、音频和字体等各种资产导入Remotion项目中。","ja":"エージェントがThree.jsとReact Three Fiberを使用して複雑な3Dコンテンツを作成し、基本的なアニメーションスキルを習得し、画像、ビデオ、オーディオ、フォントなどのさまざまなアセットをRemotionプロジェクトに効率的にインポートできるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 Three.js와 React Three Fiber를 사용하여 복잡한 3D 콘텐츠를 생성하고 기본적인 애니메이션 기술을 습득하며 이미지, 비디오, 오디오, 글꼴 등의 다양한 자산을 Remotion 프로젝트에 효율적으로 가져올 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear contenido 3D complejo utilizando Three.js y React Three Fiber, mientras dominan habilidades de animación fundamentales e importan de forma eficiente varios activos como imágenes, videos, audio y fuentes en proyectos de Remotion.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer du contenu 3D complexe en utilisant Three.js et React Three Fiber, tout en maîtrisant les compétences d''animation fondamentales et en important efficacement divers actifs tels que des images, des vidéos, de l''audio et des polices dans les projets Remotion.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, komplexen 3D-Inhalt mit Three.js und React Three Fiber zu erstellen, während sie grundlegende Animationsfähigkeiten beherrschen und verschiedene Assets wie Bilder, Videos, Audio und Schriftarten effizient in Remotion-Projekte importieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar conteúdo 3D complexo usando Three.js e React Three Fiber, dominando habilidades de animação fundamentais e importando de forma eficiente vários ativos, como imagens, vídeos, áudio e fontes para projetos Remotion.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать сложный 3D-контент с использованием Three.js и React Three Fiber, осваивая основные навыки анимации и эффективно импортируя различные активы, такие как изображения, видео, аудио и шрифты, в проекты Remotion.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء محتوى ثلاثي الأبعاد معقد باستخدام Three.js و React Three Fiber، وتطوير مهارات الرسوم المتحركة الأساسية واستيراد الموارد المختلفة مثل الصور والفيديو والصوت والخطوط بفعالية في مشاريع Remotion."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating immersive 3D animations for video explanations","Optimizing video asset imports for faster rendering","Debugging Remotion projects with detailed rule explanations"],"zh":["为视频解释创建沉浸式3D动画","优化视频资产导入以实现更快的渲染","使用详细的规则解释调试Remotion项目"],"ja":["ビデオ解説用の没入型3Dアニメーションを作成する","ビデオアセットのインポートを最適化してレンダリングを高速化する","詳細なルールの説明を使用してRemotionプロジェクトをデバッグする"],"ko":["비디오 설명을 위한 몰입형 3D 애니메이션 생성","비디오 자산 가져오기를 최적화하여 렌더링을 더 빠르게 하는 것","상세한 규칙 설명을 사용하여 Remotion 프로젝트를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Crear animaciones 3D inmersivas para explicaciones de video","Optimizar las importaciones de activos de video para un renderizado más rápido","Depurar proyectos de Remotion con explicaciones detalladas de reglas"],"fr":["Créer des animations 3D immersives pour des explications de vidéos","Optimiser les imports d''actifs vidéo pour un rendu plus rapide","Déboguer les projets Remotion avec des explications détaillées de règles"],"de":["Erstellen von immersiven 3D-