те 3D-контент с помощью Three.js и React Three Fiber","Разработайте фундаментальные навыки анимации","Импортируйте изображения, видео, аудио и шрифты в Remotion","Узнайте, как использовать аудио в проектах Remotion","Оптимизируйте свой рабочий процесс с помощью лучших практик"],"ar":["أنشئ محتوى 3D باستخدام Three.js و React Three Fiber","طور مهارات الرسوم المتحركة الأساسية","استورد الصور والفيديوهات والصوت والخطوط إلى ريموشن","تعلم كيفية استخدام الصوت في مشاريع ريموشن","أحسن تدفق العمل الخاص بك باستخدام أفضل الممارسات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Remotion","3D 内容","动画","资产","音频","Three.js","React Three Fiber","最佳实践"],"ja":["Remotion","3D コンテンツ","アニメーション","資産","オーディオ","Three.js","React Three Fiber","ベストプラクティス"],"ko":["Remotion","3D 콘텐츠","애니메이션","자산","오디오","Three.js","React Three Fiber","베스트 프랙티스"],"es":["Remotion","mejores prácticas","desarrollo de Remotion","3D en Remotion","animaciones en Remotion","assets en Remotion","audio en Remotion","React Three Fiber","Three.js"],"fr":["Remotion","bonnes pratiques","développement de Remotion","3D dans Remotion","animations dans Remotion","assets dans Remotion","audio dans Remotion","React Three Fiber","Three.js"],"de":["Remotion","beste Praktiken","Entwicklung von Remotion","3D in Remotion","Animationen in Remotion","Assets in Remotion","Audio in Remotion","React Three Fiber","Three.js"],"pt":["Remotion","Melhores práticas","3D","Animações","Importação de ativos","Desenvolvimento de vídeo","Código aberto","Three.js","React Three Fiber"],"ru":["Remotion","Лучшие практики","3D","Анимации","Импорт активов","Разработка видео","Открытый код","Three.js","React Three Fiber"],"ar":["ريموشن","أفضل الممارسات","3D","الرسوم المتحركة","استيراد الأصول","تطوير الفيديو","الكود المفتوح","Three.js","React Three Fiber"]}},"owner":"CleanExpo","repo":"Claude-Open-Code-","repoPath":"CleanExpo/Claude-Open-Code-","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.423Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"remotion-best-practices","description":"Best practices for Remotion - Video creation in React","tags":"remotion, video, react, animation, composition","bodyPreview":"## When to use\n\nUse this skills whenever you are dealing with Remotion code to obtain the domain-specific knowledge.\n\n## How to use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [rules/3d.md](rules/3d.md) - 3D content in Remotion using Three.js and React Three Fiber\n- [rules/animations.md](rules/animations.md) - Fundamental animation skills for Remotion\n- [rules/assets.md](rules/assets.md) - Importing images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion\n- [rules/audio.md]","body":"## When to use\n\nUse this skills whenever you are dealing with Remotion code to obtain the domain-specific knowledge.\n\n## How to use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [rules/3d.md](rules/3d.md) - 3D content in Remotion using Three.js and React Three Fiber\n- [rules/animations.md](rules/animations.md) - Fundamental animation skills for Remotion\n- [rules/assets.md](rules/assets.md) - Importing images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion\n- [rules/audio.md](rules/audio.md) - Using audio and sound in Remotion - importing, trimming, volume, speed, pitch\n- [rules/calculate-metadata.md](rules/calculate-metadata.md) - Dynamically set composition duration, dimensions, and props\n- [rules/can-decode.md](rules/can-decode.md) - Check if a video can be decoded by the browser using Mediabunny\n- [rules/charts.md](rules/charts.md) - Chart and data visualization patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/compositions.md](rules/compositions.md) - Defining compositions, stills, folders, default props and dynamic metadata\n- [rules/display-captions.md](rules/display-captions.md) - Displaying captions in Remotion with TikTok-style pages and word highlighting\n- [rules/extract-frames.md](rules/extract-frames.md) - Extract frames from videos at specific timestamps using Mediabunny\n- [rules/fonts.md](rules/fonts.md) - Loading Google Fonts and local fonts in Remotion\n- [rules/get-audio-duration.md](rules/get-audio-duration.md) - Getting the duration of an audio file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-dimensions.md](rules/get-video-dimensions.md) - Getting the width and height of a video file with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-duration.md](rules/get-video-duration.md) - Getting the duration of a video file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/gifs.md](rules/gifs.md) - Displaying GIFs synchronized with Remotion''s timeline\n- [rules/images.md](rules/images.md) - Embedding images in Remotion using the Img component\n- [rules/import-srt-captions.md](rules/import-srt-captions.md) - Importing .srt subtitle files into Remotion using @remotion/captions\n- [rules/lottie.md](rules/lottie.md) - Embedding Lottie animations in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md](rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md) - Measuring DOM element dimensions in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-text.md](rules/measuring-text.md) - Measuring text dimensions, fitting text to containers, and checking overflow\n- [rules/sequencing.md](rules/sequencing.md) - Sequencing patterns for Remotion - delay, trim, limit duration of items\n- [rules/tailwind.md](rules/tailwind.md) - Using TailwindCSS in Remotion\n- [rules/text-animations.md](rules/text-animations.md) - Typography and text animation patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/timing.md](rules/timing.md) - Interpolation curves in Remotion - linear, easing, spring animations\n- [rules/transcribe-captions.md](rules/transcribe-captions.md) - Transcribing audio to generate captions in Remotion\n- [rules/transitions.md](rules/transitions.md) - Scene transition patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/trimming.md](rules/trimming.md) - Trimming patterns for Remotion - cut the beginning or end of animations\n- [rules/videos.md](rules/videos.md) - Embedding videos in Remotion - trimming, volume, speed, looping, pitch\n- [rules/parameters.md](rules/parameters.md) - Make a video parametrizable by adding a Zod schema\n- [rules/maps.md](rules/maps.md) - Add a map using Mapbox and animate it\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:39:46.103Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Video Generation Agents needing domain-specific knowledge in Remotion code","zh":"非常适合需要Remotion代码领域特定知识的视频生成代理","ja":"Remotionコードに関するドメイン固有の知識を必要とするビデオ生成エージェントに最適","ko":"Remotion 코드에 대한 도메인 특정 지식을 필요로 하는 비디오 생성 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Generación de Video que necesitan conocimiento específico del dominio en código Remotion","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Génération de Vidéo ayant besoin de connaissances spécifiques au domaine dans le code Remotion","de":"Perfekt für Video-Generierungsagenten, die domänen-spezifisches Wissen in Remotion-Code benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Geração de Vídeo que necessitam de conhecimento específico de domínio em código Remotion","ru":"Идеально для агентов по генерации видео, которым требуется домен-специфические знания в коде Remotion","ar":"مثالي لعميل توليد الفيديو الذين يحتاجون إلى معرفة محددة النطاق في رمز Remotion"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create high-quality video content using Remotion, leveraging libraries like Three.js and React Three Fiber for 3D content and animations, while efficiently importing assets such as images, videos, audio, and fonts","zh":"赋予代理使用Remotion创建高质量视频内容的能力，利用Three.js和React Three Fiber等库实现3D内容和动画，同时高效导入图像、视频、音频和字体等资产","ja":"Three.jsやReact Three Fiberなどのライブラリを利用して3Dコンテンツやアニメーションを作成し、画像、動画、音声、フォントなどのアセットを効率的にインポートすることで、高品質のビデオコンテンツを作成するエージェントの能力を強化","ko":"에이전트가 Remotion을 사용하여 고품질의 비디오 콘텐츠를 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, Three.js 및 React Three Fiber와 같은 라이브러리를 활용하여 3D 콘텐츠 및 애니메이션을 생성하고, 이미지, 비디오, 오디오 및 글꼴 등의 자산을 효율적으로 가져옵니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear contenido de video de alta calidad utilizando Remotion, aprovechando bibliotecas como Three.js y React Three Fiber para contenido y animaciones 3D, mientras importa eficientemente activos como imágenes, videos, audio y fuentes","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer du contenu vidéo de haute qualité en utilisant Remotion, en exploitant des bibliothèques comme Three.js et React Three Fiber pour le contenu et les animations 3D, tout en important efficacement des ressources telles que des images, des vidéos, de l''audio et des polices","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, hochwertige Videoinhalte mit Remotion zu erstellen, indem es Bibliotheken wie Three.js und React Three Fiber für 3D-Inhalte und -Animationen nutzt und gleichzeitig Assets wie Bilder, Videos, Audio und Schriftarten effizient importiert","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar conteúdo de vídeo de alta qualidade usando Remotion, aproveitando bibliotecas como Three.js e React Three Fiber para conteúdo 3D e animações, enquanto importa eficientemente ativos como imagens, vídeos, áudio e fontes","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать высококачественный видеоконтент с помощью Remotion, используя библиотеки như Three.js и React Three Fiber для 3D-контента и анимаций, а также эффективно импортируя активы, такие как изображения, видео, аудио и шрифты","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء محتوى فيديو عالي الجودة باستخدام Remotion، واستخدام مكتبات مثل Three.js و React Three Fiber للcontenido 3D والرسوم المتحركة، وأيضا استيراد الكائنات مثل الصور والفيديو والصوت والخطوط بفعالية"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating 3D animations with Remotion and Three.js","Optimizing video asset imports for faster rendering","Debugging Remotion animations for smoother playback"],"zh":["使用Remotion和Three.js生成3D动画","优化视频资产导入以实现更快的渲染","调试Remotion动画以实现更平滑的播放"],"ja":["RemotionとThree.jsを使用した3Dアニメーションの生成","ビデオアセットのインポートを最適化してレンダリングを高速化","Remotionアニメーションのデバッグを実行して再生をスムーズ化"],"ko":["Remotion과 Three.js를 사용한 3D 애니메이션 생성","비디오 자산 가져오기를 최적화하여 렌더링을 더 빠르게 함","Remotion 애니메이션의 디버깅을 수행하여 재생을 더 부드럽게 함"],"es":["Generación de animaciones 3D con Remotion y Three.js","Optimización de la importación de activos de video para un renderizado más rápido","Depuración de animaciones de Remotion para una reproducción más suave"],"fr":["Génération d''animations 3D avec Remotion et Three.js","Optimisation de l''importation de ressources vidéo pour un rendu plus rapide","Débogage des animations Remotion pour une lecture plus fluide"],"de":["Erstellung von 3D-Animationen mit Remotion und Three.js","Optimierung des Video-Asset-Imports für ein schnelleres Rendern","Fehlerbehebung von Remotion-Animationen für eine reibungslosere Wiedergabe"],"pt":["Geração de animações 3D com Remotion e Three.js","Otimização da importação de ativos de vídeo para renderização mais rápida","Depuração de animações Remotion para reprodução mais suave"],"ru":["Генерация 3D-анимаций с помощью Remotion и Three.js","Оптимизация импорта видеоактивов для более быстрого рендеринга","Отладка анимаций Remotion для более плавного воспроизведения"],"ar":["إنشاء الرسوم المتحركة 3D مع Remotion و Three.js","تحسين استيراد الكائنات الفيديوية لجعل العرض أسرع","تصحيح أخطاء الرسوم المتحركة Remotion لجعل التشغيل أملس"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Remotion codebase access","Limited to Remotion-specific features and plugins"],"zh":["需要访问Remotion代码库","仅限Remotion特定功能和插件"],"ja":["Remotionコードベースへのアクセスが必要","Remotion固有の機能とプラグインに限定"],"ko":["Remotion 코드베이스에 대한 접근이 필요","Remotion 특정 기능 및 플러그인으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la base de código de Remotion","Limitado a características y plugins específicos de Remotion"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la base de code Remotion","Limité aux fonctionnalités et plugins spécifiques à Remotion"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf den Remotion-Codebasis","Begrenzt auf Remotion-spezifische Funktionen und -Plugins"],"pt":["Requer acesso à base de código Remotion","Limitado a recursos e plug-ins específicos do Remotion"],"ru":["Требует доступа к кодовой базе Remotion","Ограничен функциями и плагинами, специфичными для Remotion"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى قاعدة رمز Remotion","محدود بالخصائص والإضافات المحددة لبرمجي Remotion"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
