ähigkeiten zu verbessern","Beherrschung von Remotion für Entwickler"],"pt":["Crie conteúdo 3D com Three.js e React Three Fiber","Desenvolva habilidades fundamentais de animação","Importe imagens, vídeos, áudio e fontes","Aprenda a trabalhar com ativos em Remotion","Entenda como usar regras para melhorar seu código"],"ru":["Создайте 3D-контент с помощью Three.js и React Three Fiber","Разработайте фундаментальные навыки анимации","Импортируйте изображения, видео, аудио и шрифты","Узнайте, как работать с активами в Remotion","Поймите, как использовать правила для улучшения вашего кода"],"ar":["أنشئ محتوى 3D باستخدام Three.js و React Three Fiber","تطوير المهارات الأساسية للرسوم المتحركة","استيراد الصور والفيديوهات والصوت والخطوط","تعلم كيفية العمل مع الأصول في ريموشن","فهم كيفية استخدام القواعد لتحسين кодك"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Remotion 最佳实践","Remotion 代码","Three.js","React Three Fiber","动画技能","音频处理","规则文件"],"ja":["Remotion ベストプラクティス","Remotion コード","Three.js","React Three Fiber","アニメーションスキル","オーディオ処理","ルールファイル"],"ko":["Remotion 베스트 프랙티스","Remotion 코드","Three.js","React Three Fiber","애니메이션 스킬","오디오 처리","규칙 파일"],"es":["Remotion","desarrollo de video","contenido 3D","animación","importación de activos","reglas de desarrollo","ejemplos de código","mejores prácticas","desarrolladores"],"fr":["Remotion","développement de vidéo","contenu 3D","animation","importation de ressources","règles de développement","exemples de code","bonnes pratiques","développeurs"],"de":["Remotion","Videentwicklung","3D-Inhalte","Animation","Importieren von Ressourcen","Entwicklungsregeln","Codebeispiele","Best Practices","Entwickler"],"pt":["Remotion","melhores práticas","3D","animações","importação de ativos","desenvolvimento de vídeo","ferramentas de código aberto","React Three Fiber","Three.js"],"ru":["Remotion","лучшие практики","3D","анимации","импорт активов","разработка видео","инструменты с открытым исходным кодом","React Three Fiber","Three.js"],"ar":["ريموشن","أفضل الممارسات","3D","الرسوم المتحركة","استيراد الأصول","تطوير الفيديو","أدوات مفتوحة المصدر","React Three Fiber","Three.js"]}},"owner":"maupeon","repo":"bluebook","repoPath":"maupeon/bluebook","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.423Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"remotion-best-practices","description":"Best practices for Remotion - Video creation in React","tags":"remotion, video, react, animation, composition","bodyPreview":"## When to use\n\nUse this skills whenever you are dealing with Remotion code to obtain the domain-specific knowledge.\n\n## How to use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [rules/3d.md](rules/3d.md) - 3D content in Remotion using Three.js and React Three Fiber\n- [rules/animations.md](rules/animations.md) - Fundamental animation skills for Remotion\n- [rules/assets.md](rules/assets.md) - Importing images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion\n- [rules/audio.md]","body":"## When to use\n\nUse this skills whenever you are dealing with Remotion code to obtain the domain-specific knowledge.\n\n## How to use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [rules/3d.md](rules/3d.md) - 3D content in Remotion using Three.js and React Three Fiber\n- [rules/animations.md](rules/animations.md) - Fundamental animation skills for Remotion\n- [rules/assets.md](rules/assets.md) - Importing images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion\n- [rules/audio.md](rules/audio.md) - Using audio and sound in Remotion - importing, trimming, volume, speed, pitch\n- [rules/calculate-metadata.md](rules/calculate-metadata.md) - Dynamically set composition duration, dimensions, and props\n- [rules/can-decode.md](rules/can-decode.md) - Check if a video can be decoded by the browser using Mediabunny\n- [rules/charts.md](rules/charts.md) - Chart and data visualization patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/compositions.md](rules/compositions.md) - Defining compositions, stills, folders, default props and dynamic metadata\n- [rules/display-captions.md](rules/display-captions.md) - Displaying captions in Remotion with TikTok-style pages and word highlighting\n- [rules/extract-frames.md](rules/extract-frames.md) - Extract frames from videos at specific timestamps using Mediabunny\n- [rules/fonts.md](rules/fonts.md) - Loading Google Fonts and local fonts in Remotion\n- [rules/get-audio-duration.md](rules/get-audio-duration.md) - Getting the duration of an audio file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-dimensions.md](rules/get-video-dimensions.md) - Getting the width and height of a video file with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-duration.md](rules/get-video-duration.md) - Getting the duration of a video file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/gifs.md](rules/gifs.md) - Displaying GIFs synchronized with Remotion''s timeline\n- [rules/images.md](rules/images.md) - Embedding images in Remotion using the Img component\n- [rules/import-srt-captions.md](rules/import-srt-captions.md) - Importing .srt subtitle files into Remotion using @remotion/captions\n- [rules/lottie.md](rules/lottie.md) - Embedding Lottie animations in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md](rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md) - Measuring DOM element dimensions in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-text.md](rules/measuring-text.md) - Measuring text dimensions, fitting text to containers, and checking overflow\n- [rules/sequencing.md](rules/sequencing.md) - Sequencing patterns for Remotion - delay, trim, limit duration of items\n- [rules/tailwind.md](rules/tailwind.md) - Using TailwindCSS in Remotion\n- [rules/text-animations.md](rules/text-animations.md) - Typography and text animation patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/timing.md](rules/timing.md) - Interpolation curves in Remotion - linear, easing, spring animations\n- [rules/transcribe-captions.md](rules/transcribe-captions.md) - Transcribing audio to generate captions in Remotion\n- [rules/transitions.md](rules/transitions.md) - Scene transition patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/trimming.md](rules/trimming.md) - Trimming patterns for Remotion - cut the beginning or end of animations\n- [rules/videos.md](rules/videos.md) - Embedding videos in Remotion - trimming, volume, speed, looping, pitch\n- [rules/parameters.md](rules/parameters.md) - Make a video parametrizable by adding a Zod schema\n- [rules/maps.md](rules/maps.md) - Add a map using Mapbox and animate it\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:39:48.320Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Video Generation Agents requiring domain-specific knowledge of Remotion code and best practices for 3D content, animations, and asset management.","zh":"适用于需要Remotion代码和3D内容、动画及资产管理最佳实践的领域特定知识的视频生成代理。","ja":"Remotionコードと3Dコンテンツ、アニメーション、资产管理のベストプラクティスに関するドメイン固有の知識を必要とするビデオ生成エージェントに適しています。","ko":"Remotion 코드 및 3D 콘텐츠, 애니메이션 및 자산 관리의 최고 사례에 대한 도메인 특정 지식을 요구하는 비디오 생성 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de generación de video que requieren conocimientos específicos del dominio del código Remotion y las mejores prácticas para contenido 3D, animaciones y gestión de activos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de génération de vidéo nécessitant des connaissances spécifiques au domaine du code Remotion et des meilleures pratiques pour le contenu 3D, les animations et la gestion des actifs.","de":"Ideal für Video-Generierungsagenten, die domänen-spezifische Kenntnisse des Remotion-Codes und Best Practices für 3D-Inhalte, Animationen und Asset-Management benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Geração de Vídeo que requerem conhecimento específico do domínio do código Remotion e as melhores práticas para conteúdo 3D, animações e gerenciamento de ativos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по генерации видео, требующих специфических знаний домена кода Remotion и лучших практик для контента 3D, анимаций и управления активами.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يولدون الفيديو الذين يحتاجون إلى معرفة محددة للنطاق من رمز Remotion وأفضل الممارسات لمحتوى 3D والرسومات المتحركة وإدارة الأصول."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create high-quality video content using Remotion, leveraging libraries like Three.js and React Three Fiber for 3D rendering, and mastering fundamental animation skills and asset import techniques for images, videos, audio, and fonts.","zh":"赋予代理使用Remotion创建高质量视频内容的能力，利用Three.js和React Three Fiber等库进行3D渲染，并掌握图像、视频、音频和字体的基本动画技能和资产导入技术。","ja":"エージェントに、Three.jsやReact Three Fiberなどのライブラリを使用して3Dレンダリングを行い、画像、ビデオ、オーディオ、フォントなどの基本的なアニメーション技術とアセットインポート技術をマスターしながら、Remotionを使用して高品質のビデオコンテンツを作成する能力を付与します。","ko":"에이전트가 Remotion을 사용하여 고품질의 비디오 콘텐츠를 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, Three.js 및 React Three Fiber와 같은 라이브러리를 사용하여 3D 렌더링을 수행하고, 이미지, 비디오, 오디오 및 글꼴의 기본 애니메이션 기술 및 자산导入 기술을 마스터합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear contenido de video de alta calidad utilizando Remotion, aprovechando bibliotecas como Three.js y React Three Fiber para la representación 3D, y dominando habilidades de animación fundamentales y técnicas de importación de activos para imágenes, videos, audio y fuentes.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer du contenu vidéo de haute qualité en utilisant Remotion, en exploitant des bibliothèques comme Three.js et React Three Fiber pour le rendu 3D, et en maîtrisant les compétences d''animation fondamentales et les techniques d''importation d''actifs pour les images, les vidéos, l''audio et les polices.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, hochwertige Videoinhalte mit Remotion zu erstellen, indem es Bibliotheken wie Three.js und React Three Fiber für die 3D-Darstellung nutzt und grundlegende Animationsfähigkeiten und Asset-Importtechniken für Bilder, Videos, Audio und Schriftarten beherrscht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar conteúdo de vídeo de alta qualidade usando Remotion, aproveitando bibliotecas como Three.js e React Three Fiber para renderização 3D, e dominando habilidades fundamentais de animação e técnicas de importação de ativos para imagens, vídeos, áudio e fontes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать контент видео высокого качества с помощью Remotion, используя библиотеки seperti Three.js и React Three Fiber для рендеринга 3D, и осваивая основные навыки анимации и техники импорта активов для изображений, видео, аудио и шрифтов.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء محتوى فيديو عالي الجودة باستخدام Remotion، مستفيدًا من المكتبات مثل Three.js و React Three Fiber للترndering 3D، وامتلاك المهارات الأساسية للرسومات المتحركة وтехники استيراد الأصول للصور، مقاطع الفيديو، الصوت، والخطوط."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating 3D content in Remotion using Three.js","Optimizing animations for smoother video playback","Importing and managing various assets like images, videos, and fonts"],"zh":["使用Three.js在Remotion中生成3D内容","优化动画以实现更流畅的视频播放","导入和管理各种资产，如图像、视频和字体"],"ja":["Three.jsを使用してRemotionで3Dコンテンツを生成する","アニメーションを最適化してスムーズなビデオ再生を実現する","画像、ビデオ、フォントなどの様々なアセットをインポートして管理する"],"ko":["Three.js를 사용하여 Remotion에서 3D 콘텐츠를 생성하는 것","애니메이션을 최적화하여 더 부드러운 비디오 재생을 thực現하는 것","이미지, 비디오, 글꼴 등의 다양한 자산을导入하고 관리하는 것"],"es":["Generación de contenido 3D en Remotion utilizando Three.js","Optimización de animaciones para una reproducción de video más suave","Importación y gestión de varios activos como imágenes, videos y fuentes"],"fr":["Génération de contenu 3D dans Remotion en utilisant Three.js","Optimisation des animations pour une lecture vidéo plus fluide","Importation et gestion de divers actifs tels que des images, des vidéos et des polices"],"de":["Erzeugung von 3D-Inhalten in Remotion unter Verwendung von Three.js","Optimierung von Animationen für eine flüssigere Videowiedergabe","Import und Verwaltung verschiedener Assets wie Bilder, Videos und Schriftarten"],"pt":["Gerar conteúdo 3D no Remotion usando Three.js","Otimizar animações para uma reprodução de vídeo mais suave","Importar e gerenciar vários ativos como imagens, vídeos e fontes"],"ru":["Генерировать контент 3D в Remotion с помощью Three.js","Оптимизировать анимации для более плавной проигрывание видео","Импортировать и управлять различными активами, такими как изображения, видео и шрифты"],"ar":["توليد محتوى 3D في Remotion باستخدام Three.js","تحسين الرسومات المتحركة من أجل تشغيل فيديو أكثر سلاسة","استيراد وإدارة أصول متعددة مثل الصور، مقاطع الفيديو، والخطوط"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Remotion codebase access","Limited to Remotion-specific use cases"],"zh":["需要访问Remotion代码库","仅限Remotion特定用例"],"ja":["Remotionコードベースへのアクセスが必要","Remotion固有のユースケースに限定される"],"ko":["Remotion 코드베이스에 대한 액세스가 필요함","Remotion 특정 사용 사례에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la base de código de Remotion","Limitado a casos de uso específicos de Remotion"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la base de code Remotion","Limité à des cas d''utilisation spécifiques à Remotion"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf den Remotion-Codebasis","Begrenzt auf Remotion-spezifische Anwendungsfälle"],"pt":["Requer acesso à base de código Remotion","Limitado a casos de uso específicos do Remotion"],"ru":["Требует доступа к базе кода Remotion","Ограничен только случаями использования Remotion"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى قاعدة الشفرة Remotion","محدود بحالات الاستخدام الخاصة ب Remotion"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
