Автоматизация задач с помощью Markdown","ar":"قواعد Hookify: تحكم في المهام بسهولة باستخدام Markdown","en":"Writing Hookify Rules"},"description":{"zh":"Hookify 规则是使用 YAML 前置语法的 markdown 文件，用于定义模式和显示消息","ja":"Hookify ルールは YAML フロントマターを使用した Markdown ファイルであり、パターンとメッセージを定義する","ko":"Hookify 규칙은 YAML 프론트 매터를 사용하는 마크다운 파일로, 패턴과 메시지를 정의합니다","es":"Las reglas de Hookify permiten automatizar tareas y mejorar la productividad mediante la definición de patrones y mensajes personalizados.","fr":"Les règles Hookify permettent d''automatiser des tâches et d''améliorer la productivité en définissant des modèles et des messages personnalisés.","de":"Hookify-Regeln ermöglichen die Automatisierung von Aufgaben und die Verbesserung der Produktivität durch die Definition von Mustern und benutzerdefinierten N...","pt":"As regras Hookify são arquivos Markdown com frontmatter em YAML que definem padrões para assistir e mensagens para exibir quando esses padrões são correspond...","ru":"Правила Hookify представляют собой файлы Markdown с frontmatter в YAML, которые определяют шаблоны для наблюдения и сообщения для отображения, когда эти шабл...","ar":"قواعد Hookify هي ملفات Markdown مع YAML frontmatter التي تحدد أنماطًا لمشاهدتها ورسائل لإظهارها عند مطابقة تلك الأنماط.","en":"AesopIDE with Antigravity-inspired UI\""},"definition":{"en":"AesopIDE with Antigravity-inspired UI\""},"features":{"zh":["使用 YAML 前置语法定义规则","支持正则表达式模式匹配","可自定义显示消息","规则文件存储在 `.claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md` 中","支持多种事件类型，包括 bash、file、stop、prompt 和 all"],"ja":["YAML フロントマターを使用してルールを定義","正規表現パターンマッチングをサポート","表示メッセージをカスタマイズ","ルールファイルは `.claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md` に保存","複数のイベントタイプをサポート、bash、file、stop、prompt、all など"],"ko":["YAML 프론트 매터를 사용하여 규칙을 정의","정규식 패턴 일치를 지원","표시 메시지를 사용자 정의","규칙 파일은 `.claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md`에 저장","여러 가지 이벤트 유형을 지원, bash, file, stop, prompt, all 등"],"es":["Archivos markdown con frontmatter YAML","Definición de patrones y mensajes personalizados","Almacenamiento en archivos `.claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md`","Compatibilidad con eventos como bash, archivo, parada y prompt","Soporte para formato de mensaje markdown"],"fr":["Fichiers markdown avec frontmatter YAML","Définition de modèles et de messages personnalisés","Stockage dans des fichiers `.claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md`","Compatibilité avec des événements tels que bash, fichier, arrêt et invite","Prise en charge du format de message markdown"],"de":["Markdown-Dateien mit YAML-Frontmatter","Definition von Mustern und benutzerdefinierten Nachrichten","Speicherung in Dateien `.claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md`","Kompatibilität mit Ereignissen wie bash, Datei, Stopp und Prompt","Unterstützung für Markdown-Nachrichtenformat"],"pt":["Arquivos Markdown com frontmatter em YAML","Definição de padrões para assistir","Mensagens personalizadas para exibir","Armazenamento em `.claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md`","Suporte a formatação Markdown"],"ru":["Файлы Markdown с frontmatter в YAML","Определение шаблонов для наблюдения","Пользовательские сообщения для отображения","Хранение в `.claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md`","Поддержка форматирования Markdown"],"ar":["ملفات Markdown مع YAML frontmatter","تحديد أنماط لمشاهدتها","رسائل مخصصة لإظهارها","التخزين في `.claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md`","دعم تنسيق Markdown"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Hookify 规则","YAML 前置语法","markdown 文件","模式匹配","自定义消息","规则文件","事件类型"],"ja":["Hookify ルール","YAML フロントマター","Markdown ファイル","パターンマッチング","カスタムメッセージ","ルールファイル","イベントタイプ"],"ko":["Hookify 규칙","YAML 프론트 매터","마크다운 파일","패턴 일치","사용자 정의 메시지","규칙 파일","이벤트 유형"],"es":["reglas de Hookify","automatización de tareas","AesopIDE","Antigravity","markdown","YAML","patrones y mensajes personalizados"],"fr":["règles Hookify","automatisation de tâches","AesopIDE","Antigravity","markdown","YAML","modèles et messages personnalisés"],"de":["Hookify-Regeln","Automatisierung von Aufgaben","AesopIDE","Antigravity","Markdown","YAML","Muster und benutzerdefinierte Nachrichten"],"pt":["Regras Hookify","Automatização de tarefas","Markdown","YAML frontmatter","Padrões de assistência","Mensagens personalizadas"],"ru":["Правила Hookify","Автоматизация задач","Markdown","YAML frontmatter","Шаблоны для наблюдения","Пользовательские сообщения"],"ar":["قواعد Hookify","تحقيق المهام آليًا","Markdown","YAML frontmatter","أنماط لمشاهدتها","رسائل مخصصة"]}},"owner":"Dknight203","repo":"AesopIDE","repoPath":"Dknight203/AesopIDE","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.423Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Writing Hookify Rules","description":"This skill should be used when the user asks to create a hookify rule, write a hook rule, configure hookify, add a hookify rule, or needs guidance on hookify rule syntax and patterns.","version":"0.1.0","bodyPreview":"# Writing Hookify Rules\n\n## Overview\n\nHookify rules are markdown files with YAML frontmatter that define patterns to watch for and messages to show when those patterns match. Rules are stored in `.claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md` files.\n\n## Rule File Format\n\n### Basic Structure\n\n```markdown\n---\nname: rule-identifier\nenabled: true\nevent: bash|file|stop|prompt|all\npattern: regex-pattern-here\n---\n\nMessage to show Claude when this rule triggers.\nCan include markdown formatting, warnings, suggest","body":"# Writing Hookify Rules\n\n## Overview\n\nHookify rules are markdown files with YAML frontmatter that define patterns to watch for and messages to show when those patterns match. Rules are stored in `.claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md` files.\n\n## Rule File Format\n\n### Basic Structure\n\n```markdown\n---\nname: rule-identifier\nenabled: true\nevent: bash|file|stop|prompt|all\npattern: regex-pattern-here\n---\n\nMessage to show Claude when this rule triggers.\nCan include markdown formatting, warnings, suggestions, etc.\n```\n\n### Frontmatter Fields\n\n**name** (required): Unique identifier for the rule\n- Use kebab-case: `warn-dangerous-rm`, `block-console-log`\n- Be descriptive and action-oriented\n- Start with verb: warn, prevent, block, require, check\n\n**enabled** (required): Boolean to activate/deactivate\n- `true`: Rule is active\n- `false`: Rule is disabled (won''t trigger)\n- Can toggle without deleting rule\n\n**event** (required): Which hook event to trigger on\n- `bash`: Bash tool commands\n- `file`: Edit, Write, MultiEdit tools\n- `stop`: When agent wants to stop\n- `prompt`: When user submits a prompt\n- `all`: All events\n\n**action** (optional): What to do when rule matches\n- `warn`: Show message but allow operation (default)\n- `block`: Prevent operation (PreToolUse) or stop session (Stop events)\n- If omitted, defaults to `warn`\n\n**pattern** (simple format): Regex pattern to match\n- Used for simple single-condition rules\n- Matches against command (bash) or new_text (file)\n- Python regex syntax\n\n**Example:**\n```yaml\nevent: bash\npattern: rm\\s+-rf\n```\n\n### Advanced Format (Multiple Conditions)\n\nFor complex rules with multiple conditions:\n\n```markdown\n---\nname: warn-env-file-edits\nenabled: true\nevent: file\nconditions:\n  - field: file_path\n    operator: regex_match\n    pattern: \\.env$\n  - field: new_text\n    operator: contains\n    pattern: API_KEY\n---\n\nYou''re adding an API key to a .env file. Ensure this file is in .gitignore!\n```\n\n**Condition fields:**\n- `field`: Which field to check\n  - For bash: `command`\n  - For file: `file_path`, `new_text`, `old_text`, `content`\n- `operator`: How to match\n  - `regex_match`: Regex pattern matching\n  - `contains`: Substring check\n  - `equals`: Exact match\n  - `not_contains`: Substring must NOT be present\n  - `starts_with`: Prefix check\n  - `ends_with`: Suffix check\n- `pattern`: Pattern or string to match\n\n**All conditions must match for rule to trigger.**\n\n## Message Body\n\nThe markdown content after frontmatter is shown to Claude when the rule triggers.\n\n**Good messages:**\n- Explain what was detected\n- Explain why it''s problematic\n- Suggest alternatives or best practices\n- Use formatting for clarity (bold, lists, etc.)\n\n**Example:**\n```markdown\n⚠️ **Console.log detected!**\n\nYou''re adding console.log to production code.\n\n**Why this matters:**\n- Debug logs shouldn''t ship to production\n- Console.log can expose sensitive data\n- Impacts browser performance\n\n**Alternatives:**\n- Use a proper logging library\n- Remove before committing\n- Use conditional debug builds\n```\n\n## Event Type Guide\n\n### bash Events\n\nMatch Bash command patterns:\n\n```markdown\n---\nevent: bash\npattern: sudo\\s+|rm\\s+-rf|chmod\\s+777\n---\n\nDangerous command detected!\n```\n\n**Common patterns:**\n- Dangerous commands: `rm\\s+-rf`, `dd\\s+if=`, `mkfs`\n- Privilege escalation: `sudo\\s+`, `su\\s+`\n- Permission issues: `chmod\\s+777`, `chown\\s+root`\n\n### file Events\n\nMatch Edit/Write/MultiEdit operations:\n\n```markdown\n---\nevent: file\npattern: console\\.log\\(|eval\\(|innerHTML\\s*=\n---\n\nPotentially problematic code pattern detected!\n```\n\n**Match on different fields:**\n```markdown\n---\nevent: file\nconditions:\n  - field: file_path\n    operator: regex_match\n    pattern: \\.tsx?$\n  - field: new_text\n    operator: regex_match\n    pattern: console\\.log\\(\n---\n\nConsole.log in TypeScript file!\n```\n\n**Common patterns:**\n- Debug code: `console\\.log\\(`, `debugger`, `print\\(`\n- Security risks: `eval\\(`, `innerHTML\\s*=`, `dangerouslySetInnerHTML`\n- Sensitive files: `\\.env$`, `credentials`, `\\.pem$`\n- Generated files: `node_modules/`, `dist/`, `build/`\n\n### stop Events\n\nMatch when agent wants to stop (completion checks):\n\n```markdown\n---\nevent: stop\npattern: .*\n---\n\nBefore stopping, verify:\n- [ ] Tests were run\n- [ ] Build succeeded\n- [ ] Documentation updated\n```\n\n**Use for:**\n- Reminders about required steps\n- Completion checklists\n- Process enforcement\n\n### prompt Events\n\nMatch user prompt content (advanced):\n\n```markdown\n---\nevent: prompt\nconditions:\n  - field: user_prompt\n    operator: contains\n    pattern: deploy to production\n---\n\nProduction deployment checklist:\n- [ ] Tests passing?\n- [ ] Reviewed by team?\n- [ ] Monitoring ready?\n```\n\n## Pattern Writing Tips\n\n### Regex Basics\n\n**Literal characters:** Most characters match themselves\n- `rm` matches \"rm\"\n- `console.log` matches \"console.log\"\n\n**Special characters need escaping:**\n- `.` (any char) → `\\.` (literal dot)\n- `(` `)` → `\\(` `\\)` (literal parens)\n- `[` `]` → `\\[` `\\]` (literal brackets)\n\n**Common metacharacters:**\n- `\\s` - whitespace (space, tab, newline)\n- `\\d` - digit (0-9)\n- `\\w` - word character (a-z, A-Z, 0-9, _)\n- `.` - any character\n- `+` - one or more\n- `*` - zero or more\n- `?` - zero or one\n- `|` - OR\n\n**Examples:**\n```\nrm\\s+-rf         Matches: rm -rf, rm  -rf\nconsole\\.log\\(   Matches: console.log(\n(eval|exec)\\(    Matches: eval( or exec(\nchmod\\s+777      Matches: chmod 777, chmod  777\nAPI_KEY\\s*=      Matches: API_KEY=, API_KEY =\n```\n\n### Testing Patterns\n\nTest regex patterns before using:\n\n```bash\npython3 -c \"import re; print(re.search(r''your_pattern'', ''test text''))\"\n```\n\nOr use online regex testers (regex101.com with Python flavor).\n\n### Common Pitfalls\n\n**Too broad:**\n```yaml\npattern: log    # Matches \"log\", \"login\", \"dialog\", \"catalog\"\n```\nBetter: `console\\.log\\(|logger\\.`\n\n**Too specific:**\n```yaml\npattern: rm -rf /tmp  # Only matches exact path\n```\nBetter: `rm\\s+-rf`\n\n**Escaping issues:**\n- YAML quoted strings: `\"pattern\"` requires double backslashes `\\\\s`\n- YAML unquoted: `pattern: \\s` works as-is\n- **Recommendation**: Use unquoted patterns in YAML\n\n## File Organization\n\n**Location:** All rules in `.claude/` directory\n**Naming:** `.claude/hookify.{descriptive-name}.local.md`\n**Gitignore:** Add `.claude/*.local.md` to `.gitignore`\n\n**Good names:**\n- `hookify.dangerous-rm.local.md`\n- `hookify.console-log.local.md`\n- `hookify.require-tests.local.md`\n- `hookify.sensitive-files.local.md`\n\n**Bad names:**\n- `hookify.rule1.local.md` (not descriptive)\n- `hookify.md` (missing .local)\n- `danger.local.md` (missing hookify prefix)\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Creating a Rule\n\n1. Identify unwanted behavior\n2. Determine which tool is involved (Bash, Edit, etc.)\n3. Choose event type (bash, file, stop, etc.)\n4. Write regex pattern\n5. Create `.claude/hookify.{name}.local.md` file in project root\n6. Test immediately - rules are read dynamically on next tool use\n\n### Refining a Rule\n\n1. Edit the `.local.md` file\n2. Adjust pattern or message\n3. Test immediately - changes take effect on next tool use\n\n### Disabling a Rule\n\n**Temporary:** Set `enabled: false` in frontmatter\n**Permanent:** Delete the `.local.md` file\n\n## Examples\n\nSee `${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/examples/` for complete examples:\n- `dangerous-rm.local.md` - Block dangerous rm commands\n- `console-log-warning.local.md` - Warn about console.log\n- `sensitive-files-warning.local.md` - Warn about editing .env files\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n**Minimum viable rule:**\n```markdown\n---\nname: my-rule\nenabled: true\nevent: bash\npattern: dangerous_command\n---\n\nWarning message here\n```\n\n**Rule with conditions:**\n```markdown\n---\nname: my-rule\nenabled: true\nevent: file\nconditions:\n  - field: file_path\n    operator: regex_match\n    pattern: \\.ts$\n  - field: new_text\n    operator: contains\n    pattern: any\n---\n\nWarning message\n```\n\n**Event types:**\n- `bash` - Bash commands\n- `file` - File edits\n- `stop` - Completion checks\n- `prompt` - User input\n- `all` - All events\n\n**Field options:**\n- Bash: `command`\n- File: `file_path`, `new_text`, `old_text`, `content`\n- Prompt: `user_prompt`\n\n**Operators:**\n- `regex_match`, `contains`, `equals`, `not_contains`, `starts_with`, `ends_with`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:40:15.889Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Advanced AI Agents like Claude, AutoGPT, and LangChain needing customized pattern matching and notification capabilities through markdown files with YAML frontmatter.","zh":"非常适合Claude、AutoGPT和LangChain等高级AI代理，需要通过带有YAML前置内容的Markdown文件进行自定义模式匹配和通知功能。","ja":"Claude、AutoGPT、LangChainなどの高度なAIエージェントに適しています。これらは、YAMLフロントマターを備えたMarkdownファイルを介したカスタマイズされたパターンマッチングと通知機能を必要とします。","ko":"클라우드, 오토GPT, 랭체인과 같은 고급 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 이들은 YAML 프런트 매터를 갖춘 마크다운 파일을 통해 사용자 정의 패턴 매칭 및 알림 기능을 필요로 합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA Avanzados como Claude, AutoGPT y LangChain que necesitan coincidencia de patrones personalizados y capacidades de notificación a través de archivos markdown con frontmatter YAML.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA avancés comme Claude, AutoGPT et LangChain nécessitant une correspondance de modèles personnalisée et des capacités de notification via des fichiers markdown avec frontmatter YAML.","de":"Perfekt für erweiterte KI-Agents wie Claude, AutoGPT und LangChain, die benutzerdefinierte Musterabgleich- und Benachrichtigungsfunktionen über Markdown-Dateien mit YAML-Frontmatter benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Avançados de IA, como Claude, AutoGPT e LangChain, que necessitam de correspondência de padrões personalizados e capacidades de notificação por meio de arquivos markdown com frontmatter YAML.","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых агентов ИИ, таких как Claude, AutoGPT и LangChain, которым требуются настраиваемые возможности сопоставления шаблонов и уведомлений посредством файлов markdown с YAML-заголовком.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الذكي المتقدمة مثل Claude و AutoGPT و LangChain التي تحتاج إلى مطابقة نمط مخصصة وقدرات إعلام من خلال ملفات markdown مع YAML frontmatter."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to define patterns and messages using regex-patterns and markdown formatting, enabling them to watch for specific events such as bash, file, stop, prompt, or all, and display customized messages when these patterns match, utilizing YAML frontmatter in .claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md files.","zh":"使代理能够使用正则表达式模式和Markdown格式定义模式和消息，从而使它们能够监视诸如bash、文件、停止、提示或所有等特定事件，并在这些模式匹配时显示自定义消息，利用YAML前置内容在.claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md文件中。","ja":"エージェントが正規表現パターンとMarkdownフォーマットを使用してパターンとメッセージを定義できるようにし、bash、ファイル、停止、プロンプト、またはすべてなどの特定のイベントを監視し、これらのパターンに一致するときにカスタマイズされたメッセージを表示できるようにします。YAMLフロントマターを.claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.mdファイルで利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 정규식 패턴과 마크다운 형식을 사용하여 패턴과 메시지를 정의할 수 있게 해 줍니다. 이를 통해 bash, 파일, 중지, 프롬프트 또는 모든 등의 특정 이벤트를 감시하고 이러한 패턴과 일치할 때 사용자 정의 메시지를 표시할 수 있습니다. YAML 프론트 매타를 .claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md 파일에서 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a definir patrones y mensajes utilizando patrones regex y formato markdown, lo que les permite vigilar eventos específicos como bash, archivo, detener, prompt o todos, y mostrar mensajes personalizados cuando coinciden estos patrones, utilizando frontmatter YAML en archivos .claude/hookify.{nombre-regla}.local.md.","fr":"Permet aux agents de définir des modèles et des messages en utilisant des modèles regex et une mise en forme markdown, leur permettant de surveiller des événements spécifiques tels que bash, fichier, arrêter, invite ou tous, et d''afficher des messages personnalisés lorsque ces modèles correspondent, en utilisant le frontmatter YAML dans les fichiers .claude/hookify.{nom-règle}.local.md.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, Muster und Nachrichten mithilfe von Regex-Mustern und Markdown-Formatierung zu definieren, sodass sie bestimmte Ereignisse wie bash, Datei, stoppen, Prompt oder alle überwachen und benutzerdefinierte Nachrichten anzeigen können, wenn diese Muster übereinstimmen, unter Verwendung von YAML-Frontmatter in Dateien .claude/hookify.{regel-name}.local.md.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a definirem padrões e mensagens usando regex-padrões e formatação markdown, permitindo que eles monitorem eventos específicos, como bash, arquivo, parar, prompt ou todos, e exibam mensagens personalizadas quando esses padrões coincidem, utilizando o frontmatter YAML em arquivos .claude/hookify.{nome-da-regra}.local.md.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью определять шаблоны и сообщения с помощью regex-шаблонов и форматирования markdown, что позволяет им отслеживать конкретные события, такие как bash, файл, остановить, запрос или все, и отображать настраиваемые сообщения, когда эти шаблоны совпадают, используя YAML-заголовок в файлах .claude/hookify.{имя-правила}.local.md.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تعريف الأنماط والرسائل باستخدام regex-الأنماط وتنسيق markdown، مما يمكّنه من مراقبة أحداث محددة مثل bash، ملف، إيقاف، استدعاء أو كلها، وعرض رسائل مخصصة عند مطابقة هذه الأنماط، باستخدام YAML frontmatter في الملفات .claude/hookify.{اسم-القاعدة}.local.md."},"useCases":{"en":["Defining custom notification rules for specific events","Creating pattern matching rules for file system changes","Generating customized messages with markdown formatting for agent interactions"],"zh":["定义特定事件的自定义通知规则","为文件系统更改创建模式匹配规则","为代理交互生成带有Markdown格式的自定义消息"],"ja":["特定イベントのカスタマイズされた通知ルールを定義する","ファイルシステムの変更に対するパターンマッチングルールを作成する","エージェントのやり取りに対してMarkdownフォーマットを備えたカスタマイズされたメッセージを生成する"],"ko":["특정 이벤트의 사용자 정의 알림 규칙을 정의하는 것","파일 시스템 변경에 대한 패턴 매칭 규칙을 생성하는 것","에이전트 상호 작용을 위한 마크다운 형식의 사용자 정의 메시지를 생성하는 것"],"es":["Definir reglas de notificación personalizadas para eventos específicos","Crear reglas de coincidencia de patrones para cambios en el sistema de archivos","Generar mensajes personalizados con formato markdown para interacciones de agentes"],"fr":["Définir des règles de notification personnalisées pour des événements spécifiques","Créer des règles de correspondance de modèles pour les modifications du système de fichiers","Générer des messages personnalisés avec une mise en forme markdown pour les interactions des agents"],"de":["Definieren benutzerdefinierter Benachrichtigungsregeln für bestimmte Ereignisse","Erstellen von Musternabgleich-Regeln für Änderungen im Dateisystem","Erzeugen benutzerdefinierter Nachrichten mit Markdown-Formatierung für Agenten-Interaktionen"],"pt":["Definir regras de notificação personalizadas para eventos específicos","Criar regras de correspondência de padrões para alterações no sistema de arquivos","Gerar mensagens personalizadas com formatação markdown para interações de agente"],"ru":["Определение настраиваемых правил уведомлений для конкретных событий","Создание правил сопоставления шаблонов для изменений в файловой системе","Генерация настраиваемых сообщений с форматированием markdown для взаимодействия агентов"],"ar":["تحديد قواعد إعلام مخصصة لأحداث محددة","إنشاء قواعد مطابقة لأنماط لتغييرات نظام الملفات","توليد رسائل مخصصة بتنسيق markdown للتفاعلات الوكيل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires .claude directory for rule storage","Limited to markdown files with YAML frontmatter","Dependent on regex-pattern matching capabilities"],"zh":["需要.claude目录来存储规则","仅限于带有YAML前置内容的Markdown文件","依赖于正则表达式模式匹配能力"],"ja":["ルールの保存には.claudeディレクトリが必要","YAMLフロントマターを備えたMarkdownファイルのみ","正規表現パターンマッチング能力に依存する"],"ko":["규칙을 저장하기 위해 .claude 디렉토리가 필요합니다","YAML 프론트 매타를 갖춘 마크다운 파일만 해당됩니다","정규식 패턴 매칭 기능에 의존합니다"],"es":["Requiere un directorio .claude para el almacenamiento de reglas","Limitado a archivos markdown con frontmatter YAML","Dependiente de las capacidades de coincidencia de patrones regex"],"fr":["Nécessite un répertoire .claude pour le stockage des règles","Limité aux fichiers markdown avec frontmatter YAML","Dépendant des capacités de correspondance de modèles regex"],"de":["Benötigt ein Verzeichnis .claude für die Speicherung von Regeln","Begrenzt auf Markdown-Dateien mit YAML-Frontmatter","Abhängig von den Fähigkeiten der Musterabgleich-Regex"],"pt":["Requer diretório .claude para armazenamento de regras","Limitado a arquivos markdown com frontmatter YAML","Dependente das capacidades de correspondência de regex-padrões"],"ru":["Требуется директория .claude для хранения правил","Ограничен файлами markdown с YAML-заголовком","Зависит от возможностей сопоставления regex-шаблонов"],"ar":["يتطلب ملف .claude لتخزين القواعد","محدود بالملفات markdown مع YAML frontmatter","يعتمد على إمكانيات مطابقة regex-الأنماط"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
