e trabalho","Desenvolvimento de estratégias de orquestração complexas","Redução de custos e uso de contexto"],"ru":["Улучшение координации между агентами","Оптимизация производительности и задержки","Идентификация узких мест в рабочих процессах","Разработка сложных стратегий оркестровки","Снижение затрат и использования контекста"],"ar":["تحسين التنسيق بين العملاء","تحسين الأداء والتنقل","تحديد العوائق في تدفقات العمل","تصميم استراتيجيات أوركسترا معقدة","تخفيض التكاليف والاستخدام السياقي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["多智能体优化","智能体协调","复杂工作流设计","吞吐量优化","延迟优化","成本优化"],"ja":["マルチエージェント最適化","エージェント調整","複雑なワークフローの設計","スループット最適化","待ち時間最適化","コスト最適化"],"ko":["멀티 에이전트 최적화","에이전트 조정","복잡한 워크플로우 설계","처리량 최적화","대기 시간 최적화","비용 최적화"],"es":["optimización de agentes múltiples","coordinación de agentes","rendimiento de agentes","latencia de agentes","análisis de flujos de trabajo","orquestación de agentes","optimización de costos","uso de contexto"],"fr":["optimisation multi-agents","coordination d''agents","performances d''agents","latence d''agents","analyse de flux de travail","orchestration d''agents","optimisation de coûts","utilisation du contexte"],"de":["Optimierung von Multi-Agenten","Koordination von Agenten","Leistung von Agenten","Latenz von Agenten","Analyse von Workflows","Orchestrierung von Agenten","Optimierung von Kosten","Kontextnutzung"],"pt":["otimização de orquestração de múltiplos agentes","coordenação de agentes","desempenho de agentes","latência de agentes","fluxos de trabalho de agentes","estratégias de orquestração"],"ru":["оптимизация оркестровки нескольких агентов","координация агентов","производительность агентов","задержка агентов","рабочие процессы агентов","стратегии оркестровки"],"ar":["تحسين أوركسترا العميل المتعدد","تنسيق العملاء","أداء العملاء","تنقل العملاء","تدفقات عمل العملاء","استراتيجيات أوركسترا"]}},"owner":"andre-sugai","repo":"cine-explorer-mvp-block","repoPath":"andre-sugai/cine-explorer-mvp-block","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.424Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"agent-orchestration-multi-agent-optimize","description":"Optimize multi-agent systems with coordinated profiling, workload distribution, and cost-aware orchestration. Use when improving agent performance, throughput, or reliability.","bodyPreview":"# Multi-Agent Optimization Toolkit\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Improving multi-agent coordination, throughput, or latency\n- Profiling agent workflows to identify bottlenecks\n- Designing orchestration strategies for complex workflows\n- Optimizing cost, context usage, or tool efficiency\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- You only need to tune a single agent prompt\n- There are no measurable metrics or evaluation data\n- The task is unrelated to multi-agent orchestration\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Establish","body":"# Multi-Agent Optimization Toolkit\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Improving multi-agent coordination, throughput, or latency\n- Profiling agent workflows to identify bottlenecks\n- Designing orchestration strategies for complex workflows\n- Optimizing cost, context usage, or tool efficiency\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- You only need to tune a single agent prompt\n- There are no measurable metrics or evaluation data\n- The task is unrelated to multi-agent orchestration\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Establish baseline metrics and target performance goals.\n2. Profile agent workloads and identify coordination bottlenecks.\n3. Apply orchestration changes and cost controls incrementally.\n4. Validate improvements with repeatable tests and rollbacks.\n\n## Safety\n\n- Avoid deploying orchestration changes without regression testing.\n- Roll out changes gradually to prevent system-wide regressions.\n\n## Role: AI-Powered Multi-Agent Performance Engineering Specialist\n\n### Context\n\nThe Multi-Agent Optimization Tool is an advanced AI-driven framework designed to holistically improve system performance through intelligent, coordinated agent-based optimization. Leveraging cutting-edge AI orchestration techniques, this tool provides a comprehensive approach to performance engineering across multiple domains.\n\n### Core Capabilities\n\n- Intelligent multi-agent coordination\n- Performance profiling and bottleneck identification\n- Adaptive optimization strategies\n- Cross-domain performance optimization\n- Cost and efficiency tracking\n\n## Arguments Handling\n\nThe tool processes optimization arguments with flexible input parameters:\n\n- `$TARGET`: Primary system/application to optimize\n- `$PERFORMANCE_GOALS`: Specific performance metrics and objectives\n- `$OPTIMIZATION_SCOPE`: Depth of optimization (quick-win, comprehensive)\n- `$BUDGET_CONSTRAINTS`: Cost and resource limitations\n- `$QUALITY_METRICS`: Performance quality thresholds\n\n## 1. Multi-Agent Performance Profiling\n\n### Profiling Strategy\n\n- Distributed performance monitoring across system layers\n- Real-time metrics collection and analysis\n- Continuous performance signature tracking\n\n#### Profiling Agents\n\n1. **Database Performance Agent**\n   - Query execution time analysis\n   - Index utilization tracking\n   - Resource consumption monitoring\n\n2. **Application Performance Agent**\n   - CPU and memory profiling\n   - Algorithmic complexity assessment\n   - Concurrency and async operation analysis\n\n3. **Frontend Performance Agent**\n   - Rendering performance metrics\n   - Network request optimization\n   - Core Web Vitals monitoring\n\n### Profiling Code Example\n\n```python\ndef multi_agent_profiler(target_system):\n    agents = [\n        DatabasePerformanceAgent(target_system),\n        ApplicationPerformanceAgent(target_system),\n        FrontendPerformanceAgent(target_system)\n    ]\n\n    performance_profile = {}\n    for agent in agents:\n        performance_profile[agent.__class__.__name__] = agent.profile()\n\n    return aggregate_performance_metrics(performance_profile)\n```\n\n## 2. Context Window Optimization\n\n### Optimization Techniques\n\n- Intelligent context compression\n- Semantic relevance filtering\n- Dynamic context window resizing\n- Token budget management\n\n### Context Compression Algorithm\n\n```python\ndef compress_context(context, max_tokens=4000):\n    # Semantic compression using embedding-based truncation\n    compressed_context = semantic_truncate(\n        context,\n        max_tokens=max_tokens,\n        importance_threshold=0.7\n    )\n    return compressed_context\n```\n\n## 3. Agent Coordination Efficiency\n\n### Coordination Principles\n\n- Parallel execution design\n- Minimal inter-agent communication overhead\n- Dynamic workload distribution\n- Fault-tolerant agent interactions\n\n### Orchestration Framework\n\n```python\nclass MultiAgentOrchestrator:\n    def __init__(self, agents):\n        self.agents = agents\n        self.execution_queue = PriorityQueue()\n        self.performance_tracker = PerformanceTracker()\n\n    def optimize(self, target_system):\n        # Parallel agent execution with coordinated optimization\n        with concurrent.futures.ThreadPoolExecutor() as executor:\n            futures = {\n                executor.submit(agent.optimize, target_system): agent\n                for agent in self.agents\n            }\n\n            for future in concurrent.futures.as_completed(futures):\n                agent = futures[future]\n                result = future.result()\n                self.performance_tracker.log(agent, result)\n```\n\n## 4. Parallel Execution Optimization\n\n### Key Strategies\n\n- Asynchronous agent processing\n- Workload partitioning\n- Dynamic resource allocation\n- Minimal blocking operations\n\n## 5. Cost Optimization Strategies\n\n### LLM Cost Management\n\n- Token usage tracking\n- Adaptive model selection\n- Caching and result reuse\n- Efficient prompt engineering\n\n### Cost Tracking Example\n\n```python\nclass CostOptimizer:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.token_budget = 100000  # Monthly budget\n        self.token_usage = 0\n        self.model_costs = {\n            ''gpt-5'': 0.03,\n            ''claude-4-sonnet'': 0.015,\n            ''claude-4-haiku'': 0.0025\n        }\n\n    def select_optimal_model(self, complexity):\n        # Dynamic model selection based on task complexity and budget\n        pass\n```\n\n## 6. Latency Reduction Techniques\n\n### Performance Acceleration\n\n- Predictive caching\n- Pre-warming agent contexts\n- Intelligent result memoization\n- Reduced round-trip communication\n\n## 7. Quality vs Speed Tradeoffs\n\n### Optimization Spectrum\n\n- Performance thresholds\n- Acceptable degradation margins\n- Quality-aware optimization\n- Intelligent compromise selection\n\n## 8. Monitoring and Continuous Improvement\n\n### Observability Framework\n\n- Real-time performance dashboards\n- Automated optimization feedback loops\n- Machine learning-driven improvement\n- Adaptive optimization strategies\n\n## Reference Workflows\n\n### Workflow 1: E-Commerce Platform Optimization\n\n1. Initial performance profiling\n2. Agent-based optimization\n3. Cost and performance tracking\n4. Continuous improvement cycle\n\n### Workflow 2: Enterprise API Performance Enhancement\n\n1. Comprehensive system analysis\n2. Multi-layered agent optimization\n3. Iterative performance refinement\n4. Cost-efficient scaling strategy\n\n## Key Considerations\n\n- Always measure before and after optimization\n- Maintain system stability during optimization\n- Balance performance gains with resource consumption\n- Implement gradual, reversible changes\n\nTarget Optimization: $ARGUMENTS\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:40:35.988Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Complex Workflow Agents requiring advanced multi-agent coordination and optimization techniques","zh":"适用于需要高级多代理协调和优化技术的复杂工作流代理","ja":"複雑なワークフロー エージェントに適しており、先進的なマルチエージェントの調整と最適化テクニックが必要","ko":"복잡한 워크플로우 에이전트에 적합하며 고급 多エージェント 조정 및 최적화 기술이 필요","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Flujo de Trabajo Complejos que requieren coordinación y técnicas de optimización de multiagentes avanzadas","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Flux de Travail Complexes nécessitant une coordination et des techniques d''optimisation de multiagents avancées","de":"Ideal für komplexe Workflow-Agents, die erweiterte Multiagenten-Koordinierungs- und Optimierungstechniken erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Fluxo de Trabalho Complexo que exigem coordenação e técnicas de otimização de vários agentes avançadas","ru":"Идеально для сложных рабочих агентов, требующих продвинутых техник координации и оптимизации нескольких агентов","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء سير عمل معقدة تتطلب تقنيات تنسيق متقدمة وضبط عدة وكلاء"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize multi-agent workflows through bottleneck identification, cost optimization, and context usage refinement, leveraging metrics and evaluation data for informed decision-making","zh":"通过瓶颈识别、成本优化和上下文使用精化，赋予代理优化多代理工作流的能力，利用指标和评估数据进行明智的决策","ja":"ボトルネックの特定、コスト最適化、コンテキスト使用の精査を通じて、マルチエージェントのワークフローを最適化するエージェントをEmpowerし、指標と評価データを使用して情報に基づいた意思決定を行う","ko":"병목 지점 식별, 비용 최적화 및 컨텍스트 사용 정교화를 통해 다중 에이전트 워크플로를 최적화하는 에이전트를 강화하고, 지표 및 평가 데이터를 사용하여 정보에 기반한 의사 결정을 내림","es":"Permite a los agentes optimizar flujos de trabajo de multiagentes mediante la identificación de cuellos de botella, la optimización de costos y el perfeccionamiento del uso del contexto, aprovechando las métricas y los datos de evaluación para la toma de decisiones informadas","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les flux de travail de multiagents en identifiant les goulots d''étranglement, en optimisant les coûts et en affinant l''utilisation du contexte, en exploitant les métriques et les données d''évaluation pour une prise de décision éclairée","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Multiagenten-Workflows durch die Identifizierung von Engpässen, Kostenoptimierung und Kontextnutzungsverfeinerung zu optimieren, unter Nutzung von Metriken und Bewertungsdaten für eine informierte Entscheidungsfindung","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar fluxos de trabalho de vários agentes por meio da identificação de gargalos, otimização de custos e refinamento do uso de contexto, utilizando métricas e dados de avaliação para tomada de decisões informadas","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать рабочие потоки нескольких агентов посредством выявления узких мест, оптимизации затрат и совершенствования использования контекста, используя метрики и оценочные данные для принятия обоснованных решений","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تحسين سير عمل عدة وكلاء من خلال تحديد العوائق، وضبط التكاليف، وتحسين استخدام السياق، باستخدام المقاييس وبيانات التقييم لاتخاذ قرارات مستنيرة"},"useCases":{"en":["Profiling agent workflows to identify latency bottlenecks","Designing efficient orchestration strategies for complex tasks","Optimizing cost and tool efficiency in multi-agent environments"],"zh":["为代理工作流创建 профили 以识别延迟瓶颈","设计复杂任务的高效编排策略","在多代理环境中优化成本和工具效率"],"ja":["エージェントのワークフローをプロファイル化して遅延のボトルネックを特定する","複雑なタスクの効率的なオーケストレーション戦略を設計する","マルチエージェント環境でコストとツールの効率を最適化する"],"ko":["에이전트 워크플로우를 프로파일링하여 지연 병목 지점을 식별","복잡한 작업을 위한 효율적인 오케스트레이션 전략을 설계","다중 에이전트 환경에서 비용 및 도구 효율성을 최적화"],"es":["Perfilar flujos de trabajo de agentes para identificar cuellos de botella de latencia","Diseñar estrategias de orquestación eficientes para tareas complejas","Optimizar el costo y la eficiencia de las herramientas en entornos de multiagentes"],"fr":["Profiler les flux de travail des agents pour identifier les goulots d''étranglement de latence","Concevoir des stratégies d''orchestration efficaces pour les tâches complexes","Optimiser le coût et l''efficacité des outils dans les environnements de multiagents"],"de":["Agenten-Workflows profilieren, um Latenz-Engpässe zu identifizieren","Effiziente Orchestrierungsstrategien für komplexe Aufgaben entwerfen","Kosten und Werkzeugeffizienz in Multiagenten-Umgebungen optimieren"],"pt":["Perfilando fluxos de trabalho de agentes para identificar gargalos de latência","Projetando estratégias de orquestração eficientes para tarefas complexas","Otimizando custo e eficiência de ferramentas em ambientes de vários agentes"],"ru":["Профилирование рабочих потоков агентов для выявления узких мест по задержке","Проектирование эффективных стратегий оркестровки для сложных задач","Оптимизация стоимости и инструментальной эффективности в средах с несколькими агентами"],"ar":["تحليل سير عمل الوكلاء لتحديد العوائق في التأخير","تصميم استراتيجيات توجيه فعالة للمهام المعقدة","تحسين التكلفة وفعالية الأدوات في بيئات متعددة الوكلاء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires measurable metrics and evaluation data","Limited to scenarios involving multi-agent orchestration","Not suitable for single-agent prompt tuning"],"zh":["需要可衡量的指标和评估数据","仅限于涉及多代理编排的场景","不适合单代理提示调优"],"ja":["測定可能な指標と評価データが必要","マルチエージェントのオーケストレーションを伴うシナリオに限定される","シングルエージェントのプロンプトチューニングには不適"],"ko":["측정 가능한 지표 및 평가 데이터가 필요","다중 에이전트 오케스트레이션을 포함하는 시나리오로 제한","단일 에이전트 프롬프트 튜닝에는 적합하지 않음"],"es":["Requiere métricas y datos de evaluación medibles","Limitado a escenarios que involucran orquestación de multiagentes","No es adecuado para la afinación de la respuesta de un solo agente"],"fr":["Nécessite des métriques et des données d''évaluation mesurables","Limité aux scénarios impliquant l''orchestration de multiagents","N''est pas adapté pour l''affinage de la réponse d''un seul agent"],"de":["Erfordert messbare Metriken und Bewertungsdaten","Begrenzt auf Szenarien, die eine Multiagenten-Orchestrierung beinhalten","Nicht geeignet für die Feinabstimmung der Antwort eines einzelnen Agents"],"pt":["Exige métricas mensuráveis e dados de avaliação","Limitado a cenários que envolvem orquestração de vários agentes","Não é adequado para ajuste de prompt de agente único"],"ru":["Требует измеримых метрик и оценочных данных","Ограничен сценариями, включающими оркестровку нескольких агентов","Не подходит для настройки запроса одного агента"],"ar":["يتطلب مقاييس قابلة للقياس وبيانات تقييم","محدود بالسيناريوهات التي تتضمن توجيه عدة وكلاء",