com repositório de código","Guias e padrões para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["Генерация PPT с помощью ИИ","Анализ документов","Создание стилизованных изображений","Интеграция с репозиторием кода","Руководства и шаблоны для разработчиков"],"ar":["توليد عرض تقديمي مع IA","تحليل المستندات","توليد صور منمقة","التكامل مع مستودع الشفرة","دلائل وأنساق للمطورين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI PPT 生成","文档分析","样式化图像","PPT 创建工具","AI 驱动的 PPT","自动化 PPT 生成"],"ja":["AI PPT 生成","ドキュメント分析","スタイル化画像","PPT 作成ツール","AI パワーの PPT","自動化 PPT 生成"],"ko":["AI PPT 생성","문서 분석","스타일화된 이미지","PPT 생성 도구","AI 기반의 PPT","자동화 PPT 생성"],"es":["generación de PPT con IA","análisis de documentos","presentaciones personalizadas","inteligencia artificial","PPT con IA","herramientas de productividad","desarrollo de software","tecnologías de IA"],"fr":["génération de PPT avec IA","analyse de documents","présentations personnalisées","intelligence artificielle","PPT avec IA","outils de productivité","développement de logiciels","technologies de l''IA"],"de":["PPT-Generierung mit KI","Dokumentenanalyse","individuelle Präsentationen","künstliche Intelligenz","PPT mit KI","Produktivitätstools","Softwareentwicklung","KI-Technologien"],"pt":["geração de PPT com IA","análise de documentos","criação de imagens estilizadas","desenvolvimento de apresentações","ferramentas de produtividade","tecnologia de IA"],"ru":["генерация PPT с помощью ИИ","анализ документов","создание стилизованных изображений","разработка презентаций","инструменты продуктивности","технология ИИ"],"ar":["توليد عرض تقديمي مع IA","تحليل المستندات","توليد صور منمقة","تطوير العروض التقديمية","أدوات الإنتاجية","تكنولوجيا IA"]}},"owner":"andre-sugai","repo":"cine-explorer-mvp-block","repoPath":"andre-sugai/cine-explorer-mvp-block","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.424Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"nanobanana-ppt-skills","description":"AI-powered PPT generation with document analysis and styled images","bodyPreview":"# Nanobanana Ppt Skills\n\n## Overview\n\nAI-powered PPT generation with document analysis and styled images\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when you need to work with ai-powered ppt generation with document analysis and styled images.\n\n## Instructions\n\nThis skill provides guidance and patterns for ai-powered ppt generation with document analysis and styled images.\n\nFor more information, see the [source repository](https://github.com/op7418/NanoBanana-PPT-Skills).","body":"# Nanobanana Ppt Skills\n\n## Overview\n\nAI-powered PPT generation with document analysis and styled images\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when you need to work with ai-powered ppt generation with document analysis and styled images.\n\n## Instructions\n\nThis skill provides guidance and patterns for ai-powered ppt generation with document analysis and styled images.\n\nFor more information, see the [source repository](https://github.com/op7418/NanoBanana-PPT-Skills).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:40:31.295Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Presentation Agents needing advanced AI-powered PPT generation with document analysis and styled images.","zh":"非常适合需要高级AI驱动的PPT生成、文档分析和样式化图像的演示代理。","ja":"プレゼンテーションエージェントが高度なAI駆動のPPT生成、ドキュメント分析、スタイル付けされた画像を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고级 AI 기반 PPT 생성, 문서 분석 및 스타일이 지정된 이미지 기능이 필요한 프레젠테이션 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Presentación que necesitan generación de PPT avanzada con análisis de documentos y imágenes estilizadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Présentation ayant besoin d''une génération de PPT avancée avec analyse de documents et images stylisées.","de":"Perfekt für Präsentationsagenten, die eine fortschrittliche PPT-Generierung mit Dokumentenanalyse und stilisierten Bildern benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Apresentação que necessitam de geração avançada de PPT com análise de documentos e imagens estilizadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов презентаций, которые требуют продвинутой генерации PPT с анализом документов и стилизованными изображениями.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المعنيين بالعرض الذين يحتاجون إلى генерация متقدمة لملفات PPT مع تحليل الوثائق والصور المصممة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate presentations with document analysis and styled images using AI-powered PPT generation, supporting advanced features like content preview and source repository integration via GitHub.","zh":"赋予代理生成具有文档分析和样式化图像的演示文稿的能力，使用AI驱动的PPT生成，支持高级功能，如内容预览和GitHub的源代码库集成。","ja":"エージェントがドキュメント分析とスタイル付けされた画像を使用してプレゼンテーションを生成する能力を付与します。AI駆動のPPT生成を使用し、コンテンツプレビューとGitHubのソースリポジトリ統合などの高度な機能をサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 문서 분석 및 스타일이 지정된 이미지와 함께 프레젠테이션을 생성할 수 있는 기능을 부여합니다. AI 기반 PPT 생성을 사용하며 콘텐츠 미리 보기 및 GitHub의 소스 저장소 통합 等의 고급 기능을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar presentaciones con análisis de documentos y imágenes estilizadas utilizando una generación de PPT basada en IA, que admite funciones avanzadas como vista previa de contenido y integración de repositorio de origen a través de GitHub.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des présentations avec analyse de documents et images stylisées en utilisant une génération de PPT basée sur l''IA, qui prend en charge des fonctionnalités avancées comme l''aperçu de contenu et l''intégration du référentiel de sources via GitHub.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Präsentationen mit Dokumentenanalyse und stilisierten Bildern zu generieren, indem sie eine künstliche Intelligenz-basierte PPT-Generierung verwenden, die erweiterte Funktionen wie Inhaltsvorschau und Integration des Quellcode-Repositorys über GitHub unterstützt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar apresentações com análise de documentos e imagens estilizadas usando geração de PPT com IA, suportando recursos avançados como pré-visualização de conteúdo e integração de repositório de fontes via GitHub.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать презентации с анализом документов и стилизованными изображениями с помощью генерации PPT на основе ИИ, поддерживая продвинутые функции, такие как предварительный просмотр контента и интеграция с репозиторием исходного кода через GitHub.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على генерация العروض التقديمية مع تحليل الوثائق والصور المصممة باستخدام генерация PPT بالذكاء الاصطناعي، مع دعم الميزات المتقدمة مثل معاينة المحتوى وتكامل مستودع المصدر عبر GitHub."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating PPTs with styled images","Analyzing documents for presentation content","Creating presentations with AI-powered content preview"],"zh":["生成具有样式化图像的PPT","分析文档以获取演示内容","使用AI驱动的内容预览创建演示文稿"],"ja":["スタイル付けされた画像を使用してPPTを生成する","プレゼンテーションコンテンツを取得するためにドキュメントを分析する","AI駆動のコンテンツプレビューを使用してプレゼンテーションを作成する"],"ko":["스타일이 지정된 이미지로 PPT를 생성하는 것","프레젠테이션 콘텐츠를 얻기 위해 문서를 분석하는 것","AI 기반 콘텐츠 미리 보기를 사용하여 프레젠테이션을 생성하는 것"],"es":["Generar PPT con imágenes estilizadas","Analizar documentos para contenido de presentación","Crear presentaciones con vista previa de contenido basada en IA"],"fr":["Générer des PPT avec des images stylisées","Analyser des documents pour le contenu de présentation","Créer des présentations avec un aperçu de contenu basé sur l''IA"],"de":["PPT mit stilisierten Bildern generieren","Dokumente für Präsentationsinhalte analysieren","Präsentationen mit künstlicher Intelligenz-basierter Inhaltsvorschau erstellen"],"pt":["Geração de PPTs com imagens estilizadas","Análise de documentos para conteúdo de apresentação","Criação de apresentações com pré-visualização de conteúdo com IA"],"ru":["Генерация PPT с стилизованными изображениями","Анализ документов для контента презентации","Создание презентаций с предварительным просмотром контента на основе ИИ"],"ar":["generação de PPTs مع الصور المصممة","تحليل الوثائق لمحتوى العرض التقديمي","إنشاء العروض التقديمية مع معاينة المحتوى بالذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to GitHub repository for source code","Limited to PPT generation with specific analysis and styling capabilities"],"zh":["需要访问GitHub存储库以获取源代码","仅限具有特定分析和样式化功能的PPT生成"],"ja":["ソースコードを取得するためにGitHubリポジトリへのアクセスが必要","特定の分析とスタイル付け機能を使用したPPT生成のみ"],"ko":["소스 코드를 얻기 위해 GitHub 저장소에 접근해야 하는 것","특정 분석 및 스타일 지정 기능을 사용한 PPT 생성만 지원"],"es":["Requiere acceso al repositorio de GitHub para el código fuente","Limitado a la generación de PPT con capacidades de análisis y estilización específicas"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au référentiel GitHub pour le code source","Limité à la génération de PPT avec des capacités d''analyse et de stylisation spécifiques"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das GitHub-Repository für den Quellcode","Begrenzt auf die PPT-Generierung mit spezifischen Analyse- und Stilfunktionen"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao repositório GitHub para o código-fonte","Limitado à geração de PPT com capacidades de análise e estilização específicas"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к репозиторию GitHub для исходного кода","Ограничен генерацией PPT с определёнными возможностями анализа и стилизации"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مستودع GitHub للمصدر","محدود بgeneração de PPT مع القدرات التحليلية والتصميمية المحددة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('mazzasaverio/youtube-to-read/shadcn-ui', 'community', 'mazzasaverio', 'youtube-to-read', 'mazzasaverio/youtube-to-read', 'shadcn-ui', 0, 0, 80, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.424Z', '2026-02-18T04:40:34.544Z', NULL, '{"id":"mazzasaverio/youtube-to-read/shadcn-ui","name":"shadcn-ui","description":{"zh":"shadcn-ui是一个构建可访问的UI组件的专家指南，涵盖了Radix UI和Tailwind CSS的使用","ja":"shadcn-uiは、アクセシブルなUIコンポーネントを構築するためのエキスパートガイドで、Radix UIとTailwind CSSの使用をカバー","ko":"shadcn-ui는 접근 가능한 UI 컴포넌트를 구축하는 전문가 가이드로, Radix UI와 Tailwind CSS의 사용을 다룹니다","es":"shadcn-ui es una herramienta para crear componentes de UI personalizables y accesibles. Aprende a utilizarla con Radix UI y Tailwind CSS","fr":"shadcn-ui est un outil pour créer des composants d''interface utilisateur personnalisables et accessibles. Découvrez comment l''utiliser avec Radix UI et Tailwind CSS","de":"shadcn-ui ist ein Tool zum Erstellen anpassbarer und zugänglicher UI-Komponenten. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie es mit Radix UI und Tailwind CSS verwenden","pt":"Shadcn UI é uma biblioteca para criar componentes UI personalizáveis e acessíveis. Aprenda a usá-la com Radix UI e Tailwind CSS","ru":"Shadcn UI — это библиотека для создания настраиваемых и доступных компонентов UI. Узнайте, как использовать ее с Radix UI и Tailwind CSS","ar":"شادسن يُو آي هي مكتبة لإنشاء مكونات واجهة المستخدم القابلة للتخصيص والوصول. تعلم كيفية استخدامها مع راديكس يُو آي وتايلويند سي إس إس","en":" Extract YouTube video transcripts, process them with AI, and download as EPUB ebooks."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"shadcn-ui：构建可访问的UI组件","ja":"shadcn-ui：アクセシブルなUIコンポーネントを構築","ko":"shadcn-ui: 접근 가능한 UI 컴포넌트 구축","es":"shadcn-ui: Componentes de UI personalizables","fr":"shadcn-ui: Composants d''interface utilisateur personnalis...","de":"shadcn-ui: Anpassbare UI-Komponenten","pt":"Shadcn UI: Crie componentes UI personalizáveis","ru":"Shadcn UI: Создайте настраиваемые компоненты UI","ar":"شادسن يू آي: أنشئ مكونات واجهة مستخدم قابلة للتعديل","en":"shadcn-ui"},"description":{"zh":"shadcn-ui是一个构建可访问的UI组件的专家指南，涵盖了Radix UI和Tailwind CSS的使用","ja":"shadcn-uiは、アクセシブルなUIコンポーネントを構築するためのエキスパートガイドで、Radix UIとTailwind CSSの使用をカバー","ko":"shadcn-ui는 접근 가능한 UI 컴포넌트를 구축하는 전문가 가이드로, Radix UI와 Tailwind CSS의 사용을 다룹니다","es":"shadcn-ui es una herramienta para crear componentes de UI personalizables y accesibles. Aprende a utilizarla con Radix UI y Tailwind CSS","fr":"shadcn-ui est un outil pour créer des composants d''interface utilisateur personnalisables et accessibles. Découvrez comment l''utiliser avec Radix UI et Tailw...","de":"shadcn-ui ist ein Tool zum Erstellen anpassbarer und zugänglicher UI-Komponenten. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie es mit Radix UI und Tailwind CSS verwenden","pt":"Shadcn UI é uma biblioteca para criar componentes UI personalizáveis e acessíveis. Aprenda a usá-la com Radix UI e Tailwind CSS","ru":"Shadcn UI — это библиотека для создания настраиваемых и доступных компонентов UI. Узнайте, как использовать ее с Radix UI и Tailwind CSS","ar":"شادسن يُو آي هي مكتبة لإنشاء مكونات واجهة المستخدم القابلة للتخصيص والوصول. تعلم كيفية استخدامها مع راديكس يُو آي وتايلويند سي إس إس","en":" Extract YouTube video transcripts, process them with AI, and download as EPUB ebooks."},"definition":{"en":" Extract YouTube video transcripts, process them with AI, and download as EPUB ebooks."},"features":{"zh":["构建可访问的UI组件","支持Radix UI和Tailwind CSS","提供可自定义的组件","实现高效的开发","支持多种组件类型"],"ja":["アクセシブルなUIコンポーネントを構築","Radix UIとTailwind CSSをサポート","カスタマイズ可能なコンポーネントを提供","効率的な開発を実現","多種多様なコンポーネントタイプをサポート"],"ko":["접근 가능한 UI 컴포넌트 구축","Radix UI와 Tailwind CSS 지원","맞춤형 컴포넌트 제공","효율적인 개발 구현","다양한 컴포넌트 유형 지원"],"es":["Componentes de UI personalizables","Accesibilidad integrada","Compatibilidad con Radix UI y Tailwind CSS","Guía de inicio rápido","Configuración de proyecto flexible"],"fr":["Composants d''interface utilisateur personnalisables","Accessibilité intégrée","Compatibilité avec Radix UI et Tailwind CSS","Guide de démarrage rapide","Configuration de projet flexible"],"de":["Anpassbare UI-Komponenten","Integrierte Zugänglichkeit","Kompatibilität mit Radix UI und Tailwind CSS","Schnellstart-Anleitung","Flexible Projekt-Konfiguration"],"pt":["Crie componentes UI personalizáveis","Use com Radix UI e Tailwind CSS","Acessibilidade e usabilidade","Instalação e configuração fáceis","Documentação completa"],"ru":["Создайте настраиваемые компоненты UI","Используйте с Radix UI и Tailwind CSS","Доступность и удобство использования","Легкая установка и настройка","Полная документация"],"ar":["أنشئ مكونات واجهة المستخدم القابلة للتخصيص","استخدم مع راديكس يُو آي وتايلويند سي إس إس","الوصول والاستخدام","التثبيت والتهيئة السهلة","الوثائق الشاملة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["shadcn-ui","UI组件","可访问性","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","自定义UI","高效开发","前端开发"],"ja":["shadcn-ui","UIコンポーネント","アクセシビリティ","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","カスタマイズ可能なUI","効率的な開発","フロントエンド開発"],"ko":["shadcn-ui","UI 컴포넌트","접근성","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","맞춤형 UI","효율적인 개발","프론트엔드 개발"],"es":["shadcn-ui","componentes de UI","accesibilidad","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","desarrollo web","interfaces de usuario"],"fr":["shadcn-ui","composants d''interface utilisateur","accessibilité","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","développement web","interfaces utilisateur"],"de":["shadcn-ui","UI-Komponenten","Zugänglichkeit","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","Webentwicklung","Benutzeroberflächen"],"pt":["shadcn ui","componentes ui","radix ui","tailwind css","acessibilidade","usabilidade","desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["shadcn ui","компоненты ui","radix ui","tailwind css","доступность","удобство использования","веб-разработка"],"ar":["شادسن يُو آي","مكونات واجهة المستخدم","راديكس يُو آي","تايلوينند سي إس إس","الوصول","الاستخدام","تطوير الويب"]}},"owner":"mazzasaverio","repo":"youtube-to-read","repoPath":"mazzasaverio/youtube-to-read","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.424Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"shadcn-ui","description":"Complete shadcn/ui component library guide including installation, configuration, and implementation of accessible React components. Use when setting up shadcn/ui, installing components, building forms with React Hook Form and Zod, customizing themes with Tailwind CSS, or implementing UI patterns like buttons, dialogs, dropdowns, tables, and complex form layouts.","bodyPreview":"# shadcn/ui Component Patterns\n\nExpert guide for building accessible, customizable UI components with shadcn/ui, Radix UI, and Tailwind CSS.\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n- [When to Use](#when-to-use)\n- [Quick Start](#quick-start)\n- [Installation & Setup](#installation--setup)\n- [Project Configuration](#project-configuration)\n- [Core Components](#core-components)\n  - [Button](#button-component)\n  - [Input & Form Fields](#input--form-fields)\n  - [Forms with Validation](#forms-with-validation)\n  - [Card]","body":"# shadcn/ui Component Patterns\n\nExpert guide for building accessible, customizable UI components with shadcn/ui, Radix UI, and Tailwind CSS.\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n- [When to Use](#when-to-use)\n- [Quick Start](#quick-start)\n- [Installation & Setup](#installation--setup)\n- [Project Configuration](#project-configuration)\n- [Core Components](#core-components)\n  - [Button](#button-component)\n  - [Input & Form Fields](#input--form-fields)\n  - [Forms with Validation](#forms-with-validation)\n  - [Card](#card-component)\n  - [Dialog (Modal)](#dialog-modal-component)\n  - [Select (Dropdown)](#select-dropdown-component)\n  - [Sheet (Slide-over)](#sheet-slide-over-component)\n  - [Menubar & Navigation](#menubar--navigation)\n  - [Table](#table-component)\n  - [Toast Notifications](#toast-notifications)\n- [Advanced Patterns](#advanced-patterns)\n- [Customization](#customization)\n- [Next.js Integration](#nextjs-integration)\n- [Best Practices](#best-practices)\n- [Common Component Combinations](#common-component-combinations)\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Setting up a new project with shadcn/ui\n- Installing or configuring individual components\n- Building forms with React Hook Form and Zod validation\n- Creating accessible UI components (buttons, dialogs, dropdowns, sheets)\n- Customizing component styling with Tailwind CSS\n- Implementing design systems with shadcn/ui\n- Building Next.js applications with TypeScript\n- Creating complex layouts and data displays\n\n## Quick Start\n\nFor new projects, use the automated setup:\n\n```bash\n# Create Next.js project with shadcn/ui\nnpx create-next-app@latest my-app --typescript --tailwind --eslint --app\ncd my-app\nnpx shadcn@latest init\n\n# Install essential components\nnpx shadcn@latest add button input form card dialog select\n```\n\nFor existing projects:\n\n```bash\n# Install dependencies\nnpm install tailwindcss-animate class-variance-authority clsx tailwind-merge lucide-react\n\n# Initialize shadcn/ui\nnpx shadcn@latest init\n```\n\n## What is shadcn/ui?\n\nshadcn/ui is **not** a traditional component library or npm package. Instead:\n\n- It''s a **collection of reusable components** that you can copy into your project\n- Components are **yours to customize** - you own the code\n- Built with **Radix UI** primitives for accessibility\n- Styled with **Tailwind CSS** utilities\n- Includes CLI tool for easy component installation\n\n## Installation & Setup\n\n### Initial Setup\n\n```bash\n# Initialize shadcn/ui in your project\nnpx shadcn@latest init\n```\n\nDuring setup, you''ll configure:\n- TypeScript or JavaScript\n- Style (Default, New York, etc.)\n- Base color theme\n- CSS variables or Tailwind CSS classes\n- Component installation path\n\n### Installing Individual Components\n\n```bash\n# Install a single component\nnpx shadcn@latest add button\n\n# Install multiple components\nnpx shadcn@latest add button input form\n\n# Install all components\nnpx shadcn@latest add --all\n```\n\n### Manual Installation\n\nIf you prefer manual setup:\n\n```bash\n# Install dependencies for a specific component\nnpm install @radix-ui/react-slot\n\n# Copy component code from ui.shadcn.com\n# Place in src/components/ui/\n```\n\n## Project Configuration\n\n### Required Dependencies\n\n```json\n{\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"@radix-ui/react-accordion\": \"^1.1.2\",\n    \"@radix-ui/react-alert-dialog\": \"^1.0.5\",\n    \"@radix-ui/react-dialog\": \"^1.0.5\",\n    \"@radix-ui/react-dropdown-menu\": \"^2.0.6\",\n    \"@radix-ui/react-label\": \"^2.0.2\",\n    \"@radix-ui/react-select\": \"^2.0.0\",\n    \"@radix-ui/react-separator\": \"^1.0.3\",\n    \"@radix-ui/react-slot\": \"^1.0.2\",\n    \"@radix-ui/react-toast\": \"^1.1.5\",\n    \"class-variance-authority\": \"^0.7.0\",\n    \"clsx\": \"^2.0.0\",\n    \"lucide-react\": \"^0.294.0\",\n    \"tailwind-merge\": \"^2.0.0\",\n    \"tailwindcss-animate\": \"^1.0.7\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### TSConfig Configuration\n\n```json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"target\": \"es5\",\n    \"lib\": [\"dom\", \"dom.iterable\", \"es6\"],\n    \"allowJs\": true,\n    \"skipLibCheck\": true,\n    \"strict\": true,\n    \"forceConsistentCasingInFileNames\": true,\n    \"noEmit\": true,\n    \"esModuleInterop\": true,\n    \"module\": \"esnext\",\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"node\",\n    \"resolveJsonModule\": true,\n    \"isolatedModules\": true,\n    \"jsx\": \"preserve\",\n    \"incremental\": true,\n    \"plugins\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"next\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"baseUrl\": \".\",\n    \"paths\": {\n      \"@/components/*\": [\"./src/components/*\"],\n      \"@/lib/*\": [\"./src/lib/*\"]\n    }\n  },\n  \"include\": [\"next-env.d.ts\", \"**/*.ts\", \"**/*.tsx\", \".next/types/**/*.ts\"],\n  \"exclude\": [\"node_modules\"]\n}\n```\n\n### Tailwind Configuration\n\n```js\n// tailwind.config.js\n/** @type {import(''tailwindcss'').Config} */\nmodule.exports = {\n  darkMode: [\"class\"],\n  content: [\n    ''./pages/**/*.{ts,tsx}'',\n    ''./components/**/*.{ts,tsx}'',\n    ''./app/**/*.{ts,tsx}'',\n    ''./src/**/*.{ts,tsx}'',\n  ],\n  prefix: \"\",\n  theme: {\n    container: {\n      center: true,\n      padding: \"2rem\",\n      screens: {\n        \"2xl\": \"1400px\",\n      },\n    },\n    extend: {\n      colors: {\n        border: \"hsl(var(--border))\",\n        input: \"hsl(var(--input))\",\n        ring: \"hsl(var(--ring))\",\n        background: \"hsl(var(--background))\",\n        foreground: \"hsl(var(--foreground))\",\n        primary: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--primary))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--primary-foreground))\",\n        },\n        secondary: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--secondary))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--secondary-foreground))\",\n        },\n        destructive: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--destructive))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--destructive-foreground))\",\n        },\n        muted: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--muted))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--muted-foreground))\",\n        },\n        accent: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--accent))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--accent-foreground))\",\n        },\n        popover: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--popover))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--popover-foreground))\",\n        },\n        card: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--card))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--card-foreground))\",\n        },\n      },\n      borderRadius: {\n        lg: \"var(--radius)\",\n        md: \"calc(var(--radius) - 2px)\",\n        sm: \"calc(var(--radius) - 4px)\",\n      },\n      keyframes: {\n        \"accordion-down\": {\n          from: { height: \"0\" },\n          to: { height: \"var(--radix-accordion-content-height)\" },\n        },\n        \"accordion-up\": {\n          from: { height: \"var(--radix-accordion-content-height)\" },\n          to: { height: \"0\" },\n        },\n      },\n      animation: {\n        \"accordion-down\": \"accordion-down 0.2s ease-out\",\n        \"accordion-up\": \"accordion-up 0.2s ease-out\",\n      },\n    },\n  },\n  plugins: [require(\"tailwindcss-animate\")],\n}\n```\n\n### CSS Variables (globals.css)\n\n```css\n@tailwind base;\n@tailwind components;\n@tailwind utilities;\n\n@layer base {\n  :root {\n    --background: 0 0% 100%;\n    --foreground: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --card: 0 0% 100%;\n    --card-foreground: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --popover: 0 0% 100%;\n    --popover-foreground: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --primary: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --primary-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --secondary: 210 40% 96.1%;\n    --secondary-foreground: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --muted: 210 40% 96.1%;\n    --muted-foreground: 215.4 16.3% 46.9%;\n    --accent: 210 40% 96.1%;\n    --accent-foreground: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --destructive: 0 84.2% 60.2%;\n    --destructive-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --border: 214.3 31.8% 91.4%;\n    --input: 214.3 31.8% 91.4%;\n    --ring: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --radius: 0.5rem;\n  }\n\n  .dark {\n    --background: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --card: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --card-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --popover: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --popover-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --primary: 210 40% 98%;\n    --primary-foreground: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --secondary: 217.2 32.6% 17.5%;\n    --secondary-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --muted: 217.2 32.6% 17.5%;\n    --muted-foreground: 215 20.2% 65.1%;\n    --accent: 217.2 32.6% 17.5%;\n    --accent-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --destructive: 0 62.8% 30.6%;\n    --destructive-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --border: 217.2 32.6% 17.5%;\n    --input: 217.2 32.6% 17.5%;\n    --ring: 212.7 26.8% 83.9%;\n  }\n}\n\n@layer base {\n  * {\n    @apply border-border;\n  }\n  body {\n    @apply bg-background text-foreground;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Core Components\n\n### Button Component\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add button\n```\n\nBasic usage:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\";\n\nexport function ButtonDemo() {\n  return <Button>Click me</Button>;\n}\n```\n\nButton variants:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\";\n\nexport function ButtonVariants() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"flex gap-4\">\n      <Button variant=\"default\">Default</Button>\n      <Button variant=\"destructive\">Destructive</Button>\n      <Button variant=\"outline\">Outline</Button>\n      <Button variant=\"secondary\">Secondary</Button>\n      <Button variant=\"ghost\">Ghost</Button>\n      <Button variant=\"link\">Link</Button>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\nButton sizes:\n\n```tsx\n<div className=\"flex gap-4 items-center\">\n  <Button size=\"default\">Default</Button>\n  <Button size=\"sm\">Small</Button>\n  <Button size=\"lg\">Large</Button>\n  <Button size=\"icon\">\n    <Icon className=\"h-4 w-4\" />\n  </Button>\n</div>\n```\n\nWith loading state:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\";\nimport { Loader2 } from \"lucide-react\";\n\nexport function ButtonLoading() {\n  return (\n    <Button disabled>\n      <Loader2 className=\"mr-2 h-4 w-4 animate-spin\" />\n      Please wait\n    </Button>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Input & Form Fields\n\n#### Input Component\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add input\n```\n\nBasic input:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Input } from \"@/components/ui/input\";\n\nexport function InputDemo() {\n  return <Input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Email\" />;\n}\n```\n\nInput with label:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Input } from \"@/components/ui/input\";\nimport { Label } from \"@/components/ui/label\";\n\nexport function InputWithLabel() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"grid w-full max-w-sm items-center gap-1.5\">\n      <Label htmlFor=\"email\">Email</Label>\n      <Input type=\"email\" id=\"email\" placeholder=\"Email\" />\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\nInput with button:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\";\nimport { Input } from \"@/components/ui/input\";\n\nexport function InputWithButton() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"flex w-full max-w-sm items-center gap-2\">\n      <Input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Email\" />\n      <Button type=\"submit\" variant=\"outline\">Subscribe</Button>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Forms with Validation\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add form\n```\n\nThis installs React Hook Form, Zod, and form components.\n\nComplete form example:\n\n```tsx\n\"use client\"\n\nimport { zodResolver } from \"@hookform/resolvers/zod\"\nimport { useForm } from \"react-hook-form\"\nimport * as z from \"zod\"\n\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport {\n  Form,\n  FormControl,\n  FormDescription,\n  FormField,\n  FormItem,\n  FormLabel,\n  FormMessage,\n} from \"@/components/ui/form\"\nimport { Input } from \"@/components/ui/input\"\nimport { toast } from \"@/components/ui/use-toast\"\n\nconst formSchema = z.object({\n  username: z.string().min(2, {\n    message: \"Username must be at least 2 characters.\",\n  }),\n  email: z.string().email({\n    message: \"Please enter a valid email address.\",\n  }),\n})\n\nexport function ProfileForm() {\n  const form = useForm<z.infer<typeof formSchema>>({\n    resolver: zodResolver(formSchema),\n    defaultValues: {\n      username: \"\",\n      email: \"\",\n    },\n  })\n\n  function onSubmit(values: z.infer<typeof formSchema>) {\n    toast({\n      title: \"You submitted the following values:\",\n      description: (\n        <pre className=\"mt-2 w-[340px] rounded-md bg-slate-950 p-4\">\n          <code className=\"text-white\">{JSON.stringify(values, null, 2)}</code>\n        </pre>\n      ),\n    })\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <Form {...form}>\n      <form onSubmit={form.handleSubmit(onSubmit)} className=\"space-y-8\">\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"username\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Username</FormLabel>\n              <FormControl>\n                <Input placeholder=\"shadcn\" {...field} />\n              </FormControl>\n              <FormDescription>\n                This is your public display name.\n              </FormDescription>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n        \n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"email\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Email</FormLabel>\n              <FormControl>\n                <Input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\" {...field} />\n              </FormControl>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n        \n        <Button type=\"submit\">Submit</Button>\n      </form>\n    </Form>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Card Component\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add card\n```\n\nBasic card:\n\n```tsx\nimport {\n  Card,\n  CardContent,\n  CardDescription,\n  CardFooter,\n  CardHeader,\n  CardTitle,\n} from \"@/components/ui/card\"\n\nexport function CardDemo() {\n  return (\n    <Card>\n      <CardHeader>\n        <CardTitle>Card Title</CardTitle>\n        <CardDescription>Card Description</CardDescription>\n      </CardHeader>\n      <CardContent>\n        <p>Card Content</p>\n      </CardContent>\n      <CardFooter>\n        <p>Card Footer</p>\n      </CardFooter>\n    </Card>\n  )\n}\n```\n\nCard with form:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport {\n  Card,\n  CardContent,\n  CardDescription,\n  CardFooter,\n  CardHeader,\n  CardTitle,\n} from \"@/components/ui/card\"\nimport { Input } from \"@/components/ui/input\"\nimport { Label } from \"@/components/ui/label\"\n\nexport function CardWithForm() {\n  return (\n    <Card className=\"w-[350px]\">\n      <CardHeader>\n        <CardTitle>Create project</CardTitle>\n        <CardDescription>Deploy your new project in one-click.</CardDescription>\n      </CardHeader>\n      <CardContent>\n        <form>\n          <div className=\"grid w-full items-center gap-4\">\n            <div className=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5\">\n              <Label htmlFor=\"name\">Name</Label>\n              <Input id=\"name\" placeholder=\"Name of your project\" />\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </form>\n      </CardContent>\n      <CardFooter className=\"flex justify-between\">\n        <Button variant=\"outline\">Cancel</Button>\n        <Button>Deploy</Button>\n      </CardFooter>\n    </Card>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Dialog (Modal) Component\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add dialog\n```\n\nBasic dialog:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport {\n  Dialog,\n  DialogContent,\n  DialogDescription,\n  DialogFooter,\n  DialogHeader,\n  DialogTitle,\n  DialogTrigger,\n} from \"@/components/ui/dialog\"\n\nexport function DialogDemo() {\n  return (\n    <Dialog>\n      <DialogTrigger asChild>\n        <Button variant=\"outline\">Open Dialog</Button>\n      </DialogTrigger>\n      <DialogContent className=\"sm:max-w-[425px]\">\n        <DialogHeader>\n          <DialogTitle>Edit profile</DialogTitle>\n          <DialogDescription>\n            Make changes to your profile here. Click save when you''re done.\n          </DialogDescription>\n        </DialogHeader>\n        <div className=\"grid gap-4 py-4\">\n          <div className=\"grid grid-cols-4 items-center gap-4\">\n            <Label htmlFor=\"name\" className=\"text-right\">\n              Name\n            </Label>\n            <Input id=\"name\" value=\"Pedro Duarte\" className=\"col-span-3\" />\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <DialogFooter>\n          <Button type=\"submit\">Save changes</Button>\n        </DialogFooter>\n      </DialogContent>\n    </Dialog>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Sheet (Slide-over) Component\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add sheet\n```\n\nBasic sheet:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport {\n  Sheet,\n  SheetContent,\n  SheetDescription,\n  SheetHeader,\n  SheetTitle,\n  SheetTrigger,\n} from \"@/components/ui/sheet\"\n\nexport function SheetDemo() {\n  return (\n    <Sheet>\n      <SheetTrigger asChild>\n        <Button variant=\"outline\">Open Sheet</Button>\n      </SheetTrigger>\n      <SheetContent>\n        <SheetHeader>\n          <SheetTitle>Edit profile</SheetTitle>\n          <SheetDescription>\n            Make changes to your profile here. Click save when you''re done.\n          </SheetDescription>\n        </SheetHeader>\n        <div className=\"grid gap-4 py-4\">\n          <div className=\"grid grid-cols-4 items-center gap-4\">\n            <Label htmlFor=\"name\" className=\"text-right\">\n              Name\n            </Label>\n            <Input id=\"name\" value=\"Pedro Duarte\" className=\"col-span-3\" />\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"grid grid-cols-4 items-center gap-4\">\n            <Label htmlFor=\"username\" className=\"text-right\">\n              Username\n            </Label>\n            <Input id=\"username\" value=\"@peduarte\" className=\"col-span-3\" />\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </SheetContent>\n    </Sheet>\n  )\n}\n```\n\nSheet with side placement:\n\n```tsx\n<Sheet>\n  <SheetTrigger asChild>\n    <Button variant=\"outline\">Open Right Sheet</Button>\n  </SheetTrigger>\n  <SheetContent side=\"right\">\n    <SheetHeader>\n      <SheetTitle>Settings</SheetTitle>\n      <SheetDescription>\n        Configure your application settings here.\n      </SheetDescription>\n    </SheetHeader>\n    {/* Settings content */}\n  </SheetContent>\n</Sheet>\n```\n\n### Menubar & Navigation\n\n#### Menubar Component\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add menubar\n```\n\nBasic menubar:\n\n```tsx\nimport {\n  Menubar,\n  MenubarContent,\n  MenubarItem,\n  MenubarMenu,\n  MenubarSeparator,\n  MenubarShortcut,\n  MenubarSub,\n  MenubarSubContent,\n  MenubarSubTrigger,\n  MenubarTrigger,\n} from \"@/components/ui/menubar\"\n\nexport function MenubarDemo() {\n  return (\n    <Menubar>\n      <MenubarMenu>\n        <MenubarTrigger>File</MenubarTrigger>\n        <MenubarContent>\n          <MenubarItem>\n            New Tab <MenubarShortcut>⌘T</MenubarShortcut>\n          </MenubarItem>\n          <MenubarItem>\n            New Window <MenubarShortcut>⌘N</MenubarShortcut>\n          </MenubarItem>\n          <MenubarSeparator />\n          <MenubarItem>Share</MenubarItem>\n          <MenubarSeparator />\n          <MenubarItem>Print</MenubarItem>\n        </MenubarContent>\n      </MenubarMenu>\n      <MenubarMenu>\n        <MenubarTrigger>Edit</MenubarTrigger>\n        <MenubarContent>\n          <MenubarItem>\n            Undo <MenubarShortcut>⌘Z</MenubarShortcut>\n          </MenubarItem>\n          <MenubarItem>\n            Redo <MenubarShortcut>⌘Y</MenubarShortcut>\n          </MenubarItem>\n          <MenubarSeparator />\n          <MenubarSub>\n            <MenubarSubTrigger>Find</MenubarSubTrigger>\n            <MenubarSubContent>\n              <MenubarItem>Search the web</MenubarItem>\n              <MenubarItem>Find...</MenubarItem>\n              <MenubarItem>Find Next</MenubarItem>\n              <MenubarItem>Find Previous</MenubarItem>\n            </MenubarSubContent>\n          </MenubarSub>\n        </MenubarContent>\n      </MenubarMenu>\n    </Menubar>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Select (Dropdown) Component\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add select\n```\n\nBasic select:\n\n```tsx\nimport {\n  Select,\n  SelectContent,\n  SelectItem,\n  SelectTrigger,\n  SelectValue,\n} from \"@/components/ui/select\"\n\nexport function SelectDemo() {\n  return (\n    <Select>\n      <SelectTrigger className=\"w-[180px]\">\n        <SelectValue placeholder=\"Select a fruit\" />\n      </SelectTrigger>\n      <SelectContent>\n        <SelectItem value=\"apple\">Apple</SelectItem>\n        <SelectItem value=\"banana\">Banana</SelectItem>\n        <SelectItem value=\"orange\">Orange</SelectItem>\n      </SelectContent>\n    </Select>\n  )\n}\n```\n\nSelect in form:\n\n```tsx\n<FormField\n  control={form.control}\n  name=\"role\"\n  render={({ field }) => (\n    <FormItem>\n      <FormLabel>Role</FormLabel>\n      <Select onValueChange={field.onChange} defaultValue={field.value}>\n        <FormControl>\n          <SelectTrigger>\n            <SelectValue placeholder=\"Select a role\" />\n          </SelectTrigger>\n        </FormControl>\n        <SelectContent>\n          <SelectItem value=\"admin\">Admin</SelectItem>\n          <SelectItem value=\"user\">User</SelectItem>\n          <SelectItem value=\"guest\">Guest</SelectItem>\n        </SelectContent>\n      </Select>\n      <FormMessage />\n    </FormItem>\n  )}\n/>\n```\n\n### Toast Notifications\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add toast\n```\n\nSetup toast provider in root layout:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Toaster } from \"@/components/ui/toaster\"\n\nexport default function RootLayout({ children }) {\n  return (\n    <html lang=\"en\">\n      <body>\n        {children}\n        <Toaster />\n      </body>\n    </html>\n  )\n}\n```\n\nUsing toast:\n\n```tsx\nimport { useToast } from \"@/components/ui/use-toast\"\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\n\nexport function ToastDemo() {\n  const { toast } = useToast()\n\n  return (\n    <Button\n      onClick={() => {\n        toast({\n          title: \"Scheduled: Catch up\",\n          description: \"Friday, February 10, 2023 at 5:57 PM\",\n        })\n      }}\n    >\n      Show Toast\n    </Button>\n  )\n}\n```\n\nToast variants:\n\n```tsx\n// Success\ntoast({\n  title: \"Success\",\n  description: \"Your changes have been saved.\",\n})\n\n// Error\ntoast({\n  variant: \"destructive\",\n  title: \"Error\",\n  description: \"Something went wrong.\",\n})\n\n// With action\ntoast({\n  title: \"Uh oh! Something went wrong.\",\n  description: \"There was a problem with your request.\",\n  action: <ToastAction altText=\"Try again\">Try again</ToastAction>,\n})\n```\n\n### Table Component\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add table\n```\n\nBasic table:\n\n```tsx\nimport {\n  Table,\n  TableBody,\n  TableCaption,\n  TableCell,\n  TableHead,\n  TableHeader,\n  TableRow,\n} from \"@/components/ui/table\"\n\nconst invoices = [\n  { invoice: \"INV001\", status: \"Paid\", method: \"Credit Card\", amount: \"$250.00\" },\n  { invoice: \"INV002\", status: \"Pending\", method: \"PayPal\", amount: \"$150.00\" },\n]\n\nexport function TableDemo() {\n  return (\n    <Table>\n      <TableCaption>A list of your recent invoices.</TableCaption>\n      <TableHeader>\n        <TableRow>\n          <TableHead>Invoice</TableHead>\n          <TableHead>Status</TableHead>\n          <TableHead>Method</TableHead>\n          <TableHead className=\"text-right\">Amount</TableHead>\n        </TableRow>\n      </TableHeader>\n      <TableBody>\n        {invoices.map((invoice) => (\n          <TableRow key={invoice.invoice}>\n            <TableCell className=\"font-medium\">{invoice.invoice}</TableCell>\n            <TableCell>{invoice.status}</TableCell>\n            <TableCell>{invoice.method}</TableCell>\n            <TableCell className=\"text-right\">{invoice.amount}</TableCell>\n          </TableRow>\n        ))}\n      </TableBody>\n    </Table>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Customization\n\n### Theming with CSS Variables\n\nshadcn/ui uses CSS variables for theming. Configure in `globals.css`:\n\n```css\n@layer base {\n  :root {\n    --background: 0 0% 100%;\n    --foreground: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --primary: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --primary-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --secondary: 210 40% 96.1%;\n    --secondary-foreground: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --muted: 210 40% 96.1%;\n    --muted-foreground: 215.4 16.3% 46.9%;\n    --accent: 210 40% 96.1%;\n    --accent-foreground: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --destructive: 0 84.2% 60.2%;\n    --destructive-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --border: 214.3 31.8% 91.4%;\n    --input: 214.3 31.8% 91.4%;\n    --ring: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --radius: 0.5rem;\n  }\n\n  .dark {\n    --background: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --primary: 210 40% 98%;\n    --primary-foreground: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    /* ... other dark mode variables */\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Customizing Components\n\nSince you own the code, customize directly:\n\n```tsx\n// components/ui/button.tsx\nimport * as React from \"react\"\nimport { Slot } from \"@radix-ui/react-slot\"\nimport { cva, type VariantProps } from \"class-variance-authority\"\nimport { cn } from \"@/lib/utils\"\n\nconst buttonVariants = cva(\n  \"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors\",\n  {\n    variants: {\n      variant: {\n        default: \"bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/90\",\n        destructive: \"bg-destructive text-destructive-foreground hover:bg-destructive/90\",\n        outline: \"border border-input bg-background hover:bg-accent\",\n        // Add custom variant\n        custom: \"bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-500 to-pink-500 text-white\",\n      },\n      size: {\n        default: \"h-10 px-4 py-2\",\n        sm: \"h-9 rounded-md px-3\",\n        lg: \"h-11 rounded-md px-8\",\n        // Add custom size\n        xl: \"h-14 rounded-md px-10 text-lg\",\n      },\n    },\n    defaultVariants: {\n      variant: \"default\",\n      size: \"default\",\n    },\n  }\n)\n\nexport interface ButtonProps\n  extends React.ButtonHTMLAttributes<HTMLButtonElement>,\n    VariantProps<typeof buttonVariants> {\n  asChild?: boolean\n}\n\nconst Button = React.forwardRef<HTMLButtonElement, ButtonProps>(\n  ({ className, variant, size, asChild = false, ...props }, ref) => {\n    const Comp = asChild ? Slot : \"button\"\n    return (\n      <Comp\n        className={cn(buttonVariants({ variant, size, className }))}\n        ref={ref}\n        {...props}\n      />\n    )\n  }\n)\nButton.displayName = \"Button\"\n\nexport { Button, buttonVariants }\n```\n\n## Next.js Integration\n\n### App Router Setup\n\nFor Next.js 13+ with App Router, ensure components use `\"use client\"` directive:\n\n```tsx\n// src/components/ui/button.tsx\n\"use client\"\n\nimport * as React from \"react\"\nimport { Slot } from \"@radix-ui/react-slot\"\nimport { cva, type VariantProps } from \"class-variance-authority\"\nimport { cn } from \"@/lib/utils\"\n\n// ... rest of component\n```\n\n### Layout Integration\n\nAdd the Toaster to your root layout:\n\n```tsx\n// app/layout.tsx\nimport { Toaster } from \"@/components/ui/toaster\"\nimport \"./globals.css\"\n\nexport default function RootLayout({\n  children,\n}: {\n  children: React.ReactNode\n}) {\n  return (\n    <html lang=\"en\" suppressHydrationWarning>\n      <body className=\"min-h-screen bg-background font-sans antialiased\">\n        {children}\n        <Toaster />\n      </body>\n    </html>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Server Components\n\nWhen using shadcn/ui components in Server Components, wrap them in a Client Component:\n\n```tsx\n// app/dashboard/page.tsx\nimport { Card, CardContent, CardHeader, CardTitle } from \"@/components/ui/card\"\nimport { ButtonClient } from \"@/components/ui/button-client\"\n\nexport default function DashboardPage() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"container mx-auto p-6\">\n      <Card>\n        <CardHeader>\n          <CardTitle>Dashboard</CardTitle>\n        </CardHeader>\n        <CardContent>\n          <ButtonClient>Interactive Button</ButtonClient>\n        </CardContent>\n      </Card>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n```tsx\n// src/components/ui/button-client.tsx\n\"use client\"\n\nimport { Button } from \"./button\"\n\nexport function ButtonClient(props: React.ComponentProps<typeof Button>) {\n  return <Button {...props} />\n}\n```\n\n### Route Handlers with Forms\n\nCreate API routes for form submissions:\n\n```tsx\n// app/api/contact/route.ts\nimport { NextRequest, NextResponse } from \"next/server\"\nimport { z } from \"zod\"\n\nconst contactSchema = z.object({\n  name: z.string().min(2),\n  email: z.string().email(),\n  message: z.string().min(10),\n})\n\nexport async function POST(request: NextRequest) {\n  try {\n    const body = await request.json()\n    const validated = contactSchema.parse(body)\n\n    // Process form data\n    console.log(\"Form submission:\", validated)\n\n    return NextResponse.json({ success: true })\n  } catch (error) {\n    if (error instanceof z.ZodError) {\n      return NextResponse.json(\n        { errors: error.errors },\n        { status: 400 }\n      )\n    }\n\n    return NextResponse.json(\n      { error: \"Internal server error\" },\n      { status: 500 }\n    )\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Form with Server Action\n\nUsing Next.js 14+ Server Actions:\n\n```tsx\n// app/contact/page.tsx\n\"use client\"\n\nimport { zodResolver } from \"@hookform/resolvers/zod\"\nimport { useForm } from \"react-hook-form\"\nimport * as z from \"zod\"\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport {\n  Form,\n  FormControl,\n  FormField,\n  FormItem,\n  FormLabel,\n  FormMessage,\n} from \"@/components/ui/form\"\nimport { Input } from \"@/components/ui/input\"\nimport { Textarea } from \"@/components/ui/textarea\"\nimport { toast } from \"@/components/ui/use-toast\"\n\nconst formSchema = z.object({\n  name: z.string().min(2),\n  email: z.string().email(),\n  message: z.string().min(10),\n})\n\nasync function onSubmit(values: z.infer<typeof formSchema>) {\n  try {\n    const response = await fetch(\"/api/contact\", {\n      method: \"POST\",\n      headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n      body: JSON.stringify(values),\n    })\n\n    if (!response.ok) throw new Error(\"Failed to submit\")\n\n    toast({\n      title: \"Success!\",\n      description: \"Your message has been sent.\",\n    })\n  } catch (error) {\n    toast({\n      variant: \"destructive\",\n      title: \"Error\",\n      description: \"Failed to send message. Please try again.\",\n    })\n  }\n}\n\nexport default function ContactPage() {\n  const form = useForm<z.infer<typeof formSchema>>({\n    resolver: zodResolver(formSchema),\n  })\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"container mx-auto max-w-2xl py-8\">\n      <Form {...form}>\n        <form onSubmit={form.handleSubmit(onSubmit)} className=\"space-y-6\">\n          <FormField\n            control={form.control}\n            name=\"name\"\n            render={({ field }) => (\n              <FormItem>\n                <FormLabel>Name</FormLabel>\n                <FormControl>\n                  <Input placeholder=\"Your name\" {...field} />\n                </FormControl>\n                <FormMessage />\n              </FormItem>\n            )}\n          />\n\n          <FormField\n            control={form.control}\n            name=\"email\"\n            render={({ field }) => (\n              <FormItem>\n                <FormLabel>Email</FormLabel>\n                <FormControl>\n                  <Input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"your@email.com\" {...field} />\n                </FormControl>\n                <FormMessage />\n              </FormItem>\n            )}\n          />\n\n          <FormField\n            control={form.control}\n            name=\"message\"\n            render={({ field }) => (\n              <FormItem>\n                <FormLabel>Message</FormLabel>\n                <FormControl>\n                  <Textarea\n                    placeholder=\"Your message...\"\n                    className=\"resize-none\"\n                    {...field}\n                  />\n                </FormControl>\n                <FormMessage />\n              </FormItem>\n            )}\n          />\n\n          <Button type=\"submit\" className=\"w-full\">\n            Send Message\n          </Button>\n        </form>\n      </Form>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Metadata with shadcn/ui\n\nUsing shadcn/ui components in metadata:\n\n```tsx\n// app/layout.tsx\nimport { Metadata } from \"next\"\n\nexport const metadata: Metadata = {\n  title: {\n    default: \"My App\",\n    template: \"%s | My App\",\n  },\n  description: \"Built with shadcn/ui and Next.js\",\n}\n\n// app/about/page.tsx\nimport { Metadata } from \"next\"\nimport { Card, CardContent, CardHeader, CardTitle } from \"@/components/ui/card\"\n\nexport const metadata: Metadata = {\n  title: \"About Us\",\n  description: \"Learn more about our company\",\n}\n\nexport default function AboutPage() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"container mx-auto py-8\">\n      <Card>\n        <CardHeader>\n          <CardTitle>About Our Company</CardTitle>\n        </CardHeader>\n        <CardContent>\n          <p>We build amazing products with modern web technologies.</p>\n        </CardContent>\n      </Card>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Font Optimization\n\nOptimize fonts with next/font:\n\n```tsx\n// app/layout.tsx\nimport { Inter } from \"next/font/google\"\nimport { Toaster } from \"@/components/ui/toaster\"\nimport { cn } from \"@/lib/utils\"\nimport \"./globals.css\"\n\nconst inter = Inter({ subsets: [\"latin\"] })\n\nexport default function RootLayout({\n  children,\n}: {\n  children: React.ReactNode\n}) {\n  return (\n    <html lang=\"en\" suppressHydrationWarning>\n      <body className={cn(\"min-h-screen bg-background font-sans antialiased\", inter.className)}>\n        {children}\n        <Toaster />\n      </body>\n    </html>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Advanced Patterns\n\n### Form with Multiple Fields\n\n```tsx\nconst formSchema = z.object({\n  username: z.string().min(2).max(50),\n  email: z.string().email(),\n  bio: z.string().max(160).min(4),\n  role: z.enum([\"admin\", \"user\", \"guest\"]),\n  notifications: z.boolean().default(false),\n})\n\nexport function AdvancedForm() {\n  const form = useForm<z.infer<typeof formSchema>>({\n    resolver: zodResolver(formSchema),\n    defaultValues: {\n      username: \"\",\n      email: \"\",\n      bio: \"\",\n      role: \"user\",\n      notifications: false,\n    },\n  })\n\n  function onSubmit(values: z.infer<typeof formSchema>) {\n    console.log(values)\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <Form {...form}>\n      <form onSubmit={form.handleSubmit(onSubmit)} className=\"space-y-8\">\n        {/* Username field */}\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"username\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Username</FormLabel>\n              <FormControl>\n                <Input placeholder=\"johndoe\" {...field} />\n              </FormControl>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n\n        {/* Email field */}\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"email\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Email</FormLabel>\n              <FormControl>\n                <Input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"john@example.com\" {...field} />\n              </FormControl>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n\n        {/* Textarea field */}\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"bio\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Bio</FormLabel>\n              <FormControl>\n                <Textarea\n                  placeholder=\"Tell us about yourself\"\n                  className=\"resize-none\"\n                  {...field}\n                />\n              </FormControl>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n\n        {/* Select field */}\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"role\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Role</FormLabel>\n              <Select onValueChange={field.onChange} defaultValue={field.value}>\n                <FormControl>\n                  <SelectTrigger>\n                    <SelectValue placeholder=\"Select a role\" />\n                  </SelectTrigger>\n                </FormControl>\n                <SelectContent>\n                  <SelectItem value=\"admin\">Admin</SelectItem>\n                  <SelectItem value=\"user\">User</SelectItem>\n                  <SelectItem value=\"guest\">Guest</SelectItem>\n                </SelectContent>\n              </Select>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n\n        {/* Checkbox field */}\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"notifications\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem className=\"flex flex-row items-start space-x-3 space-y-0\">\n              <FormControl>\n                <Checkbox\n                  checked={field.value}\n                  onCheckedChange={field.onChange}\n                />\n              </FormControl>\n              <div className=\"space-y-1 leading-none\">\n                <FormLabel>Email notifications</FormLabel>\n                <FormDescription>\n                  Receive emails about your account activity.\n                </FormDescription>\n              </div>\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n\n        <Button type=\"submit\">Submit</Button>\n      </form>\n    </Form>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Accessibility**: Components use Radix UI primitives for ARIA compliance\n2. **Customization**: Modify components directly in your codebase\n3. **Type Safety**: Use TypeScript for type-safe props and state\n4. **Validation**: Use Zod schemas for form validation\n5. **Styling**: Leverage Tailwind utilities and CSS variables\n6. **Consistency**: Use the same component patterns across your app\n7. **Testing**: Components are testable with React Testing Library\n8. **Performance**: Components are optimized and tree-shakeable\n\n## Common Component Combinations\n\n### Login Form\n\n```tsx\n<Card className=\"w-[350px]\">\n  <CardHeader>\n    <CardTitle>Login</CardTitle>\n    <CardDescription>Enter your credentials to continue</CardDescription>\n  </CardHeader>\n  <CardContent>\n    <Form {...form}>\n      <form onSubmit={form.handleSubmit(onSubmit)} className=\"space-y-4\">\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"email\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Email</FormLabel>\n              <FormControl>\n                <Input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\" {...field} />\n              </FormControl>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"password\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Password</FormLabel>\n              <FormControl>\n                <Input type=\"password\" {...field} />\n              </FormControl>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n        <Button type=\"submit\" className=\"w-full\">Login</Button>\n      </form>\n    </Form>\n  </CardContent>\n</Card>\n```\n\n## References\n\n- Official Docs: https://ui.shadcn.com\n- Radix UI: https://www.radix-ui.com\n- React Hook Form: https://react-hook-form.com\n- Zod: https://zod.dev\n- Tailwind CSS: https://tailwindcss.com\n- Examples: https://ui.shadcn.com/examples\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:40:34.544Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing accessible and customizable UI components with Radix UI and Tailwind CSS.","zh":"非常适合需要可访问和可定制的UI组件的前端代理，使用Radix UI和Tailwind CSS。","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントがアクセス可能でカスタマイズ可能なUIコンポーネントを必要とする場合に最適です。Radix UIとTailwind CSSを使用します。","ko":"접근 및 사용자 지정 가능한 UI 컴포넌트가 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다. Radix UI 및 Tailwind CSS를 사용합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Frontend que necesitan componentes de UI accesibles y personalizables con Radix UI y Tailwind CSS.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin de composants d''interface utilisateur accessibles et personnalisables avec Radix UI et Tailwind CSS.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die zugängliche und anpassbare Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten mit Radix UI und Tailwind CSS benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de componentes de UI acessíveis e personalizáveis com Radix UI e Tailwind CSS.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым требуются доступные и настраиваемые компоненты интерфейса пользователя с Radix UI и Tailwind CSS.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الأمامية الذي يحتاج إلى مكونات واجهة المستخدم القابلة للوصول والقابلة للتخصيص مع Radix UI و Tailwind CSS."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build responsive and interactive user interfaces using shadcn-ui component patterns, leveraging core components like Button, Input & Form Fields, and Cards, all while utilizing Tailwind CSS for styling.","zh":"赋予代理构建响应式和交互式用户界面使用shadcn-ui组件模式的能力，利用核心组件如按钮、输入和表单字段以及卡片，同时利用Tailwind CSS进行样式设置。","ja":"shadcn-uiコンポーネントパターンを使用して、ボタン、入力フォーム、カードなどのコアコンポーネントを活用し、Tailwind CSSを使用してスタイリングを行うことで、レスポンシブでインタラクティブなユーザーインターフェイスを構築するエージェントの能力を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 shadcn-ui 컴포넌트 패턴을 사용하여 응답형 및 상호 작용형 사용자 인터페이스를 구축할 수 있는 능력을 제공하며, 핵심 컴포넌트인 버튼, 입력 및 양식 필드, 카드 등을 활용하며, Tailwind CSS를 사용하여 스타일을 지정합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear interfaces de usuario responsivas e interactivas utilizando patrones de componentes de shadcn-ui, aprovechando componentes básicos como Botón, Entrada y Campos de formulario, y Tarjetas, todo mientras utiliza Tailwind CSS para el estilo.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des interfaces utilisateur responsives et interactives en utilisant des modèles de composants shadcn-ui, en exploitant des composants de base tels que Bouton, Entrée et Champs de formulaire, et Cartes, le tout en utilisant Tailwind CSS pour la mise en page.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, responsive und interaktive Benutzeroberflächen mit shadcn-ui-Componentenmustern zu erstellen, indem sie Kernkomponenten wie Schaltfläche, Eingabe und Formularfelder sowie Karten nutzen, und gleichzeitig Tailwind CSS für die Formatierung verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir interfaces de usuário responsivas e interativas usando padrões de componentes shadcn-ui, aproveitando componentes principais como Botão, Entrada e Campos de Formulário e Cartões, tudo isso utilizando Tailwind CSS para estilização.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать отзывчивые и интерактивные пользовательские интерфейсы, используя шаблоны компонентов shadcn-ui, используя основные компоненты, такие как Кнопка, Ввод и поля формы, и Карточки, все это при использовании Tailwind CSS для стилизации.","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من بناء واجهات مستخدم مستجيبَة وتفاعليّة باستخدام أنماط مكونات shadcn-ui، واستخدام المكونات الرئيسية مثل الزر والمدخل وحقول النموذج والبطاقات، وكل ذلك باستخدام Tailwind CSS للتنسيق."},"useCases":{"en":["Building accessible and customizable UI components","Creating responsive and interactive forms with validation","Designing card-based layouts with shadcn-ui core components"],"zh":["构建可访问和可定制的UI组件","创建带有验证的响应式和交互式表单","使用shadcn-ui核心组件设计基于卡片的布局"],"ja":["アクセス可能でカスタマイズ可能なUIコンポーネントの構築","バリデーションを伴うレスポンシブでインタラクティブなフォームの作成","shadcn-uiコアコンポーネントを使用したカードベースのレイアウトの設計"],"ko":["접근 및 사용자 지정 가능한 UI 컴포넌트 구축","검증을 사용한 응답형 및 상호 작용형 양식 생성","shadcn-ui 핵심 컴포넌트를 사용하여 카드 기반 레이아웃 설계"],"es":["Creación de componentes de UI accesibles y personalizables","Creación de formularios responsivos e interactivos con validación","Diseño de diseños basados en tarjetas con componentes básicos de shadcn-ui"],"fr":["Création de composants d''interface utilisateur accessibles et personnalisables","Création de formulaires responsives et interactifs avec validation","Conception de mises en page basées sur des cartes avec des composants de base shadcn-ui"],"de":["Erstellung von zugänglichen und anpassbaren Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten","Erstellung von responsiven und interaktiven Formularen mit Validierung","Entwurf von kartenbasierten Layouts mit shadcn-ui-Kernkomponenten"],"pt":["Construir componentes de UI acessíveis e personalizáveis","Criar formulários responsivos e interativos com validação","Projetar layouts baseados em cartões com componentes principais shadcn-ui"],"ru":["Построение доступных и настраиваемых компонентов интерфейса пользователя","Создание отзывчивых и интерактивных форм с валидацией","Проектирование макетов на основе карточек с основными компонентами shadcn-ui"],"ar":["بناء مكونات واجهة المستخدم القابلة للوصول والقابلة للتخصيص","إنشاء استمارات مستجيبَة وتفاعليّة مع التحقق","تصميم تخطيطات قائمة على البطاقات مع مكونات شادcn-واجهة المستخدم الأساسية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Tailwind CSS and Radix UI","Limited to building UI components, not a full-fledged framework"],"zh":["需要Tailwind CSS和Radix UI的知识","仅限于构建UI组件，不是完整的框架"],"ja":["Tailwind CSSとRadix UIの知識が必要","UIコンポーネントの構築のみに限定され、完全なフレームワークではない"],"ko":["Tailwind CSS 및 Radix UI에 대한 지식이 필요","UI 컴포넌트 구축에만 제한되며, 완전한 프레임워크는 아님"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de Tailwind CSS y Radix UI","Limitado a la creación de componentes de UI, no un framework completo"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en Tailwind CSS et Radix UI","Limité à la création de composants d''interface utilisateur, et non à un framework complet"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von Tailwind CSS und Radix UI","Begrenzt auf die Erstellung von Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten, nicht ein vollständiges Framework"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de Tailwind CSS e Radix UI","Limitado à construção de componentes de UI, não um framework completo"],"ru":["Требует знания Tailwind CSS и Radix UI","Ограничен построением компонентов интерфейса пользователя, не полноценный фреймворк"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة Tailwind CSS و Radix UI","محدود ببناء مكونات واجهة المستخدم، وليس إطار عمل كامل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('AMontagu/news-from-historical-people/shadcn-ui', 'community', 'AMontagu', 'news-from-historical-people', 'AMontagu/news-from-historical-people', 'shadcn-ui', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.424Z', '2026-02-18T04:40:47.776Z', NULL, '{"id":"AMontagu/news-from-historical-people/shadcn-ui","name":"shadcn-ui","description":{"zh":"shadcn-ui Radix UI Tailwind CSS ","ja":"shadcn-ui Radix UI Tailwind CSS ","ko":"shadcn-ui Radix UI Tailwind CSS ","es":"Guía experta para crear componentes UI accesibles y personalizables con shadcn-ui, Radix UI y Tailwind CSS. Incluye patrones y mejores prácticas","fr":"Guide expert pour créer des composants UI accessibles et personnalisables avec shadcn-ui, Radix UI et Tailwind CSS. Inclut des modèles et des meilleures pratiques","de":"Expertenführer für die Erstellung zugänglicher und anpassbarer UI-Komponenten mit shadcn-ui, Radix UI und Tailwind CSS. Enthält Muster und Best Practices","pt":"Guia de componentes UI shadcn-ui para desenvolvedores, cobrindo tópicos como instalação, configuração e componentes principais","ru":"Руководство по компонентам UI shadcn-ui для разработчиков, охватывающее темы, такие как установка, настройка и основные компоненты","ar":"دليل مكونات واجهة المستخدم shadcn-ui للمطورين, يغطي مواضيع مثل التثبيت والتهيئة والمكونات الأساسية","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"shadcn-ui ","ja":"shadcn-ui","ko":"shadcn-ui","es":"Guía de patrones de componentes UI con shadcn-ui","fr":"Guide de modèles de composants UI avec shadcn-ui","de":"Anleitung für UI-Komponenten-Muster mit shadcn-ui","pt":"Guia de Componentes UI shadcn-ui","ru":"Руководство по компонентам UI shadcn-ui","ar":"دليل مكونات واجهة المستخدم shadcn-ui","en":"shadcn-ui"},"description":{"zh":"shadcn-ui Radix UI Tailwind CSS ","ja":"shadcn-ui Radix UI Tailwind CSS ","ko":"shadcn-ui Radix UI Tailwind CSS ","es":"Guía experta para crear componentes UI accesibles y personalizables con shadcn-ui, Radix UI y Tailwind CSS. Incluye patrones y mejores prácticas","fr":"Guide expert pour créer des composants UI accessibles et personnalisables avec shadcn-ui, Radix UI et Tailwind CSS. Inclut des modèles et des meilleures prat...","de":"Expertenführer für die Erstellung zugänglicher und anpassbarer UI-Komponenten mit shadcn-ui, Radix UI und Tailwind CSS. Enthält Muster und Best Practices","pt":"Guia de componentes UI shadcn-ui para desenvolvedores, cobrindo tópicos como instalação, configuração e componentes principais","ru":"Руководство по компонентам UI shadcn-ui для разработчиков, охватывающее темы, такие как установка, настройка и основные компоненты","ar":"دليل مكونات واجهة المستخدم shadcn-ui للمطورين, يغطي مواضيع مثل التثبيت والتهيئة والمكونات الأساسية","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["shadcn-ui","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","UI","shadcn/ui","UI"],"ja":["shadcn-ui","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","UI","shadcn/ui","UI"],"ko":["shadcn-ui","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","UI","shadcn/ui","UI"],"es":["Componentes UI personalizables","Accesibilidad integrada","Integración con Radix UI y Tailwind CSS","Patrones de componentes predefinidos","Validación de formularios"],"fr":["Composants UI personnalisables","Accessibilité intégrée","Intégration avec Radix UI et Tailwind CSS","Modèles de composants prédéfinis","Validation de formulaires"],"de":["Anpassbare UI-Komponenten","Integrierte Zugänglichkeit","Integration mit Radix UI und Tailwind CSS","Vordefinierte Komponentenmuster","Formularvalidierung"],"pt":["Componentes UI personalizáveis","Acessibilidade garantida","Integração com Radix UI e Tailwind CSS","Guia de instalação e configuração","Exemplos de componentes principais"],"ru":["Настройные компоненты UI","Гарантированная доступность","Интеграция с Radix UI и Tailwind CSS","Руководство по установке и настройке","Примеры основных компонентов"],"ar":["مكونات واجهة المستخدم المخصصة","الوصول garantido","التكامل مع Radix UI و Tailwind CSS","دليل التثبيت والتهيئة","أمثلة المكونات الأساسية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["shadcn-ui","UI","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","shadcn/ui","UI","UI","UI"],"ja":["shadcn-ui","UI","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","shadcn/ui","UI","UI","UI"],"ko":["shadcn-ui","UI","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","shadcn/ui","UI","UI","UI"],"es":["shadcn-ui","componentes UI","accesibilidad","personalización","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","patrones de componentes","validación de formularios"],"fr":["shadcn-ui","composants UI","accessibilité","personnalisation","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","modèles de composants","validation de formulaires"],"de":["shadcn-ui","UI-Komponenten","Zugänglichkeit","Anpassung","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","Komponentenmuster","Formularvalidierung"],"pt":["shadcn-ui","componentes UI","acessibilidade","personalização","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["shadcn-ui","компоненты UI","доступность","настройка","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","веб-разработка"],"ar":["shadcn-ui","مكونات واجهة المستخدم","الوصول","التخصيص","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","تطوير الويب"]}},"owner":"AMontagu","repo":"news-from-historical-people","repoPath":"AMontagu/news-from-historical-people","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.424Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"shadcn-ui","description":"Complete shadcn/ui component library guide including installation, configuration, and implementation of accessible React components. Use when setting up shadcn/ui, installing components, building forms with React Hook Form and Zod, customizing themes with Tailwind CSS, or implementing UI patterns like buttons, dialogs, dropdowns, tables, and complex form layouts.","bodyPreview":"# shadcn/ui Component Patterns\n\nExpert guide for building accessible, customizable UI components with shadcn/ui, Radix UI, and Tailwind CSS.\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n- [When to Use](#when-to-use)\n- [Quick Start](#quick-start)\n- [Installation & Setup](#installation--setup)\n- [Project Configuration](#project-configuration)\n- [Core Components](#core-components)\n  - [Button](#button-component)\n  - [Input & Form Fields](#input--form-fields)\n  - [Forms with Validation](#forms-with-validation)\n  - [Card]","body":"# shadcn/ui Component Patterns\n\nExpert guide for building accessible, customizable UI components with shadcn/ui, Radix UI, and Tailwind CSS.\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n- [When to Use](#when-to-use)\n- [Quick Start](#quick-start)\n- [Installation & Setup](#installation--setup)\n- [Project Configuration](#project-configuration)\n- [Core Components](#core-components)\n  - [Button](#button-component)\n  - [Input & Form Fields](#input--form-fields)\n  - [Forms with Validation](#forms-with-validation)\n  - [Card](#card-component)\n  - [Dialog (Modal)](#dialog-modal-component)\n  - [Select (Dropdown)](#select-dropdown-component)\n  - [Sheet (Slide-over)](#sheet-slide-over-component)\n  - [Menubar & Navigation](#menubar--navigation)\n  - [Table](#table-component)\n  - [Toast Notifications](#toast-notifications)\n- [Advanced Patterns](#advanced-patterns)\n- [Customization](#customization)\n- [Next.js Integration](#nextjs-integration)\n- [Best Practices](#best-practices)\n- [Common Component Combinations](#common-component-combinations)\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Setting up a new project with shadcn/ui\n- Installing or configuring individual components\n- Building forms with React Hook Form and Zod validation\n- Creating accessible UI components (buttons, dialogs, dropdowns, sheets)\n- Customizing component styling with Tailwind CSS\n- Implementing design systems with shadcn/ui\n- Building Next.js applications with TypeScript\n- Creating complex layouts and data displays\n\n## Quick Start\n\nFor new projects, use the automated setup:\n\n```bash\n# Create Next.js project with shadcn/ui\nnpx create-next-app@latest my-app --typescript --tailwind --eslint --app\ncd my-app\nnpx shadcn@latest init\n\n# Install essential components\nnpx shadcn@latest add button input form card dialog select\n```\n\nFor existing projects:\n\n```bash\n# Install dependencies\nnpm install tailwindcss-animate class-variance-authority clsx tailwind-merge lucide-react\n\n# Initialize shadcn/ui\nnpx shadcn@latest init\n```\n\n## What is shadcn/ui?\n\nshadcn/ui is **not** a traditional component library or npm package. Instead:\n\n- It''s a **collection of reusable components** that you can copy into your project\n- Components are **yours to customize** - you own the code\n- Built with **Radix UI** primitives for accessibility\n- Styled with **Tailwind CSS** utilities\n- Includes CLI tool for easy component installation\n\n## Installation & Setup\n\n### Initial Setup\n\n```bash\n# Initialize shadcn/ui in your project\nnpx shadcn@latest init\n```\n\nDuring setup, you''ll configure:\n- TypeScript or JavaScript\n- Style (Default, New York, etc.)\n- Base color theme\n- CSS variables or Tailwind CSS classes\n- Component installation path\n\n### Installing Individual Components\n\n```bash\n# Install a single component\nnpx shadcn@latest add button\n\n# Install multiple components\nnpx shadcn@latest add button input form\n\n# Install all components\nnpx shadcn@latest add --all\n```\n\n### Manual Installation\n\nIf you prefer manual setup:\n\n```bash\n# Install dependencies for a specific component\nnpm install @radix-ui/react-slot\n\n# Copy component code from ui.shadcn.com\n# Place in src/components/ui/\n```\n\n## Project Configuration\n\n### Required Dependencies\n\n```json\n{\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"@radix-ui/react-accordion\": \"^1.1.2\",\n    \"@radix-ui/react-alert-dialog\": \"^1.0.5\",\n    \"@radix-ui/react-dialog\": \"^1.0.5\",\n    \"@radix-ui/react-dropdown-menu\": \"^2.0.6\",\n    \"@radix-ui/react-label\": \"^2.0.2\",\n    \"@radix-ui/react-select\": \"^2.0.0\",\n    \"@radix-ui/react-separator\": \"^1.0.3\",\n    \"@radix-ui/react-slot\": \"^1.0.2\",\n    \"@radix-ui/react-toast\": \"^1.1.5\",\n    \"class-variance-authority\": \"^0.7.0\",\n    \"clsx\": \"^2.0.0\",\n    \"lucide-react\": \"^0.294.0\",\n    \"tailwind-merge\": \"^2.0.0\",\n    \"tailwindcss-animate\": \"^1.0.7\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### TSConfig Configuration\n\n```json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"target\": \"es5\",\n    \"lib\": [\"dom\", \"dom.iterable\", \"es6\"],\n    \"allowJs\": true,\n    \"skipLibCheck\": true,\n    \"strict\": true,\n    \"forceConsistentCasingInFileNames\": true,\n    \"noEmit\": true,\n    \"esModuleInterop\": true,\n    \"module\": \"esnext\",\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"node\",\n    \"resolveJsonModule\": true,\n    \"isolatedModules\": true,\n    \"jsx\": \"preserve\",\n    \"incremental\": true,\n    \"plugins\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"next\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"baseUrl\": \".\",\n    \"paths\": {\n      \"@/components/*\": [\"./src/components/*\"],\n      \"@/lib/*\": [\"./src/lib/*\"]\n    }\n  },\n  \"include\": [\"next-env.d.ts\", \"**/*.ts\", \"**/*.tsx\", \".next/types/**/*.ts\"],\n  \"exclude\": [\"node_modules\"]\n}\n```\n\n### Tailwind Configuration\n\n```js\n// tailwind.config.js\n/** @type {import(''tailwindcss'').Config} */\nmodule.exports = {\n  darkMode: [\"class\"],\n  content: [\n    ''./pages/**/*.{ts,tsx}'',\n    ''./components/**/*.{ts,tsx}'',\n    ''./app/**/*.{ts,tsx}'',\n    ''./src/**/*.{ts,tsx}'',\n  ],\n  prefix: \"\",\n  theme: {\n    container: {\n      center: true,\n      padding: \"2rem\",\n      screens: {\n        \"2xl\": \"1400px\",\n      },\n    },\n    extend: {\n      colors: {\n        border: \"hsl(var(--border))\",\n        input: \"hsl(var(--input))\",\n        ring: \"hsl(var(--ring))\",\n        background: \"hsl(var(--background))\",\n        foreground: \"hsl(var(--foreground))\",\n        primary: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--primary))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--primary-foreground))\",\n        },\n        secondary: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--secondary))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--secondary-foreground))\",\n        },\n        destructive: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--destructive))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--destructive-foreground))\",\n        },\n        muted: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--muted))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--muted-foreground))\",\n        },\n        accent: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--accent))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--accent-foreground))\",\n        },\n        popover: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--popover))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--popover-foreground))\",\n        },\n        card: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--card))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--card-foreground))\",\n        },\n      },\n      borderRadius: {\n        lg: \"var(--radius)\",\n        md: \"calc(var(--radius) - 2px)\",\n        sm: \"calc(var(--radius) - 4px)\",\n      },\n      keyframes: {\n        \"accordion-down\": {\n          from: { height: \"0\" },\n          to: { height: \"var(--radix-accordion-content-height)\" },\n        },\n        \"accordion-up\": {\n          from: { height: \"var(--radix-accordion-content-height)\" },\n          to: { height: \"0\" },\n        },\n      },\n      animation: {\n        \"accordion-down\": \"accordion-down 0.2s ease-out\",\n        \"accordion-up\": \"accordion-up 0.2s ease-out\",\n      },\n    },\n  },\n  plugins: [require(\"tailwindcss-animate\")],\n}\n```\n\n### CSS Variables (globals.css)\n\n```css\n@tailwind base;\n@tailwind components;\n@tailwind utilities;\n\n@layer base {\n  :root {\n    --background: 0 0% 100%;\n    --foreground: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --card: 0 0% 100%;\n    --card-foreground: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --popover: 0 0% 100%;\n    --popover-foreground: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --primary: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --primary-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --secondary: 210 40% 96.1%;\n    --secondary-foreground: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --muted: 210 40% 96.1%;\n    --muted-foreground: 215.4 16.3% 46.9%;\n    --accent: 210 40% 96.1%;\n    --accent-foreground: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --destructive: 0 84.2% 60.2%;\n    --destructive-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --border: 214.3 31.8% 91.4%;\n    --input: 214.3 31.8% 91.4%;\n    --ring: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --radius: 0.5rem;\n  }\n\n  .dark {\n    --background: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --card: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --card-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --popover: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --popover-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --primary: 210 40% 98%;\n    --primary-foreground: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --secondary: 217.2 32.6% 17.5%;\n    --secondary-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --muted: 217.2 32.6% 17.5%;\n    --muted-foreground: 215 20.2% 65.1%;\n    --accent: 217.2 32.6% 17.5%;\n    --accent-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --destructive: 0 62.8% 30.6%;\n    --destructive-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --border: 217.2 32.6% 17.5%;\n    --input: 217.2 32.6% 17.5%;\n    --ring: 212.7 26.8% 83.9%;\n  }\n}\n\n@layer base {\n  * {\n    @apply border-border;\n  }\n  body {\n    @apply bg-background text-foreground;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Core Components\n\n### Button Component\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add button\n```\n\nBasic usage:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\";\n\nexport function ButtonDemo() {\n  return <Button>Click me</Button>;\n}\n```\n\nButton variants:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\";\n\nexport function ButtonVariants() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"flex gap-4\">\n      <Button variant=\"default\">Default</Button>\n      <Button variant=\"destructive\">Destructive</Button>\n      <Button variant=\"outline\">Outline</Button>\n      <Button variant=\"secondary\">Secondary</Button>\n      <Button variant=\"ghost\">Ghost</Button>\n      <Button variant=\"link\">Link</Button>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\nButton sizes:\n\n```tsx\n<div className=\"flex gap-4 items-center\">\n  <Button size=\"default\">Default</Button>\n  <Button size=\"sm\">Small</Button>\n  <Button size=\"lg\">Large</Button>\n  <Button size=\"icon\">\n    <Icon className=\"h-4 w-4\" />\n  </Button>\n</div>\n```\n\nWith loading state:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\";\nimport { Loader2 } from \"lucide-react\";\n\nexport function ButtonLoading() {\n  return (\n    <Button disabled>\n      <Loader2 className=\"mr-2 h-4 w-4 animate-spin\" />\n      Please wait\n    </Button>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Input & Form Fields\n\n#### Input Component\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add input\n```\n\nBasic input:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Input } from \"@/components/ui/input\";\n\nexport function InputDemo() {\n  return <Input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Email\" />;\n}\n```\n\nInput with label:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Input } from \"@/components/ui/input\";\nimport { Label } from \"@/components/ui/label\";\n\nexport function InputWithLabel() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"grid w-full max-w-sm items-center gap-1.5\">\n      <Label htmlFor=\"email\">Email</Label>\n      <Input type=\"email\" id=\"email\" placeholder=\"Email\" />\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\nInput with button:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\";\nimport { Input } from \"@/components/ui/input\";\n\nexport function InputWithButton() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"flex w-full max-w-sm items-center gap-2\">\n      <Input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Email\" />\n      <Button type=\"submit\" variant=\"outline\">Subscribe</Button>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Forms with Validation\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add form\n```\n\nThis installs React Hook Form, Zod, and form components.\n\nComplete form example:\n\n```tsx\n\"use client\"\n\nimport { zodResolver } from \"@hookform/resolvers/zod\"\nimport { useForm } from \"react-hook-form\"\nimport * as z from \"zod\"\n\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport {\n  Form,\n  FormControl,\n  FormDescription,\n  FormField,\n  FormItem,\n  FormLabel,\n  FormMessage,\n} from \"@/components/ui/form\"\nimport { Input } from \"@/components/ui/input\"\nimport { toast } from \"@/components/ui/use-toast\"\n\nconst formSchema = z.object({\n  username: z.string().min(2, {\n    message: \"Username must be at least 2 characters.\",\n  }),\n  email: z.string().email({\n    message: \"Please enter a valid email address.\",\n  }),\n})\n\nexport function ProfileForm() {\n  const form = useForm<z.infer<typeof formSchema>>({\n    resolver: zodResolver(formSchema),\n    defaultValues: {\n      username: \"\",\n      email: \"\",\n    },\n  })\n\n  function onSubmit(values: z.infer<typeof formSchema>) {\n    toast({\n      title: \"You submitted the following values:\",\n      description: (\n        <pre className=\"mt-2 w-[340px] rounded-md bg-slate-950 p-4\">\n          <code className=\"text-white\">{JSON.stringify(values, null, 2)}</code>\n        </pre>\n      ),\n    })\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <Form {...form}>\n      <form onSubmit={form.handleSubmit(onSubmit)} className=\"space-y-8\">\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"username\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Username</FormLabel>\n              <FormControl>\n                <Input placeholder=\"shadcn\" {...field} />\n              </FormControl>\n              <FormDescription>\n                This is your public display name.\n              </FormDescription>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n        \n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"email\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Email</FormLabel>\n              <FormControl>\n                <Input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\" {...field} />\n              </FormControl>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n        \n        <Button type=\"submit\">Submit</Button>\n      </form>\n    </Form>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Card Component\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add card\n```\n\nBasic card:\n\n```tsx\nimport {\n  Card,\n  CardContent,\n  CardDescription,\n  CardFooter,\n  CardHeader,\n  CardTitle,\n} from \"@/components/ui/card\"\n\nexport function CardDemo() {\n  return (\n    <Card>\n      <CardHeader>\n        <CardTitle>Card Title</CardTitle>\n        <CardDescription>Card Description</CardDescription>\n      </CardHeader>\n      <CardContent>\n        <p>Card Content</p>\n      </CardContent>\n      <CardFooter>\n        <p>Card Footer</p>\n      </CardFooter>\n    </Card>\n  )\n}\n```\n\nCard with form:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport {\n  Card,\n  CardContent,\n  CardDescription,\n  CardFooter,\n  CardHeader,\n  CardTitle,\n} from \"@/components/ui/card\"\nimport { Input } from \"@/components/ui/input\"\nimport { Label } from \"@/components/ui/label\"\n\nexport function CardWithForm() {\n  return (\n    <Card className=\"w-[350px]\">\n      <CardHeader>\n        <CardTitle>Create project</CardTitle>\n        <CardDescription>Deploy your new project in one-click.</CardDescription>\n      </CardHeader>\n      <CardContent>\n        <form>\n          <div className=\"grid w-full items-center gap-4\">\n            <div className=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5\">\n              <Label htmlFor=\"name\">Name</Label>\n              <Input id=\"name\" placeholder=\"Name of your project\" />\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </form>\n      </CardContent>\n      <CardFooter className=\"flex justify-between\">\n        <Button variant=\"outline\">Cancel</Button>\n        <Button>Deploy</Button>\n      </CardFooter>\n    </Card>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Dialog (Modal) Component\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add dialog\n```\n\nBasic dialog:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport {\n  Dialog,\n  DialogContent,\n  DialogDescription,\n  DialogFooter,\n  DialogHeader,\n  DialogTitle,\n  DialogTrigger,\n} from \"@/components/ui/dialog\"\n\nexport function DialogDemo() {\n  return (\n    <Dialog>\n      <DialogTrigger asChild>\n        <Button variant=\"outline\">Open Dialog</Button>\n      </DialogTrigger>\n      <DialogContent className=\"sm:max-w-[425px]\">\n        <DialogHeader>\n          <DialogTitle>Edit profile</DialogTitle>\n          <DialogDescription>\n            Make changes to your profile here. Click save when you''re done.\n          </DialogDescription>\n        </DialogHeader>\n        <div className=\"grid gap-4 py-4\">\n          <div className=\"grid grid-cols-4 items-center gap-4\">\n            <Label htmlFor=\"name\" className=\"text-right\">\n              Name\n            </Label>\n            <Input id=\"name\" value=\"Pedro Duarte\" className=\"col-span-3\" />\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <DialogFooter>\n          <Button type=\"submit\">Save changes</Button>\n        </DialogFooter>\n      </DialogContent>\n    </Dialog>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Sheet (Slide-over) Component\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add sheet\n```\n\nBasic sheet:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport {\n  Sheet,\n  SheetContent,\n  SheetDescription,\n  SheetHeader,\n  SheetTitle,\n  SheetTrigger,\n} from \"@/components/ui/sheet\"\n\nexport function SheetDemo() {\n  return (\n    <Sheet>\n      <SheetTrigger asChild>\n        <Button variant=\"outline\">Open Sheet</Button>\n      </SheetTrigger>\n      <SheetContent>\n        <SheetHeader>\n          <SheetTitle>Edit profile</SheetTitle>\n          <SheetDescription>\n            Make changes to your profile here. Click save when you''re done.\n          </SheetDescription>\n        </SheetHeader>\n        <div className=\"grid gap-4 py-4\">\n          <div className=\"grid grid-cols-4 items-center gap-4\">\n            <Label htmlFor=\"name\" className=\"text-right\">\n              Name\n            </Label>\n            <Input id=\"name\" value=\"Pedro Duarte\" className=\"col-span-3\" />\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"grid grid-cols-4 items-center gap-4\">\n            <Label htmlFor=\"username\" className=\"text-right\">\n              Username\n            </Label>\n            <Input id=\"username\" value=\"@peduarte\" className=\"col-span-3\" />\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </SheetContent>\n    </Sheet>\n  )\n}\n```\n\nSheet with side placement:\n\n```tsx\n<Sheet>\n  <SheetTrigger asChild>\n    <Button variant=\"outline\">Open Right Sheet</Button>\n  </SheetTrigger>\n  <SheetContent side=\"right\">\n    <SheetHeader>\n      <SheetTitle>Settings</SheetTitle>\n      <SheetDescription>\n        Configure your application settings here.\n      </SheetDescription>\n    </SheetHeader>\n    {/* Settings content */}\n  </SheetContent>\n</Sheet>\n```\n\n### Menubar & Navigation\n\n#### Menubar Component\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add menubar\n```\n\nBasic menubar:\n\n```tsx\nimport {\n  Menubar,\n  MenubarContent,\n  MenubarItem,\n  MenubarMenu,\n  MenubarSeparator,\n  MenubarShortcut,\n  MenubarSub,\n  MenubarSubContent,\n  MenubarSubTrigger,\n  MenubarTrigger,\n} from \"@/components/ui/menubar\"\n\nexport function MenubarDemo() {\n  return (\n    <Menubar>\n      <MenubarMenu>\n        <MenubarTrigger>File</MenubarTrigger>\n        <MenubarContent>\n          <MenubarItem>\n            New Tab <MenubarShortcut>⌘T</MenubarShortcut>\n          </MenubarItem>\n          <MenubarItem>\n            New Window <MenubarShortcut>⌘N</MenubarShortcut>\n          </MenubarItem>\n          <MenubarSeparator />\n          <MenubarItem>Share</MenubarItem>\n          <MenubarSeparator />\n          <MenubarItem>Print</MenubarItem>\n        </MenubarContent>\n      </MenubarMenu>\n      <MenubarMenu>\n        <MenubarTrigger>Edit</MenubarTrigger>\n        <MenubarContent>\n          <MenubarItem>\n            Undo <MenubarShortcut>⌘Z</MenubarShortcut>\n          </MenubarItem>\n          <MenubarItem>\n            Redo <MenubarShortcut>⌘Y</MenubarShortcut>\n          </MenubarItem>\n          <MenubarSeparator />\n          <MenubarSub>\n            <MenubarSubTrigger>Find</MenubarSubTrigger>\n            <MenubarSubContent>\n              <MenubarItem>Search the web</MenubarItem>\n              <MenubarItem>Find...</MenubarItem>\n              <MenubarItem>Find Next</MenubarItem>\n              <MenubarItem>Find Previous</MenubarItem>\n            </MenubarSubContent>\n          </MenubarSub>\n        </MenubarContent>\n      </MenubarMenu>\n    </Menubar>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Select (Dropdown) Component\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add select\n```\n\nBasic select:\n\n```tsx\nimport {\n  Select,\n  SelectContent,\n  SelectItem,\n  SelectTrigger,\n  SelectValue,\n} from \"@/components/ui/select\"\n\nexport function SelectDemo() {\n  return (\n    <Select>\n      <SelectTrigger className=\"w-[180px]\">\n        <SelectValue placeholder=\"Select a fruit\" />\n      </SelectTrigger>\n      <SelectContent>\n        <SelectItem value=\"apple\">Apple</SelectItem>\n        <SelectItem value=\"banana\">Banana</SelectItem>\n        <SelectItem value=\"orange\">Orange</SelectItem>\n      </SelectContent>\n    </Select>\n  )\n}\n```\n\nSelect in form:\n\n```tsx\n<FormField\n  control={form.control}\n  name=\"role\"\n  render={({ field }) => (\n    <FormItem>\n      <FormLabel>Role</FormLabel>\n      <Select onValueChange={field.onChange} defaultValue={field.value}>\n        <FormControl>\n          <SelectTrigger>\n            <SelectValue placeholder=\"Select a role\" />\n          </SelectTrigger>\n        </FormControl>\n        <SelectContent>\n          <SelectItem value=\"admin\">Admin</SelectItem>\n          <SelectItem value=\"user\">User</SelectItem>\n          <SelectItem value=\"guest\">Guest</SelectItem>\n        </SelectContent>\n      </Select>\n      <FormMessage />\n    </FormItem>\n  )}\n/>\n```\n\n### Toast Notifications\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add toast\n```\n\nSetup toast provider in root layout:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Toaster } from \"@/components/ui/toaster\"\n\nexport default function RootLayout({ children }) {\n  return (\n    <html lang=\"en\">\n      <body>\n        {children}\n        <Toaster />\n      </body>\n    </html>\n  )\n}\n```\n\nUsing toast:\n\n```tsx\nimport { useToast } from \"@/components/ui/use-toast\"\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\n\nexport function ToastDemo() {\n  const { toast } = useToast()\n\n  return (\n    <Button\n      onClick={() => {\n        toast({\n          title: \"Scheduled: Catch up\",\n          description: \"Friday, February 10, 2023 at 5:57 PM\",\n        })\n      }}\n    >\n      Show Toast\n    </Button>\n  )\n}\n```\n\nToast variants:\n\n```tsx\n// Success\ntoast({\n  title: \"Success\",\n  description: \"Your changes have been saved.\",\n})\n\n// Error\ntoast({\n  variant: \"destructive\",\n  title: \"Error\",\n  description: \"Something went wrong.\",\n})\n\n// With action\ntoast({\n  title: \"Uh oh! Something went wrong.\",\n  description: \"There was a problem with your request.\",\n  action: <ToastAction altText=\"Try again\">Try again</ToastAction>,\n})\n```\n\n### Table Component\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add table\n```\n\nBasic table:\n\n```tsx\nimport {\n  Table,\n  TableBody,\n  TableCaption,\n  TableCell,\n  TableHead,\n  TableHeader,\n  TableRow,\n} from \"@/components/ui/table\"\n\nconst invoices = [\n  { invoice: \"INV001\", status: \"Paid\", method: \"Credit Card\", amount: \"$250.00\" },\n  { invoice: \"INV002\", status: \"Pending\", method: \"PayPal\", amount: \"$150.00\" },\n]\n\nexport function TableDemo() {\n  return (\n    <Table>\n      <TableCaption>A list of your recent invoices.</TableCaption>\n      <TableHeader>\n        <TableRow>\n          <TableHead>Invoice</TableHead>\n          <TableHead>Status</TableHead>\n          <TableHead>Method</TableHead>\n          <TableHead className=\"text-right\">Amount</TableHead>\n        </TableRow>\n      </TableHeader>\n      <TableBody>\n        {invoices.map((invoice) => (\n          <TableRow key={invoice.invoice}>\n            <TableCell className=\"font-medium\">{invoice.invoice}</TableCell>\n            <TableCell>{invoice.status}</TableCell>\n            <TableCell>{invoice.method}</TableCell>\n            <TableCell className=\"text-right\">{invoice.amount}</TableCell>\n          </TableRow>\n        ))}\n      </TableBody>\n    </Table>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Customization\n\n### Theming with CSS Variables\n\nshadcn/ui uses CSS variables for theming. Configure in `globals.css`:\n\n```css\n@layer base {\n  :root {\n    --background: 0 0% 100%;\n    --foreground: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --primary: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --primary-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --secondary: 210 40% 96.1%;\n    --secondary-foreground: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --muted: 210 40% 96.1%;\n    --muted-foreground: 215.4 16.3% 46.9%;\n    --accent: 210 40% 96.1%;\n    --accent-foreground: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --destructive: 0 84.2% 60.2%;\n    --destructive-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --border: 214.3 31.8% 91.4%;\n    --input: 214.3 31.8% 91.4%;\n    --ring: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --radius: 0.5rem;\n  }\n\n  .dark {\n    --background: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --primary: 210 40% 98%;\n    --primary-foreground: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    /* ... other dark mode variables */\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Customizing Components\n\nSince you own the code, customize directly:\n\n```tsx\n// components/ui/button.tsx\nimport * as React from \"react\"\nimport { Slot } from \"@radix-ui/react-slot\"\nimport { cva, type VariantProps } from \"class-variance-authority\"\nimport { cn } from \"@/lib/utils\"\n\nconst buttonVariants = cva(\n  \"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors\",\n  {\n    variants: {\n      variant: {\n        default: \"bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/90\",\n        destructive: \"bg-destructive text-destructive-foreground hover:bg-destructive/90\",\n        outline: \"border border-input bg-background hover:bg-accent\",\n        // Add custom variant\n        custom: \"bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-500 to-pink-500 text-white\",\n      },\n      size: {\n        default: \"h-10 px-4 py-2\",\n        sm: \"h-9 rounded-md px-3\",\n        lg: \"h-11 rounded-md px-8\",\n        // Add custom size\n        xl: \"h-14 rounded-md px-10 text-lg\",\n      },\n    },\n    defaultVariants: {\n      variant: \"default\",\n      size: \"default\",\n    },\n  }\n)\n\nexport interface ButtonProps\n  extends React.ButtonHTMLAttributes<HTMLButtonElement>,\n    VariantProps<typeof buttonVariants> {\n  asChild?: boolean\n}\n\nconst Button = React.forwardRef<HTMLButtonElement, ButtonProps>(\n  ({ className, variant, size, asChild = false, ...props }, ref) => {\n    const Comp = asChild ? Slot : \"button\"\n    return (\n      <Comp\n        className={cn(buttonVariants({ variant, size, className }))}\n        ref={ref}\n        {...props}\n      />\n    )\n  }\n)\nButton.displayName = \"Button\"\n\nexport { Button, buttonVariants }\n```\n\n## Next.js Integration\n\n### App Router Setup\n\nFor Next.js 13+ with App Router, ensure components use `\"use client\"` directive:\n\n```tsx\n// src/components/ui/button.tsx\n\"use client\"\n\nimport * as React from \"react\"\nimport { Slot } from \"@radix-ui/react-slot\"\nimport { cva, type VariantProps } from \"class-variance-authority\"\nimport { cn } from \"@/lib/utils\"\n\n// ... rest of component\n```\n\n### Layout Integration\n\nAdd the Toaster to your root layout:\n\n```tsx\n// app/layout.tsx\nimport { Toaster } from \"@/components/ui/toaster\"\nimport \"./globals.css\"\n\nexport default function RootLayout({\n  children,\n}: {\n  children: React.ReactNode\n}) {\n  return (\n    <html lang=\"en\" suppressHydrationWarning>\n      <body className=\"min-h-screen bg-background font-sans antialiased\">\n        {children}\n        <Toaster />\n      </body>\n    </html>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Server Components\n\nWhen using shadcn/ui components in Server Components, wrap them in a Client Component:\n\n```tsx\n// app/dashboard/page.tsx\nimport { Card, CardContent, CardHeader, CardTitle } from \"@/components/ui/card\"\nimport { ButtonClient } from \"@/components/ui/button-client\"\n\nexport default function DashboardPage() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"container mx-auto p-6\">\n      <Card>\n        <CardHeader>\n          <CardTitle>Dashboard</CardTitle>\n        </CardHeader>\n        <CardContent>\n          <ButtonClient>Interactive Button</ButtonClient>\n        </CardContent>\n      </Card>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n```tsx\n// src/components/ui/button-client.tsx\n\"use client\"\n\nimport { Button } from \"./button\"\n\nexport function ButtonClient(props: React.ComponentProps<typeof Button>) {\n  return <Button {...props} />\n}\n```\n\n### Route Handlers with Forms\n\nCreate API routes for form submissions:\n\n```tsx\n// app/api/contact/route.ts\nimport { NextRequest, NextResponse } from \"next/server\"\nimport { z } from \"zod\"\n\nconst contactSchema = z.object({\n  name: z.string().min(2),\n  email: z.string().email(),\n  message: z.string().min(10),\n})\n\nexport async function POST(request: NextRequest) {\n  try {\n    const body = await request.json()\n    const validated = contactSchema.parse(body)\n\n    // Process form data\n    console.log(\"Form submission:\", validated)\n\n    return NextResponse.json({ success: true })\n  } catch (error) {\n    if (error instanceof z.ZodError) {\n      return NextResponse.json(\n        { errors: error.errors },\n        { status: 400 }\n      )\n    }\n\n    return NextResponse.json(\n      { error: \"Internal server error\" },\n      { status: 500 }\n    )\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Form with Server Action\n\nUsing Next.js 14+ Server Actions:\n\n```tsx\n// app/contact/page.tsx\n\"use client\"\n\nimport { zodResolver } from \"@hookform/resolvers/zod\"\nimport { useForm } from \"react-hook-form\"\nimport * as z from \"zod\"\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport {\n  Form,\n  FormControl,\n  FormField,\n  FormItem,\n  FormLabel,\n  FormMessage,\n} from \"@/components/ui/form\"\nimport { Input } from \"@/components/ui/input\"\nimport { Textarea } from \"@/components/ui/textarea\"\nimport { toast } from \"@/components/ui/use-toast\"\n\nconst formSchema = z.object({\n  name: z.string().min(2),\n  email: z.string().email(),\n  message: z.string().min(10),\n})\n\nasync function onSubmit(values: z.infer<typeof formSchema>) {\n  try {\n    const response = await fetch(\"/api/contact\", {\n      method: \"POST\",\n      headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n      body: JSON.stringify(values),\n    })\n\n    if (!response.ok) throw new Error(\"Failed to submit\")\n\n    toast({\n      title: \"Success!\",\n      description: \"Your message has been sent.\",\n    })\n  } catch (error) {\n    toast({\n      variant: \"destructive\",\n      title: \"Error\",\n      description: \"Failed to send message. Please try again.\",\n    })\n  }\n}\n\nexport default function ContactPage() {\n  const form = useForm<z.infer<typeof formSchema>>({\n    resolver: zodResolver(formSchema),\n  })\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"container mx-auto max-w-2xl py-8\">\n      <Form {...form}>\n        <form onSubmit={form.handleSubmit(onSubmit)} className=\"space-y-6\">\n          <FormField\n            control={form.control}\n            name=\"name\"\n            render={({ field }) => (\n              <FormItem>\n                <FormLabel>Name</FormLabel>\n                <FormControl>\n                  <Input placeholder=\"Your name\" {...field} />\n                </FormControl>\n                <FormMessage />\n              </FormItem>\n            )}\n          />\n\n          <FormField\n            control={form.control}\n            name=\"email\"\n            render={({ field }) => (\n              <FormItem>\n                <FormLabel>Email</FormLabel>\n                <FormControl>\n                  <Input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"your@email.com\" {...field} />\n                </FormControl>\n                <FormMessage />\n              </FormItem>\n            )}\n          />\n\n          <FormField\n            control={form.control}\n            name=\"message\"\n            render={({ field }) => (\n              <FormItem>\n                <FormLabel>Message</FormLabel>\n                <FormControl>\n                  <Textarea\n                    placeholder=\"Your message...\"\n                    className=\"resize-none\"\n                    {...field}\n                  />\n                </FormControl>\n                <FormMessage />\n              </FormItem>\n            )}\n          />\n\n          <Button type=\"submit\" className=\"w-full\">\n            Send Message\n          </Button>\n        </form>\n      </Form>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Metadata with shadcn/ui\n\nUsing shadcn/ui components in metadata:\n\n```tsx\n// app/layout.tsx\nimport { Metadata } from \"next\"\n\nexport const metadata: Metadata = {\n  title: {\n    default: \"My App\",\n    template: \"%s | My App\",\n  },\n  description: \"Built with shadcn/ui and Next.js\",\n}\n\n// app/about/page.tsx\nimport { Metadata } from \"next\"\nimport { Card, CardContent, CardHeader, CardTitle } from \"@/components/ui/card\"\n\nexport const metadata: Metadata = {\n  title: \"About Us\",\n  description: \"Learn more about our company\",\n}\n\nexport default function AboutPage() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"container mx-auto py-8\">\n      <Card>\n        <CardHeader>\n          <CardTitle>About Our Company</CardTitle>\n        </CardHeader>\n        <CardContent>\n          <p>We build amazing products with modern web technologies.</p>\n        </CardContent>\n      </Card>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Font Optimization\n\nOptimize fonts with next/font:\n\n```tsx\n// app/layout.tsx\nimport { Inter } from \"next/font/google\"\nimport { Toaster } from \"@/components/ui/toaster\"\nimport { cn } from \"@/lib/utils\"\nimport \"./globals.css\"\n\nconst inter = Inter({ subsets: [\"latin\"] })\n\nexport default function RootLayout({\n  children,\n}: {\n  children: React.ReactNode\n}) {\n  return (\n    <html lang=\"en\" suppressHydrationWarning>\n      <body className={cn(\"min-h-screen bg-background font-sans antialiased\", inter.className)}>\n        {children}\n        <Toaster />\n      </body>\n    </html>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Advanced Patterns\n\n### Form with Multiple Fields\n\n```tsx\nconst formSchema = z.object({\n  username: z.string().min(2).max(50),\n  email: z.string().email(),\n  bio: z.string().max(160).min(4),\n  role: z.enum([\"admin\", \"user\", \"guest\"]),\n  notifications: z.boolean().default(false),\n})\n\nexport function AdvancedForm() {\n  const form = useForm<z.infer<typeof formSchema>>({\n    resolver: zodResolver(formSchema),\n    defaultValues: {\n      username: \"\",\n      email: \"\",\n      bio: \"\",\n      role: \"user\",\n      notifications: false,\n    },\n  })\n\n  function onSubmit(values: z.infer<typeof formSchema>) {\n    console.log(values)\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <Form {...form}>\n      <form onSubmit={form.handleSubmit(onSubmit)} className=\"space-y-8\">\n        {/* Username field */}\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"username\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Username</FormLabel>\n              <FormControl>\n                <Input placeholder=\"johndoe\" {...field} />\n              </FormControl>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n\n        {/* Email field */}\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"email\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Email</FormLabel>\n              <FormControl>\n                <Input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"john@example.com\" {...field} />\n              </FormControl>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n\n        {/* Textarea field */}\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"bio\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Bio</FormLabel>\n              <FormControl>\n                <Textarea\n                  placeholder=\"Tell us about yourself\"\n                  className=\"resize-none\"\n                  {...field}\n                />\n              </FormControl>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n\n        {/* Select field */}\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"role\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Role</FormLabel>\n              <Select onValueChange={field.onChange} defaultValue={field.value}>\n                <FormControl>\n                  <SelectTrigger>\n                    <SelectValue placeholder=\"Select a role\" />\n                  </SelectTrigger>\n                </FormControl>\n                <SelectContent>\n                  <SelectItem value=\"admin\">Admin</SelectItem>\n                  <SelectItem value=\"user\">User</SelectItem>\n                  <SelectItem value=\"guest\">Guest</SelectItem>\n                </SelectContent>\n              </Select>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n\n        {/* Checkbox field */}\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"notifications\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem className=\"flex flex-row items-start space-x-3 space-y-0\">\n              <FormControl>\n                <Checkbox\n                  checked={field.value}\n                  onCheckedChange={field.onChange}\n                />\n              </FormControl>\n              <div className=\"space-y-1 leading-none\">\n                <FormLabel>Email notifications</FormLabel>\n                <FormDescription>\n                  Receive emails about your account activity.\n                </FormDescription>\n              </div>\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n\n        <Button type=\"submit\">Submit</Button>\n      </form>\n    </Form>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Accessibility**: Components use Radix UI primitives for ARIA compliance\n2. **Customization**: Modify components directly in your codebase\n3. **Type Safety**: Use TypeScript for type-safe props and state\n4. **Validation**: Use Zod schemas for form validation\n5. **Styling**: Leverage Tailwind utilities and CSS variables\n6. **Consistency**: Use the same component patterns across your app\n7. **Testing**: Components are testable with React Testing Library\n8. **Performance**: Components are optimized and tree-shakeable\n\n## Common Component Combinations\n\n### Login Form\n\n```tsx\n<Card className=\"w-[350px]\">\n  <CardHeader>\n    <CardTitle>Login</CardTitle>\n    <CardDescription>Enter your credentials to continue</CardDescription>\n  </CardHeader>\n  <CardContent>\n    <Form {...form}>\n      <form onSubmit={form.handleSubmit(onSubmit)} className=\"space-y-4\">\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"email\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Email</FormLabel>\n              <FormControl>\n                <Input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\" {...field} />\n              </FormControl>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"password\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Password</FormLabel>\n              <FormControl>\n                <Input type=\"password\" {...field} />\n              </FormControl>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n        <Button type=\"submit\" className=\"w-full\">Login</Button>\n      </form>\n    </Form>\n  </CardContent>\n</Card>\n```\n\n## References\n\n- Official Docs: https://ui.shadcn.com\n- Radix UI: https://www.radix-ui.com\n- React Hook Form: https://react-hook-form.com\n- Zod: https://zod.dev\n- Tailwind CSS: https://tailwindcss.com\n- Examples: https://ui.shadcn.com/examples\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:40:47.776Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Development Agents needing accessible, customizable UI component generation with Tailwind CSS integration.","zh":"非常适合需要可访问、可定制的UI组件生成且集成了Tailwind CSS的前端开发代理。","ja":"Tailwind CSSを統合したアクセシブルでカスタマイズ可能なUIコンポーネント生成に適したフロントエンド開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Tailwind CSS가 통합된 접근성 및 사용자 지정 가능한 UI 컴포넌트 생성이 필요한 프런트엔드 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo frontend que necesitan generación de componentes de interfaz de usuario accesibles y personalizables con integración de Tailwind CSS.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement frontend qui ont besoin de génération de composants d''interface utilisateur accessibles et personnalisables avec intégration de Tailwind CSS.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Entwicklungsagenten, die eine zugängliche und anpassbare UI-Komponenten-Generierung mit Tailwind-CSS-Integration benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de desenvolvimento Frontend que necessitam de geração de componentes de UI acessíveis e personalizáveis com integração do Tailwind CSS.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки Frontend, которым необходима генерация доступных и настраиваемых компонентов UI с интеграцией Tailwind CSS.","ar":"مثالي ل와كلاء تطوير الواجهة الأمامية الذين يحتاجون إلى توليد مكونات واجهة المستخدم المتوافقة والقابلة للتعديل مع دمج Tailwind CSS."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to generate production-ready UI components using shadcn/ui''s Radix UI integration and Tailwind CSS styling system. Provides accessible component patterns with built-in form validation capabilities for modern web applications.","zh":"使代理能够使用shadcn/ui的Radix UI集成和Tailwind CSS样式系统生成生产就绪的UI组件。为现代Web应用程序提供了内置表单验证功能的可访问组件模式。","ja":"エージェントがshadcn/uiのRadix UI統合とTailwind CSSスタイリングシステムを使用して本番環境に適したUIコンポーネントを生成できるようにします。モダンなWebアプリケーションにビルトインフォーム検証機能を備えたアクセシブルコンポーネントパターンを提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 shadcn/ui의 Radix UI 통합 및 Tailwind CSS 스타일링 시스템을 사용하여 프로덕션 준비가 된 UI 컴포넌트를 생성할 수 있도록 합니다. 모던 웹 애플리케이션에 내장된 형식 검증 기능을 갖춘 접근 가능한 컴포넌트 패턴을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar componentes de interfaz de usuario listos para producción utilizando la integración de Radix UI de shadcn/ui y el sistema de estilos de Tailwind CSS. Proporciona patrones de componentes accesibles con capacidades de validación de formularios integradas para aplicaciones web modernas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des composants d''interface utilisateur prêts pour la production en utilisant l''intégration de Radix UI de shadcn/ui et le système de style de Tailwind CSS. Fournit des modèles de composants accessibles avec des capacités de validation de formulaire intégrées pour les applications web modernes.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, produktionsreife Benutzeroberflächen-Komponenten unter Verwendung der Radix-UI-Integration von shadcn/ui und des Tailwind-CSS-Stylesystems zu generieren. Bietet zugängliche Komponentenmuster mit integrierten Formularvalidierungsfunktionen für moderne Webanwendungen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerem componentes de UI prontos para produção usando a integração do Radix UI da shadcn/ui e o sistema de estilização do Tailwind CSS. Fornece padrões de componentes acessíveis com capacidades de validação de formulário embutidas para aplicativos web modernos.","ru":"Позволяет агентам генерировать компоненты UI, готовые к производству, используя интеграцию Radix UI от shadcn/ui и систему стилей Tailwind CSS. Предоставляет доступные шаблоны компонентов с встроенными возможностями проверки форм для современных веб-приложений.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بتوليد مكونات واجهة المستخدم جاهزة للانتاج باستخدام دمج واجهة المستخدم الراديو من شادسن/يو آي ونظام التنسيق في تي ال ويند سي إس. يوفر أنماطاً متوافقة للمكونات مع إمكانيات التحقق من صحة النماذج المدمجة للتطبيقات الوب الحديثة."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating accessible form components with validation","Building customizable UI libraries with Tailwind CSS","Creating Radix UI-based component systems","Developing consistent design system components"],"zh":["生成带有验证的可访问表单组件","使用Tailwind CSS构建可定制的UI库","创建基于Radix UI的组件系统","开发一致的设计系统组件"],"ja":["検証付きのアクセシブルフォームコンポーネントを生成する","Tailwind CSSを使用してカスタマイズ可能なUIライブラリを構築する","Radix UIベースのコンポーネントシステムを作成する","一貫したデザインシステムコンポーネントを開発する"],"ko":["유효성 검사와 함께 접근 가능한 양식 컴포넌트 생성","Tailwind CSS를 사용하여 사용자 지정 가능한 UI 라이브러리 구축","Radix UI 기반의 컴포넌트 시스템 생성","일관된 디자인 시스템 컴포넌트 개발"],"es":["Generar componentes de formulario accesibles con validación","Crear bibliotecas de interfaz de usuario personalizables con Tailwind CSS","Crear sistemas de componentes basados en Radix UI","Desarrollar componentes de sistema de diseño coherentes"],"fr":["Générer des composants de formulaire accessibles avec validation","Créer des bibliothèques d''interface utilisateur personnalisables avec Tailwind CSS","Créer des systèmes de composants basés sur Radix UI","Développer des composants de système de conception cohérents"],"de":["Zugängliche Formularkomponenten mit Validierung generieren","Anpassbare Benutzeroberflächenbibliotheken mit Tailwind CSS erstellen","Radix-UI-basierte Komponentensysteme erstellen","Konsistente Designsistemkomponenten entwickeln"],"pt":["Gerar componentes de formulário acessíveis com validação","Construir bibliotecas de UI personalizáveis com Tailwind CSS","Criar sistemas de componentes baseados em Radix UI","Desenvolver componentes de sistema de design consistentes"],"ru":["Генерировать доступные компоненты форм с проверкой","Создавать настраиваемые библиотеки UI с помощью Tailwind CSS","Создавать системы компонентов на основе Radix UI","Разрабатывать компоненты системы дизайна, обеспечивающие согласованность"],"ar":["توليد مكونات نموذج متوافقة مع التحقق","بناء مكتبات واجهة المستخدم القابلة للتعديل مع تي ال ويند سي إس","إنشاء أنظمة مكونات مبنية على واجهة المستخدم الراديو","تطوير مكونات نظام التصميم المتسقة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Tailwind CSS configuration","Depends on Radix UI primitives","Needs project-specific styling customization"],"zh":["需要Tailwind CSS配置","依赖于Radix UI原语","需要项目特定的样式自定义"],"ja":["Tailwind CSSの構成が必要","Radix UIのプリミティブに依存","プロジェクト固有のスタイルカスタマイズが必要"],"ko":["Tailwind CSS 구성이 필요","Radix UI 기본 요소에 의존","프로젝트별 스타일 사용자 지정이 필요"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Tailwind CSS","Depende de primitivas de Radix UI","Necesita personalización de estilo específica del proyecto"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de Tailwind CSS","Dépend des primitives de Radix UI","Nécessite une personnalisation de style spécifique au projet"],"de":["Benötigt Tailwind-CSS-Konfiguration","Hängt von Radix-UI-Primitiven ab","Benötigt projektspezifische Stil-Anpassung"],"pt":["Exige configuração do Tailwind CSS","Depende de primitivos do Radix UI","Necessita de personalização de estilização específica do projeto"],"ru":["Требует настройки Tailwind CSS","Зависит от примитивов Radix UI","Требует проектно-специфической настройки стилей"],"ar":["يتطلب تكوين تي ال ويند سي إس","يعتمد على البريمتيفات في واجهة المستخدم الراديو","يحتاج إلى تخصيص أنماط مشروع محدد"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
