mposants UI personnalisables","Accessibilité et compatibilité","Intégration avec Radix UI et Tailwind CSS","Configuration de projet flexible","Modèles de composants prédéfinis"],"de":["Anpassbare UI-Komponenten","Zugänglichkeit und Kompatibilität","Integration mit Radix UI und Tailwind CSS","Flexible Projektkonfiguration","Vordefinierte Komponentenmuster"],"pt":["Componentes UI acessíveis","Personalização com Radix UI e Tailwind CSS","Guia de início rápido","Configuração de projeto","Componentes principais: botão, entrada e campos de formulário"],"ru":["Доступные компоненты UI","Настройка с помощью Radix UI и Tailwind CSS","Быстрый старт","Настройка проекта","Основные компоненты: кнопка, вход и поля формы"],"ar":["مكونات واجهة المستخدم القابلة للوصول","التعديل باستخدام راديكس يُو آي وتايلويند سي إس إس","دليل البداية السريعة","تكوين المشروع","المكونات الأساسية: زر، إدخال وحقول النموذج"]},"keywords":{"zh":["shadcn-ui","UI组件","可访问性","自定义","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","按钮","输入表单","卡片"],"ja":["shadcn-ui","UIコンポーネント","アクセシビリティ","カスタマイズ","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","ボタン","入力フォーム","カード"],"ko":["shadcn-ui","UI 컴포넌트","접근성","사용자 지정","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","버튼","입력 폼","카드"],"es":["shadcn ui","componentes ui","desarrollo web","accesibilidad","personalización","radix ui","tailwind css"],"fr":["shadcn ui","composants ui","développement web","accessibilité","personnalisation","radix ui","tailwind css"],"de":["shadcn ui","ui-komponenten","webentwicklung","zugänglichkeit","anpassung","radix ui","tailwind css"],"pt":["shadcn-ui","componentes UI acessíveis","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","desenvolvimento web","interfaces de usuário","acessibilidade"],"ru":["shadcn-ui","доступные компоненты UI","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","веб-разработка","интерфейсы пользователя","доступность"],"ar":["شادسن-يُو آي","مكونات واجهة المستخدم القابلة للوصول","راديكس يُو آي","تايلويند سي إس إس","تطوير الويب","واجهات المستخدم","إمكانية الوصول"]}},"owner":"forbiddenlink","repo":"mythos","repoPath":"forbiddenlink/mythos","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.424Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"shadcn-ui","description":"Complete shadcn/ui component library guide including installation, configuration, and implementation of accessible React components. Use when setting up shadcn/ui, installing components, building forms with React Hook Form and Zod, customizing themes with Tailwind CSS, or implementing UI patterns like buttons, dialogs, dropdowns, tables, and complex form layouts.","bodyPreview":"# shadcn/ui Component Patterns\n\nExpert guide for building accessible, customizable UI components with shadcn/ui, Radix UI, and Tailwind CSS.\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n- [When to Use](#when-to-use)\n- [Quick Start](#quick-start)\n- [Installation & Setup](#installation--setup)\n- [Project Configuration](#project-configuration)\n- [Core Components](#core-components)\n  - [Button](#button-component)\n  - [Input & Form Fields](#input--form-fields)\n  - [Forms with Validation](#forms-with-validation)\n  - [Card]","body":"# shadcn/ui Component Patterns\n\nExpert guide for building accessible, customizable UI components with shadcn/ui, Radix UI, and Tailwind CSS.\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n- [When to Use](#when-to-use)\n- [Quick Start](#quick-start)\n- [Installation & Setup](#installation--setup)\n- [Project Configuration](#project-configuration)\n- [Core Components](#core-components)\n  - [Button](#button-component)\n  - [Input & Form Fields](#input--form-fields)\n  - [Forms with Validation](#forms-with-validation)\n  - [Card](#card-component)\n  - [Dialog (Modal)](#dialog-modal-component)\n  - [Select (Dropdown)](#select-dropdown-component)\n  - [Sheet (Slide-over)](#sheet-slide-over-component)\n  - [Menubar & Navigation](#menubar--navigation)\n  - [Table](#table-component)\n  - [Toast Notifications](#toast-notifications)\n- [Advanced Patterns](#advanced-patterns)\n- [Customization](#customization)\n- [Next.js Integration](#nextjs-integration)\n- [Best Practices](#best-practices)\n- [Common Component Combinations](#common-component-combinations)\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Setting up a new project with shadcn/ui\n- Installing or configuring individual components\n- Building forms with React Hook Form and Zod validation\n- Creating accessible UI components (buttons, dialogs, dropdowns, sheets)\n- Customizing component styling with Tailwind CSS\n- Implementing design systems with shadcn/ui\n- Building Next.js applications with TypeScript\n- Creating complex layouts and data displays\n\n## Quick Start\n\nFor new projects, use the automated setup:\n\n```bash\n# Create Next.js project with shadcn/ui\nnpx create-next-app@latest my-app --typescript --tailwind --eslint --app\ncd my-app\nnpx shadcn@latest init\n\n# Install essential components\nnpx shadcn@latest add button input form card dialog select\n```\n\nFor existing projects:\n\n```bash\n# Install dependencies\nnpm install tailwindcss-animate class-variance-authority clsx tailwind-merge lucide-react\n\n# Initialize shadcn/ui\nnpx shadcn@latest init\n```\n\n## What is shadcn/ui?\n\nshadcn/ui is **not** a traditional component library or npm package. Instead:\n\n- It''s a **collection of reusable components** that you can copy into your project\n- Components are **yours to customize** - you own the code\n- Built with **Radix UI** primitives for accessibility\n- Styled with **Tailwind CSS** utilities\n- Includes CLI tool for easy component installation\n\n## Installation & Setup\n\n### Initial Setup\n\n```bash\n# Initialize shadcn/ui in your project\nnpx shadcn@latest init\n```\n\nDuring setup, you''ll configure:\n- TypeScript or JavaScript\n- Style (Default, New York, etc.)\n- Base color theme\n- CSS variables or Tailwind CSS classes\n- Component installation path\n\n### Installing Individual Components\n\n```bash\n# Install a single component\nnpx shadcn@latest add button\n\n# Install multiple components\nnpx shadcn@latest add button input form\n\n# Install all components\nnpx shadcn@latest add --all\n```\n\n### Manual Installation\n\nIf you prefer manual setup:\n\n```bash\n# Install dependencies for a specific component\nnpm install @radix-ui/react-slot\n\n# Copy component code from ui.shadcn.com\n# Place in src/components/ui/\n```\n\n## Project Configuration\n\n### Required Dependencies\n\n```json\n{\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"@radix-ui/react-accordion\": \"^1.1.2\",\n    \"@radix-ui/react-alert-dialog\": \"^1.0.5\",\n    \"@radix-ui/react-dialog\": \"^1.0.5\",\n    \"@radix-ui/react-dropdown-menu\": \"^2.0.6\",\n    \"@radix-ui/react-label\": \"^2.0.2\",\n    \"@radix-ui/react-select\": \"^2.0.0\",\n    \"@radix-ui/react-separator\": \"^1.0.3\",\n    \"@radix-ui/react-slot\": \"^1.0.2\",\n    \"@radix-ui/react-toast\": \"^1.1.5\",\n    \"class-variance-authority\": \"^0.7.0\",\n    \"clsx\": \"^2.0.0\",\n    \"lucide-react\": \"^0.294.0\",\n    \"tailwind-merge\": \"^2.0.0\",\n    \"tailwindcss-animate\": \"^1.0.7\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### TSConfig Configuration\n\n```json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"target\": \"es5\",\n    \"lib\": [\"dom\", \"dom.iterable\", \"es6\"],\n    \"allowJs\": true,\n    \"skipLibCheck\": true,\n    \"strict\": true,\n    \"forceConsistentCasingInFileNames\": true,\n    \"noEmit\": true,\n    \"esModuleInterop\": true,\n    \"module\": \"esnext\",\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"node\",\n    \"resolveJsonModule\": true,\n    \"isolatedModules\": true,\n    \"jsx\": \"preserve\",\n    \"incremental\": true,\n    \"plugins\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"next\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"baseUrl\": \".\",\n    \"paths\": {\n      \"@/components/*\": [\"./src/components/*\"],\n      \"@/lib/*\": [\"./src/lib/*\"]\n    }\n  },\n  \"include\": [\"next-env.d.ts\", \"**/*.ts\", \"**/*.tsx\", \".next/types/**/*.ts\"],\n  \"exclude\": [\"node_modules\"]\n}\n```\n\n### Tailwind Configuration\n\n```js\n// tailwind.config.js\n/** @type {import(''tailwindcss'').Config} */\nmodule.exports = {\n  darkMode: [\"class\"],\n  content: [\n    ''./pages/**/*.{ts,tsx}'',\n    ''./components/**/*.{ts,tsx}'',\n    ''./app/**/*.{ts,tsx}'',\n    ''./src/**/*.{ts,tsx}'',\n  ],\n  prefix: \"\",\n  theme: {\n    container: {\n      center: true,\n      padding: \"2rem\",\n      screens: {\n        \"2xl\": \"1400px\",\n      },\n    },\n    extend: {\n      colors: {\n        border: \"hsl(var(--border))\",\n        input: \"hsl(var(--input))\",\n        ring: \"hsl(var(--ring))\",\n        background: \"hsl(var(--background))\",\n        foreground: \"hsl(var(--foreground))\",\n        primary: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--primary))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--primary-foreground))\",\n        },\n        secondary: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--secondary))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--secondary-foreground))\",\n        },\n        destructive: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--destructive))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--destructive-foreground))\",\n        },\n        muted: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--muted))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--muted-foreground))\",\n        },\n        accent: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--accent))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--accent-foreground))\",\n        },\n        popover: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--popover))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--popover-foreground))\",\n        },\n        card: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--card))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--card-foreground))\",\n        },\n      },\n      borderRadius: {\n        lg: \"var(--radius)\",\n        md: \"calc(var(--radius) - 2px)\",\n        sm: \"calc(var(--radius) - 4px)\",\n      },\n      keyframes: {\n        \"accordion-down\": {\n          from: { height: \"0\" },\n          to: { height: \"var(--radix-accordion-content-height)\" },\n        },\n        \"accordion-up\": {\n          from: { height: \"var(--radix-accordion-content-height)\" },\n          to: { height: \"0\" },\n        },\n      },\n      animation: {\n        \"accordion-down\": \"accordion-down 0.2s ease-out\",\n        \"accordion-up\": \"accordion-up 0.2s ease-out\",\n      },\n    },\n  },\n  plugins: [require(\"tailwindcss-animate\")],\n}\n```\n\n### CSS Variables (globals.css)\n\n```css\n@tailwind base;\n@tailwind components;\n@tailwind utilities;\n\n@layer base {\n  :root {\n    --background: 0 0% 100%;\n    --foreground: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --card: 0 0% 100%;\n    --card-foreground: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --popover: 0 0% 100%;\n    --popover-foreground: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --primary: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --primary-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --secondary: 210 40% 96.1%;\n    --secondary-foreground: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --muted: 210 40% 96.1%;\n    --muted-foreground: 215.4 16.3% 46.9%;\n    --accent: 210 40% 96.1%;\n    --accent-foreground: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --destructive: 0 84.2% 60.2%;\n    --destructive-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --border: 214.3 31.8% 91.4%;\n    --input: 214.3 31.8% 91.4%;\n    --ring: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --radius: 0.5rem;\n  }\n\n  .dark {\n    --background: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --card: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --card-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --popover: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --popover-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --primary: 210 40% 98%;\n    --primary-foreground: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --secondary: 217.2 32.6% 17.5%;\n    --secondary-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --muted: 217.2 32.6% 17.5%;\n    --muted-foreground: 215 20.2% 65.1%;\n    --accent: 217.2 32.6% 17.5%;\n    --accent-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --destructive: 0 62.8% 30.6%;\n    --destructive-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --border: 217.2 32.6% 17.5%;\n    --input: 217.2 32.6% 17.5%;\n    --ring: 212.7 26.8% 83.9%;\n  }\n}\n\n@layer base {\n  * {\n    @apply border-border;\n  }\n  body {\n    @apply bg-background text-foreground;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Core Components\n\n### Button Component\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add button\n```\n\nBasic usage:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\";\n\nexport function ButtonDemo() {\n  return <Button>Click me</Button>;\n}\n```\n\nButton variants:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\";\n\nexport function ButtonVariants() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"flex gap-4\">\n      <Button variant=\"default\">Default</Button>\n      <Button variant=\"destructive\">Destructive</Button>\n      <Button variant=\"outline\">Outline</Button>\n      <Button variant=\"secondary\">Secondary</Button>\n      <Button variant=\"ghost\">Ghost</Button>\n      <Button variant=\"link\">Link</Button>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\nButton sizes:\n\n```tsx\n<div className=\"flex gap-4 items-center\">\n  <Button size=\"default\">Default</Button>\n  <Button size=\"sm\">Small</Button>\n  <Button size=\"lg\">Large</Button>\n  <Button size=\"icon\">\n    <Icon className=\"h-4 w-4\" />\n  </Button>\n</div>\n```\n\nWith loading state:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\";\nimport { Loader2 } from \"lucide-react\";\n\nexport function ButtonLoading() {\n  return (\n    <Button disabled>\n      <Loader2 className=\"mr-2 h-4 w-4 animate-spin\" />\n      Please wait\n    </Button>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Input & Form Fields\n\n#### Input Component\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add input\n```\n\nBasic input:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Input } from \"@/components/ui/input\";\n\nexport function InputDemo() {\n  return <Input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Email\" />;\n}\n```\n\nInput with label:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Input } from \"@/components/ui/input\";\nimport { Label } from \"@/components/ui/label\";\n\nexport function InputWithLabel() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"grid w-full max-w-sm items-center gap-1.5\">\n      <Label htmlFor=\"email\">Email</Label>\n      <Input type=\"email\" id=\"email\" placeholder=\"Email\" />\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\nInput with button:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\";\nimport { Input } from \"@/components/ui/input\";\n\nexport function InputWithButton() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"flex w-full max-w-sm items-center gap-2\">\n      <Input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Email\" />\n      <Button type=\"submit\" variant=\"outline\">Subscribe</Button>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Forms with Validation\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add form\n```\n\nThis installs React Hook Form, Zod, and form components.\n\nComplete form example:\n\n```tsx\n\"use client\"\n\nimport { zodResolver } from \"@hookform/resolvers/zod\"\nimport { useForm } from \"react-hook-form\"\nimport * as z from \"zod\"\n\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport {\n  Form,\n  FormControl,\n  FormDescription,\n  FormField,\n  FormItem,\n  FormLabel,\n  FormMessage,\n} from \"@/components/ui/form\"\nimport { Input } from \"@/components/ui/input\"\nimport { toast } from \"@/components/ui/use-toast\"\n\nconst formSchema = z.object({\n  username: z.string().min(2, {\n    message: \"Username must be at least 2 characters.\",\n  }),\n  email: z.string().email({\n    message: \"Please enter a valid email address.\",\n  }),\n})\n\nexport function ProfileForm() {\n  const form = useForm<z.infer<typeof formSchema>>({\n    resolver: zodResolver(formSchema),\n    defaultValues: {\n      username: \"\",\n      email: \"\",\n    },\n  })\n\n  function onSubmit(values: z.infer<typeof formSchema>) {\n    toast({\n      title: \"You submitted the following values:\",\n      description: (\n        <pre className=\"mt-2 w-[340px] rounded-md bg-slate-950 p-4\">\n          <code className=\"text-white\">{JSON.stringify(values, null, 2)}</code>\n        </pre>\n      ),\n    })\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <Form {...form}>\n      <form onSubmit={form.handleSubmit(onSubmit)} className=\"space-y-8\">\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"username\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Username</FormLabel>\n              <FormControl>\n                <Input placeholder=\"shadcn\" {...field} />\n              </FormControl>\n              <FormDescription>\n                This is your public display name.\n              </FormDescription>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n        \n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"email\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Email</FormLabel>\n              <FormControl>\n                <Input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\" {...field} />\n              </FormControl>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n        \n        <Button type=\"submit\">Submit</Button>\n      </form>\n    </Form>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Card Component\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add card\n```\n\nBasic card:\n\n```tsx\nimport {\n  Card,\n  CardContent,\n  CardDescription,\n  CardFooter,\n  CardHeader,\n  CardTitle,\n} from \"@/components/ui/card\"\n\nexport function CardDemo() {\n  return (\n    <Card>\n      <CardHeader>\n        <CardTitle>Card Title</CardTitle>\n        <CardDescription>Card Description</CardDescription>\n      </CardHeader>\n      <CardContent>\n        <p>Card Content</p>\n      </CardContent>\n      <CardFooter>\n        <p>Card Footer</p>\n      </CardFooter>\n    </Card>\n  )\n}\n```\n\nCard with form:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport {\n  Card,\n  CardContent,\n  CardDescription,\n  CardFooter,\n  CardHeader,\n  CardTitle,\n} from \"@/components/ui/card\"\nimport { Input } from \"@/components/ui/input\"\nimport { Label } from \"@/components/ui/label\"\n\nexport function CardWithForm() {\n  return (\n    <Card className=\"w-[350px]\">\n      <CardHeader>\n        <CardTitle>Create project</CardTitle>\n        <CardDescription>Deploy your new project in one-click.</CardDescription>\n      </CardHeader>\n      <CardContent>\n        <form>\n          <div className=\"grid w-full items-center gap-4\">\n            <div className=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5\">\n              <Label htmlFor=\"name\">Name</Label>\n              <Input id=\"name\" placeholder=\"Name of your project\" />\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </form>\n      </CardContent>\n      <CardFooter className=\"flex justify-between\">\n        <Button variant=\"outline\">Cancel</Button>\n        <Button>Deploy</Button>\n      </CardFooter>\n    </Card>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Dialog (Modal) Component\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add dialog\n```\n\nBasic dialog:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport {\n  Dialog,\n  DialogContent,\n  DialogDescription,\n  DialogFooter,\n  DialogHeader,\n  DialogTitle,\n  DialogTrigger,\n} from \"@/components/ui/dialog\"\n\nexport function DialogDemo() {\n  return (\n    <Dialog>\n      <DialogTrigger asChild>\n        <Button variant=\"outline\">Open Dialog</Button>\n      </DialogTrigger>\n      <DialogContent className=\"sm:max-w-[425px]\">\n        <DialogHeader>\n          <DialogTitle>Edit profile</DialogTitle>\n          <DialogDescription>\n            Make changes to your profile here. Click save when you''re done.\n          </DialogDescription>\n        </DialogHeader>\n        <div className=\"grid gap-4 py-4\">\n          <div className=\"grid grid-cols-4 items-center gap-4\">\n            <Label htmlFor=\"name\" className=\"text-right\">\n              Name\n            </Label>\n            <Input id=\"name\" value=\"Pedro Duarte\" className=\"col-span-3\" />\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <DialogFooter>\n          <Button type=\"submit\">Save changes</Button>\n        </DialogFooter>\n      </DialogContent>\n    </Dialog>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Sheet (Slide-over) Component\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add sheet\n```\n\nBasic sheet:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport {\n  Sheet,\n  SheetContent,\n  SheetDescription,\n  SheetHeader,\n  SheetTitle,\n  SheetTrigger,\n} from \"@/components/ui/sheet\"\n\nexport function SheetDemo() {\n  return (\n    <Sheet>\n      <SheetTrigger asChild>\n        <Button variant=\"outline\">Open Sheet</Button>\n      </SheetTrigger>\n      <SheetContent>\n        <SheetHeader>\n          <SheetTitle>Edit profile</SheetTitle>\n          <SheetDescription>\n            Make changes to your profile here. Click save when you''re done.\n          </SheetDescription>\n        </SheetHeader>\n        <div className=\"grid gap-4 py-4\">\n          <div className=\"grid grid-cols-4 items-center gap-4\">\n            <Label htmlFor=\"name\" className=\"text-right\">\n              Name\n            </Label>\n            <Input id=\"name\" value=\"Pedro Duarte\" className=\"col-span-3\" />\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"grid grid-cols-4 items-center gap-4\">\n            <Label htmlFor=\"username\" className=\"text-right\">\n              Username\n            </Label>\n            <Input id=\"username\" value=\"@peduarte\" className=\"col-span-3\" />\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </SheetContent>\n    </Sheet>\n  )\n}\n```\n\nSheet with side placement:\n\n```tsx\n<Sheet>\n  <SheetTrigger asChild>\n    <Button variant=\"outline\">Open Right Sheet</Button>\n  </SheetTrigger>\n  <SheetContent side=\"right\">\n    <SheetHeader>\n      <SheetTitle>Settings</SheetTitle>\n      <SheetDescription>\n        Configure your application settings here.\n      </SheetDescription>\n    </SheetHeader>\n    {/* Settings content */}\n  </SheetContent>\n</Sheet>\n```\n\n### Menubar & Navigation\n\n#### Menubar Component\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add menubar\n```\n\nBasic menubar:\n\n```tsx\nimport {\n  Menubar,\n  MenubarContent,\n  MenubarItem,\n  MenubarMenu,\n  MenubarSeparator,\n  MenubarShortcut,\n  MenubarSub,\n  MenubarSubContent,\n  MenubarSubTrigger,\n  MenubarTrigger,\n} from \"@/components/ui/menubar\"\n\nexport function MenubarDemo() {\n  return (\n    <Menubar>\n      <MenubarMenu>\n        <MenubarTrigger>File</MenubarTrigger>\n        <MenubarContent>\n          <MenubarItem>\n            New Tab <MenubarShortcut>⌘T</MenubarShortcut>\n          </MenubarItem>\n          <MenubarItem>\n            New Window <MenubarShortcut>⌘N</MenubarShortcut>\n          </MenubarItem>\n          <MenubarSeparator />\n          <MenubarItem>Share</MenubarItem>\n          <MenubarSeparator />\n          <MenubarItem>Print</MenubarItem>\n        </MenubarContent>\n      </MenubarMenu>\n      <MenubarMenu>\n        <MenubarTrigger>Edit</MenubarTrigger>\n        <MenubarContent>\n          <MenubarItem>\n            Undo <MenubarShortcut>⌘Z</MenubarShortcut>\n          </MenubarItem>\n          <MenubarItem>\n            Redo <MenubarShortcut>⌘Y</MenubarShortcut>\n          </MenubarItem>\n          <MenubarSeparator />\n          <MenubarSub>\n            <MenubarSubTrigger>Find</MenubarSubTrigger>\n            <MenubarSubContent>\n              <MenubarItem>Search the web</MenubarItem>\n              <MenubarItem>Find...</MenubarItem>\n              <MenubarItem>Find Next</MenubarItem>\n              <MenubarItem>Find Previous</MenubarItem>\n            </MenubarSubContent>\n          </MenubarSub>\n        </MenubarContent>\n      </MenubarMenu>\n    </Menubar>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Select (Dropdown) Component\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add select\n```\n\nBasic select:\n\n```tsx\nimport {\n  Select,\n  SelectContent,\n  SelectItem,\n  SelectTrigger,\n  SelectValue,\n} from \"@/components/ui/select\"\n\nexport function SelectDemo() {\n  return (\n    <Select>\n      <SelectTrigger className=\"w-[180px]\">\n        <SelectValue placeholder=\"Select a fruit\" />\n      </SelectTrigger>\n      <SelectContent>\n        <SelectItem value=\"apple\">Apple</SelectItem>\n        <SelectItem value=\"banana\">Banana</SelectItem>\n        <SelectItem value=\"orange\">Orange</SelectItem>\n      </SelectContent>\n    </Select>\n  )\n}\n```\n\nSelect in form:\n\n```tsx\n<FormField\n  control={form.control}\n  name=\"role\"\n  render={({ field }) => (\n    <FormItem>\n      <FormLabel>Role</FormLabel>\n      <Select onValueChange={field.onChange} defaultValue={field.value}>\n        <FormControl>\n          <SelectTrigger>\n            <SelectValue placeholder=\"Select a role\" />\n          </SelectTrigger>\n        </FormControl>\n        <SelectContent>\n          <SelectItem value=\"admin\">Admin</SelectItem>\n          <SelectItem value=\"user\">User</SelectItem>\n          <SelectItem value=\"guest\">Guest</SelectItem>\n        </SelectContent>\n      </Select>\n      <FormMessage />\n    </FormItem>\n  )}\n/>\n```\n\n### Toast Notifications\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add toast\n```\n\nSetup toast provider in root layout:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Toaster } from \"@/components/ui/toaster\"\n\nexport default function RootLayout({ children }) {\n  return (\n    <html lang=\"en\">\n      <body>\n        {children}\n        <Toaster />\n      </body>\n    </html>\n  )\n}\n```\n\nUsing toast:\n\n```tsx\nimport { useToast } from \"@/components/ui/use-toast\"\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\n\nexport function ToastDemo() {\n  const { toast } = useToast()\n\n  return (\n    <Button\n      onClick={() => {\n        toast({\n          title: \"Scheduled: Catch up\",\n          description: \"Friday, February 10, 2023 at 5:57 PM\",\n        })\n      }}\n    >\n      Show Toast\n    </Button>\n  )\n}\n```\n\nToast variants:\n\n```tsx\n// Success\ntoast({\n  title: \"Success\",\n  description: \"Your changes have been saved.\",\n})\n\n// Error\ntoast({\n  variant: \"destructive\",\n  title: \"Error\",\n  description: \"Something went wrong.\",\n})\n\n// With action\ntoast({\n  title: \"Uh oh! Something went wrong.\",\n  description: \"There was a problem with your request.\",\n  action: <ToastAction altText=\"Try again\">Try again</ToastAction>,\n})\n```\n\n### Table Component\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add table\n```\n\nBasic table:\n\n```tsx\nimport {\n  Table,\n  TableBody,\n  TableCaption,\n  TableCell,\n  TableHead,\n  TableHeader,\n  TableRow,\n} from \"@/components/ui/table\"\n\nconst invoices = [\n  { invoice: \"INV001\", status: \"Paid\", method: \"Credit Card\", amount: \"$250.00\" },\n  { invoice: \"INV002\", status: \"Pending\", method: \"PayPal\", amount: \"$150.00\" },\n]\n\nexport function TableDemo() {\n  return (\n    <Table>\n      <TableCaption>A list of your recent invoices.</TableCaption>\n      <TableHeader>\n        <TableRow>\n          <TableHead>Invoice</TableHead>\n          <TableHead>Status</TableHead>\n          <TableHead>Method</TableHead>\n          <TableHead className=\"text-right\">Amount</TableHead>\n        </TableRow>\n      </TableHeader>\n      <TableBody>\n        {invoices.map((invoice) => (\n          <TableRow key={invoice.invoice}>\n            <TableCell className=\"font-medium\">{invoice.invoice}</TableCell>\n            <TableCell>{invoice.status}</TableCell>\n            <TableCell>{invoice.method}</TableCell>\n            <TableCell className=\"text-right\">{invoice.amount}</TableCell>\n          </TableRow>\n        ))}\n      </TableBody>\n    </Table>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Customization\n\n### Theming with CSS Variables\n\nshadcn/ui uses CSS variables for theming. Configure in `globals.css`:\n\n```css\n@layer base {\n  :root {\n    --background: 0 0% 100%;\n    --foreground: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --primary: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --primary-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --secondary: 210 40% 96.1%;\n    --secondary-foreground: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --muted: 210 40% 96.1%;\n    --muted-foreground: 215.4 16.3% 46.9%;\n    --accent: 210 40% 96.1%;\n    --accent-foreground: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --destructive: 0 84.2% 60.2%;\n    --destructive-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --border: 214.3 31.8% 91.4%;\n    --input: 214.3 31.8% 91.4%;\n    --ring: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --radius: 0.5rem;\n  }\n\n  .dark {\n    --background: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --primary: 210 40% 98%;\n    --primary-foreground: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    /* ... other dark mode variables */\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Customizing Components\n\nSince you own the code, customize directly:\n\n```tsx\n// components/ui/button.tsx\nimport * as React from \"react\"\nimport { Slot } from \"@radix-ui/react-slot\"\nimport { cva, type VariantProps } from \"class-variance-authority\"\nimport { cn } from \"@/lib/utils\"\n\nconst buttonVariants = cva(\n  \"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors\",\n  {\n    variants: {\n      variant: {\n        default: \"bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/90\",\n        destructive: \"bg-destructive text-destructive-foreground hover:bg-destructive/90\",\n        outline: \"border border-input bg-background hover:bg-accent\",\n        // Add custom variant\n        custom: \"bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-500 to-pink-500 text-white\",\n      },\n      size: {\n        default: \"h-10 px-4 py-2\",\n        sm: \"h-9 rounded-md px-3\",\n        lg: \"h-11 rounded-md px-8\",\n        // Add custom size\n        xl: \"h-14 rounded-md px-10 text-lg\",\n      },\n    },\n    defaultVariants: {\n      variant: \"default\",\n      size: \"default\",\n    },\n  }\n)\n\nexport interface ButtonProps\n  extends React.ButtonHTMLAttributes<HTMLButtonElement>,\n    VariantProps<typeof buttonVariants> {\n  asChild?: boolean\n}\n\nconst Button = React.forwardRef<HTMLButtonElement, ButtonProps>(\n  ({ className, variant, size, asChild = false, ...props }, ref) => {\n    const Comp = asChild ? Slot : \"button\"\n    return (\n      <Comp\n        className={cn(buttonVariants({ variant, size, className }))}\n        ref={ref}\n        {...props}\n      />\n    )\n  }\n)\nButton.displayName = \"Button\"\n\nexport { Button, buttonVariants }\n```\n\n## Next.js Integration\n\n### App Router Setup\n\nFor Next.js 13+ with App Router, ensure components use `\"use client\"` directive:\n\n```tsx\n// src/components/ui/button.tsx\n\"use client\"\n\nimport * as React from \"react\"\nimport { Slot } from \"@radix-ui/react-slot\"\nimport { cva, type VariantProps } from \"class-variance-authority\"\nimport { cn } from \"@/lib/utils\"\n\n// ... rest of component\n```\n\n### Layout Integration\n\nAdd the Toaster to your root layout:\n\n```tsx\n// app/layout.tsx\nimport { Toaster } from \"@/components/ui/toaster\"\nimport \"./globals.css\"\n\nexport default function RootLayout({\n  children,\n}: {\n  children: React.ReactNode\n}) {\n  return (\n    <html lang=\"en\" suppressHydrationWarning>\n      <body className=\"min-h-screen bg-background font-sans antialiased\">\n        {children}\n        <Toaster />\n      </body>\n    </html>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Server Components\n\nWhen using shadcn/ui components in Server Components, wrap them in a Client Component:\n\n```tsx\n// app/dashboard/page.tsx\nimport { Card, CardContent, CardHeader, CardTitle } from \"@/components/ui/card\"\nimport { ButtonClient } from \"@/components/ui/button-client\"\n\nexport default function DashboardPage() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"container mx-auto p-6\">\n      <Card>\n        <CardHeader>\n          <CardTitle>Dashboard</CardTitle>\n        </CardHeader>\n        <CardContent>\n          <ButtonClient>Interactive Button</ButtonClient>\n        </CardContent>\n      </Card>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n```tsx\n// src/components/ui/button-client.tsx\n\"use client\"\n\nimport { Button } from \"./button\"\n\nexport function ButtonClient(props: React.ComponentProps<typeof Button>) {\n  return <Button {...props} />\n}\n```\n\n### Route Handlers with Forms\n\nCreate API routes for form submissions:\n\n```tsx\n// app/api/contact/route.ts\nimport { NextRequest, NextResponse } from \"next/server\"\nimport { z } from \"zod\"\n\nconst contactSchema = z.object({\n  name: z.string().min(2),\n  email: z.string().email(),\n  message: z.string().min(10),\n})\n\nexport async function POST(request: NextRequest) {\n  try {\n    const body = await request.json()\n    const validated = contactSchema.parse(body)\n\n    // Process form data\n    console.log(\"Form submission:\", validated)\n\n    return NextResponse.json({ success: true })\n  } catch (error) {\n    if (error instanceof z.ZodError) {\n      return NextResponse.json(\n        { errors: error.errors },\n        { status: 400 }\n      )\n    }\n\n    return NextResponse.json(\n      { error: \"Internal server error\" },\n      { status: 500 }\n    )\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Form with Server Action\n\nUsing Next.js 14+ Server Actions:\n\n```tsx\n// app/contact/page.tsx\n\"use client\"\n\nimport { zodResolver } from \"@hookform/resolvers/zod\"\nimport { useForm } from \"react-hook-form\"\nimport * as z from \"zod\"\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport {\n  Form,\n  FormControl,\n  FormField,\n  FormItem,\n  FormLabel,\n  FormMessage,\n} from \"@/components/ui/form\"\nimport { Input } from \"@/components/ui/input\"\nimport { Textarea } from \"@/components/ui/textarea\"\nimport { toast } from \"@/components/ui/use-toast\"\n\nconst formSchema = z.object({\n  name: z.string().min(2),\n  email: z.string().email(),\n  message: z.string().min(10),\n})\n\nasync function onSubmit(values: z.infer<typeof formSchema>) {\n  try {\n    const response = await fetch(\"/api/contact\", {\n      method: \"POST\",\n      headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n      body: JSON.stringify(values),\n    })\n\n    if (!response.ok) throw new Error(\"Failed to submit\")\n\n    toast({\n      title: \"Success!\",\n      description: \"Your message has been sent.\",\n    })\n  } catch (error) {\n    toast({\n      variant: \"destructive\",\n      title: \"Error\",\n      description: \"Failed to send message. Please try again.\",\n    })\n  }\n}\n\nexport default function ContactPage() {\n  const form = useForm<z.infer<typeof formSchema>>({\n    resolver: zodResolver(formSchema),\n  })\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"container mx-auto max-w-2xl py-8\">\n      <Form {...form}>\n        <form onSubmit={form.handleSubmit(onSubmit)} className=\"space-y-6\">\n          <FormField\n            control={form.control}\n            name=\"name\"\n            render={({ field }) => (\n              <FormItem>\n                <FormLabel>Name</FormLabel>\n                <FormControl>\n                  <Input placeholder=\"Your name\" {...field} />\n                </FormControl>\n                <FormMessage />\n              </FormItem>\n            )}\n          />\n\n          <FormField\n            control={form.control}\n            name=\"email\"\n            render={({ field }) => (\n              <FormItem>\n                <FormLabel>Email</FormLabel>\n                <FormControl>\n                  <Input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"your@email.com\" {...field} />\n                </FormControl>\n                <FormMessage />\n              </FormItem>\n            )}\n          />\n\n          <FormField\n            control={form.control}\n            name=\"message\"\n            render={({ field }) => (\n              <FormItem>\n                <FormLabel>Message</FormLabel>\n                <FormControl>\n                  <Textarea\n                    placeholder=\"Your message...\"\n                    className=\"resize-none\"\n                    {...field}\n                  />\n                </FormControl>\n                <FormMessage />\n              </FormItem>\n            )}\n          />\n\n          <Button type=\"submit\" className=\"w-full\">\n            Send Message\n          </Button>\n        </form>\n      </Form>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Metadata with shadcn/ui\n\nUsing shadcn/ui components in metadata:\n\n```tsx\n// app/layout.tsx\nimport { Metadata } from \"next\"\n\nexport const metadata: Metadata = {\n  title: {\n    default: \"My App\",\n    template: \"%s | My App\",\n  },\n  description: \"Built with shadcn/ui and Next.js\",\n}\n\n// app/about/page.tsx\nimport { Metadata } from \"next\"\nimport { Card, CardContent, CardHeader, CardTitle } from \"@/components/ui/card\"\n\nexport const metadata: Metadata = {\n  title: \"About Us\",\n  description: \"Learn more about our company\",\n}\n\nexport default function AboutPage() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"container mx-auto py-8\">\n      <Card>\n        <CardHeader>\n          <CardTitle>About Our Company</CardTitle>\n        </CardHeader>\n        <CardContent>\n          <p>We build amazing products with modern web technologies.</p>\n        </CardContent>\n      </Card>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Font Optimization\n\nOptimize fonts with next/font:\n\n```tsx\n// app/layout.tsx\nimport { Inter } from \"next/font/google\"\nimport { Toaster } from \"@/components/ui/toaster\"\nimport { cn } from \"@/lib/utils\"\nimport \"./globals.css\"\n\nconst inter = Inter({ subsets: [\"latin\"] })\n\nexport default function RootLayout({\n  children,\n}: {\n  children: React.ReactNode\n}) {\n  return (\n    <html lang=\"en\" suppressHydrationWarning>\n      <body className={cn(\"min-h-screen bg-background font-sans antialiased\", inter.className)}>\n        {children}\n        <Toaster />\n      </body>\n    </html>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Advanced Patterns\n\n### Form with Multiple Fields\n\n```tsx\nconst formSchema = z.object({\n  username: z.string().min(2).max(50),\n  email: z.string().email(),\n  bio: z.string().max(160).min(4),\n  role: z.enum([\"admin\", \"user\", \"guest\"]),\n  notifications: z.boolean().default(false),\n})\n\nexport function AdvancedForm() {\n  const form = useForm<z.infer<typeof formSchema>>({\n    resolver: zodResolver(formSchema),\n    defaultValues: {\n      username: \"\",\n      email: \"\",\n      bio: \"\",\n      role: \"user\",\n      notifications: false,\n    },\n  })\n\n  function onSubmit(values: z.infer<typeof formSchema>) {\n    console.log(values)\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <Form {...form}>\n      <form onSubmit={form.handleSubmit(onSubmit)} className=\"space-y-8\">\n        {/* Username field */}\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"username\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Username</FormLabel>\n              <FormControl>\n                <Input placeholder=\"johndoe\" {...field} />\n              </FormControl>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n\n        {/* Email field */}\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"email\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Email</FormLabel>\n              <FormControl>\n                <Input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"john@example.com\" {...field} />\n              </FormControl>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n\n        {/* Textarea field */}\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"bio\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Bio</FormLabel>\n              <FormControl>\n                <Textarea\n                  placeholder=\"Tell us about yourself\"\n                  className=\"resize-none\"\n                  {...field}\n                />\n              </FormControl>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n\n        {/* Select field */}\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"role\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Role</FormLabel>\n              <Select onValueChange={field.onChange} defaultValue={field.value}>\n                <FormControl>\n                  <SelectTrigger>\n                    <SelectValue placeholder=\"Select a role\" />\n                  </SelectTrigger>\n                </FormControl>\n                <SelectContent>\n                  <SelectItem value=\"admin\">Admin</SelectItem>\n                  <SelectItem value=\"user\">User</SelectItem>\n                  <SelectItem value=\"guest\">Guest</SelectItem>\n                </SelectContent>\n              </Select>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n\n        {/* Checkbox field */}\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"notifications\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem className=\"flex flex-row items-start space-x-3 space-y-0\">\n              <FormControl>\n                <Checkbox\n                  checked={field.value}\n                  onCheckedChange={field.onChange}\n                />\n              </FormControl>\n              <div className=\"space-y-1 leading-none\">\n                <FormLabel>Email notifications</FormLabel>\n                <FormDescription>\n                  Receive emails about your account activity.\n                </FormDescription>\n              </div>\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n\n        <Button type=\"submit\">Submit</Button>\n      </form>\n    </Form>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Accessibility**: Components use Radix UI primitives for ARIA compliance\n2. **Customization**: Modify components directly in your codebase\n3. **Type Safety**: Use TypeScript for type-safe props and state\n4. **Validation**: Use Zod schemas for form validation\n5. **Styling**: Leverage Tailwind utilities and CSS variables\n6. **Consistency**: Use the same component patterns across your app\n7. **Testing**: Components are testable with React Testing Library\n8. **Performance**: Components are optimized and tree-shakeable\n\n## Common Component Combinations\n\n### Login Form\n\n```tsx\n<Card className=\"w-[350px]\">\n  <CardHeader>\n    <CardTitle>Login</CardTitle>\n    <CardDescription>Enter your credentials to continue</CardDescription>\n  </CardHeader>\n  <CardContent>\n    <Form {...form}>\n      <form onSubmit={form.handleSubmit(onSubmit)} className=\"space-y-4\">\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"email\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Email</FormLabel>\n              <FormControl>\n                <Input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\" {...field} />\n              </FormControl>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"password\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Password</FormLabel>\n              <FormControl>\n                <Input type=\"password\" {...field} />\n              </FormControl>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n        <Button type=\"submit\" className=\"w-full\">Login</Button>\n      </form>\n    </Form>\n  </CardContent>\n</Card>\n```\n\n## References\n\n- Official Docs: https://ui.shadcn.com\n- Radix UI: https://www.radix-ui.com\n- React Hook Form: https://react-hook-form.com\n- Zod: https://zod.dev\n- Tailwind CSS: https://tailwindcss.com\n- Examples: https://ui.shadcn.com/examples\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:41:16.314Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents requiring customizable UI components with accessibility features using Radix UI and Tailwind CSS.","zh":"适合需要可定制的UI组件且具有无障碍功能的前端代理，使用Radix UI和Tailwind CSS。","ja":"カスタマイズ可能なUIコンポーネントとアクセシビリティ機能が必要なフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。Radix UIとTailwind CSSを使用します。","ko":"사용자 정의 가능한 UI 구성 요소와 접근성 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다. Radix UI와 Tailwind CSS를 사용합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes front-end que requieren componentes de interfaz de usuario personalizables con características de accesibilidad utilizando Radix UI y Tailwind CSS.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Frontend nécessitant des composants d''interface utilisateur personnalisables avec des fonctionnalités d''accessibilité utilisant Radix UI et Tailwind CSS.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agents, die anpassbare Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten mit Accessibility-Features unter Verwendung von Radix UI und Tailwind CSS erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend que exigem componentes de UI personalizáveis com recursos de acessibilidade utilizando Radix UI e Tailwind CSS.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, требующих настраиваемых компонентов интерфейса пользователя с функциями доступности, использующих Radix UI и Tailwind CSS.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الأمامية الذي يتطلب مكونات واجهة المستخدم القابلة للتعديل مع ميزات الوصول باستخدام Radix UI و Tailwind CSS."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build accessible and customizable UI components with shadcn/ui, leveraging Radix UI and Tailwind CSS for enhanced narrative experiences in interactive storytelling platforms, utilizing components like Button, Input & Form Fields, and Card.","zh":"赋予代理构建无障碍和可定制的UI组件的能力，利用shadcn/ui、Radix UI和Tailwind CSS来增强交互式故事讲述平台的叙事体验，使用的组件如按钮、输入和表单字段以及卡片。","ja":"エージェントがアクセシビリティのあるカスタマイズ可能なUIコンポーネントを構築できるようにし、shadcn/ui、Radix UI、Tailwind CSSを利用してインタラクティブなストーリーテリングプラットフォームの物語体験を強化します。コンポーネントとしては、ボタン、入力フォーム、カードなどを使用します。","ko":"에이전트가 접근성이 뛰어난 사용자 정의 가능한 UI 구성 요소를 구축할 수 있도록 하여 shadcn/ui, Radix UI 및 Tailwind CSS를 활용하여 상호 작용형 스토리 텔링 플랫폼의 내러티브 경험을 향상시킵니다. 버튼, 입력 및 양식 필드, 카드 등과 같은 구성 요소를 사용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear componentes de interfaz de usuario accesibles y personalizables con shadcn/ui, aprovechando Radix UI y Tailwind CSS para experiencias narrativas mejoradas en plataformas de narración interactiva, utilizando componentes como Button, Input y Form Fields, y Card.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des composants d''interface utilisateur accessibles et personnalisables avec shadcn/ui, en exploitant Radix UI et Tailwind CSS pour améliorer les expériences narratives sur les plateformes de narration interactive, en utilisant des composants tels que Button, Input et Form Fields, et Card.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, zugängliche und anpassbare Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten mit shadcn/ui zu erstellen, indem Radix UI und Tailwind CSS für verbesserte narrative Erfahrungen auf interaktiven Erzählplattformen genutzt werden, unter Verwendung von Komponenten wie Button, Input und Form Fields sowie Card.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir componentes de UI acessíveis e personalizáveis com shadcn/ui, aproveitando Radix UI e Tailwind CSS para experiências narrativas aprimoradas em plataformas de contar histórias interativas, utilizando componentes como Botão, Entrada e Campos de Formulário e Cartão.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать доступные и настраиваемые компоненты интерфейса пользователя с помощью shadcn/ui, используя Radix UI и Tailwind CSS для улучшения повествовательных опытов на интерактивных платформах рассказывания историй, используя компоненты seperti Button, Input и Form Fields, и Card.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على بناء مكونات واجهة المستخدم المُتاحة وقابلة للتعديل مع shadcn/ui، مستفيداً من Radix UI و Tailwind CSS لتحسين تجارب السرد في منصات سرد القصص التفاعلية، باستخدام مكونات مثل الزر، والمدخلات وحقول النماذج، والبطاقة."},"useCases":{"en":["Building interactive mythological storyboards with accessible UI","Customizing UI components for folklore-based web applications using shadcn/ui and Tailwind CSS","Creating validated forms for user input in narrative-driven projects with Radix UI"],"zh":["使用无障碍的UI构建交互式神话故事板","使用shadcn/ui和Tailwind CSS为民俗基础的Web应用程序自定义UI组件","在叙事驱动的项目中使用Radix UI创建验证表单以获取用户输入"],"ja":["アクセシブルなUIを使用してインタラクティブな神話のストーリーボードを構築する","shadcn/uiとTailwind CSSを使用して民俗ベースのWebアプリケーションのUIコンポーネントをカスタマイズする","物語駆動のプロジェクトでRadix UIを使用してユーザー入力を取得するための検証フォームを作成する"],"ko":["접근성이 뛰어난 UI를 사용하여 상호 작용형 신화 스토리보드를 구축하는 것","shadcn/ui 및 Tailwind CSS를 사용하여 민속 기반 웹 애플리케이션의 UI 구성 요소를 사용자 정의하는 것","내러티브 주도형 프로젝트에서 Radix UI를 사용하여 사용자 입력을 위한 유효성 검사 양식을 생성하는 것"],"es":["Creación de tableros de historias mitológicas interactivas con interfaz de usuario accesible","Personalización de componentes de interfaz de usuario para aplicaciones web basadas en folklore utilizando shadcn/ui y Tailwind CSS","Creación de formularios validados para entrada de usuario en proyectos impulsados por narrativa con Radix UI"],"fr":["Création de tableaux de stories mythologiques interactifs avec interface utilisateur accessible","Personnalisation de composants d''interface utilisateur pour des applications web basées sur le folklore en utilisant shadcn/ui et Tailwind CSS","Création de formulaires validés pour la saisie utilisateur dans des projets à narration avec Radix UI"],"de":["Erstellung interaktiver mythologischer Storyboards mit zugänglicher Benutzeroberfläche","Anpassung von Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten für webbasierte Anwendungen auf Basis von Folklore unter Verwendung von shadcn/ui und Tailwind CSS","Erstellung validierter Formulare für Benutzereingaben in narrativ getriebenen Projekten mit Radix UI"],"pt":["Construção de quadros de história mitológica interativos com UI acessível","Personalização de componentes de UI para aplicações web baseadas em folclore usando shadcn/ui e Tailwind CSS","Criação de formulários validados para entrada de usuário em projetos impulsionados por narrativa com Radix UI"],"ru":["Создание интерактивных досок мифологических историй с доступным интерфейсом пользователя","Настройка компонентов интерфейса пользователя для веб-приложений, основанных на фольклоре, с помощью shadcn/ui и Tailwind CSS","Создание проверенных форм для ввода пользователем в проектах, управляемых повествованием, с помощью Radix UI"],"ar":["بناء لوحات القصص الميثولوجية التفاعلية مع واجهة المستخدم المُتاحة","تخصيص مكونات واجهة المستخدم لتطبيقات الويب القائمة على الفلكلور باستخدام shadcn/ui و Tailwind CSS","إنشاء نماذج تم التحقق منها لمدخلات المستخدم في المشاريع القائمة على السرد مع Radix UI"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of shadcn/ui, Radix UI, and Tailwind CSS","Limited to frontend development","Dependent on project configuration and setup"],"zh":["需要了解shadcn/ui、Radix UI和Tailwind CSS","仅限于前端开发","依赖于项目配置和设置"],"ja":["shadcn/ui、Radix UI、Tailwind CSSの知識が必要","フロントエンド開発のみに限定される","プロジェクトの構成と設定に依存する"],"ko":["shadcn/ui, Radix UI 및 Tailwind CSS에 대한 지식이 필요합니다.","프론트엔드 개발에만 제한됩니다.","프로젝트 구성 및 설정에 의존합니다."],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de shadcn/ui, Radix UI y Tailwind CSS","Limitado al desarrollo front-end","Dependiente de la configuración y configuración del proyecto"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances sur shadcn/ui, Radix UI et Tailwind CSS","Limité au développement front-end","Dépend de la configuration et de la mise en place du projet"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von shadcn/ui, Radix UI und Tailwind CSS","Begrenzt auf die Frontend-Entwicklung","Abhängig von der Projekt-Konfiguration und -Einrichtung"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de shadcn/ui, Radix UI e Tailwind CSS","Limitado ao desenvolvimento frontend","Dependente da configuração e instalação do projeto"],"ru":["Требует знания shadcn/ui, Radix UI и Tailwind CSS","Ограничен разработкой frontend","Зависит от конфигурации и настройки проекта"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة shadcn/ui و Radix UI و Tailwind CSS","محدود بالتطوير الأمامي","يعتمد على تكوين المشروع وإعدادته"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
