tion Vue ist eine Animationsbibliothek für Vue 3 und Nuxt, die hardwarebeschleunigte Animationen mit minimalem Paketgröße bietet","en":"My personal website"},"definition":{"en":"My personal website"},"features":{"zh":["硬件加速动画","简单的声明式API","小的包大小","支持Vue 3和Nuxt","支持手势交互","支持渐隐、滑动、缩放等动画"],"ja":["ハードウェアアクセラレーションアニメーション","シンプルな宣言的API","小さなパッケージサイズ","Vue 3とNuxtのサポート","ジェスチャーインタラクションのサポート","フェード、スライド、スケールなどのアニメーションのサポート"],"ko":["하드웨어 가속 애니메이션","간단한 선언적 API","작은 패키지 크기","Vue 3와 Nuxt의 지원","제스처 상호작용의 지원","페이드, 슬라이드, 스케일 등의 애니메이션 지원"],"es":["Animaciones declarativas simples","Interacciones gestuales","Renderizado acelerado por hardware","Tamaño de paquete mínimo","Compatibilidad con Vue 3 y Nuxt"],"fr":["Animations déclaratives simples","Interactions gestuelles","Rendu accéléré par matériel","Taille de paquet minimal","Compatibilité avec Vue 3 et Nuxt"],"de":["Deklarative Animationen einfach","Gestuelle Interaktionen","Hardwarebeschleunigtes Rendering","Minimale Paketgröße","Kompatibilität mit Vue 3 und Nuxt"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Motion Vue","Vue 3动画","Nuxt动画","硬件加速动画","声明式动画","手势交互","渐隐动画","滑动动画","缩放动画"],"ja":["Motion Vue","Vue 3アニメーション","Nuxtアニメーション","ハードウェアアクセラレーションアニメーション","宣言的アニメーション","ジェスチャーインタラクション","フェードアニメーション","スライドアニメーション","スケールアニメーション"],"ko":["모션 뷰","Vue 3 애니메이션","Nuxt 애니메이션","하드웨어 가속 애니메이션","선언적 애니메이션","제스처 상호작용","페이드 애니메이션","슬라이드 애니메이션","스케일 애니메이션"],"es":["Motion Vue","animaciones para Vue 3","biblioteca de animaciones","renderizado acelerado por hardware","tamaño de paquete mínimo","Vue 3","Nuxt","animaciones declarativas","interacciones gestuales"],"fr":["Motion Vue","animations pour Vue 3","bibliothèque d''animations","rendu accéléré par matériel","taille de paquet minimal","Vue 3","Nuxt","animations déclaratives","interactions gestuelles"],"de":["Motion Vue","Animationen für Vue 3","Animationsbibliothek","hardwarebeschleunigtes Rendering","minimale Paketgröße","Vue 3","Nuxt","deklarative Animationen","gestuelle Interaktionen"]}},"owner":"molaei2000","repo":"triplem.dev","repoPath":"molaei2000/triplem.dev","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.424Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"motion","description":"Use when adding animations with Motion Vue (motion-v) - provides motion component API, gesture animations, scroll-linked effects, layout transitions, and composables for Vue 3/Nuxt","bodyPreview":"# Motion Vue (motion-v)\n\nAnimation library for Vue 3 and Nuxt. Production-ready, hardware-accelerated animations with minimal bundle size.\n\n**Current stable:** motion-v 1.x - Vue port of Motion (formerly Framer Motion)\n\n## Overview\n\nProgressive reference for Motion Vue animations. Load only files relevant to current task (~200 tokens base, 500-1500 per sub-file).\n\n## When to Use\n\n**Use Motion Vue for:**\n\n- Simple declarative animations (fade, slide, scale)\n- Gesture-based interactions (hover, ta","body":"# Motion Vue (motion-v)\n\nAnimation library for Vue 3 and Nuxt. Production-ready, hardware-accelerated animations with minimal bundle size.\n\n**Current stable:** motion-v 1.x - Vue port of Motion (formerly Framer Motion)\n\n## Overview\n\nProgressive reference for Motion Vue animations. Load only files relevant to current task (~200 tokens base, 500-1500 per sub-file).\n\n## When to Use\n\n**Use Motion Vue for:**\n\n- Simple declarative animations (fade, slide, scale)\n- Gesture-based interactions (hover, tap, drag)\n- Scroll-linked animations\n- Layout animations and shared element transitions\n- Spring physics animations\n\n**Consider alternatives:**\n\n- **GSAP** - Complex timelines, SVG morphing, scroll-triggered sequences\n- **@vueuse/motion** - Simpler API, less features, smaller bundle\n- **CSS animations** - Simple transitions without JS\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\n# Vue 3\npnpm add motion-v\n\n# Nuxt 3\npnpm add motion-v @vueuse/nuxt\n```\n\n```ts\n// nuxt.config.ts - Nuxt 3 setup\nexport default defineNuxtConfig({\n  modules: [''motion-v/nuxt''],\n})\n```\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Working on...                | Load file                 |\n| ---------------------------- | ------------------------- |\n| Motion component, gestures   | references/components.md  |\n| useMotionValue, useScroll    | references/composables.md |\n| Animation examples, patterns | references/examples.md    |\n\n## Loading Files\n\n**Consider loading these reference files based on your task:**\n\n- [ ] [references/components.md](references/components.md) - if using Motion component, gestures, or layout animations\n- [ ] [references/composables.md](references/composables.md) - if using useMotionValue, useScroll, useSpring, or animate()\n- [ ] [references/examples.md](references/examples.md) - if looking for animation patterns or inspiration\n\n**DO NOT load all files at once.** Load only what''s relevant to your current task.\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### Motion Component\n\nRender any HTML/SVG element with animation capabilities:\n\n```vue\n<script setup lang=\"ts\">\nimport { motion } from ''motion-v''\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <motion.div\n    :initial=\"{ opacity: 0, y: 20 }\"\n    :animate=\"{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }\"\n    :exit=\"{ opacity: 0, y: -20 }\"\n    :transition=\"{ duration: 0.3 }\"\n  >\n    Animated content\n  </motion.div>\n</template>\n```\n\n### Gesture Animations\n\n```vue\n<motion.button\n  :whileHover=\"{ scale: 1.05 }\"\n  :whilePress=\"{ scale: 0.95 }\"\n  :transition=\"{ type: ''spring'', stiffness: 400 }\"\n>\n  Click me\n</motion.button>\n```\n\n### Scroll Animations\n\n```vue\n<motion.div\n  :initial=\"{ opacity: 0 }\"\n  :whileInView=\"{ opacity: 1 }\"\n  :viewport=\"{ once: true, margin: ''-100px'' }\"\n>\n  Appears on scroll\n</motion.div>\n```\n\n## Available Guidance\n\n**[references/components.md](references/components.md)** - Motion component variants, animation props, gesture props, layout animations, transition configuration\n\n**[references/composables.md](references/composables.md)** - useMotionValue, useSpring, useTransform, useScroll, useInView, animate()\n\n**[references/examples.md](references/examples.md)** - External resources, component libraries, animation patterns and inspiration\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:41:45.768Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced animation capabilities with Vue 3 and Nuxt.","zh":"非常适合需要使用 Vue 3 和 Nuxt 的高级动画功能的前端代理。","ja":"Vue 3 と Nuxt を使用した高度なアニメーション機能を必要とするフロントエンド エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Vue 3 및 Nuxt를 사용한 고급 애니메이션 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes frontend que necesitan capacidades de animación avanzadas con Vue 3 y Nuxt.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend ayant besoin de fonctionnalités d''animation avancées avec Vue 3 et Nuxt.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte Animationsfunktionen mit Vue 3 und Nuxt benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam de capacidades de animação avançadas com Vue 3 e Nuxt.","ru":"Идеально для фронтенд-агентов, которым требуются продвинутые возможности анимации с Vue 3 и Nuxt.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة للرسوم المتحركة مع Vue 3 و Nuxt."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create production-ready, hardware-accelerated animations with minimal bundle size using Motion Vue, supporting simple declarative animations and gesture-based interactions via Vue port of Motion.","zh":"赋予代理创建使用 Motion Vue 的生产就绪、硬件加速的动画的能力，支持简单的声明式动画和基于手势的交互，使用 Vue 的 Motion 端口，具有最小的包大小。","ja":"Motion Vue を使用して、最小のバンドルサイズでハードウェアアクセラレーションされたアニメーションを作成し、シンプルな宣言的アニメーションとジェスチャーベースのインタラクションをサポートする Vue の Motion ポートを使用して、エージェントにプロダクションレディのアニメーションを作成する能力を与えます。","ko":"에이전트가 Motion Vue를 사용하여 최소한의 번들 크기로 생산 준비가 된 하드웨어 가속 애니메이션을 만들 수 있는 기능을 부여하고, Vue의 Motion 포트를 통해 단순한 선언적 애니메이션과 제스처 기반 상호 작용을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear animaciones listas para producción, con aceleración por hardware y tamaño de paquete mínimo utilizando Motion Vue, que admite animaciones declarativas simples y gestos basados en interacciones a través de la versión de Vue de Motion.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des animations prêtes pour la production, avec un rendu accéléré par le matériel et une taille de bundle minimale en utilisant Motion Vue, qui prend en charge les animations déclaratives simples et les interactions basées sur les gestes via le port de Vue de Motion.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, produktionsreife Animations mit Hardware-Beschleunigung und minimalem Bundle-Größe zu erstellen, indem Motion Vue verwendet wird, das einfache deklarative Animationen und gestenbasierte Interaktionen über die Vue-Port von Motion unterstützt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar animações de produção prontas, com aceleração de hardware e tamanho de bundle mínimo, usando Motion Vue, que suporta animações declarativas simples e interações baseadas em gestos via porta de Motion para Vue.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать готовые к производству анимации с ускорением аппаратного обеспечения и минимальным размером пакета, используя Motion Vue, поддерживающий простые декларативные анимации и жестовые взаимодействия через порт Motion для Vue.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء رسوم متحركة جاهزة للإنتاج بدعم تشغيل عتاد مع الحد الأدنى من حجم الحزمة باستخدام Motion Vue، والذي يدعم الرسوم المتحركة الإعلانية البسيطة والتفاعلات القائمة على الإشارات عبر منفذ Motion لVue."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing simple declarative animations such as fade, slide, and scale","Developing gesture-based interactions like hover and tap events","Optimizing animation performance with hardware-accelerated rendering"],"zh":["实现简单的声明式动画，如渐入、滑动和缩放","开发基于手势的交互，如悬停和点击事件","使用硬件加速渲染优化动画性能"],"ja":["フェード、スライド、スケールなどのシンプルな宣言的アニメーションの実装","ホーバーとタップイベントなどのジェスチャーベースのインタラクションの開発","ハードウェアアクセラレーションレンダリングを使用したアニメーションパフォーマンスの最適化"],"ko":["페이드, 슬라이드, 스케일 등의 단순한 선언적 애니메이션 구현","호버 및 탭 이벤트 등의 제스처 기반 상호 작용 개발","하드웨어 가속 렌더링을 사용한 애니메이션 성능 최적화"],"es":["Implementar animaciones declarativas simples como desvanecimiento, deslizamiento y escala","Desarrollar interacciones basadas en gestos como eventos de hover y tap","Optimizar el rendimiento de la animación con representación acelerada por hardware"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des animations déclaratives simples telles que le fondu, le défilement et la mise à l''échelle","Développer des interactions basées sur les gestes comme les événements de survol et de tap","Optimiser les performances d''animation avec un rendu accéléré par le matériel"],"de":["Einfache deklarative Animationen wie Fade, Slide und Scale implementieren","Gestenbasierte Interaktionen wie Hover- und Tap-Ereignisse entwickeln","Animationsleistung mit hardwarebeschleunigter Darstellung optimieren"],"pt":["Implementação de animações declarativas simples, como fade, slide e escala","Desenvolvimento de interações baseadas em gestos, como eventos de hover e toque","Otimização do desempenho da animação com renderização acelerada por hardware"],"ru":["Реализация простых декларативных анимаций, таких как затухание, скольжение и масштабирование","Разработка жестовых взаимодействий, таких как события наведения и касания","Оптимизация производительности анимации с помощью аппаратного ускорения"],"ar":["تنفيذ رسوم متحركة إعلانية بسيطة مثل التمويه والانزلاق والتوسيع","تطوير تفاعلات قائمة على الإشارات مثل أحداث التأشير واللمس","تحسين أداء الرسوم المتحركة باستخدام العرض المعزز بالأجهزة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Vue 3 or Nuxt environment","Limited to Motion Vue''s animation capabilities"],"zh":["需要 Vue 3 或 Nuxt 环境","仅限于 Motion Vue 的动画功能"],"ja":["Vue 3 または Nuxt 環境が必要","Motion Vue のアニメーション機能のみに限定"],"ko":["Vue 3 또는 Nuxt 환경이 필요","Motion Vue의 애니메이션 기능만으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere un entorno Vue 3 o Nuxt","Limitado a las capacidades de animación de Motion Vue"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Vue 3 ou Nuxt","Limité aux capacités d''animation de Motion Vue"],"de":["Benötigt eine Vue 3- oder Nuxt-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf die Animationsfunktionen von Motion Vue"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Vue 3 ou Nuxt","Limitado às capacidades de animação do Motion Vue"],"ru":["Требуется окружение Vue 3 или Nuxt","Ограничен возможностями анимации Motion Vue"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Vue 3 أو Nuxt","محدود بإمكانيات الرسوم المتحركة في Motion Vue"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Dknight203/AesopIDE/native-data-fetching', 'community', 'Dknight203', 'AesopIDE', 'Dknight203/AesopIDE', 'native-data-fetching', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.424Z', '2026-02-18T04:41:29.960Z', NULL, '{"id":"Dknight203/AesopIDE/native-data-fetching","name":"native-data-fetching","description":{"zh":"原生数据获取是 Expo Networking 中用于处理 API 请求、数据获取、缓存和网络调试的技能","ja":"ネイティブデータフェッチングは Expo Networking で API リクエスト、データ取得、キャッシュ、ネットワーク デバッグを行うスキルです","ko":"네이티브 데이터 가져오기는 Expo 네트워킹에서 API 요청, 데이터 가져오기, 캐싱, 네트워크 디버깅을 처리하는 스킬입니다","es":"Native Data Fetching es una habilidad para el trabajo de red en Expo, que incluye solicitudes de API, recuperación de datos y depuración de redes.","fr":"Native Data Fetching est une compétence pour le travail réseau dans Expo, qui comprend les requêtes API, la récupération de données et le débogage réseau.","de":"Native Data Fetching ist eine Fähigkeit für Netzwerkarbeit in Expo, die API-Anfragen, Datenabruf und Netzwerkinformationen umfasst.","pt":"A habilidade native-data-fetching é uma ferramenta essencial para qualquer trabalho de networking, incluindo requisições de API e extração de dados.","ru":"Навык native-data-fetching является необходимым инструментом для любой сетевой работы, включая запросы API и извлечение данных.","ar":"مهارة native-data-fetching هي أداة أساسية لأي عمل شبكي، بما في ذلك طلبات واجهة البرنامج واسترجاع البيانات.","en":"AesopIDE with Antigravity-inspired UI\""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"原生数据获取 - Expo Networking 必备技能","ja":"ネイティブデータフェッチング - Expo Networking 必須スキル","ko":"네이티브 데이터 가져오기 - Expo 네트워킹 필수 스킬","es":"Native Data Fetching: Recuperación de Datos Nativa","fr":"Native Data Fetching: Récupération de Données Native","de":"Native Data Fetching: Native Datenabruf","pt":"native-data-fetching: Ferramenta de Extração de Dados Nativa","ru":"native-data-fetching: Родная Загрузка Данных","ar":"native-data-fetching: أداة استرجاع البيانات الأصلية","en":"native-data-fetching"},"description":{"zh":"原生数据获取是 Expo Networking 中用于处理 API 请求、数据获取、缓存和网络调试的技能","ja":"ネイティブデータフェッチングは Expo Networking で API リクエスト、データ取得、キャッシュ、ネットワーク デバッグを行うスキルです","ko":"네이티브 데이터 가져오기는 Expo 네트워킹에서 API 요청, 데이터 가져오기, 캐싱, 네트워크 디버깅을 처리하는 스킬입니다","es":"Native Data Fetching es una habilidad para el trabajo de red en Expo, que incluye solicitudes de API, recuperación de datos y depuración de redes.","fr":"Native Data Fetching est une compétence pour le travail réseau dans Expo, qui comprend les requêtes API, la récupération de données et le débogage réseau.","de":"Native Data Fetching ist eine Fähigkeit für Netzwerkarbeit in Expo, die API-Anfragen, Datenabruf und Netzwerkinformationen umfasst.","pt":"A habilidade native-data-fetching é uma ferramenta essencial para qualquer trabalho de networking, incluindo requisições de API e extração de dados.","ru":"Навык native-data-fetching является необходимым инструментом для любой сетевой работы, включая запросы API и извлечение данных.","ar":"مهارة native-data-fetching هي أداة أساسية لأي عمل شبكي، بما في ذلك طلبات واجهة البرنامج واسترجاع البيانات.","en":"AesopIDE with Antigravity-inspired UI\""},"definition":{"en":"AesopIDE with Antigravity-inspired UI\""},"features":{"zh":["实现 API 请求","设置数据获取","调试网络失败","实现缓存策略","处理离线场景","身份验证/令牌管理"],"ja":["API リクエストの実装","データ取得の設定","ネットワーク エラーのデバッグ","キャッシュ戦略の実装","オフライン シナリオの処理","認証/トークン管理"],"ko":["API 요청 구현","데이터 가져오기 설정","네트워크 오류 디버깅","캐싱 전략 구현","오프라인 시나리오 처리","인증/토큰 관리"],"es":["Solicitudes de API","Recuperación de datos con React Query y SWR","Depuración de redes","Implementación de estrategias de caché","Gestión de autenticación y tokens"],"fr":["Requêtes API","Récupération de données avec React Query et SWR","Débogage réseau","Mise en œuvre de stratégies de cache","Gestion de l''authentification et des jetons"],"de":["API-Anfragen","Datenabruf mit React Query und SWR","Netzwerkinformationen","Implementierung von Cachestrategien","Authentifizierungs- und Tokenverwaltung"],"pt":["Requisições de API","Extração de dados","Depuração de rede","Implementação de estratégias de cache","Gerenciamento de autenticação e token"],"ru":["Запросы API","Извлечение данных","Отладка сети","Реализация стратегий кэширования","Управление аутентификацией и токенами"],"ar":["طلبات واجهة البرنامج","استرجاع البيانات","تصحيح الأخطاء الشبكية","تنفيذ استراتيجيات التخزين المؤقت","إدارة المصادقة والرمز"]},"keywords":{"zh":["原生数据获取","Expo Networking","API 请求","数据获取","缓存","网络调试","React Query","SWR"],"ja":["ネイティブデータフェッチング","Expo Networking","API リクエスト","データ取得","キャッシュ","ネットワーク デバッグ","React Query","SWR"],"ko":["네이티브 데이터 가져오기","Expo 네트워킹","API 요청","데이터 가져오기","캐싱","네트워크 디버깅","React Query","SWR"],"es":["Native Data Fetching","Expo","API","Recuperación de datos","Depuración de redes","React Query","SWR","Caché","Autenticación"],"fr":["Native Data Fetching","Expo","API","Récupération de données","Débogage réseau","React Query","SWR","Cache","Authentification"],"de":["Native Data Fetching","Expo","API","Datenabruf","Netzwerkinformationen","React Query","SWR","Cache","Authentifizierung"],"pt":["native-data-fetching","networking","requisições de API","extração de dados","depuração de rede","React Query","SWR"],"ru":["native-data-fetching","сетевое взаимодействие","запросы API","извлечение данных","отладка сети","React Query","SWR"],"ar":["native-data-fetching","شبكات الاتصال","طلبات واجهة البرنامج","استرجاع البيانات","تصحيح الأخطاء الشبكية","React Query","SWR"]}},"owner":"Dknight203","repo":"AesopIDE","repoPath":"Dknight203/AesopIDE","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.424Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"native-data-fetching","description":"Use when implementing or debugging ANY network request, API call, or data fetching. Covers fetch API, axios, React Query, SWR, error handling, caching strategies, offline support.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Expo Networking\n\n**You MUST use this skill for ANY networking work including API requests, data fetching, caching, or network debugging.**\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this router when:\n\n- Implementing API requests\n- Setting up data fetching (React Query, SWR)\n- Debugging network failures\n- Implementing caching strategies\n- Handling offline scenarios\n- Authentication/token management\n- Configuring API URLs and environment variables\n\n## Preferences\n\n- Avoid axios, prefer expo/fetch\n\n## Common Issues &","body":"# Expo Networking\n\n**You MUST use this skill for ANY networking work including API requests, data fetching, caching, or network debugging.**\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this router when:\n\n- Implementing API requests\n- Setting up data fetching (React Query, SWR)\n- Debugging network failures\n- Implementing caching strategies\n- Handling offline scenarios\n- Authentication/token management\n- Configuring API URLs and environment variables\n\n## Preferences\n\n- Avoid axios, prefer expo/fetch\n\n## Common Issues & Solutions\n\n### 1. Basic Fetch Usage\n\n**Simple GET request**:\n\n```tsx\nconst fetchUser = async (userId: string) => {\n  const response = await fetch(`https://api.example.com/users/${userId}`);\n\n  if (!response.ok) {\n    throw new Error(`HTTP error! status: ${response.status}`);\n  }\n\n  return response.json();\n};\n```\n\n**POST request with body**:\n\n```tsx\nconst createUser = async (userData: UserData) => {\n  const response = await fetch(\"https://api.example.com/users\", {\n    method: \"POST\",\n    headers: {\n      \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n      Authorization: `Bearer ${token}`,\n    },\n    body: JSON.stringify(userData),\n  });\n\n  if (!response.ok) {\n    const error = await response.json();\n    throw new Error(error.message);\n  }\n\n  return response.json();\n};\n```\n\n---\n\n### 2. React Query (TanStack Query)\n\n**Setup**:\n\n```tsx\n// app/_layout.tsx\nimport { QueryClient, QueryClientProvider } from \"@tanstack/react-query\";\n\nconst queryClient = new QueryClient({\n  defaultOptions: {\n    queries: {\n      staleTime: 1000 * 60 * 5, // 5 minutes\n      retry: 2,\n    },\n  },\n});\n\nexport default function RootLayout() {\n  return (\n    <QueryClientProvider client={queryClient}>\n      <Stack />\n    </QueryClientProvider>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n**Fetching data**:\n\n```tsx\nimport { useQuery } from \"@tanstack/react-query\";\n\nfunction UserProfile({ userId }: { userId: string }) {\n  const { data, isLoading, error, refetch } = useQuery({\n    queryKey: [\"user\", userId],\n    queryFn: () => fetchUser(userId),\n  });\n\n  if (isLoading) return <Loading />;\n  if (error) return <Error message={error.message} />;\n\n  return <Profile user={data} />;\n}\n```\n\n**Mutations**:\n\n```tsx\nimport { useMutation, useQueryClient } from \"@tanstack/react-query\";\n\nfunction CreateUserForm() {\n  const queryClient = useQueryClient();\n\n  const mutation = useMutation({\n    mutationFn: createUser,\n    onSuccess: () => {\n      // Invalidate and refetch\n      queryClient.invalidateQueries({ queryKey: [\"users\"] });\n    },\n  });\n\n  const handleSubmit = (data: UserData) => {\n    mutation.mutate(data);\n  };\n\n  return <Form onSubmit={handleSubmit} isLoading={mutation.isPending} />;\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### 3. Error Handling\n\n**Comprehensive error handling**:\n\n```tsx\nclass ApiError extends Error {\n  constructor(message: string, public status: number, public code?: string) {\n    super(message);\n    this.name = \"ApiError\";\n  }\n}\n\nconst fetchWithErrorHandling = async (url: string, options?: RequestInit) => {\n  try {\n    const response = await fetch(url, options);\n\n    if (!response.ok) {\n      const error = await response.json().catch(() => ({}));\n      throw new ApiError(\n        error.message || \"Request failed\",\n        response.status,\n        error.code\n      );\n    }\n\n    return response.json();\n  } catch (error) {\n    if (error instanceof ApiError) {\n      throw error;\n    }\n    // Network error (no internet, timeout, etc.)\n    throw new ApiError(\"Network error\", 0, \"NETWORK_ERROR\");\n  }\n};\n```\n\n**Retry logic**:\n\n```tsx\nconst fetchWithRetry = async (\n  url: string,\n  options?: RequestInit,\n  retries = 3\n) => {\n  for (let i = 0; i < retries; i++) {\n    try {\n      return await fetchWithErrorHandling(url, options);\n    } catch (error) {\n      if (i === retries - 1) throw error;\n      // Exponential backoff\n      await new Promise((r) => setTimeout(r, Math.pow(2, i) * 1000));\n    }\n  }\n};\n```\n\n---\n\n### 4. Authentication\n\n**Token management**:\n\n```tsx\nimport * as SecureStore from \"expo-secure-store\";\n\nconst TOKEN_KEY = \"auth_token\";\n\nexport const auth = {\n  getToken: () => SecureStore.getItemAsync(TOKEN_KEY),\n  setToken: (token: string) => SecureStore.setItemAsync(TOKEN_KEY, token),\n  removeToken: () => SecureStore.deleteItemAsync(TOKEN_KEY),\n};\n\n// Authenticated fetch wrapper\nconst authFetch = async (url: string, options: RequestInit = {}) => {\n  const token = await auth.getToken();\n\n  return fetch(url, {\n    ...options,\n    headers: {\n      ...options.headers,\n      Authorization: token ? `Bearer ${token}` : \"\",\n    },\n  });\n};\n```\n\n**Token refresh**:\n\n```tsx\nlet isRefreshing = false;\nlet refreshPromise: Promise<string> | null = null;\n\nconst getValidToken = async (): Promise<string> => {\n  const token = await auth.getToken();\n\n  if (!token || isTokenExpired(token)) {\n    if (!isRefreshing) {\n      isRefreshing = true;\n      refreshPromise = refreshToken().finally(() => {\n        isRefreshing = false;\n        refreshPromise = null;\n      });\n    }\n    return refreshPromise!;\n  }\n\n  return token;\n};\n```\n\n---\n\n### 5. Offline Support\n\n**Check network status**:\n\n```tsx\nimport NetInfo from \"@react-native-community/netinfo\";\n\n// Hook for network status\nfunction useNetworkStatus() {\n  const [isOnline, setIsOnline] = useState(true);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    return NetInfo.addEventListener((state) => {\n      setIsOnline(state.isConnected ?? true);\n    });\n  }, []);\n\n  return isOnline;\n}\n```\n\n**Offline-first with React Query**:\n\n```tsx\nimport { onlineManager } from \"@tanstack/react-query\";\nimport NetInfo from \"@react-native-community/netinfo\";\n\n// Sync React Query with network status\nonlineManager.setEventListener((setOnline) => {\n  return NetInfo.addEventListener((state) => {\n    setOnline(state.isConnected ?? true);\n  });\n});\n\n// Queries will pause when offline and resume when online\n```\n\n---\n\n### 6. Environment Variables\n\n**Using environment variables for API configuration**:\n\nExpo supports environment variables with the `EXPO_PUBLIC_` prefix. These are inlined at build time and available in your JavaScript code.\n\n```tsx\n// .env\nEXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.example.com\nEXPO_PUBLIC_API_VERSION=v1\n\n// Usage in code\nconst API_URL = process.env.EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL;\n\nconst fetchUsers = async () => {\n  const response = await fetch(`${API_URL}/users`);\n  return response.json();\n};\n```\n\n**Environment-specific configuration**:\n\n```tsx\n// .env.development\nEXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:3000\n\n// .env.production\nEXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.production.com\n```\n\n**Creating an API client with environment config**:\n\n```tsx\n// api/client.ts\nconst BASE_URL = process.env.EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL;\n\nif (!BASE_URL) {\n  throw new Error(\"EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL is not defined\");\n}\n\nexport const apiClient = {\n  get: async <T,>(path: string): Promise<T> => {\n    const response = await fetch(`${BASE_URL}${path}`);\n    if (!response.ok) throw new Error(`HTTP ${response.status}`);\n    return response.json();\n  },\n\n  post: async <T,>(path: string, body: unknown): Promise<T> => {\n    const response = await fetch(`${BASE_URL}${path}`, {\n      method: \"POST\",\n      headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n      body: JSON.stringify(body),\n    });\n    if (!response.ok) throw new Error(`HTTP ${response.status}`);\n    return response.json();\n  },\n};\n```\n\n**Important notes**:\n\n- Only variables prefixed with `EXPO_PUBLIC_` are exposed to the client bundle\n- Never put secrets (API keys with write access, database passwords) in `EXPO_PUBLIC_` variables—they''re visible in the built app\n- Environment variables are inlined at **build time**, not runtime\n- Restart the dev server after changing `.env` files\n- For server-side secrets in API routes, use variables without the `EXPO_PUBLIC_` prefix\n\n**TypeScript support**:\n\n```tsx\n// types/env.d.ts\ndeclare global {\n  namespace NodeJS {\n    interface ProcessEnv {\n      EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL: string;\n      EXPO_PUBLIC_API_VERSION?: string;\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nexport {};\n```\n\n---\n\n### 7. Request Cancellation\n\n**Cancel on unmount**:\n\n```tsx\nuseEffect(() => {\n  const controller = new AbortController();\n\n  fetch(url, { signal: controller.signal })\n    .then((response) => response.json())\n    .then(setData)\n    .catch((error) => {\n      if (error.name !== \"AbortError\") {\n        setError(error);\n      }\n    });\n\n  return () => controller.abort();\n}, [url]);\n```\n\n**With React Query** (automatic):\n\n```tsx\n// React Query automatically cancels requests when queries are invalidated\n// or components unmount\n```\n\n---\n\n## Decision Tree\n\n```\nUser asks about networking\n  |-- Basic fetch?\n  |   \\-- Use fetch API with error handling\n  |\n  |-- Need caching/state management?\n  |   |-- Complex app -> React Query (TanStack Query)\n  |   \\-- Simpler needs -> SWR or custom hooks\n  |\n  |-- Authentication?\n  |   |-- Token storage -> expo-secure-store\n  |   \\-- Token refresh -> Implement refresh flow\n  |\n  |-- Error handling?\n  |   |-- Network errors -> Check connectivity first\n  |   |-- HTTP errors -> Parse response, throw typed errors\n  |   \\-- Retries -> Exponential backoff\n  |\n  |-- Offline support?\n  |   |-- Check status -> NetInfo\n  |   \\-- Queue requests -> React Query persistence\n  |\n  |-- Environment/API config?\n  |   |-- Client-side URLs -> EXPO_PUBLIC_ prefix in .env\n  |   |-- Server secrets -> Non-prefixed env vars (API routes only)\n  |   \\-- Multiple environments -> .env.development, .env.production\n  |\n  \\-- Performance?\n      |-- Caching -> React Query with staleTime\n      |-- Deduplication -> React Query handles this\n      \\-- Cancellation -> AbortController or React Query\n```\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n**Wrong: No error handling**\n\n```tsx\nconst data = await fetch(url).then((r) => r.json());\n```\n\n**Right: Check response status**\n\n```tsx\nconst response = await fetch(url);\nif (!response.ok) throw new Error(`HTTP ${response.status}`);\nconst data = await response.json();\n```\n\n**Wrong: Storing tokens in AsyncStorage**\n\n```tsx\nawait AsyncStorage.setItem(\"token\", token); // Not secure!\n```\n\n**Right: Use SecureStore for sensitive data**\n\n```tsx\nawait SecureStore.setItemAsync(\"token\", token);\n```\n\n## Example Invocations\n\nUser: \"How do I make API calls in React Native?\"\n-> Use fetch, wrap with error handling\n\nUser: \"Should I use React Query or SWR?\"\n-> React Query for complex apps, SWR for simpler needs\n\nUser: \"My app needs to work offline\"\n-> Use NetInfo for status, React Query persistence for caching\n\nUser: \"How do I handle authentication tokens?\"\n-> Store in expo-secure-store, implement refresh flow\n\nUser: \"API calls are slow\"\n-> Check caching strategy, use React Query staleTime\n\nUser: \"How do I configure different API URLs for dev and prod?\"\n-> Use EXPO*PUBLIC* env vars with .env.development and .env.production files\n\nUser: \"Where should I put my API key?\"\n-> Client-safe keys: EXPO*PUBLIC* in .env. Secret keys: non-prefixed env vars in API routes only\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:41:29.960Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Full Stack Agents requiring seamless native data fetching and caching capabilities","zh":"适用于需要无缝原生数据获取和缓存能力的全栈代理","ja":"シームレスなネイティブデータフェッチとキャッシュ機能を必要とするフルスタックエージェントに適しています","ko":"무료로 네이티브 데이터 가져오기 및 캐싱 기능이 필요한 풀스택 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para Agentes de pila completa que requieren una obtención y almacenamiento en caché de datos nativos sin problemas","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Full Stack nécessitant une récupération et un mise en cache de données natifs sans interruption","de":"Ideal für Full-Stack-Agents, die eine nahtlose, native Datenabfrage und Cachefähigkeiten erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Full Stack que exigem busca e cache de dados nativos sem interrupções","ru":"Идеально для полнофункциональных агентов, требующих бесшовной загрузки и кэширования родных данных","ar":"مثالي لعميل الويب الكامل الذي يتطلب استرجاع بيانات أصلي سلس وخصائص ذاكرة التخزين المؤقت"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to handle API requests, implement data fetching with React Query or SWR, and configure caching strategies using expo/fetch, while avoiding axios for optimized performance and reliability","zh":"赋予代理处理API请求、使用React Query或SWR实现数据获取，并使用expo/fetch配置缓存策略，同时避免使用axios以优化性能和可靠性","ja":"エージェントがAPIリクエストを処理し、React QueryまたはSWRを使用してデータフェッチを実装し、expo/fetchを使用してキャッシュ戦略を構成することを可能にし、パフォーマンスと信頼性を最適化するためにaxiosを避ける","ko":"에이전트가 API 요청을 처리하고 React Query 또는 SWR을 사용하여 데이터 가져오기를 구현하며 expo/fetch를 사용하여 캐싱 전략을 구성하고 성능 및 신뢰성을 최적화하기 위해 axios를 피함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a manejar solicitudes de API, implementar la obtención de datos con React Query o SWR y configurar estrategias de caching utilizando expo/fetch, evitando axios para un rendimiento y confiabilidad optimizados","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les requêtes API, de mettre en œuvre la récupération de données avec React Query ou SWR et de configurer les stratégies de mise en cache en utilisant expo/fetch, tout en évitant axios pour des performances et une fiabilité optimisées","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, API-Anfragen zu verarbeiten, Datenabfragen mit React Query oder SWR zu implementieren und Caching-Strategien mit expo/fetch zu konfigurieren, während axios für optimierte Leistung und Zuverlässigkeit vermieden wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a lidar com solicitações de API, implementar busca de dados com React Query ou SWR e configurar estratégias de cache usando expo/fetch, evitando axios para desempenho e confiabilidade otimizados","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обрабатывать запросы API, реализовывать загрузку данных с помощью React Query или SWR и настраивать стратегии кэширования с использованием expo/fetch, избегая axios для оптимизированной производительности и надежности","ar":"يُمكن العميل من التعامل مع طلبات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات وتطبيق استرجاع البيانات باستخدام React Query أو SWR وتكوين استراتيجيات الذاكرة المؤقتة باستخدام expo/fetch، مع تجنب axios لتحقيق أداء وموثوقية محسّنة"},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing API requests with expo/fetch for secure data transfer","Debugging network failures and handling offline scenarios","Configuring API URLs and environment variables for dynamic data fetching"],"zh":["使用expo/fetch实现安全的数据传输","调试网络故障和处理离线场景","配置API URL和环境变量以实现动态数据获取"],"ja":["expo/fetchを使用したセキュアなデータ転送の実現","ネットワーク障害のデバッグとオフラインシナリオの処理","API URLと環境変数の構成による動的データ取得の実現"],"ko":["expo/fetch를 사용한 보안 데이터 전송 구현","네트워크 오류 디버깅 및 오프라인 시나리오 처리","API URL 및 환경 변수 구성에 의한 동적 데이터 가져오기 구현"],"es":["Implementar solicitudes de API con expo/fetch para una transferencia de datos segura","Depurar fallos de red y manejar escenarios de desconexión","Configurar URLs de API y variables de entorno para la obtención dinámica de datos"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des requêtes API avec expo/fetch pour un transfert de données sécurisé","Déboguer les défaillances du réseau et gérer les scénarios de déconnexion","Configurer les URL API et les variables d''environnement pour une récupération de données dynamique"],"de":["Implementieren von API-Anfragen mit expo/fetch für einen sicheren Datentransfer","Fehler in der Netzwerkverbindung debuggen und Offline-Szenarien verwalten","Konfigurieren von API-URLs und Umgebungsvariablen für die dynamische Datenabfrage"],"pt":["Implementação de solicitações de API com expo/fetch para transferência de dados segura","Depuração de falhas de rede e tratamento de cenários offline","Configuração de URLs de API e variáveis de ambiente para busca de dados dinâmica"],"ru":["Реализация запросов API с помощью expo/fetch для безопасной передачи данных","Отладка сбоев сети и обработка офлайн-сценариев","Настройка URL-адресов API и переменных среды для динамической загрузки данных"],"ar":["تنفيذ طلبات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات باستخدام expo/fetch لنقل البيانات الآمن","تصحيح أعطال الشبكة ومعالجة السيناريوهات دون اتصال","تكوين عناوين Url لواجهة برمجة التطبيقات ومتغيرات البيئة لاسترجاع البيانات الديناميكي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Expo Networking setup","Prefer expo/fetch over axios for data fetching"],"zh":["需要Expo Networking设置","数据获取时 предпочитать expo/fetch 而非 axios"],"ja":["Expo Networkingの設定が必要","データフェッチ時にaxiosよりもexpo/fetchを優先する"],"ko":["Expo Networking 설정이 필요","데이터 가져오기 시 axios보다 expo/fetch를 우선"],"es":["Requiere la configuración de Expo Networking","Preferir expo/fetch sobre axios para la obtención de datos"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration de Expo Networking","Préférer expo/fetch à axios pour la récupération de données"],"de":["Benötigt die Einrichtung von Expo Networking","Bevorzugen von expo/fetch gegenüber axios für die Datenabfrage"],"pt":["Exige configuração da Rede do Expo","Prefira expo/fetch em vez de axios para busca de dados"],"ru":["Требует настройки сети Expo","Предпочитайте expo/fetch вместо axios для загрузки данных"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد شبكة Expo","افضل استخدام expo/fetch بدلاً من axios لاسترجاع البيانات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
