ative（iOS/Android）和打包优化","ja":"React Native 最適化ベストプラクティスガイド。JavaScript、React、ネイティブ（iOS/Android）およびバンドル化の最適化を網羅","ko":"리액트 네이티브 최적화 베스트 프랙티스 가이드, 자바스크립트, 리액트, 네이티브(ios/안드로이드) 및 번들 최적화 포함","es":"Guía de optimización de rendimiento para aplicaciones React Native, cubriendo JavaScript/React, Nativo (iOS/Android) y optimizaciones de empaquetado.","fr":"Guide d''optimisation des performances pour les applications React Native, couvrant JavaScript/React, Natif (iOS/Android) et optimisations de bundle.","de":"Leitfaden zur Leistungsoptimierung für React-Native-Anwendungen, der JavaScript/React, Native (iOS/Android) und Bundling-Optimierungen abdeckt.","pt":"Guia de otimização de desempenho para aplicações React Native, abordando JavaScript, React e otimizações nativas.","ru":"Руководство по оптимизации производительности для приложений React Native, охватывающее JavaScript, React и нативные оптимизации.","ar":"دليل لتحسين الأداء لتطبيقات رياكت نيتيف، يشمل جافاسكريبت ورياكت والتحسينات الأصلية.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["JavaScript 优化","Native 优化","打包优化","性能指标","代码优化"],"ja":["JavaScript 最適化","ネイティブ最適化","バンドル化最適化","パフォーマンスメトリクス","コード最適化"],"ko":["자바스크립트 최적화","네이티브 최적화","번들 최적화","성능 측정","코드 최적화"],"es":["Optimización de JavaScript y React","Optimización de código nativo para iOS y Android","Optimización de empaquetado y reducción de tamaño","Mejora del rendimiento de la aplicación","Guía de patrones y comandos rápidos"],"fr":["Optimisation de JavaScript et React","Optimisation de code natif pour iOS et Android","Optimisation de bundle et réduction de taille","Amélioration des performances de l''application","Guide de modèles et de commandes rapides"],"de":["Optimierung von JavaScript und React","Optimierung von Native-Code für iOS und Android","Optimierung von Bundling und Größenreduzierung","Verbesserung der Leistung der Anwendung","Leitfaden für Muster und schnelle Befehle"],"pt":["Otimização de desempenho para React Native","Melhores práticas de JavaScript e React","Otimizações nativas para iOS e Android","Guia de referência rápida para padrões e comandos","Baseado no guia definitivo de otimização da Callstack"],"ru":["Оптимизация производительности для React Native","Лучшие практики JavaScript и React","Нативные оптимизации для iOS и Android","Быстрое руководство по шаблонам и командам","Основано на окончательном руководстве по оптимизации от Callstack"],"ar":["تحسين الأداء لتطبيقات رياكت نيتيف","أفضل الممارسات لجافاسكريبت ورياكت","التحسينات الأصلية لنظامي التشغيل آي أو إس وأندرويد","دليل سريع لنمط وامر","مبني على دليل التحسين النهائي من كولستاك"]},"keywords":{"zh":["React Native 优化","JavaScript 优化","Native 优化","打包优化","性能优化","代码优化"],"ja":["React Native 最適化","JavaScript 最適化","ネイティブ最適化","バンドル化最適化","パフォーマンス最適化","コード最適化"],"ko":["리액트 네이티브 최적화","자바스크립트 최적화","네이티브 최적화","번들 최적화","성능 최적화","코드 최적화"],"es":["React Native","optimización de rendimiento","mejores prácticas","desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles","JavaScript","React","iOS","Android","bundling"],"fr":["React Native","optimisation des performances","bonnes pratiques","développement d''applications mobiles","JavaScript","React","iOS","Android","bundle"],"de":["React Native","Leistungsoptimierung","Best Practices","Entwicklung von mobilen Anwendungen","JavaScript","React","iOS","Android","Bundling"],"pt":["React Native","Otimização de desempenho","Melhores práticas","JavaScript","React","Nativas","iOS","Android","Desenvolvimento de aplicativos"],"ru":["React Native","Оптимизация производительности","Лучшие практики","JavaScript","React","Нативные","iOS","Android","Разработка приложений"],"ar":["رياكت نيتيف","تحسين الأداء","أفضل الممارسات","جافاسكريبت","رياكت","الأصلي","آي أو إس","أندرويد","تطوير التطبيقات"]}},"owner":"KorSoftwareSolutions","repo":"ui","repoPath":"KorSoftwareSolutions/ui","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.424Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"react-native-best-practices","description":"Provides React Native performance optimization guidelines for FPS, TTI, bundle size, memory leaks, re-renders, and animations. Applies to tasks involving Hermes optimization, JS thread blocking, bridge overhead, FlashList, native modules, or debugging jank and frame drops.","tags":"react-native, expo, performance, optimization, profiling","bodyPreview":"# React Native Best Practices\n\n## Overview\n\nPerformance optimization guide for React Native applications, covering JavaScript/React, Native (iOS/Android), and bundling optimizations. Based on Callstack''s \"Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization\".\n\n## Skill Format\n\nEach reference file follows a hybrid format for fast lookup and deep understanding:\n\n- **Quick Pattern**: Incorrect/Correct code snippets for immediate pattern matching\n- **Quick Command**: Shell commands for process/measurement sk","body":"# React Native Best Practices\n\n## Overview\n\nPerformance optimization guide for React Native applications, covering JavaScript/React, Native (iOS/Android), and bundling optimizations. Based on Callstack''s \"Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization\".\n\n## Skill Format\n\nEach reference file follows a hybrid format for fast lookup and deep understanding:\n\n- **Quick Pattern**: Incorrect/Correct code snippets for immediate pattern matching\n- **Quick Command**: Shell commands for process/measurement skills\n- **Quick Config**: Configuration snippets for setup-focused skills\n- **Quick Reference**: Summary tables for conceptual skills\n- **Deep Dive**: Full context with When to Use, Prerequisites, Step-by-Step, Common Pitfalls\n\n**Impact ratings**: CRITICAL (fix immediately), HIGH (significant improvement), MEDIUM (worthwhile optimization)\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Debugging slow/janky UI or animations\n- Investigating memory leaks (JS or native)\n- Optimizing app startup time (TTI)\n- Reducing bundle or app size\n- Writing native modules (Turbo Modules)\n- Profiling React Native performance\n- Reviewing React Native code for performance\n\n## Priority-Ordered Guidelines\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | FPS & Re-renders | CRITICAL | `js-*` |\n| 2 | Bundle Size | CRITICAL | `bundle-*` |\n| 3 | TTI Optimization | HIGH | `native-*`, `bundle-*` |\n| 4 | Native Performance | HIGH | `native-*` |\n| 5 | Memory Management | MEDIUM-HIGH | `js-*`, `native-*` |\n| 6 | Animations | MEDIUM | `js-*` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Critical: FPS & Re-renders\n\n**Profile first:**\n```bash\n# Open React Native DevTools\n# Press ''j'' in Metro, or shake device → \"Open DevTools\"\n```\n\n**Common fixes:**\n- Replace ScrollView with FlatList/FlashList for lists\n- Use React Compiler for automatic memoization\n- Use atomic state (Jotai/Zustand) to reduce re-renders\n- Use `useDeferredValue` for expensive computations\n\n### Critical: Bundle Size\n\n**Analyze bundle:**\n```bash\nnpx react-native bundle \\\n  --entry-file index.js \\\n  --bundle-output output.js \\\n  --platform ios \\\n  --sourcemap-output output.js.map \\\n  --dev false --minify true\n\nnpx source-map-explorer output.js --no-border-checks\n```\n\n**Common fixes:**\n- Avoid barrel imports (import directly from source)\n- Remove unnecessary Intl polyfills (Hermes has native support)\n- Enable tree shaking (Expo SDK 52+ or Re.Pack)\n- Enable R8 for Android native code shrinking\n\n### High: TTI Optimization\n\n**Measure TTI:**\n- Use `react-native-performance` for markers\n- Only measure cold starts (exclude warm/hot/prewarm)\n\n**Common fixes:**\n- Disable JS bundle compression on Android (enables Hermes mmap)\n- Use native navigation (react-native-screens)\n- Defer non-critical work with `InteractionManager`\n\n### High: Native Performance\n\n**Profile native:**\n- iOS: Xcode Instruments → Time Profiler\n- Android: Android Studio → CPU Profiler\n\n**Common fixes:**\n- Use background threads for heavy native work\n- Prefer async over sync Turbo Module methods\n- Use C++ for cross-platform performance-critical code\n\n## References\n\nFull documentation with code examples in `references/`:\n\n### JavaScript/React (`js-*`)\n\n| File | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| `js-lists-flatlist-flashlist.md` | CRITICAL | Replace ScrollView with virtualized lists |\n| `js-profile-react.md` | MEDIUM | React DevTools profiling |\n| `js-measure-fps.md` | HIGH | FPS monitoring and measurement |\n| `js-memory-leaks.md` | MEDIUM | JS memory leak hunting |\n| `js-atomic-state.md` | HIGH | Jotai/Zustand patterns |\n| `js-concurrent-react.md` | HIGH | useDeferredValue, useTransition |\n| `js-react-compiler.md` | HIGH | Automatic memoization |\n| `js-animations-reanimated.md` | MEDIUM | Reanimated worklets |\n| `js-uncontrolled-components.md` | HIGH | TextInput optimization |\n\n### Native (`native-*`)\n\n| File | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| `native-turbo-modules.md` | HIGH | Building fast native modules |\n| `native-sdks-over-polyfills.md` | HIGH | Native vs JS libraries |\n| `native-measure-tti.md` | HIGH | TTI measurement setup |\n| `native-threading-model.md` | HIGH | Turbo Module threads |\n| `native-profiling.md` | MEDIUM | Xcode/Android Studio profiling |\n| `native-platform-setup.md` | MEDIUM | iOS/Android tooling guide |\n| `native-view-flattening.md` | MEDIUM | View hierarchy debugging |\n| `native-memory-patterns.md` | MEDIUM | C++/Swift/Kotlin memory |\n| `native-memory-leaks.md` | MEDIUM | Native memory leak hunting |\n| `native-android-16kb-alignment.md` | CRITICAL | Third-party library alignment for Google Play |\n\n### Bundling (`bundle-*`)\n\n| File | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| `bundle-barrel-exports.md` | CRITICAL | Avoid barrel imports |\n| `bundle-analyze-js.md` | CRITICAL | JS bundle visualization |\n| `bundle-tree-shaking.md` | HIGH | Dead code elimination |\n| `bundle-analyze-app.md` | HIGH | App size analysis |\n| `bundle-r8-android.md` | HIGH | Android code shrinking |\n| `bundle-hermes-mmap.md` | HIGH | Disable bundle compression |\n| `bundle-native-assets.md` | HIGH | Asset catalog setup |\n| `bundle-library-size.md` | MEDIUM | Evaluate dependencies |\n| `bundle-code-splitting.md` | MEDIUM | Re.Pack code splitting |\n\n## Searching References\n\n```bash\n# Find patterns by keyword\ngrep -l \"reanimated\" references/\ngrep -l \"flatlist\" references/\ngrep -l \"memory\" references/\ngrep -l \"profil\" references/\ngrep -l \"tti\" references/\ngrep -l \"bundle\" references/\n```\n\n## Problem → Skill Mapping\n\n| Problem | Start With |\n|---------|------------|\n| App feels slow/janky | `js-measure-fps.md` → `js-profile-react.md` |\n| Too many re-renders | `js-profile-react.md` → `js-react-compiler.md` |\n| Slow startup (TTI) | `native-measure-tti.md` → `bundle-analyze-js.md` |\n| Large app size | `bundle-analyze-app.md` → `bundle-r8-android.md` |\n| Memory growing | `js-memory-leaks.md` or `native-memory-leaks.md` |\n| Animation drops frames | `js-animations-reanimated.md` |\n| List scroll jank | `js-lists-flatlist-flashlist.md` |\n| TextInput lag | `js-uncontrolled-components.md` |\n| Native module slow | `native-turbo-modules.md` → `native-threading-model.md` |\n| Native library alignment issue | `native-android-16kb-alignment.md` |\n\n## Attribution\n\nBased on \"The Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization\" by Callstack.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:42:05.536Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Mobile Development Agents needing advanced React Native performance optimization techniques.","zh":"适合需要高级 React Native 性能优化技术的移动开发代理。","ja":"高度な React Native パフォーマンス最適化テクニックを必要とするモバイル開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 React Native 성능 최적화 기술이 필요한 모바일 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo móvil que necesitan técnicas avanzadas de optimización de rendimiento de React Native.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement mobile ayant besoin de techniques avancées d''optimisation des performances de React Native.","de":"Perfekt für Mobile-Development-Agents, die fortgeschrittene Techniken zur Leistungsverbesserung von React Native benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Móvel que precisam de técnicas avançadas de otimização de desempenho do React Native.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов мобильной разработки, которым необходимы продвинутые техники оптимизации производительности React Native.","ar":"مثالي لعمال التطوير المحمول الذين يحتاجون إلى تقنيات متقدمة لتحسين أداء React Native."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize React Native applications using JavaScript and Native module optimizations, covering bundling and performance enhancements with tools like Callstack''s Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization, enabling improved iOS and Android app performance.","zh":"赋予代理优化使用 JavaScript 和本地模块优化的 React Native 应用程序的能力，涵盖捆绑和性能增强，使用类似 Callstack 的 React Native 优化终极指南的工具，从而提高 iOS 和 Android 应用程序的性能。","ja":"JavaScript とネイティブモジュールの最適化を使用した React Native アプリケーションの最適化をエージェントに可能にすることで、バンドルとパフォーマンスの強化をカバーし、Callstack の React Native 最適化の究極のガイドなどのツールを使用して、iOS と Android アプリのパフォーマンスを向上させる。","ko":"자바스크립트와 네이티브 모듈 최적화를 사용하여 React Native 애플리케이션을 최적화할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화하여, 번들링과 성능 강화를 포함하며 Callstack의 React Native 최적화 종합 가이드와 같은 도구를 사용하여 iOS 및 Android 앱의 성능을 향상시킵니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a optimizar aplicaciones de React Native utilizando optimizaciones de JavaScript y módulos nativos, cubriendo la agrupación y las mejoras de rendimiento con herramientas como la Guía definitiva para la optimización de React Native de Callstack, lo que permite una mejor experiencia en aplicaciones de iOS y Android.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les applications React Native en utilisant des optimisations JavaScript et des modules natifs, couvrant le regroupement et les améliorations des performances avec des outils tels que le Guide ultime pour l''optimisation de React Native de Callstack, permettant ainsi une meilleure expérience dans les applications iOS et Android.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, React-Native-Anwendungen zu optimieren, indem JavaScript- und Native-Modul-Optimierungen verwendet werden, einschließlich der Bundling und Leistungsverbesserungen mit Tools wie dem ultimativen Leitfaden zur Optimierung von React Native von Callstack, wodurch eine verbesserte Leistung von iOS- und Android-Apps ermöglicht wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar aplicativos React Native usando otimizações de JavaScript e módulos nativos, abrangendo empacotamento e melhorias de desempenho com ferramentas como o Guia Definitivo para Otimização do React Native da Callstack, permitindo uma melhoria no desempenho dos aplicativos iOS e Android.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать приложения React Native с помощью оптимизаций JavaScript и родных модулей, охватывая упаковку и улучшения производительности с помощью инструментов, таких как Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization от Callstack, позволяя улучшить производительность приложений iOS и Android.","ar":"تمكين العمال من تحسين تطبيقات React Native باستخدام تحسينات JavaScript ووحدات الأصلية، تشمل تخزين وتحسينات الأداء باستخدام أدوات مثل دليل التحسين النهائي لتطبيقات React Native من Callstack، مما يتيح تحسين أداء تطبيقات iOS و Android."},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing React Native app performance for iOS and Android","Generating optimized JavaScript code snippets","Debugging Native module issues"],"zh":["为 iOS 和 Android 优化 React Native 应用程序性能","生成优化的 JavaScript 代码片段","调试本地模块问题"],"ja":["iOS と Android 用の React Native アプリケーションのパフォーマンスを最適化する","最適化された JavaScript コードスニペットを生成する","ネイティブモジュールの問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["iOS 및 Android 용 React Native 애플리케이션 성능 최적화","최적화된 자바스크립트 코드 조각 생성","네이티브 모듈 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Optimizar el rendimiento de aplicaciones de React Native para iOS y Android","Generar fragmentos de código JavaScript optimizados","Depurar problemas de módulos nativos"],"fr":["Optimiser les performances des applications React Native pour iOS et Android","Générer des extraits de code JavaScript optimisés","Déboguer les problèmes de modules natifs"],"de":["Optimieren der Leistung von React-Native-Anwendungen für iOS und Android","Generieren optimierter JavaScript-Code-Snippets","Debuggen von Problemen mit nativen Modulen"],"pt":["Otimizar o desempenho do aplicativo React Native para iOS e Android","Gerar trechos de código JavaScript otimizados","Depurar problemas de módulos nativos"],"ru":["Оптимизировать производительность приложения React Native для iOS и Android","Генерировать оптимизированные фрагменты кода JavaScript","Отлаживать проблемы родных модулей"],"ar":["تحسين أداء تطبيقات React Native على أجهزة iOS و Android","генерировать شفرات JavaScript المثالية","تصحيح أخطاء الوحدات الأصلية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of React and Native development","Limited to React Native applications"],"zh":["需要 React 和本地开发知识","仅限 React Native 应用程序"],"ja":["React とネイティブ開発の知識が必要","React Native アプリケーションに限定される"],"ko":["React 및 네이티브 개발 지식 필요","React Native 애플리케이션에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de React y desarrollo nativo","Limitado a aplicaciones de React Native"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en React et en développement natif","Limité aux applications React Native"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von React und Native-Entwicklung","Begrenzt auf React-Native-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de React e desenvolvimento nativo","Limitado a aplicativos React Native"],"ru":["Требует знания React и родной разработки","Ограничен приложениями React Native"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة React والتنمية الأصلية","محدود لتطبيقات React Native"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
