ização de JavaScript e React","Otimização de desempenho para iOS e Android","Técnicas de bundling para melhorar o carregamento","Padrões de código para desenvolvimento eficiente","Ferramentas de medição para avaliar o desempenho"],"ru":["Оптимизация JavaScript и React","Оптимизация производительности для iOS и Android","Техники бандлинга для улучшения загрузки","Шаблоны кода для эффективной разработки","Инструменты измерения для оценки производительности"],"ar":["تحسين جافاسكريبت وري액ت","تحسين أداء الأجهزة لآي أو إس وأندرويد","تقنيات باكينج لتحسين التحميل","أنماط الكود للتنمية الفعالة","أدوات القياس لتقييم الأداء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["React Native 优化","JavaScript 优化","Native 优化","打包优化","性能监测","代码优化","React Native 最佳实践"],"ja":["React Native 最適化","JavaScript 最適化","ネイティブ最適化","バンドル最適化","パフォーマンス監視","コード最適化","React Native ベストプラクティス"],"ko":["React Native 최적화","JavaScript 최적화","네이티브 최적화","번들 최적화","성능 모니터링","코드 최적화","React Native 베스트 프랙티스"],"es":["React Native","optimización de rendimiento","mejores prácticas","JavaScript","React","Native","iOS","Android","empaquetado"],"fr":["React Native","optimisation des performances","bonnes pratiques","JavaScript","React","Native","iOS","Android","bundle"],"de":["React Native","Leistungsoptimierung","Best Practices","JavaScript","React","Native","iOS","Android","Bundling"],"pt":["React Native","Otimização de desempenho","JavaScript","React","Desenvolvimento móvel","Bundling","Medição de desempenho"],"ru":["React Native","Оптимизация производительности","JavaScript","React","Мобильная разработка","Бандлинг","Измерение производительности"],"ar":["ري액ت نيتيف","تحسين الأداء","جافاسكريبت","ري액ت","تنمية الهاتف المحمول","باكينج","قياس الأداء"]}},"owner":"Dknight203","repo":"AesopIDE","repoPath":"Dknight203/AesopIDE","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.424Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"react-native-best-practices","description":"Provides React Native performance optimization guidelines for FPS, TTI, bundle size, memory leaks, re-renders, and animations. Applies to tasks involving Hermes optimization, JS thread blocking, bridge overhead, FlashList, native modules, or debugging jank and frame drops.","tags":"react-native, expo, performance, optimization, profiling","bodyPreview":"# React Native Best Practices\n\n## Overview\n\nPerformance optimization guide for React Native applications, covering JavaScript/React, Native (iOS/Android), and bundling optimizations. Based on Callstack''s \"Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization\".\n\n## Skill Format\n\nEach reference file follows a hybrid format for fast lookup and deep understanding:\n\n- **Quick Pattern**: Incorrect/Correct code snippets for immediate pattern matching\n- **Quick Command**: Shell commands for process/measurement sk","body":"# React Native Best Practices\n\n## Overview\n\nPerformance optimization guide for React Native applications, covering JavaScript/React, Native (iOS/Android), and bundling optimizations. Based on Callstack''s \"Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization\".\n\n## Skill Format\n\nEach reference file follows a hybrid format for fast lookup and deep understanding:\n\n- **Quick Pattern**: Incorrect/Correct code snippets for immediate pattern matching\n- **Quick Command**: Shell commands for process/measurement skills\n- **Quick Config**: Configuration snippets for setup-focused skills\n- **Quick Reference**: Summary tables for conceptual skills\n- **Deep Dive**: Full context with When to Use, Prerequisites, Step-by-Step, Common Pitfalls\n\n**Impact ratings**: CRITICAL (fix immediately), HIGH (significant improvement), MEDIUM (worthwhile optimization)\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Debugging slow/janky UI or animations\n- Investigating memory leaks (JS or native)\n- Optimizing app startup time (TTI)\n- Reducing bundle or app size\n- Writing native modules (Turbo Modules)\n- Profiling React Native performance\n- Reviewing React Native code for performance\n\n## Priority-Ordered Guidelines\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | FPS & Re-renders | CRITICAL | `js-*` |\n| 2 | Bundle Size | CRITICAL | `bundle-*` |\n| 3 | TTI Optimization | HIGH | `native-*`, `bundle-*` |\n| 4 | Native Performance | HIGH | `native-*` |\n| 5 | Memory Management | MEDIUM-HIGH | `js-*`, `native-*` |\n| 6 | Animations | MEDIUM | `js-*` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Critical: FPS & Re-renders\n\n**Profile first:**\n```bash\n# Open React Native DevTools\n# Press ''j'' in Metro, or shake device → \"Open DevTools\"\n```\n\n**Common fixes:**\n- Replace ScrollView with FlatList/FlashList for lists\n- Use React Compiler for automatic memoization\n- Use atomic state (Jotai/Zustand) to reduce re-renders\n- Use `useDeferredValue` for expensive computations\n\n### Critical: Bundle Size\n\n**Analyze bundle:**\n```bash\nnpx react-native bundle \\\n  --entry-file index.js \\\n  --bundle-output output.js \\\n  --platform ios \\\n  --sourcemap-output output.js.map \\\n  --dev false --minify true\n\nnpx source-map-explorer output.js --no-border-checks\n```\n\n**Common fixes:**\n- Avoid barrel imports (import directly from source)\n- Remove unnecessary Intl polyfills (Hermes has native support)\n- Enable tree shaking (Expo SDK 52+ or Re.Pack)\n- Enable R8 for Android native code shrinking\n\n### High: TTI Optimization\n\n**Measure TTI:**\n- Use `react-native-performance` for markers\n- Only measure cold starts (exclude warm/hot/prewarm)\n\n**Common fixes:**\n- Disable JS bundle compression on Android (enables Hermes mmap)\n- Use native navigation (react-native-screens)\n- Defer non-critical work with `InteractionManager`\n\n### High: Native Performance\n\n**Profile native:**\n- iOS: Xcode Instruments → Time Profiler\n- Android: Android Studio → CPU Profiler\n\n**Common fixes:**\n- Use background threads for heavy native work\n- Prefer async over sync Turbo Module methods\n- Use C++ for cross-platform performance-critical code\n\n## References\n\nFull documentation with code examples in `references/`:\n\n### JavaScript/React (`js-*`)\n\n| File | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| `js-lists-flatlist-flashlist.md` | CRITICAL | Replace ScrollView with virtualized lists |\n| `js-profile-react.md` | MEDIUM | React DevTools profiling |\n| `js-measure-fps.md` | HIGH | FPS monitoring and measurement |\n| `js-memory-leaks.md` | MEDIUM | JS memory leak hunting |\n| `js-atomic-state.md` | HIGH | Jotai/Zustand patterns |\n| `js-concurrent-react.md` | HIGH | useDeferredValue, useTransition |\n| `js-react-compiler.md` | HIGH | Automatic memoization |\n| `js-animations-reanimated.md` | MEDIUM | Reanimated worklets |\n| `js-uncontrolled-components.md` | HIGH | TextInput optimization |\n\n### Native (`native-*`)\n\n| File | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| `native-turbo-modules.md` | HIGH | Building fast native modules |\n| `native-sdks-over-polyfills.md` | HIGH | Native vs JS libraries |\n| `native-measure-tti.md` | HIGH | TTI measurement setup |\n| `native-threading-model.md` | HIGH | Turbo Module threads |\n| `native-profiling.md` | MEDIUM | Xcode/Android Studio profiling |\n| `native-platform-setup.md` | MEDIUM | iOS/Android tooling guide |\n| `native-view-flattening.md` | MEDIUM | View hierarchy debugging |\n| `native-memory-patterns.md` | MEDIUM | C++/Swift/Kotlin memory |\n| `native-memory-leaks.md` | MEDIUM | Native memory leak hunting |\n| `native-android-16kb-alignment.md` | CRITICAL | Third-party library alignment for Google Play |\n\n### Bundling (`bundle-*`)\n\n| File | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| `bundle-barrel-exports.md` | CRITICAL | Avoid barrel imports |\n| `bundle-analyze-js.md` | CRITICAL | JS bundle visualization |\n| `bundle-tree-shaking.md` | HIGH | Dead code elimination |\n| `bundle-analyze-app.md` | HIGH | App size analysis |\n| `bundle-r8-android.md` | HIGH | Android code shrinking |\n| `bundle-hermes-mmap.md` | HIGH | Disable bundle compression |\n| `bundle-native-assets.md` | HIGH | Asset catalog setup |\n| `bundle-library-size.md` | MEDIUM | Evaluate dependencies |\n| `bundle-code-splitting.md` | MEDIUM | Re.Pack code splitting |\n\n## Searching References\n\n```bash\n# Find patterns by keyword\ngrep -l \"reanimated\" references/\ngrep -l \"flatlist\" references/\ngrep -l \"memory\" references/\ngrep -l \"profil\" references/\ngrep -l \"tti\" references/\ngrep -l \"bundle\" references/\n```\n\n## Problem → Skill Mapping\n\n| Problem | Start With |\n|---------|------------|\n| App feels slow/janky | `js-measure-fps.md` → `js-profile-react.md` |\n| Too many re-renders | `js-profile-react.md` → `js-react-compiler.md` |\n| Slow startup (TTI) | `native-measure-tti.md` → `bundle-analyze-js.md` |\n| Large app size | `bundle-analyze-app.md` → `bundle-r8-android.md` |\n| Memory growing | `js-memory-leaks.md` or `native-memory-leaks.md` |\n| Animation drops frames | `js-animations-reanimated.md` |\n| List scroll jank | `js-lists-flatlist-flashlist.md` |\n| TextInput lag | `js-uncontrolled-components.md` |\n| Native module slow | `native-turbo-modules.md` → `native-threading-model.md` |\n| Native library alignment issue | `native-android-16kb-alignment.md` |\n\n## Attribution\n\nBased on \"The Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization\" by Callstack.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:42:16.701Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Mobile Development Agents needing expert-level React Native optimization techniques.","zh":"非常适合需要专家级 React Native 优化技术的移动开发代理。","ja":"React Native の最適化技術の専門知識が必要なモバイル開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"리액트 네이티브 최적화 기술의 전문 지식이 필요한 모바일 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo móvil que necesitan técnicas de optimización de React Native de nivel experto.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement mobile ayant besoin de techniques d''optimisation React Native de niveau expert.","de":"Perfekt für Mobile Development Agenten, die Experten-Optimierungstechniken für React Native benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Móvel que precisam de técnicas de otimização de nível expert para React Native.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов мобильной разработки, которым необходимы техники оптимизации React Native экспертного уровня.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء تطوير الهاتف المحمول الذين يحتاجون إلى تقنيات تحسين React Native على مستوى الخبراء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize React Native applications using JavaScript and Native optimizations, covering bundling and performance enhancements with tools like Callstack''s Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization, enabling seamless integration with iOS and Android platforms.","zh":"赋予代理优化使用 JavaScript 和原生优化的 React Native 应用程序的能力，涵盖使用 Callstack 的 React Native 优化终极指南等工具进行打包和性能增强，使得与 iOS 和 Android 平台的集成无缝对接。","ja":"JavaScript とネイティブ最適化を使用して React Native アプリケーションを最適化するエージェントをEmpowerすることで、Callstack の React Native 最適化の究極のガイドなどのツールを使用してバンドルとパフォーマンスの強化をカバーし、iOS と Android プラットフォームとのシームレスな統合を可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 자바스크립트 및 네이티브 최적화를 사용하여 리액트 네이티브 애플리케이션을 최적화할 수 있도록 강화하여 Callstack의 리액트 네이티브 최적화 종합 가이드와 같은 도구를 사용하여 번들링 및 성능 향상을 포함하며, iOS 및 안드로이드 플랫폼과 원활하게 통합할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a optimizar aplicaciones de React Native utilizando optimizaciones de JavaScript y nativas, cubriendo la agrupación y las mejoras de rendimiento con herramientas como la Guía definitiva de optimización de React Native de Callstack, lo que permite una integración sin problemas con las plataformas iOS y Android.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les applications React Native en utilisant des optimisations JavaScript et natives, couvrant le regroupement et les améliorations de performances avec des outils tels que le Guide ultime de l''optimisation de React Native de Callstack, permettant une intégration transparente avec les plateformes iOS et Android.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, React Native-Anwendungen mithilfe von JavaScript- und Native-Optimierungen zu optimieren, einschließlich Bundling und Leistungsverbesserungen mit Tools wie Callstacks ultimativem Leitfaden zur Optimierung von React Native, wodurch eine nahtlose Integration mit den Plattformen iOS und Android ermöglicht wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar aplicativos React Native usando otimizações JavaScript e nativas, cobrindo empacotamento e melhorias de desempenho com ferramentas como o Guia Definitivo para Otimização do React Native da Callstack, permitindo integração perfeita com as plataformas iOS e Android.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать приложения React Native с помощью оптимизаций JavaScript и Native, покрывая сборку и улучшения производительности с помощью инструментов, таких как Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization от Callstack, обеспечивая бесшовную интеграцию с платформами iOS и Android.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تحسين تطبيقات React Native باستخدام تحسينات JavaScript والتحسينات الأصلية ، وتغطية التجميع وتحسين الأداء باستخدام أدوات مثل دليل(Callstack) الشامل لتحسين React Native ، وتمكين التكامل السلس مع منصات iOS و Android."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging performance bottlenecks in React Native applications","Implementing JavaScript and Native code optimizations for improved user experience","Bundling and deploying optimized React Native apps for iOS and Android"],"zh":["调试 React Native 应用程序的性能瓶颈","实现 JavaScript 和原生代码优化以提高用户体验","将优化后的 React Native 应用程序打包和部署到 iOS 和 Android"],"ja":["React Native アプリケーションのパフォーマンスボトルネックをデバッグする","ユーザーエクスペリエンスの向上のために JavaScript とネイティブコードの最適化を実装する","最適化された React Native アプリケーションを iOS と Android にバンドルしてデプロイする"],"ko":["리액트 네이티브 애플리케이션의 성능 병목 현상을 디버깅하는 것","사용자 경험을 개선하기 위해 자바스크립트 및 네이티브 코드 최적화를 구현하는 것","최적화된 리액트 네이티브 애플리케이션을 iOS 및 안드로이드에 패키징 및 배포하는 것"],"es":["Depuración de cuellos de botella de rendimiento en aplicaciones de React Native","Implementación de optimizaciones de código JavaScript y nativo para una mejor experiencia del usuario","Agrupación y implementación de aplicaciones de React Native optimizadas para iOS y Android"],"fr":["Débogage des goulets d''étranglement de performances dans les applications React Native","Mise en œuvre d''optimisations de code JavaScript et natif pour une expérience utilisateur améliorée","Regroupement et déploiement d''applications React Native optimisées pour iOS et Android"],"de":["Debuggen von Leistungsengpässen in React Native-Anwendungen","Implementierung von JavaScript- und Native-Code-Optimierungen für eine verbesserte Benutzererfahrung","Bündelung und Bereitstellung von optimierten React Native-Apps für iOS und Android"],"pt":["Depuração de gargalos de desempenho em aplicativos React Native","Implementação de otimizações de código JavaScript e nativo para melhorar a experiência do usuário","Empacotamento e implantação de aplicativos React Native otimizados para iOS e Android"],"ru":["Отладка узких мест производительности в приложениях React Native","Реализация оптимизаций кода JavaScript и Native для улучшения пользовательского опыта","Сборка и развертывание оптимизированных приложений React Native для iOS и Android"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء عُقبات الأداء في تطبيقات React Native","تنفيذ تحسينات في كود JavaScript والكود الأصلي لتحسين تجربة المستخدم","تجميع ونشر تطبيقات React Native المُحسّنة لمنصات iOS و Android"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of React Native and JavaScript","Focused on React Native optimization, not general mobile development"],"zh":["需要 React Native 和 JavaScript 的知识","专注于 React Native 优化，而不是一般的移动开发"],"ja":["React Native と JavaScript の知識が必要","一般的なモバイル開発ではなく React Native の最適化に焦点を当てている"],"ko":["리액트 네이티브 및 자바스크립트에 대한 지식이 필요","일반적인 모바일 개발이 아닌 리액트 네이티브 최적화에 초점"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de React Native y JavaScript","Se centra en la optimización de React Native, no en el desarrollo móvil general"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en React Native et JavaScript","Se concentre sur l''optimisation de React Native, et non sur le développement mobile général"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von React Native und JavaScript","Konzentriert sich auf die Optimierung von React Native, nicht auf die allgemeine mobile Entwicklung"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de React Native e JavaScript","Focado na otimização do React Native, não no desenvolvimento móvel geral"],"ru":["Требует знания React Native и JavaScript","Сосредоточен на оптимизации React Native, а не на общем мобильном развитии"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة React Native و JavaScript","يركز على تحسين React Native ، وليس على تطوير الهاتف المحمول بشكل عام"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('firstcreditunion/fcu-website-dev/content-modeling-best-practices', 'community', 'firstcreditunion', 'fcu-website-dev', 'firstcreditunion/fcu-website-dev', 'content-modeling-best-practices', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.424Z', '2026-02-18T04:42:22.874Z', NULL, '{"id":"firstcreditunion/fcu-website-dev/content-modeling-best-practices","name":"content-modeling-best-practices","description":{"zh":"内容建模最佳实践提供了设计结构化内容的原则，适用于任何头less CMS，包括 Sanity","ja":"コンテンツモデリングベストプラクティスは、構造化コンテンツを設計するための原則を提供し、ヘッドレスCMSに適しています","ko":"콘텐츠 모델링 최적화 방법은 구조화된 콘텐츠를 설계하기 위한 원칙을 제공하며 헤드리스 CMS에 적합합니다","es":"Conoce los principios para diseñar contenido estructurado flexible y reusable. Estas conceptos se aplican a cualquier CMS headless, incluyendo notas de implementación específicas de Sanity.","fr":"Découvrez les principes pour concevoir du contenu structuré flexible et réutilisable. Ces concepts s''appliquent à tout CMS headless, y compris des notes d''implémentation spécifiques à Sanity.","de":"Erfahren Sie die Prinzipien für die Erstellung von strukturiertem Inhalt, der flexibel und wiederverwendbar ist. Diese Konzepte gelten für jedes Headless-CMS, einschließlich spezifischer Implementierungshinweise für Sanity.","pt":"As melhores práticas de modelagem de conteúdo fornecem diretrizes para projetar conteúdo estruturado flexível e reutilizável","ru":"Лучшие практики моделирования контента предоставляют рекомендации для проектирования гибкого и повторно используемого структурированного контента","ar":"أفضل ممارسات نمذجة المحتوى توفر إرشادات لتصميم محتوى منظم مرن وقابل لإعادة الاستخدام","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"内容建模最佳实践","ja":"コンテンツモデリングベストプラクティス","ko":"콘텐츠 모델링 최적화 방법","es":"Mejores prácticas de modelado de contenido","fr":"Meilleures pratiques de modélisation de contenu","de":"Best Practices für Content-Modellierung","pt":"Melho