odyPreview":"# React Native Best Practices\n\n## Overview\n\nPerformance optimization guide for React Native applications, covering JavaScript/React, Native (iOS/Android), and bundling optimizations. Based on Callstack''s \"Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization\".\n\n## Skill Format\n\nEach reference file follows a hybrid format for fast lookup and deep understanding:\n\n- **Quick Pattern**: Incorrect/Correct code snippets for immediate pattern matching\n- **Quick Command**: Shell commands for process/measurement sk","body":"# React Native Best Practices\n\n## Overview\n\nPerformance optimization guide for React Native applications, covering JavaScript/React, Native (iOS/Android), and bundling optimizations. Based on Callstack''s \"Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization\".\n\n## Skill Format\n\nEach reference file follows a hybrid format for fast lookup and deep understanding:\n\n- **Quick Pattern**: Incorrect/Correct code snippets for immediate pattern matching\n- **Quick Command**: Shell commands for process/measurement skills\n- **Quick Config**: Configuration snippets for setup-focused skills\n- **Quick Reference**: Summary tables for conceptual skills\n- **Deep Dive**: Full context with When to Use, Prerequisites, Step-by-Step, Common Pitfalls\n\n**Impact ratings**: CRITICAL (fix immediately), HIGH (significant improvement), MEDIUM (worthwhile optimization)\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Debugging slow/janky UI or animations\n- Investigating memory leaks (JS or native)\n- Optimizing app startup time (TTI)\n- Reducing bundle or app size\n- Writing native modules (Turbo Modules)\n- Profiling React Native performance\n- Reviewing React Native code for performance\n\n## Priority-Ordered Guidelines\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | FPS & Re-renders | CRITICAL | `js-*` |\n| 2 | Bundle Size | CRITICAL | `bundle-*` |\n| 3 | TTI Optimization | HIGH | `native-*`, `bundle-*` |\n| 4 | Native Performance | HIGH | `native-*` |\n| 5 | Memory Management | MEDIUM-HIGH | `js-*`, `native-*` |\n| 6 | Animations | MEDIUM | `js-*` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Critical: FPS & Re-renders\n\n**Profile first:**\n```bash\n# Open React Native DevTools\n# Press ''j'' in Metro, or shake device → \"Open DevTools\"\n```\n\n**Common fixes:**\n- Replace ScrollView with FlatList/FlashList for lists\n- Use React Compiler for automatic memoization\n- Use atomic state (Jotai/Zustand) to reduce re-renders\n- Use `useDeferredValue` for expensive computations\n\n### Critical: Bundle Size\n\n**Analyze bundle:**\n```bash\nnpx react-native bundle \\\n  --entry-file index.js \\\n  --bundle-output output.js \\\n  --platform ios \\\n  --sourcemap-output output.js.map \\\n  --dev false --minify true\n\nnpx source-map-explorer output.js --no-border-checks\n```\n\n**Common fixes:**\n- Avoid barrel imports (import directly from source)\n- Remove unnecessary Intl polyfills (Hermes has native support)\n- Enable tree shaking (Expo SDK 52+ or Re.Pack)\n- Enable R8 for Android native code shrinking\n\n### High: TTI Optimization\n\n**Measure TTI:**\n- Use `react-native-performance` for markers\n- Only measure cold starts (exclude warm/hot/prewarm)\n\n**Common fixes:**\n- Disable JS bundle compression on Android (enables Hermes mmap)\n- Use native navigation (react-native-screens)\n- Defer non-critical work with `InteractionManager`\n\n### High: Native Performance\n\n**Profile native:**\n- iOS: Xcode Instruments → Time Profiler\n- Android: Android Studio → CPU Profiler\n\n**Common fixes:**\n- Use background threads for heavy native work\n- Prefer async over sync Turbo Module methods\n- Use C++ for cross-platform performance-critical code\n\n## References\n\nFull documentation with code examples in `references/`:\n\n### JavaScript/React (`js-*`)\n\n| File | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| `js-lists-flatlist-flashlist.md` | CRITICAL | Replace ScrollView with virtualized lists |\n| `js-profile-react.md` | MEDIUM | React DevTools profiling |\n| `js-measure-fps.md` | HIGH | FPS monitoring and measurement |\n| `js-memory-leaks.md` | MEDIUM | JS memory leak hunting |\n| `js-atomic-state.md` | HIGH | Jotai/Zustand patterns |\n| `js-concurrent-react.md` | HIGH | useDeferredValue, useTransition |\n| `js-react-compiler.md` | HIGH | Automatic memoization |\n| `js-animations-reanimated.md` | MEDIUM | Reanimated worklets |\n| `js-uncontrolled-components.md` | HIGH | TextInput optimization |\n\n### Native (`native-*`)\n\n| File | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| `native-turbo-modules.md` | HIGH | Building fast native modules |\n| `native-sdks-over-polyfills.md` | HIGH | Native vs JS libraries |\n| `native-measure-tti.md` | HIGH | TTI measurement setup |\n| `native-threading-model.md` | HIGH | Turbo Module threads |\n| `native-profiling.md` | MEDIUM | Xcode/Android Studio profiling |\n| `native-platform-setup.md` | MEDIUM | iOS/Android tooling guide |\n| `native-view-flattening.md` | MEDIUM | View hierarchy debugging |\n| `native-memory-patterns.md` | MEDIUM | C++/Swift/Kotlin memory |\n| `native-memory-leaks.md` | MEDIUM | Native memory leak hunting |\n| `native-android-16kb-alignment.md` | CRITICAL | Third-party library alignment for Google Play |\n\n### Bundling (`bundle-*`)\n\n| File | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| `bundle-barrel-exports.md` | CRITICAL | Avoid barrel imports |\n| `bundle-analyze-js.md` | CRITICAL | JS bundle visualization |\n| `bundle-tree-shaking.md` | HIGH | Dead code elimination |\n| `bundle-analyze-app.md` | HIGH | App size analysis |\n| `bundle-r8-android.md` | HIGH | Android code shrinking |\n| `bundle-hermes-mmap.md` | HIGH | Disable bundle compression |\n| `bundle-native-assets.md` | HIGH | Asset catalog setup |\n| `bundle-library-size.md` | MEDIUM | Evaluate dependencies |\n| `bundle-code-splitting.md` | MEDIUM | Re.Pack code splitting |\n\n## Searching References\n\n```bash\n# Find patterns by keyword\ngrep -l \"reanimated\" references/\ngrep -l \"flatlist\" references/\ngrep -l \"memory\" references/\ngrep -l \"profil\" references/\ngrep -l \"tti\" references/\ngrep -l \"bundle\" references/\n```\n\n## Problem → Skill Mapping\n\n| Problem | Start With |\n|---------|------------|\n| App feels slow/janky | `js-measure-fps.md` → `js-profile-react.md` |\n| Too many re-renders | `js-profile-react.md` → `js-react-compiler.md` |\n| Slow startup (TTI) | `native-measure-tti.md` → `bundle-analyze-js.md` |\n| Large app size | `bundle-analyze-app.md` → `bundle-r8-android.md` |\n| Memory growing | `js-memory-leaks.md` or `native-memory-leaks.md` |\n| Animation drops frames | `js-animations-reanimated.md` |\n| List scroll jank | `js-lists-flatlist-flashlist.md` |\n| TextInput lag | `js-uncontrolled-components.md` |\n| Native module slow | `native-turbo-modules.md` → `native-threading-model.md` |\n| Native library alignment issue | `native-android-16kb-alignment.md` |\n\n## Attribution\n\nBased on \"The Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization\" by Callstack.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:42:08.505Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Mobile App Agents needing advanced React Native performance optimization techniques.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 React Native 性能优化技术的移动应用代理。","ja":"React Native のパフォーマンス最適化テクニックが必要なモバイルアプリエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 React Native 성능 최적화 기술이 필요한 모바일 앱 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Aplicaciones Móviles que necesitan técnicas avanzadas de optimización de rendimiento de React Native.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''applications mobiles ayant besoin de techniques avancées d''optimisation des performances de React Native.","de":"Perfekt für Mobile App-Agents, die erweiterte React Native-Leistungs-Optimierungstechniken benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Aplicativos Móveis que necessitam de técnicas avançadas de otimização de desempenho do React Native.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов мобильных приложений, которым требуются продвинутые техники оптимизации производительности React Native.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطبيقات الجوال الذين يحتاجون إلى تقنيات متقدمة لتحسين أداء React Native."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize React Native applications using JavaScript and Native code improvements, including bundling optimizations, leveraging Callstack''s Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization and covering iOS and Android platforms.","zh":"赋予代理优化使用 JavaScript 和本地代码改进的 React Native 应用程序的能力，包括包优化，利用 Callstack 的 React Native 优化终极指南，并涵盖 iOS 和 Android 平台。","ja":"JavaScript とネイティブコードの改善を使用して React Native アプリケーションを最適化するエージェントをEmpowerすることができます。バンドル最適化、Callstack の React Native 最適化の究極のガイドを利用し、iOS と Android プラットフォームをカバーします。","ko":"JavaScript와 네이티브 코드 개선을 사용하여 React Native 애플리케이션을 최적화하는 에이전트를 강화하여 번들 최적화, Callstack의 React Native 최적화究極 가이드를 활용하며, iOS 및 Android 플랫폼을 다룹니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a optimizar aplicaciones de React Native utilizando mejoras de JavaScript y código nativo, incluidas optimizaciones de empaquetado, aprovechando la Guía definitiva de Callstack para la optimización de React Native y cubriendo las plataformas iOS y Android.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les applications React Native en utilisant des améliorations de JavaScript et de code natif, y compris des optimisations de regroupement, en exploitant le Guide ultime de Callstack pour l''optimisation de React Native et en couvrant les plateformes iOS et Android.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, React Native-Anwendungen zu optimieren, indem sie JavaScript- und Native-Code-Verbesserungen nutzen, einschließlich Bündel-Optimierungen, unter Ausnutzung von Callstacks ultimativer Anleitung zur Optimierung von React Native und unter Berücksichtigung der Plattformen iOS und Android.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar aplicativos React Native usando melhorias de código JavaScript e nativo, incluindo otimizações de empacotamento, aproveitando o Guia Definitivo para Otimização do React Native da Callstack e cobrindo as plataformas iOS e Android.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать приложения React Native с использованием улучшений кода JavaScript и родного кода, включая оптимизацию пакетов, используя Ультимативное руководство по оптимизации React Native от Callstack и покрывая платформы iOS и Android.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تحسين تطبيقات React Native باستخدام تحسينات في JavaScript والكود الأصلي، بما في ذلك تحسينات التعبئة، واستخدام دليل Callstack النهائي لتحسين React Native وتغطية منصات iOS و Android."},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing React Native app performance","Debugging JavaScript and Native code issues","Implementing bundling optimizations for faster load times"],"zh":["优化 React Native 应用程序性能","调试 JavaScript 和本地代码问题","实现包优化以获得更快的加载时间"],"ja":["React Native アプリケーションのパフォーマンスを最適化する","JavaScript とネイティブコードの問題をデバッグする","バンドル最適化を実装してより高速なロード時間を実現する"],"ko":["React Native 애플리케이션 성능 최적화","JavaScript 및 네이티브 코드 문제 디버깅","패키지 최적화를 구현하여 더 빠른 로드 시간을 실현"],"es":["Optimizar el rendimiento de la aplicación de React Native","Depurar problemas de JavaScript y código nativo","Implementar optimizaciones de empaquetado para tiempos de carga más rápidos"],"fr":["Optimiser les performances de l''application React Native","Déboguer les problèmes de JavaScript et de code natif","Mettre en œuvre des optimisations de regroupement pour des temps de chargement plus rapides"],"de":["Optimieren der Leistung der React Native-Anwendung","Beheben von JavaScript- und Native-Code-Problemen","Implementieren von Bündel-Optimierungen für schnellere Ladezeiten"],"pt":["Otimizar o desempenho do aplicativo React Native","Depurar problemas de código JavaScript e nativo","Implementar otimizações de empacotamento para tempos de carregamento mais rápidos"],"ru":["Оптимизировать производительность приложения React Native","Отлаживать проблемы кода JavaScript и родного кода","Реализовать оптимизацию пакетов для более быстрого времени загрузки"],"ar":["تحسين أداء تطبيق React Native","تصحيح أخطاء في JavaScript والكود الأصلي","تنفيذ تحسينات التعبئة لأوقات تحميل أسرع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of React Native and JavaScript","Focused on React Native optimization, not general mobile app development"],"zh":["需要了解 React Native 和 JavaScript","专注于 React Native 优化，而不是一般的移动应用开发"],"ja":["React Native と JavaScript の知識が必要","React Native 最適化に焦点を当てており、一般的なモバイルアプリ開発ではありません"],"ko":["React Native 및 JavaScript에 대한 지식이 필요","React Native 최적화에 초점을 둡니다. 일반적인 모바일 앱 개발은 아닙니다"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de React Native y JavaScript","Se centra en la optimización de React Native, no en el desarrollo general de aplicaciones móviles"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en React Native et JavaScript","Se concentre sur l''optimisation de React Native, et non sur le développement général d''applications mobiles"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von React Native und JavaScript","Konzentriert sich auf die Optimierung von React Native, nicht auf die allgemeine Entwicklung von Mobile Apps"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de React Native e JavaScript","Focado na otimização do React Native, não no desenvolvimento geral de aplicativos móveis"],"ru":["Требует знания React Native и JavaScript","Фокусируется на оптимизации React Native, а не на общем развитии мобильных приложений"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة React Native و JavaScript","يركز على تحسين React Native، وليس على تطوير تطبيقات الجوال بشكل عام"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('jd-solanki/lekhan-internal-sync/nuxt-seo', 'community', 'jd-solanki', 'lekhan-internal-sync', 'jd-solanki/lekhan-internal-sync', 'nuxt-seo', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.424Z', '2026-02-18T04:42:57.252Z', NULL, '{"id":"jd-solanki/lekhan-internal-sync/nuxt-seo","name":"nuxt-seo","description":{"zh":"Nuxt SEO是一个帮助您优化Nuxt.js应用程序的SEO配置的模块，包括站点URL、名称、索引性等","ja":"Nuxt SEOは、Nuxt.jsアプリケーションのSEO設定を最適化するモジュールです。サイトURL、名前、インデックス性などが含まれます","ko":"Nuxt SEO는 Nuxt.js 애플리케이션의 SEO 설정을 최적화하는 모듈입니다. 사이트 URL, 이름, 색인 가능성 등이 포함됩니다","es":"Nuxt SEO es una herramienta que ayuda a mejorar el posicionamiento en buscadores de tu sitio web. Ofrece funcionalidades para configurar el SEO de manera sencilla","fr":"Nuxt SEO est un outil qui aide à améliorer le référencement de votre site web. Il offre des fonctionnalités pour configurer le SEO de manière simple","de":"Nuxt SEO ist ein Tool, das dabei hilft, die Suchmaschinen-Optimierung Ihrer Website zu verbessern. Es bietet Funktionen, um das SEO einfach zu konfigurieren","pt":"O Nuxt SEO é uma solução para melhorar a visibilidade do seu site Nuxt. Ele oferece configuração de URL do site, nome e indexabilidade, além de geração de robots.txt e sitemap.xml.","ru":"Nuxt SEO - это решение для улучшения видимости вашего сайта Nuxt. Он предлагает настройку URL сайта, имени и индексирования, а также генерацию robots.txt и sitemap.xml.","ar":"نيكست سيو هو حل لتحسين_VISIBLE_ لموقعك Nuxt. يقدم إعداد URL الموقع، الاسم وقابلية الفهرسة، بالإضافة إلى توليد robots.txt و sitemap.xml.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Nuxt SEO优化解决方案","ja":"Nuxt SEO最適化ソリューション","ko":"Nuxt SEO 최적화 솔루션","es":"Nuxt SEO: Optimiza tu sitio web","fr":"Nuxt SEO : Optimisez votre site web","de":"Nuxt SEO: Optimieren Sie Ihre Website","pt":"Nuxt SEO: Otimização para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Nuxt SEO: Оптимизация для разработчиков","ar":"نيكست سيو: تحسين للمطورين","en":"nuxt-seo"},"description":{"zh":"Nuxt SEO是一个帮助您优化Nuxt.js应用程序的SEO配置的模块，包括站点URL、名称、索引性等","ja":"Nuxt SEOは、Nuxt.jsアプリケーションのSEO設定を最適化するモジュールです。サイトURL、名前、インデックス性などが含まれます","ko":"Nuxt SEO는 Nuxt.js 애플리케이션의 SEO 설정을 최적화하는 모듈입니다. 사이트 URL, 이름, 색인 가능성 등이 포함됩니다","es":"Nuxt SEO es una herramienta que ayuda a mejorar el posicionamiento en buscadores de tu sitio web. Ofrece funcionalidades para configurar el SEO de manera sen...","fr":"Nuxt SEO est un outil qui aide à améliorer le référencement de votre site web. Il offre des fonctionnalités pour configurer le SEO de manière simple","de":"Nuxt SEO ist ein Tool, das dabei hilft, die Suchmaschinen-Optimierung Ihrer Website zu verbessern. Es bietet Funktionen, um das SEO einfach zu konfigurieren","pt":"O Nuxt SEO é uma solução para melhorar a visibilidade do seu site Nuxt. Ele oferece configuração de URL do site, nome e indexabilidade, além de geração de ro...","ru":"Nuxt SEO - это решение для улучшения видимости вашего сайта Nuxt. Он предлагает настройку URL сайта, имени и индексирования, а также генерацию robots.txt и s...","ar":"نيكست سيو هو حل لتحسين_VISIBLE_ لموقعك Nuxt. يقدم إعداد URL الموقع، الاسم وقابلية الفهرسة، بالإضافة إلى توليد robots.txt و sitemap.xml.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["SEO配置（站点URL、名称、索引性）","robots.txt和sitemap.xml生成","动态OG图像生成","JSON-LD结构化数据（schema.org）","面包屑和规范化URL"],"ja":["SEO設定（サイトURL、名前、インデックス性）","robots.txtとsitemap.xmlの生成","動的なOG画像の生成","JSON-LD構造化データ（schema.org）","パンくずと正規化URL"],"ko":["SEO 설정（사이트 URL, 이름, 색인 가능성）","robots.txt 및 sitemap.xml 생성","동적 OG 이미지 생성","JSON-LD 구조화 데이터（schema.org）","브레드크럼과 표준화 URL"],"es":["Configuración de SEO","Generación de robots.txt y sitemap.xml","Generación dinámica de imágenes OG","Datos estructurados JSON-LD","Generación de breadcrumbs y URLs canónicas"],"fr":["Configuration du SEO","Génération de robots.txt et sitemap.xml","Génération dynamique d''images OG","Données structurées JSON-LD","Génération de breadcrumbs et d''URL canónicas"],"de":["SEO-Konfiguration","Generierung von robots.txt und sitemap.xml","Dynamische Generierung von OG-Bildern","Strukturierte Daten im JSON-LD-Format","Generierung von Breadcrumbs und kanonischen URLs"],"pt":["Configuração de URL do site e nome","Geração de robots.txt e sitemap.xml","Geração de imagem OG dinâmica","Estrutura de dados JSON-LD (schema.org)","Gerenciamento de URLs canônicas e breadcrumbs"],"ru":["Настройка URL сайта и имени","Генерация robots.txt и sitemap.xml","Генерация динамической OG-изображения","Структура данных JSON-LD (schema.org)","Управление каноническими URL и breadcrumbs"],"ar":["إعداد URL الموقع والاسم","توليد robots.txt و sitemap.xml","توليد صورة OG ديناميكية","هيكل البيانات JSON-LD (schema.org)","إدارة URLs القياسية والbreadcrumbs"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Nuxt SEO","Nuxt.js SEO","SEO优化","robots.txt","sitemap.xml","OG图像","JSON-LD","schema.org"],"ja":["Nuxt SEO","Nuxt.js SEO","SEO最適化","robots.txt","sitemap.xml","OG画像","JSON-LD","schema.org"],"ko":["Nuxt SEO","Nuxt.js SEO","SEO 최적화","robots.txt","sitemap.xml","OG 이미지","JSON-LD","schema.org"],"es":["Nuxt SEO","Optimización de sitios web","Mejora del posicionamiento en buscadores","Configuración de SEO","Generación de robots.txt","Sitemap.xml"],"fr":["Nuxt SEO","Optimisation de sites web","Amélioration du référencement","Configuration du SEO","Génération de robots.txt","Sitemap.xml"],"de":["Nuxt SEO","Suchmaschinen-Optimierung","Verbesserung der Suchmaschinen-Positionierung","SEO-Konfiguration","Generierung von robots.txt","Sitemap.xml"],"pt":["Nuxt SEO","Otimização para motores de busca","Visibilidade do site","Configuração de URL do site","Geração de robots.txt","Sitemap.xml"],"ru":["Nuxt SEO","Оптимизация для поисковых систем","Видимость сайта","Настройка URL сайта","Генерация robots.txt","Sitemap.xml"],"ar":["نيكست سيو","تحسين محركات البحث","VISIBLE_ لموقعك","إعداد URL الموقع","توليد robots.txt","Sitemap.xml"]}},"owner":"jd-solanki","repo":"lekhan-internal-sync","repoPath":"jd-solanki/lekhan-internal-sync","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.424Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"nuxt-seo","description":"Nuxt SEO meta-module with robots, sitemap, og-image, schema-org. Use when configuring SEO, generating sitemaps, creating OG images, or adding structured data.","bodyPreview":"# Nuxt SEO\n\n```bash\nnpx nuxi module add @nuxtjs/seo\n```\n\n## When to Use\n\nWorking with:\n\n- SEO configuration (site URL, name, indexability)\n- Robots.txt and sitemap.xml generation\n- Dynamic OG image generation\n- JSON-LD structured data (schema.org)\n- Breadcrumbs and canonical URLs\n\n## Loading Files\n\n**Consider loading these reference files based on your task:**\n\n- [ ] [references/site-config.md](references/site-config.md) - if configuring site URL, name, or SEO foundation\n- [ ] [references/crawla","body":"# Nuxt SEO\n\n```bash\nnpx nuxi module add @nuxtjs/seo\n```\n\n## When to Use\n\nWorking with:\n\n- SEO configuration (site URL, name, indexability)\n- Robots.txt and sitemap.xml generation\n- Dynamic OG image generation\n- JSON-LD structured data (schema.org)\n- Breadcrumbs and canonical URLs\n\n## Loading Files\n\n**Consider loading these reference files based on your task:**\n\n- [ ] [references/site-config.md](references/site-config.md) - if configuring site URL, name, or SEO foundation\n- [ ] [references/crawlability.md](references/crawlability.md) - if setting up robots.txt or sitemap.xml\n- [ ] [references/og-image.md](references/og-image.md) - if generating dynamic OG images\n- [ ] [references/schema-org.md](references/schema-org.md) - if adding JSON-LD structured data\n- [ ] [references/utilities.md](references/utilities.md) - if working with breadcrumbs, canonical URLs, or link checking\n\n**DO NOT load all files at once.** Load only what''s relevant to your current task.\n\n## Site Config\n\nFoundation for all SEO modules. Configure `site` in `nuxt.config.ts`, access via `useSiteConfig()`. See [references/site-config.md](references/site-config.md) for full options.\n\n## Module Overview\n\n| Module            | Purpose         | Key API                       |\n| ----------------- | --------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| nuxt-site-config  | Shared config   | `useSiteConfig()`             |\n| @nuxtjs/robots    | robots.txt      | `useRobotsRule()`             |\n| @nuxtjs/sitemap   | sitemap.xml     | `defineSitemapEventHandler()` |\n| nuxt-og-image     | OG images       | `defineOgImage()`             |\n| nuxt-schema-org   | JSON-LD         | `useSchemaOrg()`              |\n| nuxt-seo-utils    | Meta utilities  | `useBreadcrumbItems()`        |\n| nuxt-link-checker | Link validation | Build-time checks             |\n\n## Nuxt Content v3\n\nUse `asSeoCollection()` for automatic sitemap, og-image, and schema-org from frontmatter:\n\n```ts\n// content.config.ts\nimport { defineCollection, defineContentConfig } from ''@nuxt/content''\nimport { asSeoCollection } from ''@nuxtjs/seo/content''\n\nexport default defineContentConfig({\n  collections: {\n    posts: defineCollection(asSeoCollection({ type: ''page'', source: ''posts/**'' }))\n  }\n})\n```\n\n**Important:** Load `@nuxtjs/seo` before `@nuxt/content` in modules array:\n\n```ts\nexport default defineNuxtConfig({\n  modules: [''@nuxtjs/seo'', ''@nuxt/content'']\n})\n```\n\nFrontmatter fields: `ogImage`, `sitemap`, `robots`, `schemaOrg`.\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- [nuxt-content](../nuxt-content/SKILL.md) - For MDC rendering with SEO frontmatter\n\n## Links\n\n- [Documentation](https://nuxtseo.com)\n- [GitHub](https://github.com/harlan-zw/nuxt-seo)\n\n## Token Efficiency\n\nMain skill: ~250 tokens. Each sub-file: ~400-600 tokens. Only load files relevant to current task.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:42:57.252Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced SEO optimization and automation in Nuxt.js applications.","zh":"非常适合需要在 Nuxt.js 应用程序中实现高级 SEO 优化和自动化的前端代理。","ja":"Nuxt.js アプリケーションで高度な SEO 最適化と自動化が必要なフロントエンド エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Nuxt.js 애플리케이션에서 고급 SEO 최적화 및 자동화를 필요로 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes frontend que necesitan una optimización y automatización de SEO avanzada en aplicaciones Nuxt.js.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend ayant besoin d''une optimisation et d''une automation de SEO avancée dans les applications Nuxt.js.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine erweiterte SEO-Optimierung und -Automatisierung in Nuxt.js-Anwendungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de frontend que precisam de otimização avançada de SEO e automação em aplicações Nuxt.js.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов фронтенда, которым требуются продвинутая оптимизация SEO и автоматизация в приложениях Nuxt.js.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذين يحتاجون إلى تحسين متقدم لتحسين محركات البحث وتوافرية في تطبيقات Nuxt.js."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate SEO configuration, generate robots.txt and sitemap.xml files, and create dynamic OG images using JSON-LD structured data and schema.org protocols, enhancing website discoverability and search engine ranking.","zh":"赋予代理自动化 SEO 配置、生成 robots.txt 和 sitemap.xml 文件，并使用 JSON-LD 结构化数据和 schema.org 协议创建动态 OG 图像，提高网站的发现度和搜索引擎排名。","ja":"エージェントに SEO 構成の自動化、robots.txt と sitemap.xml ファイルの生成、JSON-LD 構造化データと schema.org プロトコルを使用した動的 OG 画像の作成を可能にし、ウェブサイトの発見性と検索エンジンのランキングを向上させます。","ko":"에이전트가 SEO 구성 자동화, robots.txt 및 sitemap.xml 파일 생성 및 JSON-LD 구조화 데이터 및 schema.org 프로토콜을 사용한 동적 OG 이미지 생성을 가능하게 하여 웹 사이트의 발견 가능성 및 검색 엔진 순위를 향상시킵니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar la configuración de SEO, generar archivos robots.txt y sitemap.xml, y crear imágenes OG dinámicas utilizando datos estructurados JSON-LD y protocolos schema.org, lo que mejora la capacidad de descubrimiento del sitio web y el ranking en los motores de búsqueda.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la configuration de SEO, de générer des fichiers robots.txt et sitemap.xml, et de créer des images OG dynamiques en utilisant des données structurées JSON-LD et des protocoles schema.org, améliorant ainsi la découverte du site web et le référencement dans les moteurs de recherche.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die SEO-Konfiguration zu automatisieren, robots.txt- und sitemap.xml-Dateien zu generieren und dynamische OG-Bilder mit strukturierten JSON-LD-Daten und schema.org-Protokollen zu erstellen, wodurch die Auffindbarkeit der Website und die Suchmaschinenrangliste verbessert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a configuração de SEO, gerar arquivos robots.txt e sitemap.xml, e criar imagens OG dinâmicas usando dados estruturados JSON-LD e protocolos schema.org, melhorando a descoberta do site e o ranking de busca.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать настройку SEO, генерировать файлы robots.txt и sitemap.xml, а также создавать динамические изображения OG с использованием структурированных данных JSON-LD и протоколов schema.org, повышая обнаруживаемость сайта и рейтинг поисковых систем.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من توفير تكوين متقدم لتحسين محركات البحث، وتوليد ملفات robots.txt و sitemap.xml، وإنشاء صور OG ديناميكية باستخدام بيانات JSON-LD المنظمة وبروتوكولات schema.org، مما يعزز اكتشاف الموقع وتصنيف محركات البحث."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating SEO metadata generation for Nuxt.js pages","Generating dynamic OG images for social media sharing","Configuring robots.txt and sitemap.xml files for improved crawlability","Implementing JSON-LD structured data for enhanced search engine understanding"],"zh":["为 Nuxt.js 页面自动生成 SEO 元数据","为社交媒体分享生成动态 OG 图像","配置 robots.txt 和 sitemap.xml 文件以提高爬行性","实现 JSON-LD 结构化数据以增强搜索引擎理解"],"ja":["Nuxt.js ページの SEO メタデータを自動生成する","ソーシャル メディア共有用に動的 OG 画像を生成する","クロール性を向上させるために robots.txt と sitemap.xml ファイルを構成する","検索エンジンの理解を強化するために JSON-LD 構造化データを実装する"],"ko":["Nuxt.js 페이지의 SEO 메타데이터 자동 생성","소셜 미디어 공유를 위한 동적 OG 이미지 생성","크롤링 가능성을 개선하기 위한 robots.txt 및 sitemap.xml 파일 구성","검색 엔진 이해를 향상시키기 위한 JSON-LD 구조화 데이터 구현"],"es":["Automatizar la generación de metadatos de SEO para páginas de Nuxt.js","Generar imágenes OG dinámicas para compartir en redes sociales","Configurar archivos robots.txt y sitemap.xml para mejorar la accesibilidad","Implementar datos estructurados JSON-LD para una mejor comprensión de los motores de búsqueda"],"fr":["Automatiser la génération de métadonnées de SEO pour les pages Nuxt.js","Générer des images OG dynamiques pour le partage sur les réseaux sociaux","Configurer des fichiers robots.txt et sitemap.xml pour améliorer la crawlabilité","Mettre en œuvre des données structurées JSON-LD pour une meilleure compréhension des moteurs de recherche"],"de":["Automatisieren der Generierung von SEO-Metadaten für Nuxt.js-Seiten","Erstellen dynamischer OG-Bilder für das Teilen in sozialen Netzwerken","Konfigurieren von robots.txt- und sitemap.xml-Dateien für eine verbesserte Crawlbility","Implementieren von strukturierten JSON-LD-Daten für ein besseres Verständnis der Suchmaschinen"],"pt":["Automatizar a geração de metadados de SEO para páginas Nuxt.js","Gerar imagens OG dinâmicas para compartilhamento em redes sociais","Configurar arquivos robots.txt e sitemap.xml para melhorar a rastreabilidade","Implementar dados estruturados JSON-LD para melhorar a compreensão dos motores de busca"],"ru":["Автоматизировать генерацию метаданных SEO для страниц Nuxt.js","Генерировать динамические изображения OG для обмена в социальных сетях","Настроить файлы robots.txt и sitemap.xml для улучшения индексирования","Реализовать структурированные данные JSON-LD для улучшения понимания поисковыми системами"],"ar":["توفير توليد بيانات وصفية لتحسين محركات البحث للصفحات Nuxt.js","توليد صور OG ديناميكية للمشاركة على وسائل التواصل الاجتماعي","تكوين ملفات robots.txt و sitemap.xml لتحسين القدرة على الفهرسة","تنفيذ بيانات JSON-LD المنظمة لتحسين فهم محركات البحث"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Nuxt.js framework installation","Dependent on @nuxtjs/seo module","Limited to SEO configuration and automation within Nuxt.js ecosystem"],"zh":["需要 Nuxt.js 框架安装","依赖于 @nuxtjs/seo 模块","仅限于 Nuxt.js 生态系统内的 SEO 配置和自动化"],"ja":["Nuxt.js フレームワークのインストールが必要","@nuxtjs/seo モジュールに依存する","Nuxt.js エコシステム内でのみ SEO 構成と自動化が可能"],"ko":["Nuxt.js 프레임워크 설치가 필요함","@nuxtjs/seo 모듈에 의존함","Nuxt.js 생태계 내에서의 SEO 구성 및 자동화에만 한정됨"],"es":["Requiere la instalación del framework Nuxt.js","Depende del módulo @nuxtjs/seo","Limitado a la configuración y automatización de SEO dentro del ecosistema Nuxt.js"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation du framework Nuxt.js","Dépend du module @nuxtjs/seo","Limité à la configuration et à l''automation de SEO au sein de l''écosystème Nuxt.js"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation des Nuxt.js-Frameworks","Hängt vom @nuxtjs/seo-Modul ab","Begrenzt auf die SEO-Konfiguration und -Automatisierung innerhalb des Nuxt.js-Ökosystems"],"pt":["Requer instalação do framework Nuxt.js","Depende do módulo @nuxtjs/seo","Limitado à configuração e automação de SEO dentro do ecossistema Nuxt.js"],"ru":["Требует установки фреймворка Nuxt.js","Зависит от модуля @nuxtjs/seo","Ограничен настройкой и автоматизацией SEO внутри экосистемы Nuxt.js"],"ar":["يحتاج إلى تثبيت إطار Nuxt.js","يعتمد على وحدة @nuxtjs/seo","محدود بالتكوين والتوفرية لتحسين محركات البحث داخل نظام Nuxt.js"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('woody1234567/Nuxt_tech_blog/nuxt-seo', 'community', 'woody1234567', 'Nuxt_tech_blog', 'woody1234567/Nuxt_tech_blog', 'nuxt-seo', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.424Z', '2026-02-18T04:42:37.049Z', NULL, '{"id":"woody1234567/Nuxt_tech_blog/nuxt-seo","name":"nuxt-seo","description":{"zh":"Nuxt SEO模块提供了一种简单的方式来优化您的Nuxt.js应用程序的SEO配置，包括站点URL、名称、索引性、robots.txt和sitemap.xml生成等","ja":"Nuxt SEOモジュールは、Nuxt.jsアプリケーションのSEO設定を最適化するための簡単な方法を提供します。サイトURL、名前、インデックス性、robots.txt、sitemap.xmlの生成など","ko":"Nuxt SEO 모듈은 Nuxt.js 애플리케이션의 SEO 설정을 최적화하는 쉬운 방법을 제공합니다. 사이트 URL, 이름, 색인 가능성, robots.txt 및 sitemap.xml 생성 등","es":"Nuxt SEO es un módulo que ayuda a configurar y optimizar el SEO de tu sitio web creado con Nuxt.js, incluyendo la generación de sitemap.xml y robots.txt.","fr":"Nuxt SEO est un module qui aide à configurer et à optimiser le SEO de votre site Web créé avec Nuxt.js, y compris la génération de sitemap.xml et de robots.txt.","de":"Nuxt SEO ist ein Modul, das hilft, die SEO-Einstellungen und -Optimierung Ihrer mit Nuxt.js erstellten Website zu konfigurieren, einschließlich der Generierung von sitemap.xml und robots.txt.","pt":"O módulo Nuxt SEO fornece recursos para melhorar a otimização de mecanismos de busca do seu site Nuxt.","ru":"Модуль Nuxt SEO предоставляет функции для улучшения оптимизации поисковых систем вашего сайта Nuxt.","ar":"يوفر مكون Nuxt SEO ميزات لتحسين تحسين محركات البحث لموقعك على الويب Nuxt.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Nuxt SEO优化模块","ja":"Nuxt SEO最適化モジュール","ko":"Nuxt SEO 최적화 모듈","es":"Nuxt SEO: Optimiza tu sitio web con Nuxt.js","fr":"Nuxt SEO : Optimisez votre site Web avec Nuxt.js","de":"Nuxt SEO: Optimieren Sie Ihre Website mit Nuxt.js","pt":"Nuxt SEO: Otimização para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Nuxt SEO: Оптимизация для разработчиков","ar":"نيكست سيو: تحسين لغة تطوير الويب","en":"nuxt-seo"},"descr