de código para JavaScript e React","Otimizações nativas para iOS e Android","Ferramentas de medição e processo para otimização","Padrões de código para desenvolvimento rápido e eficiente"],"ru":["Оптимизация производительности для React Native","Руководство по шаблонам кода для JavaScript и React","Родные оптимизации для iOS и Android","Инструменты измерения и процесса для оптимизации","Шаблоны кода для быстрой и эффективной разработки"],"ar":["تحسين الأداء لتطبيقات رياكت نيتيف","دليل أنماط الكود لجافا سكريبت ورياكت","تحسينات الأصلية لآي أو إس وأندرويد","أدوات القياس والعملية لتحسين الأداء","أنماط الكود للتنمية السريعة والفعالة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["React Native优化","JavaScript优化","Native优化","打包优化","React Native最佳实践","性能优化"],"ja":["React Native最適化","JavaScript最適化","ネイティブ最適化","バンドル最適化","React Nativeベストプラクティス","パフォーマンス最適化"],"ko":["React Native 최적화","JavaScript 최적화","네이티브 최적화","번들 최적화","React Native 최고의 관행","성능 최적화"],"es":["react native","optimización de rendimiento","mejores prácticas","javascript","react","ios","android","empaquetado"],"fr":["react native","optimisation des performances","bonnes pratiques","javascript","react","ios","android","packaging"],"de":["react native","leistungsoptimierung","best practices","javascript","react","ios","android","packaging"],"pt":["React Native","Otimização de desempenho","JavaScript","React","Desenvolvimento móvel","Otimização de código","Padrões de código","Ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["React Native","Оптимизация производительности","JavaScript","React","Мобильная разработка","Оптимизация кода","Шаблоны кода","Инструменты разработки"],"ar":["رياكت نيتيف","تحسين الأداء","جافا سكريبت","رياكت","تطوير الهواتف المحمولة","تحسين الكود","أنماط الكود","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"Faizan1421","repo":"skills-Ai","repoPath":"Faizan1421/skills-Ai","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.424Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"react-native-best-practices","description":"Provides React Native performance optimization guidelines for FPS, TTI, bundle size, memory leaks, re-renders, and animations. Applies to tasks involving Hermes optimization, JS thread blocking, bridge overhead, FlashList, native modules, or debugging jank and frame drops.","tags":"react-native, expo, performance, optimization, profiling","bodyPreview":"# React Native Best Practices\n\n## Overview\n\nPerformance optimization guide for React Native applications, covering JavaScript/React, Native (iOS/Android), and bundling optimizations. Based on Callstack''s \"Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization\".\n\n## Skill Format\n\nEach reference file follows a hybrid format for fast lookup and deep understanding:\n\n- **Quick Pattern**: Incorrect/Correct code snippets for immediate pattern matching\n- **Quick Command**: Shell commands for process/measurement sk","body":"# React Native Best Practices\n\n## Overview\n\nPerformance optimization guide for React Native applications, covering JavaScript/React, Native (iOS/Android), and bundling optimizations. Based on Callstack''s \"Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization\".\n\n## Skill Format\n\nEach reference file follows a hybrid format for fast lookup and deep understanding:\n\n- **Quick Pattern**: Incorrect/Correct code snippets for immediate pattern matching\n- **Quick Command**: Shell commands for process/measurement skills\n- **Quick Config**: Configuration snippets for setup-focused skills\n- **Quick Reference**: Summary tables for conceptual skills\n- **Deep Dive**: Full context with When to Use, Prerequisites, Step-by-Step, Common Pitfalls\n\n**Impact ratings**: CRITICAL (fix immediately), HIGH (significant improvement), MEDIUM (worthwhile optimization)\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Debugging slow/janky UI or animations\n- Investigating memory leaks (JS or native)\n- Optimizing app startup time (TTI)\n- Reducing bundle or app size\n- Writing native modules (Turbo Modules)\n- Profiling React Native performance\n- Reviewing React Native code for performance\n\n## Priority-Ordered Guidelines\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | FPS & Re-renders | CRITICAL | `js-*` |\n| 2 | Bundle Size | CRITICAL | `bundle-*` |\n| 3 | TTI Optimization | HIGH | `native-*`, `bundle-*` |\n| 4 | Native Performance | HIGH | `native-*` |\n| 5 | Memory Management | MEDIUM-HIGH | `js-*`, `native-*` |\n| 6 | Animations | MEDIUM | `js-*` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Critical: FPS & Re-renders\n\n**Profile first:**\n```bash\n# Open React Native DevTools\n# Press ''j'' in Metro, or shake device → \"Open DevTools\"\n```\n\n**Common fixes:**\n- Replace ScrollView with FlatList/FlashList for lists\n- Use React Compiler for automatic memoization\n- Use atomic state (Jotai/Zustand) to reduce re-renders\n- Use `useDeferredValue` for expensive computations\n\n### Critical: Bundle Size\n\n**Analyze bundle:**\n```bash\nnpx react-native bundle \\\n  --entry-file index.js \\\n  --bundle-output output.js \\\n  --platform ios \\\n  --sourcemap-output output.js.map \\\n  --dev false --minify true\n\nnpx source-map-explorer output.js --no-border-checks\n```\n\n**Common fixes:**\n- Avoid barrel imports (import directly from source)\n- Remove unnecessary Intl polyfills (Hermes has native support)\n- Enable tree shaking (Expo SDK 52+ or Re.Pack)\n- Enable R8 for Android native code shrinking\n\n### High: TTI Optimization\n\n**Measure TTI:**\n- Use `react-native-performance` for markers\n- Only measure cold starts (exclude warm/hot/prewarm)\n\n**Common fixes:**\n- Disable JS bundle compression on Android (enables Hermes mmap)\n- Use native navigation (react-native-screens)\n- Defer non-critical work with `InteractionManager`\n\n### High: Native Performance\n\n**Profile native:**\n- iOS: Xcode Instruments → Time Profiler\n- Android: Android Studio → CPU Profiler\n\n**Common fixes:**\n- Use background threads for heavy native work\n- Prefer async over sync Turbo Module methods\n- Use C++ for cross-platform performance-critical code\n\n## References\n\nFull documentation with code examples in `references/`:\n\n### JavaScript/React (`js-*`)\n\n| File | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| `js-lists-flatlist-flashlist.md` | CRITICAL | Replace ScrollView with virtualized lists |\n| `js-profile-react.md` | MEDIUM | React DevTools profiling |\n| `js-measure-fps.md` | HIGH | FPS monitoring and measurement |\n| `js-memory-leaks.md` | MEDIUM | JS memory leak hunting |\n| `js-atomic-state.md` | HIGH | Jotai/Zustand patterns |\n| `js-concurrent-react.md` | HIGH | useDeferredValue, useTransition |\n| `js-react-compiler.md` | HIGH | Automatic memoization |\n| `js-animations-reanimated.md` | MEDIUM | Reanimated worklets |\n| `js-uncontrolled-components.md` | HIGH | TextInput optimization |\n\n### Native (`native-*`)\n\n| File | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| `native-turbo-modules.md` | HIGH | Building fast native modules |\n| `native-sdks-over-polyfills.md` | HIGH | Native vs JS libraries |\n| `native-measure-tti.md` | HIGH | TTI measurement setup |\n| `native-threading-model.md` | HIGH | Turbo Module threads |\n| `native-profiling.md` | MEDIUM | Xcode/Android Studio profiling |\n| `native-platform-setup.md` | MEDIUM | iOS/Android tooling guide |\n| `native-view-flattening.md` | MEDIUM | View hierarchy debugging |\n| `native-memory-patterns.md` | MEDIUM | C++/Swift/Kotlin memory |\n| `native-memory-leaks.md` | MEDIUM | Native memory leak hunting |\n| `native-android-16kb-alignment.md` | CRITICAL | Third-party library alignment for Google Play |\n\n### Bundling (`bundle-*`)\n\n| File | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| `bundle-barrel-exports.md` | CRITICAL | Avoid barrel imports |\n| `bundle-analyze-js.md` | CRITICAL | JS bundle visualization |\n| `bundle-tree-shaking.md` | HIGH | Dead code elimination |\n| `bundle-analyze-app.md` | HIGH | App size analysis |\n| `bundle-r8-android.md` | HIGH | Android code shrinking |\n| `bundle-hermes-mmap.md` | HIGH | Disable bundle compression |\n| `bundle-native-assets.md` | HIGH | Asset catalog setup |\n| `bundle-library-size.md` | MEDIUM | Evaluate dependencies |\n| `bundle-code-splitting.md` | MEDIUM | Re.Pack code splitting |\n\n## Searching References\n\n```bash\n# Find patterns by keyword\ngrep -l \"reanimated\" references/\ngrep -l \"flatlist\" references/\ngrep -l \"memory\" references/\ngrep -l \"profil\" references/\ngrep -l \"tti\" references/\ngrep -l \"bundle\" references/\n```\n\n## Problem → Skill Mapping\n\n| Problem | Start With |\n|---------|------------|\n| App feels slow/janky | `js-measure-fps.md` → `js-profile-react.md` |\n| Too many re-renders | `js-profile-react.md` → `js-react-compiler.md` |\n| Slow startup (TTI) | `native-measure-tti.md` → `bundle-analyze-js.md` |\n| Large app size | `bundle-analyze-app.md` → `bundle-r8-android.md` |\n| Memory growing | `js-memory-leaks.md` or `native-memory-leaks.md` |\n| Animation drops frames | `js-animations-reanimated.md` |\n| List scroll jank | `js-lists-flatlist-flashlist.md` |\n| TextInput lag | `js-uncontrolled-components.md` |\n| Native module slow | `native-turbo-modules.md` → `native-threading-model.md` |\n| Native library alignment issue | `native-android-16kb-alignment.md` |\n\n## Attribution\n\nBased on \"The Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization\" by Callstack.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:42:11.933Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Mobile App Agents needing optimized React Native performance and best practices","zh":"适合需要优化React Native性能和最佳实践的移动应用代理","ja":"React Nativeのパフォーマンスとベストプラクティスを最適化する必要があるモバイルアプリエージェントに適しています","ko":"React Native 성능과 모바일 앱 에이전트의 최적의 관행을 필요로 하는 경우에 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Aplicaciones Móviles que necesitan un rendimiento optimizado de React Native y las mejores prácticas","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''applications mobiles nécessitant des performances React Native optimisées et les meilleures pratiques","de":"Perfekt für Mobile App-Agents, die ein optimiertes React Native-Performance und Best Practices benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Aplicativos Móveis que necessitam de desempenho otimizado do React Native e melhores práticas","ru":"Идеально для агентов мобильных приложений, которым необходим оптимизированный React Native и лучшие практики","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطبيقات المحمولة الذي يحتاج إلى أداء محسّن ل React Native وأفضل الممارسات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize React Native applications with JavaScript, Native, and bundling optimizations, leveraging Callstack''s ''Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization'' and utilizing Quick Pattern and Quick Command formats for efficient lookup and process measurement","zh":"赋予代理优化React Native应用的能力，利用JavaScript、Native和打包优化，借助Callstack的''React Native优化终极指南''，并利用快速模式和快速命令格式进行高效的查找和过程测量","ja":"エージェントにReact Nativeアプリケーションを最適化する能力を付与し、JavaScript、ネイティブ、バンドル最適化を利用し、Callstackの「React Native最適化の究極のガイド」を利用し、効率的な検索とプロセス測定のためにクイックパターンとクイックコマンド形式を使用する","ko":"에이전트가 React Native 애플리케이션을 최적화할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 자바스크립트, 네이티브 및 번들 최적화를 활용하고, Callstack의 ''React Native 최적화 종합 가이드''를 활용하며, 효율적인 조회 및 프로세스 측정을 위해 빠른 패턴 및 빠른 명령 형식을 사용합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a optimizar aplicaciones React Native con JavaScript, Native y optimizaciones de empaquetado, aprovechando la ''Guía definitiva para la optimización de React Native'' de Callstack y utilizando formatos de comando y patrón rápido para una búsqueda y medición de procesos eficientes","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les applications React Native avec JavaScript, Native et des optimisations de regroupement, en exploitant le ''Guide ultime pour l''optimisation de React Native'' de Callstack et en utilisant des formats de commande et de modèle rapide pour une recherche et une mesure de processus efficaces","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, React Native-Anwendungen mit JavaScript, Native und Bündeloptimierungen zu optimieren, indem es Callstacks ''Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization'' nutzt und Quick Pattern- und Quick Command-Formate für effizientes Lookup und Prozessmessung verwendet","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar aplicações React Native com otimizações JavaScript, nativas e de empacotamento, aproveitando o ''Guia Ultimate para Otimização do React Native'' da Callstack e utilizando formatos de Padronização Rápida e Comando Rápido para busca e medição de processos eficientes","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать приложения React Native с помощью оптимизаций JavaScript, Native и упаковки, используя ''Ультимативное руководство по оптимизации React Native'' от Callstack и используя форматы Быстрого Шаблона и Быстрой Команды для эффективного поиска и измерения процессов","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تحسين تطبيقات React Native باستخدام تحسينات JavaScript والاصدارات الأصلية وتحسينات التعبئة، مستفيدا من ''دليل التحسين النهائي لتطبيقات React Native'' من Callstack واستخدام صيغ النمط السريع وأوامر السريع للبحث والقياس الفعال"},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing React Native app performance","Debugging JavaScript and Native code issues","Implementing bundling optimizations for faster load times"],"zh":["优化React Native应用性能","调试JavaScript和Native代码问题","实现打包优化以提高加载速度"],"ja":["React Nativeアプリケーションのパフォーマンスを最適化する","JavaScriptとネイティブコードの問題をデバッグする","バンドル最適化を実装してロード時間を短縮する"],"ko":["React Native 애플리케이션 성능 최적화","자바스크립트 및 네이티브 코드 문제 디버깅","번들 최적화를 구현하여 로드 시간을 단축"],"es":["Optimizar el rendimiento de la aplicación React Native","Depurar problemas de código JavaScript y Nativo","Implementar optimizaciones de empaquetado para tiempos de carga más rápidos"],"fr":["Optimiser les performances de l''application React Native","Déboguer les problèmes de code JavaScript et Natif","Mettre en œuvre des optimisations de regroupement pour des temps de chargement plus rapides"],"de":["Optimieren der Leistung der React Native-Anwendung","Debuggen von JavaScript- und Native-Code-Problemen","Implementi