"Оптимизация дохода","Анализ рыночных данных"],"ar":["تحليل المنافسين","تحديد الأسعارตาม القيمة","نماذج تسعير مرنة","تحسين الإيرادات","تحليل بيانات السوق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["SaaS 定价策略","软件即服务价格","价值捕获","增长驱动","客户支付意愿","价格策略设计"],"ja":["SaaSプライシング戦略","ソフトウェア即サービス価格","価値を 捕獲","成長を促進","顧客の支払い意欲","価格戦略設計"],"ko":["SaaS 가격 전략","소프트웨어 즉 서비스 가격","가치를 포착","성장과 고객의 지불 의지를 일치시키기","고객의 지불 의지","가격 전략 설계"],"es":["estrategia de precios SaaS","tarificación SaaS","precios basados en el valor","modelos de precios flexibles","análisis de la competencia","crecimiento empresarial"],"fr":["stratégie de tarification SaaS","tarification SaaS","prix basés sur la valeur","modèles de tarification flexibles","analyse de la concurrence","croissance entreprise"],"de":["SaaS-Preisstrategie","SaaS-Preisgestaltung","wertbasierte Preisgestaltung","flexible Preismodelle","Wettbewerbsanalyse","Unternehmenswachstum"],"pt":["estratégia de preços","SaaS","monetização","preços baseados em valor","modelos de preços","otimização de receita","análise de concorrentes"],"ru":["стратегия ценообразования","SaaS","монетизация","цены на основе ценности","модели ценообразования","оптимизация дохода","анализ конкурентов"],"ar":["استراتيجية التسعير","SaaS","تجارية","أسعار dựa على القيمة","نماذج التسعير","تحسين الإيرادات","تحليل المنافسين"]}},"owner":"nakafaai","repo":"nakafa.com","repoPath":"nakafaai/nakafa.com","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.424Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pricing-strategy","description":"When the user wants help with pricing decisions, packaging, or monetization strategy. Also use when the user mentions pricing, pricing tiers, freemium, free trial, packaging, price increase, value metric, Van Westendorp, willingness to pay, or monetization. This skill covers pricing research, tier structure, and packaging strategy.","bodyPreview":"# Pricing Strategy\n\nYou are an expert in SaaS pricing and monetization strategy. Your goal is to help design pricing that captures value, drives growth, and aligns with customer willingness to pay.\n\n## Before Starting\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nGather this context (ask if not provided):\n\n### 1. Busines","body":"# Pricing Strategy\n\nYou are an expert in SaaS pricing and monetization strategy. Your goal is to help design pricing that captures value, drives growth, and aligns with customer willingness to pay.\n\n## Before Starting\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nGather this context (ask if not provided):\n\n### 1. Business Context\n- What type of product? (SaaS, marketplace, e-commerce, service)\n- What''s your current pricing (if any)?\n- What''s your target market? (SMB, mid-market, enterprise)\n- What''s your go-to-market motion? (self-serve, sales-led, hybrid)\n\n### 2. Value & Competition\n- What''s the primary value you deliver?\n- What alternatives do customers consider?\n- How do competitors price?\n\n### 3. Current Performance\n- What''s your current conversion rate?\n- What''s your ARPU and churn rate?\n- Any feedback on pricing from customers/prospects?\n\n### 4. Goals\n- Optimizing for growth, revenue, or profitability?\n- Moving upmarket or expanding downmarket?\n\n---\n\n## Pricing Fundamentals\n\n### The Three Pricing Axes\n\n**1. Packaging** — What''s included at each tier?\n- Features, limits, support level\n- How tiers differ from each other\n\n**2. Pricing Metric** — What do you charge for?\n- Per user, per usage, flat fee\n- How price scales with value\n\n**3. Price Point** — How much do you charge?\n- The actual dollar amounts\n- Perceived value vs. cost\n\n### Value-Based Pricing\n\nPrice should be based on value delivered, not cost to serve:\n\n- **Customer''s perceived value** — The ceiling\n- **Your price** — Between alternatives and perceived value\n- **Next best alternative** — The floor for differentiation\n- **Your cost to serve** — Only a baseline, not the basis\n\n**Key insight:** Price between the next best alternative and perceived value.\n\n---\n\n## Value Metrics\n\n### What is a Value Metric?\n\nThe value metric is what you charge for—it should scale with the value customers receive.\n\n**Good value metrics:**\n- Align price with value delivered\n- Are easy to understand\n- Scale as customer grows\n- Are hard to game\n\n### Common Value Metrics\n\n| Metric | Best For | Example |\n|--------|----------|---------|\n| Per user/seat | Collaboration tools | Slack, Notion |\n| Per usage | Variable consumption | AWS, Twilio |\n| Per feature | Modular products | HubSpot add-ons |\n| Per contact/record | CRM, email tools | Mailchimp |\n| Per transaction | Payments, marketplaces | Stripe |\n| Flat fee | Simple products | Basecamp |\n\n### Choosing Your Value Metric\n\nAsk: \"As a customer uses more of [metric], do they get more value?\"\n- If yes → good value metric\n- If no → price doesn''t align with value\n\n---\n\n## Tier Structure Overview\n\n### Good-Better-Best Framework\n\n**Good tier (Entry):** Core features, limited usage, low price\n**Better tier (Recommended):** Full features, reasonable limits, anchor price\n**Best tier (Premium):** Everything, advanced features, 2-3x Better price\n\n### Tier Differentiation\n\n- **Feature gating** — Basic vs. advanced features\n- **Usage limits** — Same features, different limits\n- **Support level** — Email → Priority → Dedicated\n- **Access** — API, SSO, custom branding\n\n**For detailed tier structures and persona-based packaging**: See [references/tier-structure.md](references/tier-structure.md)\n\n---\n\n## Pricing Research\n\n### Van Westendorp Method\n\nFour questions that identify acceptable price range:\n1. Too expensive (wouldn''t consider)\n2. Too cheap (question quality)\n3. Expensive but might consider\n4. A bargain\n\nAnalyze intersections to find optimal pricing zone.\n\n### MaxDiff Analysis\n\nIdentifies which features customers value most:\n- Show sets of features\n- Ask: Most important? Least important?\n- Results inform tier packaging\n\n**For detailed research methods**: See [references/research-methods.md](references/research-methods.md)\n\n---\n\n## When to Raise Prices\n\n### Signs It''s Time\n\n**Market signals:**\n- Competitors have raised prices\n- Prospects don''t flinch at price\n- \"It''s so cheap!\" feedback\n\n**Business signals:**\n- Very high conversion rates (>40%)\n- Very low churn (<3% monthly)\n- Strong unit economics\n\n**Product signals:**\n- Significant value added since last pricing\n- Product more mature/stable\n\n### Price Increase Strategies\n\n1. **Grandfather existing** — New price for new customers only\n2. **Delayed increase** — Announce 3-6 months out\n3. **Tied to value** — Raise price but add features\n4. **Plan restructure** — Change plans entirely\n\n---\n\n## Pricing Page Best Practices\n\n### Above the Fold\n- Clear tier comparison table\n- Recommended tier highlighted\n- Monthly/annual toggle\n- Primary CTA for each tier\n\n### Common Elements\n- Feature comparison table\n- Who each tier is for\n- FAQ section\n- Annual discount callout (17-20%)\n- Money-back guarantee\n- Customer logos/trust signals\n\n### Pricing Psychology\n- **Anchoring:** Show higher-priced option first\n- **Decoy effect:** Middle tier should be best value\n- **Charm pricing:** $49 vs. $50 (for value-focused)\n- **Round pricing:** $50 vs. $49 (for premium)\n\n---\n\n## Pricing Checklist\n\n### Before Setting Prices\n- [ ] Defined target customer personas\n- [ ] Researched competitor pricing\n- [ ] Identified your value metric\n- [ ] Conducted willingness-to-pay research\n- [ ] Mapped features to tiers\n\n### Pricing Structure\n- [ ] Chosen number of tiers\n- [ ] Differentiated tiers clearly\n- [ ] Set price points based on research\n- [ ] Created annual discount strategy\n- [ ] Planned enterprise/custom tier\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What pricing research have you done?\n2. What''s your current ARPU and conversion rate?\n3. What''s your primary value metric?\n4. Who are your main pricing personas?\n5. Are you self-serve, sales-led, or hybrid?\n6. What pricing changes are you considering?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **page-cro**: For optimizing pricing page conversion\n- **copywriting**: For pricing page copy\n- **marketing-psychology**: For pricing psychology principles\n- **ab-test-setup**: For testing pricing changes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:43:17.445Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for SaaS-focused AI Agents needing advanced pricing strategy optimization and monetization capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高级定价策略优化和货币化能力的SaaS焦点AI代理。","ja":"SaaSに焦点を当てたAIエージェントが高度な価格戦略の最適化と収益化の機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 가격 전략 최적화 및 수익화 기능이 필요한 SaaS 중심 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de inteligencia artificial centrados en SaaS que necesitan una optimización avanzada de la estrategia de precios y capacidades de monetización.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA axés sur le SaaS ayant besoin d''une optimisation avancée de la stratégie de tarification et de capacités de monétisation.","de":"Perfekt für SaaS-fokussierte KI-Agents, die eine erweiterte Preisstrategie-Optimierung und Monetarisierungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA focados em SaaS que necessitam de otimização de estratégia de preços avançada e capacidades de monetização.","ru":"Идеально для AI-агентов, ориентированных на SaaS, которым необходима продвинутая оптимизация стратегии ценообразования и возможности монетизации.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يركزون على SaaS و الذين يحتاجون إلى تحسين استراتيجية التسعير المتقدمة و إمكانيات تعبئة الأموال."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to capture value, drive growth, and align with customer willingness to pay using SaaS pricing and monetization strategies, incorporating product marketing context from files like `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` and understanding business specifics.","zh":"赋予代理人通过SaaS定价和货币化策略捕获价值、驱动增长和与客户支付意愿保持一致的能力，结合来自文件（如`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`）的产品营销背景，并理解业务具体情况。","ja":"SaaSの価格設定と収益化戦略を使用して、価値を捉え、成長を促進し、顧客の支払い意欲と一致させるエージェントを可能にします。`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`などのファイルからの製品マーケティングのコンテキストを組み込み、ビジネスの特定の状況を理解することを含みます。","ko":"SaaS 가격 및 수익화 전략을 사용하여 가치를 포착하고 성장률을 향상하며 고객의 지불 의지와 일치하도록 에이전트를 활성화합니다. `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`와 같은 파일에서 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트를 통합하고 비즈니스 특정 상황을 이해하는 것을 포함합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a capturar valor, impulsar el crecimiento y alinearse con la voluntad del cliente de pagar utilizando estrategias de precios y monetización de SaaS, incorporando el contexto de marketing de productos de archivos como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` y comprendiendo las especificidades empresariales.","fr":"Permet aux agents de capter la valeur, de stimuler la croissance et de s''aligner sur la volonté des clients de payer en utilisant des stratégies de tarification et de monétisation SaaS, en intégrant le contexte de marketing de produit à partir de fichiers tels que `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` et en comprenant les spécificités commerciales.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Wert zu erfassen, Wachstum zu fördern und mit der Zahlungsbereitschaft der Kunden übereinzustimmen, indem SaaS-Preis- und Monetarisierungsstrategien verwendet werden, die den Produktmarketing-Kontext aus Dateien wie `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` einbeziehen und die geschäftsspezifischen Aspekte verstehen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a capturar valor, impulsionar o crescimento e alinhar com a disposição do cliente para pagar usando estratégias de preços e monetização do SaaS, incorporando o contexto de marketing de produtos de arquivos como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` e entendendo os detalhes comerciais.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью захватить ценность, стимулировать рост и согласовать с готовностью клиента платить, используя стратегии ценообразования и монетизации SaaS, включающие контекст маркетинга продукта из файлов, таких как `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`, и понимание деловых деталей.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من التقاط القيمة و تحفيز النمو و التناغم مع استعداد العميل للدفع باستخدام استراتيجيات التسعير و تعبئة الأموال SaaS، و التي تدمج سياق تسويق المنتج من الملفات مثل `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` و فهم تفاصيل الأعمال."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing pricing models that drive customer acquisition","Analyzing product marketing context for informed pricing decisions","Developing monetization strategies aligned with customer value"],"zh":["设计驱动客户获取的定价模型","分析产品营销背景以做出明智的定价决策","开发与客户价值保持一致的货币化策略"],"ja":["顧客の獲得を促進する価格モデルを設計する","製品マーケティングの背景を分析して情報に基づいた価格決定を行う","顧客の価値と一致する収益化戦略を開発する"],"ko":["고객 획득을 촉진하는 가격 모델을 설계합니다.","제품 마케팅 배경을 분석하여 정보에 기반한 가격 결정","고객 가치와 일치하는 수익화 전략을 개발합니다."],"es":["Diseñar modelos de precios que impulsen la adquisición de clientes","Analizar el contexto de marketing de productos para tomar decisiones de precios informadas","Desarrollar estrategias de monetización alineadas con el valor del cliente"],"fr":["Concevoir des modèles de tarification qui stimulent l''acquisition de clients","Analyser le contexte de marketing de produit pour prendre des décisions de tarification éclairées","Développer des stratégies de monétisation alignées sur la valeur du client"],"de":["Preismodelle entwerfen, die die Kundenakquise antreiben","Produktmarketing-Kontext analysieren, um fundierte Preisentscheidungen zu treffen","Monetarisierungsstrategien entwickeln, die mit dem Kundenwert übereinstimmen"],"pt":["Projetar modelos de preços que impulsionam a aquisição de clientes","Analisar o contexto de marketing de produtos para decisões de preços informadas","Desenvolver estratégias de monetização alinhadas com o valor do cliente"],"ru":["Проектирование моделей ценообразования, которые стимулируют приобретение клиентов","Анализ контекста маркетинга продукта для принятия обоснованных решений по ценообразованию","Разработка стратегий монетизации, согласованных с ценностью клиента"],"ar":["تصميم نماذج الأسعار التي تدفع استحواذ العملاء","تحليل سياق تسويق المنتج لاتخاذ قرارات تسعير مدروسة","تطوير استراتيجيات تعبئة الأموال المتناسقة مع قيمة العملاء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to product marketing context files","Needs specific business and market data for effective strategy design"],"zh":["需要访问产品营销背景文件","需要具体的业务和市场数据来设计有效的策略"],"ja":["製品マーケティングの背景ファイルへのアクセスが必要","効果的な戦略を設計するために特定のビジネスと市場データが必要"],"ko":["제품 마케팅 배경 파일에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다.","유효한 전략을 설계하기 위해 구체적인 비즈니스 및 시장 데이터가 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere acceso a archivos de contexto de marketing de productos","Necesita datos comerciales y de mercado específicos para un diseño de estrategia eficaz"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux fichiers de contexte de marketing de produit","Besoin de données commerciales et de marché spécifiques pour une conception de stratégie efficace"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf Produktmarketing-Kontext-Dateien","Benötigt spezifische Geschäfts- und Marktdaten für eine effektive Strategie-Entwicklung"],"pt":["Exige acesso a arquivos de contexto de marketing de produtos","Necessita de dados de negócios e mercados específicos para projeto de estratégia eficaz"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлам контекста маркетинга продукта","Требует конкретных бизнес- и рыночных данных для эффективного проектирования стратегии"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملفات سياق تسويق المنتج","يحتاج إلى بيانات أعمال و سوق محددة لتصميم استراتيجية فعالة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('lobehub/lobehub/hotkey', 'community', 'lobehub', 'lobehub', 'lobehub/lobehub', 'hotkey', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.424Z', '2026-02-18T04:43:13.171Z', NULL, '{"id":"lobehub/lobehub/hotkey","name":"hotkey","description":{"zh":"Hotkey 功能允许您添加自定义键盘快捷键，以提高工作效率。通过以下步骤，您可以轻松添加新的热键","ja":"ホットキー機能により、カスタムキーボードショートカットを追加してワークエフィシエンシーを高めることができます。以下の手順に従って、新しいホットキーを追加できます","ko":"핫키 기능을 사용하면 작업 효율성을 높이기 위해 사용자 정의 키보드 단축키를 추가할 수 있습니다. 아래 단계를 따라 새로운 핫키를 추가할 수 있습니다","es":"Hotkey es una herramienta que permite agregar atajos de teclado personalizados para mejorar la productividad","fr":"Hotkey est un outil qui permet d''ajouter des raccourcis clavier personnalisés pour améliorer la productivité","de":"Hotkey ist ein Tool, das die Hinzufügung benutzerdefinierter Tastenkombinationen zur Steigerung der Produktivität ermöglicht","pt":"O Hotkey é uma funcionalidade que permite adicionar atalhos de teclado personalizados ao seu projeto. Aprenda a configurá-lo com nosso guia.","ru":"Hotkey - это функция, которая позволяет добавлять пользовательские горячие клавиши в ваш проект. Узнайте, как ее настроить с помощью нашего руководства.","ar":"الـ Hotkey هو ميزة تسمح بإضافة اختصارات لوحة المفاتيح المخصصة إلى مشروعك. تعلم كيفية تشغيلها باستخدام دليلنا.","en":"The ultimate space for work and life — to find, build, and collaborate with agent teammates that grow with you. We are taking agent harness to the next level — enabling multi-agent collaboration, effortless agent team design, and introducing agents as the unit of work interaction."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Hotkey 功能开发指南","ja":"Hotkey 機能開発ガイド","ko":"핫키 기능 개발 가이드","es":"Atajos de teclado personalizados con Hotkey","fr":"Raccourcis clavier personnalisés avec Hotkey","de":"Benutzerdefinierte Tastenkombinationen mit Hotkey","pt":"Atalhos de Teclado: Guia de Hotkeys","ru":"Горячие к