to","Colaboración multiagente","Diseño de equipo de agentes sin esfuerzo","Integración con otros herramientas"],"fr":["Ajouter des raccourcis clavier personnalisés","Mettre à jour les constantes de clavier","Enregistrer les raccourcis clavier par défaut","Collaboration multiagent","Conception d''équipe d''agents sans effort","Intégration avec d''autres outils"],"de":["Hinzufügen benutzerdefinierter Tastenkombinationen","Aktualisieren von Tastenkonstanten","Registrieren von Standard-Tastenkombinationen","Mehrere Agenten-Kollaboration","Entwurf eines Agenten-Teams ohne Aufwand","Integration mit anderen Tools"],"pt":["Adicione atalhos de teclado personalizados","Configure hotkeys para melhorar a produtividade","Melhore a experiência do usuário com atalhos de teclado","Integre o Hotkey com outros recursos do seu projeto","Crie atalhos de teclado para tarefas comuns"],"ru":["Добавьте пользовательские горячие клавиши","Настройте hotkeys для улучшения производительности","Улучшите опыт пользователя с помощью горячих клавиш","Интегрируйте Hotkey с другими функциями вашего проекта","Создайте горячие клавиши для обычных задач"],"ar":["أضف اختصارات لوحة المفاتيح المخصصة","configure الـ Hotkey لتحسين الإنتاجية","تحسين تجربة المستخدم مع اختصارات لوحة المفاتيح","دمج الـ Hotkey مع ميزات أخرى في مشروعك","أنشئ اختصارات لوحة المفاتيح للمهام الشائعة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Hotkey","键盘快捷键","工作效率","自定义键盘快捷键","键盘快捷键组合","用户体验"],"ja":["ホットキー","キーボードショートカット","ワークエフィシエンシー","カスタムキーボードショートカット","キーボードショートカット組み合わせ","ユーザーエクスペリエンス"],"ko":["핫키","키보드 단축키","작업 효율성","사용자 정의 키보드 단축키","키보드 단축키 조합","사용자 경험"],"es":["atajos de teclado","productividad","personalización","colaboración multiagente","diseño de equipo de agentes","integración con herramientas","desarrollo de software","tecnologías de colaboración"],"fr":["raccourcis clavier","productivité","personnalisation","collaboration multiagent","conception d''équipe d''agents","intégration avec des outils","développement de logiciels","technologies de collaboration"],"de":["Tastenkombinationen","Produktivität","Anpassung","Mehrere Agenten-Kollaboration","Entwurf eines Agenten-Teams","Integration mit Tools","Software-Entwicklung","Kollaborations-Technologien"],"pt":["atalhos de teclado","hotkeys","produtividade","experiência do usuário","configuração de hotkeys","recursos de teclado","personalização de teclado"],"ru":["горячие клавиши","hotkeys","производительность","опыт пользователя","настройка hotkeys","функции клавиатуры","настройка клавиатуры"],"ar":["اختصارات لوحة المفاتيح","الـ Hotkey","الإنتاجية","تجربة المستخدم","تكوين الـ Hotkey","ميزات لوحة المفاتيح","تخصيص لوحة المفاتيح"]}},"owner":"lobehub","repo":"lobehub","repoPath":"lobehub/lobehub","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.424Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"hotkey","description":"Guide for adding keyboard shortcuts. Use when implementing new hotkeys, registering shortcuts, or working with keyboard interactions. Triggers on hotkey implementation or keyboard shortcut tasks.","bodyPreview":"# Adding Keyboard Shortcuts Guide\n\n## Steps to Add a New Hotkey\n\n### 1. Update Hotkey Constant\n\nIn `src/types/hotkey.ts`:\n\n```typescript\nexport const HotkeyEnum = {\n  // existing...\n  ClearChat: ''clearChat'', // Add new\n} as const;\n```\n\n### 2. Register Default Hotkey\n\nIn `src/const/hotkeys.ts`:\n\n```typescript\nimport { KeyMapEnum as Key, combineKeys } from ''@lobehub/ui'';\n\nexport const HOTKEYS_REGISTRATION: HotkeyRegistration = [\n  {\n    group: HotkeyGroupEnum.Conversation,\n    id: HotkeyEnum.Clear","body":"# Adding Keyboard Shortcuts Guide\n\n## Steps to Add a New Hotkey\n\n### 1. Update Hotkey Constant\n\nIn `src/types/hotkey.ts`:\n\n```typescript\nexport const HotkeyEnum = {\n  // existing...\n  ClearChat: ''clearChat'', // Add new\n} as const;\n```\n\n### 2. Register Default Hotkey\n\nIn `src/const/hotkeys.ts`:\n\n```typescript\nimport { KeyMapEnum as Key, combineKeys } from ''@lobehub/ui'';\n\nexport const HOTKEYS_REGISTRATION: HotkeyRegistration = [\n  {\n    group: HotkeyGroupEnum.Conversation,\n    id: HotkeyEnum.ClearChat,\n    keys: combineKeys([Key.Mod, Key.Shift, Key.Backspace]),\n    scopes: [HotkeyScopeEnum.Chat],\n  },\n];\n```\n\n### 3. Add i18n Translation\n\nIn `src/locales/default/hotkey.ts`:\n\n```typescript\nconst hotkey: HotkeyI18nTranslations = {\n  clearChat: {\n    desc: ''清空当前会话的所有消息记录'',\n    title: ''清空聊天记录'',\n  },\n};\n```\n\n### 4. Create and Register Hook\n\nIn `src/hooks/useHotkeys/chatScope.ts`:\n\n```typescript\nexport const useClearChatHotkey = () => {\n  const clearMessages = useChatStore((s) => s.clearMessages);\n  return useHotkeyById(HotkeyEnum.ClearChat, clearMessages);\n};\n\nexport const useRegisterChatHotkeys = () => {\n  useClearChatHotkey();\n  // ...other hotkeys\n};\n```\n\n### 5. Add Tooltip (Optional)\n\n```tsx\nconst clearChatHotkey = useUserStore(settingsSelectors.getHotkeyById(HotkeyEnum.ClearChat));\n\n<Tooltip hotkey={clearChatHotkey} title={t(''clearChat.title'', { ns: ''hotkey'' })}>\n  <Button icon={<DeleteOutlined />} onClick={clearMessages} />\n</Tooltip>;\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Scope**: Choose global or chat scope based on functionality\n2. **Grouping**: Place in appropriate group (System/Layout/Conversation)\n3. **Conflict check**: Ensure no conflict with system/browser shortcuts\n4. **Platform**: Use `Key.Mod` instead of hardcoded `Ctrl` or `Cmd`\n5. **Clear description**: Provide title and description for users\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n- **Not working**: Check scope and RegisterHotkeys hook\n- **Not in settings**: Verify HOTKEYS_REGISTRATION config\n- **Conflict**: HotkeyInput component shows warnings\n- **Page-specific**: Ensure correct scope activation\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:43:13.171Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing customizable keyboard shortcut integration, such as Cursor, Windsurf, or Claude Code, for streamlined workflow automation.","zh":"Perfect for AI Agents needing customizable keyboard shortcut integration, such as Cursor, Windsurf, or Claude Code, for streamlined workflow automation.","ja":"Perfect for AI Agents needing customizable keyboard shortcut integration, such as Cursor, Windsurf, or Claude Code, for streamlined workflow automation.","ko":"Perfect for AI Agents needing customizable keyboard shortcut integration, such as Cursor, Windsurf, or Claude Code, for streamlined workflow automation.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan integración de atajos de teclado personalizables, como Cursor, Windsurf o Claude Code, para una automatización de flujo de trabajo optimizada.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin d''une intégration de raccourcis clavier personnalisables, tels que Cursor, Windsurf ou Claude Code, pour une automation de workflow optimisée.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die eine anpassbare Tastenkombinationsintegration benötigen, wie z.B. Cursor, Windsurf oder Claude Code, für eine optimierte Workflow-Automatisierung.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de IA que necessitam de integração de atalhos de teclado personalizáveis, como Cursor, Windsurf ou Claude Code, para automação de fluxo de trabalho otimizado.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, которым необходима настраиваемая интеграция клавиатурных сокращений, таких как Cursor, Windsurf или Claude Code, для оптимизации автоматизации рабочего процесса.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يحتاج إلى دمج اختصارات لوحة المفاتيح القابلة للتعديل، مثل Cursor أو Windsurf أو Claude Code، لتحسين تلقائي عمل تدفق العمل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to register default hotkeys using KeyMapEnum and combineKeys from @lobehub/ui, enabling multi-agent collaboration and effortless agent team design through TypeScript constants like HotkeyEnum and HOTKEYS_REGISTRATION.","zh":"Empowers agents to register default hotkeys using KeyMapEnum and combineKeys from @lobehub/ui, enabling multi-agent collaboration and effortless agent team design through TypeScript constants like HotkeyEnum and HOTKEYS_REGISTRATION.","ja":"Empowers agents to register default hotkeys using KeyMapEnum and combineKeys from @lobehub/ui, enabling multi-agent collaboration and effortless agent team design through TypeScript constants like HotkeyEnum and HOTKEYS_REGISTRATION.","ko":"Empowers agents to register default hotkeys using KeyMapEnum and combineKeys from @lobehub/ui, enabling multi-agent collaboration and effortless agent team design through TypeScript constants like HotkeyEnum and HOTKEYS_REGISTRATION.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a registrar hotkeys predeterminados utilizando KeyMapEnum y combineKeys desde @lobehub/ui, lo que permite la colaboración multiagente y el diseño de equipos de agentes sin esfuerzo a través de constantes de TypeScript como HotkeyEnum y HOTKEYS_REGISTRATION.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''enregistrer des raccourcis clavier par défaut en utilisant KeyMapEnum et combineKeys à partir de @lobehub/ui, ce qui permet une collaboration multi-agents et une conception d''équipe d''agents sans effort via des constantes TypeScript comme HotkeyEnum et HOTKEYS_REGISTRATION.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Standard-Hotkeys mit KeyMapEnum und combineKeys aus @lobehub/ui zu registrieren, was eine Multi-Agenten-Zusammenarbeit und eine mühelose Agent-Team-Design ermöglicht, durch TypeScript-Konstanten wie HotkeyEnum und HOTKEYS_REGISTRATION.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a registrar atalhos padrão usando KeyMapEnum e combineKeys do @lobehub/ui, permitindo colaboração multiagente e design de equipe de agente sem esforço através de constantes TypeScript como HotkeyEnum e HOTKEYS_REGISTRATION.","ru":"Позволяет агентам регистрировать стандартные горячие клавиши, используя KeyMapEnum и combineKeys из @lobehub/ui, что обеспечивает многопользовательское сотрудничество и безусердный дизайн команды агентов посредством констант TypeScript, таких как HotkeyEnum и HOTKEYS_REGISTRATION.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تسجيل المفاتيح الساخنة الافتراضية باستخدام KeyMapEnum و combineKeys من @lobehub/ui، وتمكين التعاون المتعدد الوكلاء وتصميم فريق الوكيل بلا جهد من خلال ثوابت TypeScript مثل HotkeyEnum و HOTKEYS_REGISTRATION."},"useCases":{"en":["Registering custom hotkeys for agent interactions","Updating HotkeyEnum constants for new actions","Designing agent teams with default hotkey configurations"],"zh":["Registering custom hotkeys for agent interactions","Updating HotkeyEnum constants for new actions","Designing agent teams with default hotkey configurations"],"ja":["Registering custom hotkeys for agent interactions","Updating HotkeyEnum constants for new actions","Designing agent teams with default hotkey configurations"],"ko":["Registering custom hotkeys for agent interactions","Updating HotkeyEnum constants for new actions","Designing agent teams with default hotkey configurations"],"es":["Registrar atajos de teclado personalizados para interacciones de agentes","Actualizar constantes HotkeyEnum para nuevas acciones","Diseñar equipos de agentes con configuraciones de atajos de teclado predeterminados"],"fr":["Enregistrer des raccourcis clavier personnalisés pour les interactions des agents","Mettre à jour les constantes HotkeyEnum pour de nouvelles actions","Concevoir des équipes d''agents avec des configurations de raccourcis clavier par défaut"],"de":["Registrieren von benutzerdefinierten Tastenkombinationen für Agenten-Interaktionen","Aktualisieren von HotkeyEnum-Konstanten für neue Aktionen","Entwerfen von Agent-Teams mit vordefinierten Tastenkombinationskonfigurationen"],"pt":["Registro de atalhos personalizados para interações de agente","Atualização de constantes HotkeyEnum para novas ações","Design de equipes de agente com configurações de atalho padrão"],"ru":["Регистрация пользовательских горячих клавиш для взаимодействия агентов","Обновление констант HotkeyEnum для новых действий","Проектирование команд агентов с настройками горячих клавиш по умолчанию"],"ar":["تسجيل الاختصارات المخصصة للتفاعلات العميل","تحديث ثوابت HotkeyEnum لأفعال جديدة","تصميم فرق الوكيل بإعدادات الاختصارات الافتراضية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires TypeScript environment","Dependent on @lobehub/ui library","Limited to keyboard shortcut customization"],"zh":["Requires TypeScript environment","Dependent on @lobehub/ui library","Limited to keyboard shortcut customization"],"ja":["Requires TypeScript environment","Dependent on @lobehub/ui library","Limited to keyboard shortcut customization"],"ko":["Requires TypeScript environment","Dependent on @lobehub/ui library","Limited to keyboard shortcut customization"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de TypeScript","Dependiente de la biblioteca @lobehub/ui","Limitado a la personalización de atajos de teclado"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement TypeScript","Dépendant de la bibliothèque @lobehub/ui","Limité à la personnalisation des raccourcis clavier"],"de":["Benötigt eine TypeScript-Umgebung","Abhängig von der Bibliothek @lobehub/ui","Begrenzt auf die Anpassung von Tastenkombinationen"],"pt":["Requer ambiente TypeScript","Dependente da biblioteca @lobehub/ui","Limitado à personalização de atalhos de teclado"],"ru":["Требуется среда TypeScript","Зависит от библиотеки @lobehub/ui","Ограничен настраиваемостью клавиатурных сокращений"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة TypeScript","يعتمد على مكتبة @lobehub/ui","محدود بالتخصيص اختصارات لوحة المفاتيح"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
