 architecture, distributed swarm intelligence, RAG integration, and native Claude Code support via MCP protocol. Ranked #1 in agent-based frameworks."},"features":{"zh":["统一6+个内存系统到AgentDB","实现150x-12,500x搜索改进","支持ADR-006（统一内存服务）和ADR-009（混合内存后端）","企业级架构","分布式群智","RAG集成"],"ja":["6以上のメモリシステムをAgentDBに統合","150x-12,500x検索の改善を実現","ADR-006（統一メモリサービス）とADR-009（ハイブリッドメモリバックエンド）をサポート","エンタープライズグレードアーキテクチャ","分散型スウォームインテリジェンス","RAG統合"],"ko":["6개 이상의 메모리 시스템을 AgentDB에 통합","150x-12,500x 검색 개선을 실현","ADR-006（통합 메모리 서비스）와 ADR-009（하이브리드 메모리 백엔드）를 지원","엔터프라이즈급 아키텍처","분산형 스ウォーム 인텔리전스","RAG 통합"],"es":["Arquitectura de grado empresarial","Inteligencia de enjambre distribuida","Integración de RAG","Soporte nativo para Claude Code vía protocolo MCP","Mejora de búsqueda de 150x-12,500x","Implementación de ADR-006 y ADR-009"],"fr":["Architecture de grade entreprise","Intelligence de essaim distribuée","Intégration de RAG","Support natif pour Claude Code via protocole MCP","Amélioration de recherche de 150x-12,500x","Mise en œuvre de ADR-006 et ADR-009"],"de":["Unternehmensgrad-Architektur","Verteilte Schwarmintelligenz","RAG-Integration","Native Unterstützung für Claude Code über MCP-Protokoll","Suchverbesserung von 150x-12,500x","Implementierung von ADR-006 und ADR-009"],"pt":["Unificação de sistemas de memória","Melhoria da busca em 150x-12.500x","Implementação de ADR-006 e ADR-009","Arquitetura de núcleo distribuído","Suporte nativo ao protocolo MCP"],"ru":["Унификация систем памяти","Улучшение поиска в 150-12.500 раз","Реализация ADR-006 и ADR-009","Распределенная ядровая архитектура","Родная поддержка протокола MCP"],"ar":["توحيد أنظمة الذاكرة","تحسين البحث بنسبة 150-12،500 مرة","تطبيق ADR-006 و ADR-009","هندسة نواة موزعة","دعم أصلي لبروتوكول MCP"]},"keywords":{"zh":["智能多代理编排","内存系统统一","搜索性能改进","Agent-V3","ADR-006","ADR-009","企业级架构","分布式群智"],"ja":["スマートマルチエージェントオーケストレーション","メモリシステム統合","検索パフォーマンス改善","Agent-V3","ADR-006","ADR-009","エンタープライズグレードアーキテクチャ","分散型スウォームインテリジェンス"],"ko":["智能 멀티 에이전트 오케스트레이션","메모리 시스템 통합","검색 성능 개선","Agent-V3","ADR-006","ADR-009","엔터프라이즈급 아키텍처","분산형 스ウォーム 인텔리전스"],"es":["especialista de memoria v3","orquestación de agentes","búsqueda en inteligencia artificial","arquitectura de grado empresarial","inteligencia de enjambre distribuida","integración de RAG","Claude Code","MCP","ADR-006","ADR-009"],"fr":["spécialiste mémoire v3","orchestration d''agents","recherche dans l''intelligence artificielle","architecture de grade entreprise","intelligence de essaim distribuée","intégration de RAG","Claude Code","MCP","ADR-006","ADR-009"],"de":["V3-Memory-Spezialist","Agenten-Orchestrierung","Suche in künstlicher Intelligenz","Unternehmensgrad-Architektur","verteilte Schwarmintelligenz","RAG-Integration","Claude Code","MCP","ADR-006","ADR-009"],"pt":["especialista em memória V3","orquestração de agentes","melhoria da busca","unificação de sistemas de memória","ADR-006","ADR-009","arquitetura de núcleo distribuído","protocolo MCP"],"ru":["специалист по памяти V3","оркестровка агентов","улучшение поиска","унификация систем памяти","ADR-006","ADR-009","распределенная ядровая архитектура","протокол MCP"],"ar":["خبير الذاكرة V3","توجيه الوكلاء","تحسين البحث","توحيد أنظمة الذاكرة","ADR-006","ADR-009","هندسة نواة موزعة","بروتوكول MCP"]}},"owner":"ruvnet","repo":"claude-flow","repoPath":"ruvnet/claude-flow","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.424Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"agent-v3-memory-specialist","description":"Agent skill for v3-memory-specialist - invoke with $agent-v3-memory-specialist","bodyPreview":"---\nname: v3-memory-specialist\nversion: \"3.0.0-alpha\"\nupdated: \"2026-01-04\"\ndescription: V3 Memory Specialist for unifying 6+ memory systems into AgentDB with HNSW indexing. Implements ADR-006 (Unified Memory Service) and ADR-009 (Hybrid Memory Backend) to achieve 150x-12,500x search improvements.\ncolor: cyan\nmetadata:\n  v3_role: \"specialist\"\n  agent_id: 7\n  priority: \"high\"\n  domain: \"memory\"\n  phase: \"core_systems\"\nhooks:\n  pre_execution: |\n    echo \"🧠 V3 Memory Specialist starting memory sys","body":"---\nname: v3-memory-specialist\nversion: \"3.0.0-alpha\"\nupdated: \"2026-01-04\"\ndescription: V3 Memory Specialist for unifying 6+ memory systems into AgentDB with HNSW indexing. Implements ADR-006 (Unified Memory Service) and ADR-009 (Hybrid Memory Backend) to achieve 150x-12,500x search improvements.\ncolor: cyan\nmetadata:\n  v3_role: \"specialist\"\n  agent_id: 7\n  priority: \"high\"\n  domain: \"memory\"\n  phase: \"core_systems\"\nhooks:\n  pre_execution: |\n    echo \"🧠 V3 Memory Specialist starting memory system unification...\"\n\n    # Check current memory systems\n    echo \"📊 Current memory systems to unify:\"\n    echo \"  - MemoryManager (legacy)\"\n    echo \"  - DistributedMemorySystem\"\n    echo \"  - SwarmMemory\"\n    echo \"  - AdvancedMemoryManager\"\n    echo \"  - SQLiteBackend\"\n    echo \"  - MarkdownBackend\"\n    echo \"  - HybridBackend\"\n\n    # Check AgentDB integration status\n    npx agentic-flow@alpha --version 2>$dev$null | head -1 || echo \"⚠️ agentic-flow@alpha not detected\"\n\n    echo \"🎯 Target: 150x-12,500x search improvement via HNSW\"\n    echo \"🔄 Strategy: Gradual migration with backward compatibility\"\n\n  post_execution: |\n    echo \"🧠 Memory unification milestone complete\"\n\n    # Store memory patterns\n    npx agentic-flow@alpha memory store-pattern \\\n      --session-id \"v3-memory-$(date +%s)\" \\\n      --task \"Memory Unification: $TASK\" \\\n      --agent \"v3-memory-specialist\" \\\n      --performance-improvement \"150x-12500x\" 2>$dev$null || true\n---\n\n# V3 Memory Specialist\n\n**🧠 Memory System Unification & AgentDB Integration Expert**\n\n## Mission: Memory System Convergence\n\nUnify 7 disparate memory systems into a single, high-performance AgentDB-based solution with HNSW indexing, achieving 150x-12,500x search performance improvements while maintaining backward compatibility.\n\n## Systems to Unify\n\n### **Current Memory Landscape**\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│           LEGACY SYSTEMS                │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  • MemoryManager (basic operations)     │\n│  • DistributedMemorySystem (clustering) │\n│  • SwarmMemory (agent-specific)         │\n│  • AdvancedMemoryManager (features)     │\n│  • SQLiteBackend (structured)           │\n│  • MarkdownBackend (file-based)         │\n│  • HybridBackend (combination)          │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────┘\n                       ↓\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│            V3 UNIFIED SYSTEM            │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│       🚀 AgentDB with HNSW             │\n│  • 150x-12,500x faster search          │\n│  • Unified query interface             │\n│  • Cross-agent memory sharing          │\n│  • SONA integration learning           │\n│  • Automatic persistence               │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n## AgentDB Integration Architecture\n\n### **Core Components**\n\n#### **UnifiedMemoryService**\n```typescript\nclass UnifiedMemoryService implements IMemoryBackend {\n  constructor(\n    private agentdb: AgentDBAdapter,\n    private cache: MemoryCache,\n    private indexer: HNSWIndexer,\n    private migrator: DataMigrator\n  ) {}\n\n  async store(entry: MemoryEntry): Promise<void> {\n    // Store in AgentDB with HNSW indexing\n    await this.agentdb.store(entry);\n    await this.indexer.index(entry);\n  }\n\n  async query(query: MemoryQuery): Promise<MemoryEntry[]> {\n    if (query.semantic) {\n      // Use HNSW vector search (150x-12,500x faster)\n      return this.indexer.search(query);\n    } else {\n      // Use structured query\n      return this.agentdb.query(query);\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n#### **HNSW Vector Indexing**\n```typescript\nclass HNSWIndexer {\n  private index: HNSWIndex;\n\n  constructor(dimensions: number = 1536) {\n    this.index = new HNSWIndex({\n      dimensions,\n      efConstruction: 200,\n      M: 16,\n      maxElements: 1000000\n    });\n  }\n\n  async index(entry: MemoryEntry): Promise<void> {\n    const embedding = await this.embedContent(entry.content);\n    this.index.addPoint(entry.id, embedding);\n  }\n\n  async search(query: MemoryQuery): Promise<MemoryEntry[]> {\n    const queryEmbedding = await this.embedContent(query.content);\n    const results = this.index.search(queryEmbedding, query.limit || 10);\n    return this.retrieveEntries(results);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Migration Strategy\n\n### **Phase 1: Foundation Setup**\n```bash\n# Week 3: AgentDB adapter creation\n- Create AgentDBAdapter implementing IMemoryBackend\n- Setup HNSW indexing infrastructure\n- Establish embedding generation pipeline\n- Create unified query interface\n```\n\n### **Phase 2: Gradual Migration**\n```bash\n# Week 4-5: System-by-system migration\n- SQLiteBackend → AgentDB (structured data)\n- MarkdownBackend → AgentDB (document storage)\n- MemoryManager → Unified interface\n- DistributedMemorySystem → Cross-agent sharing\n```\n\n### **Phase 3: Advanced Features**\n```bash\n# Week 6: Performance optimization\n- SONA integration for learning patterns\n- Cross-agent memory sharing\n- Performance benchmarking (150x validation)\n- Backward compatibility layer cleanup\n```\n\n## Performance Targets\n\n### **Search Performance**\n- **Current**: O(n) linear search through memory entries\n- **Target**: O(log n) HNSW approximate nearest neighbor\n- **Improvement**: 150x-12,500x depending on dataset size\n- **Benchmark**: Sub-100ms queries for 1M+ entries\n\n### **Memory Efficiency**\n- **Current**: Multiple backend overhead\n- **Target**: Unified storage with compression\n- **Improvement**: 50-75% memory reduction\n- **Benchmark**: <1GB memory usage for large datasets\n\n### **Query Flexibility**\n```typescript\n// Unified query interface supports both:\n\n// 1. Semantic similarity queries\nawait memory.query({\n  type: ''semantic'',\n  content: ''agent coordination patterns'',\n  limit: 10,\n  threshold: 0.8\n});\n\n// 2. Structured queries\nawait memory.query({\n  type: ''structured'',\n  filters: {\n    agentType: ''security'',\n    timestamp: { after: ''2026-01-01'' }\n  },\n  orderBy: ''relevance''\n});\n```\n\n## SONA Integration\n\n### **Learning Pattern Storage**\n```typescript\nclass SONAMemoryIntegration {\n  async storePattern(pattern: LearningPattern): Promise<void> {\n    // Store in AgentDB with SONA metadata\n    await this.memory.store({\n      id: pattern.id,\n      content: pattern.data,\n      metadata: {\n        sonaMode: pattern.mode, // real-time, balanced, research, edge, batch\n        reward: pattern.reward,\n        trajectory: pattern.trajectory,\n        adaptation_time: pattern.adaptationTime\n      },\n      embedding: await this.generateEmbedding(pattern.data)\n    });\n  }\n\n  async retrieveSimilarPatterns(query: string): Promise<LearningPattern[]> {\n    const results = await this.memory.query({\n      type: ''semantic'',\n      content: query,\n      filters: { type: ''learning_pattern'' },\n      limit: 5\n    });\n    return results.map(r => this.toLearningPattern(r));\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Data Migration Plan\n\n### **SQLite → AgentDB Migration**\n```sql\n-- Extract existing data\nSELECT id, content, metadata, created_at, agent_id\nFROM memory_entries\nORDER BY created_at;\n\n-- Migrate to AgentDB with embeddings\nINSERT INTO agentdb_memories (id, content, embedding, metadata)\nVALUES (?, ?, generate_embedding(?), ?);\n```\n\n### **Markdown → AgentDB Migration**\n```typescript\n// Process markdown files\nfor (const file of markdownFiles) {\n  const content = await fs.readFile(file, ''utf-8'');\n  const embedding = await generateEmbedding(content);\n\n  await agentdb.store({\n    id: generateId(),\n    content,\n    embedding,\n    metadata: {\n      originalFile: file,\n      migrationDate: new Date(),\n      type: ''document''\n    }\n  });\n}\n```\n\n## Validation & Testing\n\n### **Performance Benchmarks**\n```typescript\n// Benchmark suite\nclass MemoryBenchmarks {\n  async benchmarkSearchPerformance(): Promise<BenchmarkResult> {\n    const queries = this.generateTestQueries(1000);\n    const startTime = performance.now();\n\n    for (const query of queries) {\n      await this.memory.query(query);\n    }\n\n    const endTime = performance.now();\n    return {\n      queriesPerSecond: queries.length / (endTime - startTime) * 1000,\n      avgLatency: (endTime - startTime) / queries.length,\n      improvement: this.calculateImprovement()\n    };\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### **Success Criteria**\n- [ ] 150x-12,500x search performance improvement validated\n- [ ] All existing memory systems successfully migrated\n- [ ] Backward compatibility maintained during transition\n- [ ] SONA integration functional with <0.05ms adaptation\n- [ ] Cross-agent memory sharing operational\n- [ ] 50-75% memory usage reduction achieved\n\n## Coordination Points\n\n### **Integration Architect (Agent #10)**\n- AgentDB integration with agentic-flow@alpha\n- SONA learning mode configuration\n- Performance optimization coordination\n\n### **Core Architect (Agent #5)**\n- Memory service interfaces in DDD structure\n- Event sourcing integration for memory operations\n- Domain boundary definitions for memory access\n\n### **Performance Engineer (Agent #14)**\n- Benchmark validation of 150x-12,500x improvements\n- Memory usage profiling and optimization\n- Performance regression testing"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:43:31.348Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude requiring unified memory management and accelerated search capabilities across multiple memory systems.","zh":"适用于像 Claude 这样的 AI 代理，需要统一的内存管理和跨多个内存系统的加速搜索功能。","ja":"Claude に必要な統一されたメモリ管理と複数のメモリシステム全体での加速された検索機能を必要とする AI エージェントに適しています。","ko":"클라우드와 같은 AI 에이전트에서 유니파이드 메모리 관리와 여러 메모리 시스템에서 가속 검색 기능이 필요한 경우 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude que requieren una gestión de memoria unificada y capacidades de búsqueda acelerada en varios sistemas de memoria.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Claude nécessitant une gestion de mémoire unifiée et des capacités de recherche accélérées sur plusieurs systèmes de mémoire.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Claude, die eine einheitliche Speicherverwaltung und beschleunigte Suchfunktionen über mehrere Speichersysteme hinweg erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como Claude que requerem gestão de memória unificada e capacidades de busca aceleradas em vários sistemas de memória.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude, требующих унифицированного управления памятью и ускоренных возможностей поиска в нескольких системах памяти.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude التي تتطلب إدارة ذاكرة موحدة وقدرات بحث معززة عبر أنظمة ذاكرة متعددة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to unify 6+ memory systems into AgentDB with HNSW indexing, achieving 150x-12,500x search improvements through ADR-006 and ADR-009 implementations, and leveraging native Claude Code support via MCP.","zh":"使得代理能够通过 HNSW 索引将 6+ 个内存系统统一到 AgentDB 中，通过 ADR-006 和 ADR-009 实现来实现 150x-12,500x 的搜索改进，并通过 MCP 利用 Claude 代码的本机支持。","ja":"エージェントが HNSW インデックスを使用して 6 以上のメモリシステムを AgentDB に統合し、ADR-006 と ADR-009 の実装を通じて 150x-12,500x の検索の改善を達成し、MCP を通じて Claude コードのネイティブ サポートを活用できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 HNSW 색인을 사용하여 6개 이상의 메모리 시스템을 에이전트 DB로 통합하고, ADR-006 및 ADR-009 구현을 통해 150x-12,500x의 검색 성능 향상을 달성하며, MCP를 통해 클라우드 코드의 네이티브 지원을 활용할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes unificar 6 o más sistemas de memoria en AgentDB con indexación HNSW, logrando mejoras en la búsqueda de 150 a 12.500 veces a través de las implementaciones de ADR-006 y ADR-009, y aprovechando el soporte nativo de Claude Code a través de MCP.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''unifier 6 ou plusieurs systèmes de mémoire en AgentDB avec indexation HNSW, réalisant des améliorations de recherche de 150 à 12 500 fois grâce aux implementations ADR-006 et ADR-009, et exploitant le support natif de Claude Code via MCP.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, 6 oder mehr Speichersysteme in AgentDB mit HNSW-Indexierung zu vereinen, wodurch Suchverbesserungen von 150 bis 12.500 Mal durch die Implementierungen von ADR-006 und ADR-009 erreicht werden und die native Unterstützung von Claude Code über MCP genutzt wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a unificar 6+ sistemas de memória no AgentDB com indexação HNSW, alcançando melhorias de busca de 150x-12.500x por meio das implementações ADR-006 e ADR-009 e aproveitando o suporte nativo ao Claude Code via MCP.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью объединять 6+ систем памяти в AgentDB с индексированием HNSW, достигая улучшения поиска в 150-12 500 раз за счет реализации ADR-006 и ADR-009, а также использует родную поддержку кода Claude через MCP.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من توحيد 6+ نظام ذاكرة في AgentDB مع فهرسة HNSW، وتحقيق تحسينات البحث 150x-12،500x من خلال التنفيذ ADR-006 و ADR-009، وتستفيد من الدعم الأصلي ل Claude Code من خلال MCP."},"useCases":{"en":["Unifying disparate memory systems into a single, searchable repository","Accelerating search queries across large datasets using HNSW indexing","Implementing hybrid memory backends for enhanced performance and scalability"],"zh":["将不同的内存系统统一到单一的、可搜索的存储库中","使用 HNSW 索引加速大型数据集上的搜索查询","实现混合内存后端以提高性能和可扩展性"],"ja":["複数のメモリシステムを単一の検索可能なリポジトリに統合する","HNSW インデックスを使用して大規模なデータセット上の検索クエリを加速する","ハイブリッド メモリ バックエンドを実装してパフォーマンスとスケーラビリティを向上させる"],"ko":["다양한 메모리 시스템을 단일의 검색 가능한 저장소로 통합하는 것","HNSW 색인을 사용하여 대규모 데이터셋에 대한 검색 쿼리를 가속화하는 것","하이브리드 메모리 백엔드를 구현하여 성능과 확장성을 향상시키는 것"],"es":["Unificar sistemas de memoria dispares en un solo repositorio searchable","Acelerar consultas de búsqueda en grandes conjuntos de datos utilizando indexación HNSW","Implementar backends de memoria híbrida para mejorar el rendimiento y la escalabilidad"],"fr":["Unifier des systèmes de mémoire disparates en un seul référentiel recherchable","Accélérer les requêtes de recherche sur de grands ensembles de données en utilisant l''indexation HNSW","Mettre en œuvre des backends de mémoire hybride pour améliorer les performances et la scalabilité"],"de":["Vereinen Sie disparate Speichersysteme in einem einzigen durchsuchbaren Repository","Beschleunigen Sie Suchanfragen in großen Datenmengen mithilfe der HNSW-Indexierung","Implementieren Sie hybride Speicher-Backends, um Leistung und Skalierbarkeit zu verbessern"],"pt":["Unificar sistemas de memória dispares em um repositório único e pesquisável","Acelerar consultas de pesquisa em grandes conjuntos de dados usando indexação HNSW","Implementar backends de memória híbrida para melhorar o desempenho e a escalabilidade"],"ru":["Объединять разрозненные системы памяти в едином, поисковом репозитории","Ускорять запросы поиска в больших наборах данных с помощью индексирования HNSW","Реализовывать гибридные бэкенды памяти для повышения производительности и масштабируемости"],"ar":["توحيد أنظمة ذاكرة متفرقة في مستودع قابل للبحث","تعزيز استفسارات البحث عبر مجموعات بيانات كبيرة باستخدام فهرسة HNSW","تنفيذ خلفيات ذاكرة هجينة لتحسين الأداء والتحجيم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires AgentDB and HNSW indexing setup","Version ''3.0.0-alpha'' may have compatibility issues with older systems","Native support limited to Claude Code via MCP"],"zh":["需要 AgentDB 和 HNSW 索引设置","版本 ''3.0.0-alpha'' 可能与旧系统存在兼容性问题","本机支持仅限于通过 MCP 的 Claude 代码"],"ja":["AgentDB と HNSW インデックスの設定が必要","バージョン ''3.0.0-alpha'' は古いシステムと互換性の問題が発生する可能性がある","ネイティブ サポートは MCP を介した Claude コードに限定される"],"ko":["에이전트 DB 및 HNSW 색인 설정이 필요함","버전 ''3.0.0-알파''는 오래된 시스템과 호환성 문제가 발생할 수 있음","네이티브 지원은 MCP를 통한 클라우드 코드로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere la configuración de AgentDB y la indexación HNSW","La versión ''3.0.0-alpha'' puede tener problemas de compatibilidad con sistemas más antiguos","El soporte nativo está limitado a Claude Code a través de MCP"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration d''AgentDB et de l''indexation HNSW","La version ''3.0.0-alpha'' peut avoir des problèmes de compatibilité avec les anciens systèmes","Le support natif est limité à Claude Code via MCP"],"de":["Benötigt die Einrichtung von AgentDB und der HNSW-Indexierung","Die Version ''3.0.0-alpha'' kann Kompatibilitätsprobleme mit älteren Systemen haben","Die native Unterstützung ist auf Claude Code über MCP beschränkt"],"pt":["Requer configuração do AgentDB e indexação HNSW","A versão ''3.0.0-alpha'' pode ter problemas de compatibilidade com sistemas mais antigos","Suporte nativo limitado ao Claude Code via MCP"],"ru":["Требует настройки AgentDB и индексирования HNSW","Версия ''3.0.0-alpha'' может иметь проблемы совместимости со старыми системами","Родная поддержка ограничена кодом Claude через MCP"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد AgentDB وفهرسة HNSW","الإصدار ''3.0.0-alpha'' قد يكون له مشاكل في التوافق مع الأنظمة القديمة","الدعم الأصلي مقيد ب Claude Code من خلال MCP"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
