 PRは、決定的なsquashマージを実行することでコードのマージを迅速かつ効率的に行うツールです","ko":"Merge PR는 결정적인 스쿼시 합병을 통해 코드를 빠르고 효율적으로 병합하는 도구입니다","es":"Merge PR es una herramienta que permite mergear PR de forma automática y segura. Permite a los desarrolladores mergear PR de manera eficiente y minimizar err...","fr":"Merge PR est un outil qui permet de merger des PR de manière automatique et sécurisée. Il permet aux développeurs de merger des PR de manière efficace et de ...","de":"Merge PR ist ein Tool, das das automatische und sichere Mergen von PR ermöglicht. Es ermöglicht Entwicklern, PR effizient zu mergen und Fehler zu minimieren.","pt":"A ferramenta Merge PR é uma solução para mesclar pull requests de forma determinística e segura","ru":"Инструмент Merge PR является решением для слияния запросов на включение в определённом и безопасном порядке","ar":"أداة Merge PR هي حل لدمج طلبات السحب بطريقة محددة وأمنة","en":"Your own personal AI assistant. Any OS. Any Platform. The lobster way. 🦞 "},"definition":{"en":"Your own personal AI assistant. Any OS. Any Platform. The lobster way. 🦞 "},"features":{"zh":["确定性的squash合并","自动清理工作树","支持PR编号或URL输入","安全的合并过程"],"ja":["決定的なsquashマージ","自動的なワークツリーのクリーンアップ","PR番号またはURLの入力に対応","安全なマージプロセス"],"ko":["결정적인 스쿼시 합병","자동 작업 트리 정리","PR 번호 또는 URL 입력 지원","安全한 병합 프로세스"],"es":["Merge automático de PR","Soporte para múltiples plataformas","Seguridad avanzada con squash merge","Compatibilidad con gh pr merge","Limpieza del worktree después del merge"],"fr":["Merge automatique de PR","Support pour plusieurs plateformes","Sécurité avancée avec squash merge","Compatibilité avec gh pr merge","Nettoyage du worktree après le merge"],"de":["Automatisches Mergen von PR","Unterstützung für mehrere Plattformen","Erweiterte Sicherheit mit Squash-Merge","Kompatibilität mit gh pr merge"," Bereinigung des Worktrees nach dem Merge"],"pt":["Mescla pull requests via squash merge","Limpeza do worktree após sucesso","Suporte a múltiplas plataformas","Segurança com gh pr merge --squash","Evita execução de git push durante a mescla"],"ru":["Слияние запросов на включение через squash merge","Очистка worktree после успеха","Поддержка нескольких платформ","Безопасность с gh pr merge --squash","Избежание выполнения git push во время слияния"],"ar":["دمج طلبات السحب عبر squash merge","تنظيف شجرة العمل بعد النجاح","دعم منصات متعددة","أمان مع gh pr merge --squash","تجنب تشغيل git push أثناء الدمج"]},"keywords":{"zh":["合并PR请求","代码合并","squash合并","git","github","代码管理"],"ja":["Merge PR","コードマージ","squashマージ","git","github","コード管理"],"ko":["Merge PR","코드 병합","스쿼시 합병","git","github","코드 관리"],"es":["merge pr","desarrollo de software","automatización de pr","seguridad de pr","gh pr merge","squash merge","worktree"],"fr":["merge pr","développement de logiciels","automatisation de pr","sécurité de pr","gh pr merge","squash merge","worktree"],"de":["merge pr","Software-Entwicklung","Automatisierung von PR","Sicherheit von PR","gh pr merge","Squash-Merge","Worktree"],"pt":["merge pr","pull request","squash merge","git","github","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","segurança de código"],"ru":["merge pr","запрос на включение","squash merge","git","github","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки","безопасность кода"],"ar":["merge pr","طلب السحب","squash merge","git","github","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","أمان الشفرة"]}},"owner":"openclaw","repo":"openclaw","repoPath":"openclaw/openclaw","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.424Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"merge-pr","description":"Merge a GitHub PR via squash after /prepare-pr. Use when asked to merge a ready PR. Do not push to main or modify code. Ensure the PR ends in MERGED state and clean up worktrees after success.","bodyPreview":"# Merge PR\n\n## Overview\n\nMerge a prepared PR via deterministic squash merge (`--match-head-commit` + explicit co-author trailer), then clean up the worktree after success.\n\n## Inputs\n\n- Ask for PR number or URL.\n- If missing, use `.local/prep.env` from the worktree if present.\n- If ambiguous, ask.\n\n## Safety\n\n- Use `gh pr merge --squash` as the only path to `main`.\n- Do not run `git push` at all during merge.\n- Do not use `gh pr merge --auto` for maintainer landings.\n- Do not run gateway stop co","body":"# Merge PR\n\n## Overview\n\nMerge a prepared PR via deterministic squash merge (`--match-head-commit` + explicit co-author trailer), then clean up the worktree after success.\n\n## Inputs\n\n- Ask for PR number or URL.\n- If missing, use `.local/prep.env` from the worktree if present.\n- If ambiguous, ask.\n\n## Safety\n\n- Use `gh pr merge --squash` as the only path to `main`.\n- Do not run `git push` at all during merge.\n- Do not use `gh pr merge --auto` for maintainer landings.\n- Do not run gateway stop commands. Do not kill processes. Do not touch port 18792.\n\n## Execution Rule\n\n- Execute the workflow. Do not stop after printing the TODO checklist.\n- If delegating, require the delegate to run commands and capture outputs.\n\n## Known Footguns\n\n- If you see \"fatal: not a git repository\", you are in the wrong directory. Move to the repo root and retry.\n- Read `.local/review.md`, `.local/prep.md`, and `.local/prep.env` in the worktree. Do not skip.\n- Always merge with `--match-head-commit \"$PREP_HEAD_SHA\"` to prevent racing stale or changed heads.\n- Clean up `.worktrees/pr-<PR>` only after confirmed `MERGED`.\n\n## Completion Criteria\n\n- Ensure `gh pr merge` succeeds.\n- Ensure PR state is `MERGED`, never `CLOSED`.\n- Record the merge SHA.\n- Leave a PR comment with merge SHA and prepared head SHA, and capture the comment URL.\n- Run cleanup only after merge success.\n\n## First: Create a TODO Checklist\n\nCreate a checklist of all merge steps, print it, then continue and execute the commands.\n\n## Setup: Use a Worktree\n\nUse an isolated worktree for all merge work.\n\n```sh\nrepo_root=$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel)\ncd \"$repo_root\"\ngh auth status\n\nWORKTREE_DIR=\".worktrees/pr-<PR>\"\ncd \"$WORKTREE_DIR\"\n```\n\nRun all commands inside the worktree directory.\n\n## Load Local Artifacts (Mandatory)\n\nExpect these files from earlier steps:\n\n- `.local/review.md` from `/review-pr`\n- `.local/prep.md` from `/prepare-pr`\n- `.local/prep.env` from `/prepare-pr`\n\n```sh\nls -la .local || true\n\nfor required in .local/review.md .local/prep.md .local/prep.env; do\n  if [ ! -f \"$required\" ]; then\n    echo \"Missing $required. Stop and run /review-pr then /prepare-pr.\"\n    exit 1\n  fi\ndone\n\nsed -n ''1,120p'' .local/review.md\nsed -n ''1,120p'' .local/prep.md\nsource .local/prep.env\n```\n\n## Steps\n\n1. Identify PR meta and verify prepared SHA still matches\n\n```sh\npr_meta_json=$(gh pr view <PR> --json number,title,state,isDraft,author,headRefName,headRefOid,baseRefName,headRepository,body)\nprintf ''%s\\n'' \"$pr_meta_json\" | jq ''{number,title,state,isDraft,author:.author.login,head:.headRefName,headSha:.headRefOid,base:.baseRefName,headRepo:.headRepository.nameWithOwner,body}''\npr_title=$(printf ''%s\\n'' \"$pr_meta_json\" | jq -r .title)\npr_number=$(printf ''%s\\n'' \"$pr_meta_json\" | jq -r .number)\npr_head_sha=$(printf ''%s\\n'' \"$pr_meta_json\" | jq -r .headRefOid)\ncontrib=$(printf ''%s\\n'' \"$pr_meta_json\" | jq -r .author.login)\nis_draft=$(printf ''%s\\n'' \"$pr_meta_json\" | jq -r .isDraft)\n\nif [ \"$is_draft\" = \"true\" ]; then\n  echo \"ERROR: PR is draft. Stop and run /prepare-pr after draft is cleared.\"\n  exit 1\nfi\n\nif [ \"$pr_head_sha\" != \"$PREP_HEAD_SHA\" ]; then\n  echo \"ERROR: PR head changed after /prepare-pr (expected $PREP_HEAD_SHA, got $pr_head_sha). Re-run /prepare-pr.\"\n  exit 1\nfi\n```\n\n2. Run sanity checks\n\nStop if any are true:\n\n- PR is a draft.\n- Required checks are failing.\n- Branch is behind main.\n\nIf checks are pending, wait for completion before merging. Do not use `--auto`.\nIf no required checks are configured, continue.\n\n```sh\ngh pr checks <PR> --required --watch --fail-fast || true\nchecks_json=$(gh pr checks <PR> --required --json name,bucket,state 2>/tmp/gh-checks.err || true)\nif [ -z \"$checks_json\" ]; then\n  checks_json=''[]''\nfi\nrequired_count=$(printf ''%s\\n'' \"$checks_json\" | jq ''length'')\nif [ \"$required_count\" -eq 0 ]; then\n  echo \"No required checks configured for this PR.\"\nfi\nprintf ''%s\\n'' \"$checks_json\" | jq -r ''.[] | \"\\(.bucket)\\t\\(.name)\\t\\(.state)\"''\n\nfailed_required=$(printf ''%s\\n'' \"$checks_json\" | jq ''[.[] | select(.bucket==\"fail\")] | length'')\npending_required=$(printf ''%s\\n'' \"$checks_json\" | jq ''[.[] | select(.bucket==\"pending\")] | length'')\nif [ \"$failed_required\" -gt 0 ]; then\n  echo \"Required checks are failing, run /prepare-pr.\"\n  exit 1\nfi\nif [ \"$pending_required\" -gt 0 ]; then\n  echo \"Required checks are still pending, retry /merge-pr when green.\"\n  exit 1\nfi\n\ngit fetch origin main\ngit fetch origin pull/<PR>/head:pr-<PR> --force\ngit merge-base --is-ancestor origin/main pr-<PR> || (echo \"PR branch is behind main, run /prepare-pr\" && exit 1)\n```\n\nIf anything is failing or behind, stop and say to run `/prepare-pr`.\n\n3. Merge PR with explicit attribution metadata\n\n```sh\nreviewer=$(gh api user --jq .login)\nreviewer_id=$(gh api user --jq .id)\ncoauthor_email=${COAUTHOR_EMAIL:-\"$contrib@users.noreply.github.com\"}\nif [ -z \"$coauthor_email\" ] || [ \"$coauthor_email\" = \"null\" ]; then\n  contrib_id=$(gh api users/$contrib --jq .id)\n  coauthor_email=\"${contrib_id}+${contrib}@users.noreply.github.com\"\nfi\n\ngh_email=$(gh api user --jq ''.email // \"\"'' || true)\ngit_email=$(git config user.email || true)\nmapfile -t reviewer_email_candidates < <(\n  printf ''%s\\n'' \\\n    \"$gh_email\" \\\n    \"$git_email\" \\\n    \"${reviewer_id}+${reviewer}@users.noreply.github.com\" \\\n    \"${reviewer}@users.noreply.github.com\" | awk ''NF && !seen[$0]++''\n)\n[ \"${#reviewer_email_candidates[@]}\" -gt 0 ] || { echo \"ERROR: could not resolve reviewer author email\"; exit 1; }\nreviewer_email=\"${reviewer_email_candidates[0]}\"\n\ncat > .local/merge-body.txt <<EOF\nMerged via /review-pr -> /prepare-pr -> /merge-pr.\n\nPrepared head SHA: $PREP_HEAD_SHA\nCo-authored-by: $contrib <$coauthor_email>\nCo-authored-by: $reviewer <$reviewer_email>\nReviewed-by: @$reviewer\nEOF\n\nrun_merge() {\n  local email=\"$1\"\n  local stderr_file\n  stderr_file=$(mktemp)\n  if gh pr merge <PR> \\\n    --squash \\\n    --delete-branch \\\n    --match-head-commit \"$PREP_HEAD_SHA\" \\\n    --author-email \"$email\" \\\n    --subject \"$pr_title (#$pr_number)\" \\\n    --body-file .local/merge-body.txt \\\n    2> >(tee \"$stderr_file\" >&2)\n  then\n    rm -f \"$stderr_file\"\n    return 0\n  fi\n  merge_err=$(cat \"$stderr_file\")\n  rm -f \"$stderr_file\"\n  return 1\n}\n\nmerge_err=\"\"\nselected_merge_author_email=\"$reviewer_email\"\nif ! run_merge \"$selected_merge_author_email\"; then\n  if printf ''%s\\n'' \"$merge_err\" | rg -qi ''author.?email|email.*associated|associated.*email|invalid.*email'' && [ \"${#reviewer_email_candidates[@]}\" -ge 2 ]; then\n    selected_merge_author_email=\"${reviewer_email_candidates[1]}\"\n    echo \"Retrying once with fallback author email: $selected_merge_author_email\"\n    run_merge \"$selected_merge_author_email\" || { echo \"ERROR: merge failed after fallback retry\"; exit 1; }\n  else\n    echo \"ERROR: merge failed\"\n    exit 1\n  fi\nfi\n```\n\nRetry is allowed exactly once when the error is clearly author-email validation.\n\n4. Verify PR state and capture merge SHA\n\n```sh\nstate=$(gh pr view <PR> --json state --jq .state)\nif [ \"$state\" != \"MERGED\" ]; then\n  echo \"Merge not finalized yet (state=$state), waiting up to 15 minutes...\"\n  for _ in $(seq 1 90); do\n    sleep 10\n    state=$(gh pr view <PR> --json state --jq .state)\n    if [ \"$state\" = \"MERGED\" ]; then\n      break\n    fi\n  done\nfi\n\nif [ \"$state\" != \"MERGED\" ]; then\n  echo \"ERROR: PR state is $state after waiting. Leave worktree and retry /merge-pr later.\"\n  exit 1\nfi\n\nmerge_sha=$(gh pr view <PR> --json mergeCommit --jq ''.mergeCommit.oid'')\nif [ -z \"$merge_sha\" ] || [ \"$merge_sha\" = \"null\" ]; then\n  echo \"ERROR: merge commit SHA missing.\"\n  exit 1\nfi\n\ncommit_body=$(gh api repos/:owner/:repo/commits/$merge_sha --jq .commit.message)\ncontrib=${contrib:-$(gh pr view <PR> --json author --jq .author.login)}\nreviewer=${reviewer:-$(gh api user --jq .login)}\nprintf ''%s\\n'' \"$commit_body\" | rg -q \"^Co-authored-by: $contrib <\" || { echo \"ERROR: missing PR author co-author trailer\"; exit 1; }\nprintf ''%s\\n'' \"$commit_body\" | rg -q \"^Co-authored-by: $reviewer <\" || { echo \"ERROR: missing reviewer co-author trailer\"; exit 1; }\n\necho \"merge_sha=$merge_sha\"\n```\n\n5. PR comment\n\nUse a multiline heredoc with interpolation enabled.\n\n```sh\nok=0\ncomment_output=\"\"\nfor _ in 1 2 3; do\n  if comment_output=$(gh pr comment <PR> -F - <<EOF\nMerged via squash.\n\n- Prepared head SHA: $PREP_HEAD_SHA\n- Merge commit: $merge_sha\n\nThanks @$contrib!\nEOF\n); then\n    ok=1\n    break\n  fi\n  sleep 2\ndone\n\n[ \"$ok\" -eq 1 ] || { echo \"ERROR: failed to post PR comment after retries\"; exit 1; }\ncomment_url=$(printf ''%s\\n'' \"$comment_output\" | rg -o ''https://github.com/[^ ]+/pull/[0-9]+#issuecomment-[0-9]+'' -m1 || true)\n[ -n \"$comment_url\" ] || comment_url=\"unresolved\"\necho \"comment_url=$comment_url\"\n```\n\n6. Clean up worktree only on success\n\nRun cleanup only if step 4 returned `MERGED`.\n\n```sh\ncd \"$repo_root\"\ngit worktree remove \".worktrees/pr-<PR>\" --force\ngit branch -D temp/pr-<PR> 2>/dev/null || true\ngit branch -D pr-<PR> 2>/dev/null || true\ngit branch -D pr-<PR>-prep 2>/dev/null || true\n```\n\n## Guardrails\n\n- Worktree only.\n- Do not close PRs.\n- End in MERGED state.\n- Clean up only after merge success.\n- Never push to main. Use `gh pr merge --squash` only.\n- Do not run `git push` at all in this command.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:43:03.242Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for DevOps Automation Agents requiring deterministic, safe GitHub repository management.","zh":"适用于需要确定性、安全的 GitHub 仓库管理的 DevOps 自动化代理。","ja":"決定性で安全な GitHub リポジトリ管理を必要とする DevOps オートメーション エージェントに適しています。","ko":"결정적이고 안전한 GitHub 리포지토리 관리가 필요한 DevOps 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de automatización de DevOps que requieren un manejo de repositorios de GitHub determinista y seguro.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''automatisation DevOps nécessitant une gestion de référentiels GitHub déterministe et sécurisée.","de":"Ideal für DevOps-Automatisierungsagenten, die eine deterministische und sichere GitHub-Repository-Verwaltung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Automação de DevOps que exigem gerenciamento de repositórios do GitHub determinístico e seguro.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации DevOps, требующих детерминированного и безопасного управления репозиториями GitHub.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات التخصيص التلقائي لعمليات DevOps التي تتطلب إدارة مخازن GitHub محددة وآمنة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to execute safe, deterministic PR merges using `gh pr merge --squash` with explicit co-author trailers, ensuring a clean worktree without manual `git push` operations. It leverages `.local/prep.env` for context and enforces strict safety protocols against maintainer landings via `--auto`.","zh":"使代理能够使用 `gh pr merge --squash` 和显式共同作者标签执行安全的确定性 PR 合并，确保在没有手动 `git push` 操作的情况下保持干净的工作树。它利用 `.local/prep.env` 提供上下文，并通过 `--auto` 强制执行严格的安全协议以防止维护者登陆。","ja":"エージェントが `gh pr merge --squash` と明示的な共同作成者トレーラーを使用して安全で決定的な PR マージを実行できるようにし、手動の `git push` 操作が不要なクリーンな作業ツリーを保証します。また、`.local/prep.env` を使用してコンテキストを提供し、`--auto` を介してメンテナーの着陸に対する厳格な安全プロトコルを適用します。","ko":"에이전트가 `gh pr merge --squash`와 명시적인 공동 저자 트레일러를 사용하여 안전하고 결정적인 PR 병합을 실행할 수 있도록 하여 수동적인 `git push` 동작이 필요없는 깨끗한 작업 트리를 보장합니다. 또한 `.local/prep.env`를 사용하여 컨텍스트를 제공하고 `--auto`를 통해 유지 관리자 着陆에 대한 엄격한 안전 규약을 적용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes ejecutar fusiones de PR seguras y deterministas utilizando `gh pr merge --squash` con remolques de coautoría explícitos, asegurando un árbol de trabajo limpio sin operaciones manuales de `git push`. Se aprovecha de `.local/prep.env` para el contexto y aplica estrictos protocolos de seguridad contra aterrizajes de mantenedores a través de `--auto`.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des fusions de PR sécurisées et déterministes en utilisant `gh pr merge --squash` avec des remorques de co-auteur explicites, assurant un arbre de travail propre sans opérations manuelles de `git push`. Il exploite `.local/prep.env` pour le contexte et impose des protocoles de sécurité stricts contre les atterrissages de mainteneurs via `--auto`.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, sichere und deterministische PR-Fusionen mit `gh pr merge --squash` und expliziten Co-Autoren-Trailern auszuführen, um einen sauberen Arbeitsbereich ohne manuelle `git push`-Operationen sicherzustellen. Es nutzt `.local/prep.env` für den Kontext und erzwingt strikte Sicherheitsprotokolle gegenüber Maintainer-Landungen über `--auto`.","pt":"Permite que os agentes executem mesclagens de PR seguras e determinísticas usando `gh pr merge --squash` com trailers de co-autoria explícitos, garantindo uma árvore de trabalho limpa sem operações manuais de `git push`. Ele aproveita `.local/prep.env` para contexto e impõe protocolos de segurança rigorosos contra aterrissagens de mantenedores via `--auto`.","ru":"Позволяет агентам выполнять безопасные и детерминированные слияния PR с помощью `gh pr merge --squash` с явными трейлерами соавторов, обеспечивая чистое рабочее дерево без ручных операций `git push`. Он использует `.local/prep.env` для контекста и обеспечивает строгие протоколы безопасности против посадок обслуживающих сотрудников через `--auto`.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء تنفيذ عمليات دمج آمنة ومحددة باستخدام `gh pr merge --squash` مع ريموتات التعاون الصريح ، مما يضمن شجرة عمل نظيفة بدون عمليات `git push` اليدوية. إنه يستفيد من `.local/prep.env` للسياق وينفذ بروتوكولات أمان صارمة ضد هبوط الأشخاص الذين يقومون بالصيانة عبر `--auto`."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating PR merges via deterministic squash method","Cleaning worktrees post-successful merge","Resolving ambiguous PR inputs using local environment files"],"zh":["通过确定性 squash 方法自动执行 PR 合并","合并后清理工作树","使用本地环境文件解析模糊的 PR 输入"],"ja":["決定性 squash メソッドを使用した PR マージの自動化","マージ後の作業ツリーのクリーンアップ","ローカル環境ファイルを使用した不明確な PR 入力の解決"],"ko":["결정적인 스쿼시 방법을 통한 PR 병합 자동화","병합 후 작업 트리 정리","로컬 환경 파일을 사용한 모호한 PR 입력 해결"],"es":["Automatización de fusiones de PR mediante método de aplastamiento determinista","Limpieza de árboles de trabajo después de una fusión exitosa","Resolución de entradas de PR ambigüas utilizando archivos de entorno locales"],"fr":["Automatisation des fusions de PR via la méthode de squash déterministe","Nettoyage des arbres de travail après une fusion réussie","Résolution des entrées de PR ambigües en utilisant des fichiers d''environnement locaux"],"de":["Automatisierung von PR-Fusionen mit deterministischer Squash-Methode","Reinigung von Arbeitsbereichen nach einer erfolgreichen Fusion","Auflösung mehrdeutiger PR-Eingaben mit Hilfe lokaler Umgebungsdateien"],"pt":["Automatizar mesclagens de PR via método de esmagamento determinístico","Limpar árvores de trabalho após mesclagem bem-sucedida","Resolver entradas de PR ambíguas usando arquivos de ambiente locais"],"ru":["Автоматизировать слияния PR с помощью детерминированного метода сжатия","Очистить рабочие деревья после успешного слияния","Разрешить неоднозначные входные данные PR с помощью локальных файлов окружения"],"ar":["تحويل دمج PR تلقائيًا باستخدام طريقة الضغط المحددة","تنظيف شجيرات العمل بعد دمج ناجح","حل المدخلات الغامضة لدمج PR باستخدام ملفات بيئة محلية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub CLI (`gh`) installation","Depends on `.local/prep.env` for context if PR not provided","Exclusively uses squash merge strategy (`--squash`)"],"zh":["需要 GitHub CLI (`gh`) 安装","如果 PR 未提供，则依赖于 `.local/prep.env` 上下文","仅使用 squash 合并策略 (`--squash`)"],"ja":["GitHub CLI (`gh`) のインストールが必要","PR が提供されていない場合、`.local/prep.env` のコンテキストに依存","squash マージ戦略 (`--squash`) のみを使用"],"ko":["GitHub CLI (`gh`) 설치 필요","PR가 제공되지 않은 경우 `.local/prep.env` 컨텍스트에 의존","스쿼시 병합 전략 (`--squash`)만 사용"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de GitHub CLI (`gh`)","Depende de `.local/prep.env` para el contexto si no se proporciona PR","Utiliza exclusivamente la estrategia de fusión de squash (`--squash`)"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de GitHub CLI (`gh`)","Dépend de `.local/prep.env` pour le contexte si PR n''est pas fourni","Utilise exclusivement la stratégie de fusion de squash (`--squash`)"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von GitHub CLI (`gh`)","Hängt von `.local/prep.env` für den Kontext ab, wenn PR nicht bereitgestellt wird","Verwendet ausschließlich die Squash-Fusionsstrategie (`--squash`)"],"pt":["Exige a instalação do GitHub CLI (`gh`)","Depende de `.local/prep.env` para contexto se PR não for fornecido","Usa exclusivamente a estratégia de mesclagem de esmagamento (`--squash`)"],"ru":["Требует установки GitHub CLI (`gh`)","Зависит от `.local/prep.env` для контекста, если PR не предоставлен","Использует исключительно стратегию сжатия слияния (`--squash`)"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت واجهة سطر أوامر GitHub (`gh`)","يعتمد على `.local/prep.env` للسياق إذا لم يتم توفير PR","استخدام استراتيجية دمج الضغط حصريًا (`--squash`)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
