stes"],"ru":["Django","Разработка бэкенда","Python","Django REST Framework","Модели","Представления","Аутентификация","Оптимизация производительности","Тестирование"],"ar":["Django","تطوير الخلفية","Python","إطار Django REST","النماذج","المناظير","التحقق","تحسين الأداء","الاختبار"]}},"owner":"emlopezr","repo":"TrackWatch","repoPath":"emlopezr/TrackWatch","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.424Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"django-expert","description":"Expert Django backend development guidance. Use when creating Django models, views, serializers, or APIs; debugging ORM queries or migrations; optimizing database performance; implementing authentication; writing tests; or working with Django REST Framework. Follows Django best practices and modern patterns.","bodyPreview":"# Django Expert\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides expert guidance for Django backend development with comprehensive coverage of models, views, Django REST Framework, forms, authentication, testing, and performance optimization. It follows official Django best practices and modern Python conventions to help you build robust, maintainable applications.\n\n**Key Capabilities:**\n- Model design with optimal ORM patterns\n- View implementation (FBV, CBV, DRF viewsets)\n- Django REST Framework API developm","body":"# Django Expert\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides expert guidance for Django backend development with comprehensive coverage of models, views, Django REST Framework, forms, authentication, testing, and performance optimization. It follows official Django best practices and modern Python conventions to help you build robust, maintainable applications.\n\n**Key Capabilities:**\n- Model design with optimal ORM patterns\n- View implementation (FBV, CBV, DRF viewsets)\n- Django REST Framework API development\n- Query optimization and performance tuning\n- Authentication and permissions\n- Testing strategies and patterns\n- Security best practices\n\n## When to Use\n\nInvoke this skill when you encounter these triggers:\n\n**Model & Database Work:**\n- \"Create a Django model for...\"\n- \"Optimize this queryset/database query\"\n- \"Generate migrations for...\"\n- \"Design database schema for...\"\n- \"Fix N+1 query problem\"\n\n**View & API Development:**\n- \"Create an API endpoint for...\"\n- \"Build a Django view that...\"\n- \"Implement DRF serializer/viewset\"\n- \"Add filtering/pagination to API\"\n\n**Authentication & Security:**\n- \"Implement authentication/permissions\"\n- \"Create custom user model\"\n- \"Secure this endpoint/view\"\n\n**Testing & Quality:**\n- \"Write tests for this Django app\"\n- \"Debug this Django error/issue\"\n- \"Review Django code for issues\"\n\n**Performance & Optimization:**\n- \"This Django view is slow\"\n- \"Optimize database queries\"\n- \"Add caching to...\"\n\n**Production Deployment:**\n- \"Deploy Django to production\"\n- \"Configure Django for production\"\n- \"Set up HTTPS/SSL for Django\"\n- \"Production settings checklist\"\n- \"Configure production database/cache\"\n\n## Instructions\n\nFollow this workflow when handling Django development requests:\n\n### 1. Analyze the Request and Gather Context\n\n**Identify the task type:**\n- Model design (database schema, relationships, migrations)\n- View/API development (FBV, CBV, DRF viewsets, serializers)\n- Query optimization (N+1 problems, database performance)\n- Authentication/permissions (user models, access control)\n- Testing (unit tests, integration tests, fixtures)\n- Security review (CSRF, XSS, SQL injection, permissions)\n- Production deployment (settings, HTTPS, database, caching, monitoring)\n- Template rendering (Django templates, context processors)\n\n**Leverage available context:**\n- If `django-ai-boost` MCP server is available, use it to understand project structure and existing patterns\n- Read relevant existing code to understand conventions\n- Check Django version for compatibility considerations\n\n### 2. Load Relevant Reference Documentation\n\nBased on the task type, reference the appropriate bundled documentation:\n\n- **Models/ORM work** -> `references/models-and-orm.md`\n  - Model design patterns and field choices\n  - Relationship configurations (ForeignKey, ManyToMany)\n  - Custom managers and QuerySet methods\n  - Migration strategies\n\n- **View/API development** -> `references/views-and-urls.md` + `references/drf-guidelines.md`\n  - FBV vs CBV decision criteria\n  - DRF serializers, viewsets, and routers\n  - URL configuration patterns\n  - Middleware and request/response handling\n\n- **Performance issues** -> `references/performance-optimization.md`\n  - Query optimization techniques (select_related, prefetch_related)\n  - Caching strategies (Redis, Memcached, database caching)\n  - Database indexing and query profiling\n  - Connection pooling and async patterns\n\n- **Production deployment** -> `references/production-deployment.md`\n  - Critical settings (DEBUG, SECRET_KEY, ALLOWED_HOSTS)\n  - HTTPS and SSL/TLS configuration\n  - Database and cache configuration\n  - Static/media file serving\n  - Error monitoring and logging\n  - Deployment process and health checks\n\n- **Security concerns** -> `references/security-checklist.md`\n  - CSRF/XSS/SQL injection prevention\n  - Authentication and authorization patterns\n  - Secure configuration practices\n  - Input validation and sanitization\n\n- **Testing tasks** -> `references/testing-strategies.md`\n  - Test structure and organization\n  - Fixtures and factories\n  - Mocking external dependencies\n  - Coverage and CI/CD integration\n\n### 3. Implement Following Django Best Practices\n\n**Code quality standards:**\n- Follow PEP 8 and Django coding style\n- Use Django built-ins over third-party packages when possible\n- Keep views thin, use services/managers for business logic\n- Write descriptive variable names and add docstrings for complex logic\n- Handle errors gracefully with appropriate exceptions\n\n**Django-specific patterns:**\n- Use `select_related()` for FK/OneToOne, `prefetch_related()` for reverse FK/M2M\n- Leverage class-based views and mixins for code reuse\n- Use Django forms/serializers for validation\n- Follow Django''s migration workflow (never edit applied migrations)\n- Use Django''s built-in security features (CSRF tokens, auth decorators)\n\n**API development (DRF):**\n- Use ModelSerializer for standard CRUD operations\n- Implement proper pagination and filtering\n- Use appropriate permission classes\n- Follow RESTful conventions for endpoints\n- Version APIs when making breaking changes\n\n### 4. Validate and Test\n\nBefore presenting the solution:\n\n**Code review:**\n- Check for N+1 query problems (use Django Debug Toolbar mentally)\n- Verify proper error handling and edge cases\n- Ensure security best practices are followed\n- Confirm migrations are clean and reversible\n\n**Testing considerations:**\n- Suggest or write appropriate tests for new functionality\n- Verify test coverage for critical paths\n- Check that fixtures/factories are maintainable\n\n**Performance check:**\n- Review database queries for efficiency\n- Consider caching opportunities\n- Verify proper use of database indexes\n\n## Bundled Resources\n\n**references/** - Comprehensive Django documentation loaded into context as needed\n\nThese reference files provide detailed guidance beyond this SKILL.md overview:\n\n- **`references/models-and-orm.md`** (~11k words)\n  - Model field types and best practices\n  - Relationship configurations (ForeignKey, OneToOne, ManyToMany)\n  - Custom managers and QuerySet methods\n  - Migration patterns and common pitfalls\n  - Database-level constraints and indexes\n\n- **`references/views-and-urls.md`** (~17k words)\n  - Function-based vs class-based view trade-offs\n  - CBV mixins and inheritance patterns\n  - URL routing and reverse resolution\n  - Middleware implementation\n  - Request/response lifecycle\n\n- **`references/drf-guidelines.md`** (~18k words)\n  - Serializer patterns (ModelSerializer, nested serializers)\n  - ViewSet and router configurations\n  - Pagination, filtering, and search\n  - Authentication and permission classes\n  - API versioning strategies\n  - Performance optimization for APIs\n\n- **`references/testing-strategies.md`** (~18k words)\n  - Test organization and structure\n  - Factory patterns vs fixtures\n  - Testing views, models, and serializers\n  - Mocking external services\n  - Test database optimization\n  - CI/CD integration\n\n- **`references/security-checklist.md`** (~12k words)\n  - CSRF protection implementation\n  - XSS prevention techniques\n  - SQL injection defense\n  - Authentication best practices\n  - Permission and authorization patterns\n  - Secure settings configuration\n\n- **`references/performance-optimization.md`** (~14k words)\n  - Query optimization (select_related, prefetch_related, only, defer)\n  - Database indexing strategies\n  - Caching layers (Redis, Memcached, database cache)\n  - Database connection pooling\n  - Profiling and monitoring tools\n  - Async views and background tasks\n\n- **`references/production-deployment.md`** (~20k words)\n  - Critical settings (DEBUG, SECRET_KEY, ALLOWED_HOSTS)\n  - Database configuration and connection pooling\n  - HTTPS/SSL configuration and security headers\n  - Static and media file serving\n  - Caching with Redis/Memcached\n  - Email configuration for production\n  - Error monitoring with Sentry\n  - Logging and health checks\n  - Zero-downtime deployment strategies\n\n- **`references/examples.md`** - Practical implementation examples\n  - Model design with custom managers\n  - N+1 query optimization\n  - DRF API endpoint implementation\n  - Writing Django tests\n\n## Additional Notes\n\n**Django Version Compatibility:**\n- Consider LTS releases (4.2, 5.2) for production\n- Check deprecation warnings when upgrading\n- Use `django-upgrade` tool for automated migration\n\n**Common Pitfalls to Avoid:**\n- Circular imports (use lazy references)\n- Missing `related_name` on relationships\n- Forgetting database indexes on frequently queried fields\n- Using `get()` without exception handling\n- N+1 queries in templates and serializers\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:44:55.539Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Python Web Development Agents needing expert Django guidance and comprehensive backend development capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要Django专家指导和全面后端开发能力的Python Web开发代理。","ja":"Python Web開発エージェントがDjangoの専門知識と包括的なバックエンド開発機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"Django 전문 지침과 포괄적인 백엔드 개발 기능이 필요한 Python 웹 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo web de Python que necesitan orientación experta en Django y capacidades de desarrollo de backend integral.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement web Python ayant besoin de conseils d''expert Django et de capacités de développement de backend complet.","de":"Perfekt für Python-Web-Development-Agents, die Experten-Anleitung für Django und umfassende Backend-Entwicklungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de desenvolvimento web em Python que necessitam de orientação especializada em Django e capacidades de desenvolvimento de backend abrangentes.","ru":"Идеально для агентов веб-разработки Python, которым требуются экспертные рекомендации по Django и комплексные возможности разработки бэкенда.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الإلكتروني باستخدام بايثون الذي يحتاج إلى إرشادات خبراء في دجانجو وقدرات تطوير الخلفية الشاملة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design optimal Django models with ORM patterns, implement views using FBV, CBV, and DRF viewsets, and develop RESTful APIs with Django REST Framework, following official Django best practices and modern Python conventions.","zh":"使代理能够使用ORM模式设计最优的Django模型，使用FBV、CBV和DRF视图集实现视图，并使用Django REST Framework开发RESTful API，遵循官方Django最佳实践和现代Python约定。","ja":"エージェントがORMパターンを使用して最適なDjangoモデルを設計し、FBV、CBV、DRFビューセットを使用してビューを実装し、Django REST Frameworkを使用してRESTful APIを開発できるようにし、公式のDjangoベストプラクティスと現代のPython規約に従う。","ko":"에이전트가 ORM 패턴을 사용하여 최적의 Django 모델을 설계하고 FBV, CBV 및 DRF 뷰셋을 사용하여 뷰를 구현하며 Django REST Framework를 사용하여 RESTful API를 개발할 수 있도록 하여 공식 Django 모범 사례와 현대 Python 규칙을 따릅니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar modelos de Django óptimos con patrones de ORM, implementar vistas utilizando FBV, CBV y conjuntos de vistas de DRF, y desarrollar API RESTful con Django REST Framework, siguiendo las mejores prácticas oficiales de Django y las convenciones de Python modernas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des modèles Django optimaux avec des modèles de ORM, de mettre en œuvre des vues en utilisant FBV, CBV et des jeux de vues DRF, et de développer des API RESTful avec Django REST Framework, en suivant les meilleures pratiques officielles de Django et les conventions Python modernes.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, optimale Django-Modelle mit ORM-Mustern zu entwerfen, Ansichten mithilfe von FBV, CBV und DRF-Viewsets zu implementieren und RESTful-APIs mit Django REST Framework zu entwickeln, unter Einhaltung der offiziellen Django-Best-Practices und moderner Python-Konventionen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar modelos Django ótimos com padrões de ORM, implementar visualizações usando FBV, CBV e conjuntos de visualizações de DRF, e desenvolver APIs RESTful com Django REST Framework, seguindo as melhores práticas oficiais do Django e convenções Python modernas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать оптимальные модели Django с шаблонами ORM, реализовывать представления с помощью FBV, CBV и наборов представлений DRF, а также разрабатывать RESTful API с помощью Django REST Framework, следуя официальным рекомендациям по Django и современным соглашениям Python.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تصميم نماذج دجانجو المثالية باستخدام أنماط ORM، وتطبيق العروض باستخدام FBV وCBV ومجموعات عروض DRF، وتنمية واجهات برمجة التطبيقات RESTful باستخدام إطار دجانجو REST، متابعة أفضل الممارسات الرسمية لدجانجو والاتفاقيات الحديثة لبايثون."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing scalable Django models","Implementing secure authentication and authorization","Optimizing Django application performance"],"zh":["设计可扩展的Django模型","实现安全的身份验证和授权","优化Django应用程序性能"],"ja":["拡張可能なDjangoモデルを設計する","安全な認証と認可を実装する","Djangoアプリケーションのパフォーマンスを最適化する"],"ko":["확장 가능한 Django 모델을 설계하는 것","보안 인증 및 인가를 구현하는 것","Django 애플리케이션 성능 최적화"],"es":["Diseñar modelos de Django escalables","Implementar autenticación y autorización seguras","Optimizar el rendimiento de la aplicación Django"],"fr":["Concevoir des modèles Django évolutifs","Mettre en œuvre une authentification et une autorisation sécurisées","Optimiser les performances de l''application Django"],"de":["Skalierbare Django-Modelle entwerfen","Sichere Authentifizierung und Autorisierung implementieren","Die Leistung der Django-Anwendung optimieren"],"pt":["Projetar modelos Django escaláveis","Implementar autenticação e autorização seguras","Otimizar o desempenho da aplicação Django"],"ru":["Проектирование масштабируемых моделей Django","Реализация безопасной аутентификации и авторизации","Оптимизация производительности приложения Django"],"ar":["تصميم نماذج دجانجو قابلة للتوسيع","تطبيق المصادقة والأذونات الآمنة","تحسين أداء تطبيق دجانجو"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python and Django installation","Familiarity with Django framework and Python programming"],"zh":["需要Python和Django安装","需要熟悉Django框架和Python编程"],"ja":["PythonとDjangoのインストールが必要","DjangoフレームワークとPythonプログラミングの知識が必要"],"ko":["Python 및 Django 설치가 필요함","Django 프레임워크 및 Python 프로그래밍에 대한 지식이 필요함"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de Python y Django","Conocimiento del marco de Django y la programación de Python"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Python et de Django","Connaissance du framework Django et de la programmation Python"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von Python und Django","Vertrautheit mit dem Django-Framework und der Python-Programmierung"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Python e do Django","Familiaridade com o framework Django e programação Python"],"ru":["Требует установки Python и Django","Знакомство с фреймворком Django и программированием на Python"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت بايثون ودجانجو","إلمام بإطار دجانجو وبرمجة بايثون"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Aniket-a14/SRA/supabase-expert', 'community', 'Aniket-a14', 'SRA', 'Aniket-a14/SRA', 'supabase-expert', 0, 0, 80, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.424Z', '2026-02-18T04:44:55.009Z', NULL, '{"id":"Aniket-a14/SRA/supabase-expert","name":"supabase-expert","description":{"zh":"Supabase 集成专家技能帮助您构建安全、可扩展的 Supabase 集成，涵盖数据库设计、行级安全性和实时功能","ja":"Supabase 統合エキスパートスキルは、データベース設計、行レベルのセキュリティ、リアルタイム機能など、セキュアでスケーラブルな Supabase 統合を構築するのに役立ちます","ko":"Supabase 통합 전문가 기술은 데이터베이스 설계, 행 수준 보안, 실시간 기능 등을 포함하여 보안이 강화되고 확장 가능한 Supabase 통합을 구축하는 데 도움이 됩니다","es":"El experto en integraciones Supabase ayuda a construir integraciones seguras y escalables. Incluye diseño de bases de datos, políticas de seguridad y autenticación.","fr":"L''expert en intégrations Supabase aide à créer des intégrations sécurisées et évolutives. Il inclut la conception de bases de données, les politiques de sécurité et l''authentification.","de":"Der Supabase-Integrationsexperte hilft bei der Erstellung sicherer und skalierbarer Integrationen. Er umfasst Datenbankdesign, Sicherheitsrichtlinien und Authentifizierung.","pt":"O skill Supabase Expert ajuda a construir integrações seguras e escaláveis. Aprenda sobre design de banco de dados, RLS e autenticação.","ru":"Навык Supabase Expert помогает строить безопасные и масштабируемые интеграции. Узнайте о проектировании базы данных, RLS и аутентификации.","ar":"مهارة سوبرابيس الخبير تساعد على بناء إدماجات آمنة ومرنة. تعلم عن تصميم قاعدة البيانات و RLS والتحقق","en":"AI-powered Software Requirements Analysis (SRA) system that evaluates requirement quality, detects ambiguities, and suggests structured improvements for more reliable and complete SRS documents."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Supabase 集成专家技能","ja":"Supabase 統合エキスパートスキル","ko":"Supabase 통합 전문가 기술","es":"Experto en Integraciones Supabase","fr":"Expert en Intégrations Supabase","de":"Supabase-Integrationsexperte","pt":"Especialista em Supabase: Otimização de Integrações","ru":"Эксперт Supabase: Оптимизация Интеграций","ar":"خبير سوبرابيس: تحسين الإدماج","en":"supabase-expert"},"description":{"zh":"Supabase 集成专家技能帮助您构建安全、可扩展的 Supabase 集成，涵盖数据库设计、行级安全性和实时功能","ja":"Supabase 統合エキスパートスキルは、データベース設計、行レベルのセキュリティ、リアルタイム機能など、セキュアでスケーラブルな Supabase 統合を構築するのに役立ちます","ko":"Supabase 통합 전문가 기술은 데이터베이스 설계, 행 수준 보안, 실시간 기능 등을 포함하여 보안이 강화되고 확장 가능한 Supabase 통합을 구축하는 데 도움이 됩니다","es":"El experto en integraciones Supabase ayuda a construir integraciones seguras y escalables. Incluye diseño de bases de datos, políticas de seguridad y autenti...","fr":"L''expert en intégrations Supabase aide à créer des intégrations sécurisées et évolutives. Il inclut la conception de bases de données, les politiques de sécu...","de":"Der Supabase-Integrationsexperte hilft bei der Erstellung sicherer und skalierbarer Integrationen. Er umfasst Datenbankdesign, Sicherheitsrichtlinien und Aut...","pt":"O skill Supabase Expert ajuda a construir integrações seguras e escaláveis. Aprenda sobre design de banco de dados, RLS e autenticação.","ru":"Навык Supabase Expert помогает строить безопасные и масштабируемые интеграции. Узнайте о проектировании базы данных, RLS и аутентификации.","ar":"مهارة سوبرابيس الخبير تساعد على بناء إدماجات آمنة ومرنة. تعلم عن تصميم قاعدة البيانات و RLS والتحقق","en":"AI-powered Software Requirements Analysis (SRA) system that evaluates requirement quality, detects ambiguities, and suggests structured improvements for more..."},"definition":{"en":"AI-powered Software Requirements Analysis (SRA) system that evaluates requirement quality, detects ambiguities, and suggests structured improvements for more reliable and complete SRS documents."},"features":{"zh":["数据库设计","行级安全性（RLS）","实时功能","Edge Functions","TypeScript 类型安全"],"ja":["データベース設計","行レベルのセキュリティ（RLS）","リアルタイム機能","Edge Functions","TypeScript 型安全"],"ko":["데이터베이스 설계","행 수준 보안（RLS）","실시간 기능","Edge Functions","TypeScript 타입 안전"],"es":["Diseño de bases de datos","Políticas de seguridad de nivel de fila (RLS)","Autenticación y autorización","Funciones en tiempo real","Seguridad de datos y anonimización"],"fr":["Conception de bases de données","Politiques de sécurité de niveau de ligne (RLS)","Authentification et autorisation","Fonctions en temps réel","Sécurité des données et anonymisation"],"de":["Datenbankdesign","Sicherheitsrichtlinien auf Zeilenebene (RLS)","Authentifizierung und Autorisierung","Echtzeitfunktionen","Datensicherheit und Anonymisierung"],"pt":["Design de banco de dados","Políticas de RLS","Autenticação","Funções de borda","Recursos em tempo real"],"ru":["Проектирование базы данных","Политики RLS","Аутентификация","Функции края","Возможности в реальном времени"],"ar":["تصميم قاعدة البيانات","سياسات RLS","التحقق","دالات الحافة","ميزات في الوقت الفعلي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Supabase","数据库设计","行级安全性","实时功能","Edge Functions","TypeScript","软件要求分析"],"ja":["Supabase","データベース設計","行レベルのセキュリティ","リアルタイム機能","Edge Functions","TypeScript","ソフトウェア要件分析"],"ko":["Supabase","데이터베이스 설계","행 수준 보안","실시간 기능","Edge Functions","TypeScript","소프트웨어 요구 사항 분석"],"es":["integraciones Supabase","diseño de bases de datos","seguridad de datos","autenticación y autorización","funciones en tiempo real","Supabase experto","desarrollo de aplicaciones","bases de datos escalables"],"fr":["intégrations Supabase","conception de bases de données","sécurité des données","authentification et autorisation","fonctions en temps réel","expert Supabase","développement d''applications","bases de données évolutives"],"de":["Supabase-Integrationen","Datenbankdesign","Datensicherheit","Authentifizierung und Autorisierung","Echtzeitfunktionen","Supabase-Experte","Anwendungsentwicklung","skalierbare Datenbanken"],"pt":["supabase","integração","segurança","escalabilidade","design de banco de dados","RLS","autenticação"],"ru":["supabase","интеграция","безопасность","масштабируемость","проектирование базы данных","RLS","аутентификация"],"ar":["سوبرابيس","إدماج","أمان","مرنة","تصميم قاعدة البيانات","RLS","التحقق"]}},"owner":"Aniket-a14","repo":"SRA","repoPath":"Aniket-a14/SRA","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.424Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"supabase-expert","description":"Expert guide for Supabase integration - database schemas, RLS policies, auth, Edge Functions, and real-time subscriptions. Use when working with Supabase backend features.","bodyPreview":"# Supabase Integration Expert Skill\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill helps you build secure, scalable Supabase integrations. Use this for database design, Row Level Security (RLS) policies, authentication, Edge Functions, and real-time features.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. Security First\n- Always enable RLS on tables with user data\n- Use service role key only in secure server contexts\n- Use anon key for client-side operations\n- Test policies thoroughly\n\n### 2. Type Safety\n- Generate TypeScript types fro","body":"# Supabase Integration Expert Skill\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill helps you build secure, scalable Supabase integrations. Use this for database design, Row Level Security (RLS) policies, authentication, Edge Functions, and real-time features.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. Security First\n- Always enable RLS on tables with user data\n- Use service role key only in secure server contexts\n- Use anon key for client-side operations\n- Test policies thoroughly\n\n### 2. Type Safety\n- Generate TypeScript types from schema\n- Use generated types in application\n- Keep types in sync with schema changes\n\n### 3. Performance\n- Use indexes for frequently queried columns\n- Implement pagination for large datasets\n- Use select() to limit returned fields\n- Cache when appropriate\n\n## Database Schema Design\n\n### Basic Table Creation\n\n```sql\n-- Create a table with standard fields\ncreate table public.items (\n  id uuid default gen_random_uuid() primary key,\n  created_at timestamp with time zone default timezone(''utc''::text, now()) not null,\n  updated_at timestamp with time zone default timezone(''utc''::text, now()) not null,\n  user_id uuid references auth.users(id) on delete cascade not null,\n  title text not null,\n  description text,\n  status text default ''draft'' check (status in (''draft'', ''published'', ''archived''))\n);\n\n-- Create updated_at trigger\ncreate or replace function public.handle_updated_at()\nreturns trigger as $$\nbegin\n  new.updated_at = now();\n  return new;\nend;\n$$ language plpgsql;\n\ncreate trigger set_updated_at\n  before update on public.items\n  for each row\n  execute function public.handle_updated_at();\n\n-- Create index\ncreate index items_user_id_idx on public.items(user_id);\ncreate index items_status_idx on public.items(status);\n```\n\n### Foreign Keys & Relations\n\n```sql\n-- One-to-many relationship\ncreate table public.comments (\n  id uuid default gen_random_uuid() primary key,\n  created_at timestamp with time zone default now() not null,\n  item_id uuid references public.items(id) on delete cascade not null,\n  user_id uuid references auth.users(id) on delete cascade not null,\n  content text not null\n);\n\n-- Many-to-many relationship\ncreate table public.item_tags (\n  item_id uuid references public.items(id) on delete cascade,\n  tag_id uuid references public.tags(id) on delete cascade,\n  primary key (item_id, tag_id)\n);\n```\n\n## Row Level Security (RLS)\n\n### Basic RLS Patterns\n\n```sql\n-- Enable RLS\nalter table public.items enable row level security;\n\n-- Users can read their own items\ncreate policy \"Users can read own items\"\n  on public.items for select\n  using (auth.uid() = user_id);\n\n-- Users can insert their own items\ncreate policy \"Users can insert own items\"\n  on public.items for insert\n  with check (auth.uid() = user_id);\n\n-- Users can update their own items\ncreate policy \"Users can update own items\"\n  on public.items for update\n  using (auth.uid() = user_id)\n  with check (auth.uid() = user_id);\n\n-- Users can delete their own items\ncreate policy \"Users can delete own items\"\n  on public.items for delete\n  using (auth.uid() = user_id);\n```\n\n### Advanced RLS Patterns\n\n```sql\n-- Public read, authenticated write\ncreate policy \"Anyone can read published items\"\n  on public.items for select\n  using (status = ''published'');\n\ncreate policy \"Authenticated users can insert\"\n  on public.items for insert\n  to authenticated\n  with check (true);\n\n-- Role-based access\ncreate policy \"Admins can do everything\"\n  on public.items for all\n  using (\n    exists (\n      select 1 from public.user_roles\n      where user_id = auth.uid()\n      and role = ''admin''\n    )\n  );\n\n-- Shared access\ncreate policy \"Users can read shared items\"\n  on public.items for select\n  using (\n    auth.uid() = user_id\n    or exists (\n      select 1 from public.item_shares\n      where item_id = items.id\n      and shared_with = auth.uid()\n    )\n  );\n```\n\n### Anonymous/Guest Access\n\n```sql\n-- Allow anonymous reads\ncreate policy \"Anonymous can read public content\"\n  on public.items for select\n  to anon\n  using (status = ''published'');\n\n-- Allow anonymous inserts (for guest mode)\ncreate policy \"Anonymous can create items\"\n  on public.items for insert\n  to anon\n  with check (true);\n```\n\n## Client Integration\n\n### Setup Client (Next.js)\n\n```typescript\n// lib/supabase/client.ts\nimport { createBrowserClient } from ''@supabase/ssr''\n\nexport function createClient() {\n  return createBrowserClient(\n    process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL!,\n    process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY!\n  )\n}\n\n// lib/supabase/server.ts\nimport { createServerClient } from ''@supabase/ssr''\nimport { cookies } from ''next/headers''\n\nexport function createServerClient() {\n  const cookieStore = cookies()\n\n  return createServerClient(\n    process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL!,\n    process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY!,\n    {\n      cookies: {\n        get(name: string) {\n          return cookieStore.get(name)?.value\n        },\n      },\n    }\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### CRUD Operations\n\n```typescript\n// Query data\nconst { data, error } = await supabase\n  .from(''items'')\n  .select(''*'')\n  .eq(''status'', ''published'')\n  .order(''created_at'', { ascending: false })\n  .limit(10)\n\n// Insert data\nconst { data, error } = await supabase\n  .from(''items'')\n  .insert({ title: ''New Item'', user_id: userId })\n  .select()\n  .single()\n\n// Update data\nconst { data, error } = await supabase\n  .from(''items'')\n  .update({ title: ''Updated Title'' })\n  .eq(''id'', itemId)\n  .select()\n  .single()\n\n// Delete data\nconst { error } = await supabase\n  .from(''items'')\n  .delete()\n  .eq(''id'', itemId)\n\n// Complex joins\nconst { data, error } = await supabase\n  .from(''items'')\n  .select(`\n    *,\n    comments (\n      id,\n      content,\n      user:user_id (\n        email\n      )\n    )\n  `)\n  .eq(''user_id'', userId)\n```\n\n### Real-time Subscriptions\n\n```typescript\n// Subscribe to changes\nconst channel = supabase\n  .channel(''items-changes'')\n  .on(\n    ''postgres_changes'',\n    {\n      event: ''*'',\n      schema: ''public'',\n      table: ''items'',\n      filter: `user_id=eq.${userId}`,\n    },\n    (payload) => {\n      console.log(''Change received!'', payload)\n      // Update local state\n    }\n  )\n  .subscribe()\n\n// Cleanup\nchannel.unsubscribe()\n```\n\n## Authentication\n\n### Email/Password Auth\n\n```typescript\n// Sign up\nconst { data, error } = await supabase.auth.signUp({\n  email: ''user@example.com'',\n  password: ''password123'',\n  options: {\n    data: {\n      display_name: ''User Name'',\n    },\n  },\n})\n\n// Sign in\nconst { data, error } = await supabase.auth.signInWithPassword({\n  email: ''user@example.com'',\n  password: ''password123'',\n})\n\n// Sign out\nconst { error } = await supabase.auth.signOut()\n\n// Get current user\nconst { data: { user } } = await supabase.auth.getUser()\n```\n\n### OAuth Providers\n\n```typescript\n// Google OAuth\nconst { data, error } = await supabase.auth.signInWithOAuth({\n  provider: ''google'',\n  options: {\n    redirectTo: `${window.location.origin}/auth/callback`,\n  },\n})\n\n// Handle callback\n// app/auth/callback/route.ts\nexport async function GET(request: Request) {\n  const { searchParams } = new URL(request.url)\n  const code = searchParams.get(''code'')\n\n  if (code) {\n    const supabase = createServerClient()\n    await supabase.auth.exchangeCodeForSession(code)\n  }\n\n  return NextResponse.redirect(new URL(''/dashboard'', request.url))\n}\n```\n\n### Auth Middleware\n\n```typescript\n// middleware.ts\nimport { createServerClient } from ''@supabase/ssr''\nimport { NextResponse } from ''next/server''\nimport type { NextRequest } from ''next/server''\n\nexport async function middleware(request: NextRequest) {\n  const response = NextResponse.next()\n\n  const supabase = createServerClient(\n    process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL!,\n    process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY!,\n    {\n      cookies: {\n        get(name: string) {\n          return request.cookies.get(name)?.value\n        },\n        set(name: string, value: string, options: any) {\n          response.cookies.set(name, value, options)\n        },\n        remove(name: string, options: any) {\n          response.cookies.set(name, '''', { ...options, maxAge: 0 })\n        },\n      },\n    }\n  )\n\n  const { data: { user } } = await supabase.auth.getUser()\n\n  // Redirect to login if not authenticated\n  if (!user && request.nextUrl.pathname.startsWith(''/dashboard'')) {\n    return NextResponse.redirect(new URL(''/login'', request.url))\n  }\n\n  return response\n}\n\nexport const config = {\n  matcher: [''/dashboard/:path*''],\n}\n```\n\n## Edge Functions\n\n### Basic Edge Function\n\n```typescript\n// supabase/functions/hello/index.ts\nimport { serve } from ''https://deno.land/std@0.168.0/http/server.ts''\nimport { createClient } from ''https://esm.sh/@supabase/supabase-js@2''\n\nserve(async (req) => {\n  try {\n    // Get Supabase client\n    const supabase = createClient(\n      Deno.env.get(''SUPABASE_URL'') ?? '''',\n      Deno.env.get(''SUPABASE_ANON_KEY'') ?? '''',\n      {\n        auth: {\n          autoRefreshToken: false,\n          persistSession: false,\n        },\n      }\n    )\n\n    // Get user from auth header\n    const authHeader = req.headers.get(''Authorization'')\n    const token = authHeader?.replace(''Bearer '', '''')\n    const { data: { user } } = await supabase.auth.getUser(token)\n\n    if (!user) {\n      return new Response(\n        JSON.stringify({ error: ''Unauthorized'' }),\n        { status: 401, headers: { ''Content-Type'': ''application/json'' } }\n      )\n    }\n\n    // Your logic here\n    const { data, error } = await supabase\n      .from(''items'')\n      .select(''*'')\n      .eq(''user_id'', user.id)\n\n    return new Response(\n      JSON.stringify({ data }),\n      { headers: { ''Content-Type'': ''application/json'' } }\n    )\n  } catch (error) {\n    return new Response(\n      JSON.stringify({ error: error.message }),\n      { status: 500, headers: { ''Content-Type'': ''application/json'' } }\n    )\n  }\n})\n```\n\n## Type Generation\n\n```bash\n# Generate TypeScript types\nnpx supabase gen types typescript --project-id your-project-id > types/supabase.ts\n\n# Use in code\nimport { Database } from ''@/types/supabase''\n\ntype Item = Database[''public''][''Tables''][''items''][''Row'']\ntype ItemInsert = Database[''public''][''Tables''][''items''][''Insert'']\ntype ItemUpdate = Database[''public''][''Tables''][''items''][''Update'']\n```\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Soft Deletes\n\n```sql\nalter table public.items add column deleted_at timestamp with time zone;\n\ncreate policy \"Users cannot see deleted items\"\n  on public.items for select\n  using (deleted_at is null);\n\n-- Soft delete function\ncreate or replace function soft_delete_item(item_id uuid)\nreturns void as $$\nbegin\n  update public.items\n  set deleted_at = now()\n  where id = item_id;\nend;\n$$ language plpgsql security definer;\n```\n\n### Audit Logs\n\n```sql\ncreate table public.audit_logs (\n  id uuid default gen_random_uuid() primary key,\n  created_at timestamp with time zone default now() not null,\n  user_id uuid references auth.users(id),\n  table_name text not null,\n  record_id uuid not null,\n  action text not null,\n  changes jsonb\n);\n\n-- Trigger function\ncreate or replace function public.audit_trigger()\nreturns trigger as $$\nbegin\n  insert into public.audit_logs (user_id, table_name, record_id, action, changes)\n  values (\n    auth.uid(),\n    TG_TABLE_NAME,\n    NEW.id,\n    TG_OP,\n    to_jsonb(NEW) - to_jsonb(OLD)\n  );\n  return NEW;\nend;\n$$ language plpgsql security definer;\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Common Issues\n\n1. **401 Errors**: Check RLS policies, ensure user is authenticated\n2. **403 Errors**: RLS policy blocking operation\n3. **Row not found**: Policy may be filtering it out\n4. **Connection issues**: Check URL and API keys\n5. **Type mismatches**: Regenerate types after schema changes\n\n### Debugging RLS\n\n```sql\n-- Test as specific user\nset request.jwt.claims = ''{\"sub\": \"user-uuid-here\"}'';\n\n-- Check what policies apply\nselect * from pg_policies where tablename = ''items'';\n\n-- Disable RLS temporarily (for testing only!)\nalter table public.items disable row level security;\n```\n\n## Best Practices Checklist\n\n- [ ] Enable RLS on all tables with user data\n- [ ] Create indexes for foreign keys and frequently queried columns\n- [ ] Use UUID for primary keys\n- [ ] Add created_at and updated_at timestamps\n- [ ] Implement soft deletes for important data\n- [ ] Use check constraints for enum-like fields\n- [ ] Generate and use TypeScript types\n- [ ] Test RLS policies thoroughly\n- [ ] Use service role key only server-side\n- [ ] Implement proper error handling\n- [ ] Add audit logs for sensitive operations\n- [ ] Use transactions for multi-step operations\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nInvoke this skill when:\n- Designing database schemas\n- Creating or debugging RLS policies\n- Setting up authentication\n- Building Edge Functions\n- Implementing real-time features\n- Troubleshooting Supabase issues\n- Optimizing database queries\n- Setting up type generation\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:44:55.009Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Agents needing secure and scalable Supabase integrations with advanced features like Row Level Security and Edge Functions.","zh":"非常适合需要安全且可扩展的 Supabase 集成的云代理，具有高级功能，如行级安全性和边缘函数。","ja":"セキュアでスケーラブルな Supabase 統合が必要なクラウドエージェントに最適です。行レベルセキュリティやエッジ関数などの高度な機能を備えています。","ko":"보안이 뛰어난 확장 가능한 Supabase 통합이 필요한 클라우드 에이전트에 적합합니다. 행 수준 보안 및 에지 함수와 같은 고급 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes en la Nube que necesitan integraciones de Supabase seguras y escalables con características avanzadas como Seguridad de Nivel de Fila y Funciones de Borde.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents Cloud nécessitant des intégrations Supabase sécurisées et évolutives avec des fonctionnalités avancées comme la Sécurité au Niveau de Ligne et les Fonctions de Bord.","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Agents, die sichere und skalierbare Supabase-Integrationen mit erweiterten Funktionen wie ZeilenEbene-Sicherheit und Edge-Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de nuvem que necessitam de integrações seguras e escaláveis do Supabase com recursos avançados como Segurança em Nível de Linha e Funções de Borda.","ru":"Идеально для облачных агентов, которым необходимы безопасные и масштабируемые интеграции с Supabase с такими продвинутыми функциями, как Безопасность на уровне строк и Функции Edge.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء السحابية الذين يحتاجون إلى دمج سوبابيز آمن ومقابل للتحجيم مع ميزات متقدمة مثل أمان مستوى الصف ووظائف الحافة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design secure database architectures using Supabase, enforcing Type Safety with TypeScript and implementing robust Row Level Security policies, while leveraging Edge Functions for real-time features and authentication.","zh":"赋予代理设计使用 Supabase 的安全数据库架构的能力，强制使用 TypeScript 实现类型安全，并实施强大的行级安全策略，同时利用边缘函数实现实时功能和身份验证。","ja":"エージェントが Supabase を使用してセキュアなデータベースアーキテクチャを設計できるようにします。TypeScript を使用してタイプセーフティを確保し、強力な行レベルセキュリティポリシーを実施し、エッジ関数を使用してリアルタイム機能や認証を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 Supabase를 사용하여 보안 데이터베이스 아키텍처를 설계할 수 있도록 합니다. TypeScript를 사용하여 유형 안전성을 강제하고 강력한 행 수준 보안 정책을 구현하며 에지 함수를 사용하여 실시간 기능 및 인증을 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar arquitecturas de base de datos seguras utilizando Supabase, aplicando la Seguridad de Tipos con TypeScript y implementando políticas de Seguridad de Nivel de Fila robustas, mientras aprovecha las Funciones de Borde para características y autenticación en tiempo real.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des architectures de base de données sécurisées en utilisant Supabase, en appliquant la Sécurité des Types avec TypeScript et en mettant en œuvre des politiques de Sécurité au Niveau de Ligne robustes, tout en exploitant les Fonctions de Bord pour des fonctionnalités et une authentification en temps réel.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, sichere Datenbankarchitekturen mit Supabase zu entwerfen, indem Typsicherheit mit TypeScript durchgesetzt und robuste ZeilenEbene-Sicherheitsrichtlinien implementiert werden, während die Edge-Funktionen für Echtzeitfunktionen und Authentifizierung genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar arquiteturas de banco de dados seguras usando o Supabase, aplicando Segurança de Tipo com TypeScript e implementando políticas de Segurança em Nível de Linha robustas, ao mesmo tempo em que aproveita as Funções de Borda para recursos em tempo real e autenticação.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать безопасные архитектуры баз данных с помощью Supabase, обеспечивая Безопасность типов с помощью TypeScript и реализуя прочные политики Безопасности на уровне строк, а также использует Функции Edge для функций в режиме реального времени и аутентификации.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تصميم هندسة قواعد البيانات الآمنة باستخدام سوبابيز، مع تطبيق سلامة النوع باستخدام تايب سكريبت وتنفيذ سياسات أمان مستوى الصف قوية، وفي الوقت نفسه الاستفادة من وظائف الحافة لميزات الوقت الفعلي والتحقق."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing secure and scalable Supabase databases with Row Level Security","Implementing authentication and authorization using service role keys and anon keys","Developing real-time features with Edge Functions and Supabase","Generating TypeScript types for robust type safety in Supabase integrations"],"zh":["设计具有行级安全性的安全且可扩展的 Supabase 数据库","使用服务角色密钥和匿名密钥实现身份验证和授权","使用边缘函数和 Supabase 开发实时功能","为 Supabase 集成生成 TypeScript 类型以实现强大的类型安全"],"ja":["行レベルセキュリティを備えたセキュアでスケーラブルな Supabase データベースを設計する","サービスロールキーと匿名キーを使用して認証と認可を実装する","エッジ関数と Supabase を使用してリアルタイム機能を開発する","Supabase 統合の強力なタイプセーフティを実現するための TypeScript タイプを生成する"],"ko":["행 수준 보안이 있는 보안 및 확장 가능한 Supabase 데이터베이스 설계","서비스 역할 키 및 匿名 키를 사용하여 인증 및 권한 부여 구현","에지 함수 및 Supabase를 사용하여 실시간 기능 개발","Supabase 통합을 위한 강력한 유형 안전성을 제공하는 TypeScript 유형 생성"],"es":["Diseñar bases de datos Supabase seguras y escalables con Seguridad de Nivel de Fila","Implementar autenticación y autorización utilizando claves de rol de servicio y claves anónimas","Desarrollar características en tiempo real con Funciones de Borde y Supabase","Generar tipos TypeScript para una seguridad de tipos robusta en integraciones de Supabase"],"fr":["Concevoir des bases de données Supabase sécurisées et évolutives avec la Sécurité au Niveau de Ligne","Mettre en œuvre l''authentification et l''autorisation en utilisant des clés de rôle de service et des clés anonymes","Développer des fonctionnalités en temps réel avec les Fonctions de Bord et Supabase","Générer des types TypeScript pour une sécurité des types robuste dans les intégrations Supabase"],"de":["Sichere und skalierbare Supabase-Datenbanken mit ZeilenEbene-Sicherheit entwerfen","Authentifizierung und Autorisierung mithilfe von Dienstrollenschlüsseln und anonymer Schlüssel implementieren","Echtzeitfunktionen mit Edge-Funktionen und Supabase entwickeln","TypScript-Typen für eine robuste Typsicherheit in Supabase-Integrationen generieren"],"pt":["Projetar bancos de dados do Supabase seguros e escaláveis com Segurança em Nível de Linha","Implementar autenticação e autorização usando chaves de função de serviço e chaves anônimas","Desenvolver recursos em tempo real com Funções de Borda e Supabase","Gerar tipos TypeScript para segurança de tipo robusta em integrações do Supabase"],"ru":["Проектировать безопасные и масштабируемые базы данных Supabase с Безопасностью на уровне строк","Реализовывать аутентификацию и авторизацию с помощью ключей служебной роли и анонимных ключей","Разрабатывать функции в режиме реального времени с помощью Функций Edge и Supabase","Генерировать типы TypeScript для прочной безопасности типов в интеграциях с Supabase"],"ar":["تصميم قواعد بيانات سوبابيز آمنة ومقابلة للتحجيم مع أمان مستوى الصف","تنفيذ التحقق والتصريح باستخدام مفاتيح دورة الخدمة ومفاتيح غير معروفة","تطوير ميزات الوقت الفعلي مع وظائف الحافة وسوبابيز","توليد أنواع تايب سكريبت من أجل سلامة النوع القوية في التكاملات مع سوبابيز"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Supabase account and project setup","Needs understanding of TypeScript for type safety features","Dependent on Supabase service availability and updates"],"zh":["需要 Supabase 账户和项目设置","需要了解 TypeScript 以使用类型安全功能","依赖于 Supabase 服务的可用性和更新"],"ja":["Supabase アカウントとプロジェクト設定が必要","タイプセーフティ機能を使用するには TypeScript の理解が必要","Supabase サービスの可用性と更新に依存する"],"ko":["Supabase 계정 및 프로젝트 설정이 필요합니다.","타입 안전성 기능을 사용하려면 TypeScript에 대한 이해가 필요합니다.","Supabase 서비스의 가용성 및 업데이트에 의존합니다."],"es":["Requiere una cuenta y configuración de proyecto de Supabase","Necesita conocimiento de TypeScript para características de seguridad de tipos","Dependiente de la disponibilidad y actualizaciones del servicio Supabase"],"fr":["Nécessite un compte et une configuration de projet Supabase","Nécessite une compréhension de TypeScript pour les fonctionnalités de sécurité des types","Dépend de la disponibilité et des mises à jour du service Supabase"],"de":["Benötigt ein Supabase-Konto und eine Projektkonfiguration","Benötigt Kenntnisse von TypeScript für Typsicherheitsfunktionen","Abhängig von der Verfügbarkeit und Updates des Supabase-Dienstes"],"pt":["Exige conta e configuração de projeto do Supabase","Necessita de compreensão do TypeScript para recursos de segurança de tipo","Depende da disponibilidade e atualizações do serviço do Supabase"],"ru":["Требует учетной записи и настройки проекта Supabase","Требует понимания TypeScript для функций безопасности типов","Зависит от доступности и обновлений сервиса Supabase"],"ar":["يتطلب حسابًا وإعداد مشروع سوبابيز","يتطلب فهم تايب سكريبت لميزات سلامة النوع","يعتمد على توافر وتحديثات خدمة سوبابيز"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
