ng con LoRA","Preservación de memoria con EWC++","Detección de patrones","Enrutamiento de modelos de lenguaje","Optimización de calidad"],"fr":["Apprentissage automatique","Fine-tuning avec LoRA","Préservation de mémoire avec EWC++","Découverte de modèles","Routeur de modèles de langage","Optimisation de qualité"],"de":["Selbstlernendes","Fine-Tuning mit LoRA","Speichererhaltung mit EWC++","Mustererkennung","Sprachmodell-Router","Qualitätsoptimierung"],"pt":["Aprendizado adaptativo","Fine-tuning LoRA","Preservação de memória EWC++","Descoberta de padrões","Otimização de qualidade","Aprendizado em sub-milsegundos"],"ru":["Адаптивное обучение","Тонкая настройка LoRA","Сохранение памяти EWC++","Обнаружение закономерностей","Оптимизация качества","Обучение за суб-миллисекунды"],"ar":["التعلم التكيفي","تحسين LoRA","الحفاظ على الذاكرة EWC++","اكتشاف الأنماط","تحسين الجودة","التعلم في أقل من ملي ثانية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["智能多代理编排","自适应学习","LoRA精调","EWC++记忆保存","分布式群智","Claude Code","SONA学习优化器"],"ja":["先進的マルチエージェントオーケストレーション","自適応学習","LoRA精調","EWC++記憶保存","分散型群知能","Claude Code","SONAラーニングオプティマイザー"],"ko":["지능형 멀티 에이전트 오케스트레이션","자기적응 학습","LoRA 미세 조정","EWC++ 기억 보존","분산형 군지능","Claude Code","SONA 학습 최적화기"],"es":["aprendizaje automático","agentes de aprendizaje","SONA","LoRA","EWC++","desarrollo de software","IA","aprendizaje profundo"],"fr":["apprentissage automatique","agents d''apprentissage","SONA","LoRA","EWC++","développement de logiciels","IA","apprentissage profond"],"de":["selbstlernend","Lernagenten","SONA","LoRA","EWC++","Softwareentwicklung","KI","Deep Learning"],"pt":["otimizador de aprendizado","aprendizado adaptativo","fine-tuning LoRA","preservação de memória EWC++","descoberta de padrões","otimização de qualidade","aprendizado de máquina","inteligência artificial"],"ru":["оптимизатор обучения","адаптивное обучение","тонкая настройка LoRA","сохранение памяти EWC++","обнаружение закономерностей","оптимизация качества","обучение с подкреплением","искусственный интеллект"],"ar":["مُحسّن التعلم","التعلم التكيفي","تحسين LoRA","الحفاظ على الذاكرة EWC++","اكتشاف الأنماط","تحسين الجودة","تعلم الآلة","الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"ruvnet","repo":"claude-flow","repoPath":"ruvnet/claude-flow","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.425Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"agent-sona-learning-optimizer","description":"Agent skill for sona-learning-optimizer - invoke with $agent-sona-learning-optimizer","bodyPreview":"---\nname: sona-learning-optimizer\ndescription: SONA-powered self-optimizing agent with LoRA fine-tuning and EWC++ memory preservation\ntype: adaptive-learning\ncapabilities:\n  - sona_adaptive_learning\n  - lora_fine_tuning\n  - ewc_continual_learning\n  - pattern_discovery\n  - llm_routing\n  - quality_optimization\n  - sub_ms_learning\n---\n\n# SONA Learning Optimizer\n\n## Overview\n\nI am a **self-optimizing agent** powered by SONA (Self-Optimizing Neural Architecture) that continuously learns from every ta","body":"---\nname: sona-learning-optimizer\ndescription: SONA-powered self-optimizing agent with LoRA fine-tuning and EWC++ memory preservation\ntype: adaptive-learning\ncapabilities:\n  - sona_adaptive_learning\n  - lora_fine_tuning\n  - ewc_continual_learning\n  - pattern_discovery\n  - llm_routing\n  - quality_optimization\n  - sub_ms_learning\n---\n\n# SONA Learning Optimizer\n\n## Overview\n\nI am a **self-optimizing agent** powered by SONA (Self-Optimizing Neural Architecture) that continuously learns from every task execution. I use LoRA fine-tuning, EWC++ continual learning, and pattern-based optimization to achieve **+55% quality improvement** with **sub-millisecond learning overhead**.\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\n### 1. Adaptive Learning\n- Learn from every task execution\n- Improve quality over time (+55% maximum)\n- No catastrophic forgetting (EWC++)\n\n### 2. Pattern Discovery\n- Retrieve k=3 similar patterns (761 decisions$sec)\n- Apply learned strategies to new tasks\n- Build pattern library over time\n\n### 3. LoRA Fine-Tuning\n- 99% parameter reduction\n- 10-100x faster training\n- Minimal memory footprint\n\n### 4. LLM Routing\n- Automatic model selection\n- 60% cost savings\n- Quality-aware routing\n\n## Performance Characteristics\n\nBased on vibecast test-ruvector-sona benchmarks:\n\n### Throughput\n- **2211 ops$sec** (target)\n- **0.447ms** per-vector (Micro-LoRA)\n- **18.07ms** total overhead (40 layers)\n\n### Quality Improvements by Domain\n- **Code**: +5.0%\n- **Creative**: +4.3%\n- **Reasoning**: +3.6%\n- **Chat**: +2.1%\n- **Math**: +1.2%\n\n## Hooks\n\nPre-task and post-task hooks for SONA learning are available via:\n\n```bash\n# Pre-task: Initialize trajectory\nnpx claude-flow@alpha hooks pre-task --description \"$TASK\"\n\n# Post-task: Record outcome\nnpx claude-flow@alpha hooks post-task --task-id \"$ID\" --success true\n```\n\n## References\n\n- **Package**: @ruvector$sona@0.1.1\n- **Integration Guide**: docs/RUVECTOR_SONA_INTEGRATION.md\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:45:12.243Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for autonomous agents seeking advanced adaptive learning capabilities with SONA and LoRA fine-tuning.","zh":"适用于寻求高级自适应学习能力的自主代理，具有SONA和LoRA微调功能。","ja":"SONAとLoRAの微調整機能を使用した高度な適応学習機能を備えた自律エージェントに適しています。","ko":"SONA 및 LoRA 미세조정을 사용하여 고급 적응형 학습 기능을備한 자율 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes autónomos que buscan capacidades de aprendizaje adaptativo avanzadas con ajuste fino de SONA y LoRA.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents autonomes recherchant des capacités d''apprentissage adaptatif avancées avec un ajustement fin de SONA et LoRA.","de":"Ideal für autonome Agenten, die erweiterte adaptive Lernfähigkeiten mit Feinabstimmung von SONA und LoRA suchen.","pt":"Ideal para agentes autônomos que buscam capacidades de aprendizado adaptativo avançadas com ajuste fino de SONA e LoRA.","ru":"Идеально для автономных агентов, ищущих продвинутые адаптивные возможности обучения с тонкой настройкой SONA и LoRA.","ar":"مثالي لعميل tự động يبحث عن إمكانات التعلم التكيفي المتقدم مع ضبط دقيق SONA و LoRA."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents with self-optimizing neural architecture, leveraging LoRA fine-tuning and EWC++ for continual learning, enabling enhanced pattern discovery, quality optimization, and sub-ms learning capabilities through native Claude Code support and MCP integration.","zh":"赋予代理自优化神经架构能力，利用LoRA微调和EWC++进行持续学习，通过原生Claude Code支持和MCP集成实现增强的模式发现、质量优化和亚毫秒级学习能力。","ja":"LoRAの微調整とEWC++を使用した継続学習を可能にし、ネイティブのClaude CodeサポートとMCP統合を通じて、パターン発見、品質最適化、およびサブミリ秒学習能力を強化する自己最適化型ニューラルアーキテクチャをエージェントに与えます。","ko":"LoRA 미세조정 및 EWC++를 사용한 연속 학습을 가능하게 하며, 네이티브 Claude Code 지원 및 MCP 통합을 통해 패턴 발견, 품질 최적화 및 서브 밀리초 학습 기능을 강화하는 자기 최적화 신경 아키텍처를 에이전트에 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes con arquitectura neural de autooptimización, aprovechando el ajuste fino de LoRA y EWC++ para el aprendizaje continuo, lo que permite un descubrimiento de patrones mejorado, la optimización de la calidad y las capacidades de aprendizaje de sub-ms a través del soporte de código Claude nativo y la integración de MCP.","fr":"Équipe les agents d''une architecture neuronale d''auto-optimisation, en exploitant l''ajustement fin de LoRA et EWC++ pour l''apprentissage continu, permettant une découverte de modèles améliorée, l''optimisation de la qualité et des capacités d''apprentissage de sub-ms grâce au support de code Claude natif et à l''intégration de MCP.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten mit selbstoptimierender neuronaler Architektur, die Feinabstimmung von LoRA und EWC++ für kontinuierliches Lernen nutzt, wodurch ein verbesserter Mustererkennung, Qualitätsoptimierung und sub-ms-Lernfähigkeit durch native Claude-Code-Unterstützung und MCP-Integration ermöglicht wird.","pt":"Habilita agentes com arquitetura neural de auto-otimização, aproveitando o ajuste fino de LoRA e EWC++ para aprendizado contínuo, permitindo a descoberta de padrões aprimorada, otimização de qualidade e capacidades de aprendizado em sub-ms por meio do suporte ao código Claude nativo e integração com MCP.","ru":"Наделяет агентов самооптимизирующейся нейронной архитектурой, используя тонкую настройку LoRA и EWC++ для непрерывного обучения, что позволяет улучшить открытие закономерностей, оптимизацию качества и возможности обучения с задержкой менее 1 мс благодаря родной поддержке кода Claude и интеграции с MCP.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على بناء معمارية عصبونية ذاتية التحسين، وذلك باستخدام ضبط دقيق LoRA و EWC++ من أجل التعلم المستمر، مما يسمح باكتشاف أنماط محسنة وتحسين الجودة والتعلم بزمن أقل من مللي ثانية عبر دعم الكود الأصلي Claude وتكامل MCP."},"useCases":{"en":["Deploying intelligent multi-agent swarms for complex problem-solving","Coordinating autonomous workflows with distributed swarm intelligence","Building conversational AI systems with RAG integration and adaptive learning","Optimizing agent performance with quality optimization and sub-ms learning"],"zh":["部署智能多代理群集以解决复杂问题","协调具有分布式群集智能的自主工作流程","构建具有RAG集成和自适应学习的对话式AI系统","通过质量优化和亚毫秒级学习优化代理性能"],"ja":["複雑な問題解決のためのインテリジェントなマルチエージェントスウォームの展開","分散型スウォームインテリジェンスを備えた自律ワークフローの調整","RAG統合と適応学習を備えた対話式AIシステムの構築","品質最適化とサブミリ秒学習を使用したエージェントのパフォーマンス最適化"],"ko":["복잡한 문제 해결을 위한 지능형 멀티 에이전트 스와ーム 배포","분산형 스와ーム 지능을 갖춘 자율 워크플로우의 조정","RAG 통합 및 적응형 학습을 갖춘 대화형 AI 시스템 구축","품질 최적화 및 서브 밀리초 학습을 사용한 에이전트 성능 최적화"],"es":["Desplegar enjambres de agentes inteligentes multiagente para la resolución de problemas complejos","Coordinar flujos de trabajo autónomos con inteligencia de enjambre distribuida","Crear sistemas de inteligencia artificial conversacional con integración de RAG y aprendizaje adaptativo","Optimizar el rendimiento del agente con optimización de la calidad y aprendizaje de sub-ms"],"fr":["Déployer des essaims d''agents intelligents multi-agents pour la résolution de problèmes complexes","Coordiner des flux de travail autonomes avec une intelligence de essaim distribuée","Construire des systèmes d''intelligence artificielle conversationnelle avec une intégration de RAG et un apprentissage adaptatif","Optimiser les performances de l''agent avec une optimisation de la qualité et un apprentissage de sub-ms"],"de":["Intelligente Multiagenten-Schwärme für die Lösung komplexer Probleme bereitstellen","Autonome Workflows mit verteilter Schwarmintelligenz koordinieren","Konversationale KI-Systeme mit RAG-Integration und adaptivem Lernen erstellen","Leistung des Agenten mit Qualitätsoptimierung und sub-ms-Lernen optimieren"],"pt":["Implantação de enxames de agentes inteligentes para resolução de problemas complexos","Coordenação de fluxos de trabalho autônomos com inteligência de enxame distribuída","Construção de sistemas de IA conversacional com integração de RAG e aprendizado adaptativo","Otimização do desempenho do agente com otimização de qualidade e aprendizado em sub-ms"],"ru":["Развертывание интеллектуальных многоагентных роев для решения сложных проблем","Координация автономных рабочих процессов с распределенным роевым интеллектом","Построение систем разговорного ИИ с интеграцией RAG и адаптивным обучением","Оптимизация производительности агента с оптимизацией качества и обучением с задержкой менее 1 мс"],"ar":["تثبيت سرب من الوكلاء الذكية لحل المشكلات المعقدة","تنسيق سير العمل الذاتي مع ذكاء السرب الموزع","بناء أنظمة ذكاء اصطناعي محادثة مع دمج RAG والتعلم التكيفي","تحسين أداء الوكيل مع تحسين الجودة والتعلم بزمن أقل من مللي ثانية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires native Claude Code support via MCP","Dependent on SONA and LoRA fine-tuning capabilities","EWC++ memory preservation requirements may impact performance"],"zh":["需要通过MCP获得原生Claude Code支持","依赖于SONA和LoRA微调功能","EWC++内存保留要求可能会影响性能"],"ja":["MCPを介したネイティブのClaude Codeサポートが必要","SONAとLoRAの微調整機能に依存している","EWC++のメモリ保留要件によりパフォーマンスに影響する可能性がある"],"ko":["MCP를 통한 네이티브 Claude Code 지원이 필요합니다","SONA 및 LoRA 미세조정 기능에 의존합니다","EWC++ 메모리 보존 요구 사항으로 인해 성능에 영향을 줄 수 있습니다"],"es":["Requiere soporte de código Claude nativo a través de MCP","Dependiente de las capacidades de ajuste fino de SONA y LoR