","إدارة مثيلات","تنقيح موحد","ترشيح أدوات ذكية","تطوير البرمجيات","تكنولوجيا سياق النموذج"]}},"owner":"wibus-wee","repo":"mcpv","repoPath":"wibus-wee/mcpv","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.425Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"project-overview","description":"Provides comprehensive overview of mcpd project architecture, capabilities, and key technical details. Use when understanding the project structure, architecture layers, or core concepts.","bodyPreview":"# mcpd Project Overview\n\n**mcpd** is an elastic control plane and runtime for Model Context Protocol (MCP) servers. It provides on-demand startup, scale-to-zero hibernation, unified routing, and intelligent tool filtering for managing multiple MCP servers locally.\n\n## Key Capabilities\n\n- Elastic runtime with automatic instance lifecycle management\n- Unified gateway (`mcpvmcp`) providing single entry point for all MCP servers\n- Smart SubAgent powered by CloudWeGo/Eino for context-aware tool filte","body":"# mcpd Project Overview\n\n**mcpd** is an elastic control plane and runtime for Model Context Protocol (MCP) servers. It provides on-demand startup, scale-to-zero hibernation, unified routing, and intelligent tool filtering for managing multiple MCP servers locally.\n\n## Key Capabilities\n\n- Elastic runtime with automatic instance lifecycle management\n- Unified gateway (`mcpvmcp`) providing single entry point for all MCP servers\n- Smart SubAgent powered by CloudWeGo/Eino for context-aware tool filtering\n- GUI support (`mcpvui`) built with Wails 3 for configuration and monitoring\n- Profile-based configuration with tag-based visibility\n- Native observability with Prometheus metrics and Grafana dashboards\n\n## Architecture\n\nThree-layer architecture for maximum decoupling:\n\n1. **Core (`mcpv`)**: Central control plane managing instance lifecycles, scheduling, and aggregation\n2. **Gateway (`mcpvmcp`)**: Protocol bridge acting as standard MCP server for AI clients\n3. **App (`mcpvui`)**: Wails-driven GUI for configuration, monitoring, and core lifecycle hosting\n\n### Internal Structure\n\n- `internal/domain/`: Domain models and interfaces (ServerSpec, Instance, Transport, Scheduler, Router, etc.)\n- `internal/app/`: Application glue layer with explicit subpackages:\n  - `controlplane/`: Control plane facade, registry/discovery/observability/automation, reload application\n  - `bootstrap/`: Bootstrap and server initialization management\n  - `catalog/`: Catalog providers and state loading\n  - `runtime/`: Runtime indexes and aggregation state\n- `internal/infra/`: Infrastructure adapters organized by concern:\n  - `catalog/`: Configuration loading and validation\n  - `scheduler/`: Instance lifecycle and capacity constraints coordination\n  - `lifecycle/`: Instance startup, handshake, and shutdown management\n  - `router/`: Request routing to managed MCP server instances\n  - `transport/`: stdio and streamable HTTP transport implementations\n  - `aggregator/`: Tool/resource/prompt aggregation and indexing\n  - `gateway/`: MCP gateway client manager and registry\n  - `subagent/`: Eino-based intelligent tool filtering\n  - `telemetry/`: Prometheus metrics and health checks\n  - `rpc/`: gRPC server and client for core-gateway communication\n- `internal/ui/`: Wails bridge layer exposing core functionality to GUI\n\n## Configuration\n\nConfiguration is YAML-based with a single file per profile. See `docs/catalog.example.yaml` or `runtime.yaml` for reference.\n\n**Key Configuration Sections**:\n- `servers[]`: MCP server definitions with transport, command, tags, lifecycle settings\n- `subAgent`: Eino-based tool filtering configuration (model, provider, API key, enabled tags)\n- `observability`: Prometheus metrics endpoint configuration\n- `rpc`: gRPC server configuration for core-gateway communication\n- Runtime settings: timeouts, concurrency limits, retry policies, bootstrap behavior\n\n**Server Configuration Example**:\n```yaml\nservers:\n  - name: my-server\n    transport: stdio\n    cmd: [node, ./path/to/server.js]\n    tags: [chat]\n    idleSeconds: 60\n    maxConcurrent: 1\n    strategy: stateless\n    activationMode: on-demand\n    protocolVersion: \"2025-11-25\"\n```\n\n**Profile System**:\n- Multiple profiles supported with caller-to-profile mapping\n- Default profile used as fallback\n- Tag-based visibility: clients see only servers matching their tags\n\n## Transport Types and Activation Modes\n\n### Transport Types\n\n**stdio** (most common):\n- Launches subprocess and communicates via stdin/stdout\n- Suitable for Node.js, Python, and other scripting languages\n- Process lifecycle managed by mcpv\n\n**streamable_http**:\n- Connects to HTTP endpoint with Server-Sent Events (SSE) streaming\n- Suitable for long-running HTTP services\n- No process management needed\n\n**composite**:\n- Advanced use case combining multiple transports\n- Rarely needed\n\n### Activation Modes\n\n**on-demand** (default):\n- Instances start when first request arrives\n- Ideal for resource efficiency\n- Cold start latency on first request\n\n**always-on**:\n- Keeps `minReady` instances running at all times\n- Use for latency-sensitive servers\n- Higher resource usage\n\n**disabled**:\n- Server defined but not activated\n- Useful for testing or staged rollouts\n\n### Server Strategies\n\n**stateless**:\n- Requests can be routed to any available instance\n- Instances can be freely started/stopped\n- Most common and efficient\n\n**stateful**:\n- Router maintains sticky sessions\n- Requests from same client go to same instance\n- Session expires after client inactivity timeout\n\n### Gateway Behavior\n\nThe `mcpvmcp` gateway:\n- Registers with core on startup via gRPC\n- Maintains persistent connection to core\n- Translates MCP JSON-RPC to core''s internal protocol\n- Handles tool/resource/prompt aggregation\n- Supports both single-server and tag-based modes\n\n### Flags\n\n- `--config`: Specify config directory (default: current directory)\n- `--rpc`: Override RPC address for gateway\n- `--tag`: Filter servers by tag in gateway mode\n- `--server`: Single-server mode for gateway\n\n## Key Technical Details\n\n### Hot Reload\n\nThe core watches the config directory for changes and automatically reloads:\n- Server spec additions/removals\n- Configuration updates\n- Profile changes\n- Active instances are gracefully drained before applying changes\n\n### Concurrency Control\n\n- `maxConcurrent`: Maximum parallel requests per instance\n- `minReady`: Minimum instances to keep warm\n- Scheduler spawns new instances when capacity is reached\n- Instances are reused across requests (connection pooling)\n\n### Tool Namespace Strategy\n\nTo avoid tool name collisions across servers:\n- **prefix**: Tools named as `server__toolname` (default)\n- **suffix**: Tools named as `toolname__server`\n\n### Bootstrap Modes\n\n- **metadata**: Only fetch server metadata (tools/resources/prompts) on startup\n- **full**: Perform full initialization including handshake\n- **none**: Skip bootstrap entirely\n\n### Scale-to-Zero Runtime\n\nInstances are launched on-demand and shut down after idle timeout:\n- Scheduler manages instance pools with concurrency limits\n- Router maintains session affinity for stateful servers\n- Lifecycle manager handles startup, handshake, and graceful shutdown\n- Probe system monitors instance health\n\n### Tool Aggregation\n\nThe aggregator maintains a unified index across all active instances:\n- Automatic refresh on `list_changed` notifications\n- Concurrent refresh workers with rate limiting\n- Namespace strategy (prefix or suffix) to avoid tool name collisions\n- Supports tools, resources, and prompts\n\n## Version Information\n\n- **Go**: 1.25+\n- **Wails**: 3.0.0-alpha.53\n- **MCP SDK**: github.com/modelcontextprotocol/go-sdk v1.2.0\n- **Eino**: github.com/cloudwego/eino v0.7.15\n- **Prometheus**: github.com/prometheus/client_golang v1.23.2\n\n## Additional Resources\n\n- **MCP Specification**: https://modelcontextprotocol.io/\n- **Wails Documentation**: https://wails.io/\n- **Wire Documentation**: https://github.com/google/wire\n- **CloudWeGo Eino**: https://github.com/cloudwego/eino\n- **Frontend Guide**: See `frontend/CLAUDE.md` for React/TypeScript frontend development\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:45:47.804Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Model Context Protocol Agents needing elastic runtime management and unified gateway capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要弹性运行时管理和统一网关能力的模型上下文协议代理。","ja":"モデルコンテキストプロトコルエージェントがエラスティックなランタイム管理と統一ゲートウェイ機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"탄력적인 런타임 관리 및統一 게이트웨이 기능이 필요한 모델 컨텍스트 프로토콜 에이전트에게 최적입니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Protocolo de Contexto de Modelo que necesitan administración de tiempo de ejecución elástica y capacidades de pasarela unificadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de protocole de contexte de modèle nécessitant une gestion de runtime élastique et des capacités de passerelle unifiées.","de":"Perfekt für Model Context Protocol-Agents, die eine elastische Laufzeitverwaltung und einheitliche Gateway-Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Protocolo de Contexto de Modelo que necessitam de gerenciamento de tempo de execução elástico e capacidades de gateway unificadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов протокола контекста модели, требующих гибкого управления временем выполнения и объединенных возможностей шлюза.","ar":"مثالي لعميل بروتوكول سياق النموذج الذي يحتاج إلى إدارة وقت تشغيل مرن وقدرات بوابة موحدة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage multiple MCP servers with automatic instance lifecycle management, unified routing, and intelligent tool filtering using CloudWeGo/Eino, providing a single entry point through the mcpvmcp gateway.","zh":"通过CloudWeGo/Eino实现多个MCP服务器的自动实例生命周期管理、统一路由和智能工具过滤，提供mcpvmcp网关的单一入口点，赋予代理管理多个MCP服务器的能力。","ja":"CloudWeGo/Einoを使用して、複数のMCPサーバーに対する自動インスタンスライフサイクル管理、統一ルーティング、コンテキスト認識SubAgent機能を使用した智能ツールフィルタリングを実現し、mcpvmcpゲートウェイを通じて単一のエントリーポイントを提供します。","ko":"CloudWeGo/Eino를 사용하여 여러 MCP 서버에 대한 자동 인스턴스 라이프사이클 관리, 통일된 라우팅 및 컨텍스트 인식 SubAgent 기능을 사용한 지능형 도구 필터링을 제공하여 mcpvmcp 게이트웨이를 통해 단일 진입점을 제공하여 에이전트가 여러 MCP 서버를 관리할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a administrar varios servidores MCP con administración automática del ciclo de vida de instancias, enrutamiento unificado y filtrado de herramientas inteligentes mediante CloudWeGo/Eino, proporcionando un solo punto de entrada a través de la pasarela mcpvmcp.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer plusieurs serveurs MCP avec une gestion automatique du cycle de vie des instances, un routage unifié et un filtrage d''outils intelligents à l''aide de CloudWeGo/Eino, fournissant un seul point d''entrée via la passerelle mcpvmcp.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, mehrere MCP-Server mit automatischer Instanz-Lebenszyklusverwaltung, einheitlichem Routing und intelligenter Werkzeugfilterung unter Verwendung von CloudWeGo/Eino zu verwalten, wodurch ein einziger Einstiegspunkt über die mcpvmcp-Gateway bereitgestellt wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar vários servidores MCP com gerenciamento de ciclo de vida de instância automático, roteamento unificado e filtragem de ferramentas inteligentes usando CloudWeGo/Eino, fornecendo um único ponto de entrada por meio do gateway mcpvmcp.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять несколькими серверами MCP с автоматическим управлением жизненным циклом экземпляра, унифицированным маршрутизацией и интеллектуальной фильтрацией инструментов с помощью CloudWeGo/Eino, предоставляя единую точку входа через шлюз mcpvmcp.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إدارة خوادم متعددة MCP مع إدارة دورة حياة التطبيق التلقائي والتوجيه الموحد وترشيح الأدوات الذكية باستخدام CloudWeGo/Eino، مما يوفر نقطة دخول واحدة من خلال بوابة mcpvmcp."},"useCases":{"en":["Orchestrating MCP servers for on-demand startup and scale-to-zero hibernation","Unifying routing for multiple MCP servers","Filtering tools with context-aware SubAgent capabilities"],"zh":["为MCP服务器编排按需启动和缩放至零休眠","为多个MCP服务器统一路由","使用上下文感知SubAgent功能过滤工具"],"ja":["MCPサーバーの起動とスケールゼロ休眠を必要に応じてオーケストレーションする","複数のMCPサーバーに対するルーティングを統一する","コンテキスト認識SubAgent機能を使用してツールをフィルタリングする"],"ko":["MCP 서버의 需要에応じた 시작 및 0으로의 스케일을 위한 오케스트레이션","다중 MCP 서버의 라우팅을 통일하는 것","컨텍스트 인식 SubAgent 기능을 사용한 도구 필터링"],"es":["Orquestar servidores MCP para inicio y hibernación a escala cero bajo demanda","Unificar el enrutamiento para varios servidores MCP","Filtrar herramientas con capacidades de SubAgente con conciencia de contexto"],"fr":["Orchestrer des serveurs MCP pour un démarrage et une hibernation à l''échelle zéro sur demande","Unifier le routage pour plusieurs serveurs MCP","Filtrer des outils avec des capacités de SubAgent sensibles au contexte"],"de":["MCP-Server für bedarfsorientierten Start und Skalierung auf Null-Hibernation orchestrieren","Routing für mehrere MCP-Server vereinheitlichen","Werkzeuge mit kontextbewussten SubAgent-Funktionen filtern"],"pt":["Orquestração de servidores MCP para inicialização sob demanda e hibernação de escala zero","Unificação de roteamento para vários servidores MCP","Filtragem de ferramentas com capacidades de SubAgente com conscientização de contexto"],"ru":["Оркестровка серверов MCP для запуска по требованию и гибернации масштабирования до нуля","Унификация маршрутизации для нескольких серверов MCP","Фильтрация инструментов с контекстно-зависимыми возможностями SubAgenta"],"ar":["توجيه خوادم MCP للتشغيل عند الطلب وتجميد التوسع إلى الصفر","توحيد التوجيه لعدة خوادم MCP","ترشيح الأدوات مع khảیات SubAgent المعتمدة على السياق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires MCP server setup","Dependent on CloudWeGo/Eino for SubAgent functionality"],"zh":["需要MCP服务器设置","依赖于CloudWeGo/Eino实现SubAgent功能"],"ja":["MCPサーバーの設定が必要","SubAgent機能の実現にCloudWeGo/Einoに依存する"],"ko":["MCP 서버 설정이 필요","SubAgent 기능의 실현에 CloudWeGo/Eino에 의존"],"es":["Requiere configuración del servidor MCP","Dependiente de CloudWeGo/Eino para la funcionalidad de SubAgente"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration du serveur MCP","Dépend de CloudWeGo/Eino pour la fonctionnalité de SubAgent"],"de":["Benötigt MCP-Server-Einrichtung","Abhängig von CloudWeGo/Eino für SubAgent-Funktionalität"],"pt":["Requer configuração do servidor MCP","Dependente de CloudWeGo/Eino para funcionalidade de SubAgente"],"ru":["Требует настройки сервера MCP","Зависит от CloudWeGo/Eino для функциональности SubAgenta"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد خادم MCP","يعتمد على CloudWeGo/Eino لوظيفة SubAgent"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('DanielShuguang/tool-box/vitest', 'community', 'DanielShuguang', 'tool-box', 'DanielShuguang/tool-box', 'vitest', 0, 0, 25, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.425Z', '2026-02-18T04:45:43.336Z', NULL, '{"id":"DanielShuguang/tool-box/vitest","name":"vitest","description":{"zh":"Vitest是一个下一代测试框架，具有Jest兼容的API和原生ESM、TypeScript和JSX支持","ja":"Vitestは、Jestと互換性のあるAPIと、ネイティブのESM、TypeScript、JSXをサポートする次世代テストフレームワークです","ko":"Vitest는 Jest와 호환되는 API 및 네이티브 ESM, TypeScript, JSX를 지원하는 차세대 테스트 프레임워크입니다.","es":"Vitest es un framework de pruebas de próxima generación impulsado por Vite, que ofrece una API compatible con Jest y soporte nativo para ESM, TypeScript y JSX","fr":"Vitest est un framework de test de génération suivante propulsé par Vite, qui propose une API compatible avec Jest et un support natif pour ESM, TypeScript et JSX","de":"Vitest ist ein Next-Generation-Testframework, das von Vite angetrieben wird und eine Jest-kompatible API mit nativer Unterstützung für ESM, TypeScript und JSX bietet","pt":"Vitest é um framework de testes de próxima geração alimentado pelo Vite, oferecendo suporte nativo para ESM, TypeScript e JSX. Ele fornece uma API compatível com Jest.","ru":"Vitest — это фреймворк для тестирования нового поколения, работающий на основе Vite, и обеспечивающий родную поддержку ESM, TypeScript и JSX. Он предоставляет API, совместимый с Jest.","ar":"Vitest هو إطار اختبار الجيل التالي مدعوم من Vite، ويوفر دعمًا أصليًا ل ESM و TypeScript و JSX. كما يقدم واجهة برمجة تطبيقات متوافقة مع Jest.","en":"一个小工具箱"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Vitest：下一代测试框架","ja":"Vitest：次世代テストフレームワーク","ko":"Vitest: 차세대 테스트 프레임워크","es":"Vitest: Framework de pruebas de próxima generación","fr":"Vitest: Prochain framework de test de génération","de":"Vitest: Next-Generation-Testframework","pt":"Vitest: Framework de Testes de Próxima Geração","ru":"Vitest: Фреймворк для тестирования нового поколения","ar":"Vitest: إطار اختبار الجيل التالي","en":"vitest"},"description":{"zh":"Vitest是一个下一代测试框架，具有Jest兼容的API和原生ESM、TypeScript和JSX支持","ja":"Vitestは、Jestと互換性のあるAPIと、ネイティブのESM、TypeScript、JSXをサポートする次世代テストフレームワークです","ko":"Vitest는 Jest와 호환되는 API 및 네이티브 ESM, TypeScript, JSX를 지원하는 차세대 테스트 프레임워크입니다.","es":"Vitest es un framework de pruebas de próxima generación impulsado por Vite, que ofrece una API compatible con Jest y soporte nativo para ESM, TypeScript y JSX","fr":"Vitest est un framework de test de génération suivante propulsé par Vite, qui propose une API compatible avec Jest et un support natif pour ESM, TypeScript e...","de":"Vitest ist ein Next-Generation-Testframework, das von Vite angetrieben wird und eine Jest-kompatible API mit nativer Unterstützung für ESM, TypeScript und JS...","pt":"Vitest é um framework de testes de próxima geração alimentado pelo Vite, oferecendo suporte nativo para ESM, TypeScript e JSX. Ele fornece uma API compatível...","ru":"Vitest — это фреймворк для тестирования нового поколения, работающий на основе Vite, и обеспечивающий родную поддержку ESM, TypeScript и JSX. Он предоставляе...","ar":"Vitest هو إطار اختبار الجيل التالي مدعوم من Vite، ويوفر دعمًا أصليًا ل ESM و TypeScript و JSX. كما يقدم واجهة برمجة تطبيقات متوافقة مع Jest.","en":"一个小工具箱"},"definition":{"en":"一个小工具箱"},"features":{"zh":["Vite原生：使用Vite的转换管道实现快速的HMR-like测试更新","Jest兼容：可作为大多数Jest测试套件的替代品","智能监视模式：仅重新运行受影响的测试","原生ESM、TypeScript和JSX支持"],"ja":["Viteネイティブ：Viteの変換パイプラインを使用して高速なHMRのようなテスト更新を実現","Jest互換：大多数Jestテストスイートの代替品として使用可能","スマートウォッチモード：影響を受けるテストのみを再実行","ネイティブのESM、TypeScript、JSXをサポート"],"ko":["Vite 네이티브: Vite의 변환 파이프라인을 사용하여 빠른 HMR 같은 테스트 업데이트를 수행","Jest 호환: 대부분의 Jest 테스트 스위트의 대체品으로 사용 가능","스마트 워치 모드: 영향을 받는 테스트만 다시 실행","네이티브 ESM, TypeScript, JSX 지원"],"es":["Compatibilidad con Jest","Soporte nativo para ESM, TypeScript y JSX","Modo de vigilancia inteligente","Actualizaciones de pruebas rápidas con Vite"],"fr":["Compatibilité avec Jest","Support natif pour ESM, TypeScript et JSX","Mode de surveillance intelligente","Mises à jour de test rapides avec Vite"],"de":["Kompatibilität mit Jest","Native Unterstützung für ESM, TypeScript und JSX","Intelligenter Überwachungsmodus","Schnelle Testaktualisierungen mit Vite"],"pt":["Vite-nativo: Usa o pipeline de transformação do Vite para atualizações de teste rápidas","Compatível com Jest: Substituição direta para a maioria dos conjuntos de testes do Jest","Modo de observação inteligente: Reroduz apenas os testes afetados com base no gráfico de módulos","Suporte nativo para ESM, TypeScript e JSX"],"ru":["Vite-родной: Использует конвейер преобразования Vite для быстрого обновления тестов","Совместимый с Jest: Замена для большинства наборов тестов Jest","Умный режим наблюдения: Перезапускает только затронутые тесты на основе графа модулей","Родная поддержка ESM, TypeScript и JSX"],"ar":["مصدر Vite: يستخدم pipeline تحويل Vite لتحديثات الاختبار السريعة","متوافق مع Jest: بديل مباشر لمعظم مجموعات الاختبار Jest","وضع المراقبة الذكية: يعيد تشغيل الاختبارات المتأثرة فقط بناءً على مخطط الوحدات","دعم أصلي لـ ESM و TypeScript و JSX"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vitest","测试框架","Vite","Jest","ESM","TypeScript","JSX","测试工具"],"ja":["Vitest","テストフレームワーク","Vite","Jest","ESM","TypeScript","JSX","テストツール"],"ko":["Vitest","테스트 프레임워크","Vite","Jest","ESM","TypeScript","JSX","테스트 도구"],"es":["Vitest","Framework de pruebas","Jest","Vite","ESM","TypeScript","JSX","Desarrollo de software","Pruebas de software"],"fr":["Vitest","Framework de test","Jest","Vite","ESM","TypeScript","JSX","Développement de logiciels","Tests de logiciels"],"de":["Vitest","Testframework","Jest","Vite","ESM","TypeScript","JSX","Software-Entwicklung","Software-Tests"],"pt":["Vitest","framework de testes","Vite","Jest","ESM","TypeScript","JSX","desenvolvimento de software","testes automatizados"],"ru":["Vitest","фреймворк для тестирования","Vite","Jest","ESM","TypeScript","JSX","разработка программного обеспечения","автоматизированное тестирование"],"ar":["Vitest","إطار اختبار","Vite","Jest","ESM","TypeScript","JSX","تطوير البرمجيات","اختبارات آلية"]}},"owner":"DanielShuguang","repo":"tool-box","repoPath":"DanielShuguang/tool-box","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.425Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vitest","description":"Vitest fast unit testing framework powered by Vite with Jest-compatible API. Use when writing tests, mocking, configuring coverage, or working with test filtering and fixtures.","version":"2026.1.28","bodyPreview":"Vitest is a next-generation testing framework powered by Vite. It provides a Jest-compatible API with native ESM, TypeScript, and JSX support out of the box. Vitest shares the same config, transformers, resolvers, and plugins with your Vite app.\n\n**Key Features:**\n- Vite-native: Uses Vite''s transformation pipeline for fast HMR-like test updates\n- Jest-compatible: Drop-in replacement for most Jest test suites\n- Smart watch mode: Only reruns affected tests based on module graph\n- Native ESM, TypeS","body":"Vitest is a next-generation testing framework powered by Vite. It provides a Jest-compatible API with native ESM, TypeScript, and JSX support out of the box. Vitest shares the same config, transformers, resolvers, and plugins with your Vite app.\n\n**Key Features:**\n- Vite-native: Uses Vite''s transformation pipeline for fast HMR-like test updates\n- Jest-compatible: Drop-in replacement for most Jest test suites\n- Smart watch mode: Only reruns affected tests based on module graph\n- Native ESM, TypeScript, JSX support without configuration\n- Multi-threaded workers for parallel test execution\n- Built-in coverage via V8 or Istanbul\n- Snapshot testing, mocking, and spy utilities\n\n> The skill is based on Vitest 3.x, generated at 2026-01-28.\n\n## Core\n\n| Topic | Description | Reference |\n|-------|-------------|-----------|\n| Configuration | Vitest and Vite config integration, defineConfig usage | [core-config](references/core-config.md) |\n| CLI | Command line interface, commands and options | [core-cli](references/core-cli.md) |\n| Test API | test/it function, modifiers like skip, only, concurrent | [core-test-api](references/core-test-api.md) |\n| Describe API | describe/suite for grouping tests and nested suites | [core-describe](references/core-describe.md) |\n| Expect API | Assertions with toBe, toEqual, matchers and asymmetric matchers | [core-expect](references/core-expect.md) |\n| Hooks | beforeEach, afterEach, beforeAll, afterAll, aroundEach | [core-hooks](references/core-hooks.md) |\n\n## Features\n\n| Topic | Description | Reference |\n|-------|-------------|-----------|\n| Mocking | Mock functions, modules, timers, dates with vi utilities | [features-mocking](references/features-mocking.md) |\n| Snapshots | Snapshot testing with toMatchSnapshot and inline snapshots | [features-snapshots](references/features-snapshots.md) |\n| Coverage | Code coverage with V8 or Istanbul providers | [features-coverage](references/features-coverage.md) |\n| Test Context | Test fixtures, context.expect, test.extend for custom fixtures | [features-context](references/features-context.md) |\n| Concurrency | Concurrent tests, parallel execution, sharding | [features-concurrency](references/features-concurrency.md) |\n| Filtering | Filter tests by name, file patterns, tags | [features-filtering](references/features-filtering.md) |\n\n## Advanced\n\n| Topic | Description | Reference |\n|-------|-------------|-----------|\n| Vi Utilities | vi helper: mock, spyOn, fake timers, hoisted, waitFor | [advanced-vi](references/advanced-vi.md) |\n| Environments | Test environments: node, jsdom, happy-dom, custom | [advanced-environments](references/advanced-environments.md) |\n| Type Testing | Type-level testing with expectTypeOf and assertType | [advanced-type-testing](references/advanced-type-testing.md) |\n| Projects | Multi-project workspaces, different configs per project | [advanced-projects](references/advanced-projects.md) |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:45:43.336Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for JavaScript Agents needing fast and efficient testing frameworks with native ESM and TypeScript support.","zh":"非常适合需要具有原生ESM和TypeScript支持的快速高效测试框架的JavaScript智能体。","ja":"ネイティブなESMとTypeScriptサポートを備えた高速で効率的なテストフレームワークを必要とするJavaScriptエージェントに最適です。","ko":"네이티브 ESM 및 TypeScript 지원을 갖춘 빠르고 효율적인 테스트 프레임워크가 필요한 JavaScript 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de JavaScript que necesitan frameworks de prueba rápidos y eficientes con soporte nativo para ESM y TypeScript.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents JavaScript ayant besoin de frameworks de test rapides et efficaces avec un support natif pour ESM et TypeScript.","de":"Perfekt für JavaScript-Agents, die schnelle und effiziente Testframeworks mit nativer ESM- und TypeScript-Unterstützung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes JavaScript que necessitam de estruturas de teste rápidas e eficientes com suporte nativo para ESM e TypeScript.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов JavaScript, которым необходимы быстрые и эффективные фреймворки для тестирования с родной поддержкой ESM и TypeScript.","ar":"مثالي لعميل جافا سكريبت الذي يحتاج إلى إطارات اختبار سريعة وفعالة مع دعم أصلي ل ESM و TypeScript."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to run Jest-compatible tests with Vite-native speed, leveraging smart watch mode and native ESM support for efficient test updates, and utilizing Vitest''s config, transformers, resolvers, and plugins seamlessly with Vite apps.","zh":"使智能体能够以Vite原生的速度运行与Jest兼容的测试，利用智能监视模式和原生ESM支持实现高效的测试更新，并在Vite应用中无缝利用Vitest的配置、转换器、解析器和插件。","ja":"スマートウォッチモードとネイティブESMサポートを活用して効率的なテスト更新を実現し、ViteアプリでVitestの設定、トランスフォーマー、リゾルバー、プラグインをシームレスに利用することで、エージェントがJest互換のテストをViteネイティブの速度で実行できるようにします。","ko":"스마트 감시 모드와 네이티브 ESM 지원을 활용하여 효율적인 테스트 업데이트를 가능하게 하고, Vite 앱에서 Vitest의 설정, 변환기, 리졸버 및 플러그인을 원활하게 사용함으로써 에이전트가 Jest 호환 테스트를 Vite 네이티브 속도로 실행할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes ejecutar pruebas compatibles con Jest con la velocidad nativa de Vite, aprovechando el modo de vigilancia inteligente y el soporte nativo para ESM para actualizaciones de pruebas eficientes, y utilizando la configuración, transformadores, resolutores y plugins de Vitest de manera transparente con aplicaciones Vite.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des tests compatibles Jest avec la vitesse native de Vite, en exploitant le mode de surveillance intelligent et le support natif pour ESM pour des mises à jour de tests efficaces, et en utilisant la configuration, les transformateurs, les résolveurs et les plugins de Vitest de manière transparente avec les applications Vite.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Jest-kompatible Tests mit der nativen Vite-Geschwindigkeit auszuführen, indem es den intelligenten Überwachungsmodus und die native ESM-Unterstützung für effiziente Testaktualisierungen nutzt und die Konfiguration, Transformer, Resolver und Plugins von Vitest nahtlos mit Vite-Apps verwendet.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar testes compatíveis com Jest com velocidade nativa do Vite, aproveitando o modo de observação inteligente e o suporte nativo ao ESM para atualizações de teste eficientes, e utilizando a configuração, transformadores, resolvidores e plug-ins do Vitest de forma transparente com aplicativos Vite.","ru":"Позволяет агентам запускать тесты, совместимые с Jest, со скоростью Vite, используя умный режим отслеживания и родную поддержку ESM для эффективных обновлений тестов, а также использует конфигурацию, трансформеры, решатели и плагины Vitest без проблем с приложениями Vite.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تشغيل الاختبارات المتوافقة مع Jest بسرعة Vite الأصلية، مستفيدة من وضع المراقبة الذكية والدعم الأصلي لـ ESM لتحديثات الاختبار الفعالة، واستخدام تكوين Vitest والمتحولات والمحللين والإضافات بسهولة مع تطبيقات Vite."},"useCases":{"en":["Rerunning affected tests based on module graph","Migrating Jest test suites to Vitest for improved performance","Debugging Vite applications with fast HMR-like test updates"],"zh":["基于模块图重新运行受影响的测试","将Jest测试套件迁移到Vitest以提高性能","利用类似HMR的快速测试更新调试Vite应用程序"],"ja":["モジュールグラフに基づく影響を受けるテストの再実行","パフォーマンス向上のためのJestテストスイートからVitestへの移行","高速なHMRのようなテスト更新によるViteアプリケーションのデバッグ"],"ko":["모듈 그래프를 기반으로 영향을 받는 테스트 재실행","성능 향상을 위해 Jest 테스트 스위트를 Vitest로 마이그레이션","빠른 HMR과 유사한 테스트 업데이트로 Vite 애플리케이션 디버깅"],"es":["Volver a ejecutar pruebas afectadas en función del grafo de módulos","Migrar suites de pruebas de Jest a Vitest para mejorar el rendimiento","Depurar aplicaciones Vite con actualizaciones de pruebas rápidas similares a HMR"],"fr":["Réexécuter les tests affectés en fonction du graphique de modules","Migrer des suites de tests Jest vers Vitest pour améliorer les performances","Déboguer des applications Vite avec des mises à jour de tests rapides similaires à HMR"],"de":["Erneutes Ausführen betroffener Tests basierend auf dem Modulgraphen","Migration von Jest-Test-Suiten zu Vitest für verbesserte Leistung","Debuggen von Vite-Anwendungen mit schnellen, HMR-ähnlichen Testaktualisierungen"],"pt":["Reexecutar testes afetados com base no gráfico de módulos","Migrar conjuntos de testes Jest para Vitest para melhorar o desempenho","Depurar aplicações Vite com atualizações de teste rápidas semelhantes ao HMR"],"ru":["Перезапускать затронутые тесты на основе графа модулей","Мигрировать наборы тестов Jest в Vitest для улучшения производительности","Отлаживать приложения Vite с быстрыми обновлениями тестов, подобными HMR"],"ar":["إعادة تشغيل الاختبارات المتأثرة بالbasis على مخطط الوحدات","نقل مجموعات الاختبارات Jest إلى Vitest لتحسين الأداء","تصحيح أخطاء تطبيقات Vite مع تحديثات الاختبار السريع الشبيهة ب HMR"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Vite configuration and setup","Limited to JavaScript and TypeScript projects"],"zh":["需要Vite配置和设置","仅限于JavaScript和TypeScript项目"],"ja":["Viteの設定とセットアップが必要","JavaScriptおよびTypeScriptプロジェクトに限定"],"ko":["Vite 구성 및 설정 필요","JavaScript 및 TypeScript 프로젝트로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere configuración y configuración de Vite","Limitado a proyectos de JavaScript y TypeScript"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration et une installation de Vite","Limité aux projets JavaScript et TypeScript"],"de":["Erfordert Vite-Konfiguration und -Einrichtung","Begrenzt auf JavaScript- und TypeScript-Projekte"],"pt":["Exige configuração e instalação do Vite","Limitado a projetos JavaScript e TypeScript"],"ru":["Требует настройки и установки Vite","Ограничен проектами JavaScript и TypeScript"],"ar":["يتطلب تكوين Vite وإعداد","محدود بمشاريع جافا سكريبت و TypeScript"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":25}');
