oiement de modifications de code locales","Intégration avec Railway pour un déploiement efficace"],"de":["Code-Deployment aus dem aktuellen Verzeichnis","Verwendung von ''railway up'' zum Bereitstellen von Code","Option zum Deployment mit ''--ci'' zur Problemlösung","Verwendung von beschreibenden Commit-Nachrichten mit ''-m''","Deployment von lokalen Codeänderungen","Integration mit Railway für ein effizientes Deployment"],"pt":["Implantação de código com o comando ''railway up''","Suporte a deploy de código local","Opção de usar o modo ''--ci'' para correção de problemas","Uso de mensagens de commit descritivas com o flag ''-m''","Integração com o Railway para deploy de código"],"ru":["Развертывание кода с помощью команды ''railway up''","Поддержка развертывания локального кода","Возможность использовать режим ''--ci'' для исправления проблем","Использование описательных сообщений о коммитах с флагом ''-m''","Интеграция с Railway для развертывания кода"],"ar":["نشر الرمز باستخدام الأمر ''railway up''","دعم نشر الرمز المحلي","خيار استخدام الوضع ''--ci'' لتصحيح المشكلات","استخدام رسائل الالتزام الوصفية مع علم ''-m''","التكامل مع سكة الحديد لنشر الرمز"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Railway 部署","代码部署","持续集成","持续交付","railway up","本地代码变更","自动修复"],"ja":["Railway デプロイ","コードデプロイ","継続的インテグレーション","継続的デリバリー","railway up","ローカルコードの変更","自動修復"],"ko":["Railway 배포","코드 배포","지속적 통합","지속적 전달","railway up","로컬 코드 변경","자동 수정"],"es":["despliegue de código","railway up","desarrollo de software","entorno de producción","cambio de código","despliegue eficiente","mensaje de confirmación","despliegue de cambios locales","integración con Railway"],"fr":["déploiement de code","railway up","développement de logiciels","environnement de production","modification de code","déploiement efficace","message de confirmation","déploiement de modifications locales","intégration avec Railway"],"de":["Code-Deployment","railway up","Software-Entwicklung","Produktionsumgebung","Code-Änderung","effizientes Deployment","Commit-Nachricht","Deployment von lokalen Änderungen","Integration mit Railway"],"pt":["deploy de código","railway up","implantação de software","desenvolvimento de software","entrega de software","gerenciamento de código"],"ru":["развертывание кода","railway up","установка программного обеспечения","разработка программного обеспечения","доставка программного обеспечения","управление кодом"],"ar":["نشر الرمز","railway up","نشر البرمجيات","تطوير البرمجيات","تسليم البرمجيات","إدارة الرمز"]}},"owner":"matixlol","repo":"monitoreo-panama","repoPath":"matixlol/monitoreo-panama","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.425Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"deploy","description":"This skill should be used when the user wants to push code to Railway, says railway up, deploy, deploy to railway, ship, or push. For initial setup or creating services, use new skill. For Docker images, use environment skill.","bodyPreview":"# Deploy\n\nDeploy code from the current directory to Railway using `railway up`.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- User asks to \"deploy\", \"ship\", \"push code\"\n- User says \"railway up\" or \"deploy to Railway\"\n- User wants to deploy local code changes\n- User says \"deploy and fix any issues\" (use --ci mode)\n\n## Commit Message\n\nAlways use the `-m` flag with a descriptive commit message summarizing what''s being deployed:\n\n```bash\nrailway up --detach -m \"Add user authentication endpoint\"\n```\n\nGood commit messages:\n- De","body":"# Deploy\n\nDeploy code from the current directory to Railway using `railway up`.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- User asks to \"deploy\", \"ship\", \"push code\"\n- User says \"railway up\" or \"deploy to Railway\"\n- User wants to deploy local code changes\n- User says \"deploy and fix any issues\" (use --ci mode)\n\n## Commit Message\n\nAlways use the `-m` flag with a descriptive commit message summarizing what''s being deployed:\n\n```bash\nrailway up --detach -m \"Add user authentication endpoint\"\n```\n\nGood commit messages:\n- Describe what changed: \"Fix memory leak in worker process\"\n- Reference tickets/issues: \"Implement feature #123\"\n- Be concise but meaningful: \"Update deps and fix build warnings\"\n\n## Modes\n\n### Detach Mode (default)\nStarts deploy and returns immediately. Use for most deploys.\n\n```bash\nrailway up --detach -m \"Deploy description here\"\n```\n\n### CI Mode\nStreams build logs until complete. Use when user wants to watch the build or needs to debug issues.\n\n```bash\nrailway up --ci -m \"Deploy description here\"\n```\n\n**When to use CI mode:**\n- User says \"deploy and watch\", \"deploy and fix issues\"\n- User is debugging build failures\n- User wants to see build output\n\n## Deploy Specific Service\n\nDefault is linked service. To deploy to a different service:\n\n```bash\nrailway up --detach --service backend -m \"Deploy description here\"\n```\n\n## Deploy to Unlinked Project\n\nDeploy to a project without linking first:\n\n```bash\nrailway up --project <project-id> --environment production --detach -m \"Deploy description here\"\n```\n\nRequires both `--project` and `--environment` flags.\n\n## CLI Options\n\n| Flag | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| `-m, --message <MSG>` | Commit message describing the deploy (always use this) |\n| `-d, --detach` | Don''t attach to logs (default) |\n| `-c, --ci` | Stream build logs, exit when done |\n| `-s, --service <NAME>` | Target service (defaults to linked) |\n| `-e, --environment <NAME>` | Target environment (defaults to linked) |\n| `-p, --project <ID>` | Target project (requires --environment) |\n| `[PATH]` | Path to deploy (defaults to current directory) |\n\n## Directory Linking\n\nRailway CLI walks UP the directory tree to find a linked project. If you''re in a subdirectory of a linked project, you don''t need to relink.\n\nFor subdirectory deployments, prefer setting `rootDirectory` via the environment skill, then deploy normally with `railway up`.\n\n## After Deploy\n\n### Detach mode\n```\nDeploying to <service>...\n```\nUse `deployment` skill to check build status (with `--lines` flag).\n\n### CI mode\nBuild logs stream inline. If build fails, the error will be in the output.\n\n**Do NOT run `railway logs --build` after CI mode** - the logs already streamed. If you need\nmore context, use `deployment` skill with `--lines` flag (never stream).\n\n## Composability\n\n- **Check status after deploy**: Use `service` skill\n- **View logs**: Use `deployment` skill\n- **Fix config issues**: Use `environment` skill\n- **Redeploy after config fix**: Use `environment` skill\n\n## Error Handling\n\n### No Project Linked\n```\nNo Railway project linked. Run `railway link` first.\n```\n\n### No Service Linked\n```\nNo service linked. Use --service flag or run `railway service` to select one.\n```\n\n### Build Failure (CI mode)\nThe build logs already streamed - analyze them directly from the `railway up --ci` output.\nDo NOT run `railway logs` after CI mode (it streams forever without `--lines`).\n\nCommon issues:\n- Missing dependencies → check package.json/requirements.txt\n- Build command wrong → use environment skill to fix\n- Dockerfile issues → check dockerfile path\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:45:51.630Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing streamlined Railway deployment capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要简化铁路部署能力的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントが鉄道のデプロイ能力をストリームライン化する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"철도 배포 기능을 간소화해야 하는 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan capacidades de implementación de Railway optimizadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin de capacités de déploiement Railway rationalisées.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die optimierte Railway-Bereitstellungs-Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de capacidades de implantação de Railway simplificadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходимы упрощенные возможности развертывания Railway.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات تثبيت سكة حديدية مبسطة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to deploy code from the current directory to Railway using `railway up`, with features like detach mode and descriptive commit messages using the `-m` flag, facilitating efficient deployment and issue resolution with `--ci` mode.","zh":"赋予代理从当前目录使用 `railway up` 部署代码到铁路的能力，具有分离模式和使用 `-m` 标志的描述性提交消息等功能，通过 `--ci` 模式实现高效的部署和问题解决。","ja":"`railway up` を使用して現在のディレクトリから Railway にコードをデプロイするエージェントをエンパワーメントします。デタッチモードや `-m` フラグを使用した説明的なコミットメッセージなどの機能を搭載し、 `--ci` モードを使用して効率的なデプロイと問題解決を実現します。","ko":"현재 디レクト리에서 `railway up`를 사용하여 철도에 코드를 배포하는 에이전트를 강화합니다. 분리 모드 및 `-m` 플래그를 사용한 설명적 커밋 메시지와 같은 기능을 제공하며 `--ci` 모드를 사용하여 효율적인 배포 및 문제 해결을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar código desde el directorio actual en Railway utilizando `railway up`, con características como modo de desacoplamiento y mensajes de confirmación descriptivos utilizando la marca `-m`, lo que facilita la implementación y resolución de problemas eficientes con el modo `--ci`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de déployer du code depuis le répertoire actuel sur Railway en utilisant `railway up`, avec des fonctionnalités comme le mode déconnecté et des messages de commit descriptifs en utilisant le flag `-m`, ce qui facilite le déploiement et la résolution de problèmes efficaces avec le mode `--ci`.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Code aus dem aktuellen Verzeichnis auf Railway mit `railway up` zu bereitstellen, mit Funktionen wie dem Abkoppeln-Modus und beschreibenden Commit-Nachrichten unter Verwendung der `-m`-Flag, was eine effiziente Bereitstellung und Problemlösung mit dem `--ci`-Modus ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implantar código do diretório atual para Railway usando `railway up`, com recursos como modo de desanexação e mensagens de confirmação descritivas usando a flag `-m`, facilitando a implantação eficiente e a resolução de problemas com o modo `--ci`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью развертывать код из текущего каталога в Railway с помощью `railway up`, с функциями, такими как режим отсоединения и описательные сообщения фиксации с использованием флага `-m`, что облегчает эффективное развертывание и решение проблем с режимом `--ci`.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من تثبيت رمز من الدليل الحالي إلى سكة حديدية باستخدام `railway up` ، مع ميزات مثل وضع الفصل ورسائل الالتزام الوصفية باستخدام علم `-m` ، مما يسهل التثبيت الفعال و حل المشكلات مع وضع `--ci`."},"useCases":{"en":["Deploying local code changes to Railway","Automating deployment with descriptive commit messages","Debugging and fixing issues with `--ci` mode"],"zh":["将本地代码更改部署到 Railway","使用描述性提交消息自动化部署","使用 `--ci` 模式调试和修复问题"],"ja":["ローカルのコード変更を Railway にデプロイする","説明的なコミットメッセージを使用して自動デプロイする"," `--ci` モードを使用してデバッグおよび問題を修正する"],"ko":["로컬 코드 변경을 철도에 배포하는 것","설명적인 커밋 메시지를 사용한 자동 배포"," `--ci` 모드를 사용하여 디버깅 및 문제 해결"],"es":["Implementar cambios de código locales en Railway","Automatizar la implementación con mensajes de confirmación descriptivos","Depurar y solucionar problemas con el modo `--ci`"],"fr":["Déployer des modifications de code locales sur Railway","Automatiser le déploiement avec des messages de commit descriptifs","Déboguer et résoudre des problèmes avec le mode `--ci`"],"de":["Lokale Code-Änderungen in Railway bereitstellen","Bereitstellung automatisieren mit beschreibenden Commit-Nachrichten","Fehler beheben und Probleme mit dem `--ci`-Modus lösen"],"pt":["Implantando alterações de código locais na Railway","Automatizando a implantação com mensagens de confirmação descritivas","Depurando e corrigindo problemas com o modo `--ci`"],"ru":["Развертывание местных изменений кода в Railway","Автоматизация развертывания с описательными сообщениями фиксации","Отладка и исправление проблем с режимом `--ci`"],"ar":["تثبيت تغييرات رمز محلية على سكة حديدية","تأتمة التثبيت مع رسائل الالتزام الوصفية","تصحيح الأخطاء وإصلاحها مع وضع `--ci`"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Railway account and configuration","Limited to deploying from the current directory","Dependent on `railway up` command-line tool"],"zh":["需要 Railway 账户和配置","仅限从当前目录部署","依赖于 `railway up` 命令行工具"],"ja":["Railway アカウントと設定が必要","現在のディレクトリからのデプロイのみ"," `railway up` コマンドラインツールに依存"],"ko":["철도 계정 및 구성이 필요","현재 디렉토리로부터의 배포만 가능"," `railway up` 명령줄 도구에 의존"],"es":["Requiere cuenta y configuración de Railway","Limitado a la implementación desde el directorio actual","Dependiente de la herramienta de línea de comandos `railway up`"],"fr":["Nécessite un compte et une configuration Railway","Limité au déploiement depuis le répertoire actuel","Dépend de l''outil de ligne de commande `railway up`"],"de":["Benötigt ein Railway-Konto und eine Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf die Bereitstellung aus dem aktuellen Verzeichnis","Abhängig von der Befehlszeilen-Tool `railway up`"],"pt":["Exige conta e configuração da Railway","Limitado à implantação a partir do diretório atual","Dependente da ferramenta de linha de comando `railway up`"],"ru":["Требует учетной записи и конфигурации Railway","Ограничен развертыванием из текущего каталога","Зависит от инструмента командной строки `railway up`"],"ar":["يتطلب حسابًا وتكوينًا لسكة حديدية","محدود بالتثبيت من الدليل الحالي","يعتمد على أداة سطر الأوامر `railway up`"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
