و Browser و Node.js","استخدام المكتبات docx و xlsx و pdf-lib و pptxgenjs"]},"keywords":{"zh":["office","office","office","office","office","office","office","office","office","office"],"ja":["office","office","office","office","office","office","office","office","office","office"],"ko":["office","office","office","office","office","office","office","office","office","office"],"es":["generación de documentos de Office","TypeScript","JavaScript puro","docx","xlsx","pptxgenjs","Node.js","navegadores"],"fr":["génération de documents Office","TypeScript","JavaScript pur","docx","xlsx","pptxgenjs","Node.js","navigateurs"],"de":["Erstellung von Office-Dokumenten","TypeScript","reines JavaScript","docx","xlsx","pptxgenjs","Node.js","Browser"],"pt":["Geração de documentos Office","TypeScript","Microsoft Office","PDF","JavaScript","Desenvolvimento de software","Programação","Bibliotecas JavaScript"],"ru":["Создание документов Office","TypeScript","Microsoft Office","PDF","JavaScript","Разработка программного обеспечения","Программирование","Библиотеки JavaScript"],"ar":["إنشاء مستندات أوفيس","TypeScript","مايكروسوفت أوفيس","PDF","JavaScript","تطوير البرمجيات","البرمجة","مكتبات JavaScript"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.425Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"office","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Office Document Generation\n\n**Status**: Production Ready\n**Last Updated**: 2026-01-12\n**Dependencies**: None (pure JavaScript libraries)\n**Latest Versions**: docx@9.5.0, xlsx@0.18.5, pdf-lib@1.17.1, pptxgenjs@4.0.1\n\n---\n\n## Overview\n\nGenerate Microsoft Office documents and PDFs programmatically with TypeScript. All libraries are pure JavaScript with zero native dependencies, enabling universal runtime support:\n\n| Format | Library | Workers | Browser | Node.js |\n|--------|---------|---------|--","body":"# Office Document Generation\n\n**Status**: Production Ready\n**Last Updated**: 2026-01-12\n**Dependencies**: None (pure JavaScript libraries)\n**Latest Versions**: docx@9.5.0, xlsx@0.18.5, pdf-lib@1.17.1, pptxgenjs@4.0.1\n\n---\n\n## Overview\n\nGenerate Microsoft Office documents and PDFs programmatically with TypeScript. All libraries are pure JavaScript with zero native dependencies, enabling universal runtime support:\n\n| Format | Library | Workers | Browser | Node.js |\n|--------|---------|---------|---------|---------|\n| **DOCX** | `docx` | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |\n| **XLSX** | `xlsx` (SheetJS) | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |\n| **PDF** | `pdf-lib` | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |\n| **PPTX** | `pptxgenjs` | ⚠️* | ✅ | ✅ |\n\n*PPTX in Workers: Works for local images/data. Remote image fetching needs workaround (uses `https` module).\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Installation\n\n```bash\n# Install all four (or pick what you need)\nnpm install docx xlsx pdf-lib pptxgenjs\n```\n\n### Create a Word Document (30 seconds)\n\n```typescript\nimport { Document, Packer, Paragraph, TextRun } from ''docx'';\nimport { writeFileSync } from ''fs'';\n\nconst doc = new Document({\n  sections: [{\n    children: [\n      new Paragraph({\n        children: [\n          new TextRun({ text: ''Hello World'', bold: true, size: 48 }),\n        ],\n      }),\n    ],\n  }],\n});\n\n// Node.js: Save to file\nconst buffer = await Packer.toBuffer(doc);\nwriteFileSync(''hello.docx'', buffer);\n\n// Browser/Workers: Get as blob\nconst blob = await Packer.toBlob(doc);\n```\n\n### Create an Excel Spreadsheet (30 seconds)\n\n```typescript\nimport * as XLSX from ''xlsx'';\n\n// Create workbook with data\nconst data = [\n  [''Name'', ''Amount'', ''Date''],\n  [''Invoice #1'', 1500, ''2026-01-12''],\n  [''Invoice #2'', 2300, ''2026-01-13''],\n];\n\nconst worksheet = XLSX.utils.aoa_to_sheet(data);\nconst workbook = XLSX.utils.book_new();\nXLSX.utils.book_append_sheet(workbook, worksheet, ''Invoices'');\n\n// Node.js: Save to file\nXLSX.writeFile(workbook, ''invoices.xlsx'');\n\n// Browser/Workers: Get as buffer\nconst buffer = XLSX.write(workbook, { type: ''buffer'', bookType: ''xlsx'' });\n```\n\n### Create a PDF (30 seconds)\n\n```typescript\nimport { PDFDocument, StandardFonts, rgb } from ''pdf-lib'';\n\nconst pdfDoc = await PDFDocument.create();\nconst page = pdfDoc.addPage([612, 792]); // Letter size\nconst font = await pdfDoc.embedFont(StandardFonts.Helvetica);\n\npage.drawText(''Hello World'', {\n  x: 50,\n  y: 700,\n  size: 24,\n  font,\n  color: rgb(0, 0, 0),\n});\n\n// Get as bytes (works everywhere)\nconst pdfBytes = await pdfDoc.save();\n\n// Node.js: Save to file\nwriteFileSync(''hello.pdf'', pdfBytes);\n```\n\n### Create a PowerPoint (30 seconds)\n\n```typescript\nimport pptxgen from ''pptxgenjs'';\n\nconst pptx = new pptxgen();\npptx.author = ''Your Name'';\npptx.title = ''Sample Presentation'';\n\n// Add a slide\nconst slide = pptx.addSlide();\nslide.addText(''Hello World'', {\n  x: 1, y: 1, w: 8, h: 1.5,\n  fontSize: 36, bold: true, color: ''363636'',\n});\n\n// Node.js: Save to file\nawait pptx.writeFile({ fileName: ''hello.pptx'' });\n\n// Browser: Trigger download\nawait pptx.writeFile({ fileName: ''hello.pptx'' });\n```\n\n---\n\n## DOCX: Word Documents\n\n### Key Concepts\n\nThe `docx` package uses a builder pattern:\n- **Document** - The root container\n- **Section** - Contains pages (most docs have 1 section)\n- **Paragraph** - A line/block of text\n- **TextRun** - Formatted text within a paragraph\n- **Table** - Grid of TableRow → TableCell → Paragraph\n\n### Document with Headings and Paragraphs\n\n```typescript\nimport { Document, Packer, Paragraph, TextRun, HeadingLevel } from ''docx'';\n\nconst doc = new Document({\n  sections: [{\n    children: [\n      new Paragraph({\n        text: ''Monthly Report'',\n        heading: HeadingLevel.HEADING_1,\n      }),\n      new Paragraph({\n        children: [\n          new TextRun(''This is a ''),\n          new TextRun({ text: ''bold'', bold: true }),\n          new TextRun('' and ''),\n          new TextRun({ text: ''italic'', italics: true }),\n          new TextRun('' text example.''),\n        ],\n      }),\n    ],\n  }],\n});\n```\n\n### Tables\n\n```typescript\nimport { Document, Table, TableRow, TableCell, Paragraph, WidthType } from ''docx'';\n\nconst table = new Table({\n  width: { size: 100, type: WidthType.PERCENTAGE },\n  rows: [\n    new TableRow({\n      children: [\n        new TableCell({ children: [new Paragraph(''Header 1'')] }),\n        new TableCell({ children: [new Paragraph(''Header 2'')] }),\n      ],\n    }),\n    new TableRow({\n      children: [\n        new TableCell({ children: [new Paragraph(''Data 1'')] }),\n        new TableCell({ children: [new Paragraph(''Data 2'')] }),\n      ],\n    }),\n  ],\n});\n\nconst doc = new Document({\n  sections: [{ children: [table] }],\n});\n```\n\n### Images\n\n```typescript\nimport { Document, Paragraph, ImageRun } from ''docx'';\nimport { readFileSync } from ''fs'';\n\nconst imageBuffer = readFileSync(''logo.png'');\n\nconst doc = new Document({\n  sections: [{\n    children: [\n      new Paragraph({\n        children: [\n          new ImageRun({\n            data: imageBuffer,\n            transformation: { width: 200, height: 100 },\n            type: ''png'',\n          }),\n        ],\n      }),\n    ],\n  }],\n});\n```\n\n### Export Patterns\n\n```typescript\n// Node.js - Save to file\nimport { writeFileSync } from ''fs'';\nconst buffer = await Packer.toBuffer(doc);\nwriteFileSync(''document.docx'', buffer);\n\n// Browser - Download\nconst blob = await Packer.toBlob(doc);\nconst url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);\nconst a = document.createElement(''a'');\na.href = url;\na.download = ''document.docx'';\na.click();\n\n// Cloudflare Workers - Return as Response\nconst buffer = await Packer.toBuffer(doc);\nreturn new Response(buffer, {\n  headers: {\n    ''Content-Type'': ''application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document'',\n    ''Content-Disposition'': ''attachment; filename=\"document.docx\"'',\n  },\n});\n```\n\n---\n\n## XLSX: Excel Spreadsheets\n\n### Key Concepts\n\nSheetJS (xlsx) uses utility functions:\n- **Workbook** - Container for sheets\n- **Worksheet** - Single sheet (grid of cells)\n- **utils.aoa_to_sheet** - Array of arrays → worksheet\n- **utils.json_to_sheet** - JSON array → worksheet\n- **utils.book_new/book_append_sheet** - Create/add sheets\n\n### From Array of Arrays\n\n```typescript\nimport * as XLSX from ''xlsx'';\n\nconst data = [\n  [''Product'', ''Price'', ''Quantity'', ''Total''],\n  [''Widget A'', 10, 5, { f: ''B2*C2'' }],  // Formula\n  [''Widget B'', 15, 3, { f: ''B3*C3'' }],\n  ['''', '''', ''Grand Total:'', { f: ''SUM(D2:D3)'' }],\n];\n\nconst ws = XLSX.utils.aoa_to_sheet(data);\nconst wb = XLSX.utils.book_new();\nXLSX.utils.book_append_sheet(wb, ws, ''Sales'');\n```\n\n### From JSON\n\n```typescript\nconst invoices = [\n  { id: 1, customer: ''Acme Corp'', amount: 1500, date: ''2026-01-12'' },\n  { id: 2, customer: ''Globex'', amount: 2300, date: ''2026-01-13'' },\n];\n\nconst ws = XLSX.utils.json_to_sheet(invoices);\nconst wb = XLSX.utils.book_new();\nXLSX.utils.book_append_sheet(wb, ws, ''Invoices'');\n```\n\n### Column Widths\n\n```typescript\n// Set column widths (in characters)\nws[''!cols''] = [\n  { wch: 10 },  // Column A\n  { wch: 20 },  // Column B\n  { wch: 15 },  // Column C\n];\n```\n\n### Multiple Sheets\n\n```typescript\nconst wb = XLSX.utils.book_new();\n\nconst summaryData = [[''Total Sales'', 3800]];\nconst detailData = [[''Item'', ''Amount''], [''Item 1'', 1500], [''Item 2'', 2300]];\n\nXLSX.utils.book_append_sheet(wb, XLSX.utils.aoa_to_sheet(summaryData), ''Summary'');\nXLSX.utils.book_append_sheet(wb, XLSX.utils.aoa_to_sheet(detailData), ''Details'');\n```\n\n### Export Patterns\n\n```typescript\n// Node.js - Save to file\nXLSX.writeFile(workbook, ''report.xlsx'');\n\n// Browser/Workers - Get buffer\nconst buffer = XLSX.write(workbook, { type: ''buffer'', bookType: ''xlsx'' });\n\n// Cloudflare Workers - Return as Response\nreturn new Response(buffer, {\n  headers: {\n    ''Content-Type'': ''application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet'',\n    ''Content-Disposition'': ''attachment; filename=\"report.xlsx\"'',\n  },\n});\n```\n\n---\n\n## PDF: PDF Documents\n\n### Key Concepts\n\npdf-lib uses a page-based approach:\n- **PDFDocument** - The PDF file\n- **PDFPage** - Individual page\n- **Coordinates** - Origin at BOTTOM-LEFT (not top-left!)\n- **Units** - Points (72 points = 1 inch)\n\n### Standard Page Sizes\n\n```typescript\n// Common sizes in points [width, height]\nconst LETTER = [612, 792];    // 8.5\" x 11\"\nconst A4 = [595.28, 841.89];  // 210mm x 297mm\nconst LEGAL = [612, 1008];    // 8.5\" x 14\"\n```\n\n### Text and Fonts\n\n```typescript\nimport { PDFDocument, StandardFonts, rgb } from ''pdf-lib'';\n\nconst pdfDoc = await PDFDocument.create();\nconst page = pdfDoc.addPage([612, 792]);\n\n// Embed standard fonts\nconst helvetica = await pdfDoc.embedFont(StandardFonts.Helvetica);\nconst helveticaBold = await pdfDoc.embedFont(StandardFonts.HelveticaBold);\n\n// Draw text (y=0 is BOTTOM of page)\npage.drawText(''Invoice #12345'', {\n  x: 50,\n  y: 750,  // Near top of page\n  size: 24,\n  font: helveticaBold,\n  color: rgb(0, 0, 0),\n});\n\npage.drawText(''Thank you for your business!'', {\n  x: 50,\n  y: 50,  // Near bottom of page\n  size: 12,\n  font: helvetica,\n  color: rgb(0.5, 0.5, 0.5),\n});\n```\n\n### Drawing Shapes\n\n```typescript\n// Rectangle\npage.drawRectangle({\n  x: 50,\n  y: 600,\n  width: 200,\n  height: 100,\n  borderColor: rgb(0, 0, 0),\n  borderWidth: 1,\n  color: rgb(0.95, 0.95, 0.95),  // Fill color\n});\n\n// Line\npage.drawLine({\n  start: { x: 50, y: 500 },\n  end: { x: 550, y: 500 },\n  thickness: 1,\n  color: rgb(0, 0, 0),\n});\n```\n\n### Images\n\n```typescript\n// From URL/fetch\nconst imageBytes = await fetch(''https://example.com/logo.png'').then(r => r.arrayBuffer());\nconst image = await pdfDoc.embedPng(imageBytes);\n\n// Or embedJpg for JPEG\n// const image = await pdfDoc.embedJpg(imageBytes);\n\npage.drawImage(image, {\n  x: 50,\n  y: 700,\n  width: 100,\n  height: 50,\n});\n```\n\n### Fill PDF Forms\n\n```typescript\nimport { PDFDocument } from ''pdf-lib'';\n\n// Load existing PDF with form\nconst existingPdfBytes = await fetch(''form.pdf'').then(r => r.arrayBuffer());\nconst pdfDoc = await PDFDocument.load(existingPdfBytes);\n\n// Get form and fields\nconst form = pdfDoc.getForm();\nconst nameField = form.getTextField(''customer_name'');\nconst dateField = form.getTextField(''date'');\n\n// Fill fields\nnameField.setText(''John Doe'');\ndateField.setText(''2026-01-12'');\n\n// Flatten form (make fields non-editable)\nform.flatten();\n\nconst pdfBytes = await pdfDoc.save();\n```\n\n### Merge PDFs\n\n```typescript\nimport { PDFDocument } from ''pdf-lib'';\n\nconst pdf1Bytes = await fetch(''doc1.pdf'').then(r => r.arrayBuffer());\nconst pdf2Bytes = await fetch(''doc2.pdf'').then(r => r.arrayBuffer());\n\nconst mergedPdf = await PDFDocument.create();\nconst pdf1 = await PDFDocument.load(pdf1Bytes);\nconst pdf2 = await PDFDocument.load(pdf2Bytes);\n\n// Copy all pages from both documents\nconst pages1 = await mergedPdf.copyPages(pdf1, pdf1.getPageIndices());\nconst pages2 = await mergedPdf.copyPages(pdf2, pdf2.getPageIndices());\n\npages1.forEach(page => mergedPdf.addPage(page));\npages2.forEach(page => mergedPdf.addPage(page));\n\nconst mergedBytes = await mergedPdf.save();\n```\n\n---\n\n## PPTX: PowerPoint Presentations\n\n### Key Concepts\n\npptxgenjs uses a slide-based approach:\n- **Presentation** - The PPTX file (new pptxgen())\n- **Slide** - Individual slide (addSlide())\n- **Elements** - Text, images, shapes, tables, charts\n- **Units** - Inches by default (can change to cm/points)\n\n### Basic Presentation\n\n```typescript\nimport pptxgen from ''pptxgenjs'';\n\nconst pptx = new pptxgen();\npptx.author = ''Author Name'';\npptx.title = ''Presentation Title'';\npptx.subject = ''Subject'';\npptx.company = ''Company'';\n\n// Title slide\nconst titleSlide = pptx.addSlide();\ntitleSlide.addText(''Quarterly Report'', {\n  x: 0.5, y: 2, w: 9, h: 1,\n  fontSize: 44, bold: true, color: ''0066CC'', align: ''center'',\n});\ntitleSlide.addText(''Q1 2026'', {\n  x: 0.5, y: 3.5, w: 9, h: 0.5,\n  fontSize: 24, color: ''666666'', align: ''center'',\n});\n```\n\n### Slide with Bullet Points\n\n```typescript\nconst contentSlide = pptx.addSlide();\n\n// Title\ncontentSlide.addText(''Key Highlights'', {\n  x: 0.5, y: 0.5, w: 9, h: 0.8,\n  fontSize: 32, bold: true, color: ''333333'',\n});\n\n// Bullet points\ncontentSlide.addText([\n  { text: ''Revenue up 25% YoY'', options: { bullet: true, fontSize: 20 } },\n  { text: ''Customer base grew to 10,000'', options: { bullet: true, fontSize: 20 } },\n  { text: ''New product launch successful'', options: { bullet: true, fontSize: 20 } },\n  { text: ''Expanded to 5 new markets'', options: { bullet: true, fontSize: 20 } },\n], { x: 0.5, y: 1.5, w: 8, h: 4, valign: ''top'' });\n```\n\n### Tables\n\n```typescript\nconst tableSlide = pptx.addSlide();\n\ntableSlide.addText(''Sales Summary'', {\n  x: 0.5, y: 0.5, w: 9, h: 0.8,\n  fontSize: 28, bold: true,\n});\n\nconst tableData = [\n  [{ text: ''Region'', options: { bold: true, fill: ''0066CC'', color: ''FFFFFF'' } },\n   { text: ''Q1'', options: { bold: true, fill: ''0066CC'', color: ''FFFFFF'' } },\n   { text: ''Q2'', options: { bold: true, fill: ''0066CC'', color: ''FFFFFF'' } }],\n  [''North America'', ''$2.5M'', ''$2.8M''],\n  [''Europe'', ''$1.8M'', ''$2.1M''],\n  [''Asia Pacific'', ''$1.2M'', ''$1.5M''],\n];\n\ntableSlide.addTable(tableData, {\n  x: 0.5, y: 1.5, w: 9,\n  border: { pt: 1, color: ''CCCCCC'' },\n  fontFace: ''Arial'',\n  fontSize: 14,\n  align: ''center'',\n  valign: ''middle'',\n});\n```\n\n### Charts\n\n```typescript\nconst chartSlide = pptx.addSlide();\n\nchartSlide.addText(''Revenue Trend'', {\n  x: 0.5, y: 0.5, w: 9, h: 0.6,\n  fontSize: 28, bold: true,\n});\n\nchartSlide.addChart(pptx.ChartType.line, [\n  { name: ''Revenue'', labels: [''Jan'', ''Feb'', ''Mar'', ''Apr''], values: [100, 120, 150, 180] },\n  { name: ''Expenses'', labels: [''Jan'', ''Feb'', ''Mar'', ''Apr''], values: [80, 85, 90, 95] },\n], {\n  x: 0.5, y: 1.2, w: 9, h: 4,\n  showLegend: true,\n  legendPos: ''b'',\n  showTitle: false,\n});\n```\n\n### Images\n\n```typescript\nimport { readFileSync } from ''fs'';\n\nconst imageSlide = pptx.addSlide();\n\n// From file (Node.js)\nimageSlide.addImage({\n  path: ''logo.png'',\n  x: 0.5, y: 0.5, w: 2, h: 1,\n});\n\n// From base64\nconst imageBase64 = readFileSync(''chart.png'').toString(''base64'');\nimageSlide.addImage({\n  data: `image/png;base64,${imageBase64}`,\n  x: 0.5, y: 2, w: 4, h: 3,\n});\n\n// From URL (Node.js only - uses https module)\nimageSlide.addImage({\n  path: ''https://example.com/image.png'',\n  x: 5, y: 2, w: 4, h: 3,\n});\n```\n\n### Shapes\n\n```typescript\nconst shapeSlide = pptx.addSlide();\n\n// Rectangle\nshapeSlide.addShape(pptx.ShapeType.rect, {\n  x: 0.5, y: 0.5, w: 3, h: 2,\n  fill: { color: ''0066CC'' },\n  line: { color: ''004499'', pt: 2 },\n});\n\n// Circle/Oval\nshapeSlide.addShape(pptx.ShapeType.ellipse, {\n  x: 4, y: 0.5, w: 2, h: 2,\n  fill: { color: ''00AA00'' },\n});\n\n// Arrow\nshapeSlide.addShape(pptx.ShapeType.rightArrow, {\n  x: 1, y: 3, w: 3, h: 1,\n  fill: { color: ''FF6600'' },\n});\n```\n\n### Slide Layouts and Masters\n\n```typescript\n// Define a master slide\npptx.defineSlideMaster({\n  title: ''COMPANY_MASTER'',\n  background: { color: ''FFFFFF'' },\n  objects: [\n    { text: { text: ''Company Name'', options: { x: 0.5, y: 0.2, w: 4, h: 0.3, fontSize: 10, color: ''999999'' } } },\n    { line: { x: 0.5, y: 0.6, w: 9, h: 0, line: { color: ''0066CC'', pt: 2 } } },\n  ],\n});\n\n// Use the master\nconst slide = pptx.addSlide({ masterName: ''COMPANY_MASTER'' });\n```\n\n### Export Patterns\n\n```typescript\n// Node.js - Save to file\nawait pptx.writeFile({ fileName: ''presentation.pptx'' });\n\n// Browser - Trigger download\nawait pptx.writeFile({ fileName: ''presentation.pptx'' });\n\n// Get as base64 (for email, API, etc.)\nconst base64 = await pptx.write({ outputType: ''base64'' });\n\n// Get as Blob (browser)\nconst blob = await pptx.write({ outputType: ''blob'' });\n\n// Get as ArrayBuffer\nconst arrayBuffer = await pptx.write({ outputType: ''arraybuffer'' });\n\n// Cloudflare Workers - Return as Response\nconst arrayBuffer = await pptx.write({ outputType: ''arraybuffer'' });\nreturn new Response(arrayBuffer, {\n  headers: {\n    ''Content-Type'': ''application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.presentationml.presentation'',\n    ''Content-Disposition'': ''attachment; filename=\"presentation.pptx\"'',\n  },\n});\n```\n\n---\n\n## Cloudflare Workers Integration\n\nAll four libraries work in Cloudflare Workers (PPTX with caveats for remote images).\n\n### DOCX Generation Endpoint\n\n```typescript\nimport { Hono } from ''hono'';\nimport { Document, Packer, Paragraph, TextRun } from ''docx'';\n\nconst app = new Hono();\n\napp.get(''/api/invoice/:id'', async (c) => {\n  const invoiceId = c.req.param(''id'');\n\n  const doc = new Document({\n    sections: [{\n      children: [\n        new Paragraph({\n          children: [new TextRun({ text: `Invoice #${invoiceId}`, bold: true, size: 48 })],\n        }),\n      ],\n    }],\n  });\n\n  const buffer = await Packer.toBuffer(doc);\n\n  return new Response(buffer, {\n    headers: {\n      ''Content-Type'': ''application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document'',\n      ''Content-Disposition'': `attachment; filename=\"invoice-${invoiceId}.docx\"`,\n    },\n  });\n});\n\nexport default app;\n```\n\n### HTML to PDF with Browser Rendering\n\nFor complex layouts with CSS, use Cloudflare Browser Rendering (paid feature):\n\n```typescript\nimport puppeteer from ''@cloudflare/puppeteer'';\n\nexport default {\n  async fetch(request, env) {\n    const browser = await puppeteer.launch(env.BROWSER);\n    const page = await browser.newPage();\n\n    // Set HTML content\n    await page.setContent(`\n      <html>\n        <head>\n          <style>\n            body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; padding: 40px; }\n            h1 { color: #333; }\n            table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }\n            td, th { border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px; }\n          </style>\n        </head>\n        <body>\n          <h1>Invoice #12345</h1>\n          <table>\n            <tr><th>Item</th><th>Amount</th></tr>\n            <tr><td>Service</td><td>$500</td></tr>\n          </table>\n        </body>\n      </html>\n    `);\n\n    const pdf = await page.pdf({ format: ''A4'' });\n    await browser.close();\n\n    return new Response(pdf, {\n      headers: {\n        ''Content-Type'': ''application/pdf'',\n        ''Content-Disposition'': ''attachment; filename=\"invoice.pdf\"'',\n      },\n    });\n  },\n};\n```\n\n**wrangler.jsonc binding:**\n```jsonc\n{\n  \"browser\": {\n    \"binding\": \"BROWSER\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Critical Rules\n\n### Always Do\n\n✅ Use `await Packer.toBuffer()` for DOCX (it''s async)\n✅ Remember PDF coordinates start at BOTTOM-LEFT\n✅ Use `type: ''buffer''` for XLSX in Workers/browser\n✅ Embed fonts in PDF before using them\n✅ Set proper Content-Type headers for downloads\n✅ Use `await pptx.writeFile()` or `await pptx.write()` for PPTX\n✅ Use base64 images in PPTX for Workers (avoid remote URLs)\n\n### Never Do\n\n❌ Use `Packer.toBuffer()` without await (returns Promise)\n❌ Assume PDF y=0 is at top (it''s at bottom)\n❌ Use `writeFile` in Workers (use Response instead)\n❌ Forget to set Content-Disposition for downloads\n❌ Use Node.js fs module in browser/Workers\n❌ Use PPTX path URLs in Workers (https module not available)\n\n---\n\n## Known Issues Prevention\n\n### Issue #1: DOCX Packer Returns Promise\n**Error**: `[object Promise]` in file or empty document\n**Why**: `Packer.toBuffer()` is async but called without await\n**Prevention**: Always `await Packer.toBuffer(doc)`\n\n### Issue #2: PDF Text at Wrong Position\n**Error**: Text appears at bottom of page or off-page\n**Why**: PDF coordinates have origin at bottom-left, not top-left\n**Prevention**: For text near top, use high y values (e.g., y=750 for letter size)\n\n### Issue #3: XLSX Formula Not Calculating\n**Error**: Cell shows formula text instead of result\n**Why**: SheetJS doesn''t execute formulas, Excel does on open\n**Prevention**: This is expected - formulas calculate when opened in Excel\n\n### Issue #4: Workers DOCX/PDF Returns Empty\n**Error**: Downloaded file is empty or corrupted\n**Why**: Returning wrong type or missing Content-Type header\n**Prevention**: Return buffer directly with proper headers\n\n### Issue #5: PPTX Remote Images Fail in Workers\n**Error**: `https is not defined` or image not appearing\n**Why**: pptxgenjs uses Node.js `https` module for remote images\n**Prevention**: Use base64 data URIs or local images in Workers environment\n\n---\n\n## Using Bundled Resources\n\n### Templates (templates/)\n\n- `docx-basic.ts` - Complete Word document with headings, tables, images\n- `xlsx-basic.ts` - Excel workbook with formulas and formatting\n- `pdf-basic.ts` - PDF with text, images, shapes\n- `pptx-basic.ts` - PowerPoint with slides, charts, tables\n- `workers-pdf.ts` - Cloudflare Workers PDF generation example\n\n### References (references/)\n\n- `docx-api.md` - Quick reference for docx npm package\n- `xlsx-api.md` - Quick reference for SheetJS functions\n- `pdf-lib-api.md` - Quick reference for pdf-lib methods\n- `pptxgenjs-api.md` - Quick reference for pptxgenjs\n\n### Scripts (scripts/)\n\n- `verify-deps.sh` - Check library versions are current\n\n---\n\n## Limitations vs Anthropic''s Official Skills\n\nThis skill focuses on **document creation** with portable TypeScript libraries:\n\n| Feature | This Skill | Anthropic''s Skills |\n|---------|------------|-------------------|\n| Create DOCX/XLSX/PDF/PPTX | ✅ | ✅ |\n| Works in Cloudflare Workers | ✅ | ❌ |\n| Plugin installable | ✅ | ❌ |\n| TypeScript-first | ✅ | ❌ (Python) |\n| Edit existing DOCX with tracked changes | ❌ | ✅ |\n| Excel formula validation | ❌ | ✅ |\n| OCR scanned PDFs | ❌ | ✅ |\n\nFor advanced editing scenarios (tracked changes, formula validation), consider Anthropic''s official skills with Python tooling.\n\n---\n\n## Package Versions (Verified 2026-01-12)\n\n```json\n{\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"docx\": \"^9.5.0\",\n    \"xlsx\": \"^0.18.5\",\n    \"pdf-lib\": \"^1.17.1\",\n    \"pptxgenjs\": \"^4.0.1\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Official Documentation\n\n- **docx**: https://docx.js.org/\n- **SheetJS (xlsx)**: https://docs.sheetjs.com/\n- **pdf-lib**: https://pdf-lib.js.org/\n- **pptxgenjs**: https://gitbrent.github.io/PptxGenJS/\n- **Cloudflare Browser Rendering**: https://developers.cloudflare.com/browser-rendering/\n\n---\n\n## Complete Setup Checklist\n\n- [ ] Installed required packages (`npm install docx xlsx pdf-lib`)\n- [ ] Verified import statements match runtime (Node.js vs browser)\n- [ ] Used proper export method for target environment\n- [ ] Set Content-Type headers for HTTP responses\n- [ ] Tested document opens correctly in target application\n- [ ] Confirmed Workers compatibility (if deploying to edge)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:45:57.325Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Document Automation Agents needing advanced Microsoft Office document generation capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级Microsoft Office文档生成功能的文档自动化代理。","ja":"Microsoft Office文書の高度な生成機能を必要とするドキュメント自動化エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 Microsoft Office 문서 생성 기능이 필요한 문서 자동화 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Automatización de Documentos que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de generación de documentos de Microsoft Office.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Automatisation de Documents ayant besoin de capacités avancées de génération de documents Microsoft Office.","de":"Perfekt für Dokumentautomatisierungsagenten, die erweiterte Microsoft Office-Dokumentenerstellungs-Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação de Documentos que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de geração de documentos do Microsoft Office.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации документов, которым требуются расширенные возможности генерации документов Microsoft Office.","ar":"مثالي لعميل автоматизации المستندات التي تحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة لإنشاء مستندات Microsoft Office."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate Microsoft Office documents and PDFs programmatically using TypeScript, leveraging libraries like docx, xlsx, pdf-lib, and pptxgenjs for universal runtime support across workers, browsers, and Node.js environments.","zh":"使代理能够使用TypeScript程序化地生成Microsoft Office文档和PDF，利用docx、xlsx、pdf-lib和pptxgenjs等库，以实现对工人、浏览器和Node.js环境的通用运行时支持。","ja":"TypeScriptを使用してMicrosoft Office文書とPDFをプログラム的に生成できるようにエージェントをEmpowerし、docx、xlsx、pdf-lib、およびpptxgenjsなどのライブラリを利用して、ワーカー、ブラウザー、Node.js環境全体でユニバーサルなランタイムサポートを実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 TypeScript를 사용하여 Microsoft Office 문서와 PDF를 프로그래밍 방식으로 생성할 수 있도록 하며, docx, xlsx, pdf-lib 및 pptxgenjs 라이브러리를 사용하여 작업자, 브라우저 및 Node.js 환경에서 유니버설 런타임 지원을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar documentos de Microsoft Office y PDF de forma programática utilizando TypeScript, aprovechando bibliotecas como docx, xlsx, pdf-lib y pptxgenjs para una compatibilidad de ejecución universal en workers, navegadores y entornos Node.js.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des documents Microsoft Office et des PDF de manière programmatique en utilisant TypeScript, en exploitant des bibliothèques comme docx, xlsx, pdf-lib et pptxgenjs pour une prise en charge universelle de l''exécution sur les workers, les navigateurs et les environnements Node.js.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Microsoft Office-Dokumente und PDFs programmgesteuert mit TypeScript zu generieren, indem Bibliotheken wie docx, xlsx, pdf-lib und pptxgenjs für universelle Laufzeitunterstützung in Workern, Browsern und Node.js-Umgebungen genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar documentos do Microsoft Office e PDFs programaticamente usando TypeScript, aproveitando bibliotecas como docx, xlsx, pdf-lib e pptxgenjs para suporte de tempo de execução universal em trabalhadores, navegadores e ambientes Node.js.","ru":"Позволяет агентам генерировать документы Microsoft Office и PDF программно с использованием TypeScript, используя библиотеки seperti docx, xlsx, pdf-lib и pptxgenjs для универсальной поддержки времени выполнения в рабочих средах, браузерах и средах Node.js.","ar":"تمكّن العميل من إنشاء مستندات Microsoft Office و PDFs بالبرمجة باستخدام TypeScript، مستفيداً من المكتبات مثل docx و xlsx و pdf-lib و pptxgenjs لدعم زمن التشغيل العالمي عبر العمال والمتصفحات وبيئات Node.js."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating docx reports with custom templates","Automating xlsx spreadsheet creation for data analysis","Creating pptx presentations with dynamic content","Producing pdf documents for secure sharing"],"zh":["使用自定义模板生成docx报告","自动创建xlsx电子表格以进行数据分析","创建具有动态内容的pptx演示文稿","生成pdf文档以实现安全共享"],"ja":["カスタムテンプレートを使用してdocxレポートを生成する","xlsxスプレッドシートの自動作成によるデータ分析","動的コンテンツを含むpptxプレゼンテーションの作成","安全な共有のためのpdf文書の生成"],"ko":["사용자 지정 템플릿을 사용하여 docx 보고서 생성","데이터 분석을 위한 xlsx 전자 테이블 자동 생성","동적 콘텐츠가 포함된 pptx 프레젠테이션 생성","보안 공유를 위한 pdf 문서 생성"],"es":["Generar informes docx con plantillas personalizadas","Automatizar la creación de hojas de cálculo xlsx para el análisis de datos","Crear presentaciones pptx con contenido dinámico","Producir documentos pdf para un intercambio seguro"],"fr":["Générer des rapports docx avec des modèles personnalisés","Automatiser la création de feuilles de calcul xlsx pour l''analyse de données","Créer des présentations pptx avec un contenu dynamique","Produire des documents pdf pour un partage sécurisé"],"de":["Erstellen von docx-Berichten mit benutzerdefinierten Vorlagen","Automatisieren der Erstellung von xlsx-Tabellenkalkulationen für Datenanalyse","Erstellen von pptx-Präsentationen mit dynamischem Inhalt","Erzeugen von pdf-Dokumenten für sicheren Austausch"],"pt":["Gerar relatórios docx com modelos personalizados","Automatizar a criação de planilhas xlsx para análise de dados","Criar apresentações pptx com conteúdo dinâmico","Produzir documentos pdf para compartilhamento seguro"],"ru":["Генерировать отчеты docx с пользовательскими шаблонами","Автоматизировать создание электронных таблиц xlsx для анализа данных","Создавать презентации pptx с динамическим содержимым","Производить документы pdf для безопасного обмена"],"ar":["إنشاء تقارير docx مع قوالب مخصصة","توفير автоматиّة لإنشاء جداول بيانات xlsx لتحليل البيانات","إنشاء عروض تقديمية pptx مع محتوى ديناميكي","إنتاج مستندات pdf للتبادل الآمن"]},"limitations":{"en":["Dependencies on specific library versions (e.g., docx@9.5.0, xlsx@0.18.5)","Requires TypeScript for development"],"zh":["依赖于特定库版本（例如docx@9.5.0，xlsx@0.18.5）","需要TypeScript进行开发"],"ja":["特定ライブラリバージョン（たとえばdocx@9.5.0、xlsx@0.18.5）への依存","開発にはTypeScriptが必要"],"ko":["특정 라이브러리 버전에 대한 종속성（예: docx@9.5.0, xlsx@0.18.5）","개발을 위해 TypeScript가 필요"],"es":["Dependencias de versiones específicas de bibliotecas (p. ej., docx@9.5.0, xlsx@0.18.5)","Requiere TypeScript para el desarrollo"],"fr":["Dépendances de versions spécifiques de bibliothèques (par exemple, docx@9.5.0, xlsx@0.18.5)","Nécessite TypeScript pour le développement"],"de":["Abhängigkeiten von spezifischen Bibliotheksversionen (z. B. docx@9.5.0, xlsx@0.18.5)","Benötigt TypeScript für die Entwicklung"],"pt":["Dependências de versões específicas de bibliotecas (por exemplo, docx@9.5.0, xlsx@0.18.5)","Requer TypeScript para desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Зависимости от конкретных версий библиотек (например, docx@9.5.0, xlsx@0.18.5)","Требует TypeScript для разработки"],"ar":["اعتماديات على إصدارات محددة من المكتبات (على سبيل المثال docx@9.5.0 و xlsx@0.18.5)","يتطلب TypeScript من أجل التطوير"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('raudyagdel/ai_setup_and_tips/tailwind-4', 'community', 'raudyagdel', 'ai_setup_and_tips', 'raudyagdel/ai_setup_and_tips', 'tailwind-4', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.425Z', '2026-02-18T04:46:21.889Z', NULL, '{"id":"raudyagdel/ai_setup_and_tips/tailwind-4","name":"tailwind-4","description":{"zh":"Tailwind 4 设置指南，提供样式决策树和关键规则，帮助开发者快速开发和优化应用","ja":"Tailwind 4 設定ガイド、スタイルの決定木と重要な規則を提供し、開発者が迅速に開発および最適化するのに役立ちます","ko":"Tailwind 4 설정 가이드, 스타일 결정 트리와 중요한 규칙을 제공하여 개발자가 빠르게 개발하고 최적화할 수 있도록 도와줍니다","es":"Tailwind 4 es un framework de CSS que permite a los desarrolladores crear interfaces de usuario personalizadas de manera rápida y sencilla. Con nuestras mejores prácticas, puedes aprovechar al máximo sus características.","fr":"Tailwind 4 est un framework CSS qui permet aux développeurs de créer des interfaces utilisateur personnalisées de manière rapide et simple. Avec nos meilleures pratiques, vous pouvez tirer le meilleur parti de ses fonctionnalités.","de":"Tailwind 4 ist ein CSS-Framework, das es Entwicklern ermöglicht, benutzerdefinierte Benutzeroberflächen schnell und einfach zu erstellen. Mit unseren besten Praktiken können Sie seine Funktionen optimal nutzen.","pt":"Tailwind 4 é uma ferramenta poderosa para criar interfaces de usuário personalizadas e responsivas. Aprenda a usá-la com eficácia.","ru":"Tailwind 4 - это мощный инструмент для создания настраиваемых и адаптивных пользовательских интерфейсов. Узнайте, как им пользоваться эффективно.","ar":"Tailwind 4 هو أداة قوية لإنشاء واجهات مستخدم مخصصة ومتجاوبة. تعلم كيفية استخدامها بفعالية.","en":"AI Setup MarkDown For Copilot, Claude, Codex And Gemini"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Tailwind 4 设置指南","ja":"Tailwind 4 設定ガイド","ko":"Tailwind 4 설정 가이드","es":"Tailwind 4: Mejores prácticas para desarrolladores","fr":"Tailwind 4: Meilleures pratiques pour les développeurs","de":"Tailwind 4: Beste Praktiken für Entwickler","pt":"Tailwind 4: Guia de Estilo para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Tailwind 4: Стильное Руководство для Разработчиков","ar":"Tailwind 4: دليل أسلوبي للمطورين","en":"tailwind-4"},"description":{"zh":"Tailwind 4 设置指南，提供样式决策树和关键规则，帮助开发者快速开发和优化应用","ja":"Tailwind 4 設定ガイド、スタイルの決定木と重要な規則を提供し、開発者が迅速に開発および最適化するのに役立ちます","ko":"Tailwind 4 설정 가이드, 스타일 결정 트리와 중요한 규칙을 제공하여 개발자가 빠르게 개발하고 최적화할 수 있도록 도와줍니다","es":"Tailwind 4 es un framework de CSS que permite a los desarrolladores crear interfaces de usuario personalizadas de manera rápida y sencilla. Con nuestras mejo...","fr":"Tailwind 4 est un framework CSS qui permet aux développeurs de créer des interfaces utilisateur personnalisées de manière rapide et simple. Avec nos meilleur...","de":"Tailwind 4 ist ein CSS-Framework, das es Entwicklern ermöglicht, benutzerdefinierte Benutzeroberflächen schnell und einfach zu erstellen. Mit unseren besten ...","pt":"Tailwind 4 é uma ferramenta poderosa para criar interfaces de usuário personalizadas e responsivas. Aprenda a usá-la com eficácia.","ru":"Tailwind 4 - это мощный инструмент для создания настраиваемых и адаптивных пользовательских интерфейсов. Узнайте, как им пользоваться эффективно.","ar":"Tailwind 4 هو أداة قوية لإنشاء واجهات مستخدم مخصصة ومتجاوبة. تعلم كيفية استخدامها بفعالية.","en":"AI Setup MarkDown For Copilot, Claude, Codex And Gemini"},"definition":{"en":"AI Setup MarkDown For Copilot, Claude, Codex And Gemini"},"features":{"zh":["样式决策树","关键规则","动态样式","条件样式","静态样式"],"ja":["スタイルの決定木","重要な規則","動的スタイル","条件スタイル","静的スタイル"],"ko":["스타일 결정 트리","중요한 규칙","동적 스타일","조건 스타일","정적 스타일"],"es":["Configuración de estilos personalizados","Uso de clases de utilidad","Estilos condicionales","Compatibilidad con bibliotecas de terceros","Mejoras de rendimiento"],"fr":["Configuration de styles personnalisés","Utilisation de classes d''utilité","Styles conditionnels","Compatibilité avec les bibliothèques tierces","Améliorations des performances"],"de":["Konfiguration von benutzerdefinierten Styles","Verwendung von Utility-Klassen","Bedingte Styles","Kompatibilität mit Drittbibliotheken","Leistungsverbesserungen"],"pt":["Criação de interfaces de usuário personalizadas","Responsividade em diferentes dispositivos","Uso de classes para estilização","Suporte a valores dinâmicos","Condicionalidade de estilos"],"ru":["Создание настраиваемых пользовательских интерфейсов","Адаптивность на разных устройствах","Использование классов для стилизации","Поддержка динамических значений","Условная стилизация"],"ar":["إنشاء واجهات مستخدم مخصصة","الاستجابة على أجهزة مختلفة","استخدام الفئات لتحديد الاسلوب","دعم القيم الديناميكية","الشروط الاسلوبية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Tailwind 4","样式决策树","关键规则","动态样式","条件样式","静态样式","开发效率"],"ja":["Tailwind 4","スタイルの決定木","重要な規則","動的スタイル","条件スタイル","静的スタイル","開発効率"],"ko":["Tailwind 4","스타일 결정 트리","중요한 규칙","동적 스타일","조건 스타일","정적 스타일","개발 효율성"],"es":["Tailwind 4","desarrollo web","CSS","estilos personalizados","clases de utilidad","estilos condicionales","bibliotecas de terceros","rendimiento"],"fr":["Tailwind 4","développement web","CSS","styles personnalisés","classes d''utilité","styles conditionnels","bibliothèques tierces","performances"],"de":["Tailwind 4","Webentwicklung","CSS","benutzerdefinierte Styles","Utility-Klassen","bedingte Styles","Drittbibliotheken","Leistung"],"pt":["Tailwind 4","Desenvolvimento web","Interface de usuário","Responsividade","CSS","Classes","Valores dinâmicos","Condicionalidade de estilos"],"ru":["Tailwind 4","Веб-разработка","Пользовательский интерфейс","Адаптивность","CSS","Классы","Динамические значения","Условная стилизация"],"ar":["Tailwind 4","تطوير الويب","واجهة المستخدم","الاستجابة","CSS","الفئات","القيم الديناميكية","الشروط الاسلوبية"]}},"owner":"raudyagdel","repo":"ai_setup_and_tips","repoPath":"raudyagdel/ai_setup_and_tips","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.425Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tailwind-4","description":">","version":"1.1","bodyPreview":"## Styling Decision Tree\n\n```\nTailwind class exists?  → className=\"...\"\nDynamic value?          → style={{ width: `${x}%` }}\nConditional styles?     → cn(\"base\", condition && \"variant\")\nStatic only?            → className=\"...\" (no cn() needed)\nLibrary can''t use class?→ style prop with var() constants\n```\n\n## Critical Rules\n\n### Never Use var() in className\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ NEVER: var() in className\n<div className=\"bg-[var(--color-primary)]\" />\n<div className=\"text-[var(--text-color)]\" />\n\n//","body":"## Styling Decision Tree\n\n```\nTailwind class exists?  → className=\"...\"\nDynamic value?          → style={{ width: `${x}%` }}\nConditional styles?     → cn(\"base\", condition && \"variant\")\nStatic only?            → className=\"...\" (no cn() needed)\nLibrary can''t use class?→ style prop with var() constants\n```\n\n## Critical Rules\n\n### Never Use var() in className\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ NEVER: var() in className\n<div className=\"bg-[var(--color-primary)]\" />\n<div className=\"text-[var(--text-color)]\" />\n\n// ✅ ALWAYS: Use Tailwind semantic classes\n<div className=\"bg-primary\" />\n<div className=\"text-slate-400\" />\n```\n\n### Never Use Hex Colors\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ NEVER: Hex colors in className\n<p className=\"text-[#ffffff]\" />\n<div className=\"bg-[#1e293b]\" />\n\n// ✅ ALWAYS: Use Tailwind color classes\n<p className=\"text-white\" />\n<div className=\"bg-slate-800\" />\n```\n\n## The cn() Utility\n\n```typescript\nimport { clsx } from \"clsx\";\nimport { twMerge } from \"tailwind-merge\";\n\nexport function cn(...inputs: ClassValue[]) {\n  return twMerge(clsx(inputs));\n}\n```\n\n### When to Use cn()\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ Conditional classes\n<div className={cn(\"base-class\", isActive && \"active-class\")} />\n\n// ✅ Merging with potential conflicts\n<button className={cn(\"px-4 py-2\", className)} />  // className might override\n\n// ✅ Multiple conditions\n<div className={cn(\n  \"rounded-lg border\",\n  variant === \"primary\" && \"bg-blue-500 text-white\",\n  variant === \"secondary\" && \"bg-gray-200 text-gray-800\",\n  disabled && \"opacity-50 cursor-not-allowed\"\n)} />\n```\n\n### When NOT to Use cn()\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ Static classes - unnecessary wrapper\n<div className={cn(\"flex items-center gap-2\")} />\n\n// ✅ Just use className directly\n<div className=\"flex items-center gap-2\" />\n```\n\n## Style Constants for Charts/Libraries\n\nWhen libraries don''t accept className (like Recharts):\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ Constants with var() - ONLY for library props\nconst CHART_COLORS = {\n  primary: \"var(--color-primary)\",\n  secondary: \"var(--color-secondary)\",\n  text: \"var(--color-text)\",\n  gridLine: \"var(--color-border)\",\n};\n\n// Usage with Recharts (can''t use className)\n<XAxis tick={{ fill: CHART_COLORS.text }} />\n<CartesianGrid stroke={CHART_COLORS.gridLine} />\n```\n\n## Dynamic Values\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ style prop for truly dynamic values\n<div style={{ width: `${percentage}%` }} />\n<div style={{ opacity: isVisible ? 1 : 0 }} />\n\n// ✅ CSS custom properties for theming\n<div style={{ \"--progress\": `${value}%` } as React.CSSProperties} />\n```\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Flexbox\n\n```typescript\n<div className=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4\" />\n<div className=\"flex flex-col gap-2\" />\n<div className=\"inline-flex items-center\" />\n```\n\n### Grid\n\n```typescript\n<div className=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-4\" />\n<div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6\" />\n```\n\n### Spacing\n\n```typescript\n// Padding\n<div className=\"p-4\" />           // All sides\n<div className=\"px-4 py-2\" />     // Horizontal, vertical\n<div className=\"pt-4 pb-2\" />     // Top, bottom\n\n// Margin\n<div className=\"m-4\" />\n<div className=\"mx-auto\" />       // Center horizontally\n<div className=\"mt-8 mb-4\" />\n```\n\n### Typography\n\n```typescript\n<h1 className=\"text-2xl font-bold text-white\" />\n<p className=\"text-sm text-slate-400\" />\n<span className=\"text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide\" />\n```\n\n### Borders & Shadows\n\n```typescript\n<div className=\"rounded-lg border border-slate-700\" />\n<div className=\"rounded-full shadow-lg\" />\n<div className=\"ring-2 ring-blue-500 ring-offset-2\" />\n```\n\n### States\n\n```typescript\n<button className=\"hover:bg-blue-600 focus:ring-2 active:scale-95\" />\n<input className=\"focus:border-blue-500 focus:outline-none\" />\n<div className=\"group-hover:opacity-100\" />\n```\n\n### Responsive\n\n```typescript\n<div className=\"w-full md:w-1/2 lg:w-1/3\" />\n<div className=\"hidden md:block\" />\n<div className=\"text-sm md:text-base lg:text-lg\" />\n```\n\n### Dark Mode\n\n```typescript\n<div className=\"bg-white dark:bg-slate-900\" />\n<p className=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white\" />\n```\n\n## Arbitrary Values (Escape Hatch)\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ OK for one-off values not in design system\n<div className=\"w-[327px]\" />\n<div className=\"top-[117px]\" />\n<div className=\"grid-cols-[1fr_2fr_1fr]\" />\n\n// ❌ Don''t use for colors - use theme instead\n<div className=\"bg-[#1e293b]\" />  // NO\n```\n\n## Keywords\ntailwind, css, styling, cn, utility classes, responsive\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:46:21.889Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing streamlined CSS styling with Tailwind classes","zh":"非常适合需要利用 Tailwind 类简化 CSS 样式的前端智能体","ja":"Tailwind クラスを使用した効率的な CSS スタイリングを必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適","ko":"Tailwind 클래스를 사용하여 간소화된 CSS 스타일링이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 완벽함","es":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend que necesiten una estilización CSS simplificada con clases de Tailwind","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents Frontend ayant besoin d''une stylisation CSS rationalisée avec les classes Tailwind","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agents, die einen optimierten CSS-Styling mit Tailwind-Klassen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam de estilização de CSS simplificada com classes Tailwind","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым необходима упрощенная стилизация CSS с помощью классов Tailwind","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى تنسيق CSS مبسط باستخدام فئات Tailwind"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to dynamically apply Tailwind classes, utilizing conditional styles with cn() and style props with var() constants for seamless integration with libraries like Copilot, Claude, Codex, and Gemini","zh":"赋能智能体动态应用 Tailwind 类，利用 cn() 的条件样式和 var() 常量的样式属性，实现与 Copilot、Claude、Codex 和 Gemini 等库的无缝集成","ja":"cn() を使用した条件付きスタイルと var() 定数を使用したスタイルプロパティを活用して、Tailwind クラスを動的に適用する機能をエージェントに付与し、Copilot、Claude、Codex、Gemini などのライブラリとのシームレスな統合を実現","ko":"cn()을 사용한 조건부 스타일과 var() 상수를 사용한 스타일 props를 활용하여 Tailwind 클래스를 동적으로 적용할 수 있도록 하여, Copilot, Claude, Codex, Gemini와 같은 라이브러리와의 원활한 통합을 가능하게 함","es":"Permite a los agentes aplicar dinámicamente clases de Tailwind, utilizando estilos condicionales con cn() y propiedades de estilo con constantes var() para una integración perfecta con bibliotecas como Copilot, Claude, Codex y Gemini","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer dynamiquement des classes Tailwind, en utilisant des styles conditionnels avec cn() et des propriétés de style avec des constantes var() pour une intégration transparente avec des bibliothèques comme Copilot, Claude, Codex et Gemini","de":"Ermöglicht Agents die dynamische Anwendung von Tailwind-Klassen unter Verwendung von konditionalen Stilen mit cn() und Style-Props mit var()-Konstanten für eine nahtlose Integration mit Bibliotheken wie Copilot, Claude, Codex und Gemini","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aplicar dinamicamente classes Tailwind, utilizando estilos condicionais com cn() e propriedades de estilo com constantes var() para integração perfeita com bibliotecas como Copilot, Claude, Codex e Gemini","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью динамически применять классы Tailwind, используя условные стили с cn() и свойства стилей с константами var() для безшовной интеграции с библиотеками типа Copilot, Claude, Codex и Gemini","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تطبيق فئات Tailwind بشكل ديناميكي، باستخدام أنماط شرطية مع cn() وخصائص النمط مع ثوابت var() من أجل دمج مثالي مع مكتبات مثل Copilot وClaude وCodex وGemini"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating styling decisions with Tailwind class exists checks","Generating dynamic styles with conditional logic using cn()","Debugging CSS issues with var() constants in style props"],"zh":["通过检查 Tailwind 类是否存在来自动化样式决策","使用 cn() 的条件逻辑生成动态样式","利用样式属性中的 var() 常量调试 CSS 问题"],"ja":["Tailwind クラスの存在チェックによるスタイリング決定の自動化","cn() を使用した条件付きロジックによる動的スタイルの生成","スタイルプロパティ内の var() 定数を使用した CSS 問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["Tailwind 클래스 존재 여부 확인을 통한 스타일링 결정 자동화","cn()을 사용한 조건부 로직으로 동적 스타일 생성","스타일 props의 var() 상수를 사용한 CSS 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización de decisiones de estilización con comprobaciones de existencia de clases de Tailwind","Generación de estilos dinámicos con lógica condicional usando cn()","Depuración de problemas CSS con constantes var() en propiedades de estilo"],"fr":["Automatisation des décisions de stylisation avec vérifications d''existence de classes Tailwind","Génération de styles dynamiques avec logique conditionnelle utilisant cn()","Débogage des problèmes CSS avec des constantes var() dans les propriétés de style"],"de":["Automatisierung von Styling-Entscheidungen mit Existenzprüfungen von Tailwind-Klassen","Generierung dynamischer Styles mit konditionaler Logik unter Verwendung von cn()","Debugging von CSS-Problemen mit var()-Konstanten in Style-Props"],"pt":["Automatizar decisões de estilização com verificações de existência de classes Tailwind","Gerar estilos dinâmicos com lógica condicional usando cn()","Depurar problemas de CSS com constantes var() em propriedades de estilo"],"ru":["Автоматизировать решения по стилизации с помощью проверок существования классов Tailwind","Генерировать динамические стили с помощью условной логики, используя cn()","Отлаживать проблемы CSS с константами var() в свойствах стилей"],"ar":["توفير اتخاذ القرارات بخصوص تنسيق Styles مع فحص وجود فئات Tailwind","generar أنماط ديناميكية باستخدام المنطق الشرطي مع cn()","تصحيح أخطاء CSS باستخدام ثوابت var() في خصائص النمط"]},"limitations":{"en":["Never use var() in className","Requires Tailwind class existence checks","Limited to libraries compatible with Tailwind classes"],"zh":["切勿在 className 中使用 var()","需要进行 Tailwind 类存在性检查","仅限于与 Tailwind 类兼容的库"],"ja":["className で var() を使用しない","Tailwind クラスの存在チェックが必要","Tailwind クラスと互換性のあるライブラリに限定"],"ko":["className에서 var()를 사용하지 말 것","Tailwind 클래스 존재 여부 확인이 필요함","Tailwind 클래스와 호환되는 라이브러리로 제한됨"],"es":["Nunca usar var() en className","Requiere comprobaciones de existencia de clases de Tailwind","Limitado a bibliotecas compatibles con clases de Tailwind"],"fr":["Ne jamais utiliser var() dans className","Nécessite des vérifications d''existence des classes Tailwind","Limité aux bibliothèques compatibles avec les classes Tailwind"],"de":["var() niemals in className verwenden","Erfordert Existenzprüfungen von Tailwind-Klassen","Beschränkt auf Bibliotheken, die mit Tailwind-Klassen kompatibel sind"],"pt":["Nunca use var() em className","Exige verificações de existência de classes Tailwind","Limitado a bibliotecas compatíveis com classes Tailwind"],"ru":["Никогда не используйте var() в className","Требует проверок существования классов Tailwind","Ограничен библиотеками, совместимыми с классами Tailwind"],"ar":["لا تستخدم أبدا var() في className","يتطلب فحص وجود فئات Tailwind","محظور بمكتبات متوافقة مع فئات Tailwind"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('jacksonkasi1/portfolio-26/baseline-ui', 'community', 'jacksonkasi1', 'portfolio-26', 'jacksonkasi1/portfolio-26', 'baseline-ui', 0, 0, 25, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.425Z', '2026-02-18T04:46:49.440Z', NULL, '{"id":"jacksonkasi1/portfolio-26/baseline-ui","name":"baseline-ui","description":{"zh":"Baseline UI是一种强化界面一致性的工具，通过应用一致的UI基线来防止AI生成的界面混乱","ja":"Baseline UIはインターフェイスの一貫性を確保するツールで、AI生成のインターフェイスの混乱を防ぐために一貫性のあるUI基準を適用","ko":"Baseline UI는 인터페이스 일관성을 강화하는 도구로, AI 생성 인터페이스의 혼란을 방지하기 위해 일관된 UI 기준을 적용","es":"Baseline UI es una herramienta que establece una base de interfaz de usuario consistente para prevenir la degradación de la IU en proyectos de desarrollo de software","fr":"Baseline UI est un outil qui établit une base d''interface utilisateur cohérente pour prévenir la dégradation de l''IU dans les projets de développement de logiciels","de":"Baseline UI ist ein Tool, das eine einheitliche Benutzeroberflächen-Basis für die Verhinderung der Verschlechterung der Benutzeroberfläche in Softwareentwicklungsprojekten bereitstellt","pt":"Baseline UI é uma ferramenta que padroniza interfaces de usuário para projetos de desenvolvimento web, utilizando Tailwind CSS para garantir uma experiência de usuário consistente","ru":"Baseline UI - это инструмент, который стандартизирует пользовательские интерфейсы для веб-проектов, используя Tailwind CSS для обеспечения последовательного пользовательского опыта","ar":"Baseline UI هي أداة لت chuẩnية واجهات المستخدم لمشاريع تطوير الويب، باستخدام Tailwind CSS لضمان تجربة مستخدم متسقة","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Baseline UI：强化界面一致性","ja":"Baseline UI：インターフェイスの一貫性を確保","ko":"Baseline UI: 인터페이스 일관성을 강화","es":"Baseline UI: Establece una base de interfaz de usuario co...","fr":"Baseline UI : Établir une base d''interface utilisateur co...","de":"Baseline UI: Einheitliche Benutzeroberflächen-Basis","pt":"Baseline UI: Padronize Interfaces com Tailwind CSS","ru":"Baseline UI: Стандартизируйте Интерфейсы с Tailwind CSS","ar":"Baseline UI: معايير الواجهات باستخدام Tailwind CSS","en":"baseline-ui"},"description":{"zh":"Baseline UI是一种强化界面一致性的工具，通过应用一致的UI基线来防止AI生成的界面混乱","ja":"Baseline UIはインターフェイスの一貫性を確保するツールで、AI生成のインターフェイスの混乱を防ぐために一貫性のあるUI基準を適用","ko":"Baseline UI는 인터페이스 일관성을 강화하는 도구로, AI 생성 인터페이스의 혼란을 방지하기 위해 일관된 UI 기준을 적용","es":"Baseline UI es una herramienta que establece una base de interfaz de usuario consistente para prevenir la degradación de la IU en proyectos de desarrollo de ...","fr":"Baseline UI est un outil qui établit une base d''interface utilisateur cohérente pour prévenir la dégradation de l''IU dans les projets de développement de log...","de":"Baseline UI ist ein Tool, das eine einheitliche Benutzeroberflächen-Basis für die Verhinderung der Verschlechterung der Benutzeroberfläche in Softwareentwick...","pt":"Baseline UI é uma ferramenta que padroniza interfaces de usuário para projetos de desenvolvimento web, utilizando Tailwind CSS para garantir uma experiência ...","ru":"Baseline UI - это инструмент, который стандартизирует пользовательские интерфейсы для веб-проектов, используя Tailwind CSS для обеспечения последовательного ...","ar":"Baseline UI هي أداة لت chuẩnية واجهات المستخدم لمشاريع تطوير الويب، باستخدام Tailwind CSS لضمان تجربة مستخدم متسقة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["强制执行一致的UI基线","防止AI生成的界面混乱","提高开发效率","支持Tailwind CSS默认值","提供具体的代码级修复建议"],"ja":["一貫性のあるUI基準を適用","AI生成のインターフェイスの混乱を防ぐ","開発効率を向上","Tailwind CSSのデフォルト値をサポート","具体的なコードレベルの修正案を提供"],"ko":["일관된 UI 기준을 적용","AI 생성 인터페이스의 혼란을 방지","개발 효율성을 향상","Tailwind CSS 기본값 지원","구체적인 코드 수준의 수정 제안 제공"],"es":["Establece una base de interfaz de usuario consistente","Previene la degradación de la IU en proyectos de desarrollo de software","Utiliza Tailwind CSS por defecto","Permite la revisión de archivos contra restricciones preestablecidas","Proporciona violaciones, explicaciones y soluciones concretas"],"fr":["Établit une base d''interface utilisateur cohérente","Prévent la dégradation de l''IU dans les projets de développement de logiciels","Utilise Tailwind CSS par défaut","Permet la révision de fichiers contre des contraintes prédéfinies","Fournit des violations, des explications et des solutions concrètes"],"de":["Stellt eine einheitliche Benutzeroberflächen-Basis bereit","Verhindert die Verschlechterung der Benutzeroberfläche in Softwareentwicklungsprojekten","Verwendet Tailwind CSS standardmäßig","Ermöglicht die Überprüfung von Dateien gegen vordefinierte Einschränkungen","Bietet Verletzungen, Erklärungen und konkrete Lösungen"],"pt":["Padronização de interfaces de usuário","Uso de Tailwind CSS para estilização","Verificação de violações de regras","Sugestões de correção de código","Aplicação de restrições a arquivos de código"],"ru":["Стандартизация пользовательских интерфейсов","Использование Tailwind CSS для стилизации","Проверка на нарушения правил","Предложения по исправлению кода","Применение ограничений к файлам кода"],"ar":["ت chuẩnية واجهات المستخدم","استخدام Tailwind CSS للتنسيق","فحص انتهاكات القواعد","اقتراحات لتصحيح الشفرة","تطبيق القيود على ملفات الشفرة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Baseline UI","界面一致性","AI生成界面","Tailwind CSS","开发效率","代码级修复"],"ja":["Baseline UI","インターフェイスの一貫性","AI生成インターフェイス","Tailwind CSS","開発効率","コードレベルの修正"],"ko":["Baseline UI","인터페이스 일관성","AI 생성 인터페이스","Tailwind CSS","개발 효율성","코드 수준의 수정"],"es":["Baseline UI","interfaz de usuario","desarrollo de software","Tailwind CSS","revisión de archivos","violaciones de interfaz de usuario"],"fr":["Baseline UI","interface utilisateur","développement de logiciels","Tailwind CSS","révision de fichiers","violations d''interface utilisateur"],"de":["Baseline UI","Benutzeroberfläche","Softwareentwicklung","Tailwind CSS","Dateiüberprüfung","Benutzeroberflächen-Verletzungen"],"pt":["Baseline UI","Tailwind CSS","padronização de interfaces","desenvolvimento web","experiência de usuário","regras de estilo","verificação de código"],"ru":["Baseline UI","Tailwind CSS","стандартизация интерфейсов","веб-разработка","пользовательский опыт","правила стиля","проверка кода"],"ar":["Baseline UI","Tailwind CSS","ت chuẩnية الواجهات","تطوير الويب","تجربة المستخدم","قواعد التنسيق","فحص الشفرة"]}},"owner":"jacksonkasi1","repo":"portfolio-26","repoPath":"jacksonkasi1/portfolio-26","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.425Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"baseline-ui","description":"Enforces an opinionated UI baseline to prevent AI-generated interface slop.","bodyPreview":"# Baseline UI\n\nEnforces an opinionated UI baseline to prevent AI-generated interface slop.\n\n## How to use\n\n- `/baseline-ui`\n  Apply these constraints to any UI work in this conversation.\n\n- `/baseline-ui <file>`\n  Review the file against all constraints below and output:\n  - violations (quote the exact line/snippet)\n  - why it matters (1 short sentence)\n  - a concrete fix (code-level suggestion)\n\n## Stack\n\n- MUST use Tailwind CSS defaults unless custom values already exist or are explicitly requ","body":"# Baseline UI\n\nEnforces an opinionated UI baseline to prevent AI-generated interface slop.\n\n## How to use\n\n- `/baseline-ui`\n  Apply these constraints to any UI work in this conversation.\n\n- `/baseline-ui <file>`\n  Review the file against all constraints below and output:\n  - violations (quote the exact line/snippet)\n  - why it matters (1 short sentence)\n  - a concrete fix (code-level suggestion)\n\n## Stack\n\n- MUST use Tailwind CSS defaults unless custom values already exist or are explicitly requested\n- MUST use `motion/react` (formerly `framer-motion`) when JavaScript animation is required\n- SHOULD use `tw-animate-css` for entrance and micro-animations in Tailwind CSS\n- MUST use `cn` utility (`clsx` + `tailwind-merge`) for class logic\n\n## Components\n\n- MUST use accessible component primitives for anything with keyboard or focus behavior (`Base UI`, `React Aria`, `Radix`)\n- MUST use the project’s existing component primitives first\n- NEVER mix primitive systems within the same interaction surface\n- SHOULD prefer [`Base UI`](https://base-ui.com/react/components) for new primitives if compatible with the stack\n- MUST add an `aria-label` to icon-only buttons\n- NEVER rebuild keyboard or focus behavior by hand unless explicitly requested\n\n## Interaction\n\n- MUST use an `AlertDialog` for destructive or irreversible actions\n- SHOULD use structural skeletons for loading states\n- NEVER use `h-screen`, use `h-dvh`\n- MUST respect `safe-area-inset` for fixed elements\n- MUST show errors next to where the action happens\n- NEVER block paste in `input` or `textarea` elements\n\n## Animation\n\n- NEVER add animation unless it is explicitly requested\n- MUST animate only compositor props (`transform`, `opacity`)\n- NEVER animate layout properties (`width`, `height`, `top`, `left`, `margin`, `padding`)\n- SHOULD avoid animating paint properties (`background`, `color`) except for small, local UI (text, icons)\n- SHOULD use `ease-out` on entrance\n- NEVER exceed `200ms` for interaction feedback\n- MUST pause looping animations when off-screen\n- SHOULD respect `prefers-reduced-motion`\n- NEVER introduce custom easing curves unless explicitly requested\n- SHOULD avoid animating large images or full-screen surfaces\n\n## Typography\n\n- MUST use `text-balance` for headings and `text-pretty` for body/paragraphs\n- MUST use `tabular-nums` for data\n- SHOULD use `truncate` or `line-clamp` for dense UI\n- NEVER modify `letter-spacing` (`tracking-*`) unless explicitly requested\n\n## Layout\n\n- MUST use a fixed `z-index` scale (no arbitrary `z-*`)\n- SHOULD use `size-*` for square elements instead of `w-*` + `h-*`\n\n## Performance\n\n- NEVER animate large `blur()` or `backdrop-filter` surfaces\n- NEVER apply `will-change` outside an active animation\n- NEVER use `useEffect` for anything that can be expressed as render logic\n\n## Design\n\n- NEVER use gradients unless explicitly requested\n- NEVER use purple or multicolor gradients\n- NEVER use glow effects as primary affordances\n- SHOULD use Tailwind CSS default shadow scale unless explicitly requested\n- MUST give empty states one clear next action\n- SHOULD limit accent color usage to one per view\n- SHOULD use existing theme or Tailwind CSS color tokens before introducing new ones\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:46:49.440Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for UI-focused Agents tasked with generating clean, production-ready Tailwind CSS interfaces.","zh":"对于专注于用户界面、负责生成简洁且可用于生产环境的Tailwind CSS界面的智能体而言，此技能至关重要。","ja":"UIに焦点を当て、クリーンで本番環境対応のTailwind CSSインターフェースを生成する任務を負ったエージェントにとって必須です。","ko":"UI에 중점을 두고, 깔끔하며 프로덕션 준비가 된 Tailwind CSS 인터페이스를 생성하는 임무를 맡은 에이전트에게 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para los Agentes centrados en la interfaz de usuario encargados de generar interfaces de Tailwind CSS limpias y listas para producción.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents axés sur l''interface utilisateur chargés de générer des interfaces Tailwind CSS propres et prêtes pour la production.","de":"Wesentlich für UI-fokussierte Agenten, die mit der Generierung sauberer, produktionsreifer Tailwind-CSS-Schnittstellen beauftragt sind.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes focados em UI encarregados de gerar interfaces Tailwind CSS limpas e prontas para produção.","ru":"Необходим для агентов, ориентированных на UI, которые занимаются созданием чистых и готовых к производству интерфейсов Tailwind CSS.","ar":"ضروري للوكلاء المتمحورين حول واجهة المستخدم المعنيين بإنشاء واجهات برمجة Tailwind CSS نظيفة وجاهزة للإنتاج."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enforces an opinionated UI baseline to prevent AI-generated interface slop by applying Tailwind CSS defaults and constraints. It provides automated code review capabilities, identifying violations and suggesting concrete fixes for non-compliant code.","zh":"通过应用Tailwind CSS的默认值和约束，强制执行一个既定的UI基线，以防止AI生成的界面出现瑕疵。它提供自动化的代码审查能力，能识别违规行为并为不合规的代码建议具体的修复方案。","ja":"Tailwind CSSのデフォルトと制約を適用することで、確固たるUIベースラインを強制し、AI生成インターフェースの粗悪化を防ぎます。自動化されたコードレビュー機能を提供し、違反を特定し、非準拠のコードに対して具体的な修正を提案します。","ko":"Tailwind CSS 기본값과 제약 조건을 적용하여 독선적인 UI 기준선을 강제함으로써 AI가 생성한 인터페이스의 조잡함을 방지합니다. 자동화된 코드 리뷰 기능을 제공하여 위반 사항을 식별하고 비준수 코드에 대한 구체적인 수정 사항을 제안합니다.","es":"Establece una línea de base de interfaz de usuario opinada para evitar la generación de interfaces desordenadas mediante la aplicación de los valores predeterminados y las restricciones de Tailwind CSS. Proporciona capacidades de revisión de código automatizadas, identificando violaciones y sugiriendo soluciones concretas para el código no conforme.","fr":"Impose une ligne de base d''interface utilisateur avisée pour éviter la génération d''interfaces désordonnées en appliquant les valeurs par défaut et les contraintes de Tailwind CSS. Fournit des capacités de révision de code automatisées, identifiant les violations et suggérant des solutions concrètes pour le code non conforme.","de":"Legt eine Meinungsbasierte Benutzeroberflächen-Baseline fest, um die durch künstliche Intelligenz generierte Schnittstellen-Verschmutzung durch Anwendung der Tailwind-CSS-Standardwerte und -Einschränkungen zu verhindern. Bietet automatisierte Code-Überprüfungsfunktionen, die Verstöße identifizieren und konkrete Korrekturen für nicht konformen Code vorschlagen.","pt":"Impõe uma linha de base de UI opinativa para prevenir a desordem da interface gerada por IA aplicando configurações e restrições padrão do Tailwind CSS. Fornece capacidades de revisão de código automatizadas, identificando violações e sugerindo correções concretas para códigos não conformes.","ru":"Внедряет опорную линию пользовательского интерфейса, чтобы предотвратить неопрятный интерфейс, сгенерированный ИИ, применяя стандартные настройки и ограничения Tailwind CSS. Обеспечивает автоматические возможности проверки кода, выявляя нарушения и предлагая конкретные исправления для неконформного кода.","ar":"فرض خط قاعدي متمحور حول واجهة المستخدم لمنع فوضى واجهة المستخدم التي تم إنشاؤها بواسطة الذكاء الاصطناعي عن طريق تطبيق الإعدادات الافتراضية والقيود الخاصة بـ Tailwind CSS. يوفر khảیات مراجعة الكود التلقائي، والذي يحدد الانتهاكات ويقترح إصلاحات ملموسة للكود غير المتوافق."},"useCases":{"en":["Reviewing Tailwind UI files for compliance","Applying baseline constraints to new UI work","Generating code-level fixes for violations"],"zh":["审查Tailwind UI文件以确保合规性","对新UI工作应用基线约束","为违规行为生成代码级修复"],"ja":["Tailwind UIファイルのコンプライアンス審査","新しいUI作業へのベースライン制約の適用","違反に対するコードレベルの修正の生成"],"ko":["Tailwind UI 파일의 준수 여부 검토","새로운 UI 작업에 기준 제약 조건 적용","위반 사항에 대한 코드 수준의 수정 생성"],"es":["Revisar archivos de interfaz de usuario de Tailwind para verificar el cumplimiento","Aplicar restricciones de línea de base a nuevos trabajos de interfaz de usuario","Generar correcciones de nivel de código para violaciones"],"fr":["Réviser les fichiers d''interface utilisateur de Tailwind pour vérifier la conformité","Appliquer des contraintes de ligne de base à de nouveaux travaux d''interface utilisateur","Générer des corrections de niveau de code pour les violations"],"de":["Überprüfen von Tailwind-Benutzeroberflächen-Dateien auf Konformität","Anwenden von Baseline-Einschränkungen auf neue Benutzeroberflächen-Arbeiten","Generieren von Code-Ebene-Korrekturen für Verstöße"],"pt":["Revisar arquivos de UI do Tailwind para garantir conformidade","Aplicar restrições de linha de base para novos trabalhos de UI","Gerar correções de nível de código para violações"],"ru":["Проверка файлов интерфейса Tailwind на соответствие","Применение базовых ограничений к новой работе интерфейса","Генерация исправлений уровня кода для нарушений"],"ar":["مراجعة ملفات واجهة المستخدم Tailwind للامتثال","تطبيق قيود خط الأساس على أعمال واجهة المستخدم الجديدة","إنشاء إصلاحات على مستوى الكود للانتهاكات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Tailwind CSS dependency required","Limited to UI/HTML file formats","Requires explicit custom value definitions for non-default styling"],"zh":["需要依赖Tailwind CSS","仅限于UI/HTML文件格式","非默认样式需要明确定义自定义值"],"ja":["Tailwind CSSへの依存が必要","UI/HTMLファイル形式に限定される","非デフォルトのスタイリングには明示的なカスタム値の定義が必要"],"ko":["Tailwind CSS 종속성 필요","UI/HTML 파일 형식으로 제한됨","기본값이 아닌 스타일링에는 명시적인 사용자 정의 값 정의가 필요함"],"es":["Se requiere dependencia de Tailwind CSS","Limitado a formatos de archivo UI/HTML","Requiere definiciones de valores personalizados explícitos para estilos no predeterminados"],"fr":["Dépendance de Tailwind CSS requise","Limité aux formats de fichiers UI/HTML","Nécessite des définitions de valeurs personnalisées explicites pour les styles non par défaut"],"de":["Tailwind-CSS-Abhängigkeit erforderlich","Begrenzt auf UI/HTML-Dateiformate","Erfordert explizite benutzerdefinierte Wertedefinitionen für nicht standardmäßige Stile"],"pt":["Dependência do Tailwind CSS necessária","Limitado a formatos de arquivo UI/HTML","Requer definições de valores personalizados explícitos para estilização não padrão"],"ru":["Требуется зависимость от Tailwind CSS","Ограничен форматами файлов UI/HTML","Требует явных пользовательских определений значений для нестандартного стиля"],"ar":["الاعتماد على Tailwind CSS ضروري","محدود بتنسيقات الملفات UI/HTML","يتطلب تعريفات قيم مخصصة صريحة للأسلوب غير الافتراضي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":25}');
