as para multiplos CLIs de IA, seguindo o padrao aberto agentskills.io e as melhores praticas academicamente consolidadas."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Kubernetes 技术支持","ja":"Kubernetes スキル","ko":"쿠버네티스 기술 지원","es":"Kubernetes: Gestión de Clusters y Aplicaciones","fr":"Kubernetes : Gestion de Clusters et d''Applications","de":"Kubernetes: Cluster- und Anwendungsmanagement","pt":"Kubernetes: Gerenciamento de Workloads e Infraestrutura","ru":"Kubernetes: Управление рабочими нагрузками и инфраструктурой","ar":"كوبيرنتس: إدارة الحمل العمل وتحسين البنية التحتية","en":"kubernetes"},"description":{"zh":"Kubernetes 技术支持提供工作负载清单、网络、自动缩放和运营治理的专业执行","ja":"Kubernetes スキルは、ワークロードマニフェスト、ネットワーキング、自動スケーリング、運用ガバナンスのプロフェッショナルな実行を提供します","ko":"쿠버네티스 기술 지원은 작업량 매니페스트, 네트워킹, 자동 확장 및 운용 거버넌스의 전문적인 실행을 제공합니다","es":"Kubernetes es una habilidad que soporta la ejecución profesional en manifestos de cargas de trabajo, redes, escalado automático y gobernanza operativa.","fr":"Kubernetes est une compétence qui prend en charge l''exécution professionnelle dans les manifestes de charge de travail, les réseaux, le scaling automatique e...","de":"Kubernetes ist eine Fähigkeit, die die professionelle Ausführung in Workload-Manifesten, Netzwerken, Automatisierung und operativer Governance unterstützt.","pt":"O Kubernetes é uma ferramenta de orquestração de contêineres que ajuda a gerenciar workloads e infraestrutura de forma eficiente. Ele suporta a execução prof...","ru":"Kubernetes — это инструмент оркестровки контейнеров, который помогает управлять рабочими нагрузками и инфраструктурой эффективно. Он поддерживает профессиона...","ar":"كوبيرنتس هو أداة لorchestration الحاويات التي تساعد في إدارة الحمل العمل والبنية التحتية بفعالية. يدعم التنفيذ المهني في manifests الحمل العمل والشبكات وتوسي...","en":"Hefesto e um gerador de skills que cria Agent Skills padronizadas para multiplos CLIs de IA, seguindo o padrao aberto agentskills.io e as melhores praticas a..."},"definition":{"en":"Hefesto e um gerador de skills que cria Agent Skills padronizadas para multiplos CLIs de IA, seguindo o padrao aberto agentskills.io e as melhores praticas academicamente consolidadas."},"features":{"zh":["工作负载清单","网络管理","自动缩放","运营治理","明确的架构决策","一致的实现"],"ja":["ワークロードマニフェスト","ネットワーキング","自動スケーリング","運用ガバナンス","明確なアーキテクチャの決定","一貫性のある実装"],"ko":["작업량 매니페스트","네트워킹","자동 확장","운용 거버넌스","명확한 아키텍처 결정","일관된 구현"],"es":["Manifestos de cargas de trabajo","Redes y escalado automático","Gobernanza operativa","Arquitectura explícita","Implementación consistente"],"fr":["Manifestes de charge de travail","Réseaux et scaling automatique","Gouvernance opérationnelle","Architecture explicite","Mise en œuvre cohérente"],"de":["Workload-Manifeste","Netzwerke und Automatisierung","Operative Governance","Explizite Architektur","Konsistente Implementierung"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de workloads","Configuração de networking","Autoscaling de recursos","Governança operacional","Definição de arquitetura e limites"],"ru":["Управление рабочими нагрузками","Настройка сети","Автомасштабирование ресурсов","Операционное управление","Определение архитектуры и границ"],"ar":["إدارة الحمل العمل","تكوين الشبكات","توسيع النطاق التلقائي للموارد","إدارة العمليات","تعريف الهيكل المعماري والحدود"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Kubernetes","容器化","自动部署","扩展","管理","工作负载清单","网络管理","自动缩放","运营治理"],"ja":["Kubernetes","コンテナ化","自動デプロイ","スケーリング","管理","ワークロードマニフェスト","ネットワーキング","自動スケーリング","運用ガバナンス"],"ko":["쿠버네티스","컨테이너화","자동 배포","확장","관리","작업량 매니페스트","네트워킹","자동 확장","운용 거버넌스"],"es":["Kubernetes","orquestación de contenedores","automatización","escalado automático","gobernanza operativa","arquitectura de aplicaciones"],"fr":["Kubernetes","orchestration de conteneurs","automatisation","scaling automatique","gouvernance opérationnelle","architecture d''applications"],"de":["Kubernetes","Container-Orchestrierung","Automatisierung","Skalierung","operative Governance","Anwendungsarchitektur"],"pt":["kubernetes","gerenciamento de workloads","orchestração de contêineres","automação de deploy","escalabilidade de aplicativos","gestão de infraestrutura"],"ru":["kubernetes","управление рабочими нагрузками","оркестровка контейнеров","автоматизация развертывания","масштабирование приложений","управление инфраструктурой"],"ar":["كوبيرنتس","إدارة الحمل العمل","orchestration الحاويات","تأتمة التنفيذ","توسيع الحمل العمل","إدارة البنية التحتية"]}},"owner":"KrystianYCSilva","repo":"hefesto-skill-generator","repoPath":"KrystianYCSilva/hefesto-skill-generator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.425Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"kubernetes","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Kubernetes\n\nThis skill supports professional execution in: workload manifests, networking, autoscaling, and operational governance.\nUse it to keep architecture decisions explicit, implementation consistent, and operations reliable.\n\n## How to define architecture and boundaries\n\n- Establish explicit contracts for core interfaces, data flows, and ownership.\n- Keep domain behavior separate from infrastructure details and framework glue.\n- Define compatibility policy before introducing schema or c","body":"# Kubernetes\n\nThis skill supports professional execution in: workload manifests, networking, autoscaling, and operational governance.\nUse it to keep architecture decisions explicit, implementation consistent, and operations reliable.\n\n## How to define architecture and boundaries\n\n- Establish explicit contracts for core interfaces, data flows, and ownership.\n- Keep domain behavior separate from infrastructure details and framework glue.\n- Define compatibility policy before introducing schema or contract changes.\n- Document tradeoffs and decisions in architecture records.\n\n## How to implement with Java and Kotlin\n\n- Prefer constructor injection and explicit DTOs in service boundaries.\n- Enforce nullability and serialization consistency between Java and Kotlin modules.\n- Keep cross-module interfaces small, typed, and version-aware.\n- Add contract tests for external integrations and critical internal boundaries.\n\n## How to operate and harden in production\n\n- Define SLOs and alert thresholds tied to user-facing outcomes.\n- Implement staged rollout and rollback strategy for every critical change.\n- Track dependency saturation, retries, and failure amplification indicators.\n- Keep runbooks updated with tested mitigation steps.\n\n## How to use extended references\n\n- Read [Version History](references/version-history.md) before upgrades, migrations, or compatibility decisions.\n- Read [Java and Kotlin Examples](references/java-kotlin-examples.md) for implementation-ready snippets and language-specific guidance.\n- Read [Advanced Techniques](references/advanced-techniques.md) for specialist playbooks, incident tactics, and performance patterns.\n\n## Common Warnings & Pitfalls\n\n- Architecture decisions are implicit and undocumented, causing long-term drift.\n- Operational controls are added late, increasing incident recovery time.\n- Compatibility strategy is missing for evolving integrations and schemas.\n- Quality gates are inconsistent across environments and release stages.\n\n## Common Errors and Fixes\n\n| Symptom | Root Cause | Fix |\n|---|---|---|\n| Production regression after deployment | Configuration or contract drift across environments | Add compatibility checks, staged rollout, and rollback criteria. |\n| Latency spikes under load | Missing timeout and backpressure policies | Define budgets, tune pools, and monitor saturation indicators. |\n| Integration failures after change | Versioning and contract tests not enforced | Apply contract governance and CI compatibility gates. |\n\n## Keywords\n\n- deployment\n- service\n- ingress\n- HPA\n- pod disruption budget\n\n## References\n\n- [Official Documentation](https://kubernetes.io/docs/home/)\n- [Official Documentation](https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/)\n- [Official Documentation](https://kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:46:23.821Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cloud Management Agents requiring automated workload orchestration and containerization through Kubernetes","zh":"适用于需要通过Kubernetes自动化工作负载编排和容器化的云管理代理","ja":"Kubernetesを通じて自動化されたワークロードオーケストレーションとコンテナ化を必要とするクラウド管理エージェントに最適","ko":"쿠버네티스를 통한 자동화된 워크로드 오케스트레이션과 컨테이너화가 필요한 클라우드 관리 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de gestión de la nube que requieren orquestación automatizada de cargas de trabajo y containerización mediante Kubernetes","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de gestion de cloud nécessitant une orchestration automatisée des charges de travail et une conteneurisation via Kubernetes","de":"Ideal für Cloud-Management-Agents, die eine automatisierte Workload-Orchestrierung und Containerisierung über Kubernetes benötigen","pt":"Ideal for Cloud Management Agents requiring automated workload orchestration and containerization through Kubernetes","ru":"Ideal for Cloud Management Agents requiring automated workload orchestration and containerization through Kubernetes","ar":"Ideal for Cloud Management Agents requiring automated workload orchestration and containerization through Kubernetes"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage containerized applications with workload manifests, networking, autoscaling, and operational governance, ensuring explicit architecture decisions and consistent implementation through contracts for core interfaces, data flows, and ownership","zh":"赋予代理管理容器化应用的能力，包括工作负载清单、网络、自动扩缩和运营治理，确保显式的架构决策和通过核心接口、数据流和所有权的合同的一致实现","ja":"エージェントがコンテナ化されたアプリケーションを管理する能力を付与し、ワークロードマニフェスト、ネットワーク、自動スケーリング、運用ガバナンスを提供し、コアインターフェイス、データフロー、所有権の契約を通じて明示的なアーキテクチャの決定と一貫した実装を保証する","ko":"에이전트가 컨테이너화된 애플리케이션을 관리할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 워크로드 매니페스트, 네트워크, 자동 확장 및 운영 거버넌스를 제공하고, 핵심 인터페이스, 데이터 흐름 및 소유권의 계약을 통해 명시적인 아키텍처 결정 및 일관된 구현을 보장한다","es":"Capacita a los agentes para gestionar aplicaciones en contenedores con manifiestos de carga de trabajo, redes, escalado automático y gobernanza operativa, garantizando decisiones de arquitectura explícitas y una implementación consistente mediante contratos para interfaces principales, flujos de datos y propiedad","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer des applications conteneurisées avec des manifests de charge de travail, la mise en réseau, la mise à l''échelle automatique et la gouvernance opérationnelle, garantissant des décisions architecturales explicites et une mise en œuvre cohérente via des contrats pour les interfaces principales, les flux de données et la propriété","de":"Ermöglicht Agents die Verwaltung containerisierter Anwendungen mit Workload-Manifests, Netzwerkkonfiguration, Autoscaling und operativer Governance, wodurch explizite Architekturentscheidungen und eine konsistente Implementierung durch Verträge für Kernschnittstellen, Datenflüsse und Ownership gewährleistet werden","pt":"Empowers agents to manage containerized applications with workload manifests, networking, autoscaling, and operational governance, ensuring explicit architecture decisions and consistent implementation through contracts for core interfaces, data flows, and ownership","ru":"Empowers agents to manage containerized applications with workload manifests, networking, autoscaling, and operational governance, ensuring explicit architecture decisions and consistent implementation through contracts for core interfaces, data flows, and ownership","ar":"Empowers agents to manage containerized applications with workload manifests, networking, autoscaling, and operational governance, ensuring explicit architecture decisions and consistent implementation through contracts for core interfaces, data flows, and ownership"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating deployment and scaling of containerized applications","Configuring networking policies for secure communication between pods","Implementing operational governance through explicit contracts and compatibility policies"],"zh":["自动化部署和扩缩容器化应用","为安全的Pod间通信配置网络策略","通过显式合同和兼容性策略实现运营治理"],"ja":["コンテナ化されたアプリケーションの自動化されたデプロイとスケーリング","セキュアなPod間の通信のためのネットワークポリシーの構成","明示的な契約と互換性ポリシーを通じて運用ガバナンスの実施"],"ko":["컨테이너화된 애플리케이션의 자동화된 배포 및 확장","安全한 Pod間의 통신을 위한 네트워크 정책 구성","명시적인 계약 및 호환성 정책을 통해 운영 거버넌스의 구현"],"es":["Automatización del despliegue y escalado de aplicaciones en contenedores","Configuración de políticas de red para una comunicación segura entre pods","Implementación de gobernanza operativa mediante contratos explícitos y políticas de compatibilidad"],"fr":["Automatisation du déploiement et de la mise à l''échelle d''applications conteneurisées","Configuration des politiques de réseau pour une communication sécurisée entre les pods","Mise en œuvre d''une gouvernance opérationnelle via des contrats explicites et des politiques de compatibilité"],"de":["Automatisierung der Bereitstellung und Skalierung containerisierter Anwendungen","Konfiguration von Netzwerkrichtlinien für sichere Kommunikation zwischen Pods","Umsetzung operativer Governance durch explizite Verträge und Kompatibilitätsrichtlinien"],"pt":["Automating deployment and scaling of containerized applications","Configuring networking policies for secure communication between pods","Implementing operational governance through explicit contracts and compatibility policies"],"ru":["Automating deployment and scaling of containerized applications","Configuring networking policies for secure communication between pods","Implementing operational governance through explicit contracts and compatibility policies"],"ar":["Automating deployment and scaling of containerized applications","Configuring networking policies for secure communication between pods","Implementing operational governance through explicit contracts and compatibility policies"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Kubernetes cluster setup and configuration","Depends on explicit contracts for core interfaces and data flows"],"zh":["需要Kubernetes集群设置和配置","依赖于核心接口和数据流的显式合同"],"ja":["Kubernetesクラスタの設定と構成が必要","コアインターフェイスとデータフローの明示的な契約に依存"],"ko":["쿠버네티스 클러스터 설정 및 구성이 필요","핵심 인터페이스 및 데이터 흐름의 명시적인 계약에 의존"],"es":["Requiere la configuración y puesta a punto de un clúster de Kubernetes","Depende de contratos explícitos para las interfaces principales y los flujos de datos"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration et la mise en place d''un cluster Kubernetes","Dépend de contrats explicites pour les interfaces principales et les flux de données"],"de":["Erfordert die Einrichtung und Konfiguration eines Kubernetes-Clusters","Ist von expliziten Verträgen für Kernschnittstellen und Datenflüsse abhängig"],"pt":["Requires Kubernetes cluster setup and configuration","Depends on explicit contracts for core interfaces and data flows"],"ru":["Requires Kubernetes cluster setup and configuration","Depends on explicit contracts for core interfaces and data flows"],"ar":["Requires Kubernetes cluster setup and configuration","Depends on explicit contracts for core interfaces and data flows"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
