utter 전문가가 제공하는 가이드. Dart 프로그래밍, Flutter 프레임워크 및 크로스 플랫폼 애플리케이션 개발을 포함","es":"El experto en Dart y Flutter ofrece orientación en lenguaje Dart, framework Flutter y desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles y multiplataforma","fr":"L''expert en Dart et Flutter offre des conseils sur le langage Dart, le framework Flutter et le développement d''applications mobiles et multiplateformes","de":"Der Dart- und Flutter-Experte bietet Beratung in Dart-Sprache, Flutter-Framework und Entwicklung mobiler und plattformübergreifender Anwendungen","pt":"O especialista em Dart e Flutter oferece orientação para desenvolvedores em linguagem Dart, framework Flutter e desenvolvimento móvel.","ru":"Эксперт по Dart и Flutter предоставляет руководство для разработчиков на языке Dart, фреймворке Flutter и мобильной разработке.","ar":"يقدم خبير Dart و Flutter إرشادات للمطورين في لغة Dart وإطار العمل Flutter والتنمية المحمولة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Dart语言基础","Flutter框架开发","跨平台应用开发","状态管理和导航","Material和Cupertino设计"],"ja":["Dart言語基礎","Flutterフレームワーク開発","クロスプラットフォームアプリ開発","状態管理とナビゲーション","MaterialとCupertinoデザイン"],"ko":["Dart 언어 기초","Flutter 프레임워크 개발","크로스 플랫폼 애플리케이션 개발","상태 관리 및 네비게이션","Material 및 Cupertino 디자인"],"es":["Lenguaje Dart con inferencia de tipos","Framework Flutter para desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles","Gestión de estado con Provider, Riverpod y Bloc","Navegación y enrutamiento","Diseño de Material y Cupertino","Diseños responsivos"],"fr":["Langage Dart avec inférence de types","Framework Flutter pour le développement d''applications mobiles","Gestion d''état avec Provider, Riverpod et Bloc","Navigation et routage","Conception de Material et Cupertino","Conceptions responsives"],"de":["Dart-Sprache mit Typinferenz","Flutter-Framework für die Entwicklung mobiler Anwendungen","Zustandsverwaltung mit Provider, Riverpod und Bloc","Navigation und Routing","Material- und Cupertino-Design","Responsive-Designs"],"pt":["Linguagem Dart com tipagem forte e inferência de