o":"flownest-flutter","repoPath":"slym1v98/flownest-flutter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.425Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"dart-expert","description":"Expert-level Dart, Flutter, mobile development, and cross-platform apps","version":"1.0.0","tags":["dart","flutter","mobile","cross-platform","widgets"],"bodyPreview":"# Dart & Flutter Expert\n\nExpert guidance for Dart programming, Flutter framework, mobile development, and cross-platform applications.\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### Dart Language\n- Strong typing with type inference\n- Async/await and Futures\n- Streams\n- Mixins and extensions\n- Null safety\n- Collections\n\n### Flutter Framework\n- Widgets (Stateless & Stateful)\n- State management (Provider, Riverpod, Bloc)\n- Navigation and routing\n- Material and Cupertino design\n- Responsive layouts\n- Platform integration","body":"# Dart & Flutter Expert\n\nExpert guidance for Dart programming, Flutter framework, mobile development, and cross-platform applications.\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### Dart Language\n- Strong typing with type inference\n- Async/await and Futures\n- Streams\n- Mixins and extensions\n- Null safety\n- Collections\n\n### Flutter Framework\n- Widgets (Stateless & Stateful)\n- State management (Provider, Riverpod, Bloc)\n- Navigation and routing\n- Material and Cupertino design\n- Responsive layouts\n- Platform integration\n\n## Dart Fundamentals\n\n```dart\n// Variables and types\nvar name = ''John'';  // Type inference\nString explicitType = ''Explicit'';\nfinal constantValue = 42;  // Runtime constant\nconst compileConstant = ''Compile-time'';\n\n// Null safety\nString? nullableString;\nString nonNullable = ''Never null'';\n\n// Late initialization\nlate String lateInit;\n\n// Collections\nList<String> names = [''Alice'', ''Bob'', ''Charlie''];\nMap<String, int> ages = {''Alice'': 25, ''Bob'': 30};\nSet<int> uniqueNumbers = {1, 2, 3, 3};  // {1, 2, 3}\n\n// Functions\nint add(int a, int b) => a + b;\n\n// Named parameters\nvoid createUser({\n  required String name,\n  int age = 18,\n  String? email,\n}) {\n  print(''Creating user: $name, age: $age'');\n}\n\n// Classes\nclass User {\n  final String id;\n  final String name;\n  int age;\n\n  User({\n    required this.id,\n    required this.name,\n    this.age = 0,\n  });\n\n  // Named constructor\n  User.guest() : this(id: ''guest'', name: ''Guest'');\n\n  // Methods\n  void celebrateBirthday() {\n    age++;\n  }\n\n  @override\n  String toString() => ''User($name, $age)'';\n}\n\n// Mixins\nmixin Loggable {\n  void log(String message) {\n    print(''[${DateTime.now()}] $message'');\n  }\n}\n\nclass LoggableUser extends User with Loggable {\n  LoggableUser({required String id, required String name})\n      : super(id: id, name: name);\n}\n\n// Extensions\nextension StringExtensions on String {\n  bool get isValidEmail => contains(''@'') && contains(''.'');\n  String capitalize() => ''${this[0].toUpperCase()}${substring(1)}'';\n}\n```\n\n## Async Programming\n\n```dart\nimport ''dart:async'';\n\n// Future\nFuture<String> fetchUser(String id) async {\n  await Future.delayed(Duration(seconds: 1));\n  return ''User $id'';\n}\n\n// Error handling\nFuture<User?> fetchUserSafely(String id) async {\n  try {\n    final user = await fetchUser(id);\n    return User(id: id, name: user);\n  } catch (e) {\n    print(''Error: $e'');\n    return null;\n  }\n}\n\n// Multiple futures\nFuture<void> fetchMultiple() async {\n  final results = await Future.wait([\n    fetchUser(''1''),\n    fetchUser(''2''),\n    fetchUser(''3''),\n  ]);\n  print(results);\n}\n\n// Streams\nStream<int> countStream() async* {\n  for (int i = 1; i <= 5; i++) {\n    await Future.delayed(Duration(seconds: 1));\n    yield i;\n  }\n}\n\n// Listen to stream\nvoid listenToStream() {\n  countStream().listen(\n    (data) => print(''Received: $data''),\n    onError: (error) => print(''Error: $error''),\n    onDone: () => print(''Done''),\n  );\n}\n\n// Stream transformations\nStream<String> transformedStream() {\n  return countStream()\n      .where((n) => n % 2 == 0)\n      .map((n) => ''Number: $n'')\n      .take(3);\n}\n\n// StreamController\nclass Counter {\n  final _controller = StreamController<int>();\n\n  Stream<int> get stream => _controller.stream;\n\n  void increment(int value) {\n    _controller.add(value);\n  }\n\n  void dispose() {\n    _controller.close();\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Flutter Widgets\n\n```dart\nimport ''package:flutter/material.dart'';\n\n// Stateless Widget\nclass UserCard extends StatelessWidget {\n  final User user;\n\n  const UserCard({Key? key, required this.user}) : super(key: key);\n\n  @override\n  Widget build(BuildContext context) {\n    return Card(\n      child: ListTile(\n        title: Text(user.name),\n        subtitle: Text(''Age: ${user.age}''),\n        trailing: Icon(Icons.arrow_forward),\n      ),\n    );\n  }\n}\n\n// Stateful Widget\nclass CounterWidget extends StatefulWidget {\n  const CounterWidget({Key? key}) : super(key: key);\n\n  @override\n  State<CounterWidget> createState() => _CounterWidgetState();\n}\n\nclass _CounterWidgetState extends State<CounterWidget> {\n  int _counter = 0;\n\n  void _incrementCounter() {\n    setState(() {\n      _counter++;\n    });\n  }\n\n  @override\n  Widget build(BuildContext context) {\n    return Column(\n      children: [\n        Text(''Counter: $_counter''),\n        ElevatedButton(\n          onPressed: _incrementCounter,\n          child: Text(''Increment''),\n        ),\n      ],\n    );\n  }\n}\n\n// Layout\nclass UserListScreen extends StatelessWidget {\n  final List<User> users;\n\n  const UserListScreen({Key? key, required this.users}) : super(key: key);\n\n  @override\n  Widget build(BuildContext context) {\n    return Scaffold(\n      appBar: AppBar(\n        title: Text(''Users''),\n        actions: [\n          IconButton(\n            icon: Icon(Icons.add),\n            onPressed: () => Navigator.push(\n              context,\n              MaterialPageRoute(builder: (_) => AddUserScreen()),\n            ),\n          ),\n        ],\n      ),\n      body: ListView.builder(\n        itemCount: users.length,\n        itemBuilder: (context, index) {\n          return UserCard(user: users[index]);\n        },\n      ),\n    );\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## State Management (Provider)\n\n```dart\nimport ''package:provider/provider.dart'';\n\n// State class\nclass UserProvider extends ChangeNotifier {\n  List<User> _users = [];\n\n  List<User> get users => _users;\n\n  Future<void> fetchUsers() async {\n    _users = await api.getUsers();\n    notifyListeners();\n  }\n\n  void addUser(User user) {\n    _users.add(user);\n    notifyListeners();\n  }\n\n  void removeUser(String id) {\n    _users.removeWhere((user) => user.id == id);\n    notifyListeners();\n  }\n}\n\n// Setup provider\nvoid main() {\n  runApp(\n    MultiProvider(\n      providers: [\n        ChangeNotifierProvider(create: (_) => UserProvider()),\n        ChangeNotifierProvider(create: (_) => AuthProvider()),\n      ],\n      child: MyApp(),\n    ),\n  );\n}\n\n// Consume provider\nclass UserList extends StatelessWidget {\n  @override\n  Widget build(BuildContext context) {\n    final userProvider = Provider.of<UserProvider>(context);\n\n    return ListView.builder(\n      itemCount: userProvider.users.length,\n      itemBuilder: (context, index) {\n        final user = userProvider.users[index];\n        return ListTile(\n          title: Text(user.name),\n          trailing: IconButton(\n            icon: Icon(Icons.delete),\n            onPressed: () => userProvider.removeUser(user.id),\n          ),\n        );\n      },\n    );\n  }\n}\n\n// Consumer widget\nclass UserCounter extends StatelessWidget {\n  @override\n  Widget build(BuildContext context) {\n    return Consumer<UserProvider>(\n      builder: (context, userProvider, child) {\n        return Text(''Total users: ${userProvider.users.length}'');\n      },\n    );\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Navigation\n\n```dart\n// Basic navigation\nNavigator.push(\n  context,\n  MaterialPageRoute(builder: (context) => DetailScreen()),\n);\n\n// Named routes\nMaterialApp(\n  routes: {\n    ''/'': (context) => HomeScreen(),\n    ''/details'': (context) => DetailScreen(),\n    ''/settings'': (context) => SettingsScreen(),\n  },\n);\n\nNavigator.pushNamed(context, ''/details'');\n\n// Pass arguments\nNavigator.pushNamed(\n  context,\n  ''/details'',\n  arguments: {''userId'': ''123''},\n);\n\n// Get arguments\nfinal args = ModalRoute.of(context)!.settings.arguments as Map;\n\n// Return data\nfinal result = await Navigator.push(\n  context,\n  MaterialPageRoute(builder: (_) => SelectionScreen()),\n);\n\n// Pop with result\nNavigator.pop(context, selectedValue);\n```\n\n## HTTP and API\n\n```dart\nimport ''package:http/http.dart'' as http;\nimport ''dart:convert'';\n\nclass ApiService {\n  final String baseUrl = ''https://api.example.com'';\n\n  Future<List<User>> fetchUsers() async {\n    final response = await http.get(Uri.parse(''$baseUrl/users''));\n\n    if (response.statusCode == 200) {\n      final List<dynamic> data = json.decode(response.body);\n      return data.map((json) => User.fromJson(json)).toList();\n    } else {\n      throw Exception(''Failed to load users'');\n    }\n  }\n\n  Future<User> createUser(User user) async {\n    final response = await http.post(\n      Uri.parse(''$baseUrl/users''),\n      headers: {''Content-Type'': ''application/json''},\n      body: json.encode(user.toJson()),\n    );\n\n    if (response.statusCode == 201) {\n      return User.fromJson(json.decode(response.body));\n    } else {\n      throw Exception(''Failed to create user'');\n    }\n  }\n}\n\n// Model with JSON serialization\nclass User {\n  final String id;\n  final String name;\n  final String email;\n\n  User({required this.id, required this.name, required this.email});\n\n  factory User.fromJson(Map<String, dynamic> json) {\n    return User(\n      id: json[''id''],\n      name: json[''name''],\n      email: json[''email''],\n    );\n  }\n\n  Map<String, dynamic> toJson() {\n    return {\n      ''id'': id,\n      ''name'': name,\n      ''email'': email,\n    };\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Dart\n- Use const constructors when possible\n- Leverage null safety\n- Use final for immutable values\n- Prefer async/await over .then()\n- Use extensions for utility methods\n- Follow Effective Dart guidelines\n\n### Flutter\n- Keep widgets small and focused\n- Use const widgets for optimization\n- Avoid rebuilding entire trees\n- Implement proper state management\n- Handle errors gracefully\n- Test widgets thoroughly\n- Use keys when needed\n\n### Performance\n- Use ListView.builder for long lists\n- Implement pagination\n- Cache network images\n- Minimize widget rebuilds\n- Use const constructors\n- Profile app performance\n- Lazy load resources\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n❌ Large widget trees\n❌ State in StatelessWidget\n❌ Not disposing controllers\n❌ Ignoring null safety\n❌ Synchronous I/O in UI\n❌ No error handling\n❌ Hard-coded strings\n\n## Resources\n\n- Dart: https://dart.dev/\n- Flutter: https://flutter.dev/\n- Pub.dev: https://pub.dev/\n- Flutter Widget Catalog: https://flutter.dev/docs/development/ui/widgets\n- Effective Dart: https://dart.dev/guides/language/effective-dart\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:46:44.793Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Generation and Analysis Agents specializing in cross-platform mobile development with Dart and Flutter.","zh":"非常适合专注于使用Dart和Flutter进行跨平台移动开发的代码生成和分析代理。","ja":"DartとFlutterを使用したクロスプラットフォームモバイル開発を専門とするコード生成および分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Dart와 Flutter를 사용한 크로스 플랫폼 모바일 개발을 전문으로 하는 코드 생성 및 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de generación y análisis de código especializados en desarrollo móvil multiplataforma con Dart y Flutter.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de génération et d''analyse de code spécialisés dans le développement mobile multiplateforme avec Dart et Flutter.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Generierungs- und Analyse-Agents, die sich auf die Entwicklung von Cross-Platform-Mobile-Anwendungen mit Dart und Flutter spezialisieren.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Geração e Análise de Código especializados em desenvolvimento móvel cross-plataforma com Dart e Flutter.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов генерации и анализа кода, специализирующихся на кроссплатформенном мобильном разработке с помощью Dart и Flutter.","ar":"مثالي لعميل توليد وتحليل الشفرة المتخصص في تطوير الهواتف المحمولة متعددة المنصات باستخدام Dart و Flutter."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to generate and analyze Dart code with full null safety, implement Flutter widgets (Stateless/Stateful), and integrate state management solutions like Provider, Riverpod, and Bloc. Provides expert guidance on responsive layouts, platform integration, and asynchronous programming with Futures and Streams.","zh":"使代理能够生成和分析具有完全空安全性的Dart代码，实现Flutter小部件（无状态/有状态），并集成Provider、Riverpod和Bloc等状态管理解决方案。提供有关响应式布局、平台集成和使用Futures和Streams进行异步编程的专家指导。","ja":"エージェントが完全なnull安全性を持つDartコードを生成および分析し、Flutterウィジェット（ステートレス/ステートフル）を実装し、Provider、Riverpod、Blocなどのステート管理ソリューションを統合することを可能にします。FuturesとStreamsを使用したレスポンシブレイアウト、プラットフォーム統合、非同期プログラミングに関する専門家のガイダンスを提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 완전한 null 안전성을 가진 Dart 코드를 생성 및 분석하고, Flutter 위젯(상태가 없는/있는)을 구현하며, Provider, Riverpod, Bloc 등의 상태 관리 솔루션을 통합할 수 있도록 합니다. Futures와 Streams를 사용한 반응형 레이아웃, 플랫폼 통합, 비동기 프로그래밍에 관한 전문가 가이드를 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar y analizar código Dart con seguridad de null completo, implementar widgets de Flutter (Stateless/Stateful) e integrar soluciones de gestión de estado como Provider, Riverpod y Bloc. Proporciona orientación experta sobre diseños responsivos, integración de plataformas y programación asíncrona con Futures y Streams.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer et d''analyser du code Dart avec une sécurité de null complète, de mettre en œuvre des widgets Flutter (Stateless/Stateful) et d''intégrer des solutions de gestion d''état comme Provider, Riverpod et Bloc. Fournit des conseils d''experts sur les conceptions réactives, l''intégration de plateformes et la programmation asynchrone avec Futures et Streams.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, Dart-Code mit voller Null-Sicherheit zu generieren und zu analysieren, Flutter-Widgets (Stateless/Stateful) zu implementieren und State-Management-Lösungen wie Provider, Riverpod und Bloc zu integrieren. Bietet Expertenleitfäden für responsive Layouts, Plattformintegration und asynchrone Programmierung mit Futures und Streams.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerem e analisem código Dart com segurança de null total, implementem widgets Flutter (Stateless/Stateful) e integrem soluções de gerenciamento de estado como Provider, Riverpod e Bloc. Fornece orientação especializada em layouts responsivos, integração de plataforma e programação assíncrona com Futures e Streams.","ru":"Позволяет агентам генерировать и анализировать код Dart с полной безопасностью null, реализовывать виджеты Flutter (Stateless/Stateful) и интегрировать решения управления состоянием, такие как Provider, Riverpod и Bloc. Предоставляет экспертные рекомендации по реализации адаптивных макетов, интеграции платформы и асинхронному программированию с использованием Futures и Streams.","ar":"يمكن للعميل توليد وتحليل شفرة Dart مع ضمانات عدم وجود قيمة Null ، وتنفيذ widgets Flutter (Stateless/Stateful) ، وتكامل حلول إدارة الحالة مثل Provider و Riverpod و Bloc. يوفر إرشادات خبير في تخطيطات متجاوبة وتكامل المنصة وبرمجة غير متزامنة مع Futures و Streams."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating cross-platform UI code with Material/Cupertino widgets","Debugging async/await and Future-based code patterns","Implementing state management architectures for complex applications","Optimizing responsive layouts for multiple screen sizes"],"zh":["使用Material/Cupertino小部件生成跨平台UI代码","调试异步/等待和基于Future的代码模式","为复杂应用程序实施状态管理架构","针对多个屏幕尺寸优化响应式布局"],"ja":["Material/Cupertinoウィジェットを使用してクロスプラットフォームUIコードを生成する","async/awaitおよびFutureベースのコードパターンのデバッグ","複雑なアプリケーションのためのステート管理アーキテクチャの実装","複数の画面サイズに対するレスポンシブレイアウトの最適化"],"ko":["Material/Cupertino 위젯을 사용하여 크로스 플랫폼 UI 코드를 생성하는 것","비동기/대기 및 Future 기반 코드 패턴의 디버깅","복잡한 애플리케이션을 위한 상태 관리 아키텍처의 구현","여러 화면 크기에 대한 반응형 레이아웃의 최적화"],"es":["Generar código de interfaz de usuario multiplataforma con widgets Material/Cupertino","Depurar patrones de código async/await y basados en Future","Implementar arquitecturas de gestión de estado para aplicaciones complejas","Optimizar diseños responsivos para varios tamaños de pantalla"],"fr":["Générer du code d''interface utilisateur multiplateforme avec des widgets Material/Cupertino","Déboguer des modèles de code async/await et basés sur Future","Mettre en œuvre des architectures de gestion d''état pour des applications complexes","Optimiser des conceptions réactives pour plusieurs tailles d''écran"],"de":["Erzeugen von Cross-Platform-Benutzeroberflächen-Code mit Material/Cupertino-Widgets","Debuggen von async/await- und Future-basierten Code-Mustern","Implementieren von State-Management-Architekturen für komplexe Anwendungen","Optimieren von responsiven Layouts für verschiedene Bildschirmgrößen"],"pt":["Gerando código de UI cross-plataforma com widgets Material/Cupertino","Depurando padrões de código async/await e baseados em Future","Implementando arquiteturas de gerenciamento de estado para aplicações complexas","Otimizando layouts responsivos para vários tamanhos de tela"],"ru":["Генерация кроссплатформенного кода UI с использованием виджетов Material/Cupertino","Отладка асинхронных/ожидаемых и основанных на Future шаблонов кода","Реализация архитектур управления состоянием для сложных приложений","Оптимизация адаптивных макетов для нескольких размеров экрана"],"ar":["توليد شفرة واجهة المستخدم متعددة المنصات باستخدام widgets Material/Cupertino","تصحيح أخطاء في أنماط الشفرة غير المتزامنة / في انتظار و المستندة إلى Future","تنفيذ هياكل إدارة الحالة لتطبيقات معقدة","تحسين تخطيطات متجاوبة للعديد من أحجام الشاشة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Dart-specific language features only","Focuses exclusively on Flutter framework conventions","Requires understanding of widget lifecycle concepts"],"zh":["仅支持Dart特定语言功能","专注于Flutter框架约定","需要了解小部件生命周期概念"],"ja":["Dart固有の言語機能のみをサポート","Flutterフレームワークの規約にのみ焦点を当てている","ウィジェットのライフサイクル概念の理解が必要"],"ko":["Dart 고유의 언어 기능만을 지원함","Flutter 프레임워크 규약에만 초점을 두고 있음","위젯 라이프사이클 개념의 이해가 필요"],"es":["Características del lenguaje Dart específicas solo","Se centra exclusivamente en las convenciones del marco de trabajo Flutter","Requiere comprensión de los conceptos del ciclo de vida de los widgets"],"fr":["Fonctions du langage Dart spécifiques uniquement","Se concentre exclusivement sur les conventions du framework Flutter","Nécessite une compréhension des concepts du cycle de vie des widgets"],"de":["Dart-spezifische Sprachfunktionen nur","Konzentriert sich ausschließlich auf die Konventionen des Flutter-Frameworks","Erfordert das Verständnis von Widget-Lebenszykluskonzepten"],"pt":["Recursos de linguagem específicos do Dart apenas","Concentra-se exclusivamente nas convenções do framework Flutter","Exige compreensão de conceitos de ciclo de vida do widget"],"ru":["Только специфические для языка Dart функции","Сосредоточен исключительно на конвенциях фреймворка Flutter","Требует понимания концепций жизненного цикла виджета"],"ar":["ميزات لغة محددة ل Dart فقط","يركز حصريًا على اتفاقيات إطار Flutter","يتطلب فهم مفاهيم دورة حياة Widget"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Charles5277/swc-movie-box-office-analysis/ui-ux-pro-max', 'community', 'Charles5277', 'swc-movie-box-office-analysis', 'Charles5277/swc-movie-box-office-analysis', 'ui-ux-pro-max', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.425Z', '2026-02-18T04:47:26.751Z', NULL, '{"id":"Charles5277/swc-movie-box-office-analysis/ui-ux-pro-max","name":"ui-ux-pro-max","description":{"zh":"UI/UX Pro Max是一份全面设计指南，包含50+样式、97色板、57字体组合等，帮助开发者提高UI/UX设计水平","ja":"UI/UX Pro Maxは、開発者のUI/UX設計力を高めるための総合設計ガイドです。50以上のスタイル、97のカラーパレット、57のフォントのペアなどを含みます","ko":"UI/UX Pro Max는 개발者の UI/UX 디자인 능력을 향상시키기 위한 全面的 디자인 가이드입니다. 50가지 이상의 스타일, 97개의 색상 팔레트, 57개의 폰트 조합 등을 포함합니다","es":"UI/UX Pro Max es una guía de diseño integral para aplicaciones web y móviles, con recursos para crear interfaces de usuario atractivas y funcionales","fr":"UI/UX Pro Max est un guide de conception complet pour les applications web et mobiles, avec des ressources pour créer des interfaces utilisateur attractives et fonctionnelles","de":"UI/UX Pro Max ist ein umfassender Design-Leitfaden für Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen, mit Ressourcen zur Erstellung ansprechender und funktionaler Benutzeroberflächen","pt":"O UI/UX Pro Max é um guia de design abrangente para aplicações web e móveis, contendo mais de 50 estilos e 97 paletas de cores.","ru":"UI/UX Pro Max - это комплексное руководство по дизайну для веб- и мобильных приложений, содержащее более 50 стилей и 97 цветовых палитр.","ar":"UI/UX برو ماكس هو دليل تصميم شامل للتطبيقات الويب والجوال، يحتوي على أكثر من 50 نمطًا و 97 لوحة ألوان.","en":"陽光女子合唱團 (Sunshine Women''s Choir) 台灣票房分析"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"UI/UX Pro Max 设计指南","ja":"UI/UX Pro Max デザインガイド","ko":"UI/UX Pro Max 디자인 가이드","es":"UI/UX Pro Max: Guía de diseño para aplicaciones web y móv...","fr":"UI/UX Pro Max : Guide de conception pour applications web...","de":"UI/UX Pro Max: Design-Leitfaden für Web- und Mobile-Anwen...","pt":"UI/UX Pro Max: Guia de Design Inteligente","ru":"UI/UX Pro Max: Комплексное Руководство по Дизайну","ar":"UI/UX برو ماكس: دليل تصميم الذكاء الشامل","en":"ui-ux-pro-max"},"description":{"zh":"UI/UX Pro Max是一份全面设计指南，包含50+样式、97色板、57字体组合等，帮助开发者提高UI/UX设计水平","ja":"UI/UX Pro Maxは、開発者のUI/UX設計力を高めるための総合設計ガイドです。50以上のスタイル、97のカラーパレット、57のフォントのペアなどを含みます","ko":"UI/UX Pro Max는 개발者の UI/UX 디자인 능력을 향상시키기 위한 全面的 디자인 가이드입니다. 50가지 이상의 스타일, 97개의 색상 팔레트, 57개의 폰트 조합 등을 포함합니다","es":"UI/UX Pro Max es una guía de diseño integral para aplicaciones web y móviles, con recursos para crear interfaces de usuario atractivas y funcionales","fr":"UI/UX Pro Max est un guide de conception complet pour les applications web et mobiles, avec des ressources pour créer des interfaces utilisateur attractives ...","de":"UI/UX Pro Max ist ein umfassender Design-Leitfaden für Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen, mit Ressourcen zur Erstellung ansprechender und funktionaler Benutzerober...","pt":"O UI/UX Pro Max é um guia de design abrangente para aplicações web e móveis, contendo mais de 50 estilos e 97 paletas de cores.","ru":"UI/UX Pro Max - это комплексное руководство по дизайну для веб- и мобильных приложений, содержащее более 50 стилей и 97 цветовых палитр.","ar":"UI/UX برو ماكس هو دليل تصميم شامل للتطبيقات الويب والجوال، يحتوي على أكثر من 50 نمطًا و 97 لوحة ألوان.","en":"陽光女子合唱團 (Sunshine Women''s Choir) 台灣票房分析"},"definition":{"en":"陽光女子合唱團 (Sunshine Women''s Choir) 台灣票房分析"},"features":{"zh":["50+样式","97色板","57字体组合","99 UX指南","25种图表类型"],"ja":["50以上のスタイル","97のカラーパレット","57のフォントのペア","99のUXガイドライン","25種類のチャートタイプ"],"ko":["50가지 이상의 스타일","97개의 색상 팔레트","57개의 폰트 조합","99개의 UX 가이드라인","25종류의 차트 타입"],"es":["50+ estilos de diseño","97 paletas de colores","57 parejas de fuentes","99 directrices de UX","25 tipos de gráficos","Base de datos searchable con recomendaciones basadas en prioridad"],"fr":["50+ styles de conception","97 palettes de couleurs","57 paires de polices","99 directives d''UX","25 types de graphiques","Base de données searchable avec des recommandations basées sur la priorité"],"de":["50+ Design-Stile","97 Farbpaletten","57 Schriftkombinationen","99 UX-Richtlinien","25 Chart-Typen","Suchbare Datenbank mit prioritätsbasierten Empfehlungen"],"pt":["Mais de 50 estilos de design","97 paletas de cores personalizáveis","57 combinações de fontes","99 diretrizes de UX","25 tipos de gráficos"],"ru":["Более 50 стилей дизайна","97 настраиваемых цветовых палитр","57 комбинаций шрифтов","99 руководств по UX","25 типов графиков"],"ar":["أكثر من 50 نمطًا من التصميم","97 لوحة ألوان قابلة للتعديل","57 مزيجًا من الخطوط","99 إرشادًا لتحسين تجربة المستخدم","25 نوعًا من الرسومات البيانية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["UI设计","UX设计","设计指南","开发者工具","网页设计","移动应用设计"],"ja":["UI設計","UX設計","設計ガイド","開発者ツール","ウェブ設計","モバイルアプリ設計"],"ko":["UI 디자인","UX 디자인","디자인 가이드","개발자 도구","웹 디자인","모바일 앱 디자인"],"es":["diseño UI/UX","aplicaciones web","aplicaciones móviles","interfaces de usuario","experiencias de usuario","directrices de diseño","estilos de diseño","paletas de colores","parejas de fuentes"],"fr":["conception UI/UX","applications web","applications mobiles","interfaces utilisateur","expériences utilisateur","directives de conception","styles de conception","palettes de couleurs","paires de polices"],"de":["UI/UX-Design","Web-Anwendungen","Mobile-Anwendungen","Benutzeroberflächen","Benutzererfahrungen","Design-Richtlinien","Design-Stile","Farbpaletten","Schriftkombinationen"],"pt":["ui/ux design","guias de design","desenvolvimento de aplicações","experiência do usuário","estilos de design","paletas de cores"],"ru":["дизайн ui/ux","руководства по дизайну","разработка приложений","опыт пользователя","стили дизайна","цветовые палитры"],"ar":["تصميم ui/ux","دلائل التصميم","تطوير التطبيقات","تجربة المستخدم","أنماط التصميم","لوحات الألوان"]}},"owner":"Charles5277","repo":"swc-movie-box-office-analysis","repoPath":"Charles5277/swc-movie-box-office-analysis","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.425Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ui-ux-pro-max","description":"UI/UX design intelligence. 50 styles, 21 palettes, 50 font pairings, 20 charts, 9 stacks (React, Next.js, Vue, Svelte, SwiftUI, React Native, Flutter, Tailwind, shadcn/ui). Actions: plan, build, create, design, implement, review, fix, improve, optimize, enhance, refactor, check UI/UX code. Projects: website, landing page, dashboard, admin panel, e-commerce, SaaS, portfolio, blog, mobile app, .html, .tsx, .vue, .svelte. Elements: button, modal, navbar, sidebar, card, table, form, chart. Styles: glassmorphism, claymorphism, minimalism, brutalism, neumorphism, bento grid, dark mode, responsive, skeuomorphism, flat design. Topics: color palette, accessibility, animation, layout, typography, font pairing, spacing, hover, shadow, gradient. Integrations: shadcn/ui MCP for component search and examples.","bodyPreview":"# UI/UX Pro Max - Design Intelligence\n\nComprehensive design guide for web and mobile applications. Contains 50+ styles, 97 color palettes, 57 font pairings, 99 UX guidelines, and 25 chart types across 9 technology stacks. Searchable database with priority-based recommendations.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n\n- Designing new UI components or pages\n- Choosing color palettes and typography\n- Reviewing code for UX issues\n- Building landing pages or dashboards\n- Implementing acc","body":"# UI/UX Pro Max - Design Intelligence\n\nComprehensive design guide for web and mobile applications. Contains 50+ styles, 97 color palettes, 57 font pairings, 99 UX guidelines, and 25 chart types across 9 technology stacks. Searchable database with priority-based recommendations.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n\n- Designing new UI components or pages\n- Choosing color palettes and typography\n- Reviewing code for UX issues\n- Building landing pages or dashboards\n- Implementing accessibility requirements\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category            | Impact   | Domain                |\n| -------- | ------------------- | -------- | --------------------- |\n| 1        | Accessibility       | CRITICAL | `ux`                  |\n| 2        | Touch & Interaction | CRITICAL | `ux`                  |\n| 3        | Performance         | HIGH     | `ux`                  |\n| 4        | Layout & Responsive | HIGH     | `ux`                  |\n| 5        | Typography & Color  | MEDIUM   | `typography`, `color` |\n| 6        | Animation           | MEDIUM   | `ux`                  |\n| 7        | Style Selection     | MEDIUM   | `style`, `product`    |\n| 8        | Charts & Data       | LOW      | `chart`               |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Accessibility (CRITICAL)\n\n- `color-contrast` - Minimum 4.5:1 ratio for normal text\n- `focus-states` - Visible focus rings on interactive elements\n- `alt-text` - Descriptive alt text for meaningful images\n- `aria-labels` - aria-label for icon-only buttons\n- `keyboard-nav` - Tab order matches visual order\n- `form-labels` - Use label with for attribute\n\n### 2. Touch & Interaction (CRITICAL)\n\n- `touch-target-size` - Minimum 44x44px touch targets\n- `hover-vs-tap` - Use click/tap for primary interactions\n- `loading-buttons` - Disable button during async operations\n- `error-feedback` - Clear error messages near problem\n- `cursor-pointer` - Add cursor-pointer to clickable elements\n\n### 3. Performance (HIGH)\n\n- `image-optimization` - Use WebP, srcset, lazy loading\n- `reduced-motion` - Check prefers-reduced-motion\n- `content-jumping` - Reserve space for async content\n\n### 4. Layout & Responsive (HIGH)\n\n- `viewport-meta` - width=device-width initial-scale=1\n- `readable-font-size` - Minimum 16px body text on mobile\n- `horizontal-scroll` - Ensure content fits viewport width\n- `z-index-management` - Define z-index scale (10, 20, 30, 50)\n\n### 5. Typography & Color (MEDIUM)\n\n- `line-height` - Use 1.5-1.75 for body text\n- `line-length` - Limit to 65-75 characters per line\n- `font-pairing` - Match heading/body font personalities\n\n### 6. Animation (MEDIUM)\n\n- `duration-timing` - Use 150-300ms for micro-interactions\n- `transform-performance` - Use transform/opacity, not width/height\n- `loading-states` - Skeleton screens or spinners\n\n### 7. Style Selection (MEDIUM)\n\n- `style-match` - Match style to product type\n- `consistency` - Use same style across all pages\n- `no-emoji-icons` - Use SVG icons, not emojis\n\n### 8. Charts & Data (LOW)\n\n- `chart-type` - Match chart type to data type\n- `color-guidance` - Use accessible color palettes\n- `data-table` - Provide table alternative for accessibility\n\n## How to Use\n\nSearch specific domains using the CLI tool below.\n\n---\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nCheck if Python is installed:\n\n```bash\npython3 --version || python --version\n```\n\nIf Python is not installed, install it based on user''s OS:\n\n**macOS:**\n\n```bash\nbrew install python3\n```\n\n**Ubuntu/Debian:**\n\n```bash\nsudo apt update && sudo apt install python3\n```\n\n**Windows:**\n\n```powershell\nwinget install Python.Python.3.12\n```\n\n---\n\n## How to Use This Skill\n\nWhen user requests UI/UX work (design, build, create, implement, review, fix, improve), follow this workflow:\n\n### Step 1: Analyze User Requirements\n\nExtract key information from user request:\n\n- **Product type**: SaaS, e-commerce, portfolio, dashboard, landing page, etc.\n- **Style keywords**: minimal, playful, professional, elegant, dark mode, etc.\n- **Industry**: healthcare, fintech, gaming, education, etc.\n- **Stack**: React, Vue, Next.js, or default to `html-tailwind`\n\n### Step 2: Generate Design System (REQUIRED)\n\n**Always start with `--design-system`** to get comprehensive recommendations with reasoning:\n\n```bash\npython3 skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<product_type> <industry> <keywords>\" --design-system [-p \"Project Name\"]\n```\n\nThis command:\n\n1. Searches 5 domains in parallel (product, style, color, landing, typography)\n2. Applies reasoning rules from `ui-reasoning.csv` to select best matches\n3. Returns complete design system: pattern, style, colors, typography, effects\n4. Includes anti-patterns to avoid\n\n**Example:**\n\n```bash\npython3 skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"beauty spa wellness service\" --design-system -p \"Serenity Spa\"\n```\n\n### Step 2b: Persist Design System (Master + Overrides Pattern)\n\nTo save the design system for **hierarchical retrieval across sessions**, add `--persist`:\n\n```bash\npython3 skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<query>\" --design-system --persist -p \"Project Name\"\n```\n\nThis creates:\n\n- `design-system/MASTER.md` — Global Source of Truth with all design rules\n- `design-system/pages/` — Folder for page-specific overrides\n\n**With page-specific override:**\n\n```bash\npython3 skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<query>\" --design-system --persist -p \"Project Name\" --page \"dashboard\"\n```\n\nThis also creates:\n\n- `design-system/pages/dashboard.md` — Page-specific deviations from Master\n\n**How hierarchical retrieval works:**\n\n1. When building a specific page (e.g., \"Checkout\"), first check `design-system/pages/checkout.md`\n2. If the page file exists, its rules **override** the Master file\n3. If not, use `design-system/MASTER.md` exclusively\n\n**Context-aware retrieval prompt:**\n\n```\nI am building the [Page Name] page. Please read design-system/MASTER.md.\nAlso check if design-system/pages/[page-name].md exists.\nIf the page file exists, prioritize its rules.\nIf not, use the Master rules exclusively.\nNow, generate the code...\n```\n\n### Step 3: Supplement with Detailed Searches (as needed)\n\nAfter getting the design system, use domain searches to get additional details:\n\n```bash\npython3 skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<keyword>\" --domain <domain> [-n <max_results>]\n```\n\n**When to use detailed searches:**\n\n| Need                  | Domain       | Example                                 |\n| --------------------- | ------------ | --------------------------------------- |\n| More style options    | `style`      | `--domain style \"glassmorphism dark\"`   |\n| Chart recommendations | `chart`      | `--domain chart \"real-time dashboard\"`  |\n| UX best practices     | `ux`         | `--domain ux \"animation accessibility\"` |\n| Alternative fonts     | `typography` | `--domain typography \"elegant luxury\"`  |\n| Landing structure     | `landing`    | `--domain landing \"hero social-proof\"`  |\n\n### Step 4: Stack Guidelines (Default: html-tailwind)\n\nGet implementation-specific best practices. If user doesn''t specify a stack, **default to `html-tailwind`**.\n\n```bash\npython3 skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<keyword>\" --stack html-tailwind\n```\n\nAvailable stacks: `html-tailwind`, `react`, `nextjs`, `vue`, `svelte`, `swiftui`, `react-native`, `flutter`, `shadcn`, `jetpack-compose`\n\n---\n\n## Search Reference\n\n### Available Domains\n\n| Domain       | Use For                              | Example Keywords                                         |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `product`    | Product type recommendations         | SaaS, e-commerce, portfolio, healthcare, beauty, service |\n| `style`      | UI styles, colors, effects           | glassmorphism, minimalism, dark mode, brutalism          |\n| `typography` | Font pairings, Google Fonts          | elegant, playful, professional, modern                   |\n| `color`      | Color palettes by product type       | saas, ecommerce, healthcare, beauty, fintech, service    |\n| `landing`    | Page structure, CTA strategies       | hero, hero-centric, testimonial, pricing, social-proof   |\n| `chart`      | Chart types, library recommendations | trend, comparison, timeline, funnel, pie                 |\n| `ux`         | Best practices, anti-patterns        | animation, accessibility, z-index, loading               |\n| `react`      | React/Next.js performance            | waterfall, bundle, suspense, memo, rerender, cache       |\n| `web`        | Web interface guidelines             | aria, focus, keyboard, semantic, virtualize              |\n| `prompt`     | AI prompts, CSS keywords             | (style name)                                             |\n\n### Available Stacks\n\n| Stack             | Focus                                                 |\n| ----------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| `html-tailwind`   | Tailwind utilities, responsive, a11y (DEFAULT)        |\n| `react`           | State, hooks, performance, patterns                   |\n| `nextjs`          | SSR, routing, images, API routes                      |\n| `vue`             | Composition API, Pinia, Vue Router                    |\n| `svelte`          | Runes, stores, SvelteKit                              |\n| `swiftui`         | Views, State, Navigation, Animation                   |\n| `react-native`    | Components, Navigation, Lists                         |\n| `flutter`         | Widgets, State, Layout, Theming                       |\n| `shadcn`          | shadcn/ui components, theming, forms, patterns        |\n| `jetpack-compose` | Composables, Modifiers, State Hoisting, Recomposition |\n\n---\n\n## Example Workflow\n\n**User request:** \"Làm landing page cho dịch vụ chăm sóc da chuyên nghiệp\"\n\n### Step 1: Analyze Requirements\n\n- Product type: Beauty/Spa service\n- Style keywords: elegant, professional, soft\n- Industry: Beauty/Wellness\n- Stack: html-tailwind (default)\n\n### Step 2: Generate Design System (REQUIRED)\n\n```bash\npython3 skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"beauty spa wellness service elegant\" --design-system -p \"Serenity Spa\"\n```\n\n**Output:** Complete design system with pattern, style, colors, typography, effects, and anti-patterns.\n\n### Step 3: Supplement with Detailed Searches (as needed)\n\n```bash\n# Get UX guidelines for animation and accessibility\npython3 skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"animation accessibility\" --domain ux\n\n# Get alternative typography options if needed\npython3 skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"elegant luxury serif\" --domain typography\n```\n\n### Step 4: Stack Guidelines\n\n```bash\npython3 skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"layout responsive form\" --stack html-tailwind\n```\n\n**Then:** Synthesize design system + detailed searches and implement the design.\n\n---\n\n## Output Formats\n\nThe `--design-system` flag supports two output formats:\n\n```bash\n# ASCII box (default) - best for terminal display\npython3 skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"fintech crypto\" --design-system\n\n# Markdown - best for documentation\npython3 skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"fintech crypto\" --design-system -f markdown\n```\n\n---\n\n## Tips for Better Results\n\n1. **Be specific with keywords** - \"healthcare SaaS dashboard\" > \"app\"\n2. **Search multiple times** - Different keywords reveal different insights\n3. **Combine domains** - Style + Typography + Color = Complete design system\n4. **Always check UX** - Search \"animation\", \"z-index\", \"accessibility\" for common issues\n5. **Use stack flag** - Get implementation-specific best practices\n6. **Iterate** - If first search doesn''t match, try different keywords\n\n---\n\n## Common Rules for Professional UI\n\nThese are frequently overlooked issues that make UI look unprofessional:\n\n### Icons & Visual Elements\n\n| Rule                       | Do                                              | Don''t                                  |\n| -------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| **No emoji icons**         | Use SVG icons (Heroicons, Lucide, Simple Icons) | Use emojis like 🎨 🚀 ⚙️ as UI icons   |\n| **Stable hover states**    | Use color/opacity transitions on hover          | Use scale transforms that shift layout |\n| **Correct brand logos**    | Research official SVG from Simple Icons         | Guess or use incorrect logo paths      |\n| **Consistent icon sizing** | Use fixed viewBox (24x24) with w-6 h-6          | Mix different icon sizes randomly      |\n\n### Interaction & Cursor\n\n| Rule                   | Do                                                    | Don''t                                        |\n| ---------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| **Cursor pointer**     | Add `cursor-pointer` to all clickable/hoverable cards | Leave default cursor on interactive elements |\n| **Hover feedback**     | Provide visual feedback (color, shadow, border)       | No indication element is interactive         |\n| **Smooth transitions** | Use `transition-colors duration-200`                  | Instant state changes or too slow (>500ms)   |\n\n### Light/Dark Mode Contrast\n\n| Rule                      | Do                                  | Don''t                                   |\n| ------------------------- | ----------------------------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| **Glass card light mode** | Use `bg-white/80` or higher opacity | Use `bg-white/10` (too transparent)     |\n| **Text contrast light**   | Use `#0F172A` (slate-900) for text  | Use `#94A3B8` (slate-400) for body text |\n| **Muted text light**      | Use `#475569` (slate-600) minimum   | Use gray-400 or lighter                 |\n| **Border visibility**     | Use `border-gray-200` in light mode | Use `border-white/10` (invisible)       |\n\n### Layout & Spacing\n\n| Rule                     | Do                                  | Don''t                                  |\n| ------------------------ | ----------------------------------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| **Floating navbar**      | Add `top-4 left-4 right-4` spacing  | Stick navbar to `top-0 left-0 right-0` |\n| **Content padding**      | Account for fixed navbar height     | Let content hide behind fixed elements |\n| **Consistent max-width** | Use same `max-w-6xl` or `max-w-7xl` | Mix different container widths         |\n\n---\n\n## Pre-Delivery Checklist\n\nBefore delivering UI code, verify these items:\n\n### Visual Quality\n\n- [ ] No emojis used as icons (use SVG instead)\n- [ ] All icons from consistent icon set (Heroicons/Lucide)\n- [ ] Brand logos are correct (verified from Simple Icons)\n- [ ] Hover states don''t cause layout shift\n- [ ] Use theme colors directly (bg-primary) not var() wrapper\n\n### Interaction\n\n- [ ] All clickable elements have `cursor-pointer`\n- [ ] Hover states provide clear visual feedback\n- [ ] Transitions are smooth (150-300ms)\n- [ ] Focus states visible for keyboard navigation\n\n### Light/Dark Mode\n\n- [ ] Light mode text has sufficient contrast (4.5:1 minimum)\n- [ ] Glass/transparent elements visible in light mode\n- [ ] Borders visible in both modes\n- [ ] Test both modes before delivery\n\n### Layout\n\n- [ ] Floating elements have proper spacing from edges\n- [ ] No content hidden behind fixed navbars\n- [ ] Responsive at 375px, 768px, 1024px, 1440px\n- [ ] No horizontal scroll on mobile\n\n### Accessibility\n\n- [ ] All images have alt text\n- [ ] Form inputs have labels\n- [ ] Color is not the only indicator\n- [ ] `prefers-reduced-motion` respected\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:47:26.751Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Design-focused Agents needing comprehensive UI/UX guidelines and recommendations for web and mobile applications.","zh":"非常适合需要全面的UI/UX指南和网页及移动应用程序推荐的设计导向型Agent。","ja":"デザイン重視のエージェントに最適で、Webおよびモバイルアプリケーションのための包括的なUI/UXガイドラインと推奨事項が必要です。","ko":"디자인 중심의 에이전트에게 적합하며, 웹 및 모바일 애플리케이션을 위한 포괄적인 UI/UX 가이드라인 및 권장 사항이 필요합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes centrados en Diseño que necesitan directrices y recomendaciones de UI/UX integrales para aplicaciones web y móviles.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents axés sur la conception nécessitant des lignes directrices et des recommandations de UI/UX complètes pour les applications Web et mobiles.","de":"Perfekt für designorientierte Agenten, die umfassende UI/UX-Richtlinien und Empfehlungen für Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes focados em Design que necessitam de diretrizes e recomendações abrangentes de UI/UX para aplicações web e móveis.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, ориентированных на дизайн, которым требуются комплексные рекомендации и руководства по UI/UX для веб- и мобильных приложений.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المهتمين بالتصميم الذين يحتاجون إلى إرشادات شاملة وقواعد UI/UX لتطبيقات الويب والأجهزة النقالة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create visually appealing and user-friendly interfaces using 50+ styles, 97 color palettes, and 57 font pairings, while ensuring UX consistency with 99 guidelines and 25 chart types across 9 technology stacks, utilizing searchable databases with priority-based recommendations.","zh":"赋予代理创建视觉上吸引人且用户友好的接口的能力，使用50+样式、97个颜色调色板和57个字体配对，同时确保在9个技术栈中使用99个指南和25种图表类型时的UX一致性，利用可搜索的数据库和基于优先级的推荐。","ja":"エージェントが50以上のスタイル、97のカラーパレット、57のフォントペアを使用して視覚的に魅力的なユーザーインターフェイスを作成できるようにし、9つのテクノロジースタック全てで99のガイドラインと25種類のチャートタイプを使用してUXの一貫性を確保する。優先順位に基づく推奨事項を含む検索可能なデータベースを利用する。","ko":"에이전트가 50가지 이상의 스타일, 97개의 색상 팔레트, 57개의 글꼴 페어를 사용하여 시각적으로 매력적이고 사용자 친화적인 인터페이스를 생성할 수 있도록 하며, 9개의 기술 스택에서 99개의 가이드라인과 25종류의 차트 유형을 사용하여 UX 일관성을 보장하는 동시에 검색 가능한 데이터베이스와 우선순위 기반의 추천을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear interfaces visualmente atractivas y fáciles de usar utilizando más de 50 estilos, 97 paletas de colores y 57 emparejamientos de fuentes, garantizando la consistencia de la UX con 99 directrices y 25 tipos de gráficos en 9 pilas tecnológicas, utilizando bases de datos buscables con recomendaciones basadas en prioridad.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des interfaces visuellement attrayantes et conviviales en utilisant plus de 50 styles, 97 palettes de couleurs et 57 appariements de polices, tout en assurant la cohérence de l''UX avec 99 lignes directrices et 25 types de graphiques sur 9 piles technologiques, en utilisant des bases de données recherchables avec des recommandations basées sur la priorité.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, visuell ansprechende und benutzerfreundliche Schnittstellen zu erstellen, indem sie mehr als 50 Stile, 97 Farbpaletten und 57 Schriftkombinationen verwenden, während sie die UX-Konsistenz mit 99 Richtlinien und 25 Charttypen über 9 Technologiestacks sicherstellen, indem sie durchsuchbare Datenbanken mit prioritätsbasierten Empfehlungen nutzen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem interfaces visualmente atraentes e de fácil uso, utilizando mais de 50 estilos, 97 paletas de cores e 57 combinações de fontes, garantindo a consistência da UX com 99 diretrizes e 25 tipos de gráficos em 9 pilhas de tecnologia, utilizando bancos de dados pesquisáveis com recomendações baseadas em prioridade.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать визуально привлекательные и удобные интерфейсы, используя более 50 стилей, 97 цветовых палитр и 57 партий шрифтов, обеспечивая последовательность UX с 99 руководствами и 25 типами графиков на 9 технологических стеках, используя поисковые базы данных с рекомендациями на основе приоритета.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء واجهات مرئية جذابة وسهلة الاستخدام، باستخدام أكثر من 50 نمطًا و97 لوحة ألوان و57 زوجًا من خطوط الطباعة، مع ضمان الاتساق في UX مع 99 توجيهًا و25 نوعًا من الرسوم البيانية عبر 9 مجموعات تقنية، باستخدام قواعد بيانات قابلة للبحث مع توصيات تقوم على أساس الأولوية."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing new UI components or pages with consistent branding","Selecting optimal color palettes and typography for enhanced readability","Reviewing code for UX issues and implementing improvements","Building landing pages or dashboards with engaging chart types"],"zh":["使用一致的品牌设计新的UI组件或页面","选择最佳的颜色调色板和字体以提高可读性","审查代码以查找UX问题并实施改进","使用引人入胜的图表类型构建登陆页面或仪表板"],"ja":["一貫したブランドを使用して新しいUIコンポーネントまたはページを設計する","可読性を高めるための最適なカラーパレットとフォントを選択する","UXの問題を探すためにコードをレビューし、改善を実装する","魅力的なチャートタイプを使用してランディングページまたはダッシュボードを構築する"],"ko":["일관된 브랜드를 사용하여 새로운 UI 구성 요소 또는 페이지를 디자인함","가독성을 향상시키기 위한 최적의 색상 팔레트 및 글꼴을 선택함","UX 문제를 찾기 위해 코드를 검토하고 개선 사항을 구현함","매력적인 차트 유형을 사용하여 랜딩 페이지 또는 대시보드를 구축함"],"es":["Diseñar nuevos componentes de UI o páginas con una marca consistente","Seleccionar paletas de colores y tipografía óptimas para una mayor legibilidad","Revisar el código para problemas de UX y implementar mejoras","Crear páginas de destino o paneles de control con tipos de gráficos atractivos"],"fr":["Concevoir de nouveaux composants d''interface utilisateur ou des pages avec une marque cohérente","Sélectionner des palettes de couleurs et une typographie optimales pour une lisibilité améliorée","Réviser le code pour les problèmes d''UX et mettre en œuvre des améliorations","Créer des pages de destination ou des tableaux de bord avec des types de graphiques engageants"],"de":["Neue UI-Komponenten oder Seiten mit konsistenter Marke entwerfen","Optimale Farbpaletten und Typografie für verbesserte Lesbarkeit auswählen","Code auf UX-Probleme überprüfen und Verbesserungen implementieren","Landingpages oder Dashboards mit ansprechenden Charttypen erstellen"],"pt":["Projetar novos componentes de UI ou páginas com marcação consistente","Selecionar paletas de cores e tipografia ótimas para legibilidade aprimorada","Revisar código para problemas de UX e implementar melhorias","Construir páginas de destino ou painéis com tipos de gráficos atraentes"],"ru":["Проектировать новые компоненты UI или страницы с последовательной брендингом","Выбирать оптимальные цветовые палитры и типографику для улучшения читаемости","Проверять код на проблемы UX и реализовывать улучшения","Создавать целевые страницы или панели с привлекательными типами графиков"],"ar":["تصميم مكونات واجهة المستخدم الجديدة أو الصفحات مع التوجيهات الثابتة","اختيار لوحات الألوان والطباعة المثالية لتحسين القراءة","استعراض الشفرة للقضايا المتعلقة بتجربة المستخدم وتنفيذ التحسينات","بناء صفحات الهبوط أو لوحات التحكم بأنواع الرسوم البيانية الجذابة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to the comprehensive design guide database","Limited to web and mobile application design","May require additional design tools for implementation"],"zh":["需要访问综合设计指南数据库","仅限于网页和移动应用程序设计","可能需要额外的设计工具来实现"],"ja":["包括的なデザインガイドのデータベースへのアクセスが必要","Webおよびモバイルアプリケーションの設計のみに限定される","実装するために追加のデザインツールが必要になる可能性がある"],"ko":["포괄적인 디자인 가이드 데이터베이스에 대한 액세스가 필요함","웹 및 모바일 애플리케이션 디자인에만 제한됨","구현을 위해 추가 디자인 툴이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la base de datos de la guía de diseño integral","Limitado al diseño de aplicaciones web y móviles","Puede requerir herramientas de diseño adicionales para la implementación"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la base de données du guide de conception complet","Limité à la conception d''applications Web et mobiles","Peut nécessiter des outils de conception supplémentaires pour la mise en œuvre"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die Datenbank der umfassenden Designdokumentation","Begrenzt auf das Design von Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen","Kann zusätzliche Designtools für die Implementierung erfordern"],"pt":["Exige acesso ao banco de dados abrangente de design","Limitado ao design de aplicações web e móvel","Pode exigir ferramentas de design adicionais para implementação"],"ru":["Требует доступа к комплексной базе данных дизайна","Ограничен дизайном веб- и мобильных приложений","Может требовать дополнительных инструментов дизайна для реализации"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى قاعدة بيانات شاملة للتصميم","محدود بتصميم تطبيقات الويب والأجهزة النقالة","يمكن أن يتطلب أدوات تصميم إضافية للتنفيذ"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
