d''interface utilisateur"],"de":["Projekt-Design","Viewport-Abfragen","Container-Abfragen","Anpassung von Komponenten","anpassbares Layout","Best Practices für das Design","Webentwicklung","Benutzeroberflächen-Design"],"pt":["projeto de design de componentes","consultas de contêiner","consultas de viewport","layout escalável","componentes reutilizáveis","desenvolvimento web","design de interface","responsividade"],"ru":["проектирование компонентов","запросы контейнера","запросы viewport","масштабируемый макет","многократно используемые компоненты","веб-разработка","дизайн интерфейса","адаптивность"],"ar":["تصميم المشروع","استفسارات الحاوية","استفسارات العرض","تخطيط قابل للتوسيع","مكونات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام","تطوير الويب","تصميم الواجهة","الاستجابة"]}},"owner":"evorto-app","repo":"app","repoPath":"evorto-app/app","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.425Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"project-design","description":"Project-specific UI and styling guidance for Evorto, including when to use viewport queries versus Tailwind v4 container queries.","bodyPreview":"# Project Design\n\n## Container Queries\n\nUse viewport queries for page-level layout changes and container queries for component-level adaptation.\n\n### Rules\n\n1. Use viewport breakpoints (`sm:`, `md:`, `lg:`) for global structure (page grids, shell layout, top-level navigation behavior).\n2. Use container queries (`@container` and `@sm:`, `@md:`, `@lg:`) for reusable components that should adapt to their parent width.\n3. Mark only intentional component boundaries with `@container`; avoid deep or un","body":"# Project Design\n\n## Container Queries\n\nUse viewport queries for page-level layout changes and container queries for component-level adaptation.\n\n### Rules\n\n1. Use viewport breakpoints (`sm:`, `md:`, `lg:`) for global structure (page grids, shell layout, top-level navigation behavior).\n2. Use container queries (`@container` and `@sm:`, `@md:`, `@lg:`) for reusable components that should adapt to their parent width.\n3. Mark only intentional component boundaries with `@container`; avoid deep or unnecessary nested containers.\n4. Keep a predictable model: layout responds to viewport, components respond to container.\n5. Build for modern browsers and keep components readable if container query variants do not apply.\n\n### Tailwind v4 Pattern\n\n```html\n<section class=\"@container\">\n  <div class=\"grid gap-4 @lg:grid-cols-2\">\n    <article class=\"rounded-2xl p-4\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-base @md:text-lg\">Card title</h3>\n      <p class=\"@sm:line-clamp-3\">Component content adapts to container width.</p>\n    </article>\n  </div>\n</section>\n```\n\n### Project Notes\n\n- Prefer simple, explicit breakpoints over many tiny threshold tweaks.\n- Document non-obvious container-query behavior in the feature README when it affects UX.\n\n## Material Theming (Tailwind-First)\n\nIn this project, Material theming is consumed primarily through Tailwind tokens defined in `/Users/hedde/code/evorto/src/tailwind.css`, not through Angular Material utility classes.\n\n### Rules\n\n1. Treat `src/tailwind.css` as the theming bridge from Material system tokens (`--mat-sys-*`) to Tailwind tokens (`--color-*`, `--radius-*`, font tokens).\n2. In templates, prefer Tailwind semantic classes such as `bg-surface`, `text-on-surface`, `bg-primary-container`, and `rounded-2xl`.\n3. In component CSS, use `var(--mat-sys-*)` directly only when a style cannot be expressed cleanly with existing Tailwind utilities.\n4. If a needed token is missing, extend the mapping in `src/tailwind.css` instead of introducing hardcoded hex values.\n5. Keep dark/light behavior token-driven via Material system variables; avoid component-level theme branching unless required.\n\n### Practical Workflow\n\n1. Pick the Material role/token (for example surface, on-surface, primary-container).\n2. Use the mapped Tailwind utility first (`bg-*`, `text-*`, `rounded-*`).\n3. Add or adjust token mappings in `src/tailwind.css` when coverage is missing.\n\nReference: [Angular Material - Theming your components](https://material.angular.dev/guide/theming-your-components) (focus on CSS variables/system tokens).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:47:34.703Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents requiring adaptive layout capabilities with container queries and viewport breakpoints","zh":"适合需要自适应布局功能的前端代理，包括容器查询和视口断点","ja":"アダプティブレイアウト機能を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適で、コンテナクエリとビューポートブレークポイントを使用","ko":"적응형 레이아웃 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합하며, 컨테이너 쿼리와 뷰포트 브레이크포인트를 사용","es":"Ideal para agentes frontend que requieren capacidades de diseño adaptable con consultas de contenedor y puntos de interrupción de viewport","fr":"Idéal pour les agents frontend nécessitant des capacités de mise en page adaptative avec des requêtes de conteneur et des points d''arrêt de viewport","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agents, die adaptive Layout-Fähigkeiten mit Container-Abfragen und Viewport-Breakpoints erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend que requerem capacidades de layout adaptativo com consultas de contêiner e quebras de viewport","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, требующих адаптивных возможностей макета с запросами контейнера и точками разрыва viewport","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الأمامية الذي يتطلب قدرات تخطيط متكيفة مع استفسارات حاوية وكسور نقطة العرض"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create responsive designs using viewport queries for page-level layout changes and container queries for component-level adaptation, leveraging @container and @sm:, @md:, @lg: for reusable components","zh":"赋予代理创建响应式设计的能力，使用视口查询进行页面级别的布局更改，使用容器查询进行组件级别的自适应，利用@container和@sm:、@md:、@lg:实现可重用组件","ja":"エージェントが、ビューポートクエリを使用したページレベルのレイアウト変更とコンテナクエリを使用したコンポーネントレベルの適応により、レスポンシブデザインを作成できるようにする。@containerと@sm:、@md:、@lg:を使用して再利用可能なコンポーネントを作成","ko":"에이전트가 뷰포트 쿼리를 사용하여 페이지 수준의 레이아웃 변경과 컨테이너 쿼리를 사용하여 컴포넌트 수준의 적응을 통해 반응형 디자인을 생성할 수 있도록 하는데, @container와 @sm:, @md:, @lg:를 사용하여 재사용 가능한 컴포넌트를 만듦","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear diseños responsivos utilizando consultas de viewport para cambios de diseño a nivel de página y consultas de contenedor para adaptación a nivel de componente, aprovechando @container y @sm:, @md:, @lg: para componentes reutilizables","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des conceptions responsives en utilisant des requêtes de viewport pour les modifications de mise en page au niveau de la page et des requêtes de conteneur pour l''adaptation au niveau du composant, en exploitant @container et @sm:, @md:, @lg: pour des composants réutilisables","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, responsive Designs zu erstellen, indem sie Viewport-Abfragen für Layout-Änderungen auf Seiten-Ebene und Container-Abfragen für Anpassungen auf Komponenten-Ebene verwenden, wobei @container und @sm:, @md:, @lg: für wiederverwendbare Komponenten genutzt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criarem designs responsivos usando consultas de viewport para alterações de layout de nível de página e consultas de contêiner para adaptação de nível de componente, aproveitando @container e @sm:, @md:, @lg: para componentes reutilizáveis","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать адаптивные дизайны, используя запросы viewport для изменений макета на уровне страницы и запросы контейнера для адаптации на уровне компонента, используя @container и @sm:, @md:, @lg: для многократно используемых компонентов","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من إنشاء تصاميم مستجيبة باستخدام استفسارات نقطة العرض لتغييرات تخطيط على مستوى الصفحة واستفسارات الحاوية لتكيف على مستوى المكون، واستخدام @container و @sm و @md و @lg لإنشاء مكونات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام"},"useCases":{"en":["Designing adaptive grids with viewport breakpoints","Building reusable components with container queries","Optimizing layout for different screen sizes using @sm:, @md:, @lg:"],"zh":["使用视口断点设计自适应网格","使用容器查询构建可重用组件","使用@sm:、@md:、@lg:为不同屏幕尺寸优化布局"],"ja":["ビューポートブレークポイントを使用したアダプティブグリッドの設計","コンテナクエリを使用した再利用可能なコンポーネントの構築","@sm:、@md:、@lg:を使用したさまざまな画面サイズのレイアウト最適化"],"ko":["뷰포트 브레이크포인트를 사용하여 적응형 그리드를 설계","컨테이너 쿼리를 사용하여 재사용 가능한 컴포넌트를 구축","@sm:, @md:, @lg:를 사용하여 다양한 화면 크기에 대한 레이아웃 최적화"],"es":["Diseñar cuadrículas adaptables con puntos de interrupción de viewport","Crear componentes reutilizables con consultas de contenedor","Optimizar el diseño para diferentes tamaños de pantalla utilizando @sm:, @md:, @lg:"],"fr":["Concevoir des grilles adaptables avec des points d''arrêt de viewport","Créer des composants réutilisables avec des requêtes de conteneur","Optimiser la mise en page pour différents tailles d''écran en utilisant @sm:, @md:, @lg:"],"de":["Adaptive Gitternetze mit Viewport-Breakpoints entwerfen","Wiederverwendbare Komponenten mit Container-Abfragen erstellen","Layout für verschiedene Bildschirmgrößen mit @sm:, @md:, @lg: optimieren"],"pt":["Projetando grades adaptativas com quebras de viewport","Construindo componentes reutilizáveis com consultas de contêiner","Otimizando o layout para diferentes tamanhos de tela usando @sm:, @md:, @lg:"],"ru":["Проектирование адаптивных сеток с точками разрыва viewport","Создание многократно используемых компонентов с запросами контейнера","Оптимизация макета для разных размеров экрана с помощью @sm:, @md:, @lg:"],"ar":["تصميم شبكات متكيفة مع كسور نقطة العرض","بناء مكونات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام باستخدام استفسارات الحاوية","تحسين التخطيط لأحجام شاشة مختلفة باستخدام @sm و @md و @lg"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires manual marking of intentional component boundaries with @container","Avoids deep or unnecessary container query usage"],"zh":["需要手动标记有意的组件边界以使用@container","避免深度或不必要的容器查询使用"],"ja":["意図的なコンポーネント境界を@containerを使用して手動でマークする必要がある","深いまたは不要なコンテナクエリの使用を避ける"],"ko":["의도적인 컴포넌트 경계를 @container를 사용하여 수동으로 표시해야 함","깊은 또는 불필요한 컨테이너 쿼리 사용을 피함"],"es":["Requiere la marcación manual de límites de componentes intencionados con @container","Evita un uso profundo o innecesario de consultas de contenedor"],"fr":["Nécessite le marquage manuel des limites