rápida y integral que reemplaza ESLint y Prettier con una sola herramienta","fr":"Biome est un outil de développement web rapide et tout-en-un qui remplace ESLint et Prettier avec un seul outil","de":"Biome ist ein schnelles und umfassendes Web-Entwicklungstool, das ESLint und Prettier durch ein einzelnes Tool ersetzt","pt":"Biome é uma ferramenta de desenvolvimento web rápida e completa, escrita em Rust, que oferece linting e formatação em uma única ferramenta.","ru":"Biome - быстрый и всесторонний инструментарий для веб-проектов, написанный на Rust, который предлагает проверку кода и форматирование в одном инструменте.","ar":"بيوم هي أداة تطوير الويب سريعة وشاملة، مكتوبة بلغة روست، توفر تحقق وتنسيق في أداة واحدة.","en":"Embed documentation indexes into AGENTS.md for always-on agent context"},"definition":{"en":"Embed documentation indexes into AGENTS.md for always-on agent context"},"features":{"zh":["Rust","ESLint Prettier","100","TypeScript","VS Code","Monorepo"],"ja":["Rust","ESLint Prettier","100","TypeScript","VS Code","Monorepo"],"ko":["Rust","ESLint Prettier","100","TypeScript","VS Code","Monorepo"],"es":["Herramienta única para linting y formato","100x más rápido que ESLint","Configuración cero por defecto","Compatibilidad parcial con Prettier","Soporte nativo para monorepo","Integración con VS Code"],"fr":["Outil unique pour le linting et le formatage","100x plus rapide que ESLint","Configuration zéro par défaut","Compatibilité partielle avec Prettier","Support natif pour les monorepo","Intégration avec VS Code"],"de":["Einziges Tool für Linting und Formatierung","100x schneller als ESLint","Null-Konfiguration standardmäßig","Teilweise Kompatibilität mit Prettier","Native Unterstützung für Monorepo","Integration mit VS Code"],"pt":["Linting e formatação em uma única ferramenta","100x mais rápido que ESLint","Configuração zero por padrão","Suporte a monorepo nativo","Integração com VS Code"],"ru":["Проверка кода и форматирование в одном инструменте","100x быстрее ESLint","Нулевая конфигурация по умолчанию","Нативная поддержка монореPO","Интеграция с VS Code"],"ar":["التحقق والتنسيق في أداة واحدة","100 مرة أسرع من ESLint","إعدادات صفرية افتراضية","دعم مونوريبو أصلي","التكامل مع VS Code"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Biome","Rust","ESLint","Prettier","TypeScript","VS Code","Monorepo","Zero-config","Linting","Formatting"],"ja":["Biome","Rust","ESLint","Prettier","TypeScript","VS Code","Monorepo","Zero-config","Linting","Formatting"],"ko":["Biome","Rust","ESLint","Prettier","TypeScript","VS Code","Monorepo","Zero-config","Linting","Formatting"],"es":["desarrollo web","herramienta de desarrollo","linting","formato","ESLint","Prettier","Rust","monorepo","VS Code"],"fr":["développement web","outil de développement","linting","formatage","ESLint","Prettier","Rust","monorepo","VS Code"],"de":["Web-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstool","Linting","Formatierung","ESLint","Prettier","Rust","Monorepo","VS Code"],"pt":["desenvolvimento web","ferramenta de desenvolvimento","Rust","linting","formatação","ESLint","Prettier","monorepo","VS Code"],"ru":["веб-разработка","инструментарий для разработки","Rust","проверка кода","форматирование","ESLint","Prettier","монореPO","VS Code"],"ar":["تطوير الويب","أداة تطوير","روست","التحقق","التنسيق","ESLint","Prettier","مونوريبو","VS Code"]}},"owner":"olavocarvalho","repo":"engrain","repoPath":"olavocarvalho/engrain","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.425Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"biome","description":"Biome - Fast all-in-one toolchain for web projects (linter + formatter in Rust, 100x faster than ESLint)","version":"1.0.0","tags":"","bodyPreview":"# Biome - Fast All-in-One Toolchain\n\n## Overview\n\nBiome is a fast, all-in-one toolchain for web projects written in Rust. It replaces both ESLint and Prettier with a single tool that''s 100x faster and provides zero-config defaults.\n\n**Key Features**:\n- Single tool for linting and formatting\n- 100x faster than ESLint\n- Zero configuration by default\n- Built-in import sorting\n- TypeScript-first design\n- Partial Prettier compatibility\n- Native monorepo support\n- VS Code integration\n\n**Installation**","body":"# Biome - Fast All-in-One Toolchain\n\n## Overview\n\nBiome is a fast, all-in-one toolchain for web projects written in Rust. It replaces both ESLint and Prettier with a single tool that''s 100x faster and provides zero-config defaults.\n\n**Key Features**:\n- Single tool for linting and formatting\n- 100x faster than ESLint\n- Zero configuration by default\n- Built-in import sorting\n- TypeScript-first design\n- Partial Prettier compatibility\n- Native monorepo support\n- VS Code integration\n\n**Installation**:\n```bash\nnpm install --save-dev @biomejs/biome\n```\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### 1. Initialize Biome\n\n```bash\n# Create biome.json configuration\nnpx @biomejs/biome init\n\n# Check your project\nnpx @biomejs/biome check .\n\n# Fix issues automatically\nnpx @biomejs/biome check --write .\n\n# Format only\nnpx @biomejs/biome format --write .\n\n# Lint only\nnpx @biomejs/biome lint .\n```\n\n### 2. Package.json Scripts\n\n```json\n{\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"check\": \"biome check .\",\n    \"check:write\": \"biome check --write .\",\n    \"format\": \"biome format --write .\",\n    \"lint\": \"biome lint .\",\n    \"lint:fix\": \"biome lint --write .\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 3. Basic Configuration\n\n```json\n{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://biomejs.dev/schemas/1.9.4/schema.json\",\n  \"vcs\": {\n    \"enabled\": true,\n    \"clientKind\": \"git\",\n    \"useIgnoreFile\": true\n  },\n  \"files\": {\n    \"ignoreUnknown\": false,\n    \"ignore\": [\"node_modules\", \"dist\", \"build\", \".next\"]\n  },\n  \"formatter\": {\n    \"enabled\": true,\n    \"indentStyle\": \"space\",\n    \"indentWidth\": 2,\n    \"lineWidth\": 100\n  },\n  \"linter\": {\n    \"enabled\": true,\n    \"rules\": {\n      \"recommended\": true\n    }\n  },\n  \"javascript\": {\n    \"formatter\": {\n      \"quoteStyle\": \"single\",\n      \"semicolons\": \"asNeeded\",\n      \"trailingCommas\": \"all\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Core Commands\n\n### Check Command (Recommended)\n\nThe `check` command runs both linting and formatting:\n\n```bash\n# Check all files\nbiome check .\n\n# Fix issues automatically\nbiome check --write .\n\n# Unsafe fixes (may change behavior)\nbiome check --write --unsafe .\n\n# Apply suggested fixes\nbiome check --write --unsafe --apply-suggested\n\n# Check specific files\nbiome check src/**/*.ts\n\n# CI mode (exit with error on issues)\nbiome ci .\n```\n\n### Format Command\n\nFormat code without linting:\n\n```bash\n# Format all files\nbiome format --write .\n\n# Check formatting without changing files\nbiome format .\n\n# Format specific files\nbiome format --write src/**/*.{ts,tsx,js,jsx}\n\n# Format stdin\necho \"const x={a:1}\" | biome format --stdin-file-path=file.js\n```\n\n### Lint Command\n\nLint code without formatting:\n\n```bash\n# Lint all files\nbiome lint .\n\n# Fix linting issues\nbiome lint --write .\n\n# Show rule names\nbiome lint --verbose .\n\n# Apply unsafe fixes\nbiome lint --write --unsafe .\n```\n\n## Configuration Deep Dive\n\n### Formatter Configuration\n\n```json\n{\n  \"formatter\": {\n    \"enabled\": true,\n    \"formatWithErrors\": false,\n    \"indentStyle\": \"space\",\n    \"indentWidth\": 2,\n    \"lineEnding\": \"lf\",\n    \"lineWidth\": 80,\n    \"attributePosition\": \"auto\"\n  },\n  \"javascript\": {\n    \"formatter\": {\n      \"quoteStyle\": \"single\",\n      \"jsxQuoteStyle\": \"double\",\n      \"quoteProperties\": \"asNeeded\",\n      \"trailingCommas\": \"all\",\n      \"semicolons\": \"asNeeded\",\n      \"arrowParentheses\": \"always\",\n      \"bracketSpacing\": true,\n      \"bracketSameLine\": false\n    }\n  },\n  \"json\": {\n    \"formatter\": {\n      \"trailingCommas\": \"none\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Linter Configuration\n\n```json\n{\n  \"linter\": {\n    \"enabled\": true,\n    \"rules\": {\n      \"recommended\": true,\n      \"a11y\": {\n        \"recommended\": true,\n        \"noAutofocus\": \"error\",\n        \"useKeyWithClickEvents\": \"warn\"\n      },\n      \"complexity\": {\n        \"recommended\": true,\n        \"noForEach\": \"off\",\n        \"useLiteralKeys\": \"error\"\n      },\n      \"correctness\": {\n        \"recommended\": true,\n        \"noUnusedVariables\": \"error\",\n        \"useExhaustiveDependencies\": \"warn\"\n      },\n      \"performance\": {\n        \"recommended\": true,\n        \"noAccumulatingSpread\": \"warn\"\n      },\n      \"security\": {\n        \"recommended\": true,\n        \"noDangerouslySetInnerHtml\": \"error\"\n      },\n      \"style\": {\n        \"recommended\": true,\n        \"noNonNullAssertion\": \"warn\",\n        \"useConst\": \"error\",\n        \"useTemplate\": \"warn\"\n      },\n      \"suspicious\": {\n        \"recommended\": true,\n        \"noExplicitAny\": \"warn\",\n        \"noArrayIndexKey\": \"error\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### File Ignore Patterns\n\n```json\n{\n  \"files\": {\n    \"ignore\": [\n      \"node_modules\",\n      \"dist\",\n      \"build\",\n      \".next\",\n      \"coverage\",\n      \"*.min.js\",\n      \"public/assets/**\"\n    ],\n    \"ignoreUnknown\": false,\n    \"include\": [\"src/**/*.ts\", \"src/**/*.tsx\"]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Override Configuration for Specific Files\n\n```json\n{\n  \"overrides\": [\n    {\n      \"include\": [\"**/*.test.ts\", \"**/*.spec.ts\"],\n      \"linter\": {\n        \"rules\": {\n          \"suspicious\": {\n            \"noExplicitAny\": \"off\"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"include\": [\"scripts/**/*.js\"],\n      \"formatter\": {\n        \"lineWidth\": 120\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n## VS Code Integration\n\n### 1. Install Biome Extension\n\n```bash\n# Install from VS Code marketplace\ncode --install-extension biomejs.biome\n```\n\n### 2. VS Code Settings (`.vscode/settings.json`)\n\n```json\n{\n  \"[javascript]\": {\n    \"editor.defaultFormatter\": \"biomejs.biome\",\n    \"editor.formatOnSave\": true,\n    \"editor.codeActionsOnSave\": {\n      \"quickfix.biome\": \"explicit\",\n      \"source.organizeImports.biome\": \"explicit\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"[typescript]\": {\n    \"editor.defaultFormatter\": \"biomejs.biome\",\n    \"editor.formatOnSave\": true,\n    \"editor.codeActionsOnSave\": {\n      \"quickfix.biome\": \"explicit\",\n      \"source.organizeImports.biome\": \"explicit\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"[typescriptreact]\": {\n    \"editor.defaultFormatter\": \"biomejs.biome\",\n    \"editor.formatOnSave\": true\n  },\n  \"[json]\": {\n    \"editor.defaultFormatter\": \"biomejs.biome\",\n    \"editor.formatOnSave\": true\n  },\n  \"biome.lspBin\": \"./node_modules/@biomejs/biome/bin/biome\"\n}\n```\n\n### 3. Workspace Settings\n\n```json\n{\n  \"editor.formatOnSave\": true,\n  \"editor.formatOnPaste\": true,\n  \"editor.defaultFormatter\": \"biomejs.biome\",\n  \"biome.rename\": true,\n  \"files.autoSave\": \"onFocusChange\"\n}\n```\n\n## Migration from ESLint and Prettier\n\n### 1. Remove Old Tools\n\n```bash\n# Remove ESLint and Prettier\nnpm uninstall eslint prettier eslint-config-prettier \\\n  eslint-plugin-react eslint-plugin-import \\\n  @typescript-eslint/parser @typescript-eslint/eslint-plugin\n\n# Remove configuration files\nrm .eslintrc.js .eslintrc.json .prettierrc .prettierignore\n```\n\n### 2. Migrate Configuration\n\nUse Biome''s migration tool:\n\n```bash\n# Migrate from Prettier config\nbiome migrate prettier --write\n\n# Migrate from ESLint config\nbiome migrate eslint --write\n```\n\n### 3. Manual Migration\n\n**Prettier → Biome Formatter**:\n\n```json\n// .prettierrc (old)\n{\n  \"semi\": false,\n  \"singleQuote\": true,\n  \"trailingComma\": \"all\",\n  \"printWidth\": 100\n}\n\n// biome.json (new)\n{\n  \"formatter\": {\n    \"lineWidth\": 100\n  },\n  \"javascript\": {\n    \"formatter\": {\n      \"semicolons\": \"asNeeded\",\n      \"quoteStyle\": \"single\",\n      \"trailingCommas\": \"all\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**ESLint → Biome Linter**:\n\n```json\n// .eslintrc.json (old)\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"no-unused-vars\": \"error\",\n    \"prefer-const\": \"warn\"\n  }\n}\n\n// biome.json (new)\n{\n  \"linter\": {\n    \"rules\": {\n      \"correctness\": {\n        \"noUnusedVariables\": \"error\"\n      },\n      \"style\": {\n        \"useConst\": \"warn\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 4. Update Scripts\n\n```json\n{\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"lint\": \"biome lint .\",\n    \"lint:fix\": \"biome lint --write .\",\n    \"format\": \"biome format --write .\",\n    \"check\": \"biome check --write .\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Git Hooks Integration\n\n### Using Husky + lint-staged\n\n```bash\n# Install dependencies\nnpm install --save-dev husky lint-staged\nnpx husky init\n```\n\n**`.husky/pre-commit`**:\n```bash\n#!/usr/bin/env sh\n. \"$(dirname -- \"$0\")/_/husky.sh\"\n\nnpx lint-staged\n```\n\n**`package.json`**:\n```json\n{\n  \"lint-staged\": {\n    \"*.{js,ts,jsx,tsx,json}\": [\n      \"biome check --write --no-errors-on-unmatched\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Using Lefthook\n\n**`lefthook.yml`**:\n```yaml\npre-commit:\n  commands:\n    lint:\n      glob: \"*.{js,ts,jsx,tsx,json}\"\n      run: biome check --write --no-errors-on-unmatched {staged_files}\n```\n\n### Simple Git Hook (no dependencies)\n\n**`.git/hooks/pre-commit`**:\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\n\n# Get staged files\nSTAGED_FILES=$(git diff --cached --name-only --diff-filter=ACM | grep -E ''\\.(js|ts|jsx|tsx|json)$'')\n\nif [ -n \"$STAGED_FILES\" ]; then\n  echo \"Running Biome on staged files...\"\n  npx @biomejs/biome check --write --no-errors-on-unmatched $STAGED_FILES\n\n  # Add formatted files back to staging\n  git add $STAGED_FILES\nfi\n```\n\n## CI/CD Integration\n\n### GitHub Actions\n\n```yaml\nname: Biome CI\n\non:\n  push:\n    branches: [main, develop]\n  pull_request:\n    branches: [main]\n\njobs:\n  biome:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n\n      - name: Setup Node.js\n        uses: actions/setup-node@v4\n        with:\n          node-version: ''20''\n          cache: ''npm''\n\n      - name: Install dependencies\n        run: npm ci\n\n      - name: Run Biome CI\n        run: npx @biomejs/biome ci .\n\n      - name: Check formatting\n        run: npx @biomejs/biome format .\n\n      - name: Lint\n        run: npx @biomejs/biome lint .\n```\n\n### GitLab CI\n\n```yaml\nbiome:\n  image: node:20-alpine\n  stage: test\n  script:\n    - npm ci\n    - npx @biomejs/biome ci .\n  cache:\n    paths:\n      - node_modules/\n  only:\n    - merge_requests\n    - main\n```\n\n### CircleCI\n\n```yaml\nversion: 2.1\n\njobs:\n  biome:\n    docker:\n      - image: cimg/node:20.11\n    steps:\n      - checkout\n      - restore_cache:\n          keys:\n            - deps-{{ checksum \"package-lock.json\" }}\n      - run: npm ci\n      - save_cache:\n          paths:\n            - node_modules\n          key: deps-{{ checksum \"package-lock.json\" }}\n      - run: npx @biomejs/biome ci .\n\nworkflows:\n  test:\n    jobs:\n      - biome\n```\n\n## Import Sorting\n\nBiome includes built-in import sorting:\n\n```bash\n# Organize imports\nbiome check --write --organize-imports-enabled=true .\n```\n\n**Configuration**:\n```json\n{\n  \"organizeImports\": {\n    \"enabled\": true\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Example**:\n```typescript\n// Before\nimport { useState } from ''react'';\nimport axios from ''axios'';\nimport { Button } from ''./components/Button'';\nimport type { User } from ''./types'';\nimport ''./styles.css'';\n\n// After (sorted)\nimport type { User } from ''./types'';\n\nimport axios from ''axios'';\nimport { useState } from ''react'';\n\nimport { Button } from ''./components/Button'';\n\nimport ''./styles.css'';\n```\n\n## TypeScript Support\n\nBiome has first-class TypeScript support:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"linter\": {\n    \"rules\": {\n      \"suspicious\": {\n        \"noExplicitAny\": \"warn\",\n        \"noUnsafeDeclarationMerging\": \"error\"\n      },\n      \"correctness\": {\n        \"noUnusedVariables\": \"error\"\n      },\n      \"style\": {\n        \"useImportType\": \"error\",\n        \"useExportType\": \"error\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Type-aware linting**:\n```typescript\n// Biome detects unused variables\nconst unused = 123; // ❌ Error\n\n// Enforces type imports\nimport { User } from ''./types''; // ❌ Error\nimport type { User } from ''./types''; // ✅ Correct\n\n// Detects unsafe type assertions\nconst num = \"123\" as any as number; // ⚠️ Warning\n```\n\n## Monorepo Support\n\nBiome works great in monorepos:\n\n### Project Structure\n```\nmy-monorepo/\n├── biome.json (root config)\n├── packages/\n│   ├── web/\n│   │   └── biome.json (extends root)\n│   ├── api/\n│   │   └── biome.json\n│   └── shared/\n│       └── biome.json\n```\n\n### Root Configuration\n```json\n{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://biomejs.dev/schemas/1.9.4/schema.json\",\n  \"extends\": [],\n  \"formatter\": {\n    \"enabled\": true,\n    \"indentStyle\": \"space\",\n    \"indentWidth\": 2\n  },\n  \"linter\": {\n    \"enabled\": true,\n    \"rules\": {\n      \"recommended\": true\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Package Override\n```json\n{\n  \"extends\": [\"../../biome.json\"],\n  \"formatter\": {\n    \"lineWidth\": 100\n  },\n  \"linter\": {\n    \"rules\": {\n      \"style\": {\n        \"noNonNullAssertion\": \"off\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Monorepo Scripts\n```json\n{\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"check\": \"biome check .\",\n    \"check:packages\": \"biome check packages/*\",\n    \"format\": \"biome format --write .\",\n    \"lint\": \"biome lint packages/*\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Performance Benefits\n\n### Speed Comparison\n\n| Tool | Time (10,000 files) |\n|------|---------------------|\n| ESLint + Prettier | ~60s |\n| Biome | ~0.6s |\n\n**100x faster** on average workloads.\n\n### Caching\n\nBiome includes intelligent caching:\n\n```bash\n# First run (no cache)\nbiome check .  # 1.2s\n\n# Second run (with cache)\nbiome check .  # 0.1s\n\n# Clear cache\nrm -rf node_modules/.cache/biome\n```\n\n### Parallel Processing\n\nBiome uses all CPU cores by default:\n\n```bash\n# Limit CPU cores\nbiome check --max-diagnostics=50 .\n\n# Verbose output\nbiome check --verbose .\n```\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### React Projects\n\n```json\n{\n  \"linter\": {\n    \"rules\": {\n      \"a11y\": {\n        \"recommended\": true,\n        \"useButtonType\": \"error\",\n        \"useKeyWithClickEvents\": \"error\"\n      },\n      \"correctness\": {\n        \"useExhaustiveDependencies\": \"warn\",\n        \"useHookAtTopLevel\": \"error\"\n      },\n      \"suspicious\": {\n        \"noArrayIndexKey\": \"error\"\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"javascript\": {\n    \"formatter\": {\n      \"jsxQuoteStyle\": \"double\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Next.js Projects\n\n```json\n{\n  \"files\": {\n    \"ignore\": [\".next\", \"out\", \"node_modules\"]\n  },\n  \"overrides\": [\n    {\n      \"include\": [\"app/**/*.tsx\", \"pages/**/*.tsx\"],\n      \"linter\": {\n        \"rules\": {\n          \"a11y\": {\n            \"recommended\": true\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### Node.js Backend\n\n```json\n{\n  \"linter\": {\n    \"rules\": {\n      \"security\": {\n        \"recommended\": true,\n        \"noGlobalEval\": \"error\"\n      },\n      \"correctness\": {\n        \"noUnusedVariables\": \"error\"\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"javascript\": {\n    \"formatter\": {\n      \"semicolons\": \"always\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Use `biome check`** instead of separate format/lint commands\n2. **Enable `--write`** flag for automatic fixes\n3. **Configure VS Code** for format-on-save\n4. **Add git hooks** to enforce quality before commits\n5. **Use CI mode** (`biome ci`) in continuous integration\n6. **Start with recommended rules** then customize\n7. **Leverage import sorting** to organize imports automatically\n8. **Use overrides** for different file types or directories\n9. **Enable VCS integration** to respect .gitignore\n10. **Keep configuration minimal** - Biome has smart defaults\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Biome Not Formatting\n\n```bash\n# Check if formatter is enabled\nbiome rage\n\n# Verify file is not ignored\nbiome check --verbose src/file.ts\n\n# Check VS Code extension logs\n# View → Output → Biome\n```\n\n### Conflicts with Prettier\n\n```bash\n# Disable Prettier in VS Code settings\n\"[javascript]\": {\n  \"editor.defaultFormatter\": \"biomejs.biome\"\n}\n\n# Remove Prettier dependencies\nnpm uninstall prettier\n```\n\n### Performance Issues\n\n```bash\n# Check cache location\nbiome rage\n\n# Clear cache\nrm -rf node_modules/.cache/biome\n\n# Reduce max diagnostics\nbiome check --max-diagnostics=20 .\n```\n\n### Rule Configuration Not Working\n\n```json\n// Ensure correct category\n{\n  \"linter\": {\n    \"rules\": {\n      \"correctness\": {  // Category name matters\n        \"noUnusedVariables\": \"error\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Local Biome Configs (Your Repos)\n\nPatterns from active projects:\n\n- `ai-code-review/biome.json`: `files.includes` targets `src/**/*.ts` and excludes tests, `lineWidth: 100`, single quotes, semicolons always, and `noExplicitAny: warn`.\n- `itinerizer-ts/biome.json`: `files.ignore` includes `node_modules`, `dist`, `.claude`, and data directories; `organizeImports.enabled = true`.\n- `matsuoka-com` and `diogenes` use similar formatting defaults (2-space indent, lineWidth 100).\n\nCommon scripts:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"lint\": \"biome check src/ --diagnostic-level=error\",\n  \"lint:fix\": \"biome check src/ --write\",\n  \"format\": \"biome format src/ --write\"\n}\n```\n\n## Resources\n\n- **Official Docs**: https://biomejs.dev\n- **VS Code Extension**: https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=biomejs.biome\n- **GitHub**: https://github.com/biomejs/biome\n- **Rules Reference**: https://biomejs.dev/linter/rules/\n- **Migration Guide**: https://biomejs.dev/guides/migrate-eslint-prettier/\n\n## Summary\n\n- **Biome** is a fast all-in-one linter and formatter\n- **100x faster** than ESLint + Prettier\n- **Zero config** by default with smart defaults\n- **Built in Rust** for maximum performance\n- **TypeScript-first** with excellent type support\n- **Import sorting** included out of the box\n- **VS Code integration** with official extension\n- **Perfect for** modern web projects, monorepos, CI/CD\n- **Easy migration** from ESLint and Prettier\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:47:51.017Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Quality Agents needing lightning-fast linting and formatting for web projects.","zh":"非常适合需要为网页项目提供闪电般快速的linting和格式化的代码质量代理。","ja":"コード品質エージェントがWebプロジェクトに迅速なlintingとフォーマットが必要な場合に最適です。","ko":"웹 프로젝트를 위한 코드 품질 에이전트가 번개와 같은 속도의 linting 및 형식을 필요로 할 때 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de calidad de código que necesitan una corrección y formato de código relámpago para proyectos web.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de qualité de code nécessitant une correction et un formatage d''exécution rapide pour les projets web.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Qualitäts-Agents, die ein blitzschnelles Linting und Formatieren für Webprojekte benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Qualidade de Código que necessitam de linting e formatação extremamente rápidos para projetos web.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов контроля качества кода, которым требуется молниеносно быстрая проверка и форматирование для веб-проектов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل جودة التعليمات البرمجية الذين يحتاجون إلى تنسيق سريع للغاية وتشكيل للمشاريع الويب."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to perform comprehensive code analysis 100x faster than ESLint by leveraging Biome''s Rust-based toolchain. Provides zero-config linting, formatting, and import sorting with native TypeScript support and monorepo capabilities.","zh":"通过利用Biome的Rust基础工具链，使代理能够比ESLint快100倍地执行全面代码分析。提供零配置linting、格式化和导入排序，并支持原生TypeScript和monorepo功能。","ja":"BiomeのRustベースのツールチェーンを利用し、代理がESLintよりも100倍高速で包括的なコード分析を実行できるようにします。ネイティブのTypeScriptサポートとモノレポ機能を備えたゼロコンフィグのlinting、フォーマット、インポートの整理を提供します。","ko":"Biome의 러스트 기반 툴체인을 활용하여 에이전트가 ESLint보다 100배 빠른 속도로 포괄적인 코드 분석을 수행할 수 있도록 합니다. 네이티브 TypeScript 지원 및 모노레포 기능을 제공하는 무설정 linting, 형식 지정 및 가져오기 정렬을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes realizar un análisis de código integral 100 veces más rápido que ESLint mediante la utilización de la cadena de herramientas basada en Rust de Biome. Proporciona una corrección, formato y ordenación de importaciones sin configuración con compatibilidad nativa con TypeScript y capacidades de monorepo.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer une analyse de code complète 100 fois plus rapide que ESLint en exploitant la chaîne d''outils basée sur Rust de Biome. Fournit une correction, un formatage et un tri des déclarations d''importation sans configuration avec une prise en charge native de TypeScript et des capacités de monorepo.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, eine umfassende Codeanalyse 100-mal schneller als ESLint durchzuführen, indem es Biomes Rust-basiertes Toolchain nutzt. Bietet eine korrekte Konfiguration, Formatierung und Importsortierung ohne native Konfiguration mit TypeScript-Unterstützung und Monorepo-Fähigkeiten.","pt":"Permite que os agentes realizem análise de código abrangente 100x mais rápida do que o ESLint, aproveitando a cadeia de ferramentas baseada em Rust da Biome. Fornece linting, formatação e ordenação de importação zero-config com suporte nativo ao TypeScript e capacidades de monorepo.","ru":"Позволяет агентам выполнять всесторонний анализ кода в 100 раз быстрее, чем ESLint, используя инструментарий Biome на основе Rust. Предоставляет конфигурацию zero-config для проверки, форматирования и сортировки импортов с родной поддержкой TypeScript и возможностями монорепозитория.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء أداء تحليل شامل للكود 100x أسرع من ESLint من خلال الاستفادة من سلاسل الأدوات الراسبة على Rust في Biome. يوفر تنسيقًا بدون تكوين وتنسيقًا وفرز إعلانات الاستيراد مع دعم TypeScript الأصلي وقدرات monorepo."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code formatting with Prettier compatibility","Enforcing linting rules in TypeScript projects","Sorting import statements across codebases","Analyzing monorepo structures for consistency"],"zh":["使用Prettier兼容性自动执行代码格式化","在TypeScript项目中强制执行linting规则","跨代码库对导入语句进行排序","分析monorepo结构以确保一致性"],"ja":["Prettier互換性を使用したコードの自動フォーマット","TypeScriptプロジェクトでのlintingルールの適用","コードベース全体でのインポート文の整理","モノレポ構造の分析による一貫性の確保"],"ko":["Prettier 호환성을 사용한 코드 자동 형식 지정","TypeScript 프로젝트에서 linting 규칙 적용","코드베이스 전반의 가져오기 문 정렬","모노레포 구조 분석을 통한 일관성 보장"],"es":["Automatizar el formato de código con compatibilidad con Prettier","Aplicar reglas de corrección en proyectos TypeScript","Ordenar declaraciones de importación en código","Analizar estructuras de monorepo para la coherencia"],"fr":["Automatiser le formatage de code avec la compatibilité Prettier","Mettre en œuvre des règles de correction dans les projets TypeScript","Trier les déclarations d''importation dans les bases de code","Analyser les structures de monorepo pour la cohérence"],"de":["Automatisieren des Code-Formatierens mit Prettier-Kompatibilität","Durchsetzen von Linting-Regeln in TypeScript-Projekten","Sortieren von Importanweisungen in Codebasen","Analysieren von Monorepo-Strukturen für Konsistenz"],"pt":["Automatizar a formatação de código com compatibilidade com Prettier","Aplicar regras de linting em projetos TypeScript","Ordenar instruções de importação em todo o código","Analizar estruturas de monorepo para consistência"],"ru":["Автоматизировать форматирование кода с совместимостью Prettier","Применять правила проверки в проектах TypeScript","Сортировать операторы импорта по всему коду","Анализировать структуры монорепозитория на предмет согласованности"],"ar":["توفير تنسيق الترميز الآلي مع توافق Prettier","تنفيذ قواعد فحص في مشاريع TypeScript","فرز عبارات الاستيراد عبر قاعدة الشفرة","تحليل هياكل monorepo لضمان الاتساق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Rust-based toolchain required","Web project focus (JavaScript/TypeScript)","Partial Prettier compatibility only"],"zh":["需要Rust基础工具链","仅限Web项目（JavaScript/TypeScript）","仅Prettier兼容性部分"],"ja":["Rustベースのツールチェーンが必要","Webプロジェクト（JavaScript/TypeScript）のみ","Prettier互換性の一部のみ"],"ko":["러스트 기반 툴체인이 필요합니다.","웹 프로젝트(JavaScript/TypeScript)만 해당","부분적인 Prettier 호환성만 제공"],"es":["Se requiere una cadena de herramientas basada en Rust","Enfoque en proyectos web (JavaScript/TypeScript)","Compatibilidad parcial con Prettier solo"],"fr":["Une chaîne d''outils basée sur Rust est requise","Focus sur les projets web (JavaScript/TypeScript)","Compatibilité Prettier partielle uniquement"],"de":["Eine Rust-basierte Toolchain ist erforderlich","Fokus auf Webprojekte (JavaScript/TypeScript)","Nur teilweise Prettier-Kompatibilität"],"pt":["Cadeia de ferramentas baseada em Rust necessária","Foco em projetos web (JavaScript/TypeScript)","Compatibilidade parcial com Prettier apenas"],"ru":["Требуется инструментарий на основе Rust","Фокус на веб-проектах (JavaScript/TypeScript)","Только частичная совместимость с Prettier"],"ar":["سلسلة أدوات راسبة على Rust مطلوبة","تركيز على مشاريع الويب (JavaScript/TypeScript)","توافق 부분ي مع Prettier فقط"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Wolverine971/9takes/add-config-field', 'community', 'Wolverine971', '9takes', 'Wolverine971/9takes', 'add-config-field', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.425Z', '2026-02-18T04:47:57.763Z', NULL, '{"id":"Wolverine971/9takes/add-config-field","name":"add-config-field","description":{"zh":"add-config-field 技术允许开发人员添加新字段到 .agents.yml 配置模式，支持版本控制和迁移","ja":"add-config-field 技術により、開発者は .agents.yml 構成スキーマに新しいフィールドを追加し、バージョニングと移行をサポートできます","ko":"add-config-field 기술을 통해 개발자는 .agents.yml 구성 스키마에 새로운 필드를 추가하고 버저닝 및 마이그레이션을 지원할 수 있습니다","es":"El skill ''add-config-field'' permite agregar un nuevo campo al esquema de configuración .agents.yml con versionado y soporte de migración","fr":"Le skill ''add-config-field'' permet d''ajouter un nouveau champ au schéma de configuration .agents.yml avec versionnage et prise en charge de la migration","de":"Das Skill ''add-config-field'' ermöglicht es, ein neues Feld zum Konfigurationsschema .agents.yml mit Versionierung und Migrationsunterstützung hinzuzufügen","pt":"Adicione um novo campo ao esquema de configuração .agents.yml com suporte a versionamento e migração. Isso permite uma gestão mais eficaz da configuração do agente.","ru":"Добавьте новое поле в схему конфигурации .agents.yml с поддержкой версионирования и миграции. Это позволяет более эффективно управлять конфигурацией агента.","ar":"إضافة حقل جديد إلى مخطط تكوين .agents.yml مع دعم الإصدار والمهاجرة. هذا يسمح بإدارة أكثر كفاءة لتكوين العميل.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"添加配置字段 - add-config-field 技术","ja":"コンフィグフィールドの追加 - add-config-field","ko":"구성 필드 추가 - add-config-field","es":"Agregar Campo de Configuración","fr":"Ajouter un Champ de Configuration","de":"Konfigurationsfeld Hinzufügen","pt":"Adicionar Campo de Configuração","ru":"Добавить Поле Конфигурации","ar":"إضافة حقل تكوين","en":"add-config-field"},"description":{"zh":"add-config-field 技术允许开发人员添加新字段到 .agents.yml 配置模式，支持版本控制和迁移","ja":"add-config-field 技術により、開発者は .agents.yml 構成スキーマに新しいフィールドを追加し、バージョニングと移行をサポートできます","ko":"add-config-field 기술을 통해 개발자는 .agents.yml 구성 스키마에 새로운 필드를 추가하고 버저닝 및 마이그레이션을 지원할 수 있습니다","es":"El skill ''add-config-field'' permite agregar un nuevo campo al esquema de configuración .agents.yml con versionado y soporte de migración","fr":"Le skill ''add-config-field'' permet d''ajouter un nouveau champ au schéma de configuration .agents.yml avec versionnage et prise en charge de la migration","de":"Das Skill ''add-config-field'' ermöglicht es, ein neues Feld zum Konfigurationsschema .agents.yml mit Versionierung und Migrationsunterstützung hinzuzufügen","pt":"Adicione um novo campo ao esquema de configuração .agents.yml com suporte a versionamento e migração. Isso permite uma gestão mais eficaz da configuração do ...","ru":"Добавьте новое поле в схему конфигурации .agents.yml с поддержкой версионирования и миграции. Это позволяет более эффективно управлять конфигурацией агента.","ar":"إضافة حقل جديد إلى مخطط تكوين .agents.yml مع دعم الإصدار والمهاجرة. هذا يسمح بإدارة أكثر كفاءة لتكوين العميل.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["添加新字段到 .agents.yml 配置模式","支持版本控制","支持迁移","修改 plugins/majestic-engineer/commands/workflows/init.md 文件","更新 plugins/majestic-engineer/config-schema-version 文件"],"ja":[".agents.yml 構成スキーマに新しいフィールドを追加","バージョニングをサポート","移行をサポート","plugins/majestic-engineer/commands/workflows/init.md ファイルを変更","plugins/majestic-engineer/config-schema-version ファイルを更新"],"ko":[".agents.yml 구성 스키마에 새로운 필드를 추가","버저닝을 지원","마이그레이션을 지원","plugins/majestic-engineer/commands/workflows/init.md 파일을 수정","plugins/majestic-engineer/config-schema-version 파일을 업데이트합니다"],"es":["Agregar campos personalizados al esquema de configuración","Soporte de versionado para cambios en el esquema","Prise en charge de la migración para garantizar la compatibilidad","Actualización de los archivos de configuración .agents.yml","Inclusión de plantillas YAML para generar archivos de configuración"],"fr":["Ajouter des champs personnalisés au schéma de configuration","Prise en charge de la version pour les modifications du schéma","Prise en charge de la migration pour assurer la compatibilité","Mise à jour des fichiers de configuration .agents.yml","Inclusion de modèles YAML pour générer des fichiers de configuration"],"de":["Hinzufügen benutzerdefinierter Felder zum Konfigurationsschema","Unterstützung von Versionierung für Änderungen im Schema","Unterstützung von Migration für die Gewährleistung der Kompatibilität","Aktualisierung der Konfigurationsdateien .agents.yml","Einclusion von YAML-Vorlagen zur Generierung von Konfigurationsdateien"],"pt":["Adiciona um novo campo ao esquema de configuração .agents.yml","Suporte a versionamento e migração","Gestão eficaz da configuração do agente","Integração com plugins e comandos","Suporte a templates YAML"],"ru":["Добавляет новое поле в схему конфигурации .agents.yml","Поддержка версионирования и миграции","Эффективное управление конфигурацией агента","Интеграция с плагинами и командами","Поддержка шаблонов YAML"],"ar":["إضافة حقل جديد إلى مخطط تكوين .agents.yml","دعم الإصدار والمهاجرة","إدارة أكثر كفاءة لتكوين العميل","التكامل مع الإضافات والأوامر","دعم قوالب YAML"]},"keywords":{"zh":["add-config-field","配置模式","版本控制","迁移","plugins","majestic-engineer","开发技术"],"ja":["add-config-field","構成スキーマ","バージョニング","移行","plugins","majestic-engineer","開発技術"],"ko":["add-config-field","구성 스키마","버저닝","마이그레이션","plugins","majestic-engineer","개발 기술"],"es":["configuración de esquema","versionado","migración","campos personalizados","plantillas YAML","desarrollo de software","integración de sistemas","automatización de flujos de trabajo"],"fr":["configuration de schéma","versionnage","migration","champs personnalisés","modèles YAML","développement de logiciels","intégration de systèmes","automatisation de flux de travail"],"de":["Konfigurationsschema","Versionierung","Migration","benutzerdefinierte Felder","YAML-Vorlagen","Softwareentwicklung","Systemintegration","Automatisierung von Workflows"],"pt":["adicionar campo de configuração","esquema de configuração .agents.yml","versionamento e migração","gestão de configuração","plugins e comandos","templates YAML","desenvolvimento de software","engenharia de software"],"ru":["добавить поле конфигурации","схема конфигурации .agents.yml","версионирование и миграция","управление конфигурацией","плагины и команды","шаблоны YAML","разработка программного обеспечения","инженерия программного обеспечения"],"ar":["إضافة حقل تكوين","مخطط تكوين .agents.yml","الإصدار والمهاجرة","إدارة التكوين","الإضافات والأوامر","قوالب YAML","تطوير البرمجيات","هندسة البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"Wolverine971","repo":"9takes","repoPath":"Wolverine971/9takes","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.425Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"add-config-field","description":"Add new field to .agents.yml config schema (updates init.md templates, version, migration)","bodyPreview":"# Add Config Field\n\nAdd a new field to the `.agents.yml` config schema with proper versioning and migration support.\n\n## Files Changed\n\n| File                                                   | Purpose                                    |\n| ------------------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `plugins/majestic-engineer/commands/workflows/init.md` | 4 YAML templates that generate .agents.yml |\n| `plugins/majestic-engineer/config-schema-version`","body":"# Add Config Field\n\nAdd a new field to the `.agents.yml` config schema with proper versioning and migration support.\n\n## Files Changed\n\n| File                                                   | Purpose                                    |\n| ------------------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `plugins/majestic-engineer/commands/workflows/init.md` | 4 YAML templates that generate .agents.yml |\n| `plugins/majestic-engineer/config-schema-version`      | Schema version number                      |\n| `plugins/majestic-engineer/agents/config-reader.md`    | Changelog + migration logic                |\n| `plugins/majestic-engineer/.claude-plugin/plugin.json` | Plugin version                             |\n| `.claude-plugin/marketplace.json`                      | Marketplace version                        |\n\n## Input\n\n- **Field name**: e.g., `auto_commit`\n- **Default value**: e.g., `false` or multi-line YAML\n- **Section**: Where in template (Workflow, Quality Gate, etc.)\n- **Comment**: Inline explanation\n- **Used by**: Agent/command that reads this field\n\n## Steps\n\n### 1. Update init.md Templates\n\n**File:** `plugins/majestic-engineer/commands/workflows/init.md`\n\nAdd field to ALL 4 templates (Rails, Python, Node, Generic). Find the appropriate section and add:\n\n```yaml\nnew_field: value # Comment explaining purpose\n```\n\nOr for multi-line:\n\n```yaml\nnew_field: # Comment\n  - item1\n  - item2\n```\n\n### 2. Bump Schema Version\n\n**File:** `plugins/majestic-engineer/config-schema-version`\n\nIncrement: `1.1` → `1.2`\n\n### 3. Update config-reader.md\n\n**File:** `plugins/majestic-engineer/agents/config-reader.md`\n\n**A) Add to Version Changelog table:**\n\n```markdown\n| 1.2 | `new_field` | Description |\n```\n\n**B) Update migration YAML block** (in \"Outdated config_version\" section):\n\n```yaml\nnew_field: default_value\n```\n\n### 4. Bump Plugin Versions\n\n**Files:**\n\n- `plugins/majestic-engineer/.claude-plugin/plugin.json`: `3.15.0` → `3.16.0`\n- `.claude-plugin/marketplace.json`: Update majestic-engineer entry version\n\n### 5. Update Consumer Docs (if needed)\n\nIf a specific agent/command reads this field, update its documentation to mention the config.\n\n## Verification\n\n```bash\n# Count field in init.md (should be 4 - one per template)\ngrep -c \"new_field\" plugins/majestic-engineer/commands/workflows/init.md\n\n# Check schema version\ncat plugins/majestic-engineer/config-schema-version\n\n# Check changelog entry\ngrep \"new_field\" plugins/majestic-engineer/agents/config-reader.md\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:47:57.763Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing advanced configuration management with YAML schema versioning and migration support.","zh":"适用于需要高级配置管理的AI代理，支持YAML模式版本控制和迁移","ja":"YAMLスキーマのバージョニングとマイグレーションのサポートを備えた高度な構成管理が必要なAIエージェントに最適","ko":"YAML 스키마 버전 관리 및 마이그레이션 지원과 함께 고급 구성 관리가 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan una gestión de configuración avanzada con versión de esquema YAML y soporte de migración.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA nécessitant une gestion de configuration avancée avec une version de schéma YAML et une prise en charge de la migration.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die eine erweiterte Konfigurationsverwaltung mit YAML-Schemaversionierung und Migrationsunterstützung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de gerenciamento avançado de configuração com versionamento de esquema YAML e suporte à migração.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым требуется продвинутый менеджмент конфигурации с версионированием схемы YAML и поддержкой миграции.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي التي تحتاج إلى إدارة متقدمة للتكوين مع إصدار مخطط YAML ودعم الهجرة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to modify the `.agents.yml` config schema with proper versioning and migration support, utilizing YAML templates and config-schema-version management.","zh":"赋予代理修改`.agents.yml`配置模式的能力，支持适当的版本管理和迁移，利用YAML模板和配置模式版本管理","ja":".agents.yml構成スキーマをバージョニングとマイグレーションのサポートを使用して変更できるようにエージェントを有効にし、YAMLテンプレートと構成スキーマバージョン管理を利用","ko":"에이전트가 `.agents.yml` 구성 스키마를 수정할 수 있도록 하며, 버전 관리 및 마이그레이션 지원을 사용하고, YAML 템플릿 및 구성 스키마 버전 관리를 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a modificar el esquema de configuración `.agents.yml` con versionado y soporte de migración adecuados, utilizando plantillas YAML y gestión de versión de esquema de configuración.","fr":"Permet aux agents de modifier le schéma de configuration `.agents.yml` avec un versionnage et une prise en charge de la migration appropriés, en utilisant des modèles YAML et une gestion de version de schéma de configuration.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, das Konfigurationsschema `.agents.yml` mit ordnungsgemäßer Versionierung und Migrationsunterstützung zu ändern, indem YAML-Vorlagen und Konfigurations-Schema-Versionen-Verwaltung verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a modificarem o esquema de configuração `.agents.yml` com versionamento e suporte à migração adequados, utilizando modelos YAML e gerenciamento de versão do esquema de configuração.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность изменять схему конфигурации `.agents.yml` с правильным версионированием и поддержкой миграции, используя шаблоны YAML и управление версией схемы конфигурации.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على تعديل مخطط تكوين `.agents.yml` مع إصدار و دعم هجرة مناسبين، باستخدام قوالب YAML وإدارة إصدار مخطط التكوين."},"useCases":{"en":["Updating `.agents.yml` config schema with new fields","Migrating existing config schemas to new versions","Generating YAML templates for config schema initialization"],"zh":["使用新的字段更新`.agents.yml`配置模式","将现有的配置模式迁移到新版本","为配置模式初始化生成YAML模板"],"ja":[".agents.yml構成スキーマを新しいフィールドで更新する","既存の構成スキーマを新しいバージョンに移行する","構成スキーマの初期化にYAMLテンプレートを生成する"],"ko":[".agents.yml 구성 스키마를 새로운 필드로 업데이트","기존의 구성 스키마를 새로운 버전으로 마이그레이션","구성 스키마 초기화에 YAML 템플릿 생성"],"es":["Actualización del esquema de configuración `.agents.yml` con nuevos campos","Migración de esquemas de configuración existentes a nuevas versiones","Generación de plantillas YAML para la inicialización del esquema de configuración"],"fr":["Mise à jour du schéma de configuration `.agents.yml` avec de nouveaux champs","Migration des schémas de configuration existants vers de nouvelles versions","Génération de modèles YAML pour l''initialisation du schéma de configuration"],"de":["Aktualisierung des Konfigurationsschemas `.agents.yml` mit neuen Feldern","Migration bestehender Konfigurationsschemata zu neuen Versionen","Generierung von YAML-Vorlagen für die Initialisierung des Konfigurationsschemas"],"pt":["Atualizar o esquema de configuração `.agents.yml` com novos campos","Migrar esquemas de configuração existentes para novas versões","Gerar modelos YAML para inicialização do esquema de configuração"],"ru":["Обновление схемы конфигурации `.agents.yml` с новыми полями","Миграция существующих схем конфигурации на новые версии","Генерация шаблонов YAML для инициализации схемы конфигурации"],"ar":["تحديث مخطط تكوين `.agents.yml` مع حقول جديدة","هجرة مخططات التكوين الحالية إلى إصدارات جديدة","توليد قوالب YAML لمبادرة مخطط التكوين"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to `plugins/majestic-engineer` directory","YAML schema management only","Versioning support limited to `config-schema-version` management"],"zh":["需要访问`plugins/majestic-engineer`目录","仅支持YAML模式管理","版本管理仅限于`config-schema-version`管理"],"ja":["`plugins/majestic-engineer`ディレクトリへのアクセスが必要","YAMLスキーマ管理のみをサポート","バージョニングのサポートは`config-schema-version`管理に限定"],"ko":["`plugins/majestic-engineer` 디렉토리에 액세스해야 함","YAML 스키마 관리만 지원","버전 관리 지원은 `config-schema-version` 관리로 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso al directorio `plugins/majestic-engineer`","Gestión de esquema YAML solo","Soporte de versiones limitado a la gestión de `config-schema-version`"],"fr":["Requiert un accès au répertoire `plugins/majestic-engineer`","Gestion de schéma YAML uniquement","Prise en charge de version limitée à la gestion de `config-schema-version`"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf das Verzeichnis `plugins/majestic-engineer`","Nur YAML-Schemaverwaltung","Versionsunterstützung beschränkt auf die Verwaltung von `config-schema-version`"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao diretório `plugins/majestic-engineer`","Gerenciamento de esquema YAML apenas","Suporte à versionamento limitado ao gerenciamento de `config-schema-version`"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к каталогу `plugins/majestic-engineer`","Управление схемой YAML только","Поддержка версионирования ограничена управлением `config-schema-version`"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الدليل `plugins/majestic-engineer`","إدارة مخطط YAML فقط","دعم الإصدار محدود بإدارة `config-schema-version`"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
