et évolutives","de":"Frontend-Muster für die Entwicklung effizienter und skalierbarer Webanwendungen","pt":"Padrões de frontend modernos para melhorar a performance e a escalabilidade das aplicações. Aprenda a criar interfaces de usuário eficazes","ru":"Современные фронтенд-шаблоны для улучшения производительности и масштабируемости приложений. Узнайте, как создавать эффективные пользовательские интерфейсы","ar":"نماذج واجهة المستخدم الأمامية الحديثة لتحسين الأداء والتماسك التطبيقات. تعلم كيفية إنشاء واجهات مستخدم فعالة","en":"Spring Boot application and Angular application"},"definition":{"en":"Spring Boot application and Angular application"},"features":{"zh":["组件模式","组合优于继承","高性能用户界面","React和Next.js支持","现代前端开发最佳实践"],"ja":["コンポーネントパターン","コンポジションオーバーインヘリタンス","パフォーマンスの高いユーザーインターフェイス","ReactとNext.jsのサポート","モダンフロントエンド開発のベストプラクティス"],"ko":["컴포넌트 패턴","컴포지션 오버 인헤리튼스","고성능 사용자 인터페이스","React와 Next.js 지원","최신 프론트엔드 개발 모범 사례"],"es":["Componentes reutilizables","Arquitectura de frontend escalable","Patrones de diseño para interfaces de usuario","Optimización del rendimiento de la aplicación","Integración con frameworks como React y Next.js"],"fr":["Composants réutilisables","Architecture de frontend évolutives","Modèles de conception pour les interfaces utilisateur","Optimisation des performances de l''application","Intégration avec des frameworks tels que React et Next.js"],"de":["Wiederverwendbare Komponenten","Skalierbare Frontend-Architektur","Entwurfsmuster für Benutzeroberflächen","Optimierung der Anwendungsleistung","Integration mit Frameworks wie React und Next.js"],"pt":["Composition Over Inheritance","Component Patterns","Performant User Interfaces","React e Next.js","Desenvolvimento de frontend moderno","Melhoria da performance e escalabilidade"],"ru":["Композиция над наследованием","Компонентные шаблоны","Производительные пользовательские интерфейсы","React и Next.js","Современное фронтенд-разработка","Улучшение производительности и масштабируемости"],"ar":["التأليف على الوراثة","نماذج المكون","واجهات المستخدم عالية الأداء","React و Next.js","تطوير واجهة المستخدم الأمامية الحديثة","تحسين الأداء والتماسك"]},"keywords":{"zh":["前端开发模式","React","Next.js","组件模式","组合优于继承","高性能用户界面","前端开发最佳实践"],"ja":["フロントエンド開発パターン","React","Next.js","コンポーネントパターン","コンポジションオーバーインヘリタンス","パフォーマンスの高いユーザーインターフェイス","フロントエンド開発ベストプラクティス"],"ko":["프론트엔드 개발 패턴","React","Next.js","컴포넌트 패턴","컴포지션 오버 인헤리튼스","고성능 사용자 인터페이스","프론트엔드 개발 모범 사례"],"es":["patrones de frontend","desarrollo web","React","Next.js","interfaces de usuario","arquitectura de frontend","optimización del rendimiento","componentes reutilizables"],"fr":["modèles de frontend","développement web","React","Next.js","interfaces utilisateur","architecture de frontend","optimisation des performances","composants réutilisables"],"de":["Frontend-Muster","Webentwicklung","React","Next.js","Benutzeroberflächen","Frontend-Architektur","Leistungsoptimierung","wiederverwendbare Komponenten"],"pt":["padrões de frontend","desenvolvimento de frontend","React","Next.js","performant user interfaces","composition over inheritance","component patterns","frontend moderno","melhoria da performance"],"ru":["фронтенд-шаблоны","фронтенд-разработка","React","Next.js","производительные пользовательские интерфейсы","композиция над наследованием","компонентные шаблоны","современное фронтенд","улучшение производительности"],"ar":["نماذج واجهة المستخدم الأمامية","تطوير واجهة المستخدم الأمامية","React","Next.js","واجهات المستخدم عالية الأداء","التأليف على الوراثة","نماذج المكون","واجهة المستخدم الأمامية الحديثة","تحسين الأداء"]}},"owner":"vonomarap","repo":"kanokna","repoPath":"vonomarap/kanokna","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.425Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend-patterns","description":"Frontend development patterns for React, Next.js, state management, performance optimization, and UI best practices.","bodyPreview":"# Frontend Development Patterns\n\nModern frontend patterns for React, Next.js, and performant user interfaces.\n\n## Component Patterns\n\n### Composition Over Inheritance\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ GOOD: Component composition\ninterface CardProps {\n  children: React.ReactNode\n  variant?: ''default'' | ''outlined''\n}\n\nexport function Card({ children, variant = ''default'' }: CardProps) {\n  return <div className={`card card-${variant}`}>{children}</div>\n}\n\nexport function CardHeader({ children }: { children: React.","body":"# Frontend Development Patterns\n\nModern frontend patterns for React, Next.js, and performant user interfaces.\n\n## Component Patterns\n\n### Composition Over Inheritance\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ GOOD: Component composition\ninterface CardProps {\n  children: React.ReactNode\n  variant?: ''default'' | ''outlined''\n}\n\nexport function Card({ children, variant = ''default'' }: CardProps) {\n  return <div className={`card card-${variant}`}>{children}</div>\n}\n\nexport function CardHeader({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {\n  return <div className=\"card-header\">{children}</div>\n}\n\nexport function CardBody({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {\n  return <div className=\"card-body\">{children}</div>\n}\n\n// Usage\n<Card>\n  <CardHeader>Title</CardHeader>\n  <CardBody>Content</CardBody>\n</Card>\n```\n\n### Compound Components\n\n```typescript\ninterface TabsContextValue {\n  activeTab: string\n  setActiveTab: (tab: string) => void\n}\n\nconst TabsContext = createContext<TabsContextValue | undefined>(undefined)\n\nexport function Tabs({ children, defaultTab }: {\n  children: React.ReactNode\n  defaultTab: string\n}) {\n  const [activeTab, setActiveTab] = useState(defaultTab)\n\n  return (\n    <TabsContext.Provider value={{ activeTab, setActiveTab }}>\n      {children}\n    </TabsContext.Provider>\n  )\n}\n\nexport function TabList({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {\n  return <div className=\"tab-list\">{children}</div>\n}\n\nexport function Tab({ id, children }: { id: string, children: React.ReactNode }) {\n  const context = useContext(TabsContext)\n  if (!context) throw new Error(''Tab must be used within Tabs'')\n\n  return (\n    <button\n      className={context.activeTab === id ? ''active'' : ''''}\n      onClick={() => context.setActiveTab(id)}\n    >\n      {children}\n    </button>\n  )\n}\n\n// Usage\n<Tabs defaultTab=\"overview\">\n  <TabList>\n    <Tab id=\"overview\">Overview</Tab>\n    <Tab id=\"details\">Details</Tab>\n  </TabList>\n</Tabs>\n```\n\n### Render Props Pattern\n\n```typescript\ninterface DataLoaderProps<T> {\n  url: string\n  children: (data: T | null, loading: boolean, error: Error | null) => React.ReactNode\n}\n\nexport function DataLoader<T>({ url, children }: DataLoaderProps<T>) {\n  const [data, setData] = useState<T | null>(null)\n  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(true)\n  const [error, setError] = useState<Error | null>(null)\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    fetch(url)\n      .then(res => res.json())\n      .then(setData)\n      .catch(setError)\n      .finally(() => setLoading(false))\n  }, [url])\n\n  return <>{children(data, loading, error)}</>\n}\n\n// Usage\n<DataLoader<Market[]> url=\"/api/markets\">\n  {(markets, loading, error) => {\n    if (loading) return <Spinner />\n    if (error) return <Error error={error} />\n    return <MarketList markets={markets!} />\n  }}\n</DataLoader>\n```\n\n## Custom Hooks Patterns\n\n### State Management Hook\n\n```typescript\nexport function useToggle(initialValue = false): [boolean, () => void] {\n  const [value, setValue] = useState(initialValue)\n\n  const toggle = useCallback(() => {\n    setValue(v => !v)\n  }, [])\n\n  return [value, toggle]\n}\n\n// Usage\nconst [isOpen, toggleOpen] = useToggle()\n```\n\n### Async Data Fetching Hook\n\n```typescript\ninterface UseQueryOptions<T> {\n  onSuccess?: (data: T) => void\n  onError?: (error: Error) => void\n  enabled?: boolean\n}\n\nexport function useQuery<T>(\n  key: string,\n  fetcher: () => Promise<T>,\n  options?: UseQueryOptions<T>\n) {\n  const [data, setData] = useState<T | null>(null)\n  const [error, setError] = useState<Error | null>(null)\n  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(false)\n\n  const refetch = useCallback(async () => {\n    setLoading(true)\n    setError(null)\n\n    try {\n      const result = await fetcher()\n      setData(result)\n      options?.onSuccess?.(result)\n    } catch (err) {\n      const error = err as Error\n      setError(error)\n      options?.onError?.(error)\n    } finally {\n      setLoading(false)\n    }\n  }, [fetcher, options])\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    if (options?.enabled !== false) {\n      refetch()\n    }\n  }, [key, refetch, options?.enabled])\n\n  return { data, error, loading, refetch }\n}\n\n// Usage\nconst { data: markets, loading, error, refetch } = useQuery(\n  ''markets'',\n  () => fetch(''/api/markets'').then(r => r.json()),\n  {\n    onSuccess: data => console.log(''Fetched'', data.length, ''markets''),\n    onError: err => console.error(''Failed:'', err)\n  }\n)\n```\n\n### Debounce Hook\n\n```typescript\nexport function useDebounce<T>(value: T, delay: number): T {\n  const [debouncedValue, setDebouncedValue] = useState<T>(value)\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const handler = setTimeout(() => {\n      setDebouncedValue(value)\n    }, delay)\n\n    return () => clearTimeout(handler)\n  }, [value, delay])\n\n  return debouncedValue\n}\n\n// Usage\nconst [searchQuery, setSearchQuery] = useState('''')\nconst debouncedQuery = useDebounce(searchQuery, 500)\n\nuseEffect(() => {\n  if (debouncedQuery) {\n    performSearch(debouncedQuery)\n  }\n}, [debouncedQuery])\n```\n\n## State Management Patterns\n\n### Context + Reducer Pattern\n\n```typescript\ninterface State {\n  markets: Market[]\n  selectedMarket: Market | null\n  loading: boolean\n}\n\ntype Action =\n  | { type: ''SET_MARKETS''; payload: Market[] }\n  | { type: ''SELECT_MARKET''; payload: Market }\n  | { type: ''SET_LOADING''; payload: boolean }\n\nfunction reducer(state: State, action: Action): State {\n  switch (action.type) {\n    case ''SET_MARKETS'':\n      return { ...state, markets: action.payload }\n    case ''SELECT_MARKET'':\n      return { ...state, selectedMarket: action.payload }\n    case ''SET_LOADING'':\n      return { ...state, loading: action.payload }\n    default:\n      return state\n  }\n}\n\nconst MarketContext = createContext<{\n  state: State\n  dispatch: Dispatch<Action>\n} | undefined>(undefined)\n\nexport function MarketProvider({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {\n  const [state, dispatch] = useReducer(reducer, {\n    markets: [],\n    selectedMarket: null,\n    loading: false\n  })\n\n  return (\n    <MarketContext.Provider value={{ state, dispatch }}>\n      {children}\n    </MarketContext.Provider>\n  )\n}\n\nexport function useMarkets() {\n  const context = useContext(MarketContext)\n  if (!context) throw new Error(''useMarkets must be used within MarketProvider'')\n  return context\n}\n```\n\n## Performance Optimization\n\n### Memoization\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ useMemo for expensive computations\nconst sortedMarkets = useMemo(() => {\n  return markets.sort((a, b) => b.volume - a.volume)\n}, [markets])\n\n// ✅ useCallback for functions passed to children\nconst handleSearch = useCallback((query: string) => {\n  setSearchQuery(query)\n}, [])\n\n// ✅ React.memo for pure components\nexport const MarketCard = React.memo<MarketCardProps>(({ market }) => {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"market-card\">\n      <h3>{market.name}</h3>\n      <p>{market.description}</p>\n    </div>\n  )\n})\n```\n\n### Code Splitting & Lazy Loading\n\n```typescript\nimport { lazy, Suspense } from ''react''\n\n// ✅ Lazy load heavy components\nconst HeavyChart = lazy(() => import(''./HeavyChart''))\nconst ThreeJsBackground = lazy(() => import(''./ThreeJsBackground''))\n\nexport function Dashboard() {\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <Suspense fallback={<ChartSkeleton />}>\n        <HeavyChart data={data} />\n      </Suspense>\n\n      <Suspense fallback={null}>\n        <ThreeJsBackground />\n      </Suspense>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Virtualization for Long Lists\n\n```typescript\nimport { useVirtualizer } from ''@tanstack/react-virtual''\n\nexport function VirtualMarketList({ markets }: { markets: Market[] }) {\n  const parentRef = useRef<HTMLDivElement>(null)\n\n  const virtualizer = useVirtualizer({\n    count: markets.length,\n    getScrollElement: () => parentRef.current,\n    estimateSize: () => 100,  // Estimated row height\n    overscan: 5  // Extra items to render\n  })\n\n  return (\n    <div ref={parentRef} style={{ height: ''600px'', overflow: ''auto'' }}>\n      <div\n        style={{\n          height: `${virtualizer.getTotalSize()}px`,\n          position: ''relative''\n        }}\n      >\n        {virtualizer.getVirtualItems().map(virtualRow => (\n          <div\n            key={virtualRow.index}\n            style={{\n              position: ''absolute'',\n              top: 0,\n              left: 0,\n              width: ''100%'',\n              height: `${virtualRow.size}px`,\n              transform: `translateY(${virtualRow.start}px)`\n            }}\n          >\n            <MarketCard market={markets[virtualRow.index]} />\n          </div>\n        ))}\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Form Handling Patterns\n\n### Controlled Form with Validation\n\n```typescript\ninterface FormData {\n  name: string\n  description: string\n  endDate: string\n}\n\ninterface FormErrors {\n  name?: string\n  description?: string\n  endDate?: string\n}\n\nexport function CreateMarketForm() {\n  const [formData, setFormData] = useState<FormData>({\n    name: '''',\n    description: '''',\n    endDate: ''''\n  })\n\n  const [errors, setErrors] = useState<FormErrors>({})\n\n  const validate = (): boolean => {\n    const newErrors: FormErrors = {}\n\n    if (!formData.name.trim()) {\n      newErrors.name = ''Name is required''\n    } else if (formData.name.length > 200) {\n      newErrors.name = ''Name must be under 200 characters''\n    }\n\n    if (!formData.description.trim()) {\n      newErrors.description = ''Description is required''\n    }\n\n    if (!formData.endDate) {\n      newErrors.endDate = ''End date is required''\n    }\n\n    setErrors(newErrors)\n    return Object.keys(newErrors).length === 0\n  }\n\n  const handleSubmit = async (e: React.FormEvent) => {\n    e.preventDefault()\n\n    if (!validate()) return\n\n    try {\n      await createMarket(formData)\n      // Success handling\n    } catch (error) {\n      // Error handling\n    }\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <form onSubmit={handleSubmit}>\n      <input\n        value={formData.name}\n        onChange={e => setFormData(prev => ({ ...prev, name: e.target.value }))}\n        placeholder=\"Market name\"\n      />\n      {errors.name && <span className=\"error\">{errors.name}</span>}\n\n      {/* Other fields */}\n\n      <button type=\"submit\">Create Market</button>\n    </form>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Error Boundary Pattern\n\n```typescript\ninterface ErrorBoundaryState {\n  hasError: boolean\n  error: Error | null\n}\n\nexport class ErrorBoundary extends React.Component<\n  { children: React.ReactNode },\n  ErrorBoundaryState\n> {\n  state: ErrorBoundaryState = {\n    hasError: false,\n    error: null\n  }\n\n  static getDerivedStateFromError(error: Error): ErrorBoundaryState {\n    return { hasError: true, error }\n  }\n\n  componentDidCatch(error: Error, errorInfo: React.ErrorInfo) {\n    console.error(''Error boundary caught:'', error, errorInfo)\n  }\n\n  render() {\n    if (this.state.hasError) {\n      return (\n        <div className=\"error-fallback\">\n          <h2>Something went wrong</h2>\n          <p>{this.state.error?.message}</p>\n          <button onClick={() => this.setState({ hasError: false })}>\n            Try again\n          </button>\n        </div>\n      )\n    }\n\n    return this.props.children\n  }\n}\n\n// Usage\n<ErrorBoundary>\n  <App />\n</ErrorBoundary>\n```\n\n## Animation Patterns\n\n### Framer Motion Animations\n\n```typescript\nimport { motion, AnimatePresence } from ''framer-motion''\n\n// ✅ List animations\nexport function AnimatedMarketList({ markets }: { markets: Market[] }) {\n  return (\n    <AnimatePresence>\n      {markets.map(market => (\n        <motion.div\n          key={market.id}\n          initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 20 }}\n          animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}\n          exit={{ opacity: 0, y: -20 }}\n          transition={{ duration: 0.3 }}\n        >\n          <MarketCard market={market} />\n        </motion.div>\n      ))}\n    </AnimatePresence>\n  )\n}\n\n// ✅ Modal animations\nexport function Modal({ isOpen, onClose, children }: ModalProps) {\n  return (\n    <AnimatePresence>\n      {isOpen && (\n        <>\n          <motion.div\n            className=\"modal-overlay\"\n            initial={{ opacity: 0 }}\n            animate={{ opacity: 1 }}\n            exit={{ opacity: 0 }}\n            onClick={onClose}\n          />\n          <motion.div\n            className=\"modal-content\"\n            initial={{ opacity: 0, scale: 0.9, y: 20 }}\n            animate={{ opacity: 1, scale: 1, y: 0 }}\n            exit={{ opacity: 0, scale: 0.9, y: 20 }}\n          >\n            {children}\n          </motion.div>\n        </>\n      )}\n    </AnimatePresence>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Accessibility Patterns\n\n### Keyboard Navigation\n\n```typescript\nexport function Dropdown({ options, onSelect }: DropdownProps) {\n  const [isOpen, setIsOpen] = useState(false)\n  const [activeIndex, setActiveIndex] = useState(0)\n\n  const handleKeyDown = (e: React.KeyboardEvent) => {\n    switch (e.key) {\n      case ''ArrowDown'':\n        e.preventDefault()\n        setActiveIndex(i => Math.min(i + 1, options.length - 1))\n        break\n      case ''ArrowUp'':\n        e.preventDefault()\n        setActiveIndex(i => Math.max(i - 1, 0))\n        break\n      case ''Enter'':\n        e.preventDefault()\n        onSelect(options[activeIndex])\n        setIsOpen(false)\n        break\n      case ''Escape'':\n        setIsOpen(false)\n        break\n    }\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <div\n      role=\"combobox\"\n      aria-expanded={isOpen}\n      aria-haspopup=\"listbox\"\n      onKeyDown={handleKeyDown}\n    >\n      {/* Dropdown implementation */}\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Focus Management\n\n```typescript\nexport function Modal({ isOpen, onClose, children }: ModalProps) {\n  const modalRef = useRef<HTMLDivElement>(null)\n  const previousFocusRef = useRef<HTMLElement | null>(null)\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    if (isOpen) {\n      // Save currently focused element\n      previousFocusRef.current = document.activeElement as HTMLElement\n\n      // Focus modal\n      modalRef.current?.focus()\n    } else {\n      // Restore focus when closing\n      previousFocusRef.current?.focus()\n    }\n  }, [isOpen])\n\n  return isOpen ? (\n    <div\n      ref={modalRef}\n      role=\"dialog\"\n      aria-modal=\"true\"\n      tabIndex={-1}\n      onKeyDown={e => e.key === ''Escape'' && onClose()}\n    >\n      {children}\n    </div>\n  ) : null\n}\n```\n\n**Remember**: Modern frontend patterns enable maintainable, performant user interfaces. Choose patterns that fit your project complexity.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:48:33.509Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full Stack Agents needing advanced frontend development patterns for React and Angular applications.","zh":"适用于需要高级前端开发模式的全栈代理，特别是React和Angular应用。","ja":"フルスタックエージェントがReactおよびAngularアプリケーション向けの高度なフロントエンド開発パターンを必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"React와 Angular 애플리케이션을 위한 고급 프론트엔드 개발 패턴이 필요한 풀스택 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Full Stack que necesitan patrones de desarrollo frontend avanzados para aplicaciones de React y Angular.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full Stack ayant besoin de modèles de développement frontend avancés pour les applications React et Angular.","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agents, die erweiterte Frontend-Entwicklungsmuster für React- und Angular-Anwendungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full Stack que precisam de padrões avançados de desenvolvimento frontend para aplicações React e Angular.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Full Stack, которым необходимы продвинутые шаблоны разработки frontend для приложений React и Angular.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء كامل الحزمة الذين يحتاجون إلى أنماط متقدمة من تطوير واجهة المستخدم لReact وتطبيقات Angular."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create performant user interfaces using composition over inheritance, leveraging React and Next.js for optimized component rendering, and utilizing TypeScript for type-safe development.","zh":"使代理能够使用组合而非继承创建高性能用户界面，利用React和Next.js进行优化的组件渲染，并使用TypeScript进行类型安全开发。","ja":"エージェントが、コンポジションを継承よりも優先して高パフォーマンスのユーザーインターフェイスを作成できるようにし、ReactとNext.jsを使用してコンポーネントのレンダリングを最適化し、TypeScriptを使用して型セーフの開発を行う。","ko":"에이전트가 상속보다 조합을 우선하여 고성능 사용자 인터페이스를 생성할 수 있도록 하며, React와 Next.js를 사용하여 컴포넌트 렌더링을 최적화하며, TypeScript를 사용하여 타입 안전 개발을 수행할 수 있습니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear interfaces de usuario de alto rendimiento utilizando la composición en lugar de la herencia, aprovechando React y Next.js para una renderización de componentes optimizada, y utilizando TypeScript para un desarrollo seguro de tipos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des interfaces utilisateur performantes en utilisant la composition au lieu de l''héritage, en exploitant React et Next.js pour un rendu de composants optimisé, et en utilisant TypeScript pour un développement sûr de types.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, leistungsstarke Benutzeroberflächen zu erstellen, indem sie die Komposition anstelle von Vererbung verwenden, React und Next.js für eine optimierte Komponentenrendering nutzen und TypeScript für eine typsichere Entwicklung verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar interfaces de usuário de alto desempenho usando composição em vez de herança, aproveitando React e Next.js para renderização de componentes otimizada e utilizando TypeScript para desenvolvimento seguro de tipos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать высокопроизводительные пользовательские интерфейсы, используя композицию вместо наследования, используя React и Next.js для оптимизированной отрисовки компонентов и используя TypeScript для типобезопасного развития.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية إنشاء واجهات مستخدم عالية الأداء باستخدام التكوين بدلاً من الوراثة، واستخدام React و Next.js لعرض المكونات المُختزلة، واستخدام TypeScript لتطوير آمن من النوع."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing component patterns for reusable UI components","Optimizing React applications for better performance and scalability","Generating responsive and accessible user interfaces with Next.js"],"zh":["为可复用UI组件实现组件模式","优化React应用以提高性能和可扩展性","使用Next.js生成响应式和可访问的用户界面"],"ja":["再利用可能なUIコンポーネントのためのコンポーネントパターンの実装","パフォーマンスとスケーラビリティの向上のためのReactアプリケーションの最適化","Next.jsを使用したレスポンシブでアクセス可能なユーザーインターフェイスの生成"],"ko":["재사용 가능한 UI 컴포넌트를 위한 컴포넌트 패턴 구현","성능과 확장성 향상을 위한 React 애플리케이션 최적화","Next.js를 사용한 반응형 및 접근 가능한 사용자 인터페이스 생성"],"es":["Implementación de patrones de componentes para componentes de interfaz de usuario reutilizables","Optimización de aplicaciones de React para un mejor rendimiento y escalabilidad","Generación de interfaces de usuario responsivas y accesibles con Next.js"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre de modèles de composants pour des composants d''interface utilisateur réutilisables","Optimisation des applications React pour de meilleures performances et une meilleure évolutivité","Génération d''interfaces utilisateur réactives et accessibles avec Next.js"],"de":["Implementierung von Komponentenmustern für wiederverwendbare Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten","Optimierung von React-Anwendungen für bessere Leistung und Skalierbarkeit","Erzeugung von responsiven und zugänglichen Benutzeroberflächen mit Next.js"],"pt":["Implementação de padrões de componentes para componentes de interface de usuário reutilizáveis","Otimização de aplicações React para melhor desempenho e escalabilidade","Geração de interfaces de usuário responsivas e acessíveis com Next.js"],"ru":["Реализация шаблонов компонентов для многоразовых компонентов пользовательского интерфейса","Оптимизация приложений React для лучшей производительности и масштабируемости","Генерация адаптивных и доступных пользовательских интерфейсов с помощью Next.js"],"ar":["تنفيذ أنماط المكونات لمكونات واجهة المستخدم القابلة لإعادة الاستخدام","تحسين أداء التطبيقات React من أجل الأداء والإمكانية أفضل","توليد واجهات المستخدم المتاحة والمدعومة مع Next.js"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of TypeScript and JavaScript","Limited to React, Next.js, and Angular frameworks","Frontend development expertise necessary for effective utilization"],"zh":["需要TypeScript和JavaScript的知识","仅限React、Next.js和Angular框架","需要前端开发专业知识以有效利用"],"ja":["TypeScriptとJavaScriptの知識が必要","React、Next.js、Angularフレームワークのみ","有効な活用にはフロントエンド開発の専門知識が必要"],"ko":["TypeScript와 JavaScript에 대한 지식이 필요합니다.","React, Next.js 및 Angular 프레임워크에만 제한됨","유효한 활용을 위해서는 프론트엔드 개발 전문 지식이 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de TypeScript y JavaScript","Limitado a los frameworks React, Next.js y Angular","Se requiere experiencia en desarrollo frontend para una utilización efectiva"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en TypeScript et JavaScript","Limité aux frameworks React, Next.js et Angular","Une expertise en développement frontend est nécessaire pour une utilisation efficace"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von TypeScript und JavaScript","Begrenzt auf die Frameworks React, Next.js und Angular","Frontend-Entwicklungsexpertise ist für eine effektive Nutzung erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de TypeScript e JavaScript","Limitado a estruturas React, Next.js e Angular","É necessária especialização em desenvolvimento frontend para utilização eficaz"],"ru":["Требуется знание TypeScript и JavaScript","Ограничен рамками React, Next.js и Angular","Необходима эк