bjetivo é identificar problemas de SEO e fornecer recomendações para melhorar o desempenho de busca orgânica","ru":"Цель - выявить проблемы SEO и предоставить рекомендации для улучшения органического результата поиска","ar":"الهدف هو تحديد مشاكل تحسين محركات البحث وتقديم توصيات لتحسين أداء البحث العضوي","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["SEO","SEO","SEO","SEO"],"ja":["SEO","SEO","SEO","SEO"],"ko":["SEO","SEO","SEO","SEO"],"es":["Análisis de contexto del sitio","Identificación de problemas de SEO","Recomendaciones para mejorar el rendimiento","Análisis de tráfico orgánico","Identificación de palabras clave prioritarias"],"fr":["Analyse du contexte du site","Identification des problèmes de SEO","Recommandations pour améliorer les performances","Analyse du trafic organique","Identification des mots-clés prioritaires"],"de":["Analyse des Seitenkontexts","Identifizierung von SEO-Problemen","Empfehlungen zur Leistungsverbesserung","Analyse des organischen Traffics","Identifizierung von Prioritäts-Suchbegriffen"],"pt":["Análise de contexto do site","Avaliação do estado atual do site","Identificação de problemas de SEO","Recomendações para melhorar o desempenho de busca","Análise de tráfego orgânico","Otimização de palavras-chave"],"ru":["Анализ контекста сайта","Оценка текущего состояния сайта","Выявление проблем SEO","Рекомендации для улучшения результата поиска","Анализ органического трафика","Оптимизация ключевых слов"],"ar":["تحليل سياق الموقع","تقييم الحالة الحالية للموقع","تحديد مشاكل تحسين محركات البحث","توصيات لتحسين أداء البحث","تحليل حركة المرور العضوي","تحسين الكلمات الرئيسية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["SEO","SEO","SEO","SEO","SEO","SEO"],"ja":["SEO","SEO","SEO","SEO","SEO","SEO"],"ko":["SEO","SEO","SEO","SEO","SEO","SEO"],"es":["auditoría SEO","optimización de búsqueda","posicionamiento en buscadores","mejora de rendimiento","análisis de tráfico orgánico","palabras clave prioritarias"],"fr":["audit SEO","optimisation de recherche","référencement","amélioration des performances","analyse du trafic organique","mots-clés prioritaires"],"de":["SEO-Audit","Suchmaschinen-Optimierung","Suchmaschinen-Positionierung","Leistungsverbesserung","Organic-Suchanalyse","Prioritäts-Suchbegriffe"],"pt":["análise de SEO","otimização de desempenho de busca","recomendações de SEO","problemas de SEO","tráfego orgânico","palavras-chave","desempenho de busca","otimização de site","análise de site"],"ru":["аудит SEO","оптимизация результата поиска","рекомендации SEO","проблемы SEO","органический трафик","ключевые слова","результат поиска","оптимизация сайта","анализ сайта"],"ar":["تدقيق محركات البحث","تحسين أداء البحث","توصيات تحسين محركات البحث","مشاكل تحسين محركات البحث","حركة المرور العضوي","الكلمات الرئيسية","أداء البحث","تحسين موقع","تحليل موقع"]}},"owner":"zerdos","repo":"spike-land-nextjs","repoPath":"zerdos/spike-land-nextjs","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.425Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"seo-audit","description":"When the user wants to audit, review, or diagnose SEO issues on their site. Also use when the user mentions SEO audit, technical SEO, why am I not ranking, SEO issues, on-page SEO, meta tags review, or SEO health check. For building pages at scale to target keywords, see programmatic-seo. For adding structured data, see schema-markup.","bodyPreview":"# SEO Audit\n\nYou are an expert in search engine optimization. Your goal is to identify SEO issues and provide actionable recommendations to improve organic search performance.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\nBefore auditing, understand:\n\n1. **Site Context**\n   - What type of site? (SaaS, e-commerce, blog, etc.)\n   - What''s the primary business goal for SEO?\n   - What keywords/topics are priorities?\n\n2. **Current State**\n   - Any known issues or concerns?\n   - Current organic traffic level?\n   - Recent c","body":"# SEO Audit\n\nYou are an expert in search engine optimization. Your goal is to identify SEO issues and provide actionable recommendations to improve organic search performance.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\nBefore auditing, understand:\n\n1. **Site Context**\n   - What type of site? (SaaS, e-commerce, blog, etc.)\n   - What''s the primary business goal for SEO?\n   - What keywords/topics are priorities?\n\n2. **Current State**\n   - Any known issues or concerns?\n   - Current organic traffic level?\n   - Recent changes or migrations?\n\n3. **Scope**\n   - Full site audit or specific pages?\n   - Technical + on-page, or one focus area?\n   - Access to Search Console / analytics?\n\n---\n\n## Audit Framework\n\n### Priority Order\n\n1. **Crawlability & Indexation** (can Google find and index it?)\n2. **Technical Foundations** (is the site fast and functional?)\n3. **On-Page Optimization** (is content optimized?)\n4. **Content Quality** (does it deserve to rank?)\n5. **Authority & Links** (does it have credibility?)\n\n---\n\n## Technical SEO Audit\n\n### Crawlability\n\n**Robots.txt**\n\n- Check for unintentional blocks\n- Verify important pages allowed\n- Check sitemap reference\n\n**XML Sitemap**\n\n- Exists and accessible\n- Submitted to Search Console\n- Contains only canonical, indexable URLs\n- Updated regularly\n- Proper formatting\n\n**Site Architecture**\n\n- Important pages within 3 clicks of homepage\n- Logical hierarchy\n- Internal linking structure\n- No orphan pages\n\n**Crawl Budget Issues** (for large sites)\n\n- Parameterized URLs under control\n- Faceted navigation handled properly\n- Infinite scroll with pagination fallback\n- Session IDs not in URLs\n\n### Indexation\n\n**Index Status**\n\n- site:domain.com check\n- Search Console coverage report\n- Compare indexed vs. expected\n\n**Indexation Issues**\n\n- Noindex tags on important pages\n- Canonicals pointing wrong direction\n- Redirect chains/loops\n- Soft 404s\n- Duplicate content without canonicals\n\n**Canonicalization**\n\n- All pages have canonical tags\n- Self-referencing canonicals on unique pages\n- HTTP → HTTPS canonicals\n- www vs. non-www consistency\n- Trailing slash consistency\n\n### Site Speed & Core Web Vitals\n\n**Core Web Vitals**\n\n- LCP (Largest Contentful Paint): < 2.5s\n- INP (Interaction to Next Paint): < 200ms\n- CLS (Cumulative Layout Shift): < 0.1\n\n**Speed Factors**\n\n- Server response time (TTFB)\n- Image optimization\n- JavaScript execution\n- CSS delivery\n- Caching headers\n- CDN usage\n- Font loading\n\n**Tools**\n\n- PageSpeed Insights\n- WebPageTest\n- Chrome DevTools\n- Search Console Core Web Vitals report\n\n### Mobile-Friendliness\n\n- Responsive design (not separate m. site)\n- Tap target sizes\n- Viewport configured\n- No horizontal scroll\n- Same content as desktop\n- Mobile-first indexing readiness\n\n### Security & HTTPS\n\n- HTTPS across entire site\n- Valid SSL certificate\n- No mixed content\n- HTTP → HTTPS redirects\n- HSTS header (bonus)\n\n### URL Structure\n\n- Readable, descriptive URLs\n- Keywords in URLs where natural\n- Consistent structure\n- No unnecessary parameters\n- Lowercase and hyphen-separated\n\n---\n\n## On-Page SEO Audit\n\n### Title Tags\n\n**Check for:**\n\n- Unique titles for each page\n- Primary keyword near beginning\n- 50-60 characters (visible in SERP)\n- Compelling and click-worthy\n- Brand name placement (end, usually)\n\n**Common issues:**\n\n- Duplicate titles\n- Too long (truncated)\n- Too short (wasted opportunity)\n- Keyword stuffing\n- Missing entirely\n\n### Meta Descriptions\n\n**Check for:**\n\n- Unique descriptions per page\n- 150-160 characters\n- Includes primary keyword\n- Clear value proposition\n- Call to action\n\n**Common issues:**\n\n- Duplicate descriptions\n- Auto-generated garbage\n- Too long/short\n- No compelling reason to click\n\n### Heading Structure\n\n**Check for:**\n\n- One H1 per page\n- H1 contains primary keyword\n- Logical hierarchy (H1 → H2 → H3)\n- Headings describe content\n- Not just for styling\n\n**Common issues:**\n\n- Multiple H1s\n- Skip levels (H1 → H3)\n- Headings used for styling only\n- No H1 on page\n\n### Content Optimization\n\n**Primary Page Content**\n\n- Keyword in first 100 words\n- Related keywords naturally used\n- Sufficient depth/length for topic\n- Answers search intent\n- Better than competitors\n\n**Thin Content Issues**\n\n- Pages with little unique content\n- Tag/category pages with no value\n- Doorway pages\n- Duplicate or near-duplicate content\n\n### Image Optimization\n\n**Check for:**\n\n- Descriptive file names\n- Alt text on all images\n- Alt text describes image\n- Compressed file sizes\n- Modern formats (WebP)\n- Lazy loading implemented\n- Responsive images\n\n### Internal Linking\n\n**Check for:**\n\n- Important pages well-linked\n- Descriptive anchor text\n- Logical link relationships\n- No broken internal links\n- Reasonable link count per page\n\n**Common issues:**\n\n- Orphan pages (no internal links)\n- Over-optimized anchor text\n- Important pages buried\n- Excessive footer/sidebar links\n\n### Keyword Targeting\n\n**Per Page**\n\n- Clear primary keyword target\n- Title, H1, URL aligned\n- Content satisfies search intent\n- Not competing with other pages (cannibalization)\n\n**Site-Wide**\n\n- Keyword mapping document\n- No major gaps in coverage\n- No keyword cannibalization\n- Logical topical clusters\n\n---\n\n## Content Quality Assessment\n\n### E-E-A-T Signals\n\n**Experience**\n\n- First-hand experience demonstrated\n- Original insights/data\n- Real examples and case studies\n\n**Expertise**\n\n- Author credentials visible\n- Accurate, detailed information\n- Properly sourced claims\n\n**Authoritativeness**\n\n- Recognized in the space\n- Cited by others\n- Industry credentials\n\n**Trustworthiness**\n\n- Accurate information\n- Transparent about business\n- Contact information available\n- Privacy policy, terms\n- Secure site (HTTPS)\n\n### Content Depth\n\n- Comprehensive coverage of topic\n- Answers follow-up questions\n- Better than top-ranking competitors\n- Updated and current\n\n### User Engagement Signals\n\n- Time on page\n- Bounce rate in context\n- Pages per session\n- Return visits\n\n---\n\n## Common Issues by Site Type\n\n### SaaS/Product Sites\n\n- Product pages lack content depth\n- Blog not integrated with product pages\n- Missing comparison/alternative pages\n- Feature pages thin on content\n- No glossary/educational content\n\n### E-commerce\n\n- Thin category pages\n- Duplicate product descriptions\n- Missing product schema\n- Faceted navigation creating duplicates\n- Out-of-stock pages mishandled\n\n### Content/Blog Sites\n\n- Outdated content not refreshed\n- Keyword cannibalization\n- No topical clustering\n- Poor internal linking\n- Missing author pages\n\n### Local Business\n\n- Inconsistent NAP\n- Missing local schema\n- No Google Business Profile optimization\n- Missing location pages\n- No local content\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Audit Report Structure\n\n**Executive Summary**\n\n- Overall health assessment\n- Top 3-5 priority issues\n- Quick wins identified\n\n**Technical SEO Findings**\nFor each issue:\n\n- **Issue**: What''s wrong\n- **Impact**: SEO impact (High/Medium/Low)\n- **Evidence**: How you found it\n- **Fix**: Specific recommendation\n- **Priority**: 1-5 or High/Medium/Low\n\n**On-Page SEO Findings**\nSame format as above\n\n**Content Findings**\nSame format as above\n\n**Prioritized Action Plan**\n\n1. Critical fixes (blocking indexation/ranking)\n2. High-impact improvements\n3. Quick wins (easy, immediate benefit)\n4. Long-term recommendations\n\n---\n\n## Tools Referenced\n\n**Free Tools**\n\n- Google Search Console (essential)\n- Google PageSpeed Insights\n- Bing Webmaster Tools\n- Rich Results Test\n- Mobile-Friendly Test\n- Schema Validator\n\n**Paid Tools** (if available)\n\n- Screaming Frog\n- Ahrefs / Semrush\n- Sitebulb\n- ContentKing\n\n---\n\n## Questions to Ask\n\nIf you need more context:\n\n1. What pages/keywords matter most?\n2. Do you have Search Console access?\n3. Any recent changes or migrations?\n4. Who are your top organic competitors?\n5. What''s your current organic traffic baseline?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **programmatic-seo**: For building SEO pages at scale\n- **schema-markup**: For implementing structured data\n- **page-cro**: For optimizing pages for conversion (not just ranking)\n- **analytics-tracking**: For measuring SEO performance\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:48:49.256Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Digital Marketing Agents needing in-depth website analysis and optimization capabilities for improved organic search performance.","zh":"非常适合需要对网站进行深入分析和优化以提高有机搜索性能的数字营销代理。","ja":"デジタルマーケティングエージェントがウェブサイトを分析、最適化して、オーガニック検索のパフォーマンスを向上させるために最適です。","ko":"웹사이트를 분석하고 최적화하여 유기적 검색 성능을 향상시키는 디지털 마케팅 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de marketing digital que necesitan un análisis y capacidades de optimización de sitios web en profundidad para mejorar el rendimiento de búsqueda orgánica.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de marketing numérique ayant besoin d''une analyse et de capacités d''optimisation de sites web approfondies pour améliorer les performances de recherche organique.","de":"Perfekt für digitale Marketing-Agenten, die eine umfassende Analyse und Optimierungsfähigkeiten für Websites benötigen, um die organische Suchleistung zu verbessern.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Marketing Digital que precisam de análise e otimização de sites em profundidade para melhorar o desempenho de busca orgânica.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов цифрового маркетинга, которым необходимы глубокий анализ и оптимизация веб-сайтов для улучшения органической поисковой производительности.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تسويق رقمي الذين يحتاجون إلى تحليل موقع إلكتروني متعمق وقدرات تحسين لأداء البحث العضوي المحسّن."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to identify SEO issues and provide actionable recommendations using site context analysis, keyword prioritization, and current state assessments, leveraging protocols like HTTP and file formats such as XML sitemaps.","zh":"使代理能够通过网站上下文分析、关键词优先级和当前状态评估等手段识别SEO问题，并提供可行的建议，利用HTTP等协议和XML站点地图等文件格式。","ja":"エージェントがサイトのコンテキスト分析、キーワードの優先順位付け、現在の状態の評価などの手段を用いてSEOの問題を特定し、HTTPなどのプロトコルやXMLサイトマップなどのファイル形式を利用して実行可能な推奨事項を提供できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 사이트 컨텍스트 분석, 키워드 우선 순위 지정 및 현재 상태 평가 등을 통해 SEO 문제를 식별하고 HTTP 및 XML 사이트맵 등의 프로토콜 및 파일 형식을 활용하여 실행 가능한 추천을 제공할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a identificar problemas de SEO y proporcionar recomendaciones con acciones utilizando análisis de contexto de sitio, priorización de palabras clave y evaluaciones del estado actual, aprovechando protocolos como HTTP y formatos de archivo como mapas del sitio XML.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''identifier les problèmes de SEO et de fournir des recommandations avec des actions en utilisant l''analyse de contexte de site, la priorisation des mots-clés et les évaluations de l''état actuel, en exploitant des protocoles comme HTTP et des formats de fichiers tels que les cartes de site XML.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, SEO-Probleme zu identifizieren und handhabbare Empfehlungen unter Verwendung von Site-Kontextanalyse, Keyword-Priorisierung und aktuellen Zustandsbewertungen zu geben, indem Protokolle wie HTTP und Dateiformate wie XML-Site-Maps genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a identificar problemas de SEO e fornecer recomendações eficazes usando análise de contexto do site, priorização de palavras-chave e avaliações do estado atual, aproveitando protocolos como HTTP e formatos de arquivo como mapas do site XML.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выявлять проблемы SEO и предоставлять действенные рекомендации с помощью анализа контекста сайта, приоритизации ключевых слов и оценок текущего состояния, используя такие протоколы, как HTTP, и форматы файлов, такие как XML-карты сайта.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تحديد مشاكل تحسين محركات البحث وتقديم توصيات قابلة للتنفيذ باستخدام تحليل سياق الموقع وتحديد أولويات الكلمات الرئيسية وتقييمات الحالة الراهنة، مستفيداً من بروتوكولات مثل HTTP وتنسيقات الملفات مثل خريطة الموقع XML."},"useCases":{"en":["Auditing website structures for technical SEO issues","Analyzing keyword strategies for content optimization","Generating recommendations for improving organic traffic levels"],"zh":["审计网站结构以查找技术SEO问题","分析关键词策略以优化内容","生成提高有机流量水平的建议"],"ja":["技術的なSEOの問題を特定するためにウェブサイト構造を監査する","コンテンツの最適化のためにキーワード戦略を分析する","オーガニックトラフィックレベルを向上させるための推奨事項を生成する"],"ko":["기술적인 SEO 문제를 식별하기 위한 웹사이트 구조 감사","콘텐츠 최적화를 위한 키워드 전략 분석","유기적 트래픽 레벨을 향상시키는 추천서 생성"],"es":["Auditoría de estructuras de sitios web para problemas de SEO técnicos","Análisis de estrategias de palabras clave para la optimización de contenido","Generación de recomendaciones para mejorar los niveles de tráfico orgánico"],"fr":["Audit des structures de sites web pour les problèmes de SEO techniques","Analyse des stratégies de mots-clés pour l''optimisation de contenu","Génération de recommandations pour améliorer les niveaux de trafic organique"],"de":["Prüfung von Website-Strukturen auf technische SEO-Probleme","Analyse von Keyword-Strategien für die Inhaltsoptimierung","Generierung von Empfehlungen zur Verbesserung der organischen Traffik-Level"],"pt":["Auditoria de estruturas de sites para problemas técnicos de SEO","Análise de estratégias de palavras-chave para otimização de conteúdo","Geração de recomendações para melhorar os níveis de tráfego orgânico"],"ru":["Проверка структуры сайта на технические проблемы SEO","Анализ стратегий ключевых слов для оптимизации контента","Генерация рекомендаций для улучшения уровней органического трафика"],"ar":["فحص هيكل الموقع الإلكتروني لمشاكل تقنية متعلقة بتحسين محركات البحث","تحليل استراتيجيات الكلمات الرئيسية لتحسين المحتوى","توليد التوصيات لتحسين مستويات حركة المرور العضوية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires website access for crawling and analysis","Limited to public-facing website data"],"zh":["需要网站访问权限以进行爬行和分析","仅限于公共网站数据"],"ja":["クロールと分析のためにウェブサイトへのアクセスが必要","パブリックなウェブサイトデータのみに限定される"],"ko":["크롤링 및 분석을 위해 웹사이트 접근 권한이 필요함","공개 웹사이트 데이터에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso al sitio web para crawling y análisis","Limitado a datos de sitios web de cara al público"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au site web pour le crawling et l''analyse","Limité aux données de sites web destinées au public"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Website für Crawling und Analyse","Begrenzt auf öffentlich zugängliche Website-Daten"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao site para rastreamento e análise","Limitado a dados de site de acesso público"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к сайту для краулинга и анализа","Ограничен данными публично доступного сайта"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الموقع لتحليل ومراقبة الموقع","محدود بالبيانات العامة للموقع"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('nicolas-deyros/astro-portfolio-v2/playwright', 'community', 'nicolas-deyros', 'astro-portfolio-v2', 'nicolas-deyros/astro-portfolio-v2', 'playwright', 0, 0, 30, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.425Z', '2026-02-18T04:49:19.694Z', NULL, '{"id":"nicolas-deyros/astro-portfolio-v2/playwright","name":"playwright","description":{"zh":"Playwright 测试最佳实践指南，帮助您优化测试代码和结构","ja":"Playwright テストのベストプラクティスを紹介します","ko":"Playwright 테스트 최적화 가이드: 테스트 코드와 구조를 최적화하는 방법","es":"Playwright es una herramienta de prueba de extremo a extremo que permite a los desarrolladores crear pruebas automatizadas para aplicaciones web","fr":"Playwright est un outil de test de bout en bout qui permet aux développeurs de créer des tests automatisés pour les applications web","de":"Playwright ist ein Tool für das Testen von End-to-End, das es Entwicklern ermöglicht, automatisierte Tests für Webanwendungen zu erstellen","pt":"Playwright é uma ferramenta de teste de ponta a ponta que ajuda a garantir a qualidade do seu código. Aprenda a usá-la com eficácia","ru":"Playwright — это инструмент для тестирования от конца до конца, который помогает обеспечить качество вашего кода. Узнайте, как им эффективно пользоваться","ar":"Playwright هي أداة لاختبار النهاية إلى النهاية التي تساعد على ضمان جودة кодك. تعلم كيفية استخدامها بفعالية","en":"Personal Portfolio build with Astro 🚀"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Playwright 测试最佳实践","ja":"Playwright テストのベストプラクティス","ko":"Playwright 테스트 최적화","es":"Playwright: Mejores Prácticas de Pruebas","fr":"Playwright: Bonnes Pratiques de Test","de":"Playwright: Best Practices für Tests","pt":"Práticas de Teste com Playwright","ru":"Лучшие практики тестирования с Playwright","ar":"أفضل ممارسات اختبار Playwright","en":"playwright"},"description":{"zh":"Playwright 测试最佳实践指南，帮助您优化测试代码和结构","ja":"Playwright テストのベストプラクティスを紹介します","ko":"Playwright 테스트 최적화 가이드: 테스트 코드와 구조를 최적화하는 방법","es":"Playwright es una herramienta de prueba de extremo a extremo que permite a los desarrolladores crear pruebas automatizadas para aplicaciones web","fr":"Playwright est un outil de test de bout en bout qui permet aux développeurs de créer des tests automatisés pour les applications web","de":"Playwright ist ein Tool für das Testen von End-to-End, das es Entwicklern ermöglicht, automatisierte Tests für Webanwendungen zu erstellen","pt":"Playwright é uma ferramenta de teste de ponta a ponta que ajuda a garantir a qualidade do seu código. Aprenda a usá-la com eficácia","ru":"Playwright — это инструмент для тестирования от конца до конца, который помогает обеспечить качество вашего кода. Узнайте, как им эффективно пользоваться","ar":"Playwright هي أداة لاختبار النهاية إلى النهاية التي تساعد على ضمان جودة кодك. تعلم كيفية استخدامها بفعالية","en":"Personal Portfolio build with Astro 🚀"},"definition":{"en":"Personal Portfolio build with Astro 🚀"},"features":{"zh":["使用描述性的测试名称","实现测试隔离","使用 test.beforeEach 和 test.afterEach","保持测试代码的 DRY 原则","提取可重用的逻辑到帮助函数"],"ja":["説明的なテスト名を使用する","テストの分離を実現する","test.beforeEach と test.afterEach を使用する","テストコードを DRY に保つ","再利用可能なロジックをヘルパ関数に抽出する"],"ko":["설명적인 테스트 이름 사용","테스트 분리 구현","test.beforeEach 및 test.afterEach 사용","테스트 코드의 DRY 원칙 유지","재사용 가능한 로직을 헬퍼 함수로 추출"],"es":["Diseño de pruebas estructuradas","Uso de fixtures para aislamiento de pruebas","Implementación de test.beforeEach y test.afterEach","Creación de funciones de ayuda reutilizables","Pruebas de extremo a extremo con Playwright"],"fr":["Conception de tests structurés","Utilisation de fixtures pour l''isolement des tests","Mise en œuvre de test.beforeEach et test.afterEach","Création de fonctions d''aide réutilisables","Tests de bout en bout avec Playwright"],"de":["Strukturierte Testgestaltung","Verwendung von Fixtures für die Isolierung von Tests","Implementierung von test.beforeEach und test.afterEach","Erstellung von wiederverwendbaren Hilfsfunktionen","End-to-End-Tests mit Playwright"],"pt":["Criação de testes com nomes descritivos","Uso de fixtures do Playwright para isolamento de testes","Implementação de test.beforeEach e test.afterEach para gerenciamento de estado limpo","Manutenção de testes DRY com lógica reutilizável","Suporte a múltiplos navegadores","Integração com outras ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Создание тестов с описательными именами","Использование фикстур Playwright для изоляции тестов","Реализация test.beforeEach и test.afterEach для управления чистым состоянием","Поддержание тестов DRY с повторно используемой логикой","Поддержка нескольких браузеров","Интеграция с другими инструментами разработки"],"ar":["إنشاء اختبارات بأسماء وصفية","استخدام إصلاحات Playwright لتحقيق عزل الاختبارات","تنفيذ test.beforeEach و test.afterEach لإدارة الحالة النظيفة","الحفاظ على اختبارات DRY بالمنطق القابل لإعادة الاستخدام","دعم متصفحات متعددة","التكامل مع أدوات تطوير أخرى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Playwright","端到端测试","测试自动化","浏览器驱动","JavaScript","TypeScript","测试结构","测试隔离"],"ja":["Playwright","エンドツーエンドテスト","テスト自動化","ブラウザ駆動","JavaScript","TypeScript","テスト構造","テスト分離"],"ko":["Playwright","엔드 투 엔드 테스트","테스트 자동화","브라우저 드라이버","JavaScript","TypeScript","테스트 구조","테스트 분리"],"es":["Playwright","pruebas de software","pruebas automatizadas","desarrollo web","testing de extremo a extremo","TypeScript","JavaScript"],"fr":["Playwright","tests de logiciel","tests automatisés","développement web","testing de bout en bout","TypeScript","JavaScript"],"de":["Playwright","Software-Tests","automatisierte Tests","Webentwicklung","End-to-End-Testing","TypeScript","JavaScript"],"pt":["playwright","teste de ponta a ponta","teste de software","desenvolvimento de software","qualidade de código","teste automatizado","javascript","typescript"],"ru":["playwright","тестирование от конца до конца","тестирование программного обеспечения","разработка программного обеспечения","качество кода","автоматизированное тестирование","javascript","typescript"],"ar":["playwright","اختبار النهاية إلى النهاية","اختبار البرمجيات","تطوير البرمجيات","جودة الكود","اختبار آلي","javascript","typescript"]}},"owner":"nicolas-deyros","repo":"astro-portfolio-v2","repoPath":"nicolas-deyros/astro-portfolio-v2","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.425Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"playwright","description":"Playwright end-to-end testing best practices for web applications, covering test design, locator strategies, and assertion patterns.","bodyPreview":"# Playwright Testing Best Practices\r\n\r\nYou are a Senior QA Automation Engineer expert in TypeScript, JavaScript, and Playwright end-to-end testing.\r\n\r\n## Test Design Principles\r\n\r\n### Test Structure\r\n\r\n- Create descriptive test names that clearly explain expected behavior\r\n- Use Playwright fixtures (`test`, `page`, `expect`) for test isolation\r\n- Implement `test.beforeEach` and `test.afterEach` for clean state management\r\n- Keep tests DRY by extracting reusable logic into helper functions\r\n\r\n```","body":"# Playwright Testing Best Practices\r\n\r\nYou are a Senior QA Automation Engineer expert in TypeScript, JavaScript, and Playwright end-to-end testing.\r\n\r\n## Test Design Principles\r\n\r\n### Test Structure\r\n\r\n- Create descriptive test names that clearly explain expected behavior\r\n- Use Playwright fixtures (`test`, `page`, `expect`) for test isolation\r\n- Implement `test.beforeEach` and `test.afterEach` for clean state management\r\n- Keep tests DRY by extracting reusable logic into helper functions\r\n\r\n```typescript\r\nimport { test, expect } from ''@playwright/test''\r\n\r\ntest.describe(''User Authentication'', () => {\r\n\ttest.beforeEach(async ({ page }) => {\r\n\t\tawait page.goto(''/login'')\r\n\t})\r\n\r\n\ttest(''should login successfully with valid credentials'', async ({ page }) => {\r\n\t\tawait page.getByLabel(''Email'').fill(''user@example.com'')\r\n\t\tawait page.getByLabel(''Password'').fill(''password123'')\r\n\t\tawait page.getByRole(''button'', { name: ''Sign In'' }).click()\r\n\r\n\t\tawait expect(page.getByRole(''heading'', { name: ''Dashboard'' })).toBeVisible()\r\n\t})\r\n})\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Locator Strategy\r\n\r\n### Recommended Locators\r\n\r\n- `page.getByRole()` - Best for accessibility and user perspective\r\n- `page.getByLabel()` - For form inputs with labels\r\n- `page.getByText()` - For elements with visible text\r\n- `page.getByTestId()` - When `data-testid` attributes exist\r\n- `page.getByPlaceholder()` - For inputs with placeholder text\r\n\r\n```typescript\r\n// Recommended\r\nawait page.getByRole(''button'', { name: ''Submit'' }).click()\r\nawait page.getByLabel(''Email address'').fill(''test@example.com'')\r\n\r\n// Avoid\r\nawait page.locator(''.btn-primary'').click()\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Assertions and Waits\r\n\r\n### Web-First Assertions\r\n\r\nPrefer web-first assertions that automatically wait and retry:\r\n\r\n- `toBeVisible()` - Element is visible\r\n- `toHaveText()` - Element has specific text\r\n- `toHaveValue()` - Input has specific value\r\n- `toHaveURL()` - Page URL assertion\r\n\r\n```typescript\r\n// Recommended - web-first assertions\r\nawait expect(page.getByRole(''alert'')).toBeVisible()\r\nawait expect(page).toHaveURL(''/dashboard'')\r\n\r\n// Avoid - hardcoded timeouts\r\nawait page.waitForTimeout(5000) // Never do this\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Waiting Best Practices\r\n\r\n- Avoid hardcoded timeouts\r\n- Use `page.waitForLoadState()` for navigation\r\n- Use `page.waitForResponse()` for API calls\r\n\r\n## Configuration\r\n\r\n```typescript\r\nimport { defineConfig, devices } from ''@playwright/test''\r\n\r\nexport default defineConfig({\r\n\ttestDir: ''./tests'',\r\n\tfullyParallel: true,\r\n\tretries: process.env.CI ? 2 : 0,\r\n\tuse: {\r\n\t\tbaseURL: ''http://localhost:3000'',\r\n\t\ttrace: ''on-first-retry'',\r\n\t\tscreenshot: ''only-on-failure'',\r\n\t},\r\n\tprojects: [\r\n\t\t{ name: ''chromium'', use: { ...devices[''Desktop Chrome''] } },\r\n\t\t{ name: ''firefox'', use: { ...devices[''Desktop Firefox''] } },\r\n\t\t{ name: ''mobile'', use: { ...devices[''iPhone 13''] } },\r\n\t],\r\n})\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Best Practices\r\n\r\n- Focus on critical user paths reflecting real behavior\r\n- Keep tests independent and deterministic\r\n- Add JSDoc comments for helper functions\r\n- Implement proper error handling and logging\r\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:49:19.694Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Automation Agents specializing in end-to-end testing with TypeScript and JavaScript, leveraging Playwright''s capabilities.","zh":"适用于专门从事使用TypeScript和JavaScript进行端到端测试的自动化代理，利用Playwright的功能。","ja":"TypeScriptおよびJavaScriptを使用したエンドツーエンドテストに特化した自動化エージェントに適しています。Playwrightの機能を利用します。","ko":"TypeScript와 JavaScript를 사용하여 엔드 투 엔드 테스트를 전문으로 하는 자동화 에이전트에 적합하며 Playwright의 기능을 활용합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Automatización especializados en pruebas de extremo a extremo con TypeScript y JavaScript, aprovechando las capacidades de Playwright.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Automatisation spécialisés dans les tests de bout en bout avec TypeScript et JavaScript, en exploitant les capacités de Playwright.","de":"Ideal für Automatisierungsagenten, die auf End-to-End-Tests mit TypeScript und JavaScript spezialisiert sind und die Funktionen von Playwright nutzen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Automação especializados em testes de ponta a ponta com TypeScript e JavaScript, aproveitando as capacidades do Playwright.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации, специализирующихся на тестировании от начала до конца с помощью TypeScript и JavaScript, используя возможности Playwright.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الآليين المتخصصين في الاختبار من النهاية إلى النهاية باستخدام TypeScript و JavaScript، واستخدام إمكانيات Playwright."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement robust test design principles, utilizing Playwright fixtures and test hooks like `test.beforeEach` and `test.afterEach` for efficient test isolation and state management, while keeping tests DRY with reusable helper functions.","zh":"赋予代理实现强大的测试设计原则的能力，利用Playwright的fixture和测试钩子（如`test.beforeEach`和`test.afterEach`）实现高效的测试隔离和状态管理，同时使用可重用的辅助函数保持测试的DRY。","ja":"エージェントに強力なテスト設計原則を実装する能力を与え、Playwrightのfixtureおよびテストフック（`test.beforeEach`および`test.afterEach`など）を使用して効率的なテストの分離および状態管理を行い、再利用可能なヘルパー関数を使用してテストをDRYに保ちます。","ko":"에이전트가 강력한 테스트 설계 원칙을 구현할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 Playwright의.fixture 및 테스트 후크(`test.beforeEach` 및 `test.afterEach` 등)를 사용하여 효율적인 테스트 분리 및 상태 관리를 수행하며 재사용 가능한 헬퍼 함수를 사용하여 테스트를 DRY하게 유지합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes implementar principios de diseño de pruebas robustos, utilizando fixtures y ganchos de prueba de Playwright como `test.beforeEach` y `test.afterEach` para una aislación y gestión de estado de pruebas eficientes, manteniendo las pruebas DRY con funciones de ayuda reutilizables.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des principes de conception de tests robustes, en utilisant des fixtures et des crochets de test Playwright tels que `test.beforeEach` et `test.afterEach` pour une isolation et une gestion d''état de test efficientes, en gardant les tests DRY avec des fonctions d''aide réutilisables.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, robuste Testdesign-Prinzipien zu implementieren, indem Playwright-Fixtures und -Test-Hooks wie `test.beforeEach` und `test.afterEach` für eine effiziente Testisolation und -zustandsverwaltung verwendet werden, während die Tests DRY mit wiederverwendbaren Hilfsfunktionen gehalten werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar princípios robustos de design de testes, utilizando recursos e ganchos de teste do Playwright, como `test.beforeEach` e `test.afterEach`, para isolamento e gerenciamento de estado de teste eficientes, mantendo os testes DRY com funções de ajudante reutilizáveis.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовать прочные принципы проектирования тестов, используя фикстуры и крючки тестирования Playwright, такие как `test.beforeEach` и `test.afterEach`, для эффективного изоляции и управления состоянием тестов, сохраняя тесты DRY с помощью многократно используемых функций-помощников.","ar":"يُمكن الوكلاء من تنفيذ مبادئ تصميم اختبار قوية، باستخدام ميزات وخطافات اختبار Playwright مثل `test.beforeEach` و `test.afterEach` لتعزيل الاختبار وتحديد الحالة بشكل فعال، مع الحفاظ على الاختبارات DRY باستخدام دوال مساعدة قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating browser interactions for testing","Generating descriptive test names for clear expected behavior","Implementing test structure best practices with Playwright"],"zh":["为测试自动化浏览器交互","为清晰的预期行为生成描述性测试名称","使用Playwright实现测试结构最佳实践"],"ja":["テストの自動化ブラウザーの相互作用","明確な期待される動作のための記述的なテスト名の生成","Playwrightを使用したテスト構造のベストプラクティス実装"],"ko":["테스트를 위한 브라우저 상호작용 자동화","명확한 예상 동작을 위한 설명적인 테스트 이름 생성","Playwright를 사용한 테스트 구조 최적화 구현"],"es":["Automatizar interacciones del navegador para pruebas","Generar nombres de pruebas descriptivos para un comportamiento esperado claro","Implementar las mejores prácticas de estructura de pruebas con Playwright"],"fr":["Automatiser les interactions du navigateur pour les tests","Générer des noms de tests descriptifs pour un comportement attendu clair","Mettre en œuvre les meilleures pratiques de structure de test avec Playwright"],"de":["Automatisierung von Browser-Interaktionen für Tests","Generierung beschreibender Testnamen für ein klares erwartetes Verhalten","Implementierung von Best Practices für die Teststruktur mit Playwright"],"pt":["Automatizar interações do navegador para testes","Gerar nomes de testes descritivos para comportamento esperado claro","Implementar as melhores práticas de estrutura de teste com o Playwright"],"ru":["Автоматизация взаимодействия браузера для тестирования","Генерация описательных имен тестов для ясного ожидаемого поведения","Реализация лучших практик структуры теста с помощью Playwright"],"ar":["آليّة تفاعلات المتصفح للاختبار","توليد أسماء الاختبار الوصفية لسلوك متوقع واضح","تنفيذ أفضل الممارسات لهيكلة الاختبار مع Playwright"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires TypeScript or JavaScript environment","Playwright-specific knowledge needed","End-to-end testing focus"],"zh":["需要TypeScript或JavaScript环境","需要Playwright特定知识","端到端测试焦点"],"ja":["TypeScriptまたはJavaScript環境が必要","Playwright特有の知識が必要","エンドツーエンドテストに焦点を当てている"],"ko":["TypeScript 또는 JavaScript 환경이 필요","Playwright 특정 지식 필요","엔드 투 엔드 테스트에 중점"],"es":["Requiere entorno de TypeScript o JavaScript","Conocimiento específico de Playwright necesario","Enfoque en pruebas de extremo a extremo"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement TypeScript ou JavaScript","Connaissances spécifiques de Playwright nécessaires","Focus sur les tests de bout en bout"],"de":["Benötigt eine TypeScript- oder JavaScript-Umgebung","Playwright-spezifisches Wissen erforderlich","Fokus auf End-to-End-Tests"],"pt":["Requer ambiente TypeScript ou JavaScript","Conhecimento específico do Playwright necessário","Foco em testes de ponta a ponta"],"ru":["Требуется среда TypeScript или JavaScript","Необходимо специфическое знание Playwright","Фокус на тестировании от начала до конца"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة TypeScript أو JavaScript","مطلوب معرفة محددة حول Playwright","تركيز على الاختبار من النهاية إلى النهاية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
