e Segurança para Desenvolv...","ru":"Cloudflare Turnstile: Решение для безопасности разработчиков","ar":"Cloudflare Turnstile: حل أمان للمطورين","en":"cloudflare-turnstile"},"description":{"zh":"Cloudflare Turnstile ","ja":"Cloudflare Turnstile","ko":"Cloudflare Turnstile ","es":"Cloudflare Turnstile es una solución de seguridad para proteger aplicaciones contra el spam y los ataques de bots. Ofrece características avanzadas como anál...","fr":"Cloudflare Turnstile est une solution de sécurité pour protéger les applications contre les spams et les attaques de bots. Elle offre des fonctionnalités ava...","de":"Cloudflare Turnstile ist eine Sicherheitslösung, um Anwendungen vor Spam und Bot-Angriffen zu schützen. Sie bietet fortschrittliche Funktionen wie Verkehrsan...","pt":"O Cloudflare Turnstile é uma solução de segurança que protege seus sites e aplicativos contra bots e spam, com recursos como Turnstile Analytics e integração...","ru":"Cloudflare Turnstile — это решение для безопасности, которое защищает ваши сайты и приложения от ботов и спама, с функциями như Turnstile Analytics и интегра...","ar":"Cloudflare Turnstile هو حل أمان لحماية مواقعك وتطبيقاتك من البوتات والبريد العشوائي، مع ميزات مثل Turnstile Analytics ودمج مع React","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Production ","React ","Turnstile ","TopN "," ","API "],"ja":["Production ","React ","Turnstile ","TopN "," ","API "],"ko":["Production ","React ","Turnstile ","TopN "," ","API "],"es":["Protección contra el spam y los ataques de bots","Análisis de tráfico avanzado","Actualizaciones regulares para mantener la seguridad","Compatibilidad con React a través de @marsidev/react-turnstile","Tipos de Turnstile para una mejor integración"],"fr":["Protection contre les spams et les attaques de bots","Analyse de trafic avancée","Mises à jour régulières pour maintenir la sécurité","Compatibilité avec React via @marsidev/react-turnstile","Types de Turnstile pour une meilleure intégration"],"de":["Schutz vor Spam und Bot-Angriffen","Erweiterte Verkehrsanalyse","Regelmäßige Updates für einen besseren Schutz","Kompatibilität mit React über @marsidev/react-turnstile","Turnstile-Typen für eine bessere Integration"],"pt":["Proteção contra bots e spam","Turnstile Analytics para monitorar atividades","Integração com React para aplicativos web","Recarga automática de scripts","Suporte a diferentes plataformas"],"ru":["Защита от ботов и спама","Turnstile Analytics для мониторинга активности","Интеграция с React для веб-приложений","Автоматическая перезагрузка скриптов","Поддержка разных платформ"],"ar":["حماية من البوتات والبريد العشوائي","Turnstile Analytics لمراقبة الأنشطة","دمج مع React لتطبيقات الويب","إعادة تحميل البرامج النصية تلقائيًا","دعم منصات مختلفة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Cloudflare Turnstile","Turnstile ","Cloudflare","React Turnstile","Turnstile API","Turnstile "],"ja":["Cloudflare Turnstile","Turnstile ","Cloudflare","React Turnstile","Turnstile API","Turnstile "],"ko":["Cloudflare Turnstile","Turnstile ","Cloudflare","React Turnstile","Turnstile API","Turnstile "],"es":["seguridad web","protección contra spam","ataques de bots","análisis de tráfico","Cloudflare Turnstile","desarrollo de aplicaciones","seguridad de aplicaciones"],"fr":["sécurité web","protection contre les spams","attaques de bots","analyse de trafic","Cloudflare Turnstile","développement d''applications","sécurité des applications"],"de":["Web-Sicherheit","Schutz vor Spam","Bot-Angriffe","Verkehrsanalyse","Cloudflare Turnstile","Anwendungs-Entwicklung","Anwendungssicherheit"],"pt":["Cloudflare Turnstile","segurança de site","proteção contra bots","Turnstile Analytics","React","desenvolvimento web","segurança de aplicativos"],"ru":["Cloudflare Turnstile","безопасность сайта","защита от ботов","Turnstile Analytics","React","веб-разработка","безопасность приложений"],"ar":["Cloudflare Turnstile","أمان الموقع","حماية من البوتات","Turnstile Analytics","React","تطوير الويب","أمان التطبيقات"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.425Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cloudflare-turnstile","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Cloudflare Turnstile\n\n**Status**: Production Ready ✅\n**Last Updated**: 2026-01-21\n**Dependencies**: None (optional: @marsidev/react-turnstile for React)\n**Latest Versions**: @marsidev/react-turnstile@1.4.1, turnstile-types@1.2.3\n\n**Recent Updates (2025)**:\n- **December 2025**: @marsidev/react-turnstile v1.4.1 fixes race condition in script loading\n- **August 2025**: v1.3.0 adds `rerenderOnCallbackChange` prop for React closure issues\n- **March 2025**: Upgraded Turnstile Analytics with TopN sta","body":"# Cloudflare Turnstile\n\n**Status**: Production Ready ✅\n**Last Updated**: 2026-01-21\n**Dependencies**: None (optional: @marsidev/react-turnstile for React)\n**Latest Versions**: @marsidev/react-turnstile@1.4.1, turnstile-types@1.2.3\n\n**Recent Updates (2025)**:\n- **December 2025**: @marsidev/react-turnstile v1.4.1 fixes race condition in script loading\n- **August 2025**: v1.3.0 adds `rerenderOnCallbackChange` prop for React closure issues\n- **March 2025**: Upgraded Turnstile Analytics with TopN statistics (7 dimensions: hostnames, browsers, countries, user agents, ASNs, OS, source IPs), anomaly detection, enhanced bot behavior monitoring\n- **January 2025**: Brief remoteip validation enforcement (resolved, but highlights importance of correct IP passing)\n- **2025**: WCAG 2.1 AA compliance, Free plan (20 widgets, 7-day analytics), Enterprise features (unlimited widgets, ephemeral IDs, any hostname support, 30-day analytics, offlabel branding)\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start (5 Minutes)\n\n```bash\n# 1. Create widget: https://dash.cloudflare.com/?to=/:account/turnstile\n#    Copy sitekey (public) and secret key (private)\n\n# 2. Add widget to frontend\n<script src=\"https://challenges.cloudflare.com/turnstile/v0/api.js\" async defer></script>\n<form>\n  <div class=\"cf-turnstile\" data-sitekey=\"YOUR_SITE_KEY\"></div>\n  <button type=\"submit\">Submit</button>\n</form>\n\n# 3. Validate token server-side (Cloudflare Workers)\nconst formData = await request.formData()\nconst token = formData.get(''cf-turnstile-response'')\n\nconst verifyFormData = new FormData()\nverifyFormData.append(''secret'', env.TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY)\nverifyFormData.append(''response'', token)\nverifyFormData.append(''remoteip'', request.headers.get(''CF-Connecting-IP''))  // REQUIRED - see Critical Rules\n\nconst result = await fetch(\n  ''https://challenges.cloudflare.com/turnstile/v0/siteverify'',\n  { method: ''POST'', body: verifyFormData }\n)\n\nconst outcome = await result.json()\nif (!outcome.success) return new Response(''Invalid'', { status: 401 })\n```\n\n**CRITICAL:**\n- Token expires in 5 minutes, single-use only\n- ALWAYS validate server-side (Siteverify API required)\n- Never proxy/cache api.js (must load from Cloudflare CDN)\n- Use different widgets for dev/staging/production\n\n## Rendering Modes\n\n**Implicit** (auto-render on page load):\n```html\n<script src=\"https://challenges.cloudflare.com/turnstile/v0/api.js\" async defer></script>\n<div class=\"cf-turnstile\" data-sitekey=\"YOUR_SITE_KEY\" data-callback=\"onSuccess\"></div>\n```\n\n**Explicit** (programmatic control for SPAs):\n```typescript\n<script src=\"https://challenges.cloudflare.com/turnstile/v0/api.js?render=explicit\"></script>\nconst widgetId = turnstile.render(''#container'', { sitekey: ''YOUR_SITE_KEY'' })\nturnstile.reset(widgetId)   // Reset widget\nturnstile.getResponse(widgetId)  // Get token\n```\n\n**React** (using @marsidev/react-turnstile):\n```tsx\nimport { Turnstile } from ''@marsidev/react-turnstile''\n<Turnstile siteKey={TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY} onSuccess={setToken} />\n```\n\n---\n\n## Critical Rules\n\n### Always Do\n\n✅ **Call Siteverify API** - Server-side validation is mandatory\n✅ **Use HTTPS** - Never validate over HTTP\n✅ **Protect secret keys** - Never expose in frontend code\n✅ **Handle token expiration** - Tokens expire after 5 minutes\n✅ **Implement error callbacks** - Handle failures gracefully\n✅ **Use dummy keys for testing** - Test sitekey: `1x00000000000000000000AA`\n✅ **Set reasonable timeouts** - Don''t wait indefinitely for validation\n✅ **Validate action/hostname** - Check additional fields when specified\n✅ **Rotate keys periodically** - Use dashboard or API to rotate secrets\n✅ **Monitor analytics** - Track solve rates and failures\n✅ **Always pass client IP to Siteverify** - Use `CF-Connecting-IP` header (Workers) or `X-Forwarded-For` (Node.js). Cloudflare briefly enforced strict remoteip validation in Jan 2025, causing widespread failures for sites not passing correct IP\n\n### Never Do\n\n❌ **Skip server validation** - Client-side only = security vulnerability\n❌ **Proxy api.js script** - Must load from Cloudflare CDN\n❌ **Reuse tokens** - Each token is single-use only\n❌ **Use GET requests** - Siteverify only accepts POST\n❌ **Expose secret key** - Keep secrets in backend environment only\n❌ **Trust client-side validation** - Tokens can be forged\n❌ **Cache api.js** - Future updates will break your integration\n❌ **Use production keys in tests** - Use dummy keys instead\n❌ **Ignore error callbacks** - Always handle failures\n\n---\n\n## Known Issues Prevention\n\nThis skill prevents **15** documented issues:\n\n### Issue #1: Missing Server-Side Validation\n**Error**: Zero token validation in Turnstile Analytics dashboard\n**Source**: https://developers.cloudflare.com/turnstile/get-started/\n**Why It Happens**: Developers only implement client-side widget, skip Siteverify call\n**Prevention**: All templates include mandatory server-side validation with Siteverify API\n\n### Issue #2: Token Expiration (5 Minutes)\n**Error**: `success: false` for valid tokens submitted after delay\n**Source**: https://developers.cloudflare.com/turnstile/get-started/server-side-validation\n**Why It Happens**: Tokens expire 300 seconds after generation\n**Prevention**: Templates document TTL and implement token refresh on expiration\n\n### Issue #3: Secret Key Exposed in Frontend\n**Error**: Security bypass - attackers can validate their own tokens\n**Source**: https://developers.cloudflare.com/turnstile/get-started/server-side-validation\n**Why It Happens**: Secret key hardcoded in JavaScript or visible in source\n**Prevention**: All templates show backend-only validation with environment variables\n\n### Issue #4: GET Request to Siteverify\n**Error**: API returns 405 Method Not Allowed\n**Source**: https://developers.cloudflare.com/turnstile/migration/recaptcha\n**Why It Happens**: reCAPTCHA supports GET, Turnstile requires POST\n**Prevention**: Templates use POST with FormData or JSON body\n\n### Issue #5: Content Security Policy Blocking\n**Error**: Error 200500 - \"Loading error: The iframe could not be loaded\"\n**Source**: https://developers.cloudflare.com/turnstile/troubleshooting/client-side-errors/error-codes\n**Why It Happens**: CSP blocks challenges.cloudflare.com iframe\n**Prevention**: Skill includes CSP configuration reference and check-csp.sh script\n\n### Issue #6: Widget Crash (Error 300030)\n**Error**: Generic client execution error for legitimate users\n**Source**: https://community.cloudflare.com/t/turnstile-is-frequently-generating-300x-errors/700903\n**Why It Happens**: Unknown - appears to be Cloudflare-side issue (2025)\n**Prevention**: Templates implement error callbacks, retry logic, and fallback handling\n\n### Issue #7: Configuration Error (Error 600010)\n**Error**: Widget fails with \"configuration error\"\n**Source**: https://community.cloudflare.com/t/repeated-cloudflare-turnstile-error-600010/644578\n**Why It Happens**: Missing or deleted hostname in widget configuration\n**Prevention**: Templates document hostname allowlist requirement and verification steps\n\n### Issue #8: Safari 18 / macOS 15 \"Hide IP\" Issue\n**Error**: Error 300010 when Safari''s \"Hide IP address\" is enabled\n**Source**: https://community.cloudflare.com/t/turnstile-is-frequently-generating-300x-errors/700903\n**Why It Happens**: Privacy settings interfere with challenge signals\n**Prevention**: Error handling reference documents Safari workaround (disable Hide IP)\n\n### Issue #9: Brave Browser Confetti Animation Failure\n**Error**: Verification fails during success animation\n**Source**: https://github.com/brave/brave-browser/issues/45608 (April 2025)\n**Why It Happens**: Brave shields block animation scripts\n**Prevention**: Templates handle success before animation completes\n\n### Issue #10: Next.js + Jest Incompatibility\n**Error**: @marsidev/react-turnstile breaks Jest tests\n**Source**: https://github.com/marsidev/react-turnstile/issues/112 (Oct 2025)\n**Why It Happens**: Module resolution issues with Jest\n**Prevention**: Testing guide includes Jest mocking patterns and dummy sitekey usage\n\n### Issue #11: localhost Not in Allowlist\n**Error**: Error 110200 - \"Unknown domain: Domain not allowed\"\n**Source**: https://developers.cloudflare.com/turnstile/troubleshooting/client-side-errors/error-codes\n**Why It Happens**: Production widget used in development without localhost in allowlist\n**Prevention**: Templates use dummy test keys for dev, document localhost allowlist requirement\n\n### Issue #12: Token Reuse Attempt\n**Error**: `success: false` with \"token already spent\" error\n**Source**: https://developers.cloudflare.com/turnstile/troubleshooting/testing\n**Why It Happens**: Each token can only be validated once. Turnstile tokens are single-use - after validation (success OR failure), the token is consumed and cannot be revalidated. Developers must explicitly call `turnstile.reset()` to generate a new token for subsequent submissions.\n**Prevention**: Templates document single-use constraint and token refresh patterns\n\n```typescript\n// CRITICAL: Reset widget after validation to get new token\nconst turnstileRef = useRef(null)\n\nasync function handleSubmit(e) {\n  e.preventDefault()\n  const token = formData.get(''cf-turnstile-response'')\n\n  const result = await fetch(''/api/submit'', {\n    method: ''POST'',\n    body: JSON.stringify({ token })\n  })\n\n  // Reset widget regardless of success/failure\n  // Token is consumed either way\n  if (turnstileRef.current) {\n    turnstile.reset(turnstileRef.current)\n  }\n}\n\n<Turnstile\n  ref={turnstileRef}\n  siteKey={TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY}\n  onSuccess={setToken}\n/>\n```\n\n### Issue #13: Error 106010 - Chrome/Edge First-Load Failure\n**Error**: `106010` - \"Generic parameter error\" on first widget load in Chrome/Edge browsers\n**Source**: [Cloudflare Error Codes](https://developers.cloudflare.com/turnstile/troubleshooting/client-side-errors/error-codes/), [Community Report](https://community.cloudflare.com/t/turnstile-inconsistent-errors/856678)\n**Why It Happens**: Unknown browser-specific issue affecting Chrome and Edge on first page load. Console shows 400 error to `https://challenges.cloudflare.com/cdn-cgi/challenge-platform`. Firefox is not affected. Subsequent page reloads work correctly.\n**Prevention**: Implement error callback with auto-retry logic\n\n```typescript\nturnstile.render(''#container'', {\n  sitekey: SITE_KEY,\n  retry: ''auto'',\n  ''retry-interval'': 8000,\n  ''error-callback'': (errorCode) => {\n    if (errorCode === ''106010'') {\n      console.warn(''Chrome/Edge first-load issue (106010), auto-retrying...'')\n      // Auto-retry will handle it\n    }\n  }\n})\n```\n\n**Workaround**: Widget works correctly after page reload. Auto-retry setting resolves in most cases. Test in Incognito mode to rule out browser extensions. Review CSP rules to ensure Cloudflare Turnstile endpoints are allowed.\n\n### Issue #14: Multiple Widgets Visual Status Stuck (Community-sourced)\n**Error**: Widget displays \"Pending...\" status even after successful token generation\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #119](https://github.com/marsidev/react-turnstile/issues/119)\n**Why It Happens**: CSS repaint issue when rendering multiple `<Turnstile/>` components on a single page. Only reproducible on full HD desktop screens. Token IS successfully generated (validation works), but visual status doesn''t update. Hovering over widget triggers repaint and shows correct status.\n**Prevention**: Force CSS repaint in success callback\n\n```tsx\n<Turnstile\n  siteKey={KEY}\n  onSuccess={(token) => {\n    setToken(token)\n    // Force repaint by toggling display\n    const widget = document.querySelector(''.cf-turnstile'')\n    if (widget) {\n      widget.style.display = ''none''\n      setTimeout(() => widget.style.display = ''block'', 0)\n    }\n  }}\n/>\n```\n\n**Note**: This is a visual-only issue, not a validation failure. The token is correctly generated and functional.\n\n### Issue #15: Jest Compatibility with @marsidev/react-turnstile (Updated Dec 2025)\n**Error**: `Jest encountered an unexpected token` when importing @marsidev/react-turnstile\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #114](https://github.com/marsidev/react-turnstile/issues/114), [GitHub Issue #112](https://github.com/marsidev/react-turnstile/issues/112)\n**Why It Happens**: ESM module resolution issues with Jest 30.2.0 (latest as of Dec 2025). Issue #112 closed as \"not planned\" by maintainer. Jest users are stuck; Vitest migration works.\n**Prevention**: Mock the Turnstile component in Jest setup OR migrate to Vitest\n\n```typescript\n// Option 1: Jest mocking (jest.setup.ts)\njest.mock(''@marsidev/react-turnstile'', () => ({\n  Turnstile: () => <div data-testid=\"turnstile-mock\" />,\n}))\n\n// Option 2: transformIgnorePatterns in jest.config.js\nmodule.exports = {\n  transformIgnorePatterns: [\n    ''node_modules/(?!(@marsidev/react-turnstile)/)''\n  ]\n}\n\n// Option 3 (Recommended): Migrate to Vitest\n// Vitest handles ESM modules correctly without mocking\n```\n\n**Status**: Maintainer closed issue as \"not planned\". Recommend migrating to Vitest for new projects.\n\n## Configuration\n\n**wrangler.jsonc:**\n```jsonc\n{\n  \"vars\": { \"TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY\": \"1x00000000000000000000AA\" },\n  \"secrets\": [\"TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY\"]  // Run: wrangler secret put TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY\n}\n```\n\n**Required CSP:**\n```html\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Security-Policy\" content=\"\n  script-src ''self'' https://challenges.cloudflare.com;\n  frame-src ''self'' https://challenges.cloudflare.com;\n\">\n```\n\n---\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Hono + Cloudflare Workers\n\n```typescript\nimport { Hono } from ''hono''\n\ntype Bindings = {\n  TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY: string\n  TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY: string\n}\n\nconst app = new Hono<{ Bindings: Bindings }>()\n\napp.post(''/api/login'', async (c) => {\n  const body = await c.req.formData()\n  const token = body.get(''cf-turnstile-response'')\n\n  if (!token) {\n    return c.text(''Missing Turnstile token'', 400)\n  }\n\n  // Validate token\n  const verifyFormData = new FormData()\n  verifyFormData.append(''secret'', c.env.TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY)\n  verifyFormData.append(''response'', token.toString())\n  verifyFormData.append(''remoteip'', c.req.header(''CF-Connecting-IP'') || '''')  // CRITICAL - always pass client IP\n\n  const verifyResult = await fetch(\n    ''https://challenges.cloudflare.com/turnstile/v0/siteverify'',\n    {\n      method: ''POST'',\n      body: verifyFormData,\n    }\n  )\n\n  const outcome = await verifyResult.json<{ success: boolean }>()\n\n  if (!outcome.success) {\n    return c.text(''Invalid Turnstile token'', 401)\n  }\n\n  // Process login\n  return c.json({ message: ''Login successful'' })\n})\n\nexport default app\n```\n\n**When to use**: API routes in Cloudflare Workers with Hono framework\n\n### Pattern 2: React + Next.js App Router\n\n```tsx\n''use client''\n\nimport { Turnstile } from ''@marsidev/react-turnstile''\nimport { useState } from ''react''\n\nexport function ContactForm() {\n  const [token, setToken] = useState<string>()\n  const [error, setError] = useState<string>()\n\n  async function handleSubmit(e: React.FormEvent<HTMLFormElement>) {\n    e.preventDefault()\n\n    if (!token) {\n      setError(''Please complete the challenge'')\n      return\n    }\n\n    const formData = new FormData(e.currentTarget)\n    formData.append(''cf-turnstile-response'', token)\n\n    const response = await fetch(''/api/contact'', {\n      method: ''POST'',\n      body: formData,\n    })\n\n    if (!response.ok) {\n      setError(''Submission failed'')\n      return\n    }\n\n    // Success\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <form onSubmit={handleSubmit}>\n      <input name=\"email\" type=\"email\" required />\n      <textarea name=\"message\" required />\n\n      <Turnstile\n        siteKey={process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY!}\n        onSuccess={setToken}\n        onError={() => setError(''Challenge failed'')}\n        onExpire={() => setToken(undefined)}\n      />\n\n      {error && <div className=\"error\">{error}</div>}\n\n      <button type=\"submit\" disabled={!token}>\n        Submit\n      </button>\n    </form>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n**When to use**: Client-side forms in Next.js with React hooks\n\n---\n\n## Testing Keys\n\n**Dummy Sitekeys (client):**\n- Always pass: `1x00000000000000000000AA`\n- Always block: `2x00000000000000000000AB`\n- Force interactive: `3x00000000000000000000FF`\n\n**Dummy Secret Keys (server):**\n- Always pass: `1x0000000000000000000000000000000AA`\n- Always fail: `2x0000000000000000000000000000000AA`\n- Token already spent: `3x0000000000000000000000000000000AA`\n\n---\n\n## Bundled Resources\n\n**Scripts:** `check-csp.sh` - Verify CSP allows Turnstile\n\n**References:**\n- `widget-configs.md` - All configuration options\n- `error-codes.md` - Error code troubleshooting (100*/200*/300*/400*/600*)\n- `testing-guide.md` - Testing strategies, dummy keys\n- `react-integration.md` - React/Next.js patterns\n\n**Templates:** Complete examples for Hono, React, implicit/explicit rendering, validation\n\n---\n\n## Advanced Features\n\n**Pre-Clearance (SPAs):** Issue cookie that persists across page navigations\n```typescript\nturnstile.render(''#container'', {\n  sitekey: SITE_KEY,\n  callback: async (token) => {\n    await fetch(''/api/pre-clearance'', { method: ''POST'', body: JSON.stringify({ token }) })\n  }\n})\n```\n\n**Custom Actions & Data:** Track challenge types, pass custom data (max 255 chars)\n```typescript\nturnstile.render(''#container'', {\n  action: ''login'',  // Track in analytics\n  cdata: JSON.stringify({ userId: ''123'' }),  // Custom payload\n})\n```\n\n**Error Handling:** Use `retry: ''auto''` and `error-callback` for resilience\n```typescript\nturnstile.render(''#container'', {\n  retry: ''auto'',\n  ''retry-interval'': 8000,  // ms between retries\n  ''error-callback'': (error) => { /* handle or show fallback */ }\n})\n```\n\n---\n\n## Dependencies\n\n**Required:** None (loads from CDN)\n**React:** @marsidev/react-turnstile@1.4.1 (Cloudflare-recommended), turnstile-types@1.2.3\n**Other:** vue-turnstile, ngx-turnstile, svelte-turnstile, @nuxtjs/turnstile\n\n---\n\n## Official Documentation\n\n- https://developers.cloudflare.com/turnstile/\n- Use `mcp__cloudflare-docs__search_cloudflare_documentation` tool\n\n---\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Problem: Error 110200 - \"Unknown domain\"\n**Solution**: Add your domain (including localhost for dev) to widget''s allowed domains in Cloudflare Dashboard. For local dev, use dummy test sitekey `1x00000000000000000000AA` instead.\n\n### Problem: Error 300030 - Widget crashes for legitimate users\n**Solution**: Implement error callback with retry logic. This is a known Cloudflare-side issue (2025). Fallback to alternative verification if retries fail.\n\n### Problem: Tokens always return `success: false`\n**Solution**:\n1. Check token hasn''t expired (5 min TTL)\n2. Verify secret key is correct\n3. Ensure token hasn''t been validated before (single-use)\n4. Check hostname matches widget configuration\n\n### Problem: CSP blocking iframe (Error 200500)\n**Solution**: Add CSP directives:\n```html\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Security-Policy\" content=\"\n  frame-src https://challenges.cloudflare.com;\n  script-src https://challenges.cloudflare.com;\n\">\n```\n\n### Problem: Safari 18 \"Hide IP\" causing Error 300010\n**Solution**: Document in error message that users should disable Safari''s \"Hide IP address\" setting (Safari → Settings → Privacy → Hide IP address → Off)\n\n### Problem: Next.js + Jest tests failing with @marsidev/react-turnstile\n**Solution**: Mock the Turnstile component in Jest setup (or migrate to Vitest, which handles ESM modules correctly):\n```typescript\n// Option 1: Jest mocking (jest.setup.ts)\njest.mock(''@marsidev/react-turnstile'', () => ({\n  Turnstile: () => <div data-testid=\"turnstile-mock\" />,\n}))\n\n// Option 2: Migrate to Vitest (recommended for new projects)\n// Vitest handles ESM modules without mocking required\n```\n\n**Note**: This issue persists in Jest 30.2.0 (Dec 2025). Maintainer closed as \"not planned\". See Issue #15 for full details.\n\n---\n\n**Errors Prevented**: 15 documented issues (Safari 18 Hide IP, Brave confetti, Next.js Jest, CSP blocking, token reuse, expiration, hostname allowlist, widget crash 300030, config error 600010, missing validation, GET request, secret exposure, Chrome/Edge 106010, multiple widgets rendering, token regeneration pattern)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:49:02.319Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Security Agents requiring advanced bot detection and mitigation capabilities with Cloudflare Turnstile","zh":"适用于需要使用Cloudflare Turnstile进行高级机器人检测和缓解的安全代理","ja":"Cloudflare Turnstileを使用した高度なボット検出および緩和機能を必要とするセキュリティエージェントに適しています","ko":"Cloudflare Turnstile을 사용하여 고급_bot_検출 및 완화 기능을 필요로 하는 보안 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de seguridad que requieren capacidades avanzadas de detección y mitigación de bots con Cloudflare Turnstile","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de sécurité nécessitant des capacités de détection et de mitigation de bots avancées avec Cloudflare Turnstile","de":"Ideal für Sicherheitsagenten, die erweiterte Bot-Erkennungs- und -Minderungsfunktionen mit Cloudflare Turnstile benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Segurança que exigem detecção e mitigação de bots avançadas com Cloudflare Turnstile","ru":"Идеально для агентов безопасности, требующих продвинутых возможностей обнаружения и смягчения ботов с Cloudflare Turnstile","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل الأمن التي تتطلب اكتشاف ومعالجة متقدمة للبوتات مع Cloudflare Turnstile"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to protect web applications from automated threats using Cloudflare''s Turnstile technology, leveraging dependencies like @marsidev/react-turnstile for seamless React integration and turnstile-types for enhanced analytics","zh":"赋予代理保护Web应用程序免受自动化威胁的能力，利用Cloudflare的Turnstile技术，并利用@marsidev/react-turnstile等依赖项实现React的无缝集成，以及turnstile-types进行增强分析","ja":"エージェントに、CloudflareのTurnstileテクノロジーを利用して、自動化された脅威からWebアプリケーションを保護する能力を付与し、@marsidev/react-turnstileなどの依存関係を利用してReactとの無縫な統合を行い、turnstile-typesを利用して分析を強化する","ko":"에이전트에 자동화된 위협으로부터 웹 애플리케이션을 보호하는 기능을 부여하며, Cloudflare의 Turnstile 기술을 활용하고, @marsidev/react-turnstileなどの 종속성을 사용하여 리액트와의无缝集成을 구현하며, turnstile-types를 사용하여 분석을 강화함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a proteger aplicaciones web de amenazas automatizadas utilizando la tecnología Turnstile de Cloudflare, aprovechando dependencias como @marsidev/react-turnstile para una integración de React sin problemas y turnstile-types para análisis mejorados","fr":"Permet aux agents de protéger les applications web contre les menaces automatisées en utilisant la technologie Turnstile de Cloudflare, en exploitant des dépendances comme @marsidev/react-turnstile pour une intégration React transparente et turnstile-types pour une analyse améliorée","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Webanwendungen vor automatisierten Bedrohungen zu schützen, indem sie die Turnstile-Technologie von Cloudflare nutzen, wobei Abhängigkeiten wie @marsidev/react-turnstile für eine nahtlose React-Integration und turnstile-types für erweiterte Analysen verwendet werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a proteger aplicações web de ameaças automatizadas usando a tecnologia Turnstile da Cloudflare, aproveitando dependências como @marsidev/react-turnstile para integração perfeita do React e turnstile-types para análise aprimorada","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью защищать веб-приложения от автоматизированных угроз с помощью технологии Cloudflare Turnstile, используя зависимости, такие как @marsidev/react-turnstile для бесшовной интеграции с React и turnstile-types для расширенной аналитики","ar":"تمكين الوكيل لحماية التطبيقات الويب من Threats المتمثلة في التهديدات الألية باستخدام تقنية Turnstile من Cloudflare، وتوظيف الاعتماديات مثل @marsidev/react-turnstile من أجل دمج متكامل مع React وتقarroن-SType من أجل تحليلات محسنة"},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing robust bot detection for web forms","Enhancing security with Turnstile Analytics and TopN stats","Integrating Turnstile with React applications using @marsidev/react-turnstile"],"zh":["为Web表单实现强大的机器人检测","使用Turnstile Analytics和TopN统计增强安全性","使用@marsidev/react-turnstile将Turnstile与React应用程序集成"],"ja":["Webフォームの強力なボット検出を実装する","Turnstile AnalyticsとTopN統計を使用してセキュリティを強化する","@marsidev/react-turnstileを使用してTurnstileをReactアプリケーションに統合する"],"ko":["웹 폼에 대한 강력한_bot_검출을 구현","Turnstile Analytics 및 TopN 통계를 사용하여 보안 강화","@marsidev/react-turnstile을 사용하여 Turnstile을 리액트 애플리케이션에 통합"],"es":["Implementar una detección de bots robusta para formularios web","Mejorar la seguridad con análisis de Turnstile y estadísticas TopN","Integrar Turnstile con aplicaciones de React utilizando @marsidev/react-turnstile"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre une détection de bots robuste pour les formulaires web","Améliorer la sécurité avec l''analyse Turnstile et les statistiques TopN","Intégrer Turnstile avec des applications React en utilisant @marsidev/react-turnstile"],"de":["Eine robuste Bot-Erkennung für Webformulare implementieren","Die Sicherheit mit Turnstile-Analytics und TopN-Statistiken verbessern","Turnstile in React-Anwendungen mit @marsidev/react-turnstile integrieren"],"pt":["Implementação de detecção robusta de bots para formulários da web","Melhoria da segurança com Análise de Turnstile e estatísticas TopN","Integração de Turnstile com aplicações React usando @marsidev/react-turnstile"],"ru":["Реализация прочной детекции ботов для веб-форм","Усиление безопасности с помощью аналитики Turnstile и статистики TopN","Интеграция Turnstile с приложениями React с помощью @marsidev/react-turnstile"],"ar":["تنفيذ كشف قوي عن البوتات لاستمارات الويب","تعزيز الأمان باستخدام تحليلات Turnstile وإحصائيات TopN","دمج Turnstile مع تطبيقات React باستخدام @marsidev/react-turnstile"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Cloudflare account and Turnstile configuration","Optional dependency on @marsidev/react-turnstile for React applications"],"zh":["需要Cloudflare账户和Turnstile配置","可选依赖@marsidev/react-turnstile用于React应用程序"],"ja":["CloudflareアカウントとTurnstileの設定が必要","Reactアプリケーションの場合、@marsidev/react-turnstileへの依存はオプション"],"ko":["Cloudflare 계정 및 Turnstile 구성 필요","리액트 애플리케이션의 경우 @marsidev/react-turnstile에 대한 종속성은 선택 사항"],"es":["Requiere una cuenta de Cloudflare y una configuración de Turnstile","Dependencia opcional de @marsidev/react-turnstile para aplicaciones de React"],"fr":["Nécessite un compte Cloudflare et une configuration Turnstile","Dépendance optionnelle de @marsidev/react-turnstile pour les applications React"],"de":["Benötigt ein Cloudflare-Konto und eine Turnstile-Konfiguration","Optional: Abhängigkeit von @marsidev/react-turnstile für React-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Exige conta Cloudflare e configuração Turnstile","Dependência opcional em @marsidev/react-turnstile para aplicações React"],"ru":["Требует учетной записи Cloudflare и настройки Turnstile","Необязательная зависимость от @marsidev/react-turnstile для приложений React"],"ar":["يتطلب حساب Cloudflare وضبط Turnstile","اعتماد اختياري على @marsidev/react-turnstile لتطبيقات React"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('TheGreatAxios/nft-marketplace-skale-agent-skill-build-claude-code/skale-dev', 'community', 'TheGreatAxios', 'nft-marketplace-skale-agent-skill-build-claude-code', 'TheGreatAxios/nft-marketplace-skale-agent-skill-build-claude-code', 'skale-dev', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.425Z', '2026-02-18T04:48:53.132Z', NULL, '{"id":"TheGreatAxios/nft-marketplace-skale-agent-skill-build-claude-code/skale-dev","name":"skale-dev","description":{"zh":"SKALE , Solidity EVM, Web, .","ja":"SKALE , Solidity EVM, Web, .","ko":"SKALE , Solidity EVM, Web, .","es":"Guía de desarrollo de SKALE Network para crear smart contracts y aplicaciones descentralizadas","fr":"Guide de développement de SKALE Network pour créer des smart contracts et des applications décentralisées","de":"Entwicklerleitfaden für SKALE Network zum Erstellen von Smart Contracts und dezentralen Anwendungen","pt":"Desenvolva aplicações na SKALE Network com nossa guia abrangente, cobrindo contratos inteligentes, integração web e móvel e mais","ru":"Разрабатывайте приложения на SKALE Network с нашей всесторонней документацией, охватывающей умные контракты, веб- и мобильную интеграцию и многое другое","ar":"طور تطبيقات على شبكة SKALE باستخدام دليلنا الشامل، الذي يغطي العقود الذكية وتكامل الويب والجوال والمزيد","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"SKALE ","ja":"SKALE","ko":"SKALE ","es":"Desarrollo de SKALE Network","fr":"Développement de SKALE Network","de":"SKALE Network Entwicklung","pt":"Guia de Desenvolvimento SKALE Network","ru":"Руководство по разработке на SKALE Network","ar":"دليل تطوير شبكة SKALE","en":"skale-dev"},"description":{"zh":"SKALE , Solidity EVM, Web, .","ja":"SKALE , Solidity EVM, Web, .","ko":"SKALE , Solidity EVM, Web, .","es":"Guía de desarrollo de SKALE Network para crear smart contracts y aplicaciones descentralizadas","fr":"Guide de développement de SKALE Network pour créer des smart contracts et des applications décentralisées","de":"Entwicklerleitfaden für SKALE Network zum Erstellen von Smart Contracts und dezentralen Anwendungen","pt":"Desenvolva aplicações na SKALE Network com nossa guia abrangente, cobrindo contratos inteligentes, integração web e móvel e mais","ru":"Разрабатывайте приложения на SKALE Network с нашей всесторонней документацией, охватывающей умные контракты, веб- и мобильную интеграцию и многое другое","ar":"طور تطبيقات على شبكة SKALE باستخدام دليلنا الشامل، الذي يغطي العقود الذكية وتكامل الويب والجوال والمزيد","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["SKALE Solidity EVM","Web"," ","BITE ","SKALE "],"ja":["SKALE Solidity EVM","Web"," ","BITE ","SKALE "],"ko":["SKALE Solidity EVM","Web"," ","BITE ","SKALE "],"es":["Desarrollo de smart contracts con Solidity","Integración con aplicaciones web y móviles","Implementación de puentes entre cadenas","Aplicaciones privadas con protocolo BITE","Despliegue en redes Mainnet, Testnet y Sandbox"],"fr":["Développement de smart contracts avec Solidity","Intégration avec des applications web et mobiles","Implémentation de ponts entre chaînes","Applications privées avec protocole BITE","Déploiement sur les réseaux Mainnet, Testnet et Sandbox"],"de":["Entwicklung von Smart Contracts mit Solidity","Integration mit Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen","Implementierung von Bridges zwischen Netzwerken","Private Anwendungen mit BITE-Protokoll","Bereitstellung in Mainnet-, Testnet- und Sandbox-Netzwerken"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de contratos inteligentes em Solidity","Integração com aplicações web e móveis","Implantação de contratos em chains SKALE","Privacidade e segurança com BITE Protocol","CROSS-CHAIN bridges"],"ru":["Разработка умных контрактов на Solidity","Интеграция с веб- и мобильными приложениями","Развертывание контрактов на цепочках SKALE","Конфиденциальность и безопасность с помощью BITE Protocol","Мосты между цепочками"],"ar":["تطوير العقود الذكية بلغة Solidity","التكامل مع التطبيقات الويب والجوال","نشر العقود على سلاسل SKALE","الخصوصية والأمان باستخدام بروتوكول BITE","جسور متقاطعة بين السلاسل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["SKALE ","Solidity EVM","Web","BITE "," ","SKALE "],"ja":["SKALE ","Solidity EVM","Web","BITE "," ","SKALE "],"ko":["SKALE ","Solidity EVM","Web","BITE "," ","SKALE "],"es":["SKALE Network","desarrollo de smart contracts","integración web","aplicaciones móviles","puentes entre cadenas","aplicaciones privadas","protocolo BITE","Solidity","EVM"],"fr":["SKALE Network","développement de smart contracts","intégration web","applications mobiles","ponts entre chaînes","applications privées","protocole BITE","Solidity","EVM"],"de":["SKALE Network","Entwicklung von Smart Contracts","Web-Integration","Mobile-Anwendungen","Bridges zwischen Netzwerken","private Anwendungen","BITE-Protokoll","Solidity","EVM"],"pt":["SKALE Network","Desenvolvimento de contratos inteligentes","Integração web e móvel","Privacidade e segurança","BITE Protocol","CROSS-CHAIN bridges"],"ru":["SKALE Network","Разработка умных контрактов","Веб- и мобильная интеграция","Конфиденциальность и безопасность","BITE Protocol","Мосты между цепочками"],"ar":["SKALE Network","تطوير العقود الذكية","التكامل الويب والجوال","الخصوصية والأمان","بروتوكول BITE","جسور متقاطعة بين السلاسل"]}},"owner":"TheGreatAxios","repo":"nft-marketplace-skale-agent-skill-build-claude-code","repoPath":"TheGreatAxios/nft-marketplace-skale-agent-skill-build-claude-code","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.425Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"skale-dev","description":"SKALE Network development guidelines for building scalable dApps, smart contracts, and cross-chain solutions (February 2026). Use when building Solidity contracts, integrating SKALE into web/mobile apps, deploying to SKALE chains, or implementing privacy with BITE Protocol.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# SKALE Network Development\n\nComprehensive development guide for SKALE Network, covering smart contracts, web/mobile integration, cross-chain bridges, and privacy primitives using BITE Protocol.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Building Solidity or EVM smart contracts for SKALE\n- Integrating SKALE into web applications or dApps\n- Deploying contracts to SKALE chains (Mainnet/Testnet/Sandbox)\n- Building private EVM applications with encrypted transactions\n- Implementing automa","body":"# SKALE Network Development\n\nComprehensive development guide for SKALE Network, covering smart contracts, web/mobile integration, cross-chain bridges, and privacy primitives using BITE Protocol.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Building Solidity or EVM smart contracts for SKALE\n- Integrating SKALE into web applications or dApps\n- Deploying contracts to SKALE chains (Mainnet/Testnet/Sandbox)\n- Building private EVM applications with encrypted transactions\n- Implementing automated on-chain transactions\n- Building cross-chain applications (SKALE↔Ethereum, SKALE↔Base, inter-SKALE)\n- Working with x402 and on-chain agents\n- Implementing privacy features with BITE Protocol threshold encryption\n- Bridging assets via skale-bridge\n\n## Development Areas\n\n| Area | Focus | Key Tools |\n|------|-------|-----------|\n| Smart Contracts | Solidity/EVM contracts for SKALE | Foundry, Hardhat, solidity-dev-tips |\n| Web Apps | Frontend integration with SKALE | Web3 SDKs, RPC endpoints |\n| Mobile Apps | Native SKALE mobile integration | Mobile SDKs |\n| Infrastructure | RPC, indexing, storage | SKALE Network endpoints |\n| Cross-Chain | Bridge integration | skale-bridge |\n| Privacy | Threshold encryption | BITE Protocol |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Chain Selection (CRITICAL)\n\n- `chain-target-correct` - Use correct chain: Mainnet/Testnet/Sandbox, Europa/Calypso\n- `chain-gas-terminology` - Use \"gas\" terminology correctly for SKALE (zero gas fee context)\n- `chain-naming` - Use \"SKALE\" not \"skale\" in all references\n\n### 2. Smart Contract Development (HIGH)\n\n- `contracts-compiler-settings` - Use correct Solidity compiler: Shanghai (≤0.8.24) for standard, Istanbul (≤0.8.20) for CTX\n- `contracts-solidity-patterns` - Apply solidity-dev-tips when using Foundry/Hardhat\n- `contracts-deployment` - Follow proper deployment sequences for SKALE chains (use `--legacy --slow` for Foundry)\n- `contracts-cross-chain` - Handle cross-chain message passing patterns\n\n### 3. Privacy (HIGH)\n\n- `privacy-bite-protocol` - Use BITE Protocol for threshold encryption of transaction data\n\n### 4. Bridge Integration (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `bridge-skale-bridge` - Use skale-bridge for asset movement to/from SKALE\n- `bridge-cross-chain-validation` - Validate cross-chain transactions properly\n- `bridge-error-handling` - Handle bridge failures and retries\n\n### 5. Web Application Integration (MEDIUM)\n\n- `web-rpc-endpoints` - Use correct SKALE RPC endpoints\n- `web-wallet-connection` - Implement wallet connection for SKALE chains\n- `web-transaction-handling` - Handle zero-gas transaction patterns\n\n### 6. Native Features (MEDIUM)\n\n- `random-number-generation` - Use SKALE native RNG at precompile 0x18\n\n### 7. x402 & Agents (MEDIUM)\n\n- `x402-onchain-agents` - Build with x402 on-chain agent standards\n- `x402-automation` - Implement automated transaction patterns\n\n### 8. Infrastructure (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `infra-indexing` - Set up indexing for SKALE chains\n- `infra-storage` - Configure storage solutions for SKALE\n- `infra-rpc-fallback` - Implement RPC endpoint fallback\n\n### 9. Chain-Specific Guides (MEDIUM)\n\n- `skale-on-base` - SKALE Base chain configuration and usage\n- `skale-on-ethereum` - Ethereum↔SKALE bridge integration\n\n## How to Work\n\n### Problem-Solving Workflow\n\n1. **Identify Development Area**\n   - Web Application, Mobile, Smart Contracts, Infrastructure, or External SDK\n\n2. **Clarify and Plan**\n   - Ask necessary questions for full clarity\n   - Create task list (verbose PRDs for new features)\n\n3. **Select Resources**\n   - Pull in context for tools/libraries/frameworks\n   - Access knowledge for your specific Area\n   - Identify correct blockchain target\n\n4. **Implement**\n   - Stay focused, avoid unapproved changes\n   - Use SKALE specifics: RPC endpoints, \"SKALE\" naming, \"gas\" terminology\n   - Use Foundry with `--legacy --slow` for SKALE deployments\n   - Use Shanghai compiler (≤0.8.24) for standard contracts, Istanbul (≤0.8.20) for CTX\n   - Build clean, simple, self-documenting code\n   - Provide exact file changes and commands\n\n5. **Deliverables**\n   - **Code changes**: Exact file changes, no rambling\n   - **Research**: Short, concise output with clear actions\n   - **Answers**: Brief, clear responses\n\n## Compiler Settings Summary\n\n| Feature | Compiler Version | Notes |\n|---------|-----------------|-------|\n| Standard contracts | Shanghai or lower (≤ 0.8.24) | Recommended: 0.8.24 |\n| Conditional TX (CTX) | Istanbul (≤ 0.8.20) | CTX requires Istanbul compiler |\n| BITE Phase I | Any supported version | No special requirements |\n\n## Foundry Deployment\n\nAlways use SKALE-specific flags:\n```bash\nforge script script/Deploy.s.s \\\n  --rpc-url $SKALE_RPC_URL \\\n  --private-key $PRIVATE_KEY \\\n  --legacy \\\n  --slow \\\n  --broadcast\n```\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- `solidity-dev-tips` - Solidity best practices for Foundry/Hardhat\n- `BITE Protocol` - Threshold encryption for transaction privacy\n- `skale-bridge` - Asset bridging to/from SKALE\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:48:53.132Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Blockchain Agents needing comprehensive SKALE Network development capabilities, including smart contract deployment and cross-chain bridge integration.","zh":"非常适合需要全面SKALE网络开发能力的区块链代理，包括智能合约部署和跨链桥集成。","ja":"SKALEネットワークの総合的な開発能力、スマートコントラクトのデプロイ、クロスチェーンブリッジの統合が必要なブロックチェーンエージェントに最適です。","ko":"스마트 계약 배포 및 크로스 체인 브리지를 포함한 완전한 SKALE 네트워크 개발 기능이 필요한 블록 체인 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Blockchain que necesitan capacidades de desarrollo de SKALE Network integrales, incluyendo la implementación de contratos inteligentes y la integración de puentes entre cadenas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de Blockchain ayant besoin de capacités de développement de réseau SKALE complètes, notamment le déploiement de contrats intelligents et l''intégration de ponts inter-chaînes.","de":"Perfekt für Blockchain-Agents, die umfassende SKALE-Netzwerk-Entwicklungsfähigkeiten benötigen, einschließlich der Bereitstellung von Smart Contracts und der Integration von Bridges zwischen Blockchain-Netzwerken.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Blockchain que necessitam de capacidades de desenvolvimento abrangentes da Rede SKALE, incluindo implantação de contrato inteligente e integração de ponte de cadeia cruzada.","ru":"Идеально для агентов блокчейна, которым требуются всесторонние возможности разработки сети SKALE, включая развертывание смарт-контрактов и интеграцию межцепочечных мостов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل بلوكشين الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات تطوير شاملة لشبكة سكالي، بما في ذلك نشر عقد ذكية وتكامل جسر السلسلة العابرة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build, deploy, and manage Solidity and EVM smart contracts on SKALE Network, leveraging BITE Protocol for privacy primitives and encrypted transactions, and seamlessly integrating with web and mobile applications via cross-chain bridges.","zh":"赋予代理构建、部署和管理SKALE网络上的Solidity和EVM智能合约的能力，利用BITE协议进行隐私原语和加密事务，并通过跨链桥与Web和移动应用程序无缝集成。","ja":"エージェントがSKALEネットワーク上でSolidityとEVMスマートコントラクトを構築、デプロイ、管理できるようにし、BITEプロトコルを使用してプライバシープリミティブと暗号化トランザクションを提供し、クロスチェーンブリッジを介してWebおよびモバイルアプリケーションとシームレスに統合します。","ko":"에이전트가 SKALE 네트워크에서 솔리디티 및 EVM 스마트 계약을 구축, 배포 및 관리할 수 있도록 하며, BITE 프로토콜을 사용하여 개인 정보 보호 원시 및 암호화 트랜잭션을 제공하며, 크로스 체인 브리지를 통해 웹 및 모바일 애플리케이션과 무縫으로 통합합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear, implementar y gestionar contratos inteligentes de Solidity y EVM en SKALE Network, aprovechando el protocolo BITE para primitivas de privacidad y transacciones cifradas, e integrándose de forma transparente con aplicaciones web y móviles a través de puentes inter-chaînes.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer, de déployer et de gérer des contrats intelligents Solidity et EVM sur le réseau SKALE, en exploitant le protocole BITE pour les primitives de confidentialité et les transactions chiffrées, et en s''intégrant de manière transparente avec les applications web et mobile via des ponts inter-chaînes.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Solidity- und EVM-Smart-Contracts auf SKALE-Netzwerk zu erstellen, bereitzustellen und zu verwalten, indem es das BITE-Protokoll für Privatsphäre-Primitiven und verschlüsselte Transaktionen nutzt und nahtlos in Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen über Bridges zwischen Blockchain-Netzwerken integriert.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir, implantar e gerenciar contratos inteligentes Solidity e EVM na Rede SKALE, utilizando o Protocolo BITE para primitivos de privacidade e transações criptografadas, e integrando-se perfeitamente com aplicativos web e móveis por meio de pontes de cadeia cruzada.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать, развертывать и управлять смарт-контрактами Solidity и EVM в сети SKALE, используя протокол BITE для примитивов конфиденциальности и зашифрованных транзакций, а также бесшовно интегрируясь с веб- и мобильными приложениями через межцепочечные мосты.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على بناء وتوزيع وإدارة عقود ذكية صلبة وايفيام على شبكة سكالي، باستخدام بروتوكول بايت لعمليات الخصوصية والمعاملات المشفرة، وتكاملها بسلاسة مع التطبيقات الويب والجوال عبر جسور السلسلة العابرة."},"useCases":{"en":["Deploying contracts to SKALE chains for Mainnet, Testnet, and Sandbox environments","Building private EVM applications with encrypted transactions using BITE Protocol","Integrating SKALE into web applications or dApps for enhanced functionality"],"zh":["将合约部署到SKALE链以用于Mainnet、Testnet和Sandbox环境","使用BITE协议构建具有加密事务的私有EVM应用程序","将SKALE集成到Web应用程序或dApps中以增强功能"],"ja":["Mainnet、Testnet、Sandbox環境向けのSKALEチェーンへのコントラクトのデプロイ","BITEプロトコルを使用して暗号化トランザクションを備えたプライベートEVMアプリケーションを構築する","SKALEをWebアプリケーションまたはdAppsに統合して機能を強化する"],"ko":["메인넷, 테스트넷, 샌드박스 환경을 위한 SKALE 체인에 계약을 배포하는 것","BITE 프로토콜을 사용하여 암호화 트랜잭션을 갖춘 사적 EVM 애플리케이션을 구축하는 것","기능을 강화하기 위해 웹 애플리케이션 또는 dApps에 SKALE을 통합하는 것"],"es":["Implementar contratos en cadenas SKALE para entornos Mainnet, Testnet y Sandbox","Crear aplicaciones EVM privadas con transacciones cifradas utilizando el protocolo BITE","Integrar SKALE en aplicaciones web o dApps para una funcionalidad mejorada"],"fr":["Déployer des contrats sur des chaînes SKALE pour les environnements Mainnet, Testnet et Sandbox","Créer des applications EVM privées avec des transactions chiffrées en utilisant le protocole BITE","Intégrer SKALE dans des applications web ou des dApps pour une fonctionnalité améliorée"],"de":["Bereitstellen von Verträgen in SKALE-Netzwerken für Mainnet-, Testnet- und Sandbox-Umgebungen","Erstellen von privaten EVM-Anwendungen mit verschlüsselten Transaktionen unter Verwendung des BITE-Protokolls","Integrieren von SKALE in Web- oder dApps-Anwendungen für erweiterte Funktionalität"],"pt":["Implantação de contratos em cadeias SKALE para ambientes Mainnet, Testnet e Sandbox","Construção de aplicativos EVM privados com transações criptografadas usando o Protocolo BITE","Integração da SKALE em aplicativos web ou dApps para funcionalidade aprimorada"],"ru":["Развертывание контрактов на цепочках SKALE для сред Mainnet, Testnet и Sandbox","Создание частных приложений EVM с зашифрованными транзакциями, используя протокол BITE","Интеграция SKALE в веб-приложения или dApps для улучшения функциональности"],"ar":["نشر العقود على سلاسل سكالي لبيئات المينت وتيستنت وساندبوكس","بناء تطبيقات ايفيام الخاصة مع معاملات مشفرة باستخدام بروتوكول بايت","تكامل سكالي في تطبيقات الويب أو دابس لتحسين الوظائف"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Solidity and EVM smart contract development","SKALE Network specific, may not be compatible with other blockchain platforms"],"zh":["需要Solidity和EVM智能合约开发知识","SKALE网络特定，可能与其他区块链平台不兼容"],"ja":["SolidityとEVMスマートコントラクトの開発知識が必要","SKALEネットワーク固有であり、他のブロックチェーンプラットフォームと互換性がない可能性がある"],"ko":["솔리디티 및 EVM 스마트 계약 개발 지식이 필요","SKALE 네트워크 고유이며, 다른 블록 체인 플랫폼과 호환되지 않을 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de desarrollo de contratos inteligentes de Solidity y EVM","Específico de SKALE Network, puede que no sea compatible con otras plataformas de blockchain"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en développement de contrats intelligents Solidity et EVM","Spécifique au réseau SKALE, peut ne pas être compatible avec d''autres plateformes de blockchain"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse in der Entwicklung von Smart Contracts mit Solidity und EVM","Spezifisch für SKALE-Netzwerk, kann möglicherweise nicht mit anderen Blockchain-Plattformen kompatibel sein"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de desenvolvimento de contrato inteligente Solidity e EVM","Específico da Rede SKALE, pode não ser compatível com outras plataformas de blockchain"],"ru":["Требует знаний разработки смарт-контрактов Solidity и EVM","Специфичен для сети SKALE, может быть несовместим с другими платформами блокчейна"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بتطوير عقد ذكية صلبة وايفيام","محدد لشبكة سكالي، قد لا يكون متوافقًا مع منصات بلوكشين أخرى"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('wtyang/basic-antd-vite/ant-design', 'community', 'wtyang', 'basic-antd-vite', 'wtyang/basic-antd-vite', 'ant-design', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.425Z', '2026-02-18T04:49:17.855Z', NULL, '{"id":"wtyang/basic-antd-vite/ant-design","name":"ant-design","description":{"zh":"Ant Design 6 与 React 18-19 的后台管理项目基础架构，提供核心组件、主题和 CSS-in-JS 等功能","ja":"Ant Design 6 と React 18-19 の後台管理プロジェクト基盤。コアコンポーネント、テーマ、CSS-in-JS などの機能を提供","ko":"Ant Design 6 및 React 18-19의 백엔드 관리 프로젝트 기본 구조. 핵심 컴포넌트, 테마, CSS-in-JS 등의 기능을 제공","es":"Ant Design es un framework de React para proyectos de administración que ofrece una amplia gama de componentes y herramientas para crear interfaces de usuario personalizadas","fr":"Ant Design est un framework React pour les projets d''administration qui offre une large gamme de composants et d''outils pour créer des interfaces utilisateur personnalisées","de":"Ant Design ist ein React-Framework für Verwaltungsprojekte, das eine breite Palette von Komponenten und Tools zur Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Benutzeroberflächen bietet","pt":"Ant Design é um framework de interface de usuário para React que fornece uma variedade de componentes e ferramentas para criar interfaces de usuário personalizadas e responsivas","ru":"Ant Design - это фреймворк интерфейса пользователя для React, который предоставляет множество компонентов и инструментов для создания индивидуальных и адаптивных интерфейсов пользователя","ar":"أنت ديزاين هو إطار واجهة المستخدم لمطوري رياكت الذي يوفر مجموعة من المكونات وأدوات لإنشاء واجهات مستخدم مخصصة ومتجاوبة","en":"一个后台管理项目基础架构，基于react antd v6 vite"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Ant Design 6 与 React 18-19 后台管理项目基础架构","ja":"Ant Design 6 と React 18-19 の後台管理プロジェクト基盤","ko":"Ant Design 6 및 React 18-19 백엔드 관리 프로젝트 기본 구조","es":"Ant Design: Framework de React para proyectos de administ...","fr":"Ant Design : Framework React pour les projets d''administr...","de":"Ant Design: React-Framework für Verwaltungsprojekte","pt":"Ant Design: Framework de Interface para React","ru":"Ant Design: Фреймворк интерфейса для React","ar":"أنت ديزاين: إطار واجهة لمطوري رياكت","en":"ant-design"},"description":{"zh":"Ant Design 6 与 React 18-19 的后台管理项目基础架构，提供核心组件、主题和 CSS-in-JS 等功能","ja":"Ant Design 6 と React 18-19 の後台管理プロジェクト基盤。コアコンポーネント、テーマ、CSS-in-JS などの機能を提供","ko":"Ant Design 6 및 React 18-19의 백엔드 관리 프로젝트 기본 구조. 핵심 컴포넌트, 테마, CSS-in-JS 등의 기능을 제공","es":"Ant Design es un framework de React para proyectos de administración que ofrece una amplia gama de componentes y herramientas para crear interfaces de usuari...","fr":"Ant Design est un framework React pour les projets d''administration qui offre une large gamme de composants et d''outils pour créer des interfaces utilisateur...","de":"Ant Design ist ein React-Framework für Verwaltungsprojekte, das eine breite Palette von Komponenten und Tools zur Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Benutzer...","pt":"Ant Design é um framework de interface de usuário para React que fornece uma variedade de componentes e ferramentas para criar interfaces de usuário personal...","ru":"Ant Design - это фреймворк интерфейса пользователя для React, который предоставляет множество компонентов и инструментов для создания индивидуальных и адапти...","ar":"أنت ديزاين هو إطار واجهة المستخدم لمطوري رياكت الذي يوفر مجموعة من المكونات وأدوات لإنشاء واجهات مستخدم مخصصة ومتجاوبة","en":"一个后台管理项目基础架构，基于react antd v6 vite"},"definition":{"en":"一个后台管理项目基础架构，基于react antd v6 vite"},"features":{"zh":["核心组件","主题和 CSS-in-JS","SSR 和无障碍支持","性能优化","Pro 布局和路由","X 模式和 AI/聊天 UI 模式"],"ja":["コアコンポーネント","テーマと CSS-in-JS","SSR と無障碍サポート","パフォーマンス最適化","Pro レイアウトとルーティング","X パターンと AI/チャット UI パターン"],"ko":["핵심 컴포넌트","테마와 CSS-in-JS","SSR 및 접근성 지원","성능 최적화","Pro 레이아웃과 라우팅","X 패턴과 AI/채팅 UI 패턴"],"es":["Componentes core de antd","Personalización de temas y tokens","Compatibilidad con CSS-in-JS","Soporte para SSR y a11y","Diseños de layout y enrutamiento de Ant Design Pro"],"fr":["Composants core d''antd","Personnalisation de thèmes et de tokens","Compatibilité avec CSS-in-JS","Prise en charge de SSR et d''a11y","Conceptions de layout et de routage d''Ant Design Pro"],"de":["Core-Komponenten von antd","Anpassung von Themen und Tokens","Unterstützung für CSS-in-JS","Unterstützung für SSR und a11y","Layout- und Routing-Entwürfe von Ant Design Pro"],"pt":["Componentes core para React","Personalização de temas e tokens","Suporte a CSS-in-JS","Suporte a SSR e a11y","Layouts e rotas personalizadas"],"ru":["Основные компоненты для React","Настройка тем и токенов","Поддержка CSS-in-JS","Поддержка SSR и a11y","Пользовательские макеты и маршруты"],"ar":["مكونات أساسية لرياكت","تخصيص السمات والرموز","دعم CSS-in-JS","دعم SSR و a11y","تصاميم وطرق مخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Ant Design 6","React 18-19","后台管理项目","核心组件","主题和 CSS-in-JS","SSR 和无障碍","性能优化","Pro 布局和路由"],"ja":["Ant Design 6","React 18-19","後台管理プロジェクト","コアコンポーネント","テーマと CSS-in-JS","SSR と無障碍","パフォーマンス最適化","Pro レイアウトとルーティング"],"ko":["Ant Design 6","React 18-19","백엔드 관리 프로젝트","핵심 컴포넌트","테마와 CSS-in-JS","SSR 및 접근성","성능 최적화","Pro 레이아웃과 라우팅"],"es":["Ant Design","React","Vite","proyectos de administración","componentes core","personalización de temas","CSS-in-JS","SSR","a11y"],"fr":["Ant Design","React","Vite","projets d''administration","composants core","personnalisation de thèmes","CSS-in-JS","SSR","a11y"],"de":["Ant Design","React","Vite","Verwaltungsprojekte","Core-Komponenten","Anpassung von Themen","CSS-in-JS","SSR","a11y"],"pt":["Ant Design","React","Interface de usuário","Componentes core","Personalização de temas","CSS-in-JS","SSR","a11y"],"ru":["Ant Design","React","Интерфейс пользователя","Основные компоненты","Настройка тем","CSS-in-JS","SSR","a11y"],"ar":["أنت ديزاين","رياكت","واجهة المستخدم","مكونات أساسية","تخصيص السمات","CSS-in-JS","SSR","a11y"]}},"owner":"wtyang","repo":"basic-antd-vite","repoPath":"wtyang/basic-antd-vite","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.425Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ant-design","description":"Ant Design ecosystem guidance covering antd 6.x, Ant Design Pro 5/ProComponents, and Ant Design X v2 (AI/chat UI). Use when making component/layout decisions, theming/tokens, SSR, routing/access, CRUD patterns, or AI chat UI integrations.","bodyPreview":"# Ant Design\n\n## S - Scope\n\n- Target: antd@^6 with React 18-19, plus ant-design-pro@^5 / @ant-design/pro-components and @ant-design/x@^2 when applicable.\n- Cover: core components, theming/tokens, css-in-js, SSR, a11y, performance, Pro layouts/routing/access/CRUD, and X (AI/chat UI) patterns.\n- Avoid: undocumented APIs, internal `.ant-*` class coupling, or cross-version mixing without explicit request.\n\n### Default assumptions (when not specified)\n\n- Language: TypeScript.\n- Styling: prefer tokens","body":"# Ant Design\n\n## S - Scope\n\n- Target: antd@^6 with React 18-19, plus ant-design-pro@^5 / @ant-design/pro-components and @ant-design/x@^2 when applicable.\n- Cover: core components, theming/tokens, css-in-js, SSR, a11y, performance, Pro layouts/routing/access/CRUD, and X (AI/chat UI) patterns.\n- Avoid: undocumented APIs, internal `.ant-*` class coupling, or cross-version mixing without explicit request.\n\n### Default assumptions (when not specified)\n\n- Language: TypeScript.\n- Styling: prefer tokens, `classNames`, and `styles`; avoid global overrides.\n- Provider: a single `ConfigProvider` at app root, unless isolation is required.\n- Dependencies: do not add new packages unless required or requested.\n\n### Scope rules (must follow)\n\n- Use only officially documented antd APIs and patterns.\n- Do not invent props, events, or component names.\n- Use only officially documented Pro/X APIs and patterns.\n- Assume v6 by default; do not mix v5 APIs unless explicitly requested.\n- Do not add global `.ant-*` overrides; prefer tokens and component tokens.\n- Keep examples short; no long, multi-screen samples in the main skill.\n- Do not rely on internal `.ant-*` classes or DOM details; if unavoidable, state risk and alternatives.\n- Theme priority is fixed: global tokens -> component tokens -> alias tokens.\n- For SSR, provide the minimal provider setup and verification points (hydration, style order, duplication).\n- Route complex issues to `Reference` files; main skill gives only decisions and entry points.\n\n### Complex triggers (must open a `Reference`)\n\n- More than 3 interaction states or cross-field linkage (Form).\n- Remote search, large data, or custom rendering (Select).\n- Server sorting/filtering/pagination, virtualization, fixed columns/headers (Table).\n- Async load, checkStrictly, or virtualization (Tree).\n- Controlled `fileList`, `customRequest`, preview/auth edge cases (Upload).\n- SSR style order, streaming/hydration errors, or performance bottlenecks.\n- Pro layouts, route-driven menus, or access control (Layout/Access).\n- ProTable/ProForm with request coupling, dynamic fields, or perf tuning.\n- X streaming, tool rendering, or Markdown extensions beyond the defaults.\n\n### `Reference` index (Chinese)\n\n| Topic           | Description                                          | `Reference`                           |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| Core v6         | Version scope, migration notes, theming/SSR overview | `references/antd-v6.md`               |\n| Legacy v5       | Existing v5 projects and migration guardrails        | `references/antd-v5.md`               |\n| Form advanced   | Dynamic forms, dependencies, validation perf         | `references/form-advanced.md`         |\n| Table advanced  | Sorting/filtering/virtualization patterns            | `references/table-advanced.md`        |\n| Upload advanced | Controlled upload, customRequest, edge cases         | `references/upload-advanced.md`       |\n| Select advanced | Remote search, tags, rendering and a11y              | `references/select-advanced.md`       |\n| Tree advanced   | Async load, checkStrictly, virtual                   | `references/tree-advanced.md`         |\n| Pro v5          | Pro 5 scope and baseline guidance                    | `references/pro-v5.md`                |\n| Pro layout      | Layouts, menus, access, multi-layout patterns        | `references/pro-layout-advanced.md`   |\n| ProTable        | Query/table coupling, request patterns, perf         | `references/protable-advanced.md`     |\n| ProForm         | Step forms, dynamic fields, table linkage            | `references/proform-advanced.md`      |\n| X v2            | X v2 scope and baseline guidance                     | `references/x-v2.md`                  |\n| X components    | Message/tool component patterns                      | `references/x-components-advanced.md` |\n| X SDK           | Streaming integration and state model                | `references/x-sdk-advanced.md`        |\n| X Markdown      | X Markdown extensions and rendering                  | `references/x-markdown-advanced.md`   |\n\n### Reference routing rule\n\n- Do not expand advanced topics in the main skill.\n- Jump to a `Reference` if any condition matches:\n  - More than 3 interaction states.\n  - Async flows or large data sets.\n  - Virtualization or performance tuning.\n  - Complex accessibility requirements.\n\n## P - Process\n\n### 1) Identify the layer first\n\n- Core antd UI, Pro admin app, or X chat/agent UI?\n- If Pro or X is involved, route to the relevant `Reference` when complexity triggers match.\n\n### 2) Clarify context before advising\n\n- Framework and rendering: Next.js / Umi / Vite? CSR / SSR / streaming?\n- antd version: confirm v6 if unclear.\n- Theming depth: small token changes or component-level overrides?\n- Data scale: large lists/tables/trees/selects?\n- Interaction complexity: controlled state, linkage, async, auth, upload flows?\n\n### 3) Provider minimal set\n\n- CSR: usually `ConfigProvider` only.\n- SSR or strict style order: add `StyleProvider` as per `references/antd-v6.md`.\n- One app, one root provider; local themes only for isolation needs.\n\n### 4) Component selection rules (core antd)\n\n- Form: prefer `Form` as source of truth unless external state is required.\n- Overlay: `Modal` for blocking flows; `Drawer` for side context or long content.\n- Lists: structured data uses `Table`, light lists use `List`; `Table` needs stable `rowKey`.\n- Large data: use virtualization (see `references/table-advanced.md`).\n- Select: local filter uses `filterOption`; remote search uses `showSearch` + `filterOption={false}` + `onSearch` (see `references/select-advanced.md`).\n- Upload: controlled flow uses `fileList`; complex flow uses `customRequest` (see `references/upload-advanced.md`).\n\n### 5) Pro decision shortcuts (when Pro is in scope)\n\n- Routes are the menu source of truth; avoid hand-built menus.\n- Access control is page-first; UI hides are secondary; backend still enforces.\n- CRUD uses ProTable/ProForm schemas as the source of truth (see Pro references).\n\n### 6) X decision shortcuts (when X is in scope)\n\n- Model messages/tools as serializable data; JSX is a pure view.\n- Streaming needs stable keys, throttled updates, and scroll management (see X references).\n\n### 7) Theming decision chain\n\n1. Use global tokens for most cases.\n2. Use component tokens or `classNames`/`styles` for differences.\n3. Only if unavoidable, use scoped CSS overrides and state the risk.\n4. Never rely on global `.ant-*` overrides.\n\n### 8) Shunt complexity to `Reference`\n\n- If any complex trigger matches, provide decision + minimal skeleton + `Reference` path.\n- Details live in the corresponding `references/*.md`.\n\n### 9) a11y and performance checks\n\n- a11y: keyboard access, focus management for overlays, icon buttons with `aria-label`, not color-only states.\n- perf: stable keys, memoized columns, avoid frequent setState, use virtualization and throttling as needed.\n\n## O - Output\n\n### Output should include (as needed)\n\n- Component and layout recommendations with 1-3 sentence rationale.\n- Minimal provider and theming strategy.\n- SSR, perf, and a11y risks with concrete mitigations.\n- Pro: route/layout plan, access model, and ProTable/ProForm schema when relevant.\n- X: message/tool schema and streaming state model when relevant.\n- A `Reference` path when complex triggers match.\n- Advice only (no code) when the request is selection or decision guidance.\n\n### Output forbidden\n\n- Inventing antd APIs, tokens, or relying on internal classes without calling out risk.\n- Replacing tokens with global CSS overrides.\n- Vague SSR/hydration advice without verification points.\n\n### Regression checklist (prefer 5-10 items)\n\n- [ ] Provider: one root `ConfigProvider`; SSR style order is controlled.\n- [ ] Theming: tokens first, no broad global `.ant-*` overrides.\n- [ ] Form: validation and linkage are within `Form` and reproducible.\n- [ ] Table: stable `rowKey`; pagination/sort/filter entry points are consistent.\n- [ ] Select: remote search disables local filter; a11y checks pass.\n- [ ] Upload: controlled vs uncontrolled mode is clear; failure and retry flows defined.\n- [ ] Overlays: close and destroy behavior is defined (`destroyOnClose` etc).\n- [ ] Performance: stable keys and memoization; virtualization or throttling when needed.\n- [ ] Pro: route-driven menus/access are consistent with backend enforcement.\n- [ ] X: streaming state, stop/retry, and tool rendering are deterministic.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:49:17.855Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents requiring advanced React UI component libraries with antd v6 and Vite support.","zh":"适用于需要高级 React UI 组件库的前端代理，支持 antd v6 和 Vite。","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントが高度な React UI コンポーネント ライブラリを必要とする場合に適しています。antd v6 および Vite をサポートしています。","ko":"고급 React UI 컴포넌트 라이브러리가 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다. antd v6 및 Vite를 지원합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de frontend que requieren bibliotecas de componentes de interfaz de usuario avanzados de React con soporte para antd v6 y Vite.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de frontend nécessitant des bibliothèques de composants d''interface utilisateur avancés React avec prise en charge d''antd v6 et Vite.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte React-Benutzeroberflächen-Bibliotheken mit Unterstützung für antd v6 und Vite benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend que exigem bibliotecas de componentes UI avançados do React com suporte ao antd v6 e Vite.","ru":"Идеально для фронтенд-агентов, требующих продвинутых библиотек компонентов React UI с поддержкой antd v6 и Vite.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الأمامية الذي يتطلب مكتبات مكونات واجهة المستخدم المتقدمة من React مع دعم antd v6 و Vite."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build responsive and accessible UI components using ant-design-pro, leveraging core components, theming/tokens, CSS-in-JS, and SSR capabilities, while ensuring a11y and performance optimization.","zh":"赋予代理构建响应式和可访问的 UI 组件的能力，使用 ant-design-pro，利用核心组件、主题/令牌、CSS-in-JS 和 SSR 功能，同时确保 a11y 和性能优化。","ja":"エージェントが ant-design-pro を使用して、コアコンポーネント、テーミング/トークン、CSS-in-JS、SSR 機能を利用し、a11y とパフォーマンス最適化を確保しながら、レスポンシブでアクセス可能な UI コンポーネントを構築する能力を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 ant-design-pro를 사용하여 핵심 구성 요소, 테마/토큰, CSS-in-JS 및 SSR 기능을 활용하고 a11y 및 성능 최적화를 보장하는 동시에 반응형 및 접근 가능한 UI 구성 요소를 구축할 수 있는 능력을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear componentes de interfaz de usuario responsivos y accesibles utilizando ant-design-pro, aprovechando componentes básicos, temas/tokens, CSS-in-JS y capacidades de SSR, al mismo tiempo que garantiza la optimización de accesibilidad y rendimiento.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des composants d''interface utilisateur responsifs et accessibles en utilisant ant-design-pro, en exploitant les composants de base, les thèmes/jetons, CSS-in-JS et les capacités de SSR, tout en assurant l''optimisation de l''accessibilité et des performances.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, responsive und zugängliche Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten mit ant-design-pro zu erstellen, indem es Kernkomponenten, Themen/Token, CSS-in-JS und SSR-Fähigkeiten nutzt und gleichzeitig die Optimierung von Zugänglichkeit und Leistung sicherstellt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir componentes de UI responsivos e acessíveis usando ant-design-pro, aproveitando componentes principais, temas/tokens, CSS-in-JS e capacidades SSR, garantindo a acessibilidade e otimização de desempenho.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать отзывчивые и доступные компоненты UI, используя ant-design-pro, используя основные компоненты, темы/токены, CSS-in-JS и возможности SSR, обеспечивая доступность и оптимизацию производительности.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من بناء مكونات واجهة المستخدم المستجيبة وسهلة الوصول باستخدام ant-design-pro، واستخدام المكونات الأساسية والسمات / الرموز والسي إس إس-إن-جيه إس والقدرات على مستوى الخادم، مع ضمان إمكانية الوصول وأداء الأمثل."},"useCases":{"en":["Building responsive and customizable dashboard layouts with Pro layouts and routing","Implementing CRUD operations with ant-design-pro components","Enhancing UI accessibility and performance with a11y and optimization techniques"],"zh":["使用 Pro 布局和路由构建响应式和可定制的仪表板布局","使用 ant-design-pro 组件实现 CRUD 操作","使用 a11y 和优化技术提高 UI 可访问性和性能"],"ja":["Pro レイアウトとルーティングを使用してレスポンシブでカスタマイズ可能なダッシュボード レイアウトを構築する","ant-design-pro コンポーネントを使用して CRUD 操作を実装する","a11y と最適化技術を使用して UI のアクセシビリティとパフォーマンスを向上させる"],"ko":["Pro 레이아웃과 라우팅을 사용하여 반응형 및 사용자 정의 가능한 대시보드 레이아웃을 구축하는 것","ant-design-pro 컴포넌트를 사용하여 CRUD 연산을 구현하는 것","a11y 및 최적화 기술을 사용하여 UI 접근성 및 성능을 향상시키는 것"],"es":["Creación de diseños de paneles de instrumentos personalizables y responsivos con Pro layouts y enrutamiento","Implementación de operaciones CRUD con componentes ant-design-pro","Mejora de la accesibilidad y el rendimiento de la interfaz de usuario con técnicas de a11y y optimización"],"fr":["Création de dispositions de tableaux de bord personnalisables et responsifs avec les dispositions Pro et l''enrutement","Mise en œuvre d''opérations CRUD avec des composants ant-design-pro","Amélioration de l''accessibilité et des performances de l''interface utilisateur avec des techniques d''a11y et d''optimisation"],"de":["Erstellung von anpassbaren und responsiven Armaturenbrett-Layouts mit Pro-Layouts und Routing","Implementierung von CRUD-Operationen mit ant-design-pro-Komponenten","Verbesserung der Zugänglichkeit und Leistung der Benutzeroberfläche mit a11y- und Optimierungstechniken"],"pt":["Construir layouts de painel responsivos e personalizáveis com layouts e roteamento Pro","Implementar operações CRUD com componentes ant-design-pro","Melhorar a acessibilidade e o desempenho da UI com técnicas de acessibilidade e otimização"],"ru":["Построение отзывчивых и настраиваемых макетов панели с помощью макетов и маршрутизации Pro","Реализация операций CRUD с помощью компонентов ant-design-pro","Улучшение доступности и производительности UI с помощью методов доступности и оптимизации"],"ar":["بناء تخطيطات لوحة القيادة المستجيبة والقابلة للتعديل باستخدام تخطيطات وتصريف برو","تنفيذ عمليات CRUD باستخدام مكونات ant-design-pro","تحسين إمكانية الوصول والأداء الأمثل لواجهة المستخدم باستخدام تقنيات إمكانية الوصول والأداء الأمثل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React 18-19 and antd@^6","Avoids undocumented APIs and internal class coupling","Limited to specific versions of ant-design-pro and @ant-design/x"],"zh":["需要 React 18-19 和 antd@^6","避免未记录的 API 和内部类耦合","仅限于 ant-design-pro 和 @ant-design/x 的特定版本"],"ja":["React 18-19 と antd@^6 が必要","未記載の API と内部クラスコーピングを避ける","ant-design-pro と @ant-design/x の特定のバージョンに限定される"],"ko":["React 18-19 및 antd@^6이 필요","기록되지 않은 API 및 내부 클래스 결합을 피함","ant-design-pro 및 @ant-design/x의 특정 버전에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere React 18-19 y antd@^6","Evita API no documentadas y acoplamiento de clases internas","Limitado a versiones específicas de ant-design-pro y @ant-design/x"],"fr":["Nécessite React 18-19 et antd@^6","Évite les API non documentées et le couplage de classes internes","Limité à des versions spécifiques d''ant-design-pro et @ant-design/x"],"de":["Benötigt React 18-19 und antd@^6","Vermeidet nicht dokumentierte APIs und interne Klassenkopplung","Begrenzt auf bestimmte Versionen von ant-design-pro und @ant-design/x"],"pt":["Exige React 18-19 e antd@^6","Evita APIs não documentadas e acoplamento de classe interna","Limitado a versões específicas do ant-design-pro e @ant-design/x"],"ru":["Требует React 18-19 и antd@^6","Избегает недокументированных API и внутреннего связывания классов","Ограничен конкретными версиями ant-design-pro и @ant-design/x"],"ar":["يتطلب React 18-19 و antd@^6","يتجنب واجهات برمجة التطبيقات غير المocumented والربط الداخلي للفصول الدراسية","محدود للإصدارات المحددة من ant-design-pro و @ant-design/x"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('1wos/sdkhackthon/moru-python', 'community', '1wos', 'sdkhackthon', '1wos/sdkhackthon', 'moru-python', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.425Z', '2026-02-18T04:49:32.919Z', NULL, '{"id":"1wos/sdkhackthon/moru-python","name":"moru-python","description":{"zh":"Moru Python SDK, Python.","ja":"Moru Python SDK, Python.","ko":"Moru Python SDK, Python.","es":"El SDK de Moru Python es una herramienta para desarrollar aplicaciones con Sandbox. Permite crear y ejecutar comandos en un entorno aislado","fr":"Le SDK Moru Python est un outil pour développer des applications avec Sandbox. Il permet de créer et d''exécuter des commandes dans un environnement isolé","de":"Das Moru Python SDK ist ein Werkzeug für die Entwicklung von Anwendungen mit Sandbox. Es ermöglicht die Erstellung und Ausführung von Befehlen in einer isolierten Umgebung","pt":"O Moru Python SDK é uma ferramenta para desenvolvedores que permite criar sandboxes de forma fácil e rápida.","ru":"Moru Python SDK — это инструмент для разработчиков, который позволяет создавать sandbox легко и быстро","ar":"مكتبة Moru Python هي أداة للمطورين التي تمكنهم من إنشاء sandboxes بسهولة وسرعة","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Moru Python SDK","ja":"Moru Python","ko":"Moru Python","es":"Moru Python SDK: Desarrollo de Aplicaciones con Sandbox","fr":"SDK Moru Python : Développement d''Applications avec Sandbox","de":"Moru Python SDK: Anwendungsentwicklung mit Sandbox","pt":"Moru Python SDK: Desenvolva com Eficiência","ru":"Moru Python SDK: Разработка с Эффективностью","ar":"مكتبة Moru Python: قم بالتطوير بفعالية","en":"moru-python"},"description":{"zh":"Moru Python SDK, Python.","ja":"Moru Python SDK, Python.","ko":"Moru Python SDK, Python.","es":"El SDK de Moru Python es una herramienta para desarrollar aplicaciones con Sandbox. Permite crear y ejecutar comandos en un entorno aislado","fr":"Le SDK Moru Python est un outil pour développer des applications avec Sandbox. Il permet de créer et d''exécuter des commandes dans un environnement isolé","de":"Das Moru Python SDK ist ein Werkzeug für die Entwicklung von Anwendungen mit Sandbox. Es ermöglicht die Erstellung und Ausführung von Befehlen in einer isoli...","pt":"O Moru Python SDK é uma ferramenta para desenvolvedores que permite criar sandboxes de forma fácil e rápida.","ru":"Moru Python SDK — это инструмент для разработчиков, который позволяет создавать sandbox легко и быстро","ar":"مكتبة Moru Python هي أداة للمطورين التي تمكنهم من إنشاء sandboxes بسهولة وسرعة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Sandbox","Python","SDK","Moru Python","Python","Sandbox"],"ja":["Sandbox","Python","SDK","Moru Python","Python","Sandbox"],"ko":["Sandbox","Python","SDK","Moru Python","Python","Sandbox"],"es":["Creación de sandbox","Ejecución de comandos","Lectura y escritura de archivos","Instalación con pip","Entorno aislado"],"fr":["Création de sandbox","Exécution de commandes","Lecture et écriture de fichiers","Installation avec pip","Environnement isolé"],"de":["Erstellung von Sandbox","Ausführung von Befehlen","Lesen und Schreiben von Dateien","Installation mit pip","Isolierte Umgebung"],"pt":["Crie sandboxes de forma fácil e rápida","Execute comandos em um ambiente isolado","Leia e escreva arquivos em um sandbox","Desenvolva aplicações com eficiência","Integre com o seu fluxo de trabalho atual"],"ru":["Создавайте sandbox легко и быстро","Выполняйте команды в изолированной среде","Читайте и записывайте файлы в sandbox","Разрабатывайте приложения эффективно","Интегрируйте с вашим текущим рабочим процессом"],"ar":["قم بإنشاء sandboxes بسهولة وسرعة","قم بتنفيذ الأوامر في بيئة معزولة","قراءة وكتابة الملفات في sandbox","قم بتطوير التطبيقات بفعالية","ادمج مع تدفق العمل الحالي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Moru Python","Python SDK","Sandbox","Python","Moru Python SDK","Python","SDK","Python","Moru"],"ja":["Moru Python","Python SDK","Sandbox","Python","Moru Python SDK","Python","SDK","Python","Moru"],"ko":["Moru Python","Python SDK","Sandbox","Python","Moru Python SDK","Python","SDK","Python","Moru"],"es":["Moru Python SDK","desarrollo de aplicaciones","Sandbox","pip","entorno aislado","ejecución de comandos","lectura de archivos"],"fr":["SDK Moru Python","développement d''applications","Sandbox","pip","environnement isolé","exécution de commandes","lecture de fichiers"],"de":["Moru Python SDK","Anwendungsentwicklung","Sandbox","pip","isolierte Umgebung","Ausführung von Befehlen","Lesen von Dateien"],"pt":["Moru Python SDK","desenvolvimento de aplicações","sandboxes","ambientes de desenvolvimento isolados","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","pip","python"],"ru":["Moru Python SDK","разработка приложений","sandbox","изолированные среды разработки","инструменты разработки","pip","python"],"ar":["مكتبة Moru Python","تطوير التطبيقات","sandboxes","بيئات تطوير معزولة","أدوات التطوير","pip","بايثون"]}},"owner":"1wos","repo":"sdkhackthon","repoPath":"1wos/sdkhackthon","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.425Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"moru-python","description":"Use this skill when writing Python code that interacts with Moru cloud sandboxes. This includes: creating sandboxes with `Sandbox.create()`, running commands with `sbx.commands.run()`, reading and writing files with `sbx.files.read()` and `sbx.files.write()`, working with persistent volumes using the `Volume` class, building custom templates with the `Template` builder, handling background processes, streaming command output, and async operations with `AsyncSandbox`. The skill covers the complete Python SDK API including error handling with `TimeoutException`, `CommandExitException`, `AuthenticationException`, and other exceptions from `moru.exceptions`. Use this skill whenever users want to: execute code safely in isolated environments, build AI agents that run untrusted code, create data processing pipelines, run web scrapers, set up development environments, or any Python automation involving Moru sandboxes. Triggers on: moru python, from moru import, Sandbox.create, pip install moru, moru sdk python, python sandbox, AsyncSandbox, Volume.create, Template.build, or any Python code that needs to run in isolated cloud environments. Do NOT use this skill for JavaScript/TypeScript code - use moru-javascript instead.","bodyPreview":"# Moru Python SDK\n\n```bash\npip install moru\n```\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```python\nfrom moru import Sandbox\n\nwith Sandbox.create() as sbx:\n    sbx.files.write(\"/app/script.py\", \"print(''Hello from Moru!'')\")\n    result = sbx.commands.run(\"python3 /app/script.py\")\n    print(result.stdout)\n# Sandbox auto-killed\n```\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Code |\n|------|------|\n| Create sandbox | `Sandbox.create()` or `Sandbox.create(\"template\")` |\n| Run command | `sbx.commands.run(\"cmd\")` |\n| Read file | `sbx.files.r","body":"# Moru Python SDK\n\n```bash\npip install moru\n```\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```python\nfrom moru import Sandbox\n\nwith Sandbox.create() as sbx:\n    sbx.files.write(\"/app/script.py\", \"print(''Hello from Moru!'')\")\n    result = sbx.commands.run(\"python3 /app/script.py\")\n    print(result.stdout)\n# Sandbox auto-killed\n```\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Code |\n|------|------|\n| Create sandbox | `Sandbox.create()` or `Sandbox.create(\"template\")` |\n| Run command | `sbx.commands.run(\"cmd\")` |\n| Read file | `sbx.files.read(\"/path\")` |\n| Write file | `sbx.files.write(\"/path\", \"content\")` |\n| Background process | `sbx.commands.run(\"cmd\", background=True)` |\n| Set timeout | `Sandbox.create(timeout=600)` or `sbx.set_timeout(600)` |\n| Use volume | `Sandbox.create(volume_id=vol.volume_id, volume_mount_path=\"/workspace\")` |\n\n---\n\n## Sandbox Lifecycle\n\n### Create\n```python\nfrom moru import Sandbox\n\n# Default template\nsbx = Sandbox.create()\n\n# Specific template\nsbx = Sandbox.create(\"python\")\n\n# With options\nsbx = Sandbox.create(\n    template=\"python\",\n    timeout=600,                    # seconds (default: 300)\n    metadata={\"project\": \"myapp\"},\n    envs={\"API_KEY\": \"secret\"},\n    volume_id=\"vol_xxx\",\n    volume_mount_path=\"/workspace\",\n    allow_internet_access=True,\n)\n```\n\n### Context Manager (Recommended)\n```python\nwith Sandbox.create() as sbx:\n    result = sbx.commands.run(\"echo hello\")\n# Auto-killed on exit\n```\n\n### Connect to Existing\n```python\nsbx = Sandbox.connect(\"sbx_abc123\")\nif sbx.is_running():\n    result = sbx.commands.run(\"echo still alive\")\n```\n\n### Kill\n```python\nsbx.kill()\n# or\nSandbox.kill(\"sbx_abc123\")\n```\n\n### List All\n```python\nfor info in Sandbox.list():\n    print(f\"{info.sandbox_id}: {info.state}\")\n```\n\n---\n\n## Running Commands\n\n### Basic\n```python\nresult = sbx.commands.run(\"echo hello\")\nprint(result.stdout)      # \"hello\\n\"\nprint(result.stderr)      # \"\"\nprint(result.exit_code)   # 0\n```\n\n### With Options\n```python\nresult = sbx.commands.run(\n    \"python3 script.py\",\n    cwd=\"/app\",                         # Working directory\n    user=\"root\",                        # Run as root\n    envs={\"DEBUG\": \"1\"},               # Environment variables\n    timeout=120,                        # Command timeout (seconds)\n    on_stdout=lambda d: print(d, end=\"\"),  # Stream stdout\n    on_stderr=lambda d: print(d, end=\"\"),  # Stream stderr\n)\n```\n\n### Background Process\n```python\nhandle = sbx.commands.run(\"python3 server.py\", background=True)\n\n# Get public URL\nurl = sbx.get_host(8080)\nprint(f\"Server at: {url}\")\n\n# Send input\nhandle.send_stdin(\"quit\\n\")\n\n# Wait for completion\nresult = handle.wait()\n\n# Or kill it\nhandle.kill()\n```\n\n### Process Management\n```python\n# List running processes\nfor proc in sbx.commands.list():\n    print(f\"PID {proc.pid}: {proc.command}\")\n\n# Kill by PID\nsbx.commands.kill(1234)\n```\n\n---\n\n## Working with Files\n\n### Read/Write\n```python\n# Write\nsbx.files.write(\"/app/config.json\", ''{\"key\": \"value\"}'')\n\n# Read\ncontent = sbx.files.read(\"/app/config.json\")\n\n# Binary\ndata = sbx.files.read(\"/app/image.png\", format=\"bytes\")\nsbx.files.write(\"/app/output.bin\", binary_data)\n\n# Stream large files\nfor chunk in sbx.files.read(\"/app/large.bin\", format=\"stream\"):\n    process(chunk)\n```\n\n### Multiple Files\n```python\nsbx.files.write_files([\n    {\"path\": \"/app/file1.txt\", \"data\": \"content1\"},\n    {\"path\": \"/app/file2.txt\", \"data\": \"content2\"},\n])\n```\n\n### Directory Operations\n```python\n# Check existence\nif sbx.files.exists(\"/app/config.json\"):\n    config = sbx.files.read(\"/app/config.json\")\n\n# List directory\nfor entry in sbx.files.list(\"/app\"):\n    print(f\"{entry.type}: {entry.name} ({entry.size} bytes)\")\n\n# Recursive list\nentries = sbx.files.list(\"/app\", depth=5)\n\n# Get info\ninfo = sbx.files.get_info(\"/app/file.txt\")\nprint(f\"Size: {info.size}, Modified: {info.modified_time}\")\n\n# Create directory\nsbx.files.make_dir(\"/app/data\")\n\n# Delete\nsbx.files.remove(\"/app/old_file.txt\")\n\n# Rename/Move\nsbx.files.rename(\"/app/old.txt\", \"/app/new.txt\")\n```\n\n### Watch for Changes\n```python\nhandle = sbx.files.watch_dir(\"/app\")\nfor event in handle.events():\n    print(f\"{event.type}: {event.name}\")\nhandle.stop()\n```\n\n---\n\n## Volumes (Persistent Storage)\n\n```python\nfrom moru import Sandbox, Volume\n\n# Create volume (idempotent)\nvol = Volume.create(name=\"my-workspace\")\n\n# Attach to sandbox\nsbx = Sandbox.create(\n    volume_id=vol.volume_id,\n    volume_mount_path=\"/workspace\"  # Must be /workspace, /data, /mnt, or /volumes\n)\n\n# Data in /workspace persists after kill\nsbx.commands.run(\"echo ''persistent'' > /workspace/data.txt\")\nsbx.kill()\n\n# Later - data still there\nsbx2 = Sandbox.create(volume_id=vol.volume_id, volume_mount_path=\"/workspace\")\nresult = sbx2.commands.run(\"cat /workspace/data.txt\")\nprint(result.stdout)  # \"persistent\"\n```\n\n### Volume Operations (No Sandbox Needed)\n```python\nvol = Volume.get(\"my-workspace\")\n\n# List files\nfor f in vol.list_files(\"/\"):\n    print(f\"{f.type}: {f.name}\")\n\n# Download/Upload\ncontent = vol.download(\"/data.txt\")\nvol.upload(\"/config.json\", b''{\"key\": \"value\"}'')\n\n# Delete\nvol.delete(\"/old_file.txt\")\n\n# Delete volume (WARNING: permanent)\nvol.delete()\n```\n\n---\n\n## Templates\n\n```python\nfrom moru import Template\nfrom moru.template import wait_for_port\n\n# Define template\ntemplate = (\n    Template()\n    .from_python_image(\"3.11\")\n    .apt_install([\"curl\", \"git\"])\n    .pip_install([\"flask\", \"pandas\", \"requests\"])\n    .copy(\"./app\", \"/app\")\n    .set_workdir(\"/app\")\n    .set_envs({\"FLASK_ENV\": \"production\"})\n    .set_start_cmd(\"python app.py\", wait_for_port(5000))\n)\n\n# Build\ninfo = Template.build(template, alias=\"my-flask-app\")\n\n# Use\nsbx = Sandbox.create(\"my-flask-app\")\n```\n\n### From Dockerfile\n```python\ntemplate = Template().from_dockerfile(\"./Dockerfile\")\nTemplate.build(template, alias=\"my-app\")\n```\n\n### Build Options\n```python\nTemplate.build(\n    template,\n    alias=\"my-app\",\n    cpu_count=4,\n    memory_mb=2048,\n    on_build_logs=lambda entry: print(entry.message),\n)\n\n# Background build\ninfo = Template.build_in_background(template, alias=\"my-app\")\nstatus = Template.get_build_status(info)  # building, success, failed\n```\n\n---\n\n## Async Support\n\n```python\nimport asyncio\nfrom moru import AsyncSandbox\n\nasync def main():\n    async with await AsyncSandbox.create() as sbx:\n        result = await sbx.commands.run(\"echo hello\")\n        print(result.stdout)\n\n        await sbx.files.write(\"/tmp/test.txt\", \"content\")\n        content = await sbx.files.read(\"/tmp/test.txt\")\n\nasyncio.run(main())\n```\n\n---\n\n## Error Handling\n\n```python\nfrom moru import Sandbox\nfrom moru.exceptions import (\n    SandboxException,           # Base\n    TimeoutException,           # Operation timed out\n    NotFoundException,          # Resource not found\n    AuthenticationException,    # Invalid API key\n    NotEnoughSpaceException,    # Disk full\n    CommandExitException,       # Non-zero exit (has exit_code, stdout, stderr)\n)\n\ntry:\n    with Sandbox.create() as sbx:\n        result = sbx.commands.run(\"python3 script.py\", timeout=30)\nexcept TimeoutException:\n    print(\"Command timed out\")\nexcept CommandExitException as e:\n    print(f\"Failed with exit code {e.exit_code}: {e.stderr}\")\nexcept AuthenticationException:\n    print(\"Invalid API key - check MORU_API_KEY\")\n```\n\n---\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n### Always cleanup sandboxes\n```python\n# ❌ WRONG\nsbx = Sandbox.create()\nsbx.commands.run(\"echo hello\")\n# Forgot to kill - sandbox keeps running!\n\n# ✅ CORRECT\nwith Sandbox.create() as sbx:\n    sbx.commands.run(\"echo hello\")\n```\n\n### Don''t assume packages exist\n```python\n# ❌ WRONG\nsbx.commands.run(\"python3 -c ''import pandas''\")  # ImportError!\n\n# ✅ CORRECT\nsbx.commands.run(\"pip install pandas\", timeout=120)\nsbx.commands.run(\"python3 -c ''import pandas''\")\n```\n\n### Write to volume path for persistence\n```python\n# ❌ WRONG - lost on kill\nsbx.files.write(\"/home/user/data.txt\", \"important\")\n\n# ✅ CORRECT - persisted\nsbx.files.write(\"/workspace/data.txt\", \"important\")\n```\n\n### Handle command failures\n```python\nresult = sbx.commands.run(\"python3 script.py\")\nif result.exit_code != 0:\n    print(f\"Error: {result.stderr}\")\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:49:32.919Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Python Automation Agents needing sandboxed environment capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要沙盒环境功能的Python自动化代理。","ja":"Python自動化エージェントがサンドボックス環境の機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"샌드박스 환경 기능이 필요한 Python 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de automatización de Python que necesitan capacidades de entorno aislado.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''automatisation Python nécessitant des capacités d''environnement sandbox.","de":"Perfekt für Python-Automatisierungsagenten, die Sandbox-Umgebungs-Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação Python que precisam de capacidades de ambiente sandbox.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации Python, требующих функций песочницы.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الاوتمه بايثون الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات بيئة المربى."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create isolated sandboxes for running Python scripts, utilizing the `moru` library for secure execution and file management, including reading and writing files with `sbx.files` and executing commands with `sbx.commands`.","zh":"使代理能够创建隔离的沙盒以运行Python脚本，利用`moru`库进行安全执行和文件管理，包括使用`sbx.files`读写文件和使用`sbx.commands`执行命令。","ja":"エージェントがPythonスクリプトを実行するための隔離されたサンドボックスを作成できるようにし、`moru`ライブラリを使用してセキュアな実行とファイル管理を行い、`sbx.files`を使用してファイルの読み書きと`sbx.commands`を使用してコマンドの実行を行う。","ko":"에이전트가 Python 스크립트를 실행하는 데 사용되는 격리된 샌드박스를 생성할 수 있도록 하며, `moru` 라이브러리를 사용하여 보안 실행 및 파일 관리를 수행하고, `sbx.files`를 사용하여 파일 읽기/쓰기 및 `sbx.commands`를 사용하여 명령어 실행을 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear sandbox aislados para ejecutar scripts de Python, utilizando la biblioteca `moru` para ejecución y administración de archivos seguros, incluyendo la lectura y escritura de archivos con `sbx.files` y la ejecución de comandos con `sbx.commands`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des sandbox isolés pour exécuter des scripts Python, en utilisant la bibliothèque `moru` pour une exécution et une gestion de fichiers sécurisées, y compris la lecture et l''écriture de fichiers avec `sbx.files` et l''exécution de commandes avec `sbx.commands`.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, isolierte Sandboxes zu erstellen, um Python-Skripte auszuführen, wobei die Bibliothek `moru` für sichere Ausführung und Dateiverwaltung verwendet wird, einschließlich Lesen und Schreiben von Dateien mit `sbx.files` und Ausführen von Befehlen mit `sbx.commands`.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar sandboxes isoladas para executar scripts Python, utilizando a biblioteca `moru` para execução segura e gerenciamento de arquivos, incluindo leitura e escrita de arquivos com `sbx.files` e execução de comandos com `sbx.commands`.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать изолированные песочницы для запуска скриптов Python, используя библиотеку `moru` для безопасного выполнения и управления файлами, включая чтение и запись файлов с помощью `sbx.files` и выполнение команд с помощью `sbx.commands`.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إنشاء مربى معزولة لتشغيل البرامج النصية بايثون، باستخدام مكتبة `moru` للتنفيذ الآمن وإدارة الملفات، بما في ذلك قراءة وكتابة الملفات باستخدام `sbx.files` وتنفيذ الأوامر باستخدام `sbx.commands`."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Python script execution in a sandboxed environment","Generating and running temporary Python scripts","Debugging Python code in an isolated setting"],"zh":["在沙盒环境中自动执行Python脚本","生成和运行临时Python脚本","在隔离环境中调试Python代码"],"ja":["サンドボックス環境でPythonスクリプトを自動実行する","一時的なPythonスクリプトを生成して実行する","隔離された環境でPythonコードをデバッグする"],"ko":["샌드박스 환경에서 Python 스크립트를 자동으로 실행하는 것","임시 Python 스크립트를 생성하여 실행하는 것","격리된 환경에서 Python 코드를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar la ejecución de scripts de Python en un entorno aislado","Generar y ejecutar scripts de Python temporales","Depurar código Python en un entorno aislado"],"fr":["Automatiser l''exécution de scripts Python dans un environnement sandbox","Générer et exécuter des scripts Python temporaires","Déboguer du code Python dans un environnement isolé"],"de":["Automatisieren der Ausführung von Python-Skripten in einer Sandbox-Umgebung","Erstellen und Ausführen von temporären Python-Skripten","Debuggen von Python-Code in einer isolierten Umgebung"],"pt":["Automatizar a execução de scripts Python em um ambiente sandbox.","Gerar e executar scripts Python temporários.","Depurar código Python em um ambiente isolado."],"ru":["Автоматизировать запуск скриптов Python в песочнице.","Генерировать и запускать временные скрипты Python.","Отлаживать код Python в изолированной среде."],"ar":["أتمتة تشغيل البرامج النصية بايثون في بيئة مربى.","إنشاء و تشغيل البرامج النصية بايثون المؤقتة.","تصحيح أخطاء الكود بايثون في بيئة معزولة."]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python 3 installation","Dependent on `moru` library"],"zh":["需要Python 3的安装","依赖于`moru`库"],"ja":["Python 3のインストールが必要","`moru`ライブラリに依存する"],"ko":["Python 3 설치가 필요함","`moru` 라이브러리에 의존함"],"es":["Requiere instalación de Python 3","Dependiente de la biblioteca `moru`"],"fr":["Nécessite une installation de Python 3","Dépend de la bibliothèque `moru`"],"de":["Benötigt eine Python-3-Installation","Abhängig von der Bibliothek `moru`"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Python 3.","Dependente da biblioteca `moru`."],"ru":["Требует установки Python 3.","Зависит от библиотеки `moru`."],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت بايثون 3.","يعتمد على مكتبة `moru`."]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
