بيقات","أتمتة المهام","إرسال رسائل البريد الإلكتروني","إنشاء مشاكل","نشر الرسائل"]}},"owner":"CuCryptos","repo":"sixroundsdeep","repoPath":"CuCryptos/sixroundsdeep","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.425Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"connect-apps","description":"Connect Claude to external apps like Gmail, Slack, GitHub. Use this skill when the user wants to send emails, create issues, post messages, or take actions in external services.","bodyPreview":"# Connect Apps\n\nConnect Claude to 1000+ apps. Actually send emails, create issues, post messages - not just generate text about it.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Step 1: Install the Plugin\n\n```\n/plugin install composio-toolrouter\n```\n\n### Step 2: Run Setup\n\n```\n/composio-toolrouter:setup\n```\n\nThis will:\n- Ask for your free API key (get one at [platform.composio.dev](https://platform.composio.dev/?utm_source=Github&utm_content=AwesomeSkills))\n- Configure Claude''s connection to 1000+ apps\n- Take about 60 s","body":"# Connect Apps\n\nConnect Claude to 1000+ apps. Actually send emails, create issues, post messages - not just generate text about it.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Step 1: Install the Plugin\n\n```\n/plugin install composio-toolrouter\n```\n\n### Step 2: Run Setup\n\n```\n/composio-toolrouter:setup\n```\n\nThis will:\n- Ask for your free API key (get one at [platform.composio.dev](https://platform.composio.dev/?utm_source=Github&utm_content=AwesomeSkills))\n- Configure Claude''s connection to 1000+ apps\n- Take about 60 seconds\n\n### Step 3: Try It!\n\nAfter setup, restart Claude Code and try:\n\n```\nSend me a test email at YOUR_EMAIL@example.com\n```\n\nIf it works, you''re connected!\n\n## What You Can Do\n\n| Ask Claude to... | What happens |\n|------------------|--------------|\n| \"Send email to sarah@acme.com about the launch\" | Actually sends the email |\n| \"Create GitHub issue: fix login bug\" | Creates the issue |\n| \"Post to Slack #general: deploy complete\" | Posts the message |\n| \"Add meeting notes to Notion\" | Adds to Notion |\n\n## Supported Apps\n\n**Email:** Gmail, Outlook, SendGrid\n**Chat:** Slack, Discord, Teams, Telegram\n**Dev:** GitHub, GitLab, Jira, Linear\n**Docs:** Notion, Google Docs, Confluence\n**Data:** Sheets, Airtable, PostgreSQL\n**And 1000+ more...**\n\n## How It Works\n\n1. You ask Claude to do something\n2. Composio Tool Router finds the right tool\n3. First time? You''ll authorize via OAuth (one-time)\n4. Action executes and returns result\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n- **\"Plugin not found\"** → Make sure you ran `/plugin install composio-toolrouter`\n- **\"Need to authorize\"** → Click the OAuth link Claude provides, then say \"done\"\n- **Action failed** → Check you have permissions in the target app\n\n---\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <b>Join 20,000+ developers building agents that ship</b>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://platform.composio.dev/?utm_source=Github&utm_content=AwesomeSkills\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Get_Started_Free-4F46E5?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Get Started\"/>\n  </a>\n</p>\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:50:00.932Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude, AutoGPT, and LangChain needing seamless integration with 1000+ apps for enhanced automation capabilities.","zh":"适合像 Claude、AutoGPT 和 LangChain 这样的 AI 代理，需要与 1000+ 个应用程序无缝集成以增强自动化能力。","ja":"Claude、AutoGPT、LangChain などの AI エージェントに適しています。これらのエージェントは、自動化機能を強化するために 1000 を超えるアプリケーションとのシームレスな統合を必要とします。","ko":"Claude, AutoGPT, LangChainなどの AI 에이전트에 적합합니다. 이러한 에이전트는 자동화 기능을 강화하기 위해 1,000개 이상의 애플리케이션과 무.AddRange 통합을 필요로 합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude, AutoGPT y LangChain que necesitan una integración sin problemas con más de 1000 aplicaciones para capacidades de automatización mejoradas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Claude, AutoGPT et LangChain nécessitant une intégration transparente avec plus de 1000 applications pour des capacités d''automatisation améliorées.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Claude, AutoGPT und LangChain, die eine nahtlose Integration mit über 1000 Apps für erweiterte Automatisierungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude, AutoGPT, and LangChain needing seamless integration with 1000+ apps for enhanced automation capabilities.","ru":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude, AutoGPT, and LangChain needing seamless integration with 1000+ apps for enhanced automation capabilities.","ar":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude, AutoGPT, and LangChain needing seamless integration with 1000+ apps for enhanced automation capabilities."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to actually send emails, create issues, and post messages via API connections, leveraging protocols and libraries for comprehensive app interaction, including configuration with Composio Toolrouter and obtaining a free API key from platform.composio.dev.","zh":"赋予代理实际通过 API 连接发送电子邮件、创建问题和发布消息的能力，利用协议和库进行全面应用交互，包括使用 Composio Toolrouter 配置和从 platform.composio.dev 获取免费 API 密钥。","ja":"エージェントが実際に API 接続を介してメールを送信し、問題を作成し、メッセージを投稿できるようにし、Composio Toolrouter 構成および platform.composio.dev からの無料 API キーの取得を含むプロトコルとライブラリを利用して、アプリケーションの包括的な相互作用を可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 실제로 API 연결을 통해 이메일을 보낼 수 있고, 문제를 만들고, 메시지를 게시할 수 있는 기능을 부여하며, Composio Toolrouter 구성 및 platform.composio.dev에서 무료 API 키를 얻는 것을 포함하여 프로토콜 및 라이브러리를 활용하여 종합적인 앱 상호 작용을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a enviar correos electrónicos, crear problemas y publicar mensajes a través de conexiones de API, aprovechando protocolos y bibliotecas para una interacción de aplicaciones integral, incluida la configuración con Composio Toolrouter y la obtención de una clave de API gratuita desde platform.composio.dev.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''envoyer des courriels, de créer des problèmes et de publier des messages via des connexions d''API, en exploitant les protocoles et les bibliothèques pour une interaction d''applications complète, y compris la configuration avec Composio Toolrouter et l''obtention d''une clé d''API gratuite depuis platform.composio.dev.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, E-Mails zu senden, Probleme zu erstellen und Nachrichten über API-Verbindungen zu posten, indem es Protokolle und Bibliotheken für eine umfassende App-Interaktion nutzt, einschließlich der Konfiguration mit Composio Toolrouter und dem Erhalt eines kostenlosen API-Schlüssels von platform.composio.dev.","pt":"Empowers agents to actually send emails, create issues, and post messages via API connections, leveraging protocols and libraries for comprehensive app interaction, including configuration with Composio Toolrouter and obtaining a free API key from platform.composio.dev.","ru":"Empowers agents to actually send emails, create issues, and post messages via API connections, leveraging protocols and libraries for comprehensive app interaction, including configuration with Composio Toolrouter and obtaining a free API key from platform.composio.dev.","ar":"Empowers agents to actually send emails, create issues, and post messages via API connections, leveraging protocols and libraries for comprehensive app interaction, including configuration with Composio Toolrouter and obtaining a free API key from platform.composio.dev."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating email notifications via API","Creating issues in project management tools","Posting messages on social media platforms"],"zh":["通过 API 自动发送电子邮件通知","在项目管理工具中创建问题","在社交媒体平台上发布消息"],"ja":["API を介して自動的にメール通知を送信する","プロジェクト管理ツールで問題を作成する","ソーシャルメディアプラットフォームでメッセージを投稿する"],"ko":["API를 통해 자동으로 이메일 알림을 보내는 것","프로젝트 관리 도구에서 문제를 만드는 것","소셜 미디어 플랫폼에서 메시지를 게시하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de notificaciones por correo electrónico a través de API","Creación de problemas en herramientas de gestión de proyectos","Publicación de mensajes en plataformas de redes sociales"],"fr":["Automation des notifications par courriel via API","Création de problèmes dans les outils de gestion de projets","Publication de messages sur les plateformes de réseaux sociaux"],"de":["Automatisierung von E-Mail-Benachrichtigungen über API","Erstellung von Problemen in Projektmanagement-Tools","Veröffentlichen von Nachrichten auf sozialen Medien-Plattformen"],"pt":["Automating email notifications via API","Creating issues in project management tools","Posting messages on social media platforms"],"ru":["Automating email notifications via API","Creating issues in project management tools","Posting messages on social media platforms"],"ar":["Automating email notifications via API","Creating issues in project management tools","Posting messages on social media platforms"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Composio Toolrouter plugin installation","Needs a free API key from platform.composio.dev","Configuration takes approximately 60 seconds"],"zh":["需要安装 Composio Toolrouter 插件","需要从 platform.composio.dev 获取免费 API 密钥","配置大约需要 60 秒"],"ja":["Composio Toolrouter プラグインのインストールが必要","platform.composio.dev からの無料 API キーが必要","構成には約 60 秒かかります"],"ko":["Composio Toolrouter 플러그인의 설치가 필요합니다.","platform.composio.dev 에서 무료 API 키를 얻어야 합니다.","구성에는 약 60초가 걸립니다."],"es":["Requiere la instalación del plugin Composio Toolrouter","Necesita una clave de API gratuita desde platform.composio.dev","La configuración tarda aproximadamente 60 segundos"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation du plugin Composio Toolrouter","A besoin d''une clé d''API gratuite depuis platform.composio.dev","La configuration prend environ 60 secondes"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation des Composio Toolrouter-Plugins","Benötigt einen kostenlosen API-Schlüssel von platform.composio.dev","Die Konfiguration dauert ungefähr 60 Sekunden"],"pt":["Requires Composio Toolrouter plugin installation","Needs a free API key from platform.composio.dev","Configuration takes approximately 60 seconds"],"ru":["Requires Composio Toolrouter plugin installation","Needs a free API key from platform.composio.dev","Configuration takes approximately 60 seconds"],"ar":["Requires Co