ru":["Создание сложных форм","Валидация форм с помощью Yup","Управление состоянием форм","Реализация сложных шаблонов форм","Асинхронная отправка форм","Оптимизация производительности форм"],"ar":["إنشاء استمارات معقدة","التحقق من صحة الاستمارات مع Yup","إدارة حالة الاستمارات","تنفيذ أنماط الاستمارات المعقدة","إرسال الاستمارات بشكل غير متزامن","تحسين أداء الاستمارات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["React表单","Formik","表单验证","状态管理","复杂表单模式","异步表单提交","自定义表单组件","React表单库"],"ja":["Reactフォーム","Formik","フォームの検証","状態管理","複雑なフォームパターン","非同期フォーム送信","カスタムフォームコンポーネント","Reactフォームライブラリ"],"ko":["리액트 폼","formik","폼 검증","상태 관리","복잡한 폼 패턴","비동기 폼 제출","커스텀 폼 컴포넌트","리액트 폼 라이브러리"],"es":["Formik","React","formularios","validación","gestión de estado","Yup","patrones de formulario","envío asincrónico"],"fr":["Formik","React","formulaires","validation","gestion d''état","Yup","modèles de formulaire","envoi asynchrone"],"de":["Formik","React","Formulare","Validierung","Statusverwaltung","Yup","Formularmuster","asynchroner Eintrag"],"pt":["formik","react","formulários","validação de formulários","gerenciamento de estado","padrões de formulários","envio assíncrono","otimização de desempenho"],"ru":["formik","react","формы","валидация форм","управление состоянием","шаблоны форм","асинхронная отправка","оптимизация производительности"],"ar":["formik","رياكت","الاستمارات","التحقق من صحة الاستمارات","إدارة الحالة","أنماط الاستمارات","الإرسال غير المتزامن","تحسين الأداء"]}},"owner":"chathuraed","repo":"existing_project","repoPath":"chathuraed/existing_project","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.425Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"formik","description":"Build React forms with Formik library including validation, field management, form state, error handling, and async submissions. Use when creating forms, handling form validation with Yup, managing field state, or implementing complex form patterns in React applications.","version":"1.0","tags":["react","forms","formik","validation","yup","typescript"],"bodyPreview":"# Formik Skill\n\nA comprehensive guide for building forms in React using Formik, the most popular open-source form library.\n\n## When to use this skill\n\nUse this skill when you need to:\n- Create forms in React applications\n- Handle form validation (with or without Yup)\n- Manage form state, field values, and errors\n- Implement complex form patterns (arrays, nested objects, dynamic fields)\n- Handle async form submissions\n- Build custom form components with Formik hooks\n- Optimize form performance wi","body":"# Formik Skill\n\nA comprehensive guide for building forms in React using Formik, the most popular open-source form library.\n\n## When to use this skill\n\nUse this skill when you need to:\n- Create forms in React applications\n- Handle form validation (with or without Yup)\n- Manage form state, field values, and errors\n- Implement complex form patterns (arrays, nested objects, dynamic fields)\n- Handle async form submissions\n- Build custom form components with Formik hooks\n- Optimize form performance with FastField\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### The Formik Component\n\nFormik manages form state and provides helper methods through render props or child functions:\n\n```jsx\nimport { Formik, Form, Field, ErrorMessage } from ''formik'';\n\n<Formik\n  initialValues={{ email: '''', password: '''' }}\n  validate={values => {\n    const errors = {};\n    if (!values.email) {\n      errors.email = ''Required'';\n    }\n    return errors;\n  }}\n  onSubmit={(values, { setSubmitting }) => {\n    setTimeout(() => {\n      alert(JSON.stringify(values, null, 2));\n      setSubmitting(false);\n    }, 400);\n  }}\n>\n  {({ isSubmitting }) => (\n    <Form>\n      <Field type=\"email\" name=\"email\" />\n      <ErrorMessage name=\"email\" component=\"div\" />\n      <Field type=\"password\" name=\"password\" />\n      <ErrorMessage name=\"password\" component=\"div\" />\n      <button type=\"submit\" disabled={isSubmitting}>\n        Submit\n      </button>\n    </Form>\n  )}\n</Formik>\n```\n\n### Using Formik Hooks (Recommended)\n\nThe modern approach uses hooks for cleaner code:\n\n```jsx\nimport { useFormik } from ''formik'';\n\nfunction MyForm() {\n  const formik = useFormik({\n    initialValues: {\n      firstName: '''',\n      lastName: '''',\n      email: '''',\n    },\n    onSubmit: values => {\n      alert(JSON.stringify(values, null, 2));\n    },\n  });\n  \n  return (\n    <form onSubmit={formik.handleSubmit}>\n      <input\n        id=\"firstName\"\n        name=\"firstName\"\n        type=\"text\"\n        onChange={formik.handleChange}\n        value={formik.values.firstName}\n      />\n      \n      <input\n        id=\"email\"\n        name=\"email\"\n        type=\"email\"\n        onChange={formik.handleChange}\n        value={formik.values.email}\n      />\n      \n      <button type=\"submit\">Submit</button>\n    </form>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Validation\n\n### Schema Validation with Yup\n\nFormik integrates seamlessly with Yup for schema-based validation:\n\n```jsx\nimport * as Yup from ''yup'';\n\nconst SignupSchema = Yup.object().shape({\n  firstName: Yup.string()\n    .min(2, ''Too Short!'')\n    .max(50, ''Too Long!'')\n    .required(''Required''),\n  lastName: Yup.string()\n    .min(2, ''Too Short!'')\n    .max(50, ''Too Long!'')\n    .required(''Required''),\n  email: Yup.string()\n    .email(''Invalid email'')\n    .required(''Required''),\n  age: Yup.number()\n    .positive()\n    .integer()\n    .required(''Required''),\n});\n\n<Formik\n  initialValues={{\n    firstName: '''',\n    lastName: '''',\n    email: '''',\n    age: '''',\n  }}\n  validationSchema={SignupSchema}\n  onSubmit={values => {\n    console.log(values);\n  }}\n>\n  {/* ... */}\n</Formik>\n```\n\n### Custom Validation Function\n\nFor more control, write custom validation:\n\n```jsx\nconst validate = values => {\n  const errors = {};\n  \n  if (!values.email) {\n    errors.email = ''Required'';\n  } else if (!/^[A-Z0-9._%+-]+@[A-Z0-9.-]+\\.[A-Z]{2,}$/i.test(values.email)) {\n    errors.email = ''Invalid email address'';\n  }\n  \n  if (!values.password) {\n    errors.password = ''Required'';\n  } else if (values.password.length < 8) {\n    errors.password = ''Password must be at least 8 characters'';\n  }\n  \n  return errors;\n};\n```\n\n### Field-Level Validation\n\nValidate individual fields:\n\n```jsx\nfunction validateEmail(value) {\n  let error;\n  if (!value) {\n    error = ''Required'';\n  } else if (!/^[A-Z0-9._%+-]+@[A-Z0-9.-]+\\.[A-Z]{2,}$/i.test(value)) {\n    error = ''Invalid email address'';\n  }\n  return error;\n}\n\n<Field name=\"email\" validate={validateEmail} />\n```\n\n## Field Components\n\n### Basic Field Usage\n\nThe `Field` component handles common input types:\n\n```jsx\n<Field name=\"email\" type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Email\" />\n<Field name=\"description\" as=\"textarea\" rows=\"5\" />\n<Field name=\"color\" as=\"select\">\n  <option value=\"red\">Red</option>\n  <option value=\"green\">Green</option>\n  <option value=\"blue\">Blue</option>\n</Field>\n```\n\n### Radio Buttons\n\n```jsx\n<div role=\"group\">\n  <label>\n    <Field type=\"radio\" name=\"contactMethod\" value=\"email\" />\n    Email\n  </label>\n  <label>\n    <Field type=\"radio\" name=\"contactMethod\" value=\"phone\" />\n    Phone\n  </label>\n</div>\n```\n\n### Checkboxes\n\n```jsx\n<label>\n  <Field type=\"checkbox\" name=\"acceptTerms\" />\n  I accept the terms and conditions\n</label>\n\n{/* Checkbox group */}\n<div role=\"group\">\n  <label>\n    <Field type=\"checkbox\" name=\"hobbies\" value=\"reading\" />\n    Reading\n  </label>\n  <label>\n    <Field type=\"checkbox\" name=\"hobbies\" value=\"coding\" />\n    Coding\n  </label>\n</div>\n```\n\n### Custom Field Components\n\n```jsx\nconst MyInput = ({ field, form, ...props }) => {\n  return <input {...field} {...props} />;\n};\n\n<Field name=\"email\" component={MyInput} />\n```\n\n## Displaying Errors\n\n### Using ErrorMessage Component\n\n```jsx\n<ErrorMessage name=\"email\" />\n\n{/* Custom error component */}\n<ErrorMessage name=\"email\" component=\"div\" className=\"error\" />\n\n{/* Render prop for custom styling */}\n<ErrorMessage name=\"email\">\n  {msg => <div className=\"error-message\">{msg}</div>}\n</ErrorMessage>\n```\n\n### Manual Error Display\n\n```jsx\n{formik.touched.email && formik.errors.email ? (\n  <div className=\"error\">{formik.errors.email}</div>\n) : null}\n```\n\n## Advanced Patterns\n\n### FieldArray for Dynamic Lists\n\nHandle arrays of fields:\n\n```jsx\nimport { FieldArray } from ''formik'';\n\n<Formik\n  initialValues={{ friends: [''''] }}\n  onSubmit={values => console.log(values)}\n>\n  {({ values }) => (\n    <Form>\n      <FieldArray name=\"friends\">\n        {({ insert, remove, push }) => (\n          <div>\n            {values.friends.length > 0 &&\n              values.friends.map((friend, index) => (\n                <div key={index}>\n                  <Field name={`friends.${index}`} />\n                  <button type=\"button\" onClick={() => remove(index)}>\n                    Remove\n                  </button>\n                </div>\n              ))}\n            <button type=\"button\" onClick={() => push('''')}>\n              Add Friend\n            </button>\n          </div>\n        )}\n      </FieldArray>\n      <button type=\"submit\">Submit</button>\n    </Form>\n  )}\n</Formik>\n```\n\n### Nested Objects\n\nHandle nested form data:\n\n```jsx\ninitialValues={{\n  user: {\n    name: '''',\n    address: {\n      street: '''',\n      city: '''',\n      zip: ''''\n    }\n  }\n}}\n\n<Field name=\"user.name\" />\n<Field name=\"user.address.street\" />\n<Field name=\"user.address.city\" />\n<Field name=\"user.address.zip\" />\n```\n\n### Dependent Fields\n\nUpdate fields based on other field values:\n\n```jsx\nconst formik = useFormik({\n  initialValues: {\n    country: '''',\n    state: ''''\n  },\n  onSubmit: values => console.log(values)\n});\n\nuseEffect(() => {\n  // Reset state when country changes\n  if (formik.values.country) {\n    formik.setFieldValue(''state'', '''');\n  }\n}, [formik.values.country]);\n```\n\n## Form Submission\n\n### Basic Submission\n\n```jsx\nonSubmit={(values, { setSubmitting, setErrors, setStatus, resetForm }) => {\n  // values: form data\n  // setSubmitting: toggle submission state\n  // setErrors: set field errors\n  // setStatus: set form-level status\n  // resetForm: reset form to initial state\n  \n  setTimeout(() => {\n    console.log(values);\n    setSubmitting(false);\n  }, 400);\n}\n```\n\n### Async Submission with API\n\n```jsx\nonSubmit={async (values, { setSubmitting, setErrors }) => {\n  try {\n    const response = await fetch(''/api/submit'', {\n      method: ''POST'',\n      headers: { ''Content-Type'': ''application/json'' },\n      body: JSON.stringify(values)\n    });\n    \n    if (!response.ok) {\n      const errors = await response.json();\n      setErrors(errors);\n    } else {\n      // Handle success\n      alert(''Form submitted successfully!'');\n    }\n  } catch (error) {\n    setErrors({ submit: ''Network error occurred'' });\n  } finally {\n    setSubmitting(false);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Server-Side Validation Errors\n\n```jsx\nonSubmit={async (values, { setFieldError, setSubmitting }) => {\n  try {\n    await api.submit(values);\n  } catch (error) {\n    if (error.response?.data?.errors) {\n      // Set individual field errors from server\n      Object.entries(error.response.data.errors).forEach(([field, message]) => {\n        setFieldError(field, message);\n      });\n    }\n  } finally {\n    setSubmitting(false);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Performance Optimization\n\n### FastField\n\nFor large forms, use FastField to prevent unnecessary re-renders:\n\n```jsx\nimport { FastField } from ''formik'';\n\n// Only re-renders when its own value, error, or touched status changes\n<FastField name=\"firstName\" />\n```\n\n### When to use FastField\n\n- Forms with 30+ fields\n- Fields that don''t depend on other field values\n- Fields without complex validation logic\n\n**Don''t use FastField when:**\n- Fields need to react to changes in other fields\n- You''re using field-level validation that depends on other values\n\n## Common Form Helpers\n\n### getFieldProps\n\nSimplify field bindings:\n\n```jsx\n<input\n  type=\"text\"\n  {...formik.getFieldProps(''firstName'')}\n  // Equivalent to:\n  // name=\"firstName\"\n  // value={formik.values.firstName}\n  // onChange={formik.handleChange}\n  // onBlur={formik.handleBlur}\n/>\n```\n\n### setFieldValue\n\nProgrammatically set field values:\n\n```jsx\nformik.setFieldValue(''email'', ''user@example.com'');\nformik.setFieldValue(''user.address.city'', ''New York'');\n```\n\n### resetForm\n\nReset form to initial or specific values:\n\n```jsx\n// Reset to initial values\nformik.resetForm();\n\n// Reset to new values\nformik.resetForm({\n  values: { email: '''', password: '''' }\n});\n```\n\n## Form-Level Helpers\n\n### Form State Properties\n\n```jsx\nformik.values        // Current form values\nformik.errors        // Validation errors\nformik.touched       // Which fields have been visited\nformik.isSubmitting  // Submission in progress\nformik.isValid       // Form passes validation\nformik.dirty         // Form has been modified\nformik.isValidating  // Validation in progress\n```\n\n### Form Methods\n\n```jsx\nformik.handleSubmit()    // Submit handler\nformik.handleReset()     // Reset handler\nformik.validateForm()    // Trigger validation\nformik.setFieldTouched() // Mark field as touched\nformik.setErrors()       // Set multiple errors\nformik.setValues()       // Set multiple values\n```\n\n## Integration Examples\n\n### With Material-UI\n\n```jsx\nimport TextField from ''@mui/material/TextField'';\n\n<Field name=\"email\">\n  {({ field, meta }) => (\n    <TextField\n      {...field}\n      label=\"Email\"\n      error={meta.touched && Boolean(meta.error)}\n      helperText={meta.touched && meta.error}\n    />\n  )}\n</Field>\n```\n\n### With React Router\n\nNavigate after successful submission:\n\n```jsx\nimport { useNavigate } from ''react-router-dom'';\n\nfunction MyForm() {\n  const navigate = useNavigate();\n  \n  const formik = useFormik({\n    initialValues: { /* ... */ },\n    onSubmit: async (values) => {\n      await api.submit(values);\n      navigate(''/success'');\n    }\n  });\n  \n  return <form onSubmit={formik.handleSubmit}>...</form>;\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Always use validationSchema with Yup** for complex validation instead of custom validate functions\n2. **Use Field components** instead of manual input bindings for automatic state management\n3. **Handle isSubmitting** to disable submit buttons and prevent double submissions\n4. **Show errors only after touch** using `touched` to avoid showing errors prematurely\n5. **Use getFieldProps** for cleaner code when binding inputs\n6. **Consider FastField** for performance in large forms\n7. **Reset forms after success** using `resetForm()` when appropriate\n8. **Use setStatus** for form-level messages (success, error) that aren''t field-specific\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n1. **Not checking `touched` before showing errors** - shows all errors immediately\n2. **Forgetting to set `isSubmitting` to false** - leaves form in submitting state\n3. **Using FastField incorrectly** - breaks dependent field logic\n4. **Not handling async validation errors** - API errors get lost\n5. **Mutating form values directly** - always use `setFieldValue` or `setValues`\n6. **Missing name attribute** on Field components - breaks field binding\n\n## Debugging Tips\n\nCheck form state in DevTools:\n\n```jsx\n<pre>{JSON.stringify(formik, null, 2)}</pre>\n```\n\nEnable Formik debug mode:\n\n```jsx\n<Formik\n  enableReinitialize  // Reset when initialValues change\n  validateOnChange    // Validate on every keystroke (default: true)\n  validateOnBlur      // Validate on blur (default: true)\n  validateOnMount     // Validate on mount (default: false)\n>\n```\n\n## Additional Resources\n\n- See [references/EXAMPLES.md](references/EXAMPLES.md) for complete form examples\n- See [references/YUP_VALIDATION.md](references/YUP_VALIDATION.md) for comprehensive Yup validation patterns\n- See [assets/form-template.jsx](assets/form-template.jsx) for a starter template\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n**Installation:**\n```bash\nnpm install formik yup\n```\n\n**Basic Form:**\n```jsx\nimport { useFormik } from ''formik'';\n\nconst formik = useFormik({\n  initialValues: { email: '''' },\n  onSubmit: values => console.log(values)\n});\n```\n\n**With Validation:**\n```jsx\nimport * as Yup from ''yup'';\n\nvalidationSchema: Yup.object({\n  email: Yup.string().email().required()\n})\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:50:01.857Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for React Developer Agents building complex, validated forms with state management.","zh":"对于构建复杂、经过验证的表单并具有状态管理的React开发人员代理至关重要。","ja":"複雑なフォームを構築し、状態管理を行うReact Developerエージェントにとって不可欠です。","ko":"복잡한 양식과 상태 관리를 구축하는 React 개발자 에이전트에게 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para Agentes de Desarrollador de React que crean formularios complejos y validados con gestión de estado.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents de développeur React qui créent des formulaires complexes et validés avec gestion d''état.","de":"Wesentlich für React-Entwickleragenten, die komplexe, validierte Formulare mit Zustandsverwaltung erstellen.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de Desenvolvedores React que constroem formulários complexos e validados com gerenciamento de estado.","ru":"Необходимо для агентов разработчиков React, создающих сложные, проверенные формы с управлением состоянием.","ar":"ضروري لموظفين توسعه تطبيقات React الذين يبنيون نماذج معقدة وموثقة بإدارة الحالة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to generate React forms with built-in state management, validation (including Yup integration), and submission handling. Provides hooks for custom component integration and optimizes performance for dynamic field arrays and nested objects.","zh":"使代理能够生成带有内置状态管理、验证（包括Yup集成）和提交处理的React表单。为自定义组件集成提供钩子，并针对动态字段数组和嵌套对象优化性能。","ja":"エージェントがビルトイン状態管理、検証（Yup統合を含む）および送信処理を備えたReactフォームを生成できるようにします。カスタムコンポーネントの統合のためのフックを提供し、動的なフィールド配列とネストされたオブジェクトのパフォーマンスを最適化します。","ko":"에이전트가 내장 상태 관리, 유효성 검사(또는 Yup 통합) 및 제출 처리를 갖춘 React 양식을 생성할 수 있도록 합니다. 사용자 지정 컴포넌트 통합을 위한 훅을 제공하고 동적 필드 배열 및 중첩된 객체에 대한 성능을 최적화합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar formularios de React con gestión de estado incorporada, validación (incluida integración con Yup) y control de envío. Proporciona ganchos para la integración de componentes personalizados y optimiza el rendimiento para matrices de campos dinámicos y objetos anidados.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des formulaires React avec gestion d''état intégrée, validation (y compris l''intégration de Yup) et gestion de soumission. Fournit des crochets pour l''intégration de composants personnalisés et optimise les performances pour les tableaux de champs dynamiques et les objets imbriqués.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, React-Formulare mit integrierter Zustandsverwaltung, Validierung (einschließlich Yup-Integration) und Übermittlungsverarbeitung zu generieren. Bietet Haken für die Integration benutzerdefinierter Komponenten und optimiert die Leistung für dynamische Feldarrays und verschachtelte Objekte.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerem formulários React com gerenciamento de estado incorporado, validação (incluindo integração com Yup) e tratamento de envio. Fornece ganchos para integração de componentes personalizados e otimiza o desempenho para matrizes de campos dinâmicos e objetos aninhados.","ru":"Позволяет агентам генерировать формы React с встроенным управлением состоянием, проверкой (включая интеграцию с Yup) и обработкой отправки. Предоставляет крючки для интеграции пользовательских компонентов и оптимизирует производительность для динамических массивов полей и вложенных объектов.","ar":"يسمح للموظفين بإنتاج نماذج React مع إدارة الحالة المدمجة والتحقق (بما في ذلك التكامل مع Yup) ومعالجة الإرسال. يوفر مشابك لدمج المكونات المخصصة ويتحسين الأداء لمассивات الحقول الديناميكية والكائنات المتراصة."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating validated React form components","Implementing dynamic form fields with arrays","Handling asynchronous form submissions","Building custom form controls with useField hook"],"zh":["生成验证的React表单组件","实现带有数组的动态表单字段","处理异步表单提交","使用useField钩子构建自定义表单控件"],"ja":["検証済みのReactフォームコンポーネントを生成する","配列を使用した動的なフォームフィールドを実装する","非同期フォーム送信を処理する","useFieldフックを使用してカスタムフォームコントロールを構築する"],"ko":["유효성 검사된 React 양식 컴포넌트 생성","배열을 사용한 동적 양식 필드 구현","비동기 양식 제출 처리","useField 훅을 사용하여 사용자 지정 양식 컨트롤 구축"],"es":["Generar componentes de formularios de React validados","Implementar campos de formulario dinámicos con matrices","Controlar envíos de formularios asíncronos","Crear controles de formulario personalizados con gancho useField"],"fr":["Générer des composants de formulaire React validés","Mettre en œuvre des champs de formulaire dynamiques avec des tableaux","Gérer les soumissions de formulaire asynchrones","Créer des contrôles de formulaire personnalisés avec l''hameçon useField"],"de":["Generieren von validierten React-Formularkomponenten","Implementieren dynamischer Formularfelder mit Arrays","Verarbeiten asynchroner Formulareingaben","Erstellen benutzerdefinierter Formularsteuerungen mit useField-Haken"],"pt":["Geração de componentes de formulário React validados","Implementação de campos de formulário dinâmicos com matrizes","Tratamento de envios de formulário assíncronos","Construção de controles de formulário personalizados com gancho useField"],"ru":["Генерация проверенных компонентов формы React","Реализация динамических полей формы с массивами","Обработка асинхронных отправок формы","Создание пользовательских элементов управления формой с крючком useField"],"ar":["إنتاج مكونات نموذج React المثبتة","تنفيذ حقول النموذج الديناميكي مع المصفوفات","معالجة إرسال النموذج غير المتزامن","بناء عناصر التحكم في النموذج المخصصة مع مشبك useField"]},"limitations":{"en":["React-specific implementation only","Requires Yup for schema validation","Limited to web form interfaces"],"zh":["仅限React特定实现","需要Yup进行模式验证","仅限于Web表单接口"],"ja":["React固有の実装のみ","スキーマ検証にはYupが必要","Webフォームインターフェイスのみ"],"ko":["React 전용 구현만","스키마 유효성 검사를 위해 Yup이 필요","웹 양식 인터페이스만"],"es":["Implementación específica de React solo","Requiere Yup para la validación de esquemas","Limitado a interfaces de formularios web"],"fr":["Implémentation spécifique à React uniquement","Nécessite Yup pour la validation de schémas","Limité aux interfaces de formulaire web"],"de":["Nur React-spezifische Implementierung","Benötigt Yup für die Schemavalidierung","Begrenzt auf Webformulare"],"pt":["Implementação específica do React apenas","Requer Yup para validação de esquema","Limitado a interfaces de formulário da web"],"ru":["Только реализация, специфичная для React","Требует Yup для проверки схемы","Ограничен интерфейсами веб-форм"],"ar":["تنفيذ محدد لتطبيقات React فقط","يتطلب Yup للتحقق من مخطط","محدود لواجهات نموذج الويب"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('AgentArtel/Open-RPG/git-routing', 'community', 'AgentArtel', 'Open-RPG', 'AgentArtel/Open-RPG', 'git-routing', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.425Z', '2026-02-18T04:49:43.629Z', NULL, '{"id":"AgentArtel/Open-RPG/git-routing","name":"git-routing","description":{"zh":"git-routing 格式是一种标准化的提交消息格式，用于多代理项目","ja":"git-routing 形式は、複数のエージェントプロジェクトで使用される標準化されたコミットメッセージ形式です","ko":"git-routing 형식은 多代理 프로젝트에서 사용되는 표준화된 커밋 메시지 형식입니다","es":"El formato de mensaje de confirmación de git-routing es una estructura estandarizada para proyectos de multiagente. Utiliza un encabezado con campos AGENTE, ACCIÓN y TAREA para una descripción clara","fr":"Le format de message de commit git-routing est une structure standardisée pour les projets multi-agents. Il utilise un en-tête avec les champs AGENT, ACTION et TÂCHE pour une description claire","de":"Das Commit-Nachrichtenformat von git-routing ist eine standardisierte Struktur für Multiagenten-Projekte. Es verwendet einen Header mit den Feldern AGENT, AKTION und AUFGABE für eine klare Beschreibung","pt":"O Git Routing é um padrão de commit que facilita a colaboração em projetos multiagentes, utilizando um formato de cabeçalho para identificar agentes e ações.","ru":"Git Routing - это формат коммитов, который облегчает сотрудничество в многоагентных проектах, используя формат заголовка для идентификации агентов и действий.","ar":"Git Routing هو تنسيق رسائل Commit يسهل التعاون في مشاريع متعددة الوكلاء، باستخدام تنسيق رأس لمعرف الوكلاء والعمليات","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"git-routing 格式指南","ja":"git-routing 形式ガイド","ko":"git-routing 형식 가이드","es":"Formato de mensaje de confirmación de git-routing","fr":"Format de message de commit git-routing","de":"Git-Routing-Commit-Nachrichtenformat","pt":"Git Routing: Padrão de Commit para Projetos Multiagentes","ru":"Git Routing: Формат коммитов для многоагентных проектов","ar":"Git Routing: تنسيق رسائل Commit لمشاريع متعددة الوكلاء","en":"git-routing"},"description":{"zh":"git-routing 格式是一种标准化的提交消息格式，用于多代理项目","ja":"git-routing 形式は、複数のエージェントプロジェクトで使用される標準化されたコミットメッセージ形式です","ko":"git-routing 형식은 多代理 프로젝트에서 사용되는 표준화된 커밋 메시지 형식입니다","es":"El formato de mensaje de confirmación de git-routing es una estructura estandarizada para proyectos de multiagente. Utiliza un encabezado con campos AGENTE, ...","fr":"Le format de message de commit git-routing est une structure standardisée pour les projets multi-agents. Il utilise un en-tête avec les champs AGENT, ACTION ...","de":"Das Commit-Nachrichtenformat von git-routing ist eine standardisierte Struktur für Multiagenten-Projekte. Es verwendet einen Header mit den Feldern AGENT, AK...","pt":"O Git Routing é um padrão de commit que facilita a colaboração em projetos multiagentes, utilizando um formato de cabeçalho para identificar agentes e ações.","ru":"Git Routing - это формат коммитов, который облегчает сотрудничество в многоагентных проектах, используя формат заголовка для идентификации агентов и действий.","ar":"Git Routing هو تنسيق رسائل Commit يسهل التعاون في مشاريع متعددة الوكلاء، باستخدام تنسيق رأس لمعرف الوكلاء والعمليات","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["标准化的提交消息格式","多代理项目支持","可自定义的提交消息头部","提交消息体支持详细描述","简短描述限制在 72 个字符以内"],"ja":["標準化されたコミットメッセージ形式","複数のエージェントプロジェクト対応","カスタマイズ可能なコミットメッセージヘッダー","コミットメッセージ本文で詳細な説明をサポート","短い説明は 72 文字以内に制限"],"ko":["표준화된 커밋 메시지 형식","多代理 프로젝트 지원","사용자 정의 가능한 커밋 메시지 헤더","커밋 메시지 본문에서 자세한 설명 지원","짧은 설명은 72자 이내로 제한"],"es":["Encabezado estructurado con campos AGENTE, ACCIÓN y TAREA","Descripción corta bajo 72 caracteres","Cuerpo opcional con detalles","Valores válidos para AGENTE: claude, cursor, lovable, kimi","Compatibilidad con proyectos de multiagente"],"fr":["En-tête structuré avec les champs AGENT, ACTION et TÂCHE","Description courte sous 72 caractères","Corps optionnel avec des détails","Valeurs valides pour AGENT : claude, cursor, lovable, kimi","Compatibilité avec les projets multi-agents"],"de":["Strukturierter Header mit den Feldern AGENT, AKTION und AUFGABE","Kurze Beschreibung unter 72 Zeichen","Optional: Body mit Details","Gültige Werte für AGENT: claude, cursor, lovable, kimi","Kompatibilität mit Multiagenten-Projekten"],"pt":["Padrão de commit para projetos multiagentes","Identificação de agentes e ações","Formato de cabeçalho para commit","Melhoria da colaboração em equipe","Suporte para vários agentes"],"ru":["Формат коммитов для многоагентных проектов","Идентификация агентов и действий","Формат заголовка для коммитов","Улучшение командной работы","Поддержка нескольких агентов"],"ar":["تنسيق رسائل Commit لمشاريع متعددة الوكلاء","معرف الوكلاء والعمليات","تنسيق رأس للcommit","تحسين التعاون الفريق","دعم عدة وكلاء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["git-routing","提交消息格式","多代理项目","代码提交","标准化格式","提交消息头部"],"ja":["git-routing","コミットメッセージ形式","複数のエージェントプロジェクト","コード提出","標準化形式","コミットメッセージヘッダー"],"ko":["git-routing","커밋 메시지 형식","多代理 프로젝트","코드 제출","표준화 형식","커밋 메시지 헤더"],"es":["git-routing","formato de mensaje de confirmación","proyectos de multiagente","desarrollo de software","flujo de trabajo de desarrollo","commit message format","multiagent projects"],"fr":["git-routing","format de message de commit","projets multi-agents","développement de logiciels","flux de travail de développement","commit message format","multiagent projects"],"de":["git-routing","Commit-Nachrichtenformat","Multiagenten-Projekte","Softwareentwicklung","Entwicklungsworkflow","commit message format","Multiagenten-Projekte"],"pt":["git routing","padrão de commit","projetos multiagentes","colaboração em equipe","commit format","agentes","ações"],"ru":["git routing","формат коммитов","многоагентные проекты","командная работа","формат заголовка","агенты","действия"],"ar":["git routing","تنسيق رسائل commit","مشاريع متعددة الوكلاء","تعاون فريق","تنسيق رأس","وكلاء","عمليات"]}},"owner":"AgentArtel","repo":"Open-RPG","repoPath":"AgentArtel/Open-RPG","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.425Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"git-routing","description":"Commit message routing rules for multi-agent workflows. Defines the header format, valid values, routing table, and examples for automated agent handoffs.","bodyPreview":"## Commit Message Format\n\nEvery commit in a multi-agent project uses this header format:\n\n```\n[AGENT:agent] [ACTION:action] [TASK:task-id] Short description\n\nOptional body with details.\n```\n\nAll three header fields are required. The short description should be under 72 characters.\n\n## Valid AGENT Values\n\n| Value | Agent | Role |\n|-------|-------|------|\n| `claude` | Claude Code | Orchestrator |\n| `cursor` | Cursor | Implementation Specialist |\n| `lovable` | Lovable | UI/UX Specialist |\n| `kimi`","body":"## Commit Message Format\n\nEvery commit in a multi-agent project uses this header format:\n\n```\n[AGENT:agent] [ACTION:action] [TASK:task-id] Short description\n\nOptional body with details.\n```\n\nAll three header fields are required. The short description should be under 72 characters.\n\n## Valid AGENT Values\n\n| Value | Agent | Role |\n|-------|-------|------|\n| `claude` | Claude Code | Orchestrator |\n| `cursor` | Cursor | Implementation Specialist |\n| `lovable` | Lovable | UI/UX Specialist |\n| `kimi` | Kimi Code | Project Overseer |\n\n## Valid ACTION Values\n\n| Value | Meaning | Who Uses It |\n|-------|---------|-------------|\n| `submit` | Work completed, ready for review | Any agent submitting work |\n| `review` | Review in progress | Reviewer (Kimi or Claude Code) |\n| `approve` | Work approved | Reviewer |\n| `reject` | Work needs changes, feedback provided | Reviewer |\n| `update` | Progress update (not a submission) | Any agent |\n| `report` | Sprint or status report | Kimi or Claude Code |\n| `delegate` | Assigning work to another agent | Kimi or Claude Code |\n| `merge` | Merging approved work to target branch | Kimi or Claude Code |\n\n## Valid TASK Values\n\n| Pattern | When to Use | Example |\n|---------|-------------|---------|\n| Task ID | Standard task work | `TASK-001`, `TASK-P4-01` |\n| Sprint ID | Sprint-level work | `SPRINT-3`, `SPRINT-4` |\n| Category | Non-task work | `INFRA`, `DOCS`, `CLEANUP` |\n\n## Routing Table\n\nThis table defines what should happen after each commit pattern:\n\n| Commit Pattern | What Happens Next |\n|----------------|-------------------|\n| `[AGENT:cursor] [ACTION:submit] [TASK:X]` | Kimi or Claude Code reviews cursor''s work |\n| `[AGENT:lovable] [ACTION:submit] [TASK:X]` | Kimi or Claude Code reviews lovable''s work |\n| `[AGENT:claude] [ACTION:submit] [TASK:X]` | Kimi reviews claude''s work |\n| `[AGENT:kimi] [ACTION:approve] [TASK:X]` | Work merged to `pre-mortal`, next task assigned |\n| `[AGENT:kimi] [ACTION:reject] [TASK:X]` | Agent addresses feedback, re-submits |\n| `[AGENT:kimi] [ACTION:delegate] [TASK:X]` | Target agent picks up assignment |\n| `[AGENT:kimi] [ACTION:report] [SPRINT:X]` | Human PM reviews sprint summary |\n| `[AGENT:kimi] [ACTION:merge] [TASK:X]` | Branch merged to `pre-mortal` |\n| `[AGENT:claude] [ACTION:delegate] [TASK:X]` | Target agent picks up assignment |\n| `[AGENT:*] [ACTION:update] [TASK:X]` | Status tracking only, no action triggered |\n\n## Branch Rules\n\n- Agents commit to their own branch: `<agent>/<task-id>-<description>`\n- Submit commits are made on the agent''s branch\n- Approve and merge commits are made on `pre-mortal`\n- Report commits can be made on any branch\n\n## Examples\n\n### Agent submitting work\n\n```\n[AGENT:cursor] [ACTION:submit] [TASK:TASK-P4-01] Implement gateway API client hook\n\nAdded WebSocket JSON-RPC client with reconnection logic.\nFiles: src/hooks/use-gateway-api.ts, src/services/openclaw-client.ts\n```\n\n### Reviewer approving work\n\n```\n[AGENT:kimi] [ACTION:approve] [TASK:TASK-P4-01] Gateway API client approved\n\nAll acceptance criteria met. Merging to pre-mortal.\nUnblocks: TASK-P4-02, TASK-P4-03\n```\n\n### Reviewer requesting changes\n\n```\n[AGENT:kimi] [ACTION:reject] [TASK:TASK-P4-01] Error handling needs improvement\n\nMissing timeout handling on WebSocket reconnection.\nSee .ai/reviews/TASK-P4-01-review.md for details.\n```\n\n### Progress update\n\n```\n[AGENT:claude] [ACTION:update] [TASK:TASK-002] Enrich ideas with research findings\n\nUpdated 18 idea files with feasibility ratings and roadmap phases.\n```\n\n### Sprint report\n\n```\n[AGENT:kimi] [ACTION:report] [SPRINT:3] Sprint 3 complete — 8 tasks done\n\nSee .ai/reports/sprint-3-summary.md for full details.\n```\n\n### Delegating work\n\n```\n[AGENT:kimi] [ACTION:delegate] [TASK:TASK-P4-02] Assign agent CRUD sync to Cursor\n\nSee .ai/instructions/cursor-TASK-P4-02.md for assignment details.\n```\n\n### Merging approved work\n\n```\n[AGENT:kimi] [ACTION:merge] [TASK:TASK-P4-01] Merge gateway client to pre-mortal\n\nApproved in .ai/reviews/TASK-P4-01-review.md\n```\n\n## Reference\n\nFull routing specification with additional details: `.ai/templates/commit-message.md`\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:49:43.629Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Multi-Agent Development Teams needing standardized commit message formatting.","zh":"适用于需要标准化提交消息格式的多代理开发团队的理想选择。","ja":"標準化されたコミットメッセージ形式を必要とするマルチエージェント開発チームに最適です。","ko":"표준화된 커밋 메시지 형식을 필요로 하는 멀티 에이전트 개발 팀에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para equipos de desarrollo de multiagentes que necesitan un formato de mensaje de confirmación estandarizado.","fr":"Idéal pour les équipes de développement multi-agents ayant besoin d''un format de message de confirmation standardisé.","de":"Ideal für Multi-Agent-Entwicklungsteams, die ein standardisiertes Commit-Nachrichten-Format benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para equipes de desenvolvimento de multiagentes que necessitam de formatação de mensagens de commit padronizada.","ru":"Идеально для команд разработки мультиагентов, которым требуется стандартизированный формат сообщений о коммитах.","ar":"مثالي للفرق متعددة الوكلاء التي تحتاج إلى تنسيق رسائل الالتزام المعياري."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to maintain consistent commit histories using a structured header format, including AGENT, ACTION, and TASK fields, with support for agents like Claude Code, Cursor, and Lovable, and protocols like git.","zh":"赋予代理维护一致的提交历史记录的能力，使用结构化的头部格式，包括AGENT、ACTION和TASK字段，并支持诸如Claude Code、Cursor和Lovable的代理，以及git等协议。","ja":"AGENT、ACTION、TASKフィールドを含む構造化ヘッダー形式を使用して一貫したコミット履歴を維持するエージェントをEmpower化し、Claude Code、Cursor、Lovableなどのエージェントやgitなどのプロトコルをサポートします。","ko":"에이전트, 액션, 태스크 필드를 포함하는 구조化된 헤더 형식을 사용하여 일관된 커밋 기록을 유지할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화하고 Claude Code, Cursor, Lovable 등의 에이전트와 git 등의 프로토콜을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a mantener historias de confirmación consistentes utilizando un formato de encabezado estructurado que incluye los campos AGENTE, ACCIÓN y TAREA, con soporte para agentes como Claude Code, Cursor y Lovable, y protocolos como git.","fr":"Permet aux agents de maintenir des historiques de confirmation cohérents en utilisant un format d''en-tête structuré, y compris les champs AGENT, ACTION et TÂCHE, avec un support pour des agents tels que Claude Code, Cursor et Lovable, et des protocoles tels que git.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, konsistente Commit-Verlaufsprotokolle mithilfe eines strukturierten Header-Formats zu erhalten, das die Felder AGENT, AKTION und AUFGABE enthält, mit Unterstützung für Agenten wie Claude Code, Cursor und Lovable sowie Protokolle wie Git.","pt":"Permite que os agentes mantenham históricos de commit consistentes usando um formato de cabeçalho estruturado, incluindo campos AGENTE, AÇÃO e TAREFA, com suporte a agentes como Claude Code, Cursor e Lovable, e protocolos como git.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью поддерживать последовательные истории коммитов, используя структурированный формат заголовка, включающий поля АГЕНТ, ДЕЙСТВИЕ и ЗАДАЧА, с поддержкой агентов, таких как Claude Code, Cursor и Lovable, и протоколов, таких как git.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على الحفاظ على سجلات الالتزام المتسقة باستخدام تنسيق رأس منظم ، بما في ذلك مجالات الوكيل والعمل والمهمة ، مع دعم وكلاء مثل Claude Code و Cursor و Lovable وبروتوكولات مثل git."},"useCases":{"en":["Standardizing commit messages across multiple agents","Automating commit message validation for Claude Code and Cursor","Generating commit reports with task-id and agent information"],"zh":["跨多个代理标准化提交消息","为Claude Code和Cursor自动化提交消息验证","使用任务ID和代理信息生成提交报告"],"ja":["複数のエージェント間でコミットメッセージを標準化する","Claude CodeとCursorのコミットメッセージ検証を自動化する","タスクIDとエージェント情報を使用してコミットレポートを生成する"],"ko":["여러 에이전트에서 커밋 메시지를 표준화","Claude Code와 Cursor의 커밋 메시지 검증 자동화","태스크 ID와 에이전트 정보를 사용하여 커밋 보고서 생성"],"es":["Estandarizar mensajes de confirmación en varios agentes","Automatizar la validación de mensajes de confirmación para Claude Code y Cursor","Generar informes de confirmación con id de tarea y información del agente"],"fr":["Standardiser les messages de confirmation à travers plusieurs agents","Automatiser la validation des messages de confirmation pour Claude Code et Cursor","Générer des rapports de confirmation avec l''ID de tâche et les informations d''agent"],"de":["Standardisieren von Commit-Nachrichten über mehrere Agenten hinweg","Automatisieren der Überprüfung von Commit-Nachrichten für Claude Code und Cursor","Erstellen von Commit-Berichten mit Aufgaben-ID und Agenteninformationen"],"pt":["Padronizar mensagens de commit em vários agentes","Automatizar validação de mensagens de commit para Claude Code e Cursor","Gerar relatórios de commit com id de tarefa e informações do agente"],"ru":["Стандартизировать сообщения о коммитах в нескольких агентах","Автоматизировать проверку сообщений о коммитах для Claude Code и Cursor","Генерировать отчеты о коммитах с идентификатором задачи и информацией об агенте"],"ar":["توحيد رسائل الالتزام عبر وكلاء متعددين","آليّة التحقق من صحة رسائل الالتزام ل Claude Code و Cursor","توليد تقارير الالتزام مع معرفات المهام ومعلومات الوكيل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to the specified commit message format","Limited to the defined valid AGENT values, including claude, cursor, and lovable"],"zh":["需要遵守指定的提交消息格式","仅限于定义的有效AGENT值，包括claude、cursor和lovable"],"ja":["指定されたコミットメッセージ形式に従う必要がある","定義された有効なAGENT値に限定される、claude、cursor、lovableなど"],"ko":["지정된 커밋 메시지 형식에 따라야 함","정의된 유효한 에이전트 값으로만 제한됨, claude, cursor, lovable 등"],"es":["Requiere la adhesión al formato de mensaje de confirmación especificado","Limitado a los valores válidos de AGENTE definidos, incluyendo claude, cursor y lovable"],"fr":["Nécessite l''adhésion au format de message de confirmation spécifié","Limité aux valeurs valides d''AGENT définies, y compris claude, cursor et lovable"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung des angegebenen Commit-Nachrichten-Formats","Begrenzt auf die definierten gültigen AGENT-Werte, einschließlich claude, cursor und lovable"],"pt":["Exige aderência ao formato de mensagem de commit especificado","Limitado aos valores válidos de AGENTE definidos, incluindo claude, cursor e lovable"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения указанного формата сообщения о коммите","Ограничен определенным набором допустимых значений АГЕНТ, включая claude, cursor и lovable"],"ar":["يتطلب اتباع تنسيق رسائل الالتزام المحدد","محدود لقيم الوكيل الصالحة المعرفة ، بما في ذلك claude و cursor و lovable"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
