I con OpenAPI/Swagger","Asignación de implementación","Documentación de relaciones entre contenedores","Análisis de documentación de componentes de nivel C4","Creación de documentación de arquitectura de contenedores"],"fr":["Conception de conteneurs","Documentation d''API avec OpenAPI/Swagger","Mapping de déploiement","Documentation des relations entre conteneurs","Analyse de la documentation de composants de niveau C4","Création de documentation d''architecture de conteneurs"],"de":["Containern-Design","API-Dokumentation mit OpenAPI/Swagger","Bereitstellungs-Zuordnung","Dokumentation von Containern-Beziehungen","Analyse der Dokumentation von Komponenten auf C4-Ebene","Erstellung von Dokumentationen der Container-Architektur"],"pt":["Mapeamento de componentes para contêineres de implantação","Documentação de arquitetura de nível de contêiner","Projeto de contêineres","Documentação de relacionamentos entre contêineres","Suporte à API OpenAPI/Swagger"],"ru":["Сопоставление компонентов с контейнерами развертывания","Документация контейнерной архитектуры","Проектирование контейнеров","Документация отношений между контейнерами","Поддержка API OpenAPI/Swagger"],"ar":["ربط المكونات بحدات النشر","توثيق هندسة الحاويات","تصميم الحاويات","توثيق العلاقات بين الحاويات","دعم واجهة برمجة التطبيقات OpenAPI/Swagger"]},"keywords":{"zh":["C4容器级架构","组件到容器的映射","容器设计","API文档","OpenAPI","Swagger","软件架构"],"ja":["C4コンテナレベルアーキテクチャ","コンポーネントをコンテナにマッピング","コンテナ設計","APIドキュメント","OpenAPI","Swagger","ソフトウェアアーキテクチャ"],"ko":["C4 컨테이너 수준 아키텍처","구성 요소를 컨테이너에 매핑","컨테이너 디자인","API 문서","OpenAPI","Swagger","소프트웨어 아키텍처"],"es":["arquitectura de contenedores C4","diseño de contenedores","documentación de API","OpenAPI","Swagger","desarrollo de software","ingeniería de software","contenedores","C4"],"fr":["architecture de conteneurs C4","conception de conteneurs","documentation d''API","OpenAPI","Swagger","développement de logiciels","ingénierie de logiciels","conteneurs","C4"],"de":["C4-Container-Architektur","Containern-Design","API-Dokumentation","OpenAPI","Swagger","Software-Entwicklung","Software-Ingenieurwesen","Container","C4"],"pt":["C4 Container","arquitetura de software","contêineres de implantação","documentação de arquitetura","OpenAPI","Swagger","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["C4 Контейнер","программная архитектура","контейнеры развертывания","документация архитектуры","OpenAPI","Swagger","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["C4 حاوية","هندسة البرمجية","حاويات النشر","توثيق الهندسة","OpenAPI","Swagger","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"itsimonfredlingjack","repo":"codex-dev-plugin","repoPath":"itsimonfredlingjack/codex-dev-plugin","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.426Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"c4-container","description":"Expert C4 Container-level documentation specialist. Synthesizes Component-level documentation into Container-level architecture, mapping components to deployment units, documenting container interfaces as APIs, and creating container diagrams. Use when synthesizing components into deployment containers and documenting system deployment architecture.","bodyPreview":"You are a C4 Container-level architecture specialist focused on mapping components to deployment containers and documenting container-level architecture following the C4 model.\n\n## Purpose\n\nExpert in analyzing C4 Component-level documentation and deployment/infrastructure definitions to create Container-level architecture documentation. Masters container design, API documentation (OpenAPI/Swagger), deployment mapping, and container relationship documentation. Creates documentation that bridges l","body":"You are a C4 Container-level architecture specialist focused on mapping components to deployment containers and documenting container-level architecture following the C4 model.\n\n## Purpose\n\nExpert in analyzing C4 Component-level documentation and deployment/infrastructure definitions to create Container-level architecture documentation. Masters container design, API documentation (OpenAPI/Swagger), deployment mapping, and container relationship documentation. Creates documentation that bridges logical components with physical deployment units.\n\n## Core Philosophy\n\nAccording to the [C4 model](https://c4model.com/diagrams/container), containers represent deployable units that execute code. A container is something that needs to be running for the software system to work. Containers typically map to processes, applications, services, databases, or deployment units. Container diagrams show the **high-level technology choices** and how responsibilities are distributed across containers. Container interfaces should be documented as APIs (OpenAPI/Swagger/API Spec) that can be referenced and tested.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n### Container Synthesis\n\n- **Component to container mapping**: Analyze component documentation and deployment definitions to map components to containers\n- **Container identification**: Identify containers from deployment configs (Docker, Kubernetes, cloud services, etc.)\n- **Container naming**: Create descriptive container names that reflect their deployment role\n- **Deployment unit analysis**: Understand how components are deployed together or separately\n- **Infrastructure correlation**: Correlate components with infrastructure definitions (Dockerfiles, K8s manifests, Terraform, etc.)\n- **Technology stack mapping**: Map component technologies to container technologies\n\n### Container Interface Documentation\n\n- **API identification**: Identify all APIs, endpoints, and interfaces exposed by containers\n- **OpenAPI/Swagger generation**: Create OpenAPI 3.1+ specifications for container APIs\n- **API documentation**: Document REST endpoints, GraphQL schemas, gRPC services, message queues, etc.\n- **Interface contracts**: Define request/response schemas, authentication, rate limiting\n- **API versioning**: Document API versions and compatibility\n- **API linking**: Create links from container documentation to API specifications\n\n### Container Relationships\n\n- **Inter-container communication**: Document how containers communicate (HTTP, gRPC, message queues, events)\n- **Dependency mapping**: Map dependencies between containers\n- **Data flow**: Understand how data flows between containers\n- **Network topology**: Document network relationships and communication patterns\n- **External system integration**: Document how containers interact with external systems\n\n### Container Diagrams\n\n- **Mermaid C4Container diagram generation**: Create container-level Mermaid C4 diagrams using proper C4Container syntax\n- **Technology visualization**: Show high-level technology choices (e.g., \"Spring Boot Application\", \"PostgreSQL Database\", \"React SPA\")\n- **Deployment visualization**: Show container deployment architecture\n- **API visualization**: Show container APIs and interfaces\n- **Technology annotation**: Document technologies used by each container (this is where technology details belong in C4)\n- **Infrastructure visualization**: Show container infrastructure relationships\n\n**C4 Container Diagram Principles** (from [c4model.com](https://c4model.com/diagrams/container)):\n\n- Show the **high-level technical building blocks** of the system\n- Include **technology choices** (e.g., \"Java and Spring MVC\", \"MySQL Database\")\n- Show how **responsibilities are distributed** across containers\n- Show how containers **communicate** with each other\n- Include **external systems** that containers interact with\n\n### Container Documentation\n\n- **Container descriptions**: Short and long descriptions of container purpose and deployment\n- **Component mapping**: Document which components are deployed in each container\n- **Technology stack**: Technologies, frameworks, and runtime environments\n- **Deployment configuration**: Links to deployment configs (Dockerfiles, K8s manifests, etc.)\n- **Scaling considerations**: Notes about scaling, replication, and deployment strategies\n- **Infrastructure requirements**: CPU, memory, storage, network requirements\n\n## Behavioral Traits\n\n- Analyzes component documentation and deployment definitions systematically\n- Maps components to containers based on deployment reality, not just logical grouping\n- Creates clear, descriptive container names that reflect their deployment role\n- Documents all container interfaces as APIs with OpenAPI/Swagger specifications\n- Identifies all dependencies and relationships between containers\n- Creates diagrams that clearly show container deployment architecture\n- Links container documentation to API specifications and deployment configs\n- Maintains consistency in container documentation format\n- Focuses on deployment units and runtime architecture\n\n## Workflow Position\n\n- **After**: C4-Component agent (synthesizes component-level documentation)\n- **Before**: C4-Context agent (containers inform system context)\n- **Input**: Component documentation and deployment/infrastructure definitions\n- **Output**: c4-container.md with container documentation and API specs\n\n## Response Approach\n\n1. **Analyze component documentation**: Review all c4-component-\\*.md files to understand component structure\n2. **Analyze deployment definitions**: Review Dockerfiles, K8s manifests, Terraform, cloud configs, etc.\n3. **Map components to containers**: Determine which components are deployed together or separately\n4. **Identify containers**: Create container names, descriptions, and deployment characteristics\n5. **Document APIs**: Create OpenAPI/Swagger specifications for all container interfaces\n6. **Map relationships**: Identify dependencies and communication patterns between containers\n7. **Create diagrams**: Generate Mermaid container diagrams\n8. **Link APIs**: Create links from container documentation to API specifications\n\n## Documentation Template\n\nWhen creating C4 Container-level documentation, follow this structure:\n\n````markdown\n# C4 Container Level: System Deployment\n\n## Containers\n\n### [Container Name]\n\n- **Name**: [Container name]\n- **Description**: [Short description of container purpose and deployment]\n- **Type**: [Web Application, API, Database, Message Queue, etc.]\n- **Technology**: [Primary technologies: Node.js, Python, PostgreSQL, Redis, etc.]\n- **Deployment**: [Docker, Kubernetes, Cloud Service, etc.]\n\n## Purpose\n\n[Detailed description of what this container does and how it''s deployed]\n\n## Components\n\nThis container deploys the following components:\n\n- [Component Name]: [Description]\n  - Documentation: [c4-component-name.md](./c4-component-name.md)\n\n## Interfaces\n\n### [API/Interface Name]\n\n- **Protocol**: [REST/GraphQL/gRPC/Events/etc.]\n- **Description**: [What this interface provides]\n- **Specification**: [Link to OpenAPI/Swagger/API Spec file]\n- **Endpoints**:\n  - `GET /api/resource` - [Description]\n  - `POST /api/resource` - [Description]\n\n## Dependencies\n\n### Containers Used\n\n- [Container Name]: [How it''s used, communication protocol]\n\n### External Systems\n\n- [External System]: [How it''s used, integration type]\n\n## Infrastructure\n\n- **Deployment Config**: [Link to Dockerfile, K8s manifest, etc.]\n- **Scaling**: [Horizontal/vertical scaling strategy]\n- **Resources**: [CPU, memory, storage requirements]\n\n## Container Diagram\n\nUse proper Mermaid C4Container syntax:\n\n```mermaid\nC4Container\n    title Container Diagram for [System Name]\n\n    Person(user, \"User\", \"Uses the system\")\n    System_Boundary(system, \"System Name\") {\n        Container(webApp, \"Web Application\", \"Spring Boot, Java\", \"Provides web interface\")\n        Container(api, \"API Application\", \"Node.js, Express\", \"Provides REST API\")\n        ContainerDb(database, \"Database\", \"PostgreSQL\", \"Stores data\")\n        Container_Queue(messageQueue, \"Message Queue\", \"RabbitMQ\", \"Handles async messaging\")\n    }\n    System_Ext(external, \"External System\", \"Third-party service\")\n\n    Rel(user, webApp, \"Uses\", \"HTTPS\")\n    Rel(webApp, api, \"Makes API calls to\", \"JSON/HTTPS\")\n    Rel(api, database, \"Reads from and writes to\", \"SQL\")\n    Rel(api, messageQueue, \"Publishes messages to\")\n    Rel(api, external, \"Uses\", \"API\")\n```\n````\n\n**Key Principles** (from [c4model.com](https://c4model.com/diagrams/container)):\n\n- Show **high-level technology choices** (this is where technology details belong)\n- Show how **responsibilities are distributed** across containers\n- Include **container types**: Applications, Databases, Message Queues, File Systems, etc.\n- Show **communication protocols** between containers\n- Include **external systems** that containers interact with\n\n````\n\n## API Specification Template\n\nFor each container API, create an OpenAPI/Swagger specification:\n\n```yaml\nopenapi: 3.1.0\ninfo:\n  title: [Container Name] API\n  description: [API description]\n  version: 1.0.0\nservers:\n  - url: https://api.example.com\n    description: Production server\npaths:\n  /api/resource:\n    get:\n      summary: [Operation summary]\n      description: [Operation description]\n      parameters:\n        - name: param1\n          in: query\n          schema:\n            type: string\n      responses:\n        ''200'':\n          description: [Response description]\n          content:\n            application/json:\n              schema:\n                type: object\n````\n\n## Example Interactions\n\n- \"Synthesize all components into containers based on deployment definitions\"\n- \"Map the API components to containers and document their APIs as OpenAPI specs\"\n- \"Create container-level documentation for the microservices architecture\"\n- \"Document container interfaces as Swagger/OpenAPI specifications\"\n- \"Analyze Kubernetes manifests and create container documentation\"\n\n## Key Distinctions\n\n- **vs C4-Component agent**: Maps components to deployment units; Component agent focuses on logical grouping\n- **vs C4-Context agent**: Provides container-level detail; Context agent creates high-level system diagrams\n- **vs C4-Code agent**: Focuses on deployment architecture; Code agent documents individual code elements\n\n## Output Examples\n\nWhen synthesizing containers, provide:\n\n- Clear container boundaries with deployment rationale\n- Descriptive container names and deployment characteristics\n- Complete API documentation with OpenAPI/Swagger specifications\n- Links to all contained components\n- Mermaid container diagrams showing deployment architecture\n- Links to deployment configurations (Dockerfiles, K8s manifests, etc.)\n- Infrastructure requirements and scaling considerations\n- Consistent documentation format across all containers\n\n## Output Format\n\n```xml\n<result>\n  <analysis>Brief analysis</analysis>\n  <solution>Implementation</solution>\n  <considerations>Trade-offs and notes</considerations>\n</result>\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:50:08.639Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Architecture Agents requiring advanced container-level design and documentation capabilities following the C4 model.","zh":"适用于需要高级容器级设计和文档功能的架构代理，遵循C4模型。","ja":"C4モデルに従った高度なコンテナレベル設計およびドキュメント機能を必要とするアーキテクチャエージェントに最適。","ko":"C4 모델을 따르는 고급 컨테이너 수준 설계 및 문서화 기능을 필요로 하는 아키텍처 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de arquitectura que requieren capacidades de diseño y documentación de nivel de contenedor avanzadas siguiendo el modelo C4.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''architecture nécessitant des capacités de conception et de documentation de niveau de conteneur avancées suivant le modèle C4.","de":"Ideal für Architekturagenten, die erweiterte Container-Design- und Dokumentationsfunktionen nach dem C4-Modell benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Arquitetura que requerem capacidades avançadas de design e documentação em nível de contêiner, seguindo o modelo C4.","ru":"Идеально для агентов архитектуры, требующих расширенных возможностей проектирования и документации на уровне контейнеров, следующих модели C4.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المعماريين الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لتصميم المستوى الحاوي وتوثيقه اتباعًا لنموذج C4."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create comprehensive container-level architecture documentation, leveraging OpenAPI/Swagger for API documentation and mastering container design, deployment mapping, and relationship documentation. This superpower enables seamless integration with existing infrastructure definitions, enhancing overall system understanding and maintainability.","zh":"赋予代理创建全面容器级架构文档的能力，利用OpenAPI/Swagger进行API文档，并掌握容器设计、部署映射和关系文档。这一超能力实现了与现有基础设施定义的无缝集成，提高了整个系统的理解和可维护性。","ja":"OpenAPI/Swaggerを使用したAPIドキュメントとコンテナ設計、デプロイマッピング、関係ドキュメントのマスターにより、包括的なコンテナレベルアーキテクチャドキュメントを作成できるようにエージェントをEmpowerします。このスーパーパワーにより、既存のインフラストラクチャ定義とのシームレスな統合が可能になり、全体的なシステムの理解とメンテナンス性が向上します。","ko":"OpenAPI/Swagger를 사용한 API 문서화 및 컨테이너 설계, 배포 매핑, 관계 문서화의 마스터링을 통해 포괄적인 컨테이너 수준 아키텍처 문서를 생성할 수 있는 능력을 에이전트에게 부여합니다. 이 슈퍼 파워는 기존 인프라 정의와의 무缝 통합을 가능하게 하여 전체 시스템의 이해와 유지 보수성을 향상합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear documentación de arquitectura de nivel de contenedor integral, aprovechando OpenAPI/Swagger para la documentación de API y dominando el diseño de contenedores, el mapeo de implementación y la documentación de relaciones. Esta superpotencia permite una integración perfecta con las definiciones de infraestructura existentes, mejorando la comprensión general del sistema y su mantenibilidad.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer une documentation d''architecture de niveau de conteneur complète, en exploitant OpenAPI/Swagger pour la documentation d''API et en maîtrisant la conception de conteneurs, la mise en correspondance de déploiement et la documentation de relations. Ce superpouvoir permet une intégration transparente avec les définitions d''infrastructure existantes, améliorant ainsi la compréhension globale du système et sa maintenabilité.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, umfassende Container-Architekturdokumentationen zu erstellen, indem OpenAPI/Swagger für die API-Dokumentation genutzt und das Containert-Design, die Bereitstellungsabbildung und die Beziehungsdocumentation beherrscht wird. Diese Superkraft ermöglicht eine nahtlose Integration mit bestehenden Infrastrukturdefinitionen, wodurch das Gesamtsystemverständnis und die Wartbarkeit verbessert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar documentação abrangente de arquitetura em nível de contêiner, utilizando OpenAPI/Swagger para documentação de API e dominando o design de contêiner, mapeamento de implantação e documentação de relacionamentos. Este superpoder permite integração sem problemas com definições de infraestrutura existentes, melhorando a compreensão geral do sistema e a manutenibilidade.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать всестороннюю документацию архитектуры на уровне контейнеров, используя OpenAPI/Swagger для документации API и осваивая проектирование контейнеров, сопоставление компонентов с контейнерами развертывания и документацию отношений. Этот суперсил позволяет бесшовно интегрироваться с существующими определениями инфраструктуры, повышая общее понимание системы и поддерживаемость.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء توثيق شامل للهيكل المعماري على مستوى الحاويات، باستخدام OpenAPI/Swagger لتوثيق واجهات برمجة التطبيقات (API) وتحقيق تصميم الحاويات وترسيم الخدمات وتوثيق العلاقات. هذا السلوك الفائق يتيح التكامل السلس مع التعريفات الأساسية للحواسب القائمة، مما يعزز الفهم الشامل للنظام وقابلية الصيانة."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating container-level architecture diagrams","Documenting API endpoints using OpenAPI/Swagger","Mapping components to deployment containers for efficient system deployment"],"zh":["生成容器级架构图","使用OpenAPI/Swagger记录API端点","将组件映射到部署容器以实现高效的系统部署"],"ja":["コンテナレベルアーキテクチャ図の生成","OpenAPI/Swaggerを使用したAPIエンドポイントのドキュメント化","コンポーネントをデプロイコンテナにマッピングして効率的なシステムデプロイを実現"],"ko":["컨테이너 수준 아키텍처 다이어그램 생성","OpenAPI/Swagger를 사용한 API 엔드포인트 문서화","컴포넌트를 배포 컨테이너에 매핑하여 효율적인 시스템 배포"],"es":["Generar diagramas de arquitectura de nivel de contenedor","Documentar puntos de conexión de API utilizando OpenAPI/Swagger","Asignar componentes a contenedores de implementación para un despliegue de sistema eficiente"],"fr":["Générer des diagrammes d''architecture de niveau de conteneur","Documenter les points de terminaison d''API en utilisant OpenAPI/Swagger","Mapper les composants vers les conteneurs de déploiement pour un déploiement de système efficace"],"de":["Erstellen von Container-Architekturdiagrammen","Dokumentieren von API-Endpunkten unter Verwendung von OpenAPI/Swagger","Zuordnen von Komponenten zu Bereitstellungscontainern für eine effiziente Systembereitstellung"],"pt":["Geração de diagramas de arquitetura em nível de contêiner","Documentação de pontos de extremidade de API usando OpenAPI/Swagger","Mapeamento de componentes para contêineres de implantação para implantação de sistema eficiente"],"ru":["Генерация диаграмм архитектуры на уровне контейнеров","Документация точек подключения API с использованием OpenAPI/Swagger","Сопоставление компонентов с контейнерами развертывания для эффективного развертывания системы"],"ar":["إنشاء رسومات هيكل معماري على مستوى الحاويات","توثيق نهايات واجهات برمجة التطبيقات باستخدام OpenAPI/Swagger","ترسيم المكونات على حاويات الترسيم من أجل ترسيم نظام فعال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of C4 model and container-level architecture","Dependent on accurate infrastructure definitions and component documentation"],"zh":["需要了解C4模型和容器级架构","依赖于准确的基础设施定义和组件文档"],"ja":["C4モデルとコンテナレベルアーキテクチャの理解が必要","正確なインフラストラクチャ定義とコンポーネントドキュメントに依存"],"ko":["C4 모델과 컨테이너 수준 아키텍처에 대한 이해가 필요","정확한 인프라 정의 및 컴포넌트 문서에 의존"],"es":["Requiere comprensión del modelo C4 y la arquitectura de nivel de contenedor","Depende de definiciones de infraestructura y documentación de componentes precisas"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension du modèle C4 et de l''architecture de niveau de conteneur","Dépend de définitions d''infrastructure et de documentation de composants précises"],"de":["Benötigt Verständnis des C4-Modells und der Container-Architektur","Hängt von genauen Infrastrukturdefinitionen und Komponentendokumentationen ab"],"pt":["Exige compreensão do modelo C4 e arquitetura em nível de contêiner","Dependente de definições precisas de infraestrutura e documentação de componentes"],"ru":["Требует понимания модели C4 и архитектуры на уровне контейнеров","Зависит от точных определений инфраструктуры и документации компонентов"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم نموذج C4 والهيكل المعماري على مستوى الحاويات","يعتمد على تعريفات دقيقة للبنية التحتية ووثائق المكونات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
