ochleistungsstarke Konn...","pt":"Redes Híbridas de Nuvem: Conectividade Segura","ru":"Гибридные Облачные Сети: Безопасное Подключение","ar":"شبكات سحابية هجينة: اتصال آمن","en":"hybrid-cloud-networking"},"description":{"zh":"混合云网络解决方案提供安全、高性能的连接，实现本地数据中心与云服务提供商之间的可靠通信","ja":"ハイブリッドクラウドネットワーキングは、安全で高パフォーマンスな接続を提供し、本地データセンターとクラウドサービス提供者間の信頼性の高い通信を実現します","ko":"하이브리드 클라우드 네트워킹은 보안 및 고성능 연결을 제공하여 온프레미스 데이터 센터와 클라우드 서비스 제공자 간의 신뢰할 수 있는 통신을 구현합니다","es":"La red híbrida en la nube permite la conectividad segura y de alto rendimiento entre entornos locales y en la nube. Configura una conexión segura y confiable...","fr":"Le réseau hybride cloud permet une connectivité sécurisée et haute performance entre les environnements locaux et le cloud. Configurez une connexion sécurisé...","de":"Das Hybrid-Cloud-Netzwerk ermöglicht eine sichere und hochleistungsstarke Konnektivität zwischen lokalen und Cloud-Umgebungen. Konfigurieren Sie eine sichere...","pt":"As redes híbridas de nuvem permitem a conexão segura e de alto desempenho entre ambientes locais e em nuvem.","ru":"Гибридные облачные сети позволяют обеспечить безопасное и высокопроизводительное подключение между локальными и облачными средами.","ar":"الشبكات السحابية الهجينة تمكن الاتصال الآمن وعالية الأداء بين البيئات المحلية والسحابية.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["配置安全、高性能的连接","实现本地数据中心与云服务提供商之间的可靠通信","支持VPN、Direct Connect和ExpressRoute","满足合规性要求","实现混合云环境的渐进式迁移"],"ja":["安全で高パフォーマンスな接続の構成","本地データセンターとクラウドサービス提供者間の信頼性の高い通信の実現","VPN、Direct Connect、ExpressRouteのサポート","コンプライアンス要件の満足","ハイブリッドクラウド環境への段階的な移行の実現"],"ko":["보안 및 고성능 연결의 구성","온프레미스 데이터 센터와 클라우드 서비스 제공자 간의 신뢰할 수 있는 통신의 구현","VPN, Direct Connect, ExpressRoute의 지원","합规성 요구사항의 충족","하이브리드 클라우드 환경への渐進式 이주"],"es":["Conectividad segura con VPN","Alta velocidad con Direct Connect","Conectividad privada con ExpressRoute","Implementación de configuraciones activas-activas","Cumplimiento de requisitos de conformidad","Migración gradual a la nube"],"fr":["Connectivité sécurisée avec VPN","Haute vitesse avec Direct Connect","Connectivité privée avec ExpressRoute","Mise en œuvre de configurations actives-actives","Respect des exigences de conformité","Migration progressive vers le cloud"],"de":["Sichere Konnektivität mit VPN","Hohe Geschwindigkeit mit Direct Connect","Private Konnektivität mit ExpressRoute","Implementierung von aktiven-aktiven Konfigurationen","Einhaltung von Konformitätsanforderungen","Schrittweise Migration in die Cloud"],"pt":["Conexão segura entre ambientes locais e em nuvem","Alto desempenho com VPN, Direct Connect e ExpressRoute","Extensão de datacenter para nuvem","Implementação de configurações ativas-ativas híbridas","Atendimento a requisitos de conformidade","Migração gradual para a nuvem"],"ru":["Безопасное подключение между локальными и облачными средами","Высокопроизводительное подключение с помощью VPN, Direct Connect и ExpressRoute","Расширение данных центров в облач","Реализация гибридных активных-активных конфигураций","Соблюдение требований соответствия","Постепенная миграция в облако"],"ar":["اتصال آمن بين البيئات المحلية والسحابية","أداء عالي مع VPN و Direct Connect و ExpressRoute","تمديد مركز البيانات إلى السحابة","تنفيذ إعدادات نشطة-نشطة هجينة","الامتثال لمتطلبات التوافق","هجرة تدريجية إلى السحابة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["混合云网络","云服务提供商","本地数据中心","安全连接","高性能连接","VPN","Direct Connect","ExpressRoute"],"ja":["ハイブリッドクラウドネットワーキング","クラウドサービス提供者","本地データセンター","安全な接続","高パフォーマンスな接続","VPN","Direct Connect","ExpressRoute"],"ko":["하이브리드 클라우드 네트워킹","클라우드 서비스 제공자","온프레미스 데이터 센터","보안 연결","고성능 연결","VPN","Direct Connect","ExpressRoute"],"es":["red híbrida en la nube","conectividad segura","alto rendimiento","VPN","Direct Connect","ExpressRoute","migración a la nube","conformidad"],"fr":["réseau hybride cloud","connectivité sécurisée","haute performance","VPN","Direct Connect","ExpressRoute","migration vers le cloud","conformité"],"de":["Hybrid-Cloud-Netzwerk","sichere Konnektivität","hochleistungsstarke Konnektivität","VPN","Direct Connect","ExpressRoute","Migration in die Cloud","Konformität"],"pt":["redes híbridas de nuvem","conexão segura","alto desempenho","VPN","Direct Connect","ExpressRoute","nuvem híbrida","arquitetura de nuvem","segurança de rede"],"ru":["гибридные облачные сети","безопасное подключение","высокопроизводительное подключение","VPN","Direct Connect","ExpressRoute","гибридное облако","облачная архитектура","безопасность сети"],"ar":["شبكات سحابية هجينة","اتصال آمن","أداء عالي","VPN","Direct Connect","ExpressRoute","سحابة هجينة","هندسة سحابية","أمن الشبكة"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.426Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"hybrid-cloud-networking","description":"Configure secure, high-performance connectivity between on-premises infrastructure and cloud platforms using VPN and dedicated connections. Use when building hybrid cloud architectures, connecting data centers to cloud, or implementing secure cross-premises networking.","bodyPreview":"# Hybrid Cloud Networking\n\nConfigure secure, high-performance connectivity between on-premises and cloud environments using VPN, Direct Connect, and ExpressRoute.\n\n## Purpose\n\nEstablish secure, reliable network connectivity between on-premises data centers and cloud providers (AWS, Azure, GCP).\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Connect on-premises to cloud\n- Extend datacenter to cloud\n- Implement hybrid active-active setups\n- Meet compliance requirements\n- Migrate to cloud gradually\n\n## Connection Options\n\n###","body":"# Hybrid Cloud Networking\n\nConfigure secure, high-performance connectivity between on-premises and cloud environments using VPN, Direct Connect, and ExpressRoute.\n\n## Purpose\n\nEstablish secure, reliable network connectivity between on-premises data centers and cloud providers (AWS, Azure, GCP).\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Connect on-premises to cloud\n- Extend datacenter to cloud\n- Implement hybrid active-active setups\n- Meet compliance requirements\n- Migrate to cloud gradually\n\n## Connection Options\n\n### AWS Connectivity\n\n#### 1. Site-to-Site VPN\n\n- IPSec VPN over internet\n- Up to 1.25 Gbps per tunnel\n- Cost-effective for moderate bandwidth\n- Higher latency, internet-dependent\n\n```hcl\nresource \"aws_vpn_gateway\" \"main\" {\n  vpc_id = aws_vpc.main.id\n  tags = {\n    Name = \"main-vpn-gateway\"\n  }\n}\n\nresource \"aws_customer_gateway\" \"main\" {\n  bgp_asn    = 65000\n  ip_address = \"203.0.113.1\"\n  type       = \"ipsec.1\"\n}\n\nresource \"aws_vpn_connection\" \"main\" {\n  vpn_gateway_id      = aws_vpn_gateway.main.id\n  customer_gateway_id = aws_customer_gateway.main.id\n  type                = \"ipsec.1\"\n  static_routes_only  = false\n}\n```\n\n#### 2. AWS Direct Connect\n\n- Dedicated network connection\n- 1 Gbps to 100 Gbps\n- Lower latency, consistent bandwidth\n- More expensive, setup time required\n\n**Reference:** See `references/direct-connect.md`\n\n### Azure Connectivity\n\n#### 1. Site-to-Site VPN\n\n```hcl\nresource \"azurerm_virtual_network_gateway\" \"vpn\" {\n  name                = \"vpn-gateway\"\n  location            = azurerm_resource_group.main.location\n  resource_group_name = azurerm_resource_group.main.name\n\n  type     = \"Vpn\"\n  vpn_type = \"RouteBased\"\n  sku      = \"VpnGw1\"\n\n  ip_configuration {\n    name                          = \"vnetGatewayConfig\"\n    public_ip_address_id          = azurerm_public_ip.vpn.id\n    private_ip_address_allocation = \"Dynamic\"\n    subnet_id                     = azurerm_subnet.gateway.id\n  }\n}\n```\n\n#### 2. Azure ExpressRoute\n\n- Private connection via connectivity provider\n- Up to 100 Gbps\n- Low latency, high reliability\n- Premium for global connectivity\n\n### GCP Connectivity\n\n#### 1. Cloud VPN\n\n- IPSec VPN (Classic or HA VPN)\n- HA VPN: 99.99% SLA\n- Up to 3 Gbps per tunnel\n\n#### 2. Cloud Interconnect\n\n- Dedicated (10 Gbps, 100 Gbps)\n- Partner (50 Mbps to 50 Gbps)\n- Lower latency than VPN\n\n## Hybrid Network Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Hub-and-Spoke\n\n```\nOn-Premises Datacenter\n         ↓\n    VPN/Direct Connect\n         ↓\n    Transit Gateway (AWS) / vWAN (Azure)\n         ↓\n    ├─ Production VPC/VNet\n    ├─ Staging VPC/VNet\n    └─ Development VPC/VNet\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Multi-Region Hybrid\n\n```\nOn-Premises\n    ├─ Direct Connect → us-east-1\n    └─ Direct Connect → us-west-2\n            ↓\n        Cross-Region Peering\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Multi-Cloud Hybrid\n\n```\nOn-Premises Datacenter\n    ├─ Direct Connect → AWS\n    ├─ ExpressRoute → Azure\n    └─ Interconnect → GCP\n```\n\n## Routing Configuration\n\n### BGP Configuration\n\n```\nOn-Premises Router:\n- AS Number: 65000\n- Advertise: 10.0.0.0/8\n\nCloud Router:\n- AS Number: 64512 (AWS), 65515 (Azure)\n- Advertise: Cloud VPC/VNet CIDRs\n```\n\n### Route Propagation\n\n- Enable route propagation on route tables\n- Use BGP for dynamic routing\n- Implement route filtering\n- Monitor route advertisements\n\n## Security Best Practices\n\n1. **Use private connectivity** (Direct Connect/ExpressRoute)\n2. **Implement encryption** for VPN tunnels\n3. **Use VPC endpoints** to avoid internet routing\n4. **Configure network ACLs** and security groups\n5. **Enable VPC Flow Logs** for monitoring\n6. **Implement DDoS protection**\n7. **Use PrivateLink/Private Endpoints**\n8. **Monitor connections** with CloudWatch/Monitor\n9. **Implement redundancy** (dual tunnels)\n10. **Regular security audits**\n\n## High Availability\n\n### Dual VPN Tunnels\n\n```hcl\nresource \"aws_vpn_connection\" \"primary\" {\n  vpn_gateway_id      = aws_vpn_gateway.main.id\n  customer_gateway_id = aws_customer_gateway.primary.id\n  type                = \"ipsec.1\"\n}\n\nresource \"aws_vpn_connection\" \"secondary\" {\n  vpn_gateway_id      = aws_vpn_gateway.main.id\n  customer_gateway_id = aws_customer_gateway.secondary.id\n  type                = \"ipsec.1\"\n}\n```\n\n### Active-Active Configuration\n\n- Multiple connections from different locations\n- BGP for automatic failover\n- Equal-cost multi-path (ECMP) routing\n- Monitor health of all connections\n\n## Monitoring and Troubleshooting\n\n### Key Metrics\n\n- Tunnel status (up/down)\n- Bytes in/out\n- Packet loss\n- Latency\n- BGP session status\n\n### Troubleshooting\n\n```bash\n# AWS VPN\naws ec2 describe-vpn-connections\naws ec2 get-vpn-connection-telemetry\n\n# Azure VPN\naz network vpn-connection show\naz network vpn-connection show-device-config-script\n```\n\n## Cost Optimization\n\n1. **Right-size connections** based on traffic\n2. **Use VPN for low-bandwidth** workloads\n3. **Consolidate traffic** through fewer connections\n4. **Minimize data transfer** costs\n5. **Use Direct Connect** for high bandwidth\n6. **Implement caching** to reduce traffic\n\n## Reference Files\n\n- `references/vpn-setup.md` - VPN configuration guide\n- `references/direct-connect.md` - Direct Connect setup\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- `multi-cloud-architecture` - For architecture decisions\n- `terraform-module-library` - For IaC implementation\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:50:15.964Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cloud Integration Agents requiring secure and high-performance connectivity between on-premises and cloud environments via VPN, Direct Connect, and ExpressRoute.","zh":"适用于需要在本地和云环境之间通过 VPN、Direct Connect 和 ExpressRoute 实现安全和高性能连接的云集成代理。","ja":"VPN、Direct Connect、ExpressRoute 経由でオンプレミスとクラウドの環境間でセキュアで高性能な接続が必要なクラウド統合エージェントに適しています。","ko":"VPN, Direct Connect 및 ExpressRoute를 통해 온프레미스와 클라우드 환경 간에 보안 및 고성능 연결이 필요한 클라우드 통합 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de integración en la nube que requieren una conectividad segura y de alto rendimiento entre entornos locales y en la nube a través de VPN, Direct Connect y ExpressRoute.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''intégration cloud nécessitant une connectivité sécurisée et haute performance entre les environnements locaux et cloud via VPN, Direct Connect et ExpressRoute.","de":"Ideal für Cloud-Integration-Agents, die eine sichere und hochleistungsstarke Konnektivität zwischen lokalen und Cloud-Umgebungen über VPN, Direct Connect und ExpressRoute erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Integração de Nuvem que exigem conectividade segura e de alto desempenho entre ambientes locais e de nuvem via VPN, Direct Connect e ExpressRoute.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов интеграции облачных сервисов, требующих безопасного и высокопроизводительного подключения между локальными и облачными средами через VPN, Direct Connect и ExpressRoute.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تكامل السحابي الذي يتطلب اتصالاً آمنًا وعالياً الأداء بين البيئات المحلية والسحابية عبر VPN و Direct Connect و ExpressRoute."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to establish secure, reliable network connectivity between on-premises data centers and cloud providers like AWS, Azure, and GCP, leveraging protocols such as VPN, Direct Connect, and ExpressRoute for hybrid cloud networking.","zh":"赋予代理在本地数据中心和云提供商（如 AWS、Azure 和 GCP）之间建立安全可靠的网络连接的能力，利用 VPN、Direct Connect 和 ExpressRoute 等协议实现混合云网络。","ja":"AWS、Azure、GCP などのクラウドプロバイダーとオンプレミスデータセンターの間でセキュアで信頼性の高いネットワーク接続を確立するためのエージェントをEmpowerすることで、VPN、Direct Connect、ExpressRoute などのプロトコルを使用してハイブリッドクラウドネットワークが実現します。","ko":"AWS, Azure 및 GCP와 같은 클라우드 제공업체와 온프레미스 데이터 센터 간에 보안하고 안정적인 네트워크 연결을 구축할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화하여 VPN, Direct Connect 및 ExpressRoute와 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 하이브리드 클라우드 네트워킹을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes establecer una conectividad de red segura y confiable entre centros de datos locales y proveedores de nube como AWS, Azure y GCP, aprovechando protocolos como VPN, Direct Connect y ExpressRoute para la red de nube híbrida.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''établir une connectivité réseau sécurisée et fiable entre les centres de données locaux et les fournisseurs de cloud tels que AWS, Azure et GCP, en exploitant des protocoles tels que VPN, Direct Connect et ExpressRoute pour le réseau cloud hybride.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, eine sichere und zuverlässige Netzwerkverbindung zwischen lokalen Rechenzentren und Cloud-Anbietern wie AWS, Azure und GCP herzustellen, indem Protokolle wie VPN, Direct Connect und ExpressRoute für hybride Cloud-Netzwerke genutzt werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes estabeleçam conectividade de rede segura e confiável entre centros de dados locais e provedores de nuvem, como AWS, Azure e GCP, utilizando protocolos como VPN, Direct Connect e ExpressRoute para networking de nuvem híbrida.","ru":"Позволяет агентам устанавливать безопасное и надежное сетевое подключение между локальными центрами данных и облачными провайдерами, такими как AWS, Azure и GCP, используя протоколы, такие как VPN, Direct Connect и ExpressRoute для гибридного облачного сетевого взаимодействия.","ar":"تمكّن العملاء من إنشاء اتصال شبكي آمن وموثوق بين مراكز البيانات المحلية ومقدمي السحابي مثل AWS و Azure و GCP، باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل VPN و Direct Connect و ExpressRoute للشبكات السحابية الهجينة."},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring hybrid active-active setups for cloud and on-premises data centers","Migrating to cloud gradually while maintaining secure connectivity","Implementing compliance requirements for secure data transfer between cloud and on-premises environments"],"zh":["为云和本地数据中心配置混合主动-主动设置","在保持安全连接的同时逐渐迁移到云","在云和本地环境之间实现安全数据传输的合规要求"],"ja":["クラウドとオンプレミスデータセンターのハイブリッドアクティブ-アクティブ設定の構成","セキュアな接続を維持しながらクラウドへの移行","クラウドとオンプレミス環境間のセキュアなデータ転送のコンプライアンス要件の実施"],"ko":["클라우드 및 온프레미스 데이터 센터를 위한 하이브리드 액티브-액티브 설정 구성","보안 연결을 유지하면서 클라우드로의 이행","클라우드 및 온프레미스 환경 간의 보안 데이터 전송을 위한 컴플라이언스 요구 사항 구현"],"es":["Configuración de configuraciones híbridas activas-activas para centros de datos en la nube y locales","Migración a la nube de forma gradual mientras se mantiene la conectividad segura","Implementación de los requisitos de cumplimiento para la transferencia segura de datos entre entornos en la nube y locales"],"fr":["Configuration de configurations hybrides actives-actives pour les centres de données cloud et locaux","Migration vers le cloud de manière progressive tout en maintenant la connectivité sécurisée","Mise en œuvre des exigences de conformité pour le transfert sécurisé de données entre les environnements cloud et locaux"],"de":["Konfiguration von hybriden Aktiv-Aktiv-Konfigurationen für Cloud- und lokale Rechenzentren","Schrittweise Migration in die Cloud bei gleichzeitiger Aufrechterhaltung einer sicheren Konnektivität","Umsetzung der Konformitätsanforderungen für den sicheren Datentransfer zwischen Cloud- und lokalen Umgebungen"],"pt":["Configurando configurações ativas-ativas híbridas para centros de dados de nuvem e locais","Migrando para a nuvem gradualmente, mantendo a conectividade segura","Implementando requisitos de conformidade para transferência de dados segura entre ambientes de nuvem e locais"],"ru":["Настройка гибридных активных-активных конфигураций для облачных и локальных центров данных","Постепенная миграция в облако при сохранении безопасного подключения","Реализация требований соответствия для безопасной передачи данных между облачными и локальными средами"],"ar":["تكوين إعدادات نشطة-نشطة هجينة لمراكز بيانات السحابي والمحلية","الانتقال إلى السحابي تدريجيًا مع الحفاظ على الاتصال الآمن","تنفيذ متطلبات التوافق لنقل البيانات الآمن بين بيئات السحابي والمحلية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires expertise in cloud provider configurations (AWS, Azure, GCP)","Dependent on stable internet connectivity for VPN and Direct Connect","ExpressRoute requirements may include specific hardware and networking configurations"],"zh":["需要云提供商配置的专业知识（AWS、Azure、GCP）","依赖于稳定的互联网连接以实现 VPN 和 Direct Connect","ExpressRoute 的要求可能包括特定的硬件和网络配置"],"ja":["AWS、Azure、GCP などのクラウドプロバイダーの構成に関する専門知識が必要","VPN と Direct Connect のためには安定したインターネット接続が必要","ExpressRoute の要件には特定のハードウェアとネットワーク構成が含まれる場合がある"],"ko":["AWS, Azure, GCP와 같은 클라우드 제공업체 구성에 대한 전문 지식이 필요합니다.","VPN 및 Direct Connect를 위해 안정적인 인터넷 연결이 필요합니다.","ExpressRoute의 요구 사항에는 특정 하드웨어 및 네트워크 구성이 포함될 수 있습니다."],"es":["Requiere experiencia en configuraciones de proveedores de nube (AWS, Azure, GCP)","Depende de una conectividad a Internet estable para VPN y Direct Connect","Los requisitos de ExpressRoute pueden incluir configuraciones de hardware y redes específicas"],"fr":["Nécessite une expertise dans les configurations des fournisseurs de cloud (AWS, Azure, GCP)","Dépend d''une connectivité Internet stable pour VPN et Direct Connect","Les exigences d''ExpressRoute peuvent inclure des configurations matérielles et réseau spécifiques"],"de":["Benötigt Expertenwissen in Cloud-Anbieter-Konfigurationen (AWS, Azure, GCP)","Hängt von einer stabilen Internetverbindung für VPN und Direct Connect ab","Die Anforderungen von ExpressRoute können spezifische Hardware- und Netzwerkkonfigurationen umfassen"],"pt":["Exige expertise em configurações de provedores de nuvem (AWS, Azure, GCP)","Dependente de conectividade de internet estável para VPN e Direct Connect","Requisitos do ExpressRoute podem incluir configurações de hardware e rede específicas"],"ru":["Требует экспертизы в конфигурациях облачных провайдеров (AWS, Azure, GCP)","Зависит от стабильного интернет-соединения для VPN и Direct Connect","Требования ExpressRoute могут включать специальные аппаратные и сетевые конфигурации"],"ar":["يتطلب خبرة في تكوين مقدمي السحابي (AWS و Azure و GCP)","يعتمد على اتصال إنترنت مستقر لبروتوكول VPN و Direct Connect","يمكن أن تشمل متطلبات ExpressRoute تكوينات أجهزة وشبكات محددة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
