"صيانة باكاج.جسون","en":"package-json-maintenance"},"description":{"zh":"Package.json ","ja":"Package.json","ko":"Package.json ","es":"Nuestra herramienta de mantenimiento de package.json gestiona tareas de mantenimiento de JavaScript, incluyendo auditorías de seguridad y actualizaciones de ...","fr":"Notre outil de maintenance de package.json gère les tâches de maintenance JavaScript, y compris les audits de sécurité et les mises à jour des dépendances","de":"Unser package.json-Wartungstool verwaltet JavaScript-Wartungsaufgaben, einschließlich Sicherheitsaudits und Abhängigkeitsupdates","pt":"A manutenção de package.json gerencia tarefas de manutenção de pacotes JavaScript de forma isolada, incluindo auditorias de segurança e atualizações de depen...","ru":"Техническое обслуживание Package.json управляет задачами технического обслуживания пакетов JavaScript в изолированном рабочем дереве, включая аудиты безопасн...","ar":"صيانة باكاج.جسون تدير مهام صيانة الحزم جافاسكريبت بشكل معزول، بما في ذلك فحوصات الأمان والتحديثات التابعة","en":"Sample code for each major and minor feature of Typescript based on blog post announcements from the Typescript team."},"definition":{"en":"Sample code for each major and minor feature of Typescript based on blog post announcements from the Typescript team."},"features":{"zh":["JavaScript","npm","yarn","pnpm","bun","CVE"],"ja":["JavaScript","npm","yarn","pnpm","bun","CVE"],"ko":["JavaScript","npm","yarn","pnpm","bun","CVE"],"es":["Detección automática del administrador de paquetes","Auditorías de seguridad para detectar vulnerabilidades","Actualizaciones de dependencias para mantener el proyecto actualizado","Compatibilidad con npm, yarn, pnpm y bun","Selección de flujo de trabajo basada en la solicitud del usuario"],"fr":["Détection automatique du gestionnaire de paquets","Audits de sécurité pour détecter les vulnérabilités","Mises à jour des dépendances pour maintenir le projet à jour","Compatibilité avec npm, yarn, pnpm et bun","Sélection du flux de travail basée sur la demande de l''utilisateur"],"de":["Automatische Erkennung des Paketmanagers","Sicherheitsaudits zur Erkennung von Schwachstellen","Abhängigkeitsupdates, um das Projekt auf dem neuesten Stand zu halten","Kompatibilität mit npm, yarn, pnpm und bun","Workflow-Auswahl basierend auf der Benutzeranfrage"],"pt":["Detecção automática do gerenciador de pacotes","Auditorias de segurança","Atualizações de dependências","Suporte a npm, yarn, pnpm e bun","Seleção de fluxo de trabalho personalizado"],"ru":["Автоматическое обнаружение менеджера пакетов","Аудиты безопасности","Обновления зависимостей","Поддержка npm, yarn, pnpm и bun","Выбор пользовательского рабочего процесса"],"ar":["اكتشاف تلقائي لمدير الحزم","فحوصات الأمان","تحديثات التابعة","دعم npm و yarn و pnpm و bun","اختيار تدفق العمل المخصص"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Package.json","JavaScript","npm","yarn","pnpm","bun","CVE","Typescript","jest","security audit"],"ja":["Package.json","JavaScript","npm","yarn","pnpm","bun","CVE","Typescript","jest","security audit"],"ko":["Package.json","JavaScript","npm","yarn","pnpm","bun","CVE","Typescript","jest","security audit"],"es":["mantenimiento de package.json","auditorías de seguridad","actualizaciones de dependencias","administrador de paquetes","JavaScript","desarrollo de software","seguridad de software"],"fr":["maintenance de package.json","audits de sécurité","mises à jour des dépendances","gestionnaire de paquets","JavaScript","développement de logiciels","sécurité des logiciels"],"de":["Wartung von package.json","Sicherheitsaudits","Abhängigkeitsupdates","Paketmanager","JavaScript","Software-Entwicklung","Software-Sicherheit"],"pt":["manutenção de package.json","auditorias de segurança","atualizações de dependências","gerenciador de pacotes","npm","yarn","pnpm","bun","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["техническое обслуживание Package.json","аудиты безопасности","обновления зависимостей","менеджер пакетов","npm","yarn","pnpm","bun","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["صيانة باكاج.جسون","فحوصات الأمان","تحديثات التابعة","مدير الحزم","npm","yarn","pnpm","bun","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"WhatIfWeDigDeeper","repo":"typescript-features-by-version","repoPath":"WhatIfWeDigDeeper/typescript-features-by-version","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.426Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"package-json-maintenance","description":">","version":"0.1","bodyPreview":"# Package.json Maintenance\n\nManages JavaScript package maintenance tasks in an isolated worktree, including security audits and dependency updates. Automatically detects and uses the project''s package manager (npm, yarn, pnpm, or bun).\n\n## Arguments\n\n- **Specific packages**: `jest @types/jest`\n- **All packages**: `.`\n- **Glob patterns**: `@testing-library/* jest*`\n\n## Workflow Selection\n\nBased on user request:\n- **Security audit** (audit, CVE, vulnerabilities, security): Read [references/audit-w","body":"# Package.json Maintenance\n\nManages JavaScript package maintenance tasks in an isolated worktree, including security audits and dependency updates. Automatically detects and uses the project''s package manager (npm, yarn, pnpm, or bun).\n\n## Arguments\n\n- **Specific packages**: `jest @types/jest`\n- **All packages**: `.`\n- **Glob patterns**: `@testing-library/* jest*`\n\n## Workflow Selection\n\nBased on user request:\n- **Security audit** (audit, CVE, vulnerabilities, security): Read [references/audit-workflow.md](references/audit-workflow.md)\n- **Dependency updates** (update, upgrade, latest, modernize): Read [references/update-workflow.md](references/update-workflow.md)\n\n## Shared Process\n\n### 1. Create Isolated Environment\n\n**Preferred: Worktree** (isolated, non-disruptive)\n```bash\nTIMESTAMP=$(date +%Y%m%d-%H%M%S)\nBRANCH_NAME=\"pkg-maintenance-$TIMESTAMP\"\nWORKTREE_PATH=\"../$BRANCH_NAME\"\ngit worktree add \"$WORKTREE_PATH\" -b \"$BRANCH_NAME\"\ncd \"$WORKTREE_PATH\"\nUSE_WORKTREE=true\n```\n\n**Fallback: Branch** (if worktree fails due to sandbox directory restrictions)\n\nPrompt user: \"Worktree creation failed (sandbox may restrict creating directories outside the working directory). Run in current directory on a new branch instead? This will stash any uncommitted changes.\"\n\nIf user accepts:\n```bash\ngit stash --include-untracked\ngit checkout -b \"$BRANCH_NAME\"\nUSE_WORKTREE=false\n```\n\n### 2. Detect Package Manager\n\nCheck for lock files to determine the package manager. See [references/package-managers.md](references/package-managers.md) for detection logic and command mappings.\n\n```bash\nif [ -f \"bun.lockb\" ]; then PM=\"bun\"\nelif [ -f \"pnpm-lock.yaml\" ]; then PM=\"pnpm\"\nelif [ -f \"yarn.lock\" ]; then PM=\"yarn\"\nelse PM=\"npm\"\nfi\n```\n\nAlso check `package.json` for `packageManager` field which takes precedence.\n\n### 3. Verify Registry Access\n\nVerify the package manager can reach its registry. See [references/package-managers.md](references/package-managers.md) for manager-specific commands.\n\nIf this fails, prompt user: \"Cannot reach package registry. Sandbox may be blocking network access. To allow package manager commands in sandbox mode, update settings.json.\"\n\nDo not proceed until connectivity is confirmed.\n\n### 4. Discover Package Locations\n\nFind all package.json files excluding node_modules:\n```bash\nfind . -name \"package.json\" -not -path \"*/node_modules/*\" -type f\n```\n\nStore results as an array of directories to process.\n\n### 5. Identify Packages\n\n- Parse `$ARGUMENTS` to determine packages\n- For globs, expand against package.json dependencies\n- For `.`, process all packages\n\n### 6. Validate Changes\n\nCheck `package.json` scripts for available validation commands:\n\n| Purpose | Common names |\n|---------|--------------|\n| Build | `build`, `compile`, `tsc` |\n| Lint | `lint`, `check`, `eslint` |\n| Test | `test`, `jest`, `vitest` |\n\nRun available scripts using `$PM run <script>` in order (build → lint → test), continuing on failure to collect all errors. Skip any that don''t exist.\n\nIf validation fails, revert to previous version before continuing.\n\n### 7. Update Documentation for Major Version Changes\n\nFor major version upgrades (e.g., 18.x to 19.x):\n\n1. Search for version references: `grep -r \"React 18\\|Express 4\" --include=\"*.md\" .`\n2. Update in: `CLAUDE.md`, `README.md`, `docs/*.md`\n3. Skip: `specs/*/research.md`, `specs/*/tasks.md`, archived files\n4. Include changes in report/PR description\n\n### 8. Cleanup\n\n**If using worktree:**\n```bash\ncd -\ngit worktree remove \"$WORKTREE_PATH\"\n# Delete branch only if no PR was created\ngit branch -d \"$BRANCH_NAME\"\n```\n\n**If using branch fallback:**\n```bash\ngit checkout -\ngit stash pop\n# Delete branch only if no PR was created\ngit branch -d \"$BRANCH_NAME\"\n```\n\n## Edge Cases\n\n- **No package.json**: Error with clear message\n- **Not a git repo**: Error - git required for branch/worktree isolation\n- **Package not found**: Suggest checking package name\n- **Glob matches nothing**: Warn and list available packages\n- **Network restricted**: Package manager commands require internet access; will fail in offline sandbox environments\n- **Unsupported package manager**: If using an unrecognized package manager, prompt user for guidance\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:50:33.416Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for JavaScript Agents requiring automated package maintenance and security audit capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要自动化包维护和安全审计功能的JavaScript代理。","ja":"JavaScriptエージェントが自動化されたパッケージメンテナンスとセキュリティ監査機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"자동화된 패키지 유지 보수 및 보안 감사 기능을 요구하는 JavaScript 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de JavaScript que requieren mantenimiento de paquetes automatizado y capacidades de auditoría de seguridad.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents JavaScript nécessitant une maintenance de package automatisée et des capacités d''audit de sécurité.","de":"Ideal für JavaScript-Agents, die ein automatisiertes Paketwartung und Sicherheitsaudit-Funktionen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes JavaScript que exigem manutenção de pacotes automatizada e capacidades de auditoria de segurança.","ru":"Идеально для агентов JavaScript, требующих автоматизированного обслуживания пакетов и возможностей аудита безопасности.","ar":"مثالي لعميل جافاسكريبت الذي يتطلب صيانة حزمة أوتوماتيكية وقدرات تدقيق أمان."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage JavaScript package maintenance tasks, including security audits and dependency updates using npm, yarn, pnpm, or bun, and supports specific packages, all packages, and glob patterns like jest, @types/jest, and @testing-library/*.","zh":"赋予代理管理JavaScript包维护任务的能力，包括使用npm、yarn、pnpm或bun进行安全审计和依赖更新，并支持特定包、所有包和glob模式，如jest、@types/jest和@testing-library/*。","ja":"エージェントにJavaScriptパッケージメンテナンスタスクを管理する能力を与え、npm、yarn、pnpm、またはbunを使用したセキュリティ監査と依存関係の更新を含み、特定のパッケージ、すべてのパッケージ、およびglobパターン（jest、@types/jest、@testing-library/*など）をサポートします。","ko":"에이전트에 JavaScript 패키지 유지 보수 작업을 관리할 수 있는 기능을 부여하며, npm, yarn, pnpm 또는 bun을 사용한 보안 감사 및 종속성 업데이트를 포함하고, 특정 패키지, 모든 패키지 및 글로브 패턴(jest, @types/jest, @testing-library/* 등)을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar tareas de mantenimiento de paquetes de JavaScript, incluyendo auditorías de seguridad y actualizaciones de dependencias utilizando npm, yarn, pnpm o bun, y admite paquetes específicos, todos los paquetes y patrones de glob como jest, @types/jest y @testing-library/*.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les tâches de maintenance de package JavaScript, y compris les audits de sécurité et les mises à jour des dépendances à l''aide de npm, yarn, pnpm ou bun, et prend en charge des packages spécifiques, tous les packages et des modèles de glob tels que jest, @types/jest et @testing-library/*.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, JavaScript-Paketwartungsaufgaben zu verwalten, einschließlich Sicherheitsaudits und Abhängigkeitsupdates mit npm, yarn, pnpm oder bun, und unterstützt spezifische Pakete, alle Pakete und Globmuster wie jest, @types/jest und @testing-library/*.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar tarefas de manutenção de pacotes JavaScript, incluindo auditorias de segurança e atualizações de dependências usando npm, yarn, pnpm ou bun, e suporta pacotes específicos, todos os pacotes e padrões globais como jest, @types/jest e @testing-library/*.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять задачами обслуживания пакетов JavaScript, включая аудиты безопасности и обновления зависимостей с помощью npm, yarn, pnpm или bun, и поддерживает конкретные пакеты, все пакеты и глобальные шаблоны, такие как jest, @types/jest и @testing-library/*.","ar":"تمكين الوكيل لإدارة مهام صيانة حزمة جافاسكريبت، بما في ذلك تدقيقات الأمان وتحديثات الإعتماد باستخدام npm، yarn، pnpm أو bun، ودعم حزم محددة وجميع الحزم ونمط.glob مثل jest، @types/jest و @testing-library/*."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating security audits for npm packages","Updating dependencies using yarn or pnpm","Detecting vulnerabilities in project dependencies"],"zh":["自动化npm包的安全审计","使用yarn或pnpm更新依赖项","检测项目依赖项中的漏洞"],"ja":["npmパッケージのセキュリティ監査の自動化","yarnまたはpnpmを使用した依存関係の更新","プロジェクト依存関係内の脆弱性の検出"],"ko":["npm 패키지의 보안 감사 자동화","yarn 또는 pnpm을 사용한 종속성 업데이트","프로젝트 종속성 내의 취약점 감지"],"es":["Automatizar auditorías de seguridad para paquetes npm","Actualizar dependencias utilizando yarn o pnpm","Detectar vulnerabilidades en dependencias de proyecto"],"fr":["Automatiser les audits de sécurité pour les packages npm","Mettre à jour les dépendances à l''aide de yarn ou pnpm","Détecter les vulnérabilités dans les dépendances de projet"],"de":["Automatisierung von Sicherheitsaudits für npm-Pakete","Aktualisierung von Abhängigkeiten mit yarn oder pnpm","Erkennung von Schwachstellen in Projektabhängigkeiten"],"pt":["Automatizar auditorias de segurança para pacotes npm","Atualizar dependências usando yarn ou pnpm","Detectar vulnerabilidades nas dependências do projeto"],"ru":["Автоматизировать аудиты без