텐베rg 블록 개발","우커머스 커스터마이즈","성능 최적화"],"es":["Desarrollo de temas personalizados","Creación de plugins","Optimización de rendimiento","Desarrollo de bloques Gutenberg","Personalización de WooCommerce","Integración de REST API"],"fr":["Développement de thèmes personnalisés","Création de plugins","Optimisation des performances","Développement de blocs Gutenberg","Personnalisation de WooCommerce","Intégration de REST API"],"de":["Entwicklung benutzerdefinierter Themen","Erstellung von Plugins","Leistungsoptimierung","Entwicklung von Gutenberg-Blöcken","Anpassung von WooCommerce","Integration von REST API"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de temas personalizados","Criação de plugins","Integração com Gutenberg","Personalização do WooCommerce","Otimização de desempenho"],"ru":["Разработка кастомных тем","Создание плагинов","Интеграция с Gutenberg","Настройка WooCommerce","Оптимизация производительности"],"ar":["إنشاء Темات مخصصة","تصميم أدوات إضافية","التكامل مع جوتنبرج","تخصيص ووكوميرس","تحسين الأداء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["WordPress Pro","自定义主题","插件开发","Gutenberg 块","WooCommerce","性能优化","高级 WordPress 开发"],"ja":["WordPress Pro","カスタムテーマ","プラグイン開発","Gutenberg ブロック","WooCommerce","パフォーマンス最適化","高級 WordPress 開発"],"ko":["워드프레스 프로","커스텀 테마","플러그인 개발","구텐베rg 블록","우커머스","성능 최적화","고급 워드프레스 개발"],"es":["desarrollador wordpress pro","temas personalizados wordpress","plugins wordpress","optimización de rendimiento wordpress","gutenberg wordpress","woocommerce personalizado","rest api wordpress","desarrollo moderno de wordpress","php 8.1+ wordpress"],"fr":["développeur wordpress pro","thèmes personnalisés wordpress","plugins wordpress","optimisation des performances wordpress","gutenberg wordpress","woocommerce personnalisé","rest api wordpress","développement moderne de wordpress","php 8.1+ wordpress"],"de":["wordpress pro-entwickler","benutzerdefinierte themen wordpress","plugins wordpress","leistungsoptimierung wordpress","gutenberg wordpress","woocommerce anpassung","rest api wordpress","moderne wordpress-entwicklung","php 8.1+ wordpress"],"pt":["desenvolvedor wordpress","temas personalizados","plugins wordpress","gutenberg","woocommerce","otimização de desempenho"],"ru":["разработчик wordpress","кастомные темы","плагины wordpress","gutenberg","woocommerce","оптимизация производительности"],"ar":["مطور ووردبريس","تمات مخصصة","أدوات إضافية ووردبريس","جوتنبرج","ووكوميرس","تحسين الأداء"]}},"owner":"ErickAguilar95","repo":"full_wordpress_figma_creator","repoPath":"ErickAguilar95/full_wordpress_figma_creator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.426Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"wordpress-pro","description":"Use when developing WordPress themes, plugins, customizing Gutenberg blocks, implementing WooCommerce features, or optimizing WordPress performance and security.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# WordPress Pro\n\nExpert WordPress developer specializing in custom themes, plugins, Gutenberg blocks, WooCommerce, and WordPress performance optimization.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior WordPress developer with deep experience building custom themes, plugins, and WordPress solutions. You specialize in modern WordPress development with PHP 8.1+, Gutenberg block development, WooCommerce customization, REST API integration, and performance optimization. You build secure, scalable WordPress s","body":"# WordPress Pro\n\nExpert WordPress developer specializing in custom themes, plugins, Gutenberg blocks, WooCommerce, and WordPress performance optimization.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior WordPress developer with deep experience building custom themes, plugins, and WordPress solutions. You specialize in modern WordPress development with PHP 8.1+, Gutenberg block development, WooCommerce customization, REST API integration, and performance optimization. You build secure, scalable WordPress sites following WordPress coding standards and best practices.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building custom WordPress themes with template hierarchy\n- Developing WordPress plugins with proper architecture\n- Creating custom Gutenberg blocks and block patterns\n- Customizing WooCommerce functionality\n- Implementing WordPress REST API endpoints\n- Optimizing WordPress performance and security\n- Working with Advanced Custom Fields (ACF)\n- Full Site Editing (FSE) and block themes\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n1. **Analyze requirements** - Understand WordPress context, existing setup, goals\n2. **Design architecture** - Plan theme/plugin structure, hooks, data flow\n3. **Implement** - Build using WordPress standards, security best practices\n4. **Optimize** - Cache, query optimization, asset optimization\n5. **Test & secure** - Security audit, performance testing, compatibility checks\n\n## Reference Guide\n\nLoad detailed guidance based on context:\n\n| Topic | Reference | Load When |\n|-------|-----------|-----------|\n| Theme Development | `references/theme-development.md` | Templates, hierarchy, child themes, FSE |\n| Plugin Architecture | `references/plugin-architecture.md` | Structure, activation, settings API, updates |\n| Gutenberg Blocks | `references/gutenberg-blocks.md` | Block dev, patterns, FSE, dynamic blocks |\n| Hooks & Filters | `references/hooks-filters.md` | Actions, filters, custom hooks, priorities |\n| Performance & Security | `references/performance-security.md` | Caching, optimization, hardening, backups |\n\n## Constraints\n\n### MUST DO\n- Follow WordPress Coding Standards (WPCS)\n- Use nonces for form submissions\n- Sanitize all user inputs with appropriate functions\n- Escape all outputs (esc_html, esc_url, esc_attr)\n- Use prepared statements for database queries\n- Implement proper capability checks\n- Enqueue scripts/styles properly (wp_enqueue_*)\n- Use WordPress hooks instead of modifying core\n- Write translatable strings with text domains\n- Test across multiple WordPress versions\n\n### MUST NOT DO\n- Modify WordPress core files\n- Use PHP short tags or deprecated functions\n- Trust user input without sanitization\n- Output data without escaping\n- Hardcode database table names (use $wpdb->prefix)\n- Skip capability checks in admin functions\n- Ignore SQL injection vulnerabilities\n- Bundle unnecessary libraries (use WordPress APIs)\n- Create security vulnerabilities through file uploads\n- Skip internationalization (i18n)\n\n## Output Templates\n\nWhen implementing WordPress features, provide:\n1. Main plugin/theme file with proper headers\n2. Relevant template files or block code\n3. Functions with proper WordPress hooks\n4. Security implementations (nonces, sanitization, escaping)\n5. Brief explanation of WordPress-specific patterns used\n\n## Knowledge Reference\n\nWordPress 6.4+, PHP 8.1+, Gutenberg, WooCommerce, ACF, REST API, WP-CLI, block development, theme customizer, widget API, shortcode API, transients, object caching, query optimization, security hardening, WPCS\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:50:16.868Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Web Development Agents requiring advanced WordPress theme customization and performance optimization capabilities.","zh":"适合需要高级WordPress主题自定义和性能优化的Web开发代理。","ja":"WordPressテーマの高度なカスタマイズとパフォーマンス最適化機能を必要とするWeb開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 워드프레스 테마 사용자 지정 및 성능 최적화 기능이 필요한 웹 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo web que requieren personalización avanzada de temas de WordPress y capacidades de optimización del rendimiento.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement web nécessitant une personnalisation avancée de thèmes WordPress et des capacités d''optimisation des performances.","de":"Ideal für Webentwicklungsagenten, die erweiterte Anpassungsmöglichkeiten für WordPress-Themes und Leistungsoptimierungsfähigkeiten erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de desenvolvimento web que exigem personalização avançada de temas do WordPress e capacidades de otimização de desempenho.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов веб-разработки, требующих продвинутой настройки тем WordPress и возможностей оптимизации производительности.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تطوير الويب التي تتطلب تخصيصًا متقدمًا لمواضيع الوردبريس وقدرات تحسين الأداء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create custom WordPress themes with configurable text boxes, leveraging PHP 8.1+, Gutenberg block development, and WooCommerce integration, while optimizing WordPress performance.","zh":"赋予代理创建具有可配置文本框的自定义WordPress主题的能力，利用PHP 8.1+、Gutenberg块开发和WooCommerce集成，同时优化WordPress性能。","ja":"PHP 8.1+、Gutenbergブロック開発、WooCommerce統合を活用して、構成可能なテキストボックスを備えたカスタムWordPressテーマを作成するエージェントを可能にし、同時にWordPressのパフォーマンスを最適化します。","ko":"PHP 8.1+、구텐버그 블록 개발 및 우커머스 통합을 활용하여 구성 가능한 텍스트 상자를備えた 사용자 지정 워드프레스 테마를 생성할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화하여同時に 워드프레스 성능을 최적화합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear temas personalizados de WordPress con cuadros de texto configurables, aprovechando PHP 8.1+, el desarrollo de bloques de Gutenberg y la integración con WooCommerce, al tiempo que se optimiza el rendimiento de WordPress.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des thèmes WordPress personnalisés avec des zones de texte configurables, en exploitant PHP 8.1+, le développement de blocs Gutenberg et l''intégration WooCommerce, tout en optimisant les performances de WordPress.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, benutzerdefinierte WordPress-Themes mit konfigurierbaren Textfeldern zu erstellen, indem PHP 8.1+, die Entwicklung von Gutenberg-Blöcken und die WooCommerce-Integration genutzt werden, während gleichzeitig die WordPress-Leistung optimiert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar temas personalizados do WordPress com caixas de texto configuráveis, aproveitando o PHP 8.1+, desenvolvimento de blocos Gutenberg e integração com o WooCommerce, ao mesmo tempo em que otimiza o desempenho do WordPress.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать индивидуальные темы WordPress с настраиваемыми текстовыми полями, используя PHP 8.1+, разработку блоков Gutenberg и интеграцию с WooCommerce, а также оптимизирует производительность WordPress.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء مواضيع مخصصة لـ WordPress مع مربعات نص قابلّة للتخصيص، مع استخدام PHP 8.1+ وتطوير كتلة جوتنبرغ ودمج WooCommerce، في الوقت نفسه تحسين أداء الوردبريس."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating custom WordPress themes from Figma designs","Developing scalable Gutenberg blocks for enhanced user experience","Optimizing WordPress performance for improved page load times"],"zh":["从Figma设计生成自定义WordPress主题","开发可扩展的Gutenberg块以增强用户体验","优化WordPress性能以提高页面加载速度"],"ja":["FigmaデザインからカスタムWordPressテーマを生成する","拡張可能なGutenbergブロックを開発してユーザーエクスペリエンスを強化する","WordPressのパフォーマンスを最適化してページロード時間を短縮する"],"ko":["피그마 디자인에서 사용자 지정 워드프레스 테마 생성","확장 가능한 구텐버그 블록 개발을 통해 사용자 경험 개선","워드프레스 성능 최적화하여 페이지 로드 시간 단축"],"es":["Generación de temas personalizados de WordPress a partir de diseños de Figma","Desarrollo de bloques escalables de Gutenberg para una experiencia del usuario mejorada","Optimización del rendimiento de WordPress para tiempos de carga de página mejorados"],"fr":["Génération de thèmes WordPress personnalisés à partir de conceptions Figma","Développement de blocs Gutenberg évolutifs pour une expérience utilisateur améliorée","Optimisation des performances de WordPress pour des temps de chargement de page améliorés"],"de":["Erstellung benutzerdefinierter WordPress-Themes aus Figma-Designs","Entwicklung von skalierbaren Gutenberg-Blöcken für eine verbesserte Benutzererfahrung","Optimierung der WordPress-Leistung für verbesserte Ladezeiten"],"pt":["Geração de temas personalizados do WordPress a partir de designs do Figma","Desenvolvimento de blocos Gutenberg escaláveis para experiência do usuário aprimorada","Otimização do desempenho do WordPress para tempos de carregamento de página melhorados"],"ru":["Генерация индивидуальных тем WordPress из дизайнов Figma","Разработка масштабируемых блоков Gutenberg для улучшения пользовательского опыта","Оптимизация производительности WordPress для улучшения времени загрузки страниц"],"ar":["إنشاء مواضيع مخصصة لـ WordPress من تصاميم Figma","تطوير كتل جوتنبرغ قابلة للتوسيع لتجربة مستخدم محسّنة","تحسين أداء الوردبريس لأوقات تحميل صفحة محسّنة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires PHP 8.1+ compatibility","WordPress-specific development environment needed"],"zh":["需要PHP 8.1+兼容性","需要WordPress专用开发环境"],"ja":["PHP 8.1+の互換性が必要","WordPress専用の開発環境が必要"],"ko":["PHP 8.1+ 호환성이 필요","워드프레스 전용 개발 환경이 필요"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con PHP 8.1+","Se necesita un entorno de desarrollo específico de WordPress"],"fr":["Nécessite une compatibilité avec PHP 8.1+","Un environnement de développement spécifique à WordPress est nécessaire"],"de":["Benötigt PHP 8.1+-Kompatibilität","Ein WordPress-spezifisches Entwicklungsumfeld ist erforderlich"],"pt":["Exige compatibilidade com PHP 8.1+","Ambiente de desenvolvimento específico do WordPress necessário"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с PHP 8.1+","Необходимо специфичное для WordPress окружение разработки"],"ar":["يتطلب التوافق مع PHP 8.1+","بيئة تطوير محددة لبرنامج الوردبريس مطلوبة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
