.sh CLI将音频转换为文本","ja":"Procedio AIのスピーチツーテキスト機能は、inference.sh CLIを使用して音声をテキストに変換","ko":"Procedio AI의 음성 텍스트 변환 기능은 inference.sh CLI를 사용하여 오디오를 텍스트로 변환","es":"Transcribe audio a texto con nuestra herramienta de reconocimiento de voz Procedio AI. Utiliza nuestra CLI para transcribir archivos de audio con facilidad.","fr":"Transcrivez l''audio en texte avec notre outil de reconnaissance vocale Procedio AI. Utilisez notre CLI pour transcrire des fichiers audio avec facilité.","de":"Transkribieren Sie Audio in Text mit unserem Spracherkennungstool Procedio AI. Verwenden Sie unsere CLI, um Audiodateien mit Leichtigkeit zu transkribieren.","pt":"O Procedio AI oferece uma solução de conversão de fala para texto via CLI. Aprenda a transcrever áudio para texto com o modelo Fast Whisper V3","ru":"Procedio AI предлагает решение для преобразования речи в текст через CLI. Узнайте, как транскрибировать аудио в текст с помощью модели Fast Whisper V3","ar":"يقدم Procedio AI حلًا لتحويل الكلام إلى نص عبر CLI. تعلم كيفية نسخ الصوت إلى نص باستخدام نموذج Fast Whisper V3","en":"Procedio AI"},"definition":{"en":"Procedio AI"},"features":{"zh":["支持音频转文本","使用inference.sh CLI","快速高效","支持多种音频格式","高精度转换"],"ja":["音声テキストへの対応","inference.sh CLIの使用","高速かつ効率的","複数の音声形式をサポート","高精度変換"],"ko":["오디오를 텍스트로 변환","inference.sh CLI 사용","빠르고 효율적","여러 오디오 형식 지원","고품질 변환"],"es":["Transcripción de audio a texto en tiempo real","Compatibilidad con múltiples formatos de audio","Integración con nuestra CLI para una transcripción fácil","Modelos de reconocimiento de voz avanzados","Resultados de transcripción precisos y fiables"],"fr":["Transcription de l''audio en texte en temps réel","Compatibilité avec plusieurs formats audio","Intégration avec notre CLI pour une transcription facile","Modèles de reconnaissance vocale avancés","Résultats de transcription précis et fiables"],"de":["Echtzeit-Transkription von Audio in Text","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Audioformaten","Integration mit unserer CLI für eine einfache Transkription","Fortgeschrittene Spracherkennungsmodelle","Präzise und zuverlässige Transkriptionsergebnisse"],"pt":["Transcrição de áudio para texto","Uso da CLI inference.sh","Modelo Fast Whisper V3","Integração com Procedio AI","Suporte a vários formatos de áudio"],"ru":["Транскрибирование аудио в текст","Использование CLI inference.sh","Модель Fast Whisper V3","Интеграция с Procedio AI","Поддержка нескольких форматов аудио"],"ar":["نسخ الصوت إلى نص","استخدام CLI inference.sh","نموذج Fast Whisper V3","التكامل مع Procedio AI","دعم عدة صيغ صوتية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["语音转文本","Procedio AI","inference.sh CLI","音频转换","AI技术","自然语言处理"],"ja":["スピーチツーテキスト","Procedio AI","inference.sh CLI","音声変換","AI技術","自然言語処理"],"ko":["음성 텍스트 변환","Procedio AI","inference.sh CLI","오디오 변환","AI 기술","자연어 처리"],"es":["transcripción de voz a texto","reconocimiento de voz","procedio ai","transcripción de audio","herramienta de transcripción","reconocimiento de habla","transcripción en tiempo real","modelo de reconocimiento de voz"],"fr":["transcription vocale","reconnaissance vocale","procedio ai","transcription audio","outil de transcription","reconnaissance de la parole","transcription en temps réel","modèle de reconnaissance vocale"],"de":["sprach-zu-text-transkription","spracherkennung","procedio ai","audiotranskription","transkriptionswerkzeug","spracherkennung","echtzeit-transkription","spracherkennungsmodell"],"pt":["conversão de fala para texto","Procedio AI","inference.sh","Fast Whisper V3","transcrição de áudio","CLI","desenvolvimento de software","tecnologia de reconhecimento de voz"],"ru":["преобразование речи в текст","Procedio AI","inference.sh","Fast Whisper V3","транскрибирование аудио","CLI","разработка программного обеспечения","технология распознавания речи"],"ar":["تحويل الكلام إلى نص","Procedio AI","inference.sh","Fast Whisper V3","نسخ الصوت","CLI","تطوير البرمجيات","تكنولوجيا التعرف على الصوت"]}},"owner":"RomainGRAS42","repo":"Procedio-AI","repoPath":"RomainGRAS42/Procedio-AI","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.426Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"speech-to-text","description":"Transcribe audio to text with Whisper models via inference.sh CLI. Models: Fast Whisper Large V3, Whisper V3 Large. Capabilities: transcription, translation, multi-language, timestamps. Use for: meeting transcription, subtitles, podcast transcripts, voice notes. Triggers: speech to text, transcription, whisper, audio to text, transcribe audio, voice to text, stt, automatic transcription, subtitles generation, transcribe meeting, audio transcription, whisper ai","bodyPreview":"# Speech-to-Text\n\nTranscribe audio to text via [inference.sh](https://inference.sh) CLI.\n\n![Speech-to-Text](https://cloud.inference.sh/u/4mg21r6ta37mpaz6ktzwtt8krr/01jz025e88nkvw55at1rqtj5t8.png)\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\ncurl -fsSL https://cli.inference.sh | sh && infsh login\n\ninfsh app run infsh/fast-whisper-large-v3 --input ''{\"audio_url\": \"https://audio.mp3\"}''\n```\n\n## Available Models\n\n| Model | App ID | Best For |\n|-------|--------|----------|\n| Fast Whisper V3 | `infsh/fast-whisper-large-v3`","body":"# Speech-to-Text\n\nTranscribe audio to text via [inference.sh](https://inference.sh) CLI.\n\n![Speech-to-Text](https://cloud.inference.sh/u/4mg21r6ta37mpaz6ktzwtt8krr/01jz025e88nkvw55at1rqtj5t8.png)\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\ncurl -fsSL https://cli.inference.sh | sh && infsh login\n\ninfsh app run infsh/fast-whisper-large-v3 --input ''{\"audio_url\": \"https://audio.mp3\"}''\n```\n\n## Available Models\n\n| Model | App ID | Best For |\n|-------|--------|----------|\n| Fast Whisper V3 | `infsh/fast-whisper-large-v3` | Fast transcription |\n| Whisper V3 Large | `infsh/whisper-v3-large` | Highest accuracy |\n\n## Examples\n\n### Basic Transcription\n\n```bash\ninfsh app run infsh/fast-whisper-large-v3 --input ''{\"audio_url\": \"https://meeting.mp3\"}''\n```\n\n### With Timestamps\n\n```bash\ninfsh app sample infsh/fast-whisper-large-v3 --save input.json\n\n# {\n#   \"audio_url\": \"https://podcast.mp3\",\n#   \"timestamps\": true\n# }\n\ninfsh app run infsh/fast-whisper-large-v3 --input input.json\n```\n\n### Translation (to English)\n\n```bash\ninfsh app run infsh/whisper-v3-large --input ''{\n  \"audio_url\": \"https://french-audio.mp3\",\n  \"task\": \"translate\"\n}''\n```\n\n### From Video\n\n```bash\n# Extract audio from video first\ninfsh app run infsh/video-audio-extractor --input ''{\"video_url\": \"https://video.mp4\"}'' > audio.json\n\n# Transcribe the extracted audio\ninfsh app run infsh/fast-whisper-large-v3 --input ''{\"audio_url\": \"<audio-url>\"}''\n```\n\n## Workflow: Video Subtitles\n\n```bash\n# 1. Transcribe video audio\ninfsh app run infsh/fast-whisper-large-v3 --input ''{\n  \"audio_url\": \"https://video.mp4\",\n  \"timestamps\": true\n}'' > transcript.json\n\n# 2. Use transcript for captions\ninfsh app run infsh/caption-videos --input ''{\n  \"video_url\": \"https://video.mp4\",\n  \"captions\": \"<transcript-from-step-1>\"\n}''\n```\n\n## Supported Languages\n\nWhisper supports 99+ languages including:\nEnglish, Spanish, French, German, Italian, Portuguese, Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Arabic, Hindi, Russian, and many more.\n\n## Use Cases\n\n- **Meetings**: Transcribe recordings\n- **Podcasts**: Generate transcripts\n- **Subtitles**: Create captions for videos\n- **Voice Notes**: Convert to searchable text\n- **Interviews**: Transcription for research\n- **Accessibility**: Make audio content accessible\n\n## Output Format\n\nReturns JSON with:\n- `text`: Full transcription\n- `segments`: Timestamped segments (if requested)\n- `language`: Detected language\n\n## Related Skills\n\n```bash\n# Full platform skill (all 150+ apps)\nnpx skills add inferencesh/skills@inference-sh\n\n# Text-to-speech (reverse direction)\nnpx skills add inferencesh/skills@text-to-speech\n\n# Video generation (add captions)\nnpx skills add inferencesh/skills@ai-video-generation\n\n# AI avatars (lipsync with transcripts)\nnpx skills add inferencesh/skills@ai-avatar-video\n```\n\nBrowse all audio apps: `infsh app list --category audio`\n\n## Documentation\n\n- [Running Apps](https://inference.sh/docs/apps/running) - How to run apps via CLI\n- [Audio Transcription Example](https://inference.sh/docs/examples/audio-transcription) - Complete transcription guide\n- [Apps Overview](https://inference.sh/docs/apps/overview) - Understanding the app ecosystem\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:50:46.773Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Voice Analysis Agents needing advanced speech-to-text transcription capabilities via CLI.","zh":"非常适合需要高级语音转文本转录功能的语音分析代理，支持通过CLI实现。","ja":"音声分析エージェントが高度な音声からテキストへのトランスクリプション機能を必要とする場合に最適です。CLI経由で利用できます。","ko":"고급 음성 인식 및 음성-to-문자 전사 기능이 필요한 음성 분석 에이전트에게 적합합니다. CLI를 통해 사용할 수 있습니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Voz que necesitan capacidades de transcripción avanzadas de voz a texto a través de CLI.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse vocale nécessitant des fonctionnalités de transcription avancées de la parole à l''écrit via CLI.","de":"Perfekt für Voice-Analyse-Agents, die erweiterte Sprach-zu-Text-Transkriptionsfunktionen über die CLI benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Voz que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de transcrição de fala para texto via CLI.","ru":"Идеально для агентов анализа голоса, которым требуются продвинутые возможности транскрипции речи в текст через CLI.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل الصوت التي تحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة لترجمة الكلام إلى نص عبر CLI."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to transcribe audio files to text using Fast Whisper V3 models and inference.sh CLI, enabling efficient audio data processing and analysis through protocols like HTTPS and file formats such as MP3.","zh":"使代理能够使用Fast Whisper V3模型和inference.sh CLI将音频文件转录为文本，从而通过HTTPS等协议和MP3等文件格式实现高效的音频数据处理和分析。","ja":"Fast Whisper V3モデルとinference.sh CLIを使用して、エージェントが音声ファイルをテキストに転写できるようにし、HTTPSなどのプロトコルやMP3などのファイル形式を介した音声データの効率的な処理と分析を可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 Fast Whisper V3 모델 및 inference.sh CLI를 사용하여 오디오 파일을 텍스트로 전사할 수 있도록 하여 HTTPS 및 MP3와 같은 프로토콜 및 파일 형식을 통해 오디오 데이터를 효율적으로 처리하고 분석할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a transcribir archivos de audio a texto utilizando modelos Fast Whisper V3 e inference.sh CLI, lo que permite un procesamiento y análisis eficientes de datos de audio a través de protocolos como HTTPS y formatos de archivo como MP3.","fr":"Permet aux agents de transcrire des fichiers audio en texte en utilisant des modèles Fast Whisper V3 et inference.sh CLI, ce qui permet un traitement et une analyse efficaces des données audio via des protocoles tels que HTTPS et des formats de fichiers tels que MP3.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Audio-Dateien in Text mithilfe von Fast Whisper V3-Modellen und inference.sh-CLI zu transkribieren, was eine effiziente Audio-Datenverarbeitung und -Analyse über Protokolle wie HTTPS und Dateiformate wie MP3 ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a transcrever arquivos de áudio para texto usando modelos Fast Whisper V3 e inference.sh CLI, permitindo o processamento eficiente de dados de áudio e análise por meio de protocolos como HTTPS e formatos de arquivo como MP3.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью транскрибировать аудиофайлы в текст с использованием моделей Fast Whisper V3 и inference.sh CLI, обеспечивая эффективную обработку аудиоданных и анализ через протоколы seperti HTTPS и форматы файлов такие как MP3.","ar":"تمكン العوامل من نسخ نصوص الملفات الصوتية إلى نص باستخدام نماذج Fast Whisper V3 و inference.sh CLI، ممّا يسمح بمعالجة بيانات الصوت بفعالية وتحليلها من خلال بروتوكولات مثل HTTPS وتنسيقات الملفات مثل MP3."},"useCases":{"en":["Transcribing podcast episodes to text","Converting voice messages to readable formats","Automating audio data analysis for sentiment analysis"],"zh":["将播客剧集转录为文本","将语音消息转换为可读格式","自动化音频数据分析以进行情感分析"],"ja":["ポッドキャストエピソードをテキストに転写する","音声メッセージを読みやすい形式に変換する","感情分析のための音声データ分析の自動化"],"ko":["팟캐스트 에피소드를 텍스트로 전사하기","음성 메시지를 읽기 쉬운 형식으로 변환하기","감정 분석을 위한 오디오 데이터 분석 자동화"],"es":["Transcribir episodios de podcast a texto","Convertir mensajes de voz en formatos legibles","Automatizar el análisis de datos de audio para el análisis de sentimiento"],"fr":["Transcrire des épisodes de podcast en texte","Convertir des messages vocaux en formats lisibles","Automatiser l''analyse des données audio pour l''analyse des sentiments"],"de":["Podcast-Episoden in Text transkribieren","Sprachnachrichten in lesbare Formate umwandeln","Automatisierung der Audio-Datenanalyse für die Sentiment-Analyse"],"pt":["Transcrever episódios de podcast para texto","Converter mensagens de voz para formatos legíveis","Automatizar a análise de dados de áudio para análise de sentimentos"],"ru":["Транскрибировать эпизоды подкастов в текст","Преобразовывать голосовые сообщения в читаемые форматы","Автоматизировать анализ аудиоданных для анализа настроений"],"ar":["نسخ نصوص حلقات البودكاست إلى نص","تحويل الرسائل الصوتية إلى صيغ قابلة للقراءة","توفير تحليل بيانات الصوت آليًا لتحليل المشاعر"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires inference.sh CLI installation","Dependent on Fast Whisper V3 model performance","Limited to audio files accessible via HTTPS"],"zh":["需要安装inference.sh CLI","依赖于Fast Whisper V3模型的性能","仅限于通过HTTPS访问的音频文件"],"ja":["inference.sh CLIのインストールが必要","Fast Whisper V3モデルの性能に依存する","HTTPS経由でアクセス可能な音声ファイルのみ"],"ko":["inference.sh CLI 설치가 필요함","Fast Whisper V3 모델의 성능에 의존함","HTTPS를 통해 접근할 수 있는 오디오 파일만 해당"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de inference.sh CLI","Dependiente del rendimiento del modelo Fast Whisper V3","Limitado a archivos de audio accesibles a través de HTTPS"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de inference.sh CLI","Dépend de la performance du modèle Fast Whisper V3","Limité aux fichiers audio accessibles via HTTPS"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von inference.sh-CLI","Abhängig von der Leistung des Fast Whisper V3-Modells","Begrenzt auf Audio-Dateien, die über HTTPS zugänglich sind"],"pt":["Requer instalação do inference.sh CLI","Dependente do desempenho do modelo Fast Whisper V3","Limitado a arquivos de áudio acessíveis via HTTPS"],"ru":["Требует установки inference.sh CLI","Зависит от производительности модели Fast Whisper V3","Ограничен аудиофайлами, доступными через HTTPS"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت inference.sh CLI","يعتمد على أداء نموذج Fast Whisper V3","محدود بالملفات الصوتية التي يمكن الوصول إليها عبر HTTPS"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('itsimonfredlingjack/codex-dev-plugin/flutter-expert', 'community', 'itsimonfredlingjack', 'codex-dev-plugin', 'itsimonfredlingjack/codex-dev-plugin', 'flutter-expert', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.426Z', '2026-02-18T04:51:02.419Z', NULL, '{"id":"itsimonfredlingjack/codex-dev-plugin/flutter-expert","name":"flutter-expert","description":{"zh":"Flutter 专家是高性能、多平台应用的开发者，具有深厚的 Flutter 2025 生态系统知识。他们能够开发出高性能、跨平台的应用","ja":"Flutter エキスパートは、高パフォーマンスのマルチプラットフォーム アプリの開発者です。Flutter 2025 エコシステムに関する深い知識を持っています","ko":"Flutter 전문가는 고성능 멀티 플랫폼 애플리케이션 개발자로, Flutter 2025 생태계에 대한 깊은 지식을 가지고 있습니다","es":"El experto en Flutter desarrolla aplicaciones multiplataforma de alto rendimiento con Flutter 3.x+ y Dart 3.x. Conocimientos profundos en composición de widgets y optimización de rendimiento","fr":"L''expert Flutter développe des applications multi-plateformes haute performance avec Flutter 3.x+ et Dart 3.x. Connaissances approfondies en composition de widgets et optimisation des performances","de":"Der Flutter-Experte entwickelt Multi-Plattform-Anwendungen mit hoher Leistungsfähigkeit mit Flutter 3.x+ und Dart 3.x. Tiefes Wissen in Widget-Zusammensetzung und Leistungsoptimierung","pt":"Especialista em Flutter com conhecimento profundo do ecossistema Flutter 2025, desenvolvendo aplicações de alta performance em múltiplas plataformas","ru":"Эксперт по Flutter с глубокими знаниями экосистемы Flutter 2025, разрабатывающий высокопроизводительные приложения для нескольких платформ","ar":"خبير فلتر مع معرفة عميقة بنظام فلتر 2025، يطور تطبيقات عالية الأداء على منصات متعددة","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Flutter 专家 - 高性能跨平台应用开发","ja":"Flutter エキスパート - 高パフォーマンス マルチプラットフォーム アプリ開発","ko":"Flutter 전문가 - 고성능 멀티 플랫폼 애플리케이션 개발","es":"Experto en Flutter para aplicaciones multiplataforma","fr":"Expert Flutter pour applications multi-plateform