 in verschiedene Sprachen mithilfe von next-intl","pt":"Traduza seu aplicativo Next.js para diferentes idiomas com next-intl e ofereça uma experiência de usuário personalizada","ru":"Переведите свое приложение Next.js на разные языки с помощью next-intl и предоставьте персонализированный опыт пользователя","ar":"ترجم تطبيق Next.js الخاص بك إلى لغات مختلفة باستخدام next-intl و قدم تجربة مستخدم مخصصة","en":"Sources of my website."},"definition":{"en":"Sources of my website."},"features":{"zh":["Next.js","next-intl","i18n","","URL"],"ja":["Next.js","next-intl","i18n","","URL"],"ko":["Next.js","next-intl","i18n","","URL"],"es":["Traducción de aplicaciones web Next.js","Compatibilidad con múltiples idiomas","Configuración de rutas basadas en el idioma","Personalización de la interfaz de usuario","Integración con next-intl"],"fr":["Traduction d''applications web Next.js","Compatibilité avec plusieurs langues","Configuration de routes basées sur la langue","Personnalisation de l''interface utilisateur","Intégration avec next-intl"],"de":["Übersetzung von Next.js-Webanwendungen","Unterstützung für mehrere Sprachen","Konfiguration von sprachbasierten Routen","Anpassung der Benutzeroberfläche","Integration mit next-intl"],"pt":["Tradução de texto e layout","Suporte a múltiplos idiomas","Configuração de roteamento personalizada","Integração com next-intl","Melhoria da experiência do usuário"],"ru":["Перевод текста и макета","Поддержка нескольких языков","Пользовательская настройка маршрутизации","Интеграция с next-intl","Улучшение опыта пользователя"],"ar":["ترجمة النص و التصميم","دعم اللغات المتعددة","تكوين التوجيه المخصص","التكامل مع next-intl","تحسين تجربة المستخدم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Next.js","i18n","next-intl","","URL","SEO","","React","JavaScript"],"ja":["Next.js","i18n","next-intl","","URL","SEO","","React","JavaScript"],"ko":["Next.js","i18n","next-intl","","URL","SEO","","React","JavaScript"],"es":["i18n","traducción","next-intl","next.js","desarrollo web","internacionalización","idiomas","rutas basadas en el idioma"],"fr":["i18n","traduction","next-intl","next.js","développement web","internationalisation","langues","routes basées sur la langue"],"de":["i18n","übersetzung","next-intl","next.js","webentwicklung","internationalisierung","sprachen","sprachbasierte routen"],"pt":["i18n","next-intl","tradução de aplicativos","desenvolvimento de software","experiência do usuário","personalização","internacionalização"],"ru":["i18n","next-intl","перевод приложений","разработка программного обеспечения","опыт пользователя","персонализация","интернационализация"],"ar":["i18n","next-intl","ترجمة التطبيقات","تطوير البرمجيات","تجربة المستخدم","التنصيب","التدويل"]}},"owner":"Nivl","repo":"melvin.la","repoPath":"Nivl/melvin.la","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.426Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"i18n-translation","description":"Translate the Next.js web application to different languages using next-intl. Use this skill when the user requests to add a new language, translate content to an existing locale, update translation strings, fix missing translations, or work with internationalization (i18n) features including locale configuration, message files, and blog content translation.","bodyPreview":"# i18n Translation Skill\n\nTranslate the Next.js web application to different languages using `next-intl`.\n\n## Project Structure\n\n```\nweb/\n├── src/\n│   ├── i18n/\n│   │   ├── locales.ts           # Locale definitions and types\n│   │   ├── request.ts           # next-intl request configuration\n│   │   └── routing.ts           # Routing configuration\n│   ├── app/\n│   │   └── [locale]/            # Locale-based routes\n│   │       └── layout.tsx       # Layout with font configuration\n│   └── bundled_s","body":"# i18n Translation Skill\n\nTranslate the Next.js web application to different languages using `next-intl`.\n\n## Project Structure\n\n```\nweb/\n├── src/\n│   ├── i18n/\n│   │   ├── locales.ts           # Locale definitions and types\n│   │   ├── request.ts           # next-intl request configuration\n│   │   └── routing.ts           # Routing configuration\n│   ├── app/\n│   │   └── [locale]/            # Locale-based routes\n│   │       └── layout.tsx       # Layout with font configuration\n│   └── bundled_static/\n│       └── content/blog/        # Blog content by article and locale\n│           └── [article]/\n│               ├── en.mdx\n│               ├── fr.mdx\n│               └── ...\n└── messages/\n    ├── en.json                  # English (source of truth)\n    ├── en.d.json.ts             # TypeScript definitions\n    ├── fr.json                  # French translations\n    ├── es.json                  # Spanish translations\n    ├── ja.json                  # Japanese translations\n    ├── ko.json                  # Korean translations\n    ├── zh.json                  # Chinese Simplified translations\n    └── zh-tw.json               # Chinese Traditional translations\n```\n\n## Supported Locales\n\nCurrent supported locales are defined in `src/i18n/locales.ts`:\n- `en` - English (source of truth)\n- `fr` - French\n- `es` - Spanish\n- `ja` - Japanese\n- `ko` - Korean\n- `zh` - Chinese Simplified\n- `zh-tw` - Chinese Traditional\n\n## Workflows\n\n### Adding a New Locale\n\nFollow these steps to add a new language to the application:\n\n1. **Update locale definitions** in `src/i18n/locales.ts`:\n   - Add the new locale code to the `locales` array\n   - Example: `export const locales = [''en'', ''fr'', ''es'', ''ko'', ''zh'', ''zh-tw'', ''ja''] as const;`\n\n2. **Add language to LanguageSwitcher** in `src/components/layout/NavBar/LanguageSwitcher.tsx`:\n   - Add a new entry to the `languages` array with the locale key, native language label, and `isAI` flag\n   - **CRITICAL**: Set `isAI: true` for all AI-generated translations (all new languages added via this skill)\n   - **CRITICAL**: The `languages` array MUST be ordered alphabetically by the `key` field (locale code)\n   - Example:\n     ```typescript\n     {\n       key: ''ja'',\n       label: ''日本語'',\n       isAI: true,\n     }\n     ```\n   - This adds an \"AI\" superscript indicator in the language dropdown to inform users the translation is AI-generated\n\n3. **Create message file** at `messages/[locale].json`:\n   - Copy the structure from `messages/en.json` (source of truth)\n   - Translate all strings to the target language\n   - Maintain the same JSON structure and key names\n\n4. **Translate blog content**:\n   - For each article in `src/bundled_static/content/blog/[article]/`\n   - Create a new `[locale].mdx` file (e.g., `ja.mdx`)\n   - Translate the MDX content including frontmatter and body\n   - Keep frontmatter structure consistent (title, slug, excerpt, etc.)\n\n5. **Configure fonts** (if needed):\n   - Check if the language requires a specific Noto font (e.g., `Noto Sans JP` for Japanese)\n   - If needed, import the font in `src/app/[locale]/layout.tsx`\n   - Add the font variable to `src/app/globals.css`\n   - Note: Latin-specific fonts (like Baikal) have dedicated variables (e.g., `--font-condensed-latin`) for design-specific usage\n\n6. **Update this skill documentation** (`.agents/skills/i18n-translation/SKILL.md`):\n   - Add the new locale to the \"Supported Locales\" section\n   - Maintain alphabetical order by locale code for consistency\n   - Example: `- ''ja'' - Japanese`\n\n7. **Restart development server** for changes to take effect\n\n### Translating Existing Strings\n\nTo translate strings that are already defined in English:\n\n1. **Locate the key** in `messages/en.json`\n2. **Find the same key** in the target locale file (e.g., `messages/fr.json`)\n3. **Translate the value** while preserving:\n   - JSON structure\n   - Key names\n   - Variable placeholders (e.g., `{count}`, `{name}`)\n   - HTML entities if present\n\n### Adding New Translation Strings\n\nWhen new UI text is added to the application:\n\n1. **Add to English source** (`messages/en.json`):\n   - Use nested keys for organization (e.g., `\"HomePage\": { \"title\": \"...\" }`)\n   - Choose clear, descriptive key names\n\n2. **Add to all other locale files**:\n   - Add the same key structure to every `messages/[locale].json`\n   - Translate the value appropriately for each language\n\n3. **Use in components**:\n   ```typescript\n   import { useTranslations } from ''next-intl'';\n   \n   export function MyComponent() {\n     const t = useTranslations(''HomePage'');\n     return <h1>{t(''title'')}</h1>;\n   }\n   ```\n\n4. **Verify consistency** using `pnpm i18n:check` command\n\n### Translating Blog Articles\n\nBlog articles are stored as MDX files organized by article and locale:\n\n1. **Navigate to** `src/bundled_static/content/blog/[article]/`\n2. **Create or edit** the locale-specific MDX file (e.g., `fr.mdx`)\n3. **Translate frontmatter**:\n   ```yaml\n   ---\n   title: \"Titre de l''article\"\n   slug: \"slug-url\"\n   excerpt: \"Courte description\"\n   image: \"cover.avif\"\n   ogImage: \"cover.jpg\"\n   createdAt: \"2025-07-03\"\n   updatedAt: \"2025-07-03\"\n   ---\n   ```\n\n4. **Translate body content**:\n   - Translate all markdown content\n   - Keep code blocks and syntax intact\n   - Maintain heading structure and links\n\n5. **Restart dev server** after making changes for them to take effect\n\n### Fixing Missing Translations\n\nTo identify and fix missing translations:\n\n1. **Run consistency check**: `pnpm i18n:check`\n2. **Review errors** showing missing keys or locale files\n3. **Add missing translations** to the appropriate locale files\n4. **Ensure structure matches** `messages/en.json`\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Translation Quality\n\n- Maintain **natural phrasing** in the target language, not literal translations\n- Preserve **tone and voice** consistent with the brand\n- Keep **technical terms** consistent (e.g., \"API\", \"GitHub\")\n- Use **proper capitalization** and punctuation for the target language\n- Consider **cultural context** for idioms and expressions\n\n### JSON Structure\n\n- Always preserve the **nested key structure** from English\n- Use **double quotes** for JSON strings\n- Maintain **proper indentation** (2 spaces)\n- Keep keys in the **same order** as the English file for easier comparison\n- Do not include **comments** in JSON files\n\n### Font Configuration\n\n- Latin scripts (English, French, Spanish): Use default fonts\n- CJK languages (Chinese, Japanese, Korean): Configure Noto CJK fonts\n- Right-to-left languages (Arabic, Hebrew): Ensure RTL support is configured\n- Use `--font-condensed-latin` variable for design-specific Latin fonts regardless of locale\n\n### Blog Content\n\n- Translate **all frontmatter fields** except dates and image paths\n- Keep **slug values** in the target language for SEO\n- Maintain **markdown formatting** (headings, lists, links)\n- Preserve **code blocks** without translation\n- Keep **image paths** and **links** functional\n\n## Validation\n\nAfter making translation changes:\n\n1. Run linting: `pnpm run lint --fix`\n2. Check i18n consistency: `pnpm i18n:check`\n3. Run tests: `pnpm run test:unit`\n4. Restart dev server: `pnpm run dev`\n5. Verify changes in browser for each affected locale\n\n## Common Issues\n\n### Missing Translation Keys\n\n**Symptom**: Console warnings about missing translation keys  \n**Solution**: Add the missing key to all locale files with appropriate translations\n\n### Inconsistent JSON Structure\n\n**Symptom**: i18n:check fails with structure errors  \n**Solution**: Ensure all locale files have the same nested key structure as `en.json`\n\n### Blog Content Not Updating\n\n**Symptom**: Changes to MDX files not reflected in the app  \n**Solution**: Restart the development server (`pnpm run dev`)\n\n### Font Not Displaying Correctly\n\n**Symptom**: Characters appear with wrong font or as boxes  \n**Solution**: Verify the correct Noto font is imported and configured in `layout.tsx` and `globals.css`\n\n### Build Failures After Translation\n\n**Symptom**: Build fails with MDX processing errors  \n**Solution**: Check MDX frontmatter syntax and ensure all required fields are present\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Commands\n- `pnpm i18n:check` - Check translation consistency\n- `pnpm run dev` - Start dev server (restart after blog changes)\n- `pnpm run build` - Production build (validates all content)\n\n### File Locations\n- Locale definitions: `src/i18n/locales.ts`\n- Language switcher: `src/components/layout/NavBar/LanguageSwitcher.tsx`\n- Message files: `messages/[locale].json`\n- Blog content: `src/bundled_static/content/blog/[article]/[locale].mdx`\n- Font config: `src/app/[locale]/layout.tsx` and `src/app/globals.css`\n\n### Key Patterns\n```typescript\n// In components\nconst t = useTranslations(''SectionName'');\nconst text = t(''keyName'');\n\n// Message structure\n{\n  \"SectionName\": {\n    \"keyName\": \"Translated text\"\n  }\n}\n\n// LanguageSwitcher entry for new locale\n{\n  key: ''ja'',           // Locale code (array MUST be sorted alphabetically by this key)\n  label: ''日本語'',      // Native language name\n  isAI: true,          // Always true for AI-generated translations\n}\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:51:12.465Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Multilingual Agents needing advanced Next.js website translation capabilities using next-intl.","zh":"适用于需要使用 next-intl 进行高级 Next.js 网站翻译功能的多语言代理。","ja":"next-intl を使用した高度な Next.js Web サイトの翻訳機能を必要とするマルチリンガル エージェントに最適です。","ko":"next-intl을 사용하여 고급 Next.js 웹사이트 번역 기능이 필요한 다국어 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfect for Multilingual Agents needing advanced Next.js website translation capabilities using next-intl.","fr":"Perfect for Multilingual Agents needing advanced Next.js website translation capabilities using next-intl.","de":"Perfect for Multilingual Agents needing advanced Next.js website translation capabilities using next-intl.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Multilíngues que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de tradução de sites Next.js usando next-intl.","ru":"Идеально для многоязычных агентов, которым требуются расширенные возможности перевода сайтов Next.js с использованием next-intl.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المتعددة اللغات الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لترجمة مواقع الويب Next.js باستخدام next-intl."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to translate Next.js web applications into multiple languages using next-intl, providing locale definitions, request configuration, and routing capabilities, all while leveraging TypeScript for type safety and maintainability.","zh":"赋予代理商使用 next-intl 将 Next.js Web 应用程序翻译成多种语言的能力，提供区域定义、请求配置和路由功能，同时利用 TypeScript 实现类型安全和可维护性。","ja":"エージェントに、next-intl を使用して Next.js Web アプリケーションを複数の言語に翻訳する能力を提供し、ロケール定義、リクエスト構成、ルーティング機能を提供し、TypeScript を使用して型安全性とメンテナンス性を実現します。","ko":"에이전트에게 next-intl을 사용하여 Next.js 웹 애플리케이션을 여러 언어로 번역할 수 있는 능력을 제공하며, 로케일 정의, 요청 구성 및 라우팅 기능을 제공하고, TypeScript를 사용하여 유형 안전성 및 유지 보수성을 실현합니다.","es":"Empowers agents to translate Next.js web applications into multiple languages using next-intl, providing locale definitions, request configuration, and routing capabilities, all while leveraging TypeScript for type safety and maintainability.","fr":"Empowers agents to translate Next.js web applications into multiple languages using next-intl, providing locale definitions, request configuration, and routing capabilities, all while leveraging TypeScript for type safety and maintainability.","de":"Empowers agents to translate Next.js web applications into multiple languages using next-intl, providing locale definitions, request configuration, and routing capabilities, all while leveraging TypeScript for type safety and maintainability.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a traduzir aplicativos web Next.js para vários idiomas usando next-intl, fornecendo definições de localidade, configuração de solicitação e capacidades de roteamento, tudo isso aproveitando o TypeScript para segurança e manutenção de tipos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью переводить веб-приложения Next.js на несколько языков с использованием next-intl, обеспечивая определения местоположения, конфигурацию запроса и возможности маршрутизации, все это при использовании TypeScript для безопасности и поддержки типов.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من ترجمة تطبيقات الويب Next.js إلى لغات متعددة باستخدام next-intl، وتوفير تعريفات الموقع والتهيئة والقدرات المتنقلة، كل ذلك مع الاستفادة من TypeScript لسلامة النوع وضمان الصيانة."},"useCases":{"en":["Translating web application content for global audiences","Configuring locale-based routing for multilingual support","Implementing font configurations for diverse language sets"],"zh":["为全球受众翻译 Web 应用程序内容","为多语言支持配置基于区域的路由","为多样化语言集实现字体配置"],"ja":["グローバルなオーディエンス向けの Web アプリケーション コンテンツの翻訳","マルチリンガル サポートのためのロケールベースのルーティングの構成","多様な言語セットのためのフォント構成の実装"],"ko":["글로벌 대상자에게 웹 애플리케이션 콘텐츠 번역","다국어 지원을 위한 로케일 기반 라우팅 구성","다양한 언어 세트를 위한 글꼴 구성 구현"],"es":["Translating web application content for global audiences","Configuring locale-based routing for multilingual support","Implementing font configurations for diverse language sets"],"fr":["Translating web application content for global audiences","Configuring locale-based routing for multilingual support","Implementing font configurations for diverse language sets"],"de":["Translating web application content for global audiences","Configuring locale-based routing for multilingual support","Implementing font configurations for diverse language sets"],"pt":["Traduzir conteúdo de aplicativos web para audiências globais","Configurar roteamento baseado em localidade para suporte multilíngue","Implementar configurações de fonte para conjuntos de idiomas diversificados"],"ru":["Переводить содержимое веб-приложений для глобальной аудитории","Настроить маршрутизацию на основе местоположения для многоязычной поддержки","Реализовать конфигурации шрифтов для разнообразных языковых наборов"],"ar":["ترجمة محتوى تطبيقات الويب للجماهير العالمية","تهيئة التوجيه المبني على الموقع للدعم المتعدد اللغات","تنفيذ إعدادات الخطوط لل مجموعات اللغة المتنوعة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Next.js project setup","Dependent on next-intl library","Needs TypeScript for locale definitions and types"],"zh":["需要 Next.js 项目设置","依赖 next-intl 库","需要 TypeScript 进行区域定义和类型"],"ja":["Next.js プロジェクトの設定が必要","next-intl ライブラリに依存","ロケール定義およびタイプのために TypeScript が必要"],"ko":["Next.js 프로젝트 설정이 필요","next-intl 라이브러리에 의존","로케일 정의 및 유형을 위해 TypeScript가 필요"],"es":["Requires Next.js project setup","Dependent on next-intl library","Needs TypeScript for locale definitions and types"],"fr":["Requires Next.js project setup","Dependent on next-intl library","Needs TypeScript for locale definitions and types"],"de":["Requires Next.js project setup","Dependent on next-intl library","Needs TypeScript for locale definitions and types"],"pt":["Exige configuração do projeto Next.js","Dependente da biblioteca next-intl","Necessita TypeScript para definições de localidade e tipos"],"ru":["Требует настройки проекта Next.js","Зависит от библиотеки next-intl","Требует TypeScript для определений местоположения и типов"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد مشروع Next.js","يعتمد على مكتبة next-intl","يحتاج إلى TypeScript لتعريفات الموقع والأنواع"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
