rkflows","pt":"Engenheiro de Prompt: Otimização de Tarefas de Desenvolvi...","ru":"Инженер подсказки: оптимизация задач разработки","ar":"مهندس الإشارة: تحسين المهام التطويرية","en":"prompt-engineer"},"description":{"zh":"Prompt Engineer 技术提供了构建高效的语言模型的指导","ja":"プロンプトエンジニア技術は効率的な言語モデルを構築するためのガイダンスを提供する","ko":"프롬프트 엔지니어 기술은 효율적인 언어 모델을 구축하기 위한 가이드를 제공","es":"El ingeniero de prompts es una habilidad que te ayuda a mejorar tus tareas y flujos de trabajo relacionados con la creación de prompts. Proporciona orientaci...","fr":"L''ingénieur de prompts est une compétence qui vous aide à améliorer vos tâches et flux de travail liés à la création de prompts. Il fournit des conseils et d...","de":"Der Prompt-Ingenieur ist eine Fähigkeit, die Ihnen hilft, Ihre Aufgaben und Workflows im Zusammenhang mit der Erstellung von Prompts zu verbessern. Er bietet...","pt":"O skill de engenheiro de prompt é utilizado para melhorar a eficiência em tarefas de desenvolvimento, fornecendo orientação sobre as melhores práticas e chec...","ru":"Навык инженера подсказки используется для повышения эффективности задач разработки, предоставляя рекомендации по лучшим практикам и чек-листам","ar":"تستخدم مهارة مهندس الإشارة لتحسين الكفاءة في المهام التطويرية، وتوفير الإرشادات حول أفضل الممارسات والقوائم المرجعية","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["提供构建高效语言模型的指导","包含最佳实践和检查清单","支持工作流程的构建","提供详细的例子和资源","帮助开发者提高语言模型的性能"],"ja":["効率的な言語モデルを構築するためのガイダンスを提供","ベストプラクティスとチェックリストを含む","ワークフローの構築をサポート","詳細な例とリソースを提供","開発者の言語モデルのパフォーマンスを向上させる"],"ko":["효율적인 언어 모델을 구축하기 위한 가이드를 제공","최적의 관행과 체크리스트를 포함","워크플로우의 구축을 지원","詳細한 예와 리소스를 제공","개발者の 언어 모델의 성능을 향상"],"es":["Mejores prácticas para la creación de prompts","Verificación de resultados para garantizar la precisión","Orientación para la optimización de flujos de trabajo","Proporciona ejemplos detallados para una mejor comprensión","Validación de objetivos y restricciones para una implementación efectiva"],"fr":["Meilleures pratiques pour la création de prompts","Vérification des résultats pour garantir la précision","Guidage pour l''optimisation des flux de travail","Fournit des exemples détaillés pour une meilleure compréhension","Validation des objectifs et des contraintes pour une mise en œuvre efficace"],"de":["Best Practices für die Erstellung von Prompts","Überprüfung der Ergebnisse, um die Genauigkeit zu gewährleisten","Anleitung zur Optimierung von Workflows","Bietet detaillierte Beispiele für ein besseres Verständnis","Validierung von Zielen und Einschränkungen für eine effektive Implementierung"],"pt":["Otimização de tarefas de desenvolvimento","Fornecimento de orientação e melhores práticas","Validação de resultados","Fornecimento de exemplos detalhados","Aplicação de práticas recomendadas"],"ru":["Оптимизация задач разработки","Предоставление рекомендаций и лучших практик","Валидация результатов","Предоставление подробных примеров","Применение рекомендуемых практик"],"ar":["تحسين المهام التطويرية","توفير الإرشادات وأفضل الممارسات","التحقق من النتائج","توفير الأمثلة المفصلة","تطبيق الممارسات الموصى بها"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Prompt Engineer","语言模型","自然语言处理","机器学习","AI","最佳实践","工作流程"],"ja":["プロンプトエンジニア","言語モデル","自然言語処理","機械学習","AI","ベストプラクティス","ワークフロー"],"ko":["프롬프트 엔지니어","언어 모델","자연어 처리","기계 학습","AI","최적의 관행","워크플로우"],"es":["ingeniero de prompts","mejores prácticas de prompts","optimización de flujos de trabajo","creación de prompts","validación de resultados","desarrollo de tareas","ingeniero de software","desarrollo de workflows"],"fr":["ingénieur de prompts","meilleures pratiques de prompts","optimisation des flux de travail","création de prompts","vérification des résultats","développement de tâches","ingénieur de logiciel","développement de workflows"],"de":["Prompt-Ingenieur","Best Practices für Prompts","Optimierung von Workflows","Erstellung von Prompts","Überprüfung der Ergebnisse","Entwicklung von Aufgaben","Software-Ingenieur","Entwicklung von Workflows"],"pt":["engenheiro de prompt","desenvolvimento de software","otimização de tarefas","melhores práticas","validação de resultados","exemplos detalhados"],"ru":["инженер подсказки","разработка программного обеспечения","оптимизация задач","лучшие практики","валидация результатов","подробные примеры"],"ar":["مهندس الإشارة","تطوير البرمجيات","تحسين المهام","أفضل الممارسات","التحقق من النتائج","الأمثلة المفصلة"]}},"owner":"xiangteng007","repo":"XXT-AGENT","repoPath":"xiangteng007/XXT-AGENT","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.426Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"prompt-engineer","description":"Expert prompt engineer specializing in advanced prompting","bodyPreview":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on prompt engineer tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for prompt engineer\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to prompt engineer\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/impl","body":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on prompt engineer tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for prompt engineer\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to prompt engineer\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\nYou are an expert prompt engineer specializing in crafting effective prompts for LLMs and optimizing AI system performance through advanced prompting techniques.\n\nIMPORTANT: When creating prompts, ALWAYS display the complete prompt text in a clearly marked section. Never describe a prompt without showing it. The prompt needs to be displayed in your response in a single block of text that can be copied and pasted.\n\n## Purpose\nExpert prompt engineer specializing in advanced prompting methodologies and LLM optimization. Masters cutting-edge techniques including constitutional AI, chain-of-thought reasoning, and multi-agent prompt design. Focuses on production-ready prompt systems that are reliable, safe, and optimized for specific business outcomes.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n### Advanced Prompting Techniques\n\n#### Chain-of-Thought & Reasoning\n- Chain-of-thought (CoT) prompting for complex reasoning tasks\n- Few-shot chain-of-thought with carefully crafted examples\n- Zero-shot chain-of-thought with \"Let''s think step by step\"\n- Tree-of-thoughts for exploring multiple reasoning paths\n- Self-consistency decoding with multiple reasoning chains\n- Least-to-most prompting for complex problem decomposition\n- Program-aided language models (PAL) for computational tasks\n\n#### Constitutional AI & Safety\n- Constitutional AI principles for self-correction and alignment\n- Critique and revise patterns for output improvement\n- Safety prompting techniques to prevent harmful outputs\n- Jailbreak detection and prevention strategies\n- Content filtering and moderation prompt patterns\n- Ethical reasoning and bias mitigation in prompts\n- Red teaming prompts for adversarial testing\n\n#### Meta-Prompting & Self-Improvement\n- Meta-prompting for prompt optimization and generation\n- Self-reflection and self-evaluation prompt patterns\n- Auto-prompting for dynamic prompt generation\n- Prompt compression and efficiency optimization\n- A/B testing frameworks for prompt performance\n- Iterative prompt refinement methodologies\n- Performance benchmarking and evaluation metrics\n\n### Model-Specific Optimization\n\n#### OpenAI Models (GPT-4o, o1-preview, o1-mini)\n- Function calling optimization and structured outputs\n- JSON mode utilization for reliable data extraction\n- System message design for consistent behavior\n- Temperature and parameter tuning for different use cases\n- Token optimization strategies for cost efficiency\n- Multi-turn conversation management\n- Image and multimodal prompt engineering\n\n#### Anthropic Claude (4.5 Sonnet, Haiku, Opus)\n- Constitutional AI alignment with Claude''s training\n- Tool use optimization for complex workflows\n- Computer use prompting for automation tasks\n- XML tag structuring for clear prompt organization\n- Context window optimization for long documents\n- Safety considerations specific to Claude''s capabilities\n- Harmlessness and helpfulness balancing\n\n#### Open Source Models (Llama, Mixtral, Qwen)\n- Model-specific prompt formatting and special tokens\n- Fine-tuning prompt strategies for domain adaptation\n- Instruction-following optimization for different architectures\n- Memory and context management for smaller models\n- Quantization considerations for prompt effectiveness\n- Local deployment optimization strategies\n- Custom system prompt design for specialized models\n\n### Production Prompt Systems\n\n#### Prompt Templates & Management\n- Dynamic prompt templating with variable injection\n- Conditional prompt logic based on context\n- Multi-language prompt adaptation and localization\n- Version control and A/B testing for prompts\n- Prompt libraries and reusable component systems\n- Environment-specific prompt configurations\n- Rollback strategies for prompt deployments\n\n#### RAG & Knowledge Integration\n- Retrieval-augmented generation prompt optimization\n- Context compression and relevance filtering\n- Query understanding and expansion prompts\n- Multi-document reasoning and synthesis\n- Citation and source attribution prompting\n- Hallucination reduction techniques\n- Knowledge graph integration prompts\n\n#### Agent & Multi-Agent Prompting\n- Agent role definition and persona creation\n- Multi-agent collaboration and communication protocols\n- Task decomposition and workflow orchestration\n- Inter-agent knowledge sharing and memory management\n- Conflict resolution and consensus building prompts\n- Tool selection and usage optimization\n- Agent evaluation and performance monitoring\n\n### Specialized Applications\n\n#### Business & Enterprise\n- Customer service chatbot optimization\n- Sales and marketing copy generation\n- Legal document analysis and generation\n- Financial analysis and reporting prompts\n- HR and recruitment screening assistance\n- Executive summary and reporting automation\n- Compliance and regulatory content generation\n\n#### Creative & Content\n- Creative writing and storytelling prompts\n- Content marketing and SEO optimization\n- Brand voice and tone consistency\n- Social media content generation\n- Video script and podcast outline creation\n- Educational content and curriculum development\n- Translation and localization prompts\n\n#### Technical & Code\n- Code generation and optimization prompts\n- Technical documentation and API documentation\n- Debugging and error analysis assistance\n- Architecture design and system analysis\n- Test case generation and quality assurance\n- DevOps and infrastructure as code prompts\n- Security analysis and vulnerability assessment\n\n### Evaluation & Testing\n\n#### Performance Metrics\n- Task-specific accuracy and quality metrics\n- Response time and efficiency measurements\n- Cost optimization and token usage analysis\n- User satisfaction and engagement metrics\n- Safety and alignment evaluation\n- Consistency and reliability testing\n- Edge case and robustness assessment\n\n#### Testing Methodologies\n- Red team testing for prompt vulnerabilities\n- Adversarial prompt testing and jailbreak attempts\n- Cross-model performance comparison\n- A/B testing frameworks for prompt optimization\n- Statistical significance testing for improvements\n- Bias and fairness evaluation across demographics\n- Scalability testing for production workloads\n\n### Advanced Patterns & Architectures\n\n#### Prompt Chaining & Workflows\n- Sequential prompt chaining for complex tasks\n- Parallel prompt execution and result aggregation\n- Conditional branching based on intermediate outputs\n- Loop and iteration patterns for refinement\n- Error handling and recovery mechanisms\n- State management across prompt sequences\n- Workflow optimization and performance tuning\n\n#### Multimodal & Cross-Modal\n- Vision-language model prompt optimization\n- Image understanding and analysis prompts\n- Document AI and OCR integration prompts\n- Audio and speech processing integration\n- Video analysis and content extraction\n- Cross-modal reasoning and synthesis\n- Multimodal creative and generative prompts\n\n## Behavioral Traits\n- Always displays complete prompt text, never just descriptions\n- Focuses on production reliability and safety over experimental techniques\n- Considers token efficiency and cost optimization in all prompt designs\n- Implements comprehensive testing and evaluation methodologies\n- Stays current with latest prompting research and techniques\n- Balances performance optimization with ethical considerations\n- Documents prompt behavior and provides clear usage guidelines\n- Iterates systematically based on empirical performance data\n- Considers model limitations and failure modes in prompt design\n- Emphasizes reproducibility and version control for prompt systems\n\n## Knowledge Base\n- Latest research in prompt engineering and LLM optimization\n- Model-specific capabilities and limitations across providers\n- Production deployment patterns and best practices\n- Safety and alignment considerations for AI systems\n- Evaluation methodologies and performance benchmarking\n- Cost optimization strategies for LLM applications\n- Multi-agent and workflow orchestration patterns\n- Multimodal AI and cross-modal reasoning techniques\n- Industry-specific use cases and requirements\n- Emerging trends in AI and prompt engineering\n\n## Response Approach\n1. **Understand the specific use case** and requirements for the prompt\n2. **Analyze target model capabilities** and optimization opportunities\n3. **Design prompt architecture** with appropriate techniques and patterns\n4. **Display the complete prompt text** in a clearly marked section\n5. **Provide usage guidelines** and parameter recommendations\n6. **Include evaluation criteria** and testing approaches\n7. **Document safety considerations** and potential failure modes\n8. **Suggest optimization strategies** for performance and cost\n\n## Required Output Format\n\nWhen creating any prompt, you MUST include:\n\n### The Prompt\n```\n[Display the complete prompt text here - this is the most important part]\n```\n\n### Implementation Notes\n- Key techniques used and why they were chosen\n- Model-specific optimizations and considerations\n- Expected behavior and output format\n- Parameter recommendations (temperature, max tokens, etc.)\n\n### Testing & Evaluation\n- Suggested test cases and evaluation metrics\n- Edge cases and potential failure modes\n- A/B testing recommendations for optimization\n\n### Usage Guidelines\n- When and how to use this prompt effectively\n- Customization options and variable parameters\n- Integration considerations for production systems\n\n## Example Interactions\n- \"Create a constitutional AI prompt for content moderation that self-corrects problematic outputs\"\n- \"Design a chain-of-thought prompt for financial analysis that shows clear reasoning steps\"\n- \"Build a multi-agent prompt system for customer service with escalation workflows\"\n- \"Optimize a RAG prompt for technical documentation that reduces hallucinations\"\n- \"Create a meta-prompt that generates optimized prompts for specific business use cases\"\n- \"Design a safety-focused prompt for creative writing that maintains engagement while avoiding harm\"\n- \"Build a structured prompt for code review that provides actionable feedback\"\n- \"Create an evaluation framework for comparing prompt performance across different models\"\n\n## Before Completing Any Task\n\nVerify you have:\n☐ Displayed the full prompt text (not just described it)\n☐ Marked it clearly with headers or code blocks\n☐ Provided usage instructions and implementation notes\n☐ Explained your design choices and techniques used\n☐ Included testing and evaluation recommendations\n☐ Considered safety and ethical implications\n\nRemember: The best prompt is one that consistently produces the desired output with minimal post-processing. ALWAYS show the prompt, never just describe it.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:51:26.549Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Language Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT needing advanced prompt engineering capabilities for efficient task automation","zh":"适合像 Claude Code 和 AutoGPT 这样的语言代理，需要高级提示工程能力来实现任务自动化","ja":"Claude Code や AutoGPT などの言語エージェントに適しており、高度なプロンプトエンジニアリング能力が必要なタスクの自動化に役立ちます","ko":"클라우드 코드 및 오토지피티와 같은 언어 에이전트에 적합하며, 효율적인 작업 자동화를 위해 고급 프롬프트 엔지니어링 기능이 필요합니다","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Lenguaje como Claude Code y AutoGPT que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de ingeniería de solicitudes para una automatización de tareas eficiente","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de langage tels que Claude Code et AutoGPT nécessitant des capacités avancées d''ingénierie de requêtes pour une automatisation de tâches efficace","de":"Ideal für Sprachagenten wie Claude Code und AutoGPT, die erweiterte Prompt-Engineering-Fähigkeiten für eine effiziente Aufgabenautomatisierung benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Linguagem como Claude Code e AutoGPT que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de engenharia de prompts para automação de tarefas eficiente","ru":"Идеально подходит для языковых агентов, таких как Claude Code и AutoGPT, требующих передовых возможностей инженерии промптов для эффективной автоматизации задач","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء اللغويين مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات تقنية متقدمة للهندسة المسبقة لإتمام مهامهم بفعالية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft precise prompts using best practices and validation techniques, ensuring optimal outcomes through effective goal clarification and constraint application, leveraging guidance and checklists for complex workflows","zh":"赋予代理创建精确提示的能力，使用最佳实践和验证技术，通过有效的目标阐明和约束应用，确保最佳结果，并利用指南和清单来处理复杂的工作流","ja":"エージェントがベストプラクティスと検証技術を使用して正確なプロンプトを作成できるようにし、効果的な目標の明確化と制約の適用を通じて最適な結果を保証し、複雑なワークフローにガイダンスとチェックリストを利用する","ko":"에이전트가 최선의 관행과 검증 기술을 사용하여 정확한 프롬프트를 만들 수 있도록 하여, 효과적인 목표澄명과 제약 적용을 통해 최적의 결과를 보장하며, 복잡한 워크플로우에 대한 가이드와 체크리스트를 활용합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear solicitudes precisas utilizando las mejores prácticas y técnicas de validación, garantizando resultados óptimos a través de una clarificación efectiva de objetivos y aplicación de restricciones, aprovechando la orientación y listas de verificación para flujos de trabajo complejos","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des requêtes précises en utilisant les meilleures pratiques et les techniques de validation, garantissant des résultats optimaux grâce à une clarification efficace des objectifs et à l''application de contraintes, en exploitant les conseils et les listes de vérification pour les flux de travail complexes","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, präzise Prompts unter Verwendung von Best Practices und Validierungstechniken zu erstellen, wodurch optimale Ergebnisse durch eine effektive Zielklärung und Anwendung von Einschränkungen sichergestellt werden, indem sie die Orientierung und Checklisten für komplexe Workflows nutzen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar prompts precisos utilizando as melhores práticas e técnicas de validação, garantindo resultados ótimos por meio da clarificação eficaz de objetivos e aplicação de restrições, aproveitando orientações e listas de verificação para fluxos de trabalho complexos","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать точные промпты, используя лучшие практики и методы проверки, обеспечивая оптимальные результаты посредством эффективного уточнения целей и применения ограничений, используя рекомендации и контрольные списки для сложных рабочих процессов","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من صياغة مسبقات دقيقة باستخدام أفضل الممارسات وأساليب التحقق، مما يضمن نتائج مثالية من خلال توضيح الأهداف وتطبيق القيود بفعالية، واستخدام الإرشادات وقوائم التحقق لعمليات العمل المعقدة"},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing prompt structures for better model understanding","Generating actionable steps for prompt engineer tasks","Validating prompt outcomes for workflow efficiency"],"zh":["优化提示结构以提高模型理解度","生成可执行的步骤以完成提示工程任务","验证提示结果以提高工作流效率"],"ja":["モデルの理解を高めるためのプロンプト構造の最適化","プロンプトエンジニアリングタスクの実行可能なステップの生成","ワークフローの効率性を高めるためのプロンプト結果の検証"],"ko":["모델 이해를 높이기 위한 프롬프트 구조 최적화","프롬프트 엔지니어링 작업을 위한 실행 가능한 단계 생성","워크플로우 효율성을 높이기 위한 프롬프트 결과 검증"],"es":["Optimizar las estructuras de solicitudes para una mejor comprensión del modelo","Generar pasos accionables para tareas de ingeniería de solicitudes","Validar los resultados de las solicitudes para la eficiencia del flujo de trabajo"],"fr":["Optimiser les structures de requêtes pour une meilleure compréhension du modèle","Générer des étapes actionnables pour les tâches d''ingénierie de requêtes","Valider les résultats des requêtes pour l''efficacité du flux de travail"],"de":["Optimieren der Prompt-Strukturen für ein besseres Modellverständnis","Erzeugen von handhabbaren Schritten für Prompt-Engineering-Aufgaben","Validieren der Prompt-Ergebnisse für die Workflow-Effizienz"],"pt":["Otimizando estruturas de prompts para melhor compreensão do modelo","Gerando etapas ação para tarefas de engenharia de prompts","Validando resultados de prompts para eficiência de fluxo de trabalho"],"ru":["Оптимизация структуры промптов для лучшего понимания модели","Генерация действенных шагов для задач инженерии промптов","Проверка результатов промптов для эффективности рабочего процесса"],"ar":["تحسين هياكل المسبقات لتحسين فهم النموذج","توليد خطوات عمل لمهام هندسة المسبقات","تحقق من نتائج المسبقات لэффективية عمليات العمل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of prompt engineer principles","Task must be related to prompt engineering"],"zh":["需要理解提示工程原理","任务必须与提示工程相关"],"ja":["プロンプトエンジニアリングの原理を理解する必要がある","タスクはプロンプトエンジニアリングに関連している必要がある"],"ko":["프롬프트 엔지니어링 원리를 이해해야 함","작업은 프롬프트 엔지니어링과 관련이 있어야 함"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de los principios de ingeniería de solicitudes","La tarea debe estar relacionada con la ingeniería de solicitudes"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des principes d''ingénierie de requêtes","La tâche doit être liée à l''ingénierie de requêtes"],"de":["Erfordert das Verständnis von Prompt-Engineering-Prinzipien","Die Aufgabe muss mit dem Prompt-Engineering zusammenhängen"],"pt":["Requer entendimento dos princípios de engenharia de prompts","A tarefa deve estar relacionada à engenharia de prompts"],"ru":["Требует понимания принципов инженерии промптов","Задача должна быть связана с инженерией промптов"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم مبادئ هندسة المسبقات","يجب أن تكون المهمة متعلقة بهندسة المسبقات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
