"ko":"TypeScript 고급 타입은 강력하고 타입 안전한 애플리케이션을 구축하는 데 중요한 개념입니다. 이 가이드에서는 제네릭, 조건부 타입, 매핑 타입 등 고급 타입 시스템을 다룹니다","es":"Guía completa para dominar los tipos avanzados de TypeScript, incluyendo genéricos, tipos condicionales y más","fr":"Guide complet pour maîtriser les types avancés de TypeScript, y compris les génériques, les types conditionnels et plus","de":"Umfassendes Handbuch zur Beherrschung der erweiterten Typen von TypeScript, einschließlich Generika, bedingter Typen und mehr","pt":"Conheça os tipos avançados do TypeScript, incluindo generics, tipos condicionais e mapeados","ru":"Познакомьтесь с продвинутыми типами TypeScript, включая generics, условные типы и отображаемые типы","ar":"تعرف على الأنواع المتقدمة من TypeScript، بما في ذلك الجينيريكس والأنواع الشرطية والأنواع المapped","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["泛型","条件类型","映射类型","模板字面量类型","工具类型"],"ja":["ジェネリック","条件付きタイプ","マッピングタイプ","テンプレートリテラルタイプ","ユーティリティタイプ"],"ko":["제네릭","조건부 타입","매핑 타입","템플릿 리터럴 타입","유틸리티 타입"],"es":["Genéricos","Tipos condicionales","Tipos de mapeo","Tipos de plantilla de literal","Tipos de herramientas","Seguridad de tipos"],"fr":["Génériques","Types conditionnels","Types de mappage","Types de modèle de littéral","Types d''outils","Sécurité des types"],"de":["Generika","Bedingte Typen","Typen von Mappings","Typen von Vorlagenliterale","Typen von Werkzeugen","Typsicherheit"],"pt":["Generics","Tipos condicionais","Tipos mapeados","Template literal types","Tipos de ferramentas"],"ru":["Generics","Условные типы","Отображаемые типы","Шаблонные типы литералов","Типы инструментов"],"ar":["الجينيريكس","الأنواع الشرطية","الأنواع المapped","أنواع القوالب الحرفية","أنواع الأدوات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["TypeScript 高级类型","泛型","条件类型","映射类型","类型安全","应用程序开发"],"ja":["TypeScript 高級タイプ","ジェネリック","条件付きタイプ","マッピングタイプ","タイプセーフ","アプリケーション開発"],"ko":["TypeScript 고급 타입","제네릭","조건부 타입","매핑 타입","타입 안전","애플리케이션 개발"],"es":["typescript avanzado","tipos de datos","seguridad de tipos","genéricos","tipos condicionales","desarrollo de aplicaciones","programación segura","tipos de mapeo","tipos de plantilla de literal"],"fr":["typescript avancé","types de données","sécurité des types","génériques","types conditionnels","développement d''applications","programmation sécurisée","types de mappage","types de modèle de littéral"],"de":["erweitertes typescript","datentypen","typsicherheit","generika","bedingte typen","anwendungsentwicklung","sichere programmierung","typen von mappings","typen von vorlagenliterale"],"pt":["TypeScript avançado","Tipos avançados","Generics","Tipos condicionais","Desenvolvimento de aplicações","Segurança de tipos"],"ru":["Продвинутый TypeScript","Продвинутые типы","Generics","Условные типы","Разработка приложений","Безопасность типов"],"ar":["TypeScript متقدم","أنواع متقدمة","الجينيريكس","الأنواع الشرطية","تطوير التطبيقات","سلامة الأنواع"]}},"owner":"Loosand","repo":"next-forge","repoPath":"Loosand/next-forge","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.426Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"typescript-advanced-types","description":"掌握 TypeScript 高级类型系统，包括泛型、条件类型、映射类型、模板字面量类型和工具类型，用于构建类型安全的应用程序。在实现复杂类型逻辑、创建可复用类型工具或确保 TypeScript 项目的编译时类型安全时使用。","bodyPreview":"# TypeScript 高级类型\n\n全面掌握 TypeScript 高级类型系统的指南，包括泛型、条件类型、映射类型、模板字面量类型和工具类型，用于构建健壮、类型安全的应用程序。\n\n## 何时使用此技能\n\n- 构建类型安全的库或框架\n- 创建可复用的泛型组件\n- 实现复杂的类型推断逻辑\n- 设计类型安全的 API 客户端\n- 构建表单验证系统\n- 创建强类型配置对象\n- 实现类型安全的状态管理\n- 将 JavaScript 代码库迁移到 TypeScript\n\n## 核心概念\n\n### 1. 泛型\n\n**目的：** 创建可复用、类型灵活的组件，同时保持类型安全。\n\n**基础泛型函数：**\n\n```typescript\nfunction identity<T>(value: T): T {\n  return value;\n}\n\nconst num = identity<number>(42); // 类型: number\nconst str = identity<string>(\"hello\"); // 类型: string\nconst auto = identity(true); /","body":"# TypeScript 高级类型\n\n全面掌握 TypeScript 高级类型系统的指南，包括泛型、条件类型、映射类型、模板字面量类型和工具类型，用于构建健壮、类型安全的应用程序。\n\n## 何时使用此技能\n\n- 构建类型安全的库或框架\n- 创建可复用的泛型组件\n- 实现复杂的类型推断逻辑\n- 设计类型安全的 API 客户端\n- 构建表单验证系统\n- 创建强类型配置对象\n- 实现类型安全的状态管理\n- 将 JavaScript 代码库迁移到 TypeScript\n\n## 核心概念\n\n### 1. 泛型\n\n**目的：** 创建可复用、类型灵活的组件，同时保持类型安全。\n\n**基础泛型函数：**\n\n```typescript\nfunction identity<T>(value: T): T {\n  return value;\n}\n\nconst num = identity<number>(42); // 类型: number\nconst str = identity<string>(\"hello\"); // 类型: string\nconst auto = identity(true); // 类型推断: boolean\n```\n\n**泛型约束：**\n\n```typescript\ntype HasLength = {\n  length: number;\n};\n\nfunction logLength<T extends HasLength>(item: T): T {\n  console.log(item.length);\n  return item;\n}\n\nlogLength(\"hello\"); // OK: string 有 length 属性\nlogLength([1, 2, 3]); // OK: 数组有 length 属性\nlogLength({ length: 10 }); // OK: 对象有 length 属性\n// logLength(42);             // 错误: number 没有 length 属性\n```\n\n**多个类型参数：**\n\n```typescript\nfunction merge<T, U>(obj1: T, obj2: U): T & U {\n  return { ...obj1, ...obj2 };\n}\n\nconst merged = merge({ name: \"John\" }, { age: 30 });\n// 类型: { name: string } & { age: number }\n```\n\n### 2. 条件类型\n\n**目的：** 创建依赖于条件的类型，实现复杂的类型逻辑。\n\n**基础条件类型：**\n\n```typescript\ntype IsString<T> = T extends string ? true : false;\n\ntype A = IsString<string>; // true\ntype B = IsString<number>; // false\n```\n\n**提取返回类型：**\n\n```typescript\ntype ReturnType<T> = T extends (...args: any[]) => infer R ? R : never;\n\nfunction getUser() {\n  return { id: 1, name: \"John\" };\n}\n\ntype User = ReturnType<typeof getUser>;\n// 类型: { id: number; name: string; }\n```\n\n**分布式条件类型：**\n\n```typescript\ntype ToArray<T> = T extends any ? T[] : never;\n\ntype StrOrNumArray = ToArray<string | number>;\n// 类型: string[] | number[]\n```\n\n**嵌套条件：**\n\n```typescript\ntype TypeName<T> = T extends string\n  ? \"string\"\n  : T extends number\n    ? \"number\"\n    : T extends boolean\n      ? \"boolean\"\n      : T extends undefined\n        ? \"undefined\"\n        : T extends Function\n          ? \"function\"\n          : \"object\";\n\ntype T1 = TypeName<string>; // \"string\"\ntype T2 = TypeName<() => void>; // \"function\"\n```\n\n### 3. 映射类型\n\n**目的：** 通过遍历现有类型的属性来转换类型。\n\n**基础映射类型：**\n\n```typescript\ntype Readonly<T> = {\n  readonly [P in keyof T]: T[P];\n};\n\ntype User = {\n  id: number;\n  name: string;\n};\n\ntype ReadonlyUser = Readonly<User>;\n// 类型: { readonly id: number; readonly name: string; }\n```\n\n**可选属性：**\n\n```typescript\ntype Partial<T> = {\n  [P in keyof T]?: T[P];\n};\n\ntype PartialUser = Partial<User>;\n// 类型: { id?: number; name?: string; }\n```\n\n**键重映射：**\n\n```typescript\ntype Getters<T> = {\n  [K in keyof T as `get${Capitalize<string & K>}`]: () => T[K];\n};\n\ntype Person = {\n  name: string;\n  age: number;\n};\n\ntype PersonGetters = Getters<Person>;\n// 类型: { getName: () => string; getAge: () => number; }\n```\n\n**属性过滤：**\n\n```typescript\ntype PickByType<T, U> = {\n  [K in keyof T as T[K] extends U ? K : never]: T[K];\n};\n\ntype Mixed = {\n  id: number;\n  name: string;\n  age: number;\n  active: boolean;\n};\n\ntype OnlyNumbers = PickByType<Mixed, number>;\n// 类型: { id: number; age: number; }\n```\n\n### 4. 模板字面量类型\n\n**目的：** 创建具有模式匹配和转换功能的字符串类型。\n\n**基础模板字面量：**\n\n```typescript\ntype EventName = \"click\" | \"focus\" | \"blur\";\ntype EventHandler = `on${Capitalize<EventName>}`;\n// 类型: \"onClick\" | \"onFocus\" | \"onBlur\"\n```\n\n**字符串操作：**\n\n```typescript\ntype UppercaseGreeting = Uppercase<\"hello\">; // \"HELLO\"\ntype LowercaseGreeting = Lowercase<\"HELLO\">; // \"hello\"\ntype CapitalizedName = Capitalize<\"john\">; // \"John\"\ntype UncapitalizedName = Uncapitalize<\"John\">; // \"john\"\n```\n\n**路径构建：**\n\n```typescript\ntype Path<T> = T extends object\n  ? {\n      [K in keyof T]: K extends string ? `${K}` | `${K}.${Path<T[K]>}` : never;\n    }[keyof T]\n  : never;\n\ntype Config = {\n  server: {\n    host: string;\n    port: number;\n  };\n  database: {\n    url: string;\n  };\n};\n\ntype ConfigPath = Path<Config>;\n// 类型: \"server\" | \"database\" | \"server.host\" | \"server.port\" | \"database.url\"\n```\n\n### 5. 工具类型\n\n**内置工具类型：**\n\n```typescript\n// Partial<T> - 使所有属性可选\ntype PartialUser = Partial<User>;\n\n// Required<T> - 使所有属性必需\ntype RequiredUser = Required<PartialUser>;\n\n// Readonly<T> - 使所有属性只读\ntype ReadonlyUser = Readonly<User>;\n\n// Pick<T, K> - 选择特定属性\ntype UserName = Pick<User, \"name\" | \"email\">;\n\n// Omit<T, K> - 移除特定属性\ntype UserWithoutPassword = Omit<User, \"password\">;\n\n// Exclude<T, U> - 从联合类型中排除类型\ntype T1 = Exclude<\"a\" | \"b\" | \"c\", \"a\">; // \"b\" | \"c\"\n\n// Extract<T, U> - 从联合类型中提取类型\ntype T2 = Extract<\"a\" | \"b\" | \"c\", \"a\" | \"b\">; // \"a\" | \"b\"\n\n// NonNullable<T> - 排除 null 和 undefined\ntype T3 = NonNullable<string | null | undefined>; // string\n\n// Record<K, T> - 创建键为 K、值为 T 的对象类型\ntype PageInfo = Record<\"home\" | \"about\", { title: string }>;\n```\n\n## 高级模式\n\n### 模式 1：类型安全的事件发射器\n\n```typescript\ntype EventMap = {\n  \"user:created\": { id: string; name: string };\n  \"user:updated\": { id: string };\n  \"user:deleted\": { id: string };\n};\n\nclass TypedEventEmitter<T extends Record<string, any>> {\n  private listeners: {\n    [K in keyof T]?: Array<(data: T[K]) => void>;\n  } = {};\n\n  on<K extends keyof T>(event: K, callback: (data: T[K]) => void): void {\n    if (!this.listeners[event]) {\n      this.listeners[event] = [];\n    }\n    this.listeners[event]!.push(callback);\n  }\n\n  emit<K extends keyof T>(event: K, data: T[K]): void {\n    const callbacks = this.listeners[event];\n    if (callbacks) {\n      callbacks.forEach((callback) => callback(data));\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nconst emitter = new TypedEventEmitter<EventMap>();\n\nemitter.on(\"user:created\", (data) => {\n  console.log(data.id, data.name); // 类型安全！\n});\n\nemitter.emit(\"user:created\", { id: \"1\", name: \"John\" });\n// emitter.emit(\"user:created\", { id: \"1\" });  // 错误: 缺少 ''name''\n```\n\n### 模式 2：类型安全的 API 客户端\n\n```typescript\ntype HTTPMethod = \"GET\" | \"POST\" | \"PUT\" | \"DELETE\";\n\ntype EndpointConfig = {\n  \"/users\": {\n    GET: { response: User[] };\n    POST: { body: { name: string; email: string }; response: User };\n  };\n  \"/users/:id\": {\n    GET: { params: { id: string }; response: User };\n    PUT: { params: { id: string }; body: Partial<User>; response: User };\n    DELETE: { params: { id: string }; response: void };\n  };\n};\n\ntype ExtractParams<T> = T extends { params: infer P } ? P : never;\ntype ExtractBody<T> = T extends { body: infer B } ? B : never;\ntype ExtractResponse<T> = T extends { response: infer R } ? R : never;\n\nclass APIClient<Config extends Record<string, Record<HTTPMethod, any>>> {\n  async request<Path extends keyof Config, Method extends keyof Config[Path]>(\n    path: Path,\n    method: Method,\n    ...[options]: ExtractParams<Config[Path][Method]> extends never\n      ? ExtractBody<Config[Path][Method]> extends never\n        ? []\n        : [{ body: ExtractBody<Config[Path][Method]> }]\n      : [\n          {\n            params: ExtractParams<Config[Path][Method]>;\n            body?: ExtractBody<Config[Path][Method]>;\n          },\n        ]\n  ): Promise<ExtractResponse<Config[Path][Method]>> {\n    // 实现代码\n    return {} as any;\n  }\n}\n\nconst api = new APIClient<EndpointConfig>();\n\n// 类型安全的 API 调用\nconst users = await api.request(\"/users\", \"GET\");\n// 类型: User[]\n\nconst newUser = await api.request(\"/users\", \"POST\", {\n  body: { name: \"John\", email: \"john@example.com\" },\n});\n// 类型: User\n\nconst user = await api.request(\"/users/:id\", \"GET\", {\n  params: { id: \"123\" },\n});\n// 类型: User\n```\n\n### 模式 3：类型安全的建造者模式\n\n```typescript\ntype BuilderState<T> = {\n  [K in keyof T]: T[K] | undefined;\n};\n\ntype RequiredKeys<T> = {\n  [K in keyof T]-?: {} extends Pick<T, K> ? never : K;\n}[keyof T];\n\ntype OptionalKeys<T> = {\n  [K in keyof T]-?: {} extends Pick<T, K> ? K : never;\n}[keyof T];\n\ntype IsComplete<T, S> =\n  RequiredKeys<T> extends keyof S\n    ? S[RequiredKeys<T>] extends undefined\n      ? false\n      : true\n    : false;\n\nclass Builder<T, S extends BuilderState<T> = {}> {\n  private state: S = {} as S;\n\n  set<K extends keyof T>(key: K, value: T[K]): Builder<T, S & Record<K, T[K]>> {\n    this.state[key] = value;\n    return this as any;\n  }\n\n  build(this: IsComplete<T, S> extends true ? this : never): T {\n    return this.state as T;\n  }\n}\n\ntype User = {\n  id: string;\n  name: string;\n  email: string;\n  age?: number;\n};\n\nconst builder = new Builder<User>();\n\nconst user = builder\n  .set(\"id\", \"1\")\n  .set(\"name\", \"John\")\n  .set(\"email\", \"john@example.com\")\n  .build(); // OK: 所有必需字段已设置\n\n// const incomplete = builder\n//   .set(\"id\", \"1\")\n//   .build();  // 错误: 缺少必需字段\n```\n\n### 模式 4：深度只读/可选\n\n```typescript\ntype DeepReadonly<T> = {\n  readonly [P in keyof T]: T[P] extends object\n    ? T[P] extends Function\n      ? T[P]\n      : DeepReadonly<T[P]>\n    : T[P];\n};\n\ntype DeepPartial<T> = {\n  [P in keyof T]?: T[P] extends object\n    ? T[P] extends Array<infer U>\n      ? Array<DeepPartial<U>>\n      : DeepPartial<T[P]>\n    : T[P];\n};\n\ntype Config = {\n  server: {\n    host: string;\n    port: number;\n    ssl: {\n      enabled: boolean;\n      cert: string;\n    };\n  };\n  database: {\n    url: string;\n    pool: {\n      min: number;\n      max: number;\n    };\n  };\n};\n\ntype ReadonlyConfig = DeepReadonly<Config>;\n// 所有嵌套属性都是只读的\n\ntype PartialConfig = DeepPartial<Config>;\n// 所有嵌套属性都是可选的\n```\n\n### 模式 5：类型安全的表单验证\n\n```typescript\ntype ValidationRule<T> = {\n  validate: (value: T) => boolean;\n  message: string;\n};\n\ntype FieldValidation<T> = {\n  [K in keyof T]?: ValidationRule<T[K]>[];\n};\n\ntype ValidationErrors<T> = {\n  [K in keyof T]?: string[];\n};\n\nclass FormValidator<T extends Record<string, any>> {\n  constructor(private rules: FieldValidation<T>) {}\n\n  validate(data: T): ValidationErrors<T> | null {\n    const errors: ValidationErrors<T> = {};\n    let hasErrors = false;\n\n    for (const key in this.rules) {\n      const fieldRules = this.rules[key];\n      const value = data[key];\n\n      if (fieldRules) {\n        const fieldErrors: string[] = [];\n\n        for (const rule of fieldRules) {\n          if (!rule.validate(value)) {\n            fieldErrors.push(rule.message);\n          }\n        }\n\n        if (fieldErrors.length > 0) {\n          errors[key] = fieldErrors;\n          hasErrors = true;\n        }\n      }\n    }\n\n    return hasErrors ? errors : null;\n  }\n}\n\ntype LoginForm = {\n  email: string;\n  password: string;\n};\n\nconst validator = new FormValidator<LoginForm>({\n  email: [\n    {\n      validate: (v) => v.includes(\"@\"),\n      message: \"邮箱必须包含 @\",\n    },\n    {\n      validate: (v) => v.length > 0,\n      message: \"邮箱为必填项\",\n    },\n  ],\n  password: [\n    {\n      validate: (v) => v.length >= 8,\n      message: \"密码至少需要 8 个字符\",\n    },\n  ],\n});\n\nconst errors = validator.validate({\n  email: \"invalid\",\n  password: \"short\",\n});\n// 类型: { email?: string[]; password?: string[]; } | null\n```\n\n### 模式 6：可辨识联合\n\n```typescript\ntype Success<T> = {\n  status: \"success\";\n  data: T;\n};\n\ntype Error = {\n  status: \"error\";\n  error: string;\n};\n\ntype Loading = {\n  status: \"loading\";\n};\n\ntype AsyncState<T> = Success<T> | Error | Loading;\n\nfunction handleState<T>(state: AsyncState<T>): void {\n  switch (state.status) {\n    case \"success\":\n      console.log(state.data); // 类型: T\n      break;\n    case \"error\":\n      console.log(state.error); // 类型: string\n      break;\n    case \"loading\":\n      console.log(\"加载中...\");\n      break;\n  }\n}\n\n// 类型安全的状态机\ntype State =\n  | { type: \"idle\" }\n  | { type: \"fetching\"; requestId: string }\n  | { type: \"success\"; data: any }\n  | { type: \"error\"; error: Error };\n\ntype Event =\n  | { type: \"FETCH\"; requestId: string }\n  | { type: \"SUCCESS\"; data: any }\n  | { type: \"ERROR\"; error: Error }\n  | { type: \"RESET\" };\n\nfunction reducer(state: State, event: Event): State {\n  switch (state.type) {\n    case \"idle\":\n      return event.type === \"FETCH\"\n        ? { type: \"fetching\", requestId: event.requestId }\n        : state;\n    case \"fetching\":\n      if (event.type === \"SUCCESS\") {\n        return { type: \"success\", data: event.data };\n      }\n      if (event.type === \"ERROR\") {\n        return { type: \"error\", error: event.error };\n      }\n      return state;\n    case \"success\":\n    case \"error\":\n      return event.type === \"RESET\" ? { type: \"idle\" } : state;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## 类型推断技术\n\n### 1. infer 关键字\n\n```typescript\n// 提取数组元素类型\ntype ElementType<T> = T extends (infer U)[] ? U : never;\n\ntype NumArray = number[];\ntype Num = ElementType<NumArray>; // number\n\n// 提取 Promise 类型\ntype PromiseType<T> = T extends Promise<infer U> ? U : never;\n\ntype AsyncNum = PromiseType<Promise<number>>; // number\n\n// 提取函数参数\ntype Parameters<T> = T extends (...args: infer P) => any ? P : never;\n\nfunction foo(a: string, b: number) {}\ntype FooParams = Parameters<typeof foo>; // [string, number]\n```\n\n### 2. 类型守卫\n\n```typescript\nfunction isString(value: unknown): value is string {\n  return typeof value === \"string\";\n}\n\nfunction isArrayOf<T>(\n  value: unknown,\n  guard: (item: unknown) => item is T,\n): value is T[] {\n  return Array.isArray(value) && value.every(guard);\n}\n\nconst data: unknown = [\"a\", \"b\", \"c\"];\n\nif (isArrayOf(data, isString)) {\n  data.forEach((s) => s.toUpperCase()); // 类型: string[]\n}\n```\n\n### 3. 断言函数\n\n```typescript\nfunction assertIsString(value: unknown): asserts value is string {\n  if (typeof value !== \"string\") {\n    throw new Error(\"不是字符串\");\n  }\n}\n\nfunction processValue(value: unknown) {\n  assertIsString(value);\n  // value 现在被类型化为 string\n  console.log(value.toUpperCase());\n}\n```\n\n## 最佳实践\n\n1. **使用 `unknown` 而非 `any`**：强制进行类型检查\n2. **统一使用 `type` 定义类型**：语法一致，支持联合、交叉、映射等所有类型操作\n3. **善用类型别名**：提高代码可读性\n4. **利用类型推断**：让 TypeScript 在可能时自动推断\n5. **创建辅助类型**：构建可复用的类型工具\n6. **使用 const 断言**：保留字面量类型\n7. **避免类型断言**：使用类型守卫代替\n8. **为复杂类型添加文档**：添加 JSDoc 注释\n9. **使用严格模式**：启用所有严格编译器选项\n10. **测试你的类型**：使用类型测试验证类型行为\n\n## 类型测试\n\n```typescript\n// 类型断言测试\ntype AssertEqual<T, U> = [T] extends [U]\n  ? [U] extends [T]\n    ? true\n    : false\n  : false;\n\ntype Test1 = AssertEqual<string, string>; // true\ntype Test2 = AssertEqual<string, number>; // false\ntype Test3 = AssertEqual<string | number, string>; // false\n\n// 期望错误辅助类型\ntype ExpectError<T extends never> = T;\n\n// 使用示例\ntype ShouldError = ExpectError<AssertEqual<string, number>>;\n```\n\n## 常见陷阱\n\n1. **过度使用 `any`**：违背了 TypeScript 的目的\n2. **忽略严格空值检查**：可能导致运行时错误\n3. **类型过于复杂**：可能拖慢编译速度\n4. **不使用可辨识联合**：错失类型收窄的机会\n5. **忘记 readonly 修饰符**：允许意外的修改\n6. **循环类型引用**：可能导致编译器错误\n7. **未处理边界情况**：如空数组或 null 值\n\n## 性能考虑\n\n- 避免深度嵌套的条件类型\n- 尽可能使用简单类型\n- 缓存复杂的类型计算\n- 限制递归类型的递归深度\n- 在生产环境使用构建工具跳过类型检查\n\n## 资源\n\n- **TypeScript 手册**：https://www.typescriptlang.org/docs/handbook/\n- **Type Challenges**：https://github.com/type-challenges/type-challenges\n- **TypeScript Deep Dive**：https://basarat.gitbook.io/typescript/\n- **Effective TypeScript**：Dan Vanderkam 著\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:51:16.379Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Generation Agents needing advanced TypeScript type safety and flexibility.","zh":"非常适合需要高级TypeScript类型安全和灵活性的代码生成代理。","ja":"高度なTypeScriptの型安全性と柔軟性が必要なコード生成エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 TypeScript 유형 안전성과 유연성이 필요한 코드 생성 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de generación de código que necesitan seguridad y flexibilidad de tipos avanzados de TypeScript.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de génération de code nécessitant une sécurité et une flexibilité de types avancés de TypeScript.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Generierungsagenten, die erweiterte TypeScript-Typensicherheit und Flexibilität benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Geração de Código que necessitam de segurança e flexibilidade de tipo avançadas do TypeScript.","ru":"Идеально п