dung"],"pt":["Postagem de texto, imagens, vídeos e artigos longos","Uso de navegador Chrome real para contornar detecção anti-bot","Scripts localizados em subdiretório scripts/","Suporte a execução de scripts via terminal","Flexibilidade para personalizar o conteúdo publicado"],"ru":["Публикация текста, изображений, видео и длинных статей","Использование реального браузера Chrome для обхода анти-бот обнаружения","Скрипты расположены в подкаталоге scripts/","Поддержка выполнения скриптов через терминал","Гибкость для настройки публикуемого контента"],"ar":["نشر النصوص والصور والفيديوهات والمقالات الطويلة","استخدام متصفح Chrome الحقيقي لتجاوز الكشف المضاد للبرامج النصية","السكريبتات موجودة في المجلد الفرعي scripts/","دعم تنفيذ السكريبتات عبر الطرفية","المرونة لتعديل المحتوى المنشور"]},"keywords":{"zh":["baoyu-post-to-x","Twitter","Chrome","anti-bot","text","images","videos","SEO"],"ja":["baoyu-post-to-x","Twitter","Chrome","anti-bot","text","images","videos","SEO"],"ko":["baoyu-post-to-x","Twitter","Chrome","anti-bot","text","images","videos","SEO"],"es":["publicar en X","baoyu-post-to-x","navegador Chrome real","detección de bots","contenido dinámico","scripts de ejecución"],"fr":["publier sur X","baoyu-post-to-x","navigateur Chrome réel","détection des bots","contenu dynamique","exécution de scripts"],"de":["veröffentlichen auf X","baoyu-post-to-x","echter Chrome-Browser","Bot-Erkennung","dynamischer Inhalt","Skriptausführung"],"pt":["baoyu-post-to-x","postagem no X","navegador Chrome real","detecção anti-bot","scripts em TypeScript","publicação de conteúdo","desenvolvimento de habilidades"],"ru":["baoyu-post-to-x","публикация в X","реальный браузер Chrome","анти-бот обнаружение","скрипты на TypeScript","публикация контента","разработка навыков"],"ar":["baoyu-post-to-x","نشر على X","متصفح Chrome الحقيقي","الكشف المضاد للبرامج النصية","السكريبتات بلغة TypeScript","نشر المحتوى","تطوير المهارات"]}},"owner":"lisposter","repo":"creator","repoPath":"lisposter/creator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.426Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"baoyu-post-to-x","description":"Posts content and articles to X (Twitter). Supports regular posts with images/videos and X Articles (long-form Markdown). Uses real Chrome with CDP to bypass anti-automation. Use when user asks to post to X, tweet, publish to Twitter, or share on X.","bodyPreview":"# Post to X (Twitter)\n\nPosts text, images, videos, and long-form articles to X via real Chrome browser (bypasses anti-bot detection).\n\n## Script Directory\n\n**Important**: All scripts are located in the `scripts/` subdirectory of this skill.\n\n**Agent Execution Instructions**:\n1. Determine this SKILL.md file''s directory path as `SKILL_DIR`\n2. Script path = `${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/<script-name>.ts`\n3. Replace all `${SKILL_DIR}` in this document with the actual path\n\n**Script Reference**:\n| Script | P","body":"# Post to X (Twitter)\n\nPosts text, images, videos, and long-form articles to X via real Chrome browser (bypasses anti-bot detection).\n\n## Script Directory\n\n**Important**: All scripts are located in the `scripts/` subdirectory of this skill.\n\n**Agent Execution Instructions**:\n1. Determine this SKILL.md file''s directory path as `SKILL_DIR`\n2. Script path = `${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/<script-name>.ts`\n3. Replace all `${SKILL_DIR}` in this document with the actual path\n\n**Script Reference**:\n| Script | Purpose |\n|--------|---------|\n| `scripts/x-browser.ts` | Regular posts (text + images) |\n| `scripts/x-video.ts` | Video posts (text + video) |\n| `scripts/x-quote.ts` | Quote tweet with comment |\n| `scripts/x-article.ts` | Long-form article publishing (Markdown) |\n| `scripts/md-to-html.ts` | Markdown → HTML conversion |\n| `scripts/copy-to-clipboard.ts` | Copy content to clipboard |\n| `scripts/paste-from-clipboard.ts` | Send real paste keystroke |\n\n## Preferences (EXTEND.md)\n\nUse Bash to check EXTEND.md existence (priority order):\n\n```bash\n# Check project-level first\ntest -f .baoyu-skills/baoyu-post-to-x/EXTEND.md && echo \"project\"\n\n# Then user-level (cross-platform: $HOME works on macOS/Linux/WSL)\ntest -f \"$HOME/.baoyu-skills/baoyu-post-to-x/EXTEND.md\" && echo \"user\"\n```\n\n┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────┬───────────────────┐\n│                       Path                       │     Location      │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────┤\n│ .baoyu-skills/baoyu-post-to-x/EXTEND.md          │ Project directory │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────┤\n│ $HOME/.baoyu-skills/baoyu-post-to-x/EXTEND.md    │ User home         │\n└──────────────────────────────────────────────────┴───────────────────┘\n\n┌───────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  Result   │                                  Action                                   │\n├───────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Found     │ Read, parse, apply settings                                               │\n├───────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Not found │ Use defaults                                                              │\n└───────────┴───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n**EXTEND.md Supports**: Default Chrome profile | Auto-submit preference\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Google Chrome or Chromium\n- `bun` runtime\n- First run: log in to X manually (session saved)\n\n## References\n\n- **Regular Posts**: See `references/regular-posts.md` for manual workflow, troubleshooting, and technical details\n- **X Articles**: See `references/articles.md` for long-form article publishing guide\n\n---\n\n## Regular Posts\n\nText + up to 4 images.\n\n```bash\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-browser.ts \"Hello!\" --image ./photo.png          # Preview\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-browser.ts \"Hello!\" --image ./photo.png --submit  # Post\n```\n\n**Parameters**:\n| Parameter | Description |\n|-----------|-------------|\n| `<text>` | Post content (positional) |\n| `--image <path>` | Image file (repeatable, max 4) |\n| `--submit` | Post (default: preview) |\n| `--profile <dir>` | Custom Chrome profile |\n\n---\n\n## Video Posts\n\nText + video file.\n\n```bash\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-video.ts \"Check this out!\" --video ./clip.mp4          # Preview\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-video.ts \"Amazing content\" --video ./demo.mp4 --submit  # Post\n```\n\n**Parameters**:\n| Parameter | Description |\n|-----------|-------------|\n| `<text>` | Post content (positional) |\n| `--video <path>` | Video file (MP4, MOV, WebM) |\n| `--submit` | Post (default: preview) |\n| `--profile <dir>` | Custom Chrome profile |\n\n**Limits**: Regular 140s max, Premium 60min. Processing: 30-60s.\n\n---\n\n## Quote Tweets\n\nQuote an existing tweet with comment.\n\n```bash\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-quote.ts https://x.com/user/status/123 \"Great insight!\"          # Preview\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-quote.ts https://x.com/user/status/123 \"I agree!\" --submit       # Post\n```\n\n**Parameters**:\n| Parameter | Description |\n|-----------|-------------|\n| `<tweet-url>` | URL to quote (positional) |\n| `<comment>` | Comment text (positional, optional) |\n| `--submit` | Post (default: preview) |\n| `--profile <dir>` | Custom Chrome profile |\n\n---\n\n## X Articles\n\nLong-form Markdown articles (requires X Premium).\n\n```bash\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-article.ts article.md                        # Preview\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-article.ts article.md --cover ./cover.jpg    # With cover\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-article.ts article.md --submit               # Publish\n```\n\n**Parameters**:\n| Parameter | Description |\n|-----------|-------------|\n| `<markdown>` | Markdown file (positional) |\n| `--cover <path>` | Cover image |\n| `--title <text>` | Override title |\n| `--submit` | Publish (default: preview) |\n\n**Frontmatter**: `title`, `cover_image` supported in YAML front matter.\n\n---\n\n## Notes\n\n- First run: manual login required (session persists)\n- Always preview before `--submit`\n- Cross-platform: macOS, Linux, Windows\n\n## Extension Support\n\nCustom configurations via EXTEND.md. See **Preferences** section for paths and supported options.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:51:36.285Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Social Media Agents requiring automated posting capabilities to Twitter via a real Chrome browser, bypassing anti-bot detection.","zh":"适用于需要通过真实Chrome浏览器自动在Twitter上发布帖子的社交媒体代理，能够绕过反 bot 检测。","ja":"Twitterへの自動投稿機能を必要とするソーシャルメディアエージェントに適しています。実際のChromeブラウザを使用して反ボット検出を回避します。","ko":"트위터에 자동으로 게시하는 기능이 필요한 소셜 미디어 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 실제 크롬 브라우저를 사용하여 반자동 탐지를 우회합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Medios Sociales que requieren capacidades de publicación automatizada en Twitter a través de un navegador Chrome real, evitando la detección anti-bot.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de médias sociaux nécessitant des capacités de publication automatisée sur Twitter via un navigateur Chrome réel, contournant la détection anti-bot.","de":"Ideal für Social-Media-Agents, die automatisierte Postfunktionen auf Twitter über einen echten Chrome-Browser benötigen, um die Anti-Bot-Erkennung zu umgehen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Mídia Social que exigem capacidades de postagem automatizada para o Twitter via um navegador Chrome real, contornando a detecção anti-bot.","ru":"Идеально для социальных медиа-агентов, требующих автоматизированных возможностей публикации в Twitter через реальный браузер Chrome, обходя обнаружение анти-ботов.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء وسائل الإعلام الاجتماعية الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات منشورات آليّة على تويتر عبر متصفح كروم حقيقي ، وتجاوز كشف البرامج الضارة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to post diverse content types, including text, images, videos, and long-form articles to Twitter, leveraging a real Chrome browser to evade anti-bot measures, utilizing TypeScript scripts for execution.","zh":"赋予代理发布多种类型内容的能力，包括文本、图像、视频和长篇文章到Twitter，利用实际的Chrome浏览器来规避反 bot 措施，使用TypeScript脚本执行。","ja":"エージェントがテキスト、画像、動画、長文記事などのさまざまなコンテンツタイプをTwitterに投稿できるようにします。実際のChromeブラウザを使用して反ボット対策を回避し、TypeScriptスクリプトを使用して実行します。","ko":"에이전트가 텍스트, 이미지, 비디오 및 장문 기사를 트위터에 게시할 수 있는 기능을 제공합니다. 실제 크롬 브라우저를 사용하여 반자동 대책을 우회하고 TypeScript 스크립트를 사용하여 실행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a publicar diversos tipos de contenido, incluyendo texto, imágenes, videos y artículos de larga extensión en Twitter, aprovechando un navegador Chrome real para evadir las medidas anti-bot, utilizando scripts de TypeScript para la ejecución.","fr":"Permet aux agents de publier divers types de contenu, notamment du texte, des images, des vidéos et des articles de longue forme sur Twitter, en utilisant un navigateur Chrome réel pour éviter les mesures anti-bot, en exploitant des scripts TypeScript pour l''exécution.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, verschiedene Inhaltsarten zu posten, einschließlich Text, Bilder, Videos und langen Artikeln auf Twitter, indem sie einen echten Chrome-Browser nutzen, um Anti-Bot-Maßnahmen zu umgehen, und TypeScript-Skripte für die Ausführung verwenden.","pt":"Habilita agentes a postar diferentes tipos de conteúdo, incluindo texto, imagens, vídeos e artigos de longa forma no Twitter, utilizando um navegador Chrome real para evitar medidas anti-bot, utilizando scripts TypeScript para execução.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью публиковать разные типы контента, включая текст, изображения, видео и длинные статьи в Twitter, используя реальный браузер Chrome для обхода анти-бот мер, используя скрипты TypeScript для выполнения.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على نشر أنواع مختلفة من المحتوى ، بما في ذلك النصوص والصور والفيديوهات والمقالات الطويلة على تويتر ، باستخدام متصفح كروم حقيقي لتجاوز إجراءات مكافحة البرامج الض