EO","Creación de contenido para blogs y redes sociales","Planificación de contenido","Estrategia de marketing de contenido"],"fr":["Analyse de la voix de marque","Optimisation du SEO","Création de contenu pour les blogs et les réseaux sociaux","Planification de contenu","Stratégie de marketing de contenu"],"de":["Analyse der Markenstimme","SEO-Optimierung","Erstellung von Inhalt für Blogs und soziale Medien","Inhaltsplanung","Content-Marketing-Strategie"],"pt":["Análise de voz de marca profissional","Otimização de SEO para conteúdo","Estruturas de conteúdo personalizadas para plataformas","Desenvolvimento de estratégia de conteúdo eficaz","Criação de calendário de conteúdo personalizado","Otimização de conteúdo para redes sociais"],"ru":["Профессиональный анализ бренд-голоса","Оптимизация SEO для контента","Платформенно-специфичные контент-фреймворки","Разработка эффективной стратегии контента","Создание персонализированного контент-календаря","Оптимизация контента для социальных сетей"],"ar":["تحليل صوت العلامة التجارية الاحترافي","تحسين محرك البحث للconteúdo","أطر محتوى مخصصة للمنصات","تطوير استراتيجية محتوى فعالة","إنشاء تقويم محتوى مخصص","تحسين المحتوى لشبكات التواصل الاجتماعي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["内容创作者","品牌声音分析","SEO优化","内容营销","社交媒体营销","内容策略","内容日历","平台特定内容"],"ja":["コンテンツクリエーター","ブランドボイス分析","SEO最適化","コンテンツマーケティング","ソーシャルメディアマーケティング","コンテンツ戦略","コンテンツカレンダー","プラットフォーム特有のコンテンツ"],"ko":["콘텐츠 크리에이터","브랜드 보이스 분석","SEO 최적화","콘텐츠 마케팅","소셜미디어 마케팅","콘텐츠 전략","콘텐츠 캘린더","플랫폼 특정 콘텐츠"],"es":["creador de contenido","análisis de voz de marca","optimización de SEO","contenido de alta calidad","marketing de contenido","estrategia de marketing"],"fr":["créateur de contenu","analyse de la voix de marque","optimisation du SEO","contenu de haute qualité","marketing de contenu","stratégie de marketing"],"de":["Content Creator","Markenstimmenanalyse","SEO-Optimierung","hochwertiger Inhalt","Content-Marketing","Marketingstrategie"],"pt":["criação de conteúdo","otimização de SEO","voz de marca","redes sociais","calendário de conteúdo","estratégia de conteúdo","conteúdo de marca","otimização de conteúdo"],"ru":["создание контента","оптимизация SEO","бренд-голос","социальные сети","контент-календарь","стратегия контента","бренд-контент","оптимизация контента"],"ar":["إنشاء المحتوى","تحسين محرك البحث","صوت العلامة التجارية","شبكات التواصل الاجتماعي","تقويم المحتوى","استراتيجية المحتوى","محتوى العلامة التجارية","تحسين المحتوى"]}},"owner":"isdaniel","repo":"MyBlog","repoPath":"isdaniel/MyBlog","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.426Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"content-creator","description":"Create SEO-optimized marketing content with consistent brand voice. Includes brand voice analyzer, SEO optimizer, content frameworks, and social media templates. Use when writing blog posts, creating social media content, analyzing brand voice, optimizing SEO, planning content calendars, or when user mentions content creation, brand voice, SEO optimization, social media marketing, or content strategy.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Content Creator\n\nProfessional-grade brand voice analysis, SEO optimization, and platform-specific content frameworks.\n\n## Keywords\ncontent creation, blog posts, SEO, brand voice, social media, content calendar, marketing content, content strategy, content marketing, brand consistency, content optimization, social media marketing, content planning, blog writing, content frameworks, brand guidelines, social media strategy\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### For Brand Voice Development\n1. Run `scripts/brand_voi","body":"# Content Creator\n\nProfessional-grade brand voice analysis, SEO optimization, and platform-specific content frameworks.\n\n## Keywords\ncontent creation, blog posts, SEO, brand voice, social media, content calendar, marketing content, content strategy, content marketing, brand consistency, content optimization, social media marketing, content planning, blog writing, content frameworks, brand guidelines, social media strategy\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### For Brand Voice Development\n1. Run `scripts/brand_voice_analyzer.py` on existing content to establish baseline\n2. Review `references/brand_guidelines.md` to select voice attributes\n3. Apply chosen voice consistently across all content\n\n### For Blog Content Creation\n1. Choose template from `references/content_frameworks.md`\n2. Research keywords for topic\n3. Write content following template structure\n4. Run `scripts/seo_optimizer.py [file] [primary-keyword]` to optimize\n5. Apply recommendations before publishing\n\n### For Social Media Content\n1. Review platform best practices in `references/social_media_optimization.md`\n2. Use appropriate template from `references/content_frameworks.md`\n3. Optimize based on platform-specific guidelines\n4. Schedule using `assets/content_calendar_template.md`\n\n## Core Workflows\n\n### Establishing Brand Voice (First Time Setup)\n\nWhen creating content for a new brand or client:\n\n1. **Analyze Existing Content** (if available)\n   ```bash\n   python scripts/brand_voice_analyzer.py existing_content.txt\n   ```\n   \n2. **Define Voice Attributes**\n   - Review brand personality archetypes in `references/brand_guidelines.md`\n   - Select primary and secondary archetypes\n   - Choose 3-5 tone attributes\n   - Document in brand guidelines\n\n3. **Create Voice Sample**\n   - Write 3 sample pieces in chosen voice\n   - Test consistency using analyzer\n   - Refine based on results\n\n### Creating SEO-Optimized Blog Posts\n\n1. **Keyword Research**\n   - Identify primary keyword (search volume 500-5000/month)\n   - Find 3-5 secondary keywords\n   - List 10-15 LSI keywords\n\n2. **Content Structure**\n   - Use blog template from `references/content_frameworks.md`\n   - Include keyword in title, first paragraph, and 2-3 H2s\n   - Aim for 1,500-2,500 words for comprehensive coverage\n\n3. **Optimization Check**\n   ```bash\n   python scripts/seo_optimizer.py blog_post.md \"primary keyword\" \"secondary,keywords,list\"\n   ```\n\n4. **Apply SEO Recommendations**\n   - Adjust keyword density to 1-3%\n   - Ensure proper heading structure\n   - Add internal and external links\n   - Optimize meta description\n\n### Social Media Content Creation\n\n1. **Platform Selection**\n   - Identify primary platforms based on audience\n   - Review platform-specific guidelines in `references/social_media_optimization.md`\n\n2. **Content Adaptation**\n   - Start with blog post or core message\n   - Use repurposing matrix from `references/content_frameworks.md`\n   - Adapt for each platform following templates\n\n3. **Optimization Checklist**\n   - Platform-appropriate length\n   - Optimal posting time\n   - Correct image dimensions\n   - Platform-specific hashtags\n   - Engagement elements (polls, questions)\n\n### Content Calendar Planning\n\n1. **Monthly Planning**\n   - Copy `assets/content_calendar_template.md`\n   - Set monthly goals and KPIs\n   - Identify key campaigns/themes\n\n2. **Weekly Distribution**\n   - Follow 40/25/25/10 content pillar ratio\n   - Balance platforms throughout week\n   - Align with optimal posting times\n\n3. **Batch Creation**\n   - Create all weekly content in one session\n   - Maintain consistent voice across pieces\n   - Prepare all visual assets together\n\n## Key Scripts\n\n### brand_voice_analyzer.py\nAnalyzes text content for voice characteristics, readability, and consistency.\n\n**Usage**: `python scripts/brand_voice_analyzer.py <file> [json|text]`\n\n**Returns**:\n- Voice profile (formality, tone, perspective)\n- Readability score\n- Sentence structure analysis\n- Improvement recommendations\n\n### seo_optimizer.py\nAnalyzes content for SEO optimization and provides actionable recommendations.\n\n**Usage**: `python scripts/seo_optimizer.py <file> [primary_keyword] [secondary_keywords]`\n\n**Returns**:\n- SEO score (0-100)\n- Keyword density analysis\n- Structure assessment\n- Meta tag suggestions\n- Specific optimization recommendations\n\n## Reference Guides\n\n### When to Use Each Reference\n\n**references/brand_guidelines.md**\n- Setting up new brand voice\n- Ensuring consistency across content\n- Training new team members\n- Resolving voice/tone questions\n\n**references/content_frameworks.md**\n- Starting any new content piece\n- Structuring different content types\n- Creating content templates\n- Planning content repurposing\n\n**references/social_media_optimization.md**\n- Platform-specific optimization\n- Hashtag strategy development\n- Understanding algorithm factors\n- Setting up analytics tracking\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Content Creation Process\n1. Always start with audience need/pain point\n2. Research before writing\n3. Create outline using templates\n4. Write first draft without editing\n5. Optimize for SEO\n6. Edit for brand voice\n7. Proofread and fact-check\n8. Optimize for platform\n9. Schedule strategically\n\n### Quality Indicators\n- SEO score above 75/100\n- Readability appropriate for audience\n- Consistent brand voice throughout\n- Clear value proposition\n- Actionable takeaways\n- Proper visual formatting\n- Platform-optimized\n\n### Common Pitfalls to Avoid\n- Writing before researching keywords\n- Ignoring platform-specific requirements\n- Inconsistent brand voice\n- Over-optimizing for SEO (keyword stuffing)\n- Missing clear CTAs\n- Publishing without proofreading\n- Ignoring analytics feedback\n\n## Performance Metrics\n\nTrack these KPIs for content success:\n\n### Content Metrics\n- Organic traffic growth\n- Average time on page\n- Bounce rate\n- Social shares\n- Backlinks earned\n\n### Engagement Metrics\n- Comments and discussions\n- Email click-through rates\n- Social media engagement rate\n- Content downloads\n- Form submissions\n\n### Business Metrics\n- Leads generated\n- Conversion rate\n- Customer acquisition cost\n- Revenue attribution\n- ROI per content piece\n\n## Integration Points\n\nThis skill works best with:\n- Analytics platforms (Google Analytics, social media insights)\n- SEO tools (for keyword research)\n- Design tools (for visual content)\n- Scheduling platforms (for content distribution)\n- Email marketing systems (for newsletter content)\n\n## Quick Commands\n\n```bash\n# Analyze brand voice\npython scripts/brand_voice_analyzer.py content.txt\n\n# Optimize for SEO\npython scripts/seo_optimizer.py article.md \"main keyword\"\n\n# Check content against brand guidelines\ngrep -f references/brand_guidelines.md content.txt\n\n# Create monthly calendar\ncp assets/content_calendar_template.md this_month_calendar.md\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:51:22.043Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT seeking to enhance their content generation capabilities with professional-grade brand voice analysis and SEO optimization.","zh":"适用于Claude Code和AutoGPT等AI代理，旨在通过专业级品牌声音分析和SEO优化来增强其内容生成能力。","ja":"Claude CodeやAutoGPTなどのAIエージェントに適しており、プロフェッショナルグレードのブランド音声分析とSEO最適化によってコンテンツ生成機能を強化する。","ko":"Claude Code와 AutoGPT 같은 AI 에이전트에게 적합하며, 전문가급 브랜드 음성 분석과 SEO 최적화를 통해 콘텐츠 생성 기능을 강화하는 데 도움이 됩니다.","es":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT seeking to enhance their content generation capabilities with professional-grade brand voice analysis and SEO optimization.","fr":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT seeking to enhance their content generation capabilities with professional-grade brand voice analysis and SEO optimization.","de":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT seeking to enhance their content generation capabilities with professional-grade brand voice analysis and SEO optimization.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude Code e AutoGPT que buscam aprimorar suas capacidades de geração de conteúdo com análise de voz de marca profissional e otimização de SEO.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code и AutoGPT, стремящихся улучшить свои возможности генерации контента с помощью профессионального анализа бренд-голоса и оптимизации SEO.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الإصطناعي مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT التي تسعى إلى تعزيز قدراتها في توليد المحتوى مع تحليل صوت العلامة التجارية من الدرجة المهنية وضبط جودة تحسين محركات البحث."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft engaging content using platform-specific frameworks, ensuring brand consistency and content optimization through advanced SEO techniques and social media marketing strategies, leveraging keywords and content calendars.","zh":"赋予代理能力，使用特定平台框架创建吸引人的内容，确保品牌一致性和内容优化，通过高级SEO技术和社交媒体营销策略，利用关键词和内容日历。","ja":"エージェントにプラットフォーム固有のフレームワークを使用して魅力的なコンテンツを作成する能力を与え、ブランドの一貫性とコンテンツの最適化を確保する、先進的なSEO技術とソーシャルメディアマーケティング戦略を利用して、キーワードとコンテンツカレンダーを利用する。","ko":"에이전트에게 플랫폼 고유의 프레임워크를 사용하여 매력적인 콘텐츠를 생성하는 능력을 부여하며, 브랜드 일관성과 콘텐츠 최적화를 보장하고, 고급 SEO 기술과 소셜 미디어 마케팅 전략을 활용하여 키워드와 콘텐츠 일정표를 사용합니다.","es":"Empowers agents to craft engaging content using platform-specific frameworks, ensuring brand consistency and content optimization through advanced SEO techniques and social media marketing strategies, leveraging keywords and content calendars.","fr":"Empowers agents to craft engaging content using platform-specific frameworks, ensuring brand consistency and content optimization through advanced SEO techniques and social media marketing strategies, leveraging keywords and content calendars.","de":"Empowers agents to craft engaging content using platform-specific frameworks, ensuring brand consistency and content optimization through advanced SEO techniques and social media marketing strategies, leveraging keywords and content calendars.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar conteúdo atraente usando estruturas específicas de plataforma, garantindo a consistência da marca e a otimização do conteúdo por meio de técnicas de SEO avançadas e estratégias de marketing de mídia social, aproveitando palavras-chave e calendários de conteúdo.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать привлекательный контент с помощью платформенно-специфических фреймворков, обеспечивая бренд-консистенцию и контент-оптимизацию посредством продвинутых SEO-техник и стратегий социального маркетинга, используя ключевые слова и контент-календари.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء محتوى جذاب باستخدام الإطارات المحددة للأجهزة، وضمان الاتساق مع العلامة التجارية وتحسين المحتوى من خلال تقنيات تحسين محركات البحث المتقدمة واستراتيجيات التسويق عبر وسائل الإعلام الاجتماعية، واستخدام الكلمات الرئيسية وتقويم المحتوى."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating blog posts with optimized SEO","Developing platform-specific content frameworks for social media","Creating comprehensive content calendars for brand consistency"],"zh":["生成具有优化SEO的博客文章","为社交媒体开发特定平台的内容框架","为品牌一致性创建全面内容日历"],"ja":["最適化されたSEOのブログ記事を生成する","ソーシャルメディアのためのプラットフォーム固有のコンテンツフレームワークを開発する","ブランドの一貫性のための包括的なコンテンツカレンダーを作成する"],"ko":["최적화된 SEO를 가진 블로그 게시물 생성","소셜 미디어를 위한 플랫폼 고유의 콘텐츠 프레임워크 개발","브랜드 일관성을 위한 포괄적인 콘텐츠 일정표 생성"],"es":["Generating blog posts with optimized SEO","Developing platform-specific content frameworks for social media","Creating comprehensive content calendars for brand consistency"],"fr":["Generating blog posts with optimized SEO","Developing platform-specific content frameworks for social media","Creating comprehensive content calendars for brand consistency"],"de":["Generating blog posts with optimized SEO","Developing platform-specific content frameworks for social media","Creating comprehensive content calendars for brand consistency"],"pt":["Gerar posts de blog com SEO otimizado","Desenvolver estruturas de conteúdo específicas de plataforma para mídia social","Criar calendários de conteúdo abrangentes para consistência da marca"],"ru":["Генерировать блог-посты с оптимизированным SEO","Разрабатывать платформенно-специфические контент-фреймворки для социальных медиа","Создавать комплексные контент-календари для бренд-консистенции"],"ar":["توليد منشورات مدونة مع تحسين جودة بحث محركات البحث","إنشاء إطارات محتوى محددة للأجهزة لوسائل الإعلام الاجتماعية","إنشاء تقويمات محتوى شاملة لاتساق العلامة التجارية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires brand guidelines for voice development","Limited to text-based content generation"],"zh":["需要品牌指南来开发语音","仅限于基于文本的内容生成"],"ja":["音声開発のためにブランドガイドラインが必要","テキストベースのコンテンツ生成のみ"],"ko":["음성 개발을 위해 브랜드 가이드라인이 필요함","텍스트 기반 콘텐츠 생성에만 한정됨"],"es":["Requires brand guidelines for voice development","Limited to text-based content generation"],"fr":["Requires brand guidelines for voice development","Limited to text-based content generation"],"de":["Requires brand guidelines for voice development","Limited to text-based content generation"],"pt":["Requer diretrizes de marca para desenvolvimento de voz","Limitado à geração de conteúdo baseado em texto"],"ru":["Требует бренд-руководств для развития голоса","Ограничен генерацией текстового контента"],"ar":["يتطلب إرشادات العلامة التجارية لتطوير الصوت","محدود بتوليد المحتوى القائم على النص"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
