poral","Comprobaciones de humo antes de compartir el código final","Confirmación de requisitos previos","Selección de ejemplos ejecutables"],"fr":["Code de travail avec erreur minimale","Intégration avec le prototype de SDK de Temporal","Réutilisation de modèles de câblage de Temporal","Vérifications de fumée avant de partager le code final","Confirmation des prérequis","Sélection d''exemples exécutables"],"de":["Arbeitscode mit minimalem Fehler","Integration mit dem Prototyp des Temporal SDK","Wiederverwendung von Temporal-Verdrahtungsmustern","Rauchtests vor dem Teilen des finalen Codes","Bestätigung der Voraussetzungen","Auswahl von ausführbaren Beispielen"],"pt":["Crie código de trabalho Rust com eficiência","Etapas rápidas para iniciar o desenvolvimento","Documentação de referência para ajudar os desenvolvedores","Porte lógica de negócios enquanto mantém padrões de fiação do Temporal","Realize testes de fumaça antes de compartilhar o código final"],"ru":["Создайте рабочий код Rust с минимальными затратами","Быстрые шаги для начала разработки","Справочная документация для помощи разработчикам","Перенесите логику бизнеса, сохраняя при этом шаблоны подключения Temporal","Проведите тесты дымовых сигналов перед обменом окончательным кодом"],"ar":["إنشاء رمز العمل الرust بخفض عدد المحاولات والخطأ","خطوات سريعة لبدء التطوير","توثيق مرجعي لمساعدة المطورين","نقل 논리 الأعمال مع الحفاظ على أنماط توصيل Temporal","إجراء اختبارات الدخان قبل مشاركة الشفرة النهائية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Temporal Rust SDK","Rust 代码生成","Temporal 项目","开发工具","代码示例","试错最小化"],"ja":["Temporal Rust SDK","Rust コード生成","Temporal プロジェクト","開発ツール","コードサンプル","試行錯誤最小化"],"ko":["Temporal Rust SDK","Rust 코드 생성","Temporal 프로젝트","개발 도구","코드 예제","시도 오류 최소화"],"es":["SDK de Rust Temporal","código de trabajo","prototipo de SDK de Temporal","desarrollo de software","programación en Rust","integración de Temporal","patrones de cableado de Temporal","comprobaciones de humo"],"fr":["SDK Rust Temporal","code de travail","prototype de SDK de Temporal","développement de logiciels","programmation en Rust","intégration de Temporal","modèles de câblage de Temporal","vérifications de fumée"],"de":["Temporal Rust SDK","Arbeitscode","Prototyp des Temporal SDK","Softwareentwicklung","Rust-Programmierung","Integration von Temporal","Temporal-Verdrahtungsmuster","Rauchtests"],"pt":["Temporal Rust SDK","desenvolvimento de software","código de trabalho Rust","SDK do Temporal","eficiência no desenvolvimento","etapas rápidas","documentação de referência"],"ru":["Temporal Rust SDK","разработка программного обеспечения","рабочий код Rust","SDK Temporal","эффективность разработки","быстрые шаги","справочная документация"],"ar":["Temporal Rust SDK","تطوير البرمجيات","رمز العمل الرust","SDK Temporal","كفاءة التطوير","خطوات سريعة","توثيق مرجعي"]}},"owner":"Lynskylate","repo":"skillgregistry","repoPath":"Lynskylate/skillgregistry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.426Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"temporal-rust-sdk","description":"Provide implementation patterns and runnable examples for the Temporal Rust SDK prototype. Use when building, migrating, or debugging Temporal applications in Rust, including Workflow and Activity authoring, Worker and Client wiring, Signal handling, Local Activities, Saga compensation, and activity registration strategies.","bodyPreview":"# Temporal Rust SDK\n\nUse this skill to produce working Rust code for the Temporal prototype SDK with minimal trial and error.\n\n## Fast path\n\n1. Confirm prerequisites in reference/README.md.\n2. Select the closest runnable example under examples/.\n3. Reuse the same worker and starter command flow.\n4. Port business logic while keeping Temporal wiring patterns.\n5. Run smoke checks before sharing final code.\n\n## Reference router\n\n- reference/CLIENT.md: client creation, namespace setup, workflow start","body":"# Temporal Rust SDK\n\nUse this skill to produce working Rust code for the Temporal prototype SDK with minimal trial and error.\n\n## Fast path\n\n1. Confirm prerequisites in reference/README.md.\n2. Select the closest runnable example under examples/.\n3. Reuse the same worker and starter command flow.\n4. Port business logic while keeping Temporal wiring patterns.\n5. Run smoke checks before sharing final code.\n\n## Reference router\n\n- reference/CLIENT.md: client creation, namespace setup, workflow start, signals, result polling.\n- reference/WORKER.md: worker setup, task queue binding, run loop details.\n- reference/WORKFLOW.md: workflow structure, timers, signal loops, local activities, saga orchestration.\n- reference/ACTIVITY.md: activity contracts, payload boundaries, error handling.\n- reference/ACTIVITY_REGISTRATION.md: activity registration decision matrix and minimal templates.\n\nLoad only the reference file needed for the current task.\n\n## Activity registration rule\n\n1. Default to register_activity_json from src/lib.rs for typed JSON payloads.\n2. Use register_activity macro for short struct method prototypes.\n3. Use raw register_activity only when custom payload encoding or metadata control is required.\n\nKeep request and response structs serde compatible when using helper based registration.\n\n## Smoke check\n\nUse the reusable smoke check script before finalizing updates:\n\n~~~bash\ncd .agent/skills/temporal-rust-sdk\n./scripts/smoke_check.sh\n~~~\n\nUseful options:\n\n~~~bash\n./scripts/smoke_check.sh --all-packages --skip-runtime\n./scripts/smoke_check.sh --package saga --runtime-package saga\n./scripts/smoke_check.sh --dry-run\n~~~\n\nThe script compiles selected example packages and runs a runtime smoke check when a Temporal server is reachable at 127.0.0.1:7233.\n\n## Manual run commands\n\nRun from .agent/skills/temporal-rust-sdk/examples:\n\n~~~bash\ncargo run -p helloworld -- worker\ncargo run -p helloworld -- starter --name Alice\n~~~\n\nPackage names: helloworld, batch-sliding-window, saga, localactivity, struct-activity.\n\n## Implementation checklist\n\n- Set a unique workflow ID for each run.\n- Keep workflow logic deterministic and move side effects to activities.\n- Set explicit activity and local activity timeout policies.\n- Execute saga compensation in reverse order.\n- Keep worker and starter logs for reproducibility.\n\n## Common failure patterns\n\n- Missing protoc causes build failures.\n- Reused workflow IDs cause already running errors.\n- Blocking calls inside workflows can stall task progress.\n- Encoding metadata and payload format mismatches cause decode failures.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:52:16.037Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Rust-focused AI Agents seeking streamlined workflow development with Temporal","zh":"适合专注于Rust的AI代理，旨在使用Temporal开发流线型工作流程","ja":"Rustに焦点を当てたAIエージェント向けに、Temporalを使用したストリームラインなワークフローの開発に最適","ko":"Rust에 중점을 둔 AI 에이전트를 위한 Temporal을 사용한 스트림 라인 워크 플로우 개발에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA centrados en Rust que buscan un desarrollo de flujo de trabajo simplificado con Temporal","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA axés sur Rust qui recherchent un développement de workflow simplifié avec Temporal","de":"Ideal für Rust-fokussierte KI-Agents, die eine strukturierte Workflow-Entwicklung mit Temporal anstreben","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA focados em Rust que buscam desenvolver fluxos de trabalho otimizados com Temporal","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на Rust, стремящихся к упрощенному развитию рабочих процессов с Temporal","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي ذي تركيز على روست يسعى لتنمية تدفق عمل مجدول مع Temporal"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to produce working Rust code for the Temporal prototype SDK, leveraging minimal trial and error through reusable worker and starter command flows, and integrating with Temporal wiring patterns for efficient business logic porting, all while utilizing the Temporal Rust SDK''s reference router for client creation and namespace setup","zh":"赋予代理生成用于Temporal原型SDK的工作Rust代码的能力，通过可重用的工作人员和启动命令流，利用最少的试验和错误，并集成了Temporal的布线模式以实现高效的业务逻辑移植，同时利用Temporal Rust SDK的引用路由器进行客户端创建和命名空间设置","ja":"TemporalプロトタイプSDK用の動作するRustコードを生成するエージェントに力を与え、再利用可能なワーカーとスターターコマンドフローを利用し、最小限の試行錯誤を通じて、Temporalの配線パターンを統合してビジネスロジックの移植を効率化し、同時にTemporal Rust SDKのリファレンスルーターを使用してクライアントの作成と名前空間の設定を行う","ko":"에이전트에게 Temporal 프로토 타입 SDK용으로 작동하는 Rust 코드를 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 최소한의 시도와 오류를 통해 재사용 가능한 워커와 시작 명령 흐름을 활용하고 Temporal의 배선 패턴을 통합하여 비즈니스 논리의 효율적인 이식과 함께 Temporal Rust SDK의 참조 라우터를 사용하여 클라이언트 생성과 네임스페이스 설정을 수행","es":"Permite a los agentes producir código Rust funcionando para el SDK de prototipo de Temporal, aprovechando un mínimo de prueba y error a través de flujos de trabajo y comandos de inicio reutilizables, e integrándose con patrones de cableado de Temporal para un puerto de lógica empresarial eficiente, todo mientras utiliza el enrutador de referencia del SDK de Rust de Temporal para la creación de clientes y la configuración de espacios de nombres","fr":"Permet aux agents de produire du code Rust fonctionnel pour le SDK de prototype de Temporal, en exploitant un minimum d''essais et d''erreurs grâce à des flux de travail et des commandes de démarrage réutilisables, et en s''intégrant avec les modèles de câblage de Temporal pour un portage efficace de la logique métier, le tout en utilisant le routeur de référence du SDK Rust de Temporal pour la création de clients et la configuration des espaces de noms","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, funktionierenden Rust-Code für das Temporal-Prototyp-SDK zu produzieren, unter Nutzung von minimalen Trial- und Error-Verfahren durch wiederverwendbare Worker- und Startkommandoflüsse und durch Integration mit Temporal-Verdrahtungsmustern für eine effiziente Übertragung von Geschäftlogik, und zwar unter Verwendung des Referenzrouters des Temporal-Rust-SDKs für die Clienterstellung und die Namensraumkonfiguration","pt":"Habilita os agentes a produzir código Rust funcional para o SDK de protótipo Temporal, aproveitando o mínimo de tentativa e erro por meio de fluxos de comando de trabalhador e inicialização reutilizáveis, e integrando com padrões de fiação Temporal para portar lógica de negócios de forma eficiente, tudo isso utilizando o roteador de referência do SDK Rust do Temporal para criação de cliente e configuração de namespace","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать рабочий код Rust для прототипа SDK Temporal, используя минимальное количество проб и ошибок посредством повторно используемых рабочих и стартовых потоков команд, и интегрируя с шаблонами проводки Temporal для эффективного переноса бизнес-логики, все это при использовании справочного маршрутизатора SDK Rust Temporal для создания клиента и настройки пространства имен","ar":"يمنح الوكيل إمكانية إنتاج رمز روست قابل للتشغيل من أجل SDK نموذج Temporal، واستخدام الحد الأدنى من التجربة والخطأ من خلال تيار 命令 قابل لإعادة الاستخدام للعامل والشروع، ودمج أنماط سلك Temporal لنقل منطق العمل بفعالية، وكل ذلك باستخدام الموجه المرجعي ل SDK روست Temporal لإنشاء العميل وتكوين مساحة الاسم"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating Temporal workflow starters","Porting business logic into Temporal workflows","Debugging Temporal workflow issues with smoke checks"],"zh":["生成Temporal工作流启动器","将业务逻辑移植到Temporal工作流中","使用烟雾检查调试Temporal工作流问题"],"ja":["Temporalワークフロースターターを生成する","ビジネスロジックをTemporalワークフローに移植する","煙霧チェックを使用してTemporalワークフローの問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["Temporal 워크 플로우 스타터를 생성","비즈니스 논리를 Temporal 워크 플로우로 이식","연기 확인을 사용하여 Temporal 워크 플로우 문제를 디버깅"],"es":["Generación de iniciadores de flujo de trabajo de Temporal","Puerto de lógica empresarial en flujos de trabajo de Temporal","Depuración de problemas de flujo de trabajo de Temporal con comprobaciones de humo"],"fr":["Génération de démarreurs de workflow Temporal","Portage de la logique métier dans les workflows Temporal","Débogage des problèmes de workflow Temporal avec des vérifications de fumée"],"de":["Erzeugung von Temporal-Workflow-Startern","Übertragung von Geschäftlogik in Temporal-Workflows","Fehlerbehebung bei Temporal-Workflow-Problemen mit Rauchtests"],"pt":["Geração de inicializadores de fluxo de trabalho Temporal","Portar lógica de negócios para fluxos de trabalho Temporal","Depurar problemas de fluxo de trabalho Temporal com verificações de fumaça"],"ru":["Генерация стартовых рабочих процессов Temporal","Перенос бизнес-логики в рабочие процессы Temporal","Отладка проблем рабочих процессов Temporal с помощью проверок дыма"],"ar":["توليد مبادئ تدفق عمل Temporal","نقل منطق العمل إلى تدفقات عمل Temporal","تصحيح أخطاء في تدفق عمل Temporal باستخدام فحوصات الدخان"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires prerequisites confirmed in reference/README.md","Limited to Rust programming language","Needs understanding of Temporal wiring patterns"],"zh":["需要在reference/README.md中确认的先决条件","仅限Rust编程语言","需要了解Temporal的布线模式"],"ja":["reference/README.mdに記載された前提条件の確認が必要","Rustプログラミング言語のみ","Temporalの配線パターンの理解が必要"],"ko":["참조/README.md에記載된 전제 조건 확인 필요","Rust 프로그래밍 언어만 해당","Temporal의 배선 패턴에 대한 이해 필요"],"es":["Requiere requisitos previos confirmados en reference/README.md","Limitado al lenguaje de programación Rust","Necesita comprensión de patrones de cableado de Temporal"],"fr":["Nécessite des prérequis confirmés dans reference/README.md","Limité au langage de programmation Rust","Nécessite une compréhension des modèles de câblage de Temporal"],"de":["Erfordert bestätigte Voraussetzungen in reference/README.md","Begrenzt auf die Rust-Programmiersprache","Benötigt Verständnis von Temporal-Verdrahtungsmustern"],"pt":["Exige pré-requisitos confirmados em reference/README.md","Limitado à linguagem de programação Rust","Necessita de compreensão dos padrões de fiação Temporal"],"ru":["Требует подтвержденных предпосылок, указанных в reference/README.md","Ограничен языком программирования Rust","Требует понимания шаблонов проводки Temporal"],"ar":["يتطلب مسبقًا مؤكدًا في reference/README.md","محدود بلغة برمجة روست","يحتاج إلى فهم أنماط سلك Temporal"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
