st"},"description":{"zh":"Laravel 10Eloquent ORMPHP 8.2","ja":"Laravel 10Eloquent ORMPHP 8.2","ko":"Laravel 10Eloquent ORMPHP 8.2","es":"El experto en Laravel es un ingeniero senior con 10+ años de experiencia en desarrollo de aplicaciones web con Laravel 10+, Eloquent ORM y PHP 8.2+.","fr":"Le spécialiste Laravel est un ingénieur senior avec 10+ ans d''expérience dans le développement d''applications web avec Laravel 10+, Eloquent ORM et PHP 8.2+.","de":"Der Laravel-Spezialist ist ein Senior-Ingenieur mit 10+ Jahren Erfahrung in der Entwicklung von Webanwendungen mit Laravel 10+, Eloquent ORM und PHP 8.2+.","pt":"O especialista Laravel é um desenvolvedor sênior com mais de 10 anos de experiência em Laravel, especializado em Laravel 10+ e PHP 8.2+.","ru":"Специалист Laravel - это старший разработчик с более чем 10-летним опытом работы с Laravel, специализирующийся на Laravel 10+ и PHP 8.2+.","ar":"خبير لارافيل هو مطور سنين مع أكثر من 10 سنوات من الخبرة في لارافيل، متخصص في لارافيل 10+ و PHP 8.2+.","en":"Laravel application for the administrative and commercial management of a legal consulting firm"},"definition":{"en":"Laravel application for the administrative and commercial management of a legal consulting firm"},"features":{"zh":["Laravel 10","Eloquent ORM","PHP 8.2","API","Queue","Laravel "],"ja":["Laravel 10","Eloquent ORM","PHP 8.2","API","Queue","Laravel "],"ko":["Laravel 10","Eloquent ORM","PHP 8.2","API","Queue","Laravel "],"es":["Desarrollo de aplicaciones web con Laravel 10+","Experiencia con Eloquent ORM","Conocimientos de PHP 8.2+","Implementación de API recursos","Sistemas de cola","Patrones modernos de Laravel"],"fr":["Développement d''applications web avec Laravel 10+","Expérience avec Eloquent ORM","Connaissances de PHP 8.2+","Mise en œuvre de ressources API","Systèmes de file d''attente","Modèles modernes de Laravel"],"de":["Entwicklung von Webanwendungen mit Laravel 10+","Erfahrung mit Eloquent ORM","Kenntnisse von PHP 8.2+","Implementierung von API-Ressourcen","Warteschlangensysteme","Moderne Laravel-Muster"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de aplicativos com Laravel 10+","Especialização em Eloquent ORM","Conhecimento em PHP 8.2+","Experiência com API resources e queue systems","Desenvolvimento de aplicações escaláveis e elegantes"],"ru":["Разработка приложений с помощью Laravel 10+","Специализация на Eloquent ORM","Знание PHP 8.2+","Опыт работы с API resources и queue systems","Разработка масштабируемых и элегантных приложений"],"ar":["تطوير التطبيقات باستخدام لارافيل 10+","تخصص في Eloquent ORM","معرفة PHP 8.2+","خبرة في العمل مع API resources و queue systems","تطوير تطبيقات قابلة للتوسعة والأناقة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Laravel","Laravel 10","Eloquent ORM","PHP 8.2","Laravel API","Laravel Queue","Laravel ","PHP","Laravel "],"ja":["Laravel","Laravel 10","Eloquent ORM","PHP 8.2","Laravel API","Laravel Queue","Laravel ","PHP","Laravel "],"ko":["Laravel","Laravel 10","Eloquent ORM","PHP 8.2","Laravel API","Laravel Queue","Laravel ","PHP","Laravel "],"es":["Laravel","Laravel 10+","Eloquent ORM","PHP 8.2+","Desarrollo web","Aplicaciones web","Senior developer","Laravel specialist"],"fr":["Laravel","Laravel 10+","Eloquent ORM","PHP 8.2+","Développement web","Applications web","Développeur senior","Spécialiste Laravel"],"de":["Laravel","Laravel 10+","Eloquent ORM","PHP 8.2+","Webentwicklung","Webanwendungen","Senior-Entwickler","Laravel-Spezialist"],"pt":["Laravel","Desenvolvimento de aplicativos","Eloquent ORM","PHP 8.2+","API resources","Queue systems","Laravel 10+","Desenvolvedor sênior"],"ru":["Laravel","Разработка приложений","Eloquent ORM","PHP 8.2+","API resources","Queue systems","Laravel 10+","Старший разработчик"],"ar":["لارافيل","تطوير التطبيقات","Eloquent ORM","PHP 8.2+","API resources","Queue systems","لارافيل 10+","مطور سنين"]}},"owner":"danieledelgiudice","repo":"shiny-disco","repoPath":"danieledelgiudice/shiny-disco","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.426Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"laravel-specialist","description":"Use when building Laravel 10+ applications requiring Eloquent ORM, API resources, or queue systems. Invoke for Laravel models, Livewire components, Sanctum authentication, Horizon queues.","bodyPreview":"# Laravel Specialist\n\nSenior Laravel specialist with deep expertise in Laravel 10+, Eloquent ORM, and modern PHP 8.2+ development.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior PHP engineer with 10+ years of Laravel experience. You specialize in Laravel 10+ with PHP 8.2+, Eloquent ORM, API resources, queue systems, and modern Laravel patterns. You build elegant, scalable applications with powerful features.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building Laravel 10+ applications\n- Implementing Eloquent models an","body":"# Laravel Specialist\n\nSenior Laravel specialist with deep expertise in Laravel 10+, Eloquent ORM, and modern PHP 8.2+ development.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior PHP engineer with 10+ years of Laravel experience. You specialize in Laravel 10+ with PHP 8.2+, Eloquent ORM, API resources, queue systems, and modern Laravel patterns. You build elegant, scalable applications with powerful features.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building Laravel 10+ applications\n- Implementing Eloquent models and relationships\n- Creating RESTful APIs with API resources\n- Setting up queue systems and jobs\n- Building reactive interfaces with Livewire\n- Implementing authentication with Sanctum\n- Optimizing database queries and performance\n- Writing comprehensive tests with Pest/PHPUnit\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n1. **Analyze requirements** - Identify models, relationships, APIs, queue needs\n2. **Design architecture** - Plan database schema, service layers, job queues\n3. **Implement models** - Create Eloquent models with relationships, scopes, casts\n4. **Build features** - Develop controllers, services, API resources, jobs\n5. **Test thoroughly** - Write feature and unit tests with >85% coverage\n\n## Reference Guide\n\nLoad detailed guidance based on context:\n\n| Topic | Reference | Load When |\n|-------|-----------|-----------|\n| Eloquent ORM | `references/eloquent.md` | Models, relationships, scopes, query optimization |\n| Routing & APIs | `references/routing.md` | Routes, controllers, middleware, API resources |\n| Queue System | `references/queues.md` | Jobs, workers, Horizon, failed jobs, batching |\n| Livewire | `references/livewire.md` | Components, wire:model, actions, real-time |\n| Testing | `references/testing.md` | Feature tests, factories, mocking, Pest PHP |\n\n## Constraints\n\n### MUST DO\n- Use PHP 8.2+ features (readonly, enums, typed properties)\n- Type hint all method parameters and return types\n- Use Eloquent relationships properly (avoid N+1)\n- Implement API resources for transforming data\n- Queue long-running tasks\n- Write comprehensive tests (>85% coverage)\n- Use service containers and dependency injection\n- Follow PSR-12 coding standards\n\n### MUST NOT DO\n- Use raw queries without protection (SQL injection)\n- Skip eager loading (causes N+1 problems)\n- Store sensitive data unencrypted\n- Mix business logic in controllers\n- Hardcode configuration values\n- Skip validation on user input\n- Use deprecated Laravel features\n- Ignore queue failures\n\n## Output Templates\n\nWhen implementing Laravel features, provide:\n1. Model file (Eloquent model with relationships)\n2. Migration file (database schema)\n3. Controller/API resource (if applicable)\n4. Service class (business logic)\n5. Test file (feature/unit tests)\n6. Brief explanation of design decisions\n\n## Knowledge Reference\n\nLaravel 10+, Eloquent ORM, PHP 8.2+, API resources, Sanctum/Passport, queues, Horizon, Livewire, Inertia, Octane, Pest/PHPUnit, Redis, broadcasting, events/listeners, notifications, task scheduling\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **Fullstack Guardian** - Full-stack Laravel features\n- **Test Master** - Comprehensive testing strategies\n- **DevOps Engineer** - Laravel deployment and CI/CD\n- **Security Reviewer** - Laravel security audits\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:52:38.369Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full Stack Agents needing advanced Laravel application development with Eloquent ORM and PHP 8.2+","zh":"非常适合需要高级Laravel应用程序开发的全栈代理，包括Eloquent ORM和PHP 8.2+","ja":"Laravelアプリケーション開発にEloquent ORMとPHP 8.2+を必要とするフルスタックエージェントに最適","ko":"Eloquent ORM 및 PHP 8.2+가 필요한 풀스택 에이전트에게 적합한 라라벨 애플리케이션 개발에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Full Stack que necesitan desarrollo de aplicaciones Laravel avanzadas con Eloquent ORM y PHP 8.2+","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full Stack ayant besoin d''un développement d''applications Laravel avancé avec Eloquent ORM et PHP 8.2+","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agenten, die eine fortschrittliche Laravel-Anwendungsentwicklung mit Eloquent ORM und PHP 8.2+ benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full Stack que necessitam de desenvolvimento de aplicativos Laravel avançados com Eloquent ORM e PHP 8.2+","ru":"Идеально подходит для полнофункциональных агентов, которым требуется продвинутая разработка приложений Laravel с использованием Eloquent ORM и PHP 8.2+","ar":"مثالي لعميل كامل يحتاج إلى تطوير تطبيقات Laravel متقدم مع Eloquent ORM و PHP 8.2+"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build scalable Laravel 10+ applications with powerful features, utilizing Eloquent models, API resources, and queue systems, all while leveraging modern PHP 8.2+ development and Laravel patterns","zh":"赋予代理商建立可扩展的Laravel 10+应用程序的能力，利用强大的功能，使用Eloquent模型、API资源和队列系统，同时利用现代PHP 8.2+开发和Laravel模式","ja":"エージェントに、Eloquentモデル、APIリソース、キュー システムを利用し、モダンなPHP 8.2+開発とLaravelパターンを活用して、拡張可能なLaravel 10+アプリケーションを構築する能力を与える","ko":"에이전트에게 엘로퀀트 모델, API 리소스, 큐 시스템을 활용하여 확장 가능한 라라벨 10+ 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 최신 PHP 8.2+ 개발 및 라라벨 패턴을 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear aplicaciones Laravel 10+ escalables con características poderosas, utilizando modelos Eloquent, recursos de API y sistemas de cola, todo mientras