e desenvolvimento de equipes"],"ru":["архитектор монорепо","архитектура монорепо","системы сборки","управление зависимостями","Nx","Turborepo","Bazel","Lerna","разработка нескольких проектов","масштабируемость разработки команд"],"ar":["مهندس مونوربو","هندسة مونوربو","أنظمة البناء","إدارة التبعيات","Nx","Turborepo","Bazel","Lerna","تطوير مشاريع متعددة","توسعة تطوير الفرق"]}},"owner":"xiangteng007","repo":"XXT-AGENT","repoPath":"xiangteng007/XXT-AGENT","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.426Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"monorepo-architect","description":"Expert in monorepo architecture, build systems, and dependency management at scale. Masters Nx, Turborepo, Bazel, and Lerna for efficient multi-project development. Use PROACTIVELY for monorepo setup,","bodyPreview":"# Monorepo Architect\n\nExpert in monorepo architecture, build systems, and dependency management at scale. Masters Nx, Turborepo, Bazel, and Lerna for efficient multi-project development. Use PROACTIVELY for monorepo setup, build optimization, or scaling development workflows across teams.\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to monorepo architect\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Appl","body":"# Monorepo Architect\n\nExpert in monorepo architecture, build systems, and dependency management at scale. Masters Nx, Turborepo, Bazel, and Lerna for efficient multi-project development. Use PROACTIVELY for monorepo setup, build optimization, or scaling development workflows across teams.\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to monorepo architect\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- Monorepo tool selection (Nx, Turborepo, Bazel, Lerna)\n- Workspace configuration and project structure\n- Build caching (local and remote)\n- Dependency graph management\n- Affected/changed detection for CI optimization\n- Code sharing and library extraction\n- Task orchestration and parallelization\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Setting up a new monorepo from scratch\n- Migrating from polyrepo to monorepo\n- Optimizing slow CI/CD pipelines\n- Sharing code between multiple applications\n- Managing dependencies across projects\n- Implementing consistent tooling across teams\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Assess codebase size and team structure\n2. Select appropriate monorepo tooling\n3. Design workspace and project structure\n4. Configure build caching strategy\n5. Set up affected/changed detection\n6. Implement task pipelines\n7. Configure remote caching for CI\n8. Document conventions and workflows\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- Start with clear project boundaries\n- Use consistent naming conventions\n- Implement remote caching early\n- Keep shared libraries focused\n- Use tags for dependency constraints\n- Automate dependency updates\n- Document the dependency graph\n- Set up code ownership rules\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:52:35.880Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring expertise in multi-project development and dependency management at scale.","zh":"适合需要在大规模多项目开发和依赖管理中具备专业知识的开发代理。","ja":"大規模なマルチプロジェクト開発と依存関係管理に専門知識を必要とする開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"대규모 멀티 프로젝트 개발 및 의존성 관리에 전문 지식이 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que requieren experiencia en desarrollo de múltiples proyectos y gestión de dependencias a gran escala.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant une expertise dans le développement de projets multiples et la gestion des dépendances à grande échelle.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungsspezialisten, die Erfahrung im Entwickeln mehrerer Projekte und in der Verwaltung von Abhängigkeiten im großen Maßstab benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que exigem especialização em desenvolvimento de múltiplos projetos e gerenciamento de dependências em larga escala.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, требующих экспертизы в разработке нескольких проектов и управлении зависимостями в крупном масштабе.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء النشطين الذين يطلبون خبرة في تطوير المشاريع متعددة والاعتمادية الإدارة على نطاق واسع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to efficiently manage monorepo architecture using Nx, Turborepo, Bazel, and Lerna, optimizing build systems and dependency management for seamless development workflows across teams, and leveraging PROACTIVELY for monorepo setup and scaling.","zh":"赋予代理高效地管理monorepo架构，使用Nx、Turborepo、Bazel和Lerna，优化构建系统和依赖管理，实现团队间的无缝开发工作流，并利用PROACTIVELY进行monorepo设置和扩展。","ja":"エージェントが、Nx、Turborepo、Bazel、Lernaを使用してモノレポアーキテクチャを効率的に管理できるようにし、ビルドシステムと依存関係管理を最適化して、チーム間のシームレスな開発ワークフローを実現し、PROACTIVELYを使用してモノレポのセットアップとスケーリングを行う。","ko":"에이전트가 Nx, Turborepo, Bazel 및 Lerna를 사용하여 모노레포 아키텍처를 효율적으로 관리할 수 있도록 해주며, 빌드 시스템 및 의존성 관리를 최적화하여 팀 간에 무шов한 개발 워크플로우를 구현하며, PROACTIVELY를 사용하여 모노레포 설정 및 확장을 진행합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes gestionar de manera eficiente la arquitectura monorepo utilizando Nx, Turborepo, Bazel y Lerna, optimizando los sistemas de compilación y la gestión de dependencias para flujos de trabajo de desarrollo sin problemas en equipos, y aprovechando PROACTIVELY para la configuración y escalado de monorepo.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer efficacement l''architecture monorepo en utilisant Nx, Turborepo, Bazel et Lerna, en optimisant les systèmes de construction et la gestion des dépendances pour des flux de travail de développement transparents entre les équipes, et en exploitant PROACTIVELY pour la configuration et la mise à l''échelle de monorepo.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die Monorepo-Architektur mithilfe von Nx, Turborepo, Bazel und Lerna effizient zu verwalten, die Build-Systeme und Abhängigkeitsverwaltung für nahtlose Entwicklungsworkflows in Teams zu optimieren und PROACTIVELY für die Einrichtung und Skalierung von Monorepo zu nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar eficientemente a arquitetura monorepo usando Nx, Turborepo, Bazel e Lerna, otimizando sistemas de build e gerenciamento de dependências para fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento sem interrupções entre equipes, e aproveitando PROATIVAMENTE para configuração e dimensionamento de monorepo.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно управлять архитектурой монореPO с помощью Nx, Turborepo, Bazel и Lerna, оптимизируя системы сборки и управление зависимостями для бесперебойных рабочих процессов разработки между командами, и использует PROACTIVELY для настройки и масштабирования монореPO.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إدارة هيكل مونوربو بفعالية باستخدام Nx و Turborepo و Bazel و Lerna، وضبط أنظمة البناء وإدارة الاعتمادية من أجل سير عمل تطوير سلس بين الفرق، وتفعيل PROACTIVELY لتهيئة مونوربو وتوسيع نطاقها."},"useCases":{"en":["Setting up monorepo architecture for large-scale projects","Optimizing build systems with Nx and Turborepo","Scaling development workflows across multiple teams with Lerna and Bazel"],"zh":["为大规模项目设置monorepo架构","使用Nx和Turborepo优化构建系统","使用Lerna和Bazel跨多个团队扩展开发工作流"],"ja":["大規模プロジェクトのモノレポアーキテクチャの設定","NxとTurborepoを使用したビルドシステムの最適化","LernaとBazelを使用した複数チームへの開発ワークフローの拡張"],"ko":["대규모 프로젝트를 위한 모노레포 아키텍처 설정","Nx 및 Turborepo를 사용한 빌드 시스템 최적화","Lerna 및 Bazel을 사용한 다중 팀 개발 워크플로 확장"],"es":["Configuración de la arquitectura monorepo para proyectos a gran escala","Optimización de los sistemas de compilación con Nx y Turborepo","Escalado de flujos de trabajo de desarrollo en múltiples equipos con Lerna y Bazel"],"fr":["Configuration de l''architecture monorepo pour des projets à grande échelle","Optimisation des systèmes de construction avec Nx et Turborepo","Mise à l''échelle des flux de travail de développement sur plusieurs équipes avec Lerna et Bazel"],"de":["Einrichtung der Monorepo-Architektur für Großprojekte","Optimierung der Build-Systeme mit Nx und Turborepo","Skalierung der Entwicklungsworkflows in mehreren Teams mit Lerna und Bazel"],"pt":["Configuração da arquitetura monorepo para projetos em larga escala","Otimização dos sistemas de build com Nx e Turborepo","Dimensionamento dos fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento em várias equipes com Lerna e Bazel"],"ru":["Настройка архитектуры монореPO для крупномасштабных проектов","Оптимизация систем сборки с помощью Nx и Turborepo","Масштабирование рабочих процессов разработки между несколькими командами с помощью Lerna и Bazel"],"ar":["تهيئة هيكل مونوربو لمشاريع على نطاق واسع","تحسين أنظمة البناء باستخدام Nx و Turborepo","توسيع نطاق سير عمل التطوير بين فرق متعددة باستخدام Lerna و Bazel"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of monorepo architecture and build systems","Limited to Nx, Turborepo, Bazel, and Lerna ecosystems"],"zh":["需要对monorepo架构和构建系统有所了解","仅限于Nx、Turborepo、Bazel和Lerna生态系统"],"ja":["モノレポアーキテクチャとビルドシステムの知識が必要","Nx、Turborepo、Bazel、Lernaのエコシステムに限定"],"ko":["모노레포 아키텍처 및 빌드 시스템에 대한 지식이 필요","Nx, Turborepo, Bazel 및 Lerna의 에코 시스템에 한정"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de la arquitectura monorepo y los sistemas de compilación","Limitado a los ecosistemas de Nx, Turborepo, Bazel y Lerna"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en architecture monorepo et en systèmes de construction","Limité aux écosystèmes Nx, Turborepo, Bazel et Lerna"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der Monorepo-Architektur und der Build-Systeme","Begrenzt auf die Ökosysteme von Nx, Turborepo, Bazel und Lerna"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento da arquitetura monorepo e sistemas de build","Limitado aos ecossistemas Nx, Turborepo, Bazel e Lerna"],"ru":["Требует знания архитектуры монореPO и систем сборки","Ограничен экосистемами Nx, Turborepo, Bazel и Lerna"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بهيكل مونوربو وأنظمة البناء","محدود بنطاق النظم Nx و Turborepo و Bazel و Lerna"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
