 음성 애플리케이션을 구축하는 기술로, 지연, 음질, 사용자 경험에 중점을 둡니다","es":"El desarrollo de AI de voz implica la creación de aplicaciones de voz en tiempo real con un enfoque en la latencia, la calidad de audio y la experiencia del ...","fr":"Le développement d''IA vocale consiste à créer des applications vocales en temps réel en se concentrant sur la latence, la qualité audio et l''expérience utili...","de":"Die Sprach-AI-Entwicklung beinhaltet die Erstellung von Echtzeit-Sprachanwendungen mit Fokus auf Latenz, Audioqualität und Benutzererfahrung.","pt":"Desenvolvimento de IA de voz é uma área que combina inteligência artificial e processamento de áudio para criar aplicações de voz em tempo real","ru":"Разработка голосового ИИ - это область, сочетающая искусственный интеллект и обработку аудио для создания реальных голосовых приложений","ar":"تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي الصوتي هو مجال يدمج بين الذكاء الاصطناعي ومعالجة الصوت لإنشاء تطبيقات صوتية في الوقت الفعلي","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["OpenAI实时API","Vapi语音代理","Deepgram语音转文本","ElevenLabs语音合成","LiveKit实时通信"],"ja":["OpenAIリアルタイムAPI","Vapi音声エージェント","Deepgram音声認識","ElevenLabs音声合成","LiveKitリアルタイムコミュニケーション"],"ko":["OpenAI 실시간 API","Vapi 음성 에이전트","Deepgram 음성 인식","ElevenLabs 음성 합성","LiveKit 실시간 통신"],"es":["API de tiempo real de OpenAI","Agentes de voz Vapi","Reconocimiento de habla y síntesis de habla de Deepgram","Síntesis de voz de ElevenLabs","Kit de desarrollo de aplicaciones de voz en tiempo real LiveKit"],"fr":["API en temps réel d''OpenAI","Agents vocaux Vapi","Reconnaissance de la parole et synthèse de la parole de Deepgram","Synthèse vocale d''ElevenLabs","Kit de développement d''applications vocales en temps réel LiveKit"],"de":["Echtzeit-API von OpenAI","Sprachagenten Vapi","Spracherkennung und Sprachsynthese von Deepgram","Sprachsynthese von ElevenLabs","Kit für die Entwicklung von Echtzeit-Sprachanwendungen LiveKit"],"pt":["OpenAI Realtime API","Vapi voz","Deepgram STT/TTS","ElevenLabs síntese de voz","LiveKit em tempo real"],"ru":["OpenAI Realtime API","Vapi голос","Deepgram STT/TTS","ElevenLabs синтез голоса","LiveKit в реальном времени"],"ar":["OpenAI Realtime API","Vapi صوت","Deepgram STT/TTS","ElevenLabs توليد الصوت","LiveKit في الوقت الفعلي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["语音AI开发","实时语音应用","音频质量","用户体验","OpenAI","Vapi","Deepgram","ElevenLabs","LiveKit"],"ja":["音声AI開発","リアルタイム音声アプリケーション","音質","ユーザーエクスペリエンス","OpenAI","Vapi","Deepgram","ElevenLabs","LiveKit"],"ko":["음성 AI 개발","실시간 음성 애플리케이션","음질","사용자 경험","OpenAI","Vapi","Deepgram","ElevenLabs","LiveKit"],"es":["desarrollo de AI de voz","aplicaciones de voz en tiempo real","inteligencia artificial de voz","reconocimiento de habla","síntesis de habla","latencia en aplicaciones de voz"],"fr":["développement d''IA vocale","applications vocales en temps réel","intelligence artificielle vocale","reconnaissance de la parole","synthèse de la parole","latence dans les applications vocales"],"de":["Sprach-AI-Entwicklung","Echtzeit-Sprachanwendungen","künstliche Intelligenz für Sprache","Spracherkennung","Sprachsynthese","Latenz in Sprachanwendungen"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de ia de voz","ia de voz","processamento de áudio","aplicações de voz em tempo real","openai","deepgram","vapi voz"],"ru":["разработка голосового ии","голосовой ии","обработка аудио","голосовые приложения в реальном времени","openai","deepgram","vapi голос"],"ar":["تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي الصوتي","الذكاء الاصطناعي الصوتي","معالجة الصوت","تطبيقات صوتية في الوقت الفعلي","openai","deepgram","vapi صوت"]}},"owner":"xiangteng007","repo":"XXT-AGENT","repoPath":"xiangteng007/XXT-AGENT","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.426Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"voice-ai-development","description":"Expert in building voice AI applications - from real-time voice agents to voice-enabled apps. Covers OpenAI Realtime API, Vapi for voice agents, Deepgram for transcription, ElevenLabs for synthesis, LiveKit for real-time infrastructure, and WebRTC fundamentals. Knows how to build low-latency, production-ready voice experiences. Use when: voice ai, voice agent, speech to text, text to speech, realtime voice.","bodyPreview":"# Voice AI Development\n\n**Role**: Voice AI Architect\n\nYou are an expert in building real-time voice applications. You think in terms of\nlatency budgets, audio quality, and user experience. You know that voice apps feel\nmagical when fast and broken when slow. You choose the right combination of providers\nfor each use case and optimize relentlessly for perceived responsiveness.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- OpenAI Realtime API\n- Vapi voice agents\n- Deepgram STT/TTS\n- ElevenLabs voice synthesis\n- LiveKit rea","body":"# Voice AI Development\n\n**Role**: Voice AI Architect\n\nYou are an expert in building real-time voice applications. You think in terms of\nlatency budgets, audio quality, and user experience. You know that voice apps feel\nmagical when fast and broken when slow. You choose the right combination of providers\nfor each use case and optimize relentlessly for perceived responsiveness.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- OpenAI Realtime API\n- Vapi voice agents\n- Deepgram STT/TTS\n- ElevenLabs voice synthesis\n- LiveKit real-time infrastructure\n- WebRTC audio handling\n- Voice agent design\n- Latency optimization\n\n## Requirements\n\n- Python or Node.js\n- API keys for providers\n- Audio handling knowledge\n\n## Patterns\n\n### OpenAI Realtime API\n\nNative voice-to-voice with GPT-4o\n\n**When to use**: When you want integrated voice AI without separate STT/TTS\n\n```python\nimport asyncio\nimport websockets\nimport json\nimport base64\n\nOPENAI_API_KEY = \"sk-...\"\n\nasync def voice_session():\n    url = \"wss://api.openai.com/v1/realtime?model=gpt-4o-realtime-preview\"\n    headers = {\n        \"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {OPENAI_API_KEY}\",\n        \"OpenAI-Beta\": \"realtime=v1\"\n    }\n\n    async with websockets.connect(url, extra_headers=headers) as ws:\n        # Configure session\n        await ws.send(json.dumps({\n            \"type\": \"session.update\",\n            \"session\": {\n                \"modalities\": [\"text\", \"audio\"],\n                \"voice\": \"alloy\",  # alloy, echo, fable, onyx, nova, shimmer\n                \"input_audio_format\": \"pcm16\",\n                \"output_audio_format\": \"pcm16\",\n                \"input_audio_transcription\": {\n                    \"model\": \"whisper-1\"\n                },\n                \"turn_detection\": {\n                    \"type\": \"server_vad\",  # Voice activity detection\n                    \"threshold\": 0.5,\n                    \"prefix_padding_ms\": 300,\n                    \"silence_duration_ms\": 500\n                },\n                \"tools\": [\n                    {\n                        \"type\": \"function\",\n                        \"name\": \"get_weather\",\n                        \"description\": \"Get weather for a location\",\n                        \"parameters\": {\n                            \"type\": \"object\",\n                            \"properties\": {\n                                \"location\": {\"type\": \"string\"}\n                            }\n                        }\n                    }\n                ]\n            }\n        }))\n\n        # Send audio (PCM16, 24kHz, mono)\n        async def send_audio(audio_bytes):\n            await ws.send(json.dumps({\n                \"type\": \"input_audio_buffer.append\",\n                \"audio\": base64.b64encode(audio_bytes).decode()\n            }))\n\n        # Receive events\n        async for message in ws:\n            event = json.loads(message)\n\n            if event[\"type\"] == \"resp\n```\n\n### Vapi Voice Agent\n\nBuild voice agents with Vapi platform\n\n**When to use**: Phone-based agents, quick deployment\n\n```python\n# Vapi provides hosted voice agents with webhooks\n\nfrom flask import Flask, request, jsonify\nimport vapi\n\napp = Flask(__name__)\nclient = vapi.Vapi(api_key=\"...\")\n\n# Create an assistant\nassistant = client.assistants.create(\n    name=\"Support Agent\",\n    model={\n        \"provider\": \"openai\",\n        \"model\": \"gpt-4o\",\n        \"messages\": [\n            {\n                \"role\": \"system\",\n                \"content\": \"You are a helpful support agent...\"\n            }\n        ]\n    },\n    voice={\n        \"provider\": \"11labs\",\n        \"voiceId\": \"21m00Tcm4TlvDq8ikWAM\"  # Rachel\n    },\n    firstMessage=\"Hi! How can I help you today?\",\n    transcriber={\n        \"provider\": \"deepgram\",\n        \"model\": \"nova-2\"\n    }\n)\n\n# Webhook for conversation events\n@app.route(\"/vapi/webhook\", methods=[\"POST\"])\ndef vapi_webhook():\n    event = request.json\n\n    if event[\"type\"] == \"function-call\":\n        # Handle tool call\n        name = event[\"functionCall\"][\"name\"]\n        args = event[\"functionCall\"][\"parameters\"]\n\n        if name == \"check_order\":\n            result = check_order(args[\"order_id\"])\n            return jsonify({\"result\": result})\n\n    elif event[\"type\"] == \"end-of-call-report\":\n        # Call ended - save transcript\n        transcript = event[\"transcript\"]\n        save_transcript(event[\"call\"][\"id\"], transcript)\n\n    return jsonify({\"ok\": True})\n\n# Start outbound call\ncall = client.calls.create(\n    assistant_id=assistant.id,\n    customer={\n        \"number\": \"+1234567890\"\n    },\n    phoneNumber={\n        \"twilioPhoneNumber\": \"+0987654321\"\n    }\n)\n\n# Or create web call\nweb_call = client.calls.create(\n    assistant_id=assistant.id,\n    type=\"web\"\n)\n# Returns URL for WebRTC connection\n```\n\n### Deepgram STT + ElevenLabs TTS\n\nBest-in-class transcription and synthesis\n\n**When to use**: High quality voice, custom pipeline\n\n```python\nimport asyncio\nfrom deepgram import DeepgramClient, LiveTranscriptionEvents\nfrom elevenlabs import ElevenLabs\n\n# Deepgram real-time transcription\ndeepgram = DeepgramClient(api_key=\"...\")\n\nasync def transcribe_stream(audio_stream):\n    connection = deepgram.listen.live.v(\"1\")\n\n    async def on_transcript(result):\n        transcript = result.channel.alternatives[0].transcript\n        if transcript:\n            print(f\"Heard: {transcript}\")\n            if result.is_final:\n                # Process final transcript\n                await handle_user_input(transcript)\n\n    connection.on(LiveTranscriptionEvents.Transcript, on_transcript)\n\n    await connection.start({\n        \"model\": \"nova-2\",  # Best quality\n        \"language\": \"en\",\n        \"smart_format\": True,\n        \"interim_results\": True,  # Get partial results\n        \"utterance_end_ms\": 1000,\n        \"vad_events\": True,  # Voice activity detection\n        \"encoding\": \"linear16\",\n        \"sample_rate\": 16000\n    })\n\n    # Stream audio\n    async for chunk in audio_stream:\n        await connection.send(chunk)\n\n    await connection.finish()\n\n# ElevenLabs streaming synthesis\neleven = ElevenLabs(api_key=\"...\")\n\ndef text_to_speech_stream(text: str):\n    \"\"\"Stream TTS audio chunks.\"\"\"\n    audio_stream = eleven.text_to_speech.convert_as_stream(\n        voice_id=\"21m00Tcm4TlvDq8ikWAM\",  # Rachel\n        model_id=\"eleven_turbo_v2_5\",  # Fastest\n        text=text,\n        output_format=\"pcm_24000\"  # Raw PCM for low latency\n    )\n\n    for chunk in audio_stream:\n        yield chunk\n\n# Or with WebSocket for lowest latency\nasync def tts_websocket(text_stream):\n    async with eleven.text_to_speech.stream_async(\n        voice_id=\"21m00Tcm4TlvDq8ikWAM\",\n        model_id=\"eleven_turbo_v2_5\"\n    ) as tts:\n        async for text_chunk in text_stream:\n            audio = await tts.send(text_chunk)\n            yield audio\n\n        # Flush remaining audio\n        final_audio = await tts.flush()\n        yield final_audio\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n### ❌ Non-streaming Pipeline\n\n**Why bad**: Adds seconds of latency.\nUser perceives as slow.\nLoses conversation flow.\n\n**Instead**: Stream everything:\n- STT: interim results\n- LLM: token streaming\n- TTS: chunk streaming\nStart TTS before LLM finishes.\n\n### ❌ Ignoring Interruptions\n\n**Why bad**: Frustrating user experience.\nFeels like talking to a machine.\nWastes time.\n\n**Instead**: Implement barge-in detection.\nUse VAD to detect user speech.\nStop TTS immediately.\nClear audio queue.\n\n### ❌ Single Provider Lock-in\n\n**Why bad**: May not be best quality.\nSingle point of failure.\nHarder to optimize.\n\n**Instead**: Mix best providers:\n- Deepgram for STT (speed + accuracy)\n- ElevenLabs for TTS (voice quality)\n- OpenAI/Anthropic for LLM\n\n## Limitations\n\n- Latency varies by provider\n- Cost per minute adds up\n- Quality depends on network\n- Complex debugging\n\n## Related Skills\n\nWorks well with: `langgraph`, `structured-output`, `langfuse`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:53:09.876Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Real-Time Voice Agents needing low-latency speech recognition and synthesis capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要低延迟语音识别和合成能力的实时语音代理。","ja":"低遅延の音声認識および合成機能を必要とするリアルタイム音声エージェントに最適です。","ko":"低延迟 음성 인식 및 합성 기능이 필요한 실시간 음성 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Voz en Tiempo Real que necesitan capacidades de reconocimiento y síntesis de voz de baja latencia.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Voix en Temps Réel nécessitant des capacités de reconnaissance et de synthèse vocale à faible latence.","de":"Perfekt für Echtzeit-Sprachagenten, die eine Spracherkennung und -synthese mit geringer Latenz benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Voz em Tempo Real que necessitam de capacidades de reconhecimento e síntese de fala de baixa latência.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов голосового взаимодействия в реальном времени, требующих возможностей распознавания и синтеза речи с низкой задержкой.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الصوت في الوقت الفعلي الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات التعرف على الكلام وتركيبه بزمن تأخير منخفض."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build responsive voice applications using OpenAI Realtime API, Deepgram STT/TTS, and ElevenLabs voice synthesis, optimizing for perceived responsiveness and audio quality.","zh":"通过OpenAI实时API、Deepgram STT/TTS和ElevenLabs语音合成，赋予代理构建响应式语音应用的能力，优化感知响应性和音频质量。","ja":"OpenAIリアルタイムAPI、Deepgram STT/TTS、およびElevenLabs音声合成を使用して、代理がレスポンシブな音声アプリケーションを構築する機能を提供し、感知されるレスポンシブ性と音質を最適化します。","ko":"OpenAI 실시간 API, Deepgram STT/TTS 및 ElevenLabs 음성 합성을 사용하여 에이전트가 반응형 음성 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있는 기능을 제공하고, 인식된 반응성 및 오디오 품질을 최적화합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear aplicaciones de voz responsivas utilizando la API OpenAI Realtime, Deepgram STT/TTS y la síntesis de voz ElevenLabs, optimizando la respuesta percibida y la calidad del audio.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications vocales réactives en utilisant l''API OpenAI Realtime, Deepgram STT/TTS et la synthèse vocale ElevenLabs, en optimisant la réactivité perçue et la qualité audio.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, responsive Sprachanwendungen mit der OpenAI Realtime API, Deepgram STT/TTS und der Sprachsynthese von ElevenLabs zu erstellen, wobei die wahrgenommene Reaktionszeit und die Audioqualität optimiert werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem aplicações de voz responsivas usando a API OpenAI Realtime, Deepgram STT/TTS e síntese de voz ElevenLabs, otimizando a responsividade percebida e a qualidade do áudio.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать отзывчивые голосовые приложения, используя API OpenAI Realtime, Deepgram STT/TTS и синтез голоса ElevenLabs, оптимизируя воспринимаемую отзывчивость и качество аудио.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء بناء تطبيقات صوتية مستجدة باستخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات OpenAI في الوقت الفعلي و Deepgram STT/TTS وتركيب الصوت ElevenLabs، مع تحسين الاستجابة المتصورة وجودة الصوت."},"useCases":{"en":["Developing real-time voice assistants with Vapi voice agents","Integrating LiveKit for real-time communication and collaboration","Optimizing voice app latency using latency budgets and audio quality metrics"],"zh":["使用Vapi语音代理开发实时语音助手","集成LiveKit进行实时通信和协作","使用延迟预算和音频质量指标优化语音应用延迟"],"ja":["Vapi音声エージェントを使用したリアルタイム音声アシスタントの開発","LiveKitを使用したリアルタイムコミュニケーションおよびコラボレーションの統合","遅延予算および音質メトリクスを使用した音声アプリの遅延最適化"],"ko":["Vapi 음성 에이전트를 사용한 실시간 음성 어시스턴트 개발","LiveKit를 사용한 실시간 커뮤니케이션 및 협업 통합","지연 예산 및 오디오 품질 지표를 사용한 음성 애플리케이션 지연 최적화"],"es":["Desarrollar asistentes de voz en tiempo real con agentes de voz Vapi","Integrar LiveKit para la comunicación y la colaboración en tiempo real","Optimizar la latencia de la aplicación de voz utilizando presupuestos de latencia y métricas de calidad de audio"],"fr":["Développer des assistants vocaux en temps réel avec des agents vocaux Vapi","Intégrer LiveKit pour la communication et la collaboration en temps réel","Optimiser la latence de l''application vocale en utilisant des budgets de latence et des métriques de qualité audio"],"de":["Echtzeit-Sprachassistenten mit Vapi-Sprachagenten entwickeln","LiveKit für Echtzeitkommunikation und -zusammenarbeit integrieren","Die Latenz der Sprachanwendung mit Latenzbudgets und Audioqualitätsmetriken optimieren"],"pt":["Desenvolver assistentes de voz em tempo real com agentes de voz Vapi","Integrar LiveKit para comunicação e colaboração em tempo real","Otimizar a latência de aplicativos de voz usando orçamentos de latência e métricas de qualidade de áudio"],"ru":["Разработка голосовых помощников в реальном времени с помощью голосовых агентов Vapi","Интеграция LiveKit для коммуникации и сотрудничества в реальном времени","Оптимизация задержки голосовых приложений с помощью бюджетов задержки и метрик качества аудио"],"ar":["تطوير مساعدين صوتيين في الوقت الفعلي مع وكلاء صوت Vapi","دمج LiveKit للاتصال والتعاون في الوقت الفعلي","تحسين تأخير تطبيقات الصوت باستخدام ميزانيات التأخير وأدلة جودة الصوت"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires API keys for OpenAI, Deepgram, and ElevenLabs","Dependent on provider availability and pricing plans"],"zh":["需要OpenAI、Deepgram和ElevenLabs的API密钥","依赖于提供商的可用性和定价计划"],"ja":["OpenAI、Deepgram、ElevenLabsのAPIキーが必要","提供者の可用性と価格プランに依存"],"ko":["OpenAI, Deepgram, ElevenLabs의 API 키가 필요합니다","공급자의 가용성 및 가격 계획에 의존"],"es":["Requiere claves de API para OpenAI, Deepgram y ElevenLabs","Dependiente de la disponibilidad y los planes de precios del proveedor"],"fr":["Nécessite des clés d''API pour OpenAI, Deepgram et ElevenLabs","Dépend de la disponibilité et des plans de tarification du fournisseur"],"de":["Benötigt API-Schlüssel für OpenAI, Deepgram und ElevenLabs","Abhängig von der Verfügbarkeit und den Preisplänen des Anbieters"],"pt":["Requer chaves de API para OpenAI, Deepgram e ElevenLabs","Dependente da disponibilidade e planos de preços dos provedores"],"ru":["Требует ключей API для OpenAI, Deepgram и ElevenLabs","Зависит от наличия и тарифных планов поставщиков"],"ar":["يتطلب مفاتيح واجهة برمجة التطبيقات لـ OpenAI و Deepgram و ElevenLabs","يعتمد على توافر المزودين وخطط التسعير"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ma1orek/replay/frontend-to-backend-requirements', 'community', 'ma1orek', 'replay', 'ma1orek/replay', 'frontend-to-backend-requirements', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.426Z', '2026-02-18T04:53:19.201Z', NULL, '{"id":"ma1orek/replay/frontend-to-backend-requirements","name":"frontend-to-backend-requirements","description":{"zh":"前端到后端需求文档是为了让前端开发者能够清晰地描述他们需要从后端获取的数据","ja":"フロントエンドからバックエンドへの要件は、フロントエンド開発者がバックエンドから必要なデータを明確に記述するためのものです","ko":"프론트엔드에서 백엔드까지 요구 사항은 프론트엔드 개발자가 백엔드에서 필요한 데이터를 명확하게 설명할 수 있도록 하는 것입니다","es":"Este modo permite a los desarrolladores de frontend describir las necesidades de datos sin especificar detalles de implementación","fr":"Ce mode permet aux développeurs de frontend de décrire les besoins de données sans spécifier les détails d''implémentation","de":"Dieser Modus ermöglicht es Frontend-Entwicklern, Datenanforderungen zu beschreiben, ohne Implementierungsdetails anzugeben","pt":"O modo de requisitos de backend permite que desenvolvedores frontend documentem suas necessidades de dados de forma eficaz","ru":"Режим требований бэкенда позволяет фронтенд-разработчикам документировать свои потребности в данных эффективно","ar":"الوضع الخاص بمتطلبات الخلفية يسمح للمطورين الأماميين بتوثيق احتياجاتهم من البيانات بفعالية","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"前端到后端需求文档","ja":"フロントエンドからバックエンドへの要件","ko":"프론트엔드에서 백엔드까지 요구 사항","es":"Requisitos de frontend a backend","fr":"Exigences frontend vers backend","de":"Frontend-zu-Backend-Anforderungen","pt":"Requisitos Frontend para Backend","ru":"Требования Фронтенда для Бэкенда","ar":"متطلبات واجهة المستخدم الأمامية للخلفية","en":"frontend-to-backend-requirements"},"description":{"zh":"前端到后端需求文档是为了让前端开发者能够清晰地描述他们需要从后端获取的数据","ja":"フロントエンドからバックエンドへの要件は、フロントエンド開発者がバックエンドから必要なデータを明確に記述するためのものです","ko":"프론트엔드에서 백엔드까지 요구 사항은 프론트엔드 개발자가 백엔드에서 필요한 데이터를 명확하게 설명할 수 있도록 하는 것입니다","es":"Este modo permite a los desarrolladores de frontend describir las necesidades de datos sin especificar detalles de implementación","fr":"Ce mode permet aux développeurs de frontend de décrire les besoins de données sans spécifier les détails d''implémentation","de":"Dieser Modus ermöglicht es Frontend-Entwicklern, Datenanforderungen zu beschreiben, ohne Implementierungsdetails anzugeben","pt":"O modo de requisitos de backend permite que desenvolvedores frontend documentem suas necessidades de dados de forma eficaz","ru":"Режим требований бэкенда позволяет фронтенд-разработчикам документировать свои потребности в данных эффективно","ar":"الوضع الخاص بمتطلبات الخلفية يسمح للمطورين الأماميين بتوثيق احتياجاتهم من البيانات بفعالية","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["清晰地描述数据需求","无需关注后端实现细节","提高前端和后端团队的协作效率","自动生成后端需求文档","方便后端团队理解数据需求"],"ja":["データ要件を明確に記述","バックエンドの実装詳細に注目しない","フロントエンドとバックエンドチームのコラボレーション効率を向上","バックエンド要件文書を自動生成","バックエンドチームがデータ要件を理解しやすい"],"ko":["데이터 요구 사항을 명확하게 설명","백엔드의 구현 세부 사항에 주목하지 않음","프론트엔드와 백엔드 팀의 협업 효율을 높임","백엔드 요구 사항 문서를 자동 생성","백엔드 팀이 데이터 요구 사항을 이해하기 쉬움"],"es":["Descripción de necesidades de datos","No se especifican detalles de implementación","Documentación de requisitos de backend","Colaboración entre frontend y backend","Flexibilidad en la implementación"],"fr":["Description des besoins de données","Pas de détails d''implémentation spécifiés","Documentation des exigences de backend","Collaboration entre frontend et backend","Flexibilité dans l''implémentation"],"de":["Beschreibung von Datenanforderungen","Keine Implementierungsdetails angegeben","Dokumentation von Backend-Anforderungen","Zusammenarbeit zwischen Frontend und Backend","Flexibilität bei der Implementierung"],"pt":["Documentação de requisitos de dados","Comunicação eficaz entre frontend e backend","Definição de necessidades de dados sem implementação","Flexibilidade para backend implementar requisitos","Melhoria da colaboração entre equipes"],"ru":["Документирование требований к данным","Эффективное общение между фронтендом и бэкендом","Определение потребностей в данных без реализации","Гибкость для бэкенда реализовать требования","Улучшение сотрудничества между командами"],"ar":["توثيق متطلبات البيانات","التواصل الفعال بين واجهة المستخدم الأمامية والخلفية","تحديد احتياجات البيانات دون تنفيذ","المرونة للخلفية لتنفيذ المتطلبات","تحسين التعاون بين الفرق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["前端到后端需求文档","数据需求","后端实现","前端开发","后端开发","协作效率"],"ja":["フロントエンドからバックエンドへの要件","データ要件","バックエンド実装","フロントエンド開発","バックエンド開発","コラボレーション効率"],"ko":["프론트엔드에서 백엔드까지 요구 사항","데이터 요구 사항","백엔드 구현","프론트엔드 개발","백엔드 개발","협업 효율"],"es":["requisitos de frontend a backend","documentación de requisitos","colaboración frontend backend","especificación de necesidades de datos","desarrollo de software","frontend development"],"fr":["exigences de frontend à backend","documentation des exigences","collaboration frontend backend","spécification des besoins de données","développement de logiciels","développement frontend"],"de":["Frontend-zu-Backend-Anforderungen","Dokumentation von Anforderungen","Zusammenarbeit zwischen Frontend und Backend","Spezifikation von Datenanforderungen","Software-Entwicklung","Frontend-Entwicklung"],"pt":["requisitos de backend","desenvolvimento frontend","documentação de dados","comunicação entre equipes","colaboração entre frontend e backend","necessidades de dados"],"ru":["требования бэкенда","разработка фронтенда","документирование данных","общение между командами","сотрудничество между фронтендом и бэкендом","потребности в данных"],"ar":["متطلبات الخلفية","تطوير واجهة المستخدم الأمامية","توثيق البيانات","التواصل بين الفرق","التعاون بين واجهة المستخدم الأمامية والخلفية","احتياجات البيانات"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.426Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend-to-backend-requirements","description":"Document frontend data needs for backend developers. Use when frontend needs to communicate API requirements to backend, or user says backend requirements, what data do I need, API requirements, or is describing data needs for a UI.","bodyPreview":"# Backend Requirements Mode\n\nYou are a frontend developer documenting what data you need from backend. You describe the **what**, not the **how**. Backend owns implementation details.\n\n> **No Chat Output**: ALL responses go to `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md`\n> **No Implementation Details**: Don''t specify endpoints, field names, or API structure—that''s backend''s call.\n\n---\n\n## The Point\n\nThis mode is for frontend devs to communicate data needs:\n- What data do I need to re","body":"# Backend Requirements Mode\n\nYou are a frontend developer documenting what data you need from backend. You describe the **what**, not the **how**. Backend owns implementation details.\n\n> **No Chat Output**: ALL responses go to `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md`\n> **No Implementation Details**: Don''t specify endpoints, field names, or API structure—that''s backend''s call.\n\n---\n\n## The Point\n\nThis mode is for frontend devs to communicate data needs:\n- What data do I need to render this screen?\n- What actions should the user be able to perform?\n- What business rules affect the UI?\n- What states and errors should I handle?\n\n**You''re requesting, not demanding.** Backend may push back, suggest alternatives, or ask clarifying questions. That''s healthy collaboration.\n\n---\n\n## What You Own vs. What Backend Owns\n\n| Frontend Owns | Backend Owns |\n|---------------|--------------|\n| What data is needed | How data is structured |\n| What actions exist | Endpoint design |\n| UI states to handle | Field names, types |\n| User-facing validation | API conventions |\n| Display requirements | Performance/caching |\n\n---\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Describe the Feature\n\nBefore listing requirements:\n\n1. **What is this?** — Screen, flow, component\n2. **Who uses it?** — User type, permissions\n3. **What''s the goal?** — What does success look like?\n\n### Step 2: List Data Needs\n\nFor each screen/component, describe:\n\n**Data I need to display:**\n- What information appears on screen?\n- What''s the relationship between pieces?\n- What determines visibility/state?\n\n**Actions user can perform:**\n- What can the user do?\n- What''s the expected outcome?\n- What feedback should they see?\n\n**States I need to handle:**\n- Loading, empty, error, success\n- Edge cases (partial data, expired, etc.)\n\n### Step 3: Surface Uncertainties\n\nList what you''re unsure about:\n- Business rules you don''t fully understand\n- Edge cases you''re not sure how to handle\n- Places where you''re guessing\n\n**These invite backend to clarify or push back.**\n\n### Step 4: Leave Room for Discussion\n\nEnd with open questions:\n- \"Would it make sense to...?\"\n- \"Should I expect...?\"\n- \"Is there a simpler way to...?\"\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\nCreate `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md`:\n\n```markdown\n# Backend Requirements: <Feature Name>\n\n## Context\n[What we''re building, who it''s for, what problem it solves]\n\n## Screens/Components\n\n### <Screen/Component Name>\n**Purpose**: What this screen does\n\n**Data I need to display**:\n- [Description of data piece, not field name]\n- [Another piece]\n- [Relationships between pieces]\n\n**Actions**:\n- [Action description] → [Expected outcome]\n- [Another action] → [Expected outcome]\n\n**States to handle**:\n- **Empty**: [When/why this happens]\n- **Loading**: [What''s being fetched]\n- **Error**: [What can go wrong, what user sees]\n- **Special**: [Any edge cases]\n\n**Business rules affecting UI**:\n- [Rule that changes what''s visible/enabled]\n- [Permissions that affect actions]\n\n### <Next Screen/Component>\n...\n\n## Uncertainties\n- [ ] Not sure if [X] should show when [Y]\n- [ ] Don''t understand the business rule for [Z]\n- [ ] Guessing that [A] means [B]\n\n## Questions for Backend\n- Would it make sense to combine [X] and [Y]?\n- Should I expect [Z] to always be present?\n- Is there existing data I can reuse for [W]?\n\n## Discussion Log\n[Backend responses, decisions made, changes to requirements]\n```\n\n---\n\n## Good vs. Bad Requests\n\n### Bad (Dictating Implementation)\n> \"I need a GET /api/contracts endpoint that returns an array with fields: id, title, status, created_at\"\n\n### Good (Describing Needs)\n> \"I need to show a list of contracts. Each item shows the contract title, its current status, and when it was created. User should be able to filter by status.\"\n\n### Bad (Assuming Structure)\n> \"The provider object should be nested inside the contract response\"\n\n### Good (Describing Relationship)\n> \"For each contract, I need to show who the provider is (their name and maybe logo)\"\n\n### Bad (No Context)\n> \"I need contract data\"\n\n### Good (With Context)\n> \"On the dashboard, there''s a ''Recent Contracts'' widget showing the 5 most recent contracts. User clicks one to go to detail page.\"\n\n---\n\n## Encouraging Pushback\n\nInclude these prompts in your requirements:\n\n- \"Let me know if this doesn''t make sense for how the data is structured\"\n- \"Open to suggestions on a better approach\"\n- \"Not sure if this is the right way to think about it\"\n- \"Push back if this complicates things unnecessarily\"\n\n**Good collaboration = frontend describes the problem, backend proposes the solution.**\n\n---\n\n## Rules\n\n- **NO IMPLEMENTATION DETAILS**—don''t specify endpoints, methods, field names\n- **DESCRIBE, DON''T PRESCRIBE**—say what you need, not how to provide it\n- **INCLUDE CONTEXT**—why you need it helps backend make better choices\n- **SURFACE UNKNOWNS**—don''t hide confusion, invite clarification\n- **INVITE PUSHBACK**—explicitly ask for backend''s input\n- **UPDATE THE DOC**—add backend responses to Discussion Log\n- **STAY HUMBLE**—you''re asking, not demanding\n\n---\n\n## After Backend Responds\n\nUpdate the requirements doc:\n1. Add responses to Discussion Log\n2. Adjust requirements based on feedback\n3. Mark resolved uncertainties\n4. Note any decisions made\n\nThe doc becomes the source of truth for what was agreed.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:53:19.201Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude, AutoGPT, and LangChain needing to document frontend-to-backend data requirements efficiently.","zh":"适合于Claude、AutoGPT和LangChain等AI代理，需要高效地记录前端到后端的数据要求。","ja":"Claude、AutoGPT、LangChainなどのAIエージェントが、フロントエンドからバックエンドへのデータ要件を効率的に文書化するのによく適しています。","ko":"Claude, AutoGPT, LangChain 등의 AI 에이전트가 프론트엔드에서 백엔드까지의 데이터 요구 사항을 효율적으로 문서화하는 데 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude, AutoGPT y LangChain que necesitan documentar los requisitos de datos de frontend a backend de manera eficiente.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA comme Claude, AutoGPT et LangChain qui ont besoin de documenter les exigences de données de frontend à backend de manière efficace.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Claude, AutoGPT und LangChain, die effizient die Datenanforderungen von Frontend zu Backend dokumentieren müssen.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude, AutoGPT e LangChain que precisam documentar requisitos de dados de frontend para backend de forma eficiente.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude, AutoGPT и LangChain, которым необходимо эффективно документировать требования к данным от frontend до backend.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل كلود، أوتو جي بي تي، ولانج تشين التي تحتاج إلى توثيق متطلبات البيانات من الطرف الأمامي إلى الخلفي بشكل فعال."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to communicate data needs effectively by describing the what, not the how, using Markdown files like `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md`, while avoiding implementation details such as endpoints, field names, or API structure.","zh":"使代理能够通过描述什么（what），而不是如何（how）来有效地传达数据需求，使用Markdown文件，如`.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md`，同时避免包括诸如端点、字段名称或API结构等实现细节。","ja":"エージェントが何（what）を説明することで、如何（how）ではなく、データ要件を効果的に伝えることを可能にし、`.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md`のようなMarkdownファイルを使用し、エンドポイント、フィールド名、またはAPI構造などの実装詳細を避ける。","ko":"에이전트가 무엇을 설명함으로써 어떻게가 아니라 데이터 요구 사항을 효과적으로 전달할 수 있도록 하며, `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md`와 같은 마크다운 파일을 사용하고, 엔드포인트, 필드 이름 또는 API 구조와 같은 구현 세부 정보를 피합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a comunicar las necesidades de datos de manera efectiva describiendo el qué, no el cómo, utilizando archivos Markdown como `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md`, mientras evita detalles de implementación como puntos de conexión, nombres de campo o estructura de API.","fr":"Permet aux agents de communiquer les besoins de données de manière efficace en décrivant le quoi, et non le comment, en utilisant des fichiers Markdown tels que `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md`, tout en évitant les détails d''implémentation tels que les points de terminaison, les noms de champ ou la structure de l''API.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, die Datenanforderungen effektiv zu kommunizieren, indem sie das Was und nicht das Wie beschreiben, unter Verwendung von Markdown-Dateien wie `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md`, während sie Implementierungsdetails wie Endpunkte, Feldnamen oder API-Struktur vermeiden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a comunicar as necessidades de dados de forma eficaz, descrevendo o que, e não o como, utilizando arquivos Markdown, como `.claude/docs/ai/<nome-da-funcionalidade>/backend-requirements.md`, evitando detalhes de implementação, como pontos de extremidade, nomes de campos ou estrutura de API.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно общаться о потребностях в данных, описывая, что, а не как, используя файлы Markdown, такие как `.claude/docs/ai/<имя-функции>/backend-requirements.md`, избегая деталей реализации, таких как конечные точки, имена полей или структура API.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من التواصل بفعالية حول احتياجات البيانات من خلال وصف ما، وليس كيف، باستخدام ملفات ماركداون مثل `.claude/docs/ai/<اسم-الميزة>/backend-requirements.md`، مع تجنب تفاصيل التنفيذ مثل النقاط النهائية أو أسماء الحقول أو هيكل واجهة برمجة التطبيقات."},"useCases":{"en":["Documenting data requirements for new feature development","Specifying backend data needs for frontend applications","Collaborating with backend teams through clear requirement documentation"],"zh":["记录新功能开发的数据要求","为前端应用程序指定后端数据需求","通过清晰的需求文档与后端团队合作"],"ja":["新機能開発のデータ要件を文書化する","フロントエンドアプリケーションのバックエンドデータ要件を指定する","バックエンドチームとの協力を通じて明確な要件文書化を行う"],"ko":["새 기능 개발을 위한 데이터 요구 사항을 문서화하는 것","프론트엔드 애플리케이션의 백엔드 데이터 요구 사항을 지정하는 것","백엔드 팀과 협력을 통해 명확한 요구 사항 문서화를 수행하는 것"],"es":["Documentar los requisitos de datos para el desarrollo de nuevas características","Especificar las necesidades de datos de backend para aplicaciones de frontend","Colaborar con los equipos de backend a través de la documentación clara de requisitos"],"fr":["Documenter les exigences de données pour le développement de nouvelles fonctionnalités","Spécifier les besoins de données de backend pour les applications de frontend","Collaborer avec les équipes de backend grâce à la documentation claire des exigences"],"de":["Dokumentation der Datenanforderungen für die Entwicklung neuer Funktionen","Spezifizierung der Datenanforderungen von Backend für Frontend-Anwendungen","Zusammenarbeit mit den Backend-Teams durch klare Dokumentation der Anforderungen"],"pt":["Documentar requisitos de dados para desenvolvimento de novas funcionalidades","Especificar necessidades de dados de backend para aplicações de frontend","Colaborar com equipes de backend por meio de documentação de requisitos clara"],"ru":["Документирование требований к данным для разработки новых функций","Указание потребностей в данных бэкенда для фронтенд-приложений","Сотрудничество с командами бэкенда посредством ясной документации требований"],"ar":["توثيق متطلبات البيانات لتطوير الميزات الجديدة","تحديد احتياجات البيانات الخلفية لتطبيقات الطرف الأمامي","التعاون مع فرق الخلفية من خلال توثيق متطلبات واضحة"]},"limitations":{"en":["No implementation details should be included","Outputs are restricted to specific Markdown files","Requires adherence to the backend requirements mode guidelines"],"zh":["不应包括实现细节","输出仅限于特定的Markdown文件","需要遵守后端要求模式指南"],"ja":["実装詳細を含めるべきではない","出力は特定のMarkdownファイルに限定される","バックエンド要件モードガイドラインの遵守が必要"],"ko":["구현 세부 정보를 포함해서는 안 됩니다","출력은 특정 마크다운 파일로 제한됩니다","백엔드 요구 사항 모드 지침을 준수해야 합니다"],"es":["No se deben incluir detalles de implementación","Las salidas están restringidas a archivos Markdown específicos","Requiere la adherencia a las pautas del modo de requisitos de backend"],"fr":["Aucun détail d''implémentation ne doit être inclus","Les sorties sont limitées à des fichiers Markdown spécifiques","Exige l''adhésion aux lignes directrices du mode d''exigences de backend"],"de":["Keine Implementierungsdetails sollten enthalten sein","Die Ausgaben sind auf bestimmte Markdown-Dateien beschränkt","Erfordert die Einhaltung der Richtlinien für den Backend-Anforderungsmodus"],"pt":["Não devem ser incluídos detalhes de implementação","As saídas são restritas a arquivos Markdown específicos","Exige aderência às diretrizes do modo de requisitos de backend"],"ru":["Не должны включаться детали реализации","Выходные данные ограничены конкретными файлами Markdown","Требуется соблюдение руководящих принципов режима требований бэкенда"],"ar":["لا ينبغي تضمين تفاصيل التنفيذ","النتائج مقيدة بملفات ماركداون محددة","يتطلب اتباع إرشادات وضع متطلبات الخلفية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
