{"zh":"验证脚本是项目质量检查的标准入口，提供单一命令运行所有质量检查","ja":"検証スクリプトはプロジェクトの品質チェックの標準エントリポイントであり、すべての品質チェックを単一のコマンドで実行する","ko":"검증 스크립트는 프로젝트 品질 체크의 표준 입구로 모든 품질 체크를 단일 명령어로 실행합니다","es":"El script de verificación es un punto de entrada estándar para la validación de proyectos, que ejecuta pruebas, linting, formato y verificación de tipos","fr":"Le script de vérification est un point d''entrée standard pour la validation des projets, qui exécute des tests, un linting, un formatage et une vérification ...","de":"Das Überprüfungsskript ist ein Standard-Eintragspunkt für die Überprüfung von Projekten, der Tests, Linting, Formatierung und Typüberprüfung ausführt","pt":"O script de verificação é um pré-requisito para planejamento de implementação, fornecendo uma comando único para executar todas as verificações de qualidade","ru":"Скрипт верификации является предварительным требованием для планирования реализации, предоставляя единую команду для выполнения всех проверок качества","ar":"سكريبت التحقق هو شرط مسبق للتخطيط التنفيذي، يقدم أمرًا واحدًا لتشغيل جميع عمليات التحقق من الجودة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["运行所有质量检查","支持测试、linting、格式化和类型检查","标准化的入口点","提高项目质量","简化质量检查流程"],"ja":["すべての品質チェックを実行","テスト、linting、フォーマット、タイプチェックをサポート","標準エントリポイント","プロジェクトの品質を向上","品質チェックのプロセスを簡素化"],"ko":["모든 品质 체크를 실행","테스트, linting, 형식화, 유형 검사를 지원","표준 입구점","프로젝트 品质을 향상","品质 체크 프로세스를 단순화"],"es":["Ejecuta pruebas unitarias y de integración","Realiza linting y formato de código","Verifica la compatibilidad de tipos","Proporciona un punto de entrada estándar para la validación","Permite la automatización de tareas de calidad"],"fr":["Exécute des tests unitaires et d''intégration","Effectue un linting et un formatage de code","Vérifie la compatibilité des types","Fournit un point d''entrée standard pour la validation","Permet l''automatisation des tâches de qualité"],"de":["Führt Einheitstests und Integrationstests aus","Führt Linting und Code-Formatierung durch","Überprüft die Typkompatibilität","Bietet einen Standard-Eintragspunkt für die Überprüfung","Ermöglicht die Automatisierung von Qualitätssicherungsaufgaben"],"pt":["Executa todas as verificações de qualidade","Forncece um comando único para validação","Compatível com ferramentas de teste e linting","Suporta formatação e verificação de tipo","Retorna código de saída 0 em caso de sucesso"],"ru":["Выполняет все проверки качества","Предоставляет единую команду для проверки","Компатибелен с инструментами тестирования и линтинга","Поддерживает форматирование и проверку типа","Возвращает код выхода 0 в случае успеха"],"ar":["يقوم بتشغيل جميع عمليات التحقق من الجودة","يقدم أمرًا واحدًا للتحقق","متوافق مع أدوات الاختبار والتنسيق","يدعم التنسيق والتحقق من النوع","يعيد رمز الخروج 0 في حالة النجاح"]},"keywords":{"zh":["验证脚本","项目质量检查","测试","linting","格式化","类型检查","标准化入口点"],"ja":["検証スクリプト","プロジェクト品質チェック","テスト","linting","フォーマット","タイプチェック","標準エントリポイント"],"ko":["검증 스크립트","프로젝트 品质 체크","테스트","linting","형식화","유형 검사","표준 입구점"],"es":["script de verificación","validación de proyectos","pruebas unitarias","linting","formato de código","verificación de tipos","automatización de calidad"],"fr":["script de vérification","validation de projets","tests unitaires","linting","formatage de code","vérification de types","automatisation de la qualité"],"de":["Überprüfungsskript","Projektvalidierung","Einheitstests","Linting","Code-Formatierung","Typüberprüfung","Automatisierung der Qualitätssicherung"],"pt":["script de verificação","verificação de qualidade","planejamento de implementação","ferramentas de teste","linting","formatação","verificação de tipo"],"ru":["скрипт верификации","проверка качества","планирование реализации","инструменты тестирования","линтинг","форматирование","проверка типа"],"ar":["سكريبت التحقق","التحقق من الجودة","تخطيط التنفيذ","أدوات الاختبار","التنسيق","التحقق من النوع","تشغيل عمليات التحقق"]}},"owner":"noviadi","repo":"agent-loop","repoPath":"noviadi/agent-loop","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.426Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"writing-verify-script","description":"Creates ./scripts/verify.sh, a standardized verification script that runs tests, linting, formatting, and type checking. Use when setting up a new project, creating CI/CD pipelines, or when ./scripts/verify.sh is missing.","bodyPreview":"# Writing the Verification Script\n\nThis document defines how to create `./scripts/verify.sh`, the standardized entry point for project validation.\n\n## Overview\n\nThe verification script is a **prerequisite** for implementation planning. It provides a single command that runs all quality checks (tests, linting, formatting, type checking) regardless of the underlying toolchain.\n\n```\n./scripts/verify.sh\n    ↓\n[Project-specific tools: tests, linter, formatter, type checker]\n    ↓\nExit 0 (success) or","body":"# Writing the Verification Script\n\nThis document defines how to create `./scripts/verify.sh`, the standardized entry point for project validation.\n\n## Overview\n\nThe verification script is a **prerequisite** for implementation planning. It provides a single command that runs all quality checks (tests, linting, formatting, type checking) regardless of the underlying toolchain.\n\n```\n./scripts/verify.sh\n    ↓\n[Project-specific tools: tests, linter, formatter, type checker]\n    ↓\nExit 0 (success) or non-zero (failure)\n```\n\n## Why a Wrapper Script?\n\n| Benefit | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| **Consistency** | Same command across all projects |\n| **Discoverability** | Agents and humans know where to look |\n| **Composability** | Can run multiple tools in sequence |\n| **CI alignment** | Script can be reused in CI pipelines |\n\n## Script Requirements\n\n### Location\n\nAlways: `./scripts/verify.sh`\n\n### Behavior\n\n1. Run all quality checks in sequence\n2. Exit with code 0 if all pass\n3. Exit with non-zero code on first failure\n4. Print clear output indicating what''s running\n\n### Checks to Include\n\n| Check Type | Purpose | Examples |\n|------------|---------|----------|\n| **Tests** | Verify behavior | `cargo test`, `npm test`, `go test`, `pytest` |\n| **Linting** | Catch bugs/style issues | `cargo clippy`, `eslint`, `golangci-lint`, `flake8` |\n| **Formatting** | Ensure consistent style | `cargo fmt --check`, `prettier --check`, `gofmt`, `black --check` |\n| **Type checking** | Catch type errors | `tsc --noEmit`, `mypy`, `pyright` |\n\nNot all projects need all checks. Include what''s relevant.\n\n### Script Constraints\n\nThe script must be:\n\n| Constraint | Reason |\n|------------|--------|\n| **Non-interactive** | No prompts, confirmations, or user input; must run unattended |\n| **Fail-fast** | Exit on first failure (`set -e`); don''t continue after errors |\n| **CI-safe** | Must work in CI environments without local dependencies |\n| **Deterministic** | Same code state → same result; no flaky tests |\n| **No network dependency** | Unless explicitly documented; offline-first |\n\n**Recommended additions:**\n- Print tool versions at start (helps debug CI vs local differences)\n- Use `set -euo pipefail` for strict error handling\n- Treat warnings as errors where applicable (e.g., `cargo clippy -- -D warnings`)\n\n## Examples by Project Type\n\n### Rust\n\n```bash\n#!/usr/bin/env bash\nset -euo pipefail\n\necho \"==> Running tests...\"\ncargo test\n\necho \"==> Running clippy...\"\ncargo clippy -- -D warnings\n\necho \"==> Checking formatting...\"\ncargo fmt --check\n\necho \"==> All checks passed!\"\n```\n\n### Node.js / TypeScript\n\n```bash\n#!/usr/bin/env bash\nset -euo pipefail\n\necho \"==> Type checking...\"\nnpm run typecheck  # or: npx tsc --noEmit\n\necho \"==> Running tests...\"\nnpm test\n\necho \"==> Linting...\"\nnpm run lint  # or: npx eslint .\n\necho \"==> Checking formatting...\"\nnpx prettier --check .\n\necho \"==> All checks passed!\"\n```\n\n### Go\n\n```bash\n#!/usr/bin/env bash\nset -euo pipefail\n\necho \"==> Running tests...\"\ngo test ./...\n\necho \"==> Running linter...\"\ngolangci-lint run\n\necho \"==> Checking formatting...\"\ntest -z \"$(gofmt -l .)\" || { echo \"Files need formatting\"; exit 1; }\n\necho \"==> All checks passed!\"\n```\n\n### Python\n\n```bash\n#!/usr/bin/env bash\nset -euo pipefail\n\necho \"==> Running tests...\"\npytest\n\necho \"==> Type checking...\"\nmypy .\n\necho \"==> Linting...\"\nflake8\n\necho \"==> Checking formatting...\"\nblack --check .\n\necho \"==> All checks passed!\"\n```\n\n### Multi-language / Monorepo\n\n```bash\n#!/usr/bin/env bash\nset -euo pipefail\n\necho \"==> Backend (Rust)...\"\n(cd backend && cargo test && cargo clippy -- -D warnings)\n\necho \"==> Frontend (TypeScript)...\"\n(cd frontend && npm test && npm run lint)\n\necho \"==> All checks passed!\"\n```\n\n## Script Template\n\n```bash\n#!/usr/bin/env bash\nset -euo pipefail\n\n# Verify script for [PROJECT_NAME]\n# Runs all quality checks required before committing code.\n\necho \"==> Running tests...\"\n# TODO: Add test command\n\necho \"==> Running linter...\"\n# TODO: Add lint command\n\necho \"==> Checking formatting...\"\n# TODO: Add format check command\n\necho \"==> All checks passed!\"\n```\n\n## Creating the Script\n\n1. Create `scripts/` directory if it doesn''t exist\n2. Create `verify.sh` using the template above\n3. Fill in project-specific commands\n4. Make executable: `chmod +x scripts/verify.sh`\n5. Test it: `./scripts/verify.sh`\n6. Commit the script\n\n## Prerequisite for Plan Writing\n\nBefore running gap analysis or writing `plans/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md`:\n\n1. Check if `./scripts/verify.sh` exists\n2. If missing, **stop and notify**:\n   ```\n   ⚠️ Verification script not found.\n\n   Before creating an implementation plan, create ./scripts/verify.sh\n   See docs/writing-verify-script.md for instructions.\n   ```\n3. Once the script exists and passes, proceed with plan writing\n\n## Checklist\n\nBefore using the verification script:\n\n**Setup:**\n- [ ] Script exists at `./scripts/verify.sh`\n- [ ] Script is executable (`chmod +x`)\n- [ ] Script uses `set -euo pipefail`\n\n**Checks included:**\n- [ ] Runs tests\n- [ ] Runs linter (if project has one)\n- [ ] Checks formatting (if project has formatter)\n- [ ] Runs type checker (if applicable)\n\n**Constraints met:**\n- [ ] Non-interactive (no prompts or user input)\n- [ ] Fails fast on first error\n- [ ] CI-safe (no local-only dependencies)\n- [ ] Deterministic (no flaky behavior)\n- [ ] Exits 0 on success, non-zero on failure\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:53:10.181Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for DevOps Agents needing automated project validation and quality checks via shell scripting","zh":"非常适合需要通过shell脚本自动化项目验证和质量检查的DevOps代理","ja":"DevOpsエージェントがシェルスクリプトを介して自動化されたプロジェクトの検証と品質チェックを必要とする場合に最適","ko":"쉘 스크립트를 통해 자동화된 프로젝트 검증 및 품질 검사를 필요로 하는 DevOps 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de DevOps que necesitan una validación de proyecto automatizada y controles de calidad a través de scripting de shell","fr":"Parfait pour les agents DevOps ayant besoin d''une validation de projet automatisée et de contrôles de qualité via le scripting shell","de":"Perfekt für DevOps-Agents, die eine automatisierte Projektnvalidierung und Qualitätskontrollen über Shell-Skripting benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes DevOps que necessitam de validação de projeto automatizada e verificações de qualidade via scripting de shell","ru":"Идеально для агентов DevOps, которым необходима автоматизированная проверка проекта и проверки качества через скриптинг shell","ar":"مثالي لعميل ديف أوبس الذين يحتاجون إلى التحقق التلقائي من مشروع والتحقق من الجودة عبر برمجة 셸"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to run comprehensive quality checks including tests, linting, formatting, and type checking through a standardized entry point like ./scripts/verify.sh, ensuring project integrity and facilitating implementation planning","zh":"赋予代理运行全面质量检查的能力，包括测试、linting、格式化和类型检查，通过标准化的入口点（如./scripts/verify.sh）确保项目的完整性并促进实施规划","ja":"エージェントがテスト、linting、フォーマット、タイプチェックなどを含む包括的な品質チェックを実行する能力を付与し、標準化されたエントリーポイント（例： ./scripts/verify.sh）を介してプロジェクトの完全性を確保し、実施計画を促進する","ko":"에이전트가 테스트, 린팅, 포맷팅, 타입 체킹 등을 포함한 포괄적인 품질 체크를 실행할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 표준화된 진입점(예: ./scripts/verify.sh)을 통해 프로젝트의 완전성을 보장하고 구현 계획을 촉진한다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar controles de calidad exhaustivos, incluyendo pruebas, linting, formato y verificación de tipos a través de un punto de entrada estandarizado como ./scripts/verify.sh, lo que garantiza la integridad del proyecto y facilita la planificación de la implementación","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des contrôles de qualité exhaustifs, y compris des tests, du linting, du formatage et de la vérification de types via un point d''entrée standardisé comme ./scripts/verify.sh, ce qui garantit l''intégrité du projet et facilite la planification de la mise en œuvre","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, umfassende Qualitätskontrollen durchzuführen, einschließlich Tests, Linting, Formatierung und Typüberprüfung über einen standardisierten Einstiegspunkt wie ./scripts/verify.sh, was die Integrität des Projekts gewährleistet und die Implementierungsplanung erleichtert","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar verificações de qualidade abrangentes, incluindo testes, linting, formatação e verificação de tipo por meio de um ponto de entrada padronizado como ./scripts/verify.sh, garantindo a integridade do projeto e facilitando o planejamento de implementação","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью запускать комплексные проверки качества, включая тесты, линтинг, форматирование и проверку типа через стандартизированную точку входа, такую как ./scripts/verify.sh, обеспечивая целостность проекта и облегчая планирование реализации","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تشغيل التحقق الشامل من الجودة، بما في ذلك الاختبارات وlinting والتنسيق والتحقق من النوع من خلال نقطة الدخول الموحدة مثل ./scripts/verify.sh، مما يضمن سلامة المشروع وتسهيل تخطيط التنفيذ"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating project validation","Running quality checks for tests and linting","Streamlining implementation planning with type checking and formatting verification"],"zh":["自动化项目验证","运行测试和linting的质量检查","通过类型检查和格式化验证来简化实施规划"],"ja":["プロジェクトの検証を自動化する","テストとlintingの品質チェックを実行する","タイプチェックとフォーマットの検証を通じて実施計画を簡素化する"],"ko":["프로젝트 검증을 자동화하는 것","테스트 및 린팅에 대한 품질 체크를 실행하는 것","타입 체킹 및 포맷팅 검증을 통해 구현 계획을 간소화하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar la validación de proyectos","Ejecutar controles de calidad para pruebas y linting","Optimizar la planificación de la implementación con verificación de tipos y formato"],"fr":["Automatiser la validation de projets","Exécuter des contrôles de qualité pour les tests et le linting","Optimiser la planification de la mise en œuvre avec vérification de types et de format"],"de":["Automatisierung der Projektnvalidierung","Durchführung von Qualitätskontrollen für Tests und Linting","Optimierung der Implementierungsplanung mit Typ- und Formatüberprüfung"],"pt":["Automatizar a validação do projeto","Executar verificações de qualidade para testes e linting","Otizar o planejamento de implementação com verificação de tipo e formatação"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверку проекта","Запускать проверки качества для тестов и линтинга","Оптимизировать планирование реализации с помощью проверки типа и форматирования"],"ar":["أتمتة التحقق من مشروع","تشغيل التحقق من الجودة للاختبارات وlinting","تحسين تخطيط التنفيذ مع التحقق من النوع والتنسيق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires shell access","Project-specific tools and toolchains must be configured"],"zh":["需要shell访问","项目特定的工具和工具链必须配置"],"ja":["シェルアクセスが必要","プロジェクト固有のツールとツールチェーンが構成されなければならない"],"ko":["쉘 액세스가 필요","프로젝트 특정 도구 및 도구 체인이 구성되어야 함"],"es":["Requiere acceso a shell","Las herramientas y cadenas de herramientas específicas del proyecto deben estar configuradas"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès shell","Les outils et les chaînes d''outils spécifiques au projet doivent être configurés"],"de":["Erfordert Shell-Zugriff","Projekt-spezifische Tools und Werkzeugketten müssen konfiguriert werden"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao shell","Ferramentas e cadeias de ferramentas específicas do projeto devem ser configuradas"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к shell","Программы и инструментальные цепочки, специфичные для проекта, должны быть настроены"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى shell","يجب.configuring أدوات ومجموعات أدوات محددة للمشروع"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
