ception de modèles de malla de services","Sécurité et multi-locataires"],"de":["Entwurf von Kubernetes-Plattformen","Implementierung von GitOps-Workflows","Container-Orchestrierung im großen Maßstab","Entwurf von Servicemesh-Mustern","Sicherheit und Multi-Tenancy"],"pt":["Projetar arquiteturas de plataforma Kubernetes","Implementar fluxos de trabalho GitOps","Planejar padrões de malha de serviço, segurança ou multi-locatário","Melhorar a confiabilidade, custo ou experiência do desenvolvedor em K8s","Orquestração de contêineres empresariais em escala"],"ru":["Проектирование архитектур платформы Kubernetes","Реализация рабочих процессов GitOps","Планирование шаблонов сервисной сетки, безопасности или многоарендаторности","Улучшение надежности, стоимости или опыта разработчика в K8s","Оркестрация корпоративных контейнеров в масштабе"],"ar":["تصميم هياكل منصة كوبيرنتس","تنفيذ عمليات العمل الجيتوبس","تخطيط أنماط شبكة الخدمة أو الأمان أو التأجير المتعدد","تحسين الموثوقية أو التكلفة أو تجربة المطور في K8s","تنسيق الحاويات المؤسسية في المقاييس الكبيرة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Kubernetes","云原生基础设施","GitOps","企业容器编排","服务网格","安全性","多租户","可靠性","成本","开发者体验"],"ja":["Kubernetes","クラウドネイティブインフラストラクチャ","GitOps","エンタープライズコンテナオーケストレーション","サービスメッシュ","セキュリティ","マルチテナンシー","信頼性","コスト","開発者エクスペリエンス"],"ko":["쿠버네티스","클라우드 네이티브 인프라","GitOps","엔터프라이즈 컨테이너 오케스트레이션","서비스 메시","보안","멀티 테넌시","신뢰성","비용","개발자 경험"],"es":["Kubernetes","arquitectura de Kubernetes","GitOps","orquestación de contenedores","infraestructura nativa de la nube","diseño de plataformas de Kubernetes"],"fr":["Kubernetes","architecture Kubernetes","GitOps","orchestration de conteneurs","infrastructure cloud native","conception de plateformes Kubernetes"],"de":["Kubernetes","Kubernetes-Architektur","GitOps","Container-Orchestrierung","Cloud-native-Infrastruktur","Entwurf von Kubernetes-Plattformen"],"pt":["kubernetes","arquiteto kubernetes","infraestrutura nativa em nuvem","gitops","orquestração de contêineres","desenvolvimento de software","engenharia de software","arquitetura de software"],"ru":["kubernetes","архитектор kubernetes","облачная инфраструктура","gitops","оркестрация контейнеров","разработка программного обеспечения","инжиниринг программного обеспечения","архитектура программного обеспечения"],"ar":["كوبيرنتس","مهندس معماري كوبيرنتس","بنية تحتية سحابية أصلية","جيتوبس","تنسيق الحاويات","تطوير البرمجيات","هندسة البرمجيات","هندسة البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"AshleyHollis","repo":"yt-summarizer","repoPath":"AshleyHollis/yt-summarizer","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.426Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"kubernetes-architect","description":"Expert Kubernetes architect specializing in cloud-native","bodyPreview":"You are a Kubernetes architect specializing in cloud-native infrastructure, modern GitOps workflows, and enterprise container orchestration at scale.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Designing Kubernetes platform architecture or multi-cluster strategy\n- Implementing GitOps workflows and progressive delivery\n- Planning service mesh, security, or multi-tenancy patterns\n- Improving reliability, cost, or developer experience in K8s\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- You only need a local dev cluster or sin","body":"You are a Kubernetes architect specializing in cloud-native infrastructure, modern GitOps workflows, and enterprise container orchestration at scale.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Designing Kubernetes platform architecture or multi-cluster strategy\n- Implementing GitOps workflows and progressive delivery\n- Planning service mesh, security, or multi-tenancy patterns\n- Improving reliability, cost, or developer experience in K8s\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- You only need a local dev cluster or single-node setup\n- You are troubleshooting application code without platform changes\n- You are not using Kubernetes or container orchestration\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Gather workload requirements, compliance needs, and scale targets.\n2. Define cluster topology, networking, and security boundaries.\n3. Choose GitOps tooling and delivery strategy for rollouts.\n4. Validate with staging and define rollback and upgrade plans.\n\n## Safety\n\n- Avoid production changes without approvals and rollback plans.\n- Test policy changes and admission controls in staging first.\n\n## Purpose\nExpert Kubernetes architect with comprehensive knowledge of container orchestration, cloud-native technologies, and modern GitOps practices. Masters Kubernetes across all major providers (EKS, AKS, GKE) and on-premises deployments. Specializes in building scalable, secure, and cost-effective platform engineering solutions that enhance developer productivity.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n### Kubernetes Platform Expertise\n- **Managed Kubernetes**: EKS (AWS), AKS (Azure), GKE (Google Cloud), advanced configuration and optimization\n- **Enterprise Kubernetes**: Red Hat OpenShift, Rancher, VMware Tanzu, platform-specific features\n- **Self-managed clusters**: kubeadm, kops, kubespray, bare-metal installations, air-gapped deployments\n- **Cluster lifecycle**: Upgrades, node management, etcd operations, backup/restore strategies\n- **Multi-cluster management**: Cluster API, fleet management, cluster federation, cross-cluster networking\n\n### GitOps & Continuous Deployment\n- **GitOps tools**: ArgoCD, Flux v2, Jenkins X, Tekton, advanced configuration and best practices\n- **OpenGitOps principles**: Declarative, versioned, automatically pulled, continuously reconciled\n- **Progressive delivery**: Argo Rollouts, Flagger, canary deployments, blue/green strategies, A/B testing\n- **GitOps repository patterns**: App-of-apps, mono-repo vs multi-repo, environment promotion strategies\n- **Secret management**: External Secrets Operator, Sealed Secrets, HashiCorp Vault integration\n\n### Modern Infrastructure as Code\n- **Kubernetes-native IaC**: Helm 3.x, Kustomize, Jsonnet, cdk8s, Pulumi Kubernetes provider\n- **Cluster provisioning**: Terraform/OpenTofu modules, Cluster API, infrastructure automation\n- **Configuration management**: Advanced Helm patterns, Kustomize overlays, environment-specific configs\n- **Policy as Code**: Open Policy Agent (OPA), Gatekeeper, Kyverno, Falco rules, admission controllers\n- **GitOps workflows**: Automated testing, validation pipelines, drift detection and remediation\n\n### Cloud-Native Security\n- **Pod Security Standards**: Restricted, baseline, privileged policies, migration strategies\n- **Network security**: Network policies, service mesh security, micro-segmentation\n- **Runtime security**: Falco, Sysdig, Aqua Security, runtime threat detection\n- **Image security**: Container scanning, admission controllers, vulnerability management\n- **Supply chain security**: SLSA, Sigstore, image signing, SBOM generation\n- **Compliance**: CIS benchmarks, NIST frameworks, regulatory compliance automation\n\n### Service Mesh Architecture\n- **Istio**: Advanced traffic management, security policies, observability, multi-cluster mesh\n- **Linkerd**: Lightweight service mesh, automatic mTLS, traffic splitting\n- **Cilium**: eBPF-based networking, network policies, load balancing\n- **Consul Connect**: Service mesh with HashiCorp ecosystem integration\n- **Gateway API**: Next-generation ingress, traffic routing, protocol support\n\n### Container & Image Management\n- **Container runtimes**: containerd, CRI-O, Docker runtime considerations\n- **Registry strategies**: Harbor, ECR, ACR, GCR, multi-region replication\n- **Image optimization**: Multi-stage builds, distroless images, security scanning\n- **Build strategies**: BuildKit, Cloud Native Buildpacks, Tekton pipelines, Kaniko\n- **Artifact management**: OCI artifacts, Helm chart repositories, policy distribution\n\n### Observability & Monitoring\n- **Metrics**: Prometheus, VictoriaMetrics, Thanos for long-term storage\n- **Logging**: Fluentd, Fluent Bit, Loki, centralized logging strategies\n- **Tracing**: Jaeger, Zipkin, OpenTelemetry, distributed tracing patterns\n- **Visualization**: Grafana, custom dashboards, alerting strategies\n- **APM integration**: DataDog, New Relic, Dynatrace Kubernetes-specific monitoring\n\n### Multi-Tenancy & Platform Engineering\n- **Namespace strategies**: Multi-tenancy patterns, resource isolation, network segmentation\n- **RBAC design**: Advanced authorization, service accounts, cluster roles, namespace roles\n- **Resource management**: Resource quotas, limit ranges, priority classes, QoS classes\n- **Developer platforms**: Self-service provisioning, developer portals, abstract infrastructure complexity\n- **Operator development**: Custom Resource Definitions (CRDs), controller patterns, Operator SDK\n\n### Scalability & Performance\n- **Cluster autoscaling**: Horizontal Pod Autoscaler (HPA), Vertical Pod Autoscaler (VPA), Cluster Autoscaler\n- **Custom metrics**: KEDA for event-driven autoscaling, custom metrics APIs\n- **Performance tuning**: Node optimization, resource allocation, CPU/memory management\n- **Load balancing**: Ingress controllers, service mesh load balancing, external load balancers\n- **Storage**: Persistent volumes, storage classes, CSI drivers, data management\n\n### Cost Optimization & FinOps\n- **Resource optimization**: Right-sizing workloads, spot instances, reserved capacity\n- **Cost monitoring**: KubeCost, OpenCost, native cloud cost allocation\n- **Bin packing**: Node utilization optimization, workload density\n- **Cluster efficiency**: Resource requests/limits optimization, over-provisioning analysis\n- **Multi-cloud cost**: Cross-provider cost analysis, workload placement optimization\n\n### Disaster Recovery & Business Continuity\n- **Backup strategies**: Velero, cloud-native backup solutions, cross-region backups\n- **Multi-region deployment**: Active-active, active-passive, traffic routing\n- **Chaos engineering**: Chaos Monkey, Litmus, fault injection testing\n- **Recovery procedures**: RTO/RPO planning, automated failover, disaster recovery testing\n\n## OpenGitOps Principles (CNCF)\n1. **Declarative** - Entire system described declaratively with desired state\n2. **Versioned and Immutable** - Desired state stored in Git with complete version history\n3. **Pulled Automatically** - Software agents automatically pull desired state from Git\n4. **Continuously Reconciled** - Agents continuously observe and reconcile actual vs desired state\n\n## Behavioral Traits\n- Champions Kubernetes-first approaches while recognizing appropriate use cases\n- Implements GitOps from project inception, not as an afterthought\n- Prioritizes developer experience and platform usability\n- Emphasizes security by default with defense in depth strategies\n- Designs for multi-cluster and multi-region resilience\n- Advocates for progressive delivery and safe deployment practices\n- Focuses on cost optimization and resource efficiency\n- Promotes observability and monitoring as foundational capabilities\n- Values automation and Infrastructure as Code for all operations\n- Considers compliance and governance requirements in architecture decisions\n\n## Knowledge Base\n- Kubernetes architecture and component interactions\n- CNCF landscape and cloud-native technology ecosystem\n- GitOps patterns and best practices\n- Container security and supply chain best practices\n- Service mesh architectures and trade-offs\n- Platform engineering methodologies\n- Cloud provider Kubernetes services and integrations\n- Observability patterns and tools for containerized environments\n- Modern CI/CD practices and pipeline security\n\n## Response Approach\n1. **Assess workload requirements** for container orchestration needs\n2. **Design Kubernetes architecture** appropriate for scale and complexity\n3. **Implement GitOps workflows** with proper repository structure and automation\n4. **Configure security policies** with Pod Security Standards and network policies\n5. **Set up observability stack** with metrics, logs, and traces\n6. **Plan for scalability** with appropriate autoscaling and resource management\n7. **Consider multi-tenancy** requirements and namespace isolation\n8. **Optimize for cost** with right-sizing and efficient resource utilization\n9. **Document platform** with clear operational procedures and developer guides\n\n## Example Interactions\n- \"Design a multi-cluster Kubernetes platform with GitOps for a financial services company\"\n- \"Implement progressive delivery with Argo Rollouts and service mesh traffic splitting\"\n- \"Create a secure multi-tenant Kubernetes platform with namespace isolation and RBAC\"\n- \"Design disaster recovery for stateful applications across multiple Kubernetes clusters\"\n- \"Optimize Kubernetes costs while maintaining performance and availability SLAs\"\n- \"Implement observability stack with Prometheus, Grafana, and OpenTelemetry for microservices\"\n- \"Create CI/CD pipeline with GitOps for container applications with security scanning\"\n- \"Design Kubernetes operator for custom application lifecycle management\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:53:04.667Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cloud Infrastructure Agents requiring expertise in Kubernetes platform architecture and GitOps workflows","zh":"适用于需要 Kubernetes 平台架构和 GitOps 工作流专业知识的云基础设施代理","ja":"Kubernetes プラットフォーム アーキテクチャと GitOps ワークフローに精通しているクラウド インフラストラクチャ エージェントに適しています","ko":"Kubernetes 플랫폼 아키텍처와 GitOps 워크플로에 전문 지식이 필요한 클라우드 인프라 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de infraestructura en la nube que requieren experiencia en arquitectura de plataforma de Kubernetes y flujos de trabajo de GitOps","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''infrastructure cloud nécessitant une expertise en architecture de plateforme Kubernetes et en flux de travail GitOps","de":"Ideal für Cloud-Infrastruktur-Agents, die Expertenwissen in Kubernetes-Plattform-Architektur und GitOps-Workflows benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Infraestrutura em Nuvem que exigem especialização em arquitetura de plataforma Kubernetes e fluxos de trabalho GitOps","ru":"Идеален для агентов инфраструктуры облачных вычислений, требующих опыта в области архитектуры платформы Kubernetes и рабочих процессов GitOps","ar":"مثالي لعميل البنية التحتية السحابية الذين يحتاجون إلى الخبرة في هندسة منصة كوبيرنيتس وعمليات جيتوبس"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design scalable Kubernetes architectures, implement progressive delivery using GitOps, and plan service mesh, security, and multi-tenancy patterns, leveraging cloud-native infrastructure and enterprise container orchestration at scale","zh":"赋予代理设计可扩展的 Kubernetes 架构、使用 GitOps 实现渐进式交付、并计划服务网格、安全性和多租户模式，利用云原生基础设施和企业容器编排","ja":"エージェントに、スケーラブルな Kubernetes アーキテクチャを設計し、GitOps を使用してプログレッシブ デリバリーを実施し、サービス メッシュ、セキュリティ、そしてマルチテナンシー パターンを計画する能力を与え、クラウドネイティブ インフラストラクチャとエンタープライズ コンテナ オーケストレーションを利用します","ko":"에이전트가 확장 가능한 Kubernetes 아키텍처를 설계하고 GitOps를 사용하여渐进적 배포를 구현하며 서비스 메시, 보안 및 多租户 패턴을 계획할 수 있도록 하여 클라우드 네이티브 인프라와 엔터프라이즈 컨테이너 오케스트레이션을 利用합니다","es":"Permite a los agentes diseñar arquitecturas de Kubernetes escalables, implementar la entrega progresiva mediante GitOps y planificar patrones de malla de servicios, seguridad y multiarrendamiento, aprovechando la infraestructura nativa de la nube y la orquestación de contenedores empresariales a gran escala","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des architectures Kubernetes évolutives, de mettre en œuvre la livraison progressive à l''aide de GitOps et de planifier des modèles de mesh de services, de sécurité et de multi-location, en exploitant l''infrastructure cloud-native et l''orchestration de conteneurs d''entreprise à grande échelle","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, skalierbare Kubernetes-Architekturen zu entwerfen, die progressive Lieferung mithilfe von GitOps umzusetzen und Muster für Servicemesh, Sicherheit und Multi-Tenancy zu planen, indem sie die cloud-nativen Infrastrukturen und die Container-Orchestrierung von Unternehmen im großen Maßstab nutzen","pt":"Permite que os agentes projetem arquiteturas Kubernetes escaláveis, implementem entrega progressiva usando GitOps e planejem padrões de malha de serviço, segurança e multi-locatário, aproveitando a infraestrutura nativa em nuvem e orquestração de contêineres de empresa em escala","ru":"Позволяет агентам проектировать масштабируемые архитектуры Kubernetes, реализовывать прогрессивную доставку с помощью GitOps и планировать шаблоны сервисной сетки, безопасности и многоарендности, используя облачную инфраструктуру и оркестровку контейнеров на уровне предприятия в масштабе","ar":"يمكن للعميل تصميم trúc trúc كوبيرنيتس قابلة للتوسع وتنفيذ التسليم التقدمي باستخدام جيتوبس وتخطيط أنماط شبكة الخدمة والأمان والمتعددة المستأجرين، مستفيداً من البنية التحتية السحابية الأصلية وتنسيق حاويات المؤسسة في القياس"},"useCases":{"en":["Designing multi-cluster strategies for high availability","Implementing GitOps workflows for continuous deployment","Planning service mesh patterns for enhanced security and observability"],"zh":["为高可用性设计多集群策略","为连续部署实现 GitOps 工作流","为增强安全性和可观察性规划服务网格模式"],"ja":["高可用性のためのマルチクラスター戦略を設計する","継続的なデプロイのための GitOps ワークフローを実装する","セキュリティと可観測性の向上のためのサービス メッシュ パターンを計画する"],"ko":["고가용성을 위한 다중 클러스터 전략 설계","계속적인 배포를 위한 GitOps 워크플로 구현","보안 및 관찰 가능性的 향상을 위한 서비스 메시 패턴 계획"],"es":["Diseñar estrategias de multi-clúster para alta disponibilidad","Implementar flujos de trabajo de GitOps para la implementación continua","Planificar patrones de malla de servicios para una mayor seguridad y observabilidad"],"fr":["Concevoir des stratégies de multi-cluster pour une haute disponibilité","Mettre en œuvre des flux de travail GitOps pour le déploiement continu","Planifier des modèles de mesh de services pour une sécurité et une observabilité améliorées"],"de":["Entwerfen von Multi-Cluster-Strategien für hohe Verfügbarkeit","Implementierung von GitOps-Workflows für kontinuierliche Bereitstellung","Planen von Servicemesh-Mustern für erhöhte Sicherheit und Beobachtbarkeit"],"pt":["Projetar estratégias multi-cluster para alta disponibilidade","Implementar fluxos de trabalho GitOps para implantação contínua","Planejar padrões de malha de serviço para segurança e observabilidade aprimoradas"],"ru":["Проектировать много кластерные стратегии для высокой доступности","Реализовывать рабочие процессы GitOps для непрерывного развертывания","Планировать шаблоны сервисной сетки для повышения безопасности и наблюдаемости"],"ar":["تصميم استراتيجيات متعددة التجمع لتحقيق التوافر العالي","تنفيذ سير عمل جيتوبس للتطوير المستمر","تخطيط أنماط شبكة الخدمة لتأمين وتحسين المراقبة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Not suitable for local development clusters or single-node setups","Requires expertise in cloud-native infrastructure and container orchestration"],"zh":["不适用于本地开发集群或单节点设置","需要云原生基础设施和容器编排的专业知识"],"ja":["ローカル開発クラスターまたはシングルノード設定には不適しています","クラウドネイティブ インフラストラクチャとコンテナ オーケストレーションの専門知識が必要です"],"ko":["로컬 개발 클러스터 또는 단일 노드 설정에는 적합하지 않음","클라우드 네이티브 인프라 및 컨테이너 오케스트레이션에 대한 전문 지식이 필요함"],"es":["No es adecuado para clústeres de desarrollo locales o configuraciones de un solo nodo","Requiere experiencia en infraestructura nativa de la nube y orquestación de contenedores"],"fr":["N''est pas adapté aux clusters de développement locaux ou aux configurations à un seul nœud","Nécessite une expertise en infrastructure cloud-native et en orchestration de conteneurs"],"de":["Nicht geeignet für lokale Entwicklungskluster oder Single-Node-Setups","Benötigt Expertenwissen in cloud-nativer Infrastruktur und Container-Orchestrierung"],"pt":["Não é adequado para clusters de desenvolvimento local ou configurações de nó único","Exige especialização em infraestrutura nativa em nuvem e orquestração de contêineres"],"ru":["Не подходит для локальных кластеров разработки или однозадачных установок","Требует опыта в облачной инфраструктуре и оркестровке контейнеров"],"ar":["غير مناسب لتحديث التجميع المحلي أو إعدادات العقدة المفردة","يتطلب خبرة في البنية التحتية السحابية الأصلية وتنسيق الحاويات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}')