Canva 연결이 필요","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS에 의존하여 툴 스키마를 얻음"],"es":["Requiere conexión de Rube MCP","Conexión activa de Canva a través de RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS necesaria","Dependiente de RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS para esquemas de herramientas"],"fr":["Nécessite une connexion Rube MCP","Connexion Canva active via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS nécessaire","Dépendant de RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS pour les schémas d''outils"],"de":["Benötigt Rube-MCP-Verbindung","Aktive Canva-Verbindung über RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS erforderlich","Abhängig von RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS für Werkzeugschemata"],"pt":["Requer conexão Rube MCP","Conexão ativa do Canva via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS necessária","Dependente de RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS para esquemas de ferramentas"],"ru":["Требует соединения Rube MCP","Активное соединение Canva через RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS необходимо","Зависит от RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS для схем инструментов"],"ar":["يتطلب اتصال Rube MCP","اتصال Canva النشط عبر RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS ضروري","يعتمد على RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS من أجل مخططات الأدوات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
