estruturas de SEO eficazes","Melhoria da visibilidade do site","Práticas recomendadas para otimização de mecanismos de busca","Verificação e validação de resultados","Estrutura de site personalizada"],"ru":["Руководство по эффективным SEO-структурам","Улучшение видимости сайта","Лучшие практики для оптимизации поисковых систем","Проверка и валидация результатов","Индивидуальная структура сайта"],"ar":["إرشادات للهياكل الفعالة لتحسين محركات البحث","تحسين وضوح الموقع","أفضل الممارسات لتحسين محركات البحث","التحقق والتحقق من النتائج","هيكل موقع مخصص"]},"keywords":{"zh":["SEO结构架构师","网站优化","搜索引擎排名","内容设计","最佳实践","网站结构","搜索引擎优化"],"ja":["SEO構造アーキテクト","ウェブサイト最適化","検索エンジンランキング","コンテンツ設計","ベストプラクティス","ウェブサイト構造","検索エンジン最適化"],"ko":["SEO 구조 아키텍트","웹사이트 최적화","검색 엔진 순위","콘텐츠 디자인","모범 사례","웹사이트 구조","검색 엔진 최적화"],"es":["arquitectura seo","optimización de sitio web","mejora de posicionamiento","estructura de sitio web","seo técnico","optimización para buscadores"],"fr":["architecture seo","optimisation de site web","amélioration de référencement","structure de site web","seo technique","optimisation pour les moteurs de recherche"],"de":["seo-struktur","website-optimierung","platzierung verbessern","website-struktur","technisches seo","optimierung für suchmaschinen"],"pt":["SEO","Estrutura de site","Otimização de mecanismos de busca","Visibilidade do site","Arquiteto de Estrutura de SEO","Práticas recomendadas de SEO"],"ru":["SEO","Структура сайта","Оптимизация поисковых систем","Видимость сайта","Архитектор SEO-структуры","Лучшие практики SEO"],"ar":["تحسين محركات البحث","هيكل الموقع","تحسين محركات البحث","وضوح الموقع","مهندس هيكل تحسين محركات البحث","أفضل الممارسات لتحسين محركات البحث"]}},"owner":"xiangteng007","repo":"XXT-AGENT","repoPath":"xiangteng007/XXT-AGENT","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.426Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"seo-structure-architect","description":"Analyzes and optimizes content structure including header","bodyPreview":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on seo structure architect tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for seo structure architect\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to seo structure architect\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are requir","body":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on seo structure architect tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for seo structure architect\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to seo structure architect\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\nYou are a content structure specialist analyzing and improving information architecture.\n\n## Focus Areas\n\n- Header tag hierarchy (H1-H6) analysis\n- Content organization and flow\n- Schema markup suggestions\n- Internal linking opportunities\n- Table of contents structure\n- Content depth assessment\n- Logical information flow\n\n## Header Tag Best Practices\n\n**SEO Guidelines:**\n- One H1 per page matching main topic\n- H2s for main sections with variations\n- H3s for subsections with related terms\n- Maintain logical hierarchy\n- Natural keyword integration\n\n## Siloing Strategy\n\n1. Create topical theme clusters\n2. Establish parent/child relationships\n3. Build contextual internal links\n4. Maintain relevance within silos\n5. Cross-link only when highly relevant\n\n## Schema Markup Priority\n\n**High-Impact Schemas:**\n- Article/BlogPosting\n- FAQ Schema\n- HowTo Schema\n- Review/AggregateRating\n- Organization/LocalBusiness\n- BreadcrumbList\n\n## Approach\n\n1. Analyze provided content structure\n2. Evaluate header hierarchy\n3. Identify structural improvements\n4. Suggest internal linking opportunities\n5. Recommend appropriate schema types\n6. Assess content organization\n7. Format for featured snippet potential\n\n## Output\n\n**Structure Blueprint:**\n```\nH1: Primary Keyword Focus\n├── H2: Major Section (Secondary KW)\n│   ├── H3: Subsection (LSI)\n│   └── H3: Subsection (Entity)\n└── H2: Major Section (Related KW)\n```\n\n**Deliverables:**\n- Header hierarchy outline\n- Silo/cluster map visualization\n- Internal linking matrix\n- Schema markup JSON-LD code\n- Breadcrumb implementation\n- Table of contents structure\n- Jump link recommendations\n\n**Technical Implementation:**\n- WordPress: TOC plugin config + schema plugin setup\n- Astro/Static: Component hierarchy + structured data\n- URL structure recommendations\n- XML sitemap priorities\n\n**Snippet Optimization:**\n- List format for featured snippets\n- Table structure for comparisons\n- Definition boxes for terms\n- Step-by-step for processes\n\nFocus on logical flow and scannable content. Create clear information hierarchy for users and search engines.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:53:55.635Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Digital Marketing Agents needing advanced SEO structure architecture capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级SEO结构架构能力的数字营销代理。","ja":"デジタルマーケティングエージェントが高度なSEO構造アーキテクチャ機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 SEO 구조 아키텍처 기능이 필요한 디지털 마케팅 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de marketing digital que necesitan capacidades de arquitectura de estructura de SEO avanzada.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de marketing numérique ayant besoin de capacités de structure d''architecture SEO avancées.","de":"Perfekt für digitale Marketingagenten, die erweiterte SEO-Struktur-Architektur-Fähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Marketing Digital que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de arquitetura de estrutura de SEO.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов цифрового маркетинга, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности архитектуры структуры SEO.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التسويقيين الرقميين الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة للهيكل المعماري لتحسين محركات البحث."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to architect SEO-friendly structures using best practices, checklists, and validation protocols, ensuring optimal content preview and workflow guidance.","zh":"赋予代理商使用最佳实践、清单和验证协议构建SEO友好结构的能力，确保内容预览和工作流程指导的最佳化。","ja":"ベストプラクティス、チェックリスト、検証プロトコルを使用してSEOに優しい構造を設計するエージェントをEmpowerし、コンテンツのプレビューとワークフローガイダンスを最適化します。","ko":"베스트 프랙티스, 체크리스트, 검증 프로토콜을 사용하여 SEO에 적합한 구조를 설계할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화하여 콘텐츠 미리 보기 및 워크플로우 가이드를 최적화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a arquitectar estructuras amigables con el SEO utilizando las mejores prácticas, listas de verificación y protocolos de validación, garantizando una vista previa óptima de contenido y orientación de flujo de trabajo.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des structures compatibles SEO en utilisant les meilleures pratiques, les listes de vérification et les protocoles de validation, garantissant une prévisualisation de contenu optimale et une orientation de flux de travail.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, SEO-freundliche Strukturen mithilfe von Best Practices, Checklisten und Validierungsprotokollen zu entwerfen, um eine optimale Vorschau des Inhalts und eine Arbeitsablaufsteuerung zu gewährleisten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar estruturas compatíveis com SEO, utilizando as melhores práticas, listas de verificação e protocolos de validação, garantindo uma pré-visualização ótima de conteúdo e orientação de fluxo de trabalho.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать структуры, дружественные к SEO, используя лучшие практики, чек-листы и протоколы проверки, обеспечивая оптимальное предварительное просмотр содержания и руководство по рабочему процессу.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على设计 ه