":["pruebas python","pytest","tdd","pruebas unitarias","pruebas de integración","desarrollo guiado por pruebas","simulación de dependencias","pruebas asíncronas","operaciones concurrentes"],"fr":["tests python","pytest","tdd","tests unitaires","tests d''intégration","développement piloté par les tests","simulation de dépendances","tests asynchrones","opérations concurrentes"],"de":["python tests","pytest","tdd","einheitliche tests","integrationstests","testgetriebene entwicklung","simulation externer abhängigkeiten","tests für asynchrone code","konkurrierende operationen"],"pt":["teste de software","python testing","pytest","TDD","testes unitários","testes de integração","fixtures","mocking"],"ru":["тестирование программного обеспечения","python тестирование","pytest","TDD","юнит-тесты","интеграционные тесты","фикстуры","мокинг"],"ar":["اختبار البرمجيات","بايثون اختبار","pytest","TDD","اختبارات الوحدة","اختبارات التكامل","الإعدادات الثابتة","التعليق"]}},"owner":"xiangteng007","repo":"XXT-AGENT","repoPath":"xiangteng007/XXT-AGENT","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.426Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"python-testing-patterns","description":"Implement comprehensive testing strategies with pytest, fixtures, mocking, and test-driven development. Use when writing Python tests, setting up test suites, or implementing testing best practices.","bodyPreview":"# Python Testing Patterns\n\nComprehensive guide to implementing robust testing strategies in Python using pytest, fixtures, mocking, parameterization, and test-driven development practices.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Writing unit tests for Python code\n- Setting up test suites and test infrastructure\n- Implementing test-driven development (TDD)\n- Creating integration tests for APIs and services\n- Mocking external dependencies and services\n- Testing async code and concurrent operations\n- Setting up","body":"# Python Testing Patterns\n\nComprehensive guide to implementing robust testing strategies in Python using pytest, fixtures, mocking, parameterization, and test-driven development practices.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Writing unit tests for Python code\n- Setting up test suites and test infrastructure\n- Implementing test-driven development (TDD)\n- Creating integration tests for APIs and services\n- Mocking external dependencies and services\n- Testing async code and concurrent operations\n- Setting up continuous testing in CI/CD\n- Implementing property-based testing\n- Testing database operations\n- Debugging failing tests\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to python testing patterns\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\n## Resources\n\n- `resources/implementation-playbook.md` for detailed patterns and examples.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:53:52.288Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Python Development Agents requiring robust testing capabilities with pytest and test-driven development practices.","zh":"适合需要使用pytest和测试驱动开发实践进行强大的测试功能的Python开发代理。","ja":"pytestとテスト駆動開発の手法を用いた堅牢なテスト機能を必要とするPython開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"pytest와 테스트 주도 개발 관행을 사용하여 강력한 테스트 기능을 필요로 하는 Python 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo de Python que requieren capacidades de prueba robustas con pytest y prácticas de desarrollo dirigidas por pruebas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement Python nécessitant des capacités de test robustes avec pytest et des pratiques de développement pilotées par les tests.","de":"Ideal für Python-Entwicklungsagenten, die robuste Testfunktionen mit pytest und testgetriebenen Entwicklungspraktiken erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Python que exigem capacidades de teste robustas com pytest e práticas de desenvolvimento orientado a testes.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки Python, требующих мощных возможностей тестирования с помощью pytest и практики разработки, ориентированной на тестирование.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطوير بايثون الذي يتطلب القدرات القوية للاختبار مع pytest وممارسات التطوير القائم على الاختبار."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement comprehensive testing strategies using fixtures, mocking, and parameterization, ensuring reliable unit tests and integration tests for APIs and services with pytest.","zh":"赋予代理实施使用fixture、mocking和参数化的全面测试策略的能力，确保使用pytest的API和服务的可靠单元测试和集成测试。","ja":"フィクスチャ、モッキング、パラメータ化を使用した包括的なテスト戦略を実装するエージェントの能力を付与し、pytestを使用したAPIおよびサービスに対する信頼性の高いユニットテストおよび統合テストを確保する。","ko":"fixture, mocking, парамет화 등을 사용하여 toàn面的 테스트 전략을 구현할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하며, pytest를 사용한 API 및 서비스에 대한 신뢰할 수 있는 단위 테스트 및 통합 테스트를 보장한다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar estrategias de prueba comprehensivas utilizando fixtures, mocking y parametrización, garantizando pruebas unitarias y de integración confiables para APIs y servicios con pytest.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des stratégies de test complètes en utilisant des fixtures, du mocking et de la paramétrisation, garantissant des tests unitaires et d''intégration fiables pour les API et les services avec pytest.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, umfassende Teststrategien mit Fixtures, Mocking und Parametrisierung umzusetzen, um zuverlässige Einheitstests und Integrationstests für APIs und Dienste mit pytest sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar estratégias de teste abrangentes usando fixtures, mocking e parametrização, garantindo testes unitários e de integração confiáveis para APIs e serviços com pytest.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовывать комплексные стратегии тестирования с использованием фикстур, имитации и параметризации, обеспечивая надежные модульные тесты и тесты интеграции для API и сервисов с