n 3.xのみ対応"],"ko":["pytest 설치가 필요","Python 3.x만 호환"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de pytest","Compatible solo con Python 3.x"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de pytest","Compatible uniquement avec Python 3.x"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von pytest","Nur mit Python 3.x kompatibel"],"pt":["Exige instalação do pytest","Compatível apenas com Python 3.x"],"ru":["Требует установки pytest","Совместим только с Python 3.x"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت pytest","متوافق فقط مع بايثون 3.x"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
