"事件存储设计","CQRS 模式","投影构建","事件版本控制","性能优化"],"ja":["イベントストア設計","CQRS パターン","投影の構築","イベントバージョニング","パフォーマンス最適化"],"ko":["이벤트 저장소 설계","CQRS 패턴","투영 구축","이벤트 버저닝","성능 최적화"],"es":["Diseño e implementación de almacenes de eventos","Patrones de CQRS para la segregación de responsabilidades","Construcción de proyecciones y optimización de modelos de lectura","Orquestación de sagas y gestores de procesos","Versionado de eventos y evolución de esquemas","Estrategias de instantáneas para el rendimiento"],"fr":["Conception et implémentation de magasins d''événements","Patterns de CQRS pour la ségrégation des responsabilités","Construction de projections et optimisation de modèles de lecture","Orchestration de sagas et de gestionnaires de processus","Versionnage d''événements et évolution de schémas","Stratégies de captures d''écran pour les performances"],"de":["Entwurf und Implementierung von Ereignisspeichern","CQRS-Muster für die Trennung von Verantwortlichkeiten","Erstellung von Projeaktionen und Optimierung von Lese-Modellen","Orchestrierung von Sagas und Prozessmanagern","Versionierung von Ereignissen und Schemaversion","Momentaufnahmestrategien für die Leistung"]},"keywords":{"zh":["事件源架构","CQRS","事件驱动系统","复杂域","审计跟踪","性能优化","事件版本控制"],"ja":["イベントソーシングアーキテクチャ","CQRS","イベントドリブンシステム","複雑なドメイン","監査トレイル","パフォーマンス最適化","イベントバージョニング"],"ko":["이벤트 소싱 아키텍처","CQRS","이벤트 驱动 시스템","복잡한 도메인","감사 추적","성능 최적화","이벤트 버저닝"],"es":["Event Sourcing","CQRS","arquitecturas orientadas a eventos","dominios complejos","sistemas con consistencia eventual","patrones de diseño","escalabilidad","flexibilidad"],"fr":["Event Sourcing","CQRS","architectures pilotées par événements","domaines complexes","systèmes à cohérence éventuelle","patterns de conception","évolvabilité","flexibilité"],"de":["Event Sourcing","CQRS","ereignisgesteuerte Architekturen","komplexe Domänen","Systeme mit letztendlicher Konsistenz","Entwurfsmuster","Skalierbarkeit","Flexibilität"]}},"owner":"itsimonfredlingjack","repo":"codex-dev-plugin","repoPath":"itsimonfredlingjack/codex-dev-plugin","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.426Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"event-sourcing-architect","description":"Expert in event sourcing, CQRS, and event-driven architecture patterns. Masters event store design, projection building, saga orchestration, and eventual consistency patterns. Use PROACTIVELY for event-sourced systems, audit trail requirements, or complex domain modeling with temporal queries.","bodyPreview":"You are an expert in Event Sourcing, CQRS, and event-driven architectures. Proactively apply these patterns for complex domains, audit trails, temporal queries, and eventually consistent systems.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- Event store design and implementation\n- CQRS (Command Query Responsibility Segregation) patterns\n- Projection building and read model optimization\n- Saga and process manager orchestration\n- Event versioning and schema evolution\n- Snapshotting strategies for performance\n- Eventual con","body":"You are an expert in Event Sourcing, CQRS, and event-driven architectures. Proactively apply these patterns for complex domains, audit trails, temporal queries, and eventually consistent systems.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- Event store design and implementation\n- CQRS (Command Query Responsibility Segregation) patterns\n- Projection building and read model optimization\n- Saga and process manager orchestration\n- Event versioning and schema evolution\n- Snapshotting strategies for performance\n- Eventual consistency handling\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Building systems requiring complete audit trails\n- Implementing complex business workflows with compensating actions\n- Designing systems needing temporal queries (\"what was state at time X\")\n- Separating read and write models for performance\n- Building event-driven microservices architectures\n- Implementing undo/redo or time-travel debugging\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Identify aggregate boundaries and event streams\n2. Design events as immutable facts\n3. Implement command handlers and event application\n4. Build projections for query requirements\n5. Design saga/process managers for cross-aggregate workflows\n6. Implement snapshotting for long-lived aggregates\n7. Set up event versioning strategy\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- Events are facts - never delete or modify them\n- Keep events small and focused\n- Version events from day one\n- Design for eventual consistency\n- Use correlation IDs for tracing\n- Implement idempotent event handlers\n- Plan for projection rebuilding\n\n## Output Format\n\n```xml\n<result>\n  <analysis>Brief analysis</analysis>\n  <solution>Implementation</solution>\n  <considerations>Trade-offs and notes</considerations>\n</result>\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:54:35.322Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced AI Agents like AutoGPT and LangChain requiring expertise in event-driven architectures and CQRS patterns","zh":"适用于 AutoGPT 和 LangChain 等高级 AI 代理，需要在事件驱动架构和 CQRS 模式方面具有专业知识","ja":"AutoGPT や LangChain などの高度な AI エージェントに適しており、イベント駆動アーキテクチャと CQRS パターンに関する専門知識が必要","ko":"AutoGPT와 LangChain 등의 고급 AI 에이전트에 적합하며, 이벤트 驅動 아키텍처 및 CQRS 패턴에 대한 전문 지식이 필요","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA avanzados como AutoGPT y LangChain que requieren experiencia en arquitecturas orientadas a eventos y patrones CQRS","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA avancés comme AutoGPT et LangChain nécessitant une expertise dans les architectures orientées aux événements et les modèles CQRS","de":"Ideal für fortgeschrittene KI-Agents wie AutoGPT und LangChain, die Expertenwissen in ereignisgesteuerten Architekturen und CQRS-Mustern erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Avançados como AutoGPT e LangChain que exigem conhecimento especializado em arquiteturas orientadas a eventos e padrões CQRS","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых агентов ИИ, таких как AutoGPT и LangChain, требующих опыта в событийно-ориентированных архитектурах и шаблонах CQRS","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الذكي المتقدم مثل AutoGPT و LangChain التي تتطلب خبرة في هندسة الحدث والتوجيه القائم على الحدث"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design and implement event stores, apply CQRS patterns, and optimize read models for complex domains, leveraging event versioning and schema evolution for eventually consistent systems, and utilizing protocols like event sourcing for audit trails and temporal queries","zh":"赋予代理设计和实现事件存储、应用 CQRS 模式、优化复杂域的读取模型的能力，利用事件版本和模式演化实现最终一致性系统，并使用事件源等协议进行审计跟踪和时间查询","ja":"エージェントにイベントストアの設計と実装、CQRS パターンの適用、複雑なドメインの読み取りモデルを最適化する能力を与え、イベントバージョニングとスキーマの進化を使用して最終的一貫性システムを実現し、イベントソーシングなどのプロトコルを使用して監査トレイルと時間クエリを行う","ko":"에이전트가 이벤트 저장소의 설계 및 구현, CQRS 패턴의 적용, 복잡한 도메인의 읽기 모델을 최적화하는 기능을 제공하며, 이벤트 버저닝 및 스키마 진화를 사용하여 궁극적으로 일관된 시스템을 구현하고, 이벤트 소싱 등의 프로토콜을 사용하여 감사 추적 및 시간 쿼리를 수행","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar e implementar almacenes de eventos, aplicar patrones CQRS y optimizar modelos de lectura para dominios complejos, aprovechando la versión de eventos y la evolución de esquemas para sistemas eventualmente coherentes, y utilizando protocolos como la fuente de eventos para auditorías y consultas temporales","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir et de mettre en œuvre des magasins d''événements, d''appliquer des modèles CQRS et d''optimiser les modèles de lecture pour des domaines complexes, en exploitant la version d''événements et l''évolution de schémas pour des systèmes finalement cohérents, et en utilisant des protocoles comme la source d''événements pour les auditorias et les requêtes temporales","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, Ereignisspeicher zu entwerfen und zu implementieren, CQRS-Muster anzuwenden und Lese-Modelle für komplexe Domänen zu optimieren, indem sie die Ereignisversionierung und die Schemaevolution für letztendlich konsistente Systeme nutzen und Protokolle wie die Ereignisquelle für Audit-Verläufe und temporale Abfragen verwenden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar e implementar armazenamentos de eventos, aplicar padrões CQRS, e otimizar modelos de leitura para domínios complexos, utilizando a versão de eventos e a evolução de esquemas para sistemas eventualmente consistentes, e utilizando protocolos como fonte de eventos para registros de auditoria e consultas temporais","ru":"Позволяет агентам проектировать и реализовывать хранилища событий, применять шаблоны CQRS, и оптимизировать модели чтения для сложных доменов, используя версионирование событий и эволюцию схем для систем, которые в конечном итоге являются согласованными, и используя протоколы, такие как источник событий, для аудиторских отчетов и временных запросов","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من تصميم وتطبيق مخازن الأحداث وتطبيق أنماط CQRS وتحسين نماذج القراءة للمجالات المعقدة، باستخدام إصدار الأحداث وتطور مخطط للنظام المتسق في النهاية، واستخدام بروتوكولات مثل مصدر الحدث لتسجيلات التدقيق والاستفسارات الزمنية"},"useCases":{"en":["Designing event stores for complex domains","Implementing CQRS patterns for audit trails and temporal queries","Optimizing read models for eventually consistent systems"],"zh":["为复杂域设计事件存储","为审计跟踪和时间查询实现 CQRS 模式","为最终一致性系统优化读取模型"],"ja":["複雑なドメインのイベントストアの設計","監査トレイルと時間クエリのための CQRS パターンの実装","最終的一貫性システムの読み取りモデルの最適化"],"ko":["복잡한 도메인의 이벤트 저장소 설계","감사 추적 및 시간 쿼리의ための CQRS 패턴 구현","궁극적으로 일관된 시스템의 읽기 모델 최적화"],"es":["Diseñar almacenes de eventos para dominios complejos","Implementar patrones CQRS para auditorías y consultas temporales","Optimizar modelos de lectura para sistemas eventualmente coherentes"],"fr":["Concevoir des magasins d''événements pour des domaines complexes","Mettre en œuvre des modèles CQRS pour les auditorias et les requêtes temporales","Optimiser les modèles de lecture pour des systèmes finalement cohérents"],"de":["Ereignisspeicher für komplexe Domänen entwerfen","CQRS-Muster für Audit-Verläufe und temporale Abfragen implementieren","Lese-Modelle für letztendlich konsistente Systeme optimieren"],"pt":["Projeto de armazenamentos de eventos para domínios complexos","Implementação de padrões CQRS para registros de auditoria e consultas temporais","Otimização de modelos de leitura para sistemas eventualmente consistentes"],"ru":["Проектирование хранилищ событий для сложных доменов","Реализация шаблонов CQRS для аудиторских отчетов и временных запросов","Оптимизация моделей чтения для систем, которые в конечном итоге являются согласованными"],"ar":["تصميم مخازن الأحداث للمجالات المعقدة","تطبيق أنماط CQRS لسجلات التدقيق والاستفسارات الزمنية","تحسين نماذج القراءة للنظام المتسق في النهاية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires expertise in event-driven architectures","Limited to systems supporting event sourcing and CQRS patterns"],"zh":["需要事件驱动架构的专业知识","仅限于支持事件源和 CQRS 模式的系统"],"ja":["イベント駆動アーキテクチャに関する専門知識が必要","イベントソーシングと CQRS パターンをサポートするシステムに限定"],"ko":["이벤트 驅動 아키텍처에 대한 전문 지식이 필요","이벤트 소싱 및 CQRS 패턴을 지원하는 시스템에 한정"],"es":["Requiere experiencia en arquitecturas orientadas a eventos","Limitado a sistemas que admiten la fuente de eventos y los patrones CQRS"],"fr":["Nécessite une expertise dans les architectures orientées aux événements","Limité aux systèmes prenant en charge la source d''événements et les modèles CQRS"],"de":["Erfordert Expertenwissen in ereignisgesteuerten Architekturen","Begrenzt auf Systeme, die die Ereignisquelle und die CQRS-Muster unterstützen"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento especializado em arquiteturas orientadas a eventos","Limitado a sistemas que suportam fonte de eventos e padrões CQRS"],"ru":["Требует опыта в событийно-ориентированных архитектурах","Ограничен для систем, поддерживающих источник событий и шаблоны CQRS"],"ar":["يتطلب خبرة في هندسة الحدث","محدود للنظم التي تدعم مصدر الحدث وأنماط CQRS"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('rokkay/doc2memo/subagent-driven-development', 'community', 'rokkay', 'doc2memo', 'rokkay/doc2memo', 'subagent-driven-development', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.426Z', '2026-02-18T04:54:20.254Z', NULL, '{"id":"rokkay/doc2memo/subagent-driven-development","name":"subagent-driven-development","description":{"zh":"子代理驱动开发是一种软件开发方法，通过为每个任务分配一个新鲜的子代理，并进行两阶段的审查，实现高效的迭代和高质量的代码","ja":"サブエージェント駆動開発は、各タスクに新しいサブエージェントを割り当て、2段階のレビューを行うことで、高効率のイテレーションと高品質のコードを実現するソフトウェア開発方法","ko":"서브 에이전트 주도 개발은 각 작업에 새로운 서브 에이전트를 할당하고 2단계의 검토를 수행하여 효율적인 반복과 고품질의 코드를 구현하는 소프트웨어 개발 방법","es":"El desarrollo impulsado por subagentes es una técnica que ejecuta planes de desarrollo mediante la creación de subagentes frescos por tarea, con una revisión de dos etapas después de cada una","fr":"Le développement piloté par des sous-agents est une technique qui exécute des plans de développement en créant des sous-agents frais par tâche, avec une révision en deux étapes après chacune","de":"Die subagenten-getriebene Entwicklung ist eine Technik, die Entwicklungspläne durch die Erstellung frischer Subagenten pro Aufgabe ausführt, mit einer Zwei-Stufen-Überprüfung nach jeder","pt":"O desenvolvimento dirigido por subagentes é uma abordagem que executa planos por meio de subagentes frescos por tarefa com revisões de dois estágios, garantindo alta qualidade e iteração rápida","ru":"Разработка на основе субагентов - это подход, который выполняет планы путем создания новых субагентов для каждой задачи с двухэтапной проверкой, обеспечивая высокое качество и быструю итерацию","ar":"التطوير الموجه بواسطة الوكلاء الفرعيين هو نهج يقوم بتنفيذ الخطط من خلال وكلاء فرعيين جدد لكل مهمة مع مراجعة مرحلة المراجعة، مما يضمن جودة عالية وتكرار سريع","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"子代理驱动开发 - 高效迭代的最佳实践","ja":"サブエージェント駆動開発 - 高品質な高速イテレーション","ko":"서브 에이전트 주도 개발 - 고품질의 빠른 반복","es":"Desarrollo impulsado por subagentes","fr":"Développement piloté par des sous-agents","de":"Subagenten-getriebene Entwicklung","pt":"Desenvolvimento Dirigido por Subagentes","ru":"Разработка на основе субагентов","ar":"التطوير الموجه بواسطة الوكلاء الفرعيين","en":"subagent-driven-development"},"description":{"zh":"子代理驱动开发是一种软件开发方法，通过为每个任务分配一个新鲜的子代理，并进行两阶段的审查，实现高效的迭代和高质量的代码","ja":"サブエージェント駆動開発は、各タスクに新しいサブエージェントを割り当て、2段階のレビューを行うことで、高効率のイテレーションと高品質のコードを実現するソフトウェア開発方法","ko":"서브 에이전트 주도 개발은 각 작업에 새로운 서브 에이전트를 할당하고 2단계의 검토를 수행하여 효율적인 반복과 고품질의 코드를 구현하는 소프트웨어 개발 방법","es":"El desarrollo impulsado por subagentes es una técnica que ejecuta planes de desarrollo mediante la creación de subagentes frescos por tarea, con una revisión...","fr":"Le développement piloté par des sous-agents est une technique qui exécute des plans de développement en créant des sous-agents frais par tâche, avec une révi...","de":"Die subagenten-getriebene Entwicklung ist eine Technik, die Entwicklungspläne durch die Erstellung frischer Subagenten pro Aufgabe ausführt, mit einer Zwei-S...","pt":"O desenvolvimento dirigido por subagentes é uma abordagem que executa planos por meio de subagentes frescos por tarefa com revisões de dois estágios, garanti...","ru":"Разработка на основе субагентов - это подход, который выполняет планы путем создания новых субагентов для каждой задачи с двухэтапной проверкой, обеспечивая ...","ar":"التطوير الموجه بواسطة الوكلاء الفرعيين هو نهج يقوم بتنفيذ الخطط من خلال وكلاء فرعيين جدد لكل مهمة مع مراجعة مرحلة المراجعة، مما يضمن جودة عالية وتكرار سريع","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["为每个任务分配一个新鲜的子代理","两阶段的审查：规范合规性审查和代码质量审查","高效的迭代和快速的反馈","提高代码质量和可维护性","适合大规模的软件开发项目"],"ja":["各タスクに新しいサブエージェントを割り当て","2段階のレビュー：仕様の準拠性レビューとコード品質レビュー","高効率のイテレーションと迅速なフィードバック","コード品質と保守性の向上","大規模なソフトウェア開発プロジェクトに適する"],"ko":["각 작업에 새로운 서브 에이전트를 할당","2단계의 검토：규격 준수 검토와 코드 품질 검토","효율적인 반복과 빠른 피드백","코드 품질과 유지 보수性的 향상","대규모의 소프트웨어 개발 프로젝트에 적합"],"es":["Ejecución de planes de desarrollo con subagentes frescos por tarea","Revisión de dos etapas: cumplimiento de especificaciones y calidad del código","Mejora de la calidad y velocidad de iteración en los proyectos","Flexibilidad para adaptarse a diferentes tipos de proyectos y tareas","Posibilidad de integración con herramientas de desarrollo existentes"],"fr":["Exécution de plans de développement avec des sous-agents frais par tâche","Révision en deux étapes : conformité aux spécifications et qualité du code","Amélioration de la qualité et de la vitesse d''itération dans les projets","Flexibilité pour s''adapter à différents types de projets et de tâches","Possibilité d''intégration avec des outils de développement existants"],"de":["Ausführung von Entwicklungsplänen mit frischen Subagenten pro Aufgabe","Zwei-Stufen-Überprüfung: Einhaltung von Spezifikationen und Code-Qualität","Verbesserung der Qualität und Iterationsgeschwindigkeit in den Projekten","Flexibilität zur Anpassung an verschiedene Projekt- und Aufgabentypen","Möglichkeit der Integration mit bestehenden Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Execução de planos por meio de subagentes frescos por tarefa","Revisões de dois estágios: conformidade com especificações e qualidade do código","Garantia de alta qualidade e iteração rápida","Tarefas independentes","Permanência na mesma sessão"],"ru":["Выполнение планов путем создания новых субагентов для каждой задачи","Двухэтапная проверка: соответствие спецификациям и качество кода","Обеспечение высокого качества и быстрой итерации","Независимые задачи","Оставаться в той же сессии"],"ar":["تنفيذ الخطط من خلال وكلاء فرعيين جدد لكل مهمة","مراجعة مرحلة المراجعة: مطابقة للمواصفات وجودة الكود","ضمان جودة عالية وتكرار سريع","مهام مستقلة","البقاء في الجلسة نفسها"]},"keywords":{"zh":["子代理驱动开发","软件开发方法","高效迭代","代码质量","两阶段审查","规范合规性审查","代码质量审查"],"ja":["サブエージェント駆動開発","ソフトウェア開発方法","高効率のイテレーション","コード品質","2段階のレビュー","仕様の準拠性レビュー","コード品質レビュー"],"ko":["서브 에이전트 주도 개발","소프트웨어 개발 방법","효율적인 반복","코드 품질","2단계의 검토","규격 준수 검토","코드 품질 검토"],"es":["desarrollo impulsado por subagentes","subagentes frescos","revisión de dos etapas","cumplimiento de especificaciones","calidad del código","velocidad de iteración","proyectos de desarrollo"],"fr":["développement piloté par des sous-agents","sous-agents frais","révision en deux étapes","conformité aux spécifications","qualité du code","vitesse d''itération","projets de développement"],"de":["subagenten-getriebene Entwicklung","frische Subagenten","Zwei-Stufen-Überprüfung","Einhaltung von Spezifikationen","Code-Qualität","Iterationsgeschwindigkeit","Entwicklungsprojekte"],"pt":["desenvolvimento dirigido por subagentes","subagentes","desenvolvimento de software","técnica de desenvolvimento","qualidade do código","iteração rápida"],"ru":["разработка на основе субагентов","субагенты","разработка программного обеспечения","техника разработки","качество кода","быстрая итерация"],"ar":["التطوير الموجه بواسطة الوكلاء الفرعيين","وكلاء فرعيين","تطوير البرمجيات","تقنية التطوير","جودة الكود","تكرار سريع"]}},"owner":"rokkay","repo":"doc2memo","repoPath":"rokkay/doc2memo","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.426Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"subagent-driven-development","description":"Use when executing implementation plans with independent tasks in the current session","bodyPreview":"# Subagent-Driven Development\n\nExecute plan by dispatching fresh subagent per task, with two-stage review after each: spec compliance review first, then code quality review.\n\n**Core principle:** Fresh subagent per task + two-stage review (spec then quality) = high quality, fast iteration\n\n## When to Use\n\n```dot\ndigraph when_to_use {\n    \"Have implementation plan?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Tasks mostly independent?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Stay in this session?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"subagent-driven-d","body":"# Subagent-Driven Development\n\nExecute plan by dispatching fresh subagent per task, with two-stage review after each: spec compliance review first, then code quality review.\n\n**Core principle:** Fresh subagent per task + two-stage review (spec then quality) = high quality, fast iteration\n\n## When to Use\n\n```dot\ndigraph when_to_use {\n    \"Have implementation plan?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Tasks mostly independent?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Stay in this session?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"subagent-driven-development\" [shape=box];\n    \"executing-plans\" [shape=box];\n    \"Manual execution or brainstorm first\" [shape=box];\n\n    \"Have implementation plan?\" -> \"Tasks mostly independent?\" [label=\"yes\"];\n    \"Have implementation plan?\" -> \"Manual execution or brainstorm first\" [label=\"no\"];\n    \"Tasks mostly independent?\" -> \"Stay in this session?\" [label=\"yes\"];\n    \"Tasks mostly independent?\" -> \"Manual execution or brainstorm first\" [label=\"no - tightly coupled\"];\n    \"Stay in this session?\" -> \"subagent-driven-development\" [label=\"yes\"];\n    \"Stay in this session?\" -> \"executing-plans\" [label=\"no - parallel session\"];\n}\n```\n\n**vs. Executing Plans (parallel session):**\n- Same session (no context switch)\n- Fresh subagent per task (no context pollution)\n- Two-stage review after each task: spec compliance first, then code quality\n- Faster iteration (no human-in-loop between tasks)\n\n## The Process\n\n```dot\ndigraph process {\n    rankdir=TB;\n\n    subgraph cluster_per_task {\n        label=\"Per Task\";\n        \"Dispatch implementer subagent (./implementer-prompt.md)\" [shape=box];\n        \"Implementer subagent asks questions?\" [shape=diamond];\n        \"Answer questions, provide context\" [shape=box];\n        \"Implementer subagent implements, tests, commits, self-reviews\" [shape=box];\n        \"Dispatch spec reviewer subagent (./spec-reviewer-prompt.md)\" [shape=box];\n        \"Spec reviewer subagent confirms code matches spec?\" [shape=diamond];\n        \"Implementer subagent fixes spec gaps\" [shape=box];\n        \"Dispatch code quality reviewer subagent (./code-quality-reviewer-prompt.md)\" [shape=box];\n        \"Code quality reviewer subagent approves?\" [shape=diamond];\n        \"Implementer subagent fixes quality issues\" [shape=box];\n        \"Mark task complete in TodoWrite\" [shape=box];\n    }\n\n    \"Read plan, extract all tasks with full text, note context, create TodoWrite\" [shape=box];\n    \"More tasks remain?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Dispatch final code reviewer subagent for entire implementation\" [shape=box];\n    \"Use superpowers:finishing-a-development-branch\" [shape=box style=filled fillcolor=lightgreen];\n\n    \"Read plan, extract all tasks with full text, note context, create TodoWrite\" -> \"Dispatch implementer subagent (./implementer-prompt.md)\";\n    \"Dispatch implementer subagent (./implementer-prompt.md)\" -> \"Implementer subagent asks questions?\";\n    \"Implementer subagent asks questions?\" -> \"Answer questions, provide context\" [label=\"yes\"];\n    \"Answer questions, provide context\" -> \"Dispatch implementer subagent (./implementer-prompt.md)\";\n    \"Implementer subagent asks questions?\" -> \"Implementer subagent implements, tests, commits, self-reviews\" [label=\"no\"];\n    \"Implementer subagent implements, tests, commits, self-reviews\" -> \"Dispatch spec reviewer subagent (./spec-reviewer-prompt.md)\";\n    \"Dispatch spec reviewer subagent (./spec-reviewer-prompt.md)\" -> \"Spec reviewer subagent confirms code matches spec?\";\n    \"Spec reviewer subagent confirms code matches spec?\" -> \"Implementer subagent fixes spec gaps\" [label=\"no\"];\n    \"Implementer subagent fixes spec gaps\" -> \"Dispatch spec reviewer subagent (./spec-reviewer-prompt.md)\" [label=\"re-review\"];\n    \"Spec reviewer subagent confirms code matches spec?\" -> \"Dispatch code quality reviewer subagent (./code-quality-reviewer-prompt.md)\" [label=\"yes\"];\n    \"Dispatch code quality reviewer subagent (./code-quality-reviewer-prompt.md)\" -> \"Code quality reviewer subagent approves?\";\n    \"Code quality reviewer subagent approves?\" -> \"Implementer subagent fixes quality issues\" [label=\"no\"];\n    \"Implementer subagent fixes quality issues\" -> \"Dispatch code quality reviewer subagent (./code-quality-reviewer-prompt.md)\" [label=\"re-review\"];\n    \"Code quality reviewer subagent approves?\" -> \"Mark task complete in TodoWrite\" [label=\"yes\"];\n    \"Mark task complete in TodoWrite\" -> \"More tasks remain?\";\n    \"More tasks remain?\" -> \"Dispatch implementer subagent (./implementer-prompt.md)\" [label=\"yes\"];\n    \"More tasks remain?\" -> \"Dispatch final code reviewer subagent for entire implementation\" [label=\"no\"];\n    \"Dispatch final code reviewer subagent for entire implementation\" -> \"Use superpowers:finishing-a-development-branch\";\n}\n```\n\n## Prompt Templates\n\n- `./implementer-prompt.md` - Dispatch implementer subagent\n- `./spec-reviewer-prompt.md` - Dispatch spec compliance reviewer subagent\n- `./code-quality-reviewer-prompt.md` - Dispatch code quality reviewer subagent\n\n## Example Workflow\n\n```\nYou: I''m using Subagent-Driven Development to execute this plan.\n\n[Read plan file once: docs/plans/feature-plan.md]\n[Extract all 5 tasks with full text and context]\n[Create TodoWrite with all tasks]\n\nTask 1: Hook installation script\n\n[Get Task 1 text and context (already extracted)]\n[Dispatch implementation subagent with full task text + context]\n\nImplementer: \"Before I begin - should the hook be installed at user or system level?\"\n\nYou: \"User level (~/.config/superpowers/hooks/)\"\n\nImplementer: \"Got it. Implementing now...\"\n[Later] Implementer:\n  - Implemented install-hook command\n  - Added tests, 5/5 passing\n  - Self-review: Found I missed --force flag, added it\n  - Committed\n\n[Dispatch spec compliance reviewer]\nSpec reviewer: ✅ Spec compliant - all requirements met, nothing extra\n\n[Get git SHAs, dispatch code quality reviewer]\nCode reviewer: Strengths: Good test coverage, clean. Issues: None. Approved.\n\n[Mark Task 1 complete]\n\nTask 2: Recovery modes\n\n[Get Task 2 text and context (already extracted)]\n[Dispatch implementation subagent with full task text + context]\n\nImplementer: [No questions, proceeds]\nImplementer:\n  - Added verify/repair modes\n  - 8/8 tests passing\n  - Self-review: All good\n  - Committed\n\n[Dispatch spec compliance reviewer]\nSpec reviewer: ❌ Issues:\n  - Missing: Progress reporting (spec says \"report every 100 items\")\n  - Extra: Added --json flag (not requested)\n\n[Implementer fixes issues]\nImplementer: Removed --json flag, added progress reporting\n\n[Spec reviewer reviews again]\nSpec reviewer: ✅ Spec compliant now\n\n[Dispatch code quality reviewer]\nCode reviewer: Strengths: Solid. Issues (Important): Magic number (100)\n\n[Implementer fixes]\nImplementer: Extracted PROGRESS_INTERVAL constant\n\n[Code reviewer reviews again]\nCode reviewer: ✅ Approved\n\n[Mark Task 2 complete]\n\n...\n\n[After all tasks]\n[Dispatch final code-reviewer]\nFinal reviewer: All requirements met, ready to merge\n\nDone!\n```\n\n## Advantages\n\n**vs. Manual execution:**\n- Subagents follow TDD naturally\n- Fresh context per task (no confusion)\n- Parallel-safe (subagents don''t interfere)\n- Subagent can ask questions (before AND during work)\n\n**vs. Executing Plans:**\n- Same session (no handoff)\n- Continuous progress (no waiting)\n- Review checkpoints automatic\n\n**Efficiency gains:**\n- No file reading overhead (controller provides full text)\n- Controller curates exactly what context is needed\n- Subagent gets complete information upfront\n- Questions surfaced before work begins (not after)\n\n**Quality gates:**\n- Self-review catches issues before handoff\n- Two-stage review: spec compliance, then code quality\n- Review loops ensure fixes actually work\n- Spec compliance prevents over/under-building\n- Code quality ensures implementation is well-built\n\n**Cost:**\n- More subagent invocations (implementer + 2 reviewers per task)\n- Controller does more prep work (extracting all tasks upfront)\n- Review loops add iterations\n- But catches issues early (cheaper than debugging later)\n\n## Red Flags\n\n**Never:**\n- Start implementation on main/master branch without explicit user consent\n- Skip reviews (spec compliance OR code quality)\n- Proceed with unfixed issues\n- Dispatch multiple implementation subagents in parallel (conflicts)\n- Make subagent read plan file (provide full text instead)\n- Skip scene-setting context (subagent needs to understand where task fits)\n- Ignore subagent questions (answer before letting them proceed)\n- Accept \"close enough\" on spec compliance (spec reviewer found issues = not done)\n- Skip review loops (reviewer found issues = implementer fixes = review again)\n- Let implementer self-review replace actual review (both are needed)\n- **Start code quality review before spec compliance is ✅** (wrong order)\n- Move to next task while either review has open issues\n\n**If subagent asks questions:**\n- Answer clearly and completely\n- Provide additional context if needed\n- Don''t rush them into implementation\n\n**If reviewer finds issues:**\n- Implementer (same subagent) fixes them\n- Reviewer reviews again\n- Repeat until approved\n- Don''t skip the re-review\n\n**If subagent fails task:**\n- Dispatch fix subagent with specific instructions\n- Don''t try to fix manually (context pollution)\n\n## Integration\n\n**Required workflow skills:**\n- **superpowers:using-git-worktrees** - REQUIRED: Set up isolated workspace before starting\n- **superpowers:writing-plans** - Creates the plan this skill executes\n- **superpowers:requesting-code-review** - Code review template for reviewer subagents\n- **superpowers:finishing-a-development-branch** - Complete development after all tasks\n\n**Subagents should use:**\n- **superpowers:test-driven-development** - Subagents follow TDD for each task\n\n**Alternative workflow:**\n- **superpowers:executing-plans** - Use for parallel session instead of same-session execution"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:54:20.254Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Autonomous Agents requiring efficient task execution and quality assurance through fresh subagent deployment and two-stage review processes.","zh":"适合于需要高效任务执行和质量保证的自治代理，通过部署新的子代理和两阶段审查过程来实现。","ja":"タスクの効率的な実行と品質保証が必要な自律エージェントに適しています。新しいサブエージェントの展開と二段階のレビュー処理を通じて実現します。","ko":"효율적인 작업 실행과 품질 보증이 필요한 자율 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 새로운 서브 에이전트를 배포하고 2단계 검토 과정을 통해 구현합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes Autónomos que requieren una ejecución de tareas eficiente y aseguramiento de la calidad a través de la implementación de subagentes frescos y procesos de revisión de dos etapas.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents Autonomes nécessitant une exécution de tâches efficiente et une assurance de la qualité grâce au déploiement de sous-agents frais et à des processus de révision en deux étapes.","de":"Ideal für autonome Agenten, die eine effiziente Aufgabenausführung und Qualitätsicherung durch die Bereitstellung von neuen Subagenten und zweistufigen Überprüfungsprozessen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Autônomos que requerem execução eficiente de tarefas e garantia de qualidade por meio do deploy de subagentes recém-criados e processos de revisão em duas etapas.","ru":"Идеально для автономных агентов, требующих эффективного выполнения задач и обеспечения качества посредством развертывания свежих субагентов и двухэтапных процессов проверки.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المستقلين الذين يحتاجون إلى تنفيذ كفء للمهام وضمان الجودة من خلال نشر وكلاء فرعيين جدد وعمليات استعراض على مرحلتين."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute plans with high quality and fast iteration by dispatching fresh subagents per task, leveraging spec compliance review and code quality review protocols, and facilitating seamless task management through dot notation and graph visualization.","zh":"赋予代理执行计划的能力，具有高质量和快速迭代，通过为每个任务派遣新的子代理，利用规格合规性审查和代码质量审查协议，并通过点表示法和图形可视化实现无缝的任务管理。","ja":"エージェントに、高品質と高速なイテレーションでプランを実行する能力を付与します。各タスクに新しいサブエージェントを派遣し、仕様の準拠性レビューとコード品質レビューのプロトコルを利用し、ドット表記とグラフの視覚化を通じてシームレスなタスク管理を実現します。","ko":"에이전트에 높은 品質과 빠른 반복으로 계획을 실행할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다. 각 작업에 새로운 서브 에이전트를派遣하고, 사양 준수 리뷰와 코드 품질 리뷰 프로토콜을 활용하며, 점 표기법과 그래프 시각화를 통해無鑛な 작업 관리를 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar planes con alta calidad y rápida iteración al enviar subagentes frescos por tarea, aprovechando los protocolos de revisión de cumplimiento de especificaciones y revisión de la calidad del código, y facilitando una gestión de tareas sin problemas a través de la notación de puntos y la visualización de grafos.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des plans avec une haute qualité et une itération rapide en dépêchant des sous-agents frais par tâche, en exploitant les protocoles de révision de conformité aux spécifications et de révision de la qualité du code, et en facilitant une gestion de tâches sans problème grâce à la notation par points et à la visualisation de graphes.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Pläne mit hoher Qualität und schneller Iteration auszuführen, indem sie pro Aufgabe neue Subagenten entsenden, die Protokolle für die Einhaltung von Spezifikationen und die Code-Qualitätsprüfung nutzen und eine reibungslose Aufgabenverwaltung durch die Punktnotation und die Graphvisualisierung ermöglichen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar planos com alta qualidade e iteração rápida, enviando subagentes recém-criados por tarefa, utilizando protocolos de revisão de conformidade de especificações e revisão de qualidade de código e facilitando a gestão de tarefas sem interrupção por meio de notação por pontos e visualização gráfica.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять планы с высоким качеством и быстрой итерацией, отправляя свежих субагентов на каждую задачу, используя протоколы проверки соответствия спецификациям и качества кода, и обеспечивая бесперебойное управление задачами посредством точечной нотации и графической визуализации.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بتنفيذ الخطط بدقة عالية وسرعة التكرار من خلال إرسال وكلاء فرعيين جدد لكل مهمة، واستخدام بروتوكولات مراجعة مطابقة للمواصفات ومراجعة جودة الشفرة، وتسهيل إدارة المهام دون انقطاع من خلال التدوين النقطي والتصوير البياني."},"useCases":{"en":["Dispatching fresh subagents for independent tasks","Implementing two-stage review processes for spec compliance and code quality","Visualizing task dependencies using graph notation"],"zh":["为独立任务派遣新的子代理","实施两阶段审查过程以确保规格合规性和代码质量","使用图形表示法可视化任务依赖关系"],"ja":["独立したタスクに新しいサブエージェントを派遣する","仕様の準拠性とコード品質を確保するための二段階のレビュー処理を実施する","グラフ表記を使用してタスクの依存関係を視覚化する"],"ko":["독립적인 작업에 새로운 서브 에이전트를派遣하는 것","사양 준수와 코드 품질을 보장하는 2단계 검토 과정을 구현하는 것","그래프 표기법을 사용하여 작업 의존 관계를 시각화하는 것"],"es":["Enviar subagentes frescos para tareas independientes","Implementar procesos de revisión de dos etapas para el cumplimiento de especificaciones y la calidad del código","Visualizar las dependencias de tareas utilizando la notación de grafos"],"fr":["Dépêcher des sous-agents frais pour des tâches indépendantes","Mettre en œuvre des processus de révision en deux étapes pour la conformité aux spécifications et la qualité du code","Visualiser les dépendances de tâches à l''aide de la notation de graphes"],"de":["Neue Subagenten für unabhängige Aufgaben entsenden","Zweistufige Überprüfungsprozesse für die Einhaltung von Spezifikationen und die Code-Qualität implementieren","Aufgabenabhängigkeiten mit Hilfe der Graphnotation visualisieren"],"pt":["Enviar subagentes recém-criados para tarefas independentes","Implementar processos de revisão em duas etapas para conformidade de especificações e qualidade de código","Visualizar dependências de tarefas usando notação gráfica"],"ru":["Отправка свежих субагентов для независимых задач","Реализация двухэтапных процессов проверки для соответствия спецификациям и качества кода","Визуализация зависимостей задач с помощью графической нотации"],"ar":["إرسال وكلاء فرعيين جدد للمهام المستقلة","تنفيذ عمليات استعراض على مرحلتين لمطابقة المواصفات وجودة الشفرة","تجسيم зависимости المهام باستخدام التدوين البياني"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires implementation plan with mostly independent tasks","Limited to agents capable of dispatching fresh subagents per task"],"zh":["需要具有大部分独立任务的实现计划","仅限于能够为每个任务派遣新的子代理的代理"],"ja":["大部分が独立したタスクを持つ実装計画が必要","各タスクに新しいサブエージェントを派遣できるエージェントにのみ適用可能"],"ko":["대부분 독립적인 작업을 갖는 구현 계획이 필요","각 작업에 새로운 서브 에이전트를派遣할 수 있는 에이전트로 제한"],"es":["Requiere un plan de implementación con tareas mayoritariamente independientes","Limitado a agentes capaces de enviar subagentes frescos por tarea"],"fr":["Nécessite un plan de mise en œuvre avec des tâches majoritairement indépendantes","Limité aux agents capables de dépêcher des sous-agents frais par tâche"],"de":["Erfordert einen Implementierungsplan mit überwiegend unabhängigen Aufgaben","Begrenzt auf Agenten, die pro Aufgabe neue Subagenten entsenden können"],"pt":["Requer um plano de implementação com tarefas principalmente independentes","Limitado a agentes capazes de enviar subagentes recém-criados por tarefa"],"ru":["Требует плана реализации с в основном независимыми задачами","Ограничен агентами, способными отправлять свежих субагентов на каждую задачу"],"ar":["يتطلب خطة تنفيذ مع مهام مستقلة في الغالب","محدود بالوكلاء القادرين على إرسال وكلاء فرعيين جدد لكل مهمة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
