t/React","Otimização de desempenho nativo","Otimização de bundling","Guia de padrões de código","Comandos de shell para medição de desempenho"],"ru":["Оптимизация JavaScript/React","Оптимизация родного производительности","Оптимизация пакетирования","Руководство по шаблонам кода","Команды shell для измерения производительности"],"ar":["تحسين جافاسكريبت/رياكت","تحسين الأداء الأصلي","تحسين حزمة","دليل أنماط الكود","أوامر شل لقياس الأداء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["React Native","性能优化","JavaScript","React","Native","iOS","Android","打包优化"],"ja":["React Native","パフォーマンス最適化","JavaScript","React","ネイティブ","iOS","Android","バンドル最適化"],"ko":["React Native","성능 최적화","JavaScript","React","네이티브","ios","Android","번들링 최적화"],"es":["React Native","optimización de rendimiento","mejores prácticas","JavaScript","React","Native","iOS","Android","empaquetado"],"fr":["React Native","optimisation des performances","bonnes pratiques","JavaScript","React","Native","iOS","Android","packaging"],"de":["React Native","Leistungsoptimierung","Best Practices","JavaScript","React","Native","iOS","Android","Bundling"],"pt":["React Native","Otimização de desempenho","JavaScript","React","Desenvolvimento móvel","Bundling","Padrões de código"],"ru":["React Native","Оптимизация производительности","JavaScript","React","Мобильная разработка","Пакетирование","Шаблоны кода"],"ar":["رياكت نيتيف","تحسين الأداء","جافاسكريبت","رياكت","تطوير الهاتف المحمول","تحسين حزمة","أنماط الكود"]}},"owner":"EverHouse","repo":"everclubapp","repoPath":"EverHouse/everclubapp","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.426Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"react-native-best-practices","description":"Provides React Native performance optimization guidelines for FPS, TTI, bundle size, memory leaks, re-renders, and animations. Applies to tasks involving Hermes optimization, JS thread blocking, bridge overhead, FlashList, native modules, or debugging jank and frame drops.","tags":"react-native, expo, performance, optimization, profiling","bodyPreview":"# React Native Best Practices\n\n## Overview\n\nPerformance optimization guide for React Native applications, covering JavaScript/React, Native (iOS/Android), and bundling optimizations. Based on Callstack''s \"Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization\".\n\n## Skill Format\n\nEach reference file follows a hybrid format for fast lookup and deep understanding:\n\n- **Quick Pattern**: Incorrect/Correct code snippets for immediate pattern matching\n- **Quick Command**: Shell commands for process/measurement sk","body":"# React Native Best Practices\n\n## Overview\n\nPerformance optimization guide for React Native applications, covering JavaScript/React, Native (iOS/Android), and bundling optimizations. Based on Callstack''s \"Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization\".\n\n## Skill Format\n\nEach reference file follows a hybrid format for fast lookup and deep understanding:\n\n- **Quick Pattern**: Incorrect/Correct code snippets for immediate pattern matching\n- **Quick Command**: Shell commands for process/measurement skills\n- **Quick Config**: Configuration snippets for setup-focused skills\n- **Quick Reference**: Summary tables for conceptual skills\n- **Deep Dive**: Full context with When to Use, Prerequisites, Step-by-Step, Common Pitfalls\n\n**Impact ratings**: CRITICAL (fix immediately), HIGH (significant improvement), MEDIUM (worthwhile optimization)\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Debugging slow/janky UI or animations\n- Investigating memory leaks (JS or native)\n- Optimizing app startup time (TTI)\n- Reducing bundle or app size\n- Writing native modules (Turbo Modules)\n- Profiling React Native performance\n- Reviewing React Native code for performance\n\n## Priority-Ordered Guidelines\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | FPS & Re-renders | CRITICAL | `js-*` |\n| 2 | Bundle Size | CRITICAL | `bundle-*` |\n| 3 | TTI Optimization | HIGH | `native-*`, `bundle-*` |\n| 4 | Native Performance | HIGH | `native-*` |\n| 5 | Memory Management | MEDIUM-HIGH | `js-*`, `native-*` |\n| 6 | Animations | MEDIUM | `js-*` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Critical: FPS & Re-renders\n\n**Profile first:**\n```bash\n# Open React Native DevTools\n# Press ''j'' in Metro, or shake device → \"Open DevTools\"\n```\n\n**Common fixes:**\n- Replace ScrollView with FlatList/FlashList for lists\n- Use React Compiler for automatic memoization\n- Use atomic state (Jotai/Zustand) to reduce re-renders\n- Use `useDeferredValue` for expensive computations\n\n### Critical: Bundle Size\n\n**Analyze bundle:**\n```bash\nnpx react-native bundle \\\n  --entry-file index.js \\\n  --bundle-output output.js \\\n  --platform ios \\\n  --sourcemap-output output.js.map \\\n  --dev false --minify true\n\nnpx source-map-explorer output.js --no-border-checks\n```\n\n**Common fixes:**\n- Avoid barrel imports (import directly from source)\n- Remove unnecessary Intl polyfills (Hermes has native support)\n- Enable tree shaking (Expo SDK 52+ or Re.Pack)\n- Enable R8 for Android native code shrinking\n\n### High: TTI Optimization\n\n**Measure TTI:**\n- Use `react-native-performance` for markers\n- Only measure cold starts (exclude warm/hot/prewarm)\n\n**Common fixes:**\n- Disable JS bundle compression on Android (enables Hermes mmap)\n- Use native navigation (react-native-screens)\n- Preload commonly-used expensive screens before navigating to them\n\n### High: Native Performance\n\n**Profile native:**\n- iOS: Xcode Instruments → Time Profiler\n- Android: Android Studio → CPU Profiler\n\n**Common fixes:**\n- Use background threads for heavy native work\n- Prefer async over sync Turbo Module methods\n- Use C++ for cross-platform performance-critical code\n\n## References\n\nFull documentation with code examples in [references/][references]:\n\n### JavaScript/React (`js-*`)\n\n| File | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| [js-lists-flatlist-flashlist.md][js-lists-flatlist-flashlist] | CRITICAL | Replace ScrollView with virtualized lists |\n| [js-profile-react.md][js-profile-react] | MEDIUM | React DevTools profiling |\n| [js-measure-fps.md][js-measure-fps] | HIGH | FPS monitoring and measurement |\n| [js-memory-leaks.md][js-memory-leaks] | MEDIUM | JS memory leak hunting |\n| [js-atomic-state.md][js-atomic-state] | HIGH | Jotai/Zustand patterns |\n| [js-concurrent-react.md][js-concurrent-react] | HIGH | useDeferredValue, useTransition |\n| [js-react-compiler.md][js-react-compiler] | HIGH | Automatic memoization |\n| [js-animations-reanimated.md][js-animations-reanimated] | MEDIUM | Reanimated worklets |\n| [js-uncontrolled-components.md][js-uncontrolled-components] | HIGH | TextInput optimization |\n\n### Native (`native-*`)\n\n| File | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| [native-turbo-modules.md][native-turbo-modules] | HIGH | Building fast native modules |\n| [native-sdks-over-polyfills.md][native-sdks-over-polyfills] | HIGH | Native vs JS libraries |\n| [native-measure-tti.md][native-measure-tti] | HIGH | TTI measurement setup |\n| [native-threading-model.md][native-threading-model] | HIGH | Turbo Module threads |\n| [native-profiling.md][native-profiling] | MEDIUM | Xcode/Android Studio profiling |\n| [native-platform-setup.md][native-platform-setup] | MEDIUM | iOS/Android tooling guide |\n| [native-view-flattening.md][native-view-flattening] | MEDIUM | View hierarchy debugging |\n| [native-memory-patterns.md][native-memory-patterns] | MEDIUM | C++/Swift/Kotlin memory |\n| [native-memory-leaks.md][native-memory-leaks] | MEDIUM | Native memory leak hunting |\n| [native-android-16kb-alignment.md][native-android-16kb-alignment] | CRITICAL | Third-party library alignment for Google Play |\n\n### Bundling (`bundle-*`)\n\n| File | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| [bundle-barrel-exports.md][bundle-barrel-exports] | CRITICAL | Avoid barrel imports |\n| [bundle-analyze-js.md][bundle-analyze-js] | CRITICAL | JS bundle visualization |\n| [bundle-tree-shaking.md][bundle-tree-shaking] | HIGH | Dead code elimination |\n| [bundle-analyze-app.md][bundle-analyze-app] | HIGH | App size analysis |\n| [bundle-r8-android.md][bundle-r8-android] | HIGH | Android code shrinking |\n| [bundle-hermes-mmap.md][bundle-hermes-mmap] | HIGH | Disable bundle compression |\n| [bundle-native-assets.md][bundle-native-assets] | HIGH | Asset catalog setup |\n| [bundle-library-size.md][bundle-library-size] | MEDIUM | Evaluate dependencies |\n| [bundle-code-splitting.md][bundle-code-splitting] | MEDIUM | Re.Pack code splitting |\n\n\n## Searching References\n\n```bash\n# Find patterns by keyword\ngrep -l \"reanimated\" references/\ngrep -l \"flatlist\" references/\ngrep -l \"memory\" references/\ngrep -l \"profil\" references/\ngrep -l \"tti\" references/\ngrep -l \"bundle\" references/\n```\n\n## Problem → Skill Mapping\n\n| Problem | Start With |\n|---------|------------|\n| App feels slow/janky | [js-measure-fps.md][js-measure-fps] → [js-profile-react.md][js-profile-react] |\n| Too many re-renders | [js-profile-react.md][js-profile-react] → [js-react-compiler.md][js-react-compiler] |\n| Slow startup (TTI) | [native-measure-tti.md][native-measure-tti] → [bundle-analyze-js.md][bundle-analyze-js] |\n| Large app size | [bundle-analyze-app.md][bundle-analyze-app] → [bundle-r8-android.md][bundle-r8-android] |\n| Memory growing | [js-memory-leaks.md][js-memory-leaks] or [native-memory-leaks.md][native-memory-leaks] |\n| Animation drops frames | [js-animations-reanimated.md][js-animations-reanimated] |\n| List scroll jank | [js-lists-flatlist-flashlist.md][js-lists-flatlist-flashlist] |\n| TextInput lag | [js-uncontrolled-components.md][js-uncontrolled-components] |\n| Native module slow | [native-turbo-modules.md][native-turbo-modules] → [native-threading-model.md][native-threading-model] |\n| Native library alignment issue | [native-android-16kb-alignment.md][native-android-16kb-alignment] |\n\n[references]: references/\n[js-lists-flatlist-flashlist]: references/js-lists-flatlist-flashlist.md\n[js-profile-react]: references/js-profile-react.md\n[js-measure-fps]: references/js-measure-fps.md\n[js-memory-leaks]: references/js-memory-leaks.md\n[js-atomic-state]: references/js-atomic-state.md\n[js-concurrent-react]: references/js-concurrent-react.md\n[js-react-compiler]: references/js-react-compiler.md\n[js-animations-reanimated]: references/js-animations-reanimated.md\n[js-uncontrolled-components]: references/js-uncontrolled-components.md\n[native-turbo-modules]: references/native-turbo-modules.md\n[native-sdks-over-polyfills]: references/native-sdks-over-polyfills.md\n[native-measure-tti]: references/native-measure-tti.md\n[native-threading-model]: references/native-threading-model.md\n[native-profiling]: references/native-profiling.md\n[native-platform-setup]: references/native-platform-setup.md\n[native-view-flattening]: references/native-view-flattening.md\n[native-memory-patterns]: references/native-memory-patterns.md\n[native-memory-leaks]: references/native-memory-leaks.md\n[native-android-16kb-alignment]: references/native-android-16kb-alignment.md\n[bundle-barrel-exports]: references/bundle-barrel-exports.md\n[bundle-analyze-js]: references/bundle-analyze-js.md\n[bundle-tree-shaking]: references/bundle-tree-shaking.md\n[bundle-analyze-app]: references/bundle-analyze-app.md\n[bundle-r8-android]: references/bundle-r8-android.md\n[bundle-hermes-mmap]: references/bundle-hermes-mmap.md\n[bundle-native-assets]: references/bundle-native-assets.md\n[bundle-library-size]: references/bundle-library-size.md\n[bundle-code-splitting]: references/bundle-code-splitting.md\n\n## Attribution\n\nBased on \"The Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization\" by Callstack.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:54:12.037Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Mobile Development Agents needing advanced React Native optimization techniques.","zh":"适合需要高级 React Native 优化技术的移动开发代理。","ja":"React Native の高度な最適化テクニックを必要とするモバイル開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 React Native 최적화 기술이 필요한 모바일 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo móvil que necesitan técnicas avanzadas de optimización de React Native.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement mobile ayant besoin de techniques avancées d''optimisation de React Native.","de":"Perfekt für Mobile-Development-Agenten, die erweiterte React-Native-Optimierungstechniken benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de desenvolvimento móvel que precisam de técnicas avançadas de otimização do React Native.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки мобильных приложений, которым необходимы продвинутые техники оптимизации React Native.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى تقنيات متقدمة لتحسين React Native"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize React Native applications using JavaScript and Native module performance enhancements, covering bundling optimizations and leveraging Callstack''s Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization for improved iOS and Android performance.","zh":"赋予代理优化使用 JavaScript 和原生模块性能增强的 React Native 应用程序的能力，涵盖捆绑优化，并利用 Callstack 的 React Native 优化终极指南来提高 iOS 和 Android 的性能。","ja":"JavaScript とネイティブモジュールのパフォーマンス強化を使用して React Native アプリケーションを最適化し、バンドル最適化をカバーし、Callstack の React Native 最適化の究極のガイドを利用して、iOS と Android のパフォーマンスを向上させるエージェントの能力を与えます。","ko":"JavaScript와 네이티브 모듈의 성능 강화 기능을 사용하여 React Native 애플리케이션을 최적화하고, 번들 최적화를 포함하며, Callstack의 React Native 최적화究極 가이드를 사용하여 iOS 및 안드로이드의 성능을 개선할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes optimizar aplicaciones de React Native utilizando mejoras del rendimiento de JavaScript y módulos nativos, cubriendo optimizaciones de empaquetado y aprovechando la Guía definitiva de optimización de React Native de Callstack para mejorar el rendimiento de iOS y Android.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les applications React Native en utilisant des améliorations des performances de JavaScript et de modules natifs, couvrant les optimisations de regroupement et en exploitant le Guide ultime d''optimisation de React Native de Callstack pour améliorer les performances d''iOS et d''Android.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, React-Native-Anwendungen zu optimieren, indem sie JavaScript- und Native-Modul-Leistungsverbesserungen verwenden, einschließlich Optimierungen der Bundling und Nutzung des ultimativen Leitfadens zur Optimierung von React Native von Callstack für verbesserte iOS- und Android-Leistung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar aplicações React Native usando melhorias de desempenho de JavaScript e módulos nativos, abordando otimizações de empacotamento e aproveitando o Guia Definitivo para Otimização do React Native da Callstack para melhorar o desempenho do iOS e do Android.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать приложения React Native, используя улучшения производительности JavaScript и родных модулей, охватывая оптимизации пакетирования и используя Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization от Callstack для улучшения производительности iOS и Android.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تحسين تطبيقات React Native باستخدام تحسينات أداء جافاسكريبت والوحدات الأصلية، وغطاء تحسينات التعبئة واستخدام دليل التحسين النهائي لتطبيقات React Native من Callstack لتحسين أداء نظامي التشغيل iOS و Android"},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing React Native app performance for smoother user experiences","Identifying and fixing bottlenecks in JavaScript and Native code","Implementing efficient bundling strategies for reduced app sizes"],"zh":["优化 React Native 应用程序性能以实现更流畅的用户体验","识别和修复 JavaScript 和原生代码中的瓶颈","实施高效的捆绑策略以减少应用程序大小"],"ja":["よりスムーズなユーザーエクスペリエンスのために React Native アプリケーションのパフォーマンスを最適化する","JavaScript とネイティブコードのボトルネックを識別して修復する","アプリケーションのサイズを削減するための効率的なバンドル戦略を実装する"],"ko":["より 매끄러운 사용자 경험을 위해 React Native 애플리케이션의 성능을 최적화하는 것","JavaScript 및 네이티브 코드의 병목 현상을 식별하고 수정하는 것","애플리케이션 크기를 줄이기 위한 효율적인 번들링 전략을 구현하는 것"],"es":["Optimizar el rendimiento de la aplicación React Native para experiencias de usuario más suaves","Identificar y solucionar cuellos de botella en el código JavaScript y nativo","Implementar estrategias de empaquetado eficientes para reducir el tamaño de la aplicación"],"fr":["Optimiser les performances de l''application React Native pour des expériences utilisateur plus fluides","Identifier et corriger les goulets d''étranglement dans le code JavaScript et natif","Mettre en œuvre des stratégies de regroupement efficaces pour réduire la taille de l''application"],"de":["Optimieren der Leistung von React-Native-Apps für reibungslosere Benutzererfahrungen","Identifizieren und Beheben von Engpässen in JavaScript- und Native-Code","Implementieren effizienter Bundling-Strategien zur Reduzierung der App-Größe"],"pt":["Otimizar o desempenho do aplicativo React Native para experiências de usuário mais suaves","Identificar e corrigir gargalos no código JavaScript e nativo","Implementar estratégias de empacotamento eficientes para reduzir os tamanhos dos aplicativos"],"ru":["Оптимизировать производительность приложения React Native для более плавных пользовательских опытов","Выявлять и исправлять узкие места в коде JavaScript и родном коде","Реализовывать эффективные стратегии пакетирования для уменьшения размеров приложений"],"ar":["تحسين أداء تطبيق React Native لتحقيق تجارب مستخدم أكثر سلاسة","تحديد ومعالجة العوائق في كود جافاسكريبت والكود الأصلي","تنفيذ استراتيجيات تعبئة فعالة لتقليل حجم التطبيقات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of React Native and JavaScript","Focused on React Native optimization, not general mobile app development"],"zh":["需要 React Native 和 JavaScript 的知识","专注于 React Native 优化，而不是一般的移动应用开发"],"ja":["React Native と JavaScript の知識が必要","一般的なモバイルアプリ開発ではなく React Native 最適化に焦点を当てている"],"ko":["React Native 및 JavaScript에 대한 지식이 필요함","일반적인 모바일 앱 개발이 아니라 React Native 최적화에 중점을 두고 있음"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de React Native y JavaScript","Se centra en la optimización de React Native, no en el desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles en general"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en React Native et JavaScript","Se concentre sur l''optimisation de React Native, et non sur le développement d''applications mobiles en général"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von React Native und JavaScript","Konzentriert sich auf die Optimierung von React Native, nicht auf die allgemeine Entwicklung von Mobile-Apps"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de React Native e JavaScript","Focado na otimização do React Native, não no desenvolvimento geral de aplicativos móveis"],"ru":["Требует знания React Native и JavaScript","Сосредоточен на оптимизации React Native, а не на общем развитии мобильных приложений"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة ب React Native وجافاسكريبت","يركز على تحسين React Native، وليس على تطوير التطبيقات المتنقلة بشكل عام"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ShouxinZhang/agent-multiSubAgents/local-dev-workflow', 'community', 'ShouxinZhang', 'agent-multiSubAgents', 'ShouxinZhang/agent-multiSubAgents', 'local-dev-workflow', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.427Z', '2026-02-18T04:54:24.380Z', NULL, '{"id":"ShouxinZhang/agent-multiSubAgents/local-dev-workflow","name":"local-dev-workflow","description":{"zh":"本地开发全链路工作流是一种高效的开发流程，包括需求理解、方案对齐、编码实现等步骤","ja":"ローカル開発ワークフローは、高効率の開発プロセスです。要件理解、計画の整合、コード実装などのステップが含まれます","ko":"로컬 개발 워크플로는 효율적인 개발 프로세스입니다. 요구사항 이해, 계획 일치, 코드 구현 등의 단계가 포함됩니다","es":"El flujo de trabajo de desarrollo local es un proceso que abarca desde la comprensión de requisitos hasta la implementación y verificación. Nuestro enfoque garantiza una entrega de calidad y eficiente.","fr":"Le flux de travail de développement local est un processus qui va de la compréhension des exigences à la mise en œuvre et à la vérification. Notre approche garantit une livraison de qualité et efficace.","de":"Der lokale Entwicklungswerkfluss ist ein Prozess, der von der Anforderungsanalyse bis zur Implementierung und Überprüfung reicht. Unser Ansatz gewährleistet eine qualitativ hochwertige und effiziente Lieferung.","pt":"O fluxo de trabalho de desenvolvimento local é um processo que envolve várias etapas, desde a compreensão de requisitos até a validação local e gerenciamento de versões","ru":"Местный поток работы разработки - это процесс, который включает несколько этапов, от понимания требований до локальной проверки и управления версиями","ar":"تدفق العمل التطويري المحلي هو عملية تشمل عدة خطوات، من فهم المتطلبات إلى التحقق المحلي وإدارة الإصدارات","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"本地开发全链路工作流","ja":"ローカル開発ワークフロー","ko":"로컬 개발 워크플로","es":"Flujo de trabajo de desarrollo local","fr":"Flux de travail de développement local","de":"Lokale Entwicklungswerkfluss","pt":"Fluxo de Trabalho de Desenvolvimento Local","ru":"Местный поток работы разработки","ar":"تدفق العمل التطويري المحلي","en":"local-dev-workflow"},"description":{"zh":"本地开发全链路工作流是一种高效的开发流程，包括需求理解、方案对齐、编码实现等步骤","ja":"ローカル開発ワークフローは、高効率の開発プロセスです。要件理解、計画の整合、コード実装などのステップが含まれます","ko":"로컬 개발 워크플로는 효율적인 개발 프로세스입니다. 요구사항 이해, 계획 일치, 코드 구현 등의 단계가 포함됩니다","es":"El flujo de trabajo de desarrollo local es un proceso que abarca desde la comprensión de requisitos hasta la implementación y verificación. Nuestro enfoque g...","fr":"Le flux de travail de développement local est un processus qui va de la compréhension des exigences à la mise en œuvre et à la vérification. Notre approche g...","de":"Der lokale Entwicklungswerkfluss ist ein Prozess, der von der Anforderungsanalyse bis zur Implementierung und Überprüfung reicht. Unser Ansatz gewährleistet ...","pt":"O fluxo de trabalho de desenvolvimento local é um processo que envolve várias etapas, desde a compreensão de requisitos até a validação local e gerenciamento...","ru":"Местный поток работы разработки - это процесс, который включает несколько этапов, от понимания требований до локальной проверки и управления версиями","ar":"تدفق العمل التطويري المحلي هو عملية تشمل عدة خطوات، من فهم المتطلبات إلى التحقق المحلي وإدارة الإصدارات","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["需求理解","方案对齐","编码实现","本地验证","质量门禁","结构文档同步"],"ja":["要件理解","計画の整合","コード実装","ローカル検証","品質ゲート","構造ドキュメントの同期"],"ko":["요구사항 이해","계획 일치","코드 구현","로컬 검증","품질 게이트","구조 문서 동기화"],"es":["Comprensión de requisitos","Implementación de soluciones","Verificación local","Control de calidad","Documentación de estructura","Registro de desarrollo"],"fr":["Compréhension des exigences","Mise en œuvre de solutions","Vérification locale","Contrôle de qualité","Documentation de structure","Enregistrement de développement"],"de":["Anforderungsanalyse","Implementierung von Lösungen","Lokale Überprüfung","Qualitätskontrolle","Struktur-Dokumentation","Entwicklungs-Protokoll"],"pt":["Compreensão de requisitos","Alinhamento de soluções","Validação local","Gerenciamento de versões","Sincronização de documentos","Registro de logs de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Понимание требований","Согласование решений","Локальная проверка","Управление версиями","Синхронизация документов","Ведение журнала разработки"],"ar":["فهم المتطلبات","تنسيق الحلول","التحقق المحلي","إدارة الإصدارات","تنسيق الوثائق","تسجيل سجل التطوير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["本地开发","开发流程","需求理解","方案对齐","编码实现","本地验证","质量门禁","结构文档同步"],"ja":["ローカル開発","開発プロセス","要件理解","計画の整合","コード実装","ローカル検証","品質ゲート","構造ドキュメントの同期"],"ko":["로컬 개발","개발 프로세스","요구사항 이해","계획 일치","코드 구현","로컬 검증","품질 게이트","구조 문서 동기화"],"es":["desarrollo local","flujo de trabajo","implementación de software","verificación local","control de calidad","documentación de estructura","registro de desarrollo","desarrollo de aplicaciones","ingeniería de software"],"fr":["développement local","flux de travail","mise en œuvre de logiciels","vérification locale","contrôle de qualité","documentation de structure","enregistrement de développement","développement d''applications","ingénierie de logiciels"],"de":["lokale Entwicklung","Entwicklungswerkfluss","Implementierung von Software","lokale Überprüfung","Qualitätskontrolle","Struktur-Dokumentation","Entwicklungs-Protokoll","Anwendungsentwicklung","Software-Engineering"],"pt":["desenvolvimento local","fluxo de trabalho","compreensão de requisitos","alinhamento de soluções","validação local","gerenciamento de versões","sincronização de documentos","registro de logs de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["местная разработка","поток работы","понимание требований","согласование решений","локальная проверка","управление версиями","синхронизация документов","ведение журнала разработки"],"ar":["التطوير المحلي","تدفق العمل","فهم المتطلبات","تنسيق الحلول","التحقق المحلي","إدارة الإصدارات","تنسيق الوثائق","تسجيل سجل التطوير"]}},"owner":"ShouxinZhang","repo":"agent-multiSubAgents","repoPath":"ShouxinZhang/agent-multiSubAgents","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.427Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"local-dev-workflow","description":"本地开发全链路 SOP。接到任务后，从需求理解到 Git 管理执行闭环。","bodyPreview":"# 本地开发全链路工作流（通用版）\n\n流程：\n\n```text\n接收需求 → 理解现状 → 方案对齐 → 编码实现 → 本地验证 → 质量门禁 → 结构文档同步 → 开发日志 → Git 管理\n```\n\n## Step 1：需求理解\n\n- 读取 `AGENTS.md`\n- 按需读取目标模块代码、架构文档、近期 dev logs\n\n## Step 2：方案对齐\n\n实施前必须明确：\n1. 变更文件清单\n2. 实现方式\n3. 影响范围与风险\n\n## Step 3：编码实现\n\n- 按已确认方案实施\n- 保持最小改动和模块边界\n\n## Step 4：本地验证\n\n- 对 UI/服务行为做最小可运行验证\n- 非运行时变更可跳过\n\n## Step 5：质量门禁\n\n- 调用 `build-check`\n- 失败则修复后复跑\n\n## Step 6：结构文档同步（按需）\n\n触发条件：新增/删除/移动文件，新增依赖或 scripts。\n\n- 调用 `repo-structure-sync`\n\n## Step 7：开发日志\n\n- 调用 `dev-logs`\n- 记录对话、变更、验证、Git 锚点\n\n## Ste","body":"# 本地开发全链路工作流（通用版）\n\n流程：\n\n```text\n接收需求 → 理解现状 → 方案对齐 → 编码实现 → 本地验证 → 质量门禁 → 结构文档同步 → 开发日志 → Git 管理\n```\n\n## Step 1：需求理解\n\n- 读取 `AGENTS.md`\n- 按需读取目标模块代码、架构文档、近期 dev logs\n\n## Step 2：方案对齐\n\n实施前必须明确：\n1. 变更文件清单\n2. 实现方式\n3. 影响范围与风险\n\n## Step 3：编码实现\n\n- 按已确认方案实施\n- 保持最小改动和模块边界\n\n## Step 4：本地验证\n\n- 对 UI/服务行为做最小可运行验证\n- 非运行时变更可跳过\n\n## Step 5：质量门禁\n\n- 调用 `build-check`\n- 失败则修复后复跑\n\n## Step 6：结构文档同步（按需）\n\n触发条件：新增/删除/移动文件，新增依赖或 scripts。\n\n- 调用 `repo-structure-sync`\n\n## Step 7：开发日志\n\n- 调用 `dev-logs`\n- 记录对话、变更、验证、Git 锚点\n\n## Step 8：Git 管理\n\n- 调用 `git-management`\n- 在阶段成果或大改前后建立可回滚检查点\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:54:24.380Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing streamlined local development workflows with Git management and automated quality checks.","zh":"适合需要简化本地开发工作流的开发代理，具有Git管理和自动化质量检查。","ja":"開発エージェントがローカル開発ワークフローを簡素化するために適しています。Git管理と自動化された品質チェックを備えています。","ko":"로컬 개발 워크플로우를 간소화하는 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다. Git 관리 및 자동화된 품질 체크를 제공합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan flujos de trabajo de desarrollo locales optimizados con administración de Git y verificaciones de calidad automatizadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement qui ont besoin de flux de travail de développement local rationalisés avec une gestion Git et des vérifications de qualité automatisées.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittelstände, die optimierte lokale Entwicklungswerkflüsse mit Git-Verwaltung und automatisierten Qualitätsprüfungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento local otimizados com gerenciamento do Git e verificações de qualidade automatizadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым требуются оптимизированные локальные рабочие процессы разработки с управлением Git и автоматическими проверками качества.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذي يحتاج إلى سير عمل التطوير المحلي المتدفق مع إدارة جيت والتحقق التلقائي من الجودة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement efficient local development workflows, utilizing tools like Git for version control, and automated scripts for build checks and repository structure synchronization, ensuring minimal code changes and modular boundaries.","zh":"赋予代理实现高效的本地开发工作流的能力，利用像Git这样的工具进行版本控制，并使用自动化脚本进行构建检查和仓库结构同步，确保最小的代码更改和模块化边界。","ja":"エージェントが効率的なローカル開発ワークフローを実装できるようにします。Gitなどのツールを使用してバージョン管理を行い、自動化されたスクリプトを使用してビルドチェックとリポジトリ構造の同期を行い、コードの変更を最小限に抑え、モジュール化された境界を確保します。","ko":"에이전트가 효율적인 로컬 개발 워크플로우를 구현할 수 있도록 합니다. Gitなどの 도구를 사용하여 버전 관리를 수행하며, 자동화된 스크립트를 사용하여 빌드 체크 및 저장소 구조 동기화를 수행하여 코드 변경을 최소화하고 모듈화된 경계를 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar flujos de trabajo de desarrollo local eficientes, utilizando herramientas como Git para el control de versiones y scripts automatizados para verificaciones de compilación y sincronización de la estructura del repositorio, garantizando cambios de código mínimos y fronteras modulares.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des flux de travail de développement local efficaces, en utilisant des outils comme Git pour le contrôle de version et des scripts automatisés pour les vérifications de build et la synchronisation de la structure du référentiel, en garantissant des modifications de code minimales et des frontières modulaires.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, effiziente lokale Entwicklungswerkflüsse umzusetzen, indem sie Werkzeuge wie Git für die Versionskontrolle und automatisierte Skripte für Build-Checks und die Synchronisation der Repository-Struktur verwenden, um minimale Codeänderungen und modulare Grenzen sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento local eficientes, utilizando ferramentas como o Git para controle de versão e scripts automatizados para verificações de compilação e sincronização da estrutura do repositório, garantindo alterações mínimas de código e limites modulares.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовать эффективные локальные рабочие процессы разработки, используя инструменты, такие как Git для контроля версий, и автоматические скрипты для проверок сборки и синхронизации структуры репозитория, обеспечивая минимальные изменения кода и модульные границы.","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على تنفيذ سير عمل التطوير المحلي الفعال، باستخدام أدوات مثل جيت للتحكم في الإصدار، وال스크ربتات التلقائية للتحقق من بناء ومزامنة هيكل المستودع، مما يضمن تغييرات كود معدودة وحدود الوحدات النمطية."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating local validation and testing for UI and service behaviors","Streamlining Git management through automated commit and logging processes","Implementing quality gates with build checks and repository structure synchronization"],"zh":["自动化UI和服务行为的本地验证和测试","简化Git管理通过自动化的提交和日志记录过程","实施质量门槛，使用构建检查和仓库结构同步"],"ja":["UIとサービス動作のローカルバリデーションとテストの自動化","Git管理の簡素化を自動コミットとログ記録プロセスを介して実現","品質ゲートの実施。ビルドチェックとリポジトリ構造の同期を使用"],"ko":["UI 및 서비스 동작에 대한 로컬 검증 및 테스트 자동화","Git 관리를 자동 커밋 및 로깅 프로세스를 통한 간소화","품질 게이트 구현. 빌드 체크 및 저장소 구조 동기화를 사용"],"es":["Automatización de la validación y prueba local para comportamientos de UI y servicio","Optimización de la administración de Git a través de procesos de compromiso y registro automatizados","Implementación de puertas de calidad con verificaciones de compilación y sincronización de la estructura del repositorio"],"fr":["Automatisation de la validation et des tests locaux pour les comportements UI et de service","Rationalisation de la gestion Git via des processus de commit et de journalisation automatisés","Mise en œuvre de portes de qualité avec des vérifications de build et une synchronisation de la structure du référentiel"],"de":["Automatisierung der lokalen Validierung und des Testens für UI- und Dienstverhaltensweisen","Optimierung der Git-Verwaltung durch automatisierte Commit- und Protokollierungsprozesse","Implementierung von Qualitätsprüfungen mit Build-Checks und Synchronisation der Repository-Struktur"],"pt":["Automatizar a validação e teste local para comportamentos de UI e serviço","Otimizar o gerenciamento do Git por meio de processos de confirmação e registro automatizados","Implementar portas de qualidade com verificações de compilação e sincronização da estrutura do repositório"],"ru":["Автоматизировать локальную проверку и тестирование для поведения UI и сервиса","Оптимизировать управление Git посредством автоматизированных процессов фиксации и регистрации","Реализовать ворота качества с проверками сборки и синхронизацией структуры репозитория"],"ar":["التحقق التلقائي من التحقق والاختبار المحلي لسلوكيات الواجهة وأداء الخدمة","تحسين إدارة جيت من خلال عمليات الإنشاء التلقائية والتسجيل","تنفيذ بوابات الجودة مع التحقق من بناء ومزامنة هيكل المستودع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git installation and configuration","Dependent on specific script implementations like ''build-check'' and ''repo-structure-sync''","Optimized for development environments with accessible file systems and logging capabilities"],"zh":["需要Git的安装和配置","依赖于特定的脚本实现，如''build-check''和''repo-structure-sync''","针对具有可访问文件系统和日志记录功能的开发环境进行优化"],"ja":["Gitのインストールと設定が必要","特定のスクリプト実装（例：''build-check''および''repo-structure-sync''）に依存","アクセス可能なファイルシステムとログ記録機能を備えた開発環境向けに最適化"],"ko":["Git의 설치 및 구성이 필요","특정 스크립트 구현(''build-check'' 및 ''repo-structure-sync'' 등)에 의존","접근 가능한 파일 시스템 및 로깅 기능을 갖춘 개발 환경을 위한 최적화"],"es":["Requiere instalación y configuración de Git","Dependiente de implementaciones de script específicas como ''build-check'' y ''repo-structure-sync''","Optimizado para entornos de desarrollo con sistemas de archivos y capacidades de registro accesibles"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration de Git","Dépendant de mises en œuvre de script spécifiques comme ''build-check'' et ''repo-structure-sync''","Optimisé pour les environnements de développement avec des systèmes de fichiers et des capacités de journalisation accessibles"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation und Konfiguration von Git","Abhängig von spezifischen Skriptimplementierungen wie ''build-check'' und ''repo-structure-sync''","Optimiert für Entwicklungsumgebungen mit zugänglichen Dateisystemen und Protokollierungsfunktionen"],"pt":["Exige a instalação e configuração do Git","Depende de implementações de script específicas, como ''verificação de compilação'' e ''sincronização da estrutura do repositório''","Otimizado para ambientes de desenvolvimento com sistemas de arquivos e capacidades de registro acessíveis"],"ru":["Требует установки и настройки Git","Зависит от конкретных реализаций скриптов, таких как ''проверка сборки'' и ''синхронизация структуры репозитория''","Оптимизирован для сред разработки с доступными файловыми системами и возможностями регистрации"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت وتكوين جيت","يعتمد على تنفيذ سكربتات محددة، مثل ''تحقق من البناء'' ومزامنة هيكل المستودع","مثالي للبيئات التطويرية مع أنظمة الملفات وقدرات السجل القابلة للوصول"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
