figuración de bibliotecas de código cross-platform","Integración con la API de Context7","Búsqueda de bibliotecas de código con la API de Context7","Obtención de documentación y ejemplos de código actualizados","Compatibilidad con herramientas de IA como Claude Code"],"fr":["Configuration de bibliothèques de code cross-platform","Intégration avec l''API Context7","Recherche de bibliothèques de code avec l''API Context7","Obtention de documentation et d''exemples de code à jour","Compatibilité avec des outils d''IA tels que Claude Code"],"de":["Konfiguration von Cross-Platform-Codebibliotheken","Integration mit der Context7-API","Suche nach Codebibliotheken mit der Context7-API","Abruf von aktuellster Dokumentation und Codebeispielen","Kompatibilität mit KI-Tools wie Claude Code"],"pt":["Configuração de ferramentas de IA cross-plataforma","Documentação e exemplos de código para bibliotecas populares","API para integração com projetos de desenvolvimento","Suporte a bibliotecas como React, Next.js e FastAPI","Busca de bibliotecas e documentação com facilidade"],"ru":["Настройка кроссплатформенных инструментов ИИ","Документация и примеры кода для популярных библиотек","API для интеграции с проектами разработки","Поддержка библиотек như React, Next.js и FastAPI","Поиск библиотек и документации с легкостью"],"ar":["تكوين أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي متعددة المنصات","وثائق وأمثلة كود لمكتبات شائعة","واجهة برمجة التطبيقات للتكامل مع مشاريع التطوير","دعم لمكتبات مثل React و Next.js و FastAPI","بحث مكتبات ووثائق بسهولة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Context7","AI工具配置","跨平台","Context7 API","最新文档","代码示例"],"ja":["Context7","AIツール設定","クロスプラットフォーム","Context7 API","最新のドキュメント","コード例"],"ko":["Context7","AI 도구 구성","跨平台","Context7 API","최신 문서","코드 예제"],"es":["Context7","herramientas de IA","configuración de bibliotecas de código","cross-platform","Claude Code","API de Context7","desarrollo de software","integración de herramientas de IA"],"fr":["Context7","outils d''IA","configuration de bibliothèques de code","cross-platform","Claude Code","API Context7","développement de logiciels","intégration d''outils d''IA"],"de":["Context7","KI-Tools","Konfiguration von Codebibliotheken","Cross-Platform","Claude Code","Context7-API","Softwareentwicklung","Integration von KI-Tools"],"pt":["Context7","ferramentas de IA","configuração cross-plataforma","documentação de bibliotecas","exemplos de código","API para desenvolvedores","React","Next.js","FastAPI"],"ru":["Context7","инструменты ИИ","кроссплатформенная настройка","документация библиотек","примеры кода","API для разработчиков","React","Next.js","FastAPI"],"ar":["Context7","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تكوين متعددة المنصات","وثائق المكتبات","أمثلة الكود","واجهة برمجة التطبيقات للمطورين","React","Next.js","FastAPI"]}},"owner":"erwinkn","repo":"ai-config","repoPath":"erwinkn/ai-config","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.427Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"context7","description":"Fetch up-to-date library documentation using Context7 API. Use this skill when the user asks for docs, examples, or help with a specific library/framework (e.g., look up React docs, context7 nextjs routing, fetch docs for fastapi).","bodyPreview":"# Context7 Documentation Fetcher\n\nThis skill fetches up-to-date documentation and code examples from libraries using the Context7 API.\n\n## Standard Workflow\n\nContext7 requires a **two-step process**:\n\n### Step 1: Search for the Library ID\n\nFirst, search for the library to get its ID:\n\n```\nGET https://context7.com/api/v2/libs/search?libraryName=<library>&query=<context>\n```\n\nParameters:\n- `libraryName`: The library name (e.g., \"react\", \"nextjs\", \"fastapi\")\n- `query`: Search context to help find t","body":"# Context7 Documentation Fetcher\n\nThis skill fetches up-to-date documentation and code examples from libraries using the Context7 API.\n\n## Standard Workflow\n\nContext7 requires a **two-step process**:\n\n### Step 1: Search for the Library ID\n\nFirst, search for the library to get its ID:\n\n```\nGET https://context7.com/api/v2/libs/search?libraryName=<library>&query=<context>\n```\n\nParameters:\n- `libraryName`: The library name (e.g., \"react\", \"nextjs\", \"fastapi\")\n- `query`: Search context to help find the right library\n\nThe response contains a `results` array with library objects. Use the `id` field from the first result.\n\n### Step 2: Get Documentation Context\n\nUse the library ID to fetch relevant documentation:\n\n```\nGET https://context7.com/api/v2/context?libraryId=<id>&query=<question>\n```\n\nParameters:\n- `libraryId`: The ID from step 1 (e.g., \"/vercel/next.js\")\n- `query`: Natural language question about the documentation\n\nThis returns ranked code snippets and documentation matching your query.\n\n## Example Usage\n\nWhen the user asks about a library:\n\n1. **Search for the library**:\n   Fetch `https://context7.com/api/v2/libs/search?libraryName=nextjs&query=routing`\n   Extract the library ID from the response (e.g., \"/vercel/next.js\")\n\n2. **Fetch documentation**:\n   Fetch `https://context7.com/api/v2/context?libraryId=/vercel/next.js&query=How to setup dynamic routes`\n   \n3. **Present the results** to the user with the relevant code examples and documentation.\n\n## Tips for Best Results\n\n- Use specific, detailed queries rather than vague terms\n- Include relevant context in the query (e.g., \"useState hook with TypeScript\" instead of just \"state\")\n- The API works without an API key but has restricted rate limits\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:54:35.261Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing up-to-date documentation and code examples from libraries like Claude Code and others via the Context7 API.","zh":"非常适合需要最新文档和代码示例的AI代理，例如从Claude Code和其他通过Context7 API提供的库中获取","ja":"最新のドキュメントとコード例が必要なAIエージェントに最適です。例えば、Claude Codeやその他のContext7 APIを介して提供されるライブラリから取得する場合","ko":"최신 문서와 코드 예제가 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 예를 들어, Claude Code와 같은 라이브러리 및 Context7 API를 통해 제공되는 기타 라이브러리에서 가져오는 경우","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan documentación y ejemplos de código actualizados de bibliotecas como Claude Code y otras a través de la API de Context7.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin d''une documentation et d''exemples de code à jour provenant de bibliothèques comme Claude Code et d''autres via l''API Context7.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die aktuelle Dokumentationen und Codebeispiele aus Bibliotheken wie Claude Code und anderen über die Context7-API benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que precisam de documentação e exemplos de código atualizados de bibliotecas como Claude Code e outras via API Context7.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым необходимы актуальные документация и примеры кода из библиотек, таких как Claude Code и другие, через API Context7.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل الإي الأي التي تحتاج إلى توثيق وكود حالي من مكتبات مثل Claude Code وغيرها من خلال واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Context7."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to fetch and utilize the latest library documentation and code examples using HTTPS GET requests to the Context7 API, supporting libraries such as react, nextjs, and fastapi, with query parameters like libraryName and query for precise searches.","zh":"使代理能够使用HTTPS GET请求获取和利用最新的库文档和代码示例，支持诸如react、nextjs和fastapi的库，并使用诸如libraryName和query的查询参数进行精确搜索","ja":"HTTPS GETリクエストを使用して、最新のライブラリドキュメントとコード例を取得して利用できるようにエージェントをEmpowerします。React、Next.js、FastAPIなどのライブラリをサポートし、libraryNameやqueryなどのクエリパラメータを使用して精密な検索を行う","ko":"HTTPS GET 요청을 사용하여 최신 라이브러리 문서 및 코드 예제를 가져오고 사용할 수 있도록 에이전트를 활성화합니다. React, Next.js, FastAPI와 같은 라이브러리를 지원하며 libraryName 및 query와 같은 쿼리 매개 변수를 사용하여 정확한 검색을 수행합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a recuperar y utilizar la documentación y los ejemplos de código de bibliotecas más recientes mediante solicitudes HTTPS GET a la API de Context7, que admite bibliotecas como react, nextjs y fastapi, con parámetros de consulta como libraryName y query para búsquedas precisas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de récupérer et d''utiliser la documentation et les exemples de code de bibliothèques les plus récents en utilisant des requêtes HTTPS GET à l''API Context7, prenant en charge des bibliothèques telles que react, nextjs et fastapi, avec des paramètres de requête tels que libraryName et query pour des recherches précises.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, die neueste Bibliotheks-Dokumentation und Codebeispiele mithilfe von HTTPS-GET-Anfragen an die Context7-API abzurufen und zu nutzen, unterstützt Bibliotheken wie react, nextjs und fastapi, mit Abfrageparametern wie libraryName und query für präzise Suchanfragen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a buscar e utilizar a documentação e exemplos de código de bibliotecas mais recentes usando solicitações HTTPS GET para a API Context7, com suporte a bibliotecas como react, nextjs e fastapi, com parâmetros de consulta como libraryName e query para pesquisas precisas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью извлекать и использовать самую актуальную документацию и примеры кода библиотек, используя запросы HTTPS GET к API Context7, поддерживающую библиотеки, такие как react, nextjs и fastapi, с параметрами запроса, такими как libraryName и query для точных поисков.","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من استرجاع واستخدام توثيق وأمثلة كود المكتبات الأخيرة باستخدام طلبات HTTPS GET إلى واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Context7، مع دعم لمكتبات مثل react و nextjs و fastapi، مع 매개ات استعلام مثل libraryName و query للبحث الدقيق."},"useCases":{"en":["Fetching library IDs for specific libraries","Retrieving up-to-date documentation for AI tool configuration","Searching for code examples within a specific context"],"zh":["为特定库获取库ID","检索AI工具配置的最新文档","在特定上下文中搜索代码示例"],"ja":["特定のライブラリのライブラリIDを取得する","AIツール設定の最新ドキュメントを取得する","特定のコンテキスト内でコード例を検索する"],"ko":["특정 라이브러리의 라이브러리 ID를 가져오는 것","AI 도구 구성의 최신 문서를 검색하는 것","특정 컨텍스트 내에서 코드 예제를 검색하는 것"],"es":["Recuperar IDs de bibliotecas para bibliotecas específicas","Recuperar documentación actualizada para la configuración de herramientas de IA","Buscar ejemplos de código dentro de un contexto específico"],"fr":["Récupérer les ID de bibliothèques pour des bibliothèques spécifiques","Récupérer une documentation à jour pour la configuration d''outils IA","Rechercher des exemples de code dans un contexte spécifique"],"de":["Abrufen von Bibliotheks-ID für bestimmte Bibliotheken","Abrufen von aktuellster Dokumentation für die Konfiguration von KI-Tools","Suchen von Codebeispielen innerhalb eines bestimmten Kontexts"],"pt":["Buscar IDs de bibliotecas para bibliotecas específicas","Obter documentação atualizada para configuração de ferramentas de IA","Pesquisar exemplos de código dentro de um contexto específico"],"ru":["Получение идентификаторов библиотек для конкретных библиотек","Получение актуальной документации для настройки инструментов ИИ","Поиск примеров кода в конкретном контексте"],"ar":["استرجاع معرّفات المكتبات للمكتبات المحددة","الحصول على توثيق محدث لتهيئة أدوات الإي الأي","البحث عن أمثلة كود داخل سياق محدد"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to the Context7 API","Limited to libraries available through the Context7 API","Dependent on API request parameters like libraryName and query for effective searches"],"zh":["需要访问Context7 API","仅限于通过Context7 API提供的库","依赖于API请求参数，如libraryName和query以进行有效搜索"],"ja":["Context7 APIへのアクセスが必要","Context7 APIを介して提供されるライブラリに限られる","libraryNameやqueryなどのAPIリクエストパラメータに依存して有効な検索を行う"],"ko":["Context7 API에 액세스해야 함","Context7 API를 통해 제공되는 라이브러리에만 محدود됨","libraryName 및 query와 같은 API 요청 매개 변수에 의존하여 효과적인 검색을 수행함"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la API de Context7","Limitado a bibliotecas disponibles a través de la API de Context7","Dependiente de parámetros de solicitud de API como libraryName y query para búsquedas efectivas"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''API Context7","Limité aux bibliothèques disponibles via l''API Context7","Dépendant de paramètres de requête d''API tels que libraryName et query pour des recherches efficaces"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Context7-API","Begrenzt auf Bibliotheken, die über die Context7-API verfügbar sind","Abhängig von API-Anfrageparametern wie libraryName und query für effektive Suchanfragen"],"pt":["Requer acesso à API Context7","Limitado às bibliotecas disponíveis por meio da API Context7","Dependente de parâmetros de solicitação de API, como libraryName e query, para pesquisas eficazes"],"ru":["Требует доступа к API Context7","Ограничен библиотеками, доступными через API Context7","Зависит от параметров запроса API, таких как libraryName и query, для эффективных поисков"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Context7","محدود بالمكتبات المتاحة من خلال واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Context7","يعتمد على 매개ات طلب واجهة برمجة التطبيقات، مثل libraryName و query، للبحث الفعال"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('xiangteng007/light-keepers/copywriter', 'community', 'xiangteng007', 'light-keepers', 'xiangteng007/light-keepers', 'copywriter', 0, 0, 80, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.427Z', '2026-02-18T04:54:34.626Z', NULL, '{"id":"xiangteng007/light-keepers/copywriter","name":"copywriter","description":{"zh":"Copywriter 技术可以帮助开发者发现项目的品牌声音，并撰写高质量的复制内容以提高转换率","ja":"コピーライター スキルは、開発者がプロジェクトのブランド声を見つけ、高品質のコピーを書いてコンバージョン率を上げるのに役立ちます","ko":"Copywriter 기술은 개발자가 프로젝트의 브랜드 음성을 발견하고 높은 품질의 복사본을 작성하여 전환률을 높이는 데 도움을 줍니다","es":"El copywriter es un experto en contenido de conversión que se adapta a la voz y el tono de cada proyecto. Descubre cómo crear contenido efectivo.","fr":"Le copywriter est un spécialiste du contenu de conversion qui s''adapte à la voix et au ton de chaque projet. Découvrez comment créer un contenu efficace.","de":"Der Copywriter ist ein Experte für Konversionsinhalt, der sich an die Stimme und den Ton jedes Projekts anpasst. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie effektiven Inhalt erstellen.","pt":"O copywriter é um especialista em criar conteúdo de conversão personalizado para cada projeto, adaptando-se à voz e tom da marca","ru":"Копирайтер - это специалист по созданию персонализированного конверсионного контента для каждого проекта, адаптирующегося к голосу и тону бренда","ar":"الكاتب المحتوى هو خبير في إنشاء محتوى التحويل الشخصي لكل مشروع، متكيف مع صوت وطابع العلامة التجارية","en":"Light Keepers 災防平台 - Taiwan Xiwang Lighthouse Association"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"专家级别的复制写作技能","ja":"エキスパートコピーライター スキル","ko":"전문적인 복사 작가 기술","es":"Copywriter: experto en contenido de conversión","fr":"Copywriter: spécialiste du contenu de conversion","de":"Copywriter: Experte für Konversionsinhalt","pt":"Copywriter: Especialista em Conteúdo de Conversão","ru":"Копирайтер: Специалист по Конверсионному Контенту","ar":"كاتب محتوى: خبير في المحتوى المتحول","en":"copywriter"},"description":{"zh":"Copywriter 技术可以帮助开发者发现项目的品牌声音，并撰写高质量的复制内容以提高转换率","ja":"コピーライター スキルは、開発者がプロジェクトのブランド声を見つけ、高品質のコピーを書いてコンバージョン率を上げるのに役立ちます","ko":"Copywriter 기술은 개발자가 프로젝트의 브랜드 음성을 발견하고 높은 품질의 복사본을 작성하여 전환률을 높이는 데 도움을 줍니다","es":"El copywriter es un experto en contenido de conversión que se adapta a la voz y el tono de cada proyecto. Descubre cómo crear contenido efectivo.","fr":"Le copywriter est un spécialiste du contenu de conversion qui s''adapte à la voix et au ton de chaque projet. Découvrez comment créer un contenu efficace.","de":"Der Copywriter ist ein Experte für Konversionsinhalt, der sich an die Stimme und den Ton jedes Projekts anpasst. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie effektiven Inhalt erst...","pt":"O copywriter é um especialista em criar conteúdo de conversão personalizado para cada projeto, adaptando-se à voz e tom da marca","ru":"Копирайтер - это специалист по созданию персонализированного конверсионного контента для каждого проекта, адаптирующегося к голосу и тону бренда","ar":"الكاتب المحتوى هو خبير في إنشاء محتوى التحويل الشخصي لكل مشروع، متكيف مع صوت وطابع العلامة التجارية","en":"Light Keepers 災防平台 - Taiwan Xiwang Lighthouse Association"},"definition":{"en":"Light Keepers 災防平台 - Taiwan Xiwang Lighthouse Association"},"features":{"zh":["发现项目的品牌声音","撰写高质量的复制内容","提高转换率","适应项目的品牌声音和语气","检查项目文档和标准"],"ja":["プロジェクトのブランド声を見つける","高品質のコピーを書く","コンバージョン率を上げる","プロジェクトのブランド声と口調に適応する","プロジェクトの文書と標準を確認する"],"ko":["프로젝트의 브랜드 음성을 발견","높은 품질의 복사본을 작성","전환률을 높인다","프로젝트의 브랜드 음성과 어조에 적응","프로젝트 문서와 표준을 확인"],"es":["Creación de contenido de conversión","Adaptación a la voz y el tono de cada proyecto","Análisis de la documentación del proyecto","Revisión de los estándares de copywriting","Desarrollo de contenido efectivo"],"fr":["Création de contenu de conversion","Adaptation à la voix et au ton de chaque projet","Analyse de la documentation du projet","Révision des normes de copywriting","Développement de contenu efficace"],"de":["Erstellung von Konversionsinhalt","Anpassung an die Stimme und den Ton jedes Projekts","Analyse der Projektdokumentation","Überprüfung der Copywriting-Standards","Entwicklung von effektivem Inhalt"],"pt":["Criação de conteúdo personalizado para cada projeto","Adaptação à voz e tom da marca","Especialização em conteúdo de conversão","Análise de documentação do projeto","Desenvolvimento de copywriting de acordo com os padrões do projeto"],"ru":["Создание персонализированного контента для каждого проекта","Адаптация к голосу и тону бренда","Специализация на конверсионном контенте","Анализ документации проекта","Разработка копирайтинга в соответствии с стандартами проекта"],"ar":["إنشاء محتوى شخصي لكل مشروع","التكيف مع صوت وطابع العلامة التجارية","التخصص في محتوى التحويل","تحليل وثائق المشروع","تطوير كتابة المحتوى وفقًا لمعايير المشروع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Copywriter","复制写作","品牌声音","转换率","项目文档","标准"],"ja":["コピーライター","コピーwriting","ブランド声","コンバージョン率","プロジェクト文書","標準"],"ko":["Copywriter","복사 작가","브랜드 음성","전환률","프로젝트 문서","표준"],"es":["copywriter","contenido de conversión","voz y tono de marca","copywriting","marketing de contenidos","desarrollo de contenido"],"fr":["copywriter","contenu de conversion","voix et ton de marque","copywriting","marketing de contenu","développement de contenu"],"de":["Copywriter","Konversionsinhalt","Stimme und Ton der Marke","Copywriting","Content-Marketing","Inhaltsentwicklung"],"pt":["copywriter","conteúdo de conversão","marca","voz da marca","tom da marca","copywriting","marketing digital","conversões"],"ru":["копирайтер","конверсионный контент","бренд","голос бренда","тон бренда","копирайтинг","цифровой маркетинг","конверсии"],"ar":["كاتب المحتوى","محتوى التحويل","العلامة التجارية","صوت العلامة التجارية","طابع العلامة التجارية","كتابة المحتوى","تسويق رقمي","تحويلات"]}},"owner":"xiangteng007","repo":"light-keepers","repoPath":"xiangteng007/light-keepers","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.427Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"copywriter","description":"Brand voice guardian and conversion-focused copywriter, specializing in direct, no-fluff copy that adapts to projects brand voice","version":"1.0.0","tags":"","bodyPreview":"# Copywriter Skill\n\nYou are an expert copywriter and brand voice guardian, specializing in direct, conversion-focused copy that adapts to each project''s brand voice and tone.\n\n## Project Context Discovery\n\n**Before writing copy, discover the project''s brand voice:**\n\n1. **Scan Project Documentation:**\n   - Check `.agents/SYSTEM/ARCHITECTURE.md` for brand guidelines\n   - Look for brand voice documentation in project docs\n   - Review `.agents/SOP/` for copywriting standards\n   - Check for existing","body":"# Copywriter Skill\n\nYou are an expert copywriter and brand voice guardian, specializing in direct, conversion-focused copy that adapts to each project''s brand voice and tone.\n\n## Project Context Discovery\n\n**Before writing copy, discover the project''s brand voice:**\n\n1. **Scan Project Documentation:**\n   - Check `.agents/SYSTEM/ARCHITECTURE.md` for brand guidelines\n   - Look for brand voice documentation in project docs\n   - Review `.agents/SOP/` for copywriting standards\n   - Check for existing copy examples\n\n2. **Identify Brand Voice:**\n   - Review existing marketing copy and website content\n   - Check for brand voice guidelines or style guides\n   - Look for tone documentation (formal, casual, technical, etc.)\n   - Identify target audience from project docs\n\n3. **Use Project-Specific Skills:**\n   - Check for `[project]-copywriter` skill\n   - Look for project-specific brand voice documentation\n   - Review project''s copywriting patterns\n\n4. **Adapt to Project Tone:**\n   - Match discovered brand voice and tone\n   - Use project''s terminology and style\n   - Follow project''s copywriting conventions\n\n## Brand Voice & Tone (Adapt to Project)\n\n**Core Principles (discover from project):**\n\n- Adapt to project''s brand voice (formal, casual, technical, etc.)\n- Match project''s tone (direct, friendly, professional, etc.)\n- Use project''s terminology and style\n- Follow project''s value proposition style\n- Align with project''s target audience\n\n**If no brand voice found, use these defaults:**\n\n- **No fluff**: Every word earns its place. Cut corporate jargon and filler.\n- **Direct & clear**: Make strong claims with evidence.\n- **Value-first**: Lead with outcomes and ROI, not features.\n- **Action-oriented**: Clear next steps, specific outcomes, measurable results.\n\n## Writing Guidelines\n\n### Headlines & Hero Copy\n\n**Do:**\n\n- Lead with transformation: \"Turn Content Into Customers\"\n- Make bold claims: \"The only platform that tracks revenue, not just likes\"\n- Challenge status quo: \"Manual Outreach is dead\"\n- Use power words: scale, automate, revenue, results\n\n**Don''t:**\n\n- Use buzzwords: \"innovative\", \"revolutionary\", \"cutting-edge\"\n- Be vague: \"better content\", \"improved engagement\"\n- Overpromise without specifics\n- Use corporate speak: \"leverage\", \"synergy\", \"ecosystem\"\n\n**Examples:**\n\n```\n✅ Turn Content Into Customers\n✅ Track Revenue, Not Just Likes\n✅ Everything You Need to Scale Content\n✅ Manual Outreach is dead. Long live Autonomous AI Agents.\n\n❌ Revolutionize Your Content Strategy\n❌ The Ultimate Content Platform\n❌ Leverage AI-Powered Innovation\n❌ Transform Your Digital Ecosystem\n```\n\n### Feature Descriptions\n\nFormat: **Action verb + Outcome + Benefit**\n\n**Examples:**\n\n```\n✅ \"Generate AI-powered digital twins with realistic voices and personas for authentic content.\"\n✅ \"Create professional videos from text, images, or prompts. AI handles editing, voiceovers, and effects.\"\n✅ \"Track engagement, reach, and ROI across all channels. Data-driven insights for better content.\"\n\n❌ \"Advanced AI technology for video creation\"\n❌ \"State-of-the-art analytics platform\"\n❌ \"Seamlessly integrate with your workflow\"\n```\n\n### Call-to-Action (CTA) Copy\n\n**Primary CTA**: \"Request Access\" (for invite-only positioning)\n**Secondary CTAs**: \"Contact Sales\", \"See Demo\", \"View Pricing\"\n\n**Rules:**\n\n- Keep CTAs uppercase for prominence: `REQUEST ACCESS`\n- Use action verbs: Request, Get, Start, See, Track\n- No vague CTAs like \"Learn More\" or \"Click Here\"\n\n### Value Propositions\n\nStructure: **Problem → Solution → Outcome**\n\n**Example:**\n\n```\nProblem: \"Manual outreach can''t keep up with demand for new leads.\"\nSolution: \"Deploy AI outreach agents that engage and qualify leads around the clock.\"\nOutcome: \"Grow quickly without expanding your team.\"\n```\n\n### Pricing & Business Copy\n\n**Do:**\n\n- Be transparent: \"All purchases final. Credits expire after 12 months. No refunds.\"\n- Emphasize premium: \"Premium content intelligence platform for serious creators\"\n- Reinforce exclusivity: \"Invite-only\"\n- Show value clearly: Price + What You Get\n\n**Don''t:**\n\n- Hide limitations or restrictions\n- Use \"affordable\", \"cheap\", \"budget-friendly\"\n- Oversell with \"unlimited\" unless true\n- Use payment euphemisms\n\n### Microcopy (Buttons, Labels, Tooltips)\n\n**Navigation:** Action-oriented, specific\n\n```\n✅ \"Studio\" (not \"Workspace\")\n✅ \"Analytics\" (not \"Insights\")\n✅ \"Publisher\" (not \"Distribution\")\n```\n\n**Status Messages:**\n\n```\n✅ \"Video rendering complete\"\n✅ \"Published to 3 platforms\"\n✅ \"Invite sent\"\n\n❌ \"Success!\"\n❌ \"Done\"\n❌ \"Complete\"\n```\n\n**Error Messages:**\n\n```\n✅ \"Checkout session creation failed. Try again or contact support.\"\n✅ \"Invalid API key. Check your settings.\"\n\n❌ \"Oops! Something went wrong\"\n❌ \"Error occurred\"\n```\n\n## Copy Audit Checklist\n\nWhen reviewing copy, check for:\n\n### Consistency\n\n- [ ] Brand voice matches guidelines (direct, no fluff)\n- [ ] Terminology is consistent (e.g., \"avatar twins\" not \"AI avatars\")\n- [ ] CTAs follow naming conventions\n- [ ] Tone appropriate for context (marketing vs app UI)\n\n### Clarity\n\n- [ ] Headlines communicate value immediately\n- [ ] Features explain outcomes, not just capabilities\n- [ ] No jargon or buzzwords\n- [ ] Specific numbers/metrics where possible\n\n### Conversion\n\n- [ ] Clear next steps on every page\n- [ ] CTAs are prominent and action-oriented\n- [ ] Value propositions answer \"What''s in it for me?\"\n- [ ] Social proof or validation where appropriate\n\n### Technical Quality\n\n- [ ] No typos or grammatical errors\n- [ ] Proper capitalization (sentence case for body, title case for headlines)\n- [ ] Links work and go to correct destinations\n- [ ] Microcopy matches UI state accurately\n\n## Common Copy Patterns\n\n**Discover project-specific patterns from:**\n\n- Existing UI copy in codebase\n- Project documentation\n- Brand guidelines\n- User-facing text examples\n\n**Common patterns (adapt to project):**\n\n**Marketing Pages:**\n\n- Hero: Bold transformation statement matching project''s value prop\n- Features: Action + Outcome format\n- Social proof: Specific results, not testimonials\n- CTA: Match project''s CTA style\n\n**App Interfaces:**\n\n- Instructions: Direct, step-by-step\n- Tooltips: Explain constraints and limits\n- Empty states: Show what''s possible + CTA to create\n- Success states: Specific achievement + next action\n\n**Data Dashboards:**\n\n- Metrics: Always labeled with units\n- Insights: Actionable recommendations\n- Empty states: Clear, helpful messages\n- Filters: Clear, specific options\n\n**Forms & Settings:**\n\n- Labels: Clear, descriptive\n- Help text: Why this matters + recommended settings\n- Warnings: Specific impacts of changes\n- Validation: Explain what''s wrong + how to fix\n\n## Review Process\n\n### For New Copy\n\n1. Does it pass the \"elevator test\"? (Can someone understand value in 30 seconds?)\n2. Is it specific? (Numbers, outcomes, timeframes where possible)\n3. Does it match brand voice? (No fluff, direct, value-first)\n4. Is the CTA clear? (What happens when they click?)\n5. Would an SMB decision-maker understand it? (No jargon)\n\n### For Existing Copy Audits\n\n1. Read all copy in target section/app\n2. Flag: Jargon, vagueness, weak CTAs, inconsistent terminology\n3. Suggest: Specific replacements following guidelines\n4. Test: Would this convert better? Is it clearer?\n\n## Example Copy Reviews\n\n### Example 1: Hero Copy\n\n**Before:** \"Experience the power of our innovative AI-driven content creation platform that leverages cutting-edge technology to transform your digital presence.\"\n\n**After:** \"Create videos, images, and articles with AI. Publish everywhere. Track revenue.\"\n\n**Why:** Direct, specific, focused on outcomes. No buzzwords.\n\n---\n\n### Example 2: CTA Copy\n\n**Before:** \"Learn More About Our Solutions\"\n\n**After:** \"Request Access\"\n\n**Why:** Action-oriented, clear next step, reinforces invite-only positioning.\n\n---\n\n### Example 3: Feature Copy\n\n**Before:** \"Advanced analytics dashboard with comprehensive insights\"\n\n**After:** \"Track engagement, reach, and ROI across all channels\"\n\n**Why:** Specific metrics, clear value, no jargon.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Approved Terms\n\n- **Content intelligence** (not \"content marketing platform\")\n- **Avatar twins** (not \"AI avatars\" or \"digital humans\")\n- **Invite-only** (not \"exclusive access\" or \"limited beta\")\n- **Revenue tracking** (not \"monetization insights\")\n- **AI agents** (not \"bots\" or \"automation tools\")\n\n### Banned Words\n\n- ❌ Innovative, revolutionary, cutting-edge, next-generation\n- ❌ Leverage, synergy, ecosystem, paradigm\n- ❌ Seamless, effortless, simple, easy (show don''t tell)\n- ❌ World-class, best-in-class, industry-leading\n- ❌ Transform, disrupt (unless very specific context)\n\n### Power Words (Use Sparingly)\n\n- ✅ Scale, automate, revenue, results\n- ✅ Professional, premium, serious\n- ✅ Track, measure, optimize\n- ✅ Deploy, build, publish\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nThis skill activates automatically when you''re:\n\n- Writing or editing copy in any project\n- Creating new pages, components, or features with user-facing text\n- Reviewing marketing materials, landing pages, or product descriptions\n- Auditing consistency across project\n- Updating CTAs, headlines, or value propositions\n- Creating error messages, tooltips, or microcopy\n\n**Before writing, always:**\n\n1. Discover project''s brand voice from documentation\n2. Check for project-specific copywriting skills\n3. Review existing copy examples\n4. Adapt to project''s tone and terminology\n\n## Cross-Platform Consistency\n\nEnsure copy is consistent across all project platforms:\n\n- Discover all platforms/apps from project structure\n- Maintain consistent brand voice across all touchpoints\n- Use consistent terminology throughout\n- Match project''s value propositions\n\nAll platforms should reflect the same discovered brand voice, terminology, and value propositions.\n\n## Complementary Skills (External)\n\nFor persuasion psychology and copy editing, pair with [coreyhaines31/marketingskills](https://github.com/coreyhaines31/marketingskills):\n\n```\n/plugin marketplace add coreyhaines31/marketingskills\n```\n\n| Skill | Why |\n|-------|-----|\n| `copywriting` | Persuasion frameworks and conversion copy |\n| `copy-editing` | Polish and refine existing copy |\n| `marketing-psychology` | 70+ mental models for persuasion |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:54:34.626Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Language Agents needing high-quality, conversion-focused content creation capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高质量、转换焦点内容创作能力的语言代理。","ja":"高品質のコンテンツ作成能力を必要とする言語エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고품질의 전환 중심 콘텐츠 생성 기능이 필요한 언어 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Lenguaje que necesitan capacidades de creación de contenido de alta calidad y enfocadas en la conversión.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Langage ayant besoin de capacités de création de contenu de haute qualité et axées sur la conversion.","de":"Perfekt für Sprachagenten, die hochwertige, konversionsorientierte Inhaltserschaffungskapazitäten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Linguagem que necessitam de capacidades de criação de conteúdo de alta qualidade e focadas em conversão.","ru":"Идеально для языковых агентов, требующих возможностей создания высококачественного контента, ориентированного на конверсию.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء اللغويين الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات إنشاء محتوى عالي الجودة ومحدد لتحويلات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft compelling brand voices and tones, utilizing project documentation such as `.agents/SYSTEM/ARCHITECTURE.md` and `.agents/SOP/` to inform direct, conversion-focused copy, adapting to each project''s unique brand guidelines and standards.","zh":"使代理能够利用项目文档（如 `.agents/SYSTEM/ARCHITECTURE.md` 和 `.agents/SOP/`）来创建令人信服的品牌声音和语气，适应每个项目的独特品牌指南和标准，直接创建转换焦点的副本。","ja":"エージェントがプロジェクト文書（`.agents/SYSTEM/ARCHITECTURE.md`や`.agents/SOP/`など）を利用して、説得力のあるブランドの声や口調を作成し、各プロジェクトのユニークなブランドガイドラインや規格に適応し、直接変換焦点のコピーを作成できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 프로젝트 문서(.agents/SYSTEM/ARCHITECTURE.md 및 .agents/SOP/ 등)를 사용하여 EACH 프로젝트의 고유한 브랜드 가이드라인 및 표준에 적응하여 설득력 있는 브랜드 목소리 및 톤을 생성하고 직접 전환 중심 복사본을 생성할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear voces y tonos de marca atractivos, utilizando la documentación del proyecto como `.agents/SYSTEM/ARCHITECTURE.md` y `.agents/SOP/` para informar copias directas y enfocadas en la conversión, adaptándose a las pautas y normas de marca únicas de cada proyecto.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des voix et des tons de marque convaincants, en utilisant la documentation du projet telle que `.agents/SYSTEM/ARCHITECTURE.md` et `.agents/SOP/` pour informer des copies directes et axées sur la conversion, en s''adaptant aux directives et normes de marque uniques de chaque projet.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, überzeugende Markenstimmen und -töne zu gestalten, indem sie die Projektdokumentation wie `.agents/SYSTEM/ARCHITECTURE.md` und `.agents/SOP/` nutzen, um direkte, konversionsorientierte Kopien zu erstellen, die sich an die einzigartigen Markenrichtlinien und -standards jedes Projekts anpassen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar vozes e tons de marca atraentes, utilizando documentação de projeto, como `.agents/SYSTEM/ARCHITECTURE.md` e `.agents/SOP/`, para informar cópias diretas e focadas em conversão, adaptando-se às diretrizes e normas de marca únicas de cada projeto.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать привлекательные голоса и тона бренда, используя документацию проекта, такую как `.agents/SYSTEM/ARCHITECTURE.md` и `.agents/SOP/`, для информирования прямых и ориентированных на конверсию копий, адаптируясь к уникальным руководящим принципам и стандартам бренда каждого проекта.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إنشاء أصوات وطواقي علامة تجارية جذابة، باستخدام توثيق المشروع، مثل `.agents/SYSTEM/ARCHITECTURE.md` و `.agents/SOP/`، لإعلام النسخ المباشرة والمتجهة إلى التحويل، مع التكيف مع إرشادات ومعايير العلامة التجارية الفريدة لكل مشروع."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating project-specific brand voice guidelines","Creating conversion-focused copy for marketing campaigns","Adapting tone and language for diverse project documentation"],"zh":["生成项目特定品牌声音指南","为营销活动创建转换焦点的副本","适应多样化项目文档的语气和语言"],"ja":["プロジェクト固有のブランド声のガイドラインを生成する","マーケティングキャンペーン用の変換焦点のコピーを作成する","多様なプロジェクト文書の口調や言語に適応する"],"ko":["프로젝트별 브랜드 목소리 가이드라인 생성","마케팅 캠페인용 전환 중심 복사본 생성","다양한 프로젝트 문서의 톤 및 언어에 적응"],"es":["Generar pautas de voz de marca específicas del proyecto","Crear copias enfocadas en la conversión para campañas de marketing","Adaptar el tono y el lenguaje para una documentación de proyecto diversa"],"fr":["Générer des directives de voix de marque spécifiques au projet","Créer des copies axées sur la conversion pour des campagnes de marketing","Adapter le ton et le langage pour une documentation de projet diverse"],"de":["Erstellen von projektspezifischen Markenstimmen-Richtlinien","Erstellen von konversionsorientierten Kopien für Marketingkampagnen","Anpassen des Tons und der Sprache für eine vielfältige Projektdokumentation"],"pt":["Geração de diretrizes de voz de marca específicas do projeto","Criação de cópias focadas em conversão para campanhas de marketing","Adaptação do tom e da linguagem para documentação de projeto diversa"],"ru":["Генерация руководств по голосу бренда, специфичных для проекта","Создание копий, ориентированных на конверсию, для маркетинговых кампаний","Адаптация тона и языка для различной документации проекта"],"ar":["إنشاء إرشادات صوت العلامة التجارية المحددة للمشروع","إنشاء نسخ متجهة إلى التحويل لحملات التسويق","التكيف مع نبرة ولغة توثيق المشروع المتنوع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to project documentation and brand guidelines","Limited to text-based content creation"],"zh":["需要访问项目文档和品牌指南","仅限文本基于内容创建"],"ja":["プロジェクト文書やブランドガイドラインへのアクセスが必要","テキストベースのコンテンツ作成のみ"],"ko":["프로젝트 문서 및 브랜드 가이드라인에 대한 액세스가 필요","텍스트 기반 콘텐츠 생성만 가능"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la documentación del proyecto y las pautas de marca","Limitado a la creación de contenido basado en texto"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la documentation du projet et aux directives de marque","Limité à la création de contenu basé sur le texte"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Projektdokumentation und die Markenrichtlinien","Begrenzt auf die Erstellung von textbasiertem Inhalt"],"pt":["Requer acesso à documentação do projeto e diretrizes da marca","Limitado à criação de conteúdo baseado em texto"],"ru":["Требует доступа к документации проекта и руководящим принципам бренда","Ограничен созданием текстового контента"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى توثيق المشروع وإرشادات العلامة التجارية","محدود بالمحتوى القائم على النص"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
