to de arquivos seguro","Upload e download de arquivos","Gerenciamento de arquivos eficiente","Integração com AWS, Azure e GCP","Otimização de custos","Arquiteturas de nuvem nativas"],"ru":["Безопасное хранение файлов","Загрузка и скачивание файлов","Эффективное управление файлами","Интеграция с AWS, Azure и GCP","Оптимизация затрат","Облачные архитектуры native"],"ar":["تخزين ملفات آمن","تحميل وتنزيل الملفات","إدارة ملفات فعالة","التكامل مع AWS و Azure و GCP","تحسين التكاليف","هندسة السحابة الأصلية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["云架构师","云存储","migration 模式","成本优化","云原生架构","安全性设计","运营优化","多云架构"],"ja":["クラウドアーキテクト","クラウドストレージ","移行パターン","コスト最適化","クラウドネイティブアーキテクチャ","セキュリティ設計","運用最適化","多クラウドアーキテクチャ"],"ko":["클라우드 아키텍트","클라우드 저장소","마이그레이션 패턴","비용 최적화","클라우드 네이티브 아키텍처","보안 설계","운용 최적화","멀티 클라우드 아키텍처"],"es":["arquitecto de nube senior","estrategias de nube múltiple","migración de aplicaciones","optimización de costos","seguridad por diseño","excelencia operativa","aws","azure","gcp"],"fr":["architecte cloud senior","stratégies de cloud multinuage","migration d''applications","optimisation des coûts","sécurité par conception","excellence opérationnelle","aws","azure","gcp"],"de":["senior cloud architekt","multi-cloud-strategien","anwendungs-migration","kostenoptimierung","sicherheit durch design","betriebliche exzellenz","aws","azure","gcp"],"pt":["arquiteto de nuvem","armazenamento de arquivos","nuvem","AWS","Azure","GCP","otimização de custos","arquiteturas de nuvem nativas"],"ru":["облачный архитектор","хранение файлов","облако","AWS","Azure","GCP","оптимизация затрат","облачные архитектуры native"],"ar":["مهندس السحابة","تخزين الملفات","السحابة","AWS","Azure","GCP","تحسين التكاليف","هندسة السحابة الأصلية"]}},"owner":"D1ngirsu","repo":"MiniDrive","repoPath":"D1ngirsu/MiniDrive","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.427Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cloud-architect","description":"Use when designing cloud architectures, planning migrations, or optimizing multi-cloud deployments. Invoke for Well-Architected Framework, cost optimization, disaster recovery, landing zones, security architecture, serverless design.","bodyPreview":"# Cloud Architect\n\nSenior cloud architect specializing in multi-cloud strategies, migration patterns, cost optimization, and cloud-native architectures across AWS, Azure, and GCP.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior cloud architect with 15+ years of experience designing enterprise cloud solutions. You specialize in multi-cloud architectures, migration strategies (6Rs), cost optimization, security by design, and operational excellence. You design highly available, secure, and cost-effective clo","body":"# Cloud Architect\n\nSenior cloud architect specializing in multi-cloud strategies, migration patterns, cost optimization, and cloud-native architectures across AWS, Azure, and GCP.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior cloud architect with 15+ years of experience designing enterprise cloud solutions. You specialize in multi-cloud architectures, migration strategies (6Rs), cost optimization, security by design, and operational excellence. You design highly available, secure, and cost-effective cloud infrastructures following Well-Architected Framework principles.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Designing cloud architectures (AWS, Azure, GCP)\n- Planning cloud migrations and modernization\n- Implementing multi-cloud and hybrid cloud strategies\n- Optimizing cloud costs (right-sizing, reserved instances, spot)\n- Designing for high availability and disaster recovery\n- Implementing cloud security and compliance\n- Setting up landing zones and governance\n- Architecting serverless and container platforms\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n1. **Discovery** - Assess current state, requirements, constraints, compliance needs\n2. **Design** - Select services, design topology, plan data architecture\n3. **Security** - Implement zero-trust, identity federation, encryption\n4. **Cost Model** - Right-size resources, reserved capacity, auto-scaling\n5. **Migration** - Apply 6Rs framework, define waves, test failover\n6. **Operate** - Set up monitoring, automation, continuous optimization\n\n## Reference Guide\n\nLoad detailed guidance based on context:\n\n| Topic | Reference | Load When |\n|-------|-----------|-----------|\n| AWS Services | `references/aws.md` | EC2, S3, Lambda, RDS, Well-Architected Framework |\n| Azure Services | `references/azure.md` | VMs, Storage, Functions, SQL, Cloud Adoption Framework |\n| GCP Services | `references/gcp.md` | Compute Engine, Cloud Storage, Cloud Functions, BigQuery |\n| Multi-Cloud | `references/multi-cloud.md` | Abstraction layers, portability, vendor lock-in mitigation |\n| Cost Optimization | `references/cost.md` | Reserved instances, spot, right-sizing, FinOps practices |\n\n## Constraints\n\n### MUST DO\n- Design for high availability (99.9%+)\n- Implement security by design (zero-trust)\n- Use infrastructure as code (Terraform, CloudFormation)\n- Enable cost allocation tags and monitoring\n- Plan disaster recovery with defined RTO/RPO\n- Implement multi-region for critical workloads\n- Use managed services when possible\n- Document architectural decisions\n\n### MUST NOT DO\n- Store credentials in code or public repos\n- Skip encryption (at rest and in transit)\n- Create single points of failure\n- Ignore cost optimization opportunities\n- Deploy without proper monitoring\n- Use overly complex architectures\n- Ignore compliance requirements\n- Skip disaster recovery testing\n\n## Output Templates\n\nWhen designing cloud architecture, provide:\n1. Architecture diagram with services and data flow\n2. Service selection rationale (compute, storage, database, networking)\n3. Security architecture (IAM, network segmentation, encryption)\n4. Cost estimation and optimization strategy\n5. Deployment approach and rollback plan\n\n## Knowledge Reference\n\nAWS (EC2, S3, Lambda, RDS, VPC, CloudFront), Azure (VMs, Blob Storage, Functions, SQL Database, VNet), GCP (Compute Engine, Cloud Storage, Cloud Functions, Cloud SQL), Kubernetes, Docker, Terraform, CloudFormation, ARM templates, CI/CD, disaster recovery, cost optimization, security best practices, compliance frameworks (SOC2, HIPAA, PCI-DSS)\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **DevOps Engineer** - CI/CD pipelines and automation\n- **Kubernetes Specialist** - Container orchestration\n- **Terraform Engineer** - Infrastructure as code\n- **Security Reviewer** - Security architecture validation\n- **Microservices Architect** - Cloud-native application patterns\n- **Monitoring Expert** - Observability and alerting\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:55:32.632Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing expertise in multi-cloud strategies and cloud-native architectures across AWS, Azure, and GCP.","zh":"非常适合需要在多云策略和云原生架构方面具有专长的AI代理，尤其是在AWS、Azure和GCP等云平台上。","ja":"AWS、Azure、GCPなどのマルチクラウド戦略とクラウドネイティブアーキテクチャに精通したAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"AWS, Azure, GCP 등의 멀티 클라우드 전략과 클라우드 네이티브 아키텍처에 전문성을 필요로 하는 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan experiencia en estrategias de multi-nube y arquitecturas nativas de nube en AWS, Azure y GCP.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin d''expertise en stratégies multi-nuage et en architectures natives de nuage sur AWS, Azure et GCP.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die Expertenwissen in Multi-Cloud-Strategien und cloud-nativen Architekturen über AWS, Azure und GCP benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de especialização em estratégias multi-nuvem e arquiteturas nativas da nuvem em AWS, Azure e GCP.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, которым необходимы знания в области стратегий многокloud и облачных архитектур в AWS, Azure и GCP.","ar":"مثالي ل와كلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى خبرة في استراتيجيات الcloud المتعددة والهياكل المعمارية الأصلية للcloud عبر AWS و Azure و GCP."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design highly available, secure, and cost-effective cloud solutions using migration patterns, cost optimization, and security by design, leveraging expertise in 6Rs migration strategies and operational excellence.","zh":"赋予代理设计高可用性、安全性和成本效益的云解决方案的能力，使用迁移模式、成本优化和设计中的安全性，利用6Rs迁移策略和运营卓越性的专业知识。","ja":"マイグレーションパターン、コスト最適化、設計段階でのセキュリティを活用し、6Rsマイグレーション戦略と運用の優秀性の専門知識を利用して、高可用性、セキュリティ、コスト効率の高いクラウドソリューションを設計するエージェントの能力を付与します。","ko":"이동 패턴, 비용 최적화 및 설계 단계의 보안을 사용하여 높은 가용성, 보안 및 비용 효율성을 가진 클라우드 솔루션을 설계할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하며, 6Rs 이동 전략 및 운영 우수성의 전문 지식을 활용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes diseñar soluciones de nube altamente disponibles, seguras y rentables utilizando patrones de migración, optimización de costos y seguridad por diseño, aprovechando la experiencia en estrategias de migración 6Rs y excelencia operativa.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des solutions cloud hautement disponibles, sécurisées et rentables en utilisant des modèles de migration, une optimisation des coûts et une sécurité par conception, en exploitant l''expertise dans les stratégies de migration 6Rs et l''excellence opérationnelle.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, hochverfügbare, sichere und kosteneffiziente Cloud-Lösungen zu entwerfen, indem sie Migrationsmuster, Kostenoptimierung und Sicherheit durch Design verwenden und dabei die Expertise in 6Rs-Migrationsstrategien und operativer Exzellenz nutzen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes projetem soluções de nuvem altamente disponíveis, seguras e rentáveis, utilizando padrões de migração, otimização de custos e segurança por design, aproveitando a especialização em estratégias de migração 6Rs e excelência operacional.","ru":"Позволяет агентам проектировать высокодоступные, безопасные и экономически эффективные облачные решения, используя шаблоны миграции, оптимизацию затрат и безопасность по конструкции, используя знания в области стратегий миграции 6Rs и операционного совершенства.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تصميم حلول سحابية ذات توافر عالي وأمن وكفاءة في التكلفة، باستخدام أنماط الهجرة وتحسين التكلفة والأمن المصمم، واستخدام الخبرة في استراتيجيات الهجرة 6Rs والتميز التشغيلي."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing multi-cloud architectures for enterprise-level applications","Optimizing cloud costs using advanced cost optimization techniques","Migrating applications to cloud-native architectures using 6Rs strategies"],"zh":["为企业级应用程序设计多云架构","使用高级成本优化技术优化云成本","使用6Rs策略将应用程序迁移到云原生架构"],"ja":["エンタープライズレベルのアプリケーション用のマルチクラウドアーキテクチャを設計する","高度なコスト最適化テクニックを使用してクラウドコストを最適化する","6Rs戦略を使用してアプリケーションをクラウドネイティブアーキテクチャに移行する"],"ko":["企業 수준의 애플리케이션을 위한 멀티 클라우드 아키텍처 설계","고급 비용 최적화 기술을 사용하여 클라우드 비용 최적화","6Rs 전략을 사용하여 애플리케이션을 클라우드 네이티브 아키텍처로 마이그레이션"],"es":["Diseñar arquitecturas de multi-nube para aplicaciones de nivel empresarial","Optimizar los costos de la nube utilizando técnicas de optimización de costos avanzadas","Migrar aplicaciones a arquitecturas nativas de nube utilizando estrategias 6Rs"],"fr":["Concevoir des architectures multi-nuage pour des applications de niveau entreprise","Optimiser les coûts du cloud en utilisant des techniques d''optimisation de coûts avancées","Migrer des applications vers des architectures natives de nuage en utilisant des stratégies 6Rs"],"de":["Entwerfen von Multi-Cloud-Architekturen für Unternehmensanwendungen","Optimieren von Cloud-Kosten mit Hilfe von fortschrittlichen Kostenoptimierungstechniken","Migrieren von Anwendungen zu cloud-nativen Architekturen unter Verwendung von 6Rs-Strategien"],"pt":["Projeto de arquiteturas multi-nuvem para aplicações de nível empresarial","Otimização de custos de nuvem usando técnicas avançadas de otimização de custos","Migração de aplicações para arquiteturas nativas da nuvem usando estratégias 6Rs"],"ru":["Проектирование многокloud-архитектур для корпоративных приложений","Оптимизация облачных затрат с использованием продвинутых методов оптимизации затрат","Миграция приложений на облачные архитектуры с использованием стратегий 6Rs"],"ar":["تصميم هياكل معمارية سحابية متعددة لبرامج المؤسسات","تحسين تكاليف السحابة باستخدام تقنيات متقدمة لتحسين التكلفة","هجرة التطبيقات إلى هياكل سحابية أصلية باستخدام استراتيجيات 6Rs"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires expertise in cloud computing platforms (AWS, Azure, GCP)","Limited to cloud architecture design and planning","Does not include hands-on implementation or deployment"],"zh":["需要云计算平台（AWS、Azure、GCP）的专业知识","仅限于云架构设计和规划","不包括手动实施或部署"],"ja":["クラウドコンピューティングプラットフォーム（AWS、Azure、GCP）の専門知識が必要","クラウドアーキテクチャの設計と計画に限定される","ハンドオンの実装やデプロイは含まれない"],"ko":["클라우드 컴퓨팅 플랫폼(AWS, Azure, GCP)의 전문 지식이 필요","클라우드 아키텍처 설계 및 계획에만 국한","수동 구현 또는 배포는 포함되지 않음"],"es":["Requiere experiencia en plataformas de computación en la nube (AWS, Azure, GCP)","Limitado al diseño y planificación de la arquitectura de la nube","No incluye la implementación o implementación práctica"],"fr":["Nécessite une expertise dans les plateformes de calcul en nuage (AWS, Azure, GCP)","Limité à la conception et à la planification de l''architecture du cloud","Ne comprend pas la mise en œuvre ou le déploiement pratique"],"de":["Benötigt Expertenwissen in Cloud-Computing-Plattformen (AWS, Azure, GCP)","Begrenzt auf Cloud-Architektur-Design und -Planung","Enthält keine praktische Implementierung oder Bereitstellung"],"pt":["Exige especialização em plataformas de computação em nuvem (AWS, Azure, GCP)","Limitado ao design e planejamento de arquitetura de nuvem","Não inclui implementação ou implantação prática"],"ru":["Требует знаний в области облачных платформ (AWS, Azure, GCP)","Ограничен проектированием и планированием облачной архитектуры","Не включает практическую реализацию или развертывание"],"ar":["يتطلب خبرة في منصات الحوسبة السحابية (AWS و Azure و GCP)","محدود بتصميم وتنظيم هياكل السحابة","لا يشمل التنفيذ أو التطبيق العملي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('mich3333/mich3333/subagents-discipline', 'community', 'mich3333', 'mich3333', 'mich3333/mich3333', 'subagents-discipline', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.427Z', '2026-02-18T04:56:10.746Z', NULL, '{"id":"mich3333/mich3333/subagents-discipline","name":"subagents-discipline","description":{"zh":"subagents-discipline是一种代码实现纪律，旨在提高代码质量和可靠性","ja":"subagents-disciplineはコードの実装に関する規範で、コードの品質と信頼性を向上させる","ko":"subagents-discipline는 코드 품질과 신뢰성을 향상시키는 구현 규칙","es":"La disciplina de subagentes se centra en probar las características, no solo los componentes que se construyen. Esto ayuda a detectar errores y mejorar la calidad del código.","fr":"La discipline des sous-agents se concentre sur le test des fonctionnalités, et non seulement des composants que vous construisez. Cela aide à détecter les erreurs et à améliorer la qualité du code.","de":"Die Disziplin der Subagenten konzentriert sich auf das Testen von Funktionen, nicht nur der Komponenten, die Sie erstellen. Dies hilft, Fehler zu erkennen und die Qualität des Codes zu verbessern.","en":"Config files for my GitHub profile."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"subagents-discipline 技术指南","ja":"subagents-discipline 開発ガイド","ko":"subagents-discipline 개발 가이드","es":"Disciplina de subagentes: Mejora tu código","fr":"Discipline des sous-agents : Améliorez votre code","de":"Subagenten-Disziplin: Verbessern Sie Ihren Code","en":"subagents-discipline"},"description":{"zh":"subagents-discipline是一种代码实现纪律，旨在提高代码质量和可靠性","ja":"subagents-disciplineはコードの実装に関する規範で、コードの品質と信頼性を向上させる","ko":"subagents-discipline는 코드 품질과 신뢰성을 향상시키는 구현 규칙","es":"La disciplina de subagentes se centra en probar las características, no solo los componentes que se construyen. Esto ayuda a detectar errores y mejorar la ca...","fr":"La discipline des sous-agents se concentre sur le test des fonctionnalités, et non seulement des composants que vous construisez. Cela aide à détecter les er...","de":"Die Disziplin der Subagenten konzentriert sich auf das Testen von Funktionen, nicht nur der Komponenten, die Sie erstellen. Dies hilft, Fehler zu erkennen un...","en":"Config files for my GitHub profile."},"definition":{"en":"Config files for my GitHub profile."},"features":{"zh":["测试功能而非组件","查看实际数据","注意字段名和类型","编码时依据观察结果"],"ja":["機能をテストする","実際のデータを確認する","フィールド名とタイプを注意する","観察結果に基づいてコードを記述する"],"ko":["기능을 테스트한다","실제 데이터를 확인한다","필드 이름과 유형을 주의한다","관찰 결과에 따라 코드를 작성한다"],"es":["Prueba de características, no solo componentes","Verificación de datos reales antes de codificar","Notación de nombres de campos y tipos exactos","Codificación contra lo observado, no lo asumido"],"fr":["Test des fonctionnalités, et non seulement des composants","Vérification des données réelles avant de coder","Notation des noms de champs et des types exacts","Codage contre ce qui est observé, et non ce qui est supposé"],"de":["Testen von Funktionen, nicht nur Komponenten","Überprüfung von Echtdaten vor dem Codieren","Notation von genauen Feldnamen und -typen","Codieren gegen das Beobachtete, nicht das Angenommene"]},"keywords":{"zh":["subagents-discipline","代码质量","可靠性","编码实践","测试","功能测试"],"ja":["subagents-discipline","コード品質","信頼性","コーディング慣行","テスト","機能テスト"],"ko":["subagents-discipline","코드 품질","신뢰성","코딩 관행","테스트","기능 테스트"],"es":["disciplina de subagentes","pruebas de características","desarrollo de software","calidad del código","reducción de errores","mejora de la calidad"],"fr":["discipline des sous-agents","tests de fonctionnalités","développement de logiciels","qualité du code","réduction des erreurs","amélioration de la qualité"],"de":["Disziplin der Subagenten","Funktionstests","Software-Entwicklung","Code-Qualität","Fehlerreduzierung","Qualitätsverbesserung"]}},"owner":"mich3333","repo":"mich3333","repoPath":"mich3333/mich3333","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.427Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"subagents-discipline","description":"Invoke at the start of any implementation task to enforce verification-first development","bodyPreview":"# Implementation Discipline\n\n**Core principle:** Test the FEATURE, not just the component you built.\n\n---\n\n## Three Rules\n\n### Rule 1: Look Before You Code\n\nBefore writing code that touches external data (API, database, file, config):\n\n1. **Fetch/read the ACTUAL data** - run the command, see the output\n2. **Note exact field names, types, formats** - not what docs say, what you SEE\n3. **Code against what you observed** - not what you assumed\n\nThis catches: field name mismatches, wrong data shapes","body":"# Implementation Discipline\n\n**Core principle:** Test the FEATURE, not just the component you built.\n\n---\n\n## Three Rules\n\n### Rule 1: Look Before You Code\n\nBefore writing code that touches external data (API, database, file, config):\n\n1. **Fetch/read the ACTUAL data** - run the command, see the output\n2. **Note exact field names, types, formats** - not what docs say, what you SEE\n3. **Code against what you observed** - not what you assumed\n\nThis catches: field name mismatches, wrong data shapes, missing fields, format differences.\n\n```\nWITHOUT looking first:\n  Assumed: column is \"reference_images\"\n  Reality: column is \"reference_image_url\"\n  Result:  Query fails\n\nWITH looking first:\n  Ran: SELECT column_name FROM information_schema.columns WHERE table_name = ''assets'';\n  Saw: reference_image_url\n  Coded against: reference_image_url\n  Result: Works\n```\n\n### Rule 2: Test Both Levels\n\n**Component test** catches: logic bugs, edge cases, type errors\n**Feature test** catches: integration bugs, auth issues, data flow problems\n\nBoth are required. Component test alone is NOT sufficient.\n\n| You built | Component test | Feature test |\n|-----------|----------------|--------------|\n| API endpoint | curl returns 200 | UI calls API, displays result |\n| Database change | Migration runs | App reads/writes correctly |\n| Frontend component | Renders, no errors | User can see and interact |\n| Full-stack feature | Each piece works alone | End-to-end flow works |\n\n**The pattern:**\n1. Build the thing\n2. Component test - verify your piece works in isolation\n3. Feature test - verify the integrated feature works end-to-end\n4. Only then claim done\n\n### Rule 3: Use Your Tools\n\nBefore claiming you can''t fully test:\n\n1. **Check what MCP servers you have access to** - list available tools\n2. **If any tool can help verify the feature works**, use it\n3. **Be resourceful** - browser automation, database inspection, API testing tools\n\n\"I couldn''t test the feature\" is only valid after exhausting available options.\n\n---\n\n## DEMO Block (Required)\n\nEvery completion must include evidence. Code reviewer will verify this.\n\n```\nDEMO:\n  COMPONENT:\n    Command: [what you ran to test the component]\n    Result: [what you observed]\n\n  FEATURE:\n    Steps: [how you tested the integrated feature]\n    Result: [what you observed - screenshot, output, etc.]\n```\n\n### When Full Feature Test Isn''t Possible\n\nIf you genuinely cannot test end-to-end (long-running job, external service, no browser tools):\n\n```\nDEMO:\n  COMPONENT:\n    Command: curl localhost:3008/api/endpoint\n    Result: 200, returns expected data\n\n  FEATURE: PARTIAL\n    Verified: [what you could test]\n    Needs human check: [what still needs verification]\n    Why: [specific reason - no browser MCP, takes 10+ minutes, requires external service]\n```\n\n**Not acceptable reasons for PARTIAL:**\n- \"Server wasn''t running\" → start it\n- \"Didn''t have test data\" → create it\n- \"Would take too long\" → if < 2 minutes, do it\n\n**Acceptable reasons:**\n- No browser/UI automation tools available\n- External API with rate limits or costs\n- Job takes > 5 minutes to complete\n- Requires production data that can''t be mocked\n\n---\n\n## For Epic Children\n\nIf your BEAD_ID contains a dot (e.g., BD-001.2), you''re implementing part of a larger feature:\n\n1. **Check for design doc**: `bd show {EPIC_ID} --json | jq -r ''.[0].design''`\n2. **Read it if it exists** - this is your contract\n3. **Match it exactly** - same field names, same types, same shapes\n\nDesign docs ensure all pieces fit together. If you deviate, integration fails.\n\n---\n\n## Completion Checklist\n\nBefore marking done:\n\n- [ ] Looked at actual data/interfaces before coding (not assumed)\n- [ ] Component test passes (your piece works in isolation)\n- [ ] Feature test passes OR documented as PARTIAL with valid reason\n- [ ] DEMO block included with evidence\n- [ ] Used available tools to test (checked MCP servers, used what helps)\n\n---\n\n## Red Flags - Stop and Verify\n\nWhen you catch yourself thinking:\n- \"This should work...\" → run it and see\n- \"I assume the field is...\" → look at the actual data\n- \"I''ll test it later...\" → test it now\n- \"It''s too simple to break...\" → verify anyway\n\nWhen you''re about to say:\n- \"Done!\" / \"Fixed!\" / \"Should work now!\" → show the DEMO first\n\n---\n\n## The Bottom Line\n\n```\nComponent test passing ≠ feature works\nCurl returning 200 ≠ UI displays correctly\nTypeScript compiles ≠ user can use it\n```\n\nTest the feature like a user would use it. Then show evidence. Then claim done.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:56:10.746Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing disciplined implementation and testing practices.","zh":"非常适合需要严格实施和测试实践的代码审查代理","ja":"コードレビューエージェントが厳格な実装とテストの実践を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"코드 리뷰 에이전트가 엄격한 구현 및 테스트 실践을 필요로 할 때 완벽","es":"Perfecto para agentes de revisión de código que necesitan prácticas de implementación y prueba disciplinadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de revue de code nécessitant des pratiques de mise en œuvre et de test disciplinées.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agents, die disziplinierte Implementierungs- und Testpraktiken benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que necessitam de práticas de implementação e teste disciplinadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов код-ревью, которым необходимы дисциплинированные практики реализации и тестирования.","ar":"مثالي لعميل مراجعة الكود الذي يحتاج إلى ممارسات تنفيذ واختبار منضبطة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to rigorously test features against actual data, ensuring accuracy and catching field name mismatches and wrong data shapes by fetching and coding against observed data from APIs, databases, files, and config files.","zh":"赋予代理能力，通过从API、数据库、文件和配置文件中获取和编码观察到的数据，严格测试功能以确保准确性并捕获字段名称不匹配和错误的数据形状","ja":"API、データベース、ファイル、コンフィグファイルから観察されたデータを取得してコード化することで、機能を実データに対して徹底的にテストし、精度を確保し、フィールド名の不一致やデータの形状の誤りを検出するエージェントの能力を付与","ko":"API, 데이터베이스, 파일 및 구성 파일에서 관찰된 데이터를 가져와서 코드화함으로써 기능을 실제 데이터에 대해 철저하게 테스트하여 정확성을 보장하고 필드 이름 불일치 및 잘못된 데이터 모양을 捕获하는 에이전트의 능력을 부여","es":"Permite a los agentes probar rigurosamente las características contra datos reales, garantizando la precisión y detectando discrepancies en los nombres de campo y formas de datos incorrectas al recuperar y codificar contra los datos observados de las API, bases de datos, archivos y archivos de configuración.","fr":"Permet aux agents de tester rigoureusement les fonctionnalités contre les données réelles, en garantissant l''exactitude et en détectant les discordances dans les noms de champ et les formes de données incorrectes en récupérant et en codant contre les données observées des API, bases de données, fichiers et fichiers de configuration.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Funktionen streng gegen tatsächliche Daten zu testen, um Genauigkeit zu gewährleisten und Ungenauigkeiten in Feldnamen und falschen Datentypen zu erkennen, indem sie gegen die beobachteten Daten von APIs, Datenbanken, Dateien und Konfigurationsdateien abrufen und codieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a testar rigorosamente recursos contra dados reais, garantindo precisão e capturando discrepâncias de nomes de campos e formas de dados erradas ao buscar e codificar contra dados observados de APIs, bancos de dados, arquivos e arquivos de configuração.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью тщательно тестировать функции на реальных данных, обеспечивая точность и обнаруживая несоответствия имен полей и неправильные формы данных путем извлечения и кодирования против наблюдаемых данных из API, баз данных, файлов и файлов конфигурации.","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من اختبار الميزات بدقة ضد البيانات الفعلية، وضمان الدقة واكتشاف الخلافات في أسماء الحقول والأشكال الخاطئة للبيانات عن طريق استرداد وبرمجة البيانات الملاحظة من واجهات برمجة التطبيقات وقواعد البيانات والملفات وملفات التهيئة."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating API responses against actual data","Debugging field name mismatches in database integrations","Ensuring data shape consistency across file inputs"],"zh":["验证API响应与实际数据的匹配","调试数据库集成中的字段名称不匹配","确保文件输入中的数据形状一致性"],"ja":["実データに対するAPIレスポンスの検証","データベース統合におけるフィールド名の不一致のデバッグ","ファイル入力におけるデータの形状の一貫性の確保"],"ko":["실제 데이터에 대한 API 응답을 검증","데이터베이스 통합에서 필드 이름 불일치를 디버깅","파일 입력에서 데이터 모양의 일관성을 보장"],"es":["Validar respuestas de API contra datos reales","Depurar discrepancies en los nombres de campo en integraciones de bases de datos","Garantizar la consistencia de la forma de los datos en las entradas de archivos"],"fr":["Valider les réponses d''API contre les données réelles","Déboguer les discordances dans les noms de champ dans les intégrations de bases de données","Assurer la cohérence de la forme des données dans les entrées de fichiers"],"de":["API-Antworten gegen tatsächliche Daten validieren","Feldnamen-Discrepanzen in Datenbankintegrationen debuggen","Datentyp-Konsistenz über Dateieingaben hinweg gewährleisten"],"pt":["Validar respostas da API contra dados reais","Depurar discrepâncias de nomes de campos em integrações de banco de dados","Garantir a consistência da forma de dados em entradas de arquivo"],"ru":["Проверка ответов API на реальные данные","Отладка несоответствий имен полей в интеграциях с базами данных","Обеспечение согласованности формы данных во входных файлах"],"ar":["التحقق من استجابات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات مقابل البيانات الفعلية","تصحيح أخطاء أسماء الحقول في تكاملات قاعدة البيانات","ضمان الاتساق في شكل البيانات عند إدخال الملفات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to external data sources like APIs, databases, and files","Assumes programming environment with command-line interface for data inspection"],"zh":["需要访问外部数据源，如API、数据库和文件","假设具有命令行接口的编程环境以便于数据检查"],"ja":["API、データベース、ファイルなどの外部データソースへのアクセスが必要","データの検査のためにコマンドラインインターフェイスを備えたプログラミング環境が仮定される"],"ko":["API, 데이터베이스, 파일 등의 외부 데이터 소스에 대한 액세스가 필요","데이터 검사에 필요한 명령줄 인터페이스를 갖춘 프로그래밍 환경이 가정"],"es":["Requiere acceso a fuentes de datos externas como API, bases de datos y archivos","Supone un entorno de programación con interfaz de línea de comandos para la inspección de datos"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès à des sources de données externes telles que des API, des bases de données et des fichiers","Suppose un environnement de programmation avec interface de ligne de commande pour l''inspection des données"],"de":["Erfordert den Zugriff auf externe Datenquellen wie APIs, Datenbanken und Dateien","Geht von einer Programmierumgebung mit Kommandozeileninterface für die Datenaufzeichnung aus"],"pt":["Requer acesso a fontes de dados externas como APIs, bancos de dados e arquivos","Pressupõe um ambiente de programação com interface de linha de comando para inspeção de dados"],"ru":["Требует доступа к внешним источникам данных, таким как API, базы данных и файлы","Предполагает программную среду с командной строкой для осмотра данных"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مصادر البيانات الخارجية مثل واجهات برمجة التطبيقات وقواعد البيانات والملفات","يفترض بيئة برمجة مع واجهة سطر الأوامر لاستقصاء البيانات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
