["NestJS キュー アーキテクト","BullMQ","ジョブ処理システム","メディア重視のワークフロー","Redis キュー","堅牢性","拡張可能","キュー パターン","サービス ディスカバリ"],"ko":["NestJS 큐 아키텍트","BullMQ","작업 처리 시스템","미디어 집중 워크플로우","Redis 큐","안정성","확장 가능","큐 패턴","서비스 발견"],"es":["NestJS","BullMQ","Redis","arquitectura de cola","procesamiento de trabajos","flujos de trabajo de medios pesados","monitorización de la cola","escalabilidad","flexibilidad"],"fr":["NestJS","BullMQ","Redis","architecture de file d''attente","traitement de tâches","flux de travail de médias lourds","surveillance de la file d''attente","évolution","flexibilité"],"de":["NestJS","BullMQ","Redis","Warteschlangen-Architektur","Job-Verarbeitung","medienintensive Workflows","Warteschlangen-Überwachung","Skalierbarkeit","Flexibilität"],"pt":["NestJS","BullMQ","Arquiteto de Filas","Sistemas de Processamento de Trabalhos","Filas de Trabalhos","Redis","Desenvolvimento de Software","Arquitetura de Software","Escalabilidade","Resiliência"],"ru":["Нест ДжС","BullMQ","Архитектор Очереди","Системы Обработки Заданий","Очереди Заданий","Redis","Разработка Программного Обеспечения","Архитектура Программного Обеспечения","Масштабируемость","Прочность"],"ar":["نست جس","بول أم كيو","مهندس طوابير","أنظمة معالجة الوظائف","طوابير الوظائف","ريديس","تطوير البرمجيات","هندسة البرمجيات","القدرة على التوسيع","المتانة"]}},"owner":"xiangteng007","repo":"light-keepers","repoPath":"xiangteng007/light-keepers","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.427Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"nestjs-queue-architect","description":"Queue job management patterns, processors, and async workflows for video/image processing","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# NestJS Queue Architect - BullMQ Expert\n\nYou are a **senior queue architect** specializing in BullMQ with NestJS. Design resilient, scalable job processing systems for media-heavy workflows.\n\n## Technology Stack\n\n- **BullMQ**: 5.61.0 (Redis-backed job queue)\n- **@nestjs/bullmq**: 11.0.4\n- **@bull-board/nestjs**: 6.13.1 (Queue monitoring UI)\n\n## Project Context Discovery\n\nBefore implementing:\n\n1. Check `.agents/SYSTEM/ARCHITECTURE.md` for queue patterns\n2. Review existing queue services and cons","body":"# NestJS Queue Architect - BullMQ Expert\n\nYou are a **senior queue architect** specializing in BullMQ with NestJS. Design resilient, scalable job processing systems for media-heavy workflows.\n\n## Technology Stack\n\n- **BullMQ**: 5.61.0 (Redis-backed job queue)\n- **@nestjs/bullmq**: 11.0.4\n- **@bull-board/nestjs**: 6.13.1 (Queue monitoring UI)\n\n## Project Context Discovery\n\nBefore implementing:\n\n1. Check `.agents/SYSTEM/ARCHITECTURE.md` for queue patterns\n2. Review existing queue services and constants\n3. Look for `[project]-queue-architect` skill\n\n## Core Patterns\n\n### Queue Constants\n\n```typescript\nexport const QUEUE_NAMES = {\n  VIDEO_PROCESSING: ''video-processing'',\n  IMAGE_PROCESSING: ''image-processing'',\n} as const;\n\nexport const JOB_PRIORITY = {\n  HIGH: 1,    // User-facing\n  NORMAL: 5,  // Standard\n  LOW: 10,    // Background\n} as const;\n```\n\n### Queue Service\n\n```typescript\n@Injectable()\nexport class VideoQueueService {\n  constructor(@InjectQueue(QUEUE_NAMES.VIDEO) private queue: Queue) {}\n\n  async addJob(data: VideoJobData) {\n    return this.queue.add(JOB_TYPES.RESIZE, data, {\n      priority: JOB_PRIORITY.NORMAL,\n      attempts: 3,\n      backoff: { type: ''exponential'', delay: 2000 },\n    });\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Processor (WorkerHost)\n\n```typescript\n@Processor(QUEUE_NAMES.VIDEO)\nexport class VideoProcessor extends WorkerHost {\n  async process(job: Job<VideoJobData>) {\n    switch (job.name) {\n      case JOB_TYPES.RESIZE: return this.handleResize(job);\n      case JOB_TYPES.MERGE: return this.handleMerge(job);\n      default: throw new Error(`Unknown job: ${job.name}`);\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Key Principles\n\n1. **One service per queue type** - Encapsulate job options\n2. **Switch-based routing** - Route by `job.name`\n3. **Structured error handling** - Log, emit WebSocket, publish Redis, re-throw\n4. **Always cleanup** - Temp files in try/finally\n5. **Idempotent handlers** - Safe to retry\n\n## Queue Configuration\n\n```typescript\nBullModule.registerQueue({\n  name: QUEUE_NAMES.VIDEO,\n  defaultJobOptions: {\n    attempts: 3,\n    backoff: { type: ''exponential'', delay: 2000 },\n    removeOnComplete: 100,  // Prevent Redis bloat\n    removeOnFail: 50,\n  },\n});\n```\n\n## Retry Strategy\n\n| Job Type | Attempts | Delay | Reason |\n|----------|----------|-------|--------|\n| Resize | 3 | 2000ms | Transient failures |\n| Merge | 2 | 5000ms | Resource-intensive |\n| Metadata | 2 | 1000ms | Fast, fail quickly |\n| Cleanup | 5 | 1000ms | Must succeed |\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- **Memory leaks**: Always set `removeOnComplete/Fail`\n- **Timeouts**: Set appropriate `timeout` for heavy jobs\n- **Race conditions**: Make handlers idempotent\n\n---\n\n**For complete processor examples, testing patterns, Bull Board setup, and Redis pub/sub integration, see:** `references/full-guide.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:55:37.106Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Node.js Agents requiring scalable and resilient job processing systems with BullMQ and NestJS","zh":"适用于需要可扩展和可靠的作业处理系统的Node.js代理，使用BullMQ和NestJS","ja":"Node.jsエージェントがスケーラブルで耐久性のあるジョブ処理システムを必要とする場合に適しています。BullMQとNestJSを使用","ko":"Node.js 에이전트가 확장 가능하고 안정적인 작업 처리 시스템을 필요로 하는 경우에 적합합니다. BullMQ와 NestJS를 사용합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Node.js que requieren sistemas de procesamiento de trabajos escalables y resistentes con BullMQ y NestJS","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Node.js nécessitant des systèmes de traitement de tâches évolutifs et résilients avec BullMQ et NestJS","de":"Ideal für Node.js-Agents, die skalierbare und ausfallsichere Job-Verarbeitungssysteme mit BullMQ und NestJS erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Node.js que requerem sistemas de processamento de trabalhos escaláveis e resilientes com BullMQ e NestJS","ru":"Идеально для агентов Node.js, требующих масштабируемых и отказоустойчивых систем обработки заданий с BullMQ и NestJS","ar":"مثالي لعميل Node.js الذي يتطلب نظام معالجة وظيفي قابل للتطوير وقوي مع BullMQ و NestJS"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design and implement efficient media-heavy workflows using BullMQ''s Redis-backed job queue, integrated with NestJS via @nestjs/bullmq, and monitored through @bull-board/nestjs","zh":"赋予代理设计和实现高效的媒体密集型工作流的能力，使用BullMQ的Redis后端作业队列，通过@nestjs/bullmq与NestJS集成，并通过@bull-board/nestjs监控","ja":"エージェントが効率的なメディア重視のワークフローを設計して実装できるようにします。BullMQのRedisバックエンドジョブキューを使用し、@nestjs/bullmq経由でNestJSと統合し、@bull-board/nestjs経由で監視します","ko":"에이전트가 효율적인 미디어 집중 워크플ロー 디자인 및 구현을 가능하게 합니다. BullMQ의 Redis 백엔드 작업 큐를 사용하고 @nestjs/bullmq를 통해 NestJS와 통합하며 @bull-board/nestjs를 통해 모니터링합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes diseñar e implementar flujos de trabajo eficientes con medios pesados utilizando la cola de trabajos Redis de BullMQ, integrada con NestJS a través de @nestjs/bullmq, y supervisada a través de @bull-board/nestjs","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir et de mettre en œuvre des flux de travail efficaces pour les médias lourds en utilisant la file d''attente de travaux Redis de BullMQ, intégrée à NestJS via @nestjs/bullmq, et surveillée via @bull-board/nestjs","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, effiziente Workflows für medienintensive Aufgaben zu entwerfen und zu implementieren, indem sie die Redis-Backed-Job-Warteschlange von BullMQ verwenden, die in NestJS über @nestjs/bullmq integriert ist und über @bull-board/nestjs überwacht wird","pt":"Permite que os agentes projetem e implementem fluxos de trabalho eficientes com mídia pesada usando a fila de trabalhos do Redis com suporte do BullMQ, integrada ao NestJS via @nestjs/bullmq, e monitorada por meio do @bull-board/nestjs","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать и реализовывать эффективные рабочие процессы с интенсивной медиа-нагрузкой, используя очередь заданий Redis с поддержкой BullMQ, интегрированную с NestJS через @nestjs/bullmq, и отслеживаемую через @bull-board/nestjs","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تصميم وتنفيذ سير عمل فعالة ذات حمل وسائط ثقيلة باستخدام طابور مهام Redis المعتمد على BullMQ، المدمج في NestJS عبر @nestjs/bullmq، ومراقبةً عبر @bull-board/nestjs"},"useCases":{"en":["Designing resilient job processing systems for media-heavy workflows","Implementing scalable queue architectures with BullMQ and NestJS","Monitoring and optimizing queue performance using @bull-board/nestjs"],"zh":["为媒体密集型工作流设计可靠的作业处理系统","使用BullMQ和NestJS实现可扩展的队列架构","使用@bull-board/nestjs监控和优化队列性能"],"ja":["メディア重視のワークフロー用の堅牢なジョブ処理システムを設計する","BullMQとNestJSを使用してスケーラブルなキュー・アーキテクチャを実装する","@bull-board/nestjsを使用してキューのパフォーマンスを監視して最適化する"],"ko":["미디어 집중 워크플로우를 위한 안정적인 작업 처리 시스템 설계","BullMQ와 NestJS를 사용하여 확장 가능한 큐 아키텍처 구현","@bull-board/nestjs를 사용하여 큐 성능 모니터링 및 최적화"],"es":["Diseñar sistemas de procesamiento de trabajos resistentes para flujos de trabajo con medios pesados","Implementar arquitecturas de cola escalables con BullMQ y NestJS","Supervisar y optimizar el rendimiento de la cola utilizando @bull-board/nestjs"],"fr":["Concevoir des systèmes de traitement de tâches résilients pour les flux de travail à forte charge médiatique","Mettre en œuvre des architectures de file d''attente évolutives avec BullMQ et NestJS","Surveiller et optimiser les performances de la file d''attente à l''aide de @bull-board/nestjs"],"de":["Entwerfen von ausfallsicheren Job-Verarbeitungssystemen für medienintensive Workflows","Implementieren von skalierbaren Warteschlangen-Architekturen mit BullMQ und NestJS","Überwachen und Optimieren der Warteschlangenleistung mit @bull-board/nestjs"],"pt":["Projeto de sistemas de processamento de trabalhos resilientes para fluxos de trabalho com mídia pesada","Implementação de arquiteturas de fila escaláveis com BullMQ e NestJS","Monitoramento e otimização do desempenho da fila usando @bull-board/nestjs"],"ru":["Проектирование отказо