. Battle-tested, high-performance skills for AI agents including official skills from Anthropic and Vercel."},"features":{"zh":["支持暗黑主题","支持交互式 Mermaid 图表","生成静态站点","支持 VitePress 配置","支持自定义主题"],"ja":["ダークテーマに対応","インタラクティブな Mermaid ダイアグラムに対応","静的サイトを生成","VitePress 構成に対応","カスタムテーマに対応"],"ko":["다크 테마 지원","상호 작용 Mermaid 다이어그램 지원","정적 사이트 생성","VitePress 구성 지원","사용자 정의 테마 지원"],"es":["Generación de sitios web estáticos con VitePress","Soporte para temas oscuros y diagramas de Mermaid","Estructura de sitios web personalizable","Compatibilidad con comandos de línea de comandos","Salida de HTML navegable"],"fr":["Génération de sites web statiques avec VitePress","Prise en charge de thèmes sombres et de diagrammes Mermaid","Structure de site web personnalisable","Compatibilité avec les commandes de ligne de commande","Sortie HTML navigable"],"de":["Erzeugung von statischen Webseiten mit VitePress","Unterstützung für dunkle Themes und Mermaid-Diagramme","Anpassbare Webseitenstruktur","Kompatibilität mit Befehlszeilenbefehlen","Navegierbare HTML-Ausgabe"],"pt":["Transformação de arquivos Markdown em sites VitePress estáticos","Tema escuro personalizável","Diagramas Mermaid interativos","Estrutura de site personalizável","Suporte a comandos de linha de comando","Saída HTML navegável"],"ru":["Преобразование файлов Markdown в статические сайты VitePress","Настраиваемая темная тема","Интерактивные диаграммы Mermaid","Настраиваемая структура сайта","Поддержка командной строки","Навигируемый HTML-выход"],"ar":["تحويل ملفات Markdown إلى مواقع VitePress ثابتة","نمط داكن قابل للتخصيص","رسومات Mermaid تفاعلية","هيكل موقع قابل للتخصيص","دعم أوامر سطر الأوامر","إخراج HTML قابل للتنقل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["VitePress","Wiki","静态站点","Markdown","Mermaid","暗黑主题","交互式图表"],"ja":["VitePress","Wiki","静的サイト","Markdown","Mermaid","ダークテーマ","インタラクティブなダイアグラム"],"ko":["VitePress","위키","정적 사이트","Markdown","Mermaid","다크 테마","상호 작용 다이어그램"],"es":["wiki-vitepress","sitios web estáticos","VitePress","Markdown","temas oscuros","diagramas de Mermaid","desarrollo web","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["wiki-vitepress","sites web statiques","VitePress","Markdown","thèmes sombres","diagrammes Mermaid","développement web","outils de développement"],"de":["wiki-vitepress","statische Webseiten","VitePress","Markdown","dunkle Themes","Mermaid-Diagramme","Webentwicklung","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Wiki VitePress","Sites estáticos","Markdown","VitePress","Tema escuro","Diagramas Mermaid","Desenvolvimento web","Ferramentas de código aberto"],"ru":["Wiki VitePress","Статические сайты","Markdown","VitePress","Темная тема","Диаграммы Mermaid","Веб-разработка","Открытые инструменты"],"ar":["ويكي فيت بريس","مواقع ثابتة","Markdown","VitePress","نمط داكن","رسومات Mermaid","تطوير الويب","أدوات مفتوحة المصدر"]}},"owner":"sickn33","repo":"antigravity-awesome-skills","repoPath":"sickn33/antigravity-awesome-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.427Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"wiki-vitepress","description":"Packages generated wiki Markdown into a VitePress static site with dark theme, dark-mode Mermaid diagrams with click-to-zoom, and production build output. Use when the user wants to create a browsable website from generated wiki pages.","bodyPreview":"# Wiki VitePress Packager\n\nTransform generated wiki Markdown files into a polished VitePress static site with dark theme and interactive Mermaid diagrams.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- User asks to \"build a site\" or \"package as VitePress\"\n- User runs the `/deep-wiki:build` command\n- User wants a browsable HTML output from generated wiki pages\n\n## VitePress Scaffolding\n\nGenerate the following structure in a `wiki-site/` directory:\n\n```\nwiki-site/\n├── .vitepress/\n│   ├── config.mts\n│   └── theme/\n│","body":"# Wiki VitePress Packager\n\nTransform generated wiki Markdown files into a polished VitePress static site with dark theme and interactive Mermaid diagrams.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- User asks to \"build a site\" or \"package as VitePress\"\n- User runs the `/deep-wiki:build` command\n- User wants a browsable HTML output from generated wiki pages\n\n## VitePress Scaffolding\n\nGenerate the following structure in a `wiki-site/` directory:\n\n```\nwiki-site/\n├── .vitepress/\n│   ├── config.mts\n│   └── theme/\n│       ├── index.ts\n│       └── custom.css\n├── public/\n├── [generated .md pages]\n├── package.json\n└── index.md\n```\n\n## Config Requirements (`config.mts`)\n\n- Use `withMermaid` wrapper from `vitepress-plugin-mermaid`\n- Set `appearance: ''dark''` for dark-only theme\n- Configure `themeConfig.nav` and `themeConfig.sidebar` from the catalogue structure\n- Mermaid config must set dark theme variables:\n\n```typescript\nmermaid: {\n  theme: ''dark'',\n  themeVariables: {\n    primaryColor: ''#1e3a5f'',\n    primaryTextColor: ''#e0e0e0'',\n    primaryBorderColor: ''#4a9eed'',\n    lineColor: ''#4a9eed'',\n    secondaryColor: ''#2d4a3e'',\n    tertiaryColor: ''#2d2d3d'',\n    background: ''#1a1a2e'',\n    mainBkg: ''#1e3a5f'',\n    nodeBorder: ''#4a9eed'',\n    clusterBkg: ''#16213e'',\n    titleColor: ''#e0e0e0'',\n    edgeLabelBackground: ''#1a1a2e''\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Dark-Mode Mermaid: Three-Layer Fix\n\n### Layer 1: Theme Variables (in config.mts)\nSet via `mermaid.themeVariables` as shown above.\n\n### Layer 2: CSS Overrides (`custom.css`)\nTarget Mermaid SVG elements with `!important`:\n\n```css\n.mermaid .node rect,\n.mermaid .node circle,\n.mermaid .node polygon { fill: #1e3a5f !important; stroke: #4a9eed !important; }\n.mermaid .edgeLabel { background-color: #1a1a2e !important; color: #e0e0e0 !important; }\n.mermaid text { fill: #e0e0e0 !important; }\n.mermaid .label { color: #e0e0e0 !important; }\n```\n\n### Layer 3: Inline Style Replacement (`theme/index.ts`)\nMermaid inline `style` attributes override everything. Use `onMounted` + polling to replace them:\n\n```typescript\nimport { onMounted } from ''vue''\n\n// In setup()\nonMounted(() => {\n  let attempts = 0\n  const fix = setInterval(() => {\n    document.querySelectorAll(''.mermaid svg [style]'').forEach(el => {\n      const s = (el as HTMLElement).style\n      if (s.fill && !s.fill.includes(''#1e3a5f'')) s.fill = ''#1e3a5f''\n      if (s.stroke && !s.stroke.includes(''#4a9eed'')) s.stroke = ''#4a9eed''\n      if (s.color) s.color = ''#e0e0e0''\n    })\n    if (++attempts >= 20) clearInterval(fix)\n  }, 500)\n})\n```\n\nUse `setup()` with `onMounted`, NOT `enhanceApp()` — DOM doesn''t exist during SSR.\n\n## Click-to-Zoom for Mermaid Diagrams\n\nWrap each `.mermaid` container in a clickable wrapper that opens a fullscreen modal:\n\n```typescript\ndocument.querySelectorAll(''.mermaid'').forEach(el => {\n  el.style.cursor = ''zoom-in''\n  el.addEventListener(''click'', () => {\n    const modal = document.createElement(''div'')\n    modal.className = ''mermaid-zoom-modal''\n    modal.innerHTML = el.outerHTML\n    modal.addEventListener(''click'', () => modal.remove())\n    document.body.appendChild(modal)\n  })\n})\n```\n\nModal CSS:\n```css\n.mermaid-zoom-modal {\n  position: fixed; inset: 0;\n  background: rgba(0,0,0,0.9);\n  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n  z-index: 9999; cursor: zoom-out;\n}\n.mermaid-zoom-modal .mermaid { transform: scale(1.5); }\n```\n\n## Post-Processing Rules\n\nBefore VitePress build, scan all `.md` files and fix:\n- Replace `<br/>` with `<br>` (Vue template compiler compatibility)\n- Wrap bare `<T>` generic parameters in backticks outside code fences\n- Ensure every page has YAML frontmatter with `title` and `description`\n\n## Build\n\n```bash\ncd wiki-site && npm install && npm run docs:build\n```\n\nOutput goes to `wiki-site/.vitepress/dist/`.\n\n## Known Gotchas\n\n- Mermaid renders async — SVGs don''t exist when `onMounted` fires. Must poll.\n- `isCustomElement` compiler option for bare `<T>` causes worse crashes — do NOT use it\n- Node text in Mermaid uses inline `style` with highest specificity — CSS alone won''t fix it\n- `enhanceApp()` runs during SSR where `document` doesn''t exist — use `setup()` only\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:56:17.438Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like Claude Code and Cursor needing to transform wiki Markdown files into polished static sites with interactive Mermaid diagrams.","zh":"Perfect for AI Agents like Claude Code and Cursor needing to transform wiki Markdown files into polished static sites with interactive Mermaid diagrams.","ja":"Perfect for AI Agents like Claude Code and Cursor needing to transform wiki Markdown files into polished static sites with interactive Mermaid diagrams.","ko":"Perfect for AI Agents like Claude Code and Cursor needing to transform wiki Markdown files into polished static sites with interactive Mermaid diagrams.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA como Claude Code y Cursor que necesitan transformar archivos Markdown de wiki en sitios web estáticos pulidos con diagramas Mermaid interactivos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA comme Claude Code et Cursor ayant besoin de transformer des fichiers Markdown wiki en sites web statiques polis avec des diagrammes Mermaid interactifs.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents wie Claude Code und Cursor, die Wiki-Markdown-Dateien in polierte statische Seiten mit interaktiven Mermaid-Diagrammen umwandeln müssen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como o Claude Code e o Cursor que precisam transformar ficheiros Markdown de wiki em sites estáticos polidos com diagramas Mermaid interativos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для ИИ-агентов, таких как Claude Code и Cursor, которым необходимо преобразовывать файлы Markdown вики в отполированные статические сайты с интерактивными диаграммами Mermaid.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude Code و Cursor الذين يحتاجون إلى تحويل ملفات Markdown الخاصة بالويكي إلى مواقع ويب ثابتة مصقولة تحتوي على مخططات Mermaid تفاعلية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate browsable HTML outputs from wiki pages using VitePress, complete with dark themes and interactive diagrams, via the `/deep-wiki:build` command and supporting Markdown files.","zh":"Empowers agents to generate browsable HTML outputs from wiki pages using VitePress, complete with dark themes and interactive diagrams, via the `/deep-wiki:build` command and supporting Markdown files.","ja":"Empowers agents to generate browsable HTML outputs from wiki pages using VitePress, complete with dark themes and interactive diagrams, via the `/deep-wiki:build` command and supporting Markdown files.","ko":"Empowers agents to generate browsable HTML outputs from wiki pages using VitePress, complete with dark themes and interactive diagrams, via the `/deep-wiki:build` command and supporting Markdown files.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar salidas HTML navegables desde páginas wiki utilizando VitePress, completas con temas oscuros y diagramas interactivos, a través del comando `/deep-wiki:build` y archivos Markdown de soporte.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des sorties HTML navigables à partir de pages wiki en utilisant VitePress, complètes avec des thèmes sombres et des diagrammes interactifs, via la commande `/deep-wiki:build` et des fichiers Markdown de support.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, aus Wiki-Seiten mit VitePress browsbare HTML-Ausgaben zu generieren, komplett mit dunklen Designs und interaktiven Diagrammen, über den Befehl `/deep-wiki:build` und unterstützende Markdown-Dateien.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a gerar saídas HTML navegáveis a partir de páginas wiki usando o VitePress, completo com temas escuros e diagramas interativos, através do comando `/deep-wiki:build` e com suporte a ficheiros Markdown.","ru":"Позволяет агентам генерировать просматриваемые HTML-выходы из вики-страниц с использованием VitePress, включая темные темы и интерактивные диаграммы, с помощью команды `/deep-wiki:build` и при поддержке файлов Markdown.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء مخرجات HTML قابلة للتصفح من صفحات الويكي باستخدام VitePress، مع وجود سمات داكنة ومخططات تفاعلية، عبر الأمر `/deep-wiki:build` مع دعم ملفات Markdown."},"useCases":{"en":["Transforming wiki Markdown into VitePress static sites","Generating interactive Mermaid diagrams within wiki pages","Creating browsable HTML outputs from generated wiki content"],"zh":["Transforming wiki Markdown into VitePress static sites","Generating interactive Mermaid diagrams within wiki pages","Creating browsable HTML outputs from generated wiki content"],"ja":["Transforming wiki Markdown into VitePress static sites","Generating interactive Mermaid diagrams within wiki pages","Creating browsable HTML outputs from generated wiki content"],"ko":["Transforming wiki Markdown into VitePress static sites","Generating interactive Mermaid diagrams within wiki pages","Creating browsable HTML outputs from generated wiki content"],"es":["Transformar Markdown de wiki en sitios web estáticos de VitePress","Generar diagramas Mermaid interactivos dentro de las páginas wiki","Crear salidas HTML navegables a partir del contenido wiki generado"],"fr":["Transformer des fichiers Markdown wiki en sites web statiques VitePress","Générer des diagrammes Mermaid interactifs à l''intérieur des pages wiki","Créer des sorties HTML navigables à partir du contenu wiki généré"],"de":["Wiki-Markdown in VitePress-statische Seiten umwandeln","Interaktive Mermaid-Diagramme innerhalb von Wiki-Seiten generieren","Browsbare HTML-Ausgaben aus dem generierten Wiki-Inhalt erstellen"],"pt":["Transformar Markdown de wiki em sites estáticos VitePress","Gerar diagramas Mermaid interativos dentro de páginas wiki","Criar saídas HTML navegáveis a partir de conteúdo wiki gerado"],"ru":["Преобразование Markdown вики в статические сайты VitePress","Генерация интерактивных диаграмм Mermaid на вики-страницах","Создание просматриваемых HTML-выходов из сгенерированного вики-контента"],"ar":["تحويل Markdown الخاص بالويكي إلى مواقع ويب ثابتة باستخدام VitePress","إنشاء مخططات Mermaid تفاعلية داخل صفحات الويكي","إنشاء مخرجات HTML قابلة للتصفح من محتوى الويكي المُنشأ"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires VitePress compatibility","Limited to transforming Markdown files"],"zh":["Requires VitePress compatibility","Limited to transforming Markdown files"],"ja":["Requires VitePress compatibility","Limited to transforming Markdown files"],"ko":["Requires VitePress compatibility","Limited to transforming Markdown files"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con VitePress","Limitado a la transformación de archivos Markdown"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité avec VitePress","Limité à la transformation de fichiers Markdown"],"de":["Benötigt VitePress-Kompatibilität","Begrenzt auf die Umwandlung von Markdown-Dateien"],"pt":["Requer compatibilidade com VitePress","Limitado à transformação de ficheiros Markdown"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с VitePress","Ограничено преобразованием файлов Markdown"],"ar":["يتطلب توافقًا مع VitePress","يقتصر على تحويل ملفات Markdown"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
