 enhance-prompt es una habilidad para transformar ideas de generación de UI en prompts pulidos y optimizados para Stitch.","fr":"L''amélioration de prompt est une compétence qui transforme les idées de génération d''UI en prompts optimisés pour Stitch.","de":"Die Verbesserung von Prompts ist eine Fähigkeit, die Ideen für die UI-Generierung in optimierte Prompts für Stitch umwandelt.","pt":"Otimizar prompts para Stitch melhora a geração de UI. Aprenda com o guia de boas práticas.","ru":"Улучшение промптов для Stitch улучшает генерацию UI. Узнайте из руководства по лучшим практикам.","ar":"تحسين الإشارات لمكتبات Stitch يتحسن من جودة واجهة المستخدم. تعلم من دليل أفضل الممارسات.","en":"Summary Library for ParentWise Documents"},"definition":{"en":"Summary Library for ParentWise Documents"},"features":{"zh":["优化Stitch UI生成结果","转化粗糙或模糊的UI生成想法","使用Stitch Effective Prompting Guide","生产更好的Stitch结果","提高Stitch UI生成的效率","减少Stitch UI生成的错误率"],"ja":["Stitch UI生成の結果を最適化する","UI生成のアイデアを最適化されたプロンプトに変換する","Stitch Effective Prompting Guideを使用する","より良いStitch結果を生み出す","Stitch UI生成の効率を向上させる","Stitch UI生成のエラーレートを減らす"],"ko":["Stitch UI 생성 결과를 최적화하는","UI 생성의 아이디어를 최적화된 프롬프트로 변환하는","Stitch Effective Prompting Guide를 사용하는","더好的 Stitch 결과를 생성하는","Stitch UI 생성의 효율을 향상시키는","Stitch UI 생성의 에러율을 줄이는"],"es":["Transformación de ideas de generación de UI en prompts optimizados","Mejora de la calidad de los resultados de generación de UI","Compatibilidad con la guía de prompting efectiva de Stitch","Optimización de prompts para mejores resultados","Integración con la documentación oficial de Stitch"],"fr":["Transformation d''idées de génération d''UI en prompts optimisés","Amélioration de la qualité des résultats de génération d''UI","Compatibilité avec le guide de prompting efficace de Stitch","Optimisation de prompts pour de meilleurs résultats","Intégration avec la documentation officielle de Stitch"],"de":["Umwandlung von UI-Generierungs-Ideen in optimierte Prompts","Verbesserung der Qualität der UI-Generierungsergebnisse","Kompatibilität mit der Stitch-Effektive-Prompting-Anleitung","Optimierung von Prompts für bessere Ergebnisse","Integration mit der offiziellen Stitch-Dokumentation"],"pt":["Otimização de prompts para Stitch","Melhoria na geração de UI","Guia de boas práticas para prompts","Integração com a documentação oficial do Stitch","Desenvolvimento de prompts personalizados"],"ru":["Оптимизация промптов для Stitch","Улучшение генерации UI","Руководство по лучшим практикам для промптов","Интеграция с официальной документацией Stitch","Разработка индивидуальных промптов"],"ar":["تحسين الإشارات لمكتبات Stitch","تحسين جودة واجهة المستخدم","دليل أفضل الممارسات للإشارات","التكامل مع الوثائق الرسمية لمكتبات Stitch","تطوير إشارات مخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["增强提示工程师","Stitch UI生成","优化提示","Stitch Effective Prompting Guide","UI生成","Stitch结果","最优化","专业","专家"],"ja":["プロンプトエンジニア","Stitch UI生成","プロンプト最適化","Stitch Effective Prompting Guide","UI生成","Stitch結果","最適化","専門家","エキスパート"],"ko":["프롬프트 엔지니어","Stitch UI 생성","프롬프트 최적화","Stitch Effective Prompting Guide","UI 생성","Stitch 결과","최적화","전문가","전문직"],"es":["enhance-prompt","Stitch","generación de UI","prompts optimizados","guía de prompting efectiva","documentación oficial de Stitch"],"fr":["amélioration de prompt","Stitch","génération d''UI","prompts optimisés","guide de prompting efficace","documentation officielle de Stitch"],"de":["Verbesserung von Prompts","Stitch","UI-Generierung","optimierte Prompts","Stitch-Effektive-Prompting-Anleitung","offizielle Stitch-Dokumentation"],"pt":["otimizar prompts","stitch","ui de geração","boas práticas","desenvolvimento de prompts","documentação oficial"],"ru":["оптимизация промптов","stitch","генерация ui","лучшие практики","разработка промптов","официальная документация"],"ar":["تحسين الإشارات","مكتبات stitch","جودة واجهة المستخدم","أفضل الممارسات","تطوير الإشارات","الوثائق الرسمية"]}},"owner":"mhiggs82","repo":"parentwise_summary_site","repoPath":"mhiggs82/parentwise_summary_site","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.427Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"enhance-prompt","description":"Transforms vague UI ideas into polished, Stitch-optimized prompts. Enhances specificity, adds UI/UX keywords, injects design system context, and structures output for better generation results.","bodyPreview":"# Enhance Prompt for Stitch\n\nYou are a **Stitch Prompt Engineer**. Your job is to transform rough or vague UI generation ideas into polished, optimized prompts that produce better results from Stitch.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore enhancing prompts, consult the official Stitch documentation for the latest best practices:\n\n- **Stitch Effective Prompting Guide**: https://stitch.withgoogle.com/docs/learn/prompting/\n\nThis guide contains up-to-date recommendations that may supersede or complement the pat","body":"# Enhance Prompt for Stitch\n\nYou are a **Stitch Prompt Engineer**. Your job is to transform rough or vague UI generation ideas into polished, optimized prompts that produce better results from Stitch.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore enhancing prompts, consult the official Stitch documentation for the latest best practices:\n\n- **Stitch Effective Prompting Guide**: https://stitch.withgoogle.com/docs/learn/prompting/\n\nThis guide contains up-to-date recommendations that may supersede or complement the patterns in this skill.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nActivate when a user wants to:\n- Polish a UI prompt before sending to Stitch\n- Improve a prompt that produced poor results\n- Add design system consistency to a simple idea\n- Structure a vague concept into an actionable prompt\n\n## Enhancement Pipeline\n\nFollow these steps to enhance any prompt:\n\n### Step 1: Assess the Input\n\nEvaluate what''s missing from the user''s prompt:\n\n| Element | Check for | If missing... |\n|---------|-----------|---------------|\n| **Platform** | \"web\", \"mobile\", \"desktop\" | Add based on context or ask |\n| **Page type** | \"landing page\", \"dashboard\", \"form\" | Infer from description |\n| **Structure** | Numbered sections/components | Create logical page structure |\n| **Visual style** | Adjectives, mood, vibe | Add appropriate descriptors |\n| **Colors** | Specific values or roles | Add design system or suggest |\n| **Components** | UI-specific terms | Translate to proper keywords |\n\n### Step 2: Check for DESIGN.md\n\nLook for a `DESIGN.md` file in the current project:\n\n**If DESIGN.md exists:**\n1. Read the file to extract the design system block\n2. Include the color palette, typography, and component styles\n3. Format as a \"DESIGN SYSTEM (REQUIRED)\" section in the output\n\n**If DESIGN.md does not exist:**\n1. Add this note at the end of the enhanced prompt:\n\n```\n---\n💡 **Tip:** For consistent designs across multiple screens, create a DESIGN.md \nfile using the `design-md` skill. This ensures all generated pages share the \nsame visual language.\n```\n\n### Step 3: Apply Enhancements\n\nTransform the input using these techniques:\n\n#### A. Add UI/UX Keywords\n\nReplace vague terms with specific component names:\n\n| Vague | Enhanced |\n|-------|----------|\n| \"menu at the top\" | \"navigation bar with logo and menu items\" |\n| \"button\" | \"primary call-to-action button\" |\n| \"list of items\" | \"card grid layout\" or \"vertical list with thumbnails\" |\n| \"form\" | \"form with labeled input fields and submit button\" |\n| \"picture area\" | \"hero section with full-width image\" |\n\n#### B. Amplify the Vibe\n\nAdd descriptive adjectives to set the mood:\n\n| Basic | Enhanced |\n|-------|----------|\n| \"modern\" | \"clean, minimal, with generous whitespace\" |\n| \"professional\" | \"sophisticated, trustworthy, with subtle shadows\" |\n| \"fun\" | \"vibrant, playful, with rounded corners and bold colors\" |\n| \"dark mode\" | \"dark theme with high-contrast accents on deep backgrounds\" |\n\n#### C. Structure the Page\n\nOrganize content into numbered sections:\n\n```markdown\n**Page Structure:**\n1. **Header:** Navigation with logo and menu items\n2. **Hero Section:** Headline, subtext, and primary CTA\n3. **Content Area:** [Describe the main content]\n4. **Footer:** Links, social icons, copyright\n```\n\n#### D. Format Colors Properly\n\nWhen colors are mentioned, format them as:\n```\nDescriptive Name (#hexcode) for functional role\n```\n\nExamples:\n- \"Deep Ocean Blue (#1a365d) for primary buttons and links\"\n- \"Warm Cream (#faf5f0) for page background\"\n- \"Soft Gray (#6b7280) for secondary text\"\n\n### Step 4: Format the Output\n\nStructure the enhanced prompt in this order:\n\n```markdown\n[One-line description of the page purpose and vibe]\n\n**DESIGN SYSTEM (REQUIRED):**\n- Platform: [Web/Mobile], [Desktop/Mobile]-first\n- Theme: [Light/Dark], [style descriptors]\n- Background: [Color description] (#hex)\n- Primary Accent: [Color description] (#hex) for [role]\n- Text Primary: [Color description] (#hex)\n- [Additional design tokens...]\n\n**Page Structure:**\n1. **[Section]:** [Description]\n2. **[Section]:** [Description]\n...\n```\n\n## Output Options\n\n**Default:** Return the enhanced prompt as text for the user to copy.\n\n**Optional file output:** If the user requests, write to a file:\n- `next-prompt.md` — for use with the `stitch-loop` skill\n- Custom filename specified by user\n\n## Examples\n\n### Example 1: Vague Input → Structured Prompt\n\n**User input:**\n> \"make me a login page\"\n\n**Enhanced output:**\n```markdown\nA clean, trustworthy login page with a centered form and subtle branding.\n\n**DESIGN SYSTEM (REQUIRED):**\n- Platform: Web, Desktop-first\n- Theme: Light, minimal, professional\n- Background: Clean White (#ffffff)\n- Surface: Soft Gray (#f9fafb) for form card\n- Primary Accent: Deep Blue (#2563eb) for submit button and links\n- Text Primary: Near Black (#111827) for headings\n- Text Secondary: Medium Gray (#6b7280) for labels\n- Buttons: Subtly rounded (8px), full-width on form\n- Cards: Gently rounded (12px), soft shadow for elevation\n\n**Page Structure:**\n1. **Header:** Minimal logo, centered\n2. **Login Card:** Centered form with email, password fields, \"Forgot password?\" link\n3. **Submit Button:** Primary blue \"Sign In\" button\n4. **Footer:** \"Don''t have an account? Sign up\" link\n\n---\n💡 **Tip:** For consistent designs across multiple screens, create a DESIGN.md \nfile using the `design-md` skill.\n```\n\n### Example 2: Feature Request → Targeted Edit\n\n**User input:**\n> \"add a search bar\"\n\n**Enhanced output:**\n```markdown\nAdd a search bar to the header navigation.\n\n**Specific changes:**\n- Location: Header, right side before user avatar\n- Style: Pill-shaped input with subtle gray background (#f3f4f6)\n- Icon: Magnifying glass icon on the left, inside the input\n- Placeholder: \"Search...\" in light gray (#9ca3af)\n- Behavior: Expands on focus with subtle shadow\n- Width: 240px default, 320px on focus\n\n**Context:** This is a targeted edit. Make only this change while preserving all existing elements.\n```\n\n## Tips for Best Results\n\n1. **Be specific early** — Vague inputs need more enhancement\n2. **Match the user''s intent** — Don''t over-design if they want simple\n3. **Keep it structured** — Numbered sections help Stitch understand hierarchy\n4. **Include the design system** — Consistency is key for multi-page projects\n5. **One change at a time for edits** — Don''t bundle unrelated changes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:57:26.475Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Language Agents needing advanced prompt engineering capabilities for Stitch UI generation.","zh":"非常适合需要高级prompt工程能力的语言代理，以生成Stitch UI。","ja":"Stitch UIを生成するために高度なプロンプトエンジニアリング機能を必要とする言語エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Stitch UI 생성을 위해 고급 프롬프트 엔지니어링 기능이 필요한 언어 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Lenguaje que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de ingeniería de prompts para la generación de la interfaz de usuario de Stitch.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Langage ayant besoin de capacités avancées d''ingénierie de prompts pour la génération de l''interface utilisateur de Stitch.","de":"Perfekt für Sprachagenten, die erweiterte Prompt-Engineering-Fähigkeiten für die Stitch-Benutzeroberflächengenerierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Linguagem que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de engenharia de prompts para geração de UI do Stitch.","ru":"Идеально для языковых агентов, которым требуются продвинутые возможности инженерии подсказок для генерации интерфейса Stitch.","ar":"مثالي لعميل اللغة الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات الهندسة المتقدمة للتحفيز لإنشاء واجهة المستخدم لبرنامج Stitch."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to transform rough UI generation ideas into polished, optimized prompts using the Stitch Effective Prompting Guide, producing better results from Stitch and leveraging best practices for prompt optimization.","zh":"赋予代理将粗糙的UI生成想法转化为精致、优化的prompt，使用Stitch有效的提示指南，产生更好的结果，并利用提示优化的最佳实践。","ja":"エージェントが、StitchのUI生成のアイデアを洗練され、最適化されたプロンプトに変換できるようにし、Stitch Effective Prompting Guideを使用してより良い結果を生成し、プロンプトの最適化に関するベストプラクティスを活用します。","ko":"에이전트가 Stitch UI 생성 아이디어를 정교화하고 최적화된 프롬프트로 변환할 수 있도록 하여 Stitch Effective Prompting Guide를 사용하여 더好的 결과를 생성하고 프롬프트 최적화에 대한 모범 사례를 활용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes transformar ideas de generación de interfaz de usuario poco definidas en prompts pulidos y optimizados utilizando la Guía de Prompts Efectivos de Stitch, lo que produce mejores resultados de Stitch y aprovecha las mejores prácticas para la optimización de prompts.","fr":"Permet aux agents de transformer des idées de génération d''interface utilisateur peu définies en prompts polis et optimisés en utilisant le Guide de prompts efficaces de Stitch, ce qui produit de meilleurs résultats de Stitch et tire parti des meilleures pratiques pour l''optimisation des prompts.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, vage UI-Generierungs-Ideen in polierte und optimierte Prompts mithilfe des Stitch-Effektiven-Prompting-Leitfadens umzuwandeln, was bessere Ergebnisse von Stitch liefert und bewährte Verfahren für die Prompt-Optimierung nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a transformar ideias vagas de geração de UI em prompts polidos e otimizados, utilizando o Guia de Prompting Eficaz do Stitch, produzindo melhores resultados do Stitch e aproveitando as melhores práticas para otimização de prompts.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью преобразовать неясные идеи генерации интерфейса в отполированные и оптимизированные подсказки, используя Руководство по эффективному подсказыванию Stitch, что приводит к лучшим результатам от Stitch и использует лучшие практики для оптимизации подсказок.","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على تحويل الأفكار الغامضة لإنشاء واجهة المستخدم إلى تحفيزات مصقولة ومحسنة، باستخدام دليل التحفيز الفعال لبرنامج Stitch، مما يؤدي إلى نتائج أفضل من برنامج Stitch وتطبيق أفضل الممارسات لتحسين التحفيز."},"useCases":{"en":["Enhancing vague UI generation prompts for Stitch","Optimizing prompts for better results from Stitch","Consulting the Stitch Effective Prompting Guide for latest best practices"],"zh":["增强Stitch的UI生成提示","优化提示以获得更好的Stitch结果","参考Stitch有效的提示指南以获取最新的最佳实践"],"ja":["StitchのUI生成のプロンプトを強化する","プロンプトを最適化してより良いStitchの結果を取得する","Stitch Effective Prompting Guideを参照して最新のベストプラクティスを取得する"],"ko":["Stitch UI 생성 프롬프트 강화","프롬프트 최적화하여 더好的 Stitch 결과 얻기","Stitch Effective Prompting Guide 참조하여 최신 모범 사례 얻기"],"es":["Mejorar los prompts de generación de interfaz de usuario vagos para Stitch","Optimizar los prompts para obtener mejores resultados de Stitch","Consultar la Guía de Prompts Efectivos de Stitch para las mejores prácticas más recientes"],"fr":["Améliorer les prompts de génération d''interface utilisateur vagues pour Stitch","Optimiser les prompts pour obtenir de meilleurs résultats de Stitch","Consulter le Guide de prompts efficaces de Stitch pour les meilleures pratiques les plus récentes"],"de":["Verbesserung von vagen UI-Generierungs-Prompts für Stitch","Optimierung von Prompts für bessere Ergebnisse von Stitch","Konsultation des Stitch-Effektiven-Prompting-Leitfadens für die neuesten bewährten Verfahren"],"pt":["Melhorar prompts vagos de geração de UI para Stitch","Otimizar prompts para melhores resultados do Stitch","Consultar o Guia de Prompting Eficaz do Stitch para as últimas melhores práticas"],"ru":["Улучшение неясных подсказок генерации интерфейса для Stitch","Оптимизация подсказок для лучших результатов от Stitch","Консультирование по Руководству по эффективному подсказыванию Stitch для последних лучших практик"],"ar":["تحسين التحفيزات الغامضة لإنشاء واجهة المستخدم لبرنامج Stitch","تحسين التحفيزات للحصول على نتائج أفضل من برنامج Stitch","الاستشارة لدليل التحفيز الفعال لبرنامج Stitch لأحدث الممارسات المثلى"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires consultation of the Stitch Effective Prompting Guide","Stitch-specific prompting guide and best practices apply"],"zh":["需要参考Stitch有效的提示指南","Stitch特定的提示指南和最佳实践适用"],"ja":["Stitch Effective Prompting Guideの参照が必要","Stitch特有的プロンプトガイドとベストプラクティスが適用される"],"ko":["Stitch Effective Prompting Guide 참조 필요","Stitch 특정 프롬프트 가이드 및 모범 사례 적용"],"es":["Requiere la consulta de la Guía de Prompts Efectivos de Stitch","Guía de prompts y prácticas recomendadas específicas de Stitch"],"fr":["Nécessite la consultation du Guide de prompts efficaces de Stitch","Guide de prompts et pratiques recommandées spécifiques à Stitch"],"de":["Erfordert die Konsultation des Stitch-Effektiven-Prompting-Leitfadens","Stitch-spezifischer Prompting-Leitfaden und bewährte Verfahren"],"pt":["Requer consulta do Guia de Prompting Eficaz do Stitch","Guia de prompting específico do Stitch e melhores práticas aplicam-se"],"ru":["Требует консультации Руководства по эффективному подсказыванию Stitch","Руководство по подсказыванию, специфичное для Stitch, и лучшие практики применяются"],"ar":["يتطلب الاستشارة لدليل التحفيز الفعال لبرنامج Stitch","دليل التحفيز الخاص ببرنامج Stitch والممارسات المثلى يتم تطبيقها"]},"version":3},"qualitySco