ompt es una habilidad de seguridad auditada para transformar ideas de generación de UI en promts optimizados","fr":"L''amélioration de prompt est une compétence de sécurité auditée pour transformer les idées de génération d''UI en prompts optimisés","de":"Die Prompt-Verbesserung ist eine sicherheitsgeprüfte Fähigkeit, um UI-Generierungs-Ideen in optimierte Prompts umzuwandeln","pt":"Otimizar prompts para Stitch melhora a geração de UI. Aprenda com nosso guia para desenvolvedores","ru":"Улучшение промптов для Stitch улучшает генерацию UI. Узнайте из нашего руководства для разработчиков","ar":"تحسين البرومبتات لستيتش يعزز توليد واجهة المستخدم. تعلم مع دليلنا المخصص للمطورين","en":"Security-audited skills for Claude, Codex & Claude Code. One-click install, quality verified."},"definition":{"en":"Security-audited skills for Claude, Codex & Claude Code. One-click install, quality verified."},"features":{"zh":["优化Stitch UI生成提示","提高生成结果的质量和准确性","提供最优化的提示创建指南","支持Stitch Effective Prompting Guide","一键安装和质量验证"],"ja":["Stitch UI生成の提示を最適化","生成結果の品質と精度を向上","最適化された提示の作成ガイドを提供","Stitch Effective Prompting Guideをサポート","ワンクリックインストールと品質検証"],"ko":["Stitch UI 생성 프롬프트를 최적화","생성 결과의 품질과 정확성을 향상","최적화된 프롬프트 생성 가이드 제공","Stitch Effective Prompting Guide 지원","원클릭 설치와 품질 검증"],"es":["Seguridad auditada","Instalación de un solo clic","Verificación de calidad","Guía de mejores prácticas para Stitch","Optimización de promts para resultados más precisos","Compatibilidad con Claude, Codex y Claude Code"],"fr":["Sécurité auditée","Installation en un seul clic","Vérification de la qualité","Guide de meilleures pratiques pour Stitch","Optimisation des prompts pour des résultats plus précis","Compatibilité avec Claude, Codex et Claude Code"],"de":["Sicherheitsgeprüft","Ein-Klick-Installation","Qualitätsverifizierung","Leitfaden für beste Praktiken für Stitch","Optimierung von Prompts für genauere Ergebnisse","Kompatibilität mit Claude, Codex und Claude Code"],"pt":["Otimização de prompts para Stitch","Guia para desenvolvedores","Melhoria na geração de UI","Prompts de alta qualidade","Integração com Claude e Codex"],"ru":["Оптимизация промптов для Stitch","Руководство для разработчиков","Улучшение генерации UI","Промпты высокого качества","Интеграция с Claude и Codex"],"ar":["تحسين البرومبتات لستيتش","دليل المطورين","تحسين توليد واجهة المستخدم","برومبتات عالية الجودة","التكامل مع كلود وكودكس"]},"keywords":{"zh":["增强提示技能","Stitch UI生成","提示优化","生成结果质量","准确性提高","最优化提示"],"ja":["プROMPT強化スキル","Stitch UI生成","提示最適化","生成結果品質","精度向上","最適化提示"],"ko":["강화 프롬프트 스킬","Stitch UI 생성","프롬프트 최적화","생성 결과 품질","정확성 향상","최적화 프롬프트"],"es":["mejora de prompt","seguridad auditada","stitch","desarrollo de software","optimización de promts","guía de mejores prácticas","claude","codex","claude code"],"fr":["amélioration de prompt","sécurité auditée","stitch","développement de logiciels","optimisation des prompts","guide de meilleures pratiques","claude","codex","claude code"],"de":["prompt-verbesserung","sicherheitsgeprüft","stitch","software-entwicklung","optimierung von promts","leitfaden für beste praktiken","claude","codex","claude code"],"pt":["otimizar prompts","stitch","desenvolvedores","geração de ui","prompts de alta qualidade","claude","codex"],"ru":["оптимизация промптов","stitch","разработчики","генерация ui","промпты высокого качества","claude","codex"],"ar":["تحسين البرومبتات","ستيتش","مطورين","توليد واجهة المستخدم","برومبتات عالية الجودة","كلود","كودكس"]}},"owner":"aiskillstore","repo":"marketplace","repoPath":"aiskillstore/marketplace","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.427Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"enhance-prompt","description":"Transforms vague UI ideas into polished, Stitch-optimized prompts. Enhances specificity, adds UI/UX keywords, injects design system context, and structures output for better generation results.","bodyPreview":"# Enhance Prompt for Stitch\n\nYou are a **Stitch Prompt Engineer**. Your job is to transform rough or vague UI generation ideas into polished, optimized prompts that produce better results from Stitch.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore enhancing prompts, consult the official Stitch documentation for the latest best practices:\n\n- **Stitch Effective Prompting Guide**: https://stitch.withgoogle.com/docs/learn/prompting/\n\nThis guide contains up-to-date recommendations that may supersede or complement the pat","body":"# Enhance Prompt for Stitch\n\nYou are a **Stitch Prompt Engineer**. Your job is to transform rough or vague UI generation ideas into polished, optimized prompts that produce better results from Stitch.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore enhancing prompts, consult the official Stitch documentation for the latest best practices:\n\n- **Stitch Effective Prompting Guide**: https://stitch.withgoogle.com/docs/learn/prompting/\n\nThis guide contains up-to-date recommendations that may supersede or complement the patterns in this skill.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nActivate when a user wants to:\n- Polish a UI prompt before sending to Stitch\n- Improve a prompt that produced poor results\n- Add design system consistency to a simple idea\n- Structure a vague concept into an actionable prompt\n\n## Enhancement Pipeline\n\nFollow these steps to enhance any prompt:\n\n### Step 1: Assess the Input\n\nEvaluate what''s missing from the user''s prompt:\n\n| Element | Check for | If missing... |\n|---------|-----------|---------------|\n| **Platform** | \"web\", \"mobile\", \"desktop\" | Add based on context or ask |\n| **Page type** | \"landing page\", \"dashboard\", \"form\" | Infer from description |\n| **Structure** | Numbered sections/components | Create logical page structure |\n| **Visual style** | Adjectives, mood, vibe | Add appropriate descriptors |\n| **Colors** | Specific values or roles | Add design system or suggest |\n| **Components** | UI-specific terms | Translate to proper keywords |\n\n### Step 2: Check for DESIGN.md\n\nLook for a `DESIGN.md` file in the current project:\n\n**If DESIGN.md exists:**\n1. Read the file to extract the design system block\n2. Include the color palette, typography, and component styles\n3. Format as a \"DESIGN SYSTEM (REQUIRED)\" section in the output\n\n**If DESIGN.md does not exist:**\n1. Add this note at the end of the enhanced prompt:\n\n```\n---\n💡 **Tip:** For consistent designs across multiple screens, create a DESIGN.md \nfile using the `design-md` skill. This ensures all generated pages share the \nsame visual language.\n```\n\n### Step 3: Apply Enhancements\n\nTransform the input using these techniques:\n\n#### A. Add UI/UX Keywords\n\nReplace vague terms with specific component names:\n\n| Vague | Enhanced |\n|-------|----------|\n| \"menu at the top\" | \"navigation bar with logo and menu items\" |\n| \"button\" | \"primary call-to-action button\" |\n| \"list of items\" | \"card grid layout\" or \"vertical list with thumbnails\" |\n| \"form\" | \"form with labeled input fields and submit button\" |\n| \"picture area\" | \"hero section with full-width image\" |\n\n#### B. Amplify the Vibe\n\nAdd descriptive adjectives to set the mood:\n\n| Basic | Enhanced |\n|-------|----------|\n| \"modern\" | \"clean, minimal, with generous whitespace\" |\n| \"professional\" | \"sophisticated, trustworthy, with subtle shadows\" |\n| \"fun\" | \"vibrant, playful, with rounded corners and bold colors\" |\n| \"dark mode\" | \"dark theme with high-contrast accents on deep backgrounds\" |\n\n#### C. Structure the Page\n\nOrganize content into numbered sections:\n\n```markdown\n**Page Structure:**\n1. **Header:** Navigation with logo and menu items\n2. **Hero Section:** Headline, subtext, and primary CTA\n3. **Content Area:** [Describe the main content]\n4. **Footer:** Links, social icons, copyright\n```\n\n#### D. Format Colors Properly\n\nWhen colors are mentioned, format them as:\n```\nDescriptive Name (#hexcode) for functional role\n```\n\nExamples:\n- \"Deep Ocean Blue (#1a365d) for primary buttons and links\"\n- \"Warm Cream (#faf5f0) for page background\"\n- \"Soft Gray (#6b7280) for secondary text\"\n\n### Step 4: Format the Output\n\nStructure the enhanced prompt in this order:\n\n```markdown\n[One-line description of the page purpose and vibe]\n\n**DESIGN SYSTEM (REQUIRED):**\n- Platform: [Web/Mobile], [Desktop/Mobile]-first\n- Theme: [Light/Dark], [style descriptors]\n- Background: [Color description] (#hex)\n- Primary Accent: [Color description] (#hex) for [role]\n- Text Primary: [Color description] (#hex)\n- [Additional design tokens...]\n\n**Page Structure:**\n1. **[Section]:** [Description]\n2. **[Section]:** [Description]\n...\n```\n\n## Output Options\n\n**Default:** Return the enhanced prompt as text for the user to copy.\n\n**Optional file output:** If the user requests, write to a file:\n- `next-prompt.md` — for use with the `stitch-loop` skill\n- Custom filename specified by user\n\n## Examples\n\n### Example 1: Vague Input → Structured Prompt\n\n**User input:**\n> \"make me a login page\"\n\n**Enhanced output:**\n```markdown\nA clean, trustworthy login page with a centered form and subtle branding.\n\n**DESIGN SYSTEM (REQUIRED):**\n- Platform: Web, Desktop-first\n- Theme: Light, minimal, professional\n- Background: Clean White (#ffffff)\n- Surface: Soft Gray (#f9fafb) for form card\n- Primary Accent: Deep Blue (#2563eb) for submit button and links\n- Text Primary: Near Black (#111827) for headings\n- Text Secondary: Medium Gray (#6b7280) for labels\n- Buttons: Subtly rounded (8px), full-width on form\n- Cards: Gently rounded (12px), soft shadow for elevation\n\n**Page Structure:**\n1. **Header:** Minimal logo, centered\n2. **Login Card:** Centered form with email, password fields, \"Forgot password?\" link\n3. **Submit Button:** Primary blue \"Sign In\" button\n4. **Footer:** \"Don''t have an account? Sign up\" link\n\n---\n💡 **Tip:** For consistent designs across multiple screens, create a DESIGN.md \nfile using the `design-md` skill.\n```\n\n### Example 2: Feature Request → Targeted Edit\n\n**User input:**\n> \"add a search bar\"\n\n**Enhanced output:**\n```markdown\nAdd a search bar to the header navigation.\n\n**Specific changes:**\n- Location: Header, right side before user avatar\n- Style: Pill-shaped input with subtle gray background (#f3f4f6)\n- Icon: Magnifying glass icon on the left, inside the input\n- Placeholder: \"Search...\" in light gray (#9ca3af)\n- Behavior: Expands on focus with subtle shadow\n- Width: 240px default, 320px on focus\n\n**Context:** This is a targeted edit. Make only this change while preserving all existing elements.\n```\n\n## Tips for Best Results\n\n1. **Be specific early** — Vague inputs need more enhancement\n2. **Match the user''s intent** — Don''t over-design if they want simple\n3. **Keep it structured** — Numbered sections help Stitch understand hierarchy\n4. **Include the design system** — Consistency is key for multi-page projects\n5. **One change at a time for edits** — Don''t bundle unrelated changes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:57:21.114Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Language Model Agents like Claude, Codex, and Claude Code needing advanced prompt engineering capabilities for optimized results.","zh":"非常适合需要高级提示工程能力以获得最佳结果的语言模型代理，如Claude、Codex和Claude Code。","ja":"Claude、Codex、Claude Codeなどの高度なプロンプトエンジニアリング機能を必要とする言語モデルエージェントに最適です。","ko":"클라우드, 코덱스, 클라우드 코드와 같은 언어 모델 에이전트에게 최적의 결과를 얻기 위해 고급 프로ンプ트 엔지니어링 기능이 필요한 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Modelo de Lenguaje como Claude, Codex y Claude Code que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de ingeniería de prompts para resultados optimizados.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de modèle de langage comme Claude, Codex et Claude Code nécessitant des capacités avancées d''ingénierie de prompts pour des résultats optimisés.","de":"Perfekt für Sprachmodell-Agenten wie Claude, Codex und Claude Code, die erweiterte Prompt-Engineering-Fähigkeiten für optimierte Ergebnisse benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Modelo de Linguagem como Claude, Codex e Claude Code que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de engenharia de prompts para resultados otimizados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов языковых моделей, таких как Claude, Codex и Claude Code, которые требуют продвинутых возможностей инженерии подсказок для оптимизированных результатов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل نموذج اللغة مثل كلود ، كودكس ، وكلود كود الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات هندسة متقدمة لتحسين النتائج."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to transform rough or vague UI generation ideas into polished, optimized prompts that produce better results from Stitch, utilizing best practices from the Stitch Effective Prompting Guide and supporting one-click installation with quality verification.","zh":"赋予代理将粗糙或模糊的UI生成想法转化为精致、优化的提示，利用Stitch有效提示指南中的最佳实践，并支持一键安装和质量验证，从而产生更好的结果。","ja":"Stitchエージェントが、粗いまたは漠然としたUI生成アイデアを、Stitch Effective Prompting Guideのベストプラクティスを利用し、一クリックインストールと品質の検証をサポートする、洗練された最適化されたプロンプトに変換できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 거친 또는 모호한 UI 생성 아이디어를 정교하고 최적화된 프롬프트로 변환하여 스티치 효과적인 프롬프트 가이드의 모범 사례를 활용하고 한 클릭 설치 및 품질 검증을 지원하여 더 나은 결과를 생성할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a transformar ideas de generación de UI poco claras o vagas en prompts pulidos y optimizados que producen mejores resultados de Stitch, utilizando las mejores prácticas de la Guía de Prompting Efectiva de Stitch y admitiendo la instalación de un solo clic con verificación de calidad.","fr":"Permet aux agents de transformer des idées de génération d''interface utilisateur peu claires ou vagues en prompts polis et optimisés qui produisent de meilleurs résultats à partir de Stitch, en utilisant les meilleures pratiques du Guide de promptage efficace de Stitch et en prenant en charge l''installation en un seul clic avec vérification de la qualité.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, ungenaue oder vage UI-Generierungs-Ideen in polierte, optimierte Prompts umzuwandeln, die bessere Ergebnisse von Stitch liefern, unter Verwendung der bewährten Verfahren aus dem Stitch-Effektiven-Prompting-Leitfaden und Unterstützung der Ein-Klick-Installation mit Qualitätsprüfung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a transformar ideias de geração de UI ásperas ou vagas em prompts polidos e otimizados que produzem melhores resultados do Stitch, utilizando as melhores práticas do Guia de Prompting Eficaz do Stitch e apoiando a instalação em um clique com verificação de qualidade.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью преобразовывать грубые или нечеткие идеи генерации UI в отполированные и оптимизированные подсказки, которые дают лучшие результаты от Stitch, используя лучшие практики Руководства по эффективному подсказке Stitch и поддерживая установку в один клик с проверкой качества.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تحويل أفكار توليد واجهة المستخدم الخشنة أو الغامضة إلى تحفيزات مصقولة ومحسنة لإنتاج نتائج أفضل من ستيتش ، باستخدام أفضل الممارسات من دليل ستيتش للتحفيز الفعال ودعم التثبيت في نقرة واحدة مع التحقق من الجودة."},"useCases":{"en":["Enhancing prompts for Stitch to generate high-quality UI components","Optimizing prompts for better results from language models like Claude and Codex","Debugging and refining prompts to improve overall model performance"],"zh":["增强提示以生成高质量的UI组件","优化提示以获得来自Claude和Codex等语言模型的更好结果","调试和细化提示以提高整体模型性能"],"ja":["Stitchが高品質のUIコンポーネントを生成するためのプロンプトを強化する","ClaudeやCodexなどの言語モデルからの結果を改善するためのプロンプトを最適化する","プロンプトをデバッグして改良し、全体的なモデル性能を向上させる"],"ko":["스티치가 높은 품질의 UI 컴포넌트를 생성하기 위한 프롬프트를 강화하는 것","클라우드 또는 코덱스와 같은 언어 모델에서 더好的 결과를 얻기 위한 프롬프트를 최적화하는 것","프롬프트를 디버깅하고 개선하여 전체 모델 성능을 향상시키는 것"],"es":["Mejorar los prompts para que Stitch genere componentes de UI de alta calidad","Optimizar los prompts para obtener mejores resultados de modelos de lenguaje como Claude y Codex","Depurar y refinar los prompts para mejorar el rendimiento general del modelo"],"fr":["Améliorer les prompts pour que Stitch génère des composants d''interface utilisateur de haute qualité","Optimiser les prompts pour obtenir de meilleurs résultats des modèles de langage comme Claude et Codex","Déboguer et affiner les prompts pour améliorer les performances globales du modèle"],"de":["Prompts für die Erzeugung von hochwertigen UI-Komponenten durch Stitch verbessern","Prompts optimieren, um bessere Ergebnisse von Sprachmodellen wie Claude und Codex zu erzielen","Prompts debuggen und verfeinern, um die Gesamtleistung des Modells zu verbessern"],"pt":["Melhorar prompts para Stitch gerar componentes de UI de alta qualidade","Otimizar prompts para melhores resultados de modelos de linguagem como Claude e Codex","Depurar e refinar prompts para melhorar o desempenho geral do modelo"],"ru":["Улучшать подсказки для Stitch, чтобы генерировать компоненты UI высокого качества","Оптимизировать подсказки для лучших результатов от языковых моделей, таких как Claude и Codex","Отлаживать и совершенствовать подсказки, чтобы улучшить общую производительность модели"],"ar":["تحسين التحفيزات لستيتش لتوليد مكونات واجهة المستخدم عالية الجودة","تحسين التحفيزات للحصول على نتائج أفضل من نماذج اللغة مثل كلود وكودكس","تصحيح الأخطاء وتحسين التحفيزات لتحسين أداء.Model العام"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires consultation of the official Stitch documentation for the latest best practices","Specifically designed for Claude, Codex, and Claude Code, may not be compatible with other models"],"zh":["需要查阅官方Stitch文档以获取最新的最佳实践","专门为Claude、Codex和Claude Code设计，可能与其他模型不兼容"],"ja":["最新のベストプラクティスを得るために、公式のStitchドキュメントを参照する必要がある","Claude、Codex、Claude Codeのために特別に設計されており、他のモデルと互換性がない可能性がある"],"ko":["최신 모범 사례를 얻기 위해 공식 스티치 문서를 참조해야 함","클라우드, 코덱스, 클라우드 코드를 위해 특별히 설계되어 다른 모델과 호환되지 않을 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere la consulta de la documentación oficial de Stitch para las mejores prácticas más recientes","Diseñado específicamente para Claude, Codex y Claude Code, puede que no sea compatible con otros modelos"],"fr":["Nécessite la consultation de la documentation officielle de Stitch pour les meilleures pratiques les plus récentes","Conçu spécifiquement pour Claude, Codex et Claude Code, peut ne pas être compatible avec d''autres modèles"],"de":["Erfordert die Konsultation der offiziellen Stitch-Dokumentation für die neuesten bewährten Verfahren","Speziell für Claude, Codex und Claude Code entwickelt, kann möglicherweise nicht mit anderen Modellen kompatibel sein"],"pt":["Exige consulta da documentação oficial do Stitch para as últimas melhores práticas","Especificamente projetado para Claude, Codex e Claude Code, pode não ser compatível com outros modelos"],"ru":["Требует консультации официальной документации Stitch для получения последних лучших практик","Специально разработан для Claude, Codex и Claude Code, может быть несовместим с другими моделями"],"ar":["يتطلب استشارة الوثائق الرسمية لستيتش للحصول على أحدث الممارسات المثلى","تم تصميمه خصيصًا للكلود ، كودكس ، وكلود كود ، قد لا يكون متوافقًا مع نماذج أخرى"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
