다","es":"El objetivo del ingeniero de prompts de Stitch es transformar ideas de generación de UI vagas en prompts pulidos y optimizados","fr":"L''objectif de l''ingénieur de prompts de Stitch est de transformer des idées de génération d''UI vagues en prompts polis et optimisés","de":"Das Ziel des Stitch-Prompt-Ingenieurs ist es, vage UI-Generierungs-Ideen in polierte und optimierte Prompts umzuwandeln","pt":"Otimizar prompts para Stitch melhora a geração de UI. Aprenda com o guia oficial de prompting.","ru":"Улучшение промптов для Stitch улучшает генерацию UI. Узнайте из официального руководства по промптингу.","ar":"تحسين البرومبتات لستيتش يحسن إنشاء واجهة المستخدم. تعلم من الدليل الرسمي لبرومبتينج.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["优化Stitch提示","提高UI生成效果","提高开发效率","使用Stitch Effective Prompting Guide","掌握最新的最佳实践"],"ja":["Stitchの提示を最適化","UI生成の品質を向上","開発効率を向上","Stitch Effective Prompting Guideを使用","最新のベストプラクティスをマスター"],"ko":["Stitch 프롬프트 최적화","UI 생성 성능 향상","개발 효율성 향상","Stitch Effective Prompting Guide 사용","최신 베스트 프랙티스 마스터"],"es":["Creación de prompts óptimos para Stitch","Mejora de la generación de UI","Optimización de resultados","Consulta de la guía de prompts de Stitch","Aplicación de las mejores prácticas","Transformación de ideas vagas en prompts pulidos"],"fr":["Création de prompts optimaux pour Stitch","Amélioration de la génération d''UI","Optimisation des résultats","Consultation du guide de prompts de Stitch","Application des meilleures pratiques","Transformation d''idées vagues en prompts polis"],"de":["Erstellung optimaler Prompts für Stitch","Verbesserung der UI-Generierung","Optimierung der Ergebnisse","Konsultation der Stitch-Prompt-Anleitung","Anwendung der besten Praktiken","Umwandlung vager Ideen in polierte Prompts"],"pt":["Otimização de prompts para Stitch","Melhoria na geração de UI","Guia oficial de prompting","Práticas recomendadas para prompts","Desenvolvimento de prompts eficazes","Integração com a documentação oficial"],"ru":["Улучшение промптов для Stitch","Улучшение генерации UI","Официальное руководство по промптингу","Рекомендуемые практики для промптов","Разработка эффективных промптов","Интеграция с официальной документацией"],"ar":["تحسين البرومبتات لستيتش","تحسين إنشاء واجهة المستخدم","الدليل الرسمي لبرومبتينج","أفضل الممارسات لبرومبتات","تنمية برومبتات فعالة","التكامل مع الدليل الرسمي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Stitch Prompt Engineer","UI生成","提示优化","开发效率","Stitch Effective Prompting Guide","最佳实践"],"ja":["Stitch Promptエンジニア","UI生成","提示最適化","開発効率","Stitch Effective Prompting Guide","ベストプラクティス"],"ko":["Stitch Prompt 엔지니어","UI 생성","프롬프트 최적화","개발 효율성","Stitch Effective Prompting Guide","베스트 프랙티스"],"es":["prompts de Stitch","generación de UI","optimización de resultados","guía de prompts de Stitch","mejores prácticas","ingeniero de prompts de Stitch","desarrollo de UI","Stitch"],"fr":["prompts de Stitch","génération d''UI","optimisation des résultats","guide de prompts de Stitch","meilleures pratiques","ingénieur de prompts de Stitch","développement d''UI","Stitch"],"de":["Prompts für Stitch","UI-Generierung","Optimierung der Ergebnisse","Stitch-Prompt-Anleitung","beste Praktiken","Stitch-Prompt-Ingenieur","UI-Entwicklung","Stitch"],"pt":["otimizar prompts","stitch","geração de ui","prompting","desenvolvimento de prompts","guias de prompting","práticas recomendadas","documentação oficial","integração com stitch"],"ru":["улучшение промптов","stitch","генерация ui","промптинг","разработка промптов","руководства по промптингу","рекомендуемые практики","официальная документация","интеграция со stitch"],"ar":["تحسين البرومبتات","ستيتش","إنشاء واجهة المستخدم","برومبتينج","تنمية برومبتات","دليل برومبتينج","أفضل الممارسات","الدليل الرسمي","التكامل مع ستيتش"]}},"owner":"mhiggs82","repo":"parentwise_summary_site_2","repoPath":"mhiggs82/parentwise_summary_site_2","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.427Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"enhance-prompt","description":"Transforms vague UI ideas into polished, Stitch-optimized prompts. Enhances specificity, adds UI/UX keywords, injects design system context, and structures output for better generation results.","bodyPreview":"# Enhance Prompt for Stitch\n\nYou are a **Stitch Prompt Engineer**. Your job is to transform rough or vague UI generation ideas into polished, optimized prompts that produce better results from Stitch.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore enhancing prompts, consult the official Stitch documentation for the latest best practices:\n\n- **Stitch Effective Prompting Guide**: https://stitch.withgoogle.com/docs/learn/prompting/\n\nThis guide contains up-to-date recommendations that may supersede or complement the pat","body":"# Enhance Prompt for Stitch\n\nYou are a **Stitch Prompt Engineer**. Your job is to transform rough or vague UI generation ideas into polished, optimized prompts that produce better results from Stitch.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore enhancing prompts, consult the official Stitch documentation for the latest best practices:\n\n- **Stitch Effective Prompting Guide**: https://stitch.withgoogle.com/docs/learn/prompting/\n\nThis guide contains up-to-date recommendations that may supersede or complement the patterns in this skill.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nActivate when a user wants to:\n- Polish a UI prompt before sending to Stitch\n- Improve a prompt that produced poor results\n- Add design system consistency to a simple idea\n- Structure a vague concept into an actionable prompt\n\n## Enhancement Pipeline\n\nFollow these steps to enhance any prompt:\n\n### Step 1: Assess the Input\n\nEvaluate what''s missing from the user''s prompt:\n\n| Element | Check for | If missing... |\n|---------|-----------|---------------|\n| **Platform** | \"web\", \"mobile\", \"desktop\" | Add based on context or ask |\n| **Page type** | \"landing page\", \"dashboard\", \"form\" | Infer from description |\n| **Structure** | Numbered sections/components | Create logical page structure |\n| **Visual style** | Adjectives, mood, vibe | Add appropriate descriptors |\n| **Colors** | Specific values or roles | Add design system or suggest |\n| **Components** | UI-specific terms | Translate to proper keywords |\n\n### Step 2: Check for DESIGN.md\n\nLook for a `DESIGN.md` file in the current project:\n\n**If DESIGN.md exists:**\n1. Read the file to extract the design system block\n2. Include the color palette, typography, and component styles\n3. Format as a \"DESIGN SYSTEM (REQUIRED)\" section in the output\n\n**If DESIGN.md does not exist:**\n1. Add this note at the end of the enhanced prompt:\n\n```\n---\n💡 **Tip:** For consistent designs across multiple screens, create a DESIGN.md \nfile using the `design-md` skill. This ensures all generated pages share the \nsame visual language.\n```\n\n### Step 3: Apply Enhancements\n\nTransform the input using these techniques:\n\n#### A. Add UI/UX Keywords\n\nReplace vague terms with specific component names:\n\n| Vague | Enhanced |\n|-------|----------|\n| \"menu at the top\" | \"navigation bar with logo and menu items\" |\n| \"button\" | \"primary call-to-action button\" |\n| \"list of items\" | \"card grid layout\" or \"vertical list with thumbnails\" |\n| \"form\" | \"form with labeled input fields and submit button\" |\n| \"picture area\" | \"hero section with full-width image\" |\n\n#### B. Amplify the Vibe\n\nAdd descriptive adjectives to set the mood:\n\n| Basic | Enhanced |\n|-------|----------|\n| \"modern\" | \"clean, minimal, with generous whitespace\" |\n| \"professional\" | \"sophisticated, trustworthy, with subtle shadows\" |\n| \"fun\" | \"vibrant, playful, with rounded corners and bold colors\" |\n| \"dark mode\" | \"dark theme with high-contrast accents on deep backgrounds\" |\n\n#### C. Structure the Page\n\nOrganize content into numbered sections:\n\n```markdown\n**Page Structure:**\n1. **Header:** Navigation with logo and menu items\n2. **Hero Section:** Headline, subtext, and primary CTA\n3. **Content Area:** [Describe the main content]\n4. **Footer:** Links, social icons, copyright\n```\n\n#### D. Format Colors Properly\n\nWhen colors are mentioned, format them as:\n```\nDescriptive Name (#hexcode) for functional role\n```\n\nExamples:\n- \"Deep Ocean Blue (#1a365d) for primary buttons and links\"\n- \"Warm Cream (#faf5f0) for page background\"\n- \"Soft Gray (#6b7280) for secondary text\"\n\n### Step 4: Format the Output\n\nStructure the enhanced prompt in this order:\n\n```markdown\n[One-line description of the page purpose and vibe]\n\n**DESIGN SYSTEM (REQUIRED):**\n- Platform: [Web/Mobile], [Desktop/Mobile]-first\n- Theme: [Light/Dark], [style descriptors]\n- Background: [Color description] (#hex)\n- Primary Accent: [Color description] (#hex) for [role]\n- Text Primary: [Color description] (#hex)\n- [Additional design tokens...]\n\n**Page Structure:**\n1. **[Section]:** [Description]\n2. **[Section]:** [Description]\n...\n```\n\n## Output Options\n\n**Default:** Return the enhanced prompt as text for the user to copy.\n\n**Optional file output:** If the user requests, write to a file:\n- `next-prompt.md` — for use with the `stitch-loop` skill\n- Custom filename specified by user\n\n## Examples\n\n### Example 1: Vague Input → Structured Prompt\n\n**User input:**\n> \"make me a login page\"\n\n**Enhanced output:**\n```markdown\nA clean, trustworthy login page with a centered form and subtle branding.\n\n**DESIGN SYSTEM (REQUIRED):**\n- Platform: Web, Desktop-first\n- Theme: Light, minimal, professional\n- Background: Clean White (#ffffff)\n- Surface: Soft Gray (#f9fafb) for form card\n- Primary Accent: Deep Blue (#2563eb) for submit button and links\n- Text Primary: Near Black (#111827) for headings\n- Text Secondary: Medium Gray (#6b7280) for labels\n- Buttons: Subtly rounded (8px), full-width on form\n- Cards: Gently rounded (12px), soft shadow for elevation\n\n**Page Structure:**\n1. **Header:** Minimal logo, centered\n2. **Login Card:** Centered form with email, password fields, \"Forgot password?\" link\n3. **Submit Button:** Primary blue \"Sign In\" button\n4. **Footer:** \"Don''t have an account? Sign up\" link\n\n---\n💡 **Tip:** For consistent designs across multiple screens, create a DESIGN.md \nfile using the `design-md` skill.\n```\n\n### Example 2: Feature Request → Targeted Edit\n\n**User input:**\n> \"add a search bar\"\n\n**Enhanced output:**\n```markdown\nAdd a search bar to the header navigation.\n\n**Specific changes:**\n- Location: Header, right side before user avatar\n- Style: Pill-shaped input with subtle gray background (#f3f4f6)\n- Icon: Magnifying glass icon on the left, inside the input\n- Placeholder: \"Search...\" in light gray (#9ca3af)\n- Behavior: Expands on focus with subtle shadow\n- Width: 240px default, 320px on focus\n\n**Context:** This is a targeted edit. Make only this change while preserving all existing elements.\n```\n\n## Tips for Best Results\n\n1. **Be specific early** — Vague inputs need more enhancement\n2. **Match the user''s intent** — Don''t over-design if they want simple\n3. **Keep it structured** — Numbered sections help Stitch understand hierarchy\n4. **Include the design system** — Consistency is key for multi-page projects\n5. **One change at a time for edits** — Don''t bundle unrelated changes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:57:32.203Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Language Agents needing to refine vague UI generation ideas into polished prompts for Stitch.","zh":"非常适合需要将不明确的UI生成想法完善为Stitch的精致提示的语言代理","ja":"Stitchの曖昧なUI生成アイデアを洗練されたプロンプトに磨き上げる必要がある言語エージェントに最適","ko":"Stitch를 위한 애매한 UI 생성 아이디어를 정교한 프롬프트로 다듬어야 하는 언어 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Lenguaje que necesitan perfeccionar ideas vagas de generación de UI en prompts pulidos para Stitch.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Langage ayant besoin d''affiner des idées vagues de génération d''UI en prompts polis pour Stitch.","de":"Perfekt für Sprachagenten, die vage UI-Generierungs-Ideen in polierte Prompts für Stitch verfeinern müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Linguagem que precisam refinar ideias vagas de geração de UI em prompts polidos para Stitch.","ru":"Идеально подходит для языковых агентов, которым необходимо усовершенствовать неясные идеи генерации UI в отполированные подсказки для Stitch.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء اللغويين الذين يحتاجون إلى تحسين الأفكار الغامضة لإنشاء واجهة المستخدم في استدعاءات متطورة لبرنامج Stitch."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to transform rough prompts into optimized ones using the Stitch Effective Prompting Guide, leveraging best practices for UI generation and producing better results from Stitch through effective use of protocols like https and documentation formats.","zh":"赋予代理能力，使用Stitch有效提示指南将粗糙的提示转化为优化的提示，利用UI生成的最佳实践，并通过有效使用https等协议和文档格式从Stitch中产生更好的结果","ja":"Stitch Effective Prompting Guideを利用して、エージェントが粗いプロンプトを最適化されたものに変換できるようにし、UI生成のベストプラクティスを活用して、httpsなどのプロトコルやドキュメント形式を効果的に使用して、Stitchからより良い結果を生み出す","ko":"스튜치 효과적인 프롬프트 가이드를 사용하여 에이전트가 粗い 프롬프트를 최적화된 프롬프트로 변환할 수 있도록 하여, UI 생성의 ベストプラクティス을 활용하여 https 등의 프로토콜 및 문서 형식을 효과적으로 사용하여 스티치에서 더 나은 결과를 생성한다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a transformar prompts rudimentarios en optimizados utilizando la Guía de Prompts Efectivos de Stitch, aprovechando las mejores prácticas para la generación de UI y produciendo mejores resultados de Stitch a través del uso efectivo de protocolos como https y formatos de documentación.","fr":"Permet aux agents de transformer des prompts rudimentaires en prompts optimisés en utilisant le Guide de Prompting Efficace de Stitch, en exploitant les meilleures pratiques pour la génération d''UI et en produisant de meilleurs résultats de Stitch grâce à une utilisation efficace de protocoles tels que https et des formats de documentation.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, grobe Prompts in optimierte Prompts mithilfe des Stitch-Effektiven-Prompting-Leitfadens umzuwandeln, der die besten Praktiken für die UI-Generierung nutzt und bessere Ergebnisse von Stitch durch effektive Nutzung von Protokollen wie https und Dokumentationsformaten produziert.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a transformar prompts brutos em otimizados, utilizando o Guia de Prompting Eficaz do Stitch, aproveitando as melhores práticas para geração de UI e produzindo melhores resultados do Stitch por meio do uso eficaz de protocolos como https e formatos de documentação.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью превратить грубые подсказки в оптимизированные, используя Руководство по эффективному созданию подсказок для Stitch, используя лучшие практики для генерации UI и получая лучшие результаты от Stitch за счет эффективного использования протоколов, таких как https, и форматов документации.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية تحويل الاستدعاءات الخشنة إلى استدعاءات متطورة باستخدام دليل الاستدعاء الفعال لبرنامج Stitch، واستخدام أفضل الممارسات لإنشاء واجهة المستخدم وانتاج نتائج أفضل من برنامج Stitch من خلال الاستخدام الفعال لبروتوكولات مثل https وتنسيقات الوثائق."},"useCases":{"en":["Enhancing vague UI generation ideas for Stitch","Optimizing prompts for better results from Stitch","Consulting the Stitch Effective Prompting Guide for best practices"],"zh":["为Stitch增强不明确的UI生成想法","为获得更好的Stitch结果而优化提示","咨询Stitch有效提示指南以获取最佳实践"],"ja":["Stitchの曖昧なUI生成アイデアを強化する","Stitchからのより良い結果を得るためのプロンプトの最適化","ベストプラクティスを得るためにStitch Effective Prompting Guideを参照する"],"ko":["스티치의 애매한 UI 생성 아이디어를 강화한다","스티치로부터 더好的 결과를 얻기 위한 프롬프트의 최적화","베스트 프랙티스를 얻기 위해 스티치 효과적인 프롬프트 가이드를 참조한다"],"es":["Mejorar ideas vagas de generación de UI para Stitch","Optimizar prompts para obtener mejores resultados de Stitch","Consultar la Guía de Prompts Efectivos de Stitch para las mejores prácticas"],"fr":["Améliorer les idées vagues de génération d''UI pour Stitch","Optimiser les prompts pour obtenir de meilleurs résultats de Stitch","Consulter le Guide de Prompting Efficace de Stitch pour les meilleures pratiques"],"de":["Verfeinern von vagen UI-Generierungs-Ideen für Stitch","Optimieren von Prompts für bessere Ergebnisse von Stitch","Konsultieren des Stitch-Effektiven-Prompting-Leitfadens für die besten Praktiken"],"pt":["Melhorar ideias vagas de geração de UI para Stitch","Otimizar prompts para melhores resultados do Stitch","Consultar o Guia de Prompting Eficaz do Stitch para as melhores práticas"],"ru":["Усовершенствовать неясные идеи генерации UI для Stitch","Оптимизировать подсказки для лучших результатов от Stitch","Консультироваться с Руководством по эффективному созданию подсказок для Stitch для лучших практик"],"ar":["تحسين الأفكار الغامضة لإنشاء واجهة المستخدم لبرنامج Stitch","تحسين الاستدعاءات لنتائج أفضل من برنامج Stitch","الاستعانة بدليل الاستدعاء الفعال لبرنامج Stitch لأفضل الممارسات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires consultation of the official Stitch documentation","Stitch-specific prompting guide must be followed"],"zh":["需要参考官方的Stitch文档","必须遵循Stitch特定的提示指南"],"ja":["公式のStitchドキュメントを参照する必要がある","Stitch特有のプロンプトガイドを遵守する必要がある"],"ko":["공식 스티치 문서를 참조해야 한다","스티치 특정 프롬프트 가이드를 따라야 한다"],"es":["Requiere la consulta de la documentación oficial de Stitch","Debe seguirse la guía de prompts específica de Stitch"],"fr":["Nécessite la consultation de la documentation officielle de Stitch","Le guide de prompts spécifique à Stitch doit être suivi"],"de":["Benötigt die Konsultation der offiziellen Stitch-Dokumentation","Der Stitch-spezifische Prompting-Leitfaden muss befolgt werden"],"pt":["Requer consulta da documentação oficial do Stitch","Deve-se seguir o guia de prompting específico do Stitch"],"ru":["Требуется консультация официальной документации Stitch","Должно следоваться руководство по созданию подсказок, специфичное для Stitch"],"ar":["يتطلب الاستعانة بالوثائق الرسمية لبرنامج Stitch","يجب اتباع دليل الاستدعاء المحدد لبرنامج Stitch"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
