commercial","Meilleures pratiques et validation des résultats","Étapes actionnables et vérification","Accès à des ressources et des exemples détaillés"],"de":["Sammlung von über 800 Hochleistungs-Fähigkeiten","Anleitungen und Überprüfungslisten für Aufgaben von Geschäftsanalysten","Beste Praktiken und Ergebnisvalidierung","Handlungsempfehlungen und Überprüfung","Zugang zu Ressourcen und detaillierten Beispielen"],"pt":["Melhoria da produtividade","Tomada de decisões informadas","Fluxos de trabalho otimizados","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Guias e checklist para analistas de negócios","Exemplos detalhados para implementação"],"ru":["Улучшение производительности","Принятие обоснованных решений","Оптимизированные рабочие процессы","Интеграция с инструментами разработки","Руководства и чек-листы для бизнес-аналитиков","Подробные примеры для реализации"],"ar":["تحسين الإنتاجية","عمليات اتخاذ القرارات المعلوماتية","تدفقات العمل المُحسنة","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير","دلائل وقوائم مراجعة لمحللين الأعمال","أمثلة مفصلة للتطبيق"]},"keywords":{"es":["analista de negocios","colección de habilidades","Claude Code","alto rendimiento","mejores prácticas","tareas de analista de negocios","listas de verificación","validación de resultados"],"fr":["analyste commercial","collection de compétences","Claude Code","haute performance","meilleures pratiques","tâches d''analyste commercial","listes de vérification","validation des résultats"],"de":["Geschäftsanalyst","Sammlung von Fähigkeiten","Claude Code","Hochleistungs-Fähigkeiten","beste Praktiken","Aufgaben von Geschäftsanalysten","Überprüfungslisten","Ergebnisvalidierung"],"pt":["analista de negócios","habilidades de AI","desenvolvimento de software","produtividade","tomada de decisões","fluxos de trabalho","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","guias para analistas de negócios","exemplos de implementação"],"ru":["бизнес-аналитик","навыки AI","разработка программного обеспечения","производительность","принятие решений","рабочие процессы","инструменты разработки","руководства для бизнес-аналитиков","примеры реализации"],"ar":["محلل الأعمال","مهارات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير البرمجيات","الإنتاجية","عمليات اتخاذ القرارات","تدفقات العمل","أدوات التطوير","دلائل لمحللين الأعمال","أمثلة للتطبيق"]}},"owner":"sickn33","repo":"antigravity-awesome-skills","repoPath":"sickn33/antigravity-awesome-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.427Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"business-analyst","description":"Master modern business analysis with AI-powered analytics,","bodyPreview":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on business analyst tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for business analyst\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to business analyst\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/i","body":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on business analyst tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for business analyst\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to business analyst\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\nYou are an expert business analyst specializing in data-driven decision making through advanced analytics, modern BI tools, and strategic business intelligence.\n\n## Purpose\n\nExpert business analyst focused on transforming complex business data into actionable insights and strategic recommendations. Masters modern analytics platforms, predictive modeling, and data storytelling to drive business growth and optimize operational efficiency. Combines technical proficiency with business acumen to deliver comprehensive analysis that influences executive decision-making.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n### Modern Analytics Platforms and Tools\n\n- Advanced dashboard creation with Tableau, Power BI, Looker, and Qlik Sense\n- Cloud-native analytics with Snowflake, BigQuery, and Databricks\n- Real-time analytics and streaming data visualization\n- Self-service BI implementation and user adoption strategies\n- Custom analytics solutions with Python, R, and SQL\n- Mobile-responsive dashboard design and optimization\n- Automated report generation and distribution systems\n\n### AI-Powered Business Intelligence\n\n- Machine learning for predictive analytics and forecasting\n- Natural language processing for sentiment and text analysis\n- AI-driven anomaly detection and alerting systems\n- Automated insight generation and narrative reporting\n- Predictive modeling for customer behavior and market trends\n- Computer vision for image and video analytics\n- Recommendation engines for business optimization\n\n### Strategic KPI Framework Development\n\n- Comprehensive KPI strategy design and implementation\n- North Star metrics identification and tracking\n- OKR (Objectives and Key Results) framework development\n- Balanced scorecard implementation and management\n- Performance measurement system design\n- Metric hierarchy and dependency mapping\n- KPI benchmarking against industry standards\n\n### Financial Analysis and Modeling\n\n- Advanced revenue modeling and forecasting techniques\n- Customer lifetime value (CLV) and acquisition cost (CAC) optimization\n- Cohort analysis and retention modeling\n- Unit economics analysis and profitability modeling\n- Scenario planning and sensitivity analysis\n- Financial planning and analysis (FP&A) automation\n- Investment analysis and ROI calculations\n\n### Customer and Market Analytics\n\n- Customer segmentation and persona development\n- Churn prediction and prevention strategies\n- Market sizing and total addressable market (TAM) analysis\n- Competitive intelligence and market positioning\n- Product-market fit analysis and validation\n- Customer journey mapping and funnel optimization\n- Voice of customer (VoC) analysis and insights\n\n### Data Visualization and Storytelling\n\n- Advanced data visualization techniques and best practices\n- Interactive dashboard design and user experience optimization\n- Executive presentation design and narrative development\n- Data storytelling frameworks and methodologies\n- Visual analytics for pattern recognition and insight discovery\n- Color theory and design principles for business audiences\n- Accessibility standards for inclusive data visualization\n\n### Statistical Analysis and Research\n\n- Advanced statistical analysis and hypothesis testing\n- A/B testing design, execution, and analysis\n- Survey design and market research methodologies\n- Experimental design and causal inference\n- Time series analysis and forecasting\n- Multivariate analysis and dimensionality reduction\n- Statistical modeling for business applications\n\n### Data Management and Quality\n\n- Data governance frameworks and implementation\n- Data quality assessment and improvement strategies\n- Master data management and data integration\n- Data warehouse design and dimensional modeling\n- ETL/ELT process design and optimization\n- Data lineage and impact analysis\n- Privacy and compliance considerations (GDPR, CCPA)\n\n### Business Process Optimization\n\n- Process mining and workflow analysis\n- Operational efficiency measurement and improvement\n- Supply chain analytics and optimization\n- Resource allocation and capacity planning\n- Performance monitoring and alerting systems\n- Automation opportunity identification and assessment\n- Change management for analytics initiatives\n\n### Industry-Specific Analytics\n\n- E-commerce and retail analytics (conversion, merchandising)\n- SaaS metrics and subscription business analysis\n- Healthcare analytics and population health insights\n- Financial services risk and compliance analytics\n- Manufacturing and IoT sensor data analysis\n- Marketing attribution and campaign effectiveness\n- Human resources analytics and workforce planning\n\n## Behavioral Traits\n\n- Focuses on business impact and actionable recommendations\n- Translates complex technical concepts for non-technical stakeholders\n- Maintains objectivity while providing strategic guidance\n- Validates assumptions through data-driven testing\n- Communicates insights through compelling visual narratives\n- Balances detail with executive-level summarization\n- Considers ethical implications of data use and analysis\n- Stays current with industry trends and best practices\n- Collaborates effectively across functional teams\n- Questions data quality and methodology rigorously\n\n## Knowledge Base\n\n- Modern BI and analytics platform ecosystems\n- Statistical analysis and machine learning techniques\n- Data visualization theory and design principles\n- Financial modeling and business valuation methods\n- Industry benchmarks and performance standards\n- Data governance and quality management practices\n- Cloud analytics platforms and data warehousing\n- Agile analytics and continuous improvement methodologies\n- Privacy regulations and ethical data use guidelines\n- Business strategy frameworks and analytical approaches\n\n## Response Approach\n\n1. **Define business objectives** and success criteria clearly\n2. **Assess data availability** and quality for analysis\n3. **Design analytical framework** with appropriate methodologies\n4. **Execute comprehensive analysis** with statistical rigor\n5. **Create compelling visualizations** that tell the data story\n6. **Develop actionable recommendations** with implementation guidance\n7. **Present insights effectively** to target audiences\n8. **Plan for ongoing monitoring** and continuous improvement\n\n## Example Interactions\n\n- \"Analyze our customer churn patterns and create a predictive model to identify at-risk customers\"\n- \"Build a comprehensive revenue dashboard with drill-down capabilities and automated alerts\"\n- \"Design an A/B testing framework for our product feature releases\"\n- \"Create a market sizing analysis for our new product line with TAM/SAM/SOM breakdown\"\n- \"Develop a cohort-based LTV model and optimize our customer acquisition strategy\"\n- \"Build an executive dashboard showing key business metrics with trend analysis\"\n- \"Analyze our sales funnel performance and identify optimization opportunities\"\n- \"Create a competitive intelligence framework with automated data collection\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:58:23.609Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Corporate Agents requiring advanced business analysis and workflow optimization capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高级商业分析和工作流优化能力的企业代理。","ja":"高度なビジネス分析およびワークフロー最適化機能を必要とする企業エージェントに適しています。","ko":"고급 비즈니스 분석 및 워크플로 최적화 기능이 필요한 기업 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes corporativos que requieren capacidades de análisis de negocios avanzadas y optimización de flujos de trabajo.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''entreprise nécessitant des capacités d''analyse commerciale avancées et d''optimisation des flux de travail.","de":"Ideal für Unternehmensagenten, die erweiterte Geschäftsanalyse- und Workflow-Optimierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Corporativos que exigem análise de negócios avançada e capacidades de otimização de fluxo de trabalho.","ru":"Идеально подходит для корпоративных агентов, требующих продвинутого бизнес-анализа и возможностей оптимизации рабочих процессов.","ar":"مثالي لوسائل الإعلام التجارية التي تتطلب تحليلًا تجاريًا متقدمًا وقدرات تحسين سير العمل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to apply best practices, validate outcomes, and provide actionable steps for business analyst tasks, leveraging guidance and checklists for optimized workflows and decision-making, utilizing relevant frameworks and protocols.","zh":"赋予代理商应用最佳实践、验证结果并为商业分析师任务提供可执行步骤的能力，利用指导和检查清单优化工作流和决策，利用相关框架和协议。","ja":"エージェントにベストプラクティスを適用し、結果を検証し、ビジネスアナリストのタスクにアクション可能なステップを提供する能力を与え、ワークフローと意思決定を最適化するためのガイダンスとチェックリストを利用し、関連するフレームワークとプロトコルを利用する。","ko":"에이전트가 최고의 관행을 적용하고 결과를 검증하며 비즈니스 분석师 태스크에 대한 실행 가능한 단계를 제공할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 워크플로와 의사 결정을 최적화하기 위한 지침과 체크리스트를 활용하고 관련 프레임워크와 프로토콜을 활용한다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar las mejores prácticas, validar los resultados y proporcionar pasos de acción para tareas de análisis de negocios, aprovechando la orientación y las listas de verificación para flujos de trabajo y toma de decisiones optimizados, utilizando marcos y protocolos relevantes.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer les meilleures pratiques, de valider les résultats et de fournir des étapes d''action pour les tâches d''analyse commerciale, en exploitant les conseils et les listes de contrôle pour des flux de travail et une prise de décision optimisés, en utilisant des cadres et des protocoles pertinents.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, bewährte Methoden anzuwenden, Ergebnisse zu validieren und aktionable Schritte für Geschäftsanalystenaufgaben bereitzustellen, indem sie Anleitungen und Checklisten für optimierte Workflows und Entscheidungsfindung nutzen und dabei relevante Rahmenbedingungen und Protokolle verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aplicar as melhores práticas, validar resultados e fornecer etapas realizáveis para tarefas de analista de negócios, utilizando orientação e listas de verificação para fluxos de trabalho e tomada de decisões otimizados, utilizando estruturas e protocolos relevantes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью применять лучшие практики, проверять результаты и предоставлять действенные шаги для задач бизнес-аналитика, используя руководство и контрольные списки для оптимизированных рабочих процессов и принятия решений, используя соответствующие рамки и протоколы.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تطبيق أفضل الممارسات و التحقق من النتائج وتقديم خطوات قابلة للتنفيذ لمهام محلل الأعمال، باستخدام الإرشادات وقوائم التحقق لتحسين سير العمل و اتخاذ القرارات، باستخدام الأطر والبروتوكولات ذات الصلة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating business analyst workflows","Generating checklists for project management","Validating business outcomes against goals and constraints"],"zh":["自动化商业分析工作流","为项目管理生成检查清单","验证商业结果是否符合目标和约束"],"ja":["ビジネスアナリストのワークフローを自動化する","プロジェクト管理のためのチェックリストを生成する","ビジネスの結果を目標と制約に対して検証する"],"ko":["비즈니스 분석 워크플ロー 자동화","프로젝트 관리를 위한 체크리스트 생성","비즈니스 결과를 목표 및 제약조건과 비교하여 검증"],"es":["Automatizar flujos de trabajo de análisis de negocios","Generar listas de verificación para la gestión de proyectos","Validar resultados de negocios frente a objetivos y restricciones"],"fr":["Automatiser les flux de travail d''analyse commerciale","Générer des listes de contrôle pour la gestion de projet","Valider les résultats commerciaux par rapport aux objectifs et aux contraintes"],"de":["Automatisierung von Geschäftsanalyse-Workflows","Erstellung von Checklisten für Projektmanagement","Validierung von Geschäftsergebnissen im Vergleich zu Zielen und Einschränkungen"],"pt":["Automatizar fluxos de trabalho de analista de negócios","Gerar listas de verificação para gerenciamento de projetos","Validar resultados de negócios contra metas e restrições"],"ru":["Автоматизация рабочих процессов бизнес-аналитика","Генерация контрольных списков для управления проектами","Проверка результатов бизнеса на соответствие целям и ограничениям"],"ar":["أتمتة سير عمل محلل الأعمال","توليد قوائم التحقق لإدارة المشاريع","تحقق من نتائج الأعمال مقابل الأهداف والقيود"]},"limitations":{"en":["Task must be related to business analyst domain","Requires clear goals, constraints, and inputs for effective application"],"zh":["任务必须与商业分析师领域相关","需要明确的目标、约束和输入才能有效应用"],"ja":["タスクはビジネスアナリストのドメインに関連している必要がある","有効な適用には明確な目標、制約、入力が必要である"],"ko":["태스크는 비즈니스 분석師 도메인과 관련되어야 함","유효한 적용을 위해서는 명확한 목표, 제약 및 입력이 필요"],"es":["La tarea debe estar relacionada con el dominio del análisis de negocios","Requiere objetivos, restricciones e insumos claros para una aplicación efectiva"],"fr":["La tâche doit être liée au domaine de l''analyse commerciale","Nécessite des objectifs, des contraintes et des entrées claires pour une application efficace"],"de":["Die Aufgabe muss mit dem Bereich der Geschäftsanalyse zusammenhängen","Benötigt klare Ziele, Einschränkungen und Eingaben für eine wirksame Anwendung"],"pt":["A tarefa deve estar relacionada ao domínio do analista de negócios","Exige metas, restrições e entradas claras para aplicação eficaz"],"ru":["Задача должна быть связана с доменом бизнес-аналитика","Требует четких целей, ограничений и входных данных для эффективного применения"],"ar":["يجب أن تكون المهمة ذات صلة بنطاق محلل الأعمال","يتطلب أهدافًا وقيودًا ومدخلات واضحة للتطبيق الفعال"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('fierzone/agent-skills-standard/Flutter Notifications', 'community', 'fierzone', 'agent-skills-standard', 'fierzone/agent-skills-standard', 'Flutter Notifications', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.427Z', '2026-02-18T04:57:35.883Z', NULL, '{"id":"fierzone/agent-skills-standard/Flutter Notifications","name":"Flutter Notifications","description":{"zh":"Flutter, Firebase Messaging ","ja":"Flutter, Firebase Messaging ","ko":"Flutter, Firebase Messaging ","es":"Notificaciones Flutter es una guía técnica para implementar notificaciones push y locales en aplicaciones Flutter","fr":"Notifications Flutter est un guide technique pour implémenter les notifications push et locales dans les applications Flutter","de":"Flutter-Benachrichtigungen ist eine technische Anleitung zur Implementierung von Push- und Lokalbenachrichtigungen in Flutter-Anwendungen","pt":"O guia de notificações Flutter aborda a implementação de notificações push e locais com firebase_messaging e flutter_local_notifications.","ru":"Руководство по уведомлениям Flutter охватывает реализацию push- и локальных уведомлений с помощью firebase_messaging и flutter_local_notifications.","ar":"دليل إشعارات Flutter يغطي تنفيذ الإشعارات الدفعية والمحلية باستخدام firebase_messaging و flutter_local_notifications.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Flutter ","ja":"Flutter","ko":"Flutter ","es":"Notificaciones Flutter: Guía Técnica","fr":"Notifications Flutter: Guide Technique","de":"Flutter-Benachrichtigungen: Technische Anleitung","pt":"Notificações Flutter: Guia de Implementação","ru":"Уведомления Flutter: Руководство по реализации","ar":"إشعارات Flutter: دليل التنفيذ","en":"Flutter Notifications"},"description":{"zh":"Flutter, Firebase Messaging ","ja":"Flutter, Firebase Messaging ","ko":"Flutter, Firebase Messaging ","es":"Notificaciones Flutter es una guía técnica para implementar notificaciones push y locales en aplicaciones Flutter","fr":"Notifications Flutter est un guide technique pour implémenter les notifications push et locales dans les applications Flutter","de":"Flutter-Benachrichtigungen ist eine technische Anleitung zur Implementierung von Push- und Lokalbenachrichtigungen in Flutter-Anwendungen","pt":"O guia de notificações Flutter aborda a implementação de notificações push e locais com firebase_messaging e flutter_local_notifications.","ru":"Руководство по уведомлениям Flutter охватывает реализацию push- и локальных уведомлений с помощью firebase_messaging и flutter_local_notifications.","ar":"دليل إشعارات Flutter يغطي تنفيذ الإشعارات الدفعية والمحلية باستخدام firebase_messaging و flutter_local_notifications.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Flutter Firebase Messaging","Flutter ","Flutter ","Flutter ","Flutter "],"ja":["Flutter Firebase Messaging","Flutter ","Flutter ","Flutter ","Flutter "],"ko":["Flutter Firebase Messaging","Flutter ","Flutter ","Flutter ","Flutter "],"es":["Implementación de notificaciones push con firebase_messaging","Implementación de notificaciones locales con flutter_local_notifications","Manejo de los tres estados de la aplicación: foreground, background y terminado","Solicitud de permisos personalizados para notificaciones","Validación estricta de los datos de carga de notificaciones"],"fr":["Implémentation de notifications push avec firebase_messaging","Implémentation de notifications locales avec flutter_local_notifications","Gestion des trois états de l''application : foreground, background et terminé","Demande de permissions personnalisées pour les notifications","Validation stricte des données de charge de notifications"],"de":["Implementierung von Push-Benachrichtigungen mit firebase_messaging","Implementierung von Lokalbenachrichtigungen mit flutter_local_notifications","Verwaltung der drei Zustände der Anwendung: foreground, background und beendet","Anfrage von benutzerdefinierten Berechtigungen für Benachrichtigungen","Streng validieren der Nutzlast-Daten von Benachrichtigungen"],"pt":["Implementação de notificações push com firebase_messaging","Implementação de notificações locais com flutter_local_notifications","Manipulação de estados de foreground, background e terminado","Permissões personalizadas para notificações","Navegação segura com validação de payload","Suporte a badges"],"ru":["Реализация push-уведомлений с помощью firebase_messaging","Реализация локальных уведомлений с помощью flutter_local_notifications","Обработка состояний foreground, background и завершения","Пользовательские разрешения для уведомлений","Безопасная навигация с проверкой payload","Поддержка значков"],"ar":["تنفيذ الإشعارات الدفعية باستخدام firebase_messaging","تنفيذ الإشعارات المحلية باستخدام flutter_local_notifications","معالجة الحالات الأمامية والخلفية والإنهاء","أذونات مخصصة للإشعارات","تنقل آمن مع التحقق من payload","دعم الشعارات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Flutter","Flutter ","Flutter Firebase Messaging","Flutter ","Flutter ","Flutter "],"ja":["Flutter","Flutter ","Flutter Firebase Messaging","Flutter ","Flutter ","Flutter "],"ko":["Flutter","Flutter ","Flutter Firebase Messaging","Flutter ","Flutter ","Flutter "],"es":["notificaciones flutter","notificaciones push","notificaciones locales","firebase_messaging","flutter_local_notifications","desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles","programación en dart","notificaciones en flutter"],"fr":["notifications flutter","notifications push","notifications locales","firebase_messaging","flutter_local_notifications","développement d''applications mobiles","programmation en dart","notifications dans flutter"],"de":["flutter-benachrichtigungen","push-benachrichtigungen","lokalbenachrichtigungen","firebase_messaging","flutter_local_notifications","entwicklung von mobilen anwendungen","programmierung in dart","benachrichtigungen in flutter"],"pt":["notificações flutter","notificações push","notificações locais","firebase_messaging","flutter_local_notifications","desenvolvimento de aplicativos móveis"],"ru":["уведомления flutter","push-уведомления","локальные уведомления","firebase_messaging","flutter_local_notifications","разработка мобильных приложений"],"ar":["إشعارات flutter","إشعارات دفعية","إشعارات محلية","firebase_messaging","flutter_local_notifications","تطوير تطبيقات الجوال"]}},"owner":"fierzone","repo":"agent-skills-standard","repoPath":"fierzone/agent-skills-standard","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.427Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Flutter Notifications","description":"Push notifications and local notifications for Flutter using Firebase Cloud Messaging and flutter_local_notifications.","bodyPreview":"# Flutter Notifications\n\n## **Priority: P1 (OPERATIONAL)**\n\nPush and local notifications interactions.\n\n## Guidelines\n\n- **Stack**: Use `firebase_messaging` (Push) + `flutter_local_notifications` (Local/Foreground).\n- **Lifecycle**: Handle all 3 states explicitly: Foreground, Background, Terminated.\n- **Permissions**: Prime users with a custom dialog explaining benefits _before_ system request.\n- **Navigation**: Validate notification payload data strictly before navigating.\n- **Badges**: Manuall","body":"# Flutter Notifications\n\n## **Priority: P1 (OPERATIONAL)**\n\nPush and local notifications interactions.\n\n## Guidelines\n\n- **Stack**: Use `firebase_messaging` (Push) + `flutter_local_notifications` (Local/Foreground).\n- **Lifecycle**: Handle all 3 states explicitly: Foreground, Background, Terminated.\n- **Permissions**: Prime users with a custom dialog explaining benefits _before_ system request.\n- **Navigation**: Validate notification payload data strictly before navigating.\n- **Badges**: Manually clear iOS app badges when visiting relevant screens.\n\n[Implementation Details](references/implementation.md)\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n- **No Unconditional Permission**: Don''t ask on startup without context.\n- **No Missing State Handlers**: Forgetting `getInitialMessage()` breaks \"open from terminated\".\n- **No Forgotten Badge Clear**: Leaving notifications un-cleared frustrates users.\n- **No Direct Navigation**: Parsing JSON payloads without validation leads to crashes.\n\n## Related Topics\n\nflutter-navigation | mobile-ux-core | firebase/fcm\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:57:35.883Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Mobile Agents requiring seamless integration of push and local notifications using firebase_messaging and flutter_local_notifications.","zh":"适用于需要无缝集成推送和本地通知的移动代理，使用firebase_messaging和flutter_local_notifications。","ja":"Firebase_messagingとflutter_local_notificationsを使用したプッシュ通知とローカル通知のシームレスな統合を必要とするモバイルエージェントに適しています。","ko":"푸시 및 로컬 알림의 무결한 통합이 필요한 모바일 에이전트에게 적합하며, firebase_messaging과 flutter_local_notifications를 사용합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes móviles que requieren una integración sin problemas de notificaciones push y locales usando firebase_messaging y flutter_local_notifications.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents mobiles nécessitant une intégration transparente des notifications push et locales à l''aide de firebase_messaging et flutter_local_notifications.","de":"Ideal für Mobile Agents, die eine nahtlose Integration von Push- und lokalen Benachrichtigungen unter Verwendung von firebase_messaging und flutter_local_notifications erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Móveis que requerem integração sem interrupções de notificações push e locais usando firebase_messaging e flutter_local_notifications.","ru":"Идеально для мобильных агентов, требующих бесшовной интеграции push-уведомлений и локальных уведомлений с использованием firebase_messaging и flutter_local_notifications.","ar":"مثالي لعميل移動 يحتاج إلى إدماج متواصل للتقارير الضغطية والمحلية باستخدام firebase_messaging و flutter_local_notifications."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to handle notification interactions across foreground, background, and terminated states, utilizing firebase_messaging for push notifications and flutter_local_notifications for local and foreground notifications, while also managing permissions and navigation with strict payload validation.","zh":"赋予代理处理前台、后台和终止状态的通知交互的能力，利用firebase_messaging进行推送通知，利用flutter_local_notifications进行本地和前台通知，同时也管理权限和导航，具有严格的有效负载验证。","ja":"フォアグラウンド、バックグラウンド、終了状態での通知の相互作用を処理するエージェントの能力を提供します。Firebase_messagingを使用してプッシュ通知を行い、flutter_local_notificationsを使用してローカルおよびフォアグラウンドの通知を行い、さらに厳格なペイロードの検証を伴う権限とナビゲーションの管理を行います。","ko":"전면, 背面 및 종료 상태에서의 알림 상호 작용을 처리할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 제공하며, 푸시 알림은 firebase_messaging을 사용하고, 로컬 및 전면 알림은 flutter_local_notifications을 사용하며, 또한 엄格한有效载荷 검증을 수반하는 권한 및 탐색 관리를 수행합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes controlar las interacciones de notificación en los estados de primer plano, segundo plano y terminado, utilizando firebase_messaging para notificaciones push y flutter_local_notifications para notificaciones locales y de primer plano, mientras también gestiona permisos y navegación con una validación estricta de payloads.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les interactions de notification à travers les états avant-plan, arrière-plan et terminé, en utilisant firebase_messaging pour les notifications push et flutter_local_notifications pour les notifications locales et d''avant-plan, tout en gérant les autorisations et la navigation avec une validation stricte des charges utiles.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Benachrichtigungsinteraktionen über Vordergrund-, Hintergrund- und beendete Zustände hinweg zu handhaben, indem sie firebase_messaging für Push-Benachrichtigungen und flutter_local_notifications für lokale und Vordergrundbenachrichtigungen verwenden, während sie auch Berechtigungen und Navigation mit einer strengen Payload-Validierung verwalten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a lidar com interações de notificação em estados de primeiro plano, segundo plano e terminados, utilizando firebase_messaging para notificações push e flutter_local_notifications para notificações locais e de primeiro plano, além de gerenciar permissões e navegação com validação estrita de carga útil.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обрабатывать взаимодействия с уведомлениями в состояниях переднего плана, фона и завершения, используя firebase_messaging для push-уведомлений и flutter_local_notifications для локальных и передних уведомлений, а также управляет разрешениями и навигацией с строгой проверкой полезной нагрузки.","ar":"يُمنح الوكيل القدرة على التعامل مع تفاعلات الإشعارات عبر الحالات الأمامية والخلفية والإنهاء، باستخدام firebase_messaging للإشعارات الضغطية وإشعارات flutter_local_notifications المحلية والأمامية، بالإضافة إلى إدارة الأذونات والملاحة مع التحقق الصارم من حمولة البيانات."},"useCases":{"en":["Handling push notifications with firebase_messaging","Displaying local and foreground notifications using flutter_local_notifications","Implementing custom permission dialogs for user priming","Validating notification payload data for secure navigation"],"zh":["处理使用firebase_messaging的推送通知","使用flutter_local_notifications显示本地和前台通知","实现自定义权限对话框用于用户预设","验证通知有效负载数据以实现安全导航"],"ja":["Firebase_messagingを使用したプッシュ通知の処理","Flutter_local_notificationsを使用したローカルおよびフォアグラウンド通知の表示","カスタムの権限ダイアログの実装によるユーザーの事前準備","通知ペイロードデータの検証による安全なナビゲーション"],"ko":["Firebase_messaging을 사용한 푸시 알림 처리","Flutter_local_notifications을 사용한 로컬 및 전면 알림 표시","사용자 예비 설정을 위한 사용자 정의 권한 대화 상자의 구현","알림有效载荷 데이터의 검증을 통한 안전한 탐색"],"es":["Controlar notificaciones push con firebase_messaging","Mostrar notificaciones locales y de primer plano usando flutter_local_notifications","Implementar diálogos de permisos personalizados para la preparación del usuario","Validar datos de carga de notificación para una navegación segura"],"fr":["Gérer les notifications push avec firebase_messaging","Afficher les notifications locales et d''avant-plan en utilisant flutter_local_notifications","Mettre en œuvre des boîtes de dialogue de permissions personnalisées pour la préparation de l''utilisateur","Valider les données de charge de notification pour une navigation sécurisée"],"de":["Push-Benachrichtigungen mit firebase_messaging handhaben","Lokale und Vordergrundbenachrichtigungen mithilfe von flutter_local_notifications anzeigen","Benutzerdefinierte Berechtigungsdialoge für die Vorbereitung des Benutzers implementieren","Benachrichtigungspayload-Daten für eine sichere Navigation validieren"],"pt":["Manipulação de notificações push com firebase_messaging","Exibição de notificações locais e de primeiro plano usando flutter_local_notifications","Implementação de diálogos de permissão personalizados para preparação do usuário","Validação de dados de carga útil de notificação para navegação segura"],"ru":["Обработка push-уведомлений с помощью firebase_messaging","Отображение локальных и передних уведомлений с помощью flutter_local_notifications","Реализация пользовательских диалогов разрешений для подготовки пользователя","Проверка данных полезной нагрузки уведомления для безопасной навигации"],"ar":["تعامل الإشعارات الضغطية باستخدام firebase_messaging","عرض الإشعارات المحلية والأمامية باستخدام إشعارات flutter_local_notifications","تنفيذ حوارات أذونات مخصصة لتحضير المستخدم","التحقق من بيانات حمولة الإشعار للأمان الملاحي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires firebase_messaging and flutter_local_notifications setup","Needs manual handling of notification badges","Explicitly requires handling of all three app states: Foreground, Background, Terminated"],"zh":["需要设置firebase_messaging和flutter_local_notifications","需要手动处理通知徽章","显式地需要处理所有三个应用程序状态：前台、后台、终止"],"ja":["Firebase_messagingとflutter_local_notificationsの設定が必要","通知バッジの手動処理が必要","明示的にすべての3つのアプリケーション状態（フォアグラウンド、バックグラウンド、終了）を処理する必要がある"],"ko":["Firebase_messaging과 flutter_local_notifications 설정이 필요합니다","알림 배지에 대한 수동 처리가 필요합니다","명시적으로 모든 3가지 애플리케이션 상태(전면, 背面, 종료)를 처리해야 합니다"],"es":["Requiere la configuración de firebase_messaging y flutter_local_notifications","Necesita un manejo manual de los distintivos de notificación","Requiere explícitamente el manejo de los tres estados de la aplicación: Primer plano, Segundo plano, Terminado"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration de firebase_messaging et flutter_local_notifications","Nécessite une gestion manuelle des badges de notification","Nécessite explicitement la gestion des trois états de l''application : avant-plan, arrière-plan, terminé"],"de":["Benötigt die Einrichtung von firebase_messaging und flutter_local_notifications","Benötigt eine manuelle Handhabung der Benachrichtigungssymbole","Benötigt explizit die Handhabung aller drei App-Zustände: Vordergrund, Hintergrund, Beendet"],"pt":["Requer configuração de firebase_messaging e flutter_local_notifications","Necessita de manipulação manual de ícones de notificação","Requer explicitamente o tratamento de todos os três estados do aplicativo: Primeiro plano, Segundo plano, Terminado"],"ru":["Требует настройки firebase_messaging и flutter_local_notifications","Требует ручного xử lý значков уведомлений","Явно требует обработки всех трех состояний приложения: Передний план, Фон, Завершение"],"ar":["يتطلب إعدادًا لـ firebase_messaging و إشعارات flutter_local_notifications","يحتاج إلى التعامل اليدوي مع رموز الإشعارات","يتطلب صراحةً التعامل مع جميع ثلاثة حالات التطبيق: الأمامي، الخلفي، الإنهاء"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
