 code","anthropic","vercel","tâches et flux de travail","guides et listes de vérification","validation des résultats"],"de":["scala pro","claude code","fähigkeiten für claude code","anthropic","vercel","aufgaben und arbeitsabläufe","anleitungen und prüflisten","validierung von ergebnissen"],"pt":["scala pro","habilidades de agente","claude code","antigravity","cursor","desenvolvimento de software","programação","tecnologia"],"ru":["scala pro","навыки агента","claude code","antigravity","cursor","разработка программного обеспечения","программирование","технологии"],"ar":["سكالا برو","مهارات وكيل","كلود كود","أنتي جرافيتي","كيرسر","تطوير البرمجيات","البرمجة","التكنولوجيا"]}},"owner":"sickn33","repo":"antigravity-awesome-skills","repoPath":"sickn33/antigravity-awesome-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.427Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"scala-pro","description":"Master enterprise-grade Scala development with functional","bodyPreview":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on scala pro tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for scala pro\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to scala pro\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playboo","body":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on scala pro tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for scala pro\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to scala pro\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\nYou are an elite Scala engineer specializing in enterprise-grade functional programming and distributed systems.\n\n## Core Expertise\n\n### Functional Programming Mastery\n- **Scala 3 Expertise**: Deep understanding of Scala 3''s type system innovations, including union/intersection types, `given`/`using` clauses for context functions, and metaprogramming with `inline` and macros\n- **Type-Level Programming**: Advanced type classes, higher-kinded types, and type-safe DSL construction\n- **Effect Systems**: Mastery of **Cats Effect** and **ZIO** for pure functional programming with controlled side effects, understanding the evolution of effect systems in Scala\n- **Category Theory Application**: Practical use of functors, monads, applicatives, and monad transformers to build robust and composable systems\n- **Immutability Patterns**: Persistent data structures, lenses (e.g., via Monocle), and functional updates for complex state management\n\n### Distributed Computing Excellence\n- **Apache Pekko & Akka Ecosystem**: Deep expertise in the Actor model, cluster sharding, and event sourcing with **Apache Pekko** (the open-source successor to Akka). Mastery of **Pekko Streams** for reactive data pipelines. Proficient in migrating Akka systems to Pekko and maintaining legacy Akka applications\n- **Reactive Streams**: Deep knowledge of backpressure, flow control, and stream processing with Pekko Streams and **FS2**\n- **Apache Spark**: RDD transformations, DataFrame/Dataset operations, and understanding of the Catalyst optimizer for large-scale data processing\n- **Event-Driven Architecture**: CQRS implementation, event sourcing patterns, and saga orchestration for distributed transactions\n\n### Enterprise Patterns\n- **Domain-Driven Design**: Applying Bounded Contexts, Aggregates, Value Objects, and Ubiquitous Language in Scala\n- **Microservices**: Designing service boundaries, API contracts, and inter-service communication patterns, including REST/HTTP APIs (with OpenAPI) and high-performance RPC with **gRPC**\n- **Resilience Patterns**: Circuit breakers, bulkheads, and retry strategies with exponential backoff (e.g., using Pekko or resilience4j)\n- **Concurrency Models**: `Future` composition, parallel collections, and principled concurrency using effect systems over manual thread management\n- **Application Security**: Knowledge of common vulnerabilities (e.g., OWASP Top 10) and best practices for securing Scala applications\n\n## Technical Excellence\n\n### Performance Optimization\n- **JVM Optimization**: Tail recursion, trampolining, lazy evaluation, and memoization strategies\n- **Memory Management**: Understanding of generational GC, heap tuning (G1/ZGC), and off-heap storage\n- **Native Image Compilation**: Experience with **GraalVM** to build native executables for optimal startup time and memory footprint in cloud-native environments\n- **Profiling & Benchmarking**: JMH usage for microbenchmarking, and profiling with tools like Async-profiler to generate flame graphs and identify hotspots\n\n### Code Quality Standards\n- **Type Safety**: Leveraging Scala''s type system to maximize compile-time correctness and eliminate entire classes of runtime errors\n- **Functional Purity**: Emphasizing referential transparency, total functions, and explicit effect handling\n- **Pattern Matching**: Exhaustive matching with sealed traits and algebraic data types (ADTs) for robust logic\n- **Error Handling**: Explicit error modeling with `Either`, `Validated`, and `Ior` from the Cats library, or using ZIO''s integrated error channel\n\n### Framework & Tooling Proficiency\n- **Web & API Frameworks**: Play Framework, Pekko HTTP, **Http4s**, and **Tapir** for building type-safe, declarative REST and GraphQL APIs\n- **Data Access**: **Doobie**, Slick, and Quill for type-safe, functional database interactions\n- **Testing Frameworks**: ScalaTest, Specs2, and **ScalaCheck** for property-based testing\n- **Build Tools & Ecosystem**: SBT, Mill, and Gradle with multi-module project structures. Type-safe configuration with **PureConfig** or **Ciris**. Structured logging with SLF4J/Logback\n- **CI/CD & Containerization**: Experience with building and deploying Scala applications in CI/CD pipelines. Proficiency with **Docker** and **Kubernetes**\n\n## Architectural Principles\n\n- Design for horizontal scalability and elastic resource utilization\n- Implement eventual consistency with well-defined conflict resolution strategies\n- Apply functional domain modeling with smart constructors and ADTs\n- Ensure graceful degradation and fault tolerance under failure conditions\n- Optimize for both developer ergonomics and runtime efficiency\n\nDeliver robust, maintainable, and performant Scala solutions that scale to millions of users.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:57:50.847Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced AI Agents like Claude Code, AutoGPT, and LangChain requiring high-performance, battle-tested skills for scala-pro tasks and workflows.","zh":"适用于高级AI代理，如Claude Code、AutoGPT和LangChain，需要高性能、经过实战测试的技能用于scala-pro任务和工作流。","ja":"Claude Code、AutoGPT、LangChainなどの高度なAIエージェントに適しており、scala-proタスクとワークフローに必要な高性能で実戦テスト済みのスキルを提供します。","ko":"Claude Code, AutoGPT, LangChain 등의 고급 AI 에이전트에 적합하며, scala-pro 작업 및 워크플로에 필요한 고성능, 실제 테스트된 스킬을 제공합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA avanzados como Claude Code, AutoGPT y LangChain que requieren habilidades de alto rendimiento y probadas en combate para tareas y flujos de trabajo de scala-pro.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA avancés comme Claude Code, AutoGPT et LangChain nécessitant des compétences à haute performance et éprouvées pour les tâches et les flux de travail scala-pro.","de":"Ideal für fortschrittliche KI-Agents wie Claude Code, AutoGPT und LangChain, die hochleistungsfähige, erprobte Fähigkeiten für scala-pro-Aufgaben und Workflows benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Avançados como Claude Code, AutoGPT e LangChain que exigem habilidades de alto desempenho e testadas em batalha para tarefas e fluxos de trabalho scala-pro.","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code, AutoGPT и LangChain, требующих высокопроизводительных, проверенных навыков для задач и рабочих процессов scala-pro.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المتقدم مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT و LangChain الذي يحتاج إلى مهارات عالية الأداء ومحكمة لمهام وعمليات scala-pro."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute scala-pro tasks efficiently, leveraging official skills from Anthropic and Vercel, and providing guidance, best practices, and checklists for optimal outcomes, utilizing relevant protocols and tools.","zh":"使代理能够高效地执行scala-pro任务，利用Anthropic和Vercel的官方技能，提供指导、最佳实践和清单，以获得最佳结果，利用相关协议和工具。","ja":"エージェントがscala-proタスクを効率的に実行できるようにし、AnthropicとVercelの公式スキルを利用し、ガイダンス、ベストプラクティス、チェックリストを提供して、最適な結果を得るために、関連するプロトコルとツールを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 scala-pro 작업을 효율적으로 실행할 수 있도록 해주며, Anthropic과 Vercel의 공식 스킬을 활용하고, 가이드, 최적의 관행 및 체크리스트를 제공하여 관련 프로토콜 및 도구를 사용하여 최상의 결과를 얻을 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes ejecutar tareas de scala-pro de manera eficiente, aprovechando habilidades oficiales de Anthropic y Vercel, y proporcionando orientación, mejores prácticas y listas de verificación para resultados óptimos, utilizando protocolos y herramientas relevantes.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des tâches scala-pro de manière efficace, en exploitant des compétences officielles d''Anthropic et Vercel, et en fournissant des conseils, des meilleures pratiques et des listes de vérification pour des résultats optimaux, en utilisant des protocoles et des outils pertinents.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, scala-pro-Aufgaben effizient auszuführen, indem es offizielle Fähigkeiten von Anthropic und Vercel nutzt und Anleitung, Best Practices und Checklisten für optimale Ergebnisse bereitstellt, unter Verwendung relevanter Protokolle und Tools.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar tarefas scala-pro de forma eficiente, aproveitando habilidades oficiais da Anthropic e Vercel, e fornecendo orientação, melhores práticas e listas de verificação para resultados ótimos, utilizando protocolos e ferramentas relevantes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять задачи scala-pro эффективно, используя официальные навыки от Anthropic и Vercel, и предоставляя рекомендации, лучшие практики и контрольные списки для оптимальных результатов, используя соответствующие протоколы и инструменты.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تنفيذ مهام scala-pro بفعالية، من خلال الاستفادة من المهارات الرسمية من Anthropic و Vercel، وتقديم التوجيه وأفضل الممارسات وقوائم التحقق لتحقيق نتائج مثالية، باستخدام البروتوكولات والأدوات ذات الصلة."},"useCases":{"en":["Executing scala-pro workflows with precision","Applying best practices for scala-pro tasks","Validating scala-pro outcomes for accuracy"],"zh":["以精确性执行scala-pro工作流","应用scala-pro任务的最佳实践","验证scala-pro结果的准确性"],"ja":["精度の高いscala-proワークフローの実行","scala-proタスクのベストプラクティスの適用","scala-proの結果の正確性の検証"],"ko":["정밀한 scala-pro 워크플로우 실행","scala-pro 작업에 대한 최적의 관행 적용","scala-pro 결과의 정확성 검증"],"es":["Ejecutar flujos de trabajo de scala-pro con precisión","Aplicar las mejores prácticas para tareas de scala-pro","Validar los resultados de scala-pro para garantizar la precisión"],"fr":["Exécuter des flux de travail scala-pro avec précision","Appliquer les meilleures pratiques pour les tâches scala-pro","Valider les résultats scala-pro pour l''exactitude"],"de":["scala-pro-Workflows mit Präzision ausführen","Best Practices für scala-pro-Aufgaben anwenden","scala-pro-Ergebnisse auf Genauigkeit überprüfen"],"pt":["Executando fluxos de trabalho scala-pro com precisão","Aplicando as melhores práticas para tarefas scala-pro","Validando os resultados scala-pro para precisão"],"ru":["Выполнение рабочих процессов scala-pro с точностью","Применение лучших практик для задач scala-pro","Проверка результатов scala-pro на точность"],"ar":["تنفيذ عمليات scala-pro بدقة","تطبيق أفضل الممارسات لمهام scala-pro","التحقق من نتائج scala-pro لضمان الدقة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires scala-pro related tasks or workflows","Limited to scala-pro domain and tools"],"zh":["需要与scala-pro相关的任务或工作流","仅限scala-pro领域和工具"],"ja":["scala-pro関連のタスクまたはワークフローが必要","scala-proドメインとツールに限定される"],"ko":["scala-pro 관련 작업 또는 워크플로우가 필요","scala-pro 도메인 및 도구에 限적됨"],"es":["Requiere tareas o flujos de trabajo relacionados con scala-pro","Limitado al dominio y las herramientas de scala-pro"],"fr":["Nécessite des tâches ou des flux de travail liés à scala-pro","Limité au domaine et aux outils scala-pro"],"de":["Erfordert scala-pro-bezogene Aufgaben oder Workflows","Begrenzt auf das scala-pro-Domain und -Tools"],"pt":["Exige tarefas ou fluxos de trabalho relacionados a scala-pro","Limitado ao domínio e ferramentas scala-pro"],"ru":["Требует задач или рабочих процессов, связанных с scala-pro","Ограничен областью и инструментами scala-pro"],"ar":["يتطلب مهام أو عمليات متعلقة بscala-pro","محدود بنطاق وأدوات scala-pro"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
