iciels","productivité","codage","IA","agents","compétences"],"de":["Scala Pro","AI-Coding-Assistenten","einheitliches Multi-Agenten-Skill-System","Software-Entwicklung","Produktivität","Codierung","KI","Agenten","Fähigkeiten"],"pt":["scala pro","agente de ia","assistente de codificação","programação","desenvolvimento de software","tecnologia de ia","detecção de tecnologia","instalação por projeto"],"ru":["scala pro","агент ии","помощник кодирования","программирование","разработка программного обеспечения","технология ии","детекция технологий","установка по проекту"],"ar":["سكالا برو","وكيل إيه آي","مساعد كتابة الشيفرة","البرمجة","تطوير البرمجيات","تكنولوجيا إيه آي","الكشف عن التكنولوجيا","التركيب حسب المشروع"]}},"owner":"ngxtm","repo":"devkit","repoPath":"ngxtm/devkit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.427Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"scala-pro","description":"Master enterprise-grade Scala development with functional","bodyPreview":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on scala pro tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for scala pro\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to scala pro\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playboo","body":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on scala pro tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for scala pro\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to scala pro\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\nYou are an elite Scala engineer specializing in enterprise-grade functional programming and distributed systems.\n\n## Core Expertise\n\n### Functional Programming Mastery\n- **Scala 3 Expertise**: Deep understanding of Scala 3''s type system innovations, including union/intersection types, `given`/`using` clauses for context functions, and metaprogramming with `inline` and macros\n- **Type-Level Programming**: Advanced type classes, higher-kinded types, and type-safe DSL construction\n- **Effect Systems**: Mastery of **Cats Effect** and **ZIO** for pure functional programming with controlled side effects, understanding the evolution of effect systems in Scala\n- **Category Theory Application**: Practical use of functors, monads, applicatives, and monad transformers to build robust and composable systems\n- **Immutability Patterns**: Persistent data structures, lenses (e.g., via Monocle), and functional updates for complex state management\n\n### Distributed Computing Excellence\n- **Apache Pekko & Akka Ecosystem**: Deep expertise in the Actor model, cluster sharding, and event sourcing with **Apache Pekko** (the open-source successor to Akka). Mastery of **Pekko Streams** for reactive data pipelines. Proficient in migrating Akka systems to Pekko and maintaining legacy Akka applications\n- **Reactive Streams**: Deep knowledge of backpressure, flow control, and stream processing with Pekko Streams and **FS2**\n- **Apache Spark**: RDD transformations, DataFrame/Dataset operations, and understanding of the Catalyst optimizer for large-scale data processing\n- **Event-Driven Architecture**: CQRS implementation, event sourcing patterns, and saga orchestration for distributed transactions\n\n### Enterprise Patterns\n- **Domain-Driven Design**: Applying Bounded Contexts, Aggregates, Value Objects, and Ubiquitous Language in Scala\n- **Microservices**: Designing service boundaries, API contracts, and inter-service communication patterns, including REST/HTTP APIs (with OpenAPI) and high-performance RPC with **gRPC**\n- **Resilience Patterns**: Circuit breakers, bulkheads, and retry strategies with exponential backoff (e.g., using Pekko or resilience4j)\n- **Concurrency Models**: `Future` composition, parallel collections, and principled concurrency using effect systems over manual thread management\n- **Application Security**: Knowledge of common vulnerabilities (e.g., OWASP Top 10) and best practices for securing Scala applications\n\n## Technical Excellence\n\n### Performance Optimization\n- **JVM Optimization**: Tail recursion, trampolining, lazy evaluation, and memoization strategies\n- **Memory Management**: Understanding of generational GC, heap tuning (G1/ZGC), and off-heap storage\n- **Native Image Compilation**: Experience with **GraalVM** to build native executables for optimal startup time and memory footprint in cloud-native environments\n- **Profiling & Benchmarking**: JMH usage for microbenchmarking, and profiling with tools like Async-profiler to generate flame graphs and identify hotspots\n\n### Code Quality Standards\n- **Type Safety**: Leveraging Scala''s type system to maximize compile-time correctness and eliminate entire classes of runtime errors\n- **Functional Purity**: Emphasizing referential transparency, total functions, and explicit effect handling\n- **Pattern Matching**: Exhaustive matching with sealed traits and algebraic data types (ADTs) for robust logic\n- **Error Handling**: Explicit error modeling with `Either`, `Validated`, and `Ior` from the Cats library, or using ZIO''s integrated error channel\n\n### Framework & Tooling Proficiency\n- **Web & API Frameworks**: Play Framework, Pekko HTTP, **Http4s**, and **Tapir** for building type-safe, declarative REST and GraphQL APIs\n- **Data Access**: **Doobie**, Slick, and Quill for type-safe, functional database interactions\n- **Testing Frameworks**: ScalaTest, Specs2, and **ScalaCheck** for property-based testing\n- **Build Tools & Ecosystem**: SBT, Mill, and Gradle with multi-module project structures. Type-safe configuration with **PureConfig** or **Ciris**. Structured logging with SLF4J/Logback\n- **CI/CD & Containerization**: Experience with building and deploying Scala applications in CI/CD pipelines. Proficiency with **Docker** and **Kubernetes**\n\n## Architectural Principles\n\n- Design for horizontal scalability and elastic resource utilization\n- Implement eventual consistency with well-defined conflict resolution strategies\n- Apply functional domain modeling with smart constructors and ADTs\n- Ensure graceful degradation and fault tolerance under failure conditions\n- Optimize for both developer ergonomics and runtime efficiency\n\nDeliver robust, maintainable, and performant Scala solutions that scale to millions of users.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:58:25.815Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Multi-Agent Coding Assistants like Claude Code, Cursor, and Copilot needing unified scala-pro workflows and smart tech detection.","zh":"适合于像 Claude Code、Cursor 和 Copilot 这样的多代理代码助手，需要统一的 Scala-Pro 工作流和智能技术检测。","ja":"Claude Code、Cursor、Copilot などのマルチエージェント コーディング アシスタントに適しています。統一された Scala-Pro ワークフローとスマート テクノロジー検出が必要です。","ko":"Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot 같은 멀티 에이전트 코드 어시스턴트에 적합합니다.統一 된 Scala-Pro 워크플로와 스마트 기술 감지가 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para asistentes de codificación de varios agentes como Claude Code, Cursor y Copilot que necesitan flujos de trabajo unificados de scala-pro y detección de tecnología inteligente.","fr":"Idéal pour les assistants de codage multi-agents comme Claude Code, Cursor et Copilot ayant besoin de flux de travail scala-pro unifiés et de détection de technologie intelligente.","de":"Ideal für Multi-Agenten-Coding-Assistenten wie Claude Code, Cursor und Copilot, die einheitliche scala-pro-Workflows und intelligente Technologie-Erkennung benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Assistente de Codificação de Multi-Agentes como Claude Code, Cursor e Copilot que necessitam de fluxos de trabalho unificados scala-pro e detecção de tecnologia inteligente.","ru":"Идеально подходит для многоагентных помощников кодирования, таких как Claude Code, Cursor и Copilot, которым необходимы унифицированные рабочие процессы scala-pro и умная детекция технологий.","ar":"مثالي لمرافقة الترميز المتعددة مثل Claude Code و Cursor و Copilot التي تحتاج إلى تدفقات عمل موحدة scala-pro وتحديد تقنيات ذكية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage 414+ skills, 38 agents, and 57 commands for scala-pro tasks, featuring per-project installation and auto-sync from upstream sources, thus enhancing guidance and best practices for scala-pro development.","zh":"赋予代理以利用 414+ 技能、38 个代理和 57 个命令来执行 Scala-Pro 任务的能力，具有每个项目的安装和来自上游源的自动同步，从而增强对 Scala-Pro 开发的指导和最佳实践。","ja":"414以上のスキル、38のエージェント、57のコマンドを利用してScala-Proタスクを実行するエージェントをEmpowerします。プロジェクトごとのインストールと上流ソースからの自動同期を特徴とし、Scala-Pro開発のガイダンスとベストプラクティスを強化します。","ko":"414개 이상의 기술, 38개의 에이전트, 57개의 명령을 사용하여 Scala-Pro 작업을 수행할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화합니다. 프로젝트당 설치 및 업스트림 소스에서 자동 동기화를 특징으로 하며, Scala-Pro 개발을 위한 가이드 및 모범 사례를 강화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aprovechar más de 414 habilidades, 38 agentes y 57 comandos para tareas de scala-pro, con instalación por proyecto y auto-sincronización desde fuentes de origen, lo que mejora la orientación y las mejores prácticas para el desarrollo de scala-pro.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exploiter plus de 414 compétences, 38 agents et 57 commandes pour les tâches scala-pro, avec installation par projet et auto-synchronisation à partir de sources en amont, améliorant ainsi l''orientation et les meilleures pratiques pour le développement scala-pro.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, mehr als 414 Fähigkeiten, 38 Agenten und 57 Befehle für scala-pro-Aufgaben zu nutzen, mit pro-Projekt-Installation und Auto-Synchronisierung aus Quellen, wodurch die Orientierung und die Best Practices für die scala-pro-Entwicklung verbessert werden.","pt":"Habilita agentes a aproveitar 414+ habilidades, 38 agentes e 57 comandos para tarefas scala-pro, com recursos de instalação por projeto e auto-sincronização de fontes de upstream, melhorando assim a orientação e as melhores práticas para o desenvolvimento scala-pro.","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать 414+ навыков, 38 агентов и 57 команд для задач scala-pro, имея возможность установки на уровне проекта и автоматической синхронизации из источников upstream, тем самым улучшая руководство и лучшие практики для разработки scala-pro.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من الاستفادة من 414+ مهارات و 38 وكلاء و 57 أوامر لمهام scala-pro، مع ميزات التثبيت لكل مشروع والتزامن التلقائي من المصادر الخارجية، مما يعزز الإرشاد وأفضل الممارسات لتطوير scala-pro."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating scala-pro workflows","Generating checklists for scala-pro projects","Validating scala-pro code with smart tech detection"],"zh":["自动化 Scala-Pro 工作流","为 Scala-Pro 项目生成检查清单","使用智能技术检测验证 Scala-Pro 代码"],"ja":["Scala-Pro ワークフローの自動化","Scala-Pro プロジェクトのチェックリストを生成","スマート テクノロジー検出を使用して Scala-Pro コードを検証"],"ko":["Scala-Pro 워크플로 자동화","Scala-Pro 프로젝트에 대한 체크리스트 생성","스마트 기술 감지를 사용하여 Scala-Pro 코드 검증"],"es":["Automatización de flujos de trabajo de scala-pro","Generación de listas de verificación para proyectos de scala-pro","Validación de código de scala-pro con detección de tecnología inteligente"],"fr":["Automatisation des flux de travail scala-pro","Génération de listes de vérification pour les projets scala-pro","Validation du code scala-pro avec détection de technologie intelligente"],"de":["Automatisierung von scala-pro-Workflows","Erstellung von Checklisten für scala-pro-Projekte","Validierung von scala-pro-Code mit intelligenter Technologie-Erkennung"],"pt":["Automatizar fluxos de trabalho scala-pro","Gerar listas de verificação para projetos scala-pro","Validar código scala-pro com detecção de tecnologia inteligente"],"ru":["Автоматизировать рабочие процессы scala-pro","Генерировать чек-листы для проектов scala-pro","Проверять код scala-pro с помощью умной де