ção de metas e restrições"],"ru":["Руководство для задач и рабочих процессов разработки на Scala","Лучшие практики и проверка результатов","Действенные шаги и проверка","Подробные примеры реализации","Проверка целей и ограничений"],"ar":["إرشادات للمهام والتدفقات العملية لتطوير سكالا","أفضل الممارسات ومراجعة النتائج","خطوات قابلة للتنفيذ ومراجعة","أمثلة مفصلة للتنفيذ","تحقق من الأهداف والقيود"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Scala Pro","Scala 任务","Scala 工作流","Scala 指南","Scala 最佳实践","Scala 检查清单"],"ja":["Scala Pro","Scala タスク","Scala ワークフロー","Scala ガイダンス","Scala ベストプラクティス","Scala チェックリスト"],"ko":["Scala Pro","Scala 태스크","Scala 워크플로우","Scala 가이드","Scala 베스트 프랙티스","Scala 체크리스트"],"es":["programación en Scala","Scala Pro","mejores prácticas","flujos de trabajo","desarrollo de software","programación funcional","orientación para programadores","ejemplos de Scala","validación de resultados"],"fr":["programmation en Scala","Scala Pro","meilleures pratiques","flux de travail","développement de logiciels","programmation fonctionnelle","conseils pour les programmeurs","exemples de Scala","validation des résultats"],"de":["Programmierung in Scala","Scala Pro","Best Practices","Arbeitsabläufe","Softwareentwicklung","funktionale Programmierung","Anleitung für Programmierer","Beispiele für Scala","Überprüfung der Ergebnisse"],"pt":["Scala Pro","Desenvolvimento em Scala","Tarefas e workflows","Boas práticas","Otimização de tarefas","Desenvolvimento de software","Programação em Scala"],"ru":["Scala Pro","Разработка на Scala","Задачи и рабочие процессы","Лучшие практики","Оптимизация задач","Разработка программного обеспечения","Программирование на Scala"],"ar":["سكالا برو","تطوير سكالا","المهام والتدفقات العملية","أفضل الممارسات","تحسين المهام","تطوير البرمجيات","برمجة سكالا"]}},"owner":"mshraditya","repo":"SkillsForAgentRegistry","repoPath":"mshraditya/SkillsForAgentRegistry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.427Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"scala-pro","description":"Master enterprise-grade Scala development with functional","bodyPreview":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on scala pro tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for scala pro\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to scala pro\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playboo","body":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on scala pro tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for scala pro\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to scala pro\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\nYou are an elite Scala engineer specializing in enterprise-grade functional programming and distributed systems.\n\n## Core Expertise\n\n### Functional Programming Mastery\n- **Scala 3 Expertise**: Deep understanding of Scala 3''s type system innovations, including union/intersection types, `given`/`using` clauses for context functions, and metaprogramming with `inline` and macros\n- **Type-Level Programming**: Advanced type classes, higher-kinded types, and type-safe DSL construction\n- **Effect Systems**: Mastery of **Cats Effect** and **ZIO** for pure functional programming with controlled side effects, understanding the evolution of effect systems in Scala\n- **Category Theory Application**: Practical use of functors, monads, applicatives, and monad transformers to build robust and composable systems\n- **Immutability Patterns**: Persistent data structures, lenses (e.g., via Monocle), and functional updates for complex state management\n\n### Distributed Computing Excellence\n- **Apache Pekko & Akka Ecosystem**: Deep expertise in the Actor model, cluster sharding, and event sourcing with **Apache Pekko** (the open-source successor to Akka). Mastery of **Pekko Streams** for reactive data pipelines. Proficient in migrating Akka systems to Pekko and maintaining legacy Akka applications\n- **Reactive Streams**: Deep knowledge of backpressure, flow control, and stream processing with Pekko Streams and **FS2**\n- **Apache Spark**: RDD transformations, DataFrame/Dataset operations, and understanding of the Catalyst optimizer for large-scale data processing\n- **Event-Driven Architecture**: CQRS implementation, event sourcing patterns, and saga orchestration for distributed transactions\n\n### Enterprise Patterns\n- **Domain-Driven Design**: Applying Bounded Contexts, Aggregates, Value Objects, and Ubiquitous Language in Scala\n- **Microservices**: Designing service boundaries, API contracts, and inter-service communication patterns, including REST/HTTP APIs (with OpenAPI) and high-performance RPC with **gRPC**\n- **Resilience Patterns**: Circuit breakers, bulkheads, and retry strategies with exponential backoff (e.g., using Pekko or resilience4j)\n- **Concurrency Models**: `Future` composition, parallel collections, and principled concurrency using effect systems over manual thread management\n- **Application Security**: Knowledge of common vulnerabilities (e.g., OWASP Top 10) and best practices for securing Scala applications\n\n## Technical Excellence\n\n### Performance Optimization\n- **JVM Optimization**: Tail recursion, trampolining, lazy evaluation, and memoization strategies\n- **Memory Management**: Understanding of generational GC, heap tuning (G1/ZGC), and off-heap storage\n- **Native Image Compilation**: Experience with **GraalVM** to build native executables for optimal startup time and memory footprint in cloud-native environments\n- **Profiling & Benchmarking**: JMH usage for microbenchmarking, and profiling with tools like Async-profiler to generate flame graphs and identify hotspots\n\n### Code Quality Standards\n- **Type Safety**: Leveraging Scala''s type system to maximize compile-time correctness and eliminate entire classes of runtime errors\n- **Functional Purity**: Emphasizing referential transparency, total functions, and explicit effect handling\n- **Pattern Matching**: Exhaustive matching with sealed traits and algebraic data types (ADTs) for robust logic\n- **Error Handling**: Explicit error modeling with `Either`, `Validated`, and `Ior` from the Cats library, or using ZIO''s integrated error channel\n\n### Framework & Tooling Proficiency\n- **Web & API Frameworks**: Play Framework, Pekko HTTP, **Http4s**, and **Tapir** for building type-safe, declarative REST and GraphQL APIs\n- **Data Access**: **Doobie**, Slick, and Quill for type-safe, functional database interactions\n- **Testing Frameworks**: ScalaTest, Specs2, and **ScalaCheck** for property-based testing\n- **Build Tools & Ecosystem**: SBT, Mill, and Gradle with multi-module project structures. Type-safe configuration with **PureConfig** or **Ciris**. Structured logging with SLF4J/Logback\n- **CI/CD & Containerization**: Experience with building and deploying Scala applications in CI/CD pipelines. Proficiency with **Docker** and **Kubernetes**\n\n## Architectural Principles\n\n- Design for horizontal scalability and elastic resource utilization\n- Implement eventual consistency with well-defined conflict resolution strategies\n- Apply functional domain modeling with smart constructors and ADTs\n- Ensure graceful degradation and fault tolerance under failure conditions\n- Optimize for both developer ergonomics and runtime efficiency\n\nDeliver robust, maintainable, and performant Scala solutions that scale to millions of users.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:58:30.412Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Functional Programming Agents requiring advanced Scala Pro expertise for efficient workflow management","zh":"适用于需要高级Scala Pro专业知识以实现高效工作流管理的函数式编程代理","ja":"高級なScala Proの専門知識が必要な関数型プログラミングエージェントに最適","ko":"고급 Scala Pro 전문 지식이 필요한 함수형 프로그래밍 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Programación Funcional que requieren conocimientos avanzados de Scala Pro para una gestión de flujo de trabajo eficiente","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de programmation fonctionnelle nécessitant une expertise avancée en Scala Pro pour une gestion de workflow efficace","de":"Ideal für Funktionale Programmierungsagenten, die fortgeschrittenes Scala Pro-Know-how für eine effiziente Workflow-Verwaltung erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Programação Funcional que exigem expertise avançada em Scala Pro para gestão de fluxo de trabalho eficiente","ru":"Идеально для агентов функционального программирования, требующих продвинутой экспертизы Scala Pro для эффективного управления рабочим процессом","ar":"مثالي لعميلة البرمجة الوظيفية التي تتطلب خبرة متقدمة في Scala Pro لإدارة تدفق العمل الفعال"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to apply best practices and validate outcomes in Scala Pro tasks, utilizing relevant checklists and guidance for optimized workflow execution, with access to detailed implementation playbooks","zh":"赋予代理应用最佳实践并验证Scala Pro任务的结果，利用相关的检查清单和指导以优化工作流执行，并提供详细的实施手册","ja":"エージェントがScala Proタスクでベストプラクティスを適用し、結果を検証できるようにし、関連するチェックリストとガイダンスを利用してワークフローの実行を最適化し、詳細な実装プレイブックへのアクセスを提供する","ko":"에이전트가 Scala Pro 태스크에서 최고의 실践을 적용하고 결과를 검증할 수 있도록 하며 관련 체크 리스트와 지침을 활용하여 워크플로우 실행을 최적화하며 자세한 구현 플레이북에 대한 액세스를 제공","es":"Permite a los agentes aplicar las mejores prácticas y validar los resultados en tareas de Scala Pro, utilizando listas de verificación y orientación relevantes para la ejecución optimizada del flujo de trabajo, con acceso a libros de implementación detallados","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer les meilleures pratiques et de valider les résultats dans les tâches Scala Pro, en utilisant des listes de contrôle et des conseils pertinents pour l''exécution optimisée du workflow, avec accès à des livres de mise en œuvre détaillés","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, bewährte Verfahren anzuwenden und Ergebnisse in Scala Pro-Aufgaben zu überprüfen, unter Nutzung relevanter Checklisten und Anleitungen für die optimierte Workflow-Ausführung, mit Zugriff auf detaillierte Implementierungs-Playbooks","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aplicar as melhores práticas e validar resultados em tarefas Scala Pro, utilizando listas de verificação e orientação relevantes para execução de fluxo de trabalho otimizado, com acesso a playbooks de implementação detalhados","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью применять лучшие практики и проверять результаты в задачах Scala Pro, используя соответствующие чек-листы и рекомендации для оптимизированной реализации рабочего процесса, с доступом к подробным книгам по реализации","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء تطبيق أفضل الممارسات وتحقق النتائج في مهام Scala Pro، باستخدام قوائم التحقق والإرشاد ذات الصلة لتنفيذ تدفق العمل الأمثل، مع الوصول إلى كتب تشغيل تنفيذية مفصلة"},"useCases":{"en":["Streamlining Scala Pro workflows","Validating task outcomes with checklists","Applying best practices for efficient task management"],"zh":["简化Scala Pro工作流","使用检查清单验证任务结果","应用最佳实践以实现高效的任务管理"],"ja":["Scala Proワークフローの簡素化","チェックリストを使用したタスク結果の検証","タスク管理のためのベストプラクティスの適用"],"ko":["Scala Pro 워크플로우의 간소화","체크 리스트를 사용한 태스크 결과의 검증","태스크 관리를 위한 최고의 실践의 적용"],"es":["Optimización de flujos de trabajo de Scala Pro","Validación de resultados de tareas con listas de verificación","Aplicación de las mejores prácticas para una gestión de tareas eficiente"],"fr":["Optimisation des flux de travail Scala Pro","Validation des résultats de tâches avec des listes de contrôle","Application des meilleures pratiques pour une gestion de tâches efficace"],"de":["Optimierung von Scala Pro-Workflows","Validierung von Aufgaben-Ergebnissen mit Checklisten","Anwendung bewährter Verfahren für eine effiziente Aufgabenverwaltung"],"pt":["Otimização dos fluxos de trabalho Scala Pro","Validação de resultados de tarefas com listas de verificação","Aplicação de melhores práticas para gestão de tarefas eficiente"],"ru":["Оптимизация рабочих потоков Scala Pro","Проверка результатов задач с помощью чек-листов","Применение лучших практик для эффективного управления задачами"],"ar":["تحسين تدفقات العمل في Scala Pro","تحقق النتائج في المهام باستخدام قوائم التحقق","تطبيق أفضل الممارسات لإدارة المهام الفعالة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Task must be related to Scala Pro","Requires clarification of goals, constraints, and required inputs"],"zh":["任务必须与Scala Pro相关","需要明确目标、约束和所需输入"],"ja":["タスクはScala Proに関連している必要がある","目標、制約、必要な入力の明確化が必要"],"ko":["태스크는 Scala Pro와 관련이 있어야 함","목표, 제약, 필요한 입력의 명확화가 필요"],"es":["La tarea debe estar relacionada con Scala Pro","Requiere aclaración de objetivos, restricciones y entradas requeridas"],"fr":["La tâche doit être liée à Scala Pro","Nécessite une clarification des objectifs, des contraintes et des entrées requises"],"de":["Die Aufgabe muss mit Scala Pro zusammenhängen","Erfordert eine Klärung der Ziele, Einschränkungen und erforderlichen Eingaben"],"pt":["A tarefa deve estar relacionada à Scala Pro","Exige esclarecimento de metas, restrições e entradas necessárias"],"ru":["Задача должна быть связана с Scala Pro","Требует разъяснения целей, ограничений и необходимых входных данных"],"ar":["المرحلة يجب أن تكون ذات صلة ببرنامج Scala Pro","يتطلب توضيح الأهداف والقيود والمدخلات المطلوبة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
