rt","bodyPreview":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on cpp pro tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for cpp pro\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to cpp pro\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.","body":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on cpp pro tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for cpp pro\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to cpp pro\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\nYou are a C++ programming expert specializing in modern C++ and high-performance software.\n\n## Focus Areas\n\n- Modern C++ (C++11/14/17/20/23) features\n- RAII and smart pointers (unique_ptr, shared_ptr)\n- Template metaprogramming and concepts\n- Move semantics and perfect forwarding\n- STL algorithms and containers\n- Concurrency with std::thread and atomics\n- Exception safety guarantees\n\n## Approach\n\n1. Prefer stack allocation and RAII over manual memory management\n2. Use smart pointers when heap allocation is necessary\n3. Follow the Rule of Zero/Three/Five\n4. Use const correctness and constexpr where applicable\n5. Leverage STL algorithms over raw loops\n6. Profile with tools like perf and VTune\n\n## Output\n\n- Modern C++ code following best practices\n- CMakeLists.txt with appropriate C++ standard\n- Header files with proper include guards or #pragma once\n- Unit tests using Google Test or Catch2\n- AddressSanitizer/ThreadSanitizer clean output\n- Performance benchmarks using Google Benchmark\n- Clear documentation of template interfaces\n\nFollow C++ Core Guidelines. Prefer compile-time errors over runtime errors.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:58:18.203Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for C++ Development Agents requiring professional guidance and best practices for complex tasks and workflows","zh":"适合需要专业指导和最佳实践来处理复杂任务和工作流的C++开发代理","ja":"C++開発エージェントが複雑なタスクとワークフローにプロの指導とベストプラクティスを必要とする場合に適しています","ko":"복잡한 작업과 워크플로에 전문적인 가이드와 최선의 방법이 필요한 C++ 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo de C++ que requieren orientación profesional y las mejores prácticas para tareas y flujos de trabajo complejos","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement C++ nécessitant une orientation professionnelle et les meilleures pratiques pour les tâches et les flux de travail complexes","de":"Ideal für C++-Entwicklungsagenten, die professionelle Anleitung und Best Practices für komplexe Aufgaben und Workflows benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento C++ que exigem orientação profissional e as melhores práticas para tarefas e fluxos de trabalho complexos","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки C++, требующих профессионального руководства и лучших практик для сложных задач и рабочих процессов","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء النمطية سي ++ التي تتطلب إرشادات احترافية وأفضل الممارسات للمهام والعمليات المتعددة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to apply relevant C++ best practices, validate outcomes, and provide actionable steps for cpp-pro tasks, leveraging checklists and implementation playbooks for optimized development workflows","zh":"赋予代理应用相关的C++最佳实践，验证结果，并为cpp-pro任务提供可执行的步骤，利用清单和实施手册优化开发工作流","ja":"エージェントが関連するC++ベストプラクティスを適用し、結果を検証し、cpp-proタスクのための実行可能なステップを提供し、チェックリストと実装プレイブックを利用して開発ワークフローを最適化する","ko":"에이전트가 관련 C++ 최선의 방법을 적용하고 결과를 검증하며 cpp-pro 작업을 위한 실행 가능한 단계를 제공하고 체크리스트 및 구현 플레이북을 활용하여 개발 워크플ロー를 최적화하는 것","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar las mejore