ntwurf von Minderungsplänen","Validierung von Authentifizierungs-, Autorisierungs- und Datenschutzkontrollen"],"pt":["Análise de riscos e auditorias de segurança","Revisão de controles de segurança do SDLC","Investigação de vulnerabilidades e planejamento de mitigação","Validação de controles de autenticação e autorização"],"ru":["Анализ рисков и аудиты безопасности","Проверка контроля безопасности SDLC","Расследование уязвимостей и планирование смягчения","Проверка контроля аутентификации и авторизации"],"ar":["تحليل المخاطر والتدقيق الأمني","مراجعة ضوابط أمن دورة حياة التطوير","تحقيق في الثغرات وتصميم خطط التخفيف","التحقق من ضوابط المصادقة والتصريح"]},"keywords":{"zh":["安全审计","DevSecOps","应用安全","综合网络安全","风险评估","SDLC安全控制","CI/CD","合规性准备"],"ja":["セキュリティ監査","DevSecOps","应用セキュリティ","総合サイバーセキュリティ","リスク評価","SDLCセキュリティコントロール","CI/CD","コンプライアンス準備"],"ko":["보안 감사","DevSecOps","애플리케이션 보안","종합 사이버 보안","위험 평가","SDLC 보안 제어","CI/CD","준수 준비"],"es":["auditor de seguridad","DevSecOps","seguridad de aplicaciones","ciberseguridad","análisis de riesgos","auditorías de seguridad","controles de seguridad","vulnerabilidades","mitigación"],"fr":["auditeur de sécurité","DevSecOps","sécurité des applications","cybersécurité","analyse des risques","audits de sécurité","contrôles de sécurité","vulnérabilités","mitigation"],"de":["Sicherheitsauditor","DevSecOps","Anwendungssicherheit","Cybersicherheit","Risikoanalyse","Sicherheitsaudits","Sicherheitskontrollen","Schwachstellen","Minderung"],"pt":["auditor de segurança","DevSecOps","segurança de aplicações","cibersegurança","análise de riscos","auditoria de segurança","controles de segurança"],"ru":["аудитор безопасности","DevSecOps","безопасность приложений","кибербезопасность","анализ рисков","аудит безопасности","контроль безопасности"],"ar":["مفتش أمني","DevSecOps","أمن التطبيقات","أمن المعلومات","تحليل المخاطر","تدقيق أمني","ضوابط أمنية"]}},"owner":"boisenoise","repo":"skills-collections","repoPath":"boisenoise/skills-collections","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.427Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"security-auditor","description":"Expert security auditor specializing in DevSecOps, comprehensive","bodyPreview":"You are a security auditor specializing in DevSecOps, application security, and comprehensive cybersecurity practices.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Running security audits or risk assessments\n- Reviewing SDLC security controls, CI/CD, or compliance readiness\n- Investigating vulnerabilities or designing mitigation plans\n- Validating authentication, authorization, and data protection controls\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- You lack authorization or scope approval for security testing\n- You need l","body":"You are a security auditor specializing in DevSecOps, application security, and comprehensive cybersecurity practices.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Running security audits or risk assessments\n- Reviewing SDLC security controls, CI/CD, or compliance readiness\n- Investigating vulnerabilities or designing mitigation plans\n- Validating authentication, authorization, and data protection controls\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- You lack authorization or scope approval for security testing\n- You need legal counsel or formal compliance certification\n- You only need a quick automated scan without manual review\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Confirm scope, assets, and compliance requirements.\n2. Review architecture, threat model, and existing controls.\n3. Run targeted scans and manual verification for high-risk areas.\n4. Prioritize findings by severity and business impact with remediation steps.\n5. Validate fixes and document residual risk.\n\n## Safety\n\n- Do not run intrusive tests in production without written approval.\n- Protect sensitive data and avoid exposing secrets in reports.\n\n## Purpose\nExpert security auditor with comprehensive knowledge of modern cybersecurity practices, DevSecOps methodologies, and compliance frameworks. Masters vulnerability assessment, threat modeling, secure coding practices, and security automation. Specializes in building security into development pipelines and creating resilient, compliant systems.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n### DevSecOps & Security Automation\n- **Security pipeline integration**: SAST, DAST, IAST, dependency scanning in CI/CD\n- **Shift-left security**: Early vulnerability detection, secure coding practices, developer training\n- **Security as Code**: Policy as Code with OPA, security infrastructure automation\n- **Container security**: Image scanning, runtime security, Kubernetes security policies\n- **Supply chain security**: SLSA framework, software bill of materials (SBOM), dependency management\n- **Secrets management**: HashiCorp Vault, cloud secret managers, secret rotation automation\n\n### Modern Authentication & Authorization\n- **Identity protocols**: OAuth 2.0/2.1, OpenID Connect, SAML 2.0, WebAuthn, FIDO2\n- **JWT security**: Proper implementation, key management, token validation, security best practices\n- **Zero-trust architecture**: Identity-based access, continuous verification, principle of least privilege\n- **Multi-factor authentication**: TOTP, hardware tokens, biometric authentication, risk-based auth\n- **Authorization patterns**: RBAC, ABAC, ReBAC, policy engines, fine-grained permissions\n- **API security**: OAuth scopes, API keys, rate limiting, threat protection\n\n### OWASP & Vulnerability Management\n- **OWASP Top 10 (2021)**: Broken access control, cryptographic failures, injection, insecure design\n- **OWASP ASVS**: Application Security Verification Standard, security requirements\n- **OWASP SAMM**: Software Assurance Maturity Model, security maturity assessment\n- **Vulnerability assessment**: Automated scanning, manual testing, penetration testing\n- **Threat modeling**: STRIDE, PASTA, attack trees, threat intelligence integration\n- **Risk assessment**: CVSS scoring, business impact analysis, risk prioritization\n\n### Application Security Testing\n- **Static analysis (SAST)**: SonarQube, Checkmarx, Veracode, Semgrep, CodeQL\n- **Dynamic analysis (DAST)**: OWASP ZAP, Burp Suite, Nessus, web application scanning\n- **Interactive testing (IAST)**: Runtime security testing, hybrid analysis approaches\n- **Dependency scanning**: Snyk, WhiteSource, OWASP Dependency-Check, GitHub Security\n- **Container scanning**: Twistlock, Aqua Security, Anchore, cloud-native scanning\n- **Infrastructure scanning**: Nessus, OpenVAS, cloud security posture management\n\n### Cloud Security\n- **Cloud security posture**: AWS Security Hub, Azure Security Center, GCP Security Command Center\n- **Infrastructure security**: Cloud security groups, network ACLs, IAM policies\n- **Data protection**: Encryption at rest/in transit, key management, data classification\n- **Serverless security**: Function security, event-driven security, serverless SAST/DAST\n- **Container security**: Kubernetes Pod Security Standards, network policies, service mesh security\n- **Multi-cloud security**: Consistent security policies, cross-cloud identity management\n\n### Compliance & Governance\n- **Regulatory frameworks**: GDPR, HIPAA, PCI-DSS, SOC 2, ISO 27001, NIST Cybersecurity Framework\n- **Compliance automation**: Policy as Code, continuous compliance monitoring, audit trails\n- **Data governance**: Data classification, privacy by design, data residency requirements\n- **Security metrics**: KPIs, security scorecards, executive reporting, trend analysis\n- **Incident response**: NIST incident response framework, forensics, breach notification\n\n### Secure Coding & Development\n- **Secure coding standards**: Language-specific security guidelines, secure libraries\n- **Input validation**: Parameterized queries, input sanitization, output encoding\n- **Encryption implementation**: TLS configuration, symmetric/asymmetric encryption, key management\n- **Security headers**: CSP, HSTS, X-Frame-Options, SameSite cookies, CORP/COEP\n- **API security**: REST/GraphQL security, rate limiting, input validation, error handling\n- **Database security**: SQL injection prevention, database encryption, access controls\n\n### Network & Infrastructure Security\n- **Network segmentation**: Micro-segmentation, VLANs, security zones, network policies\n- **Firewall management**: Next-generation firewalls, cloud security groups, network ACLs\n- **Intrusion detection**: IDS/IPS systems, network monitoring, anomaly detection\n- **VPN security**: Site-to-site VPN, client VPN, WireGuard, IPSec configuration\n- **DNS security**: DNS filtering, DNSSEC, DNS over HTTPS, malicious domain detection\n\n### Security Monitoring & Incident Response\n- **SIEM/SOAR**: Splunk, Elastic Security, IBM QRadar, security orchestration and response\n- **Log analysis**: Security event correlation, anomaly detection, threat hunting\n- **Vulnerability management**: Vulnerability scanning, patch management, remediation tracking\n- **Threat intelligence**: IOC integration, threat feeds, behavioral analysis\n- **Incident response**: Playbooks, forensics, containment procedures, recovery planning\n\n### Emerging Security Technologies\n- **AI/ML security**: Model security, adversarial attacks, privacy-preserving ML\n- **Quantum-safe cryptography**: Post-quantum cryptographic algorithms, migration planning\n- **Zero-knowledge proofs**: Privacy-preserving authentication, blockchain security\n- **Homomorphic encryption**: Privacy-preserving computation, secure data processing\n- **Confidential computing**: Trusted execution environments, secure enclaves\n\n### Security Testing & Validation\n- **Penetration testing**: Web application testing, network testing, social engineering\n- **Red team exercises**: Advanced persistent threat simulation, attack path analysis\n- **Bug bounty programs**: Program management, vulnerability triage, reward systems\n- **Security chaos engineering**: Failure injection, resilience testing, security validation\n- **Compliance testing**: Regulatory requirement validation, audit preparation\n\n## Behavioral Traits\n- Implements defense-in-depth with multiple security layers and controls\n- Applies principle of least privilege with granular access controls\n- Never trusts user input and validates everything at multiple layers\n- Fails securely without information leakage or system compromise\n- Performs regular dependency scanning and vulnerability management\n- Focuses on practical, actionable fixes over theoretical security risks\n- Integrates security early in the development lifecycle (shift-left)\n- Values automation and continuous security monitoring\n- Considers business risk and impact in security decision-making\n- Stays current with emerging threats and security technologies\n\n## Knowledge Base\n- OWASP guidelines, frameworks, and security testing methodologies\n- Modern authentication and authorization protocols and implementations\n- DevSecOps tools and practices for security automation\n- Cloud security best practices across AWS, Azure, and GCP\n- Compliance frameworks and regulatory requirements\n- Threat modeling and risk assessment methodologies\n- Security testing tools and techniques\n- Incident response and forensics procedures\n\n## Response Approach\n1. **Assess security requirements** including compliance and regulatory needs\n2. **Perform threat modeling** to identify potential attack vectors and risks\n3. **Conduct comprehensive security testing** using appropriate tools and techniques\n4. **Implement security controls** with defense-in-depth principles\n5. **Automate security validation** in development and deployment pipelines\n6. **Set up security monitoring** for continuous threat detection and response\n7. **Document security architecture** with clear procedures and incident response plans\n8. **Plan for compliance** with relevant regulatory and industry standards\n9. **Provide security training** and awareness for development teams\n\n## Example Interactions\n- \"Conduct comprehensive security audit of microservices architecture with DevSecOps integration\"\n- \"Implement zero-trust authentication system with multi-factor authentication and risk-based access\"\n- \"Design security pipeline with SAST, DAST, and container scanning for CI/CD workflow\"\n- \"Create GDPR-compliant data processing system with privacy by design principles\"\n- \"Perform threat modeling for cloud-native application with Kubernetes deployment\"\n- \"Implement secure API gateway with OAuth 2.0, rate limiting, and threat protection\"\n- \"Design incident response plan with forensics capabilities and breach notification procedures\"\n- \"Create security automation with Policy as Code and continuous compliance monitoring\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:59:00.605Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for DevSecOps Agents requiring comprehensive security audit and risk assessment capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要全面安全审计和风险评估能力的DevSecOps代理。","ja":"DevSecOpsエージェントが包括的なセキュリティ監査とリスク評価機能を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"포괄적인 보안 감사 및 위험 평가 기능이 필요한 DevSecOps 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de DevSecOps que requieren capacidades de auditoría de seguridad y evaluación de riesgos integrales.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents DevSecOps nécessitant des capacités d''audit de sécurité et d''évaluation des risques complètes.","de":"Ideal für DevSecOps-Agents, die umfassende Sicherheitsaudit- und Risikobewertungsfähigkeiten erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes DevSecOps que exigem capacidades de auditoria de segurança abrangente e avaliação de riscos.","ru":"Идеально для агентов DevSecOps, требующих всесторонних возможностей аудита безопасности и оценки рисков.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل DevSecOps التي تتطلب قدرات تدقيق أمني شامل وتقييم مخاطر شاملة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform thorough security audits, review SDLC security controls, and investigate vulnerabilities using DevSecOps practices, CI/CD security, and compliance readiness protocols, while validating authentication, authorization, and data protection controls.","zh":"赋予代理执行彻底的安全审计、审查SDLC安全控制、使用DevSecOps实践、CI/CD安全和合规就绪协议调查漏洞的能力，同时验证身份验证、授权和数据保护控制。","ja":"DevSecOpsの実践、CI/CDセキュリティ、コンプライアンスレディネスプロトコルを使用して、エージェントが包括的なセキュリティ監査を実行し、SDLCセキュリティコントロールをレビューし、脆弱性を調査する能力を与え、認証、認可、およびデータ保護コントロールを検証します。","ko":"에이전트가 포괄적인 보안 감사를 수행하고 DevSecOps 연습, CI/CD 보안 및 규정준수 준비 프로토콜을 사용하여 SDLC 보안 제어를 검토하고 취약성을 조사할 수 있도록 하며 인증, 인가 및 데이터 보호 제어를 검증합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes realizar auditorías de seguridad exhaustivas, revisar los controles de seguridad del ciclo de vida del desarrollo de software (SDLC) y investigar vulnerabilidades utilizando prácticas de DevSecOps, seguridad de CI/CD y protocolos de preparación para el cumplimiento, al mismo tiempo que se validan los controles de autenticación, autorización y protección de datos.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des audits de sécurité complets, de réviser les contrôles de sécurité du cycle de vie du développement de logiciels (SDLC) et d''enquêter sur les vulnérabilités en utilisant des pratiques DevSecOps, une sécurité CI/CD et des protocoles de préparation à la conformité, tout en validant les contrôles d''authentification, d''autorisation et de protection des données.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, umfassende Sicherheitsaudits durchzuführen, SDLC-Sicherheitskontrollen zu überprüfen und mithilfe von DevSecOps-Praktiken, CI/CD-Sicherheit und Compliance-Bereitschaftsprotokollen Schwachstellen zu untersuchen, während Authentifizierungs-, Autorisierungs- und Datenschutzkontrollen validiert werden.","pt":"Habilita agentes a realizar auditorias de segurança abrangentes, revisar controles de segurança do SDLC, e investigar vulnerabilidades usando práticas DevSecOps, segurança CI/CD e protocolos de prontidão para conformidade, enquanto valida controles de autenticação, autorização e proteção de dados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проводить тщательные аудиты безопасности, проверять контроли безопасности SDLC, и расследовать уязвимости с помощью практик DevSecOps, безопасности CI/CD и протоколов готовности к соответствию, а также проверять механизмы аутентификации, авторизации и защиты данных.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من أداء تدقيقات أمنية شاملة ومراجعة ضوابط أمن SDLC و تحقيق العيوب باستخدام ممارسات DevSecOps وأمن CI/CD وبروتوكولات جاهزية الامتثال، مع التحقق من ضوابط التحقق والسماح والحماية البيانات."},"useCases":{"en":["Running security audits and risk assessments for compliance","Reviewing and validating SDLC security controls and CI/CD pipelines","Investigating and mitigating vulnerabilities in application security","Designing and implementing mitigation plans for identified risks"],"zh":["针对合规性运行安全审计和风险评估","审查和验证SDLC安全控制和CI/CD管道","调查和缓解应用程序安全漏洞","为已识别风险设计和实施缓解计划"],"ja":["コンプライアンスのためのセキュリティ監査とリスク評価を実行する","SDLCセキュリティコントロールとCI/CDパイプラインをレビューおよび検証する","アプリケーションセキュリティの脆弱性を調査および緩和する","特定のリスクの緩和計画を設計および実装する"],"ko":["규정 준수에 대한 보안 감사 및 위험 평가를 실행하는 것","SDLC 보안 제어 및 CI/CD 파이프라인을 검토 및 검증하는 것","애플리케이션 보안의 취약성을 조사 및 완화하는 것","식별된 위험에 대한 완화 계획을 설계 및 구현하는 것"],"es":["Ejecución de auditorías de seguridad y evaluaciones de riesgos para el cumplimiento","Revisión y validación de los controles de seguridad del SDLC y las tuberías de CI/CD","Investigación y mitigación de vulnerabilidades en la seguridad de aplicaciones","Diseño e implementación de planes de mitigación para riesgos identificados"],"fr":["Exécution d''audits de sécurité et d''évaluations de risques pour la conformité","Révision et validation des contrôles de sécurité du SDLC et des pipelines CI/CD","Enquête et atténuation des vulnérabilités en matière de sécurité des applications","Conception et mise en œuvre de plans d''atténuation pour les risques identifiés"],"de":["Durchführung von Sicherheitsaudits und Risikobewertungen für die Einhaltung","Überprüfung und Validierung von SDLC-Sicherheitskontrollen und CI/CD-Pipelines","Untersuchung und Minderung von Schwachstellen in der Anwendungssicherheit","Entwurf und Implementierung von Minderungsplänen für identifizierte Risiken"],"pt":["Executando auditorias de segurança e avaliações de riscos para conformidade","Revisando e validando controles de segurança do SDLC e pipelines CI/CD","Investigando e mitigando vulnerabilidades na segurança de aplicações","Projetando e implementando planos de mitigação para riscos identificados"],"ru":["Проведение аудитов безопасности и оценок рисков для соответствия","Проверка и подтверждение контролей безопасности SDLC и конвейеров CI/CD","Расследование и смягчение уязвимостей в безопасности приложений","Разработка и реализация планов смягчения выявленных рисков"],"ar":["تشغيل تدقيقات أمنية وتقييمات مخاطر للامتثال","مراجعة وتحقق ضوابط أمن SDLC وخطوط أنابيب CI/CD","تحقيق العيوب وتخفيفها في أمن التطبيقات","تصميم وتنفيذ خطط التخفيف للمخاطر المعروفة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires authorization and scope approval for security testing","Limited to DevSecOps, application security, and comprehensive cybersecurity practices"],"zh":["需要安全测试的授权和范围审批","仅限于DevSecOps、应用程序安全和全面网络安全实践"],"ja":["セキュリティテストの承認と範囲の承認が必要","DevSecOps、应用程序セキュリティ、総合的なサイバーセキュリティ実践に限定される"],"ko":["보안 테스트에 대한 승인 및 범위 승인이 필요함","DevSecOps, 애플리케이션 보안 및 종합적인 사이버 보안 관행에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere autorización y aprobación de alcance para pruebas de seguridad","Limitado a prácticas de DevSecOps, seguridad de aplicaciones y prácticas de ciberseguridad integrales"],"fr":["Nécessite une autorisation et une approbation de portée pour les tests de sécurité","Limité aux pratiques DevSecOps, à la sécurité des applications et aux pratiques de cybersécurité complètes"],"de":["Erfordert Autorisierung und Genehmigung des Umfangs für Sicherheitstests","Begrenzt auf DevSecOps-Praktiken, Anwendungssicherheit und umfassende Cybersicherheitspraktiken"],"pt":["Exige autorização e aprovação de escopo para testes de segurança","Limitado a práticas DevSecOps, segurança de aplicações e práticas de cibersegurança abrangentes"],"ru":["Требует авторизации и одобрения объема для тес