nces de l''agent","Compatibilité avec Google Antigravity","Support pour les tâches et les flux de travail Scala","Vérification des résultats et validation"],"de":["Anleitungen und Best Practices für Entwickler","Sorgfältig ausgewählte Sammlung von Fähigkeiten des Agents","Kompatibilität mit Google Antigravity","Unterstützung für Aufgaben und Workflows von Scala","Überprüfung der Ergebnisse und Validierung"],"pt":["Otimização de tarefas de Scala","Melhores práticas para fluxos de trabalho","Checklist para garantir a qualidade","Orientação para iniciantes e experientes","Integração com Google Antigravity"],"ru":["Оптимизация задач Scala","Лучшие практики для рабочих процессов","Чек-лист для обеспечения качества","Руководство для начинающих и опытных пользователей","Интеграция с Google Antigravity"],"ar":["تحسين مهام سكالا","أفضل الممارسات للتدفقات العملية","قائمة مراجعة لضمان الجودة","إرشادات للمبتدئين والمخضرمين","التكامل مع جوجل أنتي جرافيتي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Scala Pro","Google Antigravity","Agent Skills","开发最佳实践","开发指导","开发效率","Scala Pro 任务","Scala Pro 工作流"],"ja":["Scala Pro","Google Antigravity","Agent Skills","開発ベストプラクティス","開発ガイダンス","開発効率","Scala Pro タスク","Scala Pro ワークフロー"],"ko":["스칼라 프로","구글 안티그래비티","에이전트 스킬","개발 최고의 실무","개발 가이드","개발 효율성","스칼라 프로 태스크","스칼라 프로 워크플로우"],"es":["desarrollo de software","Scala","Google Antigravity","mejores prácticas","guías para desarrolladores","herramientas de desarrollo","programación en Scala","desarrollo de aplicaciones","tecnologías de desarrollo"],"fr":["développement de logiciels","Scala","Google Antigravity","meilleures pratiques","guides pour les développeurs","outils de développement","programmation en Scala","développement d''applications","technologies de développement"],"de":["Software-Entwicklung","Scala","Google Antigravity","Best Practices","Anleitungen für Entwickler","Entwicklungstools","Programmierung in Scala","Anwendungs-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstechnologien"],"pt":["Scala Pro","Otimização de tarefas","Melhores práticas","Fluxos de trabalho","Google Antigravity","Desenvolvimento de software","Programação Scala"],"ru":["Scala Pro","Оптимизация задач","Лучшие практики","Рабочие процессы","Google Antigravity","Разработка программного обеспечения","Программирование на Scala"],"ar":["سكالا برو","تحسين المهام","أفضل الممارسات","التدفقات العملية","جوجل أنتي جرافيتي","تطوير البرمجيات","برمجة سكالا"]}},"owner":"rmyndharis","repo":"antigravity-skills","repoPath":"rmyndharis/antigravity-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.427Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"scala-pro","description":"Master enterprise-grade Scala development with functional","bodyPreview":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on scala pro tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for scala pro\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to scala pro\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playboo","body":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on scala pro tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for scala pro\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to scala pro\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\nYou are an elite Scala engineer specializing in enterprise-grade functional programming and distributed systems.\n\n## Core Expertise\n\n### Functional Programming Mastery\n- **Scala 3 Expertise**: Deep understanding of Scala 3''s type system innovations, including union/intersection types, `given`/`using` clauses for context functions, and metaprogramming with `inline` and macros\n- **Type-Level Programming**: Advanced type classes, higher-kinded types, and type-safe DSL construction\n- **Effect Systems**: Mastery of **Cats Effect** and **ZIO** for pure functional programming with controlled side effects, understanding the evolution of effect systems in Scala\n- **Category Theory Application**: Practical use of functors, monads, applicatives, and monad transformers to build robust and composable systems\n- **Immutability Patterns**: Persistent data structures, lenses (e.g., via Monocle), and functional updates for complex state management\n\n### Distributed Computing Excellence\n- **Apache Pekko & Akka Ecosystem**: Deep expertise in the Actor model, cluster sharding, and event sourcing with **Apache Pekko** (the open-source successor to Akka). Mastery of **Pekko Streams** for reactive data pipelines. Proficient in migrating Akka systems to Pekko and maintaining legacy Akka applications\n- **Reactive Streams**: Deep knowledge of backpressure, flow control, and stream processing with Pekko Streams and **FS2**\n- **Apache Spark**: RDD transformations, DataFrame/Dataset operations, and understanding of the Catalyst optimizer for large-scale data processing\n- **Event-Driven Architecture**: CQRS implementation, event sourcing patterns, and saga orchestration for distributed transactions\n\n### Enterprise Patterns\n- **Domain-Driven Design**: Applying Bounded Contexts, Aggregates, Value Objects, and Ubiquitous Language in Scala\n- **Microservices**: Designing service boundaries, API contracts, and inter-service communication patterns, including REST/HTTP APIs (with OpenAPI) and high-performance RPC with **gRPC**\n- **Resilience Patterns**: Circuit breakers, bulkheads, and retry strategies with exponential backoff (e.g., using Pekko or resilience4j)\n- **Concurrency Models**: `Future` composition, parallel collections, and principled concurrency using effect systems over manual thread management\n- **Application Security**: Knowledge of common vulnerabilities (e.g., OWASP Top 10) and best practices for securing Scala applications\n\n## Technical Excellence\n\n### Performance Optimization\n- **JVM Optimization**: Tail recursion, trampolining, lazy evaluation, and memoization strategies\n- **Memory Management**: Understanding of generational GC, heap tuning (G1/ZGC), and off-heap storage\n- **Native Image Compilation**: Experience with **GraalVM** to build native executables for optimal startup time and memory footprint in cloud-native environments\n- **Profiling & Benchmarking**: JMH usage for microbenchmarking, and profiling with tools like Async-profiler to generate flame graphs and identify hotspots\n\n### Code Quality Standards\n- **Type Safety**: Leveraging Scala''s type system to maximize compile-time correctness and eliminate entire classes of runtime errors\n- **Functional Purity**: Emphasizing referential transparency, total functions, and explicit effect handling\n- **Pattern Matching**: Exhaustive matching with sealed traits and algebraic data types (ADTs) for robust logic\n- **Error Handling**: Explicit error modeling with `Either`, `Validated`, and `Ior` from the Cats library, or using ZIO''s integrated error channel\n\n### Framework & Tooling Proficiency\n- **Web & API Frameworks**: Play Framework, Pekko HTTP, **Http4s**, and **Tapir** for building type-safe, declarative REST and GraphQL APIs\n- **Data Access**: **Doobie**, Slick, and Quill for type-safe, functional database interactions\n- **Testing Frameworks**: ScalaTest, Specs2, and **ScalaCheck** for property-based testing\n- **Build Tools & Ecosystem**: SBT, Mill, and Gradle with multi-module project structures. Type-safe configuration with **PureConfig** or **Ciris**. Structured logging with SLF4J/Logback\n- **CI/CD & Containerization**: Experience with building and deploying Scala applications in CI/CD pipelines. Proficiency with **Docker** and **Kubernetes**\n\n## Architectural Principles\n\n- Design for horizontal scalability and elastic resource utilization\n- Implement eventual consistency with well-defined conflict resolution strategies\n- Apply functional domain modeling with smart constructors and ADTs\n- Ensure graceful degradation and fault tolerance under failure conditions\n- Optimize for both developer ergonomics and runtime efficiency\n\nDeliver robust, maintainable, and performant Scala solutions that scale to millions of users.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:58:30.829Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Completion Agents requiring expert-level Scala programming guidance and best practices","zh":"适合需要专家级Scala编程指导和最佳实践的代码补全代理","ja":"Scalaプログラミングの専門家レベルのガイダンスとベストプラクティスを必要とするコード補完エージェントに最適","ko":"전문가 수준의 Scala 프로그래밍 가이드 및 모범 사례가 필요한 코드 완성 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de completado de código que requieren orientación de programación Scala de nivel experto y mejores prácticas","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de complétion de code nécessitant une orientation de programmation Scala de niveau expert et des meilleures pratiques","de":"Ideal für Code-Vervollständigungsagenten, die eine Scala-Programmierführung auf Expertenebene und Best Practices benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Conclusão de Código que exigem orientação de programação Scala de nível expert e boas práticas","ru":"Идеально для агентов завершения кода, требующих экспертного уровня руководства по программированию на Scala и лучших практик","ar":"مثالي لعميل إكمال الشفرة الذي يتطلب إرشادات برمجة سكالا على مستوى الخبراء وأفضل الممارسات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to apply relevant Scala Pro best practices, validate task outcomes, and provide actionable steps for Scala-related workflows, utilizing implementation playbooks and checklists for optimized results","zh":"赋予代理应用相关的Scala Pro最佳实践，验证任务结果，并为Scala相关的工作流提供可行的步骤，利用实施手册和清单以获得最佳结果","ja":"エージェントに、関連するScala Proのベストプラクティスを適用し、タスクの結果を検証し、Scala関連のワークフローにアクション可能なステップを提供することを可能にし、実装プレイブックとチェックリストを使用して最適な結果を得る","ko":"에이전트에 관련 Scala Pro 모범 사례를 적용하고 작업 결과를 확인하며 Scala 관련 워크플로우에 대한 실행 가능한 단계를 제공하고 구현 플레이북과 체크리스트를 사용하여 최적의 결과를 얻도록 하는 것","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar las mejores prácticas de Scala Pro relevantes, validar los resultados de las tareas y proporcionar pasos de acción para flujos de trabajo relacionados con Scala, utilizando libros de implementación y listas de verificación para resultados optimizados","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer les meilleures pratiques de Scala Pro pertinentes, de valider les résultats des tâches et de fournir des étapes d''action pour les flux de travail liés à Scala, en utilisant des carnets de mise en œuvre et des listes de vérification pour des résultats optimisés","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, relevante Scala Pro-Best Practices anzuwenden, die Ergebnisse von Aufgaben zu überprüfen und aktionable Schritte für Scala-bezogene Workflows bereitzustellen, indem Implementierungsleitfäden und Prüflisten für optimierte Ergebnisse verwendet werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aplicar as melhores práticas relevantes do Scala Pro, validar os resultados das tarefas e fornecer etapas executáveis para fluxos de trabalho relacionados ao Scala, utilizando livros de implementação e listas de verificação para resultados otimizados","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью применять соответствующие лучшие практики Scala Pro, проверять результаты задач и предоставлять действенные шаги для рабочих процессов, связанных с Scala, используя книги по реализации и контрольные списки для оптимизированных результатов","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء تطبيق أفضل الممارسات المحددة لسكالا برو، التحقق من نتائج المهام، وتقديم خطوات قابلة للتنفيذ لتدفقات العمل المتعلقة بسكالا، باستخدام كتيبات التنفيذ وقوائم التحقق لتحقيق نتائج محسنة"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Scala Pro task workflows","Generating checklists for Scala best practices","Validating Scala Pro task outcomes"],"zh":["自动化Scala Pro任务工作流","为Scala最佳实践生成清单","验证Scala Pro任务结果"],"ja":["Scala Proタスクワークフローの自動化","Scalaベストプラクティスのチェックリストを生成","Scala Proタスクの結果を検証"],"ko":["Scala Pro 작업 워크플로 자동화","Scala 모범 사례를 위한 체크리스트 생성","Scala Pro 작업 결과 확인"],"es":["Automatización de flujos de trabajo de tareas de Scala Pro","Generación de listas de verificación para las mejores prácticas de Scala","Validación de los resultados de las tareas de Scala Pro"],"fr":["Automatisation des flux de travail de tâches de Scala Pro","Génération de listes de vérification pour les meilleures pratiques de Scala","Validation des résultats des tâches de Scala Pro"],"de":["Automatisierung von Scala Pro-Aufgaben-Workflows","Generierung von Prüflisten für Scala-Best Practices","Überprüfung der Ergebnisse von Scala Pro-Aufgaben"],"pt":["Automatizar fluxos de trabalho de tarefas Scala Pro","Gerar listas de verificação para as melhores práticas Scala","Validar resultados de tarefas Scala Pro"],"ru":["Автоматизация рабочих потоков задач Scala Pro","Генерация контрольных списков для лучших практик Scala","Проверка результатов задач Scala Pro"],"ar":["أتمتة تدفقات عمل مهام سكالا برو","توليد قوائم التحقق لأفضل الممارسات سكالا","التحقق من نتائج مهام سكالا برو"]},"limitations":{"en":["Task must be related to Scala Pro","Requires clarification of goals, constraints, and required inputs"],"zh":["任务必须与Scala Pro相关","需要阐明目标、约束和所需输入"],"ja":["タスクはScala Proに関連している必要がある","目標、制約、必要な入力を明確にする必要がある"],"ko":["작업은 Scala Pro와 관련되어야 함","목표, 제약 및 필요한 입력을 명확히 해야 함"],"es":["La tarea debe estar relacionada con Scala Pro","Requiere aclaración de objetivos, restricciones y entradas requeridas"],"fr":["La tâche doit être liée à Scala Pro","Nécessite une clarification des objectifs, des contraintes et des entrées requises"],"de":["Die Aufgabe muss mit Scala Pro zusammenhängen","Erfordert eine Klarstellung der Ziele, Einschränkungen und erforderlichen Eingaben"],"pt":["A tarefa deve estar relacionada ao Scala Pro","Exige esclarecimento dos objetivos, restrições e entradas necessárias"],"ru":["Задача должна быть связана с Scala Pro","Требует разъяснения целей, ограничений и необходимых входных данных"],"ar":["يجب أن تكون المهمة متعلقة بسكالا برو","يتطلب توضيح الأهداف والقيود والمدخلات المطلوبة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
