енты и лучшие практики","ar":"تحليل الأعمال: أدوات وأفضل الممارسات","en":"business-analyst"},"description":{"zh":"业务分析师技能是集合了各个平台的技能，用于业务分析任务和工作流程","ja":"ビジネスアナリストスキルは、ビジネスアナリストタスクとワークフローに使用されるスキルの集合","ko":"사업 분석가 스킬은 사업 분석 작업 및 워크플로우에 사용되는 스킬의 집합","es":"El skill de analista de negocios te proporciona las herramientas y los conocimientos necesarios para mejorar tus procesos y tomar decisiones informadas","fr":"Le skill d''analyste commercial vous fournit les outils et les connaissances nécessaires pour améliorer vos processus et prendre des décisions éclairées","de":"Das Business-Analyst-Skill bietet Ihnen die notwendigen Tools und Kenntnisse, um Ihre Prozesse zu verbessern und fundierte Entscheidungen zu treffen","pt":"A análise de negócios é uma habilidade fundamental para profissionais que buscam entender e melhorar processos de negócios. Ela envolve a aplicação de ferram...","ru":"Бизнес-аналитика является фундаментальной навыком для специалистов, которые стремятся понять и улучшить бизнес-процессы. Она включает в себя применение инстр...","ar":"تحليل الأعمال هو مهارة أساسية لمهنيين يبحثون عن فهم وتحسين عمليات الأعمال. يتضمن تطبيق أدوات وممارسات لتحليل ومعالجة مشاكل الأعمال.","en":"集合了所有的openclaw,claudecode,open等各个平台所有的skills"},"definition":{"en":"集合了所有的openclaw,claudecode,open等各个平台所有的skills"},"features":{"zh":["业务分析任务支持","最佳实践和流程指导","检查清单和验证","操作步骤和结果验证","详细示例和资源"],"ja":["ビジネスアナリストタスクのサポート","ベストプラクティスとワークフローのガイド","チェックリストと検証","操作手順と結果検証","詳細な例とリソース"],"ko":["사업 분석 작업 지원","최선의 실천 방법 및 워크플로우 가이드","체크리스트 및 검증","작업 절차 및 결과 검증","상세한 예시 및 리소스"],"es":["Mejora de procesos","Toma de decisiones informadas","Análisis de datos","Optimización de flujos de trabajo","Validación de resultados"],"fr":["Amélioration des processus","Prise de décisions éclairées","Analyse de données","Optimisation des flux de travail","Validation des résultats"],"de":["Prozessverbesserung","Fundierte Entscheidungen","Datenanalyse","Optimierung von Arbeitsabläufen","Validierung von Ergebnissen"],"pt":["Aplicação de habilidades de análise de negócios","Uso de ferramentas de análise de negócios","Desenvolvimento de planos de ação","Análise de dados de negócios","Melhoria de processos de negócios"],"ru":["Применение навыков бизнес-аналитики","Использование инструментов бизнес-аналитики","Разработка планов действий","Анализ бизнес-данных","Улучшение бизнес-процессов"],"ar":["تطبيق مهارات تحليل الأعمال","استخدام أدوات تحليل الأعمال","تطوير خطط العمل","تحليل بيانات الأعمال","تحسين عمليات الأعمال"]},"keywords":{"zh":["业务分析师技能","业务分析任务","最佳实践","流程指导","检查清单","验证","操作步骤","结果验证"],"ja":["ビジネスアナリストスキル","ビジネスアナリストタスク","ベストプラクティス","ワークフローのガイド","チェックリスト","検証","操作手順","結果検証"],"ko":["사업 분석가 스킬","사업 분석 작업","최선의 실천 방법","워크플로우 가이드","체크리스트","검증","작업 절차","결과 검증"],"es":["analista de negocios","mejora de procesos","toma de decisiones","análisis de datos","optimización de flujos de trabajo","validación de resultados","business analyst"],"fr":["analyste commercial","amélioration des processus","prise de décisions","analyse de données","optimisation des flux de travail","validation des résultats","business analyst"],"de":["business analyst","prozessverbesserung","fundierte entscheidungen","datenanalyse","optimierung von arbeitsabläufen","validierung von ergebnissen","geschäftsanalyse"],"pt":["análise de negócios","ferramentas de análise de negócios","melhores práticas de análise de negócios","desenvolvimento de habilidades de análise de negócios","análise de dados de negócios","planejamento estratégico"],"ru":["бизнес-аналитика","инструменты бизнес-аналитики","лучшие практики бизнес-аналитики","развитие навыков бизнес-аналитики","анализ бизнес-данных","стратегическое планирование"],"ar":["تحليل الأعمال","أدوات تحليل الأعمال","أفضل الممارسات لتحليل الأعمال","تطوير مهارات تحليل الأعمال","تحليل بيانات الأعمال","التخطيط الاستراتيجي"]}},"owner":"YPYT1","repo":"All-skills","repoPath":"YPYT1/All-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.427Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"business-analyst","description":"Master modern business analysis with AI-powered analytics,","bodyPreview":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on business analyst tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for business analyst\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to business analyst\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/i","body":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on business analyst tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for business analyst\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to business analyst\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\nYou are an expert business analyst specializing in data-driven decision making through advanced analytics, modern BI tools, and strategic business intelligence.\n\n## Purpose\n\nExpert business analyst focused on transforming complex business data into actionable insights and strategic recommendations. Masters modern analytics platforms, predictive modeling, and data storytelling to drive business growth and optimize operational efficiency. Combines technical proficiency with business acumen to deliver comprehensive analysis that influences executive decision-making.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n### Modern Analytics Platforms and Tools\n\n- Advanced dashboard creation with Tableau, Power BI, Looker, and Qlik Sense\n- Cloud-native analytics with Snowflake, BigQuery, and Databricks\n- Real-time analytics and streaming data visualization\n- Self-service BI implementation and user adoption strategies\n- Custom analytics solutions with Python, R, and SQL\n- Mobile-responsive dashboard design and optimization\n- Automated report generation and distribution systems\n\n### AI-Powered Business Intelligence\n\n- Machine learning for predictive analytics and forecasting\n- Natural language processing for sentiment and text analysis\n- AI-driven anomaly detection and alerting systems\n- Automated insight generation and narrative reporting\n- Predictive modeling for customer behavior and market trends\n- Computer vision for image and video analytics\n- Recommendation engines for business optimization\n\n### Strategic KPI Framework Development\n\n- Comprehensive KPI strategy design and implementation\n- North Star metrics identification and tracking\n- OKR (Objectives and Key Results) framework development\n- Balanced scorecard implementation and management\n- Performance measurement system design\n- Metric hierarchy and dependency mapping\n- KPI benchmarking against industry standards\n\n### Financial Analysis and Modeling\n\n- Advanced revenue modeling and forecasting techniques\n- Customer lifetime value (CLV) and acquisition cost (CAC) optimization\n- Cohort analysis and retention modeling\n- Unit economics analysis and profitability modeling\n- Scenario planning and sensitivity analysis\n- Financial planning and analysis (FP&A) automation\n- Investment analysis and ROI calculations\n\n### Customer and Market Analytics\n\n- Customer segmentation and persona development\n- Churn prediction and prevention strategies\n- Market sizing and total addressable market (TAM) analysis\n- Competitive intelligence and market positioning\n- Product-market fit analysis and validation\n- Customer journey mapping and funnel optimization\n- Voice of customer (VoC) analysis and insights\n\n### Data Visualization and Storytelling\n\n- Advanced data visualization techniques and best practices\n- Interactive dashboard design and user experience optimization\n- Executive presentation design and narrative development\n- Data storytelling frameworks and methodologies\n- Visual analytics for pattern recognition and insight discovery\n- Color theory and design principles for business audiences\n- Accessibility standards for inclusive data visualization\n\n### Statistical Analysis and Research\n\n- Advanced statistical analysis and hypothesis testing\n- A/B testing design, execution, and analysis\n- Survey design and market research methodologies\n- Experimental design and causal inference\n- Time series analysis and forecasting\n- Multivariate analysis and dimensionality reduction\n- Statistical modeling for business applications\n\n### Data Management and Quality\n\n- Data governance frameworks and implementation\n- Data quality assessment and improvement strategies\n- Master data management and data integration\n- Data warehouse design and dimensional modeling\n- ETL/ELT process design and optimization\n- Data lineage and impact analysis\n- Privacy and compliance considerations (GDPR, CCPA)\n\n### Business Process Optimization\n\n- Process mining and workflow analysis\n- Operational efficiency measurement and improvement\n- Supply chain analytics and optimization\n- Resource allocation and capacity planning\n- Performance monitoring and alerting systems\n- Automation opportunity identification and assessment\n- Change management for analytics initiatives\n\n### Industry-Specific Analytics\n\n- E-commerce and retail analytics (conversion, merchandising)\n- SaaS metrics and subscription business analysis\n- Healthcare analytics and population health insights\n- Financial services risk and compliance analytics\n- Manufacturing and IoT sensor data analysis\n- Marketing attribution and campaign effectiveness\n- Human resources analytics and workforce planning\n\n## Behavioral Traits\n\n- Focuses on business impact and actionable recommendations\n- Translates complex technical concepts for non-technical stakeholders\n- Maintains objectivity while providing strategic guidance\n- Validates assumptions through data-driven testing\n- Communicates insights through compelling visual narratives\n- Balances detail with executive-level summarization\n- Considers ethical implications of data use and analysis\n- Stays current with industry trends and best practices\n- Collaborates effectively across functional teams\n- Questions data quality and methodology rigorously\n\n## Knowledge Base\n\n- Modern BI and analytics platform ecosystems\n- Statistical analysis and machine learning techniques\n- Data visualization theory and design principles\n- Financial modeling and business valuation methods\n- Industry benchmarks and performance standards\n- Data governance and quality management practices\n- Cloud analytics platforms and data warehousing\n- Agile analytics and continuous improvement methodologies\n- Privacy regulations and ethical data use guidelines\n- Business strategy frameworks and analytical approaches\n\n## Response Approach\n\n1. **Define business objectives** and success criteria clearly\n2. **Assess data availability** and quality for analysis\n3. **Design analytical framework** with appropriate methodologies\n4. **Execute comprehensive analysis** with statistical rigor\n5. **Create compelling visualizations** that tell the data story\n6. **Develop actionable recommendations** with implementation guidance\n7. **Present insights effectively** to target audiences\n8. **Plan for ongoing monitoring** and continuous improvement\n\n## Example Interactions\n\n- \"Analyze our customer churn patterns and create a predictive model to identify at-risk customers\"\n- \"Build a comprehensive revenue dashboard with drill-down capabilities and automated alerts\"\n- \"Design an A/B testing framework for our product feature releases\"\n- \"Create a market sizing analysis for our new product line with TAM/SAM/SOM breakdown\"\n- \"Develop a cohort-based LTV model and optimize our customer acquisition strategy\"\n- \"Build an executive dashboard showing key business metrics with trend analysis\"\n- \"Analyze our sales funnel performance and identify optimization opportunities\"\n- \"Create a competitive intelligence framework with automated data collection\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:59:02.905Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT requiring advanced business analysis capabilities for workflow optimization and best practices guidance.","zh":"适用于像 Claude Code 和 AutoGPT 这样的 AI 代理，它们需要高级的商业分析能力以实现工作流优化和最佳实践指导。","ja":"Claude Code や AutoGPT などの高度なビジネス分析機能を必要とする AI エージェントに最適です。ワークフロー最適化とベストプラクティスガイダンスのために。","ko":"클라우드 코드와 오토지피티 같은 고급 비즈니스 분석 기능이 워크플ロー 최적화 및 최고의 실무 지침을 위해 필요한 에이아이 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude Code y AutoGPT que requieren capacidades de análisis de negocio avanzadas para la optimización de flujos de trabajo y la orientación de las mejores prácticas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Claude Code et AutoGPT nécessitant des capacités d''analyse commerciale avancées pour l''optimisation des flux de travail et les conseils de meilleures pratiques.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Claude Code und AutoGPT, die erweiterte Geschäftsanalysefunktionen für die Workflow-Optimierung und die Richtlinien für die besten Praktiken erfordern.","pt":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT requiring advanced business analysis capabilities for workflow optimization and best practices guidance.","ru":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT requiring advanced business analysis capabilities for workflow optimization and best practices guidance.","ar":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT requiring advanced business analysis capabilities for workflow optimization and best practices guidance."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to apply relevant business analyst best practices, validate outcomes, and provide actionable steps using checklists and guidance, leveraging OpenCLAW and ClaudeCode platforms for comprehensive business analysis.","zh":"赋予代理应用相关的商业分析师最佳实践，验证结果，并使用检查清单和指导提供可执行步骤，利用 OpenCLAW 和 ClaudeCode 平台进行全面商业分析。","ja":"エージェントに、関連するビジネスアナリストのベストプラクティスを適用し、結果を検証し、チェックリストとガイダンスを使用して実行可能なステップを提供することを可能にします。OpenCLAW と ClaudeCode プラットフォームを使用して、包括的なビジネス分析を行います。","ko":"에이전트에게 관련 비즈니스 분석가의 최고 실무를 적용하고 결과를 검증하며 체크리스트 및 가이드를 사용하여 실행 가능한 단계를 제공할 수 있게 합니다. 오픈클로 및 클라우드 코드 플랫폼을 사용하여 종합적인 비즈니스 분석을 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar las mejores prácticas relevantes de análisis de negocio, validar resultados y proporcionar pasos realizables utilizando listas de verificación y orientación, aprovechando las plataformas OpenCLAW y ClaudeCode para un análisis de negocio integral.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer les meilleures pratiques pertinentes d''analyse commerciale, de valider les résultats et de fournir des étapes réalisables en utilisant des listes de contrôle et des conseils, en exploitant les plateformes OpenCLAW et ClaudeCode pour une analyse commerciale complète.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, relevante Geschäftsanalyse-Best-Practices anzuwenden, Ergebnisse zu validieren und handhabbare Schritte bereitzustellen, indem Checklisten und Richtlinien verwendet werden, und die Plattformen OpenCLAW und ClaudeCode für eine umfassende Geschäftsanalyse nutzt.","pt":"Empowers agents to apply relevant business analyst best practices, validate outcomes, and provide actionable steps using checklists and guidance, leveraging OpenCLAW and ClaudeCode platforms for comprehensive business analysis.","ru":"Empowers agents to apply relevant business analyst best practices, validate outcomes, and provide actionable steps using checklists and guidance, leveraging OpenCLAW and ClaudeCode platforms for comprehensive business analysis.","ar":"Empowers agents to apply relevant business analyst best practices, validate outcomes, and provide actionable steps using checklists and guidance, leveraging OpenCLAW and ClaudeCode platforms for comprehensive business analysis."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing business workflows for efficiency improvements","Generating checklists for business analyst tasks","Validating business outcomes against best practices"],"zh":["分析商业工作流以提高效率","生成商业分析师任务的检查清单","验证商业结果是否符合最佳实践"],"ja":["ビジネスワークフローを分析して効率性を向上させる","ビジネスアナリストのタスクのチェックリストを生成する","ビジネスの結果をベストプラクティスと比較して検証する"],"ko":["비즈니스 워크플ロー 분석을 통해 효율성을 개선한다","비즈니스 분석가의 작업 체크리스트 생성","비즈니스 결과를 최고의 실무와 비교하여 검증"],"es":["Análisis de flujos de trabajo empresariales para mejoras de eficiencia","Generación de listas de verificación para tareas de análisis de negocio","Validación de resultados empresariales contra las mejores prácticas"],"fr":["Analyse des flux de travail commerciaux pour améliorer l''efficacité","Génération de listes de contrôle pour les tâches d''analyse commerciale","Validation des résultats commerciaux par rapport aux meilleures pratiques"],"de":["Analyse von Geschäftswerkflüssen für Effizienzverbesserungen","Erzeugung von Checklisten für Geschäftsanalyse-Aufgaben","Validierung von Geschäftsergebnissen gegenüber den besten Praktiken"],"pt":["Analyzing business workflows for efficiency improvements","Generating checklists for business analyst tasks","Validating business outcomes against best practices"],"ru":["Analyzing business workflows for efficiency improvements","Generating checklists for business analyst tasks","Validating business outcomes against best practices"],"ar":["Analyzing business workflows for efficiency improvements","Generating checklists for business analyst tasks","Validating business outcomes against best practices"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires business analyst task or workflow context","Limited to business analyst domain and tools"],"zh":["需要商业分析师任务或工作流上下文","仅限于商业分析师领域和工具"],"ja":["ビジネスアナリストのタスクまたはワークフローのコンテキストが必要","ビジネスアナリストのドメインとツールに限定される"],"ko":["비즈니스 분석가의 작업 또는 워크플로우 문맥이 필요","비즈니스 분석가의 도메인 및 도구에 제한"],"es":["Requiere contexto de tarea o flujo de trabajo de análisis de negocio","Limitado al dominio y herramientas de análisis de negocio"],"fr":["Nécessite un contexte de tâche ou de flux de travail d''analyse commerciale","Limité au domaine et aux outils d''analyse commerciale"],"de":["Benötigt Kontext von Geschäftsanalyse-Aufgabe oder -Workflow","Begrenzt auf das Gebiet und die Werkzeuge der Geschäftsanalyse"],"pt":["Requires business analyst task or workflow context","Limited to business analyst domain and tools"],"ru":["Requires business analyst task or workflow context","Limited to business analyst domain and tools"],"ar":["Requires business analyst task or workflow context","Limited to business analyst domain and tools"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('boisenoise/skills-collections/data-storytelling', 'community', 'boisenoise', 'skills-collections', 'boisenoise/skills-collections', 'data-storytelling', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.428Z', '2026-02-18T04:59:05.628Z', NULL, '{"id":"boisenoise/skills-collections/data-storytelling","name":"data-storytelling","description":{"zh":"数据故事讲述是将数据转化为有意义的叙述，以驱动决策和激发行动。它涉及清晰地定义目标、约束和所需输入，应用最佳实践，并验证结果","ja":"データストーリーテリングは、データを意味のある物語に変えることで、意思決定と行動を促進することを目的としたアプローチです。目標、制約、必要な入力を明確に定義し、ベストプラクティスを適用し、結果を検証することが含まれます","ko":"데이터 스토리텔링은 데이터를 의미 있는 이야기에 변환하여 의사 결정과 행동을 이끌어 내는 것을 목표로 하는 접근 방식입니다. 목표, 제약 및 필요한 입력을 명확하게 정의하고, 최적의 관행을 적용하며, 결과를 검증하는 것을 포함합니다","es":"La narrativa de datos es el proceso de transformar datos en historias que impulsan decisiones y acción. Aprende a aplicar técnicas efectivas","fr":"La narration de données est le processus de transformation des données en récits qui stimulent la prise de décision et l''action. Découvrez les techniques efficaces","de":"Das Datenstorytelling ist der Prozess der Umwandlung von Rohdaten in überzeugende Erzählungen, die Entscheidungen und Aktionen fördern. Erfahren Sie die effektiven Techniken","pt":"A habilidade de contar histórias com dados transforma dados crus em narrativas convincentes. Aprenda a aplicar essa habilidade para impulsionar decisões e inspirar ação","ru":"Навык рассказывания историй с данными преобразует сырые данные в убедительные нарративы. Узнайте, как применить этот навык, чтобы стимулировать принятие решений и вдохновить на действие","ar":"مهارة رواية القصص مع البيانات تحول البيانات الخام إلى قصص مقنعة. تعلم كيفية تطبيق هذه المهارة لتحفيز القرارات وتلهين العمل","en":"Getting Skills Together to Learn from the Best"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"数据故事讲述 - 将数据转化为引人入胜的叙述","ja":"データストーリーテリング - 生データを魅力的な物語に変える","ko":"데이터 스토리텔링 - 원시 데이터를 설득력 있는 이야기에 변환","es":"Narrativa de datos: Transforma datos en historias","fr":"Narration de données: Transformer les données en récits","de":"Datenstorytelling: Rohdaten in überzeugende Erzählungen u...","pt":"Contando Histórias com Dados","ru":"Рассказывание историй с данными","ar":"رواية القصص مع البيانات","en":"data-storytelling"},"description":{"zh":"数据故事讲述是将数据转化为有意义的叙述，以驱动决策和激发行动。它涉及清晰地定义目标、约束和所需输入，应用最佳实践，并验证结果","ja":"データストーリーテリングは、データを意味のある物語に変えることで、意思決定と行動を促進することを目的としたアプローチです。目標、制約、必要な入力を明確に定義し、ベストプラクティスを適用し、結果を検証することが含まれます","ko":"데이터 스토리텔링은 데이터를 의미 있는 이야기에 변환하여 의사 결정과 행동을 이끌어 내는 것을 목표로 하는 접근 방식입니다. 목표, 제약 및 필요한 입력을 명확하게 정의하고, 최적의 관행을 적용하며, 결과를 검증하는 것을 포함합니다","es":"La narrativa de datos es el proceso de transformar datos en historias que impulsan decisiones y acción. Aprende a aplicar técnicas efectivas","fr":"La narration de données est le processus de transformation des données en récits qui stimulent la prise de décision et l''action. Découvrez les techniques eff...","de":"Das Datenstorytelling ist der Prozess der Umwandlung von Rohdaten in überzeugende Erzählungen, die Entscheidungen und Aktionen fördern. Erfahren Sie die effe...","pt":"A habilidade de contar histórias com dados transforma dados crus em narrativas convincentes. Aprenda a aplicar essa habilidade para impulsionar decisões e in...","ru":"Навык рассказывания историй с данными преобразует сырые данные в убедительные нарративы. Узнайте, как применить этот навык, чтобы стимулировать принятие реше...","ar":"مهارة رواية القصص مع البيانات تحول البيانات الخام إلى قصص مقنعة. تعلم كيفية تطبيق هذه المهارة لتحفيز القرارات وتلهين العمل","en":"Getting Skills Together to Learn from the Best"},"definition":{"en":"Getting Skills Together to Learn from the Best"},"features":{"zh":["数据可视化","数据分析","故事讲述技巧","数据驱动决策","行动导向的见解"],"ja":["データビジュアライゼーション","データ分析","ストーリーテリング技術","データドリブンの意思決定","行動指向のインサイト"],"ko":["데이터 시각화","데이터 분석","스토리텔링 기술","데이터 주도적인 의사 결정","행동 지향적인 통찰"],"es":["Transformación de datos en historias","Técnicas de narrativa de datos efectivas","Impulso de decisiones y acción","Aplicación de mejores prácticas","Validación de resultados"],"fr":["Transformation des données en récits","Techniques de narration de données efficaces","Stimulation de la prise de décision et l''action","Application des meilleures pratiques","Validation des résultats"],"de":["Umwandlung von Rohdaten in Erzählungen","Effektive Techniken des Datenstorytellings","Förderung von Entscheidungen und Aktionen","Anwendung von Best Practices","Validierung von Ergebnissen"],"pt":["Transformação de dados crus em narrativas convincentes","Aplicação de práticas recomendadas para validação de resultados","Fornecimento de etapas ação e verificação","Acesso a exemplos detalhados para implementação","Desenvolvimento de habilidades para impulsionar decisões e inspirar ação"],"ru":["Преобразование сырых данных в убедительные нарративы","Применение рекомендуемых практик для проверки результатов","Предоставление действенных шагов и проверки","Доступ к подробным примерам для реализации","Развитие навыков для стимулирования принятия решений и вдохновения на действие"],"ar":["تحويل البيانات الخام إلى قصص مقنعة","تطبيق الممارسات الموصى بها لتحقق النتائج","توفير خطوات العمل والتحقق","الوصول إلى الأمثلة التفصيلية للتطبيق","تنمية المهارات لتحفيز القرارات وتلهين العمل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["数据故事讲述","数据可视化","数据分析","数据驱动决策","行动导向的见解","商业智能","数据科学"],"ja":["データストーリーテリング","データビジュアライゼーション","データ分析","データドリブンの意思決定","行動指向のインサイト","ビジネスインテリジェンス","データサイエンス"],"ko":["데이터 스토리텔링","데이터 시각화","데이터 분석","데이터 주도적인 의사 결정","행동 지향적인 통찰","비즈니스 인텔리전스","데이터 사이언스"],"es":["narrativa de datos","transformación de datos","técnicas de narrativa de datos","impulso de decisiones","acción basada en datos","mejores prácticas de datos"],"fr":["narration de données","transformation des données","techniques de narration de données","stimulation de la prise de décision","action basée sur les données","meilleures pratiques de données"],"de":["Datenstorytelling","Umwandlung von Rohdaten","Techniken des Datenstorytellings","Förderung von Entscheidungen","Aktionen basierend auf Daten","Best Practices für Daten"],"pt":["contar histórias com dados","narrativas de dados","tomada de decisões","inspiração para ação","práticas recomendadas para dados","validação de resultados","desenvolvimento de habilidades"],"ru":["рассказывание историй с данными","нарративы данных","принятие решений","вдохновение на действие","рекомендуемые практики для данных","проверка результатов","развитие навыков"],"ar":["رواية القصص مع البيانات","قصص البيانات","القرارات","التلهين للعمل","الممارسات الموصى بها للبيانات","التحقق من النتائج","تنمية المهارات"]}},"owner":"boisenoise","repo":"skills-collections","repoPath":"boisenoise/skills-collections","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.428Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"data-storytelling","description":"Transform data into compelling narratives using visualization, context, and persuasive structure. Use when presenting analytics to stakeholders, creating data reports, or building executive presentations.","bodyPreview":"# Data Storytelling\n\nTransform raw data into compelling narratives that drive decisions and inspire action.\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to data storytelling\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\n## Use","body":"# Data Storytelling\n\nTransform raw data into compelling narratives that drive decisions and inspire action.\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to data storytelling\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Presenting analytics to executives\n- Creating quarterly business reviews\n- Building investor presentations\n- Writing data-driven reports\n- Communicating insights to non-technical audiences\n- Making recommendations based on data\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Story Structure\n\n```\nSetup → Conflict → Resolution\n\nSetup: Context and baseline\nConflict: The problem or opportunity\nResolution: Insights and recommendations\n```\n\n### 2. Narrative Arc\n\n```\n1. Hook: Grab attention with surprising insight\n2. Context: Establish the baseline\n3. Rising Action: Build through data points\n4. Climax: The key insight\n5. Resolution: Recommendations\n6. Call to Action: Next steps\n```\n\n### 3. Three Pillars\n\n| Pillar        | Purpose  | Components                       |\n| ------------- | -------- | -------------------------------- |\n| **Data**      | Evidence | Numbers, trends, comparisons     |\n| **Narrative** | Meaning  | Context, causation, implications |\n| **Visuals**   | Clarity  | Charts, diagrams, highlights     |\n\n## Story Frameworks\n\n### Framework 1: The Problem-Solution Story\n\n```markdown\n# Customer Churn Analysis\n\n## The Hook\n\n\"We''re losing $2.4M annually to preventable churn.\"\n\n## The Context\n\n- Current churn rate: 8.5% (industry average: 5%)\n- Average customer lifetime value: $4,800\n- 500 customers churned last quarter\n\n## The Problem\n\nAnalysis of churned customers reveals a pattern:\n\n- 73% churned within first 90 days\n- Common factor: < 3 support interactions\n- Low feature adoption in first month\n\n## The Insight\n\n[Show engagement curve visualization]\nCustomers who don''t engage in the first 14 days\nare 4x more likely to churn.\n\n## The Solution\n\n1. Implement 14-day onboarding sequence\n2. Proactive outreach at day 7\n3. Feature adoption tracking\n\n## Expected Impact\n\n- Reduce early churn by 40%\n- Save $960K annually\n- Payback period: 3 months\n\n## Call to Action\n\nApprove $50K budget for onboarding automation.\n```\n\n### Framework 2: The Trend Story\n\n```markdown\n# Q4 Performance Analysis\n\n## Where We Started\n\nQ3 ended with $1.2M MRR, 15% below target.\nTeam morale was low after missed goals.\n\n## What Changed\n\n[Timeline visualization]\n\n- Oct: Launched self-serve pricing\n- Nov: Reduced friction in signup\n- Dec: Added customer success calls\n\n## The Transformation\n\n[Before/after comparison chart]\n| Metric | Q3 | Q4 | Change |\n|----------------|--------|--------|--------|\n| Trial → Paid | 8% | 15% | +87% |\n| Time to Value | 14 days| 5 days | -64% |\n| Expansion Rate | 2% | 8% | +300% |\n\n## Key Insight\n\nSelf-serve + high-touch creates compound growth.\nCustomers who self-serve AND get a success call\nhave 3x higher expansion rate.\n\n## Going Forward\n\nDouble down on hybrid model.\nTarget: $1.8M MRR by Q2.\n```\n\n### Framework 3: The Comparison Story\n\n```markdown\n# Market Opportunity Analysis\n\n## The Question\n\nShould we expand into EMEA or APAC first?\n\n## The Comparison\n\n[Side-by-side market analysis]\n\n### EMEA\n\n- Market size: $4.2B\n- Growth rate: 8%\n- Competition: High\n- Regulatory: Complex (GDPR)\n- Language: Multiple\n\n### APAC\n\n- Market size: $3.8B\n- Growth rate: 15%\n- Competition: Moderate\n- Regulatory: Varied\n- Language: Multiple\n\n## The Analysis\n\n[Weighted scoring matrix visualization]\n\n| Factor      | Weight | EMEA Score | APAC Score |\n| ----------- | ------ | ---------- | ---------- |\n| Market Size | 25%    | 5          | 4          |\n| Growth      | 30%    | 3          | 5          |\n| Competition | 20%    | 2          | 4          |\n| Ease        | 25%    | 2          | 3          |\n| **Total**   |        | **2.9**    | **4.1**    |\n\n## The Recommendation\n\nAPAC first. Higher growth, less competition.\nStart with Singapore hub (English, business-friendly).\nEnter EMEA in Year 2 with localization ready.\n\n## Risk Mitigation\n\n- Timezone coverage: Hire 24/7 support\n- Cultural fit: Local partnerships\n- Payment: Multi-currency from day 1\n```\n\n## Visualization Techniques\n\n### Technique 1: Progressive Reveal\n\n```markdown\nStart simple, add layers:\n\nSlide 1: \"Revenue is growing\" [single line chart]\nSlide 2: \"But growth is slowing\" [add growth rate overlay]\nSlide 3: \"Driven by one segment\" [add segment breakdown]\nSlide 4: \"Which is saturating\" [add market share]\nSlide 5: \"We need new segments\" [add opportunity zones]\n```\n\n### Technique 2: Contrast and Compare\n\n```markdown\nBefore/After:\n┌─────────────────┬─────────────────┐\n│ BEFORE │ AFTER │\n│ │ │\n│ Process: 5 days│ Process: 1 day │\n│ Errors: 15% │ Errors: 2% │\n│ Cost: $50/unit │ Cost: $20/unit │\n└─────────────────┴─────────────────┘\n\nThis/That (emphasize difference):\n┌─────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ CUSTOMER A vs B │\n│ ┌──────────┐ ┌──────────┐ │\n│ │ ████████ │ │ ██ │ │\n│ │ $45,000 │ │ $8,000 │ │\n│ │ LTV │ │ LTV │ │\n│ └──────────┘ └──────────┘ │\n│ Onboarded No onboarding │\n└─────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### Technique 3: Annotation and Highlight\n\n```python\nimport matplotlib.pyplot as plt\nimport pandas as pd\n\nfig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(12, 6))\n\n# Plot the main data\nax.plot(dates, revenue, linewidth=2, color=''#2E86AB'')\n\n# Add annotation for key events\nax.annotate(\n    ''Product Launch\\n+32% spike'',\n    xy=(launch_date, launch_revenue),\n    xytext=(launch_date, launch_revenue * 1.2),\n    fontsize=10,\n    arrowprops=dict(arrowstyle=''->'', color=''#E63946''),\n    color=''#E63946''\n)\n\n# Highlight a region\nax.axvspan(growth_start, growth_end, alpha=0.2, color=''green'',\n           label=''Growth Period'')\n\n# Add threshold line\nax.axhline(y=target, color=''gray'', linestyle=''--'',\n           label=f''Target: ${target:,.0f}'')\n\nax.set_title(''Revenue Growth Story'', fontsize=14, fontweight=''bold'')\nax.legend()\n```\n\n## Presentation Templates\n\n### Template 1: Executive Summary Slide\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  KEY INSIGHT                                                │\n│  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════│\n│                                                             │\n│  \"Customers who complete onboarding in week 1              │\n│   have 3x higher lifetime value\"                           │\n│                                                             │\n├──────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                      │                                      │\n│  THE DATA            │  THE IMPLICATION                     │\n│                      │                                      │\n│  Week 1 completers:  │  ✓ Prioritize onboarding UX         │\n│  • LTV: $4,500       │  ✓ Add day-1 success milestones     │\n│  • Retention: 85%    │  ✓ Proactive week-1 outreach        │\n│  • NPS: 72           │                                      │\n│                      │  Investment: $75K                    │\n│  Others:             │  Expected ROI: 8x                    │\n│  • LTV: $1,500       │                                      │\n│  • Retention: 45%    │                                      │\n│  • NPS: 34           │                                      │\n│                      │                                      │\n└──────────────────────┴──────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### Template 2: Data Story Flow\n\n```\nSlide 1: THE HEADLINE\n\"We can grow 40% faster by fixing onboarding\"\n\nSlide 2: THE CONTEXT\nCurrent state metrics\nIndustry benchmarks\nGap analysis\n\nSlide 3: THE DISCOVERY\nWhat the data revealed\nSurprising finding\nPattern identification\n\nSlide 4: THE DEEP DIVE\nRoot cause analysis\nSegment breakdowns\nStatistical significance\n\nSlide 5: THE RECOMMENDATION\nProposed actions\nResource requirements\nTimeline\n\nSlide 6: THE IMPACT\nExpected outcomes\nROI calculation\nRisk assessment\n\nSlide 7: THE ASK\nSpecific request\nDecision needed\nNext steps\n```\n\n### Template 3: One-Page Dashboard Story\n\n```markdown\n# Monthly Business Review: January 2024\n\n## THE HEADLINE\n\nRevenue up 15% but CAC increasing faster than LTV\n\n## KEY METRICS AT A GLANCE\n\n┌────────┬────────┬────────┬────────┐\n│ MRR │ NRR │ CAC │ LTV │\n│ $125K │ 108% │ $450 │ $2,200 │\n│ ▲15% │ ▲3% │ ▲22% │ ▲8% │\n└────────┴────────┴────────┴────────┘\n\n## WHAT''S WORKING\n\n✓ Enterprise segment growing 25% MoM\n✓ Referral program driving 30% of new logos\n✓ Support satisfaction at all-time high (94%)\n\n## WHAT NEEDS ATTENTION\n\n✗ SMB acquisition cost up 40%\n✗ Trial conversion down 5 points\n✗ Time-to-value increased by 3 days\n\n## ROOT CAUSE\n\n[Mini chart showing SMB vs Enterprise CAC trend]\nSMB paid ads becoming less efficient.\nCPC up 35% while conversion flat.\n\n## RECOMMENDATION\n\n1. Shift $20K/mo from paid to content\n2. Launch SMB self-serve trial\n3. A/B test shorter onboarding\n\n## NEXT MONTH''S FOCUS\n\n- Launch content marketing pilot\n- Complete self-serve MVP\n- Reduce time-to-value to < 7 days\n```\n\n## Writing Techniques\n\n### Headlines That Work\n\n```markdown\nBAD: \"Q4 Sales Analysis\"\nGOOD: \"Q4 Sales Beat Target by 23% - Here''s Why\"\n\nBAD: \"Customer Churn Report\"\nGOOD: \"We''re Losing $2.4M to Preventable Churn\"\n\nBAD: \"Marketing Performance\"\nGOOD: \"Content Marketing Delivers 4x ROI vs. Paid\"\n\nFormula:\n[Specific Number] + [Business Impact] + [Actionable Context]\n```\n\n### Transition Phrases\n\n```markdown\nBuilding the narrative:\n• \"This leads us to ask...\"\n• \"When we dig deeper...\"\n• \"The pattern becomes clear when...\"\n• \"Contrast this with...\"\n\nIntroducing insights:\n• \"The data reveals...\"\n• \"What surprised us was...\"\n• \"The inflection point came when...\"\n• \"The key finding is...\"\n\nMoving to action:\n• \"This insight suggests...\"\n• \"Based on this analysis...\"\n• \"The implication is clear...\"\n• \"Our recommendation is...\"\n```\n\n### Handling Uncertainty\n\n```markdown\nAcknowledge limitations:\n• \"With 95% confidence, we can say...\"\n• \"The sample size of 500 shows...\"\n• \"While correlation is strong, causation requires...\"\n• \"This trend holds for [segment], though [caveat]...\"\n\nPresent ranges:\n• \"Impact estimate: $400K-$600K\"\n• \"Confidence interval: 15-20% improvement\"\n• \"Best case: X, Conservative: Y\"\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Do''s\n\n- **Start with the \"so what\"** - Lead with insight\n- **Use the rule of three** - Three points, three comparisons\n- **Show, don''t tell** - Let data speak\n- **Make it personal** - Connect to audience goals\n- **End with action** - Clear next steps\n\n### Don''ts\n\n- **Don''t data dump** - Curate ruthlessly\n- **Don''t bury the insight** - Front-load key findings\n- **Don''t use jargon** - Match audience vocabulary\n- **Don''t show methodology first** - Context, then method\n- **Don''t forget the narrative** - Numbers need meaning\n\n## Resources\n\n- [Storytelling with Data (Cole Nussbaumer)](https://www.storytellingwithdata.com/)\n- [The Pyramid Principle (Barbara Minto)](https://www.amazon.com/Pyramid-Principle-Logic-Writing-Thinking/dp/0273710516)\n- [Resonate (Nancy Duarte)](https://www.duarte.com/resonate/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:59:05.628Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Insight Agents needing advanced data narrative capabilities to drive decision-making.","zh":"非常适合需要高级数据叙述能力来驱动决策的洞察代理。","ja":"意思決定を促進するために高度なデータナラティブ機能を必要とするインサイトエージェントに最適です。","ko":"의사 결정을 주도하는 고급 데이터 이야기 기능을 필요로하는 인사이트 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Insight que necesitan capacidades de narrativa de datos avanzadas para impulsar la toma de decisiones.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Insight qui ont besoin de capacités de narration de données avancées pour stimuler la prise de décision.","de":"Perfekt für Insight-Agents, die erweiterte Daten-Erzählungsfähigkeiten benötigen, um Entscheidungen zu treffen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Insight que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de narrativa de dados para impulsionar a tomada de decisões.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Insight, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности повествования данных для принятия решений.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الاستكشاف الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة في سرد البيانات لدفع اتخاذ القرارات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to transform raw data into compelling narratives using best practices, driving decisions and inspiring action with validated outcomes and actionable steps, leveraging data visualization protocols and libraries.","zh":"赋予代理能力，使用最佳实践将原始数据转化为有力的叙述，驱动决策和激发行动，利用验证的结果和可行的步骤，利用数据可视化协议和库。","ja":"ベストプラクティスを使用して生データを説得力のある物語に変換することで、意思決定を促進し、検証された成果と実行可能なステップを利用して行動を促し、データ可視化プロトコルとライブラリを利用してエージェントをEmpowerする。","ko":"베스트 프랙티스를 사용하여 원시 데이터를 설득력 있는 이야기로 변환하여 의사 결정을 주도하고 검증된 결과와 행동 가능한 단계를 활용하여 행동을 촉발하면서 데이터 시각화 프로토콜 및 라이브러리를 활용하여 에이전트를 강화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a transformar datos brutos en narrativas convincentes utilizando las mejores prácticas, impulsando decisiones e inspirando acciones con resultados validados y pasos realizables, aprovechando protocolos y bibliotecas de visualización de datos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de transformer les données brutes en récits convaincants en utilisant les meilleures pratiques, en stimulant les décisions et en inspirant l''action avec des résultats validés et des étapes réalisables, en exploitant les protocoles et les bibliothèques de visualisation de données.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, rohe Daten in überzeugende Erzählungen umzuwandeln, indem sie bewährte Verfahren anwenden, Entscheidungen treffen und mit validierten Ergebnissen und umsetzbaren Schritten handeln, indem sie Datenvisualisierungsprotokolle und -bibliotheken nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a transformar dados brutos em narrativas convincentes usando as melhores práticas, impulsionando decisões e inspirando ações com resultados validados e etapas executáveis, aproveitando protocolos e bibliotecas de visualização de dados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью преобразовывать сырые данные в убедительные повествования, используя лучшие практики, стимулируя принятие решений и вдохновляя действия с проверенными результатами и выполнимыми шагами, используя протоколы и библиотеки визуализации данных.","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على تحويل البيانات الخام إلى قصص مقنعة باستخدام أفضل الممارسات ، مما يدفع القرارات ويلهم العمل بالنتائج المُثبَتة والخطوات القابلة للتنفيذ ، مستفيدا من بروتوكولات ومكتبات تمثيل البيانات."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating data analysis reports","Generating interactive dashboards for stakeholder engagement","Creating data-driven presentations for executive summaries"],"zh":["自动化数据分析报告","生成交互式仪表板以吸引利益相关者","创建数据驱动的演示文稿以总结高管摘要"],"ja":["データ分析レポートの自動化","ステークホルダーへの関与のためのインタラクティブなダッシュボードの生成","エグゼクティブ要約のためのデータドリブンのプレゼンテーションの作成"],"ko":["데이터 분석 보고서 자동화","스테이크홀더 참여를 위한 대화형 대시보드 생성","이사 요약을 위한 데이터 주도 프레젠테이션 생성"],"es":["Automatización de informes de análisis de datos","Generación de paneles interactivos para la participación de las partes interesadas","Creación de presentaciones impulsadas por datos para resúmenes ejecutivos"],"fr":["Automatisation des rapports d''analyse de données","Génération de tableaux de bord interactifs pour l''engagement des parties prenantes","Création de présentations axées sur les données pour les résumés exécutifs"],"de":["Automatisierung von Datenanalyseberichten","Erzeugung interaktiver Dashboards für die Einbindung von Beteiligten","Erstellung von datengetriebenen Präsentationen für Executive-Zusammenfassungen"],"pt":["Automatizar relatórios de análise de dados","Gerar painéis interativos para engajamento de partes interessadas","Criar apresentações orientadas por dados para resumos executivos"],"ru":["Автоматизировать отчеты анализа данных","Генерировать интерактивные панели для вовлечения заинтересованных сторон","Создавать данные-ориентированные презентации для исполнительных резюме"],"ar":["آليّة تقارير تحليل البيانات","توليد لوحات تفاعلية لتعزيز参与 أصحاب المصلحة","إنشاء عروض تقديمية مبنية على البيانات لأ目的 Резюме التنفيذي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires data inputs and clear goals","Limited to data storytelling domain and tools"],"zh":["需要数据输入和明确的目标","仅限数据故事领域和工具"],"ja":["データ入力と明確な目標が必要","データストーリーテリングのドメインとツールに限定されている"],"ko":["데이터 입력 및 명확한 목표가 필요","데이터 스토리 텔링 도메인 및 도구에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere entradas de datos y objetivos claros","Limitado al dominio y las herramientas de narración de datos"],"fr":["Nécessite des entrées de données et des objectifs clairs","Limité au domaine et aux outils de narration de données"],"de":["Benötigt Daten-Eingaben und klare Ziele","Begrenzt auf den Bereich und die Werkzeuge der Daten-Erzählung"],"pt":["Requer entradas de dados e metas claras","Limitado ao domínio e ferramentas de storytelling de dados"],"ru":["Требует ввода данных и четких целей","Ограничен областью и инструментами повествования данных"],"ar":["يتطلب إدخال البيانات وأهداف واضحة","محدود بنطاق وأدوات سرد البيانات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
