rsion d''URL en Markdown avec baoyu-url-to-markdown","de":"Umwandlung von URL in Markdown mit baoyu-url-to-markdown","pt":"Conversão de URL para Markdown com baoyu-url-to-markdown","ru":"Преобразование URL в Markdown с baoyu-url-to-markdown","ar":"تحويل URL إلى Markdown باستخدام baoyu-url-to-markdown","en":"baoyu-url-to-markdown"},"description":{"zh":"baoyu-url-to-markdown是一个轻量级的URL转Markdown工具，使用Chrome CDP和TypeScript构建","ja":"baoyu-url-to-markdownは、Chrome CDPとTypeScriptを使用して構築された軽量のURLをMarkdownに変換するツールです","ko":"baoyu-url-to-markdown은 Chrome CDP와 TypeScript로 구축된 경량의 URL을 Markdown로 변환하는 도구입니다","es":"baoyu-url-to-markdown es un framework de asistente personal AI ultra ligero y extensible que convierte URLs en markdown limpio.","fr":"baoyu-url-to-markdown est un framework d''assistant personnel IA ultra léger et extensible qui convertit les URL en markdown propre.","de":"baoyu-url-to-markdown ist ein ultra leichtes und erweiterbares Framework für persönliche KI-Assistenten, das URLs in sauberes Markdown umwandelt.","pt":"O baoyu-url-to-markdown é um framework leve e extensível para converter URLs em Markdown, projetado para desenvolvedores.","ru":"Baoyu-url-to-markdown — это легкий и расширяемый фреймворк для преобразования URL в Markdown, предназначенный для разработчиков.","ar":"إطار العمل baoyu-url-to-markdown هو حل خفيف وممتد لتحويل عناوين URL إلى Markdown، مصمم للمطورين.","en":"An ultra-lightweight, extensible personal AI assistant framework built with TypeScript. Nanobot TS is designed to be your personal companion, capable of hand..."},"definition":{"en":"An ultra-lightweight, extensible personal AI assistant framework built with TypeScript. Nanobot TS is designed to be your personal companion, capable of handling complex tasks through a robust agent loop, memory system, and tool integration."},"features":{"zh":["使用Chrome CDP抓取URL","将HTML转换为干净的Markdown格式","支持TypeScript","轻量级和可扩展","简单易用的API"],"ja":["Chrome CDPを使用してURLを取得","HTMLをクリーンなMarkdown形式に変換","TypeScriptをサポート","軽量で拡張可能","シンプルで使いやすいAPI"],"ko":["Chrome CDP를 사용하여 URL을 가져옴","HTML을 깨끗한 Markdown 형식으로 변환","TypeScript를 지원","경량級이고 확장 가능","간단하고 dễ用的 API"],"es":["Conversión de URLs en markdown limpio","Integración con Chrome CDP","Marco de trabajo ultra ligero y extensible","Compatibilidad con TypeScript","Sistema de memoria y bucle de agente robusto"],"fr":["Conversion d''URL en markdown propre","Intégration avec Chrome CDP","Cadre de travail ultra léger et extensible","Compatibilité avec TypeScript","Système de mémoire et boucle d''agent robuste"],"de":["Umwandlung von URLs in sauberes Markdown","Integration mit Chrome CDP","Ultra leichtes und erweiterbares Framework","Kompatibilität mit TypeScript","Robustes Speichersystem und Agentenloop"],"pt":["Conversão de URL em Markdown","Uso do Chrome CDP para fetch de URLs","Código leve e extensível","Suporte a scripts personalizados","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Преобразование URL в Markdown","Использование Chrome CDP для получения URL","Легкий и расширяемый код","Поддержка пользовательских скриптов","Интеграция с инструментами разработки"],"ar":["تحويل عناوين URL إلى Markdown","استخدام Chrome CDP لاسترجاع عناوين URL","كود خفيف وممتد","دعم البرامج النصية المخصصة","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["URL转Markdown","Chrome CDP","TypeScript","Markdown转换","开发工具","轻量级工具"],"ja":["URLをMarkdownに変換","Chrome CDP","TypeScript","Markdown変換","開発ツール","軽量ツール"],"ko":["URL을 Markdown로 변환","Chrome CDP","TypeScript","Markdown 변환","개발 도구","경량 도구"],"es":["conversión de URL a markdown","baoyu-url-to-markdown","Chrome CDP","TypeScript","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","framework de asistente personal AI"],"fr":["conversion d''URL en markdown","baoyu-url-to-markdown","Chrome CDP","TypeScript","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","cadre de travail d''assistant personnel IA"],"de":["Umwandlung von URL in Markdown","baoyu-url-to-markdown","Chrome CDP","TypeScript","Softwareentwicklung","Entwicklungstools","Framework für persönliche KI-Assistenten"],"pt":["conversão de url para markdown","baoyu-url-to-markdown","desenvolvimento web","typescript","chrome cdp","markdown","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["преобразование url в markdown","baoyu-url-to-markdown","веб-разработка","typescript","chrome cdp","markdown","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["تحويل url إلى markdown","baoyu-url-to-markdown","تطوير الويب","typescript","chrome cdp","markdown","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"chengyihua","repo":"nanobot-ts","repoPath":"chengyihua/nanobot-ts","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.428Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"baoyu-url-to-markdown","description":"Fetch any URL and convert to markdown using Chrome CDP. Supports two modes - auto-capture on page load, or wait for user signal (for pages requiring login). Use when user wants to save a webpage as markdown.","bodyPreview":"# URL to Markdown\n\nFetches any URL via Chrome CDP and converts HTML to clean markdown.\n\n## Script Directory\n\n**Important**: All scripts are located in the `scripts/` subdirectory of this skill.\n\n**Agent Execution Instructions**:\n1. Determine this SKILL.md file''s directory path as `SKILL_DIR`\n2. Script path = `${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/<script-name>.ts`\n3. Replace all `${SKILL_DIR}` in this document with the actual path\n\n**Script Reference**:\n| Script | Purpose |\n|--------|---------|\n| `scripts/main.t","body":"# URL to Markdown\n\nFetches any URL via Chrome CDP and converts HTML to clean markdown.\n\n## Script Directory\n\n**Important**: All scripts are located in the `scripts/` subdirectory of this skill.\n\n**Agent Execution Instructions**:\n1. Determine this SKILL.md file''s directory path as `SKILL_DIR`\n2. Script path = `${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/<script-name>.ts`\n3. Replace all `${SKILL_DIR}` in this document with the actual path\n\n**Script Reference**:\n| Script | Purpose |\n|--------|---------|\n| `scripts/main.ts` | CLI entry point for URL fetching |\n\n## Preferences (EXTEND.md)\n\nUse Bash to check EXTEND.md existence (priority order):\n\n```bash\n# Check project-level first\ntest -f .baoyu-skills/baoyu-url-to-markdown/EXTEND.md && echo \"project\"\n\n# Then user-level (cross-platform: $HOME works on macOS/Linux/WSL)\ntest -f \"$HOME/.baoyu-skills/baoyu-url-to-markdown/EXTEND.md\" && echo \"user\"\n```\n\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┬───────────────────┐\n│                          Path                          │     Location      │\n├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────┤\n│ .baoyu-skills/baoyu-url-to-markdown/EXTEND.md          │ Project directory │\n├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────┤\n│ $HOME/.baoyu-skills/baoyu-url-to-markdown/EXTEND.md    │ User home         │\n└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┴───────────────────┘\n\n┌───────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  Result   │                                  Action                                   │\n├───────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Found     │ Read, parse, apply settings                                               │\n├───────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Not found │ Use defaults                                                              │\n└───────────┴───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n**EXTEND.md Supports**: Default output directory | Default capture mode | Timeout settings\n\n## Features\n\n- Chrome CDP for full JavaScript rendering\n- Two capture modes: auto or wait-for-user\n- Clean markdown output with metadata\n- Handles login-required pages via wait mode\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\n# Auto mode (default) - capture when page loads\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts <url>\n\n# Wait mode - wait for user signal before capture\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts <url> --wait\n\n# Save to specific file\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts <url> -o output.md\n```\n\n## Options\n\n| Option | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `<url>` | URL to fetch |\n| `-o <path>` | Output file path (default: auto-generated) |\n| `--wait` | Wait for user signal before capturing |\n| `--timeout <ms>` | Page load timeout (default: 30000) |\n\n## Capture Modes\n\n| Mode | Behavior | Use When |\n|------|----------|----------|\n| Auto (default) | Capture on network idle | Public pages, static content |\n| Wait (`--wait`) | User signals when ready | Login-required, lazy loading, paywalls |\n\n**Wait mode workflow**:\n1. Run with `--wait` → script outputs \"Press Enter when ready\"\n2. Ask user to confirm page is ready\n3. Send newline to stdin to trigger capture\n\n## Output Format\n\nYAML front matter with `url`, `title`, `description`, `author`, `published`, `captured_at` fields, followed by converted markdown content.\n\n## Output Directory\n\n```\nurl-to-markdown/<domain>/<slug>.md\n```\n\n- `<slug>`: From page title or URL path (kebab-case, 2-6 words)\n- Conflict resolution: Append timestamp `<slug>-YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS.md`\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n| Variable | Description |\n|----------|-------------|\n| `URL_CHROME_PATH` | Custom Chrome executable path |\n| `URL_DATA_DIR` | Custom data directory |\n| `URL_CHROME_PROFILE_DIR` | Custom Chrome profile directory |\n\n**Troubleshooting**: Chrome not found → set `URL_CHROME_PATH`. Timeout → increase `--timeout`. Complex pages → try `--wait` mode.\n\n## Extension Support\n\nCustom configurations via EXTEND.md. See **Preferences** section for paths and supported options.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:59:35.454Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Web Scraping Agents needing HTML to Markdown conversion capabilities via Chrome CDP.","zh":"非常适合需要通过 Chrome CDP 将 HTML 转换为 Markdown 的 Web Scraping 代理。","ja":"Chrome CDP を使用して HTML を Markdown に変換する Web Scraping エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Chrome CDP를 통해 HTML을 Markdown로 변환하는 Web Scraping 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Scraping Web que necesitan capacidades de conversión de HTML a Markdown a través de Chrome CDP.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de scraping Web ayant besoin de capacités de conversion de HTML en Markdown via Chrome CDP.","de":"Perfekt für Web Scraping Agenten, die HTML-zu-Markdown-Konvertierungsfunktionen über Chrome CDP benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de raspagem web que necessitam de capacidades de conversão de HTML para Markdown via Chrome CDP.","ru":"Идеально подходит для веб-скрапинговых агентов, которым необходимы возможности преобразования HTML в Markdown через Chrome CDP.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات حفر الويب التي تحتاج إلى khảیات تحويل HTML إلى Markdown عبر Chrome CDP."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to fetch URLs and convert HTML to clean markdown, leveraging TypeScript and Chrome CDP for robust web scraping capabilities, handling complex HTML structures and generating readable markdown content.","zh":"赋予代理从 URL 获取并将 HTML 转换为干净的 Markdown 的能力，利用 TypeScript 和 Chrome CDP 实现强大的 Web 抓取功能，处理复杂的 HTML 结构并生成可读的 Markdown 内容。","ja":"TypeScript と Chrome CDP を活用して、エージェントが URL を取得し、HTML をクリーンな Markdown に変換する能力を提供し、複雑な HTML 構造に対応し、読みやすい Markdown コンテンツを生成します。","ko":"에이전트가 URL을 가져와 HTML을 깨끗한 Markdown로 변환할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 TypeScript와 Chrome CDP를 사용하여 강력한 웹 스크레이핑 기능을 구현하고 복잡한 HTML 구조를 처리하며 가독성 있는 Markdown 콘텐츠를 생성합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a recuperar URLs y convertir HTML a markdown limpio, aprovechando TypeScript y Chrome CDP para capacidades de scraping web robustas, manejo de estructuras HTML complejas y generación de contenido de markdown legible.","fr":"Permet aux agents de récupérer des URL et de convertir le HTML en markdown propre, en exploitant TypeScript et Chrome CDP pour des capacités de scraping web robustes, en gérant des structures HTML complexes et en générant du contenu markdown lisible.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, URLs abzurufen und HTML in sauberes Markdown umzuwandeln, indem es TypeScript und Chrome CDP für robuste Web-Scraping-Funktionen nutzt, komplexe HTML-Strukturen handhabt und lesbaren Markdown-Inhalt generiert.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a buscar URLs e converter HTML em markdown limpo, aproveitando o TypeScript e o Chrome CDP para capacidades robustas de raspagem web, lidando com estruturas HTML complexas e gerando conteúdo de markdown legível.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью извлекать URL-адреса и преобразовывать HTML в чистый markdown, используя TypeScript и Chrome CDP для надежных возможностей веб-скрапинга, обработки сложных структур HTML и генерации читаемого содержимого markdown.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على استرداد عناوين URL وتحويل HTML إلى markdown نظيف ، مستفيداً من TypeScript و Chrome CDP للحصول على قدرات حفر الويب القوية ، ومعالجة الهياكل HTML المعقدة وتوليد محتوى markdown قابل للقراءة."},"useCases":{"en":["Converting web pages to markdown for archival purposes","Generating markdown documentation from HTML-based APIs","Fetching and formatting HTML content for further natural language processing"],"zh":["将网页转换为 Markdown 以存档目的","从基于 HTML 的 API 生成 Markdown 文档","获取和格式化 HTML 内容以进行进一步的自然语言处理"],"ja":["アーカイブ目的で Web ページを Markdown に変換する","HTML ベースの API から Markdown ドキュメントを生成する","さらに自然言語処理を行うために HTML コンテンツを取得してフォーマットする"],"ko":["보관 목적으로 웹 페이지를 Markdown로 변환하는 것","HTML 기반 API에서 Markdown 문서를 생성하는 것","추가적인 자연어 처리를 위해 HTML 콘텐츠를 가져와서 형식화하는 것"],"es":["Convertir páginas web a markdown para fines de archivo","Generar documentación de markdown a partir de APIs basadas en HTML","Recuperar y dar formato a contenido HTML para un posterior procesamiento de lenguaje natural"],"fr":["Convertir des pages Web en markdown pour des fins d''archivage","Générer une documentation markdown à partir d''API basées sur HTML","Récupérer et formatter du contenu HTML pour un traitement ultérieur du langage naturel"],"de":["Webseiten in Markdown für Archivzwecke umwandeln","Markdown-Dokumentation aus HTML-basierten APIs generieren","HTML-Inhalt abrufen und formatieren für weitere natürliche Sprachverarbeitung"],"pt":["Conversão de páginas da web em markdown para fins de arquivamento","Geração de documentação markdown a partir de APIs baseadas em HTML","Recuperação e formatação de conteúdo HTML para processamento de linguagem natural adicional"],"ru":["Преобразование веб-страниц в markdown для архивных целей","Генерация документации markdown из HTML-ориентированных API","Извлечение и форматирование HTML-контента для дальнейшего обработки естественного языка"],"ar":["تحويل صفحات الويب إلى markdown لأغراض الأرشفة","توليد توثيق markdown من واجهات برمجة التطبيقات القائمة على HTML","استرجاع وتشكيل محتوى HTML لمعالجة اللغة الطبيعية الإضافية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Chrome CDP setup","TypeScript environment needed","Dependent on script execution in the `scripts/` subdirectory"],"zh":["需要 Chrome CDP 设置","需要 TypeScript 环境","依赖于 `scripts/` 子目录中的脚本执行"],"ja":["Chrome CDP の設定が必要","TypeScript 環境が必要","`scripts/` サブディレクトリ内のスクリプトの実行に依存する"],"ko":["Chrome CDP 설정이 필요함","TypeScript 환경이 필요함","`scripts/` 하위 디렉토리 내의 스크립트 실행에 의존함"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Chrome CDP","Entorno de TypeScript necesario","Dependiente de la ejecución de scripts en el subdirectorio `scripts/`"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de Chrome CDP","Environnement TypeScript nécessaire","Dépend de l''exécution de scripts dans le sous-répertoire `scripts/`"],"de":["Benötigt Chrome-CDP-Setup","TypeScript-Umgebung erforderlich","Abhängig von der Skriptausführung im Unterordner `scripts/`"],"pt":["Requer configuração do Chrome CDP","Ambiente TypeScript necessário","Dependente da execução de scripts no subdiretório `scripts/`"],"ru":["Требуется настройка Chrome CDP","Необходимо окружение TypeScript","Зависит от выполнения скриптов в подкаталоге `scripts/`"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Chrome CDP","بيئة TypeScript ضرورية","يعتمد على تنفيذ البرامج النصية في المجلد الفرعي `scripts/`"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
