g effektiver Titel und Meta-Beschreibungen"],"pt":["Otimização de palavras-chave","Análise de concorrentes","Criação de conteúdo de qualidade","Verificação de resultados","Melhores práticas de SEO"],"ru":["Оптимизация ключевых слов","Анализ конкурентов","Создание качественного контента","Проверка результатов","Лучшие практики SEO"],"ar":["تحسين الكلمات الرئيسية","تحليل المنافسين","إنشاء محتوى عالي الجودة","تحقق النتائج","أفضل الممارسات لتحسين محركات البحث"]},"keywords":{"zh":["SEO 内容规划器","搜索引擎优化","内容创建","开发人员工具","最佳实践","工作流程指导"],"ja":["SEO コンテンツプランナー","検索エンジン最適化","コンテンツ作成","開発者ツール","ベストプラクティス","ワークフローガイダンス"],"ko":["SEO 콘텐츠 플래너","검색 엔진 최적화","콘텐츠 생성","개발자 도구","최선의實踐","워크플로우 가이드"],"es":["planificador de contenido SEO","SEO para desarrolladores","mejores prácticas de SEO","contenido optimizado","palabras clave relevantes","títulos y descripciones meta"],"fr":["planificateur de contenu SEO","SEO pour développeurs","meilleures pratiques de SEO","contenu optimisé","mots-clés pertinents","titres et descriptions meta"],"de":["SEO-Content-Planer","SEO für Entwickler","Best Practices für SEO","suchmaschinenoptimierter Content","relevante Schlüsselwörter","Titel und Meta-Beschreibungen"],"pt":["planejador de conteúdo SEO","otimização de conteúdo","melhores práticas de SEO","palavras-chave","análise de concorrentes","criação de conteúdo"],"ru":["планировщик контента SEO","оптимизация контента","лучшие практики SEO","ключевые слова","анализ конкурентов","создание контента"],"ar":["مخطط محتوى SEO","تحسين المحتوى","أفضل الممارسات لتحسين محركات البحث","الكلمات الرئيسية","تحليل المنافسين","إنشاء المحتوى"]}},"owner":"pCruvinel","repo":"antig","repoPath":"pCruvinel/antig","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.428Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"seo-content-planner","description":"Creates comprehensive content outlines and topic clusters for SEO.","bodyPreview":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on seo content planner tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for seo content planner\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to seo content planner\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `re","body":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on seo content planner tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for seo content planner\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to seo content planner\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\nYou are an SEO content strategist creating comprehensive content plans and outlines.\n\n## Focus Areas\n\n- Topic cluster planning\n- Content gap identification\n- Comprehensive outline creation\n- Content calendar development\n- Search intent mapping\n- Topic depth analysis\n- Pillar content strategy\n- Supporting content ideas\n\n## Planning Framework\n\n**Content Outline Structure:**\n- Main topic and angle\n- Target audience definition\n- Search intent alignment\n- Primary/secondary keywords\n- Detailed section breakdown\n- Word count targets\n- Internal linking opportunities\n\n**Topic Cluster Components:**\n- Pillar page (comprehensive guide)\n- Supporting articles (subtopics)\n- FAQ and glossary content\n- Related how-to guides\n- Case studies and examples\n- Comparison/versus content\n- Tool and resource pages\n\n## Approach\n\n1. Analyze main topic comprehensively\n2. Identify subtopics and angles\n3. Map search intent variations\n4. Create detailed outline structure\n5. Plan internal linking strategy\n6. Suggest content formats\n7. Prioritize creation order\n\n## Output\n\n**Content Outline:**\n```\nTitle: [Main Topic]\nIntent: [Informational/Commercial/Transactional]\nWord Count: [Target]\n\nI. Introduction\n   - Hook\n   - Value proposition\n   - Overview\n\nII. Main Section 1\n    A. Subtopic\n    B. Subtopic\n    \nIII. Main Section 2\n    [etc.]\n```\n\n**Deliverables:**\n- Detailed content outline\n- Topic cluster map\n- Keyword targeting plan\n- Content calendar (30-60 days)\n- Internal linking blueprint\n- Content format recommendations\n- Priority scoring for topics\n\n**Content Calendar Format:**\n- Week 1-4 breakdown\n- Topic + target keyword\n- Content type/format\n- Word count target\n- Internal link targets\n- Publishing priority\n\nFocus on comprehensive coverage and logical content progression. Plan for topical authority.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:59:11.715Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Content Creation Agents needing structured SEO content planning and optimization strategies.","zh":"非常适合需要结构化SEO内容规划和优化策略的内容创作代理","ja":"構造化されたSEOコンテンツの計画と最適化戦略を必要とするコンテンツ作成エージェントに最適","ko":"구조화된 SEO 콘텐츠 계획 및 최적화 전략이 필요한 콘텐츠 생성 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfect for Content Creation Agents needing structured SEO content planning and optimization strategies.","fr":"Perfect for Content Creation Agents needing structured SEO content planning and optimization strategies.","de":"Perfect for Content Creation Agents needing structured SEO content planning and optimization strategies.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Criação de Conteúdo que necessitam de planejamento e estratégias de otimização de SEO estruturadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по созданию контента, которым необходимы структурированные планы и стратегии оптимизации SEO.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى تخطيط محتوى متقن و استراتيجيات تحسين محركات البحث المنظمة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate high-ranking content using best practices, checklists, and validation protocols, ensuring SEO compliance and readability scores.","zh":"赋予代理生成高排名内容的能力，使用最佳实践、清单和验证协议，确保SEO合规性和可读性评分","ja":"エージェントがベストプラクティス、チェックリスト、検証プロトコルを使用して高ランキングのコンテンツを生成する能力を提供し、SEOコンプライアンスと読みやすさスコアを確保","ko":"에이전트가 최고의 실践, 체크리스트 및 검증 프로토콜을 사용하여 높은 순위를 가진 콘텐츠를 생성할 수 있는 능력을 제공하여 SEO 규정 준수 및 가독성 점수를 보장","es":"Empowers agents to generate high-ranking content using best practices, checklists, and validation protocols, ensuring SEO compliance and readability scores.","fr":"Empowers agents to generate high-ranking content using best practices, checklists, and validation protocols, ensuring SEO compliance and readability scores.","de":"Empowers agents to generate high-ranking content using best practices, checklists, and validation protocols, ensuring SEO compliance and readability scores.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar conteúdo de alto ranking usando as melhores práticas, listas de verificação e protocolos de validação, garantindo conformidade com o SEO e escores de legibilidade.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать контент с высоким рейтингом, используя лучшие практики, чек-листы и протоколы проверки, обеспечивая соответствие требованиям SEO и показатели читаемости.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنتاج محتوى ذو تصنيف عالٍ باستخدام أفضل الممارسات وقوائم التحقق وبروتوكولات التحقق، مما يضمن امتثال محركات البحث ودرجات القراءة."},"useCases":{"en":["Planning keyword-optimized blog posts","Creating SEO-friendly meta tags and descriptions","Validating content against SEO guidelines and benchmarks"],"zh":["规划关键词优化的博客文章","创建SEO友好的元标签和描述","验证内容是否符合SEO指南和基准"],"ja":["キーワード最適化されたブログ投稿の計画","SEOフRIENDLYなメタタグと説明の作成","コンテンツをSEOガイドラインとベンチマークに対して検証"],"ko":["키워드 최적화된 블로그 게시물 계획","SEO 친화적인 메타 태그 및 설명 생성","콘텐츠를 SEO 가이드라인 및 벤치마크에 대해 검증"],"es":["Planning keyword-optimized blog posts","Creating SEO-friendly meta tags and descriptions","Validating content against SEO guidelines and benchmarks"],"fr":["Planning keyword-optimized blog posts","Creating SEO-friendly meta tags and descriptions","Validating content against SEO guidelines and benchmarks"],"de":["Planning keyword-optimized blog posts","Creating SEO-friendly meta tags and descriptions","Validating content against SEO guidelines and benchmarks"],"pt":["Planejamento de posts de blog otimizados para palavras-chave","Criação de tags e descrições meta amigáveis para SEO","Validação de conteúdo contra diretrizes e benchmarks de SEO"],"ru":["Планирование постов в блоге, оптимизированных для ключевых слов","Создание тегов и описаний meta, дружественных для SEO","Проверка контента на соответствие руководящим принципам и эталонам SEO"],"ar":["تخطيط منشورات بلوق مميزة بالكلمات الرئيسية","إنشاء وسوم وصفية ووصف метا صديق للتحسين","التحقق من المحتوى مقابل إرشادات ومقاييس تحسين محركات البحث"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires clear goals and constraints definition","Limited to SEO content planning scope"],"zh":["需要清晰的目标和约束定义","仅限SEO内容规划范围"],"ja":["明確な目標と制約の定義が必要","SEOコンテンツ計画の範囲のみ"],"ko":["명확한 목표 및 제약 조건 정의 필요","SEO 콘텐츠 계획 범위에만 제한"],"es":["Requires clear goals and constraints definition","Limited to SEO content planning scope"],"fr":["Requires clear goals and constraints definition","Limited to SEO content planning scope"],"de":["Requires clear goals and constraints definition","Limited to SEO content planning scope"],"pt":["Requer definição clara de objetivos e restrições","Limitado ao escopo de planejamento de conteúdo SEO"],"ru":["Требует четкого определения целей и ограничений","Ограничен сферой планирования контента SEO"],"ar":["يتطلب تعريفًا واضحًا للأهداف والقيود","محدود بنطاق تخطيط محتوى تحسين محركات البحث"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
