n":{"zh":"Compliance Manager 提供数据保护和法规遵从，包括PCI-DSS、GDPR、PSD2、SOX和HIPAA","ja":"Compliance Manager は、データ保護と規制遵守を提供し、PCI-DSS、GDPR、PSD2、SOX、HIPAAを含む","ko":"Compliance Manager는 데이터 보호 및 규정 준수를 제공하며, PCI-DSS, GDPR, PSD2, SOX 및 HIPAA를 포함","es":"El Gestor de Cumplimiento ofrece protección de datos y cumplimiento normativo para PCI-DSS, GDPR, PSD2, SOX y HIPAA","fr":"Le Gestionnaire de Conformité propose une protection des données et une conformité réglementaire pour PCI-DSS, GDPR, PSD2, SOX et HIPAA","de":"Der Compliance-Manager bietet Datenschutz und Einhaltung von Vorschriften für PCI-DSS, GDPR, PSD2, SOX und HIPAA","pt":"O Gerenciador de Conformidade é um serviço de API abrangente que fornece proteção de dados e cumprimento de regulamentações","ru":"Менеджер соответствия - это комплексная служба API, обеспечивающая защиту данных и соблюдение нормативных актов","ar":"مدير التوافق هو خدمة API شاملة توفر حماية البيانات وامتثال اللوائح","en":"Onasis Gateway - Comprehensive API service warehouse with MCP server interfaces and REST endpoints"},"definition":{"en":"Onasis Gateway - Comprehensive API service warehouse with MCP server interfaces and REST endpoints"},"features":{"zh":["PCI-DSS数据保护","GDPR合规","PSD2强客户认证","SOX审计跟踪","HIPAA健康数据保护"],"ja":["PCI-DSSデータ保護","GDPRコンプライアンス","PSD2ストロングカスタマーアウθενティケーション","SOX監査トレイル","HIPAAヘルスデータ保護"],"ko":["PCI-DSS 데이터 보호","GDPR 규정 준수","PSD2 강한 고객 인증","SOX 감사 추적","HIPAA 건강 데이터 보호"],"es":["Protección de datos PCI-DSS","Cumplimiento GDPR","Autenticación de cliente fuerte PSD2","Registro de auditoría SOX","Protección de datos de salud HIPAA","Validación de normas regulatorias"],"fr":["Protection des données PCI-DSS","Conformité GDPR","Authentification client forte PSD2","Journal d''audit SOX","Protection des données de santé HIPAA","Validation des normes réglementaires"],"de":["Datenschutz PCI-DSS","Einhalung von GDPR","Starke Kundenauthentifizierung PSD2","SOX-Audit-Trail","Gesundheitsschutz HIPAA","Validierung von Vorschriften"],"pt":["Proteção de dados de pagamento (PCI-DSS)","Cumprimento da GDPR","Cumprimento da PSD2","Registro de auditoria seguro","Proteção de dados de saúde (HIPAA)","Validação de regulamentações múltiplas"],"ru":["Защита платежных данных (PCI-DSS)","Соблюдение GDPR","Соблюдение PSD2","Безопасный аудитный журнал","Защита медицинских данных (HIPAA)","Проверка нескольких нормативных актов"],"ar":["حماية بيانات الدفع (PCI-DSS)","امتثال اللوائح العامة لحماية البيانات (GDPR)","امتثال اللوائح المالية (PSD2)","تسجيل تدقيق آمن","حماية البيانات الصحية (HIPAA)","التحقق من لوائح متعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Compliance Manager","数据保护","法规遵从","PCI-DSS","GDPR","PSD2","SOX","HIPAA"],"ja":["Compliance Manager","データ保護","規制遵守","PCI-DSS","GDPR","PSD2","SOX","HIPAA"],"ko":["Compliance Manager","데이터 보호","규정 준수","PCI-DSS","GDPR","PSD2","SOX","HIPAA"],"es":["gestor de cumplimiento","protección de datos","cumplimiento normativo","PCI-DSS","GDPR","PSD2","SOX","HIPAA","seguridad de la información"],"fr":["gestionnaire de conformité","protection des données","conformité réglementaire","PCI-DSS","GDPR","PSD2","SOX","HIPAA","sécurité de l''information"],"de":["compliance-manager","datenschutz","einhalung von vorschriften","PCI-DSS","GDPR","PSD2","SOX","HIPAA","informationssicherheit"],"pt":["gerenciador de conformidade","proteção de dados","PCI-DSS","GDPR","PSD2","HIPAA","segurança da informação","conformidade regulatória"],"ru":["менеджер соответствия","защита данных","PCI-DSS","GDPR","PSD2","HIPAA","информационная безопасность","регуляторное соответствие"],"ar":["مدير التوافق","حماية البيانات","PCI-DSS","اللوائح العامة لحماية البيانات","اللوائح المالية","HIPAA","أمن المعلومات","الامتثال اللوائحي"]}},"owner":"thefixer3x","repo":"onasis-gateway","repoPath":"thefixer3x/onasis-gateway","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.428Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"compliance-manager","description":"Guardrails for edits to core/security/compliance-manager.js that preserve PCI/GDPR/PSD2/SOX/HIPAA controls (masking, encryption, SCA, consent checks, and audit logging). Use when changing compliance validators, security handling, or audit flows.","bodyPreview":"# Compliance Manager Guardian\n\n## Purpose & Scope\n\nApply this skill when modifying `core/security/compliance-manager.js`.\n\nThe Compliance Manager provides:\n- PCI-DSS data protection (card data masking, encryption)\n- GDPR compliance (pseudonymization, consent management, data minimization)\n- PSD2 compliance (Strong Customer Authentication)\n- SOX audit trail requirements\n- HIPAA health data protection\n- Multi-regulation validation framework\n- Secure audit logging\n\n## Non-Negotiables (Never Do)\n\n##","body":"# Compliance Manager Guardian\n\n## Purpose & Scope\n\nApply this skill when modifying `core/security/compliance-manager.js`.\n\nThe Compliance Manager provides:\n- PCI-DSS data protection (card data masking, encryption)\n- GDPR compliance (pseudonymization, consent management, data minimization)\n- PSD2 compliance (Strong Customer Authentication)\n- SOX audit trail requirements\n- HIPAA health data protection\n- Multi-regulation validation framework\n- Secure audit logging\n\n## Non-Negotiables (Never Do)\n\n### Compliance Validators\n- Never disable or bypass compliance validators.\n- Never weaken validation rules (for example, making required checks optional).\n- Never skip validation for \"trusted\" sources.\n- Never add bypass flags or debug modes that skip compliance.\n\n### PCI-DSS Rules\n- Never log these PCI fields (even in debug mode):\n  - `cvv`, `cvv2`, `cvc`, `cvc2`, `cid`, `cav2`\n  - `pin`, `pinBlock`\n  - `track1`, `track2`, `magneticStripe`\n- Never weaken card masking:\n  - Must show only first 6 and last 4 digits.\n  - Middle digits must be masked with `*`.\n- Never reduce encryption below AES-256-GCM.\n- Never store CVV/PIN after authorization.\n\n### GDPR Rules\n- Never process personal data without consent check.\n- Never skip pseudonymization for personal identifiers.\n- Never retain personal data beyond retention period.\n- Never disable data minimization for analytics.\n\n### PSD2 Rules\n- Never reduce SCA requirements below 2 factors.\n- Never bypass SCA for amounts over threshold.\n- Never skip transaction monitoring for high-value transactions.\n- Never disable cumulative amount tracking.\n\n### Audit Logging\n- Never skip audit logging for sensitive operations.\n- Never delete or modify existing audit entries.\n- Never log sensitive data in audit trails (mask first).\n- Never disable audit persistence.\n\n### Security Rollback\n- Never rollback security fixes without security team approval.\n- Never lower security levels in production.\n\n## Required Patterns (Must Follow)\n\n### Card Number Masking\n```javascript\n// Must mask showing only first 6 and last 4\nmaskCardNumber(cardNumber) {\n    const cleaned = cardNumber.replace(/\\D/g, '''');\n    const first6 = cleaned.substring(0, 6);\n    const last4 = cleaned.substring(cleaned.length - 4);\n    const masked = ''*''.repeat(cleaned.length - 10);\n    return `${first6}${masked}${last4}`;\n}\n// Example: 4111111111111111 -> 411111******1111\n```\n\n### Data Encryption\n```javascript\n// Must use AES-256-GCM\nencryptSensitiveData(data) {\n    const algorithm = ''aes-256-gcm'';  // Do not change\n    const key = process.env.ENCRYPTION_KEY;\n    if (!key) throw new Error(''ENCRYPTION_KEY is required'');\n\n    // 12-byte IV is recommended for GCM\n    const iv = crypto.randomBytes(12);\n\n    // Prefer @onasis/security-sdk for key handling if available\n    // If ENCRYPTION_KEY is a passphrase, derive a 32-byte key via scrypt.\n    const keyBuf = (key.length === 64 && /^[0-9a-f]+$/i.test(key))\n        ? Buffer.from(key, ''hex'')\n        : crypto.scryptSync(key, ''onasis-gateway'', 32);\n\n    const cipher = crypto.createCipheriv(''aes-256-gcm'', keyBuf, iv);\n    cipher.setAAD(Buffer.from(''compliance-encryption''));\n\n    const plaintext = typeof data === ''string'' ? data : JSON.stringify(data);\n    const ciphertext = Buffer.concat([cipher.update(plaintext, ''utf8''), cipher.final()]);\n    const authTag = cipher.getAuthTag();\n\n    return {\n        encrypted: ciphertext.toString(''base64''),\n        iv: iv.toString(''hex''),\n        authTag: authTag.toString(''hex''),\n        algorithm\n    };\n}\n```\n\n### Strong Customer Authentication\n```javascript\n// Must require 2+ factors\nvalidateSCA(data) {\n    const factors = [];\n\n    if (data.password || data.pin) factors.push(''knowledge'');\n    if (data.deviceId || data.token) factors.push(''possession'');\n    if (data.biometric || data.fingerprint) factors.push(''inherence'');\n\n    return factors.length >= 2;  // PSD2 requirement\n}\n```\n\n### Defense in Depth\n```javascript\n// Must apply all applicable protections\nenforceDataHandling(serviceId, data, operation) {\n    let processedData = { ...data };\n\n    if (service?.compliance?.pci) {\n        processedData = this.applyPCIProtections(processedData, operation);\n    }\n    if (service?.compliance?.gdpr) {\n        processedData = this.applyGDPRProtections(processedData, operation);\n    }\n    if (service?.compliance?.psd2) {\n        processedData = this.applyPSD2Protections(processedData, operation);\n    }\n\n    return processedData;\n}\n```\n\n### Audit Entry Creation\n```javascript\n// Must create audit entry for all compliance events\nlogAuditEntry(action, details) {\n    const entry = {\n        timestamp: new Date(),\n        action,\n        details,\n        id: crypto.randomUUID()\n    };\n\n    this.auditLog.push(entry);\n    this.emit(''audit:logged'', entry);\n    this.persistAuditEntry(entry);  // Must persist\n}\n```\n\n## Prohibited Fields Registry\n\n| Field | Regulation | Storage | Logging | Transmission |\n|-------|------------|---------|---------|--------------|\n| cvv, cvv2, cvc, cvc2 | PCI-DSS 3.2 | Never | Never | HTTPS only |\n| pin, pinBlock | PCI-DSS 3.4 | Never | Never | Encrypted |\n| track1, track2 | PCI-DSS 3.2 | Never | Never | Never |\n| magneticStripe | PCI-DSS 3.2 | Never | Never | Never |\n| Full card number | PCI-DSS 3.4 | Encrypted | Masked | Encrypted |\n\n## Integration Points\n\n| Component | Integration Method |\n|-----------|-------------------|\n| Base Client | Data passed through `enforceDataHandling()` |\n| Metrics Collector | `compliance_violations_total` metric |\n| API Routes | Middleware for request validation |\n| Database | Audit entries persisted to `audit.compliance_log` |\n\n## Compliance Validation Checklist\n\nBefore deploying changes:\n- [ ] Card data properly masked (first 6, last 4 only).\n- [ ] CVV/PIN never logged or stored.\n- [ ] Encryption uses AES-256-GCM.\n- [ ] SCA requires 2+ factors.\n- [ ] Audit entries created for all operations.\n- [ ] GDPR consent check in place.\n- [ ] Data minimization applied for analytics.\n- [ ] No PII in metric labels.\n- [ ] Audit log persisted to secure storage.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:01:03.378Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Regulatory Compliance Agents needing advanced data protection and encryption capabilities for PCI-DSS, GDPR, and HIPAA","zh":"非常适合需要高级数据保护和加密功能的PCI-DSS、GDPR和HIPAA监管合规代理","ja":"PCI-DSS、GDPR、HIPAAの高度なデータ保護および暗号化機能を必要とする規制コンプライアンスエージェントに最適","ko":"고급 데이터 보호 및 암호화 기능이 필요한 PCI-DSS, GDPR, HIPAA 규제 준수 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de cumplimiento normativo que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de protección y cifrado de datos para PCI-DSS, GDPR y HIPAA","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de conformité réglementaire ayant besoin de capacités de protection et de chiffrement de données avancées pour PCI-DSS, GDPR et HIPAA","de":"Perfekt für Compliance-Agents, die erweiterte DatenSchutz- und Verschlüsselungsfunktionen für PCI-DSS, GDPR und HIPAA benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Conformidade Regulatória que necessitam de proteção de dados avançada e capacidades de criptografia para PCI-DSS, GDPR e HIPAA","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по соблюдению нормативных требований, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности защиты данных и шифрования для PCI-DSS, GDPR и HIPAA","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المتعلقين بالامتثال التنظيمي الذين يحتاجون إلى حماية بيانات متقدمة و possibilités التشفير لـ PCI-DSS و GDPR و HIPAA"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce robust compliance frameworks using REST endpoints and MCP server interfaces, ensuring secure audit logging, pseudonymization, and consent management for multi-regulation validation","zh":"使代理能够使用REST端点和MCP服务器接口强制执行强大的合规框架，确保安全的审计日志记录、匿名化和同意管理，以实现多项法规验证","ja":"エージェントがRESTエンドポイントおよびMCPサーバーインターフェイスを使用して堅牢なコンプライアンスフレームワークを施行できるようにし、多規制の有効性確認のためのセキュアな監査ログ記録、仮名化、同意管理を確保する","ko":"에이전트가 REST 엔드포인트 및 MCP 서버 인터페이스를 사용하여 강력한 컴플라이언스 프레임워크를 시행할 수 있도록 하여 다중 규제 유효성 검사에 대한 보안 감사 로깅, 가명화 및 동의 관리를 보장","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar marcos de cumplimiento sólidos utilizando puntos de conexión REST y interfaces de servidor MCP, garantizando un registro de auditoría seguro, la pseudonimización y la gestión de consentimiento para la validación de múltiples regulaciones","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des cadres de conformité robustes en utilisant des points de terminaison REST et des interfaces de serveur MCP, garantissant un enregistrement d''audit sécurisé, la pseudonymisation et la gestion du consentement pour la validation de plusieurs réglementations","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, robuste Compliance-Rahmen mithilfe von REST-Endpunkten und MCP-Server-Schnittstellen umzusetzen, wodurch sichere Audit-Protokollierung, Pseudonymisierung und Zustimmungsverwaltung für die Validierung mehrerer Vorschriften gewährleisten lassen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor estruturas de conformidade robustas usando endpoints REST e interfaces de servidor MCP, garantindo registro de auditoria seguro, pseudonimização e gerenciamento de consentimento para validação de multi-regulação","ru":"Позволяет агентам реализовывать прочные рамки соответствия с помощью точек REST и интерфейсов сервера MCP, обеспечивая безопасный ведение аудиторских журналов, псевдонимизацию и управление согласием для đa-регуляторной проверки","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من فرض إطارات الامتثال القوية باستخدام نقاط النهاية REST وواجهات خادم MCP، مما يضمن تسجيل تدقيق آمن وتشوير مجهول الهوية وإدارة الموافقة للتحقق من العدید من اللوائح"},"useCases":{"en":["Enforcing PCI-DSS data protection for card transactions","Implementing GDPR compliance for user consent management","Validating SOX audit trail requirements for financial data"],"zh":["强制执行卡交易的PCI-DSS数据保护","实施用户同意管理的GDPR合规性","验证金融数据的SOX审计跟踪要求"],"ja":["カード取引のPCI-DSSデータ保護の施行","ユーザー同意管理のGDPRコンプライアンスの実施","金融データのSOX監査トレイル要件の検証"],"ko":["카드 거래의 PCI-DSS 데이터 보호 강제","사용자 동의 관리의 GDPR 컴플라이언스 구현","금융 데이터의 SOX 감사 추적 요구 사항 검증"],"es":["Aplicar la protección de datos PCI-DSS para transacciones con tarjeta","Implementar el cumplimiento de GDPR para la gestión del consentimiento del usuario","Validar los requisitos de auditoría SOX para datos financieros"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre la protection des données PCI-DSS pour les transactions par carte","Implémenter la conformité GDPR pour la gestion du consentement des utilisateurs","Valider les exigences de traçabilité SOX pour les données financières"],"de":["Umsetzung des PCI-DSS-Datenschutzes für Kreditkarten-Transaktionen","Implementierung der GDPR-Konformität für die Nutzerzustimmungsverwaltung","Validierung der SOX-Audit-Anforderungen für Finanzdaten"],"pt":["Aplicando proteção de dados PCI-DSS para transações de cartão","Implementando conformidade GDPR para gerenciamento de consentimento do usuário","Validando requisitos de auditoria SOX para dados financeiros"],"ru":["Применение защиты данных PCI-DSS для транзакций по карте","Реализация соответствия GDPR для управления согласием пользователей","Проверка требований аудита SOX для финансовых данных"],"ar":["تطبيق حماية البيانات PCI-DSS على معاملات البطاقة","تنفيذ الامتثال GDPR لإدارة موافقة المستخدم","التحقق من متطلبات تدقيق SOX للبيانات المالية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Onasis Gateway API access","Dependent on MCP server interfaces and REST endpoints"],"zh":["需要Onasis Gateway API访问","依赖于MCP服务器接口和REST端点"],"ja":["Onasis Gateway APIへのアクセスが必要","MCPサーバーインターフェイスおよびRESTエンドポイントに依存"],"ko":["Onasis Gateway API 액세스가 필요함","MCP 서버 인터페이스 및 REST 엔드포인트에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la API de Onasis Gateway","Dependiente de las interfaces de servidor MCP y los puntos de conexión REST"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''API Onasis Gateway","Dépend des interfaces de serveur MCP et des points de terminaison REST"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Onasis-Gateway-API","Abhängig von MCP-Server-Schnittstellen und REST-Endpunkten"],"pt":["Exige acesso à API do Gateway Onasis","Dependente de interfaces de servidor MCP e endpoints REST"],"ru":["Требует доступа к API шлюза Onasis","Зависит от интерфейсов сервера MCP и точек REST"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى واجهة برمجة تطبيقات بوابة Onasis","يعتمد على واجهات خادم MCP ونقاط النهاية REST"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Asmayaseen/hackathon-2/building-chat-interfaces', 'community', 'Asmayaseen', 'hackathon-2', 'Asmayaseen/hackathon-2', 'building-chat-interfaces', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.428Z', '2026-02-18T05:01:25.650Z', NULL, '{"id":"Asmayaseen/hackathon-2/building-chat-interfaces","name":"building-chat-interfaces","description":{"zh":"构建生产级AI聊天界面，实现自定义后端集成","ja":"生産性の高いAIチャットインターフェースを構築し、カスタムバックエンド統合を実現","ko":"프로덕션급 AI 채팅 인터페이스를 구축하여 사용자 지정 백엔드 통합을 실현","es":"Construye interfaces de chat de nivel de producción con integración de backend personalizada","fr":"Créez des interfaces de chat de niveau de production avec intégration de backend personnalisée","de":"Erstellen Sie Chat-Schnittstellen mit benutzerdefinierter Backend-Integration für die Produktion","pt":"Construa interfaces de chat de produção com integração personalizada de backend e frontend. Aprenda a usar o ChatKit para criar soluções de chat personalizadas.","ru":"Создайте интерфейсы чата для производства с пользовательской интеграцией backend и frontend. Узнайте, как использовать ChatKit для создания пользовательских решений чата.","ar":"ابني واجهات الدردشة الإنتاجية مع التكامل الخلفي والامامي المخصص. تعلم كيفية استخدام ChatKit لإنشاء حلول دردشة مخصصة.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"构建聊天界面","ja":"チャットインターフェースの構築","ko":"채팅 인터페이스 구축","es":"Construye interfaces de chat con AI","fr":"Créez des interfaces de chat avec l''IA","de":"Erstellen Sie Chat-Schnittstellen mit KI","pt":"Construa Interfaces de Chat com Integração Personalizada","ru":"Создание Интерфейсов Чата с Пользовательской Интеграцией","ar":"بناء واجهات الدردشة مع التكامل الخلفي المخصص","en":"building-chat-interfaces"},"description":{"zh":"构建生产级AI聊天界面，实现自定义后端集成","ja":"生産性の高いAIチャットインターフェースを構築し、カスタムバックエンド統合を実現","ko":"프로덕션급 AI 채팅 인터페이스를 구축하여 사용자 지정 백엔드 통합을 실현","es":"Construye interfaces de chat de nivel de producción con integración de backend personalizada","fr":"Créez des interfaces de chat de niveau de production avec intégration de backend personnalisée","de":"Erstellen Sie Chat-Schnittstellen mit benutzerdefinierter Backend-Integration für die Produktion","pt":"Construa interfaces de chat de produção com integração personalizada de backend e frontend. Aprenda a usar o ChatKit para criar soluções de chat personalizadas.","ru":"Создайте интерфейсы чата для производства с пользовательской интеграцией backend и frontend. Узнайте, как использовать ChatKit для создания пользовательских ...","ar":"ابني واجهات الدردشة الإنتاجية مع التكامل الخلفي والامامي المخصص. تعلم كيفية استخدام ChatKit لإنشاء حلول دردشة مخصصة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["自定义后端集成","生产级AI聊天界面","React前端集成","Python后端支持","HTTP/SSE协议支持"],"ja":["カスタムバックエンド統合","生産性の高いAIチャットインターフェース","Reactフロントエンド統合","Pythonバックエンドサポート","HTTP/SSEプロトコルサポート"],"ko":["사용자 지정 백엔드 통합","프로덕션급 AI 채팅 인터페이스","React 프론트엔드 통합","Python 백엔드 지원","HTTP/SSE 프로토콜 지원"],"es":["Integración de backend personalizada","Interfaz de usuario personalizable","Soporte para HTTP y SSE","Compatibilidad con React y Python","Implementación de producción lista","Documentación y soporte técnico"],"fr":["Intégration de backend personnalisée","Interface utilisateur personnalisable","Prise en charge de HTTP et SSE","Compatibilité avec React et Python","Mise en œuvre de production prête","Documentation et support technique"],"de":["Benutzerdefinierte Backend-Integration","Benutzerdefinierte Benutzeroberfläche","Unterstützung für HTTP und SSE","Kompatibilität mit React und Python","Produktionsbereite Implementierung","Dokumentation und technischer Support"],"pt":["Integração personalizada de backend","Frontend personalizado com React","Suporte a HTTP e SSE","Uso do ChatKit para soluções de chat personalizadas","Código de exemplo em Python e JavaScript"],"ru":["Пользовательская интеграция backend","Пользовательский frontend с React","Поддержка HTTP и SSE","Использование ChatKit для пользовательских решений чата","Пример кода на Python и JavaScript"],"ar":["التكامل الخلفي المخصص","الواجهة الأمامية المخصصة مع React","دعم HTTP و SSE","استخدام ChatKit لإنشاء حلول دردشة مخصصة","أمثلة الكود باللغة Python و JavaScript"]},"keywords":{"zh":["聊天界面","AI聊天","自定义后端","生产级AI","React前端","Python后端"],"ja":["チャットインターフェース","AIチャット","カスタムバックエンド","生産性の高いAI","Reactフロントエンド","Pythonバックエンド"],"ko":["채팅 인터페이스","AI 채팅","사용자 지정 백엔드","프로덕션급 AI","React 프론트엔드","Python 백엔드"],"es":["interfaces de chat","integración de backend","desarrollo de chat","react","python","http","sse","producción","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["interfaces de chat","intégration de backend","développement de chat","react","python","http","sse","production","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Chat-Schnittstellen","Backend-Integration","Chat-Entwicklung","React","Python","HTTP","SSE","Produktion","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["interface de chat","integração de backend","frontend personalizado","chatkit","react","python","javascript","desenvolvimento de chat"],"ru":["интерфейс чата","интеграция backend","пользовательский frontend","chatkit","react","python","javascript","разработка чата"],"ar":["واجهة الدردشة","التكامل الخلفي","الواجهة الأمامية المخصصة","chatkit","react","python","javascript","تطوير الدردشة"]}},"owner":"Asmayaseen","repo":"hackathon-2","repoPath":"Asmayaseen/hackathon-2","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.428Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"building-chat-interfaces","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Building Chat Interfaces\r\n\r\nBuild production-grade AI chat interfaces with custom backend integration.\r\n\r\n## Quick Start\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# Backend (Python)\r\nuv add chatkit-sdk agents httpx\r\n\r\n# Frontend (React)\r\nnpm install @openai/chatkit-react\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Core Architecture\r\n\r\n```\r\nFrontend (React)                    Backend (Python)\r\n┌─────────────────┐                ┌─────────────────┐\r\n│  useChatKit()   │───HTTP/SSE───>│  ChatKitServer  │\r\n│  - custom fetch │                │  - respond","body":"# Building Chat Interfaces\r\n\r\nBuild production-grade AI chat interfaces with custom backend integration.\r\n\r\n## Quick Start\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# Backend (Python)\r\nuv add chatkit-sdk agents httpx\r\n\r\n# Frontend (React)\r\nnpm install @openai/chatkit-react\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Core Architecture\r\n\r\n```\r\nFrontend (React)                    Backend (Python)\r\n┌─────────────────┐                ┌─────────────────┐\r\n│  useChatKit()   │───HTTP/SSE───>│  ChatKitServer  │\r\n│  - custom fetch │                │  - respond()    │\r\n│  - auth headers │                │  - store        │\r\n│  - page context │                │  - agent        │\r\n└─────────────────┘                └─────────────────┘\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Backend Patterns\r\n\r\n### 1. ChatKit Server with Custom Agent\r\n\r\n```python\r\nfrom chatkit.server import ChatKitServer\r\nfrom chatkit.agents import stream_agent_response\r\nfrom agents import Agent, Runner\r\n\r\nclass CustomChatKitServer(ChatKitServer[RequestContext]):\r\n    \"\"\"Extend ChatKit server with custom agent.\"\"\"\r\n\r\n    async def respond(\r\n        self,\r\n        thread: ThreadMetadata,\r\n        input_user_message: UserMessageItem | None,\r\n        context: RequestContext,\r\n    ) -> AsyncIterator[ThreadStreamEvent]:\r\n        if not input_user_message:\r\n            return\r\n\r\n        # Load conversation history\r\n        previous_items = await self.store.load_thread_items(\r\n            thread.id, after=None, limit=10, order=\"desc\", context=context\r\n        )\r\n\r\n        # Build history string for prompt\r\n        history_str = \"\\n\".join([\r\n            f\"{item.role}: {item.content}\"\r\n            for item in reversed(previous_items.data)\r\n        ])\r\n\r\n        # Extract context from metadata\r\n        user_info = context.metadata.get(''userInfo'', {})\r\n        page_context = context.metadata.get(''pageContext'', {})\r\n\r\n        # Create agent with context in instructions\r\n        agent = Agent(\r\n            name=\"Assistant\",\r\n            tools=[your_search_tool],\r\n            instructions=f\"{history_str}\\nUser: {user_info.get(''name'')}\\n{system_prompt}\",\r\n        )\r\n\r\n        # Run agent with streaming\r\n        result = Runner.run_streamed(agent, input_user_message.content)\r\n        async for event in stream_agent_response(context, result):\r\n            yield event\r\n```\r\n\r\n### 2. Database Persistence\r\n\r\n```python\r\nfrom sqlmodel.ext.asyncio.session import AsyncSession\r\nfrom sqlalchemy.ext.asyncio import create_async_engine\r\n\r\nDATABASE_URL = os.getenv(\"DATABASE_URL\").replace(\"postgresql://\", \"postgresql+asyncpg://\")\r\nengine = create_async_engine(DATABASE_URL, pool_pre_ping=True)\r\n\r\n# Pre-warm connections on startup\r\nasync def warmup_pool():\r\n    async with engine.begin() as conn:\r\n        await conn.execute(text(\"SELECT 1\"))\r\n```\r\n\r\n### 3. JWT/JWKS Authentication\r\n\r\n```python\r\nfrom jose import jwt\r\nimport httpx\r\n\r\nasync def get_current_user(authorization: str = Header()):\r\n    token = authorization.replace(\"Bearer \", \"\")\r\n    async with httpx.AsyncClient() as client:\r\n        jwks = (await client.get(JWKS_URL)).json()\r\n    payload = jwt.decode(token, jwks, algorithms=[\"RS256\"])\r\n    return payload\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Frontend Patterns\r\n\r\n### 1. Custom Fetch Interceptor\r\n\r\n```typescript\r\nconst { control, sendUserMessage } = useChatKit({\r\n  api: {\r\n    url: `${backendUrl}/chatkit`,\r\n    domainKey: domainKey,\r\n\r\n    // Custom fetch to inject auth and context\r\n    fetch: async (url: string, options: RequestInit) => {\r\n      if (!isLoggedIn) {\r\n        throw new Error(''User must be logged in'');\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      const pageContext = getPageContext();\r\n      const userInfo = { id: userId, name: user.name };\r\n\r\n      // Inject metadata into request body\r\n      let modifiedOptions = { ...options };\r\n      if (modifiedOptions.body && typeof modifiedOptions.body === ''string'') {\r\n        const parsed = JSON.parse(modifiedOptions.body);\r\n        if (parsed.params?.input) {\r\n          parsed.params.input.metadata = {\r\n            userId, userInfo, pageContext,\r\n            ...parsed.params.input.metadata,\r\n          };\r\n          modifiedOptions.body = JSON.stringify(parsed);\r\n        }\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      return fetch(url, {\r\n        ...modifiedOptions,\r\n        headers: {\r\n          ...modifiedOptions.headers,\r\n          ''X-User-ID'': userId,\r\n          ''Content-Type'': ''application/json'',\r\n        },\r\n      });\r\n    },\r\n  },\r\n});\r\n```\r\n\r\n### 2. Page Context Extraction\r\n\r\n```typescript\r\nconst getPageContext = useCallback(() => {\r\n  if (typeof window === ''undefined'') return null;\r\n\r\n  const metaDescription = document.querySelector(''meta[name=\"description\"]'')\r\n    ?.getAttribute(''content'') || '''';\r\n\r\n  const mainContent = document.querySelector(''article'') ||\r\n                     document.querySelector(''main'') ||\r\n                     document.body;\r\n\r\n  const headings = Array.from(mainContent.querySelectorAll(''h1, h2, h3''))\r\n    .slice(0, 5)\r\n    .map(h => h.textContent?.trim())\r\n    .filter(Boolean)\r\n    .join('', '');\r\n\r\n  return {\r\n    url: window.location.href,\r\n    title: document.title,\r\n    path: window.location.pathname,\r\n    description: metaDescription,\r\n    headings: headings,\r\n  };\r\n}, []);\r\n```\r\n\r\n### 3. Script Loading Detection\r\n\r\n```typescript\r\nconst [scriptStatus, setScriptStatus] = useState<''pending'' | ''ready'' | ''error''>(\r\n  isBrowser && window.customElements?.get(''openai-chatkit'') ? ''ready'' : ''pending''\r\n);\r\n\r\nuseEffect(() => {\r\n  if (!isBrowser || scriptStatus !== ''pending'') return;\r\n\r\n  if (window.customElements?.get(''openai-chatkit'')) {\r\n    setScriptStatus(''ready'');\r\n    return;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  customElements.whenDefined(''openai-chatkit'').then(() => {\r\n    setScriptStatus(''ready'');\r\n  });\r\n}, []);\r\n\r\n// Only render when ready\r\n{isOpen && scriptStatus === ''ready'' && <ChatKit control={control} />}\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Next.js Integration\r\n\r\n### httpOnly Cookie Proxy\r\n\r\nWhen auth tokens are in httpOnly cookies (can''t be read by JavaScript):\r\n\r\n```typescript\r\n// app/api/chatkit/route.ts\r\nimport { NextRequest, NextResponse } from \"next/server\";\r\nimport { cookies } from \"next/headers\";\r\n\r\nexport async function POST(request: NextRequest) {\r\n  const cookieStore = await cookies();\r\n  const idToken = cookieStore.get(\"auth_token\")?.value;\r\n\r\n  if (!idToken) {\r\n    return NextResponse.json({ error: \"Not authenticated\" }, { status: 401 });\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  const response = await fetch(`${API_BASE}/chatkit`, {\r\n    method: \"POST\",\r\n    headers: {\r\n      Authorization: `Bearer ${idToken}`,\r\n      \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\r\n    },\r\n    body: await request.text(),\r\n  });\r\n\r\n  // Handle SSE streaming\r\n  if (response.headers.get(\"content-type\")?.includes(\"text/event-stream\")) {\r\n    return new Response(response.body, {\r\n      status: response.status,\r\n      headers: {\r\n        \"Content-Type\": \"text/event-stream\",\r\n        \"Cache-Control\": \"no-cache\",\r\n      },\r\n    });\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  return NextResponse.json(await response.json(), { status: response.status });\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Script Loading Strategy\r\n\r\n```tsx\r\n// app/layout.tsx\r\nimport Script from \"next/script\";\r\n\r\nexport default function RootLayout({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {\r\n  return (\r\n    <html lang=\"en\">\r\n      <head>\r\n        {/* MUST be beforeInteractive for web components */}\r\n        <Script\r\n          src=\"https://cdn.platform.openai.com/deployments/chatkit/chatkit.js\"\r\n          strategy=\"beforeInteractive\"\r\n        />\r\n      </head>\r\n      <body>{children}</body>\r\n    </html>\r\n  );\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## MCP Tool Authentication\r\n\r\nMCP protocol doesn''t forward auth headers. Pass credentials via system prompt:\r\n\r\n```python\r\nSYSTEM_PROMPT = \"\"\"You are Assistant.\r\n\r\n## Authentication Context\r\n- User ID: {user_id}\r\n- Access Token: {access_token}\r\n\r\nCRITICAL: When calling ANY MCP tool, include:\r\n- user_id: \"{user_id}\"\r\n- access_token: \"{access_token}\"\r\n\"\"\"\r\n\r\n# Format with credentials\r\ninstructions = SYSTEM_PROMPT.format(\r\n    user_id=context.user_id,\r\n    access_token=context.metadata.get(\"access_token\", \"\"),\r\n)\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Common Pitfalls\r\n\r\n| Issue | Symptom | Fix |\r\n|-------|---------|-----|\r\n| History not in prompt | Agent doesn''t remember conversation | Include history as string in system prompt |\r\n| Context not transmitted | Agent missing user/page info | Add to request metadata, extract in backend |\r\n| Script not loaded | Component fails to render | Detect script loading, wait before rendering |\r\n| Auth headers missing | Backend rejects requests | Use custom fetch interceptor |\r\n| httpOnly cookies | Can''t read token from JS | Create server-side API route proxy |\r\n| First request slow | 7+ second delay | Pre-warm database connection pool |\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Verification\r\n\r\nRun: `python3 scripts/verify.py`\r\n\r\nExpected: `✓ building-chat-interfaces skill ready`\r\n\r\n## If Verification Fails\r\n\r\n1. Check: references/ folder has chatkit-integration-patterns.md\r\n2. **Stop and report** if still failing\r\n\r\n## Related Skills (Tiered System)\r\n\r\n- **streaming-llm-responses** - Tier 2: Response lifecycle, progress updates, client effects\r\n- **building-chat-widgets** - Tier 3: Interactive widgets, entity tagging, composer tools\r\n- **fetching-library-docs** - ChatKit docs: `--library-id /openai/chatkit --topic useChatKit`\r\n\r\n## References\r\n\r\n- [references/chatkit-integration-patterns.md](references/chatkit-integration-patterns.md) - Complete patterns with evidence\r\n- [references/nextjs-httponly-proxy.md](references/nextjs-httponly-proxy.md) - Next.js cookie proxy patterns"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:01:25.650Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full-Stack AI Agents needing production-ready chat interfaces with custom backend integration.","zh":"非常适合需要生产就绪聊天界面并与自定义后端集成的全栈AI代理。","ja":"カスタムバックエンド統合を備えたプロダクションレディなチャットインターフェースを必要とするフルスタックAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"커스텀 백엔드 통합이 가능한 프로덕션 준비된 채팅 인터페이스가 필요한 풀스택 AI 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de inteligencia artificial de pila completa que necesitan interfaces de chat de producción con integración personalizada de backend.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle full-stack nécessitant des interfaces de chat prêtes pour la production avec une intégration de backend personnalisée.","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-KI-Agents, die produktionsbereite Chat-Schnittstellen mit benutzerdefinierter Backend-Integration benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA Full-Stack que precisam de interfaces de chat prontas para produção com integração personalizada de backend.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ Full-Stack, требующих интерфейсов чата, готовых к производству, с настраиваемой интеграцией бэкенда.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الوكيل الكامل الذي يحتاج إلى واجهات دردشة جاهزة للإنتاج مع دمج خلفية مخصص"},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables seamless creation of React-based chat interfaces with Python backend integration using HTTP/SSE protocols. Provides custom fetch capabilities through chatkit-sdk and agents libraries for building responsive AI chat applications.","zh":"支持通过HTTP/SSE协议无缝创建基于React的聊天界面并与Python后端集成。通过chatkit-sdk和agents库提供自定义fetch功能，用于构建响应式AI聊天应用。","ja":"HTTP/SSEプロトコルを使用したPythonバックエンド統合によるReactベースのチャットインターフェースのシームレスな作成を可能にします。chatkit-sdkとagentsライブラリを通じてカスタムフェッチ機能を提供し、応答性の高いAIチャットアプリケーションの構築を支援します。","ko":"HTTP/SSE 프로토콜을 사용한 Python 백엔드 통합과 함께 React 기반 채팅 인터페이스를 원활하게 생성할 수 있습니다. 반응형 AI 채팅 애플리케이션 구축을 위해 chatkit-sdk 및 agents 라이브러리를 통해 커스텀 fetch 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite la creación sin problemas de interfaces de chat basadas en React con integración de backend de Python utilizando protocolos HTTP/SSE. Proporciona capacidades de recuperación personalizadas a través de chatkit-sdk y bibliotecas de agentes para la creación de aplicaciones de chat de inteligencia artificial responsivas.","fr":"Permet la création sans heurts d''interfaces de chat basées sur React avec une intégration de backend Python utilisant les protocoles HTTP/SSE. Fournit des capacités de récupération personnalisées via chatkit-sdk et des bibliothèques d''agents pour la création d''applications de chat d''intelligence artificielle réactives.","de":"Ermöglicht die nahtlose Erstellung von React-basierten Chat-Schnittstellen mit Python-Backend-Integration unter Verwendung von HTTP/SSE-Protokollen. Bietet benutzerdefinierte Abrufmöglichkeiten über chatkit-sdk und Agentenbibliotheken für den Bau von responsiven KI-Chat-Anwendungen.","pt":"Permite a criação sem problemas de interfaces de chat baseadas em React com integração de backend em Python usando protocolos HTTP/SSE. Fornece capacidades de busca personalizadas por meio de chatkit-sdk e bibliotecas de agentes para construir aplicativos de chat de IA responsivos.","ru":"Позволяет легко создавать интерфейсы чата на основе React с интеграцией бэкенда на Python, используя протоколы HTTP/SSE. Предоставляет настраиваемые возможности поиска через chatkit-sdk и библиотеки агентов для построения отзывчивых приложений чата ИИ.","ar":"تمكن من إنشاء واجهات دردشة قائم على رياكت مع دمج خلفية بايثون باستخدام بروتوكولات HTTP/SSE. يوفر قدرات استرجاع مخصصة من خلال chatkit-sdk ومكتبات الوكلاء لإنشاء تطبيقات دردشة ذكية استجابة"},"useCases":{"en":["Integrating custom backend logic with React chat interfaces","Implementing Server-Sent Events (SSE) for real-time chat updates","Building production-grade AI chat applications with Python backend"],"zh":["将自定义后端逻辑与React聊天界面集成","实现服务器发送事件（SSE）以实现实时聊天更新","使用Python后端构建生产级AI聊天应用"],"ja":["カスタムバックエンドロジックとReactチャットインターフェースの統合","リアルタイムチャット更新のためのサーバー送信イベント（SSE）の実装","Pythonバックエンドを使用したプロダクショングレードのAIチャットアプリケーションの構築"],"ko":["커스텀 백엔드 로직과 React 채팅 인터페이스 통합","실시간 채팅 업데이트를 위한 서버 전송 이벤트(SSE) 구현","Python 백엔드를 사용한 프로덕션 등급 AI 채팅 애플리케이션 구축"],"es":["Integración de lógica de backend personalizada con interfaces de chat de React","Implementación de eventos enviados por el servidor (SSE) para actualizaciones de chat en tiempo real","Creación de aplicaciones de chat de inteligencia artificial de grado de producción con backend de Python"],"fr":["Intégration de la logique de backend personnalisée avec des interfaces de chat React","Mise en œuvre d''événements envoyés par le serveur (SSE) pour des mises à jour de chat en temps réel","Création d''applications de chat d''intelligence artificielle de grade de production avec un backend Python"],"de":["Integration von benutzerdefinierter Backend-Logik mit React-Chat-Schnittstellen","Implementierung von Server-Sent-Events (SSE) für Echtzeit-Chat-Updates","Erstellung von produktionsreifen KI-Chat-Anwendungen mit Python-Backend"],"pt":["Integrar lógica de backend personalizada com interfaces de chat em React","Implementar Eventos Enviados pelo Servidor (SSE) para atualizações de chat em tempo real","Construir aplicações de chat de IA de produção com backend em Python"],"ru":["Интегрировать настраиваемую логику бэкенда с интерфейсами чата React","Реализовать события, отправленные сервером (SSE), для обновлений чата в режиме реального времени","Построить приложения чата ИИ производственного уровня с бэкендом на Python"],"ar":["دمج منطق الخلفية المخصصة مع واجهات دردشة رياكت","تنفيذ أحداث مرسلة من الخادم (SSE) لتحديثات الدردشة في الوقت الفعلي","بناء تطبيقات دردشة ذكية من الدرجة الإنتاجية مع خلفية بايثون"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires separate React frontend and Python backend setup","Depends on chatkit-sdk and agents libraries","Needs HTTP/SSE protocol implementation"],"zh":["需要独立的React前端和Python后端设置","依赖chatkit-sdk和agents库","需要实现HTTP/SSE协议"],"ja":["別個のReactフロントエンドとPythonバックエンドの設定が必要","chatkit-sdkとagentsライブラリに依存","HTTP/SSEプロトコルの実装が必要"],"ko":["별도의 React 프론트엔드와 Python 백엔드 설정 필요","chatkit-sdk 및 agents 라이브러리에 종속성","HTTP/SSE 프로토콜 구현 필요"],"es":["Requiere una configuración de frontend de React y backend de Python separada","Depende de chatkit-sdk y bibliotecas de agentes","Necesita implementación del protocolo HTTP/SSE"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de frontend React et de backend Python séparée","Dépend de chatkit-sdk et des bibliothèques d''agents","Nécessite une mise en œuvre du protocole HTTP/SSE"],"de":["Benötigt eine separate React-Frontend- und Python-Backend-Konfiguration","Hängt von chatkit-sdk und Agentenbibliotheken ab","Benötigt eine Implementierung des HTTP/SSE-Protokolls"],"pt":["Exige configuração de frontend React e backend Python separados","Depende de chatkit-sdk e bibliotecas de agentes","Necessita de implementação do protocolo HTTP/SSE"],"ru":["Требует отдельной настройки frontend React и бэкенда Python","Зависит от chatkit-sdk и библиотек агентов","Требует реализации протокола HTTP/SSE"],"ar":["يتطلب إعدادًا منفصلًا لويب رياكت وخلفية بايثون","يعتمد على chatkit-sdk ومكتبات الوكلاء","يحتاج إلى تنفيذ بروتوكول HTTP/SSE"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
