я рекомендаций по улучшению","Применение улучшений","Оптимизация навыков Claude"],"ar":["بحث أفضل الممارسات","تحليل المهارات الحالية","توليد توصيات التحسين","تطبيق التحسينات","تحسين مهارات برنامج Claude"]},"keywords":{"zh":["技能改进器","Claude 技能","最佳实践","技能分析","改进建议","技术开发","软件开发"],"ja":["スキルインプルーバー","クロードスキル","ベストプラクティス","スキル分析","改善提案","技術開発","ソフトウェア開発"],"ko":["스킬 개선자","클라우드 스킬","최적의 방법","스킬 분석","개선 제안","기술 개발","소프트웨어 개발"],"es":["mejorador de habilidades","Claude","desarrollo de habilidades","mejores prácticas","investigación de habilidades","análisis de habilidades"],"fr":["améliorateur de compétences","Claude","développement de compétences","meilleures pratiques","recherche de compétences","analyse de compétences"],"de":["Fähigkeitsverbesserer","Claude","Fähigkeitsentwicklung","beste Praktiken","Fähigkeitsrecherche","Fähigkeitsanalyse"],"pt":["skill-improver","melhorar habilidades","otimizar habilidades","desenvolvedores","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Claude","navegador de habilidades"],"ru":["skill-improver","улучшить навыки","оптимизировать навыки","разработчики","инструменты разработки","Claude","навигатор навыков"],"ar":["skill-improver","تحسين المهارات","تحسين المهارات","مطورون","أدوات التطوير","Claude","متصفح المهارات"]}},"owner":"shakefu","repo":"contextium","repoPath":"shakefu/contextium","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.428Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"skill-improver","description":"Research and improve Claude skills with current best practices. Triggers on requests to improve skills, update skills, research best practices for skills, enhance skill quality, or modernize existing skills.","bodyPreview":"# Skill Improver\n\nResearch current best practices and improve existing Claude skills.\n\n## Process Overview\n\n1. Identify target skill and its domain\n2. Research current best practices (web search)\n3. Analyze existing skill against best practices\n4. Generate improvement recommendations\n5. Apply improvements (if requested)\n\n## Step 1: Identify Target\n\nLocate the skill to improve:\n\n```bash\n# Find skill location\nls -la .claude/skills/<skill-name>/\n```\n\nRead SKILL.md and all references to understand c","body":"# Skill Improver\n\nResearch current best practices and improve existing Claude skills.\n\n## Process Overview\n\n1. Identify target skill and its domain\n2. Research current best practices (web search)\n3. Analyze existing skill against best practices\n4. Generate improvement recommendations\n5. Apply improvements (if requested)\n\n## Step 1: Identify Target\n\nLocate the skill to improve:\n\n```bash\n# Find skill location\nls -la .claude/skills/<skill-name>/\n```\n\nRead SKILL.md and all references to understand current implementation.\n\n## Step 2: Research Best Practices\n\nUse subagents (Task tool) to parallelize research across multiple topics:\n\n```\nSpawn parallel research agents for:\n1. \"<domain> best practices 2026\"\n2. \"<domain> common mistakes to avoid\"\n3. \"Claude AI <domain> techniques\" (if applicable)\n```\n\nEach subagent should return:\n- Key findings with sources\n- Actionable recommendations\n\nFocus areas:\n- Industry standards and conventions\n- Common pitfalls and how to avoid them\n- Performance optimizations\n- Security considerations (if relevant)\n- Token efficiency for LLM skills\n\n## Step 3: Analyze Skill\n\nCompare existing skill against:\n\n| Aspect | Check |\n|--------|-------|\n| **Clarity** | Instructions unambiguous? |\n| **Completeness** | All use cases covered? |\n| **Efficiency** | Minimal tokens for max utility? |\n| **Accuracy** | Reflects current best practices? |\n| **Triggers** | Description covers all valid triggers? |\n| **Structure** | Follows skill-creator guidelines? |\n\n## Step 4: Generate Recommendations\n\nCreate improvement report:\n\n```markdown\n## Skill Improvement Report: <skill-name>\n\n### Summary\n- Current state assessment\n- Key findings from research\n\n### Recommendations\n\n#### High Priority\n1. [Issue]: [Recommended fix]\n\n#### Medium Priority\n1. [Issue]: [Recommended fix]\n\n#### Low Priority / Nice-to-Have\n1. [Suggestion]\n\n### Best Practices Found\n- [Practice 1]: [Source]\n- [Practice 2]: [Source]\n```\n\n## Step 5: Apply Improvements\n\nIf user approves changes:\n\n1. Edit SKILL.md with improvements\n2. Update/add references if needed\n3. Update scripts if applicable\n4. Validate with `scripts/validate_skill.py`\n\n## Guidelines\n\n- **Preserve intent** - Improvements should enhance, not change skill purpose\n- **Cite sources** - Link to best practice sources when recommending changes\n- **Prioritize impact** - Focus on changes that meaningfully improve skill quality\n- **Maintain conciseness** - Don''t bloat skills with unnecessary content\n- **Test triggers** - Ensure description still triggers appropriately after changes\n\nSee `references/research-strategies.md` for search query templates and source evaluation guidelines.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:01:37.321Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like Claude, AutoGPT, and LangChain needing continuous skill enhancement and best practice adoption.","zh":"非常适合需要持续技能提升和最佳实践采用的AI代理，如Claude、AutoGPT和LangChain。","ja":"Claude、AutoGPT、LangChainなど、継続的なスキル向上とベストプラクティスの導入が必要なAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Claude, AutoGPT, LangChain과 같이 지속적인 기술 향상과 최적 방법론 채택이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA como Claude, AutoGPT y LangChain que necesitan una mejora continua de habilidades y adopción de las mejores prácticas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA comme Claude, AutoGPT et LangChain qui ont besoin d''une amélioration continue des compétences et de l''adoption des meilleures pratiques.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents wie Claude, AutoGPT und LangChain, die eine kontinuierliche Fähigkeitsverbesserung und die Übernahme von Best Practices benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA como Claude, AutoGPT e LangChain que necessitam de melhoria contínua de habilidades e adoção de melhores práticas.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude, AutoGPT и LangChain, которым необходима непрерывная улучшение навыков и внедрение лучших практик.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل كلود وأوتو جبت ولانج تشين الذين يحتاجون إلى تحسين مستمر للخبرات وتعزيز أفضل الممارسات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to research current best practices, analyze existing skills against them, and generate improvement recommendations using web search and SKILL.md analysis, ultimately enhancing their overall performance and capabilities.","zh":"使代理能够研究当前最佳实践，根据这些实践分析现有技能，并利用网络搜索和SKILL.md分析生成改进建议，最终提升其整体性能和能力。","ja":"ウェブ検索とSKILL.md分析を使用して、現在のベストプラクティスを調査し、既存のスキルを分析して改善提案を生成し、最終的にエージェントの全体的なパフォーマンスと能力を強化します。","ko":"웹 검색과 SKILL.md 분석을 사용하여 현재 최적 방법론을 연구하고, 기존 기술을 분석하여 개선 기회를 찾으며, 기술 업데이트를 위한 권장 사항을 생성하여 궁극적으로 에이전트의 전반적인 성능과 역량을 향상시킵니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes investigar las mejores prácticas actuales, analizar las habilidades existentes en relación con ellas y generar recomendaciones de mejora utilizando la búsqueda en la web y el análisis de SKILL.md, lo que en última instancia mejora su rendimiento y capacidades generales.","fr":"Permet aux agents de recherche les meilleures pratiques actuelles, d''analyser les compétences existantes par rapport à celles-ci et de générer des recommandations d''amélioration en utilisant la recherche sur le web et l''analyse de SKILL.md, ce qui améliore en fin de compte leur performance et leurs capacités globales.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, aktuelle Best Practices zu recherchieren, vorhandene Fähigkeiten im Vergleich zu diesen zu analysieren und Verbesserungsvorschläge unter Verwendung der Websuche und der SKILL.md-Analyse zu generieren, was letztendlich die Gesamtleistung und -fähigkeiten verbessert.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a pesquisar as melhores práticas atuais, analisar habilidades existentes em relação a elas e gerar recomendações de melhoria usando a pesquisa na web e análise do SKILL.md, melhorando assim seu desempenho geral e capacidades.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью исследовать текущие лучшие практики, анализировать существующие навыки в отношении их и генерировать рекомендации по улучшению с помощью веб-поиска и анализа SKILL.md, в конечном итоге улучшая их общую производительность и возможности.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من البحث عن أفضل الممارسات الحالية، وتحليل الخبرات الحالية فيما يتعلق بها، وتوليد توصيات التحسين باستخدام البحث على الويب وتحليل SKILL.md، مما يعزز أدائهم العام والقدرات في النهاية."},"useCases":{"en":["Researching industry best practices for skill improvement","Analyzing existing skills for enhancement opportunities","Generating recommendations for skill updates"],"zh":["研究行业最佳实践以改进技能","分析现有技能以寻找改进机会","生成技能更新的建议"],"ja":["スキル向上のための業界のベストプラクティスの調査","改善の機会に対する既存スキルの分析","スキル更新のための推奨事項の生成"],"ko":["기술 향상을 위한 업계 최적 방법론 연구","개선 기회를 위한 기존 기술 분석","기술 업데이트를 위한 권장 사항 생성"],"es":["Investigación de las mejores prácticas de la industria para la mejora de habilidades","Análisis de habilidades existentes para identificar oportunidades de mejora","Generación de recomendaciones para actualizaciones de habilidades"],"fr":["Recherche des meilleures pratiques du secteur pour l''amélioration des compétences","Analyse des compétences existantes pour identifier les opportunités d''amélioration","Génération de recommandations pour les mises à jour des compétences"],"de":["Recherche von Branchenbest Practices zur Fähigkeitsverbesserung","Analyse vorhandener Fähigkeiten zur Identifizierung von Verbesserungsmöglichkeiten","Generierung von Vorschlägen für Fähigkeitsupdates"],"pt":["Pesquisando as melhores práticas da indústria para melhoria de habilidades","Analisando habilidades existentes para oportunidades de melhoria","Gerando recomendações para atualizações de habilidades"],"ru":["Изучение лучших практик отрасли для улучшения навыков","Анализ существующих навыков для выявления возможностей улучшения","Генерация рекомендаций для обновления навыков"],"ar":["البحث عن أفضل الممارسات في الصناعة لتحسين الخبرات","تحليل الخبرات الحالية لفرص التحسين","توليد التوصيات لتحديث الخبرات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires web search capabilities","Needs access to SKILL.md files","Limited to improving existing Claude skills"],"zh":["需要具备网络搜索能力","需要访问SKILL.md文件","仅限于改进现有的Claude技能"],"ja":["ウェブ検索機能が必要","SKILL.mdファイルへのアクセスが必要","既存のClaudeスキルの改善に限定される"],"ko":["웹 검색 기능이 필요함","SKILL.md 파일에 대한 접근 권한이 필요함","기존 Claude 기술 개선으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere capacidades de búsqueda en la web","Necesita acceso a archivos SKILL.md","Limitado a la mejora de habilidades de Claude existentes"],"fr":["Nécessite des capacités de recherche sur le web","A besoin d''un accès aux fichiers SKILL.md","Limité à l''amélioration des compétences de Claude existantes"],"de":["Benötigt Websuchfunktionen","Benötigt Zugriff auf SKILL.md-Dateien","Begrenzt auf die Verbesserung vorhandener Claude-Fähigkeiten"],"pt":["Requer capacidades de pesquisa na web","Necessita acesso a arquivos SKILL.md","Limitado a melhorar habilidades existentes do Claude"],"ru":["Требует возможностей веб-поиска","Требует доступа к файлам SKILL.md","Ограничен улучшением существующих навыков Claude"],"ar":["يتطلب قدرات البحث على الويب","يحتاج إلى وصول إلى ملفات SKILL.md","محدود بتحسين الخبرات الحالية لكلود"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
