sibilité","Mise en œuvre de la prise en charge de VoiceOver et TalkBack","Gestion de la mise au point dans les modales et les feuilles inférieures","Annonces à l''écran tactile pour le contenu dynamique","Conformité aux critères d''accessibilité mobile de la WCAG 2.1","Prise en charge des commutateurs"],"de":["Auditoría de la interfaz móvil para problemas de accesibilidad","Implementierung der Unterstützung für VoiceOver und TalkBack","Fokusverwaltung in Modals und Bottom Sheets","Bildschirmannoncen für dynamischen Inhalt","Einhaltung der mobilen Zugänglichkeitskriterien von WCAG 2.1","Unterstützung für Umschalter"],"pt":["Auditoria de interface móvel para problemas de acessibilidade","Implementação de suporte para VoiceOver e TalkBack","Gestão de foco em modais e folhas inferiores","Anúncios de leitor de tela para conteúdo dinâmico","Garantia de que os alvos de toque atendam aos critérios de acessibilidade","Suporte a comutação para pessoas com deficiência"],"ru":["Аудитория мобильного интерфейса для проблем доступности","Реализация поддержки для VoiceOver и TalkBack","Управление фокусом в модальных окнах и нижних листах","Объявления экранного читателя для динамического контента","Гарантия того, что цели касания соответствуют критериям доступности","Поддержка переключения для людей с ограниченными возможностями"],"ar":["تدقيق واجهة المستخدم المتنقلة للعثور على مشاكل في إمكانية الوصول","تنفيذ دعم لبرامج VoiceOver وTalkBack","إدارة التركيز في النماذج وورقة الأسفل","إعلانات برنامج قراءة الشاشة للمحتوى الديناميكي","ضمان أن يستوفي أهداف اللمس معايير إمكانية الوصول","دعم التبديل للأشخاص ذوي الإعاقة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["移动端无障碍访问","VoiceOver","TalkBack","WCAG 2.1","移动应用开发","无障碍设计"],"ja":["モバイルアクセシビリティ","VoiceOver","TalkBack","WCAG 2.1","モバイルアプリ開発","アクセシビリティ設計"],"ko":["모바일 접근성","VoiceOver","TalkBack","WCAG 2.1","모바일 앱 개발","접근성 디자인"],"es":["accesibilidad móvil","auditoría de accesibilidad","VoiceOver","TalkBack","navegación por pantalla táctil","WCAG 2.1","desarrollo web accesible","experiencia de usuario móvil"],"fr":["accessibilité mobile","audit d''accessibilité","VoiceOver","TalkBack","navigation à l''écran tactile","WCAG 2.1","développement web accessible","expérience utilisateur mobile"],"de":["mobile Zugänglichkeit","Zugänglichkeits-Audit","VoiceOver","TalkBack","Touchscreen-Navigation","WCAG 2.1","barrierefreies Webdesign","mobile Benutzererfahrung"],"pt":["acessibilidade móvel","auditoria de acessibilidade","VoiceOver","TalkBack","navegação por leitor de tela","critérios de acessibilidade","desenvolvimento de aplicativos móveis","acessibilidade para pessoas com deficiência"],"ru":["мобильная доступность","аудитория доступности","VoiceOver","TalkBack","навигация по экрану","критерии доступности","разработка мобильных приложений","доступность для людей с ограниченными возможностями"],"ar":["إمكانية الوصول المتنقلة","تدقيق إمكانية الوصول","برنامج VoiceOver","برنامج TalkBack","تنقل الشاشة","معايير إمكانية الوصول","تطوير التطبيقات المتنقلة","إمكانية الوصول للأشخاص ذوي الإعاقة"]}},"owner":"cbemister","repo":"claude-code-utils","repoPath":"cbemister/claude-code-utils","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.428Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"mobile-accessibility","description":"Ensure mobile interfaces work with VoiceOver, TalkBack, and screen readers. Audits touch target sizes, focus management, and WCAG 2.1 mobile criteria.","bodyPreview":"# Mobile Accessibility Skill\n\nComprehensive mobile accessibility audit and implementation for VoiceOver (iOS), TalkBack (Android), and touch-based screen reader navigation.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse `/mobile-accessibility` when you need to:\n- Audit mobile interface for accessibility issues\n- Implement VoiceOver/TalkBack support\n- Fix focus management in modals and bottom sheets\n- Add screen reader announcements for dynamic content\n- Ensure touch targets meet WCAG 2.1 mobile criteria\n- Support switch","body":"# Mobile Accessibility Skill\n\nComprehensive mobile accessibility audit and implementation for VoiceOver (iOS), TalkBack (Android), and touch-based screen reader navigation.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse `/mobile-accessibility` when you need to:\n- Audit mobile interface for accessibility issues\n- Implement VoiceOver/TalkBack support\n- Fix focus management in modals and bottom sheets\n- Add screen reader announcements for dynamic content\n- Ensure touch targets meet WCAG 2.1 mobile criteria\n- Support switch control and alternative input methods\n\n## Instructions\n\n### Phase 1: Mobile Accessibility Audit\n\n**Goal**: Identify mobile-specific accessibility issues\n\n**WCAG 2.1 Mobile Criteria:**\n\n| Criterion | Level | Requirement |\n|-----------|-------|-------------|\n| **2.5.5 Target Size** | AAA | 44x44 CSS pixels minimum |\n| **2.5.1 Pointer Gestures** | A | Multi-point/path-based gestures have single-point alternative |\n| **2.5.2 Pointer Cancellation** | A | Completion on up-event, can abort |\n| **2.5.3 Label in Name** | A | Accessible name contains visible text |\n| **2.5.4 Motion Actuation** | A | Motion-triggered functions can be disabled |\n| **1.3.4 Orientation** | AA | Content works in portrait and landscape |\n| **1.4.10 Reflow** | AA | Content reflows to 320px without horizontal scroll |\n\n**I will:**\n1. Check all interactive element sizes (44x44px minimum)\n2. Verify screen reader labels are present and descriptive\n3. Test focus order and keyboard navigation\n4. Audit ARIA landmarks and roles\n5. Check color contrast ratios (4.5:1 for normal text)\n6. Verify form inputs have associated labels\n7. Check that dynamic content announces to screen readers\n\n**Audit bash commands:**\n\n```bash\n# Find small touch targets\ngrep -rn \"width:\\s*[0-3][0-9]px\\|height:\\s*[0-3][0-9]px\" --include=\"*.css\" src/\n\n# Find images without alt text\ngrep -rn \"<img\" --include=\"*.tsx\" --include=\"*.jsx\" src/ | grep -v \"alt=\"\n\n# Find buttons without accessible labels\ngrep -rn \"<button\" --include=\"*.tsx\" src/ | grep -v \"aria-label\\|>.*</\"\n\n# Find inputs without labels\ngrep -rn \"<input\" --include=\"*.tsx\" src/ | grep -v \"aria-label\\|id=\"\n```\n\n---\n\n### Phase 2: Screen Reader Support\n\n**Goal**: Ensure VoiceOver and TalkBack can navigate and understand content\n\n**ARIA Landmarks for Mobile:**\n\n```html\n<!-- Header with navigation -->\n<header role=\"banner\">\n  <nav role=\"navigation\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\">\n    <!-- Nav items -->\n  </nav>\n</header>\n\n<!-- Main content -->\n<main role=\"main\">\n  <h1>Page Title</h1>\n  <!-- Content -->\n</main>\n\n<!-- Search -->\n<div role=\"search\">\n  <label for=\"search\">Search</label>\n  <input type=\"search\" id=\"search\" />\n</div>\n\n<!-- Footer -->\n<footer role=\"contentinfo\">\n  <!-- Footer content -->\n</footer>\n```\n\n**Button Accessibility:**\n\n```html\n<!-- ❌ Bad - no label for icon-only button -->\n<button>\n  <svg><!-- icon --></svg>\n</button>\n\n<!-- ✅ Good - aria-label for screen readers -->\n<button aria-label=\"Close dialog\">\n  <svg aria-hidden=\"true\"><!-- icon --></svg>\n</button>\n\n<!-- ✅ Good - visually hidden text -->\n<button>\n  <svg aria-hidden=\"true\"><!-- icon --></svg>\n  <span class=\"visuallyHidden\">Close dialog</span>\n</button>\n```\n\n**Visually Hidden CSS:**\n\n```css\n.visuallyHidden {\n  position: absolute;\n  width: 1px;\n  height: 1px;\n  padding: 0;\n  margin: -1px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);\n  white-space: nowrap;\n  border-width: 0;\n}\n```\n\n**Form Accessibility:**\n\n```html\n<!-- ❌ Bad - placeholder is not a label -->\n<input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Email address\" />\n\n<!-- ✅ Good - proper label association -->\n<label for=\"email\">Email address</label>\n<input type=\"email\" id=\"email\" autocomplete=\"email\" />\n\n<!-- ✅ Good - error announcement -->\n<label for=\"password\">Password</label>\n<input\n  type=\"password\"\n  id=\"password\"\n  aria-invalid=\"true\"\n  aria-describedby=\"password-error\"\n/>\n<div id=\"password-error\" role=\"alert\">\n  Password must be at least 8 characters\n</div>\n```\n\n---\n\n### Phase 3: Focus Management\n\n**Goal**: Proper focus handling for modals, sheets, and navigation\n\n**Modal/Sheet Focus Management:**\n\n```javascript\nclass AccessibleModal {\n  constructor(modalElement) {\n    this.modal = modalElement;\n    this.focusableElements = null;\n    this.previousFocus = null;\n  }\n\n  open() {\n    // Store current focus\n    this.previousFocus = document.activeElement;\n\n    // Get all focusable elements in modal\n    this.focusableElements = this.modal.querySelectorAll(\n      ''a[href], button:not([disabled]), textarea, input, select, [tabindex]:not([tabindex=\"-1\"])''\n    );\n\n    // Focus first element\n    if (this.focusableElements.length > 0) {\n      this.focusableElements[0].focus();\n    }\n\n    // Trap focus within modal\n    this.modal.addEventListener(''keydown'', this.trapFocus.bind(this));\n\n    // Announce modal to screen readers\n    this.modal.setAttribute(''aria-modal'', ''true'');\n    this.modal.setAttribute(''role'', ''dialog'');\n  }\n\n  trapFocus(e) {\n    if (e.key !== ''Tab'') return;\n\n    const firstElement = this.focusableElements[0];\n    const lastElement = this.focusableElements[this.focusableElements.length - 1];\n\n    if (e.shiftKey && document.activeElement === firstElement) {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      lastElement.focus();\n    } else if (!e.shiftKey && document.activeElement === lastElement) {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      firstElement.focus();\n    }\n  }\n\n  close() {\n    this.modal.removeEventListener(''keydown'', this.trapFocus);\n\n    // Return focus to trigger element\n    if (this.previousFocus) {\n      this.previousFocus.focus();\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Bottom Sheet Focus:**\n\n```css\n.bottomSheet {\n  position: fixed;\n  bottom: 0;\n  left: 0;\n  right: 0;\n  background: var(--color-bg);\n  border-radius: 16px 16px 0 0;\n  padding: 24px;\n  transform: translateY(100%);\n  transition: transform 0.3s ease;\n}\n\n.bottomSheet.open {\n  transform: translateY(0);\n}\n\n/* Focus indicator for keyboard users */\n.bottomSheet *:focus {\n  outline: 2px solid var(--color-primary);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\n/* Hide focus outline for mouse users, show for keyboard */\n.bottomSheet *:focus:not(:focus-visible) {\n  outline: none;\n}\n\n.bottomSheet *:focus-visible {\n  outline: 2px solid var(--color-primary);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### Phase 4: Live Regions & Announcements\n\n**Goal**: Announce dynamic content changes to screen readers\n\n**Toast/Snackbar Announcements:**\n\n```html\n<!-- Polite announcement - doesn''t interrupt -->\n<div role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\" class=\"visuallyHidden\">\n  <!-- Announcement text injected here -->\n</div>\n\n<!-- Assertive announcement - interrupts immediately -->\n<div role=\"alert\" aria-live=\"assertive\" aria-atomic=\"true\" class=\"visuallyHidden\">\n  <!-- Error messages injected here -->\n</div>\n```\n\n```javascript\nfunction announce(message, priority = ''polite'') {\n  const liveRegion = document.querySelector(`[aria-live=\"${priority}\"]`);\n\n  // Clear and re-add to trigger announcement\n  liveRegion.textContent = '''';\n  setTimeout(() => {\n    liveRegion.textContent = message;\n  }, 100);\n\n  // Auto-clear after announcement\n  setTimeout(() => {\n    liveRegion.textContent = '''';\n  }, 5000);\n}\n\n// Usage\nsaveButton.addEventListener(''click'', async () => {\n  await saveData();\n  announce(''Changes saved successfully'', ''polite'');\n});\n\ndeleteButton.addEventListener(''click'', async () => {\n  try {\n    await deleteItem();\n    announce(''Item deleted'', ''polite'');\n  } catch (error) {\n    announce(''Error: Could not delete item'', ''assertive'');\n  }\n});\n```\n\n**Loading States:**\n\n```html\n<!-- Loading button with status -->\n<button\n  aria-label=\"Save changes\"\n  aria-busy=\"true\"\n  disabled\n>\n  <span aria-hidden=\"true\">\n    <!-- Spinner icon -->\n  </span>\n  <span>Saving...</span>\n</button>\n\n<!-- Completed state -->\n<button aria-label=\"Save changes\">\n  Save\n</button>\n```\n\n**Dynamic Content:**\n\n```html\n<!-- List that updates -->\n<ul role=\"list\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-relevant=\"additions removals\">\n  <li>Item 1</li>\n  <li>Item 2</li>\n  <!-- New items announced automatically -->\n</ul>\n\n<!-- Pagination -->\n<nav aria-label=\"Pagination\">\n  <button aria-label=\"Previous page\" disabled>Previous</button>\n  <span aria-current=\"page\" aria-label=\"Page 1 of 5\">1</span>\n  <button aria-label=\"Next page, Page 2\">Next</button>\n</nav>\n```\n\n---\n\n### Phase 5: VoiceOver/TalkBack Testing\n\n**Goal**: Manual testing with actual screen readers\n\n**VoiceOver Gestures (iOS):**\n- Swipe right: Next item\n- Swipe left: Previous item\n- Double tap: Activate\n- Three-finger swipe: Scroll\n- Two-finger double tap: Magic Tap (primary action)\n- Rotor: Two-finger rotation to change navigation mode\n\n**TalkBack Gestures (Android):**\n- Swipe right: Next item\n- Swipe left: Previous item\n- Double tap: Activate\n- Swipe down then up: First item\n- Swipe up then down: Last item\n- Local context menu: Swipe up then right\n\n**Testing Checklist:**\n\n```markdown\n### VoiceOver Testing (iOS)\n\n- [ ] Can navigate through all interactive elements\n- [ ] Button labels are descriptive (\"Close\" not \"X\")\n- [ ] Form inputs announce their purpose and state\n- [ ] Images have meaningful alt text (or aria-hidden if decorative)\n- [ ] Modals trap focus and announce as dialogs\n- [ ] Page title announces on navigation\n- [ ] Headings create logical document outline\n- [ ] Custom controls have appropriate ARIA roles\n- [ ] Loading states announce to user\n- [ ] Error messages are announced immediately\n- [ ] Dynamic content updates are announced\n- [ ] Can dismiss modals with swipe gestures\n- [ ] Rotor navigation works (headings, links, form controls)\n\n### TalkBack Testing (Android)\n\n- [ ] All interactive elements are reachable\n- [ ] Touch exploration works (drag finger to explore)\n- [ ] Local context menu provides actions\n- [ ] Swipe gestures navigate correctly\n- [ ] Custom gestures have TalkBack equivalents\n- [ ] Reading order matches visual order\n- [ ] Lists announce item count\n- [ ] Expandable sections announce state (expanded/collapsed)\n\n### Switch Control Testing\n\n- [ ] Can navigate with single switch\n- [ ] All actions reachable via scanning\n- [ ] Scanning speed is reasonable\n- [ ] No focus traps for switch users\n```\n\n---\n\n### Phase 6: Reduced Motion & Preferences\n\n**Goal**: Respect user preferences for motion and accessibility\n\n```css\n/* Disable animations for users who prefer reduced motion */\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n  *,\n  *::before,\n  *::after {\n    animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;\n    animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;\n    transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;\n  }\n\n  .pullToRefresh .refreshIndicator,\n  .swipeableItem .swipeContent {\n    transition: none !important;\n  }\n}\n\n/* High contrast mode */\n@media (prefers-contrast: high) {\n  .button {\n    border: 2px solid currentColor;\n  }\n\n  .card {\n    border: 1px solid var(--color-text);\n  }\n}\n\n/* Dark mode preference */\n@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n  :root {\n    --color-bg: #121212;\n    --color-text: #ffffff;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Mobile Accessibility Checklist\n\n### Touch Targets\n- [ ] All interactive elements ≥ 44x44px (WCAG AAA) or ≥ 48x48px (recommended)\n- [ ] Adequate spacing between targets (8px minimum)\n- [ ] Touch targets don''t overlap\n\n### Screen Reader Support\n- [ ] All images have alt text (or aria-hidden if decorative)\n- [ ] Icon-only buttons have aria-label\n- [ ] Form inputs have associated labels\n- [ ] Custom controls have appropriate ARIA roles\n- [ ] Page landmarks (header, nav, main, footer) are defined\n- [ ] Headings create logical document outline (h1 → h2 → h3)\n\n### Focus Management\n- [ ] Focus order matches visual order\n- [ ] All interactive elements are keyboard accessible\n- [ ] Focus indicators are clearly visible (2px outline minimum)\n- [ ] Modals trap focus and return focus on close\n- [ ] Skip links provided for navigation\n\n### Live Regions\n- [ ] Loading states announce with aria-busy or live region\n- [ ] Success messages use aria-live=\"polite\"\n- [ ] Error messages use role=\"alert\" or aria-live=\"assertive\"\n- [ ] Dynamic content updates are announced\n\n### Forms\n- [ ] All inputs have visible labels\n- [ ] Required fields are indicated (not just color)\n- [ ] Error messages are associated with inputs (aria-describedby)\n- [ ] Validation errors are announced\n- [ ] Autocomplete attributes for common fields\n\n### Motion & Preferences\n- [ ] Respects prefers-reduced-motion\n- [ ] Animations can be paused or disabled\n- [ ] Motion-triggered actions have static alternatives\n- [ ] High contrast mode supported\n\n### Mobile-Specific\n- [ ] Content reflows to 320px without horizontal scroll\n- [ ] Works in portrait and landscape orientation\n- [ ] No pinch-to-zoom disabled (allow zoom)\n- [ ] Text can be resized to 200% without loss of content\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n```markdown\n## Mobile Accessibility Audit Results\n\n### Critical Issues (WCAG Level A)\n- [ ] **Touch Target Too Small** - Button at `[selector]` is 32x32px (requires 44x44px)\n- [ ] **Missing Label** - Input at `[selector]` has no associated label\n- [ ] **Focus Trap** - Modal does not return focus on close\n\n### Important Issues (WCAG Level AA)\n- [ ] **Insufficient Contrast** - Text on background is 3.2:1 (requires 4.5:1)\n- [ ] **Missing Landmark** - Page missing main landmark\n\n### Enhancements (WCAG Level AAA)\n- [ ] **Touch Target Enhancement** - Increase to 48x48px for better usability\n- [ ] **Enhanced Announcements** - Add more descriptive loading states\n\n### Files Modified\n- `[filepath]` - Touch target fixes\n- `[filepath]` - ARIA labels and landmarks\n- `[filepath]` - Focus management\n- `[filepath]` - Live region announcements\n\n### Testing Notes\n**VoiceOver (iOS):**\n- Navigation works correctly through all elements\n- Buttons announce purpose clearly\n- Modal focus trapping works\n\n**TalkBack (Android):**\n- All elements reachable via swipe\n- Local context menu provides expected actions\n- Reading order matches visual layout\n\n### Checklist Results\n✅ Touch targets ≥ 44px\n✅ Screen reader labels present\n✅ Focus management implemented\n✅ Live regions for dynamic content\n✅ Reduced motion respected\n⚠️ High contrast mode needs testing\n```\n\n---\n\n## Integration with Other Skills\n\n- **/mobile-patterns** - Ensure navigation patterns are accessible\n- **/touch-interactions** - Verify gestures have keyboard alternatives\n- **/component-states** - Add accessible focus and disabled states\n- **/accessibility-audit** - General accessibility (this skill is mobile-focused)\n\n---\n\n## Notes\n\n- Test with actual screen readers on real devices - simulators don''t fully replicate experience\n- VoiceOver and TalkBack have different behaviors - test both\n- Touch target size is the #1 mobile accessibility issue\n- Don''t rely on color alone to convey information\n- Keep forms short and use appropriate input types for mobile keyboards\n- Respect user preferences (reduced motion, dark mode, high contrast)\n- Live regions should be in DOM from page load, not dynamically added\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:01:31.314Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Mobile Development Agents specializing in accessibility compliance and screen reader optimization.","zh":"适合专门从事无障碍合规和屏幕阅读器优化的移动开发代理。","ja":"アクセシビリティのコンプライアンスやスクリーンリーダーの最適化を専門とするモバイル開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"접근성 규정 준수 및 화면 리더 최적화를 전문으로 하는 모바일 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo móvil especializados en el cumplimiento de accesibilidad y optimización de lectores de pantalla.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement mobile spécialisés dans la conformité d''accessibilité et l''optimisation des lecteurs d''écran.","de":"Perfekt für Mobile-Development-Agents, die sich auf die Einhaltung von Barrierefreiheit und die Optimierung von Bildschirmlesern spezialisiert haben.","pt":"Perfect for Mobile Development Agents specializing in accessibility compliance and screen reader optimization.","ru":"Perfect for Mobile Development Agents specializing in accessibility compliance and screen reader optimization.","ar":"Perfect for Mobile Development Agents specializing in accessibility compliance and screen reader optimization."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables comprehensive mobile accessibility audits and implementations for VoiceOver (iOS) and TalkBack (Android), including focus management in modals, screen reader announcements for dynamic content, and WCAG 2.1 mobile criteria compliance for touch targets and switch control support.","zh":"实现全面的移动无障碍审计和实施，包括针对VoiceOver（iOS）和TalkBack（Android）的支持，包括模态中的焦点管理、动态内容的屏幕阅读器公告以及触摸目标和开关控制支持的WCAG 2.1移动标准合规性。","ja":"VoiceOver（iOS）とTalkBack（Android）を含む包括的なモバイルアクセシビリティの監査と実装を可能にします。モーダルのフォーカス管理、動的コンテンツのスクリーンリーダー通知、およびタッチターゲットとスイッチコントロールサポートのWCAG 2.1モバイル基準のコンプライアンスが含まれます。","ko":"VoiceOver(ios) 및 TalkBack(안드로이드)를 포함한 포괄적인 모바일 접근성 감사를 가능하게 하며, 모달의 포커스 관리, 동적 콘텐츠의 화면 리더 알림 및 터치 대상 및 스위치 제어 지원에 대한 WCAG 2.1 모바일 기준 준수를 포함합니다.","es":"Permite auditorías e implementaciones exhaustivas de accesibilidad móvil para VoiceOver (iOS) y TalkBack (Android), incluyendo la gestión del foco en modales, anuncios del lector de pantalla para contenido dinámico y el cumplimiento de los criterios móviles WCAG 2.1 para objetivos táctiles y soporte de control por conmutador.","fr":"Permet des audits et des implémentations complets d''accessibilité mobile pour VoiceOver (iOS) et TalkBack (Android), incluant la gestion du focus dans les modales, les annonces du lecteur d''écran pour le contenu dynamique, et la conformité aux critères mobiles WCAG 2.1 pour les zones tactiles et la prise en charge de la commande par commutateur.","de":"Ermöglicht umfassende Audits und Implementierungen der mobilen Barrierefreiheit für VoiceOver (iOS) und TalkBack (Android), einschließlich Fokusmanagement in modalen Dialogen, Bildschirmleseransagen für dynamische Inhalte und Einhaltung der WCAG-2.1-Mobilkriterien für Berührungsziele und Unterstützung der Schaltersteuerung.","pt":"Enables comprehensive mobile accessibility audits and implementations for VoiceOver (iOS) and TalkBack (Android), including focus management in modals, screen reader announcements for dynamic content, and WCAG 2.1 mobile criteria compliance for touch targets and switch control support.","ru":"Enables comprehensive mobile accessibility audits and implementations for VoiceOver (iOS) and TalkBack (Android), including focus management in modals, screen reader announcements for dynamic content, and WCAG 2.1 mobile criteria compliance for touch targets and switch control support.","ar":"Enables comprehensive mobile accessibility audits and implementations for VoiceOver (iOS) and TalkBack (Android), including focus management in modals, screen reader announcements for dynamic content, and WCAG 2.1 mobile criteria compliance for touch targets and switch control support."},"useCases":{"en":["Auditing mobile interfaces for accessibility violations","Implementing VoiceOver/TalkBack navigation support","Fixing focus management in modals and bottom sheets","Adding screen reader announcements for dynamic content updates","Ensuring touch targets meet WCAG 2.1 mobile requirements"],"zh":["审计移动界面中的无障碍违规","实现VoiceOver/TalkBack导航支持","修复模态和底部表单中的焦点管理","为动态内容更新添加屏幕阅读器公告","确保触摸目标符合WCAG 2.1移动要求"],"ja":["アクセシビリティ違反の監査","VoiceOver/TalkBackナビゲーションの実装","モーダルとボトムシートのフォーカス管理の修正","動的コンテンツ更新のスクリーンリーダー通知の追加","タッチターゲットのWCAG 2.1モバイル要件のコンプライアンスの確保"],"ko":["모바일 인터페이스의 접근성 위반 감사","VoiceOver/TalkBack 네비게이션 지원 구현","모달 및 바닥시트의 포커스 관리 수정","동적 콘텐츠 업데이트에 대한 화면 리더 알림 추가","터치 대상의 WCAG 2.1 모바일 요구 사항 준수 보장"],"es":["Auditar interfaces móviles en busca de violaciones de accesibilidad","Implementar soporte de navegación para VoiceOver/TalkBack","Corregir la gestión del foco en modales y hojas inferiores","Añadir anuncios del lector de pantalla para actualizaciones de contenido dinámico","Garantizar que los objetivos táctiles cumplan con los requisitos móviles de WCAG 2.1"],"fr":["Auditer les interfaces mobiles pour les violations d''accessibilité","Implémenter la prise en charge de la navigation VoiceOver/TalkBack","Corriger la gestion du focus dans les modales et les feuilles inférieures","Ajouter des annonces du lecteur d''écran pour les mises à jour de contenu dynamique","Garantir que les zones tactiles répondent aux exigences mobiles WCAG 2.1"],"de":["Überprüfung mobiler Benutzeroberflächen auf Barrierefreiheitsverstöße","Implementierung der Navigationsunterstützung für VoiceOver/TalkBack","Behebung des Fokusmanagements in modalen Dialogen und Bottom Sheets","Hinzufügen von Bildschirmleseransagen für dynamische Inhaltsaktualisierungen","Sicherstellen, dass Berührungsziele den mobilen WCAG-2.1-Anforderungen entsprechen"],"pt":["Auditing mobile interfaces for accessibility violations","Implementing VoiceOver/TalkBack navigation support","Fixing focus management in modals and bottom sheets","Adding screen reader announcements for dynamic content updates","Ensuring touch targets meet WCAG 2.1 mobile requirements"],"ru":["Auditing mobile interfaces for accessibility violations","Implementing VoiceOver/TalkBack navigation support","Fixing focus management in modals and bottom sheets","Adding screen reader announcements for dynamic content updates","Ensuring touch targets meet WCAG 2.1 mobile requirements"],"ar":["Auditing mobile interfaces for accessibility violations","Implementing VoiceOver/TalkBack navigation support","Fixing focus management in modals and bottom sheets","Adding screen reader announcements for dynamic content updates","Ensuring touch targets meet WCAG 2.1 mobile requirements"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires mobile-specific interface analysis","Platform-specific implementation for iOS/Android","Dependent on mobile screen reader environments"],"zh":["需要移动特定接口分析","需要针对iOS/Android的特定实现","依赖于移动屏幕阅读器环境"],"ja":["モバイル特有のインターフェイス分析が必要","iOS/Android向けの特定の実装が必要","モバイルスクリーンリーダー環境に依存"],"ko":["모바일 특정 인터페이스 분석이 필요","iOS/Android에 대한 특정 구현이 필요","모바일 화면 리더 환경에 의존"],"es":["Requiere análisis de interfaz específico para móviles","Implementación específica de plataforma para iOS/Android","Dependiente de entornos de lectores de pantalla móviles"],"fr":["Nécessite une analyse d''interface spécifique au mobile","Implémentation spécifique à la plateforme pour iOS/Android","Dépend des environnements de lecteurs d''écran mobiles"],"de":["Erfordert eine mobile spezifische Schnittstellenanalyse","Plattformspezifische Implementierung für iOS/Android","Abhängig von mobilen Bildschirmleserumgebungen"],"pt":["Requires mobile-specific interface analysis","Platform-specific implementation for iOS/Android","Dependent on mobile screen reader environments"],"ru":["Requires mobile-specific interface analysis","Platform-specific implementation for iOS/Android","Dependent on mobile screen reader environments"],"ar":["Requires mobile-specific interface analysis","Platform-specific implementation for iOS/Android","Dependent on mobile screen reader environments"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
