ие","Операции выпуска и горячего исправления","Автоматизация повторяющихся задач Git"],"ar":["إنشاء فروع الميزات مع اتفاقيات التسمية المناسبة","إدارة تحديد التعارض و استراتيجيات الحل","متابعة منهجيات جيت فلو أو جيت هب فلو","إنشاء ومراجعة طلبات الدمج","عمليات الإصدار والتصحيح السريع","تأتمة مهام جيت المتكررة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Git","Git ","Git Flow","GitHub Flow","Pull Request","Git"],"ja":["Git","Git","Git Flow","GitHub Flow","Pull Request","Git"],"ko":["Git","Git ","Git ","GitHub ","Pull Request","Git"],"es":["automatización de flujo de trabajo Git","control de versiones","Git Flow","GitHub Flow","ramas de características","conflictos de fusiones","solicitudes de extracción","lanzamiento y corrección de errores"],"fr":["automatisation du workflow Git","contrôle de version","Git Flow","GitHub Flow","branches de fonctionnalités","conflits de fusion","demandes d''extraction","lancement et correction de bogues"],"de":["Git-Workflow-Automatisierung","Versionskontrolle","Git-Flow","GitHub-Flow","Feature-Branches","Merge-Konflikte","Pull-Requests","Release- und Hotfix-Operationen"],"pt":["automação de fluxo de trabalho git","controle de versão","git flow","github flow","merge conflicts","pull requests","release management","hotfix operations","automação de tarefas git"],"ru":["автоматизация рабочего процесса git","контроль версий","git flow","github flow","конфликты слияния","запросы на слияние","управление выпусками","операции горячего исправления","автоматизация задач git"],"ar":["تأتمة تدفق العمل جيت","إدارة الإصدارات","جيت فلو","جيت هب فلو","تحديد التعارض","طلبات الدمج","إدارة الإصدار","عمليات التصحيح السريع","تأتمة مهام جيت"]}},"owner":"MuhammadUsmanGM","repo":"Skills_Assignment","repoPath":"MuhammadUsmanGM/Skills_Assignment","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.428Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"git-workflow-automation","description":"Comprehensive Git workflow automation including branching strategies, pull request creation, code reviews, merge strategies, and release management. Use when Claude needs to help with Git operations, branching models (Git Flow, GitHub Flow), pull request creation, code reviews, merge conflicts, or release processes.","bodyPreview":"# Git Workflow Automation\n\n## Overview\nThis skill automates common Git workflows and provides expert guidance on best practices for version control.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n- Creating feature branches with proper naming conventions\n- Managing merge conflicts and resolution strategies\n- Following Git Flow or GitHub Flow methodologies\n- Creating and reviewing pull requests\n- Performing release and hotfix operations\n- Automating repetitive Git tasks\n\n## Branching Strategies\n\n### Git Flow\n```\nmai","body":"# Git Workflow Automation\n\n## Overview\nThis skill automates common Git workflows and provides expert guidance on best practices for version control.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n- Creating feature branches with proper naming conventions\n- Managing merge conflicts and resolution strategies\n- Following Git Flow or GitHub Flow methodologies\n- Creating and reviewing pull requests\n- Performing release and hotfix operations\n- Automating repetitive Git tasks\n\n## Branching Strategies\n\n### Git Flow\n```\nmain (production-ready code)\n├── develop (integration branch)\n│   ├── feature/* (feature branches)\n│   └── release/* (release preparation)\n└── hotfix/* (urgent fixes)\n```\n\n### GitHub Flow\n```\nmain (always deployable)\n└── feature/* (short-lived branches)\n```\n\n## Common Operations\n\n### Creating a Feature Branch\n```bash\ngit checkout -b feature/user-authentication\n```\n\n### Syncing with Upstream\n```bash\ngit checkout main\ngit pull origin main\ngit checkout feature/user-authentication\ngit rebase main\n```\n\n### Resolving Merge Conflicts\n1. Identify conflicted files: `git status`\n2. Open files and look for conflict markers: `<<<<<<<`, `=======`, `>>>>>>>`\n3. Manually resolve conflicts by keeping desired changes\n4. Stage resolved files: `git add .`\n5. Complete the merge: `git rebase --continue` or `git merge --continue`\n\n## Pull Request Best Practices\n- Write clear, descriptive titles and descriptions\n- Link to related issues\n- Include testing instructions\n- Specify reviewers\n- Follow conventional commit messages\n\n## Release Management\n- Tag releases with semantic versioning (v1.2.3)\n- Create release notes highlighting changes\n- Verify CI/CD pipelines pass before merging\n- Coordinate with stakeholders for deployment timing\n\n## Scripts Available\n- `scripts/create-feature-branch.sh` - Automated feature branch creation\n- `scripts/sync-with-main.sh` - Sync current branch with main\n- `scripts/prepare-release.sh` - Prepare a new release branch\n\n## References\n- `references/naming-conventions.md` - Git branch naming conventions and best practices\n- `references/workflow-patterns.md` - Detailed workflow patterns and commands for different Git strategies"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:01:24.579Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring streamlined Git workflow automation and version control expertise","zh":"适用于需要简化Git工作流自动化和版本控制专业知识的开发代理","ja":"開発エージェントがGitのワークフロー自動化とバージョン管理の専門知識を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"개발 에이전트가 Git 워크플ロー 자동화 및 버전 관리 전문 지식을 필요로 하는 경우에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que requieren una automatización de flujo de trabajo de Git optimizada y experiencia en control de versiones","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant une automatisation du flux de travail Git simplifiée et une expertise en contrôle de version","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine optimierte Git-Workflow-Automatisierung und Versionierungsexpertise erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que requerem automação de fluxo de trabalho Git simplificada e especialização em controle de versão","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, требующих упрощенной автоматизации рабочего процесса Git и экспертизы в области управления версиями","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء النموزجيون الذين يتطلبون تسهيل تدفق العمل الجيت وتخصص الخبرة في التحكم في الإصدار"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate repetitive Git tasks, manage merge conflicts using Git Flow or GitHub Flow methodologies, and create and review pull requests, all while following best practices for branching strategies and release operations using protocols like SSH and HTTPS","zh":"赋予代理人自动执行重复的Git任务、使用Git Flow或GitHub Flow方法管理合并冲突、创建和审查拉取请求的能力，同时遵循分支策略和发布操作的最佳实践，使用像SSH和HTTPS这样的协议","ja":"エージェントが繰り返しのGitタスクを自動化し、Git FlowまたはGitHub Flow方法を使用してマージコンフリクトを解決し、プルリクエストを作成してレビューする機能を提供し、SSHやHTTPSなどのプロトコルを使用してブランチ戦略とリリース操作のベストプラクティスに従う","ko":"에이전트가 반복되는 Git 작업을 자동화하고 Git Flow 또는 GitHub Flow 방법을 사용하여 병합 충돌을 해결하며 풀 리퀘스트를 생성하고 검토할 수 있는 능력을 제공하며, SSH 및 HTTPS와 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 브랜치 전략 및 릴리즈 운영의 모범 사례를 따름","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar tareas Git repetitivas, administrar conflictos de fusión utilizando metodologías Git Flow o GitHub Flow, y crear y revisar solicitudes de incorporación, todo mientras sigue las mejores prácticas para estrategias de ramificación y operaciones de lanzamiento utilizando protocolos como SSH y HTTPS","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les tâches Git répétitives, de gérer les conflits de fusion en utilisant les méthodologies Git Flow ou GitHub Flow, et de créer et de réviser les demandes d''intégration, le tout en suivant les meilleures pratiques pour les stratégies de branchement et les opérations de publication en utilisant des protocoles tels que SSH et HTTPS","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, wiederkehrende Git-Aufgaben zu automatisieren, Merge-Konflikte mithilfe von Git-Flow- oder GitHub-Flow-Methoden zu verwalten und Pull-Requests zu erstellen und zu überprüfen, und dabei die besten Praktiken für Verzweigungsstrategien und Release-Betriebe unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie SSH und HTTPS einzuhalten","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar tarefas Git repetitivas, gerenciar conflitos de mesclagem usando metodologias Git Flow ou GitHub Flow, e criar e revisar solicitações de pull, tudo seguindo as melhores práticas para estratégias de ramificação e operações de lançamento usando protocolos como SSH e HTTPS","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать повторяющиеся задачи Git, управлять конфликтами слияния с помощью методологий Git Flow или GitHub Flow, и создавать и рассматривать запросы на включение, все это при соблюдении лучших практик для стратегий ветвления и операций выпуска с использованием протоколов như SSH и HTTPS","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على توفير المهام المتكررة الجيت، وإدارة تحديات الدمج باستخدام منهجيات الجيت فلوف أو جيت هب فلوف، وإنشاء ومراجعة طلبات السحب، وجميعها تتبع أفضل الممارسات لاستراتيجيات الفرع وتشغيل الإصدار باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل SSH و HTTPS"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating feature branch creation with proper naming conventions","Resolving merge conflicts using Git Flow","Generating and reviewing pull requests for code quality assurance"],"zh":["使用适当的命名约定自动创建功能分支","使用Git Flow解决合并冲突","生成和审查拉取请求以确保代码质量"],"ja":["適切な命名規則で機能ブランチを作成する自動化","Git Flowを使用してマージコンフリクトを解決する","コード品質保証のためにプルリクエストを生成してレビューする"],"ko":["적절한 명명 규칙으로 기능 브랜치를 자동 생성","Git Flow를 사용하여 병합 충돌을 해결","코드 품질 보증을 위해 풀 리퀘스트를 생성하여 검토"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de ramas de características con convenciones de nomenclatura adecuadas","Resolución de conflictos de fusión utilizando Git Flow","Generación y revisión de solicitudes de incorporación para la garantía de la calidad del código"],"fr":["Automatisation de la création de branches de fonctionnalités avec des conventions de nommage appropriées","Résolution des conflits de fusion en utilisant Git Flow","Génération et révision des demandes d''intégration pour l''assurance de la qualité du code"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung von Feature-Branches mit geeigneten Namenskonventionen","Auflösung von Merge-Konflikten unter Verwendung von Git Flow","Erstellung und Überprüfung von Pull-Requests zur Sicherstellung der Code-Qualität"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de ramo de recurso com convenções de nomenclatura apropriadas","Resolver conflitos de mesclagem usando Git Flow","Gerar e revisar solicitações de pull para garantia de qualidade de código"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание функциональной ветки с правильными соглашениями об именах","Разрешать конфликты слияния с помощью Git Flow","Генерировать и рассматривать запросы на включение для обеспечения качества кода"],"ar":["توفير إنشاء فرع الميزة مع اتفاقيات التسمية المناسبة","حل تحديات الدمج باستخدام الجيت فلوف","توليد ومراجعة طلبات السحب لضمان جودة الشفرة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git installation and configuration","Limited to Git version control systems"],"zh":["需要Git安装和配置","仅限于Git版本控制系统"],"ja":["Gitのインストールと設定が必要","Gitのバージョン管理システムのみに限る"],"ko":["Git 설치 및 구성이 필요","Git 버전 관리 시스템에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere instalación y configuración de Git","Limitado a sistemas de control de versiones Git"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration de Git","Limité aux systèmes de contrôle de version Git"],"de":["Erfordert Git-Installation und -Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf Git-Versionierungssysteme"],"pt":["Requer instalação e configuração do Git","Limitado a sistemas de controle de versão Git"],"ru":["Требует установки и конфигурации Git","Ограничен системами управления версиями Git"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت وتكوين الجيت","محدود بنظم التحكم في الإصدار الجيت"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
