adores acceder a resultados de trabajo, transcripciones y ejecuciones de problemas de manera programática con Python","fr":"L''API Taiga permet aux développeurs d''accéder aux résultats de travail, aux transcriptions et aux exécutions de problèmes de manière programmatique avec Python","de":"Die Taiga-API ermöglicht es Entwicklern, Arbeitsergebnisse, Transkripte und Problem-Executions programmatisch mit Python abzurufen","pt":"A Taiga API permite consultar resultados de trabalhos, transcritos e execuções de problemas. Use Python para evitar problemas com variáveis de ambiente e pipes","ru":"Taiga API позволяет запрашивать результаты работы, транскрипты и запуски задач. Используйте Python, чтобы избежать проблем с переменными среды и pipe","ar":"سماح Taiga API باستعلام نتائج العمل والنسخ وتنفيذ المشاكل. استخدم Python لتجنب المشاكل المتعلقة بمتغيرات البيئة والأنابيب","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Taiga API","Python","Taiga","API","Taiga API"],"ja":["Taiga API","Python","Taiga","API","Taiga API"],"ko":["Taiga API","Python","Taiga","API","Taiga API"],"es":["Acceso a resultados de trabajo","Recuperación de transcripciones","Ejecución de problemas","Uso de Python para solicitudes API","Carga de cookies con helper de Python"],"fr":["Accès aux résultats de travail","Récupération de transcriptions","Exécution de problèmes","Utilisation de Python pour les requêtes API","Chargement de cookies avec helper Python"],"de":["Zugriff auf Arbeitsergebnisse","Abruf von Transkripten","Ausführung von Problemen","Verwendung von Python für API-Anfragen","Laden von Cookies mit Python-Helper"],"pt":["Acesso a resultados de trabalhos","Consulta de transcritos","Execução de problemas","Uso de Python para evitar problemas com variáveis de ambiente","Código de exemplo para carregar cookie","Integração com a plataforma de avaliação Taiga"],"ru":["Доступ к результатам работы","Запрос транскриптов","Запуск задач","Использование Python для избежания проблем с переменными среды","Пример кода для загрузки cookie","Интеграция с платформой оценки Taiga"],"ar":["الوصول إلى نتائج العمل","استعلام النسخ","تنفيذ المشاكل","استخدام Python لتجنب المشاكل المتعلقة بمتغيرات البيئة","كود مثال لتحميل الكعكة","التكامل مع منصة التقييم Taiga"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Taiga API","Python","Taiga","API","Taiga API","Taiga API"],"ja":["Taiga API","Python","Taiga","API","Taiga API","Taiga API"],"ko":["Taiga API","Python","Taiga","API","Taiga API","Taiga API"],"es":["Taiga API","API de Taiga","resultados de trabajo","transcripciones","problemas","Python","desarrollo de software","integración de API"],"fr":["Taiga API","API Taiga","résultats de travail","transcriptions","problèmes","Python","développement de logiciels","intégration d''API"],"de":["Taiga API","Taiga-API","Arbeitsergebnisse","Transkripte","Probleme","Python","Software-Entwicklung","API-Integration"],"pt":["Taiga API","Python","resultados de trabalhos","transcritos","execução de problemas","variáveis de ambiente","cookie","plataforma de avaliação"],"ru":["Taiga API","Python","результаты работы","транскрипты","запуск задач","переменные среды","cookie","платформа оценки"],"ar":["Taiga API","Python","نتائج العمل","النسخ","تنفيذ المشاكل","متغيرات البيئة","الكعكة","منصة التقييم"]}},"owner":"atondwal","repo":"config","repoPath":"atondwal/config","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.428Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"taiga-api","description":"Query the hosted Taiga API at taiga.ant.dev for job results, passrates, transcripts, and run evaluations. Use when user asks about Taiga jobs, problem scores, eval results, or needs to submit/check jobs.","bodyPreview":"# Taiga API\n\nQuery the hosted Taiga evaluation platform API for job results, transcripts, and problem runs.\n\n## IMPORTANT: Use Python, Not Shell\n\n**Always use Python for Taiga API requests.** Shell has env var + pipe bugs that strip cookie values.\n\nPython helper to load cookie:\n```python\ndef get_cookie():\n    with open(''/home/atondwal/dmodel/ant/taiga-worktree/.env'') as f:\n        for line in f:\n            if line.startswith(''TAIGA_IAP_COOKIE=''):\n                return line.split(''='', 1)[1].str","body":"# Taiga API\n\nQuery the hosted Taiga evaluation platform API for job results, transcripts, and problem runs.\n\n## IMPORTANT: Use Python, Not Shell\n\n**Always use Python for Taiga API requests.** Shell has env var + pipe bugs that strip cookie values.\n\nPython helper to load cookie:\n```python\ndef get_cookie():\n    with open(''/home/atondwal/dmodel/ant/taiga-worktree/.env'') as f:\n        for line in f:\n            if line.startswith(''TAIGA_IAP_COOKIE=''):\n                return line.split(''='', 1)[1].strip().strip(''\"'')\n```\n\n## IMPORTANT: Always Use Opus 4.5\n\n**When submitting jobs, ALWAYS use `claude-opus-4-5-20251101` as the model. Never use Sonnet or other models unless explicitly requested.**\n\n## Authentication\n\nCookie stored in `~/dmodel/ant/taiga-worktree/.env`. Uses `__Host-` prefix (session-only). If auth fails, ask user to refresh from browser DevTools → Network → copy Cookie header.\n\n## Making Requests\n\n```python\nimport urllib.request, json\n\ndef taiga_get(endpoint):\n    cookie = get_cookie()  # see helper above\n    req = urllib.request.Request(f\"https://taiga.ant.dev/api{endpoint}\")\n    req.add_header(''Cookie'', cookie)\n    return json.loads(urllib.request.urlopen(req).read())\n\n# Example: get job problems\ndata = taiga_get(f\"/jobs/{job_id}/problems\")\n```\n\n## API Reference\n\nFull docs at: `https://taiga.ant.dev/api/docs`\n\n### Jobs (Most Common)\n\n| Endpoint | Method | Purpose |\n|----------|--------|---------|\n| `/jobs` | GET | List all jobs |\n| `/jobs?environment_id={id}` | GET | List jobs for environment |\n| `/jobs/{job_id}` | GET | Get job details |\n| `/jobs/{job_id}/problems` | GET | **Get problem results (passrates, scores)** |\n| `/jobs/{job_id}/problems/stream` | GET | Stream problem results |\n| `/jobs/{job_id}/error-summary` | GET | Get error summary |\n| `/jobs` | POST | Create job with problems |\n| `/cancel-job/{job_id}` | POST | Cancel running job |\n| `/resubmit-problem/{job_id}/{problem_id}` | POST | Resubmit specific problem |\n\n### Transcripts\n\n| Endpoint | Method | Purpose |\n|----------|--------|---------|\n| `/transcript/{problem_run_id}` | GET | Get full transcript |\n| `/transcript/stream/{problem_run_id}` | GET | Stream transcript |\n\n### Problem Runs\n\n| Endpoint | Method | Purpose |\n|----------|--------|---------|\n| `/problem_runs/{problem_id}` | GET | List runs for problem |\n| `/problem-runs/{id}/container-logs` | GET | Get container logs |\n| `/problem-runs/{id}/mcp-server-logs` | GET | Get MCP server logs |\n| `/problem-runs/{id}/download-output` | GET | Download output directory |\n\n### Environments\n\n| Endpoint | Method | Purpose |\n|----------|--------|---------|\n| `/environments` | GET | List environments |\n| `/environments/{id}` | GET | Get environment details |\n| `/environments?skip=0&limit=100` | GET | Paginated list |\n\n### Problems\n\n| Endpoint | Method | Purpose |\n|----------|--------|---------|\n| `/problems/{problem_id}/attempts` | GET | Get problem attempts |\n| `/problems/versions/{version_id}` | GET | Get problem version |\n| `/problems/versions/{version_id}/run` | POST | Run problem version |\n| `/problem-crud` | GET | List all problems |\n| `/problem-crud/stats/pass-rates` | POST | Get pass rate stats |\n\n### Docker Images\n\n| Endpoint | Method | Purpose |\n|----------|--------|---------|\n| `/docker-images` | GET | List docker images |\n| `/docker-images/{id}/download` | GET | Download image source |\n\n## Common Workflows\n\n### Get Passrates for a Job\n\n```python\njob_id = \"3c300cca-707a-4e92-ac71-5688165f9ae1\"  # from URL ?id= param\ndata = taiga_get(f\"/jobs/{job_id}/problems\")\nfor r in data:\n    print(f\"{r[''problem_id'']}: {r[''final_score'']}\")\n```\n\n### Aggregate Passrates\n\n```python\nfrom collections import defaultdict\n\njob_id = \"YOUR_JOB_ID\"\ndata = taiga_get(f\"/jobs/{job_id}/problems\")\n\nproblems = defaultdict(list)\nfor r in data:\n    problems[r[''problem_id'']].append(r[''final_score''])\n\ntotal_pass = total_runs = 0\nfor pid, scores in sorted(problems.items()):\n    passed = sum(1 for s in scores if s == 1.0)\n    total = len(scores)\n    total_pass += passed\n    total_runs += total\n    print(f\"{pid}: {passed}/{total} ({100*passed/total:.0f}%)\")\n\nprint(f\"\\nOverall: {total_pass}/{total_runs} ({100*total_pass/total_runs:.1f}%)\")\n```\n\n### Get Transcript\n\n```python\nproblem_run_id = \"118ed21a-9864-4c8c-b34b-d92428f1c22a\"\ntranscript = taiga_get(f\"/transcript/{problem_run_id}\")\n```\n\n### List Jobs for Environment\n\n```python\nenv_id = \"8e646c11-1461-44a4-9e8d-e3800a02ba07\"\njobs = taiga_get(f\"/jobs?environment_id={env_id}\")\nfor j in jobs:\n    print(f\"{j[''id'']}: {j[''status'']}\")\n```\n\n### Check Job Status\n\n```python\njob = taiga_get(f\"/jobs/{job_id}\")\nprint(f\"Status: {job[''status'']}, Completed: {job.get(''completed_count'')}\")\n```\n\n### Create a Job\n\n```python\nimport urllib.request, json\n\nwith open(''problems-metadata.json'') as f:\n    problems = json.load(f)\n\npayload = {\n    \"name\": \"my-job-name\",\n    \"problems_metadata\": problems,\n    \"n_attempts_per_problem\": 10,\n    \"api_model_name\": \"claude-opus-4-5-20251101\"  # ALWAYS use Opus 4.5\n}\n\ncookie = get_cookie()\nreq = urllib.request.Request(\n    \"https://taiga.ant.dev/api/jobs\",\n    data=json.dumps(payload).encode(),\n    headers={\"Cookie\": cookie, \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"}\n)\nresp = json.loads(urllib.request.urlopen(req).read())\nprint(f\"Job ID: {resp.get(''job_id'')}\")\n```\n\n## Response Schemas\n\n### Problem Run\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"118ed21a-...\",\n  \"problem_id\": \"sort-unique\",\n  \"attempt_number\": 1,\n  \"final_score\": 1.0,\n  \"status\": \"completed\",\n  \"subscores\": {\"matched_solution\": 1.0},\n  \"weights\": {\"matched_solution\": 1.0},\n  \"execution_time_ms\": 467000,\n  \"total_tokens\": 34205\n}\n```\n\n### Job\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"3c300cca-...\",\n  \"status\": \"completed\",\n  \"environment_id\": \"8e646c11-...\",\n  \"api_model_name\": \"claude-opus-4-5-20251101\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2025-11-24T17:46:30Z\"\n}\n```\n\n## URL Patterns\n\nFrom Taiga web UI URLs:\n- Job page: `https://taiga.ant.dev/job?id={job_id}&environmentId={env_id}`\n- Transcripts: `https://taiga.ant.dev/transcripts?id={job_id}&problemId={problem_id}&...`\n\nThe `id` parameter in URLs is the job_id.\n\n## Tips\n\n1. Use Python with `urllib.request` - avoid shell due to env var bugs\n2. Cookie expires periodically - refresh from browser if auth fails\n3. `/jobs/{id}/problems` is the main endpoint for checking pass rates\n4. For streaming large responses, use the `/stream` variants\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:02:27.750Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Python-based AI Agents needing seamless integration with the Taiga evaluation platform API for job results and transcripts.","zh":"非常适合需要与Taiga评估平台API无缝集成以获取作业结果和转录的Python 기반AI代理。","ja":"Taiga評価プラットフォームAPIとのシームレスな統合が必要なPythonベースのAIエージェントに最適です。ジョブ結果とトランスクリプトが得られます。","ko":"Taiga 평가 플랫폼 API와의 무결점 통합이 필요한 파이썬 기반 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 작업 결과와 트랜스크립트를 얻을 수 있습니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA basados en Python que necesitan una integración sin problemas con la API de la plataforma de evaluación Taiga para resultados de trabajo y transcripciones.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA basés sur Python ayant besoin d''une intégration transparente avec l''API de la plateforme d''évaluation Taiga pour les résultats de travail et les transcriptions.","de":"Perfekt für Python-basierte KI-Agents, die eine nahtlose Integration mit der Taiga-Bewertungsplattform-API für Job-Ergebnisse und Transkripte benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA baseados em Python que necessitam de integração sem problemas com a plataforma de API de avaliação Taiga para resultados de trabalhos e transcritos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ на основе Python, которым требуется бесшовная интеграция с платформой API Taiga для оценки результатов работы и транскриптов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يعتمد على بيثون والذي يحتاج إلى دمج بدون مشاكل مع منصة تايغا لتقييم واجهة برمجة التطبيقات لنتائج الوظيفة والنصوص"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to query the Taiga API using Python, providing access to job results, transcripts, and problem runs, while avoiding shell environment variable and pipe bugs that can strip cookie values, utilizing Python libraries for secure cookie handling.","zh":"使代理能够使用Python查询Taiga API，提供对作业结果、转录和问题运行的访问，同时避免shell环境变量和管道错误，这些错误可能会剥夺cookie值，并利用Python库进行安全的cookie处理。","ja":"エージェントがPythonを使用してTaiga APIにクエリを実行できるようにし、ジョブ結果、トランスクリプト、問題の実行結果へのアクセスを提供します。また、Cookie値を剥奪する可能性のあるシェルの環境変数やパイプのバグを避け、Pythonライブラリを使用して安全にCookieを処理します。","ko":"에이전트가 파이썬을 사용하여 Taiga API에 쿼리를 실행할 수 있도록 하여 작업 결과, 트랜스크립트 및 문제 실행 결과에 대한 액세스를 제공하며, 쿠키 값을剥奪할 수 있는 쉘 환경 변수 및 파이프 버그를 피하고 파이썬 라이브러리를 사용하여 쿠키를 안전하게 처리합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a consultar la API de Taiga usando Python, proporcionando acceso a resultados de trabajo, transcripciones y ejecuciones de problemas, mientras evita errores de entorno de shell y tuberías que pueden eliminar valores de cookies, utilizando bibliotecas de Python para el manejo seguro de cookies.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''interroger l''API Taiga en utilisant Python, en fournissant un accès aux résultats de travail, aux transcriptions et aux exécutions de problèmes, tout en évitant les bogues d''environnement shell et de tuyaux qui peuvent supprimer les valeurs de cookies, en utilisant des bibliothèques Python pour la gestion sécurisée des cookies.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, die Taiga-API mit Python abzufragen, und bietet Zugriff auf Job-Ergebnisse, Transkripte und Problem-Runs, während es Shell-Umgebungsvariable- und Pipe-Fehler vermeidet, die Cookie-Werte löschen können, indem es Python-Bibliotheken für sicheres Cookie-Handling nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a consultar a API Taiga usando Python, fornecendo acesso a resultados de trabalhos, transcritos e execuções de problemas, enquanto evita bugs de variáveis de ambiente e pipe do shell que podem remover valores de cookie, utilizando bibliotecas Python para manipulação segura de cookies.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность запроса API Taiga с помощью Python, обеспечивая доступ к результатам работы, транскриптам и запускам проблем, при этом избегая ошибок переменных среды и конвейера оболочки, которые могут удалять значения файлов cookie, используя библиотеки Python для безопасной обработки файлов cookie.","ar":"يمنح العميل إمكانية استفسار واجهة برمجة تطبيقات تايغا باستخدام بيثون، ويوفر الوصول إلى نتائج الوظيفة والنصوص وتشغيل المشكلات، مع تجنب أخطاء متغيرات بيئة الجلج وخط الأنابيب التي يمكن أن تزيل قيم ملفات تعريف الارتباط، باستخدام مكتبات بيثون لمعالجة ملفات تعريف الارتباط بشكل آمن."},"useCases":{"en":["Querying job results from the Taiga platform","Retrieving transcripts for further analysis","Fetching problem runs for debugging purposes"],"zh":["从Taiga平台查询作业结果","检索转录以进行进一步分析","获取问题运行结果以进行调试"],"ja":["Taigaプラットフォームからのジョブ結果の照会","トランスクリプトの取得による詳細分析","デバッグ目的の問題の実行結果の取得"],"ko":["Taiga 플랫폼에서 작업 결과 쿼리","추가 분석을 위한 트랜스크립트 검색","디버깅 목적으로 문제 실행 결과 가져오기"],"es":["Consulta de resultados de trabajo de la plataforma Taiga","Recuperación de transcripciones para un análisis posterior","Recuperación de ejecuciones de problemas para fines de depuración"],"fr":["Interrogation des résultats de travail de la plateforme Taiga","Récupération de transcriptions pour une analyse ultérieure","Récupération d''exécutions de problèmes pour des fins de débogage"],"de":["Abfrage von Job-Ergebnissen von der Taiga-Plattform","Abruf von Transkripten für weitere Analysen","Abruf von Problem-Runs für Debugging-Zwecke"],"pt":["Consulta de resultados de trabalhos da plataforma Taiga","Recuperação de transcritos para análise adicional","Recuperação de execuções de problemas para fins de depuração"],"ru":["Запрос результатов работы из платформы Taiga","Получение транскриптов для дальнейшего анализа","Получение запусков проблем для целей отладки"],"ar":["استفسار نتائج الوظيفة من منصة تايغا","استرجاع النصوص لتحليل إضافي","استرجاع تشغيل المشكلات لأغراض التصحيح"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment","Taiga API access credentials necessary","Avoids shell usage due to potential cookie value stripping"],"zh":["需要Python环境","需要Taiga API访问凭证","避免使用shell以防止潜在的cookie值剥夺"],"ja":["Python環境が必要","Taiga APIへのアクセス資格情報が必要","Cookie値の剥奪を避けるためにシェルの使用を避ける"],"ko":["파이썬 환경 필요","Taiga API 액세스 자격 증명 필요","潜在적인 쿠키 값剥奪을 피하기 위해 쉘 사용 안함"],"es":["Requiere entorno de Python","Se necesitan credenciales de acceso a la API de Taiga","Evita el uso de shell debido a la posible eliminación de valores de cookies"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python","Des informations d''identification d''accès à l''API Taiga sont nécessaires","Évite l''utilisation de shell en raison de la suppression potentielle de valeurs de cookies"],"de":["Benötigt Python-Umgebung","Zugriffsberechtigungen für die Taiga-API sind erforderlich","Vermeidet Shell-Nutzung aufgrund des potenziellen Löschens von Cookie-Werten"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Python","Credenciais de acesso à API Taiga necessárias","Evita uso do shell devido à possibilidade de remoção de valores de cookie"],"ru":["Требуется среда Python","Необходимы учетные данные доступа к API Taiga","Избегает использования оболочки из-за возможности удаления значений файлов cookie"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة بيثون","معلومات اعتماد الوصول إلى واجهة برمجة تطبيقات تايغا ضرورية","يتجنب استخدام الجلج بسبب احتمال إزالة قيم ملفات تعريف الارتباط"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
