 المنافسة","كلود كود","مهارات العمل","تحليل السوق","استراتيجية العمل","المنافسة"]}},"owner":"BellaBe","repo":"lean-os","repoPath":"BellaBe/lean-os","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.429Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"fnd.r-analyzing-competition","description":"Maps competitive landscape, identifies positioning gaps, and assesses competitor threats. Use when analyzing competition, finding white space, mapping alternatives, or building Canvas section 06.","bodyPreview":"# Competitive Analyzing\n\nMap competitive landscape and identify positioning opportunities.\n\n## Canvas Files\n\n- **Reads:** 01.context.md (industry dynamics), 04.segments.md (target segment), 05.problem.md (problems being solved)\n- **Writes:** 06.competitive.md\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore competitive analysis:\n- `strategy/canvas/05.problem.md` must exist (problems define competitive frame)\n- `strategy/canvas/04.segments.md` should exist (segment defines competitive context)\n\nIf missing:\n```\n\"Competi","body":"# Competitive Analyzing\n\nMap competitive landscape and identify positioning opportunities.\n\n## Canvas Files\n\n- **Reads:** 01.context.md (industry dynamics), 04.segments.md (target segment), 05.problem.md (problems being solved)\n- **Writes:** 06.competitive.md\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore competitive analysis:\n- `strategy/canvas/05.problem.md` must exist (problems define competitive frame)\n- `strategy/canvas/04.segments.md` should exist (segment defines competitive context)\n\nIf missing:\n```\n\"Competitive analysis requires problem definition from 05.problem.md.\n\nCompetition is framed by what problems you solve for whom.\n\nRun fnd.r-scoring-problems skill or fnd-researcher agent first.\"\n```\n\n## Process\n\n### Step 1: Load Context\n\nRead from canvas:\n- **Problems** from 05.problem.md — What problems are we solving?\n- **Segment** from 04.segments.md — Who are we solving for?\n- **Industry** from 01.context.md (if exists) — Industry dynamics\n\n### Step 2: Identify Direct Competitors\n\nDirect competitors solve the **same problem** for the **same segment** with a **similar solution**.\n\nFor each problem in 05.problem.md:\n1. Search for existing solutions\n2. Identify companies explicitly targeting this problem\n3. Note their positioning, pricing, and target segment\n\n**Search queries:**\n- \"[Problem] software\"\n- \"[Problem] solution for [segment]\"\n- \"[Segment] [problem] tools\"\n- \"Alternative to [known competitor]\"\n\n**Data sources:**\n- G2, Capterra, Product Hunt\n- Crunchbase (funding, positioning)\n- Company websites (messaging, pricing)\n- LinkedIn (company size, hiring)\n\n### Step 3: Identify Indirect Competitors\n\nIndirect competitors solve the **same problem** with a **different approach** OR serve **adjacent needs**.\n\nCategories:\n| Type | Example |\n|------|---------|\n| Manual process | Spreadsheets, email, paper |\n| Adjacent product | Feature in larger platform |\n| Service provider | Consultants, agencies |\n| DIY solution | Internal tools, scripts |\n| Status quo | Do nothing |\n\n### Step 4: Profile Each Competitor\n\nFor direct competitors, capture:\n\n| Attribute | Source |\n|-----------|--------|\n| Positioning | Website headline, tagline |\n| Target segment | Website copy, case studies |\n| Pricing model | Pricing page |\n| Price points | Pricing page, G2 |\n| Key differentiators | Features page, comparisons |\n| Weaknesses | G2 reviews, Reddit, complaints |\n| Funding/size | Crunchbase, LinkedIn |\n| Growth signals | Hiring, news, product launches |\n\n### Step 5: Build Positioning Matrix\n\nCreate 2x2 positioning map:\n\n**Choose axes that matter to buyers:**\n| Axis Option | When to Use |\n|-------------|-------------|\n| Price (low/high) | Price-sensitive market |\n| Complexity (simple/complex) | Workflow-heavy products |\n| Target (SMB/Enterprise) | Clear segment splits |\n| Approach (AI/Manual) | Technology differentiation |\n| Breadth (Point/Platform) | Build vs. buy decisions |\n\n**Map competitors:**\n1. Place each competitor on the matrix\n2. Identify clusters (crowded positions)\n3. Find white space (unoccupied positions)\n\n### Step 6: Identify Positioning Gaps\n\nGaps are unoccupied or underserved positions:\n\n| Gap Type | Signal | Opportunity |\n|----------|--------|-------------|\n| Price gap | No option between $X and $Y | Mid-market play |\n| Feature gap | Problem partially solved | Complete solution |\n| Segment gap | Underserved buyer type | Focused positioning |\n| Approach gap | Old technology dominant | Modern alternative |\n| Experience gap | All options complex | Simplicity play |\n\n**Validate gaps:**\n- Is the gap intentional (unviable) or overlooked?\n- Is there demand for this position?\n- Can we credibly occupy this position?\n\n### Step 7: Assess Competitive Threats\n\nFor top 3-5 competitors:\n\n| Threat | Assessment |\n|--------|------------|\n| Response speed | How fast can they copy us? |\n| Resource advantage | Funding, team, distribution |\n| Switching costs | How locked-in are their users? |\n| Brand strength | Trust, recognition |\n| Expansion likelihood | Are they moving toward us? |\n\n**Threat level:**\n- **High:** Well-funded, fast, overlapping roadmap\n- **Medium:** Capable but distracted or slow\n- **Low:** Resource-constrained, different focus\n\n### Step 8: Write Output\n\nWrite to `strategy/canvas/06.competitive.md` using output format below.\n\n## Output Format\n\n```markdown\n# 06. Competitive Landscape\n\n## Competitive Frame\n\n**Problem being solved:** [From 05.problem — primary problem]\n**Segment served:** [From 04.segments — primary segment]\n**Category:** [Market category name]\n\n## Direct Competitors\n\n### [Competitor 1]\n\n| Attribute | Value |\n|-----------|-------|\n| Positioning | [Their headline/tagline] |\n| Target | [Who they serve] |\n| Pricing | [Model and price points] |\n| Strengths | [What they do well] |\n| Weaknesses | [Gaps, complaints] |\n| Threat Level | High/Medium/Low |\n\n**Source:** [G2, website, etc.]\n\n---\n\n### [Competitor 2]\n\n[Same structure]\n\n---\n\n### [Competitor 3]\n\n[Same structure]\n\n---\n\n## Indirect Competitors\n\n| Alternative | Type | How Used | Limitation |\n|-------------|------|----------|------------|\n| [Spreadsheets] | Manual | [How] | [Why inadequate] |\n| [Platform X] | Adjacent | [How] | [Why inadequate] |\n| [Agency Y] | Service | [How] | [Why inadequate] |\n\n## Positioning Matrix\n\n**Axes:**\n- X-axis: [Dimension 1] (low → high)\n- Y-axis: [Dimension 2] (low → high)\n\n**Map:**\n```\n              HIGH [Dimension 2]\n                    │\n    [Competitor A]  │  [Competitor B]\n                    │\nLOW ────────────────┼──────────────── HIGH\n[Dimension 1]       │           [Dimension 1]\n                    │\n    [Gap: ?]        │  [Competitor C]\n                    │\n              LOW [Dimension 2]\n```\n\n## Positioning Gaps\n\n| Gap | Position | Why Valuable | Our Fit |\n|-----|----------|--------------|---------|\n| [Gap 1] | [Description] | [Demand signal] | High/Med/Low |\n| [Gap 2] | [Description] | [Demand signal] | High/Med/Low |\n\n## Recommended Position\n\n**Position:** [Specific position statement]\n**Rationale:** [Why this gap + why we can own it]\n\n## Competitive Response Prediction\n\n| If We... | They Likely... | Our Counter |\n|----------|----------------|-------------|\n| Enter market | [Response] | [Strategy] |\n| Win customers | [Response] | [Strategy] |\n| [Specific move] | [Response] | [Strategy] |\n\n## Competitive Intelligence Gaps\n\n| Unknown | Why It Matters | How to Learn |\n|---------|----------------|--------------|\n| [Gap 1] | [Impact] | [Method] |\n| [Gap 2] | [Impact] | [Method] |\n```\n\n## Quality Criteria\n\nBefore finalizing, verify:\n\n- [ ] At least 3 direct competitors profiled\n- [ ] Indirect competitors documented\n- [ ] Positioning matrix has clear axes\n- [ ] At least 1 actionable gap identified\n- [ ] Threat assessment for top competitors\n- [ ] Recommended position stated\n\n## Competitor Profile Template\n\nQuick capture format for research:\n\n```markdown\n## [Competitor Name]\n\n**Website:** [URL]\n**Founded:** [Year]\n**Funding:** $[X] ([Stage])\n**Size:** [Employees]\n\n**Positioning:** \"[Their tagline]\"\n**Target:** [Segment]\n**Pricing:** [Model] — $[X]-$[Y]\n\n**Strengths:**\n- [Strength 1]\n- [Strength 2]\n\n**Weaknesses (from reviews):**\n- [Weakness 1]\n- [Weakness 2]\n\n**Recent moves:**\n- [News, launches, hires]\n```\n\n## Boundaries\n\n- Does NOT predict competitor strategy with certainty\n- Does NOT guarantee positioning gap is viable\n- Does NOT validate market demand for gap\n- Competitor data is point-in-time — markets shift\n- Review complaints are selection-biased\n- Does NOT handle patent/IP competitive analysis\n- Requires problem definition before meaningful analysis\n- Positioning recommendation is hypothesis until validated"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:02:58.963Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Business Strategy Agents requiring competitive landscape analysis and market positioning insights.","zh":"Ideal for Business Strategy Agents requiring competitive landscape analysis and market positioning insights.","ja":"Ideal for Business Strategy Agents requiring competitive landscape analysis and market positioning insights.","ko":"Ideal for Business Strategy Agents requiring competitive landscape analysis and market positioning insights.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Estrategia Empresarial que requieren análisis de paisaje competitivo y conocimientos de posicionamiento en el mercado.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de stratégie commerciale nécessitant une analyse du paysage concurrentiel et des connaissances sur le positionnement sur le marché.","de":"Ideal für Geschäftsstrategieagenten, die eine Wettbewerbslandschaftsanalyse und Marktpositionierungserkenntnisse erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Estratégia de Negócios que exigem análise da paisagem competitiva e insights de posicionamento de mercado.","ru":"Идеально для бизнес-стратегических агентов, требующих анализа конкурентной среды и информацию о позиционировании на рынке.","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء الاستراتيجية التجارية الذين يتطلبون تحليل المناظر التنافسية وأضواء موضع السوق."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to map competitive landscapes and identify positioning opportunities by analyzing industry dynamics, target segments, and problems being solved, leveraging Canvas Files such as 01.context.md, 04.segments.md, and 05.problem.md to generate strategic 06.competitive.md reports.","zh":"Empowers agents to map competitive landscapes and identify positioning opportunities by analyzing industry dynamics, target segments, and problems being solved, leveraging Canvas Files such as 01.context.md, 04.segments.md, and 05.problem.md to generate strategic 06.competitive.md reports.","ja":"Empowers agents to map competitive landscapes and identify positioning opportunities by analyzing industry dynamics, target segments, and problems being solved, leveraging Canvas Files such as 01.context.md, 04.segments.md, and 05.problem.md to generate strategic 06.competitive.md reports.","ko":"Empowers agents to map competitive landscapes and identify positioning opportunities by analyzing industry dynamics, target segments, and problems being solved, leveraging Canvas Files such as 01.context.md, 04.segments.md, and 05.problem.md to generate strategic 06.competitive.md reports.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a cartografiar paisajes competitivos e identificar oportunidades de posicionamiento analizando la dinámica de la industria, segmentos objetivo y problemas que se resuelven, utilizando archivos de lienzo como 01.context.md, 04.segments.md y 05.problem.md para generar informes estratégicos 06.competitive.md.","fr":"Permet aux agents de cartographier les paysages concurrentiels et d''identifier les opportunités de positionnement en analysant la dynamique de l''industrie, les segments cibles et les problèmes résolus, en utilisant des fichiers de canevas tels que 01.context.md, 04.segments.md et 05.problem.md pour générer des rapports stratégiques 06.competitive.md.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Wettbewerbslandschaften zu kartieren und Positionierungsmöglichkeiten zu identifizieren, indem sie die Branchendynamik, Zielsegmente und gelöste Probleme analysieren und Canvas-Dateien wie 01.context.md, 04.segments.md und 05.problem.md verwenden, um strategische 06.competitive.md-Berichte zu generieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a mapear paisagens competitivas e identificar oportunidades de posicionamento, analisando dinâmicas da indústria, segmentos-alvo e problemas a serem resolvidos, utilizando arquivos Canvas como 01.context.md, 04.segments.md e 05.problem.md para gerar relatórios estratégicos 06.competitive.md.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью картографировать конкурентную среду и определять возможности позиционирования, анализируя динамику отрасли, целевые сегменты и проблемы, которые необходимо решить, используя файлы Canvas, такие как 01.context.md, 04.segments.md и 05.problem.md для генерации стратегических отчетов 06.competitive.md.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من رسم الخرائط للمناظر التنافسية وتحديد فرص الموضع من خلال تحليل ديناميات الصناعة والقطاعات المستهدفة والمشاكل التي يتم حلها، باستخدام ملفات Canvas مثل 01.context.md و 04.segments.md و 05.problem.md لتوليد تقارير إستراتيجية 06.competitive.md."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing industry dynamics to inform strategic decisions","Identifying market gaps and opportunities for solo founders","Generating competitive landscape reports to guide business positioning"],"zh":["Analyzing industry dynamics to inform strategic decisions","Identifying market gaps and opportunities for solo founders","Generating competitive landscape reports to guide business positioning"],"ja":["Analyzing industry dynamics to inform strategic decisions","Identifying market gaps and opportunities for solo founders","Generating competitive landscape reports to guide business positioning"],"ko":["Analyzing industry dynamics to inform strategic decisions","Identifying market gaps and opportunities for solo founders","Generating competitive landscape reports to guide business positioning"],"es":["Análisis de la dinámica de la industria para informar decisiones estratégicas","Identificación de brechas y oportunidades de mercado para fundadores individuales","Generación de informes de paisaje competitivo para guiar la posición empresarial"],"fr":["Analyse de la dynamique de l''industrie pour éclairer les décisions stratégiques","Identification des lacunes et des opportunités de marché pour les fondateurs individuels","Génération de rapports de paysage concurrentiel pour guider la position commerciale"],"de":["Analyse der Branchendynamik, um strategische Entscheidungen zu treffen","Identifizierung von Marktlücken und -chancen für einzelne Gründer","Erstellung von Wettbewerbslandschaftsberichten, um die Geschäftspositionierung zu leiten"],"pt":["Analisar dinâmicas da indústria para informar decisões estratégicas","Identificar lacunas e oportunidades de mercado para fundadores solo","Gerar relatórios de paisagem competitiva para orientar o posicionamento de negócios"],"ru":["Анализ динамики отрасли для принятия стратегических решений","Определение пробелов и возможностей на рынке для сольных основателей","Генерация отчетов о конкурентной среде для руководства позиционированием бизнеса"],"ar":["تحليل ديناميات الصناعة لإبلاغ القرارات الإستراتيجية","تحديد الفجوات وفرص السوق لصانعي المؤسسات الفردية","توليد تقارير عن المناظر التنافسية لتوجيه موضع الأعمال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires existing strategy/canvas/05.problem.md and recommends strategy/canvas/04.segments.md files","Specific to Claude Code skills system and AI Business OS framework"],"zh":["Requires existing strategy/canvas/05.problem.md and recommends strategy/canvas/04.segments.md files","Specific to Claude Code skills system and AI Business OS framework"],"ja":["Requires existing strategy/canvas/05.problem.md and recommends strategy/canvas/04.segments.md files","Specific to Claude Code skills system and AI Business OS framework"],"ko":["Requires existing strategy/canvas/05.problem.md and recommends strategy/canvas/04.segments.md files","Specific to Claude Code skills system and AI Business OS framework"],"es":["Requiere archivos de estrategia/canvas/05.problem.md existentes y recomienda archivos de estrategia/canvas/04.segments.md","Específico del sistema de habilidades Claude Code y del marco de trabajo de AI Business OS"],"fr":["Nécessite des fichiers de stratégie/canevas/05.problem.md existants et recommande des fichiers de stratégie/canevas/04.segments.md","Spécifique au système de compétences Claude Code et au cadre de travail AI Business OS"],"de":["Benötigt bestehende Strategie/Canvas/05.problem.md-Dateien und empfiehlt Strategie/Canvas/04.segments.md-Dateien","Spezifisch für das Claude-Code-Fähigkeitssystem und das AI-Business-OS-Rahmenwerk"],"pt":["Exige existência de estratégia/canvas/05.problem.md e recomenda arquivos estratégia/canvas/04.segments.md","Específico para o sistema de habilidades Claude Code e o framework AI Business OS"],"ru":["Требует существования стратегии/canvas/05.problem.md и рекомендует файлы стратегии/canvas/04.segments.md","Конкретно для системы навыков Claude Code и фреймворка AI Business OS"],"ar":["يتطلب وجود استراتيجية/قنفذ/05.problem.md ويوصي بملفات استراتيجية/قنفذ/04.segments.md","محدد لنظام مهارات Claude Code وإطار العمل AI Business OS"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
