ult, Consul, AWS, HTTP, etc.)","Funciones extensas para el procesamiento de datos","Compatibilidad con la sintaxis text/template de Go","Depuración y gestión de plantillas","Integración con Home Assistant"],"fr":["Prise en charge de plusieurs types de données (JSON, YAML, Vault, Consul, AWS, HTTP, etc.)","Fonctions étendues pour le traitement de données","Compatibilité avec la syntaxe text/template de Go","Débogage et gestion de modèles","Intégration avec Home Assistant"],"de":["Unterstützung für multiple Datentypen (JSON, YAML, Vault, Consul, AWS, HTTP, usw.)","Umfangreiche Funktionen für die Datenverarbeitung","Kompatibilität mit der text/template-Syntax von Go","Fehlerbehebung und Verwaltung von Vorlagen","Integration mit Home Assistant"],"pt":["Suporte a vários tipos de fontes de dados (JSON, YAML, Vault, Consul, AWS, HTTP, etc.)","Sintaxe text/template do Go com funções extensas","Criação de templates personalizados para Home Assistant Apps/Addons","Depuração e gerenciamento de templates","Integração com Home Assistant Apps/Addons"],"ru":["Поддержка нескольких типов источников данных (JSON, YAML, Vault, Consul, AWS, HTTP и т. д.)","Синтаксис text/template от Go с обширными функциями","Создание пользовательских шаблонов для приложений и дополнений Home Assistant","Отладка и управление шаблонами","Интеграция с приложениями и дополнениями Home Assistant"],"ar":["دعم لمصادر بيانات متعددة (JSON، YAML، Vault، Consul، AWS، HTTP، إلخ)","بنية النص/قالب من جو مع وظائف متقدمة","إنشاء قوالب مخصصة لتطبيقات و إضافات Home Assistant","تصحيح وأدارة القوالب","التكامل مع تطبيقات و إضافات Home Assistant"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Gomplate","模板渲染器","Go text/template","多数据源支持","模板开发","调试和管理"],"ja":["Gomplate","テンプレートレンダラー","Go text/template","複数のデータソースサポート","テンプレート開発","デバッグと管理"],"ko":["Gomplate","템플릿 렌더러","Go text/template","多 데이터 ソース 지원","템플릿 개발","디버깅과 관리"],"es":["gomplate","templating","Home Assistant","plantillas","datos","JSON","YAML","Vault","Consul","AWS"],"fr":["gomplate","templating","Home Assistant","modèles","données","JSON","YAML","Vault","Consul","AWS"],"de":["gomplate","templating","Home Assistant","Vorlagen","Daten","JSON","YAML","Vault","Consul","AWS"],"pt":["gomplate","renderizador de templates","Home Assistant","Apps/Addons","desenvolvedores","templates personalizados","fontes de dados","depuração","gerenciamento"],"ru":["gomplate","шаблонизатор","Home Assistant","приложения и дополнения","разработчики","пользовательские шаблоны","источники данных","отладка","управление"],"ar":["جومبليت","معالج قوالب","Home Assistant","تطبيقات و إضافات","المطورين","قوالب مخصصة","مصادر بيانات","تصحيح","إدارة"]}},"owner":"rigerc","repo":"ha-apps","repoPath":"rigerc/ha-apps","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.429Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"gomplate","description":"This skill should be used when the user asks to create a gomplate template, work with gomplate, use gomplate datasources, configure gomplate, fix gomplate template, debug gomplate syntax, create .gomplate.yaml, or mentions gomplate templating, Go templates with datasources, or template rendering with external data.","version":"0.1.0","bodyPreview":"# Gomplate Templating Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nProvide comprehensive guidance for creating, debugging, and managing gomplate templates. Gomplate is a powerful template renderer that uses Go''s text/template syntax enhanced with extensive functions and support for multiple datasource types (JSON, YAML, Vault, Consul, AWS, HTTP, and more).\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Creating new gomplate templates from scratch\n- Working with datasources (file, HTTP, Vault, Consul, AWS S3, etc.)\n-","body":"# Gomplate Templating Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nProvide comprehensive guidance for creating, debugging, and managing gomplate templates. Gomplate is a powerful template renderer that uses Go''s text/template syntax enhanced with extensive functions and support for multiple datasource types (JSON, YAML, Vault, Consul, AWS, HTTP, and more).\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Creating new gomplate templates from scratch\n- Working with datasources (file, HTTP, Vault, Consul, AWS S3, etc.)\n- Debugging template syntax errors or function usage\n- Creating or modifying `.gomplate.yaml` configuration files\n- Converting environment variables or data files into structured output\n- Generating configuration files from templates and external data\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Understand Template Basics\n\nGomplate uses Go''s `text/template` syntax with `{{` and `}}` delimiters. Templates combine static text with dynamic actions.\n\n**Basic syntax:**\n```\nHello, {{ env.Getenv \"USER\" }}!\n```\n\n**Key concepts:**\n- Actions are delimited by `{{` and `}}`\n- Variables start with `$` (e.g., `{{ $name := \"value\" }}`)\n- The context is accessed with `.` (period)\n- Functions perform operations (e.g., `{{ add 1 2 }}`)\n\n**Whitespace control:**\n- `{{-` removes leading whitespace/newlines\n- `-}}` removes trailing whitespace/newlines\n- Use both to suppress newlines entirely: `{{- action -}}`\n\n### Step 2: Working with Datasources\n\nDatasources are the primary way to inject external data into templates.\n\n**Define datasources with `-d` flag:**\n```bash\ngomplate -d config=./config.json -i ''value: {{ (ds \"config\").key }}''\ngomplate -d data=https://api.example.com/data.json -i ''{{ (ds \"data\").field }}''\n```\n\n**Common datasource schemes:**\n- `file://` or relative path - Local files\n- `http://`, `https://` - HTTP endpoints\n- `vault://` - HashiCorp Vault secrets\n- `consul://` - HashiCorp Consul KV store\n- `aws+smp://` - AWS Systems Manager Parameter Store\n- `aws+sm://` - AWS Secrets Manager\n- `s3://` - Amazon S3 objects\n- `env:` - Environment variables\n- `stdin:` - Standard input\n\n**Access datasources in templates:**\n```\n{{ $config := ds \"config\" }}\n{{ $config.database.host }}\n```\n\n**Use context datasources (loaded before rendering):**\n```bash\ngomplate -c user=./user.json -i ''Hello {{ .user.name }}''\n```\n\nConsult **`references/datasources-guide.md`** for comprehensive datasource documentation.\n\n### Step 3: Create Templates\n\n**Simple variable substitution:**\n```\nName: {{ env.Getenv \"USER\" }}\nHome: {{ env.Getenv \"HOME\" }}\n```\n\n**Conditionals:**\n```\n{{ if eq (env.Getenv \"ENV\") \"production\" -}}\nProduction configuration\n{{- else -}}\nDevelopment configuration\n{{- end }}\n```\n\n**Loops:**\n```\n{{ range $key, $value := ds \"config\" -}}\n{{ $key }}: {{ $value }}\n{{ end }}\n```\n\n**Functions:**\nGomplate provides extensive built-in functions across namespaces:\n- `env` - Environment variables\n- `strings` - String manipulation\n- `coll` - Collection operations\n- `conv` - Type conversion\n- `data` - Data parsing\n- `file` - File operations\n- `math` - Mathematical operations\n\nExample:\n```\n{{ $data := file.Read \"/etc/config.json\" | data.JSON }}\n{{ $data.setting | strings.ToUpper }}\n```\n\nSee **`examples/basic-template.tmpl`** and **`examples/advanced-template.tmpl`** for working examples.\n\n### Step 4: Configure with .gomplate.yaml\n\nFor complex scenarios with multiple datasources, create a `.gomplate.yaml` configuration file.\n\n**Basic structure:**\n```yaml\ninputDir: templates/\noutputDir: rendered/\n\ndatasources:\n  config:\n    url: file:///etc/app/config.yaml\n  secrets:\n    url: vault:///secret/app\n\ncontext:\n  user:\n    url: https://api.example.com/user.json\n    header:\n      Authorization: [\"Bearer token123\"]\n```\n\n**Common configuration options:**\n- `inputFiles` / `outputFiles` - Specify input/output file pairs\n- `inputDir` / `outputDir` - Process entire directories\n- `datasources` - Define lazy-loaded datasources\n- `context` - Define immediately-loaded datasources\n- `excludes` - Exclude patterns for inputDir\n- `leftDelim` / `rightDelim` - Override default delimiters\n- `plugins` - Define custom function plugins\n\nConsult **`references/config-reference.md`** for complete configuration details and **`examples/gomplate-config.yaml`** for a working example.\n\n### Step 5: Handle Common Patterns\n\n**Merge multiple datasources:**\n```bash\ngomplate -d merged=merge:prod.yaml|defaults.yaml -i ''{{ (ds \"merged\").setting }}''\n```\n\n**Use pipes for data transformation:**\n```\n{{ \"hello world\" | strings.ToUpper | strings.ReplaceAll \" \" \"-\" }}\n```\n\n**Access nested data:**\n```\n{{ (ds \"config\").database.connections.primary.host }}\n{{ index (ds \"config\") \"database\" \"connections\" \"primary\" \"host\" }}\n```\n\n**Iterate with index:**\n```\n{{ range $idx, $item := coll.Slice \"one\" \"two\" \"three\" -}}\n{{ add 1 $idx }}: {{ $item }}\n{{ end }}\n```\n\n**Handle missing keys safely:**\n```bash\n# Error on missing keys (default)\ngomplate --missing-key error -i ''{{ .name }}''\n\n# Return zero value\ngomplate --missing-key zero -i ''{{ .name | default \"Unknown\" }}''\n```\n\nSee **`references/common-patterns.md`** for more examples.\n\n### Step 6: Debug Templates\n\n**Common error: undefined variable**\n```\nError: undefined variable \"$foo\"\n```\nFix: Declare variable outside control structure or use `:=` for first assignment.\n\n**Common error: missing datasource**\n```\nError: no datasource with alias ''config''\n```\nFix: Verify datasource is defined with `-d` flag or in `.gomplate.yaml`.\n\n**Common error: invalid function**\n```\nError: function \"doesnotexist\" not defined\n```\nFix: Check function namespace and syntax in function reference.\n\n**Enable verbose logging:**\n```bash\ngomplate --verbose -f template.tmpl -o output.txt\n```\n\nConsult **`references/troubleshooting.md`** for comprehensive debugging guidance.\n\n### Step 7: Process Multiple Files\n\n**Using input-dir and output-dir:**\n```bash\ngomplate --input-dir ./templates --output-dir ./config\n```\n\n**Exclude patterns:**\n```bash\ngomplate --input-dir ./templates --output-dir ./config \\\n  --exclude ''*.md'' --exclude ''draft/*''\n```\n\n**Output mapping (rename files):**\n```bash\ngomplate --input-dir templates \\\n  --output-map ''out/{{ .in | strings.ReplaceAll \".tmpl\" \"\" }}''\n```\n\n**Preserve directory structure:**\nAll files in input directory are processed recursively, maintaining directory structure in output.\n\n## Best Practices\n\n**Use descriptive datasource aliases:**\n```bash\n# Good\ngomplate -d appConfig=config.yaml -d dbSecrets=vault:///db/creds\n\n# Avoid\ngomplate -d c=config.yaml -d d=vault:///db/creds\n```\n\n**Leverage progressive disclosure:**\nKeep templates focused. Move complex logic to datasources or helper templates.\n\n**Use nested templates for reusability:**\n```\n{{ define \"header\" }}\n=== {{ . }} ===\n{{ end }}\n\n{{ template \"header\" \"Configuration\" }}\n```\n\n**Handle errors gracefully:**\nUse `default`, `has`, and `required` functions to handle missing data:\n```\n{{ .user.email | default \"no-email@example.com\" }}\n{{ if has .config \"debug\" }}Debug: {{ .config.debug }}{{ end }}\n{{ .apiKey | required \"API key is required\" }}\n```\n\n**Test templates with sample data:**\nCreate test JSON/YAML files before connecting to live datasources like Vault or Consul.\n\n## Additional Resources\n\n### Reference Files\n\nFor detailed information, consult:\n- **`references/datasources-guide.md`** - Complete datasource documentation\n- **`references/config-reference.md`** - Configuration file options\n- **`references/functions-overview.md`** - Function namespaces and usage\n- **`references/syntax-guide.md`** - Template syntax details\n- **`references/common-patterns.md`** - Practical template patterns\n- **`references/troubleshooting.md`** - Debugging and error resolution\n\n### Example Files\n\nWorking examples in `examples/`:\n- **`examples/basic-template.tmpl`** - Simple template with variables and functions\n- **`examples/advanced-template.tmpl`** - Complex template with datasources and loops\n- **`examples/gomplate-config.yaml`** - Complete configuration file example\n- **`examples/vault-template.tmpl`** - Vault datasource usage\n- **`examples/multi-datasource.tmpl`** - Merging multiple datasources\n\n### Scripts\n\nUtility scripts in `scripts/`:\n- **`scripts/validate-template.sh`** - Validate template syntax\n- **`scripts/test-template.sh`** - Test template with sample data\n- **`scripts/render-all.sh`** - Batch render templates with common config\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n**Common commands:**\n```bash\n# Inline template\ngomplate -i ''Hello {{ env.Getenv \"USER\" }}''\n\n# File input/output\ngomplate -f template.tmpl -o output.txt\n\n# With datasource\ngomplate -d config=config.yaml -f template.tmpl -o output.txt\n\n# Multiple files\ngomplate -f app.tmpl -f db.tmpl -o app.conf -o db.conf\n\n# Directory processing\ngomplate --input-dir templates/ --output-dir config/\n\n# With config file\ngomplate --config .gomplate.yaml\n\n# Stdin input\necho \"Hello {{ env.Getenv \"USER\" }}\" | gomplate\n```\n\n**Common functions:**\n```\n{{ env.Getenv \"VAR\" }}           - Get environment variable\n{{ strings.ToUpper \"text\" }}     - Uppercase string\n{{ coll.Has .map \"key\" }}        - Check if key exists\n{{ data.JSON (file.Read \"x.json\") }} - Parse JSON file\n{{ ds \"datasource\" }}            - Load datasource\n{{ ds \"datasource\" \"key\" }}      - Load specific key from datasource\n{{ index .map \"key\" }}           - Access map with complex key\n{{ default \"fallback\" .value }}  - Provide default value\n{{ required \"msg\" .value }}      - Require value or error\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:03:37.244Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Automation Agents requiring advanced template rendering with Go''s text/template syntax and support for multiple datasources like JSON, YAML, and Vault.","zh":"适用于需要使用Go的text/template语法进行高级模板渲染，并支持多种数据源（如JSON、YAML和Vault）的自动化代理。","ja":"Goのtext/template構文を使用した高度なテンプレートレンダリングと、JSON、YAML、Vaultなどの複数のデータソースをサポートする自動化エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 템플릿 렌더링을 위해 Go의 text/template 구문을 사용하고 JSON, YAML 및 Vault와 같은 여러 데이터 소스를 지원하는 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de automatización que requieren renderizado de plantillas avanzado con la sintaxis de text/template de Go y soporte para múltiples fuentes de datos como JSON, YAML y Vault.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''automatisation nécessitant un rendu de modèle avancé avec la syntaxe text/template de Go et un support pour plusieurs sources de données comme JSON, YAML et Vault.","de":"Ideal für Automatisierungsagenten, die erweitertes Template-Rendering mit der text/template-Syntax von Go und Unterstützung für mehrere Datenquellen wie JSON, YAML und Vault erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Automação que exigem renderização de modelos avançada com a sintaxe text/template do Go e suporte a múltiplas fontes de dados como JSON, YAML e Vault.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации, требующих продвинутого рендеринга шаблонов с синтаксисом text/template от Go и поддержкой нескольких источников данных, таких как JSON, YAML и Vault.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الآليين الذين يحتاجون إلى عرض قوالب متقدم باستخدام بناء الجملة text/template الخاص ب Go ودعم لمнож来源 البيانات مثل JSON و YAML و Vault."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create, debug, and manage gomplate templates with extensive functions, leveraging datasources such as HTTP, Consul, AWS, and more, for comprehensive automation tasks.","zh":"赋予代理创建、调试和管理gomplate模板的能力，利用HTTP、Consul、AWS等数据源的广泛功能，实现全面自动化任务。","ja":"エージェントがgomplateテンプレートを作成、デバッグ、管理できるようにし、HTTP、Consul、AWSなどのデータソースを利用して、包括的な自動化タスクを実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 gomplate 템플릿을 생성, 디버깅 및 관리할 수 있도록 하며, HTTP, Consul, AWS 등과 같은 데이터 소스를 사용하여 포괄적인 자동화 작업을 수행할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear, depurar y gestionar plantillas de gomplate con funciones extensas, aprovechando fuentes de datos como HTTP, Consul, AWS y más, para tareas de automatización comprehensivas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer, de déboguer et de gérer des modèles gomplate avec des fonctions étendues, en exploitant des sources de données telles que HTTP, Consul, AWS et plus encore, pour des tâches d''automatisation complètes.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, gomplate-Vorlagen zu erstellen, zu debuggen und zu verwalten, mit umfangreichen Funktionen, die Datenquellen wie HTTP, Consul, AWS und mehr nutzen, für umfassende Automatisierungsaufgaben.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar, depurar e gerenciar modelos gomplate com funções extensas, aproveitando fontes de dados como HTTP, Consul, AWS e muito mais, para tarefas de automação abrangentes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать, отлаживать и управлять шаблонами gomplate с обширными функциями, используя источники данных, такие как HTTP, Consul, AWS и многие другие, для всесторонних задач автоматизации.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء وتصحيح وأدارة قوالب gomplate مع وظائف واسعة، مستفيدة من مصادر البيانات مثل HTTP و Consul و AWS وغيرها، لمهام الأتمتة الشاملة."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating new gomplate templates from scratch","Debugging existing gomplate templates with complex datasource integrations","Managing gomplate templates across multiple environments with varying datasource types"],"zh":["从头开始创建新的gomplate模板","调试具有复杂数据源集成的现有gomplate模板","在具有不同数据源类型的多个环境中管理gomplate模板"],"ja":["新しいgomplateテンプレートを作成する","複雑なデータソース統合を持つ既存のgomplateテンプレートをデバッグする","複数の環境間でgomplateテンプレートを管理する（異なるデータソースタイプ）"],"ko":["새로운 gomplate 템플릿을 처음부터 생성하는 것","複雑한 데이터 소스 통합을 갖춘 기존 gomplate 템플릿을 디버깅하는 것","다양한 데이터 소스 유형을 갖춘 여러 환경에서 gomplate 템플릿을 관리하는 것"],"es":["Creación de nuevas plantillas de gomplate desde cero","Depuración de plantillas de gomplate existentes con integraciones de fuentes de datos complejas","Gestión de plantillas de gomplate en varios entornos con tipos de fuentes de datos variables"],"fr":["Création de nouveaux modèles gomplate à partir de zéro","Débogage de modèles gomplate existants avec des intégrations de sources de données complexes","Gestion de modèles gomplate dans plusieurs environnements avec des types de sources de données variables"],"de":["Erstellung neuer gomplate-Vorlagen von Grund auf","Fehlerbehebung bei bestehenden gomplate-Vorlagen mit komplexen Datenquellen-Integrationen","Verwaltung von gomplate-Vorlagen in mehreren Umgebungen mit variablen Datenquellentypen"],"pt":["Criar novos modelos gomplate do zero","Depurar modelos gomplate existentes com integrações de fontes de dados complexas","Gerenciar modelos gomplate em vários ambientes com tipos de fontes de dados variados"],"ru":["Создание новых шаблонов gomplate с нуля","Отладка существующих шаблонов gomplate с сложными интеграциями источников данных","Управление шаблонами gomplate в нескольких средах с разными типами источников данных"],"ar":["إنشاء قوالب gomplate جديدة من الصفر","تصحيح قوالب gomplate الحالية مع تكنولوجيا مخلوطات مصادر البيانات المعقدة","إدارة قوالب gomplate عبر بيئات متعددة مع أنواع مختلفة لمصادر البيانات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Go''s text/template syntax","Dependent on datasource availability and compatibility (e.g., Vault, Consul, AWS)"],"zh":["需要了解Go的text/template语法","依赖于数据源的可用性和兼容性（例如Vault、Consul、AWS）"],"ja":["Goのtext/template構文の知識が必要","データソースの可用性と互換性（例：Vault、Consul、AWS）に依存する"],"ko":["Go의 text/template 구문을 이해해야 함","데이터 소스의 가용성 및 호환성(예: Vault, Consul, AWS)에 의존함"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de la sintaxis de text/template de Go","Depende de la disponibilidad y compatibilidad de las fuentes de datos (por ejemplo, Vault, Consul, AWS)"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances de la syntaxe text/template de Go","Dépend de la disponibilité et de la compatibilité des sources de données (par exemple, Vault, Consul, AWS)"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der text/template-Syntax von Go","Hängt von der Verfügbarkeit und Kompatibilität der Datenquellen ab (z. B. Vault, Consul, AWS)"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento da sintaxe text/template do Go","Depende da disponibilidade e compatibilidade das fontes de dados (por exemplo, Vault, Consul, AWS)"],"ru":["Требует знания синтаксиса text/template от Go","Зависит от доступности и совместимости источников данных (например, Vault, Consul, AWS)"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بناء الجملة text/template الخاص ب Go","يعتمد على توافر ومتانة مصادر البيانات (على سبيل المثال Vault و Consul و AWS)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
