вление рабочими процессами","ar":"منسق.Cascade: تحسين العمليات","en":"cascade-orchestrator"},"description":{"zh":"级联编排器（增强版）是一种管理工作流的工具，集成了Codex沙盒迭代、多模型路由等功能","ja":"カスケードオーケストレーター（強化版）とは、ワークフローを管理するツールで、Codexサンドボックスの反復やマルチモデルのルーティングなどを統合","ko":"캐스케이드 오케스트레이터(강화版)는 워크플ロー 관리 도구로 Codex 샌드박스 반복, 멀티 모델 라우팅 등 기능을 통합","es":"Cascade Orchestrator es una herramienta que gestiona flujos de trabajo complejos integrando tecnologías como Codex. Mejora la eficiencia y la productividad","fr":"Cascade Orchestrator est un outil qui gère des flux de travail complexes en intégrant des technologies comme Codex. Il améliore l''efficacité et la productivité","de":"Cascade-Orchestrierer ist ein Werkzeug, das komplexe Arbeitsflüsse verwaltet, indem es Technologien wie Codex integriert. Es verbessert die Effizienz und Pro...","pt":"O Cascade Orchestrator é uma ferramenta que gerencia fluxos de trabalho, integrando várias micro-habilidades em processos coesos","ru":"Cascade Orchestrator - это инструмент, который управляет рабочими процессами, интегрируя несколько микро-навыков в связные процессы","ar":"منسق.Cascade هو أداة لإدارة تدفقات العمل، وتكامل مهارات متعددة في عمليات مترابطة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Codex沙盒迭代","多模型路由","ruv-swarm协调","内存持久化"],"ja":["Codexサンドボックスの反復","マルチモデルのルーティング","ruv-swarmの調整","メモリの永続化"],"ko":["Codex 샌드박스 반복","멀티 모델 라우팅","ruv-swarm 조정","메모리 지속"],"es":["Codex Sandbox Iteration","Multi-model routing","Ruv-swarm coordination","Memoria persistente en varias etapas","Integración de tecnologías de vanguardia"],"fr":["Itération de bac à sable Codex","Routing multi-modèle","Coordination de ruv-swarm","Mémoire persistante à plusieurs étapes","Intégration de technologies de pointe"],"de":["Codex-Sandbox-Iteration","Multi-Modell-Routing","Ruv-Schwarm-Koordination","Persistente Speicherung über mehrere Stufen","Integration von SpitzenTechnologien"],"pt":["Integração com sandbox de Codex","Coordenação de modelos múltiplos","Ruv-swarm coordination","Memória persistente em várias etapas"],"ru":["Интеграция с песочницей Codex","Координация нескольких моделей","Координация Ruv-swarm","ПERSISTентная память на нескольких этапах"],"ar":["التكامل مع حجر الرمل من Codex","تنسيق النماذج المتعددة","تنسيق Ruv-swarm","الذاكرة الثابتة عبر المراحل المتعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["级联编排器","工作流管理","Codex沙盒","多模型路由","ruv-swarm","内存持久化"],"ja":["カスケードオーケストレーター","ワークフロー管理","Codexサンドボックス","マルチモデルのルーティング","ruv-swarm","メモリの永続化"],"ko":["캐스케이드 오케스트레이터","워크플ロー 관리","Codex 샌드박스","멀티 모델 라우팅","ruv-swarm","메모리 지속"],"es":["gestión de flujos de trabajo","Cascade Orchestrator","Codex","micro-habilidades","automatización de procesos","tecnologías de vanguardia","desarrollo de software","productividad"],"fr":["gestion de flux de travail","Orchestrateur Cascade","Codex","micro-compétences","automatisation de processus","technologies de pointe","développement de logiciels","productivité"],"de":["Verwaltung von Arbeitsflüssen","Cascade-Orchestrierer","Codex","Mikro-Fähigkeiten","Automatisierung von Prozessen","SpitzenTechnologien","Software-Entwicklung","Produktivität"],"pt":["Cascade Orchestrator","gerenciamento de fluxos de trabalho","integração de micro-habilidades","Codex sandbox","coordenação de modelos","ruv-swarm"],"ru":["Cascade Orchestrator","управление рабочими процессами","интеграция микро-навыков","песочница Codex","координация моделей","Ruv-swarm"],"ar":["منسق.Cascade","إدارة تدفقات العمل","تكامل المهارات المتعددة","حجر الرمل من Codex","تنسيق النماذج","Ruv-swarm"]}},"owner":"DNYoussef","repo":"ai-chrome-extension","repoPath":"DNYoussef/ai-chrome-extension","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.429Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cascade-orchestrator","description":"Creates sophisticated workflow cascades coordinating multiple micro-skills with sequential pipelines, parallel execution, conditional branching, and Codex sandbox iteration. Enhanced with multi-model routing (Gemini/Codex), ruv-swarm coordination, memory persistence, and audit-pipeline patterns for production workflows.","version":"2.0.0","tags":["orchestration","workflows","cascades","multi-model","codex-integration","tier-2"],"bodyPreview":"# Cascade Orchestrator (Enhanced)\n\n## Overview\nManages workflows (cascades) that coordinate multiple micro-skills into cohesive processes. This enhanced version integrates Codex sandbox iteration, multi-model routing, ruv-swarm coordination, and memory persistence across stages.\n\n## Philosophy: Composable Excellence\n\nComplex capabilities emerge from composing simple, well-defined components.\n\n**Enhanced Capabilities**:\n- **Codex Sandbox Iteration**: Auto-fix failures in isolated environment (fro","body":"# Cascade Orchestrator (Enhanced)\n\n## Overview\nManages workflows (cascades) that coordinate multiple micro-skills into cohesive processes. This enhanced version integrates Codex sandbox iteration, multi-model routing, ruv-swarm coordination, and memory persistence across stages.\n\n## Philosophy: Composable Excellence\n\nComplex capabilities emerge from composing simple, well-defined components.\n\n**Enhanced Capabilities**:\n- **Codex Sandbox Iteration**: Auto-fix failures in isolated environment (from audit-pipeline)\n- **Multi-Model Routing**: Use Gemini/Codex based on stage requirements\n- **Swarm Coordination**: Parallel execution via ruv-swarm MCP\n- **Memory Persistence**: Maintain context across stages\n- **GitHub Integration**: CI/CD pipeline automation\n\n**Key Principles**:\n1. Separation of concerns (micro-skills execute, cascades coordinate)\n2. Reusability through composition\n3. Flexible orchestration patterns\n4. Declarative workflow definition\n5. Intelligent model selection\n\n## Cascade Architecture (Enhanced)\n\n### Definition Layer\n\n**Extended Stage Types**:\n```yaml\nstages:\n  - type: sequential     # One after another\n  - type: parallel       # Simultaneous execution\n  - type: conditional    # Based on runtime conditions\n  - type: codex-sandbox  # NEW: Iterative testing with auto-fix\n  - type: multi-model    # NEW: Intelligent AI routing\n  - type: swarm-parallel # NEW: Coordinated via ruv-swarm\n```\n\n**Enhanced Data Flow**:\n```yaml\ndata_flow:\n  - stage_output: previous stage results\n  - shared_memory: persistent across stages\n  - multi_model_context: AI-specific formatting\n  - codex_sandbox_state: isolated test environment\n```\n\n**Advanced Error Handling**:\n```yaml\nerror_handling:\n  - retry_with_backoff\n  - fallback_to_alternative\n  - codex_auto_fix        # NEW: Auto-fix via Codex\n  - model_switching       # NEW: Try different AI\n  - swarm_recovery        # NEW: Redistribute tasks\n```\n\n### Execution Engine (Enhanced)\n\n**Stage Scheduling with AI Selection**:\n```python\nfor stage in cascade.stages:\n    if stage.type == \"codex-sandbox\":\n        execute_with_codex_iteration(stage)\n    elif stage.type == \"multi-model\":\n        model = select_optimal_model(stage.task)\n        execute_on_model(stage, model)\n    elif stage.type == \"swarm-parallel\":\n        execute_via_ruv_swarm(stage)\n    else:\n        execute_standard(stage)\n```\n\n**Codex Sandbox Iteration Loop**:\n```python\ndef execute_with_codex_iteration(stage):\n    \"\"\"\n    From audit-pipeline Phase 2: functionality-audit pattern\n    \"\"\"\n    results = execute_tests(stage.tests)\n\n    for test in failed_tests(results):\n        iteration = 0\n        max_iterations = 5\n\n        while test.failed and iteration < max_iterations:\n            # Spawn Codex in sandbox\n            fix = spawn_codex_auto(\n                task=f\"Fix test failure: {test.error}\",\n                sandbox=True,\n                context=test.context\n            )\n\n            # Re-test\n            test.result = rerun_test(test)\n            iteration += 1\n\n            if test.passed:\n                apply_fix_to_main(fix)\n                break\n\n        if still_failed(test):\n            escalate_to_user(test)\n\n    return aggregate_results(results)\n```\n\n**Multi-Model Routing**:\n```python\ndef select_optimal_model(task):\n    \"\"\"\n    Route to best AI based on task characteristics\n    \"\"\"\n    if task.requires_large_context:\n        return \"gemini-megacontext\"  # 1M tokens\n    elif task.needs_current_info:\n        return \"gemini-search\"        # Web grounding\n    elif task.needs_visual_output:\n        return \"gemini-media\"          # Imagen/Veo\n    elif task.needs_rapid_prototype:\n        return \"codex-auto\"            # Full Auto\n    elif task.needs_alternative_view:\n        return \"codex-reasoning\"       # GPT-5-Codex\n    else:\n        return \"claude\"                # Best overall\n```\n\n## Enhanced Cascade Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Linear Pipeline with Multi-Model\n\n```yaml\ncascade:\n  name: enhanced-data-pipeline\n  stages:\n    - stage: extract\n      model: auto-select\n      skill: extract-data\n\n    - stage: validate\n      model: auto-select\n      skill: validate-data\n      error_handling:\n        strategy: codex-auto-fix  # NEW\n\n    - stage: transform\n      model: codex-auto           # Fast prototyping\n      skill: transform-data\n\n    - stage: report\n      model: gemini-media         # Generate visuals\n      skill: generate-report\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Parallel Fan-Out with Swarm\n\n```yaml\ncascade:\n  name: code-quality-swarm\n  stages:\n    - stage: quality-checks\n      type: swarm-parallel        # NEW: Via ruv-swarm\n      skills:\n        - lint-code\n        - security-scan\n        - complexity-analysis\n        - test-coverage\n      swarm_config:\n        topology: mesh\n        max_agents: 4\n        strategy: balanced\n\n    - stage: aggregate\n      skill: merge-quality-reports\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Codex Sandbox Iteration\n\n```yaml\ncascade:\n  name: test-and-fix\n  stages:\n    - stage: functionality-audit\n      type: codex-sandbox         # NEW\n      test_suite: comprehensive\n      codex_config:\n        mode: full-auto\n        max_iterations: 5\n        sandbox: true\n      error_recovery:\n        auto_fix: true\n        escalate_after: 5\n\n    - stage: validate-fixes\n      skill: regression-tests\n```\n\n### Pattern 4: Conditional with Model Switching\n\n```yaml\ncascade:\n  name: adaptive-workflow\n  stages:\n    - stage: analyze\n      model: gemini-megacontext   # Large context\n      skill: analyze-codebase\n\n    - stage: decide\n      type: conditional\n      condition: ${analyze.quality_score}\n      branches:\n        high_quality:\n          model: codex-auto       # Fast path\n          skill: deploy-fast\n        low_quality:\n          model: multi-model      # Comprehensive path\n          cascade: deep-quality-audit\n```\n\n### Pattern 5: Iterative with Memory\n\n```yaml\ncascade:\n  name: iterative-refinement\n  stages:\n    - stage: refactor\n      model: auto-select\n      skill: refactor-code\n      memory: persistent          # NEW\n\n    - stage: check-quality\n      skill: quality-metrics\n\n    - stage: repeat-decision\n      type: conditional\n      condition: ${quality < threshold}\n      repeat: refactor            # Loop back\n      max_iterations: 3\n      memory_shared: true         # Context persists\n```\n\n## Creating Enhanced Cascades\n\n### Step 1: Define with AI Considerations\n\n**Identify Model Requirements**:\n```markdown\nFor each stage, determine:\n- Large context needed? → Gemini\n- Current web info needed? → Gemini Search\n- Visual output needed? → Gemini Media\n- Rapid prototyping needed? → Codex\n- Testing with auto-fix? → Codex Sandbox\n- Best overall reasoning? → Claude\n```\n\n### Step 2: Design with Swarm Parallelism\n\n**When to Use Swarm**:\n- Multiple independent tasks\n- Resource-intensive operations\n- Need load balancing\n- Want fault tolerance\n\n**Swarm Configuration**:\n```yaml\nswarm_config:\n  topology: mesh | hierarchical | star\n  max_agents: number\n  strategy: balanced | specialized | adaptive\n  memory_shared: true | false\n```\n\n### Step 3: Add Codex Iteration for Quality\n\n**Pattern from audit-pipeline**:\n```yaml\nstages:\n  - type: codex-sandbox\n    tests: ${test_suite}\n    fix_strategy:\n      auto_fix: true\n      max_iterations: 5\n      sandbox_isolated: true\n      network_disabled: true\n      regression_check: true\n```\n\n### Step 4: Enable Memory Persistence\n\n**Shared Memory Across Stages**:\n```yaml\nmemory:\n  persistence: enabled\n  scope: cascade | global\n  storage: mcp__ruv-swarm__memory\n  keys:\n    - analysis_results\n    - intermediate_outputs\n    - learned_patterns\n```\n\n## Enhanced Cascade Definition Format\n\n```yaml\ncascade:\n  name: cascade-name\n  description: What this accomplishes\n  version: 2.0.0\n\n  config:\n    multi_model: enabled\n    swarm_coordination: enabled\n    memory_persistence: enabled\n    github_integration: enabled\n\n  inputs:\n    - name: input-name\n      type: type\n      description: description\n\n  stages:\n    - stage_id: stage-1\n      name: Stage Name\n      type: sequential | parallel | codex-sandbox | multi-model | swarm-parallel\n      model: auto-select | gemini | codex | claude\n\n      # For micro-skill execution\n      skills:\n        - skill: micro-skill-name\n          inputs: {...}\n          outputs: {...}\n\n      # For Codex sandbox\n      codex_config:\n        mode: full-auto\n        sandbox: true\n        max_iterations: 5\n\n      # For swarm execution\n      swarm_config:\n        topology: mesh\n        max_agents: 4\n\n      # For memory\n      memory:\n        read_keys: [...]\n        write_keys: [...]\n\n      error_handling:\n        strategy: retry | codex-auto-fix | model-switch | swarm-recovery\n        max_retries: 3\n        fallback: alternative-skill\n\n  memory:\n    persistence: enabled\n    scope: cascade\n\n  github_integration:\n    create_pr: on_success\n    report_issues: on_failure\n```\n\n## Real-World Enhanced Cascades\n\n### Example 1: Complete Development Workflow\n\n```yaml\ncascade: complete-dev-workflow\nstages:\n  1. gemini-search: \"Research latest framework best practices\"\n  2. codex-auto: \"Rapid prototype with best practices\"\n  3. codex-sandbox: \"Test everything, auto-fix failures\"\n  4. gemini-media: \"Generate architecture diagrams\"\n  5. style-audit: \"Polish code to production standards\"\n  6. github-pr: \"Create PR with comprehensive report\"\n```\n\n### Example 2: Legacy Modernization\n\n```yaml\ncascade: modernize-legacy-code\nstages:\n  1. gemini-megacontext: \"Analyze entire 50K line codebase\"\n  2. theater-detection: \"Find all mocks and placeholders\"\n  3. [swarm-parallel]:\n     - codex-auto: \"Complete implementations\" (parallel)\n     - gemini-media: \"Document architecture\"\n  4. codex-sandbox: \"Test all changes with auto-fix\"\n  5. style-audit: \"Final polish\"\n  6. generate-pr: \"Create PR with before/after comparison\"\n```\n\n### Example 3: Bug Fix with RCA\n\n```yaml\ncascade: intelligent-bug-fix\nstages:\n  1. root-cause-analyzer: \"Deep RCA analysis\"\n  2. multi-model-decision:\n     condition: ${rca.complexity}\n     simple: codex-auto (quick fix)\n     complex: [\n       gemini-megacontext (understand broader context),\n       codex-reasoning (alternative approaches),\n       claude (implement best approach)\n     ]\n  3. codex-sandbox: \"Test fix thoroughly\"\n  4. regression-suite: \"Ensure no breakage\"\n  5. github-issue-update: \"Document fix with RCA report\"\n```\n\n## Integration Points\n\n### With Micro-Skills\n- Executes micro-skills in stages\n- Passes data between skills\n- Handles skill errors gracefully\n\n### With Multi-Model System\n- Routes stages to optimal AI\n- Uses gemini-* skills for unique capabilities\n- Uses codex-* skills for prototyping/fixing\n- Uses Claude for best reasoning\n\n### With Audit Pipeline\n- Incorporates theater → functionality → style pattern\n- Uses Codex sandbox iteration from Phase 2\n- Applies quality gates throughout\n\n### With Slash Commands\n- Commands trigger cascades\n- Parameter mapping from command to cascade\n- Progress reporting to command interface\n\n### With Ruv-Swarm MCP\n- Parallel stage coordination\n- Memory persistence\n- Neural training\n- Performance tracking\n\n## Working with Enhanced Cascade Orchestrator\n\n**Invocation**:\n\"Create a cascade that [end goal] using [micro-skills] with [Codex/Gemini/swarm] capabilities\"\n\n**The orchestrator will**:\n1. Design workflow with optimal AI model selection\n2. Configure Codex sandbox for testing stages\n3. Set up swarm coordination for parallel stages\n4. Enable memory persistence across stages\n5. Integrate with GitHub for CI/CD\n6. Generate executable cascade definition\n\n**Advanced Features**:\n- Automatic model routing based on task\n- Codex iteration loop for auto-fixing\n- Swarm coordination for parallelism\n- Memory sharing across stages\n- GitHub PR/issue integration\n- Performance monitoring and optimization\n\n---\n\n**Version 2.0 Enhancements**:\n- Codex sandbox iteration pattern\n- Multi-model intelligent routing\n- Ruv-swarm MCP integration\n- Memory persistence\n- GitHub workflow automation\n- Enhanced error recovery\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:03:47.040Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced AI Agents like AutoGPT and LangChain needing enhanced workflow management through cascade orchestration","zh":"适用于如 AutoGPT 和 LangChain 等高级 AI 代理，需要通过级联编排增强工作流管理","ja":"AutoGPT や LangChain などの高度な AI エージェントに適しており、カスケード オーケストレーションを通じてワークフロー管理を強化する必要がある","ko":"AutoGPT 및 LangChain과 같은 고급 AI 에이전트에 적합하며 캐스케이드 오케스트레이션을 통해 워크플ロー 관리를 강화하는 데 필요합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA avanzados como AutoGPT y LangChain que necesitan una gestión de flujo de trabajo mejorada a través de una orquestación en cascada","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA avancés comme AutoGPT et LangChain nécessitant une gestion de flux de travail améliorée via une orchestration en cascade","de":"Ideal für erweiterte KI-Agents wie AutoGPT und LangChain, die eine verbesserte Workflow-Verwaltung durch Cascade-Orchestrierung benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Avançados, como AutoGPT e LangChain, que necessitam de gestão de fluxo de trabalho aprimorada por meio de orquestração em cascata","ru":"Идеально подходит для передовых агентов ИИ, таких как AutoGPT и LangChain, требующих улучшенного управления рабочим процессом посредством каскадной оркестрации","ar":"مثالي للوكيلات الذكية المتقدمة مثل AutoGPT و LangChain التي تحتاج إلى إدارة سير عمل محسنة من خلال تنسيق متسلسل"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to compose complex workflows by integrating Codex sandbox iteration, multi-model routing, and ruv-swarm coordination, ensuring memory persistence across stages and enhancing overall process cohesion through composable excellence","zh":"赋予代理通过集成 Codex 沙盒迭代、多模型路由和 ruv-swarm 协调来构成复杂工作流的能力，确保各阶段内存持久性，并通过可组合卓越性增强整体流程凝聚力","ja":"Codex サンドボックスのイテレーション、多モデルルーティング、ruv-swarm の調整を統合することで、複雑なワークフローを構成できるエージェントをEmpowerし、各段階のメモリ持続性を確保し、コンポーザブルな優れたものを通じて全体的なプロセスの凝集力を高める","ko":"Codex 샌드박스 반복, 다중 모델 라우팅 및 ruv-swarm 조정을 통합하여 복잡한 워크플ロー 구성이 가능하도록 에이전트에게 권한을 부여하고 각 단계의 메모리 지속성을 보장하며 구성 가능한 우수성을 통해 전체 프로세스의 응집력을 향상시킵니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a componer flujos de trabajo complejos integrando la iteración de sandbox de Codex, la enrutamiento multi-modelo y la coordinación de ruv-swarm, garantizando la persistencia de memoria en todas las etapas y mejorando la cohesión general del proceso a través de la excelencia componible","fr":"Permet aux agents de composer des flux de travail complexes en intégrant l''itération de sandbox de Codex, la routage multi-modèle et la coordination de ruv-swarm, assurant la persistance de la mémoire à travers toutes les étapes et améliorant la cohésion générale du processus via l''excellence composable","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, komplexe Workflows zu komponieren, indem sie die Sandbox-Iteration von Codex, die Multi-Modell-Weiterleitung und die ruv-Swarm-Koordination integrieren, wodurch die Speicherpersistenz über alle Stufen hinweg gewährleistet und die Gesamtkohärenz des Prozesses durch komponierbare Exzellenz verbessert wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a compor fluxos de trabalho complexos, integrando iteração de areia de Codex, roteamento multi-modelo e coordenação de enxame ruv, garantindo a persistência de memória em todas as etapas e melhorando a coesão geral do processo por meio de excelência componível","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью составлять сложные рабочие процессы, интегрируя итерацию песочницы Codex, многомодельное маршрутизация и координацию роя ruv, обеспечивая сохранение памяти на всех этапах и повышая общую связность процесса за счет составной совершенства","ar":"تمكّن الوكيلات من تأليف سلاسل عمل معقدة من خلال دمج تكرار حجر الرمل من Codex وتصريف متعدد النماذج وتنسيق سرب ruv، مما يضمن استمرار الذاكرة عبر المراحل وتعزيز تماسك العملية العام من خلال تميز قابل للتركيب"},"useCases":{"en":["Orchestrating multi-stage workflows with Codex sandbox iteration for auto-fixing failures","Coordinating ruv-swarm activities for distributed task management","Implementing multi-model routing for adaptive workflow adjustments"],"zh":["通过 Codex 沙盒迭代来编排多阶段工作流以自动修复故障","协调 ruv-swarm 活动进行分布式任务管理","实施多模型路由以进行适应性工作流调整"],"ja":["Codex サンドボックスのイテレーションを使用して、自動での障害修復を可能にするマルチステージ ワークフローをオーケストレーションする","ruv-swarm のアクティビティを調整して分散タスク管理を行う","マルチモデル ルーティングを実施して適応性ワークフロー調整を行う"],"ko":["Codex 샌드박스 반복을 사용하여 자동으로 장애를 수정하는 다단계 워크플로를 오케스트레이션합니다","ruv-swarm 활동을 조정하여 분산 태스크 관리를 수행합니다","다중 모델 라우팅을 구현하여 적응형 워크플로 조정을 수행합니다"],"es":["Orquestar flujos de trabajo multietapa con iteración de sandbox de Codex para la corrección automática de fallos","Coordinar actividades de ruv-swarm para la gestión de tareas distribuidas","Implementar enrutamiento multi-modelo para ajustes de flujo de trabajo adaptativos"],"fr":["Orchestrer des flux de travail multétapes avec l''itération de sandbox de Codex pour la correction automatique des défaillances","Coordonner les activités de ruv-swarm pour la gestion de tâches distribuées","Mettre en œuvre un routage multi-modèle pour des ajustements de flux de travail adaptatifs"],"de":["Multistufige Workflows mit der Sandbox-Iteration von Codex für die automatische Fehlerbehebung orchestrieren","Ruv-Swarm-Aktivitäten für die verteilte Aufgabenverwaltung koordinieren","Multi-Modell-Weiterleitung für adaptive Workflow-Anpassungen implementieren"],"pt":["Orquestração de fluxos de trabalho multietapas com iteração de areia de Codex para correção automática de falhas","Coordenação de atividades de enxame ruv para gerenciamento de tarefas distribuídas","Implementação de roteamento multi-modelo para ajustes adaptativos de fluxo de trabalho"],"ru":["Оркестрация многостадийных рабочих процессов с итерацией песочницы Codex для автоматического исправления сбоев","Координация деятельности роя ruv для распределенного управления задачами","Реализация многомодельного маршрутизации для адаптивных корректировок рабочего процесса"],"ar":["تنسيق سلاسل العمل متعددة المراحل مع تكرار حجر الرمل من Codex لتصحيح الأعطال بشكل تلقائي","تنسيق أنشطة سرب ruv لإدارة المهام الموزعة","تنفيذ تصريف متعدد النماذج لت调节 سلاسل العمل التكيفية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires isolated environment for Codex sandbox iteration","Dependent on memory persistence for workflow continuity","Complexity may increase with the number of integrated micro-skills"],"zh":["需要隔离环境以进行 Codex 沙盒迭代","依赖于内存持久性以实现工作流连续性","复杂性可能会随着集成的微技能数量而增加"],"ja":["Codex サンドボックスのイテレーションを行うために隔離された環境が必要","ワークフロー連続性を実現するためにメモリ持続性に依存","複雑さは統合されるマイクロスキルの数とともに増加する可能性がある"],"ko":["Codex 샌드박스 반복을 수행하기 위해 격리된 환경이 필요합니다","워크플로 연속성을 구현하기 위해 메모리 지속성에 의존합니다","복잡성은 통합되는 마이크로 스킬의 수와 함께 증가할 수 있습니다"],"es":["Requiere un entorno aislado para la iteración de sandbox de Codex","Depende de la persistencia de memoria para la continuidad del flujo de trabajo","La complejidad puede aumentar con el número de micro-habilidades integradas"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement isolé pour l''itération de sandbox de Codex","Dépend de la persistance de la mémoire pour la continuité du flux de travail","La complexité peut augmenter avec le nombre de micro-competences intégrées"],"de":["Benötigt eine isolierte Umgebung für die Sandbox-Iteration von Codex","Ist von der Speicherpersistenz für die Workflow-Kontinuität abhängig","Die Komplexität kann mit der Anzahl der integrierten Mikrofähigkeiten zunehmen"],"pt":["Requer ambiente isolado para iteração de areia de Codex","Depende da persistência de memória para continuidade do fluxo de trabalho","A complexidade pode aumentar com o número de micro-habilidades integradas"],"ru":["Требует изолированной среды для итерации песочницы Codex","Зависит от сохранения памяти для непрерывности рабочего процесса","Сложность может увеличиться с количеством интегрированных микро-навыков"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة معزولة لتحديث حجر الرمل من Codex","يعتمد على استمرار الذاكرة لاستمرارية سير العمل","قد تزيد التعقيدات مع عدد المهارات الصغيرة المتكاملة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('toilahuongg/Shopify-Agents-Kit/shopify-metafields', 'community', 'toilahuongg', 'Shopify-Agents-Kit', 'toilahuongg/Shopify-Agents-Kit', 'shopify-metafields', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.429Z', '2026-02-18T05:03:22.203Z', NULL, '{"id":"toilahuongg/Shopify-Agents-Kit/shopify-metafields","name":"shopify-metafields","description":{"zh":"Shopify元字段允许您在Shopify资源上存储额外数据，扩展默认模式","ja":"Shopify Metafieldsは、Shopifyリソース上に追加データを保存できるようにし、デフォルトのスキーマを拡張します","ko":"Shopify 메타 필드는 Shopify 리소스에 추가 데이터를 저장할 수 있게 해주어 기본 스키마를 확장합니다","es":"Los campos meta de Shopify permiten almacenar datos adicionales en recursos como productos, pedidos y clientes. Aprende a utilizarlos para personalizar tu tienda.","fr":"Les champs meta Shopify permettent de stocker des données supplémentaires sur les ressources telles que les produits, les commandes et les clients. Apprenez à les utiliser pour personnaliser votre boutique.","de":"Die Metafelder von Shopify ermöglichen die Speicherung zusätzlicher Daten in Ressourcen wie Produkten, Bestellungen und Kunden. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie sie verwenden, um Ihren Shop zu personalisieren.","pt":"Os campos meta do Shopify permitem armazenar dados adicionais em recursos como produtos e pedidos.","ru":"Мета-поля Shopify позволяют хранить дополнительные данные в ресурсах, таких как продукты и заказы.","ar":"تتيح حقول ميتا في Shopify تخزين البيانات الإضافية في الموارد مثل المنتجات والطلبات.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Shopify元字段：扩展产品数据","ja":"Shopify Metafields：商品データ拡張","ko":"Shopify 메타 필드: 제품 데이터 확장","es":"Campos Meta de Shopify","fr":"Champs Meta Shopify","de":"Shopify Metafelder","pt":"Campos Meta do Shopify","ru":"Мета-поля Shopify","ar":"حقول ميتا في Shopify","en":"shopify-metafields"},"description":{"zh":"Shopify元字段允许您在Shopify资源上存储额外数据，扩展默认模式","ja":"Shopify Metafieldsは、Shopifyリソース上に追加データを保存できるようにし、デフォルトのスキーマを拡張します","ko":"Shopify 메타 필드는 Shopify 리소스에 추가 데이터를 저장할 수 있게 해주어 기본 스키마를 확장합니다","es":"Los campos meta de Shopify permiten almacenar datos adicionales en recursos como productos, pedidos y clientes. Aprende a utilizarlos para personalizar tu ti...","fr":"Les champs meta Shopify permettent de stocker des données supplémentaires sur les ressources telles que les produits, les commandes et les clients. Apprenez ...","de":"Die Metafelder von Shopify ermöglichen die Speicherung zusätzlicher Daten in Ressourcen wie Produkten, Bestellungen und Kunden. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie sie ver...","pt":"Os campos meta do Shopify permitem armazenar dados adicionais em recursos como produtos e pedidos.","ru":"Мета-поля Shopify позволяют хранить дополнительные данные в ресурсах, таких как продукты и заказы.","ar":"تتيح حقول ميتا في Shopify تخزين البيانات الإضافية في الموارد مثل المنتجات والطلبات.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["支持多种数据类型","可用于产品、订单、客户和店铺资源","具有命名空间和键的概念","支持JSON数据类型","可用于扩展默认模式"],"ja":["複数のデータタイプをサポート","商品、注文、顧客、ショップなどのリソースで使用可能","名前空間とキーの概念を備えている","JSONデータタイプをサポート","デフォルトのスキーマを拡張するために使用可能"],"ko":["여러 데이터 유형 지원","제품, 주문, 고객, 상점 등 리소스에서 사용 가능","네임스페이스와 키의 개념","JSON 데이터 유형 지원","기본 스키마 확장에 사용 가능"],"es":["Almacenamiento de datos adicionales en recursos de Shopify","Personalización de la tienda con campos meta","Compatibilidad con diferentes tipos de datos","Uso de espacios de nombres para organizar los campos meta","Asignación de propietarios a los campos meta"],"fr":["Stockage de données supplémentaires sur les ressources Shopify","Personnalisation de la boutique avec les champs meta","Compatibilité avec différents types de données","Utilisation d''espaces de noms pour organiser les champs meta","Affectation de propriétaires aux champs meta"],"de":["Speicherung zusätzlicher Daten in Shopify-Ressourcen","Anpassung des Shops mit Metafeldern","Unterstützung verschiedener Datentypen","Verwendung von Namensräumen zur Organisation der Metafelder","Zuweisung von Besitzern zu den Metafeldern"],"pt":["Armazenamento de dados adicionais em recursos do Shopify","Suporte a vários tipos de dados","Possibilidade de criar namespaces personalizados","Integração com recursos como produtos e pedidos","Suporte a JSON e outros formatos de dados"],"ru":["Хранение дополнительных данных в ресурсах Shopify","Поддержка нескольких типов данных","Возможность создания пользовательских пространств имен","Интеграция с ресурсами, такими как продукты и заказы","Поддержка JSON и других форматов данных"],"ar":["تخزين البيانات الإضافية في موارد Shopify","دعم أنواع متعددة من البيانات","إمكانية إنشاء مساحات أسماء مخصصة","التكامل مع الموارد مثل المنتجات والطلبات","دعم JSON وأشكال أخرى من البيانات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Shopify元字段","Shopify开发","电子商务平台","产品数据存储","扩展默认模式","命名空间","键","数据类型"],"ja":["Shopify Metafields","Shopify開発","電子商取引プラットフォーム","商品データ保存","デフォルトのスキーマ拡張","名前空間","キー","データタイプ"],"ko":["Shopify 메타 필드","Shopify 개발","전자상거래 플랫폼","제품 데이터 저장","기본 스키마 확장","네임스페이스","키","데이터 유형"],"es":["campos meta shopify","almacenamiento de datos adicionales","personalización de tienda","tipos de datos","espacios de nombres","propietarios de campos meta"],"fr":["champs meta shopify","stockage de données supplémentaires","personnalisation de boutique","types de données","espaces de noms","propriétaires de champs meta"],"de":["shopify metafelder","speicherung zusätzlicher daten","anpassung des shops","datentypen","namensräume","besitzer von metafeldern"],"pt":["campos meta do Shopify","armazenamento de dados adicionais","recursos do Shopify","tipos de dados","namespaces personalizados","integração com produtos e pedidos"],"ru":["мета-поля Shopify","хранение дополнительных данных","ресурсы Shopify","типы данных","пользовательские пространства имен","интеграция с продуктами и заказами"],"ar":["حقول ميتا في Shopify","تخزين البيانات الإضافية","موارد Shopify","أنواع البيانات","مساحات أسماء مخصصة","التكامل مع المنتجات والطلبات"]}},"owner":"toilahuongg","repo":"Shopify-Agents-Kit","repoPath":"toilahuongg/Shopify-Agents-Kit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.429Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"shopify-metafields","description":"Guide for working with Shopify Metafields. Covers definitions, storing custom data, accessing via Liquid, and GraphQL mutations.","bodyPreview":"# Shopify Metafields\n\nMetafields allow you to store additional data on Shopify resources (Products, Orders, Customers, Shops) that aren''t included in the default schema (e.g., \"washing instructions\" for a product).\n\n## 1. Concepts\n\n-   **Namespace**: Grouping folder (e.g., `my_app`, `global`).\n-   **Key**: Specific field name (e.g., `washing_instructions`).\n-   **Type**: Data type (e.g., `single_line_text_field`, `number_integer`, `json`).\n-   **Owner**: The resource attaching the data (Product","body":"# Shopify Metafields\n\nMetafields allow you to store additional data on Shopify resources (Products, Orders, Customers, Shops) that aren''t included in the default schema (e.g., \"washing instructions\" for a product).\n\n## 1. Concepts\n\n-   **Namespace**: Grouping folder (e.g., `my_app`, `global`).\n-   **Key**: Specific field name (e.g., `washing_instructions`).\n-   **Type**: Data type (e.g., `single_line_text_field`, `number_integer`, `json`).\n-   **Owner**: The resource attaching the data (Product ID, Shop ID).\n\n## 2. Metafield Definitions (Standard)\n\nAlways use **Metafield Definitions** (pinned metafields) when possible. This integrates them into the Admin UI and ensures standard processing.\n\n-   **Create**: Settings > Custom Data > [Resource] > Add definition.\n-   **Access**: `namespace.key`\n\n## 3. Accessing in Liquid\n\nTo display metafield data on the Storefront:\n\n```liquid\n<!-- Accessing a product metafield -->\n<p>Washing: {{ product.metafields.my_app.washing_instructions }}</p>\n\n<!-- Accessing a file/image metafield -->\n{% assign file = product.metafields.my_app.size_chart.value %}\n<img src=\"{{ file | image_url: width: 500 }}\" />\n\n<!-- Checking existence -->\n{% if product.metafields.my_app.instructions != blank %}\n   ...\n{% endif %}\n```\n\n## 4. Reading via API (GraphQL)\n\n```graphql\nquery {\n  product(id: \"gid://shopify/Product/123\") {\n    title\n    metafield(namespace: \"my_app\", key: \"instructions\") {\n      value\n      type\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## 5. Writing via API (GraphQL)\n\nTo create or update a metafield, use `metafieldsSet`.\n\n```graphql\nmutation metafieldsSet($metafields: [MetafieldsSetInput!]!) {\n  metafieldsSet(metafields: $metafields) {\n    metafields {\n      id\n      namespace\n      key\n      value\n    }\n    userErrors {\n      field\n      message\n    }\n  }\n}\n\n/* Variables */\n{\n  \"metafields\": [\n    {\n      \"ownerId\": \"gid://shopify/Product/123\",\n      \"namespace\": \"my_app\",\n      \"key\": \"instructions\",\n      \"type\": \"single_line_text_field\",\n      \"value\": \"Wash cold, tumble dry.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n## 6. Private Metafields\n\nIf you want data to be **hidden from other apps** and the storefront, use Private Metafields. Note: These cannot be accessed via Liquid directly.\n\n-   Use `privateMetafield` queries/mutations.\n-   Requires explicit `read_private_metafields` / `write_private_metafields` scope (rarely used now, `app_data` metafields are preferred for app-specific valid storage).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:03:22.203Z","qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('spences10/devhub-crm/error-handling-patterns', 'community', 'spences10', 'devhub-crm', 'spences10/devhub-crm', 'error-handling-patterns', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.429Z', '2026-02-18T05:03:47.910Z', NULL, '{"id":"spences10/devhub-crm/error-handling-patterns","name":"error-handling-patterns","description":{"zh":"Svelte 中的错误处理模式提供了一种捕获组件错误的简单方法，使用 `<svelte:boundary>` 来提高代码稳定性","ja":"Svelte のエラーハンドリングパターンは、コンポーネントのエラーを捕捉するためのシンプルな方法を提供します。 `<svelte:boundary>` を使用してコードの安定性を向上させる","ko":"Svelte의 오류 처리 패턴은 컴포넌트 오류를 捕获하는 간단한 방법을 제공하며 `<svelte:boundary>`를 사용하여 코드 안정성을 향상시킵니다","es":"Los patrones de manejo de errores son esenciales para una experiencia de usuario sin interrupciones. Aprende a implementarlos de manera efectiva","fr":"Les modèles de gestion d''erreurs sont essentiels pour une expérience utilisateur sans interruption. Découvrez comment les mettre en œuvre de manière efficace","de":"Fehlerbehandlungsmuster sind für eine unterbrechungsfreie Benutzererfahrung unerlässlich. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie sie effektiv implementieren","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"错误处理模式 - Svelte 错误边界","ja":"エラーハンドリングパターン - Svelte エラーボーダー","ko":"오류 처리 패턴 - Svelte 오류 경계","es":"Patrones de manejo de errores para desarrolladores","fr":"Modèles de gestion d''erreurs pour les développeurs","de":"Fehlerbehandlungsmuster für Entwickler","en":"error-handling-patterns"},"description":{"zh":"Svelte 中的错误处理模式提供了一种捕获组件错误的简单方法，使用 `<svelte:boundary>` 来提高代码稳定性","ja":"Svelte のエラーハンドリングパターンは、コンポーネントのエラーを捕捉するためのシンプルな方法を提供します。 `<svelte:boundary>` を使用してコードの安定性を向上させる","ko":"Svelte의 오류 처리 패턴은 컴포넌트 오류를 捕获하는 간단한 방법을 제공하며 `<svelte:boundary>`를 사용하여 코드 안정성을 향상시킵니다","es":"Los patrones de manejo de errores son esenciales para una experiencia de usuario sin interrupciones. Aprende a implementarlos de manera efectiva","fr":"Les modèles de gestion d''erreurs sont essentiels pour une expérience utilisateur sans interruption. Découvrez comment les mettre en œuvre de manière efficace","de":"Fehlerbehandlungsmuster sind für eine unterbrechungsfreie Benutzererfahrung unerlässlich. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie sie effektiv implementieren","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["错误边界","组件错误捕获","代码稳定性提高","简单易用","高可用性"],"ja":["エラーボーダー","コンポーネントエラーキャッチ","コードの安定性向上","シンプルさ","高可用性"],"ko":["오류 경계","컴포넌트 오류 捕获","코드 안정성 향상","간단한 사용법","높은 가용성"],"es":["Uso de <svelte:boundary> para capturar componentes","Implementación de estados de carga y error","Uso de snippets para manejar errores y estados","Reset de errores con un solo clic","Mejora de la experiencia del usuario con manejo de errores"],"fr":["Utilisation de <svelte:boundary> pour capturer les composants","Mise en œuvre des états de chargement et d''erreur","Utilisation de snippets pour gérer les erreurs et les états","Réinitialisation des erreurs en un seul clic","Amélioration de l''expérience utilisateur avec la gestion des erreurs"],"de":["Verwendung von <svelte:boundary> zum Erfassen von Komponenten","Implementierung von Lade- und Fehlerzuständen","Verwendung von Snippets zum Verwalten von Fehlern und Zuständen","Zurücksetzen von Fehlern mit einem einzigen Klick","Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung durch Fehlerbehandlung"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Svelte","错误处理","错误边界","组件错误","代码稳定性","前端开发"],"ja":["Svelte","エラーハンドリング","エラーボーダー","コンポーネントエラー","コードの安定性","フロントエンド開発"],"ko":["Svelte","오류 처리","오류 경계","컴포넌트 오류","코드 안정성","프론트엔드 개발"],"es":["patrones de manejo de errores","desarrollo de aplicaciones","svelte","errores","experiencia del usuario","manejo de errores"," Boundary","snippets"],"fr":["modèles de gestion d''erreurs","développement d''applications","svelte","erreurs","expérience utilisateur","gestion des erreurs","limite","extraits de code"],"de":["Fehlerbehandlungsmuster","Anwendungsentwicklung","svelte","Fehler","Benutzererfahrung","Fehlerbehandlung","Grenze","Code-Snippets"]}},"owner":"spences10","repo":"devhub-crm","repoPath":"spences10/devhub-crm","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.429Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"error-handling-patterns","description":"Svelte 5 error handling. Use for error boundaries, async await expressions, loading states, and form errors.","bodyPreview":"# Error Handling Patterns\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```svelte\n<svelte:boundary>\n\t<ul>\n\t\t{#each await get_contacts() as contact}\n\t\t\t<li>{contact.name}</li>\n\t\t{/each}\n\t</ul>\n\n\t{#snippet pending()}\n\t\t<div class=\"loading\">Loading...</div>\n\t{/snippet}\n\n\t{#snippet failed(error, reset)}\n\t\t<div class=\"error\">\n\t\t\t<p>Error: {error.message}</p>\n\t\t\t<button onclick={reset}>Retry</button>\n\t\t</div>\n\t{/snippet}\n</svelte:boundary>\n```\n\n## Core Principles\n\n- **Error boundaries**: Use `<svelte:boundary>` to catch component","body":"# Error Handling Patterns\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```svelte\n<svelte:boundary>\n\t<ul>\n\t\t{#each await get_contacts() as contact}\n\t\t\t<li>{contact.name}</li>\n\t\t{/each}\n\t</ul>\n\n\t{#snippet pending()}\n\t\t<div class=\"loading\">Loading...</div>\n\t{/snippet}\n\n\t{#snippet failed(error, reset)}\n\t\t<div class=\"error\">\n\t\t\t<p>Error: {error.message}</p>\n\t\t\t<button onclick={reset}>Retry</button>\n\t\t</div>\n\t{/snippet}\n</svelte:boundary>\n```\n\n## Core Principles\n\n- **Error boundaries**: Use `<svelte:boundary>` to catch component\n  errors\n- **Pending snippet**: Show loading state while awaiting data\n- **Failed snippet**: Display errors with retry via `reset` function\n- **Await expressions**: Use `{#each await query()}` directly in\n  markup\n- **Granular boundaries**: Wrap individual features, not entire pages\n- **Form errors**: Check remote function `.error` property (e.g.,\n  `create_contact.error`)\n\n## Reference Files\n\n- [error-handling-guide.md](references/error-handling-guide.md) -\n  Complete patterns and examples\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:03:47.910Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents requiring robust error handling and boundary management in Svelte applications.","zh":"适用于需要在Svelte应用中进行强大的错误处理和边界管理的前端代理。","ja":"Svelteアプリケーションで強力なエラーハンドリングと境界管理を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"스벨트 애플리케이션에서 강력한 오류 처리 및 경계 관리가 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de frontend que requieren un control de errores robusto y gestión de límites en aplicaciones Svelte.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents frontend nécessitant une gestion d''erreurs robuste et une gestion de limites dans les applications Svelte.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agents, die eine robuste Fehlerbehandlung und Grenzenverwaltung in Svelte-Anwendungen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend que exigem tratamento robusto de erros e gerenciamento de limites em aplicações Svelte.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, требующих надежной обработки ошибок и управления границами в приложениях Svelte.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذين يحتاجون إلى معالجة الأخطاء القوية وإدارة الحدود في تطبيقات Svelte."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement error boundaries using `<svelte:boundary>`, handle pending states with `{#snippet pending()}`, and manage failed states with `{#snippet failed(error, reset)}`, ensuring a seamless user experience through advanced error handling patterns and Svelte-specific syntax.","zh":"赋予代理实现错误边界使用 `<svelte:boundary>`，处理待处理状态使用 `{#snippet pending()}`，并使用 `{#snippet failed(error, reset)}` 管理失败状态，确保通过高级错误处理模式和 Svelte 特定语法提供无缝的用户体验。","ja":"エージェントが `<svelte:boundary>` を使用してエラーの境界を実装し、 `{#snippet pending()}` を使用して保留状態を処理し、 `{#snippet failed(error, reset)}` を使用して失敗した状態を管理できるようにし、高度なエラーハンドリングパターンと Svelte 固有の構文を使用してシームレスなユーザーエクスペリエンスを提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 `<svelte:boundary>`를 사용하여 오류 경계를 구현하고 `{#snippet pending()}`를 사용하여 대기 상태를 처리하며 `{#snippet failed(error, reset)}`를 사용하여 실패한 상태를 관리할 수 있도록 하여 고급 오류 처리 패턴 및 스벨트 특정 구문을 통해 無斷な 사용자 경험을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes implementar límites de error utilizando `<svelte:boundary>`, manejar estados pendientes con `{#snippet pending()}`, y gestionar estados fallidos con `{#snippet failed(error, reset)}`, garantizando una experiencia de usuario fluida a través de patrones de manejo de errores avanzados y sintaxis específica de Svelte.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des limites d''erreur en utilisant `<svelte:boundary>`, de gérer les états en attente avec `{#snippet pending()}`, et de gérer les états échoués avec `{#snippet failed(error, reset)}`, garantissant une expérience utilisateur fluide grâce à des modèles de gestion d''erreurs avancés et une syntaxe spécifique à Svelte.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, Fehlergrenzen mit `<svelte:boundary>` zu implementieren, ausstehende Zustände mit `{#snippet pending()}` zu handhaben und fehlgeschlagene Zustände mit `{#snippet failed(error, reset)}` zu verwalten, wodurch eine nahtlose Benutzeroberfläche durch fortschrittliche Fehlerbehandlungsmuster und Svelte-spezifische Syntax gewährleistet wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar limites de erro usando `<svelte:boundary>`, lidar com estados pendentes com `{#snippet pending()}`, e gerenciar estados com falha com `{#snippet failed(error, reset)}`, garantindo uma experiência do usuário sem interrupções por meio de padrões avançados de tratamento de erros e sintaxe específica do Svelte.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовывать границы ошибок с использованием `<svelte:boundary>`, обрабатывать состояния ожидания с `{#snippet pending()}`, и управлять состояниями с ошибками с `{#snippet failed(error, reset)}`, обеспечивая бесшовный опыт пользователя за счет продвинутых шаблонов обработки ошибок и синтаксиса, специфичного для Svelte.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء تنفيذ حدود الأخطاء باستخدام `<svelte:boundary>` ، ومعالجة الحالات المعلقة باستخدام `{#snippet pending()}` ، وإدارة الحالات الفاشلة باستخدام `{#snippet failed(error, reset)}` ، مما يضمن تجربة مستخدم دون انقطاع من خلال أنماط متقدمة لمعالجة الأخطاء والتركيب النحوي المحدد ل Svelte."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing error boundaries in Svelte components","Handling asynchronous data fetching errors","Creating retry mechanisms for failed operations"],"zh":["在 Svelte 组件中实现错误边界","处理异步数据获取错误","为失败的操作创建重试机制"],"ja":["Svelte コンポーネントでエラーの境界を実装する","非同期データ取得エラーを処理する","失敗した操作のためにリトライメカニズムを作成する"],"ko":["스벨트 컴포넌트에서 오류 경계를 구현","비동기 데이터 가져오기 오류 처리","실패한 작업을 위한 재시도 메커니즘 생성"],"es":["Implementar límites de error en componentes Svelte","Manejar errores de recuperación de datos asíncronos","Crear mecanismos de reintento para operaciones fallidas"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des limites d''erreur dans les composants Svelte","Gérer les erreurs de récupération de données asynchrones","Créer des mécanismes de réessai pour les opérations échouées"],"de":["Fehlergrenzen in Svelte-Komponenten implementieren","Fehler bei asynchroner Datenabfrage handhaben","Wiederholungsmechanismen für fehlgeschlagene Operationen erstellen"],"pt":["Implementar limites de erro em componentes Svelte","Lidar com erros de busca de dados assíncronos","Criar mecanismos de repetição para operações com falha"],"ru":["Реализация границ ошибок в компонентах Svelte","Обработка ошибок асинхронной загрузки данных","Создание механизмов повторения для операций с ошибками"],"ar":["تنفيذ حدود الأخطاء في مكونات Svelte","معالجة أخطاء استرجاع البيانات غير المتزامنة","إنشاء آليات لإعادة التشغيل للعمليات الفاشلة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Svelte framework","Limited to client-side error handling"],"zh":["需要 Svelte 框架","仅限客户端错误处理"],"ja":["Svelte フレームワークが必要","クライアント側のエラーハンドリングのみ"],"ko":["스벨트 프레임워크 필요","클라이언트 측 오류 처리만"],"es":["Requiere el framework Svelte","Limitado a la gestión de errores del lado del cliente"],"fr":["Nécessite le framework Svelte","Limité à la gestion d''erreurs côté client"],"de":["Benötigt das Svelte-Framework","Begrenzt auf die Fehlerbehandlung auf Client-Seite"],"pt":["Exige o framework Svelte","Limitado ao tratamento de erros do lado do cliente"],"ru":["Требует фреймворка Svelte","Ограничен обработкой ошибок на стороне клиента"],"ar":["يتطلب إطار Svelte","محدود بمعالجة الأخطاء على جانب العميل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
