응답형 디자인을 생성하고, 밝은 테마와 어둠 테마를 지원하는 것이 포함됩니다","es":"El diseño UX implica crear experiencias móviles responsivas con temas oscuros y claros. Aprende a diseñar componentes móviles","fr":"La conception UX consiste à créer des expériences mobiles réactives avec des thèmes clairs et sombres. Apprenez à concevoir des composants mobiles","de":"Das UX-Design beinhaltet die Erstellung mobiler, responsiver Erfahrungen mit hellen und dunklen Themen. Lernen Sie, wie Sie mobile Komponenten entwerfen","pt":"Desenvolvimento UX para interfaces responsivas e personalizadas. Aprenda a criar designs móveis e adaptáveis","ru":"UX Дизайн для отзывчивых и персонализированных интерфейсов. Узнайте, как создать мобильные и адаптивные дизайны","ar":"تصميم UX لواجهات مستجيبة ومتوافقة. تعلم كيفية تصميم واجهات مستجيبة وهواتف محمولة قابلة للتكيف","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["移动优先设计","响应式设计","主题感知","支持浅色和深色主题","适用于移动、平板电脑和桌面设备"],"ja":["モバイルファーストデザイン","レスポンシブデザイン","テーマ認識","ライトテーマとダークテーマのサポート","モバイル、タブレット、デスクトップ向け"],"ko":["모바일 우선 디자인","반응형 디자인","테마 인식","밝은 테마와 어둠 테마 지원","모바일, 태블릿, 데스크톱을 위한"],"es":["Diseño móvil","Diseño responsivo","Temas oscuros y claros","Media queries","Componentes personalizables"],"fr":["Conception mobile","Design réactif","Thèmes clairs et sombres","Requêtes multimédias","Composants personnalisables"],"de":["Mobiles Design","Responsives Design","Helles und dunkles Thema","Media-Abfragen","Anpassbare Komponenten"],"pt":["Design móvel","Responsividade","Suporte a temas claros e escuros","Componentes personalizados","Adaptação a diferentes dispositivos"],"ru":["Мобильный дизайн","Отзывчивость","Поддержка светлых и темных тем","Персонализированные компоненты","Адаптация к разным устройствам"],"ar":["تصميم الهاتف المحمول","الاستجابة","دعم السمات الفاتحة والداكنة","المكونات المخصصة","التكيف مع أجهزة مختلفة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["UX 设计","移动优先设计","响应式设计","主题感知","浅色主题","深色主题","移动开发","前端开发"],"ja":["UX デザイン","モバイルファーストデザイン","レスポンシブデザイン","テーマ認識","ライトテーマ","ダークテーマ","モバイル開発","フロントエンド開発"],"ko":["UX 디자인","모바일 우선 디자인","반응형 디자인","테마 인식","밝은 테마","어둠 테마","모바일 개발","프론트엔드 개발"],"es":["diseño UX","experiencia de usuario","diseño móvil","diseño responsivo","temas oscuros y claros","media queries"],"fr":["conception UX","expérience utilisateur","conception mobile","design réactif","thèmes clairs et sombres","requêtes multimédias"],"de":["UX-Design","Benutzeroberfläche","mobiles Design","responsives Design","helles und dunkles Thema","Media-Abfragen"],"pt":["desenvolvimento UX","design responsivo","interfaces móveis","temas claros e escuros","componentes personalizados","adaptação a dispositivos"],"ru":["разработка UX","отзывчивый дизайн","мобильные интерфейсы","светлые и темные темы","персонализированные компоненты","адаптация к устройствам"],"ar":["تطوير UX","تصميم مستجيب","واجهات الهاتف المحمول","سمات فاتحة وداكنة","مكونات مخصصة","التكيف مع الأجهزة"]}},"owner":"ReubenFrimpong","repo":"past-care-spring","repoPath":"ReubenFrimpong/past-care-spring","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.429Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ux","description":"UX patterns including responsive design, accessibility, interactions, and user flows for PastCare","bodyPreview":"# UX Design Skill\n\nImplement UX for: $ARGUMENTS\n\n## Mobile-First Responsive Design (MANDATORY)\n\nAll components MUST be:\n1. **Mobile-first**: Write CSS for mobile, add media queries for larger screens\n2. **Responsive**: Work across mobile, tablet, desktop\n3. **Theme-aware**: Support light and dark themes\n\n### Breakpoints\n```css\n/* Mobile (default) - ≤640px */\n.component {\n  padding: 1rem;\n  flex-direction: column;\n}\n\n/* Tablet - ≥768px */\n@media (min-width: 768px) {\n  .component {\n    padding: 1.","body":"# UX Design Skill\n\nImplement UX for: $ARGUMENTS\n\n## Mobile-First Responsive Design (MANDATORY)\n\nAll components MUST be:\n1. **Mobile-first**: Write CSS for mobile, add media queries for larger screens\n2. **Responsive**: Work across mobile, tablet, desktop\n3. **Theme-aware**: Support light and dark themes\n\n### Breakpoints\n```css\n/* Mobile (default) - ≤640px */\n.component {\n  padding: 1rem;\n  flex-direction: column;\n}\n\n/* Tablet - ≥768px */\n@media (min-width: 768px) {\n  .component {\n    padding: 1.5rem;\n    flex-direction: row;\n  }\n}\n\n/* Desktop - ≥1024px */\n@media (min-width: 1024px) {\n  .component {\n    padding: 2rem;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Mobile Adjustments\n- Single column layouts\n- Full-width buttons\n- Reduced padding (1rem)\n- Stack flex layouts vertically\n- Hide non-essential button text (show icons only)\n\n### Tablet Adjustments\n- Form rows → single column\n- Adjust grid columns\n- Show abbreviated labels\n\n### Desktop\n- Full multi-column layouts\n- All features visible\n- Hover states active\n\n## Theme Support\n\n```css\n/* Light theme (default) */\n.component {\n  background: var(--bg-card);\n  color: var(--text-primary);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-normal);\n}\n\n/* Dark theme */\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] .component {\n  background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.95);\n  border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n}\n```\n\n### CSS Variables for Theming\n```css\n--bg-card: /* card background */\n--bg-input: /* input field background */\n--text-primary: /* primary text */\n--text-secondary: /* secondary text */\n--text-tertiary: /* muted text */\n--border-normal: /* default border */\n--color-primary: /* primary action */\n--color-danger: /* danger/error */\n--color-success: /* success */\n--color-info: /* information */\n--shadow-sm, --shadow-md, --shadow-lg, --shadow-xl: /* shadows */\n--focus-ring: /* focus state */\n```\n\n## Spacing System\n\n### Padding\n```css\n/* Page container */ padding: 1.5rem;\n/* Cards/sections */ padding: 1.25rem to 1.5rem;\n/* Form fields */ padding: 0.75rem;\n/* Primary buttons */ padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;\n/* Secondary buttons */ padding: 0.625rem 1.25rem;\n/* Dialog content */ padding: 1rem to 1.5rem;\n```\n\n### Margins\n```css\n/* Page header bottom */ margin-bottom: 2rem;\n/* Section spacing */ margin: 1.5rem to 2rem;\n/* Form field spacing */ margin-bottom: 1.25rem;\n/* Item spacing */ margin: 0.625rem to 1rem;\n```\n\n### Gaps (Flexbox/Grid)\n```css\ngap: 1rem;    /* Primary - DEFAULT */\ngap: 0.5rem;  /* Compact - icon+text */\ngap: 1.5rem;  /* Wide - major sections */\n```\n\n## Layout Patterns\n\n### Page Container\n```css\n.page-container {\n  max-width: 1400px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  padding: 1.5rem;\n}\n```\n\n### Stats Grid (Auto-Responsive)\n```css\n.stats-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));\n  gap: 1rem;\n}\n```\n\n### Card Grid\n```css\n.card-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr));\n  gap: 1.25rem;\n}\n```\n\n### Form Row (2-Column)\n```css\n.form-row {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: 1rem;\n}\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n  .form-row {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Interaction Patterns\n\n### Transitions\n```css\ntransition: all 0.2s ease;  /* Standard */\ntransition: all 0.3s ease;  /* Important states */\n/* NEVER exceed 0.3s */\n```\n\n### Hover Effects\n```css\n/* Lift effect */\ntransform: translateY(-2px);  /* Subtle */\ntransform: translateY(-4px);  /* Cards */\n\n/* Scale (FAB only) */\ntransform: scale(1.1);\n```\n\n### Focus States\n```css\n/* Always visible focus ring */\n:focus {\n  outline: none;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1);\n  border-color: #8b5cf6;\n}\n```\n\n### Loading States\n```css\n.loading {\n  opacity: 0.7;\n  pointer-events: none;\n}\n.spinner {\n  animation: spin 1s linear infinite;\n}\n```\n\n### Animations\n```css\n@keyframes slideDown {\n  from {\n    opacity: 0;\n    transform: translateY(-10px);\n  }\n  to {\n    opacity: 1;\n    transform: translateY(0);\n  }\n}\n\n@keyframes fadeIn {\n  from { opacity: 0; }\n  to { opacity: 1; }\n}\n```\n\n## Accessibility Requirements\n\n### Form Labels\n```html\n<!-- Always associate labels with inputs -->\n<label for=\"email\">Email <span class=\"required\">*</span></label>\n<input id=\"email\" type=\"email\" aria-required=\"true\">\n```\n\n### Required Fields\n- Red asterisk (`*`) after label\n- `aria-required=\"true\"` on input\n- Clear validation messages\n\n### Focus Management\n- All interactive elements focusable\n- Visible focus indicators\n- Logical tab order\n- Skip links for navigation\n\n### Screen Readers\n```html\n<!-- Announce dynamic content -->\n<div role=\"alert\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n  {{ statusMessage }}\n</div>\n\n<!-- Descriptive buttons -->\n<button aria-label=\"Delete member John Doe\">\n  <i class=\"pi pi-trash\"></i>\n</button>\n```\n\n### Color Contrast\n- Text on backgrounds: minimum 4.5:1 ratio\n- Large text: minimum 3:1 ratio\n- Interactive elements: clearly distinguishable\n\n### ARIA for PrimeNG\n```html\n<p-table aria-label=\"Members list\">\n<p-dialog [ariaLabel]=\"''Edit member''\">\n<p-dropdown [ariaLabel]=\"''Select fellowship''\">\n```\n\n## User Feedback Patterns\n\n### Success Feedback\n```typescript\n// Toast notification\nthis.messageService.add({\n  severity: ''success'',\n  summary: ''Success'',\n  detail: ''Member saved successfully''\n});\n```\n\n### Error Feedback\n```typescript\n// Show in form AND toast for critical errors\nthis.messageService.add({\n  severity: ''error'',\n  summary: ''Error'',\n  detail: ''Failed to save member''\n});\n```\n\n### Confirmation Dialogs\n```typescript\n// Always confirm destructive actions\nthis.confirmationService.confirm({\n  message: ''Are you sure you want to delete this member?'',\n  header: ''Confirm Delete'',\n  icon: ''pi pi-exclamation-triangle'',\n  acceptButtonStyleClass: ''p-button-danger'',\n  accept: () => this.deleteMember()\n});\n```\n\n### Progress Indicators\n- Show spinner for operations > 300ms\n- Show progress bar for uploads/long operations\n- Disable submit buttons while processing\n\n## Navigation Patterns\n\n### Breadcrumbs\n```html\n<nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\">\n  <ol class=\"breadcrumb\">\n    <li><a routerLink=\"/dashboard\">Dashboard</a></li>\n    <li><a routerLink=\"/members\">Members</a></li>\n    <li aria-current=\"page\">John Doe</li>\n  </ol>\n</nav>\n```\n\n### Back Navigation\n- Always provide way to go back\n- Preserve form state when navigating away\n- Warn before losing unsaved changes\n\n## Critical UX Rules\n\n1. ALWAYS design mobile-first\n2. ALWAYS provide loading feedback\n3. ALWAYS confirm destructive actions\n4. ALWAYS maintain visible focus states\n5. ALWAYS use semantic HTML\n6. NEVER remove content without confirmation\n7. NEVER disable back navigation\n8. NEVER auto-submit forms\n9. NEVER hide errors from users\n10. ALWAYS preserve user input on errors\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:03:46.790Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing responsive and theme-aware UI design capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要响应式和主题感知 UI 设计能力的前端代理。","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントがレスポンシブでテーマに応じたUIデザイン能力を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"반응형 및 테마 인식 UI 디자인 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes frontend que necesitan capacidades de diseño de UI responsivo y consciente del tema.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend ayant besoin de capacités de conception d''UI réactives et sensibles au thème.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die responsive und themenbewusste UI-Designfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades de design de UI responsivo e ciente do tema.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы возможности разработки адаптивного и осведомленного о теме дизайна пользовательского интерфейса.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأمامي الذين يحتاجون إلى قابليات تصميم واجهة المستخدم الاستجابة والمتوافقة مع موضوع"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft mobile-first responsive designs using CSS media queries, supporting light and dark themes across various breakpoints, including mobile, tablet, and desktop screens.","zh":"赋予代理创建移动优先的响应式设计的能力，使用CSS媒体查询，支持各种断点（包括移动设备、平板电脑和桌面屏幕）的浅色和深色主题。","ja":"エージェントがCSSメディアクエリを使用してモバイルファーストのレスポンシブデザインを作成できるようにし、モバイル、タブレット、デスクトップスクリーンなど、さまざまなブレークポイントでのライトおよびダークテーマをサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 CSS 미디어 쿼리를 사용하여 모바일 우선의 반응형 디자인을 만들 수 있도록 하며, 모바일, 태블릿, 데스크톱 화면 등 다양한 브레이크포인트에서 라이트 및 다크 테마를 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear diseños responsivos de primera generación para móviles utilizando consultas de medios CSS, que admiten temas claros y oscuros en varios puntos de interrupción, incluidas pantallas de móviles, tabletas y escritorios.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des conceptions réactives de première génération pour les appareils mobiles en utilisant des requêtes multimedia CSS, qui prennent en charge les thèmes clairs et sombres dans divers points d''arrêt, notamment les écrans de mobiles, de tablettes et de bureau.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, mobile-first-Responsive-Designs unter Verwendung von CSS-Media-Abfragen zu erstellen, die helle und dunkle Themen über verschiedene Breakpoints hinweg unterstützen, einschließlich Mobil-, Tablet- und Desktop-Bildschirme.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem projetos móveis-responsivos usando consultas de mídia CSS, suportando temas claros e escuros em vários pontos de quebra, incluindo telas de celular, tablet e desktop.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать мобильные адаптивные дизайны, используя медиа-запросы CSS, поддерживающие светлые и темные темы на различных точках разрыва, включая мобильные, планшетные и настольные экраны.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من设计 تصاميم استجابة أولاً للجوال باستخدام استفسارات الوسائط CSS ، ودعم المواضيع الفاتحة والداكنة عبر نقاط انكسار مختلفة ، بما في ذلك شاشات الهاتف المحمول واللوحي وأجهزة الكمبيوتر المكتبية"},"useCases":{"en":["Designing mobile-first responsive layouts for web applications","Implementing theme-aware UI components for enhanced user experience","Optimizing CSS for cross-device compatibility and accessibility"],"zh":["为Web应用程序设计移动优先的响应式布局","实现主题感知的UI组件以增强用户体验","优化CSS以实现跨设备兼容性和可访问性"],"ja":["Webアプリケーションのモバイルファーストのレスポンシブレイアウトを設計する","テーマに応じたUIコンポーネントを実装してユーザーエクスペリエンスを強化する","CSSを最適化して、デバイス間の互換性とアクセシビリティを実現する"],"ko":["웹 애플리케이션을 위한 모바일 우선의 반응형 레이아웃 디자인","유저 경험을 향상시키기 위한 테마 인식 UI 컴포넌트 구현","크로스 디바이스 호환성 및 접근성을 위한 CSS 최적화"],"es":["Diseñar diseños responsivos de primera generación para móviles para aplicaciones web","Implementar componentes de UI conscientes del tema para una experiencia de usuario mejorada","Optimizar CSS para la compatibilidad y accesibilidad entre dispositivos"],"fr":["Concevoir des conceptions réactives de première génération pour les appareils mobiles pour les applications Web","Mettre en œuvre des composants d''UI sensibles au thème pour une expérience utilisateur améliorée","Optimiser CSS pour la compatibilité et l''accessibilité entre les appareils"],"de":["Entwerfen von mobile-first-Responsive-Layouts für Webanwendungen","Implementieren von themenbewussten UI-Komponenten für eine verbesserte Benutzererfahrung","Optimieren von CSS für Geräteübergreifende Kompatibilität und Zugänglichkeit"],"pt":["Projetar layouts responsivos móveis para aplicações web","Implementar componentes de UI cientes do tema para uma experiência do usuário aprimorada","Otimizar CSS para compatibilidade e acessibilidade em vários dispositivos"],"ru":["Разработка мобильных адаптивных макетов для веб-приложений","Реализация компонентов пользовательского интерфейса, осведомленных о теме, для улучшения пользовательского опыта","Оптимизация CSS для совместимости и доступности на различных устройствах"],"ar":["تصميم تخطيطات استجابة أولاً للجوال لتطبيقات الويب","تطبيق مكونات واجهة المستخدم المتوافقة مع الموضوع لتحسين تجربة المستخدم","تحسين CSS لتوافقها وسهولة الوصول إلى أجهزة متعددة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires CSS and media query knowledge","Limited to web-based applications","Mobile-first approach may not be ideal for all use cases"],"zh":["需要CSS和媒体查询知识","仅限于基于Web的应用程序","移动优先的方法可能并不适合所有使用场景"],"ja":["CSSとメディアクエリの知識が必要","Webベースのアプリケーションに限定される","モバイルファーストのアプローチは、すべてのユースケースに最適ではない可能性がある"],"ko":["CSS 및 미디어 쿼리 지식이 필요","웹 기반 애플리케이션으로 제한됨","모바일 우선 접근법은 모든 사용 사례에 적합하지 않을 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de CSS y consultas de medios","Limitado a aplicaciones basadas en web","El enfoque de primera generación para móviles puede no ser ideal para todos los casos de uso"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en CSS et en requêtes multimedia","Limité aux applications basées sur le Web","L''approche de première génération pour les appareils mobiles peut ne pas être idéale pour tous les cas d''utilisation"],"de":["Benötigt CSS- und Media-Query-Kenntnisse","Begrenzt auf webbasierte Anwendungen","Der mobile-first-Ansatz kann nicht für alle Anwendungsfälle ideal sein"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de CSS e consultas de mídia","Limitado a aplicações baseadas na web","A abordagem móvel-primeira pode não ser ideal para todos os casos de uso"],"ru":["Требует знаний CSS и медиа-запросов","Ограничен веб-приложениями","Мобильный-первый подход может быть не идеальным для всех случаев использования"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة CSS واستفسارات الوسائط","محدود لتطبيقات الويب","النهج الجوال أولاً قد لا يكون مثاليًا لجميع حالات الاستخدام"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('WHITS-ISLAND/inspirehub-mobile/retro', 'community', 'WHITS-ISLAND', 'inspirehub-mobile', 'WHITS-ISLAND/inspirehub-mobile', 'retro', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.429Z', '2026-02-18T05:03:56.058Z', NULL, '{"id":"WHITS-ISLAND/inspirehub-mobile/retro","name":"retro","description":{"zh":"Retro 技术是一种分析 AI 代理内存的技能，用于找出优化机会，提高效率","ja":"Retro スキルは AI エージェントのメモリを分析し、効率化のための提案を行う技術です","ko":"Retro 기술은 AI 에이전트 메모리를 분석하여 최적화 기회를 찾고 효율성을 높이는 스킬입니다","es":"Retro es una habilidad que analiza la memoria de los agentes y proporciona recomendaciones para optimizar la eficiencia y reducir la complejidad","fr":"Retro est une compétence qui analyse la mémoire des agents et fournit des recommandations pour optimiser l''efficacité et réduire la complexité","de":"Retro ist eine Fähigkeit, die den Speicher von Agenten analysiert und Empfehlungen zur Optimierung der Effizienz und Reduzierung der Komplexität bietet","pt":"A habilidade Retro analisa a memória de agentes e fornece propostas para otimização e automação de processos","ru":"Навык Retro анализирует память агентов и предоставляет предложения по оптимизации и автоматизации процессов","ar":"المهارة Retro تحلل ذاكرة الوكلاء وتقدم مقترحات لتحسين وتأتمة العمليات","en":"アイデア共有プラットフォームアプリのネイティブアプリ用のリポジトリ"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Retro 技术：优化 AI 代理内存","ja":"Retro スキル：AI エージェントのメモリを分析","ko":"Retro 기술: AI 에이전트 메모리 최적화","es":"Retro: Optimización de Memoria de Agentes","fr":"Retro: Optimisation de la Mémoire des Agents","de":"Retro: Optimierung des Agenten-Speichers","pt":"Retro: Otimização de Memória de Agente","ru":"Retro: Оптимизация памяти агента","ar":"ريترو: تحسين ذاكرة الوكيل","en":"retro"},"description":{"zh":"Retro 技术是一种分析 AI 代理内存的技能，用于找出优化机会，提高效率","ja":"Retro スキルは AI エージェントのメモリを分析し、効率化のための提案を行う技術です","ko":"Retro 기술은 AI 에이전트 메모리를 분석하여 최적화 기회를 찾고 효율성을 높이는 스킬입니다","es":"Retro es una habilidad que analiza la memoria de los agentes y proporciona recomendaciones para optimizar la eficiencia y reducir la complejidad","fr":"Retro est une compétence qui analyse la mémoire des agents et fournit des recommandations pour optimiser l''efficacité et réduire la complexité","de":"Retro ist eine Fähigkeit, die den Speicher von Agenten analysiert und Empfehlungen zur Optimierung der Effizienz und Reduzierung der Komplexität bietet","pt":"A habilidade Retro analisa a memória de agentes e fornece propostas para otimização e automação de processos","ru":"Навык Retro анализирует память агентов и предоставляет предложения по оптимизации и автоматизации процессов","ar":"المهارة Retro تحلل ذاكرة الوكلاء وتقدم مقترحات لتحسين وتأتمة العمليات","en":"アイデア共有プラットフォームアプリのネイティブアプリ用のリポジトリ"},"definition":{"en":"アイデア共有プラットフォームアプリのネイティブアプリ用のリポジトリ"},"features":{"zh":["分析 AI 代理内存","找出优化机会","提高效率","检测重复模式","建议自动化"],"ja":["エージェントメモリ分析","効率化のための提案","繰り返しパターンの検出","自動化の提案","コンテキスト肥大化チェック"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 메모리 분석","최적화 기회 찾기","효율성 높이기","반복 패턴 검출","자동화 제안"],"es":["Análisis de la memoria de los agentes","Detección de patrones repetidos","Recomendaciones para la optimización de la eficiencia","Detección de áreas de dolor en la memoria de los agentes","Recomendaciones para la creación de nuevos agentes"],"fr":["Analyse de la mémoire des agents","Détection de modèles répétitifs","Recommandations pour l''optimisation de l''efficacité","Détection de domaines de douleur dans la mémoire des agents","Recommandations pour la création de nouveaux agents"],"de":["Analyse des Speichers von Agenten","Erkennung von wiederkehrenden Mustern","Empfehlungen zur Optimierung der Effizienz","Erkennung von Schmerzpunkten im Speicher von Agenten","Empfehlungen zur Erstellung neuer Agenten"],"pt":["Análise de memória de agentes","Detecção de padrões repetidos","Propostas de otimização e automação","Verificação de duplicação de conhecimento","Sugestões de criação de novos agentes"],"ru":["Анализ памяти агентов","Обнаружение повторяющихся паттернов","Предложения по оптимизации и автоматизации","Проверка дублирования знаний","Предложения по созданию новых агентов"],"ar":["تحليل ذاكرة الوكلاء","اكتشاف الأنماط المكررة","مقترحات لتحسين وتأتمة","فحص تكرار المعرفة","اقتراحات لإنشاء وكلاء جدد"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Retro 技术","AI 代理内存分析","优化机会","效率提高","重复模式检测","自动化建议"],"ja":["Retro スキル","AI エージェントメモリ分析","効率化","繰り返しパターン","自動化","コンテキスト肥大化"],"ko":["Retro 기술","AI 에이전트 메모리 분석","최적화 기회","효율성 높이기","반복 패턴","자동화"],"es":["optimización de memoria","agentes","eficiencia","complexidad","análisis de memoria","detección de patrones","recomendaciones de optimización"],"fr":["optimisation de la mémoire","agents","efficacité","complexité","analyse de la mémoire","détection de modèles","recommandations d''optimisation"],"de":["Optimierung des Speichers","Agenten","Effizienz","Komplexität","Analyse des Speichers","Erkennung von Mustern","Empfehlungen zur Optimierung"],"pt":["otimização de memória de agente","automatização de processos","análise de memória","padrões repetidos","criação de novos agentes","desenvolvimento de habilidades"],"ru":["оптимизация памяти агента","автоматизация процессов","анализ памяти","повторяющиеся паттерны","создание новых агентов","разработка навыков"],"ar":["تحسين ذاكرة الوكيل","تأتمة العمليات","تحليل الذاكرة","الأنماط المكررة","إنشاء وكلاء جدد","تطوير المهارات"]}},"owner":"WHITS-ISLAND","repo":"inspirehub-mobile","repoPath":"WHITS-ISLAND/inspirehub-mobile","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.429Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"retro","description":"エージェントの振り返りを実行し、スキル化候補・サブエージェント増設提案・コンテキスト肥大化チェックをレポートする","bodyPreview":"# 振り返り・効率化スキル\r\n\r\nエージェントのメモリを分析し、効率化のための提案を行う。\r\n\r\n## 処理フロー\r\n\r\n### 1. エージェントメモリ分析\r\n\r\n- `.claude/agent-memory/*/MEMORY.md` を全て読み込み\r\n- 各ファイルの行数をチェック（200行超 → コンテキスト肥大化警告）\r\n- 「Repeated Patterns」セクションから繰り返しパターンを集約\r\n\r\n### 2. スキル化候補の検出\r\n\r\n- 繰り返しパターンを分析し、スキル化で自動化できるものを提案\r\n- 既存スキル（`.claude/skills/*/SKILL.md`）と重複しないか確認\r\n\r\n### 3. サブエージェント増設の判断\r\n\r\n- 「Pain Points」セクションから、既存エージェントではカバーできない領域を検出\r\n- 新エージェント作成の提案（役割・ツール・スコープ）\r\n\r\n### 4. コンテキスト肥大化チェック\r\n\r\n- MEMORY.mdの行数 > 200行: 整理推奨\r\n- 同じ知見が複数エージェントに重複: 共有ルール化を提案","body":"# 振り返り・効率化スキル\r\n\r\nエージェントのメモリを分析し、効率化のための提案を行う。\r\n\r\n## 処理フロー\r\n\r\n### 1. エージェントメモリ分析\r\n\r\n- `.claude/agent-memory/*/MEMORY.md` を全て読み込み\r\n- 各ファイルの行数をチェック（200行超 → コンテキスト肥大化警告）\r\n- 「Repeated Patterns」セクションから繰り返しパターンを集約\r\n\r\n### 2. スキル化候補の検出\r\n\r\n- 繰り返しパターンを分析し、スキル化で自動化できるものを提案\r\n- 既存スキル（`.claude/skills/*/SKILL.md`）と重複しないか確認\r\n\r\n### 3. サブエージェント増設の判断\r\n\r\n- 「Pain Points」セクションから、既存エージェントではカバーできない領域を検出\r\n- 新エージェント作成の提案（役割・ツール・スコープ）\r\n\r\n### 4. コンテキスト肥大化チェック\r\n\r\n- MEMORY.mdの行数 > 200行: 整理推奨\r\n- 同じ知見が複数エージェントに重複: 共有ルール化を提案\r\n\r\n### 5. レポート出力\r\n\r\n## 出力フォーマット\r\n\r\n```markdown\r\n## 振り返りレポート\r\n\r\n### コンテキスト状況\r\n| エージェント | MEMORY.md行数 | ステータス |\r\n|-------------|--------------|-----------|\r\n| kotlin-dev  | 45行         | 正常      |\r\n| ios-dev     | 210行        | 要整理    |\r\n\r\n### スキル化候補\r\n- [ ] (パターン名)（(エージェント名)で(N)回以上実施）\r\n\r\n### サブエージェント増設提案\r\n- (提案またはなし)\r\n\r\n### ルール追加提案\r\n- [ ] (提案)\r\n```\r\n\r\n## エージェントメモリ規約\r\n\r\n各エージェントのMEMORY.mdに以下のセクションを維持する:\r\n\r\n- **Repeated Patterns**: 繰り返し行った作業パターン\r\n- **Pain Points**: 既存の仕組みでは解決しにくかった課題\r\n- **Lessons Learned**: 学んだ知見・ベストプラクティス\r\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:03:56.058Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude, AutoGPT, and LangChain requiring efficient memory analysis and skill optimization for improved performance.","zh":"适用于Claude、AutoGPT和LangChain等需要高效内存分析和技能优化以提高性能的AI代理。","ja":"Claude、AutoGPT、LangChainなどの効率的なメモリ分析とスキル最適化が必要なAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"클라우드, 오토GPT, 랑체인 等과 같은 효율적인 메모리 분석과 스킬 최적화를 필요로 하는 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude, AutoGPT y LangChain que requieren un análisis de memoria eficiente y una optimización de habilidades para un mejor rendimiento.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Claude, AutoGPT et LangChain nécessitant une analyse de mémoire efficace et une optimisation des compétences pour améliorer les performances.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Claude, AutoGPT und LangChain, die eine effiziente Speicheranalyse und eine Optimierung von Fähigkeiten für eine verbesserte Leistung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude, AutoGPT e LangChain que requerem análise de memória eficiente e otimização de habilidades para melhorar o desempenho.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude, AutoGPT и LangChain, требующих эффективного анализа памяти и оптимизации навыков для улучшения производительности.","ar":"مثالية لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude و AutoGPT و LangChain الذين يتطلبون تحليلًا ذكيًا للذاكرة وتحسين المهارات من أجل تحسين الأداء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze their memory, detect repeated patterns, and propose skill automation using Markdown files like `MEMORY.md` and `SKILL.md`, while also identifying areas for sub-agent expansion and context optimization.","zh":"赋予代理分析其内存、检测重复模式并使用Markdown文件（如`MEMORY.md`和`SKILL.md`）提出技能自动化，同时识别子代理扩展和上下文优化的领域。","ja":"エージェントにメモリを分析し、繰り返しのパターンを検出してMarkdownファイル（例： `MEMORY.md`と`SKILL.md`）を使用してスキル自動化を提案し、サブエージェントの拡張とコンテキスト最適化の領域を特定する力を与えます。","ko":"에이전트가 메모리를 분석하고 반복되는 패턴을 감지하여 Markdown 파일(예: `MEMORY.md` 및 `SKILL.md`)을 사용하여 스킬 자동화를 제안하고 하위 에이전트 확장 및 컨텍스트 최적화 영역을 식별할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes analizar su memoria, detectar patrones repetidos y proponer la automatización de habilidades utilizando archivos Markdown como `MEMORY.md` y `SKILL.md`, además de identificar áreas para la expansión de subagentes y la optimización del contexto.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser leur mémoire, de détecter des modèles répétitifs et de proposer l''automatisation des compétences en utilisant des fichiers Markdown tels que `MEMORY.md` et `SKILL.md`, tout en identifiant les domaines pour l''expansion des sous-agents et l''optimisation du contexte.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, ihr Gedächtnis zu analysieren, wiederholte Muster zu erkennen und die Automatisierung von Fähigkeiten mithilfe von Markdown-Dateien wie `MEMORY.md` und `SKILL.md` vorzuschlagen, sowie Bereiche für die Erweiterung von Subagenten und die Kontextoptimierung zu identifizieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a analisar sua memória, detectar padrões repetidos e propor automação de habilidades usando arquivos Markdown como `MEMORY.md` e `SKILL.md`, além de identificar áreas para expansão de sub-agentes e otimização de contexto.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью анализировать свою память, обнаруживать повторяющиеся закономерности и предлагать автоматизацию навыков с помощью файлов Markdown, таких как `MEMORY.md` и `SKILL.md`, а также определять области для расширения субагентов и оптимизации контекста.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تحليل ذاكرتهم، وكشف النمط المتكرر، واقترح آليّة المهارات باستخدام ملفات Markdown مثل `MEMORY.md` و `SKILL.md`، بالإضافة إلى تحديد المجالات لتوسيع نطاق وكيل فرعي وتحسين السياق."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing agent memory for efficiency improvements","Automating repeated patterns in agent workflows","Identifying opportunities for sub-agent creation and task delegation"],"zh":["分析代理内存以提高效率","自动化代理工作流中的重复模式","识别子代理创建和任务委托的机会"],"ja":["エージェントのメモリを分析して効率を向上させる","エージェントのワークフロー内の繰り返しのパターンを自動化する","サブエージェントの作成とタスクの委任の機会を特定する"],"ko":["에이전트 메모리를 분석하여 효율성을 개선합니다","에이전트 워크플로에서 반복되는 패턴을 자동화합니다","하위 에이전트 생성 및 작업 위임의 기회를 식별합니다"],"es":["Análisis de la memoria del agente para mejoras de eficiencia","Automatización de patrones repetidos en los flujos de trabajo del agente","Identificación de oportunidades para la creación de subagentes y la delegación de tareas"],"fr":["Analyse de la mémoire de l''agent pour améliorer l''efficacité","Automatisation des modèles répétitifs dans les flux de travail de l''agent","Identification des opportunités pour la création de sous-agents et la délégation de tâches"],"de":["Analyse des Agenten-Speichers für Effizienzverbesserungen","Automatisierung von wiederholten Mustern in den Arbeitsabläufen des Agents","Identifizierung von Möglichkeiten für die Erstellung von Subagenten und die Delegation von Aufgaben"],"pt":["Analisar a memória do agente para melhorias de eficiência","Automatizar padrões repetidos nos fluxos de trabalho do agente","Identificar oportunidades para criação de sub-agentes e delegação de tarefas"],"ru":["Анализировать память агента для улучшения эффективности","Автоматизировать повторяющиеся закономерности в рабочих процессах агента","Определять возможности для создания субагентов и делегирования задач"],"ar":["تحليل ذاكرة العميل لتحسين الكفاءة","آليّة الأنماط المتكررة في سير عمل الوكيل","تحديد الفرص لإنشاء وكيل فرعي وتحويل المهام"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to agent memory files","Limited to agents with Markdown-based skill and memory structures","May require manual review of proposed optimizations"],"zh":["需要访问代理内存文件","仅限于具有基于Markdown的技能和内存结构的代理","可能需要手动审查提出的优化"],"ja":["エージェントのメモリファイルへのアクセスが必要","Markdownベースのスキルとメモリ構造を持つエージェントのみに限定","提案された最適化の手動レビューが必要になる場合がある"],"ko":["에이전트 메모리 파일에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다","마크다운 기반의 스킬 및 메모리 구조를 갖는 에이전트에만 제한됩니다","제안된 최적화에 대한 수동 검토가 필요할 수 있습니다"],"es":["Requiere acceso a los archivos de memoria del agente","Limitado a agentes con estructuras de habilidades y memoria basadas en Markdown","Puede requerir una revisión manual de las optimizaciones propuestas"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux fichiers de mémoire de l''agent","Limité aux agents avec des structures de compétences et de mémoire basées sur Markdown","Peut nécessiter une révision manuelle des optimisations proposées"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Speicherdateien des Agents","Begrenzt auf Agenten mit Fähigkeits- und Speicherstrukturen, die auf Markdown basieren","Kann eine manuelle Überprüfung der vorgeschlagenen Optimierungen erfordern"],"pt":["Requer acesso a arquivos de memória do agente","Limitado a agentes com estruturas de habilidades e memória baseadas em Markdown","Pode requerer revisão manual das otimizações propostas"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлам памяти агента","Ограничен агентами с навыками и структурами памяти на основе Markdown","Может требовать ручного обзора предлагаемых оптимизаций"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملفات ذاكرة العميل","محدود بالوكلاء الذين لديهم مهارات وهياكل ذاكرة dựa على Markdown","قد يتطلب مراجعة يدوية للتحسينات المقترحة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Surya-Sunkari/continuous-algorithms-solver/convert', 'community', 'Surya-Sunkari', 'continuous-algorithms-solver', 'Surya-Sunkari/continuous-algorithms-solver', 'convert', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.429Z', '2026-02-18T05:03:58.483Z', NULL, '{"id":"Surya-Sunkari/continuous-algorithms-solver/convert","name":"convert","description":{"zh":"我们的LaTeX转换器可以将作业问题转换为准确的LaTeX表示，确保高精度转换","ja":"LaTeX変換器は、課題問題を正確なLaTeX表現に変換します。高精度変換を実現","ko":"LaTeX 변환기는 과제 문제를 정확한 LaTeX 표현으로 변환하여 높은 精度 변환을 제공","es":"Convierte problemas de tareas en su representación LaTeX exacta con precisión","fr":"Convertissez des problèmes de devoirs en leur représentation LaTeX exacte avec précision","de":"Wandelt Aufgaben in ihre exakte LaTeX-Darstellung mit Genauigkeit um","pt":"O Conversor de Trabalho para LaTeX converte problemas de trabalho em representações LaTeX exatas, garantindo a precisão dos conteúdos matemáticos.","ru":"Преобразователь домашнего задания в LaTeX преобразует домашнее задание в точные представления LaTeX, обеспечивая точность математического контента.","ar":"مُحَوِّل الواجب إلى LaTeX يقوم بتحويل الواجبات إلى تمثيلات LaTeX دقيقة، ويضمن دقة المحتوى الرياضي.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"LaTeX 转换器：准确转换作业问题","ja":"LaTeX 変換器：課題問題を正確に変換","ko":"LaTeX 변환기: 과제 문제를 정확하게 변환","es":"Conversor de tareas a LaTeX","fr":"Convertisseur de devoirs en LaTeX","de":"Aufgaben in LaTeX umwandeln","pt":"Conversor de Trabalho para LaTeX","ru":"Преобразователь домашнего задания в LaTeX","ar":"مُحَوِّل الواجب إلى LaTeX","en":"convert"},"description":{"zh":"我们的LaTeX转换器可以将作业问题转换为准确的LaTeX表示，确保高精度转换","ja":"LaTeX変換器は、課題問題を正確なLaTeX表現に変換します。高精度変換を実現","ko":"LaTeX 변환기는 과제 문제를 정확한 LaTeX 표현으로 변환하여 높은 精度 변환을 제공","es":"Convierte problemas de tareas en su representación LaTeX exacta con precisión","fr":"Convertissez des problèmes de devoirs en leur représentation LaTeX exacte avec précision","de":"Wandelt Aufgaben in ihre exakte LaTeX-Darstellung mit Genauigkeit um","pt":"O Conversor de Trabalho para LaTeX converte problemas de trabalho em representações LaTeX exatas, garantindo a precisão dos conteúdos matemáticos.","ru":"Преобразователь домашнего задания в LaTeX преобразует домашнее задание в точные представления LaTeX, обеспечивая точность математического контента.","ar":"مُحَوِّل الواجب إلى LaTeX يقوم بتحويل الواجبات إلى تمثيلات LaTeX دقيقة، ويضمن دقة المحتوى الرياضي.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["准确转换","高精度输出","支持作业问题转换","LaTeX 表示","文件输出"],"ja":["正確変換","高精度出力","課題問題変換サポート","LaTeX 表現","ファイル出力"],"ko":["정확한 변환","높은 精度 출력","과제 문제 변환 지원","LaTeX 표현","파일 출력"],"es":["Conversión precisa de problemas de tareas","Representaciones LaTeX exactas","Uso de la herramienta de escritura para salida","Compatibilidad con carpetas de asignación de destino","Estrategia de salida de subagentes","Soporte para transcripción de contenido matemático"],"fr":["Conversion précise de problèmes de devoirs","Représentations LaTeX exactes","Utilisation de l''outil d''écriture pour la sortie","Compatibilité avec les dossiers de mission cible","Stratégie de sortie des sous-agents","Prise en charge de la transcription de contenu mathématique"],"de":["Genaue Umwandlung von Aufgaben","Exakte LaTeX-Darstellungen","Verwendung des Schreibtools für die Ausgabe","Kompatibilität mit Zielordnern","Ausgabestrategie von Subagenten","Unterstützung für die Transkription von mathematischem Inhalt"],"pt":["Conversão exata de problemas de trabalho para LaTeX","Garantia de precisão dos conteúdos matemáticos","Saída em arquivos usando a ferramenta Write","Compatibilidade com subagentes","Resultados confiáveis e precisos"],"ru":["Точное преобразование домашнего задания в LaTeX","Обеспечение точности математического контента","Выходные данные в файлах с помощью инструмента Write","Совместимость с субагентами","Надежные и точные результаты"],"ar":["تحويل دقيق للواجبات إلى LaTeX","ضمان دقة المحتوى الرياضي","إخراج الملفات باستخدام أداة الكتابة","التوافق مع الوكلاء الفرعيين","نتائج موثوقة ودقيقة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["LaTeX转换器","作业问题转换","高精度转换","LaTeX表示","文件输出","转换工具"],"ja":["LaTeX変換器","課題問題変換","高精度変換","LaTeX表現","ファイル出力","変換ツール"],"ko":["LaTeX 변환기","과제 문제 변환","높은 精度 변환","LaTeX 표현","파일 출력","변환 도구"],"es":["conversor de tareas a latex","representaciones latex exactas","conversión precisa","herramienta de escritura","carpetas de asignación de destino","estrategia de salida de subagentes","transcripción de contenido matemático","desarrollo de software","tecnologías de conversión"],"fr":["convertisseur de devoirs en latex","représentations latex exactes","conversion précise","outil d''écriture","dossiers de mission cible","stratégie de sortie des sous-agents","transcription de contenu mathématique","développement de logiciels","technologies de conversion"],"de":["aufgaben in latex umwandeln","exakte latex-darstellungen","genaue umwandlung","schreibtool","zielordner","ausgabestrategie von subagenten","transkription von mathematischem inhalt","softwareentwicklung","umwandlungstechnologien"],"pt":["conversor de trabalho para latex","conversão de problemas de trabalho","representações latex exatas","precisão de conteúdos matemáticos","ferramenta de conversão","subagentes","resultados confiáveis"],"ru":["преобразователь домашнего задания в latex","преобразование домашнего задания","точные представления latex","точность математического контента","инструмент конвертера","субагенты","надежные результаты"],"ar":["مُحَوِّل الواجب إلى latex","تحويل الواجبات","تمثيلات latex دقيقة","دقة المحتوى الرياضي","أداة التحويل","الوكلاء الفرعيين","نتائج موثوقة"]}},"owner":"Surya-Sunkari","repo":"continuous-algorithms-solver","repoPath":"Surya-Sunkari/continuous-algorithms-solver","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.429Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"convert","description":"Convert homework PDF or problem screenshots to exact LaTeX representations","bodyPreview":"# Homework to LaTeX Converter\n\nYou are converting homework problems into their **exact** LaTeX representations. Accuracy is paramount — the output must be a character-perfect transcription of the mathematical content.\n\nThe target assignment folder is: `$ARGUMENTS`\n\n---\n\n## IMPORTANT: Subagent Output Strategy\n\nAll subagents in this skill MUST write their output to files using the Write tool, NOT return text in their response. This ensures the main agent can reliably read subagent results.\n\n- Tran","body":"# Homework to LaTeX Converter\n\nYou are converting homework problems into their **exact** LaTeX representations. Accuracy is paramount — the output must be a character-perfect transcription of the mathematical content.\n\nThe target assignment folder is: `$ARGUMENTS`\n\n---\n\n## IMPORTANT: Subagent Output Strategy\n\nAll subagents in this skill MUST write their output to files using the Write tool, NOT return text in their response. This ensures the main agent can reliably read subagent results.\n\n- Transcription subagents write to: `$ARGUMENTS/problems/pN.tex`\n- Verification subagents write to: `$ARGUMENTS/problems/pN_verification.txt`\n\nAfter all subagents finish, the main agent reads these files to check results and clean up verification files.\n\n---\n\n## PHASE 1: Input Detection & Validation\n\nAuto-detect the input mode by checking in this order:\n\n1. **PDF mode**: Use Glob to check for any `.pdf` file in `$ARGUMENTS/` (NOT in `$ARGUMENTS/notes/`). If found, use PDF mode.\n2. **Screenshot mode**: Check if `$ARGUMENTS/screenshots/` exists with `problem*` subdirectories containing image files. If found, use screenshot mode.\n3. **Neither found**: Stop and tell the user to either place a homework PDF in `$ARGUMENTS/` or create screenshot folders in `$ARGUMENTS/screenshots/problem1/`, etc.\n\nCreate `$ARGUMENTS/problems/` if it does not exist.\n\nTell the user which mode was detected before proceeding.\n\n---\n\n## PDF MODE\n\n### Phase 2P: Read & Split PDF\n\n#### Step A: Read the Full PDF\n\n1. Identify the PDF file in `$ARGUMENTS/` (if multiple PDFs exist, exclude any in `notes/` and pick the one that looks like a homework — or ask the user).\n2. Read the PDF using the Read tool. For PDFs longer than 10 pages, read in chunks of 10-20 pages using the `pages` parameter.\n3. As you read, identify:\n   - **Problem boundaries**: Look for headings like \"Problem 1\", \"Problem 2\", \"Question 1\", etc.\n   - **Footnotes**: Note which footnotes belong to which problem. Footnotes are typically numbered (e.g., superscript 1, 2, 3) and appear at the bottom of the page or end of the document.\n   - **Shared preamble text**: Any setup text that applies to multiple problems (e.g., \"For problems 1-3, assume X...\"). This should be included at the top of each relevant problem file.\n\n#### Step B: Transcribe Each Problem\n\nFor each identified problem, launch a Task subagent (subagent_type: \"general-purpose\", model: \"opus\"). You may launch multiple subagents in parallel since they write to separate files.\n\nSubagent prompt:\n\n```\nYou are an expert LaTeX transcriber. Your job is to produce an EXACT transcription of a math problem from a PDF into LaTeX.\n\nRead the following PDF file and extract ONLY the specified problem:\n[PDF file path and page range]\n\nPROBLEM TO EXTRACT: Problem N\nPROBLEM BOUNDARIES: Starts at [description] and ends at [description]\n\nFOOTNOTES BELONGING TO THIS PROBLEM:\n[list any footnotes that are referenced within this problem''s text]\n\nSHARED PREAMBLE (include at the top if present):\n[any shared setup text that applies to this problem]\n\nRULES — follow these precisely:\n1. EXACT TRANSCRIPTION: Reproduce every symbol, subscript, superscript, fraction, summation, integral, matrix, and piece of text exactly as it appears. Do not paraphrase, rephrase, simplify, or add anything.\n2. MATH NOTATION: Use standard LaTeX math commands. Use \\mathbb for blackboard bold, \\mathbf for bold vectors, \\text{} for text within math mode, \\operatorname{} for named operators, \\mathcal for calligraphic letters, \\ell for script l.\n3. FORMATTING: Preserve the visual structure — numbered parts like (i), (ii), (iii) or (a), (b), (c) should be kept as-is. Preserve paragraph breaks and line breaks where they appear meaningful.\n4. NO PREAMBLE: Output only the problem content — no \\documentclass, no \\begin{document}, no packages. Just the raw LaTeX content that would go inside a document body.\n5. NO SOLUTIONS: Only transcribe the problem statement. If a solution or hint appears, do not include it.\n6. DISPLAY MATH: Use \\[...\\] for displayed equations (never $$...$$). Use align* if the original shows aligned/numbered equations.\n7. INLINE MATH: Use $...$ for inline math.\n8. FOOTNOTES: Include footnotes using \\footnote{} inline where the superscript reference appears in the problem text. Transcribe the footnote content exactly.\n9. DOUBLE-CHECK: After transcribing, re-read the PDF and verify every symbol matches. Pay special attention to:\n   - Subscripts vs superscripts\n   - Similar-looking symbols (ε vs ∈, ≤ vs <, ⊂ vs ⊆)\n   - Parentheses vs brackets vs braces\n   - Bold vs regular vs calligraphic letters\n   - Summation/product bounds (above vs below)\n   - Fraction numerators and denominators\n   - Footnote numbering and content\n\nIMPORTANT: Use the Write tool to save your transcription to: [output file path for pN.tex]\nDo NOT just output the text — you MUST write it to the file.\n```\n\n#### Step C: Verification\n\nAfter transcription subagents complete, launch SEPARATE verification subagents (subagent_type: \"general-purpose\", model: \"opus\") — one per problem, can run in parallel.\n\nSubagent prompt:\n\n```\nYou are a LaTeX transcription verifier. You will be given a PDF of a math homework and a proposed LaTeX transcription of one problem. Your job is to find ANY discrepancies.\n\nRead the PDF:\n[PDF file path and page range]\n\nPROBLEM BEING VERIFIED: Problem N\n\nRead the proposed transcription from: [path to pN.tex]\n\nCompare the PDF to the LaTeX character by character for this problem. Check:\n1. Every mathematical symbol matches exactly\n2. Every subscript and superscript is correct\n3. All fractions, sums, products, integrals have correct bounds\n4. Text content matches word-for-word\n5. Numbering of parts/subparts matches\n6. No content is missing or added\n7. Parentheses, brackets, and delimiters match\n8. All footnotes referenced in this problem are included with exact content\n9. Any shared preamble text is correctly included\n\nIMPORTANT: Use the Write tool to save your verdict to: [path to pN_verification.txt]\nWrite either \"VERIFIED\" if the transcription is exact, or list discrepancies as:\nDISCREPANCY: [what''s wrong and what it should be]\n```\n\n#### Step D: Check Results & Retry\n\n1. Read each `pN_verification.txt` file.\n2. If VERIFIED, the problem is done.\n3. If discrepancies were found:\n   - Launch a new transcription subagent with the original PDF PLUS the discrepancy feedback. Instruct it to read the current pN.tex, fix the listed errors, and overwrite pN.tex.\n   - Launch a fresh verifier to re-check and overwrite pN_verification.txt.\n   - Repeat up to 3 times. If still failing, prepend a LaTeX comment to pN.tex: `% NOTE: Transcription could not be fully verified — check against original PDF`\n4. Delete all `pN_verification.txt` files when done.\n\n---\n\n## SCREENSHOT MODE\n\n### Phase 2S: Convert Screenshots\n\nFor each `$ARGUMENTS/screenshots/problemN/` folder:\n\n#### Step A: Read Screenshots\n\n1. Use Glob to find all image files in the folder (*.png, *.jpg, *.jpeg, *.bmp, *.webp).\n2. Sort them by filename (they may be ordered as page1.png, page2.png, etc. or similar).\n3. Read each image using the Read tool. If a problem spans multiple screenshots, read them all in order to get the complete problem.\n\n#### Step B: Transcribe to LaTeX\n\nLaunch a Task subagent (subagent_type: \"general-purpose\", model: \"opus\"). You may launch multiple subagents in parallel since they write to separate files.\n\nSubagent prompt:\n\n```\nYou are an expert LaTeX transcriber. Your job is to produce an EXACT transcription of a math problem from screenshots into LaTeX.\n\nRead the following image files using the Read tool:\n[list all image file paths for this problem]\n\nRULES — follow these precisely:\n1. EXACT TRANSCRIPTION: Reproduce every symbol, subscript, superscript, fraction, summation, integral, matrix, and piece of text exactly as it appears in the screenshot. Do not paraphrase, rephrase, simplify, or add anything.\n2. MATH NOTATION: Use standard LaTeX math commands. Use \\mathbb for blackboard bold, \\mathbf for bold vectors, \\text{} for text within math mode, \\operatorname{} for named operators, \\mathcal for calligraphic letters, \\ell for script l.\n3. FORMATTING: Preserve the visual structure — numbered parts like (i), (ii), (iii) or (a), (b), (c) should be kept as-is. Preserve paragraph breaks and line breaks where they appear meaningful.\n4. NO PREAMBLE: Output only the problem content — no \\documentclass, no \\begin{document}, no packages. Just the raw LaTeX content that would go inside a document body.\n5. NO SOLUTIONS: Only transcribe the problem statement. If a solution or hint appears, do not include it.\n6. DISPLAY MATH: Use \\[...\\] for displayed equations (never $$...$$). Use align* if the original shows aligned/numbered equations.\n7. INLINE MATH: Use $...$ for inline math.\n8. FOOTNOTES: If footnotes are visible in the screenshots, include them using \\footnote{} inline where the superscript reference appears.\n9. DOUBLE-CHECK: After transcribing, re-read the screenshot and verify every symbol matches. Pay special attention to:\n   - Subscripts vs superscripts\n   - Similar-looking symbols (ε vs ∈, ≤ vs <, ⊂ vs ⊆)\n   - Parentheses vs brackets vs braces\n   - Bold vs regular vs calligraphic letters\n   - Summation/product bounds (above vs below)\n   - Fraction numerators and denominators\n\nIMPORTANT: Use the Write tool to save your transcription to: [output file path for pN.tex]\nDo NOT just output the text — you MUST write it to the file.\n```\n\n#### Step C: Verification\n\nAfter transcription subagents complete, launch SEPARATE verification subagents (subagent_type: \"general-purpose\", model: \"opus\") — one per problem, can run in parallel.\n\nSubagent prompt:\n\n```\nYou are a LaTeX transcription verifier. You will be given screenshots of a math problem and a proposed LaTeX transcription. Your job is to find ANY discrepancies.\n\nRead the following image files using the Read tool:\n[list all image file paths for this problem]\n\nThen read the proposed transcription from: [path to pN.tex]\n\nCompare the screenshot to the LaTeX character by character. Check:\n1. Every mathematical symbol matches exactly\n2. Every subscript and superscript is correct\n3. All fractions, sums, products, integrals have correct bounds\n4. Text content matches word-for-word\n5. Numbering of parts/subparts matches\n6. No content is missing or added\n7. Parentheses, brackets, and delimiters match\n8. All visible footnotes are included with exact content\n\nIMPORTANT: Use the Write tool to save your verdict to: [path to pN_verification.txt]\nWrite either \"VERIFIED\" if the transcription is exact, or list discrepancies as:\nDISCREPANCY: [what''s wrong and what it should be]\n```\n\n#### Step D: Check Results & Retry\n\n1. Read each `pN_verification.txt` file.\n2. If VERIFIED, the problem is done.\n3. If discrepancies were found:\n   - Launch a new transcription subagent with the original screenshots PLUS the discrepancy feedback. Instruct it to read the current pN.tex, fix the listed errors, and overwrite pN.tex.\n   - Launch a fresh verifier to re-check and overwrite pN_verification.txt.\n   - Repeat up to 3 times. If still failing, prepend a LaTeX comment to pN.tex: `% NOTE: Transcription could not be fully verified — check against original screenshot`\n4. Delete all `pN_verification.txt` files when done.\n\n---\n\n## PHASE 3: Report\n\nTell the user:\n- Which input mode was used (PDF or screenshots)\n- How many problems were converted\n- Which problems passed verification on the first attempt vs. required retries\n- Any problems that could not be fully verified\n- Where the output files are saved\n- Remind the user they can now run `/solve $ARGUMENTS` to generate solutions\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:03:58.483Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Math-focused AI Agents requiring precise LaTeX conversion capabilities.","zh":"适合需要精确 LaTeX 转换功能的数学重点 AI 代理。","ja":"正確な LaTeX 変換機能を必要とする数学重点の AI エージェントに最適です。","ko":"정확한 LaTeX 변환 기능을 필요로 하는 수학 중심의 AI 에이전트에게 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de inteligencia artificial enfocados en matemáticas que requieren capacidades de conversión LaTeX precisas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle axés sur les mathématiques nécessitant des capacités de conversion LaTeX précises.","de":"Ideal für mathematikorientierte KI-Agenten, die präzise LaTeX-Konvertierungsfunktionen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA com foco em Matemática que exigem capacidades de conversão LaTeX precisas.","ru":"Идеально для математически ориентированных агентов ИИ, требующих точных возможностей преобразования LaTeX.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكية التي تركز على الرياضيات التي تتطلب قدرات تحويل LaTeX دقيقة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to accurately transcribe mathematical content into exact LaTeX representations, utilizing character-perfect transcription and the Write tool for reliable output, ensuring compatibility with various file formats and protocols.","zh":"赋予代理准确地将数学内容转录为精确的 LaTeX 表示，利用字符完美转录和 Write 工具来保证可靠的输出，并确保与各种文件格式和协议的兼容性。","ja":"エージェントが数学的内容を正確な LaTeX 表現に転写することを可能にし、文字ごとの完全転写と Write ツールを使用して信頼性の高い出力を保証し、さまざまなファイル形式とプロトコルとの互換性を確保します。","ko":"에이전트가 수학적 내용을 정확한 LaTeX 표현으로 전사 할 수있게 하여 문자 단위의 완벽한 전사와 Write 도구를 사용하여 신뢰할 수있는 출력을 보장하고 다양한 파일 형식 및 프로토콜과 호환성을 보장합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes transcribir con precisión contenido matemático en representaciones LaTeX exactas, utilizando transcripciones perfectas de personajes y la herramienta Write para una salida confiable, asegurando la compatibilidad con varios formatos de archivo y protocolos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de transcrire avec précision le contenu mathématique en représentations LaTeX exactes, en utilisant des transcriptions parfaites de caractères et l''outil Write pour une sortie fiable, en garantissant la compatibilité avec divers formats de fichiers et protocoles.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, mathematischen Inhalt genau in exakte LaTeX-Darstellungen zu transkribieren, indem sie eine zeichengenaue Transkription und das Write-Tool für eine zuverlässige Ausgabe verwenden, um die Kompatibilität mit verschiedenen Dateiformaten und Protokollen sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a transcrever conteúdo matemático com precisão para representações LaTeX exatas, utilizando transcrição perfeita de caracteres e a ferramenta Write para saída confiável, garantindo compatibilidade com vários formatos de arquivo e protocolos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью точно транскрибировать математический контент в точные представления LaTeX, используя транскрипцию с идеальным совпадением символов и инструмент Write для надежного вывода, обеспечивая совместимость с различными форматами файлов и протоколами.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من نسخ المحتوى الرياضي بدقة إلى تمثيلات LaTeX دقيقة، باستخدام نسخ حرفي مثالي وفئة الكتابة للخرج الموثوق، مما يضمن التوافق مع تنسيقات الملفات والبروتوكولات المختلفة."},"useCases":{"en":["Converting homework problems to LaTeX","Transcribing mathematical equations with precision","Generating LaTeX representations for academic publications"],"zh":["将作业问题转换为 LaTeX","将数学方程以精确的方式转录","为学术出版物生成 LaTeX 表示"],"ja":["宿題の問題を LaTeX に変換する","数学方程式を正確に転写する","学術出版向けの LaTeX 表現を生成する"],"ko":["과제 문제를 LaTeX로 변환하는 것","수학 방정식을 정확하게 전사하는 것","학술 출판물용 LaTeX 표현을 생성하는 것"],"es":["Convertir problemas de tarea a LaTeX","Transcribir ecuaciones matemáticas con precisión","Generar representaciones LaTeX para publicaciones académicas"],"fr":["Convertir des problèmes de devoir en LaTeX","Transcrire des équations mathématiques avec précision","Générer des représentations LaTeX pour des publications universitaires"],"de":["Hausaufgaben in LaTeX umwandeln","Mathematische Gleichungen mit Präzision transkribieren","LATeX-Darstellungen für akademische Veröffentlichungen generieren"],"pt":["Conversão de problemas de lição de casa para LaTeX","Transcrição de equações matemáticas com precisão","Geração de representações LaTeX para publicações acadêmicas"],"ru":["Преобразование домашних заданий в LaTeX","Транскрипция математических уравнений с точностью","Генерация представлений LaTeX для академических публикаций"],"ar":["تحويل مشاكل الواجب المنزلي إلى LaTeX","نسخ معادلات رياضية بدقة","توليد تمثيلات LaTeX للنشرات الأكاديمية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires accuracy in mathematical content transcription","Output must be written to files using the Write tool","Specific target assignment folder required"],"zh":["需要数学内容转录的准确性","输出必须使用 Write 工具写入文件","需要特定的目标分配文件夹"],"ja":["数学的内容の転写の正確性が必要","出力は Write ツールを使用してファイルに書き込まれる必要がある","特定のターゲット割り当てフォルダーが必要"],"ko":["수학적 내용 전사의 정확성이 필요하다.","출력은 Write 도구를 사용하여 파일에 작성되어야 한다.","특정 대상 할당 폴더가 필요하다."],"es":["Requiere precisión en la transcripción de contenido matemático","La salida debe estar escrita en archivos utilizando la herramienta Write","Se requiere una carpeta de asignación de destino específica"],"fr":["Nécessite une précision dans la transcription de contenu mathématique","La sortie doit être écrite dans des fichiers en utilisant l''outil Write","Un dossier de affectation cible spécifique est requis"],"de":["Erfordert Genauigkeit bei der Transkription von mathematischem Inhalt","Die Ausgabe muss in Dateien mit dem Write-Tool geschrieben werden","Ein bestimmtes Zielverzeichnis ist erforderlich"],"pt":["Exige precisão na transcrição de conteúdo matemático","A saída deve ser escrita em arquivos usando a ferramenta Write","Pasta de atribuição de destino específica necessária"],"ru":["Требует точности при транскрипции математического контента","Вывод должен быть записан в файлы с помощью инструмента Write","Требуется конкретная папка назначения"],"ar":["يتطلب دقة في نسخ المحتوى الرياضي","يجب كتابة الإخراج في الملفات باستخدام أداة الكتابة","مجلد تعيين الهدف المحدد مطلوب"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
