рированными предпросмотрами контента","Генерировать технические статьи в блоге с конкретными темами, такими как AI原理","Оптимизировать посты в блоге для поисковых систем с нацеленными ключевыми словами"],"ar":["تحسين كتابة منشورات المدونة مع معاينة المحتوى المنظّم","إنشاء مقالات مدونة تقنية مع مواضيع محددة مثل AI原理","تحسين منشورات المدونة لمحركات البحث مع كلمات مفتاحية مستهدفة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Hugo version v0.153.2+ (Extended)","Limited to hermit-V2 theme","Content directory must be ''content/posts/''"],"zh":["需要Hugo版本v0.153.2+（扩展）","仅限hermit-V2主题","内容目录必须是''content/posts/''"],"ja":["Hugoバージョンv0.153.2+（拡張）が必要","hermit-V2テーマのみ","コンテンツディレクトリは''content/posts/''でなければならない"],"ko":["Hugo 버전 v0.153.2+（확장）가 필요합니다","hermit-V2 테마만 해당","콘텐츠 디렉토리는 ''content/posts/''이어야 합니다"],"es":["Requiere la versión v0.153.2+ (Extendida) de Hugo","Limitado al tema hermit-V2","El directorio de contenido debe ser ''content/posts/''"],"fr":["Nécessite la version v0.153.2+ (étendue) de Hugo","Limité au thème hermit-V2","Le répertoire de contenu doit être ''content/posts/''"],"de":["Benötigt Hugo-Version v0.153.2+ (Erweitert)","Begrenzt auf das hermit-V2-Theme","Das Inhaltsverzeichnis muss ''content/posts/'' sein"],"pt":["Exige a versão v0.153.2+ (Estendida) do Hugo","Limitado ao tema hermit-V2","O diretório de conteúdo deve ser ''content/posts/''"],"ru":["Требуется версия v0.153.2+ (Расширенная) Hugo","Ограничен темой hermit-V2","Каталог контента должен быть ''content/posts/''"],"ar":["يتطلب الإصدار v0.153.2+ (الممتد) من Hugo","محدود بموضوع hermit-V2","يجب أن يكون مدير المحتوى ''content/posts/''"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('D0miH/claudsidian/validate_paper_links', 'community', 'D0miH', 'claudsidian', 'D0miH/claudsidian', 'validate_paper_links', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.429Z', '2026-02-18T05:04:33.610Z', NULL, '{"id":"D0miH/claudsidian/validate_paper_links","name":"validate_paper_links","description":{"zh":"Validate Paper Links Skill 验证论文中的链接，确保链接正确性和相关性","ja":"Validate Paper Links Skill を使用して、論文内のリンクを検証し、リンクの正確性と関連性を確保する","ko":"Validate Paper Links Skill을 사용하여 논문内の 링크를 검증하고 링크의 정확성과 관련성을 보장합니다","es":"Valida enlaces de artículos de investigación contra referencias y patrones de citación","fr":"Valide les liens d''articles de recherche contre les références et les modèles de citation","de":"Überprüfe Forschungsartikel-Links gegen Referenzen und Zitiermuster","pt":"A habilidade validate_paper_links ajuda a garantir a precisão das referências em artigos, impedindo links inválidos.","ru":"Навык validate_paper_links помогает обеспечить точность ссылок в статьях, предотвращая недействительные ссылки.","ar":"المهارة validate_paper_links تساعد على ضمان دقة المراجع في الأوراق، وتنهي الروابط غير الصالحة.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"论文链接验证 - Validate Paper Links Skill","ja":"論文リンク検証 - Validate Paper Links Skill","ko":"논문 링크 검증 - Validate Paper Links Skill","es":"Validar enlaces de artículos de investigación","fr":"Valider les liens d''articles de recherche","de":"Forschungsartikel-Links validieren","pt":"Validação de Links de Artigos","ru":"Валидация ссылок на статьи","ar":"تحقق صحة روابط الأوراق","en":"validate_paper_links"},"description":{"zh":"Validate Paper Links Skill 验证论文中的链接，确保链接正确性和相关性","ja":"Validate Paper Links Skill を使用して、論文内のリンクを検証し、リンクの正確性と関連性を確保する","ko":"Validate Paper Links Skill을 사용하여 논문内の 링크를 검증하고 링크의 정확성과 관련성을 보장합니다","es":"Valida enlaces de artículos de investigación contra referencias y patrones de citación","fr":"Valide les liens d''articles de recherche contre les références et les modèles de citation","de":"Überprüfe Forschungsartikel-Links gegen Referenzen und Zitiermuster","pt":"A habilidade validate_paper_links ajuda a garantir a precisão das referências em artigos, impedindo links inválidos.","ru":"Навык validate_paper_links помогает обеспечить точность ссылок в статьях, предотвращая недействительные ссылки.","ar":"المهارة validate_paper_links تساعد على ضمان دقة المراجع في الأوراق، وتنهي الروابط غير الصالحة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["验证论文链接的正确性","防止幻觉链接和错误引用","确保链接与论文相关","支持批量验证","提高论文质量和可靠性"],"ja":["論文リンクの正確性を検証","幻覚リンクや誤った引用を防ぐ","リンクが論文に関連していることを確認","バッチ検証をサポート","論文の品質と信頼性を向上"],"ko":["논문 링크의 정확성을 검증","환각 링크와 잘못된 인용을 방지","링크가 논문과 관련이 있는지 확인","배치 검증을 지원","논문의 품질과 신뢰성을 향상"],"es":["Prevención de enlaces a artículos no referenciados","Detección de títulos incorrectos o formato","Identificación de artículos de baja influencia","Corrección de nombres de archivos rotos"],"fr":["Prévention des liens vers des articles non référencés","Détection de titres incorrects ou de format","Identification d''articles à faible influence","Correction de noms de fichiers cassés"],"de":["Vermeidung von Links zu nicht referenzierten Artikeln","Erkennung von fehlerhaften Titeln oder Format","Identifizierung von Artikeln mit geringem Einfluss","Korrektur von fehlerhaften Dateinamen"],"pt":["Verificação de links para artigos não referenciados","Prevenção de links com títulos ou formatação incorretos","Filtragem de artigos de baixa influência","Correção de nomes de arquivos quebrados"],"ru":["Проверка ссылок на статьи, не упомянутые в текущей статье","Предотвращение создания ссылок с неправильными названиями или форматированием","Фильтрация статей с низким влиянием","Исправление сломанных имен файлов"],"ar":["تحقق من الروابط إلى الأوراق غير المذكورة","منع إنشاء روابط بأسماء أو تنسيق غير صحيح","filtration الأوراق ذات التأثير الواطئ","تصحيح أسماء الملفات المعطوبة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["论文链接验证","Validate Paper Links Skill","论文质量","链接正确性","幻觉链接","错误引用","论文相关性"],"ja":["論文リンク検証","Validate Paper Links Skill","論文品質","リンク正確性","幻覚リンク","誤った引用","論文関連性"],"ko":["논문 링크 검증","Validate Paper Links Skill","논문 품질","링크 정확성","환각 링크","잘못된 인용","논문 관련성"],"es":["validación de enlaces","artículos de investigación","referencias","patrones de citación","enlaces rotos","artículos no referenciados"],"fr":["validation de liens","articles de recherche","références","modèles de citation","liens cassés","articles non référencés"],"de":["Link-Validierung","Forschungsartikel","Referenzen","Zitiermuster","fehlerhafte Links","nicht referenzierte Artikel"],"pt":["validação de links","artigos acadêmicos","referências precisas","prevenção de links inválidos","filtragem de artigos","correção de nomes de arquivos"],"ru":["валидация ссылок","научные статьи","точные ссылки","предотвращение недействительных ссылок","фильтрация статей","исправление имен файлов"],"ar":["تحقق صحة الروابط","الأوراق الأكاديمية","مراجع دقيقة","منع الروابط غير الصالحة","filtration الأوراق","تصحيح أسماء الملفات"]}},"owner":"D0miH","repo":"claudsidian","repoPath":"D0miH/claudsidian","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.429Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"validate_paper_links","description":"Validate paper note links against actual paper references and influence","bodyPreview":"## ✅ Validate Paper Links Skill\n\nValidate all `[[Paper Title]]` links in a paper note against the actual paper''s references and citation patterns.\n\n**Goal:** Prevent:\n1. Links to papers NOT referenced in the current paper (hallucination)\n2. Links to papers with incorrect titles or formatting\n3. Links to low-influence papers (cited once, not foundational)\n4. Broken file names (`:` not exchanged to `-`)\n\n---\n\n## CRITICAL RULES\n\n**A link should exist only if:**\n1. ✅ The paper IS referenced in the c","body":"## ✅ Validate Paper Links Skill\n\nValidate all `[[Paper Title]]` links in a paper note against the actual paper''s references and citation patterns.\n\n**Goal:** Prevent:\n1. Links to papers NOT referenced in the current paper (hallucination)\n2. Links to papers with incorrect titles or formatting\n3. Links to low-influence papers (cited once, not foundational)\n4. Broken file names (`:` not exchanged to `-`)\n\n---\n\n## CRITICAL RULES\n\n**A link should exist only if:**\n1. ✅ The paper IS referenced in the current paper''s bibliography/references\n2. ✅ The paper is INFLUENTIAL (cited ≥2 times OR explicitly foundational/cited in intro/abstract)\n3. ✅ Title is in exact Title Case matching the reference\n4. ✅ File name properly formats `:` as `-` (e.g., `Attention - Is All You Need`)\n\n**A link should be removed if:**\n- ❌ Paper is NOT in the current paper''s references\n- ❌ Paper is cited only once in methods/results (low influence)\n- ❌ Title formatting is incorrect\n- ❌ File name violates naming convention\n\n---\n\n## WORKFLOW\n\n### 0. Read last-run timestamp\nRead `.claude/vault_maintanance.md` and note the `validate_paper_links:` timestamp.\n\n**Default: incremental scan** — only validate papers in `Reading/` modified after the `validate_paper_links:` timestamp.\nUse `find Reading/ -newer <reference_file>` to identify changed paper notes.\nTo use a reference file: `touch -t YYYYMMDDHHMI /tmp/validate_ref && find Reading/ -newer /tmp/validate_ref`\n\n- If no papers were modified: skip and report \"All paper links already validated.\"\n- Only run a full rescan if the user explicitly requests it or no timestamp exists yet.\n\n### 1. Get paper and note details\n\nRead the paper note and extract:\n- **Paper URL:** From frontmatter (arXiv HTML URL preferred)\n- **Paper title:** From frontmatter or file name\n- **Authors:** From frontmatter (if available)\n- **Year:** From frontmatter (if available)\n\n### 2. Fetch references section from arXiv HTML\n\n**Access paper:**\n- Use paper URL from frontmatter (typically `https://arxiv.org/html/[paper-id]v[version]`)\n- Use WebFetch with prompt focused **only on references section**\n- Skip all paper content (abstract, introduction, methods, results, etc.)\n- Extract **only** the bibliography/references section\n\n**Extract citation data:**\n- Parse reference list to get: titles, authors, years\n- Build structured reference list from bibliography section\n- Reference section is clearly marked on arXiv HTML pages\n\n**WebFetch optimization:**\n- Prompt: \"Extract ONLY the bibliography/references section. Ignore all other paper content (abstract, introduction, methods, results). Return reference titles, authors, and years.\"\n- This signals to skip 90% of paper content and focus only on references\n- Saves tokens by not parsing paper text\n\n**Why arXiv HTML:**\n- ✅ Direct access to paper bibliography\n- ✅ Pre-formatted references (easy to extract)\n- ✅ No API rate limiting or authentication\n- ✅ Reliable and consistent structure across papers\n- ✅ No JavaScript rendering issues\n- ✅ Can optimize WebFetch to skip content (token savings)\n\n### 3. Read paper note\n\n- Open paper note from `Reading/[filename].md`\n- Extract all `[[Paper Title]]` links from \"🔗 Connections to Other Work\" section\n- Build link list with current formatting\n\n### 4. Validate each link\n\n**For each `[[Paper Title]]` in the note:**\n\n**Check 1: Reference exists?**\n- Does this paper appear in the current paper''s bibliography?\n- If NO → FLAG: \"Not referenced in paper\" (candidate for removal)\n- If YES → PASS\n\n**Check 2: Influence level**\n- Count how many times the paper is cited in the current paper''s text\n- Referenced paper with `≥2` citations in this paper = influential ✓\n- Referenced paper cited once but foundational (cited in abstract/intro)? = influential ✓\n- Referenced paper cited only once in methods/results (low-impact section)? = LOW influence (candidate for removal)\n- If influence is borderline → ask user for judgment\n\n**Check 3: Title formatting**\n- Compare link title against reference list title\n- Is it Title Case?\n- Are colons `:` present in reference but `-` in link?\n- Are special characters consistent?\n- If mismatch → FLAG: \"Title mismatch\" or \"Formatting error\"\n\n**Check 4: File name validity**\n- Expected file name: exact title with `:` → `-`\n- Is current link pointing to correct file name?\n- Example: `[[Attention - Is All You Need]]` should match file `Attention - Is All You Need.md`\n- If mismatch → FLAG: \"File name doesn''t match link\"\n\n### 5. Generate validation report\n\nGroup findings by severity:\n\n**🔴 CRITICAL (remove immediately):**\n- Papers not in references\n- Papers cited only once in low-importance sections\n\n**🟡 NEEDS FIXING:**\n- Title case errors\n- File name formatting errors (`:` not converted to `-`)\n\n**🟢 OK:**\n- Papers properly referenced\n- Properly formatted\n- Appropriately influential\n\n**❓ NEEDS USER JUDGMENT:**\n- Papers cited ~2 times (borderline influence)\n- Foundational papers cited rarely but in key sections\n\n### 6. Apply fixes\n\nWith user approval:\n- **Remove links:** Delete `[[Paper Title]]` lines from \"🔗 Connections to Other Work\"\n- **Fix titles:** Correct Title Case and formatting to match references\n- **Fix file names:** Ensure `:` → `-` conversion\n- **Update note:** Save corrected paper note\n- **Verify:** Re-scan to confirm all links now valid\n\n### 7. Update vault_maintanance.md\nAfter completing validation (regardless of whether fixes were applied):\n- Run `date` via Bash to get the current system time\n- Read `.claude/vault_maintanance.md`\n- Update `validate_paper_links:` line to current date and time in format `DD-MM-YYYY HH:MM`\n- Reset `papers_since_validate_links:` to `0`\n- Write the updated file\n\n**Example update:**\n```\nvalidate_paper_links: 10-02-2026 14:35\n```\n\n---\n\n## TOKEN EFFICIENCY\n\n**Optimizations:**\n- **arXiv HTML** for direct bibliography access (single WebFetch call)\n- **References-only extraction** via targeted WebFetch prompt\n- Skip all paper content (abstract, intro, methods, results)\n- Bibliography section clearly marked and easy to extract\n- No API calls, no rate limiting, no authentication needed\n- Direct title + author list from bibliography\n- Build simple title→reference mapping\n\n**Why this is efficient:**\n- 1 WebFetch call to arXiv HTML (direct paper access via frontmatter URL)\n- **Targeted prompt skips 90% of paper content** (saves major tokens)\n- Bibliography section is well-formatted and clearly delimited\n- No API dependencies or rate limiting concerns\n- Minimal parsing needed (just extract reference titles)\n- No ambiguity in reference data\n\n**Workflow:**\n1. Read paper note frontmatter for arXiv HTML URL\n2. WebFetch the arXiv HTML page with prompt: \"Extract ONLY bibliography/references section. Skip all other content.\"\n3. Extract bibliography/references section\n4. Build reference list from bibliography\n5. Validate links against reference list\n\n**Avoid:**\n- Semantic Scholar (JavaScript rendering, rate limiting issues)\n- PDF parsing\n- Regex patterns for extraction (bibliography is already structured)\n- Processing full paper text (use targeted prompt instead)\n\n**Expected cost:** ~100-150 tokens per paper (1 optimized WebFetch call + validation)\n\n---\n\n## OUTPUT RULES\n\n- Grouped by severity (CRITICAL → needs fixing → OK)\n- File name / Link text / Issue / Suggested fix\n- No prose, bullets only\n- Example:\n\n```\n🔴 CRITICAL (remove):\n- [[Paper Not In References]] - Not in bibliography → REMOVE\n\n🟡 NEEDS FIXING:\n- [[attention is all you need]] - Title case error → Fix to [[Attention Is All You Need]]\n- [[My Paper: A Study]] - File name formatting → Should be [[My Paper - A Study]]\n\n🟢 OK (keep):\n- [[Transformers are All You Need]] ✓\n```\n\n---\n\n## SELF-CHECK\n\n✅ Did I fetch the arXiv HTML page from the frontmatter URL?\n✅ Did I extract all references from the bibliography section?\n✅ Did I extract reference metadata (title, authors, year)?\n✅ Did I check each link against the bibliography references?\n✅ Did I assess influence (citation count/context in paper)?\n✅ Did I validate Title Case formatting against bibliography titles?\n✅ Did I check file name convention (: → -)?\n✅ Did I group findings by severity?\n✅ Did I get user approval before removing links?\n✅ Did I verify all remaining links are valid?\n✅ Did I update vault_maintanance.md with current timestamp?\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:04:33.610Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Research Agents needing advanced paper link validation and citation analysis capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级论文链接验证和引用分析功能的研究代理。","ja":"研究エージェントが高度な論文リンクの検証と引用分析機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 논문 링크 검증 및 인용 분석 기능이 필요한 연구 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de investigación que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de validación de enlaces de artículos y análisis de citas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de recherche ayant besoin de capacités avancées de validation de liens d''articles et d''analyse de citations.","de":"Perfekt für Forschungsagenten, die erweiterte Funktionen zur Überprüfung von Artikelverknüpfungen und Zitatanalyse benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Pesquisa que necessitam de validação avançada de links de artigos e capacidades de análise de citações.","ru":"Идеально подходит для исследовательских агентов, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности проверки ссылок на статьи и анализа цитат.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء البحثيين الذين يحتاجون إلى تحقق متقدم من صحة روابط الأبحاث وقدرات تحليل الاقتباسات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to prevent hallucination, incorrect titles, and broken file names by validating paper links against actual references and citation patterns using protocols like file name formatting and reference checking.","zh":"通过使用文件名格式化和引用检查等协议来验证论文链接与实际引用和引用模式，赋予代理防止幻觉、不正确的标题和破损文件名的能力。","ja":"ファイル名のフォーマットや参照チェックなどのプロトコルを使用して、論文リンクを実際の参照と引用パターンに対して検証することで、代理は幻覚、不正確なタイトル、破損したファイル名を防ぐことができます。","ko":"파일 이름 형식 및 참조 확인 등의 프로토콜을 사용하여 논문 링크를 실제 참조 및 인용 패턴에 대해 검증하여 에이전트가 환각, 잘못된 제목 및 손상된 파일 이름을 방지할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a prevenir alucinaciones, títulos incorrectos y nombres de archivos rotos validando los enlaces de artículos contra referencias y patrones de citación reales utilizando protocolos como el formato de nombres de archivos y la comprobación de referencias.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''éviter les hallucinations, les titres incorrects et les noms de fichiers cassés en validant les liens d''articles contre les références et les modèles de citation réels en utilisant des protocoles tels que le formatage des noms de fichiers et la vérification des références.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Halluzinationen, falsche Titel und defekte Dateinamen zu verhindern, indem Artikelverknüpfungen gegen tatsächliche Referenzen und Zitierungsmuster überprüft werden, die Protokolle wie Dateinamensformatierung und Referenzprüfung verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a prevenir alucinações, títulos incorretos e nomes de arquivos quebrados, validando links de artigos contra referências reais e padrões de citação usando protocolos como formatação de nomes de arquivos e verificação de referências.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью предотвратить галлюцинации, неправильные названия и сломанные имена файлов, проверяя ссылки на статьи против фактических ссылок и шаблонов цитирования с использованием протоколов, таких как форматирование имен файлов и проверка ссылок.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على منع الوهم والعناوين الخاطئة والأسماء الملفية المعطوبة عن طريق التحقق من صحة روابط الأبحاث ضد المراجع الفعلية وأنماط الاقتباس باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل تنسيق أسماء الملفات وفحص المراجع."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating paper links for accuracy and relevance","Preventing links to low-influence papers with minimal citations","Debugging broken file names and formatting issues in paper links"],"zh":["验证论文链接的准确性和相关性","防止链接到影响力低的论文，引用数量最少","调试论文链接中的破损文件名和格式问题"],"ja":["論文リンクの正確性と関連性を検証する","影響力の低い論文へのリンクを防ぐ、引用数が最も少ない","論文リンクの中の破損ファイル名とフォーマットの問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["논문 링크의 정확성 및 관련성을 검증하는 것","영향력이 낮은 논문에 대한 링크를 방지하여 최소한의 인용 수를 갖는 것","논문 링크의 손상된 파일 이름 및 형식 문제를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Validar enlaces de artículos para precisión y relevancia","Prevenir enlaces a artículos de poca influencia con citas mínimas","Depurar nombres de archivos rotos y problemas de formato en enlaces de artículos"],"fr":["Valider les liens d''articles pour l''exactitude et la pertinence","Éviter les liens vers les articles à faible influence avec des citations minimales","Déboguer les noms de fichiers cassés et les problèmes de formatage dans les liens d''articles"],"de":["Überprüfen von Artikelverknüpfungen auf Genauigkeit und Relevanz","Verhindern von Verknüpfungen zu wenig einflussreichen Artikeln mit minimalen Zitierungen","Fehlerbehebung bei defekten Dateinamen und Formatierungsproblemen in Artikelverknüpfungen"],"pt":["Validar links de artigos para precisão e relevância","Prevenir links para artigos de baixa influência com citações mínimas","Depurar nomes de arquivos quebrados e problemas de formatação em links de artigos"],"ru":["Проверка ссылок на статьи для точности и актуальности","Предотвращение ссылок на статьи с минимальными цитатами и низким влиянием","Отладка сломанных имен файлов и проблем форматирования в ссылках на статьи"],"ar":["التحقق من صحة روابط الأبحاث ل الدقة والأهمية","منع الروابط إلى الأبحاث ذات التأثير المنخفض مع اقتباسات قليلة","تصحيح الأسماء الملفية المعطوبة ومشاكل التنسيق في روابط الأبحاث"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to paper references and citation data","Limited to validating links in a specific paper note format","May not work with papers having non-standard reference or citation formats"],"zh":["需要访问论文引用和引用数据","仅限验证特定论文笔记格式中的链接","可能不适用于具有非标准引用或引用格式的论文"],"ja":["論文の参照と引用データへのアクセスが必要","特定の論文ノート形式の中でのみリンクを検証する","標準以外の参照または引用形式を持つ論文では機能しない可能性がある"],"ko":["논문 참조 및 인용 데이터에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다.","특정 논문 노트 형식 내에서만 링크를 검증","표준 외의 참조 또는 인용 형식을 갖는 논문에서는 작동하지 않을 수 있습니다"],"es":["Requiere acceso a referencias y datos de citación de artículos","Limitado a la validación de enlaces en un formato de nota de artículo específico","Puede no funcionar con artículos que tienen formatos de referencia o citación no estándar"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès aux références et aux données de citation d''articles","Limité à la validation des liens dans un format de note d''article spécifique","Peut ne pas fonctionner avec des articles ayant des formats de référence ou de citation non standard"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf Artikelreferenzen und Zitierungsdaten","Begrenzt auf die Überprüfung von Verknüpfungen in einem bestimmten Artikelnotizformat","Kann möglicherweise nicht mit Artikeln funktionieren, die nicht standardmäßige Referenz- oder Zitierungsformate haben"],"pt":["Requer acesso a referências de artigos e dados de citação","Limitado à validação de links em um formato de nota de artigo específico","Pode não funcionar com artigos que têm formatos de referência ou citação não padrão"],"ru":["Требует доступа к ссылкам на статьи и данным о цитатах","Ограничен проверкой ссылок в определенном формате заметок о статье","Может не работать со статьями, имеющими нестандартные форматы ссылок или цитат"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مراجع الأبحاث وبيانات الاقتباس","محدود بالتحقق من صحة الروابط في تنسيق ملاحظة البحث المحدد","قد لا يعمل مع الأبحاث التي لديها تنسيقات مرجعية أو اقتباسية غير стандартية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
