"태스크 브레인스토밍 기술은 문제를 이해하고 해결책을 제안하는ための 구조화된 질문과 탐색 방법입니다","es":"La herramienta de lluvia de ideas para tareas ayuda a convertir requisitos vagos en diseños concretos","fr":"L''outil de brainstorming pour tâches aide à convertir des exigences vagues en conceptions concrètes","de":"Das Brainstorming-Tool für Aufgaben hilft dabei, vage Anforderungen in konkrete Designs umzuwandeln","pt":"A ferramenta knowns.task.brainstorm é uma técnica de brainstorming que ajuda a entender o problema antes de propor soluções, por meio de questionamento estru...","ru":"Инструмент knowns.task.brainstorm - это техника мозгового штурма, которая помогает понять проблему, прежде чем предлагать решения, посредством структурирован...","ar":"أداة knowns.task.brainstorm هي تقنية عصف ذهني تساعد على فهم المشكلة قبل تقديم الحلول من خلال استجواب منظم","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["结构化提问","探索式解决方案","多选题支持","一步一步的过程"],"ja":["構造化された質問","探索式の解決策","多肢選択問題のサポート","ステップバイステップのプロセス"],"ko":["구조화된 질문","탐색식 해결책","다중 선택지 지원","一步一步의 과정"],"es":["Exploración de enfoques a través de preguntas estructuradas","Conversión de requisitos vagos en diseños concretos","Uso de preguntas de múltiple opción cuando sea posible","Anuncio al inicio del uso de la herramienta de lluvia de ideas","Enfoque en la comprensión del problema antes de proponer soluciones"],"fr":["Exploration d''approches à travers des questions structurées","Conversion d''exigences vagues en conceptions concrètes","Utilisation de questions à choix multiple lorsque possible","Annonce au début de l''utilisation de l''outil de brainstorming","Focus sur la compréhension du problème avant de proposer des solutions"],"de":["Erkundung von Ansätzen durch strukturierte Fragen","Umwandlung von vagen Anforderungen in konkrete Designs","Verwendung von Multiple-Choice-Fragen wenn möglich","Bekanntgabe am Anfang der Verwendung des Brainstorming-Tools","Fokus auf das Verständnis des Problems bevor Lösungen vorgeschlagen werden"],"pt":["Questionamento estruturado","Exploração de abordagens","Definição de requisitos","Desenvolvimento de designs concretos","Análise de soluções"],"ru":["Структурированный вопрос","Изучение подходов","Определение требований","Разработка конкретных дизайнов","Анализ решений"],"ar":["استجواب منظم","استكشاف مداخل","تحديد متطلبات","تطوير تصميمات محددة","تحليل حلول"]},"keywords":{"zh":["任务头脑风暴","结构化提问","探索式解决方案","多选题","一步一步的过程","问题理解","解决方案设计"],"ja":["タスクブレインストーミング","構造化された質問","探索式の解決策","多肢選択問題","ステップバイステップのプロセス","問題理解","解決策設計"],"ko":["태스크 브레인스토밍","구조화된 질문","탐색식 해결책","다중 선택지","一步一步의 과정","문제 이해","해결책 설계"],"es":["lluvia de ideas para tareas","herramienta de brainstorming","diseño de tareas","requisitos vagos","preguntas estructuradas","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["brainstorming pour tâches","outil de brainstorming","conception de tâches","exigences vagues","questions structurées","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Brainstorming für Aufgaben","Brainstorming-Tool","Aufgaben-Design","vage Anforderungen","strukturierte Fragen","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["brainstorming","desenvolvimento de software","requisitos de sistema","design de sistema","análise de soluções","desenvolvedores","técnica de brainstorming"],"ru":["мозговой штурм","разработка программного обеспечения","требования системы","дизайн системы","анализ решений","разработчики","техника мозгового штурма"],"ar":["عصف ذهني","تطوير البرمجيات","متطلبات النظام","تصميم النظام","تحليل الحلول","المطورون","تقنية العصف الذهني"]}},"owner":"tominhphong","repo":"dfw-viet-biz","repoPath":"tominhphong/dfw-viet-biz","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.429Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"knowns.task.brainstorm","description":"Use when requirements are unclear, multiple approaches exist, or you need to explore solutions before planning","bodyPreview":"# Brainstorming for Tasks\n\nConvert vague requirements into concrete design through structured questioning and exploration.\n\n**Announce at start:** \"I''m using the knowns.task.brainstorm skill to explore approaches.\"\n\n**Core principle:** UNDERSTAND THE PROBLEM BEFORE PROPOSING SOLUTIONS.\n\n## The Process\n\n### Phase 1: Discovery\n\n**One question at a time.** Don''t overwhelm with multiple questions.\n\nPrefer multiple-choice when possible:\n```\nWhich approach do you prefer?\nA) Quick solution with trade-o","body":"# Brainstorming for Tasks\n\nConvert vague requirements into concrete design through structured questioning and exploration.\n\n**Announce at start:** \"I''m using the knowns.task.brainstorm skill to explore approaches.\"\n\n**Core principle:** UNDERSTAND THE PROBLEM BEFORE PROPOSING SOLUTIONS.\n\n## The Process\n\n### Phase 1: Discovery\n\n**One question at a time.** Don''t overwhelm with multiple questions.\n\nPrefer multiple-choice when possible:\n```\nWhich approach do you prefer?\nA) Quick solution with trade-offs\nB) Comprehensive solution, more effort\nC) Something else (describe)\n```\n\nQuestions to clarify:\n- What problem are we solving?\n- Who are the users/stakeholders?\n- What are the constraints?\n- What does success look like?\n\n### Phase 2: Research Existing Patterns\n\n```json\n// Search docs for related patterns\nmcp__knowns__search_docs({ \"query\": \"<topic>\" })\n\n// Check how similar things were done\nmcp__knowns__search_tasks({ \"query\": \"<keywords>\" })\n```\n\n**Learn from history** - completed tasks often contain implementation insights.\n\n### Phase 3: Explore Approaches\n\nPresent 2-3 options with trade-offs:\n\n```markdown\n## Option A: [Name]\n- **Approach**: Brief description\n- **Pros**: What''s good\n- **Cons**: What''s challenging\n- **Effort**: Low/Medium/High\n\n## Option B: [Name]\n- **Approach**: Brief description\n- **Pros**: What''s good\n- **Cons**: What''s challenging\n- **Effort**: Low/Medium/High\n```\n\n**Lead with your recommendation** and explain why.\n\n### Phase 4: Validate and Document\n\nAfter agreement:\n- Summarize the chosen approach\n- Identify potential risks\n- Define acceptance criteria\n\nIf creating a new task:\n```json\nmcp__knowns__create_task({\n  \"title\": \"<title>\",\n  \"description\": \"Based on brainstorm: <key decisions>\",\n  \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\"Criterion 1\", \"Criterion 2\"]\n})\n```\n\nIf updating existing task:\n```json\nmcp__knowns__update_task({\n  \"taskId\": \"$ARGUMENTS\",\n  \"description\": \"Updated based on brainstorm...\"\n})\n```\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n**Good candidates:**\n- Vague requirements (\"make it faster\", \"improve UX\")\n- Multiple valid approaches exist\n- Significant effort involved\n- New territory for the project\n\n**Skip for:**\n- Clear, well-defined tasks\n- Bug fixes with obvious solutions\n- Simple additions following existing patterns\n\n## Red Flags\n\n**You''re doing it wrong if:**\n- Proposing solutions before understanding the problem\n- Asking too many questions at once\n- Not researching existing patterns first\n- Skipping trade-off analysis\n\n## Remember\n\n- One question at a time\n- Research existing patterns first\n- Present options with trade-offs\n- Lead with your recommendation\n- Document the decision"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:04:42.544Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Conversational Agents needing structured task exploration through questioning and analysis.","zh":"适合需要通过提问和分析进行结构化任务探索的对话式代理。","ja":"会話エージェントが質問と分析を通じて構造化されたタスク探索を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"대화형 에이전트가 질문과 분석을 통해 구조화된 태스크 탐색을 필요로 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Conversacionales que necesitan exploración de tareas estructuradas a través de preguntas y análisis.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents Conversationnels ayant besoin d''une exploration de tâches structurée par le biais de questions et d''analyse.","de":"Perfekt für Conversational Agents, die eine strukturierte Aufgabenexploration durch Fragen und Analyse benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Conversação que necessitam de exploração de tarefas estruturadas por meio de questionamento e análise.","ru":"Идеально для Конверсационных Агентов, которым необходима структурированная эксплорация задач посредством вопросов и анализа.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المحادثين الذين يحتاجون إلى استكشاف مهام منظم من خلال الاستجواب والتحليل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to convert vague requirements into concrete designs using multiple-choice questioning and phased discovery, leveraging core principles like understanding the problem before proposing solutions.","zh":"赋予代理将模糊的需求转化为具体设计的能力，使用多选题询问和分阶段发现，利用理解问题在提出解决方案之前的核心原则。","ja":"エージェントに、複数選択式の質問と段階的な発見を利用して、曖昧な要件を具体的な設計に変換する能力を付与し、問題を理解することよりも解決策を提案することの方が重要であるという核心原則を活用します。","ko":"에이전트가 다중 선택형 질문과 단계적 발견을 사용하여 모호한 요구 사항을 구체적인 설계로 변환 할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 문제를 이해하는 것이 해결책을 제안하는 것보다 더 중요한 핵심 원칙을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a convertir requisitos vagos en diseños concretos utilizando preguntas de múltiple opción y descubrimiento por fases, aprovechando principios básicos como comprender el problema antes de proponer soluciones.","fr":"Permet aux agents de convertir des exigences vagues en conceptions concrètes en utilisant des questions à choix multiple et une découverte par phases, en exploitant des principes de base tels que la compréhension du problème avant de proposer des solutions.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, vage Anforderungen in konkrete Entwürfe umzuwandeln, indem sie Multiple-Choice-Fragen und phasenweises Entdecken verwenden und dabei grundlegende Prinzipien wie das Verständnis des Problems vor der Lösungsvorschlag nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a converter requisitos vagos em projetos concretos usando questionamento de múltipla escolha e descoberta faseada, aproveitando princípios fundamentais como entender o problema antes de propor soluções.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью преобразовывать нечеткие требования в конкретные проекты с помощью вопросов с несколькими вариантами ответов и фазовой эксплорации, используя основные принципы, такие как понимание проблемы до предложения решений.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تحويل المتطلبات الغامضة إلى تصاميم ملموسة باستخدام أسئلة الاختيار المتعدد والاكتشاف المرحلي، واستخدام المبادئ الأساسية مثل فهم المشكلة قبل تقديم الحلول."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating task requirement gathering","Generating concrete design approaches","Exploring problem spaces through structured questioning"],"zh":["自动化任务需求收集","生成具体的设计方法","通过结构化提问探索问题空间"],"ja":["タスク要件の収集を自動化する","具体的な設計アプローチを生成する","構造化された質問を通じて問題空間を探索する"],"ko":["태스크 요구 사항 수집 자동화","구체적인 디자인 접근 방식 생성","구조화된 질문을 통해 문제 공간 탐색"],"es":["Automatización de la recopilación de requisitos de tarea","Generación de enfoques de diseño concretos","Exploración de espacios de problemas a través de preguntas estructuradas"],"fr":["Automatisation de la collecte des exigences de tâche","Génération d''approches de conception concrètes","Exploration d''espaces de problèmes par le biais de questions structurées"],"de":["Automatisierung der Aufgaben-Anforderungserfassung","Erzeugung konkreter Designansätze","Exploration von Problemräumen durch strukturierte Fragen"],"pt":["Automatizar a coleta de requisitos de tarefas","Gerar abordagens de projeto concretas","Explorar espaços de problemas por meio de questionamento estruturado"],"ru":["Автоматизация сбора требований задач","Генерация конкретных подходов к проектированию","Изучение проблемных пространств посредством структурированного вопросования"],"ar":["تحسين جمع متطلبات المهام","إنتاج نهج تصميم ملموس","استكشاف مجالات المشكلات من خلال الاستجواب المنظم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires user engagement for questioning","One question at a time to avoid overwhelming users"],"zh":["需要用户参与提问","一次一个问题以避免让用户感到不知所措"],"ja":["質問にユーザーの関与が必要","一度に1つの質問を行うことで、ユーザーを負担させない"],"ko":["질문에 사용자 참여가 필요","한번에 하나의 질문으로 사용자가 압도당하지 않도록"],"es":["Requiere la participación del usuario para las preguntas","Una pregunta a la vez para evitar abrumar a los usuarios"],"fr":["Nécessite la participation de l''utilisateur pour les questions","Une question à la fois pour éviter de submerger les utilisateurs"],"de":["Benötigt die Benutzereingabe für Fragen","Eine Frage auf einmal, um Benutzer nicht zu überfordern"],"pt":["Requer engajamento do usuário para questionamento","Uma pergunta de cada vez para evitar sobrecarregar os usuários"],"ru":["Требует участия пользователя для вопросования","Один вопрос за раз, чтобы не перегружать пользователей"],"ar":["يتطلب تفاعل المستخدم للاستجواب","سؤال واحد في المرة لتجنب إرهاق المستخدمين"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
