reen Refactor ist eine Entwicklungstechnik, die die Codequalität durch automatisierte Tests verbessert","pt":"TDD Red Green Refactor é uma técnica de desenvolvimento de software que melhora a qualidade do código. Aprenda a aplicá-la!","ru":"TDD Red Green Refactor - это техника разработки программного обеспечения, которая улучшает качество кода.","ar":"TDD Red Green Refactor هو技عة لتطوير البرمجيات التي تحسن جودة الكود","en":"🤖 an AI agent for the support desk at Badass Courses"},"definition":{"en":"🤖 an AI agent for the support desk at Badass Courses"},"features":{"zh":["TDD "," "," "," "," "],"ja":["TDD","","","",""],"ko":["TDD "," "," "," "," "],"es":["Pruebas automatizadas","Implementación de código mínimo","Refactorización para mejorar la claridad y la estructura","Identificación del comportamiento observable más pequeño","Actualización de pruebas para que fallen en el código actual"],"fr":["Tests automatisés","Implémentation de code minimum","Refactorisation pour améliorer la clarté et la structure","Identification du comportement observable le plus petit","Mise à jour des tests pour qu''ils échouent sur le code actuel"],"de":["Automatisierte Tests","Implementierung von minimalem Code","Refactorisierung zur Verbesserung von Klarheit und Struktur","Identifizierung des kleinsten beobachtbaren Verhaltens","Aktualisierung von Tests, um sie im aktuellen Code fehlschlagen zu lassen"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de software com testes","Melhoria da qualidade do código","Redução de erros","Técnica de refatoração","Testes automatizados","Desenvolvimento ágil"],"ru":["Разработка программного обеспечения с тестами","Улучшение качества кода","Снижение ошибок","Техника рефакторинга","Автоматизированное тестирование","Гибкая разработка"],"ar":["تطوير البرمجيات مع الاختبارات","تحسين جودة الكود","تقليل الأخطاء","تقنية لإعادة هيكلة الكود","اختبارات آلية","تطوير مرن"]},"keywords":{"zh":["TDD "," "," "," ","TDD"," "],"ja":["TDD","","","","TDD",""],"ko":["TDD "," "," "," ","TDD"," "],"es":["TDD","Desarrollo de software","Pruebas automatizadas","Refactorización","Código de calidad","Desarrollo ágil","Testing"],"fr":["TDD","Développement de logiciels","Tests automatisés","Refactorisation","Code de qualité","Développement agile","Testing"],"de":["TDD","Software-Entwicklung","Automatisierte Tests","Refactorisierung","Code-Qualität","Agiles Entwicklung","Testing"],"pt":["TDD","Red Green Refactor","Desenvolvimento de software","Testes automatizados","Refatoração","Desenvolvimento ágil","Qualidade do código","Redução de erros"],"ru":["TDD","Red Green Refactor","Разработка программного обеспечения","Автоматизированное тестирование","Рефакторинг","Гибкая разработка","Качество кода","Снижение ошибок"],"ar":["TDD","تطوير البرمجيات","اختبارات آلية","إعادة هيكلة الكود","تطوير مرن","جودة الكود","تقليل الأخطاء","Red Green Refactor"]}},"owner":"skillrecordings","repo":"support","repoPath":"skillrecordings/support","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.429Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tdd-red-green-refactor","description":"Enforce TDD workflow (red → green → refactor). Use for any code change that is testable.","bodyPreview":"# TDD Red / Green / Refactor\n\nUse this skill whenever making code changes that should be covered by tests.\n\n## Non-negotiables\n- Start with a failing test that expresses the behavior (red).\n- Implement the smallest change to pass (green).\n- Refactor for clarity/structure after green, keeping tests passing.\n- If no tests exist, add a minimal test harness + a failing test first.\n\n## Workflow\n1. Identify the smallest observable behavior.\n2. Add or update a test to fail on current code.\n3. Run the s","body":"# TDD Red / Green / Refactor\n\nUse this skill whenever making code changes that should be covered by tests.\n\n## Non-negotiables\n- Start with a failing test that expresses the behavior (red).\n- Implement the smallest change to pass (green).\n- Refactor for clarity/structure after green, keeping tests passing.\n- If no tests exist, add a minimal test harness + a failing test first.\n\n## Workflow\n1. Identify the smallest observable behavior.\n2. Add or update a test to fail on current code.\n3. Run the smallest relevant test command (targeted if possible).\n4. Implement the minimal code to make it pass.\n5. Refactor with tests still green.\n6. Report: test command(s) run + results.\n\n## If tests cannot run\n- State why (missing deps, env, credentials, etc.).\n- Still write the failing test first and note the expected outcome.\n- Provide a suggested test command for the user to run.\n\n## Test targeting\nPrefer the narrowest scope:\n- single file\n- package-level\n- repo-level only if needed\n\n## Typecheck policy\n\nTypes always pass. Do not blame pre-existing errors. Fix or revert.\n\n## WE USE VITEST - NOT BUN:TEST\n\n**This is non-negotiable.** Never use `bun:test` imports or APIs.\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ CORRECT - Vitest\nimport { describe, it, expect, vi, beforeEach } from ''vitest''\n\n// ❌ WRONG - bun:test (DO NOT USE)\nimport { describe, it, expect, mock } from ''bun:test''\n```\n\n### Test commands\n\n```bash\n# All tests via Turborepo\nbun run test\n\n# Filtered by package\nbun run test --filter=@skillrecordings/core\nbun run test --filter=web\n\n# Direct Vitest (when you need fine-grained control)\nbun run test:all\nbun run test:all -- -t \"name of test\"\nbun run test:all -- packages/core/src/tools/process-refund.test.ts\n```\n\n### Common Vitest patterns\n\n```typescript\n// Mocking\nconst mockFn = vi.fn()\nvi.mocked(someModule).someMethod.mockResolvedValue(result)\n\n// Hoisting mocks (required for factory functions)\nconst mockClient = vi.hoisted(() => ({ method: vi.fn() }))\nvi.mock(''./client'', () => ({ client: mockClient }))\n\n// Spying\nvi.spyOn(object, ''method'').mockImplementation(...)\n```\n\n## Notes to include in the response\n- Which test you wrote first.\n- The command used to hit red and green.\n- Any refactor that changed structure but not behavior.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:04:44.638Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing test-driven development capabilities with red-green-refactor workflow.","zh":"适用于需要测试驱动开发能力的代码审查代理，具有红绿重构工作流程。","ja":"コードレビュー代理がテスト駆動開発の機能を必要とする場合に適しています。レッドグリーンリファクタリングワークフローを備えています。","ko":"테스트 주도 개발 기능과 레드-그린-리팩터링 워크플로가 필요한 코드 리뷰 에이전트에게 최적입니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de revisión de código que necesitan capacidades de desarrollo dirigido por pruebas con flujo de trabajo rojo-verde-reconstruir.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de revue de code nécessitant des capacités de développement piloté par les tests avec un workflow rouge-vert-reconstruire.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agenten, die Test-getriebene Entwicklungsfähigkeiten mit roter-grüner-Refaktorisierungs-Workflow benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que necessitam de capacidades de desenvolvimento direcionado por testes com fluxo de trabalho red-green-refactor.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов код-ревью, которым требуются возможности разработки, управляемой тестированием, с рабочим процессом red-green-refactor.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء مراجعة الكود الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات التطوير القائم على الاختبار مع تدفق العمل الأحمر والأخضر-إعادة هيكلة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to write robust code by implementing a failing test, passing with minimal code, and refactoring for clarity, all while maintaining test coverage through protocols like TDD and behaviors like red-green-refactor.","zh":"使代理能够通过实施失败的测试、最小代码通过以及重构以提高清晰度来编写强大的代码，同时通过TDD和红绿重构等协议维持测试覆盖。","ja":"エージェントが失敗するテストを実装し、最小限のコードで通過し、明確性のためにリファクタリングすることで強力なコードを書くことを可能にします。TDDやレッドグリーンリファクタリングなどのプロトコルを通じてテストカバレッジを維持します。","ko":"에이전트가 실패하는 테스트를 구현하고 최소한의 코드로 통과하고 명확성을 위해 리팩터링함으로써 강력한 코드를 작성할 수 있도록 합니다. TDD 및 레드-그린-리팩터링과 같은 프로토콜을 통해 테스트 커버리지 유지","es":"Habilita a los agentes a escribir código robusto implementando una prueba fallida, pasando con código mínimo y refactorizando para mayor claridad, todo mientras mantiene la cobertura de pruebas a través de protocolos como TDD y comportamientos como rojo-verde-reconstruir.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''écrire du code robuste en implémentant un test qui échoue, en passant avec un code minimal et en refactorisant pour plus de clarté, le tout en maintenant la couverture de tests grâce à des protocoles comme TDD et des comportements comme rouge-vert-reconstruire.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, robusten Code zu schreiben, indem sie einen fehlgeschlagenen Test implementieren, mit minimalem Code bestehen und für größere Klarheit refactorisieren, all dies, während sie die Testabdeckung durch Protokolle wie TDD und Verhaltensweisen wie rot-grün-Refaktorisierung aufrechterhalten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a escreverem código robusto implementando um teste com falha, passando com código mínimo e reestruturando para clareza, tudo enquanto mantém a cobertura de teste por meio de protocolos como TDD e comportamentos como red-green-refactor.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью писать прочный код, реализуя неудачный тест, проходящий с минимальным кодом, и рефакторинг для ясности, все это при поддержании покрытия теста посредством протоколов, таких как TDD, и поведений, таких как red-green-refactor.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على كتابة شيفرة متينة من خلال تنفيذ اختبار فاشل، ومرور مع كود 최소، وإعادة هيكلة من أجل الوضوح، وكل ذلك مع الحفاظ على تغطية الاختبار من خلال بروتوكولات مثل TDD وسلوكيات مثل الأحمر والأخضر-إعادة هيكلة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating test creation for new features","Refactoring legacy code with test validation","Debugging failing tests with minimal code changes"],"zh":["为新功能自动创建测试","使用测试验证重构遗留代码","使用最小代码更改调试失败的测试"],"ja":["新しい機能の自動テスト作成","テスト検証によるレガシーコードのリファクタリング","最小限のコード変更による失敗テストのデバッグ"],"ko":["새로운 기능을 위한 자동 테스트 생성","테스트 유효성 검사를 통한 레거시 코드 리팩토링","최소한의 코드 변경을 통한 실패한 테스트 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de pruebas para nuevas características","Reconstrucción de código heredado con validación de pruebas","Depuración de pruebas fallidas con cambios mínimos de código"],"fr":["Automatisation de la création de tests pour de nouvelles fonctionnalités","Réfactorisation de code hérité avec validation de tests","Débogage de tests qui échouent avec des modifications minimales de code"],"de":["Automatisierung der Test-Erstellung für neue Funktionen","Refaktorisierung von Legacy-Code mit Testvalidierung","Fehlerbehebung von fehlgeschlagenen Tests mit minimalen Codeänderungen"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de testes para recursos novos","Reestruturar código legado com validação de teste","Depurar testes com falha com alterações mínimas de código"],"ru":["Автоматизация создания тестов для новых функций","Рефакторинг устаревшего кода с проверкой теста","Отладка неудачных тестов с минимальными изменениями кода"],"ar":["تأتمتة إنشاء الاختبارات لالميزات الجديدة","إعادة هيكلة الشيفرة القديمة مع التحقق من الاختبار","تصحيح أخطاء الاختبارات الفاشلة مع تغييرات كود 최소"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires existing test framework","Applies to code changes only","Needs initial test harness for uncovered code"],"zh":["需要现有的测试框架","仅适用于代码更改","需要最初的测试工具包来覆盖未覆盖的代码"],"ja":["既存のテストフレームワークが必要","コード変更のみに適用","未カバーのコードをカバーするための初期のテストハーネスが必要"],"ko":["既存의 테스트 프레임워크가 필요합니다.","코드 변경만 적용","커버되지 않은 코드를 커버하기 위한 초기 테스트 하네스가 필요"],"es":["Requiere un marco de pruebas existente","Se aplica solo a cambios de código","Necesita un arnés de pruebas inicial para código no cubierto"],"fr":["Nécessite un cadre de tests existant","S''applique uniquement aux modifications de code","Nécessite un harnais de tests initial pour du code non couvert"],"de":["Benötigt ein bestehendes Testframework","Wird nur auf Codeänderungen angewendet","Benötigt ein anfängliches Testharnisch für nicht abgedeckten Code"],"pt":["Exige estrutura de teste existente","Aplica-se apenas a alterações de código","Necessita de harness de teste inicial para código não coberto"],"ru":["Требует существующей тестовой структуры","Применяется только к изменениям кода","Требует начального тестового каркаса для непокрытого кода"],"ar":["يتطلب هيكلة اختبار موجودة","يتعلق فقط بتغييرات الشيفرة","يحتاج إلى هارنس اختبار أولي للشيفرة غير مغطاة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('RockwallJMC/piercedesk6/verification-before-completion', 'community', 'RockwallJMC', 'piercedesk6', 'RockwallJMC/piercedesk6', 'verification-before-completion', 0, 0, 35, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.429Z', '2026-02-18T05:04:51.860Z', NULL, '{"id":"RockwallJMC/piercedesk6/verification-before-completion","name":"verification-before-completion","description":{"zh":"验证前完成是一种确保代码质量和可靠性的方法，通过在完成前运行验证命令","ja":"完了前の検証は、コードの品質と信頼性を確保するための方法で、完成前に検証コマンドを実行します","ko":"완료 전 검증은 코드 품질 및 신뢰성을 보장하는 방법으로 완료 전에 검증 명령을 실행합니다","es":"La verificación antes de la completar es un principio fundamental para garantizar la calidad y la honestidad en el desarrollo de software","fr":"La vérification avant l''achèvement est un principe fondamental pour garantir la qualité et l''honnêteté dans le développement de logiciels","de":"Die Verifizierung vor dem Abschluss ist ein grundlegendes Prinzip, um die Qualität und Ehrlichkeit in der Softwareentwicklung zu gewährleisten","pt":"A verificação antes da conclusão é um princípio fundamental para garantir a qualidade e a honestidade do trabalho","ru":"Верификация перед завершением является основным принципом для обеспечения качества и честности работы","ar":"التحقق قبل الإكمال هو مبدأ أساسي لضمان جودة العمل والمصداقية","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"验证前完成","ja":"完了前の検証","ko":"완료 전 검증","es":"Verificación antes de completar","fr":"Vérification avant achèvement","de":"Verifizierung vor Abschluss","pt":"Verificação Antes da Conclusão","ru":"Верификация Перед Завершением","ar":"التحقق قبل الإكمال","en":"verification-before-completion"},"description":{"zh":"验证前完成是一种确保代码质量和可靠性的方法，通过在完成前运行验证命令","ja":"完了前の検証は、コードの品質と信頼性を確保するための方法で、完成前に検証コマンドを実行します","ko":"완료 전 검증은 코드 품질 및 신뢰성을 보장하는 방법으로 완료 전에 검증 명령을 실행합니다","es":"La verificación antes de la completar es un principio fundamental para garantizar la calidad y la honestidad en el desarrollo de software","fr":"La vérification avant l''achèvement est un principe fondamental pour garantir la qualité et l''honnêteté dans le développement de logiciels","de":"Die Verifizierung vor dem Abschluss ist ein grundlegendes Prinzip, um die Qualität und Ehrlichkeit in der Softwareentwicklung zu gewährleisten","pt":"A verificação antes da conclusão é um princípio fundamental para garantir a qualidade e a honestidade do trabalho","ru":"Верификация перед завершением является основным принципом для обеспечения качества и честности работы","ar":"التحقق قبل الإكمال هو مبدأ أساسي لضمان جودة العمل والمصداقية","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["验证前完成","代码质量保证","可靠性提高","自动化验证","提高开发效率"],"ja":["完了前の検証","コードの品質保証","信頼性の向上","自動化された検証","開発効率の向上"],"ko":["완료 전 검증","코드 품질 보장","신뢰성 향상","자동화 된 검증","개발 효율성 향상"],"es":["Garantiza la calidad y la honestidad en el desarrollo de software","Evita declarar tareas como completadas sin verificar su funcionalidad","Mejora la eficiencia y reduce los errores","Fomenta la transparencia y la responsabilidad en el equipo de desarrollo","Se puede implementar en cualquier proyecto de desarrollo de software"],"fr":["Garantit la qualité et l''honnêteté dans le développement de logiciels","Évite de déclarer des tâches comme achevées sans vérifier leur fonctionnalité","Améliore l''efficacité et réduit les erreurs","Favorise la transparence et la responsabilité au sein de l''équipe de développement","Peut être mis en œuvre dans n''importe quel projet de développement de logiciels"],"de":["Gewährleistet die Qualität und Ehrlichkeit in der Softwareentwicklung","Verhindert die Erklärung von Aufgaben als abgeschlossen ohne Überprüfung ihrer Funktionalität","Verbessert die Effizienz und reduziert die Fehler","Fördert die Transparenz und Verantwortung im Entwicklerteam","Kann in jedem Softwareentwicklungsprojekt implementiert werden"],"pt":["Evidência antes de reivindicações","Verificação em tempo real","Transparência no processo de trabalho","Melhoria da eficiência","Redução de erros"],"ru":["Доказательства перед заявлениями","Верификация в реальном времени","Прозрачность процесса работы","Улучшение эффективности","Снижение ошибок"],"ar":["البرهان قبل المطالبات","التحقق في الوقت الفعلي","شفافية عملية العمل","تحسين الكفاءة","تقليل الأخطاء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["验证前完成","代码质量","可靠性","自动化验证","软件开发","开发效率"],"ja":["完了前の検証","コードの品質","信頼性","自動化された検証","ソフトウェア開発","開発効率"],"ko":["완료 전 검증","코드 품질","신뢰성","자동화 된 검증","소프트웨어 개발","개발 효율성"],"es":["verificación antes de completar","desarrollo de software","calidad y honestidad","eficiencia y productividad","transparencia y responsabilidad","pruebas y verificación"],"fr":["vérification avant achèvement","développement de logiciels","qualité et honnêteté","efficacité et productivité","transparence et responsabilité","tests et vérification"],"de":["Verifizierung vor Abschluss","Softwareentwicklung","Qualität und Ehrlichkeit","Effizienz und Produktivität","Transparenz und Verantwortung","Tests und Verifizierung"],"pt":["verificação antes da conclusão","qualidade do trabalho","eficiência","honestidade","desenvolvimento de software","testes de software","verificação de código"],"ru":["верификация перед завершением","качество работы","эффективность","честность","разработка программного обеспечения","тестирование программного обеспечения","верификация кода"],"ar":["التحقق قبل الإكمال","جودة العمل","كفاءة","مصداقية","تطوير البرمجيات","اختبار البرمجيات","التحقق من الشفرة"]}},"owner":"RockwallJMC","repo":"piercedesk6","repoPath":"RockwallJMC/piercedesk6","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.429Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"verification-before-completion","description":"Use when about to claim work is complete, fixed, or passing, before committing changes - requires running verification commands and confirming output before making any success claims; evidence before assertions always","bodyPreview":"# Verification Before Completion\n\n## Overview\n\nClaiming work is complete without verification is dishonesty, not efficiency.\n\n**Core principle:** Evidence before claims, always.\n**DONT run npx playwright in the background, run in terminal for visibility**\n\n**Violating the letter of this rule is violating the spirit of this rule.**\n\n## The Iron Law\n\n```\nNO COMPLETION CLAIMS WITHOUT FRESH VERIFICATION EVIDENCE\n```\n\nIf you haven''t run the verification command in this message, you cannot claim it pa","body":"# Verification Before Completion\n\n## Overview\n\nClaiming work is complete without verification is dishonesty, not efficiency.\n\n**Core principle:** Evidence before claims, always.\n**DONT run npx playwright in the background, run in terminal for visibility**\n\n**Violating the letter of this rule is violating the spirit of this rule.**\n\n## The Iron Law\n\n```\nNO COMPLETION CLAIMS WITHOUT FRESH VERIFICATION EVIDENCE\n```\n\nIf you haven''t run the verification command in this message, you cannot claim it passes.\n\n## The Gate Function\n\n```\nBEFORE claiming any status or expressing satisfaction:\n\n1. IDENTIFY: What command proves this claim?\n2. RUN: Execute the FULL command (fresh, complete)\n3. READ: Full output, check exit code, count failures\n4. VERIFY: Does output confirm the claim?\n   - If NO: State actual status with evidence\n   - If YES: State claim WITH evidence\n5. ONLY THEN: Make the claim\n\nSkip any step = lying, not verifying\n```\n\n## Common Failures\n\n| Claim                 | Requires                        | Not Sufficient                 |\n| --------------------- | ------------------------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| Tests pass            | Test command output: 0 failures | Previous run, \"should pass\"    |\n| Linter clean          | Linter output: 0 errors         | Partial check, extrapolation   |\n| Build succeeds        | Build command: exit 0           | Linter passing, logs look good |\n| Bug fixed             | Test original symptom: passes   | Code changed, assumed fixed    |\n| Regression test works | Red-green cycle verified        | Test passes once               |\n| Agent completed       | VCS diff shows changes          | Agent reports \"success\"        |\n| Requirements met      | Line-by-line checklist          | Tests passing                  |\n\n## Red Flags - STOP\n\n- Using \"should\", \"probably\", \"seems to\"\n- Expressing satisfaction before verification (\"Great!\", \"Perfect!\", \"Done!\", etc.)\n- About to commit/push/PR without verification\n- Trusting agent success reports\n- Relying on partial verification\n- Thinking \"just this once\"\n- Tired and wanting work over\n- **ANY wording implying success without having run verification**\n\n## Rationalization Prevention\n\n| Excuse                                  | Reality                |\n| --------------------------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| \"Should work now\"                       | RUN the verification   |\n| \"I''m confident\"                         | Confidence ≠ evidence  |\n| \"Just this once\"                        | No exceptions          |\n| \"Linter passed\"                         | Linter ≠ compiler      |\n| \"Agent said success\"                    | Verify independently   |\n| \"I''m tired\"                             | Exhaustion ≠ excuse    |\n| \"Partial check is enough\"               | Partial proves nothing |\n| \"Different words so rule doesn''t apply\" | Spirit over letter     |\n\n## Key Patterns\n\n**Tests:**\n\n```\n✅ [Run test command] [See: 34/34 pass] \"All tests pass\"\n❌ \"Should pass now\" / \"Looks correct\"\n```\n\n**Regression tests (TDD Red-Green):**\n\n```\n✅ Write → Run (pass) → Revert fix → Run (MUST FAIL) → Restore → Run (pass)\n❌ \"I''ve written a regression test\" (without red-green verification)\n```\n\n**Build:**\n\n```\n✅ [Run build] [See: exit 0] \"Build passes\"\n❌ \"Linter passed\" (linter doesn''t check compilation)\n```\n\n**Requirements:**\n\n```\n✅ Re-read plan → Create checklist → Verify each → Report gaps or completion\n❌ \"Tests pass, phase complete\"\n```\n\n**Agent delegation:**\n\n```\n✅ Agent reports success → Check VCS diff → Verify changes → Report actual state\n❌ Trust agent report\n```\n\n## Why This Matters\n\nFrom 24 failure memories:\n\n- your human partner said \"I don''t believe you\" - trust broken\n- Undefined functions shipped - would crash\n- Missing requirements shipped - incomplete features\n- Time wasted on false completion → redirect → rework\n- Violates: \"Honesty is a core value. If you lie, you''ll be replaced.\"\n\n## When To Apply\n\n**ALWAYS before:**\n\n- ANY variation of success/completion claims\n- ANY expression of satisfaction\n- ANY positive statement about work state\n- Committing, task completion\n- Moving to next task\n- Delegating to agents\n\n**Rule applies to:**\n\n- Exact phrases\n- Paraphrases and synonyms\n- Implications of success\n- ANY communication suggesting completion/correctness\n\n## The Bottom Line\n\n**No shortcuts for verification.**\n\nRun the command. Read the output. THEN claim the result.\n\nThis is non-negotiable.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:04:51.860Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for QA Agents needing rigorous verification and testing protocols.","zh":"非常适合需要严格验证和测试协议的QA代理。","ja":"徹底的な検証とテストプロトコルが必要なQAエージェントに最適です。","ko":"严격한 검증 및 테스트 프로토콜이 필요한 QA 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de QA que necesitan protocolos de verificación y prueba rigurosos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de QA nécessitant des protocoles de vérification et de test rigoureux.","de":"Perfekt für QA-Agenten, die strenge Verifizierungs- und Testprotokolle benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de QA que necessitam de protocolos de verificação e teste rigorosos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов QA, которым требуются строгие протоколы проверки и тестирования.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكالات جودة التأكد التي تحتاج إلى بروتوكولات التحقق والاختبار القاسية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to ensure claims are substantiated with fresh verification evidence, utilizing terminal-run commands like ''npx playwright'' for visibility and adhering to the Iron Law of no completion claims without evidence, thereby enhancing the reliability of their outputs through evidence-based validation.","zh":"使代理能够确保声明得到新鲜验证证据的支持，利用像''npx playwright''这样的终端运行命令来实现可视性，并遵守无证据不完成声明的铁律，从而通过基于证据的验证提高其输出的可靠性。","ja":"エージェントが声明を新しい検証証拠によって裏付けることを可能にし、''npx playwright''のような端末実行コマンドを使用して透明性を保ち、証拠なしに完了を主張しない鉄の法則を遵守することで、エビデンスベースのバリデーションによってその出力の信頼性を高める。","ko":"에이전트가声明을 신선한 검증증거로裏付ける 것을 가능하게 하며, ''npx playwright'' 같은 터미널 실행 명령어를 사용하여 투명성을 유지하며, 증거없이 완료를 주장하지 않는 철의 법칙을 준수함으로써, 증거 기반의 검증을 통해 출력의 신뢰성을 향상시킵니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes garantizar que las reclamaciones estén respaldadas por evidencia de verificación reciente, utilizando comandos de ejecución de terminal como ''npx playwright'' para visibilidad y ajustándose a la Ley de Hierro de no reclamaciones de finalización sin evidencia, mejorando así la confiabilidad de sus resultados a través de la validación basada en evidencia.","fr":"Permet aux agents de s''assurer que les réclamations sont étayées par des preuves de vérification fraîches, en utilisant des commandes d''exécution de terminal comme ''npx playwright'' pour la visibilité et en respectant la Loi de Fer selon laquelle aucune réclamation de completion n''est faite sans preuve, améliorant ainsi la fiabilité de leurs sorties grâce à une validation basée sur la preuve.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, sicherzustellen, dass Ansprüche mit frischer Verifizierungsbeweisen untermauert werden, indem Terminal-Befehle wie ''npx playwright'' für Transparenz verwendet werden und sich an das eisernes Gesetz keiner Abschlussansprüche ohne Beweise halten, wodurch die Zuverlässigkeit ihrer Ausgaben durch beweisbasierte Validierung verbessert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a garantir que as alegações sejam substanciadas com evidências de verificação recentes, utilizando comandos de execução de terminal como ''npx playwright'' para visibilidade e aderindo à Lei de Ferro de não realizar alegações de conclusão sem evidências, melhorando assim a confiabilidade de suas saídas por meio de validação baseada em evidências.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечить, чтобы претензии подтверждались свежими доказательствами проверки, используя команды терминала, такие как ''npx playwright'', для прозрачности и соблюдения Железного Закона о том, что не следует утверждать о завершении без доказательств, тем самым повышая достоверность их выходных данных за счет проверки, основанной на доказательствах.","ar":"تمكين الوكالات من ضمان أن تكون المطالبات مدعومة bằng أدلة تحقق جديدة، باستخدام أوامر تشغيل الطرفية مثل ''npx playwright'' للشفافية وامتثال لقانون الحديد لمطالبات الإكمال بدون أدلة، وبالتالي تعزيز موثوقية مخرجاتها من خلال التحقق القائم على الأدلة."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating completion claims with fresh evidence","Running verification commands in the terminal for transparency","Enforcing the Iron Law in automated workflows"],"zh":["使用新鲜证据验证完成声明","在终端运行验证命令以实现透明性","在自动化工作流中强制执行铁律"],"ja":["新しい証拠を使用して完了を検証する","端末で検証コマンドを実行して透明性を保つ","自動化されたワークフローで鉄の法則を強制する"],"ko":["신선한 증거를 사용하여 완료를 검증하는 것","터미널에서 검증 명령어를 실행하여 투명성을 유지하는 것","자동화된 워크플로에서 철의 법칙을 강제하는 것"],"es":["Validar reclamaciones de finalización con evidencia reciente","Ejecutar comandos de verificación en el terminal para transparencia","Hacer cumplir la Ley de Hierro en flujos de trabajo automatizados"],"fr":["Valider les réclamations de completion avec des preuves fraîches","Exécuter des commandes de vérification dans le terminal pour la transparence","Faire respecter la Loi de Fer dans les flux de travail automatisés"],"de":["Validieren von Abschlussansprüchen mit frischer Beweise","Ausführen von Verifizierungsbefehlen im Terminal für Transparenz","Durchsetzen des eisernen Gesetzes in automatisierten Workflows"],"pt":["Validar alegações de conclusão com evidências recentes","Executar comandos de verificação no terminal para transparência","Fazer cumprir a Lei de Ferro em fluxos de trabalho automatizados"],"ru":["Проверка претензий на завершение с помощью свежих доказательств","Запуск команд проверки в терминале для прозрачности","Принудительное соблюдение Железного Закона в автоматизированных рабочих процессах"],"ar":["التحقق من مطالبات الإكمال مع الأدلة الحديثة","تشغيل أوامر التحقق في الطرفية للشفافية","فرض قانون الحديد في سير العمل الآلي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to the Iron Law","Mandatory terminal execution for visibility","No background execution of verification commands"],"zh":["需要遵守铁律","需要终端执行以实现可视性","不支持后台执行验证命令"],"ja":["鉄の法則を遵守する必要がある","可視性を保つために端末実行が必要","バックグラウンドでの検証コマンドの実行はサポートされていない"],"ko":["철의 법칙을 준수해야 함","가시성을 유지하기 위해 터미널 실행이 필요","백그라운드에서 검증 명령어를 실행하는 것은 지원되지 않음"],"es":["Requiere adherencia a la Ley de Hierro","Ejecución obligatoria en terminal para visibilidad","No ejecución en segundo plano de comandos de verificación"],"fr":["Nécessite le respect de la Loi de Fer","Exécution obligatoire dans le terminal pour la visibilité","Aucune exécution en arrière-plan des commandes de vérification"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung des eisernen Gesetzes","Obligatorische Ausführung im Terminal für Transparenz","Keine Hintergrundauführung von Verifizierungsbefehlen"],"pt":["Exige adesão à Lei de Ferro","Execução obrigatória de terminal para visibilidade","Sem execução em segundo plano de comandos de verificação"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения Железного Закона","Обязательная выполнение в терминале для прозрачности","Нет фоновому выполнению команд проверки"],"ar":["يتطلب امتثال لقانون الحديد","التشغيل الإلزامي للطرفية للشفافية","لا يوجد تشغيل خلفي لأوامر التحقق"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('toilahuongg/submission-design/shopify-metafields', 'community', 'toilahuongg', 'submission-design', 'toilahuongg/submission-design', 'shopify-metafields', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.429Z', '2026-02-18T05:04:51.613Z', NULL, '{"id":"toilahuongg/submission-design/shopify-metafields","name":"shopify-metafields","description":{"zh":"Shopify Metafields,","ja":"Shopify Metafields","ko":"Shopify Metafields","es":"Los Metafields de Shopify te permiten almacenar datos adicionales en recursos como productos, pedidos y clientes.","fr":"Les Metafields Shopify vous permettent de stocker des données supplémentaires sur les ressources telles que les produits, les commandes et les clients.","de":"Die Metafields von Shopify ermöglichen es Ihnen, zusätzliche Daten in Ressourcen wie Produkten, Bestellungen und Kunden zu speichern.","pt":"Os campos meta do Shopify permitem armazenar dados adicionais em recursos como produtos, pedidos e clientes. Saiba mais sobre como utilizá-los.","ru":"Мета-поля Shopify позволяют хранить дополнительные данные в ресурсах, таких как продукты, заказы и клиенты. Узнайте больше о том, как их использовать.","ar":"تتيح حقول ميتا في شوبيفاي تخزين بيانات إضافية في الموارد مثل المنتجات والطلبيات والعملاء. تعرف على كيفية استخدامها.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Shopify Metafields ","ja":"Shopify Metafields","ko":"Shopify ","es":"Campos personalizados de Shopify","fr":"Champs personnalisés Shopify","de":"Shopify Metafelder","pt":"Campos Meta do Shopify","ru":"Мета-поля Shopify","ar":"حقول ميتا في شوبيفاي","en":"shopify-metafields"},"description":{"zh":"Shopify Metafields,","ja":"Shopify Metafields","ko":"Shopify Metafields","es":"Los Metafields de Shopify te permiten almacenar datos adicionales en recursos como productos, pedidos y clientes.","fr":"Les Metafields Shopify vous permettent de stocker des données supplémentaires sur les ressources telles que les produits, les commandes et les clients.","de":"Die Metafields von Shopify ermöglichen es Ihnen, zusätzliche Daten in Ressourcen wie Produkten, Bestellungen und Kunden zu speichern.","pt":"Os campos meta do Shopify permitem armazenar dados adicionais em recursos como produtos, pedidos e clientes. Saiba mais sobre como utilizá-los.","ru":"Мета-поля Shopify позволяют хранить дополнительные данные в ресурсах, таких как продукты, заказы и клиенты. Узнайте больше о том, как их использовать.","ar":"تتيح حقول ميتا في شوبيفاي تخزين بيانات إضافية في الموارد مثل المنتجات والطلبيات والعملاء. تعرف على كيفية استخدامها.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Namespace","Key","Type","Owner","Shopify"],"ja":["Namespace","Key","Type","Owner","Shopify"],"ko":["Namespace","Key","Type","Owner","Shopify"],"es":["Almacenamiento de datos adicionales en recursos de Shopify","Personalización de campos para productos, pedidos y clientes","Tipos de datos variados como texto, número y JSON","Asignación de propietarios a los datos almacenados","Organización de Metafields en espacios de nombres"],"fr":["Stockage de données supplémentaires sur les ressources Shopify","Personnalisation de champs pour les produits, les commandes et les clients","Types de données variés tels que texte, nombre et JSON","Attribution de propriétaires aux données stockées","Organisation des Metafields dans des espaces de noms"],"de":["Speicherung von zusätzlichen Daten in Shopify-Ressourcen","Anpassung von Feldern für Produkte, Bestellungen und Kunden","Verschiedene Datentypen wie Text, Zahl und JSON","Zuweisung von Besitzern zu den gespeicherten Daten","Organisation von Metafields in Namensräumen"],"pt":["Armazenamento de dados adicionais","Personalização de recursos","Integração com aplicativos","Suporte a vários tipos de dados","Controle de acesso"],"ru":["Хранение дополнительных данных","Настройка ресурсов","Интеграция с приложениями","Поддержка нескольких типов данных","Контроль доступа"],"ar":["تخزين بيانات إضافية","تخصيص الموارد","التكامل مع التطبيقات","دعم أنواع متعددة من البيانات","سیطرة الوصول"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Shopify Metafields","Shopify","Metafields","Namespace","Key","Type","Owner"],"ja":["Shopify Metafields","Shopify","Metafields","Namespace","Key","Type","Owner"],"ko":["Shopify Metafields","Shopify","Metafields","Namespace","Key","Type","Owner"],"es":["Metafields Shopify","campos personalizados","almacenamiento de datos","recursos de Shopify","productos","pedidos","clientes","espacio de nombres"],"fr":["Metafields Shopify","champs personnalisés","stockage de données","ressources Shopify","produits","commandes","clients","espace de noms"],"de":["Shopify Metafields","benutzerdefinierte Felder","Daten-speicherung","Shopify-Ressourcen","Produkte","Bestellungen","Kunden","Namensraum"],"pt":["campos meta shopify","armazenamento de dados","personalização de recursos","integração com aplicativos","desenvolvimento de aplicativos shopify","api shopify"],"ru":["мета-поля shopify","хранение данных","настройка ресурсов","интеграция с приложениями","разработка приложений shopify","api shopify"],"ar":["حقول ميتا شوبيفاي","تخزين البيانات","تخصيص الموارد","التكامل مع التطبيقات","تطوير تطبيقات شوبيفاي","api شوبيفاي"]}},"owner":"toilahuongg","repo":"submission-design","repoPath":"toilahuongg/submission-design","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.429Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"shopify-metafields","description":"Guide for working with Shopify Metafields. Covers definitions, storing custom data, accessing via Liquid, and GraphQL mutations.","bodyPreview":"# Shopify Metafields\n\nMetafields allow you to store additional data on Shopify resources (Products, Orders, Customers, Shops) that aren''t included in the default schema (e.g., \"washing instructions\" for a product).\n\n## 1. Concepts\n\n-   **Namespace**: Grouping folder (e.g., `my_app`, `global`).\n-   **Key**: Specific field name (e.g., `washing_instructions`).\n-   **Type**: Data type (e.g., `single_line_text_field`, `number_integer`, `json`).\n-   **Owner**: The resource attaching the data (Product","body":"# Shopify Metafields\n\nMetafields allow you to store additional data on Shopify resources (Products, Orders, Customers, Shops) that aren''t included in the default schema (e.g., \"washing instructions\" for a product).\n\n## 1. Concepts\n\n-   **Namespace**: Grouping folder (e.g., `my_app`, `global`).\n-   **Key**: Specific field name (e.g., `washing_instructions`).\n-   **Type**: Data type (e.g., `single_line_text_field`, `number_integer`, `json`).\n-   **Owner**: The resource attaching the data (Product ID, Shop ID).\n\n## 2. Metafield Definitions (Standard)\n\nAlways use **Metafield Definitions** (pinned metafields) when possible. This integrates them into the Admin UI and ensures standard processing.\n\n-   **Create**: Settings > Custom Data > [Resource] > Add definition.\n-   **Access**: `namespace.key`\n\n## 3. Accessing in Liquid\n\nTo display metafield data on the Storefront:\n\n```liquid\n<!-- Accessing a product metafield -->\n<p>Washing: {{ product.metafields.my_app.washing_instructions }}</p>\n\n<!-- Accessing a file/image metafield -->\n{% assign file = product.metafields.my_app.size_chart.value %}\n<img src=\"{{ file | image_url: width: 500 }}\" />\n\n<!-- Checking existence -->\n{% if product.metafields.my_app.instructions != blank %}\n   ...\n{% endif %}\n```\n\n## 4. Reading via API (GraphQL)\n\n```graphql\nquery {\n  product(id: \"gid://shopify/Product/123\") {\n    title\n    metafield(namespace: \"my_app\", key: \"instructions\") {\n      value\n      type\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## 5. Writing via API (GraphQL)\n\nTo create or update a metafield, use `metafieldsSet`.\n\n```graphql\nmutation metafieldsSet($metafields: [MetafieldsSetInput!]!) {\n  metafieldsSet(metafields: $metafields) {\n    metafields {\n      id\n      namespace\n      key\n      value\n    }\n    userErrors {\n      field\n      message\n    }\n  }\n}\n\n/* Variables */\n{\n  \"metafields\": [\n    {\n      \"ownerId\": \"gid://shopify/Product/123\",\n      \"namespace\": \"my_app\",\n      \"key\": \"instructions\",\n      \"type\": \"single_line_text_field\",\n      \"value\": \"Wash cold, tumble dry.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n## 6. Private Metafields\n\nIf you want data to be **hidden from other apps** and the storefront, use Private Metafields. Note: These cannot be accessed via Liquid directly.\n\n-   Use `privateMetafield` queries/mutations.\n-   Requires explicit `read_private_metafields` / `write_private_metafields` scope (rarely used now, `app_data` metafields are preferred for app-specific valid storage).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:04:51.613Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for E-commerce Agents needing customized product information management through Shopify metafields","zh":"非常适合需要通过Shopify元字段自定义产品信息管理的电子商务代理","ja":"Shopifyのメタフィールドを介したカスタマイズされた製品情報管理が必要なECエージェントに最適","ko":"Shopify 메타 필드를 통해 제품 정보를 관리해야 하는 전자상거래 에이전트에게 적합함","es":"Perfecto para agentes de comercio electrónico que necesitan una gestión de información de productos personalizada a través de metafields de Shopify","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de commerce électronique ayant besoin d''une gestion d''informations de produits personnalisée via les metafields de Shopify","de":"Perfekt für E-Commerce-Agents, die eine benutzerdefinierte Produktinformationenverwaltung über Shopify-Metafields benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Comércio Eletrônico que precisam de gerenciamento de informações de produtos personalizadas por meio de metafields do Shopify","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов электронной коммерции, которым требуется настраиваемое управление информацией о продуктах через метаполя Shopify","ar":"مثالي لوسائل تجارة إلكترونية التي تحتاج إلى إدارة معلومات منتجات مخصصة من خلال حقول ميتا في Shopify"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to store and manage additional data on Shopify resources such as products, orders, and customers using namespaces, keys, and specific data types like single_line_text_field and json, enhancing their ability to handle complex product details like washing instructions","zh":"赋予代理商使用命名空间、键和特定数据类型（如单行文本字段和json）在Shopify资源（如产品、订单和客户）上存储和管理额外数据的能力，从而增强他们处理复杂产品细节（如洗涤说明）的能力","ja":"エージェントが名前空間、キー、および単一行テキストフィールドやJSONなどの特定のデータ型を使用して、Shopifyのリソース（製品、注文、顧客など）に追加のデータを保存および管理できるようにし、洗濯方法などの複雑な製品の詳細を扱う能力を高める","ko":"에이전트가 네임스페이스, 키 및 단일行 텍스트 필드 또는 JSON과 같은 특정 데이터 유형을 사용하여 Shopify 리소스(제품, 주문, 고객 등)에 추가 데이터를 저장 및 관리할 수 있도록 하여 세탁 지침과 같은 복잡한 제품 세부 정보를 처리할 수 있는 기능을 강화함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a almacenar y gestionar datos adicionales en recursos de Shopify como productos, pedidos y clientes utilizando namespaces, claves y tipos de datos específicos como single_line_text_field y json, lo que mejora su capacidad para manejar detalles de productos complejos como instrucciones de lavado","fr":"Permet aux agents de stocker et de gérer des données supplémentaires sur les ressources Shopify telles que les produits, les commandes et les clients en utilisant des namespaces, des clés et des types de données spécifiques comme single_line_text_field et json, améliorant ainsi leur capacité à gérer des détails de produits complexes tels que les instructions de lavage","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, zusätzliche Daten in Shopify-Ressourcen wie Produkten, Bestellungen und Kunden zu speichern und zu verwalten, indem sie Namespaces, Schlüssel und bestimmte Datentypen wie single_line_text_field und json verwenden, wodurch ihre Fähigkeit, komplexe Produktdetails wie Waschanweisungen zu handhaben, verbessert wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a armazenar e gerenciar dados adicionais em recursos do Shopify, como produtos, pedidos e clientes, utilizando namespaces, chaves e tipos de dados específicos, como single_line_text_field e json, melhorando sua capacidade de lidar com detalhes de produtos complexos, como instruções de lavagem","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью хранить и управлять дополнительными данными о ресурсах Shopify, таких как продукты, заказы и клиенты, используя пространства имен, ключи и специальные типы данных, такие как single_line_text_field и json, повышая их способность работать с сложными деталями продуктов, такими как инструкции по стирке","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تخزين وإدارة بيانات إضافية لموارد Shopify مثل المنتجات والطلبات والعملاء باستخدام مساحات الأسماء والمفاتيح وأنواع البيانات المحددة مثل single_line_text_field و json، مما يعزز قدرتهم على التعامل مع تفاصيل المنتجات المعقدة مثل تعليمات الغسيل"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating product information updates with metafield data","Generating custom product reports using metafield keys and namespaces","Debugging issues with product variants using metafield type validation"],"zh":["使用元字段数据自动更新产品信息","使用元字段键和命名空间生成自定义产品报告","使用元字段类型验证调试产品变体问题"],"ja":["メタフィールドデータを使用して製品情報を自動更新する","メタフィールドキーと名前空間を使用してカスタム製品レポートを生成する","メタフィールドタイプの検証を使用して製品バリアントの問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["메타 필드 데이터를 사용하여 제품 정보를 자동으로 업데이트함","메타 필드 키 및 네임스페이스를 사용하여 사용자 지정 제품 보고서를 생성함","메타 필드 유형 검증을 사용하여 제품 변형 문제를 디버깅함"],"es":["Automatizar las actualizaciones de información de productos con datos de metafields","Generar informes de productos personalizados utilizando claves y namespaces de metafields","Depurar problemas con variantes de productos utilizando la validación de tipo de metafield"],"fr":["Automatiser les mises à jour d''informations de produits avec des données de metafields","Générer des rapports de produits personnalisés en utilisant des clés et des namespaces de metafields","Déboguer les problèmes avec les variantes de produits en utilisant la validation de type de metafield"],"de":["Automatisieren von Produktinformationen-Aktualisierungen mit Metafield-Daten","Erstellen von benutzerdefinierten Produktberichten unter Verwendung von Metafield-Schlüsseln und -Namespaces","Fehlerbehebung bei Produktvarianten unter Verwendung der Metafield-Typvalidierung"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de informações de produtos com dados de metafield","Gerar relatórios personalizados de produtos usando chaves e namespaces de metafield","Depurar problemas com variantes de produtos usando validação de tipo de metafield"],"ru":["Автоматизация обновлений информации о продуктах с помощью данных метаполей","Генерация пользовательских отчетов о продуктах с помощью ключей и пространств имен метаполей","Отладка проблем с вариациями продуктов с помощью валидации типа метаполя"],"ar":["تأتمة تحديثات معلومات المنتجات باستخدام بيانات حقل ميتا","توليد تقارير مخصصة للمنتجات باستخدام مفاتيح وأسماء المجالات لحقول ميتا","تصحيح الأعطال في متغيرات المنتجات باستخدام التحقق من نوع حقل ميتا"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Shopify API access","Limited to Shopify resources such as products, orders, and customers","Dependent on correct namespace and key configuration"],"zh":["需要Shopify API访问","仅限Shopify资源，如产品、订单和客户","依赖于正确的命名空间和键配置"],"ja":["Shopify APIへのアクセスが必要","製品、注文、顧客などのShopifyリソースのみ","正しい名前空間とキーの構成に依存"],"ko":["Shopify API 액세스가 필요함","제품, 주문, 고객 등 Shopify 리소스에만 한정됨","정확한 네임스페이스 및 키 구성에 의존함"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la API de Shopify","Limitado a recursos de Shopify como productos, pedidos y clientes","Dependiente de la configuración correcta de namespace y clave"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''API Shopify","Limité aux ressources Shopify telles que les produits, les commandes et les clients","Dépend de la configuration correcte de namespace et de clé"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Shopify-API","Begrenzt auf Shopify-Ressourcen wie Produkte, Bestellungen und Kunden","Abhängig von der korrekten Konfiguration von Namespace und Schlüssel"],"pt":["Exige acesso à API do Shopify","Limitado a recursos do Shopify, como produtos, pedidos e clientes","Dependente da configuração correta de namespace e chave"],"ru":["Требует доступа к API Shopify","Ограничен ресурсами Shopify, такими как продукты, заказы и клиенты","Зависит от правильной настройки пространства имен и ключа"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Shopify","محدود بموارد Shopify مثل المنتجات والطلبات والعملاء","يعتمد على تكوين مساحة الاسم والمفتاح الصحيح"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('jakubciszak/family-plan/native-data-fetching', 'community', 'jakubciszak', 'family-plan', 'jakubciszak/family-plan', 'native-data-fetching', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.429Z', '2026-02-18T05:05:33.413Z', NULL, '{"id":"jakubciszak/family-plan/native-data-fetching","name":"native-data-fetching","description":{"zh":"原生数据获取是一种用于实现API请求、数据获取、缓存和网络调试的技能","ja":"ネイティブデータフェッチングは、APIリクエスト、データ取得、キャッシュ、ネットワークデバッグを実現するスキルです","ko":"네이티브 데이터 가져오기는 API 요청, 데이터 가져오기, 캐싱 및 네트워크 디버깅을 위한 스킬입니다","es":"La recuperación de datos nativa es una habilidad fundamental para cualquier trabajo de red en Expo, incluyendo solicitudes de API y caché","fr":"La récupération de données native est une compétence essentielle pour tout travail de réseau dans Expo, y compris les requêtes d''API et le cache","de":"Der native Datenabruf ist eine grundlegende Fähigkeit für jede Netzwerk-Arbeit in Expo, einschließlich API-Anfragen und Caching","pt":"A habilidade de busca de dados nativa é essencial para qualquer trabalho de rede, incluindo requisições de API, busca de dados e depuração de falhas de rede.","ru":"Навык нативной загрузки данных необходим для любой сетевой работы, включая запросы API, загрузку данных и отладку сетевых сбоев.","ar":"مهارة التحميل المحلي للبيانات ضرورية لأي عمل شبكي ، بما في ذلك طلبات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات والتحميل والتصحيح الأخطاء الشبكية.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"原生数据获取","ja":"ネイティブデータフェッチング","ko":"네이티브 데이터 가져오기","es":"Recuperación de datos nativa para Expo","fr":"Récupération de données native pour Expo","de":"Native Datenabruf für Expo","pt":"Native Data Fetching: Otimização de Requisições de API","ru":"Нативная Загрузка Данных: Оптимизация Запросов API","ar":"التحميل المحلي للبيانات: تحسين طلبات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","en":"native-data-fetching"},"description":{"zh":"原生数据获取是一种用于实现API请求、数据获取、缓存和网络调试的技能","ja":"ネイティブデータフェッチングは、APIリクエスト、データ取得、キャッシュ、ネットワークデバッグを実現するスキルです","ko":"네이티브 데이터 가져오기는 API 요청, 데이터 가져오기, 캐싱 및 네트워크 디버깅을 위한 스킬입니다","es":"La recuperación de datos nativa es una habilidad fundamental para cualquier trabajo de red en Expo, incluyendo solicitudes de API y caché","fr":"La récupération de données native est une compétence essentielle pour tout travail de réseau dans Expo, y compris les requêtes d''API et le cache","de":"Der native Datenabruf ist eine grundlegende Fähigkeit für jede Netzwerk-Arbeit in Expo, einschließlich API-Anfragen und Caching","pt":"A habilidade de busca de dados nativa é essencial para qualquer trabalho de rede, incluindo requisições de API, busca de dados e depuração de falhas de rede.","ru":"Навык нативной загрузки данных необходим для любой сетевой работы, включая запросы API, загрузку данных и отладку сетевых сбоев.","ar":"مهارة التحميل المحلي للبيانات ضرورية لأي عمل شبكي ، بما في ذلك طلبات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات والتحميل والتصحيح الأخطاء الشبكية.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["实现API请求","设置数据获取","调试网络故障","实现缓存策略","处理离线场景"],"ja":["APIリクエストの実現","データ取得の設定","ネットワーク障害のデバッグ","キャッシュ戦略の実現","オフラインシナリオの処理"],"ko":["API 요청 구현","데이터 가져오기 설정","네트워크 오류 디버깅","캐싱 전략 구현","오프라인 시나리오 처리"],"es":["Implementación de solicitudes de API","Configuración de caché y estrategias de caché","Depuración de fallos de red","Implementación de autenticación y gestión de tokens","Configuración de URL de API y variables de entorno","Soporte para escenarios de desconexión"],"fr":["Implémentation de requêtes d''API","Configuration du cache et des stratégies de cache","Débogage des échecs de réseau","Implémentation de l''authentification et de la gestion des jetons","Configuration des URL d''API et des variables d''environnement","Prise en charge des scénarios de déconnexion"],"de":["Implementierung von API-Anfragen","Konfiguration von Caching und Caching-Strategien","Fehlerbehebung bei Netzwerkfehlern","Implementierung von Authentifizierung und Token-Verwaltung","Konfiguration von API-URLs und Umgebungsvariablen","Unterstützung für Offline-Szenarien"],"pt":["Implementação de requisições de API","Configuração de busca de dados com React Query e SWR","Depuração de falhas de rede","Implementação de estratégias de cache","Gerenciamento de autenticação e token"],"ru":["Реализация запросов API","Настройка загрузки данных с React Query и SWR","Отладка сетевых сбоев","Реализация стратегий кэширования","Управление аутентификацией и токеном"],"ar":["تنفيذ طلبات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","تكوين تحميل البيانات مع React Query و SWR","تصحيح الأخطاء الشبكية","تنفيذ استراتيجيات التخزين المؤقت","إدارة مصادقة وتوكن"]},"keywords":{"zh":["原生数据获取","API请求","数据获取","缓存","网络调试","离线场景"],"ja":["ネイティブデータフェッチング","APIリクエスト","データ取得","キャッシュ","ネットワークデバッグ","オフラインシナリオ"],"ko":["네이티브 데이터 가져오기","API 요청","데이터 가져오기","캐싱","네트워크 디버깅","오프라인 시나리오"],"es":["recuperación de datos nativa","Expo","solicitudes de API","caché","depuración de red","autenticación","gestión de tokens","variables de entorno"],"fr":["récupération de données native","Expo","requêtes d''API","cache","débogage de réseau","authentification","gestion des jetons","variables d''environnement"],"de":["nativer Datenabruf","Expo","API-Anfragen","Caching","Netzwerk-Debugging","Authentifizierung","Token-Verwaltung","Umgebungsvariablen"],"pt":["busca de dados nativa","requisições de API","busca de dados","depuração de falhas de rede","estratégias de cache","autenticação e token","React Query","SWR","Expo Networking"],"ru":["нативная загрузка данных","запросы API","загрузка данных","отладка сетевых сбоев","стратегии кэширования","аутентификация и токен","React Query","SWR","Expo Networking"],"ar":["التحميل المحلي للبيانات","طلبات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","تحميل البيانات","تصحيح الأخطاء الشبكية","استراتيجيات التخزين المؤقت","مصادقة وتوكن","React Query","SWR","Expo Networking"]}},"owner":"jakubciszak","repo":"family-plan","repoPath":"jakubciszak/family-plan","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.429Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"native-data-fetching","description":"Use when implementing or debugging ANY network request, API call, or data fetching. Covers fetch API, axios, React Query, SWR, error handling, caching strategies, offline support.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Expo Networking\n\n**You MUST use this skill for ANY networking work including API requests, data fetching, caching, or network debugging.**\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this router when:\n\n- Implementing API requests\n- Setting up data fetching (React Query, SWR)\n- Debugging network failures\n- Implementing caching strategies\n- Handling offline scenarios\n- Authentication/token management\n- Configuring API URLs and environment variables\n\n## Preferences\n\n- Avoid axios, prefer expo/fetch\n\n## Common Issues &","body":"# Expo Networking\n\n**You MUST use this skill for ANY networking work including API requests, data fetching, caching, or network debugging.**\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this router when:\n\n- Implementing API requests\n- Setting up data fetching (React Query, SWR)\n- Debugging network failures\n- Implementing caching strategies\n- Handling offline scenarios\n- Authentication/token management\n- Configuring API URLs and environment variables\n\n## Preferences\n\n- Avoid axios, prefer expo/fetch\n\n## Common Issues & Solutions\n\n### 1. Basic Fetch Usage\n\n**Simple GET request**:\n\n```tsx\nconst fetchUser = async (userId: string) => {\n  const response = await fetch(`https://api.example.com/users/${userId}`);\n\n  if (!response.ok) {\n    throw new Error(`HTTP error! status: ${response.status}`);\n  }\n\n  return response.json();\n};\n```\n\n**POST request with body**:\n\n```tsx\nconst createUser = async (userData: UserData) => {\n  const response = await fetch(\"https://api.example.com/users\", {\n    method: \"POST\",\n    headers: {\n      \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n      Authorization: `Bearer ${token}`,\n    },\n    body: JSON.stringify(userData),\n  });\n\n  if (!response.ok) {\n    const error = await response.json();\n    throw new Error(error.message);\n  }\n\n  return response.json();\n};\n```\n\n---\n\n### 2. React Query (TanStack Query)\n\n**Setup**:\n\n```tsx\n// app/_layout.tsx\nimport { QueryClient, QueryClientProvider } from \"@tanstack/react-query\";\n\nconst queryClient = new QueryClient({\n  defaultOptions: {\n    queries: {\n      staleTime: 1000 * 60 * 5, // 5 minutes\n      retry: 2,\n    },\n  },\n});\n\nexport default function RootLayout() {\n  return (\n    <QueryClientProvider client={queryClient}>\n      <Stack />\n    </QueryClientProvider>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n**Fetching data**:\n\n```tsx\nimport { useQuery } from \"@tanstack/react-query\";\n\nfunction UserProfile({ userId }: { userId: string }) {\n  const { data, isLoading, error, refetch } = useQuery({\n    queryKey: [\"user\", userId],\n    queryFn: () => fetchUser(userId),\n  });\n\n  if (isLoading) return <Loading />;\n  if (error) return <Error message={error.message} />;\n\n  return <Profile user={data} />;\n}\n```\n\n**Mutations**:\n\n```tsx\nimport { useMutation, useQueryClient } from \"@tanstack/react-query\";\n\nfunction CreateUserForm() {\n  const queryClient = useQueryClient();\n\n  const mutation = useMutation({\n    mutationFn: createUser,\n    onSuccess: () => {\n      // Invalidate and refetch\n      queryClient.invalidateQueries({ queryKey: [\"users\"] });\n    },\n  });\n\n  const handleSubmit = (data: UserData) => {\n    mutation.mutate(data);\n  };\n\n  return <Form onSubmit={handleSubmit} isLoading={mutation.isPending} />;\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### 3. Error Handling\n\n**Comprehensive error handling**:\n\n```tsx\nclass ApiError extends Error {\n  constructor(message: string, public status: number, public code?: string) {\n    super(message);\n    this.name = \"ApiError\";\n  }\n}\n\nconst fetchWithErrorHandling = async (url: string, options?: RequestInit) => {\n  try {\n    const response = await fetch(url, options);\n\n    if (!response.ok) {\n      const error = await response.json().catch(() => ({}));\n      throw new ApiError(\n        error.message || \"Request failed\",\n        response.status,\n        error.code\n      );\n    }\n\n    return response.json();\n  } catch (error) {\n    if (error instanceof ApiError) {\n      throw error;\n    }\n    // Network error (no internet, timeout, etc.)\n    throw new ApiError(\"Network error\", 0, \"NETWORK_ERROR\");\n  }\n};\n```\n\n**Retry logic**:\n\n```tsx\nconst fetchWithRetry = async (\n  url: string,\n  options?: RequestInit,\n  retries = 3\n) => {\n  for (let i = 0; i < retries; i++) {\n    try {\n      return await fetchWithErrorHandling(url, options);\n    } catch (error) {\n      if (i === retries - 1) throw error;\n      // Exponential backoff\n      await new Promise((r) => setTimeout(r, Math.pow(2, i) * 1000));\n    }\n  }\n};\n```\n\n---\n\n### 4. Authentication\n\n**Token management**:\n\n```tsx\nimport * as SecureStore from \"expo-secure-store\";\n\nconst TOKEN_KEY = \"auth_token\";\n\nexport const auth = {\n  getToken: () => SecureStore.getItemAsync(TOKEN_KEY),\n  setToken: (token: string) => SecureStore.setItemAsync(TOKEN_KEY, token),\n  removeToken: () => SecureStore.deleteItemAsync(TOKEN_KEY),\n};\n\n// Authenticated fetch wrapper\nconst authFetch = async (url: string, options: RequestInit = {}) => {\n  const token = await auth.getToken();\n\n  return fetch(url, {\n    ...options,\n    headers: {\n      ...options.headers,\n      Authorization: token ? `Bearer ${token}` : \"\",\n    },\n  });\n};\n```\n\n**Token refresh**:\n\n```tsx\nlet isRefreshing = false;\nlet refreshPromise: Promise<string> | null = null;\n\nconst getValidToken = async (): Promise<string> => {\n  const token = await auth.getToken();\n\n  if (!token || isTokenExpired(token)) {\n    if (!isRefreshing) {\n      isRefreshing = true;\n      refreshPromise = refreshToken().finally(() => {\n        isRefreshing = false;\n        refreshPromise = null;\n      });\n    }\n    return refreshPromise!;\n  }\n\n  return token;\n};\n```\n\n---\n\n### 5. Offline Support\n\n**Check network status**:\n\n```tsx\nimport NetInfo from \"@react-native-community/netinfo\";\n\n// Hook for network status\nfunction useNetworkStatus() {\n  const [isOnline, setIsOnline] = useState(true);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    return NetInfo.addEventListener((state) => {\n      setIsOnline(state.isConnected ?? true);\n    });\n  }, []);\n\n  return isOnline;\n}\n```\n\n**Offline-first with React Query**:\n\n```tsx\nimport { onlineManager } from \"@tanstack/react-query\";\nimport NetInfo from \"@react-native-community/netinfo\";\n\n// Sync React Query with network status\nonlineManager.setEventListener((setOnline) => {\n  return NetInfo.addEventListener((state) => {\n    setOnline(state.isConnected ?? true);\n  });\n});\n\n// Queries will pause when offline and resume when online\n```\n\n---\n\n### 6. Environment Variables\n\n**Using environment variables for API configuration**:\n\nExpo supports environment variables with the `EXPO_PUBLIC_` prefix. These are inlined at build time and available in your JavaScript code.\n\n```tsx\n// .env\nEXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.example.com\nEXPO_PUBLIC_API_VERSION=v1\n\n// Usage in code\nconst API_URL = process.env.EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL;\n\nconst fetchUsers = async () => {\n  const response = await fetch(`${API_URL}/users`);\n  return response.json();\n};\n```\n\n**Environment-specific configuration**:\n\n```tsx\n// .env.development\nEXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:3000\n\n// .env.production\nEXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.production.com\n```\n\n**Creating an API client with environment config**:\n\n```tsx\n// api/client.ts\nconst BASE_URL = process.env.EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL;\n\nif (!BASE_URL) {\n  throw new Error(\"EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL is not defined\");\n}\n\nexport const apiClient = {\n  get: async <T,>(path: string): Promise<T> => {\n    const response = await fetch(`${BASE_URL}${path}`);\n    if (!response.ok) throw new Error(`HTTP ${response.status}`);\n    return response.json();\n  },\n\n  post: async <T,>(path: string, body: unknown): Promise<T> => {\n    const response = await fetch(`${BASE_URL}${path}`, {\n      method: \"POST\",\n      headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n      body: JSON.stringify(body),\n    });\n    if (!response.ok) throw new Error(`HTTP ${response.status}`);\n    return response.json();\n  },\n};\n```\n\n**Important notes**:\n\n- Only variables prefixed with `EXPO_PUBLIC_` are exposed to the client bundle\n- Never put secrets (API keys with write access, database passwords) in `EXPO_PUBLIC_` variables—they''re visible in the built app\n- Environment variables are inlined at **build time**, not runtime\n- Restart the dev server after changing `.env` files\n- For server-side secrets in API routes, use variables without the `EXPO_PUBLIC_` prefix\n\n**TypeScript support**:\n\n```tsx\n// types/env.d.ts\ndeclare global {\n  namespace NodeJS {\n    interface ProcessEnv {\n      EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL: string;\n      EXPO_PUBLIC_API_VERSION?: string;\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nexport {};\n```\n\n---\n\n### 7. Request Cancellation\n\n**Cancel on unmount**:\n\n```tsx\nuseEffect(() => {\n  const controller = new AbortController();\n\n  fetch(url, { signal: controller.signal })\n    .then((response) => response.json())\n    .then(setData)\n    .catch((error) => {\n      if (error.name !== \"AbortError\") {\n        setError(error);\n      }\n    });\n\n  return () => controller.abort();\n}, [url]);\n```\n\n**With React Query** (automatic):\n\n```tsx\n// React Query automatically cancels requests when queries are invalidated\n// or components unmount\n```\n\n---\n\n## Decision Tree\n\n```\nUser asks about networking\n  |-- Basic fetch?\n  |   \\-- Use fetch API with error handling\n  |\n  |-- Need caching/state management?\n  |   |-- Complex app -> React Query (TanStack Query)\n  |   \\-- Simpler needs -> SWR or custom hooks\n  |\n  |-- Authentication?\n  |   |-- Token storage -> expo-secure-store\n  |   \\-- Token refresh -> Implement refresh flow\n  |\n  |-- Error handling?\n  |   |-- Network errors -> Check connectivity first\n  |   |-- HTTP errors -> Parse response, throw typed errors\n  |   \\-- Retries -> Exponential backoff\n  |\n  |-- Offline support?\n  |   |-- Check status -> NetInfo\n  |   \\-- Queue requests -> React Query persistence\n  |\n  |-- Environment/API config?\n  |   |-- Client-side URLs -> EXPO_PUBLIC_ prefix in .env\n  |   |-- Server secrets -> Non-prefixed env vars (API routes only)\n  |   \\-- Multiple environments -> .env.development, .env.production\n  |\n  \\-- Performance?\n      |-- Caching -> React Query with staleTime\n      |-- Deduplication -> React Query handles this\n      \\-- Cancellation -> AbortController or React Query\n```\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n**Wrong: No error handling**\n\n```tsx\nconst data = await fetch(url).then((r) => r.json());\n```\n\n**Right: Check response status**\n\n```tsx\nconst response = await fetch(url);\nif (!response.ok) throw new Error(`HTTP ${response.status}`);\nconst data = await response.json();\n```\n\n**Wrong: Storing tokens in AsyncStorage**\n\n```tsx\nawait AsyncStorage.setItem(\"token\", token); // Not secure!\n```\n\n**Right: Use SecureStore for sensitive data**\n\n```tsx\nawait SecureStore.setItemAsync(\"token\", token);\n```\n\n## Example Invocations\n\nUser: \"How do I make API calls in React Native?\"\n-> Use fetch, wrap with error handling\n\nUser: \"Should I use React Query or SWR?\"\n-> React Query for complex apps, SWR for simpler needs\n\nUser: \"My app needs to work offline\"\n-> Use NetInfo for status, React Query persistence for caching\n\nUser: \"How do I handle authentication tokens?\"\n-> Store in expo-secure-store, implement refresh flow\n\nUser: \"API calls are slow\"\n-> Check caching strategy, use React Query staleTime\n\nUser: \"How do I configure different API URLs for dev and prod?\"\n-> Use EXPO*PUBLIC* env vars with .env.development and .env.production files\n\nUser: \"Where should I put my API key?\"\n-> Client-safe keys: EXPO*PUBLIC* in .env. Secret keys: non-prefixed env vars in API routes only\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:05:33.413Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Fullstack Agents requiring seamless native data fetching and caching capabilities","zh":"适合于需要无缝原生数据获取和缓存能力的全栈代理","ja":"シームレスなネイティブデータフェッチとキャッシング機能を必要とするフルスタックエージェントに最適","ko":"무결점의 네이티브 데이터 가져오기 및 캐싱 기능을 필요로 하는 풀스택 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes Fullstack que requieren una recuperación y almacenamiento en caché de datos nativos sin problemas","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Fullstack qui nécessitent une récupération et un stockage en cache de données natifs sans interruption","de":"Ideal für Fullstack-Agents, die eine nahtlose native Datenabfrage und Caching-Funktionen benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Fullstack que exigem busca e cache de dados nativos sem interrupções","ru":"Идеально для агентов Fullstack, требующих бесшовного родного извлечения и кэширования данных","ar":"مثالية لأعضاء الوكالة الكاملة الذين يحتاجون إلى استرجاع بيانات أصلي متوافق وقدرات تخزين مؤقت"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to handle API requests, implement data fetching with React Query or SWR, and manage caching strategies, all while preferring expo/fetch over axios for optimized network interactions","zh":"赋予代理处理API请求、使用React Query或SWR实现数据获取以及管理缓存策略的能力，同时优先使用expo/fetch而不是axios以优化网络交互","ja":"エージェントがAPIリクエストを処理し、React QueryまたはSWRを使用してデータフェッチを実装し、キャッシング戦略を管理することを可能にし、ネットワークの相互作用を最適化するためにaxiosよりもexpo/fetchを優先する","ko":"에이전트가 API 요청을 처리하고 React Query 또는 SWR을 사용하여 데이터 가져오기를 구현하며 캐싱 전략을 관리할 수 있도록 하며 네트워크 상호 작용을 최적화하기 위해 axios보다 expo/fetch를 선호","es":"Permite a los agentes manejar solicitudes de API, implementar la recuperación de datos con React Query o SWR y gestionar estrategias de caché, todo mientras prefiere expo/fetch sobre axios para interacciones de red optimizadas","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les requêtes API, de mettre en œuvre la récupération de données avec React Query ou SWR et de gérer les stratégies de mise en cache, le tout en préférant expo/fetch à axios pour des interactions réseau optimisées","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, API-Anfragen zu bearbeiten, Datenabfragen mit React Query oder SWR zu implementieren und Caching-Strategien zu verwalten, alles bei der bevorzugten Verwendung von expo/fetch anstelle von axios für optimierte Netzwerkinteraktionen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a lidar com solicitações de API, implementar busca de dados com React Query ou SWR e gerenciar estratégias de cache, tudo isso preferindo expo/fetch em vez de axios para interações de rede otimizadas","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обрабатывать запросы API, реализовывать извлечение данных с помощью React Query или SWR и управлять стратегиями кэширования, все это при предпочтении expo/fetch вместо axios для оптимизированных сетевых взаимодействий","ar":"تمكّن الوكالات من التعامل مع طلبات API وتنفيذ استرجاع البيانات باستخدام React Query أو SWR وإدارة استراتيجيات التخزين المؤقت، وكل ذلك مع التفضيل لاستخدام expo/fetch بدلاً من axios من أجل التفاعلات الشبكية المتوفرة"},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing secure API requests with authentication and token management","Debugging network failures and handling offline scenarios","Configuring API URLs and environment variables for dynamic data fetching"],"zh":["实现安全的API请求和身份验证及令牌管理","调试网络故障和处理离线场景","配置API URL和环境变量以实现动态数据获取"],"ja":["認証とトークン管理を伴う安全なAPIリクエストの実装","ネットワーク障害のデバッグとオフラインシナリオの処理","API URLと環境変数の構成による動的なデータフェッチ"],"ko":["인증 및 토큰 관리를 포함한 보안 API 요청 구현","네트워크 실패의 디버깅 및 오프라인 시나리오 처리","API URL 및 환경 변수 구성에 의한 동적 데이터 가져오기"],"es":["Implementar solicitudes de API seguras con autenticación y gestión de tokens","Depurar fallos de red y manejar escenarios sin conexión","Configurar URLs de API y variables de entorno para la recuperación dinámica de datos"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des requêtes API sécurisées av