tions and code examples:\n\n- [rules/3d.md](rules/3d.md) - 3D content in Remotion using Three.js and React Three Fiber\n- [rules/animations.md](rules/animations.md) - Fundamental animation skills for Remotion\n- [rules/assets.md](rules/assets.md) - Importing images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion\n- [rules/audio.md](rules/audio.md) - Using audio and sound in Remotion - importing, trimming, volume, speed, pitch\n- [rules/calculate-metadata.md](rules/calculate-metadata.md) - Dynamically set composition duration, dimensions, and props\n- [rules/can-decode.md](rules/can-decode.md) - Check if a video can be decoded by the browser using Mediabunny\n- [rules/charts.md](rules/charts.md) - Chart and data visualization patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/compositions.md](rules/compositions.md) - Defining compositions, stills, folders, default props and dynamic metadata\n- [rules/display-captions.md](rules/display-captions.md) - Displaying captions in Remotion with TikTok-style pages and word highlighting\n- [rules/extract-frames.md](rules/extract-frames.md) - Extract frames from videos at specific timestamps using Mediabunny\n- [rules/fonts.md](rules/fonts.md) - Loading Google Fonts and local fonts in Remotion\n- [rules/get-audio-duration.md](rules/get-audio-duration.md) - Getting the duration of an audio file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-dimensions.md](rules/get-video-dimensions.md) - Getting the width and height of a video file with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-duration.md](rules/get-video-duration.md) - Getting the duration of a video file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/gifs.md](rules/gifs.md) - Displaying GIFs synchronized with Remotion''s timeline\n- [rules/images.md](rules/images.md) - Embedding images in Remotion using the Img component\n- [rules/import-srt-captions.md](rules/import-srt-captions.md) - Importing .srt subtitle files into Remotion using @remotion/captions\n- [rules/lottie.md](rules/lottie.md) - Embedding Lottie animations in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md](rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md) - Measuring DOM element dimensions in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-text.md](rules/measuring-text.md) - Measuring text dimensions, fitting text to containers, and checking overflow\n- [rules/sequencing.md](rules/sequencing.md) - Sequencing patterns for Remotion - delay, trim, limit duration of items\n- [rules/tailwind.md](rules/tailwind.md) - Using TailwindCSS in Remotion\n- [rules/text-animations.md](rules/text-animations.md) - Typography and text animation patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/timing.md](rules/timing.md) - Interpolation curves in Remotion - linear, easing, spring animations\n- [rules/transcribe-captions.md](rules/transcribe-captions.md) - Transcribing audio to generate captions in Remotion\n- [rules/transitions.md](rules/transitions.md) - Scene transition patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/trimming.md](rules/trimming.md) - Trimming patterns for Remotion - cut the beginning or end of animations\n- [rules/videos.md](rules/videos.md) - Embedding videos in Remotion - trimming, volume, speed, looping, pitch\n- [rules/parameters.md](rules/parameters.md) - Make a video parametrizable by adding a Zod schema\n- [rules/maps.md](rules/maps.md) - Add a map using Mapbox and animate it\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:05:18.931Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Video Generation Agents requiring expertise in Remotion and React Three Fiber for 3D content creation.","zh":"适用于需要在Remotion和React Three Fiber中具有3D内容创建专业知识的视频生成代理。","ja":"RemotionとReact Three Fiberでの3Dコンテンツ作成に専門知識を必要とするビデオ生成エージェントに適しています。","ko":"Remotion과 React Three Fiber에서 3D 콘텐츠 생성에 전문 지식을 필요로 하는 비디오 생성 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de generación de video que requieren experiencia en Remotion y React Three Fiber para la creación de contenido 3D.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de génération de vidéos nécessitant une expertise en Remotion et React Three Fiber pour la création de contenu 3D.","de":"Ideal für Video-Generierungs-Agents, die Expertenwissen in Remotion und React Three Fiber für die Erstellung von 3D-Inhalten benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Geração de Vídeo que exigem especialização em Remotion e React Three Fiber para criação de conteúdo 3D.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов генерации видео, требующих экспертизы в Remotion и React Three Fiber для создания 3D-контента.","ar":"مثالية لعميل توليد الفيديو الذين يتطلبون الخبرة في Remotion و React Three Fiber لإنشاء محتوى 3D."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to master Remotion best practices, leveraging Three.js and React Three Fiber for 3D animations, and efficiently importing various media assets such as images, videos, audio, and fonts. This enables the generation of high-quality, engaging video content with precise control over animations and asset management.","zh":"赋予代理掌握Remotion最佳实践的能力，利用Three.js和React Three Fiber进行3D动画，并高效导入各种媒体资产，例如图像、视频、音频和字体。这使得代理能够生成高质量、吸引人的视频内容，并对动画和资产管理具有精确的控制。","ja":"エージェントがRemotionのベストプラクティスをマスターできるようにし、Three.jsとReact Three Fiberを使用して3Dアニメーションを作成し、画像、ビデオ、オーディオ、フォントなどの様々なメディアアセットを効率的にインポートできるようにします。これにより、エージェントはアニメーションとアセット管理に対する精密な制御を持ち、高品質で魅力的なビデオコンテンツを生成できます。","ko":"에이전트가 Remotion의 최적화된 방법을 습득할 수 있도록 하며, Three.js와 React Three Fiber를 사용하여 3D 애니메이션을 생성하고, 이미지, 비디오, 오디오, 글꼴 등의 다양한 미디어 자산을 효율적으로 가져올 수 있도록 합니다. 이를 통해 에이전트는 애니메이션과 자산 관리에 대한 정밀한 제어를 가지며, 고품질의 매력적인 비디오 콘텐츠를 생성할 수 있습니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes dominar las mejores prácticas de Remotion, aprovechando Three.js y React Three Fiber para animaciones 3D, y importar de manera eficiente varios activos multimedia como imágenes, videos, audio y fuentes. Esto permite la generación de contenido de video de alta calidad y atractivo, con un control preciso sobre las animaciones y la gestión de activos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de maîtriser les meilleures pratiques de Remotion, en exploitant Three.js et React Three Fiber pour les animations 3D, et en important de manière efficace divers actifs multimédias tels que des images, des vidéos, de l''audio et des polices. Cela permet la génération de contenu vidéo de haute qualité et engageant, avec un contrôle précis sur les animations et la gestion des actifs.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Remotion-Best-Practices zu meistern, indem es Three.js und React Three Fiber für 3D-Animationen nutzt und verschiedene Multimedia-Assets wie Bilder, Videos, Audio und Schriften effizient importiert. Dies ermöglicht die Generierung von hochwertigem, ansprechendem Video-Inhalt mit präziser Kontrolle über Animationen und Asset-Management.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a dominar as melhores práticas de Remotion, aproveitando o Three.js e o React Three Fiber para animações 3D, e importando eficientemente vários ativos de mídia, como imagens, vídeos, áudio e fontes. Isso permite a geração de conteúdo de vídeo de alta qualidade, envolvente, com controle preciso sobre as animações e o gerenciamento de ativos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью освоить лучшие практики Remotion, используя Three.js и React Three Fiber для 3D-анимаций, и эффективно импортировать различные медиаактивы, такие как изображения, видео, аудио и шрифты. Это позволяет генерировать высококачественный, увлекательный видеоконтент с точным контролем над анимациями и управлением активами.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من إتقان أفضل الممارسات في Remotion، مستفيداً من Three.js و React Three Fiber لإنشاء animations 3D، وإضافة مختلف وسائل الإعلام مثل الصور والفيديو والصوت والخطوط بطريقة فعالة. هذا يتيح إنتاج محتوى فيديو عالي الجودة وممتع، مع التحكم الدقيق في Animations وإدارة الوسائط."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating complex 3D animations in Remotion using Three.js","Optimizing video asset imports for faster rendering","Debugging animation issues with fundamental animation skills"],"zh":["使用Remotion和Three.js创建复杂的3D动画","优化视频资产导入以实现更快的渲染","使用基本动画技能调试动画问题"],"ja":["RemotionとThree.jsを使用して複雑な3Dアニメーションを作成する","ビデオアセットのインポートを最適化してレンダリングを高速化する","基本的なアニメーションスキルを使用してアニメーションの問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["Remotion과 Three.js를 사용하여 복잡한 3D 애니메이션을 생성하는 것","비디오 자산의 가져오기를 최적화하여 렌더링을 가속화하는 것","기본적인 애니메이션 스킬을 사용하여 애니메이션 문제를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Creación de animaciones 3D complejas en Remotion utilizando Three.js","Optimización de la importación de activos de video para un renderizado más rápido","Depuración de problemas de animación con habilidades de animación fundamentales"],"fr":["Création d''animations 3D complexes dans Remotion en utilisant Three.js","Optimisation de l''importation d''actifs vidéo pour un rendu plus rapide","Débogage de problèmes d''animation avec des compétences en animation fondamentales"],"de":["Erstellung komplexer 3D-Animationen in Remotion mit Three.js","Optimierung des Video-Asset-Imports für eine schnellere Renderung","Fehlerbehebung bei Animationsproblemen mit grundlegenden Animationsfähigkeiten"],"pt":["Criar animações 3D complexas no Remotion usando o Three.js","Otimizar a importação de ativos de vídeo para renderização mais rápida","Depurar problemas de animação com habilidades de animação fundamentais"],"ru":["Создание сложных 3D-анимаций в Remotion с помощью Three.js","Оптимизация импорта видеоактивов для более быстрого рендеринга","Отладка проблем с анимацией с помощью базовых навыков анимации"],"ar":["إنشاء animations 3D معقدة في Remotion باستخدام Three.js","تحسين استيراد أصول الفيديو من أجل تقديم أسرع","تصحيح الأخطاء في animations باستخدام المهارات الأساسية لanimations"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Remotion codebase access","Familiarity with React Three Fiber and Three.js necessary"],"zh":["需要Remotion代码库的访问权限","需要熟悉React Three Fiber和Three.js"],"ja":["Remotionコードベースへのアクセスが必要","React Three FiberとThree.jsの知識が必要"],"ko":["Remotion 코드베이스에 대한 액세스가 필요함","React Three Fiber와 Three.js에 대한 지식이 필요함"],"es":["Requiere acceso al código base de Remotion","Familiaridad con React Three Fiber y Three.js necesaria"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au code base de Remotion","Familiarité avec React Three Fiber et Three.js nécessaire"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf den Remotion-Codebase","Vertrautheit mit React Three Fiber und Three.js erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer acesso à base de código do Remotion","Familiaridade com React Three Fiber e Three.js necessária"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к кодовой базе Remotion","Необходимо знание React Three Fiber и Three.js"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى قاعدة الشفرة الخاصة ب Remotion","يلزم الإطلاع على React Three Fiber و Three.js"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
