es/3d.md](rules/3d.md) - 3D content in Remotion using Three.js and React Three Fiber\n- [rules/animations.md](rules/animations.md) - Fundamental animation skills for Remotion\n- [rules/assets.md](rules/assets.md) - Importing images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion\n- [rules/audio.md]","body":"## When to use\n\nUse this skills whenever you are dealing with Remotion code to obtain the domain-specific knowledge.\n\n## How to use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [rules/3d.md](rules/3d.md) - 3D content in Remotion using Three.js and React Three Fiber\n- [rules/animations.md](rules/animations.md) - Fundamental animation skills for Remotion\n- [rules/assets.md](rules/assets.md) - Importing images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion\n- [rules/audio.md](rules/audio.md) - Using audio and sound in Remotion - importing, trimming, volume, speed, pitch\n- [rules/calculate-metadata.md](rules/calculate-metadata.md) - Dynamically set composition duration, dimensions, and props\n- [rules/can-decode.md](rules/can-decode.md) - Check if a video can be decoded by the browser using Mediabunny\n- [rules/charts.md](rules/charts.md) - Chart and data visualization patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/compositions.md](rules/compositions.md) - Defining compositions, stills, folders, default props and dynamic metadata\n- [rules/display-captions.md](rules/display-captions.md) - Displaying captions in Remotion with TikTok-style pages and word highlighting\n- [rules/extract-frames.md](rules/extract-frames.md) - Extract frames from videos at specific timestamps using Mediabunny\n- [rules/fonts.md](rules/fonts.md) - Loading Google Fonts and local fonts in Remotion\n- [rules/get-audio-duration.md](rules/get-audio-duration.md) - Getting the duration of an audio file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-dimensions.md](rules/get-video-dimensions.md) - Getting the width and height of a video file with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-duration.md](rules/get-video-duration.md) - Getting the duration of a video file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/gifs.md](rules/gifs.md) - Displaying GIFs synchronized with Remotion''s timeline\n- [rules/images.md](rules/images.md) - Embedding images in Remotion using the Img component\n- [rules/import-srt-captions.md](rules/import-srt-captions.md) - Importing .srt subtitle files into Remotion using @remotion/captions\n- [rules/lottie.md](rules/lottie.md) - Embedding Lottie animations in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md](rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md) - Measuring DOM element dimensions in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-text.md](rules/measuring-text.md) - Measuring text dimensions, fitting text to containers, and checking overflow\n- [rules/sequencing.md](rules/sequencing.md) - Sequencing patterns for Remotion - delay, trim, limit duration of items\n- [rules/tailwind.md](rules/tailwind.md) - Using TailwindCSS in Remotion\n- [rules/text-animations.md](rules/text-animations.md) - Typography and text animation patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/timing.md](rules/timing.md) - Interpolation curves in Remotion - linear, easing, spring animations\n- [rules/transcribe-captions.md](rules/transcribe-captions.md) - Transcribing audio to generate captions in Remotion\n- [rules/transitions.md](rules/transitions.md) - Scene transition patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/trimming.md](rules/trimming.md) - Trimming patterns for Remotion - cut the beginning or end of animations\n- [rules/videos.md](rules/videos.md) - Embedding videos in Remotion - trimming, volume, speed, looping, pitch\n- [rules/parameters.md](rules/parameters.md) - Make a video parametrizable by adding a Zod schema\n- [rules/maps.md](rules/maps.md) - Add a map using Mapbox and animate it\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:05:24.829Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced video production capabilities with Remotion","zh":"非常适合需要使用Remotion进行高级视频制作的前端代理","ja":"Remotionを使用した高度なビデオ制作機能を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適","ko":"Remotion을 사용한 고급 비디오 제작 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes frontend que necesitan capacidades de producción de video avanzadas con Remotion","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend ayant besoin de capacités de production vidéo avancées avec Remotion","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte Videoproduktionsfähigkeiten mit Remotion benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades de produção de vídeo avançadas com Remotion","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы расширенные возможности видеопроизводства с Remotion","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات إنتاج فيديو متقدمة مع Remotion"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create complex animations using Three.js and React Three Fiber, import various assets such as images, videos, and audio, and optimize 3D content for web deployment, all while following best practices for Remotion development","zh":"赋予代理创建使用Three.js和React Three Fiber的复杂动画的能力，导入各种资产，如图像、视频和音频，并针对Web部署优化3D内容，同时遵循Remotion开发的最佳实践","ja":"Three.jsとReact Three Fiberを使用した複雑なアニメーションの作成、画像、ビデオ、オーディオなどのさまざまなアセットのインポート、Webデプロイ向けの3Dコンテンツの最適化などを可能にし、Remotion開発のベストプラクティスに従う","ko":"Three.js와 React Three Fiber를 사용한 복잡한 애니메이션 생성, 이미지, 비디오, 오디오 등의 다양한 자산을 가져오고, 웹 배포를 위한 3D 콘텐츠 최적화 등을 가능하게 하며, Remotion 개발의 모범 사례를 따름","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear animaciones complejas utilizando Three.js y React Three Fiber, importar varios activos como imágenes, videos y audio, y optimizar contenido 3D para la implementación web, siguiendo siempre las mejores prácticas para el desarrollo de Remotion","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des animations complexes à l''aide de Three.js et React Three Fiber, d''importer divers actifs tels que des images, des vidéos et de l''audio, et d''optimiser le contenu 3D pour le déploiement web, tout en suivant les meilleures pratiques pour le développement de Remotion","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, komplexe Animationen mit Three.js und React Three Fiber zu erstellen, verschiedene Assets wie Bilder, Videos und Audio zu importieren und 3D-Inhalte für die Web-Bereitstellung zu optimieren, dabei immer die besten Praktiken für die Remotion-Entwicklung befolgend","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar animações complexas usando Three.js e React Three Fiber, importar vários ativos, como imagens, vídeos e áudio, e otimizar conteúdo 3D para implantação na web, seguindo as melhores práticas para o desenvolvimento de Remotion","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать сложные анимации, используя Three.js и React Three Fiber, импортировать различные активы, такие как изображения, видео и аудио, и оптимизировать контент 3D для веб-развертывания, следуя лучшим практикам разработки Remotion","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إنشاء رسوم متحركة معقدة باستخدام Three.js و React Three Fiber واستيراد各种 الأصول مثل الصور والفيديو والصوت وتحسين المحتوى ثلاثي الأبعاد للنشر على الويب، مع اتباع أفضل الممارسات لتطوير Remotion"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating 3D animations for explainer videos","Optimizing video assets for web use","Creating interactive audiovisual experiences with Remotion"],"zh":["为解释视频生成3D动画","优化视频资产以用于Web","使用Remotion创建交互式音视频体验"],"ja":["説明動画用の3Dアニメーション生成","Web用のビデオアセットの最適化","Remotionを使用したインタラクティブなオーディオビジュアル体験の作成"],"ko":["설명 비디오를 위한 3D 애니메이션 생성","웹 용 비디오 자산 최적화","Remotion을 사용한 상호 작용형 오디오 비주얼 경험 생성"],"es":["Generar animaciones 3D para videos explicativos","Optimizar activos de video para su uso en la web","Crear experiencias audiovisuales interactivas con Remotion"],"fr":["Générer des animations 3D pour des vidéos explicatives","Optimiser les actifs vidéo pour une utilisation sur le web","Créer des expériences audiovisuelles interactives avec Remotion"],"de":["Erstellen von 3D-Animationen für Erklärvideos","Optimieren von Video-Assets für die Web-Verwendung","Erstellen interaktiver audiovisueller Erfahrungen mit Remotion"],"pt":["Geração de animações 3D para vídeos explicativos","Otimização de ativos de vídeo para uso na