sk 应用的核心原则，确保工作流程的可靠性和效率","ja":"完了前の検証は Threadbilt v0 PierceDesk アプリケーションのコアプリンシプルであり、ワークフローの信頼性と効率を保証する","ko":"완료 전 확인은 Threadbilt v0 PierceDesk 애플리케이션의 핵심 원칙으로 작업 흐름의 신뢰성과 효율성을 보장한다","es":"La verificación antes de completar es un principio fundamental que garantiza la integridad y eficiencia en el desarrollo de software","fr":"La vérification avant achèvement est un principe de base qui garantit l''intégrité et l''efficacité dans le développement de logiciels","de":"Die Verifizierung vor Abschluss ist ein Grundprinzip, das die Integrität und Effizienz in der Softwareentwicklung sicherstellt","pt":"A verificação antes da conclusão é fundamental para garantir a qualidade e a honestidade do trabalho","ru":"Верификация перед завершением имеет важное значение для обеспечения качества и честности работы","ar":"التحقق قبل الاستكمال هو أمر أساسي لضمان جودة العمل وصدقه","en":"Threadbilt v0 - PierceDesk Application"},"definition":{"en":"Threadbilt v0 - PierceDesk Application"},"features":{"zh":["验证前完成的核心原则","提高工作流程的可靠性和效率","确保声明工作完成前的验证","防止不诚实的声明","提高代码质量和稳定性"],"ja":["完了前の検証のコアプリンシプル","ワークフローの信頼性と効率を高める","作業を完了したと主張する前の検証を保証する","不誠実な主張を防ぐ","コードの品質と安定性を高める"],"ko":["완료 전 확인의 핵심 원칙","작업 흐름의 신뢰성과 효율성을 높인다","작업을 완료했다고 주장하기前的 확인을 보장한다","부정직한 주장을 방지한다","코드 품질과 안정성을 높인다"],"es":["Requiere evidencia antes de reclamar la finalización","Garantiza la integridad y eficiencia en el desarrollo","Aplicable en proyectos de desarrollo de software","Fomenta la transparencia y la honestidad","Mejora la calidad del código y la documentación"],"fr":["Exige des preuves avant de réclamer l''achèvement","Garantit l''intégrité et l''efficacité dans le développement","Applicable dans les projets de développement de logiciels","Favorise la transparence et l''honnêteté","Améliore la qualité du code et de la documentation"],"de":["Erfordert Beweise, bevor der Abschluss behauptet wird","Sichert die Integrität und Effizienz in der Entwicklung","Anwendbar in Entwicklungsprojekten für Software","Fördert Transparenz und Ehrlichkeit","Verbessert die Qualität des Codes und der Dokumentation"],"pt":["Verificação de evidências","Garantia de qualidade","Prevenção de erros","Transparência no processo","Cumprimento das regras"],"ru":["Верификация доказательств","Гарантия качества","Предотвращение ошибок","Прозрачность процесса","Соблюдение правил"],"ar":["التحقق من الأدلة","ضمان الجودة","منع الأخطاء","شفافية العملية","الامتثال للقواعد"]},"keywords":{"zh":["验证前完成","Threadbilt v0","PierceDesk 应用","工作流程优化","代码质量","可靠性和效率"],"ja":["完了前の検証","Threadbilt v0","PierceDesk アプリケーション","ワークフロー最適化","コード品質","信頼性と効率"],"ko":["완료 전 확인","Threadbilt v0","PierceDesk 애플리케이션","작업 흐름 최적화","코드 품질","신뢰성과 효율성"],"es":["verificación antes de completar","principio de desarrollo","integridad y eficiencia","desarrollo de software","evidencia y transparencia","calidad del código","documentación técnica"],"fr":["vérification avant achèvement","principe de développement","intégrité et efficacité","développement de logiciels","preuves et transparence","qualité du code","documentation technique"],"de":["Verifizierung vor Abschluss","Entwicklungsprinzip","Integrität und Effizienz","Softwareentwicklung","Beweise und Transparenz","Code-Qualität","technische Dokumentation"],"pt":["verificação antes da conclusão","qualidade do trabalho","honestidade","evidências","transparência","cumprimento das regras"],"ru":["верификация перед завершением","качество работы","честность","доказательства","прозрачность","соблюдение правил"],"ar":["التحقق قبل الاستكمال","جودة العمل","صدق","أدلة","شفافية","الامتثال للقواعد"]}},"owner":"RockwallJMC","repo":"Threadbilt-v0","repoPath":"RockwallJMC/Threadbilt-v0","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.429Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"verification-before-completion","description":"Use when about to claim work is complete, fixed, or passing, before committing changes - requires running verification commands and confirming output before making any success claims; evidence before assertions always","bodyPreview":"# Verification Before Completion\n\n## Overview\n\nClaiming work is complete without verification is dishonesty, not efficiency.\n\n**Core principle:** Evidence before claims, always.\n**DONT run npx playwright in the background, run in terminal for visibility**\n\n**Violating the letter of this rule is violating the spirit of this rule.**\n\n## The Iron Law\n\n```\nNO COMPLETION CLAIMS WITHOUT FRESH VERIFICATION EVIDENCE\n```\n\nIf you haven''t run the verification command in this message, you cannot claim it pa","body":"# Verification Before Completion\n\n## Overview\n\nClaiming work is complete without verification is dishonesty, not efficiency.\n\n**Core principle:** Evidence before claims, always.\n**DONT run npx playwright in the background, run in terminal for visibility**\n\n**Violating the letter of this rule is violating the spirit of this rule.**\n\n## The Iron Law\n\n```\nNO COMPLETION CLAIMS WITHOUT FRESH VERIFICATION EVIDENCE\n```\n\nIf you haven''t run the verification command in this message, you cannot claim it passes.\n\n## The Gate Function\n\n```\nBEFORE claiming any status or expressing satisfaction:\n\n1. IDENTIFY: What command proves this claim?\n2. RUN: Execute the FULL command (fresh, complete)\n3. READ: Full output, check exit code, count failures\n4. VERIFY: Does output confirm the claim?\n   - If NO: State actual status with evidence\n   - If YES: State claim WITH evidence\n5. ONLY THEN: Make the claim\n\nSkip any step = lying, not verifying\n```\n\n## Common Failures\n\n| Claim                 | Requires                        | Not Sufficient                 |\n| --------------------- | ------------------------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| Tests pass            | Test command output: 0 failures | Previous run, \"should pass\"    |\n| Linter clean          | Linter output: 0 errors         | Partial check, extrapolation   |\n| Build succeeds        | Build command: exit 0           | Linter passing, logs look good |\n| Bug fixed             | Test original symptom: passes   | Code changed, assumed fixed    |\n| Regression test works | Red-green cycle verified        | Test passes once               |\n| Agent completed       | VCS diff shows changes          | Agent reports \"success\"        |\n| Requirements met      | Line-by-line checklist          | Tests passing                  |\n\n## Red Flags - STOP\n\n- Using \"should\", \"probably\", \"seems to\"\n- Expressing satisfaction before verification (\"Great!\", \"Perfect!\", \"Done!\", etc.)\n- About to commit/push/PR without verification\n- Trusting agent success reports\n- Relying on partial verification\n- Thinking \"just this once\"\n- Tired and wanting work over\n- **ANY wording implying success without having run verification**\n\n## Rationalization Prevention\n\n| Excuse                                  | Reality                |\n| --------------------------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| \"Should work now\"                       | RUN the verification   |\n| \"I''m confident\"                         | Confidence ≠ evidence  |\n| \"Just this once\"                        | No exceptions          |\n| \"Linter passed\"                         | Linter ≠ compiler      |\n| \"Agent said success\"                    | Verify independently   |\n| \"I''m tired\"                             | Exhaustion ≠ excuse    |\n| \"Partial check is enough\"               | Partial proves nothing |\n| \"Different words so rule doesn''t apply\" | Spirit over letter     |\n\n## Key Patterns\n\n**Tests:**\n\n```\n✅ [Run test command] [See: 34/34 pass] \"All tests pass\"\n❌ \"Should pass now\" / \"Looks correct\"\n```\n\n**Regression tests (TDD Red-Green):**\n\n```\n✅ Write → Run (pass) → Revert fix → Run (MUST FAIL) → Restore → Run (pass)\n❌ \"I''ve written a regression test\" (without red-green verification)\n```\n\n**Build:**\n\n```\n✅ [Run build] [See: exit 0] \"Build passes\"\n❌ \"Linter passed\" (linter doesn''t check compilation)\n```\n\n**Requirements:**\n\n```\n✅ Re-read plan → Create checklist → Verify each → Report gaps or completion\n❌ \"Tests pass, phase complete\"\n```\n\n**Agent delegation:**\n\n```\n✅ Agent reports success → Check VCS diff → Verify changes → Report actual state\n❌ Trust agent report\n```\n\n## Why This Matters\n\nFrom 24 failure memories:\n\n- your human partner said \"I don''t believe you\" - trust broken\n- Undefined functions shipped - would crash\n- Missing requirements shipped - incomplete features\n- Time wasted on false completion → redirect → rework\n- Violates: \"Honesty is a core value. If you lie, you''ll be replaced.\"\n\n## When To Apply\n\n**ALWAYS before:**\n\n- ANY variation of success/completion claims\n- ANY expression of satisfaction\n- ANY positive statement about work state\n- Committing, task completion\n- Moving to next task\n- Delegating to agents\n\n**Rule applies to:**\n\n- Exact phrases\n- Paraphrases and synonyms\n- Implications of success\n- ANY communication suggesting completion/correctness\n\n## The Bottom Line\n\n**No shortcuts for verification.**\n\nRun the command. Read the output. THEN claim the result.\n\nThis is non-negotiable.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:05:43.551Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Quality Assurance Agents needing rigorous verification and testing capabilities with tools like npx playwright.","zh":"非常适合需要严格验证和测试能力的质量保证代理，具有使用npx playwright等工具的功能。","ja":"npx playwrightなどのツールを使用した厳格な検証とテスト機能が必要な品質保証エージェントに最適です。","ko":"npx playwright와 같은 도구를 사용하여 엄격한 검증 및 테스트 기능이 필요한 품질 보증 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de garantía de calidad que necesitan capacidades de verificación y prueba rigurosas con herramientas como npx playwright.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''assurance qualité ayant besoin de capacités de vérification et de test rigoureuses avec des outils comme npx playwright.","de":"Perfekt für Qualitätsprüfungsagenten, die strengen Überprüfungs- und Testfunktionen mit Tools wie npx playwright benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Garantia de Qualidade que necessitam de capacidades de verificação e teste rigorosas com ferramentas como npx playwright.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по обеспечению качества, которым необходимы строгие возможности проверки и тестирования с помощью инструментов типа npx playwright.","ar":"مثالي لعميل ضمان الجودة الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات التحقق والاختبار القاسية مع أدوات مثل npx playwright."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce the core principle of evidence before claims, ensuring honesty and efficiency in completion claims by running verification commands in terminals for visibility, and adhering to protocols like the Iron Law of NO COMPLETION CLAIMS WITHOUT FRESH VERIFICATION EVIDENCE.","zh":"赋予代理人执行以证据为先的核心原则的能力，确保在运行终端的验证命令以实现可见性时，声明的完成具有诚实和效率，并遵守《无新鲜验证证据不提出完成声明》的铁律。","ja":"エージェントが証拠を以て主張するという基本原則を遵守する能力を付与し、端末で実行される検証コマンドの可視性を保ち、効率性と誠実性を保証し、《新規な検証証拠なしに完了請求を行わない》という鉄則に従う。","ko":"에이전트가 증거를 먼저 확인하는 핵심 원칙을 준수할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 Visibility를 위한 터미널에서 검증 명령을 실행했을 때诚实性과 효율성을 보장하고, 《신선한 검증 증거 없이 완료 청구를 하지 않는다》는 철칙을 준수한다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a hacer cumplir el principio fundamental de evidencia antes de las reclamaciones, garantizando la honestidad y la eficiencia en las reclamaciones de finalización al ejecutar comandos de verificación en terminales para visibilidad y ajustarse a protocolos como la Ley de Hierro de NO RECLAMACIONES DE FINALIZACIÓN SIN EVIDENCIA DE VERIFICACIÓN FRESCA.","fr":"Permet aux agents de faire respecter le principe fondamental de preuve avant les réclamations, en garantissant l''honnêteté et l''efficacité dans les réclamations d''achèvement en exécutant des commandes de vérification dans les terminaux pour la visibilité et en se conformant aux protocoles tels que la Loi de Fer de PAS DE RÉCLAMATIONS D''ACHÈVEMENT SANS PREUVES DE VÉRIFICATION FRAÎCHES.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, das Kernprinzip der Beweise vor den Ansprüchen durchzusetzen, die Ehrlichkeit und Effizienz bei der Erledigung von Ansprüchen sicherzustellen, indem sie Überprüfungsbefehle in Terminals für die Sichtbarkeit ausführen und sich an Protokolle wie das Eisernes Gesetz von KEINE ERLEDIGUNGSANSPRÜCHE OHNE FRISCHE ÜBERPRÜFUNGSBEWEISE halten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor o princípio básico de evidências antes de reivindicações, garantindo honestidade e eficiência nas reivindicações de conclusão executando comandos de verificação em terminais para visibilidade e aderindo a protocolos como a Lei de Ferro de NENHUMA REIVINDICAÇÃO DE CONCLUSÃO SEM EVIDÊNCIAS DE VERIFICAÇÃO FRESCA.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечить соблюдение основного принципа – наличие доказательств перед предъявлением претензий, гарантируя честность и эффективность в претензиях на завершение путем выполнения команд проверки в терминалах для обеспечения видимости и соблюдения протоколов, таких как Железный закон НЕТ ПРЕТЕНЗИЙ НА ЗАВЕРШЕНИЕ БЕЗ СВЕЖИХ ДОКАЗАТЕЛЬСТВ ПРОВЕРКИ.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل pouvoir فرض المبدأ الأساسي للأدلة قبل المطالبات، مما يضمن الصدق والكفاءة في المطالبات بإكمال تشغيل أوامر التحقق في الطرفيات من أجل الرؤية والامتثال لبروتوكولات مثل قانون حديدي لا مطالبات لإكمال بدون أدلة تحقق جديدة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating verification processes before claiming completion","Generating fresh verification evidence using npx playwright","Debugging claims without proper verification"],"zh":["在声明完成之前自动执行验证过程","使用npx playwright生成新鲜的验证证据","调试没有适当验证的声明"],"ja":["完了を主張する前に検証プロセスを自動化する","npx playwrightを使用して新規の検証証拠を生成する","適切な検証のない主張をデバッグする"],"ko":["완료를 선언하기 전에 자동으로 검증 프로세스를 수행하는 것","npx playwright를 사용하여 새로운 검증 증거를 생성하는 것","적절한 검증이 없는 청구를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar los procesos de verificación antes de reclamar la finalización","Generar evidencia de verificación fresca utilizando npx playwright","Depurar reclamaciones sin verificación adecuada"],"fr":["Automatiser les processus de vérification avant de réclamer l''achèvement","Générer des preuves de vérification fraîches à l''aide de npx playwright","Déboguer les réclamations sans vérification appropriée"],"de":["Automatisieren der Überprüfungsprozesse vor der Erledigung von Ansprüchen","Erzeugen von frischer Überprüfungsbeweisen mit npx playwright","Fehlerbehebung bei Ansprüchen ohne ordnungsgemäße Überprüfung"],"pt":["Automatizar processos de verificação antes de reivindicar conclusão","Gerar evidências de verificação frescas usando npx playwright","Depurar reivindicações sem verificação apropriada"],"ru":["Автоматизировать процессы проверки перед предъявлением претензий на завершение","Генерировать свежие доказательства проверки с помощью npx playwright","Отлаживать претензии без надлежащей проверки"],"ar":["أتمتة عمليات التحقق قبل المطالبة بإكمال","إنتاج أدلة تحقق جديدة باستخدام npx playwright","تصحيح المطالبات بدون تحقق مناسب"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires terminal visibility for running verification commands","Violating the letter of the verification rule is considered violating its spirit","Must run verification commands before claiming completion"],"zh":["需要终端可见性来运行验证命令","违反验证规则的字母精神被认为是违反其精神","必须在声明完成之前运行验证命令"],"ja":["検証コマンドを実行するために端末の可視性が必要","検証ルールの文字を違反することはその精神を違反することと見なされる","完了を主張する前に検証コマンドを実行する必要がある"],"ko":["검증 명령을 실행하기 위해 터미널의 가시성이 필요하다.","검증 규칙의 문자를 위반하는 것은 그 정신을 위반하는 것으로 간주된다.","완성을 선언하기 전에 검증 명령을 실행해야 한다."],"es":["Requiere visibilidad de terminal para ejecutar comandos de verificación","Violación de la letra de la regla de verificación se considera violación de su espíritu","Debe ejecutar comandos de verificación antes de reclamar la finalización"],"fr":["Nécessite une visibilité de terminal pour exécuter des commandes de vérification","La violation de la lettre de la règle de vérification est considérée comme une violation de son esprit","Doit exécuter des commandes de vérification avant de réclamer l''achèvement"],"de":["Benötigt Terminal-Sichtbarkeit zum Ausführen von Überprüfungsbefehlen","Verletzung des Wortlauts der Überprüfungsregel gilt als Verletzung ihres Geistes","Muss Überprüfungsbefehle ausführen, bevor er Ansprüche auf Erledigung geltend macht"],"pt":["Requer visibilidade do terminal para executar comandos de verificação","Violar a letra da regra de verificação é considerado violar o seu espírito","Deve executar comandos de verificação antes de reivindicar conclusão"],"ru":["Требует видимости терминала для выполнения команд проверки","Нарушение буквы правила проверки считается нарушением его духа","Должен выполнять команды проверки перед предъявлением претензий на завершение"],"ar":["يتطلب رؤية الطرفية لتشغيل أوامر التحقق","مخالفة حرف قانون التحقق يُعتبر مخالفة روحه","يجب تشغيل أوامر التحقق قبل المطالبة بإكمال"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
