derungen","Exploration von Ansätzen und Lösungen","Gestaltung konkreter Lösungen","Verwendung der LMS-Plattform Tulie Lab","Integration mit Next.js, Express und Prisma"],"pt":["Exploração de abordagens de forma estruturada","Conversão de requisitos vagos em design concreto","Uso de perguntas estruturadas para entender o problema","Preferência por respostas de múltipla escolha","Anúncio de início da exploração"],"ru":["Исследование подходов структурированным образом","Преобразование нечетких требований в конкретный дизайн","Использование структурированных вопросов для понимания проблемы","Предпочтение ответов с несколькими вариантами","Объявление о начале исследования"],"ar":["استكشاف المناهج بطريقة منظمة","تحويل المتطلبات الغامضة إلى تصميم ملموس","استخدام أسئلة منظمة لفهم المشكلة","التفضيل للإجابات متعددة الخيارات","الإعلان عن بداية الاستكشاف"]},"keywords":{"zh":["任务头脑风暴","knowns.task.brainstorm","结构化问题","多选择题","设计探索","需求转化"],"ja":["タスクブレインストーム","knowns.task.brainstorm","構造化された質問","多選択式","設計探索","要件変換"],"ko":["태스크 브레인스토밍","knowns.task.brainstorm","구조화된 질문","다중 선택형","디자인 탐색","요구 사항 변환"],"es":["lluvia de ideas para tareas","diseño de soluciones","plataforma LMS","Next.js","Express","Prisma","desarrollo de software","técnica de brainstorming"],"fr":["remue-méninges pour tâches","conception de solutions","plateforme LMS","Next.js","Express","Prisma","développement de logiciels","technique de brainstorming"],"de":["Brainstorming für Aufgaben","Gestaltung von Lösungen","LMS-Plattform","Next.js","Express","Prisma","Softwareentwicklung","Brainstorming-Technik"],"pt":["brainstorm de tarefas","exploração de abordagens","conversão de requisitos","design concreto","desenvolvimento de software","metodologias ágeis"],"ru":["мозговой штурм задач","исследование подходов","преобразование требований","конкретный дизайн","разработка программного обеспечения","гибкие методологии"],"ar":["عصف فكري للمهام","استكشاف المناهج","تحويل المتطلبات","تصميم ملموس","تطوير البرمجيات","منهجيات مرنة"]}},"owner":"tung68nt","repo":"tulie_lab","repoPath":"tung68nt/tulie_lab","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.429Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"knowns.task.brainstorm","description":"Use when requirements are unclear, multiple approaches exist, or you need to explore solutions before planning","bodyPreview":"# Brainstorming for Tasks\n\nConvert vague requirements into concrete design through structured questioning and exploration.\n\n**Announce at start:** \"I''m using the knowns.task.brainstorm skill to explore approaches.\"\n\n**Core principle:** UNDERSTAND THE PROBLEM BEFORE PROPOSING SOLUTIONS.\n\n## The Process\n\n### Phase 1: Discovery\n\n**One question at a time.** Don''t overwhelm with multiple questions.\n\nPrefer multiple-choice when possible:\n```\nWhich approach do you prefer?\nA) Quick solution with trade-o","body":"# Brainstorming for Tasks\n\nConvert vague requirements into concrete design through structured questioning and exploration.\n\n**Announce at start:** \"I''m using the knowns.task.brainstorm skill to explore approaches.\"\n\n**Core principle:** UNDERSTAND THE PROBLEM BEFORE PROPOSING SOLUTIONS.\n\n## The Process\n\n### Phase 1: Discovery\n\n**One question at a time.** Don''t overwhelm with multiple questions.\n\nPrefer multiple-choice when possible:\n```\nWhich approach do you prefer?\nA) Quick solution with trade-offs\nB) Comprehensive solution, more effort\nC) Something else (describe)\n```\n\nQuestions to clarify:\n- What problem are we solving?\n- Who are the users/stakeholders?\n- What are the constraints?\n- What does success look like?\n\n### Phase 2: Research Existing Patterns\n\n```json\n// Search docs for related patterns\nmcp__knowns__search_docs({ \"query\": \"<topic>\" })\n\n// Check how similar things were done\nmcp__knowns__search_tasks({ \"query\": \"<keywords>\" })\n```\n\n**Learn from history** - completed tasks often contain implementation insights.\n\n### Phase 3: Explore Approaches\n\nPresent 2-3 options with trade-offs:\n\n```markdown\n## Option A: [Name]\n- **Approach**: Brief description\n- **Pros**: What''s good\n- **Cons**: What''s challenging\n- **Effort**: Low/Medium/High\n\n## Option B: [Name]\n- **Approach**: Brief description\n- **Pros**: What''s good\n- **Cons**: What''s challenging\n- **Effort**: Low/Medium/High\n```\n\n**Lead with your recommendation** and explain why.\n\n### Phase 4: Validate and Document\n\nAfter agreement:\n- Summarize the chosen approach\n- Identify potential risks\n- Define acceptance criteria\n\nIf creating a new task:\n```json\nmcp__knowns__create_task({\n  \"title\": \"<title>\",\n  \"description\": \"Based on brainstorm: <key decisions>\",\n  \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\"Criterion 1\", \"Criterion 2\"]\n})\n```\n\nIf updating existing task:\n```json\nmcp__knowns__update_task({\n  \"taskId\": \"$ARGUMENTS\",\n  \"description\": \"Updated based on brainstorm...\"\n})\n```\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n**Good candidates:**\n- Vague requirements (\"make it faster\", \"improve UX\")\n- Multiple valid approaches exist\n- Significant effort involved\n- New territory for the project\n\n**Skip for:**\n- Clear, well-defined tasks\n- Bug fixes with obvious solutions\n- Simple additions following existing patterns\n\n## Red Flags\n\n**You''re doing it wrong if:**\n- Proposing solutions before understanding the problem\n- Asking too many questions at once\n- Not researching existing patterns first\n- Skipping trade-off analysis\n\n## Remember\n\n- One question at a time\n- Research existing patterns first\n- Present options with trade-offs\n- Lead with your recommendation\n- Document the decision"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:05:33.556Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Conversational Agents needing structured problem exploration and requirements gathering capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要结构化问题探索和需求收集能力的对话式代理。","ja":"構造化された問題の探索と要件の収集能力が必要な会話エージェントに最適です。","ko":"구조화된 문제 탐색 및 요구사항 수집 기능이 필요한 대화형 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Conversación que necesitan capacidades de exploración de problemas estructurados y recopilación de requisitos.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Conversation ayant besoin d''une exploration de problèmes structurée et de capacités de collecte de exigences.","de":"Perfekt für Conversational Agents, die strukturierte Problemerforschung und Anforderungserfassungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Conversação que necessitam de exploração de problemas estruturada e capacidades de coleta de requisitos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Конверсационных Агентов, требующих структурированного исследования проблем и возможностей сбора требований.","ar":"مثالي ل와كلاء المحادثة الذين يحتاجون إلى استكشاف مشكلة منظم وقدرات جمع المتطلبات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to convert vague requirements into concrete designs through structured questioning and exploration, utilizing Next.js, Express, and Prisma for robust backend support and efficient data management.","zh":"通过结构化的提问和探索，能够将模糊的需求转化为具体的设计，并利用 Next.js、Express 和 Prisma 实现强大的后端支持和高效的数据管理。","ja":"構造化された質問と探索を通じて、曖昧な要件を具体的な設計に変換することができ、Next.js、Express、Prisma を利用して堅牢なバックエンドサポートと効率的なデータ管理を実現します。","ko":"구조화된 질문과 탐색을 통해 모호한 요구사항을 구체적인 설계로 변환할 수 있으며, Next.js, Express 및 Prisma를 활용하여 강력한 백엔드 지원과 효율적인 데이터 관리를 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a convertir requisitos vagos en diseños concretos a través de preguntas estructuradas y exploración, utilizando Next.js, Express y Prisma para un soporte de backend robusto y una gestión de datos eficiente.","fr":"Permet aux agents de convertir des exigences vagues en conceptions concrètes grâce à des questions structurées et une exploration, en utilisant Next.js, Express et Prisma pour un support backend robuste et une gestion de données efficace.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, vage Anforderungen in konkrete Designs umzuwandeln, durch strukturierte Fragen und Exploration, unter Verwendung von Next.js, Express und Prisma für eine robuste Backend-Unterstützung und effizientes Datenmanagement.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a converter requisitos vagos em projetos concretos por meio de questionamento estruturado e exploração, utilizando Next.js, Express e Prisma para suporte robusto de backend e gerenciamento de dados eficiente.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью преобразовывать расплывчатые требования в конкретные проекты посредством структурированного вопроса и исследования, используя Next.js, Express и Prisma для надежной поддержки бэкенда и эффективного управления данными.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تحويل المتطلبات الغامضة إلى تصاميم ملموسة من خلال استجواب منظم واستكشاف، باستخدام Next.js و Express و Prisma لدعم خلفية قوي وإدارة بيانات فعالة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating the discovery phase for project planning","Generating concrete design specifications from vague requirements","Exploring approaches through multiple-choice questioning for efficient decision-making"],"zh":["自动化项目规划的发现阶段","从模糊的需求中生成具体的设计规格","通过多项选择的问题探索高效的决策"],"ja":["プロジェクト計画の発見段階を自動化する","曖昧な要件から具体的な設計仕様を生成する","多項選択式の質問を通じて効率的な意思決定を探索する"],"ko":["프로젝트 계획의 발견 단계를 자동화하는 것","모호한 요구사항에서 구체적인 설계 사양을 생성하는 것","다중 선택형 질문을 통해 효율적인 의사결정을 탐색하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar la fase de descubrimiento para la planificación de proyectos","Generar especificaciones de diseño concretas a partir de requisitos vagos","Explorar enfoques a través de preguntas de múltiple opción para una toma de decisiones eficiente"],"fr":["Automatiser la phase de découverte pour la planification de projets","Générer des spécifications de conception concrètes à partir d''exigences vagues","Explorer des approches à travers des questions à choix multiple pour une prise de décision efficace"],"de":["Automatisieren der Entdeckungsphase für die Projektplanung","Erzeugen von konkreten Designspezifikationen aus vagen Anforderungen","Erkunden von Ansätzen durch Multiple-Choice-Fragen für eine effiziente Entscheidungsfindung"],"pt":["Automatizar a fase de descoberta para planejamento de projetos","Gerar especificações de design concretas a partir de requisitos vagos","Explorar abordagens por meio de questionamento de múltipla escolha para tomada de decisões eficiente"],"ru":["Автоматизировать фазу открытия для планирования проектов","Генерировать конкретные спецификации дизайна из расплывчатых требований","Изучать подходы посредством вопросов с несколькими вариантами ответов для эффективного принятия решений"],"ar":["توفير مرحلة اكتشاف آليّة لتنظيم المشاريع","إنتاج مواصفات تصميم ملموسة من متطلبات غامضة","استكشاف المناهج من خلال أسئلة متعددة الخيارات لأخذ القرارات بفعالية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires a clear problem statement to initiate the brainstorming process","Dependent on the quality of questions asked during the discovery phase"],"zh":["需要明确的问题陈述来启动头脑风暴过程","依赖于发现阶段中提出的问题的质量"],"ja":["ブレインストーミングプロセスを開始するために明確な問題文を必要とする","発見段階で提起された質問の品質に依存する"],"ko":["브레인스토밍 프로세스를 시작하려면 명확한 문제 문이 필요함","발견 단계에서 제기된 질문의 품질에 의존함"],"es":["Requiere una declaración de problema clara para iniciar el proceso de lluvia de ideas","Dependiente de la calidad de las preguntas formuladas durante la fase de descubrimiento"],"fr":["Nécessite un énoncé de problème clair pour initier le processus de brainstorming","Dépendante de la qualité des questions posées pendant la phase de découverte"],"de":["Benötigt eine klare Problembeschreibung, um den Brainstorming-Prozess zu starten","Abhängig von der Qualität der Fragen, die während der Entdeckungsphase gestellt werden"],"pt":["Requer uma declaração de problema clara para iniciar o processo de brainstorming","Depende da qualidade das perguntas feitas durante a fase de descoberta"],"ru":["Требует четкого заявления проблемы для начала процесса мозгового штурма","Зависит от качества вопросов, задаваемых во время фазы открытия"],"ar":["يتطلب بيانا واضحا للمشكلة لبدء عملية العصف الذهني","يعتمد على جودة الأسئلة المطرحة خلال مرحلة اكتشاف"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
