g von Codeänderungen und die Validierung seines Verhaltens","pt":"O Storyblok OSS monorepo oferece uma abordagem de revisão e QA de código para garantir a qualidade e a confiabilidade","ru":"Storyblok OSS monorepo предоставляет подход к проверке и тестированию кода для обеспечения качества и надежности","ar":"يقدم Storyblok OSS monorepo نهجًا لمراجعة و جودة الأكواد لضمان الجودة والموثوقية","en":"The Storyblok OSS monorepo"},"definition":{"en":"The Storyblok OSS monorepo"},"features":{"zh":["代码审查","QA测试","代码质量检查","最佳实践确保","自动化测试"],"ja":["コードレビュー","QAテスト","コード品質チェック","ベストプラクティス確保","自動化テスト"],"ko":["코드 리뷰","QA 테스트","코드 품질 체크","최상의 实践 보장","자동화 테스트"],"es":["Revisión de código en dos fases","Validación de comportamiento","Cumplimiento de las mejores prácticas","Inclusión de pruebas","Revisión de la arquitectura"],"fr":["Révision de code en deux phases","Validation du comportement","Respect des meilleures pratiques","Inclusion de tests","Révision de l''architecture"],"de":["Code-Review in zwei Phasen","Validierung des Verhaltens","Einhaltung der Best Practices","Einclusion von Tests","Überprüfung der Architektur"],"pt":["Revisão de código de duas fases","Verificação de qualidade e arquitetura","Criação de casos de teste manuais","Garantia de confiabilidade e qualidade","Suporte ao Storyblok OSS monorepo","Melhoria contínua da qualidade do código"],"ru":["Двухфазная проверка кода","Проверка качества и архитектуры","Создание ручных тестовых случаев","Гарантия надежности и качества","Поддержка Storyblok OSS monorepo","Постоянное улучшение качества кода"],"ar":["استعراض الأكواد بمرحلتين","التحقق من الجودة والهيكل","إنشاء حالات اختبار يدوية","ضمان الموثوقية والجودة","دعم Storyblok OSS monorepo","تحسين مستمر لجودة الأكواد"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码审查","QA测试","代码质量","最佳实践","自动化测试","代码可靠性","代码优化"],"ja":["コードレビュー","QAテスト","コード品質","ベストプラクティス","自動化テスト","コード信頼性","コード最適化"],"ko":["코드 리뷰","QA 테스트","코드 품질","최상의 实践","자동화 테스트","코드 안정성","코드 최적화"],"es":["revisión de código","QA de código","mejores prácticas de código","pruebas de código","arquitectura de código","desarrollo de software","control de calidad"],"fr":["révision de code","QA de code","meilleures pratiques de code","tests de code","architecture de code","développement de logiciels","contrôle de qualité"],"de":["Code-Review","QA von Code","Best Practices für Code","Code-Tests","Code-Architektur","Software-Entwicklung","Qualitätskontrolle"],"pt":["revisão de código","QA de código","Storyblok OSS monorepo","qualidade de código","desenvolvimento de software","testes de QA","revisão de código de duas fases","garantia de qualidade"],"ru":["проверка кода","тестирование кода","Storyblok OSS monorepo","качество кода","разработка программного обеспечения","тестирование QA","двухфазная проверка кода","гарантия качества"],"ar":["استعراض الأكواد","جودة الأكواد","Storyblok OSS monorepo","جودة التطوير","تطوير البرمجيات","اختبارات الجودة","استعراض الأكواد بمرحلتين","ضمان الجودة"]}},"owner":"storyblok","repo":"monoblok","repoPath":"storyblok/monoblok","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.430Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"review-and-qa","description":"Review the changes for <commit|branch|pr> and create a QA review plan","bodyPreview":"# Review Changes\n\nReview the changes for: $ARGUMENTS.\n\n## Instructions\n\nPerform a two-phase review:\n\n1. **Code review** - Review quality, architecture, and best practices.\n2. **QA review** - Create manual test cases to validate behavior.\n\n## Phase 1: Code review\n\nAnalyze the code changes for:\n\n## PR checklist\n\n### Required for all PRs\n\n- [ ] **Small diff** - One logical change. If the PR does multiple things, split it.\n- [ ] **Tests included** - New functionality has tests. Bug fixes have regres","body":"# Review Changes\n\nReview the changes for: $ARGUMENTS.\n\n## Instructions\n\nPerform a two-phase review:\n\n1. **Code review** - Review quality, architecture, and best practices.\n2. **QA review** - Create manual test cases to validate behavior.\n\n## Phase 1: Code review\n\nAnalyze the code changes for:\n\n## PR checklist\n\n### Required for all PRs\n\n- [ ] **Small diff** - One logical change. If the PR does multiple things, split it.\n- [ ] **Tests included** - New functionality has tests. Bug fixes have regression tests.\n- [ ] **No secrets** - No tokens, passwords, or credentials in the code.\n\n### If user-facing changes\n\n- [ ] **Docs updated** - The README or relevant documentation reflects the change.\n- [ ] **Examples work** - Code examples in the documentation are tested and copy-paste ready.\n- [ ] **Error messages helpful** - New errors explain what went wrong and how to fix it.\n\n### If breaking changes\n\n- [ ] **Migration notes** - Provide clear before and after examples showing how to upgrade.\n- [ ] **Changelog entry** - Follow conventional commits for release notes.\n- [ ] **Deprecation warnings** - If keeping an old API temporarily, warn users.\n\n### If adding dependencies\n\n- [ ] **Justified** - No existing solution exists in the codebase.\n- [ ] **License compatible** - Use MIT or a compatible license.\n- [ ] **Maintained** - Use an active project with recent updates.\n- [ ] **Size reasonable** - Avoid adding significant bundle weight.\n\n### Quality and clean code\n\n- [ ] Functions are small and single-purpose.\n- [ ] Variable and function names are descriptive.\n- [ ] No dead code or commented-out blocks exist.\n- [ ] No magic numbers exist (use constants).\n- [ ] Error messages are helpful.\n\n### Architecture and design\n\n- [ ] Changes fit existing patterns in the codebase.\n- [ ] No unnecessary coupling exists between modules.\n- [ ] Proper separation of concerns exists (actions vs. commands vs. utils).\n- [ ] Types and interfaces are defined appropriately.\n\n### Reusability and centralization\n\n- [ ] Duplicated logic is extracted to shared utilities.\n- [ ] Existing helpers are used where applicable.\n- [ ] New utilities are generic enough for reuse.\n- [ ] Constants are centralized (not scattered).\n\n### Best practices\n\n- [ ] Async and await are used consistently (no mixed patterns).\n- [ ] Errors are propagated correctly (not swallowed).\n- [ ] Edge cases are handled (null, empty, invalid input).\n- [ ] No security issues exist (injection, secrets exposure).\n\n### Output format (code review)\n\n```markdown\n## Code review summary\n\n[LGTM / Needs changes / Blocking issues]\n\n## Issues found\n\n### [Critical/Major/Minor]: Issue title\n\n**File:** `path/to/file.ts:123`\n**Problem:** Description.\n**Suggestion:** How to fix.\n```\n\n## Phase 2: QA review\n\n### Test case structure\n\nRefer to the [Test Plan Template](./templates/test-plan.md) and the [Test Plan Example](./examples/assets-test-plan.md) for test plan structure guidance.\n\n### Coverage requirements\n\nCreate test cases for:\n\n1. **Happy path** - Normal successful operation.\n2. **Negative cases** - Invalid input, unauthorized access, and missing data.\n3. **Edge cases** - Empty input, large input, and special characters.\n4. **Error recovery** - What happens when things fail mid-operation.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:07:33.637Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing rigorous Pull Request analysis and Quality Assurance validation.","zh":"非常适合需要严格的Pull Request分析和质量保证验证的代码审查代理。","ja":"コードレビュー代理が厳格なプルリクエスト分析と品質保証の検証を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"코드 리뷰 에이전트가 엄격한 풀 리퀘스트 분석 및 품질 보증 검증을 필요로 할 때 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de revisión de código que necesitan un análisis riguroso de solicitudes de extracción y validación de garantía de calidad.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de révision de code nécessitant une analyse rigoureuse des demandes d''extraction et une validation de l''assurance qualité.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agents, die eine strenge Analyse von Pull-Requests und eine Validierung der Qualitätssicherung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que necessitam de análise rigorosa de Solicitações de Pull e validação de Garantia de Qualidade.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов код-ревью, которым требуется тщательный анализ запросов на включение и проверка качества.","ar":"مثالي لعميل مراجعة الكود الذي يحتاج إلى تحليل دقيق لطلبات السحب وتأكيد جودة الخدمة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform two-phase reviews, analyzing code quality, architecture, and best practices, while also creating manual test cases to validate behavior using PR checklists and regression tests.","zh":"赋予代理执行双阶段审查的能力，分析代码质量、架构和最佳实践，同时创建手动测试用例以使用PR检查清单和回归测试来验证行为。","ja":"エージェントに2段階のレビューを実行する能力を付与し、コード品質、構成、ベストプラクティスを分析し、PRチェックリストとリグレッションテストを使用して動作を検証するための手動テストケースを作成します。","ko":"에이전트가 2단계 리뷰를 수행할 수 있도록 하여 코드 품질, 아키텍처 및 모범 사례를 분석하고 PR 체크리스트 및 회귀 테스트를 사용하여 동작을 검증하기 위한 수동 테스트 케이스를 생성합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar revisiones de dos fases, analizando la calidad del código, la arquitectura y las mejores prácticas, y también creando casos de prueba manuales para validar el comportamiento utilizando listas de verificación de solicitudes de extracción y pruebas de regresión.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des révisions en deux phases, analysant la qualité du code, l''architecture et les meilleures pratiques, tout en créant des cas de test manuels pour valider le comportement en utilisant des listes de contrôle de demandes d''extraction et des tests de régression.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, zweiphasige Überprüfungen durchzuführen, die Codequalität, Architektur und Best Practices analysieren, und auch manuelle Testfälle zu erstellen, um das Verhalten mit Pull-Request-Checklisten und RegressionsTests zu überprüfen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar revisões de duas fases, analisando a qualidade do código, arquitetura e melhores práticas, além de criar casos de teste manuais para validar o comportamento usando listas de verificação de solicitações de pull e testes de regressão.","ru":"Позволяет агентам выполнять двухфазные обзоры, анализируя качество кода, архитектуру и лучшие практики, а также создавать ручные тестовые случаи для проверки поведения с помощью контрольных списков запросов на включение и регрессионных тестов.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بإجراء مراجعات مرحلتين ، وتحليل جودة الكود ، والهيكلة ، وأفضل الممارسات ، بالإضافة إلى إنشاء حالات اختبار يدوية لتحقق السلوك باستخدام قوائم التحقق من طلبات السحب واختبارات الانحدار."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code reviews for small diffs","Generating manual test cases for new functionality","Validating bug fix regressions"],"zh":["自动化小型差异的代码审查","为新功能生成手动测试用例","验证bug修复的回归"],"ja":["小さな差分のコードレビューの自動化","新しい機能の手動テストケースの生成","バグ修正のリグレッションの検証"],"ko":["소형 차이의 코드 리뷰 자동화","새로운 기능에 대한 수동 테스트 케이스 생성","버그 수정의 회귀 검증"],"es":["Automatizar revisiones de código para diferencias pequeñas","Generar casos de prueba manuales para nueva funcionalidad","Validar regresiones de corrección de errores"],"fr":["Automatiser les révisions de code pour les différences mineures","Générer des cas de test manuels pour la nouvelle fonctionnalité","Valider les régressions de correction de bogues"],"de":["Automatisieren von Code-Reviews für kleine Diffs","Erstellen manueller Testfälle für neue Funktionalität","Überprüfen von Fehlern bei der Fehlerbehebung"],"pt":["Automatizar revisões de código para pequenas diferenças","Gerar casos de teste manuais para nova funcionalidade","Validar regressões de correção de bugs"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обзоры кода для небольших различий","Генерировать ручные тестовые случаи для новой функциональности","Проверять регрессии исправления ошибок"],"ar":["تحسين مراجعات الكود للفرق الصغيرة","توليد حالات اختبار يدوية للوظائف الجديدة","تحقق من انحدارات correção من العيوب"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to code repository","Limited to Pull Request analysis"],"zh":["需要访问代码仓库","仅限Pull Request分析"],"ja":["コードリポジトリへのアクセスが必要","プルリクエスト分析のみ"],"ko":["코드 저장소에 대한 액세스가 필요","풀 리퀘스트 분석만"],"es":["Requiere acceso al repositorio de código","Limitado al análisis de solicitudes de extracción"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au référentiel de code","Limité à l''analyse des demandes d''extraction"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das Code-Repository","Begrenzt auf die Analyse von Pull-Requests"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao repositório de código","Limitado à análise de Solicitações de Pull"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к хранилищу кода","Ограничен анализ запросов на включение"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مستودع الكود","محدود لتحليل طلبات السحب"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
