認証は、Keycloak OIDC を使用したセキュアな認証と認可のソリューションを提供","ko":"MLflow OIDC 인증은 Keycloak OIDC를 사용한 보안 인증 및 인가 솔루션을 제공","es":"El plugin mlflow-oidc-auth proporciona autenticación OIDC y autorización basada en grupos para MLflow","fr":"Le plugin mlflow-oidc-auth fournit une authentification OIDC et une autorisation basée sur les groupes pour MLflow","de":"Das mlflow-oidc-auth-Plugin bietet OIDC-Authentifizierung und gruppenbasierte Autorisierung für MLflow","pt":"O mlflow-oidc-auth é um wrapper FastAPI em torno do MLflow que fornece autenticação OIDC via Keycloak e gerenciamento de sessão","ru":"Модуль mlflow-oidc-auth представляет собой оболочку FastAPI вокруг MLflow, обеспечивающую аутентификацию OIDC через Keycloak и управление сессиями","ar":"ملحق mlflow-oidc-auth هو غلاف FastAPI حول MLflow يقدم التحقق من الهوية OIDC عبر Keycloak وإدارة الجلسات","en":"Main Kagenti repo - installer, UI and docs"},"definition":{"en":"Main Kagenti repo - installer, UI and docs"},"features":{"zh":["OIDC 身份验证","组基于授权","会话管理","Basic/Bearer 身份验证"],"ja":["OIDC 認証","グループベースの認可","セッション管理","Basic/Bearer 認証"],"ko":["OIDC 인증","그룹 기반 인가","세션 관리","Basic/Bearer 인증"],"es":["Autenticación OIDC mediante Keycloak","Autorización basada en grupos con permisos de lectura, edición y administración","Gestión de sesiones para acceso desde el navegador","Autenticación básica y Bearer para acceso programático"],"fr":["Authentification OIDC via Keycloak","Autorisation basée sur les groupes avec des permissions de lecture, d''édition et d''administration","Gestion des sessions pour l''accès depuis le navigateur","Authentification de base et Bearer pour l''accès programmatique"],"de":["OIDC-Authentifizierung über Keycloak","Gruppenbasierte Autorisierung mit Lese-, Schreib- und Verwaltungsrechten","Sitzungsverwaltung für Browser-Zugriff","Basic- und Bearer-Authentifizierung für programmatischen Zugriff"],"pt":["Autenticação OIDC via Keycloak","Autorização baseada em grupo (permissões LEITURA/EDIÇÃO/GERENCIAMENTO)","Gerenciamento de sessão para acesso via navegador","Autenticação Básica/Bearer para acesso programático"],"ru":["Аутентификация OIDC через Keycloak","Групповая авторизация (права ЧТЕНИЕ/РЕДАКТИРОВАНИЕ/УПРАВЛЕНИЕ)","Управление сессиями для доступа через браузер","Базовая/Bearer-аутентификация для программного доступа"],"ar":["التحقق من الهوية OIDC عبر Keycloak","التحكم في الوصول المبني على المجموعة (أذونات القراءة/التحرير/الإدارة)","إدارة الجلسات للوصول عبر المتصفح","التحقق من الهوية الأساسية/Bearer للوصول البرمجي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["MLflow","OIDC","Keycloak","身份验证","授权","FastAPI"],"ja":["MLflow","OIDC","Keycloak","認証","認可","FastAPI"],"ko":["MLflow","OIDC","Keycloak","인증","인가","FastAPI"],"es":["autenticación OIDC","MLflow","Keycloak","autorización basada en grupos","gestión de sesiones","autenticación básica","Bearer","acceso programático","seguridad de MLflow"],"fr":["authentification OIDC","MLflow","Keycloak","autorisation basée sur les groupes","gestion des sessions","authentification de base","Bearer","accès programmatique","sécurité de MLflow"],"de":["OIDC-Authentifizierung","MLflow","Keycloak","gruppenbasierte Autorisierung","Sitzungsverwaltung","Basic-Authentifizierung","Bearer","programmatischer Zugriff","MLflow-Sicherheit"],"pt":["autenticação OIDC","MLflow","Keycloak","autorização baseada em grupo","gerenciamento de sessão","acesso programático","FastAPI","plugin de autenticação"],"ru":["аутентификация OIDC","MLflow","Keycloak","групповая авторизация","управление сессиями","программный доступ","FastAPI","плагин аутентификации"],"ar":["التحقق من الهوية OIDC","MLflow","Keycloak","التحكم في الوصول المبني على المجموعة","إدارة الجلسات","الوصول البرمجي","FastAPI","ملحق التحقق من الهوية"]}},"owner":"kagenti","repo":"kagenti","repoPath":"kagenti/kagenti","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.430Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"auth:mlflow-oidc-auth","description":"Configure MLflow with mlflow-oidc-auth plugin for Keycloak OIDC authentication","bodyPreview":"# MLflow OIDC Authentication\n\nConfigure MLflow Tracking Server with Keycloak OIDC authentication using the mlflow-oidc-auth plugin.\n\n## Overview\n\nmlflow-oidc-auth is a FastAPI wrapper around MLflow that provides:\n- OIDC authentication via Keycloak\n- Group-based authorization (READ/EDIT/MANAGE permissions)\n- Session management for browser access\n- Basic/Bearer auth for programmatic access\n\n## Architecture\n\n```\nBrowser → Keycloak OIDC → mlflow-oidc-auth → MLflow Flask → PostgreSQL\nOTEL    → mTLS (","body":"# MLflow OIDC Authentication\n\nConfigure MLflow Tracking Server with Keycloak OIDC authentication using the mlflow-oidc-auth plugin.\n\n## Overview\n\nmlflow-oidc-auth is a FastAPI wrapper around MLflow that provides:\n- OIDC authentication via Keycloak\n- Group-based authorization (READ/EDIT/MANAGE permissions)\n- Session management for browser access\n- Basic/Bearer auth for programmatic access\n\n## Architecture\n\n```\nBrowser → Keycloak OIDC → mlflow-oidc-auth → MLflow Flask → PostgreSQL\nOTEL    → mTLS (Istio) → /v1/traces       → MLflow      → PostgreSQL\n```\n\n## Required Environment Variables\n\n```yaml\nenv:\n  # Database for MLflow\n  - name: MLFLOW_BACKEND_STORE_URI\n    value: \"postgresql://user:pass@postgres:5432/mlflow\"\n  - name: MLFLOW_TRACKING_URI\n    value: \"postgresql://user:pass@postgres:5432/mlflow\"  # Needed for otel_router\n\n  # OIDC Configuration\n  - name: OIDC_DISCOVERY_URL\n    value: \"http://keycloak-service.keycloak:8080/realms/master/.well-known/openid-configuration\"\n  - name: OIDC_CLIENT_ID\n    value: \"mlflow\"\n  - name: OIDC_CLIENT_SECRET\n    valueFrom:\n      secretKeyRef:\n        name: mlflow-oauth-secret\n        key: OIDC_CLIENT_SECRET\n\n  # OIDC Groups for Authorization\n  - name: OIDC_GROUP_NAME\n    value: \"mlflow\"  # Users must be in this group\n  - name: OIDC_ADMIN_GROUP_NAME\n    value: \"mlflow-admin\"  # Admin users group\n\n  # Database for OIDC plugin\n  - name: OIDC_USERS_DB_URI\n    value: \"postgresql://user:pass@postgres:5432/mlflow\"\n```\n\n## OTEL Trace Ingestion Setup\n\n### Problem\n\nmlflow-oidc-auth doesn''t include MLflow''s `otel_router` which provides the `/v1/traces` OTLP endpoint.\n\n### Solution: Runtime Patches\n\nApply two patches before starting the app:\n\n```python\n# Patch 1: Add otel_router to get_all_routers()\nfrom mlflow.server.otel_api import otel_router\nimport mlflow_oidc_auth.routers as routers_module\n\noriginal_get_all_routers = routers_module.get_all_routers\ndef patched_get_all_routers():\n    return original_get_all_routers() + [otel_router]\nrouters_module.get_all_routers = patched_get_all_routers\n\n# Patch 2: Exclude /v1/traces from OIDC auth\nfrom mlflow_oidc_auth.middleware.auth_middleware import AuthMiddleware\n\noriginal_is_unprotected = AuthMiddleware._is_unprotected_route\ndef patched_is_unprotected(self, path: str) -> bool:\n    if path.startswith(\"/v1/traces\"):\n        return True\n    return original_is_unprotected(self, path)\nAuthMiddleware._is_unprotected_route = patched_is_unprotected\n\n# NOW import app (uses patched functions)\nfrom mlflow_oidc_auth.app import app\nimport uvicorn\nuvicorn.run(app, host=\"0.0.0.0\", port=5000)\n```\n\n### Security\n\nThe `/v1/traces` endpoint is secured via Istio instead of OIDC:\n\n```yaml\napiVersion: security.istio.io/v1\nkind: AuthorizationPolicy\nmetadata:\n  name: mlflow-traces-from-otel\nspec:\n  targetRefs:\n    - kind: Service\n      name: mlflow\n  action: ALLOW\n  rules:\n    - from:\n        - source:\n            principals:\n              - \"cluster.local/ns/kagenti-system/sa/otel-collector\"\n      to:\n        - operation:\n            methods: [\"POST\"]\n            paths: [\"/v1/traces\", \"/v1/traces/*\"]\n    - to:\n        - operation:\n            notPaths: [\"/v1/traces\", \"/v1/traces/*\"]\n```\n\n## Waypoint Proxy for L7 Auth\n\nThe AuthorizationPolicy needs L7 (path-based) evaluation, which requires a waypoint proxy:\n\n```yaml\napiVersion: gateway.networking.k8s.io/v1\nkind: Gateway\nmetadata:\n  name: mlflow-waypoint\n  labels:\n    istio.io/waypoint-for: service\nspec:\n  gatewayClassName: istio-waypoint\n  listeners:\n    - name: mesh\n      port: 15008\n      protocol: HBONE\n```\n\nAdd the waypoint label to the MLflow service:\n\n```yaml\napiVersion: v1\nkind: Service\nmetadata:\n  name: mlflow\n  labels:\n    istio.io/use-waypoint: mlflow-waypoint\n```\n\n## Helm Chart Integration\n\nSee `charts/kagenti-deps/templates/mlflow.yaml` for the full implementation.\n\nKey values:\n```yaml\nmlflow:\n  auth:\n    enabled: true\n    secretName: mlflow-oauth-secret\n```\n\n## Programmatic API Access\n\n### Using Client Credentials Flow\n\nFor E2E tests and CI/CD pipelines, use the MLflow client''s OAuth credentials:\n\n```python\nimport base64\nimport requests\nfrom kubernetes import client, config\n\n# Get credentials from K8s secret\nconfig.load_kube_config()\nk8s = client.CoreV1Api()\nsecret = k8s.read_namespaced_secret(\"mlflow-oauth-secret\", \"kagenti-system\")\n\nclient_id = base64.b64decode(secret.data[\"OIDC_CLIENT_ID\"]).decode()\nclient_secret = base64.b64decode(secret.data[\"OIDC_CLIENT_SECRET\"]).decode()\ntoken_url = base64.b64decode(secret.data[\"OIDC_TOKEN_URL\"]).decode()\n\n# Get token using client credentials flow\nresponse = requests.post(token_url, data={\n    \"grant_type\": \"client_credentials\",\n    \"client_id\": client_id,\n    \"client_secret\": client_secret,\n}, verify=False)\n\naccess_token = response.json()[\"access_token\"]\n\n# Set for MLflow Python client\nimport os\nos.environ[\"MLFLOW_TRACKING_TOKEN\"] = access_token\n```\n\n**Important**: Use the `mlflow` client credentials, NOT `admin-cli`. The mlflow-oidc-auth\nvalidates the token audience and will reject tokens from other clients.\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### \"Authentication required\" for /v1/traces\n\nVerify patches are applied:\n```bash\nkubectl logs -n kagenti-system deploy/mlflow -c mlflow | grep \"otel_router\"\n# Should see: \"Patched get_all_routers() to include otel_router\"\n# Should see: \"Excluded /v1/traces from OIDC auth (mTLS via Istio)\"\n```\n\n### Bearer token rejected with \"Invalid token\"\n\nCheck MLflow logs for SSL errors:\n```bash\nkubectl logs -n kagenti-system deploy/mlflow -c mlflow | grep -i \"ssl\\|cert\\|jwks\"\n```\n\nIf you see `CERTIFICATE_VERIFY_FAILED`, the CA bundle is incomplete. On OpenShift/HyperShift:\n- Set `SSL_CERT_FILE` (for httpx/authlib) in addition to `REQUESTS_CA_BUNDLE`\n- Include both ingress CA and root CA in the bundle (HyperShift uses a CA chain)\n\n```yaml\n# In mlflow.yaml startup script:\nexport SSL_CERT_FILE=/etc/pki/ingress-ca/ingress-ca.pem && \\\nexport REQUESTS_CA_BUNDLE=/etc/pki/ingress-ca/ingress-ca.pem && \\\n```\n\n### SQLite errors for trace storage\n\nEnsure both `MLFLOW_BACKEND_STORE_URI` AND `MLFLOW_TRACKING_URI` are set to PostgreSQL.\n\n### Traces not appearing\n\n1. Check OTEL collector logs:\n```bash\nkubectl logs -n kagenti-system deploy/otel-collector | grep mlflow\n```\n\n2. Verify trace count in database:\n```bash\nkubectl exec -n kagenti-system postgres-otel-0 -- \\\n  psql -U postgres -d mlflow -c \"SELECT COUNT(*) FROM trace_info;\"\n```\n\n3. Check AuthorizationPolicy:\n```bash\nkubectl get authorizationpolicy -n kagenti-system mlflow-traces-from-otel -o yaml\n```\n\n## Known Limitations\n\n1. **No path exclusion config**: mlflow-oidc-auth hardcodes unprotected paths\n2. **Missing otel_router**: Not included in get_all_routers()\n3. **Direct Access Grants disabled**: MLflow client uses client_credentials flow only, not password grant\n\n## Future Improvements\n\n- Upstream PR for `OIDC_EXCLUDE_PATHS` environment variable\n- Upstream PR to include `otel_router` in standard routers\n- Consider Istio-level auth as alternative to application auth\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- `auth:otel-oauth2-exporter`\n- `auth:keycloak-confidential-client`\n- `istio:ambient-waypoint`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:07:47.887Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents requiring secure MLflow Tracking Server integration with Keycloak OIDC authentication and authorization","zh":"适用于需要安全的MLflow Tracking Server集成与Keycloak OIDC身份验证和授权的AI代理","ja":"Keycloak OIDC認証および認可とMLflow Tracking Serverの安全な統合を必要とするAIエージェントに適しています","ko":"Keycloak OIDC 인증 및 인가와 MLflow Tracking Server의 보안 통합을 필요로 하는 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA que requieren una integración segura con el servidor de seguimiento de MLflow con autenticación y autorización de Keycloak OIDC","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA nécessitant une intégration sécurisée du serveur de suivi MLflow avec l''authentification et l''autorisation Keycloak OIDC","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents, die eine sichere Integration mit dem MLflow-Tracking-Server mit Keycloak-OIDC-Authentifizierung und -Autorisierung erfordern","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA que exigem integração segura do servidor de rastreamento MLflow com autenticação e autorização Keycloak OIDC","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, требующих безопасной интеграции сервера отслеживания MLflow с аутентификацией и авторизацией Keycloak OIDC","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يتطلبون دمج خادم تتبع MLflow الآمن مع مصادقة وت�权 Keycloak OIDC"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to authenticate via Keycloak OIDC, manage group-based permissions, and handle session management for browser access, all while utilizing FastAPI and MLflow for robust data tracking and analysis with protocols like mTLS and OTEL","zh":"赋予代理通过Keycloak OIDC进行身份验证、管理基于组的权限、处理浏览器访问的会话管理的能力，同时利用FastAPI和MLflow进行强大的数据跟踪和分析，支持mTLS和OTEL等协议","ja":"Keycloak OIDC経由での認証、グループベースの権限管理、ブラウザアクセスのセッション管理を行うことで、FastAPIおよびMLflowを利用した堅牢なデータ追跡および分析を行うことができ、mTLSやOTELなどのプロトコルをサポートします","ko":"Keycloak OIDC를 통해 인증을 수행하고, 그룹 기반의 권한을 관리하며, 브라우저 접근의 세션 관리를 처리하는 동시에 FastAPI와 MLflow를 이용하여 강력한 데이터 추적 및 분석을 수행할 수 있으며, mTLS 및 OTEL 등의 프로토콜을 지원합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a autenticarse a través de Keycloak OIDC, gestionar permisos basados en grupos y controlar el acceso de sesión para el acceso del navegador, todo mientras utiliza FastAPI y MLflow para un seguimiento y análisis de datos robustos con protocolos como mTLS y OTEL","fr":"Permet aux agents de s''authentifier via Keycloak OIDC, de gérer les autorisations basées sur les groupes et de gérer l''accès de session pour l''accès navigateur, le tout en utilisant FastAPI et MLflow pour un suivi et une analyse de données robustes avec des protocoles comme mTLS et OTEL","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, sich über Keycloak OIDC zu authentifizieren, gruppenbasierte Berechtigungen zu verwalten und Sitzungszugriff für browserbasierte Interaktionen zu verwalten, all dies unter Verwendung von FastAPI und MLflow für robuste Datenverfolgung und -analyse mit Protokollen wie mTLS und OTEL","pt":"Habilita os agentes a autenticar via Keycloak OIDC, gerenciar permissões baseadas em grupo e lidar com gerenciamento de sessão para acesso do navegador, tudo isso utilizando FastAPI e MLflow para rastreamento e análise de dados robustos com protocolos como mTLS e OTEL","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью аутентификации через Keycloak OIDC, управления разрешениями на основе групп и обработки управления сессиями для доступа браузера, все это при использовании FastAPI и MLflow для надежного отслеживания и анализа данных с протоколами như mTLS и OTEL","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على المصادقة عبر Keycloak OIDC وإدارة صلاحيات المجموعة ومعالجة إدارة الجلسة للوصول إلى المتصفح، كل ذلك باستخدام FastAPI و MLflow لتعقب البيانات والتحليل الموثوق به بروتوكولات مثل mTLS وOTEL"},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring MLflow Tracking Server with Keycloak OIDC authentication","Implementing group-based authorization for READ, EDIT, and MANAGE permissions","Managing session access for browser-based interactions"],"zh":["配置MLflow Tracking Server与Keycloak OIDC身份验证的集成","实施基于组的READ、EDIT和MANAGE权限的授权","管理浏览器交互的会话访问"],"ja":["Keycloak OIDC認証とMLflow Tracking Serverの統合を設定する","READ、EDIT、MANAGE権限のグループベースの認可を実装する","ブラウザベースのインタラクションのセッションアクセスを管理する"],"ko":["Keycloak OIDC 인증과 MLflow Tracking Server의 통합을 구성하는こと","READ, EDIT, MANAGE 권한의 그룹 기반 인가를 구현하는こと","브라우저 기반 상호작용의 세션 액세스를 관리하는 것"],"es":["Configuración del servidor de seguimiento de MLflow con autenticación de Keycloak OIDC","Implementación de autorización basada en grupos para permisos de LECTURA, EDICIÓN y ADMINISTRACIÓN","Administración del acceso de sesión para interacciones basadas en navegador"],"fr":["Configuration du serveur de suivi MLflow avec l''authentification Keycloak OIDC","Mise en œuvre de l''autorisation basée sur les groupes pour les autorisations LECTURE, ÉDITION et GESTION","Gestion de l''accès de session pour les interactions basées sur le navigateur"],"de":["Konfiguration des MLflow-Tracking-Servers mit Keycloak-OIDC-Authentifizierung","Implementierung gruppenbasierter Autorisierung für Lese-, Bearbeitungs- und Verwaltungsrechte","Verwaltung des Sitzungszugriffs für browserbasierte Interaktionen"],"pt":["Configurando o servidor de rastreamento MLflow com autenticação Keycloak OIDC","Implementando autorização baseada em grupo para permissões LEITURA, EDITAR e GERENCIAR","Gerenciando acesso de sessão para interações baseadas em navegador"],"ru":["Настройка сервера отслеживания MLflow с аутентификацией Keycloak OIDC","Реализация разрешений на основе групп для разрешений ЧТЕНИЕ, РЕДАКТИРОВАНИЕ и УПРАВЛЕНИЕ","Управление доступом к сессии для взаимодействий на основе браузера"],"ar":["تكوين خادم تتبع MLflow مع مصادقة Keycloak OIDC","تنفيذ صلاحيات المجموعة لمسؤوليات القراءة والتعديل والإدارة","إدارة الوصول إلى الجلسة للتفاعلات المعتمدة على المتصفح"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Keycloak OIDC setup","Dependent on MLflow and FastAPI compatibility","PostgreSQL database required for MLflow Tracking Server"],"zh":["需要Keycloak OIDC设置","依赖于MLflow和FastAPI的兼容性","需要PostgreSQL数据库用于MLflow Tracking Server"],"ja":["Keycloak OIDCの設定が必要","MLflowおよびFastAPIの互換性に依存する","MLflow Tracking Server用のPostgreSQLデータベースが必要"],"ko":["Keycloak OIDC 설정이 필요합니다","MLflow 및 FastAPI의 호환성에 의존합니다","MLflow Tracking Server를 위한 PostgreSQL 데이터베이스가 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Keycloak OIDC","Dependiente de la compatibilidad de MLflow y FastAPI","Se requiere una base de datos PostgreSQL para el servidor de seguimiento de MLflow"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration Keycloak OIDC","Dépend de la compatibilité de MLflow et FastAPI","Une base de données PostgreSQL est requise pour le serveur de suivi MLflow"],"de":["Erfordert Keycloak-OIDC-Setup","Abhängig von der Kompatibilität von MLflow und FastAPI","Eine PostgreSQL-Datenbank ist erforderlich für den MLflow-Tracking-Server"],"pt":["Exige configuração do Keycloak OIDC","Dependente da compatibilidade do MLflow e FastAPI","Banco de dados PostgreSQL necessário para o servidor de rastreamento MLflow"],"ru":["Требует настройки Keycloak OIDC","Зависит от совместимости MLflow и FastAPI","Требуется база данных PostgreSQL для сервера отслеживания MLflow"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Keycloak OIDC","يعتمد على توافق MLflow و FastAPI","يتطلب قاعدة بيانات PostgreSQL لخادم تتبع MLflow"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
