react: حزم جافاسكريبت الرسمية","en":"dojo-react"},"description":{"zh":"Dojo React是为React应用提供的官方JavaScript包，帮助开发者简化设置和状态管理","ja":"Dojo Reactは、Reactアプリケーション用の公式JavaScriptパッケージであり、開発者が設定と状態管理を簡素化するのに役立ちます","ko":"도조 리액트는 리액트 애플리케이션을 위한 공식 자바스크립트 패키지로서 개발자가 설정 및 상태 관리를 단순화하는 데 도움이 됩니다","es":"Dojo React es un kit de herramientas oficial de JavaScript para crear aplicaciones complejas con React. Ofrece patrones y características avanzadas para el d...","fr":"Dojo React est un kit de développement officiel JavaScript pour créer des applications complexes avec React. Il propose des modèles et des fonctionnalités av...","de":"Dojo React ist ein offizielles JavaScript-Toolkit für die Erstellung komplexer Anwendungen mit React. Es bietet Muster und erweiterte Funktionen für die Anwe...","pt":"O Dojo React é uma coleção de bibliotecas JavaScript oficiais para criar aplicações React escaláveis e eficientes.","ru":"Dojo React — это коллекция официальных пакетов JavaScript для создания масштабируемых и эффективных приложений React.","ar":"dojo-react هو مجموعة من الحزم جافاسكريبت الرسمية لإنشاء تطبيقات رياكت قابلة للتوسع والكفاءة.","en":"Official JavaScript packages for Dojo."},"definition":{"en":"Official JavaScript packages for Dojo."},"features":{"zh":["设置React提供者层次结构","使用Effect原子处理复杂异步状态","实现无限滚动","处理加载和错误状态"],"ja":["Reactプロバイダーの階層構造を設定","Effectアトムを使用して複雑な非同期状態を処理","無限スクロールを実装","読み込みとエラー状態を処理"],"ko":["리액트 제공자 계층 구조를 설정","Effect 원자를 사용하여 복잡한 비동기 상태를 처리","무한 스크롤을 구현","로드 및 오류 상태를 처리"],"es":["Configuración de la jerarquía de proveedores de React","Uso de átomos de efecto para estado asíncrono complejo","Implementación de desplazamiento infinito","Gestión de estados de carga y error"],"fr":["Configuration de la hiérarchie des fournisseurs de React","Utilisation d''atomes d''effet pour un état asynchrone complexe","Mise en œuvre de la définition infinie","Gestion des états de chargement et d''erreur"],"de":["Konfiguration der React-Anbieterhierarchie","Verwendung von Effektatomen für komplexen asynchronen Zustand","Implementierung des unendlichen Scrollens","Verwaltung von Lade- und Fehlerzuständen"],"pt":["Configuração do provedor de hierarquia","Uso de átomos de efeito para estados assíncronos complexos","Implementação de rolagem infinita","Gerenciamento de estados de carregamento e erro"],"ru":["Настройка иерархии провайдеров","Использование эффект-атомов для сложных асинхронных состояний","Реализация бесконечной прокрутки","Управление состояниями загрузки и ошибок"],"ar":["تكوين التسلسل الهرمي للموفر","استخدام ذرات التأثير لتحديد الحالات غير المتزامنة المعقدة","تنفيذ التمرير اللانهائي","إدارة حالات التحميل والخطأ"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Dojo React","React提供者","Effect原子","无限滚动","加载状态","错误状态"],"ja":["Dojo React","Reactプロバイダー","Effectアトム","無限スクロール","読み込み状態","エラー状態"],"ko":["도조 리액트","리액트 제공자","Effect 원자","무한 스크롤","로드 상태","오류 상태"],"es":["Dojo React","Kit de herramientas de JavaScript","Desarrollo de aplicaciones complejas","React","Patrones de React","Estado asíncrono","Desplazamiento infinito"],"fr":["Dojo React","Kit de développement JavaScript","Développement d''applications complexes","React","Modèles de React","État asynchrone","Définition infinie"],"de":["Dojo React","JavaScript-Toolkit","Entwicklung komplexer Anwendungen","React","React-Muster","Asynchroner Zustand","Unendliches Scrollen"],"pt":["Dojo React","Bibliotecas JavaScript","Aplicações React","Provedor de hierarquia","Estados assíncronos","Rolagem infinita"],"ru":["Dojo React","Пакеты JavaScript","Приложения React","Иерархия провайдеров","Асинхронные состояния","Бесконечная прокрутка"],"ar":["dojo-react","حزم جافاسكريبت","تطبيقات رياكت","التسلسل الهرمي للموفر","الحالات غير المتزامنة","التمرير اللانهائي"]}},"owner":"dojoengine","repo":"dojo.js","repoPath":"dojoengine/dojo.js","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.430Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"dojo-react","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Dojo.js React Patterns\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Setting up React provider hierarchy\n- Using Effect atoms for complex async state\n- Implementing infinite scroll\n- Handling loading/error states\n\n## Provider Hierarchy\n\nRecommended order:\n\n```tsx\nimport { StarknetConfig } from \"@starknet-react/core\";\nimport { DojoSdkProvider } from \"@dojoengine/sdk/react\";\n\nfunction Providers({ children }) {\n    return (\n        <StarknetConfig connectors={connectors}>\n            <DojoSdkProvider","body":"# Dojo.js React Patterns\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Setting up React provider hierarchy\n- Using Effect atoms for complex async state\n- Implementing infinite scroll\n- Handling loading/error states\n\n## Provider Hierarchy\n\nRecommended order:\n\n```tsx\nimport { StarknetConfig } from \"@starknet-react/core\";\nimport { DojoSdkProvider } from \"@dojoengine/sdk/react\";\n\nfunction Providers({ children }) {\n    return (\n        <StarknetConfig connectors={connectors}>\n            <DojoSdkProvider\n                dojoConfig={dojoConfig}\n                sdk={sdk}\n                clientFn={createClient}\n            >\n                {children}\n            </DojoSdkProvider>\n        </StarknetConfig>\n    );\n}\n```\n\n## useDojoSDK Hook\n\n```tsx\nimport { useDojoSDK } from \"@dojoengine/sdk/react\";\n\nfunction GameComponent() {\n    const {\n        sdk,          // SDK instance\n        config,       // DojoConfig\n        client,       // Client from clientFn\n        provider,     // DojoProvider\n        useDojoStore  // Zustand store hook\n    } = useDojoSDK();\n}\n```\n\n## Effect Atoms (Recommended)\n\nEffect atoms provide robust async state management:\n\n### Entity Query Atom\n\n```tsx\nimport { createEntityQueryAtom } from \"@dojoengine/react/effect\";\nimport { Result } from \"@dojoengine/react/effect\";\n\nconst playersAtom = createEntityQueryAtom(\n    runtime,\n    new ToriiQueryBuilder().addEntityModel(\"game-Player\").withLimit(100)\n);\n\nfunction PlayerList() {\n    const players = useAtomValue(playersAtom);\n\n    return Result.match(players, {\n        onSuccess: ({ value }) => (\n            <ul>\n                {value.items.map(p => <li key={p.entityId}>{p.models.game.Player.name}</li>)}\n            </ul>\n        ),\n        onFailure: (error) => <div>Error: {error.message}</div>,\n        onInitial: () => <div>Loading...</div>\n    });\n}\n```\n\n### Entity Updates Atom (Real-time)\n\n```tsx\nimport { createEntityUpdatesAtom } from \"@dojoengine/react/effect\";\n\nconst updatesAtom = createEntityUpdatesAtom(\n    runtime,\n    KeysClause([\"game-Player\"], [], \"VariableLen\").build()\n);\n```\n\n### Combined Query + Updates\n\n```tsx\nimport { createEntityQueryWithUpdatesAtom } from \"@dojoengine/react/effect\";\n\nconst livePlayersAtom = createEntityQueryWithUpdatesAtom(\n    runtime,\n    query,\n    clause\n);\n```\n\n## Infinite Scroll\n\n```tsx\nimport { createEntitiesInfiniteScrollAtom } from \"@dojoengine/react/effect\";\n\nconst infinitePlayersAtom = createEntitiesInfiniteScrollAtom(\n    runtime,\n    new ToriiQueryBuilder().addEntityModel(\"game-Player\"),\n    20 // page size\n);\n\nfunction InfinitePlayerList() {\n    const [state, loadMore] = useAtom(infinitePlayersAtom);\n\n    return Result.match(state, {\n        onSuccess: ({ value }) => (\n            <>\n                <ul>\n                    {value.items.map(p => (\n                        <li key={p.entityId}>{p.models.game.Player.name}</li>\n                    ))}\n                </ul>\n                {value.hasMore && (\n                    <button onClick={loadMore}>Load More</button>\n                )}\n            </>\n        ),\n        onFailure: (error) => <div>Error: {error.message}</div>,\n        onInitial: () => <div>Loading...</div>\n    });\n}\n```\n\n## Token Balance Atoms\n\n```tsx\nimport {\n    createTokenBalanceQueryAtom,\n    createTokenBalanceUpdatesAtom\n} from \"@dojoengine/react/effect\";\n\n// One-time query\nconst balanceAtom = createTokenBalanceQueryAtom(runtime, {\n    contractAddresses: [\"0x...\"],\n    accountAddresses: [playerAddress]\n});\n\n// Polling updates\nconst liveBalanceAtom = createTokenBalanceUpdatesAtom(\n    runtime,\n    { contractAddresses: [\"0x...\"], accountAddresses: [playerAddress] },\n    5000 // poll every 5 seconds\n);\n```\n\n## Data Formatters\n\nTransform data before rendering:\n\n```tsx\nconst formatters = {\n    models: {\n        \"game-Player\": (player) => ({\n            ...player,\n            displayName: player.name || \"Anonymous\",\n            displayScore: `${player.score.toLocaleString()} pts`\n        })\n    },\n    fields: {\n        \"game-Player.score\": (score) => Math.floor(score / 100)\n    }\n};\n\nconst playersAtom = createEntityQueryAtom(runtime, query, formatters);\n```\n\n## Custom Subscription Hooks\n\n```tsx\nimport { createSubscriptionHook } from \"@dojoengine/sdk/react\";\n\nconst usePlayerSubscription = createSubscriptionHook({\n    subscribeMethod: (sdk, params) => sdk.subscribeEntityQuery(params),\n    processInitialData: (data) => data.items,\n    processUpdateData: (update) => update\n});\n\nfunction PlayerTracker({ entityId }) {\n    const { data, error, isLoading } = usePlayerSubscription({\n        query: new ToriiQueryBuilder()\n            .withClause(KeysClause([\"game-Player\"], [entityId]).build())\n    });\n}\n```\n\n## Zustand Selectors\n\nOptimize re-renders with selectors:\n\n```tsx\nfunction PlayerScore({ entityId }) {\n    const { useDojoStore } = useDojoSDK();\n\n    // Only re-render when score changes\n    const score = useDojoStore(\n        state => state.entities[entityId]?.models?.game?.Player?.score,\n        (a, b) => a === b // equality function\n    );\n\n    return <span>{score}</span>;\n}\n```\n\n## useEntityId Hook\n\n```tsx\nimport { useEntityId } from \"@dojoengine/sdk/react\";\n\nfunction PlayerCard({ address, gameId }) {\n    // Memoized entity ID computation\n    const entityId = useEntityId(address, gameId);\n    const player = useModel(entityId, \"game-Player\");\n}\n```\n\n## Error Boundaries\n\n```tsx\nimport { ErrorBoundary } from \"react-error-boundary\";\n\nfunction GameErrorFallback({ error, resetErrorBoundary }) {\n    return (\n        <div>\n            <p>Something went wrong: {error.message}</p>\n            <button onClick={resetErrorBoundary}>Retry</button>\n        </div>\n    );\n}\n\nfunction App() {\n    return (\n        <ErrorBoundary FallbackComponent={GameErrorFallback}>\n            <Game />\n        </ErrorBoundary>\n    );\n}\n```\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n1. **Missing provider**: Ensure DojoSdkProvider wraps all Dojo-using components\n2. **Effect runtime**: Create runtime once at app startup, not in components\n3. **Selector stability**: Use stable selector functions to prevent re-renders\n4. **Cleanup**: Effect atoms handle cleanup, but manual subscriptions need cleanup\n5. **Result.match**: Always handle all three cases (success, failure, initial)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:07:44.956Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced React state management and Starknet integration.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 React 状态管理和 Starknet 集成的前端代理。","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントが高度な React 状態管理と Starknet 統合を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 React 상태 관리 및 Starknet 통합이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced React state management and Starknet integration.","fr":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced React state management and Starknet integration.","de":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced React state management and Starknet integration.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de gerenciamento avançado de estado do React e integração com Starknet.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходим продвинутый менеджмент состояния React и интеграция со Starknet.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الواجهة الأمامية الذي يحتاج إلى إدارة متقدمة ل 상태 React وتكامل Starknet."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage complex async state using Effect atoms, implement infinite scroll, and handle loading/error states with DojoSdkProvider and StarknetConfig, leveraging React provider hierarchy and TypeScript.","zh":"赋予代理管理复杂异步状态使用 Effect 原子、实现无限滚动，并使用 DojoSdkProvider 和 StarknetConfig 处理加载/错误状态，利用 React 提供者层次结构和 TypeScript。","ja":"エージェントが Effect アトムを使用して複雑な非同期状態を管理し、DojoSdkProvider を使用して無限スクロールを実装し、DojoSdkProvider と StarknetConfig を使用してロード/エラー状態を処理し、React プロバイダー階層と TypeScript を活用することができます。","ko":"에이전트가 Effect 원자를 사용하여 복잡한 비동기 상태를 관리하고 DojoSdkProvider를 사용하여 무한 스크롤을 구현하며 DojoSdkProvider 및 StarknetConfig를 사용하여 로딩/오류 상태를 처리하며 React 제공자 계층 및 TypeScript를 활용하도록 합니다.","es":"Empowers agents to manage complex async state using Effect atoms, implement infinite scroll, and handle loading/error states with DojoSdkProvider and StarknetConfig, leveraging React provider hierarchy and TypeScript.","fr":"Empowers agents to manage complex async state using Effect atoms, implement infinite scroll, and handle loading/error states with DojoSdkProvider and StarknetConfig, leveraging React provider hierarchy and TypeScript.","de":"Empowers agents to manage complex async state using Effect atoms, implement infinite scroll, and handle loading/error states with DojoSdkProvider and StarknetConfig, leveraging React provider hierarchy and TypeScript.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar estados assíncronos complexos usando átomos Effect, implementar rolagem infinita e lidar com estados de carregamento/erro usando DojoSdkProvider e StarknetConfig, aproveitando a hierarquia de provedores do React e o TypeScript.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять сложными асинхронными состояниями с помощью атомов Effect, реализовывать бесконечную прокрутку и обрабатывать состояния загрузки/ошибки с помощью DojoSdkProvider и StarknetConfig, используя иерархию провайдеров React и TypeScript.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إدارة حالات متزامنة معقدة باستخدام ذرات Effect وتنفيذ التمرير اللانهائي ومعالجة حالات التحميل/الأخطاء باستخدام DojoSdkProvider وStarknetConfig، واستخدام التسلسل الهرمي لمقدمي React وTypeScript."},"useCases":{"en":["Setting up React provider hierarchies with StarknetConfig","Implementing infinite scroll with DojoSdkProvider","Handling loading/error states using Effect atoms"],"zh":["使用 StarknetConfig 设置 React 提供者层次结构","使用 DojoSdkProvider 实现无限滚动","使用 Effect 原子处理加载/错误状态"],"ja":["StarknetConfig を使用して React プロバイダー階層を設定する","DojoSdkProvider を使用して無限スクロールを実装する","Effect アトムを使用してロード/エラー状態を処理する"],"ko":["StarknetConfig를 사용하여 React 제공자 계층을 설정","DojoSdkProvider를 사용하여 무한 스크롤을 구현","Effect 원자를 사용하여 로딩/오류 상태를 처리"],"es":["Setting up React provider hierarchies with StarknetConfig","Implementing infinite scroll with DojoSdkProvider","Handling loading/error states using Effect atoms"],"fr":["Setting up React provider hierarchies with StarknetConfig","Implementing infinite scroll with DojoSdkProvider","Handling loading/error states using Effect atoms"],"de":["Setting up React provider hierarchies with StarknetConfig","Implementing infinite scroll with DojoSdkProvider","Handling loading/error states using Effect atoms"],"pt":["Configurando hierarquias de provedores do React com StarknetConfig","Implementando rolagem infinita com DojoSdkProvider","Lidando com estados de carregamento/erro usando átomos Effect"],"ru":["Настройка иерархий провайдеров React со StarknetConfig","Реализация бесконечной прокрутки с помощью DojoSdkProvider","Обработка состояний загрузки/ошибки с помощью атомов Effect"],"ar":["تكوين التسلسل الهرمي لمقدمي React مع StarknetConfig","تنفيذ التمرير اللانهائي باستخدام DojoSdkProvider","معالجة حالات التحميل/الأخطاء باستخدام ذرات Effect"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React and TypeScript setup","Dependent on Starknet ecosystem and Dojo SDK"],"zh":["需要 React 和 TypeScript 设置","依赖于 Starknet 生态系统和 Dojo SDK"],"ja":["React と TypeScript の設定が必要","Starknet エコシステムと Dojo SDK 依存"],"ko":["React 및 TypeScript 설정이 필요","Starknet 생태계 및 Dojo SDK 종속"],"es":["Requires React and TypeScript setup","Dependent on Starknet ecosystem and Dojo SDK"],"fr":["Requires React and TypeScript setup","Dependent on Starknet ecosystem and Dojo SDK"],"de":["Requires React and TypeScript setup","Dependent on Starknet ecosystem and Dojo SDK"],"pt":["Requer configuração do React e do TypeScript","Dependente do ecossistema Starknet e do Dojo SDK"],"ru":["Требует настройки React и TypeScript","Зависит от экосистемы Starknet и Dojo SDK"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد React وTypeScript","يعتمد على نظام Starknet وDojo SDK"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
