m","pt":"Especialista em Firestore: Plataforma Moai","ru":"Специалист по Firestore: Платформа Moai","ar":"خبير فايربيس: منصة مواي","en":"moai-platform-firestore"},"description":{"zh":"moai-platform-firestore 是一个 Firebase Firestore 专家，提供实时同步、离线缓存、安全规则和云函数触发器等功能","ja":"moai-platform-firestore は Firebase Firestore スペシャリストで、リアルタイム同期、オフラインキャッシュ、セキュリティルール、クラウド関数トリガーなどの機能を提供します","ko":"moai-platform-firestore는 Firebase Firestore 전문가로 실시간 동기화, 오프라인 캐싱, 보안 규칙 및 클라우드 함수 트리거 등의 기능을 제공합니다","es":"La plataforma Moai se integra con Firebase Firestore para ofrecer una base de datos NoSQL con sincronización en tiempo real y arquitectura offline-first.","fr":"La plateforme Moai s''intègre à Firebase Firestore pour offrir une base de données NoSQL avec synchronisation en temps réel et architecture offline-first.","de":"Die Moai-Plattform integriert sich mit Firebase Firestore, um eine Echtzeit-NoSQL-Datenbank mit offline-first-Architektur anzubieten.","pt":"A plataforma Moai oferece especialização em Firestore, com recursos como sincronização em tempo real e cache offline.","ru":"Платформа Moai предлагает специализацию в Firestore, с функциями như синхронизация в режиме реального времени и кэширование офлайн.","ar":"منصة مواي تقدم تخصصًا في فايربيس، مع ميزات مثل التزامن في الوقت الفعلي والแคش غير المتصل.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["实时同步","离线缓存","安全规则","云函数触发器","移动优化 SDK"],"ja":["リアルタイム同期","オフラインキャッシュ","セキュリティルール","クラウド関数トリガー","モバイル最適化 SDK"],"ko":["실시간 동기화","오프라인 캐싱","보안 규칙","클라우드 함수 트리거","모바일 최적화 SDK"],"es":["Sincronización en tiempo real","Caché offline con IndexedDB","Reglas de seguridad declarativas","Disparadores de Cloud Functions","SDKs optimizados para móviles"],"fr":["Synchronisation en temps réel","Cache hors ligne avec IndexedDB","Règles de sécurité déclaratives","Déclencheurs de Cloud Functions","SDKs optimisés pour les appareils mobiles"],"de":["Echtzeit-Synchronisation","Offline-Cache mit IndexedDB","Deklarative Sicherheitsregeln","Cloud Functions-Trigger","Mobil-optimierte SDKs"],"pt":["Sincronização em tempo real","Cache offline","Regras de segurança","Gatilhos de Cloud Functions","SDKs otimizados para dispositivos móveis"],"ru":["Синхронизация в режиме реального времени","Кэширование офлайн","Правила безопасности","Триггеры Cloud Functions","SDKs для мобильных устройств"],"ar":["التزامن في الوقت الفعلي","الแคش غير المتصل","قواعد الأمان","مفاتيح دوال السحابة","SDKs مُختصة بالأجهزة المحمولة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Firebase Firestore","NoSQL 文档数据库","实时同步","离线缓存","安全规则","云函数触发器","移动优化 SDK"],"ja":["Firebase Firestore","NoSQL ドキュメントデータベース","リアルタイム同期","オフラインキャッシュ","セキュリティルール","クラウド関数トリガー","モバイル最適化 SDK"],"ko":["Firebase Firestore","NoSQL 문서 데이터베이스","실시간 동기화","오프라인 캐싱","보안 규칙","클라우드 함수 트리거","모바일 최적화 SDK"],"es":["Firebase Firestore","base de datos NoSQL","sincronización en tiempo real","arquitectura offline-first","reglas de seguridad","desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles"],"fr":["Firebase Firestore","base de données NoSQL","synchronisation en temps réel","architecture offline-first","règles de sécurité","développement d''applications mobiles"],"de":["Firebase Firestore","NoSQL-Datenbank","Echtzeit-Synchronisation","offline-first-Architektur","Sicherheitsregeln","Mobile-App-Entwicklung"],"pt":["Firestore","Plataforma Moai","NoSQL","Sincronização em tempo real","Cache offline","Regras de segurança","Desenvolvimento de aplicativos móveis","Cloud Functions"],"ru":["Firestore","Платформа Moai","NoSQL","Синхронизация в режиме реального времени","Кэширование офлайн","Правила безопасности","Разработка мобильных приложений","Cloud Functions"],"ar":["فايربيس","منصة مواي","NoSQL","التزامن في الوقت الفعلي","الแคش غير المتصل","قواعد الأمان","تطوير التطبيقات المتنقلة","دوال السحابة"]}},"owner":"yarang","repo":"chatbot_ai_assistant_v2","repoPath":"yarang/chatbot_ai_assistant_v2","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.430Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"moai-platform-firestore","description":"Firebase Firestore specialist covering NoSQL patterns, real-time sync, offline caching, and Security Rules. Use when building mobile-first apps with offline support, implementing real-time listeners, or configuring Firestore security.","version":"2.1.0","tags":["firestore","firebase","nosql","realtime","offline","mobile"],"bodyPreview":"# moai-platform-firestore: Firebase Firestore Specialist\n\n## Quick Reference\n\nFirebase Firestore Expertise: NoSQL document database with real-time synchronization, offline-first architecture, Security Rules, Cloud Functions triggers, and mobile-optimized SDKs.\n\n### Core Capabilities\n\nReal-time Sync provides automatic synchronization across all connected clients.\n\nOffline Caching uses IndexedDB persistence with automatic sync when online.\n\nSecurity Rules offer declarative field-level access contr","body":"# moai-platform-firestore: Firebase Firestore Specialist\n\n## Quick Reference\n\nFirebase Firestore Expertise: NoSQL document database with real-time synchronization, offline-first architecture, Security Rules, Cloud Functions triggers, and mobile-optimized SDKs.\n\n### Core Capabilities\n\nReal-time Sync provides automatic synchronization across all connected clients.\n\nOffline Caching uses IndexedDB persistence with automatic sync when online.\n\nSecurity Rules offer declarative field-level access control.\n\nCloud Functions enable document triggers for server-side processing.\n\nComposite Indexes support complex query optimization.\n\n### When to Use Firestore\n\nUse Firestore for mobile-first applications with offline support, real-time collaborative features, cross-platform apps across iOS, Android, Web, and Flutter, projects requiring Google Cloud integration, and apps with flexible evolving data structures.\n\n### Context7 Documentation Access\n\nStep 1: Resolve the Firebase library ID using mcp__context7__resolve-library-id with libraryName \"firebase\" to get the Context7-compatible library ID.\n\nStep 2: Fetch Firestore documentation using mcp__context7__get-library-docs with the resolved ID. Set topic to specific areas such as \"firestore security-rules\", \"firestore offline\", or \"firestore real-time\". Allocate 6000 to 8000 tokens for comprehensive coverage.\n\n### Module Index\n\nThis skill is organized into specialized modules for deep implementation guidance:\n\nSecurity Rules Module at modules/security-rules.md covers basic rule structure and syntax, role-based access control patterns, custom claims integration, field-level validation, and testing and debugging rules.\n\nOffline and Caching Module at modules/offline-cache.md covers persistent cache configuration, multi-tab manager setup, cache size optimization, sync status handling, and network state management.\n\nReal-time Listeners Module at modules/realtime-listeners.md covers snapshot listener patterns, metadata handling for pending writes, query subscription optimization, listener lifecycle management, and error handling strategies.\n\nTransactions Module at modules/transactions.md covers atomic batch operations, transaction patterns and constraints, distributed counter implementation, conflict resolution strategies, and performance considerations.\n\n---\n\n## Implementation Guide\n\n### Firestore Initialization with Offline Persistence\n\nImport initializeApp from firebase/app and initializeFirestore, persistentLocalCache, persistentMultipleTabManager, and CACHE_SIZE_UNLIMITED from firebase/firestore. Create the app with initializeApp passing the config object containing apiKey, authDomain, and projectId from environment variables. Export the db instance created with initializeFirestore, passing the app and a localCache configuration using persistentLocalCache with tabManager set to persistentMultipleTabManager() and cacheSizeBytes set to CACHE_SIZE_UNLIMITED.\n\n### Basic Security Rules Structure\n\nDefine Security Rules using rules_version 2 and service cloud.firestore. In the databases match block, create a users collection match with userId wildcard allowing read and write if request.auth.uid equals userId. Create a documents collection match with docId wildcard. Allow read if the document isPublic field is true, or if request.auth.uid equals the ownerId field, or if request.auth.uid is in the collaborators array. Allow create if request.auth is not null and the new document ownerId equals request.auth.uid. Allow update and delete if request.auth.uid equals the document ownerId.\n\n### Real-time Listener with Metadata\n\nImport collection, query, where, orderBy, and onSnapshot from firebase/firestore. Create a subscribeToDocuments function taking userId and a callback. Build a query on the documents collection filtering where collaborators array-contains userId and ordering by createdAt descending. Call onSnapshot with the query, includeMetadataChanges set to true, and a callback that maps snapshot.docs to objects containing id, document data spread, _pending set to doc.metadata.hasPendingWrites, and _fromCache set to doc.metadata.fromCache. Return the unsubscribe function.\n\n### Composite Indexes Configuration\n\nDefine indexes in firestore.indexes.json with an indexes array. Each index object specifies collectionGroup, queryScope as COLLECTION, and a fields array. Fields specify fieldPath and either order as ASCENDING or DESCENDING, or arrayConfig as CONTAINS for array fields. Create indexes for common query patterns such as organizationId with createdAt descending, or tags array with createdAt descending.\n\n---\n\n## Performance and Pricing\n\n### Performance Characteristics\n\nRead Latency ranges from 50 to 200 milliseconds depending on region.\n\nWrite Latency ranges from 100 to 300 milliseconds.\n\nReal-time Propagation takes 100 to 500 milliseconds.\n\nOffline Sync occurs automatically on reconnection.\n\n### Free Tier (2024)\n\nStorage: 1GB. Daily Reads: 50,000. Daily Writes: 20,000. Daily Deletes: 20,000.\n\n---\n\n## Works Well With\n\n- moai-platform-firebase-auth for Firebase Authentication integration\n- moai-lang-flutter for Flutter SDK patterns\n- moai-lang-typescript for TypeScript client patterns\n- moai-domain-mobile for mobile architecture patterns\n- moai-quality-security for Security Rules best practices\n\n---\n\n## Additional Resources\n\n- reference.md provides extended documentation and best practices\n- examples.md provides complete working code examples\n- modules/security-rules.md provides Security Rules deep dive\n- modules/offline-cache.md covers offline persistence patterns\n- modules/realtime-listeners.md covers real-time subscription patterns\n- modules/transactions.md covers batch and transaction operations\n\n---\n\nStatus: Production Ready\nGenerated with: MoAI-ADK Skill Factory v2.0\nLast Updated: 2026-01-11\nPlatform: Firebase Firestore\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:08:08.245Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Agents needing real-time NoSQL database synchronization with Firebase Firestore","zh":"适用于需要实时NoSQL数据库同步的Firebase Firestore的云代理","ja":"Firebase FirestoreとのリアルタイムNoSQLデータベース同期が必要なCloud Agentに適しています","ko":"Firebase Firestore와의 실시간 NoSQL 데이터베이스 동기화가 필요한 클라우드 에이전트에게 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Cloud que necesitan sincronización de bases de datos NoSQL en tiempo real con Firebase Firestore","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents Cloud nécessitant une synchronisation de bases de données NoSQL en temps réel avec Firebase Firestore","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Agents, die eine Echtzeit-Synchronisierung von NoSQL-Datenbanken mit Firebase Firestore benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Nuvem que precisam de sincronização de banco de dados NoSQL em tempo real com o Firebase Firestore","ru":"Идеально подходит для облачных агентов, которым требуется синхронизация базы данных NoSQL в режиме реального времени с Firebase Firestore","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء السحابيين الذين يحتاجون إلى مزامنة قاعدة بيانات NoSQL في الوقت الفعلي مع Firebase Firestore"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage real-time synchronization, offline caching with IndexedDB, and declarative Security Rules, while utilizing Cloud Functions triggers and mobile-optimized SDKs for seamless data management","zh":"赋予代理实时同步、离线缓存和声明式安全规则的能力，同时利用Cloud Functions触发器和移动优化的SDK进行无缝的数据管理","ja":"リアルタイム同期、オフラインキャッシュ、宣言的セキュリティルールを利用し、Cloud Functionsトリガーとモバイル最適化されたSDKを使用してシームレスなデータ管理を行うことができます","ko":"실시간 동기화, 오프라인 캐싱 및 선언적 보안 규칙을 사용할 수 있으며, Cloud Functions 트리거와 모바일 최적화된 SDK를 사용하여 무결점 데이터 관리를 수행할 수 있습니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aprovechar la sincronización en tiempo real, la memoria caché offline con IndexedDB y reglas de seguridad declarativas, mientras utiliza triggers de Cloud Functions y SDK optimizados para móviles para un manejo de datos sin problemas","fr":"Permet aux agents de tirer parti de la synchronisation en temps réel, du cache hors ligne avec IndexedDB et des règles de sécurité déclaratives, tout en utilisant des déclencheurs de Cloud Functions et des SDK optimisés pour les mobiles pour une gestion de données transparente","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Echtzeit-Synchronisierung, Offline-Caching mit IndexedDB und deklarative Sicherheitsregeln zu nutzen, während Cloud Functions-Trigger und mobile-optimierte SDKs für eine nahtlose Datenverwaltung verwendet werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitarem a sincronização em tempo real, cache offline com IndexedDB e regras de segurança declarativas, além de utilizar gatilhos de Funções em Nuvem e SDKs otimizados para dispositivos móveis para gerenciamento de dados sem interrupções","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность использовать синхронизацию в режиме реального времени, кэширование в автономном режиме с IndexedDB и декларативные правила безопасности, а также использовать триггеры облачных функций и SDK, оптимизированные для мобильных устройств, для беспрепятственного управления данными","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من الاستفادة من التزامن في الوقت الفعلي وتخزين البيانات غير المتصل مع IndexedDB والقواعد الأمنية الطوعية، بالإضافة إلى استخدام عناصر تحفيز الوظائف السحابية وSDK المحمولة المثبتة للتحكم في البيانات دون انقطاع"},"useCases":{"en":["Synchronizing real-time data across connected clients","Implementing offline-first architecture with automatic sync","Enforcing field-level access control with Security Rules"],"zh":["实时数据在连接的客户端之间的同步","实现离线优先的架构并自动同步","使用安全规则强制字段级访问控制"],"ja":["接続されたクライアント間でのリアルタイムデータの同期","オフライン優先のアーキテクチャを実装し自動同期する","セキュリティルールを使用したフィールドレベルのアクセス制御の適用"],"ko":["연결된 클라이언트 간의 실시간 데이터 동기화","오프라인 우선 아키텍처 구현 및 자동 동기화","보안 규칙을 사용한 필드 수준 액세스 제어 적용"],"es":["Sincronización de datos en tiempo real en clientes conectados","Implementación de arquitectura offline-first con sincronización automática","Aplicación de control de acceso a nivel de campo con reglas de seguridad"],"fr":["Synchronisation de données en temps réel sur des clients connectés","Mise en œuvre d''une architecture offline-first avec synchronisation automatique","Application d''un contrôle d''accès au niveau du champ avec des règles de sécurité"],"de":["Synchronisierung von Echtzeit-Daten über verbundene Clients","Implementierung einer Offline-First-Architektur mit automatischer Synchronisierung","Durchsetzung von feldbasiertem Zugriffsschutz mit Sicherheitsregeln"],"pt":["Sincronizar dados em tempo real em clientes conectados","Implementar arquitetura offline-first com sincronização automática","Aplicar controle de acesso em nível de campo com Regras de Segurança"],"ru":["Синхронизировать данные в режиме реального времени на подключенных клиентах","Реализовать архитектуру offline-first с автоматической синхронизацией","Внедрить контроль доступа на уровне поля с помощью правил безопасности"],"ar":["مزامنة البيانات في الوقت الفعلي على العملاء المتصلين","تنفيذ هندسة أولوية عدم الاتصال مع التزامن التلقائي","تطبيق مراقبة الوصول على مستوى الحقل باستخدام قواعد الأمان"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Firebase Firestore setup and configuration","Dependent on Cloud Functions for trigger functionality","Limited to Firebase ecosystem"],"zh":["需要Firebase Firestore的设置和配置","依赖于Cloud Functions进行触发器功能","仅限于Firebase生态系统"],"ja":["Firebase Firestoreの設定と構成が必要","Cloud Functionsに依存してトリガー機能を実現","Firebaseエコシステムでのみ使用可能"],"ko":["Firebase Firestore 설정 및 구성이 필요함","Cloud Functions에 의존하여 트리거 기능을 구현함","Firebase 생태계에서만 사용 가능"],"es":["Requiere configuración y configuración de Firebase Firestore","Dependiente de Cloud Functions para la funcionalidad de trigger","Limitado al ecosistema de Firebase"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration et une configuration de Firebase Firestore","Dépendant de Cloud Functions pour la fonctionnalité de déclencheur","Limité à l''écosystème de Firebase"],"de":["Benötigt Firebase Firestore-Setup und -Konfiguration","Abhängig von Cloud Functions für Trigger-Funktionalität","Begrenzt auf das Firebase-Ökosystem"],"pt":["Requer configuração e instalação do Firebase Firestore","Depende das Funções em Nuvem para funcionalidade de gatilho","Limitado ao ecossistema do Firebase"],"ru":["Требует настройки и конфигурации Firebase Firestore","Зависит от облачных функций для функциональности триггера","Ограничен экосистемой Firebase"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد وتكوين Firebase Firestore","يعتمد على الوظائف السحابية لوظيفة التفعيل","محدود بنظام Firebase البيئي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('xiaolai/vmark/tiptap-editor', 'community', 'xiaolai', 'vmark', 'xiaolai/vmark', 'tiptap-editor', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.430Z', '2026-02-18T05:08:01.999Z', NULL, '{"id":"xiaolai/vmark/tiptap-editor","name":"tiptap-editor","description":{"zh":"Tiptap 编辑器 API 模式为 vmark 开发提供了清晰的使用指南，帮助开发者高效使用 Tiptap API","ja":"Tiptap エディター API パターンは、vmark 開発者が Tiptap API を効果的に使用できるように設計されています","ko":"Tiptap 에디터 API 패턴은 vmark 개발자를 위한 사용 가이드를 제공하여 Tiptap API의 효율적인 사용을 도와줍니다","es":"El editor Tiptap es una herramienta de markdown enriquecida con funcionalidades avanzadas. Aprende a aprovechar al máximo su API para crear experiencias de edición personalizadas","fr":"L''éditeur Tiptap est un outil de markdown enrichi de fonctionnalités avancées. Découvrez comment exploiter au maximum son API pour créer des expériences d''édition personnalisées","de":"Der Tiptap-Editor ist ein erweitertes Markdown-Tool mit fortgeschrittenen Funktionen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie seine API optimal nutzen, um benutzerdefinierte Bearbeitungserlebnisse zu erstellen","pt":"O Tiptap Editor é uma ferramenta de edição de markdown avançada que ajuda a melhorar a experiência do usuário.","ru":"Tiptap Editor — это продвинутый инструмент редактирования маркдауна, который помогает улучшить опыт пользователя.","ar":"محرر Tiptap هو أداة تحرير markdown متقدمة تساعد على تحسين تجربة المستخدم.","en":"An AI friendly markdown editor."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Tiptap 编辑器 API 模式","ja":"Tiptap エディター API パターン","ko":"Tiptap 에디터 API 패턴","es":"Tiptap Editor: Mejores prácticas de API para desarrolladores","fr":"Tiptap Éditeur : Meilleures pratiques d''API pour les déve...","de":"Tiptap-Editor: Beste API-Praktiken für Entwickler","pt":"Tiptap Editor: Melhor Edição de Markdown","ru":"Tiptap Editor: Лучший Маркдаун-редактор","ar":"محرر Tiptap: تحرير markdown متقدم","en":"tiptap-editor"},"description":{"zh":"Tiptap 编辑器 API 模式为 vmark 开发提供了清晰的使用指南，帮助开发者高效使用 Tiptap API","ja":"Tiptap エディター API パターンは、vmark 開発者が Tiptap API を効果的に使用できるように設計されています","ko":"Tiptap 에디터 API 패턴은 vmark 개발자를 위한 사용 가이드를 제공하여 Tiptap API의 효율적인 사용을 도와줍니다","es":"El editor Tiptap es una herramienta de markdown enriquecida con funcionalidades avanzadas. Aprende a aprovechar al máximo su API para crear experiencias de e...","fr":"L''éditeur Tiptap est un outil de markdown enrichi de fonctionnalités avancées. Découvrez comment exploiter au maximum son API pour créer des expériences d''éd...","de":"Der Tiptap-Editor ist ein erweitertes Markdown-Tool mit fortgeschrittenen Funktionen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie seine API optimal nutzen, um benutzerdefinierte B...","pt":"O Tiptap Editor é uma ferramenta de edição de markdown avançada que ajuda a melhorar a experiência do usuário.","ru":"Tiptap Editor — это продвинутый инструмент редактирования маркдауна, который помогает улучшить опыт пользователя.","ar":"محرر Tiptap هو أداة تحرير markdown متقدمة تساعد على تحسين تجربة المستخدم.","en":"An AI friendly markdown editor."},"definition":{"en":"An AI friendly markdown editor."},"features":{"zh":["格式命令","块类型更改","列表操作","表格操作","内容插入"],"ja":["書式コマンド","ブロックタイプの変更","リスト操作","表操作","コンテンツ挿入"],"ko":["서식 명령","블록 유형 변경","목록 연산","표 연산","콘텐츠 삽입"],"es":["Comandos de formato avanzados","Cambios de tipo de bloque","Operaciones de lista y tabla","Inserción de contenido personalizado","Acceso directo a ProseMirror","Extensiones de tabla de Tiptap"],"fr":["Commandes de format avancées","Changements de type de bloc","Opérations de liste et de tableau","Insertion de contenu personnalisé","Accès direct à ProseMirror","Extensions de tableau Tiptap"],"de":["Erweiterte Formatierungsanweisungen","Blocktypänderungen","Liste- und Tabellenoperationen","Einfügung von benutzerdefiniertem Inhalt","Direkter Zugriff auf ProseMirror","Tiptap-Tabelle-Erweiterungen"],"pt":["Formatos de texto avançados","Alterações de tipo de bloco","Operações de lista","Operações de tabela via extensão","Inserção de conteúdo personalizada"],"ru":["Продвинутые текстовые форматы","Изменения типа блока","Операции со списками","Операции с таблицами через расширение","Пользовательская вставка контента"],"ar":["تنسيقات نص متقدمة","تغييرات نوع الكتلة","عمليات القائمة","عمليات الجدول عبر الامتداد","إدراج المحتوى المخصص"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Tiptap 编辑器","markdown 编辑器","AI 友好","vmark 开发","ProseMirror","高级 API"],"ja":["Tiptap エディター","マークダウン エディター","AI フレンドリー","vmark 開発","ProseMirror","高級 API"],"ko":["Tiptap 에디터","마크다운 에디터","AI 친화적","vmark 개발","ProseMirror","고급 API"],"es":["Tiptap Editor","API de Tiptap","editor de markdown","desarrollo de vmark","patrones de API","ProseMirror","edición de contenido","personalización de editores","desarrollo web"],"fr":["Tiptap Éditeur","API Tiptap","éditeur de markdown","développement de vmark","modèles d''API","ProseMirror","édition de contenu","personnalisation d''éditeurs","développement web"],"de":["Tiptap-Editor","Tiptap-API","Markdown-Editor","vmark-Entwicklung","API-Muster","ProseMirror","Inhaltsbearbeitung","Editor-Anpassung","Webentwicklung"],"pt":["Tiptap Editor","edição de markdown","API de markdown","desenvolvimento web","ferramentas de edição","formatos de texto","manipulação de conteúdo"],"ru":["Tiptap Editor","редактирование маркдауна","API маркдауна","веб-разработка","инструменты редактирования","текстовые форматы","манипулирование контентом"],"ar":["محرر Tiptap","تحرير markdown","واجهة برمجة تطبيقات markdown","تطوير الويب","أدوات تحرير","تنسيقات نص","تنقل المحتوى"]}},"owner":"xiaolai","repo":"vmark","repoPath":"xiaolai/vmark","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.430Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tiptap-editor","description":"Tiptap editor API patterns for vmark WYSIWYG development. Use when working with editor commands, node traversal, selection handling, or format operations.","bodyPreview":"# Tiptap Editor API Patterns\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill documents proper Tiptap API usage patterns for vmark development. It helps distinguish when to use Tiptap''s high-level API vs direct ProseMirror access.\n\n## When to Use Tiptap API\n\n**Always prefer Tiptap API for:**\n- Format commands (bold, italic, underline, etc.)\n- Block type changes (heading, paragraph, code block)\n- List operations (bullet, ordered, toggle, indent/outdent)\n- Table operations via Tiptap table extension\n- Content insertion a","body":"# Tiptap Editor API Patterns\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill documents proper Tiptap API usage patterns for vmark development. It helps distinguish when to use Tiptap''s high-level API vs direct ProseMirror access.\n\n## When to Use Tiptap API\n\n**Always prefer Tiptap API for:**\n- Format commands (bold, italic, underline, etc.)\n- Block type changes (heading, paragraph, code block)\n- List operations (bullet, ordered, toggle, indent/outdent)\n- Table operations via Tiptap table extension\n- Content insertion and replacement\n- Editor state queries (`isActive`, `getAttributes`)\n\n**Tiptap patterns to use:**\n```typescript\n// Direct commands\neditor.commands.toggleBold()\neditor.commands.setHeading({ level: 2 })\neditor.commands.setContent(doc, { emitUpdate: false })\n\n// Chained commands (for multiple operations)\neditor.chain().focus().setHeading({ level: 2 }).run()\neditor.chain().focus().toggleMark(\"underline\").run()\n\n// State queries\neditor.isActive(\"blockquote\")\neditor.isActive(\"heading\", { level: 2 })\neditor.getAttributes(\"link\")\n```\n\n## When Direct ProseMirror is Appropriate\n\n**Use ProseMirror directly for:**\n- Markdown conversion layer (`proseMirrorToMdast.ts`, `mdastToProseMirror.ts`)\n- Multi-cursor/selection subclassing (`MultiSelection.ts`)\n- Custom node views\n- Low-level transaction manipulation\n- Schema-level operations\n\n## Known Issues in vmark\n\n### 1. cursorHandlers.ts Block Boundary Issue\n`src/hooks/mcpBridge/cursorHandlers.ts` uses `doc.textContent` which flattens the document and loses block boundaries. The correct approach is to use `$pos` helpers:\n\n```typescript\n// WRONG - loses block structure\nconst text = doc.textContent;\n\n// RIGHT - respects block boundaries\nconst $pos = doc.resolve(from);\nconst currentNode = $pos.parent;\nconst blockStart = $pos.before($pos.depth);\nconst blockEnd = $pos.after($pos.depth);\n```\n\n### 2. Cursor Sync Drift After WYSIWYG Edits\n`sourceLine` attributes are only set on initial parse. After WYSIWYG edits that add/remove blocks, line numbers no longer match the source. This is a known limitation.\n\n### 3. HtmlNodeView.ts Store Issue\n`src/plugins/markdownArtifacts/HtmlNodeView.ts` writes cursor info to wrong store.\n\n## References\n\n- `references/patterns.md` - Detailed API patterns and $pos usage\n- `references/examples.md` - Real code examples from vmark codebase\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Identify operation type (format, block, selection, traversal)\n2. Check if Tiptap has a built-in command for it\n3. Use `editor.commands.xxx()` for single operations\n4. Use `editor.chain().focus().xxx().run()` when focus is needed or chaining\n5. For node traversal, use `doc.resolve(pos)` to get `$pos` helpers\n6. For state queries, use `editor.isActive()` or `editor.getAttributes()`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:08:01.999Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents requiring advanced markdown editing capabilities, such as Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code, to efficiently format and manage content using Tiptap''s high-level API.","zh":"适合需要高级markdown编辑功能的AI代理，例如Cursor、Windsurf和Claude Code，使用Tiptap的高级API来高效地格式化和管理内容。","ja":"Tiptapの高レベルAPIを使用して効率的にコンテンツを整形および管理できるため、Cursor、Windsurf、Claude Codeなどの高度なMarkdown編集機能を必要とするAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Cursor, Windsurf, Claude Code와 같은 고급 마크다운 편집 기능이 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 적합하며, Tiptap의 고급 API를 사용하여 효율적으로 콘텐츠를 형식화하고 관리할 수 있습니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA que requieren capacidades de edición de markdown avanzadas, como Cursor, Windsurf y Claude Code, para formatar y gestionar contenido de manera eficiente utilizando la API de alto nivel de Tiptap.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA nécessitant des fonctionnalités de modification de markdown avancées, telles que Cursor, Windsurf et Claude Code, pour formatter et gérer le contenu de manière efficace en utilisant l''API de haut niveau de Tiptap.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents, die erweiterte Markdown-Bearbeitungsfunktionen benötigen, wie z.B. Cursor, Windsurf und Claude Code, um Inhalte effizient zu formatieren und zu verwalten, indem sie die hochrangige Tiptap-API nutzen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA que requerem capacidades avançadas de edição de markdown, como Cursor, Windsurf e Claude Code, para formatar e gerenciar conteúdo de forma eficiente usando a API de alto nível do Tiptap.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, требующих расширенных возможностей редактирования markdown, таких как Cursor, Windsurf и Claude Code, для эффективного форматирования и управления контентом с помощью высокоуровневого API Tiptap.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الذكي التي تتطلب قدرات متقدمة لتحرير markdown، مثل Cursor و Windsurf و Claude Code، لإدارة المحتوى وتحسينه بفعالية باستخدام واجهة برمجة التطبيقات عالية المستوى من Tiptap."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage Tiptap''s API for format commands, block type changes, list operations, and table operations via the Tiptap table extension, enhancing content creation and editing with ProseMirror access.","zh":"赋予代理使用Tiptap API执行格式命令、块类型更改、列表操作和表格操作的能力（通过Tiptap表格扩展），并通过ProseMirror访问增强内容创建和编辑。","ja":"Tiptap APIを使用してフォーマットコマンド、ブロックタイプの変更、リスト操作、およびTiptapテーブル拡張機能を介したテーブル操作を実行する機能をエージェントに提供し、ProseMirrorへのアクセスを通じてコンテンツ作成および編集を強化します。","ko":"Tiptap API를 사용하여 형식 명령, 블록 유형 변경, 목록 작업 및 Tiptap 테이블 확장 기능을 통해 테이블 작업을 수행할 수 있는 기능을 에이전트에게 제공하며, ProseMirror 액세스를 통해 콘텐츠 생성 및 편집을 향상합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aprovechar la API de Tiptap para comandos de formato, cambios de tipo de bloque, operaciones de lista y operaciones de tabla a través de la extensión de tabla de Tiptap, lo que mejora la creación y edición de contenido con acceso a ProseMirror.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exploiter l''API de Tiptap pour les commandes de format, les modifications de type de bloc, les opérations de liste et les opérations de tableau via l''extension de tableau de Tiptap, améliorant ainsi la création et la modification de contenu avec l''accès à ProseMirror.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, die Tiptap-API für Formatierungsanweisungen, Blocktypänderungen, Listenvorgänge und Tabellenvorgänge über die Tiptap-Tabellenerweiterung zu nutzen, wodurch die Inhaltserschaffung und -bearbeitung mit ProseMirror-Zugriff verbessert wird.","pt":"Permite que os agentes utilizem a API do Tiptap para comandos de formatação, alterações de tipo de bloco, operações de lista e operações de tabela por meio da extensão de tabela do Tiptap, melhorando a criação e edição de conteúdo com acesso ao ProseMirror.","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать API Tiptap для команд форматирования, изменений типа блока, операций со списками и операций с таблицами через расширение таблицы Tiptap, улучшая создание и редактирование контента с доступом к ProseMirror.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من استخدام واجهة برمجة التطبيقات Tiptap لأوامر التنسيق وتغيير نوع الكتلة وعمليات القائمة وعمليات الجدول من خلال ملحق جدول Tiptap، مما يعزز إنشاء المحتوى وتحريره بإمكانية الوصول إلى ProseMirror."},"useCases":{"en":["Formatting content with bold, italic, and underline commands","Converting block types, such as switching between headings and paragraphs","Managing list operations, including bullet points, ordered lists, and indentation","Inserting content and utilizing the Tiptap table extension for table operations"],"zh":["使用粗体、斜体和下划线命令格式化内容","在标题和段落之间切换等块类型转换","管理列表操作，包括项目符号、有序列表和缩进","插入内容并使用Tiptap表格扩展执行表格操作"],"ja":["ボールド、イタリック、下線コマンドを使用してコンテンツを整形する","見出しと段落の間を切り替えるなどブロックタイプを変更する","リスト操作（項目記号、順序付きリスト、インデントなど）を管理する","コンテンツを挿入し、Tiptapテーブル拡張機能を使用してテーブル操作を実行する"],"ko":["볼드, 이탤릭, 밑줄 명령을 사용하여 콘텐츠를 형식화한다","제목과 단락 사이를 전환하는 등 블록 유형을 변경한다","목록 작업(項目 기호, 순서가 있는 목록, 들여쓰기 등)을 관리한다","콘텐츠를 삽입하고 Tiptap 테이블 확장 기능을 사용하여 테이블 작업을 수행한다"],"es":["Formato de contenido con comandos de negrita, cursiva y subrayado","Conversión de tipos de bloque, como cambiar entre títulos y párrafos","Gestión de operaciones de lista, incluyendo puntos de lista, listas ordenadas y sangría","Inserción de contenido y utilización de la extensión de tabla de Tiptap para operaciones de tabla"],"fr":["Mise en forme de contenu avec des commandes de gras, d''italique et de soulignement","Conversion de types de bloc, comme passer d''un titre à un paragraphe","Gestion des opérations de liste, y compris les points de liste, les listes ordonnées et l''indentation","Insertion de contenu et utilisation de l''extension de tableau de Tiptap pour les opérations de tableau"],"de":["Formatierung von Inhalten mit Fett-, Kursiv- und Unterstrichanweisungen","Umwandlung von Blocktypen, wie z.B. Wechseln zwischen Überschriften und Absätzen","Verwaltung von Listenvorgängen, einschließlich Aufzählungspunkten, sortierten Listen und Einrückung","Einfügen von Inhalten und Nutzung der Tiptap-Tabellenerweiterung für Tabellenvorgänge"],"pt":["Formatar conteúdo com comandos de negrito, itálico e sublinhado","Converter tipos de bloco, como alternar entre títulos e parágrafos","Gerenciar operações de lista, incluindo pontos de bala, listas ordenadas e recuo","Inserir conteúdo e utilizar a extensão de tabela do Tiptap para operações de tabela"],"ru":["Форматировать контент с помощью команд жирного, курсивного и подчёркнутого текста","Преобразовывать типы блоков, такие как переключение между заголовками и абзацами","Управлять операциями со списками, включая маркеры, пронумерованные списки и отступ","Вставлять контент и использовать расширение таблицы Tiptap для операций с таблицами"],"ar":["تنسيق المحتوى بأوامر الغامق والمائل والتسطير","تحويل أنواع الكتلة، مثل التبديل بين العناوين والفقرات","إدارة عمليات القائمة، بما في ذلك نقاط البداية والقوائم المرتبة والتنسيق","إدراج المحتوى واستخدام ملحق جدول Tiptap لعمليات الجدول"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of Tiptap API usage patterns","Direct ProseMirror access may be necessary for advanced customizations"],"zh":["需要了解Tiptap API使用模式","高级自定义可能需要直接ProseMirror访问"],"ja":["Tiptap APIの使用パターンを理解する必要がある","高度なカスタマイズにはProseMirrorへの直接アクセスが必要になる場合がある"],"ko":["Tiptap API 사용 패턴을 이해해야 함","고급 사용자 지정에는 직접 ProseMirror 액세스가 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de los patrones de uso de la API de Tiptap","Es posible que se necesite acceso directo a ProseMirror para personalizaciones avanzadas"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des modèles d''utilisation de l''API de Tiptap","Un accès direct à ProseMirror peut être nécessaire pour des personnalisation avancées"],"de":["Erfordert Verständnis der Nutzungsarten der Tiptap-API","Direkter Zugriff auf ProseMirror kann für erweiterte Anpassungen erforderlich sein"],"pt":["Requer entendimento dos padrões de uso da API do Tiptap","O acesso direto ao ProseMirror pode ser necessário para personalizações avançadas"],"ru":["Требует понимания шаблонов использования API Tiptap","Прямой доступ к ProseMirror может быть необходим для расширенных настроек"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم أنماط استخدام واجهة برمجة التطبيقات Tiptap","يمكن أن يكون الوصول المباشر إلى ProseMirror ضروريًا لتحسينات متقدمة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
