rísticas de software con investigación estructurada, planificación y ejecución en capas para desarrolladores full-stack","fr":"Mise en œuvre de fonctionnalités logicielles avec investigation structurée, planification et exécution en couches pour les développeurs full-stack","de":"Implementierung von Software-Funktionen mit strukturierter Untersuchung, Planung und schichtweiser Ausführung für Full-Stack-Entwickler","pt":"Implemente recursos novos de ponta a ponta com investigação estruturada e execução em camadas em .NET e Angular.","ru":"Реализуйте новые функции от начала до конца с помощью структурированного исследования и многослойного выполнения в .NET и Angular.","ar":"نفذ الميزات الجديدة من النهاية إلى النهاية مع التحقيق المنظم والتنفيذ المتعدد الطبقات في .NET و Angular.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["结构化调查","分层执行","Domain > Persistence > Application > API > Frontend","风险评估","验证"],"ja":["構造化調査","階層化実行","ドメイン > 永続性 > アプリケーション > API > フロントエンド","リスク評価","検証"],"ko":["구조화된 조사","계층적 실행","도메인 > 지속성 > 애플리케이션 > API > 프론트엔드","위험 평가","검증"],"es":["Investigación estructurada","Planificación y ejecución en capas","Implementación de características de software","Verificación y prueba","Desarrollo full-stack con .NET y Angular"],"fr":["Investigation structurée","Planification et exécution en couches","Mise en œuvre de fonctionnalités logicielles","Vérification et test","Développement full-stack avec .NET et Angular"],"de":["Strukturierte Untersuchung","Planung und schichtweise Ausführung","Implementierung von Software-Funktionen","Verifizierung und Test","Full-Stack-Entwicklung mit .NET und Angular"],"pt":["Investigação estruturada","Execução em camadas","Desenvolvimento full-stack em .NET e Angular","Verificação e teste","Planejamento e gestão de projetos"],"ru":["Структурированное исследование","Многослойное выполнение","Разработка полного стека на .NET и Angular","Проверка и тестирование","Планирование и управление проектами"],"ar":["التحقيق المنظم","التنفيذ المتعدد الطبقات","تطوير متعدد الطبقات في .NET و Angular","التحقق والاختبار","التخطيط وإدارة المشاريع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["全栈开发","NET","Angular","功能实现","结构化调查","分层执行"],"ja":["フルスタック開発","NET","Angular","機能実装","構造化調査","階層化実行"],"ko":["풀스택 개발","NET","Angular","기능 구현","구조화된 조사","계층적 실행"],"es":["implementación de características","desarrollo full-stack","investigación estructurada","planificación y ejecución en capas","verificación y prueba","NET","Angular"],"fr":["mise en œuvre de fonctionnalités","développement full-stack","investigation structurée","planification et exécution en couches","vérification et test","NET","Angular"],"de":["Implementierung von Funktionen","Full-Stack-Entwicklung","strukturierte Untersuchung","Planung und schichtweise Ausführung","Verifizierung und Test","NET","Angular"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de software","implementação de recursos","full-stack",".NET","Angular","investigação estruturada","execução em camadas","verificação e teste"],"ru":["разработка программного обеспечения","реализация функций","полный стек",".NET","Angular","структурированное исследование","многослойное выполнение","проверка и тестирование"],"ar":["تطوير البرمجيات","تنفيذ الميزات","متعدد الطبقات",".NET","Angular","التحقيق المنظم","التنفيذ المتعدد الطبقات","التحقق والاختبار"]}},"owner":"duc01226","repo":"EasyPlatform","repoPath":"duc01226/EasyPlatform","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.430Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"feature","description":"[Implementation] Use when the user asks to implement a new feature, enhancement, add functionality, build something new, or create new capabilities. Triggers on keywords like implement, add feature, build, create new, develop, enhancement.","bodyPreview":"# Feature Implementation\n\nExpert full-stack .NET + Angular implementation skill with structured investigation, planning, and layered execution.\n\n## Summary\n\n**Goal:** Implement new features end-to-end with structured investigation, layered execution (Domain > Persistence > Application > API > Frontend), and verification.\n\n| Step | Action | Key Notes |\n|------|--------|-----------|\n| 1 | Design Intent | State WHAT+WHY, risks, guiding principle in 3 sentences |\n| 2 | Investigate | Decompose requir","body":"# Feature Implementation\n\nExpert full-stack .NET + Angular implementation skill with structured investigation, planning, and layered execution.\n\n## Summary\n\n**Goal:** Implement new features end-to-end with structured investigation, layered execution (Domain > Persistence > Application > API > Frontend), and verification.\n\n| Step | Action | Key Notes |\n|------|--------|-----------|\n| 1 | Design Intent | State WHAT+WHY, risks, guiding principle in 3 sentences |\n| 2 | Investigate | Decompose requirements, search codebase for related patterns |\n| 3 | Knowledge graph | Build analysis in `.ai/workspace/analysis/{feature}.md` |\n| 4 | Plan | Layered implementation plan (backend bottom-up, frontend service-first) |\n| 5 | Approval gate | Present plan -- DO NOT proceed without user approval |\n| 6 | Execute | Implement layer-by-layer following approved plan |\n| 7 | Verify | Type checks, tests, integration validation |\n\n**Key Principles:**\n- Evidence-based: verify assumptions with grep/search before implementing\n- Platform-first: use EasyPlatform patterns; CQRS Command+Result+Handler in ONE file\n- Logic in LOWEST layer: Entity > Service > Component\n\n## Mode Selection\n\n| Mode                      | Flag           | Behavior                                                                             |\n| ------------------------- | -------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Interactive** (default) | _(none)_       | Approval gates at plan + execution; user feedback loop                               |\n| **Autonomous**            | `--autonomous` | Structured headless workflow; approval gate at plan only, then execute to completion |\n\n## Workflow Overview\n\n1. **Design Intent** -- State WHAT+WHY, risks, guiding principle in 3 sentences\n2. **Investigate** -- Decompose requirements, search codebase for related entities/patterns/boundaries\n3. **Knowledge Graph** -- Build structured analysis in `.ai/workspace/analysis/{feature}.md`\n4. **Plan** -- Generate layered implementation plan (Domain > Persistence > Application > API > Frontend)\n5. **Approval Gate** -- Present plan for user approval; do NOT proceed without it\n6. **Execute** -- Implement layer-by-layer following approved plan\n7. **Verify** -- Type checks, tests, integration validation\n\n> **⚠️ MUST READ** `.claude/skills/feature/references/implementation-workflow.md` for detailed phase instructions.\n\n## ⚠️ MUST READ Before Implementation\n\n**IMPORTANT: You MUST read these files before starting. Do NOT skip.**\n\n- **⚠️ MUST READ** `.claude/skills/shared/anti-hallucination-protocol.md` — validation checkpoints\n- **⚠️ MUST READ** `.claude/skills/shared/knowledge-graph-template.md` — per-file analysis structure\n- **⚠️ MUST READ** `CLAUDE.md` — codebase instructions and platform patterns\n\n## Implementation Order\n\n### Backend (bottom-up)\n\n1. Domain Layer -- Entity, expressions, value objects\n2. Persistence Layer -- Configuration, migration\n3. Application Layer -- DTOs, commands, queries, event handlers\n4. API Layer -- Controller endpoints\n\n### Frontend (service-first)\n\n1. API Service -- `PlatformApiService` extension\n2. Store -- `PlatformVmStore` state management\n3. Components -- `AppBaseVmStoreComponent` / `AppBaseFormComponent`\n4. Routing -- Route definitions and guards\n\n## Approval Gate Format\n\n```markdown\n## Implementation Plan Complete - Approval Required\n\n### Summary\n[Brief description]\n\n### Files to Create\n1. `path/to/file` - [purpose]\n\n### Files to Modify\n1. `path/to/file:line` - [change description]\n\n### Implementation Order\n1. [Step 1] ... N. [Step N]\n\n### Risks & Considerations\n- [Risk 1]\n\n**Awaiting approval to proceed with implementation.**\n```\n\n## Execution Safeguards\n\n- Verify file exists before modification\n- Read current content before editing\n- Check conflicts with existing code\n- Validate changes against platform patterns\n- If any step fails: HALT, report failure, return to approval gate\n\n## Post-Implementation\n\n- Verify against all requirements\n- Document under `## Success Validation` heading\n- Summarize changes in `changelog.md`\n\n> **⚠️ MUST READ** `.claude/skills/feature/references/validation-checklist.md` for verification items.\n> **⚠️ MUST READ** `.claude/skills/feature/references/ep-file-locations.md` for path reference and related skills.\n\n## Coding Guidelines\n\n- Evidence-based: verify assumptions with grep/search\n- Platform-first: use established EasyPlatform patterns\n- Cross-service: use event bus, never direct DB access\n- CQRS: Command + Result + Handler in ONE file\n- Logic in LOWEST layer: Entity > Service > Component\n\n\n## IMPORTANT Task Planning Notes\n\n- Always plan and break many small todo tasks\n- Always add a final review todo task to review the works done at the end to find any fix or enhancement needed\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:08:56.933Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full-Stack Agents needing structured feature implementation with .NET and Angular","zh":"非常适合需要使用 .NET 和 Angular 实现结构化特性的全栈代理","ja":".NET と Angular を使用して構造化された機能の実装が必要なフルスタックエージェントに最適","ko":".NET과 Angular을 사용하여 구조화된 기능 구현이 필요한 풀스택 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes Full-Stack que necesitan implementación estructurada de funciones con .NET y Angular","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full-Stack nécessitant une implémentation structurée de fonctionnalités avec .NET et Angular","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agenten, die strukturierte Funktionsimplementierung mit .NET und Angular benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full-Stack que necessitam de implementação de recursos estruturados com .NET e Angular","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Full-Stack, которым необходима структурированная реализация функций с использованием .NET и Angular","ar":"مثالي لعميل.Full-Stack الذي يحتاج إلى تنفيذ ميزات منظم مع .NET و Angular"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement new features end-to-end with layered execution, including Domain, Persistence, Application, API, and Frontend, using structured investigation and verification, leveraging .NET and Angular for robust full-stack development","zh":"赋予代理实现从头到尾的新功能，包括使用结构化调查和验证，利用 .NET 和 Angular 进行分层执行，包括域、持久性、应用程序、API 和前端","ja":"エージェントが新しい機能をエンドツーエンドで実装できるようにし、構造化された調査と検証を使用して、.NET と Angular を使用したロバストなフルスタック開発で、ドメイン、永続性、アプリケーション、API、フロントエンドを含む分層実行を実行","ko":"에이전트가 새로운 기능을 끝까지 구현할 수 있도록 하며, 구조화된 조사와 검증을 사용하여, .NET과 Angular을 사용한 강력한 풀스택 개발에서, 도메인, 지속성, 애플리케이션, API, 프론트엔드 등을 포함한 계층적 실행을 수행","es":"Permite a los agentes implementar nuevas funciones de extremo a extremo con ejecución por capas, incluyendo Dominio, Persistencia, Aplicación, API y Frontend, utilizando investigación y verificación estructuradas, aprovechando .NET y Angular para un desarrollo full-stack robusto","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre de nouvelles fonctionnalités de bout en bout avec une exécution en couches, incluant Domaine, Persistance, Application, API et Frontend, en utilisant une investigation et une vérification structurées, tirant parti de .NET et Angular pour un développement full-stack robuste","de":"Ermöglicht Agenten die end-to-end-Implementierung neuer Funktionen mit geschichteter Ausführung, einschließlich Domain, Persistence, Application, API und Frontend, unter Verwendung strukturierter Untersuchung und Verifizierung, unter Nutzung von .NET und Angular für robuste Full-Stack-Entwicklung","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar novos recursos de ponta a ponta com execução em camadas, incluindo Domínio, Persistência, Aplicação, API e Frontend, usando investigação e verificação estruturadas, aproveitando .NET e A