n Zenoh ohne ROS2-Umgebung","Kompatibilität mit verschiedenen Nachrichtentypen","Organisierte Projektstruktur","Unterstützung für Trajektorien, Sensoren und Geometrien"],"pt":["Criação de exemplos de publicação e assinatura","Suporte a diferentes tipos de mensagens ROS2","Integração com o sdk Zenoh-ROS2","Exemplos de código em Python","Estrutura de projeto organizada"],"ru":["Создание примеров публикации и подписки","Поддержка различных типов сообщений ROS2","Интеграция с sdk Zenoh-ROS2","Примеры кода на Python","Организованная структура проекта"],"ar":["إنشاء أمثلة لنشر وإشترك","دعم أنواع مختلفة من رسائل ROS2","التكامل مع sdk Zenoh-ROS2","أمثلة код في Python","هيكل مشروع منظم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["ROS 2","Zenoh","Python SDK","通信示例","create-example","ROS2","消息类型","发布/订阅"],"ja":["ROS 2","Zenoh","Python SDK","コミュニケーションの例","create-example","ROS2","メッセージタイプ","パブリッシュ/サブスクライブ"],"ko":["ROS 2","Zenoh","Python SDK","통신 예제","create-example","ROS2","메시지 유형","발행/구독"],"es":["ROS 2","Zenoh","SDK de Python","comunicación ROS 2","publicación y suscripción","entorno ROS2","ejemplos de ROS 2"],"fr":["ROS 2","Zenoh","SDK Python","communication ROS 2","publication et abonnement","environnement ROS2","exemples de ROS 2"],"de":["ROS 2","Zenoh","Python-SDK","ROS 2-Kommunikation","Veröffentlichung und Abonnement","ROS2-Umgebung","Beispiele für ROS 2"],"pt":["ROS 2","Zenoh","sdk Zenoh-ROS2","publicação e assinatura","Python","comunicação ROS 2","desenvolvimento de software","automação"],"ru":["ROS 2","Zenoh","sdk Zenoh-ROS2","публикация и подписка","Python","связь ROS 2","разработка программного обеспечения","автоматизация"],"ar":["ROS 2","Zenoh","sdk Zenoh-ROS2","نشر وإشترك","Python","اتصال ROS 2","تطوير البرمجيات","الآلية"]}},"owner":"ROBOTIS-GIT","repo":"zenoh_ros2_sdk","repoPath":"ROBOTIS-GIT/zenoh_ros2_sdk","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.430Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"create-example","description":"Create new publish/subscribe examples for ROS2 message types. Use when the user wants to add a new example, create pub/sub for a new message type, or add trajectory/sensor/geometry message examples.","bodyPreview":"# Create Example\n\nThis skill guides you through creating new publish/subscribe examples for the zenoh-ros2-sdk.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- User wants to add a new example for a message type\n- User wants to create publisher/subscriber for a new ROS2 message\n- Adding support for trajectory, sensor, geometry, or other message types\n\n## Project Structure\n\nExamples are in `examples/` with numbered filenames:\n- Odd numbers: publishers (e.g., `11_publish_*.py`)\n- Even numbers: subscribers (e.g., `12_subscribe_","body":"# Create Example\n\nThis skill guides you through creating new publish/subscribe examples for the zenoh-ros2-sdk.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- User wants to add a new example for a message type\n- User wants to create publisher/subscriber for a new ROS2 message\n- Adding support for trajectory, sensor, geometry, or other message types\n\n## Project Structure\n\nExamples are in `examples/` with numbered filenames:\n- Odd numbers: publishers (e.g., `11_publish_*.py`)\n- Even numbers: subscribers (e.g., `12_subscribe_*.py`)\n\n## 1. Determine Next Example Numbers\n\nCheck existing examples in `examples/` directory. Use the next available odd number for publisher, next even for subscriber.\n\n## 2. Look Up Message Definition\n\nFind the ROS2 message definition. Key resources:\n- https://docs.ros2.org/foxy/api/{package}/msg/{MessageName}.html\n- Common packages: `std_msgs`, `geometry_msgs`, `sensor_msgs`, `trajectory_msgs`, `nav_msgs`\n\n## 3. Publisher Template\n\nCreate `examples/{NN}_publish_{msg_name}.py`:\n\n```python\n#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"\n{NN} - Publish {MessageName} Messages\n\nDemonstrates how to publish {package}/msg/{MessageName} messages to a ROS2 topic.\n{Brief description of what this message type is used for.}\n\"\"\"\nimport time\nimport numpy as np\n\nfrom zenoh_ros2_sdk import ROS2Publisher, get_message_class\n\n\ndef main():\n    print(\"{NN} - Publish {MessageName} Messages\")\n    print(\"Publishing to /{topic_name} topic...\\n\")\n\n    # Get message classes for easy object creation\n    Header = get_message_class(\"std_msgs/msg/Header\")\n    Time = get_message_class(\"builtin_interfaces/msg/Time\")\n    {MessageName} = get_message_class(\"{package}/msg/{MessageName}\")\n    # Add nested message classes as needed\n\n    if not all([Header, Time, {MessageName}]):\n        print(\"Error: Failed to get message classes\")\n        return\n\n    # Create publisher\n    pub = ROS2Publisher(\n        topic=\"/{topic_name}\",\n        msg_type=\"{package}/msg/{MessageName}\"\n    )\n\n    try:\n        print(\"Publishing {MessageName} messages...\")\n        print(\"Press Ctrl+C to stop\\n\")\n\n        counter = 0\n        while True:\n            # Get current time\n            now = time.time()\n            sec = int(now)\n            nanosec = int((now - sec) * 1e9)\n\n            # Create header with timestamp\n            header = Header(\n                stamp=Time(sec=sec, nanosec=nanosec),\n                frame_id=\"base_link\"\n            )\n\n            # Create and populate message fields\n            # Note: Arrays need to be numpy arrays for proper serialization\n\n            # Publish message - pass fields as kwargs matching message structure\n            pub.publish(\n                header=header,\n                # ... other fields\n            )\n\n            print(f\"Published {MessageName} {counter}\")\n            counter += 1\n            time.sleep(0.1)  # 10 Hz\n\n    except KeyboardInterrupt:\n        print(\"\\nInterrupted by user\")\n    finally:\n        pub.close()\n        print(\"Publisher closed\")\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 4. Subscriber Template\n\nCreate `examples/{NN+1}_subscribe_{msg_name}.py`:\n\n```python\n#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"\n{NN+1} - Subscribe to {MessageName} Messages\n\nDemonstrates how to subscribe to a ROS2 topic and receive {package}/msg/{MessageName} messages.\n{Brief description of what this message type is used for.}\n\"\"\"\nimport time\n\nfrom zenoh_ros2_sdk import ROS2Subscriber\n\n\ndef main():\n    print(\"{NN+1} - Subscribe to {MessageName} Messages\")\n    print(\"Subscribing to /{topic_name} topic...\\n\")\n\n    message_count = [0]  # Use list to allow modification in nested function\n\n    def on_message(msg):\n        \"\"\"Callback function called when a {MessageName} message is received.\"\"\"\n        message_count[0] += 1\n\n        # Extract information from the message\n        timestamp = msg.header.stamp\n        frame_id = msg.header.frame_id\n        # ... extract other fields\n\n        # Display received data\n        print(f\"\\n--- {MessageName} Message #{message_count[0]} ---\")\n        print(f\"Timestamp: {timestamp.sec}.{timestamp.nanosec:09d}\")\n        print(f\"Frame ID: {frame_id}\")\n        # ... print other fields\n\n    # Create subscriber\n    sub = ROS2Subscriber(\n        topic=\"/{topic_name}\",\n        msg_type=\"{package}/msg/{MessageName}\",\n        callback=on_message\n    )\n\n    try:\n        print(\"Waiting for {MessageName} messages... Press Ctrl+C to stop\")\n        while True:\n            time.sleep(0.1)\n    except KeyboardInterrupt:\n        print(\"\\nInterrupted by user\")\n    finally:\n        sub.close()\n        print(\"Subscriber closed\")\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 5. Update README\n\nAdd entries to `examples/README.md`:\n\n```markdown\n### [`{NN}_publish_{msg_name}.py`]({NN}_publish_{msg_name}.py)\nDemonstrates how to publish `{package}/msg/{MessageName}` messages. {Description}.\n\n**Usage:**\n\\```bash\npython3 examples/{NN}_publish_{msg_name}.py\n\\```\n\n### [`{NN+1}_subscribe_{msg_name}.py`]({NN+1}_subscribe_{msg_name}.py)\nDemonstrates how to subscribe to `{package}/msg/{MessageName}` messages. {Description}.\n\n**Usage:**\n\\```bash\npython3 examples/{NN+1}_subscribe_{msg_name}.py\n\\```\n```\n\n## 6. Key Patterns\n\n### Arrays\nUse numpy arrays for proper CDR serialization:\n```python\npositions = np.array([0.0, 0.1, 0.2], dtype=np.float64)\n```\n\n### Nested Messages\nGet nested message classes and construct them:\n```python\nPoint = get_message_class(\"trajectory_msgs/msg/JointTrajectoryPoint\")\nDuration = get_message_class(\"builtin_interfaces/msg/Duration\")\n\npoint = Point(\n    positions=np.array([0.0, 0.1], dtype=np.float64),\n    time_from_start=Duration(sec=1, nanosec=0)\n)\n```\n\n### Common Topic Names\n- `/joint_states` - JointState\n- `/cmd_vel` - Twist\n- `/joint_trajectory` - JointTrajectory\n- `/odom` - Odometry\n- `/tf` - TransformStamped\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:09:09.291Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for ROS 2 Agents requiring seamless communication via Zenoh without a ROS2 environment","zh":"适用于需要通过 Zenoh 进行无缝通信的 ROS 2 代理，无需 ROS2 环境","ja":"ROS 2 エージェントが Zenoh を使用して無停止通信を行う必要がある場合に適しています。ROS2 環境は不要です","ko":"ROS2 환경 없이 Zenoh를 통해 무중단 통신이 필요한 ROS 2 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes ROS 2 que requieren una comunicación sin problemas a través de Zenoh sin un entorno ROS2","fr":"Idéal pour les agents ROS 2 nécessitant une communication transparente via Zenoh sans environnement ROS2","de":"Ideal für ROS-2-Agents, die eine nahtlose Kommunikation über Zenoh ohne ROS2-Umgebung erfordern","pt":"Ideal para agentes ROS 2 que requerem comunicação sem interrupções via Zenoh sem um ambiente ROS2","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ROS 2, требующих бесперебойной связи через Zenoh без среды ROS2","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء ROS 2 الذين يحتاجون إلى اتصال متواصل عبر Zenoh بدون بيئة ROS2"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create publish/subscribe examples for the zenoh-ros2-sdk, supporting trajectory, sensor, geometry, and other message types via Python SDK, enabling efficient ROS 2 communication without a traditional ROS2 setup","zh":"赋予代理创建发布/订阅示例的能力，通过 Python SDK 支持 trajectory、sensor、geometry 等消息类型，实现高效的 ROS 2 通信，无需传统的 ROS2 设置","ja":"エージェントが zenoh-ros2-sdk の発行/購読の例を作成できるようにし、Python SDK を使用して trajectory、sensor、geometry などのメッセージ タイプをサポートし、従来の ROS2 環境を使用せずに効率的な ROS 2 通信を可能にします","ko":"에이전트가 zenoh-ros2-sdk의 발행/구독 예제를 생성할 수 있도록 하여 Python SDK를 사용하여 trajectory, sensor, geometry 등의 메시지 유형을 지원하고 전통적인 ROS2 설정 없이 효율적인 ROS 2 통신을 가능하게 합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear ejemplos de publicación/suscripción para el zenoh-ros2-sdk, que admiten tipos de mensajes de trayectoria, sensor, geometría y otros a través del SDK de Python, lo que permite una comunicación ROS 2 eficiente sin una configuración tradicional de ROS2","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des exemples de publication/abonnement pour le zenoh-ros2-sdk, prenant en charge les types de messages de trajectoire, de capteur, de géométrie et d''autres via le SDK Python, permettant une communication ROS 2 efficace sans une configuration traditionnelle de ROS2","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Veröffentlichungs-/Abonnementbeispiele für das zenoh-ros2-sdk zu erstellen, die Trajektions-, Sensor-, Geometrie- und andere Nachrichtentypen über das Python-SDK unterstützen, wodurch eine effiziente ROS-2-Kommunikation ohne herkömmliche ROS2-Konfiguration ermöglicht wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar exemplos de publicação/assinatura para o zenoh-ros2-sdk, suportando trajetória, sensor, geometria e outros tipos de mensagens via Python SDK, permitindo uma comunicação ROS 2 eficiente sem uma configuração tradicional ROS2","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать примеры публикации/подписки для zenoh-ros2-sdk, поддерживающие траекторию, датчики, геометрию и другие типы сообщений через Python SDK, обеспечивая эффективную связь ROS 2 без традиционной настройки ROS2","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء أمثلة لنشر/التحقق من zenoh-ros2-sdk ، ودعم المسار والحساسات والهندسة المعمارية وأنواع الرسائل الأخرى عبر Python SDK ، وتمكين الاتصال الفعال ROS 2 بدون إعداد ROS2 تقليدي"},"useCases":{"en":["Creating custom publishers for new ROS2 message types","Developing subscribers for specific sensor data","Adding support for geometry messages in robotic applications"],"zh":["为新的 ROS2 消息类型创建自定义发布者","为特定传感器数据开发订阅者","在机器人应用中添加对几何消息的支持"],"ja":["新しい ROS2 メッセージ タイプのカスタム パブリッシャーを作成する","特定のセンサー データのサブスクライバーを開発する","ロボット アプリケーションで幾何学メッセージをサポートする"],"ko":["新的 ROS2 메시지 유형을 위한 사용자 지정 발행자 생성","특정 센서 데이터를 위한 구독자 개발","로봇 애플리케이션에서 기하 메시지를 지원하는 기능 추가"],"es":["Crear editores personalizados para nuevos tipos de mensajes ROS2","Desarrollar suscriptores para datos de sensores específicos","Agregar soporte para mensajes de geometría en aplicaciones robóticas"],"fr":["Créer des éditeurs personnalisés pour de nouveaux types de messages ROS2","Développer des abonnés pour des données de capteurs spécifiques","Ajouter la prise en charge des messages de géométrie dans les applications robotiques"],"de":["Erstellen von benutzerdefinierten Verlegern für neue ROS2-Nachrichtentypen","Entwickeln von Abonnenten für spezifische Sensordaten","Hinzufügen der Unterstützung für Geometrienachrichten in Roboteranwendungen"],"pt":["Criação de publicadores personalizados para novos tipos de mensagens ROS2","Desenvolvimento de assinantes para dados de sensores específicos","Adicionando suporte a mensagens de geometria em aplicações robóticas"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских публикаторов для новых типов сообщений ROS2","Разработка подписчиков для конкретных данных сенсоров","Добавление поддержки сообщений геометрии в роботизированных приложениях"],"ar":["إنشاء ناشرين مخصصين لأنواع رسائل ROS2 الجديدة","تطوير المشتركين لبيانات الحساسات الخاصة","إضافة دعم لرسائل الهندسة المعمارية في التطبيقات الروبوتية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment","Specific to ROS 2 and Zenoh communication protocol"],"zh":["需要 Python 环境","仅限 ROS 2 和 Zenoh 通信协议"],"ja":["Python 環境が必要","ROS 2 と Zenoh 通信プロトコルに特化"],"ko":["Python 환경 필요","ROS 2와 Zenoh 통신 프로토콜 전용"],"es":["Requiere entorno de Python","Específico para el protocolo de comunicación ROS 2 y Zenoh"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python","Spécifique au protocole de communication ROS 2 et Zenoh"],"de":["Benötigt Python-Umgebung","Spezifisch für das ROS-2- und Zenoh-Kommunikationsprotokoll"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Python","Específico para comunicação ROS 2 e protocolo Zenoh"],"ru":["Требуется среда Python","Конкретно для связи ROS 2 и протокола Zenoh"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة بايثون","محدد للاتصال ROS 2 وبروتوكول Zenoh"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
