Wi-Fi et Bluetooth","Modems cellulaires et petites cellules","Gestion d''énergie et suivi d''enveloppe"],"de":["Mobile-Plattformen Snapdragon","IoT- und Embedded-Lösungen","RF-Module und Antennen","Drahtlose Konnektivität Wi-Fi und Bluetooth","Mobilfunkmodems und Kleinzellen","Energiemanagement und Hüllkurvenverfolgung"],"pt":["Plataformas móveis Snapdragon","Solucões de conectividade Wi-Fi/Bluetooth","Módulos de RF e antenas","Processadores de aplicação","Plataformas de IoT"],"ru":["Мобильные платформы Snapdragon","Решения для подключения Wi-Fi/Bluetooth","Модули RF и антенны","Программные процессоры","Платформы IoT"],"ar":["منصات الموبايل سنابدراجون","حلول الاتصال اللاسلكي وبلوتوث","وحدات RF والهوائيات","معالجات التطبيقات","منصات أجهزة联网"]},"keywords":{"zh":["高通公司","移动SoC","物联网","射频前端","无线连接","小型基站","芯片设计","半导体公司"],"ja":["Qualcomm","モバイルSoC","IoT","RFフロントエンド","ワイヤレス接続","小型基地局","チップ設計","半導体企業"],"ko":["퀄컴","모바일 SoC","IoT","RF 프론트엔드","무선 연결","소형 기지국","칩 디자인","반도체 회사"],"es":["Qualcomm","semiconductores","móviles","IoT","conectividad inalámbrica","Snapdragon","RF","antenas","módems celulares","gestión de energía"],"fr":["Qualcomm","semiconducteurs","mobiles","IoT","connectivité sans fil","Snapdragon","RF","antennes","modems cellulaires","gestion d''énergie"],"de":["Qualcomm","Halbleiter","Mobile","IoT","drahtlose Konnektivität","Snapdragon","RF","Antennen","Mobilfunkmodems","Energiemanagement"],"pt":["Qualcomm","semicondutores","plataformas móveis","conectividade","Snapdragon","IoT","RF","antenas","processadores de aplicação"],"ru":["Qualcomm","полупроводники","мобильные платформы","подключение","Snapdragon","IoT","RF","антенны","программные процессоры"],"ar":["كوالكوم","أشباه الموصلات","منصات الموبايل","اتصال","سنابدراجون","أجهزة联网","RF","الهوائيات","معالجات التطبيقات"]}},"owner":"Cantara","repo":"lib-electronic-components","repoPath":"Cantara/lib-electronic-components","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.430Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"qualcomm","description":"Qualcomm MPN encoding patterns, suffix decoding, and handler guidance. Use when working with Qualcomm mobile SoCs, RF front-end, WiFi/Bluetooth, modems, or power management ICs.","bodyPreview":"# Qualcomm Manufacturer Skill\n\n## Company Overview\n\nQualcomm is a leading fabless semiconductor company specializing in:\n\n- **Mobile SoCs**: Snapdragon mobile platforms (SM, SD, QSD, MSM series)\n- **IoT/Embedded**: QCS/QCM IoT platforms, APQ application processors, IPQ network processors\n- **RF Front-End**: RF modules (QM), power modules (QPM), antenna tuners (QAT), envelope trackers (QET)\n- **Wireless Connectivity**: WiFi/Bluetooth (QCA, WCN), cellular modems (MDM), small cell (FSM)\n- **Power M","body":"# Qualcomm Manufacturer Skill\n\n## Company Overview\n\nQualcomm is a leading fabless semiconductor company specializing in:\n\n- **Mobile SoCs**: Snapdragon mobile platforms (SM, SD, QSD, MSM series)\n- **IoT/Embedded**: QCS/QCM IoT platforms, APQ application processors, IPQ network processors\n- **RF Front-End**: RF modules (QM), power modules (QPM), antenna tuners (QAT), envelope trackers (QET)\n- **Wireless Connectivity**: WiFi/Bluetooth (QCA, WCN), cellular modems (MDM), small cell (FSM)\n- **Power Management**: PMICs (PM, PMI), battery charging (SMB)\n- **Audio**: Audio codecs (WCD), smart amplifiers (WSA)\n\n---\n\n## MPN Structure\n\nQualcomm MPNs follow this general structure:\n\n```\n[PREFIX][SERIES][-PACKAGE]\n   │       │        │\n   │       │        └── Optional: Package suffix (BGA, CSP, QFN, etc.)\n   │       └── Numeric series (3-4 digits)\n   └── Product family prefix (SM, QCA, PM, etc.)\n```\n\n### Example Decoding\n\n```\nSM8550-AB\n│  │   │\n│  │   └── AB = Package/variant designation\n│  └── 8550 = Snapdragon 8 Gen 2 series\n└── SM = Snapdragon Mobile platform\n\nQCA6390-FCBGA\n│   │    │\n│   │    └── FCBGA = Flip-Chip BGA package\n│   └── 6390 = Wi-Fi 6E / Bluetooth 5.2 combo chip\n└── QCA = Qualcomm Connectivity/Atheros (Wi-Fi/BT)\n\nPM8550\n│  │\n│  └── 8550 = Power management IC for SM8550 platform\n└── PM = Power Management IC\n```\n\n---\n\n## Product Family Prefixes\n\n### Mobile Platforms (Snapdragon)\n\n| Prefix | Category | Examples | Notes |\n|--------|----------|----------|-------|\n| SM | Snapdragon Mobile | SM8550, SM8450, SM8350 | Current flagship naming |\n| SD | Snapdragon | SD888, SD865, SD855 | Legacy flagship naming |\n| QSD | Snapdragon (original) | QSD8250, QSD8650 | First-gen Snapdragon |\n| MSM | Mobile Station Modem | MSM8996, MSM8953 | Integrated modem SoCs |\n\n### IoT/Embedded Platforms\n\n| Prefix | Category | Examples | Notes |\n|--------|----------|----------|-------|\n| QCS | IoT Platform | QCS400, QCS603, QCS610 | Smart speaker, camera, etc. |\n| QCM | IoT Module | QCM2150, QCM6490 | Complete system modules |\n| APQ | Application Processor | APQ8064, APQ8084 | No integrated modem |\n| IPQ | Network Processor | IPQ8074, IPQ6018 | Routers, networking |\n\n### RF Front-End\n\n| Prefix | Category | Examples | Notes |\n|--------|----------|----------|-------|\n| QM | RF Module | QM42195, QM78207 | Integrated RF front-end |\n| QPM | Power Module | QPM2630, QPM5677 | PA power modules |\n| QAT | Antenna Tuner | QAT3516, QAT3555 | Impedance tuning |\n| QET | Envelope Tracker | QET5100, QET6100 | Power efficiency |\n\n### Wireless Connectivity\n\n| Prefix | Category | Examples | Notes |\n|--------|----------|----------|-------|\n| QCA | Wi-Fi/Bluetooth | QCA6390, QCA9377, QCA6174 | Atheros heritage |\n| WCN | Wireless Connectivity | WCN3990, WCN6855 | Combo chips |\n| MDM | Modem | MDM9206, MDM9650 | Standalone modems |\n| FSM | Small Cell | FSM9955, FSM9900 | Base station |\n\n### Power Management\n\n| Prefix | Category | Examples | Notes |\n|--------|----------|----------|-------|\n| PM | PMIC | PM8550, PM8350, PM8150 | Main PMICs |\n| PMI | Power Management IC | PMI8998, PMI632 | Alternate PMIC series |\n| SMB | Battery Charger | SMB1360, SMB1350 | Charging ICs |\n\n### Audio\n\n| Prefix | Category | Examples | Notes |\n|--------|----------|----------|-------|\n| WCD | Audio Codec | WCD9380, WCD9340 | Audio CODEC ICs |\n| WSA | Smart Amplifier | WSA8810, WSA8815 | Speaker amplifiers |\n\n---\n\n## Package Codes\n\nPackage codes appear after a hyphen in the MPN.\n\n| Suffix | Package | Full Name |\n|--------|---------|-----------|\n| BGA | BGA | Ball Grid Array |\n| CSP | CSP | Chip Scale Package |\n| POP / PoP | Package-on-Package | Stacked package |\n| QFN | QFN | Quad Flat No-leads |\n| PQFN | Power QFN | Power-rated QFN |\n| LFCSP | Lead Frame CSP | Lead Frame Chip Scale |\n| WLCSP | Wafer Level CSP | Smallest footprint |\n| FCBGA | Flip-Chip BGA | Flip-chip interconnect |\n\n### Package Extraction Logic\n\nThe handler extracts package codes from the suffix after the last hyphen:\n\n```java\n// Direct match\n\"BGA\" -> \"BGA\"\n\"CSP\" -> \"CSP\"\n\"POP\" or \"PoP\" -> \"Package-on-Package\"\n\"QFN\" -> \"QFN\"\n\"PQFN\" -> \"Power QFN\"\n\"LFCSP\" -> \"Lead Frame CSP\"\n\"WLCSP\" -> \"Wafer Level CSP\"\n\"FCBGA\" -> \"Flip-Chip BGA\"\n\n// Contains check (fallback)\nContains \"BGA\" -> \"BGA\"\nContains \"CSP\" -> \"CSP\"\nContains \"QFN\" -> \"QFN\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Series Extraction Logic\n\nThe handler extracts series by collecting letters and digits before any hyphen:\n\n```java\n// Algorithm: collect alphanumerics until hyphen or end of letter+digit pattern\nSM8550-AB → SM8550\nQCA6390 → QCA6390\nPM8550 → PM8550\nMDM9650 → MDM9650\n```\n\nThe extraction stops when:\n1. A hyphen is encountered\n2. Letters and digits have both been found, and a non-alphanumeric appears\n\n---\n\n## Snapdragon Naming Evolution\n\n### Modern Naming (2021+)\n\n| Series | Tier | Examples |\n|--------|------|----------|\n| SM8xxx | Flagship (8-series) | SM8550 (Gen 2), SM8650 (Gen 3) |\n| SM7xxx | Premium (7-series) | SM7550, SM7450 |\n| SM6xxx | Mainstream (6-series) | SM6350, SM6225 |\n| SM4xxx | Budget (4-series) | SM4350, SM4250 |\n\n### Legacy Naming\n\n| Series | Year | Examples |\n|--------|------|----------|\n| SD8xx | 2017-2021 | SD888, SD865, SD855, SD845 |\n| SD7xx | 2018-2021 | SD780, SD765, SD750 |\n| SD6xx | 2017-2021 | SD695, SD680, SD660 |\n| SD4xx | 2016-2021 | SD480, SD460, SD450 |\n| MSM89xx | 2014-2017 | MSM8996, MSM8953 |\n\n### Performance Tiers (Suffix Keywords)\n\n| Tier | Keyword | Description |\n|------|---------|-------------|\n| Elite | Elite | Highest performance |\n| Plus | Plus | Enhanced variant |\n| Pro | Pro | Professional variant |\n| Standard | (none) | Base variant |\n\n### Generation (Suffix Keywords)\n\n| Generation | Keyword | Year |\n|------------|---------|------|\n| Gen 1 | Gen1 | 2021 |\n| Gen 2 | Gen2 | 2022 |\n| Gen 3 | Gen3 | 2023 |\n\n---\n\n## Supported ComponentTypes\n\nThe handler registers all patterns under `ComponentType.IC` and declares:\n\n```java\ngetSupportedTypes() → { WIFI_IC_QUALCOMM }\n```\n\n**Known Issue**: The handler registers patterns for many IC categories (SoCs, modems, PMICs, etc.) but only declares `WIFI_IC_QUALCOMM` in `getSupportedTypes()`. Consider adding `IC` to `getSupportedTypes()` for completeness.\n\n---\n\n## Replacement Compatibility Logic\n\nThe handler implements sophisticated replacement checking via `isOfficialReplacement()`:\n\n### Compatible Series Pairs\n\n| Series 1 | Series 2 | Category |\n|----------|----------|----------|\n| SD8xx | SD8xx | Snapdragon flagship |\n| SM8xx | SM8xx | Snapdragon mobile |\n| QCS4xx | QCS4xx | IoT platform |\n| QCM2xx | QCM2xx | IoT module |\n| QM4xx | QM4xx | RF module |\n| QCA6xx | QCA6xx | Wi-Fi/Bluetooth |\n| WCN3xx | WCN3xx | Wireless connectivity |\n\n### Category-Specific Checks\n\n**Snapdragon SoCs** (SM, SD, QSD, MSM):\n- Generation compatibility (higher gen can replace lower)\n- Performance tier compatibility (Elite > Plus > Pro > Standard)\n\n**Wireless Modules** (QCA, WCN, MDM, FSM):\n- Wi-Fi version compatibility (WiFi-6 > WiFi-5 > WiFi-4)\n- Bluetooth version compatibility (5.2 > 5.1 > 5.0 > 4.2)\n\n**Power Management** (PM, PMI, SMB):\n- Voltage rating compatibility (within 5% tolerance)\n- Current rating compatibility (higher can replace lower)\n\n---\n\n## Example MPNs\n\n### Mobile SoCs\n\n| MPN | Description |\n|-----|-------------|\n| SM8550-AB | Snapdragon 8 Gen 2 flagship SoC |\n| SM8450-3-AB | Snapdragon 8 Gen 1 SoC |\n| SD888 | Snapdragon 888 flagship (legacy naming) |\n| MSM8996 | Snapdragon 820/821 SoC |\n| QSD8250 | First-gen Snapdragon |\n\n### IoT Platforms\n\n| MPN | Description |\n|-----|-------------|\n| QCS603 | Vision Intelligence Platform |\n| QCM6490 | IoT module with 5G |\n| APQ8064 | Application processor (no modem) |\n| IPQ8074 | Networking processor for routers |\n\n### RF Front-End\n\n| MPN | Description |\n|-----|-------------|\n| QM42195 | RF front-end module |\n| QPM5677 | Power amplifier module |\n| QAT3555 | Antenna tuner |\n| QET6100 | Envelope tracking module |\n\n### Wireless Connectivity\n\n| MPN | Description |\n|-----|-------------|\n| QCA6390 | Wi-Fi 6E / Bluetooth 5.2 |\n| QCA6174A-3-FCBGA | Wi-Fi 5 / BT 4.2, FCBGA package |\n| WCN6855 | Wi-Fi 6E combo chip |\n| MDM9650 | LTE Cat-9 modem |\n\n### Power Management\n\n| MPN | Description |\n|-----|-------------|\n| PM8550 | Main PMIC for SM8550 |\n| PMI8998 | Power management IC |\n| SMB1360-1-BGA | Battery charging IC, BGA package |\n\n### Audio\n\n| MPN | Description |\n|-----|-------------|\n| WCD9380 | Audio codec |\n| WSA8810 | Smart speaker amplifier |\n\n---\n\n## Handler Implementation Notes\n\n### Pattern Matching\n\nAll patterns are registered under `ComponentType.IC`:\n\n```java\n// Mobile Platforms\n\"^SM[0-9]{3}.*\"       // SM8550, SM7450\n\"^SD[0-9]{3}.*\"       // SD888, SD865\n\"^QSD[0-9]{4}.*\"      // QSD8250\n\"^MSM[0-9]{4}.*\"      // MSM8996\n\n// IoT/Embedded\n\"^QCS[0-9]{3}.*\"      // QCS603\n\"^QCM[0-9]{3}.*\"      // QCM2150\n\"^APQ[0-9]{4}.*\"      // APQ8064\n\"^IPQ[0-9]{4}.*\"      // IPQ8074\n\n// RF Front-End\n\"^QM[0-9]{4}.*\"       // QM42195\n\"^QPM[0-9]{4}.*\"      // QPM5677\n\"^QAT[0-9]{4}.*\"      // QAT3555\n\"^QET[0-9]{4}.*\"      // QET6100\n\n// Wireless\n\"^QCA[0-9]{4}.*\"      // QCA6390\n\"^WCN[0-9]{4}.*\"      // WCN6855\n\"^MDM[0-9]{4}.*\"      // MDM9650\n\"^FSM[0-9]{4}.*\"      // FSM9955\n\n// Power Management\n\"^PM[0-9]{4}.*\"       // PM8550\n\"^PMI[0-9]{4}.*\"      // PMI8998\n\"^SMB[0-9]{3}.*\"      // SMB1360\n\n// Audio\n\"^WCD[0-9]{4}.*\"      // WCD9380\n\"^WSA[0-9]{4}.*\"      // WSA8810\n```\n\n### Known Issues\n\n1. **HashSet in getSupportedTypes()**: Uses `HashSet` instead of `Set.of()` - should be updated for consistency\n2. **IC type not in getSupportedTypes()**: Handler registers patterns for `ComponentType.IC` but only declares `WIFI_IC_QUALCOMM` - may cause `matches()` to return true but type not in supported set\n3. **Commented-out code**: Line 54 has commented-out `WIFI_IC` type\n\n---\n\n## Related Files\n\n- Handler: `manufacturers/QualcommHandler.java`\n- Component types: `WIFI_IC_QUALCOMM`\n- Tests: (None currently - handler needs test coverage)\n\n---\n\n## Learnings & Quirks\n\n- **PMIC naming convention**: PM/PMI part numbers often match the SoC they''re designed for (PM8550 pairs with SM8550)\n- **Atheros heritage**: QCA prefix comes from Qualcomm Atheros acquisition (2011) - Wi-Fi/Bluetooth expertise\n- **Package suffix variability**: Many Qualcomm parts are sold without explicit package suffix in MPN\n- **Generation extraction**: The handler extracts generation from 3-digit numeric portions (first digit = generation, second digit = tier)\n- **Wi-Fi capability keywords**: Some MPNs include \"ax\", \"ac\", \"n\" to indicate Wi-Fi version\n- **BT version in MPN**: Bluetooth version may appear as \"BT5.2\", \"BT5.1\", etc. in some variants\n\n<!-- Add new learnings above this line -->\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:10:15.209Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for IoT and Embedded System Agents requiring expertise in mobile SoCs, IoT platforms, and wireless connectivity technologies like WiFi, Bluetooth, and cellular modems.","zh":"适用于需要在移动SoC、IoT平台和无线连接技术（如WiFi、蓝牙和蜂窝调制解调器）方面具有专业知识的IoT和嵌入式系统代理。","ja":"モバイルSoC、IoTプラットフォーム、無線接続技術（Wi-Fi、Bluetooth、セルラーモデムなど）に関する専門知識を必要とするIoTおよび組み込みシステムエージェントに適しています。","ko":"모바일 SoC, IoT 플랫폼 및 WiFi, 블루투스, 셀룰러 모뎀과 같은 무선 연결 기술에 대한 전문 지식이 필요한 IoT 및 임베디드 시스템 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IoT y sistemas embebidos que requieren experiencia en SoCs móviles, plataformas de IoT y tecnologías de conectividad inalámbrica como WiFi, Bluetooth y módems celulares.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IoT et les systèmes intégrés nécessitant une expertise dans les SoCs mobiles, les plateformes IoT et les technologies de connectivité sans fil comme WiFi, Bluetooth et modems cellulaires.","de":"Ideal für IoT- und Embedded-System-Agents, die Expertenwissen in mobilen SoCs, IoT-Plattformen und drahtlosen Konnektivitätstechnologien wie WiFi, Bluetooth und Mobilfunkmodems erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IoT e Sistemas Embarcados que exigem especialização em SoCs móveis, plataformas de IoT e tecnologias de conectividade sem fio, como WiFi, Bluetooth e módems celulares.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов IoT и встроенных систем, требующих знаний в области мобильных SoC, платформ IoT и беспроводных технологий связи, таких как WiFi, Bluetooth и сотовые модемы.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل الأجهزة الذكية و أنظمة الأجهزة المدمجة التي تتطلب الخبرة في معالجات الأجهزة المحمولة و منصات إنترنت الأشياء و تقنيات الاتصال اللاسلكي مثل واي فاي و بلوتوث و مودمات الهاتف الخلوي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design and develop cutting-edge mobile and IoT solutions using Snapdragon mobile platforms, QCS/QCM IoT platforms, and RF Front-End modules, leveraging technologies like QCA, WCN, and MDM. It enables the integration of wireless connectivity protocols and power management systems, facilitating the creation of efficient and high-performance devices. By utilizing Qualcomm''s semiconductor technologies, agents can optimize system architecture and improve overall device functionality.","zh":"赋予代理设计和开发使用高通骁龙移动平台、QCS/QCM IoT平台和RF前端模块的尖端移动和IoT解决方案的能力，利用QCA、WCN和MDM等技术。它实现了无线连接协议和电源管理系统的集成，促进了高效和高性能设备的创建。通过利用高通的半导体技术，代理可以优化系统架构并改善整体设备功能。","ja":"Snapdragonモバイルプラットフォーム、QCS/QCM IoTプラットフォーム、RFフロントエンドモジュールを使用した先端のモバイルおよびIoTソリューションの設計および開発をエージェントに可能にする。QCA、WCN、MDMなどの技術を利用し、無線接続プロトコルと電源管理システムの統合を実現し、高効率、高性能デバイスの作成を促進する。高通の半導体技術を利用することで、エージェントはシステムアーキテクチャを最適化し、全体的なデバイス機能を改善できる。","ko":"스냅드래곤 모바일 플랫폼, QCS/QCM IoT 플랫폼 및 RF 프론트엔드 모듈을 사용하여尖端의 모바일 및 IoT 솔루션을 설계하고 개발할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여한다. QCA, WCN, MDM 등 기술을 활용하여 무선 연결 프로토콜 및 전원 관리 시스템의 통합을 구현하여 효율적이고 고성능 디바이스의 생성을促進한다. 퀄컴의 반도체 기술을 활용함으로써 에이전트는 시스템 아키텍처를 최적화하고 전체 디바이스 기능을 개선할 수 있다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar y desarrollar soluciones móviles e IoT de vanguardia utilizando plataformas móviles Snapdragon, plataformas IoT QCS/QCM y módulos de frontend de RF, aprovechando tecnologías como QCA, WCN y MDM. Permite la integración de protocolos de conectividad inalámbrica y sistemas de gestión de energía, facilitando la creación de dispositivos eficientes y de alto rendimiento. Al utilizar las tecnologías de semiconductores de Qualcomm, los agentes pueden optimizar la arquitectura del sistema y mejorar la funcionalidad general del dispositivo.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir et de développer des solutions mobiles et IoT de pointe en utilisant des plateformes mobiles Snapdragon, des plateformes IoT QCS/QCM et des modules de front-end RF, en exploitant des technologies telles que QCA, WCN et MDM. Cela permet l''intégration de protocoles de connectivité sans fil et de systèmes de gestion de l''énergie, facilitant la création de dispositifs efficaces et hautes performances. En utilisant les technologies de semiconducteurs de Qualcomm, les agents peuvent optimiser l''architecture du système et améliorer la fonctionnalité générale du dispositif.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, mobile und IoT-Lösungen der nächsten Generation mit Snapdragon-Mobilplattformen, QCS/QCM-IoT-Plattformen und RF-Frontend-Modulen zu entwerfen und zu entwickeln, indem sie Technologien wie QCA, WCN und MDM nutzen. Damit wird die Integration von drahtlosen Konnektivitätsprotokollen und Energienutzungssystemen ermöglicht, wodurch die Erstellung effizienter und leistungsstarker Geräte erleichtert wird. Durch die Nutzung von Qualcomms Halbleitertechnologien können die Agenten die Systemarchitektur optimieren und die Gesamtfunktionalität des Geräts verbessern.","pt":"Permite que os agentes projetem e desenvolvam soluções móveis e de IoT de ponta usando plataformas móveis Snapdragon, plataformas de IoT QCS/QCM e módulos de RF Front-End, aproveitando tecnologias como QCA, WCN e MDM. Isso permite a integração de protocolos de conectividade sem fio e sistemas de gerenciamento de energia, facilitando a criação de dispositivos eficientes e de alto desempenho. Ao utilizar as tecnologias de semicondutores da Qualcomm, os agentes podem otimizar a arquitetura do sistema e melhorar a funcionalidade geral do dispositivo.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать и разрабатывать передовые мобильные и решения IoT, используя мобильные платформы Snapdragon, платформы IoT QCS/QCM и модули RF Front-End, используя технологии QCA, WCN и MDM. Это позволяет интегрировать протоколы беспроводной связи и системы управления питанием, облегчая создание эффективных и высокопроизводительных устройств. Используя полупроводниковые технологии Qualcomm, агенты могут оптимизировать систему и улучшить общую функциональность устройства.","ar":"تمكن الوكيل من تصميم وتطوير حلول الأجهزة الذكية وإنترنت الأشياء المتقدمة باستخدام منصات سناب دراغون المحمولة ومنصات إنترنت الأشياء QCS/QCM ووحدات RF Front-End، واستخدام تقنيات مثل QCA و WCN و MDM. هذا يسمح بتكامل بروتوكولات الاتصال اللاسلكي ونظم إدارة الطاقة، ويسهل إنشاء أجهزة فعالة وذات أداء عالي. من خلال استخدام تقنيات أشباه الموصلات من كوالكوم، يمكن للوكلاء تحسين هندسة النظام وتحسين وظائف الجهاز بشكل عام."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing mobile devices with advanced Snapdragon SoCs","Developing IoT solutions using QCS/QCM platforms and RF Front-End modules","Integrating wireless connectivity protocols like WiFi, Bluetooth, and cellular modems","Optimizing power management systems for efficient device performance"],"zh":["使用高级Snapdragon SoC设计移动设备","使用QCS/QCM平台和RF前端模块开发IoT解决方案","集成无线连接协议，如WiFi、蓝牙和蜂窝调制解调器","优化电源管理系统以实现高效的设备性能"],"ja":["先端のSnapdragon SoCを使用したモバイルデバイスの設計","QCS/QCMプラットフォームとRFフロントエンドモジュールを使用したIoTソリューションの開発","Wi-Fi、Bluetooth、セルラーモデムなどの無線接続プロトコルの統合","効率的なデバイス性能を実現するための電源管理システムの最適化"],"ko":["先端의 스냅드래곤 SoC를 사용한 모바일 디바이스 설계","QCS/QCM 플랫폼 및 RF 프론트엔드 모듈을 사용한 IoT 솔루션 개발","WiFi, 블루투스, 셀룰러 모뎀 등 무선 연결 프로토콜의 통합","효율적인 디바이스 성능을 실현하는 전원 관리 시스템의 최적화"],"es":["Diseñar dispositivos móviles con SoCs Snapdragon avanzados","Desarrollar soluciones de IoT utilizando plataformas QCS/QCM y módulos de frontend de RF","Integrar protocolos de conectividad inalámbrica como WiFi, Bluetooth y módems celulares","Optimizar sistemas de gestión de energía para un rendimiento de dispositivo eficiente"],"fr":["Concevoir des appareils mobiles avec des SoCs Snapdragon avancés","Développer des solutions IoT en utilisant des plateformes QCS/QCM et des modules de front-end RF","Intégrer des protocoles de connectivité sans fil tels que WiFi, Bluetooth et modems cellulaires","Optimiser les systèmes de gestion de l''énergie pour une performance d''appareil efficace"],"de":["Mobile Geräte mit fortschrittlichen Snapdragon-SoCs entwerfen","IoT-Lösungen entwickeln, die QCS/QCM-Plattformen und RF-Frontend-Module verwenden","Drahtlose Konnektivitätsprotokolle wie WiFi, Bluetooth und Mobilfunkmodems integrieren","Energienutzungssysteme optimieren, um eine effiziente Geräteleistung zu erzielen"],"pt":["Projetar dispositivos móveis com SoCs Snapdragon avançados","Desenvolver soluções de IoT usando plataformas QCS/QCM e módulos de RF Front-End","Integrar protocolos de conectividade sem fio, como WiFi, Bluetooth e módems celulares","Otimizar sistemas de gerenciamento de energia para desempenho de dispositivo eficiente"],"ru":["Проектировать мобильные устройства с передовыми SoC Snapdragon","Разрабатывать решения IoT, используя платформы QCS/QCM и модули RF Front-End","Интегрировать протоколы беспроводной связи, такие как WiFi, Bluetooth и сотовые модемы","Оптимизировать системы управления питанием для эффективной работы устройства"],"ar":["تصميم أجهزة محمولة مع معالجات سناب دراغون المتقدمة","تطوير حلول إنترنت الأشياء باستخدام منصات QCS/QCM ووحدات RF Front-End","تكامل بروتوكولات الاتصال اللاسلكي مثل واي فاي وبلوتوث ومودمات الهاتف الخلوي","تحسين أنظمة إدارة الطاقة لتحقيق أداء جهاز فعال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of fabless semiconductor technology","Limited to Qualcomm-specific products and platforms"],"zh":["需要无厂半导体技术的知识","仅限于高通特定产品和平台"],"ja":["ファブレス半導体技術に関する知識が必要","クアルコム特有の製品およびプラットフォームに限定される"],"ko":["파블리스 반도체 기술에 대한 지식이 필요","퀄컴 특유의 제품 및 플랫폼에限定"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de tecnología de semiconductores fabless","Limitado a productos y plataformas específicos de Qualcomm"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance de la technologie de semiconducteurs fabless","Limité à des produits et des plateformes spécifiques à Qualcomm"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von fabless-Halbleitertechnologie","Begrenzt auf Qualcomm-spezifische Produkte und Plattformen"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de tecnologia de semicondutor fabless","Limitado a produtos e plataformas específicos da Qualcomm"],"ru":["Требует знаний о технологии полупроводников fabless","Ограничен конкретными продуктами и платформами Qualcomm"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بتكنولوجيا أشباه الموصلات فابلس","محدود بالمنتجات والمنصات الخاصة بشركة كوالكوم"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('oriolrius/pki-manager-web/GitHub CLI', 'community', 'oriolrius', 'pki-manager-web', 'oriolrius/pki-manager-web', 'GitHub CLI', 0, 0, 80, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.430Z', '2026-02-18T05:09:57.548Z', NULL, '{"id":"oriolrius/pki-manager-web/GitHub CLI","name":"GitHub CLI","description":{"zh":"GitHub CLI 是一个强大的命令行工具，用于管理 GitHub 仓库和工作流程。通过本指南，学习如何安装、设置和使用 GitHub CLI","ja":"GitHub CLI は、GitHub リポジトリとワークフローを管理する強力なコマンドライン ツールです。このガイドでは、インストール、設定、使用方法を学びます","ko":"GitHub CLI는 GitHub 저장소 및 워크플로우를 관리하는 강력한 명령줄 툴입니다. 이 가이드를 통해 설치, 설정 및 사용 방법을 학습하세요","es":"La CLI de GitHub es una herramienta poderosa para mejorar tus flujos de trabajo y operaciones de desarrollo. Con nuestra guía, aprenderás a utilizar GitHub CLI de manera efectiva.","fr":"La CLI de GitHub est un outil puissant pour améliorer vos flux de travail et opérations de développement. Avec notre guide, vous apprendrez à utiliser GitHub CLI de manière efficace.","de":"Die GitHub-CLI ist ein leistungsfähiges Tool, um Ihre Arbeitsabläufe und Entwicklungsoperationen zu verbessern. Mit unserer Anleitung lernen Sie, GitHub CLI effektiv zu verwenden.","pt":"O GitHub CLI é uma ferramenta de linha de comando para interagir com o GitHub. Aprenda a instalar e usar o GitHub CLI para melhorar sua produtividade","ru":"GitHub CLI — это инструмент командной строки для взаимодействия с GitHub. Узнайте, как установить и использовать GitHub CLI для повышения производительности","ar":"GitHub CLI هو أداة سطر أوامر للتفاعل مع GitHub. تعلم كيفية تثبيت واستخدام GitHub CLI لتحسين إنتاجيتك","en":"Web-based PKI Manager - Secure X.509 certificate lifecycle management with Cosmian KMS integration"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"GitHub CLI 工具专家指南","ja":"GitHub CLI ツールのエキスパート ガイダンス","ko":"GitHub CLI 툴 전문가 가이드","es":"GitHub CLI: Guía para operaciones y flujos de trabajo","fr":"GitHub CLI : Guide pour les opérations et les flux de tra...","de":"GitHub CLI: Anleitung für Operationen und Workflows","pt":"GitHub CLI: Guia de Instalação e Uso Avançado","ru":"GitHub CLI: Расширенное руководство по установке и исполь...","ar":"GitHub CLI: دليل تثبيت واستخدام متقدم","en":"GitHub CLI"},"description":{"zh":"GitHub CLI 是一个强大的命令行工具，用于管理 GitHub 仓库和工作流程。通过本指南，学习如何安装、设置和使用 GitHub CLI","ja":"GitHub CLI は、GitHub リポジトリとワークフローを管理する強力なコマンドライン ツールです。このガイドでは、インストール、設定、使用方法を学びます","ko":"GitHub CLI는 GitHub 저장소 및 워크플로우를 관리하는 강력한 명령줄 툴입니다. 이 가이드를 통해 설치, 설정 및 사용 방법을 학습하세요","es":"La CLI de GitHub es una herramienta poderosa para mejorar tus flujos de trabajo y operaciones de desarrollo. Con nuestra guía, aprenderás a utilizar GitHub C...","fr":"La CLI de GitHub est un outil puissant pour améliorer vos flux de travail et opérations de développement. Avec notre guide, vous apprendrez à utiliser GitHub...","de":"Die GitHub-CLI ist ein leistungsfähiges Tool, um Ihre Arbeitsabläufe und Entwicklungsoperationen zu verbessern. Mit unserer Anleitung lernen Sie, GitHub CLI ...","pt":"O GitHub CLI é uma ferramenta de linha de comando para interagir com o GitHub. Aprenda a instalar e usar o GitHub CLI para melhorar sua produtividade","ru":"GitHub CLI — это инструмент командной строки для взаимодействия с GitHub. Узнайте, как установить и использовать GitHub CLI для повышения производительности","ar":"GitHub CLI هو أداة سطر أوامر للتفاعل مع GitHub. تعلم كيفية تثبيت واستخدام GitHub CLI لتحسين إنتاجيتك","en":"Web-based PKI Manager - Secure X.509 certificate lifecycle management with Cosmian KMS integration"},"definition":{"en":"Web-based PKI Manager - Secure X.509 certificate lifecycle management with Cosmian KMS integration"},"features":{"zh":["安装和设置 GitHub CLI","使用 GitHub CLI 管理仓库和工作流程","创建和管理拉取请求","配置 Git 以使用 GitHub CLI 作为凭据帮助程序"],"ja":["GitHub CLI のインストールと設定","GitHub CLI を使用してリポジトリとワークフローを管理","プルリクエストの作成と管理","Git を設定して GitHub CLI をクレデンシャル ヘルパーとして使用"],"ko":["GitHub CLI의 설치 및 설정","GitHub CLI를 사용하여 저장소 및 워크플로우를 관리","풀 리퀘스트의 생성 및 관리","Git을 설정하여 GitHub CLI를 자격증명 도우미로 사용"],"es":["Autenticación y autorización","Creación y gestión de solicitudes de extracción","Configuración de Git para utilizar gh como ayuda de credenciales","Interacción con repositorios de GitHub","Soporte para flujos de trabajo de desarrollo"],"fr":["Authentification et autorisation","Création et gestion de demandes d''extraction","Configuration de Git pour utiliser gh comme aide de credenciales","Interaction avec les référentiels GitHub","Prise en charge des flux de travail de développement"],"de":["Authentifizierung und Autorisierung","Erstellung und Verwaltung von Pull-Requests","Konfiguration von Git zur Verwendung von gh als Credential-Hilfe","Interaktion mit GitHub-Repositorys","Unterstützung von Entwicklungs-Workflows"],"pt":["Instalação e configuração do GitHub CLI","Criação e gerenciamento de pull requests","Autenticação e autorização no GitHub","Integração com o Git para fluxos de trabalho automatizados","Suporte a comandos personalizados e scripts"],"ru":["Установка и настройка GitHub CLI","Создание и управление запросами на включение","Аутентификация и авторизация на GitHub","Интеграция с Git для автоматизированных рабочих процессов","Поддержка пользовательских команд и скриптов"],"ar":["تثبيت وتكوين GitHub CLI","إنشاء وادارة طلبات الدمج","التحقق والتصريح على GitHub","التكامل مع Git لعمليات العمل الآلية","دعم الأوامر المخصصة والبرامج النصية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GitHub CLI","命令行工具","仓库管理","工作流程管理","拉取请求","Git配置"],"ja":["GitHub CLI","コマンドライン ツール","リポジトリ管理","ワークフロー管理","プルリクエスト","Git設定"],"ko":["GitHub CLI","명령줄 툴","저장소 관리","워크플로우 관리","풀 리퀘스트","Git설정"],"es":["GitHub CLI","desarrollo de software","flujos de trabajo","operaciones de desarrollo","autenticación","autorización","solicitudes de extracción","Git","credenciales"],"fr":["GitHub CLI","développement de logiciels","flux de travail","opérations de développement","authentification","autorisation","demandes d''extraction","Git","credenciales"],"de":["GitHub CLI","Software-Entwicklung","Arbeitsabläufe","Entwicklungsoperationen","Authentifizierung","Autorisierung","Pull-Requests","Git","Credential-Hilfe"],"pt":["github cli","gitHub comando","linha de comando github","github cli instalacao","github cli tutorial","github cli exemplos","github cli documentacao"],"ru":["github cli","github команда","командная строка github","установка github cli","руководство по github cli","примеры github cli","документация github cli"],"ar":["github cli","أوامر github","سطر أوامر github","تثبيت github cli","دليل github cli","أمثلة github cli","وثائق github cli"]}},"owner":"oriolrius","repo":"pki-manager-web","repoPath":"oriolrius/pki-manager-web","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.430Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"GitHub CLI","description":"Expert help with GitHub CLI (gh) for managing pull requests, issues, repositories, workflows, and releases. Use this when working with GitHub operations from the command line, creating new releases, or bumping package versions.","bodyPreview":"# GitHub CLI (gh)\n\nExpert guidance for GitHub CLI operations and workflows.\n\n## Installation & Setup\n\n```bash\n# Login to GitHub\ngh auth login\n\n# Check authentication status\ngh auth status\n\n# Configure git to use gh as credential helper\ngh auth setup-git\n```\n\n## Pull Requests\n\n### Creating PRs\n```bash\n# Create PR interactively\ngh pr create\n\n# Create PR with title and body\ngh pr create --title \"Add feature\" --body \"Description\"\n\n# Create PR to specific branch\ngh pr create --base main --head featur","body":"# GitHub CLI (gh)\n\nExpert guidance for GitHub CLI operations and workflows.\n\n## Installation & Setup\n\n```bash\n# Login to GitHub\ngh auth login\n\n# Check authentication status\ngh auth status\n\n# Configure git to use gh as credential helper\ngh auth setup-git\n```\n\n## Pull Requests\n\n### Creating PRs\n```bash\n# Create PR interactively\ngh pr create\n\n# Create PR with title and body\ngh pr create --title \"Add feature\" --body \"Description\"\n\n# Create PR to specific branch\ngh pr create --base main --head feature-branch\n\n# Create draft PR\ngh pr create --draft\n\n# Create PR from current branch\ngh pr create --fill  # Uses commit messages\n```\n\n### Viewing PRs\n```bash\n# List PRs\ngh pr list\n\n# List my PRs\ngh pr list --author @me\n\n# View PR details\ngh pr view 123\n\n# View PR in browser\ngh pr view 123 --web\n\n# View PR diff\ngh pr diff 123\n\n# Check PR status\ngh pr status\n```\n\n### Managing PRs\n```bash\n# Checkout PR locally\ngh pr checkout 123\n\n# Review PR\ngh pr review 123 --approve\ngh pr review 123 --comment --body \"Looks good!\"\ngh pr review 123 --request-changes --body \"Please fix X\"\n\n# Merge PR\ngh pr merge 123\ngh pr merge 123 --squash\ngh pr merge 123 --rebase\ngh pr merge 123 --merge\n\n# Close PR\ngh pr close 123\n\n# Reopen PR\ngh pr reopen 123\n\n# Ready draft PR\ngh pr ready 123\n```\n\n### PR Checks\n```bash\n# View PR checks\ngh pr checks 123\n\n# Watch PR checks\ngh pr checks 123 --watch\n```\n\n## Issues\n\n### Creating Issues\n```bash\n# Create issue interactively\ngh issue create\n\n# Create issue with title and body\ngh issue create --title \"Bug report\" --body \"Description\"\n\n# Create issue with labels\ngh issue create --title \"Bug\" --label bug,critical\n\n# Assign issue\ngh issue create --title \"Task\" --assignee @me\n```\n\n### Viewing Issues\n```bash\n# List issues\ngh issue list\n\n# List my issues\ngh issue list --assignee @me\n\n# List by label\ngh issue list --label bug\n\n# View issue details\ngh issue view 456\n\n# View in browser\ngh issue view 456 --web\n```\n\n### Managing Issues\n```bash\n# Close issue\ngh issue close 456\n\n# Reopen issue\ngh issue reopen 456\n\n# Edit issue\ngh issue edit 456 --title \"New title\"\ngh issue edit 456 --add-label bug\ngh issue edit 456 --add-assignee @user\n\n# Comment on issue\ngh issue comment 456 --body \"Update\"\n```\n\n## Repository Operations\n\n### Repository Info\n```bash\n# View repository\ngh repo view\n\n# View in browser\ngh repo view --web\n\n# Clone repository\ngh repo clone owner/repo\n\n# Fork repository\ngh repo fork owner/repo\n\n# List repositories\ngh repo list owner\n```\n\n### Repository Management\n```bash\n# Create repository\ngh repo create my-repo --public\ngh repo create my-repo --private\n\n# Delete repository\ngh repo delete owner/repo\n\n# Sync fork\ngh repo sync owner/repo\n\n# Set default repository\ngh repo set-default\n```\n\n## Workflows & Actions\n\n### Viewing Workflows\n```bash\n# List workflows\ngh workflow list\n\n# View workflow runs\ngh run list\n\n# View specific run\ngh run view 789\n\n# Watch run\ngh run watch 789\n\n# View run logs\ngh run view 789 --log\n```\n\n### Managing Workflows\n```bash\n# Trigger workflow\ngh workflow run workflow.yml\n\n# Cancel run\ngh run cancel 789\n\n# Rerun workflow\ngh run rerun 789\n\n# Download artifacts\ngh run download 789\n```\n\n## Releases\n\n### Creating Releases\n```bash\n# Create release\ngh release create v1.0.0\n\n# Create release with notes\ngh release create v1.0.0 --notes \"Release notes\"\n\n# Create release with files\ngh release create v1.0.0 dist/*.tar.gz\n\n# Create draft release\ngh release create v1.0.0 --draft\n\n# Generate release notes automatically\ngh release create v1.0.0 --generate-notes\n```\n\n### Managing Releases\n```bash\n# List releases\ngh release list\n\n# View release\ngh release view v1.0.0\n\n# Download release assets\ngh release download v1.0.0\n\n# Delete release\ngh release delete v1.0.0\n```\n\n## Version Management (pki-manager specific)\n\n**IMPORTANT**: When creating a new release for this project, you MUST bump the version in ALL THREE package.json files:\n- `package.json` (root - authoritative source)\n- `frontend/package.json`\n- `backend/package.json`\n\n### Version Bump Types (Semantic Versioning)\n\n| Type | When to use | Example |\n|------|-------------|---------|\n| **patch** | Bug fixes, minor changes | `1.2.0` → `1.2.1` |\n| **minor** | New features, backwards compatible | `1.2.0` → `1.3.0` |\n| **major** | Breaking changes | `1.2.0` → `2.0.0` |\n\n### Pre-Release Workflow\n\nBefore creating a release, you MUST:\n\n1. **Check current version** in root package.json\n2. **Determine bump type** based on changes since last release\n3. **Update ALL package.json files** with the new version\n4. **Commit version changes** with message: `chore: bump version to vX.Y.Z`\n5. **Create git tag**: `git tag vX.Y.Z`\n6. **Push tag**: `git push origin vX.Y.Z`\n7. **Create GitHub release**: `gh release create vX.Y.Z --generate-notes`\n\n### Complete Release Workflow\n\n```bash\n# 1. Determine current version\ncat package.json | grep ''\"version\"''\n# Output: \"version\": \"1.2.0\"\n\n# 2. Update versions in all package.json files\n# For patch bump (1.2.0 → 1.2.1):\nNEW_VERSION=\"1.2.1\"\n\n# Edit package.json (root)\n# Edit frontend/package.json\n# Edit backend/package.json\n# All three must have the same version!\n\n# 3. Commit version bump\ngit add package.json frontend/package.json backend/package.json\ngit commit -m \"chore: bump version to v${NEW_VERSION}\"\n\n# 4. Create and push tag\ngit tag \"v${NEW_VERSION}\"\ngit push origin main\ngit push origin \"v${NEW_VERSION}\"\n\n# 5. Create GitHub release with auto-generated notes\ngh release create \"v${NEW_VERSION}\" --generate-notes\n\n# Or with custom notes\ngh release create \"v${NEW_VERSION}\" --notes \"## What''s Changed\n- Feature A\n- Bug fix B\n- Improvement C\"\n```\n\n### Version Synchronization Rules\n\n**CRITICAL**: All three package.json files MUST have matching versions:\n\n| File | Path | Must Match Root |\n|------|------|-----------------|\n| Root | `package.json` | ✓ (authoritative) |\n| Frontend | `frontend/package.json` | ✓ |\n| Backend | `backend/package.json` | ✓ |\n\n### Checking Version Consistency\n\n```bash\n# Quick check all versions\necho \"Root: $(cat package.json | grep ''\"version\"'' | head -1)\"\necho \"Frontend: $(cat frontend/package.json | grep ''\"version\"'' | head -1)\"\necho \"Backend: $(cat backend/package.json | grep ''\"version\"'' | head -1)\"\n```\n\n### Release Checklist\n\nBefore releasing, verify:\n- [ ] All tests pass (`pnpm test`)\n- [ ] Build succeeds (`pnpm build`)\n- [ ] All three package.json versions match\n- [ ] Changes are committed to main branch\n- [ ] No uncommitted changes (`git status`)\n- [ ] Previous release tag exists for comparison\n\n## Gists\n\n```bash\n# Create gist\ngh gist create file.txt\n\n# Create gist from stdin\necho \"content\" | gh gist create -\n\n# List gists\ngh gist list\n\n# View gist\ngh gist view <gist-id>\n\n# Edit gist\ngh gist edit <gist-id>\n\n# Delete gist\ngh gist delete <gist-id>\n```\n\n## Advanced Features\n\n### Aliases\n```bash\n# Create alias\ngh alias set pv \"pr view\"\ngh alias set bugs \"issue list --label bug\"\n\n# List aliases\ngh alias list\n\n# Use alias\ngh pv 123\n```\n\n### API Access\n```bash\n# Make API call\ngh api repos/:owner/:repo/issues\n\n# With JSON data\ngh api repos/:owner/:repo/issues -f title=\"Bug\" -f body=\"Description\"\n\n# Paginated results\ngh api --paginate repos/:owner/:repo/issues\n```\n\n### Extensions\n```bash\n# List extensions\ngh extension list\n\n# Install extension\ngh extension install owner/gh-extension\n\n# Upgrade extensions\ngh extension upgrade --all\n```\n\n## Common Workflows\n\n### Code Review Workflow\n```bash\n# List PRs assigned to you\ngh pr list --assignee @me\n\n# Checkout PR for testing\ngh pr checkout 123\n\n# Run tests, review code...\n\n# Approve PR\ngh pr review 123 --approve --body \"LGTM!\"\n\n# Merge PR\ngh pr merge 123 --squash\n```\n\n### Quick PR Creation\n```bash\n# Create feature branch, make changes, commit\ngit checkout -b feature/new-feature\n# ... make changes ...\ngit add .\ngit commit -m \"Add new feature\"\ngit push -u origin feature/new-feature\n\n# Create PR from commits\ngh pr create --fill\n\n# View PR\ngh pr view --web\n```\n\n### Issue Triage\n```bash\n# List open issues\ngh issue list\n\n# Add labels to issues\ngh issue edit 456 --add-label needs-triage\ngh issue edit 456 --add-label bug\n\n# Assign issue\ngh issue edit 456 --add-assignee @developer\n```\n\n## Configuration\n\n```bash\n# Set default editor\ngh config set editor vim\n\n# Set default git protocol\ngh config set git_protocol ssh\n\n# View configuration\ngh config list\n\n# Set browser\ngh config set browser firefox\n```\n\n## Tips\n\n1. **Use `--web` flag**: Open items in browser for detailed view\n2. **Interactive prompts**: Most commands work interactively if you omit parameters\n3. **Filters**: Use `--author`, `--label`, `--state` to filter lists\n4. **JSON output**: Add `--json` flag for scriptable output\n5. **Template repos**: Use `gh repo create --template` for templates\n6. **Auto-merge**: Enable with `gh pr merge --auto`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:09:57.548Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Version Control Agents needing streamlined GitHub workflow automation.","zh":"非常适合需要简化GitHub工作流自动化的版本控制代理。","ja":"GitHubのワークフロー自動化をストリームライン化する必要があるバージョン管理エージェントに最適です。","ko":"GitHub 워크플로 자동화를 간소화하는 버전 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de control de versiones que necesitan automatizar el flujo de trabajo de GitHub de forma optimizada.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de contrôle de version ayant besoin d''une automatisation du flux de travail GitHub simplifiée.","de":"Perfekt für Version Control Agents, die eine optimierte GitHub-Workflow-Automatisierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Controle de Versão que necessitam de automação de fluxo de trabalho do GitHub simplificada.","ru":"Идеально для агентов контроля версий, которым необходима автоматизация рабочего процесса GitHub.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التحكم في الإصدار الذي يحتاج إلى تسهيل عملية عمل GitHub"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage GitHub repositories securely using X.509 certificate lifecycle management with Cosmian KMS integration, enabling authenticated operations like pull request creation and git credential helper configuration via gh auth and gh pr commands.","zh":"赋予代理安全地管理GitHub仓库的能力，使用X.509证书生命周期管理与Cosmian KMS集成，实现通过gh auth和gh pr命令进行授权操作，如拉取请求创建和git凭证助手配置。","ja":"エージェントにGitHubリポジトリを安全に管理する機能を提供します。X.509証明書のライフサイクル管理とCosmian KMSの統合を使用して、gh authおよびgh prコマンドを介した認証付きの操作（プルリクエストの作成やGit資格情報ヘルパーの構成など）を可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 보안적으로 GitHub 리포지토리를 관리할 수 있도록 합니다. X.509 인증서 수명 주기 관리와 Cosmian KMS 통합을 사용하여 gh auth 및 gh pr 명령을 통해 인증된 작업(풀 요청 생성 및 Git 자격 증명 도우미 구성 등)을 활성화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar repositorios de GitHub de forma segura utilizando la administración del ciclo de vida de certificados X.509 con integración de Cosmian KMS, lo que permite operaciones autenticadas como la creación de solicitudes de extracción y la configuración de ayuda de credenciales de git a través de los comandos gh auth y gh pr.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les référentiels GitHub de manière sécurisée en utilisant la gestion du cycle de vie des certificats X.509 avec l''intégration de Cosmian KMS, ce qui permet des opérations authentifiées comme la création de demandes d''extraction et la configuration de l''aide de credenciaux de git via les commandes gh auth et gh pr.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, GitHub-Repositorys sicher zu verwalten, indem es die Lebenszyklusverwaltung von X.509-Zertifikaten mit Cosmian KMS-Integration verwendet, wodurch authentifizierte Operationen wie die Erstellung von Pull-Anfragen und die Konfiguration des Git-Credential-Helfers über die Befehle gh auth und gh pr ermöglicht werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar repositórios do GitHub de forma segura usando o gerenciamento do ciclo de vida de certificados X.509 com integração do Cosmian KMS, permitindo operações autenticadas como criação de solicitações de pull e configuração do auxiliar de credenciais do git via comandos gh auth e gh pr.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять репозиториями GitHub безопасно с помощью управления жизненным циклом сертификатов X.509 с интеграцией Cosmian KMS, что позволяет выполнять аутентифицированные операции, такие как создание запросов на включение и настройка помощника учетных данных git с помощью команд gh auth и gh pr.","ar":"يتمكن العملاء من إدارة مستودعات GitHub بأمان باستخدام إدارة دورة حياة شهادات X.509 مع تكامل Cosmian KMS ، مما يتيح العمليات المعتمدة مثل إنشاء طلبات السحب وتكوين مساعد بيانات اعتماد Git عبر أوامر gh auth و gh pr"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating pull request creation with custom titles and bodies","Configuring git to use GitHub CLI as a credential helper","Managing authentication status with gh auth commands"],"zh":["使用自定义标题和正文自动创建拉取请求","配置Git以使用GitHub CLI作为凭证助手","使用gh auth命令管理认证状态"],"ja":["カスタムタイトルと本文を使用してプルリクエストを作成する自動化","GitにGitHub CLIを資格情報ヘルパーとして使用するように構成する","gh authコマンドを使用して認証ステータスを管理する"],"ko":["사용자 지정 제목 및 본문으로 풀 요청 자동 생성","Git에서 GitHub CLI를 자격 증명 도우미로 사용하도록 구성","gh auth 명령을 사용하여 인증 상태 관리"],"es":["Automatizar la creación de solicitudes de extracción con títulos y cuerpos personalizados","Configurar git para utilizar GitHub CLI como ayuda de credenciales","Administrar el estado de autenticación con comandos gh auth"],"fr":["Automatiser la création de demandes d''extraction avec des titres et des corps personnalisés","Configurer git pour utiliser GitHub CLI comme aide de credenciaux","Gérer le statut d''authentification avec les commandes gh auth"],"de":["Automatisieren der Erstellung von Pull-Anfragen mit benutzerdefinierten Titeln und Inhalten","Git so konfigurieren, dass GitHub CLI als Credential-Helfer verwendet wird","Authentifizierungsstatus mit gh auth-Befehlen verwalten"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de solicitações de pull com títulos e corpos personalizados","Configurar o git para usar a CLI do GitHub como um auxiliar de credenciais","Gerenciar o status de autenticação com comandos gh auth"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание запросов на включение с пользовательскими заголовками и телами","Настроить git для использования GitHub CLI в качестве помощника учетных данных","Управлять статусом аутентификации с помощью команд gh auth"],"ar":["تحسين إنشاء طلبات السحب مع أسماء وبدن مخصصة","تكوين Git لاستخدام واجهة سطر الأوامر GitHub كمساعد بيانات اعتماد","إدارة حالة التحقق من الصحة باستخدام أوامر gh auth"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub authentication","Dependent on Cosmian KMS integration for X.509 certificate management"],"zh":["需要GitHub认证","依赖Cosmian KMS集成进行X.509证书管理"],"ja":["GitHubの認証が必要","X.509証明書管理のためにCosmian KMSの統合に依存"],"ko":["GitHub 인증이 필요","X.509 인증서 관리를 위해 Cosmian KMS 통합에 의존"],"es":["Requiere autenticación de GitHub","Dependiente de la integración de Cosmian KMS para la administración de certificados X.509"],"fr":["Nécessite une authentification GitHub","Dépend de l''intégration de Cosmian KMS pour la gestion des certificats X.509"],"de":["Erfordert GitHub-Authentifizierung","Abhängig von der Cosmian KMS-Integration für die X.509-Zertifikatsverwaltung"],"pt":["Exige autenticação do GitHub","Depende da integração do Cosmian KMS para gerenciamento de certificados X.509"],"ru":["Требует аутентификации GitHub","Зависит от интеграции Cosmian KMS для управления сертификатами X.509"],"ar":["يتطلب التحقق من صحة GitHub","يعتمد على تكامل Cosmian KMS لإدارة شهادات X.509"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ojo-network/turbine-py-client/railway-deploy', 'community', 'ojo-network', 'turbine-py-client', 'ojo-network/turbine-py-client', 'railway-deploy', 0, 0, 35, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.430Z', '2026-02-18T05:10:06.040Z', NULL, '{"id":"ojo-network/turbine-py-client/railway-deploy","name":"railway-deploy","description":{"zh":"本指南帮助您将 Turbine 交易机器人部署到 Railway，实现 24/7 云端运作。Railway 的免费套餐包括 30 天 5 美元信用，足够轻量级 Python 机器人使用。","ja":"このガイドでは、Turbine トレーディングボットを Railway にデプロイして 24/7 クラウド操作を実現する方法を紹介します。Railway の無料プランには 30 日間 5 ドル相当のクレジットが含まれています。","ko":"본 가이드는 Turbine 트레이딩 봇을 Railway에 배포하여 24/7 클라우드 운영을实现하는 방법을介绍합니다. Railway의 무료 플랜에는 30일간 5달러相当의 크레딧이 포함되어 있습니다.","es":"Despliega tu bot de trading Turbine en Railway para una operación en la nube 24/7 con un crédito de $5 gratis. Sigue los pasos para una configuración exitosa.","fr":"Déployez votre bot de trading Turbine sur Railway pour une opération cloud 24/7 avec un crédit de 5$ gratuit. Suivez les étapes pour une configuration réussie.","de":"Stellen Sie Ihren Turbine-Handelsbot auf Railway bereit, um 24/7 Cloud-Betrieb mit einem kostenlosen 5-$-Guthaben zu ermöglichen. Befolgen Sie die Schritte für eine erfolgreiche Konfiguration.","pt":"O Railway oferece uma camada gratuita com $5 de crédito por 30 dias, ideal para um bot de negociação Python leve. Confira os pré-requisitos e etapas para implantação","ru":"Railway предлагает бесплатный тариф с кредитом $5 на 30 дней, подходящий для легкого бота торговли Python. Проверьте предварительные требования и шаги для развертывания","ar":"سكة حديد تقدم طبقة مجانية مع رصيد 5 دولارات لمدة 30 يومًا ، مناسب لبوط تيربين خفيف. راجع المتطلبات المسبقة والخطوات للتثبيت","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Railway 部署指南 - Turbine 机器人","ja":"Railway デプロイガイド - Turbine ボット","ko":"Railway 배포 가이드 - Turbine 봇","es":"Despliegue de Railway para bots de trading","fr":"Déploiement Railway pour les bots de trading","de":"Railway-Deployment für Trading-Bots","pt":"Implantação de Bot de Negociação Turbine no Railway","ru":"Развертывание бота Turbine на Railway","ar":"تثبيت بوت تيربين على سكة حديد","en":"railway-deploy"},"description":{"zh":"本指南帮助您将 Turbine 交易机器人部署到 Railway，实现 24/7 云端运作。Railway 的免费套餐包括 30 天 5 美元信用，足够轻量级 Python 机器人使用。","ja":"このガイドでは、Turbine トレーディングボットを Railway にデプロイして 24/7 クラウド操作を実現する方法を紹介します。Railway の無料プランには 30 日間 5 ドル相当のクレジットが含まれています。","ko":"본 가이드는 Turbine 트레이딩 봇을 Railway에 배포하여 24/7 클라우드 운영을实现하는 방법을介绍합니다. Railway의 무료 플랜에는 30일간 5달러相当의 크레딧이 포함되어 있습니다.","es":"Despliega tu bot de trading Turbine en Railway para una operación en la nube 24/7 con un crédito de $5 gratis. Sigue los pasos para una configuración exitosa.","fr":"Déployez votre bot de trading Turbine sur Railway pour une opération cloud 24/7 avec un crédit de 5$ gratuit. Suivez les étapes pour une configuration réussie.","de":"Stellen Sie Ihren Turbine-Handelsbot auf Railway bereit, um 24/7 Cloud-Betrieb mit einem kostenlosen 5-$-Guthaben zu ermöglichen. Befolgen Sie die Schritte f...","pt":"O Railway oferece uma camada gratuita com $5 de crédito por 30 dias, ideal para um bot de negociação Python leve. Confira os pré-requisitos e etapas para imp...","ru":"Railway предлагает бесплатный тариф с кредитом $5 на 30 дней, подходящий для легкого бота торговли Python. Проверьте предварительные требования и шаги для ра...","ar":"سكة حديد تقدم طبقة مجانية مع رصيد 5 دولارات لمدة 30 يومًا ، مناسب لبوط تيربين خفيف. راجع المتطلبات المسبقة والخطوات للتثبيت","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["24/7 云端运作","轻量级 Python 机器人支持","免费套餐包含 30 天 5 美元信用","简单的部署过程","支持多种编程语言"],"ja":["24/7 クラウド操作","軽量級 Python ボット対応","無料プランには 30 日間 5 ドル相当のクレジット","簡単なデプロイプロセス","多くのプログラミング言語をサポート"],"ko":["24/7 클라우드 운영","경량급 Python 봇 지원","무료 플랜에는 30일간 5달러相当의 크레딧","간단한 배포 프로세스","다수의 프로그래밍 언어를 지원"],"es":["Despliegue en la nube 24/7","Crédito de $5 gratis para el tier gratuito","Compatibilidad con bots de trading ligeros de Python","Verificación de prerequisitos para una configuración exitosa","Uso de la CLI de Railway para una implementación sencilla","Soporte para archivos .env para la configuración del bot"],"fr":["Déploiement cloud 24/7","Crédit de 5$ gratuit pour le tier gratuit","Compatibilité avec des bots de trading légers Python","Vérification des prérequis pour une configuration réussie","Utilisation de la CLI Railway pour un déploiement simple","Prise en charge des fichiers .env pour la configuration du bot"],"de":["Cloud-Bereitstellung 24/7","Kostenloses 5-$-Guthaben für das kostenlose Tier","Kompatibilität mit leichten Python-Handelsbots","Überprüfung der Voraussetzungen für eine erfolgreiche Konfiguration","Verwendung der Railway-CLI für eine einfache Bereitstellung","Unterstützung für .env-Dateien zur Konfiguration des Bots"],"pt":["Implantação de bot de negociação Turbine no Railway","Camada gratuita com $5 de crédito por 30 dias","Verificação de pré-requisitos antes da implantação","Suporte a bots de negociação Python leves","Operação em nuvem 24/7","Integração com o CLI do Railway"],"ru":["Развертывание бота торговли Turbine на Railway","Бесплатный тариф с кредитом $5 на 30 дней","Проверка предварительных требований перед развертыванием","Поддержка легких ботов торговли Python","Круглосуточная облачная работа","Интеграция с CLI Railway"],"ar":["تثبيت بوت تيربين على سكة حديد","طبقة مجانية مع رصيد 5 دولارات لمدة 30 يومًا","التحقق من المتطلبات المسبقة قبل التثبيت","دعم بوتات تيربين خفيفة","التشغيل السحابي على مدار 24/7","التكامل مع واجهة سطر الأوامر سكة حديد"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Railway 部署","Turbine 机器人","云端运作","Python 机器人","免费套餐","轻量级机器人"],"ja":["Railway デプロイ","Turbine ボット","クラウド操作","Python ボット","無料プラン","軽量級ボット"],"ko":["Railway 배포","Turbine 봇","클라우드 운영","Python 봇","무료 플랜","경량급 봇"],"es":["despliegue de railway","bot de trading","nube 24/7","crédito gratis","python","CLI de railway","archivos .env","configuración de bot","despliegue en la nube"],"fr":["déploiement railway","bot de trading","cloud 24/7","crédit gratuit","python","CLI railway","fichiers .env","configuration de bot","déploiement dans le cloud"],"de":["railway-deployment","handelsbot","cloud 24/7","kostenloses guthaben","python","railway-cli","dateien .env","bot-konfiguration","cloud-bereitstellung"],"pt":["railway deploy","turbine bot","implantação de bot","nuvem 24/7","python trading bot","camada gratuita","pré-requisitos","CLI railway","bot de negociação"],"ru":["railway deploy","turbine бот","развертывание бота","облачная работа 24/7","python торговый бот","бесплатный тариф","предварительные требования","CLI railway","бот торговли"],"ar":["سكة حديد تثبيت","بوت تيربين","تثبيت بوت","التشغيل السحابي على مدار 24/7","بوت تيربين خفيف","طبقة مجانية","المتطلبات المسبقة","واجهة سطر الأوامر سكة حديد","بوت تيربين"]}},"owner":"ojo-network","repo":"turbine-py-client","repoPath":"ojo-network/turbine-py-client","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.430Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"railway-deploy","description":"Deploy a Turbine trading bot to Railway for 24/7 cloud operation. Use after creating a bot with /create-bot.","bodyPreview":"# Turbine Bot - Railway Deployment\n\nYou are helping a user deploy their Turbine trading bot to Railway for 24/7 cloud operation.\n\nRailway''s free tier includes a $5 credit for 30 days — plenty for a lightweight Python trading bot.\n\n## Step 0: Check Prerequisites\n\nRun these checks:\n\n```bash\n# Check Railway CLI\ncommand -v railway && railway --version || echo \"RAILWAY_NOT_FOUND\"\n\n# Check for .env\nls -la .env 2>/dev/null || echo \"NO_ENV_FILE\"\n\n# Check for bot Python files in root (exclude examples/,","body":"# Turbine Bot - Railway Deployment\n\nYou are helping a user deploy their Turbine trading bot to Railway for 24/7 cloud operation.\n\nRailway''s free tier includes a $5 credit for 30 days — plenty for a lightweight Python trading bot.\n\n## Step 0: Check Prerequisites\n\nRun these checks:\n\n```bash\n# Check Railway CLI\ncommand -v railway && railway --version || echo \"RAILWAY_NOT_FOUND\"\n\n# Check for .env\nls -la .env 2>/dev/null || echo \"NO_ENV_FILE\"\n\n# Check for bot Python files in root (exclude examples/, tests/, turbine_client/)\nls *.py 2>/dev/null || echo \"NO_PY_FILES\"\n```\n\n**If Railway CLI is not found:**\nInstall it automatically. Try these in order:\n\n1. If `brew` is available: `brew install railway`\n2. Else if `npm` is available: `npm i -g @railway/cli`\n3. Else: `bash <(curl -fsSL cli.new)`\n\nAfter installing, verify with `command -v railway && railway --version`. If installation fails, show the manual install options and STOP.\n\n**If .env is not found:**\nTell the user to get set up first:\n```\nNo .env file found. Run /setup first to configure your environment,\nthen /create-bot to generate a trading bot.\n```\nSTOP here.\n\n## Step 1: Identify the Bot File\n\nIf the user passed an argument (e.g., `/railway-deploy my_bot.py`), use that filename.\n\nOtherwise, look at the Python files in the project root. Find files matching bot patterns (`*bot*`, `*trader*`, `*maker*`, `*trading*`). Exclude `setup.py`, `conftest.py`, and files inside `examples/`, `tests/`, `turbine_client/`.\n\nIf there''s exactly one candidate, confirm with the user using `AskUserQuestion`:\n- \"Which file should Railway run?\" with the detected file as the recommended option\n\nIf there are multiple candidates, present them all as options.\n\nIf there are zero candidates, use `AskUserQuestion` with a text prompt asking for the filename.\n\nStore the result as `BOT_FILE` for the remaining steps.\n\n## Step 2: Generate Deployment Configuration\n\nCreate these files using the Write tool:\n\n**`requirements.txt`** — Railpack looks for this to install dependencies. A single `.` tells pip to install the package and all its deps from `pyproject.toml`:\n\n```\n.\n```\n\n**`main.py`** — Railpack looks for this file as the entry point. If `BOT_FILE` is already `main.py`, skip this step. Otherwise create it:\n\n```python\nimport runpy\nrunpy.run_path(\"{BOT_FILE}\", run_name=\"__main__\")\n```\n\n**`railway.toml`** — configures restart policy:\n\n```toml\n[deploy]\nrestartPolicyType = \"ON_FAILURE\"\nrestartPolicyMaxRetries = 10\n```\n\nTell the user what you created and why:\n- `requirements.txt` tells Railpack to install the project''s dependencies from `pyproject.toml`\n- `main.py` is the entry point Railpack auto-detects — it just runs `{BOT_FILE}`\n- `railway.toml` configures restart-on-crash behavior\n\n## Step 3: Railway Login and Project Setup\n\nRun these commands sequentially:\n\n```bash\nrailway login --browserless\n```\n\nThis prints a URL and pairing code. Tell the user to open the URL in their browser and enter the code. Wait for confirmation before proceeding.\n\nThen create a project:\n\n```bash\nrailway init --name \"turbine-bot\"\n```\n\nIf `railway init` fails (e.g., project name taken), try:\n\n```bash\nrailway link\n```\n\nThis lets the user select an existing project.\n\n## Step 4: Push Environment Variables\n\nRead the `.env` file to extract the three Turbine credentials:\n- `TURBINE_PRIVATE_KEY`\n- `TURBINE_API_KEY_ID`\n- `TURBINE_API_PRIVATE_KEY`\n\n**IMPORTANT: Security handling:**\n- Never print raw private key values. Mask them: show first 6 and last 4 characters only.\n- Before pushing, tell the user: \"Your credentials will be stored as encrypted environment variables on Railway.\"\n\nUse `AskUserQuestion` to confirm before pushing:\n- \"Push your credentials to Railway? They will be encrypted at rest.\"\n- Options: \"Yes, push secrets\" / \"No, I''ll set them manually\"\n\nIf the user approves, run these commands:\n\n```bash\nrailway variables --set \"TURBINE_PRIVATE_KEY=<value>\"\nrailway variables --set \"TURBINE_API_KEY_ID=<value>\"\nrailway variables --set \"TURBINE_API_PRIVATE_KEY=<value>\"\n```\n\n**If API credentials are empty:**\nTell the user:\n```\nYour TURBINE_API_KEY_ID and TURBINE_API_PRIVATE_KEY are empty.\nThe bot auto-generates these on first run and saves them to .env.\n\nRecommended: Run your bot locally first to generate credentials:\n  python {BOT_FILE}\n\nThen re-run /railway-deploy to push the full credentials.\n\nOr deploy now — the bot will auto-register on Railway, but credentials\nwon''t persist across redeployments. You can copy them from the logs later:\n  railway logs\n```\n\nUse `AskUserQuestion`:\n- \"API credentials are empty. What would you like to do?\"\n- Options: \"Run bot locally first (Recommended)\" / \"Deploy without them\"\n\nIf they choose to run locally, tell them to run `python {BOT_FILE}`, wait for it to register, then run `/railway-deploy` again. STOP here.\n\n## Step 5: Deploy\n\nRun the deployment:\n\n```bash\nrailway up --detach\n```\n\nThe `--detach` flag returns immediately instead of streaming logs.\n\n## Step 6: Success Message\n\nTell the user:\n\n```\nYour bot is deployed to Railway!\n\nUseful commands:\n  railway logs          # Stream bot logs\n  railway status        # Check deployment status\n  railway variables     # View environment variables\n  railway down          # Stop deployment\n  railway open          # Open Railway dashboard\n\nRailway free tier: $5 credit for 30 days, then $1/month.\n\nTo redeploy after making changes:\n  railway up --detach\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:10:06.040Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Deployment Agents needing seamless Railway integration for 24/7 Python trading bot operations.","zh":"非常适合需要与铁路进行无缝集成的云部署代理，用于24/7 Python交易机器人操作。","ja":"24/7のPythonトレーディングボット操作のためのシームレスな鉄道との統合を必要とするクラウドデプロイエージェントに最適です。","ko":"24/7 파이썬 거래 봇 운영을 위한 무중단 철도 통합이 필요한 클라우드 배포 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de implementación en la nube que necesitan una integración ferroviaria sin problemas para operaciones de bot de trading de Python 24/7.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de déploiement cloud nécessitant une intégration ferroviaire sans faille pour les opérations de bot de trading Python 24/7.","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Deployment-Agents, die eine nahtlose Railway-Integration für 24/7-Python-Trading-Bot-Operationen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Implantação em Nuvem que necessitam de integração ferroviária sem interrupções para operações de bot de negociação Python 24/7.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов развертывания в облаке, которым необходима бесшовная интеграция с железной дорогой для круглосуточных операций торгового бота Python.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطبيق السحابي الذي يحتاج إلى دمج سكك حديدية بدون انقطاع لتشغيل بوت التداول بال파이ثون على مدار 24/7."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to deploy lightweight Python applications to Railway''s cloud platform, leveraging the Railway CLI and utilizing .env files for secure configuration, all within a free tier including a $5 credit for 30 days.","zh":"赋予代理部署轻量级Python应用程序到铁路的云平台的能力，利用铁路CLI，并利用.env文件进行安全配置，全都在包括30天内5美元信用额度的免费层中。","ja":"エージェントがRailwayのクラウドプラットフォームに軽量のPythonアプリケーションをデプロイできるようにし、Railway CLIを利用し、.envファイルを使用してセキュアな設定を行うことができます。すべてが30日間の5ドルクレジットを含む無料枠内で提供されます。","ko":"에이전트가 철도의 클라우드 플랫폼에 경량 파이썬 애플리케이션을 배포할 수 있도록 하며, 철도 CLI를 활용하고, .env 파일을 사용하여 보안 구성이 가능합니다. 모두 30일 동안 5달러 크레딧을 포함한 무료 티어에서 제공됩니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes implementar aplicaciones Python ligeras en la plataforma en la nube de Railway, utilizando la CLI de Railway y los archivos .env para una configuración segura, todo dentro de un nivel gratuito que incluye un crédito de $5 durante 30 días.","fr":"Permet aux agents de déployer des applications Python légères sur la plateforme cloud de Railway, en utilisant la CLI de Railway et en utilisant des fichiers .env pour une configuration sécurisée, le tout dans un niveau gratuit incluant un crédit de 5 $ pendant 30 jours.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, leichte Python-Anwendungen auf der Railway-Cloud-Plattform bereitzustellen, indem sie die Railway-CLI und .env-Dateien für eine sichere Konfiguration nutzen, all dies innerhalb eines kostenlosen Tarifs, der einen 5-Dollar-Guthaben für 30 Tage enthält.","pt":"Permite que os agentes implantem aplicações Python leves na plataforma de nuvem Railway, utilizando a CLI Railway e arquivos .env para configuração segura, tudo dentro de uma camada gratuita que inclui um crédito de $5 por 30 dias.","ru":"Позволяет агентам развертывать легкие приложения Python на облачной платформе Railway, используя CLI Railway и файлы .env для безопасной конфигурации, все это в рамках бесплатного тарифного плана, включающего кредит в $5 на 30 дней.","ar":"يسمح للعملاء بنشر تطبيقات بايثون الخفيفة على منصة سحابية للسكك الحديدية، واستخدام واجهة سطر الأوامر للسكك الحديدية وملفات .env لأغراض التهيئة الآمنة، وكل ذلك ضمن层 مجانية تشمل رصيدًا بقيمة 5 دولارات لمدة 30 يومًا."},"useCases":{"en":["Deploying Turbine trading bots to Railway for continuous operation","Configuring .env files for secure bot deployment","Validating Railway CLI installation for seamless deployment"],"zh":["将涡轮交易机器人部署到铁路以进行连续操作","配置.env文件以进行安全的机器人部署","验证铁路CLI安装以进行无缝部署"],"ja":["タービン取引ボットをRailwayにデプロイして連続運用を行う",".envファイルを設定してセキュアなボットデプロイを行う","Railway CLIのインストールを検証してシームレスなデプロイを行う"],"ko":["터빈 거래 봇을 철도에 배포하여 연속 작동을 수행하는 것",".env 파일을 구성하여 보안 봇 배포를 수행하는 것","철도 CLI 설치를 검증하여 무중단 배포를 수행하는 것"],"es":["Implementar bots de trading Turbine en Railway para operación continua","Configurar archivos .env para una implementación segura de bots","Validar la instalación de la CLI de Railway para una implementación sin problemas"],"fr":["Déployer des bots de trading Turbine sur Railway pour une opération continue","Configurer des fichiers .env pour un déploiement sécurisé de bots","Valider l''installation de la CLI de Railway pour un déploiement sans faille"],"de":["Turbine-Handelsbots in Railway für kontinuierlichen Betrieb bereitstellen","Konfigurieren von .env-Dateien für eine sichere Bot-Bereitstellung","Überprüfen der Railway-CLI-Installation für eine nahtlose Bereitstellung"],"pt":["Implantação de bots de negociação Turbine na Railway para operação contínua","Configuração de arquivos .env para implantação segura de bots","Validação da instalação da CLI Railway para implantação sem interrupções"],"ru":["Развертывание торговых ботов Turbine на Railway для непрерывной работы","Настройка файлов .env для безопасного развертывания ботов","Проверка установки CLI Railway для бесперебойного развертывания"],"ar":["نشر بوتات تداول التربين على منصة السكك الحديدية من أجل تشغيل مستمر","تهيئة ملفات .env لنشر بوتات آمن","التحقق من تثبيت واجهة سطر أوامر السكك الحديدية من أجل نشر بدون انقطاع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Railway CLI installation","Needs .env file for configuration","Limited to Railway''s free tier constraints"],"zh":["需要铁路CLI安装","需要.env文件进行配置","受铁路免费层限制"],"ja":["Railway CLIのインストールが必要",".envファイルが設定に必要","Railwayの無料枠の制限を受ける"],"ko":["철도 CLI 설치가 필요합니다.",".env 파일이 구성에 필요합니다.","철도의 무료 티어 제한을 받습니다."],"es":["Requiere instalación de la CLI de Railway","Necesita un archivo .env para la configuración","Limitado a las limitaciones del nivel gratuito de Railway"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de la CLI de Railway","A besoin d''un fichier .env pour la configuration","Limité aux contraintes du niveau gratuit de Railway"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation der Railway-CLI","Benötigt eine .env-Datei für die Konfiguration","Begrenzt durch die Einschränkungen des kostenlosen Tarifs von Railway"],"pt":["Exige instalação da CLI Railway","Necessita de arquivo .env para configuração","Limitado às restrições da camada gratuita da Railway"],"ru":["Требует установки CLI Railway","Требует файла .env для конфигурации","Ограничен ограничениями бесплатного тарифного плана Railway"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت واجهة سطر أوامر السكك الحديدية","يحتاج إلى ملف .env للتهيئة","محدود بقيود_layer المجانية لمنصة السكك الحديدية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Cantara/lib-electronic-components/seoulsemi', 'community', 'Cantara', 'lib-electronic-components', 'Cantara/lib-electronic-components', 'seoulsemi', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.430Z', '2026-02-18T05:10:32.069Z', NULL, '{"id":"Cantara/lib-electronic-components/seoulsemi","name":"seoulsemi","description":{"zh":"首尔半导体是一家韩国LED制造商，生产广泛的LED产品，包括Acrich、SunLike、Z-Power和WICOP等创新技术","ja":"ソウル半導体は韓国のLEDメーカーで、Acrich、SunLike、Z-Power、WICOPなどの革新的な技術を含む幅広いLED製品を生産しています","ko":"서울반도체는 한국의 LED 제조업체로, Acrich, SunLike, Z-Power, WICOP 등의 혁신적인 기술을 포함한 다양한 LED 제품을 생산합니다","es":"Seoul Semiconductor es un fabricante de LEDs que produce una amplia gama de productos para iluminación, automoción y aplicaciones especiales","fr":"Seoul Semiconductor est un fabricant de LEDs qui produit une large gamme de produits pour l''éclairage, l''automobile et les applications spécialisées","de":"Seoul Semiconductor ist ein Hersteller von LEDs, der eine breite Palette von Produkten für Beleuchtung, Automotive und Spezialanwendungen herstellt","pt":"A Seoul Semiconductor é uma fabricante sul-coreana de LEDs que produz uma ampla gama de produtos para iluminação, automotivo e aplicações especializadas.","ru":"Seoul Semiconductor - южнокорейский производитель светодиодов, выпускающий широкий спектр изделий для освещения, автомобильной промышленности и специальных применений.","ar":"سيول سيميكونديكتور هي شركة كورية جنوبية لتصنيع الإضاءة العضوية发射ية التي تنتج مجموعة واسعة من المنتجات للإضاءة والسيارات والتطبيقات المتخصصة.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"首尔半导体（Seoul Semiconductor）LED 技术","ja":"ソウル半導体（Seoul Semiconductor）LED 技術","ko":"서울반도체 LED 기술","es":"Seoul Semiconductor: Innovación en LEDs","fr":"Seoul Semiconductor: L''innovation dans les LEDs","de":"Seoul Semiconductor: LED-Innovationen","pt":"Seoul Semiconductor: Tecnologias LED Inovadoras","ru":"Seoul Semiconductor: Инновационные LED-технологии","ar":"سيول سيميكونديكتور: تقنيات إضاءة LED مبتكرة","en":"seoulsemi"},"description":{"zh":"首尔半导体是一家韩国LED制造商，生产广泛的LED产品，包括Acrich、SunLike、Z-Power和WICOP等创新技术","ja":"ソウル半導体は韓国のLEDメーカーで、Acrich、SunLike、Z-Power、WICOPなどの革新的な技術を含む幅広いLED製品を生産しています","ko":"서울반도체는 한국의 LED 제조업체로, Acrich, SunLike, Z-Power, WICOP 등의 혁신적인 기술을 포함한 다양한 LED 제품을 생산합니다","es":"Seoul Semiconductor es un fabricante de LEDs que produce una amplia gama de productos para iluminación, automoción y aplicaciones especiales","fr":"Seoul Semiconductor est un fabricant de LEDs qui produit une large gamme de produits pour l''éclairage, l''automobile et les applications spécialisées","de":"Seoul Semiconductor ist ein Hersteller von LEDs, der eine breite Palette von Produkten für Beleuchtung, Automotive und Spezialanwendungen herstellt","pt":"A Seoul Semiconductor é uma fabricante sul-coreana de LEDs que produz uma ampla gama de produtos para iluminação, automotivo e aplicações especializadas.","ru":"Seoul Semiconductor - южнокорейский производитель светодиодов, выпускающий широкий спектр изделий для освещения, автомобильной промышленности и специальных п...","ar":"سيول سيميكونديكتور هي شركة كورية جنوبية لتصنيع الإضاءة العضوية发射ية التي تنتج مجموعة واسعة من المنتجات للإضاءة والسيارات والتطبيقات المتخصصة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Acrich：AC驱动LED模块","SunLike：人体中心照明LED，自然光谱","Z-Power：高功率LED，用于一般照明","WICOP：晶圆级集成芯片"],"ja":["Acrich：AC駆動LEDモジュール","SunLike：人間中心照明LED、自然なスペクトル","Z-Power：高出力LED、一般照明用","WICOP：ウエハーレベル集成チップ"],"ko":["Acrich：AC 구동 LED 모듈","SunLike：인간 중심 조명 LED, 자연스러운 스펙트럼","Z-Power：고출력 LED, 일반 조명용","WICOP：웨이퍼 레벨 통합 칩"],"es":["Acrich: módulos LED con alimentación CA","SunLike: LEDs con espectro natural para iluminación humana","Z-Power: LEDs de alta potencia para iluminación general","WICOP: tecnología de integración de chips a nivel de wafer"],"fr":["Acrich: modules LED à alimentation CA","SunLike: LEDs avec spectre naturel pour l''éclairage humain","Z-Power: LEDs haute puissance pour l''éclairage général","WICOP: technologie d''intégration de puces au niveau du wafer"],"de":["Acrich: LED-Module mit Wechselstromversorgung","SunLike: LEDs mit natürlichen Spektrum für die menschliche Beleuchtung","Z-Power: Hochleistungs-LEDs für die allgemeine Beleuchtung","WICOP: Technologie zur Integration von Chips auf Wafer-Ebene"],"pt":["Acrich - módulos LED acionados por corrente alternada","SunLike - LEDs de iluminação humanocêntrica com espectro natural","Z-Power - LEDs de alta potência para iluminação geral","WICOP - Chip de integração em nível de wafer"],"ru":["Acrich - светодиодные модули с приводом от переменного тока","SunLike - светодиоды с естественным спектром для человеческого освещения","Z-Power - высокомощные светодиоды для общего освещения","WICOP - чип интегрированный на уровне winger"],"ar":["Acrich - وحدات الإضاءة العضوية发射ية التي تعمل بالتيار المتردد","SunLike - الإضاءة العضوية发射ية ذات الطيف الطبيعي للإضاءة البشرية","Z-Power - الإضاءة العضوية发射ية عالية القدرة للإضاءة العامة","WICOP - شريحة متكاملة على مستوى الوفر"]},"keywords":{"zh":["LED技术","首尔半导体","Acrich","SunLike","Z-Power","WICOP","LED制造商","韩国LED"],"ja":["LED技術","ソウル半導体","Acrich","SunLike","Z-Power","WICOP","LEDメーカー","韓国LED"],"ko":["LED 기술","서울반도체","Acrich","SunLike","Z-Power","WICOP","LED 제조업체","한국 LED"],"es":["Seoul Semiconductor","LEDs","iluminación","automoción","aplicaciones especiales","Acrich","SunLike","Z-Power","WICOP"],"fr":["Seoul Semiconductor","LEDs","éclairage","automobile","applications spécialisées","Acrich","SunLike","Z-Power","WICOP"],"de":["Seoul Semiconductor","LEDs","Beleuchtung","Automotive","Spezialanwendungen","Acrich","SunLike","Z-Power","WICOP"],"pt":["Seoul Semiconductor","LEDs","iluminação","tecnologia","Acrich","SunLike","Z-Power","WICOP"],"ru":["Seoul Semiconductor","светодиоды","освещение","технология","Acrich","SunLike","Z-Power","WICOP"],"ar":["سيول سيميكونديكتور","الإضاءة العضوية发射ية","إضاءة","تكنولوجيا","Acrich","SunLike","Z-Power","WICOP"]}},"owner":"Cantara","repo":"lib-electronic-components","repoPath":"Cantara/lib-electronic-components","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.430Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"seoulsemi","description":"Seoul Semiconductor LED MPN encoding patterns, series identification, package extraction, and color decoding. Use when working with Seoul Semi LEDs or SeoulSemiHandler.","bodyPreview":"# Seoul Semiconductor Manufacturer Skill\n\n## Overview\n\nSeoul Semiconductor is a South Korean LED manufacturer producing a wide range of LED products for lighting, automotive, and specialty applications. The company is known for innovative LED technologies including:\n\n- **Acrich** - AC-driven LED modules (no external driver needed)\n- **SunLike** - Human-centric lighting LEDs with natural spectrum\n- **Z-Power** - High-power LEDs for general illumination\n- **WICOP** - Wafer-Level Integrated Chip on","body":"# Seoul Semiconductor Manufacturer Skill\n\n## Overview\n\nSeoul Semiconductor is a South Korean LED manufacturer producing a wide range of LED products for lighting, automotive, and specialty applications. The company is known for innovative LED technologies including:\n\n- **Acrich** - AC-driven LED modules (no external driver needed)\n- **SunLike** - Human-centric lighting LEDs with natural spectrum\n- **Z-Power** - High-power LEDs for general illumination\n- **WICOP** - Wafer-Level Integrated Chip on PCB (no wire bonding)\n- **MJT** - Multi-Junction Technology for high-voltage LEDs\n- **UV/IR LEDs** - Specialty LEDs for sterilization, sensing\n\n---\n\n## MPN Structure\n\nSeoul Semiconductor MPNs vary by product family, but follow these general patterns:\n\n### Z-Power Series (High-Power LEDs)\n```\nZ5-M0-W0-00\n│  │  │  │\n│  │  │  └── Options/variant\n│  │  └── W0 = White color code\n│  └── M0 = Power variant (M0, M1, M2)\n└── Z5 = Z-Power family, generation 5\n```\n\n### Acrich Series (AC-Driven LED Modules)\n```\nSMJHA-3V1W1P0S0\n│     │ │ │ │ │\n│     │ │ │ │ └── Options\n│     │ │ │ └── P0 = Power factor\n│     │ │ └── W1 = Wattage\n│     │ └── V1 = Voltage variant\n│     └── 3 = Series number\n└── SMJHA = Acrich module prefix\n```\n\n### SunLike Series (Human-Centric LEDs)\n```\nSPHWHTL3D50YE3KPH\n│   │   │ │ │ │ │\n│   │   │ │ │ │ └── Options (PH=tape/reel)\n│   │   │ │ │ └── KP = Package variant\n│   │   │ │ └── E3 = Efficiency bin\n│   │   │ └── Y = Color bin\n│   │   └── 50 = CCT (5000K)\n│   └── HTL3D = Series variant\n└── SPH = SunLike prefix\n```\n\n### Standard White LEDs (STW/STN Series)\n```\nSTW9Q14C-W9\n│  │    │ │\n│  │    │ └── W9 = Color temperature bin\n│  │    └── C = Variant\n│  └── 9Q14 = Series identifier\n└── STW = Standard White prefix (STN = Neutral)\n```\n\n### UV LEDs (CUD Series)\n```\nCUD6GF1B\n│  │││ │\n│  │││ └── B = Bin/variant\n│  ││└── 1 = Generation\n│  │└── F = Package\n│  └── 6G = Power/wavelength class\n└── CUD = UV LED prefix\n```\n\n---\n\n## Product Family Prefixes\n\n| Prefix | Product Family | Description |\n|--------|---------------|-------------|\n| Z5, Z4 | Z-Power | High-power LEDs for general lighting |\n| SMJHA | Acrich | AC-driven LED modules |\n| SPH | SunLike | Human-centric spectrum LEDs |\n| STW | Standard White | General purpose white LEDs |\n| STN | Standard Neutral | Neutral white LEDs |\n| CUD | UV LED | Ultraviolet LEDs (UVA, UVB, UVC) |\n| SFH | Infrared | IR LEDs and emitters |\n| W | WICOP | Wafer-level chip-scale package |\n| MJT | MJT | Multi-Junction Technology |\n| P4, P7 | P-Series | High-power LEDs |\n| X | X-Series | Premium high-power LEDs |\n| N | N-Series | Niche/specialty LEDs |\n\n---\n\n## Package Codes\n\n### Standard SMD Packages\n\n| Code | Package Size | Description |\n|------|--------------|-------------|\n| 2835 | 2.8 x 3.5mm | Mid-power SMD |\n| 3014 | 3.0 x 1.4mm | Compact SMD |\n| 3030 | 3.0 x 3.0mm | Mid-power SMD |\n| 3528 | 3.5 x 2.8mm | Standard SMD |\n| 3535 | 3.5 x 3.5mm | High-power SMD |\n| 5050 | 5.0 x 5.0mm | High-power/RGB |\n| 5630 | 5.6 x 3.0mm | High-power SMD |\n\n### Technology-Specific Packages\n\n| Return Value | Description | Series |\n|--------------|-------------|--------|\n| Ceramic | Ceramic substrate high-power | Z5-M0, Z5-M1, Z5-M2 |\n| High-Power | Generic high-power package | Z-Power, P4, P7, X-series |\n| Module | Complete LED module | Acrich (SMJHA) |\n| CSP | Chip Scale Package | WICOP |\n| MJT | Multi-Junction Package | MJT series |\n| UV | UV LED package | CUD series |\n| IR | Infrared LED package | SFH series |\n| SMD | Generic surface mount | STW, STN, SunLike |\n\n---\n\n## Color Codes\n\n### Color Code Extraction\n\nSeoul Semi uses various conventions for color in MPNs:\n\n| Code | Color | Examples |\n|------|-------|----------|\n| W, WH, WHT | White | `-W0`, `-W-`, `WHT` |\n| CW | Cool White | `-CW`, `CW-` |\n| WW | Warm White | `-WW`, `WW-` |\n| NW | Neutral White | `-NW`, `NW-` |\n| R, RD | Red | `-R0`, `RED` |\n| G, GR | Green | `-G0`, `GRN` |\n| B, BL | Blue | `-B0`, `BLU` |\n| Y, YL | Yellow | `-Y0`, `YEL` |\n| A, AM | Amber | `-A0`, `AMB` |\n| UV | Ultraviolet | `CUD` prefix, `UV` in MPN |\n| IR | Infrared | `SFH` prefix |\n\n---\n\n## Series Extraction Rules\n\nThe handler extracts series based on the product family:\n\n| Pattern | Series Format | Example |\n|---------|---------------|---------|\n| Z-Power | `Z5-M0`, `Z5-M1`, `Z5` | `Z5-M0-W0-00` -> `Z5-M0` |\n| Acrich | `Acrich` (constant) | `SMJHA3V1W1P0S0` -> `Acrich` |\n| SunLike | `SunLike` (constant) | `SPHWHTL3D50YE3KPH` -> `SunLike` |\n| UV LED | `CUD6`, `CUD8`, `CUD` | `CUD6GF1B` -> `CUD6` |\n| IR LED | `SFH4`, `SFH5`, `SFH` | `SFH4550` -> `SFH4` |\n| WICOP | `WICOP` (constant) | `W123456` -> `WICOP` |\n| MJT | `MJT` (constant) | `MJT123` -> `MJT` |\n| STW/STN | Series code | `STW9Q14C-W9` -> `STW9Q14C` |\n| N-Series | `N` + digits | `N20` -> `N20` |\n| P-Series | `P4` or `P7` | `P4ABC` -> `P4` |\n| X-Series | `X` + digits | `X123` -> `X123` |\n\n---\n\n## Supported Component Types\n\nThe handler supports:\n\n| ComponentType | Description |\n|---------------|-------------|\n| `LED` | Primary type for all LED products |\n| `IC` | Secondary registration for pattern matching |\n\n**Note**: All patterns are registered under both `LED` and `IC` types to ensure proper pattern matching in the registry.\n\n---\n\n## Handler Implementation Notes\n\n### Package Code Extraction Priority\n\nThe handler checks patterns in a specific order to avoid false positives:\n\n```java\n// 1. Check technology-specific patterns FIRST (before embedded size codes)\nif (Z_POWER_PATTERN.matches()) return \"Ceramic\" or \"High-Power\";\nif (ACRICH_PATTERN.matches()) return \"Module\";\nif (WICOP_PATTERN.matches()) return \"CSP\";\nif (MJT_PATTERN.matches()) return \"MJT\";\nif (UV_LED_PATTERN.matches()) return \"UV\";\nif (IR_LED_PATTERN.matches()) return \"IR\";\nif (P_SERIES_PATTERN.matches()) return \"High-Power\";\nif (X_SERIES_PATTERN.matches()) return \"High-Power\";\n\n// 2. Then check for embedded package sizes in SunLike/STW\nif (SUNLIKE_PATTERN.matches() || STW_STN_PATTERN.matches()) {\n    // Extract 4-digit size code like \"3030\", \"5050\"\n    return PACKAGE_CODES.getOrDefault(size, \"SMD\");\n}\n\n// 3. Fallback: check for ANY embedded size code\nfor (sizeCode : [\"3030\", \"3535\", \"5050\", ...]) {\n    if (mpn.contains(sizeCode)) return sizeCode;\n}\n```\n\n### Color Code Extraction Priority\n\nColor extraction checks specific patterns before generic ones:\n\n```java\n// 1. UV/IR first (based on prefix)\nif (mpn.startsWith(\"CUD\") || mpn.contains(\"UV\")) return \"UV\";\nif (mpn.startsWith(\"SFH\") || mpn.contains(\"IR\")) return \"IR\";\n\n// 2. White variants BEFORE generic white\nif (contains(\"-CW\") || contains(\"CW-\")) return \"CW\";  // Cool White\nif (contains(\"-WW\") || contains(\"WW-\")) return \"WW\";  // Warm White\nif (contains(\"-NW\") || contains(\"NW-\")) return \"NW\";  // Neutral White\n\n// 3. Generic white LAST\nif (contains(\"-W0\") || contains(\"-W-\") || contains(\"WHT\")) return \"W\";\n```\n\n### Replacement Detection\n\nTwo MPNs are considered official replacements if:\n1. Same series\n2. Same color (or at least one unknown)\n3. Same package (or at least one unknown)\n\n---\n\n## Example MPN Decoding\n\n### Z-Power LED\n```\nZ5-M0-W0-00\n├── Series: Z5-M0\n├── Package: Ceramic (Z5-M0 variant)\n├── Color: W (White)\n└── Technology: High-Power LED\n```\n\n### Acrich AC Module\n```\nSMJHA-3V1W1P0S0\n├── Series: Acrich\n├── Package: Module\n├── Color: (not specified in MPN)\n└── Technology: AC-Driven\n```\n\n### SunLike LED\n```\nSPHWHTL3D50YE3KPH\n├── Series: SunLike\n├── Package: SMD (default for SunLike)\n├── Color: (encoded in spec fields)\n└── Technology: SunLike (Human-Centric)\n```\n\n### Standard White LED\n```\nSTW9Q14C-W9\n├── Series: STW9Q14C\n├── Package: SMD (default)\n├── Color: W (White, bin 9)\n└── Technology: Standard White\n```\n\n### UV LED\n```\nCUD6GF1B\n├── Series: CUD6\n├── Package: UV\n├── Color: UV (Ultraviolet)\n└── Technology: UV LED\n```\n\n### Infrared LED\n```\nSFH4550\n├── Series: SFH4\n├── Package: IR\n├── Color: IR (Infrared)\n└── Technology: Infrared LED\n```\n\n---\n\n## Related Files\n\n- Handler: `manufacturers/SeoulSemiHandler.java`\n- Component types: `ComponentType.LED`, `ComponentType.IC`\n- Similarity: `/similarity-led` skill for LED comparison logic\n\n---\n\n## Learnings & Edge Cases\n\n- **Hyphen variations**: Some MPNs have optional hyphens (e.g., `SMJHA3V1W1P0S0` vs `SMJHA-3V1W1P0S0`). Patterns must handle both.\n- **Z-Power variants**: Z5-M0, Z5-M1, Z5-M2 are distinct power grades in the same family. M0 is typically lower power.\n- **SunLike spectrum**: SunLike LEDs are designed to match natural sunlight spectrum for human-centric lighting.\n- **WICOP technology**: No wire bonding or phosphor layer on LED chip - leads to smaller form factor and better thermal performance.\n- **Acrich modules**: Self-contained AC LED modules that can run directly from mains voltage without external drivers.\n- **CUD UV series**: Numbers after CUD (6, 8) typically indicate wavelength range (e.g., CUD6 = UVC ~275nm).\n- **Color code ordering**: When extracting colors, check specific variants (CW, WW, NW) before generic white (W) to avoid false matches.\n- **Package embedded in MPN**: SunLike and STW series may have 4-digit package codes embedded (e.g., 3030, 5050). Extract with regex.\n- **IC registration**: Patterns are also registered under `ComponentType.IC` to ensure proper pattern matching in the handler factory.\n\n<!-- Add new learnings above this line -->\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:10:32.069Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Industrial Automation Agents needing advanced LED technology insights from Seoul Semiconductor.","zh":"非常适合需要先进LED技术洞察的工业自动化代理，特别是从首尔半导体获取的洞察。","ja":"ソウル半導体からの高度なLED技術の洞察が必要な産業用オートメーションエージェントに最適です。","ko":"서울반도체에서 제공하는 고급 LED 기술 정보가 필요한 산업 자동화 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de automatización industrial que necesitan conocimientos avanzados de tecnología LED de Seoul Semiconductor.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''automatisation industrielle ayant besoin d''informations avancées sur la technologie LED de Seoul Semiconductor.","de":"Perfekt für Industrieautomationsagenten, die erweiterte Einblicke in die LED-Technologie von Seoul Semiconductor benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação Industrial que necessitam de insights avançados de tecnologia de LED da Seoul Semiconductor.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов промышленной автоматизации, которым необходимы глубокие знания технологии светодиодов компании Seoul Semiconductor.","ar":"مثالي لعميل آلي في 자동ية صناعية يحتاج إلى رؤى متقدمة في تكنولوجيا الإضاءة من شركة سيول سيميكونديكتور"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to integrate Acrich, SunLike, Z-Power, and WICOP LED technologies into lighting, automotive, and specialty applications using AC-driven modules, human-centric lighting, high-power LEDs, and wafer-level integrated chips.","zh":"赋予代理将Acrich、SunLike、Z-Power和WICOP LED技术整合到使用交流驱动模块、人性化照明、高功率LED和晶圆级集成芯片的照明、汽车和专用应用中。","ja":"エージェントが、交流駆動モジュール、ヒューマンセントリック照明、高出力LED、ウエハーレベル統合チップを使用した照明、自動車、特殊用途アプリケーションに、Acrich、SunLike、Z-Power、WICOP LED技術を統合できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가交流 구동 모듈, 인간 중심 조명, 고출력 LED 및 웨이퍼 수준 통합 칩을 사용하는 조명, 자동차 및 전문 응용 프로그램에 Acrich, SunLike, Z-Power 및 WICOP LED 기술을 통합할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a integrar tecnologías LED Acrich, SunLike, Z-Power y WICOP en aplicaciones de iluminación, automotriz y especializada utilizando módulos con alimentación de corriente alterna, iluminación centrada en el ser humano, LEDs de alta potencia y chips integrados a nivel de oblea.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''intégrer les technologies LED Acrich, SunLike, Z-Power et WICOP dans des applications d''éclairage, automobile et spécialisée en utilisant des modules à alimentation alternée, un éclairage centré sur l''humain, des LEDs haute puissance et des puces intégrées au niveau de la plaquette.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Acrich-, SunLike-, Z-Power- und WICOP-LED-Technologien in Beleuchtungs-, Automobil- und Spezialanwendungen mit Wechselstrommodulen, humanzentrierter Beleuchtung, Hochleistungs-LEDs und waferintegrierten Chips zu integrieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a integrar tecnologias de LED Acrich, SunLike, Z-Power e WICOP em aplicações de iluminação, automotiva e especializada usando módulos com alimentação CA, iluminação centrada no ser humano, LEDs de alta potência e chips integrados em nível de wafer.","ru":"Позволяет агентам интегрировать технологии светодиодов Acrich, SunLike, Z-Power и WICOP в освещение, автомобильные и специализированные приложения, используя модули с переменным током, освещение, ориентированное на человека, мощные светодиоды и интегральные схемы на уровне пластины.","ar":"تمكّن العميل الآلي من دمج تكنولوجيا الإضاءة مثل Acrich و SunLike و Z-Power و WICOP في تطبيقات الإضاءة والسيارات والتخصصية باستخدام وحدات مدعومة بالتيار المتردد والإضاءة المتمركزة حول الإنسان وشرائح الإضاءة القوية وشرائح الوفرة المتكاملة"},"useCases":{"en":["Specifying Acrich LED modules for automotive lighting systems","Designing human-centric lighting solutions with SunLike LEDs","Selecting Z-Power LEDs for general illumination applications","Integrating WICOP technology into specialty LED products"],"zh":["为汽车照明系统指定Acrich LED模块","使用SunLike LED设计人性化照明解决方案","为一般照明应用选择Z-Power LED","将WICOP技术集成到专用LED产品中"],"ja":["自動車照明システムのためのAcrich LEDモジュールの指定","SunLike LEDを使用したヒューマンセントリック照明ソリューションの設計","一般照明用途のためのZ-Power LEDの選択","専用LED製品へのWICOP技術の統合"],"ko":["자동차 조명 시스템을 위한 Acrich LED 모듈 지정","SunLike LED를 사용한 인간 중심 조명 솔루션 설계","일반 조명 애플리케이션을 위한 Z-Power LED 선택","전용 LED 제품에 WICOP 기술 통합"],"es":["Especificar módulos LED Acrich para sistemas de iluminación automotriz","Diseñar soluciones de iluminación centradas en el ser humano con LEDs SunLike","Seleccionar LEDs Z-Power para aplicaciones de iluminación general","Integrar la tecnología WICOP en productos LED especializados"],"fr":["Spécifier des modules LED Acrich pour les systèmes d''éclairage automobile","Concevoir des solutions d''éclairage centrées sur l''humain avec des LEDs SunLike","Sélectionner des LEDs Z-Power pour les applications d''éclairage général","Intégrer la technologie WICOP dans des produits LED spécialisés"],"de":["Acrich-LED-Module für Automobilbeleuchtungssysteme spezifizieren","Humanzentrierte Beleuchtungslösungen mit SunLike-LEDs entwerfen","Z-Power-LEDs für allgemeine Beleuchtungsanwendungen auswählen","WICOP-Technologie in spezielle LED-Produkte integrieren"],"pt":["Especificar módulos de LED Acrich para sistemas de iluminação automotiva","Projetar soluções de iluminação centrada no ser humano com LEDs SunLike","Selecionar LEDs Z-Power para aplicações de iluminação geral","Integrar tecnologia WICOP em produtos de LED especializados"],"ru":["Указать модули светодиодов Acrich для автомобильных систем освещения","Разработать решения для освещения, ориентированного на человека, со светодиодами SunLike","Выбрать светодиоды Z-Power для общего освещения","Интегрировать технологию WICOP в специализированные изделия со светодиодами"],"ar":["تحديد وحدات إضاءة Acrich لمعايير أنظمة الإضاءة الآلية","تصميم حلول إضاءة متمركزة حول الإنسان مع شرائح الإضاءة SunLike","اختيار شرائح الإضاءة Z-Power لتطبيقات الإضاءة العامة","دمج تكنولوجيا WICOP في منتجات الإضاءة المتخصصة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of LED technology and applications","Specific to Seoul Semiconductor products","May require additional technical documentation for implementation"],"zh":["需要LED技术和应用知识","仅适用于首尔半导体产品","可能需要额外的技术文档来实现"],"ja":["LED技術と応用に関する知識が必要","ソウル半導体製品のみに適用","実装には追加の技術文書が必要になる場合があります"],"ko":["LED 기술 및 애플리케이션에 대한 지식이 필요함","서울반도체 제품에만 적용됨","구현을 위해 추가 기술 문서가 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de tecnología LED y aplicaciones","Específico para productos de Seoul Semiconductor","Puede requerir documentación técnica adicional para la implementación"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en technologie LED et applications","Spécifique aux produits de Seoul Semiconductor","Peut nécessiter une documentation technique supplémentaire pour la mise en œuvre"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse über LED-Technologie und Anwendungen","Spezifisch für Produkte von Seoul Semiconductor","Kann zusätzliche technische Dokumentation für die Implementierung erfordern"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de tecnologia de LED e aplicações","Específico para produtos da Seoul Semiconductor","Pode requerer documentação técnica adicional para implementação"],"ru":["Требует знаний технологии светодиодов и их применения","Относится конкретно к продуктам компании Seoul Semiconductor","Может потребовать дополнительную техническую документацию для реализации"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بتكنولوجيا الإضاءة وتطبيقاتها","محدد لمنتجات شركة سيول سيميكونديكتور"," قد يتطلب وثائق فنية إضافية للتنفيذ"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
