ption":{"zh":"创建 GitHub 问题的技巧，确保问题清晰、完整，促进团队合作","ja":"GitHub の問題を作成するスキル，問題が明確で完全なものとなる","ko":"GitHub 이슈 생성 기술, 이슈가 명확하고 완전한 것을 보장","es":"Esta habilidad garantiza que las incidencias de GitHub contengan suficiente contexto para que cualquiera las comprenda e implemente.","fr":"Cette compétence garantit que les problèmes GitHub contiennent suffisamment de contexte pour que n''importe qui les comprenne et les mette en œuvre.","de":"Diese Fähigkeit stellt sicher, dass GitHub-Probleme genügend Kontext enthalten, damit jeder sie verstehen und implementieren kann.","pt":"Criar issues no GitHub de forma eficaz é crucial para a colaboração e resolução de problemas. Este skill ajuda a garantir que as issues contenham contexto su...","ru":"Создание эффективных проблем в GitHub имеет решающее значение для сотрудничества и решения проблем. Этот навык помогает обеспечить, чтобы проблемы содержали ...","ar":"إنشاء مشاكل جيثب بشكل فعال أمر حاسم للتعاون و حل المشكلات. هذا المهارة يساعد على ضمان أن تحتوي المشاكل على سياق كافٍ.","en":"A modern, sleek file browser with native performance built with Tauri and React"},"definition":{"en":"A modern, sleek file browser with native performance built with Tauri and React"},"features":{"zh":["研究代码库","明确问题描述","提供相关代码路径","提供相关功能实现","提供数据库表或 API 端点信息"],"ja":["コードベースを調査する","問題の説明を明確にする","関連するコードパスを提供する","関連する機能の実装を提供する","データベースのテーブルまたは API エンドポイントの情報を提供する"],"ko":["코드베이스를 조사","문제 설명을 명확히","관련 코드 경로 제공","관련 기능 구현 제공","데이터베이스 테이블 또는 API 엔드포인트 정보 제공"],"es":["Investigación del código","Documentación clara","Contexto suficiente","Flujo de trabajo obligatorio","Mejora de la colaboración"],"fr":["Recherche de code","Documentation claire","Contexte suffisant","Flux de travail obligatoire","Amélioration de la collaboration"],"de":["Code-Recherche","Klare Dokumentation","Ausreichender Kontext","Obligatorischer Workflow","Verbesserung der Zusammenarbeit"],"pt":["Pesquisa do código","Entendimento do contexto","Documentação clara","Colaboração eficaz","Resolução de problemas"],"ru":["Исследование кода","Понимание контекста","Ясная документация","Эффективное сотрудничество","Решение проблем"],"ar":["بحث الكود","فهم السياق","توثيق واضح","تعاون فعال","حل المشكلات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GitHub 问题","创建 GitHub 问题","代码质量","团队协作","代码库研究","问题描述"],"ja":["GitHub の問題","GitHub の問題を作成する","コードの品質","チームコラボレーション","コードベースの調査","問題の説明"],"ko":["GitHub 이슈","GitHub 이슈 생성","코드 품질","팀 협업","코드베이스 조사","이슈 설명"],"es":["creación de incidencias en GitHub","documentación de código","colaboración en equipo","mejora de la productividad","gestión de problemas","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["création de problèmes GitHub","documentation de code","collaboration d''équipe","amélioration de la productivité","gestion de problèmes","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Erstellung von GitHub-Problemen","Code-Dokumentation","Teamzusammenarbeit","Produktivitätssteigerung","Problemmangement","Softwareentwicklung"],"pt":["criar issues github","colaboração de código","resolução de problemas","documentação de código","github issues","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["создать проблему github","сотрудничество кода","решение проблем","документация кода","проблемы github","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["إنشاء مشاكل جيثب","تعاون الكود","حل المشكلات","توثيق الكود","مشاكل جيثب","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"StirlingMarketingGroup","repo":"marlin","repoPath":"StirlingMarketingGroup/marlin","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.430Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"creating-github-issues","description":"Use when creating GitHub issues, making new issues, filing bugs, requesting features, or before running `gh issue create`. Triggers on new issue, create issue, file issue, gh issue, open issue. Ensures proper research, labels, and comprehensive issue documentation.","bodyPreview":"# Creating GitHub Issues\n\n## Overview\n\nEvery GitHub issue should be well-researched and clearly documented. This skill ensures issues contain enough context for anyone to understand and implement them.\n\n## Mandatory Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Research the Codebase\n\nBefore writing the issue, use the Explore agent or search tools to understand:\n\n- Where relevant code lives (file paths, functions, components)\n- How similar functionality is currently implemented\n- Database tables, API endpoints, or UI co","body":"# Creating GitHub Issues\n\n## Overview\n\nEvery GitHub issue should be well-researched and clearly documented. This skill ensures issues contain enough context for anyone to understand and implement them.\n\n## Mandatory Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Research the Codebase\n\nBefore writing the issue, use the Explore agent or search tools to understand:\n\n- Where relevant code lives (file paths, functions, components)\n- How similar functionality is currently implemented\n- Database tables, API endpoints, or UI components involved\n- Existing patterns that should be followed\n\n**Include in the issue:**\n- Specific file paths and line numbers\n- Code snippets showing current implementation\n- References to similar existing code as examples\n\n**Why:** Issues with research reduce back-and-forth questions and give implementers a head start.\n\n### Step 2: Create the Issue\n\nUse `gh issue create` with a well-structured body:\n\n```bash\ngh issue create --title \"Brief descriptive title\" --body \"$(cat <<''EOF''\n## Summary\n<1-3 sentences describing what needs to be done>\n\n## Current State\n<What exists now, with file paths and code references>\n\n## Proposed Changes\n<What should change, with specific details>\n\n## Technical Notes\n<File paths, database tables, API endpoints, code snippets>\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Specific testable requirement\n- [ ] Another requirement\nEOF\n)\"\n```\n\n### Step 3: Add Labels\n\nDiscover current labels and apply appropriate ones:\n\n```bash\ngh label list --limit 50\n```\n\n**Common label categories:**\n\n1. **Type** (pick one):\n   - `enhancement` - New feature or improvement\n   - `bug` - Something isn''t working\n   - `documentation` - Documentation improvements\n   - `question` - Further information requested\n\n2. **Priority** (if applicable):\n   - `priority: critical` - Production broken, blocking issue\n   - `priority: high` - Important bug fix, urgent feature\n   - `priority: low` - Nice to have, can wait\n\n3. **Area** (if applicable):\n   - Labels indicating which part of the codebase is affected\n\n```bash\ngh issue edit <number> --add-label \"enhancement\"\n```\n\n### Step 4: Add to Project (if applicable)\n\nIf the repository uses GitHub Projects:\n\n```bash\ngh issue edit <number> --add-project \"Project Name\"\n```\n\n## Issue Template\n\n```markdown\n## Summary\n<1-3 sentences describing what needs to be done>\n\n## Current State\n<What exists now>\n- File: `path/to/file.ts:123`\n- Current behavior: <description>\n\n## Proposed Changes\n<What should change>\n1. Change X to do Y\n2. Add Z functionality\n\n## Technical Notes\n- Relevant files: `src/components/Feature.tsx`, `src/utils/helpers.ts`\n- Related functions: `handleSubmit()`, `validateInput()`\n- Consider: <architectural notes, edge cases>\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Specific testable requirement\n- [ ] Another requirement\n- [ ] Tests pass\n\n## Additional Context\n<Screenshots, error messages, related issues>\n```\n\n## Field Selection Guidelines\n\n### Priority\n- **Critical** - Production broken, blocking issue\n- **High** - Important bug fix, urgent feature (most bugs default here)\n- **Medium** - Standard feature work\n- **Low** - Nice to have, can wait\n\n**Default guidance:** Bugs default to High unless trivial. Enhancements default to Medium unless urgent.\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n| Mistake | Fix |\n|---------|-----|\n| Create issue without researching code first | Use Explore agent to find relevant files |\n| Generic issue description | Include specific file paths, line numbers, code snippets |\n| Missing acceptance criteria | Always include testable requirements |\n| No labels | Always add at least a type label |\n| Vague title | Make titles specific and searchable |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:10:59.494Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing streamlined GitHub issue creation and management.","zh":"非常适合需要简化 GitHub 问题创建和管理的开发代理。","ja":"GitHub の問題作成と管理をストリームライン化する必要がある開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"GitHub 이슈 생성 및 관리를 간소화해야 하는 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan una creación y gestión de problemas de GitHub simplificadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une création et de gestion de problèmes GitHub simplifiées.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine vereinfachte Erstellung und Verwaltung von GitHub-Problemen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que precisam de criação e gerenciamento de problemas do GitHub de forma simplificada.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, которым требуется упрощенное создание и управление проблемами GitHub.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء مشاكل GitHub وادارتها بتقسيم مبسط"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft well-researched and clearly documented GitHub issues, including understanding codebase structure, similar functionality implementation, and database tables, leveraging tools like Explore agent or search tools, and integrating with native performance built with Tauri and React.","zh":"赋予代理创建经过深入研究和清晰文档的 GitHub 问题的能力，包括了解代码库结构、类似功能实现和数据库表，利用 Explore 代理或搜索工具，并与使用 Tauri 和 React 构建的原生性能集成。","ja":"エージェントが、コードベース構造、類似の機能実装、データベーステーブルを理解し、Explore エージェントや検索ツールなどのツールを利用し、Tauri と React で構築されたネイティブパフォーマンスと統合して、十分に調査されたおよび明確に文書化された GitHub の問題を作成できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 코드베이스 구조, 유사한 기능 구현 및 데이터베이스 테이블을 이해하고 Explore 에이전트 또는 검색 도구와 같은 도구를 사용하여 Tauri 및 React로 구축된 네이티브 성능과 통합하여 철저하게 조사되고 명확하게 문서화된 GitHub 문제를 작성할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear problemas de GitHub bien investigados y claramente documentados, incluyendo la comprensión de la estructura del código, la implementación de funcionalidades similares y las tablas de bases de datos, aprovechando herramientas como Explore agent o herramientas de búsqueda, e integrándose con el rendimiento nativo construido con Tauri y React.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des problèmes GitHub bien étudiés et clairement documentés, comprenant la structure du codebase, la mise en œuvre de fonctionnalités similaires et les tables de bases de données, en exploitant des outils tels que Explore agent ou des outils de recherche, et en s''intégrant avec les performances natives construites avec Tauri et React.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, gut recherchierte und klar dokumentierte GitHub-Probleme zu erstellen, einschließlich des Verständnisses der Codebasis-Struktur, der Implementierung ähnlicher Funktionalitäten und der Datenbanktabellen, unter Nutzung von Tools wie Explore-Agent oder Suchtools und Integration mit dem nativen Leistungsvermögen, das mit Tauri und React erstellt wurde.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem problemas do GitHub bem pesquisados e claramente documentados, incluindo a compreensão da estrutura do código, implementação de funcionalidades semelhantes e tabelas de banco de dados, utilizando ferramentas como o Explore agent ou ferramentas de pesquisa e integrando com o desempenho nativo construído com Tauri e React.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать хорошо исследованные и четко документированные проблемы GitHub, включая понимание структуры кодовой базы, реализацию аналогичной функциональности и таблиц базы данных, используя инструменты seperti Explore agent или инструменты поиска и интегрируя с родным性能, построенным с помощью Tauri и React.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء إنشاء مشاكل جيت هب bien مُبحوثة ومدونة بكل وضوح، بما في ذلك فهم هيكل قاعدة الشفرة وتنفيذ وظائف مماثلة وجداول قواعد البيانات، باستخدام أدوات مثل Explore agent أو أدوات البحث ودمجها مع الأداء الأصلي المبني مع Tauri و React."},"useCases":{"en":["Researching codebases for issue context","Generating well-documented GitHub issues","Integrating with Explore agent for code understanding","Utilizing Tauri and React for native performance"],"zh":["研究代码库以获取问题上下文","生成良好文档的 GitHub 问题","与 Explore 代理集成以了解代码","利用 Tauri 和 React 进行原生性能"],"ja":["問題コンテキストを取得するためのコードベースの調査","よく文書化された GitHub の問題を生成する","コードの理解のために Explore エージェントと統合する","ネイティブ パフォーマンスのために Tauri と React を利用する"],"ko":["문제 컨텍스트를 얻기 위한 코드베이스 연구","잘 문서화된 GitHub 문제 생성","코드 이해를 위한 Explore 에이전트 통합","네이티브 성능을 위한 Tauri 및 React 활용"],"es":["Investigación de codebases para contexto de problemas","Generación de problemas de GitHub bien documentados","Integración con el agente Explore para la comprensión del código","Utilización de Tauri y React para el rendimiento nativo"],"fr":["Recherche de codebases pour contexte de problèmes","Génération de problèmes GitHub bien documentés","Intégration avec l''agent Explore pour la compréhension du code","Utilisation de Tauri et React pour les performances natives"],"de":["Recherche von Codebasen für Problemkontext","Erstellung gut dokumentierter GitHub-Probleme","Integration mit dem Explore-Agent für Codeverständnis","Nutzen von Tauri und React für native Leistung"],"pt":["Pesquisando repositórios de código para contexto de problemas","Gerando problemas do GitHub bem documentados","Integrando com o Explore agent para compreender o código","Utilizando Tauri e React para desempenho nativo"],"ru":["Изучение кодовой базы для контекста проблем","Генерирование хорошо документированных проблем GitHub","Интеграция с Explore agent для понимания кода","Использование Tauri и React для родного.performance"],"ar":["البحث في مخازن الشفرة لسياق المشاكل","إنشاء مشاكل جيت هب مدونة جيدا","التكامل مع Explore agent لفهم الشفرة","استخدام Tauri و React للأداء الأصلي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub access","Needs understanding of codebase structure","Limited to issues with sufficient context"],"zh":["需要 GitHub 访问","需要了解代码库结构","仅限于具有足够上下