ics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pr","description":"Create a pull request with WSL-safe workflow. Uses --body-file to avoid heredoc permission corruption.","bodyPreview":"# Create Pull Request\r\n\r\nCreate a PR from the current branch using WSL-safe patterns.\r\n\r\n## Process\r\n\r\n1. **Check state**:\r\n   - `git status` — note any uncommitted changes\r\n   - `git log main..HEAD` — review commits to include\r\n   - `git diff main...HEAD --stat` — files changed\r\n\r\n2. **Prepare**:\r\n   - If uncommitted changes exist, ask user whether to commit first\r\n   - Ensure branch is pushed: `powershell.exe -Command ''cd C:\\Projects\\cq; git push -u origin BRANCH''`\r\n\r\n3. **Write PR body** to `","body":"# Create Pull Request\r\n\r\nCreate a PR from the current branch using WSL-safe patterns.\r\n\r\n## Process\r\n\r\n1. **Check state**:\r\n   - `git status` — note any uncommitted changes\r\n   - `git log main..HEAD` — review commits to include\r\n   - `git diff main...HEAD --stat` — files changed\r\n\r\n2. **Prepare**:\r\n   - If uncommitted changes exist, ask user whether to commit first\r\n   - Ensure branch is pushed: `powershell.exe -Command ''cd C:\\Projects\\cq; git push -u origin BRANCH''`\r\n\r\n3. **Write PR body** to `/mnt/c/Projects/cq/pr_body.md`:\r\n   ```markdown\r\n   ## Summary\r\n   - Bullet points summarizing changes\r\n\r\n   ## Test plan\r\n   - [ ] cargo test passes\r\n   - [ ] cargo clippy clean\r\n   - [ ] Manual verification steps\r\n   ```\r\n\r\n4. **Create PR** via PowerShell:\r\n   ```\r\n   powershell.exe -Command ''cd C:\\Projects\\cq; gh pr create --title \"...\" --body-file pr_body.md''\r\n   ```\r\n\r\n5. **Clean up**: Delete `pr_body.md`\r\n\r\n6. **Wait for CI**: `powershell.exe -Command ''cd C:\\Projects\\cq; gh pr checks N --watch''`\r\n\r\n7. **Report**: Show PR URL\r\n\r\n## Critical rules\r\n\r\n- **ALWAYS use `--body-file`** — never inline heredocs in `gh pr create --body`\r\n- Heredocs get captured as permission entries in `settings.local.json`, corrupting startup\r\n- All `git push` and `gh` commands go through PowerShell (Windows has git credentials)\r\n- main is protected — all changes require PR\r\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:11:23.534Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing streamlined Git workflow automation and semantic code search capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要简化 Git 工作流自动化和语义代码搜索功能的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントが Git ワークフローの自動化とコードの意味的検索機能を簡素化する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"개발 에이전트가 Git 워크플로 자동화와 의미적 코드 검색 기능을 간소화해야 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan una automatización de flujo de trabajo de Git simplificada y capacidades de búsqueda de código semántico.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une automatisation de workflow Git simplifiée et de capacités de recherche de code sémantique.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine gestreamte Git-Workflow-Automatisierung und semantische Code-Suchfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de automação de fluxo de trabalho do Git otimizada e capacidades de pesquisa de código semântico.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, которым необходима оптимизированная автоматизация рабочего процесса Git и возможности семантического поиска кода.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تطوير العميل التي تحتاج إلى автомatisation تدفق عمل Git المتدفق وخصائص البحث الكودي الدلالي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create pull requests using WSL-safe patterns, ensuring seamless integration with Git repositories and leveraging local ML embeddings for code intelligence, including tracing call chains and assessing impact with single tool calls.","zh":"赋予代理创建使用 WSL 安全模式的拉取请求的能力，确保与 Git 仓库的无缝集成，并利用本地机器学习嵌入来实现代码智能，包括跟踪调用链并通过单一工具调用评估影响。","ja":"WSL セーフ パターンを使用してプルリクエストを作成するエージェントを可能にし、Git リポジトリとのシームレスな統合を保証し、ローカル ML エンベッディングを使用してコードの知識を得ることができます。つまり、呼び出しチェーンをトレースし、単一のツール呼び出しで影響を評価できます。","ko":"에이전트가 WSL 안전 패턴을 사용하여 풀 리퀘스트를 생성할 수 있도록 하여 Git 리포지토리와의 무결점 통합을 보장하고 로컬 ML 임베딩을 사용하여 코드 지능을 구현할 수 있습니다. 즉, 호출 체인을 추적하고 단일 도구 호출로 영향을 평가할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear solicitudes de extracción utilizando patrones seguros para WSL, garantizando una integración sin problemas con los repositorios de Git y aprovechando incrustaciones de ML locales para inteligencia de código, incluida la trazabilidad de cadenas de llamadas y la evaluación del impacto con llamadas a herramientas únicas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des demandes d''extraction en utilisant des modèles sécurisés pour WSL, garantissant une intégration sans problème avec les référentiels Git et exploitant les embeddings ML locaux pour l''intelligence de code, y compris le traçage des chaînes d''appels et l''évaluation de l''impact avec des appels d''outils uniques.","de":"Ermächtigt die Mittel, Pull-Requests mit WSL-sicheren Mustern zu erstellen, um eine nahtlose Integration mit Git-Repositorys sicherzustellen und lokale ML-Einbettungen für Code-Intelligenz zu nutzen, einschließlich der Nachverfolgung von Aufrufketten und der Bewertung der Auswirkungen mit einzelnen Werkzeugaufrufen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar solicitações de pull usando padrões seguros WSL, garantindo integração perfeita com repositórios Git e aproveitando incorporações de ML locais para inteligência de código, incluindo rastreamento de cadeias de chamadas e avaliação de impacto com chamadas de ferramentas únicas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать запросы на включение с помощью шаблонов, безопасных для WSL, обеспечивая бесперебойную интеграцию с репозиториями Git и используя локальные встраивания ML для кодовой разведки, включая отслеживание цепочек вызовов и оценку воздействия с помощью единственных вызовов инструментов.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء طلبات سحب باستخدام أنماط WSL آمنة، مما يضمن التكامل السلس مع مستودعات Git وتحسين التضمين المحلي لتقنيات التعلم الآلي للذكاء البرمجي، بما في ذلك تتبع سلاسل الاتصال وتقييم التأثير باستخدام أدوات متوفرة بشكل فردي."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating pull request creation from current branches","Tracing call chains for impact assessment","Generating PR bodies with relevant commit information"],"zh":["自动从当前分支创建拉取请求","跟踪调用链以评估影响","使用相关提交信息生成 PR 正文"],"ja":["現在のブランチからプルリクエストを作成する自動化","呼び出しチェーンをトレースして影響を評価する","関連するコミット情報を使用して PR 本文を生成する"],"ko":["현재 분기에서 풀 리퀘스트 생성 자동화","호출 체인을 추적하여 영향을 평가하는 것","관련 커밋 정보를 사용하여 PR 본문을 생성하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de solicitudes de extracción desde las ramas actuales","Rastreo de cadenas de llamadas para la evaluación del impacto","Generación de cuerpos de PR con información de compromiso relevante"],"fr":["Automatisation de la création de demandes d''extraction à partir des branches actuelles","Traçage des chaînes d''appels pour l''évaluation de l''impact","Génération de corps de PR avec des informations de commit pertinentes"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung von Pull-Requests aus aktuellen Zweigen","Nachverfolgung von Aufrufketten für die Auswirkungsbewertung","Erzeugung von PR-Inhalten mit relevanten Commit-Informationen"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de solicitações de pull a partir de branches atuais","Rastrear cadeias de chamadas para avaliação de impacto","Gerar corpos de PR com informações de commit relevantes"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание запросов на включение из текущих веток","Отслеживать цепочки вызовов для оценки воздействия","Генерировать тела PR с соответствующей информацией о коммитах"],"ar":["تأتمتة إنشاء طلبات السحب من الفروع الحالية","تتبع سلاسل الاتصال لتقييم التأثير","إنشاء أجساد طلبات السحب مع معلومات الإلتزام ذات الصلة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git installation and configuration","WSL-safe patterns required for compatibility","Limited to local ML embeddings for code intelligence"],"zh":["需要 Git 安装和配置","需要 WSL 安全模式以确保兼容性","仅限于本地机器学习嵌入来实现代码智能"],"ja":["Git のインストールと設定が必要","WSL セーフ パターンが互換性を確保するために必要","コードの知識を得るためにローカル ML エンベッディングのみに限定される"],"ko":["Git 설치 및 구성이 필요합니다","WSL 안전 패턴이 호환성을 보장하기 위해 필요합니다","코드 지능을 구현하기 위해 로컬 ML 임베딩만으로 제한됩니다"],"es":["Requiere instalación y configuración de Git","Se requieren patrones seguros para WSL para la compatibilidad","Limitado a incrustaciones de ML locales para la inteligencia de código"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration de Git","Des modèles sécurisés pour WSL sont nécessaires pour la compatibilité","Limité aux embeddings ML locaux pour l''intelligence de code"],"de":["Erfordert Git-Installation und -Konfiguration","WSL-sichere Muster sind für die Kompatibilität erforderlich","Begrenzt auf lokale ML-Einbettungen für die Code-Intelligenz"],"pt":["Requer instalação e configuração do Git","Padrões seguros WSL são necessários para compatibilidade","Limitado a incorporações de ML locais para inteligência de código"],"ru":["Требуется установка и настройка Git","Шаблоны, безопасные для WSL, необходимы для совместимости","Ограничен локальными встраиваниями ML для кодовой разведки"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت وتكوين Git","أنماط آمنة WSL مطلوبة للتوافق","محدود بالتضمين المحلي لتقنيات التعلم الآلي للذكاء البرمجي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('datasciencemonkey/claude-code-cli-bricks/asset-bundles', 'community', 'datasciencemonkey', 'claude-code-cli-bricks', 'datasciencemonkey/claude-code-cli-bricks', 'asset-bundles', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.431Z', '2026-02-18T05:11:37.770Z', NULL, '{"id":"datasciencemonkey/claude-code-cli-bricks/asset-bundles","name":"asset-bundles","description":{"zh":"Databricks 资产包（DABs）写入器用于创建和管理多环境部署。它支持多环境配置和资源定义","ja":"Databricks アセットバンドル（DABs）ライターは、マルチ環境デプロイの作成と管理に使用されます。マルチ環境構成とリソース定義をサポートします","ko":"Databricks 자산 번들(DABs) 작성기는 멀티 환경 배포를 생성하고 관리하는 데 사용됩니다. 멀티 환경 구성과 리소스 정의를 지원합니다","es":"Los paquetes de activos de Databricks permiten despliegues multi-entorno para dev, staging y prod","fr":"Les bundles d''actifs Databricks permettent des déploiements multi-environnement pour dev, staging et prod","de":"Die Databricks-Asset-Bundles ermöglichen Multi-Umgebungs-Deployments für dev, staging und prod","pt":"Os Pacotes de Ativos Databricks (DABs) permitem a implantação de código em vários ambientes, incluindo dev, staging e prod","ru":"Пакеты активов Databricks (DABs) позволяют развертывать код в нескольких средах, включая dev, staging и prod","ar":"حزم 资産 Databricks (DABs) تسمح بتنفيذ التعليمات البرمجية في بيئات متعددة، بما في ذلك التطوير و الاستادج و الإنتاج","en":"Run claude code on Databricks Apps 🚀"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Databricks 资产包（DABs）写入器","ja":"Databricks アセットバンドル（DABs）ライター","ko":"Databricks 자산 번들(DABs) 작성기","es":"Paquetes de activos de Databricks","fr":"Bundles d''actifs Databricks","de":"Databricks Asset-Bundles","pt":"Pacotes de Ativos Databricks - Implementação de Multi-Amb...","ru":"Пакеты активов Databricks - развертывание вหลาย средах","ar":"حزم 资産 Databricks - التثبيت في بيئات متعددة","en":"asset-bundles"},"description":{"zh":"Databricks 资产包（DABs）写入器用于创建和管理多环境部署。它支持多环境配置和资源定义","ja":"Databricks アセットバンドル（DABs）ライターは、マルチ環境デプロイの作成と管理に使用されます。マルチ環境構成とリソース定義をサポートします","ko":"Databricks 자산 번들(DABs) 작성기는 멀티 환경 배포를 생성하고 관리하는 데 사용됩니다. 멀티 환경 구성과 리소스 정의를 지원합니다","es":"Los paquetes de activos de Databricks permiten despliegues multi-entorno para dev, staging y prod","fr":"Les bundles d''actifs Databricks permettent des déploiements multi-environnement pour dev, staging et prod","de":"Die Databricks-Asset-Bundles ermöglichen Multi-Umgebungs-Deployments für dev, staging und prod","pt":"Os Pacotes de Ativos Databricks (DABs) permitem a implantação de código em vários ambientes, incluindo dev, staging e prod","ru":"Пакеты активов Databricks (DABs) позволяют развертывать код в нескольких средах, включая dev, staging и prod","ar":"حزم 资産 Databricks (DABs) تسمح بتنفيذ التعليمات البرمجية في بيئات متعددة، بما في ذلك التطوير و الاستادج و الإنتاج","en":"Run claude code on Databricks Apps 🚀"},"definition":{"en":"Run claude code on Databricks Apps 🚀"},"features":{"zh":["支持多环境配置","支持资源定义","支持 Spark Declarative Pipeline 配置","支持 SQL Alert schemas","支持多环境部署"],"ja":["マルチ環境構成をサポート","リソース定義をサポート","Spark Declarative Pipeline 構成をサポート","SQL Alert スキーマをサポート","マルチ環境デプロイをサポート"],"ko":["멀티 환경 구성 지원","리소스 정의 지원","Spark Declarative Pipeline 구성 지원","SQL Alert 스키마 지원","멀티 환경 배포 지원"],"es":["Despliegue multi-entorno","Configuración de pipelines declarativos","Definición de recursos","Código y paneles personalizables","Compatibilidad con Databricks Apps","Facilidad de uso"],"fr":["Déploiement multi-environnement","Configuration de pipelines déclaratifs","Définition de ressources","Code et tableaux de bord personnalisables","Compatibilité avec Databricks Apps","Facilité d''utilisation"],"de":["Multi-Umgebungs-Deployments","Konfiguration von deklarativen Pipelines","Ressourcen-Definition","Anpassbares Code und Dashboards","Kompatibilität mit Databricks Apps","Benutzerfreundlichkeit"],"pt":["Criação de pacotes de ativos para implantação em vários ambientes","Suporte a configurações de pipeline declarativo","Definição de recursos e configurações para implantação","Suporte a alertas SQL críticos","Estrutura de pacote flexível e personalizável"],"ru":["Создание пакетов активов для развертывания в нескольких средах","Поддержка конфигурацийdeclarativo пайплайна","Определение ресурсов и конфигураций для развертывания","Поддержка критических SQL-оповещений","Гибкая и настраиваемая структура пакета"],"ar":["إنشاء حزم 资産 لتنفيذها في بيئات متعددة","دعم إعدادات أنابيب إعلانية","تعريف الموارد و الإعدادات لتنفيذها","دعم تنبيهات SQL حرجة","هيكل حزمة مرن و قابل للتعديل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Databricks 资产包","DABs","多环境部署","Spark Declarative Pipeline","SQL Alert","资源定义","Databricks 开发"],"ja":["Databricks アセットバンドル","DABs","マルチ環境デプロイ","Spark Declarative Pipeline","SQL Alert","リソース定義","Databricks 開発"],"ko":["Databricks 자산 번들","DABs","멀티 환경 배포","Spark Declarative Pipeline","SQL Alert","리소스 정의","Databricks 개발"],"es":["Databricks","paquetes de activos","despliegue multi-entorno","pipelines declarativos","recursos","código personalizable","Databricks Apps","desarrollo de aplicaciones","devops"],"fr":["Databricks","bundles d''actifs","déploiement multi-environnement","pipelines déclaratifs","ressources","code personnalisable","Databricks Apps","développement d''applications","devops"],"de":["Databricks","Asset-Bundles","Multi-Umgebungs-Deployments","deklarative Pipelines","Ressourcen","anpassbares Code","Databricks Apps","Anwendungs-Entwicklung","devops"],"pt":["Pacotes de Ativos Databricks","Implantação de código","Multi-ambientes","Dev","Staging","Prod","Databricks","Pipeline declarativo","Alertas SQL"],"ru":["Пакеты активов Databricks","Развертывание кода","Многосредовая","Dev","Staging","Prod","Databricks","Декларативный пайплайн","Критические SQL-оповещения"],"ar":["حزم 资産 Databricks","تنفيذ التعليمات البرمجية","بيئات متعددة","التطوير","الاستادج","الإنتاج","Databricks","أنابيب إعلانية","تنبيهات SQL حرجة"]}},"owner":"datasciencemonkey","repo":"claude-code-cli-bricks","repoPath":"datasciencemonkey/claude-code-cli-bricks","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.431Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"asset-bundles","description":"Create and configure Databricks Asset Bundles (DABs) with best practices for multi-environment deployments. Use when working with: (1) Creating new DAB projects, (2) Adding resources (dashboards, pipelines, jobs, alerts), (3) Configuring multi-environment deployments, (4) Setting up permissions, (5) Deploying or running bundle resources","bodyPreview":"# Databricks Asset Bundle (DABs) Writer\n\n## Overview\nCreate DABs for multi-environment deployment (dev/staging/prod).\n\n## Reference Files\n\n- **[SDP_guidance.md](SDP_guidance.md)** - Spark Declarative Pipeline configurations\n- **[alerts_guidance.md](alerts_guidance.md)** - SQL Alert schemas (critical - API differs)\n\n## Bundle Structure\n\n```\nproject/\n├── databricks.yml           # Main config + targets\n├── resources/*.yml          # Resource definitions\n└── src/                     # Code/dashboar","body":"# Databricks Asset Bundle (DABs) Writer\n\n## Overview\nCreate DABs for multi-environment deployment (dev/staging/prod).\n\n## Reference Files\n\n- **[SDP_guidance.md](SDP_guidance.md)** - Spark Declarative Pipeline configurations\n- **[alerts_guidance.md](alerts_guidance.md)** - SQL Alert schemas (critical - API differs)\n\n## Bundle Structure\n\n```\nproject/\n├── databricks.yml           # Main config + targets\n├── resources/*.yml          # Resource definitions\n└── src/                     # Code/dashboard files\n```\n\n### Main Configuration (databricks.yml)\n\n```yaml\nbundle:\n  name: project-name\n\ninclude:\n  - resources/*.yml\n\nvariables:\n  catalog:\n    default: \"default_catalog\"\n  schema:\n    default: \"default_schema\"\n  warehouse_id:\n    lookup:\n      warehouse: \"Shared SQL Warehouse\"\n\ntargets:\n  dev:\n    default: true\n    mode: development\n    workspace:\n      profile: dev-profile\n    variables:\n      catalog: \"dev_catalog\"\n      schema: \"dev_schema\"\n\n  prod:\n    mode: production\n    workspace:\n      profile: prod-profile\n    variables:\n      catalog: \"prod_catalog\"\n      schema: \"prod_schema\"\n```\n\n### Dashboard Resources\n\n```yaml\nresources:\n  dashboards:\n    dashboard_name:\n      display_name: \"[${bundle.target}] Dashboard Title\"\n      file_path: ../src/dashboards/dashboard.lvdash.json  # Relative to resources/\n      warehouse_id: ${var.warehouse_id}\n      permissions:\n        - level: CAN_RUN\n          group_name: \"users\"\n```\n\n**Permission levels**: `CAN_READ`, `CAN_RUN`, `CAN_EDIT`, `CAN_MANAGE`\n\n### Pipelines\n\n**See [SDP_guidance.md](SDP_guidance.md)** for pipeline configuration\n\n### SQL Alerts\n\n**See [alerts_guidance.md](alerts_guidance.md)** - Alert schema differs significantly from other resources\n\n### Jobs Resources\n\n```yaml\nresources:\n  jobs:\n    job_name:\n      name: \"[${bundle.target}] Job Name\"\n      tasks:\n        - task_key: \"main_task\"\n          notebook_task:\n            notebook_path: ../src/notebooks/main.py  # Relative to resources/\n          new_cluster:\n            spark_version: \"13.3.x-scala2.12\"\n            node_type_id: \"i3.xlarge\"\n            num_workers: 2\n      schedule:\n        quartz_cron_expression: \"0 0 9 * * ?\"\n        timezone_id: \"America/Los_Angeles\"\n      permissions:\n        - level: CAN_VIEW\n          group_name: \"users\"\n```\n\n**Permission levels**: `CAN_VIEW`, `CAN_MANAGE_RUN`, `CAN_MANAGE`\n\n⚠️ **Cannot modify \"admins\" group permissions** on jobs - verify custom groups exist before use\n\n### Path Resolution\n\n⚠️ **Critical**: Paths depend on file location:\n\n| File Location | Path Format | Example |\n|--------------|-------------|---------|\n| `resources/*.yml` | `../src/...` | `../src/dashboards/file.json` |\n| `databricks.yml` targets | `./src/...` | `./src/dashboards/file.json` |\n\n**Why**: `resources/` files are one level deep, so use `../` to reach bundle root. `databricks.yml` is at root, so use `./`\n\n### Volume Resources\n\n```yaml\nresources:\n  volumes:\n    my_volume:\n      catalog_name: ${var.catalog}\n      schema_name: ${var.schema}\n      name: \"volume_name\"\n      volume_type: \"MANAGED\"\n```\n\n⚠️ **Volumes use `grants` not `permissions`** - different format from other resources\n\n### Apps Resources\n\n**Apps resource support added in Databricks CLI 0.239.0 (January 2025)**\n\nApps in DABs have a minimal configuration - environment variables are defined in `app.yaml` in the source directory, NOT in databricks.yml.\n\n#### Generate from Existing App (Recommended)\n\n```bash\n# Generate bundle config from existing CLI-deployed app\ndatabricks bundle generate app --existing-app-name my-app --key my_app --profile DEFAULT\n\n# This creates:\n# - resources/my_app.app.yml (minimal resource definition)\n# - src/app/ (downloaded source files including app.yaml)\n```\n\n#### Manual Configuration\n\n**resources/my_app.app.yml:**\n```yaml\nresources:\n  apps:\n    my_app:\n      name: my-app-${bundle.target}        # Environment-specific naming\n      description: \"My application\"\n      source_code_path: ../src/app         # Relative to resources/ dir\n```\n\n**src/app/app.yaml:** (Environment variables go here)\n```yaml\ncommand:\n  - \"python\"\n  - \"dash_app.py\"\n\nenv:\n  - name: USE_MOCK_BACKEND\n    value: \"false\"\n  - name: DATABRICKS_WAREHOUSE_ID\n    value: \"your-warehouse-id\"\n  - name: DATABRICKS_CATALOG\n    value: \"main\"\n  - name: DATABRICKS_SCHEMA\n    value: \"my_schema\"\n```\n\n**databricks.yml:**\n```yaml\nbundle:\n  name: my-bundle\n\ninclude:\n  - resources/*.yml\n\nvariables:\n  warehouse_id:\n    default: \"default-warehouse-id\"\n\ntargets:\n  dev:\n    default: true\n    mode: development\n    workspace:\n      profile: dev-profile\n    variables:\n      warehouse_id: \"dev-warehouse-id\"\n```\n\n#### Key Differences from Other Resources\n\n| Aspect | Apps | Other Resources |\n|--------|------|-----------------|\n| **Environment vars** | In `app.yaml` (source dir) | In databricks.yml or resource file |\n| **Configuration** | Minimal (name, description, path) | Extensive (tasks, clusters, etc.) |\n| **Source path** | Points to app directory | Points to specific files |\n\n⚠️ **Important**: When source code is in project root (not src/app), use `source_code_path: ..` in the resource file\n\n### Other Resources\n\nDABs supports schemas, models, experiments, clusters, warehouses, etc. Use `databricks bundle schema` to inspect schemas.\n\n**Reference**: [DABs Resource Types](https://docs.databricks.com/dev-tools/bundles/resources)\n\n## Common Commands\n\n### Validation\n```bash\ndatabricks bundle validate                    # Validate default target\ndatabricks bundle validate -t prod           # Validate specific target\n```\n\n### Deployment\n```bash\ndatabricks bundle deploy                      # Deploy to default target\ndatabricks bundle deploy -t prod             # Deploy to specific target\ndatabricks bundle deploy --auto-approve      # Skip confirmation prompts\ndatabricks bundle deploy --force             # Force overwrite remote changes\n```\n\n### Running Resources\n```bash\ndatabricks bundle run resource_name          # Run a pipeline or job\ndatabricks bundle run pipeline_name -t prod  # Run in specific environment\n\n# Apps require bundle run to start after deployment\ndatabricks bundle run app_resource_key -t dev    # Start/deploy the app\n```\n\n### Monitoring & Logs\n\n**View application logs (for Apps resources):**\n```bash\n# View logs for deployed apps\ndatabricks apps logs <app-name> --profile <profile-name>\n\n# Examples:\ndatabricks apps logs my-dash-app-dev -p DEFAULT\ndatabricks apps logs my-streamlit-app-prod -p DEFAULT\n```\n\n**What logs show:**\n- `[SYSTEM]` - Deployment progress, file updates, dependency installation\n- `[APP]` - Application output (print statements, errors)\n- Backend connection status\n- Deployment IDs and timestamps\n- Stack traces for errors\n\n**Key log patterns to look for:**\n- ✅ `Deployment successful` - Confirms deployment completed\n- ✅ `App started successfully` - App is running\n- ✅ `Initialized real backend` - Backend connected to Unity Catalog\n- ❌ `Error:` - Look for error messages and stack traces\n- 📝 `Requirements installed` - Dependencies loaded correctly\n\n### Cleanup\n```bash\ndatabricks bundle destroy -t dev\ndatabricks bundle destroy -t prod --auto-approve\n```\n\n---\n\n## Common Issues\n\n| Issue | Solution |\n|-------|----------|\n| **App deployment fails** | Check logs: `databricks apps logs <app-name>` for error details |\n| **App not connecting to Unity Catalog** | Check logs for backend connection errors; verify warehouse ID and permissions |\n| **Wrong permission level** | Dashboards: CAN_READ/RUN/EDIT/MANAGE; Jobs: CAN_VIEW/MANAGE_RUN/MANAGE |\n| **Path resolution fails** | Use `../src/` in resources/*.yml, `./src/` in databricks.yml |\n| **Catalog doesn''t exist** | Create catalog first or update variable |\n| **\"admins\" group error on jobs** | Cannot modify admins permissions on jobs |\n| **Volume permissions** | Use `grants` not `permissions` for volumes |\n| **Hardcoded catalog in dashboard** | Create environment-specific files or parameterize JSON |\n| **App not starting after deploy** | Apps require `databricks bundle run <resource_key>` to start |\n| **App env vars not working** | Environment variables go in `app.yaml` (source dir), not databricks.yml |\n| **Wrong app source path** | Use `../` from resources/ dir if source is in project root |\n| **Debugging any app issue** | First step: `databricks apps logs <app-name>` to see what went wrong |\n\n## Key Principles\n\n1. **Path resolution**: `../src/` in resources/*.yml, `./src/` in databricks.yml\n2. **Variables**: Parameterize catalog, schema, warehouse\n3. **Mode**: `development` for dev/staging, `production` for prod\n4. **Groups**: Use `\"users\"` for all workspace users\n5. **Job permissions**: Verify custom groups exist; can''t modify \"admins\"\n\n## Resources\n\n- [Databricks Asset Bundles Documentation](https://docs.databricks.com/dev-tools/bundles/)\n- [Bundle Resources Reference](https://docs.databricks.com/dev-tools/bundles/resources)\n- [Bundle Configuration Reference](https://docs.databricks.com/dev-tools/bundles/settings)\n- [Supported Resource Types](https://docs.databricks.com/aws/en/dev-tools/bundles/resources#resource-types)\n- [Examples Repository 1](https://github.com/databricks-solutions/databricks-dab-examples)\n- [Example Repository 2](https://github.com/databricks/bundle-examples)"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:11:37.770Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Agents needing advanced Databricks App deployment capabilities with asset bundles","zh":"非常适合需要高级 Databricks 应用程序部署能力的云代理，包括资产包","ja":"クラウド エージェントが Databricks アプリの高度なデプロイ機能とアセット バンドルを必要とする場合に最適","ko":"데이터브릭스 애플리케이션의 고급 배포 기능과資産 번들을 필요로 하는 클라우드 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Cloud que necesitan capacidades de implementación avanzadas de aplicaciones de Databricks con paquetes de assets","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Cloud nécessitant des capacités de déploiement avancées d''applications Databricks avec des bundles d''actifs","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Agents, die erweiterte Databricks-App-Bereitstellungsfunktionen mit Asset-Bundles benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Nuvem que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de implantação do aplicativo Databricks com pacotes de ativos","ru":"Идеально подходит для облачных агентов, которым требуются расширенные возможности развертывания приложения Databricks с пакетами активов","ar":"مثالي لعميل السحابة الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتنصيب تطبيق Databricks مع حزم الأصول"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create and manage Databricks Asset Bundles (DABs) for multi-environment deployment, leveraging Spark Declarative Pipeline configurations and SQL Alert schemas, with support for databricks.yml and resource definitions","zh":"赋予代理创建和管理 Databricks 资产包（DABs）以实现多环境部署的能力，利用 Spark 声明式管道配置和 SQL 报警架构，并支持 databricks.yml 和资源定义","ja":"エージェントに Databricks Asset Bundle（DABs）を作成および管理する機能を付与し、Spark Declarative Pipeline 構成と SQL アラート スキーマを活用し、databricks.yml およびリソース定義をサポート","ko":"에이전트가 다중 환경 배포를 위한 데이터브릭스 자산 번들(DABs)을 생성하고 관리할 수 있도록 하며, 스파크 선언적 파이프라인 구성 및 SQL 경고 스키마를 활용하고 databricks.yml 및 리소스 정의를 지원","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear y administrar Databricks Asset Bundles (DABs) para la implementación en varios entornos, aprovechando configuraciones de tuberías declarativas de Spark y esquemas de alertas SQL, con soporte para databricks.yml y definiciones de recursos","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de gérer des bundles d''actifs Databricks (DAB) pour le déploiement multi-environnement, en exploitant les configurations de pipelines déclaratifs Spark et les schémas d''alertes SQL, avec prise en charge de databricks.yml et de définitions de ressources","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Databricks-Asset-Bundles (DABs) für die Bereitstellung in mehreren Umgebungen zu erstellen und zu verwalten, indem Spark-Declarative-Pipeline-Konfigurationen und SQL-Alert-Schemata genutzt werden, mit Unterstützung für databricks.yml und Ressourcen-Definitionen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar e gerenciar Pacotes de Ativos Databricks (DABs) para implantação em vários ambientes, aproveitando configurações de pipeline declarativo Spark e esquemas de alerta SQL, com suporte a databricks.yml e definições de recursos","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать и управлять пакетами активов Databricks (DAB) для развертывания в нескольких средах, используя конфигурации декларативного конвейера Spark и схемы уведомлений SQL, с поддержкой databricks.yml и определений ресурсов","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إنشاء و إدارة حزم أصول Databricks (DABs) لتنصيب متعدد البيئات، واستخدام تكوينات أنابيب Spark الإعلانية ومخططات تنبيه SQL، مع دعم databricks.yml و تعريفات الموارد"},"useCases":{"en":["Creating DABs for dev/staging/prod environments","Configuring Spark Declarative Pipelines for automated workflows","Defining SQL Alert schemas for critical notifications"],"zh":["为开发、暂存、生产环境创建 DABs","为自动化工作流配置 Spark 声明式管道","为关键通知定义 SQL 报警架构"],"ja":["開発/ステージ/プロダクション環境用の DABs を作成","自動化されたワークフロー用の Spark Declarative Pipeline を構成","重要な通知用の SQL アラート スキーマを定義"],"ko":["개발/스테이징/프로덕션 환경을 위한 DABs 생성","자동화된 워크플로우를 위한 스파크 선언적 파이프라인 구성","중요한 알림을 위한 SQL 경고 스키마 정의"],"es":["Creación de DABs para entornos de desarrollo, preparación y producción","Configuración de tuberías declarativas de Spark para flujos de trabajo automatizados","Definición de esquemas de alertas SQL para notificaciones críticas"],"fr":["Création de DAB pour les environnements de développement, de staging et de production","Configuration des pipelines déclaratifs Spark pour les workflows automatisés","Définition des schémas d''alertes SQL pour les notifications critiques"],"de":["Erstellung von DABs für Entwicklung-, Staging- und Produktionsumgebungen","Konfiguration von Spark-Declarative-Pipelines für automatisierte Workflows","Definition von SQL-Alert-Schemata für kritische Benachrichtigungen"],"pt":["Criar DABs para ambientes de dev/staging/prod","Configurar pipelines declarativos Spark para fluxos de trabalho automatizados","Definir esquemas de alerta SQL para notificações críticas"],"ru":["Создание DAB для сред dev/staging/prod","Настройка декларативных конвейеров Spark для автоматизированных рабочих процессов","Определение схем уведомлений SQL для критических уведомлений"],"ar":["إنشاء DABs لبيئات dev/staging/prod","تكوين خطوط أنابيب Spark الإعلانية للعمليات الآلية","تحديد مخططات تنبيه SQL للتنبيهات الحرجة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Databricks App setup","Dependent on Spark and SQL configurations"],"zh":["需要 Databricks 应用程序设置","依赖于 Spark 和 SQL 配置"],"ja":["Databricks アプリの設定が必要","Spark および SQL 構成に依存"],"ko":["데이터브릭스 애플리케이션 설정이 필요","스파크 및 SQL 구성에 의존"],"es":["Requiere configuración de la aplicación Databricks","Depende de las configuraciones de Spark y SQL"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de l''application Databricks","Dépend des configurations Spark et SQL"],"de":["Erfordert Databricks-App-Setup","Hängt von Spark- und SQL-Konfigurationen ab"],"pt":["Requer configuração do aplicativo Databricks","Dependente das configurações do Spark e SQL"],"ru":["Требуется настройка приложения Databricks","Зависит от конфигураций Spark и SQL"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد تطبيق Databricks","يعتمد على تكوينات Spark و SQL"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
