I para acceso a datos","Bot de Telegram para notificaciones","Aplicación mini para monitoreo en tiempo real","Validación de rendimiento y recompensas"],"fr":["Indexer pour la chaîne Beacon","API pour accéder aux données","Bot Telegram pour les notifications","Application mini pour la surveillance en temps réel","Validation des performances et récompenses"],"de":["Indexer für die Beacon-Kette","API für den Zugriff auf Daten","Telegram-Bot für Benachrichtigungen","Mini-Anwendung für die Überwachung in Echtzeit","Validierung der Leistung und Belohnungen"],"pt":["Criação de problemas no GitHub de forma eficaz","Validação da cadeia de beacon","Integração com o Telegram","Mini-aplicativo para desempenho e recompensas em tempo real","Alertas personalizados"],"ru":["Эффективное создание проблем в GitHub","Валидация beacon chain","Интеграция с Telegram","Мини-приложение для производительности и наград в реальном времени","Настройка уведомлений"],"ar":["إنشاء مشاكل على GitHub بفعالية","تحقق رتبة المحسّنة","التكامل مع تليجرام","تطبيق مصغر لاداء و مكافآت في الوقت الحقيقي","تنبيهات مخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GitHub Issue","Beacon 链","验证器监控","实时性能","奖励跟踪","警报通知","开发者工具"],"ja":["GitHub Issue","Beacon チェーン","バリデーターモニター","リアルタイムパフォーマンス","報酬の追跡","アラート通知","開発者ツール"],"ko":["GitHub Issue","Beacon 체인","검증기 모니터","실시간 성능","보상 추적","경고 알림","개발자 도구"],"es":["GitHub Issue","validación de cadena de Beacon","indexer","API","bot de Telegram","monitoreo en tiempo real","rendimiento de validadores","recompensas de validadores"],"fr":["GitHub Issue","validation de chaîne Beacon","indexer","API","bot Telegram","surveillance en temps réel","performances des validateurs","récompenses des validateurs"],"de":["GitHub Issue","Validierung der Beacon-Kette","Indexer","API","Telegram-Bot","Überwachung in Echtzeit","Leistung der Validatoren","Belohnungen der Validatoren"],"pt":["GitHub Issue","validação da cadeia de beacon","criação de problemas no GitHub","integração com o Telegram","desempenho em tempo real","recompensas","alertas personalizados"],"ru":["GitHub Issue","валідація beacon chain","создание проблем в GitHub","интеграция с Telegram","производительность в реальном времени","награды","настройка уведомлений"],"ar":["أداة GitHub Issue","تحقق رتبة المحسّنة","إنشاء مشاكل على GitHub","التكامل مع تليجرام","الاداء في الوقت الحقيقي","مكافآت","تنبيهات مخصصة"]}},"owner":"NodeSentinel","repo":"beacon-chain-validators-monitor","repoPath":"NodeSentinel/beacon-chain-validators-monitor","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.430Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"github-issue","description":"Use when creating GitHub issues, breaking down work into issues, or when asked to file a bug report or feature request","bodyPreview":"# Creating GitHub Issues\n\nCreate focused, self-contained GitHub issues that an external contributor could implement without additional context.\n\n## Decision Flow\n\n```\nWork requested\n    │\n    ▼\nSingle clear goal? ──yes──> Create single issue\n    │\n    no\n    │\n    ▼\nSpans multiple layers? ──yes──> Create epic with sub-issues\n```\n\n## Scope Boundaries (CRITICAL)\n\n**Stick to what was requested.** Create issues ONLY for the requested feature. Do NOT expand into adjacent features.\n\nWhen Feature X dep","body":"# Creating GitHub Issues\n\nCreate focused, self-contained GitHub issues that an external contributor could implement without additional context.\n\n## Decision Flow\n\n```\nWork requested\n    │\n    ▼\nSingle clear goal? ──yes──> Create single issue\n    │\n    no\n    │\n    ▼\nSpans multiple layers? ──yes──> Create epic with sub-issues\n```\n\n## Scope Boundaries (CRITICAL)\n\n**Stick to what was requested.** Create issues ONLY for the requested feature. Do NOT expand into adjacent features.\n\nWhen Feature X depends on Feature Y:\n\n- Create minimal stub for Y (just enough to unblock X)\n- ASK user if they want a separate epic for Y\n\n**ASK before proceeding when:**\n\n1. Adjacent features detected\n2. Ambiguous boundaries\n3. Multiple interpretations possible\n4. Feature seems too large (10+ issues)\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Clarify Scope\n\nASK user about boundaries before drafting.\n\n### 2. Review Preference\n\nUse `AskUserQuestion`:\n\n- **\"Review first\" (Recommended)**: Create preview file in scratchpad for feedback before creating issues\n- **\"Create directly\"**: Create issues immediately with `needs-review` label added via `gh issue edit <num> --add-label \"needs-review\"` after creation\n\n### 3. Create Issues (Single Script)\n\nUse GraphQL API for reliable creation (see `./graphql-api.md`).\n\n**CRITICAL**: Execute ALL operations in a SINGLE bash script to minimize permission prompts. This includes:\n\n1. Getting repo info\n2. Getting repo ID\n3. Creating epic\n4. Creating all sub-issues\n5. Linking sub-issues to epic\n6. Adding labels\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\n# ALL OPERATIONS IN ONE SCRIPT - Single permission prompt\n\nset -e\n\n# 1. Get repo info\nREPO=$(gh repo view --json nameWithOwner -q .nameWithOwner)\nOWNER=$(echo \"$REPO\" | cut -d''/'' -f1)\nNAME=$(echo \"$REPO\" | cut -d''/'' -f2)\n\n# 2. Get repo ID\nREPO_ID=$(gh api graphql -f query=\"query { repository(owner: \\\"$OWNER\\\", name: \\\"$NAME\\\") { id } }\" -q ''.data.repository.id'')\n\n# 3. Create epic\nEPIC=$(gh api graphql -f query=''\nmutation($repoId: ID!, $title: String!, $body: String!) {\n  createIssue(input: { repositoryId: $repoId, title: $title, body: $body }) {\n    issue { number id }\n  }\n}'' -f repoId=\"$REPO_ID\" -f title=\"[Context] Epic: Feature Name\" -f body=\"$(cat <<''EOF''\n## Objective\nEpic description here...\n\n## Sub-Issues\n- [ ] Sub-issue 1\n- [ ] Sub-issue 2\nEOF\n)\")\nEPIC_NUM=$(echo \"$EPIC\" | jq -r ''.data.createIssue.issue.number'')\nEPIC_ID=$(echo \"$EPIC\" | jq -r ''.data.createIssue.issue.id'')\n\n# 4. Create sub-issues\nISSUE1=$(gh api graphql -f query=''\nmutation($repoId: ID!, $title: String!, $body: String!) {\n  createIssue(input: { repositoryId: $repoId, title: $title, body: $body }) {\n    issue { number id }\n  }\n}'' -f repoId=\"$REPO_ID\" -f title=\"[Context] Sub-issue 1\" -f body=\"Issue body...\")\nISSUE1_NUM=$(echo \"$ISSUE1\" | jq -r ''.data.createIssue.issue.number'')\nISSUE1_ID=$(echo \"$ISSUE1\" | jq -r ''.data.createIssue.issue.id'')\n\n# Continue for all sub-issues...\n\n# 5. Link sub-issues (attempt - may not be available on all repos)\ngh api graphql \\\n  -H \"GraphQL-Features: sub_issues\" \\\n  -f query=''mutation($parentId: ID!, $childId: ID!) {\n    addSubIssue(input: { issueId: $parentId, subIssueId: $childId }) {\n      issue { number }\n    }\n  }'' \\\n  -f parentId=\"$EPIC_ID\" \\\n  -f childId=\"$ISSUE1_ID\" 2>/dev/null || true\n\n# 6. Add labels\nfor issue in $EPIC_NUM $ISSUE1_NUM; do\n  gh issue edit \"$issue\" --add-label \"needs-review\" --repo \"$REPO\" 2>/dev/null || true\ndone\n\necho \"Created Epic #$EPIC_NUM with sub-issues\"\n```\n\n## Issue Structure\n\n### Title Convention\n\nIssue titles MUST include context prefix from the user''s request. Extract the context (e.g., \"Seller\", \"Buyer\", \"Payments\") and prefix all issues:\n\n```\n[Context] Issue title\n```\n\nExamples:\n\n- User asks: \"create issues for the Seller\" → `[Seller] Seller Registration`, `[Seller] Create Product Listing`\n- User asks: \"create issues for checkout flow\" → `[Checkout] Cart Summary`, `[Checkout] Payment Processing`\n- Epic title: `[Seller] Epic: Seller Experience`\n\n### Required Sections\n\nEvery issue MUST include:\n\n| Section                 | Purpose                           |\n| ----------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| **Objective**           | Single, clear goal (one sentence) |\n| **Scope**               | What''s included                   |\n| **Acceptance Criteria** | Checkboxes for \"done\"             |\n| **Out of Scope**        | Explicit boundaries               |\n| **How to Test**         | Verification steps                |\n\nOptional: Examples, Technical Notes, Dependencies, Related\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n| Mistake                          | Fix                                   |\n| -------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| Vague objective                  | Specific goal with measurable outcome |\n| Missing acceptance criteria      | Add checkboxes                        |\n| Expanding into adjacent features | ASK if separate epic needed           |\n| Using only labels to link issues | Use GraphQL `addSubIssue`             |\n\n## Reference Files\n\nLoad these on-demand as needed:\n\n- `./graphql-api.md` - GraphQL mutations for creating issues and sub-issues (RECOMMENDED)\n- `./cli-reference.md` - Quick gh CLI commands reference\n- `./templates.md` - Issue body templates and examples\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:11:13.458Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring structured issue tracking and project management through GitHub APIs and Telegram bot integrations.","zh":"适合需要通过GitHub API和Telegram机器人集成进行结构化问题跟踪和项目管理的开发代理。","ja":"GitHub APIおよびTelegramボットの統合を介した構造化された問題追跡およびプロジェクト管理を必要とする開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"GitHub API 및 Telegram 봇 통합을 통해 구조화된 문제 추적 및 프로젝트 관리가 필요한 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que requieren un seguimiento de problemas estructurado y gestión de proyectos a través de las APIs de GitHub y las integraciones del bot de Telegram.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant un suivi de problèmes structuré et une gestion de projet via les API GitHub et les intégrations de bot Telegram.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungssagenten, die ein strukturiertes Problemtracking und Projektmanagement über GitHub-APIs und Telegram-Bot-Integrationen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que requerem acompanhamento de problemas estruturado e gerenciamento de projetos por meio de APIs do GitHub e integrações de bot do Telegram.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, требующих структурированного отслеживания проблем и управления проектами через API GitHub и интеграции с Telegram-ботами.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات التطوير التي تتطلب تتبع مشاكل منظمًا وإدارة مشاريع من خلال واجهات برمجة تطبيقات GitHub ودمج بوت تلجرام."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create focused, self-contained GitHub issues with clear goals, utilizing decision flows and scope boundaries to manage work requests, epics, and sub-issues, all while integrating with Telegram for real-time alerts and updates.","zh":"赋予代理创建专注、自成体系的GitHub问题的能力，具有明确的目标，利用决策流程和范围边界来管理工作请求、史诗和子问题，同时与Telegram集成以实现实时警报和更新。","ja":"エージェントが焦点を当てた、自己完結的なGitHubの問題を作成する能力を付与し、明確な目標を持ち、決定フローとスコープの境界を使用して作業リクエスト、エピック、サブ問題を管理し、リアルタイムのアラートと更新のためにTelegramと統合します。","ko":"에이전트가 명확한 목표를 갖고焦点을 맞춘 GitHub 문제를 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 의사 결정 흐름과 범위 경계를 사용하여 작업 요청, 에피소드 및 하위 문제를 관리하고, 실시간 알림 및 업데이트를 위한 Telegram과 통합합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear problemas de GitHub enfocados y autocontenidos con objetivos claros, utilizando flujos de decisión y límites de alcance para gestionar solicitudes de trabajo, épicos y subproblemas, todo mientras se integra con Telegram para alertas y actualizaciones en tiempo real.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des problèmes GitHub ciblés et autocontenus avec des objectifs clairs, en utilisant des flux de décision et des limites de portée pour gérer les demandes de travail, les épopées et les sous-problèmes, le tout en s''intégrant avec Telegram pour des alertes et des mises à jour en temps réel.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, fokussierte, selbstenthaltene GitHub-Probleme mit klaren Zielen zu erstellen, die Entscheidungsflüsse und Umfangsgrenzen nutzen, um Arbeitsanforderungen, Epen und Unterprobleme zu verwalten, und sich gleichzeitig mit Telegram für Echtzeitwarnungen und -aktualisierungen integrieren.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem problemas focados e autocontidos no GitHub com metas claras, utilizando fluxos de decisão e limites de escopo para gerenciar solicitações de trabalho, épicos e subproblemas, tudo isso integrado ao Telegram para alertas e atualizações em tempo real.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать сосредоточенные, самодостаточные проблемы GitHub с четкими целями, используя потоки решений и границы объема для управления запросами на работу, эпики и субзадачи, все это интегрированно с Telegram для оповещений и обновлений в реальном времени.","ar":"يُمكِّن الوكلاء من إنشاء مشاكل محددة ومتكاملة في جيثب مع أهداف واضحة، باستخدام تدفقات القرار وحدود النطاق لإدارة طلبات العمل والمهام الكبيرة والفرعية، مع دمجها مع تيلجرام للحصول على تنبيهات وتحديثات في الوقت الفعلي."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating single issues for clear goals","Generating epics with sub-issues for complex tasks","Integrating Telegram bots for real-time validator performance alerts"],"zh":["为明确的目标创建单个问题","为复杂任务生成包含子问题的史诗","将Telegram机器人集成用于实时验证器性能警报"],"ja":["明確な目標のための単一の問題を作成する","複雑なタスクのためのサブ問題を含むエピックを生成する","リアルタイムのバリデータパフォーマンスアラートのためのTelegramボットを統合する"],"ko":["명확한 목표를 위한 단일 문제 생성","복잡한 작업을 위한 하위 문제가 포함된 에피소드 생성","실시간 검증기 성능 알림을 위한 Telegram 봇 통합"],"es":["Crear problemas individuales para objetivos claros","Generar épicos con subproblemas para tareas complejas","Integrar bots de Telegram para alertas de rendimiento de validadores en tiempo real"],"fr":["Créer des problèmes individuels pour des objectifs clairs","Générer des épopées avec des sous-problèmes pour des tâches complexes","Intégrer des bots Telegram pour des alertes de performances de validateurs en temps réel"],"de":["Erstellen von einzelnen Problemen für klare Ziele","Erzeugen von Epen mit Unterproblemen für komplexe Aufgaben","Integration von Telegram-Bots für Echtzeitwarnungen zur Leistung von Validierern"],"pt":["Criar problemas individuais para metas claras","Gerar épicos com subproblemas para tarefas complexas","Integrar bots do Telegram para alertas de desempenho de validadores em tempo real"],"ru":["Создавать отдельные проблемы для ясных целей","Генерировать эпики с субзадачами для сло