entation","Intégration avec le modèle de lac de contexte","Curation de contenu pertinent","Structure de rôles personnalisable","Historique de contexte récent","Intégration avec MCP"],"de":["Intelligente Aktualisierung von Rollen und Dokumentation","Integration mit dem Kontextsee-Muster","Kuration von relevantem Inhalt","Anpassbare Rollenstruktur","Aktueller Kontextverlauf","Integration mit MCP"],"pt":["Atualização inteligente de papéis e documentos","Integração com o padrão de lago de contexto","Curadoria inteligente de conteúdo","Estrutura de papéis personalizável","Integração com MCP"],"ru":["Интеллектуальное обновление ролей и документов","Интеграция с шаблоном контекстного озера","Интеллектуальная курирование контента","Настраиваемая структура ролей","Интеграция с MCP"],"ar":["تحديث ذكاء لأدوار والمستندات","الدمج مع نمط بحيرة السياق","التنسيق الذكي للمحتوى","هيكل أدوار قابل للتعديل","الدمج مع MCP"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Claude Code","学习技能","文件系统优先","知识管理","智能更新","会话摘要","Context Lake 模式"],"ja":["Claude Code","学習スキル","ファイルシステム優先","知識管理","智能的な更新","セッションの要約","Context Lake パターン"],"ko":["Claude Code","학습 기능","파일 시스템 우선","知識 관리","智能的な 更新","세션 요약","Context Lake 패턴"],"es":["aprendizaje automático","gestión de conocimiento","Claude Code","sistema de archivos","patrón de lago de contexto","curación de contenido","roles personalizables","MCP","desarrollo de software","inteligencia artificial"],"fr":["apprentissage automatique","gestion des connaissances","Claude Code","système de fichiers","modèle de lac de contexte","curation de contenu","rôles personnalisables","MCP","développement de logiciels","intelligence artificielle"],"de":["maschinelles Lernen","Wissensmanagement","Claude Code","Dateisystem","Kontextsee-Muster","Inhaltskurierung","anpassbare Rollen","MCP","Softwareentwicklung","künstliche Intelligenz"],"pt":["gerenciamento de conhecimento","sistema de arquivos","inteligência artificial","padrão de lago de contexto","MCP","aprendizado de máquina","desenvolvimento de software","engenharia de conhecimento"],"ru":["управление знаниями","файловая система","искусственный интеллект","шаблон контекстного озера","MCP","машинное обучение","разработка программного обеспечения","инженерия знаний"],"ar":["إدارة المعرفة","نظام الملفات","الذكاء الاصطناعي","نمط بحيرة السياق","MCP","تعلم الآلة","تطوير البرمجيات","هندسة المعرفة"]}},"owner":"joshuacook","repo":"motoko","repoPath":"joshuacook/motoko","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.431Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"learn","description":"Process inbox summaries and update system knowledge. Curates role Right Now sections, appends Recent Context, updates central docs. Intelligent curation, not just appending.","bodyPreview":"# Learn (System Learning)\n\nIntelligently update roles and docs based on session summaries.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- User says: \"learn\", \"update roles\"\n- After compressing sessions\n- When inbox has session summaries\n\n## Approach\n\n**OLD:** Append bullets to logs\n**NEW:** Intelligent curation\n\n**Role structure:**\n- What This Role Does (rarely changes)\n- **Right Now** ← CURATE (what''s currently relevant)\n- **Recent Context** ← APPEND (timestamped, last 30 days)\n- How This Role Operates (rarely change","body":"# Learn (System Learning)\n\nIntelligently update roles and docs based on session summaries.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- User says: \"learn\", \"update roles\"\n- After compressing sessions\n- When inbox has session summaries\n\n## Approach\n\n**OLD:** Append bullets to logs\n**NEW:** Intelligent curation\n\n**Role structure:**\n- What This Role Does (rarely changes)\n- **Right Now** ← CURATE (what''s currently relevant)\n- **Recent Context** ← APPEND (timestamped, last 30 days)\n- How This Role Operates (rarely changes)\n\n## Process\n\n### 1. Read Inbox\n\n```bash\nls inbox/session-summaries/\ncat inbox/session-summaries/*.md\n```\n\n### 2. Analyze Changes\n\n**Extract from summaries:**\n- Decisions made\n- Tools/workflows built\n- Role activity\n- Context changes\n\n**Categorize:**\n- **Right Now:** What''s newly relevant for ongoing work\n- **Recent Context:** Timestamped decisions (auto-prune > 30 days)\n\n### 3. Create Branch\n\n```bash\ngit checkout -b learning-$(date +%Y-%m-%d)\n```\n\n### 4. Update Roles\n\n**For each affected role:**\n\n#### A. Read Current Role\n```bash\ncat roles/[role-file].md\n```\n\n#### B. Curate \"Right Now\"\n\nThis is CURATION, not appending:\n1. Read existing \"Right Now\"\n2. Add newly relevant context\n3. Remove stale/no-longer-relevant items\n4. Keep tight (5-10 bullets max)\n\n#### C. Append \"Recent Context\"\n\nAdd timestamped entry at top:\n```markdown\n## Recent Context (Last 30 Days)\n\n**YYYY-MM-DD:** [Summary]\n- Key point 1\n- Key point 2\n\n[...existing entries...]\n```\n\nAuto-prune if > 10 entries.\n\n#### D. Update \"Last Updated\"\n\n### 5. Commit and PR\n\n```bash\ngit add roles/*.md\ngit commit -m \"System learning: [summary]\"\ngit push -u origin learning-$(date +%Y-%m-%d)\ngh pr create --title \"System Learning $(date +%Y-%m-%d)\" --body \"...\"\ngit checkout main\n```\n\n### 6. Report\n\n```\nSystem learning complete.\n\nProcessed: [N] session summaries\nRoles updated: [list]\nBranch: learning-YYYY-MM-DD\nPR: #[number]\n\nNext: Review and merge PR.\n```\n\n## Curation Guidelines\n\n**\"Right Now\" = what''s relevant:**\n- Shapes how role operates TODAY\n- Would need to know this to do role''s job\n- NOT just recent - could be weeks old but still relevant\n\n**\"Recent Context\" = what happened:**\n- Timestamped decisions\n- Links to details if needed\n- Auto-prune oldest when > 10 entries\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:11:41.046Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code requiring intelligent knowledge management and Context Lake pattern integration with MCP.","zh":"适用于 Claude Code 等人工智能代理，需要智能知识管理和 Context Lake 模式与 MCP 集成。","ja":"Claude Code などの AI エージェントに適しており、知識管理と Context Lake パターンの MCP との統合が必要です。","ko":"클라우드 코드와 같은 인공지능 에이전트에 적합하며 지능형 지식 관리와 컨텍스트 레이크 패턴의 MCP 통합이 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude Code que requieren una gestión inteligente del conocimiento y la integración del patrón Context Lake con MCP.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Claude Code nécessitant une gestion intelligente des connaissances et une intégration du modèle Context Lake avec MCP.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Claude Code, die eine intelligente Wissensverwaltung und eine Integration des Context-Lake-Musters mit MCP erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude Code que exigem gestão de conhecimento inteligente e integração de padrão Context Lake com MCP.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code, требующих интеллектуального управления знаниями и интеграции шаблона Context Lake с MCP.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude Code الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة معرفة ذكية وتكامل نمط Context Lake مع MCP."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to intelligently update roles and documents based on session summaries, leveraging filesystem-first knowledge management and intelligent curation, while integrating with Context Lake and MCP protocols.","zh":"赋予代理智能更新角色和文档的能力，基于会话摘要，利用文件系统优先的知识管理和智能策划，同时与 Context Lake 和 MCP 协议集成。","ja":"セッションの要約に基づいて役割とドキュメントをインテリジェントに更新するエージェントの能力を提供します。ファイルシステム優先の知識管理とインテリジェントなキュレーションを利用しながら、Context Lake と MCP プロトコルと統合します。","ko":"세션 요약을 기반으로 역할과 문서를 지능적으로 업데이트하는 에이전트의 능력을 제공하며 파일시스템 우선의 지식 관리와 지능형 큐레이션을 활용하여 컨텍스트 레이크와 MCP 프로토콜과 통합합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes actualizar inteligentemente los roles y los documentos en función de los resúmenes de sesiones, aprovechando la gestión de conocimientos basada en el sistema de archivos y la curación inteligente, y al mismo tiempo integrándose con los protocolos Context Lake y MCP.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre à jour de manière intelligente les rôles et les documents en fonction des résumés de sessions, en exploitant la gestion des connaissances basée sur le système de fichiers et la curation intelligente, tout en s''intégrant avec les protocoles Context Lake et MCP.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Rollen und Dokumente basierend auf Sitzungszusammenfassungen intelligent zu aktualisieren, indem es die Dateisystem-erste Wissensverwaltung und intelligente Kuratierung nutzt und gleichzeitig mit den Context-Lake- und MCP-Protokollen integriert.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a atualizar inteligentemente funções e documentos com base em resumos de sessões, aproveitando a gestão de conhecimento orientada a sistema de arquivos e curadoria inteligente, além de integrar com os protocolos Context Lake e MCP.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью интеллектуально обновлять роли и документы на основе сводок сессий, используя файловую систему для управления знаниями и интеллектуальную курирование, а также интегрируясь с протоколами Context Lake и MCP.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تحديث الأدوار والوثائق بذكاء بناءً على ملخصات الجلسات، مستفيداً من إدارة المعرفة التي تعتمد على نظام الملفات والتنقيح الذكي، بالإضافة إلى التكامل مع بروتوكولات Context Lake و MCP."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating role updates with intelligent curation","Generating timestamped recent context for roles","Intelligently compressing sessions for knowledge management"],"zh":["使用智能策划自动执行角色更新","为角色生成时间戳的最近上下文","使用会话压缩进行知识管理"],"ja":["インテリジェントなキュレーションを使用して役割の更新を自動化する","役割の最近のコンテキストにタイムスタンプを生成する","セッションの圧縮を使用して知識管理を行う"],"ko":["지능형 큐레이션을 사용하여 역할 업데이트를 자동화하는 것","역할 최근 컨텍스트에 타임스탬프를 생성하는 것","세션 압축을 사용하여 지식 관리를 수행하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar las actualizaciones de roles con curación inteligente","Generar contexto reciente con marca de tiempo para roles","Comprimir sesiones de manera inteligente para la gestión del conocimiento"],"fr":["Automatiser les mises à jour de rôles avec une curation intelligente","Générer un contexte récent avec horodatage pour les rôles","Compresser de manière intelligente les sessions pour la gestion des connaissances"],"de":["Automatisieren von Rollen-Aktualisierungen mit intelligenter Kuratierung","Erzeugen von aktuellem Kontext mit Zeitstempel für Rollen","Intelligente Komprimierung von Sitzungen für die Wissensverwaltung"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de funções com curadoria inteligente","Gerar contexto recente com carimbo de data/hora para funções","Comprimir inteligentemente sessões para gestão de conhecimento"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обновления ролей с помощью интеллектуальной курирования","Генерировать недавний контекст с меткой времени для ролей","Интеллектуально сжимать сессии для управления знаниями"],"ar":["تأتمتة تحديث الأدوار باستخدام التنقيح الذكي","توليد سياق حديث مع طابع زمني للأدوار","ضغط الجلسات بذكاء لإدارة المعرفة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Claude Code integration","Dependent on Context Lake pattern and MCP","Limited to filesystem-based knowledge management"],"zh":["需要 Claude Code 集成","依赖于 Context Lake 模式和 MCP","仅限于文件系统基础知识管理"],"ja":["Claude Code の統合が必要","Context Lake パターンと MCP 依存","ファイルシステムベースの知識管理に限定"],"ko":["클라우드 코드 통합이 필요","컨텍스트 레이크 패턴 및 MCP 의존","파일시스템 기반 지식 관리에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere integración con Claude Code","Dependiente del patrón Context Lake y MCP","Limitado a la gestión de conocimientos basada en el sistema de archivos"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec Claude Code","Dépendant du modèle Context Lake et MCP","Limité à la gestion des connaissances basée sur le système de fichiers"],"de":["Erfordert Integration mit Claude Code","Abhängig vom Context-Lake-Muster und MCP","Begrenzt auf die dateisystembasierte Wissensverwaltung"],"pt":["Exige integração com Claude Code","Depende do padrão Context Lake e MCP","Limitado à gestão de conhecimento baseada em sistema de arquivos"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с Claude Code","Зависит от шаблона Context Lake и MCP","Ограничен управлением знаниями на основе файловой системы"],"ar":["يحتاج إلى تكامل مع Claude Code","يعتمد على نمط Context Lake و MCP","محدود بإدارة المعرفة القائمة على نظام الملفات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('specvital/specvital.github.io/adr-write', 'community', 'specvital', 'specvital.github.io', 'specvital/specvital.github.io', 'adr-write', 0, 0, 75, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.431Z', '2026-02-18T05:12:14.283Z', NULL, '{"id":"specvital/specvital.github.io/adr-write","name":"adr-write","description":{"zh":"ADR写作命令用于生成ADR文档，基于 adr-candidates.md 中的发现候选项。它研究GitHub提交和PR，并应用ADR模板","ja":"ADR書き込みコマンドは、adr-candidates.md に記載された候補に基づいてADR文書を生成するものです。GitHubのコミットとPRを調査し、ADRテンプレートを適用します","ko":"ADR 작성 명령은 adr-candidates.md에 기록된 후보자를 기반으로 ADR 문서를 생성합니다. GitHub 커밋 및 PR를 연구하고 ADR 템플릿을 적용합니다","es":"ADR Write es una herramienta que genera documentos ADR completos basados en candidatos descubiertos. Automatiza el proceso de creación de documentos","fr":"ADR Write est un outil qui génère des documents ADR complets basés sur des candidats découverts. Il automatise le processus de création de documents","de":"ADR Write ist ein Tool, das vollständige ADR-Dokumente basierend auf entdeckten Kandidaten generiert. Es automatisiert den Erstellungsprozess von Dokumenten","pt":"O ADR Write é uma ferramenta que gera documentos ADR completos com base em commits e PRs do GitHub.","ru":"ADR Write — это инструмент, который генерирует полные документы ADR на основе коммитов и PR GitHub.","ar":"ADR Write هو أداة توليد وثائق ADR كاملة بناءً على التعليقات والطلبات السابقة على GitHub.","en":"🏠 Official project website and documentation hub hosted on GitHub Pages."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"ADR 写作命令 - 生成ADR文档","ja":"ADR 書き込みコマンド - ADR文書の生成","ko":"ADR 작성 명령 - ADR 문서 생성","es":"ADR Write: Generación de documentos ADR","fr":"ADR Write: Génération de documents ADR","de":"ADR Write: Erstellung von ADR-Dokumenten","pt":"ADR Write: Gere ADRs com GitHub","ru":"ADR Write: Генерация ADR на GitHub","ar":"ADR Write: إنشاء وثائق ADR على GitHub","en":"adr-write"},"description":{"zh":"ADR写作命令用于生成ADR文档，基于 adr-candidates.md 中的发现候选项。它研究GitHub提交和PR，并应用ADR模板","ja":"ADR書き込みコマンドは、adr-candidates.md に記載された候補に基づいてADR文書を生成するものです。GitHubのコミットとPRを調査し、ADRテンプレートを適用します","ko":"ADR 작성 명령은 adr-candidates.md에 기록된 후보자를 기반으로 ADR 문서를 생성합니다. GitHub 커밋 및 PR를 연구하고 ADR 템플릿을 적용합니다","es":"ADR Write es una herramienta que genera documentos ADR completos basados en candidatos descubiertos. Automatiza el proceso de creación de documentos","fr":"ADR Write est un outil qui génère des documents ADR complets basés sur des candidats découverts. Il automatise le processus de création de documents","de":"ADR Write ist ein Tool, das vollständige ADR-Dokumente basierend auf entdeckten Kandidaten generiert. Es automatisiert den Erstellungsprozess von Dokumenten","pt":"O ADR Write é uma ferramenta que gera documentos ADR completos com base em commits e PRs do GitHub.","ru":"ADR Write — это инструмент, который генерирует полные документы ADR на основе коммитов и PR GitHub.","ar":"ADR Write هو أداة توليد وثائق ADR كاملة بناءً على التعليقات والطلبات السابقة على GitHub.","en":"🏠 Official project website and documentation hub hosted on GitHub Pages."},"definition":{"en":"🏠 Official project website and documentation hub hosted on GitHub Pages."},"features":{"zh":["基于 adr-candidates.md 中的发现候选项生成ADR文档","研究GitHub提交和PR","应用ADR模板","支持多代理人协作管道","生成完整的ADR文档"],"ja":["adr-candidates.md に記載された候補に基づいてADR文書を生成","GitHubのコミットとPRを調査","ADRテンプレートを適用","マルチエージェントコラボレーションパイプラインをサポート","完全なADR文書を生成"],"ko":["adr-candidates.md에 기록된 후보자를 기반으로 ADR 문서를 생성","GitHub 커밋 및 PR를 연구","ADR 템플릿을 적용","다중 에이전트 협력 파이프라인을 지원","완전한 ADR 문서를 생성"],"es":["Generación de documentos ADR completos","Uso de plantilla de ADR para crear documentos","Colaboración multi-agente para el proceso de creación de documentos","Investigación de commits y PRs de GitHub para generar documentos","Compatibilidad con la creación de documentos basados en candidatos"],"fr":["Génération de documents ADR complets","Utilisation d''un modèle de ADR pour créer des documents","Collaboration multi-agente pour le processus de création de documents","Recherche de commits et de PRs GitHub pour générer des documents","Compatibilité avec la création de documents basés sur des candidats"],"de":["Erstellung von vollständigen ADR-Dokumenten","Verwendung einer ADR-Vorlage zur Erstellung von Dokumenten","Mehragenten-Kollaboration für den Erstellungsprozess von Dokumenten","Recherche von GitHub-Commits und -PRs zur Erstellung von Dokumenten","Kompatibilität mit der Erstellung von Dokumenten basierend auf Kandidaten"],"pt":["Geração de documentos ADR completos","Pesquisa de commits e PRs do GitHub","Aplicação de modelo de ADR","Colaboração multi-agente","Integração com GitHub Pages"],"ru":["Генерация полных документов ADR","Поиск коммитов и PR GitHub","Применение шаблона ADR","Многоагентная коллаборация","Интеграция с GitHub Pages"],"ar":["إنشاء وثائق ADR كاملة","البحث في التعليقات والطلبات السابقة على GitHub","تطبيق نموذج ADR","تعاون متعدد الوكالات","التكامل مع GitHub Pages"]},"keywords":{"zh":["ADR写作命令","ADR文档生成","GitHub提交","PR研究","ADR模板","多代理人协作管道"],"ja":["ADR書き込みコマンド","ADR文書生成","GitHubコミット","PR調査","ADRテンプレート","マルチエージェントコラボレーションパイプライン"],"ko":["ADR 작성 명령","ADR 문서 생성","GitHub 커밋","PR 연구","ADR 템플릿","다중 에이전트 협력 파이프라인"],"es":["ADR Write","generación de documentos ADR","herramienta de ADR","plantilla de ADR","colaboración multi-agente","commits de GitHub","PRs de GitHub","candidatos de ADR"],"fr":["ADR Write","génération de documents ADR","outil de ADR","modèle de ADR","collaboration multi-agente","commits GitHub","PRs GitHub","candidats de ADR"],"de":["ADR Write","Erstellung von ADR-Dokumenten","ADR-Tool","ADR-Vorlage","Mehragenten-Kollaboration","GitHub-Commits","GitHub-PRs","ADR-Kandidaten"],"pt":["ADR Write","Geração de documentos ADR","GitHub","Commits","PRs","Modelo de ADR","Colaboração multi-agente"],"ru":["ADR Write","Генерация документов ADR","GitHub","Коммиты","PR","Шаблон ADR","Многоагентная коллаборация"],"ar":["ADR Write","إنشاء وثائق ADR","GitHub","التعليقات","الطلبات السابقة","نموذج ADR","تعاون متعدد الوكالات"]}},"owner":"specvital","repo":"specvital.github.io","repoPath":"specvital/specvital.github.io","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.431Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"adr-write","description":"Write ADR document from discovered candidates with GitHub context research","bodyPreview":"# ADR Write Command\n\nWrite ADR documents based on discovered candidates from `adr-candidates.md`.\n\n## User Input\n\n```text\n$ARGUMENTS\n```\n\nYou **MUST** consider the user input before proceeding.\n\n---\n\n## Overview\n\nGenerate complete ADR documents by researching GitHub commits/PRs and applying the ADR template.\n\n**Multi-Agent Collaboration Pipeline**:\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                    ADR Writing Pipeline                          │\n├──────","body":"# ADR Write Command\n\nWrite ADR documents based on discovered candidates from `adr-candidates.md`.\n\n## User Input\n\n```text\n$ARGUMENTS\n```\n\nYou **MUST** consider the user input before proceeding.\n\n---\n\n## Overview\n\nGenerate complete ADR documents by researching GitHub commits/PRs and applying the ADR template.\n\n**Multi-Agent Collaboration Pipeline**:\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                    ADR Writing Pipeline                          │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  Phase 1: specvital-specialist                                   │\n│    → Search related commits/PRs via GitHub API                   │\n│    → Extract decision context and rationale                      │\n│    → Identify options that were considered                       │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  Phase 2: product-strategist                                     │\n│    → Analyze decision trade-offs                                 │\n│    → Evaluate consequences (positive/negative)                   │\n│    → Structure options comparison                                │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  Phase 3: Write ADR Documents                                    │\n│    → Generate English version (docs/en/adr/)                     │\n│    → Generate Korean version (docs/ko/adr/)                      │\n│    → Update all required index files                             │\n│    → Update sidebar configuration                                │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n## Input Interpretation\n\n### Numeric Reference\n\nReference candidates by number from `adr-candidates.md`:\n\n```bash\n/adr-write 1          # Platform Level candidate #1\n/adr-write core/1     # Core repository candidate #1\n/adr-write worker/1   # Worker repository candidate #1\n```\n\n### Natural Language\n\nDescribe what ADR to write:\n\n```bash\n/adr-write billing and quota system\n/adr-write write the AI spec document generation ADR\n/adr-write domain hints extraction for core repository\n```\n\n### Parsing Logic\n\n1. **Numeric only** (e.g., `1`, `2`): Match Platform Level candidate by number\n2. **Prefixed numeric** (e.g., `core/1`, `web/2`): Match repository-level candidate\n3. **Natural language**: Search candidate titles and descriptions for best match\n\n---\n\n## Execution Flow\n\n### Phase 0: Load Candidate Information\n\nRead `adr-candidates.md` and identify the target ADR:\n\n```\n1. Parse user input to identify candidate\n2. Extract from adr-candidates.md:\n   - Title\n   - Target location (e.g., /en/adr/13-xxx.md)\n   - Related repositories\n   - Complexity and priority\n3. Determine ADR number and file paths\n```\n\n**File Path Determination**:\n\n| Candidate Type | English Path                         | Korean Path                          |\n| -------------- | ------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------ |\n| Platform Level | `docs/en/adr/{num}-{slug}.md`        | `docs/ko/adr/{num}-{slug}.md`        |\n| Core           | `docs/en/adr/core/{num}-{slug}.md`   | `docs/ko/adr/core/{num}-{slug}.md`   |\n| Worker         | `docs/en/adr/worker/{num}-{slug}.md` | `docs/ko/adr/worker/{num}-{slug}.md` |\n| Web            | `docs/en/adr/web/{num}-{slug}.md`    | `docs/ko/adr/web/{num}-{slug}.md`    |\n\n---\n\n### Phase 1: Context Research (specvital-specialist)\n\n**Task tool invocation**:\n\n```\nTask(subagent_type=\"specvital-specialist\", prompt=\"\"\"\nResearch GitHub context for ADR: {candidate_title}\n\n**Target Repositories**: {related_repos}\n\n**Research Tasks**:\n\n1. **Search Related Commits**\n   - Use gh CLI or GitHub MCP to search commits\n   - Keywords: {extracted_keywords}\n   - Timeframe: Last 90 days\n   - Command: `gh search commits \"{keyword}\" --repo specvital/{repo} --limit 20`\n\n2. **Search Related PRs**\n   - Find PRs that introduced or modified this feature\n   - Command: `gh pr list --repo specvital/{repo} --search \"{keyword}\" --state all --limit 10`\n\n3. **Extract Decision Context**\n   For each relevant commit/PR:\n   - What problem was being solved?\n   - What approach was taken?\n   - Any alternatives mentioned in discussions?\n\n4. **Output Format**\n```\n\n## Relevant Commits\n\n- {commit_sha}: {message} - {date}\n\n## Relevant PRs\n\n- #{pr_number}: {title} - {state}\n\n## Context Summary\n\n- Problem: ...\n- Decision: ...\n- Alternatives mentioned: ...\n\n```\n\"\"\")\n```\n\n---\n\n### Phase 2: Decision Analysis (product-strategist)\n\n**Task tool invocation**:\n\n```\nTask(subagent_type=\"product-strategist\", prompt=\"\"\"\nAnalyze the architectural decision for ADR: {candidate_title}\n\n**Input**: Context from Phase 1\n\n**Analysis Tasks**:\n\n1. **Structure the Context**\n   - What was the problem/need?\n   - Why was a decision required?\n   - What constraints existed?\n\n2. **Identify Options**\n   Based on commits/PRs and common patterns:\n   - Option A (selected): What was chosen and why\n   - Option B: What alternatives existed\n   - Option C: Any other approaches considered\n\n3. **Evaluate Consequences**\n   For the selected option:\n   - Positive outcomes (benefits, improvements)\n   - Negative outcomes (trade-offs, limitations)\n   - Technical implications\n\n4. **Output Format**\n   Structured content ready for ADR template sections:\n   - Context section content\n   - Decision section content\n   - Options Considered section content\n   - Consequences section content\n\"\"\")\n```\n\n---\n\n### Phase 3: Write ADR Documents\n\nGenerate both English and Korean versions following the template.\n\n**ADR Template Structure**:\n\n```markdown\n---\ntitle: { Title }\ndescription: ADR for {brief description}\n---\n\n# ADR-{num}: {Title}\n\n> [Korean Version](/ko/adr/{path}) OR 🇰🇷 [한국어 버전](/ko/adr/{path})\n\n| Date       | Author    | Repos            |\n| ---------- | --------- | ---------------- |\n| YYYY-MM-DD | @{author} | {repo1}, {repo2} |\n\n## Context\n\n{Problem situation and why a decision was needed}\n\n## Decision\n\n{The decision made and its rationale}\n\n## Options Considered\n\n### Option A: {Name} (Selected)\n\n{Description, pros, cons}\n\n### Option B: {Name}\n\n{Description, pros, cons}\n\n## Consequences\n\n**Positive:**\n\n- {Benefit 1}\n- {Benefit 2}\n\n**Negative:**\n\n- {Trade-off 1}\n- {Trade-off 2}\n\n## References\n\n- [Related ADR](/en/adr/XX-related.md)\n- [Related PR](https://github.com/specvital/{repo}/pull/{num})\n```\n\n---\n\n## Post-Write Updates (CRITICAL)\n\nAfter writing ADR documents, you **MUST** update all required files per CLAUDE.md rules.\n\n### For Platform Level ADR (e.g., `adr/13-xxx.md`)\n\nUpdate **6 files**:\n\n```\n☐ docs/en/index.md           ← Homepage ADR links section\n☐ docs/ko/index.md           ← Homepage ADR links section\n☐ docs/en/adr/index.md       ← ADR overview\n☐ docs/ko/adr/index.md       ← ADR overview\n☐ docs/.vitepress/config.mts ← Sidebar navigation\n```\n\n### For Repository Level ADR (e.g., `adr/core/16-xxx.md`)\n\nUpdate **6 files**:\n\n```\n☐ docs/en/index.md                 ← Homepage ADR links section\n☐ docs/ko/index.md                 ← Homepage ADR links section\n☐ docs/en/adr/index.md             ← ADR overview (repository section)\n☐ docs/ko/adr/index.md             ← ADR overview (repository section)\n☐ docs/en/adr/{category}/index.md  ← Category index\n☐ docs/ko/adr/{category}/index.md  ← Category index\n☐ docs/.vitepress/config.mts       ← Sidebar navigation\n```\n\n---\n\n## Language Rules\n\n### English Version (`/en/`)\n\n- Write entirely in English\n- Use technical terminology appropriately\n- Clear, concise prose\n\n### Korean Version (`/ko/`)\n\n- Write entirely in Korean\n- **MUST use noun-ending style** (명사형 종결)\n- **NEVER use verb-ending style** (동사 종결어미 금지)\n\n**Korean Style Examples**:\n\n| ✅ Correct                   | ❌ Incorrect                         |\n| ---------------------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| 데이터 무결성 검증           | 데이터 무결성을 검증합니다           |\n| API 호출 최소화              | API 호출이 최소화됩니다              |\n| 정적 분석 기반 테스트 카운트 | 정적 분석을 통해 테스트를 카운트한다 |\n\n---\n\n## Key Rules\n\n### Must Do\n\n- Load candidate info from `adr-candidates.md`\n- Research actual GitHub commits/PRs for context\n- Follow ADR template structure exactly\n- Generate both English and Korean versions\n- Update ALL required index files (check CLAUDE.md for complete list)\n- Update sidebar in `config.mts`\n- Use noun-ending style for Korean\n\n### Must Not Do\n\n- Skip GitHub research (must base on actual commits)\n- Write only one language version\n- Forget to update index files\n- Use verb endings in Korean documents\n- Guess content without evidence from commits/PRs\n\n---\n\n## Output Summary\n\nAfter completion, report:\n\n```\n## ADR Written\n\n| Item | Value |\n|------|-------|\n| Title | {ADR Title} |\n| Number | ADR-{num} |\n| English | docs/en/adr/{path} |\n| Korean | docs/ko/adr/{path} |\n\n## Files Updated\n\n- [x] docs/en/adr/{path} (created)\n- [x] docs/ko/adr/{path} (created)\n- [x] docs/en/index.md\n- [x] docs/ko/index.md\n- [x] docs/en/adr/index.md\n- [x] docs/ko/adr/index.md\n- [x] docs/.vitepress/config.mts\n\n## Source References\n\n- {commit_sha}: {message}\n- PR #{num}: {title}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Usage Examples\n\n```bash\n# Write Platform Level candidate #1 (Billing and Quota)\n/adr-write 1\n\n# Write Core repository candidate #1\n/adr-write core/1\n\n# Natural language - matches \"AI-Based Spec Document Generation Pipeline\"\n/adr-write AI spec generation\n\n# Natural language with context\n/adr-write write the billing ADR, focus on quota tracking aspects\n```\n\n---\n\n## Related Commands\n\n- `/adr-discover`: Discover ADR candidates\n- `/document-business-rule`: Business rule documentation\n- `/commit`: Commit message generation\n\n## Related Agents\n\n- `specvital-specialist`: GitHub context research\n- `product-strategist`: Decision analysis and trade-offs\n- `prompt-engineer`: Document quality optimization\n- `claude-code-specialist`: Command and workflow optimization\n\n---\n\n## Execution\n\nNow execute the workflow:\n\n1. **Parse $ARGUMENTS**: Identify target candidate from `adr-candidates.md`\n2. **Phase 1**: Invoke Task(specvital-specialist) for GitHub research\n3. **Phase 2**: Invoke Task(product-strategist) for decision analysis\n4. **Phase 3**: Write ADR documents (English + Korean)\n5. **Update Index Files**: Per CLAUDE.md requirements\n6. **Report**: Summary of created/updated files\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:12:14.283Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Documentation Agents needing automated ADR document generation based on GitHub commits and PRs.","zh":"非常适合需要自动根据 GitHub 提交和 PR 生成 ADR 文档的文档代理","ja":"GitHub のコミットと PR に基づいて自動で ADR ドキュメントを生成する必要があるドキュメント エージェントに最適","ko":"GitHub 커밋 및 PR를 기반으로 자동으로 ADR 문서를 생성해야 하는 문서 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Documentación que necesitan generación automática de documentos ADR basada en confirmaciones y solicitudes de extracción de GitHub.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de documentation ayant besoin d''une génération automatisée de documents ADR basée sur les validations et les demandes d''extraction de GitHub.","de":"Perfekt für Dokumentationsagenten, die eine automatisierte ADR-Dokumentenerstellung auf Basis von GitHub-Commits und Pull-Requests benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Documentação que necessitam de geração automática de documentos ADR com base em commits e PRs do GitHub.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов документации, которым требуется автоматизированная генерация документов ADR на основе коммитов и PR GitHub.","ar":"مثالي لعميل وثائق يتطلبونه لتوليد مستندات ADR آليًا بناءً على الالتزامات وطلبات السحب على GitHub."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate complete ADR documents by researching GitHub commits/PRs and applying the ADR template, utilizing Markdown files such as `adr-candidates.md` and leveraging GitHub Pages for hosting.","zh":"通过研究 GitHub 提交/PR 并应用 ADR 模板，利用 Markdown 文件（如 `adr-candidates.md`），并利用 GitHub Pages 进行托管，从而使代理能够生成完整的 ADR 文档","ja":"GitHub のコミット/PR を調査し、ADR テンプレートを適用し、Markdown ファイル（例：`adr-candidates.md`）を利用し、GitHub Pages でホストすることで、エージェントが完全な ADR ドキュメントを生成できるようにする","ko":"GitHub 커밋/PR를 조사하고 ADR 템플릿을 적용하고 Markdown 파일(예: `adr-candidates.md`)을 활용하고 GitHub Pages에서 호스팅함으로써 에이전트가 완전한 ADR 문서를 생성할 수 있도록 합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar documentos ADR completos investigando confirmaciones y solicitudes de extracción de GitHub y aplicando la plantilla ADR, utilizando archivos Markdown como `adr-candidates.md` y aprovechando GitHub Pages para la alojamiento.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des documents ADR complets en recherchant les validations et les demandes d''extraction de GitHub et en appliquant le modèle ADR, en utilisant des fichiers Markdown tels que `adr-candidates.md` et en exploitant GitHub Pages pour l''hébergement.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, vollständige ADR-Dokumente zu erstellen, indem sie GitHub-Commits und Pull-Requests recherchieren und die ADR-Vorlage anwenden, indem sie Markdown-Dateien wie `adr-candidates.md` verwenden und GitHub Pages für die Bereitstellung nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar documentos ADR completos pesquisando commits/PRs do GitHub e aplicando o modelo de ADR, utilizando arquivos Markdown como `adr-candidates.md` e aproveitando o GitHub Pages para hospedagem.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать полные документы ADR, исследуя коммиты/PR GitHub и применяя шаблон ADR, используя файлы Markdown, такие как `adr-candidates.md`, и использует GitHub Pages для размещения.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء مستندات ADR كاملة من خلال البحث في الالتزامات وطلبات السحب على GitHub وتطبيق نموذج ADR ، باستخدام ملفات Markdown مثل `adr-candidates.md` وتوظيف GitHub Pages لاستضافة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating ADR document creation from candidate lists","Generating documentation based on GitHub project history","Researching and applying ADR templates for consistent documentation"],"zh":["自动从候选列表生成 ADR 文档","根据 GitHub 项目历史记录生成文档","研究和应用 ADR 模板以实现一致的文档"],"ja":["候補者リストから ADR ドキュメントを自動生成する","GitHub プロジェクトの履歴に基づいてドキュメントを生成する","ADR テンプレートを調査して適用し、一貫したドキュメントを実現する"],"ko":["候補자 목록에서 ADR 문서를 자동 생성","GitHub 프로젝트 기록을 기반으로 문서 생성","ADR 템플릿을 조사하고 적용하여 일관된 문서를 구현"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de documentos ADR a partir de listas de candidatos","Generación de documentación basada en el historial del proyecto de GitHub","Investigación y aplicación de plantillas ADR para una documentación coherente"],"fr":["Automatisation de la création de documents ADR à partir de listes de candidats","Génération de la documentation basée sur l''historique du projet GitHub","Recherche et application de modèles ADR pour une documentation cohérente"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung von ADR-Dokumenten aus Kandidatenlisten","Generierung von Dokumentation basierend auf der Projektgeschichte von GitHub","Recherche und Anwendung von ADR-Vorlagen für eine konsistente Dokumentation"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de documentos ADR a partir de listas de candidatos","Gerar documentação com base na história do projeto GitHub","Pesquisar e aplicar modelos de ADR para documentação consistente"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание документов ADR из списков кандидатов","Генерировать документацию на основе истории проекта GitHub","Исследовать и применять шаблоны ADR для последовательной документации"],"ar":["تأتمتة إنشاء مستندات ADR من قوائم المرشحين","إنشاء توثيق بناءً على تاريخ مشروع GitHub","البحث وتطبيق قوالب ADR للوثائق المتسقة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to GitHub commits and PRs","Must have `adr-candidates.md` file for candidate discovery","Hosted on GitHub Pages"],"zh":["需要访问 GitHub 提交和 PR","必须有 `adr-candidates.md` 文件以发现候选项","托管在 GitHub Pages"],"ja":["GitHub のコミットと PR にアクセスする必要がある","`adr-candidates.md` ファイルが必要である候補者を発見する","GitHub Pages でホストされる"],"ko":["GitHub 커밋 및 PR에 액세스해야 함","`adr-candidates.md` 파일이 필요함을 발견하기 위함","GitHub Pages에서 호스팅됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a confirmaciones y solicitudes de extracción de GitHub","Debe tener el archivo `adr-candidates.md` para la detección de candidatos","Alojado en GitHub Pages"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux validations et aux demandes d''extraction de GitHub","Doit avoir le fichier `adr-candidates.md` pour la découverte des candidats","Hébergé sur GitHub Pages"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf GitHub-Commits und Pull-Requests","Muss die Datei `adr-candidates.md` für die Kandidatenerkennung haben","Wird auf GitHub Pages gehostet"],"pt":["Requer acesso a commits e PRs do GitHub","Deve ter arquivo `adr-candidates.md` para descoberta de candidatos","Hospedado no GitHub Pages"],"ru":["Требует доступа к коммитам и PR GitHub","Должен иметь файл `adr-candidates.md` для обнаружения кандидатов","Размещен на GitHub Pages"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الالتزامات وطلبات السحب على GitHub","يجب أن يكون لديك ملف `adr-candidates.md` لاكتشاف المرشحين","مستضاف على GitHub Pages"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
