récents de Kakao. Vous pouvez personnaliser le nombre de messages téléchargés.","de":"Der Befehl kakao-down ermöglicht das Herunterladen neuer Nachrichten von Kakao. Sie können die Anzahl der heruntergeladenen Nachrichten anpassen.","pt":"O Kakao-Down é uma ferramenta que permite visualizar as mensagens mais recentes do KakaoTalk. Com ele, você pode facilmente acessar as últimas mensagens.","ru":"Kakao-Down - это инструмент, который позволяет просматривать последние сообщения в KakaoTalk. С его помощью вы легко можете получить доступ к последним сообщ...","ar":"كاكاو-داون هو أداة تعرض الرسائل الحديثة في KakaoTalk. يمكنك بسهولة الوصول إلى الرسائل الأخيرة باستخدامه.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Kakao","10","offset","0","/kakao-up","/kakao-refresh"],"ja":["Kakao","10","offset","0","/kakao-up","/kakao-refresh"],"ko":["10","offset","0","/kakao-up","/kakao-refresh","cd /Users/taehoje/space/kakao-terminal && python kakao_cli.py down $ARGUMENTS"],"es":["Descarga de mensajes recientes","Personalización de la cantidad de mensajes","Uso de comandos para descargar mensajes","Integración con la plataforma Kakao","Compatibilidad con diferentes sistemas operativos"],"fr":["Téléchargement de messages récents","Personnalisation du nombre de messages","Utilisation de commandes pour télécharger des messages","Intégration avec la plateforme Kakao","Compatibilité avec différents systèmes d''exploitation"],"de":["Herunterladen neuer Nachrichten","Anpassung der Anzahl der Nachrichten","Verwendung von Befehlen zum Herunterladen von Nachrichten","Integration mit der Plattform Kakao","Kompatibilität mit verschiedenen Betriebssystemen"],"pt":["Visualize as 10 mensagens mais recentes do KakaoTalk","Opção para especificar o número de mensagens a serem exibidas","Comando simples para acessar as mensagens mais recentes","Funciona com offset para ler mensagens mais antigas","Integração com o KakaoTalk para acesso fácil às mensagens"],"ru":["Просмотр последних 10 сообщений в KakaoTalk","Возможность указать количество сообщений для отображения","Простая команда для доступа к последним сообщениям","Работает с офсетом для чтения более старых сообщений","Интеграция с KakaoTalk для легкого доступа к сообщениям"],"ar":["عرض أحدث 10 رسائل في KakaoTalk","خيار لتحديد عدد الرسائل المعروضة","أمر بسيط للوصول إلى الرسائل الحديثة","يعمل مع الإزاحة لقراءة الرسائل القديمة","التكامل مع KakaoTalk للوصول السهل إلى الرسائل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Kakao","Kakao API","Kakao","offset","Kakao","Kakao"],"ja":["Kakao","Kakao API","Kakao","offset","Kakao","Kakao"],"ko":["kakao-down","Kakao API","Kakao","offset","Kakao","Kakao","kakao-terminal"],"es":["kakao down","descargar mensajes recientes","comando kakao-down","personalizar cantidad de mensajes","integración con kakao","compatibilidad con sistemas operativos"],"fr":["kakao down","télécharger messages récents","commande kakao-down","personnaliser nombre de messages","intégration avec kakao","compatibilité avec systèmes d''exploitation"],"de":["kakao down","herunterladen neuer nachrichten","befehl kakao-down","anpassen anzahl der nachrichten","integration mit kakao","kompatibilität mit betriebssystemen"],"pt":["Kakao-Down","KakaoTalk","mensagens recentes","ferramenta de linha de comando","visualizar mensagens"," Offset para leitura de mensagens"],"ru":["Kakao-Down","KakaoTalk","последние сообщения","консольный инструмент","просмотр сообщений","офсет для чтения сообщений"],"ar":["كاكاو-داون","KakaoTalk","الرسائل الحديثة","أداة سطر أوامر","عرض الرسائل","الإزاحة لقراءة الرسائل"]}},"owner":"stpcoder","repo":"kakao-terminal","repoPath":"stpcoder/kakao-terminal","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.431Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"kakao-down","description":"카카오톡 최신 메시지 보기. 카톡 아래로, 최신 메시지, kakao down, KakaoTalk scroll down 시 사용.","bodyPreview":"# 카카오톡 최신 메시지 보기\n\n아래로 스크롤하여 최신 메시지를 봅니다.\n\n## 실행\n\n```bash\ncd /Users/taehoje/space/kakao-terminal && python kakao_cli.py down $ARGUMENTS\n```\n\n## 옵션\n\n- `/kakao-down` - 10개 최신으로 (기본)\n- `/kakao-down 20` - 20개 최신으로\n\n## 동작 방식\n\n- 호출할 때마다 offset 감소\n- 최소 offset은 0 (가장 최신)\n- 현재에 가까운 메시지를 읽음\n\n## 다음 단계\n\n- `/kakao-up` - 이전 메시지로\n- `/kakao-refresh` - 가장 최신으로 리셋","body":"# 카카오톡 최신 메시지 보기\n\n아래로 스크롤하여 최신 메시지를 봅니다.\n\n## 실행\n\n```bash\ncd /Users/taehoje/space/kakao-terminal && python kakao_cli.py down $ARGUMENTS\n```\n\n## 옵션\n\n- `/kakao-down` - 10개 최신으로 (기본)\n- `/kakao-down 20` - 20개 최신으로\n\n## 동작 방식\n\n- 호출할 때마다 offset 감소\n- 최소 offset은 0 (가장 최신)\n- 현재에 가까운 메시지를 읽음\n\n## 다음 단계\n\n- `/kakao-up` - 이전 메시지로\n- `/kakao-refresh` - 가장 최신으로 리셋\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:12:37.280Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Chat Agents needing to fetch the latest KakaoTalk messages.","zh":"非常适合需要获取最新 KakaoTalk 消息的聊天机器人","ja":"最新のKakaoTalkメッセージを取得する必要があるチャットエージェントに最適","ko":"최신 카카오톡 메시지를 가져야 하는 채팅 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de chat que necesitan recuperar los mensajes más recientes de KakaoTalk.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de chat ayant besoin de récupérer les messages les plus récents de KakaoTalk.","de":"Perfekt für Chat-Agents, die die neuesten KakaoTalk-Nachrichten abrufen müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Chat que precisam buscar as últimas mensagens do KakaoTalk.","ru":"Идеально для агентов чата, которым необходимо получать последние сообщения KakaoTalk.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الدردشة الذي يحتاج إلى استرجاع أحدث رسائل KakaoTalk."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to retrieve recent KakaoTalk messages using Python and the kakao-cli.py script, allowing for offset-based message fetching and supporting commands like /kakao-down for latest messages.","zh":"使得代理能够使用 Python 和 kakao-cli.py 脚本检索最近的 KakaoTalk 消息，支持基于偏移量的消息获取和类似 /kakao-down 的命令来获取最新消息","ja":"Pythonとkakao-cli.pyスクリプトを使用して最近のKakaoTalkメッセージを取得するエージェントを可能にし、オフセットベースのメッセージ取得と/kakao-downなどのコマンドをサポートして最新のメッセージを取得","ko":"파이썬과 kakao-cli.py 스크립트를 사용하여 최근 카카오톡 메시지를 가져오는 에이전트를 강화하여 오프셋 기반 메시지 가져오기와 /kakao-down 등의 명령어를 지원하여 최신 메시지를 가져올 수 있음","es":"Permite a los agentes recuperar mensajes recientes de KakaoTalk utilizando Python y el script kakao-cli.py, lo que permite la recuperación de mensajes basada en desplazamiento y admite comandos como /kakao-down para los mensajes más recientes.","fr":"Permet aux agents de récupérer des messages récents de KakaoTalk en utilisant Python et le script kakao-cli.py, ce qui permet la récupération de messages basée sur le décalage et prend en charge des commandes comme /kakao-down pour les messages les plus récents.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, KakaoTalk-Nachrichten mithilfe von Python und dem Script kakao-cli.py abzurufen, wodurch eine offsetbasierte Nachrichtenabfrage ermöglicht wird und Befehle wie /kakao-down für die neuesten Nachrichten unterstützt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a recuperar mensagens recentes do KakaoTalk usando Python e o script kakao-cli.py, permitindo a recuperação de mensagens com base em deslocamento e suportando comandos como /kakao-down para as mensagens mais recentes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью получать недавние сообщения KakaoTalk с помощью Python и скрипта kakao-cli.py, что позволяет получать сообщения на основе смещения и поддерживает команды, такие как /kakao-down для последних сообщений.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على استرجاع رسائل KakaoTalk الأخيرة باستخدام بايثون وبرنامج kakao-cli.py، مما يسمح بإرجاع الرسائل على أساس الانزلاق ودعم أوامر مثل /kakao-down لآخر الرسائل."},"useCases":{"en":["Fetching the latest 10 KakaoTalk messages","Retrieving a specified number of recent messages","Implementing a message scrolling feature with /kakao-down and /kakao-up commands"],"zh":["获取最新的 10 条 KakaoTalk 消息","检索指定数量的最近消息","使用 /kakao-down 和 /kakao-up 命令实现消息滚动功能"],"ja":["最新の 10 件のKakaoTalkメッセージを取得","指定された数の最近のメッセージを取得","/kakao-downと/kakao-upコマンドを使用してメッセージスクロール機能を実装"],"ko":["최신 10개의 카카오톡 메시지를 가져옴","지정된 수의 최근 메시지를 가져옴","/kakao-down과 /kakao-up 명령어를 사용하여 메시지 스크롤 기능 구현"],"es":["Recuperar los 10 mensajes más recientes de KakaoTalk","Recuperar un número especificado de mensajes recientes","Implementar una función de desplazamiento de mensajes con los comandos /kakao-down y /kakao-up"],"fr":["Récupérer les 10 messages les plus récents de KakaoTalk","Récupérer un nombre spécifié de messages récents","Mettre en œuvre une fonction de défilement de messages avec les commandes /kakao-down et /kakao-up"],"de":["Die neuesten 10 KakaoTalk-Nachrichten abrufen","Eine bestimmte Anzahl von Nachrichten abrufen","Eine Nachrichten-Scrollfunktion mit den Befehlen /kakao-down und /kakao-up implementieren"],"pt":["Buscar as últimas 10 mensagens do KakaoTalk","Recuperar um número especificado de mensagens recentes","Implementar um recurso de rolagem de mensagens com os comandos /kakao-down e /kakao-up"],"ru":["Получение последних 10 сообщений KakaoTalk","Получение указанного количества недавних сообщений","Реализация функции прокрутки сообщений с помощью команд /kakao-down и /kakao-up"],"ar":["استرجاع آخر 10 رسائل من KakaoTalk","استرجاع عدد محدد من الرسائل الأخيرة","تنفيذ ميزة التمرير الرسائل بأوامر /kakao-down و /kakao-up"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment","Dependent on kakao-cli.py script","Limited to KakaoTalk platform"],"zh":["需要 Python 环境","依赖于 kakao-cli.py 脚本","仅限 KakaoTalk 平台"],"ja":["Python環境が必要","kakao-cli.pyスクリプトに依存","KakaoTalkプラットフォームのみ"],"ko":["파이썬 환경이 필요","kakao-cli.py 스크립트에 의존","카카오톡 플랫폼만 지원"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de Python","Depende del script kakao-cli.py","Limitado a la plataforma KakaoTalk"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python","Dépend du script kakao-cli.py","Limité à la plateforme KakaoTalk"],"de":["Benötigt eine Python-Umgebung","Hängt vom Script kakao-cli.py ab","Beschränkt auf die KakaoTalk-Plattform"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Python","Dependente do script kakao-cli.py","Limitado à plataforma KakaoTalk"],"ru":["Требуется среда Python","Зависит от скрипта kakao-cli.py","Ограничен платформой KakaoTalk"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة بايثون","يعتمد على برنامج kakao-cli.py","محدود بمنصة KakaoTalk"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('olegakbarov/ispo-code/tanstack-db', 'community', 'olegakbarov', 'ispo-code', 'olegakbarov/ispo-code', 'tanstack-db', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.431Z', '2026-02-18T05:12:58.005Z', NULL, '{"id":"olegakbarov/ispo-code/tanstack-db","name":"tanstack-db","description":{"zh":"TanStack DB 是一个反应式客户端存储，用于构建本地优先应用，具有子毫秒查询、乐观式变异和实时同步功能","ja":"TanStack DB は、ローカルファーストアプリケーションを構築するためのリアクティブクライアントストアで、サブミリ秒クエリ、楽観的なミューテーション、リアルタイム同期などの機能を提供","ko":"TanStack DB는 로컬 우선 애플리케이션을 구축하는 반응형 클라이언트 저장소로, 서브 밀리초 쿼리, 낙관적 변이, 실시간 동기화 등의 기능을 제공","es":"TanStack DB es un almacenamiento cliente reactivo para aplicaciones locales con consultas en milisegundos y mutaciones optimistas. Actualmente se encuentra en versión beta.","fr":"TanStack DB est un stockage client réactif pour applications locales avec des requêtes en millisecondes et des mutations optimistes. Actuellement en version bêta.","de":"TanStack DB ist ein reaktiver Client-Speicher für lokale Anwendungen mit Abfragen in Millisekunden und optimistischen Mutationen. Derzeit in der Beta-Version.","pt":"TanStack DB é uma loja de clientes reativa para construir aplicativos locais com consultas rápidas e mutações otimistas. Aprenda mais sobre suas funcionalidades e benefícios","ru":"TanStack DB — реактивное хранилище клиента для построения локальных приложений с быстрыми запросами и оптимистическими мутациями. Узнайте больше о его функциях и преимуществах","ar":"TanStack DB هو مخزن عميل متفاعل لبناء التطبيقات المحلية مع استفسارات سريعة وطفرات متفائلة. تعرف على المزيد من ميزاته وفوائده","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"TanStack DB - 构建本地优先应用的反应式客户端存储","ja":"TanStack DB - ローカルファーストアプリケーションを構築するためのリアクティブクライアントストア","ko":"TanStack DB - 로컬 우선 애플리케이션을 구축하는 반응형 클라이언트 저장소","es":"TanStack DB: Almacenamiento reactivo para aplicaciones lo...","fr":"TanStack DB : Stockage réactif pour applications locales","de":"TanStack DB: Reaktives Speicher für lokale Anwendungen","pt":"TanStack DB: Loja de Clientes Reativa para Aplicativos","ru":"TanStack DB: Реактивное хранилище клиента для приложений","ar":"TanStack DB: مخزن عميل متفاعل لبناء التطبيقات","en":"tanstack-db"},"description":{"zh":"TanStack DB 是一个反应式客户端存储，用于构建本地优先应用，具有子毫秒查询、乐观式变异和实时同步功能","ja":"TanStack DB は、ローカルファーストアプリケーションを構築するためのリアクティブクライアントストアで、サブミリ秒クエリ、楽観的なミューテーション、リアルタイム同期などの機能を提供","ko":"TanStack DB는 로컬 우선 애플리케이션을 구축하는 반응형 클라이언트 저장소로, 서브 밀리초 쿼리, 낙관적 변이, 실시간 동기화 등의 기능을 제공","es":"TanStack DB es un almacenamiento cliente reactivo para aplicaciones locales con consultas en milisegundos y mutaciones optimistas. Actualmente se encuentra e...","fr":"TanStack DB est un stockage client réactif pour applications locales avec des requêtes en millisecondes et des mutations optimistes. Actuellement en version ...","de":"TanStack DB ist ein reaktiver Client-Speicher für lokale Anwendungen mit Abfragen in Millisekunden und optimistischen Mutationen. Derzeit in der Beta-Version.","pt":"TanStack DB é uma loja de clientes reativa para construir aplicativos locais com consultas rápidas e mutações otimistas. Aprenda mais sobre suas funcionalida...","ru":"TanStack DB — реактивное хранилище клиента для построения локальных приложений с быстрыми запросами и оптимистическими мутациями. Узнайте больше о его функци...","ar":"TanStack DB هو مخزن عميل متفاعل لبناء التطبيقات المحلية مع استفسارات سريعة وطفرات متفائلة. تعرف على المزيد من ميزاته وفوائده","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["子毫秒查询","乐观式变异","实时同步","反应式客户端存储","本地优先应用"],"ja":["サブミリ秒クエリ","楽観的なミューテーション","リアルタイム同期","リアクティブクライアントストア","ローカルファーストアプリケーション"],"ko":["서브 밀리초 쿼리","낙관적 변이","실시간 동기화","반응형 클라이언트 저장소","로컬 우선 애플리케이션"],"es":["Colecciones tipadas de objetos","Consultas en vivo que se actualizan incrementalmente","Mutaciones optimistas con escritura local instantánea","Sincronización en tiempo real","Consultas en milisegundos","Diseño reactivo"],"fr":["Collections typées d''objets","Requêtes en direct qui se mettent à jour de manière incrémentielle","Mutations optimistes avec écriture locale instantanée","Synchronisation en temps réel","Requêtes en millisecondes","Conception réactive"],"de":["Typisierte Objektsammlungen","Live-Abfragen, die inkrementell aktualisiert werden","Optimistische Mutationen mit sofortiger lokaler Schreibweise","Echtzeit-Synchronisation","Abfragen in Millisekunden","Reaktives Design"],"pt":["Consultas em milissegundos","Mutações otimistas","Sincronização em tempo real","Coleções tipadas","Consultas reativas","Suporte a aplicativos locais"],"ru":["Запросы в миллисекундах","Оптимистические мутации","Синхронизация в реальном времени","Типизированные коллекции","Реактивные запросы","Поддержка локальных приложений"],"ar":["استفسارات في مللي ثانية","طفرات متفائلة","مزامنة في الوقت الفعلي","مجموعات منوعة","استفسارات متفاعلة","دعم التطبيقات المحلية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["TanStack DB","反应式客户端存储","本地优先应用","子毫秒查询","乐观式变异","实时同步"],"ja":["TanStack DB","リアクティブクライアントストア","ローカルファーストアプリケーション","サブミリ秒クエリ","楽観的なミューテーション","リアルタイム同期"],"ko":["TanStack DB","반응형 클라이언트 저장소","로컬 우선 애플리케이션","서브 밀리초 쿼리","낙관적 변이","실시간 동기화"],"es":["TanStack DB","almacenamiento reactivo","aplicaciones locales","consultas en milisegundos","mutaciones optimistas","sincronización en tiempo real","desarrollo de aplicaciones","tecnologías de almacenamiento","bases de datos locales"],"fr":["TanStack DB","stockage réactif","applications locales","requêtes en millisecondes","mutations optimistes","synchronisation en temps réel","développement d''applications","technologies de stockage","bases de données locales"],"de":["TanStack DB","reaktiver Speicher","lokale Anwendungen","Abfragen in Millisekunden","optimistische Mutationen","Echtzeit-Synchronisation","Anwendungsentwicklung","Speichertechnologien","lokale Datenbanken"],"pt":["TanStack DB","banco de dados de cliente reativo","aplicativos locais","consultas em milissegundos","mutações otimistas","sincronização em tempo real","desenvolvimento de aplicativos","tecnologias de banco de dados"],"ru":["TanStack DB","реактивное хранилище клиента","локальные приложения","запросы в миллисекундах","оптимистические мутации","синхронизация в реальном времени","разработка приложений","технологии баз данных"],"ar":["TanStack DB","مخزن عميل متفاعل","تطبيقات محلية","استفسارات في مللي ثانية","طفرات متفائلة","مزامنة في الوقت الفعلي","تطوير التطبيقات","تقنيات قواعد البيانات"]}},"owner":"olegakbarov","repo":"ispo-code","repoPath":"olegakbarov/ispo-code","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.431Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tanstack-db","description":"Expert guidance for TanStack DB reactive client-side database with collections, live queries, optimistic mutations, and sync engines (ElectricSQL, RxDB, PowerSync). Use when user says tanstack db, /tanstack-db, local-first, live query, collection, optimistic mutation, electric, sync engine, or asks about reactive data, offline-first, or real-time sync.","bodyPreview":"# TanStack DB Skill\n\nExpert guidance for TanStack DB - the reactive client store for building local-first apps with sub-millisecond queries, optimistic mutations, and real-time sync.\n\n**Note:** TanStack DB is currently in BETA.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Core Concepts\n\n| Concept | Purpose |\n|---------|---------|\n| **Collection** | Typed set of objects (like a DB table) |\n| **Live Query** | Reactive query that updates incrementally |\n| **Optimistic Mutation** | Instant local write, synced in backgr","body":"# TanStack DB Skill\n\nExpert guidance for TanStack DB - the reactive client store for building local-first apps with sub-millisecond queries, optimistic mutations, and real-time sync.\n\n**Note:** TanStack DB is currently in BETA.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Core Concepts\n\n| Concept | Purpose |\n|---------|---------|\n| **Collection** | Typed set of objects (like a DB table) |\n| **Live Query** | Reactive query that updates incrementally |\n| **Optimistic Mutation** | Instant local write, synced in background |\n| **Sync Engine** | Real-time data sync (Electric, RxDB, PowerSync) |\n\n### Project Structure\n\n```\nsrc/\n├── collections/\n│   ├── todos.ts         # Todo collection definition\n│   ├── users.ts         # User collection\n│   └── index.ts         # Export all collections\n├── queries/\n│   └── hooks.ts         # Custom live query hooks\n└── lib/\n    └── db.ts            # DB setup & QueryClient\n```\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\n# Core + React\nnpm install @tanstack/react-db @tanstack/db\n\n# With TanStack Query (REST APIs)\nnpm install @tanstack/query-db-collection @tanstack/react-query\n\n# With ElectricSQL (Postgres sync)\nnpm install @tanstack/electric-db-collection\n\n# With RxDB (offline-first)\nnpm install @tanstack/rxdb-db-collection rxdb\n```\n\n## Collections\n\n### Query Collection (REST API)\n\n```typescript\n// src/collections/todos.ts\nimport { createCollection } from \"@tanstack/react-db\"\nimport { queryCollectionOptions } from \"@tanstack/query-db-collection\"\nimport { queryClient } from \"@/lib/db\"\n\nexport interface Todo {\n  id: string\n  text: string\n  completed: boolean\n  createdAt: string\n}\n\nexport const todosCollection = createCollection(\n  queryCollectionOptions({\n    queryKey: [\"todos\"],\n    queryFn: async () => {\n      const res = await fetch(\"/api/todos\")\n      return res.json() as Promise<Todo[]>\n    },\n    queryClient,\n    getKey: (item) => item.id,\n\n    // Persistence handlers\n    onInsert: async ({ transaction }) => {\n      const items = transaction.mutations.map((m) => m.modified)\n      await fetch(\"/api/todos\", {\n        method: \"POST\",\n        body: JSON.stringify(items),\n      })\n    },\n\n    onUpdate: async ({ transaction }) => {\n      await Promise.all(\n        transaction.mutations.map((m) =>\n          fetch(`/api/todos/${m.key}`, {\n            method: \"PATCH\",\n            body: JSON.stringify(m.changes),\n          })\n        )\n      )\n    },\n\n    onDelete: async ({ transaction }) => {\n      await Promise.all(\n        transaction.mutations.map((m) =>\n          fetch(`/api/todos/${m.key}`, { method: \"DELETE\" })\n        )\n      )\n    },\n  })\n)\n```\n\n### Electric Collection (Postgres Sync)\n\n```typescript\n// src/collections/todos.ts\nimport { createCollection } from \"@tanstack/react-db\"\nimport { electricCollectionOptions } from \"@tanstack/electric-db-collection\"\n\nexport const todosCollection = createCollection(\n  electricCollectionOptions({\n    id: \"todos\",\n    shapeOptions: {\n      url: \"/api/electric/todos\", // Proxy to Electric\n    },\n    getKey: (item) => item.id,\n\n    // Use transaction ID for sync confirmation\n    onInsert: async ({ transaction }) => {\n      const item = transaction.mutations[0].modified\n      const res = await fetch(\"/api/todos\", {\n        method: \"POST\",\n        body: JSON.stringify(item),\n      })\n      const { txid } = await res.json()\n      return { txid } // Electric waits for this txid\n    },\n\n    onUpdate: async ({ transaction }) => {\n      const { key, changes } = transaction.mutations[0]\n      const res = await fetch(`/api/todos/${key}`, {\n        method: \"PATCH\",\n        body: JSON.stringify(changes),\n      })\n      const { txid } = await res.json()\n      return { txid }\n    },\n\n    onDelete: async ({ transaction }) => {\n      const { key } = transaction.mutations[0]\n      const res = await fetch(`/api/todos/${key}`, { method: \"DELETE\" })\n      const { txid } = await res.json()\n      return { txid }\n    },\n  })\n)\n```\n\n### Sync Modes\n\n```typescript\n// Eager (default): Load all upfront - best for <10k rows\nelectricCollectionOptions({\n  sync: { mode: \"eager\" },\n  // ...\n})\n\n// On-demand: Load only what queries request - best for >50k rows\nelectricCollectionOptions({\n  sync: { mode: \"on-demand\" },\n  // ...\n})\n\n// Progressive: Instant query results + background full sync\nelectricCollectionOptions({\n  sync: { mode: \"progressive\" },\n  // ...\n})\n```\n\n## Live Queries\n\n### Basic Query\n\n```tsx\nimport { useLiveQuery } from \"@tanstack/react-db\"\nimport { todosCollection } from \"@/collections/todos\"\n\nfunction TodoList() {\n  const { data: todos, isLoading } = useLiveQuery((q) =>\n    q.from({ todo: todosCollection })\n  )\n\n  if (isLoading) return <div>Loading...</div>\n\n  return (\n    <ul>\n      {todos?.map((todo) => (\n        <li key={todo.id}>{todo.text}</li>\n      ))}\n    </ul>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Filtering with Where\n\n```typescript\nimport { eq, gt, and, or, like, inArray } from \"@tanstack/react-db\"\n\n// Simple equality\nuseLiveQuery((q) =>\n  q.from({ todo: todosCollection })\n   .where(({ todo }) => eq(todo.completed, false))\n)\n\n// Multiple conditions\nuseLiveQuery((q) =>\n  q.from({ todo: todosCollection })\n   .where(({ todo }) =>\n     and(\n       eq(todo.completed, false),\n       gt(todo.priority, 5)\n     )\n   )\n)\n\n// OR conditions\nuseLiveQuery((q) =>\n  q.from({ todo: todosCollection })\n   .where(({ todo }) =>\n     or(\n       eq(todo.status, \"urgent\"),\n       eq(todo.status, \"high\")\n     )\n   )\n)\n\n// String matching\nuseLiveQuery((q) =>\n  q.from({ todo: todosCollection })\n   .where(({ todo }) => like(todo.text, \"%meeting%\"))\n)\n\n// In array\nuseLiveQuery((q) =>\n  q.from({ todo: todosCollection })\n   .where(({ todo }) => inArray(todo.id, [\"1\", \"2\", \"3\"]))\n)\n```\n\n### Comparison Operators\n\n| Operator | Description |\n|----------|-------------|\n| `eq(a, b)` | Equal |\n| `gt(a, b)` | Greater than |\n| `gte(a, b)` | Greater than or equal |\n| `lt(a, b)` | Less than |\n| `lte(a, b)` | Less than or equal |\n| `like(a, pattern)` | Case-sensitive match |\n| `ilike(a, pattern)` | Case-insensitive match |\n| `inArray(a, arr)` | Value in array |\n| `isNull(a)` | Is null |\n| `isUndefined(a)` | Is undefined |\n\n### Sorting and Pagination\n\n```typescript\nuseLiveQuery((q) =>\n  q.from({ todo: todosCollection })\n   .orderBy(({ todo }) => todo.createdAt, \"desc\")\n   .limit(20)\n   .offset(0)\n)\n```\n\n### Select Projection\n\n```typescript\n// Select specific fields\nuseLiveQuery((q) =>\n  q.from({ todo: todosCollection })\n   .select(({ todo }) => ({\n     id: todo.id,\n     text: todo.text,\n     done: todo.completed,\n   }))\n)\n\n// Computed fields\nuseLiveQuery((q) =>\n  q.from({ todo: todosCollection })\n   .select(({ todo }) => ({\n     id: todo.id,\n     displayText: upper(todo.text),\n     isOverdue: lt(todo.dueDate, new Date().toISOString()),\n   }))\n)\n```\n\n### Joins\n\n```typescript\nimport { usersCollection } from \"@/collections/users\"\n\n// Inner join\nuseLiveQuery((q) =>\n  q.from({ todo: todosCollection })\n   .join(\n     { user: usersCollection },\n     ({ todo, user }) => eq(todo.userId, user.id),\n     \"inner\"\n   )\n   .select(({ todo, user }) => ({\n     id: todo.id,\n     text: todo.text,\n     assignee: user.name,\n   }))\n)\n\n// Left join (default)\nuseLiveQuery((q) =>\n  q.from({ todo: todosCollection })\n   .leftJoin(\n     { user: usersCollection },\n     ({ todo, user }) => eq(todo.userId, user.id)\n   )\n)\n```\n\n### Aggregations\n\n```typescript\n// Group by with aggregates\nuseLiveQuery((q) =>\n  q.from({ todo: todosCollection })\n   .groupBy(({ todo }) => todo.status)\n   .select(({ todo }) => ({\n     status: todo.status,\n     count: count(todo.id),\n     avgPriority: avg(todo.priority),\n   }))\n)\n\n// With having clause\nuseLiveQuery((q) =>\n  q.from({ order: ordersCollection })\n   .groupBy(({ order }) => order.customerId)\n   .select(({ order }) => ({\n     customerId: order.customerId,\n     totalSpent: sum(order.amount),\n   }))\n   .having(({ $selected }) => gt($selected.totalSpent, 1000))\n)\n```\n\n### Find Single Item\n\n```typescript\n// Returns T | undefined\nuseLiveQuery((q) =>\n  q.from({ todo: todosCollection })\n   .where(({ todo }) => eq(todo.id, todoId))\n   .findOne()\n)\n```\n\n### Reactive Dependencies\n\n```typescript\n// Re-run query when deps change\nconst [filter, setFilter] = useState(\"all\")\n\nuseLiveQuery(\n  (q) =>\n    q.from({ todo: todosCollection })\n     .where(({ todo }) =>\n       filter === \"all\" ? true : eq(todo.status, filter)\n     ),\n  [filter] // Dependency array\n)\n```\n\n## Mutations\n\n### Basic Operations\n\n```typescript\nconst { collection } = useLiveQuery((q) =>\n  q.from({ todo: todosCollection })\n)\n\n// Insert\ncollection.insert({\n  id: crypto.randomUUID(),\n  text: \"New todo\",\n  completed: false,\n  createdAt: new Date().toISOString(),\n})\n\n// Insert multiple\ncollection.insert([item1, item2, item3])\n\n// Update (immutable draft pattern)\ncollection.update(todoId, (draft) => {\n  draft.completed = true\n  draft.completedAt = new Date().toISOString()\n})\n\n// Update multiple\ncollection.update([id1, id2], (drafts) => {\n  drafts.forEach((d) => (d.completed = true))\n})\n\n// Delete\ncollection.delete(todoId)\n\n// Delete multiple\ncollection.delete([id1, id2, id3])\n```\n\n### Non-Optimistic Mutations\n\n```typescript\n// Skip optimistic update, wait for server\ncollection.insert(item, { optimistic: false })\ncollection.update(id, updater, { optimistic: false })\ncollection.delete(id, { optimistic: false })\n```\n\n### Custom Optimistic Actions\n\n```typescript\nimport { createOptimisticAction } from \"@tanstack/react-db\"\n\n// Multi-collection or complex mutations\nconst likePost = createOptimisticAction<string>({\n  onMutate: (postId) => {\n    postsCollection.update(postId, (draft) => {\n      draft.likeCount += 1\n      draft.likedByMe = true\n    })\n  },\n  mutationFn: async (postId) => {\n    await fetch(`/api/posts/${postId}/like`, { method: \"POST\" })\n    // Optionally refetch\n    await postsCollection.utils.refetch()\n  },\n})\n\n// Usage\nlikePost.mutate(postId)\n```\n\n### Manual Transactions\n\n```typescript\nimport { createTransaction } from \"@tanstack/react-db\"\n\nconst tx = createTransaction({\n  autoCommit: false,\n  mutationFn: async ({ transaction }) => {\n    // Batch all mutations in single request\n    await fetch(\"/api/batch\", {\n      method: \"POST\",\n      body: JSON.stringify(transaction.mutations),\n    })\n  },\n})\n\n// Queue mutations\ntx.mutate(() => {\n  todosCollection.insert(newTodo)\n  todosCollection.update(existingId, (d) => (d.status = \"active\"))\n  todosCollection.delete(oldId)\n})\n\n// Commit or rollback\nawait tx.commit()\n// or\ntx.rollback()\n```\n\n### Paced Mutations (Debounce/Throttle)\n\n```typescript\nimport { usePacedMutations, debounceStrategy } from \"@tanstack/react-db\"\n\n// Debounce rapid updates (e.g., text input)\nconst { mutate } = usePacedMutations({\n  onMutate: (value: string) => {\n    todosCollection.update(todoId, (d) => (d.text = value))\n  },\n  mutationFn: async ({ transaction }) => {\n    const changes = transaction.mutations[0].changes\n    await fetch(`/api/todos/${todoId}`, {\n      method: \"PATCH\",\n      body: JSON.stringify(changes),\n    })\n  },\n  strategy: debounceStrategy({ wait: 500 }),\n})\n\n// Usage in input\n<input onChange={(e) => mutate(e.target.value)} />\n```\n\n## Provider Setup\n\n```tsx\n// src/main.tsx\nimport { QueryClient, QueryClientProvider } from \"@tanstack/react-query\"\nimport { DBProvider } from \"@tanstack/react-db\"\n\nconst queryClient = new QueryClient()\n\nfunction App() {\n  return (\n    <QueryClientProvider client={queryClient}>\n      <DBProvider>\n        <Router />\n      </DBProvider>\n    </QueryClientProvider>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Electric Backend Setup\n\n### Server-Side Transaction ID\n\n```typescript\n// api/todos/route.ts (example with Drizzle)\nimport { db } from \"@/db\"\nimport { todos } from \"@/db/schema\"\nimport { sql } from \"drizzle-orm\"\n\nexport async function POST(req: Request) {\n  const data = await req.json()\n\n  const result = await db.transaction(async (tx) => {\n    // Insert the todo\n    const [todo] = await tx.insert(todos).values(data).returning()\n\n    // Get transaction ID in SAME transaction\n    const [{ txid }] = await tx.execute(\n      sql`SELECT pg_current_xact_id()::text as txid`\n    )\n\n    return { todo, txid: parseInt(txid, 10) }\n  })\n\n  return Response.json(result)\n}\n```\n\n### Electric Proxy Route\n\n```typescript\n// api/electric/[...path]/route.ts\nexport async function GET(req: Request) {\n  const url = new URL(req.url)\n  const electricUrl = `${process.env.ELECTRIC_URL}${url.pathname}${url.search}`\n\n  return fetch(electricUrl, {\n    headers: { Authorization: `Bearer ${process.env.ELECTRIC_TOKEN}` },\n  })\n}\n```\n\n## Utility Methods\n\n```typescript\n// Refetch collection data\nawait collection.utils.refetch()\n\n// Direct writes (bypass optimistic state)\ncollection.utils.writeInsert(item)\ncollection.utils.writeUpdate(item)\ncollection.utils.writeDelete(id)\ncollection.utils.writeUpsert(item)\n\n// Batch direct writes\ncollection.utils.writeBatch(() => {\n  collection.utils.writeInsert(item1)\n  collection.utils.writeDelete(id2)\n})\n\n// Wait for Electric sync (with txid)\nawait collection.utils.awaitTxId(txid, 30000)\n\n// Wait for custom match\nawait collection.utils.awaitMatch(\n  (msg) => msg.value.id === expectedId,\n  5000\n)\n```\n\n## Gotchas and Tips\n\n1. **Queries run client-side**: TanStack DB is NOT an ORM - queries run locally against collections, not against a database\n2. **Sub-millisecond updates**: Uses differential dataflow - only recalculates affected parts of queries\n3. **Transaction IDs matter**: With Electric, always get `pg_current_xact_id()` in the SAME transaction as mutations\n4. **Sync modes**: Use \"eager\" for small datasets, \"on-demand\" for large, \"progressive\" for collaborative apps\n5. **Optimistic by default**: All mutations apply instantly; use `{ optimistic: false }` for server-validated operations\n6. **Fine-grained reactivity**: Only components using changed data re-render\n7. **Mutation merging**: Rapid updates merge automatically (insert+update→insert, update+update→merged)\n8. **Collection = complete state**: Empty array from queryFn clears the collection\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Loading States\n\n```tsx\nfunction TodoList() {\n  const { data, isLoading, isPending } = useLiveQuery((q) =>\n    q.from({ todo: todosCollection })\n  )\n\n  if (isLoading) return <Skeleton />\n  if (!data?.length) return <EmptyState />\n\n  return <List items={data} />\n}\n```\n\n### Mutation with Feedback\n\n```tsx\nfunction TodoItem({ todo }: { todo: Todo }) {\n  const { collection } = useLiveQuery((q) =>\n    q.from({ todo: todosCollection })\n  )\n\n  const toggle = async () => {\n    const tx = collection.update(todo.id, (d) => {\n      d.completed = !d.completed\n    })\n\n    try {\n      await tx.isPersisted.promise\n      toast.success(\"Saved!\")\n    } catch (err) {\n      toast.error(\"Failed to save\")\n      // Optimistic update already rolled back\n    }\n  }\n\n  return <Checkbox checked={todo.completed} onChange={toggle} />\n}\n```\n\n### Derived/Computed Collections\n\n```tsx\n// Create a \"view\" with live query\nconst completedTodos = useLiveQuery((q) =>\n  q.from({ todo: todosCollection })\n   .where(({ todo }) => eq(todo.completed, true))\n   .orderBy(({ todo }) => todo.completedAt, \"desc\")\n)\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:12:58.005Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Local-First App Agents needing reactive client stores with sub-millisecond queries and real-time sync.","zh":"非常适合需要具有亚毫秒查询和实时同步的本地优先应用代理的反应式客户端存储。","ja":"サブミリ秒クエリおよびリアルタイム同期を備えたリアクティブクライアントストアを必要とするローカルファーストアプリエージェントに最適。","ko":"서브 밀리초 쿼리 및 실시간 동기화를 갖춘 리액티브 클라이언트 저장소가 필요한 로컬 우선 앱 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Aplicaciones de Primera Instancia Local que necesitan tiendas de clientes reactivas con consultas de submilisegundo y sincronización en tiempo real.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Applications Premiers Locaux ayant besoin de magasins de clients réactifs avec des requêtes de sous-milliseconde et une synchronisation en temps réel.","de":"Perfekt für lokale Erstanbieter-App-Agents, die reaktive Client-Speicher mit Abfragen im Submillisekundenbereich und Echtzeitsynchronisierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Aplicativos Local-First que precisam de lojas de clientes reativas com consultas de sub-milissegundos e sincronização em tempo real.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов локальных приложений, которым необходимы реактивные клиентские хранилища с запросами за доли миллисекунды и синхронизацией в реальном времени.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطبيقات المحلية الأولية التي تحتاج إلى مخازن عميل phản應ية مع استفسارات أقل من ملي ثانية وتزامن في الوقت الفعلي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build applications with live queries, optimistic mutations, and real-time synchronization using TanStack DB, leveraging its collection and live query capabilities for instant local writes and incremental updates.","zh":"赋予代理构建具有实时查询、乐观变异和实时同步的应用程序的能力，利用 TanStack DB 的集合和实时查询功能实现即时本地写入和增量更新。","ja":"TanStack DB のコレクションおよびライブクエリ機能を利用して、即時ローカル書き込みおよび増分更新を実現し、ライブクエリ、楽観的ミューテーション、リアルタイム同期を使用したアプリケーションの構築を可能にする。","ko":"TanStack DB의 컬렉션 및 라이브 쿼리 기능을 활용하여 即시 로컬 쓰기 및 증분 업데이트를 구현하고, 라이브 쿼리, 낙관적 변이 및 실시간 동기화를 사용하여 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있는 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a construir aplicaciones con consultas en vivo, mutaciones optimistas y sincronización en tiempo real utilizando TanStack DB, aprovechando sus capacidades de colección y consulta en vivo para escrituras locales instantáneas y actualizaciones incrementales.","fr":"Permet aux agents de construire des applications avec des requêtes en direct, des mutations optimistes et une synchronisation en temps réel en utilisant TanStack DB, en exploitant ses capacités de collection et de requête en direct pour des écritures locales instantanées et des mises à jour incrémentielles.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Anwendungen mit Live-Abfragen, optimistischen Mutationen und Echtzeitsynchronisierung zu erstellen, indem sie TanStack DB nutzen und seine Sammlungs- und Live-Abfragefunktionen für instantane lokale Schreibvorgänge und inkrementelle Aktualisierungen ausschöpfen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir aplicações com consultas ao vivo, mutações otimistas e sincronização em tempo real usando o TanStack DB, aproveitando suas capacidades de coleção e consulta ao vivo para gravações locais instantâneas e atualizações incrementais.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать приложения с живыми запросами, оптимистическими мутациями и синхронизацией в реальном времени, используя TanStack DB, используя его возможности коллекций и живых запросов для мгновенного локального написания и инкрементальных обновлений.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء بناء التطبيقات باستخدام استفسارات مباشرة وتغييرات متفائلة وتزامن في الوقت الفعلي باستخدام TanStack DB، واستخدام khảیات مجموعة والاستفسار المباشر للكتابة المحلية الفورية والتحديثات المتزايدة."},"useCases":{"en":["Building local-first apps with sub-millisecond queries","Implementing optimistic mutations for instant local writes","Syncing data in real-time across applications"],"zh":["构建具有亚毫秒查询的本地优先应用程序","实现乐观变异以实现即时本地写入","实时跨应用程序同步数据"],"ja":["サブミリ秒クエリを備えたローカルファーストアプリケーションの構築","即時ローカル書き込みを実現するための楽観的ミューテーションの実装","リアルタイムでアプリケーション間のデータを同期する"],"ko":["서브 밀리초 쿼리를 갖춘 로컬 우선 애플리케이션 구축","즉시 로컬 쓰기를 위한 낙관적 변이 구현","실시간으로 애플리케이션 간 데이터 동기화"],"es":["Construir aplicaciones de primera instancia local con consultas de submilisegundo","Implementar mutaciones optimistas para escrituras locales instantáneas","Sincronizar datos en tiempo real entre aplicaciones"],"fr":["Construire des applications premières locales avec des requêtes de sous-milliseconde","Mettre en œuvre des mutations optimistes pour des écritures locales instantanées","Synchroniser des données en temps réel entre les applications"],"de":["Lokale Erstanbieter-Apps mit Abfragen im Submillisekundenbereich erstellen","Optimistische Mutationen für instantane lokale Schreibvorgänge implementieren","Daten in Echtzeit zwischen Anwendungen synchronisieren"],"pt":["Construir aplicações local-first com consultas de sub-milissegundos","Implementar mutações otimistas para gravações locais instantâneas","Sincronizar dados em tempo real entre aplicações"],"ru":["Построение локальных приложений с запросами за доли миллисекунды","Реализация оптимистических мутаций для мгновенного локального написания","Синхронизация данных в реальном времени между приложениями"],"ar":["بناء التطبيقات المحلية الأولية مع استفسارات أقل من ملي ثانية","تنفيذ التغييرات المتفائلة للكتابة المحلية الفورية","مزامنة البيانات في الوقت الفعلي بين التطبيقات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Currently in BETA","Requires understanding of collections and live queries"],"zh":["目前处于 BETA 阶段","需要对集合和实时查询的理解"],"ja":["現在ベータ版","コレクションおよびライブクエリの理解が必要"],"ko":["현재 베타 버전","컬렉션 및 라이브 쿼리 이해 필요"],"es":["Actualmente en BETA","Requiere comprensión de colecciones y consultas en vivo"],"fr":["Actuellement en BETA","Nécessite une compréhension des collections et des requêtes en direct"],"de":["Derzeit in BETA","Benötigt Verständnis von Sammlungen und Live-Abfragen"],"pt":["Atualmente em BETA","Requer entendimento de coleções e consultas ao vivo"],"ru":["Находится в стадии BETA","Требует понимания коллекций и живых запросов"],"ar":["حاليًا في المرحلة التجريبية","يتطلب فهم المجموعات والاستفسار المباشر"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
