og-Plattformen","pt":"Arquitetura de Coleta: Plataforma de Blog Multi-tenant","ru":"Архитектура сбора: Многоуровневая блог-платформа","ar":"هندسة الجمع: منصة مدونة متعددة المستأجرين","en":"gathering-architecture"},"description":{"zh":"多租户博客平台架构是一种设计模式，用于构建可扩展和高性能的博客平台","ja":"マルチテナントブログプラットフォームアーキテクチャは、拡張性と高性能のブログプラットフォームを構築するための設計パターンです","ko":"멀티 테넌트 블로그 플랫폼 아키텍처는 확장성과 고성능의 블로그 플랫폼을 구축하기 위한 설계 패턴입니다","es":"La arquitectura de recopilación es un enfoque para diseñar plataformas de blog multi-tenant escalables y flexibles. Permite la creación de sistemas y servici...","fr":"L''architecture de collecte est une approche pour concevoir des plates-formes de blog multi-tenant évolutives et flexibles. Elle permet la création de système...","de":"Die Sammelarchitektur ist ein Ansatz zur Konzeption von skalierbaren und flexiblen Multi-Tenant-Blog-Plattformen. Sie ermöglicht die Erstellung von Systemen ...","pt":"A arquitetura de coleta é uma plataforma de blog multi-tenant para desenvolvedores, projetada para sistemas escaláveis e flexíveis.","ru":"Архитектура сбора - это многоуровневая блог-платформа для разработчиков, предназначенная для масштабируемых и гибких систем.","ar":"هندسة الجمع هي منصة مدونة متعددة المستأجرين لل مطورين، مصممة لنظم قابلة للتحجيم ومرنة.","en":"Multi-tenant blog platform"},"definition":{"en":"Multi-tenant blog platform"},"features":{"zh":["可扩展性","高性能","多租户支持","灵活的设计","易于维护"],"ja":["拡張性","高性能","マルチテナント対応","柔軟な設計","メンテナンスの容易性"],"ko":["확장성","고성능","멀티 테넌트 지원","유연한 설계","유지 보수의 용이성"],"es":["Diseño de sistemas y servicios escalables","Arquitectura de plataforma de blog multi-tenant","Flexibilidad y adaptabilidad a las necesidades de los usuarios","Creación de sistemas y servicios que se pueden refactorizar","Diseño de infraestructura core y refactorización"],"fr":["Conception de systèmes et services évolutifs","Architecture de plate-forme de blog multi-tenant","Flexibilité et adaptabilité aux besoins des utilisateurs","Création de systèmes et services qui peuvent être refactorisés","Conception d''infrastructure core et refactorisation"],"de":["Entwurf von skalierbaren Systemen und Diensten","Architektur von Multi-Tenant-Blog-Plattformen","Flexibilität und Anpassungsfähigkeit an die Bedürfnisse der Benutzer","Erstellung von Systemen und Diensten, die refactorisiert werden können","Entwurf von Core-Infrastruktur und Refactorierung"],"pt":["Plataforma de blog multi-tenant","Sistemas escaláveis e flexíveis","Design de arquitetura para desenvolvedores","Refatoração de infraestrutura de código","Criação de plataformas para recursos"],"ru":["Многоуровневая блог-платформа","Масштабируемые и гибкие системы","Проектирование архитектуры для разработчиков","Рефакторинг кодовой инфраструктуры","Создание платформ для функций"],"ar":["منصة مدونة متعددة المستأجرين","نظم قابلة للتحجيم ومرنة","تصميم هندسة ل المطورين","إعادة هيكلة بنية الكود","إنشاء منصات لميزات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["多租户博客平台","架构设计","可扩展性","高性能","软件设计模式","云计算","DevOps"],"ja":["マルチテナントブログプラットフォーム","アーキテクチャ設計","拡張性","高性能","ソフトウェア設計パターン","クラウドコンピューティング","DevOps"],"ko":["멀티 테넌트 블로그 플랫폼","아키텍처 설계","확장성","고성능","소프트웨어 설계 패턴","클라우드 컴퓨팅","DevOps"],"es":["arquitectura de recopilación","plataformas de blog multi-tenant","diseño de sistemas escalables","infraestructura core","refactorización de código","desarrollo de software","ingeniería de software","arquitectura de software"],"fr":["architecture de collecte","plates-formes de blog multi-tenant","conception de systèmes évolutifs","infrastructure core","refactorisation de code","développement de logiciels","ingénierie de logiciels","architecture de logiciels"],"de":["Sammelarchitektur","Multi-Tenant-Blog-Plattformen","Entwurf von skalierbaren Systemen","Core-Infrastruktur","Refactorierung von Code","Software-Entwicklung","Software-Ingenieurwesen","Software-Architektur"],"pt":["arquitetura de coleta","plataforma de blog multi-tenant","desenvolvimento de sistemas","design de arquitetura","refatoração de código","criação de plataformas"],"ru":["архитектура сбора","многоуровневая блог-платформа","разработка систем","проектирование архитектуры","рефакторинг кода","создание платформ"],"ar":["هندسة الجمع","منصة مدونة متعددة المستأجرين","تطوير النظم","تصميم هندسة","إعادة هيكلة الكود","إنشاء منصات"]}},"owner":"AutumnsGrove","repo":"GroveEngine","repoPath":"AutumnsGrove/GroveEngine","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.431Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"gathering-architecture","description":"The drum sounds. Eagle, Swan, and Elephant gather for system architecture. Use when designing major systems from vision to implementation.","bodyPreview":"# Gathering Architecture 🌲🦅\n\nThe drum echoes high in the canopy. The Eagle soars above, seeing the forest''s patterns. The Swan glides across the lake, elegant designs taking form. The Elephant moves below, building what was envisioned. Together they transform a clearing into a cathedral of code—systems that stand for seasons.\n\n## When to Summon\n\n- Designing new systems or services\n- Major architectural decisions\n- Refactoring core infrastructure\n- Creating platforms that other features build u","body":"# Gathering Architecture 🌲🦅\n\nThe drum echoes high in the canopy. The Eagle soars above, seeing the forest''s patterns. The Swan glides across the lake, elegant designs taking form. The Elephant moves below, building what was envisioned. Together they transform a clearing into a cathedral of code—systems that stand for seasons.\n\n## When to Summon\n\n- Designing new systems or services\n- Major architectural decisions\n- Refactoring core infrastructure\n- Creating platforms that other features build upon\n- When vision, design, and implementation must align\n\n---\n\n## Grove Tools for This Gathering\n\nUse `gw` and `gf` throughout. Quick reference for architecture work:\n\n```bash\n# Orientation — understand the project before designing\ngw context\n\n# Explore the existing architecture\ngf --agent search \"pattern\"         # Find code patterns\ngf --agent class \"ServiceName\"      # Find class/component definitions\ngf --agent routes                   # Map route structure\n\n# Understand dependencies and change impact\ngf --agent deps                     # Dependency graph\ngf --agent impact \"module\"          # Blast radius of changes\n```\n\n---\n\n## The Gathering\n\n```\nSUMMON → ORGANIZE → EXECUTE → VALIDATE → COMPLETE\n   ↓         ↲          ↲          ↲          ↓\nReceive  Dispatch   Animals    Verify   Architecture\nRequest  Animals    Work       Design   Defined\n```\n\n### Animals Mobilized\n\n1. **🦅 Eagle** — Design system architecture from 10,000 feet\n2. **🦢 Swan** — Write detailed technical specifications\n3. **🐘 Elephant** — Implement the architectural foundation\n\n---\n\n### Phase 1: SUMMON\n\n_The drum sounds. The canopy rustles..._\n\nReceive and parse the request:\n\n**Clarify the System:**\n\n- What problem does this solve?\n- What are the scale requirements?\n- What are the constraints?\n- What''s the growth trajectory?\n\n**Nature Metaphor:**\n\n> \"Every architecture needs a nature metaphor. What does this system resemble?\n>\n> - Heartwood (core that holds everything)\n> - Wisp (gentle guiding light)\n> - Porch (place to gather and talk)\n> - Something else?\"\n\n**Confirm:**\n\n> \"I''ll mobilize an architecture gathering for: **[system description]**\n>\n> This will involve:\n>\n> - 🦅 Eagle designing the high-level architecture\n> - 🦢 Swan writing the detailed specification\n> - 🐘 Elephant implementing the foundation\n>\n> Proceed with the gathering?\"\n\n---\n\n### Phase 2: ORGANIZE\n\n_The birds circle. The elephant waits below..._\n\nDispatch in sequence:\n\n**Dispatch Order:**\n\n```\nEagle ──→ Swan ──→ Elephant\n  │         │           │\n  │         │           │\nDesign    Write      Build\nSystem    Spec       Foundation\n```\n\n**Dependencies:**\n\n- Eagle must complete before Swan (needs architecture vision)\n- Swan must complete before Elephant (needs detailed spec)\n\n---\n\n### Phase 3: EXECUTE\n\n_The architecture takes form from sky to earth..._\n\nExecute each phase:\n\n**🦅 EAGLE — DESIGN**\n\n```\n\"Soaring above to see the whole system...\"\n\nOutput:\n- System boundaries defined\n- Component interactions mapped\n- Technology choices documented\n- Scale and constraints identified\n- Nature metaphor chosen\n\nArtifacts:\n- Architecture overview document\n- System diagrams\n- ADR (Architecture Decision Records)\n```\n\n**🦢 SWAN — SPECIFY**\n\n```\n\"Gliding across to craft the specification...\"\n\nOutput:\n- Detailed technical specification\n- API contracts defined\n- Database schema designed\n- Flow diagrams created\n- ASCII art header\n- Implementation checklist\n\nArtifacts:\n- tech-spec.md with all required sections\n- Interface definitions\n- Migration plan (if applicable)\n```\n\n**🐘 ELEPHANT — BUILD**\n\n```\n\"Building the foundation with unstoppable momentum...\"\n\nOutput:\n- Core infrastructure implemented\n- Base classes/modules created\n- API skeleton established\n- Database migrations written\n- Essential tests included\n\nArtifacts:\n- Working codebase\n- Foundation tests\n- Setup documentation\n```\n\n---\n\n### Phase 4: VALIDATE\n\n_The structure stands. Each animal verifies their work..._\n\n**Validation Checklist:**\n\n- [ ] Eagle: Architecture addresses all requirements\n- [ ] Swan: Specification is complete and implementable\n- [ ] Elephant: Foundation is solid and tested\n\n**Review Points:**\n\n```\nAfter Eagle:\n  → Review architecture with stakeholders\n  → Confirm boundaries and trade-offs\n  → Approve before Swan begins\n\nAfter Swan:\n  → Review spec for completeness\n  → Verify all sections present\n  → Confirm implementation ready\n\nAfter Elephant:\n  → Test foundation thoroughly\n  → Verify patterns established\n  → Confirm next features can build upon it\n```\n\n---\n\n### Phase 5: COMPLETE\n\n_The gathering ends. Architecture stands ready..._\n\n**Completion Report:**\n\n```markdown\n## 🌲 GATHERING ARCHITECTURE COMPLETE\n\n### System: [Name]\n\n### Animals Mobilized\n\n🦅 Eagle → 🦢 Swan → 🐘 Elephant\n\n### Architecture Decisions\n\n- **Pattern:** [e.g., Event-driven microservices]\n- **Scale Target:** [e.g., 10k concurrent users]\n- **Key Trade-offs:** [summary]\n\n### Artifacts Created\n\n- Architecture Overview (`docs/architecture/[system].md`)\n- Technical Specification (`docs/specs/[system]-spec.md`)\n- ADRs ([list])\n- Foundation Code ([location])\n- Base Tests ([location])\n\n### Ready for\n\n- Feature development on this foundation\n- Team onboarding using the spec\n- Future architecture reviews\n\n### Time Elapsed\n\n[Duration]\n\n_The forest has a new landmark._ 🌲\n```\n\n---\n\n## Example Gathering\n\n**User:** \"/gathering-architecture Design the notification system\"\n\n**Gathering execution:**\n\n1. 🌲 **SUMMON** — \"Mobilizing for: Notification system. Send email, push, SMS to users. Scale: millions of notifications/day.\"\n\n2. 🌲 **ORGANIZE** — \"Sequence: Eagle (architecture) → Swan (spec) → Elephant (foundation)\"\n\n3. 🌲 **EXECUTE** —\n   - 🦅 Eagle: \"Event-driven: App emits events → Queue → Workers → Providers. Scales horizontally.\"\n   - 🦢 Swan: \"Complete spec with flow diagrams, API contracts, provider adapter interface\"\n   - 🐘 Elephant: \"Event bus, queue infrastructure, base notification service, database schema\"\n\n4. 🌲 **VALIDATE** — \"Architecture handles scale, spec complete, foundation tested\"\n\n5. 🌲 **COMPLETE** — \"Notification platform ready for feature development\"\n\n---\n\n_From vision to foundation, the forest grows._ 🌲\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:13:06.481Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Architecture Agents needing multi-tenant blog platform design capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要多租户博客平台设计能力的架构代理。","ja":"マルチテナントブログプラットフォーム設計能力が必要なアーキテクチャエージェントに最適です。","ko":"다중 테넌트 블로그 플랫폼 디자인 기능이 필요한 아키텍처 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de arquitectura que necesitan capacidades de diseño de plataforma de blog multi-tenant.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''architecture ayant besoin de capacités de conception de plateforme de blog multi-locataire.","de":"Perfekt für Architektur-Agenten, die Multi-Tenant-Blog-Plattform-Designfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Arquitetura que necessitam de capacidades de design de plataformas de blog multi-tenant.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов архитектуры, которым необходимы возможности проектирования платформ блогов с несколькими арендаторами.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الهندسة المعمارية الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات تصميم منصة بلوق متعددة المستأجرين."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design and refactor core infrastructure using multi-tenant systems, creating platforms that other features build upon, and making major architectural decisions with elegance and precision, leveraging protocols and systems that stand for seasons.","zh":"赋予代理设计和重构核心基础设施的能力，使用多租户系统，创建其他功能构建的平台，并以优雅和精确的方式做出重大架构决策，利用能够经久不衰的协议和系统。","ja":"エージェントにマルチテナントシステムを使用してコアインフラストラクチャを設計およびリファクタリングする能力を付与し、他の機能を構築するためのプラットフォームを作成し、優雅で正確な方法で重要なアーキテクチャ上の決定を下し、季節が経つプロトコルとシステムを利用する。","ko":"에이전트에게 다중 테넌트 시스템을 사용하여 핵심 인프라를 설계하고 리팩토링할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 다른 기능을 구축하기 위한 플랫폼을 만들고, 우아하고 정밀한 방법으로 주요 아키텍처 결정들을 내리고, 계절이 지나는 프로토콜과 시스템을 활용한다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar y refactorizar la infraestructura central utilizando sistemas multi-tenant, creando plataformas sobre las que se construyen otras características, y tomando decisiones arquitectónicas importantes con elegancia y precisión, aprovechando protocolos y sistemas que perduran durante las estaciones.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir et de réorganiser l''infrastructure centrale en utilisant des systèmes multi-locataires, créant des plates-formes sur lesquelles d''autres fonctionnalités sont construites, et prenant des décisions architecturales importantes avec élégance et précision, en exploitant des protocoles et des systèmes qui durent pendant les saisons.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die Kerninfrastruktur mit Hilfe von Multi-Tenant-Systemen zu entwerfen und neu zu strukturieren, Plattformen zu erstellen, auf denen andere Funktionen aufbauen, und wichtige architektonische Entscheidungen mit Eleganz und Präzision zu treffen, indem sie Protokolle und Systeme nutzen, die über mehrere Jahreszeiten Bestand haben.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar e reestruturar a infraestrutura central utilizando sistemas multi-tenant, criando plataformas nas quais outros recursos são construídos, e tomando decisões arquitetônicas importantes com elegância e precisão, utilizando protocolos e sistemas que se mantêm por temporadas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать и перерабатывать основную инфраструктуру с использованием систем с несколькими арендаторами, создавая платформы, на которых строятся другие функции, и принимая важные архитектурные решения с изяществом и точностью, используя протоколы и системы, которые функционируют в течение сезонов.","ar":"يتمكن الوكلاء من تصميم وإعادة هيكلة البنية التحتية الأساسية باستخدام أنظمة متعددة المستأجرين، وخلق منصات لبناء ميزات أخرى، واتخاذ قرارات архيتيكتونية رئيسية مع أناقة ودقة، واستخدام بروتوكولات وأنظمة تقف لعدة مواسم."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing new multi-tenant systems","Refactoring core infrastructure for scalability","Creating platforms for feature development"],"zh":["设计新的多租户系统","为可扩展性而重构核心基础设施","为功能开发创建平台"],"ja":["新しいマルチテナントシステムを設計する","スケーラビリティのためにコアインフラストラクチャをリファクタリングする","機能開発のためのプラットフォームを作成する"],"ko":["新的 다중 테넌트 시스템을 설계한다","확장성을 위한 핵심 인프라를 리팩토링한다","기능 개발을 위한 플랫폼을 생성한다"],"es":["Diseñar nuevos sistemas multi-tenant","Reorganizar la infraestructura central para la escalabilidad","Crear plataformas para el desarrollo de características"],"fr":["Concevoir de nouveaux systèmes multi-locataires","Réorganiser l''infrastructure centrale pour la mise à l''échelle","Créer des plates-formes pour le développement de fonctionnalités"],"de":["Entwerfen neuer Multi-Tenant-Systeme","Neustrukturieren der Kerninfrastruktur für Skalierbarkeit","Erstellen von Plattformen für die Funktionsentwicklung"],"pt":["Projeto de novos sistemas multi-tenant","Reestruturação da infraestrutura central para escalabilidade","Criação de plataformas para desenvolvimento de recursos"],"ru":["Проектирование новых систем с несколькими арендаторами","Переработка основной инфраструктуры для масштабируемости","Создание платформ для разработки функций"],"ar":["تصميم أنظمة جديدة متعددة المستأجرين","إعادة هيكلة البنية التحتية الأساسية للتمكين من التوسع","خلق منصات لتطوير الميزات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of system design patterns","Limited to high-level architecture decisions"],"zh":["需要理解系统设计模式","仅限于高级架构决策"],"ja":["システム設計パターンの理解が必要","ハイレベルなアーキテクチャ上の決定のみ"],"ko":["시스템 디자인 패턴에 대한 이해가 필요하다","고수준의 아키텍처 결정만"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de patrones de diseño de sistemas","Limitado a decisiones de arquitectura de alto nivel"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des modèles de conception de systèmes","Limité aux décisions d''architecture de haut niveau"],"de":["Benötigt Verständnis von Systemdesignmustern","Begrenzt auf hochrangige Architekturentscheidungen"],"pt":["Exige compreensão de padrões de design de sistemas","Limitado a decisões de arquitetura de alto nível"],"ru":["Требует понимания шаблонов проектирования систем","Ограничен решениями архитектуры высокого уровня"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم أنماط تصميم الأنظمة","محدود بقرارات الهندسة المعمارية على مستوى عال"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('FlexNetOS/ripple-env/Kubernetes & Container Orchestration', 'community', 'FlexNetOS', 'ripple-env', 'FlexNetOS/ripple-env', 'Kubernetes & Container Orchestration', 0, 0, 35, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.431Z', '2026-02-18T05:12:42.543Z', NULL, '{"id":"FlexNetOS/ripple-env/Kubernetes & Container Orchestration","name":"Kubernetes & Container Orchestration","description":{"zh":"Kubernetes是一种容器编排平台，用于部署、扩展和管理容器化应用","ja":"Kubernetesはコンテナオーケストレーションプラットフォームであり、コンテナ化アプリケーションのデプロイ、拡張、管理に使用","ko":"쿠버네티스는 컨테이너 오케스트레이션 플랫폼으로 컨테이너화된 애플리케이션의 배포, 확장, 관리에 사용","es":"Kubernetes es una plataforma de orquestación de contenedores para desplegar, escalar y gestionar aplicaciones. Conoce sus recursos clave","fr":"Kubernetes est une plateforme d''orchestration de conteneurs pour déployer, mettre à l''échelle et gérer des applications. Découvrez ses ressources clés","de":"Kubernetes ist eine Container-Orchestrierungsplattform für das Bereitstellen, Skalieren und Verwalten von Anwendungen. Erfahren Sie mehr über seine wichtigsten Ressourcen","pt":"Kubernetes é uma plataforma de orquestração de contêineres para implantar, dimensionar e gerenciar aplicações em contêineres. Ela fornece recursos essenciais para gerenciar o ciclo de vida dos contêineres.","ru":"Kubernetes — это платформа оркестровки контейнеров для развертывания, масштабирования и управления контейнеризованными приложениями. Она предоставляет основные ресурсы для управления жизненным циклом контейнеров.","ar":"كوبرنيتس هي منصة لتأشير الحاويات لنشر وتوسيع وإدارة التطبيقات المحمولة. توفر الموارد الأساسية لإدارة دورة حياة الحاويات.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Kubernetes容器编排平台","ja":"Kubernetesコンテナオーケストレーション","ko":"쿠버네티스 컨테이너 오케스트레이션","es":"Orquestación de Contenedores con Kubernetes","fr":"Orchestration de Conteneurs avec Kubernetes","de":"Container-Orchestrierung mit Kubernetes","pt":"Orquestração de Contêineres com Kubernetes","ru":"Kubernetes и Оркестровка Контейнеров","ar":"تأشير حاويات كوبرنيتس","en":"Kubernetes & Container Orchestration"},"description":{"zh":"Kubernetes是一种容器编排平台，用于部署、扩展和管理容器化应用","ja":"Kubernetesはコンテナオーケストレーションプラットフォームであり、コンテナ化アプリケーションのデプロイ、拡張、管理に使用","ko":"쿠버네티스는 컨테이너 오케스트레이션 플랫폼으로 컨테이너화된 애플리케이션의 배포, 확장, 관리에 사용","es":"Kubernetes es una plataforma de orquestación de contenedores para desplegar, escalar y gestionar aplicaciones. Conoce sus recursos clave","fr":"Kubernetes est une plateforme d''orchestration de conteneurs pour déployer, mettre à l''échelle et gérer des applications. Découvrez ses ressources clés","de":"Kubernetes ist eine Container-Orchestrierungsplattform für das Bereitstellen, Skalieren und Verwalten von Anwendungen. Erfahren Sie mehr über seine wichtigst...","pt":"Kubernetes é uma plataforma de orquestração de contêineres para implantar, dimensionar e gerenciar aplicações em contêineres. Ela fornece recursos essenciais...","ru":"Kubernetes — это платформа оркестровки контейнеров для развертывания, масштабирования и управления контейнеризованными приложениями. Она предоставляет основн...","ar":"كوبرنيتس هي منصة لتأشير الحاويات لنشر وتوسيع وإدارة التطبيقات المحمولة. توفر الموارد الأساسية لإدارة دورة حياة الحاويات.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["自动化部署和扩展","容器化应用管理","服务发现和负载均衡","配置和密钥管理","网络和安全管理"],"ja":["自動化デプロイと拡張","コンテナ化アプリケーション管理","サービスディスカバリと負荷分散","設定と鍵管理","ネットワークとセキュリティ管理"],"ko":["자동화 배포와 확장","컨테이너화된 애플리케이션 관리","서비스 검색과 부하 분산","구성과 키 관리","네트워크와 보안 관리"],"es":["Despliegue de aplicaciones","Escalado de aplicaciones","Gestión de contenedores","Orquestación de servicios","Gestión de configuraciones","Seguridad de datos"],"fr":["Déploiement d''applications","Mise à l''échelle d''applications","Gestion de conteneurs","Orchestration de services","Gestion de configurations","Sécurité des données"],"de":["Bereitstellung von Anwendungen","Skalierung von Anwendungen","Verwaltung von Containern","Orchestrierung von Diensten","Verwaltung von Konfigurationen","Datensicherheit"],"pt":["Implantação de aplicações em contêineres","Dimensionamento automático de contêineres","Gerenciamento de ciclo de vida de contêineres","Provisionamento de recursos de rede","Gerenciamento de configurações e segredos"],"ru":["Развертывание контейнеризованных приложений","Автомасштабирование контейнеров","Управление жизненным циклом контейнеров","Проставление сетевых ресурсов","Управление конфигурациями и секретами"],"ar":["نشر التطبيقات المحمولة","توسيع آلي للحاويات","إدارة دورة حياة الحاويات","توفير الموارد الشبكية","إدارة التكوين والسر"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Kubernetes","容器编排","容器化应用","自动化部署","扩展和管理","服务发现","负载均衡"],"ja":["Kubernetes","コンテナオーケストレーション","コンテナ化アプリケーション","自動化デプロイ","拡張と管理","サービスディスカバリ","負荷分散"],"ko":["쿠버네티스","컨테이너 오케스트레이션","컨테이너화된 애플리케이션","자동화 배포","확장과 관리","서비스 검색","부하 분산"],"es":["Kubernetes","Orquestación de contenedores","Despliegue de aplicaciones","Escalado de aplicaciones","Gestión de contenedores","DevOps","Cloud Computing","Contenedores","Docker"],"fr":["Kubernetes","Orchestration de conteneurs","Déploiement d''applications","Mise à l''échelle d''applications","Gestion de conteneurs","DevOps","Cloud Computing","Conteneurs","Docker"],"de":["Kubernetes","Container-Orchestrierung","Bereitstellung von Anwendungen","Skalierung von Anwendungen","Verwaltung von Containern","DevOps","Cloud Computing","Container","Docker"],"pt":["Kubernetes","orquestração de contêineres","implantação de aplicações","dimensionamento automático","gerenciamento de contêineres","provisionamento de recursos","devops","contêineres","aplicações em contêineres"],"ru":["Kubernetes","оркестровка контейнеров","развертывание приложений","автомасштабирование","управление контейнерами","простановление ресурсов","devops","контейнеры","контейнеризованные приложения"],"ar":["كوبرنيتس","تأشير الحاويات","نشر التطبيقات","توسيع آلي","إدارة الحاويات","توفير الموارد","devops","الحاويات","التطبيقات المحمولة"]}},"owner":"FlexNetOS","repo":"ripple-env","repoPath":"FlexNetOS/ripple-env","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.431Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Kubernetes & Container Orchestration","description":"Kubernetes deployment and management. Activate when: (1) Creating or modifying K8s manifests, (2) Working with Helm charts, (3) Configuring ArgoCD GitOps, (4) Managing cluster resources, or (5) Troubleshooting pod/service issues.","bodyPreview":"# Kubernetes & Container Orchestration\n\n## Overview\n\nKubernetes (K8s) is a container orchestration platform for deploying, scaling, and managing containerized applications.\n\n## Core Resources\n\n| Resource | Purpose | Short Name |\n|----------|---------|------------|\n| Pod | Smallest deployable unit | po |\n| Deployment | Manages ReplicaSets | deploy |\n| Service | Network endpoint | svc |\n| ConfigMap | Configuration data | cm |\n| Secret | Sensitive data | secret |\n| Ingress | External access | ing |","body":"# Kubernetes & Container Orchestration\n\n## Overview\n\nKubernetes (K8s) is a container orchestration platform for deploying, scaling, and managing containerized applications.\n\n## Core Resources\n\n| Resource | Purpose | Short Name |\n|----------|---------|------------|\n| Pod | Smallest deployable unit | po |\n| Deployment | Manages ReplicaSets | deploy |\n| Service | Network endpoint | svc |\n| ConfigMap | Configuration data | cm |\n| Secret | Sensitive data | secret |\n| Ingress | External access | ing |\n| PersistentVolumeClaim | Storage request | pvc |\n| Namespace | Resource isolation | ns |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### kubectl Commands\n\n```bash\n# Context & Cluster\nkubectl config get-contexts\nkubectl config use-context <name>\nkubectl cluster-info\n\n# Resources\nkubectl get pods -A                    # All namespaces\nkubectl get deploy,svc,ing -n <ns>     # Multiple resources\nkubectl describe pod <name>            # Detailed info\nkubectl logs <pod> -f --tail=100       # Stream logs\nkubectl exec -it <pod> -- /bin/sh      # Shell into pod\n\n# Apply/Delete\nkubectl apply -f manifest.yaml\nkubectl delete -f manifest.yaml\nkubectl apply -k ./kustomize/          # Kustomize\n\n# Debug\nkubectl get events --sort-by=.lastTimestamp\nkubectl top pods                       # Resource usage\nkubectl port-forward svc/<name> 8080:80\n```\n\n## Manifest Templates\n\n### Deployment\n\n```yaml\napiVersion: apps/v1\nkind: Deployment\nmetadata:\n  name: myapp\n  labels:\n    app: myapp\nspec:\n  replicas: 3\n  selector:\n    matchLabels:\n      app: myapp\n  template:\n    metadata:\n      labels:\n        app: myapp\n    spec:\n      containers:\n        - name: myapp\n          image: myapp:latest\n          ports:\n            - containerPort: 8080\n          env:\n            - name: DATABASE_URL\n              valueFrom:\n                secretKeyRef:\n                  name: myapp-secrets\n                  key: database-url\n          resources:\n            requests:\n              memory: \"128Mi\"\n              cpu: \"100m\"\n            limits:\n              memory: \"256Mi\"\n              cpu: \"500m\"\n          livenessProbe:\n            httpGet:\n              path: /health\n              port: 8080\n            initialDelaySeconds: 10\n            periodSeconds: 5\n          readinessProbe:\n            httpGet:\n              path: /ready\n              port: 8080\n            initialDelaySeconds: 5\n            periodSeconds: 3\n```\n\n### Service\n\n```yaml\napiVersion: v1\nkind: Service\nmetadata:\n  name: myapp\nspec:\n  selector:\n    app: myapp\n  ports:\n    - port: 80\n      targetPort: 8080\n  type: ClusterIP  # or LoadBalancer, NodePort\n```\n\n### Ingress\n\n```yaml\napiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1\nkind: Ingress\nmetadata:\n  name: myapp\n  annotations:\n    kubernetes.io/ingress.class: nginx\n    cert-manager.io/cluster-issuer: letsencrypt-prod\nspec:\n  tls:\n    - hosts:\n        - myapp.example.com\n      secretName: myapp-tls\n  rules:\n    - host: myapp.example.com\n      http:\n        paths:\n          - path: /\n            pathType: Prefix\n            backend:\n              service:\n                name: myapp\n                port:\n                  number: 80\n```\n\n## Helm\n\n### Chart Structure\n\n```\nmychart/\n├── Chart.yaml\n├── values.yaml\n├── templates/\n│   ├── _helpers.tpl\n│   ├── deployment.yaml\n│   ├── service.yaml\n│   └── ingress.yaml\n└── charts/          # Dependencies\n```\n\n### Helm Commands\n\n```bash\n# Repository\nhelm repo add bitnami https://charts.bitnami.com/bitnami\nhelm repo update\nhelm search repo postgres\n\n# Install/Upgrade\nhelm install myrelease mychart/ -f values.yaml -n namespace\nhelm upgrade myrelease mychart/ -f values.yaml\nhelm upgrade --install myrelease mychart/  # Install or upgrade\n\n# Debug\nhelm template mychart/ -f values.yaml      # Render locally\nhelm install --dry-run --debug myrelease mychart/\nhelm lint mychart/\n\n# Management\nhelm list -A                               # All releases\nhelm history myrelease                     # Release history\nhelm rollback myrelease 1                  # Rollback to revision\nhelm uninstall myrelease\n```\n\n## ArgoCD GitOps\n\n### Application Manifest\n\n```yaml\napiVersion: argoproj.io/v1alpha1\nkind: Application\nmetadata:\n  name: myapp\n  namespace: argocd\nspec:\n  project: default\n  source:\n    repoURL: https://github.com/org/repo\n    targetRevision: HEAD\n    path: k8s/overlays/production\n  destination:\n    server: https://kubernetes.default.svc\n    namespace: production\n  syncPolicy:\n    automated:\n      prune: true\n      selfHeal: true\n    syncOptions:\n      - CreateNamespace=true\n```\n\n### ArgoCD CLI\n\n```bash\n# Login\nargocd login argocd.example.com\n\n# Applications\nargocd app list\nargocd app get myapp\nargocd app sync myapp\nargocd app diff myapp\n\n# Rollback\nargocd app history myapp\nargocd app rollback myapp <revision>\n```\n\n## Kustomize\n\n### Structure\n\n```\nbase/\n├── kustomization.yaml\n├── deployment.yaml\n└── service.yaml\n\noverlays/\n├── development/\n│   ├── kustomization.yaml\n│   └── replica-patch.yaml\n└── production/\n    ├── kustomization.yaml\n    └── replica-patch.yaml\n```\n\n### kustomization.yaml\n\n```yaml\n# base/kustomization.yaml\napiVersion: kustomize.config.k8s.io/v1beta1\nkind: Kustomization\nresources:\n  - deployment.yaml\n  - service.yaml\n\n# overlays/production/kustomization.yaml\napiVersion: kustomize.config.k8s.io/v1beta1\nkind: Kustomization\nresources:\n  - ../../base\npatchesStrategicMerge:\n  - replica-patch.yaml\nnamespace: production\nnamePrefix: prod-\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Pod Issues\n\n```bash\n# Pod not starting\nkubectl describe pod <name>\nkubectl logs <pod> --previous  # Previous container logs\n\n# Common issues:\n# - ImagePullBackOff: Check image name/registry access\n# - CrashLoopBackOff: Check logs, liveness probe\n# - Pending: Check resources, node selector, PVC\n```\n\n### Service Issues\n\n```bash\n# Service not reachable\nkubectl get endpoints <svc>    # Check endpoints exist\nkubectl get pods -l app=<label> # Check pod labels match\nkubectl port-forward svc/<name> 8080:80  # Test directly\n```\n\n## External Links\n\n- [Kubernetes Documentation](https://kubernetes.io/docs/)\n- [Helm Documentation](https://helm.sh/docs/)\n- [ArgoCD Documentation](https://argo-cd.readthedocs.io/)\n- [Kustomize Documentation](https://kustomize.io/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:12:42.543Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for DevOps Agents requiring automated container orchestration and scalable Kubernetes deployments.","zh":"适用于需要自动化容器编排和可扩展的Kubernetes部署的DevOps代理。","ja":"自動化されたコンテナオーケストレーションとスケーラブルなKubernetesデプロイを必要とするDevOpsエージェントに適しています。","ko":"자동화된 컨테이너 오케스트레이션과 확장 가능한 쿠버네티스 배포를 필요로 하는 DevOps 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de DevOps que requieren una orquestación de contenedores automatizada y despliegues escalables de Kubernetes.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents DevOps nécessitant une orchestration de conteneurs automatisée et des déploiements Kubernetes escalables.","de":"Ideal für DevOps-Agents, die eine automatisierte Container-Orchestrierung und skalierbare Kubernetes-Deployments erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes DevOps que requerem orquestração de contêineres automatizada e implantações escaláveis do Kubernetes.","ru":"Идеально для агентов DevOps, требующих автоматизированной оркестрации контейнеров и масштабируемых развертываний Kubernetes.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء DevOps الذين يتطلبون تحكمًا автомاتيكيًا في الحاويات وتنصيب Kubernetes قابل للتوسيع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage containerized applications using Kubernetes resources like Pods, Deployments, and Services, while leveraging ConfigMaps for configuration data and Secrets for sensitive information, all accessible through the Kubernetes API.","zh":"赋予代理使用Kubernetes资源（如Pod、Deployments和Services）管理容器化应用程序的能力，同时利用ConfigMaps进行配置数据管理和Secrets进行敏感信息管理，所有这些都可以通过Kubernetes API访问。","ja":"エージェントがKubernetesリソース（たとえばPod、Deployments、Services）を使用してコンテナ化されたアプリケーションを管理できるようにし、ConfigMapsを使用して構成データを管理し、Secretsを使用して機密情報を管理します。すべてのリソースはKubernetes APIを介してアクセスできます。","ko":"에이전트가 쿠버네티스 리소스(Pod, Deployments, Services 등)를 사용하여 컨테이너화된 애플리케이션을 관리할 수 있도록 하며, ConfigMaps를 사용하여 구성 데이터를 관리하고, Secrets를 사용하여 機密 정보를 관리합니다. 모든 리소스는 쿠버네티스 API를 통해 접근할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar aplicaciones contenerizadas utilizando recursos de Kubernetes como Pods, Despliegues y Servicios, aprovechando ConfigMaps para datos de configuración y Secretos para información sensible, todo accesible a través de la API de Kubernetes.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer des applications conteneurisées en utilisant des ressources Kubernetes comme des Pods, des déploiements et des services, en exploitant des ConfigMaps pour les données de configuration et des secrets pour les informations sensibles, le tout accessible via l''API Kubernetes.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, kontainerisierte Anwendungen mit Kubernetes-Ressourcen wie Pods, Deployments und Services zu verwalten, wobei ConfigMaps für Konfigurationsdaten und Secrets für sensible Informationen genutzt werden, alles über die Kubernetes-API zugänglich.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar aplicações contêinerizadas usando recursos do Kubernetes como Pods, Deployments e Services, aproveitando ConfigMaps para dados de configuração e Secrets para informações sensíveis, todos acessíveis por meio da API do Kubernetes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять контейнеризированными приложениями с помощью ресурсов Kubernetes, таких как Pods, Deployments и Services, используя ConfigMaps для конфигурационных данных и Secrets для конфиденциальной информации, все доступно через API Kubernetes.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إدارة التطبيقات المُحَوَّصة باستخدام موارد Kubernetes مثل Pods و Deployments و Services، مع استخدام ConfigMaps لبيانات التهيئة وأسرار للبيانات الحساسة، وكلها يمكن الوصول إليها من خلال واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Kubernetes."},"useCases":{"en":["Orchestrating containerized applications with Deployments and ReplicaSets","Exposing Services for network access and load balancing","Managing sensitive data with Secrets and configuration with ConfigMaps"],"zh":["使用Deployments和ReplicaSets编排容器化应用程序","使用Services暴露网络访问和负载均衡","使用Secrets和ConfigMaps管理敏感数据和配置"],"ja":["DeploymentsとReplicaSetsを使用してコンテナ化されたアプリケーションをオーケストレーションする","Servicesを使用してネットワークアクセスと負荷分散を公開する","SecretsとConfigMapsを使用して機密データと構成を管理する"],"ko":["Deployments와 ReplicaSets를 사용하여 컨테이너화된 애플리케이션을 오케스트레이션하는 것","Services를 사용하여 네트워크 접근과 부하 분산을 노출하는 것","Secrets와 ConfigMaps를 사용하여 기밀 데이터와 구성 관리를 하는 것"],"es":["Orquestar aplicaciones contenerizadas con Despliegues y ReplicaSets","Exponer Servicios para acceso a la red y equilibrio de carga","Gestionar datos sensibles con Secretos y configuración con ConfigMaps"],"fr":["Orchestrer des applications conteneurisées avec des déploiements et des ReplicaSets","Exposer des services pour l''accès au réseau et l''équilibrage de charge","Gérer des données sensibles avec des secrets et une configuration avec des ConfigMaps"],"de":["Kontainerisierte Anwendungen mit Deployments und ReplicaSets orchestrieren","Services für Netzwerkzugriff und Lastenausgleich exponieren","Sensible Daten mit Secrets und Konfiguration mit ConfigMaps verwalten"],"pt":["Orquestração de aplicações contêinerizadas com Deployments e ReplicaSets","Exposição de Services para acesso de rede e balanceamento de carga","Gerenciamento de dados sensíveis com Secrets e configuração com ConfigMaps"],"ru":["Оркестрация контейнеризированных приложений с помощью Deployments и ReplicaSets","Публикация Services для сетевого доступа и балансировки нагрузки","Управление конфиденциальными данными с помощью Secrets и конфигурацией с ConfigMaps"],"ar":["التحكم في التطبيقات المُحَوَّصة باستخدام Deployments و ReplicaSets","إتاحة Services للوصول الشبكي وتوازن الحمل","إدارة البيانات الحساسة مع أسرار والتهيئة مع ConfigMaps"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Kubernetes cluster access","Containerization of applications necessary"],"zh":["需要Kubernetes集群访问","需要应用程序容器化"],"ja":["Kubernetesクラスタへのアクセスが必要","アプリケーションのコンテナ化が必要"],"ko":["쿠버네티스 클러스터 접근이 필요","애플리케이션 컨테이너화가 필요"],"es":["Requiere acceso a un clúster de Kubernetes","La contenerización de aplicaciones es necesaria"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à un cluster Kubernetes","La conteneurisation des applications est nécessaire"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf einen Kubernetes-Cluster","Die Kontainerisierung von Anwendungen ist erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao cluster Kubernetes","Contêinerização de aplicações necessária"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к кластеру Kubernetes","Необходима контейнеризация приложений"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مجموعة Kubernetes","التهيئة الضرورية للتطبيقات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('dchuk/source_monitor/sm-configure', 'community', 'dchuk', 'source_monitor', 'dchuk/source_monitor', 'sm-configure', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.431Z', '2026-02-18T05:13:29.904Z', NULL, '{"id":"dchuk/source_monitor/sm-configure","name":"sm-configure","description":{"es":"sm-configure es un DSL de configuración para SourceMonitor que permite personalizar ajustes de aplicación","fr":"sm-configure est un DSL de configuration pour SourceMonitor qui permet de personnaliser les paramètres d''application","de":"sm-configure ist ein Konfigurations-DSL für SourceMonitor, mit dem Anwendungseinstellungen angepasst werden können","pt":"O sm-configure é uma ferramenta de configuração para o SourceMonitor. Ele fornece uma forma flexível de personalizar as configurações do SourceMonitor.","ru":"Sm-configure - это инструмент настройки для SourceMonitor. Он предоставляет гибкий способ настройки параметров конфигурации SourceMonitor.","ar":"sm-configure هو أداة تكوين لمحرك SOURCE. يقدم طريقة مرنة لتحديث إعدادات محرك SOURCE.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"es":"Configuración de SourceMonitor con sm-configure","fr":"Configurer SourceMonitor avec sm-configure","de":"Konfiguration von SourceMonitor mit sm-configure","pt":"Configuração de Motor de SOURCE","ru":"Настройка движка SourceMonitor","ar":"تكوين محرك SOURCE","en":"sm-configure"},"description":{"es":"sm-configure es un DSL de configuración para SourceMonitor que permite personalizar ajustes de aplicación","fr":"sm-configure est un DSL de configuration pour SourceMonitor qui permet de personnaliser les paramètres d''application","de":"sm-configure ist ein Konfigurations-DSL für SourceMonitor, mit dem Anwendungseinstellungen angepasst werden können","pt":"O sm-configure é uma ferramenta de configuração para o SourceMonitor. Ele fornece uma forma flexível de personalizar as configurações do SourceMonitor.","ru":"Sm-configure - это инструмент настройки для SourceMonitor. Он предоставляет гибкий способ настройки параметров конфигурации SourceMonitor.","ar":"sm-configure هو أداة تكوين لمحرك SOURCE. يقدم طريقة مرنة لتحديث إعدادات محرك SOURCE.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"es":["Configuración de SourceMonitor","Personalización de ajustes de aplicación","Depuración de problemas de configuración","Configuración de entornos específicos"],"fr":["Configuration de SourceMonitor","Personnalisation des paramètres d''application","Débogage des problèmes de configuration","Configuration d''environnements spécifiques"],"de":["Konfiguration von SourceMonitor","Anpassung von Anwendungseinstellungen","Fehlerbehebung bei Konfigurationsproblemen","Konfiguration von Umgebungen"],"pt":["Configuração flexível do SourceMonitor","Personalização de configurações","Suporte a configurações específicas do ambiente","Depuração de problemas de configuração","Integração com o arquivo de inicialização do aplicativo"],"ru":["Гибкая настройка SourceMonitor","Настройка параметров конфигурации","Поддержка параметров конфигурации для конкретной среды","Отладка проблем с конфигурацией","Интеграция с файлом инициализации приложения"],"ar":["تكوين مرن لمحرك SOURCE","تخصيص الإعدادات","دعم الإعدادات المحددة للبيئة","تصحيح أخطاء التكوين","التكامل مع ملف التهيئة للتطبيق"]},"keywords":{"es":["sm-configure","SourceMonitor","configuración de aplicación","personalización de ajustes","depuración de configuración","entornos específicos"],"fr":["sm-configure","SourceMonitor","configuration d''application","personnalisation de paramètres","débogage de configuration","environnements spécifiques"],"de":["sm-configure","SourceMonitor","Anwendungskonfiguration","Anpassung von Einstellungen","Fehlerbehebung bei Konfiguration","Umgebungen"],"pt":["configuração de motor de SOURCE","SourceMonitor","DSL de configuração","desenvolvimento de software","personalização de configurações","depuração de configuração"],"ru":["настройка движка SourceMonitor","SourceMonitor","DSL-конфигурация","разработка программного обеспечения","настройка параметров конфигурации","отладка конфигурации"],"ar":["تكوين محرك SOURCE","محرك SOURCE","لغة تعريف الإعدادات","تطوير البرمجيات","تخصيص الإعدادات","تصحيح أخطاء التكوين"]}},"owner":"dchuk","repo":"source_monitor","repoPath":"dchuk/source_monitor","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.431Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"sm-configure","description":"Use when configuring SourceMonitor engine settings via the DSL, including queue settings, HTTP client, fetching, health, scrapers, retention, scraping controls, events, model extensions, realtime, and authentication.","bodyPreview":"# sm-configure: Engine Configuration DSL\n\nComprehensive reference for configuring SourceMonitor via `SourceMonitor.configure`.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Adding or modifying settings in `config/initializers/source_monitor.rb`\n- Understanding what configuration options are available\n- Debugging configuration-related issues\n- Setting up environment-specific overrides\n\n## Configuration Entry Point\n\nAll configuration lives inside the `configure` block in the host app''s initializer:\n\n```ruby\nSourceMonitor.co","body":"# sm-configure: Engine Configuration DSL\n\nComprehensive reference for configuring SourceMonitor via `SourceMonitor.configure`.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Adding or modifying settings in `config/initializers/source_monitor.rb`\n- Understanding what configuration options are available\n- Debugging configuration-related issues\n- Setting up environment-specific overrides\n\n## Configuration Entry Point\n\nAll configuration lives inside the `configure` block in the host app''s initializer:\n\n```ruby\nSourceMonitor.configure do |config|\n  # settings here\nend\n```\n\nAfter the block executes, `ModelExtensions.reload!` runs automatically to apply any model changes. Restart web and worker processes after changes.\n\n## Configuration Sections\n\nThe `config` object (`SourceMonitor::Configuration`) has 11 sub-sections plus top-level queue/job settings:\n\n| Section | Accessor | Class |\n|---|---|---|\n| Top-level | `config.*` | `Configuration` |\n| HTTP | `config.http` | `HTTPSettings` |\n| Fetching | `config.fetching` | `FetchingSettings` |\n| Health | `config.health` | `HealthSettings` |\n| Scrapers | `config.scrapers` | `ScraperRegistry` |\n| Retention | `config.retention` | `RetentionSettings` |\n| Scraping | `config.scraping` | `ScrapingSettings` |\n| Events | `config.events` | `Events` |\n| Models | `config.models` | `Models` |\n| Realtime | `config.realtime` | `RealtimeSettings` |\n| Authentication | `config.authentication` | `AuthenticationSettings` |\n| Images | `config.images` | `ImagesSettings` |\n\nSee `reference/configuration-reference.md` for every setting with types, defaults, and examples.\n\n## Quick Examples\n\n### Queue Configuration\n```ruby\nconfig.queue_namespace = \"source_monitor\"\nconfig.fetch_queue_name = \"source_monitor_fetch\"\nconfig.fetch_queue_concurrency = 4\n```\n\n### HTTP Client\n```ruby\nconfig.http.timeout = 30\nconfig.http.proxy = ENV[\"HTTP_PROXY\"]\nconfig.http.retry_max = 3\n```\n\n### Authentication (Devise)\n```ruby\nconfig.authentication.authenticate_with :authenticate_user!\nconfig.authentication.authorize_with ->(c) { c.current_user&.admin? }\n```\n\n### Image Downloads (Active Storage)\n```ruby\nconfig.images.download_to_active_storage = true\nconfig.images.max_download_size = 5 * 1024 * 1024  # 5 MB\nconfig.images.download_timeout = 15\nconfig.images.allowed_content_types = %w[image/jpeg image/png image/webp]\n```\n\n### Events\n```ruby\nconfig.events.after_item_created { |e| Notifier.new_item(e.item) }\nconfig.events.register_item_processor ->(ctx) { Indexer.index(ctx.item) }\n```\n\n### Model Extensions\n```ruby\nconfig.models.table_name_prefix = \"sm_\"\nconfig.models.source.include_concern \"MyApp::SourceExtension\"\nconfig.models.item.validate :custom_check\n```\n\n### Realtime\n```ruby\nconfig.realtime.adapter = :redis\nconfig.realtime.redis_url = ENV[\"REDIS_URL\"]\n```\n\n## Helper APIs\n\n```ruby\nSourceMonitor.config                         # Current configuration\nSourceMonitor.configure { |c| ... }          # Set configuration\nSourceMonitor.reset_configuration!           # Revert to defaults (for tests)\nSourceMonitor.events                         # Shortcut to config.events\nSourceMonitor.queue_name(:fetch)             # Resolved queue name\nSourceMonitor.queue_concurrency(:scrape)     # Resolved concurrency\nSourceMonitor.mission_control_dashboard_path # Resolved MC path or nil\n```\n\n## Key Source Files\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|---|---|\n| `lib/source_monitor/configuration.rb` | Main Configuration class |\n| `lib/source_monitor/configuration/http_settings.rb` | HTTP client settings |\n| `lib/source_monitor/configuration/fetching_settings.rb` | Adaptive scheduling |\n| `lib/source_monitor/configuration/health_settings.rb` | Health monitoring |\n| `lib/source_monitor/configuration/scraper_registry.rb` | Scraper adapter registry |\n| `lib/source_monitor/configuration/retention_settings.rb` | Item retention |\n| `lib/source_monitor/configuration/scraping_settings.rb` | Scraping controls |\n| `lib/source_monitor/configuration/events.rb` | Event callbacks |\n| `lib/source_monitor/configuration/models.rb` | Model extensions config |\n| `lib/source_monitor/configuration/model_definition.rb` | Per-model definition |\n| `lib/source_monitor/configuration/realtime_settings.rb` | Action Cable settings |\n| `lib/source_monitor/configuration/authentication_settings.rb` | Auth settings |\n| `lib/source_monitor/configuration/images_settings.rb` | Image download settings |\n| `lib/source_monitor/configuration/validation_definition.rb` | Validation wrapper |\n\n## References\n\n- `reference/configuration-reference.md` -- Complete settings reference\n- `docs/configuration.md` -- Official configuration documentation\n- `lib/generators/source_monitor/install/templates/source_monitor.rb.tt` -- Initializer template\n\n## Testing\n\nReset configuration between tests:\n```ruby\nsetup do\n  SourceMonitor.reset_configuration!\nend\n```\n\nTest custom configuration:\n```ruby\ntest \"custom queue name\" do\n  SourceMonitor.configure do |config|\n    config.fetch_queue_name = \"custom_fetch\"\n  end\n  assert_equal \"custom_fetch\", SourceMonitor.queue_name(:fetch)\nend\n```\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [ ] Initializer exists at `config/initializers/source_monitor.rb`\n- [ ] Queue names match `config/queue.yml` (or `config/solid_queue.yml`) entries\n- [x] Dispatcher config includes `recurring_schedule: config/recurring.yml` (handled by install generator)\n- [ ] Authentication hooks configured for host auth system\n- [ ] HTTP timeouts appropriate for target feeds\n- [ ] Retention policy set for production\n- [ ] Workers restarted after configuration changes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:13:29.904Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Ruby-based AI Agents needing advanced SourceMonitor configuration capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 SourceMonitor 配置功能的基于 Ruby 的 AI 代理。","ja":"Ruby ベースの AI エージェントが高度な SourceMonitor 構成機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 SourceMonitor 구성 기능이 필요한 루비 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de inteligencia artificial basados en Ruby que necesitan capacidades de configuración avanzadas de SourceMonitor.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle basés sur Ruby nécessitant des capacités de configuration avancées de SourceMonitor.","de":"Perfekt für Ruby-basierte KI-Agents, die erweiterte SourceMonitor-Konfigurationsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de IA baseados em Ruby que precisam de capacidades de configuração avançadas do SourceMonitor.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ на основе Ruby, которым требуются расширенные возможности конфигурации SourceMonitor.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المبني على روبي الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات تكوين متقدمة لبرنامج SourceMonitor."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage environment-specific overrides and configure SourceMonitor via the `SourceMonitor.configure` block, utilizing Ruby initializers and configuration options.","zh":"赋予代理管理环境特定覆盖和通过 `SourceMonitor.configure` 块配置 SourceMonitor 的能力，利用 Ruby 初始化器和配置选项。","ja":"エージェントが環境固有のオーバーライドを管理し、`SourceMonitor.configure` ブロックを介して SourceMonitor を構成する機能を提供し、Ruby 初期化子と構成オプションを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 환경별 오버라이드를 관리하고 `SourceMonitor.configure` 블록을 통해 SourceMonitor를 구성할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, 루비 초기화자와 구성 옵션을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a administrar anulaciones específicas del entorno y a configurar SourceMonitor a través del bloque `SourceMonitor.configure`, utilizando inicializadores y opciones de configuración de Ruby.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les annulations spécifiques à l''environnement et de configurer SourceMonitor via le bloc `SourceMonitor.configure`, en utilisant les initialiseurs et les options de configuration Ruby.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, umgebungsspezifische Überschreibungen zu verwalten und SourceMonitor über den `SourceMonitor.configure`-Block zu konfigurieren, unter Verwendung von Ruby-Initialisierern und Konfigurationsoptionen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerenciem substituições específicas do ambiente e configurem o SourceMonitor por meio do bloco `SourceMonitor.configure`, utilizando inicializadores Ruby e opções de configuração.","ru":"Позволяет агентам управлять переопределениями, специфичными для окружения, и конфигурировать SourceMonitor через блок `SourceMonitor.configure`, используя инициализаторы Ruby и параметры конфигурации.","ar":"يمكن للعميل من إدارة الإعدادات الخاصة بالبيئة وتكوين برنامج SourceMonitor من خلال كتلة `SourceMonitor.configure` ، باستخدام المُبدئات الروبية وخيارات التكوين."},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring SourceMonitor for debug logging","Modifying settings in `config/initializers/source_monitor.rb`","Debugging configuration-related issues"],"zh":["为调试日志配置 SourceMonitor","修改 `config/initializers/source_monitor.rb` 中的设置","调试与配置相关的问题"],"ja":["デバッグ ロギング用の SourceMonitor 構成","`config/initializers/source_monitor.rb` 内の設定の変更","構成関連の問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["디버깅 로깅용 SourceMonitor 구성","`config/initializers/source_monitor.rb`의 설정 수정","구성 관련 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Configuración de SourceMonitor para la registrazione de depuración","Modificación de la configuración en `config/initializers/source_monitor.rb`","Depuración de problemas relacionados con la configuración"],"fr":["Configuration de SourceMonitor pour la journalisation de débogage","Modification des paramètres dans `config/initializers/source_monitor.rb`","Débogage des problèmes liés à la configuration"],"de":["Konfiguration von SourceMonitor für Debug-Protokollierung","Änderung der Einstellungen in `config/initializers/source_monitor.rb`","Fehlerbehebung bei konfigurationsbezogenen Problemen"],"pt":["Configurando o SourceMonitor para registro de depuração","Modificando configurações em `config/initializers/source_monitor.rb`","Depurando problemas relacionados à configuração"],"ru":["Настройка SourceMonitor для ведения журнала отладки","Изменение параметров в `config/initializers/source_monitor.rb`","Отладка проблем, связанных с конфигурацией"],"ar":["تكوين برنامج SourceMonitor لسجل تصحيح الأخطاء","تعديل الإعدادات في `config/initializers/source_monitor.rb`","تصحيح أخطاء متعلقة بالتكوين"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Ruby environment","SourceMonitor dependency needed"],"zh":["需要 Ruby 环境","需要 SourceMonitor 依赖"],"ja":["Ruby 環境が必要","SourceMonitor 依存関係が必要"],"ko":["루비 환경 필요","SourceMonitor 종속성 필요"],"es":["Requiere entorno Ruby","Se necesita dependencia de SourceMonitor"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Ruby","Dépendance de SourceMonitor nécessaire"],"de":["Benötigt Ruby-Umgebung","SourceMonitor-Abhängigkeit erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Ruby","Dependência do SourceMonitor necessária"],"ru":["Требуется окружение Ruby","Необходима зависимость от SourceMonitor"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة روبي","الاعتماد على برنامج SourceMonitor ضروري"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('aaronbassett/paneful/security-core', 'community', 'aaronbassett', 'paneful', 'aaronbassett/paneful', 'security-core', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.431Z', '2026-02-18T05:13:37.338Z', NULL, '{"id":"aaronbassett/paneful/security-core","name":"security-core","description":{"zh":"Security Core","ja":"Security Core","ko":"Security Core","es":"Security Core ofrece orientación sobre seguridad de aplicaciones para TypeScript, Python y Rust, incluyendo autenticación y autorización","fr":"Security Core propose des conseils de sécurité pour les applications TypeScript, Python et Rust, y compris l''authentification et l''autorisation","de":"Security Core bietet Anleitung zur Anwendungssicherheit für TypeScript, Python und Rust, einschließlich Authentifizierung und Autorisierung","pt":"O Security Core fornece orientações abrangentes de segurança para aplicativos TypeScript, Python e Rust, incluindo autenticação e autorização.","ru":"Security Core предоставляет комплексные рекомендации по безопасности для приложений TypeScript, Python и Rust, включая аутентификацию и авторизацию.","ar":"يوفر Security Core إرشادات شاملة لأمان التطبيقات TypeScript و Python و Rust، بما في ذلك المصادقة والتفويض.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Security Core","ja":"Security Core","ko":"Security Core","es":"Security Core: Guía de seguridad de aplicaciones","fr":"Security Core : Guide de sécurité d''applications","de":"Security Core: Anwendungssicherheitsleitfaden","pt":"Segurança Core - Guia de Segurança de Aplicativos","ru":"Security Core - Комплексное руководство по безопасности п...","ar":"نواة الأمان - إرشادات شاملة لأمان التطبيقات","en":"security-core"},"description":{"zh":"Security Core","ja":"Security Core","ko":"Security Core","es":"Security Core ofrece orientación sobre seguridad de aplicaciones para TypeScript, Python y Rust, incluyendo autenticación y autorización","fr":"Security Core propose des conseils de sécurité pour les applications TypeScript, Python et Rust, y compris l''authentification et l''autorisation","de":"Security Core bietet Anleitung zur Anwendungssicherheit für TypeScript, Python und Rust, einschließlich Authentifizierung und Autorisierung","pt":"O Security Core fornece orientações abrangentes de segurança para aplicativos TypeScript, Python e Rust, incluindo autenticação e autorização.","ru":"Security Core предоставляет комплексные рекомендации по безопасности для приложений TypeScript, Python и Rust, включая аутентификацию и авторизацию.","ar":"يوفر Security Core إرشادات شاملة لأمان التطبيقات TypeScript و Python و Rust، بما في ذلك المصادقة والتفويض.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["TypeScript","Python","Rust","JWT","RBAC/ABAC/RLS","Security Templates"],"ja":["TypeScript","Python","Rust","JWT","RBAC/ABAC/RLS","Security Templates"],"ko":["TypeScript","Python","Rust","JWT","RBAC/ABAC/RLS","Security Templates"],"es":["Autenticación con JWT","Autorización con RBAC/ABAC/RLS","Plantillas de seguridad predefinidas","Patrones de implementación para TypeScript, Python y Rust","Guía para la configuración de la seguridad","Recursos para la autenticación y autorización"],"fr":["Authentification avec JWT","Autorisation avec RBAC/ABAC/RLS","Modèles de sécurité prédéfinis","Modèles d''implémentation pour TypeScript, Python et Rust","Guide pour la configuration de la sécurité","Ressources pour l''authentification et l''autorisation"],"de":["Authentifizierung mit JWT","Autorisierung mit RBAC/ABAC/RLS","Vordefinierte Sicherheitstemplates","Implementierungsmuster für TypeScript, Python und Rust","Leitfaden für die Sicherheitskonfiguration","Ressourcen für Authentifizierung und Autorisierung"],"pt":["Orientações de autenticação e autorização","Modelos de segurança para TypeScript, Python e Rust","Implementação de JWT e RBAC/ABAC/RLS","Consultas de referência para padrões de segurança","Exemplos de código para facilitar a implementação"],"ru":["Рекомендации по аутентификации и авторизации","Модели безопасности для TypeScript, Python и Rust","Реализация JWT и RBAC/ABAC/RLS","Ссылки на рекомендации по стандартам безопасности","Примеры кода для облегчения реализации"],"ar":["إرشادات المصادقة والتفويض","نماذج الأمان للتطبيقات TypeScript و Python و Rust","تنفيذ JWT و RBAC/ABAC/RLS","مراجع لتنفيذ معايير الأمان","أمثلة من الكود لتعزيز التنفيذ"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Security Core","TypeScript","Python","Rust","JWT","RBAC/ABAC/RLS","Security Templates","Authentication","Authorization"],"ja":["Security Core","TypeScript","Python","Rust","JWT","RBAC/ABAC/RLS","Security Templates","Authentication","Authorization"],"ko":["Security Core","TypeScript","Python","Rust","JWT","RBAC/ABAC/RLS","Security Templates","Authentication","Authorization"],"es":["seguridad de aplicaciones","autenticación","autorización","TypeScript","Python","Rust","JWT","RBAC","ABAC","RLS"],"fr":["sécurité des applications","authentification","autorisation","TypeScript","Python","Rust","JWT","RBAC","ABAC","RLS"],"de":["Anwendungssicherheit","Authentifizierung","Autorisierung","TypeScript","Python","Rust","JWT","RBAC","ABAC","RLS"],"pt":["segurança de aplicativos","autenticação e autorização","TypeScript","Python","Rust","JWT","RBAC","ABAC","RLS","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["безопасность приложений","аутентификация и авторизация","TypeScript","Python","Rust","JWT","RBAC","ABAC","RLS","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["أمان التطبيقات","المصادقة والتفويض","TypeScript","Python","Rust","JWT","RBAC","ABAC","RLS","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"aaronbassett","repo":"paneful","repoPath":"aaronbassett/paneful","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.431Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"security-core","description":"Comprehensive application security expertise covering authentication, authorization, OWASP Top 10, and security best practices. Use when (1) Implementing authentication (JWT, OAuth2, sessions, OAuth for CLI/TUI/desktop apps), (2) Adding authorization (RBAC, ABAC, RLS with Supabase/PostgreSQL), (3) Security auditing code or infrastructure, (4) Setting up security infrastructure (headers, CORS, CSP, rate limiting), (5) Managing secrets and credentials, (6) Preventing OWASP Top 10 vulnerabilities (injection, XSS, CSRF, etc.), (7) Reviewing code for security issues, (8) Configuring secure web applications in TypeScript, Python, or Rust. Automatically triggered when working with authentication/authorization systems, security reviews, or addressing security vulnerabilities.","bodyPreview":"# Security Core\n\nComprehensive application security guidance for TypeScript, Python, and Rust applications.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Common Security Tasks\n\n**Setting up authentication:**\n1. Generate JWT keys: `./scripts/generate_jwt_keys.sh RS256`\n2. Consult [authentication.md](references/authentication.md) for implementation patterns\n3. Use security templates from `assets/configs/`\n\n**Implementing authorization:**\n1. Review [authorization.md](references/authorization.md) for RBAC/ABAC/RLS patterns","body":"# Security Core\n\nComprehensive application security guidance for TypeScript, Python, and Rust applications.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Common Security Tasks\n\n**Setting up authentication:**\n1. Generate JWT keys: `./scripts/generate_jwt_keys.sh RS256`\n2. Consult [authentication.md](references/authentication.md) for implementation patterns\n3. Use security templates from `assets/configs/`\n\n**Implementing authorization:**\n1. Review [authorization.md](references/authorization.md) for RBAC/ABAC/RLS patterns\n2. For Supabase: See RLS section with multi-tenant examples\n3. Implement permission checking at API and database layers\n\n**Security auditing:**\n1. Run: `./scripts/audit_security.sh`\n2. Review [code-review.md](references/code-review.md) checklist\n3. Check [owasp-top-10.md](references/owasp-top-10.md) for vulnerabilities\n\n**Hardening application:**\n1. Apply security headers from [security-headers.md](references/security-headers.md)\n2. Implement rate limiting from [rate-limiting.md](references/rate-limiting.md)\n3. Configure secrets management per [secrets-management.md](references/secrets-management.md)\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n### Authentication Scenarios\n- Implementing login/signup flows\n- Adding JWT or session-based authentication\n- Integrating OAuth 2.0 providers\n- **OAuth for CLI, TUI, or desktop applications** (Device Flow)\n- Multi-factor authentication (TOTP, SMS/Email OTP)\n- Password hashing and validation\n\n### Authorization Scenarios\n- Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)\n- Attribute-Based Access Control (ABAC)\n- **Row Level Security (RLS) with Supabase/PostgreSQL**\n- Multi-tenant data isolation\n- Permission-based access control\n- Resource ownership validation\n\n### Security Auditing\n- Code security reviews\n- Dependency vulnerability scanning\n- OWASP Top 10 compliance checks\n- Secret detection in code\n- Security configuration verification\n\n### Infrastructure Security\n- Security headers (CSP, HSTS, X-Frame-Options)\n- CORS configuration\n- Rate limiting implementation\n- Secrets management\n- API security hardening\n\n## Core Resources\n\n### Scripts (`scripts/`)\n\n**`audit_security.sh`** - Security audit for TypeScript, Python, and Rust projects\n- Runs dependency vulnerability scanners (npm audit, pip-audit, cargo-audit)\n- Detects hardcoded secrets in code\n- Checks for common security misconfigurations\n- Usage: `./scripts/audit_security.sh [project-directory]`\n\n**`generate_jwt_keys.sh`** - Generate secure JWT signing keys\n- Supports HS256 (symmetric), RS256 (asymmetric), ES256 (elliptic curve)\n- Automatically adds keys to .gitignore\n- Provides usage examples\n- Usage: `./scripts/generate_jwt_keys.sh [ALGORITHM] [OUTPUT_DIR]`\n\n### Reference Documentation (`references/`)\n\n**[authentication.md](references/authentication.md)** - Complete authentication guide\n- JWT implementation (TypeScript, Python, Rust)\n- Session-based authentication\n- OAuth 2.0 Authorization Code Flow\n- **OAuth Device Flow for CLI/TUI/desktop apps** ⭐\n- Multi-factor authentication (TOTP, SMS)\n- Password security and hashing\n- Token storage best practices\n\n**[authorization.md](references/authorization.md)** - Authorization patterns and implementations\n- Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)\n- Attribute-Based Access Control (ABAC)\n- **Row Level Security (RLS) with Supabase/PostgreSQL** ⭐\n- Multi-tenant RLS patterns\n- Permission checking patterns\n- Resource-based authorization\n- Testing authorization logic\n\n**[owasp-top-10.md](references/owasp-top-10.md)** - OWASP Top 10 prevention guide\n- A01: Broken Access Control\n- A02: Cryptographic Failures\n- A03: Injection (SQL, NoSQL, Command)\n- A04: Insecure Design\n- A05: Security Misconfiguration\n- A06: Vulnerable Components\n- A07: Authentication Failures\n- A08: Data Integrity Failures\n- A09: Logging & Monitoring Failures\n- A10: Server-Side Request Forgery (SSRF)\n\n**[secrets-management.md](references/secrets-management.md)** - Secrets and credentials management\n- Environment variables best practices\n- Secret managers (AWS Secrets Manager, HashiCorp Vault)\n- Secret rotation strategies\n- CI/CD secrets handling\n- Local development with .env files\n\n**[security-headers.md](references/security-headers.md)** - HTTP security headers\n- Content-Security-Policy (CSP)\n- Strict-Transport-Security (HSTS)\n- X-Frame-Options, X-Content-Type-Options\n- CORS configuration\n- Implementation examples for all frameworks\n\n**[rate-limiting.md](references/rate-limiting.md)** - Rate limiting strategies\n- Fixed window, sliding window, token bucket\n- Implementation in TypeScript, Python, Rust\n- Distributed rate limiting with Redis\n- Per-user and per-IP limiting\n- Rate limit headers and responses\n\n**[code-review.md](references/code-review.md)** - Security code review checklist\n- Authentication & authorization checks\n- Input validation & sanitization\n- Data protection and encryption\n- Security headers & configuration\n- Session management\n- API security\n- Common vulnerabilities (XSS, CSRF, SQL injection)\n\n### Configuration Templates (`assets/configs/`)\n\nReady-to-use security middleware for all supported languages:\n\n**TypeScript:** `assets/configs/typescript/security-config.ts`\n- Express + Helmet configuration\n- CORS setup\n- Rate limiting\n- Security headers\n\n**Python:** `assets/configs/python/security_middleware.py`\n- FastAPI middleware\n- Security headers\n- CORS\n- Rate limiting with slowapi\n\n**Rust:** `assets/configs/rust/security_middleware.rs`\n- Axum middleware\n- tower-http CORS layer\n- Security headers\n\n## Decision Guides\n\n### Choosing Authentication Method\n\n| Method | Use When | Complexity | Best For |\n|--------|----------|------------|----------|\n| JWT | Stateless APIs, microservices | Medium | SPAs, mobile apps, APIs |\n| Sessions | Traditional web apps | Low | Server-rendered apps |\n| OAuth 2.0 | Third-party auth, SSO | High | Delegated authentication |\n| API Keys | Service-to-service | Low | Internal services |\n\nSee [authentication.md](references/authentication.md) for detailed implementation patterns.\n\n### Choosing Authorization Model\n\n| Model | Use When | Complexity | Best For |\n|-------|----------|------------|----------|\n| RBAC | Simple role hierarchies | Low | Standard web apps |\n| ABAC | Complex, dynamic policies | High | Enterprise apps |\n| RLS | Multi-tenant with data isolation | Medium | SaaS applications |\n| Permissions | Fine-grained control | Medium | Admin panels, APIs |\n\nSee [authorization.md](references/authorization.md) for implementation patterns and RLS examples.\n\n### OAuth for CLI/TUI/Desktop\n\nFor applications without traditional browser redirects:\n\n**Device Authorization Flow (OAuth 2.0):**\n1. App requests device code\n2. User opens browser and enters code\n3. App polls for token\n4. Token granted after user approval\n\nFull implementation examples in [authentication.md - OAuth for CLI, TUI, and Desktop Apps](references/authentication.md#oauth-for-cli-tui-and-desktop-apps).\n\n## Common Workflows\n\n### 1. Implementing JWT Authentication\n\n```bash\n# Generate keys\n./scripts/generate_jwt_keys.sh RS256 ./keys\n\n# Review implementation patterns\n# See references/authentication.md#jwt-authentication\n```\n\nThen implement using examples for your language (TypeScript/Python/Rust).\n\n### 2. Adding Row Level Security (Supabase)\n\n```bash\n# Review RLS patterns\n# See references/authorization.md#row-level-security-rls\n```\n\nImplement RLS policies for multi-tenant isolation:\n- Enable RLS on tables\n- Create policies for SELECT, INSERT, UPDATE, DELETE\n- Use helper functions for complex rules\n- Test with different user contexts\n\n### 3. Security Audit Workflow\n\n```bash\n# Run automated audit\n./scripts/audit_security.sh\n\n# Manual review\n# 1. Check references/code-review.md checklist\n# 2. Review references/owasp-top-10.md for vulnerabilities\n# 3. Verify security headers with references/security-headers.md\n# 4. Test rate limiting per references/rate-limiting.md\n```\n\n### 4. Hardening New Application\n\n1. **Apply security templates:**\n   - Copy appropriate config from `assets/configs/[language]/`\n   - Configure CORS for your domains\n   - Set up rate limiting\n\n2. **Implement authentication:**\n   - Choose method from [authentication.md](references/authentication.md)\n   - Generate secure keys\n   - Configure token expiration\n\n3. **Add authorization:**\n   - Choose model from [authorization.md](references/authorization.md)\n   - Implement permission checks\n   - Enable RLS if multi-tenant\n\n4. **Configure security headers:**\n   - Follow [security-headers.md](references/security-headers.md)\n   - Test with online tools\n\n5. **Set up secrets management:**\n   - Follow [secrets-management.md](references/secrets-management.md)\n   - Use environment variables or secret manager\n\n6. **Review OWASP Top 10:**\n   - Check [owasp-top-10.md](references/owasp-top-10.md)\n   - Ensure all risks are mitigated\n\n## Language-Specific Guidance\n\n### TypeScript/Node.js\n- Use Helmet for security headers\n- Validate inputs with Zod\n- Use prepared statements for SQL\n- Hash passwords with bcrypt\n- See config: `assets/configs/typescript/security-config.ts`\n\n### Python/FastAPI\n- Use Pydantic for validation\n- Parameterized queries only\n- Hash passwords with bcrypt\n- Security middleware in startup\n- See config: `assets/configs/python/security_middleware.py`\n\n### Rust\n- Compiler prevents many issues\n- Validate at boundaries\n- Use sqlx for type-safe SQL\n- Hash passwords with argon2\n- See config: `assets/configs/rust/security_middleware.rs`\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Defense in Depth** - Multiple security layers\n2. **Least Privilege** - Grant minimum necessary permissions\n3. **Fail Securely** - Default to deny\n4. **Keep Secrets Secret** - Never commit credentials\n5. **Validate Everything** - All inputs at boundaries\n6. **Use Strong Crypto** - Modern algorithms only\n7. **Log Security Events** - Authentication, authorization failures\n8. **Update Dependencies** - Regular security patches\n9. **Rate Limit** - Protect against abuse\n10. **Test Security** - Automated security tests\n\n## Testing Security\n\nWrite tests for security concerns:\n\n```typescript\n// Authentication tests\nit(''should reject invalid credentials'');\nit(''should rate limit login attempts'');\nit(''should require MFA when enabled'');\n\n// Authorization tests\nit(''should deny unauthorized access'');\nit(''should allow access for correct role'');\nit(''should enforce resource ownership'');\n\n// Input validation tests\nit(''should prevent SQL injection'');\nit(''should sanitize HTML input'');\nit(''should validate file uploads'');\n```\n\nSee [code-review.md](references/code-review.md) for complete testing checklist.\n\n## Security Resources\n\n**Primary references in this skill:**\n- [authentication.md](references/authentication.md) - Auth patterns and OAuth for CLI/desktop\n- [authorization.md](references/authorization.md) - RBAC, ABAC, and RLS\n- [owasp-top-10.md](references/owasp-top-10.md) - Top web vulnerabilities\n- [secrets-management.md](references/secrets-management.md) - Credential handling\n- [security-headers.md](references/security-headers.md) - HTTP security headers\n- [rate-limiting.md](references/rate-limiting.md) - API protection\n- [code-review.md](references/code-review.md) - Security review checklist\n\n**External resources:**\n- [OWASP Top 10](https://owasp.org/www-project-top-ten/)\n- [OWASP Cheat Sheet Series](https://cheatsheetseries.owasp.org/)\n- [Security Headers](https://securityheaders.com/)\n- [Mozilla Web Security Guidelines](https://infosec.mozilla.org/guidelines/web_security)\n\n## Getting Started\n\n**For a new secure application:**\n1. Review [Best Practices](#best-practices) section\n2. Apply security templates from `assets/configs/`\n3. Implement authentication from [authentication.md](references/authentication.md)\n4. Add authorization from [authorization.md](references/authorization.md)\n5. Configure security headers from [security-headers.md](references/security-headers.md)\n6. Run `./scripts/audit_security.sh` to verify\n\n**For security review:**\n1. Run `./scripts/audit_security.sh`\n2. Follow [code-review.md](references/code-review.md) checklist\n3. Check [owasp-top-10.md](references/owasp-top-10.md) for vulnerabilities\n\n**For specific security concern:**\n- Authentication issue → [authentication.md](references/authentication.md)\n- Authorization issue → [authorization.md](references/authorization.md)\n- OWASP vulnerability → [owasp-top-10.md](references/owasp-top-10.md)\n- Configuration issue → [security-headers.md](references/security-headers.md) or [rate-limiting.md](references/rate-limiting.md)\n- Secrets issue → [secrets-management.md](references/secrets-management.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:13:37.338Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents focusing on secure application development, particularly those utilizing TypeScript, Python, and Rust.","zh":"适用于专注于安全应用开发的AI代理，特别是那些使用TypeScript、Python和Rust的代理。","ja":"セキュアなアプリケーション開発に重点を置くAIエージェント、特にTypeScript、Python、Rustを使用するものに最適です。","ko":"안전한 애플리케이션 개발에 중점을 둔 AI 에이전트에게 적합하며, 특히 TypeScript, Python 및 Rust를 사용하는 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA que se centran en el desarrollo de aplicaciones seguras, particularmente aquellos que utilizan TypeScript, Python y Rust.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA axés sur le développement d''applications sécurisées, en particulier ceux qui utilisent TypeScript, Python et Rust.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents, die sich auf die Entwicklung sicherer Anwendungen konzentrieren, insbesondere solche, die TypeScript, Python und Rust verwenden.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA que se concentram no desenvolvimento de aplicações seguras, particularmente aqueles que utilizam TypeScript, Python e Rust.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на разработку безопасных приложений, в частности тех, которые используют TypeScript, Python и Rust.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يركزون على تطوير التطبيقات الآمنة، ولا سيما أولئك الذين يستخدمون TypeScript و Python و Rust."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement robust authentication and authorization mechanisms using JWT keys, RBAC/ABAC/RLS patterns, and security templates, ensuring comprehensive application security.","zh":"赋予代理实现使用JWT密钥、RBAC/ABAC/RLS模式和安全模板的强大身份验证和授权机制，确保全面应用安全。","ja":"JWTキー、RBAC/ABAC/RLSパターン、セキュリティテンプレートを使用した堅牢な認証および認可メカニズムの実装をエージェントに可能にし、包括的なアプリケーションセキュリティを確保します。","ko":"JWT 키, RBAC/ABAC/RLS 패턴 및 보안 템플릿을 사용하여 강력한 인증 및 권한 부여 메커니즘을 구현할 수 있도록 에이전트에게 권장하며, 종합적인 애플리케이션 보안을 đảm保합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes implementar mecanismos de autenticación y autorización robustos utilizando claves JWT, patrones RBAC/ABAC/RLS y plantillas de seguridad, garantizando la seguridad integral de la aplicación.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des mécanismes d''authentification et d''autorisation robustes en utilisant des clés JWT, des modèles RBAC/ABAC/RLS et des modèles de sécurité, garantissant ainsi la sécurité globale de l''application.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, robuste Authentifizierungs- und Autorisierungsmechanismen mit JWT-Schlüsseln, RBAC/ABAC/RLS-Mustern und Sicherheitsvorlagen umzusetzen, um damit eine umfassende Anwendungssicherheit zu gewährleisten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar mecanismos de autenticação e autorização robustos usando chaves JWT, padrões RBAC/ABAC/RLS e modelos de segurança, garantindo uma segurança de aplicação abrangente.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовывать надежные механизмы аутентификации и авторизации с помощью ключей JWT, шаблонов RBAC/ABAC/RLS и шаблонов безопасности, обеспечивая комплексную безопасность приложений.","ar":"يتمكن العملاء من تنفيذ آليات مصادقة وتصريح قوية باستخدام مفاتيح JWT ونماط RBAC/ABAC/RLS وقوالب أمنية، مما يضمن أمانًا شاملاً للتطبيقات."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing secure authentication protocols with JWT keys","Configuring role-based access control (RBAC) for application authorization","Generating security templates for TypeScript, Python, and Rust applications"],"zh":["使用JWT密钥实现安全的身份验证协议","配置基于角色的访问控制（RBAC）用于应用授权","为TypeScript、Python和Rust应用生成安全模板"],"ja":["JWTキーを使用したセキュアな認証プロトコルの実装","アプリケーションの認可に役割ベースのアクセス制御（RBAC）を構成する","TypeScript、Python、Rustアプリケーションのセキュリティテンプレートを生成する"],"ko":["JWT 키를 사용한 안전한 인증 프로토콜 구현","애플리케이션 인가에 역할 기반 액세스 제어(RBAC) 구성","TypeScript, Python 및 Rust 애플리케이션에 대한 보안 템플릿 생성"],"es":["Implementar protocolos de autenticación seguros con claves JWT","Configurar el control de acceso basado en roles (RBAC) para la autorización de aplicaciones","Generar plantillas de seguridad para aplicaciones de TypeScript, Python y Rust"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des protocoles d''authentification sécurisés avec des clés JWT","Configurer le contrôle d''accès basé sur les rôles (RBAC) pour l''autorisation des applications","Générer des modèles de sécurité pour les applications TypeScript, Python et Rust"],"de":["Implementierung sicherer Authentifizierungsprotokolle mit JWT-Schlüsseln","Konfiguration der rollenbasierten Zugriffskontrolle (RBAC) für die Autorisierung von Anwendungen","Generierung von Sicherheitsvorlagen für TypeScript-, Python- und Rust-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Implementando protocolos de autenticação seguros com chaves JWT","Configurando controle de acesso baseado em funções (RBAC) para autorização de aplicativos","Gerando modelos de segurança para aplicações TypeScript, Python e Rust"],"ru":["Реализация безопасных протоколов аутентификации с помощью ключей JWT","Настройка контроля доступа на основе ролей (RBAC) для авторизации приложений","Генерация шаблонов безопасности для приложений TypeScript, Python и Rust"],"ar":["تنفيذ بروتوكولات مصادقة آمنة باستخدام مفاتيح JWT","تكوين التحكم في الوصول المستند إلى الأدوار (RBAC) لتصريح التطبيقات","توليد قوالب أمنية لتطبيقات TypeScript و Python و Rust"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of TypeScript, Python, and Rust programming languages","Limited to applications using JWT for authentication","Dependent on external scripts (e.g., generate_jwt_keys.sh) for key generation"],"zh":["需要TypeScript、Python和Rust编程语言的知识","仅限于使用JWT进行身份验证的应用","依赖外部脚本（例如generate_jwt_keys.sh）进行密钥生成"],"ja":["TypeScript、Python、Rustプログラミング言語の知識が必要","認証にJWTを使用するアプリケーションに限定される","キー生成のために外部スクリプト（例：generate_jwt_keys.sh）に依存する"],"ko":["TypeScript, Python 및 Rust 프로그래밍 언어에 대한 지식 필요","인증에 JWT를 사용하는 애플리케이션으로 제한됨","키 생성을 위해 외부 스크립트(예: generate_jwt_keys.sh)에 의존"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de los lenguajes de programación TypeScript, Python y Rust","Limitado a aplicaciones que utilizan JWT para la autenticación","Dependiente de scripts externos (por ejemplo, generate_jwt_keys.sh) para la generación de claves"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance des langages de programmation TypeScript, Python et Rust","Limité aux applications qui utilisent JWT pour l''authentification","Dépendant de scripts externes (par exemple, generate_jwt_keys.sh) pour la génération de clés"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse in den Programmiersprachen TypeScript, Python und Rust","Begrenzt auf Anwendungen, die JWT für die Authentifizierung verwenden","Abhängig von externen Skripten (z. B. generate_jwt_keys.sh) für die Schlüsselgenerierung"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento das linguagens de programação TypeScript, Python e Rust","Limitado a aplicações que utilizam JWT para autenticação","Dependente de scripts externos (por exemplo, generate_jwt_keys.sh) para geração de chaves"],"ru":["Требует знания языков программирования TypeScript, Python и Rust","Ограничен для приложений, использующих JWT для аутентификации","Зависит от внешних скриптов (например, generate_jwt_keys.sh) для генерации ключей"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة لغات البرمجة TypeScript و Python و Rust","محدود للتطبيقات التي تستخدم JWT للمصادقة","يعتمد على سكريبتات خارجية (على سبيل المثال generate_jwt_keys.sh) لتوليد المفاتيح"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
