on mit Versionskontrollsystemen"],"pt":["Análise automática da atividade dos estudantes","Monitoramento do progresso dos estudantes","Identificação de estudantes em risco","Análise da participação dos estudantes","Verificação da conclusão de laboratórios e projetos"],"ru":["Автоматический анализ деятельности студентов","Отслеживание прогресса студентов","Выявление студентов, находящихся в группе риска","Анализ участия студентов","Проверка завершения лабораторных и проектных работ"],"ar":["تحليل تلقائي لنشاط الطلاب","مراقبة التقدم","تحديد الطلاب المعرضين للخطر","تحليل المشاركة","التحقق من إكمال العمل المعملية والمشاريع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["学生活动分析","自动化分析","Git活动分析","学生进度跟踪","学生参与度分析","_at-risk_学生识别"],"ja":["学生活動分析","自動分析","Git活動分析","学生進度追跡","学生参加状況分析","_at-risk_学生特定"],"ko":["학생 활동 분석","자동 분석","Git 활동 분석","학생 진행 상황 추적","학생 참여도 분석","_at-risk_ 학생 식별"],"es":["análisis de actividad estudiantil","automatización de análisis","ingeniería de software","participación de los estudiantes","identificación de estudiantes en riesgo","visualización de la actividad","control de versiones","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["analyse d''activité étudiante","automatisation de l''analyse","génie logiciel","participation des étudiants","identification des étudiants à risque","visualisation de l''activité","contrôle de version","développement de logiciel"],"de":["Schüleraktivitätsanalyse","Automatisierung der Analyse","Software-Entwicklung","Schülerbeteiligung","Identifizierung von Schülern in Gefahr","Visualisierung der Aktivität","Versionskontrolle","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["análise de atividade estudantil","automatização","git","educadores","estudantes em risco","participação","laboratórios","projetos"],"ru":["анализ деятельности студентов","автоматизация","git","педагоги","студенты в группе риска","участие","лабораторные работы","проекты"],"ar":["تحليل نشاط الطلاب","أتمتة","جيت","معلمين","طلاب معرضون للخطر","مشاركة","أعمال معملية","مشاريع"]}},"owner":"nibzard","repo":"2025-intro-swe","repoPath":"nibzard/2025-intro-swe","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.431Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"student-activity-analysis","description":"Analyze student git activity, lab submissions, and project work for software engineering courses. Use when asked to update student analysis, check student activity, analyze the class, or when working with student rosters and git repositories. Handles inconsistencies in student behavior like multiple usernames, name variations, and missing data.","bodyPreview":"# Student Activity Analysis Skill\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nInvoke this skill when the user:\n- Asks to \"update the student activity analysis\"\n- Asks \"how are students doing?\" or \"check student progress\"\n- Mentions checking class activity, lab submissions, or project work\n- Wants to see who has completed labs or is actively contributing\n- Needs to verify student participation or identify at-risk students\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill automates the analysis of student git activity in a software engin","body":"# Student Activity Analysis Skill\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nInvoke this skill when the user:\n- Asks to \"update the student activity analysis\"\n- Asks \"how are students doing?\" or \"check student progress\"\n- Mentions checking class activity, lab submissions, or project work\n- Wants to see who has completed labs or is actively contributing\n- Needs to verify student participation or identify at-risk students\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill automates the analysis of student git activity in a software engineering course. It reads from a canonical student roster (OFFICIAL_STUDENT_ROSTER.json), queries git history, checks file systems, and generates a comprehensive markdown report (STUDENT_ACTIVITY_ANALYSIS.md).\n\n## Step-by-Step Instructions\n\n### Step 0: Sync with Main Branch (CRITICAL)\n\n**Always start by syncing with the main branch** to ensure you''re analyzing the latest activity:\n\n```bash\ngit fetch origin main\ngit merge origin main -m \"Sync with main before analysis\"\n```\n\n⚠️ **Why this is critical:** Without syncing, you may miss up to 76% of student activity that exists on the main branch but not on your current branch.\n\n### Step 1: Collect Activity Data\n\nRun the data collection script:\n\n```bash\npython3 .claude/skills/student-activity-analysis/collect_data.py\n```\n\nThis script will:\n- Read OFFICIAL_STUDENT_ROSTER.json\n- Query git logs for each student (handling multiple usernames)\n- Check lab01 completion (intro.py files)\n- Check lab03 folders\n- Analyze project folder activity\n- Generate STUDENT_ACTIVITY_DATA.json\n\n### Step 2: Generate Report\n\nRun the report generation script:\n\n```bash\npython3 .claude/skills/student-activity-analysis/generate_report.py\n```\n\nThis script will:\n- Read STUDENT_ACTIVITY_DATA.json\n- Generate formatted markdown tables\n- Calculate statistics\n- Write to STUDENT_ACTIVITY_ANALYSIS.md\n\n### Step 3: Review and Commit\n\nReview the generated report and commit if everything looks good:\n\n```bash\ngit add STUDENT_ACTIVITY_ANALYSIS.md STUDENT_ACTIVITY_DATA.json\ngit commit -m \"Update student activity analysis - $(date +%Y-%m-%d)\"\ngit push -u origin <branch-name>\n```\n\n## Handling Edge Cases\n\nThe real world is messy. Students don''t always follow instructions perfectly. This skill is designed to handle common inconsistencies:\n\n### Edge Case 1: Multiple GitHub Usernames\n\n**Problem:** A student may have multiple GitHub usernames or commit under different names.\n\n**Example from roster:**\n```json\n\"github_username\": \"jcuzic/Zlicone\"\n```\n\n**Solution:** Split on \"/\" and query git with all usernames:\n```bash\ngit log --all --author=\"jcuzic\\|Zlicone\" --oneline | wc -l\n```\n\n### Edge Case 2: Name Variations and Diacritics\n\n**Problem:** Student names in folders may not match roster exactly due to diacritics or spelling.\n\n**Roster:** \"Stipe Ćubelić\"\n**Folder:** `students/lab03/scubelic/`\n\n**Solution:** Use fuzzy matching when checking for folders:\n- Convert names to lowercase\n- Remove diacritics (ć→c, š→s, ž→z)\n- Check for partial matches\n\n### Edge Case 3: Lab Submissions in Wrong Location\n\n**Problem:** Student may create intro.py in the wrong directory.\n\n**Expected:** `students/<github_username>/intro.py`\n**Actual:** `students/intro.py` or `students/lab01/<name>/intro.py`\n\n**Solution:** Search entire students/ directory:\n```bash\nfind students/ -name \"intro.py\" -type f\n```\n\nThen manually verify which file belongs to which student.\n\n### Edge Case 4: Stale or Orphaned Project Folders\n\n**Problem:** Project folders exist but no students in roster claim them.\n\n**Examples:**\n- `projects/garderoba/` (no team registered)\n- `projects/climate-analyzers-asmith-bjohnson/` (demo data?)\n\n**Solution:**\n- List all projects in report\n- Mark unmatched folders as \"Unknown Team\"\n- Show commit count to help identify ownership\n\n### Edge Case 5: Team Lead with No Commits\n\n**Problem:** Student is listed as project lead but has 0 commits in project folder.\n\n**Possible reasons:**\n- Commits under different username\n- Work done in different branch\n- Administrative lead (not technical)\n\n**Solution:**\n- Mark as \"Lead Only - Verify\" status\n- Manually review git log for project folder\n- Check if commits exist under alternative username\n\n## Validation and Error Handling\n\nBefore finalizing the report, validate:\n\n1. **Student count matches:** Number of students in report = Number in roster\n2. **No missing projects:** All project folders are accounted for\n3. **Date ranges make sense:** First commit < Last commit\n4. **Status classifications are consistent:**\n   - \"Very Active\" = 15+ commits\n   - \"Active\" = 5-14 commits\n   - \"Low Activity\" = 2-4 commits\n   - \"Minimal Activity\" = 1 commit\n   - \"No Git Activity\" = 0 commits\n\nIf validation fails:\n- Report the discrepancy\n- Show which students/projects are problematic\n- Ask user if manual review is needed\n\n## Output Format\n\nThe generated STUDENT_ACTIVITY_ANALYSIS.md should include:\n\n1. **Overview Statistics**\n   - Total students (from roster)\n   - Students with activity\n   - Activity percentage\n\n2. **Student Activity Table**\n   - ALL students (even those with 0 commits)\n   - Sorted by activity level (most active first)\n   - Columns: Name, GitHub, Commits, Status, Lab01, Lab03, Project Role\n   - NO email addresses (kept in JSON only)\n\n3. **Project Teams Table**\n   - ALL project folders\n   - Columns: Project, Total Commits, Team Lead, Status\n   - Include \"Unknown\" projects\n\n4. **Recommendations**\n   - Students needing attention (0 commits)\n   - Positive highlights (very active students)\n\n## Testing the Skill\n\nTo test this skill manually:\n\n1. Create a test branch\n2. Invoke the skill\n3. Verify output contains all 52 students\n4. Check that statistics add up correctly\n5. Manually verify a few commit counts with `git log`\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n**Q: Script says \"OFFICIAL_STUDENT_ROSTER.json not found\"**\nA: Make sure you''re in the repository root directory `/home/user/2025-intro-swe/`\n\n**Q: Git log shows no commits for a student I know has commits**\nA: Check if they have multiple GitHub usernames. Update roster with \"username1/username2\" format.\n\n**Q: Student has intro.py but script doesn''t detect it**\nA: Check the file path. Script searches entire students/ directory but may need manual verification.\n\n**Q: Project folder exists but not in any team''s project_folder field**\nA: This is an orphaned project. Script will mark it as \"Unknown Team\" - may need manual investigation.\n\n## Files Managed by This Skill\n\n- **OFFICIAL_STUDENT_ROSTER.json** (READ ONLY - never modified by scripts)\n- **STUDENT_ACTIVITY_DATA.json** (Generated by collect_data.py)\n- **STUDENT_ACTIVITY_ANALYSIS.md** (Generated by generate_report.py)\n\n## Key Lessons Learned\n\n1. **Always sync with main first** - Missing this step caused 76% of activity to be missed initially\n2. **Include ALL enrolled students** - Even those with 0 activity need to be in the report\n3. **Separate static from dynamic data** - Roster is manual, activity data is automated\n4. **Handle real-world messiness** - Students use multiple usernames, misspell names, put files in wrong places\n5. **Make it deterministic** - Same git state should produce same report every time\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:14:23.622Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Education-focused AI Agents needing automated student git activity analysis and data visualization capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要自动化学生git活动分析和数据可视化能力的教育重点AI代理。","ja":"教育に焦点を当てたAIエージェントが学生のGitアクティビティ分析とデータ視覚化機能を自動化するために最適です。","ko":"학생의 깃 활동 분석 및 데이터 시각화 기능을 자동화해야 하는 교육 중심 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA con enfoque en educación que necesitan análisis automatizado de la actividad de los estudiantes en git y capacidades de visualización de datos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA axés sur l''éducation nécessitant une analyse automatisée de l''activité des étudiants sur git et des capacités de visualisation de données.","de":"Ideal für bildungsorientierte KI-Agents, die eine automatisierte Analyse der Git-Aktivitäten der Studierenden und Datenvisualisierungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA com foco em Educação que necessitam de análise automatizada de atividade de estudantes no git e capacidades de visualização de dados.","ru":"Идеально для образовательных агентов ИИ, требующих автоматизированного анализа деятельности студентов в git и возможностей визуализации данных.","ar":"مثالي لبرامج एजنت الذكاء الاصطناعي الموجهة للتعليم التي تحتاج إلى تحليل آلي لنشاط الطلاب في جيت وقدرات عرض البيانات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to track student progress, identify at-risk students, and verify participation through advanced git repository analysis, leveraging protocols like git and data formats like JSON or CSV.","zh":"赋予代理跟踪学生进度、识别处于风险中的学生并通过高级git仓库分析验证参与情况的能力，利用git和JSON或CSV等协议和数据格式。","ja":"エージェントが学生の進度を追跡し、リスクのある学生を特定し、GitやJSON、CSVなどのプロトコルとデータ形式を利用した高度なGitリポジトリ分析によって参加を検証する能力を与えます。","ko":"에이전트가 학생의 진행 상황을 추적하고 위험에 처한 학생을 식별하며 깃, JSON, CSV 등의 프로토콜 및 데이터 형식을 사용한 고급 깃 저장소 분석을 통해 참여를 확인하는 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes realizar un seguimiento del progreso de los estudiantes, identificar a los estudiantes en riesgo y verificar la participación a través de un análisis avanzado de los repositorios git, aprovechando protocolos como git y formatos de datos como JSON o CSV.","fr":"Permet aux agents de suivre la progression des étudiants, d''identifier les étudiants à risque et de vérifier la participation grâce à une analyse avancée des référentiels git, en exploitant des protocoles comme git et des formats de données comme JSON ou CSV.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, den Fortschritt der Studierenden zu verfolgen, Studierende mit Risiko zu identifizieren und die Teilnahme durch eine erweiterte Analyse von Git-Repositorys zu überprüfen, indem Protokolle wie Git und Datenformate wie JSON oder CSV genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a acompanhar o progresso dos estudantes, identificar estudantes em risco e verificar a participação por meio de análise avançada de repositórios git, utilizando protocolos como git e formatos de dados como JSON ou CSV.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью отслеживать прогресс студентов, выявлять студентов, находящихся в группе риска, и проверять участие через продвинутый анализ репозиториев git, используя протоколы như git и форматы данных как JSON или CSV.","ar":"تمكّن البرامج من تتبع تقدم الطلاب، وتحديد الطلاب المعرضين للخطر، والتحقق من المشاركة من خلال تحليل متقدم لمخازن جيت، مستخدمة بروتوكولات مثل جيت وتنسيقات بيانات مثل JSON أو CSV."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating student activity reports for instructors","Identifying students with low git activity for targeted support","Analyzing class activity trends to inform teaching strategies"],"zh":["为教师自动创建学生活动报告","识别git活动较低的学生以提供有针对性的支持","分析班级活动趋势以指导教学策略"],"ja":["教員のために学生のアクティビティ報告を自動化する","Gitアクティビティが低い学生を特定してターゲットを絞ったサポートを行う","クラスのアクティビティ傾向を分析して指導戦略に役立てる"],"ko":["교사용 학생 활동 보고서 자동 생성","깃 활동이 낮은 학생 식별을 통한 목표 지원","수업 활동 추세 분석을 통한 교육 전략 수립"],"es":["Automatizar los informes de actividad de los estudiantes para los instructores","Identificar a los estudiantes con baja actividad en git para un apoyo dirigido","Analizar las tendencias de actividad de la clase para informar las estrategias de enseñanza"],"fr":["Automatiser les rapports d''activité des étudiants pour les instructeurs","Identifier les étudiants ayant une faible activité sur git pour un soutien ciblé","Analyser les tendances d''activité de la classe pour éclairer les stratégies d''enseignement"],"de":["Automatisieren der Aktivitätsberichte der Studierenden für die Dozenten","Identifizieren von Studierenden mit geringer Git-Aktivität für gezielte Unterstützung","Analysieren der Aktivitätstrends der Klasse, um die Lehrstrategien zu bestimmen"],"pt":["Automatizar relatórios de atividade de estudantes para instrutores","Identificar estudantes com baixa atividade no git para apoio direcionado","Analizar tendências de atividade de classe para informar estratégias de ensino"],"ru":["Автоматизировать отчеты о деятельности студентов для преподавателей","Определить студентов с низкой активностью в git для целенаправленной поддержки","Анализировать тенденции активности класса, чтобы информировать стратегии преподавания"],"ar":["أتمتة تقارير نشاط الطلاب للمدرسين","تحديد الطلاب ذوي النشاط المنخفض في جيت للدعم المستهدف","تحليل اتجاهات نشاط الفصل لتحديد استراتيجيات التدريس"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to student git repositories","Limited to software engineering or similar courses with git-based projects"],"zh":["需要访问学生的git仓库","仅限于软件工程或类似课程中的git-based项目"],"ja":["学生のGitリポジトリへのアクセスが必要","ソフトウェアエンジニアリングや同等のコースでのGitベースのプロジェクトに限定される"],"ko":["학생의 깃 저장소에 대한 액세스가 필요","소프트웨어 엔지니어링 또는 유사한 코스에서 깃 기반 프로젝트로 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso a los repositorios git de los estudiantes","Limitado a cursos de ingeniería de software o similares con proyectos basados en git"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux référentiels git des étudiants","Limité aux cours d''ingénierie logicielle ou similaires avec des projets basés sur git"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die Git-Repositorys der Studierenden","Begrenzt auf Software-Engineering- oder ähnliche Kurse mit git-basierten Projekten"],"pt":["Requer acesso a repositórios git dos estudantes","Limitado a cursos de engenharia de software ou similares com projetos baseados em git"],"ru":["Требует доступа к репозиториям git студентов","Ограничен для курсов программной инженерии или подобных с проектами на основе git"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مخازن جيت للطلاب","محدود بالدورات الدراسية للهندسة البرمجية أو الدورات المماثلة ذات المشاريع المعتمدة على جيت"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('z3z1ma/vibe-pipe/loom-workspace', 'community', 'z3z1ma', 'vibe-pipe', 'z3z1ma/vibe-pipe', 'loom-workspace', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.431Z', '2026-02-18T05:14:06.107Z', NULL, '{"id":"z3z1ma/vibe-pipe/loom-workspace","name":"loom-workspace","description":{"zh":"Loom Workspace 是一个管理多个 TUI 的工具，提供工作树管理和分支命名规范等功能","ja":"Loom Workspace は複数の TUI を管理するツールで、ワークツリー管理やブランチ命名規約などを提供します","ko":"Loom Workspace는 여러 TUI를 관리하는 도구로, 작업 트리 관리와 분기 命名 규칙 등을 제공합니다","es":"Loom Workspace es una herramienta para gestionar múltiples TUIs. Permite crear y gestionar worktrees, ramas y repositorios","fr":"Loom Workspace est un outil pour gérer plusieurs TUI. Il permet de créer et de gérer des worktrees, des branches et des dépôts","de":"Loom Workspace ist ein Tool zur Verwaltung mehrerer TUIs. Es ermöglicht die Erstellung und Verwaltung von Worktrees, Branches und Repositorien","pt":"O Loom Workspace é uma ferramenta para gerenciar um conjunto de ferramentas de interface de usuário. Ele permite criar e gerenciar worktrees para branches de repositório.","ru":"Loom Workspace — это инструмент для управления набором инструментов интерфейса пользователя. Он позволяет создавать и управлять worktrees для веток репозитория.","ar":"لوح العمل لوم هو أداة لادارة مجموعة من واجهات المستخدم. يسمح بإنشاء وادارة worktrees لفرع مستودع","en":"Just a testbed for loom, a tool for managing a horde of your favorite TUIs"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Loom Workspace 技术概览","ja":"Loom Workspace の概要","ko":"Loom Workspace 기술 개요","es":"Loom Workspace: Gestión de TUIs","fr":"Loom Workspace: Gestion des TUI","de":"Loom Workspace: TUI-Verwaltung","pt":"Loom Workspace: Gerenciamento de TUIs","ru":"Loom Workspace: Управление TUI","ar":"loom workspace: إدارة واجهات المستخدم","en":"loom-workspace"},"description":{"zh":"Loom Workspace 是一个管理多个 TUI 的工具，提供工作树管理和分支命名规范等功能","ja":"Loom Workspace は複数の TUI を管理するツールで、ワークツリー管理やブランチ命名規約などを提供します","ko":"Loom Workspace는 여러 TUI를 관리하는 도구로, 작업 트리 관리와 분기 命名 규칙 등을 제공합니다","es":"Loom Workspace es una herramienta para gestionar múltiples TUIs. Permite crear y gestionar worktrees, ramas y repositorios","fr":"Loom Workspace est un outil pour gérer plusieurs TUI. Il permet de créer et de gérer des worktrees, des branches et des dépôts","de":"Loom Workspace ist ein Tool zur Verwaltung mehrerer TUIs. Es ermöglicht die Erstellung und Verwaltung von Worktrees, Branches und Repositorien","pt":"O Loom Workspace é uma ferramenta para gerenciar um conjunto de ferramentas de interface de usuário. Ele permite criar e gerenciar worktrees para branches de...","ru":"Loom Workspace — это инструмент для управления набором инструментов интерфейса пользователя. Он позволяет создавать и управлять worktrees для веток репозитория.","ar":"لوح العمل لوم هو أداة لادارة مجموعة من واجهات المستخدم. يسمح بإنشاء وادارة worktrees لفرع مستودع","en":"Just a testbed for loom, a tool for managing a horde of your favorite TUIs"},"definition":{"en":"Just a testbed for loom, a tool for managing a horde of your favorite TUIs"},"features":{"zh":["工作树管理","分支命名规范","Repo 模型支持","工作树添加和删除","Repo 状态查询"],"ja":["ワークツリー管理","ブランチ命名規約","リポジトリモデル対応","ワークツリーの追加と削除","リポジトリ状態の照会"],"ko":["작업 트리 관리","분기 명명 규칙","리포지토리 모델 지원","작업 트리 추가 및 삭제","리포지토리 상태 조회"],"es":["Gestión de worktrees","Creación y eliminación de ramas","Gestión de repositorios","Estado del repositorio","Nombre de rama recomendado"],"fr":["Gestion des worktrees","Création et suppression de branches","Gestion des dépôts","État du dépôt","Nom de branche recommandé"],"de":["Verwaltung von Worktrees","Erstellung und Löschung von Branches","Verwaltung von Repositorien","Repositorien-Status","Empfohlener Branch-Name"],"pt":["Criação de worktrees para branches de repositório","Listagem de worktrees existentes","Remoção de worktrees","Exibição do status do repositório","Suporte a naming convention para branches"],"ru":["Создание worktrees для веток репозитория","Список существующих worktrees","Удаление worktrees","Отображение статуса репозитория","Поддержка соглашения об именовании для веток"],"ar":["إنشاء worktrees لفرع مستودع","قائمة worktrees الحالية","إزالة worktrees","عرض حالة المستودع","دعم اتفاقية تسمية للفروع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Loom Workspace","TUI 管理","工作树管理","分支命名规范","Repo 模型","开发工具"],"ja":["Loom Workspace","TUI 管理","ワークツリー管理","ブランチ命名規約","リポジトリモデル","開発ツール"],"ko":["Loom Workspace","TUI 관리","작업 트리 관리","분기 명명 규칙","리포지토리 모델","개발 도구"],"es":["Loom Workspace","TUI","gestión de TUIs","worktrees","ramas","repositorios","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["Loom Workspace","TUI","gestion de TUI","worktrees","branches","dépôts","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Loom Workspace","TUI","TUI-Verwaltung","Worktrees","Branches","Repositorien","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["Loom Workspace","gerenciamento de TUIs","worktrees","branches de repositório","ferramentas de interface de usuário","naming convention","repositório","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["Loom Workspace","управление TUI","worktrees","ветки репозитория","инструменты интерфейса пользователя","соглашение об именовании","репозиторий","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["لوح العمل لوم","ادارة واجهات المستخدم","worktrees","فرع مستودع","ادوات واجهة المستخدم","اتفاقية تسمية","مستودع","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"z3z1ma","repo":"vibe-pipe","repoPath":"z3z1ma/vibe-pipe","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.431Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"loom-workspace","description":"Use loom workspace to create/manage worktrees for isolated execution of tickets.","version":"1","tags":"git,workflow","bodyPreview":"<!-- BEGIN:compound:skill-managed -->\n## Worktree basics (repo model)\n\nEnsure a worktree exists for a branch:\n\n- `compound_workspace(argv=[\"repo\", \"worktree\", \"add\", \"<branch>\"])`\n\nList worktrees:\n\n- `compound_workspace(argv=[\"repo\", \"worktree\", \"ls\"])`\n\nRemove a worktree:\n\n- `compound_workspace(argv=[\"repo\", \"worktree\", \"rm\", \"<branch>\"])`\n\nRepo status:\n\n- `compound_workspace(argv=[\"repo\", \"status\"])`\n\n## Branch naming\n\nRecommended:\n\n- `ticket-<ticket-id>-<short-slug>`\n\nExample:\n\n- `ticket-42-s","body":"<!-- BEGIN:compound:skill-managed -->\n## Worktree basics (repo model)\n\nEnsure a worktree exists for a branch:\n\n- `compound_workspace(argv=[\"repo\", \"worktree\", \"add\", \"<branch>\"])`\n\nList worktrees:\n\n- `compound_workspace(argv=[\"repo\", \"worktree\", \"ls\"])`\n\nRemove a worktree:\n\n- `compound_workspace(argv=[\"repo\", \"worktree\", \"rm\", \"<branch>\"])`\n\nRepo status:\n\n- `compound_workspace(argv=[\"repo\", \"status\"])`\n\n## Branch naming\n\nRecommended:\n\n- `ticket-<ticket-id>-<short-slug>`\n\nExample:\n\n- `ticket-42-streaming-chunking`\n\n## Practical note\n\nOpenCode runs inside *one* working directory. Typically, this is the main branch worktree.\n`loom workspace` creates the worktree path (usually under `.loom-repo/worktrees/<branch>`).\nDo the code changes in that worktree.\n<!-- END:compound:skill-managed -->\n\n## Manual notes\n\n_This section is preserved when the skill is updated. Put human notes, caveats, and exceptions here._\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:14:06.107Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Git-based AI Agents needing advanced repository management capabilities, particularly those utilizing worktrees for branch management.","zh":"适用于需要高级仓库管理能力的基于 Git 的 AI 代理，特别是那些使用工作树进行分支管理的代理。","ja":"Git ベースの AI エージェントが高度なリポジトリ管理機能を必要とする場合、特にブランチ管理にワークツリーを使用する場合に最適です。","ko":"Git 기반 AI 에이전트가 고급 리포지토리 관리 기능을 필요로 할 때 적합하며, 특히 브랜치 관리를 위해 워크트리를 사용하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de inteligencia artificial basados en Git que necesitan capacidades de gestión de repositorio avanzadas, particularmente aquellos que utilizan worktrees para la gestión de ramas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle basés sur Git nécessitant des capacités de gestion de référentiel avancées, en particulier ceux qui utilisent des worktrees pour la gestion des branches.","de":"Ideal für Git-basierte KI-Agents, die erweiterte Repository-Verwaltungsfunktionen benötigen, insbesondere solche, die Worktrees für die Verwaltung von Branches verwenden.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA baseados em Git que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de gerenciamento de repositórios, particularmente aqueles que utilizam worktrees para gerenciamento de branches.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, основанных на Git, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности управления репозиториями, особенно для тех, кто использует worktrees для управления ветками.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يعتمد على جيت و الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لإدارة المستودعات، ولا سيما أولئك الذين يستخدمون worktrees لإدارة الفروع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage a horde of TUIs with loom, facilitating worktree operations such as adding, listing, and removing worktrees, as well as checking repository status, all through command-line interfaces like `compound_workspace` with arguments for `repo`, `worktree`, and `status`.","zh":"赋予代理管理大量 TUI 的能力，利用 loom 实现工作树操作，如添加、列出和删除工作树，以及检查仓库状态，所有这些操作都可以通过命令行接口进行，如 `compound_workspace`，带有 `repo`、`worktree` 和 `status` 参数。","ja":"エージェントが大量の TUI を管理できるようにし、loom を使用してワークツリー操作（ワークツリーの追加、リスト、削除など）およびリポジトリの状態の確認を実行できるようにします。すべての操作は、`repo`、`worktree`、`status` パラメータを持つ `compound_workspace` などのコマンドラインインターフェイスを使用して実行できます。","ko":"에이전트가大量의 TUI를 관리할 수 있도록 하며, loom을 사용하여 작업 트리 작업(예: 작업 트리 추가, 목록, 삭제)을 수행하고 리포지토리의 상태를 확인할 수 있습니다. 모든 작업은 `repo`, `worktree`, `status` 매개 변수를 사용하는 `compound_workspace`와 같은 명령줄 인터페이스를 통해 수행할 수 있습니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes gestionar un gran número de TUI con loom, facilitando operaciones de worktree como agregar, listar y eliminar worktrees, así como comprobar el estado del repositorio, todo a través de interfaces de línea de comandos como `compound_workspace` con argumentos para `repo`, `worktree` y `status`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer une multitude de TUI avec loom, facilitant les opérations de worktree telles que l''ajout, la liste et la suppression de worktrees, ainsi que la vérification de l''état du référentiel, le tout via des interfaces de ligne de commande comme `compound_workspace` avec des arguments pour `repo`, `worktree` et `status`.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, eine Vielzahl von TUIs mit loom zu verwalten, wodurch Worktree-Operationen wie Hinzufügen, Auflisten und Entfernen von Worktrees sowie Überprüfen des Repository-Status erleichtert werden, und zwar über Kommandozeilen-Schnittstellen wie `compound_workspace` mit Argumenten für `repo`, `worktree` und `status`.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerenciem uma grande quantidade de TUIs com loom, facilitando operações de worktree, como adicionar, listar e remover worktrees, bem como verificar o status do repositório, tudo através de interfaces de linha de comando como `compound_workspace` com argumentos para `repo`, `worktree` e `status`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять большим количеством TUI с помощью loom, облегчая операции с worktree, такие как добавление, перечисление и удаление worktree, а также проверку состояния репозитория, все через командные интерфейсы, такие как `compound_workspace` с аргументами для `repo`, `worktree` и `status`.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء إمكانية إدارة مجموعة كبيرة من واجهات المستخدم النصية مع loom، و تسهل عمليات worktree مثل إضافة و قائمة و إزالة worktrees، وكذلك التحقق من حالة المستودع، و كل ذلك من خلال واجهات سطر الأوامر مثل `compound_workspace` مع الحجج ل `repo` و `worktree` و `status`."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating worktree setup for new branches with `compound_workspace(argv=[\"repo\", \"worktree\", \"add\", \"<branch>\"])`","Debugging repository issues by listing all worktrees with `compound_workspace(argv=[\"repo\", \"worktree\", \"ls\"])`","Streamlining development workflows by removing unused worktrees with `compound_workspace(argv=[\"repo\", \"worktree\", \"rm\", \"<branch>\"])`"],"zh":["使用 `compound_workspace(argv=[\"repo\", \"worktree\", \"add\", \"<branch>\"])` 自动设置新分支的工作树","使用 `compound_workspace(argv=[\"repo\", \"worktree\", \"ls\"])` 列出所有工作树以调试仓库问题","使用 `compound_workspace(argv=[\"repo\", \"worktree\", \"rm\", \"<branch>\"])` 删除未使用的工作树以简化开发工作流"],"ja":["新しいブランチのワークツリーを自動的に設定するために `compound_workspace(argv=[\"repo\", \"worktree\", \"add\", \"<branch>\"])` を使用する","すべてのワークツリーをリストしてリポジトリの問題をデバッグするために `compound_workspace(argv=[\"repo\", \"worktree\", \"ls\"])` を使用する","使用されていないワークツリーを削除して開発ワークフローを簡素化するために `compound_workspace(argv=[\"repo\", \"worktree\", \"rm\", \"<branch>\"])` を使用する"],"ko":["새로운 브랜치의 작업 트리를 자동으로 설정하기 위해 `compound_workspace(argv=[\"repo\", \"worktree\", \"add\", \"<branch>\"])`를 사용","모든 작업 트리를 나열하여 리포지토리 문제를 디버깅하기 위해 `compound_workspace(argv=[\"repo\", \"worktree\", \"ls\"])`를 사용","사용하지 않는 작업 트리를 삭제하여 개발 워크플ロー를 간소화하기 위해 `compound_workspace(argv=[\"repo\", \"worktree\", \"rm\", \"<branch>\"])`를 사용"],"es":["Automatizar la configuración de worktree para nuevas ramas con `compound_workspace(argv=[\"repo\", \"worktree\", \"add\", \"<rama>\"])`","Depurar problemas de repositorio mediante la lista de todos los worktrees con `compound_workspace(argv=[\"repo\", \"worktree\", \"ls\"])`","Optimizar flujos de trabajo de desarrollo eliminando worktrees no utilizados con `compound_workspace(argv=[\"repo\", \"worktree\", \"rm\", \"<rama>\"])`"],"fr":["Automatiser la configuration de worktree pour de nouvelles branches avec `compound_workspace(argv=[\"repo\", \"worktree\", \"add\", \"<branche>\"])`","Déboguer les problèmes de référentiel en listant tous les worktrees avec `compound_workspace(argv=[\"repo\", \"worktree\", \"ls\"])`","Optimiser les flux de travail de développement en supprimant les worktrees inutilisés avec `compound_workspace(argv=[\"repo\", \"worktree\", \"rm\", \"<branche>\"])`"],"de":["Automatisieren der Worktree-Konfiguration für neue Branches mit `compound_workspace(argv=[\"repo\", \"worktree\", \"add\", \"<Zweig>\"])`","Beheben von Repository-Problemen durch Auflisten aller Worktrees mit `compound_workspace(argv=[\"repo\", \"worktree\", \"ls\"])`","Optimieren von Entwicklungsworkflows durch Entfernen nicht genutzter Worktrees mit `compound_workspace(argv=[\"repo\", \"worktree\", \"rm\", \"<Zweig>\"])`"],"pt":["Automatizar a configuração do worktree para novos branches com `compound_workspace(argv=[\"repo\", \"worktree\", \"add\", \"<branch>\"])`","Depurar problemas do repositório listando todos os worktrees com `compound_workspace(argv=[\"repo\", \"worktree\", \"ls\"])`","Otimizar fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento removendo worktrees não utilizados com `compound_workspace(argv=[\"repo\", \"worktree\", \"rm\", \"<branch>\"])`"],"ru":["Автоматизировать настройку worktree для новых веток с помощью `compound_workspace(argv=[\"repo\", \"worktree\", \"add\", \"<branch>\"])`","Отладить проблемы репозитория, перечислив все worktree с помощью `compound_workspace(argv=[\"repo\", \"worktree\", \"ls\"])`","Упростить рабочие потоки разработки, удалив неиспользуемые worktree с помощью `compound_workspace(argv=[\"repo\", \"worktree\", \"rm\", \"<branch>\"])`"],"ar":["تأتمة إعداد worktree لفرع جديد مع `compound_workspace(argv=[\"repo\", \"worktree\", \"add\", \"<branch>\"])`","تصحيح مشاكل المستودع عن طريق قائمة جميع worktrees مع `compound_workspace(argv=[\"repo\", \"worktree\", \"ls\"])`","تبسيط تدفقات العمل عن طريق إزالة worktrees غير المستخدمة مع `compound_workspace(argv=[\"repo\", \"worktree\", \"rm\", \"<branch>\"])`"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git repository setup","Command-line interface dependency","Limited to TUI management within loom"],"zh":["需要 Git 仓库设置","依赖于命令行接口","仅限于 loom 内的 TUI 管理"],"ja":["Git リポジトリの設定が必要","コマンドラインインターフェイスに依存","loom 内の TUI 管理に限定"],"ko":["Git 리포지토리 설정이 필요","명령줄 인터페이스에 의존","loom 내의 TUI 관리에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere configuración de repositorio Git","Dependencia de la interfaz de línea de comandos","Limitado a la gestión de TUI dentro de loom"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de référentiel Git","Dépendance de l''interface de ligne de commande","Limité à la gestion de TUI au sein de loom"],"de":["Benötigt Git-Repository-Setup","Kommandozeilen-Schnittstellen-Abhängigkeit","Begrenzt auf TUI-Verwaltung innerhalb von loom"],"pt":["Requer configuração do repositório Git","Dependência da interface de linha de comando","Limitado ao gerenciamento de TUI dentro do loom"],"ru":["Требует настройки репозитория Git","Зависимость от командного интерфейса","Ограничен управлением TUI внутри loom"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد مستودع جيت","اعتماد واجهة سطر الأوامر","محدود بالإدارة التفاعلية داخل loom"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('milosptr/pos-system/printing-guide', 'community', 'milosptr', 'pos-system', 'milosptr/pos-system', 'printing-guide', 0, 0, 30, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.431Z', '2026-02-18T05:13:49.340Z', NULL, '{"id":"milosptr/pos-system/printing-guide","name":"printing-guide","description":{"zh":"本文介绍如何使用 ePOS SDK 将 Epson 热敏收据打印机集成到您的 POS 系统中","ja":"この記事では、ePOS SDK を使用して Epson の熱感レシートプリンタを POS システムに統合する方法について説明します","ko":"이 문서는 ePOS SDK를 사용하여 Epson의 열감지 영수증 프린터를 POS 시스템에 통합하는 방법을 설명합니다","es":"Esta guía de impresión Epson describe la integración de impresores térmicos de recibos en un sistema POS mediante el SDK ePOS.","fr":"Ce guide d''impression Epson décrit l''intégration d''imprimantes de reçus thermiques dans un système POS via le SDK ePOS.","de":"Dieser Epson-Druckleitfaden beschreibt die Integration von Thermalquittungsdruckern in ein POS-System über das ePOS-SDK.","pt":"Este guia descreve a integração da impressora Epson com o sistema de ponto de venda via SDK ePOS.","ru":"Это руководство описывает интеграцию принтера Epson с системой продаж через SDK ePOS.","ar":"يصف هذا الدليل دمج طابعة إبسون مع نظام نقطة البيع عبر SDK ePOS.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Epson 打印机集成指南","ja":"Epson プリンタ統合ガイド","ko":"Epson 프린터 통합 가이드","es":"Guía de Impresión Epson para Desarrolladores","fr":"Guide d''Impression Epson pour Développeurs","de":"Epson-Druckerteil-Leitfaden für Entwickler","pt":"Guia de Integração de Impressora Epson","ru":"Руководство по интеграции принтера Epson","ar":"دليل تكامل طابعة إبسون","en":"printing-guide"},"description":{"zh":"本文介绍如何使用 ePOS SDK 将 Epson 热敏收据打印机集成到您的 POS 系统中","ja":"この記事では、ePOS SDK を使用して Epson の熱感レシートプリンタを POS システムに統合する方法について説明します","ko":"이 문서는 ePOS SDK를 사용하여 Epson의 열감지 영수증 프린터를 POS 시스템에 통합하는 방법을 설명합니다","es":"Esta guía de impresión Epson describe la integración de impresores térmicos de recibos en un sistema POS mediante el SDK ePOS.","fr":"Ce guide d''impression Epson décrit l''intégration d''imprimantes de reçus thermiques dans un système POS via le SDK ePOS.","de":"Dieser Epson-Druckleitfaden beschreibt die Integration von Thermalquittungsdruckern in ein POS-System über das ePOS-SDK.","pt":"Este guia descreve a integração da impressora Epson com o sistema de ponto de venda via SDK ePOS.","ru":"Это руководство описывает интеграцию принтера Epson с системой продаж через SDK ePOS.","ar":"يصف هذا الدليل دمج طابعة إبسون مع نظام نقطة البيع عبر SDK ePOS.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["支持 Epson 热敏收据打印机","使用 ePOS SDK 进行集成","提供打印管理和设备连接管理","支持 IP 地址和端口配置","包含打印实用程序和设备管理模块","支持多语言环境"],"ja":["Epson の熱感レシートプリンタをサポート","ePOS SDK を使用して統合","印刷管理とデバイス接続管理を提供","IP アドレスとポートの構成をサポート","印刷ユーティリティとデバイス管理モジュールを含む","複数の言語環境をサポート"],"ko":["Epson의 열감지 영수증 프린터를 지원","ePOS SDK를 사용하여 통합","인쇄 관리 및 장치 연결 관리를 제공","IP 주소 및 포트 구성 지원","인쇄 유틸리티 및 장치 관리 모듈 포함","다중 언어 환경 지원"],"es":["Integración con el SDK ePOS de Epson","Gestión de impresión con módulo Vuex","Conexión de dispositivos mediante módulo epos.js","Utilidades de impresión heredadas en printing.js","Arquitectura de archivos para una implementación sencilla"],"fr":["Intégration avec le SDK ePOS d''Epson","Gestion d''impression avec module Vuex","Connexion d''appareils via module epos.js","Utilitaires d''impression hérités dans printing.js","Architecture de fichiers pour une mise en œuvre simple"],"de":["Integration mit dem Epson-ePOS-SDK","Druckverwaltung mit Vuex-Modul","Geräteverbindung über epos.js-Modul","Veraltete Druckutilitäten in printing.js","Dateiarchitektur für einfache Implementierung"],"pt":["Integração com impressora térmica de recibo Epson","Uso do SDK ePOS para conexão","Gerenciamento de impressão via módulo Vuex","Detalhes de conexão personalizáveis","Utilitários de impressão legados","Arquitetura escalável"],"ru":["Интеграция с термопринтером Epson для печати чеков","Использование SDK ePOS для соединения","Управление печатью через модуль Vuex","Настраиваемые детали соединения","Утилиты печати устаревшего образца","Масштабируемая архитектура"],"ar":["دمج طابعة إبسون الحرارية للفواتير","استخدام SDK ePOS للاتصال","إدارة الطباعة عبر وحدة Vuex","تفاصيل الاتصال القابلة للتعديل","أدوات الطباعة التقليدية","هيكل قابل للتوسيع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Epson 打印机","POS 系统","ePOS SDK","热敏收据打印机","打印管理","设备连接管理","IP 地址","端口配置"],"ja":["Epson プリンタ","POS システム","ePOS SDK","熱感レシートプリンタ","印刷管理","デバイス接続管理","IP アドレス","ポート構成"],"ko":["Epson 프린터","POS 시스템","ePOS SDK","열감지 영수증 프린터","인쇄 관리","장치 연결 관리","IP 주소","포트 구성"],"es":["impresión Epson","integración de impresión","SDK ePOS","sistema POS","desarrollo de impresión","Vuex","epos.js","printing.js"],"fr":["impression Epson","intégration d''impression","SDK ePOS","système POS","développement d''impression","Vuex","epos.js","printing.js"],"de":["Epson-Druck","Druckintegration","ePOS-SDK","POS-System","Druckentwicklung","Vuex","epos.js","printing.js"],"pt":["integração de impressora epson","sdk epos","impressora térmica de recibo","vuex","gerenciamento de impressão","desenvolvimento de software","ponto de venda","impressora epson"],"ru":["интеграция принтера epson","sdk epos","термопринтер для печати чеков","vuex","управление печатью","разработка программного обеспечения","система продаж","принтер epson"],"ar":["دمج طابعة إبسون","sdk epos","طابعة حرارية للفواتير","vuex","إدارة الطباعة","تطوير البرمجيات","نقطة البيع","طابعة إبسون"]}},"owner":"milosptr","repo":"pos-system","repoPath":"milosptr/pos-system","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.431Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"printing-guide","description":"Reference for Epson thermal printer integration. Use when working with receipt printing, printer connection, or the ePOS SDK.","bodyPreview":"# Epson Printer Integration Guide\n\nThis POS system integrates with Epson thermal receipt printers via the ePOS SDK.\n\n## Architecture\n\n### Files\n- `resources/js/epos-2.20.0.js` - Epson ePOS SDK library (253KB)\n- `resources/js/store/modules/printing.js` - Vuex module for print management\n- `resources/js/store/modules/epos.js` - Device connection management\n- `resources/js/printing.js` - Legacy printing utilities\n\n### Connection Details\n- **IP Address**: `192.168.200.80`\n- **Port**: `8008`\n- **Prot","body":"# Epson Printer Integration Guide\n\nThis POS system integrates with Epson thermal receipt printers via the ePOS SDK.\n\n## Architecture\n\n### Files\n- `resources/js/epos-2.20.0.js` - Epson ePOS SDK library (253KB)\n- `resources/js/store/modules/printing.js` - Vuex module for print management\n- `resources/js/store/modules/epos.js` - Device connection management\n- `resources/js/printing.js` - Legacy printing utilities\n\n### Connection Details\n- **IP Address**: `192.168.200.80`\n- **Port**: `8008`\n- **Protocol**: ePOS Device Service\n\n## Vuex Store Structure\n\n### State\n```javascript\nstate: {\n    ePosDev: null,           // ePOS device instance\n    printer: null,           // Printer object\n    printingNotification: false,\n    printingAttempts: 0,\n    printing: {\n        order: null,         // Current order being printed\n        invoice: null,       // Current invoice being printed\n    },\n    printingHistory: []\n}\n```\n\n### Key Actions\n\n```javascript\n// Connect to printer\nthis.$store.dispatch(''setEpsonDevice'')\n\n// Print an order (kitchen ticket)\nthis.$store.dispatch(''setPrintingOrder'', order)\n\n// Print an invoice (receipt)\nthis.$store.dispatch(''setPrintingInvoice'', invoice)\n```\n\n## Connection Flow\n\n```javascript\n// In printing.js store module\n\nsetEpsonDevice({ commit, state }) {\n    const ePosDev = new epson.ePOSDevice();\n\n    ePosDev.connect(''192.168.200.80'', 8008, (result) => {\n        if (result === ''OK'' || result === ''SSL_CONNECT_OK'') {\n            ePosDev.createDevice(''local_printer'',\n                ePosDev.DEVICE_TYPE_PRINTER,\n                { crypto: false, buffer: false },\n                (printer, code) => {\n                    if (code === ''OK'') {\n                        printer.timeout = 60000;\n                        commit(''setEpsonDevice'', { ePosDev, printer });\n                    }\n                }\n            );\n        }\n    });\n}\n```\n\n## Receipt Formatting\n\n### Order Ticket (Kitchen)\n```javascript\n// Header\nprinter.addTextAlign(printer.ALIGN_CENTER);\nprinter.addTextSize(1, 2);\nprinter.addTextStyle(false, false, true, printer.COLOR_1);\nprinter.addText(''TABLE NAME\\n\\n'');\n\n// Time\nprinter.addTextSize(1, 1);\nprinter.addText(` Vreme: ${time}\\n`);\n\n// Items\nprinter.addTextSize(1, 2);\nprinter.addText('' —————————————————\\n'');\nitems.forEach(item => {\n    printer.addText(` ${item.qty} x ${item.name}\\n`);\n});\n\n// Cut\nprinter.addFeedLine(1);\nprinter.addCut(printer.CUT_FEED);\n```\n\n### Invoice Receipt\n```javascript\n// Header\nprinter.addText(''PREDRAČUN\\n'');  // \"Bill\" in Serbian\n\n// Items with prices\nitems.forEach(item => {\n    printer.addText(formatLine(item.name, item.total));\n});\n\n// Totals\nprinter.addText(''—————————————————\\n'');\nprinter.addText(formatLine(''UKUPNO:'', total));\nprinter.addText(formatLine(''PDV (20%):'', tax));\n\n// Receipt number\nprinter.addText(`\\nBroj: ${receiptNumber}\\n`);\n\n// Cut\nprinter.addCut(printer.CUT_FEED);\n```\n\n## Helper Functions\n\n```javascript\n// Right-align text with spacing\nfunction printerTextBetween(left, right, width = 48) {\n    const spaces = width - left.length - right.length;\n    return left + '' ''.repeat(spaces) + right;\n}\n\n// Format price\nfunction formatPrice(price) {\n    return new Intl.NumberFormat(''de-DE'').format(price);\n}\n```\n\n## Error Handling\n\n```javascript\n// Sentry integration for error tracking\nimport * as Sentry from ''@sentry/vue'';\n\nprinter.onreceive = (response) => {\n    if (!response.success) {\n        Sentry.captureException(new Error(''Print failed''));\n        commit(''setPrintingNotification'', true);\n    }\n};\n\n// Retry logic\nif (state.printingAttempts < 3) {\n    commit(''incrementPrintingAttempts'');\n    dispatch(''setEpsonDevice'');\n}\n```\n\n## Printer Commands Reference\n\n```javascript\n// Text formatting\nprinter.addTextAlign(printer.ALIGN_LEFT | ALIGN_CENTER | ALIGN_RIGHT);\nprinter.addTextSize(width, height);  // 1-8 each\nprinter.addTextStyle(reverse, underline, bold, color);\n\n// Line spacing\nprinter.addTextLineSpace(pixels);  // Default ~30\nprinter.addFeedLine(lines);\n\n// Paper cutting\nprinter.addCut(printer.CUT_FEED);     // Feed then cut\nprinter.addCut(printer.CUT_NO_FEED);  // Cut without feed\n\n// Send to printer\nprinter.send();\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n1. **Printer not connecting**: Check IP/port, ensure printer is on network\n2. **Print jobs stuck**: Call `disconnect()` and reconnect\n3. **Garbled text**: Ensure UTF-8 encoding for Serbian characters\n4. **Slow printing**: Check `buffer: false` setting\n\n## Real-time Notifications\n\nThe printing module shows a notification when:\n- Print job is in progress\n- Print job fails (with retry option)\n- Timeout after 30 seconds\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:13:49.340Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Point-of-Sale Integration Agents requiring direct Epson thermal printer connectivity.","zh":"适用于需要直接连接爱普生热敏打印机的销售点集成代理","ja":"Epson 熱感プリンターへの直接接続を必要とする POS インテグレーション エージェントに最適","ko":"직접 에프손 열감지 프린터 연결이 필요한 POS 통합 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Integración de Punto de Venta que requieren conectividad directa con impresoras térmicas Epson.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''intégration de point de vente nécessitant une connectivité directe aux imprimantes thermiques Epson.","de":"Ideal für Point-of-Sale-Integration-Agenten, die eine direkte Verbindung zu Epson-Thermaldruckern benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Integração de Pontos de Venda que exigem conectividade direta com impressoras térmicas Epson.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов интеграции точек продаж, требующих прямого подключения к термопринтерам Epson.","ar":"مثالي لعميل نقاط البيع الذين يحتاجون إلى اتصال مباشر بطابعات إيبوص الحرارية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables direct integration with Epson thermal receipt printers via the ePOS SDK, providing IP-based device communication (192.168.200.80:8008) and comprehensive print job management through Vuex modules.","zh":"通过 ePOS SDK 实现与爱普生热敏收据打印机的直接集成，提供基于 IP 的设备通信（192.168.200.80:8008）和通过 Vuex 模块的综合打印作业管理","ja":"ePOS SDK を使用して、Epson 熱感レシートプリンターとの直接統合を実現し、IP ベースのデバイス通信（192.168.200.80:8008）と Vuex モジュールを介した包括的な印刷ジョブ管理を提供","ko":"에프손 열감지 영수증 프린터와의 직접 통합을 가능하게 하는 ePOS SDK를 통해 IP 기반의 디바이스 통신（192.168.200.80:8008）과 뷰엑스 모듈을 통한 종합적인 인쇄 작업 관리를 제공","es":"Permite la integración directa con imprimadoras de recibos térmicos Epson a través del SDK ePOS, proporcionando comunicación de dispositivos basada en IP (192.168.200.80:8008) y una gestión de trabajos de impresión integral a través de módulos Vuex.","fr":"Permet l''intégration directe avec les imprimantes de reçus thermiques Epson via le SDK ePOS, fournissant une communication d''appareil basée sur IP (192.168.200.80:8008) et une gestion complète des travaux d''impression via des modules Vuex.","de":"Ermöglicht die direkte Integration mit Epson-Thermalbon-druckern über das ePOS-SDK, bietet IP-basierte Gerätekommunikation (192.168.200.80:8008) und umfassendes Druckjob-Management durch Vuex-Module.","pt":"Permite integração direta com impressoras de recibo térmico Epson por meio do SDK ePOS, fornecendo comunicação de dispositivo baseada em IP (192.168.200.80:8008) e gerenciamento abrangente de trabalhos de impressão por meio de módulos Vuex.","ru":"Позволяет直接 интегрироваться с термопринтерами квитанций Epson через SDK ePOS, обеспечивая устройство на основе IP (192.168.200.80:8008) и всестороннее управление заданиями печати через модули Vuex.","ar":"يسمح بالتكامل المباشر مع طابعات إيبوص الحرارية للفاتورة من خلال SDK ePOS ، وتوفير اتصال الجهاز المت基طة على IP (192.168.200.80:8008) وإدارة شاملة لوظائف الطباعة من خلال وحدات Vuex."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating receipt printing workflows","Managing Epson device connections via IP configuration","Debugging thermal printer communication protocols"],"zh":["自动化收据打印工作流程","通过 IP 配置管理爱普生设备连接","调试热敏打印机通信协议"],"ja":["レシート印刷ワークフローの自動化","IP 構成を介したエプソン デバイス接続の管理","熱感プリンター通信プロトコルのデバッグ"],"ko":["영수증 인쇄 워크플로우 자동화","IP 구성 통해 에프손 디바이스 연결 관리","열감지 프린터 통신 규약 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar flujos de trabajo de impresión de recibos","Administrar conexiones de dispositivos Epson a través de la configuración de IP","Depurar protocolos de comunicación de impresoras térmicas"],"fr":["Automatiser les flux de travail d''impression de reçus","Gérer les connexions d''appareils Epson via la configuration IP","Déboguer les protocoles de communication d''imprimantes thermiques"],"de":["Automatisierung von Druckauftrags-Workflows","Verwaltung von Epson-Geräteverbindungen über IP-Konfiguration","Fehlerbehebung bei der Kommunikation von Thermaldruckern"],"pt":["Automatizar fluxos de trabalho de impressão de recibos","Gerenciar conexões de dispositivos Epson via configuração IP","Depurar protocolos de comunicação de impressora térmica"],"ru":["Автоматизировать рабочие процессы печати квитанций","Управлять подключениями устройств Epson через настройку IP","Отладить протоколы связи термопринтера"],"ar":["أتمتة تدفقات عمل طباعة الفواتير","إدارة الاتصالات أجهزة إيبوص عبر إعدادات IP","تصحيح أخطاء بروتوكولات الاتصال بطابعات إيبوص الحرارية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires specific Epson ePOS SDK (2.20.0)","Limited to IP-based printer connections (192.168.200.80:8008)","Dependent on Vuex store architecture"],"zh":["需要特定的爱普生 ePOS SDK（2.20.0）","仅限于基于 IP 的打印机连接（192.168.200.80:8008）","依赖于 Vuex 存储架构"],"ja":["特定の Epson ePOS SDK（2.20.0）が必要","IP ベースのプリンター接続（192.168.200.80:8008）のみ","Vuex ストア アーキテクチャに依存"],"ko":["특정 에프손 ePOS SDK（2.20.0）가 필요","IP 기반의 프린터 연결（192.168.200.80:8008）만 가능","뷰엑스 스토어 아키텍처에 의존"],"es":["Requiere el SDK ePOS Epson específico (2.20.0)","Limitado a conexiones de impresora basadas en IP (192.168.200.80:8008)","Dependiente de la arquitectura de la tienda Vuex"],"fr":["Nécessite le SDK ePOS Epson spécifique (2.20.0)","Limité aux connexions d''imprimante basées sur IP (192.168.200.80:8008)","Dépendant de l''architecture du magasin Vuex"],"de":["Benötigt das spezifische Epson-ePOS-SDK (2.20.0)","Begrenzt auf IP-basierte Druckeranschlüsse (192.168.200.80:8008)","Abhängig von der Vuex-Speicherarchitektur"],"pt":["Exige SDK ePOS Epson específico (2.20.0)","Limitado a conexões de impressora baseadas em IP (192.168.200.80:8008)","Dependente da arquitetura de loja Vuex"],"ru":["Требует специального SDK ePOS Epson (2.20.0)","Ограничен до подключений принтера на основе IP (192.168.200.80:8008)","Зависит от архитектуры хранилища Vuex"],"ar":["يتطلب SDK ePOS Epson المحدد (2.20.0)","محدود بالاتصالات الطابعة المعتمدة على IP (192.168.200.80:8008)","يعتمد على هيكل مخزن Vuex"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
