ов MCP","Архитектура, основанная на протоколах","Поддержка async/await","Реализация на Swift"],"ar":["إنشاء أدوات MCP مخصصة","تعديل أدوات MCP الحالية","هندسة قائمة على البروتوكولات","دعم async/await","تنفيذ باستخدام Swift"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Naki MCP 工具编写器","Swift","Core ML","协议架构","MCP 工具","异步/等待"],"ja":["Naki MCP ツールライター","Swift","Core ML","プロトコルアーキテクチャ","MCP ツール","非同期/待機"],"ko":["Naki MCP 툴 라이터","Swift","Core ML","프로토콜 아키텍처","MCP 툴","비동기/대기"],"es":["MCP","Naki","Swift","Core ML","arquitectura basada en protocolos","herramientas MCP","desarrollo de herramientas","async/await","registro de herramientas"],"fr":["MCP","Naki","Swift","Core ML","architecture basée sur des protocoles","outils MCP","développement d''outils","async/await","enregistrement d''outils"],"de":["MCP","Naki","Swift","Core ML","protokollbasierte Architektur","MCP-Tools","Tool-Entwicklung","async/await","Tool-Registrierung"],"pt":["MCP Tool Writer","criação de MCP","modificação de MCP","arquitetura baseada em protocolos","Swift","async/await","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["MCP Tool Writer","создание MCP","изменение MCP","архитектура, основанная на протоколах","Swift","async/await","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["مكتب أداة MCP","إنشاء MCP","تعديل MCP","هندسة قائمة على البروتوكولات","Swift","async/await","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"Sunalamye","repo":"Naki","repoPath":"Sunalamye/Naki","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.431Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"mcp-tool-writer","description":"Create, modify, and manage MCP tools for the Naki mahjong AI assistant. Use when adding new MCP tools, modifying existing tools, or fixing tool-related issues. This skill understands the Protocol-based MCPTool architecture.","bodyPreview":"# Naki MCP Tool Writer\n\nBase directory: {baseDir}\n\n<IMPORTANT>\n**MCP 調用規則**: 測試新建的 MCP 工具時，使用 `/naki-mcp-proxy` skill 調用。\n</IMPORTANT>\n\nThis skill helps create and modify MCP (Model Context Protocol) tools for the Naki project using the Protocol-based architecture.\n\n## Architecture Overview\n\nNaki uses a Protocol-based MCP architecture:\n\n```\ncommand/Services/MCP/\n├── MCPTool.swift          - Protocol 定義 + Schema 類型\n├── MCPContext.swift       - 執行上下文 (async/await 支持)\n├── MCPToolRegistry.swift  - 工","body":"# Naki MCP Tool Writer\n\nBase directory: {baseDir}\n\n<IMPORTANT>\n**MCP 調用規則**: 測試新建的 MCP 工具時，使用 `/naki-mcp-proxy` skill 調用。\n</IMPORTANT>\n\nThis skill helps create and modify MCP (Model Context Protocol) tools for the Naki project using the Protocol-based architecture.\n\n## Architecture Overview\n\nNaki uses a Protocol-based MCP architecture:\n\n```\ncommand/Services/MCP/\n├── MCPTool.swift          - Protocol 定義 + Schema 類型\n├── MCPContext.swift       - 執行上下文 (async/await 支持)\n├── MCPToolRegistry.swift  - 工具註冊表 (單例)\n├── MCPHandler.swift       - MCP 協議處理器\n└── Tools/\n    ├── SystemTools.swift  - 系統類工具 (get_status, get_help, get_logs, clear_logs)\n    ├── BotTools.swift     - Bot 控制工具 (bot_status, bot_trigger, bot_ops, bot_deep, bot_chi, bot_pon, bot_sync)\n    ├── GameTools.swift    - 遊戲狀態工具 (game_state, game_hand, game_ops, game_discard, game_action)\n    └── UITools.swift      - UI 操作工具 (execute_js, detect, explore, test_indicators, click, calibrate, ui_names_*)\n```\n\n## Current Registered Tools (47 total)\n\n| Category | Count | Examples |\n|----------|-------|----------|\n| System | 4 | `get_status`, `get_help`, `get_logs`, `clear_logs` |\n| Bot | 7 | `bot_status`, `bot_trigger`, `bot_ops`, `bot_deep`, `bot_chi`, `bot_pon`, `bot_sync` |\n| Game | 6 | `game_state`, `game_hand`, `game_ops`, `game_discard`, `game_action`, `game_emoji` |\n| Highlight | 6 | `highlight_tile`, `highlight_status`, `show_recommendations`, `hide_highlight` |\n| Emoji | 4 | `game_emoji`, `game_emoji_list`, `game_emoji_random` |\n| Lobby | 9 | `lobby_status`, `lobby_navigate`, `lobby_start_match`, `lobby_cancel_match` |\n| UI | 11 | `execute_js`, `detect`, `explore`, `click`, `calibrate`, `ui_names_*` |\n\nSee `/naki-mcp-proxy` for complete tool catalog.\n\n## How to Create a New MCP Tool\n\n### Step 1: Define the Tool Struct\n\nCreate a new struct implementing `MCPTool` protocol in the appropriate `Tools/*.swift` file:\n\n```swift\nstruct MyNewTool: MCPTool {\n    // 1. 工具名稱 (唯一標識符)\n    static let name = \"my_new_tool\"\n\n    // 2. 工具描述 (給 AI 看的說明)\n    static let description = \"描述這個工具做什麼，何時使用\"\n\n    // 3. 輸入參數 Schema\n    static let inputSchema = MCPInputSchema(\n        properties: [\n            \"param1\": .string(\"參數1的描述\"),\n            \"param2\": .integer(\"參數2的描述\")\n        ],\n        required: [\"param1\"]  // 必填參數\n    )\n\n    // 4. 上下文 (用於訪問 JS、Bot 等)\n    private let context: MCPContext\n\n    init(context: MCPContext) {\n        self.context = context\n    }\n\n    // 5. 執行邏輯\n    func execute(arguments: [String: Any]) async throws -> Any {\n        guard let param1 = arguments[\"param1\"] as? String else {\n            throw MCPToolError.missingParameter(\"param1\")\n        }\n\n        // 執行邏輯...\n\n        return [\"success\": true, \"result\": \"...\"]\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Step 2: Register the Tool\n\n在 `MCPToolRegistry.swift:142-182` 的 `registerBuiltInTools()` 方法中添加：\n\n```swift\nregister(MyNewTool.self)\n```\n\n**注意**: Tools 列表會自動從 Registry 生成，無需手動維護 JSON 檔案。\n\n## Input Schema Types\n\n```swift\n// 無參數\nstatic let inputSchema = MCPInputSchema.empty\n\n// 有參數\nstatic let inputSchema = MCPInputSchema(\n    properties: [\n        \"stringParam\": .string(\"字串參數描述\"),\n        \"intParam\": .integer(\"整數參數描述\"),\n        \"numberParam\": .number(\"數字參數描述\"),\n        \"boolParam\": .boolean(\"布林參數描述\"),\n        \"objectParam\": .object(\"物件參數描述\")\n    ],\n    required: [\"stringParam\"]  // 必填參數列表\n)\n```\n\n## Context API\n\n工具可以通過 `context` 訪問以下功能（定義在 `MCPContext.swift:15-38`）：\n\n```swift\n// 執行 JavaScript（async/await）\nlet result = try await context.executeJavaScript(\"return document.title\")\n\n// 獲取 Bot 狀態\nlet status = context.getBotStatus()\n\n// 觸發自動打牌\ncontext.triggerAutoPlay()\n\n// 日誌操作\nlet logs = context.getLogs()\ncontext.clearLogs()\ncontext.log(\"記錄訊息\")\n\n// 服務器埠號\nlet port = context.serverPort\n```\n\n## ⚠️ JavaScript 執行注意事項\n\n**重要**：`context.executeJavaScript()` 必須使用 `return` 語句才能正確返回值！\n\n```swift\n// ✅ 正確：使用 return 語句\nlet title = try await context.executeJavaScript(\"return document.title\")\nlet sum = try await context.executeJavaScript(\"return 1 + 1\")\nlet json = try await context.executeJavaScript(\"return JSON.stringify({a:1})\")\n\n// ❌ 錯誤：沒有 return，結果為 nil\nlet title = try await context.executeJavaScript(\"document.title\")  // 返回 nil！\n```\n\n**常見模式**：\n\n```swift\n// 調用遊戲 API 並返回 JSON\nlet script = \"return JSON.stringify(window.__nakiGameAPI.getGameState())\"\nlet result = try await context.executeJavaScript(script)\n\n// 執行操作並返回布林值\nlet script = \"return window.__nakiGameAPI.discardTile(0)\"\nlet success = try await context.executeJavaScript(script) as? Bool ?? false\n\n// 檢查 API 是否存在\nlet script = \"return typeof window.__nakiGameAPI !== ''undefined''\"\nlet exists = try await context.executeJavaScript(script) as? Bool ?? false\n```\n\n## Error Handling\n\n使用 `MCPToolError`（定義在 `MCPTool.swift:129-147`）處理錯誤：\n\n```swift\nthrow MCPToolError.missingParameter(\"paramName\")\nthrow MCPToolError.invalidParameter(\"paramName\", expected: \"string\")\nthrow MCPToolError.executionFailed(\"原因描述\")\nthrow MCPToolError.notAvailable(\"資源名稱\")\n```\n\n## Tool Categories & File Locations\n\n| Category | File | When to Add Here |\n|----------|------|-----------------|\n| 系統 | `SystemTools.swift` | Server status, logs, help |\n| Bot | `BotTools.swift` | Bot control, AI inference |\n| 遊戲 | `GameTools.swift` | Game state, hand, actions |\n| UI | `UITools.swift` | JS execution, clicks, detection |\n\n## Checklist for New Tools\n\n- [ ] 定義唯一的 `name`（snake_case 格式）\n- [ ] 寫清楚的 `description`（給 AI 理解，包含何時使用）\n- [ ] 定義正確的 `inputSchema`\n- [ ] 實現 `execute()` 方法（async throws）\n- [ ] 處理所有錯誤情況（使用 MCPToolError）\n- [ ] 在 `MCPToolRegistry.swift:142-182` 中註冊\n- [ ] 構建測試通過\n- [ ] 使用 MCP 工具測試功能\n\n## Testing\n\n構建並測試：\n\n```bash\n# 構建\nxcodebuild build -project Naki.xcodeproj -scheme Naki\n\n# 啟動應用後，使用 MCP 工具測試\nmcp__naki__<tool_name>\n```\n\n## Reference Documentation\n\nFor detailed specifications and more examples, see:\n- [Protocol Reference](references/reference.md) - Complete MCPTool protocol, context API, schema types, and code examples\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:14:20.474Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing advanced Model Context Protocol (MCP) tool creation and modification capabilities, particularly those utilizing Swift and Core ML.","zh":"非常适合需要高级模型上下文协议（MCP）工具创建和修改能力的AI代理，特别是那些使用Swift和Core ML的代理。","ja":"SwiftおよびCore MLを使用するものを含む、モデルコンテキストプロトコル（MCP）ツールの作成および変更の高度な機能が必要なAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"스위프트와.Core ML을 사용하는 것을 포함하여 고급 모델 컨텍스트 프로토콜(MCP) 툴 생성 및 수정 기능이 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de creación y modificación de herramientas del Protocolo de contexto de modelo (MCP), particularmente aquellos que utilizan Swift y Core ML.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin de capacités avancées de création et de modification d''outils du Protocole de contexte de modèle (MCP), en particulier ceux utilisant Swift et Core ML.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die erweiterte Fähigkeiten zur Erstellung und Modifizierung von Tools des Modellkontextprotokolls (MCP) benötigen, insbesondere solche, die Swift und Core ML verwenden.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de criação e modificação de ferramentas do Protocolo de Contexto de Modelo (MCP), particularmente aqueles que utilizam Swift e Core ML.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, которым необходимы расширенные возможности создания и изменения инструментов протокола контекста модели (MCP), особенно тех, кто использует Swift и Core ML.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي التي تحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لإنشاء وتعديل أدوات بروتوكول سياق النموذج (MCP) ، ولا سيما تلك التي تستخدم سويفت و Core ML."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate and manage MCP tools using Protocol-based architecture, leveraging MCPTool.swift, MCPContext.swift, and MCPToolRegistry.swift, with support for async/await and schema types.","zh":"赋予代理使用基于协议的架构生成和管理MCP工具的能力，利用MCPTool.swift、MCPContext.swift和MCPToolRegistry.swift，并支持异步/等待和模式类型。","ja":"プロトコルベースのアーキテクチャを使用して、MCPTool.swift、MCPContext.swift、MCPToolRegistry.swiftを利用し、非同期/待機およびスキーマタイプをサポートして、MCPツールの生成および管理が代理に可能になります。","ko":"프로토콜 기반 아키텍처를 사용하여 MCPTool.swift, MCPContext.swift 및 MCPToolRegistry.swift를 활용하고 비동기/대기 및 스키마 유형을 지원하여 에이전트가 MCP 툴을 생성 및 관리할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar y administrar herramientas MCP utilizando una arquitectura basada en protocolos, aprovechando MCPTool.swift, MCPContext.swift y MCPToolRegistry.swift, con soporte para async/await y tipos de esquema.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer et de gérer des outils MCP en utilisant une architecture basée sur les protocoles, en exploitant MCPTool.swift, MCPContext.swift et MCPToolRegistry.swift, avec une prise en charge de async/await et des types de schéma.","de":"Ermöglich es den Agenten, MCP-Tools mit einer protokollbasierten Architektur zu generieren und zu verwalten, indem sie MCPTool.swift, MCPContext.swift und MCPToolRegistry.swift nutzen, mit Unterstützung für async/await und Schematypen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar e gerenciar ferramentas MCP usando arquitetura baseada em protocolo, aproveitando MCPTool.swift, MCPContext.swift e MCPToolRegistry.swift, com suporte para async/await e tipos de esquema.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность создавать и управлять инструментами MCP с помощью архитектуры на основе протокола, используя MCPTool.swift, MCPContext.swift и MCPToolRegistry.swift, с поддержкой async/await и типов схемы.","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من إنشاء أدوات MCP وإدارتها باستخدام هندسة قائم على البروتوكول، واستخدام MCPTool.swift و MCPContext.swift و MCPToolRegistry.swift ، مع دعم async/await وأنواع مخطط."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating custom MCP tools for the Naki project","Modifying existing MCP tools to adapt to new project requirements","Debugging MCP tool integrations using the /naki-mcp-proxy skill"],"zh":["为Naki项目创建自定义MCP工具","修改现有的MCP工具以适应新项目的要求","使用/naki-mcp-proxy技能调试MCP工具集成"],"ja":["Nakiプロジェクト用のカスタムMCPツールを作成する","新しいプロジェクト要件に適応するために既存のMCPツールを変更する","/naki-mcp-proxyスキルを使用してMCPツールの統合をデバッグする"],"ko":["나키 프로젝트를 위한 사용자 지정 MCP 툴을 생성하는 것","새로운 프로젝트 요구 사항에 맞게 기존의 MCP 툴을 수정하는 것","/naki-mcp-proxy 스킬을 사용하여 MCP 툴 통합을 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Creación de herramientas personalizadas MCP para el proyecto Naki","Modificación de herramientas MCP existentes para adaptarse a los nuevos requisitos del proyecto","Depuración de integraciones de herramientas MCP utilizando la habilidad /naki-mcp-proxy"],"fr":["Création d''outils MCP personnalisés pour le projet Naki","Modification d''outils MCP existants pour s''adapter aux nouveaux besoins du projet","Débogage des intégrations d''outils MCP en utilisant la compétence /naki-mcp-proxy"],"de":["Erstellung benutzerdefinierter MCP-Tools für das Naki-Projekt","Modifizierung bestehender MCP-Tools, um sich an neue Projektanforderungen anzupassen","Fehlerbehebung bei der Integration von MCP-Tools mithilfe der Fähigkeit /naki-mcp-proxy"],"pt":["Criar ferramentas MCP personalizadas para o projeto Naki","Modificar ferramentas MCP existentes para se adaptar a novos requisitos do projeto","Depurar integrações de ferramentas MCP usando a habilidade /naki-mcp-proxy"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских инструментов MCP для проекта Naki","Модификация существующих инструментов MCP для адаптации к новым требованиям проекта","Отладка интеграций инструментов MCP с помощью навыка /naki-mcp-proxy"],"ar":["إنشاء أدوات MCP مخصصة لمشروع Naki","تعديل أدوات MCP الحالية لتكيفها مع متطلبات المشروع الجديدة","تصحيح أخطاء تكام