es problèmes spécifiques pour améliorer l''expérience de jeu","de":"Das Debuggen von GridRacer beinhaltet die Untersuchung und Diagnose spezifischer Probleme, um die Spielereahrung zu verbessern","pt":"Depure o GridRacer com nossa solução de problemas. Reproduza erros, colete contexto e resolva problemas.","ru":"Отладите GridRacer с нашей помощью. Повторите ошибки, соберите контекст и решите проблемы.","ar":"اكتشف كيفية تصحيح أخطاء GridRacer. اكرر الأخطاء، اجمع السياق وحل المشكلات.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["使用命令行工具重现问题","捕获和分析控制台日志","收集代码上下文","分析Swift代码","检查Git更改"],"ja":["コンソールログを使用して問題を再現","問題をキャプチャして分析","コードのコンテキストを収集","Swiftコードを分析","Gitの変更を確認"],"ko":["콘솔 로그를 사용하여 문제 재현","문제 캡처 및 분석","코드 컨텍스트 수집","Swift 코드 분석","Git 변경 확인"],"es":["Reproducción y captura de errores","Búsqueda de código relacionado","Lectura de archivos Swift relevantes","Verificación de cambios recientes en Git"],"fr":["Reproduction et capture des erreurs","Recherche de code lié","Lecture de fichiers Swift pertinents","Vérification des changements récents dans Git"],"de":["Reproduktion und Erfassung von Fehlern","Suche nach verwandtem Code","Lesen von relevanten Swift-Dateien","Überprüfung von aktuellen Änderungen in Git"],"pt":["Reproduzir erros","Capturar logs de console","Coletar contexto","Analisar código","Verificar alterações recentes no Git"],"ru":["Повторить ошибки","Захватить консольные журналы","Собрать контекст","Анализировать код","Проверить недавние изменения в Git"],"ar":["تكرار الأخطاء","اكتساب سجلات المحفوظات","اجماع السياق","تحليل الشفرة","التحقق من التغييرات الأخيرة في Git"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GridRacer调试","命令行工具","代码审查","Swift开发","iOS开发","问题重现","控制台日志"],"ja":["GridRacerデバッグ","コンソールログ","コードレビュー","Swift開発","iOS開発","問題再現","Git"],"ko":["GridRacer 디버깅","콘솔 로그","코드 리뷰","Swift 개발","iOS 개발","문제 재현","Git"],"es":["depurar GridRacer","solución de problemas","diagnóstico de errores","desarrollo de juegos","Swift","Git"],"fr":["débogage GridRacer","résolution de problèmes","diagnostic d''erreurs","développement de jeux","Swift","Git"],"de":["Debuggen von GridRacer","Fehlerbehebung","Fehlerdiagnose","Spielentwicklung","Swift","Git"],"pt":["depuração","debug","GridRacer","erro","problema","solução de problemas","desenvolvimento de aplicativos","Swift","Git"],"ru":["отладка","debug","GridRacer","ошибка","проблема","решение проблем","разработка приложений","Swift","Git"],"ar":["التصحيح","debug","GridRacer","خطأ","مشكلة","حل المشكلات","تطوير التطبيقات","Swift","Git"]}},"owner":"Pjpj42","repo":"GridRacer","repoPath":"Pjpj42/GridRacer","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.431Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"debug","description":"Debug a specific issue by reading logs and investigating code","bodyPreview":"# Debug GridRacer Issue\n\nInvestigate and diagnose a specific problem.\n\n## Arguments\n`$ARGUMENTS` - Description of the issue to debug\n\n## Steps\n\n### 1. Reproduce and Capture\n```bash\n# Launch with console logging\nxcrun simctl launch --console booted trouarat.GridRacer 2>&1 | head -100\n```\n\nOr take a screenshot to see current state:\n- Use `mcp__automation__screenshot` to capture the game\n\n### 2. Gather Context\n- Search codebase for related code\n- Read relevant Swift files\n- Check recent git changes","body":"# Debug GridRacer Issue\n\nInvestigate and diagnose a specific problem.\n\n## Arguments\n`$ARGUMENTS` - Description of the issue to debug\n\n## Steps\n\n### 1. Reproduce and Capture\n```bash\n# Launch with console logging\nxcrun simctl launch --console booted trouarat.GridRacer 2>&1 | head -100\n```\n\nOr take a screenshot to see current state:\n- Use `mcp__automation__screenshot` to capture the game\n\n### 2. Gather Context\n- Search codebase for related code\n- Read relevant Swift files\n- Check recent git changes: `git log --oneline -10`\n\n### 3. Form Hypothesis\nBased on:\n- Error messages in console\n- Visual state in screenshot\n- Code analysis\n\n### 4. Verify\n- Add print statements or breakpoints conceptually\n- Trace execution path\n- Check edge cases\n\n### 5. Report\nProvide:\n- **Root cause**: Why the bug occurs\n- **Location**: File and line number\n- **Fix**: Specific code change needed\n- **Verification**: How to confirm the fix works\n\n### 6. Create Issue (Optional)\n\nAfter completing investigation, offer:\n\n```\n🐛 Investigation Complete\n\nRoot Cause: [Identified cause]\nLocation: [File:line]\nSuggested Fix: [Proposed solution]\n\nCreate GitHub issue to track this bug? [Y/n]\n```\n\nIf yes:\n```bash\ngh issue create \\\n  --title \"BUG: [Short summary from investigation]\" \\\n  --template bug_report.md \\\n  --label \"bug\" \\\n  --body \"$(cat <<''EOF''\n## Bug Analysis\n\n**Root Cause**: [Identified cause from investigation]\n\n**Location**: [File path and line number]\n\n**Steps to Reproduce**:\n1. [Step 1 from debugging]\n2. [Step 2]\n\n**Expected**: [What should happen]\n**Actual**: [What happens]\n\n**Suggested Fix**:\n[Proposed solution with code snippet if applicable]\n\n**Related Files**:\n- `[file path]:[line]`\n\n**Discovered via**: /debug skill\n\n---\n[Additional context from investigation]\nEOF\n)\"\n```\n\nOutput: \"✓ Issue #N created. Start work with: /work-on N\"\n\n**Component Label Auto-Detection**:\nBased on investigation findings, add relevant labels:\n- Collision issues → add `collision-detection`\n- SceneKit issues → add `scenekit`\n- Game logic issues → add `game-logic`\n- UI issues → add `ui`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:14:34.816Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced AI Agents like AutoGPT and LangChain requiring in-depth issue analysis and troubleshooting capabilities.","zh":"适合于像 AutoGPT 和 LangChain 这样的高级 AI 代理，需要进行深入的issue分析和故障排除能力。","ja":"AutoGPT や LangChain などの高度な AI エージェントに適しており、問題の詳細な分析とトラブルシューティング機能が必要です。","ko":"AutoGPT와 LangChain 같은 고급 AI 에이전트에 적합하며, 심층적인 이슈 분석 및 문제 해결 기능이 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA avanzados como AutoGPT y LangChain que requieren un análisis y capacidad de depuración de problemas en profundidad.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA avancés comme AutoGPT et LangChain nécessitant une analyse approfondie des problèmes et des capacités de dépannage.","de":"Ideal für fortschrittliche KI-Agents wie AutoGPT und LangChain, die eine umfassende Analyse und Fehlersuche erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Avançados, como AutoGPT e LangChain, que exigem análise e capacidades de solução de problemas em profundidade.","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых агентов ИИ, таких как AutoGPT и LangChain, требующих глубокого анализа проблем и возможностей поиска неисправностей.","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المتقدم مثل AutoGPT و LangChain التي تتطلب تحليلًا متعمقًا وقدرات فحص الأخطاء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to diagnose specific problems using console logging, codebase searches, and git change analysis, leveraging tools like xcrun simctl and mcp__automation__screenshot for comprehensive issue reproduction and context gathering.","zh":"赋予代理使用控制台日志、代码库搜索和 git 变更分析来诊断特定问题的能力，利用 xcrun simctl 和 mcp__automation__screenshot 等工具进行全面问题复现和上下文收集。","ja":"エージェントがコンソールログ、コードベース検索、Git 変更分析を使用して特定の問題を診断する能力を提供し、xcrun simctl と mcp__automation__screenshot などのツールを使用して問題の再現とコンテキストの収集を総合的に行う。","ko":"에이전트가 콘솔 로그, 코드베이스 검색 및 Git 변경 분석을 사용하여 특정 문제를 진단할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, xcrun simctl 및 mcp__automation__screenshot 등의 도구를 사용하여 문제 재현 및 컨텍스트 수집을 종합적으로 수행합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes diagnosticar problemas específicos utilizando la grabación de consola, búsquedas en el código y análisis de cambios en git, aprovechando herramientas como xcrun simctl y mcp__automation__screenshot para una reproducción y recopilación de contexto de problemas completa.","fr":"Permet aux agents de diagnostiquer des problèmes spécifiques en utilisant la journalisation de la console, les recherches dans le codebase et l''analyse des modifications Git, en exploitant des outils comme xcrun simctl et mcp__automation__screenshot pour une reproduction et une collecte de contexte de problèmes complètes.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, bestimmte Probleme mithilfe von Konsolenprotokollen, Codebasesuchen und Git-Änderungsanalysen zu diagnostizieren, und nutzt Tools wie xcrun simctl und mcp__automation__screenshot für eine umfassende Reproduktion und Kontextsammlung von Problemen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a diagnosticar problemas específicos usando registro de console, pesquisas no código e análise de alterações do git, aproveitando ferramentas como xcrun simctl e mcp__automation__screenshot para reprodução e coleta de contexto de problemas abrangentes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью диагностировать конкретные проблемы с помощью журнала консоли, поиска в кодовой базе и анализа изменений git, используя инструменты như xcrun simctl и mcp__automation__screenshot для комплексной воспроизведения и сбора контекста проблем.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تشخيص مشاكل محددة باستخدام سجل المحطة وعمليات البحث في قاعدة الشفرة وتحليل التغييرات في جيت، مع الاستفادة من أدوات مثل xcrun simctl و mcp__automation__screenshot لتحقيق إعادة إنتاج مشاكل شاملة وجمع السياق."},"useCases":{"en":["Reproducing and capturing issues with console logging","Gathering context through codebase searches and git change analysis","Debugging GridRacer issues using xcrun simctl and screenshot captures"],"zh":["使用控制台日志复现和捕获问题","通过代码库搜索和 git 变更分析收集上下文","使用 xcrun simctl 和截图捕获调试 GridRacer 问题"],"ja":["コンソールログを使用して問題を再現してキャプチャする","コードベース検索と Git 変更分析を使用してコンテキストを収集する","xcrun simctl とスクリーンショットを使用して GridRacer の問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["콘솔 로그를 사용하여 문제를 재현하고 캡처하는 것","코드베이스 검색 및 Git 변경 분석을 사용하여 컨텍스트를 수집하는 것","xcrun simctl 및 스크린샷을 사용하여 GridRacer 문제를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Reproducir y capturar problemas con grabación de consola","Recopilar contexto a través de búsquedas en el código y análisis de cambios en git","Depurar problemas de GridRacer utilizando xcrun simctl y capturas de pantalla"],"fr":["Reproduire et capturer des problèmes avec la journalisation de la console","Recueillir le contexte à travers des recherches dans le codebase et l''analyse des modifications Git","Dépanner les problèmes de GridRacer en utilisant xcrun simctl et des captures d''écran"],"de":["Probleme mit Konsolenprotokollen reproduzieren und erfassen","Kontext durch Codebasesuchen und Git-Änderungsanalyse sammeln","GridRacer-Probleme mithilfe von xcrun simctl und Screenshot-Erfassung debuggen"],"pt":["Reproduzir e capturar problemas com registro de console","Coletar contexto por meio de pesquisas no código e análise de alterações do git","Depurar problemas do GridRacer usando xcrun simctl e capturas de tela"],"ru":["Воспроизводить и фиксировать проблемы с помощью журнала консоли","Собирать контекст посредством поиска в кодовой базе и анализа изменений git","Отлаживать проблемы GridRacer с помощью xcrun simctl и захвата экрана"],"ar":["إعادة إنتاج المشاكل وتصويرها باستخدام سجل المحطة","جمع السياق من خلال عمليات البحث في قاعدة الشفرة وتحليل التغييرات في جيت","فحص أخطاء GridRacer باستخدام xcrun simctl وتصوير الشاشة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to console logs and codebase","Limited to GridRacer issue debugging","Dependent on xcrun simctl and mcp__automation__screenshot tools"],"zh":["需要访问控制台日志和代码库","仅限于 GridRacer 问题调试","依赖于 xcrun simctl 和 mcp__automation__screenshot 工具"],"ja":["コンソールログとコードベースへのアクセスが必要","GridRacer の問題のデバッグのみに限定される","xcrun simctl と mcp__automation__screenshot ツールに依存する"],"ko":["콘솔 로그 및 코드베이스에 대한 액세스가 필요함","GridRacer 문제 디버깅에만限定됨","xcrun simctl 및 mcp__automation__screenshot 도구에 의존함"],"es":["Requiere acceso a registros de consola y código","Limitado a la depuración de problemas de GridRacer","Dependiente de las herramientas xcrun simctl y mcp__automation__screenshot"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux journaux de la console et au codebase","Limité au dépannage des problèmes de GridRacer","Dépendant des outils xcrun simctl et mcp__automation__screenshot"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf Konsolenprotokolle und Codebase","Befindet sich auf die Fehlersuche von GridRacer-Problemen","Abhängig von den Tools xcrun simctl und mcp__automation__screenshot"],"pt":["Exige acesso a registros de console e código","Limitado à depuração de problemas do GridRacer","Dependente das ferramentas xcrun simctl e mcp__automation__screenshot"],"ru":["Требует доступа к журналам консоли и кодовой базе","Ограничен отладкой проблем GridRacer","Зависит от инструментов xcrun simctl и mcp__automation__screenshot"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى سجلات المحطة وقاعدة الشفرة","محدود بفحص أخطاء GridRacer","يعتمد على أدوات xcrun simctl و mcp__automation__screenshot"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
