","es":"La interfaz de notificación UI proporciona una interfaz visual para mostrar notificaciones, incluyendo un icono de campana con insignia y un panel de notific...","fr":"L''interface de notification UI fournit une interface visuelle pour afficher les notifications, y compris un icône de cloche avec badge et un panneau de notif...","de":"Die Benachrichtigungs-UI bietet eine visuelle Oberfläche zum Anzeigen von Benachrichtigungen, einschließlich eines Glocken-Symbols mit Abzeichen und einem in...","pt":"O skill de notificação UI fornece uma interface visual para exibir notificações, incluindo ícone de sino com badge e painel de notificações interativo.","ru":"Навык уведомлений UI предоставляет визуальный интерфейс для отображения уведомлений, включая значок колокольчика с бейджем и интерактивную панель уведомлений.","ar":"مهارة الإشعارات UI توفر واجهة مرئية لتعرض الإشعارات، بما في ذلك رمز الجرس مع شارة ولوحة إشعارات تفاعلية.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["bell","badge","animated indicators","notification panel","unread notification count","animated new notification arrivals"],"ja":["","","","","",""],"ko":["","","","","",""],"es":["Icono de campana con insignia","Panel de notificación interactivo","Indicadores animados","Compatibilidad con la renderización de la cabecera de la aplicación","Compatibilidad con la interacción del usuario con las notificaciones"],"fr":["Icône de cloche avec badge","Panneau de notification interactif","Indicateurs animés","Compatibilité avec la mise en page de l''en-tête de l''application","Compatibilité avec l''interaction de l''utilisateur avec les notifications"],"de":["Glocken-Symbol mit Abzeichen","Interaktives Benachrichtigungs-Panel","Animierte Indikatoren","Kompatibilität mit der Renderung der Anwendungskopfzeile","Kompatibilität mit der Benutzerinteraktion mit Benachrichtigungen"],"pt":["Ícone de sino com badge","Painel de notificações interativo","Indicadores animados","Contagem de notificações não lidas","Animação de chegada de novas notificações","Interação com notificações"],"ru":["Значок колокольчика с бейджем","Интерактивная панель уведомлений","Анимированные индикаторы","Счетчик непрочитанных уведомлений","Анимация прибытия новых уведомлений","Взаимодействие с уведомлениями"],"ar":["رمز الجرس مع شارة","لوحة إشعارات تفاعلية","مؤشرات متحركة","عرض عدد الإشعارات غير المقروءة","تffect الإشعارات الجديدة","التفاعل مع الإشعارات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["notification UI","bell icon","badge","animated indicators","notification panel","unread notification count","animated new notification arrivals","interactive notification panel"],"ja":["Notification UI","","","","","","",""],"ko":["Notification UI","","","","","","",""],"es":["interfaz de notificación UI","notificaciones en aplicaciones","experiencia del usuario","desarrollo de aplicaciones","diseño de interfaz de usuario","notificación push"],"fr":["interface de notification UI","notifications dans les applications","expérience utilisateur","développement d''applications","conception d''interface utilisateur","notification push"],"de":["Benachrichtigungs-UI","Benachrichtigungen in Anwendungen","Benutzererfahrung","Anwendungsentwicklung","Benutzeroberflächendesign","Push-Benachrichtigung"],"pt":["interface de notificação","notificação ui","desenvolvimento de interface","notificações interativas","ícone de sino","painel de notificações","animação de notificações","contagem de notificações"],"ru":["интерфейс уведомлений","уведомления ui","разработка интерфейса","интерактивные уведомления","значок колокольчика","панель уведомлений","анимация уведомлений","счетчик уведомлений"],"ar":["واجهة الإشعارات","إشعارات ui","تطوير واجهة","إشعارات تفاعلية","رمز الجرس","لوحة الإشعارات","تأثير الإشعارات","عرض عدد الإشعارات"]}},"owner":"Syedaashnaghazanfar","repo":"todo-app","repoPath":"Syedaashnaghazanfar/todo-app","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.431Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"notification-ui","description":"Renders notification bell icon with unread count badge, pulse animations for new notifications, and dropdown panel (320px × max 400px) displaying notification items with purple theme for VERY IMPORTANT tasks. Includes mark-as-read interaction and empty state handling.","bodyPreview":"# Notification UI Skill\n\n## Overview\n\nThe notification UI skill provides the visual interface for displaying notifications, including a bell icon with badge, animated indicators, and an interactive notification panel.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nApply this skill:\n- When rendering the app header (bell icon)\n- When displaying unread notification count\n- When showing notification panel/dropdown\n- When animating new notification arrivals\n- When user interacts with notifications (click to mark as read)\n- When","body":"# Notification UI Skill\n\n## Overview\n\nThe notification UI skill provides the visual interface for displaying notifications, including a bell icon with badge, animated indicators, and an interactive notification panel.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nApply this skill:\n- When rendering the app header (bell icon)\n- When displaying unread notification count\n- When showing notification panel/dropdown\n- When animating new notification arrivals\n- When user interacts with notifications (click to mark as read)\n- When displaying empty state (no notifications)\n\n## Bell Icon Specifications\n\n### Icon Size and Position\n\n- **Size**: 24px × 24px\n- **Position**: Top-right header\n- **Color**: Default #374151 (gray), hover #1F2937 (dark gray)\n\n```jsx\nfunction BellIcon({ unreadCount, onClick }) {\n  return (\n    <button\n      className=\"bell-icon-button\"\n      onClick={onClick}\n      aria-label={`Notifications (${unreadCount} unread)`}\n    >\n      <svg\n        width=\"24\"\n        height=\"24\"\n        viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n        fill=\"none\"\n        xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"\n        className=\"bell-icon\"\n      >\n        <path\n          d=\"M15 17H20L18.5951 15.5951C18.2141 15.2141 18 14.6973 18 14.1585V11C18 8.38757 16.3304 6.16509 14 5.34142V5C14 3.89543 13.1046 3 12 3C10.8954 3 10 3.89543 10 5V5.34142C7.66962 6.16509 6 8.38757 6 11V14.1585C6 14.6973 5.78595 15.2141 5.40493 15.5951L4 17H9M15 17V18C15 19.6569 13.6569 21 12 21C10.3431 21 9 19.6569 9 18V17M15 17H9\"\n          stroke=\"currentColor\"\n          strokeWidth=\"2\"\n          strokeLinecap=\"round\"\n          strokeLinejoin=\"round\"\n        />\n      </svg>\n      {unreadCount > 0 && (\n        <span className=\"badge\">{unreadCount > 99 ? ''99+'' : unreadCount}</span>\n      )}\n    </button>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Bell Icon Styling\n\n```css\n.bell-icon-button {\n  position: relative;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  padding: 8px;\n  background: transparent;\n  border: none;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  transition: background-color 0.2s ease;\n}\n\n.bell-icon-button:hover {\n  background-color: #F3F4F6;\n}\n\n.bell-icon {\n  color: #374151;\n  transition: color 0.2s ease;\n}\n\n.bell-icon-button:hover .bell-icon {\n  color: #1F2937;\n}\n```\n\n## Unread Count Badge\n\n### Badge Specifications\n\n- **Shape**: Circular\n- **Background**: #DC2626 (red)\n- **Text**: White (#FFFFFF)\n- **Display**: Count up to 99, then \"99+\"\n- **Position**: Top-right corner of bell icon\n\n```css\n.badge {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 4px;\n  right: 4px;\n  min-width: 18px;\n  height: 18px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background-color: #DC2626; /* Red */\n  color: #FFFFFF; /* White */\n  font-size: 10px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  padding: 0 4px;\n  box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);\n}\n```\n\n### Badge Display Logic\n\n```javascript\nfunction getBadgeText(count) {\n  if (count === 0) return null; // No badge\n  if (count > 99) return ''99+'';\n  return count.toString();\n}\n```\n\n## Pulse Animation\n\n### Animation Specifications\n\n- **Duration**: 2 seconds\n- **Effect**: Purple glow (#8B5CF6)\n- **Trigger**: On new notification arrival\n- **Iterations**: 3 times, then stop\n\n```css\n@keyframes pulse {\n  0%, 100% {\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.7);\n  }\n  50% {\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 8px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0);\n  }\n}\n\n.bell-icon-button.pulsing {\n  animation: pulse 2s ease-in-out 3;\n}\n```\n\n### Animation Trigger\n\n```jsx\nfunction NotificationBell({ notifications }) {\n  const [isPulsing, setIsPulsing] = useState(false);\n  const prevCountRef = useRef(notifications.length);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    // Detect new notification\n    if (notifications.length > prevCountRef.current) {\n      setIsPulsing(true);\n\n      // Stop animation after 6 seconds (3 iterations × 2s)\n      setTimeout(() => setIsPulsing(false), 6000);\n    }\n\n    prevCountRef.current = notifications.length;\n  }, [notifications.length]);\n\n  return (\n    <BellIcon\n      className={isPulsing ? ''pulsing'' : ''''}\n      unreadCount={notifications.filter(n => !n.read).length}\n    />\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Notification Dropdown Panel\n\n### Panel Specifications\n\n- **Width**: 320px\n- **Max Height**: 400px\n- **Scrollable**: Yes (overflow-y: auto)\n- **Position**: Dropdown below bell icon\n- **Elevation**: Shadow for depth\n\n```css\n.notification-dropdown {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: calc(100% + 8px);\n  right: 0;\n  width: 320px;\n  max-height: 400px;\n  overflow-y: auto;\n  background-color: #FFFFFF;\n  border: 1px solid #E5E7EB;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  box-shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1),\n              0 4px 6px -2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\n  z-index: 1000;\n}\n\n.notification-dropdown-header {\n  padding: 16px;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid #E5E7EB;\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: center;\n}\n\n.notification-dropdown-title {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: #111827;\n}\n\n.mark-all-read {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  color: #8B5CF6;\n  background: none;\n  border: none;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.mark-all-read:hover {\n  color: #7C3AED;\n  text-decoration: underline;\n}\n```\n\n## Notification Item Styling\n\n### Item Specifications\n\n- **Padding**: 16px\n- **Border**: Bottom separator (1px solid #F3F4F6)\n- **Hover**: Background change to #F9FAFB\n- **Purple Theme**: VERY IMPORTANT notifications use #8B5CF6 accent\n\n```css\n.notification-item {\n  padding: 16px;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid #F3F4F6;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background-color 0.15s ease;\n}\n\n.notification-item:hover {\n  background-color: #F9FAFB;\n}\n\n.notification-item:last-child {\n  border-bottom: none;\n}\n\n.notification-item.unread {\n  background-color: #FAF5FF; /* Very light purple */\n}\n\n.notification-item.unread:hover {\n  background-color: #F3E8FF; /* Light purple */\n}\n\n.notification-content {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 6px;\n}\n\n.notification-header {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: flex-start;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.notification-priority-indicator {\n  width: 6px;\n  height: 6px;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  background-color: #8B5CF6; /* Purple for VERY IMPORTANT */\n  margin-top: 6px;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n.notification-message {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  color: #374151;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n  flex: 1;\n}\n\n.notification-item.unread .notification-message {\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: #111827;\n}\n\n.notification-time {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  color: #9CA3AF;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 4px;\n}\n\n.unread-dot {\n  width: 8px;\n  height: 8px;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  background-color: #8B5CF6; /* Purple */\n}\n```\n\n## Complete Notification Item Component\n\n```jsx\nfunction NotificationItem({ notification, onMarkAsRead }) {\n  const handleClick = () => {\n    if (!notification.read) {\n      onMarkAsRead(notification.id);\n    }\n  };\n\n  const relativeTime = formatRelativeTime(notification.timestamp);\n\n  return (\n    <div\n      className={`notification-item ${notification.read ? '''' : ''unread''}`}\n      onClick={handleClick}\n    >\n      <div className=\"notification-content\">\n        <div className=\"notification-header\">\n          <div className=\"notification-priority-indicator\" />\n          <p className=\"notification-message\">{notification.message}</p>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"notification-time\">\n          {!notification.read && <span className=\"unread-dot\" />}\n          <span>{relativeTime}</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\nfunction formatRelativeTime(timestamp) {\n  const now = Date.now();\n  const diff = now - timestamp;\n  const minutes = Math.floor(diff / (1000 * 60));\n  const hours = Math.floor(diff / (1000 * 60 * 60));\n  const days = Math.floor(diff / (1000 * 60 * 60 * 24));\n\n  if (minutes < 1) return ''Just now'';\n  if (minutes < 60) return `${minutes}m ago`;\n  if (hours < 24) return `${hours}h ago`;\n  return `${days}d ago`;\n}\n```\n\n## Mark-as-Read Interaction\n\n### Click to Mark Read\n\nClicking an unread notification marks it as read:\n\n```jsx\nfunction handleNotificationClick(notification) {\n  if (!notification.read) {\n    // Mark as read\n    notificationPersistence.markAsRead(notification.id);\n\n    // Update UI state\n    setNotifications(notificationPersistence.getAll());\n    setUnreadCount(notificationPersistence.getUnreadCount());\n\n    // Optional: Navigate to task\n    navigateToTask(notification.taskId);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Visual Feedback\n\n```jsx\nfunction NotificationItem({ notification, onMarkAsRead }) {\n  const [isMarking, setIsMarking] = useState(false);\n\n  const handleClick = async () => {\n    if (!notification.read && !isMarking) {\n      setIsMarking(true);\n      await onMarkAsRead(notification.id);\n      setIsMarking(false);\n    }\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <div\n      className={`notification-item ${notification.read ? '''' : ''unread''} ${isMarking ? ''marking'' : ''''}`}\n      onClick={handleClick}\n    >\n      {/* ... */}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Empty State\n\n### Empty State Component\n\n```jsx\nfunction EmptyState() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"notification-empty-state\">\n      <div className=\"empty-icon\">🔔</div>\n      <p className=\"empty-title\">No notifications</p>\n      <p className=\"empty-description\">\n        You''re all caught up! Notifications for VERY IMPORTANT tasks will appear here.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Empty State Styling\n\n```css\n.notification-empty-state {\n  padding: 48px 24px;\n  text-align: center;\n  color: #6B7280;\n}\n\n.empty-icon {\n  font-size: 48px;\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n  opacity: 0.4;\n}\n\n.empty-title {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: #374151;\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n}\n\n.empty-description {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  color: #9CA3AF;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n}\n```\n\n## Complete Notification System\n\n```jsx\nfunction NotificationSystem() {\n  const [isOpen, setIsOpen] = useState(false);\n  const [notifications, setNotifications] = useState([]);\n  const [unreadCount, setUnreadCount] = useState(0);\n  const dropdownRef = useRef(null);\n\n  // Load notifications\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const loaded = notificationPersistence.getAll();\n    setNotifications(loaded);\n    setUnreadCount(notificationPersistence.getUnreadCount());\n  }, []);\n\n  // Close dropdown when clicking outside\n  useEffect(() => {\n    function handleClickOutside(event) {\n      if (dropdownRef.current && !dropdownRef.current.contains(event.target)) {\n        setIsOpen(false);\n      }\n    }\n\n    document.addEventListener(''mousedown'', handleClickOutside);\n    return () => document.removeEventListener(''mousedown'', handleClickOutside);\n  }, []);\n\n  const handleMarkAsRead = (id) => {\n    notificationPersistence.markAsRead(id);\n    setNotifications(notificationPersistence.getAll());\n    setUnreadCount(notificationPersistence.getUnreadCount());\n  };\n\n  const handleMarkAllAsRead = () => {\n    notificationPersistence.markAllAsRead();\n    setNotifications(notificationPersistence.getAll());\n    setUnreadCount(0);\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"notification-system\" ref={dropdownRef}>\n      <NotificationBell\n        unreadCount={unreadCount}\n        onClick={() => setIsOpen(!isOpen)}\n        notifications={notifications}\n      />\n\n      {isOpen && (\n        <div className=\"notification-dropdown\">\n          <div className=\"notification-dropdown-header\">\n            <h3 className=\"notification-dropdown-title\">Notifications</h3>\n            {unreadCount > 0 && (\n              <button className=\"mark-all-read\" onClick={handleMarkAllAsRead}>\n                Mark all as read\n              </button>\n            )}\n          </div>\n\n          {notifications.length === 0 ? (\n            <EmptyState />\n          ) : (\n            <div className=\"notification-list\">\n              {notifications.map(notification => (\n                <NotificationItem\n                  key={notification.id}\n                  notification={notification}\n                  onMarkAsRead={handleMarkAsRead}\n                />\n              ))}\n            </div>\n          )}\n        </div>\n      )}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Responsive Behavior\n\n### Mobile Adjustments\n\n```css\n@media (max-width: 640px) {\n  .notification-dropdown {\n    position: fixed;\n    top: 0;\n    left: 0;\n    right: 0;\n    bottom: 0;\n    width: 100%;\n    max-height: 100%;\n    border-radius: 0;\n  }\n\n  .notification-dropdown-header {\n    position: sticky;\n    top: 0;\n    background-color: #FFFFFF;\n    z-index: 1;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Integration Points\n\nThis skill integrates with:\n- **Notification Persistence Skill**: Reads notification data\n- **Notification Trigger Skill**: Displays triggered notifications\n- **Priority Classification Skill**: Uses purple theme for VERY IMPORTANT\n- **Notification Experience Agent**: Coordinates UI interactions\n\n## Accessibility\n\n- Bell icon button has aria-label with unread count\n- Keyboard navigation supported (Enter/Space to open/close)\n- Focus management in dropdown\n- Screen reader announcements for new notifications\n- Sufficient color contrast ratios (WCAG AA)\n\n## Performance Considerations\n\n- Dropdown renders only when open (conditional rendering)\n- Virtual scrolling for large notification lists (>50)\n- Debounced mark-as-read operations\n- Memoized components to prevent unnecessary re-renders\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:14:34.527Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing interactive notification display capabilities with animated indicators and bell icons.","zh":"非常适合需要交互式通知显示功能的前端代理，具有动画指示器和铃铛图标。","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントがインタラクティブな通知表示機能を必要とする場合に最適です。アニメーションインジケーターとベルアイコンが含まれます。","ko":"인터랙티브 알림 표시 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다. 애니메이션 인디케이터와 벨 아이콘을 지원합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades de visualización de notificaciones interactivas con indicadores animados y iconos de campana.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui nécessitent des capacités d''affichage de notifications interactives avec des indicateurs animés et des icônes de cloche.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die interaktive Benachrichtigungsanzeigefunktionen mit animierten Indikatoren und Glockensymbolen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades de exibição de notificações interativas com indicadores animados e ícones de sino.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым требуются возможности интерактивного отображения уведомлений с анимированными индикаторами и колокольчиками.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الأمامية الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات عرض الإشعارات التفاعلية مع المؤشرات المتحركة وأيقونات الجرس."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to display unread notification counts, render animated indicators, and provide interactive notification panels using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, with features like badge updates and click-to-mark-as-read functionality.","zh":"赋予代理显示未读通知数、渲染动画指示器和提供交互式通知面板的能力，使用HTML、CSS和JavaScript，并具有徽章更新和点击即可标记为已读的功能。","ja":"エージェントが未読通知数を表示したり、アニメーションインジケーターをレンダリングしたり、インタラクティブな通知パネルを提供したりする能力を提供します。HTML、CSS、JavaScriptを使用し、バッジの更新やクリックして既読にする機能などを備えています。","ko":"에이전트가 읽지 않은 알림 수를 표시하거나 애니메이션 인디케이터를 렌더링하거나 인터랙티브 알림 패널을 제공할 수 있는 기능을 제공합니다. HTML, CSS, 자바스크립트를 사용하며 배지 업데이트 및 클릭하여 읽음 표시와 같은 기능을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a mostrar cuentas de notificaciones no leídas, renderizar indicadores animados y proporcionar paneles de notificaciones interactivos utilizando HTML, CSS y JavaScript, con características como actualizaciones de insignias y funcionalidad de clic para marcar como leído.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''afficher des comptes de notifications non lus, de rendre des indicateurs animés et de fournir des panneaux de notifications interactifs en utilisant HTML, CSS et JavaScript, avec des fonctionnalités comme des mises à jour de badges et une fonctionnalité de clic pour marquer comme lu.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, ungelesene Benachrichtigungsanzahlen anzuzeigen, animierte Indikatoren zu rendern und interaktive Benachrichtigungspanels bereitzustellen, indem HTML, CSS und JavaScript verwendet werden, mit Funktionen wie Abzeichen-Aktualisierungen und Klick-zum-Kennzeichnen-als-gelesen-Funktion.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a exibir contagens de notificações não lidas, renderizar indicadores animados e fornecer painéis de notificação interativos usando HTML, CSS e JavaScript, com recursos como atualizações de emblemas e funcionalidade de clicar para marcar como lido.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью отображать счетчики непрочитанных уведомлений, рендерить анимированные индикаторы и предоставлять интерактивные панели уведомлений с помощью HTML, CSS и JavaScript, с функциями, такими как обновление значков и возможность клика для пометки как прочитанного.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على عرض числа الإشعارات غير المقروءة، وتصيير المؤشرات المتحركة، وتوفير لوحات الإشعارات التفاعلية باستخدام HTML و CSS و JavaScript، مع ميزات مثل تحديث الشعارات ووظيفة النقر لتسجيلها كقروء."},"useCases":{"en":["Rendering app headers with dynamic bell icons","Displaying notification panels with animated arrivals","Updating unread notification counts in real-time"],"zh":["渲染具有动态铃铛图标的应用程序头部","显示具有动画到达的通知面板","实时更新未读通知数"],"ja":["動的ベルアイコンを持つアプリケーションヘッダーをレンダリングする","アニメーション到着を持つ通知パネルを表示する","未読通知数をリアルタイムで更新する"],"ko":["동적 벨 아이콘을 갖는 애플리케이션 헤더 렌더링","애니메이션 도착을 갖는 알림 패널 표시","읽지 않은 알림 수 실시간 업데이트"],"es":["Renderizar encabezados de aplicaciones con iconos de campana dinámicos","Mostrar paneles de notificaciones con llegadas animadas","Actualizar cuentas de notificaciones no leídas en tiempo real"],"fr":["Render les en-têtes d''applications avec des icônes de cloche dynamiques","Afficher des panneaux de notifications avec des arrivées animées","Mettre à jour les comptes de notifications non lus en temps réel"],"de":["Rendern von App-Headern mit dynamischen Glockensymbolen","Anzeigen von Benachrichtigungs-Panelen mit animierten Ankünften","Aktualisieren von ungelesenen Benachrichtigungsanzahlen in Echtzeit"],"pt":["Renderização de cabeçalhos de aplicativos com ícones de sino dinâmicos","Exibição de painéis de notificação com chegadas animadas","Atualização de contagens de notificações não lidas em tempo real"],"ru":["Рендеринг заголовков приложений с динамическими колокольчиками","Отображение панелей уведомлений с анимированными прибытиями","Обновление счетчиков непрочитанных уведомлений в режиме реального времени"],"ar":["تجسيد رأسيات تطبيقات مع أيقونات جرس ديناميكية","عرض لوحات إشعارات مع وصول متحرك","تحديث عدد الإشعارات غير المقروءة في الوقت الفعلي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires client-side rendering capability","Limited to web-based applications"],"zh":["需要客户端渲染功能","仅限于基于Web的应用程序"],"ja":["クライアントサイドレンダリング機能が必要","Webベースのアプリケーションに限定される"],"ko":["클라이언트 측 렌더링 기능이 필요","웹 기반 애플리케이션에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere capacidad de renderizado en el lado del cliente","Limitado a aplicaciones basadas en web"],"fr":["Nécessite une capacité de rendu côté client","Limité aux applications basées sur le web"],"de":["Benötigt Client-seitige Renderfunktion","Begrenzt auf webbasierte Anwendungen"],"pt":["Requer capacidade de renderização do lado do cliente","Limitado a aplicações baseadas na web"],"ru":["Требует возможности рендеринга на стороне клиента","Ограничен веб-приложениями"],"ar":["يتطلب القدرة على تجسيد العميل","محدود بالتطبيقات المستندة إلى الويب"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('giolaq/Multi-TV-dev-power/tmdb-integration', 'community', 'giolaq', 'Multi-TV-dev-power', 'giolaq/Multi-TV-dev-power', 'tmdb-integration', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.431Z', '2026-02-18T05:14:36.782Z', NULL, '{"id":"giolaq/Multi-TV-dev-power/tmdb-integration","name":"tmdb-integration","description":{"zh":"该技能用于在React Native TV应用程序中集成The Movie Database（TMDB）API，实现数据获取和显示等功能","ja":"このスキルは、React Native TVアプリケーションでThe Movie Database（TMDB）APIを統合し、データの取得や表示などの機能を実現するために使用されます","ko":"이 스킬은 React Native TV 애플리케이션에서 The Movie Database（TMDB）API를 통합하여 데이터를 가져오고 표시하는 등의 기능을 구현하는 데 사용됩니다","es":"La integración TMDB permite a los desarrolladores obtener datos de películas y series de TV para sus aplicaciones React Native TV","fr":"L''intégration TMDB permet aux développeurs d''obtenir des données de films et de séries TV pour leurs applications React Native TV","de":"Die TMDB-Integration ermöglicht es Entwicklern, Filmdaten und Fernsehsendungen für ihre React Native TV-Anwendungen zu erhalten","pt":"Integração TMDB para React Native TV para obter dados de filmes e séries de TV. Aprenda a autenticar e otimizar a API","ru":"Интеграция TMDB для React Native TV для получения данных о фильмах и сериалах. Узнайте, как аутентифицировать и оптимизировать API","ar":"دمج TMDB لReact Native TV للحصول على بيانات الأفلام والمسلسلات. تعلم كيفية المصادقة وتحسين الأداء","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"TMDB集成技能 - React Native TV应用程序","ja":"TMDB統合スキル - React Native TVアプリケーション","ko":"TMDB 통합 스킬 - React Native TV 애플리케이션","es":"Integración TMDB para React Native TV","fr":"Intégration TMDB pour React Native TV","de":"TMDB-Integration für React Native TV","pt":"Integração TMDB para React Native TV","ru":"Интеграция TMDB для React Native TV","ar":"دمج TMDB لReact Native TV","en":"tmdb-integration"},"description":{"zh":"该技能用于在React Native TV应用程序中集成The Movie Database（TMDB）API，实现数据获取和显示等功能","ja":"このスキルは、React Native TVアプリケーションでThe Movie Database（TMDB）APIを統合し、データの取得や表示などの機能を実現するために使用されます","ko":"이 스킬은 React Native TV 애플리케이션에서 The Movie Database（TMDB）API를 통합하여 데이터를 가져오고 표시하는 등의 기능을 구현하는 데 사용됩니다","es":"La integración TMDB permite a los desarrolladores obtener datos de películas y series de TV para sus aplicaciones React Native TV","fr":"L''intégration TMDB permet aux développeurs d''obtenir des données de films et de séries TV pour leurs applications React Native TV","de":"Die TMDB-Integration ermöglicht es Entwicklern, Filmdaten und Fernsehsendungen für ihre React Native TV-Anwendungen zu erhalten","pt":"Integração TMDB para React Native TV para obter dados de filmes e séries de TV. Aprenda a autenticar e otimizar a API","ru":"Интеграция TMDB для React Native TV для получения данных о фильмах и сериалах. Узнайте, как аутентифицировать и оптимизировать API","ar":"دمج TMDB لReact Native TV للحصول على بيانات الأفلام والمسلسلات. تعلم كيفية المصادقة وتحسين الأداء","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["获取电影和电视节目数据","显示海报和背景图像","实现搜索功能","获取热门内容","获取视频预告片","TMDB身份验证和API密钥"],"ja":["映画やテレビ番組のデータを取得","ポスターと背景画像を表示","検索機能を実現","人気コンテンツを取得","ビデオトレーラーを取得","TMDBの認証とAPIキー"],"ko":["영화 및 TV 프로그램 데이터 가져오기","포스터 및 배경 이미지를 표시","검색 기능 구현","인기 콘텐츠 가져오기","비디오 예고편 가져오기","TMDB 인증 및 API 키"],"es":["Obtención de datos de películas y series de TV","Visualización de imágenes de carteles y fondos","Implementación de funcionalidad de búsqueda","Obtención de contenido de tendencias","Obtención de trailers de video","Autenticación TMDB y claves API"],"fr":["Obtention de données de films et de séries TV","Affichage d''images de posters et de fonds","Implémentation de la fonctionnalité de recherche","Obtention de contenu de tendances","Obtention de bandes-annonces de vidéo","Authentification TMDB et clés API"],"de":["Abruf von Filmdaten und Fernsehsendungen","Anzeige von Poster- und Hintergrundbildern","Implementierung der Suchfunktion","Abruf von Trend-Inhalten","Abruf von Video-Trailern","TMDB-Authentifizierung und API-Schlüssel"],"pt":["Autenticação TMDB","Obtenção de dados de filmes e séries de TV","Exibição de imagens de capa e fundo","Implementação de funcionalidade de busca","Obtenção de conteúdo em tendência","Otimização da API"],"ru":["Аутентификация TMDB","Получение данных о фильмах и сериалах","Отображение изображений постера и фона","Реализация функции поиска","Получение трендового контента","Оптимизация API"],"ar":["المصادقة TMDB","الحصول على بيانات الأفلام والمسلسلات","عرض صور الغلاف والخلفية","تنفيذ وظيفة البحث","الحصول على المحتوى الشائع","تحسين الأداء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["TMDB集成","React Native TV","电影数据","电视节目数据","海报图片","背景图像","搜索功能","热门内容","视频预告片","TMDB身份验证"],"ja":["TMDB統合","React Native TV","映画データ","テレビ番組データ","ポスター画像","背景画像","検索機能","人気コンテンツ","ビデオトレーラー","TMDB認証"],"ko":["TMDB 통합","React Native TV","영화 데이터","TV 프로그램 데이터","포스터 이미지","배경 이미지","검색 기능","인기 콘텐츠","비디오 예고편","TMDB 인증"],"es":["integración TMDB","React Native TV","API de The Movie Database","datos de películas","series de TV","autenticación TMDB","claves API","optimización de rendimiento"],"fr":["intégration TMDB","React Native TV","API de The Movie Database","données de films","séries TV","authentification TMDB","clés API","optimisation des performances"],"de":["TMDB-Integration","React Native TV","API von The Movie Database","Filmdaten","Fernsehsendungen","TMDB-Authentifizierung","API-Schlüssel","Leistungsoptimierung"],"pt":["Integração TMDB","React Native TV","API TMDB","Autenticação TMDB","Dados de filmes","Dados de séries de TV","Otimização da API"],"ru":["Интеграция TMDB","React Native TV","API TMDB","Аутентификация TMDB","Данные о фильмах","Данные о сериалах","Оптимизация API"],"ar":["دمج TMDB","React Native TV","API قاعدة بيانات الأفلام","المصادقة TMDB","بيانات الأفلام","بيانات المسلسلات","تحسين الأداء"]}},"owner":"giolaq","repo":"Multi-TV-dev-power","repoPath":"giolaq/Multi-TV-dev-power","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.431Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tmdb-integration","description":"TMDB (The Movie Database) API integration for React Native TV streaming apps. Use when users need help with movie/TV show data, poster images, search functionality, trending content, video trailers from TMDB, API authentication, rate limiting, or TypeScript types for TMDB responses.","bodyPreview":"# TMDB Integration Skill\n\nYou are an expert in integrating The Movie Database (TMDB) API with React Native TV applications. This skill activates when users ask about:\n\n- Fetching movie or TV show data\n- Displaying poster and backdrop images\n- Implementing search functionality\n- Getting trending content\n- Fetching video trailers\n- TMDB authentication and API keys\n- Rate limiting and optimization\n- TypeScript types for TMDB responses\n\n## Authentication\n\nTMDB offers two equivalent authentication me","body":"# TMDB Integration Skill\n\nYou are an expert in integrating The Movie Database (TMDB) API with React Native TV applications. This skill activates when users ask about:\n\n- Fetching movie or TV show data\n- Displaying poster and backdrop images\n- Implementing search functionality\n- Getting trending content\n- Fetching video trailers\n- TMDB authentication and API keys\n- Rate limiting and optimization\n- TypeScript types for TMDB responses\n\n## Authentication\n\nTMDB offers two equivalent authentication methods:\n\n### API Key (Query Parameter)\n\n```typescript\nconst url = `https://api.themoviedb.org/3/movie/550?api_key=${API_KEY}`;\n```\n\n### Bearer Token (Header) - Recommended\n\n```typescript\nconst headers = {\n  ''Authorization'': `Bearer ${ACCESS_TOKEN}`,\n  ''Accept'': ''application/json''\n};\n```\n\n**Both tokens are generated in your TMDB account settings.** Bearer token is recommended for production as credentials aren''t visible in URLs.\n\n## Image URL Construction\n\n**Base URL:** `https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/`\n\n**Official Sizes (use these for CDN caching):**\n\n| Type | Available Sizes |\n|------|-----------------|\n| Poster | w92, w154, w185, w342, w500, w780, original |\n| Backdrop | w300, w780, w1280, original |\n| Logo | w45, w92, w154, w185, w300, w500, original |\n| Profile | w45, w185, h632, original |\n\n**Image URL Helper:**\n\n```typescript\nconst TMDB_IMAGE_BASE = ''https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/'';\n\ntype PosterSize = ''w92'' | ''w154'' | ''w185'' | ''w342'' | ''w500'' | ''w780'' | ''original'';\ntype BackdropSize = ''w300'' | ''w780'' | ''w1280'' | ''original'';\n\nexport function getPosterUrl(path: string | null, size: PosterSize = ''w500''): string | null {\n  if (!path) return null;\n  return `${TMDB_IMAGE_BASE}${size}${path}`;\n}\n\nexport function getBackdropUrl(path: string | null, size: BackdropSize = ''w1280''): string | null {\n  if (!path) return null;\n  return `${TMDB_IMAGE_BASE}${size}${path}`;\n}\n```\n\n**Important:** Only use official sizes - non-standard sizes bypass CDN caching and are 10-50x slower.\n\n## Essential Endpoints\n\n### Trending Content\n\n```\nGET /trending/{media_type}/{time_window}\n\nmedia_type: movie, tv, person, all\ntime_window: day, week\n```\n\n### Discovery\n\n```\nGET /discover/movie\nGET /discover/tv\n\nParameters:\n- sort_by: popularity.desc, vote_average.desc, release_date.desc\n- with_genres: 28,12 (AND) or 28|12 (OR)\n- page: pagination (20 items per page)\n```\n\n### Search\n\n```\nGET /search/movie?query={term}\nGET /search/tv?query={term}\nGET /search/multi?query={term}  // Movies, TV, and people\n```\n\n### Details with Related Data\n\n```\nGET /movie/{id}?append_to_response=videos,credits,images\nGET /tv/{id}?append_to_response=videos,credits,images,season/1,season/2\n```\n\n**append_to_response** combines multiple requests into one (doesn''t count toward rate limits).\n\n### Genres\n\n```\nGET /genre/movie/list\nGET /genre/tv/list\n```\n\n## TypeScript Interfaces\n\n```typescript\n// Base types\nexport interface Movie {\n  id: number;\n  title: string;\n  overview: string;\n  poster_path: string | null;\n  backdrop_path: string | null;\n  release_date: string;\n  vote_average: number;\n  vote_count: number;\n  popularity: number;\n  genre_ids?: number[];\n  adult: boolean;\n}\n\nexport interface TVShow {\n  id: number;\n  name: string;\n  overview: string;\n  poster_path: string | null;\n  backdrop_path: string | null;\n  first_air_date: string;\n  vote_average: number;\n  vote_count: number;\n  popularity: number;\n  genre_ids?: number[];\n  origin_country: string[];\n}\n\nexport interface TMDBResponse<T> {\n  page: number;\n  results: T[];\n  total_pages: number;\n  total_results: number;\n}\n\n// Detail types\nexport interface MovieDetails extends Movie {\n  budget: number;\n  revenue: number;\n  runtime: number;\n  status: string;\n  tagline: string;\n  genres: Genre[];\n  production_companies: ProductionCompany[];\n  credits?: Credits;\n  videos?: { results: Video[] };\n  images?: Images;\n}\n\nexport interface TVDetails extends TVShow {\n  number_of_episodes: number;\n  number_of_seasons: number;\n  episode_run_time: number[];\n  seasons: Season[];\n  networks: Network[];\n  status: string;\n  credits?: Credits;\n  videos?: { results: Video[] };\n}\n\nexport interface Genre {\n  id: number;\n  name: string;\n}\n\nexport interface Video {\n  id: string;\n  key: string;           // YouTube/Vimeo video ID\n  name: string;\n  site: ''YouTube'' | ''Vimeo'';\n  size: number;\n  type: ''Trailer'' | ''Teaser'' | ''Clip'' | ''Featurette'' | ''Behind the Scenes'';\n  official: boolean;\n  published_at: string;\n}\n\nexport interface Credits {\n  cast: CastMember[];\n  crew: CrewMember[];\n}\n\nexport interface CastMember {\n  id: number;\n  name: string;\n  character: string;\n  profile_path: string | null;\n  order: number;\n}\n\nexport interface CrewMember {\n  id: number;\n  name: string;\n  job: string;\n  department: string;\n  profile_path: string | null;\n}\n\nexport interface Season {\n  id: number;\n  season_number: number;\n  name: string;\n  overview: string;\n  air_date: string;\n  episode_count: number;\n  poster_path: string | null;\n}\n\nexport interface Episode {\n  id: number;\n  name: string;\n  overview: string;\n  episode_number: number;\n  season_number: number;\n  still_path: string | null;\n  air_date: string;\n  runtime: number;\n  vote_average: number;\n}\n```\n\n## Axios Client Setup\n\n```typescript\nimport axios from ''axios'';\n\nconst TMDB_BASE_URL = ''https://api.themoviedb.org/3'';\n\nconst tmdbClient = axios.create({\n  baseURL: TMDB_BASE_URL,\n  timeout: 10000,\n  headers: {\n    ''Accept'': ''application/json'',\n    ''Authorization'': `Bearer ${process.env.TMDB_ACCESS_TOKEN}`,\n  },\n});\n\n// Add default language\ntmdbClient.interceptors.request.use((config) => {\n  config.params = {\n    ...config.params,\n    language: ''en-US'',\n  };\n  return config;\n});\n\n// Error handling\ntmdbClient.interceptors.response.use(\n  (response) => response,\n  (error) => {\n    if (error.response?.status === 429) {\n      // Rate limited - implement retry with backoff\n      console.warn(''TMDB rate limit hit'');\n    }\n    return Promise.reject(error);\n  }\n);\n\nexport default tmdbClient;\n```\n\n## React Native Hooks\n\n### useTrending Hook\n\n```typescript\nimport { useState, useEffect } from ''react'';\nimport tmdbClient from ''../services/tmdbClient'';\nimport { Movie, TVShow, TMDBResponse } from ''../types/tmdb'';\n\ntype MediaType = ''movie'' | ''tv'' | ''all'';\ntype TimeWindow = ''day'' | ''week'';\n\nexport function useTrending<T extends Movie | TVShow>(\n  mediaType: MediaType = ''movie'',\n  timeWindow: TimeWindow = ''week''\n) {\n  const [data, setData] = useState<T[]>([]);\n  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(true);\n  const [error, setError] = useState<Error | null>(null);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    let cancelled = false;\n\n    async function fetchTrending() {\n      try {\n        setLoading(true);\n        const response = await tmdbClient.get<TMDBResponse<T>>(\n          `/trending/${mediaType}/${timeWindow}`\n        );\n        if (!cancelled) {\n          setData(response.data.results);\n        }\n      } catch (err) {\n        if (!cancelled) {\n          setError(err as Error);\n        }\n      } finally {\n        if (!cancelled) {\n          setLoading(false);\n        }\n      }\n    }\n\n    fetchTrending();\n    return () => { cancelled = true; };\n  }, [mediaType, timeWindow]);\n\n  return { data, loading, error };\n}\n```\n\n### useMovieDetails Hook\n\n```typescript\nexport function useMovieDetails(movieId: number) {\n  const [movie, setMovie] = useState<MovieDetails | null>(null);\n  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(true);\n  const [error, setError] = useState<Error | null>(null);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    let cancelled = false;\n\n    async function fetchDetails() {\n      try {\n        setLoading(true);\n        const response = await tmdbClient.get<MovieDetails>(\n          `/movie/${movieId}`,\n          {\n            params: {\n              append_to_response: ''videos,credits,images'',\n            },\n          }\n        );\n        if (!cancelled) {\n          setMovie(response.data);\n        }\n      } catch (err) {\n        if (!cancelled) {\n          setError(err as Error);\n        }\n      } finally {\n        if (!cancelled) {\n          setLoading(false);\n        }\n      }\n    }\n\n    if (movieId) {\n      fetchDetails();\n    }\n    return () => { cancelled = true; };\n  }, [movieId]);\n\n  return { movie, loading, error };\n}\n```\n\n### useSearch Hook with Debounce\n\n```typescript\nimport { useState, useCallback, useRef } from ''react'';\nimport { debounce } from ''lodash'';\n\nexport function useSearch() {\n  const [results, setResults] = useState<(Movie | TVShow)[]>([]);\n  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(false);\n  const [error, setError] = useState<Error | null>(null);\n\n  const searchRef = useRef(\n    debounce(async (query: string) => {\n      if (!query.trim()) {\n        setResults([]);\n        return;\n      }\n\n      try {\n        setLoading(true);\n        const response = await tmdbClient.get(''/search/multi'', {\n          params: { query },\n        });\n        setResults(response.data.results.filter(\n          (item: any) => item.media_type === ''movie'' || item.media_type === ''tv''\n        ));\n      } catch (err) {\n        setError(err as Error);\n      } finally {\n        setLoading(false);\n      }\n    }, 300)\n  );\n\n  const search = useCallback((query: string) => {\n    searchRef.current(query);\n  }, []);\n\n  return { results, loading, error, search };\n}\n```\n\n## Rate Limiting\n\n**Current Limits:**\n- 50 requests per second\n- 20 simultaneous connections per IP\n\n**Optimization Strategies:**\n\n1. **Use append_to_response** - Combine requests (free, no rate limit impact)\n2. **Implement caching** - Cache responses with TTL\n3. **Debounce searches** - Wait 300ms after user stops typing\n4. **Batch requests** - Group API calls with small delays\n\n## Common Pitfalls & Solutions\n\n| Pitfall | Solution |\n|---------|----------|\n| API key in client-side code | Use backend proxy in production |\n| Slow image loading | Only use official sizes (w342, w500, w780) |\n| Missing images crash app | Always check for null: `poster_path && getPosterUrl(poster_path)` |\n| Wrong video displayed | Filter: `videos.filter(v => v.type === ''Trailer'' && v.official)` |\n| Rate limit errors | Implement exponential backoff, use append_to_response |\n| State update on unmounted component | Use cleanup flag in useEffect |\n| Search fires too often | Debounce search input (300-500ms) |\n| Can''t get all TV episodes | Use `append_to_response=season/1,season/2,...` (max 20) |\n\n## Error Codes\n\n| Code | Meaning | Action |\n|------|---------|--------|\n| 7 | Invalid API key | Check for typos, verify key in settings |\n| 10 | Suspended API key | Contact TMDB support |\n| 34 | Resource not found | May be temporary - retry once |\n| 429 | Rate limit exceeded | Implement backoff, reduce request rate |\n\n## Video URL Construction\n\n```typescript\nfunction getVideoUrl(video: Video): string {\n  if (video.site === ''YouTube'') {\n    return `https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=${video.key}`;\n  }\n  if (video.site === ''Vimeo'') {\n    return `https://vimeo.com/${video.key}`;\n  }\n  return '''';\n}\n\n// Get official trailer\nfunction getOfficialTrailer(videos: Video[]): Video | undefined {\n  return videos.find(v => v.type === ''Trailer'' && v.official)\n      || videos.find(v => v.type === ''Trailer'')\n      || videos[0];\n}\n```\n\n## Resources\n\n- [TMDB API Docs](https://developer.themoviedb.org/docs/getting-started)\n- [TMDB API Reference](https://developer.themoviedb.org/reference/getting-started)\n- [Image Configuration](https://developer.themoviedb.org/docs/image-basics)\n- [Rate Limiting](https://developer.themoviedb.org/docs/rate-limiting)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:14:36.782Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Media Agents needing seamless integration with The Movie Database API for enhanced entertainment data analysis.","zh":"非常适合需要与The Movie Database API无缝集成的媒体代理，以增强娱乐数据分析。","ja":"The Movie Database APIとのシームレスな統合が必要なメディアエージェントに最適です。","ko":"The Movie Database API와의無縫한통합이 필요한 미디어 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Medios que necesitan una integración sin problemas con la API de The Movie Database para un análisis de datos de entretenimiento mejorado.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de médias nécessitant une intégration sans problèmes avec l''API de The Movie Database pour une analyse de données de divertissement améliorée.","de":"Perfekt für Media-Agenten, die eine nahtlose Integration mit der The Movie Database-API für eine verbesserte Unterhaltungsdatenanalyse benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Mídia que necessitam de integração sem problemas com a API do The Movie Database para análise de dados de entretenimento aprimorada.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Медиа-агентов, которым необходима бесшовная интеграция с API базы данных фильмов для расширенного анализа данных о развлечениях.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الإعلاميين الذين يحتاجون إلى تكامل بدون مشاكل مع واجهة برمجة تطبيقات قاعدة بيانات الأفلام لتحليل بيانات الترفيه المحسّن."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to fetch movie and TV show data, display poster and backdrop images, and implement search functionality using TMDB''s RESTful API and TypeScript types for optimized responses, all while handling rate limiting and authentication via API keys.","zh":"赋予代理商使用TMDB的RESTful API和TypeScript类型来获取电影和电视节目数据、显示海报和背景图像以及实现搜索功能的能力，同时处理速率限制和通过API密钥进行身份验证，以优化响应。","ja":"TMDBのRESTful APIとTypeScriptの型を使用して映画やテレビ番組のデータを取得し、ポスターと背景画像を表示し、検索機能を実装する能力をエージェントに与え、同時にAPIキーの認証とレート制限を処理してレスポンスを最適化します。","ko":"에이전트에게 TMDB의 RESTful API와 TypeScript 타입을 사용하여 영화 및 TV 프로그램 데이터를 가져오고, 포스터 및 배경 이미지를 표시하고, 검색 기능을 구현할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며,同時に API 키를 통한 인증 및 레이트 제한을 처리하여 응답을 최적화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a recuperar datos de películas y programas de televisión, mostrar imágenes de póster y fondo, e implementar la función de búsqueda utilizando la API RESTful de TMDB y los tipos de TypeScript para respuestas optimizadas, todo mientras se controla la limitación de velocidad y la autenticación a través de claves de API.","fr":"Permet aux agents de récupérer des données de films et d''émissions de télévision, d''afficher des images de posters et de fond, et de mettre en œuvre la fonctionnalité de recherche en utilisant l''API RESTful de TMDB et les types TypeScript pour des réponses optimisées, le tout en gérant la limitation de débit et l''authentification via des clés d''API.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Film- und Fernsehsendungsdaten abzurufen, Poster- und Hintergrundbilder anzuzeigen und die Suchfunktion mithilfe der RESTful-API von TMDB und TypeScript-Typen für optimierte Antworten zu implementieren, und zwar unter Berücksichtigung der Rate-Limiting und Authentifizierung über API-Schlüssel.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a buscar dados de filmes e programas de TV, exibir imagens de pôster e fundo, e implementar funcionalidade de pesquisa usando a API RESTful do TMDB e tipos TypeScript para respostas otimizadas, tudo isso lidando com limitação de taxa e autenticação via chaves de API.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью получать данные о фильмах и телешоу, отображать изображения постеров и фонов, и реализовывать функциональность поиска с помощью RESTful API TMDB и типов TypeScript для оптимизированных ответов, все это при обработке ограничения скорости и аутентификации по ключам API.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على استرجاع بيانات الأفلام والبرامج التلفزيونية، وعرض صور البوسترات والخلفيات، وتنفيذ وظيفة البحث باستخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات TMDB القائمة على REST وتنسيقات TypeScript للresponses المُحسّنة، مع التعامل مع حد الت率 والتحقق من خلال مفتاح واجهة البرمجة."},"useCases":{"en":["Fetching trending movies and TV shows for personalized recommendations","Implementing search bars with autocomplete functionality using TMDB''s search endpoint","Displaying video trailers and metadata for enhanced user engagement"],"zh":["获取热门电影和电视节目以进行个性化推荐","使用TMDB的搜索端点实现带有自动完成功能的搜索栏","显示视频预告片和元数据以增强用户参与度"],"ja":["個別のレコメンデーションを行うためにトレンドの映画やテレビ番組を取得する","TMDBの検索エンドポイントを使用してオートコンプリート機能を備えた検索バーを実装する","ビデオトレーラーとメタデータを表示してユーザー関与を高める"],"ko":["개별 추천을 위해 트랜드하는 영화 및 TV 프로그램을 가져옵니다","TMDB의 검색 엔드포인트를 사용하여 자동 완성 기능을 갖춘 검색 바를 구현합니다","비디오 트레일러와 메타데이터를 표시하여 사용자 참여를 높입니다"],"es":["Recuperación de películas y programas de televisión tendencias para recomendaciones personalizadas","Implementación de barras de búsqueda con funcionalidad de autocompletado utilizando el punto final de búsqueda de TMDB","Visualización de tráileres de video y metadatos para una mayor participación del usuario"],"fr":["Récupération de films et d''émissions de télévision tendances pour des recommandations personnalisées","Mise 