بالذكاء الاصطناعي","Test-Driven Development","إكمال المواصفات","التحقق من جودة QA","ضمان الجودة"]}},"owner":"Agentic-Engineering-Agency","repo":"specsafe","repoPath":"Agentic-Engineering-Agency/specsafe","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.431Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"specsafe-complete","description":"Complete a SpecSafe specification. Moves spec from QA to COMPLETE stage.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Complete a SpecSafe specification (QA → COMPLETE stage).\n\n**When to use:**\n- QA validation passed with GO recommendation\n- Ready to mark as production-ready\n- Finalizing the spec\n\n**Input**: The spec ID (e.g., SPEC-20240204-001)\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **Validate QA passed**\n\n   Verify QA report shows GO recommendation.\n   Check that all critical issues are resolved.\n\n2. **Complete the spec**\n\n   ```bash\n   specsafe complete \"<spec-id>\"\n   ```\n\n   This:\n   - Moves spec to COMPLETE stage\n   - Moves spec f","body":"Complete a SpecSafe specification (QA → COMPLETE stage).\n\n**When to use:**\n- QA validation passed with GO recommendation\n- Ready to mark as production-ready\n- Finalizing the spec\n\n**Input**: The spec ID (e.g., SPEC-20240204-001)\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **Validate QA passed**\n\n   Verify QA report shows GO recommendation.\n   Check that all critical issues are resolved.\n\n2. **Complete the spec**\n\n   ```bash\n   specsafe complete \"<spec-id>\"\n   ```\n\n   This:\n   - Moves spec to COMPLETE stage\n   - Moves spec file to `specs/completed/`\n   - Archives QA report\n   - Updates PROJECT_STATE.md\n\n3. **Show completion summary**\n\n   Display:\n   - Spec completion confirmation\n   - Metrics (time to complete, coverage, etc.)\n   - Location of completed spec\n   - Next steps\n\n**Output**\n\nAfter completion:\n- ✅ Completion confirmation\n- Spec moved to `specs/completed/`\n- PROJECT_STATE.md updated\n- Prompt: \"Ready to start a new spec? Run `specsafe new`\"\n\n**Guardrails**\n- Spec must be in QA stage\n- QA report must recommend GO\n- Do NOT complete if NO-GO\n- Confirm all requirements met"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:15:14.148Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Test-Driven Development Agents requiring automated QA validation and spec completion","zh":"适合需要自动化QA验证和规格完成的测试驱动开发代理","ja":"自動化QA検証と仕様の完成が必要なテスト駆動開発エージェントに適しています","ko":"자동화된 QA 검증 및仕様 완성을 필요로 하는 테스트 주도 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de Desarrollo Dirigido por Pruebas que requieren validación automática de QA y finalización de especificaciones","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement piloté par les tests nécessitant une validation automatique de la QA et une finalisation de spécifications","de":"Ideal für Test-Driven-Development-Agents, die eine automatisierte QA-Validierung und Spezifikationsvervollständigung erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Dirigido por Testes que requerem validação de QA automatizada e conclusão de especificações","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, ориентированных на тестирование, требующих автоматической проверки QA и завершения спецификаций","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير القائم على الاختبار الذي يتطلب التحقق الآلي من جودة الضمان وتكملة المواصفات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to finalize SpecSafe specifications by validating QA reports and moving specs to the COMPLETE stage using the specsafe complete command, ensuring production-ready code with resolved critical issues","zh":"赋予代理完成SpecSafe规格的能力，通过验证QA报告并使用specsafe complete命令将规格移动到完成阶段，确保生产就绪代码并解决关键问题","ja":"SpecSafe仕様を完成させるエージェントの能力を提供し、QAレポートを検証し、specsafe completeコマンドを使用して仕様を完了ステージに移動し、製品に適したコードを確保し、重大な問題を解決します","ko":"SpecSafe 사양을 완료하는 에이전트의 능력을 제공하고 QA 보고서를 검증하고 specsafe 완료 명령을 사용하여 사양을 완료 단계로 이동하여 프로덕션 준비 코드를 보장하고 중요 문제를 해결합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a finalizar las especificaciones de SpecSafe validando los informes de QA y moviendo las especificaciones a la etapa COMPLETE utilizando el comando specsafe complete, garantizando un código listo para producción con problemas críticos resueltos","fr":"Permet aux agents de finaliser les spécifications SpecSafe en validant les rapports de QA et en déplaçant les spécifications vers l''étape COMPLETE en utilisant la commande specsafe complete, garantissant un code prêt pour la production avec les problèmes critiques résolus","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Spezifikationen von SpecSafe abzuschließen, indem sie die QA-Berichte validieren und die Spezifikationen mit dem Befehl specsafe complete in die COMPLETE-Phase verschieben, wodurch ein produktionsbereiter Code mit gelösten kritischen Problemen sichergestellt wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a finalizar as especificações do SpecSafe validando os relatórios de QA e movendo as especificações para a etapa COMPLETE utilizando o comando specsafe complete, garantindo código pronto para produção com questões críticas resolvidas","ru":"Позволяет агентам завершать спецификации SpecSafe, проверяя отчеты QA и перемещая спецификации в стадию COMPLETE с помощью команды specsafe complete, обеспечивая готовый к производству код с решенными критическими проблемами","ar":"تمكّن العميل من إنهاء مواصفات SpecSafe من خلال التحقق من تقارير جودة الضمان ونقل المواصفات إلى مرحلة COMPLETE باستخدام أمر specsafe complete، مما يضمن الحصول على 코드 جاهز للإنتاج مع حل القضايا الحرجة"},"useCases":{"en":["Validating QA reports for GO recommendation","Completing SpecSafe specifications for production-ready code","Resolving critical issues in specs"],"zh":["验证GO推荐的QA报告","完成生产就绪代码的SpecSafe规格","解决规格中的关键问题"],"ja":["GO推奨のQAレポートの検証","製品に適したコードのSpecSafe仕様の完成","仕様の重大な問題の解決"],"ko":["GO 추천의 QA 보고서 검증","프로덕션 준비 코드의 SpecSafe 사양 완료","사양의 중요 문제 해결"],"es":["Validar informes de QA para la recomendación de GO","Completar especificaciones de SpecSafe para código listo para producción","Resolver problemas críticos en las especificaciones"],"fr":["Valider les rapports de QA pour la recommandation de GO","Compléter les spécifications SpecSafe pour un code