tório","marketing","eficiência","gestão de ativos","ferramentas de marketing","fluxo de trabalho de marketing"],"ru":["организация активов","стандарты вывода","соглашения об именах","структура директорий","маркетинг","эффективность","управление активами","маркетинговые инструменты","маркетинговый рабочий процесс"],"ar":["تنظيم الأصول","معايير الإخراج","أسماء التوجيه","هيكل الدليل","التسويق","كفاءة","إدارة الأصول","أدوات التسويق","تدفق عمل التسويق"]}},"owner":"NammDev","repo":"Goads-Krea","repoPath":"NammDev/Goads-Krea","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.431Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"assets-organizing","description":"Organize all outputs from slash commands and subagents in assets/ directory by topics, date format, and slugs.","bodyPreview":"# Assets Organizing\n\nStandardize asset output locations, naming conventions, and directory structures for all marketing outputs.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Creating content that needs file output (articles, videos, designs)\n- Generating AI assets (images, storyboards, scripts)\n- Organizing existing assets\n- Determining output paths for new content types\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Output Paths\n\n| Asset Type | Path | Naming |\n|------------|------|--------|\n| Articles | `assets/articles/","body":"# Assets Organizing\n\nStandardize asset output locations, naming conventions, and directory structures for all marketing outputs.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Creating content that needs file output (articles, videos, designs)\n- Generating AI assets (images, storyboards, scripts)\n- Organizing existing assets\n- Determining output paths for new content types\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Output Paths\n\n| Asset Type | Path | Naming |\n|------------|------|--------|\n| Articles | `assets/articles/{date}-{slug}/` | `{slug}.md` + `images/{date}-{slug}/` |\n| Storyboards | `assets/storyboards/{date}-{slug}/` | `storyboard.md` + `scene-{N}-*.png` |\n| Videos | `assets/videos/{date}-{slug}/` | `master.mp4` + `scene-{N}.mp4` |\n| Transcripts | `assets/transcripts/` | `{slug}.md` |\n| Writing Styles | `assets/writing-styles/` | `{slug}.md` |\n| Banners | `assets/banners/{campaign}/` | `{variant}-{size}.{ext}` |\n| Designs | `assets/designs/{project}/` | `{type}-{variant}.{ext}` |\n| Infographics | `assets/infographics/` | `{date}-{slug}.{ext}` |\n| Logos | `assets/logos/` | `{name}-{variant}.{ext}` |\n| Social Posts | `assets/posts/{platform}/` | `{date}-{slug}.{ext}` |\n| Generated | `assets/generated/{type}/` | `{date}-{slug}.{ext}` |\n| **Reports** | | |\n| Analytics | `assets/reports/analytics/` | `{date}-{report-type}.md` |\n| SEO | `assets/reports/seo/` | `{date}-{audit-type}.md` |\n| Social | `assets/reports/social/` | `{date}-{platform}-{report-type}.md` |\n| Campaign | `assets/reports/campaigns/` | `{date}-{campaign}-{report-type}.md` |\n| Performance | `assets/reports/performance/` | `{date}-{channel}-report.md` |\n| Ads | `assets/reports/ads/` | `{date}-{platform}-report.md` |\n| Email | `assets/reports/email/` | `{date}-{campaign}-report.md` |\n| Funnel | `assets/reports/funnels/` | `{date}-{funnel}-analysis.md` |\n| Content | `assets/reports/content/` | `{date}-{content-type}-audit.md` |\n| **Text Content** | | |\n| Copy | `assets/copy/{type}/` | `{date}-{slug}.md` |\n| Ad Copy | `assets/copy/ads/` | `{date}-{campaign}-{variant}.md` |\n| Email Copy | `assets/copy/emails/` | `{date}-{sequence}-{slug}.md` |\n| Landing Pages | `assets/copy/landing-pages/` | `{slug}.md` |\n| Headlines | `assets/copy/headlines/` | `{date}-{topic}.md` |\n| Scripts | `assets/scripts/{type}/` | `{slug}.md` |\n| **Campaigns** | | |\n| Campaign Briefs | `assets/campaigns/{date}-{slug}/briefs/` | `{type}-brief.md` |\n| Campaign Creatives | `assets/campaigns/{date}-{slug}/creatives/` | `{channel}-{variant}.{ext}` |\n| Campaign Reports | `assets/campaigns/{date}-{slug}/reports/` | `{date}-{report-type}.md` |\n| Campaign Assets | `assets/campaigns/{date}-{slug}/assets/` | `{type}-{name}.{ext}` |\n| **Sales** | | |\n| Pitches | `assets/sales/pitches/` | `{date}-{industry}-{persona}.md` |\n| Proposals | `assets/sales/proposals/` | `{date}-{client}-proposal.md` |\n| Case Studies | `assets/sales/case-studies/` | `{date}-{client}-{outcome}.md` |\n| Battlecards | `assets/sales/battlecards/` | `{competitor}.md` |\n| **SEO** | | |\n| SEO Audits | `assets/seo/audits/` | `{date}-{domain}-audit.md` |\n| Keyword Research | `assets/seo/keywords/` | `{date}-{topic}-keywords.md` |\n| Schema Markup | `assets/seo/schemas/` | `{page}-schema.json` |\n| **Funnels** | | |\n| Funnel Designs | `assets/funnels/designs/` | `{date}-{slug}-funnel.md` |\n| Funnel Audits | `assets/funnels/audits/` | `{date}-{funnel}-audit.md` |\n| A/B Tests | `assets/funnels/tests/` | `{date}-{test-name}.md` |\n| **Leads** | | |\n| Scoring Models | `assets/leads/scoring-models/` | `{date}-{model-name}.md` |\n| Segments | `assets/leads/segments/` | `{segment-name}.md` |\n| ICP Profiles | `assets/leads/icp-profiles/` | `{persona}.md` |\n| **Community** | | |\n| Response Templates | `assets/community/templates/` | `{situation}.md` |\n| FAQs | `assets/community/faqs/` | `{topic}.md` |\n| Moderation Guides | `assets/community/moderation/` | `{policy}.md` |\n| **Retention** | | |\n| Retention Campaigns | `assets/retention/campaigns/` | `{date}-{campaign}.md` |\n| Health Scoring | `assets/retention/scoring-models/` | `{date}-{model}.md` |\n| Intervention Playbooks | `assets/retention/playbooks/` | `{segment}.md` |\n| **Attraction** | | |\n| Landing Page Content | `assets/attraction/landing-pages/` | `{slug}.md` |\n| Lead Magnets | `assets/attraction/lead-magnets/` | `{slug}.md` |\n| pSEO Templates | `assets/attraction/pseo-templates/` | `{template-name}.md` |\n| Content Briefs | `assets/attraction/content-briefs/` | `{date}-{topic}.md` |\n| **Diagnostics** | | |\n| Campaign Audits | `assets/diagnostics/campaign-audits/` | `{date}-{campaign}.md` |\n| Content Reviews | `assets/diagnostics/content-reviews/` | `{date}-{content}.md` |\n\n### Naming Conventions\n\nLoad: `references/naming-conventions.md`\n\n### Directory Structure Rules\n\nLoad: `references/directory-structure.md`\n\n### Asset Type Details\n\nLoad: `references/asset-types.md`\n\n## Core Rules\n\n1. **Always use kebab-case** for slugs and filenames\n2. **Date prefix** for time-sensitive assets: `{YYMMDD}` or `{YYMMDD-HHmm}`\n3. **Self-contained folders** for multi-file assets (articles, videos, storyboards)\n4. **Flat files** for single-file assets (transcripts, writing-styles)\n5. **Platform subfolders** for platform-specific content\n\n## Date Format\n\nUse `$CK_PLAN_DATE_FORMAT` env var or default to `YYMMDD-HHmm`.\n\n```bash\n# PowerShell\nGet-Date -UFormat \"%y%m%d-%H%M\"\n\n# Bash\ndate +%y%m%d-%H%M\n```\n\n## Pre-Output Checklist\n\nBefore writing any asset:\n1. Determine asset type → get base path\n2. Generate slug from topic/title\n3. Check if folder/file exists (avoid overwrite)\n4. Create directory structure if needed\n5. Output all related files together\n\n## Integration Points\n\nThis skill integrates with:\n- `/video:create` - Video assets\n- `/video:storyboard:create` - Storyboard assets\n- `/content/blog` - Article assets\n- `/campaign` commands - Campaign assets\n- `content-creator` agent - Various content\n- `ui-ux-designer` agent - Design assets\n- `copywriter` agent - Copy assets\n- `email-wizard` agent - Email copy\n- `social-media-manager` agent - Social posts\n- `campaign-manager` agent - Campaign assets\n- `sale-enabler` agent - Sales assets\n- `seo-specialist` agent - SEO assets\n- `/seo` commands - SEO audits\n- `funnel-architect` agent - Funnel assets\n- `lead-qualifier` agent - Lead assets\n- `community-manager` agent - Community assets\n- `continuity-specialist` agent - Retention assets\n- `attraction-specialist` agent - Attraction assets\n- `campaign-debugger` agent - Diagnostic reports\n- `content-reviewer` agent - Review reports\n- `analytics` skill - Analytics reports\n- `seo-optimization` skill - SEO reports\n- `social-media` skill - Social reports\n- `campaign-management` skill - Campaign reports\n- `ads-management` skill - Ads reports\n- `email-marketing` skill - Email reports\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:15:23.018Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT requiring structured asset management for marketing content creation and organization.","zh":"适合于需要结构化资产管理的AI代理，如Claude Code和AutoGPT，用于营销内容创建和组织。","ja":"構造化されたアセット管理を必要とするAIエージェント、たとえばClaude CodeやAutoGPTに向けて、適切なものです。マーケティングコンテンツの作成や組織化に利用されます。","ko":"구조화된 자산 관리가 필요한 AI 에이전트인 Claude Code 및 AutoGPT와 같은 마케팅 콘텐츠 생성 및 조직에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude Code y AutoGPT que requieren una gestión de activos estructurada para la creación y organización de contenido de marketing.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA comme Claude Code et AutoGPT nécessitant une gestion d''actifs structurée pour la création et l''organisation de contenu marketing.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Claude Code und AutoGPT, die eine strukturierte Verwaltung von Assets für die Erstellung und Organisation von Marketinginhalten erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como Claude Code e AutoGPT que exigem gestão de ativos estruturada para criação e organização de conteúdo de marketing.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code и AutoGPT, требующих структурированного управления активами для создания и организации маркетингового контента.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT الذين يتطلبون إدارة الأصول المنظمة لإنشاء المحتوى التسويقي والتنظيم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to standardize asset output locations, enforce consistent naming conventions, and maintain organized directory structures for various marketing assets, including articles, videos, designs, images, and scripts, utilizing protocols like file system hierarchies and metadata tagging.","zh":"赋予代理标准化资产输出位置、执行一致的命名约定、并维护各种营销资产的组织化目录结构，包括文章、视频、设计、图像和脚本，利用诸如文件系统层次结构和元数据标记等协议。","ja":"エージェントに、資産の出力先を標準化し、一貫した命名規則を適用し、記事、ビデオ、デザイン、画像、スクリプトなどの様々なマーケティング資産の整理されたディレクトリ構造を維持することを可能にします。ファイルシステムの階層構造やメタデータのタグ付けなどのプロトコルを利用します。","ko":"에이전트에게 자산 출력 위치를 표준화하고 일관된命명 규칙을 적용하며 기사, 비디오, 디자인, 이미지, 스크립트 등의 다양한 마케팅 자산에 대한 조직화된 디렉토리 구조를 유지할 수 있도록 합니다. 파일 시스템 계층 구조 및 메타데이터 태깅과 같은 프로토콜을 사용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes estandarizar las ubicaciones de salida de los activos, aplicar convenciones de nomenclatura coherentes y mantener estructuras de directorios organizadas para varios activos de marketing, incluidos artículos, videos, diseños, imágenes y secuencias de comandos, utilizando protocolos como jerarquías de sistema de archivos y etiquetado de metadatos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de normaliser les emplacements de sortie des actifs, d''appliquer des conventions de dénomination cohérentes et de maintenir des structures de répertoires organisées pour divers actifs marketing, notamment des articles, des vidéos, des conceptions, des images et des scripts, en utilisant des protocoles tels que les hiérarchies de système de fichiers et le marquage de métadonnées.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, die Ausgabestellen der Assets zu standardisieren, konsistente Benennungskonventionen durchzusetzen und organisierte Verzeichnisstrukturen für verschiedene Marketing-Assets wie Artikel, Videos, Designs, Bilder und Skripte zu erhalten, indem Protokolle wie Dateisystemhierarchien und Metadaten-Tagging verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a padronizar localizações de saída de ativos, impor convenções de nomenclatura consistentes e manter estruturas de diretórios organizadas para vários ativos de marketing, incluindo artigos, vídeos, designs, imagens e scripts, utilizando protocolos como hierarquias de sistema de arquivos e marcação de metadados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью стандартизировать места вывода активов, обеспечивать последовательные соглашения об именах и поддерживать организованные структуры каталогов для различных маркетинговых активов, включая статьи, видео, дизайны, изображения и сценарии, используя протоколы, такие как иерархии файловых систем и метаданные.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من توحيد مواقع إخراج الأصول وتطبيق اتفاقيات تسمية متسقة والحفاظ على هياكل الدلائل المنظمة لمختلف الأصول التسويقية، بما في ذلك المقالات والفيديوهات والتصاميم والصور والنصوص، باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل هرميات نظام الملفات ووسوم البيانات الوصفية."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating asset file naming and directory creation for new marketing campaigns","Generating organized output paths for AI-generated images and storyboards","Standardizing existing asset collections for easier retrieval and reuse"],"zh":["为新的营销活动自动化资产文件命名和目录创建","为AI生成的图像和故事板生成组织化的输出路径","标准化现有的资产集合以便于检索和重用"],"ja":["新しいマーケティングキャンペーンのための資産ファイル命名とディレクトリ作成の自動化","AI生成の画像やストーリーボードのための整理された出力パスの生成","既存の資産コレクションの標準化による容易な検索と再利用"],"ko":["新的 마케팅 캠페인에 대한 자산 파일 이름 지정 및 디렉토리 생성 자동화","AI 생성 이미지 및 스토리보드에 대한 조직화된 출력 경로 생성","既存의 자산 컬렉션 표준화로 쉽게 검색 및 재사용"],"es":["Automatizar el nombre de archivo y la creación de directorios para nuevas campañas de marketing","Generar rutas de salida organizadas para imágenes y storyboards generados por IA","Establecer colecciones de activos existentes para una recuperación y reutilización más fáciles"],"fr":["Automatiser le nom de fichier et la création de répertoires pour de nouvelles campagnes marketing","Générer des chemins de sortie organisés pour les images et les storyboards générés par l''IA","Normaliser les collections d''actifs existants pour une récupération et une réutilisation plus faciles"],"de":["Automatisieren des Dateinamens und der Erstellung von Verzeichnissen für neue Marketingkampagnen","Erzeugen von organisierten Ausgabepfaden für von KI generierte Bilder und Storyboards","Standardisieren bestehender Asset-Sammlungen für eine einfachere Wiederherstellung und Wiederverwendung"],"pt":["Automatizar a nomeação de arquivos de ativos e criação de diretórios para novas campanhas de marketing","Gerar caminhos de saída organizados para imagens e storyboards gerados por IA","Padronizar coleções de ativos existentes para facilitar a recuperação e reutilização"],"ru":["Автоматизировать именование файлов активов и создание каталогов для новых маркетинговых кампаний","Генерировать организованные пути вывода для изображений и раскадровок, сгенерированных ИИ","Стандартизировать существующие коллекции активов для облегчения извлечения и повторного использования"],"ar":["توفير تعيين أسماء تلقائي للملفات الأصول وإنشاء الدلائل الجديدة للحملات التسويقية الجديدة","إنشاء مسارات إخراج منظمة للصور والقصص المصورة التي تم إنشاؤها بواسطة الذكاء الاصطناعي","توحيد مجموعات الأصول الحالية لتسهيل استرجاعها وإعادة استخدامها"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires predefined asset type categories and naming conventions","Dependent on consistent file system access and permissions"],"zh":["需要预定义的资产类型类别和命名约定","依赖于一致的文件系统访问和权限"],"ja":["事前に定義された資産タイプカテゴリと命名規則が必要","一貫したファイルシステムへのアクセスと権限に依存する"],"ko":["사전에 정의된 자산 유형 카테고리 및命명 규칙이 필요","일관된 파일 시스템 액세스 및 권한에 의존"],"es":["Requiere categorías de tipo de activo y convenciones de nomenclatura predefinidas","Depende del acceso y los permisos consistentes del sistema de archivos"],"fr":["Nécessite des catégories de type d''actif et des conventions de dénomination prédéfinies","Dépend de l''accès et des autorisations cohérents du système de fichiers"],"de":["Benötigt vordefinierte Asset-Typkategorien und Benennungskonventionen","Hängt von konsistentem Dateisystemzugriff und -berechtigungen ab"],"pt":["Exige categorias de tipo de ativo e convenções de nomenclatura pré-definidas","Depende do acesso consistente ao sistema de arquivos e permissões"],"ru":["Требует предварительно определенных категорий типов активов и соглашений об именах","Зависит от последовательного доступа к файловой системе и разрешений"],"ar":["يتطلب فئات منوعة من الأصول وتسميات مسبقة التحديد","يعتمد على الوصول المتسق إلى نظام الملفات والصلاحيات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('rchanda1392/VibeCodeProjects/execute', 'community', 'rchanda1392', 'VibeCodeProjects', 'rchanda1392/VibeCodeProjects', 'execute', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.432Z', '2026-02-18T05:15:56.286Z', NULL, '{"id":"rchanda1392/VibeCodeProjects/execute","name":"execute","description":{"es":"El Skill Execute te permite implementar planes de ejecución de forma sistemática y fase por fase, con seguimiento de progreso y creación de tareas","fr":"Le Skill Exécuter vous permet de mettre en œuvre des plans d''exécution de manière systématique et phase par phase, avec suivi de progression et création de tâches","de":"Der Skill Execute ermöglicht es Ihnen, Ausführungspläne systematisch und phase für phase umzusetzen, mit Fortschrittsverfolgung und Erstellung von Aufgaben","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"es":"Ejecutar planes de ejecución de forma sistemática","fr":"Exécuter des plans d''exécution de manière systématique","de":"Systematische Ausführung von Ausführungsplänen","en":"execute"},"description":{"es":"El Skill Execute te permite implementar planes de ejecución de forma sistemática y fase por fase, con seguimiento de progreso y creación de tareas","fr":"Le Skill Exécuter vous permet de mettre en œuvre des plans d''exécution de manière systématique et phase par phase, avec suivi de progression et création de t...","de":"Der Skill Execute ermöglicht es Ihnen, Ausführungspläne systematisch und phase für phase umzusetzen, mit Fortschrittsverfolgung und Erstellung von Aufgaben","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"es":["Carga de planes de ejecución","Seguimiento de progreso en tiempo real","Implementación fase por fase","Creación de tareas con TodoWrite","Sincronización de planes y tareas"],"fr":["Chargement de plans d''exécution","Suivi de progression en temps réel","Mise en œuvre phase par phase","Création de tâches avec TodoWrite","Synchronisation de plans et de tâches"],"de":["Laden von Ausführungsplänen","Fortschrittsverfolgung in Echtzeit","Umsetzung phase für phase","Erstellung von Aufgaben mit TodoWrite","Synchronisation von Plänen und Aufgaben"]},"keywords":{"es":["implementación de planes de ejecución","seguimiento de progreso","creación de tareas","sincronización de planes","TodoWrite","desarrollo de software","gestión de proyectos"],"fr":["mise en œuvre de plans d''exécution","suivi de progression","création de tâches","synchronisation de plans","TodoWrite","développement de logiciels","gestion de projets"],"de":["Umsetzung von Ausführungsplänen","Fortschrittsverfolgung","Erstellung von Aufgaben","Synchronisation von Plänen","TodoWrite","Softwareentwicklung","Projektmanagement"]}},"owner":"rchanda1392","repo":"VibeCodeProjects","repoPath":"rchanda1392/VibeCodeProjects","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.432Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"execute","description":"Execute implementation plans phase-by-phase with progress tracking and automatic checkpoints. Use after /plan to implement the execution roadmap.","bodyPreview":"# Execute Skill\n\nYou are an implementation assistant that systematically executes execution plans. Your role is to work through `EXECUTION_PLAN.md` phase-by-phase, implementing each task while keeping the plan and todos synchronized.\n\n## Your Objectives\n\n1. **Load Execution Plan**: Read and understand EXECUTION_PLAN.md\n2. **Track Progress**: Use TodoWrite to create todos from plan tasks for real-time visibility\n3. **Implement Phase-by-Phase**: Complete one phase at a time, seeking approval befor","body":"# Execute Skill\n\nYou are an implementation assistant that systematically executes execution plans. Your role is to work through `EXECUTION_PLAN.md` phase-by-phase, implementing each task while keeping the plan and todos synchronized.\n\n## Your Objectives\n\n1. **Load Execution Plan**: Read and understand EXECUTION_PLAN.md\n2. **Track Progress**: Use TodoWrite to create todos from plan tasks for real-time visibility\n3. **Implement Phase-by-Phase**: Complete one phase at a time, seeking approval before proceeding\n4. **Handle Errors Gracefully**: Pause on errors, report clearly, ask for guidance\n5. **Verify Success**: Check success criteria after completing each phase\n6. **Update Plan**: Keep EXECUTION_PLAN.md synchronized as you progress\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Initialize Execution\n\nWhen invoked, follow this process:\n\n**A. Locate Execution Plan**\n- Search for `EXECUTION_PLAN.md` in current directory or project root\n- If not found, check for alternative names: `PLAN.md`, `execution-plan.md`\n- If multiple found or none found, ask user which to use or suggest running `/plan` first\n\n**B. Parse Plan Structure**\nExtract from EXECUTION_PLAN.md:\n- **Total phases**: How many phases exist\n- **Current phase**: Which phase to start from (look at status indicators)\n- **Completed work**: What tasks are already marked `[x]`\n- **Open questions**: Any unresolved questions that need answering first\n- **Risks**: Known risks to be aware of\n\n**C. Handle Arguments**\n- No argument: Start from first incomplete phase\n- `resume`: Continue from where last left off\n- Phase number (e.g., `2`, `Phase 2`): Start from that specific phase\n- If user specifies invalid phase, ask for clarification\n\n**D. Check Prerequisites**\nBefore starting execution:\n- Are there open questions that must be answered first?\n- Are there blockers marked in the plan?\n- Are prerequisites for the starting phase met?\n- If any issues, report them and ask how to proceed\n\n**E. Create Todos from Current Phase**\nUse TodoWrite to create todos for all tasks in the current phase:\n- Extract each task from EXECUTION_PLAN.md\n- Create corresponding todo items with status:\n  - `pending`: Not started yet\n  - `in_progress`: Currently working (only one at a time)\n  - `completed`: Already marked `[x]` in plan\n- Use clear, actionable content and activeForm\n\nExample:\n```\nPlan task: \"Task 1.1: Create database schema file\"\nTodo:\n  content: \"Create database schema file\"\n  activeForm: \"Creating database schema file\"\n  status: \"pending\"\n```\n\n**F. Present Execution Summary**\nShow the user:\n- Which phase you''ll be executing\n- How many tasks in this phase\n- What the phase checkpoint criteria are\n- Ask: \"Ready to begin Phase [N]?\"\n\n### 2. Execute Phase\n\nFor each task in the current phase:\n\n**A. Mark Task as In Progress**\n1. Update TodoWrite: Set current task to `in_progress`\n2. Update EXECUTION_PLAN.md: Add a note if helpful (optional for brevity)\n3. Announce to user: \"Starting: [Task description]\"\n\n**B. Implement the Task**\n- Read any files mentioned in \"Files\" section\n- Use appropriate tools (Edit, Write, Bash, etc.)\n- Follow details and requirements from plan\n- Apply best practices and avoid over-engineering\n- Keep changes focused on the specific task\n\n**C. Verify Success Criteria**\n- Check if the task''s success criteria are met\n- Run any verification commands (tests, builds, etc.)\n- If criteria not met, don''t mark complete - report issue\n\n**D. Handle Errors**\nIf you encounter an error or test failure:\n\n1. **Pause execution** immediately\n2. **Report clearly**:\n   - What task you were working on\n   - What error occurred (exact message/output)\n   - What you think might be the cause\n3. **Update plan**: Mark task as 🚫 Blocked if appropriate\n4. **Ask for guidance**: Present options:\n   - Try a different approach\n   - Skip this task and continue\n   - Investigate further\n   - User will fix manually\n   - Abort execution\n5. **Wait for user decision** before proceeding\n\n**E. Mark Task Complete**\nOnce task succeeds and criteria are met:\n1. Update TodoWrite: Set task to `completed`\n2. Update EXECUTION_PLAN.md: Mark task as `[x]`\n3. Brief update to user: \"✓ Completed: [Task description]\"\n\n**F. Move to Next Task**\nRepeat A-E for each task in the phase.\n\n### 3. Phase Checkpoint\n\nAfter completing all tasks in a phase:\n\n**A. Verify Phase Success**\nCheck all checkpoint criteria from EXECUTION_PLAN.md:\n- Are all tasks marked `[x]`?\n- Are the phase-specific verification steps complete?\n- Run any tests or validation mentioned in checkpoint\n\n**B. Update Plan Status**\n1. Mark phase status as ✅ Complete in EXECUTION_PLAN.md\n2. Update \"Last Updated\" timestamp\n3. Add note in \"Notes & Decisions\" if anything significant happened\n\n**C. Clear Current Phase Todos**\n- Mark all todos for current phase as completed in TodoWrite\n- This keeps the todo list clean for next phase\n\n**D. Report Phase Completion**\nShow the user:\n- ✅ Phase [N] complete\n- Summary of what was accomplished (2-3 sentences)\n- Any issues encountered and resolved\n- What the next phase entails (brief preview)\n\n**E. Request Approval for Next Phase**\nAsk: \"Phase [N] complete. Ready to proceed to Phase [N+1]: [Phase Name]?\"\n\nOptions for user:\n- **Yes**: Continue to next phase\n- **Modify plan first**: Pause so user can adjust EXECUTION_PLAN.md\n- **Stop here**: End execution session (user will resume later)\n- **Review changes**: Show what files were modified before continuing\n\n**F. If Approved, Initialize Next Phase**\n- Load tasks from next phase\n- Create new todos via TodoWrite\n- Repeat the Execute Phase workflow\n\n### 4. Completion\n\nWhen all phases are complete:\n\n**A. Mark Plan Complete**\n1. Update EXECUTION_PLAN.md:\n   - Set overall Status to \"✅ Complete\"\n   - Update timestamp\n   - Add completion note with date\n\n**B. Run Final Verification**\nCheck all major success criteria mentioned throughout the plan:\n- Build succeeds (if applicable)\n- Tests pass (if applicable)\n- Core functionality works as designed\n- Success criteria from architecture/requirements are met\n\n**C. Report Success**\nShow the user:\n- 🎉 Execution complete!\n- Summary of all phases completed\n- Verification results\n- List of files created/modified\n- Any outstanding items or recommendations\n\n**D. Clear All Todos**\nMark all remaining todos as completed to clean up the todo list.\n\n### 5. Special Commands\n\nThe skill supports these variations:\n\n**Resume Execution**\n```\n/execute resume\n```\n- Reads current state from EXECUTION_PLAN.md\n- Continues from first incomplete phase\n- Recreates todos for current phase\n\n**Start from Specific Phase**\n```\n/execute 3\n/execute Phase 3\n```\n- Starts execution from specified phase\n- Warns if earlier phases are incomplete\n- Creates todos only for that phase\n\n**Dry Run (Plan Review)**\n```\n/execute --dry-run\n```\n- Shows what would be executed without making changes\n- Useful for reviewing plan before starting\n\n**Continue After Error**\n```\n/execute continue\n```\n- After an error pause, resume from current task\n- Use after user has fixed the issue or provided guidance\n\n## Error Handling Strategy\n\nWhen you encounter errors:\n\n**1. Categorize the Error**\n- **Syntax/Type Error**: Code issue that prevents running\n- **Test Failure**: Code runs but doesn''t meet requirements\n- **Build Error**: Compilation or bundling fails\n- **Dependency Issue**: Missing package or tool\n- **Logic Error**: Code runs but behavior is wrong\n\n**2. Report with Context**\n```\n🚫 Error encountered in Phase [N], Task [N.M]\n\nTask: [Task description]\nError Type: [Category]\nError Message:\n[Exact error output]\n\nPossible Causes:\n- [Your analysis of what might be wrong]\n\nOptions:\n1. [Suggested fix approach]\n2. Skip this task and continue\n3. Stop execution for manual investigation\n```\n\n**3. Wait for User Guidance**\nDon''t proceed until user chooses an option.\n\n**4. Update Plan**\nAdd error details to \"Notes & Decisions\" section so it''s documented.\n\n## Progress Tracking\n\nYou maintain progress in two places simultaneously:\n\n**TodoWrite (Real-time visibility)**\n- Shows current task being worked on\n- User can see active progress at a glance\n- Cleared after each phase for cleanliness\n\n**EXECUTION_PLAN.md (Persistent record)**\n- Marks tasks with `[x]` when complete\n- Updates phase status (⬜ → 🔄 → ✅)\n- Documents decisions and issues in notes\n- Permanent record of execution history\n\nKeep these synchronized - when you mark a todo complete, also mark the task in the plan.\n\n## Key Principles\n\n1. **Phase-by-Phase**: Never skip ahead without completing current phase\n2. **User Approval**: Get explicit approval before moving to next phase\n3. **Error Transparency**: Report all errors immediately and clearly\n4. **No Guessing**: If uncertain, ask rather than assuming\n5. **Synchronized State**: Keep todos and plan file in sync\n6. **Verification First**: Don''t mark complete until success criteria are met\n7. **Clean Progress**: Clear completed todos regularly to reduce noise\n\n## Integration with Other Skills\n\n**After /brainstorm**\n- Creates ARCHITECTURE.md with design\n\n**After /plan**\n- Creates EXECUTION_PLAN.md from architecture\n- Sets up phases and tasks\n\n**During /execute** (this skill)\n- Implements each task\n- Updates plan as you go\n- Tracks progress with todos\n\n**Complete Workflow**\n```\n/brainstorm → ARCHITECTURE.md\n/plan → EXECUTION_PLAN.md\n/execute → Implementation + Updated Plan\n```\n\n## Important Notes\n\n- **Always read files before modifying** - Never edit blindly\n- **Follow the plan** - Don''t add features or make changes not in plan\n- **Verify before marking complete** - Run tests, check output\n- **Report before proceeding** - Keep user informed of progress\n- **Ask when stuck** - Don''t spend time guessing\n- **One task at a time** - Only one todo should be in_progress\n- **Update timestamps** - Keep \"Last Updated\" current in plan\n\n## Tone & Style\n\n- **Systematic**: Work methodically through the plan\n- **Transparent**: Report what you''re doing and why\n- **Cautious**: Verify before marking complete\n- **Communicative**: Keep user informed of progress\n- **Resilient**: Handle errors gracefully, don''t crash\n- **Focused**: Stay on task, don''t over-engineer\n\n---\n\n**Ready to execute? Tell me which phase to start from, or I''ll begin with Phase 1!**\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:15:56.286Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Task Management Agents needing systematic execution plan implementation and synchronization.","zh":"适用于需要系统执行计划实施和同步的任务管理代理。","ja":"タスク管理エージェントが体系的な実行計画の実施と同期を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"시스템적인 실행 계획 구현 및 동기화를 필요로 하는 태스크 관리 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de gestión de tareas que necesitan implementación y sincronización de planes de ejecución sistemáticos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de gestion de tâches nécessitant une mise en œuvre et une synchronisation de plans d''exécution systématiques.","de":"Ideal für Task-Management-Agents, die eine systematische Ausführungsplan-Implementierung und -Synchronisation benötigen.","pt":"Ideal for Task Management Agents needing systematic execution plan implementation and synchronization.","ru":"Ideal for Task Management Agents needing systematic execution plan implementation and synchronization.","ar":"Ideal for Task Management Agents needing systematic execution plan implementation and synchronization."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to systematically execute phase-by-phase plans, utilizing TodoWrite for real-time visibility and synchronization, while working through EXECUTION_PLAN.md files.","zh":"赋予代理系统地执行分阶段计划的能力，利用TodoWrite实现实时可见性和同步，同时处理EXECUTION_PLAN.md文件。","ja":"エージェントに段階的な計画を体系的に実行する能力を与え、TodoWriteを使用してリアルタイムの可視性と同期を実現し、EXECUTION_PLAN.mdファイルを処理します。","ko":"에이전트에게 단계적인 계획을 체계적으로 실행할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, TodoWrite를 사용하여 실시간 가시성 및 동기화를 구현하고, EXECUTION_PLAN.md 파일을 처리합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar planes fase por fase de manera sistemática, utilizando TodoWrite para visibilidad y sincronización en tiempo real, mientras trabajan con archivos EXECUTION_PLAN.md.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des plans phase par phase de manière systématique, en utilisant TodoWrite pour une visibilité et une synchronisation en temps réel, tout en travaillant avec des fichiers EXECUTION_PLAN.md.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Pläne schrittweise systematisch auszuführen, indem sie TodoWrite für Echtzeit-Visibility und -Synchronisation nutzen, während sie mit EXECUTION_PLAN.md-Dateien arbeiten.","pt":"Empowers agents to systematically execute phase-by-phase plans, utilizing TodoWrite for real-time visibility and synchronization, while working through EXECUTION_PLAN.md files.","ru":"Empowers agents to systematically execute phase-by-phase plans, utilizing TodoWrite for real-time visibility and synchronization, while working through EXECUTION_PLAN.md files.","ar":"Empowers agents to systematically execute phase-by-phase plans, utilizing TodoWrite for real-time visibility and synchronization, while working through EXECUTION_PLAN.md files."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing phase-by-phase execution plans","Tracking progress with TodoWrite","Synchronizing todos with execution plan tasks"],"zh":["实施分阶段执行计划","使用TodoWrite跟踪进度","将待办事项与执行计划任务同步"],"ja":["段階的な実行計画の実施","TodoWriteを使用して進度を追跡する","Todoを実行計画のタスクと同期する"],"ko":["단계적인 실행 계획의 구현","TodoWrite를 사용하여 진행 상황을 추적하다","투두를 실행 계획의 태스크와 동기화하다"],"es":["Implementación de planes de ejecución fase por fase","Seguimiento del progreso con TodoWrite","Sincronización de tareas con las tareas del plan de ejecución"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre de plans d''exécution phase par phase","Suivi de la progression avec TodoWrite","Synchronisation des tâches avec les tâches du plan d''exécution"],"de":["Implementierung von Ausführungsplänen schrittweise","Verfolgung des Fortschritts mit TodoWrite","Synchronisation von Aufgaben mit den Aufgaben des Ausführungsplans"],"pt":["Implementing phase-by-phase execution plans","Tracking progress with TodoWrite","Synchronizing todos with execution plan tasks"],"ru":["Implementing phase-by-phase execution plans","Tracking progress with TodoWrite","Synchronizing todos with execution plan tasks"],"ar":["Implementing phase-by-phase execution plans","Tracking progress with TodoWrite","Synchronizing todos with execution plan tasks"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to EXECUTION_PLAN.md files","TodoWrite integration necessary"],"zh":["需要访问EXECUTION_PLAN.md文件","需要TodoWrite集成"],"ja":["EXECUTION_PLAN.mdファイルへのアクセスが必要","TodoWriteの統合が必要"],"ko":["EXECUTION_PLAN.md 파일에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다","TodoWrite 통합이 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere acceso a archivos EXECUTION_PLAN.md","Necesaria integración con TodoWrite"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux fichiers EXECUTION_PLAN.md","Intégration à TodoWrite nécessaire"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf EXECUTION_PLAN.md-Dateien","TodoWrite-Integration erforderlich"],"pt":["Requires access to EXECUTION_PLAN.md files","TodoWrite integration necessary"],"ru":["Requires access to EXECUTION_PLAN.md files","TodoWrite integration necessary"],"ar":["Requires access to EXECUTION_PLAN.md files","TodoWrite integration necessary"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('gpt-cmdr/hms-commander/executing-hms-runs', 'community', 'gpt-cmdr', 'hms-commander', 'gpt-cmdr/hms-commander', 'executing-hms-runs', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.432Z', '2026-02-18T05:16:05.153Z', NULL, '{"id":"gpt-cmdr/hms-commander/executing-hms-runs","name":"executing-hms-runs","description":{"zh":"HEC-HMS hms-commander, Python","ja":"HEC-HMShms-commanderPython","ko":"HEC-HMS hms-commander, Python","es":"La biblioteca hms-commander permite automatizar corridas HEC-HMS de manera eficiente. Puedes ejecutar corridas individuales y paralelas con facilidad","fr":"La bibliothèque hms-commander permet d''automatiser les exécutions HEC-HMS de manière efficace. Vous pouvez exécuter des runs individuels et parallèles avec facilité","de":"Die Bibliothek hms-commander ermöglicht die Automatisierung von HEC-HMS-Läufen auf effiziente Weise. Sie können einzelne und parallele Läufe mit Leichtigkeit ausführen","pt":"A biblioteca hms-commander permite a automação de runs do HEC-HMS. Execute simulações em paralelo e otimize seus projetos","ru":"Библиотека hms-commander позволяет автоматизировать запуски HEC-HMS. Выполняйте симуляции параллельно и оптимизируйте свои проекты","ar":"مكتبة hms-commander تسمح بأتمتة تشغيل HEC-HMS. تشغيل محاكاة متوازي وتحسين مشاريعك","en":"HEC-HMS automation library (hms-commander)"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"HEC-HMS ","ja":"HEC-HMS","ko":"HEC-HMS ","es":"Automatización HEC-HMS con hms-commander","fr":"Exécution HEC-HMS avec hms-commander","de":"HEC-HMS-Automatisierung mit hms-commander","pt":"Executando HEC-HMS com hms-commander","ru":"Выполнение HEC-HMS с помощью hms-commander","ar":"تشغيل HEC-HMS باستخدام hms-commander","en":"executing-hms-runs"},"description":{"zh":"HEC-HMS hms-commander, Python","ja":"HEC-HMShms-commanderPython","ko":"HEC-HMS hms-commander, Python","es":"La biblioteca hms-commander permite automatizar corridas HEC-HMS de manera eficiente. Puedes ejecutar corridas individuales y paralelas con facilidad","fr":"La bibliothèque hms-commander permet d''automatiser les exécutions HEC-HMS de manière efficace. Vous pouvez exécuter des runs individuels et parallèles avec f...","de":"Die Bibliothek hms-commander ermöglicht die Automatisierung von HEC-HMS-Läufen auf effiziente Weise. Sie können einzelne und parallele Läufe mit Leichtigkeit...","pt":"A biblioteca hms-commander permite a automação de runs do HEC-HMS. Execute simulações em paralelo e otimize seus projetos","ru":"Библиотека hms-commander позволяет автоматизировать запуски HEC-HMS. Выполняйте симуляции параллельно и оптимизируйте свои проекты","ar":"مكتبة hms-commander تسمح بأتمتة تشغيل HEC-HMS. تشغيل محاكاة متوازي وتحسين مشاريعك","en":"HEC-HMS automation library (hms-commander)"},"definition":{"en":"HEC-HMS automation library (hms-commander)"},"features":{"zh":["HEC-HMS","hms-commander","Python","API","Parallel"],"ja":["HEC-HMS","hms-commander","Python","API","Parallel"],"ko":["HEC-HMS","hms-commander","Python","API","Parallel"],"es":["Ejecución de corridas individuales","Ejecución de corridas paralelas","Automatización de procesos HEC-HMS","Integración con Python","Documentación completa con ejemplos"],"fr":["Exécution de runs individuels","Exécution de runs parallèles","Automatisation des processus HEC-HMS","Intégration avec Python","Documentation complète avec exemples"],"de":["Ausführung von einzelnen Läufen","Ausführung von parallelen Läufen","Automatisierung von HEC-HMS-Prozessen","Integration mit Python","Vollständige Dokumentation mit Beispielen"],"pt":["Execução de simulações em paralelo","Automação de runs do HEC-HMS","Otimização de projetos","Integração com HEC-HMS","Suporte a múltiplos runs"],"ru":["Параллельное выполнение симуляций","Автоматизация запусков HEC-HMS","Оптимизация проектов","Интеграция с HEC-HMS","Поддержка нескольких запусков"],"ar":["تشغيل محاكاة متوازي","أتمتة تشغيل HEC-HMS","تحسين مشاريع","التكامل مع HEC-HMS","دعم تشغيل متعدد"]},"keywords":{"zh":["HEC-HMS","hms-commander","Python","API","Parallel","Automation","Library"],"ja":["HEC-HMS","hms-commander","Python","API","Parallel","Automation","Library"],"ko":["HEC-HMS","hms-commander","Python","API","Parallel","Automation","Library"],"es":["HEC-HMS","automatización","hms-commander","Python","corridas paralelas","procesos HEC-HMS","biblioteca de automatización","ejecución de corridas"],"fr":["HEC-HMS","automatisation","hms-commander","Python","runs parallèles","processus HEC-HMS","bibliothèque d''automatisation","exécution de runs"],"de":["HEC-HMS","Automatisierung","hms-commander","Python","parallele Läufe","HEC-HMS-Prozesse","Automatisierungsbibliothek","Ausführung von Läufen"],"pt":["HEC-HMS","hms-commander","automação","simulação","paralelo","otimização","projetos","integração"],"ru":["HEC-HMS","hms-commander","автоматизация","симуляция","параллельное","оптимизация","проекты","интеграция"],"ar":["HEC-HMS","hms-commander","أتمتة","محاكاة","متوازي","تحسين","مشاريع","تكامل"]}},"owner":"gpt-cmdr","repo":"hms-commander","repoPath":"gpt-cmdr/hms-commander","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.432Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"executing-hms-runs","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Executing HEC-HMS Runs\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```python\nfrom hms_commander import init_hms_project, HmsCmdr\n\n# Initialize project\ninit_hms_project(r\"C:\\Projects\\watershed\")\n\n# Execute single run\nHmsCmdr.compute_run(\"Run 1\")\n\n# Execute multiple runs in parallel\nHmsCmdr.compute_parallel([\"Run 1\", \"Run 2\", \"Run 3\"], max_workers=2)\n```\n\n## Primary Sources\n\n**Code (Authoritative API)**:\n- `hms_commander/HmsCmdr.py` - Execution engine with complete docstrings\n- `hms_commander/HmsJython.py` - Script genera","body":"# Executing HEC-HMS Runs\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```python\nfrom hms_commander import init_hms_project, HmsCmdr\n\n# Initialize project\ninit_hms_project(r\"C:\\Projects\\watershed\")\n\n# Execute single run\nHmsCmdr.compute_run(\"Run 1\")\n\n# Execute multiple runs in parallel\nHmsCmdr.compute_parallel([\"Run 1\", \"Run 2\", \"Run 3\"], max_workers=2)\n```\n\n## Primary Sources\n\n**Code (Authoritative API)**:\n- `hms_commander/HmsCmdr.py` - Execution engine with complete docstrings\n- `hms_commander/HmsJython.py` - Script generation and version detection\n\n**Examples (Working Demonstrations)**:\n- `examples/01_multi_version_execution.ipynb` - Complete workflow\n- `examples/04_hms_workflow.ipynb` - End-to-end simulation\n\n**Rules (Patterns & Decisions)**:\n- `.claude/rules/hec-hms/execution.md` - Execution patterns\n- `.claude/rules/hec-hms/version-support.md` - HMS 3.x vs 4.x differences\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n**Trigger Scenarios**:\n- User says \"run HMS simulation\"\n- User says \"execute this model\"\n- User says \"compute all runs in parallel\"\n- User mentions \"Jython script\"\n- Working with HMS 3.x (requires Python 2 compatibility)\n- Need to execute batch simulations\n- Setting up automated workflows\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\n### 1. Single Run Execution\n\n**Pattern**: Initialize → Compute → Verify\n\nSee `reference/compute_run.md` for complete API details.\n\n**Key Decision**: When to use `compute_run()` vs `compute_test_mode()`\n- Use `compute_run()` for actual simulation\n- Use `compute_test_mode()` to validate setup without running\n\n### 2. Parallel Execution\n\n**Pattern**: Batch runs across multiple workers\n\nSee `reference/parallel.md` for parallel execution strategies.\n\n**Key Decision**: How many workers?\n- Default: 2 workers (safe for most systems)\n- CPU-bound: Use `os.cpu_count() - 1`\n- Memory-constrained: Use 1 worker (sequential)\n- Large models: Consider memory per run × workers\n\n### 3. Jython Script Generation\n\n**Pattern**: Generate version-appropriate script → Execute via HMS\n\nSee `reference/jython.md` for script generation details.\n\n**Critical Decision**: HMS 3.x vs 4.x\n- HMS 3.x: MUST use `python2_compatible=True`\n- HMS 4.x: Use default (Python 3 syntax)\n- Auto-detection: Check install path contains \"(x86)\" = 3.x\n\n## HMS Version Awareness\n\n**This skill handles BOTH HMS 3.x and 4.x**:\n\n| Aspect | HMS 3.x | HMS 4.x |\n|--------|---------|---------|\n| Architecture | 32-bit | 64-bit |\n| Python Syntax | Python 2 (`print \"x\"`) | Python 3 (`print(\"x\")`) |\n| Script Flag | `python2_compatible=True` | Default |\n| Max Memory | ~1.3 GB | 32+ GB |\n| Install Path | `Program Files (x86)` | `Program Files` |\n\n**See**: `.claude/rules/hec-hms/version-support.md` for complete differences\n\n## Common Workflows\n\n### Workflow 1: Basic Execution\n\n```python\nfrom hms_commander import init_hms_project, HmsCmdr\n\ninit_hms_project(r\"C:\\Projects\\watershed\")\nHmsCmdr.compute_run(\"Run 1\")\n```\n\n**See**: `examples/basic-run.md` for complete walkthrough\n\n### Workflow 2: Batch Execution (Sequential)\n\n```python\nruns = [\"Baseline\", \"Alternative_1\", \"Alternative_2\"]\nHmsCmdr.compute_batch(runs)\n```\n\n**See**: `examples/batch-runs.md` for batch strategies\n\n### Workflow 3: Parallel Execution\n\n```python\nruns = [\"Run_1\", \"Run_2\", \"Run_3\", \"Run_4\"]\nHmsCmdr.compute_parallel(runs, max_workers=2)\n```\n\n**See**: `reference/parallel.md` for worker allocation\n\n### Workflow 4: Legacy HMS 3.x Project\n\n```python\nfrom hms_commander import HmsJython\n\n# Generate Python 2 compatible script\nscript = HmsJython.generate_compute_script(\n    project_path=r\"C:\\Projects\\old_project\",\n    run_name=\"Run 1\",\n    python2_compatible=True  # CRITICAL for HMS 3.x!\n)\n\n# Execute with HMS 3.x\nsuccess, stdout, stderr = HmsJython.execute_script(\n    script_content=script,\n    hms_exe_path=r\"C:\\Program Files (x86)\\HEC\\HEC-HMS\\3.5\"\n)\n```\n\n**See**: `.claude/rules/hec-hms/version-support.md` for legacy workflows\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n**Common Issues**:\n\n1. **HMS Not Found**: See `reference/jython.md#finding-hms`\n2. **Memory Errors**: See `reference/jython.md#memory-allocation`\n3. **Python 2 Syntax Errors**: See `.claude/rules/hec-hms/version-support.md`\n4. **Parallel Execution Hangs**: See `reference/parallel.md#debugging`\n\n## Integration Points\n\n**Before Execution**:\n- Use `HmsBasin` to modify parameters (see `parsing-basin-models` skill)\n- Use `HmsMet` to update precipitation (see `updating-met-models` skill)\n- Use `HmsControl` to set time window (see `.claude/rules/hec-hms/control-files.md`)\n\n**After Execution**:\n- Use `HmsDss` to extract results (see `extracting-dss-results` skill)\n- Use `HmsResults` for analysis (see `.claude/rules/hec-hms/dss-operations.md`)\n\n## Reference Files\n\n**Detailed API Documentation** (load on-demand):\n- `reference/compute_run.md` - HmsCmdr.compute_run() complete API\n- `reference/parallel.md` - Parallel execution strategies\n- `reference/jython.md` - Script generation and execution\n- `reference/troubleshooting.md` - Common issues and solutions\n\n**Complete Examples** (working code):\n- `examples/basic-run.md` - Simple single run\n- `examples/batch-runs.md` - Sequential batch execution\n- `examples/parallel-runs.md` - Parallel execution with worker allocation\n- `examples/legacy-3x.md` - HMS 3.x compatibility\n\n## Testing This Skill\n\nUse real HMS projects for testing:\n\n```python\nfrom hms_commander import HmsExamples\n\n# Extract example project\nHmsExamples.extract_project(\"tifton\")\n\n# Test execution\ninit_hms_project(\"tifton/tifton\")\nHmsCmdr.compute_run(\"1970_simulation\")\n```\n\n**See**: `.claude/rules/testing/tdd-approach.md` for testing philosophy\n\n## Key Patterns (Not in Primary Sources)\n\n### Pattern 1: Destination Folder Management\n\nHMS creates output in the project folder. For organized results:\n\n```python\n# Results go to project_folder/results/RUN_<run_name>.results\n# DSS file location specified in .run file\n```\n\n**Decision**: HMS writes to project folder, not a separate destination folder like RAS.\n\n### Pattern 2: Version Auto-Detection\n\n```python\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nhms_path = Path(r\"C:\\Program Files (x86)\\HEC\\HEC-HMS\\3.5\")\nis_3x = \"(x86)\" in str(hms_path)  # 32-bit = HMS 3.x\npython2_compatible = is_3x\n```\n\n**Decision**: Use install path pattern for version detection, not HMS version file.\n\n### Pattern 3: Error Handling\n\n```python\ntry:\n    HmsCmdr.compute_run(\"Run 1\")\nexcept Exception as e:\n    # Check HMS log file for details\n    log_file = hms.project_folder / f\"RUN_Run 1.log\"\n    if log_file.exists():\n        print(log_file.read_text())\n    raise\n```\n\n**Decision**: HMS errors appear in log files, check those for diagnostics.\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **parsing-basin-models** - Modify parameters before execution\n- **updating-met-models** - Update precipitation before execution\n- **extracting-dss-results** - Process outputs after execution\n- **cloning-hms-components** - Create QAQC comparison runs\n- **managing-hms-versions** - Multi-version testing workflows\n\n---\n\n**Navigation**: This skill points to primary sources. For complete API details, read the code docstrings in `hms_commander/HmsCmdr.py` and `hms_commander/HmsJython.py`.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:16:05.153Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Hydrological Modeling Agents needing automation of HEC-HMS runs.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化 HEC-HMS 运行的水文模型代理","ja":"HEC-HMS の実行の自動化が必要な水文モデリングエージェントに最適","ko":"HEC-HMS 실행 자동화가 필요한 수문 모형 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de modelado hidrológico que necesitan automatizar las ejecuciones de HEC-HMS.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de modélisation hydrologique ayant besoin d''automatiser les exécutions de HEC-HMS.","de":"Perfekt für hydrologische Modellierungsagenten, die die Automatisierung von HEC-HMS-Läufen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Modelagem Hidrológica que necessitam de automação de execuções do HEC-HMS.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов гидрологического моделирования, которым требуется автоматизация запусков HEC-HMS.","ar":"مثالي لعميل النمذجة الهيدرولوجية الذي يحتاج إلى آليّة تشغيل HEC-HMS."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate HEC-HMS simulations using the hms-commander library, enabling parallel execution of multiple runs and efficient project initialization with init_hms_project, while leveraging HmsCmdr for compute_run and compute_parallel functionalities.","zh":"通过 hms-commander 库实现 HEC-HMS 模拟的自动化，支持多运行的并行执行和使用 init_hms_project 进行高效的项目初始化，同时利用 HmsCmdr 的 compute_run 和 compute_parallel 功能","ja":"hms-commander ライブラリを使用して HEC-HMS シミュレーションの自動化を可能にし、複数の実行の並列実行と init_hms_project を使用した効率的なプロジェクト初期化をサポートし、HmsCmdr の compute_run と compute_parallel 機能を利用","ko":"hms-commander 라이브러리를 사용하여 HEC-HMS 시뮬레이션의 자동화를 가능하게 하며, 여러 실행의 병렬 실행과 init_hms_project를 사용한 효율적인 프로젝트 초기화를 지원하며, HmsCmdr의 compute_run 및 compute_parallel 기능을 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar simulaciones de HEC-HMS utilizando la biblioteca hms-commander, lo que permite la ejecución paralela de múltiples corridas y una inicialización eficiente de proyectos con init_hms_project, aprovechando HmsCmdr para funcionalidades de compute_run y compute_parallel.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les simulations de HEC-HMS en utilisant la bibliothèque hms-commander, permettant l''exécution parallèle de plusieurs exécutions et une initialisation efficace de projets avec init_hms_project, en exploitant HmsCmdr pour les fonctionnalités de compute_run et compute_parallel.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, HEC-HMS-Simulationen mithilfe der hms-commander-Bibliothek zu automatisieren, wodurch die parallele Ausführung mehrerer Läufe und eine effiziente Projekteinrichtung mit init_hms_project ermöglicht wird, während HmsCmdr für compute_run- und compute_parallel-Funktionen genutzt wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar simulações do HEC-HMS usando a biblioteca hms-commander, permitindo a execução paralela de várias execuções e uma inicialização eficiente de projetos com init_hms_project, aproveitando HmsCmdr para funcionalidades compute_run e compute_parallel.","ru":"Позволяет агентам автоматизировать симуляции HEC-HMS с помощью библиотеки hms-commander, обеспечивая параллельное выполнение нескольких запусков и эффективную инициализацию проектов с init_hms_project, используя HmsCmdr для функций compute_run и compute_parallel.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من آليّة تشغيل محاكاة HEC-HMS باستخدام مكتبة hms-commander، وتمكين تنفيذ متوازي للعديد من العمليات وبدء مشاريع فعالة باستخدام init_hms_project، واستغلال HmsCmdr لوظائف compute_run وcompute_parallel."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating HEC-HMS model runs for watershed analysis","Executing multiple HEC-HMS scenarios in parallel for comparative studies","Initializing and managing HEC-HMS projects programmatically"],"zh":["自动化水系分析的 HEC-HMS 模型运行","并行执行多个 HEC-HMS 方案以进行比较研究","程序化地初始化和管理 HEC-HMS 项目"],"ja":["水系分析のための HEC-HMS モデル実行の自動化","比較研究のための複数の HEC-HMS シナリオの並列実行","プログラムによる HEC-HMS プロジェクトの初期化と管理"],"ko":["수문 분석을 위한 HEC-HMS 모델 실행의 자동화","비교 연구를 위한 여러 HEC-HMS 시나리오의 병렬 실행","프로그램을 통한 HEC-HMS 프로젝트의 초기화 및 관리"],"es":["Automatizar las corridas del modelo HEC-HMS para el análisis de cuencas","Ejecutar múltiples escenarios de HEC-HMS en paralelo para estudios comparativos","Inicializar y administrar proyectos de HEC-HMS de forma programática"],"fr":["Automatiser les exécutions du modèle HEC-HMS pour l''analyse des bassins","Exécuter plusieurs scénarios de HEC-HMS en parallèle pour des études comparatives","Initialiser et gérer les projets de HEC-HMS de manière programmatique"],"de":["Automatisieren von HEC-HMS-Modellläufen für die Analyse von Wassereinzugsgebieten","Ausführen mehrerer HEC-HMS-Szenarien in Parallel für vergleichende Studien","Initialisieren und verwalten von HEC-HMS-Projekten programmgesteuert"],"pt":["Automatizar execuções de modelos HEC-HMS para análise de bacias hidrográficas","Executar múltiplos cenários HEC-HMS em paralelo para estudos comparativos","Inicializar e gerenciar projetos HEC-HMS programaticamente"],"ru":["Автоматизация запусков моделей HEC-HMS для анализа водосборов","Выполнение нескольких сценариев HEC-HMS в параллели для сравнительных исследований","Программная инициализация и управление проектами HEC-HMS"],"ar":["آليّة تشغيل نماذج HEC-HMS للتحليل المائي","تشغيل سيناريوهات متعددة من HEC-HMS بشكل متوازي للدراسات المقارنة","بدء مشاريع HEC-HMS وإدارتها برمجيًا"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires hms-commander library installation","Dependent on HEC-HMS software","Python environment required"],"zh":["需要安装 hms-commander 库","依赖于 HEC-HMS 软件","需要 Python 环境"],"ja":["hms-commander ライブラリのインストールが必要","HEC-HMS ソフトウェアに依存","Python 環境が必要"],"ko":["hms-commander 라이브러리의 설치가 필요","HEC-HMS 소프트웨어에 의존","Python 환경이 필요"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de la biblioteca hms-commander","Dependiente del software HEC-HMS","Entorno de Python requerido"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de la bibliothèque hms-commander","Dépendant du logiciel HEC-HMS","Environnement Python requis"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation der hms-commander-Bibliothek","Abhängig von der HEC-HMS-Software","Python-Umgebung erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer instalação da biblioteca hms-commander","Dependente do software HEC-HMS","Ambiente Python necessário"],"ru":["Требуется установка библиотеки hms-commander","Зависит от программного обеспечения HEC-HMS","Требуется среда Python"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت مكتبة hms-commander","يعتمد على برنامج HEC-HMS","يتطلب بيئة بايثون"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('RustyLindquist/EnhancedHR/handoff', 'community', 'RustyLindquist', 'EnhancedHR', 'RustyLindquist/EnhancedHR', 'handoff', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.432Z', '2026-02-18T05:15:30.134Z', NULL, '{"id":"RustyLindquist/EnhancedHR/handoff","name":"handoff","description":{"zh":"handoff 技术是一种实现跨会话工作传递的方法，通过记录和传递工作进度，提高开发效率","ja":"ハンドオフ技術は、セッション間の作業の移行を実現する方法で、作業の進捗を記録して伝達することで開発効率を向上させる","ko":"핸드오프 기술은 세션 간 작업 전달을 구현하는 방법으로, 작업 진행 상황을 기록하여 전달함으로써 개발 효율성을 향상시킵니다","es":"Handoff es una técnica para garantizar la continuidad del trabajo entre sesiones, mejorando la eficiencia y reduciendo la pérdida de contexto","fr":"Handoff est une technique pour assurer la continuité du travail entre les sessions, améliorant l''efficacité et réduisant la perte de contexte","de":"Handoff ist eine Technik, um die Arbeitskontinuität zwischen Sitzungen zu gewährleisten, die Effizienz zu verbessern und den Kontextverlust zu reduzieren","pt":"A técnica de handoff permite que o trabalho seja portátil entre sessões, melhorando a produtividade e a colaboração em equipe.","ru":"Техника handoff позволяет сделать работу портативной между сессиями, повышая производительность и командную работу.","ar":"تتيح تقنية handoff جعل العمل قابل للنقل بين الجلسات، مما يحسن الإنتاجية والتعاون الفريق.","en":"An AI-Enhanced Online Academy for HR"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"handoff 技术：跨会话工作传递","ja":"ハンドオフ技術：セッション間の作業の移行","ko":"핸드오프 기술: 세션 간 작업 전달","es":"Handoff: Continuidad de trabajo en sesiones","fr":"Handoff : Continuité de travail dans les sessions","de":"Handoff: Arbeitskontinuität über Sitzungen hinweg","pt":"Handoff: Técnica de Continuidade de Trabalho","ru":"Handoff: Метод Передачи Работы","ar":"Handoff: تقنية استمرار العمل","en":"handoff"},"description":{"zh":"handoff 技术是一种实现跨会话工作传递的方法，通过记录和传递工作进度，提高开发效率","ja":"ハンドオフ技術は、セッション間の作業の移行を実現する方法で、作業の進捗を記録して伝達することで開発効率を向上させる","ko":"핸드오프 기술은 세션 간 작업 전달을 구현하는 방법으로, 작업 진행 상황을 기록하여 전달함으로써 개발 효율성을 향상시킵니다","es":"Handoff es una técnica para garantizar la continuidad del trabajo entre sesiones, mejorando la eficiencia y reduciendo la pérdida de contexto","fr":"Handoff est une technique pour assurer la continuité du travail entre les sessions, améliorant l''efficacité et réduisant la perte de contexte","de":"Handoff ist eine Technik, um die Arbeitskontinuität zwischen Sitzungen zu gewährleisten, die Effizienz zu verbessern und den Kontextverlust zu reduzieren","pt":"A técnica de handoff permite que o trabalho seja portátil entre sessões, melhorando a produtividade e a colaboração em equipe.","ru":"Техника handoff позволяет сделать работу портативной между сессиями, повышая производительность и командную работу.","ar":"تتيح تقنية handoff جعل العمل قابل للنقل بين الجلسات، مما يحسن الإنتاجية والتعاون الفريق.","en":"An AI-Enhanced Online Academy for HR"},"definition":{"en":"An AI-Enhanced Online Academy for HR"},"features":{"zh":["跨会话工作传递","记录和传递工作进度","提高开发效率","简化工作流程","减少错误和遗漏"],"ja":["セッション間の作業の移行","作業の進捗を記録して伝達","開発効率を向上させる","ワークフローを簡素化する","エラーとミスの削減"],"ko":["세션 간 작업 전달","작업 진행 상황을 기록하여 전달","개발 효율성을 향상시키기","작업 흐름을 단순화하기","오류와 누락을 줄이기"],"es":["Gestión de contexto de trabajo","Documentación de progreso","Verificación de trabajo correcto","Identificación de tareas pendientes","Preparación para la próxima sesión"],"fr":["Gestion du contexte de travail","Documentation des progrès","Vérification du travail correct","Identification des tâches en cours","Préparation pour la prochaine session"],"de":["Arbeitskontext-Verwaltung","Dokumentation des Fortschritts","Überprüfung der korrekten Arbeit","Identifizierung von offenen Aufgaben","Vorbereitung für die nächste Sitzung"],"pt":["Permite a continuidade de trabalho entre sessões","Melhora a produtividade e a colaboração em equipe","Ajuda a compactar o contexto de trabalho","Fornece um processo claro para a documentação e verificação do trabalho","Permite a identificação de tarefas incompletas e bloqueios"],"ru":["Позволяет обеспечить непрерывность работы между сессиями","Повышает производительность и командную работу","Помогает компактно представлять контекст работы","Предоставляет четкий процесс для документации и верификации работы","Позволяет выявлять незавершенные задачи и блокировки"],"ar":["تتيح استمرار العمل بين الجلسات","تحسن الإنتاجية والتعاون الفريق","تساعد على ضغط سياق العمل","توفر عملية واضحة للتدوين والتحقق من العمل","تتيح تحديد المهام غير المكتملة والحواجز"]},"keywords":{"zh":["handoff 技术","跨会话工作传递","在线开发方法","开发效率","工作流程","错误和遗漏","开发工具","开发技术"],"ja":["ハンドオフ技術","セッション間の作業の移行","オンライン開発方法","開発効率","ワークフロー","エラーとミス","開発ツール","開発技術"],"ko":["핸드오프 기술","세션 간 작업 전달","온라인 개발 방법","개발 효율성","작업 흐름","오류와 누락","개발 도구","개발 기술"],"es":["handoff","continuidad de trabajo","gestión de contexto","documentación de progreso","verificación de trabajo","desarrollo de software","productividad"],"fr":["handoff","continuité de travail","gestion du contexte","documentation des progrès","vérification du travail","développement de logiciels","productivité"],"de":["handoff","arbeitskontinuität","arbeitskontext-verwaltung","dokumentation des fortschritts","überprüfung der arbeit","software-entwicklung","produktivität"],"pt":["handoff","continuidade de trabalho","produtividade","colaboração em equipe","compactação de contexto","documentação de trabalho"],"ru":["handoff","непрерывность работы","производительность","командная работа","компактное представление контекста","документация работы"],"ar":["handoff","استمرار العمل","الإنتاجية","التعاون الفريق","ضغط السياق","تدوين العمل"]}},"owner":"RustyLindquist","repo":"EnhancedHR","repoPath":"RustyLindquist/EnhancedHR","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.432Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"handoff","description":"Writes comprehensive handoff note at session end. Captures work done, files changed, remaining tasks, and next steps. Use before ending any work session or switching contexts.","bodyPreview":"# Handoff\n\nMake work portable across sessions. Write to `.context/handoff.md`.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- End of every work session\n- Before switching tasks or contexts\n- Before user leaves\n- When compacting context\n\n## Process\n\n1. **Gather**: What was requested? What did we do? What changed?\n2. **Document**: Files, agents, decisions, docs updated\n3. **Verify**: How to confirm the work is correct\n4. **Remaining**: What''s incomplete, issues, blockers\n5. **Prepare**: What does next session need?\n\n## Outpu","body":"# Handoff\n\nMake work portable across sessions. Write to `.context/handoff.md`.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- End of every work session\n- Before switching tasks or contexts\n- Before user leaves\n- When compacting context\n\n## Process\n\n1. **Gather**: What was requested? What did we do? What changed?\n2. **Document**: Files, agents, decisions, docs updated\n3. **Verify**: How to confirm the work is correct\n4. **Remaining**: What''s incomplete, issues, blockers\n5. **Prepare**: What does next session need?\n\n## Output Location\n\nWrite to: `.context/handoff.md`\n\n## Essential Sections\n\n```markdown\n# Session Handoff — [Date]\n\n## Summary\n[2-3 sentences: what was accomplished]\n\n## Work Completed\n- [Feature/fix]: [description]\n\n## Files Changed\n| File | Change | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| path | modified | what changed |\n\n## Verification\n[Commands to run, UI to check, tests to execute]\n\n## Remaining\n- [ ] [Incomplete task]\n- **Issue**: [description + workaround]\n\n## Next Session\n1. Run `/session-start`\n2. Load [specific docs]\n3. Start with [first action]\n```\n\n## Quick Handoff (Short Sessions)\n\n```markdown\n# Quick Handoff — [Date]\n**Did**: [one sentence]\n**Changed**: [file list]\n**Verify**: [one command/action]\n**Next**: [what to do]\n```\n\n## Quality Check\n\n- [ ] Summary is specific, not vague\n- [ ] All changed files listed\n- [ ] Verification steps are actionable\n- [ ] Remaining work is explicit\n- [ ] Next session can start immediately\n\n## Related\n\n- Full template: See [reference/full-template.md](reference/full-template.md)\n- Compaction handoff: See [reference/compact-handoff.md](reference/compact-handoff.md)\n- Consumed by: `/session-start`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:15:30.134Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code needing session persistence and context handoff capabilities.","zh":"适合需要会话持久性和上下文交接能力的AI代理，如Cursor、Windsurf和Claude Code。","ja":"セッション永続性とコンテキストハンドオフ機能が必要なAIエージェント、たとえばCursor、Windsurf、Claude Codeに適しています。","ko":"세션 지속성 및 컨텍스트 핸드오버 기능이 필요한 AI 에이전트인 Cursor, Windsurf 및 Claude Code에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf y Claude Code que necesitan persistencia de sesión y capacidades de transferencia de contexto.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA comme Cursor, Windsurf et Claude Code nécessitant une persistance de session et des capacités de transfert de contexte.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents wie Cursor, Windsurf und Claude Code, die Sitzungspersistenz und Kontextübergabefunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf e Claude Code que necessitam de persistência de sessão e capacidades de transferência de contexto.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor, Windsurf и Claude Code, которым необходимы возможности сохранения сеанса и передачи контекста.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Cursor و Windsurf و Claude Code الذين يحتاجون إلى استمرار الجلسة وクابILITIES لتحويل السياق."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to maintain work continuity across sessions by writing to `.context/handoff.md`, ensuring seamless task switching and context compaction using Markdown documentation and verification protocols.","zh":"通过将数据写入 `.context/handoff.md` 文件，使得代理能够在会话之间保持工作连续性，并使用Markdown文档和验证协议实现无缝的任务切换和上下文压缩。","ja":"`.context/handoff.md` にデータを書き込むことで、セッション間で作業の連続性を維持し、Markdown ドキュメントと検証プロトコルを使用してシームレスなタスクの切り替えとコンテキストの圧縮を実現します。","ko":"`.context/handoff.md` 파일에 데이터를 작성하여 에이전트가 세션 간에 작업 연속성을 유지하고, 마크다운 문서 및 검증 프로토콜을 사용하여 무缝한 작업 전환 및 컨텍스트 압축을 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a mantener la continuidad del trabajo entre sesiones al escribir en `.context/handoff.md`, garantizando un cambio de tarea y una compactación de contexto sin problemas, utilizando documentación y protocolos de verificación de Markdown.","fr":"Permet aux agents de maintenir la continuité du travail entre sessions en écrivant dans `.context/handoff.md`, assurant un commutation de tâche et une compactation de contexte sans heurts, en utilisant la documentation et les protocoles de vérification de Markdown.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, die Arbeitskontinuität zwischen den Sitzungen aufrechtzuerhalten, indem sie in `.context/handoff.md` schreiben, und stellt so einen nahtlosen Aufgabenwechsel und eine Kontextkompaktion unter Verwendung von Markdown-Dokumentation und Überprüfungsprotokollen sicher.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a manter a continuidade do trabalho entre as sessões, escrevendo em `.context/handoff.md`, garantindo a alternância de tarefas e a compactação de contexto sem interrupções, utilizando documentação e protocolos de verificação em Markdown.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью поддерживать непрерывность работы между сеансами, записывая в `.context/handoff.md`, обеспечивая бесшовное переключение задач и компактацию контекста с помощью документации и протоколов проверки Markdown.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على الحفاظ على استمرار العمل عبر الجلسات عن طريق الكتابة إلى `.context/handoff.md`، مما يضمن تبديل المهام وتكثيف السياق بشكل متواصل باستخدام توثيق بروتوكولات التحقق Markdown."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating session wrap-ups","Generating task summaries","Compacting context for next sessions","Documenting decisions and updates"],"zh":["自动化会话总结","生成任务摘要","压缩下一个会话的上下文","记录决策和更新"],"ja":["セッションのラッピングを自動化する","タスクのサマリーを生成する","次のセッションのコンテキストを圧縮する","決定と更新を文書化する"],"ko":["세션 종료를 자동화하는","작업 요약을 생성하는","다음 세션의 컨텍스트를 압축하는","결정과 업데이트를 문서화하는"],"es":["Automatizar las sesiones de cierre","Generar resúmenes de tareas","Compactar el contexto para las próximas sesiones","Documentar decisiones y actualizaciones"],"fr":["Automatiser les sessions de fermeture","Générer des résumés de tâches","Compacter le contexte pour les prochaines sessions","Documenter les décisions et les mises à jour"],"de":["Sitzungsabschlüsse automatisieren","Aufgabenübersichten generieren","Kontext für die nächsten Sitzungen kompaktieren","Entscheidungen und Updates dokumentieren"],"pt":["Automatizar a conclusão das sessões","Gerar resumos de tarefas","Compactar contexto para as próximas sessões","Documentar decisões e atualizações"],"ru":["Автоматизировать завершение сеансов","Генерировать сводки задач","Компактировать контекст для следующих сеансов","Документировать решения и обновления"],"ar":["تحسين إنهاء الجلسات","генерировать ملخصات المهام","تكثيف السياق للجلسات التالية","توثيق القرارات والتحديثات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires filesystem access to write to `.context/handoff.md`","Depends on agent''s ability to gather and document session data"],"zh":["需要文件系统访问权限来写入 `.context/handoff.md`","依赖于代理收集和文档化会话数据的能力"],"ja":["`.context/handoff.md` に書き込むためにファイルシステムへのアクセスが必要","エージェントがセッションデータを収集して文書化する能力に依存する"],"ko":["`.context/handoff.md`에 작성하기 위해 파일 시스템 액세스가 필요합니다","에이전트가 세션 데이터를 수집하여 문서화하는 능력에 의존합니다"],"es":["Requiere acceso al sistema de archivos para escribir en `.context/handoff.md`","Depende de la capacidad del agente para recopilar y documentar los datos de la sesión"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au système de fichiers pour écrire dans `.context/handoff.md`","Dépend de la capacité de l''agent à collecter et à documenter les données de la session"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das Dateisystem, um in `.context/handoff.md` zu schreiben","Hängt von der Fähigkeit des Agents ab, Sitzungsdaten zu sammeln und zu dokumentieren"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao sistema de arquivos para escrever em `.context/handoff.md`","Depende da capacidade do agente de coletar e documentar dados de sessão"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файловой системе для записи в `.context/handoff.md`","Зависит от способности агента собирать и документировать данные сеанса"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى نظام الملفات للكتابة إلى `.context/handoff.md`","يعتمد على قدرة الوكيل على جمع و توثيق بيانات الجلسة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('bearcove/pikru/idiomatic-rust', 'community', 'bearcove', 'pikru', 'bearcove/pikru', 'idiomatic-rust', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.432Z', '2026-02-18T05:16:40.362Z', NULL, '{"id":"bearcove/pikru/idiomatic-rust","name":"idiomatic-rust","description":{"zh":"Rust idiomatic编程强调正确的行为而非逐行翻译，通过将逻辑放在数据所在的位置来实现","ja":"イディオマティックRustは、正しい動作を実現するために、データが存在する場所にロジックを配置することによって実現されます","ko":"Rust 정형화 프로그래밍은 올바른 동작을 구현하기 위해 데이터가 존재하는 위치에 논리를 배치하여 구현됩니다","es":"Rust idiomatico se centra en escribir código Rust de manera correcta y eficiente, en lugar de traducir patrones de C","fr":"Rust idiomatique se concentre sur l''écriture de code Rust de manière correcte et efficace, plutôt que de traduire des modèles de C","de":"Idiomatic Rust konzentriert sich auf das Schreiben von Rust-Code auf die richtige und effiziente Weise, anstatt C-Muster zu übersetzen","pt":"Idiomatic Rust é uma abordagem para desenvolver em Rust de forma eficiente, utilizando recursos como métodos e encapsulamento de dados","ru":"Идиоматический Rust - это подход к разработке на Rust, эффективно использующий возможности языка, такие как методы и инкапсуляция данных","ar":"رست الإديوماتيكي هو نهج لتطوير رست بشكل فعال، باستخدام موارد مثل الأساليب وتنسيق البيانات","en":"pikchr port to Rust"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Rust idiomatic编程：pikchr的Rust实现","ja":"イディオマティックRust：pikchrのRustポート","ko":"Rust 정형화: pikchr의 Rust 구현","es":"Rust Idiomatico: Mejores prácticas de programación","fr":"Rust Idiomatique: Les meilleures pratiques de programmation","de":"Idiomatic Rust: Beste Programmierpraktiken","pt":"Idiomatic Rust: Desenvolvimento Eficiente","ru":"Идиоматический Rust: Эффективное Разработка","ar":"رست الإديوماتيكي: التطوير الفعال","en":"idiomatic-rust"},"description":{"zh":"Rust idiomatic编程强调正确的行为而非逐行翻译，通过将逻辑放在数据所在的位置来实现","ja":"イディオマティックRustは、正しい動作を実現するために、データが存在する場所にロジックを配置することによって実現されます","ko":"Rust 정형화 프로그래밍은 올바른 동작을 구현하기 위해 데이터가 존재하는 위치에 논리를 배치하여 구현됩니다","es":"Rust idiomatico se centra en escribir código Rust de manera correcta y eficiente, en lugar de traducir patrones de C","fr":"Rust idiomatique se concentre sur l''écriture de code Rust de manière correcte et efficace, plutôt que de traduire des modèles de C","de":"Idiomatic Rust konzentriert sich auf das Schreiben von Rust-Code auf die richtige und effiziente Weise, anstatt C-Muster zu übersetzen","pt":"Idiomatic Rust é uma abordagem para desenvolver em Rust de forma eficiente, utilizando recursos como métodos e encapsulamento de dados","ru":"Идиоматический Rust - это подход к разработке на Rust, эффективно использующий возможности языка, такие как методы и инкапсуляция данных","ar":"رست الإديوماتيكي هو نهج لتطوير رست بشكل فعال، باستخدام موارد مثل الأساليب وتنسيق البيانات","en":"pikchr port to Rust"},"definition":{"en":"pikchr port to Rust"},"features":{"zh":["将逻辑放在数据所在的位置","避免将C模式移植到Rust","实现正确的行为","使用Rust语言的惯用法","提高代码的可读性和可维护性"],"ja":["データが存在する場所にロジックを配置","CのパターンをRustに移植しない","正しい動作を実現","Rust言語の慣用法を使用","コードの可読性と保守性を向上"],"ko":["데이터가 존재하는 위치에 논리를 배치","C 패턴을 Rust로 이식하지 않음","올바른 동작을 구현","Rust 언어의 관용구를 사용","코드의 가독성과 유지 보수를 향상"],"es":["Estructuras de datos personalizadas","Métodos y funciones integrados","Evitación de patrones de C","Sintaxis y estilo de Rust","Portabilidad y mantenimiento"],"fr":["Structures de données personnalisées","Méthodes et fonctions intégrées","Évitement des modèles de C","Syntaxe et style de Rust","Portabilité et maintenance"],"de":["Benutzerdefinierte Datenstrukturen","Integrierte Methoden und Funktionen","Vermeidung von C-Mustern","Syntax und Stil von Rust","Portabilität und Wartung"],"pt":["Escreva códigos Rust de forma eficaz","Evite padrões de C","Utilize recursos da linguagem como métodos e encapsulamento de dados","Desenvolva aplicações robustas e escaláveis","Aprenda a utilizar a sintaxe Rust de forma correta"],"ru":["Пишите эффективный код на Rust","Избегайте шаблонов C","Используйте возможности языка, такие как методы и инкапсуляция данных","Разрабатывайте прочные и масштабируемые приложения","Узнайте, как правильно использовать синтаксис Rust"],"ar":["اكتب كود رست بشكل فعال","تجنب أنماط سي","استخدم موارد اللغة مثل الأساليب وتنسيق البيانات","طور تطبيقات قوية وقابلة للتوسعة","تعلم كيفية استخدام بناء الجملة رست بشكل صحيح"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Rust idiomatic","pikchr","Rust编程","正确行为","惯用法","最佳实践"],"ja":["イディオマティックRust","pikchr","Rustプログラミング","正しい動作","慣用法","ベストプラクティス"],"ko":["Rust 정형화","pikchr","Rust 프로그래밍","올바른 동작","관용구","모범 사례"],"es":["Rust idiomatico","programación en Rust","patrones de C","sintaxis de Rust","estilo de Rust","estructuras de datos personalizadas","métodos y funciones integrados"],"fr":["Rust idiomatique","programmation en Rust","modèles de C","syntaxe de Rust","style de Rust","structures de données personnalisées","méthodes et fonctions intégrées"],"de":["Idiomatic Rust","Programmierung in Rust","C-Muster","Rust-Syntax","Rust-Stil","benutzerdefinierte Datenstrukturen","integrierte Methoden und Funktionen"],"pt":["Rust","Desenvolvimento Eficiente","Programação Funcional","Métodos","Encapsulamento de Dados","Sintaxe Rust","Padrões de C","Linguagem de Programação"],"ru":["Rust","Эффективное Разработка","Функциональное Программирование","Методы","Инкапсуляция Данных","Синтаксис Rust","Шаблоны C","Язык Программирования"],"ar":["رست","التطوير الفعال","برمجة وظيفية","الأساليب","تنسيق البيانات","بناء الجملة رست","أنماط سي","لغة البرمجة"]}},"owner":"bearcove","repo":"pikru","repoPath":"bearcove/pikru","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.432Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"idiomatic-rust","description":"Idiomatic Rust patterns for pikru C port. Use when writing or reviewing Rust code ported from C. Dont write C in Rust - the goal is correct behavior, not line-by-line translation.","bodyPreview":"# Idiomatic Rust: Don''t port C patterns\n\nThis is a Rust port of C code, but **do not write C in Rust**. The goal is correct behavior, not line-by-line translation.\n\n## Put logic where the data lives\n\nIf a struct has all the information needed to compute something, make it a method:\n\n```rust\n// BAD: C-style function with boolean flag soup\nfn text_width(text: &str, charwid: f64, is_mono: bool, font_scale: f64, is_bold: bool) -> f64\n\n// GOOD: The type already knows its properties\nimpl PositionedTex","body":"# Idiomatic Rust: Don''t port C patterns\n\nThis is a Rust port of C code, but **do not write C in Rust**. The goal is correct behavior, not line-by-line translation.\n\n## Put logic where the data lives\n\nIf a struct has all the information needed to compute something, make it a method:\n\n```rust\n// BAD: C-style function with boolean flag soup\nfn text_width(text: &str, charwid: f64, is_mono: bool, font_scale: f64, is_bold: bool) -> f64\n\n// GOOD: The type already knows its properties\nimpl PositionedText {\n    fn width_inches(&self, charwid: f64) -> f64 {\n        // self.mono, self.bold, self.big are all right here\n    }\n}\n```\n\n**Rationale:** Boolean flags are:\n- Easy to pass in wrong order (`width(s, w, true, 1.0, false)` - which bool is which?)\n- Require the caller to extract properties just to pass them back in\n- Duplicate knowledge that the type already has\n\n## Use newtypes for domain concepts\n\n```rust\n// BAD: Bare f64 everywhere, easy to mix up inches and pixels\nfn convert(value: f64, scale: f64) -> f64\n\n// GOOD: The type system catches mistakes\nstruct Inches(f64);\nstruct Pixels(f64);\nfn convert(value: Inches, scale: &Scaler) -> Pixels\n```\n\n## Prefer methods over standalone functions\n\nWhen you find yourself writing `foo_bar(bar, ...)`, consider `bar.foo(...)` instead. This:\n- Groups related functionality\n- Enables IDE autocomplete on the type\n- Makes the relationship between data and operations explicit\n\n## Enums over boolean flags\n\n```rust\n// BAD: What does `true` mean here?\nrender_text(text, true, false)\n\n// GOOD: Self-documenting\nenum TextAnchor { Start, Middle, End }\nrender_text(text, TextAnchor::Start)\n```\n\n## The C code is a spec, not a template\n\nWhen porting C:\n1. Understand what the C code **does** (behavior)\n2. Understand **why** it does it (intent)\n3. Implement that behavior idiomatically in Rust\n\nThe `// cref:` comments link to C for reference, but the Rust should stand on its own.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:16:40.362Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Rust-based Agents needing to write idiomatic code with correct behavior, not line-by-line translation from C.","zh":"非常适合需要编写惯用代码和正确行为的Rust-based Agents，而不是从C语言进行逐行翻译。","ja":"Rustベースのエージェントが、Cからの逐行翻訳ではなく、イディオマティックなコードを書き、正しい動作を実現する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"Rust 기반 에이전트가 C에서 行 단위 번역이 아닌 관용적인 코드를 작성하고 올바른 동작을 수행해야 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfect for Rust-based Agents needing to write idiomatic code with correct behavior, not line-by-line translation from C.","fr":"Perfect for Rust-based Agents needing to write idiomatic code with correct behavior, not line-by-line translation from C.","de":"Perfect for Rust-based Agents needing to write idiomatic code with correct behavior, not line-by-line translation from C.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes baseados em Rust que precisam escrever código idiomático com comportamento correto, e não tradução linha por linha do C.","ru":"Идеально для агентов на основе Rust, которым необходимо писать идиоматический код с правильным поведением, а не перевод построчно из C.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يستندون إلى روست ويدرجون كتابة شفرة متوافقة مع اللغة مع سلوك صحيح، وليس ترجمة سطر بسطر من سي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to organize logic within structs using methods, avoiding C-style function patterns and leveraging Rust''s type system for efficient computation, such as calculating text width with font scale and bold properties.","zh":"赋予代理组织逻辑的能力，使用结构中的方法，避免C风格的函数模式，并利用Rust的类型系统进行高效的计算，例如计算带有字体缩放和粗体属性的文本宽度。","ja":"エージェントが、Cスタイルの関数パターンを避け、Rustのタイプシステムを活用して効率的な計算（例：フォントスケールやボールド属性を使用したテキスト幅の計算）を行うために、構造体内でメソッドを使用してロジックを組織する能力を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 C 스타일의 함수 패턴을 피하고 Rust의 타입 시스템을 활용하여 효율적인 계산(예: 글꼴 크기 조정 및 볼드 속성을 사용한 텍스트 너비 계산)을 수행할 수 있도록 구조체 내에서 메서드를 사용하여 논리를 구성할 수 있는 능력을 제공합니다.","es":"Empowers agents to organize logic within structs using methods, avoiding C-style function patterns and leveraging Rust''s type system for efficient computation, such as calculating text width with font scale and bold properties.","fr":"Empowers agents to organize logic within structs using methods, avoiding C-style function patterns and leveraging Rust''s type system for efficient computation, such as calculating text width with font scale and bold properties.","de":"Empowers agents to organize logic within structs using methods, avoiding C-style function patterns and leveraging Rust''s type system for efficient computation, such as calculating text width with font scale and bold properties.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a organizar a lógica dentro de estruturas utilizando métodos, evitando padrões de função no estilo C e aproveitando o sistema de tipos do Rust para computação eficiente, como calcular a largura do texto com escala de fonte e propriedades em negrito.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью организовывать логику внутри структур с помощью методов, избегая шаблонов функций в стиле C и используя систему типов Rust для эффективных вычислений, таких как расчет ширины текста с масштабом шрифта и свойствами жирного шрифта.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تنظيم المنطق داخل الهياكل باستخدام الأساليب، وتجنب أنماط الوظائف على نمط سي واستغلال نظام أنواع روست للحسابات الفعالة، مثل حساب عرض النص مع مقياس الخط والخصائص المائلة."},"useCases":{"en":["Refactoring C-style code to idiomatic Rust","Implementing methods on structs for encapsulated logic","Avoiding boolean flag soup in function parameters"],"zh":["将C风格代码重构为惯用Rust代码","在结构体上实现方法以封装逻辑","避免函数参数中的布尔标志汤"],"ja":["CスタイルのコードをイディオマティックなRustコードにリファクタリングする","構造体にメソッドを実装してロジックをカプセル化する","関数パラメータでのブールフラグスープを避ける"],"ko":["C 스타일 코드를 관용적인 Rust 코드로 리팩토링하는 것","구조체에 메서드를 구현하여 논리를 캡슐화하는 것","함수 매개 변수에서 불린 플래그 수프를 피하는 것"],"es":["Refactoring C-style code to idiomatic Rust","Implementing methods on structs for encapsulated logic","Avoiding boolean flag soup in function parameters"],"fr":["Refactoring C-style code to idiomatic Rust","Implementing methods on structs for encapsulated logic","Avoiding boolean flag soup in function parameters"],"de":["Refactoring C-style code to idiomatic Rust","Implementing methods on structs for encapsulated logic","Avoiding boolean flag soup in function parameters"],"pt":["Reestruturação de código no estilo C para código idiomático em Rust","Implementação de métodos em estruturas para lógica encapsulada","Evitar a ''sopa de flags'' booleanos nos parâmetros de função"],"ru":["Рефакторинг кода в стиле C в идиоматический код на Rust","Реализация методов на структурах для инкапсулированной логики","Избежание булевых флагов в параметрах функций"],"ar":["إعادة هيكلة شفرة على نمط سي إلى شفرة متوافقة مع اللغة في روست","تنفيذ الأساليب على الهياكل من أجل منطق مغلف","تجنب ''حساء الأعلام'' المنطقية في معاملات الدالة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of Rust programming language","Not a direct line-by-line translation from C code"],"zh":["需要了解Rust编程语言","不是从C代码的直接逐行翻译"],"ja":["Rustプログラミング言語の理解が必要","Cコードからの直接的な行ごとの翻訳ではない"],"ko":["Rust 프로그래밍 언어를 이해해야 함","C 코드에서 직접적인 줄 단위 번역이 아님"],"es":["Requires understanding of Rust programming language","Not a direct line-by-line translation from C code"],"fr":["Requires understanding of Rust programming language","Not a direct line-by-line translation from C code"],"de":["Requires understanding of Rust programming language","Not a direct line-by-line translation from C code"],"pt":["Exige compreensão da linguagem de programação Rust","Não é uma tradução direta linha por linha do código C"],"ru":["Требует понимания языка программирования Rust","Не является прямым переводом построчно из кода C"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم لغة البرمجة روست","ليست ترجمة مباشرة سطر بسطر من كود سي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('dennislee928/Smart_Zone/oauth-integrations', 'community', 'dennislee928', 'Smart_Zone', 'dennislee928/Smart_Zone', 'oauth-integrations', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.432Z', '2026-02-18T05:16:03.267Z', NULL, '{"id":"dennislee928/Smart_Zone/oauth-integrations","name":"oauth-integrations","description":{"zh":"OAuth集成允许开发者在边缘环境中安全地集成GitHub和Microsoft OAuth","ja":"OAuth統合により、開発者はエッジ環境でGitHubとMicrosoft OAuthを安全に統合できます","ko":"OAuth 통합을 통해 개발자는 에지 환경에서 GitHub 및 Microsoft OAuth를 안전하게 통합할 수 있습니다","es":"Las integraciones OAuth permiten la autenticación segura en entornos de edge. Aprende a implementar GitHub y Microsoft OAuth en Cloudflare Workers","fr":"Les intégrations OAuth permettent une authentification sécurisée dans les environnements de edge. Découvrez comment implémenter GitHub et Microsoft OAuth dans Cloudflare Workers","de":"Die OAuth-Integrationen ermöglichen eine sichere Authentifizierung in Edge-Umgebungen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie GitHub und Microsoft OAuth in Cloudflare Workers implementieren","pt":"Aprenda a implementar integrações OAuth para ambientes de borda, incluindo GitHub e Microsoft, em Cloudflare Workers e outros runtimes de borda","ru":"Узнайте, как реализовать интеграции OAuth для краевых сред, включая GitHub и Microsoft, в Cloudflare Workers и других краевых средах","ar":"تعلم كيفية تنفيذ تكاملات OAuth للبيئات الحرفية، بما في ذلك GitHub و Microsoft، في Cloudflare Workers وبيئات أخرى حافة","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"OAuth集成=edge环境下的GitHub和Microsoft OAuth","ja":"OAuth統合：Edge環境でのGitHubとMicrosoft OAuth","ko":"OAuth 통합: 에지 환경에서 GitHub 및 Microsoft OAuth","es":"Integraciones OAuth para entornos de edge","fr":"Intégrations OAuth pour les environnements de edge","de":"OAuth-Integrationen für Edge-Umgebungen","pt":"Integrações OAuth para Ambientes de Borda","ru":"Интеграции OAuth для краевых сред","ar":"تكاملات OAuth للبيئات الحرفية","en":"oauth-integrations"},"description":{"zh":"OAuth集成允许开发者在边缘环境中安全地集成GitHub和Microsoft OAuth","ja":"OAuth統合により、開発者はエッジ環境でGitHubとMicrosoft OAuthを安全に統合できます","ko":"OAuth 통합을 통해 개발자는 에지 환경에서 GitHub 및 Microsoft OAuth를 안전하게 통합할 수 있습니다","es":"Las integraciones OAuth permiten la autenticación segura en entornos de edge. Aprende a implementar GitHub y Microsoft OAuth en Cloudflare Workers","fr":"Les intégrations OAuth permettent une authentification sécurisée dans les environnements de edge. Découvrez comment implémenter GitHub et Microsoft OAuth dan...","de":"Die OAuth-Integrationen ermöglichen eine sichere Authentifizierung in Edge-Umgebungen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie GitHub und Microsoft OAuth in Cloudflare Workers...","pt":"Aprenda a implementar integrações OAuth para ambientes de borda, incluindo GitHub e Microsoft, em Cloudflare Workers e outros runtimes de borda","ru":"Узнайте, как реализовать интеграции OAuth для краевых сред, включая GitHub и Microsoft, в Cloudflare Workers и других краевых средах","ar":"تعلم كيفية تنفيذ تكاملات OAuth للبيئات الحرفية، بما في ذلك GitHub و Microsoft، في Cloudflare Workers وبيئات أخرى حافة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["实现GitHub OAuth身份验证","支持Microsoft OAuth集成","适用于Cloudflare Workers和其他边缘运行时","严格的安全要求和头部验证","支持application/vnd.github+json格式"],"ja":["GitHub OAuth認証の実装","Microsoft OAuth統合のサポート","Cloudflare Workersやその他のエッジランタイムに対応","厳格なセキュリティ要件とヘッダーの検証","application/vnd.github+json形式のサポート"],"ko":["GitHub OAuth 인증 구현","Microsoft OAuth 통합 지원","Cloudflare Workers 및 기타 에지 런타임 지원","严格한 보안 요구 사항 및 헤더 검증","application/vnd.github+json 형식 지원"],"es":["Implementación de GitHub OAuth en Cloudflare Workers","Configuración de Microsoft OAuth en entornos de edge","Autenticación segura con OAuth","Acceso a recursos sin compartir contraseñas","Compatibilidad con diferentes proveedores de OAuth"],"fr":["Implémentation de GitHub OAuth dans Cloudflare Workers","Configuration de Microsoft OAuth dans les environnements de edge","Authentification sécurisée avec OAuth","Accès à des ressources sans partager de mots de passe","Compatibilité avec différents fournisseurs d''OAuth"],"de":["Implementierung von GitHub OAuth in Cloudflare Workers","Konfiguration von Microsoft OAuth in Edge-Umgebungen","Sichere Authentifizierung mit OAuth","Zugriff auf Ressourcen ohne Passwörter zu teilen","Kompatibilität mit verschiedenen OAuth-Anbietern"],"pt":["Implementação de autenticação OAuth com GitHub","Implementação de autenticação OAuth com Microsoft","Suporte a Cloudflare Workers e outros runtimes de borda","Requisitos de cabeçalho personalizados para GitHub API","Suporte a diferentes plataformas de autenticação"],"ru":["Реализация аутентификации OAuth с GitHub","Реализация аутентификации OAuth с Microsoft","Поддержка Cloudflare Workers и других краевых сред","Пользовательские требования к заголовкам для GitHub API","Поддержка разных платформ аутентификации"],"ar":["تنفيذ التوثيق OAuth مع GitHub","تنفيذ التوثيق OAuth مع Microsoft","دعم Cloudflare Workers وبيئات أخرى حافة","متطلبات رأس مخصصة ل GitHub API","دعم منصات مصادقة مختلفة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["OAuth集成","边缘环境","GitHub OAuth","Microsoft OAuth","Cloudflare Workers","OAuth身份验证","安全集成"],"ja":["OAuth統合","エッジ環境","GitHub OAuth","Microsoft OAuth","Cloudflare Workers","OAuth認証","セキュアな統合"],"ko":["OAuth 통합","에지 환경","GitHub OAuth","Microsoft OAuth","Cloudflare Workers","OAuth 인증","보안 통합"],"es":["integraciones OAuth","autenticación segura","Cloudflare Workers","GitHub OAuth","Microsoft OAuth","entornos de edge","desarrollo de aplicaciones","seguridad de la aplicación"],"fr":["intégrations OAuth","authentification sécurisée","Cloudflare Workers","GitHub OAuth","Microsoft OAuth","environnements de edge","développement d''applications","sécurité de l''application"],"de":["OAuth-Integrationen","sichere Authentifizierung","Cloudflare Workers","GitHub OAuth","Microsoft OAuth","Edge-Umgebungen","Anwendungsentwicklung","Anwendungssicherheit"],"pt":["integração OAuth","autenticação OAuth","GitHub OAuth","Microsoft OAuth","Cloudflare Workers","ambientes de borda","segurança de autenticação"],"ru":["интеграция OAuth","аутентификация OAuth","GitHub OAuth","Microsoft OAuth","Cloudflare Workers","краевые среды","безопасность аутентификации"],"ar":["تكامل OAuth","توثيق OAuth","GitHub OAuth","Microsoft OAuth","Cloudflare Workers","بيئات حافة","أمان المصادقة"]}},"owner":"dennislee928","repo":"Smart_Zone","repoPath":"dennislee928/Smart_Zone","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.432Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"oauth-integrations","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# OAuth Integrations for Edge Environments\n\nImplement GitHub and Microsoft OAuth in Cloudflare Workers and other edge runtimes.\n\n## GitHub OAuth\n\n### Required Headers\n\nGitHub API has strict requirements that differ from other providers.\n\n| Header | Requirement |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `User-Agent` | **REQUIRED** - Returns 403 without it |\n| `Accept` | `application/vnd.github+json` recommended |\n\n```typescript\nconst resp = await fetch(''https://api.github.com/user'', {\n  headers: {\n    Authoriz","body":"# OAuth Integrations for Edge Environments\n\nImplement GitHub and Microsoft OAuth in Cloudflare Workers and other edge runtimes.\n\n## GitHub OAuth\n\n### Required Headers\n\nGitHub API has strict requirements that differ from other providers.\n\n| Header | Requirement |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `User-Agent` | **REQUIRED** - Returns 403 without it |\n| `Accept` | `application/vnd.github+json` recommended |\n\n```typescript\nconst resp = await fetch(''https://api.github.com/user'', {\n  headers: {\n    Authorization: `Bearer ${accessToken}`,\n    ''User-Agent'': ''MyApp/1.0'',  // Required!\n    ''Accept'': ''application/vnd.github+json'',\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Private Email Handling\n\nGitHub users can set email to private (`/user` returns `email: null`).\n\n```typescript\nif (!userData.email) {\n  const emails = await fetch(''https://api.github.com/user/emails'', { headers })\n    .then(r => r.json());\n  userData.email = emails.find(e => e.primary && e.verified)?.email;\n}\n```\n\nRequires `user:email` scope.\n\n### Token Exchange\n\nToken exchange returns form-encoded by default. Add Accept header for JSON:\n\n```typescript\nconst tokenResponse = await fetch(''https://github.com/login/oauth/access_token'', {\n  method: ''POST'',\n  headers: {\n    ''Content-Type'': ''application/x-www-form-urlencoded'',\n    ''Accept'': ''application/json'',  // Get JSON response\n  },\n  body: new URLSearchParams({ code, client_id, client_secret, redirect_uri }),\n});\n```\n\n### GitHub OAuth Notes\n\n| Issue | Solution |\n|-------|----------|\n| Callback URL | Must be EXACT - no wildcards, no subdirectory matching |\n| Token exchange returns form-encoded | Add `''Accept'': ''application/json''` header |\n| Tokens don''t expire | No refresh flow needed, but revoked = full re-auth |\n\n## Microsoft Entra (Azure AD) OAuth\n\n### Why MSAL Doesn''t Work in Workers\n\nMSAL.js depends on:\n- Browser APIs (localStorage, sessionStorage, DOM)\n- Node.js crypto module\n\nCloudflare''s V8 isolate runtime has neither. Use manual OAuth instead:\n1. Manual OAuth URL construction\n2. Direct token exchange via fetch\n3. JWT validation with `jose` library\n\n### Required Scopes\n\n```typescript\n// For user identity (email, name, profile picture)\nconst scope = ''openid email profile User.Read'';\n\n// For refresh tokens (long-lived sessions)\nconst scope = ''openid email profile User.Read offline_access'';\n```\n\n**Critical**: `User.Read` is required for Microsoft Graph `/me` endpoint. Without it, token exchange succeeds but user info fetch returns 403.\n\n### User Info Endpoint\n\n```typescript\n// Microsoft Graph /me endpoint\nconst resp = await fetch(''https://graph.microsoft.com/v1.0/me'', {\n  headers: { Authorization: `Bearer ${accessToken}` },\n});\n\n// Email may be in different fields\nconst email = data.mail || data.userPrincipalName;\n```\n\n### Tenant Configuration\n\n| Tenant Value | Who Can Sign In |\n|--------------|-----------------|\n| `common` | Any Microsoft account (personal + work) |\n| `organizations` | Work/school accounts only |\n| `consumers` | Personal Microsoft accounts only |\n| `{tenant-id}` | Specific organization only |\n\n### Azure Portal Setup\n\n1. App Registration → New registration\n2. Platform: **Web** (not SPA) for server-side OAuth\n3. Redirect URIs: Add both `/callback` and `/admin/callback`\n4. Certificates & secrets → New client secret\n\n### Token Lifetimes\n\n| Token Type | Default Lifetime | Notes |\n|------------|------------------|-------|\n| Access token | 60-90 minutes | Configurable via token lifetime policies |\n| Refresh token | 90 days | Revoked on password change |\n| ID token | 60 minutes | Same as access token |\n\n**Best Practice**: Always request `offline_access` scope and implement refresh token flow for sessions longer than 1 hour.\n\n## Common Corrections\n\n| If Claude suggests... | Use instead... |\n|----------------------|----------------|\n| GitHub fetch without User-Agent | Add `''User-Agent'': ''AppName/1.0''` (REQUIRED) |\n| Using MSAL.js in Workers | Manual OAuth + jose for JWT validation |\n| Microsoft scope without User.Read | Add `User.Read` scope |\n| Fetching email from token claims only | Use Graph `/me` endpoint |\n\n## Error Reference\n\n### GitHub Errors\n\n| Error | Cause | Fix |\n|-------|-------|-----|\n| 403 Forbidden | Missing User-Agent header | Add User-Agent header |\n| `email: null` | User has private email | Fetch `/user/emails` with `user:email` scope |\n\n### Microsoft Errors\n\n| Error | Cause | Fix |\n|-------|-------|-----|\n| AADSTS50058 | Silent auth failed | Use interactive flow |\n| AADSTS700084 | Refresh token expired | Re-authenticate user |\n| 403 on Graph /me | Missing User.Read scope | Add User.Read to scopes |\n\n## Reference\n\n- GitHub API: https://docs.github.com/en/rest\n- GitHub OAuth: https://docs.github.com/en/apps/oauth-apps\n- Microsoft Graph permissions: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/graph/permissions-reference\n- AADSTS error codes: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/entra/identity-platform/reference-error-codes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:16:03.267Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Edge Environment Agents requiring secure authentication via GitHub and Microsoft OAuth","zh":"适用于需要通过 GitHub 和 Microsoft OAuth 进行安全身份验证的边缘环境代理","ja":"GitHub および Microsoft OAuth を使用したセキュアな認証が必要なエッジ環境エージェントに最適","ko":"GitHub 및 Microsoft OAuth를 사용한 보안 인증이 필요한 에지 환경 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de entorno de Edge que requieren autenticación segura a través de GitHub y Microsoft OAuth","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''environnement Edge nécessitant une authentification sécurisée via GitHub et Microsoft OAuth","de":"Ideal für Edge-Umgebung-Agents, die eine sichere Authentifizierung über GitHub und Microsoft OAuth erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Ambiente de Borda que exigem autenticação segura via GitHub e Microsoft OAuth","ru":"Идеально для агентов среды Edge, требующих безопасную аутентификацию через GitHub и Microsoft OAuth","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء بيئة الحافة الذين يتطلبون مصادقة آمنة عبر GitHub و Microsoft OAuth"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to authenticate with GitHub and Microsoft using OAuth, handling strict requirements such as specific `User-Agent` headers and `application/vnd.github+json` Accept headers, enabling seamless integration with Cloudflare Workers and other edge runtimes","zh":"赋予代理使用 OAuth 与 GitHub 和 Microsoft 进行身份验证的能力，处理诸如特定的 `User-Agent` 首部和 `application/vnd.github+json` 接受首部等严格要求，使其能够与 Cloudflare Workers 和其他边缘运行时实现无缝集成","ja":"OAuth を使用して GitHub および Microsoft と認証するエージェントを可能にし、特定の `User-Agent` ヘッダーおよび `application/vnd.github+json` Accept ヘッダーなどの厳格な要件を処理し、Cloudflare Workers およびその他のエッジ ランタイムとシームレスに統合できる","ko":"OAuth를 사용하여 GitHub 및 Microsoft와 인증하는 에이전트를 가능하게 하며, 특정 `User-Agent` 헤더 및 `application/vnd.github+json` Accept 헤더와 같은 엄격한 요구 사항을 처리하여 Cloudflare Workers 및 기타 에지 런타임과無縫な統合을 가능하게 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a autenticarse con GitHub y Microsoft utilizando OAuth, manejando requisitos estrictos como encabezados de `User-Agent` específicos y encabezados de aceptación `application/vnd.github+json`, lo que permite una integración sin problemas con Cloudflare Workers y otros entornos de ejecución de edge","fr":"Permet aux agents de s''authentifier auprès de GitHub et Microsoft en utilisant OAuth, en gérant des exigences strictes telles que des en-têtes `User-Agent` spécifiques et des en-têtes d''acceptation `application/vnd.github+json`, ce qui permet une intégration transparente avec Cloudflare Workers et d''autres environnements d''exécution de edge","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, sich mit GitHub und Microsoft über OAuth zu authentifizieren, wobei strenge Anforderungen wie bestimmte `User-Agent`-Header und `application/vnd.github+json`-Accept-Header gehandhabt werden, was eine nahtlose Integration mit Cloudflare Workers und anderen Edge-Laufzeiten ermöglicht","pt":"Habilita os agentes a se autenticarem com o GitHub e a Microsoft usando OAuth, lidando com requisitos estritos, como cabeçalhos de `User-Agent` específicos e cabeçalhos de aceitação `application/vnd.github+json`, permitindo integração perfeita com Cloudflare Workers e outros ambientes de execução de borda","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью аутентификации с GitHub и Microsoft с помощью OAuth, обрабатывая严гие требования, такие как определенные заголовки `User-Agent` и заголовки Accept `application/vnd.github+json`, обеспечивая бесшовную интеграцию с Cloudflare Workers и другими средами выполнения Edge","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على المصادقة مع GitHub و Microsoft باستخدام OAuth، وتحديد متطلبات صارمة مثل رؤوس `User-Agent` المحددة ورؤوس قبول `application/vnd.github+json`، وتمكين التكامل السلس مع Cloudflare Workers وبيئات التشغيل الحدية الأخرى"},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing GitHub OAuth for edge environment authentication","Configuring Microsoft OAuth for secure API access","Handling OAuth token validation and refresh in edge environments"],"zh":["为边缘环境身份验证实现 GitHub OAuth","为安全 API 访问配置 Microsoft OAuth","在边缘环境中处理 OAuth 令牌验证和刷新"],"ja":["エッジ環境の認証に GitHub OAuth を実装する","セキュアな API アクセスに Microsoft OAuth を構成する","エッジ環境での OAuth トークンの検証と更新を処理する"],"ko":["에지 환경 인증을 위한 GitHub OAuth 구현","보안 API 액세스를 위한 Microsoft OAuth 구성","에지 환경에서 OAuth 토큰 유효성 검사 및 갱신 처리"],"es":["Implementación de GitHub OAuth para la autenticación del entorno de edge","Configuración de Microsoft OAuth para un acceso API seguro","Control de la validación y actualización de tokens OAuth en entornos de edge"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre de GitHub OAuth pour l''authentification de l''environnement de edge","Configuration de Microsoft OAuth pour un accès API sécurisé","Gestion de la validation et du rafraîchissement des jetons OAuth dans les environnements de edge"],"de":["Implementierung von GitHub OAuth für die Authentifizierung der Edge-Umgebung","Konfiguration von Microsoft OAuth für sicheren API-Zugriff","Handhabung der Validierung und Aktualisierung von OAuth-Token in Edge-Umgebungen"],"pt":["Implementação da autenticação do OAuth do GitHub para autenticação de ambiente de borda","Configuração do OAuth da Microsoft para acesso seguro à API","Tratamento de validação e atualização de token OAuth em ambientes de borda"],"ru":["Реализация аутентификации GitHub OAuth для аутентификации среды Edge","Настройка аутентификации Microsoft OAuth для безопасного доступа к API","Обработка проверки и обновления токенов OAuth в средах Edge"],"ar":["تنفيذ المصادقة OAuth من GitHub للمصادقة في بيئة الحافة","تحرير المصادقة OAuth من Microsoft للوصول الآمن إلى واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","معالجة التحقق والتحديث من رموز OAuth في بيئات الحافة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires specific header configurations for GitHub API","Limited to GitHub and Microsoft OAuth providers","Dependent on Cloudflare Workers or compatible edge runtimes"],"zh":["需要特定的 GitHub API 首部配置","仅限 GitHub 和 Microsoft OAuth 提供商","依赖于 Cloudflare Workers 或兼容的边缘运行时"],"ja":["GitHub API に特定のヘッダー構成が必要","GitHub および Microsoft OAuth プロバイダーのみ","Cloudflare Workers または互換性のあるエッジ ランタイムに依存する"],"ko":["GitHub API에 특정 헤더 구성이 필요","GitHub 및 Microsoft OAuth 제공자만 해당","Cloudflare Workers 또는 호환 에지 런타임에 의존"],"es":["Requiere configuraciones de encabezados específicas para la API de GitHub","Limitado a proveedores de OAuth de GitHub y Microsoft","Dependiente de Cloudflare Workers o entornos de ejecución de edge compatibles"],"fr":["Nécessite des configurations d''en-tête spécifiques pour l''API GitHub","Limité aux fournisseurs d''authentification OAuth GitHub et Microsoft","Dépendant de Cloudflare Workers ou d''environnements d''exécution de edge compatibles"],"de":["Erfordert bestimmte Header-Konfigurationen für die GitHub-API","Begrenzt auf GitHub- und Microsoft-OAuth-Provider","Abhängig von Cloudflare Workers oder kompatiblen Edge-Laufzeiten"],"pt":["Exige configurações de cabeçalho específicas para a API do GitHub","Limitado aos provedores de OAuth do GitHub e da Microsoft","Dependente de Cloudflare Workers ou ambientes de execução de borda compatíveis"],"ru":["Требует определенных конфигураций заголовков для API GitHub","Ограничен поставщиками аутентификации OAuth GitHub и Microsoft","Зависит от Cloudflare Workers или совместимых сред выполнения Edge"],"ar":["يتطلب تكوينات رأس محددة ل واجهة برمجة التطبيقات GitHub","محدود بمزودي OAuth من GitHub و Microsoft","يعتمد على Cloudflare Workers أو بيئات تشغيل الحافة المتوافقة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('DonaldMurillo/momentum-cms/component', 'community', 'DonaldMurillo', 'momentum-cms', 'DonaldMurillo/momentum-cms', 'component', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.432Z', '2026-02-18T05:16:37.483Z', NULL, '{"id":"DonaldMurillo/momentum-cms/component","name":"component","description":{"zh":"该技能可以生成独立的 Angular 组件，按照 Momentum CMS 规范创建组件文件","ja":"このスキルは、Momentum CMS の規範に従ってスタンドアロン Angular コンポーネントを作成します","ko":"이 기능은 Momentum CMS 규약에 따라 독립형 Angular 컴포넌트를 생성합니다","es":"Generar un componente Angular siguiendo las convenciones de Momentum CMS.","fr":"Générer un composant Angular suivant les conventions de Momentum CMS.","de":"Erstellen eines Angular-Components nach den Konventionen von Momentum CMS.","pt":"O componente Angular é uma parte fundamental da estrutura da aplicação. Aprenda a criá-lo seguindo as convenções do Momentum CMS.","ru":"Компонент Angular является фундаментальной частью структуры приложения. Узнайте, как его создать, следуя конвенциям Momentum CMS.","ar":"المكون الإضافي لأنجولار هو جزء أساسي من هيكل التطبيق. تعلم كيفية إنشائه اتباعًا لاتفاقيات Momentum CMS.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Angular 组件生成器","ja":"Angular コンポーネント生成ツール","ko":"Angular 컴포넌트 생성기","es":"Generar Componente Angular","fr":"Générer Composant Angular","de":"Erstellen Sie Angular-Komponente","pt":"Gerar Componente Angular","ru":"Создание компонента Angular","ar":"إنشاء مكون أنجولار","en":"component"},"description":{"zh":"该技能可以生成独立的 Angular 组件，按照 Momentum CMS 规范创建组件文件","ja":"このスキルは、Momentum CMS の規範に従ってスタンドアロン Angular コンポーネントを作成します","ko":"이 기능은 Momentum CMS 규약에 따라 독립형 Angular 컴포넌트를 생성합니다","es":"Generar un componente Angular siguiendo las convenciones de Momentum CMS.","fr":"Générer un composant Angular suivant les conventions de Momentum CMS.","de":"Erstellen eines Angular-Components nach den Konventionen von Momentum CMS.","pt":"O componente Angular é uma parte fundamental da estrutura da aplicação. Aprenda a criá-lo seguindo as convenções do Momentum CMS.","ru":"Компонент Angular является фундаментальной частью структуры приложения. Узнайте, как его создать, следуя конвенциям Momentum CMS.","ar":"المكون الإضافي لأنجولار هو جزء أساسي من هيكل التطبيق. تعلم كيفية إنشائه اتباعًا لاتفاقيات Momentum CMS.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["根据 Momentum CMS 规范创建组件文件","支持创建组件类、模板、样式和测试文件","提高开发效率","支持多种组件类型","易于使用和配置"],"ja":["Momentum CMS の規範に従ってコンポーネントファイルを作成","コンポーネントクラス、テンプレート、スタイル、テストファイルの作成をサポート","開発効率の向上","さまざまなコンポーネントタイプをサポート","使用と設定が容易"],"ko":["Momentum CMS 규약에 따라 컴포넌트 파일을 생성","컴포넌트 클래스, 템플릿, 스타일, 테스트 파일의 생성을 지원","개발 효율성 향상","다양한 컴포넌트 유형을 지원","사용과 설정이 용이"],"es":["Crea componentes de forma independiente","Sigue las convenciones de Momentum CMS","Genera archivos de componente","Incluye plantillas HTML y CSS","Permite la creación de pruebas unitarias"],"fr":["Crée des composants de manière indépendante","Suit les conventions de Momentum CMS","Génère des fichiers de composant","Inclut des modèles HTML et CSS","Permet la création de tests unitaires"],"de":["Erstellt Komponenten unabhängig","Folgt den Konventionen von Momentum CMS","Erstellt Komponenten-Dateien","Beinhaltet HTML- und CSS-Vorlagen","Ermöglicht die Erstellung von Einheitstests"],"pt":["Criação de componentes standalone","Seguimento das convenções do Momentum CMS","Geração de arquivos de componente","Inclusão de testes unitários","Customização de estilos e templates"],"ru":["Создание независимых компонентов","Следование конвенциям Momentum CMS","Генерация файлов компонента","Включение модульных тестов","Настройка стилей и шаблонов"],"ar":["إنشاء مكونات مستقلة","اتباع اتفاقيات Momentum CMS","توليد ملفات المكون","إضافة اختبارات الوحدة","تخصيص الأنماط والقوالب"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Angular 组件生成","Momentum CMS","独立组件","组件开发","Angular 开发工具","前端开发"],"ja":["Angular コンポーネント生成","Momentum CMS","スタンドアロン コンポーネント","コンポーネント開発","Angular 開発ツール","フロントエンド開発"],"ko":["Angular 컴포넌트 생성","Momentum CMS","독립 컴포넌트","컴포넌트 개발","Angular 개발 도구","프론트엔드 개발"],"es":["componente angular","momentum cms","desarrollo web","programación angular","creación de componentes","convenciones de codificación"],"fr":["composant angular","momentum cms","développement web","programmation angular","création de composants","conventions de codage"],"de":["angular-komponente","momentum cms","webentwicklung","angular-programmierung","erstellung von komponenten","codierkonventionen"],"pt":["componente angular","momentum cms","desenvolvimento de aplicativos","angular standalone","convenções de codificação","geração de componentes"],"ru":["компонент angular","momentum cms","разработка приложений","angular standalone","конвенции кодирования","генерация компонентов"],"ar":["مكون أنجولار","مومنتوم سي إم إس","تطوير التطبيقات","أنجولار مستقل","اتفاقيات الترميز","توليد المكونات"]}},"owner":"DonaldMurillo","repo":"momentum-cms","repoPath":"DonaldMurillo/momentum-cms","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.432Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"component","description":"Generate a standalone Angular component with signals and modern patterns","bodyPreview":"# Generate Angular Component\n\nCreate a standalone Angular component following Momentum CMS conventions.\n\n## Arguments\n- First argument: Library path (e.g., \"admin\", \"admin/components\")\n- Second argument: Component name (e.g., \"data-table\", \"field-renderer\")\n\n## Steps\n\n1. Create component files in `libs/<library>/src/lib/<component>/`:\n   - `<component>.ts` (component class)\n   - `<component>.html` (template, if complex)\n   - `<component>.css` (styles)\n   - `<component>.spec.ts` (tests)\n\n2. Use t","body":"# Generate Angular Component\n\nCreate a standalone Angular component following Momentum CMS conventions.\n\n## Arguments\n- First argument: Library path (e.g., \"admin\", \"admin/components\")\n- Second argument: Component name (e.g., \"data-table\", \"field-renderer\")\n\n## Steps\n\n1. Create component files in `libs/<library>/src/lib/<component>/`:\n   - `<component>.ts` (component class)\n   - `<component>.html` (template, if complex)\n   - `<component>.css` (styles)\n   - `<component>.spec.ts` (tests)\n\n2. Use this template for the component:\n```typescript\nimport { Component, input, output, computed, signal, inject } from ''@angular/core'';\nimport { CommonModule } from ''@angular/common'';\n\n@Component({\n  selector: ''mcms-<component-name>'',\n  standalone: true,\n  imports: [CommonModule],\n  template: `\n    <!-- Template here -->\n  `,\n  styles: [`\n    :host {\n      display: block;\n    }\n  `],\n  changeDetection: ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush,\n})\nexport class <PascalName>Component {\n  // Signal inputs\n  data = input.required<any>();\n\n  // Optional inputs with defaults\n  disabled = input(false);\n\n  // Signal outputs\n  valueChange = output<any>();\n\n  // Internal state\n  private _loading = signal(false);\n\n  // Computed values\n  readonly loading = this._loading.asReadonly();\n  readonly hasData = computed(() => !!this.data());\n\n  // Injected services\n  private readonly http = inject(HttpClient);\n}\n```\n\n3. Export from library''s `index.ts`:\n```typescript\nexport { <PascalName>Component } from ''./lib/<component>/<component>'';\n```\n\n## Key Conventions\n- Always use `standalone: true`\n- Always use `ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush`\n- Use `input()` and `input.required()` for inputs\n- Use `output()` for outputs\n- Use `signal()` for internal state\n- Use `computed()` for derived values\n- Use `inject()` for dependency injection\n- Use `@for`/`@if`/`@switch` control flow\n- Prefix selectors with `mcms-`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:16:37.483Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing rapid Angular component development following Momentum CMS conventions.","zh":"非常适合需要快速Angular组件开发并遵循Momentum CMS约定的前端代理。","ja":"Momentum CMSの規約に従った迅速なAngularコンポーネント開発を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Momentum CMS 규약을 따르는 빠른 Angular 컴포넌트 개발이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan un desarrollo rápido de componentes Angular siguiendo las convenciones de Momentum CMS.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin d''un développement rapide de composants Angular suivant les conventions de Momentum CMS.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die eine schnelle Entwicklung von Angular-Komponenten nach den Konventionen von Momentum CMS benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes Frontend que necessitam de desenvolvimento rápido de componentes Angular seguindo as convenções do Momentum CMS.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым требуется быстрая разработка компонентов Angular в соответствии с конвенциями Momentum CMS.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم التي تحتاج إلى تطوير سريع لمكونات Angular اتباعًا لتقاليد Momentum CMS."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate standalone Angular components with accompanying TypeScript classes, HTML templates, and CSS styles, leveraging library paths and component names to create structured files within the `libs` directory.","zh":"赋予代理生成独立的Angular组件，包括伴随的TypeScript类、HTML模板和CSS样式，利用库路径和组件名称在`libs`目录中创建结构化文件。","ja":"エージェントが、ライブラリパスとコンポーネント名を使用して`libs`ディレクトリ内に構造化されたファイルを作成する、TypeScriptクラス、HTMLテンプレート、CSSスタイルを伴う独立したAngularコンポーネントを生成できる。","ko":"에이전트가 라이브러리 경로와 컴포넌트 이름을 사용하여 `libs` 디렉토리 내에 구조화된 파일을 생성하는 独立된 Angular 컴포넌트를 생성할 수 있도록 하며, TypeScript 클래스, HTML 템플릿 및 CSS 스타일을 포함합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar componentes Angular autónomos con clases TypeScript acompañantes, plantillas HTML y estilos CSS, aprovechando los caminos de la biblioteca y los nombres de los componentes para crear archivos estructurados dentro del directorio `libs`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des composants Angular autonomes avec des classes TypeScript accompagnatrices, des modèles HTML et des styles CSS, en exploitant les chemins de bibliothèque et les noms de composants pour créer des fichiers structurés dans le répertoire `libs`.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, autarke Angular-Komponenten mit begleitenden TypeScript-Klassen, HTML-Vorlagen und CSS-Stilen zu generieren, indem es Bibliothekspfade und Komponentennamen nutzt, um strukturierte Dateien innerhalb des `libs`-Verzeichnisses zu erstellen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerem componentes Angular autônomos com classes TypeScript acompanhantes, modelos HTML e estilos CSS, aproveitando caminhos de bibliotecas e nomes de componentes para criar arquivos estruturados no diretório `libs`.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать автономные компоненты Angular с сопутствующими классами TypeScript, шаблонами HTML и стилями CSS, используя пути библиотек и имена компонентов для создания структурированных файлов в директории `libs`.","ar":"يمكن للعميل توليد مكونات Angular مستقلة مع فئات TypeScript المرافقة وقوالب HTML وأسلوب CSS، واستخدام مسارات المكتبات وأسماء المكونات لإنشاء ملفات منظمة في الدليل `libs`."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating data-table components for dynamic data visualization","Creating field-renderer components for custom form handling","Automating component testing with spec files"],"zh":["为动态数据可视化生成数据表格组件","为自定义表单处理创建字段渲染器组件","使用规格文件自动化组件测试"],"ja":["動的データ視覚化用のデータテーブルコンポーネントを生成する","カスタムフォームハンドリング用のフィールドレンダラーコンポーネントを作成する","スペックファイルを使用してコンポーネントテストを自動化する"],"ko":["동적 데이터 시각화를 위한 데이터 테이블 컴포넌트 생성","사용자 지정 양식 처리를 위한 필드 렌더러 컴포넌트 생성","규격 파일을 사용하여 컴포넌트 테스트 자동화"],"es":["Generación de componentes de tabla de datos para la visualización de datos dinámicos","Creación de componentes de representación de campos para el manejo personalizado de formularios","Automatización de pruebas de componentes con archivos de especificación"],"fr":["Génération de composants de tableau de données pour la visualisation de données dynamiques","Création de composants de représentation de champs pour la gestion personnalisée de formulaires","Automatisation des tests de composants avec des fichiers de spécification"],"de":["Generierung von Daten-Tabelle-Komponenten für die dynamische Datenvisualisierung","Erstellung von Feld-Renderer-Komponenten für die benutzerdefinierte Formularverarbeitung","Automatisierung von Komponententests mit Spezifikationsdateien"],"pt":["Geração de componentes de tabela de dados para visualização de dados dinâmicos","Criação de componentes de renderização de campos para manipulação de formulários personalizados","Automatização de testes de componentes com arquivos de especificação"],"ru":["Генерация компонентов таблицы данных для визуализации динамических данных","Создание компонентов рендеринга полей для настраиваемой обработки форм","Автоматизация тестирования компонентов с помощью файлов спецификации"],"ar":["توليد مكونات جدول البيانات للتصوير البياني للبيانات الديناميكية","إنشاء مكونات معالجة الحقول للتعامل مع الاستمارات المخصصة","أتمتة اختبار المكونات باستخدام ملفات المواصفة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Momentum CMS setup","Angular-specific","Library path and component name arguments required"],"zh":["需要Momentum CMS设置","特定于Angular","需要库路径和组件名称参数"],"ja":["Momentum CMSの設定が必要","Angular特有","ライブラリパスとコンポーネント名の引数が必要"],"ko":["Momentum CMS 설정이 필요","Angular 전용","라이브러리 경로 및 컴포넌트 이름 인수가 필요"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Momentum CMS","Específico de Angular","Se requieren argumentos de camino de biblioteca y nombre de componente"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de Momentum CMS","Spécifique à Angular","Des arguments de chemin de bibliothèque et de nom de composant sont requis"],"de":["Benötigt Momentum-CMS-Setup","Angular-spezifisch","Bibliothekspfad- und Komponentenname-Argumente erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer configuração do Momentum CMS","Específico do Angular","Argumentos de caminho de biblioteca e nome de componente são necessários"],"ru":["Требуется настройка Momentum CMS","Специфичен для Angular","Требуются аргументы пути библиотеки и имени компонента"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Momentum CMS","محدد لشركة Angular","مطلوب حجة مسار المكتبة واسم المكون"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('zsxawerdu/gitexplorer/avalonia', 'community', 'zsxawerdu', 'gitexplorer', 'zsxawerdu/gitexplorer', 'avalonia', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.432Z', '2026-02-18T05:16:14.189Z', NULL, '{"id":"zsxawerdu/gitexplorer/avalonia","name":"avalonia","description":{"zh":"Avalonia UI开发专家，精通C#和Avalonia UI开发，能够创建美观且功能性的界面","ja":"Avalonia UI開発の専門家で、C#とAvalonia UI開発に精通しています。美しく機能的なインターフェイスを作成することができます","ko":"Avalonia UI 개발 전문가로 C# 및 Avalonia UI 개발에 능숙하여 아름답고 기능적인 인터페이스를 생성할 수 있습니다","es":"Avalonia UI es un framework de desarrollo de aplicaciones que permite crear interfaces de usuario personalizadas y funcionales. Combina C# con XAML para una experiencia de usuario óptima.","fr":"Avalonia UI est un framework de développement d''applications qui permet de créer des interfaces utilisateur personnalisées et fonctionnelles. Il combine C# avec XAML pour une expérience utilisateur optimale.","de":"Avalonia UI ist ein Framework für die Anwendungsentwicklung, mit dem Sie benutzerdefinierte und funktionale Benutzeroberflächen erstellen können. Es kombiniert C# mit XAML für eine optimale Benutzererfahrung.","pt":"Avalonia UI é uma plataforma de desenvolvimento de interfaces para aplicações desktop. Com expertise em C# e design visual, é possível criar aplicações com interfaces atraentes.","ru":"Avalonia UI — это платформа для разработки интерфейсов для настольных приложений. С опытом в C# и визуальном дизайне можно создавать приложения с привлекательными интерфейсами.","ar":"أفالونيا يو آي هي منصة لتطوير الواجهات لتطبيقات سطح المكتب. مع الخبرة في سي شارب والتصميم البصري، يمكن إنشاء تطبيقات مع واجهات جذابة.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Avalonia UI开发专家","ja":"Avalonia UI開発の専門家","ko":"Avalonia UI 개발 전문가","es":"Avalonia UI: Desarrollo de Interfaces de Usuario","fr":"Avalonia UI : Développement d''Interfaces Utilisateur","de":"Avalonia UI: Entwicklung von Benutzeroberflächen","pt":"Avalonia UI: Desenvolvimento de Interfaces","ru":"Avalonia UI: Разработка Интерфейсов","ar":"أفالونيا يو آي: تطوير الواجهات","en":"avalonia"},"description":{"zh":"Avalonia UI开发专家，精通C#和Avalonia UI开发，能够创建美观且功能性的界面","ja":"Avalonia UI開発の専門家で、C#とAvalonia UI開発に精通しています。美しく機能的なインターフェイスを作成することができます","ko":"Avalonia UI 개발 전문가로 C# 및 Avalonia UI 개발에 능숙하여 아름답고 기능적인 인터페이스를 생성할 수 있습니다","es":"Avalonia UI es un framework de desarrollo de aplicaciones que permite crear interfaces de usuario personalizadas y funcionales. Combina C# con XAML para una ...","fr":"Avalonia UI est un framework de développement d''applications qui permet de créer des interfaces utilisateur personnalisées et fonctionnelles. Il combine C# a...","de":"Avalonia UI ist ein Framework für die Anwendungsentwicklung, mit dem Sie benutzerdefinierte und funktionale Benutzeroberflächen erstellen können. Es kombinie...","pt":"Avalonia UI é uma plataforma de desenvolvimento de interfaces para aplicações desktop. Com expertise em C# e design visual, é possível criar aplicações com i...","ru":"Avalonia UI — это платформа для разработки интерфейсов для настольных приложений. С опытом в C# и визуальном дизайне можно создавать приложения с привлекател...","ar":"أفالونيا يو آي هي منصة لتطوير الواجهات لتطبيقات سطح المكتب. مع الخبرة في سي شارب والتصميم البصري، يمكن إنشاء تطبيقات مع واجهات جذابة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["XAML语法","视图模型","交互设计","美观界面","功能性界面"],"ja":["XAML構文","ViewModel","インタラクション設計","美しいインターフェイス","機能的なインターフェイス"],"ko":["XAML 문법","뷰 모델","상호 작용 설계","아름다운 인터페이스","기능적인 인터페이스"],"es":["Desarrollo de interfaces de usuario personalizadas","Uso de C# y XAML","Diseño visual y de interacción","Creación de interfaces funcionales y hermosas","Compatibilidad con records y value types"],"fr":["Développement d''interfaces utilisateur personnalisées","Utilisation de C# et XAML","Conception visuelle et d''interaction","Création d''interfaces fonctionnelles et belles","Compatibilité avec les records et les value types"],"de":["Erstellung benutzerdefinierter Benutzeroberflächen","Verwendung von C# und XAML","Visuelles und interaktives Design","Erstellung funktionaler und schöner Benutzeroberflächen","Kompatibilität mit Records und Value-Typen"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de interfaces com C#","Design visual e interação","Criação de aplicações desktop com XAML","Uso de records, value types e padrões procedurais","Integração com ViewModels e bindings"],"ru":["Разработка интерфейсов с помощью C#","Визуальный дизайн и взаимодействие","Создание настольных приложений с XAML","Использование записей, типов значений и процедурных шаблонов","Интеграция с ViewModels и привязками"],"ar":["تطوير الواجهات باستخدام سي شارب","التصميم البصري والتفاعل","إنشاء تطبيقات سطح المكتب مع XAML","استخدام السجلات والأنواع القيمة والأنماط الإجرائية","التكامل مع ViewModels والرابط"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Avalonia UI","C#","XAML","视图模型","交互设计","界面设计"],"ja":["Avalonia UI","C#","XAML","ViewModel","インタラクション設計","インターフェイス設計"],"ko":["Avalonia UI","C#","XAML","뷰 모델","상호 작용 설계","인터페이스 디자인"],"es":["Avalonia UI","C#","XAML","desarrollo de aplicaciones","interfaces de usuario","diseño visual","diseño de interacción","records","value types"],"fr":["Avalonia UI","C#","XAML","développement d''applications","interfaces utilisateur","conception visuelle","conception d''interaction","records","value types"],"de":["Avalonia UI","C#","XAML","Anwendungsentwicklung","Benutzeroberflächen","visuelles Design","interaktives Design","Records","Value-Typen"],"pt":["Avalonia UI","Desenvolvimento de interfaces","C#","XAML","Design visual","Aplicações desktop","ViewModels","Bindings"],"ru":["Avalonia UI","Разработка интерфейсов","C#","XAML","Визуальный дизайн","Настольные приложения","ViewModels","Привязки"],"ar":["أفالونيا يو آي","تطوير الواجهات","سي شارب","XAML","التصميم البصري","تطبيقات سطح المكتب","ViewModels","الرابط"]}},"owner":"zsxawerdu","repo":"gitexplorer","repoPath":"zsxawerdu/gitexplorer","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.432Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"avalonia","description":"Avalonia UI development - XAML, MVVM, styling, and patterns","bodyPreview":"You are an expert in C# and Avalonia UI development. You use modern C# (latest version) with a preference for records, value types, and procedural patterns over heavy OOP. You think in terms of data flow.\n\nYou are also an Avalonia UI designer with expertise in visual design, interaction design, and creating beautiful, functional interfaces.\n\n# Avalonia UI Skill\n\n## When to Read Each File\n\n| Need | File |\n|------|------|\n| XAML syntax, selectors, bindings, templates | CORE.md |\n| ViewModels, comm","body":"You are an expert in C# and Avalonia UI development. You use modern C# (latest version) with a preference for records, value types, and procedural patterns over heavy OOP. You think in terms of data flow.\n\nYou are also an Avalonia UI designer with expertise in visual design, interaction design, and creating beautiful, functional interfaces.\n\n# Avalonia UI Skill\n\n## When to Read Each File\n\n| Need | File |\n|------|------|\n| XAML syntax, selectors, bindings, templates | CORE.md |\n| ViewModels, commands, validation, messaging | MVVM.md |\n| Animations, transitions, styling, colors | DESIGN.md |\n| UI patterns: sidebar, navigation, DataGrid | PATTERNS.md |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n- **File extension**: `.axaml` (not `.xaml`)\n- **Namespace**: `https://github.com/avaloniaui`\n- **Styles**: CSS-like selectors (not WPF TargetType)\n- **No triggers**: Use pseudo-classes (`:pointerover`, `:pressed`)\n- **MVVM toolkit**: CommunityToolkit.Mvvm\n- **Cross-platform**: Windows, macOS, Linux, iOS, Android, WebAssembly\n\n## Scaffold Commands\n\n```bash\n# New MVVM app (recommended)\ndotnet new avalonia.mvvm -o MyApp\n\n# Add new window\ndotnet new avalonia.window -n MyWindow -o Views\n\n# Add new UserControl\ndotnet new avalonia.usercontrol -n MyControl -o Views\n\n# Add resource dictionary\ndotnet new avalonia.resource -n MyResources -o Styles\n\n# Add styles file\ndotnet new avalonia.styles -n MyStyles -o Styles\n\n# Add templated control\ndotnet new avalonia.templatedcontrol -n MyControl -o Controls\n```\n\n## Key Differences from WPF\n\n| WPF | Avalonia |\n|-----|----------|\n| `.xaml` | `.axaml` |\n| `TargetType` + `BasedOn` | CSS-like selectors |\n| Triggers | Pseudo-classes |\n| `<RotateTransform/>` | `rotate(45deg)` |\n| Style for templates | ControlTheme |\n\n## Project Structure\n\n```\nMyApp/\n├── Assets/           # Icons, images, fonts\n├── Converters/       # Value converters\n├── Models/           # Data models (records)\n├── Styles/           # AXAML style files\n├── ViewModels/       # MVVM ViewModels\n├── Views/            # AXAML views + code-behind\n├── App.axaml         # Application resources\n├── Program.cs        # Entry point\n└── ViewLocator.cs    # View-ViewModel mapping\n```\n\n## Documentation\n\n- Official docs: https://docs.avaloniaui.net\n- Samples: https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia.Samples\n- Playground: https://play.avaloniaui.net\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:16:14.189Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for C#-based AI Agents needing advanced desktop UI development with Avalonia UI and modern C# features like records and value types.","zh":"非常适合需要使用Avalonia UI进行高级桌面UI开发并使用现代C#功能（如记录和值类型）的C#-based AI代理。","ja":"Avalonia UIを使用した高級デスクトップUI開発と、レコードや値の型などの最新のC#機能を使用するC#ベースのAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Avalonia UI를 사용하여 고급 데스크톱 UI 개발 및 레코드 및 값 형식などの 최신 C# 기능을 사용하는 C# 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA basados en C# que necesitan desarrollo de UI de escritorio avanzado con Avalonia UI y características modernas de C# como registros y tipos de valor.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA basés sur C# nécessitant un développement d''interface utilisateur de bureau avancé avec Avalonia UI et des fonctionnalités C# modernes comme les enregistrements et les types de valeur.","de":"Perfekt für C#-basierte KI-Agents, die eine fortschrittliche Desktop-Benutzeroberflächen-Entwicklung mit Avalonia UI und modernen C#-Funktionen wie Aufzeichnungen und Werttypen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de IA baseados em C# que necessitam de desenvolvimento de UI de desktop avançado com Avalonia UI e recursos modernos de C# como registros e tipos de valor.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ на основе C#, которым требуется продвинутая разработка десктоп-интерфейсов с помощью Avalonia UI и современных функций C#, таких как записи и типы значений.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات إيفاي الأعمال الذكية القائمة على C# التي تحتاج إلى تطوير واجهة المستخدم على سطح المكتب متقدمة مع Avalonia UI وميزات C# الحديثة مثل السجلات وأنواع القيمة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design and develop beautiful, functional interfaces using Avalonia UI, with expertise in XAML syntax, selectors, bindings, and templates, as well as ViewModels and communication patterns, leveraging procedural patterns and data flow thinking.","zh":"赋予代理设计和开发使用Avalonia UI创建美观且功能齐全的接口的能力，具有XAML语法、选择器、绑定和模板的专业知识，以及视图模型和通信模式，利用程序化模式和数据流思维。","ja":"Avalonia UIを使用して美しく機能的なインターフェースを設計および開発するエージェントを可能にし、XAML構文、セレクタ、バインディング、テンプレート、ViewModel、およびコミュニケーションパターンの専門知識を提供し、手続き型パターンとデータフローの思考を活用します。","ko":"에이전트가 Avalonia UI를 사용하여 아름답고 기능적인 인터페이스를 설계 및 개발할 수 있도록 하며, XAML 구문, 선택기, 바인딩, 템플릿, 뷰 모델 및 통신 패턴에 대한 전문 지식과 절차적 패턴 및 데이터 흐름 사고를 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar y desarrollar interfaces hermosas y funcionales utilizando Avalonia UI, con experiencia en sintaxis XAML, selectores, enlaces y plantillas, así como ViewModels y patrones de comunicación, aprovechando patrones procedimentales y pensamiento de flujo de datos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir et de développer des interfaces belles et fonctionnelles en utilisant Avalonia UI, avec une expertise dans la syntaxe XAML, les sélecteurs, les liaisons et les modèles, ainsi que les ViewModels et les modèles de communication, en exploitant les modèles procéduraux et la pensée de flux de données.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, schöne und funktionale Schnittstellen mit Avalonia UI zu entwerfen und zu entwickeln, mit Erfahrung in XAML-Syntax, Selektoren, Bindungen und Vorlagen sowie ViewModels und Kommunikationsmustern, die prozedurale Muster und Datenflussdenken nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar e desenvolver interfaces bonitas e funcionais usando Avalonia UI, com especialização em sintaxe XAML, seletores, vinculações e modelos, bem como ViewModels e padrões de comunicação, aproveitando padrões procedurais e pensamento de fluxo de dados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать и разрабатывать красивые, функциональные интерфейсы с использованием Avalonia UI, с опытом работы с синтаксисом XAML, селекторами, привязками и шаблонами, а также ViewModel и шаблонами общения, используя процедурные шаблоны и мыслительный подход к потоку данных.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تصميم وتطوير واجهات المستخدم الجميلة والوظيفية باستخدام Avalonia UI، مع الخبرة في بناء الجملة XAML والمحددات والربطات والقوالب، بالإضافة إلى نماذج العرض وأنماط الاتصال، واستخدام أنماط إجرائية وتفكير تدفق البيانات."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing and implementing visually appealing desktop applications with Avalonia UI","Creating interactive and responsive user interfaces using XAML and bindings","Developing ViewModels and managing data flow in Avalonia UI applications"],"zh":["使用Avalonia UI设计和实现视觉上吸引人的桌面应用程序","使用XAML和绑定创建交互式和响应式用户界面","开发ViewModel并在Avalonia UI应用程序中管理数据流"],"ja":["Avalonia UIを使用して視覚的に魅力的なデスクトップアプリケーションを設計および実装する","XAMLとバインディングを使用してインタラクティブでレスポンシブなユーザーインターフェースを作成する","ViewModelを開発し、Avalonia UIアプリケーションのデータフローを管理する"],"ko":["Avalonia UI를 사용하여 시각적으로 매력적인 데스크톱 애플리케이션을 설계 및 구현하는 것","XAML 및 바인딩을 사용하여 상호 작용형 및 반응형 사용자 인터페이스를 생성하는 것","뷰 모델을 개발하고 Avalonia UI 애플리케이션의 데이터 흐름을 관리하는 것"],"es":["Diseñar e implementar aplicaciones de escritorio visualmente atractivas con Avalonia UI","Crear interfaces de usuario interactivas y responsivas utilizando XAML y enlaces","Desarrollar ViewModels y gestionar el flujo de datos en aplicaciones de Avalonia UI"],"fr":["Concevoir et mettre en œuvre des applications de bureau visuellement attrayantes avec Avalonia UI","Créer des interfaces utilisateur interactives et réactives en utilisant XAML et des liaisons","Développer des ViewModels et gérer le flux de données dans les applications Avalonia UI"],"de":["Visuell ansprechende Desktop-Anwendungen mit Avalonia UI entwerfen und implementieren","Interaktive und responsive Benutzeroberflächen mit XAML und Bindungen erstellen","ViewModels entwickeln und Datenfluss in Avalonia-UI-Anwendungen verwalten"],"pt":["Projetar e implementar aplicações de desktop visualmente atraentes com Avalonia UI","Criar interfaces de usuário interativas e responsivas usando XAML e vinculações","Desenvolver ViewModels e gerenciar o fluxo de dados em aplicações Avalonia UI"],"ru":["Проектировать и реализовывать визуально привлекательные десктоп-приложения с помощью Avalonia UI","Создавать интерактивные и отзывчивые пользовательские интерфейсы с использованием XAML и привязок","Разрабатывать ViewModel и управлять потоком данных в приложениях Avalonia UI"],"ar":["تصميم وتطبيق تطبيقات سطح المكتب بصرية جذابة مع Avalonia UI","إنشاء واجهات مستخدم تفاعلية واستجابة باستخدام XAML والربطات","تطوير نماذج العرض وإدارة تدفق البيانات في تطبيقات Avalonia UI"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of C# and Avalonia UI","Focuses on desktop UI development, not web or mobile","Uses specific C# features like records and value types, which may require modern C# versions"],"zh":["需要C#和Avalonia UI的知识","专注于桌面UI开发，而不是Web或移动开发","使用特定的C#功能，如记录和值类型，这可能需要现代C#版本"],"ja":["C#とAvalonia UIの知識が必要","デスクトップUI開発に焦点を当て、Webやモバイル開発には対応していない","レコードや値の型などの特定のC#機能を使用するため、最新のC#バージョンが必要となる場合がある"],"ko":["C# 및 Avalonia UI에 대한 지식이 필요합니다.","데스크톱 UI 개발에 중점을 두고 웹 또는 모바일 개발에는対応하지 않습니다.","레코드 및 값 형식과 같은 특정 C# 기능을 사용하므로 최신 C# 버전이 필요할 수 있습니다."],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de C# y Avalonia UI","Se centra en el desarrollo de UI de escritorio, no en web o móvil","Utiliza características específicas de C# como registros y tipos de valor, que pueden requerir versiones modernas de C#"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en C# et Avalonia UI","Se concentre sur le développement d''interface utilisateur de bureau, et non sur le web ou le mobile","Utilise des fonctionnalités spécifiques de C# comme les enregistrements et les types de valeur, qui peuvent nécessiter des versions modernes de C#"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse in C# und Avalonia UI","Konzentriert sich auf die Entwicklung von Desktop-Benutzeroberflächen, nicht auf Web oder Mobile","Nutzt spezifische C#-Funktionen wie Aufzeichnungen und Werttypen, die möglicherweise moderne C#-Versionen erfordern"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de C# e Avalonia UI","Concentra-se no desenvolvimento de UI de desktop, não na web ou móvel","Usa recursos específicos de C# como registros e tipos de valor, que podem requerer versões modernas de C#"],"ru":["Требует знания C# и Avalonia UI","Сосредоточен на разработке десктоп-интерфейсов, а не веб- или мобильных","Использует специфические функции C#, такие как записи и типы значений, которые могут требовать современных версий C#"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة C# وAvalonia UI","يركز على تطوير واجهة المستخدم على سطح المكتب، وليس على الويب أو الهاتف المحمول","يستخدم ميزات محددة من C# مثل السجلات وأنواع القيمة، والتي قد تتطلب إصدارات حديثة من C#"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Kjdragan/universal_agent/github', 'community', 'Kjdragan', 'universal_agent', 'Kjdragan/universal_agent', 'github', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.432Z', '2026-02-18T05:17:26.813Z', NULL, '{"id":"Kjdragan/universal_agent/github","name":"github","description":{"zh":"GitHub技能允许开发者使用gh CLI管理仓库，检查CI状态和查看工作流运行","ja":"GitHubスキルは、開発者がgh CLIを使用してリポジトリを管理し、CIステータスを確認し、ワークフローの実行を表示する","ko":"GitHub 스킬은 개발자가 gh CLI를 사용하여 저장소를 관리하고 CI 상태를 확인하며 워크플로 실행을 표시","es":"La herramienta GitHub permite interactuar con el repositorio desde la línea de comandos, facilitando la automatización de tareas y el seguimiento de los flujos de trabajo","fr":"L''outil GitHub permet d''interagir avec le référentiel depuis la ligne de commande, facilitant l''automatisation des tâches et le suivi des flux de travail","de":"Das GitHub-Tool ermöglicht die Interaktion mit dem Repository über die Kommandozeile, was die Automatisierung von Aufgaben und die Überwachung von Workflows erleichtert","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"GitHub技能：使用gh CLI管理仓库","ja":"GitHubスキル：gh CLIでリポジトリを管理","ko":"GitHub 스킬: gh CLI로 저장소 관리","es":"Herramienta GitHub: Interactúa con GitHub desde la línea ...","fr":"Outil GitHub : Interagir avec GitHub à partir de la ligne...","de":"GitHub-Tool: Interagieren mit GitHub über die Kommandozeile","en":"github"},"description":{"zh":"GitHub技能允许开发者使用gh CLI管理仓库，检查CI状态和查看工作流运行","ja":"GitHubスキルは、開発者がgh CLIを使用してリポジトリを管理し、CIステータスを確認し、ワークフローの実行を表示する","ko":"GitHub 스킬은 개발자가 gh CLI를 사용하여 저장소를 관리하고 CI 상태를 확인하며 워크플로 실행을 표시","es":"La herramienta GitHub permite interactuar con el repositorio desde la línea de comandos, facilitando la automatización de tareas y el seguimiento de los fluj...","fr":"L''outil GitHub permet d''interagir avec le référentiel depuis la ligne de commande, facilitant l''automatisation des tâches et le suivi des flux de travail","de":"Das GitHub-Tool ermöglicht die Interaktion mit dem Repository über die Kommandozeile, was die Automatisierung von Aufgaben und die Überwachung von Workflows ...","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["使用gh CLI管理仓库","检查CI状态","查看工作流运行","查看运行日志","管理Pull Request"],"ja":["gh CLIを使用してリポジトリを管理","CIステータスの確認","ワークフローの実行を表示","実行ログの表示","プルリクエストの管理"],"ko":["gh CLI로 저장소를 관리","CI 상태 확인","워크플로 실행 표시","실행 로그 표시","풀 리퀘스트 관리"],"es":["Interactuar con el repositorio de GitHub desde la línea de comandos","Verificar el estado de los flujos de trabajo","Listar las ejecuciones recientes de los flujos de trabajo","Ver los registros de los pasos que fallaron","Automatizar tareas y flujos de trabajo"],"fr":["Interagir avec le référentiel GitHub depuis la ligne de commande","Vérifier l''état des flux de travail","Lister les exécutions récentes des flux de travail","Voir les journaux des étapes qui ont échoué","Automatiser des tâches et des flux de travail"],"de":["Interagieren mit dem GitHub-Repository über die Kommandozeile","Überprüfen des Status der Workflows","Auflisten der kürzlichen Ausführungen von Workflows","Anzeigen der Protokolle der fehlgeschlagenen Schritte","Automatisieren von Aufgaben und Workflows"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GitHub","gh CLI","CI状态","工作流运行","Pull Request","仓库管理","开发工具"],"ja":["GitHub","gh CLI","CIステータス","ワークフローの実行","プルリクエスト","リポジトリ管理","開発ツール"],"ko":["GitHub","gh CLI","CI 상태","워크플로 실행","풀 리퀘스트","저장소 관리","개발 도구"],"es":["github","herramienta de línea de comandos","automatización de tareas","seguimiento de flujos de trabajo","interacción con el repositorio","github cli","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["github","outil de ligne de commande","automatisation de tâches","suivi des flux de travail","interaction avec le référentiel","github cli","développement de logiciels"],"de":["github","kommandozeilen-tool","automatisierung von aufgaben","überwachung von workflows","interaktion mit dem repository","github cli","software-entwicklung"]}},"owner":"Kjdragan","repo":"universal_agent","repoPath":"Kjdragan/universal_agent","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.432Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"github","description":"Interact with GitHub using the `gh` CLI. Use `gh issue`, `gh pr`, `gh run`, and `gh api` for issues, PRs, CI runs, and advanced queries.","bodyPreview":"# GitHub Skill\n\nUse the `gh` CLI to interact with GitHub. Always specify `--repo owner/repo` when not in a git directory, or use URLs directly.\n\n## Pull Requests\n\nCheck CI status on a PR:\n```bash\ngh pr checks 55 --repo owner/repo\n```\n\nList recent workflow runs:\n```bash\ngh run list --repo owner/repo --limit 10\n```\n\nView a run and see which steps failed:\n```bash\ngh run view <run-id> --repo owner/repo\n```\n\nView logs for failed steps only:\n```bash\ngh run view <run-id> --repo owner/repo --log-failed","body":"# GitHub Skill\n\nUse the `gh` CLI to interact with GitHub. Always specify `--repo owner/repo` when not in a git directory, or use URLs directly.\n\n## Pull Requests\n\nCheck CI status on a PR:\n```bash\ngh pr checks 55 --repo owner/repo\n```\n\nList recent workflow runs:\n```bash\ngh run list --repo owner/repo --limit 10\n```\n\nView a run and see which steps failed:\n```bash\ngh run view <run-id> --repo owner/repo\n```\n\nView logs for failed steps only:\n```bash\ngh run view <run-id> --repo owner/repo --log-failed\n```\n\n## API for Advanced Queries\n\nThe `gh api` command is useful for accessing data not available through other subcommands.\n\nGet PR with specific fields:\n```bash\ngh api repos/owner/repo/pulls/55 --jq ''.title, .state, .user.login''\n```\n\n## JSON Output\n\nMost commands support `--json` for structured output.  You can use `--jq` to filter:\n\n```bash\ngh issue list --repo owner/repo --json number,title --jq ''.[] | \"\\(.number): \\(.title)\"''\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T05:17:26.813Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing advanced GitHub repository management and automation capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 GitHub 仓库管理和自动化功能的开发代理。","ja":"GitHub リポジトリの管理と自動化機能が高度に必要な開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 GitHub 리포지토리 관리 및 자동화 기능이 필요한 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de administración y automatización de repositorios de GitHub.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin de capacités avancées de gestion et d''automatisation de référentiels GitHub.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungssagenten, die erweiterte GitHub-Repository-Verwaltungs- und Automatisierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfect for Development Agents needing advanced GitHub repository management and automation capabilities.","ru":"Perfect for Development Agents needing advanced GitHub repository management and automation capabilities.","ar":"Perfect for Development Agents needing advanced GitHub repository management and automation capabilities."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to interact with GitHub using the `gh` CLI, providing features like CI status checks on pull requests, workflow run management, and log analysis for failed steps using protocols like `--repo owner/repo` and `--log-failed`.","zh":"赋予代理使用 `gh` CLI 与 GitHub 交互的能力，提供诸如拉取请求的 CI 状态检查、工作流运行管理和使用诸如 `--repo owner/repo` 和 `--log-failed` 的协议来分析失败步骤的日志等功能。","ja":"エージェントが `gh` CLI を使用して GitHub とやり取りできるようにし、プルリクエストの CI ステータスチェック、ワークフローの実行管理、`--repo owner/repo` や `--log-failed` などのプロトコルを使用して失敗したステップのログを分析するなどの機能を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 `gh` CLI를 사용하여 GitHub와 상호 작용할 수 있도록 하여, 풀 리퀘스트의 CI 상태 검사, 워크플로 실행 관리 및 `--repo owner/repo` 및 `--log-failed`와 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 실패한 단계의 로그를 분석하는 등의 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a interactuar con GitHub mediante la CLI `gh`, proporcionando características como comprobaciones de estado de CI en solicitudes de extracción, administración de ejecuciones de flujo de trabajo y análisis de registros para pasos fallidos utilizando protocolos como `--repo owner/repo` y `--log-failed`.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''interagir avec GitHub à l''aide de la CLI `gh`, offrant des fonctionnalités telles que les vérifications d''état de CI sur les demandes d''extraction, la gestion des exécutions de workflow et l''analyse des journaux pour les étapes échouées en utilisant des protocoles tels que `--repo owner/repo` et `--log-failed`.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, mit GitHub über die `gh`-CLI zu interagieren und bietet Funktionen wie CI-Status-Checks für Pull-Requests, Workflow-Ausführungsverwaltung und Log-Analyse für fehlgeschlagene Schritte unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie `--repo owner/repo` und `--log-failed`.","pt":"Empowers agents to interact with GitHub using the `gh` CLI, providing features like CI status checks on pull requests, workflow run management, and log analysis for failed steps using protocols like `--repo owner/repo` and `--log-failed`.","ru":"Empowers agents to interact with GitHub using the `gh` CLI, providing features like CI status checks on pull requests, workflow run management, and log analysis for failed steps using protocols like `--repo owner/repo` and `--log-failed`.","ar":"Empowers agents to interact with GitHub using the `gh` CLI, providing features like CI status checks on pull requests, workflow run management, and log analysis for failed steps using protocols like `--repo owner/repo` and `--log-failed`."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating pull request checks with `gh pr checks`","Debugging failed workflow runs using `gh run view`","Monitoring recent workflow runs with `gh run list`"],"zh":["使用 `gh pr checks` 自动执行拉取请求检查","使用 `gh run view` 调试失败的工作流运行","使用 `gh run list` 监控最近的工作流运行"],"ja":["`gh pr checks` を使用してプルリクエストのチェックを自動化する","`gh run view` を使用して失敗したワークフローの実行をデバッグする","`gh run list` を使用して最近のワークフローの実行を監視する"],"ko":["`gh pr checks`를 사용하여 풀 리퀘스트 검사를 자동화하는 것","`gh run view`를 사용하여 실패한 워크플로 실행을 디버깅하는 것","`gh run list`를 사용하여 최근의 워크플로 실행을 모니터링하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar comprobaciones de solicitudes de extracción con `gh pr checks`","Depurar ejecuciones de flujo de trabajo fallidas con `gh run view`","Supervisar ejecuciones de flujo de trabajo recientes con `gh run list`"],"fr":["Automatiser les vérifications de demandes d''extraction avec `gh pr checks`","Déboguer les exécutions de workflow échouées avec `gh run view`","Surveiller les exécutions de workflow récentes avec `gh run list`"],"de":["Automatisieren von Pull-Request-Checks mit `gh pr checks`","Fehlgeschlagene Workflow-Ausführungen mit `gh run view` debuggen","Aktuelle Workflow-Ausführungen mit `gh run list` überwachen"],"pt":["Automating pull request checks with `gh pr checks`","Debugging failed workflow runs using `gh run view`","Monitoring recent workflow runs with `gh run list`"],"ru":["Automating pull request checks with `gh pr checks`","Debugging failed workflow runs using `gh run view`","Monitoring recent workflow runs with `gh run list`"],"ar":["Automating pull request checks with `gh pr checks`","Debugging failed workflow runs using `gh run view`","Monitoring recent workflow runs with `gh run list`"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires `gh` CLI installation","Must specify `--repo owner/repo` when not in a git directory"],"zh":["需要安装 `gh` CLI","未在 git 目录中时必须指定 `--repo owner/repo`"],"ja":["`gh` CLI のインストールが必要","Git ディレクトリ内にない場合、`--repo owner/repo` を指定する必要がある"],"ko":["`gh` CLI 설치 필요","Git 디렉토리 내에 없을 때는 `--repo owner/repo`를 지정해야 함"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de la CLI `gh`","Debe especificar `--repo owner/repo` cuando no esté en un directorio git"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de la CLI `gh`","Doit spécifier `--repo owner/repo` lorsqu''il n''est pas dans un répertoire git"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation der `gh`-CLI","Muss `--repo owner/repo` angeben, wenn nicht in einem Git-Verzeichnis"],"pt":["Requires `gh` CLI installation","Must specify `--repo owner/repo` when not in a git directory"],"ru":["Requires `gh` CLI installation","Must specify `--repo owner/repo` when not in a git directory"],"ar":["Requires `gh` CLI installation","Must specify `--repo owner/repo` when not in a git directory"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
